 y optimiza programas de referidos para convertir a los clientes en motores de crecimiento","fr":"Concevez et optimisez les programmes de parrainage pour transformer les clients en moteurs de croissance","de":"Entwerfen und optimieren Sie Empfehlungsprogramme, um Kunden in Wachstumsmotoren zu verwandeln","pt":"Desenvolva programas de recomendação personalizados para estimular o crescimento viral e aumentar a fidelidade dos clientes","ru":"Разработайте индивидуальные программы рекомендаций для стимулирования вирусного роста и увеличения лояльности клиентов","ar":"قم بإنشاء برامج توصية مخصصة لتعزيز النمو الفيروسي وزيادة ولاء العملاء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设计和优化推荐计划","利用病毒式增长和推荐营销","将客户转化为增长引擎","提高客户忠诚度和留存率","增加品牌知名度和认可度"],"ja":["リファラルプログラムの設計と最適化","ウイルス性成長とリファラルマーケティングの利用","顧客を成長エンジンに変える","顧客の忠誠心と留存率の向上","ブランド認知度と認知の向上"],"ko":["추천 프로그램 설계 및 최적화","바이러스성 성장과 추천 마케팅 활용","고객을 성장 엔진으로 바꾸기","고객 충성도와 유지율 향상","브랜드 인지도와 인식 향상"],"es":["Diseño de programas de referidos personalizados","Optimización de campañas de marketing viral","Análisis de datos para medir el éxito del programa","Integración con plataformas de marketing existentes","Creación de contenido atractivo para promocionar el programa"],"fr":["Conception de programmes de parrainage sur mesure","Optimisation de campagnes de marketing viral","Analyse de données pour mesurer le succès du programme","Intégration avec les plateformes de marketing existantes","Création de contenu attractif pour promouvoir le programme"],"de":["Entwurf von maßgeschneiderten Empfehlungsprogrammen","Optimierung von Viral-Marketing-Kampagnen","Datenanalyse zur Messung des Erfolgs des Programms","Integration mit bestehenden Marketingplattformen","Erstellung von ansprechendem Inhalt zur Förderung des Programms"],"pt":["Otimização de programas de recomendação","Desenvolvimento de estratégias de crescimento viral","Análise de dados para melhorar a eficácia","Criação de incentivos para os clientes","Integração com plataformas de marketing existentes"],"ru":["Оптимизация программ рекомендаций","Разработка стратегий вирусного роста","Анализ данных для улучшения эффективности","Создание стимулов для клиентов","Интеграция с существующими маркетинговыми платформами"],"ar":["تحسين برامج التوصية","إنشاء استراتيجيات لتعزيز النمو الفيروسي","تحليل البيانات لتحسين الفعالية","إنشاء حوافز للعملاء","التكامل مع منصات التسويق الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["推荐计划","病毒式增长","推荐营销","客户转化","增长引擎","客户忠诚度","品牌知名度"],"ja":["リファラルプログラム","ウイルス性成長","リファラルマーケティング","顧客転換","成長エンジン","顧客忠誠心","ブランド認知度"],"ko":["추천 프로그램","바이러스성 성장","추천 마케팅","고객 전환","성장 엔진","고객 충성도","브랜드 인지도"],"es":["programas de referidos","marketing viral","crecimiento viral","estrategias de marketing","campañas de marketing","análisis de datos","integración de plataformas"],"fr":["programmes de parrainage","marketing viral","croissance virale","stratégies de marketing","campagnes de marketing","analyse de données","intégration de plateformes"],"de":["Empfehlungsprogramme","Viral-Marketing","virales Wachstum","Marketingstrategien","Marketingkampagnen","Datenanalyse","Integration von Plattformen"],"pt":["programas de recomendação","crescimento viral","marketing de recomendação","estratégias de crescimento","otimização de programas","análise de dados"],"ru":["программы рекомендаций","вирусный рост","маркетинг рекомендаций","стратегии роста","оптимизация программ","анализ данных"],"ar":["برامج التوصية","النمو الفيروسي","تسويق التوصية","استراتيجيات النمو","تحسين البرامج","تحليل البيانات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.501Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"referral-program","description":"When the user wants to create, optimize, or analyze a referral program, affiliate program, or word-of-mouth strategy. Also use when the user mentions referral, affiliate, ambassador, word of mouth, viral loop, refer a friend, or partner program. This skill covers program design, incentive structure, and growth optimization.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Referral & Affiliate Programs\n\nYou are an expert in viral growth and referral marketing. Your goal is to help design and optimize programs that turn customers into growth engines.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Program Type\n- Customer","body":"# Referral & Affiliate Programs\n\nYou are an expert in viral growth and referral marketing. Your goal is to help design and optimize programs that turn customers into growth engines.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Program Type\n- Customer referral program, affiliate program, or both?\n- B2B or B2C?\n- What''s the average customer LTV?\n- What''s your current CAC from other channels?\n\n### 2. Current State\n- Existing referral/affiliate program?\n- Current referral rate (% who refer)?\n- What incentives have you tried?\n\n### 3. Product Fit\n- Is your product shareable?\n- Does it have network effects?\n- Do customers naturally talk about it?\n\n### 4. Resources\n- Tools/platforms you use or consider?\n- Budget for referral incentives?\n\n---\n\n## Referral vs. Affiliate\n\n### Customer Referral Programs\n\n**Best for:**\n- Existing customers recommending to their network\n- Products with natural word-of-mouth\n- Lower-ticket or self-serve products\n\n**Characteristics:**\n- Referrer is an existing customer\n- One-time or limited rewards\n- Higher trust, lower volume\n\n### Affiliate Programs\n\n**Best for:**\n- Reaching audiences you don''t have access to\n- Content creators, influencers, bloggers\n- Higher-ticket products that justify commissions\n\n**Characteristics:**\n- Affiliates may not be customers\n- Ongoing commission relationship\n- Higher volume, variable trust\n\n---\n\n## Referral Program Design\n\n### The Referral Loop\n\n```\nTrigger Moment → Share Action → Convert Referred → Reward → (Loop)\n```\n\n### Step 1: Identify Trigger Moments\n\n**High-intent moments:**\n- Right after first \"aha\" moment\n- After achieving a milestone\n- After exceptional support\n- After renewing or upgrading\n\n### Step 2: Design Share Mechanism\n\n**Ranked by effectiveness:**\n1. In-product sharing (highest conversion)\n2. Personalized link\n3. Email invitation\n4. Social sharing\n5. Referral code (works offline)\n\n### Step 3: Choose Incentive Structure\n\n**Single-sided rewards** (referrer only): Simpler, works for high-value products\n\n**Double-sided rewards** (both parties): Higher conversion, win-win framing\n\n**Tiered rewards**: Gamifies referral process, increases engagement\n\n**For examples and incentive sizing**: See [references/program-examples.md](references/program-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Program Optimization\n\n### Improving Referral Rate\n\n**If few customers are referring:**\n- Ask at better moments\n- Simplify sharing process\n- Test different incentive types\n- Make referral prominent in product\n\n**If referrals aren''t converting:**\n- Improve landing experience for referred users\n- Strengthen incentive for new users\n- Ensure referrer''s endorsement is visible\n\n### A/B Tests to Run\n\n**Incentive tests:** Amount, type, single vs. double-sided, timing\n\n**Messaging tests:** Program description, CTA copy, landing page copy\n\n**Placement tests:** Where and when the referral prompt appears\n\n### Common Problems & Fixes\n\n| Problem | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Low awareness | Add prominent in-app prompts |\n| Low share rate | Simplify to one click |\n| Low conversion | Optimize referred user experience |\n| Fraud/abuse | Add verification, limits |\n| One-time referrers | Add tiered/gamified rewards |\n\n---\n\n## Measuring Success\n\n### Key Metrics\n\n**Program health:**\n- Active referrers (referred someone in last 30 days)\n- Referral conversion rate\n- Rewards earned/paid\n\n**Business impact:**\n- % of new customers from referrals\n- CAC via referral vs. other channels\n- LTV of referred customers\n- Referral program ROI\n\n### Typical Findings\n\n- Referred customers have 16-25% higher LTV\n- Referred customers have 18-37% lower churn\n- Referred customers refer others at 2-3x rate\n\n---\n\n## Launch Checklist\n\n### Before Launch\n- [ ] Define program goals and success metrics\n- [ ] Design incentive structure\n- [ ] Build or configure referral tool\n- [ ] Create referral landing page\n- [ ] Set up tracking and attribution\n- [ ] Define fraud prevention rules\n- [ ] Create terms and conditions\n- [ ] Test complete referral flow\n\n### Launch\n- [ ] Announce to existing customers\n- [ ] Add in-app referral prompts\n- [ ] Update website with program details\n- [ ] Brief support team\n\n### Post-Launch (First 30 Days)\n- [ ] Review conversion funnel\n- [ ] Identify top referrers\n- [ ] Gather feedback\n- [ ] Fix friction points\n- [ ] Send reminder emails to non-referrers\n\n---\n\n## Email Sequences\n\n### Referral Program Launch\n\n```\nSubject: You can now earn [reward] for sharing [Product]\n\nWe just launched our referral program!\n\nShare [Product] with friends and earn [reward] for each signup.\nThey get [their reward] too.\n\n[Unique referral link]\n\n1. Share your link\n2. Friend signs up\n3. You both get [reward]\n```\n\n### Referral Nurture Sequence\n\n- Day 7: Remind about referral program\n- Day 30: \"Know anyone who''d benefit?\"\n- Day 60: Success story + referral prompt\n- After milestone: \"You achieved [X]—know others who''d want this?\"\n\n---\n\n## Affiliate Programs\n\n**For detailed affiliate program design, commission structures, recruitment, and tools**: See [references/affiliate-programs.md](references/affiliate-programs.md)\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of program (referral, affiliate, or both)?\n2. What''s your customer LTV and current CAC?\n3. Existing program or starting from scratch?\n4. What tools/platforms are you considering?\n5. What''s your budget for rewards/commissions?\n6. Is your product naturally shareable?\n\n---\n\n## Tool Integrations\n\nFor implementation, see the [tools registry](../../tools/REGISTRY.md). Key tools for referral programs:\n\n| Tool | Best For | Guide |\n|------|----------|-------|\n| **Rewardful** | Stripe-native affiliate programs | [rewardful.md](../../tools/integrations/rewardful.md) |\n| **Tolt** | SaaS affiliate programs | [tolt.md](../../tools/integrations/tolt.md) |\n| **Mention Me** | Enterprise referral programs | [mention-me.md](../../tools/integrations/mention-me.md) |\n| **Dub.co** | Link tracking and attribution | [dub-co.md](../../tools/integrations/dub-co.md) |\n| **Stripe** | Payment processing (for commission tracking) | [stripe.md](../../tools/integrations/stripe.md) |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **launch-strategy**: For launching referral program effectively\n- **email-sequence**: For referral nurture campaigns\n- **marketing-psychology**: For understanding referral motivation\n- **analytics-tracking**: For tracking referral attribution\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:34:45.524Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents specializing in viral growth and customer retention strategies.","zh":"非常适合专注于病毒式增长和客户留存策略的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントがウイルス性成長と顧客ロイヤルティ戦略を専門とする場合に最適です。","ko":"바이러스성 성장 및 고객 유지 전략을 전문으로 하는 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing especializados en crecimiento viral y estrategias de retención de clientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing spécialisés dans la croissance virale et les stratégies de rétention des clients.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die sich auf virales Wachstum und Kundenbindungsstrategien spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing especializados em crescimento viral e estratégias de retenção de clientes.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, специализирующихся на вирусном росте и стратегиях удержания клиентов.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام الترويجية المتخصصة في النمو الفيروسي واستراتيجيات الاحتفاظ بالعملاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and optimize referral programs using product marketing context, enabling the creation of customized customer growth engines through viral marketing techniques and affiliate program strategies.","zh":"赋予代理商使用产品营销背景设计和优化推荐计划的能力，能够通过病毒营销技术和联盟计划策略创建定制的客户增长引擎。","ja":"製品マーケティングコンテキストを使用して、紹介プログラムを設計および最適化するエージェントを可能にし、ウイルス性マーケティング技術とアフィリエイトプログラム戦略を通じて、カスタマイズされた顧客成長エンジンを作成できるようにします。","ko":"제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 사용하여 소개 프로그램을 설계 및 최적화할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 바이러스성 마케팅 기술 및 아フィ리이트 프로그램 전략을 통해 맞춤형 고객 성장 엔진을 생성할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y optimizar programas de referidos utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos, lo que permite la creación de motores de crecimiento de clientes personalizados a través de técnicas de marketing viral y estrategias de programas de afiliados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et d''optimiser des programmes de référencement en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits, ce qui permet de créer des moteurs de croissance client personnalisés grâce à des techniques de marketing viral et des stratégies de programmes d''affiliation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Verweisprogramme unter Verwendung des Produktmarketing-Kontexts zu entwerfen und zu optimieren, wodurch die Erstellung von maßgeschneiderten Kundenwachstumsmotoren durch virale Marketingtechniken und Affiliate-Programmstrategien ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem e otimizarem programas de referência utilizando o contexto de marketing de produtos, permitindo a criação de motores de crescimento de clientes personalizados por meio de técnicas de marketing viral e estratégias de programas de afiliados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и оптимизировать программы рекомендаций с использованием контекста маркетинга продукта, что позволяет создавать индивидуальные двигатели роста клиентов посредством вирусных маркетинговых техник и стратегий партнерских программ.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تصميم وتنظيم برامج الإحالة باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج، مما يسمح بإنشاء محركات نمو العملاء المخصصة من خلال تقنيات التسويق الفيروسي واستراتيجيات برامج المساهمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing incentive structures for customer referrals","Optimizing program metrics for viral growth","Developing affiliate program strategies"],"zh":["为客户推荐设计激励结构","为病毒式增长优化程序指标","开发联盟计划策略"],"ja":["顧客紹介のためのインセントブ構造を設計する","ウイルス性成長のためのプログラムメトリクスを最適化する","アフィリエイトプログラム戦略を開発する"],"ko":["고객 추천을 위한 인센티브 구조 설계","바이러스성 성장의 프로그램 메트릭스 최적화","아피리이트 프로그램 전략 개발"],"es":["Diseñar estructuras de incentivos para referidos de clientes","Optimizar las métricas del programa para el crecimiento viral","Desarrollar estrategias de programas de afiliados"],"fr":["Concevoir des structures d''incitation pour les références client","Optimiser les métriques du programme pour la croissance virale","Développer des stratégies de programmes d''affiliation"],"de":["Entwerfen von Anreizstrukturen für Kundenverweise","Optimieren der Programm-Metrik für virales Wachstum","Entwickeln von Affiliate-Programmstrategien"],"pt":["Projeto de estruturas de incentivo para referências de clientes","Otimização de métricas de programa para crescimento viral","Desenvolvimento de estratégias de programas de afiliados"],"ru":["Проектирование структур стимулирования для рекомендаций клиентов","Оптимизация метрик программы для вирусного роста","Разработка стратегий партнерских программ"],"ar":["تصميم هياكل الحفーズ للعملاء المراجعين","تحسين مقاييس البرنامج من أجل النمو الفيروسي","تطوير استراتيجيات برامج المساهمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context","Dependent on existing customer base"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景","依赖于现有的客户群"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキストが必要","既存の顧客ベースに依存する"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트가 필요","既存의 고객 기반에 의존"],"es":["Requiere contexto de marketing de productos","Depende de la base de clientes existente"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de marketing de produits","Dépend de la base de clients existante"],"de":["Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontext","Hängt von der bestehenden Kundenbasis ab"],"pt":["Exige contexto de marketing de produtos","Depende da base de clientes existente"],"ru":["Требует контекста маркетинга продукта","Зависит от существующей клиентской базы"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تسويق المنتج","يعتمد على قاعدة العملاء الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
