es para aplicaciones móviles. Aprende a utilizar HIG y SwiftUI para desarroll...","fr":"La conception iOS implique la création d''interfaces utilisateur natives et accessibles pour les applications mobiles. Apprenez à utiliser HIG et SwiftUI pour...","de":"Das iOS-Design umfasst die Erstellung von nativen und zugänglichen Benutzeroberflächen für Mobile-Anwendungen. Lernen Sie, HIG und SwiftUI zu verwenden, um h...","pt":"Desenvolva aplicações iOS com design polido e acessível, seguindo as diretrizes da Apple","ru":"Разрабатывайте мобильные приложения iOS с использованием SwiftUI и руководства по интерфейсу пользователя Apple","ar":"ابني تطبيقات iOS الأصلية مع واجهة مستخدم متقنة وسهلة الوصول، مع اتباع إرشادات شركة آبل","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","SF Symbols","iOS"],"ja":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","SF Symbols","iOS"],"ko":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","SF Symbols","iOS"],"es":["Diseño de interfaces de usuario con HIG","Uso de SwiftUI para crear vistas y diseños","Implementación de patrones de navegación de iOS","Creación de diseños adaptables para iPhone y iPad","Uso de SF Symbols y tipografía del sistema","Creación de interfaces de usuario accesibles"],"fr":["Conception d''interfaces utilisateur avec HIG","Utilisation de SwiftUI pour créer des vues et des conceptions","Mise en œuvre de modèles de navigation d''iOS","Création de conceptions adaptables pour iPhone et iPad","Utilisation de SF Symbols et de la typographie du système","Création d''interfaces utilisateur accessibles"],"de":["Entwurf von Benutzeroberflächen mit HIG","Verwendung von SwiftUI zur Erstellung von Ansichten und Designs","Implementierung von iOS-Navigationsmustern","Erstellung von adaptiven Designs für iPhone und iPad","Verwendung von SF Symbols und Systemtypografie","Erstellung von zugänglichen Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário seguindo as diretrizes da Apple","Desenvolvimento de views e layouts com SwiftUI","Implementação de padrões de navegação iOS","Criação de layouts adaptáveis para iPhone e iPad","Uso de SF Symbols e tipografia do sistema","Desenvolvimento de interfaces acessíveis"],"ru":["Создание интерфейсов пользователя в соответствии с руководством по интерфейсу пользователя Apple","Разработка представлений и макетов с помощью SwiftUI","Реализация шаблонов навигации iOS","Создание адаптивных макетов для iPhone и iPad","Использование SF Symbols и системной типографики","Разработка доступных интерфейсов"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات المستخدم وفقًا لمرشد واجهة المستخدم لشركة آبل","بناء العروض والمخططات باستخدام SwiftUI","تنفيذ أنماط الملاحة في iOS","إنشاء مخططات قابلة للتكيف للهواتف النقالة وأجهزة iPad","استخدام رموز SF والطباعة النظامية","بناء واجهات المستخدم القابلة للوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","iOS","SF Symbols","iOS"],"ja":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","iOS","SF Symbols","iOS"],"ko":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","iOS","SF Symbols","iOS"],"es":["diseño de iOS","HIG","SwiftUI","aplicaciones móviles","interfaces de usuario","navegación de iOS","diseños adaptables","SF Symbols","tipografía del sistema","accesibilidad"],"fr":["conception iOS","HIG","SwiftUI","applications mobiles","interfaces utilisateur","navigation d''iOS","conceptions adaptables","SF Symbols","typographie du système","accessibilité"],"de":["iOS-Design","HIG","SwiftUI","Mobile-Anwendungen","Benutzeroberflächen","iOS-Navigationsmuster","adaptive Designs","SF Symbols","Systemtypografie","Zugänglichkeit"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de interfaces iOS","design de aplicações móveis","SwiftUI","diretrizes da Apple","acessibilidade em aplicações móveis","desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas","iOS development","mobile app design","user interface design"],"ru":["дизайн мобильных приложений iOS","разработка приложений для устройств Apple","SwiftUI","руководство по интерфейсу пользователя Apple","доступность в мобильных приложениях","разработка родных приложений","iOS разработка","дизайн мобильных приложений","дизайн интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات الهواتف النقالة iOS","بناء تطبيقات الأجهزة النقالة لشركة آبل","SwiftUI","مرشد واجهة المستخدم لشركة آبل","إمكانية الوصول في التطبيقات النقالة","بناء التطبيقات الأصلية","تطوير iOS","تصميم تطبيقات الهواتف النقالة","تصميم واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.501Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-ios-design","description":"Master iOS Human Interface Guidelines and SwiftUI patterns for building native iOS apps. Use when designing iOS interfaces, implementing SwiftUI views, or ensuring apps follow Apples design principles.","bodyPreview":"# iOS Mobile Design\n\nMaster iOS Human Interface Guidelines (HIG) and SwiftUI patterns to build polished, native iOS applications that feel at home on Apple platforms.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing iOS app interfaces following Apple HIG\n- Building SwiftUI views and layouts\n- Implementing iOS navigation patterns (NavigationStack, TabView, sheets)\n- Creating adaptive layouts for iPhone and iPad\n- Using SF Symbols and system typography\n- Building accessible iOS interfaces\n- Implementing iO","body":"# iOS Mobile Design\n\nMaster iOS Human Interface Guidelines (HIG) and SwiftUI patterns to build polished, native iOS applications that feel at home on Apple platforms.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing iOS app interfaces following Apple HIG\n- Building SwiftUI views and layouts\n- Implementing iOS navigation patterns (NavigationStack, TabView, sheets)\n- Creating adaptive layouts for iPhone and iPad\n- Using SF Symbols and system typography\n- Building accessible iOS interfaces\n- Implementing iOS-specific gestures and interactions\n- Designing for Dynamic Type and Dark Mode\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Human Interface Guidelines Principles\n\n**Clarity**: Content is legible, icons are precise, adornments are subtle\n**Deference**: UI helps users understand content without competing with it\n**Depth**: Visual layers and motion convey hierarchy and enable navigation\n\n**Platform Considerations:**\n\n- **iOS**: Touch-first, compact displays, portrait orientation\n- **iPadOS**: Larger canvas, multitasking, pointer support\n- **visionOS**: Spatial computing, eye/hand input\n\n### 2. SwiftUI Layout System\n\n**Stack-Based Layouts:**\n\n```swift\n// Vertical stack with alignment\nVStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 12) {\n    Text(\"Title\")\n        .font(.headline)\n    Text(\"Subtitle\")\n        .font(.subheadline)\n        .foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n}\n\n// Horizontal stack with flexible spacing\nHStack {\n    Image(systemName: \"star.fill\")\n    Text(\"Featured\")\n    Spacer()\n    Text(\"View All\")\n        .foregroundStyle(.blue)\n}\n```\n\n**Grid Layouts:**\n\n```swift\n// Adaptive grid that fills available width\nLazyVGrid(columns: [\n    GridItem(.adaptive(minimum: 150, maximum: 200))\n], spacing: 16) {\n    ForEach(items) { item in\n        ItemCard(item: item)\n    }\n}\n\n// Fixed column grid\nLazyVGrid(columns: [\n    GridItem(.flexible()),\n    GridItem(.flexible()),\n    GridItem(.flexible())\n], spacing: 12) {\n    ForEach(items) { item in\n        ItemThumbnail(item: item)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Navigation Patterns\n\n**NavigationStack (iOS 16+):**\n\n```swift\nstruct ContentView: View {\n    @State private var path = NavigationPath()\n\n    var body: some View {\n        NavigationStack(path: $path) {\n            List(items) { item in\n                NavigationLink(value: item) {\n                    ItemRow(item: item)\n                }\n            }\n            .navigationTitle(\"Items\")\n            .navigationDestination(for: Item.self) { item in\n                ItemDetailView(item: item)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**TabView:**\n\n```swift\nstruct MainTabView: View {\n    @State private var selectedTab = 0\n\n    var body: some View {\n        TabView(selection: $selectedTab) {\n            HomeView()\n                .tabItem {\n                    Label(\"Home\", systemImage: \"house\")\n                }\n                .tag(0)\n\n            SearchView()\n                .tabItem {\n                    Label(\"Search\", systemImage: \"magnifyingglass\")\n                }\n                .tag(1)\n\n            ProfileView()\n                .tabItem {\n                    Label(\"Profile\", systemImage: \"person\")\n                }\n                .tag(2)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. System Integration\n\n**SF Symbols:**\n\n```swift\n// Basic symbol\nImage(systemName: \"heart.fill\")\n    .foregroundStyle(.red)\n\n// Symbol with rendering mode\nImage(systemName: \"cloud.sun.fill\")\n    .symbolRenderingMode(.multicolor)\n\n// Variable symbol (iOS 16+)\nImage(systemName: \"speaker.wave.3.fill\", variableValue: volume)\n\n// Symbol effect (iOS 17+)\nImage(systemName: \"bell.fill\")\n    .symbolEffect(.bounce, value: notificationCount)\n```\n\n**Dynamic Type:**\n\n```swift\n// Use semantic fonts\nText(\"Headline\")\n    .font(.headline)\n\nText(\"Body text that scales with user preferences\")\n    .font(.body)\n\n// Custom font that respects Dynamic Type\nText(\"Custom\")\n    .font(.custom(\"Avenir\", size: 17, relativeTo: .body))\n```\n\n### 5. Visual Design\n\n**Colors and Materials:**\n\n```swift\n// Semantic colors that adapt to light/dark mode\nText(\"Primary\")\n    .foregroundStyle(.primary)\nText(\"Secondary\")\n    .foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n\n// System materials for blur effects\nRectangle()\n    .fill(.ultraThinMaterial)\n    .frame(height: 100)\n\n// Vibrant materials for overlays\nText(\"Overlay\")\n    .padding()\n    .background(.regularMaterial, in: RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))\n```\n\n**Shadows and Depth:**\n\n```swift\n// Standard card shadow\nRoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 16)\n    .fill(.background)\n    .shadow(color: .black.opacity(0.1), radius: 8, y: 4)\n\n// Elevated appearance\n.shadow(radius: 2, y: 1)\n.shadow(radius: 8, y: 4)\n```\n\n## Quick Start Component\n\n```swift\nimport SwiftUI\n\nstruct FeatureCard: View {\n    let title: String\n    let description: String\n    let systemImage: String\n\n    var body: some View {\n        HStack(spacing: 16) {\n            Image(systemName: systemImage)\n                .font(.title)\n                .foregroundStyle(.blue)\n                .frame(width: 44, height: 44)\n                .background(.blue.opacity(0.1), in: Circle())\n\n            VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 4) {\n                Text(title)\n                    .font(.headline)\n                Text(description)\n                    .font(.subheadline)\n                    .foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n                    .lineLimit(2)\n            }\n\n            Spacer()\n\n            Image(systemName: \"chevron.right\")\n                .foregroundStyle(.tertiary)\n        }\n        .padding()\n        .background(.background, in: RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))\n        .shadow(color: .black.opacity(0.05), radius: 4, y: 2)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use Semantic Colors**: Always use `.primary`, `.secondary`, `.background` for automatic light/dark mode support\n2. **Embrace SF Symbols**: Use system symbols for consistency and automatic accessibility\n3. **Support Dynamic Type**: Use semantic fonts (`.body`, `.headline`) instead of fixed sizes\n4. **Add Accessibility**: Include `.accessibilityLabel()` and `.accessibilityHint()` modifiers\n5. **Use Safe Areas**: Respect `safeAreaInset` and avoid hardcoded padding at screen edges\n6. **Implement State Restoration**: Use `@SceneStorage` for preserving user state\n7. **Support iPad Multitasking**: Design for split view and slide over\n8. **Test on Device**: Simulator doesn''t capture full haptic and performance experience\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Layout Breaking**: Use `.fixedSize()` sparingly; prefer flexible layouts\n- **Performance Issues**: Use `LazyVStack`/`LazyHStack` for long scrolling lists\n- **Navigation Bugs**: Ensure `NavigationLink` values are `Hashable`\n- **Dark Mode Problems**: Avoid hardcoded colors; use semantic or asset catalog colors\n- **Accessibility Failures**: Test with VoiceOver enabled\n- **Memory Leaks**: Watch for strong reference cycles in closures\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Human Interface Guidelines](https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/)\n- [SwiftUI Documentation](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/swiftui)\n- [SF Symbols App](https://developer.apple.com/sf-symbols/)\n- [WWDC SwiftUI Sessions](https://developer.apple.com/videos/swiftui/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:34:58.957Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI/UX Agents specializing in Apple ecosystem design, needing mastery of iOS Human Interface Guidelines and SwiftUI patterns.","zh":"适合专注于苹果生态系统设计的UI/UX代理，需要掌握iOS人机界面指南和SwiftUI模式。","ja":"Appleエコシステムデザインを専門とするUI/UXエージェントに適しています。iOS Human Interface GuidelinesとSwiftUIパターンをマスターする必要があります。","ko":"애플 에코시스템 디자인을 전문으로 하는 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합합니다. iOS 휴먼 인터페이스 가이드라인과 SwiftUI 패턴을 마스터해야 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de UI/UX que se especializan en el diseño del ecosistema de Apple, necesitando dominio de las Guías de interfaz humana de iOS y patrones de SwiftUI.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents UI/UX spécialisés dans la conception de l''écosystème Apple, nécessitant une maîtrise des directives d''interface humaine d''iOS et des modèles SwiftUI.","de":"Ideal für UI/UX-Agenten, die sich auf das Design des Apple-Ökosystems spezialisieren und die Beherrschung der iOS-Human-Interface-Richtlinien und SwiftUI-Muster benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de UI/UX especializados em design do ecossistema Apple, necessitando de domínio das Diretrizes de Interface Humana do iOS e padrões do SwiftUI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов UI/UX, специализирующихся на设计е экосистемы Apple, требующих освоения руководства по интерфейсу человека iOS и паттернов SwiftUI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم / واجهة المستخدم المتخصصة في تصميم نظام البيئة أبل، والذي يحتاج إلى إتقان إرشادات واجهة المستخدم البشرية لنظام أبل والأنماط الخاصة بـ SwiftUI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design polished, native iOS applications using SwiftUI, implementing iOS navigation patterns like NavigationStack and TabView, and creating adaptive layouts with SF Symbols and system typography for seamless user experiences.","zh":"赋予代理设计精致的原生iOS应用程序的能力，使用SwiftUI，实现iOS导航模式，如NavigationStack和TabView，并使用SF Symbols和系统字体创建自适应布局，以实现无缝的用户体验。","ja":"エージェントがSwiftUIを使用して洗練されたネイティブiOSアプリケーションを設計できるようにし、NavigationStackやTabViewのようなiOSナビゲーションパターンを実装し、SF Symbolsやシステムフォントを使用してアダプティブレイアウトを作成して、シームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 SwiftUI를 사용하여 정교한 네이티브 iOS 애플리케이션을 설계할 수 있도록 하며, NavigationStack 및 TabView와 같은 iOS 네비게이션 패턴을 구현하고, SF Symbols 및 시스템 글꼴을 사용하여 적응형 레이아웃을 생성하여 무결점의 사용자 경험을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar aplicaciones iOS nativas y pulidas utilizando SwiftUI, implementando patrones de navegación de iOS como NavigationStack y TabView, y creando diseños adaptables con SF Symbols y tipografía del sistema para experiencias de usuario sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des applications iOS natives et polies en utilisant SwiftUI, en implémentant des modèles de navigation iOS tels que NavigationStack et TabView, et en créant des dispositions adaptables avec des symboles SF et une typographie système pour des expériences utilisateur sans accroc.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, native, polierte iOS-Anwendungen mit SwiftUI zu entwerfen, indem sie iOS-Navigationsmuster wie NavigationStack und TabView implementieren und adaptive Layouts mit SF-Symbolen und Systemtypografie für eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar aplicativos iOS polidos e nativos usando o SwiftUI, implementando padrões de navegação do iOS como NavigationStack e TabView, e criando layouts adaptáveis com SF Symbols e tipografia do sistema para experiências de usuário sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать отполированные, родные приложения iOS с помощью SwiftUI, реализуя шаблоны навигации iOS, такие как NavigationStack и TabView, и создавая адаптивные макеты с SF Symbols и системной типографией для беспрепятственных пользовательских опытов.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تصميم تطبيقات iOS متطورة وأصلية باستخدام SwiftUI، وتنفيذ أنماط التنقل الخاصة بنظام أبل مثل NavigationStack و TabView، وإنشاء تخطيطات قابلة للتكيف مع SF Symbols وطباعة النظام لنصوع الخبرة المستخدم بدون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing iOS app interfaces following Apple HIG","Building and implementing accessible iOS interfaces","Creating adaptive layouts for iPhone and iPad using SwiftUI"],"zh":["按照Apple HIG设计iOS应用程序接口","构建和实现可访问的iOS接口","使用SwiftUI为iPhone和iPad创建自适应布局"],"ja":["Apple HIGに従ってiOSアプリケーションのインターフェイスを設計する","アクセス可能なiOSインターフェイスを構築して実装する","SwiftUIを使用してiPhoneとiPadのアダプティブレイアウトを作成する"],"ko":["애플 HIG를 따르는 iOS 애플리케이션 인터페이스 설계","접근 가능한 iOS 인터페이스 구축 및 구현","SwiftUI를 사용하여 아이폰 및 아이패드의 적응형 레이아웃 생성"],"es":["Diseñar interfaces de aplicaciones iOS siguiendo las Guías de interfaz humana de Apple","Crear e implementar interfaces iOS accesibles","Crear diseños adaptables para iPhone y iPad utilizando SwiftUI"],"fr":["Concevoir des interfaces d''applications iOS suivant les directives d''interface humaine d''Apple","Créer et implémenter des interfaces iOS accessibles","Créer des dispositions adaptables pour iPhone et iPad en utilisant SwiftUI"],"de":["Entwerfen von iOS-App-Interfaces unter Berücksichtigung der iOS-Human-Interface-Richtlinien von Apple","Erstellen und Implementieren von zugänglichen iOS-Interfaces","Erstellen von adaptiven Layouts für iPhone und iPad mit SwiftUI"],"pt":["Projeto de interfaces de aplicativos iOS seguindo as Diretrizes de Interface Humana da Apple","Construção e implementação de interfaces iOS acessíveis","Criação de layouts adaptáveis para iPhone e iPad usando o SwiftUI"],"ru":["Проектирование интерфейсов приложений iOS в соответствии с руководством по интерфейсу человека Apple","Построение и реализация доступных интерфейсов iOS","Создание адаптивных макетов для iPhone и iPad с помощью SwiftUI"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات تطبيقات iOS اتباعًا لدليل واجهة المستخدم البشرية الخاص بأبل","بناء وتنفيذ واجهات iOS قابلة للوصول","إنشاء تخطيطات قابلة للتكيف للهاتف المحمول وأبل باستخدام SwiftUI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Apple''s iOS Human Interface Guidelines","Limited to designing for Apple iOS platforms","SwiftUI proficiency necessary for implementation"],"zh":["需要苹果的iOS人机界面指南知识","仅限设计用于苹果iOS平台","SwiftUI熟练程度必要"],"ja":["AppleのiOS Human Interface Guidelinesの知識が必要","AppleのiOSプラットフォームの設計のみ","SwiftUIの熟練度が必要"],"ko":["애플의 iOS 휴먼 인터페이스 가이드라인 지식 필요","애플 iOS 플랫폼만을 위한 디자인으로 제한","SwiftUI 숙련도 필요"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las Guías de interfaz humana de iOS de Apple","Limitado al diseño para plataformas iOS de Apple","Se requiere competencia en SwiftUI para la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des directives d''interface humaine d''Apple pour iOS","Limité à la conception pour les plateformes iOS d''Apple","Une compétence en SwiftUI est nécessaire pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der iOS-Human-Interface-Richtlinien von Apple","Begrenzt auf das Design für Apple-iOS-Plattformen","SwiftUI-Kenntnisse sind für die Implementierung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento das Diretrizes de Interface Humana do iOS da Apple","Limitado ao design para plataformas iOS da Apple","Proficiência em SwiftUI necessária para implementação"],"ru":["Требует знания руководства по интерфейсу человека iOS от Apple","Ограничен проектированием для платформ iOS от Apple","Профессиональное владение SwiftUI необходимо для реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة إرشادات واجهة المستخدم البشرية الخاصة بنظام أبل","محدود بالتصميم لأنظمة أبل","البراعة في استخدام SwiftUI ضرورية للتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
