","Analyse wichtiger Leistungsindikatoren","Wachstumsplanung abgestimmt auf Umsatzmeilensteine"],"pt":["Planejamento de contratação por papel","Estratégias de compensação e alocação de ações","Análise de orçamento e marcos de receita","Otimização da estrutura de equipe por estágio","Análise de benchmarks de mercado"],"ru":["Планирование найма по ролям","Стратегии компенсации и распределения акций","Анализ бюджета и вех дохода","Оптимизация структуры команды по стадиям","Анализ рыночных бенчмарков"],"ar":["تخطيط التوظيف حسب الدور","استراتيجيات التعويض وتوزيع الأسهم","تحليل الميزانية ومراحل الإيرادات","تحسين هيكل الفريق حسب المراحل","تحليل المعايير القياسية السوقية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["团队组成分析","初创企业团队结构","招聘计划","薪酬策略","股权分配","团队建设","市场基准","收入里程碑","预算约束"],"ja":["チーム構成分析","スタートアップチーム構成","採用計画","報酬戦略","株式配分","チーム構築","市場基準","収益里程碑","予算制約"],"ko":["팀 구성 분석","초기 창업 팀 구조","채용 계획","보상 전략","지분 배분","팀 구축","시장 기준","수익 里程碑","예산 제약"],"es":["análisis de composición de equipo","estructura de equipo para startups","planificación de contrataciones","estrategias de compensación","asignación de acciones","indicadores de rendimiento clave","crecimiento de startups"],"fr":["analyse de composition d''équipe","structure d''équipe pour startups","planification des embauches","stratégies de rémunération","attribution d''actions","indicateurs de performance clés","croissance des startups"],"de":["Teamzusammensetzungsanalyse","Teamstruktur für Startups","Planung der Einstellungen","Strategien für Vergütung","Aktienzuteilung","wichtige Leistungsindikatoren","Wachstum von Startups"],"pt":["análise de composição de equipe","planejamento de contratação","estratégias de compensação","startups em estágio inicial","otimização de equipe","gestão de equipe"],"ru":["анализ состава команды","планирование найма","стратегии компенсации","стартапы на ранней стадии","оптимизация команды","управление командой"],"ar":["تحليل تكوين الفريق","تخطيط التوظيف","استراتيجيات التعويض","المشاريع الجديدة في المراحل الأولى","تحسين الفريق","إدارة الفريق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.501Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"team-composition-analysis","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to plan team structure, determine hiring needs, design org chart, calculate compensation, plan equity allocation, or requests organizational design and headcount planning for a startup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Team Composition Analysis\n\nDesign optimal team structures, hiring plans, compensation strategies, and equity allocation for early-stage startups from pre-seed through Series A.\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild the right team at the right time with appropriate compensation and equity. Plan role-by-role hiring aligned with revenue milestones, budget constraints, and market benchmarks.\n\n## Team Structure by Stage\n\n### Pre-Seed (0-$500K ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 2-5 people**\n\n**Core Roles:**\n\n- Founders (2-3): Produc","body":"# Team Composition Analysis\n\nDesign optimal team structures, hiring plans, compensation strategies, and equity allocation for early-stage startups from pre-seed through Series A.\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild the right team at the right time with appropriate compensation and equity. Plan role-by-role hiring aligned with revenue milestones, budget constraints, and market benchmarks.\n\n## Team Structure by Stage\n\n### Pre-Seed (0-$500K ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 2-5 people**\n\n**Core Roles:**\n\n- Founders (2-3): Product, engineering, business\n- First engineer (if needed)\n- Contract roles: Design, marketing\n\n**Focus:** Build and validate product-market fit\n\n### Seed ($500K-$2M ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 5-15 people**\n\n**Key Hires:**\n\n- Engineering lead + 2-3 engineers\n- First sales/business development\n- Product manager\n- Marketing/growth lead\n\n**Focus:** Scale product and prove repeatable sales\n\n### Series A ($2M-$10M ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 15-50 people**\n\n**Department Build-Out:**\n\n- Engineering (40%): 6-20 people\n- Sales & Marketing (30%): 5-15 people\n- Customer Success (10%): 2-5 people\n- G&A (10%): 2-5 people\n- Product (10%): 2-5 people\n\n**Focus:** Scale revenue and build repeatable processes\n\n## Role-by-Role Planning\n\n### Engineering Team\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founders write code\n- 0-1 contract developers\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- Engineering Lead (first $150K-$180K)\n- 2-3 Full-Stack Engineers ($120K-$150K)\n- 1 Frontend or Backend Specialist ($130K-$160K)\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- VP Engineering ($180K-$250K + equity)\n- 2-3 Senior Engineers ($150K-$180K)\n- 3-5 Mid-Level Engineers ($120K-$150K)\n- 1-2 Junior Engineers ($90K-$120K)\n- 1 DevOps/Infrastructure ($140K-$170K)\n\n### Sales & Marketing\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founders do sales\n- Contract marketing help\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- First Sales Hire / Head of Sales ($120K-$150K + commission)\n- Marketing/Growth Lead ($100K-$140K)\n- SDR or BDR (if B2B) ($50K-$70K + commission)\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- VP Sales ($150K-$200K + commission + equity)\n- 3-5 Account Executives ($80K-$120K + commission)\n- 2-3 SDRs/BDRs ($50K-$70K + commission)\n- Marketing Manager ($90K-$130K)\n- Content/Demand Gen ($70K-$100K)\n\n### Product Team\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founder as product lead\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- First Product Manager ($120K-$150K)\n- Contract designer\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- Head of Product ($150K-$180K)\n- 1-2 Product Managers ($120K-$150K)\n- Product Designer ($100K-$140K)\n- UX Researcher (optional) ($90K-$130K)\n\n### Customer Success\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founders handle support\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- First CS hire (optional) ($60K-$90K)\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- CS Manager ($100K-$130K)\n- 2-4 CS Representatives ($60K-$90K)\n- Support Engineer (technical) ($80K-$120K)\n\n### G&A (General & Administrative)\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Contractors (accounting, legal)\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- Operations/Office Manager ($70K-$100K)\n- Contract CFO\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- CFO or Finance Lead ($150K-$200K)\n- Recruiter ($80K-$120K)\n- Office Manager / EA ($60K-$90K)\n\n## Compensation Strategy\n\n### Base Salary Benchmarks (US, 2024)\n\n**Engineering:**\n\n- Junior: $90K-$120K\n- Mid-Level: $120K-$150K\n- Senior: $150K-$180K\n- Staff/Principal: $180K-$220K\n- Engineering Manager: $160K-$200K\n- VP Engineering: $180K-$250K\n\n**Sales:**\n\n- SDR/BDR: $50K-$70K base + $50K-$70K commission\n- Account Executive: $80K-$120K base + $80K-$120K commission\n- Sales Manager: $120K-$160K base + $80K-$120K commission\n- VP Sales: $150K-$200K base + $150K-$200K commission\n\n**Product:**\n\n- Product Manager: $120K-$150K\n- Senior PM: $150K-$180K\n- Head of Product: $150K-$180K\n- VP Product: $180K-$220K\n\n**Marketing:**\n\n- Marketing Manager: $90K-$130K\n- Content/Demand Gen: $70K-$100K\n- Head of Marketing: $130K-$170K\n- VP Marketing: $150K-$200K\n\n**Customer Success:**\n\n- CS Representative: $60K-$90K\n- CS Manager: $100K-$130K\n- VP Customer Success: $140K-$180K\n\n### Total Compensation Formula\n\n```\nTotal Comp = Base Salary × 1.30 (benefits & taxes) + Equity Value\n```\n\n**Fully-Loaded Cost:**\n\n- Base salary\n- Payroll taxes (7.65% FICA)\n- Benefits (health insurance, 401k): $10K-$15K per employee\n- Other (workspace, equipment, software): $5K-$10K per employee\n\n**Rule of Thumb:** Multiply base salary by 1.3-1.4 for fully-loaded cost\n\n### Geographic Adjustments\n\n**San Francisco / New York:** +20-30% above benchmarks\n**Seattle / Boston / Los Angeles:** +10-20%\n**Austin / Denver / Chicago:** +0-10%\n**Remote / Other US Cities:** -10-20%\n**International:** Varies widely by country\n\n## Equity Allocation\n\n### Equity by Role and Stage\n\n**Founders:**\n\n- First founder: 40-60%\n- Second founder: 20-40%\n- Third founder: 10-20%\n- Vesting: 4 years with 1-year cliff\n\n**Early Employees (Pre-Seed):**\n\n- First engineer: 0.5-2.0%\n- First 5 employees: 0.25-1.0% each\n\n**Seed Stage Hires:**\n\n- VP/Head level: 0.5-1.5%\n- Senior IC: 0.1-0.5%\n- Mid-level: 0.05-0.25%\n- Junior: 0.01-0.1%\n\n**Series A Hires:**\n\n- C-level (CTO, CFO): 1.0-3.0%\n- VP level: 0.3-1.0%\n- Director level: 0.1-0.5%\n- Senior IC: 0.05-0.2%\n- Mid-level: 0.01-0.1%\n- Junior: 0.005-0.05%\n\n### Equity Pool Sizing\n\n**Option Pool by Round:**\n\n- Pre-Seed: 10-15% reserved\n- Seed: 10-15% top-up\n- Series A: 10-15% top-up\n- Series B+: 5-10% per round\n\n**Pre-Funding Dilution:**\nInvestors often require option pool creation before investment, diluting founders.\n\n**Example:**\n\n```\nPre-money: $10M\nInvestors want 15% option pool post-money\n\nCalculation:\nPost-money: $15M ($10M + $5M investment)\nOption pool: $2.25M (15% × $15M)\nFounders diluted by pool creation before new money\n```\n\n## Organizational Design\n\n### Reporting Structure\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n```\nFounders (flat structure)\n├── Contractors\n└── First hires (report to founders)\n```\n\n**Seed:**\n\n```\nCEO\n├── Engineering Lead (2-4 engineers)\n├── Sales/Growth Lead (1-2 reps)\n├── Product Manager\n└── Operations\n```\n\n**Series A:**\n\n```\nCEO\n├── CTO / VP Engineering (6-20 people)\n│   ├── Engineering Manager(s)\n│   └── Individual Contributors\n├── VP Sales (5-15 people)\n│   ├── Sales Manager\n│   ├── Account Executives\n│   └── SDRs\n├── Head of Product (2-5 people)\n│   ├── Product Managers\n│   └── Designers\n├── Head of Customer Success (2-5 people)\n└── CFO / Finance Lead (2-5 people)\n    ├── Recruiter\n    └── Operations\n```\n\n### Span of Control\n\n**Manager Ratios:**\n\n- First-line managers: 4-8 direct reports\n- Directors: 3-5 direct reports (managers)\n- VPs: 3-5 direct reports (directors)\n- CEO: 5-8 direct reports (executive team)\n\n## Full-Time vs. Contract\n\n### Use Full-Time for:\n\n- Core product development\n- Sales (revenue-generating roles)\n- Mission-critical operations\n- Institutional knowledge roles\n\n### Use Contractors for:\n\n- Specialized short-term needs (legal, accounting)\n- Variable workload (design, marketing campaigns)\n- Skills outside core competency\n- Testing role before FTE hire\n- Geographic expansion before permanent presence\n\n### Cost Comparison\n\n**Full-Time:**\n\n- Lower hourly cost\n- Benefits and overhead\n- Long-term commitment\n- Cultural fit matters\n\n**Contract:**\n\n- Higher hourly rate ($75-$200/hour vs. $40-$100/hour FTE equivalent)\n- No benefits or overhead\n- Flexible engagement\n- Easier to scale up/down\n\n## Hiring Velocity\n\n### Realistic Timeline\n\n**Role Opening to Hire:**\n\n- Junior: 6-8 weeks\n- Mid-Level: 8-12 weeks\n- Senior: 12-16 weeks\n- Executive: 16-24 weeks\n\n**Time to Productivity:**\n\n- Junior: 4-6 months\n- Mid-Level: 2-4 months\n- Senior: 1-3 months\n- Executive: 3-6 months\n\n### Planning Buffer\n\nAlways add 2-3 months buffer to hiring plans.\n\n**Example:**\nIf need engineer by July 1:\n\n- Start recruiting: April 1 (12 weeks)\n- Productivity: September 1 (2 months ramp)\n\n## Budget Planning\n\n### Compensation as % of Revenue\n\n**Early Stage (Seed):**\n\n- Total comp: 120-150% of revenue (burning cash to grow)\n- Engineering: 50-60%\n- Sales: 30-40%\n- Other: 20-30%\n\n**Growth Stage (Series A):**\n\n- Total comp: 70-100% of revenue\n- Engineering: 35-45%\n- Sales: 25-35%\n- Other: 20-30%\n\n### Headcount Budget Formula\n\n```\nTotal Comp Budget = Σ (Role Count × Fully-Loaded Cost × % of Year)\n\nExample:\n3 Engineers × $202K × 100% = $606K\n2 AEs × $230K × 75% (mid-year start) = $345K\n1 PM × $162K × 100% = $162K\nTotal: $1.1M\n```\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n### Reference Files\n\n- **`references/compensation-benchmarks.md`** - Detailed salary data by role, level, and location\n- **`references/equity-calculator.md`** - Equity sizing formulas and dilution scenarios\n\n### Example Files\n\n- **`examples/seed-stage-hiring-plan.md`** - Complete hiring plan for seed-stage SaaS company\n- **`examples/org-chart-evolution.md`** - Organizational design from 5 to 50 people\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo plan team composition:\n\n1. **Identify stage** - Pre-seed, seed, or Series A\n2. **Define roles** - What functions are needed now\n3. **Prioritize hires** - Critical path for business goals\n4. **Set compensation** - Base salary + equity by level\n5. **Plan timeline** - Account for recruiting and ramp time\n6. **Calculate budget** - Fully-loaded cost × headcount\n7. **Design org chart** - Reporting structure and span of control\n8. **Allocate equity** - Fair allocation that preserves pool\n\nFor detailed compensation benchmarks and hiring plan templates, see `references/` and `examples/`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:35:15.822Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Strategic Planning Agents needing advanced team structure optimization and compensation analysis","zh":"非常适合需要高级团队结构优化和补偿分析的战略规划代理","ja":"戦略的計画エージェントが高度なチーム構造の最適化と補償分析を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"전략 계획 에이전트가 고급 팀 구조 최적화와 보상 분석이 필요할 때 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Planificación Estratégica que necesitan una optimización avanzada de la estructura del equipo y análisis de compensación","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Planification Stratégique ayant besoin d''une optimisation avancée de la structure d''équipe et d''analyse de rémunération","de":"Perfekt für Strategische Planungsagenten, die eine fortschrittliche Optimierung der Teamstruktur und eine Vergütungsanalyse benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Planejamento Estratégico que necessitam de otimização avançada da estrutura da equipe e análise de compensação","ru":"Идеально для Стратегических Планировщиков, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация структуры команды и анализ компенсации","ar":"مثالي لعميل التخطيط الاستراتيجي الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين هيكل الفريق وتحليل التعويض المتقدم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design optimal team compositions, aligned with revenue milestones, budget constraints, and market benchmarks, utilizing role-by-role hiring plans and equity allocation strategies for early-stage startups","zh":"赋予代理设计最优团队组成，符合收入里程碑、预算约束和市场基准，利用角色逐一招聘计划和股权分配策略，适用于初创公司的早期阶段","ja":"エージェントが最適なチーム構成を設計できるようにし、収益マイルストーン、予算の制約、市場基準に合わせて役割ごとの採用計画と株式配分戦略を利用することで、初期段階のスタートアップに適している","ko":"에이전트가 최적의 팀 구성과 수익 里程碑, 예산 제한 및 시장 벤치마크에 맞게 설계할 수 있도록 하며, 초기 스타트업에 적합한 역할별 채용 계획 및 주식 배분 전략을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar composiciones de equipo óptimas, alineadas con los hitos de ingresos, las limitaciones presupuestarias y los estándares del mercado, utilizando planes de contratación role por role y estrategias de asignación de acciones para startups en etapas tempranas","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des compositions d''équipe optimales, alignées sur les jalons de revenus, les contraintes budgétaires et les références du marché, en utilisant des plans d''embauche role par role et des stratégies d''allocation d''actions pour les startups en stade précoce","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, optimale Teamzusammensetzungen zu entwerfen, die an Umsatzmeilensteine, Budgetbeschränkungen und Marktbenchmarks ausgerichtet sind, unter Verwendung von rollenbasierten Einstellungsplänen und Eigenkapitalzuteilungsstrategien für Startups in der Frühphase","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem composições de equipes ótimas, alinhadas com marcos de receita, restrições orçamentárias e benchmarks de mercado, utilizando planos de contratação por papel e estratégias de alocação de ações para startups em estágio inicial","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать оптимальные составы команд, соответствующие этапам получения дохода, бюджетным ограничениям и рыночным показателям, используя планы набора персонала по ролям и стратегии распределения акций для стартапов на ранней стадии","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تصميم تشكيلات فرق مثالية ، متوافقة مع معالم الإيرادات والقيود المالية ومقاييس السوق ، باستخدام خطط توظيف دورية واستراتيجيات تخصيص الأسهم لشركات بداية التشغيل في مرحلة مبكرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating team structure recommendations for pre-seed through Series A startups","Generating role-by-role hiring plans aligned with revenue growth and budget constraints","Analyzing compensation strategies and equity allocation for optimal team performance"],"zh":["为种子轮前至A轮的初创公司自动化团队结构推荐","根据收入增长和预算约束生成角色逐一招聘计划","分析补偿策略和股权分配以实现最佳团队绩效"],"ja":["シードラウンド前のスタートアップからシリーズAまでのチーム構造の推奨を自動化する","収益成長と予算の制約に基づいて役割ごとの採用計画を生成する","補償戦略と株式配分を分析して最適なチームパフォーマンスを実現する"],"ko":["시드 라운드 이전부터 시리즈 A까지의 스타트업을 위한 팀 구조 추천 자동화","수익 성장 및 예산 제한에 따라 역할별 채용 계획 생성","보상 전략 및 주식 배분 분석을 통해 최적의 팀 성과 달성"],"es":["Automatización de recomendaciones de estructura de equipo para startups desde la etapa pre-semilla hasta la Serie A","Generación de planes de contratación role por role alineados con el crecimiento de los ingresos y las limitaciones presupuestarias","Análisis de estrategias de compensación y asignación de acciones para un rendimiento óptimo del equipo"],"fr":["Automatisation des recommandations de structure d''équipe pour les startups depuis le stade pré-semence jusqu''à la Série A","Génération de plans d''embauche role par role alignés sur la croissance des revenus et les contraintes budgétaires","Analyse des stratégies de rémunération et d''allocation d''actions pour une performance optimale de l''équipe"],"de":["Automatisierung von Teamstruktur-Empfehlungen für Startups von der Vorgründungsphase bis zur Serie A","Erstellung von rollenbasierten Einstellungsplänen, die an Umsatzwachstum und Budgetbeschränkungen ausgerichtet sind","Analyse von Vergütungsstrategien und Eigenkapitalzuteilung für ein optimales Teamergebnis"],"pt":["Automatizar recomendações de estrutura de equipe para startups de pré-semente até Série A","Gerar planos de contratação por papel alinhados com o crescimento da receita e as restrições orçamentárias","Analisar estratégias de compensação e alocação de ações para desempenho ótimo da equipe"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рекомендации по структуре команды для стартапов от предпосевного до серии А","Генерировать планы набора персонала по ролям, соответствующие росту дохода и бюджетным ограничениям","Анализировать стратегии компенсации и распределения акций для оптимальной производительности команды"],"ar":["تحسين التوصيات بهيكل الفريق لتطبيقات بداية التشغيل من مرحلة ما قبل البذور إلى سلسلة أ","توليد خطط توظيف دورية متوافقة مع نمو الإيرادات والقيود المالية","تحليل استراتيجيات التعويض وتخصيص الأسهم لأداء الفريق الأمثل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to early-stage startups (pre-seed through Series A)","Requires knowledge of market benchmarks and revenue milestones","May not account for unique industry or company-specific factors"],"zh":["仅限于初创公司的早期阶段（种子轮前至A轮）","需要了解市场基准和收入里程碑","可能无法考虑到特定行业或公司特有的因素"],"ja":["初期段階のスタートアップ（シードラウンド前からシリーズAまで）に限定される","市場基準と収益マイルストーンの知識が必要","特定の業界や会社特有の要因を考慮できない可能性がある"],"ko":["초기 스타트업(시드 라운드 이전부터 시리즈 A까지)만 해당","시장 벤치마크 및 수익 里程碑에 대한 지식이 필요","특정 산업 또는 회사 고유의 요인을 고려하지 못할 수 있음"],"es":["Limitado a startups en etapas tempranas (pre-semilla hasta Serie A)","Requiere conocimiento de estándares del mercado y hitos de ingresos","Es posible que no tenga en cuenta factores únicos de la industria o específicos de la empresa"],"fr":["Limité aux startups en stade précoce (pré-semence à Série A)","Nécessite une connaissance des références du marché et des jalons de revenus","Peut ne pas tenir compte de facteurs uniques de l''industrie ou spécifiques à l''entreprise"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Startups in der Frühphase (Vorgründungsphase bis Serie A)","Benötigt Kenntnisse von Marktbenchmarks und Umsatzmeilensteinen","Könnte einzigartige Branchen- oder unternehmensspezifische Faktoren nicht berücksichtigen"],"pt":["Limitado a startups em estágio inicial (pré-semente até Série A)","Exige conhecimento de benchmarks de mercado e marcos de receita","Pode não levar em conta fatores únicos da indústria ou específicos da empresa"],"ru":["Ограничен стартапами на ранней стадии (от предпосевного до серии А)","Требует знания рыночных показателей и этапов получения дохода","Может не учитывать уникальные отраслевые или компанией-специфические факторы"],"ar":["محدود لشركات بداية التشغيل في مرحلة مبكرة (من مرحلة ما قبل البذور إلى سلسلة أ)","يتطلب معرفة بمقاييس السوق ومعالم الإيرادات","قد لا يأخذ في الاعتبار عوامل فريدة من نوعها في الصناعة أو معايير محددة للشركة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
