illeures pratiques pour écrire de manière claire et concise dans la documentation et la communication technique","de":"Dieses Skill deckt die besten Praktiken für klares und prägnantes Schreiben in Dokumentationen und technischer Kommunikation ab","pt":"Escreva com clareza e concisão para melhorar a comunicação em documentação e código","ru":"Пишите ясно и лаконично, чтобы улучшить коммуникацию в документации и коде","ar":"اكتب بوضوح ووجاز لتحسين التواصل في Tài liệu ورمز","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["改善技术文档的清晰度","提高提交消息和错误消息的有效性","增强代码注释和帮助文本的质量","优化报告和总结的可读性","编辑和改进技术写作的技巧"],"ja":["テクニカルドキュメントの明確性を向上させる","コミットメッセージとエラーメッセージの有効性を高める","コード注釈とヘルプテキストの品質を向上させる","レポートとサマリーの可読性を最適化する","テクニカルライティングを編集して改善するためのテクニック"],"ko":["기술 문서의 명확성을 향상시키기","커밋 메시지와 오류 메시지의 효과성을 높이기","코드 注釈와 도움말 텍스트의 품질을 향상시키기","보고서와 요약의 가독성을 최적화하기","기술 문서 작성과 편집을 개선하는 기술"],"es":["Mejora la claridad en la documentación","Optimiza la comunicación en mensajes y explicaciones técnicas","Edita textos para mejorar la comprensión","Escribe commit messages y descripciones de pull requests efectivas","Crea UI copy y ayuda de texto clara"],"fr":["Améliorez la clarté de la documentation","Optimisez la communication dans les messages et les explications techniques","Éditez des textes pour améliorer la compréhension","Écrivez des messages de commit et des descriptions de pull requests efficaces","Créez des copies d''interface utilisateur et du texte d''aide clair"],"de":["Verbessern Sie die Klarheit in Dokumentationen","Optimieren Sie die Kommunikation in Nachrichten und technischen Erklärungen","Bearbeiten Sie Texte, um die Verständlichkeit zu verbessern","Schreiben Sie effektive Commit-Nachrichten und Pull-Request-Beschreibungen","Erstellen Sie benutzerfreundliche UI-Copy und Hilfetexte"],"pt":["Melhora a comunicação em documentação","Escreva commits e descrições de pull requests claras","Crie mensagens de erro e UI copy eficazes","Edite texto para melhorar a clareza","Escreva relatórios e resumos concisos"],"ru":["Улучшает коммуникацию в документации","Пишите ясные коммиты и описания pull requests","Создайте эффективные сообщения об ошибках и UI copy","Редактируйте текст, чтобы улучшить ясность","Пишите краткие отчеты и резюме"],"ar":["تحسين التواصل في Tài liệu","اكتب Commits ووصف pull requests واضحة","انشاء رسائل خطأ و UI copy فعالة","تحرير النص لتحسين الوضوح","اكتب تقارير وملخصات موجزة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["清晰简洁写作","技术文档","提交消息","错误消息","代码注释","帮助文本","报告","总结","编辑"],"ja":["明確かつ簡潔な文章","テクニカルドキュメント","コミットメッセージ","エラーメッセージ","コード注釈","ヘルプテキスト","レポート","サマリー","編集"],"ko":["명확하고 간결한 글쓰기","기술 문서","커밋 메시지","오류 메시지","코드 注釈","도움말 텍스트","보고서","요약","편집"],"es":["escribir claro","comunicación técnica","documentación clara","redacción efectiva","explicaciones técnicas","commit messages"],"fr":["écrire clair","communication technique","documentation claire","rédaction efficace","explications techniques","messages de commit"],"de":["klar schreiben","technische Kommunikation","klare Dokumentation","effektive Redaktion","technische Erklärungen","Commit-Nachrichten"],"pt":["escrita clara","comunicação eficaz","documentação","commits","UI copy","mensagens de erro","edição de texto","relatórios","resumos"],"ru":["ясная escrita","эффективная коммуникация","документация","коммиты","UI copy","сообщения об ошибках","редактирование текста","отчеты","резюме"],"ar":["كتابة واضحة","تواصل فعال","Tài liệu","Commits","UI copy","رسائل خطأ","تحرير النص","تقارير","ملخصات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.501Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writing-clearly-and-concisely","description":"Use when writing prose humans will read—documentation, commit messages, error messages, explanations, reports, or UI text. Applies Strunks timeless rules for clearer, stronger, more professional writing.","bodyPreview":"# Writing Clearly and Concisely\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite with clarity and force. This skill covers what to do (Strunk) and what not to do (AI patterns).\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill whenever you write prose for humans:\n\n- Documentation, README files, technical explanations\n- Commit messages, pull request descriptions\n- Error messages, UI copy, help text, comments\n- Reports, summaries, or any explanation\n- Editing to improve clarity\n\n**If you''re writing sentences for a human to read, use","body":"# Writing Clearly and Concisely\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite with clarity and force. This skill covers what to do (Strunk) and what not to do (AI patterns).\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill whenever you write prose for humans:\n\n- Documentation, README files, technical explanations\n- Commit messages, pull request descriptions\n- Error messages, UI copy, help text, comments\n- Reports, summaries, or any explanation\n- Editing to improve clarity\n\n**If you''re writing sentences for a human to read, use this skill.**\n\n## Limited Context Strategy\n\nWhen context is tight:\n\n1. Write your draft using judgment\n2. Dispatch a subagent with your draft and the relevant section file\n3. Have the subagent copyedit and return the revision\n\nLoading a single section (~1,000-4,500 tokens) instead of everything saves significant context.\n\n## Elements of Style\n\nWilliam Strunk Jr.''s *The Elements of Style* (1918) teaches you to write clearly and cut ruthlessly.\n\n### Rules\n\n**Elementary Rules of Usage (Grammar/Punctuation)**:\n\n1. Form possessive singular by adding ''s\n2. Use comma after each term in series except last\n3. Enclose parenthetic expressions between commas\n4. Comma before conjunction introducing co-ordinate clause\n5. Don''t join independent clauses by comma\n6. Don''t break sentences in two\n7. Participial phrase at beginning refers to grammatical subject\n\n**Elementary Principles of Composition**:\n\n8. One paragraph per topic\n9. Begin paragraph with topic sentence\n10. **Use active voice**\n11. **Put statements in positive form**\n12. **Use definite, specific, concrete language**\n13. **Omit needless words**\n14. Avoid succession of loose sentences\n15. Express co-ordinate ideas in similar form\n16. **Keep related words together**\n17. Keep to one tense in summaries\n18. **Place emphatic words at end of sentence**\n\n### Reference Files\n\nThe rules above are summarized from Strunk''s original text. For complete explanations with examples:\n\n| Section | File | ~Tokens |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| Grammar, punctuation, comma rules | `02-elementary-rules-of-usage.md` | 2,500 |\n| Paragraph structure, active voice, concision | `03-elementary-principles-of-composition.md` | 4,500 |\n| Headings, quotations, formatting | `04-a-few-matters-of-form.md` | 1,000 |\n| Word choice, common errors | `05-words-and-expressions-commonly-misused.md` | 4,000 |\n\n**Most tasks need only `03-elementary-principles-of-composition.md`** — it covers active voice, positive form, concrete language, and omitting needless words.\n\n## AI Writing Patterns to Avoid\n\nLLMs regress to statistical means, producing generic, puffy prose. Avoid:\n\n- **Puffery:** pivotal, crucial, vital, testament, enduring legacy\n- **Empty \"-ing\" phrases:** ensuring reliability, showcasing features, highlighting capabilities\n- **Promotional adjectives:** groundbreaking, seamless, robust, cutting-edge\n- **Overused AI vocabulary:** delve, leverage, multifaceted, foster, realm, tapestry\n- **Formatting overuse:** excessive bullets, emoji decorations, bold on every other word\n\nBe specific, not grandiose. Say what it actually does.\n\nFor comprehensive research on why these patterns occur, see `signs-of-ai-writing.md`. Wikipedia editors developed this guide to detect AI-generated submissions — their patterns are well-documented and field-tested.\n\n## Bottom Line\n\nWriting for humans? Load the relevant section from `elements-of-style/` and apply the rules. For most tasks, `03-elementary-principles-of-composition.md` covers what matters most.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:35:21.879Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that require advanced text generation and editing capabilities to produce clear and concise human-readable content.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等语言代理，这些代理需要高级文本生成和编辑功能来产生清晰简洁的人类可读内容。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの言語エージェントに適しており、明確で簡潔な人間が読めるコンテンツを生成するために高度なテキスト生成および編集機能を必要とする。","ko":"클라우드 코드, 오토지피티, 랑체인などの 언어 에이전트에 적합하며, 명확하고 간결한 인간이 읽을 수 있는 콘텐츠를 생성하기 위해 고급 텍스트 생성 및 편집 기능을 필요로 한다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren capacidades avanzadas de generación y edición de texto para producir contenido legible y conciso para humanos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de langage comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain qui nécessitent des capacités avancées de génération et d''édition de texte pour produire un contenu lisible et concis pour les humains.","de":"Ideal für Sprachagenten wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die erweiterte Textgenerierungs- und -editierfunktionen benötigen, um klares und präzises, für Menschen lesbares Inhalte zu erstellen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem capacidades avançadas de geração e edição de texto para produzir conteúdo legível e conciso para humanos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которые требуют продвинутых возможностей генерации и редактирования текста для создания ясного и краткого контента, читаемого человеком.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء نص وتحريره لإنتاج محتوى واضح وموجز للقراءة البشرية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling README files, commit messages, and technical explanations using best practices from Strunk, while avoiding common AI patterns that hinder clarity, ensuring forceful and effective communication through documentation, UI copy, and error messages.","zh":"赋予代理创建令人信服的README文件、提交消息和技术解释的能力，使用斯特朗克的最佳实践，同时避免常见的AI模式，这些模式会阻碍清晰度，确保通过文档、UI复制和错误消息进行有力的有效沟通。","ja":"ストランクのベストプラクティスを使用して、説得力のあるREADMEファイル、コミットメッセージ、技術的説明を作成し、明確性を損なう一般的なAIパターンを避け、ドキュメント、UIコピー、エラーメッセージを介して強力で効果的なコミュニケーションを確実に行うエージェントの能力を付与する。","ko":"斯特朗크의 모범 사례를 사용하여 설득력 있는 README 파일, 커밋 메시지, 기술 설명서를 작성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하고, 명확성을 저해하는 일반적인 AI 패턴을 피하여 문서, UI 복사, 오류 메시지를 통해 강력하고 효과적인 의사 소통을 보장한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear archivos README convincentes, mensajes de confirmación y explicaciones técnicas utilizando las mejores prácticas de Strunk, evitando patrones comunes de IA que obstaculizan la claridad, garantizando una comunicación eficaz y contundente a través de la documentación, la copia de la interfaz de usuario y los mensajes de error.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fichiers README convaincants, des messages de validation et des explications techniques en utilisant les meilleures pratiques de Strunk, en évitant les modèles d''IA courants qui entravent la clarté, garantissant une communication efficace et persuasive à travers la documentation, la copie d''interface utilisateur et les messages d''erreur.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, überzeugende README-Dateien, Commit-Mitteilungen und technische Erklärungen zu erstellen, die die bewährten Methoden von Strunk verwenden, während sie gleichzeitig gängige AI-Muster vermeiden, die die Klarheit behindern, und so eine kraftvolle und effektive Kommunikation durch Dokumentation, Benutzeroberflächenkopie und Fehlermeldungen sicherstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar arquivos README convincentes, mensagens de commit e explicações técnicas usando as melhores práticas de Strunk, evitando padrões de IA comuns que dificultam a clareza, garantindo uma comunicação eficaz e enérgica por meio da documentação, cópia de interface do usuário e mensagens de erro.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать убедительные файлы README, сообщения коммитов и технические объяснения, используя лучшие практики Странка, избегая распространенных шаблонов ИИ, которые препятствуют ясности, обеспечивая эффективное и результативное общение через документацию, копию пользовательского интерфейса и сообщения об ошибках.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء ملفات README مقنعة ورسائل الالتزام وشرح تقني باستخدام أفضل الممارسات من سترونك، وتجنب الأنماط الشائعة في الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تعيق الوضوح، مما يضمن التواصل الفعال والقوي من خلال الوثائق ونسخ واجهة المستخدم ورسائل الخطأ."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating clear commit messages for code repositories","Crafting concise technical explanations for documentation","Editing text to improve readability and clarity"],"zh":["为代码仓库生成清晰的提交消息","为文档编写简洁的技术解释","编辑文本以提高可读性和清晰度"],"ja":["コードリポジトリのための明確なコミットメッセージを生成する","ドキュメントのための簡潔な技術的説明を作成する","読みやすさと明確さを向上させるためにテキストを編集する"],"ko":["코드 저장소에 대한 명확한 커밋 메시지 생성","문서에 대한 간결한 기술 설명 작성","가독성 및 명확성을 향상시키기 위한 텍스트 편집"],"es":["Generar mensajes de confirmación claros para repositorios de código","Crear explicaciones técnicas concisas para la documentación","Editar texto para mejorar la legibilidad y la claridad"],"fr":["Générer des messages de validation clairs pour les référentiels de code","Créer des explications techniques concises pour la documentation","Éditer du texte pour améliorer la lisibilité et la clarté"],"de":["Erstellen von klaren Commit-Mitteilungen für Code-Repositorys","Erstellen von präzisen technischen Erklärungen für die Dokumentation","Bearbeiten von Text, um die Lesbarkeit und Klarheit zu verbessern"],"pt":["Geração de mensagens de commit claras para repositórios de código","Criação de explicações técnicas concisas para documentação","Edição de texto para melhorar a legibilidade e a clareza"],"ru":["Генерация ясных сообщений коммитов для репозиториев кода","Создание кратких технических объяснений для документации","Редактирование текста для улучшения читаемости и ясности"],"ar":["إنشاء رسائ