entender o comportamento","Identificação de casos de teste, incluindo caminhos felizes e erros","Criação de testes independentes e repetíveis"],"ru":["Генерация автоматизированных тестов для кода Python","Использование pytest для создания комплексных тестов","Анализ кода для понимания его поведения","Определение тестовых случаев, включая счастливые пути и ошибки","Создание независимых и повторяемых тестов"],"ar":["توليد الاختبارات الآلية لبرامج پايثون","استخدام pytest لإنشاء اختبارات شاملة","تحليل الكود لفهم سلوكيته","تحديد حالات الاختبار، بما في ذلك المسارات السعيدة والأخطاء","إنشاء اختبارات مستقلة ومتكررة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python","Pytest","API","UI","Pytest","CI/CD","Pytest","Python","Pytest"],"ja":["Python","Pytest","API","UI","Pytest","CI/CD","Pytest","Python","Pytest"],"ko":["Python","Pytest","API","UI","Pytest","CI/CD","Pytest","Python","Pytest"],"es":["generación de pruebas","pytest","pruebas automatizadas","código python","tests de unidad","tests de integración","desarrollo de software","calidad de software","fiabilidad de software"],"fr":["génération de tests","pytest","tests automatisés","code python","tests d''unité","tests d''intégration","développement de logiciel","qualité de logiciel","fiabilité de logiciel"],"de":["Erzeugung von Tests","pytest","automatisierte Tests","Python-Code","Einheitstests","Integrationstests","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Qualität","Software-Zuverlässigkeit"],"pt":["geração de testes","pytest","testes automatizados","código python","qualidade de código","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["генерация тестов","pytest","автоматизированные тесты","код python","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["توليد الاختبارات","pytest","الاختبارات الآلية","برامج پايثون","جودة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Luminous-Banking","repo":"aibom-test","repoPath":"Luminous-Banking/aibom-test","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.501Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"test-generation","description":"Generate unit tests and integration tests for Python code using pytest. Use when the user asks to write tests, needs test coverage, or wants to test specific functions or modules.","bodyPreview":"# Test Generation\n\nGenerate comprehensive tests for Python code using pytest.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen generating tests:\n\n1. Analyze the code to understand its behavior\n2. Identify test cases (happy path, edge cases, errors)\n3. Write tests following pytest conventions\n4. Ensure tests are independent and repeatable\n\n## Test File Structure\n\n```\ntests/\n├── __init__.py\n├── conftest.py           # Shared fixtures\n├── unit/\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   └── test_module.py\n└── integration/\n    ├── __init__.py","body":"# Test Generation\n\nGenerate comprehensive tests for Python code using pytest.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen generating tests:\n\n1. Analyze the code to understand its behavior\n2. Identify test cases (happy path, edge cases, errors)\n3. Write tests following pytest conventions\n4. Ensure tests are independent and repeatable\n\n## Test File Structure\n\n```\ntests/\n├── __init__.py\n├── conftest.py           # Shared fixtures\n├── unit/\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   └── test_module.py\n└── integration/\n    ├── __init__.py\n    └── test_api.py\n```\n\n## Pytest Conventions\n\n### Test Function Naming\n```python\n# Pattern: test_<function>_<scenario>_<expected_result>\ndef test_calculate_total_with_discount_returns_reduced_price():\n    ...\n\ndef test_create_user_with_invalid_email_raises_validation_error():\n    ...\n```\n\n### Basic Test Structure\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom mymodule import calculate_total\n\nclass TestCalculateTotal:\n    \"\"\"Tests for the calculate_total function.\"\"\"\n\n    def test_returns_sum_of_items(self):\n        \"\"\"Happy path: normal calculation.\"\"\"\n        items = [10, 20, 30]\n        result = calculate_total(items)\n        assert result == 60\n\n    def test_empty_list_returns_zero(self):\n        \"\"\"Edge case: empty input.\"\"\"\n        result = calculate_total([])\n        assert result == 0\n\n    def test_negative_values_raises_error(self):\n        \"\"\"Error case: invalid input.\"\"\"\n        with pytest.raises(ValueError, match=\"negative\"):\n            calculate_total([-1, 10])\n```\n\n## Fixtures\n\n### Basic Fixture\n```python\n@pytest.fixture\ndef sample_user():\n    \"\"\"Create a sample user for testing.\"\"\"\n    return {\n        \"id\": \"user-123\",\n        \"name\": \"Test User\",\n        \"email\": \"test@example.com\"\n    }\n\ndef test_user_creation(sample_user):\n    user = User(**sample_user)\n    assert user.email == \"test@example.com\"\n```\n\n### Fixture with Cleanup\n```python\n@pytest.fixture\ndef temp_database():\n    \"\"\"Create and cleanup a temporary database.\"\"\"\n    db = create_test_database()\n    yield db\n    db.cleanup()\n```\n\n### Parameterized Fixtures\n```python\n@pytest.fixture(params=[\"sqlite\", \"postgres\"])\ndef database(request):\n    \"\"\"Test with multiple database backends.\"\"\"\n    return create_database(backend=request.param)\n```\n\n## Parameterized Tests\n\n```python\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"input_val,expected\", [\n    (0, \"zero\"),\n    (1, \"one\"),\n    (2, \"two\"),\n    (-1, \"negative\"),\n])\ndef test_number_to_word(input_val, expected):\n    assert number_to_word(input_val) == expected\n```\n\n## Mocking\n\n### Mock External Services\n```python\nfrom unittest.mock import Mock, patch\n\ndef test_fetch_user_data():\n    with patch(''mymodule.requests.get'') as mock_get:\n        mock_get.return_value.json.return_value = {\"id\": \"123\"}\n        mock_get.return_value.status_code = 200\n\n        result = fetch_user_data(\"123\")\n\n        assert result[\"id\"] == \"123\"\n        mock_get.assert_called_once()\n```\n\n### Mock Objects\n```python\n@pytest.fixture\ndef mock_database():\n    db = Mock()\n    db.query.return_value = [{\"id\": 1}, {\"id\": 2}]\n    return db\n\ndef test_list_users(mock_database):\n    service = UserService(mock_database)\n    users = service.list_users()\n    assert len(users) == 2\n```\n\n## Test Categories\n\nGenerate tests for these scenarios:\n\n1. **Happy Path**: Normal expected usage\n2. **Edge Cases**: Boundary conditions, empty inputs\n3. **Error Cases**: Invalid inputs, exceptions\n4. **Integration**: Component interactions\n\n## Running Tests\n\n```bash\n# Run all tests\npytest\n\n# Run with coverage\npytest --cov=mymodule --cov-report=html\n\n# Run specific test file\npytest tests/unit/test_module.py\n\n# Run tests matching pattern\npytest -k \"test_user\"\n\n# Verbose output\npytest -v\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:35:55.075Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Python Development Agents requiring comprehensive test coverage using pytest.","zh":"适用于需要使用pytest进行全面测试覆盖的Python开发代理。","ja":"pytestを使用した包括的なテストカバレッジが必要なPython開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"pytest를 사용하여 완전한 테스트 커버리지를 필요로 하는 Python 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo en Python que requieran una cobertura de pruebas exhaustiva utilizando pytest.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement Python nécessitant une couverture de tests complète utilisant pytest.","de":"Ideal für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine umfassende Testabdeckung mit pytest benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento Python que exigem cobertura de teste abrangente usando pytest.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Python, требующих всестороннего покрытия тестирования с использованием pytest.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير بايثون الذين يتطلبون تغطية اختبار شاملة باستخدام pytest."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate independent and repeatable tests for Python code, utilizing pytest conventions and identifying happy path, edge cases, and errors, while ensuring tests are properly structured in a test file hierarchy.","zh":"赋予代理生成独立的、可重复的测试用例，利用pytest惯例，识别正常路径、边界情况和错误，并确保测试正确地结构化在测试文件层次中。","ja":"エージェントが独立して繰り返し実行可能なテストを生成できるようにし、pytestの規約を利用し、ハッピーパス、エッジケース、エラーを識別し、テストをテストファイルの階層構造に適切に構造化する。","ko":"에이전트가 독립적이고 반복 가능한 테스트를 생성할 수 있도록 해주며, pytest 규칙을 사용하여 행복한 경로, 에지 ケース 및 오류를 식별하고 테스트를 테스트 파일 계층 구조에 적절하게 구조화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar pruebas independientes y repetibles para código Python, utilizando las convenciones de pytest e identificando el camino feliz, los casos límite y los errores, al tiempo que garantiza que las pruebas estén correctamente estructuradas en una jerarquía de archivos de prueba.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des tests indépendants et reproductibles pour le code Python, en utilisant les conventions pytest et en identifiant le scénario nominal, les cas limites et les erreurs, tout en garantissant que les tests sont correctement structurés dans une hiérarchie de fichiers de test.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, unabhängige und wiederholbare Tests für Python-Code zu generieren, unter Verwendung von pytest-Konventionen und Identifizierung von Happy Path, Grenzfällen und Fehlern, wobei sichergestellt wird, dass die Tests in einer Testdateihierarchie korrekt strukturiert sind.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem testes independentes e repetíveis para código Python, utilizando convenções pytest e identificando caminho feliz, casos de bordo e erros, garantindo que os testes estejam adequadamente estruturados em uma hierarquia de arquivos de teste.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать независимые и повторяемые тесты для кода Python, используя конвенции pytest и выявляя сценарии успешного выполнения, граничные случаи и ошибки, обеспечивая надлежащую структуризацию тестов в иерархии тестовых файлов.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إنشاء اختبارات مستقلة وقابلة للتكرار للكود بايثون، باستخدام اتفاقيات pytest وتحديد المسار السعيد وحالات الحافة والأخطاء، مع ضمان هيكلة الاختبارات بشكل صحيح في هرمية ملفات الاختبار."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating unit tests for Python modules","Creating integration tests for complex workflows","Automating test case identification for edge cases and errors"],"zh":["为Python模块生成单元测试","为复杂工作流创建集成测试","自动识别边界情况和错误的测试用例"],"ja":["Pythonモジュールのユニットテストを生成する","複雑なワークフローに対する統合テストを作成する","エッジケースとエラーのテストケースを自動的に識別する"],"ko":["Python 모듈에 대한 단위 테스트 생성","복잡한 워크플로우에 대한 통합 테스트 생성","에지 ケース 및 오류에 대한 테스트 ケース 자동 식별"],"es":["Generación de pruebas unitarias para módulos de Python","Creación de pruebas de integración para flujos de trabajo complejos","Automatización de la identificación de casos de prueba para casos límite y errores"],"fr":["Génération de tests unitaires pour les modules Python","Création de tests d''intégration pour des workflows complexes","Automatisation de l''identification des cas de test pour les cas limites et les erreurs"],"de":["Generieren von Unit-Tests für Python-Module","Erstellen von Integrationstests für komplexe Workflows","Automatisierte Identifizierung von Testfällen für Grenzfälle und Fehler"],"pt":["Geração de testes unitários para módulos Python","Criação de testes de integração para fluxos de trabalho complexos","Automatização da identificação de casos de teste para casos de bordo e erros"],"ru":["Генерация юнит-тестов для модулей Python","Создание интеграционных тестов для сложных рабочих процессов","Автоматизация выявления тестовых случаев для граничных случаев и ошибок"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات وحدة لمدخلات بايثون","إنشاء اختبارات إدماجية لاتجاهات عمل معقدة","تأتمتة تحديد حالات الاختبار للحالات الحدية والأخطاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python code to analyze","Limited to pytest testing framework","Python 3.x compatibility required"],"zh":["需要Python代码来分析","仅限pytest测试框架","需要Python 3.x兼容性"],"ja":["分析するためにPythonコードが必要","pytestテストフレームワークのみ","Python 3.xの互換性が必要"],"ko":["분석을 위해 Python 코드가 필요합니다.","pytest 테스트 프레임워크만 해당","Python 3.x 호환성이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere código Python para analizar","Limitado al framework de pruebas pytest","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python 3.x"],"fr":["Nécessite du code Python à analyser","Limité au framework de test pytest","Compatibilité Python 3.x requise"],"de":["Erfordert Python-Code zur Analyse","Beschränkt auf das pytest-Testframework","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige código Python para análise","Limitado ao framework de teste pytest","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária"],"ru":["Требует кода Python для анализа","Ограничен фреймворком тестирования pytest","Требуется совместимость с Python 3.x"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز بايثون للتحليل","محدود بالإطار الاختباري pytest","متطلبات التوافق مع بايثون 3.x"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Columbia-Cloudworks-LLC/EquipQR/test-orchestrator', 'community', 'Columbia-Cloudworks-LLC', 'EquipQR', 'Columbia-Cloudworks-LLC/EquipQR', 'test-orchestrator', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.501Z', '2026-02-18T11:36:15.912Z', NULL, '{"id":"Columbia-Cloudworks-LLC/EquipQR/test-orchestrator","name":"test-orchestrator","description":{"es":"El orquestador de pruebas es una herramienta que administra y depura pruebas de EquipQR con Vitest y jsdom.","fr":"L''orchestrateur de tests est un outil qui gère et débogage les tests EquipQR avec Vitest et jsdom.","de":"Der Test-Orchestrierer ist ein Tool, das EquipQR-Tests mit Vitest und jsdom verwaltet und debuggt.","en":"Manage the history of work on your fleet service equipment using secure, sharable QR codes."},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Orquestador de pruebas: Administra pruebas de EquipQR","fr":"Orchestrateur de tests: Gérez les tests EquipQR","de":"Test-Orchestrierer: Verwalten Sie EquipQR-Tests","en":"test-orchestrator"},"description":{"es":"El orquestador de pruebas es una herramienta que administra y depura pruebas de EquipQR con Vitest y jsdom.","fr":"L''orchestrateur de tests est un outil qui gère et débogage les tests EquipQR avec Vitest et jsdom.","de":"Der Test-Orchestrierer ist ein Tool, das EquipQR-Tests mit Vitest und jsdom verwaltet und debuggt.","en":"Manage the history of work on your fleet service equipment using secure, sharable QR codes."},"definition":{"en":"Manage the history of work on your fleet service equipment using secure, sharable QR codes."},"features":{"es":["Ejecuta pruebas unitarias relacionadas con archivos modificados","Ejecuta pruebas de integración y suites de viaje","Depura y soluciona pruebas fallidas de forma autónoma","Utiliza Vitest 3.2.4 como runner de pruebas","Soporta entornos jsdom y pool de forks"],"fr":["Exécute des tests unitaires liés à des fichiers modifiés","Exécute des tests d''intégration et des suites de voyage","Débogage et résolution de tests échoués de manière autonome","Utilise Vitest 3.2.4 comme exécuteur de tests","Prend en charge les environnements jsdom et le pool de forks"],"de":["Führt Unit-Tests in Bezug auf geänderte Dateien aus","Führt Integrations- und Reisetests sowie Test-Suiten aus","Fehlerhafte Tests werden automatisch debuggt und behoben","Verwendet Vitest 3.2.4 als Test-Runner","Unterstützt jsdom-Umgebungen und Fork-Pool"]},"keywords":{"es":["orquestador de pruebas","pruebas de software","Vitest","jsdom","depuración de pruebas","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración"],"fr":["orchestrateur de tests","tests de logiciel","Vitest","jsdom","débogage de tests","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration"],"de":["Test-Orchestrierer","Software-Tests","Vitest","jsdom","Test-Debugging","Unit-Tests","Integrations-Tests"]}},"owner":"Columbia-Cloudworks-LLC","repo":"EquipQR","repoPath":"Columbia-Cloudworks-LLC/EquipQR","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.501Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"test-orchestrator","description":"Runs unit tests, integration tests, and debugs failing specs in the EquipQR Vitest suite. Finds related test files for modified source code, parses failures into structured JSON, and drives autonomous fix-retry loops. Use when the user says run tests, run unit tests, run integration tests, debug spec, fix failing test, test this change, or run related tests.","bodyPreview":"# Test Orchestrator\n\nOrchestrates Vitest test runs for EquipQR. Three capabilities:\n\n1. **Run Unit Tests** — run tests related to changed files\n2. **Run Integration Tests** — run journey / integration suites\n3. **Debug Spec** — diagnose and fix a failing test autonomously\n\n## Project Test Stack\n\n| Item | Value |\n|------|-------|\n| Runner | Vitest 3.2.4 via `node scripts/test-runner.mjs` |\n| Environment | jsdom, pool: forks |\n| Include pattern | `src/**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}` |\n| Path alias | `@","body":"# Test Orchestrator\n\nOrchestrates Vitest test runs for EquipQR. Three capabilities:\n\n1. **Run Unit Tests** — run tests related to changed files\n2. **Run Integration Tests** — run journey / integration suites\n3. **Debug Spec** — diagnose and fix a failing test autonomously\n\n## Project Test Stack\n\n| Item | Value |\n|------|-------|\n| Runner | Vitest 3.2.4 via `node scripts/test-runner.mjs` |\n| Environment | jsdom, pool: forks |\n| Include pattern | `src/**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}` |\n| Path alias | `@/` → `./src/` |\n| Setup file | `src/test/setup.ts` |\n| Utilities | `src/test/utils/`, `src/test/fixtures/`, `src/test/mocks/` |\n\n> **Windows note**: Always use `node scripts/test-runner.mjs` (not bare `vitest run`) to prevent the process from hanging.\n\n---\n\n## Capability 1: Run Unit Tests\n\nRun tests related to a set of modified source files.\n\n### Quick path (few files)\n\n```powershell\nnode scripts/test-runner.mjs src/features/equipment/hooks/__tests__/useEquipment.test.ts\n```\n\n### Automated discovery\n\nUse the helper script to map changed files to their test files:\n\n```powershell\nnpx tsx .cursor/skills/test-orchestrator/scripts/run-related.ts <file1> <file2> ...\n```\n\nThe script:\n1. Accepts source file paths as CLI arguments\n2. Resolves each to its `*.test.ts(x)` or `*.spec.ts(x)` counterpart\n3. Runs only the matched tests via `node scripts/test-runner.mjs`\n4. Exits with the vitest exit code\n\n### File-to-test mapping conventions\n\n| Source location | Test location |\n|----------------|---------------|\n| `src/path/to/file.ts` | `src/path/to/__tests__/file.test.ts` |\n| `src/path/to/Component.tsx` | `src/path/to/__tests__/Component.test.tsx` |\n| `src/path/to/file.ts` | `src/path/to/file.test.ts` (co-located) |\n| `src/path/to/file.ts` | `src/path/to/file.spec.tsx` (co-located) |\n\nIf no test file is found for a source file, log a warning and skip it.\n\n### When to use\n\n- After editing source files — run only related tests\n- Before committing — verify nothing broke\n- When the user says \"run tests\" or \"test this change\"\n\n---\n\n## Capability 2: Run Integration Tests\n\n### Journey tests (primary)\n\n```powershell\nnode scripts/test-runner.mjs src/tests/journeys\n```\n\nJourney tests live in `src/tests/journeys/` and exercise full user workflows using persona-based rendering (`src/test/journey/render-journey.tsx`).\n\n### Integration tests\n\n```powershell\nnode scripts/test-runner.mjs src/tests/integration\n```\n\n### Database tests (pgTAP)\n\n```powershell\nnpm run test:db\n```\n\n### Full suite with coverage\n\n```powershell\nnpm run test:coverage\n```\n\n### When to use\n\n- After cross-cutting changes (auth, routing, providers)\n- Before creating a PR\n- When the user says \"run integration tests\" or \"run journeys\"\n\n---\n\n## Capability 3: Debug Spec\n\nDiagnose and fix a failing test through an autonomous retry loop.\n\n### Workflow\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Run the failing test(s)\n- [ ] Step 2: Parse failures into JSON\n- [ ] Step 3: Read source + test code\n- [ ] Step 4: Fix the root cause\n- [ ] Step 5: Re-run and verify\n- [ ] Step 6: Repeat steps 2-5 until green (max 3 retries)\n```\n\n### Step 1: Run the failing test\n\n```powershell\nnode scripts/test-runner.mjs path/to/failing.test.tsx 2>&1 | Out-File -Encoding utf8 tmp/test-output.txt\n```\n\n### Step 2: Parse failures\n\n```powershell\npython .cursor/skills/test-orchestrator/scripts/parse-failure.py tmp/test-output.txt\n```\n\nOutput is a JSON array of failure objects:\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"file\": \"src/features/equipment/hooks/__tests__/useEquipment.test.ts\",\n    \"test\": \"useEquipment > should return equipment list\",\n    \"error\": \"expected 3 but received 0\",\n    \"expected\": \"3\",\n    \"actual\": \"0\",\n    \"source_line\": \"expect(result.current.data).toHaveLength(3)\",\n    \"stack_file\": \"src/features/equipment/hooks/__tests__/useEquipment.test.ts\",\n    \"stack_line\": 42\n  }\n]\n```\n\n### Step 3: Read source + test code\n\nRead both the test file and the source file under test. Focus on:\n- The failing assertion and what it expects\n- Mock setup — are mocks returning correct data?\n- Async timing — is `waitFor` / `act` used correctly?\n- Import paths — does `@/` alias resolve correctly?\n\n### Step 4: Fix the root cause\n\nCommon failure patterns:\n\n| Pattern | Likely cause | Fix |\n|---------|-------------|-----|\n| `expected X received undefined` | Mock not returning data | Fix mock setup or add missing mock |\n| `not wrapped in act(...)` | State update outside act | Wrap in `act()` or use `waitFor()` |\n| `Unable to find role` | Component not rendering | Check providers in test, verify render call |\n| `Timeout` | Async operation never resolves | Check mock promises, add `vi.useFakeTimers()` |\n| `Cannot find module` | Import alias issue | Verify `@/` paths resolve via vitest config |\n\n### Step 5-6: Re-run and verify\n\nRe-run the test. If it still fails, parse again and fix (max 3 retries). If it passes, mark complete.\n\n### When to use\n\n- When a test fails after code changes\n- When the user says \"debug spec\", \"fix failing test\", or \"why is this test failing\"\n- After the Run Unit Tests capability reports failures\n\n---\n\n## Utility Scripts\n\n### scripts/run-related.ts\n\nFinds test files for modified source files and runs them.\n\n```powershell\nnpx tsx .cursor/skills/test-orchestrator/scripts/run-related.ts src/hooks/useAuth.ts src/utils/date.ts\n```\n\nExecute this script; do not read it as reference.\n\n### scripts/parse-failure.py\n\nParses Vitest failure output into structured JSON.\n\n```powershell\npython .cursor/skills/test-orchestrator/scripts/parse-failure.py tmp/test-output.txt\n# or pipe:\ntype tmp\\test-output.txt | python .cursor/skills/test-orchestrator/scripts/parse-failure.py\n```\n\nExecute this script; do not read it as reference.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:36:15.912Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript Agents needing automated testing capabilities with Vitest and jsdom","zh":"适合需要使用Vitest和jsdom进行自动化测试的JavaScript代理","ja":"Vitestとjsdomを使用した自動テスト機能を必要とするJavaScriptエージェントに最適","ko":"Vitest와 jsdom을 사용한 자동화된 테스트 기능이 필요한 JavaScript 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de JavaScript que necesitan capacidades de prueba automatizada con Vitest y jsdom","fr":"Parfait pour les agents JavaScript nécessitant des capacités de test automatisé avec Vitest et jsdom","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript-Agents, die automatisierte Testfunktionen mit Vitest und jsdom benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes JavaScript que precisam de capacidades de teste automatizado com Vitest e jsdom","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов JavaScript, требующих автоматизированных возможностей тестирования с Vitest и jsdom","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء جافا سكريبت الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات اختبار أوتوماتيكية مع Vitest و jsdom"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run unit tests and integration tests using Vitest 3.2.4, and diagnose failing tests autonomously, utilizing jsdom and node scripts for efficient test orchestration","zh":"赋予代理运行单元测试和集成测试的能力，使用Vitest 3.2.4，并使用jsdom和node脚本自主诊断失败的测试，实现高效的测试编排","ja":"エージェントにVitest 3.2.4を使用してユニットテストと統合テストを実行し、jsdomとノードスクリプトを使用して効率的にテストをオーケストレーションし、失敗したテストを自律的に診断する能力を付与","ko":"에이전트가 Vitest 3.2.4를 사용하여 유닛 테스트와 통합 테스트를 실행하고 jsdom 및 노드 스크립트를 사용하여 효율적으로 테스트를 오케스트레이션하며 실패한 테스트를 자율적으로 진단할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas unitarias y de integración utilizando Vitest 3.2.4 y diagnosticar pruebas fallidas de forma autónoma, utilizando jsdom y scripts de node para una orquestación de pruebas eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests unitaires et d''intégration à l''aide de Vitest 3.2.4 et de diagnostiquer les tests défaillants de manière autonome, en utilisant jsdom et des scripts node pour une orchestration de tests efficace","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Einheitstests und Integrationstests mit Vitest 3.2.4 durchzuführen und fehlgeschlagene Tests autonom zu diagnostizieren, indem jsdom und Node-Skripte für eine effiziente Testorchestrierung verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes unitários e de integração usando Vitest 3.2.4 e diagnosticar testes com falha de forma autônoma, utilizando jsdom e scripts de node para orquestração de testes eficiente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать модульные тесты и тесты интеграции с помощью Vitest 3.2.4 и диагностировать неудачные тесты автономно, используя jsdom и скрипты node для эффективной оркестровки тестов","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل الاختبارات الوحدوية واختبارات التكامل باستخدام Vitest 3.2.4 وتشخيص الاختبارات الفاشلة بطريقة مستقلة، باستخدام jsdom وبرامج عقدة لتنسيق الاختبارات الفعال"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test runs for changed files","Debugging failing tests with Debug Spec","Running integration suites for journey testing"],"zh":["自动化更改文件的测试运行","使用调试规范调试失败的测试","运行集成套件进行旅程测试"],"ja":["変更されたファイルのテスト実行を自動化","デバッグ仕様を使用して失敗したテストをデバッグ","統合スイートを実行してジャーニーテストを実行"],"ko":["변경된 파일의 테스트 실행을 자동화","디버깅 사양을 사용하여 실패한 테스트를 디버깅","통합 스위트를 실행하여 여행 테스트를 실행"],"es":["Automatizar ejecuciones de pruebas para archivos modificados","Depurar pruebas fallidas con Debug Spec","Ejecutar suites de integración para pruebas de recorrido"],"fr":["Automatiser les exécutions de tests pour les fichiers modifiés","Déboguer les tests défaillants avec Debug Spec","Exécuter des suites d''intégration pour les tests de parcours"],"de":["Automatisieren von Testläufen für geänderte Dateien","Fehlschlagende Tests mit Debug Spec debuggen","Durchführen von Integrations-Suiten für Reise-Tests"],"pt":["Automatizar execuções de testes para arquivos alterados","Depurar testes com falha com Debug Spec","Executar conjuntos de integração para testes de jornada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать запуски тестов для измененных файлов","Отлаживать неудачные тесты с помощью Debug Spec","Выполнять интеграционные наборы для тестирования путей"],"ar":["أتمتة تشغيل الاختبارات للملفات المعدلة","تصحيح الاختبارات الفاشلة باستخدام Debug Spec","تشغيل مجموعات التكامل لاختبارات الرحلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Vitest 3.2.4 compatibility","jsdom dependency"],"zh":["需要Node.js环境","Vitest 3.2.4兼容性","jsdom依赖"],"ja":["Node.js環境が必要","Vitest 3.2.4の互換性","jsdom依存"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요","Vitest 3.2.4 호환성","jsdom 종속"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Node.js","Compatibilidad con Vitest 3.2.4","Dependencia de jsdom"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Compatibilité avec Vitest 3.2.4","Dépendance de jsdom"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js-Umgebung","Kompatibilität mit Vitest 3.2.4","Abhängigkeit von jsdom"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js","Compatibilidade com Vitest 3.2.4","Dependência de jsdom"],"ru":["Требуется среда Node.js","Совместимость с Vitest 3.2.4","Зависимость от jsdom"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","متوافق مع Vitest 3.2.4","اعتماد على jsdom"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
