認証システムの実装","RESTまたはGraphQL APIの保護","OAuth2/ソーシャルログインの追加","ロールベースのアクセス制御の実装","セッション管理の設計","認証システムの移行"],"ko":["사용자 인증 시스템 구현","REST 또는 GraphQL API 보호","OAuth2/소셜 로그인 추가","역할 기반 접근 제어 구현","세션 관리 설계","인증 시스템 마이그레이션"],"pt":["Implementação de sistemas de autenticação de usuário","Proteção de APIs REST ou GraphQL","Adição de login OAuth2/social","Controle de acesso baseado em funções","Gerenciamento de sessão"],"ru":["Реализация систем аутентификации пользователей","Защита API REST или GraphQL","Добавление входа OAuth2/социального","Контроль доступа на основе ролей","Управление сессиями"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنظمة مصادقة المستخدم","حماية واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST أو GraphQL","إضافة تسجيل الدخول OAuth2/الاجتماعي","مراقبة الوصول حسب الأدوار","إدارة الجلسات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["身份验证","授权","认证系统","安全系统","可扩展系统","OAuth2","社交登录","基于角色的访问控制","会话管理","认证模式"],"ja":["認証","認可","認証システム","安全なシステム","スケーラブルなシステム","OAuth2","ソーシャルログイン","ロールベースのアクセス制御","セッション管理","認証パターン"],"ko":["인증","인가","인증 시스템","안전한 시스템","확장 가능한 시스템","OAuth2","소셜 로그인","역할 기반 접근 제어","세션 관리","인증 패턴"],"pt":["autenticação e autorização","padrões de implementação","sistemas de autenticação","proteção de APIs","login OAuth2","controle de acesso baseado em funções"],"ru":["аутентификация и авторизация","шаблоны реализации","системы аутентификации","защита API","вход OAuth2","контроль доступа на основе ролей"],"ar":["المصادقة والمواثيق","نماذج التنفيذ","أنظمة المصادقة","حماية واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","تسجيل الدخول OAuth2","مراقبة الوصول حسب الأدوار"]}},"owner":"shinnytech","repo":"caiwenqiang-member-rank","repoPath":"shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"auth-implementation-patterns","description":"Master authentication and authorization patterns including JWT, OAuth2, session management, and RBAC to build secure, scalable access control systems. Use when implementing auth systems, securing APIs, or debugging security issues.","bodyPreview":"# Authentication & Authorization Implementation Patterns\n\nBuild secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing user authentication systems\n- Securing REST or GraphQL APIs\n- Adding OAuth2/social login\n- Implementing role-based access control (RBAC)\n- Designing session management\n- Migrating authentication systems\n- Debugging auth issues\n- Implementing SSO or multi-tenancy\n\n## Core Con","body":"# Authentication & Authorization Implementation Patterns\n\nBuild secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing user authentication systems\n- Securing REST or GraphQL APIs\n- Adding OAuth2/social login\n- Implementing role-based access control (RBAC)\n- Designing session management\n- Migrating authentication systems\n- Debugging auth issues\n- Implementing SSO or multi-tenancy\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Authentication vs Authorization\n\n**Authentication (AuthN)**: Who are you?\n- Verifying identity (username/password, OAuth, biometrics)\n- Issuing credentials (sessions, tokens)\n- Managing login/logout\n\n**Authorization (AuthZ)**: What can you do?\n- Permission checking\n- Role-based access control (RBAC)\n- Resource ownership validation\n- Policy enforcement\n\n### 2. Authentication Strategies\n\n**Session-Based:**\n- Server stores session state\n- Session ID in cookie\n- Traditional, simple, stateful\n\n**Token-Based (JWT):**\n- Stateless, self-contained\n- Scales horizontally\n- Can store claims\n\n**OAuth2/OpenID Connect:**\n- Delegate authentication\n- Social login (Google, GitHub)\n- Enterprise SSO\n\n## JWT Authentication\n\n### Pattern 1: JWT Implementation\n\n```typescript\n// JWT structure: header.payload.signature\nimport jwt from ''jsonwebtoken'';\nimport { Request, Response, NextFunction } from ''express'';\n\ninterface JWTPayload {\n    userId: string;\n    email: string;\n    role: string;\n    iat: number;\n    exp: number;\n}\n\n// Generate JWT\nfunction generateTokens(userId: string, email: string, role: string) {\n    const accessToken = jwt.sign(\n        { userId, email, role },\n        process.env.JWT_SECRET!,\n        { expiresIn: ''15m'' }  // Short-lived\n    );\n\n    const refreshToken = jwt.sign(\n        { userId },\n        process.env.JWT_REFRESH_SECRET!,\n        { expiresIn: ''7d'' }  // Long-lived\n    );\n\n    return { accessToken, refreshToken };\n}\n\n// Verify JWT\nfunction verifyToken(token: string): JWTPayload {\n    try {\n        return jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET!) as JWTPayload;\n    } catch (error) {\n        if (error instanceof jwt.TokenExpiredError) {\n            throw new Error(''Token expired'');\n        }\n        if (error instanceof jwt.JsonWebTokenError) {\n            throw new Error(''Invalid token'');\n        }\n        throw error;\n    }\n}\n\n// Middleware\nfunction authenticate(req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) {\n    const authHeader = req.headers.authorization;\n    if (!authHeader?.startsWith(''Bearer '')) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''No token provided'' });\n    }\n\n    const token = authHeader.substring(7);\n    try {\n        const payload = verifyToken(token);\n        req.user = payload;  // Attach user to request\n        next();\n    } catch (error) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Invalid token'' });\n    }\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.get(''/api/profile'', authenticate, (req, res) => {\n    res.json({ user: req.user });\n});\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Refresh Token Flow\n\n```typescript\ninterface StoredRefreshToken {\n    token: string;\n    userId: string;\n    expiresAt: Date;\n    createdAt: Date;\n}\n\nclass RefreshTokenService {\n    // Store refresh token in database\n    async storeRefreshToken(userId: string, refreshToken: string) {\n        const expiresAt = new Date(Date.now() + 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n        await db.refreshTokens.create({\n            token: await hash(refreshToken),  // Hash before storing\n            userId,\n            expiresAt,\n        });\n    }\n\n    // Refresh access token\n    async refreshAccessToken(refreshToken: string) {\n        // Verify refresh token\n        let payload;\n        try {\n            payload = jwt.verify(\n                refreshToken,\n                process.env.JWT_REFRESH_SECRET!\n            ) as { userId: string };\n        } catch {\n            throw new Error(''Invalid refresh token'');\n        }\n\n        // Check if token exists in database\n        const storedToken = await db.refreshTokens.findOne({\n            where: {\n                token: await hash(refreshToken),\n                userId: payload.userId,\n                expiresAt: { $gt: new Date() },\n            },\n        });\n\n        if (!storedToken) {\n            throw new Error(''Refresh token not found or expired'');\n        }\n\n        // Get user\n        const user = await db.users.findById(payload.userId);\n        if (!user) {\n            throw new Error(''User not found'');\n        }\n\n        // Generate new access token\n        const accessToken = jwt.sign(\n            { userId: user.id, email: user.email, role: user.role },\n            process.env.JWT_SECRET!,\n            { expiresIn: ''15m'' }\n        );\n\n        return { accessToken };\n    }\n\n    // Revoke refresh token (logout)\n    async revokeRefreshToken(refreshToken: string) {\n        await db.refreshTokens.deleteOne({\n            token: await hash(refreshToken),\n        });\n    }\n\n    // Revoke all user tokens (logout all devices)\n    async revokeAllUserTokens(userId: string) {\n        await db.refreshTokens.deleteMany({ userId });\n    }\n}\n\n// API endpoints\napp.post(''/api/auth/refresh'', async (req, res) => {\n    const { refreshToken } = req.body;\n    try {\n        const { accessToken } = await refreshTokenService\n            .refreshAccessToken(refreshToken);\n        res.json({ accessToken });\n    } catch (error) {\n        res.status(401).json({ error: ''Invalid refresh token'' });\n    }\n});\n\napp.post(''/api/auth/logout'', authenticate, async (req, res) => {\n    const { refreshToken } = req.body;\n    await refreshTokenService.revokeRefreshToken(refreshToken);\n    res.json({ message: ''Logged out successfully'' });\n});\n```\n\n## Session-Based Authentication\n\n### Pattern 1: Express Session\n\n```typescript\nimport session from ''express-session'';\nimport RedisStore from ''connect-redis'';\nimport { createClient } from ''redis'';\n\n// Setup Redis for session storage\nconst redisClient = createClient({\n    url: process.env.REDIS_URL,\n});\nawait redisClient.connect();\n\napp.use(\n    session({\n        store: new RedisStore({ client: redisClient }),\n        secret: process.env.SESSION_SECRET!,\n        resave: false,\n        saveUninitialized: false,\n        cookie: {\n            secure: process.env.NODE_ENV === ''production'',  // HTTPS only\n            httpOnly: true,  // No JavaScript access\n            maxAge: 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000,  // 24 hours\n            sameSite: ''strict'',  // CSRF protection\n        },\n    })\n);\n\n// Login\napp.post(''/api/auth/login'', async (req, res) => {\n    const { email, password } = req.body;\n\n    const user = await db.users.findOne({ email });\n    if (!user || !(await verifyPassword(password, user.passwordHash))) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Invalid credentials'' });\n    }\n\n    // Store user in session\n    req.session.userId = user.id;\n    req.session.role = user.role;\n\n    res.json({ user: { id: user.id, email: user.email, role: user.role } });\n});\n\n// Session middleware\nfunction requireAuth(req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) {\n    if (!req.session.userId) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n    }\n    next();\n}\n\n// Protected route\napp.get(''/api/profile'', requireAuth, async (req, res) => {\n    const user = await db.users.findById(req.session.userId);\n    res.json({ user });\n});\n\n// Logout\napp.post(''/api/auth/logout'', (req, res) => {\n    req.session.destroy((err) => {\n        if (err) {\n            return res.status(500).json({ error: ''Logout failed'' });\n        }\n        res.clearCookie(''connect.sid'');\n        res.json({ message: ''Logged out successfully'' });\n    });\n});\n```\n\n## OAuth2 / Social Login\n\n### Pattern 1: OAuth2 with Passport.js\n\n```typescript\nimport passport from ''passport'';\nimport { Strategy as GoogleStrategy } from ''passport-google-oauth20'';\nimport { Strategy as GitHubStrategy } from ''passport-github2'';\n\n// Google OAuth\npassport.use(\n    new GoogleStrategy(\n        {\n            clientID: process.env.GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID!,\n            clientSecret: process.env.GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n            callbackURL: ''/api/auth/google/callback'',\n        },\n        async (accessToken, refreshToken, profile, done) => {\n            try {\n                // Find or create user\n                let user = await db.users.findOne({\n                    googleId: profile.id,\n                });\n\n                if (!user) {\n                    user = await db.users.create({\n                        googleId: profile.id,\n                        email: profile.emails?.[0]?.value,\n                        name: profile.displayName,\n                        avatar: profile.photos?.[0]?.value,\n                    });\n                }\n\n                return done(null, user);\n            } catch (error) {\n                return done(error, undefined);\n            }\n        }\n    )\n);\n\n// Routes\napp.get(''/api/auth/google'', passport.authenticate(''google'', {\n    scope: [''profile'', ''email''],\n}));\n\napp.get(\n    ''/api/auth/google/callback'',\n    passport.authenticate(''google'', { session: false }),\n    (req, res) => {\n        // Generate JWT\n        const tokens = generateTokens(req.user.id, req.user.email, req.user.role);\n        // Redirect to frontend with token\n        res.redirect(`${process.env.FRONTEND_URL}/auth/callback?token=${tokens.accessToken}`);\n    }\n);\n```\n\n## Authorization Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```typescript\nenum Role {\n    USER = ''user'',\n    MODERATOR = ''moderator'',\n    ADMIN = ''admin'',\n}\n\nconst roleHierarchy: Record<Role, Role[]> = {\n    [Role.ADMIN]: [Role.ADMIN, Role.MODERATOR, Role.USER],\n    [Role.MODERATOR]: [Role.MODERATOR, Role.USER],\n    [Role.USER]: [Role.USER],\n};\n\nfunction hasRole(userRole: Role, requiredRole: Role): boolean {\n    return roleHierarchy[userRole].includes(requiredRole);\n}\n\n// Middleware\nfunction requireRole(...roles: Role[]) {\n    return (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n        if (!req.user) {\n            return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n        }\n\n        if (!roles.some(role => hasRole(req.user.role, role))) {\n            return res.status(403).json({ error: ''Insufficient permissions'' });\n        }\n\n        next();\n    };\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.delete(''/api/users/:id'',\n    authenticate,\n    requireRole(Role.ADMIN),\n    async (req, res) => {\n        // Only admins can delete users\n        await db.users.delete(req.params.id);\n        res.json({ message: ''User deleted'' });\n    }\n);\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Permission-Based Access Control\n\n```typescript\nenum Permission {\n    READ_USERS = ''read:users'',\n    WRITE_USERS = ''write:users'',\n    DELETE_USERS = ''delete:users'',\n    READ_POSTS = ''read:posts'',\n    WRITE_POSTS = ''write:posts'',\n}\n\nconst rolePermissions: Record<Role, Permission[]> = {\n    [Role.USER]: [Permission.READ_POSTS, Permission.WRITE_POSTS],\n    [Role.MODERATOR]: [\n        Permission.READ_POSTS,\n        Permission.WRITE_POSTS,\n        Permission.READ_USERS,\n    ],\n    [Role.ADMIN]: Object.values(Permission),\n};\n\nfunction hasPermission(userRole: Role, permission: Permission): boolean {\n    return rolePermissions[userRole]?.includes(permission) ?? false;\n}\n\nfunction requirePermission(...permissions: Permission[]) {\n    return (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n        if (!req.user) {\n            return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n        }\n\n        const hasAllPermissions = permissions.every(permission =>\n            hasPermission(req.user.role, permission)\n        );\n\n        if (!hasAllPermissions) {\n            return res.status(403).json({ error: ''Insufficient permissions'' });\n        }\n\n        next();\n    };\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.get(''/api/users'',\n    authenticate,\n    requirePermission(Permission.READ_USERS),\n    async (req, res) => {\n        const users = await db.users.findAll();\n        res.json({ users });\n    }\n);\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Resource Ownership\n\n```typescript\n// Check if user owns resource\nasync function requireOwnership(\n    resourceType: ''post'' | ''comment'',\n    resourceIdParam: string = ''id''\n) {\n    return async (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n        if (!req.user) {\n            return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n        }\n\n        const resourceId = req.params[resourceIdParam];\n\n        // Admins can access anything\n        if (req.user.role === Role.ADMIN) {\n            return next();\n        }\n\n        // Check ownership\n        let resource;\n        if (resourceType === ''post'') {\n            resource = await db.posts.findById(resourceId);\n        } else if (resourceType === ''comment'') {\n            resource = await db.comments.findById(resourceId);\n        }\n\n        if (!resource) {\n            return res.status(404).json({ error: ''Resource not found'' });\n        }\n\n        if (resource.userId !== req.user.userId) {\n            return res.status(403).json({ error: ''Not authorized'' });\n        }\n\n        next();\n    };\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.put(''/api/posts/:id'',\n    authenticate,\n    requireOwnership(''post''),\n    async (req, res) => {\n        // User can only update their own posts\n        const post = await db.posts.update(req.params.id, req.body);\n        res.json({ post });\n    }\n);\n```\n\n## Security Best Practices\n\n### Pattern 1: Password Security\n\n```typescript\nimport bcrypt from ''bcrypt'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\n// Password validation schema\nconst passwordSchema = z.string()\n    .min(12, ''Password must be at least 12 characters'')\n    .regex(/[A-Z]/, ''Password must contain uppercase letter'')\n    .regex(/[a-z]/, ''Password must contain lowercase letter'')\n    .regex(/[0-9]/, ''Password must contain number'')\n    .regex(/[^A-Za-z0-9]/, ''Password must contain special character'');\n\n// Hash password\nasync function hashPassword(password: string): Promise<string> {\n    const saltRounds = 12;  // 2^12 iterations\n    return bcrypt.hash(password, saltRounds);\n}\n\n// Verify password\nasync function verifyPassword(\n    password: string,\n    hash: string\n): Promise<boolean> {\n    return bcrypt.compare(password, hash);\n}\n\n// Registration with password validation\napp.post(''/api/auth/register'', async (req, res) => {\n    try {\n        const { email, password } = req.body;\n\n        // Validate password\n        passwordSchema.parse(password);\n\n        // Check if user exists\n        const existingUser = await db.users.findOne({ email });\n        if (existingUser) {\n            return res.status(400).json({ error: ''Email already registered'' });\n        }\n\n        // Hash password\n        const passwordHash = await hashPassword(password);\n\n        // Create user\n        const user = await db.users.create({\n            email,\n            passwordHash,\n        });\n\n        // Generate tokens\n        const tokens = generateTokens(user.id, user.email, user.role);\n\n        res.status(201).json({\n            user: { id: user.id, email: user.email },\n            ...tokens,\n        });\n    } catch (error) {\n        if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n            return res.status(400).json({ error: error.errors[0].message });\n        }\n        res.status(500).json({ error: ''Registration failed'' });\n    }\n});\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Rate Limiting\n\n```typescript\nimport rateLimit from ''express-rate-limit'';\nimport RedisStore from ''rate-limit-redis'';\n\n// Login rate limiter\nconst loginLimiter = rateLimit({\n    store: new RedisStore({ client: redisClient }),\n    windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,  // 15 minutes\n    max: 5,  // 5 attempts\n    message: ''Too many login attempts, please try again later'',\n    standardHeaders: true,\n    legacyHeaders: false,\n});\n\n// API rate limiter\nconst apiLimiter = rateLimit({\n    windowMs: 60 * 1000,  // 1 minute\n    max: 100,  // 100 requests per minute\n    standardHeaders: true,\n});\n\n// Apply to routes\napp.post(''/api/auth/login'', loginLimiter, async (req, res) => {\n    // Login logic\n});\n\napp.use(''/api/'', apiLimiter);\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Never Store Plain Passwords**: Always hash with bcrypt/argon2\n2. **Use HTTPS**: Encrypt data in transit\n3. **Short-Lived Access Tokens**: 15-30 minutes max\n4. **Secure Cookies**: httpOnly, secure, sameSite flags\n5. **Validate All Input**: Email format, password strength\n6. **Rate Limit Auth Endpoints**: Prevent brute force attacks\n7. **Implement CSRF Protection**: For session-based auth\n8. **Rotate Secrets Regularly**: JWT secrets, session secrets\n9. **Log Security Events**: Login attempts, failed auth\n10. **Use MFA When Possible**: Extra security layer\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Weak Passwords**: Enforce strong password policies\n- **JWT in localStorage**: Vulnerable to XSS, use httpOnly cookies\n- **No Token Expiration**: Tokens should expire\n- **Client-Side Auth Checks Only**: Always validate server-side\n- **Insecure Password Reset**: Use secure tokens with expiration\n- **No Rate Limiting**: Vulnerable to brute force\n- **Trusting Client Data**: Always validate on server\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/jwt-best-practices.md**: JWT implementation guide\n- **references/oauth2-flows.md**: OAuth2 flow diagrams and examples\n- **references/session-security.md**: Secure session management\n- **assets/auth-security-checklist.md**: Security review checklist\n- **assets/password-policy-template.md**: Password requirements template\n- **scripts/token-validator.ts**: JWT validation utility\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:36:59.768Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced authentication and authorization implementation patterns","zh":"非常适合需要高级身份验证和授权实现模式的安全代理","ja":"高度な認証および認可の実装パターンを必要とするセキュリティエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 인증 및 인가 구현 패턴이 필요한 보안 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Seguridad que necesitan patrones de implementación de autenticación y autorización avanzados","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de sécurité ayant besoin de modèles d''implémentation d''authentification et d''autorisation avancés","de":"Perfekt für Sicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsimplementierungsmuster benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança que precisam de padrões avançados de autenticação e implementação de autorização","ru":"Идеально для агентов безопасности, которым необходимы продвинутые шаблоны аутентификации и реализации авторизации","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمنيين الذين يحتاجون إلى أنماط متقدمة من التحقق والمصادقة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement secure, scalable authentication systems using industry-standard patterns like OAuth2, role-based access control (RBAC), and session management, while also supporting multi-tenancy and single sign-on (SSO) capabilities","zh":"赋予代理实现安全、可扩展的身份验证系统的能力，使用行业标准模式，如OAuth2、基于角色的访问控制（RBAC）和会话管理，同时还支持多租户和单点登录（SSO）能力","ja":"OAuth2、ロールベースのアクセス制御（RBAC）およびセッション管理などの業界標準パターンを使用して、セキュアでスケーラブルな認証システムを実装できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、同時にマルチテナンシーとシングルサインオン（SSO）機能もサポート","ko":"OAuth2, 역할 기반 액세스 제어(RBAC) 및 세션 관리와 같은 산업 표준 패턴을 사용하여 보안이고 확장 가능한 인증 시스템을 구현할 수 있는 에이전트를 활성화하고,同時에 다중 테넌시 및 단일 인증(SSO) 기능도 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar sistemas de autenticación seguros y escalables utilizando patrones estándar de la industria como OAuth2, control de acceso basado en roles (RBAC) y gestión de sesiones, y también admite capacidades de multi-tenant y inicio de sesión único (SSO)","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des systèmes d''authentification sécurisés et évolutifs en utilisant des modèles standard de l''industrie tels que OAuth2, contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles (RBAC) et gestion de session, et prend également en charge les capacités de multi-locataire et d''authentification unique (SSO)","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere und skalierbare Authentifizierungssysteme unter Verwendung von Branchenstandardmustern wie OAuth2, rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle (RBAC) und Sitzungsverwaltung zu implementieren, und unterstützt auch Multi-Tenant- und Single-Sign-On-(SSO)-Funktionen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar sistemas de autenticação seguros e escaláveis usando padrões padrão da indústria, como OAuth2, controle de acesso baseado em função (RBAC) e gerenciamento de sessão, além de suportar capacidades de multi-locatário e login único (SSO)","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать безопасные и масштабируемые системы аутентификации, используя отраслевые стандарты, такие как OAuth2, контроль доступа на основе ролей (RBAC) и управление сеансами, а также поддержку возможностей многоарендаторности и единого входа (SSO)","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ أنظمة التحقق المأمونة والقابلة للتطوير باستخدام معايير الصناعة القياسية مثل OAuth2 ومراقبة الوصول القائمة على الدور (RBAC) وإدارة الجلسات، بالإضافة إلى دعم القدرات المتعددة الإيجار والوصول الفردي (SSO)"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing user authentication systems with REST or GraphQL APIs","Debugging authentication issues using modern best practices","Designing and migrating authentication systems to support OAuth2 and social login"],"zh":["使用REST或GraphQL API实现用户身份验证系统","使用现代最佳实践调试身份验证问题","设计和迁移身份验证系统以支持OAuth2和社交登录"],"ja":["RESTまたはGraphQL APIを使用するユーザー認証システムの実装","モダンベストプラクティスを使用して認証の問題をデバッグ","OAuth2およびソーシャルログインをサポートする認証システムの設計および移行"],"ko":["REST 또는 GraphQL API를 사용하여 사용자 인증 시스템 구현","최신 베스트 프랙티스 사용하여 인증 이슈 디버깅","OAuth2 및 소셜 로그인 지원을 위한 인증 시스템 디자인 및 마이그레이션"],"es":["Implementar sistemas de autenticación de usuarios con REST o GraphQL APIs","Depurar problemas de autenticación utilizando las mejores prácticas modernas","Diseñar y migrar sistemas de autenticación para admitir OAuth2 e inicio de sesión social"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des systèmes d''authentification des utilisateurs avec des API REST ou GraphQL","Déboguer les problèmes d''authentification en utilisant les meilleures pratiques modernes","Concevoir et migrer des systèmes d''authentification pour prendre en charge OAuth2 et le login social"],"de":["Implementierung von Benutzerauthentifizierungssystemen mit REST- oder GraphQL-APIs","Beheben von Authentifizierungsproblemen unter Verwendung moderner Best Practices","Entwerfen und Migration von Authentifizierungssystemen zur Unterstützung von OAuth2 und sozialem Login"],"pt":["Implementar sistemas de autenticação de usuário com APIs REST ou GraphQL","Depurar problemas de autenticação usando as melhores práticas modernas","Projetar e migrar sistemas de autenticação para suportar OAuth2 e login social"],"ru":["Реализация систем аутентификации пользователей с использованием REST или GraphQL API","Отладка проблем аутентификации с использованием современных最佳 практик","Проектирование и миграция систем аутентификации для поддержки OAuth2 и социального входа"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنظمة التحقق من المستخدم باستخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST أو GraphQL","تصحيح أخطاء التحقق باستخدام أفضل الممارسات الحديثة","تصميم ونقل أنظمة التحقق لدعم OAuth2 والدخول الاجتماعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of authentication protocols like OAuth2","May require additional setup for multi-tenancy and SSO support"],"zh":["需要OAuth2等身份验证协议的知识","可能需要额外的设置来支持多租户和SSO"],"ja":["OAuth2などの認証プロトコルの知識が必要","マルチテナンシーとSSOのサポートのために追加の設定が必要になる場合"],"ko":["OAuth2 등의 인증 프로토콜에 대한 지식 필요","다중 테넌시 및 SSO 지원을 위한 추가 설정이 필요한 경우"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de protocolos de autenticación como OAuth2","Puede requerir configuración adicional para admitir multi-tenant y soporte SSO"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des protocoles d''authentification tels que OAuth2","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour prendre en charge la multi-locataire et le support SSO"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse von Authentifizierungsprotokollen wie OAuth2","Kann eine zusätzliche Konfiguration für die Unterstützung von Multi-Tenant und SSO-Unterstützung erfordern"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de protocolos de autenticação como OAuth2","Pode exigir configuração adicional para suporte a multi-locatário e SSO"],"ru":["Требует знания протоколов аутентификации, таких как OAuth2","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для поддержки многоарендаторности и SSO"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بروتوكولات التحقق مثل OAuth2","يمكن أن يتطلب إعدادًا إضافيًا لدعم الإيجار المتعدد والوصول الفردي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('santistebanc/quizMaster/frontend-design', 'community', 'santistebanc', 'quizMaster', 'santistebanc/quizMaster', 'frontend-design', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z', '2026-02-18T11:37:09.405Z', NULL, '{"id":"santistebanc/quizMaster/frontend-design","name":"frontend-design","description":{"zh":"前端设计技能指导创建独特的生产级前端界面，实现真实的工作代码和出色的美学细节","ja":"フロントエンドデザインスキルは、独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成し、真の動作コードと優れた美的細節を実現する","ko":"프론트엔드 디자인 스킬은 독특한 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하고 실제 작동하는 코드와優れた 미적 세부 사항을 구현하는 것을 도와줍니다","es":"Este skill permite crear interfaces de frontend personalizadas y de alta calidad, evitando estéticas genéricas. Implementa código de producción con atención al detalle y elecciones creativas.","fr":"Ce skill permet de créer des interfaces de frontend sur mesure et de haute qualité, en évitant les esthétiques génériques. Il implémente du code de production avec attention au détail et des choix créatifs.","de":"Dieser Skill ermöglicht die Erstellung benutzerdefinierter und hochwertiger Frontend-Schnittstellen, die generische Ästhetik vermeiden. Er implementiert Produktionscode mit Aufmerksamkeit für Details und kreative Entscheidungen.","pt":"Este skill ajuda a criar interfaces frontend personalizadas e de produção com atenção aos detalhes estéticos","ru":"Этот навык помогает создавать уникальные интерфейсы frontend с вниманием к эстетическим деталям","ar":"هذا المهارة يساعد على إنشاء واجهات أمامية مخصصة مع عناية بال细节 والإبداع","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"前端设计技能","ja":"フロントエンドデザインスキル","ko":"프론트엔드 디자인 스킬","es":"Diseño de frontend personalizado","fr":"Conception de frontend sur mesure","de":"Benutzerdefiniertes Frontend-Design","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Interfaces Frontend Personalizadas","ru":"Создание уникальных интерфейсов frontend","ar":"تصميم واجهات أمامية مخصصة","en":"frontend-design"},"description":{"zh":"前端设计技能指导创建独特的生产级前端界面，实现真实的工作代码和出色的美学细节","ja":"フロントエンドデザインスキルは、独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成し、真の動作コードと優れた美的細節を実現する","ko":"프론트엔드 디자인 스킬은 독특한 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하고 실제 작동하는 코드와優れた 미적 세부 사항을 구현하는 것을 도와줍니다","es":"Este skill permite crear interfaces de frontend personalizadas y de alta calidad, evitando estéticas genéricas. Implementa código de producción con atención ...","fr":"Ce skill permet de créer des interfaces de frontend sur mesure et de haute qualité, en évitant les esthétiques génériques. Il implémente du code de productio...","de":"Dieser Skill ermöglicht die Erstellung benutzerdefinierter und hochwertiger Frontend-Schnittstellen, die generische Ästhetik vermeiden. Er implementiert Prod...","pt":"Este skill ajuda a criar interfaces frontend personalizadas e de produção com atenção aos detalhes estéticos","ru":"Этот навык помогает создавать уникальные интерфейсы frontend с вниманием к эстетическим деталям","ar":"هذا المهارة يساعد على إنشاء واجهات أمامية مخصصة مع عناية بال细节 والإبداع","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建独特的生产级前端界面","实现真实的工作代码","出色的美学细节","避免通用AI美学","支持多种技术栈"],"ja":["独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成","真の動作コードを実現","優れた美的細節","一般的なAIエステティクスを避ける","複数のテクノロジースタックをサポート"],"ko":["고유한 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성","실제 작동하는 코드를 구현","優れた 미적 세부 사항","일반적인 AI 미학을 피함","多种 기술 스택을 지원"],"es":["Diseño de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Implementación de código de producción de alta calidad","Atención al detalle y elecciones creativas","Evitación de estéticas genéricas","Compatibilidad con diferentes dispositivos y navegadores"],"fr":["Conception d''interfaces utilisateur sur mesure","Implémentation de code de production de haute qualité","Attention au détail et choix créatifs","Évitement des esthétiques génériques","Compatibilité avec différents appareils et navigateurs"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Benutzeroberflächen","Implementierung von hochwertigem Produktionscode","Aufmerksamkeit für Details und kreative Entscheidungen","Vermeidung von generischer Ästhetik","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Geräten und Browsern"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces frontend personalizadas","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Desenvolvimento de componentes e páginas","Implementação de soluções técnicas criativas","Integração com tecnologias frontend","Otimização para experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Создание уникальных интерфейсов frontend","Внимание к эстетическим деталям","Разработка компонентов и страниц","Реализация творческих технических решений","Интеграция с технологиями frontend","Оптимизация для пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات أمامية مخصصة","الانتباه إلى التفاصيل الجمالية","إنشاء مكونات وصفحات","تنفيذ حلول فنية إبداعية","التكامل مع تكنولوجيا الواجهة الأمامية","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级前端界面","AI美学","前端开发","Web开发","界面设计"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイス","AIエステティクス","フロントエンド開発","Web開発","インターフェイスデザイン"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스","AI 미학","프론트엔드 개발","Web 개발","인터페이스 디자인"],"es":["diseño de frontend","interfaces de usuario","código de producción","estéticas personalizadas","desarrollo web","aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["conception de frontend","interfaces utilisateur","code de production","esthétiques sur mesure","développement web","applications mobiles"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Produktionscode","benutzerdefinierte Ästhetik","Web-Entwicklung","Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","interfaces de usuário","design de interface","tecnologias frontend","experiência do usuário","otimização de frontend","componentes frontend","páginas frontend","soluções técnicas criativas"],"ru":["создание интерфейсов frontend","интерфейсы пользователя","дизайн интерфейса","технологии frontend","пользовательский опыт","оптимизация frontend","компоненты frontend","страницы frontend","творческие технические решения"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات أمامية","واجهات المستخدم","تصميم الواجهة","تكنولوجيا الواجهة الأمامية","تجربة المستخدم","تحسين الواجهة الأمامية","مكونات الواجهة الأمامية","صفحات الواجهة الأمامية","حلول فنية إبداعية"]}},"owner":"santistebanc","repo":"quizMaster","repoPath":"santistebanc/quizMaster","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:37:09.405Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Visual AI Agents seeking to craft unique, production-grade frontend interfaces with meticulous attention to aesthetic details.","zh":"适合视觉AI代理创建独特的、生产级的前端界面，并且对美学细节有着严格的关注。","ja":"視覚AIエージェントが独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェースを美的細部に至るまで丁寧に作成するのに適しています。","ko":"시각 AI 에이전트가 독특한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 미적 세부 사항에 철저한 주의를 기울여 제작하기에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Visuales que buscan crear interfaces de frontend únicas y de grado de producción con una atención meticulosa a los detalles estéticos.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Visuels qui cherchent à créer des interfaces de frontend uniques et de niveau de production avec une attention minutieuse aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Ideal für visuelle KI-Agents, die einzigartige, produktionsreife Frontend-Schnittstellen mit peinlicher Beachtung von ästhetischen Details erstellen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Visuais que buscam criar interfaces de frontend únicas e de produção de alta qualidade, com atenção meticulosa aos detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Идеально для визуальных агентов ИИ, стремящихся создавать уникальные интерфейсы frontend высокого качества с тщательным вниманием к эстетическим деталям.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل الإيائي البصري الذين يسعون إلى إنشاء واجهات المستخدم الأمامية الفريدة ومنتجات الجودة مع الانتباه الدقيق للتفاصيل الجمالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate distinctive, real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices, leveraging design thinking principles and bold aesthetic directions, while considering context, purpose, audience, and technical constraints, utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to create custom components, pages, applications, or interfaces.","zh":"赋予代理生成独特的、真正可用的代码，具有对美学细节和创造性选择的异常关注，利用设计思维原则和大胆的美学方向，同时考虑上下文、目的、受众和技术约束，利用HTML、CSS和JavaScript创建自定义组件、页面、应用程序或接口。","ja":"エージェントが独自の、実際に動作するコードを生成できるようにし、美的細部や創造的選択に卓越した注意を払い、デザイン思考の原則や大胆な美的方向性を利用し、コンテキスト、目的、対象者、技術的制約を考慮しながら、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用してカスタムコンポーネント、ページ、応用プログラム、またはインターフェースを作成します。","ko":"에이전트가 독특한 실제 작동 코드를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 미적 세부 사항 및 창의적 선택에 예외적인 주의를 기울이며, 디자인 사고 원칙 및 대담한 미적 방향을 활용하고, 문脈, 목적, 대상, 기술적 제약을 고려하면서 HTML, CSS, JavaScript를 사용하여 사용자 정의 컴포넌트, 페이지, 애플리케이션 또는 인터페이스를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar código distinto y funcional con una atención excepcional a los detalles estéticos y opciones creativas, aprovechando los principios de diseño de pensamiento y direcciones estéticas audaces, al mismo tiempo que se consideran el contexto, el propósito, la audiencia y las limitaciones técnicas, utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript para crear componentes personalizados, páginas, aplicaciones o interfaces.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer un code distinctif et fonctionnel avec une attention exceptionnelle aux détails esthétiques et aux choix créatifs, en exploitant les principes de conception de la pensée et les directions esthétiques audacieuses, tout en considérant le contexte, le but, le public et les contraintes techniques, en utilisant HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour créer des composants personnalisés, des pages, des applications ou des interfaces.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eindeutigen, funktionierenden Code mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details und kreative Entscheidungen zu generieren, indem es die Prinzipien des Design-Denkens und kühne ästhetische Richtungen nutzt, während es Kontext, Zweck, Zielgruppe und technische Einschränkungen berücksichtigt, und HTML, CSS und JavaScript verwendet, um benutzerdefinierte Komponenten, Seiten, Anwendungen oder Schnittstellen zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar código de trabalho real e distinto, com atenção excepcional aos detalhes estéticos e às escolhas criativas, utilizando princípios de design thinking e direções estéticas ousadas, considerando contexto, propósito, audiência e restrições técnicas, utilizando HTML, CSS e JavaScript para criar componentes personalizados, páginas, aplicações ou interfaces.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать отличный, реально работающий код с исключительным вниманием к эстетическим деталям и творческим выборам, используя принципы design thinking и смелые эстетические направления, учитывая контекст, цель, аудиторию и технические ограничения, используя HTML, CSS и JavaScript для создания пользовательских компонентов, страниц, приложений или интерфейсов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على生成 رمز العمل الحقيقي والمتميز مع الانتباه الاستثنائي للتفاصيل الجمالية والاختيارات الإبداعية، باستخدام مبادئ التصميم والاتجاهات الجمالية الجريئة، مع مراعاة السياق والغرض والجمهور والقيود الفنية، باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript لإنشاء مكونات مخصصة وصفحات وتطبيقات أو واجهات."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom UI components with precise aesthetic control","Designing responsive web applications with attention to user experience","Developing unique interface layouts for specific audiences or purposes"],"zh":["创建具有精确美学控制的自定义UI组件","设计响应式Web应用程序，注重用户体验","为特定受众或目的开发独特的界面布局"],"ja":["正確な美的制御を持つカスタムUIコンポーネントを作成する","ユーザーエクスペリエンスに注意を払ったレスポンシブWebアプリケーションを設計する","特定の対象者や目的のためのユニークなインターフェースレイアウトを開発する"],"ko":["정확한 미적 제어를 갖춘 사용자 정의 UI 컴포넌트を作成하기","사용자 경험에 주의를 기울인 반응형 웹 애플리케이션 설계하기","특정 대상이나 목적을 위한 고유한 인터페이스 레이아웃 개발하기"],"es":["Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados con un control estético preciso","Diseñar aplicaciones web responsivas con atención a la experiencia del usuario","Desarrollar diseños de interfaz únicos para audiencias o propósitos específicos"],"fr":["Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés avec un contrôle esthétique précis","Concevoir des applications web responsives avec attention à l''expérience utilisateur","Développer des dispositions d''interface uniques pour des publics ou des objectifs spécifiques"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit präziser ästhetischer Kontrolle","Entwerfen von responsiven Webanwendungen mit Blick auf die Benutzererfahrung","Entwickeln von einzigartigen Schnittstellenlayouts für bestimmte Zielgruppen oder Zwecke"],"pt":["Criar componentes de UI personalizados com controle estético preciso","Projetar aplicações web responsivas com atenção à experiência do usuário","Desenvolver layouts de interface únicos para públicos ou propósitos específicos"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских компонентов UI с точным эстетическим контролем","Проектирование отзывчивых веб-приложений с вниманием к пользовательскому опыту","Разработка уникальных интерфейсных макетов для конкретных аудиторий или целей"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة مع التحكم الدقيق في الجماليات","تصميم تطبيقات الويب المستجيبة مع الانتباه إلى تجربة المستخدم","تطوير تخطيطات واجهة فريدة للجماهير أو الأغراض المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires detailed frontend requirements from the user","May need additional technical constraints for optimal implementation"],"zh":["需要来自用户的详细前端要求","可能需要额外的技术约束以实现最佳实现"],"ja":["ユーザーからの詳細なフロントエンド要件が必要","最適な実装のためには追加の技術的制約が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["사용자로부터詳細한 프론트엔드 요구 사항이 필요","최적의 구현을 위해 추가적인 기술적 제약이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere requisitos de frontend detallados del usuario","Puede necesitar restricciones técnicas adicionales para una implementación óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences de frontend détaillées de l''utilisateur","Peut nécessiter des contraintes techniques supplémentaires pour une mise en œuvre optimale"],"de":["Benötigt detaillierte Anforderungen an die Benutzeroberfläche vom Benutzer","Kann zusätzliche technische Einschränkungen für eine optimale Implementierung benötigen"],"pt":["Exige requisitos de frontend detalhados do usuário","Pode precisar de restrições técnicas adicionais para implementação ótima"],"ru":["Требует детальных требований к frontend от пользователя","Может потребовать дополнительных технических ограничений для оптимальной реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المحددة من المستخدم","يمكن أن يحتاج إلى قيود فنية إضافية للتطبيق الأمثل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vuthuonghai-steve/KLTN/openspec-verify-change', 'community', 'vuthuonghai-steve', 'KLTN', 'vuthuonghai-steve/KLTN', 'openspec-verify-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z', '2026-02-18T11:37:20.734Z', NULL, '{"id":"vuthuonghai-steve/KLTN/openspec-verify-change","name":"openspec-verify-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change 技术验证实现是否匹配变更文档，确保开发一致性","ja":"openspec-verify-change 技術を使用して実装が変更ドキュメントと一致するかを検証し、開発の一貫性を確保","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술을 사용하여 구현이 변경 문서와 일치하는지 검증하고 개발 일관성을 보장","es":"El skill openspec-verify-change verifica que una implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio. Permite a los usuarios seleccionar un cambio y verifica la implementación en consecuencia.","fr":"Le skill openspec-verify-change vérifie que une mise en œuvre correspond aux artefacts de modification. Il permet aux utilisateurs de sélectionner un changement et vérifie la mise en œuvre en conséquence.","de":"Der Skill openspec-verify-change überprüft, ob eine Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt. Er ermöglicht es Benutzern, eine Änderung auszuwählen und überprüft die Implementierung entsprechend.","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta que verifica se uma implementação corresponde às alterações de artefatos, como especificações, tarefas e design.","ru":"Openspec-verify-change - это инструмент, который проверяет соответствие реализации изменениям артефактов, таких как спецификации, задачи и дизайн.","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة لتحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع التغييرات في الملفات المكونة، مثل المواصفات وال مهام والتصميم.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change 技术验证","ja":"openspec-verify-change 技術検証","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술 검증","es":"Verificar cambios con openspec-verify-change","fr":"Vérifier les modifications avec openspec-verify-change","de":"