des mises en œuvre","Sélection des modifications","Utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Exécution des commandes openspec","Compatibilité avec le format JSON"],"de":["Überprüfung von Implementierungen","Auswahl von Änderungen","Verwendung des Tools AskUserQuestion","Ausführung von openspec-Befehlen","Kompatibilität mit JSON-Format"],"pt":["Verificação de alterações de artefatos","Suporte a seleção de alterações","Integração com o comando openspec list","Uso da ferramenta AskUserQuestion","Verificação de implementações de tarefas"],"ru":["Проверка изменений артефактов","Поддержка выбора изменений","Интеграция с командой openspec list","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion","Проверка реализации задач"],"ar":["التحقق من التغييرات في الملفات المكونة","دعم اختيار التغييرات","التكامل مع الأمر openspec list","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion","التحقق من تنفيذ المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-verify-change","技术验证","变更文档","实现匹配","开发一致性","AskUserQuestion","变更名称"],"ja":["openspec-verify-change","技術検証","変更ドキュメント","実装の一致","開発の一貫性","AskUserQuestion","変更名"],"ko":["openspec-verify-change","기술 검증","변경 문서","구현 일치","개발 일관성","AskUserQuestion","변경 이름"],"es":["openspec-verify-change","verificar implementaciones","seleccionar cambios","askuserquestion","comandos openspec","formato json","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["openspec-verify-change","vérifier les mises en œuvre","sélectionner des modifications","askuserquestion","commandes openspec","format json","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["openspec-verify-change","überprüfen von implementierungen","auswählen von änderungen","askuserquestion","openspec-befehle","json-format","software-entwicklung","software-ingeneering"],"pt":["openspec-verify-change","verificação de alterações","arteefatos","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["openspec-verify-change","проверка изменений","артефакты","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["openspec-verify-change","التحقق من التغييرات","الملفات المكونة","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة التعليمات البرمجية","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"vuthuonghai-steve","repo":"KLTN","repoPath":"vuthuonghai-steve/KLTN","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-verify-change","description":"Verify implementation matches change artifacts. Use when the user wants to validate that implementation is complete, correct, and coherent before archiving.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifa","body":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifact exists).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n   Mark changes with incomplete tasks as \"(In Progress)\".\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifacts exist for this change\n\n3. **Get the change directory and load artifacts**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns the change directory and context files. Read all available artifacts from `contextFiles`.\n\n4. **Initialize verification report structure**\n\n   Create a report structure with three dimensions:\n   - **Completeness**: Track tasks and spec coverage\n   - **Correctness**: Track requirement implementation and scenario coverage\n   - **Coherence**: Track design adherence and pattern consistency\n\n   Each dimension can have CRITICAL, WARNING, or SUGGESTION issues.\n\n5. **Verify Completeness**\n\n   **Task Completion**:\n   - If tasks.md exists in contextFiles, read it\n   - Parse checkboxes: `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - Count complete vs total tasks\n   - If incomplete tasks exist:\n     - Add CRITICAL issue for each incomplete task\n     - Recommendation: \"Complete task: <description>\" or \"Mark as done if already implemented\"\n\n   **Spec Coverage**:\n   - If delta specs exist in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`:\n     - Extract all requirements (marked with \"### Requirement:\")\n     - For each requirement:\n       - Search codebase for keywords related to the requirement\n       - Assess if implementation likely exists\n     - If requirements appear unimplemented:\n       - Add CRITICAL issue: \"Requirement not found: <requirement name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Implement requirement X: <description>\"\n\n6. **Verify Correctness**\n\n   **Requirement Implementation Mapping**:\n   - For each requirement from delta specs:\n     - Search codebase for implementation evidence\n     - If found, note file paths and line ranges\n     - Assess if implementation matches requirement intent\n     - If divergence detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Implementation may diverge from spec: <details>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Review <file>:<lines> against requirement X\"\n\n   **Scenario Coverage**:\n   - For each scenario in delta specs (marked with \"#### Scenario:\"):\n     - Check if conditions are handled in code\n     - Check if tests exist covering the scenario\n     - If scenario appears uncovered:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Scenario not covered: <scenario name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Add test or implementation for scenario: <description>\"\n\n7. **Verify Coherence**\n\n   **Design Adherence**:\n   - If design.md exists in contextFiles:\n     - Extract key decisions (look for sections like \"Decision:\", \"Approach:\", \"Architecture:\")\n     - Verify implementation follows those decisions\n     - If contradiction detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Design decision not followed: <decision>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Update implementation or revise design.md to match reality\"\n   - If no design.md: Skip design adherence check, note \"No design.md to verify against\"\n\n   **Code Pattern Consistency**:\n   - Review new code for consistency with project patterns\n   - Check file naming, directory structure, coding style\n   - If significant deviations found:\n     - Add SUGGESTION: \"Code pattern deviation: <details>\"\n     - Recommendation: \"Consider following project pattern: <example>\"\n\n8. **Generate Verification Report**\n\n   **Summary Scorecard**:\n   ```\n   ## Verification Report: <change-name>\n\n   ### Summary\n   | Dimension    | Status           |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | Completeness | X/Y tasks, N reqs|\n   | Correctness  | M/N reqs covered |\n   | Coherence    | Followed/Issues  |\n   ```\n\n   **Issues by Priority**:\n\n   1. **CRITICAL** (Must fix before archive):\n      - Incomplete tasks\n      - Missing requirement implementations\n      - Each with specific, actionable recommendation\n\n   2. **WARNING** (Should fix):\n      - Spec/design divergences\n      - Missing scenario coverage\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   3. **SUGGESTION** (Nice to fix):\n      - Pattern inconsistencies\n      - Minor improvements\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   **Final Assessment**:\n   - If CRITICAL issues: \"X critical issue(s) found. Fix before archiving.\"\n   - If only warnings: \"No critical issues. Y warning(s) to consider. Ready for archive (with noted improvements).\"\n   - If all clear: \"All checks passed. Ready for archive.\"\n\n**Verification Heuristics**\n\n- **Completeness**: Focus on objective checklist items (checkboxes, requirements list)\n- **Correctness**: Use keyword search, file path analysis, reasonable inference - don''t require perfect certainty\n- **Coherence**: Look for glaring inconsistencies, don''t nitpick style\n- **False Positives**: When uncertain, prefer SUGGESTION over WARNING, WARNING over CRITICAL\n- **Actionability**: Every issue must have a specific recommendation with file/line references where applicable\n\n**Graceful Degradation**\n\n- If only tasks.md exists: verify task completion only, skip spec/design checks\n- If tasks + specs exist: verify completeness and correctness, skip design\n- If full artifacts: verify all three dimensions\n- Always note which checks were skipped and why\n\n**Output Format**\n\nUse clear markdown with:\n- Table for summary scorecard\n- Grouped lists for issues (CRITICAL/WARNING/SUGGESTION)\n- Code references in format: `file.ts:123`\n- Specific, actionable recommendations\n- No vague suggestions like \"consider reviewing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:37:20.734Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring precise implementation verification against change artifacts and specs.","zh":"适用于需要对变更文档和规格进行精确实现验证的开发代理。","ja":"変更アーティファクトおよび仕様に対する正確な実装の検証が必要な開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"변경 아티팩트 및 사양에 대한 정확한 구현 검증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una verificación de implementación precisa contra artefactos de cambio y especificaciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une vérification d''implémentation précise contre les artefacts de modification et les spécifications.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine präzise Implementierungsverifizierung gegen Änderungsartefakte und Spezifikationen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem verificação de implementação precisa contra artefatos de alteração e especificações.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих точной верификации реализации по отношению к артефактам изменений и спецификациям.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيين الذين يتطلبون التحقق الدقيق للتطبيق مقابل محارف التغيير والمواصفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change artifacts using openspec, ensuring accuracy by running `openspec list --json` and leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, all while handling JSON data and potential ambiguity in change names.","zh":"赋予代理验证实现是否匹配变更文档，使用openspec确保准确性，通过运行`openspec list --json`并利用AskUserQuestion工具进行用户选择，同时处理JSON数据和变更名称的潜在模糊性。","ja":"エージェントが実装が変更アーティファクトと一致することを検証できるようにし、openspecを使用して精度を確保し、`openspec list --json`を実行し、AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザー選択を行い、JSONデータと変更名の潜在的な曖昧性を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 구현이 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 검증할 수 있도록 하며, openspec를 사용하여 정확성을 보장하고, `openspec list --json`을 실행하고, AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자 선택을 수행하며, JSON 데이터와 변경 이름의 잠재적인 모호성을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar que la implementación coincide con los artefactos de cambio utilizando openspec, garantizando la precisión al ejecutar `openspec list --json` y aprovechando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la selección del usuario, todo mientras se manejan datos JSON y la posible ambigüedad en los nombres de los cambios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que l''implémentation correspond aux artefacts de modification en utilisant openspec, en garantissant l''exactitude en exécutant `openspec list --json` et en exploitant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection de l''utilisateur, le tout en gérant les données JSON et l''ambiguïté potentielle dans les noms de modification.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Implementierung zu überprüfen, ob sie mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt, indem openspec verwendet wird, wodurch die Genauigkeit durch Ausführen von `openspec list --json` und durch die Nutzung des AskUserQuestion-Tools für die Benutzerauswahl gewährleistet wird, während JSON-Daten und potenzielle Mehrdeutigkeit in den Änderungsnamen gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar se a implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração usando openspec, garantindo a precisão executando `openspec list --json` e utilizando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção do usuário, lidando com dados JSON e potencial ambiguidade nos nomes de alteração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить соответствие реализации артефактам изменений с помощью openspec, обеспечивая точность путем выполнения `openspec list --json` и использования инструмента AskUserQuestion для выбора пользователя, а также обрабатывая данные JSON и потенциальную двусмысленность в именах изменений.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التحقق من تطابق التطبيق مع محارف التغيير باستخدام openspec، وتأمين الدقة من خلال تشغيل `openspec list --json` واستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار المستخدم، مع التعامل مع بيانات JSON والغموض المحتمل في أسماء التغيير."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying implementation against specified change artifacts","Automating the process of checking for implementation matches","Debugging discrepancies between implementation and change specs"],"zh":["验证实现是否符合指定的变更文档","自动化实现匹配检查过程","调试实现与变更规格之间的差异"],"ja":["実装が指定された変更アーティファクトと一致することを検証する","実装のマッチングの確認プロセスを自動化する","実装と変更仕様の差異をデバッグする"],"ko":["구현이 지정된 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 검증する","구현 일치 확인 프로세스를 자동화하는","구현과 변경 사양의 차이를 디버깅하는"],"es":["Verificar la implementación contra los artefactos de cambio especificados","Automatizar el proceso de comprobación de coincidencias de implementación","Depurar discrepancias entre la implementación y las especificaciones de cambio"],"fr":["Vérifier l''implémentation contre les artefacts de modification spécifiés","Automatiser le processus de vérification des correspondances d''implémentation","Déboguer les écarts entre l''implémentation et les spécifications de modification"],"de":["Überprüfen der Implementierung gegen die angegebenen Änderungsartefakte","Automatisieren des Prozesses zum Überprüfen von Implementierungsübereinstimmungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Diskrepanzen zwischen Implementierung und Änderungsspezifikationen"],"pt":["Verificar a implementação contra artefatos de alteração especificados","Automatizar o processo de verificação da correspondência da implementação","Depurar discrepâncias entre a implementação e as especificações de alteração"],"ru":["Проверка реализации против указанных артефактов изменений","Автоматизация процесса проверки соответствия реализации","Отладка несоответствий между реализацией и спецификациями изменений"],"ar":["التحقق من التطبيق مقابل محارف التغيير المحددة","تأتمتة عملية التحقق من تطابق التطبيق","تصحيح الأخطاء بين التطبيق ومواصفات التغيير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Needs access to change artifacts and implementation details","May prompt for user input if change name is vague or ambiguous"],"zh":["需要openspec的安装和配置","需要访问变更文档和实现细节","可能会提示用户输入如果变更名称不明确或模糊"],"ja":["openspecのインストールと設定が必要","変更アーティファクトおよび実装の詳細にアクセスする必要がある","変更名が曖昧または不明確な場合、ユーザー入力を求めることがある"],"ko":["openspec의 설치 및 구성이 필요함","변경 아티팩트 및 구현 세부 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요함","변경 이름이 모호하거나 불분명한 경우 사용자 입력을 요청할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de openspec","Necesita acceso a los artefactos de cambio y a los detalles de implementación","Puede solicitar la entrada del usuario si el nombre del cambio es vago o ambiguo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''openspec","Nécessite l''accès aux artefacts de modification et aux détails d''implémentation","Peut demander une entrée utilisateur si le nom de la modification est vague ou ambigu"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von openspec","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Änderungsartefakte und die Implementierungsdetails","Kann die Eingabe des Benutzers erfordern, wenn der Änderungsname vage oder mehrdeutig ist"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do openspec","Necessita acesso a artefatos de alteração e detalhes de implementação","Pode solicitar entrada do usuário se o nome da alteração for vago ou ambíguo"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации openspec","Требует доступа к артефактам изменений и деталям реализации","Может запросить ввод пользователя, если имя изменения неоднозначно или двусмысленно"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين openspec","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى محارف التغيير و细يات التطبيق","يمكن أن يطلب إدخال المستخدم إذا كان اسم التغيير غامض أو غير واضح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Chenm4/VoiceChatAssistant/frontend-design', 'community', 'Chenm4', 'VoiceChatAssistant', 'Chenm4/VoiceChatAssistant', 'frontend-design', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z', '2026-02-18T11:37:12.414Z', NULL, '{"id":"Chenm4/VoiceChatAssistant/frontend-design","name":"frontend-design","description":{"zh":"该技能指导创建独特的生产级前端界面，注重美学细节和创意选择。","ja":"このスキルは、独自の生産レベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成するためのガイドであり、美的細部と創造的な選択に焦点を当てています。","ko":"이 스킬은 독특한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하는 방법에 대한 안내로, 미적 세부 사항과 창의적 선택에 중점을 둡니다.","es":"El diseño de frontend guía la creación de interfaces de usuario distintivas y de alta calidad","fr":"La conception de frontend guide la création d''interfaces utilisateur distinctives et de haute qualité","de":"Der Frontend-Design leitet die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten und hochwertigen Benutzeroberflächen","pt":"O skill de frontend-design permite criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e de alta qualidade, evitando estéticas genéricas.","ru":"Навык frontend-design позволяет создавать индивидуальные и высококачественные пользовательские интерфейсы, избегая общих эстетических решений.","ar":"تمكن مهارة تصميم الواجهة الأمامية من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة وذات جودة عالية، وتجنب الجماليات العامة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"前端设计技巧","ja":"フロントエンドデザインスキル","ko":"프론트엔드 디자인 스킬","es":"Diseño de frontend personalizado","fr":"Conception de frontend sur mesure","de":"Maßgeschneiderter Frontend-Design","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Frontend Personalizado","ru":"Индивидуальный фронтенд-дизайн","ar":"تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة","en":"frontend-design"},"description":{"zh":"该技能指导创建独特的生产级前端界面，注重美学细节和创意选择。","ja":"このスキルは、独自の生産レベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成するためのガイドであり、美的細部と創造的な選択に焦点を当てています。","ko":"이 스킬은 독특한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하는 방법에 대한 안내로, 미적 세부 사항과 창의적 선택에 중점을 둡니다.","es":"El diseño de frontend guía la creación de interfaces de usuario distintivas y de alta calidad","fr":"La conception de frontend guide la création d''interfaces utilisateur distinctives et de haute qualité","de":"Der Frontend-Design leitet die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten und hochwertigen Benutzeroberflächen","pt":"O skill de frontend-design permite criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e de alta qualidade, evitando estéticas genéricas.","ru":"Навык frontend-design позволяет создавать индивидуальные и высококачественные пользовательские интерфейсы, избегая общих эстетических решений.","ar":"تمكن مهارة تصميم الواجهة الأمامية من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة وذات جودة عالية، وتجنب الجماليات العامة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建独特的生产级前端界面","注重美学细节和创意选择","理解设计背景和目的","实现实用的代码和技术约束"],"ja":["独自の生産レベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成","美的細部と創造的な選択に焦点を当てる","デザインの背景と目的を理解する","実用的コードと技術的制約を実現する"],"ko":["독특한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성","미적 세부 사항과 창의적 선택에 중점을 둠","디자인의 배경과 목적을 이해","실用的 코드와 기술적 제약을 구현"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Atención al detalle y opciones creativas","Implementación de código de producción de alta calidad","Diseño de componentes y páginas web","Desarrollo de aplicaciones y interfaces de usuario"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces utilisateur sur mesure","Attention aux détails et options créatives","Mise en œuvre de code de production de haute qualité","Conception de composants et de pages web","Développement d''applications et d''interfaces utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen","Besondere Aufmerksamkeit für Details und kreative Optionen","Implementierung von hochwertigem Produktionscode","Design von Komponenten und Webseiten","Entwicklung von Anwendungen und Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Implementação de código de trabalho real","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Desenvolvimento de aplicações web de alta qualidade","Evitação de estéticas genéricas"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных пользовательских интерфейсов","Реализация рабочего кода","Внимание к эстетическим деталям","Разработка высококачественных веб-приложений","Избежание общих эстетических решений"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تنفيذ رمز العمل الحقيقي","الاهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية","تنمية تطبيقات الويب ذات الجودة العالية","تجنب الجماليات العامة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级界面","美学细节","创意选择","用户界面","前端开发"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","生産レベルのインターフェイス","美的細部","創造的な選択","ユーザーインターフェイス","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","생산급 인터페이스","미적 세부 사항","창의적 선택","사용자 인터페이스","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["diseño de frontend","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo web","codificación","diseño de componentes","aplicaciones web","experiencia de usuario","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["conception de frontend","interfaces utilisateur","développement web","codage","conception de composants","applications web","expérience utilisateur","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung","Codierung","Komponenten-Design","Webanwendungen","Benutzererfahrung","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["frontend-design","desenvolvimento de frontend","interfaces de usuário personalizadas","código de trabalho real","estéticas genéricas","aplicações web de alta qualidade"],"ru":["frontend-design","разработка фронтенда","индивидуальные пользовательские интерфейсы","рабочий код","общие эстетические решения","высококачественные веб-приложения"],"ar":["تصميم الواجهة الأمامية","تنمية الواجهة الأمامية","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","رمز العمل الحقيقي","الجماليات العامة","تطبيقات الويب ذات الجودة العالية"]}},"owner":"Chenm4","repo":"VoiceChatAssistant","repoPath":"Chenm4/VoiceChatAssistant","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:37:12.414Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused AI Agents needing production-grade frontend interface creation with exceptional aesthetic details.","zh":"非常适合需要生产级前端界面创建的UI焦点AI代理，具有出色的美学细节。","ja":"プロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイス作成が必要なUI重視のAIエージェントに最適で、優れた美的詳細を備えています。","ko":"생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스 생성이 필요한 UI 중심의 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 예외적인 미적 세부 사항을 가지고 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA centrados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan la creación de interfaces de frontend de grado de producción con detalles estéticos excepcionales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant la création d''interfaces frontend de grade de production avec des détails esthétiques exceptionnels.","de":"Perfekt für benutzeroberflächenorientierte KI-Agents, die eine erstklassige Frontend-Schnittstellen-Erstellung mit außergewöhnlichen ästhetischen Details benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em UI que necessitam de criação de interface de frontend de produção com detalhes estéticos excepcionais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на пользовательский интерфейс, которым необходима создание фронтенд-интерфейса уровня производства с исключительными эстетическими деталями.","ar":"مثالي لعميلة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تركز على واجهة المستخدم والتي تحتاج إلى إنشاء واجهة أمامية من الدرجة الأولى مع تفاصيل جمالية استثنائية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, real working code with attention to creative choices, implementing bold aesthetic directions using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, while avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics.","zh":"赋予代理创建独特的、真正可工作的代码的能力，注重创造性的选择，实施大胆的美学方向，使用HTML、CSS和JavaScript，同时避免通用的''AI乱码''美学。","ja":"HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用して、大胆な美的方向を実装し、創造的な選択に注目しながら、汎用的な『AIスロップ』美学を避けることで、独自の、実際に動作するコードを作成するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"HTML, CSS, JavaScript를 사용하여 대담한 미적 방향을 구현하고, 창의적인 선택에注目하면서, 일반적인 ''AI 스크럽'' 미학을 피함으로써, 독특한 실제 작동 코드를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear código de trabajo real y distintivo, con atención a las opciones creativas, implementando direcciones estéticas atrevidas utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript, evitando al mismo tiempo la estética genérica de ''suciedad de IA''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un code de travail réel et distinctif, en prêtant attention aux choix créatifs, en mettant en œuvre des directions esthétiques audacieuses en utilisant HTML, CSS et JavaScript, tout en évitant l''esthétique générique de ''sloppiness d''IA''.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, einzigartigen, funktionierenden Code zu erstellen, wobei die kreativen Entscheidungen berücksichtigt und mutige ästhetische Richtungen mithilfe von HTML, CSS und JavaScript umgesetzt werden, während gleichzeitig die generische ''KI-Schlamperei''-Ästhetik vermieden wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar códigos distintos e funcionais com atenção às escolhas criativas, implementando direções estéticas ousadas usando HTML, CSS e JavaScript, evitando assim estéticas genéricas de ''slop de IA''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отличительный, реально работающий код с вниманием к творческим решениям, реализуя смелые эстетические направления с помощью HTML, CSS и JavaScript, избегая при этом эстетики общего ''слоу ИИ''.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من创اطة رموز متميزة وعملية مع اهتمام بالخيارات الإبداعية، وتنفيذ اتجاهات جمالية جريئة باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript، وتجنب الجماليات العامة ل ''سلوك الذكاء الاصطناعي''."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web applications","Generating custom UI components","Creating visually appealing page layouts"],"zh":["设计响应式Web应用程序","生成自定义UI组件","创建视觉上吸引人的页面布局"],"ja":["レスポンシブWebアプリケーションの設計","カスタムUIコンポーネントの生成","視覚的に魅力的なページレイアウトの作成"],"ko":["반응형 웹 애플리케이션 디자인","사용자 지정 UI 구성 요소 생성","시각적으로 매력적인 페이지 레이아웃 생성"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones web responsivas","Generar componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados","Crear diseños de página visualmente atractivos"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications web réactives","Générer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés","Créer des dispositions de page visuellement attrayantes"],"de":["Reaktive Webanwendungen entwerfen","Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten anpassen","Visuell ansprechende Seitengestaltungen erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar aplicações web responsivas","Gerar componentes de UI personalizados","Criar layouts de página visualmente atraentes"],"ru":["Проектирование отзывчивых веб-приложений","Генерация настраиваемых компонентов пользовательского интерфейса","Создание визуально привлекательных макетов страниц"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات ويب مستجيبة","generando مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","إنشاء تخطيطات صفحة بصرية جذابة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements","Dependent on technical constraints and context"],"zh":["需要用户提供的前端要求","依赖于技术约束和上下文"],"ja":["ユーザー提供のフロントエンド要件が必要","技術的な制約やコンテキストに依存する"],"ko":["사용자 제공의 프론트엔드 요구 사항이 필요","기술적 제약과 컨텍스트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere requisitos de frontend proporcionados por el usuario","Depende de las limitaciones técnicas y del contexto"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences de frontend fournies par l''utilisateur","Dépend des contraintes techniques et du contexte"],"de":["Benötigt vom Benutzer bereitgestellte Frontend-Anforderungen","Hängt von den technischen Einschränkungen und dem Kontext ab"],"pt":["Exige requisitos de frontend fornecidos pelo usuário","Dependente de restrições técnicas e contexto"],"ru":["Требует наличия требований фронтенда, предоставляемых пользователем","Зависит от технических ограничений и контекста"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية التي يقدمها المستخدم","يعتمد على القيود الفنية والسياق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/git-pushing', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'git-pushing', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z', '2026-02-18T11:37:29.777Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/git-pushing","name":"git-pushing","description":{"zh":"Git 推送工作流是一种自动化代码提交的功能，通过脚本实现代码的提交和推送","ja":"Git プッシュワークフローは、コードの自動コミット機能であり、スクリプトを使用してコードをコミットおよびプッシュします","ko":"Git 푸시 워크플로우는 자동 코드 커밋 기능으로, 스크립트를 사용하여 코드를 커밋하고 푸시합니다","es":"El agente de habilidades de git-pushing automatiza el flujo de trabajo de Git, permitiendo a los desarrolladores realizar un proceso de git push eficiente.","fr":"L''agent de compétences de git-pushing automatise le flux de travail Git, permettant aux développeurs de réaliser un processus de git push efficace.","de":"Der Git-Pushing-Skill-Agent automatisiert den Git-Arbeitsablauf, ermöglicht es Entwicklern, einen effizienten Git-Push-Prozess durchzuführen.","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de Git Push é uma forma automatizada de salvar alterações no repositório remoto","ru":"Поток работы Git Push — это автоматизированный способ сохранять изменения в удаленном репозитории","ar":"تدفق عمل Git Push هو طريقة تلقائية لحفظ التعديلات في المستودع البعيد","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Git 推送工作流 - 自动化代码提交","ja":"Git プッシュワークフロー - コードの自動コミット","ko":"Git 푸시 워크플로우 - 자동 코드 커밋","es":"Flujo de trabajo de Git Push","fr":"Flux de travail Git Push","de":"Git Push Arbeitsablauf","pt":"Git Push: Fluxo de Trabalho Automatizado","ru":"Git Push: Автоматизированный Workflow","ar":"Git Push: تدفق العمل التلقائي","en":"git-pushing"},"description":{"zh":"Git 推送工作流是一种自动化代码提交的功能，通过脚本实现代码的提交和推送","ja":"Git プッシュワークフローは、コードの自動コミット機能であり、スクリプトを使用してコードをコミットおよびプッシュします","ko":"Git 푸시 워크플로우는 자동 코드 커밋 기능으로, 스크립트를 사용하여 코드를 커밋하고 푸시합니다","es":"El agente de habilidades de git-pushing automatiza el flujo de trabajo de Git, permitiendo a los desarrolladores realizar un proceso de git push eficiente.","fr":"L''agent de compétences de git-pushing automatise le flux de travail Git, permettant aux développeurs de réaliser un processus de git push efficace.","de":"Der Git-Pushing-Skill-Agent automatisiert den Git-Arbeitsablauf, ermöglicht es Entwicklern, einen effizienten Git-Push-Prozess durchzuführen.","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de Git Push é uma forma automatizada de salvar alterações no repositório remoto","ru":"Поток работы Git Push — это автоматизированный способ сохранять изменения в удаленном репозитории","ar":"تدفق عمل Git Push هو طريقة تلقائية لحفظ التعديلات في المستودع البعيد","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化代码提交","通过脚本实现代码推送","提高开发效率","支持多种 Git 命令","简化代码管理流程"],"ja":["コードの自動コミット","スクリプトを使用したコードプッシュ","開発効率の向上","複数の Git コマンドのサポート","コード管理プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["자동 코드 커밋","스크립트를 사용한 코드 푸시","개발 효율성 향상","여러 가지 Git 명령어 지원","코드 관리 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Automatización del flujo de trabajo de Git","Creación de un compromiso convencional","Envío a la rama remota","Uso de scripts para evitar comandos manuales de Git","Activación automática al guardar cambios","Compatibilidad con frases de voz para git push"],"fr":["Automatisation du flux de travail Git","Création d''un engagement conventionnel","Envoi à la branche distante","Utilisation de scripts pour éviter les commandes manuelles de Git","Activation automatique lors de la sauvegarde des modifications","Compatibilité avec les phrases de voix pour git push"],"de":["Automatisierung des Git-Arbeitsablaufs","Erstellung eines konventionellen Commits","Übertragung auf den Remote-Zweig","Verwendung von Skripten, um manuelle Git-Befehle zu vermeiden","Automatische Aktivierung beim Speichern von Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit Sprachphrasen für Git-Push"],"pt":["Automatização de alterações","Criação de commits convencionais","Envio de alterações para o repositório remoto","Uso de scripts personalizados","Integração com o fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизация изменений","Создание конвенциональных коммитов","Отправка изменений в удаленный репозиторий","Использование индивидуальных скриптов","Интеграция с потоком работы разработки"],"ar":["التوفير التلقائي للتعديلات","إنشاء التعديلات التقليدية","إرسال التعديلات إلى المستودع البعيد","استخدام البرامج النصية المخصصة","التكامل مع تدفق عمل التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 推送工作流","自动化代码提交","Git 脚本","代码管理","开发效率","Git 命令"],"ja":["Git プッシュワークフロー","コードの自動コミット","Git スクリプト","コード管理","開発効率","Git コマンド"],"ko":["Git 푸시 워크플로우","자동 코드 커밋","Git 스크립트","코드 관리","개발 효율성","Git 명령어"],"es":["git push","flujo de trabajo de Git","automatización de Git","desarrollo de software","control de versiones","git pushing","agente de habilidades","script de Git","compromiso convencional"],"fr":["git push","flux de travail Git","automatisation de Git","développement de logiciels","contrôle de version","git pushing","agent de compétences","script de Git","engagement conventionnel"],"de":["git push","Git-Arbeitsablauf","Automatisierung von Git","Software-Entwicklung","Versionskontrolle","git pushing","Skill-Agent","Git-Skript","konventioneller Commit"],"pt":["git push","fluxo de trabalho","automatização","desenvolvimento de software","repositório remoto","commits convencionais"],"ru":["git push","поток работы","автоматизация","разработка программного обеспечения","удаленный репозиторий","конвенциональные коммиты"],"ar":["git push","تدفق العمل","التوفير التلقائي","تطوير البرمجيات","المستودع البعيد","التعديلات التقليدية"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-pushing","description":"Stage, commit, and push git changes with conventional commit messages. Use when user wants to commit and push changes, mentions pushing to remote, or asks to save and push their work. Also activates when user says push changes, commit and push, push this, push to github, or similar git workflow requests.","bodyPreview":"# Git Push Workflow\n\nStage all changes, create a conventional commit, and push to the remote branch.\n\n## When to Use\n\nAutomatically activate when the user:\n\n- Explicitly asks to push changes (\"push this\", \"commit and push\")\n- Mentions saving work to remote (\"save to github\", \"push to remote\")\n- Completes a feature and wants to share it\n- Says phrases like \"let''s push this up\" or \"commit these changes\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n**ALWAYS use the script** - do NOT use manual git commands:\n\n```bash\nbash skills/","body":"# Git Push Workflow\n\nStage all changes, create a conventional commit, and push to the remote branch.\n\n## When to Use\n\nAutomatically activate when the user:\n\n- Explicitly asks to push changes (\"push this\", \"commit and push\")\n- Mentions saving work to remote (\"save to github\", \"push to remote\")\n- Completes a feature and wants to share it\n- Says phrases like \"let''s push this up\" or \"commit these changes\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n**ALWAYS use the script** - do NOT use manual git commands:\n\n```bash\nbash skills/git-pushing/scripts/smart_commit.sh\n```\n\nWith custom message:\n\n```bash\nbash skills/git-pushing/scripts/smart_commit.sh \"feat: add feature\"\n```\n\nScript handles: staging, conventional commit message, Claude footer, push with -u flag.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:37:29.777Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated Git workflow management and version control","zh":"适用于需要自动化 Git 工作流管理和版本控制的开发代理","ja":"開発エージェントが自動化された Git ワークフロー管理とバージョン管理を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"自动화된 Git 워크플로 관리 및 버전 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren gestión de flujo de trabajo de Git automatizada y control de 