erificar cambios con openspec-verify-change","fr":"Vérifier les modifications avec openspec-verify-change","de":"Änderungen mit openspec-verify-change überprüfen","pt":"Verificador de Alterações Openspec","ru":"Проверка изменений Openspec","ar":"مُصادق تغييرات Openspec","en":"openspec-verify-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change技能用于验证实现是否与变更规范相符，确保开发项目的准确性和效率","ja":"openspec-verify-changeスキルは、実装が変更仕様に従っているかを検証し、開発プロジェクトの精度と効率を確保します","ko":"openspec-verify-change 스킬은 구현이 변경 사양에 따라 수행되는지 검증하여 개발 프로젝트의 정확성과 효율성을 보장합니다","es":"openspec-verify-change es una herramienta que verifica que la implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio, como especificaciones, tareas y diseños","fr":"openspec-verify-change est un outil qui vérifie que la mise en œuvre correspond aux artefacts de modification, tels que les spécifications, les tâches et les...","de":"openspec-verify-change ist ein Tool, das überprüft, ob die Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten wie Spezifikationen, Aufgaben und Designs übereinstimmt","pt":"O Openspec-Verify-Change é uma ferramenta que verifica se a implementação corresponde às alterações de artefatos, como especificações, tarefas e design.","ru":"Openspec-Verify-Change - это инструмент, который проверяет, соответствует ли реализация изменениям артефактов, таких как спецификации, задачи и дизайн.","ar":"Openspec-Verify-Change هو أداة تحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع تغييرات الملفات المضغوطة، مثل المواصفات والأدوار والتصميم.","en":"Complex Unzip Tool v2 is a powerful and intelligent archive extraction utility designed to handle complex archive scenarios.复杂解压工具 v2 是一个功能强大且智能的档案提取实用程序，专为处..."},"definition":{"en":"Complex Unzip Tool v2 is a powerful and intelligent archive extraction utility designed to handle complex archive scenarios.复杂解压工具 v2 是一个功能强大且智能的档案提取实用程序，专为处理复杂的档案场景而设计。"},"features":{"zh":["验证实现与变更规范的相符性","支持变更名称的输入和推断","提供可用的变更列表","使用AskUserQuestion工具进行用户交互"],"ja":["実装と変更仕様の相符性を検証","変更名称の入力と推論をサポート","利用可能な変更の一覧を提供","AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーとやり取り"],"ko":["구현과 변경 사양의 일치性을 검증","변경 이름의 입력과 추론을 지원","사용 가능한 변경 목록을 제공","AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 사용자와 상호작용"],"es":["Verificación de implementación de cambios","Compatibilidad con artefactos de cambio como especificaciones y tareas","Selección de cambios disponibles mediante la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Ejecución de comandos como openspec list --json","Inferrer de cambios a partir del contexto de la conversación"],"fr":["Vérification de la mise en œuvre des modifications","Compatibilité avec les artefacts de modification tels que les spécifications et les tâches","Sélection des modifications disponibles via l''outil AskUserQuestion","Exécution de commandes comme openspec list --json","Inférence des modifications à partir du contexte de la conversation"],"de":["Überprüfung der Implementierung von Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit Änderungsartefakten wie Spezifikationen und Aufgaben","Auswahl verfügbarer Änderungen über das Tool AskUserQuestion","Ausführung von Befehlen wie openspec list --json","Ableitung von Änderungen aus dem Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Verificação de implementação","Suporte a alterações de artefatos","Integração com o AskUserQuestion","Listagem de alterações disponíveis","Seleção de alterações pelo usuário"],"ru":["Проверка реализации","Поддержка изменений артефактов","Интеграция с AskUserQuestion","Список доступных изменений","Выбор изменений пользователем"],"ar":["تحقق من التنفيذ","دعم تغييرات الملفات المضغوطة","التكامل مع AskUserQuestion","قائمة التغييرات المتاحة","اختيار التغييرات من قبل المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-verify-change","变更规范","实现验证","开发效率","AskUserQuestion","变更名称"],"ja":["openspec-verify-change","変更仕様","実装検証","開発効率","AskUserQuestion","変更名称"],"ko":["openspec-verify-change","변경 사양","구현 검증","개발 효율성","AskUserQuestion","변경 이름"],"es":["verificación de implementación","artefactos de cambio","openspec-verify-change","desarrollo de software","herramientas de verificación","implementación de cambios"],"fr":["vérification de la mise en œuvre","artefacts de modification","openspec-verify-change","développement de logiciels","outils de vérification","mise en œuvre des modifications"],"de":["Implementierungsüberprüfung","Änderungsartefakte","openspec-verify-change","Softwareentwicklung","Überprüfungstools","Implementierung von Änderungen"],"pt":["Openspec-Verify-Change","verificação de implementação","alterações de artefatos","AskUserQuestion","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Openspec-Verify-Change","проверка реализации","изменения артефактов","AskUserQuestion","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Openspec-Verify-Change","تحقق من التنفيذ","تغييرات الملفات المضغوطة","AskUserQuestion","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"rozx","repo":"Complex-unzip-tool-v2","repoPath":"rozx/Complex-unzip-tool-v2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-verify-change","description":"Verify implementation matches change artifacts. Use when the user wants to validate that implementation is complete, correct, and coherent before archiving.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifa","body":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifact exists).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n   Mark changes with incomplete tasks as \"(In Progress)\".\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifacts exist for this change\n\n3. **Get the change directory and load artifacts**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns the change directory and context files. Read all available artifacts from `contextFiles`.\n\n4. **Initialize verification report structure**\n\n   Create a report structure with three dimensions:\n   - **Completeness**: Track tasks and spec coverage\n   - **Correctness**: Track requirement implementation and scenario coverage\n   - **Coherence**: Track design adherence and pattern consistency\n\n   Each dimension can have CRITICAL, WARNING, or SUGGESTION issues.\n\n5. **Verify Completeness**\n\n   **Task Completion**:\n   - If tasks.md exists in contextFiles, read it\n   - Parse checkboxes: `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - Count complete vs total tasks\n   - If incomplete tasks exist:\n     - Add CRITICAL issue for each incomplete task\n     - Recommendation: \"Complete task: <description>\" or \"Mark as done if already implemented\"\n\n   **Spec Coverage**:\n   - If delta specs exist in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`:\n     - Extract all requirements (marked with \"### Requirement:\")\n     - For each requirement:\n       - Search codebase for keywords related to the requirement\n       - Assess if implementation likely exists\n     - If requirements appear unimplemented:\n       - Add CRITICAL issue: \"Requirement not found: <requirement name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Implement requirement X: <description>\"\n\n6. **Verify Correctness**\n\n   **Requirement Implementation Mapping**:\n   - For each requirement from delta specs:\n     - Search codebase for implementation evidence\n     - If found, note file paths and line ranges\n     - Assess if implementation matches requirement intent\n     - If divergence detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Implementation may diverge from spec: <details>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Review <file>:<lines> against requirement X\"\n\n   **Scenario Coverage**:\n   - For each scenario in delta specs (marked with \"#### Scenario:\"):\n     - Check if conditions are handled in code\n     - Check if tests exist covering the scenario\n     - If scenario appears uncovered:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Scenario not covered: <scenario name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Add test or implementation for scenario: <description>\"\n\n7. **Verify Coherence**\n\n   **Design Adherence**:\n   - If design.md exists in contextFiles:\n     - Extract key decisions (look for sections like \"Decision:\", \"Approach:\", \"Architecture:\")\n     - Verify implementation follows those decisions\n     - If contradiction detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Design decision not followed: <decision>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Update implementation or revise design.md to match reality\"\n   - If no design.md: Skip design adherence check, note \"No design.md to verify against\"\n\n   **Code Pattern Consistency**:\n   - Review new code for consistency with project patterns\n   - Check file naming, directory structure, coding style\n   - If significant deviations found:\n     - Add SUGGESTION: \"Code pattern deviation: <details>\"\n     - Recommendation: \"Consider following project pattern: <example>\"\n\n8. **Generate Verification Report**\n\n   **Summary Scorecard**:\n   ```\n   ## Verification Report: <change-name>\n\n   ### Summary\n   | Dimension    | Status           |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | Completeness | X/Y tasks, N reqs|\n   | Correctness  | M/N reqs covered |\n   | Coherence    | Followed/Issues  |\n   ```\n\n   **Issues by Priority**:\n\n   1. **CRITICAL** (Must fix before archive):\n      - Incomplete tasks\n      - Missing requirement implementations\n      - Each with specific, actionable recommendation\n\n   2. **WARNING** (Should fix):\n      - Spec/design divergences\n      - Missing scenario coverage\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   3. **SUGGESTION** (Nice to fix):\n      - Pattern inconsistencies\n      - Minor improvements\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   **Final Assessment**:\n   - If CRITICAL issues: \"X critical issue(s) found. Fix before archiving.\"\n   - If only warnings: \"No critical issues. Y warning(s) to consider. Ready for archive (with noted improvements).\"\n   - If all clear: \"All checks passed. Ready for archive.\"\n\n**Verification Heuristics**\n\n- **Completeness**: Focus on objective checklist items (checkboxes, requirements list)\n- **Correctness**: Use keyword search, file path analysis, reasonable inference - don''t require perfect certainty\n- **Coherence**: Look for glaring inconsistencies, don''t nitpick style\n- **False Positives**: When uncertain, prefer SUGGESTION over WARNING, WARNING over CRITICAL\n- **Actionability**: Every issue must have a specific recommendation with file/line references where applicable\n\n**Graceful Degradation**\n\n- If only tasks.md exists: verify task completion only, skip spec/design checks\n- If tasks + specs exist: verify completeness and correctness, skip design\n- If full artifacts: verify all three dimensions\n- Always note which checks were skipped and why\n\n**Output Format**\n\nUse clear markdown with:\n- Table for summary scorecard\n- Grouped lists for issues (CRITICAL/WARNING/SUGGESTION)\n- Code references in format: `file.ts:123`\n- Specific, actionable recommendations\n- No vague suggestions like \"consider reviewing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:36:59.319Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing precise change verification and implementation validation.","zh":"非常适合需要精确变更验证和实现验证的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが正確な変更の検証と実装の検証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"정확한 변경 확인 및 구현 유효성을 필요로 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una verificación de cambios precisa y una validación de implementación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une vérification de modification précise et une validation d''implémentation.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine präzise Änderungsüberprüfung und eine Implementierungsvalidierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de verificação de alterações precisas e validação de implementação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима точная верификация изменений и проверка реализации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق الدقيق من التغييرات وتصديق التنفيذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change artifacts using openspec, handling complex archive scenarios and ensuring design integrity through specs, tasks, and JSON output.","zh":"使代理能够使用openspec验证实现是否与变更工件相匹配，处理复杂的存档场景，并通过规格、任务和JSON输出确保设计完整性。","ja":"エージェントがopenspecを使用して、実装が変更アーティファクトと一致することを検証し、複雑なアーカイブシナリオを処理し、仕様、タスク、JSON出力を通じて設計の完全性を確保できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 오픈스펙을 사용하여 구현이 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 확인하고 복잡한 아카이브 시나리오를 처리하며 규격, 작업 및 JSON 출력을 통해 설계의 완전성을 보장할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar que la implementación coincide con los artefactos de cambio utilizando openspec, manejando escenarios de archivo complejos y asegurando la integridad del diseño a través de especificaciones, tareas y salida JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que l''implémentation correspond aux artefacts de modification en utilisant openspec, en gérant des scénarios d''archivage complexes et en assurant l''intégrité de la conception via des spécifications, des tâches et une sortie JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Implementierung zu überprüfen, ob sie mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt, indem openspec verwendet wird, komplexe Archivszenarien zu bewältigen und die Designintegrität durch Spezifikationen, Aufgaben und JSON-Ausgabe sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar se a implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração usando openspec, lidando com cenários de arquivo complexos e garantindo a integridade do design por meio de especificações, tarefas e saída JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить соответствие реализации артефактам изменений с помощью openspec, обрабатывая сложные сценарии архивации и обеспечивая целостность конструкции через спецификации, задачи и выходные данные JSON.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من مطابقة التنفيذ لمواصفات التغيير باستخدام openspec، ويتعامل مع سيناريوهات الأرشفة المعقدة وضمان سلامة التصميم من خلال المواصفات والمهام ومخرجات JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying change implementations against specs","Validating design integrity through automated checks","Inferring change names from conversation context"],"zh":["验证变更实现是否与规格相符","通过自动化检查验证设计完整性","从会话上下文推断变更名称"],"ja":["実装が仕様と一致することを検証する","自動化されたチェックを通じて設計の完全性を検証する","会話のコンテキストから変更名を推論する"],"ko":["구현이 규격과 일치하는지 확인하기","자동화된 체크를 통해 설계의 완전성을 확인하기","대화의 맥락에서 변경 이름을 추론하기"],"es":["Verificar implementaciones de cambios frente a especificaciones","Validar la integridad del diseño a través de comprobaciones automatizadas","Inferir nombres de cambios del contexto de la conversación"],"fr":["Vérifier les implémentations de modification par rapport aux spécifications","Valider l''intégrité de la conception via des vérifications automatisées","Deduire les noms de modification du contexte de la conversation"],"de":["Überprüfen von Änderungsimplementierungen gegen Spezifikationen","Validieren der Designintegrität durch automatisierte Prüfungen","Ableiten von Änderungsnamen aus dem Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Verificar implementações de alterações contra especificações","Validar integridade do design por meio de verificações automatizadas","Inferir nomes de alterações a partir do contexto da conversa"],"ru":["Проверка реализации изменений против спецификаций","Проверка целостности конструкции через автоматические проверки","Выделение имен изменений из контекста разговора"],"ar":["التحقق من تنفيذ التغييرات مقابل المواصفات","التحقق من سلامة التصميم من خلال الفحوصات الآلية","استنتاج أسماء التغييرات من سياق المحادثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to handling complex archive scenarios through openspec tools"],"zh":["需要openspec的安装和配置","依赖于会话上下文来推断变更名称","仅限通过openspec工具处理复杂的存档场景"],"ja":["openspecのインストールとコンフィギュレーションが必要","変更名の推論に会話のコンテキストに依存する","複雑なアーカイブシナリオの処理はopenspecツールに限定される"],"ko":["오픈스펙의 설치 및 구성이 필요함","변경 이름 추론에 대화 맥락에 의존함","복잡한 아카이브 시나리오의 처리는 오픈스펙 툴로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de openspec","Dependiente del contexto de la conversación para la inferencia del nombre de cambio","Limitado a manejar escenarios de archivo complejos a través de herramientas openspec"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''openspec","Dépend du contexte de la conversation pour la déduction du nom de modification","Limité à la gestion de scénarios d''archivage complexes via des outils openspec"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von openspec","Abhängig vom Konversationskontext für die Ableitung des Änderungsnamens","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung komplexer Archivszenarien über openspec-Tools"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do openspec","Depende do contexto da conversa para inferir nome de alteração","Limitado ao manuseio de cenários de arquivo complexos por meio de ferramentas openspec"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки openspec","Зависит от контекста разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен обработкой сложных сценариев архивации через инструменты openspec"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين openspec","يعتمد على سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج اسم التغيير","محدود بمعالجة سيناريوهات الأرشفة المعقدة من خلال أدوات openspec"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Scrollico/scrolli-website-project/git-pushing', 'community', 'Scrollico', 'scrolli-website-project', 'Scrollico/scrolli-website-project', 'git-pushing', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z', '2026-02-18T11:38:13.815Z', NULL, '{"id":"Scrollico/scrolli-website-project/git-pushing","name":"git-pushing","description":{"zh":"Git 推送工作流是一种自动化的 Git 推送过程，能够提高开发效率。它包括阶段性提交、创建标准化的提交信息和推送到远程分支。","ja":"Git プッシュワークフローは、自動化された Git プッシュプロセスであり、開発効率を上げることができる。ステージング、標準的なコミットメッセージの作成、リモートブランチへのプッシュを含む。","ko":"Git 푸시 워크플로우는 자동화된 Git 푸시 프로세스로 개발 효율을 높일 수 있다. 스테이징, 표준 커밋 메시지 생성, 리모트 브랜치 푸시를 포함한다.","pt":"O Git Push é um fluxo de trabalho automatizado que otimiza a produtividade do desenvolvedor","ru":"Git Push - это автоматизированный workflow, который оптимизирует производительность разработчика","ar":"git_push هو تدفق عمل تلقائي ي tối ưu إنتاجية المطور","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Git 推送工作流","ja":"Git プッシュワークフロー","ko":"Git 푸시 워크플로우","pt":"Git Push: Fluxo de Trabalho Automatizado","ru":"Git Push: Автоматизированный Workflow","ar":"git_push: تدفق العمل التلقائي","en":"git-pushing"},"description":{"zh":"Git 推送工作流是一种自动化的 Git 推送过程，能够提高开发效率。它包括阶段性提交、创建标准化的提交信息和推送到远程分支。","ja":"Git プッシュワークフローは、自動化された Git プッシュプロセスであり、開発効率を上げることができる。ステージング、標準的なコミットメッセージの作成、リモートブランチへのプッシュを含む。","ko":"Git 푸시 워크플로우는 자동화된 Git 푸시 프로세스로 개발 효율을 높일 수 있다. 스테이징, 표준 커밋 메시지 생성, 리모트 브랜치 푸시를 포함한다.","pt":"O Git Push é um fluxo de trabalho automatizado que otimiza a produtividade do desenvolvedor","ru":"Git Push - это автоматизированный workflow, который оптимизирует производительность разработчика","ar":"git_push هو تدفق عمل تلقائي ي tối ưu إنتاجية المطور","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化 Git 推送","阶段性提交","标准化的提交信息","推送到远程分支","提高开发效率"],"ja":["Git プッシュの自動化","ステージング","標準的なコミットメッセージ","リモートブランチへのプッシュ","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["Git 푸시 자동화","스테이징","표준 커밋 메시지","리모트 브랜치 푸시","개발 효율성 향상"],"pt":["Automatização do fluxo de trabalho do Git","Criação de commits convencionais","Envio de alterações para o branch remoto","Ativação automática ao salvar trabalho remoto","Suporte a comandos Git personalizados"],"ru":["Автоматизация workflow Git","Создание конвенциональных коммитов","Отправка изменений в удаленную ветку","Автоматическая активация при сохранении работы в удаленном репозитории","Поддержка пользовательских команд Git"],"ar":["التلقين التلقائي لتدفق العمل لgit","إنشاء التزامات تقليدية","إرسال التغييرات إلى الفرع البعيد","التفعيل التلقائي عند حفظ العمل البعيد","دعم أوامر Git المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 推送","自动化","开发效率","Git 工作流","版本控制"],"ja":["Git プッシュ","自動化","開発効率","Git ワークフロー","バージョン管理"],"ko":["Git 푸시","자동화","개발 효율","Git 워크플로우","버전 관리"],"pt":["git push","fluxo de trabalho automatizado","produtividade do desenvolvedor","gerenciamento de alterações","commits convencionais","branch remoto"],"ru":["git push","автоматизированный workflow","производительность разработчика","управление изменениями","конвенциональные коммиты","удаленная ветка"],"ar":["git_push","تدفق العمل التلقائي","إنتاجية المطور","إدارة التغييرات","التزامات تقليدية","الفرع البعيد"]}},"owner":"Scrollico","repo":"scrolli-website-project","repoPath":"Scrollico/scrolli-website-project","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-pushing","description":"Stage, commit, and push git changes with conventional commit messages. Use when user wants to commit and push changes, mentions pushing to remote, or asks to save and push their work. Also activates when user says push changes, commit and push, push this, push to github, or similar git workflow requests.","bodyPreview":"# Git Push Workflow\n\nStage all changes, create a conventional commit, and push to the remote branch.\n\n## When to Use\n\nAutomatically activate when the user:\n\n- Explicitly asks to push changes (\"push this\", \"commit and push\")\n- Mentions saving work to remote (\"save to github\", \"push to remote\")\n- Completes a feature and wants to share it\n- Says phrases like \"let''s push this up\" or \"commit these changes\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n**ALWAYS use the script** - do NOT use manual git commands:\n\n```bash\nbash skills/","body":"# Git Push Workflow\n\nStage all changes, create a conventional commit, and push to the remote branch.\n\n## When to Use\n\nAutomatically activate when the user:\n\n- Explicitly asks to push changes (\"push this\", \"commit and push\")\n- Mentions saving work to remote (\"save to github\", \"push to remote\")\n- Completes a feature and wants to share it\n- Says phrases like \"let''s push this up\" or \"commit these changes\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n**ALWAYS use the script** - do NOT use manual git commands:\n\n```bash\nbash skills/git-pushing/scripts/smart_commit.sh\n```\n\nWith custom message:\n\n```bash\nbash skills/git-pushing/scripts/smart_commit.sh \"feat: add feature\"\n```\n\nScript handles: staging, conventional commit message, Claude footer, push with -u flag.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:38:13.815Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated Git workflow management, particularly those utilizing bash scripts for version control.","zh":"适合需要自动化 Git 工作流管理的开发代理，特别是那些使用 bash 脚本进行版本控制的代理。","ja":"自動化 Git ワークフロー管理を必要とする開発エージェントに適しています。特に、バージョン管理に bash スクリプトを使用するものに適しています。","ko":"自動화된 Git 워크플로우 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 버전 관리를 위해 bash 스크립트를 사용하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión automatizada del flujo de trabajo de Git, particularmente aquellos que utilizan scripts de bash para el control de versiones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion automatisée du flux de travail Git, en particulier ceux qui utilisent des scripts bash pour le contrôle de version.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Git-Workflow-Verwaltung benötigen, insbesondere solche, die Bash-Skripte für die Versionskontrolle verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho do Git automatizado, particularmente aqueles que utilizam scripts bash para controle de versão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированного управления рабочим процессом Git, особенно тех, кто использует скрипты bash для управления версиями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تدفق العمل التلقائي لجت، خاصة أولئك الذين يستخدمون سكريبتات باش للتحكم في الإصدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Git push workflows using conventional commits and remote branch management, ensuring seamless collaboration and version control through bash scripts and Git protocols.","zh":"赋予代理自动化 Git 推送工作流的能力，使用标准提交和远程分支管理，确保通过 bash 脚本和 Git 协议实现无缝协作和版本控制。","ja":"エージェントに、従来のコミットとリモートブランチ管理を使用して Git プッシュワークフローを自動化する能力を与え、bash スクリプトと Git プロトコルを通じて無縫なコラボレーションとバージョン管理を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 표준 커밋 및 원격 브랜치 관리를 사용하여 Git 푸시 워크플ロー 자동화를 가능하게 하며, bash 스크립트 및 Git 프로토콜을 통해 원활한 협업 및 버전 관리를 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar flujos de trabajo de Git push utilizando compromisos convencionales y gestión de ramas remotas, garantizando una colaboración y control de versiones sin problemas a través de scripts de bash y protocolos de Git.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail Git push en utilisant des commits conventionnels et une gestion de branches distantes, garantissant une collaboration et un contrôle de version sans problème via des scripts bash et des protocoles Git.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Git-Push-Workflows mithilfe konventioneller Commits und Remote-Branch-Verwaltung zu automatisieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Zusammenarbeit und Versionskontrolle durch Bash-Skripte und Git-Protokolle gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho de envio do Git usando commits convencionais e gerenciamento de branch remoto, garantindo colaboração e controle de versão sem interrupções por meio de scripts bash e protocolos do Git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рабочие процессы Git с помощью обычных коммитов и удаленного управления ветками, обеспечивая бесперебойное сотрудничество и контроль версий с помощью скриптов bash и протоколов Git.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير سير عمل دفع جت آلي باستخدام الالتزامات التقليدية وإدارة الفرع البعيد، مما يضمن التعاون والأتمتة بدون انقطاع من خلال سكريبتات باش وبروتوكولات جت."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit and push actions for feature updates","Saving work to remote repositories like GitHub","Streamlining workflow with scripted Git commands"],"zh":["自动化提交和推送操作以进行功能更新","将工作保存到 GitHub 等远程仓库","使用脚本化的 Git 命令来简化工作流"],"ja":["機能更新のためのコミットとプッシュ操作の自動化","GitHub などのリモートリポジトリに作業を保存する","スクリプト化された Git コマンドを使用してワークフローを簡素化する"],"ko":["기능 업데이트를 위한 커밋 및 푸시 동작 자동화","작업을 GitHub 등의 원격 저장소에 저장","스크립트화된 Git 명령을 사용하여 워크플ロー 단순화"],"es":["Automatizar acciones de compromiso y envío para actualizaciones de características","Guardar trabajo en repositorios remotos como GitHub","Optimizar el flujo de trabajo con comandos de Git scriptados"],"fr":["Automatiser les actions de commit et de push pour les mises à jour de fonctionnalités","Enregistrer le travail dans des référentiels distants comme GitHub","Optimiser le flux de travail avec des commandes Git scriptées"],"de":["Automatisieren von Commit- und Push-Aktionen für Funktionsupdates","Arbeit in Remote-Repositorys wie GitHub speichern","Optimieren des Workflows mit skriptgesteuerten Git-Befehlen"],"pt":["Automatizar ações de compromisso e envio para atualizações de recursos","Salvar trabalho em repositórios remotos como o GitHub","Otimizar o fluxo de trabalho com comandos Git scriptados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать действия коммита и пуша для обновления функций","Сохранять работу в удаленных репозиториях, таких как GitHub","Оптимизировать рабочий процесс с помощью скриптовых команд Git"],"ar":["أتمتة إجراءات الالتزام والإرسال لتحديثات الميزات","حفظ العمل في مستودعات منفصلة مثل جت هب","تبسيط سير العمل باستخدام أوامر جت المبرمجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires bash script execution capabilities","Git installation and configuration necessary","Always uses a script, does not support manual Git commands"],"zh":["需要 bash 脚本执行能力","需要 Git 安装和配置","始终使用脚本，不支持手动 Git 命令"],"ja":["bash スクリプトの実行能力が必要","Git のインストールと設定が必要","常にスクリプトを使用し、手動の Git コマンドはサポートしません"],"ko":["bash 스크립트 실행 능력이 필요","Git 설치 및 구성이 필요","항상 스크립트를 사용하며 수동 Git 명령은 지원하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere capacidad de ejecución de scripts de bash","Se requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Siempre utiliza un script, no admite comandos de Git manuales"],"fr":["Nécessite la capacité d''exécuter des scripts bash","L''installation et la configuration de Git sont nécessaires","Utilise toujours un script, ne prend pas en charge les commandes Git manuelles"],"de":["Benötigt die Fähigkeit, Bash-Skripte auszuführen","Git-Installation und -Konfiguration erforderlich","Verwendet immer ein Skript, unterstützt keine manuellen Git-Befehle"],"pt":["Requer capacidades de execução de script bash","Instalação e configuração do Git necessárias","Sempre usa um script, não suporta comandos Git manuais"],"ru":["Требует возможности выполнения скриптов bash","Необходима установка и настройка Git","Всегда использует скрипт, не поддерживает ручные команды Git"],"ar":["يتطلب khảيات تنفيذ سكريبتات باش","تركيب وتفصيل جت ضروري","دائما يستخدم سكريبت، لا يدعم أوامر جت اليدوية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
