development.","zh":"适用于使用 Vue.js 和 Nuxt 的前端代理，希望利用 VueUse 可组合函数进行高效开发。","ja":"Vue.js と Nuxt で作業するフロントエンド エージェントに適しています。VueUse のコンポーザブルを使用して効率的な開発を行いたい場合に最適です。","ko":"Vue.js와 Nuxt에서 작업하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. VueUse 컴포즈블을 사용하여 효율적인 개발을 수행하려는 경우에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que trabajan con Vue.js y Nuxt, y buscan aprovechar los componentes VueUse para un desarrollo eficiente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend travaillant avec Vue.js et Nuxt, cherchant à exploiter les composables VueUse pour un développement efficace.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die mit Vue.js und Nuxt arbeiten und VueUse-Composables für eine effiziente Entwicklung nutzen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que trabalham com Vue.js e Nuxt, buscando aproveitar os compostáveis do VueUse para desenvolvimento eficiente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, работающих с Vue.js и Nuxt, стремящихся использовать составные компоненты VueUse для эффективного развития.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يعمل مع Vue.js و Nuxt ، يسعى لاستخدام مكونات VueUse القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام من أجل تطوير فعال"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement concise, maintainable, and performant solutions by mapping requirements to the most suitable VueUse functions, applying correct usage patterns, and preferring composable-based solutions over bespoke code in Vue.js and Nuxt projects using composables.","zh":"使代理能够通过将需求映射到最合适的 VueUse 函数、应用正确的使用模式以及在使用组件的 Vue.js 和 Nuxt 项目中更喜欢基于组件的解决方案而不是自定义代码，来实现简洁、可维护和高性能的解决方案。","ja":"エージェントが、要件を最も適切な VueUse 関数にマッピングし、正しい使用パターンを適用し、コンポーザブルを使用する Vue.js と Nuxt プロジェクトで、カスタム コードよりもコンポーザブル ベースのソリューションを優先することで、簡潔で保守可能で高性能なソリューションを実装できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 요구 사항을 가장 적합한 VueUse 함수에 매핑하고, 올바른 사용 패턴을 적용하고, 컴포즈블을 사용하는 Vue.js 및 Nuxt 프로젝트에서 커스텀 코드보다 컴포즈블 기반 솔루션을 선호함으로써, 간결하고 유지 보수 가능하며 고성능인 솔루션을 구현할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar soluciones concisas, mantenibles y de alto rendimiento al asignar requisitos a las funciones VueUse más adecuadas, aplicar patrones de uso correctos y preferir soluciones basadas en componentes a código personalizado en proyectos Vue.js y Nuxt que utilizan componentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des solutions concises, maintainables et performantes en faisant correspondre les exigences aux fonctions VueUse les plus appropriées, en appliquant des modèles d''utilisation corrects et en préférant des solutions basées sur des composables à du code sur mesure dans les projets Vue.js et Nuxt utilisant des composables.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, koncise, wartbare und leistungsstarke Lösungen umzusetzen, indem sie Anforderungen den geeignetsten VueUse-Funktionen zuordnen, korrekte Verwendungsmuster anwenden und komponible-basierte Lösungen gegenüber individuellem Code in Vue.js- und Nuxt-Projekten, die Composables verwenden, bevorzugen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar soluções concisas, mantidas e de alto desempenho, mapeando requisitos para as funções mais adequadas do VueUse, aplicando padrões de uso corretos e preferindo soluções baseadas em componentes reutilizáveis em vez de código personalizado em projetos Vue.js e Nuxt que usam componentes reutilizáveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать краткие, поддерживаемые и эффективные решения, сопоставляя требования с наиболее подходящими функциями VueUse, применяя правильные модели использования и отдающие предпочтение решениям на основе составных компонентов над индивидуальным кодом в проектах Vue.js и Nuxt, использующих составные компоненты.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ حلول متوافقة ومدروسة وذات أداء عالٍ من خلال ربط المتطلبات بالوظائف الأكثر ملاءمة ل VueUse ، وتطبيق أنماط الاستخدام الصحيحة ، وأفضل الحلول القائمة على المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام على 코드 مخصص في مشاريع Vue.js و Nuxt التي تستخدم المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing composable-based solutions for Vue.js applications","Optimizing Nuxt project performance with suitable VueUse functions","Automating the selection of appropriate VueUse composables for given requirements"],"zh":["为 Vue.js 应用程序实现基于组件的解决方案","使用适当的 VueUse 函数优化 Nuxt 项目性能","自动选择给定要求的适当 VueUse 组件"],"ja":["Vue.js アプリケーションのコンポーザブル ベースのソリューションを実装する","適切な VueUse 関数を使用して Nuxt プロジェクトのパフォーマンスを最適化する","与えられた要件の適切な VueUse コンポーザブルを自動的に選択する"],"ko":["Vue.js 애플리케이션을 위한 컴포즈블 기반 솔루션 구현","적절한 VueUse 함수를 사용하여 Nuxt 프로젝트 성능 최적화","주어진 요구 사항에 대한 적절한 VueUse 컴포즈블 자동 선택"],"es":["Implementar soluciones basadas en componentes para aplicaciones Vue.js","Optimizar el rendimiento de proyectos Nuxt con funciones VueUse adecuadas","Automatizar la selección de componentes VueUse adecuados para requisitos determinados"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des solutions basées sur des composables pour les applications Vue.js","Optimiser les performances des projets Nuxt avec des fonctions VueUse appropriées","Automatiser la sélection de composables VueUse appropriés pour des exigences données"],"de":["Implementierung von komponible-basierten Lösungen für Vue.js-Anwendungen","Optimierung der Leistung von Nuxt-Projekten mit geeigneten VueUse-Funktionen","Automatisierung der Auswahl geeigneter VueUse-Composables für bestimmte Anforderungen"],"pt":["Implementar soluções baseadas em componentes reutilizáveis para aplicações Vue.js","Otimizar o desempenho do projeto Nuxt com funções VueUse adequadas","Automatizar a seleção de componentes reutilizáveis do VueUse adequados para requisitos específicos"],"ru":["Реализация решений на основе составных компонентов для приложений Vue.js","Оптимизация производительности проекта Nuxt с помощью подходящих функций VueUse","Автоматизация выбора подходящих составных компонентов VueUse для заданных требований"],"ar":["تنفيذ حلول قائمة على المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لتطبيقات Vue.js ","تحسين أداء مشروع Nuxt مع وظائف VueUse المناسبة","تحسين اختيار المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام من VueUse المناسبة للمتطلبات المعينة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Vue.js and Nuxt","Limited to VueUse composables ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 Vue.js 和 Nuxt 的知识","仅限于 VueUse 组件生态系统"],"ja":["Vue.js と Nuxt の知識が必要","VueUse コンポーザブルのエコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["Vue.js 및 Nuxt에 대한 지식이 필요","VueUse 컴포즈블 에코시스템에 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Vue.js y Nuxt","Limitado al ecosistema de componentes VueUse"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de Vue.js et Nuxt","Limité à l''écosystème de composables VueUse"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Vue.js und Nuxt","Begrenzt auf das VueUse-Composables-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Vue.js e Nuxt","Limitado ao ecossistema de componentes reutilizáveis do VueUse"],"ru":["Требует знания Vue.js и Nuxt","Ограничен экосистемой составных компонентов VueUse"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Vue.js و Nuxt","محدود بنطاق مكونات VueUse القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/game-development', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'IzaCenter', 'claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter', 'game-development', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z', '2026-02-18T11:38:04.126Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/game-development","name":"game-development","description":{"zh":"游戏开发技能提供游戏开发的核心原则和路线图，帮助开发者快速找到合适的子技能","ja":"ゲーム開発スキルはゲーム開発の基本原則とロードマップを提供し、開発者が適切なサブスキルを見つけるのに役立ちます","ko":"게임 개발 스킬은 게임 개발의 핵심 원칙과 로드맵을 제공하여 개발자가 적합한 하위 스킬을 찾을 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"El desarrollo de juegos implica principios y rutas especializadas. Aprende a seleccionar la plataforma adecuada para tu proyecto","fr":"Le développement de jeux implique des principes et des routes spécialisées. Apprenez à sélectionner la plate-forme appropriée pour votre projet","de":"Die Game-Entwicklung umfasst Prinzipien und spezialisierte Routen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die richtige Plattform für Ihr Projekt auswählen","pt":"O desenvolvimento de jogos é uma habilidade que fornece princípios básicos e rotas para habilidades especializadas.","ru":"Разработка игр - это навык, который предоставляет основные принципы и маршруты для специализированных навыков.","ar":"تطوير الألعاب هو مهارة توفر المبادئ الأساسية وطرقًا إلى مهارات متخصصة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"游戏开发技能","ja":"ゲーム開発スキル","ko":"게임 개발 스킬","es":"Desarrollo de Juegos: Principios y Rutas","fr":"Développement de Jeux: Principes et Routes","de":"Game-Entwicklung: Prinzipien und Routen","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Jogos","ru":"Разработка Игр","ar":"تطوير الألعاب","en":"game-development"},"description":{"zh":"游戏开发技能提供游戏开发的核心原则和路线图，帮助开发者快速找到合适的子技能","ja":"ゲーム開発スキルはゲーム開発の基本原則とロードマップを提供し、開発者が適切なサブスキルを見つけるのに役立ちます","ko":"게임 개발 스킬은 게임 개발의 핵심 원칙과 로드맵을 제공하여 개발자가 적합한 하위 스킬을 찾을 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"El desarrollo de juegos implica principios y rutas especializadas. Aprende a seleccionar la plataforma adecuada para tu proyecto","fr":"Le développement de jeux implique des principes et des routes spécialisées. Apprenez à sélectionner la plate-forme appropriée pour votre projet","de":"Die Game-Entwicklung umfasst Prinzipien und spezialisierte Routen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die richtige Plattform für Ihr Projekt auswählen","pt":"O desenvolvimento de jogos é uma habilidade que fornece princípios básicos e rotas para habilidades especializadas.","ru":"Разработка игр - это навык, который предоставляет основные принципы и маршруты для специализированных навыков.","ar":"تطوير الألعاب هو مهارة توفر المبادئ الأساسية وطرقًا إلى مهارات متخصصة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["核心原则","路线图","子技能路由","平台选择","游戏开发框架"],"ja":["基本原則","ロードマップ","サブスキルルーティング","プラットフォーム選択","ゲーム開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["핵심 원칙","로드맵","하위 스킬 라우팅","플랫폼 선택","게임 개발 프레임워크"],"es":["Principios básicos del desarrollo de juegos","Selección de plataforma","Rutas especializadas","Desarrollo de juegos para web"],"fr":["Principes de base du développement de jeux","Sélection de plate-forme","Routes spécialisées","Développement de jeux pour le web"],"de":["Grundprinzipien der Game-Entwicklung","Plattformauswahl","Spezialisierte Routen","Game-Entwicklung für das Web"],"pt":["Princípios básicos do desenvolvimento de jogos","Roteamento para habilidades especializadas","Desenvolvimento de jogos para web","Desenvolvimento de jogos para dispositivos móveis","Uso de tecnologias como HTML5 e WebGL"],"ru":["Основные принципы разработки игр","Маршрутизация для специализированных навыков","Разработка игр для веба","Разработка игр для мобильных устройств","Использование технологий như HTML5 и WebGL"],"ar":["المبادئ الأساسية لتطوير الألعاب","التوجيه إلى المهارات المتخصصة","تطوير الألعاب للويب","تطوير الألعاب للأجهزة المحمولة","استخدام التكنولوجيا مثل HTML5 و WebGL"]},"keywords":{"zh":["游戏开发","核心原则","子技能","平台选择","游戏开发框架","HTML5","WebGL"],"ja":["ゲーム開発","基本原則","サブスキル","プラットフォーム選択","ゲーム開発フレームワーク","HTML5","WebGL"],"ko":["게임 개발","핵심 원칙","하위 스킬","플랫폼 선택","게임 개발 프레임워크","HTML5","WebGL"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos","principios de juego","selección de plataforma","rutas especializadas","juegos para web","HTML5","WebGL"],"fr":["développement de jeux","principes de jeu","sélection de plate-forme","routes spécialisées","jeux pour le web","HTML5","WebGL"],"de":["Game-Entwicklung","Spiele-Prinzipien","Plattformauswahl","spezialisierte Routen","Spiele für das Web","HTML5","WebGL"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos","jogos eletrônicos","HTML5","WebGL","desenvolvimento de jogos para web","desenvolvimento de jogos para dispositivos móveis"],"ru":["разработка игр","электронные игры","HTML5","WebGL","разработка игр для веба","разработка игр для мобильных устройств"],"ar":["تطوير الألعاب","الألعاب الإلكترونية","HTML5","WebGL","تطوير الألعاب للويب","تطوير الألعاب للأجهزة المحمولة"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"game-development","description":"Game development orchestrator. Routes to platform-specific skills based on project needs.","bodyPreview":"# Game Development\n\n> **Orchestrator skill** that provides core principles and routes to specialized sub-skills.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nYou are working on a game development project. This skill teaches the PRINCIPLES of game development and directs you to the right sub-skill based on context.\n\n---\n\n## Sub-Skill Routing\n\n### Platform Selection\n\n| If the game targets... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|------------------------|---------------|\n| Web browsers (HTML5, WebGL) | `game-development/web-game","body":"# Game Development\n\n> **Orchestrator skill** that provides core principles and routes to specialized sub-skills.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nYou are working on a game development project. This skill teaches the PRINCIPLES of game development and directs you to the right sub-skill based on context.\n\n---\n\n## Sub-Skill Routing\n\n### Platform Selection\n\n| If the game targets... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|------------------------|---------------|\n| Web browsers (HTML5, WebGL) | `game-development/web-games` |\n| Mobile (iOS, Android) | `game-development/mobile-games` |\n| PC (Steam, Desktop) | `game-development/pc-games` |\n| VR/AR headsets | `game-development/vr-ar` |\n\n### Dimension Selection\n\n| If the game is... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|-------------------|---------------|\n| 2D (sprites, tilemaps) | `game-development/2d-games` |\n| 3D (meshes, shaders) | `game-development/3d-games` |\n\n### Specialty Areas\n\n| If you need... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|----------------|---------------|\n| GDD, balancing, player psychology | `game-development/game-design` |\n| Multiplayer, networking | `game-development/multiplayer` |\n| Visual style, asset pipeline, animation | `game-development/game-art` |\n| Sound design, music, adaptive audio | `game-development/game-audio` |\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles (All Platforms)\n\n### 1. The Game Loop\n\nEvery game, regardless of platform, follows this pattern:\n\n```\nINPUT  → Read player actions\nUPDATE → Process game logic (fixed timestep)\nRENDER → Draw the frame (interpolated)\n```\n\n**Fixed Timestep Rule:**\n- Physics/logic: Fixed rate (e.g., 50Hz)\n- Rendering: As fast as possible\n- Interpolate between states for smooth visuals\n\n---\n\n### 2. Pattern Selection Matrix\n\n| Pattern | Use When | Example |\n|---------|----------|---------|\n| **State Machine** | 3-5 discrete states | Player: Idle→Walk→Jump |\n| **Object Pooling** | Frequent spawn/destroy | Bullets, particles |\n| **Observer/Events** | Cross-system communication | Health→UI updates |\n| **ECS** | Thousands of similar entities | RTS units, particles |\n| **Command** | Undo, replay, networking | Input recording |\n| **Behavior Tree** | Complex AI decisions | Enemy AI |\n\n**Decision Rule:** Start with State Machine. Add ECS only when performance demands.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Input Abstraction\n\nAbstract input into ACTIONS, not raw keys:\n\n```\n\"jump\"  → Space, Gamepad A, Touch tap\n\"move\"  → WASD, Left stick, Virtual joystick\n```\n\n**Why:** Enables multi-platform, rebindable controls.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Performance Budget (60 FPS = 16.67ms)\n\n| System | Budget |\n|--------|--------|\n| Input | 1ms |\n| Physics | 3ms |\n| AI | 2ms |\n| Game Logic | 4ms |\n| Rendering | 5ms |\n| Buffer | 1.67ms |\n\n**Optimization Priority:**\n1. Algorithm (O(n²) → O(n log n))\n2. Batching (reduce draw calls)\n3. Pooling (avoid GC spikes)\n4. LOD (detail by distance)\n5. Culling (skip invisible)\n\n---\n\n### 5. AI Selection by Complexity\n\n| AI Type | Complexity | Use When |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| **FSM** | Simple | 3-5 states, predictable behavior |\n| **Behavior Tree** | Medium | Modular, designer-friendly |\n| **GOAP** | High | Emergent, planning-based |\n| **Utility AI** | High | Scoring-based decisions |\n\n---\n\n### 6. Collision Strategy\n\n| Type | Best For |\n|------|----------|\n| **AABB** | Rectangles, fast checks |\n| **Circle** | Round objects, cheap |\n| **Spatial Hash** | Many similar-sized objects |\n| **Quadtree** | Large worlds, varying sizes |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns (Universal)\n\n| Don''t | Do |\n|-------|-----|\n| Update everything every frame | Use events, dirty flags |\n| Create objects in hot loops | Object pooling |\n| Cache nothing | Cache references |\n| Optimize without profiling | Profile first |\n| Mix input with logic | Abstract input layer |\n\n---\n\n## Routing Examples\n\n### Example 1: \"I want to make a browser-based 2D platformer\"\n→ Start with `game-development/web-games` for framework selection\n→ Then `game-development/2d-games` for sprite/tilemap patterns\n→ Reference `game-development/game-design` for level design\n\n### Example 2: \"Mobile puzzle game for iOS and Android\"\n→ Start with `game-development/mobile-games` for touch input and stores\n→ Use `game-development/game-design` for puzzle balancing\n\n### Example 3: \"Multiplayer VR shooter\"\n→ `game-development/vr-ar` for comfort and immersion\n→ `game-development/3d-games` for rendering\n→ `game-development/multiplayer` for networking\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Great games come from iteration, not perfection. Prototype fast, then polish.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:38:04.126Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents focusing on interactive applications, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, needing core game development principles and routing to specialized sub-skills.","zh":"适合专注于交互式应用的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code，需要核心游戏开发原则和路由到专门的子技能。","ja":"インタラクティブアプリケーションに重点を置くAIエージェント、たとえばCursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeに適しています。これらは、コアのゲーム開発原則と専門のサブスキルへのルーティングが必要です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 상호 작용 응용 프로그램에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 핵심 게임 개발 원칙과 전문 하위 기술로의 라우팅이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que se centran en aplicaciones interactivas, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code, que necesitan principios básicos de desarrollo de juegos y enrutamiento a habilidades especializadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur les applications interactives, telles que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, nécessitant des principes de base de développement de jeux et un routage vers des compétences spécialisées.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die sich auf interaktive Anwendungen wie Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code konzentrieren und grundlegende Spielentwicklungsprinzipien sowie Routing zu spezialisierten Teilfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que se concentram em aplicações interativas, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, que necessitam de princípios básicos de desenvolvimento de jogos e direcionamento para sub-habilidades especializadas.","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, ориентированных на интерактивные приложения, такие как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, требующие основных принципов разработки игр и маршрутизации к специализированным поднавыкам.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يركزون على التطبيقات التفاعلية، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code، والذين يحتاجون إلى مبادئ أساسية لتطوير الألعاب وتوجيهها إلى مهارات فرعية متخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop games across various platforms, including web browsers using HTML5 and WebGL, by providing foundational knowledge and directing them to specific sub-skills like `game-development/web-game` for tailored development needs.","zh":"赋予代理在各种平台上开发游戏的能力，包括使用HTML5和WebGL的网页浏览器，通过提供基础知识并将其引导至特定的子技能，如`game-development/web-game`，以满足定制的开发需求。","ja":"HTML5とWebGLを使用したWebブラウザを含むさまざまなプラットフォームでゲームを開発するエージェントの能力を与え、基礎知識を提供し、特定のサブスキル、たとえば`game-development/web-game`に導き、カスタマイズされた開発ニーズを満たします。","ko":"웹 브라우저를 포함한 다양한 플랫폼에서 게임을 개발할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. HTML5와 WebGL을 사용하여 기본 지식을 제공하고, 특정 하위 기술인 `game-development/web-game`로 안내하여 맞춤형 개발 요구 사항을 충족합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar juegos en varias plataformas, incluidos los navegadores web que utilizan HTML5 y WebGL, proporcionando conocimientos básicos y dirigiéndolos a habilidades específicas como `game-development/web-game` para necesidades de desarrollo personalizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des jeux sur diverses plateformes, y compris les navigateurs web utilisant HTML5 et WebGL, en fournissant des connaissances de base et en les dirigeant vers des compétences spécifiques comme `game-development/web-game` pour des besoins de développement sur mesure.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Spiele auf verschiedenen Plattformen zu entwickeln, einschließlich Webbrowsern, die HTML5 und WebGL verwenden, indem grundlegende Kenntnisse bereitgestellt und spezifische Fähigkeiten wie `game-development/web-game` für maßgeschneiderte Entwicklungsbereitstellungen bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver jogos em várias plataformas, incluindo navegadores da web utilizando HTML5 e WebGL, fornecendo conhecimento fundamental e direcionando-os para sub-habilidades específicas, como `game-development/web-game`, para necessidades de desenvolvimento personalizadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать игры на различных платформах, включая веб-браузеры, используя HTML5 и WebGL, предоставляя основные знания и направляя их к конкретным поднавыкам, таким как `game-development/web-game`, для индивидуальных потребностей разработки.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تطوير الألعاب عبر منصات متعددة، بما في ذلك متصفحات الويب باستخدام HTML5 و WebGL، من خلال تقديم المعرفة الأساسية وتوجيههم إلى مهارات فرعية محددة، مثل `game-development/web-game`، لنصوص تطوير مخصصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Routing game development projects to the appropriate sub-skills based on target platforms","Developing web-based games utilizing HTML5 and WebGL technologies","Applying core game development principles to guide project decisions"],"zh":["基于目标平台将游戏开发项目路由到相应的子技能","利用HTML5和WebGL技术开发基于Web的游戏","将核心游戏开发原则应用于指导项目决策"],"ja":["ターゲットプラットフォームに基づいてゲーム開発プロジェクトを適切なサブスキルにルーティングする","HTML5とWebGLテクノロジを使用してWebベースのゲームを開発する","コアのゲーム開発原則を適用してプロジェクトの意思決定を導く"],"ko":["목표 플랫폼을 기반으로 게임 개발 프로젝트를 적절한 하위 기술로 라우팅하는 것","HTML5 및 WebGL 기술을 사용하여 웹 기반 게임을 개발하는 것","핵심 게임 개발 원칙을 적용하여 프로젝트 의사 결정을 안내하는 것"],"es":["Enrutamiento de proyectos de desarrollo de juegos a las habilidades especializadas adecuadas según las plataformas de destino","Desarrollo de juegos basados en web utilizando tecnologías HTML5 y WebGL","Aplicación de principios básicos de desarrollo de juegos para guiar las decisiones del proyecto"],"fr":["Acheminement de projets de développement de jeux aux compétences spécialisées appropriées en fonction des plateformes cibles","Développement de jeux basés sur le web utilisant les technologies HTML5 et WebGL","Application des principes de base de développement de jeux pour guider les décisions de projet"],"de":["Weiterleitung von Spielentwicklungsprojekten an die entsprechenden spezialisierten Fähigkeiten basierend auf den Zielplattformen","Entwicklung von webbasierten Spielen unter Verwendung von HTML5- und WebGL-Technologien","Anwendung von grundlegenden Spielentwicklungsprinzipien zur Steuerung von Projektsentscheidungen"],"pt":["Encaminhamento de projetos de desenvolvimento de jogos para as sub-habilidades apropriadas com base em plataformas de destino","Desenvolvimento de jogos baseados na web utilizando tecnologias HTML5 e WebGL","Aplicação de princípios básicos de desenvolvimento de jogos para orientar decisões de projeto"],"ru":["Маршрутизация проектов разработки игр к подходящим поднавыкам на основе целевых платформ","Разработка веб-игр, использующих технологии HTML5 и WebGL","Применение основных принципов разработки игр для руководства решениями проекта"],"ar":["توجيه مشاريع تطوير الألعاب إلى المهارات الفرعية المناسبة بناءً على منصات الوجهة","تطوير ألعاب dựa على الويب باستخدام تقنيات HTML5 و WebGL","تطبيق مبادئ أساسية لتطوير الألعاب لتوجيه قرارات المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of specific game development platforms and technologies","Sub-skills may have additional requirements or dependencies, such as `game-development/web-game` needing WebGL support"],"zh":["需要特定的游戏开发平台和技术的知识","子技能可能具有额外的要求或依赖项，例如`game-development/web-game`需要WebGL支持"],"ja":["特定のゲーム開発プラットフォームとテクノロジーの知識が必要","サブスキルには追加の要件または依存関係がある場合があります。たとえば、`game-development/web-game`ではWebGLのサポートが必要"],"ko":["특정 게임 개발 플랫폼 및 기술에 대한 지식이 필요함","하위 기술에는 추가 요구 사항 또는 종속성들이 있을 수 있음. 예를 들어, `game-development/web-game`에는 WebGL 지원이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de plataformas y tecnologías específicas de desarrollo de juegos","Las habilidades especializadas pueden tener requisitos o dependencias adicionales, como `game-development/web-game` que requiere compatibilidad con WebGL"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances de plateformes et de technologies de développement de jeux spécifiques","Les compétences spécialisées peuvent avoir des exigences ou des dépendances supplémentaires, comme `game-development/web-game` qui nécessite une prise en charge de WebGL"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von bestimmten Spielentwicklungsplattformen und -technologien","Teilfähigkeiten können zusätzliche Anforderungen oder Abhängigkeiten aufweisen, wie z. B. `game-development/web-game`, die WebGL-Unterstützung benötigt"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de plataformas e tecnologias de desenvolvimento de jogos específicas","As sub-habilidades podem ter requisitos ou dependências adicionais, como `game-development/web-game` que necessita de suporte WebGL"],"ru":["Требует знания конкретных платформ и технологий разработки игр","Поднавыки могут иметь дополнительные требования или зависимости, такие как `game-development/web-game`, требующие поддержки WebGL"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة منصات وتقنيات تطوير الألعاب المحددة","مهارات فرعية قد يكون لها متطلبات أو اعتمادات إضافية، مثل `game-development/web-game` التي تحتاج إلى دعم WebGL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/d3-viz', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'd3-viz', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z', '2026-02-18T11:38:20.809Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/d3-viz","name":"d3-viz","description":{"zh":"D3.js 是一个 JavaScript 库，用于创建交互式数据可视化。它提供了数据驱动文档的强大功能，允许开发者创建自定义、出版质量的可视化效果","ja":"D3.js は、インタラクティブなデータビジュアライゼーションを作成するための JavaScript ライブラリです。データ駆動ドキュメントの強力な機能を提供し、開発者がカスタマイズされた、出版品質のビジュアライゼーションを作成できるようにします","ko":"D3.js는 상호작용 데이터 시각화를 생성하기 위한 JavaScript 라이브러리입니다. 데이터 주도 문서의 강력한 기능을 제공하여 개발자가 맞춤형, 출판 품질의 시각화를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"D3.js es una biblioteca para crear visualizaciones de datos interactivas y personalizadas. Permite unir datos a elementos DOM y aplicar transformaciones para crear gráficos de alta calidad.","fr":"D3.js est une bibliothèque pour créer des visualisations de données interactives et personnalisées. Elle permet de relier des données à des éléments DOM et d''appliquer des transformations pour créer des graphiques de haute qualité.","de":"D3.js ist eine Bibliothek zum Erstellen interaktiver und benutzerdefinierter Datenvisualisierungen. Sie ermöglicht das Binden von Daten an DOM-Elemente und das Anwenden von Transformationen, um Veröffentlichungsqualitätsgrafiken zu erstellen.","pt":"D3.js é uma biblioteca para criar visualizações de dados interativas e personalizadas. Ela oferece controle preciso sobre os elementos visuais.","ru":"D3.js — это библиотека для создания интерактивных и кастомных визуализаций данных. Она обеспечивает точный контроль над визуальными элементами.","ar":"D3.js هي مكتبة لإنشاء تصورات البيانات التفاعلية والمخصصة. توفر التحكم الدقيق في العناصر المرئية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"D3.js 数据可视化","ja":"D3.js データビジュアライゼーション","ko":"D3.js 데이터 시각화","es":"D3.js: Visualización de datos interactiva","fr":"D3.js: Visualisation de données interactive","de":"D3.js: Interaktive Datenvisualisierung","pt":"D3.js: Crie Visualizações de Dados Interativas","ru":"D3.js: Создание интерактивных визуализаций данных","ar":"D3.js: إنشاء تصورات بيانات تفاعلية","en":"d3-viz"},"description":{"zh":"D3.js 是一个 JavaScript 库，用于创建交互式数据可视化。它提供了数据驱动文档的强大功能，允许开发者创建自定义、出版质量的可视化效果","ja":"D3.js は、インタラクティブなデータビジュアライゼーションを作成するための JavaScript ライブラリです。データ駆動ドキュメントの強力な機能を提供し、開発者がカスタマイズされた、出版品質のビジュアライゼーションを作成できるようにします","ko":"D3.js는 상호작용 데이터 시각화를 생성하기 위한 JavaScript 라이브러리입니다. 데이터 주도 문서의 강력한 기능을 제공하여 개발자가 맞춤형, 출판 품질의 시각화를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"D3.js es una biblioteca para crear visualizaciones de datos interactivas y personalizadas. Permite unir datos a elementos DOM y aplicar transformaciones para...","fr":"D3.js est une bibliothèque pour créer des visualisations de données interactives et personnalisées. Elle permet de relier des données à des éléments DOM et d...","de":"D3.js ist eine Bibliothek zum Erstellen interaktiver und benutzerdefinierter Datenvisualisierungen. Sie ermöglicht das Binden von Daten an DOM-Elemente und d...","pt":"D3.js é uma biblioteca para criar visualizações de dados interativas e personalizadas. Ela oferece controle preciso sobre os elementos visuais.","ru":"D3.js — это библиотека для создания интерактивных и кастомных визуализаций данных. Она обеспечивает точный контроль над визуальными элементами.","ar":"D3.js هي مكتبة لإنشاء تصورات البيانات التفاعلية والمخصصة. توفر التحكم الدقيق في العناصر المرئية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["交互式数据可视化","数据驱动文档","自定义可视化效果","出版质量的可视化","支持多种 JavaScript 环境"],"ja":["インタラクティブなデータビジュアライゼーション","データ駆動ドキュメント","カスタマイズされたビジュアライゼーション","出版品質のビジュアライゼーション","複数の JavaScript 環境をサポート"],"ko":["상호작용 데이터 시각화","데이터 주도 문서","맞춤형 시각화","출판 품질의 시각화","여러 JavaScript 환경 지원"],"es":["Creación de visualizaciones de datos interactivas","Unión de datos a elementos DOM","Aplicación de transformaciones para crear gráficos personalizados","Compatibilidad con vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte y otros frameworks","Control preciso sobre cada elemento visual"],"fr":["Création de visualisations de données interactives","Relier des données à des éléments DOM","Application de transformations pour créer des graphiques personnalisés","Compatibilité avec vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte et d''autres frameworks","Contrôle précis sur chaque élément visuel"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver Datenvisualisierungen","Binden von Daten an DOM-Elemente","Anwenden von Transformationen, um benutzerdefinierte Grafiken zu erstellen","Kompatibilität mit vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte und anderen Frameworks","Präzise Kontrolle über jedes visuelle Element"],"pt":["Criação de visualizações de dados personalizadas","Controle preciso sobre os elementos visuais","Compatibilidade com várias bibliotecas JavaScript","Suporte a interatividade e animações","Possibilidade de uso em diferentes ambientes JavaScript"],"ru":["Создание кастомных визуализаций данных","Точный контроль над визуальными элементами","Совместимость с различными JavaScript-библиотеками","Поддержка интерактивности и анимаций","Возможность использования в разных JavaScript-окружениях"],"ar":["إنشاء تصورات البيانات المخصصة","التحكم الدقيق في العناصر المرئية","التوافق مع مكتبات جافا سكريبت المختلفة","دعم التفاعل والرسوم المتحركة","إمكانية استخدامها في بيئات جافا سكريبت المختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["D3.js","数据可视化","交互式可视化","JavaScript 库","数据驱动文档","自定义可视化"],"ja":["D3.js","データビジュアライゼーション","インタラクティブなビジュアライゼーション","JavaScript ライブラリ","データ駆動ドキュメント","カスタマイズされたビジュアライゼーション"],"ko":["D3.js","데이터 시각화","상호작용 시각화","JavaScript 라이브러리","데이터 주도 문서","맞춤형 시각화"],"es":["D3.js","visualización de datos","gráficos interactivos","JavaScript","React","Vue","Svelte","vanilla JavaScript","visualización de datos personalizada"],"fr":["D3.js","visualisation de données","graphiques interactifs","JavaScript","React","Vue","Svelte","vanilla JavaScript","visualisation de données personnalisée"],"de":["D3.js","Datenvisualisierung","interaktive Grafiken","JavaScript","React","Vue","Svelte","vanilla JavaScript","benutzerdefinierte Datenvisualisierung"],"pt":["D3.js","visualização de dados","biblioteca JavaScript","interatividade","animações","desenvolvimento web","apresentação de dados","controle visual"],"ru":["D3.js","визуализация данных","JavaScript-библиотека","интерактивность","анимации","веб-разработка","представление данных","визуальный контроль"],"ar":["D3.js","تصور البيانات","مكتبة جافا سكريبت","التفاعل","الرسوم المتحركة","تطوير الويب","عرض البيانات","التحكم المرئي"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"d3-viz","description":"Creating interactive data visualisations using d3.js. This skill should be used when creating custom charts, graphs, network diagrams, geographic visualisations, or any complex SVG-based data visualisation that requires fine-grained control over visual elements, transitions, or interactions. Use this for bespoke visualisations beyond standard charting libraries, whether in React, Vue, Svelte, vanilla JavaScript, or any other environment.","bodyPreview":"# D3.js Visualisation\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating sophisticated, interactive data visualisations using d3.js. D3.js (Data-Driven Documents) excels at binding data to DOM elements and applying data-driven transformations to create custom, publication-quality visualisations with precise control over every visual element. The techniques work across any JavaScript environment, including vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte, and other frameworks.\n\n## When to use d3.js\n\n*","body":"# D3.js Visualisation\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating sophisticated, interactive data visualisations using d3.js. D3.js (Data-Driven Documents) excels at binding data to DOM elements and applying data-driven transformations to create custom, publication-quality visualisations with precise control over every visual element. The techniques work across any JavaScript environment, including vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte, and other frameworks.\n\n## When to use d3.js\n\n**Use d3.js for:**\n- Custom visualisations requiring unique visual encodings or layouts\n- Interactive explorations with complex pan, zoom, or brush behaviours\n- Network/graph visualisations (force-directed layouts, tree diagrams, hierarchies, chord diagrams)\n- Geographic visualisations with custom projections\n- Visualisations requiring smooth, choreographed transitions\n- Publication-quality graphics with fine-grained styling control\n- Novel chart types not available in standard libraries\n\n**Consider alternatives for:**\n- 3D visualisations - use Three.js instead\n\n## Core workflow\n\n### 1. Set up d3.js\n\nImport d3 at the top of your script:\n\n```javascript\nimport * as d3 from ''d3'';\n```\n\nOr use the CDN version (7.x):\n\n```html\n<script src=\"https://d3js.org/d3.v7.min.js\"></script>\n```\n\nAll modules (scales, axes, shapes, transitions, etc.) are accessible through the `d3` namespace.\n\n### 2. Choose the integration pattern\n\n**Pattern A: Direct DOM manipulation (recommended for most cases)**\nUse d3 to select DOM elements and manipulate them imperatively. This works in any JavaScript environment:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawChart(data) {\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart''); // Select by ID, class, or DOM element\n\n  // Clear previous content\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  // Set up dimensions\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 400;\n  const margin = { top: 20, right: 30, bottom: 40, left: 50 };\n\n  // Create scales, axes, and draw visualisation\n  // ... d3 code here ...\n}\n\n// Call when data changes\ndrawChart(myData);\n```\n\n**Pattern B: Declarative rendering (for frameworks with templating)**\nUse d3 for data calculations (scales, layouts) but render elements via your framework:\n\n```javascript\nfunction getChartElements(data) {\n  const xScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.value)])\n    .range([0, 400]);\n\n  return data.map((d, i) => ({\n    x: 50,\n    y: i * 30,\n    width: xScale(d.value),\n    height: 25\n  }));\n}\n\n// In React: {getChartElements(data).map((d, i) => <rect key={i} {...d} fill=\"steelblue\" />)}\n// In Vue: v-for directive over the returned array\n// In vanilla JS: Create elements manually from the returned data\n```\n\nUse Pattern A for complex visualisations with transitions, interactions, or when leveraging d3''s full capabilities. Use Pattern B for simpler visualisations or when your framework prefers declarative rendering.\n\n### 3. Structure the visualisation code\n\nFollow this standard structure in your drawing function:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawVisualization(data) {\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart''); // Or pass a selector/element\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove(); // Clear previous render\n\n  // 1. Define dimensions\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 400;\n  const margin = { top: 20, right: 30, bottom: 40, left: 50 };\n  const innerWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;\n  const innerHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;\n\n  // 2. Create main group with margins\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`);\n\n  // 3. Create scales\n  const xScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.x)])\n    .range([0, innerWidth]);\n\n  const yScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.y)])\n    .range([innerHeight, 0]); // Note: inverted for SVG coordinates\n\n  // 4. Create and append axes\n  const xAxis = d3.axisBottom(xScale);\n  const yAxis = d3.axisLeft(yScale);\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(0,${innerHeight})`)\n    .call(xAxis);\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .call(yAxis);\n\n  // 5. Bind data and create visual elements\n  g.selectAll(\"circle\")\n    .data(data)\n    .join(\"circle\")\n    .attr(\"cx\", d => xScale(d.x))\n    .attr(\"cy\", d => yScale(d.y))\n    .attr(\"r\", 5)\n    .attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\");\n}\n\n// Call when data changes\ndrawVisualization(myData);\n```\n\n### 4. Implement responsive sizing\n\nMake visualisations responsive to container size:\n\n```javascript\nfunction setupResponsiveChart(containerId, data) {\n  const container = document.getElementById(containerId);\n  const svg = d3.select(`#${containerId}`).append(''svg'');\n\n  function updateChart() {\n    const { width, height } = container.getBoundingClientRect();\n    svg.attr(''width'', width).attr(''height'', height);\n\n    // Redraw visualisation with new dimensions\n    drawChart(data, svg, width, height);\n  }\n\n  // Update on initial load\n  updateChart();\n\n  // Update on window resize\n  window.addEventListener(''resize'', updateChart);\n\n  // Return cleanup function\n  return () => window.removeEventListener(''resize'', updateChart);\n}\n\n// Usage:\n// const cleanup = setupResponsiveChart(''chart-container'', myData);\n// cleanup(); // Call when component unmounts or element removed\n```\n\nOr use ResizeObserver for more direct container monitoring:\n\n```javascript\nfunction setupResponsiveChartWithObserver(svgElement, data) {\n  const observer = new ResizeObserver(() => {\n    const { width, height } = svgElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n    d3.select(svgElement)\n      .attr(''width'', width)\n      .attr(''height'', height);\n\n    // Redraw visualisation\n    drawChart(data, d3.select(svgElement), width, height);\n  });\n\n  observer.observe(svgElement.parentElement);\n  return () => observer.disconnect();\n}\n```\n\n## Common visualisation patterns\n\n### Bar chart\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawBarChart(data, svgElement) {\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(svgElement);\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 400;\n  const margin = { top: 20, right: 30, bottom: 40, left: 50 };\n  const innerWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;\n  const innerHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;\n\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`);\n\n  const xScale = d3.scaleBand()\n    .domain(data.map(d => d.category))\n    .range([0, innerWidth])\n    .padding(0.1);\n\n  const yScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.value)])\n    .range([innerHeight, 0]);\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(0,${innerHeight})`)\n    .call(d3.axisBottom(xScale));\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .call(d3.axisLeft(yScale));\n\n  g.selectAll(\"rect\")\n    .data(data)\n    .join(\"rect\")\n    .attr(\"x\", d => xScale(d.category))\n    .attr(\"y\", d => yScale(d.value))\n    .attr(\"width\", xScale.bandwidth())\n    .attr(\"height\", d => innerHeight - yScale(d.value))\n    .attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\");\n}\n\n// Usage:\n// drawBarChart(myData, document.getElementById(''chart''));\n```\n\n### Line chart\n\n```javascript\nconst line = d3.line()\n  .x(d => xScale(d.date))\n  .y(d => yScale(d.value))\n  .curve(d3.curveMonotoneX); // Smooth curve\n\ng.append(\"path\")\n  .datum(data)\n  .attr(\"fill\", \"none\")\n  .attr(\"stroke\", \"steelblue\")\n  .attr(\"stroke-width\", 2)\n  .attr(\"d\", line);\n```\n\n### Scatter plot\n\n```javascript\ng.selectAll(\"circle\")\n  .data(data)\n  .join(\"circle\")\n  .attr(\"cx\", d => xScale(d.x))\n  .attr(\"cy\", d => yScale(d.y))\n  .attr(\"r\", d => sizeScale(d.size)) // Optional: size encoding\n  .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(d.category)) // Optional: colour encoding\n  .attr(\"opacity\", 0.7);\n```\n\n### Chord diagram\n\nA chord diagram shows relationships between entities in a circular layout, with ribbons representing flows between them:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawChordDiagram(data) {\n  // data format: array of objects with source, target, and value\n  // Example: [{ source: ''A'', target: ''B'', value: 10 }, ...]\n\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart'');\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  const width = 600;\n  const height = 600;\n  const innerRadius = Math.min(width, height) * 0.3;\n  const outerRadius = innerRadius + 30;\n\n  // Create matrix from data\n  const nodes = Array.from(new Set(data.flatMap(d => [d.source, d.target])));\n  const matrix = Array.from({ length: nodes.length }, () => Array(nodes.length).fill(0));\n\n  data.forEach(d => {\n    const i = nodes.indexOf(d.source);\n    const j = nodes.indexOf(d.target);\n    matrix[i][j] += d.value;\n    matrix[j][i] += d.value;\n  });\n\n  // Create chord layout\n  const chord = d3.chord()\n    .padAngle(0.05)\n    .sortSubgroups(d3.descending);\n\n  const arc = d3.arc()\n    .innerRadius(innerRadius)\n    .outerRadius(outerRadius);\n\n  const ribbon = d3.ribbon()\n    .source(d => d.source)\n    .target(d => d.target);\n\n  const colourScale = d3.scaleOrdinal(d3.schemeCategory10)\n    .domain(nodes);\n\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${width / 2},${height / 2})`);\n\n  const chords = chord(matrix);\n\n  // Draw ribbons\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"fill-opacity\", 0.67)\n    .selectAll(\"path\")\n    .data(chords)\n    .join(\"path\")\n    .attr(\"d\", ribbon)\n    .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(nodes[d.source.index]))\n    .attr(\"stroke\", d => d3.rgb(colourScale(nodes[d.source.index])).darker());\n\n  // Draw groups (arcs)\n  const group = g.append(\"g\")\n    .selectAll(\"g\")\n    .data(chords.groups)\n    .join(\"g\");\n\n  group.append(\"path\")\n    .attr(\"d\", arc)\n    .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(nodes[d.index]))\n    .attr(\"stroke\", d => d3.rgb(colourScale(nodes[d.index])).darker());\n\n  // Add labels\n  group.append(\"text\")\n    .each(d => { d.angle = (d.startAngle + d.endAngle) / 2; })\n    .attr(\"dy\", \"0.31em\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", d => `rotate(${(d.angle * 180 / Math.PI) - 90})translate(${outerRadius + 30})${d.angle > Math.PI ? \"rotate(180)\" : \"\"}`)\n    .attr(\"text-anchor\", d => d.angle > Math.PI ? \"end\" : null)\n    .text((d, i) => nodes[i])\n    .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n}\n```\n\n### Heatmap\n\nA heatmap uses colour to encode values in a two-dimensional grid, useful for showing patterns across categories:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawHeatmap(data) {\n  // data format: array of objects with row, column, and value\n  // Example: [{ row: ''A'', column: ''X'', value: 10 }, ...]\n\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart'');\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 600;\n  const margin = { top: 100, right: 30, bottom: 30, left: 100 };\n  const innerWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;\n  const innerHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;\n\n  // Get unique rows and columns\n  const rows = Array.from(new Set(data.map(d => d.row)));\n  const columns = Array.from(new Set(data.map(d => d.column)));\n\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`);\n\n  // Create scales\n  const xScale = d3.scaleBand()\n    .domain(columns)\n    .range([0, innerWidth])\n    .padding(0.01);\n\n  const yScale = d3.scaleBand()\n    .domain(rows)\n    .range([0, innerHeight])\n    .padding(0.01);\n\n  // Colour scale for values\n  const colourScale = d3.scaleSequential(d3.interpolateYlOrRd)\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.value)]);\n\n  // Draw rectangles\n  g.selectAll(\"rect\")\n    .data(data)\n    .join(\"rect\")\n    .attr(\"x\", d => xScale(d.column))\n    .attr(\"y\", d => yScale(d.row))\n    .attr(\"width\", xScale.bandwidth())\n    .attr(\"height\", yScale.bandwidth())\n    .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(d.value));\n\n  // Add x-axis labels\n  svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`)\n    .selectAll(\"text\")\n    .data(columns)\n    .join(\"text\")\n    .attr(\"x\", d => xScale(d) + xScale.bandwidth() / 2)\n    .attr(\"y\", -10)\n    .attr(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\")\n    .text(d => d)\n    .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n\n  // Add y-axis labels\n  svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`)\n    .selectAll(\"text\")\n    .data(rows)\n    .join(\"text\")\n    .attr(\"x\", -10)\n    .attr(\"y\", d => yScale(d) + yScale.bandwidth() / 2)\n    .attr(\"dy\", \"0.35em\")\n    .attr(\"text-anchor\", \"end\")\n    .text(d => d)\n    .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n\n  // Add colour legend\n  const legendWidth = 20;\n  const legendHeight = 200;\n  const legend = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${width - 60},${margin.top})`);\n\n  const legendScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain(colourScale.domain())\n    .range([legendHeight, 0]);\n\n  const legendAxis = d3.axisRight(legendScale)\n    .ticks(5);\n\n  // Draw colour gradient in legend\n  for (let i = 0; i < legendHeight; i++) {\n    legend.append(\"rect\")\n      .attr(\"y\", i)\n      .attr(\"width\", legendWidth)\n      .attr(\"height\", 1)\n      .attr(\"fill\", colourScale(legendScale.invert(i)));\n  }\n\n  legend.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${legendWidth},0)`)\n    .call(legendAxis);\n}\n```\n\n### Pie chart\n\n```javascript\nconst pie = d3.pie()\n  .value(d => d.value)\n  .sort(null);\n\nconst arc = d3.arc()\n  .innerRadius(0)\n  .outerRadius(Math.min(width, height) / 2 - 20);\n\nconst colourScale = d3.scaleOrdinal(d3.schemeCategory10);\n\nconst g = svg.append(\"g\")\n  .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${width / 2},${height / 2})`);\n\ng.selectAll(\"path\")\n  .data(pie(data))\n  .join(\"path\")\n  .attr(\"d\", arc)\n  .attr(\"fill\", (d, i) => colourScale(i))\n  .attr(\"stroke\", \"white\")\n  .attr(\"stroke-width\", 2);\n```\n\n### Force-directed network\n\n```javascript\nconst simulation = d3.forceSimulation(nodes)\n  .force(\"link\", d3.forceLink(links).id(d => d.id).distance(100))\n  .force(\"charge\", d3.forceManyBody().strength(-300))\n  .force(\"center\", d3.forceCenter(width / 2, height / 2));\n\nconst link = g.selectAll(\"line\")\n  .data(links)\n  .join(\"line\")\n  .attr(\"stroke\", \"#999\")\n  .attr(\"stroke-width\", 1);\n\nconst node = g.selectAll(\"circle\")\n  .data(nodes)\n  .join(\"circle\")\n  .attr(\"r\", 8)\n  .attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\")\n  .call(d3.drag()\n    .on(\"start\", dragstarted)\n    .on(\"drag\", dragged)\n    .on(\"end\", dragended));\n\nsimulation.on(\"tick\", () => {\n  link\n    .attr(\"x1\", d => d.source.x)\n    .attr(\"y1\", d => d.source.y)\n    .attr(\"x2\", d => d.target.x)\n    .attr(\"y2\", d => d.target.y);\n  \n  node\n    .attr(\"cx\", d => d.x)\n    .attr(\"cy\", d => d.y);\n});\n\nfunction dragstarted(event) {\n  if (!event.active) simulation.alphaTarget(0.3).restart();\n  event.subject.fx = event.subject.x;\n  event.subject.fy = event.subject.y;\n}\n\nfunction dragged(event) {\n  event.subject.fx = event.x;\n  event.subject.fy = event.y;\n}\n\nfunction dragended(event) {\n  if (!event.active) simulation.alphaTarget(0);\n  event.subject.fx = null;\n  event.subject.fy = null;\n}\n```\n\n## Adding interactivity\n\n### Tooltips\n\n```javascript\n// Create tooltip div (outside SVG)\nconst tooltip = d3.select(\"body\").append(\"div\")\n  .attr(\"class\", \"tooltip\")\n  .style(\"position\", \"absolute\")\n  .style(\"visibility\", \"hidden\")\n  .style(\"background-color\", \"white\")\n  .style(\"border\", \"1px solid #ddd\")\n  .style(\"padding\", \"10px\")\n  .style(\"border-radius\", \"4px\")\n  .style(\"pointer-events\", \"none\");\n\n// Add to elements\ncircles\n  .on(\"mouseover\", function(event, d) {\n    d3.select(this).attr(\"opacity\", 1);\n    tooltip\n      .style(\"visibility\", \"visible\")\n      .html(`<strong>${d.label}</strong><br/>Value: ${d.value}`);\n  })\n  .on(\"mousemove\", function(event) {\n    tooltip\n      .style(\"top\", (event.pageY - 10) + \"px\")\n      .style(\"left\", (event.pageX + 10) + \"px\");\n  })\n  .on(\"mouseout\", function() {\n    d3.select(this).attr(\"opacity\", 0.7);\n    tooltip.style(\"visibility\", \"hidden\");\n  });\n```\n\n### Zoom and pan\n\n```javascript\nconst zoom = d3.zoom()\n  .scaleExtent([0.5, 10])\n  .on(\"zoom\", (event) => {\n    g.attr(\"transform\", event.transform);\n  });\n\nsvg.call(zoom);\n```\n\n### Click interactions\n\n```javascript\ncircles\n  .on(\"click\", function(event, d) {\n    // Handle click (dispatch event, update app state, etc.)\n    console.log(\"Clicked:\", d);\n\n    // Visual feedback\n    d3.selectAll(\"circle\").attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\");\n    d3.select(this).attr(\"fill\", \"orange\");\n\n    // Optional: dispatch custom event for your framework/app to listen to\n    // window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent(''chartClick'', { detail: d }));\n  });\n```\n\n## Transitions and animations\n\nAdd smooth transitions to visual changes:\n\n```javascript\n// Basic transition\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .duration(750)\n  .attr(\"r\", 10);\n\n// Chained transitions\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .duration(500)\n  .attr(\"fill\", \"orange\")\n  .transition()\n  .duration(500)\n  .attr(\"r\", 15);\n\n// Staggered transitions\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .delay((d, i) => i * 50)\n  .duration(500)\n  .attr(\"cy\", d => yScale(d.value));\n\n// Custom easing\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .duration(1000)\n  .ease(d3.easeBounceOut)\n  .attr(\"r\", 10);\n```\n\n## Scales reference\n\n### Quantitative scales\n\n```javascript\n// Linear scale\nconst xScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n  .domain([0, 100])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n\n// Log scale (for exponential data)\nconst logScale = d3.scaleLog()\n  .domain([1, 1000])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n\n// Power scale\nconst powScale = d3.scalePow()\n  .exponent(2)\n  .domain([0, 100])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n\n// Time scale\nconst timeScale = d3.scaleTime()\n  .domain([new Date(2020, 0, 1), new Date(2024, 0, 1)])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n```\n\n### Ordinal scales\n\n```javascript\n// Band scale (for bar charts)\nconst bandScale = d3.scaleBand()\n  .domain([''A'', ''B'', ''C'', ''D''])\n  .range([0, 400])\n  .padding(0.1);\n\n// Point scale (for line/scatter categories)\nconst pointScale = d3.scalePoint()\n  .domain([''A'', ''B'', ''C'', ''D''])\n  .range([0, 400]);\n\n// Ordinal scale (for colours)\nconst colourScale = d3.scaleOrdinal(d3.schemeCategory10);\n```\n\n### Sequential scales\n\n```javascript\n// Sequential colour scale\nconst colourScale = d3.scaleSequential(d3.interpolateBlues)\n  .domain([0, 100]);\n\n// Diverging colour scale\nconst divScale = d3.scaleDiverging(d3.interpolateRdBu)\n  .domain([-10, 0, 10]);\n```\n\n## Best practices\n\n### Data preparation\n\nAlways validate and prepare data before visualisation:\n\n```javascript\n// Filter invalid values\nconst cleanData = data.filter(d => d.value != null && !isNaN(d.value));\n\n// Sort data if order matters\nconst sortedData = [...data].sort((a, b) => b.value - a.value);\n\n// Parse dates\nconst parsedData = data.map(d => ({\n  ...d,\n  date: d3.timeParse(\"%Y-%m-%d\")(d.date)\n}));\n```\n\n### Performance optimisation\n\nFor large datasets (>1000 elements):\n\n```javascript\n// Use canvas instead of SVG for many elements\n// Use quadtree for collision detection\n// Simplify paths with d3.line().curve(d3.curveStep)\n// Implement virtual scrolling for large lists\n// Use requestAnimationFrame for custom animations\n```\n\n### Accessibility\n\nMake visualisations accessible:\n\n```javascript\n// Add ARIA labels\nsvg.attr(\"role\", \"img\")\n   .attr(\"aria-label\", \"Bar chart showing quarterly revenue\");\n\n// Add title and description\nsvg.append(\"title\").text(\"Quarterly Revenue 2024\");\nsvg.append(\"desc\").text(\"Bar chart showing revenue growth across four quarters\");\n\n// Ensure sufficient colour contrast\n// Provide keyboard navigation for interactive elements\n// Include data table alternative\n```\n\n### Styling\n\nUse consistent, professional styling:\n\n```javascript\n// Define colour palettes upfront\nconst colours = {\n  primary: ''#4A90E2'',\n  secondary: ''#7B68EE'',\n  background: ''#F5F7FA'',\n  text: ''#333333'',\n  gridLines: ''#E0E0E0''\n};\n\n// Apply consistent typography\nsvg.selectAll(\"text\")\n  .style(\"font-family\", \"Inter, sans-serif\")\n  .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n\n// Use subtle grid lines\ng.selectAll(\".tick line\")\n  .attr(\"stroke\", colours.gridLines)\n  .attr(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"2,2\");\n```\n\n## Common issues and solutions\n\n**Issue**: Axes not appearing\n- Ensure scales have valid domains (check for NaN values)\n- Verify axis is appended to correct group\n- Check transform translations are correct\n\n**Issue**: Transitions not working\n- Call `.transition()` before attribute changes\n- Ensure elements have unique keys for proper data binding\n- Check that useEffect dependencies include all changing data\n\n**Issue**: Responsive sizing not working\n- Use ResizeObserver or window resize listener\n- Update dimensions in state to trigger re-render\n- Ensure SVG has width/height attributes or viewBox\n\n**Issue**: Performance problems\n- Limit number of DOM elements (consider canvas for >1000 items)\n- Debounce resize handlers\n- Use `.join()` instead of separate enter/update/exit selections\n- Avoid unnecessary re-renders by checking dependencies\n\n## Resources\n\n### references/\nContains detailed reference materials:\n- `d3-patterns.md` - Comprehensive collection of visualisation patterns and code examples\n- `scale-reference.md` - Complete guide to d3 scales with examples\n- `colour-schemes.md` - D3 colour schemes and palette recommendations\n\n### assets/\n\nContains boilerplate templates:\n\n- `chart-template.js` - Starter template for basic chart\n- `interactive-template.js` - Template with tooltips, zoom, and interactions\n- `sample-data.json` - Example datasets for testing\n\nThese templates work with vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte, or any other JavaScript environment. Adapt them as needed for your specific framework.\n\nTo use these resources, read the relevant files when detailed guidance is needed for specific visualisation types or patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:38:20.809Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced interactive data visualization capabilities with d3.js","zh":"非常适合需要使用d3.js进行高级交互式数据可视化的前端代理","ja":"d3.jsを使用した高度なインタラクティブなデータ視覚化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"d3.js를 사용한 고급 인터랙티브 데이터 시각화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos interactivos avanzadas con d3.js","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de visualisation de données interactives avancées avec d3.js","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte interaktive Datenvisualisierungsfähigkeiten mit d3.js benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de dados interativos com d3.js","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности интерактивной визуализации данных с d3.js","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصوير البيانات التفاعلي مع d3.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create sophisticated, interactive data visualisations with precise control over every visual element, leveraging Data-Driven Documents (D3.js) across various JavaScript environments, including vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, and Svelte, and supporting custom, publication-quality visualisations","zh":"赋予代理创建复杂、交互式数据可视化的能力，并且对每个视觉元素都有精确的控制，利用数据驱动文档（D3.js）跨多种JavaScript环境，包括纯JavaScript、React、Vue和Svelte，并支持自定义、出版级别的可视化","ja":"エージェントが複雑なインタラクティブなデータ視覚化を作成する能力を与え、毎ビジュアル要素に対する正確な制御を提供し、データ駆動ドキュメント（D3.js）を使用して、バニラJavaScript、React、Vue、Svelteなど、様々なJavaScript環境を横断し、カスタム、出版品質の視覚化をサポートする","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 인터랙티브 데이터 시각화를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 모든 시각적 요소에 대한 정교한 제어를 제공하고, 데이터 주도 문서(D3.js)를 사용하여 다양한 자바스크립트 환경(vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte 등)을 지원하며, 사용자 정의 및 출판 수준의 시각화를 지원함","es":"Permite a los agentes crear visualizaciones de datos sofisticadas e interactivas con un control preciso sobre cada elemento visual, aprovechando los Documentos impulsados por datos (D3.js) en varios entornos de JavaScript, incluyendo JavaScript vanilla, React, Vue y Svelte, y admitiendo visualizaciones personalizadas de calidad de publicación","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des visualisations de données sophistiquées et interactives avec un contrôle précis sur chaque élément visuel, en exploitant les Documents pilotés par les données (D3.js) dans divers environnements JavaScript, notamment JavaScript vanille, React, Vue et Svelte, et en prenant en charge des visualisations personnalisées de qualité d''édition","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, anspruchsvolle, interaktive Datenvisualisierungen mit präziser Kontrolle über jedes visuelle Element zu erstellen, indem es auf Datengetriebene Dokumente (D3.js) in verschiedenen JavaScript-Umgebungen, einschließlich Vanilla-JavaScript, React, Vue und Svelte, zurückgreift und benutzerdefinierte, veröffentlichungsreife Visualisierungen unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem visualizações de dados sofisticadas e interativas com controle preciso sobre cada elemento visual, aproveitando Documentos Impulsionados por Dados (D3.js) em vários ambientes JavaScript, incluindo JavaScript vanilla, React, Vue e Svelte, e com suporte a visualizações personalizadas de qualidade de publicação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложные, интерактивные визуализации данных с точным контролем над каждым визуальным элементом, используя Документы, управляемые данными (D3.js), в различных средах JavaScript, включая ванильный JavaScript, React, Vue и Svelte, и поддержку пользовательских визуализаций высокого качества","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تصورات بيانات متقدمة ومتفاعلة مع التحكم الدقيق في كل عنصر مرئي، مستفيدة من وثائق مدفوعة بالبيانات (D3.js) في بيئات جافا سكريبت المختلفة، بما في ذلك جافا سكريبت الفانيليا، ري액ت، فيو، وسفلت، ودعم التصورات المرئية ذات جودة النشر"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating interactive bar charts for dashboard analytics","Creating custom, publication-quality visualisations for data storytelling","Binding data to DOM elements for dynamic visual updates"],"zh":["为仪表板分析生成交互式条形图","创建用于数据故事讲述的自定义、出版级别的可视化","将数据绑定到DOM元素以进行动态视觉更新"],"ja":["ダッシュボード分析のインタラクティブなバーチャートを生成する","データストーリーテリングのためのカスタム、出版品質の視覚化を作成する","データをDOM要素にバインドして動的なビジュアル更新を実行する"],"ko":["대시보드 분석을 위한 인터랙티브 바 차트 생성","데이터 스토리텔링을 위한 사용자 정의 및 출판 수준의 시각화 생성","동적인 시각적 업데이트를 위해 데이터를 DOM 요소에 바인딩"],"es":["Generar gráficas de barras interactivas para analíticas de panel de control","Crear visualizaciones personalizadas de calidad de publicación para narración de datos","Enlazar datos con elementos DOM para actualizaciones visuales dinámicas"],"fr":["Générer des graphiques à barres interactifs pour l''analyse de tableau de bord","Créer des visualisations personnalisées de qualité d''édition pour la narration de données","Lier des données aux éléments DOM pour des mises à jour visuelles dynamiques"],"de":["Interaktive Balken diagrams für Dashboard-Analytics generieren","Benutzerdefinierte, veröffentlichungsreife Visualisierungen für Datenstorytelling erstellen","Daten an DOM-Elemente binden für dynamische visuelle Updates"],"pt":["Gerar gráficos de barras interativos para análise de painéis","Criar visualizações personalizadas de qualidade de publicação para narrativa de dados","Ligar dados a elementos DOM para atualizações visuais dinâmicas"],"ru":["Генерировать интерактивные гистограммы для аналитики панелей","Создавать пользовательские визуализации высокого качества для рассказывания историй с данными","Привязывать данные к элементам DOM для динамических визуальных обновлений"],"ar":["генерировать مخططات شريطية تفاعلية لتحليل لوحات القيادة","إنشاء تصورات مرئية ذات جودة نشر مخصصة للقصص التي يتم рассказها مع البيانات","ربط البيانات bằng عناصر DOM من أجل تحديثات مرئية ديناميكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JavaScript environment","Limited to d3.js library"],"zh":["需要JavaScript环境","仅限于d3.js库"],"ja":["JavaScript環境が必要","D3.jsライブラリのみに限定"],"ko":["자바스크립트 환경이 필요","d3.js 라이브러리만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere entorno de JavaScript","Limitado a la biblioteca d3.js"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement JavaScript","Limité à la bibliothèque d3.js"],"de":["Benötigt eine JavaScript-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Bibliothek d3.js"],"pt":["Requer ambiente JavaScript","Limitado à biblioteca d3.js"],"ru":["Требуется среда JavaScript","Ограничен библиотекой d3.js"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة جافا سكريبت","محدود بمكتبة d3.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
