eloppement de jeux implique des principes et des routes spécialisées. Découvrez comment créer des expériences de jeu inoubliables.","de":"Die Spiele-Entwicklung umfasst Prinzipien und spezialisierte Routen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie unvergessliche Spiel-Erfahrungen schaffen.","pt":"O desenvolvimento de jogos é uma habilidade que fornece princípios fundamentais e rotas para habilidades especializadas.","ru":"Разработка игр - это навык, который предоставляет основные принципы и пути к специализированным навыкам.","ar":"تطوير الألعاب هو مهارة توفر المبادئ الأساسية والمسارات إلى المهارات المتخصصة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提供游戏开发核心原则","路由到专门的子技能","支持多平台游戏开发","包括Web游戏开发","提供游戏开发最佳实践"],"ja":["ゲーム開発の基本原則を提供","専門のサブスキルへのルーティング","多プラットフォームゲーム開発をサポート","Webゲーム開発を含む","ゲーム開発のベストプラクティスを提供"],"ko":["게임 개발 핵심 원칙 제공","전문적인 하위 스킬로의 라우팅","다중 플랫폼 게임 개발 지원","웹 게임 개발 포함","게임 개발最佳实践 제공"],"es":["Principios de desarrollo de juegos","Rutas especializadas","Creación de experiencias de juego","Desarrollo de juegos para web","Selección de plataformas"],"fr":["Principes de développement de jeux","Routes spécialisées","Création d''expériences de jeu","Développement de jeux pour le web","Sélection de plates-formes"],"de":["Prinzipien der Spiele-Entwicklung","Spezialisierte Routen","Erstellung von Spiel-Erfahrungen","Spiele-Entwicklung für das Web","Plattform-Auswahl"],"pt":["Princípios fundamentais do desenvolvimento de jogos","Rotas para habilidades especializadas","Desenvolvimento de jogos para web","Uso de tecnologias como HTML5 e WebGL","Criação de jogos para plataformas móveis","Otimização de desempenho de jogos"],"ru":["Основные принципы разработки игр","Пути к специализированным навыкам","Разработка игр для веба","Использование технологий seperti HTML5 и WebGL","Создание игр для мобильных платформ","Оптимизация производительности игр"],"ar":["المبادئ الأساسية لتطوير الألعاب","المسارات إلى المهارات المتخصصة","تطوير الألعاب للويب","استخدام تقنيات مثل HTML5 و WebGL","إنشاء الألعاب لأنظمة التشغيل المتنقلة","تحسين أداء الألعاب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["游戏开发","游戏开发技能","游戏开发核心原则","游戏开发路由","Web游戏开发"],"ja":["ゲーム開発","ゲーム開発スキル","ゲーム開発の基本原則","ゲーム開発ルーティング","Webゲーム開発"],"ko":["게임 개발","게임 개발 스킬","게임 개발 핵심 원칙","게임 개발 라우팅","웹 게임 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos","creación de juegos","juegos electrónicos","desarrollo de juegos para web","principios de desarrollo de juegos"],"fr":["développement de jeux","création de jeux","jeux électroniques","développement de jeux pour le web","principes de développement de jeux"],"de":["Spiele-Entwicklung","Erstellung von Spielen","elektronische Spiele","Spiele-Entwicklung für das Web","Prinzipien der Spiele-Entwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos","jogos eletrônicos","programação de jogos","design de jogos","testes de jogos","HTML5","WebGL","jogos para web","jogos móveis"],"ru":["разработка игр","электронные игры","программирование игр","дизайн игр","тестирование игр","HTML5","WebGL","игры для веба","мобильные игры"],"ar":["تطوير الألعاب","الألعاب الإلكترونية","برمجة الألعاب","تصميم الألعاب","اختبار الألعاب","HTML5","WebGL","ألعاب الويب","ألعاب الجوال"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"game-development","description":"Game development orchestrator. Routes to platform-specific skills based on project needs.","bodyPreview":"# Game Development\n\n> **Orchestrator skill** that provides core principles and routes to specialized sub-skills.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nYou are working on a game development project. This skill teaches the PRINCIPLES of game development and directs you to the right sub-skill based on context.\n\n---\n\n## Sub-Skill Routing\n\n### Platform Selection\n\n| If the game targets... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|------------------------|---------------|\n| Web browsers (HTML5, WebGL) | `game-development/web-game","body":"# Game Development\n\n> **Orchestrator skill** that provides core principles and routes to specialized sub-skills.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nYou are working on a game development project. This skill teaches the PRINCIPLES of game development and directs you to the right sub-skill based on context.\n\n---\n\n## Sub-Skill Routing\n\n### Platform Selection\n\n| If the game targets... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|------------------------|---------------|\n| Web browsers (HTML5, WebGL) | `game-development/web-games` |\n| Mobile (iOS, Android) | `game-development/mobile-games` |\n| PC (Steam, Desktop) | `game-development/pc-games` |\n| VR/AR headsets | `game-development/vr-ar` |\n\n### Dimension Selection\n\n| If the game is... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|-------------------|---------------|\n| 2D (sprites, tilemaps) | `game-development/2d-games` |\n| 3D (meshes, shaders) | `game-development/3d-games` |\n\n### Specialty Areas\n\n| If you need... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|----------------|---------------|\n| GDD, balancing, player psychology | `game-development/game-design` |\n| Multiplayer, networking | `game-development/multiplayer` |\n| Visual style, asset pipeline, animation | `game-development/game-art` |\n| Sound design, music, adaptive audio | `game-development/game-audio` |\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles (All Platforms)\n\n### 1. The Game Loop\n\nEvery game, regardless of platform, follows this pattern:\n\n```\nINPUT  → Read player actions\nUPDATE → Process game logic (fixed timestep)\nRENDER → Draw the frame (interpolated)\n```\n\n**Fixed Timestep Rule:**\n- Physics/logic: Fixed rate (e.g., 50Hz)\n- Rendering: As fast as possible\n- Interpolate between states for smooth visuals\n\n---\n\n### 2. Pattern Selection Matrix\n\n| Pattern | Use When | Example |\n|---------|----------|---------|\n| **State Machine** | 3-5 discrete states | Player: Idle→Walk→Jump |\n| **Object Pooling** | Frequent spawn/destroy | Bullets, particles |\n| **Observer/Events** | Cross-system communication | Health→UI updates |\n| **ECS** | Thousands of similar entities | RTS units, particles |\n| **Command** | Undo, replay, networking | Input recording |\n| **Behavior Tree** | Complex AI decisions | Enemy AI |\n\n**Decision Rule:** Start with State Machine. Add ECS only when performance demands.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Input Abstraction\n\nAbstract input into ACTIONS, not raw keys:\n\n```\n\"jump\"  → Space, Gamepad A, Touch tap\n\"move\"  → WASD, Left stick, Virtual joystick\n```\n\n**Why:** Enables multi-platform, rebindable controls.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Performance Budget (60 FPS = 16.67ms)\n\n| System | Budget |\n|--------|--------|\n| Input | 1ms |\n| Physics | 3ms |\n| AI | 2ms |\n| Game Logic | 4ms |\n| Rendering | 5ms |\n| Buffer | 1.67ms |\n\n**Optimization Priority:**\n1. Algorithm (O(n²) → O(n log n))\n2. Batching (reduce draw calls)\n3. Pooling (avoid GC spikes)\n4. LOD (detail by distance)\n5. Culling (skip invisible)\n\n---\n\n### 5. AI Selection by Complexity\n\n| AI Type | Complexity | Use When |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| **FSM** | Simple | 3-5 states, predictable behavior |\n| **Behavior Tree** | Medium | Modular, designer-friendly |\n| **GOAP** | High | Emergent, planning-based |\n| **Utility AI** | High | Scoring-based decisions |\n\n---\n\n### 6. Collision Strategy\n\n| Type | Best For |\n|------|----------|\n| **AABB** | Rectangles, fast checks |\n| **Circle** | Round objects, cheap |\n| **Spatial Hash** | Many similar-sized objects |\n| **Quadtree** | Large worlds, varying sizes |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns (Universal)\n\n| Don''t | Do |\n|-------|-----|\n| Update everything every frame | Use events, dirty flags |\n| Create objects in hot loops | Object pooling |\n| Cache nothing | Cache references |\n| Optimize without profiling | Profile first |\n| Mix input with logic | Abstract input layer |\n\n---\n\n## Routing Examples\n\n### Example 1: \"I want to make a browser-based 2D platformer\"\n→ Start with `game-development/web-games` for framework selection\n→ Then `game-development/2d-games` for sprite/tilemap patterns\n→ Reference `game-development/game-design` for level design\n\n### Example 2: \"Mobile puzzle game for iOS and Android\"\n→ Start with `game-development/mobile-games` for touch input and stores\n→ Use `game-development/game-design` for puzzle balancing\n\n### Example 3: \"Multiplayer VR shooter\"\n→ `game-development/vr-ar` for comfort and immersion\n→ `game-development/3d-games` for rendering\n→ `game-development/multiplayer` for networking\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Great games come from iteration, not perfection. Prototype fast, then polish.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:37:58.027Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents focused on interactive entertainment, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, needing core game development principles and routing to specialized sub-skills.","zh":"非常适合专注于交互式娱乐的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code，需要核心游戏开发原则和路由到专门的子技能。","ja":"インタラクティブエンターテイメントに焦点を当てたAIエージェント（例：Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Code）に最適で、核心的なゲーム開発原則と専門のサブスキルへのルーティングが必要です。","ko":"대화형 엔터테인먼트에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트(Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code 등)에게 적합하며, 핵심 게임 개발 원칙과 전문 하위 스킬로의 라우팅이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA centrados en entretenimiento interactivo, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code, que necesitan principios básicos de desarrollo de juegos y enrutamiento a habilidades especializadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA axés sur le divertissement interactif, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, nécessitant des principes de base de développement de jeux et un routage vers des sous-compétences spécialisées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die auf interaktives Entertainment ausgerichtet sind, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die grundlegende Spiele-Entwicklungsprinzipien und Weiterleitung zu spezialisierten Teilkompetenzen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em entretenimento interativo, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, que necessitam de princípios básicos de desenvolvimento de jogos e roteamento para sub-habilidades especializadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на интерактивное развлечение, такие как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, которым необходимы основные принципы разработки игр и маршрутизация к специализированным поднавыкам.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تركز على الترفيه التفاعلي، مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code، والتي تحتاج إلى مبادئ أساسية لتطوير الألعاب وتوجيهها إلى مهارات فرعية متخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate game development projects by teaching core principles and directing them to sub-skills based on context, such as platform selection for web browsers using HTML5 and WebGL, and provides a foundation for further learning in specialized areas like web game development.","zh":"赋予代理在游戏开发项目中导航的能力，通过教授核心原则并根据上下文将其引导到子技能，例如为使用HTML5和WebGL的网页浏览器选择平台，并为网页游戏开发等专门领域提供进一步学习的基础。","ja":"ゲーム開発プロジェクトをナビゲートするエージェントの能力を提供し、コア原則を教え、コンテキストに基づいてサブスキルに導き、例えばHTML5とWebGLを使用するWebブラウザのプラットフォーム選択などを実行し、Webゲーム開発などの専門分野でさらに学ぶ基盤を提供します。","ko":"게임 개발 프로젝트에서 네비게이션하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 핵심 원칙을 가르치고, 컨텍스트에 따라 하위 스킬로 안내하며, 예를 들어 HTML5와 WebGL을 사용하는 웹 브라우저의 플랫폼 선택과 같은 작업을 수행하고, 웹 게임 개발과 같은 전문 분야에서 추가로 학습할 수 있는 기반을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a navegar por proyectos de desarrollo de juegos enseñando principios básicos y dirigiéndolos a sub-habilidades en función del contexto, como la selección de plataformas para navegadores web que utilizan HTML5 y WebGL, y proporciona una base para un aprendizaje adicional en áreas especializadas como el desarrollo de juegos web.","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans les projets de développement de jeux en enseignant les principes de base et en les dirigeant vers des sous-compétences en fonction du contexte, comme la sélection de plates-formes pour les navigateurs web utilisant HTML5 et WebGL, et fournit une base pour une formation complémentaire dans des domaines spécialisés tels que le développement de jeux web.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Spiele-Entwicklungsprojekte zu navigieren, indem sie grundlegende Prinzipien lehren und sie in Abhängigkeit vom Kontext zu Teilkompetenzen weiterleiten, wie z.B. die Auswahl von Plattformen für Webbrowser mit HTML5 und WebGL, und bietet eine Grundlage für weiteres Lernen in spezialisierten Bereichen wie der Entwicklung von Web-Spielen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar em projetos de desenvolvimento de jogos, ensinando princípios básicos e direcionando-os para sub-habilidades com base no contexto, como seleção de plataforma para navegadores da web usando HTML5 e WebGL, e fornece uma base para aprendizado adicional em áreas especializadas como desenvolvimento de jogos da web.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ориентироваться в проектах разработки игр, обучая основным принципам и направляя их к поднавыкам на основе контекста, таких как выбор платформы для веб-браузеров с использованием HTML5 и WebGL, и обеспечивает основу для дальнейшего обучения в специализированных областях, таких как разработка веб-игр.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من التنقل في مشاريع تطوير الألعاب من خلال تعليم المبادئ الأساسية وتوجيهها إلى مهارات فرعية بناءً على السياق، مثل اختيار المنصة لمتصفحات الويب باستخدام HTML5 و WebGL، ويوفر أساسًا للتعلم اللاحق في مجالات متخصصة مثل تطوير ألعاب الويب."},"useCases":{"en":["Routing to sub-skills for platform-specific game development","Applying core game development principles to new projects","Selecting appropriate technologies like HTML5 or WebGL for web-based games"],"zh":["平台特定游戏开发的子技能路由","将核心游戏开发原则应用于新项目","为基于Web的游戏选择合适的技术，如HTML5或WebGL"],"ja":["プラットフォーム特定のゲーム開発のサブスキルルーティング","新しいプロジェクトにコアゲーム開発原則を適用する","Webベースのゲーム用にHTML5またはWebGLなどの適切な技術を選択する"],"ko":["플랫폼별 게임 개발을 위한 하위 스킬 라우팅","新的 프로젝트에 핵심 게임 개발 원칙을 적용하는 것","웹 기반 게임을 위한 적절한 기술 선택, 예를 들어 HTML5 또는 WebGL"],"es":["Enrutamiento a sub-habilidades para el desarrollo de juegos específicos de plataforma","Aplicación de principios básicos de desarrollo de juegos a nuevos proyectos","Selección de tecnologías adecuadas como HTML5 o WebGL para juegos basados en web"],"fr":["Routage vers des sous-compétences pour le développement de jeux spécifiques à la plate-forme","Application des principes de base de développement de jeux à de nouveaux projets","Sélection de technologies appropriées comme HTML5 ou WebGL pour les jeux basés sur le web"],"de":["Weiterleitung zu Teilkompetenzen für plattform-spezifische Spiele-Entwicklung","Anwendung grundlegender Spiele-Entwicklungsprinzipien auf neue Projekte","Auswahl geeigneter Technologien wie HTML5 oder WebGL für web-basierte Spiele"],"pt":["Roteamento para sub-habilidades para desenvolvimento de jogos específicos de plataforma","Aplicação de princípios básicos de desenvolvimento de jogos em novos projetos","Seleção de tecnologias apropriadas como HTML5 ou WebGL para jogos baseados na web"],"ru":["Маршрутизация к поднавыкам для платформенно-специфичного разработки игр","Применение основных принципов разработки игр к новым проектам","Выбор подходящих технологий, таких как HTML5 или WebGL, для веб-игр"],"ar":["توجيه إلى مهارات فرعية لتطوير ألعاب محددة بالمنصة","تطبيق مبادئ أساسية لتطوير الألعاب على مشاريع جديدة","اختيار تقنيات مناسبة مثل HTML5 أو WebGL لألعاب الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of specific game development platforms or technologies","Context-dependent routing may require additional information about the project"],"zh":["需要特定游戏开发平台或技术的知识","上下文依赖的路由可能需要关于项目的额外信息"],"ja":["特定ゲーム開発プラットフォームまたは技術の知識が必要","コンテキスト依存のルーティングにはプロジェクトに関する追加情報が必要である"],"ko":["특정 게임 개발 플랫폼 또는 기술에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","컨텍스트 종속 라우팅은 프로젝트에 대한 추가 정보가 필요할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de plataformas o tecnologías de desarrollo de juegos específicas","El enrutamiento dependiente del contexto puede requerir información adicional sobre el proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances de plates-formes ou de technologies de développement de jeux spécifiques","Le routage dépendant du contexte peut nécessiter des informations supplémentaires sur le projet"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von bestimmten Spiele-Entwicklungsplattformen oder -technologien","Kontext-abhängige Weiterleitung kann zusätzliche Informationen über das Projekt erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de plataformas ou tecnologias de desenvolvimento de jogos específicas","Roteamento dependente de contexto pode exigir informações adicionais sobre o projeto"],"ru":["Требует знания конкретных платформ или технологий разработки игр","Контекстно-зависимая маршрутизация может требовать дополнительной информации о проекте"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة منصات أو تقنيات تطوير ألعاب محددة","التوجيه المعتمد على السياق قد يتطلب معلومات إضافية حول المشروع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Scrollico/scrolli-website-project/d3-viz', 'community', 'Scrollico', 'scrolli-website-project', 'Scrollico/scrolli-website-project', 'd3-viz', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z', '2026-02-18T11:38:39.184Z', NULL, '{"id":"Scrollico/scrolli-website-project/d3-viz","name":"d3-viz","description":{"zh":"D3.js 是一个用于创建交互式数据可视化的 JavaScript 库，提供了对 DOM 元素的精确控制","ja":"D3.js はインタラクティブなデータビジュアライゼーションを作成するための JavaScript ライブラリで、DOM 要素に対する精密な制御を提供","ko":"D3.js는 상호 작용형 데이터 시각화를 생성하기 위한 JavaScript 라이브러리로서 DOM 요소에 대한 정밀한 제어를 제공","es":"d3.js es una biblioteca JavaScript para crear visualizaciones de datos interactivas y personalizadas. Ofrece un control preciso sobre cada elemento visual.","fr":"d3.js est une bibliothèque JavaScript pour créer des visualisations de données interactives et personnalisées. Elle offre un contrôle précis sur chaque élément visuel.","de":"d3.js ist eine JavaScript-Bibliothek zur Erstellung interaktiver und benutzerdefinierter Datenvisualisierungen. Sie bietet eine präzise Kontrolle über jedes visuelle Element.","pt":"D3.js é uma biblioteca JavaScript para criar visualizações de dados interativas. Fornece controle preciso sobre elementos visuais para criar gráficos personalizados.","ru":"D3.js - это библиотека JavaScript для создания интерактивных данных визуализаций. Она обеспечивает точный контроль над визуальными элементами для создания пользовательских графиков.","ar":"D3.js هي مكتبة JavaScript لإنشاء تصورات بيانات تفاعلية. توفر التحكم الدقيق في العناصر المرئية لإنشاء الرسومات المخصصة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"D3.js 数据可视化","ja":"D3.js データビジュアライゼーション","ko":"D3.js 데이터 시각화","es":"Visualizaciones de datos con d3.js","fr":"Visualisations de données avec d3.js","de":"Datenvisualisierungen mit d3.js","pt":"D3.js: Crie Visualizações de Dados Interativas","ru":"D3.js: Создание интерактивных данных визуализаций","ar":"D3.js: إنشاء تصورات بيانات تفاعلية","en":"d3-viz"},"description":{"zh":"D3.js 是一个用于创建交互式数据可视化的 JavaScript 库，提供了对 DOM 元素的精确控制","ja":"D3.js はインタラクティブなデータビジュアライゼーションを作成するための JavaScript ライブラリで、DOM 要素に対する精密な制御を提供","ko":"D3.js는 상호 작용형 데이터 시각화를 생성하기 위한 JavaScript 라이브러리로서 DOM 요소에 대한 정밀한 제어를 제공","es":"d3.js es una biblioteca JavaScript para crear visualizaciones de datos interactivas y personalizadas. Ofrece un control preciso sobre cada elemento visual.","fr":"d3.js est une bibliothèque JavaScript pour créer des visualisations de données interactives et personnalisées. Elle offre un contrôle précis sur chaque éléme...","de":"d3.js ist eine JavaScript-Bibliothek zur Erstellung interaktiver und benutzerdefinierter Datenvisualisierungen. Sie bietet eine präzise Kontrolle über jedes ...","pt":"D3.js é uma biblioteca JavaScript para criar visualizações de dados interativas. Fornece controle preciso sobre elementos visuais para criar gráficos persona...","ru":"D3.js - это библиотека JavaScript для создания интерактивных данных визуализаций. Она обеспечивает точный контроль над визуальными элементами для создания по...","ar":"D3.js هي مكتبة JavaScript لإنشاء تصورات بيانات تفاعلية. توفر التحكم الدقيق في العناصر المرئية لإنشاء الرسومات المخصصة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["交互式数据可视化","自定义和精确控制","支持多种 JavaScript 环境","包括 React、Vue、Svelte 等框架"],"ja":["インタラクティブなデータビジュアライゼーション","カスタマイズと精密な制御","多種の JavaScript 環境をサポート","React、Vue、Svelte などのフレームワークを含む"],"ko":["상호 작용형 데이터 시각화","사용자 정의 및 정밀한 제어","다양한 JavaScript 환경 지원","React, Vue, Svelte 등 프레임워크 포함"],"es":["Creación de visualizaciones de datos interactivas","Control preciso sobre cada elemento visual","Compatibilidad con cualquier entorno JavaScript","Personalización de visualizaciones de datos","Compatibilidad con frameworks como React, Vue y Svelte"],"fr":["Création de visualisations de données interactives","Contrôle précis sur chaque élément visuel","Compatibilité avec n''importe quel environnement JavaScript","Personnalisation des visualisations de données","Compatibilité avec des frameworks tels que React, Vue et Svelte"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver Datenvisualisierungen","Präzise Kontrolle über jedes visuelle Element","Kompatibilität mit jedem JavaScript-Umgebung","Anpassung von Datenvisualisierungen","Kompatibilität mit Frameworks wie React, Vue und Svelte"],"pt":["Criação de visualizações de dados personalizadas","Controle preciso sobre elementos visuais","Compatibilidade com várias bibliotecas JavaScript","Suporte a gráficos interativos de alta qualidade","Flexibilidade para criar gráficos em diferentes ambientes"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских данных визуализаций","Точный контроль над визуальными элементами","Совместимость с различными библиотеками JavaScript","Поддержка интерактивных графиков высокого качества","Гибкость для создания графиков в разных средах"],"ar":["إنشاء تصورات بيانات مخصصة","التحكم الدقيق في العناصر المرئية","التوافق مع مكتبات JavaScript المختلفة","دعم الرسومات التفاعلية عالية الجودة","المرونة لإنشاء الرسومات في بيئات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["D3.js","数据可视化","JavaScript 库","交互式可视化","自定义可视化","数据驱动文档"],"ja":["D3.js","データビジュアライゼーション","JavaScript ライブラリ","インタラクティブなビジュアライゼーション","カスタマイズビジュアライゼーション","データ駆動ドキュメント"],"ko":["D3.js","데이터 시각화","JavaScript 라이브러리","상호 작용형 시각화","사용자 정의 시각화","데이터 주도 문서"],"es":["d3.js","visualización de datos","JavaScript","visualizaciones interactivas","datos","bibliotecas JavaScript","desarrollo web","visualización de datos en línea"],"fr":["d3.js","visualisation de données","JavaScript","visualisations interactives","données","bibliothèques JavaScript","développement web","visualisation de données en ligne"],"de":["d3.js","Datenvisualisierung","JavaScript","interaktive Visualisierungen","Daten","JavaScript-Bibliotheken","Webentwicklung","Online-Datenvisualisierung"],"pt":["D3.js","visualização de dados","gráficos interativos","biblioteca JavaScript","criação de gráficos","controle preciso","alta qualidade"],"ru":["D3.js","данные визуализация","интерактивные графики","библиотека JavaScript","создание графиков","точный контроль","высокое качество"],"ar":["D3.js","تصور بيانات","رسومات تفاعلية","مكتبة JavaScript","إنشاء رسومات","التحكم الدقيق","جودة عالية"]}},"owner":"Scrollico","repo":"scrolli-website-project","repoPath":"Scrollico/scrolli-website-project","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"d3-viz","description":"Creating interactive data visualisations using d3.js. This skill should be used when creating custom charts, graphs, network diagrams, geographic visualisations, or any complex SVG-based data visualisation that requires fine-grained control over visual elements, transitions, or interactions. Use this for bespoke visualisations beyond standard charting libraries, whether in React, Vue, Svelte, vanilla JavaScript, or any other environment.","bodyPreview":"# D3.js Visualisation\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating sophisticated, interactive data visualisations using d3.js. D3.js (Data-Driven Documents) excels at binding data to DOM elements and applying data-driven transformations to create custom, publication-quality visualisations with precise control over every visual element. The techniques work across any JavaScript environment, including vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte, and other frameworks.\n\n## When to use d3.js\n\n*","body":"# D3.js Visualisation\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating sophisticated, interactive data visualisations using d3.js. D3.js (Data-Driven Documents) excels at binding data to DOM elements and applying data-driven transformations to create custom, publication-quality visualisations with precise control over every visual element. The techniques work across any JavaScript environment, including vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte, and other frameworks.\n\n## When to use d3.js\n\n**Use d3.js for:**\n- Custom visualisations requiring unique visual encodings or layouts\n- Interactive explorations with complex pan, zoom, or brush behaviours\n- Network/graph visualisations (force-directed layouts, tree diagrams, hierarchies, chord diagrams)\n- Geographic visualisations with custom projections\n- Visualisations requiring smooth, choreographed transitions\n- Publication-quality graphics with fine-grained styling control\n- Novel chart types not available in standard libraries\n\n**Consider alternatives for:**\n- 3D visualisations - use Three.js instead\n\n## Core workflow\n\n### 1. Set up d3.js\n\nImport d3 at the top of your script:\n\n```javascript\nimport * as d3 from ''d3'';\n```\n\nOr use the CDN version (7.x):\n\n```html\n<script src=\"https://d3js.org/d3.v7.min.js\"></script>\n```\n\nAll modules (scales, axes, shapes, transitions, etc.) are accessible through the `d3` namespace.\n\n### 2. Choose the integration pattern\n\n**Pattern A: Direct DOM manipulation (recommended for most cases)**\nUse d3 to select DOM elements and manipulate them imperatively. This works in any JavaScript environment:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawChart(data) {\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart''); // Select by ID, class, or DOM element\n\n  // Clear previous content\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  // Set up dimensions\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 400;\n  const margin = { top: 20, right: 30, bottom: 40, left: 50 };\n\n  // Create scales, axes, and draw visualisation\n  // ... d3 code here ...\n}\n\n// Call when data changes\ndrawChart(myData);\n```\n\n**Pattern B: Declarative rendering (for frameworks with templating)**\nUse d3 for data calculations (scales, layouts) but render elements via your framework:\n\n```javascript\nfunction getChartElements(data) {\n  const xScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.value)])\n    .range([0, 400]);\n\n  return data.map((d, i) => ({\n    x: 50,\n    y: i * 30,\n    width: xScale(d.value),\n    height: 25\n  }));\n}\n\n// In React: {getChartElements(data).map((d, i) => <rect key={i} {...d} fill=\"steelblue\" />)}\n// In Vue: v-for directive over the returned array\n// In vanilla JS: Create elements manually from the returned data\n```\n\nUse Pattern A for complex visualisations with transitions, interactions, or when leveraging d3''s full capabilities. Use Pattern B for simpler visualisations or when your framework prefers declarative rendering.\n\n### 3. Structure the visualisation code\n\nFollow this standard structure in your drawing function:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawVisualization(data) {\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart''); // Or pass a selector/element\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove(); // Clear previous render\n\n  // 1. Define dimensions\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 400;\n  const margin = { top: 20, right: 30, bottom: 40, left: 50 };\n  const innerWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;\n  const innerHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;\n\n  // 2. Create main group with margins\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`);\n\n  // 3. Create scales\n  const xScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.x)])\n    .range([0, innerWidth]);\n\n  const yScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.y)])\n    .range([innerHeight, 0]); // Note: inverted for SVG coordinates\n\n  // 4. Create and append axes\n  const xAxis = d3.axisBottom(xScale);\n  const yAxis = d3.axisLeft(yScale);\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(0,${innerHeight})`)\n    .call(xAxis);\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .call(yAxis);\n\n  // 5. Bind data and create visual elements\n  g.selectAll(\"circle\")\n    .data(data)\n    .join(\"circle\")\n    .attr(\"cx\", d => xScale(d.x))\n    .attr(\"cy\", d => yScale(d.y))\n    .attr(\"r\", 5)\n    .attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\");\n}\n\n// Call when data changes\ndrawVisualization(myData);\n```\n\n### 4. Implement responsive sizing\n\nMake visualisations responsive to container size:\n\n```javascript\nfunction setupResponsiveChart(containerId, data) {\n  const container = document.getElementById(containerId);\n  const svg = d3.select(`#${containerId}`).append(''svg'');\n\n  function updateChart() {\n    const { width, height } = container.getBoundingClientRect();\n    svg.attr(''width'', width).attr(''height'', height);\n\n    // Redraw visualisation with new dimensions\n    drawChart(data, svg, width, height);\n  }\n\n  // Update on initial load\n  updateChart();\n\n  // Update on window resize\n  window.addEventListener(''resize'', updateChart);\n\n  // Return cleanup function\n  return () => window.removeEventListener(''resize'', updateChart);\n}\n\n// Usage:\n// const cleanup = setupResponsiveChart(''chart-container'', myData);\n// cleanup(); // Call when component unmounts or element removed\n```\n\nOr use ResizeObserver for more direct container monitoring:\n\n```javascript\nfunction setupResponsiveChartWithObserver(svgElement, data) {\n  const observer = new ResizeObserver(() => {\n    const { width, height } = svgElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n    d3.select(svgElement)\n      .attr(''width'', width)\n      .attr(''height'', height);\n\n    // Redraw visualisation\n    drawChart(data, d3.select(svgElement), width, height);\n  });\n\n  observer.observe(svgElement.parentElement);\n  return () => observer.disconnect();\n}\n```\n\n## Common visualisation patterns\n\n### Bar chart\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawBarChart(data, svgElement) {\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(svgElement);\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 400;\n  const margin = { top: 20, right: 30, bottom: 40, left: 50 };\n  const innerWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;\n  const innerHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;\n\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`);\n\n  const xScale = d3.scaleBand()\n    .domain(data.map(d => d.category))\n    .range([0, innerWidth])\n    .padding(0.1);\n\n  const yScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.value)])\n    .range([innerHeight, 0]);\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(0,${innerHeight})`)\n    .call(d3.axisBottom(xScale));\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .call(d3.axisLeft(yScale));\n\n  g.selectAll(\"rect\")\n    .data(data)\n    .join(\"rect\")\n    .attr(\"x\", d => xScale(d.category))\n    .attr(\"y\", d => yScale(d.value))\n    .attr(\"width\", xScale.bandwidth())\n    .attr(\"height\", d => innerHeight - yScale(d.value))\n    .attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\");\n}\n\n// Usage:\n// drawBarChart(myData, document.getElementById(''chart''));\n```\n\n### Line chart\n\n```javascript\nconst line = d3.line()\n  .x(d => xScale(d.date))\n  .y(d => yScale(d.value))\n  .curve(d3.curveMonotoneX); // Smooth curve\n\ng.append(\"path\")\n  .datum(data)\n  .attr(\"fill\", \"none\")\n  .attr(\"stroke\", \"steelblue\")\n  .attr(\"stroke-width\", 2)\n  .attr(\"d\", line);\n```\n\n### Scatter plot\n\n```javascript\ng.selectAll(\"circle\")\n  .data(data)\n  .join(\"circle\")\n  .attr(\"cx\", d => xScale(d.x))\n  .attr(\"cy\", d => yScale(d.y))\n  .attr(\"r\", d => sizeScale(d.size)) // Optional: size encoding\n  .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(d.category)) // Optional: colour encoding\n  .attr(\"opacity\", 0.7);\n```\n\n### Chord diagram\n\nA chord diagram shows relationships between entities in a circular layout, with ribbons representing flows between them:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawChordDiagram(data) {\n  // data format: array of objects with source, target, and value\n  // Example: [{ source: ''A'', target: ''B'', value: 10 }, ...]\n\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart'');\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  const width = 600;\n  const height = 600;\n  const innerRadius = Math.min(width, height) * 0.3;\n  const outerRadius = innerRadius + 30;\n\n  // Create matrix from data\n  const nodes = Array.from(new Set(data.flatMap(d => [d.source, d.target])));\n  const matrix = Array.from({ length: nodes.length }, () => Array(nodes.length).fill(0));\n\n  data.forEach(d => {\n    const i = nodes.indexOf(d.source);\n    const j = nodes.indexOf(d.target);\n    matrix[i][j] += d.value;\n    matrix[j][i] += d.value;\n  });\n\n  // Create chord layout\n  const chord = d3.chord()\n    .padAngle(0.05)\n    .sortSubgroups(d3.descending);\n\n  const arc = d3.arc()\n    .innerRadius(innerRadius)\n    .outerRadius(outerRadius);\n\n  const ribbon = d3.ribbon()\n    .source(d => d.source)\n    .target(d => d.target);\n\n  const colourScale = d3.scaleOrdinal(d3.schemeCategory10)\n    .domain(nodes);\n\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${width / 2},${height / 2})`);\n\n  const chords = chord(matrix);\n\n  // Draw ribbons\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"fill-opacity\", 0.67)\n    .selectAll(\"path\")\n    .data(chords)\n    .join(\"path\")\n    .attr(\"d\", ribbon)\n    .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(nodes[d.source.index]))\n    .attr(\"stroke\", d => d3.rgb(colourScale(nodes[d.source.index])).darker());\n\n  // Draw groups (arcs)\n  const group = g.append(\"g\")\n    .selectAll(\"g\")\n    .data(chords.groups)\n    .join(\"g\");\n\n  group.append(\"path\")\n    .attr(\"d\", arc)\n    .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(nodes[d.index]))\n    .attr(\"stroke\", d => d3.rgb(colourScale(nodes[d.index])).darker());\n\n  // Add labels\n  group.append(\"text\")\n    .each(d => { d.angle = (d.startAngle + d.endAngle) / 2; })\n    .attr(\"dy\", \"0.31em\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", d => `rotate(${(d.angle * 180 / Math.PI) - 90})translate(${outerRadius + 30})${d.angle > Math.PI ? \"rotate(180)\" : \"\"}`)\n    .attr(\"text-anchor\", d => d.angle > Math.PI ? \"end\" : null)\n    .text((d, i) => nodes[i])\n    .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n}\n```\n\n### Heatmap\n\nA heatmap uses colour to encode values in a two-dimensional grid, useful for showing patterns across categories:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawHeatmap(data) {\n  // data format: array of objects with row, column, and value\n  // Example: [{ row: ''A'', column: ''X'', value: 10 }, ...]\n\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart'');\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 600;\n  const margin = { top: 100, right: 30, bottom: 30, left: 100 };\n  const innerWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;\n  const innerHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;\n\n  // Get unique rows and columns\n  const rows = Array.from(new Set(data.map(d => d.row)));\n  const columns = Array.from(new Set(data.map(d => d.column)));\n\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`);\n\n  // Create scales\n  const xScale = d3.scaleBand()\n    .domain(columns)\n    .range([0, innerWidth])\n    .padding(0.01);\n\n  const yScale = d3.scaleBand()\n    .domain(rows)\n    .range([0, innerHeight])\n    .padding(0.01);\n\n  // Colour scale for values\n  const colourScale = d3.scaleSequential(d3.interpolateYlOrRd)\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.value)]);\n\n  // Draw rectangles\n  g.selectAll(\"rect\")\n    .data(data)\n    .join(\"rect\")\n    .attr(\"x\", d => xScale(d.column))\n    .attr(\"y\", d => yScale(d.row))\n    .attr(\"width\", xScale.bandwidth())\n    .attr(\"height\", yScale.bandwidth())\n    .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(d.value));\n\n  // Add x-axis labels\n  svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`)\n    .selectAll(\"text\")\n    .data(columns)\n    .join(\"text\")\n    .attr(\"x\", d => xScale(d) + xScale.bandwidth() / 2)\n    .attr(\"y\", -10)\n    .attr(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\")\n    .text(d => d)\n    .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n\n  // Add y-axis labels\n  svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`)\n    .selectAll(\"text\")\n    .data(rows)\n    .join(\"text\")\n    .attr(\"x\", -10)\n    .attr(\"y\", d => yScale(d) + yScale.bandwidth() / 2)\n    .attr(\"dy\", \"0.35em\")\n    .attr(\"text-anchor\", \"end\")\n    .text(d => d)\n    .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n\n  // Add colour legend\n  const legendWidth = 20;\n  const legendHeight = 200;\n  const legend = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${width - 60},${margin.top})`);\n\n  const legendScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain(colourScale.domain())\n    .range([legendHeight, 0]);\n\n  const legendAxis = d3.axisRight(legendScale)\n    .ticks(5);\n\n  // Draw colour gradient in legend\n  for (let i = 0; i < legendHeight; i++) {\n    legend.append(\"rect\")\n      .attr(\"y\", i)\n      .attr(\"width\", legendWidth)\n      .attr(\"height\", 1)\n      .attr(\"fill\", colourScale(legendScale.invert(i)));\n  }\n\n  legend.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${legendWidth},0)`)\n    .call(legendAxis);\n}\n```\n\n### Pie chart\n\n```javascript\nconst pie = d3.pie()\n  .value(d => d.value)\n  .sort(null);\n\nconst arc = d3.arc()\n  .innerRadius(0)\n  .outerRadius(Math.min(width, height) / 2 - 20);\n\nconst colourScale = d3.scaleOrdinal(d3.schemeCategory10);\n\nconst g = svg.append(\"g\")\n  .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${width / 2},${height / 2})`);\n\ng.selectAll(\"path\")\n  .data(pie(data))\n  .join(\"path\")\n  .attr(\"d\", arc)\n  .attr(\"fill\", (d, i) => colourScale(i))\n  .attr(\"stroke\", \"white\")\n  .attr(\"stroke-width\", 2);\n```\n\n### Force-directed network\n\n```javascript\nconst simulation = d3.forceSimulation(nodes)\n  .force(\"link\", d3.forceLink(links).id(d => d.id).distance(100))\n  .force(\"charge\", d3.forceManyBody().strength(-300))\n  .force(\"center\", d3.forceCenter(width / 2, height / 2));\n\nconst link = g.selectAll(\"line\")\n  .data(links)\n  .join(\"line\")\n  .attr(\"stroke\", \"#999\")\n  .attr(\"stroke-width\", 1);\n\nconst node = g.selectAll(\"circle\")\n  .data(nodes)\n  .join(\"circle\")\n  .attr(\"r\", 8)\n  .attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\")\n  .call(d3.drag()\n    .on(\"start\", dragstarted)\n    .on(\"drag\", dragged)\n    .on(\"end\", dragended));\n\nsimulation.on(\"tick\", () => {\n  link\n    .attr(\"x1\", d => d.source.x)\n    .attr(\"y1\", d => d.source.y)\n    .attr(\"x2\", d => d.target.x)\n    .attr(\"y2\", d => d.target.y);\n  \n  node\n    .attr(\"cx\", d => d.x)\n    .attr(\"cy\", d => d.y);\n});\n\nfunction dragstarted(event) {\n  if (!event.active) simulation.alphaTarget(0.3).restart();\n  event.subject.fx = event.subject.x;\n  event.subject.fy = event.subject.y;\n}\n\nfunction dragged(event) {\n  event.subject.fx = event.x;\n  event.subject.fy = event.y;\n}\n\nfunction dragended(event) {\n  if (!event.active) simulation.alphaTarget(0);\n  event.subject.fx = null;\n  event.subject.fy = null;\n}\n```\n\n## Adding interactivity\n\n### Tooltips\n\n```javascript\n// Create tooltip div (outside SVG)\nconst tooltip = d3.select(\"body\").append(\"div\")\n  .attr(\"class\", \"tooltip\")\n  .style(\"position\", \"absolute\")\n  .style(\"visibility\", \"hidden\")\n  .style(\"background-color\", \"white\")\n  .style(\"border\", \"1px solid #ddd\")\n  .style(\"padding\", \"10px\")\n  .style(\"border-radius\", \"4px\")\n  .style(\"pointer-events\", \"none\");\n\n// Add to elements\ncircles\n  .on(\"mouseover\", function(event, d) {\n    d3.select(this).attr(\"opacity\", 1);\n    tooltip\n      .style(\"visibility\", \"visible\")\n      .html(`<strong>${d.label}</strong><br/>Value: ${d.value}`);\n  })\n  .on(\"mousemove\", function(event) {\n    tooltip\n      .style(\"top\", (event.pageY - 10) + \"px\")\n      .style(\"left\", (event.pageX + 10) + \"px\");\n  })\n  .on(\"mouseout\", function() {\n    d3.select(this).attr(\"opacity\", 0.7);\n    tooltip.style(\"visibility\", \"hidden\");\n  });\n```\n\n### Zoom and pan\n\n```javascript\nconst zoom = d3.zoom()\n  .scaleExtent([0.5, 10])\n  .on(\"zoom\", (event) => {\n    g.attr(\"transform\", event.transform);\n  });\n\nsvg.call(zoom);\n```\n\n### Click interactions\n\n```javascript\ncircles\n  .on(\"click\", function(event, d) {\n    // Handle click (dispatch event, update app state, etc.)\n    console.log(\"Clicked:\", d);\n\n    // Visual feedback\n    d3.selectAll(\"circle\").attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\");\n    d3.select(this).attr(\"fill\", \"orange\");\n\n    // Optional: dispatch custom event for your framework/app to listen to\n    // window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent(''chartClick'', { detail: d }));\n  });\n```\n\n## Transitions and animations\n\nAdd smooth transitions to visual changes:\n\n```javascript\n// Basic transition\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .duration(750)\n  .attr(\"r\", 10);\n\n// Chained transitions\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .duration(500)\n  .attr(\"fill\", \"orange\")\n  .transition()\n  .duration(500)\n  .attr(\"r\", 15);\n\n// Staggered transitions\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .delay((d, i) => i * 50)\n  .duration(500)\n  .attr(\"cy\", d => yScale(d.value));\n\n// Custom easing\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .duration(1000)\n  .ease(d3.easeBounceOut)\n  .attr(\"r\", 10);\n```\n\n## Scales reference\n\n### Quantitative scales\n\n```javascript\n// Linear scale\nconst xScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n  .domain([0, 100])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n\n// Log scale (for exponential data)\nconst logScale = d3.scaleLog()\n  .domain([1, 1000])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n\n// Power scale\nconst powScale = d3.scalePow()\n  .exponent(2)\n  .domain([0, 100])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n\n// Time scale\nconst timeScale = d3.scaleTime()\n  .domain([new Date(2020, 0, 1), new Date(2024, 0, 1)])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n```\n\n### Ordinal scales\n\n```javascript\n// Band scale (for bar charts)\nconst bandScale = d3.scaleBand()\n  .domain([''A'', ''B'', ''C'', ''D''])\n  .range([0, 400])\n  .padding(0.1);\n\n// Point scale (for line/scatter categories)\nconst pointScale = d3.scalePoint()\n  .domain([''A'', ''B'', ''C'', ''D''])\n  .range([0, 400]);\n\n// Ordinal scale (for colours)\nconst colourScale = d3.scaleOrdinal(d3.schemeCategory10);\n```\n\n### Sequential scales\n\n```javascript\n// Sequential colour scale\nconst colourScale = d3.scaleSequential(d3.interpolateBlues)\n  .domain([0, 100]);\n\n// Diverging colour scale\nconst divScale = d3.scaleDiverging(d3.interpolateRdBu)\n  .domain([-10, 0, 10]);\n```\n\n## Best practices\n\n### Data preparation\n\nAlways validate and prepare data before visualisation:\n\n```javascript\n// Filter invalid values\nconst cleanData = data.filter(d => d.value != null && !isNaN(d.value));\n\n// Sort data if order matters\nconst sortedData = [...data].sort((a, b) => b.value - a.value);\n\n// Parse dates\nconst parsedData = data.map(d => ({\n  ...d,\n  date: d3.timeParse(\"%Y-%m-%d\")(d.date)\n}));\n```\n\n### Performance optimisation\n\nFor large datasets (>1000 elements):\n\n```javascript\n// Use canvas instead of SVG for many elements\n// Use quadtree for collision detection\n// Simplify paths with d3.line().curve(d3.curveStep)\n// Implement virtual scrolling for large lists\n// Use requestAnimationFrame for custom animations\n```\n\n### Accessibility\n\nMake visualisations accessible:\n\n```javascript\n// Add ARIA labels\nsvg.attr(\"role\", \"img\")\n   .attr(\"aria-label\", \"Bar chart showing quarterly revenue\");\n\n// Add title and description\nsvg.append(\"title\").text(\"Quarterly Revenue 2024\");\nsvg.append(\"desc\").text(\"Bar chart showing revenue growth across four quarters\");\n\n// Ensure sufficient colour contrast\n// Provide keyboard navigation for interactive elements\n// Include data table alternative\n```\n\n### Styling\n\nUse consistent, professional styling:\n\n```javascript\n// Define colour palettes upfront\nconst colours = {\n  primary: ''#4A90E2'',\n  secondary: ''#7B68EE'',\n  background: ''#F5F7FA'',\n  text: ''#333333'',\n  gridLines: ''#E0E0E0''\n};\n\n// Apply consistent typography\nsvg.selectAll(\"text\")\n  .style(\"font-family\", \"Inter, sans-serif\")\n  .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n\n// Use subtle grid lines\ng.selectAll(\".tick line\")\n  .attr(\"stroke\", colours.gridLines)\n  .attr(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"2,2\");\n```\n\n## Common issues and solutions\n\n**Issue**: Axes not appearing\n- Ensure scales have valid domains (check for NaN values)\n- Verify axis is appended to correct group\n- Check transform translations are correct\n\n**Issue**: Transitions not working\n- Call `.transition()` before attribute changes\n- Ensure elements have unique keys for proper data binding\n- Check that useEffect dependencies include all changing data\n\n**Issue**: Responsive sizing not working\n- Use ResizeObserver or window resize listener\n- Update dimensions in state to trigger re-render\n- Ensure SVG has width/height attributes or viewBox\n\n**Issue**: Performance problems\n- Limit number of DOM elements (consider canvas for >1000 items)\n- Debounce resize handlers\n- Use `.join()` instead of separate enter/update/exit selections\n- Avoid unnecessary re-renders by checking dependencies\n\n## Resources\n\n### references/\nContains detailed reference materials:\n- `d3-patterns.md` - Comprehensive collection of visualisation patterns and code examples\n- `scale-reference.md` - Complete guide to d3 scales with examples\n- `colour-schemes.md` - D3 colour schemes and palette recommendations\n\n### assets/\n\nContains boilerplate templates:\n\n- `chart-template.js` - Starter template for basic chart\n- `interactive-template.js` - Template with tooltips, zoom, and interactions\n- `sample-data.json` - Example datasets for testing\n\nThese templates work with vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte, or any other JavaScript environment. Adapt them as needed for your specific framework.\n\nTo use these resources, read the relevant files when detailed guidance is needed for specific visualisation types or patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:38:39.184Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced interactive data visualization capabilities with d3.js","zh":"非常适合需要使用d3.js进行高级交互式数据可视化的前端代理","ja":"d3.jsを使用した高度なインタラクティブなデータ可視化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"d3.js를 사용한 고급 인터랙티브 데이터 시각화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de visualización de datos interactivos con d3.js","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées de visualisation de données interactives avec d3.js","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte interaktive Datenvisualisierungsfunktionen mit d3.js benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de dados interativos com d3.js","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности интерактивной визуализации данных с помощью d3.js","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة في تجسير بيانات التفاعل مع d3.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create custom, publication-quality visualisations with precise control over every visual element using Data-Driven Documents, binding data to DOM elements and applying data-driven transformations across JavaScript environments, including vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, and Svelte","zh":"赋予代理创建自定义、出版质量的可视化，并使用数据驱动文档以精确控制每个视觉元素，将数据绑定到DOM元素，并在包括原生JavaScript、React、Vue和Svelte在内的JavaScript环境中应用数据驱动的变换","ja":"エージェントに、カスタムの出版品質の視覚化を作成し、データ駆動ドキュメントを使用して各視覚要素を正確に制御し、データをDOM要素にバインドし、バニラJavaScript、React、Vue、Svelteを含むJavaScript環境全体でデータ駆動型の変換を適用する力を与える","ko":"에이전트가 커스텀 출판 품질의 시각화를 만들고 데이터 구동 문서를 사용하여 모든 시각적 요소를 정확하게 제어하며 데이터를 DOM 요소에 바인딩하고 바닐라 자바스크립트, 리액트, 뷰, 스벨트를 포함한 자바스크립트 환경 전반에서 데이터 구동 변환을 적용할 수 있는力を 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear visualizaciones personalizadas de calidad de publicación con un control preciso sobre cada elemento visual utilizando Documentos impulsados por datos, vinculando datos a elementos DOM y aplicando transformaciones impulsadas por datos en entornos de JavaScript, incluyendo JavaScript vanilla, React, Vue y Svelte","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des visualisations personnalisées de qualité d''édition avec un contrôle précis sur chaque élément visuel en utilisant des documents pilotés par des données, en liant des données à des éléments DOM et en appliquant des transformations pilotées par des données dans des environnements JavaScript, notamment JavaScript vanille, React, Vue et Svelte","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Visualisierungen in Veröffentlichungsqualität mit präziser Kontrolle über jedes visuelle Element zu erstellen, indem sie Daten-Getriebene Dokumente verwenden, Daten an DOM-Elemente binden und datengetriebene Transformationen in JavaScript-Umgebungen anwenden, einschließlich Vanilla-JavaScript, React, Vue und Svelte","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar visualizações personalizadas de qualidade de publicação com controle preciso sobre todos os elementos visuais usando Documentos Dirigidos por Dados, vinculando dados a elementos DOM e aplicando transformações dirigidas por dados em ambientes JavaScript, incluindo JavaScript vanilla, React, Vue e Svelte","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать индивидуальные визуализации высокого качества с точным контролем над каждым визуальным элементом, используя Документы, управляемые данными, привязывая данные к элементам DOM и применяя трансформации, управляемые данными, во всех средах JavaScript, включая ванильный JavaScript, React, Vue и Svelte","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء تصورات مخصصة من نوعية المنشورات مع سيطرة دقيقة على كل عنصر مرئي باستخدام وثائق مدفوعة بالبيانات ، وربط البيانات بالعناصر DOM وتطبيق تحويلات مدفوعة بالبيانات عبر بيئات جافا سكريبت ، بما في ذلك جافا سكريبت فانيليا ورياكت وفيو وسفلت"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating interactive bar charts for dashboard analytics","Creating custom, responsive scatter plots for data exploration","Visualizing complex data relationships with force-directed layouts"],"zh":["为仪表盘分析生成交互式条形图","创建自定义、响应式散点图以进行数据探索","使用力导向布局可视化复杂数据关系"],"ja":["ダッシュボード分析のためのインタラクティブなバー図の生成","データの探索のためのカスタム、レスポンシブな散布図の作成","力導向レイアウトを使用した複雑なデータ関係の視覚化"],"ko":["대시보드 분석을 위한 인터랙티브 바 차트 생성","데이터 탐색을 위한 커스텀 반응형 산점도 생성","강제 방향 레이아웃을 사용한 복잡한 데이터 관계 시각화"],"es":["Generar gráficos de barras interactivos para análisis de paneles de control","Crear tramas de dispersión personalizadas y responsivas para la exploración de datos","Visualizar relaciones de datos complejas con diseños dirigidos por fuerza"],"fr":["Générer des graphiques à barres interactifs pour l''analyse des tableaux de bord","Créer des trames de dispersion personnalisées et responsives pour l''exploration de données","Visualiser des relations de données complexes avec des mises en page dirigées par force"],"de":["Interaktive Balken diagrams für Dashboard-Analytics generieren","Benutzerdefinierte, responsive Streudiagramme für die Datenexploration erstellen","Komplexe Datenbeziehungen mit kraftgesteuerten Layouts visualisieren"],"pt":["Gerar gráficos de barras interativos para análise de painel","Criar gráficos de dispersão personalizados e responsivos para exploração de dados","Visualizar relacionamentos de dados complexos com layouts orientados por força"],"ru":["Генерировать интерактивные гистограммы для аналитики панели","Создавать индивидуальные, адаптивные диаграммы рассеяния для исследования данных","Визуализировать сложные отношения данных с помощью компоновок, управляемых силой"],"ar":["إنتاج مخططات شريطية تفاعلية لتحليل لوحة القيادة","إنشاء مخططات التبعية المخصصة والمتجاوبة لاستكشاف البيانات","تجسير العلاقات المعقدة للبيانات باستخدام تخطيطات موجهة بالقوة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JavaScript environment","Limited to d3.js library and its compatible frameworks"],"zh":["需要JavaScript环境","仅限于d3.js库及其兼容框架"],"ja":["JavaScript環境が必要","d3.jsライブラリ及其の互換フレームワークに限定"],"ko":["자바스크립트 환경이 필요","