erShell 脚本","开发者工具"],"ja":["PowerShell Windows","演算子シンタックス","Unicode 制限","論理演算子","スクリプト最適化","Windows スクリプト","PowerShell スクリプト","開発者ツール"],"ko":["PowerShell Windows","연산자 구문","Unicode 제한","논리 연산자","스크립트 최적화","Windows 스크립트","PowerShell 스크립트","개발자 도구"],"es":["PowerShell","Windows","patrones críticos","sintaxis de operadores","paréntesis","Unicode","emoji","automatización","productividad"],"fr":["PowerShell","Windows","modèles critiques","syntaxe des opérateurs","parenthèses","Unicode","emoji","automatisation","productivité"],"de":["PowerShell","Windows","kritische Muster","Operator-Syntax","Klammern","Unicode","Emoji","Automatisierung","Produktivität"],"pt":["PowerShell no Windows","Padrões do PowerShell","Desenvolvimento de software","Cmdlets","Sintaxe do PowerShell","Erros comuns do PowerShell"],"ru":["PowerShell для Windows","Шаблоны PowerShell","Разработка программного обеспечения","Cmdlets","Синтаксис PowerShell","Общие ошибки PowerShell"],"ar":["باور شيل على ويندوز","أنماط باور شيل","تطوير البرمجيات","cmdlets","صياغة باور شيل","أخطاء شائعة في باور شيل"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"powershell-windows","description":"PowerShell Windows patterns. Critical pitfalls, operator syntax, error handling.","bodyPreview":"# PowerShell Windows Patterns\n\n> Critical patterns and pitfalls for Windows PowerShell.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Operator Syntax Rules\n\n### CRITICAL: Parentheses Required\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `if (Test-Path \"a\" -or Test-Path \"b\")` | `if ((Test-Path \"a\") -or (Test-Path \"b\"))` |\n| `if (Get-Item $x -and $y -eq 5)` | `if ((Get-Item $x) -and ($y -eq 5))` |\n\n**Rule:** Each cmdlet call MUST be in parentheses when using logical operators.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Unicode/Emoji Restriction\n\n### CRIT","body":"# PowerShell Windows Patterns\n\n> Critical patterns and pitfalls for Windows PowerShell.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Operator Syntax Rules\n\n### CRITICAL: Parentheses Required\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `if (Test-Path \"a\" -or Test-Path \"b\")` | `if ((Test-Path \"a\") -or (Test-Path \"b\"))` |\n| `if (Get-Item $x -and $y -eq 5)` | `if ((Get-Item $x) -and ($y -eq 5))` |\n\n**Rule:** Each cmdlet call MUST be in parentheses when using logical operators.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Unicode/Emoji Restriction\n\n### CRITICAL: No Unicode in Scripts\n\n| Purpose | ❌ Don''t Use | ✅ Use |\n|---------|-------------|--------|\n| Success | ✅ ✓ | [OK] [+] |\n| Error | ❌ ✗ 🔴 | [!] [X] |\n| Warning | ⚠️ 🟡 | [*] [WARN] |\n| Info | ℹ️ 🔵 | [i] [INFO] |\n| Progress | ⏳ | [...] |\n\n**Rule:** Use ASCII characters only in PowerShell scripts.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Null Check Patterns\n\n### Always Check Before Access\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `$array.Count -gt 0` | `$array -and $array.Count -gt 0` |\n| `$text.Length` | `if ($text) { $text.Length }` |\n\n---\n\n## 4. String Interpolation\n\n### Complex Expressions\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `\"Value: $($obj.prop.sub)\"` | Store in variable first |\n\n**Pattern:**\n```\n$value = $obj.prop.sub\nWrite-Output \"Value: $value\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Error Handling\n\n### ErrorActionPreference\n\n| Value | Use |\n|-------|-----|\n| Stop | Development (fail fast) |\n| Continue | Production scripts |\n| SilentlyContinue | When errors expected |\n\n### Try/Catch Pattern\n\n- Don''t return inside try block\n- Use finally for cleanup\n- Return after try/catch\n\n---\n\n## 6. File Paths\n\n### Windows Path Rules\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Literal path | `C:\\Users\\User\\file.txt` |\n| Variable path | `Join-Path $env:USERPROFILE \"file.txt\"` |\n| Relative | `Join-Path $ScriptDir \"data\"` |\n\n**Rule:** Use Join-Path for cross-platform safety.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Array Operations\n\n### Correct Patterns\n\n| Operation | Syntax |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Empty array | `$array = @()` |\n| Add item | `$array += $item` |\n| ArrayList add | `$list.Add($item) | Out-Null` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. JSON Operations\n\n### CRITICAL: Depth Parameter\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `ConvertTo-Json` | `ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10` |\n\n**Rule:** Always specify `-Depth` for nested objects.\n\n### File Operations\n\n| Operation | Pattern |\n|-----------|---------|\n| Read | `Get-Content \"file.json\" -Raw | ConvertFrom-Json` |\n| Write | `$data | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10 | Out-File \"file.json\" -Encoding UTF8` |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Common Errors\n\n| Error Message | Cause | Fix |\n|---------------|-------|-----|\n| \"parameter ''or''\" | Missing parentheses | Wrap cmdlets in () |\n| \"Unexpected token\" | Unicode character | Use ASCII only |\n| \"Cannot find property\" | Null object | Check null first |\n| \"Cannot convert\" | Type mismatch | Use .ToString() |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Script Template\n\n```powershell\n# Strict mode\nSet-StrictMode -Version Latest\n$ErrorActionPreference = \"Continue\"\n\n# Paths\n$ScriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Path\n\n# Main\ntry {\n    # Logic here\n    Write-Output \"[OK] Done\"\n    exit 0\n}\ncatch {\n    Write-Warning \"Error: $_\"\n    exit 1\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** PowerShell has unique syntax rules. Parentheses, ASCII-only, and null checks are non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:38:48.238Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Windows-focused Agents needing advanced PowerShell scripting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 PowerShell 脚本编写能力的 Windows 专注代理。","ja":"Windows 専用エージェントが高度な PowerShell スクリプト作成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 PowerShell 스크립팅 기능이 필요한 Windows 중심 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en Windows que necesitan capacidades de scripting de PowerShell avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur Windows ayant besoin de capacités de scripting PowerShell avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Windows-fokussierte Agenten, die erweiterte PowerShell-Scripting-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Windows que precisam de capacidades avançadas de script em PowerShell.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на Windows, которые требуют расширенных возможностей скриптинга PowerShell.","ar":"مثالي لعميل يركز على نظام التشغيل Windows والذي يحتاج إلى قدرات برمجة PowerShell متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust PowerShell scripts using correct operator syntax rules and avoiding Unicode/Emoji restrictions, ensuring seamless execution of cmdlets like Test-Path and Get-Item.","zh":"赋予代理编写强大的 PowerShell 脚本的能力，使用正确的运算符语法规则，避免 Unicode/Emoji 限制，确保 cmdlet（如 Test-Path 和 Get-Item）执行顺畅。","ja":"エージェントが正しい演算子構文規則を使用して強力な PowerShell スクリプトを記述し、Unicode/Emoji の制限を回避し、Test-Path や Get-Item などのコマンドレットをスムーズに実行できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 올바른 연산자 구문 규칙을 사용하여 강력한 PowerShell 스크립트를 작성하고 유니코드/이모티콘 제한을 피하여 Test-Path 및 Get-Item과 같은 cmdlet을 무중단으로 실행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir scripts de PowerShell robustos utilizando reglas de sintaxis de operadores correctas y evitando restricciones de Unicode/Emoji, garantizando la ejecución sin problemas de cmdlets como Test-Path y Get-Item.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des scripts PowerShell robustes en utilisant les règles de syntaxe d''opérateurs correctes et en évitant les restrictions d''Unicode/Emoji, assurant ainsi l''exécution sans problème de cmdlets tels que Test-Path et Get-Item.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robuste PowerShell-Skripte unter Verwendung korrekter Operator-Syntaxregeln und Vermeidung von Unicode/Emoji-Einschränkungen zu schreiben, um eine reibungslose Ausführung von Cmdlets wie Test-Path und Get-Item sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever scripts PowerShell robustos usando regras de sintaxe de operador corretas e evitando restrições de Unicode/Emoji, garantindo a execução sem problemas de cmdlets como Test-Path e Get-Item.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать прочные скрипты PowerShell с использованием правильных правил синтаксиса операторов и избегая ограничений Юникода/Emoji, обеспечивая бесперебойное выполнение cmdlet, таких как Test-Path и Get-Item.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية كتابة نصوص برمجة PowerShell متينة باستخدام قواعد بناء جملة المشغل الصحيحة وتجنب قيود اليونيكود/الرموز التعبيرية، مما يضمن تنفيذ cmdlet دون مشاكل مثل Test-Path و Get-Item."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex PowerShell scripts","Automating Windows system administration tasks","Generating reports using PowerShell output"],"zh":["调试复杂的 PowerShell 脚本","自动执行 Windows 系统管理任务","使用 PowerShell 输出生成报告"],"ja":["複雑な PowerShell スクリプトのデバッグ","Windows システム管理タスクの自動化","PowerShell 出力からのレポート生成"],"ko":["복잡한 PowerShell 스크립트 디버깅","Windows 시스템 관리 작업 자동화","PowerShell 출력으로 보고서 생성"],"es":["Depuración de scripts de PowerShell complejos","Automatización de tareas de administración del sistema Windows","Generación de informes utilizando la salida de PowerShell"],"fr":["Débogage de scripts PowerShell complexes","Automatisation des tâches d''administration du système Windows","Génération de rapports à l''aide de la sortie PowerShell"],"de":["Debugging komplexer PowerShell-Skripte","Automatisierung von Windows-Systemadministrationsaufgaben","Generierung von Berichten unter Verwendung von PowerShell-Ausgaben"],"pt":["Depuração de scripts PowerShell complexos","Automatização de tarefas de administração do sistema Windows","Geração de relatórios usando saída do PowerShell"],"ru":["Отладка сложных скриптов PowerShell","Автоматизация задач администрирования системы Windows","Генерация отчетов с использованием вывода PowerShell"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء في نصوص برمجة PowerShell المعقدة","أتمتة مهام إدارة نظام التشغيل Windows","توليد تقارير باستخدام مخرجات PowerShell"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Windows operating system","PowerShell version compatibility needed"],"zh":["需要 Windows 操作系统","需要 PowerShell 版本兼容性"],"ja":["Windows オペレーティングシステムが必要","PowerShell バージョンの互換性が必要"],"ko":["Windows 운영 체제 필요","PowerShell 버전 호환성 필요"],"es":["Requiere sistema operativo Windows","Se necesita compatibilidad de versión de PowerShell"],"fr":["Nécessite un système d''exploitation Windows","La compatibilité de la version de PowerShell est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Windows-Betriebssystem","PowerShell-Version-Kompatibilität erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer sistema operacional Windows","Compatibilidade de versão do PowerShell necessária"],"ru":["Требуется операционная система Windows","Необходима совместимость версии PowerShell"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام تشغيل Windows","مطلوبة توافق إصدار PowerShell"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
