в cmdlets","Логика операторов","Лучшие практики для разработчиков"],"ar":["قواعد بناء العبارات","قيود اليونيكود والرموز التعبيرية","استخدام الأقواس في cmdlets","منطق العبارات","أفضل الممارسات للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Windows PowerShell","操作符语法","Unicode 限制","批处理脚本","代码调试","安全最佳实践","性能优化","powershell 脚本"],"ja":["Windows PowerShell","演算子構文","Unicode の制限","バッチスクリプト","コードデバッグ","セキュリティのベストプラクティス","パフォーマンスの最適化","powershell スクリプト"],"ko":["Windows PowerShell","연산자 구문","유니코드 제한","배치 스크립트","코드 디버깅","보안 모범 사례","성능 최적화","powershell 스크립트"],"es":["PowerShell","Windows","patrones críticos","trampas","scripting","eficiencia","productividad","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["PowerShell","Windows","modèles critiques","pièges","scripting","efficacité","productivité","développement de logiciels"],"de":["PowerShell","Windows","kritische Muster","Fallstricke","Skripting","Effizienz","Produktivität","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["PowerShell no Windows","Desenvolvimento de scripts","Automatização de tarefas","Gerenciamento de sistemas","Linguagem de script","Cmdlets","Operadores lógicos","Melhores práticas"],"ru":["PowerShell в Windows","Разработка скриптов","Автоматизация задач","Управление системами","Язык скриптов","Cmdlets","Логические операторы","Лучшие практики"],"ar":["PowerShell في نظام التشغيل Windows","تصميم البرامج النصية","تطبيق العمليات التلقائية","إدارة الأنظمة","لغة البرمجة","cmdlets","عبارات منطقية","أفضل الممارسات"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"powershell-windows","description":"PowerShell Windows patterns. Critical pitfalls, operator syntax, error handling.","bodyPreview":"# PowerShell Windows Patterns\n\n> Critical patterns and pitfalls for Windows PowerShell.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Operator Syntax Rules\n\n### CRITICAL: Parentheses Required\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `if (Test-Path \"a\" -or Test-Path \"b\")` | `if ((Test-Path \"a\") -or (Test-Path \"b\"))` |\n| `if (Get-Item $x -and $y -eq 5)` | `if ((Get-Item $x) -and ($y -eq 5))` |\n\n**Rule:** Each cmdlet call MUST be in parentheses when using logical operators.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Unicode/Emoji Restriction\n\n### CRIT","body":"# PowerShell Windows Patterns\n\n> Critical patterns and pitfalls for Windows PowerShell.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Operator Syntax Rules\n\n### CRITICAL: Parentheses Required\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `if (Test-Path \"a\" -or Test-Path \"b\")` | `if ((Test-Path \"a\") -or (Test-Path \"b\"))` |\n| `if (Get-Item $x -and $y -eq 5)` | `if ((Get-Item $x) -and ($y -eq 5))` |\n\n**Rule:** Each cmdlet call MUST be in parentheses when using logical operators.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Unicode/Emoji Restriction\n\n### CRITICAL: No Unicode in Scripts\n\n| Purpose | ❌ Don''t Use | ✅ Use |\n|---------|-------------|--------|\n| Success | ✅ ✓ | [OK] [+] |\n| Error | ❌ ✗ 🔴 | [!] [X] |\n| Warning | ⚠️ 🟡 | [*] [WARN] |\n| Info | ℹ️ 🔵 | [i] [INFO] |\n| Progress | ⏳ | [...] |\n\n**Rule:** Use ASCII characters only in PowerShell scripts.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Null Check Patterns\n\n### Always Check Before Access\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `$array.Count -gt 0` | `$array -and $array.Count -gt 0` |\n| `$text.Length` | `if ($text) { $text.Length }` |\n\n---\n\n## 4. String Interpolation\n\n### Complex Expressions\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `\"Value: $($obj.prop.sub)\"` | Store in variable first |\n\n**Pattern:**\n```\n$value = $obj.prop.sub\nWrite-Output \"Value: $value\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Error Handling\n\n### ErrorActionPreference\n\n| Value | Use |\n|-------|-----|\n| Stop | Development (fail fast) |\n| Continue | Production scripts |\n| SilentlyContinue | When errors expected |\n\n### Try/Catch Pattern\n\n- Don''t return inside try block\n- Use finally for cleanup\n- Return after try/catch\n\n---\n\n## 6. File Paths\n\n### Windows Path Rules\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Literal path | `C:\\Users\\User\\file.txt` |\n| Variable path | `Join-Path $env:USERPROFILE \"file.txt\"` |\n| Relative | `Join-Path $ScriptDir \"data\"` |\n\n**Rule:** Use Join-Path for cross-platform safety.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Array Operations\n\n### Correct Patterns\n\n| Operation | Syntax |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Empty array | `$array = @()` |\n| Add item | `$array += $item` |\n| ArrayList add | `$list.Add($item) | Out-Null` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. JSON Operations\n\n### CRITICAL: Depth Parameter\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `ConvertTo-Json` | `ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10` |\n\n**Rule:** Always specify `-Depth` for nested objects.\n\n### File Operations\n\n| Operation | Pattern |\n|-----------|---------|\n| Read | `Get-Content \"file.json\" -Raw | ConvertFrom-Json` |\n| Write | `$data | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10 | Out-File \"file.json\" -Encoding UTF8` |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Common Errors\n\n| Error Message | Cause | Fix |\n|---------------|-------|-----|\n| \"parameter ''or''\" | Missing parentheses | Wrap cmdlets in () |\n| \"Unexpected token\" | Unicode character | Use ASCII only |\n| \"Cannot find property\" | Null object | Check null first |\n| \"Cannot convert\" | Type mismatch | Use .ToString() |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Script Template\n\n```powershell\n# Strict mode\nSet-StrictMode -Version Latest\n$ErrorActionPreference = \"Continue\"\n\n# Paths\n$ScriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Path\n\n# Main\ntry {\n    # Logic here\n    Write-Output \"[OK] Done\"\n    exit 0\n}\ncatch {\n    Write-Warning \"Error: $_\"\n    exit 1\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** PowerShell has unique syntax rules. Parentheses, ASCII-only, and null checks are non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:38:44.757Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Windows-focused AI Agents needing advanced PowerShell scripting capabilities.","zh":"Perfect for Windows-focused AI Agents needing advanced PowerShell scripting capabilities.","ja":"Perfect for Windows-focused AI Agents needing advanced PowerShell scripting capabilities.","ko":"Perfect for Windows-focused AI Agents needing advanced PowerShell scripting capabilities.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA centrados en Windows que necesitan capacidades de scripting de PowerShell avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA axés sur Windows ayant besoin de capacités de scripting PowerShell avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Windows-fokussierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte PowerShell-Skripting-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA com foco em Windows que precisam de capacidades avançadas de scripting do PowerShell.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Windows, которым требуются расширенные возможности скриптинга PowerShell.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الإي الأي التي تركز على نظام التشغيل Windows وتحتاج إلى قدرات برمجة PowerShell متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust PowerShell scripts using correct operator syntax rules and avoiding Unicode/Emoji restrictions, ensuring seamless execution of cmdlets with logical operators.","zh":"Empowers agents to write robust PowerShell scripts using correct operator syntax rules and avoiding Unicode/Emoji restrictions, ensuring seamless execution of cmdlets with logical operators.","ja":"Empowers agents to write robust PowerShell scripts using correct operator syntax rules and avoiding Unicode/Emoji restrictions, ensuring seamless execution of cmdlets with logical operators.","ko":"Empowers agents to write robust PowerShell scripts using correct operator syntax rules and avoiding Unicode/Emoji restrictions, ensuring seamless execution of cmdlets with logical operators.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir scripts de PowerShell robustos utilizando reglas de sintaxis de operadores correctas y evitando restricciones de Unicode/Emoji, garantizando la ejecución sin problemas de cmdlets con operadores lógicos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des scripts PowerShell robustes en utilisant des règles de syntaxe d''opérateurs correctes et en évitant les restrictions Unicode/Emoji, garantissant l''exécution sans problème des cmdlets avec des opérateurs logiques.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, robuste PowerShell-Skripte unter Verwendung korrekter Operator-Syntaxregeln und unter Vermeidung von Unicode/Emoji-Einschränkungen zu schreiben, um eine reibungslose Ausführung von Cmdlets mit logischen Operatoren sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever scripts PowerShell robustos usando regras de sintaxe de operadores corretas e evitando restrições de Unicode/Emoji, garantindo a execução sem problemas de cmdlets com operadores lógicos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать прочные скрипты PowerShell, используя правильные правила синтаксиса операторов и избегая ограничений Unicode/Emoji, обеспечивая бесперебойное выполнение командлетов с логическими операторами.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من كتابة نصوص برمجة PowerShell قوية باستخدام قواعد بناء الجملة للمشغلين بشكل صحيح وتجنب قيود Unicode/Emoji، مما يضمن تنفيذ cmdlets مع مشغلات логية دون أي مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging PowerShell scripts with complex conditional statements","Automating Windows system administration tasks using optimized PowerShell commands","Validating PowerShell script syntax for logical operator correctness"],"zh":["Debugging PowerShell scripts with complex conditional statements","Automating Windows system administration tasks using optimized PowerShell commands","Validating PowerShell script syntax for logical operator correctness"],"ja":["Debugging PowerShell scripts with complex conditional statements","Automating Windows system administration tasks using optimized PowerShell commands","Validating PowerShell script syntax for logical operator correctness"],"ko":["Debugging PowerShell scripts with complex conditional statements","Automating Windows system administration tasks using optimized PowerShell commands","Validating PowerShell script syntax for logical operator correctness"],"es":["Depuración de scripts de PowerShell con declaraciones condicionales complejas","Automatización de tareas de administración del sistema Windows mediante comandos de PowerShell optimizados","Validación de la sintaxis de scripts de PowerShell para la corrección de operadores lógicos"],"fr":["Débogage de scripts PowerShell avec des instructions conditionnelles complexes","Automatisation des tâches d''administration du système Windows à l''aide de commandes PowerShell optimisées","Validation de la syntaxe des scripts PowerShell pour la correction des opérateurs logiques"],"de":["Debuggen von PowerShell-Skripten mit komplexen bedingten Anweisungen","Automatisierung von Windows-Systemadministrationsaufgaben unter Verwendung optimierter PowerShell-Befehle","Validierung der PowerShell-Skript-Syntax für die Richtigkeit logischer Operatoren"],"pt":["Depuração de scripts PowerShell com instruções condicionais complexas","Automatização de tarefas de administração do sistema Windows usando comandos PowerShell otimizados","Validação da sintaxe de scripts PowerShell para correção de operadores lógicos"],"ru":["Отладка скриптов PowerShell с сложными условными операторами","Автоматизация задач администрирования системы Windows с помощью оптимизированных команд PowerShell","Проверка синтаксиса скриптов PowerShell на правильность логических операторов"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء في نصوص برمجة PowerShell مع عبارات شرطية معقدة","تحسين مهام إدارة نظام التشغيل Windows باستخدام أوامر PowerShell المُحسّنة","تحقق من صحة بناء الجملة لنصوص برمجة PowerShell لضمان دقة المشغلين اللوجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Windows environment","PowerShell compatibility only","Parentheses required for cmdlet calls with logical operators"],"zh":["Requires Windows environment","PowerShell compatibility only","Parentheses required for cmdlet calls with logical operators"],"ja":["Requires Windows environment","PowerShell compatibility only","Parentheses required for cmdlet calls with logical operators"],"ko":["Requires Windows environment","PowerShell compatibility only","Parentheses required for cmdlet calls with logical operators"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Windows","Compatibilidad solo con PowerShell","Paréntesis necesarios para llamadas a cmdlets con operadores lógicos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Windows","Compatibilité uniquement avec PowerShell","Parenthèses requises pour les appels de cmdlets avec des opérateurs logiques"],"de":["Benötigt Windows-Umgebung","Kompatibilität nur mit PowerShell","Klammern erforderlich für Cmdlet-Aufrufe mit logischen Operatoren"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Windows","Compatibilidade apenas com PowerShell","Parênteses necessários para chamadas de cmdlets com operadores lógicos"],"ru":["Требуется среда Windows","Совместимость только с PowerShell","Скобки необходимы для вызовов командлетов с логическими операторами"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة نظام التشغيل Windows","متوافق فقط مع PowerShell","يتطلب قوسين لاستدعاءات cmdlets مع مشغلات логية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
