":"Windows PowerShell의 핵심 패턴과 함정, 연산자 구문 규칙 및 유니코드/이모지 제한 포함","es":"Aprende a dominar los patrones críticos de PowerShell en Windows y evita errores comunes en tus scripts.","fr":"Apprenez à maîtriser les modèles critiques de PowerShell Windows et évitez les erreurs courantes dans vos scripts.","de":"Lernen Sie, die kritischen Muster von PowerShell Windows zu beherrschen und vermeiden Sie häufige Fehler in Ihren Skripten.","pt":"Este guia apresenta padrões críticos e armadilhas do PowerShell no Windows, incluindo regras de sintaxe de operadores e restrições de unicode.","ru":"Этот гид представляет собой критические шаблоны и ловушки PowerShell в Windows, включая правила синтаксиса операторов и ограничения юникода.","ar":"يقدم هذا الدليل أنماطاً حرجة وفخاخ في PowerShell لنظام التشغيل Windows، بما في ذلك قواعد بناء الجمل للمشغلين وقيود اليونيكود.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["运算符语法规则","Unicode/Emoji 限制","逻辑运算符的使用","cmdlet 调用的语法","脚本编写最佳实践"],"ja":["演算子構文規則","Unicode/Emoji の制限","論理演算子の使用","cmdlet の呼び出しの構文","スクリプトの作成に関するベストプラクティス"],"ko":["연산자 구문 규칙","유니코드/이모지 제한","논리 연산자의 사용","cmdlet 호출의 구문","스크립트 작성에 대한 모범 사례"],"es":["Sintaxis de operadores lógicos","Reglas de paréntesis","Restricciones de Unicode y emojis","Patrones críticos para scripts de PowerShell","Ejemplos de errores comunes"],"fr":["Syntaxe des opérateurs logiques","Règles des parenthèses","Restrictions d''Unicode et d''émoticônes","Modèles critiques pour les scripts PowerShell","Exemples d''erreurs courantes"],"de":["Syntax von logischen Operatoren","Regeln für Klammern","Einschränkungen von Unicode und Emojis","Kritische Muster für PowerShell-Skripte","Beispiele für häufige Fehler"],"pt":["Regras de sintaxe de operadores","Restrições de unicode","Padrões críticos para scripting","Melhores práticas para evitar erros","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Правила синтаксиса операторов","Ограничения юникода","Критические шаблоны для скриптинга","Лучшие практики для избежания ошибок","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["قواعد بناء الجمل للمشغلين","قيود اليونيكود","أنماط حرجة لكتابة البرامج النصية","أفضل الممارسات لتجنب الأخطاء","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Windows PowerShell","运算符语法","Unicode 限制","逻辑运算符","cmdlet 调用","脚本编写","任务自动化","配置管理"],"ja":["Windows PowerShell","演算子構文","Unicode 制限","論理演算子","cmdlet 呼び出し","スクリプト作成","タスク自動化","構成管理"],"ko":["Windows PowerShell","연산자 구문","유니코드 제한","논리 연산자","cmdlet 호출","스크립트 작성","작업 자동화","구성 관리"],"es":["PowerShell","Windows","patrones críticos","operadores lógicos","paréntesis","Unicode","emojis","desarrollo de scripts"],"fr":["PowerShell","Windows","modèles critiques","opérateurs logiques","parenthèses","Unicode","émoticônes","développement de scripts"],"de":["PowerShell","Windows","kritische Muster","logische Operatoren","Klammern","Unicode","Emojis","Skriptentwicklung"],"pt":["PowerShell","Windows","scripting","padrões","armadilhas","regras de sintaxe","unicode","desempenho"],"ru":["PowerShell","Windows","скриптинг","шаблоны","ловушки","правила синтаксиса","юникод","производительность"],"ar":["PowerShell","نظام التشغيل Windows","كتابة البرامج النصية","أنماط","فخاخ","قواعد بناء الجمل","يونيكود","الأداء"]}},"owner":"Nickzhan1001","repo":"AI-tools","repoPath":"Nickzhan1001/AI-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"powershell-windows","description":"PowerShell Windows patterns. Critical pitfalls, operator syntax, error handling.","bodyPreview":"# PowerShell Windows Patterns\n\n> Critical patterns and pitfalls for Windows PowerShell.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Operator Syntax Rules\n\n### CRITICAL: Parentheses Required\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `if (Test-Path \"a\" -or Test-Path \"b\")` | `if ((Test-Path \"a\") -or (Test-Path \"b\"))` |\n| `if (Get-Item $x -and $y -eq 5)` | `if ((Get-Item $x) -and ($y -eq 5))` |\n\n**Rule:** Each cmdlet call MUST be in parentheses when using logical operators.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Unicode/Emoji Restriction\n\n### CRIT","body":"# PowerShell Windows Patterns\n\n> Critical patterns and pitfalls for Windows PowerShell.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Operator Syntax Rules\n\n### CRITICAL: Parentheses Required\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `if (Test-Path \"a\" -or Test-Path \"b\")` | `if ((Test-Path \"a\") -or (Test-Path \"b\"))` |\n| `if (Get-Item $x -and $y -eq 5)` | `if ((Get-Item $x) -and ($y -eq 5))` |\n\n**Rule:** Each cmdlet call MUST be in parentheses when using logical operators.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Unicode/Emoji Restriction\n\n### CRITICAL: No Unicode in Scripts\n\n| Purpose | ❌ Don''t Use | ✅ Use |\n|---------|-------------|--------|\n| Success | ✅ ✓ | [OK] [+] |\n| Error | ❌ ✗ 🔴 | [!] [X] |\n| Warning | ⚠️ 🟡 | [*] [WARN] |\n| Info | ℹ️ 🔵 | [i] [INFO] |\n| Progress | ⏳ | [...] |\n\n**Rule:** Use ASCII characters only in PowerShell scripts.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Null Check Patterns\n\n### Always Check Before Access\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `$array.Count -gt 0` | `$array -and $array.Count -gt 0` |\n| `$text.Length` | `if ($text) { $text.Length }` |\n\n---\n\n## 4. String Interpolation\n\n### Complex Expressions\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `\"Value: $($obj.prop.sub)\"` | Store in variable first |\n\n**Pattern:**\n```\n$value = $obj.prop.sub\nWrite-Output \"Value: $value\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Error Handling\n\n### ErrorActionPreference\n\n| Value | Use |\n|-------|-----|\n| Stop | Development (fail fast) |\n| Continue | Production scripts |\n| SilentlyContinue | When errors expected |\n\n### Try/Catch Pattern\n\n- Don''t return inside try block\n- Use finally for cleanup\n- Return after try/catch\n\n---\n\n## 6. File Paths\n\n### Windows Path Rules\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Literal path | `C:\\Users\\User\\file.txt` |\n| Variable path | `Join-Path $env:USERPROFILE \"file.txt\"` |\n| Relative | `Join-Path $ScriptDir \"data\"` |\n\n**Rule:** Use Join-Path for cross-platform safety.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Array Operations\n\n### Correct Patterns\n\n| Operation | Syntax |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Empty array | `$array = @()` |\n| Add item | `$array += $item` |\n| ArrayList add | `$list.Add($item) | Out-Null` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. JSON Operations\n\n### CRITICAL: Depth Parameter\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `ConvertTo-Json` | `ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10` |\n\n**Rule:** Always specify `-Depth` for nested objects.\n\n### File Operations\n\n| Operation | Pattern |\n|-----------|---------|\n| Read | `Get-Content \"file.json\" -Raw | ConvertFrom-Json` |\n| Write | `$data | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10 | Out-File \"file.json\" -Encoding UTF8` |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Common Errors\n\n| Error Message | Cause | Fix |\n|---------------|-------|-----|\n| \"parameter ''or''\" | Missing parentheses | Wrap cmdlets in () |\n| \"Unexpected token\" | Unicode character | Use ASCII only |\n| \"Cannot find property\" | Null object | Check null first |\n| \"Cannot convert\" | Type mismatch | Use .ToString() |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Script Template\n\n```powershell\n# Strict mode\nSet-StrictMode -Version Latest\n$ErrorActionPreference = \"Continue\"\n\n# Paths\n$ScriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Path\n\n# Main\ntry {\n    # Logic here\n    Write-Output \"[OK] Done\"\n    exit 0\n}\ncatch {\n    Write-Warning \"Error: $_\"\n    exit 1\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** PowerShell has unique syntax rules. Parentheses, ASCII-only, and null checks are non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:39:00.099Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for System Administration Agents requiring advanced Windows PowerShell scripting capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级Windows PowerShell脚本编写能力的系统管理代理。","ja":"システム管理エージェントがWindows PowerShellスクリプトの高度な機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Windows PowerShell 스크립팅 기능이 필요한 시스템 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de sistemas que requieren capacidades de scripting avanzadas de Windows PowerShell.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''administration système nécessitant des capacités de scripting avancées de Windows PowerShell.","de":"Ideal für Systemadministration-Agenten, die erweiterte Windows PowerShell-Skriptfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Administração de Sistema que exigem capacidades de script avançadas do Windows PowerShell.","ru":"Идеально для агентов системного администрирования, требующих расширенных возможностей скриптинга Windows PowerShell.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة النظام الذي يتطلب قدرات برمجة Windows PowerShell متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust PowerShell scripts using critical patterns and pitfalls, including proper operator syntax rules and handling Unicode/Emoji restrictions, ensuring reliable automation of Windows tasks.","zh":"赋予代理编写强大的PowerShell脚本的能力，包括关键模式和陷阱，例如适当的运算符语法规则和处理Unicode/Emoji限制，确保Windows任务的可靠自动化。","ja":"エージェントが重要なパターンや落とし穴を含む堅牢なPowerShellスクリプトを記述できるようにし、適切な演算子構文規則やUnicode/Emojiの制限の処理などを使用して、Windowsタスクの信頼性の高い自動化を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 중요한 패턴 및 함정 등을 포함한 강력한 PowerShell 스크립트를 작성할 수 있도록 하며, 적절한 연산자 구문 규칙 및 유니코드/이모지 제한 처리 등을 사용하여 Windows 작업의 신뢰할 수 있는 자동화를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir scripts de PowerShell robustos utilizando patrones y trampas críticas, incluyendo reglas de sintaxis de operadores adecuadas y el manejo de restricciones de Unicode/Emoji, lo que garantiza la automatización confiable de tareas de Windows.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des scripts PowerShell robustes en utilisant des modèles et des pièges critiques, notamment les règles de syntaxe des opérateurs et la gestion des restrictions Unicode/Emoji, ce qui assure l''automatisation fiable des tâches Windows.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robuste PowerShell-Skripte unter Verwendung kritischer Muster und Fallstricke zu schreiben, einschließlich geeigneter Operator-Syntaxregeln und der Handhabung von Unicode/Emoji-Einschränkungen, was eine zuverlässige Automatisierung von Windows-Aufgaben gewährleistet.","pt":"Permite que os agentes escrevam scripts PowerShell robustos usando padrões críticos e armadilhas, incluindo regras de sintaxe de operadores apropriadas e manipulação de restrições de Unicode/Emoji, garantindo a automação confiável de tarefas do Windows.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать прочные скрипты PowerShell, используя критические шаблоны и ловушки, включая правильные правила синтаксиса операторов и обработку ограничений Unicode/Emoji, обеспечивая надежную автоматизацию задач Windows.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بكتابة نصوص برمجة PowerShell قوية باستخدام الأنماط الحرجة والفخاخ ، بما في ذلك قواعد بناء الجملة للمشغلين الصحيحة ومعالجة قيود Unicode/Emoji ، مما يضمن автоматية موثوقة لمهام Windows."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Windows system configuration","Debugging complex PowerShell scripts","Generating reports using PowerShell cmdlets"],"zh":["自动化Windows系统配置","调试复杂的PowerShell脚本","使用PowerShell cmdlet生成报告"],"ja":["Windowsシステム構成の自動化","複雑なPowerShellスクリプトのデバッグ","PowerShell cmdletを使用したレポートの生成"],"ko":["Windows 시스템 구성 자동화","복잡한 PowerShell 스크립트 디버깅","PowerShell cmdlet을 사용한 보고서 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la configuración del sistema Windows","Depuración de scripts de PowerShell complejos","Generación de informes mediante cmdlets de PowerShell"],"fr":["Automatisation de la configuration du système Windows","Débogage de scripts PowerShell complexes","Génération de rapports à l''aide de cmdlets PowerShell"],"de":["Automatisierung der Windows-Systemkonfiguration","Fehlerbehebung komplexer PowerShell-Skripte","Erzeugung von Berichten mit PowerShell-Cmdlets"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração do sistema Windows","Depurar scripts PowerShell complexos","Gerar relatórios usando cmdlets do PowerShell"],"ru":["Автоматизация конфигурации системы Windows","Отладка сложных скриптов PowerShell","Генерация отчетов с помощью cmdlets PowerShell"],"ar":["تأتمتة تكوين نظام Windows","تصحيح أخطاء في نصوص برمجة PowerShell المعقدة","генерация تقارير باستخدام cmdlets من PowerShell"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Windows environment","PowerShell version compatibility needed","Parentheses required for logical operators"],"zh":["需要Windows环境","需要PowerShell版本兼容性","逻辑运算符需要括号"],"ja":["Windows環境が必要","PowerShellのバージョン互換性が必要","論理演算子には括弧が必要"],"ko":["Windows 환경 필요","PowerShell 버전 호환성 필요","논리 연산자에 괄호 필요"],"es":["Se requiere entorno de Windows","Se necesita compatibilidad de versión de PowerShell","Se requieren paréntesis para operadores lógicos"],"fr":["Environnement Windows requis","Compatibilité de la version de PowerShell nécessaire","Parenthèses requises pour les opérateurs logiques"],"de":["Windows-Umgebung erforderlich","PowerShell-Version-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Klammern erforderlich für logische Operatoren"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Windows","Compatibilidade de versão do PowerShell necessária","Parênteses necessários para operadores lógicos"],"ru":["Требуется среда Windows","Необходима совместимость версий PowerShell","Скобки необходимы для логических операторов"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Windows","مطلوب توافق إصدار PowerShell","قوسين مطلوبان للمشغلين المنطقيين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
