ados","Gerenciamento de Navegação","Integração com ReactiveUI","Utilização de Zafiro"],"ru":["Функционально-реактивный подход","Улучшенные команды","Управление навигацией","Интеграция с ReactiveUI","Использование Zafiro"],"ar":["نظرية وظيفية-متفاعلة","أوامر محسنة","إدارة التنقل","التكامل مع ReactiveUI","استخدام زافيرو"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Avalonia","ViewModel","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","功能性反应式","增强命令","Wizard","导航管理"],"ja":["Avalonia","ViewModel","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","関数型リアクティブ","強化コマンド","Wizard","ナビゲーション管理"],"ko":["Avalonia","ViewModel","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","기능적 반응형","강화 명령","Wizard","내비게이션 관리"],"es":["Avalonia ViewModels","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","ViewModels","Wizards","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","Programación reactiva","Gestión de estado"],"fr":["Modèles de vue Avalonia","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","ViewModels","Wizards","Développement d''applications","Programmation réactive","Gestion de l''état"],"de":["Avalonia ViewModels","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","ViewModels","Wizards","Anwendungsentwicklung","Reaktive Programmierung","Zustandsverwaltung"],"pt":["Avalonia ViewModels","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos","ViewModels","Wizards","Navegação"],"ru":["Avalonia ViewModels","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","Разработка приложений","ViewModels","Wizards","Навигация"],"ar":["أفالونيا فيومدلز","زافيرو","رياكتيف يو آي","تطوير التطبيقات","فيومدلز","ويزاردز","التنقل"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"avalonia-viewmodels-zafiro","description":"Optimal ViewModel and Wizard creation patterns for Avalonia using Zafiro and ReactiveUI.","bodyPreview":"# Avalonia ViewModels with Zafiro\n\nThis skill provides a set of best practices and patterns for creating ViewModels, Wizards, and managing navigation in Avalonia applications, leveraging the power of **ReactiveUI** and the **Zafiro** toolkit.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1.  **Functional-Reactive Approach**: Use ReactiveUI (`ReactiveObject`, `WhenAnyValue`, etc.) to handle state and logic.\n2.  **Enhanced Commands**: Utilize `IEnhancedCommand` for better command management, including progress reporting a","body":"# Avalonia ViewModels with Zafiro\n\nThis skill provides a set of best practices and patterns for creating ViewModels, Wizards, and managing navigation in Avalonia applications, leveraging the power of **ReactiveUI** and the **Zafiro** toolkit.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1.  **Functional-Reactive Approach**: Use ReactiveUI (`ReactiveObject`, `WhenAnyValue`, etc.) to handle state and logic.\n2.  **Enhanced Commands**: Utilize `IEnhancedCommand` for better command management, including progress reporting and name/text attributes.\n3.  **Wizard Pattern**: Implement complex flows using `SlimWizard` and `WizardBuilder` for a declarative and maintainable approach.\n4.  **Automatic Section Discovery**: Use the `[Section]` attribute to register and discover UI sections automatically.\n5.  **Clean Composition**: map ViewModels to Views using `DataTypeViewLocator` and manage dependencies in the `CompositionRoot`.\n\n## Guides\n\n- [ViewModels & Commands](viewmodels.md): Creating robust ViewModels and handling commands.\n- [Wizards & Flows](wizards.md): Building multi-step wizards with `SlimWizard`.\n- [Navigation & Sections](navigation_sections.md): Managing navigation and section-based UIs.\n- [Composition & Mapping](composition.md): Best practices for View-ViewModel wiring and DI.\n\n## Example Reference\n\nFor real-world implementations, refer to the **Angor** project:\n- `CreateProjectFlowV2.cs`: Excellent example of complex Wizard building.\n- `HomeViewModel.cs`: Simple section ViewModel using functional-reactive commands.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:39:16.755Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI-focused Agents seeking to enhance Avalonia applications with robust ViewModels and navigation management","zh":"适合于专注于UI的Agent，旨在通过强大的ViewModel和导航管理来增强Avalonia应用程序","ja":"UIに焦点を当てたエージェントに適しており、Avaloniaアプリケーションを強力なViewModelとナビゲーション管理で強化する","ko":"UI에 중점을 둔 에이전트에게 적합하며, Avalonia 애플리케이션을 강력한 ViewModel 및 탐색 관리로 강화하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Ideal para agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario que buscan mejorar las aplicaciones de Avalonia con ViewModels robustos y gestión de navegación","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur qui souhaitent améliorer les applications Avalonia avec des ViewModels robustes et une gestion de navigation","de":"Ideal für benutzeroberflächenorientierte Agenten, die Avalonia-Anwendungen mit robusten ViewModels und Navigationssverwaltung verbessern möchten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes focados em UI que buscam aprimorar aplicativos Avalonia com ViewModels robustos e gerenciamento de navegação","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которые стремятся улучшить приложения Avalonia с помощью надежных ViewModels и управления навигацией","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء ذوي التوجيه نحو واجهة المستخدم الذين يبحثون عن تعزيز تطبيقات Avalonia مع نماذج عرض قوية وإدارة الملاحة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage ReactiveUI and the Zafiro toolkit for a functional-reactive approach, utilizing IEnhancedCommand for advanced command management and progress reporting, and streamlining navigation with best practices for Wizards and ViewModels","zh":"赋予代理使用ReactiveUI和Zafiro工具包的函数响应式方法，利用IEnhancedCommand进行高级命令管理和进度报告，并使用Wizards和ViewModel的最佳实践来简化导航","ja":"ReactiveUIとZafiroツールキットを使用した関数型リアクティブアプローチでエージェントを強化し、IEnhancedCommandを使用した高度なコマンド管理と進度報告を行い、WizardsとViewModelのベストプラクティスを使用してナビゲーションを最適化する","ko":"ReactiveUI 및 Zafiro 툴킷을 사용하여 함수형 반응형 접근 방식을 제공하며, IEnhancedCommand를 사용하여 고급 명령 관리 및 진행 상황 보고를 수행하고, Wizard 및 ViewModel의 모범 사례를 사용하여 탐색을 간소화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar ReactiveUI y la herramienta Zafiro para un enfoque funcional-reactivo, utilizando IEnhancedCommand para una gestión de comandos avanzada y notificación de progreso, y simplificando la navegación con las mejores prácticas para Wizards y ViewModels","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter ReactiveUI et l''outil Zafiro pour une approche fonctionnelle-réactive, en utilisant IEnhancedCommand pour une gestion de commandes avancée et un signalement de progression, et en simplifiant la navigation avec les meilleures pratiques pour les Wizards et les ViewModels","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ReactiveUI und das Zafiro-Toolkit für einen funktional-reaktiven Ansatz zu nutzen, indem IEnhancedCommand für eine erweiterte Befehlsverwaltung und Fortschrittsberichterstattung verwendet wird und die Navigation mit bewährten Methoden für Wizards und ViewModels optimiert","pt":"Habilita agentes a aproveitarem ReactiveUI e a ferramenta Zafiro para uma abordagem funcional-reativa, utilizando IEnhancedCommand para gerenciamento avançado de comandos e relatórios de progresso, e otimizando a navegação com as melhores práticas para Wizards e ViewModels","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать ReactiveUI и инструментарий Zafiro для функционально-реактивного подхода, используя IEnhancedCommand для расширенного управления командами и отчетов о прогрессе, и оптимизируя навигацию с помощью лучших практик для Wizards и ViewModels","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من ReactiveUI وأداة Zafiro لمقاربة وظيفية-تفاعلية، باستخدام IEnhancedCommand لإدارة أوامر متقدمة وتقارير تقدم، وتبسيط الملاحة مع أفضل الممارسات للمشعوذين ونماذج العرض"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing functional-reactive state handling with ReactiveObject and WhenAnyValue","Creating enhanced commands with progress reporting and better management using IEnhancedCommand","Streamlining navigation in Avalonia applications with optimized Wizards and ViewModels"],"zh":["使用ReactiveObject和WhenAnyValue实现函数响应式状态处理","使用IEnhancedCommand创建具有进度报告和更好的管理的增强命令","使用优化的Wizards和ViewModel简化Avalonia应用程序中的导航"],"ja":["ReactiveObjectとWhenAnyValueを使用した関数型リアクティブ状態の処理の実装","IEnhancedCommandを使用した進度報告とより良い管理のための強化されたコマンドの作成","最適化されたWizardsとViewModelを使用したAvaloniaアプリケーションのナビゲーションの簡素化"],"ko":["ReactiveObject 및 WhenAnyValue를 사용하여 함수형 반응형 상태 처리 구현","IEnhancedCommand를 사용하여 진행 상황 보고 및 더 나은 관리가 가능한 강화된 명령 생성","최적화된 Wizard 및 ViewModel을 사용하여 Avalonia 애플리케이션의 탐색을 간소화"],"es":["Implementación de control de estado funcional-reactivo con ReactiveObject y WhenAnyValue","Creación de comandos mejorados con notificación de progreso y mejor gestión utilizando IEnhancedCommand","Optimización de la navegación en aplicaciones de Avalonia con Wizards y ViewModels optimizados"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''une gestion d''état fonctionnelle-réactive avec ReactiveObject et WhenAnyValue","Création de commandes améliorées avec un signalement de progression et une meilleure gestion en utilisant IEnhancedCommand","Optimisation de la navigation dans les applications Avalonia avec des Wizards et des ViewModels optimisés"],"de":["Implementierung der funktional-reaktiven Zustandssteuerung mit ReactiveObject und WhenAnyValue","Erstellung von erweiterten Befehlen mit Fortschrittsberichterstattung und verbesserter Verwaltung unter Verwendung von IEnhancedCommand","Optimierung der Navigation in Avalonia-Anwendungen mit optimierten Wizards und ViewModels"],"pt":["Implementação de tratamento de estado funcional-reativo com ReactiveObject e WhenAnyValue","Criação de comandos aprimorados com relatórios de progresso e melhor gerenciamento usando IEnhancedCommand","Otimização da navegação em aplicativos Avalonia com Wizards e ViewModels otimizados"],"ru":["Реализация функционально-реактивного xử lý состояния с помощью ReactiveObject и WhenAnyValue","Создание улучшенных команд с отчетами о прогрессе и лучшим управлением с помощью IEnhancedCommand","Оптимизация навигации в приложениях Avalonia с помощью оптимизированных Wizards и ViewModels"],"ar":["تنفيذ معالجة حالة وظيفية-تفاعلية باستخدام ReactiveObject و WhenAnyValue","إنشاء أوامر محسّنة مع تقارير تقدم وأفضل إدارة باستخدام IEnhancedCommand","تحسين الملاحة في تطبيقات Avalonia مع سحرة ونماذج عرض محسّنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with Avalonia and ReactiveUI","Dependent on Zafiro toolkit","Avalonia-specific, may not be directly applicable to other UI frameworks"],"zh":["需要熟悉Avalonia和ReactiveUI","依赖于Zafiro工具包","特定于Avalonia，可能无法直接应用于其他UI框架"],"ja":["AvaloniaとReactiveUIの知識が必要","Zafiroツールキットに依存","Avalonia特有のため、他のUIフレームワークに直接適用できない可能性がある"],"ko":["Avalonia 및 ReactiveUI에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","Zafiro 툴킷에 의존합니다","Avalonia 전용으로, 다른 UI 프레임워크에 직접 적용할 수 없습니다"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con Avalonia y ReactiveUI","Dependiente de la herramienta Zafiro","Específico de Avalonia, puede que no sea directamente aplicable a otros marcos de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance d''Avalonia et de ReactiveUI","Dépend de l''outil Zafiro","Spécifique à Avalonia, peut ne pas être directement applicable à d''autres cadres d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Avalonia und ReactiveUI","Abhängig vom Zafiro-Toolkit","Spezifisch für Avalonia, möglicherweise nicht direkt anwendbar auf andere Benutzeroberflächenframeworks"],"pt":["Exige familiaridade com Avalonia e ReactiveUI","Dependente da ferramenta Zafiro","Específico do Avalonia, pode não ser diretamente aplicável a outros frameworks de UI"],"ru":["Требует знания Avalonia и ReactiveUI","Зависит от инструментария Zafiro","Специфичен для Avalonia, может не быть直接 применим к другим фреймворкам UI"],"ar":["يتطلب دراية بأفالونيا وريأكتيف يوي","يعتمد على أداة زافيرو","محدد لأفالونيا، قد لا يكون قابلا للتطبيق مباشرة على إطارات واجهة المستخدم الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
