,"Integration mit Zafiro"],"pt":["Abordagem Funcional-Reativa","Comandos Aumentados","Gerenciamento de Navegação","Integração com ReactiveUI","Uso de IEnhancedCommand"],"ru":["Функционально-реактивный подход","Улучшенные команды","Управление навигацией","Интеграция с ReactiveUI","Использование IEnhancedCommand"],"ar":["نهاية وظيفية-تفاعلية","أوامر محسنة","إدارة الملاحة","التكامل مع ReactiveUI","استخدام IEnhancedCommand"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Avalonia","ViewModels","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","函数响应式","增强命令","导航管理"],"ja":["Avalonia","ViewModels","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","関数反応","強化コマンド","ナビゲーション管理"],"ko":["Avalonia","ViewModels","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","함수 반응형","강화 명령","네비게이션 관리"],"es":["Avalonia ViewModels","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","ViewModels","navegación","gestión de estado","lógica","comandos mejorados","informes de progreso"],"fr":["Modèles de vue Avalonia","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","ViewModels","navigation","gestion de l''état","logique","commandes améliorées","rapports de progression"],"de":["Avalonia ViewModels","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","ViewModels","Navigation","Zustandsverwaltung","Logik","erweiterte Befehle","Fortschrittsberichte"],"pt":["Avalonia ViewModels","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","ViewModels em Avalonia","Gerenciamento de Navegação em Avalonia","Desenvolvimento de Aplicações Avalonia"],"ru":["Avalonia ViewModel","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","ViewModels в Avalonia","Управление навигацией в Avalonia","Разработка приложений Avalonia"],"ar":["نماذج العرض في Avalonia","Zafiro","ReactiveUI","نماذج العرض في تطبيقات Avalonia","إدارة الملاحة في Avalonia","تطوير تطبيقات Avalonia"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"avalonia-viewmodels-zafiro","description":"Optimal ViewModel and Wizard creation patterns for Avalonia using Zafiro and ReactiveUI.","bodyPreview":"# Avalonia ViewModels with Zafiro\n\nThis skill provides a set of best practices and patterns for creating ViewModels, Wizards, and managing navigation in Avalonia applications, leveraging the power of **ReactiveUI** and the **Zafiro** toolkit.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1.  **Functional-Reactive Approach**: Use ReactiveUI (`ReactiveObject`, `WhenAnyValue`, etc.) to handle state and logic.\n2.  **Enhanced Commands**: Utilize `IEnhancedCommand` for better command management, including progress reporting a","body":"# Avalonia ViewModels with Zafiro\n\nThis skill provides a set of best practices and patterns for creating ViewModels, Wizards, and managing navigation in Avalonia applications, leveraging the power of **ReactiveUI** and the **Zafiro** toolkit.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1.  **Functional-Reactive Approach**: Use ReactiveUI (`ReactiveObject`, `WhenAnyValue`, etc.) to handle state and logic.\n2.  **Enhanced Commands**: Utilize `IEnhancedCommand` for better command management, including progress reporting and name/text attributes.\n3.  **Wizard Pattern**: Implement complex flows using `SlimWizard` and `WizardBuilder` for a declarative and maintainable approach.\n4.  **Automatic Section Discovery**: Use the `[Section]` attribute to register and discover UI sections automatically.\n5.  **Clean Composition**: map ViewModels to Views using `DataTypeViewLocator` and manage dependencies in the `CompositionRoot`.\n\n## Guides\n\n- [ViewModels & Commands](viewmodels.md): Creating robust ViewModels and handling commands.\n- [Wizards & Flows](wizards.md): Building multi-step wizards with `SlimWizard`.\n- [Navigation & Sections](navigation_sections.md): Managing navigation and section-based UIs.\n- [Composition & Mapping](composition.md): Best practices for View-ViewModel wiring and DI.\n\n## Example Reference\n\nFor real-world implementations, refer to the **Angor** project:\n- `CreateProjectFlowV2.cs`: Excellent example of complex Wizard building.\n- `HomeViewModel.cs`: Simple section ViewModel using functional-reactive commands.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:39:25.304Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Desktop UI Agents leveraging Avalonia and ReactiveUI for advanced application development.","zh":"适用于使用Avalonia和ReactiveUI进行高级应用程序开发的桌面UI代理。","ja":"AvaloniaとReactiveUIを使用した高度なアプリケーション開発に適したデスクトップUIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Avalonia와 ReactiveUI를 사용한 고급 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 데스크톱 UI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de UI de Escritorio que utilizan Avalonia y ReactiveUI para el desarrollo de aplicaciones avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''interface utilisateur de bureau utilisant Avalonia et ReactiveUI pour le développement d''applications avancées.","de":"Ideal für Desktop-Benutzeroberflächen-Agents, die Avalonia und ReactiveUI für die Erstellung von fortschrittlichen Anwendungen nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de UI de Desktop que utilizam Avalonia e ReactiveUI para desenvolvimento de aplicativos avançados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интерфейса пользователя рабочего стола, использующих Avalonia и ReactiveUI для продвинутого разработки приложений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم سطح المكتب الذين يستفيدون من Avalonia و ReactiveUI لتطوير التطبيقات المتقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create robust ViewModels and Wizards, utilizing ReactiveUI''s ReactiveObject and WhenAnyValue for state management, and Zafiro''s toolkit for enhanced command management, including progress reporting and navigation.","zh":"赋予代理创建强大的ViewModel和向导的能力，利用ReactiveUI的ReactiveObject和WhenAnyValue进行状态管理，并使用Zafiro的工具包进行增强的命令管理，包括进度报告和导航。","ja":"ReactiveUIのReactiveObjectとWhenAnyValueを使用した状態管理、およびZafiroのツールキットを使用した高度なコマンド管理（進度報告やナビゲーションを含む）により、エージェントが強健なViewModelとウィザードを作成できるようにします。","ko":"ReactiveUI의 ReactiveObject와 WhenAnyValue를 사용한 상태 관리 및 Zafiro의 툴킷을 사용한 향상된 명령어 관리(진행 상황 보고 및 탐색 포함)를 통해 에이전트가 강력한 ViewModel 및 마법사를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ViewModels y Wizards robustos, utilizando ReactiveObject y WhenAnyValue de ReactiveUI para la gestión de estado, y la herramienta Zafiro para una gestión de comandos mejorada, incluyendo informes de progreso y navegación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des ViewModels et des Wizards robustes, en utilisant ReactiveObject et WhenAnyValue de ReactiveUI pour la gestion d''état, et la boîte à outils Zafiro pour une gestion de commandes améliorée, y compris les rapports de progrès et la navigation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, robuste ViewModels und Wizards zu erstellen, indem sie ReactiveObject und WhenAnyValue von ReactiveUI für die Zustandsverwaltung und das Zafiro-Toolkit für eine verbesserte Befehlsverwaltung verwenden, einschließlich Fortschrittsberichte und Navigation.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem ViewModels e Wizards robustos, utilizando o ReactiveObject e o WhenAnyValue do ReactiveUI para gerenciamento de estado, e a toolkit do Zafiro para gerenciamento de comandos aprimorado, incluindo relatórios de progresso e navegação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать прочные ViewModels и Wizards, используя ReactiveObject и WhenAnyValue из ReactiveUI для управления состоянием, и набор инструментов Zafiro для расширенного управления командами, включая отчеты о прогрессе и навигации.","ar":"يمكن العميل من إنشاء نماذج عرض ووصفات ساحرة قوية، باستخدام كائن التفاعل و WhenAnyValue من ReactiveUI لإدارة الحالة، وعمليات Zafiro المُحسنة لتحسين إدارة الأوامر، بما في ذلك تقارير التقدم والملاحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Functional-Reactive Approaches in Avalonia applications","Managing navigation and command execution with IEnhancedCommand","Developing wizards with ReactiveUI and Zafiro"],"zh":["在Avalonia应用程序中实现函数响应式方法","使用IEnhancedCommand管理导航和命令执行","使用ReactiveUI和Zafiro开发向导"],"ja":["Avaloniaアプリケーションで関数反応アプローチを実装する","IEnhancedCommandを使用したナビゲーションとコマンドの実行の管理","ReactiveUIとZafiroを使用したウィザードの開発"],"ko":["Avalonia 애플리케이션에서 함수 반응형 접근 방식을 구현하는 것","IEnhancedCommand를 사용한 탐색 및 명령어 실행 관리","ReactiveUI 및 Zafiro를 사용한 마법사 개발"],"es":["Implementar enfoques funcionales-reactivos en aplicaciones Avalonia","Gestionar la navegación y la ejecución de comandos con IEnhancedCommand","Desarrollar wizards con ReactiveUI y Zafiro"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des approches fonctionnelles-réactives dans les applications Avalonia","Gérer la navigation et l''exécution de commandes avec IEnhancedCommand","Développer des wizards avec ReactiveUI et Zafiro"],"de":["Funktionsreaktive Ansätze in Avalonia-Anwendungen implementieren","Navigation und Befehlsausführung mit IEnhancedCommand verwalten","Wizards mit ReactiveUI und Zafiro entwickeln"],"pt":["Implementação de Abordagens Funcionais-Reativas em aplicações Avalonia","Gerenciamento de navegação e execução de comandos com IEnhancedCommand","Desenvolvimento de wizards com ReactiveUI e Zafiro"],"ru":["Реализация функционально-реактивных подходов в приложениях Avalonia","Управление навигацией и выполнением команд с помощью IEnhancedCommand","Разработка мастеров с помощью ReactiveUI и Zafiro"],"ar":["تنفيذ النهج الوظيفي-التفاعلي في تطبيقات Avalonia","إدارة الملاحة وتشغيل الأوامر باستخدام IEnhancedCommand","تطوير الوصفات الساحرة باستخدام ReactiveUI و Zafiro"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Avalonia and ReactiveUI","Dependent on Zafiro toolkit","Avalonia-specific, may not be compatible with other UI frameworks"],"zh":["需要Avalonia和ReactiveUI的知识","依赖于Zafiro工具包","特定于Avalonia，可能与其他UI框架不兼容"],"ja":["AvaloniaとReactiveUIの知識が必要","Zafiroツールキットに依存している","Avalonia固有のため、他のUIフレームワークと互換性がなくなる可能性がある"],"ko":["Avalonia 및 ReactiveUI에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","Zafiro 툴킷에 의존합니다","Avalonia 전용으로, 다른 UI 프레임워크와 호환되지 않을 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Avalonia y ReactiveUI","Dependiente de la herramienta Zafiro","Específico de Avalonia, puede que no sea compatible con otros marcos de UI"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Avalonia et ReactiveUI","Dépend de la boîte à outils Zafiro","Spécifique à Avalonia, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres cadres d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Avalonia und ReactiveUI","Abhängig von dem Zafiro-Toolkit","Avalonia-spezifisch, kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen Benutzeroberflächen-Frameworks kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Avalonia e ReactiveUI","Dependente da toolkit do Zafiro","Específico do Avalonia, pode não ser compatível com outros frameworks de UI"],"ru":["Требует знания Avalonia и ReactiveUI","Зависит от набора инструментов Zafiro","Специфичен для Avalonia, может быть несовместим с другими фреймворками интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Avalonia و ReactiveUI","يعتمد على أدوات Zafiro","خاص بسطح المكتب Avalonia، قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع إطارات واجهة المستخدم الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
