帮助开发者提高脚本编写效率","ja":"この記事では、PowerShell Windows の重要なパターンと落とし穴について説明し、開発者がスクリプトの作成効率を向上させるのに役立ちます","ko":"이 문서는 PowerShell Windows의 중요한 패턴과 함정을介绍하여 개발자가 스크립트 작성 효율성을 높일 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"Conoce los patrones críticos y errores comunes en PowerShell para Windows, incluyendo reglas de sintaxis y restricciones de Unicode.","fr":"Découvrez les modèles critiques et les erreurs courantes dans PowerShell pour Windows, y compris les règles de syntaxe et les restrictions d''Unicode.","de":"Erfahren Sie mehr über die kritischen Muster und häufigen Fehler in PowerShell für Windows, einschließlich Syntaxregeln und Unicode-Einschränkungen.","pt":"O PowerShell no Windows apresenta padrões e armadilhas específicas que devem ser compreendidas para um desenvolvimento eficaz.","ru":"PowerShell в Windows имеет специфические шаблоны и ловушки, которые необходимо понимать для эффективного развития.","ar":"يتميز PowerShell على نظام التشغيل Windows bằng أنماط وألغام محددة يجب فهمها من أجل التطوير الفعال.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["操作符语法规则","Unicode 和 Emoji 限制","逻辑运算符的使用","cmdlet 调用的括号要求","脚本编写最佳实践"],"ja":["演算子シンタックスルール","Unicode と Emoji の制限","論理演算子の使用","コマンドレット呼び出しの括弧要件","スクリプトの作成ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["연산자 구문 규칙","유니코드 및 이모티콘 제한","논리 연산자의 사용","cmdlet 호출의 괄호 요구","스크립트 작성 모범 사례"],"es":["Reglas de sintaxis para operadores lógicos","Restricciones de Unicode y emojis","Patrones críticos para evitar errores comunes","Consejos para una mejor experiencia de desarrollo","Ejemplos de código para ilustrar conceptos clave"],"fr":["Règles de syntaxe pour les opérateurs logiques","Restrictions d''Unicode et d''émoticônes","Modèles critiques pour éviter les erreurs courantes","Conseils pour une meilleure expérience de développement","Exemples de code pour illustrer les concepts clés"],"de":["Syntaxregeln für logische Operatoren","Unicode- und Emoticon-Einschränkungen","Kritische Muster zur Vermeidung häufiger Fehler","Tipps für eine bessere Entwicklungserfahrung","Codebeispiele zur Veranschaulichung wichtiger Konzepte"],"pt":["Regras de sintaxe de operadores","Restrições de Unicode e emojis","Uso de parênteses em chamadas de cmdlets","Padrões críticos para desenvolvimento eficaz","Melhores práticas para evitar erros comuns"],"ru":["Правила синтаксиса операторов","Ограничения Юникода и эмодзи","Использование скобок в вызовах cmdlet","Критические шаблоны для эффективного развития","Лучшие практики для избежания распространенных ошибок"],"ar":["قواعد بناء الجملة للمشغلين","قيود اليونيكود والأشكال التعبيرية","استخدام الأقواس في استدعاءات cmdlet","أنماط حرجة لتطوير فعال","أفضل الممارسات لتجنب الأخطاء الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PowerShell Windows","脚本语言","自动化","Windows 系统","管理任务","操作符语法","Unicode 限制"],"ja":["PowerShell Windows","スクリプト言語","自動化","Windows システム","管理タスク","演算子シンタックス","Unicode 制限"],"ko":["PowerShell Windows","스크립트 언어","자동화","Windows 시스템","관리 작업","연산자 구문","유니코드 제한"],"es":["PowerShell","Windows","patrones de código","errores comunes","desarrollo de software","scripting","administración de sistemas","Unicode","operadores lógicos"],"fr":["PowerShell","Windows","modèles de code","erreurs courantes","développement de logiciels","scripting","administration des systèmes","Unicode","opérateurs logiques"],"de":["PowerShell","Windows","Code-Muster","häufige Fehler","Software-Entwicklung","Skripting","Systemverwaltung","Unicode","logische Operatoren"],"pt":["PowerShell no Windows","Desenvolvimento de PowerShell","Padrões de PowerShell","Armadilhas de PowerShell","Regras de sintaxe de operadores","Restrições de Unicode"],"ru":["PowerShell в Windows","Разработка на PowerShell","Шаблоны PowerShell","Ловушки PowerShell","Правила синтаксиса операторов","Ограничения Юникода"],"ar":["PowerShell على نظام التشغيل Windows","تطوير PowerShell","أنماط PowerShell","ألغام PowerShell","قواعد بناء الجملة للمشغلين","قيود اليونيكود"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"powershell-windows","description":"PowerShell Windows patterns. Critical pitfalls, operator syntax, error handling.","bodyPreview":"# PowerShell Windows Patterns\n\n> Critical patterns and pitfalls for Windows PowerShell.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Operator Syntax Rules\n\n### CRITICAL: Parentheses Required\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `if (Test-Path \"a\" -or Test-Path \"b\")` | `if ((Test-Path \"a\") -or (Test-Path \"b\"))` |\n| `if (Get-Item $x -and $y -eq 5)` | `if ((Get-Item $x) -and ($y -eq 5))` |\n\n**Rule:** Each cmdlet call MUST be in parentheses when using logical operators.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Unicode/Emoji Restriction\n\n### CRIT","body":"# PowerShell Windows Patterns\n\n> Critical patterns and pitfalls for Windows PowerShell.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Operator Syntax Rules\n\n### CRITICAL: Parentheses Required\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `if (Test-Path \"a\" -or Test-Path \"b\")` | `if ((Test-Path \"a\") -or (Test-Path \"b\"))` |\n| `if (Get-Item $x -and $y -eq 5)` | `if ((Get-Item $x) -and ($y -eq 5))` |\n\n**Rule:** Each cmdlet call MUST be in parentheses when using logical operators.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Unicode/Emoji Restriction\n\n### CRITICAL: No Unicode in Scripts\n\n| Purpose | ❌ Don''t Use | ✅ Use |\n|---------|-------------|--------|\n| Success | ✅ ✓ | [OK] [+] |\n| Error | ❌ ✗ 🔴 | [!] [X] |\n| Warning | ⚠️ 🟡 | [*] [WARN] |\n| Info | ℹ️ 🔵 | [i] [INFO] |\n| Progress | ⏳ | [...] |\n\n**Rule:** Use ASCII characters only in PowerShell scripts.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Null Check Patterns\n\n### Always Check Before Access\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `$array.Count -gt 0` | `$array -and $array.Count -gt 0` |\n| `$text.Length` | `if ($text) { $text.Length }` |\n\n---\n\n## 4. String Interpolation\n\n### Complex Expressions\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `\"Value: $($obj.prop.sub)\"` | Store in variable first |\n\n**Pattern:**\n```\n$value = $obj.prop.sub\nWrite-Output \"Value: $value\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Error Handling\n\n### ErrorActionPreference\n\n| Value | Use |\n|-------|-----|\n| Stop | Development (fail fast) |\n| Continue | Production scripts |\n| SilentlyContinue | When errors expected |\n\n### Try/Catch Pattern\n\n- Don''t return inside try block\n- Use finally for cleanup\n- Return after try/catch\n\n---\n\n## 6. File Paths\n\n### Windows Path Rules\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Literal path | `C:\\Users\\User\\file.txt` |\n| Variable path | `Join-Path $env:USERPROFILE \"file.txt\"` |\n| Relative | `Join-Path $ScriptDir \"data\"` |\n\n**Rule:** Use Join-Path for cross-platform safety.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Array Operations\n\n### Correct Patterns\n\n| Operation | Syntax |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Empty array | `$array = @()` |\n| Add item | `$array += $item` |\n| ArrayList add | `$list.Add($item) | Out-Null` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. JSON Operations\n\n### CRITICAL: Depth Parameter\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `ConvertTo-Json` | `ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10` |\n\n**Rule:** Always specify `-Depth` for nested objects.\n\n### File Operations\n\n| Operation | Pattern |\n|-----------|---------|\n| Read | `Get-Content \"file.json\" -Raw | ConvertFrom-Json` |\n| Write | `$data | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10 | Out-File \"file.json\" -Encoding UTF8` |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Common Errors\n\n| Error Message | Cause | Fix |\n|---------------|-------|-----|\n| \"parameter ''or''\" | Missing parentheses | Wrap cmdlets in () |\n| \"Unexpected token\" | Unicode character | Use ASCII only |\n| \"Cannot find property\" | Null object | Check null first |\n| \"Cannot convert\" | Type mismatch | Use .ToString() |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Script Template\n\n```powershell\n# Strict mode\nSet-StrictMode -Version Latest\n$ErrorActionPreference = \"Continue\"\n\n# Paths\n$ScriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Path\n\n# Main\ntry {\n    # Logic here\n    Write-Output \"[OK] Done\"\n    exit 0\n}\ncatch {\n    Write-Warning \"Error: $_\"\n    exit 1\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** PowerShell has unique syntax rules. Parentheses, ASCII-only, and null checks are non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:38:58.923Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for System Administration Agents requiring advanced Windows PowerShell scripting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Windows PowerShell脚本编写能力的系统管理员代理。","ja":"Windows PowerShellスクリプトの高度な機能を必要とするシステム管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Windows PowerShell 스크립팅 기능이 필요한 시스템 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de administración de sistemas que requieren capacidades de scripting avanzadas de Windows PowerShell.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''administration système nécessitant des capacités de scripting avancées de Windows PowerShell.","de":"Perfekt für Systemadministration-Agenten, die erweiterte Windows PowerShell-Scripting-Fähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Administração de Sistema que exigem capacidades avançadas de script em Windows PowerShell.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов системного администрирования, требующих расширенных возможностей скриптинга Windows PowerShell.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل إدارة النظام التي تتطلب khảيات متقدمة لبرمجة نصية في Windows PowerShell."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust PowerShell scripts using critical patterns and pitfalls, including proper operator syntax rules and Unicode/Emoji restrictions, ensuring reliable automation of Windows tasks.","zh":"赋予代理编写使用关键模式和陷阱的强健PowerShell脚本的能力，包括适当的运算符语法规则和Unicode/Emoji限制，确保Windows任务的可靠自动化。","ja":"エージェントが重要なパターンと落とし穴を使用して堅牢なPowerShellスクリプトを書くことができるようにし、適切な演算子構文規則とUnicode/Emoji制限を含む、Windowsタスクの信頼性の高い自動化を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 중요 패턴 및 함정 등을 사용하여 강력한 PowerShell 스크립트를 작성할 수 있도록 하며, 적절한 연산자 구문 규칙 및 유니코드/이모티콘 제한 등을 포함하여 윈도우 태스크의 안정적인 자동화를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir scripts de PowerShell robustos utilizando patrones y trampas críticas, incluyendo reglas de sintaxis de operadores adecuadas y restricciones de Unicode/Emoji, lo que garantiza la automatización confiable de tareas de Windows.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des scripts PowerShell robustes en utilisant des modèles et des pièges critiques, notamment des règles de syntaxe d''opérateurs appropriées et des restrictions Unicode/Emoji, garantissant ainsi l''automatisation fiable des tâches Windows.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, robuste PowerShell-Skripte unter Verwendung kritischer Muster und Fallstricke zu schreiben, einschließlich geeigneter Operator-Syntaxregeln und Unicode/Emoji-Einschränkungen, um so eine zuverlässige Automatisierung von Windows-Aufgaben zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever scripts PowerShell robustos utilizando padrões críticos e armadilhas, incluindo regras de sintaxe de operador adequadas e restrições de Unicode/Emoji, garantindo automação confiável de tarefas do Windows.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать прочные скрипты PowerShell, используя критические шаблоны и ловушки, включая правильные правила синтаксиса операторов и ограничения Unicode/Emoji, обеспечивая надежную автоматизацию задач Windows.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على كتابة نصوص برمجة PowerShell قوية باستخدام أنماط حرجة وفخاخ، بما في ذلك قواعد بنية المشغل الصحيحة وقيود اليونيكود/الرسوم التعبيرية، مما يضمن تلقائية موثوقة لمهام نظام التشغيل Windows."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex PowerShell scripts","Automating Windows system administration tasks","Optimizing PowerShell command performance"],"zh":["调试复杂的PowerShell脚本","自动化Windows系统管理任务","优化PowerShell命令性能"],"ja":["複雑なPowerShellスクリプトのデバッグ","Windowsシステム管理タスクの自動化","PowerShellコマンドのパフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["복잡한 PowerShell 스크립트 디버깅","윈도우 시스템 관리 태스크 자동화","PowerShell 명령어 성능 최적화"],"es":["Depuración de scripts de PowerShell complejos","Automatización de tareas de administración de sistemas de Windows","Optimización del rendimiento de comandos de PowerShell"],"fr":["Débogage de scripts PowerShell complexes","Automatisation des tâches d''administration système Windows","Optimisation des performances des commandes PowerShell"],"de":["Debuggen komplexer PowerShell-Skripte","Automatisierung von Windows-Systemadministrationsaufgaben","Optimierung der Leistung von PowerShell-Befehlen"],"pt":["Depuração de scripts PowerShell complexos","Automatização de tarefas de administração do sistema Windows","Otimização do desempenho do comando PowerShell"],"ru":["Отладка сложных скриптов PowerShell","Автоматизация задач системного администрирования Windows","Оптимизация производительности команд PowerShell"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء نصوص برمجة PowerShell المعقدة","أتمتة مهام إدارة نظام التشغيل Windows","تحسين أداء أوامر PowerShell"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Windows environment","PowerShell compatibility required"],"zh":["需要Windows环境","需要PowerShell兼容性"],"ja":["Windows環境が必要","PowerShellの互換性が必要"],"ko":["윈도우 환경 필요","PowerShell 호환성 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Windows","Se requiere compatibilidad con PowerShell"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Windows","La compatibilité PowerShell est requise"],"de":["Benötigt Windows-Umgebung","PowerShell-Kompatibilität erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Windows","Compatibilidade com PowerShell necessária"],"ru":["Требует среды Windows","Требуется совместимость с PowerShell"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة نظام التشغيل Windows","مطلوب توافق مع PowerShell"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
