styles, restyling components, working with gradients, spacing, layout, flex, grid, responsive design, dark mode, colors, typography, or borders; or when the user mentions CSS, styling, classes, Tailwind, restyle, hero section, cards, buttons, or any visual/UI changes.","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<!-- CSS-First Config -->\n```css\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n```\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<!-- v4 Import Syntax -->\n```diff\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n```\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<!-- Gap Utilities -->\n```html\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<!-- Dark Mode -->\n```html\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<!-- Flexbox Layout -->\n```html\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<!-- Grid Layout -->\n```html\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:40:09.058Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Frontend Development Agents implementing responsive UI components with Tailwind CSS v4 patterns.","zh":"适用于使用 Tailwind CSS v4 模式实现响应式 UI 组件的前端开发代理。","ja":"Tailwind CSS v4 パターンを使用してレスポンシブ UI コンポーネントを実装するフロントエンド開発エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"Tailwind CSS v4 패턴을 사용하여 반응형 UI 구성 요소를 구현하는 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de desarrollo frontend que implementan componentes de interfaz de usuario responsivos con patrones de Tailwind CSS v4.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de développement frontend qui mettent en œuvre des composants d''interface utilisateur responsifs avec des modèles Tailwind CSS v4.","de":"Wesentlich für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die responsive UI-Komponenten mit Tailwind CSS v4-Mustern implementieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend que implementam componentes de UI responsivos com padrões do Tailwind CSS v4.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов разработки фронтенда, реализующих адаптивные компоненты пользовательского интерфейса с использованием шаблонов Tailwind CSS v4.","ar":"essential للوكلاء تطوير الواجهة الأمامية الذين ينفذون مكونات واجهة المستخدم ذات الاستجابة باستخدام أنماط Tailwind CSS v4."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to rapidly style HTML components using Tailwind CSS classes while maintaining project conventions. Provides direct access to responsive design implementation, dark mode configuration, and component pattern extraction through documented v4 patterns.","zh":"使代理能够快速使用 Tailwind CSS 类样式化 HTML 组件，同时保持项目约定。提供对响应式设计实现、暗黑模式配置和组件模式提取的直接访问，通过记录的 v4 模式。","ja":"エージェントが Tailwind CSS クラスを使用して HTML コンポーネントを迅速にスタイル設定できるようにし、プロジェクトの規約を維持します。ドキュメント化された v4 パターンを介して、レスポンシブ デザインの実装、ダーク モードの構成、およびコンポーネント パターンの抽出への直接アクセスを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 규칙을 유지하면서 Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 HTML 구성 요소를 신속하게 스타일링할 수 있도록 합니다. 문서화된 v4 패턴을 통해 반응형 디자인 구현, 다크 모드 구성 및 구성 요소 패턴 추출에 대한 직접적인 액세스를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes dar estilo rápidamente a componentes HTML utilizando clases de Tailwind CSS mientras mantienen las convenciones del proyecto. Proporciona acceso directo a la implementación de diseño responsivo, configuración de modo oscuro y extracción de patrones de componentes a través de patrones documentados v4.","fr":"Permet aux agents de styliser rapidement des composants HTML à l''aide de classes Tailwind CSS tout en maintenant les conventions de projet. Fournit un accès direct à la mise en œuvre de la conception réactive, à la configuration du mode sombre et à l''extraction de modèles de composants via des modèles v4 documentés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, HTML-Komponenten schnell mit Tailwind CSS-Klassen zu stylen, während die Projektkonventionen aufrechterhalten werden. Bietet direkten Zugriff auf die Implementierung responsiver Designs, die Konfiguration des Dunkelmodus und die Extraktion von Komponentenmustern durch dokumentierte v4-Muster.","pt":"Permite que os agentes estilizem rapidamente componentes HTML usando classes do Tailwind CSS, mantendo as convenções do projeto. Fornece acesso direto à implementação de design responsivo, configuração do modo escuro e extração de padrões de componentes por meio de padrões documentados v4.","ru":"Позволяет агентам быстро оформлять компоненты HTML с помощью классов Tailwind CSS, сохраняя при этом конвенции проекта. Предоставляет прямой доступ к реализации адаптивного дизайна, настройке темного режима и извлечению шаблонов компонентов через задокументированные шаблоны v4.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتوفير تنسيق سريع للمكونات HTML باستخدام فئات Tailwind CSS مع الحفاظ على اتفاقيات المشروع. يوفر وصولاً مباشراً إلى تنفيذ تصميم استجابي وتكوين وضع المظلمة واستخراج أنماط المكونات من خلال الأنماط الموثقة v4."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing responsive design breakpoints","Configuring dark mode theming systems","Extracting repeated patterns into reusable components","Debugging spacing and layout inconsistencies","Applying existing project Tailwind conventions"],"zh":["实现响应式设计断点","配置暗黑模式主题系统","提取重复模式到可复用组件","调试间距和布局不一致","应用现有的项目 Tailwind 约定"],"ja":["レスポンシブ デザインのブレーク ポイントの実装","ダーク モードのテーマ システムの構成","繰り返しのパターンを再利用可能なコンポーネントに抽出","スペースとレイアウトの不一致のデバッグ","既存のプロジェクト Tailwind 規約の適用"],"ko":["반응형 디자인 브레이크ポイント 구현","다크 모드 테마 시스템 구성","반복되는 패턴을 재사용 가능한 구성 요소로 추출","공간과 레이아웃의 불일치 디버깅","기존 프로젝트 Tailwind 규칙 적용"],"es":["Implementar puntos de interrupción de diseño responsivo","Configurar sistemas de temáticas de modo oscuro","Extraer patrones repetidos en componentes reutilizables","Depurar inconsistencias de espaciado y diseño","Aplicar convenciones de Tailwind existentes del proyecto"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des points d''arrêt de conception réactive","Configurer des systèmes de thèmes de mode sombre","Extraire des modèles répétitifs en composants réutilisables","Déboguer les incohérences d''espacement et de conception","Appliquer les conventions Tailwind existantes du projet"],"de":["Implementierung responsiver Design-Breakpoints","Konfiguration von Dunkelmodus-Theme-Systemen","Extraktion wiederholter Muster in wiederverwendbare Komponenten","Debuggen von Abstands- und Layout-Inkonsistenzen","Anwenden bestehender Projekt-Tailwind-Konventionen"],"pt":["Implementação de quebras de design responsivo","Configuração de sistemas de tema de modo escuro","Extração de padrões repetidos em componentes reutilizáveis","Depuração de inconsistências de espaçamento e layout","Aplicação de convenções de Tailwind existentes do projeto"],"ru":["Реализация адаптивного дизайна с точками разрыва","Настройка темного режима","Извлечение повторяющихся шаблонов в переиспользуемые компоненты","Отладка несоответствий пробелов и компоновки","Применение существующих конвенций Tailwind проекта"],"ar":["تنفيذ كسر تصميم استجابي","تكوين أنظمة موضوع وضع المظلمة","استخراج الأنماط المتكررة إلى مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تصحيح أخطاء عدم انتظام في المسافات والتنسيق","تطبيق اتفاقيات Tailwind الحالية للمشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Tailwind CSS project setup","Dependent on project-specific conventions","Needs HTML component structure access"],"zh":["需要现有的 Tailwind CSS 项目设置","依赖于项目特定的约定","需要 HTML 组件结构访问"],"ja":["既存の Tailwind CSS プロジェクト設定の必要性","プロジェクト固有の規約への依存","HTML コンポーネント構造へのアクセスの必要性"],"ko":["기존의 Tailwind CSS 프로젝트 설정 필요","프로젝트별 규약에 의존","HTML 구성 요소 구조에 대한 액세스 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto de Tailwind CSS existente","Dependiente de convenciones específicas del proyecto","Necesita acceso a la estructura de componentes HTML"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Tailwind CSS existante","Dépendante des conventions spécifiques au projet","Nécessite un accès à la structure de composant HTML"],"de":["Erfordert bestehende Tailwind CSS-Projektsetup","Abhängig von projektspezifischen Konventionen","Benötigt Zugriff auf die HTML-Komponentenstruktur"],"pt":["Exige configuração de projeto Tailwind CSS existente","Dependente de convenções específicas do projeto","Necessita acesso à estrutura de componente HTML"],"ru":["Требует наличия настроенного проекта Tailwind CSS","Зависит от проектных конвенций","Требует доступа к структуре компонента HTML"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Tailwind CSS موجود","يعتمد على اتفاقيات المشروع","يحتاج إلى وصول إلى هيكل مكون HTML"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
