:["Создание настраиваемых пользовательских интерфейсов","Разработка адаптивных проектов","Внедрение темного режима","Извлечение повторяющихся паттернов в компонентах","Отладка проблем с пространством или макетом"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تطوير مشاريع متجاوبة","تنفيذ الوضع الداكن","استخراج الأنماط المتكررة في المكونات","تصحيح أخطاء التبويب أو التصميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","响应式设计","CSS 框架","前端开发","用户界面","自定义组件"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","レスポンシブ デザイン","CSS フレームワーク","フロントエンド開発","ユーザー インターフェイス","カスタム コンポーネント"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","반응형 디자인","CSS 프레임워크","프론트엔드 개발","사용자 인터페이스","사용자 지정 컴포넌트"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","estilos CSS","diseño responsivo","modo oscuro","patrones reutilizables","depuración de espaciado","framework CSS"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","développement web","styles CSS","conception réactive","mode sombre","modèles réutilisables","débogage de l''espacement","framework CSS"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Webentwicklung","CSS-Styles","responsives Design","dunkles Design","wiederverwendbare Muster","Fehlerbehebung bei Abständen","CSS-Framework"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento web","interfaces de usuário","projeto responsivo","modo escuro","componentes reutilizáveis"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS","веб-разработка","пользовательские интерфейсы","адаптивный проект","темный режим","повторно используемые компоненты"],"ar":["تيلويند سي إس إس","تطوير ويب","واجهات مستخدم","مشروع متجاوب","الوضع الداكن","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]}},"owner":"MTS-Services","repo":"luisacuna_marketplace_laravel","repoPath":"MTS-Services/luisacuna_marketplace_laravel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss-development","description":"Styles applications using Tailwind CSS v4 utilities. Activates when adding styles, restyling components, working with gradients, spacing, layout, flex, grid, responsive design, dark mode, colors, typography, or borders; or when the user mentions CSS, styling, classes, Tailwind, restyle, hero section, cards, buttons, or any visual/UI changes.","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<!-- CSS-First Config -->\n```css\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n```\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<!-- v4 Import Syntax -->\n```diff\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n```\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<!-- Gap Utilities -->\n```html\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<!-- Dark Mode -->\n```html\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<!-- Flexbox Layout -->\n```html\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<!-- Grid Layout -->\n```html\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:39:52.829Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents focusing on responsive web development with Tailwind CSS","zh":"适合专注于使用 Tailwind CSS 进行响应式 Web 开发的前端代理","ja":"Tailwind CSS を使用したレスポンシブ Web 開発に焦点を当てたフロントエンド エージェントに最適","ko":"Tailwind CSS를 사용한 반응형 웹 개발에 중점을 둔 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes front-end que se centran en el desarrollo web responsivo con Tailwind CSS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend qui se concentrent sur le développement web réactif avec Tailwind CSS","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf responsives Webdesign mit Tailwind CSS konzentrieren","pt":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que se concentram no desenvolvimento web responsivo com Tailwind CSS","ru":"Идеально для агентов frontend, ориентированных на разработку адаптивного веб-дизайна с использованием Tailwind CSS","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يركز على تطوير الويب المتجاوب مع Tailwind CSS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently style HTML components using Tailwind CSS classes, facilitating responsive design, dark mode implementation, and debugging of spacing or layout issues with precise control over CSS patterns and documentation via `search-docs` for Tailwind CSS v4","zh":"使代理能够使用 Tailwind CSS 类高效地样式化 HTML 组件，从而促进响应式设计、暗黑模式实现以及使用 `search-docs` 对 CSS 模式和文档进行精确控制，以便调试间距或布局问题，适用于 Tailwind CSS v4","ja":"エージェントが Tailwind CSS クラスを使用して HTML コンポーネントを効率的にスタイル設定できるようにし、レスポンシブ デザイン、ダーク モードの実装、スペーシングまたはレイアウトの問題のデバッグを容易にし、`search-docs` を使用して CSS パターンとドキュメントを精密に制御できるようにし、Tailwind CSS v4 用","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 HTML 컴포넌트를 효율적으로 스타일링할 수 있도록 해주어 반응형 디자인, 다크 모드 구현 및 간격 또는 레이아웃 문제의 디버깅을 용이하게 하며 `search-docs`를 사용하여 CSS 패턴 및 문서를 정밀하게 제어할 수 있으며 Tailwind CSS v4용","es":"Permite a los agentes dar estilo a los componentes HTML de manera eficiente utilizando clases de Tailwind CSS, facilitando el diseño responsivo, la implementación del modo os