イピングツールです","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발은 자동 TS 유형 생성 및 Nuxt UI를 포함하는 빠른 프론트엔드 프로토 타이핑 도구입니다","es":"Tailwind CSS es una herramienta para el desarrollo frontend que permite una prototipación rápida y eficiente","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un outil pour le développement frontend qui permet une prototypage rapide et efficace","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Tool für die Frontend-Entwicklung, das eine schnelle und effiziente Prototypisierung ermöglicht","pt":"O Tailwind CSS é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento front-end que permite criar projetos personalizados e rápidos.","ru":"Tailwind CSS — это инструмент для разработки фронтенда, который позволяет создавать настраиваемые и быстрые проекты.","ar":"تايلويند سي اس اس هو أداة لتطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية التي تمكن من إنشاء مشاريع مخصصة وسريعة.","en":"This is a fully e2e typesafe starter kit with auto TS type generation and Nuxt UI for fast front-end prototyping"},"definition":{"en":"This is a fully e2e typesafe starter kit with auto TS type generation and Nuxt UI for fast front-end prototyping"},"features":{"zh":["自动TS类型生成","Nuxt UI集成","快速前端原型开发","响应式设计支持","暗黑模式支持"],"ja":["自動TSタイプ生成","Nuxt UI統合","高速なフロントエンドプロトタイピング","レスポンシブデザイン対応","ダークモード対応"],"ko":["자동 TS 유형 생성","Nuxt UI 통합","빠른 프론트엔드 프로토 타이핑","반응형 디자인 지원","다크 모드 지원"],"es":["Prototipado rápido con Nuxt UI","Generación automática de tipos TS","Diseño responsivo y personalizado","Implementación de modo oscuro","Depuración de espaciado y layout"],"fr":["Prototypage rapide avec Nuxt UI","Génération automatique de types TS","Conception responsives et personnalisées","Implémentation du mode sombre","Débogage de l''espacement et du layout"],"de":["Schnelles Prototyping mit Nuxt UI","Automatische Generierung von TS-Typen","Responsives und benutzerdefiniertes Design","Implementierung des Dunkelmodus","Fehlerbehebung von Abständen und Layout"],"pt":["Kit de inicialização com suporte a TypeScript","Geração automática de tipos TS","Interface do usuário Nuxt para prototipagem rápida","Suporte a design responsivo","Modo escuro implementado","Extração de padrões repetidos em componentes"],"ru":["Стартовый набор с поддержкой TypeScript","Автоматическая генерация типов TS","Интерфейс пользователя Nuxt для быстрой прототипизации","Поддержка адаптивного дизайна","Реализованный темный режим","Извлечение повторяющихся паттернов в компонентах"],"ar":["مجموعة بدء التشغيل بدعم لغة تا입 سكريبت","توليد تلقائي لأنواع تي إس","واجهة المستخدم نكست لأغراض التصميم السريع","دعم التصميم المتجاوب","تنفيذ وضع الظلام","استخراج الأنماط المكررة في المكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","前端开发","快速原型开发","自动TS类型生成","Nuxt UI","响应式设计","暗黑模式"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","フロントエンド開発","高速なプロトタイピング","自動TSタイプ生成","Nuxt UI","レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","프론트엔드 개발","빠른 프로토 타이핑","자동 TS 유형 생성","Nuxt UI","반응형 디자인","다크 모드"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","desarrollo frontend","prototipado rápido","diseño responsivo","modo oscuro","depuración de layout"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","développement frontend","prototypage rapide","conception responsives","mode sombre","débogage de layout"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Frontend-Entwicklung","schnelles Prototyping","responsives Design","Dunkelmodus","Fehlerbehebung von Layout"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS","Desenvolvimento front-end","Kit de inicialização","TypeScript","Nuxt","Design responsivo","Modo escuro"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS","Разработка фронтенда","Стартовый набор","TypeScript","Nuxt","Адаптивный дизайн","Темный режим"],"ar":["تايلويند سي اس اس","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","مجموعة بدء التشغيل","تا입 سكريبت","نكست","تصميم متجاوب","وضع الظلام"]}},"owner":"joshdonnell","repo":"laravel-starter-kit-vue","repoPath":"joshdonnell/laravel-starter-kit-vue","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss-development","description":"Styles applications using Tailwind CSS v4 utilities. Activates when adding styles, restyling components, working with gradients, spacing, layout, flex, grid, responsive design, dark mode, colors, typography, or borders; or when the user mentions CSS, styling, classes, Tailwind, restyle, hero section, cards, buttons, or any visual/UI changes.","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<!-- CSS-First Config -->\n```css\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n```\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<!-- v4 Import Syntax -->\n```diff\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n```\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<!-- Gap Utilities -->\n```html\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<!-- Dark Mode -->\n```html\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<!-- Flexbox Layout -->\n```html\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<!-- Grid Layout -->\n```html\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:40:17.519Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing rapid and responsive UI development with Tailwind CSS","zh":"非常适合需要快速响应的前端开发的前端代理，使用 Tailwind CSS 进行 UI 开发","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが迅速かつレスポンシブなUI開発を必要とする場合に最適です。Tailwind CSSを使用します","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 빠르고 반응형 UI 개발을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. 테일윈드 CSS를 사용합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan un desarrollo de interfaz de usuario rápido y receptivo con Tailwind CSS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''un développement d''interface utilisateur rapide et réactif avec Tailwind CSS","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine schnelle und responsive UI-Entwicklung mit Tailwind CSS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento de UI rápido e responsivo com Tailwind CSS","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуется быстрое и отзывчивое развитие UI с Tailwind CSS","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير واجهة مستخدم سريع ومتجاوب مع Tailwind CSS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to style HTML with Tailwind CSS classes, leveraging Nuxt UI for fast front-end prototyping and auto TS type generation for seamless development, including responsive design and dark mode implementation","zh":"赋予代理样式化 HTML 的能力，使用 Tailwind CSS 类，利用 Nuxt UI 进行快速的前端原型设计，并自动生成 TS 类型以实现无缝开发，包括响应式设计和暗黑模式实现","ja":"エージェントにHTMLをスタイリングする能力を与え、Tailwind CSSクラスを使用し、Nuxt UIを利用して高速なフロントエンドプロトタイピングを行い、自動的にTSタイプを生成して無駄のない開発を行うことを可能にします。レスポンシブデザインやダークモードの実装も含まれます","ko":"에이전트에게 HTML을 스타일링할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 테일윈드 CSS 클래스를 사용하고, 누스트 UI를 활용하여 빠른 프론트엔드 프로토 타이핑을进行하며, 자동으로 TS 타입을 생성하여 무결점 개발을 가능하게 합니다. 반응형 디자인 및 다크 모드 구현도 포함됩니다","es":"Permite a los agentes dar estilo a HTML con clases de Tailwind CSS, aprovechando Nuxt UI para una prototipación rápida de front-end y una generación automática de tipos TS para un desarrollo sin problemas, incluyendo diseño receptivo y implementación de modo oscuro","fr":"Permet aux agents de styler le HTML avec des classes Tailwind CSS, en exploitant Nuxt UI pour une prototypage rapide de front-end et une génération automatique de types TS pour un développement sans problème, y compris la conception réactive et la mise en œuvre du mode sombre","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, HTML mit Tailwind-CSS-Klassen zu stylen, indem Nuxt UI für eine schnelle Frontend-Prototypisierung und eine automatische TS-Typgenerierung für eine reibungslose Entwicklung genutzt wird, einschließlich responsivem Design und Dunkelmodus-Implementierung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estilizar o HTML com classes Tailwind CSS, aproveitando a Nuxt UI para prototipagem de front-end rápida e geração automática de tipos TS para desenvolvimento sem interrupções, incluindo design responsivo e implementação de modo escuro","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью стилизовать HTML с помощью классов Tailwind CSS, используя Nuxt UI для быстрой прототипизации фронтенда и автоматической генерации типов TS для бесперебойной разработки, включая адаптивный дизайн и реализацию темного режима","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تشكيل HTML باستخدام فئات Tailwind CSS، مستفيدين من Nuxt UI لتحقيق نمذجة واجهة المستخدم الأمامية السريعة وتوليد أنواع TS تلقائيًا من أجل تطوير دون انقطاع، بما في ذلك التصميم التفاعلي وتطبيق وضع الليل"},"useCases":{"en":["Styling components with Tailwind CSS classes","Implementing responsive design for mobile and desktop","Debugging spacing or layout issues with existing Tailwind conventions"],"zh":["使用 Tailwind CSS 类样式化组件","为移动设备和桌面设备实现响应式设计","使用现有的 Tailwind 约定调试间距或布局问题"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSクラスを使用してコンポーネントをスタイリングする","モバイルとデスクトップのレスポンシブデザインを実装する","既存のTailwind約定を使用してスペースやレイアウトの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["테일윈드 CSS 클래스를 사용하여 컴포넌트를 스타일링합니다","모바일 및 데스크톱의 반응형 디자인을 구현합니다","기존의 테일윈드 규약을 사용하여 여백 또는 레이아웃 문제를 디버깅합니다"],"es":["Estilizar componentes con clases de Tailwind CSS","Implementar diseño receptivo para móviles y de escritorio","Depurar problemas de espaciado o diseño con las convenciones de Tailwind existentes"],"fr":["Styler les composants avec des classes Tailwind CSS","Mettre en œuvre une conception réactive pour les appareils mobiles et de bureau","Déboguer les problèmes d''espacement ou de disposition avec les conventions Tailwind existantes"],"de":["Komponenten mit Tailwind-CSS-Klassen stylen","Responsives Design für Mobile und Desktop implementieren","Probleme mit Abständen oder Layout mit bestehenden Tailwind-Konventionen debuggen"],"pt":["Estilizar componentes com classes Tailwind CSS","Implementar design responsivo para dispositivos móveis e de mesa","Depurar problemas de espaçamento ou layout com convenções Tailwind existentes"],"ru":["Стилизация компонентов с помощью классов Tailwind CSS","Реализация адаптивного дизайна для мобильных и настольных устройств","Отладка проблем с пробелами или макетом с использованием существующих конвенций Tailwind"],"ar":["تلوين المكونات بفئات Tailwind CSS","تطبيق تصميم تفاعلي للهواتف المحمولة وأجهزة المكتب","تصحيح أخطاء المسافات أو تصميم الواجهة باستخدام الاتفاقيات الموجودة في Tailwind"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nuxt UI setup","Limited to Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation"],"zh":["需要 Nuxt UI 设置","仅限于 Tailwind CSS v4 模式和文档"],"ja":["Nuxt UIの設定が必要","Tailwind CSS v4のパターンとドキュメントに限定される"],"ko":["누스트 UI 설정이 필요합니다","테일윈드 CSS v4 패턴 및 문서에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Nuxt UI","Limitado a patrones y documentación de Tailwind CSS v4"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Nuxt UI","Limité aux modèles et à la documentation de Tailwind CSS v4"],"de":["Benötigt Nuxt-UI-Setup","Begrenzt auf Muster und Dokumentation von Tailwind CSS v4"],"pt":["Requer configuração da Nuxt UI","Limitado a padrões e documentação do Tailwind CSS v4"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Nuxt UI","Ограничен шаблонами и документацией Tailwind CSS v4"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Nuxt UI","محدود بنماذج وثائق Tailwind CSS v4"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
