entes","Requiere registro de BSP previo","Soporte para Cursor IDE","Herramienta integral para el desarrollo de 1C:Enterprise"],"fr":["Ajoute des commandes aux fonctions de traitement de données externes","Génère des gestionnaires correspondants","Requiert un enregistrement BSP préalable","Prise en charge de Cursor IDE","Outil complet pour le développement 1C : Enterprise"],"de":["Fügt Befehle zu Funktionen für die Verarbeitung externer Daten hinzu","Generiert entsprechende Handler","Erfordert vorherige BSP-Registrierung","Unterstützung für Cursor IDE","Umfassendes Tool für die Entwicklung von 1C:Enterprise"],"pt":["Adiciona comandos SSL","Gera manipuladores correspondentes","Requer registro BSP prévio","Suporta desenvolvimento em Cursor IDE","Fornece ferramentas de desenvolvimento 1C:Enterprise"],"ru":["Добавляет команды SSL","Генерирует соответствующие обработчики","Требует предварительной регистрации BSP","Поддерживает разработку в Cursor IDE","Предоставляет инструменты для разработки 1C:Enterprise"],"ar":["تضيف أوامر SSL","توليد معالجات متوافقة","تتطلب تسجيل BSP مسبقا","تدعم برمجة في Cursor IDE","توفر أدوات لبرمجة 1C:Enterprise"]},"keywords":{"zh":["1C BSP 命令","SSL 命令","1C:Enterprise 开发","Cursor IDE","处理程序生成","命令行工具","开发工具","1C BSP 工具包"],"ja":["1C BSP コマンド","SSL コマンド","1C:Enterprise 開発","Cursor IDE","ハンドラー生成","コマンドライン ツール","開発ツール","1C BSP ツールキット"],"ko":["1C BSP 명령","SSL 명령","1C:Enterprise 개발","Cursor IDE","처리기 생성","명령줄 툴","개발 툴","1C BSP 툴킷"],"es":["1c-bsp-command","desarrollo de 1C:Enterprise","Cursor IDE","herramientas de desarrollo","agentes de IA","procesamiento de datos externos","registro de BSP"],"fr":["1c-bsp-command","développement 1C : Enterprise","Cursor IDE","outils de développement","agents d''IA","traitement de données externes","enregistrement BSP"],"de":["1c-bsp-command","Entwicklung von 1C:Enterprise","Cursor IDE","Entwicklungstools","KI-Agents","Verarbeitung externer Daten","BSP-Registrierung"],"pt":["1c-bsp-command","desenvolvimento 1C:Enterprise","comandos SSL","Cursor IDE","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","registro BSP"],"ru":["1c-bsp-command","разработка 1C:Enterprise","команды SSL","Cursor IDE","инструменты разработки","регистрация BSP"],"ar":["1c-bsp-command","برمجة 1C:Enterprise","أوامر SSL","Cursor IDE","أدوات برمجة","تسجيل BSP"]}},"owner":"Jefest9988","repo":"1c-ai-development-kit","repoPath":"Jefest9988/1c-ai-development-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"1c-bsp-command","description":"Add a command to an SSL/BSP-registered data processor. Use when adding new commands to ExternalDataProcessorInfo() in the object module.","bodyPreview":"# 1C BSP Command — Add SSL Command\n\nAdds a command to an existing `ExternalDataProcessorInfo()` function and generates the corresponding handler.\n\nThe data processor must be initialized with BSP registration first (see `1c-bsp-registration` skill).\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n1c-bsp-command <ProcessorName> <Identifier> [CommandType] [Presentation]\n```\n\n| Parameter | Required | Default | Description |\n|-----------|:--------:|---------|-------------|\n| ProcessorName | yes | — | Processor name |\n| Identifier |","body":"# 1C BSP Command — Add SSL Command\n\nAdds a command to an existing `ExternalDataProcessorInfo()` function and generates the corresponding handler.\n\nThe data processor must be initialized with BSP registration first (see `1c-bsp-registration` skill).\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n1c-bsp-command <ProcessorName> <Identifier> [CommandType] [Presentation]\n```\n\n| Parameter | Required | Default | Description |\n|-----------|:--------:|---------|-------------|\n| ProcessorName | yes | — | Processor name |\n| Identifier | yes | — | Internal command name (Latin characters) |\n| CommandType | no | from processor kind | Command launch type (see mapping below) |\n| Presentation | no | = Identifier | Display name for the user |\n| SrcDir | no | `src` | Source directory |\n\n## Command Type Mapping\n\nUser may specify type in free form:\n\n| User Input | Command Type |\n|------------|-------------|\n| open form, form | `CommandTypeOpenForm()` |\n| client method, on client | `CommandTypeClientMethodCall()` |\n| server method, on server | `CommandTypeServerMethodCall()` |\n| form filling, fill form | `CommandTypeFormFilling()` |\n| scenario, safe mode | `CommandTypeScenarioInSafeMode()` |\n\nIf user does not specify — determine from processor kind in existing `ExternalDataProcessorInfo()` code:\n\n| Processor Kind (from code) | Default Command Type |\n|---------------------------|---------------------|\n| AdditionalDataProcessor | `CommandTypeOpenForm()` |\n| AdditionalReport | `CommandTypeOpenForm()` |\n| ObjectFilling | `CommandTypeServerMethodCall()` |\n| Report | `CommandTypeOpenForm()` |\n| PrintForm | `CommandTypeServerMethodCall()` |\n| RelatedObjectCreation | `CommandTypeServerMethodCall()` |\n\n## Command Addition Template\n\nInsert in `ExternalDataProcessorInfo()` **before** the `Return RegistrationParameters` line:\n\n```bsl\n\tNewCommand = RegistrationParameters.Commands.Add();\n\tNewCommand.Presentation        = NStr(\"en = ''{{Presentation}}''\");\n\tNewCommand.ID                  = \"{{Identifier}}\";\n\tNewCommand.Use                 = AdditionalReportsAndDataProcessorsClientServer.{{CommandType}};\n\tNewCommand.ShowNotification    = False;\n```\n\nFor print forms (ProcessorKindPrintForm) also add:\n\n```bsl\n\tNewCommand.Modifier = \"PrintMXL\";\n```\n\nNote: unlike the first command (from `1c-bsp-registration`), additional commands use string literals `NStr(\"en = ''...''\")` for presentation and a string for ID, not `Metadata()`.\n\n## Handler Templates\n\n### ServerMethodCall — handler already exists\n\nIf `ExecuteCommand` procedure already exists in the object module, add a branch before `EndIf`:\n\n```bsl\n\tElsIf CommandID = \"{{Identifier}}\" Then\n\t\t// TODO: Implementation {{Identifier}}\n```\n\n### ServerMethodCall — no handler yet\n\nFor global processors (without `TargetObjects`):\n\n```bsl\nProcedure ExecuteCommand(CommandID, CommandExecutionParameters) Export\n\n\tIf CommandID = \"{{Identifier}}\" Then\n\t\t// TODO: Implementation {{Identifier}}\n\tEndIf;\n\nEndProcedure\n```\n\nFor assignable processors (with `TargetObjects`):\n\n```bsl\nProcedure ExecuteCommand(CommandID, TargetObjects, CommandExecutionParameters) Export\n\n\tIf CommandID = \"{{Identifier}}\" Then\n\t\t// TODO: Implementation {{Identifier}}\n\tEndIf;\n\nEndProcedure\n```\n\n### PrintForm — Print procedure already exists\n\nAdd block before `EndProcedure`:\n\n```bsl\n\tPrintForm = PrintManagement.PrintFormInfo(PrintFormsCollection, \"{{Identifier}}\");\n\tIf PrintForm <> Undefined Then\n\t\tPrintForm.SpreadsheetDocument = Generate{{Identifier}}(ObjectsArray, PrintObjects);\n\t\tPrintForm.TemplateSynonym = NStr(\"en = ''{{Presentation}}''\");\n\tEndIf;\n```\n\n### PrintForm — no Print procedure yet\n\n```bsl\nProcedure Print(ObjectsArray, PrintFormsCollection, PrintObjects, OutputParameters) Export\n\n\tPrintForm = PrintManagement.PrintFormInfo(PrintFormsCollection, \"{{Identifier}}\");\n\tIf PrintForm <> Undefined Then\n\t\tPrintForm.SpreadsheetDocument = Generate{{Identifier}}(ObjectsArray, PrintObjects);\n\t\tPrintForm.TemplateSynonym = NStr(\"en = ''{{Presentation}}''\");\n\tEndIf;\n\nEndProcedure\n```\n\n### ClientMethodCall\n\nAdded to **form module** (`Forms/<FormName>/Ext/Form/Module.bsl`):\n\nFor global processors:\n\n```bsl\n&AtClient\nProcedure ExecuteCommand(CommandID) Export\n\n\tIf CommandID = \"{{Identifier}}\" Then\n\t\t// TODO: Implementation {{Identifier}}\n\tEndIf;\n\nEndProcedure\n```\n\nFor assignable processors:\n\n```bsl\n&AtClient\nProcedure ExecuteCommand(CommandID, TargetObjectsArray) Export\n\n\tIf CommandID = \"{{Identifier}}\" Then\n\t\t// TODO: Implementation {{Identifier}}\n\tEndIf;\n\nEndProcedure\n```\n\nIf procedure already exists — add `ElsIf` branch.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Find and read `ObjectModule.bsl` via Glob: `src/{{ProcessorName}}/Ext/ObjectModule.bsl`\n2. Ensure `ExternalDataProcessorInfo()` exists. If not — suggest using `1c-bsp-registration` skill first\n3. Determine processor kind from existing code (find the line with `ProcessorKind...()`)\n4. Insert command block **before** `Return RegistrationParameters`\n5. Add handler:\n   - For server handlers — in `ObjectModule.bsl`, `PublicInterface` region\n   - For client handlers — in form module (find via Glob: `src/{{ProcessorName}}/Forms/*/Ext/Form/Module.bsl`)\n6. If handler (`ExecuteCommand` / `Print`) already exists — add branch, do not duplicate the procedure\n7. Use tabs for indentation\n\n## MCP Integration\n\nUse `ssl_search` MCP tool to verify SSL method names. Use `codesearch` to find existing handler patterns in the codebase.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:40:44.476Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 1C:Enterprise development agents needing advanced BSP command integration in Cursor IDE","zh":"非常适合需要在Cursor IDE中高级BSP命令集成的1C:Enterprise开发代理","ja":"Cursor IDEで高度なBSPコマンド統合を必要とする1C:Enterprise開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Cursor IDE에서 고급 BSP 명령 통합이 필요한 1C:Enterprise 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de 1C:Enterprise que necesitan una integración avanzada de comandos BSP en Cursor IDE","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement 1C:Enterprise ayant besoin d''une intégration avancée de commandes BSP dans Cursor IDE","de":"Perfekt für 1C:Enterprise-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine erweiterte BSP-Befehlsintegration in Cursor IDE benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento 1C:Enterprise que necessitam de integração avançada de comandos BSP no IDE Cursor","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки 1C:Enterprise, требующих расширенной интеграции команд BSP в IDE Cursor","ar":"مثالي لعمليات开发 1C:Enterprise التي تحتاج إلى تكامل متقدم لأوامر BSP في Cursor IDE"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate ExternalDataProcessorInfo handlers and add SSL commands using BSP registration, enhancing their 1C:Enterprise development capabilities with protocol-specific implementations","zh":"赋予代理生成ExternalDataProcessorInfo处理程序和使用BSP注册添加SSL命令的能力，增强他们的1C:Enterprise开发能力，采用特定协议的实现","ja":"エージェントにExternalDataProcessorInfoハンドラを生成し、BSP登録を使用してSSLコマンドを追加する能力を付与し、1C:Enterprise開発能力を向上させ、プロトコル固有の実装を採用","ko":"에이전트가 ExternalDataProcessorInfo 처리기를 생성하고 BSP 등록을 사용하여 SSL 명령을 추가할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 1C:Enterprise 개발 능력을 강화하고 프로토콜별 구현을 채택","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar controladores de ExternalDataProcessorInfo y agregar comandos SSL mediante el registro de BSP, mejorando sus capacidades de desarrollo de 1C:Enterprise con implementaciones específicas de protocolo","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des gestionnaires de ExternalDataProcessorInfo et d''ajouter des commandes SSL à l''aide de l''enregistrement BSP, améliorant ainsi leurs capacités de développement 1C:Enterprise avec des implémentations spécifiques au protocole","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ExternalDataProcessorInfo-Handler zu generieren und SSL-Befehle mithilfe der BSP-Registrierung hinzuzufügen, wodurch ihre 1C:Enterprise-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit protokollspezifischen Implementierungen verbessert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar manipuladores de ExternalDataProcessorInfo e adicionar comandos SSL usando o registro BSP, melhorando suas capacidades de desenvolvimento 1C:Enterprise com implementações específicas de protocolo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать обработчики ExternalDataProcessorInfo и добавлять команды SSL с помощью регистрации BSP, повышая их возможности разработки 1C:Enterprise с реализациями, специфичными для протокола","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توليد معالجات ExternalDataProcessorInfo وإضافة أوامر SSL باستخدام تسجيل BSP، وتحسين قدراتهم في تطوير 1C:Enterprise مع التنفيذات المحددة لبروتوكول"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating BSP command additions","Generating handler functions for ExternalDataProcessorInfo","Debugging 1C:Enterprise applications with improved SSL command support"],"zh":["自动化BSP命令添加","生成ExternalDataProcessorInfo处理程序","使用改进的SSL命令支持调试1C:Enterprise应用程序"],"ja":["BSPコマンドの追加を自動化","ExternalDataProcessorInfoハンドラを生成","改良されたSSLコマンドサポートを使用して1C:Enterpriseアプリケーションをデバッグ"],"ko":["BSP 명령 추가 자동화","ExternalDataProcessorInfo 처리기 생성","개선된 SSL 명령 지원을 사용하여 1C:Enterprise 애플리케이션 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de adiciones de comandos BSP","Generación de funciones de controlador para ExternalDataProcessorInfo","Depuración de aplicaciones 1C:Enterprise con una mejor compatibilidad de comandos SSL"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''ajout de commandes BSP","Génération de fonctions de gestionnaire pour ExternalDataProcessorInfo","Débogage d''applications 1C:Enterprise avec une meilleure prise en charge des commandes SSL"],"de":["Automatisierung von BSP-Befehlszusätzen","Generierung von Handler-Funktionen für ExternalDataProcessorInfo","Fehlersuche in 1C:Enterprise-Anwendungen mit verbesserter SSL-Befehlsunterstützung"],"pt":["Automatizar adições de comandos BSP","Gerar funções de manipulação para ExternalDataProcessorInfo","Depurar aplicativos 1C:Enterprise com suporte aprimorado de comandos SSL"],"ru":["Автоматизация добавления команд BSP","Генерация функций обработки для ExternalDataProcessorInfo","Отладка приложений 1C:Enterprise с улучшенной поддержкой команд SSL"],"ar":["أتمتة إضافات أوامر BSP","توليد دوال المعالجة لمعلومات معالج البيانات الخارجية","تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات 1C:Enterprise مع دعم محسّن لأوامر SSL"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires BSP registration initialization","Specific to 1C:Enterprise development in Cursor IDE"],"zh":["需要BSP注册初始化","特定于Cursor IDE中的1C:Enterprise开发"],"ja":["BSP登録初期化が必要","Cursor IDEでの1C:Enterprise開発に特有"],"ko":["BSP 등록 초기화 필요","Cursor IDE에서 1C:Enterprise 개발에 특정"],"es":["Requiere la inicialización de la registrazione de BSP","Específico para el desarrollo de 1C:Enterprise en Cursor IDE"],"fr":["Nécessite l''initialisation de l''enregistrement BSP","Spécifique au développement 1C:Enterprise dans Cursor IDE"],"de":["Erfordert die Initialisierung der BSP-Registrierung","Spezifisch für die 1C:Enterprise-Entwicklung in Cursor IDE"],"pt":["Requer inicialização de registro BSP","Específico para desenvolvimento 1C:Enterprise no IDE Cursor"],"ru":["Требует инициализации регистрации BSP","Специфично для разработки 1C:Enterprise в IDE Cursor"],"ar":["يتطلب تهيئة تسجيل BSP","محدد لتطوير 1C:Enterprise في Cursor IDE"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
