ntierung der Datenladung","Empfehlungen zur Optimierung der Ladezeit","Unterstützung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen","Wartung und Updates durch Vercel"],"pt":["57 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias para priorizar refatoração e geração de código","Guia para escrita de componentes React e páginas Next.js","Implementação de busca de dados cliente e servidor","Revisão de código para problemas de desempenho","Refatoração de código existente"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации рефакторинга и генерации кода","Руководство для написания компонентов React и страниц Next.js","Реализация поиска данных на стороне клиента и сервера","Проверка кода на наличие проблем с производительностью","Рефакторинг существующего кода"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات للترتيب الأولوي لتحسين وإنشاء الكود","دليل لكتابة مكونات React وصفحات Next.js","تنفيذ استرجاع البيانات على جانب العميل والخادم","مراجعة الكود ل مشاكل الأداء","إعادة هيكلة الكود الحالي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React最佳实践","Next.js优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成"],"ja":["Vercel React","Reactベストプラクティス","Next.js最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成"],"ko":["버셀 리액트","리액트 최적화","넥스트js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성"],"es":["React","Next.js","Vercel","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","desarrollo web","aplicaciones web","carga de datos","velocidad de carga"],"fr":["React","Next.js","Vercel","optimisation des performances","meilleures pratiques","développement web","applications web","chargement de données","vitesse de chargement"],"de":["React","Next.js","Vercel","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","Webentwicklung","Webanwendungen","Datenladung","Ladezeit"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","React","Melhores práticas","Guia de otimização","Desempenho de aplicativos"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","Next.js","Веб-разработка","React","Лучшие практики","Руководство по оптимизации","Производительность приложений"],"ar":["Vercel React","تحسين الأداء","Next.js","تطوير الويب","React","أفضل الممارسات","دليل تحسين","أداء التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"JeonB","repo":"hband-connect","repoPath":"JeonB/hband-connect","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:40:56.035Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js performance configuration.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 性能配置的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js のパフォーマンス設定を最適化する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 및 Next.js 성능 구성이 최적화된 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan una configuración de rendimiento optimizada para React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une configuration de performances optimisée pour React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine optimierte Leistungskonfiguration für React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de configuração de desempenho otimizada do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется оптимизированная конфигурация производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوين أداء محسّن ل React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 57 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别进行全面性能优化，包括使用 Vercel 指南的数据获取和包优化。","ja":"エージェントに React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって使用し、Vercel ガイドラインを使用したデータ取得とバンドル最適化を含む総合的なパフォーマンス最適化を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 React 컴포넌트 및 Next.js 페이지의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 해주며, Vercel 지침을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함하여 8개 범주에 걸쳐 57개의 규칙을 사용하여 종합적인 성능 최적화를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, aprovechando 57 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización de rendimiento integral, incluida la optimización de la recuperación de datos y la creación de paquetes utilizando las pautas de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 57 règles dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation des performances complète, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement en utilisant les directives Vercel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem es 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung nutzt, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung unter Verwendung der Vercel-Richtlinien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 57 regras em 8 categorias para otimização de desempenho abrangente, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando diretrizes do Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях для комплексной оптимизации производительности, включая оптимизацию получения данных и пакетирования с использованием рекомендаций Vercel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير تلقيني لإعادة بناء وإنشاء رمز للمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، مستخدماً 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الأداء الشامل، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحسين الحزمة باستخدام إرشادات Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components","Implementing efficient data fetching for client and server-side rendering","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance"],"zh":["自动优化新 React 组件的性能","为客户端和服务器端渲染实现高效的数据获取","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["新しい React コンポーネントのパフォーマンスを自動最適化する","クライアント側とサーバー側のレンダリングのために効率的なデータ取得を実装する","既存の React と Next.js コードをより良いパフォーマンスのためにリファクタリングする"],"ko":["새로운 React 컴포넌트의 성능을 자동으로 최적화하는 것","클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 렌더링을 위한 효율적인 데이터 가져오기 구현","기존의 React 및 Next.js 코드를 더 나은 성능을 위해 리팩토링하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para nuevos componentes de React","Implementar una recuperación de datos eficiente para el renderizado del lado del cliente y del servidor","Reestructurar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les nouveaux composants React","Mettre en œuvre une récupération de données efficace pour le rendu côté client et côté serveur","Réorganiser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für neue React-Komponenten","Effiziente Datenabfrage für Client- und Server-Seitige Rendering implementieren","Umbau des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para novos componentes React","Implementar busca de dados eficiente para renderização do lado do cliente e do servidor","Refatorar o código existente do React e Next.js para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для новых компонентов React","Реализовать эффективную загрузку данных для клиентской и серверной отрисовки","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["توفير تلقيني لتحسين الأداء لمكونات React الجديدة","تنفيذ استرجاع بيانات فعال للترسيم العميل والخادم","إعادة بناء رمز React و Next.js الحالي لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js project setup","Limited to Vercel''s performance optimization guidelines"],"zh":["需要 React 或 Next.js 项目设置","仅限于 Vercel 的性能优化指南"],"ja":["React または Next.js プロジェクト設定が必要","Vercel のパフォーマンス最適化ガイドラインに限定される"],"ko":["React 또는 Next.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요함","Vercel의 성능 최적화 지침에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de proyecto de React o Next.js","Limitado a las pautas de optimización de rendimiento de Vercel"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React ou Next.js","Limité aux directives d''optimisation des performances de Vercel"],"de":["Benötigt eine React- oder Next.js-Projektsetup","Begrenzt auf die Vercel-Leistungsoptimierungsrichtlinien"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto React ou Next.js","Limitado às diretrizes de otimização de desempenho do Vercel"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта React или Next.js","Ограничен рекомендациями по оптимизации производительности Vercel"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع React أو Next.js","محدود بإرشادات تحسين الأداء من Vercel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
