ente para aplicações React e Next.js, mantido pelo Vercel.","ru":"Полное руководство по оптимизации производительности для приложений React и Next.js, поддерживаемое Vercel.","ar":"دليل شامل لتحسين الأداء لتطبيقات ري액ت و نكست.جس، يتم صيانته من قبل فيرسيل.","en":"FediChess: The fediverse of chess. Decentralized P2P chess in the browser."},"definition":{"en":"FediChess: The fediverse of chess. Decentralized P2P chess in the browser."},"features":{"es":["57 reglas para optimizar el rendimiento","8 categorías para guiar la refactorización y generación de código","Priorización de reglas por impacto","Guía para la implementación de la búsqueda de datos","Optimización del rendimiento para React y Next.js"],"fr":["57 règles pour optimiser les performances","8 catégories pour guider la refactorisation et la génération de code","Priorisation des règles par impact","Guide pour la mise en œuvre de la recherche de données","Optimisation des performances pour React et Next.js"],"de":["57 Regeln zur Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien zur Steuerung der Refaktorisierung und Codegenerierung","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Auswirkung","Leitfaden für die Implementierung der Datenabfrage","Leistungsoptimierung für React und Next.js"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho para React e Next.js","57 regras em 8 categorias","Priorização de impacto para refatoração automática","Geração de código","Melhores práticas para escrita de componentes React","Otimização de bundles"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для React и Next.js","57 правил в 8 категориях","Приоритизация влияния для автоматической рефакторинга","Генерация кода","Лучшие практики для написания компонентов React","Оптимизация пакетов"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات ري액ت و نكست.جس","57 قاعدة في 8 فئات","التحديد الأولوي لتحسين التأثير للتحديث التلقائي","توليد الكود","أفضل الممارسات لكتابة مكونات ري액ت","تحسين الحزم"]},"keywords":{"es":["Vercel React","optimización del rendimiento","React","Next.js","mejores prácticas","desarrollo web","rendimiento de aplicaciones","refactorización de código"],"fr":["Vercel React","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","bonnes pratiques","développement web","performances des applications","refactorisation de code"],"de":["Vercel React","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Best-Practices","Webentwicklung","Leistung von Anwendungen","Code-Refaktorisierung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas React","Otimização de desempenho React","Next.js","React performance","Desenvolvimento web","Front-end","Back-end","Programação"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики React","Оптимизация производительности React","Next.js","React производительность","Веб-разработка","Фронтенд","Бэкенд","Программирование"],"ar":["ري액ت فيرسيل","أفضل الممارسات لري액ت","تحسين الأداء لري액ت","نكست.جس","أداء ري액ت","تطوير الويب","الواجهة الأمامية","الواجهة الخلفية","البرمجة"]}},"owner":"HKTITAN","repo":"FediChess","repoPath":"HKTITAN/FediChess","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:41:32.397Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents developing high-performance React and Next.js applications.","zh":"非常适合开发高性能React和Next.js应用的前端代理","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高性能のReactとNext.jsアプリケーションを開発するのに最適","ko":"고성능 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션을 개발하는 프런트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que desarrollan aplicaciones de alto rendimiento con React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui développent des applications haute performance avec React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die Hochleistungsanwendungen mit React und Next.js entwickeln.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Frontend que desenvolvem aplicações de alto desempenho em React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, разрабатывающих высокопроизводительные приложения React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يطورون تطبيقات عالية الأداء باستخدام React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React components and Next.js pages with automated refactoring and code generation, leveraging 57 rules across 8 categories for improved performance, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel''s best practices.","zh":"赋予代理优化React组件和Next.js页面的能力，通过自动重构和代码生成，利用57条规则跨8个类别来提高性能，包括使用Vercel最佳实践的数据获取和捆绑优化","ja":"エージェントにReactコンポーネントとNext.jsページを最適化する能力を与え、自動リファクタリングとコード生成を使用し、パフォーマンスの向上のために8つのカテゴリにわたる57のルールを活用し、Vercelのベストプラクティスを使用したデータ取得とバンドル最適化を含む","ko":"에이전트가 React 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지를 최적화할 수 있도록 하며, 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 통해 8개의 카테고리에 걸친 57개의 규칙을 활용하여 성능을 향상시키고, Vercel의 ベスト プラクティス 를 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los componentes de React y las páginas de Next.js con refactorización automatizada y generación de código, aprovechando 57 reglas en 8 categorías para mejorar el rendimiento, incluida la optimización de la recolección de datos y el empaquetado utilizando las mejores prácticas de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les composants React et les pages Next.js avec une refactorisation automatisée et une génération de code, en exploitant 57 règles dans 8 catégories pour améliorer les performances, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement en utilisant les meilleures pratiques de Vercel.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten mit automatisierter Refaktorierung und Codegenerierung zu optimieren, indem 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für verbesserte Leistung genutzt werden, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung unter Verwendung der Vercel-Best-Practices.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem componentes React e páginas Next.js com refatoração automatizada e geração de código, aproveitando 57 regras em 8 categorias para melhorar o desempenho, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando as melhores práticas do Vercel.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать компоненты React и страницы Next.js с помощью автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях для улучшения производительности, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и упаковки, используя лучшие практики Vercel.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تحسين مكونات React وصفحات Next.js من خلال إعادة هيكلة و生成 رمز آلي، مستفيداً من 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الأداء، بما في ذلك تحسين جلب البيانات وتنسيق الحزم باستخدام أفضل الممارسات من Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for React applications","Refactoring existing Next.js code for better performance","Implementing efficient data fetching strategies for client and server-side rendering"],"zh":["为React应用程序自动执行性能优化","重构现有的Next.js代码以获得更好的性能","为客户端和服务器端渲染实现高效的数据获取策略"],"ja":["Reactアプリケーションのパフォーマンス最適化を自動化する","既存のNext.jsコードを再構成してパフォーマンスを向上させる","クライアントサイドおよびサーバーサイドレンダリングのための効率的なデータ取得戦略を実装する"],"ko":["React 애플리케이션의 성능 최적화를 자동화","기존 Next.js 코드를 재구성하여 성능을 개선","클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 렌더링을 위한 효율적인 데이터 가져오기 전략을 구현"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para aplicaciones React","Refactorizar el código existente de Next.js para un mejor rendimiento","Implementar estrategias de recolección de datos eficientes para la representación del lado cliente y del servidor"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les applications React","Refactoriser le code existant de Next.js pour de meilleures performances","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de récupération de données efficaces pour le rendu côté client et côté serveur"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für React-Anwendungen","Refaktorisieren des bestehenden Next.js-Codes für bessere Leistung","Implementieren effizienter Datenabrustrategien für Client- und Server-Seitendarstellung"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para aplicações React","Refatorar o código existente do Next.js para melhor desempenho","Implementar estratégias de busca de dados eficientes para renderização do lado do cliente e do servidor"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для приложений React","Рефакторить существующий код Next.js для лучшей производительности","Реализовать эффективные стратегии извлечения данных для клиентской и серверной отрисовки"],"ar":["أتمتة تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React","إعادة هيكلة الكود الموجود ل Next.js لتحسين الأداء","تنفيذ استراتيجيات جلب بيانات فعالة لتحسين العرض على стор العميل والخادم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js project setup","Limited to JavaScript and React ecosystem"],"zh":["需要React或Next.js项目设置","仅限于JavaScript和React生态系统"],"ja":["ReactまたはNext.jsプロジェクトの設定が必要","JavaScriptとReactエコシステムのみに限定"],"ko":["React 또는 Next.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요","JavaScript 및 React 생태계에만 محدود"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto React o Next.js","Limitado al ecosistema de JavaScript y React"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React ou Next.js","Limité à l''écosystème JavaScript et React"],"de":["Benötigt eine React- oder Next.js-Projektsetup","Begrenzt auf das JavaScript- und React-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto React ou Next.js","Limitado ao ecossistema JavaScript e React"],"ru":["Требуется настройка проекта React или Next.js","Ограничен экосистемой JavaScript и React"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع React أو Next.js","محدود بنظام JavaScript و React"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
