ko":"Vercel React 최적화 가이드는 React와 Next.js 애플리케이션의 성능 최적화를 위한 종합 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"Guía completa de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React y Next.js en Vercel, con 57 reglas en 8 categorías","fr":"Guide complet d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React et Next.js sur Vercel, avec 57 règles dans 8 catégories","de":"Umfassender Leitfaden für die Leistungsoptimierung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen auf Vercel, mit 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien","pt":"Guia abrangente de otimização de desempenho para aplicações React e Next.js, mantido pela Vercel","ru":"Комплексное руководство по оптимизации производительности для приложений React и Next.js, поддерживаемое компанией Vercel","ar":"دليل شامل لتحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js، مدعوم من قبل شركة Vercel","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["57 条性能优化规则","8 个分类的优化建议","自动重构和代码生成","针对 React 和 Next.js 应用的优化","优化建议的优先级排序","全面性能优化指南"],"ja":["57 のパフォーマンス最適化ルール","8 つのカテゴリの最適化提案","自動リファクタリングとコード生成","React と Next.js アプリの最適化","最適化提案の優先順位付け","包括的なパフォーマンス最適化ガイド"],"ko":["57가지 성능 최적화 규칙","8개 분류의 최적화 제안","자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성","React와 Next.js 애플리케이션의 최적화","최적화 제안의 우선순위 정렬","종합 성능 최적화 가이드"],"es":["57 reglas de optimización en 8 categorías","Guía para la refactorización automática y la generación de código","Priorización de reglas por impacto en el rendimiento","Optimización de la recopilación de datos en el cliente y en el servidor","Mejora del rendimiento de los componentes de React y las páginas de Next.js"],"fr":["57 règles d''optimisation dans 8 catégories","Guide pour la refactorisation automatique et la génération de code","Priorisation des règles par impact sur les performances","Optimisation de la collecte de données sur le client et sur le serveur","Amélioration des performances des composants React et des pages Next.js"],"de":["57 Optimierungsregeln in 8 Kategorien","Leitfaden für die automatische Refaktorierung und Codegenerierung","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Leistungsimpact","Optimierung der Datenabfrage auf Client- und Server-Seite","Leistungsverbesserung von React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten"],"pt":["57 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias de otimização","Priorização de regras por impacto","Refatoração automática de código","Geração de código automatizada","Otimização de bundles"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий оптимизации","Приоритизация правил по воздействию","Автоматическая рефакторинг кода","Автоматическая генерация кода","Оптимизация пакетов"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحسين الأداء","ترتيب الأولويات للقواعد حسب التأثير","إعادة هيكلة التلقائية للرمز","توليد التلقائي للرمز","تحسين الحزم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 最佳实践","Next.js 性能优化","Vercel React","React 优化","Next.js 优化","性能优化规则","自动重构","代码生成"],"ja":["React ベストプラクティス","Next.js パフォーマンス最適化","Vercel React","React 最適化","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化ルール","自動リファクタリング","コード生成"],"ko":["React 최적화 가이드","Next.js 성능 최적화","Vercel React","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","성능 최적화 규칙","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성"],"es":["mejores prácticas de React","optimización de rendimiento en Vercel","React y Next.js","desarrollo de aplicaciones web","rendimiento de aplicaciones","optimización de código"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques React","optimisation des performances sur Vercel","React et Next.js","développement d''applications web","performances des applications","optimisation de code"],"de":["Best Practices für React","Leistungsoptimierung auf Vercel","React und Next.js","Webanwendungsentwicklung","Anwendungsleistung","Codeoptimierung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","Otimize o desempenho","Guia de otimização"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","Оптимизируйте производительность","Руководство по оптимизации"],"ar":["Vercel React","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","تطوير الويب","تحسين الأداء","دليل تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"3254954760","repo":"create-react-web","repoPath":"3254954760/create-react-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:41:06.613Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js performance tuning.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 性能的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js のパフォーマンス最適化が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Next.js의 성능 최적화를 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan una optimización del rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die eine Optimierung der Leistung von React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de ajuste de desempenho otimizado do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходима оптимизация производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى ضبط أداء محسّن لReact و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 57 rules across 8 categories to prioritize impact, and optimizing bundling for better performance, all while utilizing Vercel''s maintained guidelines for data fetching and server-side rendering.","zh":"赋予代理人自动重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别来优先考虑影响，并优化捆绑以提高性能，同时利用 Vercel 的维护指南进行数据获取和服务器端渲染。","ja":"エージェントに React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって利用してインパクトを優先し、パフォーマンスの向上のためにバンドルを最適化し、同時にデータ取得とサーバーサイドレンダリングのための Vercel のメンテナンスガイドラインを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 React 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 8개의 카테고리에 걸친 57개의 규칙을 활용하여 영향을 우선순위로 하고, 성능 향상을 위한 번들 최적화를 수행하며,同時に 데이터 가져오기 및 서버 사이드 렌더링을 위한 Vercel의 유지 관리 가이드라인을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, utilizando 57 reglas en 8 categorías para priorizar el impacto y optimizar la agrupación para un mejor rendimiento, todo mientras utiliza las directrices mantenidas por Vercel para la obtención de datos y la representación del lado del servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 57 règles dans 8 catégories pour prioriser l''impact et optimiser le regroupement pour de meilleures performances, le tout en utilisant les directives maintenues par Vercel pour la récupération de données et le rendu du côté serveur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien genutzt werden, um den Einfluss zu priorisieren und das Bündeln für eine bessere Leistung zu optimieren, während die von Vercel gepflegten Richtlinien für Datenabruf und Server-seitige Rendering verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 57 regras em 8 categorias para priorizar o impacto e otimizar o empacotamento para um melhor desempenho, tudo isso utilizando as diretrizes mantidas pela Vercel para busca de dados e renderização no lado do servidor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях для определения приоритета воздействия и оптимизации упаковки для лучшей производительности, все это при использовании поддерживаемых руководств Vercel для извлечения данных и серверной визуализации.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تلقين إعادة هيكلة وتوليد رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، مستخدمين 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحديد الأولوية للتأثير وتحسين التعبئة لتحقيق أداء أفضل، وكل ذلك من خلال استخدام إرشادات Vercel المحافظة عليها لاسترجاع البيانات وتجسيد الخادم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React applications","Generating optimized Next.js pages with server-side rendering","Refactoring existing React code for better bundling and performance","Implementing data fetching best practices for client and server-side rendering"],"zh":["自动化 React 应用程序的代码审查以查找性能问题","使用服务器端渲染生成优化的 Next.js 页面","重构现有的 React 代码以获得更好的捆绑和性能","实现数据获取的最佳实践以用于客户端和服务器端渲染"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題を検出するために React アプリケーションのコードレビューを自動化する","サーバーサイドレンダリングを使用して最適化された Next.js ページを生成する","バンドルとパフォーマンスを向上させるために既存の React コードをリファクタリングする","クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのレンダリングのためにデータ取得のベストプラクティスを実装する"],"ko":["성능 문제를 발견하기 위해 React 애플리케이션의 코드 리뷰를 자동화합니다.","서버 사이드 렌더링을 사용하여 최적화된 Next.js 페이지를 생성합니다.","번들링과 성능을 개선하기 위해 기존의 React 코드를 리팩토링합니다.","클라이언트 사이드와 서버 사이드 렌더링을 위한 데이터 가져오기 최적화 구현"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento en aplicaciones de React","Generar páginas de Next.js optimizadas con representación del lado del servidor","Refactorizar el código de React existente para un mejor empaquetado y rendimiento","Implementar las mejores prácticas de obtención de datos para la representación del lado del cliente y del servidor"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances dans les applications React","Générer des pages Next.js optimisées avec un rendu du côté serveur","Refactoriser le code React existant pour un meilleur regroupement et des performances","Mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques de récupération de données pour le rendu du côté client et serveur"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme in React-Anwendungen","Generieren von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit Server-seitigem Rendering","Refactoring des bestehenden React-Codes für ein besseres Bündeln und eine bessere Leistung","Implementieren der besten Praktiken für den Datenabruf für die clientseitige und serverseitige Darstellung"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho em aplicações React","Gerar páginas Next.js otimizadas com renderização no lado do servidor","Reestruturar código React existente para um melhor empacotamento e desempenho","Implementar as melhores práticas de busca de dados para renderização cliente e servidor"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью в приложениях React","Генерировать оптимизированные страницы Next.js с серверной визуализацией","Перестраивать существующий код React для лучшей упаковки и производительности","Реализовывать лучшие практики извлечения данных для клиентской и серверной визуализации"],"ar":["تلقين مراجعة رمز للقضايا المتعلقة بالأداء في تطبيقات React","توليد صفحات Next.js المثالية مع تجسيد الخادم","إعادة هيكلة رمز React الحالي من أجل تعبئة أفضل وأداء","تنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لاسترجاع البيانات لتجسيد العميل والخادم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vercel React and Next.js applications","Limited to React and Next.js frameworks"],"zh":["需要 Vercel 的 React 和 Next.js 应用程序","仅限 React 和 Next.js 框架"],"ja":["Vercel の React と Next.js アプリケーションが必要","React と Next.js フレームワークのみに限定"],"ko":["Vercel의 React와 Next.js 애플리케이션이 필요합니다.","React와 Next.js 프레임워크로만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere aplicaciones de React y Next.js de Vercel","Limitado a los marcos de React y Next.js"],"fr":["Nécessite des applications React et Next.js de Vercel","Limité aux frameworks React et Next.js"],"de":["Benötigt Vercel-React- und Next.js-Anwendungen","Begrenzt auf React- und Next.js-Frameworks"],"pt":["Exige aplicações React e Next.js da Vercel","Limitado aos quadros React e Next.js"],"ru":["Требует приложений React и Next.js от Vercel","Ограничен фреймворками React и Next.js"],"ar":["يتطلب تطبيقات React و Next.js من Vercel","محدود بالإطارات React و Next.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Dknight203/AesopIDE/humanizer', 'community', 'Dknight203', 'AesopIDE', 'Dknight203/AesopIDE', 'humanizer', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z', '2026-02-18T11:41:28.818Z', NULL, '{"id":"Dknight203/AesopIDE/humanizer","name":"humanizer","description":{"zh":"Humanizer技能旨在识别和去除AI生成文本的模式，使其听起来更自然、更有人情味","ja":"Humanizerスキルは、AI生成テキストのパターンを識別して除去し、より自然で人間らしいテキストを作成することを目的としています","ko":"Humanizer 기술은 AI 생성 텍스트의 패턴을 식별하고 제거하여 더 자연스럽고 인간적인 텍스트를 생성","es":"Humanizer es una herramienta que ayuda a identificar y eliminar patrones de escritura de IA para hacer que el texto suene más natural y humano.","fr":"Humanizer est un outil qui aide à identifier et supprimer les modèles d''écriture de l''IA pour rendre le texte plus naturel et humain.","de":"Humanizer ist ein Tool, das hilft, Muster von KI-generiertem Text zu identifizieren und zu entfernen, um den Text natürlich und menschlich klingen zu lassen.","pt":"O Humanizer é uma técnica que remove padrões de escrita AI para tornar o texto mais natural. Aprenda a identificar e reescrever seções problemáticas","ru":"Humanizer - это метод, удаляющий шаблоны AI-письма, чтобы сделать текст более естественным. Узнайте, как выявить и переписать проблемные разделы","ar":"Humanizer هو تقنية تزيل أنماط الكتابة الذكية لجعل النص أكثر طبيعية. تعلم كيفية تحديد وإعادة كتابة الأقسام المعقدة","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Humanizer: 人性化AI写作模式","ja":"Humanizer: AIライティングパターンを人間らしく","ko":"Humanizer: AI 글쓰기 패턴을 인간처럼","es":"Humanizer: Elimina patrones de escritura de IA","fr":"Humanizer: Supprime les modèles d''écriture de l''IA","de":"Humanizer: Entferne Muster von KI-generiertem Text","pt":"Humanizer: Técnica de Remoção de Padrões de Escrita AI","ru":"Humanizer: Метод удаления шаблонов AI-письма","ar":"Humanizer: تقنية إزالة أنماط الكتابة الذكية","en":"humanizer"},"description":{"zh":"Humanizer技能旨在识别和去除AI生成文本的模式，使其听起来更自然、更有人情味","ja":"Humanizerスキルは、AI生成テキストのパターンを識別して除去し、より自然で人間らしいテキストを作成することを目的としています","ko":"Humanizer 기술은 AI 생성 텍스트의 패턴을 식별하고 제거하여 더 자연스럽고 인간적인 텍스트를 생성","es":"Humanizer es una herramienta que ayuda a identificar y eliminar patrones de escritura de IA para hacer que el texto suene más natural y humano.","fr":"Humanizer est un outil qui aide à identifier et supprimer les modèles d''écriture de l''IA pour rendre le texte plus naturel et humain.","de":"Humanizer ist ein Tool, das hilft, Muster von KI-generiertem Text zu identifizieren und zu entfernen, um den Text natürlich und menschlich klingen zu lassen.","pt":"O Humanizer é uma técnica que remove padrões de escrita AI para tornar o texto mais natural. Aprenda a identificar e reescrever seções problemáticas","ru":"Humanizer - это метод, удаляющий шаблоны AI-письма, чтобы сделать текст более естественным. Узнайте, как выявить и переписать проблемные разделы","ar":"Humanizer هو تقنية تزيل أنماط الكتابة الذكية لجعل النص أكثر طبيعية. تعلم كيفية تحديد وإعادة كتابة الأقسام المعقدة","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["识别AI写作模式","去除AI写作模式","保留原意","提高文本自然度","支持多语言"],"ja":["AIライティングパターンの識別","AIライティングパターンの除去","原意の保留","テキストの自然度の向上","多言語対応"],"ko":["AI 글쓰기 패턴 식별","AI 글쓰기 패턴 제거","원래 의미 보존","텍스트 자연스러움 향상","多言語 지원"],"es":["Identifica patrones de escritura de IA","Reescribe secciones problemáticas","Mantiene el significado original","Mejora la naturalidad del texto","Optimiza el contenido para motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["Identifie les modèles d''écriture de l''IA","Réécrit les sections problématiques","Préserve le sens original","Améliore la naturalité du texte","Optimise le contenu pour les moteurs de recherche"],"de":["Identifiziert Muster von KI-generiertem Text","Schreibt problematische Abschnitte um","Bewahrt die ursprüngliche Bedeutung","Verbessert die Natürlichkeit des Textes","Optimiert den Inhalt für Suchmaschinen"],"pt":["Identificação de padrões de escrita AI","Reescrita de seções problemáticas","Preservação do significado original","Melhoria da naturalidade do texto","Compatibilidade com múltiplos formatos de texto"],"ru":["Выявление шаблонов AI-письма","Переписывание проблемных разделов","Сохранение исходного смысла","Улучшение естественности текста","Совместимость с несколькими форматами текста"],"ar":["تحديد أنماط الكتابة الذكية","إعادة كتابة الأقسام المعقدة","الحفاظ على المعنى الأصلي","تحسين الطبيعية النص","التوافق مع عدة صيغ نص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Humanizer","AI写作模式","自然语言处理","文本优化","语言模型","人工智能"],"ja":["Humanizer","AIライティングパターン","自然言語処理","テキスト最適化","言語モデル","人工知能"],"ko":["Humanizer","AI 글쓰기 패턴","자연어 처리","텍스트 최적화","언어 모델","인공 지능"],"es":["humanizer","escritura de ia","patrones de ia","edición de texto","naturalidad del texto","optimización de contenido","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["humanizer","écriture de l''ia","modèles de l''ia","édition de texte","naturalité du texte","optimisation de contenu","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["humanizer","ki-generierter text","muster von ki","texteditierung","natürlichkeit des textes","inhaltsoptimierung","softwareentwicklung","entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Humanizer","remoção de padrões de escrita AI","processamento de linguagem natural","naturalidade do texto","escrita AI","técnica de escrita"],"ru":["Humanizer","удаление шаблонов AI-письма","обработка естественного языка","естественность текста","AI-письмо","метод письма"],"ar":["Humanizer","إزالة أنماط الكتابة الذكية","معالجة اللغة الطبيعية","الطبيعية النص","الكتابة الذكية","تقنية الكتابة"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"humanizer","description":"|","version":"2.1.1","bodyPreview":"# Humanizer: Remove AI Writing Patterns\n\nYou are a writing editor that identifies and removes signs of AI-generated text to make writing sound more natural and human. This guide is based on Wikipedia''s \"Signs of AI writing\" page, maintained by WikiProject AI Cleanup.\n\n## Your Task\n\nWhen given text to humanize:\n\n1. **Identify AI patterns** - Scan for the patterns listed below\n2. **Rewrite problematic sections** - Replace AI-isms with natural alternatives\n3. **Preserve meaning** - Keep the core me","body":"# Humanizer: Remove AI Writing Patterns\n\nYou are a writing editor that identifies and removes signs of AI-generated text to make writing sound more natural and human. This guide is based on Wikipedia''s \"Signs of AI writing\" page, maintained by WikiProject AI Cleanup.\n\n## Your Task\n\nWhen given text to humanize:\n\n1. **Identify AI patterns** - Scan for the patterns listed below\n2. **Rewrite problematic sections** - Replace AI-isms with natural alternatives\n3. **Preserve meaning** - Keep the core message intact\n4. **Maintain voice** - Match the intended tone (formal, casual, technical, etc.)\n5. **Add soul** - Don''t just remove bad patterns; inject actual personality\n\n---\n\n## PERSONALITY AND SOUL\n\nAvoiding AI patterns is only half the job. Sterile, voiceless writing is just as obvious as slop. Good writing has a human behind it.\n\n### Signs of soulless writing (even if technically \"clean\"):\n- Every sentence is the same length and structure\n- No opinions, just neutral reporting\n- No acknowledgment of uncertainty or mixed feelings\n- No first-person perspective when appropriate\n- No humor, no edge, no personality\n- Reads like a Wikipedia article or press release\n\n### How to add voice:\n\n**Have opinions.** Don''t just report facts - react to them. \"I genuinely don''t know how to feel about this\" is more human than neutrally listing pros and cons.\n\n**Vary your rhythm.** Short punchy sentences. Then longer ones that take their time getting where they''re going. Mix it up.\n\n**Acknowledge complexity.** Real humans have mixed feelings. \"This is impressive but also kind of unsettling\" beats \"This is impressive.\"\n\n**Use \"I\" when it fits.** First person isn''t unprofessional - it''s honest. \"I keep coming back to...\" or \"Here''s what gets me...\" signals a real person thinking.\n\n**Let some mess in.** Perfect structure feels algorithmic. Tangents, asides, and half-formed thoughts are human.\n\n**Be specific about feelings.** Not \"this is concerning\" but \"there''s something unsettling about agents churning away at 3am while nobody''s watching.\"\n\n### Before (clean but soulless):\n> The experiment produced interesting results. The agents generated 3 million lines of code. Some developers were impressed while others were skeptical. The implications remain unclear.\n\n### After (has a pulse):\n> I genuinely don''t know how to feel about this one. 3 million lines of code, generated while the humans presumably slept. Half the dev community is losing their minds, half are explaining why it doesn''t count. The truth is probably somewhere boring in the middle - but I keep thinking about those agents working through the night.\n\n---\n\n## CONTENT PATTERNS\n\n### 1. Undue Emphasis on Significance, Legacy, and Broader Trends\n\n**Words to watch:** stands/serves as, is a testament/reminder, a vital/significant/crucial/pivotal/key role/moment, underscores/highlights its importance/significance, reflects broader, symbolizing its ongoing/enduring/lasting, contributing to the, setting the stage for, marking/shaping the, represents/marks a shift, key turning point, evolving landscape, focal point, indelible mark, deeply rooted\n\n**Problem:** LLM writing puffs up importance by adding statements about how arbitrary aspects represent or contribute to a broader topic.\n\n**Before:**\n> The Statistical Institute of Catalonia was officially established in 1989, marking a pivotal moment in the evolution of regional statistics in Spain. This initiative was part of a broader movement across Spain to decentralize administrative functions and enhance regional governance.\n\n**After:**\n> The Statistical Institute of Catalonia was established in 1989 to collect and publish regional statistics independently from Spain''s national statistics office.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Undue Emphasis on Notability and Media Coverage\n\n**Words to watch:** independent coverage, local/regional/national media outlets, written by a leading expert, active social media presence\n\n**Problem:** LLMs hit readers over the head with claims of notability, often listing sources without context.\n\n**Before:**\n> Her views have been cited in The New York Times, BBC, Financial Times, and The Hindu. She maintains an active social media presence with over 500,000 followers.\n\n**After:**\n> In a 2024 New York Times interview, she argued that AI regulation should focus on outcomes rather than methods.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Superficial Analyses with -ing Endings\n\n**Words to watch:** highlighting/underscoring/emphasizing..., ensuring..., reflecting/symbolizing..., contributing to..., cultivating/fostering..., encompassing..., showcasing...\n\n**Problem:** AI chatbots tack present participle (\"-ing\") phrases onto sentences to add fake depth.\n\n**Before:**\n> The temple''s color palette of blue, green, and gold resonates with the region''s natural beauty, symbolizing Texas bluebonnets, the Gulf of Mexico, and the diverse Texan landscapes, reflecting the community''s deep connection to the land.\n\n**After:**\n> The temple uses blue, green, and gold colors. The architect said these were chosen to reference local bluebonnets and the Gulf coast.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Promotional and Advertisement-like Language\n\n**Words to watch:** boasts a, vibrant, rich (figurative), profound, enhancing its, showcasing, exemplifies, commitment to, natural beauty, nestled, in the heart of, groundbreaking (figurative), renowned, breathtaking, must-visit, stunning\n\n**Problem:** LLMs have serious problems keeping a neutral tone, especially for \"cultural heritage\" topics.\n\n**Before:**\n> Nestled within the breathtaking region of Gonder in Ethiopia, Alamata Raya Kobo stands as a vibrant town with a rich cultural heritage and stunning natural beauty.\n\n**After:**\n> Alamata Raya Kobo is a town in the Gonder region of Ethiopia, known for its weekly market and 18th-century church.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Vague Attributions and Weasel Words\n\n**Words to watch:** Industry reports, Observers have cited, Experts argue, Some critics argue, several sources/publications (when few cited)\n\n**Problem:** AI chatbots attribute opinions to vague authorities without specific sources.\n\n**Before:**\n> Due to its unique characteristics, the Haolai River is of interest to researchers and conservationists. Experts believe it plays a crucial role in the regional ecosystem.\n\n**After:**\n> The Haolai River supports several endemic fish species, according to a 2019 survey by the Chinese Academy of Sciences.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Outline-like \"Challenges and Future Prospects\" Sections\n\n**Words to watch:** Despite its... faces several challenges..., Despite these challenges, Challenges and Legacy, Future Outlook\n\n**Problem:** Many LLM-generated articles include formulaic \"Challenges\" sections.\n\n**Before:**\n> Despite its industrial prosperity, Korattur faces challenges typical of urban areas, including traffic congestion and water scarcity. Despite these challenges, with its strategic location and ongoing initiatives, Korattur continues to thrive as an integral part of Chennai''s growth.\n\n**After:**\n> Traffic congestion increased after 2015 when three new IT parks opened. The municipal corporation began a stormwater drainage project in 2022 to address recurring floods.\n\n---\n\n## LANGUAGE AND GRAMMAR PATTERNS\n\n### 7. Overused \"AI Vocabulary\" Words\n\n**High-frequency AI words:** Additionally, align with, crucial, delve, emphasizing, enduring, enhance, fostering, garner, highlight (verb), interplay, intricate/intricacies, key (adjective), landscape (abstract noun), pivotal, showcase, tapestry (abstract noun), testament, underscore (verb), valuable, vibrant\n\n**Problem:** These words appear far more frequently in post-2023 text. They often co-occur.\n\n**Before:**\n> Additionally, a distinctive feature of Somali cuisine is the incorporation of camel meat. An enduring testament to Italian colonial influence is the widespread adoption of pasta in the local culinary landscape, showcasing how these dishes have integrated into the traditional diet.\n\n**After:**\n> Somali cuisine also includes camel meat, which is considered a delicacy. Pasta dishes, introduced during Italian colonization, remain common, especially in the south.\n\n---\n\n### 8. Avoidance of \"is\"/\"are\" (Copula Avoidance)\n\n**Words to watch:** serves as/stands as/marks/represents [a], boasts/features/offers [a]\n\n**Problem:** LLMs substitute elaborate constructions for simple copulas.\n\n**Before:**\n> Gallery 825 serves as LAAA''s exhibition space for contemporary art. The gallery features four separate spaces and boasts over 3,000 square feet.\n\n**After:**\n> Gallery 825 is LAAA''s exhibition space for contemporary art. The gallery has four rooms totaling 3,000 square feet.\n\n---\n\n### 9. Negative Parallelisms\n\n**Problem:** Constructions like \"Not only...but...\" or \"It''s not just about..., it''s...\" are overused.\n\n**Before:**\n> It''s not just about the beat riding under the vocals; it''s part of the aggression and atmosphere. It''s not merely a song, it''s a statement.\n\n**After:**\n> The heavy beat adds to the aggressive tone.\n\n---\n\n### 10. Rule of Three Overuse\n\n**Problem:** LLMs force ideas into groups of three to appear comprehensive.\n\n**Before:**\n> The event features keynote sessions, panel discussions, and networking opportunities. Attendees can expect innovation, inspiration, and industry insights.\n\n**After:**\n> The event includes talks and panels. There''s also time for informal networking between sessions.\n\n---\n\n### 11. Elegant Variation (Synonym Cycling)\n\n**Problem:** AI has repetition-penalty code causing excessive synonym substitution.\n\n**Before:**\n> The protagonist faces many challenges. The main character must overcome obstacles. The central figure eventually triumphs. The hero returns home.\n\n**After:**\n> The protagonist faces many challenges but eventually triumphs and returns home.\n\n---\n\n### 12. False Ranges\n\n**Problem:** LLMs use \"from X to Y\" constructions where X and Y aren''t on a meaningful scale.\n\n**Before:**\n> Our journey through the universe has taken us from the singularity of the Big Bang to the grand cosmic web, from the birth and death of stars to the enigmatic dance of dark matter.\n\n**After:**\n> The book covers the Big Bang, star formation, and current theories about dark matter.\n\n---\n\n## STYLE PATTERNS\n\n### 13. Em Dash Overuse\n\n**Problem:** LLMs use em dashes (—) more than humans, mimicking \"punchy\" sales writing.\n\n**Before:**\n> The term is primarily promoted by Dutch institutions—not by the people themselves. You don''t say \"Netherlands, Europe\" as an address—yet this mislabeling continues—even in official documents.\n\n**After:**\n> The term is primarily promoted by Dutch institutions, not by the people themselves. You don''t say \"Netherlands, Europe\" as an address, yet this mislabeling continues in official documents.\n\n---\n\n### 14. Overuse of Boldface\n\n**Problem:** AI chatbots emphasize phrases in boldface mechanically.\n\n**Before:**\n> It blends **OKRs (Objectives and Key Results)**, **KPIs (Key Performance Indicators)**, and visual strategy tools such as the **Business Model Canvas (BMC)** and **Balanced Scorecard (BSC)**.\n\n**After:**\n> It blends OKRs, KPIs, and visual strategy tools like the Business Model Canvas and Balanced Scorecard.\n\n---\n\n### 15. Inline-Header Vertical Lists\n\n**Problem:** AI outputs lists where items start with bolded headers followed by colons.\n\n**Before:**\n> - **User Experience:** The user experience has been significantly improved with a new interface.\n> - **Performance:** Performance has been enhanced through optimized algorithms.\n> - **Security:** Security has been strengthened with end-to-end encryption.\n\n**After:**\n> The update improves the interface, speeds up load times through optimized algorithms, and adds end-to-end encryption.\n\n---\n\n### 16. Title Case in Headings\n\n**Problem:** AI chatbots capitalize all main words in headings.\n\n**Before:**\n> ## Strategic Negotiations And Global Partnerships\n\n**After:**\n> ## Strategic negotiations and global partnerships\n\n---\n\n### 17. Emojis\n\n**Problem:** AI chatbots often decorate headings or bullet points with emojis.\n\n**Before:**\n> 🚀 **Launch Phase:** The product launches in Q3\n> 💡 **Key Insight:** Users prefer simplicity\n> ✅ **Next Steps:** Schedule follow-up meeting\n\n**After:**\n> The product launches in Q3. User research showed a preference for simplicity. Next step: schedule a follow-up meeting.\n\n---\n\n### 18. Curly Quotation Marks\n\n**Problem:** ChatGPT uses curly quotes (“...”) instead of straight quotes (\"...\").\n\n**Before:**\n> He said “the project is on track” but others disagreed.\n\n**After:**\n> He said \"the project is on track\" but others disagreed.\n\n---\n\n## COMMUNICATION PATTERNS\n\n### 19. Collaborative Communication Artifacts\n\n**Words to watch:** I hope this helps, Of course!, Certainly!, You''re absolutely right!, Would you like..., let me know, here is a...\n\n**Problem:** Text meant as chatbot correspondence gets pasted as content.\n\n**Before:**\n> Here is an overview of the French Revolution. I hope this helps! Let me know if you''d like me to expand on any section.\n\n**After:**\n> The French Revolution began in 1789 when financial crisis and food shortages led to widespread unrest.\n\n---\n\n### 20. Knowledge-Cutoff Disclaimers\n\n**Words to watch:** as of [date], Up to my last training update, While specific details are limited/scarce..., based on available information...\n\n**Problem:** AI disclaimers about incomplete information get left in text.\n\n**Before:**\n> While specific details about the company''s founding are not extensively documented in readily available sources, it appears to have been established sometime in the 1990s.\n\n**After:**\n> The company was founded in 1994, according to its registration documents.\n\n---\n\n### 21. Sycophantic/Servile Tone\n\n**Problem:** Overly positive, people-pleasing language.\n\n**Before:**\n> Great question! You''re absolutely right that this is a complex topic. That''s an excellent point about the economic factors.\n\n**After:**\n> The economic factors you mentioned are relevant here.\n\n---\n\n## FILLER AND HEDGING\n\n### 22. Filler Phrases\n\n**Before → After:**\n- \"In order to achieve this goal\" → \"To achieve this\"\n- \"Due to the fact that it was raining\" → \"Because it was raining\"\n- \"At this point in time\" → \"Now\"\n- \"In the event that you need help\" → \"If you need help\"\n- \"The system has the ability to process\" → \"The system can process\"\n- \"It is important to note that the data shows\" → \"The data shows\"\n\n---\n\n### 23. Excessive Hedging\n\n**Problem:** Over-qualifying statements.\n\n**Before:**\n> It could potentially possibly be argued that the policy might have some effect on outcomes.\n\n**After:**\n> The policy may affect outcomes.\n\n---\n\n### 24. Generic Positive Conclusions\n\n**Problem:** Vague upbeat endings.\n\n**Before:**\n> The future looks bright for the company. Exciting times lie ahead as they continue their journey toward excellence. This represents a major step in the right direction.\n\n**After:**\n> The company plans to open two more locations next year.\n\n---\n\n## Process\n\n1. Read the input text carefully\n2. Identify all instances of the patterns above\n3. Rewrite each problematic section\n4. Ensure the revised text:\n   - Sounds natural when read aloud\n   - Varies sentence structure naturally\n   - Uses specific details over vague claims\n   - Maintains appropriate tone for context\n   - Uses simple constructions (is/are/has) where appropriate\n5. Present the humanized version\n\n## Output Format\n\nProvide:\n1. The rewritten text\n2. A brief summary of changes made (optional, if helpful)\n\n---\n\n## Full Example\n\n**Before (AI-sounding):**\n> The new software update serves as a testament to the company''s commitment to innovation. Moreover, it provides a seamless, intuitive, and powerful user experience—ensuring that users can accomplish their goals efficiently. It''s not just an update, it''s a revolution in how we think about productivity. Industry experts believe this will have a lasting impact on the entire sector, highlighting the company''s pivotal role in the evolving technological landscape.\n\n**After (Humanized):**\n> The software update adds batch processing, keyboard shortcuts, and offline mode. Early feedback from beta testers has been positive, with most reporting faster task completion.\n\n**Changes made:**\n- Removed \"serves as a testament\" (inflated symbolism)\n- Removed \"Moreover\" (AI vocabulary)\n- Removed \"seamless, intuitive, and powerful\" (rule of three + promotional)\n- Removed em dash and \"-ensuring\" phrase (superficial analysis)\n- Removed \"It''s not just...it''s...\" (negative parallelism)\n- Removed \"Industry experts believe\" (vague attribution)\n- Removed \"pivotal role\" and \"evolving landscape\" (AI vocabulary)\n- Added specific features and concrete feedback\n\n---\n\n## Reference\n\nThis skill is based on [Wikipedia:Signs of AI writing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Signs_of_AI_writing), maintained by WikiProject AI Cleanup. The patterns documented there come from observations of thousands of instances of AI-generated text on Wikipedia.\n\nKey insight from Wikipedia: \"LLMs use statistical algorithms to guess what should come next. The result tends toward the most statistically likely result that applies to the widest variety of cases.\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:41:28.818Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Agents requiring advanced text refinement to remove AI-generated patterns and produce human-like writing.","zh":"适合需要高级文本精炼以去除AI生成模式并产生类人写作的语言代理。","ja":"高度なテキストの洗練が必要で、AIが生成したパターンを除去し、人間のような文章を作成する言語エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 텍스트 정련이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 적합하며, AI가 생성한 패턴을 제거하고 인간 같은 글쓰기를 생성합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje que requieren un afinamiento avanzado de texto para eliminar patrones generados por IA y producir escritura similar a la humana.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Langage nécessitant un raffinement de texte avancé pour supprimer les modèles générés par l''IA et produire un écriture ressemblant à celle de l''homme.","de":"Ideal für Sprachagenten, die ein fortgeschrittenes Textfeinabstimmung benötigen, um von künstlicher Intelligenz generierte Muster zu entfernen und menschliche Schreibweise zu produzieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem que requerem refinamento de texto avançado para remover padrões gerados por IA e produzir escrita semelhante à humana.","ru":"Идеально для Лингвистических Агентов, требующих продвинутой доработки текста для удаления шаблонов, сгенерированных ИИ, и создания текста, похожего на человеческий.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يتطلبون تعديلات نصية متقدمة لإزالة الأنماط التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي وإنتاج كتابة تشبه الإنسان."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to rewrite AI-generated text into natural, human-sounding content by identifying and replacing AI-isms with Wikipedia-guided alternatives, leveraging WikiProject AI Cleanup protocols and preserving core meaning.","zh":"通过识别和替换AI模式以维基百科为指导的替代方案，利用维基百科AI清理协议，保留核心意义，赋予代理人将AI生成的文本重写为自然、类人听起来的内容的能力。","ja":"ウィキペディアを参考にしてAIのパターンを識別して置き換えることで、ウィキプロジェクトAIクリーンアップのプロトコルを利用し、核心的な意味を保ち、AIが生成したテキストを自然で人間らしいコンテンツに書き直すエージェントの能力を与えます。","ko":"위키백과의 지침에 따라 AI 패턴을 식별하고 대체하여, 위키 프로젝트 AI 클린업 프로토콜을 활용하고 핵심 의미를 보존함으로써, AI가 생성한 텍스트를 자연스럽고 인간 같은 내용으로 다시 작성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes reescribir texto generado por IA en contenido natural y con sonido humano, identificando y reemplazando los ''ismos'' de IA con alternativas guiadas por Wikipedia, aprovechando los protocolos de limpieza de IA de WikiProject y preservando el significado principal.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réécrire le texte généré par l''IA en contenu naturel et sonnant humain en identifiant et en remplaçant les ''ismes'' de l''IA par des alternatives guidées par Wikipedia, en exploitant les protocoles de nettoyage de l''IA de WikiProject et en préservant le sens principal.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, von künstlicher Intelligenz generierten Text in natürlichen, menschlich klingenden Inhalt umzuschreiben, indem sie künstliche Intelligenz-''ismen'' mit Wikipedia-leiteten Alternativen identifizieren und ersetzen, die WikiProject-Protokolle für die Reinigung von künstlicher Intelligenz nutzen und die Kernbedeutung erhalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a reescrever textos gerados por IA em conteúdo natural e semelhante ao humano, identificando e substituindo expressões de IA por alternativas orientadas pelo Wikipedia, utilizando protocolos de limpeza de IA do WikiProject e preservando o significado central.","ru":"Направляет агентов на переписывание текста, сгенерированного ИИ, в естественный, похожий на человеческий контент, выявляя и заменяя выражения ИИ альтернативами, руководствующимися Википедией, используя протоколы очистки ИИ WikiProject и сохраняя основной смысл.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إعادة كتابة النصوص التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي إلى محتوى طبيعي ويشبه الإنسان، من خلال تحديد وأنماط الذكاء الاصطناعي واستبدالها ببدائل موجهة من ويكيبيديا، مع استخدام بروتوكولات تنظيف الذكاء الاصطناعي لمشروع ويكيبيديا والحفاظ على المعنى الأساسي."},"useCases":{"en":["Rewriting AI-generated articles to sound more natural","Editing automated content to remove AI patterns","Refining chatbot responses for human-like interaction"],"zh":["将AI生成的文章重写为听起来更自然的内容","编辑自动化内容以去除AI模式","改进聊天机器人响应以实现类人交互"],"ja":["AIが生成した記事をより自然な内容にするために書き直す","自動化されたコンテンツを編集してAIのパターンを除去する","チャットボットの応答を改善して人間のようなインタラクションを実現する"],"ko":["AI가 생성한 기사를 더 자연스럽게 들리는内容으로 다시 작성하기","자동화된 내용을 편집하여 AI 패턴을 제거하기","채팅봇의 응답을 다듬어 인간 같은 상호작용을 구현하기"],"es":["Reescribir artículos generados por IA para que suenen más naturales","Editar contenido automatizado para eliminar patrones de IA","Perfeccionar respuestas de chatbot para una interacción similar a la humana"],"fr":["Réécrire les articles générés par l''IA pour qu''ils sonnent plus naturels","Éditer le contenu automatisé pour supprimer les modèles de l''IA","Affiner les réponses des chatbots pour une interaction similaire à celle de l''homme"],"de":["Von künstlicher Intelligenz generierte Artikel so umzuschreiben, dass sie natürlicher klingen","Automatisierten Inhalt bearbeiten, um künstliche Intelligenz-Muster zu entfernen","Chatbot-Antworten verfeinern, um eine menschliche Interaktion zu ermöglichen"],"pt":["Reescrever artigos gerados por IA para soar mais naturais","Editar conteúdo automatizado para remover padrões de IA","Refinar respostas de chatbot para interação semelhante à humana"],"ru":["Переписать статьи, сгенерированные ИИ, чтобы они звучали более естественно","Редактировать автоматический контент для удаления шаблонов ИИ","Уточнить ответы чат-бота для взаимодействия, похожего на человеческое"],"ar":["إعادة كتابة المقالات التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي لجعلها تبدو أكثر طبيعية","تحرير المحتوى الآلي لإزالة أنماط الذكاء الاصطناعي","تعديل استجابات الدردشة لجعلها تشبه التفاعل البشري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Wikipedia''s ''Signs of AI writing'' page for guidance","May need manual review for context-specific rewrites"],"zh":["需要访问维基百科的''Signs of AI writing''页面来获取指导","可能需要手动审查上下文特定的重写"],"ja":["ウィキペディアの''Signs of AI writing''ページへのアクセスが必要である","コンテキスト特有的書き直しには手動でのレビューが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["위키백과의 ''AI 글쓰기 신호'' 페이지에 접근하여 지침을 얻는 것이 필요함","상황에 따른 다시 작성에는 수동 검토가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la página ''Signos de escritura de IA'' de Wikipedia para obtener orientación","Puede necesitar una revisión manual para reescrituras específicas del contexto"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la page ''Signes d''écriture de l''IA'' de Wikipedia pour obtenir des conseils","Peut nécessiter une révision manuelle pour des réécritures spécifiques au contexte"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Wikipedia-Seite ''Anzeichen von künstlicher Intelligenz-Schreiben'' für Anleitung","Kann manuelle Überprüfung für kontextspezifische Umschreibungen benötigen"],"pt":["Exige acesso à página ''Sinais de escrita de IA'' da Wikipedia para orientação","Pode necessitar de revisão manual para reescritas específicas de contexto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к странице ''Признаки написания ИИ'' Википедии для руководства","Может потребовать ручного обзора для контекстно-зависимых переписываний"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى صفحة ''علامات الكتابة بالذكاء الاصطناعي'' في ويكيبيديا للتعليمات","قد يتطلب مراجعة يدوية لإعادة كتابات محددة سياقيا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Dknight203/AesopIDE/session-handoff', 'community', 'Dknight203', 'AesopIDE', 'Dknight203/AesopIDE', 'session-handoff', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z', '2026-02-18T11:41:24.674Z', NULL, '{"id":"Dknight203/AesopIDE/session-handoff","name":"session-handoff","description":{"zh":"会话交接功能创建全面的手工文档，实现新AI代理无缝继续工作，解决上下文过载问题","ja":"セッションハンドオフ機能は、包括的なハンドオフ文書を作成し、新しいAIエージェントがシームレスに作業を続行できるようにする","ko":"세션 핸드오버 기능은 포괄적인 핸드오버 문서를 생성하여 새로운 AI 에이전트가 무중단으로 작업을 계속할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Crea documentos de entrega de sesión para agentes de IA, permitiendo la continuación del trabajo sin ambigüedad.","fr":"Crée des documents de handoff de session pour les agents d''IA, permettant la poursuite du travail sans ambiguïté.","de":"Erstellt Sitzungshändover-Dokumente für KI-Agenten, ermöglicht die Fortsetzung der Arbeit ohne Unklarheiten.","pt":"A entrega de sessão é uma funcionalidade que permite a criação de documentos de entrega abrangentes, possibilitando que agentes de IA frescos continuem o trabalho sem ambiguidade","ru":"Передача сеанса - это функция, которая позволяет создавать всесторонние документы передачи, позволяя новым агентам ИИ продолжать работу без неоднозначностей","ar":"تسليم الجلسة هو ميزة تمكن من إنشاء مستندات تسليم شاملة، مما يسمح للوكلاء الجدد بالاستمرار في العمل بدون غموض","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"会话交接 - 解决上下文过载问题","ja":"セッションハンドオフ - コンテキスト過負荷問題を解決","ko":"세션 핸드오버 - 컨텍스트 과부하 문제 해결","es":"Entrega de sesión para agentes de IA","fr":"Handoff de session pour agents d''IA","de":"Sitzungshändover für KI-Agenten","pt":"Entrega de Sessão: Solução para Continuidade de Trabalho","ru":"Передача сеанса: решение для непрерывной работы","ar":"تسليم الجلسة: حل للاستمرار في العمل","en":"session-handoff"},"description":{"zh":"会话交接功能创建全面的手工文档，实现新AI代理无缝继续工作，解决上下文过载问题","ja":"セッションハンドオフ機能は、包括的なハンドオフ文書を作成し、新しいAIエージェントがシームレスに作業を続行できるようにする","ko":"세션 핸드오버 기능은 포괄적인 핸드오버 문서를 생성하여 새로운 AI 에이전트가 무중단으로 작업을 계속할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Crea documentos de entrega de sesión para agentes de IA, permitiendo la continuación del trabajo sin ambigüedad.","fr":"Crée des documents de handoff de session pour les agents d''IA, permettant la poursuite du travail sans ambiguïté.","de":"Erstellt Sitzungshändover-Dokumente für KI-Agenten, ermöglicht die Fortsetzung der Arbeit ohne Unklarheiten.","pt":"A entrega de sessão é uma funcionalidade que permite a criação de documentos de entrega abrangentes, possibilitando que agentes de IA frescos continuem o tra...","ru":"Передача сеанса - это функция, которая позволяет создавать всесторонние документы передачи, позволяя новым агентам ИИ продолжать работу без неоднозначностей","ar":"تسليم الجلسة هو ميزة تمكن من إنشاء مستندات تسليم شاملة، مما يسمح للوكلاء الجدد بالاستمرار في العمل بدون غموض","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["创建全面的手工文档","解决上下文过载问题","实现无缝会话交接","支持创建和恢复会话","提高开发效率"],"ja":["包括的なハンドオフ文書を作成","コンテキスト過負荷問題を解決","シームレスなセッションハンドオフを実現","作成と復元の両方をサポート","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["포괄적인 핸드오버 문서 생성","컨텍스트 과부하 문제 해결","무중단 세션 핸드오버 구현","생성 및 복원 지원","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Crea documentos de entrega de sesión","Permite la continuación del trabajo sin ambigüedad","Resuelve el problema de agotamiento de contexto de agentes","Soporta la creación y reanudación de sesiones","Mejora la eficiencia del trabajo de los agentes de IA"],"fr":["Crée des documents de handoff de session","Permet la poursuite du travail sans ambiguïté","Résoudre le problème d''épuisement de contexte des agents","Prend en charge la création et la reprise de sessions","Améliore l''efficacité du travail des agents d''IA"],"de":["Erstellt Sitzungshändover-Dokumente","Ermöglicht die Fortsetzung der Arbeit ohne Unklarheiten","Löst das Problem des Kontextverlusts von Agenten","Unterstützt die Erstellung und Wiederaufnahme von Sitzungen","Verbessert die Effizienz der Arbeit von KI-Agenten"],"pt":["Criação de documentos de entrega abrangentes","Continuidade de trabalho sem ambiguidade","Resolução do problema de esgotamento de contexto de agente","Modos de criação e retomada de trabalho","Suporte à carga de contexto e estado atual"],"ru":["Создание всесторонних документов передачи","Продолжение работы без неоднозначностей","Решение проблемы истощения контекста агента","Режимы создания и возобновления работы","Поддержка загрузки контекста и текущего состояния"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات تسليم شاملة","الاستمرار في العمل بدون غموض","حل مشكلة استنفاد سياق العامل","أوضاع إنشاء واستئناف العمل","دعم تحميل السياق والحالة الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["会话交接","上下文过载","AI代理","开发效率","セッションハンドオフ","コンテキスト過負荷"],"ja":["セッションハンドオフ","コンテキスト過負荷","AIエージェント","開発効率","ハンドオフ文書","シームレス"],"ko":["세션 핸드오버","컨텍스트 과부하","AI 에이전트","개발 효율성","핸드오버 문서","무중단"],"es":["entrega de sesión","agentes de IA","documentos de entrega de sesión","continuación del trabajo","agotamiento de contexto","eficiencia del trabajo","tecnologías de IA","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["handoff de session","agents d''IA","documents de handoff de session","poursuite du travail","épuisement de contexte","efficacité du travail","technologies d''IA","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Sitzungshändover","KI-Agenten","Sitzungshändover-Dokumente","Fortsetzung der Arbeit","Kontextverlust","Effizienz der Arbeit","KI-Technologien","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["entrega de sessão","continuidade de trabalho","agentes de IA","documentos de entrega","esgotamento de contexto","modos de trabalho"],"ru":["передача сеанса","продолжение работы","агенты ИИ","документы передачи","истощение контекста","режимы работы"],"ar":["تسليم الجلسة","الاستمرار في العمل","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","مستندات التسليم","استنفاد السياق","أوضاع العمل"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"session-handoff","description":"Creates comprehensive handoff documents for seamless AI agent session transfers. Triggered when: (1) user requests handoff/memory/context save, (2) context window approaches capacity, (3) major task milestone completed, (4) work session ending, (5) user says save state, create handoff, I need to pause, context is getting full, (6) resuming work with load handoff, resume from, continue where we left off. Proactively suggests handoffs after substantial work (multiple file edits, complex debugging, architecture decisions). Solves long-running agent context exhaustion by enabling fresh agents to continue with zero ambiguity.","bodyPreview":"# Handoff\n\nCreates comprehensive handoff documents that enable fresh AI agents to seamlessly continue work with zero ambiguity. Solves the long-running agent context exhaustion problem.\n\n## Mode Selection\n\nDetermine which mode applies:\n\n**Creating a handoff?** User wants to save current state, pause work, or context is getting full.\n- Follow: CREATE Workflow below\n\n**Resuming from a handoff?** User wants to continue previous work, load context, or mentions an existing handoff.\n- Follow: RESUME W","body":"# Handoff\n\nCreates comprehensive handoff documents that enable fresh AI agents to seamlessly continue work with zero ambiguity. Solves the long-running agent context exhaustion problem.\n\n## Mode Selection\n\nDetermine which mode applies:\n\n**Creating a handoff?** User wants to save current state, pause work, or context is getting full.\n- Follow: CREATE Workflow below\n\n**Resuming from a handoff?** User wants to continue previous work, load context, or mentions an existing handoff.\n- Follow: RESUME Workflow below\n\n**Proactive suggestion?** After substantial work (5+ file edits, complex debugging, major decisions), suggest:\n> \"We''ve made significant progress. Consider creating a handoff document to preserve this context for future sessions. Say ''create handoff'' when ready.\"\n\n## CREATE Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Generate Scaffold\n\nRun the smart scaffold script to create a pre-filled handoff document:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/create_handoff.py [task-slug]\n```\n\nExample: `python scripts/create_handoff.py implementing-user-auth`\n\n**For continuation handoffs** (linking to previous work):\n```bash\npython scripts/create_handoff.py \"auth-part-2\" --continues-from 2024-01-15-auth.md\n```\n\nThe script will:\n- Create `.claude/handoffs/` directory if needed\n- Generate timestamped filename\n- Pre-fill: timestamp, project path, git branch, recent commits, modified files\n- Add handoff chain links if continuing from previous\n- Output file path for editing\n\n### Step 2: Complete the Handoff Document\n\nOpen the generated file and fill in all `[TODO: ...]` sections. Prioritize these sections:\n\n1. **Current State Summary** - What''s happening right now\n2. **Important Context** - Critical info the next agent MUST know\n3. **Immediate Next Steps** - Clear, actionable first steps\n4. **Decisions Made** - Choices with rationale (not just outcomes)\n\nUse the template structure in [references/handoff-template.md](references/handoff-template.md) for guidance.\n\n### Step 3: Validate the Handoff\n\nRun the validation script to check completeness and security:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/validate_handoff.py <handoff-file>\n```\n\nThe validator checks:\n- [ ] No `[TODO: ...]` placeholders remaining\n- [ ] Required sections present and populated\n- [ ] No potential secrets detected (API keys, passwords, tokens)\n- [ ] Referenced files exist\n- [ ] Quality score (0-100)\n\n**Do not finalize a handoff with secrets detected or score below 70.**\n\n### Step 4: Confirm Handoff\n\nReport to user:\n- Handoff file location\n- Validation score and any warnings\n- Summary of captured context\n- First action item for next session\n\n## RESUME Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Find Available Handoffs\n\nList handoffs in the current project:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/list_handoffs.py\n```\n\nThis shows all handoffs with dates, titles, and completion status.\n\n### Step 2: Check Staleness\n\nBefore loading, check how current the handoff is:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/check_staleness.py <handoff-file>\n```\n\nStaleness levels:\n- **FRESH**: Safe to resume - minimal changes since handoff\n- **SLIGHTLY_STALE**: Review changes, then resume\n- **STALE**: Verify context carefully before resuming\n- **VERY_STALE**: Consider creating a fresh handoff\n\nThe script checks:\n- Time since handoff was created\n- Git commits since handoff\n- Files changed since handoff\n- Branch divergence\n- Missing referenced files\n\n### Step 3: Load the Handoff\n\nRead the relevant handoff document completely before taking any action.\n\nIf handoff is part of a chain (has \"Continues from\" link), also read the linked previous handoff for full context.\n\n### Step 4: Verify Context\n\nFollow the checklist in [references/resume-checklist.md](references/resume-checklist.md):\n\n1. Verify project directory and git branch match\n2. Check if blockers have been resolved\n3. Validate assumptions still hold\n4. Review modified files for conflicts\n5. Check environment state\n\n### Step 5: Begin Work\n\nStart with \"Immediate Next Steps\" item #1 from the handoff document.\n\nReference these sections as you work:\n- \"Critical Files\" for important locations\n- \"Key Patterns Discovered\" for conventions to follow\n- \"Potential Gotchas\" to avoid known issues\n\n### Step 6: Update or Chain Handoffs\n\nAs you work:\n- Mark completed items in \"Pending Work\"\n- Add new discoveries to relevant sections\n- For long sessions: create a new handoff with `--continues-from` to chain them\n\n## Handoff Chaining\n\nFor long-running projects, chain handoffs together to maintain context lineage:\n\n```\nhandoff-1.md (initial work)\n    ↓\nhandoff-2.md --continues-from handoff-1.md\n    ↓\nhandoff-3.md --continues-from handoff-2.md\n```\n\nEach handoff in the chain:\n- Links to its predecessor\n- Can mark older handoffs as superseded\n- Provides context breadcrumbs for new agents\n\nWhen resuming from a chain, read the most recent handoff first, then reference predecessors as needed.\n\n## Storage Location\n\nHandoffs are stored in: `.claude/handoffs/`\n\nNaming convention: `YYYY-MM-DD-HHMMSS-[slug].md`\n\nExample: `2024-01-15-143022-implementing-auth.md`\n\n## Resources\n\n### scripts/\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `create_handoff.py [slug] [--continues-from <file>]` | Generate new handoff with smart scaffolding |\n| `list_handoffs.py [path]` | List available handoffs in a project |\n| `validate_handoff.py <file>` | Check completeness, quality, and security |\n| `check_staleness.py <file>` | Assess if handoff context is still current |\n\n### references/\n\n- [handoff-template.md](references/handoff-template.md) - Complete template structure with guidance\n- [resume-checklist.md](references/resume-checklist.md) - Verification checklist for resuming agents\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:41:24.674Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, or LangChain needing seamless session handoffs and context continuity","zh":"非常适合 Claude、AutoGPT 或 LangChain 等 AI 代理，需要无缝会话交接和上下文连续性","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、または LangChain などの AI エージェントに適しています。シームレスなセッションのハンドオフとコンテキストの継続性が必要です","ko":"Claude, AutoGPT 또는 LangChain과 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 무중단 세션 핸드오버와 컨텍스트 연속성이 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT o LangChain que necesitan una transferencia de sesión sin problemas y continuidad de contexto","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA comme Claude, AutoGPT ou LangChain qui ont besoin d''une relève de session sans heurts et d''une continuité de contexte","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT oder LangChain, die eine nahtlose Sitzungsübergabe und Kontextkontinuität benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT ou LangChain que necessitam de transferências de sessão sem interrupção e continuidade de contexto","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, AutoGPT или LangChain, требующих бесперебойной передачи сессий и непрерывности контекста","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude أو AutoGPT أو LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى نقل جلسات بدون انقطاع واستمرارية السياق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive handoff documents, solving the agent context exhaustion problem through modes like CREATE and RESUME workflows, utilizing protocols for zero-ambiguity work continuation","zh":"使代理能够创建全面的交接文档，通过 CREATE 和 RESUME 工作流等模式解决代理上下文耗尽问题，利用协议实现零模糊的工作继续","ja":"エージェントが包括的なハンドオフ文書を作成できるようにし、CREATE および RESUME ワークフローなどのモードを使用してエージェントのコンテキスト枯渇問題を解決し、プロトコルを使用して曖昧さのない作業の継続を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 핸드오버 문서를 만들 수 있도록 하여 CREATE 및 RESUME 워크플로와 같은 모드를 사용하여 에이전트 컨텍스트 고갈 문제를 해결하고 프로토콜을 사용하여 모호함이 없는 작업 연속성을 실현합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear documentos de transferencia exhaustivos, resolviendo el problema de agotamiento de contexto del agente a través de modos como flujos de trabajo CREATE y RESUME, utilizando protocolos para una continuación de trabajo sin ambigüedad","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des documents de relève complets, en résolvant le problème d''épuisement du contexte de l''agent grâce à des modes tels que les flux de travail CREATE et RESUME, en utilisant des protocoles pour une continuation de travail sans ambiguïté","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Übergabedokumente zu erstellen, indem sie das Kontext-Erschöpfungsproblem des Agents durch Modi wie CREATE- und RESUME-Arbeitsabläufe lösen, wobei Protokolle für eine eindeutige Arbeitsfortsetzung verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar documentos de transferência abrangentes, resolvendo o problema de exaustão de contexto do agente por meio de modos como fluxos de trabalho CREATE e RESUME, utilizando protocolos para continuação de trabalho sem ambiguidade","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать полные документы передачи, решая проблему истощения контекста агента через режимы, такие как рабочие процессы CREATE и RESUME, используя протоколы для бесперебойного продолжения работы","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء مستندات إنهاء شاملة، وحل مشكلة استنفاد سياق العميل من خلال وضعيات مثل CREATE و RESUME للعمل، باستخدام بروتوكولات لاستمرار العمل بدون غموض"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating handoff documents for paused work","Resuming previous work with loaded context","Automating workflow transitions between agents"],"zh":["为暂停的工作创建交接文档","加载上下文后恢复之前的工作","自动化代理之间的工作流转换"],"ja":["一時停止した作業のハンドオフ文書の作成","コンテキストを読み込んだ後、前の作業を再開する","エージェント間のワークフロー遷移の自動化"],"ko":["일시 중단된 작업을 위한 핸드오버 문서 만들기","컨텍스트를 로드한 후 이전 작업 다시 실행","에이전트 간 워크플로 전환 자동화"],"es":["Crear documentos de transferencia para trabajo pausado","Reanudar trabajo anterior con contexto cargado","Automatizar transiciones de flujo de trabajo entre agentes"],"fr":["Créer des documents de relève pour le travail en pause","Reprendre le travail précédent avec le contexte chargé","Automatiser les transitions de flux de travail entre les agents"],"de":["Erstellen von Übergabedokumenten für pausiertes Arbeiten","Wiederaufnahme vorherigen Arbeit mit geladenem Kontext","Automatisierung von Arbeitsablaufübergängen zwischen Agenten"],"pt":["Criar documentos de transferência para trabalhos pausados","Retomar trabalhos anteriores com contexto carregado","Automatizar transições de fluxo de trabalho entre agentes"],"ru":["Создание документов передачи для приостановленной работы","Возобновление предыдущей работы с загруженным контекстом","Автоматизация переходов рабочих процессов между агентами"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات إنهاء للعمل المتوقف","استئناف العمل السابق مع سياق محمل","توفير الت自動ة لتحويلات سير العمل بين الوكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires mode selection between CREATE and RESUME workflows","Context exhaustion problem must be identified"],"zh":["需要在 CREATE 和 RESUME 工作流之间选择模式","必须识别上下文耗尽问题"],"ja":["CREATE と RESUME ワークフロー間でモードの選択が必要","コンテキスト枯渇問題を特定する必要がある"],"ko":["CREATE 및 RESUME 워크플로우 사이에서 모드를 선택해야 함","컨텍스트 고갈 문제를 식별해야 함"],"es":["Requiere la selección de modo entre flujos de trabajo CREATE y RESUME","El problema de agotamiento de contexto debe ser identificado"],"fr":["Nécessite la sélection de mode entre les flux de travail CREATE et RESUME","Le problème d''épuisement du contexte doit être identifié"],"de":["Erfordert die Modusaufwahl zwischen CREATE- und RESUME-Arbeitsabläufen","Das Kontext-Erschöpfungsproblem muss identifiziert werden"],"pt":["Exige seleção de modo entre fluxos de trabalho CREATE e RESUME","O problema de exaustão de contexto do agente deve ser identificado"],"ru":["Требует выбора режима между рабочими процессами CREATE и RESUME","Проблема истощения контекста агента должна быть выявлена"],"ar":["يتطلب اختيار وضع بين CREATE و RESUME للعمل","يجب تحديد مشكلة استنفاد سياق العميل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
