рограмма рекомендаций - Оптимизация вирусного роста","ar":"برنامج الإحالة - تحسين النمو المتواصل","en":"referral-program"},"description":{"zh":"推荐程序是将客户转化为增长引擎的关键。设计和优化推荐程序需要深入了解客户行为和营销策略","ja":"リファラルプログラムは顧客を成長エンジンに変える重要な手段です。設計と最適化には、顧客の行動とマーケティング戦略についての深い理解が必要です","ko":"추천 프로그램은 고객을 성장 엔진으로 변환하는 중요한 수단입니다. 설계와 최적화에는 고객의 행동과 마케팅 전략에 대한 깊은 이해가 필요합니다","es":"Programas de referidos y afiliados para impulsar el crecimiento viral. Ayuda a diseñar y optimizar programas que conviertan a los clientes en motores de crec...","fr":"Programmes de parrainage et d''affiliation pour stimuler la croissance virale. Aide à concevoir et optimiser des programmes qui transforment les clients en mo...","de":"Empfehlungs- und Affiliate-Programme für virales Wachstum. Hilft bei der Gestaltung und Optimierung von Programmen, die Kunden in Wachstumsmotoren verwandeln.","pt":"O programa de recomendação é uma estratégia de marketing que visa converter clientes em embaixadores da marca, impulsionando o crescimento viral","ru":"Программа рекомендаций - это маркетинговая стратегия, направленная на превращение клиентов в послов бренда, стимулирующая вирусный рост","ar":"برنامج الإحالة هو استراتيجية تسويقية تهدف إلى تحويل العملاء إلى سفير للعلامة التجارية، وتعزيز النمو المتواصل","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设计和优化推荐程序","了解客户行为和营销策略","将客户转化为增长引擎","提高客户忠诚度和留存率","增加推荐和转化率"],"ja":["リファラルプログラムの設計と最適化","顧客の行動とマーケティング戦略の理解","顧客を成長エンジンに変える","顧客のロイヤルティとリテンション率の向上","リファラルとコンバージョン率の増加"],"ko":["추천 프로그램의 설계와 최적화","고객의 행동과 마케팅 전략의 이해","고객을 성장 엔진으로 변환","고객의 충성도와 리텐션率의 향상","추천과 전환률의 증가"],"es":["Diseño de programas de referidos personalizados","Optimización de programas para crecimiento viral","Integración con estrategias de marketing existentes","Análisis y seguimiento de resultados","Mejora de la experiencia del cliente"],"fr":["Conception de programmes de parrainage sur mesure","Optimisation de programmes pour croissance virale","Intégration avec des stratégies de marketing existantes","Analyse et suivi des résultats","Amélioration de l''expérience client"],"de":["Entwurf von maßgeschneiderten Empfehlungsprogrammen","Optimierung von Programmen für virales Wachstum","Integration mit bestehenden Marketingstrategien","Analyse und Verfolgung von Ergebnissen","Verbesserung der Kundenerfahrung"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de estratégias de crescimento viral","Criação de programas de recomendação personalizados","Otimização de experiência do usuário para aumentar as conversões","Análise de dados para medir a eficácia do programa","Integração com canais de marketing existentes"],"ru":["Разработка стратегий вирусного роста","Создание индивидуальных программ рекомендаций","Оптимизация пользовательского опыта для увеличения конверсий","Анализ данных для измерения эффективности программы","Интеграция с существующими маркетинговыми каналами"],"ar":["تطوير استراتيجيات النمو المتواصل","إنشاء برامج إحالة مخصصة","تحسين تجربة المستخدم لزيادة التحويلات","تحليل البيانات لقياس فعالية البرنامج","التكامل مع القنوات التسويقية الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["推荐程序","营销策略","客户行为","增长引擎","推荐营销","客户忠诚度","转化率"],"ja":["リファラルプログラム","マーケティング戦略","顧客の行動","成長エンジン","リファラルマーケティング","顧客ロイヤルティ","コンバージョン率"],"ko":["추천 프로그램","마케팅 전략","고객 행동","성장 엔진","추천 마케팅","고객 충성도","전환률"],"es":["programas de referidos","crecimiento viral","marketing de afiliados","estrategias de marketing","experiencia del cliente","análisis de resultados"],"fr":["programmes de parrainage","croissance virale","marketing d''affiliation","stratégies de marketing","expérience client","analyse de résultats"],"de":["Empfehlungsprogramme","virales Wachstum","Affiliate-Marketing","Marketingstrategien","Kundenerfahrung","Ergebnisanalyse"],"pt":["programa de recomendação","crescimento viral","marketing de recomendação","desenvolvimento de estratégias","otimização de experiência do usuário","análise de dados"],"ru":["программа рекомендаций","вирусный рост","маркетинг рекомендаций","разработка стратегий","оптимизация пользовательского опыта","анализ данных"],"ar":["برنامج الإحالة","النمو المتواصل","تسويق الإحالة","تطوير الاستراتيجيات","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","تحليل البيانات"]}},"owner":"yunusemreerkesikbas","repo":"AdminCraft","repoPath":"yunusemreerkesikbas/AdminCraft","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"referral-program","description":"When the user wants to create, optimize, or analyze a referral program, affiliate program, or word-of-mouth strategy. Also use when the user mentions referral, affiliate, ambassador, word of mouth, viral loop, refer a friend, or partner program. This skill covers program design, incentive structure, and growth optimization.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Referral & Affiliate Programs\n\nYou are an expert in viral growth and referral marketing. Your goal is to help design and optimize programs that turn customers into growth engines.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Program Type\n- Customer","body":"# Referral & Affiliate Programs\n\nYou are an expert in viral growth and referral marketing. Your goal is to help design and optimize programs that turn customers into growth engines.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Program Type\n- Customer referral program, affiliate program, or both?\n- B2B or B2C?\n- What''s the average customer LTV?\n- What''s your current CAC from other channels?\n\n### 2. Current State\n- Existing referral/affiliate program?\n- Current referral rate (% who refer)?\n- What incentives have you tried?\n\n### 3. Product Fit\n- Is your product shareable?\n- Does it have network effects?\n- Do customers naturally talk about it?\n\n### 4. Resources\n- Tools/platforms you use or consider?\n- Budget for referral incentives?\n\n---\n\n## Referral vs. Affiliate\n\n### Customer Referral Programs\n\n**Best for:**\n- Existing customers recommending to their network\n- Products with natural word-of-mouth\n- Lower-ticket or self-serve products\n\n**Characteristics:**\n- Referrer is an existing customer\n- One-time or limited rewards\n- Higher trust, lower volume\n\n### Affiliate Programs\n\n**Best for:**\n- Reaching audiences you don''t have access to\n- Content creators, influencers, bloggers\n- Higher-ticket products that justify commissions\n\n**Characteristics:**\n- Affiliates may not be customers\n- Ongoing commission relationship\n- Higher volume, variable trust\n\n---\n\n## Referral Program Design\n\n### The Referral Loop\n\n```\nTrigger Moment → Share Action → Convert Referred → Reward → (Loop)\n```\n\n### Step 1: Identify Trigger Moments\n\n**High-intent moments:**\n- Right after first \"aha\" moment\n- After achieving a milestone\n- After exceptional support\n- After renewing or upgrading\n\n### Step 2: Design Share Mechanism\n\n**Ranked by effectiveness:**\n1. In-product sharing (highest conversion)\n2. Personalized link\n3. Email invitation\n4. Social sharing\n5. Referral code (works offline)\n\n### Step 3: Choose Incentive Structure\n\n**Single-sided rewards** (referrer only): Simpler, works for high-value products\n\n**Double-sided rewards** (both parties): Higher conversion, win-win framing\n\n**Tiered rewards**: Gamifies referral process, increases engagement\n\n**For examples and incentive sizing**: See [references/program-examples.md](references/program-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Program Optimization\n\n### Improving Referral Rate\n\n**If few customers are referring:**\n- Ask at better moments\n- Simplify sharing process\n- Test different incentive types\n- Make referral prominent in product\n\n**If referrals aren''t converting:**\n- Improve landing experience for referred users\n- Strengthen incentive for new users\n- Ensure referrer''s endorsement is visible\n\n### A/B Tests to Run\n\n**Incentive tests:** Amount, type, single vs. double-sided, timing\n\n**Messaging tests:** Program description, CTA copy, landing page copy\n\n**Placement tests:** Where and when the referral prompt appears\n\n### Common Problems & Fixes\n\n| Problem | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Low awareness | Add prominent in-app prompts |\n| Low share rate | Simplify to one click |\n| Low conversion | Optimize referred user experience |\n| Fraud/abuse | Add verification, limits |\n| One-time referrers | Add tiered/gamified rewards |\n\n---\n\n## Measuring Success\n\n### Key Metrics\n\n**Program health:**\n- Active referrers (referred someone in last 30 days)\n- Referral conversion rate\n- Rewards earned/paid\n\n**Business impact:**\n- % of new customers from referrals\n- CAC via referral vs. other channels\n- LTV of referred customers\n- Referral program ROI\n\n### Typical Findings\n\n- Referred customers have 16-25% higher LTV\n- Referred customers have 18-37% lower churn\n- Referred customers refer others at 2-3x rate\n\n---\n\n## Launch Checklist\n\n### Before Launch\n- [ ] Define program goals and success metrics\n- [ ] Design incentive structure\n- [ ] Build or configure referral tool\n- [ ] Create referral landing page\n- [ ] Set up tracking and attribution\n- [ ] Define fraud prevention rules\n- [ ] Create terms and conditions\n- [ ] Test complete referral flow\n\n### Launch\n- [ ] Announce to existing customers\n- [ ] Add in-app referral prompts\n- [ ] Update website with program details\n- [ ] Brief support team\n\n### Post-Launch (First 30 Days)\n- [ ] Review conversion funnel\n- [ ] Identify top referrers\n- [ ] Gather feedback\n- [ ] Fix friction points\n- [ ] Send reminder emails to non-referrers\n\n---\n\n## Email Sequences\n\n### Referral Program Launch\n\n```\nSubject: You can now earn [reward] for sharing [Product]\n\nWe just launched our referral program!\n\nShare [Product] with friends and earn [reward] for each signup.\nThey get [their reward] too.\n\n[Unique referral link]\n\n1. Share your link\n2. Friend signs up\n3. You both get [reward]\n```\n\n### Referral Nurture Sequence\n\n- Day 7: Remind about referral program\n- Day 30: \"Know anyone who''d benefit?\"\n- Day 60: Success story + referral prompt\n- After milestone: \"You achieved [X]—know others who''d want this?\"\n\n---\n\n## Affiliate Programs\n\n**For detailed affiliate program design, commission structures, recruitment, and tools**: See [references/affiliate-programs.md](references/affiliate-programs.md)\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of program (referral, affiliate, or both)?\n2. What''s your customer LTV and current CAC?\n3. Existing program or starting from scratch?\n4. What tools/platforms are you considering?\n5. What''s your budget for rewards/commissions?\n6. Is your product naturally shareable?\n\n---\n\n## Tool Integrations\n\nFor implementation, see the [tools registry](../../tools/REGISTRY.md). Key tools for referral programs:\n\n| Tool | Best For | Guide |\n|------|----------|-------|\n| **Rewardful** | Stripe-native affiliate programs | [rewardful.md](../../tools/integrations/rewardful.md) |\n| **Tolt** | SaaS affiliate programs | [tolt.md](../../tools/integrations/tolt.md) |\n| **Mention Me** | Enterprise referral programs | [mention-me.md](../../tools/integrations/mention-me.md) |\n| **Dub.co** | Link tracking and attribution | [dub-co.md](../../tools/integrations/dub-co.md) |\n| **Stripe** | Payment processing (for commission tracking) | [stripe.md](../../tools/integrations/stripe.md) |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **launch-strategy**: For launching referral program effectively\n- **email-sequence**: For referral nurture campaigns\n- **marketing-psychology**: For understanding referral motivation\n- **analytics-tracking**: For tracking referral attribution\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:41:30.623Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents specializing in viral growth and customer retention strategies.","zh":"非常适合专注于病毒式增长和客户留存策略的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントがウイルス性成長と顧客留存戦略を専門とする場合に最適です。","ko":"마케팅 에이전트가 바이러스성 성장과 고객 유지 전략을 전문으로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing especializados en crecimiento viral y estrategias de retención de clientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing spécialisés dans la croissance virale et les stratégies de rétention des clients.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die sich auf virales Wachstum und Kundenbindungstrategien spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing especializados em crescimento viral e estratégias de retenção de clientes.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, специализирующихся на вирусном росте и стратегиях удержания клиентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الذين ي专زون في النمو الفيروسي واستراتيجيات الاحتفاظ بالعملاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and optimize referral programs using product marketing context, leveraging customer growth engines and viral marketing techniques through .claude/product-marketing-context.md files and specific program types like customer referrals.","zh":"赋予代理设计和优化推荐计划的能力，利用产品营销环境、客户增长引擎和病毒式营销技术，通过.claude/product-marketing-context.md 文件和特定的计划类型，如客户推荐。","ja":"エージェントがプロダクトマーケティングコンテキストを利用して、リファラープログラムを設計、最適化することを可能にします。.claude/product-marketing-context.md ファイルと、顧客リファラープログラムなどの特定のプログラムタイプを使用して、ウイルス性マーケティングテクニックと顧客成長エンジンを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 제품 마케팅 환경, 고객 성장 엔진 및 바이러스성 마케팅 기술을 사용하여 추천 프로그램을 설계하고 최적화할 수 있도록 합니다. .claude/product-marketing-context.md 파일 및 고객 추천 프로그램과 같은 특정 프로그램 유형을 통해","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar y optimizar programas de recomendación utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos, aprovechando los motores de crecimiento de clientes y las técnicas de marketing viral a través de archivos .claude/product-marketing-context.md y tipos de programas específicos como referidos de clientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et d''optimiser des programmes de recommandation en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits, en exploitant les moteurs de croissance des clients et les techniques de marketing viral via des fichiers .claude/product-marketing-context.md et des types de programmes spécifiques tels que les références de clients.","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, Empfehlungsprogramme zu entwerfen und zu optimieren, indem sie den Produktmarketing-Kontext nutzen, Kundenwachstumsmotoren und virale Marketingtechniken über .claude/product-marketing-context.md-Dateien und spezifische Programmarten wie Kundenempfehlungen ausnutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e otimizar programas de referência usando o contexto de marketing de produtos, aproveitando os motores de crescimento de clientes e técnicas de marketing viral por meio de arquivos .claude/product-marketing-context.md e tipos de programas específicos, como referências de clientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и оптимизировать программы рекомендаций с использованием контекста маркетинга продукта, используя двигатели роста клиентов и вирусные маркетинговые техники через файлы .claude/product-marketing-context.md и конкретные типы программ, такие как рекомендации клиентов.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتصميم وتنظيم برامج الإحالة باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج، واستغلال محركات نمو العملاء وتقنيات التسويق الفيروسي من خلال ملفات .claude/product-marketing-context.md وأنواع برامج محددة مثل إحالات العملاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing customer referral programs","Optimizing viral growth strategies","Analyzing product marketing context for referral programs"],"zh":["设计客户推荐计划","优化病毒式增长策略","分析产品营销环境以用于推荐计划"],"ja":["顧客リファラープログラムの設計","ウイルス性成長戦略の最適化","リファラープログラムのためのプロダクトマーケティングコンテキストの分析"],"ko":["고객 추천 프로그램 설계","바이러스성 성장 전략 최적화","추천 프로그램을 위한 제품 마케팅 환경 분석"],"es":["Diseñar programas de referidos de clientes","Optimizar estrategias de crecimiento viral","Analizar el contexto de marketing de productos para programas de referidos"],"fr":["Concevoir des programmes de références de clients","Optimiser les stratégies de croissance virale","Analyser le contexte de marketing de produits pour les programmes de références"],"de":["Entwerfen von Kundenempfehlungsprogrammen","Optimieren von viralen Wachstumsstrategien","Analysieren des Produktmarketing-Kontexts für Empfehlungsprogramme"],"pt":["Projetar programas de referência de clientes","Otimizar estratégias de crescimento viral","Analisar o contexto de marketing de produtos para programas de referência"],"ru":["Проектирование программ рекомендаций клиентов","Оптимизация стратегий вирусного роста","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта для программ рекомендаций"],"ar":["تصميم برامج إحالة العملاء","تحسين استراتيجيات النمو الفيروسي","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج لبرامج الإحالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context file (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limited to customer referral program type"],"zh":["需要产品营销环境文件 (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","仅限客户推荐计划类型"],"ja":["プロダクトマーケティングコンテキストファイル (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) が必要","顧客リファラープログラムタイプに限定される"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 환경 파일 (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) 필요","고객 추천 프로그램 유형으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere archivo de contexto de marketing de productos (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limitado al tipo de programa de referidos de clientes"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de contexte de marketing de produits (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limité au type de programme de références de clients"],"de":["Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontextdatei (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Begrenzt auf Kundenempfehlungsprogrammtyp"],"pt":["Requer arquivo de contexto de marketing de produtos (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limitado ao tipo de programa de referência de clientes"],"ru":["Требует файла контекста маркетинга продукта (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Ограничен типом программы рекомендаций клиентов"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف سياق تسويق المنتج (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","محدود بنوع برنامج إحالة العملاء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
