cretos","Análisis de la autenticación y autorización","Revisión de la seguridad de la API","Detección de posibles ataques"],"fr":["Identification des vulnérabilités de sécurité","Suivi des meilleures pratiques de sécurité","Vérification de la gestion des secrets","Analyse de l''authentification et de l''autorisation","Vérification de la sécurité de l''API","Détection de possibles attaques"],"de":["Identifizierung von Sicherheitsschwachstellen","Befolgen der besten Sicherheitspraktiken","Überprüfung der Geheimnisverwaltung","Analyse der Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Überprüfung der API-Sicherheit","Erkennung von möglichen Angriffen"],"pt":["Verificação de segredos e credenciais","Análise de entrada de usuário e upload de arquivos","Criação de pontos de extremidade de API seguros","Trabalho com dados sensíveis","Integração com APIs de terceiros"],"ru":["Проверка секретов и учетных данных","Анализ пользовательского ввода и загрузки файлов","Создание безопасных конечных точек API","Работа с конфиденциальными данными","Интеграция с API третьих сторон"],"ar":["فحص الأسرار والبيانات الاعتبارية","تحليل إدخال المستخدم ورفع الملفات","إنشاء نقاط نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الآمنة","العمل مع البيانات الحساسة","التكامل مع واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الخارجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码安全审查","安全最佳实践","潜在漏洞","身份验证","用户输入","API安全","代码审查"],"ja":["コードセキュリティレビュー","セキュリティのベストプラクティス","潜在的な脆弱性","認証","ユーザー入力","APIセキュリティ","コードレビュー"],"ko":["코드 보안 리뷰","보안의 베스트 프랙티스","잠재적인 취약성","인증","사용자 입력","API 보안","코드 리뷰"],"es":["seguridad del código","revisión de seguridad","mejores prácticas de seguridad","vulnerabilidades de seguridad","gestión de secretos","autenticación y autorización","seguridad de la API","desarrollo seguro"],"fr":["sécurité du code","vérification de sécurité","meilleures pratiques de sécurité","vulnérabilités de sécurité","gestion des secrets","authentification et autorisation","sécurité de l''API","développement sécurisé"],"de":["Codesicherheit","Sicherheitsprüfung","beste Sicherheitspraktiken","Sicherheitsschwachstellen","Geheimnisverwaltung","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","API-Sicherheit","sichere Entwicklung"],"pt":["revisão de segurança","segurança de código","melhores práticas de segurança","vulnerabilidades de segurança","desenvolvimento de software seguro","segurança de dados"],"ru":["анализ безопасности","безопасность кода","лучшие практики безопасности","уязвимости безопасности","разработка безопасного программного обеспечения","безопасность данных"],"ar":["استعراض الأمان","أمان الشفرة","أفضل الممارسات الأمنية","ثغرات الأمان","تنمية البرمجيات الآمنة","أمان البيانات"]}},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-review","description":"Use this skill when adding authentication, handling user input, working with secrets, creating API endpoints, or implementing payment/sensitive features. Provides comprehensive security checklist and patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Security Review Skill\n\nThis skill ensures all code follows security best practices and identifies potential vulnerabilities.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Implementing authentication or authorization\n- Handling user input or file uploads\n- Creating new API endpoints\n- Working with secrets or credentials\n- Implementing payment features\n- Storing or transmitting sensitive data\n- Integrating third-party APIs\n\n## Security Checklist\n\n### 1. Secrets Management\n\n#### ❌ NEVER Do This\n```typescript\nconst api","body":"# Security Review Skill\n\nThis skill ensures all code follows security best practices and identifies potential vulnerabilities.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Implementing authentication or authorization\n- Handling user input or file uploads\n- Creating new API endpoints\n- Working with secrets or credentials\n- Implementing payment features\n- Storing or transmitting sensitive data\n- Integrating third-party APIs\n\n## Security Checklist\n\n### 1. Secrets Management\n\n#### ❌ NEVER Do This\n```typescript\nconst apiKey = \"sk-proj-xxxxx\"  // Hardcoded secret\nconst dbPassword = \"password123\" // In source code\n```\n\n#### ✅ ALWAYS Do This\n```typescript\nconst apiKey = process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY\nconst dbUrl = process.env.DATABASE_URL\n\n// Verify secrets exist\nif (!apiKey) {\n  throw new Error(''OPENAI_API_KEY not configured'')\n}\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] No hardcoded API keys, tokens, or passwords\n- [ ] All secrets in environment variables\n- [ ] `.env.local` in .gitignore\n- [ ] No secrets in git history\n- [ ] Production secrets in hosting platform (Vercel, Railway)\n\n### 2. Input Validation\n\n#### Always Validate User Input\n```typescript\nimport { z } from ''zod''\n\n// Define validation schema\nconst CreateUserSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  name: z.string().min(1).max(100),\n  age: z.number().int().min(0).max(150)\n})\n\n// Validate before processing\nexport async function createUser(input: unknown) {\n  try {\n    const validated = CreateUserSchema.parse(input)\n    return await db.users.create(validated)\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n      return { success: false, errors: error.errors }\n    }\n    throw error\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### File Upload Validation\n```typescript\nfunction validateFileUpload(file: File) {\n  // Size check (5MB max)\n  const maxSize = 5 * 1024 * 1024\n  if (file.size > maxSize) {\n    throw new Error(''File too large (max 5MB)'')\n  }\n\n  // Type check\n  const allowedTypes = [''image/jpeg'', ''image/png'', ''image/gif'']\n  if (!allowedTypes.includes(file.type)) {\n    throw new Error(''Invalid file type'')\n  }\n\n  // Extension check\n  const allowedExtensions = [''.jpg'', ''.jpeg'', ''.png'', ''.gif'']\n  const extension = file.name.toLowerCase().match(/\\.[^.]+$/)?.[0]\n  if (!extension || !allowedExtensions.includes(extension)) {\n    throw new Error(''Invalid file extension'')\n  }\n\n  return true\n}\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] All user inputs validated with schemas\n- [ ] File uploads restricted (size, type, extension)\n- [ ] No direct use of user input in queries\n- [ ] Whitelist validation (not blacklist)\n- [ ] Error messages don''t leak sensitive info\n\n### 3. SQL Injection Prevention\n\n#### ❌ NEVER Concatenate SQL\n```typescript\n// DANGEROUS - SQL Injection vulnerability\nconst query = `SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ''${userEmail}''`\nawait db.query(query)\n```\n\n#### ✅ ALWAYS Use Parameterized Queries\n```typescript\n// Safe - parameterized query\nconst { data } = await supabase\n  .from(''users'')\n  .select(''*'')\n  .eq(''email'', userEmail)\n\n// Or with raw SQL\nawait db.query(\n  ''SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = $1'',\n  [userEmail]\n)\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] All database queries use parameterized queries\n- [ ] No string concatenation in SQL\n- [ ] ORM/query builder used correctly\n- [ ] Supabase queries properly sanitized\n\n### 4. Authentication & Authorization\n\n#### JWT Token Handling\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: localStorage (vulnerable to XSS)\nlocalStorage.setItem(''token'', token)\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: httpOnly cookies\nres.setHeader(''Set-Cookie'',\n  `token=${token}; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Strict; Max-Age=3600`)\n```\n\n#### Authorization Checks\n```typescript\nexport async function deleteUser(userId: string, requesterId: string) {\n  // ALWAYS verify authorization first\n  const requester = await db.users.findUnique({\n    where: { id: requesterId }\n  })\n\n  if (requester.role !== ''admin'') {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: ''Unauthorized'' },\n      { status: 403 }\n    )\n  }\n\n  // Proceed with deletion\n  await db.users.delete({ where: { id: userId } })\n}\n```\n\n#### Row Level Security (Supabase)\n```sql\n-- Enable RLS on all tables\nALTER TABLE users ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\n\n-- Users can only view their own data\nCREATE POLICY \"Users view own data\"\n  ON users FOR SELECT\n  USING (auth.uid() = id);\n\n-- Users can only update their own data\nCREATE POLICY \"Users update own data\"\n  ON users FOR UPDATE\n  USING (auth.uid() = id);\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] Tokens stored in httpOnly cookies (not localStorage)\n- [ ] Authorization checks before sensitive operations\n- [ ] Row Level Security enabled in Supabase\n- [ ] Role-based access control implemented\n- [ ] Session management secure\n\n### 5. XSS Prevention\n\n#### Sanitize HTML\n```typescript\nimport DOMPurify from ''isomorphic-dompurify''\n\n// ALWAYS sanitize user-provided HTML\nfunction renderUserContent(html: string) {\n  const clean = DOMPurify.sanitize(html, {\n    ALLOWED_TAGS: [''b'', ''i'', ''em'', ''strong'', ''p''],\n    ALLOWED_ATTR: []\n  })\n  return <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: clean }} />\n}\n```\n\n#### Content Security Policy\n```typescript\n// next.config.js\nconst securityHeaders = [\n  {\n    key: ''Content-Security-Policy'',\n    value: `\n      default-src ''self'';\n      script-src ''self'' ''unsafe-eval'' ''unsafe-inline'';\n      style-src ''self'' ''unsafe-inline'';\n      img-src ''self'' data: https:;\n      font-src ''self'';\n      connect-src ''self'' https://api.example.com;\n    `.replace(/\\s{2,}/g, '' '').trim()\n  }\n]\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] User-provided HTML sanitized\n- [ ] CSP headers configured\n- [ ] No unvalidated dynamic content rendering\n- [ ] React''s built-in XSS protection used\n\n### 6. CSRF Protection\n\n#### CSRF Tokens\n```typescript\nimport { csrf } from ''@/lib/csrf''\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const token = request.headers.get(''X-CSRF-Token'')\n\n  if (!csrf.verify(token)) {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: ''Invalid CSRF token'' },\n      { status: 403 }\n    )\n  }\n\n  // Process request\n}\n```\n\n#### SameSite Cookies\n```typescript\nres.setHeader(''Set-Cookie'',\n  `session=${sessionId}; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Strict`)\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] CSRF tokens on state-changing operations\n- [ ] SameSite=Strict on all cookies\n- [ ] Double-submit cookie pattern implemented\n\n### 7. Rate Limiting\n\n#### API Rate Limiting\n```typescript\nimport rateLimit from ''express-rate-limit''\n\nconst limiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000, // 15 minutes\n  max: 100, // 100 requests per window\n  message: ''Too many requests''\n})\n\n// Apply to routes\napp.use(''/api/'', limiter)\n```\n\n#### Expensive Operations\n```typescript\n// Aggressive rate limiting for searches\nconst searchLimiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: 60 * 1000, // 1 minute\n  max: 10, // 10 requests per minute\n  message: ''Too many search requests''\n})\n\napp.use(''/api/search'', searchLimiter)\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] Rate limiting on all API endpoints\n- [ ] Stricter limits on expensive operations\n- [ ] IP-based rate limiting\n- [ ] User-based rate limiting (authenticated)\n\n### 8. Sensitive Data Exposure\n\n#### Logging\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Logging sensitive data\nconsole.log(''User login:'', { email, password })\nconsole.log(''Payment:'', { cardNumber, cvv })\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Redact sensitive data\nconsole.log(''User login:'', { email, userId })\nconsole.log(''Payment:'', { last4: card.last4, userId })\n```\n\n#### Error Messages\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Exposing internal details\ncatch (error) {\n  return NextResponse.json(\n    { error: error.message, stack: error.stack },\n    { status: 500 }\n  )\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Generic error messages\ncatch (error) {\n  console.error(''Internal error:'', error)\n  return NextResponse.json(\n    { error: ''An error occurred. Please try again.'' },\n    { status: 500 }\n  )\n}\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] No passwords, tokens, or secrets in logs\n- [ ] Error messages generic for users\n- [ ] Detailed errors only in server logs\n- [ ] No stack traces exposed to users\n\n### 9. Blockchain Security (Solana)\n\n#### Wallet Verification\n```typescript\nimport { verify } from ''@solana/web3.js''\n\nasync function verifyWalletOwnership(\n  publicKey: string,\n  signature: string,\n  message: string\n) {\n  try {\n    const isValid = verify(\n      Buffer.from(message),\n      Buffer.from(signature, ''base64''),\n      Buffer.from(publicKey, ''base64'')\n    )\n    return isValid\n  } catch (error) {\n    return false\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Transaction Verification\n```typescript\nasync function verifyTransaction(transaction: Transaction) {\n  // Verify recipient\n  if (transaction.to !== expectedRecipient) {\n    throw new Error(''Invalid recipient'')\n  }\n\n  // Verify amount\n  if (transaction.amount > maxAmount) {\n    throw new Error(''Amount exceeds limit'')\n  }\n\n  // Verify user has sufficient balance\n  const balance = await getBalance(transaction.from)\n  if (balance < transaction.amount) {\n    throw new Error(''Insufficient balance'')\n  }\n\n  return true\n}\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] Wallet signatures verified\n- [ ] Transaction details validated\n- [ ] Balance checks before transactions\n- [ ] No blind transaction signing\n\n### 10. Dependency Security\n\n#### Regular Updates\n```bash\n# Check for vulnerabilities\nnpm audit\n\n# Fix automatically fixable issues\nnpm audit fix\n\n# Update dependencies\nnpm update\n\n# Check for outdated packages\nnpm outdated\n```\n\n#### Lock Files\n```bash\n# ALWAYS commit lock files\ngit add package-lock.json\n\n# Use in CI/CD for reproducible builds\nnpm ci  # Instead of npm install\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] Dependencies up to date\n- [ ] No known vulnerabilities (npm audit clean)\n- [ ] Lock files committed\n- [ ] Dependabot enabled on GitHub\n- [ ] Regular security updates\n\n## Security Testing\n\n### Automated Security Tests\n```typescript\n// Test authentication\ntest(''requires authentication'', async () => {\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/protected'')\n  expect(response.status).toBe(401)\n})\n\n// Test authorization\ntest(''requires admin role'', async () => {\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/admin'', {\n    headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${userToken}` }\n  })\n  expect(response.status).toBe(403)\n})\n\n// Test input validation\ntest(''rejects invalid input'', async () => {\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/users'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    body: JSON.stringify({ email: ''not-an-email'' })\n  })\n  expect(response.status).toBe(400)\n})\n\n// Test rate limiting\ntest(''enforces rate limits'', async () => {\n  const requests = Array(101).fill(null).map(() =>\n    fetch(''/api/endpoint'')\n  )\n\n  const responses = await Promise.all(requests)\n  const tooManyRequests = responses.filter(r => r.status === 429)\n\n  expect(tooManyRequests.length).toBeGreaterThan(0)\n})\n```\n\n## Pre-Deployment Security Checklist\n\nBefore ANY production deployment:\n\n- [ ] **Secrets**: No hardcoded secrets, all in env vars\n- [ ] **Input Validation**: All user inputs validated\n- [ ] **SQL Injection**: All queries parameterized\n- [ ] **XSS**: User content sanitized\n- [ ] **CSRF**: Protection enabled\n- [ ] **Authentication**: Proper token handling\n- [ ] **Authorization**: Role checks in place\n- [ ] **Rate Limiting**: Enabled on all endpoints\n- [ ] **HTTPS**: Enforced in production\n- [ ] **Security Headers**: CSP, X-Frame-Options configured\n- [ ] **Error Handling**: No sensitive data in errors\n- [ ] **Logging**: No sensitive data logged\n- [ ] **Dependencies**: Up to date, no vulnerabilities\n- [ ] **Row Level Security**: Enabled in Supabase\n- [ ] **CORS**: Properly configured\n- [ ] **File Uploads**: Validated (size, type)\n- [ ] **Wallet Signatures**: Verified (if blockchain)\n\n## Resources\n\n- [OWASP Top 10](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\n- [Next.js Security](https://nextjs.org/docs/security)\n- [Supabase Security](https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth)\n- [Web Security Academy](https://portswigger.net/web-security)\n\n---\n\n**Remember**: Security is not optional. One vulnerability can compromise the entire platform. When in doubt, err on the side of caution.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:42:13.578Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced security auditing and vulnerability detection capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级安全审计和漏洞检测功能的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが高度なセキュリティ監査と脆弱性検出機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 보안 감사 및 취약점 검색 기능이 필요한 코드 검토 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades de auditoría de seguridad avanzada y detección de vulnerabilidades.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant des capacités de vérification de sécurité avancées et de détection de vulnérabilités.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die erweiterte Sicherheitsprüf- und Schwachstellen-Erkennungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de revisão de código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de auditoria de segurança e detecção de vulnerabilidades.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым необходимы расширенные возможности аудита безопасности и обнаружения уязвимостей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء قائم على مراجعة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تقييم الأمان المتقدمة وتحديد النقاط الضعيفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce security best practices and identify potential vulnerabilities in code, ensuring compliance with standards like authentication, authorization, and secrets management, and supporting protocols such as secure API endpoint creation and sensitive data handling.","zh":"赋予代理强制实施安全最佳实践和识别代码中的潜在漏洞的能力，确保遵守诸如身份验证、授权和机密管理等标准，并支持诸如安全 API 端点创建和敏感数据处理等协议。","ja":"エージェントに、認証、認可、シークレット管理などの規格に準拠し、セキュアな API エンドポイントの作成や機密データの取り扱いなどのプロトコルをサポートするコード内の潜在的な脆弱性を特定し、セキュリティのベストプラクティスを強制する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트에 보안 모범 사례를 강제实施하고 코드에서 잠재적인 취약점을 식별하여 인증, 권한 부여 및 기密 관리와 같은 표준을 준수하고 안전한 API 엔드포인트 생성 및 민감한 데이터 처리와 같은 프로토콜을 지원하는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas de seguridad e identificar posibles vulnerabilidades en el código, garantizando el cumplimiento de estándares como la autenticación, la autorización y la gestión de secretos, y apoyando protocolos como la creación de puntos finales de API seguros y el manejo de datos sensibles.","fr":"Habilite les agents à appliquer les meilleures pratiques de sécurité et à identifier les vulnérabilités potentielles dans le code, garantissant la conformité avec des normes telles que l''authentification, l''autorisation et la gestion des secrets, et prenant en charge des protocoles tels que la création de points de terminaison d''API sécurisés et la gestion de données sensibles.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Sicherheitsbest-Praktiken durchzusetzen und potenzielle Schwachstellen im Code zu erkennen, um die Einhaltung von Standards wie Authentifizierung, Autorisierung und Geheimnisverwaltung sicherzustellen und Protokolle wie die Erstellung sicherer API-Endpunkte und die Verarbeitung sensibler Daten zu unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor as melhores práticas de segurança e identificar possíveis vulnerabilidades no código, garantindo a conformidade com padrões como autenticação, autorização e gerenciamento de segredos, e suportando protocolos como a criação segura de pontos de extremidade de API e manipulação de dados sensíveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение лучших практик безопасности и выявлять потенциальные уязвимости в коде, обеспечивая соответствие стандартам, таким как аутентификация, авторизация и управление секретами, а также поддержку протоколов, таких как создание безопасных конечных точек API и обработка конфиденциальных данных.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من فرض أفضل الممارسات الأمنية وتحديد الثغرات المحتملة في الشفرة، مما يضمن الامتثال للمعايير مثل المصادقة والتصريح وإدارة الأسرار، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل إنشاء نقطة نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الآمنة ومعالجة البيانات الحساسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating security checks for authentication and authorization implementations","Identifying potential vulnerabilities in user input handling and file upload mechanisms","Reviewing API endpoint creations for security compliance"],"zh":["自动执行身份验证和授权实现的安全检查","识别用户输入处理和文件上传机制中的潜在漏洞","审查 API 端点创建以确保安全合规性"],"ja":["認証および認可の実装に対するセキュリティチェックの自動化","ユーザー入力処理およびファイルアップロードメカニズムにおける潜在的な脆弱性の特定","セキュリティコンプライアンスを確保するための API エンドポイント作成のレビュー"],"ko":["인증 및 인가 구현에 대한 보안 점검 자동화","사용자 입력 처리 및 파일 업로드 메커니즘에서 잠재적인 취약점 식별","보안 규정 준수를 보장하기 위한 API 엔드포인트 생성 검토"],"es":["Automatizar controles de seguridad para implementaciones de autenticación y autorización","Identificar posibles vulnerabilidades en el manejo de la entrada del usuario y los mecanismos de carga de archivos","Revisar la creación de puntos finales de API para el cumplimiento de la seguridad"],"fr":["Automatiser les contrôles de sécurité pour les implémentations d''authentification et d''autorisation","Identifier les vulnérabilités potentielles dans la gestion des entrées utilisateur et les mécanismes de téléchargement de fichiers","Examiner la création de points de terminaison d''API pour la conformité à la sécurité"],"de":["Automatisieren von Sicherheitsprüfungen für Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsimplementierungen","Identifizieren von potenziellen Schwachstellen in der Benutzereingabeverarbeitung und den Datei-Upload-Mechanismen","Überprüfen der API-Endpunkterstellung für die Sicherheitskonformität"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de segurança para implementações de autenticação e autorização","Identificar possíveis vulnerabilidades no tratamento de entrada de usuário e mecanismos de upload de arquivos","Revisar a criação de pontos de extremidade de API para conformidade com a segurança"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки безопасности для реализаций аутентификации и авторизации","Выявлять потенциальные уязвимости в обработке пользовательского ввода и механизмах загрузки файлов","Проверять создание конечных точек API на соответствие требованиям безопасности"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في فحوصات الأمان لتنفيذ المصادقة والتصريح","تحديد الثغرات المحتملة في معالجة إدخال المستخدم وأجهزة تحميل الملفات","مراجعة إنشاء نقطة نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للامتثال لأمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to code repositories","Limited to specific programming languages like TypeScript","Dependent on regular updates for vulnerability database"],"zh":["需要访问代码仓库","仅限特定编程语言，如 TypeScript","依赖定期更新以获取漏洞数据库"],"ja":["コードリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","TypeScript などの特定のプログラミング言語のみに限定される","脆弱性データベースを取得するための定期的な更新に依存する"],"ko":["코드 저장소에 접근해야 함","TypeScript와 같은 특정 프로그래밍 언어에만 제한됨","취약점 데이터베이스를 얻기 위한 정기적 업데이트에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los repositorios de código","Limitado a lenguajes de programación específicos como TypeScript","Dependiente de actualizaciones regulares para la base de datos de vulnerabilidades"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux référentiels de code","Limité à des langages de programmation spécifiques comme TypeScript","Dépendant des mises à jour régulières pour la base de données de vulnérabilités"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Code-Repositorys","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Programmiersprachen wie TypeScript","Abhängig von regelmäßigen Updates für die Schwachstellen-Datenbank"],"pt":["Exige acesso a repositórios de código","Limitado a linguagens de programação específicas, como o TypeScript","Dependente de atualizações regulares para o banco de dados de vulnerabilidades"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиториям кода","Ограничен конкретными языками программирования, такими как TypeScript","Зависит от регулярных обновлений для базы данных уязвимостей"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودعات الشفرة","محدود بلغات برمجة محددة مثل تايب سكريبت","يعتمد على التحديثات المنتظمة لقاعدة بيانات الثغرات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":100}');
