":"팀 구성 분석은 초기 스타트업이 최적의 팀 구조와 채용 계획을 설계하는 데 도움을 주어 회사 성공을 보장","es":"Diseñe la estructura de equipo óptima para startups en etapas tempranas. Analice la composición del equipo para lograr el éxito.","fr":"Concevez la structure d''équipe optimale pour les startups en démarrage. Analysez la composition de l''équipe pour atteindre le succès.","de":"Gestalten Sie die optimale Teamstruktur für Startups in der Frühphase. Analysieren Sie die Teamzusammensetzung, um den Erfolg zu erzielen.","pt":"Análise de Composição de Equipe ajuda a desenvolver estruturas de equipe ótimas para startups em estágios iniciais","ru":"Анализ состава команды помогает разработать оптимальную структуру команды для стартапов на ранних этапах","ar":"تحليل تركيبة الفريق يساعد على ابتكار هياكل فريق مثالية لرواد الأعمال في المراحل الأولية","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["设计最优团队结构","招聘计划制定","薪酬策略优化","股权分配设计","早期创业公司支持"],"ja":["最適なチーム構造を設計","採用計画を立てる","報酬戦略を最適化","株式配分を設計","スタートアップをサポート"],"ko":["최적의 팀 구조 설계","채용 계획 수립","보상 전략 최적화","주식 배분 설계","초기 스타트업 지원"],"es":["Diseño de planes de contratación","Estrategias de compensación y asignación de acciones","Análisis de la estructura de equipo por etapa","Planificación de roles y responsabilidades","Análisis de presupuesto y restricciones de mercado"],"fr":["Conception de plans d''embauche","Stratégies de rémunération et d''attribution d''actions","Analyse de la structure d''équipe par étape","Planification de rôles et responsabilités","Analyse de budget et de contraintes de marché"],"de":["Gestaltung von Mitarbeiterplänen","Vergütungsstrategien und Aktienzuweisungen","Analyse der Teamstruktur nach Phase","Planung von Rollen und Verantwortlichkeiten","Analyse von Budget und Markteinschränkungen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de estruturas de equipe ótimas","Planos de contratação personalizados","Estratégias de compensação e alocação de ações","Análise de orçamento e marcos de receita","Integração com marcos de mercado"],"ru":["Разработка оптимальной структуры команды","Планы найма на заказ","Стратегии компенсации и распределения акций","Анализ бюджета и марок дохода","Интеграция с марками рынка"],"ar":["ابتكار هياكل فريق مثالية","خطط توظيف حسب الطلب","استراتيجيات تعويض وتخصيص أسهم","تحليل الميزانية ومراحل الإيرادات","التكامل مع علامات السوق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["团队组成分析","创业公司","招聘计划","薪酬策略","股权分配","团队结构","早期创业","团队管理"],"ja":["チーム構成分析","スタートアップ","採用計画","報酬戦略","株式配分","チーム構造","初期創業","チームマネジメント"],"ko":["팀 구성 분석","스타트업","채용 계획","보상 전략","주식 배분","팀 구조","초기 창업","팀 관리"],"es":["análisis de composición de equipo","startups en etapas tempranas","diseño de equipo","planes de contratación","estrategias de compensación","asignación de acciones","análisis de estructura de equipo"],"fr":["analyse de composition d''équipe","startups en démarrage","conception d''équipe","plans d''embauche","stratégies de rémunération","attribution d''actions","analyse de structure d''équipe"],"de":["Teamzusammensetzungsanalyse","Startups in der Frühphase","Teamgestaltung","Mitarbeiterpläne","Vergütungsstrategien","Aktienzuweisungen","Teamstrukturanalyse"],"pt":["análise de composição de equipe","startups","estruturas de equipe","planos de contratação","estratégias de compensação","alocação de ações","orçamento","marcos de receita"],"ru":["анализ состава команды","стартапы","структуры команды","планы найма","стратегии компенсации","распределение акций","бюджет","марки дохода"],"ar":["تحليل تركيبة الفريق","رواد الأعمال","هياكل الفريق","خطط توظيف","استراتيجيات تعويض","تخصيص أسهم","ميزانية","مراحل الإيرادات"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"team-composition-analysis","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to plan team structure, determine hiring needs, design org chart, calculate compensation, plan equity allocation, or requests organizational design and headcount planning for a startup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Team Composition Analysis\n\nDesign optimal team structures, hiring plans, compensation strategies, and equity allocation for early-stage startups from pre-seed through Series A.\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild the right team at the right time with appropriate compensation and equity. Plan role-by-role hiring aligned with revenue milestones, budget constraints, and market benchmarks.\n\n## Team Structure by Stage\n\n### Pre-Seed (0-$500K ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 2-5 people**\n\n**Core Roles:**\n\n- Founders (2-3): Produc","body":"# Team Composition Analysis\n\nDesign optimal team structures, hiring plans, compensation strategies, and equity allocation for early-stage startups from pre-seed through Series A.\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild the right team at the right time with appropriate compensation and equity. Plan role-by-role hiring aligned with revenue milestones, budget constraints, and market benchmarks.\n\n## Team Structure by Stage\n\n### Pre-Seed (0-$500K ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 2-5 people**\n\n**Core Roles:**\n\n- Founders (2-3): Product, engineering, business\n- First engineer (if needed)\n- Contract roles: Design, marketing\n\n**Focus:** Build and validate product-market fit\n\n### Seed ($500K-$2M ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 5-15 people**\n\n**Key Hires:**\n\n- Engineering lead + 2-3 engineers\n- First sales/business development\n- Product manager\n- Marketing/growth lead\n\n**Focus:** Scale product and prove repeatable sales\n\n### Series A ($2M-$10M ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 15-50 people**\n\n**Department Build-Out:**\n\n- Engineering (40%): 6-20 people\n- Sales & Marketing (30%): 5-15 people\n- Customer Success (10%): 2-5 people\n- G&A (10%): 2-5 people\n- Product (10%): 2-5 people\n\n**Focus:** Scale revenue and build repeatable processes\n\n## Role-by-Role Planning\n\n### Engineering Team\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founders write code\n- 0-1 contract developers\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- Engineering Lead (first $150K-$180K)\n- 2-3 Full-Stack Engineers ($120K-$150K)\n- 1 Frontend or Backend Specialist ($130K-$160K)\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- VP Engineering ($180K-$250K + equity)\n- 2-3 Senior Engineers ($150K-$180K)\n- 3-5 Mid-Level Engineers ($120K-$150K)\n- 1-2 Junior Engineers ($90K-$120K)\n- 1 DevOps/Infrastructure ($140K-$170K)\n\n### Sales & Marketing\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founders do sales\n- Contract marketing help\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- First Sales Hire / Head of Sales ($120K-$150K + commission)\n- Marketing/Growth Lead ($100K-$140K)\n- SDR or BDR (if B2B) ($50K-$70K + commission)\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- VP Sales ($150K-$200K + commission + equity)\n- 3-5 Account Executives ($80K-$120K + commission)\n- 2-3 SDRs/BDRs ($50K-$70K + commission)\n- Marketing Manager ($90K-$130K)\n- Content/Demand Gen ($70K-$100K)\n\n### Product Team\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founder as product lead\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- First Product Manager ($120K-$150K)\n- Contract designer\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- Head of Product ($150K-$180K)\n- 1-2 Product Managers ($120K-$150K)\n- Product Designer ($100K-$140K)\n- UX Researcher (optional) ($90K-$130K)\n\n### Customer Success\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founders handle support\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- First CS hire (optional) ($60K-$90K)\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- CS Manager ($100K-$130K)\n- 2-4 CS Representatives ($60K-$90K)\n- Support Engineer (technical) ($80K-$120K)\n\n### G&A (General & Administrative)\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Contractors (accounting, legal)\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- Operations/Office Manager ($70K-$100K)\n- Contract CFO\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- CFO or Finance Lead ($150K-$200K)\n- Recruiter ($80K-$120K)\n- Office Manager / EA ($60K-$90K)\n\n## Compensation Strategy\n\n### Base Salary Benchmarks (US, 2024)\n\n**Engineering:**\n\n- Junior: $90K-$120K\n- Mid-Level: $120K-$150K\n- Senior: $150K-$180K\n- Staff/Principal: $180K-$220K\n- Engineering Manager: $160K-$200K\n- VP Engineering: $180K-$250K\n\n**Sales:**\n\n- SDR/BDR: $50K-$70K base + $50K-$70K commission\n- Account Executive: $80K-$120K base + $80K-$120K commission\n- Sales Manager: $120K-$160K base + $80K-$120K commission\n- VP Sales: $150K-$200K base + $150K-$200K commission\n\n**Product:**\n\n- Product Manager: $120K-$150K\n- Senior PM: $150K-$180K\n- Head of Product: $150K-$180K\n- VP Product: $180K-$220K\n\n**Marketing:**\n\n- Marketing Manager: $90K-$130K\n- Content/Demand Gen: $70K-$100K\n- Head of Marketing: $130K-$170K\n- VP Marketing: $150K-$200K\n\n**Customer Success:**\n\n- CS Representative: $60K-$90K\n- CS Manager: $100K-$130K\n- VP Customer Success: $140K-$180K\n\n### Total Compensation Formula\n\n```\nTotal Comp = Base Salary × 1.30 (benefits & taxes) + Equity Value\n```\n\n**Fully-Loaded Cost:**\n\n- Base salary\n- Payroll taxes (7.65% FICA)\n- Benefits (health insurance, 401k): $10K-$15K per employee\n- Other (workspace, equipment, software): $5K-$10K per employee\n\n**Rule of Thumb:** Multiply base salary by 1.3-1.4 for fully-loaded cost\n\n### Geographic Adjustments\n\n**San Francisco / New York:** +20-30% above benchmarks\n**Seattle / Boston / Los Angeles:** +10-20%\n**Austin / Denver / Chicago:** +0-10%\n**Remote / Other US Cities:** -10-20%\n**International:** Varies widely by country\n\n## Equity Allocation\n\n### Equity by Role and Stage\n\n**Founders:**\n\n- First founder: 40-60%\n- Second founder: 20-40%\n- Third founder: 10-20%\n- Vesting: 4 years with 1-year cliff\n\n**Early Employees (Pre-Seed):**\n\n- First engineer: 0.5-2.0%\n- First 5 employees: 0.25-1.0% each\n\n**Seed Stage Hires:**\n\n- VP/Head level: 0.5-1.5%\n- Senior IC: 0.1-0.5%\n- Mid-level: 0.05-0.25%\n- Junior: 0.01-0.1%\n\n**Series A Hires:**\n\n- C-level (CTO, CFO): 1.0-3.0%\n- VP level: 0.3-1.0%\n- Director level: 0.1-0.5%\n- Senior IC: 0.05-0.2%\n- Mid-level: 0.01-0.1%\n- Junior: 0.005-0.05%\n\n### Equity Pool Sizing\n\n**Option Pool by Round:**\n\n- Pre-Seed: 10-15% reserved\n- Seed: 10-15% top-up\n- Series A: 10-15% top-up\n- Series B+: 5-10% per round\n\n**Pre-Funding Dilution:**\nInvestors often require option pool creation before investment, diluting founders.\n\n**Example:**\n\n```\nPre-money: $10M\nInvestors want 15% option pool post-money\n\nCalculation:\nPost-money: $15M ($10M + $5M investment)\nOption pool: $2.25M (15% × $15M)\nFounders diluted by pool creation before new money\n```\n\n## Organizational Design\n\n### Reporting Structure\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n```\nFounders (flat structure)\n├── Contractors\n└── First hires (report to founders)\n```\n\n**Seed:**\n\n```\nCEO\n├── Engineering Lead (2-4 engineers)\n├── Sales/Growth Lead (1-2 reps)\n├── Product Manager\n└── Operations\n```\n\n**Series A:**\n\n```\nCEO\n├── CTO / VP Engineering (6-20 people)\n│   ├── Engineering Manager(s)\n│   └── Individual Contributors\n├── VP Sales (5-15 people)\n│   ├── Sales Manager\n│   ├── Account Executives\n│   └── SDRs\n├── Head of Product (2-5 people)\n│   ├── Product Managers\n│   └── Designers\n├── Head of Customer Success (2-5 people)\n└── CFO / Finance Lead (2-5 people)\n    ├── Recruiter\n    └── Operations\n```\n\n### Span of Control\n\n**Manager Ratios:**\n\n- First-line managers: 4-8 direct reports\n- Directors: 3-5 direct reports (managers)\n- VPs: 3-5 direct reports (directors)\n- CEO: 5-8 direct reports (executive team)\n\n## Full-Time vs. Contract\n\n### Use Full-Time for:\n\n- Core product development\n- Sales (revenue-generating roles)\n- Mission-critical operations\n- Institutional knowledge roles\n\n### Use Contractors for:\n\n- Specialized short-term needs (legal, accounting)\n- Variable workload (design, marketing campaigns)\n- Skills outside core competency\n- Testing role before FTE hire\n- Geographic expansion before permanent presence\n\n### Cost Comparison\n\n**Full-Time:**\n\n- Lower hourly cost\n- Benefits and overhead\n- Long-term commitment\n- Cultural fit matters\n\n**Contract:**\n\n- Higher hourly rate ($75-$200/hour vs. $40-$100/hour FTE equivalent)\n- No benefits or overhead\n- Flexible engagement\n- Easier to scale up/down\n\n## Hiring Velocity\n\n### Realistic Timeline\n\n**Role Opening to Hire:**\n\n- Junior: 6-8 weeks\n- Mid-Level: 8-12 weeks\n- Senior: 12-16 weeks\n- Executive: 16-24 weeks\n\n**Time to Productivity:**\n\n- Junior: 4-6 months\n- Mid-Level: 2-4 months\n- Senior: 1-3 months\n- Executive: 3-6 months\n\n### Planning Buffer\n\nAlways add 2-3 months buffer to hiring plans.\n\n**Example:**\nIf need engineer by July 1:\n\n- Start recruiting: April 1 (12 weeks)\n- Productivity: September 1 (2 months ramp)\n\n## Budget Planning\n\n### Compensation as % of Revenue\n\n**Early Stage (Seed):**\n\n- Total comp: 120-150% of revenue (burning cash to grow)\n- Engineering: 50-60%\n- Sales: 30-40%\n- Other: 20-30%\n\n**Growth Stage (Series A):**\n\n- Total comp: 70-100% of revenue\n- Engineering: 35-45%\n- Sales: 25-35%\n- Other: 20-30%\n\n### Headcount Budget Formula\n\n```\nTotal Comp Budget = Σ (Role Count × Fully-Loaded Cost × % of Year)\n\nExample:\n3 Engineers × $202K × 100% = $606K\n2 AEs × $230K × 75% (mid-year start) = $345K\n1 PM × $162K × 100% = $162K\nTotal: $1.1M\n```\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n### Reference Files\n\n- **`references/compensation-benchmarks.md`** - Detailed salary data by role, level, and location\n- **`references/equity-calculator.md`** - Equity sizing formulas and dilution scenarios\n\n### Example Files\n\n- **`examples/seed-stage-hiring-plan.md`** - Complete hiring plan for seed-stage SaaS company\n- **`examples/org-chart-evolution.md`** - Organizational design from 5 to 50 people\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo plan team composition:\n\n1. **Identify stage** - Pre-seed, seed, or Series A\n2. **Define roles** - What functions are needed now\n3. **Prioritize hires** - Critical path for business goals\n4. **Set compensation** - Base salary + equity by level\n5. **Plan timeline** - Account for recruiting and ramp time\n6. **Calculate budget** - Fully-loaded cost × headcount\n7. **Design org chart** - Reporting structure and span of control\n8. **Allocate equity** - Fair allocation that preserves pool\n\nFor detailed compensation benchmarks and hiring plan templates, see `references/` and `examples/`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:41:47.420Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Strategy Agents needing advanced team structure planning and compensation analysis for early-stage startups.","zh":"非常适合需要高级团队结构规划和补偿分析的策略代理，特别是针对早期创业公司。","ja":"戦略エージェントが高度なチーム構造計画と補償分析を必要とする場合、特に初期のスタートアップ企業に最適です。","ko":"전략 에이전트가 고급 팀 구조 계획 및 보상 분석을 필요로 하는 경우, 특히 초기 스타트업 기업에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de estrategia que necesitan una planificación avanzada de la estructura del equipo y un análisis de compensación para startups en etapas iniciales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de stratégie ayant besoin d''une planification avancée de la structure d''équipe et d''une analyse de rémunération pour les startups en démarrage.","de":"Perfekt für Strategieagenten, die eine fortschrittliche Teamstrukturplanung und eine Vergütungsanalyse für Startups in der Frühphase benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Estratégia que necessitam de planejamento avançado de estrutura de equipe e análise de compensação para startups em estágio inicial.","ru":"Идеально подходит для стратегических агентов, которым требуется продвинутый планирование структуры команды и анализ компенсации для стартапов на ранней стадии.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الاستراتيجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط متقدم لهياكل الفريق وتحليل التعويضات للشركات الناشئة في المراحل الأولى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design optimal team compositions, hiring plans, and equity allocation strategies aligned with revenue milestones, budget constraints, and market benchmarks, utilizing role-by-role hiring planning and compensation strategies.","zh":"使代理能够设计出与收入里程碑、预算约束和市场基准相符的最佳团队组成、招聘计划和股权分配策略，利用角色招聘规划和补偿策略。","ja":"エージェントが収益マイルストーン、予算の制約、市場ベンチマークと一致する最適なチーム構成、採用計画、株式配分戦略を設計できるようにすることで、ロールごとの採用計画と補償戦略を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 수익 里程碑, 예산 제약 및 시장 기준과 일치하는 최적의 팀 구성, 채용 계획 및 주식 할당 전략을 설계할 수 있도록 함으로써, 역할별 채용 계획 및 보상 전략을 활용합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para diseñar composiciones de equipo óptimas, planes de contratación y estrategias de asignación de acciones alineadas con los hitos de ingresos, las limitaciones presupuestarias y las referencias del mercado, utilizando la planificación de contratación y las estrategias de compensación rol por rol.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des compositions d''équipe optimales, des plans d''embauche et des stratégies d''allocation d''actions alignées sur les jalons de chiffre d''affaires, les contraintes budgétaires et les références du marché, en utilisant la planification d''embauche et les stratégies de rémunération rôle par rôle.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, optimale Teamzusammensetzungen, Einstellungspläne und Aktienzuteilungsstrategien zu entwerfen, die mit den Umsatzmeilensteinen, Budgetbeschränkungen und Marktbenchmarks übereinstimmen, unter Verwendung der rollenbasierten Einstellungsplanung und Vergütungsstrategien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem composições de equipe ótimas, planos de contratação e estratégias de alocação de ações alinhadas com marcos de receita, restrições orçamentárias e benchmarks de mercado, utilizando planejamento de contratação e estratégias de compensação por papel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать оптимальные составы команд, планы найма и стратегии распределения акций, согласованные с вехами дохода, бюджетными ограничениями и рыночными ориентирами, используя планирование найма и стратегии компенсации по ролям.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تصميم تركيبات فريق مثالية وخطط توظيف وخطط تخصيص أسهم متوافقة مع معالم الإيرادات والقيود المالية والمعايير السوقية، باستخدام التخطيط للتوظيف واستراتيجيات التعويضات من خلال دورة الدور."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating team structure recommendations for pre-seed through Series A startups","Generating hiring plans aligned with revenue growth and budget constraints","Analyzing compensation strategies and equity allocation for core roles"],"zh":["为种子轮前至A轮的初创公司提供团队结构推荐的自动化","生成与收入增长和预算约束相符的招聘计划","分析核心职位的补偿策略和股权分配"],"ja":["シードラウンド前からAラウンドまでのスタートアップ企業向けのチーム構造推奨の自動化","収益成長と予算の制約に合った採用計画を生成する","コアロールの補償戦略と株式配分を分析する"],"ko":["시드 라운드 이전부터 A 라운드까지의 스타트업 기업을 위한 팀 구조 추천의 자동화","수익 성장과 예산 제약에 맞춘 채용 계획을 생성하는","코어 역할의 보상 전략 및 주식 할당을 분석한다"],"es":["Automatización de las recomendaciones de estructura de equipo para startups desde la etapa pre-semilla hasta la Serie A","Generación de planes de contratación alineados con el crecimiento de los ingresos y las limitaciones presupuestarias","Análisis de estrategias de compensación y asignación de acciones para roles clave"],"fr":["Automatisation des recommandations de structure d''équipe pour les startups depuis le stade pré-graine jusqu''à la série A","Génération de plans d''embauche alignés sur la croissance du chiffre d''affaires et les contraintes budgétaires","Analyse des stratégies de rémunération et d''allocation d''actions pour les rôles clés"],"de":["Automatisierung der Teamstruktur-Empfehlungen für Startups von der Vorgründungsphase bis zur Serie A","Erstellung von Einstellungsplänen, die mit dem Umsatzwachstum und den Budgetbeschränkungen übereinstimmen","Analyse von Vergütungsstrategien und Aktienzuteilung für Schlüsselrollen"],"pt":["Automatizar recomendações de estrutura de equipe para startups de pré-semente até a Série A","Gerar planos de contratação alinhados com o crescimento da receita e as restrições orçamentárias","Analisar estratégias de compensação e alocação de ações para funções principais"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рекомендации по структуре команды для стартапов от предпосевного до серии А","Генерировать планы найма, согласованные с ростом дохода и бюджетными ограничениями","Анализировать стратегии компенсации и распределения акций для ключевых ролей"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لتوصيات هيكل الفريق للشركات الناشئة من مرحلة ما قبل البذرة إلى السلسلة أ","إنتاج خطط توظيف متوافقة مع نمو الإيرادات والقيود المالية","تحليل استراتيجيات التعويضات وتخصيص الأسهم للأدوار الرئيسية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to early-stage startups (pre-seed through Series A)","Requires knowledge of market benchmarks and revenue milestones"],"zh":["仅限于早期创业公司（种子轮前至A轮）","需要了解市场基准和收入里程碑"],"ja":["初期のスタートアップ企業（シードラウンド前からAラウンドまで）に限定される","市場ベンチマークと収益マイルストーンの知識が必要"],"ko":["초기 스타트업 기업(시드 라운드 이전부터 A 라운드까지)로 제한됨","시장 기준 및 수익 里程碑에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Limitado a startups en etapas iniciales (pre-semilla hasta Serie A)","Requiere conocimiento de referencias del mercado y hitos de ingresos"],"fr":["Limité aux startups en démarrage (pré-graine à série A)","Nécessite une connaissance des références du marché et des jalons de chiffre d''affaires"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Startups in der Frühphase (Vorgründungsphase bis Serie A)","Benötigt Kenntnisse von Marktbenchmarks und Umsatzmeilensteinen"],"pt":["Limitado a startups em estágio inicial (pré-semente até a Série A)","Exige conhecimento de benchmarks de mercado e marcos de receita"],"ru":["Ограничен для стартапов на ранней стадии (от предпосевного до серии А)","Требует знания рыночных ориентиров и вех дохода"],"ar":["محدود للشركات الناشئة في المراحل الأولى (من مرحلة ما قبل البذرة إلى السلسلة أ)","يتطلب معرفة بمعايير السوق ومعالم الإيرادات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
