ن في الوقت الفعلي","تحقق هويّة آمن","تطوير البرمجيات","حوسبة السحابة"]}},"owner":"ThinkEx-OSS","repo":"thinkex","repoPath":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloud","description":"Guide for assistant-cloud persistence and authorization. Use when setting up thread persistence, file uploads, or authentication.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui Cloud\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nCloud persistence for threads, messages, and files.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/persistence.md](./references/persistence.md) -- Thread and message persistence\n- [./references/authorization.md](./references/authorization.md) -- Authentication patterns\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install assistant-cloud\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```tsx\nimport { AssistantCloud } from \"assistant-","body":"# assistant-ui Cloud\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nCloud persistence for threads, messages, and files.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/persistence.md](./references/persistence.md) -- Thread and message persistence\n- [./references/authorization.md](./references/authorization.md) -- Authentication patterns\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install assistant-cloud\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```tsx\nimport { AssistantCloud } from \"assistant-cloud\";\nimport { useChatRuntime, AssistantChatTransport } from \"@assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk\";\nimport { AssistantRuntimeProvider, Thread, ThreadList } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nconst cloud = new AssistantCloud({\n  baseUrl: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSISTANT_BASE_URL,\n  authToken: async () => getAuthToken(),\n});\n\nfunction Chat() {\n  const runtime = useChatRuntime({\n    transport: new AssistantChatTransport({ api: \"/api/chat\" }),\n    cloud,\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <AssistantRuntimeProvider runtime={runtime}>\n      <ThreadList />\n      <Thread />\n    </AssistantRuntimeProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Authentication Options\n\n```tsx\n// JWT Token (recommended)\nconst cloud = new AssistantCloud({\n  baseUrl: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSISTANT_BASE_URL,\n  authToken: async () => session?.accessToken,\n});\n\n// API Key (server-side)\nconst cloud = new AssistantCloud({\n  baseUrl: process.env.ASSISTANT_BASE_URL,\n  apiKey: process.env.ASSISTANT_API_KEY,\n  userId: user.id,\n  workspaceId: user.workspaceId,\n});\n\n// Anonymous (public apps)\nconst cloud = new AssistantCloud({\n  baseUrl: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSISTANT_BASE_URL,\n  anonymous: true,\n});\n```\n\n## Cloud API\n\n```tsx\n// Thread operations\nconst threads = await cloud.threads.list();\nawait cloud.threads.create({ title: \"New Chat\" });\nawait cloud.threads.update(threadId, { title: \"Updated\" });\nawait cloud.threads.delete(threadId);\n\n// Message operations\nconst messages = await cloud.threads.messages(threadId).list();\n\n// File uploads\nconst { signedUrl, publicUrl } = await cloud.files.generatePresignedUploadUrl({\n  filename: \"document.pdf\",\n});\nawait fetch(signedUrl, { method: \"PUT\", body: file });\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```env\nNEXT_PUBLIC_ASSISTANT_BASE_URL=https://api.assistant-ui.com\nASSISTANT_API_KEY=your-api-key  # Server-side only\n```\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n**Threads not persisting**\n- Pass `cloud` to runtime\n- Check authentication\n\n**Auth errors**\n- Verify `authToken` returns valid token\n- Check `baseUrl` is correct\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:43:29.486Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing cloud-based persistence for threads, messages, and files.","zh":"非常适合需要基于云的线程、消息和文件持久性的AI代理。","ja":"クラウドベースのスレッド、メッセージ、ファイルの永続性が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 기반의 쓰레드, 메시지, 파일 지속성이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan persistencia basada en la nube para hilos, mensajes y archivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une persistance basée sur le cloud pour les threads, les messages et les fichiers.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine cloudbasierte Persistenz für Threads, Nachrichten und Dateien benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que necessitam de persistência baseada em nuvem para threads, mensagens e ficheiros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым требуется облачное хранение потоков, сообщений и файлов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى استدامة قائمة على السحابة للمحادثات والرسائل والملفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize cloud persistence via the AssistantCloud library, enabling features like thread and message persistence, and authentication patterns, all accessible through a simple npm installation and API integration.","zh":"通过AssistantCloud库赋予代理使用云持久性的能力，实现线程和消息持久性、认证模式等功能，所有功能都可以通过简单的npm安装和API集成访问。","ja":"AssistantCloudライブラリを通じて、エージェントがクラウド永続性を利用できるようにし、スレッドとメッセージの永続性、認証パターンなどの機能を実現します。すべての機能は、シンプルなnpmインストールとAPI統合でアクセスできます。","ko":"AssistantCloud 라이브러리를 통해 에이전트가 클라우드 지속성을 사용할 수 있도록 하여, 쓰레드와 메시지 지속성, 인증 패턴 등을 포함한 기능을 제공하며, 모든 기능은 간단한 npm 설치와 API 통합을 통해 접근할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar la persistencia en la nube a través de la biblioteca AssistantCloud, lo que permite funciones como la persistencia de threads y mensajes, y patrones de autenticación, todo accesible a través de una instalación npm simple y una integración de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser la persistance cloud via la bibliothèque AssistantCloud, permettant des fonctionnalités telles que la persistance de threads et de messages, et des modèles d''authentification, le tout accessible via une installation npm simple et une intégration d''API.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, cloudbasierte Persistenz über die AssistantCloud-Bibliothek zu nutzen, wodurch Funktionen wie Thread- und Nachrichtenpersistenz und Authentifizierungsmuster ermöglicht werden, die alles über eine einfache npm-Installation und API-Integration zugänglich sind.","pt":"Permite que os agentes utilizem a persistência em nuvem através da biblioteca AssistantCloud, possibilitando funcionalidades como a persistência de threads e mensagens, e padrões de autenticação, tudo acessível através de uma simples instalação npm e integração de API.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать облачное хранение через библиотеку AssistantCloud, обеспечивая такие функции, как сохранение потоков и сообщений, а также шаблоны аутентификации, все доступно через простое npm-установку и интеграцию API.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من استخدام الاستدامة السحابية عبر مكتبة AssistantCloud، مما يتيح ميزات مثل استدامة المحادثات والرسائل وأنماط المصادقة، وكلها يمكن الوصول إليها من خلال تثبيت npm بسيط وتكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing cloud-based thread persistence for conversational continuity","Authenticating users with robust authorization patterns","Storing and retrieving files in a cloud environment"],"zh":["为对话连续性实现基于云的线程持久性","使用强大的授权模式对用户进行认证","在云环境中存储和检索文件"],"ja":["会話の連続性のためにクラウドベースのスレッド永続性を実装する","強力な認可パターンを使用してユーザーを認証する","クラウド環境でファイルを保存して取得する"],"ko":["대화 연속성을 위한 클라우드 기반의 쓰레드 지속성 구현","강력한 인가 패턴을 사용한 사용자 인증","클라우드 환경에서 파일 저장 및 검색"],"es":["Implementar la persistencia de threads basada en la nube para la continuidad conversacional","Autenticar a los usuarios con patrones de autorización robustos","Almacenar y recuperar archivos en un entorno de nube"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la persistance de threads basée sur le cloud pour la continuité conversationnelle","Authentifier les utilisateurs avec des modèles d''autorisation robustes","Stockage et récupération de fichiers dans un environnement cloud"],"de":["Implementierung der cloudbasierten Thread-Persistenz für die konversationelle Kontinuität","Authentifizierung von Benutzern mit robusten Autorisierungsmustern","Speichern und Abrufen von Dateien in einer Cloud-Umgebung"],"pt":["Implementação de persistência de threads baseada em nuvem para continuidade conversacional","Autenticação de utilizadores com padrões de autorização robustos","Armazenamento e recuperação de ficheiros em ambiente de nuvem"],"ru":["Реализация облачного хранения потоков для обеспечения непрерывности беседы","Аутентификация пользователей с надежными шаблонами авторизации","Хранение и извлечение файлов в облачной среде"],"ar":["تنفيذ استدامة المحادثات القائمة على السحابة لضمان استمرارية المحادثة","مصادقة المستخدمين بأنماط تفويض قوية","تخزين واسترجاع الملفات في بيئة سحابية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation of assistant-cloud","Must consult latest API at assistant-ui.com/llms.txt"],"zh":["需要安装assistant-cloud的npm","必须在assistant-ui.com/llms.txt参考最新的API"],"ja":["assistant-cloudのnpmをインストールする必要がある","最新のAPIをassistant-ui.com/llms.txtで参照する必要がある"],"ko":["assistant-cloud의 npm 설치가 필요하다","assistant-ui.com/llms.txt에서 최신 API를 참조해야 한다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de npm de assistant-cloud","Debe consultar la última API en assistant-ui.com/llms.txt"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation npm de assistant-cloud","Doit consulter la dernière API sur assistant-ui.com/llms.txt"],"de":["Benötigt die npm-Installation von assistant-cloud","Muss die neueste API unter assistant-ui.com/llms.txt konsultieren"],"pt":["Requer instalação via npm do assistant-cloud","É necessário consultar a API mais recente em assistant-ui.com/llms.txt"],"ru":["Требует npm-установки assistant-cloud","Необходимо обращаться к последней версии API на assistant-ui.com/llms.txt"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت حزمة assistant-cloud عبر npm","يجب الرجوع إلى أحدث واجهة برمجة تطبيقات على assistant-ui.com/llms.txt"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
