un análisis exhaustivo de la seguridad de tus aplicaciones.","fr":"L''audit de sécurité Convex est un examen approfondi de la sécurité de vos applications.","de":"Die Convex-Sicherheitsprüfung ist eine umfassende Analyse der Sicherheit Ihrer Anwendungen.","pt":"A auditoria de segurança Convex é uma revisão abrangente de padrões de segurança para aplicações Convex.","ru":"Аудит безопасности Convex - это всесторонний обзор шаблонов безопасности для приложений Convex.","ar":"تدقيق أمن Convex هو مراجعة شاملة لأنماط الأمان لتطبيقات Convex.","en":"Portal is the open-source Slack replacement. Chat in real time, keep conversations tidy in channels, and collaborate freely with zero tracking or spying."},"definition":{"en":"Portal is the open-source Slack replacement. Chat in real time, keep conversations tidy in channels, and collaborate freely with zero tracking or spying."},"features":{"zh":["授权逻辑安全审查","数据访问边界保护","操作隔离和限速","敏感操作保护","全面安全审查模式"],"ja":["認証ロジックのセキュリティレビュー","データアクセス境界の保護","操作の隔離とレート制限","機密操作の保護","包括的なセキュリティレビューパターン"],"ko":["인증 로직 보안 검토","데이터 접근 경계 보호","작업 분리 및 제한","민감한 작업 보호","포괄적인 보안 검토 패턴"],"es":["Análisis de lógica de autorización","Revisión de límites de acceso a datos","Aislamiento de acciones","Limitación de velocidad","Protección de operaciones sensibles"],"fr":["Analyse de la logique d''autorisation","Révision des limites d''accès aux données","Isolement des actions","Limitation de vitesse","Protection des opérations sensibles"],"de":["Analyse der Autorisierungslogik","Überprüfung der Zugriffsgrenzen für Daten","Isolierung von Aktionen","Rate Limiting","Schutz sensibler Operationen"],"pt":["Análise de lógica de autorização","Verificação de limites de acesso a dados","Isolamento de ações","Limitação de taxa","Proteção de operações sensíveis"],"ru":["Анализ логики авторизации","Проверка границ доступа к данным","Изоляция действий","Ограничение скорости","Защита чувствительных операций"],"ar":["تحليل منطق المصادقة","تحقق من حدود الوصول إلى البيانات","عزل الإجراءات","تحديد الحد الأقصى للسرعة","حماية العمليات الحساسة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 安全审计","Convex 应用程序安全","授权逻辑安全","数据访问边界保护","操作隔离","限速","敏感操作保护"],"ja":["Convex セキュリティ監査","Convex アプリケーションのセキュリティ","認証ロジックのセキュリティ","データアクセス境界の保護","操作の隔離","レート制限","機密操作の保護"],"ko":["Convex 보안 감사","Convex 애플리케이션 보안","인증 로직 보안","데이터 접근 경계 보호","작업 분리","제한","민감한 작업 보호"],"es":["seguridad Convex","auditoría de seguridad","autorización de aplicaciones","acceso a datos","desarrollo de aplicaciones seguras"," Convex seguridad"],"fr":["sécurité Convex","audit de sécurité","autorisation d''applications","accès aux données","développement d''applications sécurisées","sécurité Convex"],"de":["Convex-Sicherheit","Sicherheitsprüfung","Autorisierung von Anwendungen","Datenzugriff","Entwicklung sicherer Anwendungen","Convex-Sicherheitsprüfung"],"pt":["auditoria de segurança Convex","segurança de aplicações Convex","análise de segurança","proteção de dados","autorização","limitação de taxa"],"ru":["аудит безопасности Convex","безопасность приложений Convex","анализ безопасности","защита данных","авторизация","ограничение скорости"],"ar":["تدقيق أمن Convex","أمان تطبيقات Convex","تحليل الأمان","حماية البيانات","المصادقة","تحديد الحد الأقصى للسرعة"]}},"owner":"tryportal","repo":"portal","repoPath":"tryportal/portal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex Security Audit","description":"Deep security review patterns for authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","security","audit","authorization","rate-limiting","protection"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Security Audit\n\nComprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications including authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n###","body":"# Convex Security Audit\n\nComprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications including authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Security Audit Areas\n\n1. **Authorization Logic** - Who can do what\n2. **Data Access Boundaries** - What data users can see\n3. **Action Isolation** - Protecting external API calls\n4. **Rate Limiting** - Preventing abuse\n5. **Sensitive Operations** - Protecting critical functions\n\n### Authorization Logic Audit\n\n#### Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```typescript\n// convex/lib/auth.ts\nimport { QueryCtx, MutationCtx } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { Doc } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n\ntype UserRole = \"user\" | \"moderator\" | \"admin\" | \"superadmin\";\n\nconst roleHierarchy: Record<UserRole, number> = {\n  user: 0,\n  moderator: 1,\n  admin: 2,\n  superadmin: 3,\n};\n\nexport async function getUser(ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx): Promise<Doc<\"users\"> | null> {\n  const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n  if (!identity) return null;\n  \n  return await ctx.db\n    .query(\"users\")\n    .withIndex(\"by_tokenIdentifier\", (q) => \n      q.eq(\"tokenIdentifier\", identity.tokenIdentifier)\n    )\n    .unique();\n}\n\nexport async function requireRole(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx, \n  minRole: UserRole\n): Promise<Doc<\"users\">> {\n  const user = await getUser(ctx);\n  \n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\",\n      message: \"Authentication required\",\n    });\n  }\n  \n  const userRoleLevel = roleHierarchy[user.role as UserRole] ?? 0;\n  const requiredLevel = roleHierarchy[minRole];\n  \n  if (userRoleLevel < requiredLevel) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: `Role ''${minRole}'' or higher required`,\n    });\n  }\n  \n  return user;\n}\n\n// Permission-based check\ntype Permission = \"read:users\" | \"write:users\" | \"delete:users\" | \"admin:system\";\n\nconst rolePermissions: Record<UserRole, Permission[]> = {\n  user: [\"read:users\"],\n  moderator: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\"],\n  admin: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\", \"delete:users\"],\n  superadmin: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\", \"delete:users\", \"admin:system\"],\n};\n\nexport async function requirePermission(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx,\n  permission: Permission\n): Promise<Doc<\"users\">> {\n  const user = await getUser(ctx);\n  \n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({ code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\", message: \"Authentication required\" });\n  }\n  \n  const userRole = user.role as UserRole;\n  const permissions = rolePermissions[userRole] ?? [];\n  \n  if (!permissions.includes(permission)) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: `Permission ''${permission}'' required`,\n    });\n  }\n  \n  return user;\n}\n```\n\n### Data Access Boundaries Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/data.ts\nimport { query, mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { getUser, requireRole } from \"./lib/auth\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// Audit: Users can only see their own data\nexport const getMyData = query({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"userData\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    if (!user) return [];\n    \n    // SECURITY: Filter by userId\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"userData\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", user._id))\n      .collect();\n  },\n});\n\n// Audit: Verify ownership before returning sensitive data\nexport const getSensitiveItem = query({\n  args: { itemId: v.id(\"sensitiveItems\") },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"sensitiveItems\"),\n    secret: v.string(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    if (!user) return null;\n    \n    const item = await ctx.db.get(args.itemId);\n    \n    // SECURITY: Verify ownership\n    if (!item || item.ownerId !== user._id) {\n      return null; // Don''t reveal if item exists\n    }\n    \n    return item;\n  },\n});\n\n// Audit: Shared resources with access list\nexport const getSharedDocument = query({\n  args: { docId: v.id(\"documents\") },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"documents\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n    accessLevel: v.string(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    const doc = await ctx.db.get(args.docId);\n    \n    if (!doc) return null;\n    \n    // Public documents\n    if (doc.visibility === \"public\") {\n      return { ...doc, accessLevel: \"public\" };\n    }\n    \n    // Must be authenticated for non-public\n    if (!user) return null;\n    \n    // Owner has full access\n    if (doc.ownerId === user._id) {\n      return { ...doc, accessLevel: \"owner\" };\n    }\n    \n    // Check shared access\n    const access = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"documentAccess\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_doc_and_user\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"documentId\", args.docId).eq(\"userId\", user._id)\n      )\n      .unique();\n    \n    if (!access) return null;\n    \n    return { ...doc, accessLevel: access.level };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Action Isolation Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/actions.ts\n\"use node\";\n\nimport { action, internalAction } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { api, internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// SECURITY: Never expose API keys in responses\nexport const callExternalAPI = action({\n  args: { query: v.string() },\n  returns: v.object({ result: v.string() }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Verify user is authenticated\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    if (!identity) {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n    }\n    \n    // Get API key from environment (not hardcoded)\n    const apiKey = process.env.EXTERNAL_API_KEY;\n    if (!apiKey) {\n      throw new Error(\"API key not configured\");\n    }\n    \n    // Log usage for audit trail\n    await ctx.runMutation(internal.audit.logAPICall, {\n      userId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      endpoint: \"external-api\",\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n    \n    const response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/query\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: {\n        \"Authorization\": `Bearer ${apiKey}`,\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ query: args.query }),\n    });\n    \n    if (!response.ok) {\n      // Don''t expose external API error details\n      throw new ConvexError(\"External service unavailable\");\n    }\n    \n    const data = await response.json();\n    \n    // Sanitize response before returning\n    return { result: sanitizeResponse(data) };\n  },\n});\n\n// Internal action - not exposed to clients\nexport const _processPayment = internalAction({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    amount: v.number(),\n    paymentMethodId: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ success: v.boolean(), transactionId: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const stripeKey = process.env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY;\n    \n    // Process payment with Stripe\n    // This should NEVER be exposed as a public action\n    \n    return { success: true, transactionId: \"txn_xxx\" };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Rate Limiting Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/rateLimit.ts\nimport { mutation, query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\nconst RATE_LIMITS = {\n  message: { requests: 10, windowMs: 60000 }, // 10 per minute\n  upload: { requests: 5, windowMs: 300000 },  // 5 per 5 minutes\n  api: { requests: 100, windowMs: 3600000 },  // 100 per hour\n};\n\nexport const checkRateLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.string(),\n    action: v.union(v.literal(\"message\"), v.literal(\"upload\"), v.literal(\"api\")),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ allowed: v.boolean(), retryAfter: v.optional(v.number()) }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const limit = RATE_LIMITS[args.action];\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - limit.windowMs;\n    \n    // Count requests in window\n    const requests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"rateLimits\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user_and_action\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"userId\", args.userId).eq(\"action\", args.action)\n      )\n      .filter((q) => q.gt(q.field(\"timestamp\"), windowStart))\n      .collect();\n    \n    if (requests.length >= limit.requests) {\n      const oldestRequest = requests[0];\n      const retryAfter = oldestRequest.timestamp + limit.windowMs - now;\n      \n      return { allowed: false, retryAfter };\n    }\n    \n    // Record this request\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"rateLimits\", {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      action: args.action,\n      timestamp: now,\n    });\n    \n    return { allowed: true };\n  },\n});\n\n// Use in mutations\nexport const sendMessage = mutation({\n  args: { content: v.string() },\n  returns: v.id(\"messages\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    if (!identity) throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n    \n    // Check rate limit\n    const rateCheck = await checkRateLimit(ctx, {\n      userId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      action: \"message\",\n    });\n    \n    if (!rateCheck.allowed) {\n      throw new ConvexError({\n        code: \"RATE_LIMITED\",\n        message: `Too many requests. Try again in ${Math.ceil(rateCheck.retryAfter! / 1000)} seconds`,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"messages\", {\n      content: args.content,\n      authorId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Sensitive Operations Protection\n\n```typescript\n// convex/admin.ts\nimport { mutation, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { requireRole, requirePermission } from \"./lib/auth\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\n// Two-factor confirmation for dangerous operations\nexport const deleteAllUserData = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    confirmationCode: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Require superadmin\n    const admin = await requireRole(ctx, \"superadmin\");\n    \n    // Verify confirmation code\n    const confirmation = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"confirmations\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_admin_and_code\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"adminId\", admin._id).eq(\"code\", args.confirmationCode)\n      )\n      .filter((q) => q.gt(q.field(\"expiresAt\"), Date.now()))\n      .unique();\n    \n    if (!confirmation || confirmation.action !== \"delete_user_data\") {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Invalid or expired confirmation code\");\n    }\n    \n    // Delete confirmation to prevent reuse\n    await ctx.db.delete(confirmation._id);\n    \n    // Schedule deletion (don''t do it inline)\n    await ctx.scheduler.runAfter(0, internal.admin._performDeletion, {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      requestedBy: admin._id,\n    });\n    \n    // Audit log\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"auditLogs\", {\n      action: \"delete_user_data\",\n      targetUserId: args.userId,\n      performedBy: admin._id,\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n    \n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\n// Generate confirmation code for sensitive action\nexport const requestDeletionConfirmation = mutation({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.string(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const admin = await requireRole(ctx, \"superadmin\");\n    \n    const code = generateSecureCode();\n    \n    await ctx.db.insert(\"confirmations\", {\n      adminId: admin._id,\n      code,\n      action: \"delete_user_data\",\n      targetUserId: args.userId,\n      expiresAt: Date.now() + 5 * 60 * 1000, // 5 minutes\n    });\n    \n    // In production, send code via secure channel (email, SMS)\n    return code;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Complete Audit Trail System\n\n```typescript\n// convex/audit.ts\nimport { mutation, query, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { getUser, requireRole } from \"./lib/auth\";\n\nconst auditEventValidator = v.object({\n  _id: v.id(\"auditLogs\"),\n  _creationTime: v.number(),\n  action: v.string(),\n  userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n  resourceType: v.string(),\n  resourceId: v.string(),\n  details: v.optional(v.any()),\n  ipAddress: v.optional(v.string()),\n  timestamp: v.number(),\n});\n\n// Internal: Log audit event\nexport const logEvent = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    action: v.string(),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n    resourceType: v.string(),\n    resourceId: v.string(),\n    details: v.optional(v.any()),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"auditLogs\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"auditLogs\", {\n      ...args,\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\n// Admin: View audit logs\nexport const getAuditLogs = query({\n  args: {\n    resourceType: v.optional(v.string()),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(auditEventValidator),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await requireRole(ctx, \"admin\");\n    \n    let query = ctx.db.query(\"auditLogs\");\n    \n    if (args.resourceType) {\n      query = query.withIndex(\"by_resource_type\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"resourceType\", args.resourceType)\n      );\n    }\n    \n    return await query\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 100);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Implement defense in depth (multiple security layers)\n- Log all sensitive operations for audit trails\n- Use confirmation codes for destructive actions\n- Rate limit all user-facing endpoints\n- Never expose internal API keys or errors\n- Review access patterns regularly\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Single point of failure** - Implement multiple auth checks\n2. **Missing audit logs** - Log all sensitive operations\n3. **Trusting client data** - Always validate server-side\n4. **Exposing error details** - Sanitize error messages\n5. **No rate limiting** - Always implement rate limits\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Functions Auth: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:43:14.322Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security Analysis Agents requiring comprehensive Convex application reviews, including authorization logic and data access boundaries.","zh":"适合需要对 Convex 应用程序进行全面审查的安全分析代理，包括授权逻辑和数据访问边界。","ja":"Convex アプリケーションの包括的なレビューを必要とするセキュリティ分析エージェントに最適です。権限ロジックやデータアクセス境界などが含まれます。","ko":"Convex 애플리케이션의 완전한 검토가 필요한 보안 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 승인 논리 및 데이터 액세스 경계 등을 포함합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Seguridad que requieren revisiones de aplicaciones Convex exhaustivas, incluyendo lógica de autorización y límites de acceso a datos.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Sécurité nécessitant des examens d''applications Convex complets, y compris la logique d''autorisation et les limites d''accès aux données.","de":"Ideal für Sicherheitsanalyseagenten, die umfassende Überprüfungen von Convex-Anwendungen erfordern, einschließlich Autorisierungslogik und Datenzugriffsgrenzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Segurança que exigem revisões abrangentes de aplicativos Convex, incluindo lógica de autorização e limites de acesso a dados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа безопасности, требующих всестороннего обзора приложений Convex, включая логику авторизации и границы доступа к данным.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الأمن التي تتطلب مراجعة شاملة لتطبيقات Convex، بما في ذلك منطق التفويض وحدود الوصول إلى البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough security audits of Convex applications, leveraging documentation from sources like https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth and https://docs.convex.dev/production to ensure secure authorization, rate limiting, and protection of sensitive operations using Convex''s authentication functions.","zh":"使代理能够对 Convex 应用程序执行彻底的安全审计，利用来自 https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth 和 https://docs.convex.dev/production 的文档，确保使用 Convex 的身份验证函数实现安全的授权、速率限制和保护敏感操作。","ja":"エージェントが Convex アプリケーションの包括的なセキュリティ監査を実行できるようにし、https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth および https://docs.convex.dev/production からのドキュメントを利用して、Convex の認証機能を使用してセキュアな認証、レート制限、および機密操作の保護を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Convex 애플리케이션에 대한 철저한 보안 감사를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth 및 https://docs.convex.dev/production에서 제공하는 문서를 활용하여 Convex의 인증 함수를 사용하여 보안 인증, 속도 제한 및 민감한 작업 보호를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de seguridad exhaustivas de aplicaciones Convex, utilizando la documentación de fuentes como https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth y https://docs.convex.dev/production para garantizar una autorización segura, limitación de velocidad y protección de operaciones sensibles utilizando las funciones de autenticación de Convex.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de sécurité complets des applications Convex, en exploitant la documentation de sources comme https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth et https://docs.convex.dev/production pour assurer une autorisation sécurisée, une limitation de débit et la protection des opérations sensibles en utilisant les fonctions d''authentification de Convex.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Sicherheitsaudits von Convex-Anwendungen durchzuführen, indem sie die Dokumentation von Quellen wie https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth und https://docs.convex.dev/production nutzen, um eine sichere Autorisierung, eine Rate Limitierung und den Schutz sensibler Operationen mithilfe der Authentifizierungsfunktionen von Convex zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de segurança abrangentes de aplicativos Convex, utilizando documentação de fontes como https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth e https://docs.convex.dev/production para garantir autorização segura, limitação de taxa e proteção de operações sensíveis usando funções de autenticação do Convex.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные аудиты безопасности приложений Convex, используя документацию из источников, таких как https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth и https://docs.convex.dev/production, для обеспечения безопасной авторизации, ограничения скорости и защиты чувствительных операций с помощью функций аутентификации Convex.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إجراء عمليات فحص أمنية شاملة لتطبيقات Convex، مستخدماً وثائق من مصادر مثل https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth و https://docs.convex.dev/production لضمان تفويض آمن وضبط معدل الاستخدام وحماية العمليات الحساسة باستخدام دوال التحقق من Convex."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing Convex application authorization logic for vulnerabilities","Analyzing data access boundaries to prevent unauthorized access","Implementing rate limiting to protect against excessive usage","Securing sensitive operations within Convex applications"],"zh":["审计 Convex 应用程序的授权逻辑以发现漏洞","分析数据访问边界以防止未经授权的访问","实施速率限制以保护免受过度使用","保护 Convex 应用程序中的敏感操作"],"ja":["Convex アプリケーションの権限ロジックの脆弱性を特定するための監査","未認証アクセスの防止のためのデータアクセス境界の分析","過剰な使用からの保護のためのレート制限の実装","Convex アプリケーション内の機密操作の保護"],"ko":["취약점을 발견하기 위한 Convex 애플리케이션의 승인 논리의 감사","미승인 액세스를 방지하기 위한 데이터 액세스 경계의 분석","과도한 사용으로부터의 보호를 위한 속도 제한의 구현","Convex 애플리케이션 내의 민감한 작업의 보호"],"es":["Auditoría de la lógica de autorización de aplicaciones Convex en busca de vulnerabilidades","Análisis de los límites de acceso a datos para prevenir el acceso no autorizado","Implementación de una limitación de velocidad para proteger contra un uso excesivo","Protección de operaciones sensibles dentro de las aplicaciones Convex"],"fr":["Audit de la logique d''autorisation des applications Convex pour détecter les vulnérabilités","Analyse des limites d''accès aux données pour prévenir l''accès non autorisé","Mise en œuvre d''une limitation de débit pour protéger contre une utilisation excessive","Protection des opérations sensibles au sein des applications Convex"],"de":["Überprüfung der Autorisierungslogik von Convex-Anwendungen auf Sicherheitslücken","Analyse der Datenzugriffsgrenzen zur Verhinderung von unbefugtem Zugriff","Implementierung einer Rate Limitierung zum Schutz vor übermäßiger Nutzung","Sicherung sensibler Operationen innerhalb von Convex-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Auditoria da lógica de autorização do aplicativo Convex para vulnerabilidades","Análise dos limites de acesso a dados para prevenir acesso não autorizado","Implementação de limitação de taxa para proteger contra uso excessivo","Proteção de operações sensíveis dentro dos aplicativos Convex"],"ru":["Аудит логики авторизации приложения Convex на наличие уязвимостей","Анализ границ доступа к данным для предотвращения несанкционированного доступа","Реализация ограничения скорости для защиты от чрезмерного использования","Защита чувствительных операций внутри приложений Convex"],"ar":["فحص منطق التفويض لتطبيقات Convex للكشف عن الثغرات","تحليل حدود الوصول إلى البيانات لمنع الوصول غير المصرح به","تنفيذ سيطرة على معدل الاستخدام لحماية ضد الاستخدام المفرط","حماية العمليات الحساسة داخل تطبيقات Convex"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex application documentation","Limited to Convex applications and their specific security features","Needs up-to-date documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/ for accurate analysis"],"zh":["需要访问 Convex 应用程序文档","仅限 Convex 应用程序及其特定的安全功能","需要来自 https://docs.convex.dev/ 的最新文档以进行准确的分析"],"ja":["Convex アプリケーションのドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Convex アプリケーションとその特定のセキュリティ機能に限定される","https://docs.convex.dev/ からの最新のドキュメントが必要になる"],"ko":["Convex 애플리케이션 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요함","Convex 애플리케이션 및 해당 특정 보안 기능으로 제한됨","정확한 분석을 위해 https://docs.convex.dev/에서 최신 문서가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de aplicaciones Convex","Limitado a aplicaciones Convex y sus características de seguridad específicas","Necesita documentación actualizada desde https://docs.convex.dev/ para un análisis preciso"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation des applications Convex","Limité aux applications Convex et à leurs fonctionnalités de sécurité spécifiques","Nécessite une documentation à jour depuis https://docs.convex.dev/ pour une analyse précise"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Dokumentation von Convex-Anwendungen","Begrenzt auf Convex-Anwendungen und deren spezifische Sicherheitsfunktionen","Benötigt aktuelle Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/ für eine genaue Analyse"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação do aplicativo Convex","Limitado a aplicativos Convex e suas características de segurança específicas","Necessita de documentação atualizada de https://docs.convex.dev/ para análise precisa"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации приложения Convex","Ограничен приложениями Convex и их конкретными функциями безопасности","Требует актуальной документации с https://docs.convex.dev/ для точного анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق تطبيق Convex","محدود بتطبيقات Convex وميزات الأمان الخاصة بها","يحتاج إلى وثائق محدثة من https://docs.convex.dev/ للتحليل الدقيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":90}');
