d boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Vite 作为前端构建工具","集成 GraphQL 作为数据管理解决方案","使用 Typescript 作为编程语言","支持 Feature-Sliced Design 项目架构方法","支持实验性工作流的变更存档"],"ja":["Vite をフロントエンドビルドツールとして使用","GraphQL をデータ管理ソリューションとして統合","Typescript をプログラミング言語として使用","Feature-Sliced Design プロジェクトアーキテクチャ方法をサポート","実験的ワークフローの変更アーカイブをサポート"],"ko":["Vite를 프론트엔드 빌드 도구로 사용","GraphQL을 데이터 관리 솔루션으로 통합","Typescript를 프로그래밍 언어로 사용","Feature-Sliced Design 프로젝트 아키텍처 방법을 지원","실험적 워크플로의 변경 아카이브를 지원"],"es":["Boilerplate de Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design como metodología de arquitectura de proyecto","Archivado de cambios en el flujo de trabajo experimental","Selección de cambios mediante la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Soporte para esquemas personalizados"],"fr":["Boilerplate Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design comme méthodologie d''architecture de projet","Archivage de modifications dans le flux de travail expérimental","Sélection de modifications à l''aide de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Prise en charge de schémas personnalisés"],"de":["Vite + GraphQL + Typescript-Boilerplate","Feature-Sliced Design als Projektarchitekturmethodik","Archivieren von Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow","Auswahl von Änderungen mit der AskUserQuestion-Tool","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Schemata"],"pt":["Vite como ferramenta de build","GraphQL como linguagem de consulta","Typescript como linguagem de programação","Feature-Sliced Design como metodologia de arquitetura","Boilerplate de frontend pronto para uso","Suporte a diferentes ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Vite в качестве инструмента сборки","GraphQL в качестве языка запросов","Typescript в качестве языка программирования","Feature-Sliced Design в качестве методологии архитектуры","Шаблон frontend, готовый к использованию","Поддержка различных сред разработки"],"ar":["Vite كأداة بناء","GraphQL كanguage استفسار","Typescript كlanguage برمجة","Feature-Sliced Design كمنهجية تصميم","قالب موحد لبرنامج طرف العميل جاهز للاستخدام","دعم لبيئات تطوير متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","实验性工作流","变更存档","前端项目模板"],"ja":["Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","実験的ワークフロー","変更アーカイブ","フロントエンドプロジェクトテンプレート"],"ko":["Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","실험적 워크플ロー","변경 아카이브","프론트엔드 프로젝트 템플릿"],"es":["openspec-archive-change","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","boilerplate","archivado de cambios","flujo de trabajo experimental"],"fr":["openspec-archive-change","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","boilerplate","archivage de modifications","flux de travail expérimental"],"de":["openspec-archive-change","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","Boilerplate","Änderungsarchivierung","experimenteller Workflow"],"pt":["boilerplate frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","desenvolvimento web","programação","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["шаблон frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","веб-разработка","программирование","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["قالب موحد لبرنامج طرف العميل","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","تطوير الويب","برمجة","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"uxname","repo":"litefront","repoPath":"uxname/litefront","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:43:21.875Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents utilizing Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript, needing to efficiently manage experimental workflows.","zh":"非常适合使用 Vite、GraphQL 和 Typescript 的开发代理，需要高效地管理实验工作流程。","ja":"Vite、GraphQL、TypeScriptを使用する開発エージェントに最適で、実験的なワークフローを効率的に管理する必要があります。","ko":"Vite, GraphQL 및 Typescript를 사용하는 개발 에이전트에게 최적화되어 있으며, 실험적 워크플로를 효율적으로 관리할 필요가 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que utilizan Vite, GraphQL y Typescript, y necesitan gestionar flujos de trabajo experimentales de manera eficiente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement utilisant Vite, GraphQL et Typescript, ayant besoin de gérer efficacement les flux de travail expérimentaux.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die Vite, GraphQL und Typescript verwenden und effizient experimentelle Arbeitsabläufe verwalten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que utilizam Vite, GraphQL e Typescript, necessitando gerenciar fluxos de trabalho experimentais de forma eficiente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, использующих Vite, GraphQL и Typescript, которым необходимо эффективно управлять экспериментальными рабочими процессами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية الذين يستخدمون Vite و GraphQL و Typescript، وهم بحاجة إلى إدارة تدفقات العمل التجريبية بفعالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to archive completed changes in experimental workflows using Feature-Sliced Design, and integrates seamlessly with GraphQL and Typescript, enabling efficient project architecture management and utilizing the `openspec list --json` command for retrieving available changes.","zh":"赋予代理在实验工作流程中使用特性切片设计来存档已完成的更改的能力，并与 GraphQL 和 Typescript 无缝集成，实现高效的项目架构管理，并利用 `openspec list --json` 命令来检索可用的更改。","ja":"実験的ワークフローでFeature-Sliced Designを使用して完了した変更をアーカイブする機能をエージェントに与え、GraphQLおよびTypeScriptとシームレスに統合し、効率的なプロジェクトアーキテクチャ管理を可能にし、`openspec list --json`コマンドを使用して利用可能な変更を取得します。","ko":"실험적 워크플로에서 기능 슬라이스 디자인을 사용하여 완료된 변경 사항을 저장소에 보관할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, GraphQL 및 Typescript와 무정지로 통합되어 효율적인 프로젝트 아키텍처 관리를 가능하게 하며, `openspec list --json` 명령어를 사용하여 사용 가능한 변경 사항을 가져올 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar los cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales utilizando Diseño en Rebanadas de Funcionalidad, e integra perfectamente con GraphQL y Typescript, lo que permite una gestión eficiente de la arquitectura del proyecto y utiliza el comando `openspec list --json` para recuperar los cambios disponibles.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver les modifications terminées dans les flux de travail expérimentaux en utilisant la conception en tranches de fonctionnalités, et s''intègre sans heurts à GraphQL et Typescript, permettant ainsi une gestion efficace de l''architecture du projet et utilisant la commande `openspec list --json` pour récupérer les modifications disponibles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Arbeitsabläufen mithilfe von Funktions-Slice-Design zu archivieren, und integriert sich nahtlos mit GraphQL und Typescript, wodurch eine effiziente Projektarchitekturverwaltung ermöglicht wird und der Befehl `openspec list --json` zur Abrufung verfügbarer Änderungen verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais usando Design em Fatias de Recursos, e se integra perfeitamente com GraphQL e Typescript, permitindo a gestão eficiente da arquitetura do projeto e utilizando o comando `openspec list --json` para recuperar alterações disponíveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальных рабочих процессах с помощью дизайна, разбитого на части функций, и интегрируется без проблем с GraphQL и Typescript, обеспечивая эффективное управление архитектурой проекта и используя команду `openspec list --json` для получения доступных изменений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في تدفقات العمل التجريبية باستخدام تصميم مقسم إلى شرائح ميزة، ويندمج بشكل متكامل مع GraphQL و Typescript، ويمكنه إدارةه هندسة المشروع بفعالية واستخدام أمر `openspec list --json` لاسترجاع التغييرات المتاحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed changes in experimental workflows","Retrieving available changes using the `openspec list --json` command","Prompting users for change selection using the AskUserQuestion tool"],"zh":["在实验工作流程中存档已完成的更改","使用 `openspec list --json` 命令检索可用的更改","使用 AskUserQuestion 工具提示用户选择更改"],"ja":["実験的ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブする"," `openspec list --json` コマンドを使用して利用可能な変更を取得する","AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーに変更の選択を求める"],"ko":["실험적 워크플로에서 완료된 변경 사항을 저장소에 보관"," `openspec list --json` 명령어를 사용하여 사용 가능한 변경 사항을 가져오기","AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 사용자에게 변경 사항 선택을 요구"],"es":["Archivar los cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales","Recuperar los cambios disponibles utilizando el comando `openspec list --json`","Solicitar a los usuarios que seleccionen cambios utilizando la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications terminées dans les flux de travail expérimentaux","Récupérer les modifications disponibles en utilisant la commande `openspec list --json`","Inciter les utilisateurs à sélectionner des modifications à l''aide de l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Arbeitsabläufen archivieren","Verfügbare Änderungen mithilfe des Befehls `openspec list --json` abrufen","Benutzer auffordern, Änderungen mit dem Tool AskUserQuestion auszuwählen"],"pt":["Arquivar alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais","Recuperar alterações disponíveis usando o comando `openspec list --json`","Solicitar que os usuários selecionem alterações usando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальных рабочих процессах","Получать доступные изменения, используя команду `openspec list --json`","Просить пользователей выбрать изменения, используя инструмент AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في تدفقات العمل التجريبية","استرجاع التغييرات المتاحة باستخدام أمر `openspec list --json`","طلب من المستخدمين اختيار التغييرات باستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript setup","Needs access to the experimental workflow context","Limited to active changes, excluding already archived ones"],"zh":["需要 Vite、GraphQL 和 Typescript 的设置","需要访问实验工作流程的上下文","仅限于活动更改，排除已经存档的更改"],"ja":["Vite、GraphQL、TypeScriptの設定が必要","実験的ワークフローのコンテキストへのアクセスが必要","アクティブな変更のみに限定され、既にアーカイブされている変更は除外される"],"ko":["Vite, GraphQL 및 Typescript 설정이 필요","실험적 워크플로의 콘텍스트에 대한 액세스가 필요","활성 변경 사항만 제한되며 이미 보관된 변경 사항은 제외"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Vite, GraphQL y Typescript","Necesita acceso al contexto del flujo de trabajo experimental","Limitado a cambios activos, excluyendo los ya archivados"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Vite, GraphQL et Typescript","A besoin d''un accès au contexte du flux de travail expérimental","Limité aux modifications actives, à l''exclusion de celles déjà archivées"],"de":["Benötigt Vite-, GraphQL- und Typescript-Konfiguration","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Kontext des experimentellen Arbeitsablaufs","Begrenzt auf aktive Änderungen, ausgenommen bereits archivierte"],"pt":["Exige configuração de Vite, GraphQL e Typescript","Necessita acesso ao contexto do fluxo de trabalho experimental","Limitado a alterações ativas, excluindo as já arquivadas"],"ru":["Требует настройки Vite, GraphQL и Typescript","Требует доступа к контексту экспериментального рабочего процесса","Ограничен активными изменениями, исключая уже архивированные"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Vite و GraphQL و Typescript","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى سياق تدفق العمل التجريبي","محدود بالتغييرات النشطة، باستثناء تلك التي تم أرشفتها بالفعل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
