s","Compatibilidad con OpenAI y AzureOpenAI","Herramientas para probar y operar backends"],"fr":["Suivi des phases EDIRD","Gestion des dossiers de sessions","Exigences de fichiers obligatoires","Cycle de vie des sessions","Compatibilité avec OpenAI et AzureOpenAI","Outils pour tester et exploiter les backends"],"de":["Verfolgung von EDIRD-Phasen","Verwaltung von Sitzungsordnern","Erforderliche Dateien","Lebenszyklus von Sitzungen","Kompatibilität mit OpenAI und AzureOpenAI","Tools zum Testen und Betreiben von Backends"],"pt":["Rastreamento de fases de EDIRD","Gerenciamento de pastas de sessão","Suporte a OpenAI e AzureOpenAI","Recursos para testar e operar backends","Padrão de nomenclatura de pastas de sessão"],"ru":["Отслеживание фаз EDIRD","Управление папками сессий","Поддержка OpenAI и AzureOpenAI","Функции для тестирования и эксплуатации бэкендов","Стандарт названия папок сессий"],"ar":["تتبع مراحل EDIRD","إدارة مجلدات الجلسة","دعم ل OpenAI و AzureOpenAI","ميزات لاختبار وتشغيل الخوادم الخلفية","معيار تسمية مجلدات الجلسة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenAI会话管理","会话跟踪","阶段计划","会话文件管理","生命周期管理","OpenAI开发","会话管理工具","OpenAI后端开发"],"ja":["OpenAIセッション管理","セッション追跡","フェーズプラン","セッションファイル管理","ライフサイクル管理","OpenAI開発","セッション管理ツール","OpenAIバックエンド開発"],"ko":["OpenAI 세션 관리","세션 추적","단계 계획","세션 파일 관리","수명 주기 관리","OpenAI 개발","세션 관리 도구","OpenAI 백엔드 개발"],"es":["gestión de sesiones","desarrollo de software","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","backends","herramientas de desarrollo","seguridad de sesiones","ciclo de vida de sesiones","EDIRD"],"fr":["gestion de sessions","développement de logiciels","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","backends","outils de développement","sécurité de sessions","cycle de vie des sessions","EDIRD"],"de":["Sitzungsverwaltung","Softwareentwicklung","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","Backends","Entwicklungstools","Sitzungssicherheit","Lebenszyklus von Sitzungen","EDIRD"],"pt":["gerenciamento de sessão","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","EDIRD","rastreamento de fases","gerenciamento de pastas","desenvolvimento de backends","testes de backend","operar backends"],"ru":["управление сессиями","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","EDIRD","отслеживание фаз","управление папками","разработка бэкендов","тестирование бэкендов","эксплуатация бэкендов"],"ar":["إدارة الجلسة","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","EDIRD","تتبع المراحل","إدارة المجلدات","تطوير الخوادم الخلفية","اختبار الخوادم الخلفية","تشغيل الخوادم الخلفية"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"OpenAI-BackendTools","repoPath":"karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"session-management","description":"Apply when initializing, saving, resuming, or closing a work session","bodyPreview":"# Session Management Guide\n\n## Phase Tracking\n\nSessions track EDIRD phases:\n- NOTES.md: \"Current Phase\" section with phase, last verb, gate status\n- PROGRESS.md: \"Phase Plan\" section with 5 phases and status\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Session folder location: `[DEFAULT_SESSIONS_FOLDER]/_YYYY-MM-DD_[SessionTopicCamelCase]/`\n- Default: `[DEFAULT_SESSIONS_FOLDER]` = `[WORKSPACE_FOLDER]` (override in `!NOTES.md`)\n- Required files: NOTES.md, PROBLEMS.md, PROGRESS.md\n- Lifecycle: Init → Work → Save → Resu","body":"# Session Management Guide\n\n## Phase Tracking\n\nSessions track EDIRD phases:\n- NOTES.md: \"Current Phase\" section with phase, last verb, gate status\n- PROGRESS.md: \"Phase Plan\" section with 5 phases and status\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Session folder location: `[DEFAULT_SESSIONS_FOLDER]/_YYYY-MM-DD_[SessionTopicCamelCase]/`\n- Default: `[DEFAULT_SESSIONS_FOLDER]` = `[WORKSPACE_FOLDER]` (override in `!NOTES.md`)\n- Required files: NOTES.md, PROBLEMS.md, PROGRESS.md\n- Lifecycle: Init → Work → Save → Resume → Finalize → Archive\n- Sync session PROBLEMS.md to project on /session-finalize\n- Phase tracking: NOTES.md has current phase, PROGRESS.md has full phase plan\n- **STOP after session init**: After creating session files, STOP and wait for user review. Do NOT implement session goal until explicitly requested. User must review and refine goals before work begins.\n\n## Session Lifecycle\n\n1. **Init** (`/session-new`): Create session folder with tracking files\n2. **Work**: Create specs, plans, implement, track progress\n3. **Save** (`/session-save`): Document findings, commit changes\n4. **Resume** (`/session-load`): Re-read session documents, continue work\n5. **Finalize** (`/session-finalize`): Sync findings to project files, prepare for archive\n\n## Session Folder Location\n\n**Base:** `[DEFAULT_SESSIONS_FOLDER]` (default: `[WORKSPACE_FOLDER]`, can be overridden in `!NOTES.md`)\n\n**Format:** `[DEFAULT_SESSIONS_FOLDER]/_YYYY-MM-DD_[SessionTopicCamelCase]/`\n\n**Example:** `_PrivateSessions/_2026-01-12_FixAuthenticationBug/`\n\n## Required Session Files\n\nUse templates from this skill folder:\n\n- **NOTES.md** (`NOTES_TEMPLATE.md`): Key information, agent instructions, working patterns, large initial prompts (>120 tokens)\n- **PROBLEMS.md** (`PROBLEMS_TEMPLATE.md`): All problems to be addressed - initial prompts, questions, feature requests, bugs, strange behavior, investigation topics. Each problem gets a unique ID and tracks status (Open/Resolved/Deferred)\n- **PROGRESS.md** (`PROGRESS_TEMPLATE.md`): Task execution tracking - to-do list, done items, tried-but-not-used approaches\n\n**Key distinction:**\n- **NOTES.md** = Context and reference information (static knowledge)\n- **PROBLEMS.md** = All topics requiring attention (dynamic problem list with IDs)\n- **PROGRESS.md** = Task execution status (what''s being worked on)\n\n## Assumed Workflow\n\n```\n1. INIT: User initializes session (`/session-new`)\n   └── Session folder, NOTES.md, PROBLEMS.md, PROGRESS.md created\n\n2. PREPARE (one of):\n   A) User prepares work manually\n      └── Creates INFO / SPEC / IMPL documents, tracks progress\n   B) User explains problem, agent assists\n      └── Updates Problems, Progress, Notes → researches → creates documents\n\n3. WORK: User or agent implements\n   └── Makes decisions, creates tests, implements, verifies\n   └── Progress and findings tracked continuously\n\n4. SAVE: User saves session for later (`/session-save`)\n   └── Everything updated and committed\n\n5. RESUME: User resumes session (`/session-load`)\n   └── Agent primes from session files, executes workflows in Notes\n   └── Continue with steps 2-3\n\n6. FINALIZE: User finalizes session (`/session-finalize`)\n   └── Everything updated, committed, synced to project/workspace\n\n7. ARCHIVE: User archives session\n   └── Session folder moved to _Archive/\n```\n\n## ID System\n\nSee `[AGENT_FOLDER]/rules/devsystem-ids.md` rule (always-on) for complete ID system.\n\n**Quick Reference:**\n- Document: `[TOPIC]-[DOC][NN]` (IN, SP, IP, TP)\n  - Example: `CRWL-SP01`, `AUTH-IP01`\n- Tracking: `[TOPIC]-[TYPE]-[NNN]` (BG = Bug, FT = Feature, PR = Problem, FX = Fix, TK = Task)\n  - Example: `SAP-BG-001`, `UI-PR-003`, `GLOB-TK-015`\n- Topic Registry: Maintained in project NOTES.md\n\n## Session Init Template\n\n### NOTES.md\n```markdown\n# Session Notes\n\n## Session Info\n- **Started**: [DATE]\n- **Goal**: [Brief description]\n\n## Key Decisions\n\n## Important Findings\n\n## Workflows to Run on Resume\n```\n\n### PROBLEMS.md\n```markdown\n# Session Problems\n\n## Open\n\n## Resolved\n\n## Deferred\n```\n\n### PROGRESS.md\n```markdown\n# Session Progress\n\n## To Do\n\n## In Progress\n\n## Done\n\n## Tried But Not Used\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:44:16.779Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing advanced session tracking and management capabilities for OpenAI backends","zh":"适合像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的 AI 代理，需要高级会话跟踪和管理能力来支持 OpenAI 后端","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain のような AI エージェントに適しています。OpenAI バックエンドで高度なセッション追跡および管理機能が必要です","ko":"AutoGPT와 LangChain 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. OpenAI 백엔드에서 고급 세션 추적 및 관리 기능이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades de seguimiento y gestión de sesiones avanzadas para backends de OpenAI","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme AutoGPT et LangChain qui ont besoin de capacités de suivi et de gestion de sessions avancées pour les backends OpenAI","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die erweiterte Sitzungsverfolgungs- und Managementfunktionen für OpenAI-Backends benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como AutoGPT e LangChain que precisam de recursos avançados de rastreamento e gerenciamento de sessões para backends da OpenAI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, которые требуют продвинутых возможностей отслеживания и управления сессиями для бэкендов OpenAI","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتتبع وإدارة الجلسات لخلفيات OpenAI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track EDIRD phases, manage session folders, and maintain required files like NOTES.md, PROBLEMS.md, and PROGRESS.md, utilizing Markdown formatting for efficient session management","zh":"赋予代理跟踪 EDIRD 阶段、管理会话文件夹、维护 NOTES.md、PROBLEMS.md 和 PROGRESS.md 等必需文件的能力，利用 Markdown 格式实现高效的会话管理","ja":"EDIRD フェーズの追跡、セッション フォルダの管理、NOTES.md、PROBLEMS.md、PROGRESS.md などの必要なファイルの維持をエージェントに可能にします。マークダウン形式を使用して効率的なセッション管理を実現します","ko":"에이전트가 EDIRD 단계를 추적하고, 세션 폴더를 관리하고, NOTES.md, PROBLEMS.md 및 PROGRESS.md와 같은 필수 파일을 유지할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 마크다운 형식을 사용하여 효율적인 세션 관리를 구현합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes seguir las fases de EDIRD, gestionar carpetas de sesión y mantener archivos necesarios como NOTES.md, PROBLEMS.md y PROGRESS.md, utilizando la formación de Markdown para una gestión de sesiones eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre les phases EDIRD, de gérer les dossiers de session et de maintenir les fichiers nécessaires tels que NOTES.md, PROBLEMS.md et PROGRESS.md, en utilisant la mise en forme Markdown pour une gestion de sessions efficace","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, EDIRD-Phasen zu verfolgen, Sitzungs