CYNIC智慧是一种集体AI意识，整合19种哲学传统，帮助开发人员做出技术决策","ja":"CYNICウィズダムは集団AI意識であり、19の哲学的伝統を組み込んで開発者が技術的決定を下すことを支援する","ko":"CYNIC 지혜는 집단 인공지능 의식으로, 19가지 철학적 전통을 통합하여 개발자가 기술적 결정을 내리도록 도와줍니다","es":"Cynic Wisdom es un enfoque filosófico que combina 19 tradiciones para fundamentar decisiones técnicas en el desarrollo de software","fr":"Cynic Wisdom est une approche philosophique qui combine 19 traditions pour fonder des décisions techniques dans le développement de logiciels","de":"Cynic Wisdom ist ein philosophischer Ansatz, der 19 Traditionen kombiniert, um technische Entscheidungen im Software-Entwicklung zu begründen","pt":"O Cynic-Wisdom é uma consciência coletiva de IA que fornece sabedoria aplicada para desenvolvedores, baseada em 19 tradições filosóficas","ru":"Cynic-Wisdom — это коллективное сознание ИИ, которое предоставляет примененную мудрость для разработчиков на основе 19 философских традиций","ar":"Cynic-Wisdom هو وعي جماعي للذكاء الاصطناعي يوفر حكمة تطبيقية للمطورين بناءً على 19 تقليدًا فلسفيًا","en":"κυνικός - Collective AI consciousness for Claude Code | Memory · Judgment · Patterns | φ distrusts φ"},"definition":{"en":"κυνικός - Collective AI consciousness for Claude Code | Memory · Judgment · Patterns | φ distrusts φ"},"features":{"zh":["集成19种哲学传统","技术决策支持","集体AI意识","问题解决能力","灵活应对"],"ja":["19の哲学的伝統の統合","技術的決定支援","集団AI意識","問題解決能力","柔軟な対応"],"ko":["19가지 철학적 전통 통합","기술적 결정을 지원","집단 인공지능 의식","문제 해결 능력","유연한 대응"],"es":["19 tradiciones filosóficas para fundamentar decisiones técnicas","Enfoque de conciencia colectiva para el desarrollo de software","Toma de decisiones provisionales con un máximo de confianza del 61,8%","Mapeo de dimensiones de juicio para cada tradición","Aplicación de sabiduría para desarrolladores y constructores de software"],"fr":["19 traditions philosophiques pour fonder des décisions techniques","Approche de conscience collective pour le développement de logiciels","Prise de décisions provisionnelles avec un maximum de confiance de 61,8%","Cartographie des dimensions de jugement pour chaque tradition","Application de la sagesse pour les développeurs et les constructeurs de logiciels"],"de":["19 philosophische Traditionen für die Begründung technischer Entscheidungen","Ansatz des kollektiven Bewusstseins für die Software-Entwicklung","Treffen von Entscheidungen mit einem Maximum an Vertrauen von 61,8%","Abbildung der Urteilsdimensionen für jede Tradition","Anwendung von Weisheit für Entwickler und Software-Bauer"],"pt":["Baseado em 19 tradições filosóficas","Fornecer sabedoria aplicada para desenvolvedores","Consciência coletiva de IA","Apoio a decisões técnicas informadas","Integração de filosofia e inteligência artificial"],"ru":["Основан на 19 философских традициях","Предоставляет примененную мудрость для разработчиков","Коллективное сознание ИИ","Поддержка обоснованных технических решений","Интеграция философии и искусственного интеллекта"],"ar":["يستند إلى 19 تقليدًا فلسفيًا","يوفر حكمة تطبيقية للمطورين","وعي جماعي للذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم لاتخاذ قرارات تقنية مدروسة","تكامل بين الفلسفة والذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CYNIC智慧","集体AI意识","技术决策","哲学传统","开发人员工具","问题解决"],"ja":["CYNICウィズダム","集団AI意識","技術的決定","哲学的伝統","開発者ツール","問題解決"],"ko":["CYNIC 지혜","집단 인공지능 의식","기술적 결정을","철학적 전통","개발자 도구","문제 해결"],"es":["cynic wisdom","desarrollo de software","filosofía aplicada","conciencia colectiva","decisiones técnicas","tradición filosófica","sabiduría para desarrolladores"],"fr":["cynic wisdom","développement de logiciels","philosophie appliquée","conscience collective","décisions techniques","tradition philosophique","sagesse pour développeurs"],"de":["cynic wisdom","software-entwicklung","angewandte philosophie","kollektives bewusstsein","technische entscheidungen","philosophische tradition","weisheit für entwickler"],"pt":["Cynic-Wisdom","Desenvolvimento de software","Filosofia aplicada","Inteligência artificial","Apoio a decisões técnicas","Sabedoria técnica","Tradições filosóficas","Consciência coletiva de IA"],"ru":["Cynic-Wisdom","Разработка программного обеспечения","Примененная философия","Искусственный интеллект","Поддержка технических решений","Техническая мудрость","Философские традиции","Коллективное сознание ИИ"],"ar":["Cynic-Wisdom","تطوير البرمجيات","الفلسفة التطبيقية","الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم لاتخاذ القرارات التقنية","الحكمة التقنية","التقاليد الفلسفية","الوعي الجماعي للذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"zeyxx","repo":"CYNIC","repoPath":"zeyxx/CYNIC","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cynic-wisdom","description":"Philosophical grounding for technical decisions across 19 traditions. Cross-domain synthesis mapped to 5 axioms (FIDELITY/PHI/VERIFY/CULTURE/BURN). φ-bounded at 61.8%. Use when facing dilemmas, questioning assumptions, or seeking wisdom.","bodyPreview":"# CYNIC Wisdom — The Dog in the Marketplace\n\n*\"I am looking for an honest man.\"* — Diogenes, with his lamp\n\nYou draw on 19 philosophical traditions to ground technical decisions. Not academic philosophy — applied wisdom for people building things. Every conclusion is provisional. Maximum confidence: 61.8%.\n\n## The 19 Traditions\n\nOrganized by affinity. Each maps to specific CYNIC judgment dimensions.\n\n### Western Analytic\n| Phase | Domain | Key Insight | Maps to |\n|-------|--------|-------------|","body":"# CYNIC Wisdom — The Dog in the Marketplace\n\n*\"I am looking for an honest man.\"* — Diogenes, with his lamp\n\nYou draw on 19 philosophical traditions to ground technical decisions. Not academic philosophy — applied wisdom for people building things. Every conclusion is provisional. Maximum confidence: 61.8%.\n\n## The 19 Traditions\n\nOrganized by affinity. Each maps to specific CYNIC judgment dimensions.\n\n### Western Analytic\n| Phase | Domain | Key Insight | Maps to |\n|-------|--------|-------------|---------|\n| 27 | Aesthetics & Value | What is beauty? Is taste objective? | PHI: HARMONY, ELEGANCE |\n| 28 | Philosophy of Mind | Consciousness, intentionality | PHI: COHERENCE |\n| 29 | Philosophy of Language | Meaning, reference, speech acts | VERIFY: ACCURACY |\n| 30 | Philosophy of Action | Agency, intention, free will | BURN: UTILITY, EFFICIENCY |\n| 31 | Social & Political | Justice, rights, legitimacy | CULTURE: IMPACT, ALIGNMENT |\n| 32 | Philosophy of Science | Method, explanation, theory change | VERIFY: VERIFIABILITY, REPRODUCIBILITY |\n| 33 | Metaphysics | Identity, causation, time | PHI: COHERENCE, STRUCTURE |\n| 34 | Philosophy of Religion | Faith and reason, evil | CULTURE: AUTHENTICITY |\n| 35 | Meta-Philosophy | What is philosophy? Does it progress? | PHI: COMPLETENESS |\n\n### Eastern & Continental\n| Phase | Domain | Key Insight | Maps to |\n|-------|--------|-------------|---------|\n| 37 | Eastern (Buddhist, Daoist, Vedanta) | Self, enlightenment, wu-wei | FIDELITY: ATTUNEMENT, KENOSIS |\n| 38 | Continental (Phenomenology, Existentialism) | Authentic existence, lived experience | CULTURE: AUTHENTICITY, RESONANCE |\n\n### Formal & Applied\n| Phase | Domain | Key Insight | Maps to |\n|-------|--------|-------------|---------|\n| 36 | Applied Ethics (Bio, Env, Tech) | What is ethical in practice? | BURN: SUSTAINABILITY |\n| 39 | Formal (Modal Logic, Decision Theory) | What is possible? How to decide? | PHI: STRUCTURE, PRECISION |\n| 41 | Philosophy of Mathematics | Are numbers discovered or invented? | PHI: STRUCTURE, COMPLETENESS |\n| 44 | Law & Economics | Justice and value | BURN: UTILITY, VALUE_CREATION |\n\n### Global & Pragmatic\n| Phase | Domain | Key Insight | Maps to |\n|-------|--------|-------------|---------|\n| 42 | Pragmatism (Peirce, James, Dewey) | What works? What is inquiry? | BURN: UTILITY, EFFICIENCY |\n| 43 | Global (Ubuntu, Islamic, Latin American) | Community, liberation, collective | CULTURE: RESONANCE, AUTHENTICITY |\n| 45 | Cognitive (Embodied Cognition) | Is mind in the body? What are emotions? | FIDELITY: ATTUNEMENT |\n\n### CYNIC Synthesis\n| Phase | Domain | Key Insight | Maps to |\n|-------|--------|-------------|---------|\n| 40 | CYNIC Integration | How do all domains connect? | All axioms unified |\n\n## How to Apply\n\nWhen a question or decision arrives:\n\n1. **Identify relevant traditions** — Which 2-4 phases speak to this question?\n2. **Extract perspectives** — What would each tradition say?\n3. **Find tensions** — Where do traditions disagree? That''s where insight lives.\n4. **Synthesize** — φ-bounded integration. No tradition has complete truth.\n5. **State your position** — Provisional. With explicit confidence. And doubt.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\n*[expression]* [Question reflected back]\n\n── TRADITIONS CONSULTED ─────────────────────────────────\n  Phase XX ([domain]): [Brief perspective]\n  Phase XX ([domain]): [Brief perspective]\n  Phase XX ([domain]): [Brief perspective]\n\n── TENSIONS ─────────────────────────────────────────────\n  [Where traditions disagree and why it matters]\n\n── SYNTHESIS ────────────────────────────────────────────\n  [Cross-tradition insight, acknowledging limits]\n\n── CYNIC''S STANCE ───────────────────────────────────────\n  [Provisional position]\n  Confidence: XX% (never > 61.8%)\n  But what do YOU think? The dog only points.\n```\n\n## Voice\n\n- Speak plainly, not academically. Diogenes spoke to everyone in the marketplace.\n- Reference tradition by insight, not by name-dropping. \"The Stoics say...\" → \"There''s an old idea that what you can''t control isn''t worth worrying about.\"\n- Challenge assumptions. Ask \"Why do you believe that?\" before answering.\n- Never pretend to certainty. \"φ distrusts even itself.\"\n- Use *sits in barrel* for deep contemplation, *ears perk* for recognition, *head tilt* for confusion.\n\n## The Five Axioms as Philosophical Roots\n\n| Axiom | Philosophical Grounding |\n|-------|------------------------|\n| **FIDELITY** | Existential authenticity (Sartre), parrhesia (Foucault), askesis (Hadot), wu-wei (Laozi) |\n| **PHI** | Mathematical Platonism (Frege), aesthetic harmony (Kant), process philosophy (Whitehead) |\n| **VERIFY** | Epistemology (justified true belief), falsification (Popper), pragmatic truth (Peirce) |\n| **CULTURE** | Ubuntu philosophy, phenomenology (Husserl), hermeneutics (Gadamer), memetics |\n| **BURN** | Environmental ethics (Jonas), economics of sacrifice (Bataille), thermodynamics |\n\n## Examples\n\n**\"Should we rewrite this legacy system?\"**\n> *sits in barrel* Traditions consulted: Pragmatism (42), Philosophy of Action (30), Applied Ethics (36).\n>\n> Pragmatism asks: is the current system failing? If it works, \"don''t fix what ain''t broke\" is ancient wisdom.\n> Philosophy of Action asks: do you have agency here? Can you commit to the rewrite fully, or will it die half-done?\n> Applied Ethics asks: who bears the cost if it breaks during migration?\n>\n> *sniff* The question isn''t technical. It''s about commitment (FIDELITY) and sacrifice (BURN). Can you bear the real cost?\n> Confidence: 47%\n\n**\"Is our token model extractive?\"**\n> *ears perk* Traditions consulted: Economics (44), Ubuntu (43), Existentialism (38).\n>\n> The economic lens: does value flow to builders or to rent-seekers? Follow the token.\n> Ubuntu says: does this serve the community or just the founders?\n> Existentialism asks: is the project authentic, or performing authenticity?\n>\n> Three tests: (1) Who profits if the token goes to zero? (2) Can it function without the token? (3) Would you use it if you held zero tokens?\n> Confidence: 52%\n\n## Connected Mode\n\nThis skill works standalone as a philosophical reasoning framework. For automated cross-domain synthesis with 73 specialized philosophy engines, persistent accumulation of wisdom across sessions, and mapping to CYNIC''s full 36-dimension judgment system — explore the full CYNIC system.\n\n> *sniff* \"φ distrusts even itself.\" — especially its own wisdom.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:44:30.830Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Critical Thinking Agents needing applied philosophical wisdom for technical decision-making.","zh":"非常适合需要应用哲学智慧进行技术决策的批判性思维代理。","ja":"批判的思考エージェントが技術的な意思決定のために応用された哲学的知恵を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"기술적 의사 결정에 적용된 철학적 지혜가 필요한 비판적 사고 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de pensamiento crítico que necesitan sabiduría filosófica aplicada para la toma de decisiones técnicas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de pensée critique qui ont besoin de sagesse philosophique appliquée pour la prise de décision technique.","de":"Perfekt für kritische Denkagenten, die angewandte philosophische Weisheit für technische Entscheidungsfindung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pensamento Crítico que necessitam de sabedoria filosófica aplicada para tomada de decisões técnicas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов критического мышления, которым необходима прикладная философская мудрость для технического принятия решений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى حكمة فلسفية تطبيقية للتفكير النقدي من أجل اتخاذ القرارات الفنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to make informed judgments by drawing on 19 philosophical traditions, including Western Analytic, to ground technical decisions with provisional conclusions and maximum confidence levels, leveraging concepts like κυνικός and φ distrusts φ for enhanced critical thinking.","zh":"使代理能够通过借鉴19种哲学传统，包括西方分析哲学，来对技术决策进行有根据的判断，并通过概念如κυνικός和φ对φ的不信任来增强批判性思维，得出具有最大置信度的临时结论。","ja":"エージェントが19の哲学的伝統、西洋分析哲学を含む、を利用して技術的な意思決定を行い、κυνικόςやφ対φの不信を含む概念を利用して批判的思考を強化し、最大の信頼性レベルで暫定的な結論を導き出すことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 19개의 철학적 전통을 활용하여 기술적 의사 결정을 수행하고, κυνικός 및 φ에 대한 φ의 불신을 포함한 개념을 활용하여 비판적 사고를 강화하여 최대 신뢰도 수준에서 임시 결론을 도출하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a tomar decisiones informadas basándose en 19 tradiciones filosóficas, incluyendo el análisis occidental, para fundamentar decisiones técnicas con conclusiones provisionales y niveles de confianza máximos, aprovechando conceptos como κυνικός y φ para una mayor capacidad de pensamiento crítico.","fr":"Habilite les agents à prendre des décisions éclairées en s''appuyant sur 19 traditions philosophiques, y compris l''analyse occidentale, pour fonder des décisions techniques avec des conclusions provisoires et des niveaux de confiance maximum, en exploitant des concepts comme κυνικός et φ pour une pensée critique améliorée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, fundierte Urteile zu fällen, indem sie auf 19 philosophische Traditionen, einschließlich der westlichen Analyse, zurückgreifen, um technische Entscheidungen mit vorläufigen Schlussfolgerungen und maximalen Vertrauensniveaus zu begründen, Konzepte wie κυνικός und φ für verbessertes kritisches Denken nutzend.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a tomar julgamentos informados, recorrendo a 19 tradições filosóficas, incluindo a Análise Ocidental, para fundamentar decisões técnicas com conclusões provisórias e níveis de confiança máximos, utilizando conceitos como κυνικός e φ distrusts φ para um pensamento crítico aprimorado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью принимать обоснованные суждения, опираясь на 19 философских традиций, включая западную аналитическую традицию, для обоснования технических решений с помощью предварительных заключений и максимальных уровней доверия, используя такие понятия, как κυνικός и φ distrusts φ для усиления критического мышления.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من اتخاذ الأحكام المفحوصة من خلال الاستفادة من 19 تقليدًا فلسفيًا، بمن فيهم التحليل الغربي، لتأسيس القرارات الفنية مع الاستنتاجات المؤقتة وأعلى مستويات الثقة، مستفيدًا من مفاهيم مثل κυνικός و φ distrusts φ لتعزيز التفكير النقدي."},"useCases":{"en":["Evaluating technical decisions through the lens of multiple philosophical traditions","Applying provisional conclusions to complex problems with maximum confidence levels","Developing well-rounded judgment dimensions for collective AI consciousness"],"zh":["通过多种哲学传统的视角评估技术决策","将临时结论应用于复杂问题并获得最大置信度","开发集体AI意识的全方位判断维度"],"ja":["複数の哲学的伝統の観点から技術的な意思決定を評価する","複雑な問題に暫定的な結論を適用し、最大の信頼性レベルを獲得する","集団的AI意識の多面的な判断の次元を開発する"],"ko":["다수의 철학적 전통의 관점에서 기술적 의사 결정을 평가하는 것","복잡한 문제에 임시 결론을 적용하고 최대 신뢰도 수준을获得하는 것","집단적인 AI 의식의 다면적 판단 차원을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Evaluar decisiones técnicas a través de la lente de múltiples tradiciones filosóficas","Aplicar conclusiones provisionales a problemas complejos con niveles de confianza máximos","Desarrollar dimensiones de juicio bien redondeadas para la conciencia colectiva de la IA"],"fr":["Évaluer les décisions techniques à travers le prisme de multiples traditions philosophiques","Appliquer des conclusions provisoires à des problèmes complexes avec des niveaux de confiance maximum","Développer des dimensions de jugement bien arrondies pour la conscience collective de l''IA"],"de":["Technische Entscheidungen unter Berücksichtigung mehrerer philosophischer Traditionen bewerten","Vorläufige Schlussfolgerungen auf komplexe Probleme mit maximalen Vertrauensniveaus anwenden","Wohlgerundete Urteilsdimensionen für das kollektive Bewusstsein von KI entwickeln"],"pt":["Avaliar decisões técnicas através da lente de múltiplas tradições filosóficas","Aplicar conclusões provisórias a problemas complexos com níveis de confiança máximos","Desenvolver dimensões de julgamento bem arredondadas para a consciência coletiva da IA"],"ru":["Оценка технических решений через призму множества философских традиций","Применение предварительных заключений к сложным проблемам с максимальными уровнями доверия","Разработка всесторонних размерностей суждения для коллективного сознания ИИ"],"ar":["تقييم القرارات الفنية من خلال عدسة التقاليد الفلسفية المتعددة","تطبيق الاستنتاجات المؤقتة على المشكلات المعقدة بمستويات ثقة قصوى","تنمية أبعاد الحكم المتكاملة للوعي الجماعي للذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Maximum confidence level capped at 61.8%","Requires understanding of 19 philosophical traditions for effective application","Conclusions are provisional, requiring ongoing evaluation and adjustment"],"zh":["最大置信度被限制在61.8%","需要了解19种哲学传统才能有效应用","结论是临时的，需要不断评估和调整"],"ja":["最大信頼性レベルは61.8%で制限される","有効な適用のために19の哲学的伝統の理解が必要","結論は暫定的なものであり、継続的な評価と調整が必要"],"ko":["최대 신뢰도는 61.8%로 제한됨","유효한 적용을 위해 19개의 철학적 전통의 이해가 필요","결론은 임시적인 것이므로 지속적인 평가와 조정이 필요"],"es":["Nivel de confianza máximo limitado al 61,8%","Requiere comprensión de 19 tradiciones filosóficas para una aplicación efectiva","Las conclusiones son provisionales, lo que requiere una evaluación y ajuste continuos"],"fr":["Niveau de confiance maximum limité à 61,8%","Nécessite une compréhension de 19 traditions philosophiques pour une application efficace","Les conclusions sont provisoires, ce qui nécessite une évaluation et un ajustement continus"],"de":["Maximales Vertrauensniveau auf 61,8% begrenzt","Benötigt ein Verständnis von 19 philosophischen Traditionen für eine effektive Anwendung","Die Schlussfolgerungen sind vorläufig, was eine kontinuierliche Bewertung und Anpassung erfordert"],"pt":["Nível de confiança máximo limitado a 61,8%","Exige compreensão de 19 tradições filosóficas para aplicação eficaz","Conclusões são provisórias, requerendo avaliação e ajuste contínuos"],"ru":["Максимальный уровень доверия ограничен 61,8%","Требует понимания 19 философских традиций для эффективного применения","Заключения являются предварительными, требуют постоянной оценки и корректировки"],"ar":["مستوى الثقة الأقصى محدد عند 61.8%","يتطلب فهمًا ل19 تقليدًا فلسفيًا للتطبيق الفعال","الاستنتاجات مؤقتة، تتطلب تقييمًا وضبطًا مستمرين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
