do Next.js ajudam a garantir a qualidade e a escalabilidade do seu código.","ru":"Лучшие практики Next.js помогают обеспечить качество и масштабируемость вашего кода.","ar":"تساعد أفضل الممارسات ل Next.js على ضمان جودة وأداء رمزك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["文件约定","RSC 边界检测","路由段检测","中间件重命名","异步客户端组件检测"],"ja":["ファイル規約","RSC 境界検出","ルート セグメント検出","ミドルウェアの名前変更","非同期クライアント コンポーネント検出"],"ko":["파일 규칙","RSC 경계 감지","경로 세그먼트 감지","미들웨어 이름 변경","비동기 클라이언트 컴포넌트 감지"],"es":["Convenciones de archivos y estructura de proyectos","Detección de patrones de componentes de servidor de React inválidos","Reglas para rutas y middleware","Condiciones para componentes de cliente asíncronos","Convenciones para nombres de middleware y proxy"],"fr":["Conventions de fichiers et structure de projets","Détection de modèles de composants de serveur React invalides","Règles pour les routes et les middleware","Conditions pour les composants de client asynchrones","Conventions pour les noms de middleware et de proxy"],"de":["Dateikonventionen und Projektstruktur","Erkennung ungültiger React-Server-Komponentenmuster","Regeln für Routen und Middleware","Bedingungen für asynchrone Client-Komponenten","Konventionen für Middleware- und Proxy-Namen"],"pt":["Convenções de arquivo","Limites de RSC","Detecção de componentes de cliente assíncronos","Renomeação de middleware","Estrutura de projeto e arquivos especiais","Rotas paralelas e interceptadoras"],"ru":["Конвенции файлов","Границы RSC","Обнаружение асинхронных клиентских компонентов","Переименование middleware","Структура проекта и специальные файлы","Параллельные и перехватывающие маршруты"],"ar":["اتفاقيات الملفات","حدود RSC","كشف المكونات العميلة غير المتزامنة","إعادة تسمية middleware","هيكل المشروع والملفات الخاصة","مسارات موازية ومتداخلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","最佳实践","文件约定","RSC 边界检测","路由段检测","中间件重命名"],"ja":["Next.js","ベストプラクティス","ファイル規約","RSC 境界検出","ルート セグメント検出","ミドルウェアの名前変更"],"ko":["Next.js","최적의 관행","파일 규칙","RSC 경계 감지","경로 세그먼트 감지","미들웨어 이름 변경"],"es":["Next.js","mejores prácticas","desarrollo web","React","componentes de servidor","rutas","middleware","optimización de código"],"fr":["Next.js","bonnes pratiques","développement web","React","composants de serveur","routes","middleware","optimisation de code"],"de":["Next.js","Best Practices","Webentwicklung","React","Server-Komponenten","Routen","Middleware","Code-Optimierung"],"pt":["Next.js","melhores práticas","desenvolvimento web","performance","escalabilidade","código de alta qualidade","convenções de arquivo","RSC","middleware"],"ru":["Next.js","лучшие практики","веб-разработка","производительность","масштабируемость","код высокого качества","конвенции файлов","RSC","middleware"],"ar":["Next.js","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير الويب","الأداء","التوسيع","رمز عالي الجودة","اتفاقيات الملفات","RSC","middleware"]}},"owner":"ElementsAI-Dev","repo":"Cognia","repoPath":"ElementsAI-Dev/Cognia","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"next-best-practices","description":"Next.js best practices - file conventions, RSC boundaries, data patterns, async APIs, metadata, error handling, route handlers, image/font optimization, bundling","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\nApply these rules when writing or reviewing Next.js code.\n\n## File Conventions\n\nSee [file-conventions.md](./file-conventions.md) for:\n- Project structure and special files\n- Route segments (dynamic, catch-all, groups)\n- Parallel and intercepting routes\n- Middleware rename in v16 (middleware → proxy)\n\n## RSC Boundaries\n\nDetect invalid React Server Component patterns.\n\nSee [rsc-boundaries.md](./rsc-boundaries.md) for:\n- Async client component detection (invalid)\n- Non-ser","body":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\nApply these rules when writing or reviewing Next.js code.\n\n## File Conventions\n\nSee [file-conventions.md](./file-conventions.md) for:\n- Project structure and special files\n- Route segments (dynamic, catch-all, groups)\n- Parallel and intercepting routes\n- Middleware rename in v16 (middleware → proxy)\n\n## RSC Boundaries\n\nDetect invalid React Server Component patterns.\n\nSee [rsc-boundaries.md](./rsc-boundaries.md) for:\n- Async client component detection (invalid)\n- Non-serializable props detection\n- Server Action exceptions\n\n## Async Patterns\n\nNext.js 15+ async API changes.\n\nSee [async-patterns.md](./async-patterns.md) for:\n- Async `params` and `searchParams`\n- Async `cookies()` and `headers()`\n- Migration codemod\n\n## Runtime Selection\n\nSee [runtime-selection.md](./runtime-selection.md) for:\n- Default to Node.js runtime\n- When Edge runtime is appropriate\n\n## Directives\n\nSee [directives.md](./directives.md) for:\n- `''use client''`, `''use server''` (React)\n- `''use cache''` (Next.js)\n\n## Functions\n\nSee [functions.md](./functions.md) for:\n- Navigation hooks: `useRouter`, `usePathname`, `useSearchParams`, `useParams`\n- Server functions: `cookies`, `headers`, `draftMode`, `after`\n- Generate functions: `generateStaticParams`, `generateMetadata`\n\n## Error Handling\n\nSee [error-handling.md](./error-handling.md) for:\n- `error.tsx`, `global-error.tsx`, `not-found.tsx`\n- `redirect`, `permanentRedirect`, `notFound`\n- `forbidden`, `unauthorized` (auth errors)\n- `unstable_rethrow` for catch blocks\n\n## Data Patterns\n\nSee [data-patterns.md](./data-patterns.md) for:\n- Server Components vs Server Actions vs Route Handlers\n- Avoiding data waterfalls (`Promise.all`, Suspense, preload)\n- Client component data fetching\n\n## Route Handlers\n\nSee [route-handlers.md](./route-handlers.md) for:\n- `route.ts` basics\n- GET handler conflicts with `page.tsx`\n- Environment behavior (no React DOM)\n- When to use vs Server Actions\n\n## Metadata & OG Images\n\nSee [metadata.md](./metadata.md) for:\n- Static and dynamic metadata\n- `generateMetadata` function\n- OG image generation with `next/og`\n- File-based metadata conventions\n\n## Image Optimization\n\nSee [image.md](./image.md) for:\n- Always use `next/image` over `<img>`\n- Remote images configuration\n- Responsive `sizes` attribute\n- Blur placeholders\n- Priority loading for LCP\n\n## Font Optimization\n\nSee [font.md](./font.md) for:\n- `next/font` setup\n- Google Fonts, local fonts\n- Tailwind CSS integration\n- Preloading subsets\n\n## Bundling\n\nSee [bundling.md](./bundling.md) for:\n- Server-incompatible packages\n- CSS imports (not link tags)\n- Polyfills (already included)\n- ESM/CommonJS issues\n- Bundle analysis\n\n## Scripts\n\nSee [scripts.md](./scripts.md) for:\n- `next/script` vs native script tags\n- Inline scripts need `id`\n- Loading strategies\n- Google Analytics with `@next/third-parties`\n\n## Hydration Errors\n\nSee [hydration-error.md](./hydration-error.md) for:\n- Common causes (browser APIs, dates, invalid HTML)\n- Debugging with error overlay\n- Fixes for each cause\n\n## Suspense Boundaries\n\nSee [suspense-boundaries.md](./suspense-boundaries.md) for:\n- CSR bailout with `useSearchParams` and `usePathname`\n- Which hooks require Suspense boundaries\n\n## Parallel & Intercepting Routes\n\nSee [parallel-routes.md](./parallel-routes.md) for:\n- Modal patterns with `@slot` and `(.)` interceptors\n- `default.tsx` for fallbacks\n- Closing modals correctly with `router.back()`\n\n## Self-Hosting\n\nSee [self-hosting.md](./self-hosting.md) for:\n- `output: ''standalone''` for Docker\n- Cache handlers for multi-instance ISR\n- What works vs needs extra setup\n\n## Debug Tricks\n\nSee [debug-tricks.md](./debug-tricks.md) for:\n- MCP endpoint for AI-assisted debugging\n- Rebuild specific routes with `--debug-build-paths`\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:44:28.864Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Next.js development capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Next.js 开发能力的前端代理。","ja":"Next.js の高度な開発機能を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Next.js 개발 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합