tarterkit.starterkit.yml und README.md","Begrenzt auf Drupal 8-10-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos arquivos package.json, brainsum_starterkit.info.yml, brainsum_starterkit.starterkit.yml e README.md","Limitado a ambientes Drupal 8-10"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам package.json, brainsum_starterkit.info.yml, brainsum_starterkit.starterkit.yml и README.md","Ограничен средами Drupal 8-10"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الملفات package.json و brainsum_starterkit.info.yml و brainsum_starterkit.starterkit.yml و README.md","محدود ببيئات Drupal 8-10"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
