y equipos a simplificar su vida diaria y aumentar su eficiencia.","fr":"Wakti est une plateforme de productivité et d''organisation qui aide les individus et les équipes à simplifier leur vie quotidienne et à améliorer leur effica...","de":"Wakti ist eine Plattform für Produktivität und Organisation, die Einzelpersonen und Teams hilft, ihr tägliches Leben zu vereinfachen und ihre Effizienz zu st...","pt":"Wakti é uma ferramenta de produtividade que visa empoderar indivíduos e equipes, simplificando a vida diária e removendo barreiras para a criatividade e comu...","ru":"Wakti - это инструмент для управления временем, целью которого является расширение возможностей людей и команд, упрощение повседневной жизни и устранение бар...","ar":"واكتي هي أداة لتحسين الإنتاجية تهدف إلى تمكين الأفراد والفرق، وتسهيل الحياة اليومية، وإزالة الحواجز أمام الإبداع والتواصل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["","","",""],"ja":["","","",""],"ko":["","","",""],"es":["Organización y planificación","Herramientas de productividad","Conexión y colaboración","Aprendizaje y creación","Integración con Supabase"],"fr":["Organisation et planification","Outils de productivité","Connexion et collaboration","Apprentissage et création","Intégration avec Supabase"],"de":["Organisation und Planung","Produktivitätstools","Vernetzung und Zusammenarbeit","Lernen und Erstellen","Integration mit Supabase"],"pt":["Otimização de produtividade","Simplificação da vida diária","Remoção de barreiras para criatividade e comunicação","Organização e aprendizado","Conexão e criação"],"ru":["Управление временем","Упрощение повседневной жизни","Удаление барьеров для творчества и общения","Организация и обучение","Связь и создание"],"ar":["تحسين الإنتاجية","تسهيل الحياة اليومية","إزالة الحواجز أمام الإبداع والتواصل","التنظيم والتعلم","التواصل والإبداع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Wakti","","","","",""],"ja":["Wakti","","","","",""],"ko":["Wakti","","","","",""],"es":["productividad","organización","herramientas de productividad","colaboración","aprendizaje","creación","Supabase","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de la información"],"fr":["productivité","organisation","outils de productivité","collaboration","apprentissage","création","Supabase","développement de logiciels","technologies de l''information"],"de":["Produktivität","Organisation","Produktivitätstools","Zusammenarbeit","Lernen","Erstellen","Supabase","Softwareentwicklung","Informationstechnologie"],"pt":["produtividade","otimização","ferramenta de produtividade","gestão de tempo","organização","aprendizado","conexão","criação"],"ru":["управление временем","продуктивность","инструмент для управления временем","упрощение повседневной жизни","организация","обучение","связь","создание"],"ar":["تحسين الإنتاجية","أداة لتحسين الإنتاجية","إدارة الوقت","التنظيم","التعلم","التواصل","الإبداع","المنصة الرقمية"]}},"owner":"alfadlyqtr","repo":"wakti-bilingual-assistant","repoPath":"alfadlyqtr/wakti-bilingual-assistant","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wakti","description":"Global project rules, identity, platform constraints, PM authority, and mandatory design system for the Wakti AI app.","bodyPreview":"# =========================\n# PROJECT IDENTITY\n# =========================\nProject Name: Wakti\nApp Name: Wakti AI\n\nSupabase:\n  Project ID: hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf\n  Project URL: https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co\n\nCore Purpose:\n  - Empower individuals and teams\n  - Simplify daily life\n  - Boost productivity\n  - Remove barriers to creativity and communication\n\nWakti is a trusted digital partner for organizing, learning, connecting, and creating.\n\n# =========================\n# PLATFORM & WRAPPI","body":"# =========================\n# PROJECT IDENTITY\n# =========================\nProject Name: Wakti\nApp Name: Wakti AI\n\nSupabase:\n  Project ID: hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf\n  Project URL: https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co\n\nCore Purpose:\n  - Empower individuals and teams\n  - Simplify daily life\n  - Boost productivity\n  - Remove barriers to creativity and communication\n\nWakti is a trusted digital partner for organizing, learning, connecting, and creating.\n\n# =========================\n# PLATFORM & WRAPPING RULES\n# =========================\nDeployment:\n  Frontend: Vercel\n  Backend: Supabase\n  Dev Environment: Windsurf (VS Code)\n\nBackend Rules:\n  - Always use MCP or CLI\n  - Never touch Supabase directly outside MCP\n  - Even inside MCP, ask for confirmation before changes (view-only allowed)\n\nNatively:\n  Role: Mobile wrapper and publisher\n  Wraps: Wakti web app via SDK\n  Publishes: iOS and Android apps\n  Integrations:\n    - RevenueCat (subscriptions / IAP)\n    - OneSignal (push notifications)\n\nTerminology:\n  \"the app\": Wakti web app + Supabase backend\n  \"the wrapper / native shell\": Natively layer only\n\n# =========================\n# MISSION & PRODUCT VISION\n# =========================\nMission:\n  Wakti is the ultimate productivity AI app — built to simplify life, boost creativity, and make technology feel human.\n\nCore Capabilities:\n  - Shareable smart tasks and subtasks\n  - Real-time progress tracking\n  - Events with live RSVP\n  - Voice recording with transcription and summaries\n  - Voice cloning and translation (60+ languages)\n  - AI chat, smart search, text, image, and video generation\n\nEnd Goal:\n  Become the most trusted, loved, and indispensable AI app.\n\n# =========================\n# ABSOLUTE COMMAND RULE\n# =========================\nMOST IMPORTANT RULE:\n  - Always do exactly as the user instructs\n  - No assumptions\n  - No silent changes\n  - No extra features unless explicitly approved\n\n# =========================\n# COMMUNICATION RULES\n# =========================\nCommunication:\n  - Plain English only\n  - Assume non-technical user\n  - Avoid jargon\n  - Human, friendly, professional tone\n\n# =========================\n# PROJECT MANAGER MODE\n# =========================\nPM Mode:\n  - Act as project manager at all times\n  - Protect scope\n  - Guide decisions\n  - Care about correctness and quality\n\n# =========================\n# APPROVAL & OVERRIDES\n# =========================\nApproval Flow:\n  Default: Do nothing without explicit approval\n  \"OK, proceed\": Proceed immediately\n  \"It''s ok to proceed\": Proceed immediately without reconfirmation\n\nPM Exception:\n  - If a better or simpler approach exists:\n      1. Explain why\n      2. Recommend alternative\n      3. Wait for approval\n\n# =========================\n# SCOPE DISCIPLINE\n# =========================\nScope Rules:\n  - Never touch anything outside the requested scope\n  - Never modify DONE or LOCKED items\n  - Changes only with explicit approval\n\n# =========================\n# DEBUGGING & AUDITS\n# =========================\nDebugging:\n  - Investigate first\n  - Understand root cause\n  - No guessing\n  - Explain clearly before proposing fixes\n\nAudit Mode:\n  Trigger Phrases:\n    - \"This is an audit\"\n    - \"Investigate and report back\"\n  Behavior:\n    - No fixes\n    - No suggestions\n    - Findings and root cause only\n\n# =========================\n# TIME & DECISION MANAGEMENT\n# =========================\nTime Management:\n  - If stuck or wasting time, say it honestly\n  - Suggest simplification, workaround, or dropping feature\n  - Explain pros and cons\n  - Recommend best path\n  - Wait for approval\n\nOptions Rule:\n  - Provide multiple options when possible\n  - Include pros, cons, and recommendation\n  - Wait for confirmation\n\n# =========================\n# CONFIRMATION REQUIREMENTS\n# =========================\nMandatory Confirmation:\n  - No fixes without approval\n  - No backend changes without approval\n  - No UI changes without approval\n\n# =========================\n# SECURITY & SECRETS\n# =========================\nSecurity:\n  - Never expose service role keys or JWT secrets\n  - Secrets allowed only in secure server-side environments\n    - Supabase Edge Functions\n    - Backend APIs\n\n# =========================\n# BEHAVIOR & TONE\n# =========================\nTone:\n  - Buddy-like\n  - Human\n  - Calm\n  - Professional\n  - Never robotic\n\nRead First Rule:\n  - Always read carefully\n  - Always confirm understanding before acting\n\nFeature Isolation:\n  - Never mix features\n  - Never mix files\n\n# =========================\n# WAKTI DESIGN SYSTEM (MANDATORY)\n# =========================\n\nTheme Colors:\n\nDark Mode:\n  Background: \"#0c0f14\"\n  Secondary: \"#606062\"\n  Tertiary: \"#858384\"\n  Text: \"#f2f2f2\"\n\nLight Mode:\n  Background: \"#fcfefd\"\n  Primary: \"#060541\"\n  Secondary: \"#e9ceb0\"\n\nAccent Colors (HSL):\n  Blue: \"210 100% 65%\"\n  Green: \"142 76% 55%\"\n  Orange: \"25 95% 60%\"\n  Purple: \"280 70% 65%\"\n  Pink: \"320 75% 70%\"\n  Cyan: \"180 85% 60%\"\n  Amber: \"45 100% 60%\"\n  Emerald: \"160 80% 55%\"\n\nGradients:\n  Light Primary: \"#060541 → hsl(260 70% 25%) → #060541\"\n  Light Secondary: \"#e9ceb0 → hsl(45 80% 75%) → #e9ceb0\"\n  Dark Card: \"#0c0f14 → hsl(235 25% 8%) → #0c0f14\"\n  Dark Vibrant: \"hsl(210 100% 60%) → hsl(280 70% 65%) → hsl(25 95% 60%)\"\n\nGlows & Shadows:\n  Primary Glow: \"0 0 40px hsla(210,100%,65%,0.5)\"\n  Soft Shadow: \"0 2px 20px hsla(0,0%,0%,0.5)\"\n\nLayout Variables:\n  Border Radius: \"0.75rem\"\n  Mobile Header Height: \"64px + safe-area-inset\"\n  Bottom Tabs Height: \"64px + safe-area-inset\"\n  Desktop Sidebar Expanded: \"220px\"\n  Desktop Sidebar Mini: \"70px\"\n  Tablet Sidebar Expanded: \"180px\"\n  Tablet Sidebar Mini: \"60px\"\n\nTypography:\n  English: \"System UI\"\n  Arabic: \"Noto Sans Arabic, Segoe UI, Tahoma, Arial\"\n  RTL Support: true\n\nDesign Principles:\n  - Mobile-first\n  - Arabic (RTL) and English (LTR)\n  - Dark and Light themes\n  - Touch-friendly\n  - Safe-area aware\n\nKey CSS Classes:\n  - .mobile-container\n  - .enhanced-card\n  - .btn-enhanced\n  - .floating-nav\n  - .status-success\n  - .status-warning\n  - .status-info\n  - .status-error\n  - .solid-bg\n  - .rtl\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:45:05.821Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT seeking to integrate with Supabase for enhanced project management and team collaboration capabilities.","zh":"适合像Cursor和AutoGPT这样的AI代理，旨在与Supabase集成，以增强项目管理和团队协作功能。","ja":"CursorやAutoGPTのようなAIエージェントがSupabaseと統合してプロジェクト管理とチームコラボレーション機能を強化するために最適です。","ko":"Cursor와 AutoGPT 같은 AI 에이전트가 Supabase와 통합하여 프로젝트 관리 및 팀 협업 기능을 강화하기에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor y AutoGPT que buscan integrarse con Supabase para mejorar las capacidades de gestión de proyectos y colaboración en equipo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor et AutoGPT cherchant à s''intégrer à Supabase pour améliorer les capacités de gestion de projet et de collaboration d''équipe.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten wie Cursor und AutoGPT, die sich in Supabase integrieren möchten, um die Projektmanagement- und Teamkollaborationsfunktionen zu erweitern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor e AutoGPT que buscam integrar-se com o Supabase para melhorar as capacidades de gerenciamento de projetos e colaboração em equipe.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor и AutoGPT, стремящихся интегрироваться с Supabase для улучшения возможностей управления проектами и командного сотрудничества.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Cursor و AutoGPT التي تسعى إلى الاندماج مع Supabase لتحسين إمكانيات إدارة المشاريع والتعاون الفريق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline daily life by organizing tasks, learning materials, and creative projects, leveraging Supabase''s robust database capabilities and secure project URLs like https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co, thereby boosting productivity and removing barriers to creativity and communication.","zh":"赋予代理人通过组织任务、学习材料和创意项目来简化日常生活的能力，利用Supabase强大的数据库功能和安全的项目URL（如https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co），从而提高生产力并消除创造力和沟通的障碍。","ja":"エージェントにタスク、学習資料、創造的プロジェクトを整理することで日常生活を合理化する能力を付与し、Supabaseの強力なデータベース機能と安全なプロジェクトURL（例：https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co）を利用して、生産性を高め、創造性とコミュニケーションの障壁を除去します。","ko":"에이전트가 작업, 학습 자료, 창의적 프로젝트를 구성하여 일상 생활을 합리화 할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 Supabase의 강력한 데이터베이스 기능과 안전한 프로젝트 URL(예: https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co)을 활용하여 생산성을 높이고 창의성 및 커뮤니케이션의 장벽을 제거합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar la vida diaria organizando tareas, materiales de aprendizaje y proyectos creativos, aprovechando las robustas capacidades de base de datos de Supabase y las URL de proyecto seguras como https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co, lo que mejora la productividad y elimina las barreras para la creatividad y la comunicación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser la vie quotidienne en organisant les tâches, les matériaux d''apprentissage et les projets créatifs, en exploitant les capacités robustes de base de données de Supabase et les URL de projet sécurisées comme https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co, ce qui améliore la productivité et supprime les obstacles à la créativité et à la communication.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Alltag zu optimieren, indem sie Aufgaben, Lernmaterialien und kreative Projekte organisieren, die robusten Datenbankfunktionen von Supabase und sichere Projekt-URLs wie https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co nutzen, wodurch die Produktivität gesteigert und Hindernisse für Kreativität und Kommunikation beseitigt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar a vida diária, organizando tarefas, materiais de aprendizado e projetos criativos, aproveitando as capacidades robustas do banco de dados do Supabase e URLs de projeto seguras, como https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co, aumentando assim a produtividade e removendo barreiras para a criatividade e comunicação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать повседневную жизнь, организуя задачи, учебные материалы и творческие проекты, используя мощные возможности базы данных Supabase и безопасные URL-адреса проектов, такие как https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co, тем самым повышая производительность и удаляя барьеры для творчества и общения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحسين الحياة اليومية من خلال تنظيم المهام والمواد التعليمية والمشاريع الإبداعية، مستفيداً من قدرات قاعدة بيانات Supabase القوية والرابطات الآمنة للمشروع مثل https://hxauxozopvpzpdygoqwf.supabase.co، وبالتالي تعزيز الإنتاجية وازالة الحواجز أمام الإبداع والتواصل"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task assignments and project tracking within Supabase","Generating learning pathways for team members","Enhancing team communication through integrated collaboration tools"],"zh":["在Supabase中自动化任务分配和项目跟踪","为团队成员生成学习路径","通过集成的协作工具增强团队沟通"],"ja":["Supabase内でのタスク割り当てとプロジェクト追跡の自動化","チームメンバーのための学習パスの生成","統合されたコラボレーションツールを通じたチームコミュニケーションの強化"],"ko":["Supabase 내에서 작업 할당 및 프로젝트 추적 자동화","팀 멤버를 위한 학습 경로 생성","통합된 협업 도구를 통한 팀 커뮤니케이션 강화"],"es":["Automatizar la asignación de tareas y el seguimiento de proyectos dentro de Supabase","Generar trayectorias de aprendizaje para los miembros del equipo","Mejorar la comunicación del equipo a través de herramientas de colaboración integradas"],"fr":["Automatiser l''attribution de tâches et le suivi de projets au sein de Supabase","Générer des parcours d''apprentissage pour les membres de l''équipe","Améliorer la communication de l''équipe via des outils de collaboration intégrés"],"de":["Automatisieren der Aufgabenvergabe und der Projektverfolgung innerhalb von Supabase","Erstellen von Lernpfaden für die Teammitglieder","Verbessern der Teamkommunikation durch integrierte Kollaborationstools"],"pt":["Automatizar a atribuição de tarefas e o acompanhamento de projetos dentro do Supabase","Gerar caminhos de aprendizado para membros da equipe","Melhorar a comunicação da equipe por meio de ferramentas de colaboração integradas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать назначение задач и отслеживание проектов внутри Supabase","Генерировать пути обучения для членов команды","Улучшать командную коммуникацию посредством интегрированных инструментов сотрудничества"],"ar":["توفيرتumbnails المهام وتتبع المشاريع داخل Supabase","إنشاء مسارات تعليمية لأعضاء الفريق","تحسين اتصالات الفريق من خلال أدوات التعاون المدمجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Supabase project ID and URL for integration","Dependent on Supabase''s database and security features"],"zh":["需要Supabase项目ID和URL进行集成","依赖于Supabase的数据库和安全功能"],"ja":["SupabaseプロジェクトIDとURLが統合に必要","Supabaseのデータベースとセキュリティ機能に依存"],"ko":["Supabase 프로젝트 ID 및 URL이 통합에 필요","Supabase의 데이터베이스 및 보안 기능에 의존"],"es":["Requiere el ID de proyecto y la URL de Supabase para la integración","Depende de las características de base de datos y seguridad de Supabase"],"fr":["Nécessite l''ID de projet et l''URL de Supabase pour l''intégration","Dépend des fonctionnalités de base de données et de sécurité de Supabase"],"de":["Benötigt die Projekt-ID und die URL von Supabase für die Integration","Hängt von den Datenbank- und Sicherheitsfunktionen von Supabase ab"],"pt":["Requer ID do projeto Supabase e URL para integração","Dependente das funcionalidades de banco de dados e segurança do Supabase"],"ru":["Требует ID проекта Supabase и URL для интеграции","Зависит от возможностей базы данных и функций безопасности Supabase"],"ar":["يتطلب معرف مشروع Supabase و الرابط للاندماج","يعتمد على خصائص قاعدة البيانات و ميزات الأمان في Supabase"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
