dad con múltiples países y monedas"],"fr":["Génération de numéros de compte spécifiques au pays","Attribution de devise multiple","Préservation des zéros initiaux dans les numéros de compte","Garantie d''unicité dans tous les comptes","Compatibilité avec de multiples pays et devises"],"de":["Generierung von länderspezifischen Kontonummern","Zuweisung von Mehrwährungen","Erhaltung von führenden Nullen in Kontonummern","Gewährleistung der Eindeutigkeit in allen Konten","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Ländern und Währungen"],"pt":["Geração automática de números de conta","Atribuição de moeda primária com base na localização do usuário","Suporte a múltiplas moedas","Preservação de zeros à esquerda nos números de conta","Garantia de unicidade de números de conta"],"ru":["Автоматическая генерация номеров счетов","Назначение основной валюты на основе местоположения пользователя","Поддержка нескольких валют","Сохранение ведущих нулей в номерах счетов","Гарантия уникальности номеров счетов"],"ar":["توليد أوتوماتيكي لأرقام الحساب","تعيين العملة الأساسية بناءً على موقع المستخدم","دعم العملات المتعددة","الحفاظ على الأصفار الزائدة في أرقام الحساب","ضمان فريدية أرقام الحساب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["标准渣打银行平台技能","自动生成账号","多币种分配","账号唯一性","银行业务自动化","银行平台开发","金融技术解决方案"],"ja":["スタンダードチャータード銀行プラットフォームスキル","アカウント番号自動生成","マルチカレンシー割り当て","アカウントユニーク性","銀行業務自動化","銀行プラットフォーム開発","金融技術ソリューション"],"ko":["스탠다드차타드은행 플랫폼 스킬","계좌번호 자동 생성","다중 통화 할당","계좌 유일성","은행 업무 자동화","은행 플랫폼 개발","금융 기술 솔루션"],"es":["plataforma bancaria","desarrollo de aplicaciones","generación de números de cuenta","asignación de moneda múltiple","banca en línea","tecnologías financieras"],"fr":["plateforme bancaire","développement d''applications","génération de numéros de compte","attribution de devise multiple","banque en ligne","technologies financières"],"de":["Banking-Plattform","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Kontonummern-Generierung","Mehrwährungs-Zuweisung","Online-Banking","Finanztechnologien"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de skills de banco","geração de números de conta","atribuição de moeda","suporte a múltiplas moedas","preservação de zeros à esquerda","garantia de unicidade de números de conta"],"ru":["разработка банковских навыков","генерация номеров счетов","назначение валюты","поддержка нескольких валют","сохранение ведущих нулей","гарантия уникальности номеров счетов"],"ar":["تطوير مهارات البنوك","توليد أرقام الحساب","تعيين العملة","دعم العملات المتعددة","الحفاظ على الأصفار الزائدة","ضمان فريدية أرقام الحساب"]}},"owner":"SIRI-bit-tech","repo":"Standard-Chartered-","repoPath":"SIRI-bit-tech/Standard-Chartered-","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skills","description":"A brief description, shown to the model to help it understand when to use this skill","bodyPreview":"Instructions for the skill go here. Provide relative paths to other resources in the skill directory as needed.\n\nSKILLS\n\nStandard Chartered Banking Platform Skills\n\nAccount Number Generation: Automatically generate country-specific account numbers with correct digit lengths (SG: 10, HK: 12, US: 12, GB: 8, KE: 13, IN: 14, UAE: 14, etc.). Store as String to preserve leading zeros. Ensure uniqueness across all accounts.\nMulti-Currency Assignment: Assign primary currency based on user''s selected cou","body":"Instructions for the skill go here. Provide relative paths to other resources in the skill directory as needed.\n\nSKILLS\n\nStandard Chartered Banking Platform Skills\n\nAccount Number Generation: Automatically generate country-specific account numbers with correct digit lengths (SG: 10, HK: 12, US: 12, GB: 8, KE: 13, IN: 14, UAE: 14, etc.). Store as String to preserve leading zeros. Ensure uniqueness across all accounts.\nMulti-Currency Assignment: Assign primary currency based on user''s selected country during registration (US→USD, GB→GBP, EU→EUR, KW→KWD, AE→AED, SG→SGD, HK→HKD, IN→INR, NG→NGN, ZA→ZAR, KE→KES). Allow users to open additional accounts in other supported currencies.\nTransfer Processing: Handle internal transfers (instant, $0 fee), domestic transfers (instant, $0 fee, limits by tier), international wires (1-3 days, SWIFT, fees and exchange markup by tier), ACH transfers (1-3 days, US only), and wire transfers (same day, domestic). Validate beneficiary details, enforce daily limits, generate receipts.\nReal-time Notifications via Ably: Publish events to Ably channels (user:{user_id}, account:{account_id}, transfers:{user_id}) for balance updates, transaction posts, transfer completions/failures, security alerts, loan approvals. Frontend subscribes to channels and displays toast notifications.\nLoan Application Processing: Support personal loans ($1K-$50K, 12-60 months), auto loans ($5K-$100K, 24-72 months), mortgages ($50K-$1M, 15-30 years), balance transfers (0% for 12 months), and tax season loans ($500-$5K, 3-6 months). Calculate monthly payments, generate amortization schedules, process approvals based on tier (instant for Premium pre-qualified amounts).\nCryptocurrency Operations: Support BTC, ETH, USDT, USDC trading. Buy crypto with fiat from checking/savings accounts, sell crypto to fiat accounts, transfer to external wallets, receive from external wallets. Real-time price updates every 30 seconds. Trading fees: 2% (Standard), 1% (Priority), 0% (Premium).\nDocument Generation: Generate monthly account statements (PDF), tax documents (1099-INT, 1099-MISC, 1098), transaction receipts, loan schedules. Store securely in Cloudinary with authenticated URLs and watermarks. Enable eStatements for paperless delivery.\nSession Management: Implement 15-minute session timeout with warning at 13 minutes. Store sessions in Redis with TTL. Track device fingerprints, IP addresses, locations. Require device authorization for new devices or different countries. Send email alerts for new device logins.\nTier-Based Features: Standard tier (basic features, standard fees/rates), Priority tier (50% reduced fees, better exchange rates, live chat support, relationship manager), Premium tier (zero fees, best rates, instant loan approval, concierge services, SMS notifications).\nAudit Logging: Log all state-changing operations (user_id, action, entity_type, entity_id, old_values, new_values, IP, user_agent, timestamp) to audit_logs table. Retain for 7 years for regulatory compliance."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:45:37.413Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Agents needing automated account management and multi-currency support.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化账户管理和多币种支持的金融代理。","ja":"金融代理が自動化されたアカウント管理と複数の通貨をサポートする必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 계정 관리 및 다중 통화 지원이 필요한 금융 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Financieros que necesitan gestión de cuentas automatizada y soporte de varias monedas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents financiers ayant besoin d''une gestion de comptes automatisée et d''un support multidevises.","de":"Perfekt für Finanzagenten, die eine automatisierte Kontenverwaltung und eine Mehrwährungsunterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Financial Agents needing automated account management and multi-currency support.","ru":"Perfect for Financial Agents needing automated account management and multi-currency support.","ar":"Perfect for Financial Agents needing automated account management and multi-currency support."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate unique country-specific account numbers and assign primary currencies based on user-selected countries, utilizing string storage to preserve leading zeros and ensuring uniqueness across all accounts.","zh":"赋予代理人生成唯一的国家特定账号并根据用户选择的国家分配主要货币的能力，利用字符串存储来保存前导零并确保所有账户的唯一性。","ja":"ユーザーが選択した国に基づいて、国ごとに固有のアカウント番号を生成し、主要通貨を割り当てるエージェントの能力を提供し、文字列ストレージを使用して先頭のゼロを保存し、アカウント全体で一意性を保証します。","ko":"사용자가 선택한 국가를 기반으로 고유한 국가별 계정 번호를 생성하고 주요 통화를 할당하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 문자열 저장소를 사용하여 선두 자릿수를 보존하고 모든 계정에서 고유성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar números de cuenta únicos específicos de cada país y asignar monedas principales en función de los países seleccionados por el usuario, utilizando el almacenamiento de cadenas para preservar los ceros iniciales y garantizar la unicidad en todas las cuentas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des numéros de compte uniques spécifiques à chaque pays et d''attribuer des devises principales en fonction des pays sélectionnés par l''utilisateur, en utilisant le stockage de chaînes pour préserver les zéros initiaux et en assurant l''unicité de tous les comptes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, eindeutige länderspezifische Kontonummern zu generieren und primäre Währungen basierend auf den vom Benutzer ausgewählten Ländern zuzuweisen, indem sie die Zeichenfolgen-Speicherung verwenden, um führende Nullen zu erhalten und die Eindeutigkeit über alle Konten hinweg sicherzustellen.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate unique country-specific account numbers and assign primary currencies based on user-selected countries, utilizing string storage to preserve leading zeros and ensuring uniqueness across all accounts.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate unique country-specific account numbers and assign primary currencies based on user-selected countries, utilizing string storage to preserve leading zeros and ensuring uniqueness across all accounts.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate unique country-specific account numbers and assign primary currencies based on user-selected countries, utilizing string storage to preserve leading zeros and ensuring uniqueness across all accounts."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating account number generation for various countries","Assigning primary currencies based on user preferences","Ensuring unique account numbers across multiple regions"],"zh":["为各个国家自动化生成账号","根据用户偏好分配主要货币","确保跨多个地区的账号唯一性"],"ja":["各国のアカウント番号を自動生成する","ユーザーの選択に基づいて主要通貨を割り当てる","複数の地域全体でアカウント番号の一意性を確保する"],"ko":["각 국가의 계정 번호를 자동으로 생성하는 것","사용자의 선택을 기반으로 주요 통화를 할당하는 것","여러 지역에서 계정 번호의 고유성을 보장하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de números de cuenta para varios países","Asignación de monedas principales en función de las preferencias del usuario","Garantizar números de cuenta únicos en varias regiones"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de numéros de compte pour différents pays","Attribution de devises principales en fonction des préférences de l''utilisateur","Assurer l''unicité des numéros de compte dans plusieurs régions"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Kontonummern für verschiedene Länder","Zuweisung von Hauptwährungen basierend auf den Benutzervorlieben","Sicherstellung eindeutiger Kontonummern in mehreren Regionen"],"pt":["Automating account number generation for various countries","Assigning primary currencies based on user preferences","Ensuring unique account numbers across multiple regions"],"ru":["Automating account number generation for various countries","Assigning primary currencies based on user preferences","Ensuring unique account numbers across multiple regions"],"ar":["Automating account number generation for various countries","Assigning primary currencies based on user preferences","Ensuring unique account numbers across multiple regions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of country-specific account number formats","Limited to specified countries (SG, HK, US, GB, KE, IN, UAE)"],"zh":["需要了解国家特定账号格式的知识","仅限于指定国家（SG, HK, US, GB, KE, IN, UAE）"],"ja":["国ごとに固有のアカウント番号形式に関する知識が必要","指定された国（SG, HK, US, GB, KE, IN, UAE）のみに限定"],"ko":["국가별 계정 번호 형식에 대한 지식이 필요","지정된 국가(SG, HK, US, GB, KE, IN, UAE)のみ로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los formatos de números de cuenta específicos de cada país","Limitado a países especificados (SG, HK, US, GB, KE, IN, UAE)"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des formats de numéros de compte spécifiques à chaque pays","Limité aux pays spécifiés (SG, HK, US, GB, KE, IN, UAE)"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der länderspezifischen Kontonummernformate","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Länder (SG, HK, US, GB, KE, IN, UAE)"],"pt":["Requires knowledge of country-specific account number formats","Limited to specified countries (SG, HK, US, GB, KE, IN, UAE)"],"ru":["Requires knowledge of country-specific account number formats","Limited to specified countries (SG, HK, US, GB, KE, IN, UAE)"],"ar":["Requires knowledge of country-specific account number formats","Limited to specified countries (SG, HK, US, GB, KE, IN, UAE)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
