"],"de":["Beste Praktiken für Pipelines für kontinuierliche Integration und Lieferung","Optimierung von Build- und Deployment-Prozessen","Integration mit GitHub Actions und GitLab CI","Code-Analyse und Unit-Tests","Automatisierung von Entwicklungs- und Lieferaufgaben","Überwachung und Verfolgung der Software-Qualität"],"pt":["Melhores práticas para pipelines de CI/CD","Integração com GitHub Actions e GitLab CI","Otimização de processos de build e deploy","Análise estática e testes unitários","Controle de qualidade do código","Escalabilidade e flexibilidade"],"ru":["Лучшие практики для конвейеров CI/CD","Интеграция с GitHub Actions и GitLab CI","Оптимизация процессов сборки и развертывания","Статический анализ и модульные тесты","Контроль качества кода","Масштабируемость и гибкость"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات للأنابيب CI/CD","التكامل مع جيت هاب أكشنز وجيت لاب سي آي","تحسين عمليات البناء والنشر","التحليل الثابت والاختبارات الوحدوية","مراقبة جودة Код","التوسع والتكيف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DevOps CI/CD","GitHub Actions","GitLab CI","CI/CD ","DevOps","CI/CD","Automated Testing","Continuous Integration","Continuous Deployment"],"ja":["DevOps CI/CD","GitHub Actions","GitLab CI","CI/CD ","DevOps","CI/CD","Automated Testing","Continuous Integration","Continuous Deployment"],"ko":["DevOps CI/CD","GitHub Actions","GitLab CI"," CI/CD ","DevOps","CI/CD","Automated Testing","Continuous Integration","Continuous Deployment"],"es":["DevOps","CI/CD","pipelines de integración","entrega continua","GitHub Actions","GitLab CI","análisis de código","pruebas unitarias","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["DevOps","CI/CD","pipelines d''intégration","livraison continue","GitHub Actions","GitLab CI","analyse de code","tests unitaires","automatisation des tâches"],"de":["DevOps","CI/CD","Pipelines für kontinuierliche Integration","kontinuierliche Lieferung","GitHub Actions","GitLab CI","Code-Analyse","Unit-Tests","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["DevOps","CI/CD","pipelines","GitHub Actions","GitLab CI","otimização de processos","análise estática","testes unitários","controle de qualidade"],"ru":["DevOps","CI/CD","конвейеры","GitHub Actions","GitLab CI","оптимизация процессов","статический анализ","модульные тесты","контроль качества"],"ar":["ديفوبس","سي/سي دي","الأنابيب","جيت هاب أكشنز","جيت لاب سي آي","تحسين العمليات","التحليل الثابت","الاختبارات الوحدوية","مراقبة الجودة"]}},"owner":"teodevlor","repo":"agent-kit-skill","repoPath":"teodevlor/agent-kit-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.503Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"devops-cicd","description":"CI/CD pipeline best practices for GitHub Actions and GitLab CI. Use when setting up or modifying CI/CD pipelines.","bodyPreview":"# DevOps CI/CD Standards\n\nThis skill provides CI/CD pipeline best practices.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when creating GitHub Actions workflows\n- Use this skill when setting up GitLab CI pipelines\n- Use this skill when optimizing build/deploy processes\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Pipeline Stages\n\nThe pipeline must follow this strict order:\n1. **Lint & Static Analysis:** Fail fast if code style violates rules.\n2. **Test:** Run Unit Tests. (Block merge if failed).\n3. **Build:** Verify the applic","body":"# DevOps CI/CD Standards\n\nThis skill provides CI/CD pipeline best practices.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when creating GitHub Actions workflows\n- Use this skill when setting up GitLab CI pipelines\n- Use this skill when optimizing build/deploy processes\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Pipeline Stages\n\nThe pipeline must follow this strict order:\n1. **Lint & Static Analysis:** Fail fast if code style violates rules.\n2. **Test:** Run Unit Tests. (Block merge if failed).\n3. **Build:** Verify the application builds successfully.\n4. **Deploy (CD):** Only on `main` or `develop` branches.\n\n### 2. GitHub Actions Example\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/ci.yml\nname: CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main, develop]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main, develop]\n\nenv:\n  NODE_VERSION: ''20''\n\njobs:\n  lint:\n    name: Lint\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      \n      - name: Setup Node.js\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: ${{ env.NODE_VERSION }}\n          cache: ''npm''\n      \n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n      \n      - name: Run ESLint\n        run: npm run lint\n      \n      - name: Run TypeScript check\n        run: npm run type-check\n\n  test:\n    name: Test\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    needs: lint\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      \n      - name: Setup Node.js\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: ${{ env.NODE_VERSION }}\n          cache: ''npm''\n      \n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n      \n      - name: Run tests\n        run: npm run test:ci\n      \n      - name: Upload coverage\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v3\n        if: always()\n\n  build:\n    name: Build\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    needs: test\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      \n      - name: Setup Node.js\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: ${{ env.NODE_VERSION }}\n          cache: ''npm''\n      \n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n      \n      - name: Build\n        run: npm run build\n      \n      - name: Upload build artifacts\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: build\n          path: dist/\n\n  deploy:\n    name: Deploy\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    needs: build\n    if: github.ref == ''refs/heads/main''\n    environment: production\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      \n      - name: Download build artifacts\n        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: build\n          path: dist/\n      \n      - name: Deploy to production\n        run: |\n          # Deploy commands here\n          echo \"Deploying to production...\"\n```\n\n### 3. Optimization\n\n#### Caching\nCACHE dependencies to speed up runs.\n\n```yaml\n- name: Setup Node.js\n  uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n  with:\n    node-version: ''20''\n    cache: ''npm''  # Automatically caches node_modules\n```\n\n#### Parallelism\nRun unrelated jobs in parallel.\n\n```yaml\njobs:\n  lint-frontend:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    # ...\n\n  lint-backend:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    # ...\n\n  test:\n    needs: [lint-frontend, lint-backend]  # Runs after both complete\n    # ...\n```\n\n### 4. Secrets Management\n\n#### Rules\n- **NEVER** print secrets/tokens in logs.\n- Use the CI platform''s Secret masking features.\n- **Least Privilege:** CI tokens should only have required permissions.\n\n```yaml\n# Good - Using secrets\n- name: Deploy\n  env:\n    API_KEY: ${{ secrets.API_KEY }}\n  run: ./deploy.sh\n\n# Bad - Printing secrets\n- name: Debug\n  run: echo ${{ secrets.API_KEY }}  # NEVER DO THIS\n```\n\n### 5. Branch Protection\n\n```yaml\n# Only deploy from protected branches\ndeploy:\n  if: github.ref == ''refs/heads/main''\n  \n# Or use environment protection\ndeploy:\n  environment: production  # Requires approval if configured\n```\n\n### 6. GitLab CI Example\n\n```yaml\n# .gitlab-ci.yml\nstages:\n  - lint\n  - test\n  - build\n  - deploy\n\nvariables:\n  NODE_VERSION: \"20\"\n\ncache:\n  key: ${CI_COMMIT_REF_SLUG}\n  paths:\n    - node_modules/\n\nlint:\n  stage: lint\n  image: node:${NODE_VERSION}-alpine\n  script:\n    - npm ci\n    - npm run lint\n    - npm run type-check\n\ntest:\n  stage: test\n  image: node:${NODE_VERSION}-alpine\n  script:\n    - npm ci\n    - npm run test:ci\n  coverage: ''/All files[^|]*\\|[^|]*\\s+([\\d\\.]+)/''\n\nbuild:\n  stage: build\n  image: node:${NODE_VERSION}-alpine\n  script:\n    - npm ci\n    - npm run build\n  artifacts:\n    paths:\n      - dist/\n    expire_in: 1 week\n\ndeploy:\n  stage: deploy\n  image: node:${NODE_VERSION}-alpine\n  script:\n    - echo \"Deploying...\"\n  environment:\n    name: production\n  only:\n    - main\n  when: manual\n```\n\n### 7. Best Practices Checklist\n\n- [ ] Lint runs before tests\n- [ ] Tests run before build\n- [ ] Build artifacts are cached/uploaded\n- [ ] Secrets are never logged\n- [ ] Dependencies are cached\n- [ ] Deploy only from protected branches\n- [ ] Environment approvals for production\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:47:56.748Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for CI/CD-focused Agents needing standardized pipeline management and automation","zh":"适用于需要标准化管道管理和自动化的CI/CD聚焦代理","ja":"CI/CDに焦点を当てたエージェントが標準化されたパイプライン管理と自動化を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"CI/CD에 중점을 둔 에이전트가 표준화된 파이프라인 관리 및 자동화를 필요로 할 때 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes centrados en CI/CD que necesitan una gestión y automatización de pipelines estandarizadas","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents axés sur CI/CD ayant besoin d''une gestion et d''une automatisation de pipelines standardisées","de":"Ideal für CI/CD-fokussierte Agents, die standardisiertes Pipeline-Management und Automatisierung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes com foco em CI/CD que necessitam de gestão de pipeline padronizada e automação","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на CI/CD, требующих стандартизированного управления конвейерами и автоматизации","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على CI/CD ويتطلبون إدارة أنابيب معيارية وتأتمات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce strict CI/CD pipeline stages, including Lint & Static Analysis, Unit Testing, and Build verification, utilizing GitHub Actions and GitLab CI pipelines for optimized build and deploy processes","zh":"赋予代理执行严格的CI/CD管道阶段的能力，包括Lint与静态分析、单元测试和构建验证，利用GitHub Actions和GitLab CI管道优化构建和部署过程","ja":"Lintおよび静的分析、ユニットテスト、ビルドの検証を含む厳格なCI/CDパイプラインステージをエージェントが施行できるようにし、GitHub ActionsとGitLab CIパイプラインを使用してビルドとデプロイプロセスを最適化する","ko":"Lint 및 정적 분석, 유닛 테스트, 빌드 검증 등을 포함한 엄격한 CI/CD 파이프라인 단계를 에이전트가 시행할 수 있도록