Fehlersuche in Windows 11"],"pt":["Análise de sintomas","Identificação de causas raiz","Automatização de scripts","Configuração de MCP","Hotkeys personalizados com AutoHotkey","Integração com Windows 11"],"ru":["Анализ симптомов","Выявление коренных причин","Автоматизация скриптов","Конфигурация MCP","Персонализированные хоткеи с AutoHotkey","Интеграция с Windows 11"],"ar":["تحليل الأعراض","تحديد الأسباب الجذرية","تأتمة البرامج النصية","تكوين MCP","مفاتيح ساخنة مخصصة مع AutoHotkey","التكامل مع Windows 11"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ultra Debug","Windows 11 AI开发","自动化脚本","热键配置","MCP配置","调试方法","根本原因分析","Symptom分析"],"ja":["Ultra Debug","Windows 11 AI開発","自動化スクリプト","ホットキーコンフィグ","MCPコンフィグ","デバッグ方法","根本原因分析","症状分析"],"ko":["Ultra Debug","Windows 11 AI 개발","자동화 스크립트","핫키 구성","MCP 구성","디버깅 방법","근본 원인 분석","증상 분석"],"es":["depuración de código","herramientas de depuración","AutoHotkey","MCP configs","Windows 11","desarrollo de software","identificación de errores","resolución de problemas"],"fr":["débogage de code","outils de débogage","AutoHotkey","configurations MCP","Windows 11","développement de logiciels","identification d''erreurs","résolution de problèmes"],"de":["Fehlersuche","Debugging-Tools","AutoHotkey","MCP-Konfigurationen","Windows 11","Software-Entwicklung","Fehleridentifizierung","Problembehebung"],"pt":["depuração","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de depuração","Ultra Debug","Windows 11","AutoHotkey","MCP","scripts de automação"],"ru":["отладка","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты отладки","Ультра Дебаг","Windows 11","AutoHotkey","MCP","скрипты автоматизации"],"ar":["فحص","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الفحص","ألترا ديباج","Windows 11","AutoHotkey","MCP","برامج النصية التأتمة"]}},"owner":"FinesseAC","repo":"windows-ai-dev-station","repoPath":"FinesseAC/windows-ai-dev-station","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Ultra Debug","description":"Deep systematic debugging with root cause analysis and hypothesis testing","bodyPreview":"# Ultra Debug Protocol\n\nA comprehensive debugging methodology that goes beyond surface-level fixes to identify and resolve root causes.\n\n## Step 1: Symptom Analysis\n\nGather complete information about the failure:\n\n- **What exactly is failing?** (Error message, unexpected behavior, crash)\n- **When did it start?** (After a specific change, randomly, under certain conditions)\n- **Is it reproducible?** (Always, sometimes, only in specific environments)\n- **What changed recently?** Run `git log -10 -","body":"# Ultra Debug Protocol\n\nA comprehensive debugging methodology that goes beyond surface-level fixes to identify and resolve root causes.\n\n## Step 1: Symptom Analysis\n\nGather complete information about the failure:\n\n- **What exactly is failing?** (Error message, unexpected behavior, crash)\n- **When did it start?** (After a specific change, randomly, under certain conditions)\n- **Is it reproducible?** (Always, sometimes, only in specific environments)\n- **What changed recently?** Run `git log -10 --oneline` to see recent commits\n\n## Step 2: Context Gathering\n\nBefore debugging, understand the system:\n\n- Review relevant code files\n- Check recent git changes in affected areas\n- Look for similar past issues\n- Understand the expected vs actual behavior\n\n## Step 3: Hypothesis Generation\n\nGenerate at least 3 hypotheses ranked by likelihood:\n\n1. **[Most Likely]** Description - Reasoning for likelihood\n2. **[Possible]** Description - Why this could be the cause\n3. **[Less Likely]** Description - Worth checking anyway because...\n\n## Step 4: Systematic Elimination\n\nFor each hypothesis (starting with most likely):\n\n1. Design a minimal test that would confirm/refute the hypothesis\n2. Execute the test\n3. Record the result\n4. Update probability rankings based on evidence\n5. Move to next hypothesis if not confirmed\n\n## Step 5: Root Cause Identification\n\nOnce you find the issue:\n\n- Trace the COMPLETE causal chain (not just the immediate trigger)\n- Ask \"why\" at least 3 times to get to the root\n- Document the root cause clearly\n\n## Step 6: Fix Implementation\n\nApply a proper fix:\n\n- Make the MINIMAL change needed to fix the root cause\n- Avoid band-aid fixes that only address symptoms\n- Ensure the fix doesn''t introduce new issues\n- Add a regression test if possible\n\n## Step 7: Verification\n\nConfirm the fix:\n\n- Verify the original issue is resolved\n- Test edge cases related to the fix\n- Run existing tests to check for regressions\n- Document what was fixed and why\n\n## Step 8: Prevention\n\nLearn from the bug:\n\n- Why wasn''t this caught earlier?\n- What process improvement could prevent similar issues?\n- Should tests be added/improved?\n- Should documentation be updated?\n\n## Debugging Commands Reference\n\n```powershell\n# Recent git changes\ngit log -10 --oneline\ngit diff HEAD~5\n\n# Find where something was introduced\ngit bisect start\ngit bisect bad HEAD\ngit bisect good <known-good-commit>\n\n# Search for patterns in code\ngrep -r \"pattern\" --include=\"*.ts\"\n\n# Check running processes\nGet-Process | Where-Object { $_.ProcessName -like \"*node*\" }\n\n# Check port usage\nnetstat -ano | findstr :3000\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:48:26.388Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Debugging Agents requiring in-depth symptom analysis and automation scripts","zh":"适用于需要进行深入症状分析和自动化脚本的高级调试代理","ja":"高度なデバッグ エージェントが深い症状分析と自動化スクリプトを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"심층적인 증상 분석 및 자동화 스크립트가 필요한 고급 디버깅 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de depuración avanzada que requieren un análisis de síntomas en profundidad y scripts de automatización","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de débogage avancé nécessitant une analyse de symptômes en profondeur et des scripts d''automatisation","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche Debugging-Agents, die eine tiefe Symptomanalyse und Automatisierungsskripte erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Depuração Avançada que exigem análise de sintomas aprofundada e scripts de automação","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов отладки, требующих глубокого анализа симптомов и автоматизации скриптов","ar":"مثالي لعميل تصحيح متقدم يتطلب تحليل أعراض متعمق وبرامج نصية للتحكم الآلي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform comprehensive debugging using AutoHotkey hotkeys, MCP configs, and automation scripts, analyzing error messages, unexpected behavior, and crash reports to identify root causes, leveraging tools like `git log` for recent change analysis","zh":"赋予代理执行全面调试的能力，使用 AutoHotkey 热键、MCP 配置和自动化脚本，分析错误消息、意外行为和崩溃报告以确定根本原因，利用工具如 `git log` 进行最近更改分析","ja":"エージェントが AutoHotkey ホットキー、MCP 構成、および自動化スクリプトを使用して包括的なデバッグを実行できるようにし、エラーメッセージ、予期せぬ動作、およびクラッシュ レポートを分析して根本原因を特定し、`git log` などのツールを使用して最近の変更分析を実行する","ko":"에이전트가 AutoHotkey 핫키, MCP 구성 및 자동화 스크립트를 사용하여 종합적인 디버깅을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 오류 메시지, 예상치 못한 동작 및 충돌 보고서를 분석하여根本 원인을 식별하며, `git log`와 같은 도구를 사용하여 최근 변경 분석을 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un depuración integral utilizando hotkeys de AutoHotkey, configuraciones de MCP y scripts de automatización, analizando mensajes de error, comportamiento inesperado e informes de bloqueo para identificar las causas raíz, aprovechando herramientas como `git log` para el análisis de cambios recientes","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer un débogage complet en utilisant des raccourcis AutoHotkey, des configurations MCP et des scripts d''automatisation, en analysant les messages d''erreur, le comportement inattendu et les rapports de plantage pour identifier les causes profondes, en exploitant des outils comme `git log` pour l''analyse des modifications récentes","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine umfassende Fehlersuche durchzuführen, indem sie AutoHotkey-Hotkeys, MCP-Konfigurationen und Automatisierungsskripte verwenden, Fehlermeldungen, unerwartetes Verhalten und Absturzberichte analysieren, um die Ursachen zu identifizieren, und Werkzeuge wie `git log` für die Analyse kürzlicher Änderungen nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar depuração abrangente usando atalhos AutoHotkey, configurações MCP e scripts de automação, analisando mensagens de erro, comportamento inesperado e relatórios de falha para identificar causas raiz, aproveitando ferramentas como `git log` para análise de alterações recentes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить комплексную отладку с помощью горячих клавиш AutoHotkey, конфигураций MCP и автоматизации скриптов, анализируя сообщения об ошибках, неожиданное поведение и отчеты о сбоях для определения коренных причин, используя инструменты типа `git log` для анализа недавних изменений","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إجراء تصحيح متعمق باستخدام مفتاح ساخن AutoHotkey، وتفاصيل MCP، وبرامج نصية للتحكم الآلي، وتحليل رسائل الخطأ والسلوك غير المتوقع وتقارير الانهيار لتحديد الأسباب الجذرية، وتوظيف أدوات مثل `git log` للتحليل التغييرات الأخيرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating symptom analysis for Windows 11 applications","Generating debug reports with reproducibility details","Debugging crashes using recent change analysis with `git log -10`"],"zh":["针对 Windows 11 应用程序自动执行症状分析","生成具有再现性详细信息的调试报告","使用 `git log -10` 进行最近更改分析来调试崩溃"],"ja":["Windows 11 アプリケーションの症状分析を自動化する","再現性の詳細を含むデバッグ レポートを生成する","`git log -10` を使用した最近の変更分析によりクラッシュをデバッグする"],"ko":["Windows 11 애플리케이션의 증상 분석을 자동화","재현성 세부 정보를 포함하는 디버그 보고서 생성","`git log -10`를 사용하여 최근 변경 분석을 통해 충돌 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar el análisis de síntomas para aplicaciones de Windows 11","Generar informes de depuración con detalles de reproducibilidad","Depurar bloqueos utilizando el análisis de cambios recientes con `git log -10`"],"fr":["Automatiser l''analyse des symptômes pour les applications Windows 11","Générer des rapports de débogage avec des détails de reproductibilité","Déboguer les plantages en utilisant l''analyse des modifications récentes avec `git log -10`"],"de":["Automatisieren der Symptomanalyse für Windows-11-Anwendungen","Generieren von Fehlersuchberic