дь","Документация всего","Эффективное выполнение задач"],"ar":["الالتزامات الذرية","معالجة الانحرافات","التحقق أولاً","توثيق كل شيء","التنفيذ الفعال للمهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GSD Executor","开发方法","原子提交","偏差处理","验证优先","文档记录","任务执行流程"],"ja":["GSD Executor","開発方法","原子コミット","偏差ハンドリング","検証優先","ドキュメント記録","タスク実行フロー"],"ko":["GSD Executor","개발 방법","원자적 커밋","편차 처리","검증 우선","문서 기록","작업 실행 흐름"],"es":["GSD Executor","ejecución de planes","commits atómicos","verificación previa","documentación de desviaciones","desarrollo de software","metodologías de desarrollo"],"fr":["GSD Executor","exécution de plans","commits atomiques","vérification préalable","documentation des écarts","développement de logiciels","méthodologies de développement"],"de":["GSD-Executor","Ausführung von Plänen","atomare Commits","vorherige Verifizierung","Dokumentation von Abweichungen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungsmethoden"],"pt":["GSD Executor","execução de planos","metodologia de execução","commits atômicos","tratamento de desvios","verificação","documentação","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["GSD Executor","выполнение планов","методология выполнения","атомарные коммиты","обработка отклонений","верификация","документация","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مُنيق GSD","تنفيذ الخطط","منهجية التنفيذ","الالتزامات الذرية","معالجة الانحرافات","التحقق","توثيق","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"AnasShahid","repo":"vimsy_lead_generation","repoPath":"AnasShahid/vimsy_lead_generation","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gsd-executor","description":"Methodology for executing GSD plans with atomic commits, deviation handling, and verification. Invoke when executing PLAN.md files.","bodyPreview":"# GSD Executor\n\nYou are executing a GSD plan. Follow this methodology for consistent, high-quality execution.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Atomic commits** — One commit per task, never batch\n2. **Deviation handling** — Auto-fix bugs/blockers, ask about architecture\n3. **Verification first** — Don''t proceed until verification passes\n4. **Document everything** — Deviations go in SUMMARY.md\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### For Each Task\n\n1. **Read task completely** before starting\n2. **Implement** following th","body":"# GSD Executor\n\nYou are executing a GSD plan. Follow this methodology for consistent, high-quality execution.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Atomic commits** — One commit per task, never batch\n2. **Deviation handling** — Auto-fix bugs/blockers, ask about architecture\n3. **Verification first** — Don''t proceed until verification passes\n4. **Document everything** — Deviations go in SUMMARY.md\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### For Each Task\n\n1. **Read task completely** before starting\n2. **Implement** following the action instructions\n3. **Verify** using the verification command\n4. **Commit** only task-related files\n5. **Record** commit hash for Summary\n\n### Commit Protocol\n\n```bash\n# NEVER use git add . or git add -A\n# Stage files individually\ngit add src/specific/file.ts\ngit add src/another/file.ts\n\n# Commit with conventional format\ngit commit -m \"{type}({phase}-{plan}): {task description}\"\n```\n\n**Types:** `feat`, `fix`, `test`, `refactor`, `docs`, `chore`\n\n## Deviation Rules\n\n### Rule 1: Auto-fix Bugs\n**Trigger:** Code doesn''t work (errors, wrong output, crashes)\n\n**Action:** Fix immediately, track for Summary\n\n**Examples:**\n- Wrong logic, off-by-one errors\n- Type errors, null pointer exceptions\n- Broken validation\n\n**No permission needed.** Bugs must be fixed.\n\n### Rule 2: Auto-add Critical Functionality\n**Trigger:** Missing essential security/correctness features\n\n**Action:** Add immediately, track for Summary\n\n**Examples:**\n- Missing error handling\n- No input validation\n- Missing auth checks\n- No rate limiting\n\n**No permission needed.** These are requirements for correctness.\n\n### Rule 3: Auto-fix Blockers\n**Trigger:** Can''t proceed without fixing\n\n**Action:** Fix to unblock, track for Summary\n\n**Examples:**\n- Missing dependency\n- Wrong import path\n- Missing environment variable\n- Build config error\n\n**No permission needed.** Can''t complete task without fix.\n\n### Rule 4: ASK About Architectural Changes\n**Trigger:** Significant structural modification needed\n\n**Action:** STOP and present to user\n\n**Examples:**\n- Adding new database table\n- Major schema changes\n- Switching libraries/frameworks\n- New service layer\n\n**User decision required.** These affect system design.\n\n### Priority Order\n\n1. If Rule 4 applies → STOP and ask\n2. If Rules 1-3 apply → Fix and document\n3. If unsure → Apply Rule 4 (ask)\n\n## Tracking Deviations\n\nFor each auto-fix, record:\n\n```markdown\n**[Rule N - Type] [Description]**\n- Found during: Task [N]\n- Issue: [what was wrong]\n- Fix: [what was done]\n- Files: [affected]\n- Commit: [hash]\n```\n\n## Verification Patterns\n\n### Code Verification\n```bash\n# TypeScript compiles\nnpx tsc --noEmit\n\n# Tests pass\nnpm test\n\n# Linting passes\nnpm run lint\n```\n\n### API Verification\n```bash\n# Endpoint responds\ncurl -X POST localhost:3000/api/endpoint -d ''{}'' -H \"Content-Type: application/json\"\n\n# Returns expected status\n# Check response body\n```\n\n### Component Verification\n```bash\n# Build succeeds\nnpm run build\n\n# Dev server starts\nnpm run dev\n```\n\n## Summary Creation\n\nAfter all tasks, create SUMMARY.md with:\n\n1. **One-liner** — Substantive, not generic\n   - Good: \"JWT auth with refresh rotation using jose\"\n   - Bad: \"Authentication implemented\"\n\n2. **What was built** — 2-3 paragraphs\n\n3. **Tasks table** — Task, commit hash, files\n\n4. **Deviations** — All auto-fixes documented\n\n5. **Decisions** — Any choices made during execution\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\nBefore marking plan complete:\n\n- [ ] All tasks executed\n- [ ] All verifications pass\n- [ ] Each task has its own commit\n- [ ] Deviations documented\n- [ ] SUMMARY.md is substantive\n- [ ] No uncommitted changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:48:51.148Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Task Automation Agents requiring structured execution methodologies with atomic commits and deviation handling","zh":"适用于需要结构化执行方法的任务自动化代理，具有原子提交和偏差处理","ja":"タスクの自動化エージェントに適しており、構造化された実行方法論と原子コミットおよび偏差ハンドリングを必要とする","ko":"작업 자동화 에이전트에게 적합하며 구조화된 실행 방법론과 원자적 커밋 및 편차 처리가 필요함","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Tareas que requieren metodologías de ejecución estructuradas con confirmaciones atómicas y manejo de desviaciones","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Tâches nécessitant des méthodologies d''exécution structurées avec des validations atomiques et une gestion des écarts","de":"Ideal für Task-Automatisierungsagenten, die strukturierte Ausführungsmethoden mit atomaren Commits und Abweichungsbehandlung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Tarefas que exigem metodologias de execução estruturadas com confirmações atômicas e tratamento de desvios","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации задач, требующих структурированных методов выполнения с атомарными фиксациями и обработкой отклонений","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إتمام الواجبات التي تتطلب منهجيات تنفيذ منظمة مع التزامات ذرية ومعالجة انحرافات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute tasks consistently with high-quality results using verification-first approaches, documenting everything in SUMMARY.md files, and handling deviations through auto-fixing bugs and blockers, ensuring adherence to core principles like atomic commits and verification first, all while implementing tasks following specific guidelines and protocols","zh":"使得代理能够一致地执行任务，使用验证优先方法，记录所有内容到SUMMARY.md文件中，并通过自动修复bug和阻塞，确保遵守核心原则，如原子提交和验证优先，同时按照特定的指南和协议执行任务","ja":"エージェントが一貫してタスクを実行できるようにし、高品質の結果を得るために検証優先アプローチを使用し、すべての内容をSUMMARY.mdファイルに記録し、自動でバグやブロッカーを修復することで、原子コミットや検証優先などの核となる原則に従い、特定のガイドラインや規約に従ってタスクを実行する","ko":"에이전트가 일관되게 작업을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 