 representaciones visuales de la infraestructura de AWS a partir de plantillas de CloudFormation, salida de AWS CLI o de...","fr":"Le générateur de diagrammes AWS crée des représentations visuelles de l''infrastructure AWS à partir de modèles CloudFormation, de sortie AWS CLI ou de descri...","de":"Der AWS-Diagramm-Generator erstellt visuelle Darstellungen der AWS-Infrastruktur aus CloudFormation-Vorlagen, AWS-CLI-Ausgaben oder natürlichen Sprachbeschre...","pt":"O Gerador de Diagramas AWS gera diagramas de arquitetura para infraestrutura AWS a partir de templates CloudFormation ou saída da CLI do AWS","ru":"Генератор диаграмм AWS генерирует диаграммы архитектуры для инфраструктуры AWS из шаблонов CloudFormation или вывода AWS CLI","ar":"مولد رسومات AWS ينشئ مخططات بنية لموارد AWS باستخدام قوالب CloudFormation أو إخراج واجهة سطر أوامر AWS","en":"sarthakdev.me"},"definition":{"en":"sarthakdev.me"},"features":{"zh":["CloudFormation","AWS CLI","AWS","EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, VPC"],"ja":["CloudFormation","AWS CLI","AWS","EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, VPC"],"ko":["CloudFormation","AWS CLI","AWS","EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, VPC"],"es":["Genera diagramas de arquitectura a partir de plantillas de CloudFormation","Crea diagramas a partir de salida de AWS CLI","Permite la visualización de recursos de AWS","Soporta descripciones en lenguaje natural","Incluye compatibilidad con varios servicios de AWS"],"fr":["Générez des diagrammes d''architecture à partir de modèles CloudFormation","Créez des diagrammes à partir de sortie AWS CLI","Permet la visualisation des ressources AWS","Prend en charge les descriptions en langage naturel","Inclut la compatibilité avec plusieurs services AWS"],"de":["Erstellt Architekturdiagramme aus CloudFormation-Vorlagen","Erstellt Diagramme aus AWS-CLI-Ausgaben","Ermöglicht die Visualisierung von AWS-Ressourcen","Unterstützt natürliche Sprachbeschreibungen","Enthält Kompatibilität mit mehreren AWS-Diensten"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas de arquitetura para infraestrutura AWS","Suporte a templates CloudFormation (YAML/JSON)","Suporte a saída da CLI do AWS","Geração de diagramas a partir de descrições em linguagem natural","Visualização de recursos AWS"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм архитектуры для инфраструктуры AWS","Поддержка шаблонов CloudFormation (YAML/JSON)","Поддержка вывода AWS CLI","Генерация диаграмм из описаний на естественном языке","Визуализация ресурсов AWS"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات بنية لموارد AWS","دعم قوالب CloudFormation (YAML/JSON)","دعم إخراج واجهة سطر أوامر AWS","إنشاء مخططات من وصف لغة طبيعية","تجسيد موارد AWS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AWS","CloudFormation","AWS CLI","AWS","EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, VPC","AWS"],"ja":["AWS","CloudFormation","AWS CLI","AWS","EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, VPC","AWS"],"ko":["AWS","CloudFormation","AWS CLI","AWS","EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, VPC","AWS"],"es":["generador de diagramas de AWS","CloudFormation","AWS CLI","visualización de recursos de AWS","descripciones en lenguaje natural","servicios de AWS","infraestructura de AWS","arquitectura de AWS"],"fr":["générateur de diagrammes AWS","CloudFormation","AWS CLI","visualisation des ressources AWS","descriptions en langage naturel","services AWS","infrastructure AWS","architecture AWS"],"de":["AWS-Diagramm-Generator","CloudFormation","AWS-CLI","Visualisierung von AWS-Ressourcen","natürliche Sprachbeschreibungen","AWS-Dienste","AWS-Infrastruktur","AWS-Architektur"],"pt":["AWS","Diagramas de arquitetura","CloudFormation","CLI do AWS","Linguagem natural","Recursos AWS","Gerador de diagramas","Infraestrutura AWS"],"ru":["AWS","Диаграммы архитектуры","CloudFormation","AWS CLI","Естественный язык","Ресурсы AWS","Генератор диаграмм","Инфраструктура AWS"],"ar":["AWS","مخططات بنية","CloudFormation","واجهة سطر أوامر AWS","لغة طبيعية","موارد AWS","مولد رسومات","بنية تحتية AWS"]}},"owner":"gamingopgamingop","repo":"sarthak-skill-forge","repoPath":"gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aws-diagrams","description":"Visualizes AWS infrastructure from CLI output, CloudFormation, or descriptions. Use when user has AWS resources to diagram.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"aws, diagram, cloudformation, ec2, vpc, s3, rds, lambda, infrastructure","bodyPreview":"# AWS Diagram Generator\n\nGenerates architecture diagrams for AWS infrastructure from CloudFormation templates, AWS CLI output, or natural language descriptions.\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- User has AWS CloudFormation templates (YAML/JSON)\n- User provides AWS CLI output (e.g., `aws ec2 describe-instances`)\n- User wants to visualize AWS resources\n- User mentions AWS services (EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, VPC, etc.)\n- User asks to \"diagram my AWS infrastructure\"\n\n## How It Works\n\nThis sk","body":"# AWS Diagram Generator\n\nGenerates architecture diagrams for AWS infrastructure from CloudFormation templates, AWS CLI output, or natural language descriptions.\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- User has AWS CloudFormation templates (YAML/JSON)\n- User provides AWS CLI output (e.g., `aws ec2 describe-instances`)\n- User wants to visualize AWS resources\n- User mentions AWS services (EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, VPC, etc.)\n- User asks to \"diagram my AWS infrastructure\"\n\n## How It Works\n\nThis skill generates AWS-specific diagrams by parsing AWS resources and calling the Eraser API directly:\n\n1. **Parse AWS Resources**: Extract resources from CloudFormation, CLI output, or descriptions\n2. **Map AWS Relationships**: Identify VPCs, subnets, security groups, IAM roles\n3. **Generate Eraser DSL**: Create Eraser DSL code from AWS resources\n4. **Call Eraser API**: Use `/api/render/elements` with `diagramType: \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"`\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen the user provides AWS infrastructure information:\n\n1. **Parse the Source**\n\n   - **CloudFormation**: Extract `Resources` section, identify types (AWS::EC2::Instance, etc.)\n   - **CLI Output**: Parse JSON output from `aws` commands\n   - **Description**: Identify AWS service names and relationships\n\n2. **Identify AWS Components**\n\n   - **Networking**: VPCs, Subnets, Internet Gateways, NAT Gateways, Route Tables\n   - **Compute**: EC2 Instances, Auto Scaling Groups, Lambda Functions, ECS Services\n   - **Storage**: S3 Buckets, EBS Volumes, EFS File Systems\n   - **Databases**: RDS Instances, DynamoDB Tables, ElastiCache Clusters\n   - **Security**: Security Groups, IAM Roles, IAM Policies, NACLs\n   - **Load Balancing**: ALB, NLB, CLB\n   - **Other**: SQS Queues, SNS Topics, API Gateway, CloudFront\n\n3. **Map Relationships**\n\n   - EC2 instances in subnets\n   - Subnets in VPCs\n   - Security groups attached to instances\n   - IAM roles attached to services\n   - Load balancers targeting instances\n   - Databases accessed by applications\n\n4. **Generate Eraser DSL** Convert AWS resources to Eraser DSL:\n\n   - **CRITICAL: Label Formatting Rules**\n     - Labels MUST be on a single line - NEVER use newlines inside label attributes\n     - Keep labels simple and readable - prefer separate labels over concatenating too much metadata\n     - Format DSL with proper line breaks (one node/group per line, but labels stay on single lines)\n     - If including metadata like CIDR blocks or instance types, include them in the same quoted label string: `[label: \"VPC 10.0.0.0/16\"]`\n\n   Example:\n\n   ```\n   main-vpc [label: \"VPC 10.0.0.0/16\"] {\n     public-subnet [label: \"Public Subnet\"] {\n       web-server [icon: aws-ec2, label: \"Web Server\"]\n       load-balancer [icon: aws-elb]\n     }\n     private-subnet [label: \"Private Subnet\"] {\n       database [icon: aws-rds]\n       cache [icon: aws-elasticache]\n     }\n   }\n   data-bucket [icon: aws-s3]\n   function [icon: aws-lambda]\n   load-balancer -> web-server\n   web-server -> database\n   ```\n\n5. **Make the HTTP Request**\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: You MUST execute this curl command after generating the DSL. Never stop after generating DSL without making the API call.\n\n   **CRITICAL**: In the `X-Skill-Source` header below, you MUST replace the value with your AI agent name:\n   - If you are Claude (Anthropic), use: `claude`\n   - If you are running in Cursor, use: `cursor`\n   - If you are ChatGPT (OpenAI), use: `chatgpt`\n   - If you are Gemini (Google), use: `gemini`\n   - Otherwise, use your model/agent name in lowercase\n\n   ```bash\n   curl -X POST https://app.eraser.io/api/render/elements \\\n     -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n     -H \"X-Skill-Source: eraser-skill\" \\\n     -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${ERASER_API_KEY}\" \\\n     -d ''{\n       \"elements\": [{\n         \"type\": \"diagram\",\n         \"id\": \"diagram-1\",\n         \"code\": \"<your generated DSL>\",\n         \"diagramType\": \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"\n       }],\n       \"scale\": 2,\n        \"theme\": \"${ERASER_THEME:-dark}\",\n       \"background\": true\n     }''\n   ```\n\n6. **Track Sources During Analysis**\n\n   As you analyze files and resources to generate the diagram, track:\n\n   - **Internal files**: Record each file path you read and what information was extracted (e.g., `infra/main.tf` - VPC and subnet definitions)\n   - **External references**: Note any documentation, examples, or URLs consulted (e.g., AWS VPC best practices documentation)\n   - **Annotations**: For each source, note what it contributed to the diagram\n\n7. **Handle the Response**\n\n   **CRITICAL: Minimal Output Format**\n\n   Your response MUST always include these elements with clear headers:\n\n   1. **Diagram Preview**: Display with a header\n      ```\n      ## Diagram\n      ![{Title}]({imageUrl})\n      ```\n      Use the ACTUAL `imageUrl` from the API response.\n\n   2. **Editor Link**: Display with a header\n      ```\n      ## Open in Eraser\n      [Edit this diagram in the Eraser editor]({createEraserFileUrl})\n      ```\n      Use the ACTUAL URL from the API response.\n\n   3. **Sources section**: Brief list of files/resources analyzed (if applicable)\n      ```\n      ## Sources\n      - `path/to/file` - What was extracted\n      ```\n\n   4. **Diagram Code section**: The Eraser DSL in a code block with `eraser` language tag\n      ```\n      ## Diagram Code\n      ```eraser\n      {DSL code here}\n      ```\n      ```\n\n   5. **Learn More link**: `You can learn more about Eraser at https://docs.eraser.io/docs/using-ai-agent-integrations`\n\n   **Additional content rules:**\n   - If the user ONLY asked for a diagram, include NOTHING beyond the 5 elements above\n   - If the user explicitly asked for more (e.g., \"explain the architecture\", \"suggest improvements\"), you may include that additional content\n   - Never add unrequested sections like Overview, Security Considerations, Testing, etc.\n\n   The default output should be SHORT. The diagram image speaks for itself.\n\n## AWS-Specific Tips\n\n- **Show Regions and AZs**: Include availability zones for multi-AZ deployments\n- **VPC as Container**: Always show VPCs containing subnets and resources\n- **Security Groups**: Include security group rules and attachments\n- **IAM Roles**: Show IAM roles attached to services\n- **Data Flow**: Show traffic flow (Internet → ALB → EC2 → RDS)\n- **Use AWS Icons**: Request AWS-specific styling in the description\n\n## Example: CloudFormation with Multiple AWS Services\n\n### User Input\n\n```yaml\nResources:\n  MyVPC:\n    Type: AWS::EC2::VPC\n    Properties:\n      CidrBlock: 10.0.0.0/16\n\n  PublicSubnet:\n    Type: AWS::EC2::Subnet\n    Properties:\n      VpcId: !Ref MyVPC\n      CidrBlock: 10.0.1.0/24\n\n  WebServer:\n    Type: AWS::EC2::Instance\n    Properties:\n      InstanceType: t3.micro\n      SubnetId: !Ref PublicSubnet\n\n  MyBucket:\n    Type: AWS::S3::Bucket\n    Properties:\n      BucketName: my-app-bucket\n\n  MyFunction:\n    Type: AWS::Lambda::Function\n    Properties:\n      Runtime: python3.9\n      Handler: index.handler\n\n  MyDatabase:\n    Type: AWS::RDS::DBInstance\n    Properties:\n      Engine: postgres\n      DBInstanceClass: db.t3.micro\n```\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n1. Parses CloudFormation:\n\n   - **Networking**: VPC, Subnet\n   - **Compute**: EC2 instance, Lambda function\n   - **Storage**: S3 bucket\n   - **Database**: RDS PostgreSQL instance\n\n2. Generates DSL showing AWS service diversity:\n\n   ```\n   MyVPC [label: \"VPC 10.0.0.0/16\"] {\n     PublicSubnet [label: \"Public Subnet 10.0.1.0/24\"] {\n       WebServer [icon: aws-ec2, label: \"EC2 t3.micro\"]\n     }\n   }\n\n   MyBucket [icon: aws-s3, label: \"S3 my-app-bucket\"]\n   MyFunction [icon: aws-lambda, label: \"Lambda python3.9\"]\n   MyDatabase [icon: aws-rds, label: \"RDS PostgreSQL db.t3.micro\"]\n\n   WebServer -> MyBucket\n   MyFunction -> MyDatabase\n   WebServer -> MyDatabase\n   ```\n\n   **Important**: All label text must be on a single line within quotes. AWS-specific: Include service icons, show data flows between services, group by VPC when applicable.\n\n3. Calls `/api/render/elements` with `diagramType: \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"`\n\n## Example: AWS CLI Output\n\n### User Input\n\n```\nUser runs: aws ec2 describe-instances\nProvides JSON output\n```\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n1. Parses JSON to extract:\n\n   - Instance IDs, types, states\n   - Subnet IDs, VPC IDs\n   - Security groups\n   - Tags\n\n2. Formats and calls API\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:48:45.329Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Infrastructure Agents needing advanced AWS architecture visualization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 AWS 架构可视化能力的云基础设施代理。","ja":"クラウドインフラストラクチャエージェントが高度なAWSアーキテクチャの視覚化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 AWS 아키텍처 시각화 기능이 필요한 클라우드 인프라 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de infraestructura en la nube que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de visualización de arquitectura de AWS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''infrastructure cloud qui nécessitent des capacités avancées de visualisation d''architecture AWS.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Infrastruktur-Agents, die erweiterte AWS-Architektur-Visualisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Infraestrutura em Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de arquitetura da AWS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов инфраструктуры облака, которым необходимы расширенные возможности визуализации архитектуры AWS.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل البنية التحتية للسحابة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة في تخطيط بنية نظام أمازون ويب سيرفيسز."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate architecture diagrams from CloudFormation templates, AWS CLI output, or natural language descriptions, utilizing YAML, JSON, and AWS services like EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, and VPC.","zh":"赋予代理生成架构图的能力，从CloudFormation模板、AWS CLI输出或自然语言描述中，利用YAML、JSON和AWS服务，如EC2、S3、RDS、Lambda和VPC。","ja":"CloudFormationテンプレート、AWS CLIの出力、または自然言語の説明からアーキテクチャ図を生成するエージェントの能力を提供します。YAML、JSON、およびEC2、S3、RDS、Lambda、VPCなどのAWSサービスを利用します。","ko":"클라우드 형성 템플릿, AWS CLI 출력 또는 자연어 설명에서 아키텍처 다이어그램을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다. YAML, JSON 및 EC2, S3, RDS, 람다, VPC 등의 AWS 서비스를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar diagramas de arquitectura a partir de plantillas de CloudFormation, salida de AWS CLI o descripciones en lenguaje natural, utilizando YAML, JSON y servicios de AWS como EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda y VPC.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diagrammes d''architecture à partir de modèles CloudFormation, de sortie AWS CLI ou de descriptions en langage naturel, en utilisant YAML, JSON et des services AWS tels que EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda et VPC.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Architekturdiagramme aus CloudFormation-Vorlagen, AWS-CLI-Ausgabe oder natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen zu generieren, unter Verwendung von YAML, JSON und AWS-Diensten wie EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda und VPC.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar diagramas de arquitetura a partir de modelos do CloudFormation, saída do AWS CLI ou descrições em linguagem natural, utilizando YAML, JSON e serviços da AWS como EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda e VPC.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать диаграммы архитектуры из шаблонов CloudFormation, вывода AWS CLI или описаний на естественном языке, используя YAML, JSON и сервисы AWS, такие как EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda и VPC.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توليد رسومات بنية من قوالب كلاود فورمشن أو مخرجات واجهة سطر أوصله أمازون ويب سيرفيسز أو وصفات لغة طبيعية، مستخدمًا YAML و JSON وخدمات أمازون ويب سيرفيسز مثل EC2 و S3 و RDS و لامدا و VPC."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating diagrams from CloudFormation templates","Visualizing AWS resources from CLI output","Creating architecture diagrams from natural language descriptions"],"zh":["从CloudFormation模板生成图表","从CLI输出可视化AWS资源","从自然语言描述创建架构图表"],"ja":["CloudFormationテンプレートから図を生成する","CLIの出力からAWSリソースを視覚化する","自然言語の説明からアーキテクチャ図を生成する"],"ko":["클라우드 형성 템플릿에서 다이어그램 생성","CLI 출력에서 AWS 리소스 시각화","자연어 설명에서 아키텍처 다이어그램 생성"],"es":["Generar diagramas a partir de plantillas de CloudFormation","Visualizar recursos de AWS a partir de la salida de CLI","Crear diagramas de arquitectura a partir de descripciones en lenguaje natural"],"fr":["Générer des diagrammes à partir de modèles CloudFormation","Visualiser les ressources AWS à partir de la sortie CLI","Créer des diagrammes d''architecture à partir de descriptions en langage naturel"],"de":["Diagramme aus CloudFormation-Vorlagen generieren","AWS-Ressourcen aus CLI-Ausgabe visualisieren","Architekturdiagramme aus natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen erstellen"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas a partir de modelos do CloudFormation","Visualização de recursos da AWS a partir da saída do CLI","Criação de diagramas de arquitetura a partir de descrições em linguagem natural"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм из шаблонов CloudFormation","Визуализация ресурсов AWS из вывода CLI","Создание диаграмм архитектуры из описаний на естественном языке"],"ar":["توليد رسومات من قوالب كلاود فورمشن","رؤية الموارد من مخرجات واجهة سطر أوصله","إنشاء رسومات هيكلية من وصفات لغة طبيعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AWS CloudFormation templates or AWS CLI output","Limited to AWS services"],"zh":["需要AWS CloudFormation模板或AWS CLI输出","仅限AWS服务"],"ja":["AWS CloudFormationテンプレートまたはAWS CLIの出力が必要","AWSサービスのみに限定"],"ko":["AWS 클라우드 형성 템플릿 또는 AWS CLI 출력이 필요","AWS 서비스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere plantillas de AWS CloudFormation o salida de AWS CLI","Limitado a servicios de AWS"],"fr":["Nécessite des modèles AWS CloudFormation ou une sortie AWS CLI","Limité aux services AWS"],"de":["Benötigt AWS CloudFormation-Vorlagen oder AWS-CLI-Ausgabe","Begrenzt auf AWS-Dienste"],"pt":["Exige modelos do CloudFormation da AWS ou saída do AWS CLI","Limitado a serviços da AWS"],"ru":["Требует шаблонов CloudFormation AWS или вывода AWS CLI","Ограничен сервисами AWS"],"ar":["يتطلب قوالب كلاود فورمشن أو مخرجات واجهة سطر أوصله","محدود بخدمات أمازون ويب سيرفيسز"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('eKoh951/hytale-gg/agent-browser', 'community', 'eKoh951', 'hytale-gg', 'eKoh951/hytale-gg', 'agent-browser', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z', '2026-02-18T11:49:16.472Z', NULL, '{"id":"eKoh951/hytale-gg/agent-browser","name":"agent-browser","description":{"zh":"agent-browser是一种浏览器自动化工具，能够自动化浏览器操作","ja":"agent-browserはブラウザの自動化ツールであり、ブラウザ操作を自動化することができます","ko":"agent-browser는 브라우저 자동화 도구로 브라우저操作을 자동화할 수 있습니다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta para automatizar tareas en el navegador. Permite abrir páginas, capturar elementos y realizar acciones.","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil pour automatiser des tâches dans le navigateur. Il permet d''ouvrir des pages, de capturer des éléments et de réaliser des actions.","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser. Es ermöglicht das Öffnen von Seiten, das Erfassen von Elementen und das Ausführen von Aktionen.","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite abrir páginas, capturar elementos e interagir com eles de forma programática.","ru":"Agent-browser - это инструмент автоматизации браузера, который позволяет открывать страницы, захватывать элементы и взаимодействовать с ними программно.","ar":"agent-browser هو أداة أتمتة المتصفح التي تمكنك من فتح الصفحات و التقاط العناصر والتفاعل معها برمجيًا.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"agent-browser自动化浏览器","ja":"agent-browserブラウザ自動化","ko":"agent-browser 브라우저 자동화","es":"Automatización de navegador con agent-browser","fr":"Automatisation du navigateur avec agent-browser","de":"Browser-Automatisierung mit agent-browser","pt":"Automatize Navegação com agent-browser","ru":"Автоматизируйте Браузер с agent-browser","ar":"أتمتة المتصفح مع agent-browser","en":"agent-browser"},"description":{"zh":"agent-browser是一种浏览器自动化工具，能够自动化浏览器操作","ja":"agent-browserはブラウザの自動化ツールであり、ブラウザ操作を自動化することができます","ko":"agent-browser는 브라우저 자동화 도구로 브라우저操作을 자동화할 수 있습니다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta para automatizar tareas en el navegador. Permite abrir páginas, capturar elementos y realizar acciones.","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil pour automatiser des tâches dans le navigateur. Il permet d''ouvrir des pages, de capturer des éléments et de réaliser des actions.","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser. Es ermöglicht das Öffnen von Seiten, das Erfassen von Elementen und das Ausführen von...","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite abrir páginas, capturar elementos e interagir com eles de forma programática.","ru":"Agent-browser - это инструмент автоматизации браузера, который позволяет открывать страницы, захватывать элементы и взаимодействовать с ними программно.","ar":"agent-browser هو أداة أتمتة المتصفح التي تمكنك من فتح الصفحات و التقاط العناصر والتفاعل معها برمجيًا.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化浏览器操作","支持网页截图","支持元素交互","支持输入填充","支持浏览器关闭"],"ja":["ブラウザ操作の自動化","ウェブページのスクリーンショットをサポート","要素のインタラクションをサポート","入力の埋め込みをサポート","ブラウザの閉じるをサポート"],"ko":["브라우저操作 자동화","웹페이지 스크린샷 지원","요소 상호작용 지원","입력 채우기 지원","브라우저 닫기 지원"],"es":["Apertura de páginas","Captura de elementos","Realización de acciones","Interacción con elementos","Cierre del navegador"],"fr":["Ouverture de pages","Capture d''éléments","Réalisations d''actions","Interaction avec des éléments","Fermeture du navigateur"],"de":["Öffnen von Seiten","Erfassen von Elementen","Ausführen von Aktionen","Interaktion mit Elementen","Schließen des Browsers"],"pt":["Abra páginas com facilidade","Captura de elementos interativos","Interação programática com elementos","Fechar o navegador quando necessário","Suporte a comandos personalizados"],"ru":["Откройте страницы с легкостью","Захват интерактивных элементов","Программное взаимодействие с элементами","Закрытие браузера при необходимости","Поддержка пользовательских команд"],"ar":["افتح الصفحات بسهولة","التقاط العناصر التفاعلية","التفاعل البرمجي مع العناصر","إغلاق المتصفح عند الحاجة","دعم أوامر مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","agent-browser","自动化测试","浏览器交互","网页自动化","开发工具"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","agent-browser","自動テスト","ブラウザのインタラクション","ウェブ自動化","開発ツール"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","agent-browser","자동화 테스트","브라우저 상호작용","웹 자동화","개발 도구"],"es":["automatización de navegador","agent-browser","automatización de tareas","herramienta de automatización","navegador automático","desarrollo web"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","agent-browser","automatisation de tâches","outil d''automatisation","navigateur automatique","développement web"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","agent-browser","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Automatisierungstool","automatischer Browser","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["automação de navegador","agent-browser","abrir páginas","capturar elementos","interação programática","ferramenta de automação","desenvolvimento web","testes automatizados"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","agent-browser","открывать страницы","захватывать элементы","программное взаимодействие","инструмент автоматизации","веб-разработка","автоматизированное тестирование"],"ar":["أتمتة المتصفح","agent-browser","فتح الصفحات","التقاط العناصر","التفاعل البرمجي","أداة أتمتة","تطوير الويب","اختبارات أتمتة"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-browser","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>        # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i       # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1         # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"   # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close             # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. Intera","body":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>        # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i       # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1         # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"   # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close             # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. Interact using refs from the snapshot\n4. Re-snapshot after navigation or significant DOM changes\n\n## Commands\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>      # Navigate to URL (aliases: goto, navigate)\n                              # Supports: https://, http://, file://, about:, data://\n                              # Auto-prepends https:// if no protocol given\nagent-browser back            # Go back\nagent-browser forward         # Go forward\nagent-browser reload          # Reload page\nagent-browser close           # Close browser (aliases: quit, exit)\nagent-browser connect 9222    # Connect to browser via CDP port\n```\n\n### Snapshot (page analysis)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser snapshot            # Full accessibility tree\nagent-browser snapshot -i         # Interactive elements only (recommended)\nagent-browser snapshot -c         # Compact output\nagent-browser snapshot -d 3       # Limit depth to 3\nagent-browser snapshot -s \"#main\" # Scope to CSS selector\n```\n\n### Interactions (use @refs from snapshot)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser click @e1           # Click\nagent-browser dblclick @e1        # Double-click\nagent-browser focus @e1           # Focus element\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"     # Clear and type\nagent-browser type @e2 \"text\"     # Type without clearing\nagent-browser press Enter         # Press key (alias: key)\nagent-browser press Control+a     # Key combination\nagent-browser keydown Shift       # Hold key down\nagent-browser keyup Shift         # Release key\nagent-browser hover @e1           # Hover\nagent-browser check @e1           # Check checkbox\nagent-browser uncheck @e1         # Uncheck checkbox\nagent-browser select @e1 \"value\"  # Select dropdown option\nagent-browser select @e1 \"a\" \"b\"  # Select multiple options\nagent-browser scroll down 500     # Scroll page (default: down 300px)\nagent-browser scrollintoview @e1  # Scroll element into view (alias: scrollinto)\nagent-browser drag @e1 @e2        # Drag and drop\nagent-browser upload @e1 file.pdf # Upload files\n```\n\n### Get information\n\n```bash\nagent-browser get text @e1        # Get element text\nagent-browser get html @e1        # Get innerHTML\nagent-browser get value @e1       # Get input value\nagent-browser get attr @e1 href   # Get attribute\nagent-browser get title           # Get page title\nagent-browser get url             # Get current URL\nagent-browser get count \".item\"   # Count matching elements\nagent-browser get box @e1         # Get bounding box\nagent-browser get styles @e1      # Get computed styles (font, color, bg, etc.)\n```\n\n### Check state\n\n```bash\nagent-browser is visible @e1      # Check if visible\nagent-browser is enabled @e1      # Check if enabled\nagent-browser is checked @e1      # Check if checked\n```\n\n### Screenshots & PDF\n\n```bash\nagent-browser screenshot          # Save to a temporary directory\nagent-browser screenshot path.png # Save to a specific path\nagent-browser screenshot --full   # Full page\nagent-browser pdf output.pdf      # Save as PDF\n```\n\n### Video recording\n\n```bash\nagent-browser record start ./demo.webm    # Start recording (uses current URL + state)\nagent-browser click @e1                   # Perform actions\nagent-browser record stop                 # Stop and save video\nagent-browser record restart ./take2.webm # Stop current + start new recording\n```\n\nRecording creates a fresh context but preserves cookies/storage from your session. If no URL is provided, it\nautomatically returns to your current page. For smooth demos, explore first, then start recording.\n\n### Wait\n\n```bash\nagent-browser wait @e1                     # Wait for element\nagent-browser wait 2000                    # Wait milliseconds\nagent-browser wait --text \"Success\"        # Wait for text (or -t)\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"    # Wait for URL pattern (or -u)\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle      # Wait for network idle (or -l)\nagent-browser wait --fn \"window.ready\"     # Wait for JS condition (or -f)\n```\n\n### Mouse control\n\n```bash\nagent-browser mouse move 100 200      # Move mouse\nagent-browser mouse down left         # Press button\nagent-browser mouse up left           # Release button\nagent-browser mouse wheel 100         # Scroll wheel\n```\n\n### Semantic locators (alternative to refs)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser find role button click --name \"Submit\"\nagent-browser find text \"Sign In\" click\nagent-browser find text \"Sign In\" click --exact      # Exact match only\nagent-browser find label \"Email\" fill \"user@test.com\"\nagent-browser find placeholder \"Search\" type \"query\"\nagent-browser find alt \"Logo\" click\nagent-browser find title \"Close\" click\nagent-browser find testid \"submit-btn\" click\nagent-browser find first \".item\" click\nagent-browser find last \".item\" click\nagent-browser find nth 2 \"a\" hover\n```\n\n### Browser settings\n\n```bash\nagent-browser set viewport 1920 1080          # Set viewport size\nagent-browser set device \"iPhone 14\"          # Emulate device\nagent-browser set geo 37.7749 -122.4194       # Set geolocation (alias: geolocation)\nagent-browser set offline on                  # Toggle offline mode\nagent-browser set headers ''{\"X-Key\":\"v\"}''     # Extra HTTP headers\nagent-browser set credentials user pass       # HTTP basic auth (alias: auth)\nagent-browser set media dark                  # Emulate color scheme\nagent-browser set media light reduced-motion  # Light mode + reduced motion\n```\n\n### Cookies & Storage\n\n```bash\nagent-browser cookies                     # Get all cookies\nagent-browser cookies set name value      # Set cookie\nagent-browser cookies clear               # Clear cookies\nagent-browser storage local               # Get all localStorage\nagent-browser storage local key           # Get specific key\nagent-browser storage local set k v       # Set value\nagent-browser storage local clear         # Clear all\n```\n\n### Network\n\n```bash\nagent-browser network route <url>              # Intercept requests\nagent-browser network route <url> --abort      # Block requests\nagent-browser network route <url> --body ''{}''  # Mock response\nagent-browser network unroute [url]            # Remove routes\nagent-browser network requests                 # View tracked requests\nagent-browser network requests --filter api    # Filter requests\n```\n\n### Tabs & Windows\n\n```bash\nagent-browser tab                 # List tabs\nagent-browser tab new [url]       # New tab\nagent-browser tab 2               # Switch to tab by index\nagent-browser tab close           # Close current tab\nagent-browser tab close 2         # Close tab by index\nagent-browser window new          # New window\n```\n\n### Frames\n\n```bash\nagent-browser frame \"#iframe\"     # Switch to iframe\nagent-browser frame main          # Back to main frame\n```\n\n### Dialogs\n\n```bash\nagent-browser dialog accept [text]  # Accept dialog\nagent-browser dialog dismiss        # Dismiss dialog\n```\n\n### JavaScript\n\n```bash\nagent-browser eval \"document.title\"   # Run JavaScript\n```\n\n## Global options\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --session <name> ...    # Isolated browser session\nagent-browser --json ...              # JSON output for parsing\nagent-browser --headed ...            # Show browser window (not headless)\nagent-browser --full ...              # Full page screenshot (-f)\nagent-browser --cdp <port> ...        # Connect via Chrome DevTools Protocol\nagent-browser -p <provider> ...       # Cloud browser provider (--provider)\nagent-browser --proxy <url> ...       # Use proxy server\nagent-browser --headers <json> ...    # HTTP headers scoped to URL''s origin\nagent-browser --executable-path <p>   # Custom browser executable\nagent-browser --extension <path> ...  # Load browser extension (repeatable)\nagent-browser --help                  # Show help (-h)\nagent-browser --version               # Show version (-V)\nagent-browser <command> --help        # Show detailed help for a command\n```\n\n### Proxy support\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --proxy http://proxy.com:8080 open example.com\nagent-browser --proxy http://user:pass@proxy.com:8080 open example.com\nagent-browser --proxy socks5://proxy.com:1080 open example.com\n```\n\n## Environment variables\n\n```bash\nAGENT_BROWSER_SESSION=\"mysession\"            # Default session name\nAGENT_BROWSER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=\"/path/chrome\" # Custom browser path\nAGENT_BROWSER_EXTENSIONS=\"/ext1,/ext2\"       # Comma-separated extension paths\nAGENT_BROWSER_PROVIDER=\"your-cloud-browser-provider\"  # Cloud browser provider (select browseruse or browserbase)\nAGENT_BROWSER_STREAM_PORT=\"9223\"             # WebSocket streaming port\nAGENT_BROWSER_HOME=\"/path/to/agent-browser\"  # Custom install location (for daemon.js)\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/form\nagent-browser snapshot -i\n# Output shows: textbox \"Email\" [ref=e1], textbox \"Password\" [ref=e2], button \"Submit\" [ref=e3]\n\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"user@example.com\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password123\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle\nagent-browser snapshot -i  # Check result\n```\n\n## Example: Authentication with saved state\n\n```bash\n# Login once\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/login\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"username\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"\nagent-browser state save auth.json\n\n# Later sessions: load saved state\nagent-browser state load auth.json\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/dashboard\n```\n\n## Sessions (parallel browsers)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --session test1 open site-a.com\nagent-browser --session test2 open site-b.com\nagent-browser session list\n```\n\n## JSON output (for parsing)\n\nAdd `--json` for machine-readable output:\n\n```bash\nagent-browser snapshot -i --json\nagent-browser get text @e1 --json\n```\n\n## Debugging\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --headed open example.com   # Show browser window\nagent-browser --cdp 9222 snapshot         # Connect via CDP port\nagent-browser connect 9222                # Alternative: connect command\nagent-browser console                     # View console messages\nagent-browser console --clear             # Clear console\nagent-browser errors                      # View page errors\nagent-browser errors --clear              # Clear errors\nagent-browser highlight @e1               # Highlight element\nagent-browser trace start                 # Start recording trace\nagent-browser trace stop trace.zip        # Stop and save trace\nagent-browser record start ./debug.webm   # Record video from current page\nagent-browser record stop                 # Save recording\n```\n\n## Deep-dive documentation\n\nFor detailed patterns and best practices, see:\n\n| Reference | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| [references/snapshot-refs.md](references/snapshot-refs.md) | Ref lifecycle, invalidation rules, troubleshooting |\n| [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md) | Parallel sessions, state persistence, concurrent scraping |\n| [references/authentication.md](references/authentication.md) | Login flows, OAuth, 2FA handling, state reuse |\n| [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md) | Recording workflows for debugging and documentation |\n| [references/proxy-support.md](references/proxy-support.md) | Proxy configuration, geo-testing, rotating proxies |\n\n## Ready-to-use templates\n\nExecutable workflow scripts for common patterns:\n\n| Template | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [templates/form-automation.sh](templates/form-automation.sh) | Form filling with validation |\n| [templates/authenticated-session.sh](templates/authenticated-session.sh) | Login once, reuse state |\n| [templates/capture-workflow.sh](templates/capture-workflow.sh) | Content extraction with screenshots |\n\nUsage:\n```bash\n./templates/form-automation.sh https://example.com/form\n./templates/authenticated-session.sh https://app.example.com/login\n./templates/capture-workflow.sh https://example.com ./output\n```\n\n## HTTPS Certificate Errors\n\nFor sites with self-signed or invalid certificates:\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://localhost:8443 --ignore-https-errors\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:49:16.472Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring interactive browser control and element manipulation","zh":"适用于需要交互式浏览器控制和元素操作的自动化代理","ja":"インタラクティブブラウザ制御と要素操作を必要とする自動化エージェントに適している","ko":"대화형 브라우저 제어 및 요소 조작이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización que requieren control y manipulación de elementos del navegador interactivo","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant un contrôle et une manipulation d''éléments de navigateur interactif","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine interaktive Browsersteuerung und Elementmanipulation erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que exigem controle interativo de navegador e manipulação de elementos","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, требующих интерактивного управления браузером и манипуляции элементами","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الآليين الذين يتطلبون التحكم التفاعلي في المتصفح وتصريف العناصر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using snapshot capabilities, enabling precise element selection and manipulation through refs, and supporting protocols like HTTP and HTTPS, with commands like ''open'', ''snapshot'', ''click'', and ''fill''","zh":"赋予代理通过快照功能自动化浏览器交互的能力，实现通过引用精确选择和操作元素，并支持HTTP和HTTPS等协议，包括''open''、''snapshot''、''click''和''fill''等命令","ja":"エージェントがスナップショット機能を使用してブラウザの相互作用を自動化できるようにし、参照を介して要素の選択と操作を可能にし、HTTPおよびHTTPSなどのプロトコルをサポートし、''open''、''snapshot''、''click''、''fill''などのコマンドを提供する","ko":"스냅샷 기능을 사용하여 브라우저 상호 작용을 자동화할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 참조를 통해 요소의 선택 및 조작을 가능하게 하며, HTTP 및 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 지원하며, ''open'', ''snapshot'', ''click'', ''fill''와 같은 명령을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las interacciones del navegador mediante capacidades de instantánea, lo que permite una selección y manipulación de elementos precisas a través de referencias, y soporta protocolos como HTTP y HTTPS, con comandos como ''abrir'', ''instantánea'', ''hacer clic'' y ''rellenar''","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions du navigateur en utilisant des fonctionnalités d''instantané, permettant une sélection et une manipulation d''éléments précises via des références, et prend en charge des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTTPS, avec des commandes comme ''ouvrir'', ''instantané'', ''cliquer'' et ''remplir''","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Browserinteraktionen mithilfe von Snapshot-Funktionen zu automatisieren, wodurch eine präzise Auswahl und Manipulation von Elementen über Referenzen ermöglicht wird, und unterstützt Protokolle wie HTTP und HTTPS, mit Befehlen wie ''öffnen'', ''Snapshot'', ''klicken'' und ''ausfüllen''","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações de navegador usando capacidades de instantâneo, permitindo a seleção e manipulação precisas de elementos por meio de referências, e suportando protocolos como HTTP e HTTPS, com comandos como ''abrir'', ''instantâneo'', ''clique'' e ''preencher''","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера с помощью возможностей создания снимков, обеспечивая точное выбирание и манипулирование элементами посредством ссылок, и поддерживая протоколы, такие как HTTP и HTTPS, с командами, такими как ''открыть'', ''создать снимок'', ''клик'' и ''заполнить''","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توفير تفاعلات المتصفح باستخدام قدرات اللقطة، مما يتيح اختيار العناصر بدقة وتصريفها من خلال المراجع، ودعم البروتوكولات مثل HTTP وHTTPS، والأوامر مثل ''فتح'' و ''لقطة'' و ''انقر'' و ''املأ''"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web form submissions","Debugging web application interactions","Generating snapshots of web pages for analysis"],"zh":["自动化网页表单提交","调试网页应用程序交互","为分析生成网页快照"],"ja":["Webフォームの提出を自動化する","Webアプリケーションの相互作用をデバッグする","分析のためのWebページのスナップショットを生成する"],"ko":["웹 폼 제출 자동화","웹 애플리케이션 상호 작용 디버깅","분석을 위한 웹 페이지 스냅샷 생성"],"es":["Automatización de envíos de formularios web","Depuración de interacciones de aplicaciones web","Generación de instantáneas de páginas web para análisis"],"fr":["Automatisation de soumissions de formulaires web","Débogage d''interactions d''applications web","Génération d''instantanés de pages web pour analyse"],"de":["Automatisierung von Webformulareingaben","Fehlerbehebung bei Webanwendungsinteraktionen","Erstellung von Snapshots von Webseiten für Analysezwecke"],"pt":["Automatizar envios de formulários da web","Depurar interações de aplicativos da web","Gerar snapshots de páginas da web para análise"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отправку веб-форм","Отлаживать взаимодействия веб-приложений","Генерировать снимки веб-страниц для анализа"],"ar":["توفير ارسال استمارات الويب","تصحيح اختراقات تطبيقات الويب","توليد لقطة من صفحات الويب للتحليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires browser instance access","Limited to HTTP and HTTPS protocols"],"zh":["需要浏览器实例访问","仅限HTTP和HTTPS协议"],"ja":["ブラウザインスタンスへのアクセスが必要","HTTPおよびHTTPSプロトコルのみ"],"ko":["브라우저 인스턴스 액세스가 필요","HTTP 및 HTTPS 프로토콜만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a instancias de navegador","Limitado a protocolos HTTP y HTTPS"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des instances de navigateur","Limité aux protocoles HTTP et HTTPS"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Browserinstanzen","Begrenzt auf HTTP- und HTTPS-Protokolle"],"pt":["Exige acesso a instância de navegador","Limitado a protocolos HTTP e HTTPS"],"ru":["Требует доступа к экземпляру браузера","Ограничен протоколами HTTP и HTTPS"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مثيل المتصفح","محدود ببروتوكولات HTTP وHTTPS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
