Three.js","React Three Fiber","animation","importation de ressources"],"de":["Remotion","Erstellung von Videos","Code in einem IDE-ähnlichen Fenster","Software-Entwicklung","Three.js","React Three Fiber","Animation","Import von Ressourcen"],"pt":["Remotion","vídeos interativos","código aberto","desenvolvedores","3D","animações","importação de recursos"],"ru":["Remotion","интерактивные видео","открытый код","разработчики","3D","анимации","импорт ресурсов"],"ar":["Remotion","مقاطع فيديو تفاعلية","كود مفتوح","مطوري البرامج","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الموارد"]}},"owner":"Lysak-AA","repo":"remotion-code-display","repoPath":"Lysak-AA/remotion-code-display","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/transparent-videos.md](rules/transparent-videos.md) - Rendering out a video with transparency\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:49:05.076Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing advanced Remotion capabilities for creating interactive code videos.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Remotion功能来创建交互式代码视频的视频生成代理。","ja":"高度なRemotion機能を使用してインタラクティブなコードビデオを作成する必要があるビデオ生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"인터랙티브 코드 비디오를 생성하기 위해 고급 Remotion 기능이 필요한 비디오 생성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de video que necesitan capacidades de Remotion avanzadas para crear videos de código interactivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de vidéos nécessitant des fonctionnalités Remotion avancées pour créer des vidéos de code interactives.","de":"Perfekt für Video-Generierungsagenten, die erweiterte Remotion-Funktionen für die Erstellung interaktiver Code-Videos benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que precisam de capacidades avançadas de Remotion para criar vídeos de código interativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации видео, которым требуются расширенные возможности Remotion для создания интерактивных видеороликов с кодом.","ar":"مثالي للعملاء الذين يحتاجون إلى وكيلات متقدمة لإنشاء مقاطع فيديو تفاعلية بالرموش"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality video content using Remotion, leveraging libraries like Three.js and React Three Fiber for 3D content and animations, while importing various assets such as images, videos, audio, and fonts.","zh":"赋予代理使用Remotion生成高质量的视频内容的能力，利用像Three.js和React Three Fiber这样的库进行3D内容和动画，同时导入各种资产，如图像、视频、音频和字体。","ja":"エージェントにRemotionを使用して高品質のビデオコンテンツを生成する能力を与え、Three.jsやReact Three Fiberなどのライブラリを使用して3Dコンテンツやアニメーションを作成し、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどの様々なアセットをインポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Remotion을 사용하여 고품질의 비디오 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Three.js 및 React Three Fiber와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 3D 콘텐츠 및 애니메이션을 생성하고, 이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 폰트 등의 다양한 자산을 가져옵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar contenido de video de alta calidad utilizando Remotion, aprovechando bibliotecas como Three.js y React Three Fiber para contenido 3D y animaciones, mientras importa varios activos como imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du contenu vidéo de haute qualité en utilisant Remotion, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme Three.js et React Three Fiber pour le contenu 3D et les animations, tout en important divers actifs tels que des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige Videoinhalte mit Remotion zu generieren, indem es Bibliotheken wie Three.js und React Three Fiber für 3D-Inhalte und Animationen nutzt und verschiedene Assets wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten importiert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar conteúdo de vídeo de alta qualidade usando Remotion, aproveitando bibliotecas como Three.js e React Three Fiber para conteúdo 3D e animações, enquanto importa vários ativos, como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать контент высокого качества, используя Remotion, и задействует такие библиотеки, как Three.js и React Three Fiber для 3D-контента и анимаций, а также импортирует различные активы, такие как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء محتوى فيديو عالي الجودة باستخدام الرموش، واستخدام المكتبات مثل Three.js و React Three Fiber لإنشاء محتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد والرسوم المتحركة، مع استيراد مختلف الأصول مثل الصور والفيديو والصوت والخطوط."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating video tutorials with animated code snippets","Creating interactive 3D models using Remotion and Three.js","Importing and utilizing various media assets in Remotion projects"],"zh":["生成带有动画代码片段的视频教程","使用Remotion和Three.js创建交互式3D模型","在Remotion项目中导入和利用各种媒体资产"],"ja":["アニメーション化されたコードスニペットを含むビデオチュートリアルの生成","RemotionとThree.jsを使用したインタラクティブな3Dモデルの作成","Remotionプロジェクトで様々なメディアアセットをインポートして利用"],"ko":["애니메이션 코드 조각을 포함하는 비디오 튜토리얼 생성","Remotion 및 Three.js를 사용한 인터랙티브 3D 모델 생성","Remotion 프로젝트에서 다양한 미디어 자산 가져오기 및 사용"],"es":["Generación de tutoriales de video con fragmentos de código animados","Creación de modelos 3D interactivos utilizando Remotion y Three.js","Importación y utilización de varios activos multimedia en proyectos de Remotion"],"fr":["Génération de didacticiels vidéo avec des extraits de code animés","Création de modèles 3D interactifs en utilisant Remotion et Three.js","Importation et utilisation de divers actifs multimédia dans les projets Remotion"],"de":["Erstellung von Video-Tutorials mit animierten Code-Snippets","Erstellung interaktiver 3D-Modelle mit Remotion und Three.js","Importieren und Nutzen verschiedener Medien-Assets in Remotion-Projekten"],"pt":["Gerar tutoriais de vídeo com trechos de código animados","Criar modelos 3D interativos usando Remotion e Three.js","Importar e utilizar vários ativos de mídia em projetos Remotion"],"ru":["Генерировать видео-уроки с анимированными фрагментами кода","Создавать интерактивные 3D-модели, используя Remotion и Three.js","Импортировать и использовать различные медиа-активы в проектах Remotion"],"ar":["إنشاء دروس فيديو مع شفرات متحركة","إنشاء نماذج ثلاثية الأبعاد تفاعلية باستخدام الرموش و Three.js","استيراد واستخدام مختلف الأصول الإعلامية في مشاريع الرموش"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion code and .md file input","Limited to Remotion-specific use cases"],"zh":["需要Remotion代码和.md文件输入","仅限Remotion特定用例"],"ja":["Remotionコードと.mdファイルの入力が必要","Remotion特有のユースケースに限定される"],"ko":["Remotion 코드 및 .md 파일 입력이 필요","Remotion 특정 사용 사례에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entrada de código Remotion y archivo .md","Limitado a casos de uso específicos de Remotion"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de code Remotion et un fichier .md","Limité à des cas d''utilisation spécifiques à Remotion"],"de":["Benötigt Remotion-Code- und .md-Dateieingabe","Begrenzt auf Remotion-spezifische Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Requer entrada de código Remotion e arquivo .md","Limitado a casos de uso específicos de Remotion"],"ru":["Требует ввода кода Remotion и файла .md","Ограничен конкретными случаями использования Remotion"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال رمز الرموش وملف .md","محدود لحالات استخدام الرموش المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2/openspec-archive-change', 'community', 'gAmUssA', 'vscode-open-in-marked2', 'gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2', 'openspec-archive-change', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z', '2026-02-18T11:49:12.067Z', NULL, '{"id":"gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2/openspec-archive-change","name":"openspec-archive-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change 是一个 VS Code 扩展，用于在 Marked 2 中打开 Markdown 和 AsciiDoc 文件。它可以归档实验工作流中的完成更改","ja":"openspec-archive-change は、Marked 2 で Markdown および AsciiDoc ファイルを開くための VS Code 拡張機能です。実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブできます","ko":"openspec-archive-change는 Marked 2에서 Markdown 및 AsciiDoc 파일을 여는 VS Code 확장입니다. 실험 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경을 아카이브할 수 있습니다","es":"La extensión openspec-archive-change para VS Code permite abrir archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc en Marked 2","fr":"L''extension openspec-archive-change pour VS Code permet d''ouvrir des fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc dans Marked 2","de":"Die Erweiterung openspec-archive-change für VS Code ermöglicht das Öffnen von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien in Marked 2","pt":"A extensão openspec-archive-change é uma ferramenta para arquivar alterações no fluxo de trabalho experimental do VS Code. Ela permite que os desenvolvedores gerenciem suas alterações de forma eficiente.","ru":"Расширение openspec-archive-change — это инструмент для архивации изменений в экспериментальном рабочем процессе VS Code. Он позволяет разработчикам эффективно управлять своими изменениями.","ar":"ممتد openspec-archive-change هو أداة لأرشفة التغييرات في تدفق العمل التجريبي لبرنامج VS Code. يسمح للمطورين بإدارة تغييراتهم بفعالية.","en":"VS Code extension to open Markdown and AsciiDoc files in Marked 2"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change：VS Code 扩展","ja":"openspec-archive-change：VS Code 拡張機能","ko":"openspec-archive-change: VS Code 확장","es":"Extensión d