scription":{"zh":"品牌设计师技能帮助您创建统一的品牌形象、Logo和视觉品牌系统，提升品牌识别度","ja":"ブランドデザイナースキルは、広告のためのブランドアイデンティティ、ロゴ、視覚ブランドシステムを作成","ko":"브랜드 디자이너 기술은 일관된 브랜드 정체성, 로고 및 시각적 브랜드 시스템을 생성하여 브랜드 이미지를 향상","es":"El diseñador de marca crea identidades visuales coherentes y materiales de marketing para empresas.","fr":"Le concepteur de marque crée des identités visuelles cohérentes et des matériaux de marketing pour les entreprises.","de":"Der Marken-Designer erstellt kohärente visuelle Identitäten und Marketingmaterialien für Unternehmen.","pt":"O designer de marca ajuda a criar identidades visuais coerentes, logotipos e sistemas de marca. Fornece soluções para identidade de marca, ativos visuais e e...","ru":"Бренд-дизайнер помогает создать сплоченные визуальные идентичности, логотипы и бренд-системы. Предоставляет решения для бренд-идентичности, визуальных активо...","ar":"مصمم العلامة التجارية يساعد في إنشاء هوية بصرية متسقة، شعارات وأنظمة العلامة التجارية. يوفر حلولاً للهوية العلامة التجارية، الأصول البصرية وстратегية العلامة...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["品牌识别设计","Logo设计","视觉品牌系统","品牌策略","目标受众定义","竞争对手分析"],"ja":["ブランドアイデンティティ設計","ロゴ設計","視覚ブランドシステム","ブランド戦略","ターゲットオーディエンス定義","競合他社分析"],"ko":["브랜드 정체성 디자인","로고 디자인","시각적 브랜드 시스템","브랜드 전략","타겟 오디언스 정의","경쟁사 분석"],"es":["Diseño de logotipos y variaciones","Paletas de colores y sistemas tipográficos","Materiales de marketing y presentaciones de marca","Análisis de competidores y definición de la voz y el tono de la marca","Diseño de tarjetas de presentación y papel con membrete","Plantillas de redes sociales"],"fr":["Conception de logotypes et variations","Palettes de couleurs et systèmes typographiques","Matériaux de marketing et présentations de marque","Analyse des concurrents et définition de la voix et du ton de la marque","Conception de cartes de visite et papier à en-tête","Modèles de réseaux sociaux"],"de":["Erstellung von Logos und Variationen","Farbpaletten und Typografiesysteme","Marketingmaterialien und Markenpräsentationen","Wettbewerbsanalyse und Definition der Markenstimme und -ton","Erstellung von Visitenkarten und Briefpapier","Social-Media-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Criação de logotipos e variações","Desenvolvimento de paletas de cores","Criação de sistemas de tipografia","Desenvolvimento de guias de marca","Criação de materiais de marketing"],"ru":["Создание логотипов и их вариаций","Разработка цветовых палитр","Создание систем типографики","Разработка руководств по бренду","Создание маркетинговых материалов"],"ar":["تصميم الشعارات والتصاميم المتغيرة","إنشاء التصاميم اللونية","تصميم أنظمة الطباعة","تطوير دليل العلامة التجارية","تصميم مواد التسويق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["品牌设计","品牌识别","Logo设计","视觉品牌系统","品牌策略","目标受众定义","竞争对手分析","品牌设计师"],"ja":["ブランドデザイン","ブランドアイデンティティ","ロゴデザイン","視覚ブランドシステム","ブランド戦略","ターゲットオーディエンス定義","競合他社分析","ブランドデザイナー"],"ko":["브랜드 디자인","브랜드 정체성","로고 디자인","시각적 브랜드 시스템","브랜드 전략","타겟 오디언스 정의","경쟁사 분석","브랜드 디자이너"],"es":["diseñador de marca","identidad visual","logotipo","materiales de marketing","marca empresarial","diseño de marca","estrategia de marca","voz y tono de la marca","análisis de competidores"],"fr":["concepteur de marque","identité visuelle","logotype","matériaux de marketing","marque entreprise","conception de marque","stratégie de marque","voix et ton de la marque","analyse des concurrents"],"de":["Marken-Designer","visuelle Identität","Logo","Marketingmaterialien","Unternehmensmarke","Marken-Design","Markenstrategie","Markenstimme und -ton","Wettbewerbsanalyse"],"pt":["designer de marca","identidade visual","logotipo","paleta de cores","sistema de tipografia","guia de marca","materiais de marketing"],"ru":["бренд-дизайнер","визуальная идентичность","логотип","цветовая палитра","система типографики","руководство по бренду","маркетинговые материалы"],"ar":["مصمم العلامة التجارية","الهوية البصرية","الشعار","التصميم اللوني","نظام الطباعة","دليل العلامة التجارية","مواد التسويق"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"brand-designer","description":"Expert in brand identity, logo design, and visual brand systems","version":"1.0.0","tags":["branding","logo-design","identity","visual-identity","brand-guidelines"],"bodyPreview":"# Brand Designer Skill\n\nI help you create cohesive brand identities, logos, and visual brand systems.\n\n## What I Do\n\n**Brand Identity:**\n\n- Logo design and variations\n- Color palettes\n- Typography systems\n- Brand guidelines\n\n**Visual Assets:**\n\n- Business cards, letterheads\n- Social media templates\n- Marketing materials\n- Brand presentation decks\n\n**Brand Strategy:**\n\n- Brand positioning\n- Target audience definition\n- Competitor analysis\n- Brand voice and tone\n\n## Logo Design Process\n\n### Step 1","body":"# Brand Designer Skill\n\nI help you create cohesive brand identities, logos, and visual brand systems.\n\n## What I Do\n\n**Brand Identity:**\n\n- Logo design and variations\n- Color palettes\n- Typography systems\n- Brand guidelines\n\n**Visual Assets:**\n\n- Business cards, letterheads\n- Social media templates\n- Marketing materials\n- Brand presentation decks\n\n**Brand Strategy:**\n\n- Brand positioning\n- Target audience definition\n- Competitor analysis\n- Brand voice and tone\n\n## Logo Design Process\n\n### Step 1: Brand Discovery\n\n**Questions to Answer:**\n\n- What does the company do?\n- Who is the target audience?\n- What are the brand values?\n- What feeling should the logo evoke?\n- Any colors/symbols to avoid?\n\n**Example Brief:**\n\n```markdown\n## Brand Brief: TechStart\n\n**Industry:** SaaS, developer tools\n**Target Audience:** Software developers, 25-40 years old\n**Brand Values:** Innovation, simplicity, reliability\n**Personality:** Modern, technical, approachable\n**Competitors:** GitHub, GitLab, Vercel\n\n**Logo Requirements:**\n\n- Works in monochrome\n- Scales from 16px (favicon) to billboard\n- Modern, not trendy (should age well)\n- Unique, memorable\n```\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Logo Concepts\n\n**Concept 1: Wordmark**\n\n```\nClean, modern typography\nFocus on the company name\nExample: Google, Facebook, Netflix\n```\n\n**Concept 2: Lettermark**\n\n```\nInitials in a distinctive way\nGood for long company names\nExample: IBM, HBO, CNN\n```\n\n**Concept 3: Icon + Wordmark**\n\n```\nSymbol + company name\nMost versatile option\nExample: Nike, Apple, Twitter\n```\n\n**Example SVG Logo (React Component):**\n\n```typescript\n// components/brand/Logo.tsx\n\ninterface LogoProps {\n  variant?: ''full'' | ''icon'' | ''wordmark''\n  color?: ''primary'' | ''white'' | ''black''\n  size?: number\n}\n\nexport function Logo({ variant = ''full'', color = ''primary'', size = 40 }: LogoProps) {\n  const colors = {\n    primary: ''#0066CC'',\n    white: ''#FFFFFF'',\n    black: ''#000000''\n  }\n\n  const fillColor = colors[color]\n\n  if (variant === ''icon'') {\n    return (\n      <svg width={size} height={size} viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\">\n        <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"18\" fill={fillColor} />\n        <path\n          d=\"M15 20 L25 15 L25 25 Z\"\n          fill=\"white\"\n        />\n      </svg>\n    )\n  }\n\n  if (variant === ''wordmark'') {\n    return (\n      <svg width={size * 4} height={size} viewBox=\"0 0 160 40\" fill=\"none\">\n        <text\n          x=\"0\"\n          y=\"30\"\n          fontFamily=\"Inter, sans-serif\"\n          fontSize=\"24\"\n          fontWeight=\"700\"\n          fill={fillColor}\n        >\n          TechStart\n        </text>\n      </svg>\n    )\n  }\n\n  // Full logo (icon + wordmark)\n  return (\n    <svg width={size * 5} height={size} viewBox=\"0 0 200 40\" fill=\"none\">\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"18\" fill={fillColor} />\n      <path d=\"M15 20 L25 15 L25 25 Z\" fill=\"white\" />\n      <text\n        x=\"50\"\n        y=\"30\"\n        fontFamily=\"Inter, sans-serif\"\n        fontSize=\"24\"\n        fontWeight=\"700\"\n        fill={fillColor}\n      >\n        TechStart\n      </text>\n    </svg>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n\n```typescript\n// Different logo variations\n<Logo variant=\"full\" />\n<Logo variant=\"icon\" size={32} />\n<Logo variant=\"wordmark\" color=\"white\" />\n```\n\n---\n\n## Color Palette\n\n### Primary Brand Colors\n\n```typescript\n// config/brand-colors.ts\n\nexport const brandColors = {\n  // Primary (main brand color)\n  primary: {\n    50: ''#E6F0FF'',\n    100: ''#CCE0FF'',\n    200: ''#99C2FF'',\n    300: ''#66A3FF'',\n    400: ''#3385FF'',\n    500: ''#0066CC'', // Main brand color\n    600: ''#0052A3'',\n    700: ''#003D7A'',\n    800: ''#002952'',\n    900: ''#001429''\n  },\n\n  // Secondary (accent color)\n  secondary: {\n    50: ''#FFF4E6'',\n    100: ''#FFE9CC'',\n    200: ''#FFD399'',\n    300: ''#FFBD66'',\n    400: ''#FFA733'',\n    500: ''#FF9100'', // Main accent\n    600: ''#CC7400'',\n    700: ''#995700'',\n    800: ''#663A00'',\n    900: ''#331D00''\n  },\n\n  // Neutral (grays)\n  neutral: {\n    50: ''#F9FAFB'',\n    100: ''#F3F4F6'',\n    200: ''#E5E7EB'',\n    300: ''#D1D5DB'',\n    400: ''#9CA3AF'',\n    500: ''#6B7280'',\n    600: ''#4B5563'',\n    700: ''#374151'',\n    800: ''#1F2937'',\n    900: ''#111827''\n  },\n\n  // Semantic colors\n  success: ''#10B981'',\n  warning: ''#F59E0B'',\n  error: ''#EF4444'',\n  info: ''#3B82F6''\n}\n```\n\n### Color Usage Guidelines\n\n```typescript\n// Tailwind config\nmodule.exports = {\n  theme: {\n    colors: {\n      primary: brandColors.primary,\n      secondary: brandColors.secondary,\n      gray: brandColors.neutral,\n      green: brandColors.success\n      // ...\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Color Palette Documentation:**\n\n```markdown\n## Brand Colors\n\n### Primary Blue (#0066CC)\n\n- **Use for:** Primary buttons, links, active states, brand elements\n- **Don''t use for:** Backgrounds, large areas\n- **Accessibility:** Passes WCAG AA for text on white\n\n### Secondary Orange (#FF9100)\n\n- **Use for:** CTAs, highlights, important actions\n- **Don''t use for:** Body text\n- **Pairing:** Works best with primary blue\n\n### Neutral Grays\n\n- **Use for:** Text, borders, backgrounds, UI elements\n- **Hierarchy:**\n  - 900: Headings\n  - 700: Body text\n  - 500: Secondary text\n  - 300: Borders\n  - 100: Backgrounds\n```\n\n---\n\n## Typography System\n\n### Font Selection\n\n```css\n/* Google Fonts import */\n@import url(''https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap'');\n\n:root {\n  /* Font families */\n  --font-sans: ''Inter'', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ''Segoe UI'', sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: ''JetBrains Mono'', ''Courier New'', monospace;\n\n  /* Font sizes */\n  --text-xs: 0.75rem; /* 12px */\n  --text-sm: 0.875rem; /* 14px */\n  --text-base: 1rem; /* 16px */\n  --text-lg: 1.125rem; /* 18px */\n  --text-xl: 1.25rem; /* 20px */\n  --text-2xl: 1.5rem; /* 24px */\n  --text-3xl: 1.875rem; /* 30px */\n  --text-4xl: 2.25rem; /* 36px */\n  --text-5xl: 3rem; /* 48px */\n\n  /* Font weights */\n  --font-normal: 400;\n  --font-medium: 500;\n  --font-semibold: 600;\n  --font-bold: 700;\n\n  /* Line heights */\n  --leading-tight: 1.25;\n  --leading-normal: 1.5;\n  --leading-relaxed: 1.75;\n}\n```\n\n**Typography Scale:**\n\n```typescript\n// components/Typography.tsx\n\nexport function Heading1({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return (\n    <h1 className=\"text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-gray-900\">\n      {children}\n    </h1>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function Heading2({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return (\n    <h2 className=\"text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-gray-900\">\n      {children}\n    </h2>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function BodyText({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return (\n    <p className=\"text-base font-normal leading-normal text-gray-700\">\n      {children}\n    </p>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function Caption({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return (\n    <p className=\"text-sm font-normal leading-normal text-gray-500\">\n      {children}\n    </p>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Brand Guidelines Document\n\n### Creating brand-guidelines.md\n\n```markdown\n# TechStart Brand Guidelines\n\n## Logo Usage\n\n### Logo Variations\n\n- **Full Logo**: Use on marketing materials, website header\n- **Icon Only**: Use for app icon, favicon, social media avatars\n- **Wordmark**: Use when icon doesn''t fit context\n\n### Clear Space\n\nMaintain clear space around logo equal to height of the \"T\" in TechStart\n\n### Minimum Size\n\n- **Digital**: 120px width (full logo), 40px (icon)\n- **Print**: 1 inch width (full logo), 0.25 inch (icon)\n\n### Don''ts\n\n❌ Don''t rotate the logo\n❌ Don''t change colors (except approved variations)\n❌ Don''t add effects (shadows, gradients, etc.)\n❌ Don''t distort or stretch\n\n---\n\n## Color Palette\n\n### Primary Colors\n\n- **Brand Blue**: #0066CC\n  - RGB: 0, 102, 204\n  - CMYK: 100, 50, 0, 20\n- **Accent Orange**: #FF9100\n  - RGB: 255, 145, 0\n  - CMYK: 0, 43, 100, 0\n\n### Usage\n\n- Primary buttons, links: Brand Blue\n- CTAs, highlights: Accent Orange\n- Backgrounds: Neutral grays\n\n---\n\n## Typography\n\n### Fonts\n\n- **Headings**: Inter Bold (700)\n- **Body**: Inter Regular (400)\n- **Code**: JetBrains Mono Regular (400)\n\n### Hierarchy\n\n- H1: 48px / Bold / Tight leading\n- H2: 36px / Semibold / Tight leading\n- Body: 16px / Regular / Normal leading\n- Caption: 14px / Regular / Normal leading\n\n---\n\n## Voice & Tone\n\n### Brand Personality\n\n- **Professional** but not corporate\n- **Technical** but approachable\n- **Innovative** but reliable\n\n### Writing Style\n\n- Use active voice\n- Be concise and clear\n- Avoid jargon (unless technical docs)\n- Use \"we\" and \"you\" (not \"I\" or \"one\")\n\n### Examples\n\n✅ \"Deploy your app in seconds\"\n❌ \"Applications can be deployed quickly\"\n\n✅ \"We built this for developers like you\"\n❌ \"This product was designed for developer users\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Social Media Templates\n\n### Profile Image (SVG Template)\n\n```typescript\n// templates/SocialProfileImage.tsx\n\nexport function SocialProfileImage() {\n  return (\n    <svg width=\"400\" height=\"400\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\">\n      {/* Background */}\n      <rect width=\"400\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0066CC\" />\n\n      {/* Logo (centered) */}\n      <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"120\" fill=\"white\" />\n      <path\n        d=\"M160 200 L240 160 L240 240 Z\"\n        fill=\"#0066CC\"\n      />\n    </svg>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Social Media Post Template\n\n```typescript\n// templates/SocialPost.tsx\n\ninterface SocialPostProps {\n  title: string\n  description: string\n  imageUrl?: string\n}\n\nexport function SocialPost({ title, description, imageUrl }: SocialPostProps) {\n  return (\n    <svg width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 630\">\n      {/* Background gradient */}\n      <defs>\n        <linearGradient id=\"bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\n          <stop offset=\"0%\" stopColor=\"#0066CC\" />\n          <stop offset=\"100%\" stopColor=\"#003D7A\" />\n        </linearGradient>\n      </defs>\n      <rect width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" fill=\"url(#bg)\" />\n\n      {/* Content */}\n      <text\n        x=\"60\"\n        y=\"200\"\n        fontSize=\"60\"\n        fontWeight=\"700\"\n        fill=\"white\"\n        fontFamily=\"Inter\"\n      >\n        {title}\n      </text>\n      <text\n        x=\"60\"\n        y=\"270\"\n        fontSize=\"32\"\n        fill=\"#CCE0FF\"\n        fontFamily=\"Inter\"\n      >\n        {description}\n      </text>\n\n      {/* Logo */}\n      <Logo variant=\"icon\" size={60} color=\"white\" />\n    </svg>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Business Card Design\n\n```typescript\n// templates/BusinessCard.tsx\n\ninterface BusinessCardProps {\n  name: string\n  title: string\n  email: string\n  phone: string\n}\n\nexport function BusinessCard({ name, title, email, phone }: BusinessCardProps) {\n  return (\n    <svg width=\"350\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 350 200\">\n      {/* Front side */}\n      <rect width=\"350\" height=\"200\" fill=\"white\" />\n\n      {/* Logo */}\n      <Logo variant=\"full\" size={30} />\n\n      {/* Contact info */}\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"120\" fontSize=\"20\" fontWeight=\"700\" fill=\"#111827\">\n        {name}\n      </text>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"145\" fontSize=\"14\" fill=\"#6B7280\">\n        {title}\n      </text>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"170\" fontSize=\"12\" fill=\"#6B7280\">\n        {email}\n      </text>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"185\" fontSize=\"12\" fill=\"#6B7280\">\n        {phone}\n      </text>\n    </svg>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Brand Asset Management\n\n### File Organization\n\n```\nbrand-assets/\n├── logo/\n│   ├── svg/\n│   │   ├── logo-full.svg\n│   │   ├── logo-icon.svg\n│   │   └── logo-wordmark.svg\n│   ├── png/\n│   │   ├── logo-full@1x.png\n│   │   ├── logo-full@2x.png\n│   │   └── logo-full@3x.png\n│   └── favicon/\n│       ├── favicon-16x16.png\n│       ├── favicon-32x32.png\n│       └── favicon.ico\n├── colors/\n│   └── palette.json\n├── fonts/\n│   ├── Inter-Regular.woff2\n│   ├── Inter-Bold.woff2\n│   └── JetBrainsMono-Regular.woff2\n├── templates/\n│   ├── social-profile.svg\n│   ├── social-post.svg\n│   └── business-card.svg\n└── guidelines/\n    └── brand-guidelines.pdf\n```\n\n---\n\n## Favicon Generation\n\n```typescript\n// scripts/generate-favicons.ts\n\nimport sharp from ''sharp''\nimport fs from ''fs''\n\nasync function generateFavicons() {\n  const sizes = [16, 32, 48, 64, 128, 256]\n\n  for (const size of sizes) {\n    await sharp(''logo-icon.svg'')\n      .resize(size, size)\n      .png()\n      .toFile(`public/favicon-${size}x${size}.png`)\n\n    console.log(`Generated ${size}x${size} favicon`)\n  }\n\n  console.log(''Favicons generated!'')\n}\n\ngenerateFavicons()\n```\n\n**Favicon HTML:**\n\n```html\n<!-- In layout/head -->\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/favicon-16x16.png\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicon-32x32.png\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\" />\n```\n\n---\n\n## When to Use Me\n\n**Perfect for:**\n\n- Creating new brand identities\n- Designing logos and visual systems\n- Building brand guidelines\n- Creating marketing templates\n- Ensuring brand consistency\n\n**I''ll help you:**\n\n- Design memorable logos\n- Create cohesive color palettes\n- Build typography systems\n- Generate brand assets\n- Document brand guidelines\n\n## What I''ll Create\n\n```\n🎨 Logo Designs (SVG)\n🌈 Color Palettes\n📝 Typography Systems\n📄 Brand Guidelines\n🖼️ Social Media Templates\n💼 Business Cards\n```\n\nLet''s build a strong, cohesive brand identity!\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:50:02.139Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Agents needing advanced visual brand system capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级视觉品牌系统能力的创意代理","ja":"高度なビジュアルブランドシステムの機能が必要なクリエイティブエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 시각적 브랜드 시스템 기능이 필요한 크리에이티브 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes creativos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de sistema de marca visual.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents créatifs ayant besoin de capacités avancées de système de marque visuel.","de":"Perfekt für kreative Agenten, die erweiterte visuelle Markensystemfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Criativos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de sistema de marca visual.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Креативных Агентов, которым необходимы передовые возможности визуальной системы бренда.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإبداعيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لنظام العلامة التجارية البصرية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate cohesive brand identities, logos, and visual brand systems using typography systems, color palettes, and brand guidelines, while leveraging brand strategy techniques like brand positioning, target audience definition, and competitor analysis.","zh":"赋予代理商使用打字系统、颜色调色板和品牌指南等技术生成统一的品牌识别、标志和视觉品牌系统的能力，同时利用品牌战略技术，如品牌定位、目标受众定义和竞争对手分析","ja":"タイポグラフィーシステム、カラーパレット、ブランドガイドラインなどの技術を使用して一貫したブランドアイデンティティ、ロゴ、ビジュアルブランドシステムを生成するエージェントをEmpowerし、ブランド戦略技術 seperti ブランドポジショニング、ターゲットオーディエンス定義、競合他社分析を活用する","ko":"타이포그래피 시스템, 색상 팔레트, 브랜드 가이드ライン 등을 사용하여 일관된 브랜드 아이덴티티, 로고, 시각적 브랜드 시스템을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하며, 브랜드 전략 기술인 브랜드 포지셔닝, 목표 대상 정의, 경쟁사 분석 등을 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes generar identidades de marca coherentes, logotipos y sistemas de marca visual utilizando sistemas de tipografía, paletas de colores y directrices de marca, al mismo tiempo que aprovechan técnicas de estrategia de marca como la posición de marca, la definición de la audiencia objetivo y el análisis de la competencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des identités de marque cohérentes, des logos et des systèmes de marque visuelle en utilisant des systèmes de typographie, des palettes de couleurs et des directives de marque, tout en exploitant des techniques de stratégie de marque comme la positionnement de marque, la définition du public cible et l''analyse de la concurrence.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, kohärente Markenidentitäten, Logos und visuelle Markensysteme unter Verwendung von Typografiesystemen, Farbpaletten und Marktanleitungen zu generieren, während sie Markenstrategietechniken wie Markenpositionierung, Zielgruppendefinition und Wettbewerbsanalyse nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar identidades de marca coesas, logotipos e sistemas de marca visual usando sistemas de tipografia, paletas de cores e diretrizes de marca, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita técnicas de estratégia de marca como posicionamento de marca, definição de público-alvo e análise de concorrentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать целостные идентичности бренда, логотипы и визуальные системы бренда с помощью типографских систем, цветовых палитр и руководств по бренду, а также использовать техники стратегии бренда, такие как позиционирование бренда, определение целевой аудитории и анализ конкурентов.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء هوية العلامة التجارية المتسقة والشعارات ونظم العلامة التجارية البصرية باستخدام أنظمة الطباعة الحرفية ولوحات الألوان وإرشادات العلامة التجارية، في الوقت نفسه الاستفادة من تقنيات استراتيجية العلامة التجارية مثل vị trí العلامة التجارية وتصريف جمهور الهدف وتحليل المنافسين."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing consistent social media templates","Creating professional business cards and letterheads","Developing brand presentation decks with unique brand voices and tones"],"zh":["设计一致的社交媒体模板","创建专业的商业卡片和信头","开发具有独特品牌声音和语气的品牌演示文稿"],"ja":["一貫したソーシャルメディアテンプレートを設計する","プロフェッショナルなビジネスカードとレターヘッドを作成する","独自のブランドボイスとトーンを持つブランドプレゼンテーションデッキを開発する"],"ko":["일관된 소셜 미디어 템플릿을 설계","전문적인 비즈니스 카드와 레터헤드를 생성","고유한 브랜드 보이스와 톤을 가진 브랜드 프레젠테이션 덱을 개발"],"es":["Diseñar plantillas de redes sociales coherentes","Crear tarjetas de presentación y membrete de empresa profesional","Desarrollar presentaciones de marca con voces y tonos de marca únicos"],"fr":["Concevoir des modèles de réseaux sociaux cohérents","Créer des cartes de visite et des en-têtes de lettre professionnels","Développer des présentations de marque avec des voix et des tons de marque uniques"],"de":["Konsistente Social-Media-Vorlagen entwerfen","Professionelle Visitenkarten und Briefbögen erstellen","Markenpräsentationen mit einzigartigen Markenstimmen und -tönen entwickeln"],"pt":["Projetar modelos de mídia social consistentes","Criar cartões de visita e papel timbrado profissionais","Desenvolver decks de apresentação de marca com vozes e tons de marca únicos"],"ru":["Разрабатывать последовательные шаблоны социальных сетей","Создавать профессиональные визитные карточки и бланки","Разрабатывать презентационные материалы бренда с уникальными голосами и тонами бренда"],"ar":["تصميم قوالب وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية المتسقة","إنشاء بطاقات أعمال وورق رسمي محترف","تطوير عروض تقديمية للعلامة التجارية بأصوات وأطوار فريدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires design expertise","Output limited to 2D visual assets","No 3D modeling or animation capabilities"],"zh":["需要设计专业知识","输出仅限于2D视觉资产","没有3D建模或动画功能"],"ja":["デザインの専門知識が必要","出力は2Dビジュアルアセットに限定される","3Dモデリングまたはアニメーションの機能がない"],"ko":["디자인 전문 지식이 필요","출력은 2D 시각적 자산으로 제한","3D 모델링 또는 애니메이션 기능 없음"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en diseño","La salida está limitada a activos visuales 2D","No hay capacidades de modelado 3D o animación"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en conception","La sortie est limitée aux actifs visuels 2D","Pas de capacités de modélisation 3D ou d''animation"],"de":["Benötigt Design-Expertise","Ausgabe beschränkt auf 2D-Bildmaterial","Keine 3D-Modellierungs- oder Animationsfunktionen"],"pt":["Exige expertise em design","Saída limitada a ativos visuais 2D","Sem capacidades de modelagem ou animação 3D"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в области дизайна","Выход ограничен двумерными визуальными активами","Нет возможностей трехмерного моделирования или анимации"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في التصميم","الخرج محدود بالassets البصرية ثنائية الأبعاد","لا يوجد قدرات على نمذجة أو تحريك 3D"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
