 pour leur situation spé...","de":"Der marketing-ideas-Skill bietet 139 bewährte Marketingstrategien, um den Nutzern zu helfen, die besten Taktiken für ihre spezifische Situation zu finden","pt":"Encontre as estratégias de marketing certas para o seu negócio de SaaS com base em seu estágio e recursos.","ru":"Найдите правильные маркетинговые стратегии для вашего бизнеса SaaS на основе его этапа и ресурсов.","ar":"ابحث عن الاستراتيجيات التسويقية المناسبة ل业务ك في برامج الخدمة بناءً على مرحلته وموارده.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["139","SaaS","API","SDK",""],"ja":["139","SaaS","API","SDK",""],"ko":["139","SaaS","API","SDK",""],"es":["139 ideas de marketing probadas","Estrategias personalizadas para cada situación","Contexto de marketing para productos","Información específica para cada tarea","Ayuda para encontrar las mejores tácticas de marketing"],"fr":["139 idées de marketing éprouvées","Stratégies personnalisées pour chaque situation","Contexte de marketing pour les produits","Informations spécifiques pour chaque tâche","Aide pour trouver les meilleures tactiques de marketing"],"de":["139 bewährte Marketingideen","Maßgeschneiderte Strategien für jede Situation","Marketingkontext für Produkte","Spezifische Informationen für jede Aufgabe","Hilfe bei der Suche nach den besten Marketingtaktiken"],"pt":["139 ideias de marketing comprovadas","Estratégias personalizadas para cada estágio do negócio","Otimização de recursos para maximizar a conversão","Análise de contextos de marketing de produto","Recomendações de marketing baseadas em recursos disponíveis"],"ru":["139 проверенных маркетинговых идей","Индивидуальные стратегии для каждого этапа бизнеса","Оптимизация ресурсов для максимизации конверсии","Анализ контекстов маркетинга продукта","Рекомендации по маркетингу на основе доступных ресурсов"],"ar":["139 فكرة تسويقية مثبتة","استراتيجيات مخصصة لكل مرحلة من مراحل العمل","تحسين الموارد لزيادة التحويل","تحليل سياقات تسويق المنتج","توصيات تسويقية بناءً على الموارد المتاحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SaaS","API","SDK","","139","SaaS"],"ja":["SaaS","API","SDK","","139","SaaS"],"ko":["SaaS","API","SDK","","139","SaaS"],"es":["marketing para saas","ideas de marketing","estrategias de marketing","marketing digital","negocios de saas","marketing en línea"],"fr":["marketing pour les logiciels en tant que service","idées de marketing","stratégies de marketing","marketing numérique","entreprises de logiciels en tant que service","marketing en ligne"],"de":["marketing für saas-unternehmen","marketingideen","marketingstrategien","digitales marketing","saas-unternehmen","online-marketing"],"pt":["ideias de marketing para SaaS","estratégias de marketing para software como serviço","marketing de produto para SaaS","otimização de recursos para SaaS","conversão de vendas para SaaS","desenvolvimento de negócios de SaaS"],"ru":["маркетинговые идеи для SaaS","маркетинговые стратегии для программного обеспечения как услуги","маркетинг продукта для SaaS","оптимизация ресурсов для SaaS","конверсия продаж для SaaS","развитие бизнеса SaaS"],"ar":["افكار تسويقية لبرامج الخدمة","استراتيجيات تسويقية لبرامج الخدمة","تسويق المنتج لبرامج الخدمة","تحسين الموارد لبرامج الخدمة","تحويل المبيعات لبرامج الخدمة","تنمية أعمال برامج الخدمة"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"marketing-ideas","description":"When the user needs marketing ideas, inspiration, or strategies for their SaaS or software product. Also use when the user asks for marketing ideas, growth ideas, how to market, marketing strategies, marketing tactics, ways to promote, or ideas to grow. This skill provides 139 proven marketing approaches organized by category.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Marketing Ideas for SaaS\n\nYou are a marketing strategist with a library of 139 proven marketing ideas. Your goal is to help users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources.\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nWhen asked for marketing ideas","body":"# Marketing Ideas for SaaS\n\nYou are a marketing strategist with a library of 139 proven marketing ideas. Your goal is to help users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources.\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nWhen asked for marketing ideas:\n1. Ask about their product, audience, and current stage if not clear\n2. Suggest 3-5 most relevant ideas based on their context\n3. Provide details on implementation for chosen ideas\n4. Consider their resources (time, budget, team size)\n\n---\n\n## Ideas by Category (Quick Reference)\n\n| Category | Ideas | Examples |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| Content & SEO | 1-10 | Programmatic SEO, Glossary marketing, Content repurposing |\n| Competitor | 11-13 | Comparison pages, Marketing jiu-jitsu |\n| Free Tools | 14-22 | Calculators, Generators, Chrome extensions |\n| Paid Ads | 23-34 | LinkedIn, Google, Retargeting, Podcast ads |\n| Social & Community | 35-44 | LinkedIn audience, Reddit marketing, Short-form video |\n| Email | 45-53 | Founder emails, Onboarding sequences, Win-back |\n| Partnerships | 54-64 | Affiliate programs, Integration marketing, Newsletter swaps |\n| Events | 65-72 | Webinars, Conference speaking, Virtual summits |\n| PR & Media | 73-76 | Press coverage, Documentaries |\n| Launches | 77-86 | Product Hunt, Lifetime deals, Giveaways |\n| Product-Led | 87-96 | Viral loops, Powered-by marketing, Free migrations |\n| Content Formats | 97-109 | Podcasts, Courses, Annual reports, Year wraps |\n| Unconventional | 110-122 | Awards, Challenges, Guerrilla marketing |\n| Platforms | 123-130 | App marketplaces, Review sites, YouTube |\n| International | 131-132 | Expansion, Price localization |\n| Developer | 133-136 | DevRel, Certifications |\n| Audience-Specific | 137-139 | Referrals, Podcast tours, Customer language |\n\n**For the complete list with descriptions**: See [references/ideas-by-category.md](references/ideas-by-category.md)\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Tips\n\n### By Stage\n\n**Pre-launch:**\n- Waitlist referrals (#79)\n- Early access pricing (#81)\n- Product Hunt prep (#78)\n\n**Early stage:**\n- Content & SEO (#1-10)\n- Community (#35)\n- Founder-led sales (#47)\n\n**Growth stage:**\n- Paid acquisition (#23-34)\n- Partnerships (#54-64)\n- Events (#65-72)\n\n**Scale:**\n- Brand campaigns\n- International (#131-132)\n- Media acquisitions (#73)\n\n### By Budget\n\n**Free:**\n- Content & SEO\n- Community building\n- Social media\n- Comment marketing\n\n**Low budget:**\n- Targeted ads\n- Sponsorships\n- Free tools\n\n**Medium budget:**\n- Events\n- Partnerships\n- PR\n\n**High budget:**\n- Acquisitions\n- Conferences\n- Brand campaigns\n\n### By Timeline\n\n**Quick wins:**\n- Ads, email, social posts\n\n**Medium-term:**\n- Content, SEO, community\n\n**Long-term:**\n- Brand, thought leadership, platform effects\n\n---\n\n## Top Ideas by Use Case\n\n### Need Leads Fast\n- Google Ads (#31) - High-intent search\n- LinkedIn Ads (#28) - B2B targeting\n- Engineering as Marketing (#15) - Free tool lead gen\n\n### Building Authority\n- Conference Speaking (#70)\n- Book Marketing (#104)\n- Podcasts (#107)\n\n### Low Budget Growth\n- Easy Keyword Ranking (#1)\n- Reddit Marketing (#38)\n- Comment Marketing (#44)\n\n### Product-Led Growth\n- Viral Loops (#93)\n- Powered By Marketing (#87)\n- In-App Upsells (#91)\n\n### Enterprise Sales\n- Investor Marketing (#133)\n- Expert Networks (#57)\n- Conference Sponsorship (#72)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen recommending ideas, provide for each:\n\n- **Idea name**: One-line description\n- **Why it fits**: Connection to their situation\n- **How to start**: First 2-3 implementation steps\n- **Expected outcome**: What success looks like\n- **Resources needed**: Time, budget, skills required\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current stage and main growth goal?\n2. What''s your marketing budget and team size?\n3. What have you already tried that worked or didn''t?\n4. What competitor tactics do you admire?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For scaling SEO content (#4)\n- **competitor-alternatives**: For comparison pages (#11)\n- **email-sequence**: For email marketing tactics\n- **free-tool-strategy**: For engineering as marketing (#15)\n- **referral-program**: For viral growth (#93)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:50:12.743Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude and AutoGPT needing access to a vast library of proven marketing strategies for SaaS products.","zh":"适用于Claude和AutoGPT等AI代理，需要访问大量已验证的SaaS产品营销策略库。","ja":"ClaudeやAutoGPTのようなAIエージェントが、広範なマーケティング戦略ライブラリにアクセスする必要があるSaaS製品に最適です。","ko":"클라우드와 AutoGPT 같은 AI 에이전트가 대규모 검증된 마케팅 전략 라이브러리에 액세스해야 하는 SaaS 제품에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude y AutoGPT que necesitan acceso a una vasta biblioteca de estrategias de marketing probadas para productos SaaS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude et AutoGPT qui ont besoin d''accéder à une vaste bibliothèque de stratégies de marketing éprouvées pour les produits SaaS.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten wie Claude und AutoGPT, die Zugang zu einer umfassenden Bibliothek mit bewährten Marketingstrategien für SaaS-Produkte benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude e AutoGPT que precisam acessar uma vasta biblioteca de estratégias de marketing comprovadas para produtos SaaS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude и AutoGPT, которым требуется доступ к огромной библиотеке проверенных маркетинговых стратегий для продуктов SaaS.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات الوكلاء الذكية مثل Claude و AutoGPT التي تحتاج إلى الوصول إلى مكتبة شاملة من استراتيجيات التسويق المثبتة لمنتجات SaaS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to suggest tailored marketing ideas using product marketing context, analyzing specific situations, stages, and resources, and leveraging a library of 139 proven marketing concepts to drive business growth through effective SaaS marketing strategies.","zh":"赋予代理商使用产品营销背景建议量身定制的营销创意的能力，分析特定情况、阶段和资源，并利用139个已验证的营销概念来驱动业务增长，通过有效的SaaS营销策略。","ja":"エージェントに、製品マーケティングのコンテキストを使用して、特定の状況、段階、リソースを分析し、139の検証済みマーケティング概念を活用して、効果的なSaaSマーケティング戦略を通じてビジネス成長を促進するためのカスタマイズされたマーケティングアイデアを提案する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 사용하여 특정 상황, 단계 및 리소스를 분석하고 139개의 검증된 마케팅 개념을 활용하여 효과적인 SaaS 마케팅 전략을 통해 비즈니스 성장을 추진하기 위한 맞춤형 마케팅 아이디어를 제안할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes sugerir ideas de marketing personalizadas utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos, analizando situaciones, etapas y recursos específicos, y aprovechando una biblioteca de 139 conceptos de marketing probados para impulsar el crecimiento empresarial a través de estrategias de marketing de SaaS efectivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suggérer des idées de marketing personnalisées en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits, en analysant des situations, des étapes et des ressources spécifiques, et en exploitant une bibliothèque de 139 concepts de marketing éprouvés pour stimuler la croissance commerciale grâce à des stratégies de marketing SaaS efficaces.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, maßgeschneiderte Marketingideen mithilfe des Produktmarketing-Kontexts vorzuschlagen, indem sie spezifische Situationen, Stadien und Ressourcen analysieren und eine Bibliothek mit 139 bewährten Marketingkonzepten nutzen, um das Geschäftswachstum durch effektive SaaS-Marketingstrategien voranzutreiben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a sugerir ideias de marketing personalizadas usando o contexto de marketing de produtos, analisando situações específicas, estágios e recursos, e utilizando uma biblioteca de 139 conceitos de marketing comprovados para impulsionar o crescimento dos negócios por meio de estratégias de marketing de SaaS eficazes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам предлагать индивидуальные маркетинговые идеи, используя контекст маркетинга продукта, анализируя конкретные ситуации, стадии и ресурсы, и используя библиотеку из 139 проверенных маркетинговых концепций для стимулирования бизнес-роста за счет эффективных стратегий маркетинга SaaS.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من اقتراح أفكار تسويقية مخصصة باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج، وتحليل حالات ومراحل وموارد محددة، والاستفادة من مكتبة تحتوي على 139 مفهوم تسويقي مثبت لتعزيز نمو الأعمال من خلال استراتيجيات تسويق SaaS فعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating targeted SaaS marketing campaigns","Analyzing product marketing context for informed strategy","Suggesting resource-specific marketing tactics for SaaS businesses"],"zh":["生成针对性的SaaS营销活动","分析产品营销背景以制定明智的策略","为SaaS业务建议特定资源的营销策略"],"ja":["ターゲットを絞ったSaaSマーケティングキャンペーンを生成する","製品マーケティングのコンテキストを分析して情報に基づいた戦略を立てる","SaaSビジネス向けの特定のリソースを使用したマーケティング戦術を提案する"],"ko":["대상별 SaaS 마케팅 캠페인을 생성합니다","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 분석하여 정보에基づいた 전략을 수립합니다","SaaS 비즈니스용 특정 리소스에 대한 마케팅 전략을 제안합니다"],"es":["Generación de campañas de marketing de SaaS dirigidas","Análisis del contexto de marketing de productos para una estrategia informada","Sugerencia de tácticas de marketing específicas de recursos para empresas de SaaS"],"fr":["Génération de campagnes de marketing SaaS ciblées","Analyse du contexte de marketing de produits pour une stratégie éclairée","Suggestion de tactiques de marketing spécifiques aux ressources pour les entreprises SaaS"],"de":["Erstellung gezielter SaaS-Marketingkampagnen","Analyse des Produktmarketing-Kontexts für eine informierte Strategie","Vorschlag von ressourcenspezifischen Marketingtaktiken für SaaS-Unternehmen"],"pt":["Geração de campanhas de marketing de SaaS direcionadas","Análise do contexto de marketing de produtos para estratégia informada","Sugestão de táticas de marketing específicas de recursos para empresas SaaS"],"ru":["Генерация целевых кампаний маркетинга SaaS","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта для информированной стратегии","Предложение тактик маркетинга, специфичных для ресурсов, для бизнеса SaaS"],"ar":["توليد حملات تسويقية لمنتجات SaaS مستهدفة","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج من أجل استراتيجية مستنيرة","اقتراح تكتيكات تسويقية محددة للموارد لأعمال SaaS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for optimal performance","Limited to SaaS marketing ideas"],"zh":["需要访问`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`以获得最佳性能","仅限SaaS营销创意"],"ja":["最適なパフォーマンスを得るために`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`にアクセスする必要がある","SaaSマーケティングアイデアに限定される"],"ko":["최적의 성능을 얻으려면 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`에 액세스해야 합니다","SaaS 마케팅 아이디어로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para un rendimiento óptimo","Limitado a ideas de marketing de SaaS"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour des performances optimales","Limité aux idées de marketing SaaS"],"de":["Benötigt Zugang zu `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für optimale Leistung","Begrenzt auf SaaS-Marketingideen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para desempenho ótimo","Limitado a ideias de marketing de SaaS"],"ru":["Требует доступа к `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для оптимальной производительности","Ограничен идеями маркетинга SaaS"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` للأداء الأمثل","محدود بأفكار التسويق لمنتجات SaaS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
