e impulsan decisiones y acciones. Aprende a presentar análisis de manera efectiva","fr":"Transformez les données en récits qui stimulent la prise de décision et l''action. Apprenez à présenter des analyses de manière efficace","de":"Verwandle Rohdaten in überzeugende Erzählungen, die Entscheidungen und Aktionen beeinflussen. Lernen Sie, Analysen effektiv zu präsentieren","pt":"O data-storytelling é uma habilidade que transforma dados em narrativas que impulsionam decisões e inspiram ação.","ru":"История данных - это навык, который преобразует данные в повествования, которые стимулируют принятие решений и вдохновляют на действие.","ar":"سرد القصص البيانية هو مهارة تحول البيانات إلى قصص تدفع القرارات وتلهم العمل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["呈现分析结果","创建季度商业审查","撰写数据驱动的报告","传达信息和驱动决策","使用故事结构"],"ja":["分析結果の提示","四半期のビジネスレビューの作成","データドリブンのレポートの作成","情報の伝達と意思決定の促進","ストーリー構造の使用"],"ko":["분석 결과 제시","분기별 비즈니스 리뷰 작성","데이터드린 보고서 작성","정보 전달과 결정에 영향을 미치기","이야기 구조 사용"],"es":["Estructura de historia","Presentación de análisis a ejecutivos","Creación de informes trimestrales","Comunicación de información a audiencias no técnicas","Toma de decisiones basada en datos","Creación de presentaciones para inversores"],"fr":["Structure de l''histoire","Présentation d''analyses aux dirigeants","Création de rapports trimestriels","Communication d''informations à des auditoires non techniques","Prise de décision basée sur des données","Création de présentations pour les investisseurs"],"de":["Erzählstruktur","Präsentation von Analysen an Führungskräfte","Erstellung von Quartalsberichten","Kommunikation von Informationen an nicht-technische Zielgruppen","Entscheidungsfindung basierend auf Daten","Erstellung von Präsentationen für Investoren"],"pt":["Estrutura de história","Análise de dados","Apresentação de resultados","Comunicação de insights","Criação de relatórios","Tomada de decisões"],"ru":["Структура истории","Анализ данных","Презентация результатов","Обмен инсайтами","Создание отчетов","Принятие решений"],"ar":["هيكل القصة","تحليل البيانات","عرض النتائج","تبادل الاطلاعات","إنشاء التقارير","اتخاذ القرارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据故事讲述","数据分析","商业智能","数据可视化","故事结构","数据驱动的决策"],"ja":["データストーリーテリング","データ分析","ビジネスインテリジェンス","データビジュアライゼーション","ストーリー構造","データドリブンの意思決定"],"ko":["데이터 스토리텔링","데이터 분석","비즈니스 인텔리전스","데이터 비주얼라이제이션","이야기 구조","데이터드린 결정"],"es":["narración de datos","análisis de datos","presentación de análisis","informes basados en datos","comunicación de información","toma de decisiones","dataviz","visualización de datos","storytelling de datos"],"fr":["storytelling de données","analyse de données","présentation d''analyses","rapports basés sur des données","communication d''informations","prise de décision","dataviz","visualisation de données","récit de données"],"de":["datenstorytelling","datenanalyse","präsentation von analysen","datenbasierte berichte","kommunikation von informationen","entscheidungsfindung","dataviz","datenvisualisierung","erzählung von daten"],"pt":["data-storytelling","análise de dados","apresentação de resultados","comunicação de insights","criação de relatórios","tomada de decisões","visualização de dados","business intelligence"],"ru":["история данных","анализ данных","презентация результатов","обмен инсайтами","создание отчетов","принятие решений","визуализация данных","бизнес-аналитика"],"ar":["سرد القصص البيانية","تحليل البيانات","عرض النتائج","تبادل الاطلاعات","إنشاء التقارير","اتخاذ القرارات","تصوير البيانات","استخبارات الأعمال"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"data-storytelling","description":"Transform data into compelling narratives using visualization, context, and persuasive structure. Use when presenting analytics to stakeholders, creating data reports, or building executive presentations.","bodyPreview":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Presenting analytics to executives\n- Creating quarterly business reviews\n- Building investor presentations\n- Writing data-driven reports\n- Communicating insights to non-technical audiences\n- Making recommendations based on data\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Story Structure\n\n```\nSetup → Conflict → Resolution\n\nSetup: Context and baseline\nConflict: The problem or opp","body":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Presenting analytics to executives\n- Creating quarterly business reviews\n- Building investor presentations\n- Writing data-driven reports\n- Communicating insights to non-technical audiences\n- Making recommendations based on data\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Story Structure\n\n```\nSetup → Conflict → Resolution\n\nSetup: Context and baseline\nConflict: The problem or opportunity\nResolution: Insights and recommendations\n```\n\n### 2. Narrative Arc\n\n```\n1. Hook: Grab attention with surprising insight\n2. Context: Establish the baseline\n3. Rising Action: Build through data points\n4. Climax: The key insight\n5. Resolution: Recommendations\n6. Call to Action: Next steps\n```\n\n### 3. Three Pillars\n\n| Pillar        | Purpose  | Components                       |\n| ------------- | -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Data**      | Evidence | Numbers, trends, comparisons     |\n| **Narrative** | Meaning  | Context, causation, implications |\n| **Visuals**   | Clarity  | Charts, diagrams, highlights     |\n\n## Story Frameworks\n\n### Framework 1: The Problem-Solution Story\n\n```markdown\n# Customer Churn Analysis\n\n## The Hook\n\n\"We''re losing $2.4M annually to preventable churn.\"\n\n## The Context\n\n- Current churn rate: 8.5% (industry average: 5%)\n- Average customer lifetime value: $4,800\n- 500 customers churned last quarter\n\n## The Problem\n\nAnalysis of churned customers reveals a pattern:\n\n- 73% churned within first 90 days\n- Common factor: < 3 support interactions\n- Low feature adoption in first month\n\n## The Insight\n\n[Show engagement curve visualization]\nCustomers who don''t engage in the first 14 days\nare 4x more likely to churn.\n\n## The Solution\n\n1. Implement 14-day onboarding sequence\n2. Proactive outreach at day 7\n3. Feature adoption tracking\n\n## Expected Impact\n\n- Reduce early churn by 40%\n- Save $960K annually\n- Payback period: 3 months\n\n## Call to Action\n\nApprove $50K budget for onboarding automation.\n```\n\n### Framework 2: The Trend Story\n\n```markdown\n# Q4 Performance Analysis\n\n## Where We Started\n\nQ3 ended with $1.2M MRR, 15% below target.\nTeam morale was low after missed goals.\n\n## What Changed\n\n[Timeline visualization]\n\n- Oct: Launched self-serve pricing\n- Nov: Reduced friction in signup\n- Dec: Added customer success calls\n\n## The Transformation\n\n[Before/after comparison chart]\n| Metric | Q3 | Q4 | Change |\n|----------------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Trial → Paid | 8% | 15% | +87% |\n| Time to Value | 14 days| 5 days | -64% |\n| Expansion Rate | 2% | 8% | +300% |\n\n## Key Insight\n\nSelf-serve + high-touch creates compound growth.\nCustomers who self-serve AND get a success call\nhave 3x higher expansion rate.\n\n## Going Forward\n\nDouble down on hybrid model.\nTarget: $1.8M MRR by Q2.\n```\n\n### Framework 3: The Comparison Story\n\n```markdown\n# Market Opportunity Analysis\n\n## The Question\n\nShould we expand into EMEA or APAC first?\n\n## The Comparison\n\n[Side-by-side market analysis]\n\n### EMEA\n\n- Market size: $4.2B\n- Growth rate: 8%\n- Competition: High\n- Regulatory: Complex (GDPR)\n- Language: Multiple\n\n### APAC\n\n- Market size: $3.8B\n- Growth rate: 15%\n- Competition: Moderate\n- Regulatory: Varied\n- Language: Multiple\n\n## The Analysis\n\n[Weighted scoring matrix visualization]\n\n| Factor      | Weight | EMEA Score | APAC Score |\n| ----------- | ------ | ---------- | ---------- |\n| Market Size | 25%    | 5          | 4          |\n| Growth      | 30%    | 3          | 5          |\n| Competition | 20%    | 2          | 4          |\n| Ease        | 25%    | 2          | 3          |\n| **Total**   |        | **2.9**    | **4.1**    |\n\n## The Recommendation\n\nAPAC first. Higher growth, less competition.\nStart with Singapore hub (English, business-friendly).\nEnter EMEA in Year 2 with localization ready.\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n\n- Timezone coverage: Hire 24/7 support\n- Cultural fit: Local partnerships\n- Payment: Multi-currency from day 1\n```\n\n## Visualization Techniques\n\n### Technique 1: Progressive Reveal\n\n```markdown\nStart simple, add layers:\n\nSlide 1: \"Revenue is growing\" [single line chart]\nSlide 2: \"But growth is slowing\" [add growth rate overlay]\nSlide 3: \"Driven by one segment\" [add segment breakdown]\nSlide 4: \"Which is saturating\" [add market share]\nSlide 5: \"We need new segments\" [add opportunity zones]\n```\n\n### Technique 2: Contrast and Compare\n\n```markdown\nBefore/After:\n┌─────────────────┬─────────────────┐\n│ BEFORE │ AFTER │\n│ │ │\n│ Process: 5 days│ Process: 1 day │\n│ Errors: 15% │ Errors: 2% │\n│ Cost: $50/unit │ Cost: $20/unit │\n└─────────────────┴─────────────────┘\n\nThis/That (emphasize difference):\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ CUSTOMER A vs B │\n│ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ │\n│ │ ████████ │ │ ██ │ │\n│ │ $45,000 │ │ $8,000 │ │\n│ │ LTV │ │ LTV │ │\n│ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ │\n│ Onboarded No onboarding │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Technique 3: Annotation and Highlight\n\n```python\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport pandas as pd\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 6))\n\n# Plot the main data\nax.plot(dates, revenue, linewidth=2, color=''#2E86AB'')\n\n# Add annotation for key events\nax.annotate(\n    ''Product Launch\\n+32% spike'',\n    xy=(launch_date, launch_revenue),\n    xytext=(launch_date, launch_revenue * 1.2),\n    fontsize=10,\n    arrowprops=dict(arrowstyle=''->'', color=''#E63946''),\n    color=''#E63946''\n)\n\n# Highlight a region\nax.axvspan(growth_start, growth_end, alpha=0.2, color=''green'',\n           label=''Growth Period'')\n\n# Add threshold line\nax.axhline(y=target, color=''gray'', linestyle=''--'',\n           label=f''Target: ${target:,.0f}'')\n\nax.set_title(''Revenue Growth Story'', fontsize=14, fontweight=''bold'')\nax.legend()\n```\n\n## Presentation Templates\n\n### Template 1: Executive Summary Slide\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  KEY INSIGHT                                                │\n│  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════│\n│                                                             │\n│  \"Customers who complete onboarding in week 1              │\n│   have 3x higher lifetime value\"                           │\n│                                                             │\n├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                      │                                      │\n│  THE DATA            │  THE IMPLICATION                     │\n│                      │                                      │\n│  Week 1 completers:  │  ✓ Prioritize onboarding UX         │\n│  • LTV: $4,500       │  ✓ Add day-1 success milestones     │\n│  • Retention: 85%    │  ✓ Proactive week-1 outreach        │\n│  • NPS: 72           │                                      │\n│                      │  Investment: $75K                    │\n│  Others:             │  Expected ROI: 8x                    │\n│  • LTV: $1,500       │                                      │\n│  • Retention: 45%    │                                      │\n│  • NPS: 34           │                                      │\n│                      │                                      │\n└──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Template 2: Data Story Flow\n\n```\nSlide 1: THE HEADLINE\n\"We can grow 40% faster by fixing onboarding\"\n\nSlide 2: THE CONTEXT\nCurrent state metrics\nIndustry benchmarks\nGap analysis\n\nSlide 3: THE DISCOVERY\nWhat the data revealed\nSurprising finding\nPattern identification\n\nSlide 4: THE DEEP DIVE\nRoot cause analysis\nSegment breakdowns\nStatistical significance\n\nSlide 5: THE RECOMMENDATION\nProposed actions\nResource requirements\nTimeline\n\nSlide 6: THE IMPACT\nExpected outcomes\nROI calculation\nRisk assessment\n\nSlide 7: THE ASK\nSpecific request\nDecision needed\nNext steps\n```\n\n### Template 3: One-Page Dashboard Story\n\n```markdown\n# Monthly Business Review: January 2024\n\n## THE HEADLINE\n\nRevenue up 15% but CAC increasing faster than LTV\n\n## KEY METRICS AT A GLANCE\n\n┌────────┬────────┬────────┬────────┐\n│ MRR │ NRR │ CAC │ LTV │\n│ $125K │ 108% │ $450 │ $2,200 │\n│ ▲15% │ ▲3% │ ▲22% │ ▲8% │\n└────────┴────────┴────────┴────────┘\n\n## WHAT''S WORKING\n\n✓ Enterprise segment growing 25% MoM\n✓ Referral program driving 30% of new logos\n✓ Support satisfaction at all-time high (94%)\n\n## WHAT NEEDS ATTENTION\n\n✗ SMB acquisition cost up 40%\n✗ Trial conversion down 5 points\n✗ Time-to-value increased by 3 days\n\n## ROOT CAUSE\n\n[Mini chart showing SMB vs Enterprise CAC trend]\nSMB paid ads becoming less efficient.\nCPC up 35% while conversion flat.\n\n## RECOMMENDATION\n\n1. Shift $20K/mo from paid to content\n2. Launch SMB self-serve trial\n3. A/B test shorter onboarding\n\n## NEXT MONTH''S FOCUS\n\n- Launch content marketing pilot\n- Complete self-serve MVP\n- Reduce time-to-value to < 7 days\n```\n\n## Writing Techniques\n\n### Headlines That Work\n\n```markdown\nBAD: \"Q4 Sales Analysis\"\nGOOD: \"Q4 Sales Beat Target by 23% - Here''s Why\"\n\nBAD: \"Customer Churn Report\"\nGOOD: \"We''re Losing $2.4M to Preventable Churn\"\n\nBAD: \"Marketing Performance\"\nGOOD: \"Content Marketing Delivers 4x ROI vs. Paid\"\n\nFormula:\n[Specific Number] + [Business Impact] + [Actionable Context]\n```\n\n### Transition Phrases\n\n```markdown\nBuilding the narrative:\n• \"This leads us to ask...\"\n• \"When we dig deeper...\"\n• \"The pattern becomes clear when...\"\n• \"Contrast this with...\"\n\nIntroducing insights:\n• \"The data reveals...\"\n• \"What surprised us was...\"\n• \"The inflection point came when...\"\n• \"The key finding is...\"\n\nMoving to action:\n• \"This insight suggests...\"\n• \"Based on this analysis...\"\n• \"The implication is clear...\"\n• \"Our recommendation is...\"\n```\n\n### Handling Uncertainty\n\n```markdown\nAcknowledge limitations:\n• \"With 95% confidence, we can say...\"\n• \"The sample size of 500 shows...\"\n• \"While correlation is strong, causation requires...\"\n• \"This trend holds for [segment], though [caveat]...\"\n\nPresent ranges:\n• \"Impact estimate: $400K-$600K\"\n• \"Confidence interval: 15-20% improvement\"\n• \"Best case: X, Conservative: Y\"\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Start with the \"so what\"** - Lead with insight\n- **Use the rule of three** - Three points, three comparisons\n- **Show, don''t tell** - Let data speak\n- **Make it personal** - Connect to audience goals\n- **End with action** - Clear next steps\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t data dump** - Curate ruthlessly\n- **Don''t bury the insight** - Front-load key findings\n- **Don''t use jargon** - Match audience vocabulary\n- **Don''t show methodology first** - Context, then method\n- **Don''t forget the narrative** - Numbers need meaning\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Storytelling with Data (Cole Nussbaumer)](https://www.storytellingwithdata.com/)\n- [The Pyramid Principle (Barbara Minto)](https://www.amazon.com/Pyramid-Principle-Logic-Writing-Thinking/dp/0273710516)\n- [Resonate (Nancy Duarte)](https://www.duarte.com/resonate/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:50:09.805Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Analytics Agents needing advanced data visualization and narrative capabilities to drive business decisions.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据可视化和叙述能力的分析代理，以驱动商业决策。","ja":"高度なデータ可視化と物語的能力を必要とする分析エージェントに最適で、ビジネス上の意思決定を促進する。","ko":"고급 데이터 시각화와 내러티브 기능이 필요한 분석 에이전트에게 적합하며, 비즈니스 의사 결정을 주도한다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos avanzados y narrativas para impulsar decisiones comerciales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse ayant besoin de capacités de visualisation de données avancées et de capacités narratives pour prendre des décisions commerciales.","de":"Perfekt für Analytics-Agents, die erweiterte Datenvisualisierungs- und Erzählungsfähigkeiten benötigen, um Geschäftsentscheidungen zu treffen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise que necessitam de visualização de dados avançada e capacidades narrativas para impulsionar decisões de negócios.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Аналитики, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации данных и повествовательные способности для принятия деловых решений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليليين الذين يحتاجون إلى تعرض بيانات متقدم وقدرات سردية لتشغيل قرارات الأعمال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform raw data into compelling narratives using story structure and conflict resolution techniques, driving decisions and inspiring action with data-driven reports and presentations in formats like CSV, JSON, and PDF.","zh":"赋予代理人将原始数据转化为有力的故事的能力，利用故事结构和冲突解决技术，驱动决策，并以数据驱动的报告和演示文稿（如CSV、JSON和PDF格式）激发行动。","ja":"エージェントに生データを説得力のある物語に変換する能力を与え、物語の構造と葛藤解決技術を使用して意思決定を促進し、データ駆動のレポートやプレゼンテーション（CSV、JSON、PDF形式など）で行動を促す。","ko":"에이전트가 원시 데이터를 설득력 있는 내러티브로 변환할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 이야기 구조와 갈등 해결 기술을 사용하여 의사 결정을 주도하고 데이터 驅動 보고서 및 프레젠테이션(CSV, JSON, PDF 형식 등)을 통해 행동을 이끌어냅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar datos crudos en narrativas convincentes utilizando técnicas de estructura de historias y resolución de conflictos, impulsando decisiones e inspirando acciones con informes y presentaciones basados en datos en formatos como CSV, JSON y PDF.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les données brutes en récits convaincants en utilisant des techniques de structure d''histoire et de résolution de conflits, en impulsant les décisions et en inspirant l''action avec des rapports et des présentations basés sur les données au format CSV, JSON et PDF.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, rohe Daten in überzeugende Erzählungen umzuwandeln, indem sie Techniken der Geschichtsstruktur und Konfliktlösung verwenden, um Entscheidungen zu treffen und mit datengetriebenen Berichten und Präsentationen im CSV-, JSON- und PDF-Format zu handeln.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar dados brutos em narrativas convincentes usando estrutura de história e técnicas de resolução de conflitos, impulsionando decisões e inspirando ação com relatórios e apresentações baseados em dados nos formatos como CSV, JSON e PDF.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать сырые данные в убедительные нарративы с помощью структуры истории и техник разрешения конфликтов, стимулируя принятие решений и вдохновляя действие с отчетами и презентациями, основанными на данных, в форматах seperti CSV, JSON и PDF.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحويل البيانات الخام إلى قصص مقنعة باستخدام هيكل القصة وأساليب حل النزاعات، مما يدفع القرارات ويلهم الإجراءات بالتقارير والمتحدثات التي تعتمد على البيانات والمنسقة مثل CSV و JSON و PDF."},"useCases":{"en":["Presenting analytics to executives with clear data storytelling","Generating quarterly business reviews with actionable insights","Creating investor presentations with data-driven narratives"],"zh":["向高管呈现具有清晰数据故事的分析","使用可行的见解生成季度商业审查","创建具有数据驱动内러티브的投资者演示文稿"],"ja":["エグゼクティブに明確なデータ物語を伴う分析を提示する","実行可能な洞察を使用して四半期のビジネスレビューを生成する","データ駆動の物語を伴う投資家向けプレゼンテーションを作成する"],"ko":["경영진에게 명확한 데이터 스토리를 갖춘 분석을 제시","실行 가능한 통찰력을 사용하여 분기별 비즈니스 리뷰를 생성","데이터 驱動 내러티브를 갖춘 투자자 프레젠테이션을 생성"],"es":["Presentar análisis a ejecutivos con historias de datos claras","Generar revisiones comerciales trimestrales con conocimientos accionables","Crear presentaciones para inversores con narrativas basadas en datos"],"fr":["Présenter des analyses aux dirigeants avec des histoires de données claires","Générer des examens d''entreprise trimestriels avec des connaissances actionnables","Créer des présentations pour les investisseurs avec des récits basés sur les données"],"de":["Analyse an Führungskräfte mit klaren Datenstorys präsentieren","Quartalsgeschäftsprüfungen mit handhabbaren Erkenntnissen generieren","Präsentationen für Investoren mit datengetriebenen Erzählungen erstellen"],"pt":["Apresentar análises para executivos com uma história de dados clara","Gerar revisões trimestrais de negócios com insights ação","Criar apresentações para investidores com narrativas baseadas em dados"],"ru":["Представление аналитики руководству с ясным рассказом о данных","Генерация квартальных обзоров бизнеса с действенными идеями","Создание презентаций для инвесторов с нарративами на основе данных"],"ar":["تقديم تحليلات للمدراء التنفيذيين مع سرد بيانات واضح","توليد استعراضات ربع سنوية للأعمال مع أفكار عمل","إنشاء عروض تقديمية للمستثمرين مع قصص تعتمد على البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to raw data sources","Limited to non-technical audience communication","Setup and conflict resolution techniques require domain expertise"],"zh":["需要访问原始数据源","仅限于非技术受众的沟通","设置和冲突解决技术需要领域专业知识"],"ja":["生データソースへのアクセスが必要","非技術的なオーディエンスとのコミュニケーションに限定される","セットアップと葛藤解決技術にはドメインの専門知識が必要"],"ko":["원시 데이터 소스에 대한 액세스가 필요","비 기술적 대상자와의 커뮤니케이션에 제한","설정 및 갈등 해결 기술에는 도메인 전문 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a fuentes de datos crudos","Limitado a la comunicación con una audiencia no técnica","La configuración y las técnicas de resolución de conflictos requieren experiencia en el dominio"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux sources de données brutes","Limité à la communication avec un public non technique","La configuration et les techniques de résolution de conflits nécessitent une expertise dans 