g der Zielgruppe","Verbesserung der Marke"],"pt":["Entender o contexto da história da marca","Encontrar a história central da marca","Estruturar a narrativa da marca","Inspiração de 30 líderes de produto e especialistas em storytelling","Técnicas para criar histórias de marca memoráveis"],"ru":["Понимание контекста бренд-истории","Поиск центральной истории бренда","Структуризация бренд-нарратива","Вдохновение от 30 лидеров продукта и экспертов по рассказыванию историй","Техники создания запоминающихся бренд-историй"],"ar":["فهم السياق لقصة العلامة التجارية","العثور على القصة المركزية للعلامة التجارية","هيكلة سرد القصة للعلامة التجارية","الإلهام من 30 قائدا في المنتج وخبيري في سرد القصص","تقنيات لإنشاء قصص علامة تجارية محفورة في الذاكرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["品牌故事讲述","品牌记忆","营销手法","故事讲述","品牌价值","品牌使命"],"ja":["ブランドストーリーテリング","ブランド記憶","マーケティング手法","ストーリーテリング","ブランド価値","ブランドミッション"],"ko":["브랜드 스토리텔링","브랜드 기억","마케팅 手法","스토리텔링","브랜드 가치","브랜드 미션"],"es":["storytelling de marca","narrativa efectiva","creación de historias","marca memorable","inspiración de la audiencia","técnica de narrativa","líderes de producto","expertos en narrativa","desarrollo de marca"],"fr":["storytelling de marque","narration efficace","création d''histoires","marque mémorable","inspiration du public","technique de narration","leaders de produit","experts en narration","développement de marque"],"de":["Markenstorytelling","effektive Erzählung","Erstellung von Geschichten","unvergessliche Marke","Inspirierung der Zielgruppe","Erzähltechnik","Produktleiter","Erzähl-Experten","Markenentwicklung"],"pt":["contar histórias de marca","storytelling de marca","narrativas de marca","marca memorável","técnicas de storytelling","líderes de produto","especialistas em storytelling"],"ru":["бренд-с.storyтеллинг","искусство рассказывания историй","бренд-истории","запоминающиеся бренды","техники рассказывания историй","лидеры продукта","эксперты по рассказыванию историй"],"ar":["سرد القصص العلامة التجارية","فن سرد القصص","قصص العلامة التجارية","علامات تجارية محفورة في الذاكرة","تقنيات سرد القصص","قادة المنتج","خبراء في سرد القصص"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"brand-storytelling","description":"Help users craft compelling brand narratives. Use when someone is defining brand strategy, writing company positioning, creating pitch narratives, developing messaging frameworks, or trying to make their company story more memorable.","bodyPreview":"# Brand Storytelling\n\nHelp the user craft compelling narratives that make their brand memorable using techniques from 30 product leaders and storytelling experts.\n\n## How to Help\n\nWhen the user asks for help with brand storytelling:\n\n1. **Understand the context** - Ask who the audience is (investors, customers, employees) and what action they want to inspire\n2. **Find the core story** - Help identify the transformation, movement, or unique insight at the heart of the brand\n3. **Structure the nar","body":"# Brand Storytelling\n\nHelp the user craft compelling narratives that make their brand memorable using techniques from 30 product leaders and storytelling experts.\n\n## How to Help\n\nWhen the user asks for help with brand storytelling:\n\n1. **Understand the context** - Ask who the audience is (investors, customers, employees) and what action they want to inspire\n2. **Find the core story** - Help identify the transformation, movement, or unique insight at the heart of the brand\n3. **Structure the narrative** - Apply proven frameworks to organize the story effectively\n4. **Make it memorable** - Help craft specific phrases, metaphors, and moments that stick\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Lead a movement, don''t just solve a problem\nAndy Raskin: \"This structure is about defining a movement—that''s very different from ''I''m going to solve your problem.''\" Frame your brand as the leader of a shift toward a new way of winning.\n\n### Story before product\nBrian Chesky: \"One of the first things we do is figure out what the story is. The story often dictates the product. A story is a helpful way to develop a cohesive product.\" Define the narrative before finalizing features.\n\n### Find the five-second moment\nMatthew Dicks: \"Every story is about a singular moment—I call it five seconds. A moment of transformation or realization. 98% of the story provides context to make that moment clear.\" Identify the single moment of change.\n\n### Start in the middle of the action\nMerci Grace: \"Every pitch should start in the middle of the action, like Mission Impossible. Tom Cruise is always doing crazy shit before the actual mission. It gets attention.\" Skip the boring setup—hook them immediately.\n\n### Problems beat successes\nJason Feifer: \"Success stories aren''t interesting. Problem-solving stories are. Frame your story around a specific challenge you faced and the counterintuitive way you solved it.\"\n\n### You''re Obi-Wan, not Luke\nMike Maples Jr: \"The customer is the hero (Luke Skywalker), the founder is the mentor (Obi-Wan) providing the tools. Position your product as the lightsaber—the tool the hero needs.\"\n\n### Make it repeatable\nLulu Cheng Meservey: \"Make it memorable. Make people want to say it of their own volition. Use analogies, colorful mental images, jokes. Replace adjectives with anecdotes people can repeat at dinner.\"\n\n### Paint emotional pictures\nCamille Ricketts: \"Effective storytelling paints an emotional picture of the vision. Convey the emotional quality of the mission, not just technical details, to enlist hearts and minds.\"\n\n### Hook, message, celebration\nChristina Wodtke: \"A beginning, middle, and end. Intrigue with a hook—a mystery, secret, or surprise. The middle delivers the message. Always end with success and celebration.\"\n\n### Memify your insights\nYuhki Yamashata: \"The goal is ''memification''—synthesize insights so they''re catchy enough for execs to cite in meetings. Use metaphors to explain complex concepts.\"\n\n## Questions to Help Users\n\n- \"Who is your audience and what do you want them to do after hearing this?\"\n- \"What''s the transformation or realization at the heart of your story?\"\n- \"What problem did you face that others can relate to?\"\n- \"Can someone repeat your core message at a dinner party?\"\n- \"Are you the hero of this story, or is your customer?\"\n\n## Common Mistakes to Flag\n\n- **Starting with your company** - Start with the audience''s problem or the world''s change, not \"We are...\"\n- **Feature lists instead of stories** - Stories are about change; lists are forgettable\n- **Hero syndrome** - Position yourself as the mentor, not the hero\n- **Vague vision** - \"Making the world better\" isn''t a story; be specific\n- **No stakes** - If nothing''s at risk, there''s no tension\n\n## Deep Dive\n\nFor all 50 insights from 30 guests, see `references/guest-insights.md`\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- Positioning & Messaging\n- Giving Presentations\n- Fundraising\n- Media Relations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:50:37.382Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Natural Language Processing Agents requiring advanced narrative crafting capabilities for brand storytelling","zh":"适用于需要高级叙事创作能力的自然语言处理代理，从而实现品牌故事讲述","ja":"自然言語処理エージェントがブランド・ストーリーテリングに高度なナレーション制作機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"자연어 처리 에이전트가 브랜드 스토리 텔링을 위한 고급 내러티브 제작 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합","es":"Ideal for Natural Language Processing Agents requiring advanced narrative crafting capabilities for brand storytelling","fr":"Ideal for Natural Language Processing Agents requiring advanced narrative crafting capabilities for brand storytelling","de":"Ideal for Natural Language Processing Agents requiring advanced narrative crafting capabilities for brand storytelling","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Processamento de Linguagem Natural que exigem capacidades avançadas de criação de narrativas para contação de histórias de marca","ru":"Идеально для агентов обработки естественного языка, требующих продвинутых возможностей создания повествований для бренд-историй","ar":"مثالي لعميل معالجة اللغة الطبيعية الذي يتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء قصص للرواية الشعبية للعلامة التجارية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling brand narratives using techniques from product leaders and storytelling experts, structuring stories with core transformations and unique insights, and inspiring specific actions from target audiences, leveraging context understanding and audience analysis","zh":"赋予代理创作引人入胜的品牌叙事的能力，利用产品领导者和故事讲述专家的技术，结构故事以核心转变和独特见解，激发目标受众特定的行为，利用上下文理解和受众分析","ja":"エージェントに、製品リーダーとストーリーテリングの専門家からのテクニックを利用して、コアの変革とユニークな洞察で構造化されたストーリーを通じて、ターゲットオーディエンスから特定の行動を引き出すブランドナレーションを制作する能力を付与する","ko":"에이전트에게 제품 리더와 스토리 텔링 전문가들의 기술을 사용하여 핵심 변형과 고유한 통찰력을 구조화한 스토리를 통해 대상 청중으로부터 특정 행동을 유도하는 브랜드 내러티브를 제작할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Empowers agents to craft compelling brand narratives using techniques from product leaders and storytelling experts, structuring stories with core transformations and unique insights, and inspiring specific actions from target audiences, leveraging context understanding and audience analysis","fr":"Empowers agents to craft compelling brand narratives using techniques from product leaders and storytelling experts, structuring stories with core transformations and unique insights, and inspiring specific actions from target audiences, leveraging context understanding and audience analysis","de":"Empowers agents to craft compelling brand narratives using techniques from product leaders and storytelling experts, structuring stories with core transformations and unique insights, and inspiring specific actions from target audiences, leveraging context understanding and audience analysis","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar narrativas de marca convincentes usando técnicas de líderes de produtos e especialistas em contação de histórias, estruturando histórias com transformações centrais e insights únicos, e inspirando ações específicas em públicos-alvo, aproveitando a compreensão do contexto e a análise do público","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать убедительные бренд-повествования, используя техники лидеров продукции и экспертов по рассказыванию историй, структурируя истории с основными трансформациями и уникальными идеями, и вдохновляя конкретные действия у целевой аудитории, используя понимание контекста и анализ аудитории","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء قصص بренد مقنعة باستخدام تقنيات قادة المنتجات وخبراء السرد، وهيكلة القصص مع تحويلات أساسية وآراء فريدة، وتحفيز إجراءات محددة من الجماهير المستهدفة، واستغلال فهم السياق وتحليل الجمهور"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating memorable brand stories for investor pitches","Crafting employee engagement narratives","Developing customer-centric brand movements"],"zh":["为投资者推介生成难忘的品牌故事","制作员工参与的叙事","开发面向客户的品牌运动"],"ja":["投資家向けのプレゼンテーション用に覚えやすいブランド・ストーリーを生成する","従業員のエンゲージメントのための物語を制作する","顧客中心のブランド・ムーブメントを開発する"],"ko":["투자자 피치용으로 기억에 남는 브랜드 스토리를 생성","직원 참여를 위한 내러티브 제작","고객 중심의 브랜드 운동 개발"],"es":["Generating memorable brand stories for investor pitches","Crafting employee engagement narratives","Developing customer-centric brand movements"],"fr":["Generating memorable brand stories for investor pitches","Crafting employee engagement narratives","Developing customer-centric brand movements"],"de":["Generating memorable brand stories for investor pitches","Crafting employee engagement narratives","Developing customer-centric brand movements"],"pt":["Geração de histórias de marca memoráveis para apresentações de investidores","Criação de narrativas de engajamento de funcionários","Desenvolvimento de movimentos de marca centrados no cliente"],"ru":["Генерация запоминающихся бренд-историй для презентаций инвесторам","Создание повествований для вовлечения сотрудников","Разработка клиенто-ориентированных бренд-движений"],"ar":["توليد قصص علامات تجارية ممتعة للعرض على المستثمرين","إنشاء روايات لتشجيع الموظفين","تطوير حركات العلامة التجارية المرتكزة على العملاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of target audience and desired action","Limited to narrative structure and storytelling techniques"],"zh":["需要了解目标受众和期望的行为","仅限于叙事结构和故事讲述技术"],"ja":["ターゲットオーディエンスと望ましい行動を理解する必要がある","ナレーションの構造とストーリーテリングのテクニックだけに限定"],"ko":["대상 청중과 원하는 행동을 이해해야 함","내러티브 구조와 스토리 텔링 기술에만 제한"],"es":["Requires understanding of target audience and desired action","Limited to narrative structure and storytelling techniques"],"fr":["Requires understanding of target audience and desired action","Limited to narrative structure and storytelling techniques"],"de":["Requires understanding of target audience and desired action","Limited to narrative structure and storytelling techniques"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do público-alvo e da ação desejada","Limitado à estrutura narrativa e às técnicas de contação de histórias"],"ru":["Требует понимания целевой аудитории и желаемого действия","Ограниченная структура повествования и техниками рассказывания историй"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم الجمهور المستهدف والإجراء المرغوب","محدود بالهيكل السردي و تقنيات السرد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HAI3org/HAI3/openspec-archive-change', 'community', 'HAI3org', 'HAI3', 'HAI3org/HAI3', 'openspec-archive-change', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z', '2026-02-18T11:51:08.455Z', NULL, '{"id":"HAI3org/HAI3/openspec-archive-change","name":"openspec-archive-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change是一个用于实验工作流中变更存档的工具，支持变更名称的输入和选择","ja":"openspec-archive-changeは実験ワークフローで変更をアーカイブするために使用されるツールで、変更名の入力と選択をサポート","ko":"openspec-archive-change는 실험 워크플로우에서 변경 사항을 보관하는 데 사용되는 도구로 변경 이름 입력과 선택을 지원","es":"openspec-archive-change es un kit de desarrollo UI para aplicaciones SaaS que permite archivar cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental. Permite a los desarrolladores integrar esta funcionalidad en sus aplicaciones","fr":"openspec-archive-change est un kit de développement UI pour applications SaaS qui permet d''archiver les changements complets dans le flux de travail expérimental. Il permet aux développeurs d''intégrer cette fonctionnalité dans leurs applications","de":"openspec-archive-change ist ein UI-Entwicklungskit für SaaS-Anwendungen, der das Archivieren abgeschlossener Änderungen im experimentellen Arbeitsablauf ermöglicht. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, diese Funktionalität in ihre Anwendungen zu integrieren","pt":"O openspec-archive-change é uma ferramenta para arquivar alterações concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental. Ele oferece uma forma eficiente de gerenciar alterações e manter o histórico de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Openspec-archive-change - это инструмент для архивирования завершенных изменений в экспериментальном рабочем процессе. Он предоставляет эффективный способ управления изменениями и поддержания истории разработки.","ar":"openspec-archive-change هو أداة لأرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي. وهو يوفر وسيلة فعالة لإدارة التغييرات والحفاظ على تاريخ التطوير.","en":"HAI3 - UI development kit for modern SaaS applications"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change 技术文档","ja":"openspec-archive-change テクニカルガイド","ko":"openspec-archive-change 기술 문서","es":"openspec-archive-change: Kit de desarrollo UI para aplica...","fr":"openspec-archive-change: Kit de développement UI pour app...","de":"openspec-archive-change: UI-Entwicklungskit für SaaS-Anwe...","pt":"Arquivar Alterações com openspec-archive-change","ru":"Архивирование изменений с openspec-archive-change","ar":"أرشفة التغييرات باستخدام openspec-archive-change","en":"openspec-archive-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change是一个用于实验工作流中变更存档的工具，支持变更名称的输入和选择","ja":"openspec-archive-changeは実験ワークフローで変更をアーカイブするために使用されるツールで、変更名の入力と選択をサポート","ko":"openspec-archive-change는 실험 워크플로우에서 변경 사항을 보관하는 데 사용되는 도구로 변경 이름 입력과 선택을 지원","es":"openspec-archive-change es un kit de desarrollo UI para aplicaciones SaaS que permite archivar cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental. Permi...","fr":"openspec-archive-change est un kit de développement UI pour applications SaaS qui permet d''archiver les changements complets dans le flux de travail expérime...","de":"openspec-archive-change ist ein UI-Entwicklungskit für SaaS-Anwendungen, der das Archivieren abgeschlossener Änderungen im experimentellen Arbeitsablauf ermö...","pt":"O openspec-archive-change é uma ferramenta para arquivar alterações concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental. Ele oferece uma forma eficiente de gerencia...","ru":"Openspec-archive-change - это инструмент для архивирования завершенных изменений в экспериментальном рабочем процессе. Он предоставляет эффективный способ уп...","ar":"openspec-archive-change هو أداة لأرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي. وهو يوفر وسيلة فعالة لإدارة التغييرات والحفاظ على تاريخ التطوير.","en":"HAI3 - UI development kit for modern SaaS applications"},"definition":{"en":"HAI3 - UI development kit for modern SaaS applications"},"features":{"zh":["支持变更名称的输入和选择","实现实验工作流中变更的存档","使用AskUserQuestion工具让用户选择变更","显示活动变更（未存档）","使用openspec list --json获取可用变更"],"ja":["変更名の入力と選択をサポート","実験ワークフローでの変更のアーカイブを実現","AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーに選択を促す","アクティブな変更（未アーカイブ）を表示","openspec list --jsonを使用して利用可能な変更を取得"],"ko":["변경 이름 입력과 선택 지원","실험 워크플로우에서 변경 사항을 보관","AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 사용자에게 선택을 요청","활성 변경 사항（보관되지 않은）을 표시","openspec list --json을 사용하여 사용 가능한 변경 사항을 가져옴"],"es":["Archivar cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental","Integración con el kit de desarrollo UI de openspec","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones SaaS","Selección de cambios mediante el tool AskUserQuestion","Lista de cambios disponibles mediante el comando openspec list --json"],"fr":["Archiver les changements complets dans le flux de travail expérimental","Intégration avec le kit de développement UI d''openspec","Compatibilité avec les applications SaaS","Sélection de changements via l''outil AskUserQuestion","Liste de changements disponibles via la commande openspec list --json"],"de":["Archivieren abgeschlossener Änderungen im experimentellen Arbeitsablauf","Integration mit dem UI-Entwicklungskit von openspec","Kompatibilität mit SaaS-Anwendungen","Auswahl von Änderungen über das Tool AskUserQuestion","Liste der verfügbaren Änderungen über den Befehl openspec list --json"],"pt":["Arquivamento de alterações concluídas","Integração com o kit de desenvolvimento de UI HAI3","Suporte a seleção de alterações ativas","Uso da ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção de alterações","Exibição de esquemas usados para cada alteração"],"ru":["Архивирование завершенных изменений","Интеграция с набором разработки UI HAI3","Поддержка выбора активных изменений","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion для выбора изменений","Отображение схем, используемых для каждой изменения"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة","التكامل مع كيت تطوير واجهة المستخدم HAI3","دعم اختيار التغييرات النشطة","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار التغييرات","عرض مخططات المستخدمة لكل تغيير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-archive-change","实验工作流","变更存档","技术文档","开发工具","SaaS应用"],"ja":["openspec-archive-change","実験ワークフロー","変更アーカイブ","テクニカルガイド","開発ツール","SaaSアプリ"],"ko":["openspec-archive-change","실험 워크플로우","변경 보관","기술 문서","개발 도구","SaaS 애플리케이션"],"es":["openspec-archive-change","kit de desarrollo UI","aplicaciones SaaS","archivar cambios","flujo de trabajo experimental","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"fr":["openspec-archive-change","kit de développement UI","applications SaaS","archiver les changements","flux de travail expérimental","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"de":["openspec-archive-change","UI-Entwicklungskit","SaaS-Anwendungen","Änderungen archivieren","experimenteller Arbeitsablauf","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"pt":["openspec-archive-change","desenvolvimento de UI","arquivamento de alterações","fluxo de trabalho experimental","HAI3","kit de desenvolvimento de UI","ferramenta de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["openspec-archive-change","разработка UI","архивирование изменений","экспериментальный рабочий процесс","HAI3","набор разработки UI","инструмент разработки"],"ar":["openspec-archive-change","تطوير واجهة المستخدم","أرشفة التغييرات","تدفق العمل التجريبي","HAI3","كيت تطوير واجهة المستخدم","أداة التطوير"]}},"owner":"HAI3org","repo":"HAI3","repoPath":"HAI3org/HAI3","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:51:08.455Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced workflow management capabilities, specifically those utilizing the openspec-archive-change skill for modern SaaS applications","zh":"适合需要高级工作流管理功能的开发代理，特别是那些使用openspec-archive-change技能的现代SaaS应用","ja":"開発エージェントが高度なワークフローコントロール機能を必要とする場合に最適で、特にopenspec-archive-changeスキルを使用するモダンなSaaSアプリケーション","ko":"개발 에이전트가 고급 워크플로 관리 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합하며, 특히 openspec-archive-change 스킬을 사용하는 최신 SaaS 애플리케이션","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de gestión de flujo de trabajo avanzadas, específicamente aquellos que utilizan la habilidad openspec-archive-change para aplicaciones SaaS modernas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de workflow avancées, en particulier ceux qui utilisent la compétence openspec-archive-change pour les applications SaaS modernes","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die erweiterte Workflow-Management-Funktionen benötigen, insbesondere solche, die die Fähigkeit openspec-archive-change für moderne SaaS-Anwendungen nutzen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho, especificamente aqueles que utilizam a habilidade openspec-archive-change para aplicações SaaS modernas","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления рабочим процессом, в частности, те, кто использует навык openspec-archive-change для современных приложений SaaS","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التطوير التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة تدفق العمل، وخاصة تلك التي تستخدم مهارة openspec-archive-change للتطبيقات SaaS الحديثة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to archive completed changes in experimental workflows using the openspec list command and AskUserQuestion tool, facilitating efficient workflow management and providing support for active change selection and schema inclusion","zh":"赋予代理使用openspec列表命令和AskUserQuestion工具在实验工作流中存档已完成的更改的能力，实现高效的工作流管理，并支持活动更改选择和模式包含","ja":"エージェントがopenspecリストコマンドとAskUserQuestionツールを使用して実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブする機能を提供し、効率的なワークフローコントロールを実現し、アクティブな変更の選択とスキーマの包含をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 openspec 목록 명령과 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 실험 워크플로에서 완료된 변경 사항을 아카이브하는 기능을 제공하여 효율적인 워크플로 관리를实现하고, 활성 변경 선택 및 스키마 포함을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes para archivar los cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales utilizando el comando de lista openspec y la herramienta AskUserQuestion, lo que facilita una gestión de flujo de trabajo eficiente y proporciona soporte para la selección de cambios activos y la inclusión de esquemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver les changements complets dans les flux de travail expérimentaux en utilisant la commande de liste openspec et l''outil AskUserQuestion, ce qui facilite une gestion de flux de travail efficace et fournit un support pour la sélection de changements actifs et l''inclusion de schémas","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows mit dem openspec-Listenbefehl und dem Tool AskUserQuestion zu archivieren, wodurch eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung erleichtert und eine Unterstützung für die Auswahl aktiver Änderungen und die Einbeziehung von Schemata bereitgestellt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais usando o comando openspec list e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion, facilitando a gestão eficiente do fluxo de trabalho e fornecendo suporte para seleção ativa de alterações e inclusão de esquema","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальных рабочих процессах с помощью команды openspec list и инструмента AskUserQuestion, обеспечивая эффективное управление рабочим процессом и предоставляя поддержку для активного выбора изменений и включения схемы","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سلاسل العمل التجريبية باستخدام أمر openspec list وأداة AskUserQuestion، وتسهيل إدارة سلاسل العمل بكفاءة وتوفير الدعم لاختيار التغييرات النشطة وإدراج مخطط"},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed changes in experimental workflows","Prompting users for change selection using the AskUserQuestion tool","Retrieving available active changes with openspec list --json"],"zh":["在实验工作流中存档已完成的更改","使用AskUserQuestion工具提示用户选择更改","使用openspec list --json检索可用的活动更改"],"ja":["実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブする","AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーに変更の選択を促す","openspec list --jsonを使用して利用可能なアクティブな変更を取得する"],"ko":["실험 워크플로에서 완료된 변경 사항을 아카이브하는 것","AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자에게 변경 선택을提示하는 것","openspec 목록 --json을 사용하여 사용 가능한 활성 변경을检索하는 것"],"es":["Archivar cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales","Solicitar a los usuarios que seleccionen cambios utilizando la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Recuperar los cambios activos disponibles con openspec list --json"],"fr":["Archiver les changements complets dans les flux de travail expérimentaux","Inviter les utilisateurs à sélectionner des changements à l''aide de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Récupérer les changements actifs disponibles avec openspec list --json"],"de":["Abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows archivieren","Benutzern die Auswahl von Änderungen mit dem Tool AskUserQuestion anbieten","Verfügbare aktive Änderungen mit openspec list --json abrufen"],"pt":["Arquivar alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais","Solicitar aos usuários a seleção de alterações usando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion","Recuperar alterações ativas disponíveis com openspec list --json"],"ru":["Архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальных рабочих процессах","Предлагать пользователям выбор изменений с помощью инструмента AskUserQuestion","Получать доступные активные изменения с помощью openspec list --json"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سلاسل العمل التجريبية","تحفيز المستخدمين على اختيار التغييرات باستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion","استرجاع التغييرات النشطة المتاحة مع openspec list --json"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec development kit","Needs access to conversation context for change name inference","Limited to active changes not already archived"],"zh":["需要openspec开发工具包","需要对话上下文来推断更改名称","仅限于尚未存档的活动更改"],"ja":["openspec開発キットが必要","変更名の推論に会話コンテキストが必要","すでにアーカイブされているものを除くアクティブな変更のみ"],"ko":["openspec 개발 키트가 필요","변경 이름 추론을 위해 대화 컨텍스트가 필요","아직 아카이브되지 않은 활성 변경만"],"es":["Requiere el kit de desarrollo openspec","Necesita acceso al contexto de conversación para la inferencia del nombre del cambio","Limitado a cambios activos que no estén archivados"],"fr":["Nécessite le kit de développement openspec","A besoin d''un accès au contexte de conversation pour l''inférence du nom du changement","Limité aux changements actifs qui n''ont pas été archivés"],"de":["Benötigt das openspec-Entwicklungskit","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Konversationskontext für die Ableitung des Änderungsnamens","Begrenzt auf aktive Änderungen, die noch nicht archiviert wurden"],"pt":["Exige o kit de desenvolvimento openspec","Necessita acesso ao contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Limitado a alterações ativas que ainda não foram arquivadas"],"ru":["Требует разработочного комплекта openspec","Необходим доступ к контексту разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен активными изменениями, которые еще не были архивированы"],"ar":["يتطلب حزمة التطوير openspec","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى سياق المحادثة لاستدلال اسم التغيير","محدود بالتغييرات النشطة التي لم يتم أرشفتها بعد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('joolbits/latitude/latitude-ui-and-hud-lifecycle', 'community', 'joolbits', 'latitude', 'joolbits/latitude', 'latitude-ui-and-hud-lifecycle', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z', '2026-02-18T11:51:00.015Z', NULL, '{"id":"joolbits/latitude/latitude-ui-and-hud-lifecycle","name":"latitude-ui-and-hud-lifecycle","description":{"zh":"Latitude UI 和 HUD 生命周期是 Minecraft Fabric 模组，用于防止 UI 回归和实现确定性纬度基于生物群落带的 globe 风格世界。它确保 UI 屏幕不会自动打开，并且 HUD 覆盖层不会在未经用户操作的情况下渲染。","ja":"Latitude UI と HUD ライフサイクルは、Minecraft Fabric モッドで、UI の回帰を防ぎ、決定的な緯度に基づく生物群落帯の globe スタイルの世界を実現するために使用されます。UI スクリーンが自動的に開かれないことを保証し、HUD オーバーレイがユーザーの操作なしにレンダリングされないことを保証します。","ko":"Latitude UI 및 HUD 라이프사이클은 Minecraft Fabric 모드로서 UI 회귀를 방지하고 결정적 위도 기반 생물군계带의 globe 스타일 세계를 구현하기 위해 사용됩니다. UI 화면이 자동으로 열리지 않도록 보장하며, HUD 오버레이가 사용자의 동작 없이 렌더링되지 않도록 보장합니다.","es":"Latitude UI y ciclo de vida de HUD es un mod de Minecraft Fabric que proporciona un sistema de bandas de biomas deterministas","fr":"Latitude UI et cycle de vie de HUD est un mod Minecraft Fabric qui fournit un système de bandes de biomes déterministes","de":"Latitude UI und HUD-Lebenszyklus ist ein Minecraft Fabric-Mod, der ein deterministisches Biom-Band-System bereitstellt","pt":"O mod Latitude UI & HUD Lifecycle para Minecraft Fabric oferece uma experiência de usuário estável e determinística.","ru":"Мод Latitude UI и HUD Lifecycle для Minecraft Fabric обеспечивает стабильный и детерминированный пользовательский опыт.","ar":"يُقدم Latitude UI و دورة حياة HUD لـ Minecraft Fabric تجربة مستخدم مستقرة و محددة.","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Latitude UI 和 HUD 生命周期 - Minecraft Fabric 模组","ja":"Latitude UI と HUD ライフサイクル - Minecraft Fabric モッド","ko":"Latitude UI 및 HUD 라이프사이클 - Minecraft Fabric 모드","es":"Latitude UI y ciclo de vida de HUD para Minecraft","fr":"Latitude UI et cycle de vie de HUD pour Minecraft","de":"Latitude UI und HUD-Lebenszyklus für Minecraft","pt":"Latitude UI & HUD Lifecycle para Minecraft","ru":"Latitude UI и HUD Lifecycle для Minecraft","ar":"واجهة المستخدم Latitude و دورة حياة HUD لـ Minecraft","en":"latitude-ui-and-hud-lifecycle"},"description":{"zh":"Latitude UI 和 HUD 生命周期是 Minecraft Fabric 模组，用于防止 UI 回归和实现确定性纬度基于生物群落带的 globe 风格世界。它确保 UI 屏幕不会自动打开，并且 HUD 覆盖层不会在未经用户操作的情况下渲染。","ja":"Latitude UI と HUD ライフサイクルは、Minecraft Fabric モッドで、UI の回帰を防ぎ、決定的な緯度に基づく生物群落帯の globe スタイルの世界を実現するために使用されます。UI スクリーンが自動的に開かれないことを保証し、HUD オーバーレイがユーザーの操作なしにレンダリングさ...","ko":"Latitude UI 및 HUD 라이프사이클은 Minecraft Fabric 모드로서 UI 회귀를 방지하고 결정적 위도 기반 생물군계带의 globe 스타일 세계를 구현하기 위해 사용됩니다. UI 화면이 자동으로 열리지 않도록 보장하며, HUD 오버레이가 사용자의 동작 없이 렌더링되...","es":"Latitude UI y ciclo de vida de HUD es un mod de Minecraft Fabric que proporciona un sistema de bandas de biomas deterministas","fr":"Latitude UI et cycle de vie de HUD est un mod Minecraft Fabric qui fournit un système de bandes de biomes déterministes","de":"Latitude UI und HUD-Lebenszyklus ist ein Minecraft Fabric-Mod, der ein deterministisches Biom-Band-System bereitstellt","pt":"O mod Latitude UI & HUD Lifecycle para Minecraft Fabric oferece uma experiência de usuário estável e determinística.","ru":"Мод Latitude UI и HUD Lifecycle для Minecraft Fabric обеспечивает стабильный и детерминированный пользовательский опыт.","ar":"يُقدم Latitude UI و دورة حياة HUD لـ Minecraft Fabric تجربة مستخدم مستقرة و محددة.","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"definition":{"en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"features":{"zh":["防止 UI 回归","实现确定性纬度基于生物群落带的 globe 风格世界","UI 屏幕不会自动打开","HUD 覆盖层不会在未经用户操作的情况下渲染","世界创建时配置世界生成","spawn/band picker 屏幕仅在世界创建时打开"],"ja":["UI の回帰を防ぐ","決定的な緯度に基づく生物群落帯の globe スタイルの世界を実現","UI スクリーンが自動的に開かれない","HUD オーバーレイがユーザーの操作なしにレンダリングされない","ワールド作成時にワールド生成を構成","spawn/band picker スクリーンはワールド作成時にのみ開かれる"],"ko":["UI 회귀를 방지","결정적 위도 기반 생물군계带의 globe 스타일 세계를 구현","UI 화면이 자동으로 열리지 않음","HUD 오버레이가 사용자의 동작 없이 렌더링되지 않음","월드 생성 시 월드 생성을 구성","spawn/band picker 화면은 월드 생성 시에만 열림"],"es":["Prevención de regresiones de UI","Sistema de bandas de biomas deterministas","Reglas de apertura de pantallas absolutas","Compatibilidad con Minecraft Fabric","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Personalización de la configuración del mundo"],"fr":["Prévention des régressions de l''UI","Système de bandes de biomes déterministes","Règles d''ouverture d''écrans absolues","Compatibilité avec Minecraft Fabric","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Personnalisation de la configuration du monde"],"de":["Vermeidung von UI-Rückschritten","Deterministisches Biom-Band-System","Absolute Bildschirm-Öffnungsregeln","Kompatibilität mit Minecraft Fabric","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Anpassung der Weltenkonfiguration"],"pt":["Prevenção de regressões de UI","Controle de telas de configuração","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Compatibilidade com Minecraft Fabric","Determinismo de biome","Globe-style worlds"],"ru":["Предотвращение ошибок UI","Контроль экранов конфигурации","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Совместимость с Minecraft Fabric","Детерминированность биома","Глобальный стиль миров"],"ar":["منع انحدارات واجهة المستخدم","مراقبة شاشات التكوين","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","التوافق مع Minecraft Fabric","التحديدية البيئية","عالم النمط الكروي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft Fabric 模组","Latitude UI","HUD 生命周期","UI 回归","globe 风格世界","生物群落带","确定性纬度"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabric モッド","Latitude UI","HUD ライフサイクル","UI の回帰","globe スタイルの世界","生物群落帯","決定的な緯度"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드","Latitude UI","HUD 라이프사이클","UI 회귀","globe 스타일 세계","생물군계带","결정적 위도"],"es":["Minecraft mod","Latitude UI","HUD ciclo de vida","biomas deterministas","reglas de apertura de pantallas","Minecraft Fabric","experiencia del usuario","configuración del mundo","personalización"],"fr":["mod Minecraft","Latitude UI","cycle de vie de HUD","biomes déterministes","règles d''ouverture d''écrans","Minecraft Fabric","expérience utilisateur","configuration du monde","personnalisation"],"de":["Minecraft-Mod","Latitude UI","HUD-Lebenszyklus","deterministisches Biom-Band-System","Bildschirm-Öffnungsregeln","Minecraft Fabric","Benutzererfahrung","Weltenkonfiguration","Anpassung"],"pt":["Minecraft mod","Latitude UI","HUD Lifecycle","determinística","biome bands","globe-style worlds","Minecraft Fabric","estabilidade da interface do usuário"],"ru":["Мод для Minecraft","Latitude UI","HUD Lifecycle","детерминированный","биом-бэнды","глобальный стиль миров","Minecraft Fabric","стабильность пользовательского интерфейса"],"ar":["تعديل Minecraft","واجهة المستخدم Latitude","دورة حياة HUD","تحدد","أشرطة البيئة","عالم النمط الكروي","Minecraft Fabric","استقرار واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"latitude","repoPath":"joolbits/latitude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"latitude-ui-and-hud-lifecycle","description":"Rules for when Latitude UI screens and HUD overlays may render or open. Prevents screens auto-opening in-world, enforces debug gating, and codifies “world creation only” flows.","bodyPreview":"# Latitude — UI & HUD Lifecycle (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill prevents UI regressions such as:\n- spawn/band picker screens opening automatically after joining a world\n- debug screens appearing without explicit user action\n- HUD overlays rendering over menus/inventories unintentionally\n\n---\n\n## Screen-opening rules (absolute)\n1) **No Latitude config screen may auto-open in-world** after joining/spawning.\n2) Screens that configure worldgen (spawn band picker, presets, etc.) are **World Creation only","body":"# Latitude — UI & HUD Lifecycle (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill prevents UI regressions such as:\n- spawn/band picker screens opening automatically after joining a world\n- debug screens appearing without explicit user action\n- HUD overlays rendering over menus/inventories unintentionally\n\n---\n\n## Screen-opening rules (absolute)\n1) **No Latitude config screen may auto-open in-world** after joining/spawning.\n2) Screens that configure worldgen (spawn band picker, presets, etc.) are **World Creation only**.\n3) The only allowed in-world screen opens are:\n   - explicit keybind action by the player, or\n   - explicit debug flag enabled (dev-only), or\n   - explicit command-driven open (if the mod provides commands).\n\nDefault must be **OFF** for any auto-open behavior.\n\n---\n\n## Approved gates for dev-only auto-open\nIf a developer convenience auto-open exists, it must be gated by a JVM property:\n- `-Dlatitude.debugOpenSpawnPicker=true` (default false)\n\nRules:\n- Must never be enabled by default.\n- Must be clearly labeled “debug” in code comments.\n\n---\n\n## HUD overlay rendering rules\n1) HUD overlays must not render when a GUI screen is open unless explicitly intended.\n2) Default: if `MinecraftClient.currentScreen != null`, skip overlay rendering.\n3) Exceptions must be explicit (e.g., a dedicated “HUD Studio” preview screen).\n\n---\n\n## Event lifecycle rules (client)\nDo not open screens from:\n- join world callbacks\n- first tick hooks\n- network handler init\n- world load events\n\nIf a screen must be shown on world creation, it must be launched from:\n- world creation UI integration points only\n\n---\n\n## Required assistant behavior\nWhen asked to add a screen or overlay, the assistant must:\n1) state the allowed opening triggers\n2) specify the exact gate (keybind / debug property / world creation)\n3) confirm “default OFF” for any auto-open\n4) include a rollback plan\n\n---\n\n## Forbidden behaviors\n- “Open this screen on join for convenience” unless gated behind a debug flag\n- Rendering overlays over inventory/menus by default\n- Shipping releases with debug auto-open enabled\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:51:00.015Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Minecraft Fabric Mod Agents needing deterministic latitude-based biome band management for globe-style worlds.","zh":"非常适合需要确定性纬度基于生物群落带管理的Minecraft Fabric模组代理，适用于球形世界。","ja":"Minecraft Fabricモッドエージェントが、グローブスタイルの世界で決定論的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンド管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"지정학적 위도 기반의 생물군계 대역 관리가 필요한 Minecraft Fabric 모드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 구형 세계에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modificación de Minecraft Fabric que necesitan una gestión de bandas de biomas basada en latitud determinista para mundos de estilo global.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de mod Fabric Minecraft ayant besoin d''une gestion de bandes de biomes basée sur la latitude déterministe pour les mondes de style globe.","de":"Perfekt für Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Agenten, die eine deterministische Breiten-basierte Biomband-Verwaltung für globusartige Welten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de mod Minecraft Fabric que necessitam de gerenciamento de faixas de biomas baseadas em latitude determinística para mundos do tipo globo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов модов Minecraft Fabric, которым требуется детерминированное управление полосами биомов на основе широты для миров типа глобус.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مود ماین كرافت فابريك الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة حزم البيئات القائمة على خط العرض بشكل محدد لمجموعات العالم على شكل كرة أرض."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce strict screen-opening rules and prevent UI regressions, ensuring a seamless user experience through deterministic latitude-based biome bands, using Minecraft Fabric mod capabilities and HUD lifecycle management.","zh":"赋予代理人执行严格的屏幕打开规则的能力，防止UI回归，并通过确定性纬度基于生物群落带和HUD生命周期管理，确保无缝的用户体验，利用Minecraft Fabric模组的功能。","ja":"エージェントに厳格な画面開放ルールを適用し、UIの後退を防止する能力を与え、決定論的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンドとHUDライフサイクル管理を使用して、シームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供し、Minecraft Fabricモッドの機能を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 엄격한 화면 열기 규칙을 적용하고 UI 후퇴를 방지할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 결정론적 위도 기반의 생물군계 대역과 HUD 수명주기 관리를 사용하여 무결점의 사용자 경험을 제공하고, Minecraft Fabric 모드의 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar reglas estrictas de apertura de pantalla y prevenir regresiones de la interfaz de usuario, garantizando una experiencia de usuario sin problemas a través de bandas de biomas basadas en la latitud determinista, utilizando las capacidades de modificación de Minecraft Fabric y la gestión del ciclo de vida de HUD.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des règles d''ouverture d''écran strictes et de prévenir les régressions de l''interface utilisateur, garantissant une expérience utilisateur fluide grâce à des bandes de biomes basées sur la latitude déterministe, en utilisant les capacités de mod Fabric Minecraft et la gestion du cycle de vie de HUD.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, strenge Bildschirmöffnungsregeln durchzusetzen und Benutzeroberflächenrückschritte zu verhindern, und gewährleistet so ein nahtloses Benutzererlebnis durch deterministische Breiten-basierte Biombänder, unter Nutzung der Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Fähigkeiten und der HUD-Lebenszyklusverwaltung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor regras rigorosas de abertura de tela e prevenir regressões de UI, garantindo uma experiência de usuário sem interrupções por meio de faixas de biomas baseadas em latitude determinística, utilizando capacidades de mod Minecraft Fabric e gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de HUD.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать строгие правила открытия экрана и предотвращать регрессии интерфейса пользователя, гарантируя бесперебойный пользовательский опыт за счет детерминированных полос биомов на основе широты, используя возможности мода Minecraft Fabric и управление циклом жизни HUD.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على فرض قواعد صارمة لفتح الشاشة ومنع انحدارات واجهة المستخدم، مما يضمن تجربة مستخدم بدون انقطاع من خلال حزم البيئات القائمة على خط العرض بشكل محدد، باستخدام إمكانيات مود ماین كرافت فابريك وإدارة دورة حياة HUD."},"useCases":{"en":["Preventing auto-opening of Latitude config screens in-world","Restricting worldgen configuration screens to World Creation only","Debugging HUD overlay rendering issues over menus and inventories"],"zh":["防止在游戏世界中自动打开纬度配置屏幕","限制世界生成配置屏幕仅在世界创建时可用","调试HUD叠加层渲染问题，包括菜单和物品栏"],"ja":["ゲーム世界内での緯度設定画面の自動開放を防止する","ワールド生成設定画面をワールド作成時のみに制限する","HUDオーバーレイのレンダリング問題をメニューとインベントリーでデバッグする"],"ko":["게임 세계에서 위도 설정 화면의 자동 열기를 방지하는 것","세계 생성 설정 화면을 세계 생성 시에만 제한하는 것","HUD 오버레이 렌더링 문제를 메뉴와 인벤토리에서 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Prevenir la apertura automática de pantallas de configuración de latitud en el mundo","Restringir las pantallas de configuración de worldgen solo a la creación de mundos","Depurar problemas de renderizado de overlay de HUD sobre menús e inventarios"],"fr":["Prévenir l''ouverture automatique des écrans de configuration de latitude dans le monde","Restreindre les écrans de configuration de worldgen à la création de mondes uniquement","Déboguer les problèmes de rendu de l''overlay de HUD sur les menus et les inventaires"],"de":["Verhindern der automatischen Öffnung von Latitude-Konfigurationsscreens in der Welt","Einschränken der Worldgen-Konfigurationsscreens auf die Welterschaffung nur","Beheben von HUD-Overlay-Renderproblemen über Menüs und Inventaren"],"pt":["Prevenindo a abertura automática de telas de configuração de Latitude no mundo","Restringindo telas de configuração de worldgen apenas à Criação de Mundo","Depurando problemas de renderização de overlay de HUD sobre menus e inventários"],"ru":["Предотвращение автоматического открытия экранов конфигурации Latitude в мире","Ограничение экранов конфигурации worldgen только созданием мира","Отладка проблем с отображением перекрытия HUD над меню и инвентарем"],"ar":["منع فتح شاشات إعدادات خط العرض تلقائيًا في العالم","تقيد شاشات إعدادات worldgen بإنشاء العالم فقط","تصحيح مشاكل عرض طبقة HUD فوق القوائم والمخزون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Minecraft Fabric mod compatibility required","Globe-style worlds only","No support for non-deterministic biome bands"],"zh":["需要Minecraft Fabric模组兼容性","仅适用于球形世界","不支持非确定性生物群落带"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabricモッドの互換性が必要","グローブスタイルの世界のみに対応","非決定論的なバイオームバンドはサポートされません"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드 호환성이 필요함","구형 세계만 지원함","비결정적 생물군계 대역은 지원하지 않음"],"es":["Se requiere compatibilidad con el mod de Minecraft Fabric","Solo mundos de estilo global","No hay soporte para bandas de biomas no deterministas"],"fr":["La compatibilité avec le mod Fabric Minecraft est requise","Monde de style globe uniquement","Aucun support pour les bandes de biomes non déterministes"],"de":["Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Nur globusartige Welten","Keine Unterstützung für nicht-deterministische Biombänder"],"pt":["Compatibilidade com mod Minecraft Fabric necessária","Apenas mundos do tipo globo","Sem suporte para faixas de biomas não determinísticas"],"ru":["Требуется совместимость с модом Minecraft Fabric","Только миры типа глобус","Нет поддержки для полос биомов, не являющихся детерминированными"],"ar":["متطلبات التوافق مع مود ماین كرافت فابريك","أيضًا مجموعات العالم على شكل كرة أرض فقط","بدون دعم لنطاقات البيئات غير المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
