 avec les opérations d''agent","Sélection des modifications à synchroniser","Synchronisation des spécifications principales"],"de":["Automatische Synchronisierung von Delta-Spezifikationen","Intelligente Zusammenführung von Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit Agenten-Operationen","Auswahl von Änderungen zur Synchronisierung","Synchronisierung von Haupt-Spezifikationen"],"pt":["Sincronização de alterações de especificações","Mesclagem inteligente de cenários","Edição direta de especificações principais","Suporte a inferência de contexto de conversa","Prompt para seleção de alterações disponíveis"],"ru":["Синхронизация изменений спецификаций","Интеллектуальное объединение сценариев","Прямое редактирование основых спецификаций","Поддержка вывода контекста разговора","Запрос на выбор доступных изменений"],"ar":["مزامنة التغييرات في المواصفات","الدمج الذكي للسيناريوهات","التحرير المباشر للمواصفات الرئيسية","دعم استنتاج سياق المحادثة","تذكير لاختيار التغييرات المتاحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-sync-specs","智能规格同步","规格合并","开发效率","自动编辑","变化的规格"],"ja":["openspec-sync-specs","スマートな仕様同期","仕様マージ","開発効率","自動編集","変更された仕様"],"ko":["openspec-sync-specs","지능형 사양 동기화","사양 병합","개발 효율성","자동 편집","변경된 사양"],"es":["sincronización de especificaciones","openspec-sync-specs","desarrollo de software","automatización de flujos de trabajo","fusión inteligente de cambios","operaciones de agente"],"fr":["synchronisation des spécifications","openspec-sync-specs","développement de logiciels","automatisation de flux de travail","fusion intelligente des modifications","opérations d''agent"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Spezifikationen","openspec-sync-specs","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Workflows","intelligente Zusammenführung von Änderungen","Agenten-Operationen"],"pt":["sincronização de especificações","mesclagem de cenários","edição de especificações","inferência de contexto","desenvolvimento de software","openspec-sync-specs"],"ru":["синхронизация спецификаций","объединение сценариев","редактирование спецификаций","вывод контекста","разработка программного обеспечения","openspec-sync-specs"],"ar":["مزامنة المواصفات","الدمج السيناريوهات","تحرير المواصفات","استنتاج السياق","تطوير البرمجيات","openspec-sync-specs"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"naija-conflict-tracker","repoPath":"Ejyke90/naija-conflict-tracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-sync-specs","description":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs. Use when the user wants to update main specs with changes from a delta spec, without archiving the change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selectio","body":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have delta specs (under `specs/` directory).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Find delta specs**\n\n   Look for delta spec files in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/*/spec.md`.\n\n   Each delta spec file contains sections like:\n   - `## ADDED Requirements` - New requirements to add\n   - `## MODIFIED Requirements` - Changes to existing requirements\n   - `## REMOVED Requirements` - Requirements to remove\n   - `## RENAMED Requirements` - Requirements to rename (FROM:/TO: format)\n\n   If no delta specs found, inform user and stop.\n\n3. **For each delta spec, apply changes to main specs**\n\n   For each capability with a delta spec at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/<capability>/spec.md`:\n\n   a. **Read the delta spec** to understand the intended changes\n\n   b. **Read the main spec** at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md` (may not exist yet)\n\n   c. **Apply changes intelligently**:\n\n      **ADDED Requirements:**\n      - If requirement doesn''t exist in main spec → add it\n      - If requirement already exists → update it to match (treat as implicit MODIFIED)\n\n      **MODIFIED Requirements:**\n      - Find the requirement in main spec\n      - Apply the changes - this can be:\n        - Adding new scenarios (don''t need to copy existing ones)\n        - Modifying existing scenarios\n        - Changing the requirement description\n      - Preserve scenarios/content not mentioned in the delta\n\n      **REMOVED Requirements:**\n      - Remove the entire requirement block from main spec\n\n      **RENAMED Requirements:**\n      - Find the FROM requirement, rename to TO\n\n   d. **Create new main spec** if capability doesn''t exist yet:\n      - Create `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n      - Add Purpose section (can be brief, mark as TBD)\n      - Add Requirements section with the ADDED requirements\n\n4. **Show summary**\n\n   After applying all changes, summarize:\n   - Which capabilities were updated\n   - What changes were made (requirements added/modified/removed/renamed)\n\n**Delta Spec Format Reference**\n\n```markdown\n## ADDED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: New Feature\nThe system SHALL do something new.\n\n#### Scenario: Basic case\n- **WHEN** user does X\n- **THEN** system does Y\n\n## MODIFIED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Existing Feature\n#### Scenario: New scenario to add\n- **WHEN** user does A\n- **THEN** system does B\n\n## REMOVED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Deprecated Feature\n\n## RENAMED Requirements\n\n- FROM: `### Requirement: Old Name`\n- TO: `### Requirement: New Name`\n```\n\n**Key Principle: Intelligent Merging**\n\nUnlike programmatic merging, you can apply **partial updates**:\n- To add a scenario, just include that scenario under MODIFIED - don''t copy existing scenarios\n- The delta represents *intent*, not a wholesale replacement\n- Use your judgment to merge changes sensibly\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Specs Synced: <change-name>\n\nUpdated main specs:\n\n**<capability-1>**:\n- Added requirement: \"New Feature\"\n- Modified requirement: \"Existing Feature\" (added 1 scenario)\n\n**<capability-2>**:\n- Created new spec file\n- Added requirement: \"Another Feature\"\n\nMain specs are now updated. The change remains active - archive when implementation is complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Read both delta and main specs before making changes\n- Preserve existing content not mentioned in delta\n- If something is unclear, ask for clarification\n- Show what you''re changing as you go\n- The operation should be idempotent - running twice should give same result\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:51:07.174Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Specification Management Agents needing intelligent spec merging capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要智能规格合并能力的规格管理代理。","ja":"スマートな仕様統合機能を必要とする仕様管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"지능형 사양 병합 기능이 필요한 사양 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Especificaciones que necesitan capacidades de fusión de especificaciones inteligentes.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion de Spécifications ayant besoin de capacités de fusion de spécifications intelligentes.","de":"Perfekt für Spezifikationsmanagement-Agenten, die intelligente Spezifikationszusammenführungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Especificações que necessitam de capacidades de mesclagem de especificações inteligentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления спецификациями, требующих интеллектуальных возможностей слияния спецификаций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المواصفات الذي يحتاج إلى khảيات دمج مواصفات ذكية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to directly edit main specs by intelligently merging delta specs, utilizing agent-driven operations for efficient change management and supporting protocols like change name inference from conversation context.","zh":"赋予代理直接编辑主规格的能力，通过智能合并增量规格，利用代理驱动的操作实现高效的变更管理，并支持从对话上下文中推断更改名称等协议。","ja":"エージェントにメイン仕様を直接編集する機能を付与し、デルタ仕様をスマートに統合してエージェント駆動の操作で効率的な変更管理を行い、会話のコンテキストから変更名を推論するなどのプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 메인 사양을 직접 편집할 수 있는 기능을 제공하고 델타 사양을智能하게 병합하여 에이전트 주도操作으로 효율적인 변경 관리를 수행하며 대화의 맥락에서 변경 이름을 추론하는 등과 같은 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a editar directamente las especificaciones principales fusionando inteligentemente las especificaciones delta, utilizando operaciones impulsadas por agentes para un cambio eficiente y compatibles con protocolos como la inferencia de nombres de cambios a partir del contexto de la conversación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''éditer directement les spécifications principales en fusionnant intelligemment les spécifications delta, en utilisant des opérations pilotées par agent pour une gestion efficace des changements et en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que l''inférence de nom de changement à partir du contexte de la conversation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Hauptspezifikationen direkt zu bearbeiten, indem sie die Deltaspezifikationen intelligently zusammenführen, Agenten-getriebene Operationen für effizientes Änderungsmanagement nutzen und Protokolle wie Änderungsnameableitung aus dem Gesprächskontext unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a editar diretamente as especificações principais mesclando inteligentemente as especificações delta, utilizando operações impulsionadas por agente para gerenciamento eficiente de alterações e suportando protocolos como inferência de nome de alteração do contexto da conversa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью直接 редактировать основные спецификации, интеллектуально сливая delta-спецификации, используя операции, управляемые агентом, для эффективного управления изменениями и поддержки протоколов, таких как вывод имени изменения из контекста разговора.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تحرير المواصفات الرئيسية مباشرة من خلال دمج ذكاء المواصفات دلتا، باستخدام عمليات مدفوعة بالوكيل لإدارة التغييرات بكفاءة ودعم بروتوكولات مثل استنتاج اسم التغيير من سياق المحادثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating delta spec synchronization","Merging scenario updates without duplicating requirements","Debugging spec inconsistencies through intelligent merging"],"zh":["自动化增量规格同步","合并场景更新而不重复需求","通过智能合并调试规格不一致性"],"ja":["デルタ仕様の同期を自動化する","シナリオの更新をマージして要件の重複を避ける","スマートな統合を通じて仕様の不一致をデバッグする"],"ko":["델타 사양 동기화를 자동화하는 것","시나리오 업데이트를 병합하여 요구사항의 중복을 피하는 것","智能한 병합을 통해 사양의 불일치를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la sincronización de especificaciones delta","Combinar actualizaciones de escenarios sin duplicar requisitos","Depurar inconsistencias de especificaciones a través de la fusión inteligente"],"fr":["Automatiser la synchronisation des spécifications delta","Fusionner les mises à jour de scénarios sans dupliquer les exigences","Déboguer les incohérences de spécifications grâce à la fusion intelligente"],"de":["Automatisieren der Deltaspezifikationssynchronisation","Szenario-Updates zusammenführen, ohne Anforderungen zu duplizieren","Spezifikationsinkonsistenzen durch intelligente Zusammenführung debuggen"],"pt":["Automatizar a sincronização de especificações delta","Mesclar atualizações de cenário sem duplicar requisitos","Depurar inconsistências de especificações por meio de mesclagem inteligente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать синхронизацию delta-спецификаций","Сливать обновления сценариев без дублирования требований","Отлаживать несоответствия спецификаций посредством интеллектуального слияния"],"ar":["تحسين التزامن التلقائي للمواصفات دلتا","دمج تحديثات السيناريو دون تكرار المتطلبات","تصحيح أخطاء عدم تطابق المواصفات من خلال دمج ذكاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires conversation context for change name inference","May prompt for change selection if input is vague or ambiguous"],"zh":["需要对话上下文来推断更改名称","如果输入不明确或模糊，可能会提示选择更改"],"ja":["変更名の推論に会話のコンテキストが必要","入力が不明確または曖昧な場合は、変更の選択を求めることがある"],"ko":["변경 이름을 추론하기 위해 대화의 맥락이 필요","입력이 불분명하거나 모호한 경우 변경 선택을 요구할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere contexto de conversación para la inferencia de nombres de cambios","Puede solicitar la selección de cambios si la entrada es vaga o ambigua"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de conversation pour l''inférence de noms de changement","Peut demander la sélection de changements si l''entrée est vague ou ambiguë"],"de":["Benötigt Gesprächskontext für die Änderungsnameableitung","Kann die Änderungsauswahl auffordern, wenn die Eingabe vage oder mehrdeutig ist"],"pt":["Requer contexto de conversa para inferência de nome de alteração","Pode solicitar seleção de alteração se a entrada for vaga ou ambígua"],"ru":["Требует контекста разговора для вывода имени изменения","Может запросить выбор изменения, если входные данные неоднозначны или расплывчаты"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج اسم التغيير","قد يطلب اختيار التغيير إذا كانت المدخلات غامضة أو غير واضحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
