tilizado para cada cambio"],"fr":["Backend léger GraphQL et Prisma.io","Archive des modifications terminées dans le flux de travail expérimental","Permet la sélection de modifications disponibles","Utilise l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection de modifications","Affiche uniquement les modifications actives","Inclut le schéma utilisé pour chaque modification"],"de":["Leichtes GraphQL- und Prisma.io-Backend","Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow archivieren","Ermöglicht die Auswahl verfügbarer Änderungen","Verwendet das Tool AskUserQuestion für die Auswahl von Änderungen","Zeigt nur aktive Änderungen an","Inklusive des für jede Änderung verwendeten Schemas"],"pt":["Arquivamento de mudanças completas","Backend leve GraphQL","Integração com Prisma.io","Seleção de mudanças ativas","Prompt para seleção de mudanças"],"ru":["Архивация завершенных изменений","Легкий backend GraphQL","Интеграция с Prisma.io","Выбор активных изменений","Промпт для выбора изменений"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة","خلفية GraphQL الخفيفة","التكامل مع Prisma.io","اختيار التغييرات النشطة","تذييل لاختيار التغييرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-archive-change","GraphQL","Prisma.io","Node.js","实验工作流","改变存档","轻量级后端"],"ja":["openspec-archive-change","GraphQL","Prisma.io","Node.js","実験ワークフロー","変更アーカイブ","軽量バックエンド"],"ko":["openspec-archive-change","GraphQL","Prisma.io","Node.js","실험 워크플로우","변경 보관","경량 백엔드"],"es":["openspec-archive-change","GraphQL","Prisma.io","backend ligero","flujo de trabajo experimental","archivar cambios","seleccionar cambios","AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["openspec-archive-change","GraphQL","Prisma.io","backend léger","flux de travail expérimental","archiver des modifications","sélectionner des modifications","AskUserQuestion"],"de":["openspec-archive-change","GraphQL","Prisma.io","leichtes Backend","experimenteller Workflow","Änderungen archivieren","Änderungen auswählen","AskUserQuestion"],"pt":["openspec-archive-change","arquivamento de mudanças","workflow experimental","GraphQL","Prisma.io","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["openspec-archive-change","архивация изменений","экспериментальный workflow","GraphQL","Prisma.io","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["openspec-archive-change","أرشفة التغييرات","تدفق العمل التجريبي","GraphQL","Prisma.io","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"uxname","repo":"liteend","repoPath":"uxname/liteend","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:51:06.714Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Node.js Agents requiring efficient workflow management through GraphQL and Prisma.io integration.","zh":"适用于需要通过 GraphQL 和 Prisma.io 集成进行高效工作流管理的 Node.js 代理。","ja":"GraphQL と Prisma.io 統合を通じて効率的なワークフローマネージメントを必要とする Node.js エージェントに適しています。","ko":"GraphQL 및 Prisma.io 통합을 통해 효율적인 워크플로우 관리가 필요한 Node.js 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Node.js que requieren una gestión de flujo de trabajo eficiente a través de la integración de GraphQL y Prisma.io.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Node.js nécessitant une gestion de workflow efficace via l''intégration de GraphQL et Prisma.io.","de":"Ideal für Node.js-Agents, die eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung durch die Integration von GraphQL und Prisma.io erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Node.js que exigem gestão de fluxo de trabalho eficiente por meio da integração do GraphQL e do Prisma.io.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Node.js, требующих эффективного управления рабочим процессом через интеграцию GraphQL и Prisma.io.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Node.js الذي يتطلب إدارة سير العمل الفعالة من خلال التكامل معGraphQL و Prisma.io"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly archive completed changes in experimental workflows using GraphQL queries and Prisma.io, streamlining workflow management by prompting users for change selection and handling active change archival.","zh":"赋予代理无缝存档实验工作流中完成的更改，使用 GraphQL 查询和 Prisma.io，通过提示用户选择更改和处理活动更改存档来简化工作流管理。","ja":"エージェントに、GraphQL クエリと Prisma.io を使用して実験ワークフローで完了した変更をシームレスにアーカイブする機能を提供し、変更の選択をユーザーに提示し、有効な変更のアーカイブを処理することでワークフローマネージメントを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 GraphQL 쿼리와 Prisma.io를 사용하여 실험 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경 사항을 무중단으로 아카이브할 수 있도록 하며, 변경 사항 선택을 사용자에게 제안하고 활성 변경 사항 아카이브를 처리함으로써 워크플로우 관리를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para archivar de forma transparente los cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales utilizando consultas de GraphQL y Prisma.io, racionalizando la gestión de flujos de trabajo al solicitar a los usuarios la selección de cambios y gestionar el archivo de cambios activos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver de manière transparente les changements complets dans les flux de travail expérimentaux en utilisant des requêtes GraphQL et Prisma.io, rationalisant la gestion des flux de travail en demandant aux utilisateurs de sélectionner les changements et en gérant l''archivage des changements actifs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows mithilfe von GraphQL-Abfragen und Prisma.io nahtlos zu archivieren, rationalisiert die Workflow-Verwaltung, indem Benutzern die Änderungsauswahl angezeigt wird und die Archivierung aktiver Änderungen gehandhabt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar mudanças concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais usando consultas GraphQL e Prisma.io, racionalizando a gestão do fluxo de trabalho ao solicitar aos usuários a seleção de mudanças e lidar com o arquivamento de mudanças ativas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовного архивирования завершенных изменений в экспериментальных рабочих процессах с использованием запросов GraphQL и Prisma.io, оптимизируя управление рабочим процессом путем запроса к пользователям выбора изменений и обработки архивирования активных изменений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سير العمل التجريبي باستخدام استفسارات GraphQL و Prisma.io، ويراقب إدارة سير العمل من خلال طلب تحديد التغييرات من المستخدمين ومعالجة أرشفة التغييرات النشطة."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed changes in experimental workflows","Prompting users for change selection","Managing active changes with Prisma.io and GraphQL"],"zh":["存档实验工作流中完成的更改","提示用户选择更改","使用 Prisma.io 和 GraphQL 管理活动更改"],"ja":["実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブする","変更の選択をユーザーに提示する","Prisma.io と GraphQL を使用して有効な変更を管理する"],"ko":["실험 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경 사항을 아카이브하는 것","사용자에게 변경 사항 선택을 제안하는 것","Prisma.io 및 GraphQL을 사용하여 활성 변경 사항을 관리하는 것"],"es":["Archivar cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales","Solicitar a los usuarios la selección de cambios","Gestionar cambios activos con Prisma.io y GraphQL"],"fr":["Archiver les changements complets dans les flux de travail expérimentaux","Demander aux utilisateurs de sélectionner les changements","Gérer les changements actifs avec Prisma.io et GraphQL"],"de":["Abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows archivieren","Benutzern die Änderungsauswahl anbieten","Aktive Änderungen mit Prisma.io und GraphQL verwalten"],"pt":["Arquivamento de mudanças concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais","Solicitação de seleção de mudanças aos usuários","Gestão de mudanças ativas com Prisma.io e GraphQL"],"ru":["Архивирование завершенных изменений в экспериментальных рабочих процессах","Запрос к пользователям выбора изменений","Управление активными изменениями с помощью Prisma.io и GraphQL"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سير العمل التجريبي","طلب تحديد التغييرات من المستخدمين","إدارة التغييرات النشطة مع Prisma.io و GraphQL"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Dependent on Prisma.io and GraphQL setup","Needs access to conversation context for change name inference"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 环境","依赖于 Prisma.io 和 GraphQL 设置","需要对话上下文访问以进行更改名称推断"],"ja":["Node.js 環境が必要","Prisma.io と GraphQL の設定に依存する","変更名の推論のために会話コンテキストへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요함","Prisma.io 및 GraphQL 설정에 의존함","변경 이름 추론을 위해 대화 컨텍스트 액세스가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Node.js","Dependiente de la configuración de Prisma.io y GraphQL","Necesita acceso al contexto de conversación para inferir el nombre del cambio"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Dépend de la configuration de Prisma.io et GraphQL","Nécessite un accès au contexte de conversation pour inférer le nom du changement"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js-Umgebung","Abhängig von der Konfiguration von Prisma.io und GraphQL","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Konversationskontext, um den Änderungsnamen abzuleiten"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Node.js","Dependente da configuração do Prisma.io e GraphQL","Necessita acesso ao contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da mudança"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Зависит от настройки Prisma.io и GraphQL","Требует доступа к контексту разговора для вывода имени изменения"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","يعتمد على إعداد Prisma.io و GraphQL","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى سياق المحادثة لاستدلال اسم التغيير"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
