ершенных изменений","Выбор активных изменений","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion","Выполнение команд openspec","Поддержка экспериментального рабочего процесса"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة","اختيار التغييرات النشطة","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion","تشغيل أوامر openspec","دعم تدفق العمل التجريبي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-archive-change","实验性工作流程","变更存档","开发效率","工作流程优化","自动化","用户交互"],"ja":["openspec-archive-change","実験的ワークフロー","変更アーカイブ","開発効率","ワークフロー最適化","自動化","ユーザーインタラクション"],"ko":["openspec-archive-change","실험적 워크플ロー","변경 아카이브","개발 효율","워크플ロー 최적화","자동화","사용자 상호작용"],"es":["openspec","archivar cambios","flujo de trabajo experimental","desarrollo de software","AskUserQuestion","comando openspec list --json"],"fr":["openspec","archiver les modifications","flux de travail expérimental","développement de logiciels","AskUserQuestion","commande openspec list --json"],"de":["openspec","änderungen archivieren","experimenteller workflow","software-entwicklung","AskUserQuestion","befehl openspec list --json"],"pt":["openspec-archive-change","arquivamento de alterações","fluxo de trabalho experimental","AskUserQuestion tool","comandos openspec","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["openspec-archive-change","архивирование изменений","экспериментальный рабочий процесс","инструмент AskUserQuestion","команды openspec","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["openspec-archive-change","أرشفة التغييرات","تدفق العمل التجريبي","أداة AskUserQuestion","أوامر openspec","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"ai-assisted-engineering","repoPath":"gAmUssA/ai-assisted-engineering","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:51:20.949Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring efficient workflow management, particularly those utilizing the openspec framework for experimental workflow tracking.","zh":"适合需要高效工作流管理的开发代理，特别是那些使用openspec框架进行实验工作流跟踪的代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが効率的なワークフローの管理を必要とする場合、特に実験的ワークフローのトラッキングにopenspecフレームワークを使用する場合に適しています。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 효율적인 워크플로우 관리를 필요로 하는 경우, 특히 실험적 워크플로우 추적에 openspec 프레임워크를 사용하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una gestión de flujo de trabajo eficiente, particularmente aquellos que utilizan el marco openspec para el seguimiento de flujo de trabajo experimental.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement nécessitant une gestion de workflow efficace, en particulier ceux utilisant le cadre openspec pour la traçabilité de workflow expérimental.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung benötigen, insbesondere solche, die das openspec-Framework für die experimentelle Workflow-Verfolgung verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho eficiente, particularmente aqueles que utilizam o framework openspec para rastreamento de fluxo de trabalho experimental.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих эффективного управления рабочим процессом, особенно для тех, кто использует фреймворк openspec для отслеживания экспериментального рабочего процесса.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيون الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تدفق العمل الفعالة، وخاصة أولئك الذين يستخدمون إطار العمل openspec لتتبع تدفق العمل التجريبي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to archive completed changes in the experimental workflow by running `openspec list --json` and utilizing the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, ensuring seamless integration with JSON data and openspec schema.","zh":"使代理能够通过运行`openspec list --json`并利用AskUserQuestion工具进行用户选择来存档实验工作流中的完成更改，从而确保与JSON数据和openspec模式的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが`openspec list --json`を実行し、AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザー選択を行うことで、実験的ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブできるようにし、JSONデータとopenspecスキーマとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 `openspec list --json`을 실행하고 AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 사용자 선택을 수행함으로써 실험적 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경 사항을 아카이브할 수 있도록 하며, JSON 데이터와 openspec 스키마との无缝한 통합을 обеспеч합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar los cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental ejecutando `openspec list --json` y utilizando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la selección de usuarios, garantizando una integración sin problemas con los datos JSON y el esquema openspec.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver les modifications terminées dans le workflow expérimental en exécutant `openspec list --json` et en utilisant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection des utilisateurs, assurant une intégration transparente avec les données JSON et le schéma openspec.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die abgeschlossenen Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow zu archivieren, indem sie `openspec list --json` ausführen und das Tool AskUserQuestion für die Benutzerauswahl verwenden, was eine nahtlose Integration mit JSON-Daten und openspec-Schema gewährleistet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar alterações concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental executando `openspec list --json` e utilizando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção de usuário, garantindo integração perfeita com dados JSON e esquema openspec.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальном рабочем процессе, выполняя `openspec list --json` и используя инструмент AskUserQuestion для выбора пользователя, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с данными JSON и схемой openspec.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي من خلال تشغيل `openspec list --json` واستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لتحديد المستخدم، مما يضمن التكامل السلس مع بيانات JSON ومخطط openspec."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed experimental changes","Managing active changes in the workflow","Prompting users for change selection"],"zh":["存档完成的实验更改","管理工作流中的活动更改","提示用户选择更改"],"ja":["完了した実験的変更をアーカイブする","ワークフロー中的アクティブな変更を管理する","ユーザーに変更の選択を求める"],"ko":["완료된 실험적 변경을 아카이브하는 것","워크플로우中的 활동 변경을 관리하는 것","사용자에게 변경 선택을 요구하는 것"],"es":["Archivar los cambios experimentales completados","Gestionar los cambios activos en el flujo de trabajo","Solicitar a los usuarios que seleccionen cambios"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications expérimentales terminées","Gérer les modifications actives dans le workflow","Inviter les utilisateurs à sélectionner des modifications"],"de":["Abgeschlossene experimentelle Änderungen archivieren","Aktive Änderungen im Workflow verwalten","Benutzer auffordern, Änderungen auszuwählen"],"pt":["Arquivamento de alterações experimentais concluídas","Gerenciamento de alterações ativas no fluxo de trabalho","Solicitação de seleção de alterações ao usuário"],"ru":["Архивация завершенных экспериментальных изменений","Управление активными изменениями в рабочем процессе","Запрос к пользователю выбора изменений"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات التجريبية المكتملة","إدارة التغييرات النشطة في تدفق العمل","استئناف اختيار التغييرات للمستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec framework installation","Needs access to experimental workflow data","Limited to archiving active, unarchived changes"],"zh":["需要openspec框架的安装","需要访问实验工作流数据","仅限存档活动、未存档的更改"],"ja":["openspecフレームワークのインストールが必要","実験的ワークフローデータへのアクセスが必要","アクティブでアーカイブされていない変更のみをアーカイブできる"],"ko":["openspec 프레임워크의 설치가 필요","실험적 워크플로우 데이터에 대한 액세스가 필요","활동 및 아카이브되지 않은 변경만 아카이브할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del marco openspec","Necesita acceso a los datos del flujo de trabajo experimental","Limitado a archivar cambios activos, no archivados"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du cadre openspec","Besoin d''accès aux données du workflow expérimental","Limité à l''archivage des modifications actives, non archivées"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des openspec-Frameworks","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Daten des experimentellen Workflows","Begrenzt auf die Archivierung aktiver, nicht archivierter Änderungen"],"pt":["Exige instalação do framework openspec","Necessita acesso a dados de fluxo de trabalho experimental","Limitado ao arquivamento de alterações ativas, não arquivadas"],"ru":["Требует установку фреймворка openspec","Требует доступа к данным экспериментального рабочего процесса","Ограничен архивацией активных, неархивированных изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت إطار العمل openspec","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى بيانات تدفق العمل التجريبي","محدود بأرشفة التغييرات النشطة غير المأرشفة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('brtstore4340-glitch/POS_SUPA/tailwind-design-system', 'community', 'brtstore4340-glitch', 'POS_SUPA', 'brtstore4340-glitch/POS_SUPA', 'tailwind-design-system', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z', '2026-02-18T11:52:06.035Z', NULL, '{"id":"brtstore4340-glitch/POS_SUPA/tailwind-design-system","name":"tailwind-design-system","description":{"zh":"Tailwind 设计系统允许开发者构建生产就绪的设计系统，包括设计令牌、组件变体和响应式模式","ja":"Tailwind デザインシステムは、開発者がデザイントークン、コンポーネントバリアント、レスポンシブパターンを含む生産就緒のデザインシステムを構築できるようにします","ko":"Tailwind 디자인 시스템은 개발자가 디자인 토큰, 컴포넌트 변형, 반응형 패턴을 포함한 프로덕션 준비된 디자인 시스템을 구축할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"El sistema de diseño Tailwind es una herramienta para crear bibliotecas de componentes personalizados con Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Le système de conception Tailwind est un outil pour créer des bibliothèques de composants personnalisés avec Tailwind CSS.","de":"Das Tailwind-Design-System ist ein Werkzeug zum Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Komponentenbibliotheken mit Tailwind CSS.","pt":"O sistema de design Tailwind permite criar bibliotecas de componentes personalizadas e padrões de UI consistentes.","ru":"Дизайн-система Tailwind позволяет создавать настраиваемые библиотеки компонентов и последовательные шаблоны UI.","ar":"يناسب نظام تصميم تيلويند إنشاء مكتبات مكونات مخصصة وأنماط واجهة مستخدم متسقة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tailwind 设计系统 - 构建生产就绪的设计系统","ja":"Tailwind デザインシステム - 生産就緒のデザインシステムを構築","ko":"Tailwind 디자인 시스템 - 프로덕션 준비된 디자인 시스템 구축","es":"Sistema de diseño Tailwind","fr":"Système de conception Tailwind","de":"Tailwind-Design-System","pt":"Sistema de Design Tailwind","ru":"Дизайн-система Tailwind","ar":"نظام تصميم تيلويند","en":"tailwind-design-system"},"description":{"zh":"Tailwind 设计系统允许开发者构建生产就绪的设计系统，包括设计令牌、组件变体和响应式模式","ja":"Tailwind デザインシステムは、開発者がデザイントークン、コンポーネントバリアント、レスポンシブパターンを含む生産就緒のデザインシステムを構築できるようにします","ko":"Tailwind 디자인 시스템은 개발자가 디자인 토큰, 컴포넌트 변형, 반응형 패턴을 포함한 프로덕션 준비된 디자인 시스템을 구축할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"El sistema de diseño Tailwind es una herramienta para crear bibliotecas de componentes personalizados con Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Le système de conception Tailwind est un outil pour créer des bibliothèques de composants personnalisés avec Tailwind CSS.","de":"Das Tailwind-Design-System ist ein Werkzeug zum Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Komponentenbibliotheken mit Tailwind CSS.","pt":"O sistema de design Tailwind permite criar bibliotecas de componentes personalizadas e padrões de UI consistentes.","ru":"Дизайн-система Tailwind позволяет создавать настраиваемые библиотеки компонентов и последовательные шаблоны UI.","ar":"يناسب نظام تصميم تيلويند إنشاء مكتبات مكونات مخصصة وأنماط واجهة مستخدم متسقة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设计令牌","组件变体","响应式模式","无障碍功能","暗黑模式和色彩方案"],"ja":["デザイントークン","コンポーネントバリアント","レスポンシブパターン","アクセシビリティ機能","ダークモードとカラースキーム"],"ko":["디자인 토큰","컴포넌트 변형","반응형 패턴","접근성 기능","다크 모드 및 색상 구성"],"es":["Tokens de diseño personalizados","Componentes responsivos","Patrones de diseño accesibles","Bibliotecas de componentes personalizadas","Implementación de temas y modos oscuros","Estándares de patrones de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Jetons de conception personnalisés","Composants responsives","Modèles de conception accessibles","Bibliothèques de composants personnalisés","Implémentation de thèmes et de modes sombres","Normes de modèles d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Design-Tokens","Responsive Komponenten","Zugängliche Designmuster","Benutzerdefinierte Komponentenbibliotheken","Implementierung von Themen und Dunkelmodus","Benutzeroberflächen-Musterstandards"],"pt":["Criação de bibliotecas de componentes personalizadas","Implementação de tokens de design e temas","Criação de componentes responsivos e acessíveis","Padrões de UI consistentes em todo o código","Migração para ou extensão do Tailwind CSS","Configuração de modo escuro e esquemas de cores"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых библиотек компонентов","Реализация токенов дизайна и тем","Создание отзывчивых и доступных компонентов","Последовательные шаблоны UI во всем коде","Миграция на или расширение Tailwind CSS","Настройка темного режима и цветовых схем"],"ar":["إنشاء مكتبات مكونات مخصصة","تنفيذ رموز التصميم والسمات","إنشاء مكونات استجابة و易 الوصول","أنماط واجهة مستخدم متسقة في جميع أنحاء الكود","هجرة إلى أو توسيع Tailwind CSS","ضبط وضع المظلم وسلاسل الألوان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","设计系统","生产就绪","设计令牌","组件变体","响应式模式","无障碍功能","暗黑模式"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","デザインシステム","生産就緒","デザイントークン","コンポーネントバリアント","レスポンシブパターン","アクセシビリティ機能","ダークモード"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","디자인 시스템","프로덕션 준비","디자인 토큰","컴포넌트 변형","반응형 패턴","접근성 기능","다크 모드"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","sistema de diseño","componentes personalizados","tokens de diseño","patrones responsivos","accesibilidad","bibliotecas de componentes","temas y modos oscuros"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","système de conception","composants personnalisés","jetons de conception","modèles responsives","accessibilité","bibliothèques de composants","thèmes et modes sombres"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Design-System","benutzerdefinierte Komponenten","Design-Tokens","responsive Muster","Zugänglichkeit","Komponentenbibliotheken","Themen und Dunkelmodus"],"pt":["sistema de design tailwind","tailwind css","design tokens","componentes responsivos","acessibilidade","padrões de ui","migração tailwind","modo escuro","esquemas de cores"],"ru":["дизайн-система tailwind","tailwind css","токены дизайна","отзывчивые компоненты","доступность","шаблоны ui","миграция tailwind","темный режим","цветовые схемы"],"ar":["نظام تصميم تيلويند","Tailwind CSS","رموز التصميم","مكونات استجابة","سهولة الوصول","أنماط واجهة المستخدم","هجرة تيلويند","وضع المظلم","سلاسل الألوان"]}},"owner":"brtstore4340-glitch","repo":"POS_SUPA","repoPath":"brtstore4340-glitch/POS_SUPA","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwind-design-system","description":"Build scalable design systems with Tailwind CSS, design tokens, component libraries, and responsive patterns. Use when creating component libraries, implementing design systems, or standardizing UI patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind Design System\n\nBuild production-ready design systems with Tailwind CSS, including design tokens, component variants, responsive patterns, and accessibility.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating a component library with Tailwind\n- Implementing design tokens and theming\n- Building responsive and accessible components\n- Standardizing UI patterns across a codebase\n- Migrating to or extending Tailwind CSS\n- Setting up dark mode and color schemes\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Design Token Hie","body":"# Tailwind Design System\n\nBuild production-ready design systems with Tailwind CSS, including design tokens, component variants, responsive patterns, and accessibility.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating a component library with Tailwind\n- Implementing design tokens and theming\n- Building responsive and accessible components\n- Standardizing UI patterns across a codebase\n- Migrating to or extending Tailwind CSS\n- Setting up dark mode and color schemes\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Design Token Hierarchy\n\n```\nBrand Tokens (abstract)\n    └── Semantic Tokens (purpose)\n        └── Component Tokens (specific)\n\nExample:\n    blue-500 → primary → button-bg\n```\n\n### 2. Component Architecture\n\n```\nBase styles → Variants → Sizes → States → Overrides\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```typescript\n// tailwind.config.ts\nimport type { Config } from \"tailwindcss\";\n\nconst config: Config = {\n  content: [\"./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}\"],\n  darkMode: \"class\",\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        // Semantic color tokens\n        primary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--primary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--primary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        secondary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--secondary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--secondary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        destructive: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--destructive))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--destructive-foreground))\",\n        },\n        muted: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--muted))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--muted-foreground))\",\n        },\n        accent: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--accent))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--accent-foreground))\",\n        },\n        background: \"hsl(var(--background))\",\n        foreground: \"hsl(var(--foreground))\",\n        border: \"hsl(var(--border))\",\n        ring: \"hsl(var(--ring))\",\n      },\n      borderRadius: {\n        lg: \"var(--radius)\",\n        md: \"calc(var(--radius) - 2px)\",\n        sm: \"calc(var(--radius) - 4px)\",\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [require(\"tailwindcss-animate\")],\n};\n\nexport default config;\n```\n\n```css\n/* globals.css */\n@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --secondary: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --muted: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215 20.2% 65.1%;\n    --accent: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --accent-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --destructive: 0 62.8% 30.6%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --ring: 212.7 26.8% 83.9%;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: CVA (Class Variance Authority) Components\n\n```typescript\n// components/ui/button.tsx\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from ''class-variance-authority''\nimport { forwardRef } from ''react''\nimport { cn } from ''@/lib/utils''\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  // Base styles\n  ''inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50'',\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: ''bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90'',\n        destructive: ''bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90'',\n        outline: ''border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground'',\n        secondary: ''bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80'',\n        ghost: ''hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground'',\n        link: ''text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline'',\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: ''h-10 px-4 py-2'',\n        sm: ''h-9 rounded-md px-3'',\n        lg: ''h-11 rounded-md px-8'',\n        icon: ''h-10 w-10'',\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: ''default'',\n      size: ''default'',\n    },\n  }\n)\n\nexport interface ButtonProps\n  extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {\n  asChild?: boolean\n}\n\nconst Button = forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>(\n  ({ className, variant, size, asChild = false, ...props }, ref) => {\n    const Comp = asChild ? Slot : ''button''\n    return (\n      <Comp\n        className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, className }))}\n        ref={ref}\n        {...props}\n      />\n    )\n  }\n)\nButton.displayName = ''Button''\n\nexport { Button, buttonVariants }\n\n// Usage\n<Button variant=\"destructive\" size=\"lg\">Delete</Button>\n<Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n<Button asChild><Link href=\"/home\">Home</Link></Button>\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Compound Components\n\n```typescript\n// components/ui/card.tsx\nimport { cn } from ''@/lib/utils''\nimport { forwardRef } from ''react''\n\nconst Card = forwardRef<HTMLDivElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <div\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(\n        ''rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm'',\n        className\n      )}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  )\n)\nCard.displayName = ''Card''\n\nconst CardHeader = forwardRef<HTMLDivElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <div\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(''flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6'', className)}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  )\n)\nCardHeader.displayName = ''CardHeader''\n\nconst CardTitle = forwardRef<HTMLHeadingElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLHeadingElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <h3\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(''text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight'', className)}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  )\n)\nCardTitle.displayName = ''CardTitle''\n\nconst CardDescription = forwardRef<HTMLParagraphElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLParagraphElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <p\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(''text-sm text-muted-foreground'', className)}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  )\n)\nCardDescription.displayName = ''CardDescription''\n\nconst CardContent = forwardRef<HTMLDivElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <div ref={ref} className={cn(''p-6 pt-0'', className)} {...props} />\n  )\n)\nCardContent.displayName = ''CardContent''\n\nconst CardFooter = forwardRef<HTMLDivElement, React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <div\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(''flex items-center p-6 pt-0'', className)}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  )\n)\nCardFooter.displayName = ''CardFooter''\n\nexport { Card, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardDescription, CardContent, CardFooter }\n\n// Usage\n<Card>\n  <CardHeader>\n    <CardTitle>Account</CardTitle>\n    <CardDescription>Manage your account settings</CardDescription>\n  </CardHeader>\n  <CardContent>\n    <form>...</form>\n  </CardContent>\n  <CardFooter>\n    <Button>Save</Button>\n  </CardFooter>\n</Card>\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Form Components\n\n```typescript\n// components/ui/input.tsx\nimport { forwardRef } from ''react''\nimport { cn } from ''@/lib/utils''\n\nexport interface InputProps extends React.InputHTMLAttributes<HTMLInputElement> {\n  error?: string\n}\n\nconst Input = forwardRef<HTMLInputElement, InputProps>(\n  ({ className, type, error, ...props }, ref) => {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"relative\">\n        <input\n          type={type}\n          className={cn(\n            ''flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-sm ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50'',\n            error && ''border-destructive focus-visible:ring-destructive'',\n            className\n          )}\n          ref={ref}\n          aria-invalid={!!error}\n          aria-describedby={error ? `${props.id}-error` : undefined}\n          {...props}\n        />\n        {error && (\n          <p\n            id={`${props.id}-error`}\n            className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-destructive\"\n            role=\"alert\"\n          >\n            {error}\n          </p>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n)\nInput.displayName = ''Input''\n\n// components/ui/label.tsx\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from ''class-variance-authority''\n\nconst labelVariants = cva(\n  ''text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70''\n)\n\nconst Label = forwardRef<HTMLLabelElement, React.LabelHTMLAttributes<HTMLLabelElement>>(\n  ({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n    <label ref={ref} className={cn(labelVariants(), className)} {...props} />\n  )\n)\nLabel.displayName = ''Label''\n\n// Usage with React Hook Form\nimport { useForm } from ''react-hook-form''\nimport { zodResolver } from ''@hookform/resolvers/zod''\nimport * as z from ''zod''\n\nconst schema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(''Invalid email address''),\n  password: z.string().min(8, ''Password must be at least 8 characters''),\n})\n\nfunction LoginForm() {\n  const { register, handleSubmit, formState: { errors } } = useForm({\n    resolver: zodResolver(schema),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n      <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n        <Label htmlFor=\"email\">Email</Label>\n        <Input\n          id=\"email\"\n          type=\"email\"\n          {...register(''email'')}\n          error={errors.email?.message}\n        />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n        <Label htmlFor=\"password\">Password</Label>\n        <Input\n          id=\"password\"\n          type=\"password\"\n          {...register(''password'')}\n          error={errors.password?.message}\n        />\n      </div>\n      <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">Sign In</Button>\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Responsive Grid System\n\n```typescript\n// components/ui/grid.tsx\nimport { cn } from ''@/lib/utils''\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from ''class-variance-authority''\n\nconst gridVariants = cva(''grid'', {\n  variants: {\n    cols: {\n      1: ''grid-cols-1'',\n      2: ''grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2'',\n      3: ''grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3'',\n      4: ''grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4'',\n      5: ''grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5'',\n      6: ''grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6'',\n    },\n    gap: {\n      none: ''gap-0'',\n      sm: ''gap-2'',\n      md: ''gap-4'',\n      lg: ''gap-6'',\n      xl: ''gap-8'',\n    },\n  },\n  defaultVariants: {\n    cols: 3,\n    gap: ''md'',\n  },\n})\n\ninterface GridProps\n  extends React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof gridVariants> {}\n\nexport function Grid({ className, cols, gap, ...props }: GridProps) {\n  return (\n    <div className={cn(gridVariants({ cols, gap, className }))} {...props} />\n  )\n}\n\n// Container component\nconst containerVariants = cva(''mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8'', {\n  variants: {\n    size: {\n      sm: ''max-w-screen-sm'',\n      md: ''max-w-screen-md'',\n      lg: ''max-w-screen-lg'',\n      xl: ''max-w-screen-xl'',\n      ''2xl'': ''max-w-screen-2xl'',\n      full: ''max-w-full'',\n    },\n  },\n  defaultVariants: {\n    size: ''xl'',\n  },\n})\n\ninterface ContainerProps\n  extends React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof containerVariants> {}\n\nexport function Container({ className, size, ...props }: ContainerProps) {\n  return (\n    <div className={cn(containerVariants({ size, className }))} {...props} />\n  )\n}\n\n// Usage\n<Container>\n  <Grid cols={4} gap=\"lg\">\n    {products.map((product) => (\n      <ProductCard key={product.id} product={product} />\n    ))}\n  </Grid>\n</Container>\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Animation Utilities\n\n```typescript\n// lib/animations.ts - Tailwind CSS Animate utilities\nimport { cn } from ''./utils''\n\nexport const fadeIn = ''animate-in fade-in duration-300''\nexport const fadeOut = ''animate-out fade-out duration-300''\nexport const slideInFromTop = ''animate-in slide-in-from-top duration-300''\nexport const slideInFromBottom = ''animate-in slide-in-from-bottom duration-300''\nexport const slideInFromLeft = ''animate-in slide-in-from-left duration-300''\nexport const slideInFromRight = ''animate-in slide-in-from-right duration-300''\nexport const zoomIn = ''animate-in zoom-in-95 duration-300''\nexport const zoomOut = ''animate-out zoom-out-95 duration-300''\n\n// Compound animations\nexport const modalEnter = cn(fadeIn, zoomIn, ''duration-200'')\nexport const modalExit = cn(fadeOut, zoomOut, ''duration-200'')\nexport const dropdownEnter = cn(fadeIn, slideInFromTop, ''duration-150'')\nexport const dropdownExit = cn(fadeOut, ''slide-out-to-top'', ''duration-150'')\n\n// components/ui/dialog.tsx\nimport * as DialogPrimitive from ''@radix-ui/react-dialog''\n\nconst DialogOverlay = forwardRef<\n  React.ElementRef<typeof DialogPrimitive.Overlay>,\n  React.ComponentPropsWithoutRef<typeof DialogPrimitive.Overlay>\n>(({ className, ...props }, ref) => (\n  <DialogPrimitive.Overlay\n    ref={ref}\n    className={cn(\n      ''fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/80'',\n      ''data-[state=open]:animate-in data-[state=closed]:animate-out'',\n      ''data-[state=closed]:fade-out-0 data-[state=open]:fade-in-0'',\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  />\n))\n\nconst DialogContent = forwardRef<\n  React.ElementRef<typeof DialogPrimitive.Content>,\n  React.ComponentPropsWithoutRef<typeof DialogPrimitive.Content>\n>(({ className, children, ...props }, ref) => (\n  <DialogPortal>\n    <DialogOverlay />\n    <DialogPrimitive.Content\n      ref={ref}\n      className={cn(\n        ''fixed left-[50%] top-[50%] z-50 grid w-full max-w-lg translate-x-[-50%] translate-y-[-50%] gap-4 border bg-background p-6 shadow-lg'',\n        ''data-[state=open]:animate-in data-[state=closed]:animate-out'',\n        ''data-[state=closed]:fade-out-0 data-[state=open]:fade-in-0'',\n        ''data-[state=closed]:zoom-out-95 data-[state=open]:zoom-in-95'',\n        ''data-[state=closed]:slide-out-to-left-1/2 data-[state=closed]:slide-out-to-top-[48%]'',\n        ''data-[state=open]:slide-in-from-left-1/2 data-[state=open]:slide-in-from-top-[48%]'',\n        ''sm:rounded-lg'',\n        className\n      )}\n      {...props}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </DialogPrimitive.Content>\n  </DialogPortal>\n))\n```\n\n### Pattern 6: Dark Mode Implementation\n\n```typescript\n// providers/ThemeProvider.tsx\n''use client''\n\nimport { createContext, useContext, useEffect, useState } from ''react''\n\ntype Theme = ''dark'' | ''light'' | ''system''\n\ninterface ThemeProviderProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  defaultTheme?: Theme\n  storageKey?: string\n}\n\ninterface ThemeContextType {\n  theme: Theme\n  setTheme: (theme: Theme) => void\n  resolvedTheme: ''dark'' | ''light''\n}\n\nconst ThemeContext = createContext<ThemeContextType | undefined>(undefined)\n\nexport function ThemeProvider({\n  children,\n  defaultTheme = ''system'',\n  storageKey = ''theme'',\n}: ThemeProviderProps) {\n  const [theme, setTheme] = useState<Theme>(defaultTheme)\n  const [resolvedTheme, setResolvedTheme] = useState<''dark'' | ''light''>(''light'')\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const stored = localStorage.getItem(storageKey) as Theme | null\n    if (stored) setTheme(stored)\n  }, [storageKey])\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const root = window.document.documentElement\n    root.classList.remove(''light'', ''dark'')\n\n    let resolved: ''dark'' | ''light''\n\n    if (theme === ''system'') {\n      resolved = window.matchMedia(''(prefers-color-scheme: dark)'').matches\n        ? ''dark''\n        : ''light''\n    } else {\n      resolved = theme\n    }\n\n    root.classList.add(resolved)\n    setResolvedTheme(resolved)\n  }, [theme])\n\n  const value = {\n    theme,\n    setTheme: (newTheme: Theme) => {\n      localStorage.setItem(storageKey, newTheme)\n      setTheme(newTheme)\n    },\n    resolvedTheme,\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <ThemeContext.Provider value={value}>{children}</ThemeContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport const useTheme = () => {\n  const context = useContext(ThemeContext)\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''useTheme must be used within ThemeProvider'')\n  return context\n}\n\n// components/ThemeToggle.tsx\nimport { Moon, Sun } from ''lucide-react''\nimport { useTheme } from ''@/providers/ThemeProvider''\n\nexport function ThemeToggle() {\n  const { resolvedTheme, setTheme } = useTheme()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      variant=\"ghost\"\n      size=\"icon\"\n      onClick={() => setTheme(resolvedTheme === ''dark'' ? ''light'' : ''dark'')}\n    >\n      <Sun className=\"h-5 w-5 rotate-0 scale-100 transition-all dark:-rotate-90 dark:scale-0\" />\n      <Moon className=\"absolute h-5 w-5 rotate-90 scale-0 transition-all dark:rotate-0 dark:scale-100\" />\n      <span className=\"sr-only\">Toggle theme</span>\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Utility Functions\n\n```typescript\n// lib/utils.ts\nimport { type ClassValue, clsx } from \"clsx\";\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\";\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs));\n}\n\n// Focus ring utility\nexport const focusRing = cn(\n  \"focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2\",\n  \"focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2\",\n);\n\n// Disabled utility\nexport const disabled = \"disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50\";\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Use CSS variables** - Enable runtime theming\n- **Compose with CVA** - Type-safe variants\n- **Use semantic colors** - `primary` not `blue-500`\n- **Forward refs** - Enable composition\n- **Add accessibility** - ARIA attributes, focus states\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t use arbitrary values** - Extend theme instead\n- **Don''t nest @apply** - Hurts readability\n- **Don''t skip focus states** - Keyboard users need them\n- **Don''t hardcode colors** - Use semantic tokens\n- **Don''t forget dark mode** - Test both themes\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Tailwind CSS Documentation](https://tailwindcss.com/docs)\n- [CVA Documentation](https://cva.style/docs)\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/)\n- [Radix Primitives](https://www.radix-ui.com/primitives)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:52:06.035Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined CSS development with Tailwind CSS","zh":"非常适合需要使用Tailwind CSS简化CSS开发的前端代理","ja":"Tailwind CSSを使用してCSS開発をストリームライン化する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 CSS 개발을 간소화해야 하는 프런트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan un desarrollo de CSS optimizado con Tailwind CSS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui ont besoin d''un développement de CSS optimisé avec Tailwind CSS","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine optimierte CSS-Entwicklung mit Tailwind CSS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de frontend que precisam de desenvolvimento de CSS simplificado com Tailwind CSS","ru":"Идеально для агентов frontend, которым необходим упрощенный разработка CSS с помощью Tailwind CSS","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنمية CSS مبسطة مع Tailwind CSS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build production-ready design systems with responsive patterns, accessibility features, and customizable design tokens using Tailwind CSS, streamlining the development of component libraries and UI standardization across codebases","zh":"赋予代理构建生产就绪的设计系统的能力，具有响应式模式、无障碍功能和可自定义的设计令牌，使用Tailwind CSS，简化组件库和UI标准化的开发，跨代码库","ja":"エージェントに、レスポンシブなパターン、アクセシビリティ機能、およびカスタマイズ可能なデザイントークンを使用して、Tailwind CSSで生産対応のデザインシステムを構築する能力を与え、コンポーネントライブラリとUIの標準化の開発を簡素化する","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 반응형 패턴, 접근성 기능 및 사용자 정의 디자인 토큰을 사용하여 생산 준비가 된 디자인 시스템을 구축할 수 있도록 하여, 컴포넌트 라이브러리 및 코드베이스 전반의 UI 표준화를 개발하는 것을 간소화","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear sistemas de diseño listos para producción con patrones responsivos, características de accesibilidad y tokens de diseño personalizables utilizando Tailwind CSS, optimizando el desarrollo de bibliotecas de componentes y la estandarización de la interfaz de usuario en todos los códigos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des systèmes de conception prêts pour la production avec des modèles responsives, des fonctionnalités d''accessibilité et des jetons de conception personnalisables en utilisant Tailwind CSS, optimisant ainsi le développement de bibliothèques de composants et la standardisation de l''interface utilisateur à travers les bases de code","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, produktionssichere Designs zu erstellen, mit responsiven Mustern, Zugriffsmöglichkeiten und anpassbaren Design-Tokens unter Verwendung von Tailwind CSS, wodurch die Entwicklung von Komponentenbibliotheken und die Standardisierung der Benutzeroberfläche in allen Codebasen optimiert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir sistemas de design prontos para produção com padrões responsivos, recursos de acessibilidade e tokens de design personalizáveis usando Tailwind CSS, simplificando o desenvolvimento de bibliotecas de componentes e a padronização da UI em todo o código","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать системы дизайна, готовые к производству, с отзывчивыми шаблонами, функциями доступности и настраиваемыми дизайн-токенами, используя Tailwind CSS, что упрощает разработку библиотек компонентов и стандартизацию интерфейса пользователя на всех кодовых базах","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء أنظمة التصميم الجاهزة للإنتاج مع الأنماط الاستجابة وميزات الوصول والرموز التصميمية القابلة للتعديل باستخدام Tailwind CSS، مما يبسط تطوير مكتبات المكونات ومعيار الواجهة المستخدمة عبر قواعد البيانات"},"useCases":{"en":["Building responsive and accessible components with Tailwind CSS","Implementing design tokens and theming for consistent UI patterns","Migrating to or extending Tailwind CSS for existing projects","Setting up dark mode and customizable color schemes"],"zh":["使用Tailwind CSS构建响应式和无障碍组件","实现设计令牌和主题以实现一致的UI模式","将现有项目迁移到或扩展Tailwind CSS","设置暗模式和可自定义的颜色方案"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSを使用してレスポンシブなコンポーネントとアクセシビリティの高いコンポーネントを構築する","デザイントークンとテーマを実装して一貫したUIパターンを実現する","既存のプロジェクトをTailwind CSSに移行または拡張する","ダークモードとカスタマイズ可能なカラースキームを設定する"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 반응형 및 접근성 높은 컴포넌트를 구축","디자인 토큰 및 테마를 구현하여 일관된 UI 패턴을 구현","기존 프로젝트를 Tailwind CSS로 마이그레이션하거나 확장","다크 모드 및 사용자 정의 가능한 색상 구성표를 설정"],"es":["Crear componentes responsivos y accesibles con Tailwind CSS","Implementar tokens de diseño y temas para patrones de interfaz de usuario coherentes","Migrar a o ampliar Tailwind CSS para proyectos existentes","Configurar el modo oscuro y esquemas de color personalizables"],"fr":["Créer des composants responsives et accessibles avec Tailwind CSS","Mettre en œuvre des jetons de conception et des thèmes pour des modèles d''interface utilisateur cohérents","Migrer vers ou étendre Tailwind CSS pour les projets existants","Configurer le mode sombre et les schémas de couleur personnalisables"],"de":["Erstellen von responsiven und zugänglichen Komponenten mit Tailwind CSS","Implementierung von Design-Tokens und Themen für konsistente Benutzeroberflächenmuster","Migration zu oder Erweiterung von Tailwind CSS für bestehende Projekte","Einrichten des Dunkelmodus und anpassbarer Farbschemata"],"pt":["Construir componentes responsivos e acessíveis com Tailwind CSS","Implementar tokens de design e temas para padrões de UI consistentes","Migrar para ou estender Tailwind CSS para projetos existentes","Configurar o modo escuro e esquemas de cores personalizáveis"],"ru":["Создание отзывчивых и доступных компонентов с помощью Tailwind CSS","Реализация дизайн-токенов и тем для согласованных шаблонов интерфейса пользователя","Переход на Tailwind CSS или расширение его для существующих проектов","Настройка темного режима и настраиваемых цветовых схем"],"ar":["بناء مكونات استجابة ويمكن الوصول إليها مع Tailwind CSS","تنفيذ رموز التصميم والسمات لانماط الواجهة المستخدمة المتسقة","الانتقال إلى Tailwind CSS أو توسيعها لمشاريع موجودة","تكوين الوضع الداكن والخطط اللونية القابلة للتعديل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Tailwind CSS and CSS development","Limited to frontend development and design systems"],"zh":["需要Tailwind CSS和CSS开发的知识","仅限于前端开发和设计系统"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSとCSS開発の知識が必要","フロントエンド開発とデザインシステムのみに限定"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 및 CSS 개발에 대한 지식이 필요","프론트엔드 개발 및 디자인 시스템에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Tailwind CSS y desarrollo de CSS","Limitado al desarrollo frontend y los sistemas de diseño"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Tailwind CSS et en développement de CSS","Limité au développement frontend et aux systèmes de conception"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Tailwind CSS und CSS-Entwicklung","Begrenzt auf die Frontend-Entwicklung und die Designs"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Tailwind CSS e desenvolvimento de CSS","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de frontend e sistemas de design"],"ru":["Требует знания Tailwind CSS и разработки CSS","Ограничен разработкой frontend и системами дизайна"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Tailwind CSS وتنمية CSS","محدود بالتنمية الأمامية وأنظمة التصميم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
