eistungsverbesserung","Optimierung der Datenladung auf Client- und Server-Seite","Leistungsverbesserung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen"],"pt":["45 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias para priorizar a otimização","Guia para refatoração automática e geração de código","Otimização para React e Next.js","Melhoria da performance da aplicação"],"ru":["45 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для определения приоритета оптимизации","Руководство для автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода","Оптимизация для React и Next.js","Улучшение производительности приложения"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحديد أولوية التحسين","دليل لإعادة هيكلة التطبيقات وتوليد الشفرة","تحسين الأداء لرياكت ونيكست.جس","تحسين أداء التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","最佳实践","性能优化","React 优化","Next.js 优化","自动重构","代码生成","应用性能"],"ja":["Vercel React","ベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化","React 最適化","Next.js 最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","アプリパフォーマンス"],"ko":["Vercel React","최적화 가이드","성능 최적화","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","애플리케이션 성능"],"es":["mejores prácticas de Vercel","optimización de rendimiento React","Next.js","refactorización automatizada","generación de código","carga de datos","rendimiento de aplicaciones","desarrollo de aplicaciones web","React y Next.js"],"fr":["bonnes pratiques Vercel","optimisation des performances React","Next.js","refactorisation automatique","génération de code","chargement de données","performances des applications","développement d''applications web","React et Next.js"],"de":["Vercel-Best-Practices","Leistungsoptimierung React","Next.js","automatisierte Refaktorierung","Codegenerierung","Datenladung","Leistung von Anwendungen","Webanwendungsentwicklung","React und Next.js"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","Melhores práticas","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","Performance optimization"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","Лучшие практики","React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["فيرسل رياكت","تحسين الأداء","أفضل الممارسات","رياكت","نيكست.جس","تطوير الويب","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"santos-sanz","repo":"zepp-viewer","repoPath":"santos-sanz/zepp-viewer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:53:12.092Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js application performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化React和Next.js应用程序性能的前端代理。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsのアプリケーションパフォーマンスを最適化する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Next.js 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan un rendimiento óptimo de aplicaciones React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un rendement optimal des applications React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes Leistungsverhalten von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado de aplicativos React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный性能 приложений React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء تطبيقات React و Next.js المُحسّن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages using 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s performance optimization guide for better client and server-side data fetching.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于React组件和Next.js页面，使用45条规则跨8个类别，按影响优先，并利用Vercel的性能优化指南以实现更好的客户端和服务器端数据获取。","ja":"ReactコンポーネントとNext.jsページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、8つのカテゴリにわたる45のルールを使用し、影響度に基づいて優先順位付けを行い、Vercelのパフォーマンス最適化ガイドを活用してクライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのデータ取得を改善します。","ko":"React 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지를 자동으로 리팩토링하고 코드를 생성할 수 있게 해주며, 8개 카테고리에 걸쳐 45개의 규칙을 사용하여 영향에 따라 우선순위를 정하며, Vercel의 성능 최적화 가이드를 활용하여 클라이언트 측과 서버 측 데이터 가져오기를 개선합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js utilizando 45 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, y aprovechando la guía de optimización de rendimiento de Vercel para una mejor captura de datos en el lado del cliente y del servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js en utilisant 45 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, et en exploitant le guide d''optimisation des performances de Vercel pour une meilleure collecte de données côté client et serveur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwendet werden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert sind und Vercels Leistungsoptimierungsleitfaden für eine bessere Datenabfrage auf Client- und Serverseite nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 45 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, e aproveitando o guia de otimização de desempenho da Vercel para uma melhor captura de dados do cliente e do servidor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях, отсортированных по влиянию, и используя руководство Vercel по оптимизации производительности для лучшей обработки данных на стороне клиента и сервера.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على توفير автомاتизации إعادة هيكلة وتوليد رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، باستخدام 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات، مصنفة حسب التأثير، وتستفيد من دليل تحسين الأداء من Vercel للحصول على أفضل جلب للبيانات على جانب العميل والخادم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better bundling","Reviewing code for performance issues and implementing data fetching improvements"],"zh":["自动化新React组件的性能优化","重构现有的React和Next.js代码以实现更好的打包","审查代码以查找性能问题并实施数据获取改进"],"ja":["新しいReactコンポーネントのパフォーマンス最適化の自動化","既存のReactとNext.jsコードのリファクタリングによるより良いバンドル化","パフォーマンスの問題を検出してコードをレビューし、データ取得の改善を実装する"],"ko":["새로운 React 컴포넌트의 성능 최적화를 자동화하는 것","기존의 React와 Next.js 코드를 리팩토링하여 더 나은 번들링을 하는 것","성능 문제를 찾고 코드를 검토하여 데이터 가져오기 개선 사항을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la optimización del rendimiento para nuevos componentes de React","Reestructuración del código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor empaquetado","Revisión del código para problemas de rendimiento y implementación de mejoras en la captura de datos"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''optimisation des performances pour les nouveaux composants React","Réorganisation du code existant de React et Next.js pour un meilleur regroupement","Examen du code pour les problèmes de performances et mise en œuvre d''améliorations pour la collecte de données"],"de":["Automatisierung der Leistungsoptimierung für neue React-Komponenten","Neustrukturierung des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für ein besseres Bündeln","Überprüfung des Codes auf Leistungsprobleme und Implementierung von Verbesserungen für die Datenabfrage"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para novos componentes React","Refatorar o código existente React e Next.js para um melhor empacotamento","Revisar o código para problemas de desempenho e implementar melhorias na captura de dados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для новых компонентов React","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей сборки","Просматривать код на наличие проблем с производительностью и внедрять улучшения в обработке данных"],"ar":["توفير تحسين الأداء التلقائي لمكونات React الجديدة","إعادة هيكلة رمز React و Next.js الحالي من أجل حزمة أفضل","مراجعة الشفرة لحل مشاكل الأداء وتطبيق تحسينات في جلب البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js application setup","Limited to Vercel''s predefined 45 rules and 8 categories"],"zh":["需要React或Next.js应用程序设置","仅限Vercel的预定义45条规则和8个类别"],"ja":["ReactまたはNext.jsアプリケーションのセットアップが必要","Vercelの事前に定義された45のルールと8つのカテゴリに限定される"],"ko":["React 또는 Next.js 애플리케이션 설정이 필요함","Vercel의 사전 정의된 45개 규칙과 8개 카테고리만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de la aplicación React o Next.js","Limitado a las 45 reglas predefinidas y 8 categorías de Vercel"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application React ou Next.js","Limité aux 45 règles prédéfinies et 8 catégories de Vercel"],"de":["Benötigt eine React- oder Next.js-Anwendungskonfiguration","Begrenzt auf Vercels vordefinierte 45 Regeln und 8 Kategorien"],"pt":["Requer configuração de aplicativo React ou Next.js","Limitado às 45 regras pré-definidas e 8 categorias da Vercel"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения React или Next.js","Ограничен 45 предопределенными правилами и 8 категориями Vercel"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق React أو Next.js","محدود بالقواعد المحددة مسبقًا البالغ عددها 45 وقسم 8 من Vercel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
