omponentes e páginas"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для React и Next.js","45 правил в 8 категориях","Руководство для автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода","Приоритизация правил по влиянию","Лучшие практики для написания компонентов и страниц"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت و نيكست.جس","45 قاعدة في 8 فئات","دليل لإعادة هيكلة التطبيقات وتوليد الكود","توجيه القواعد حسب التأثير","أفضل الممارسات لكتابة المكونات والصفحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React最佳实践","Next.js性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","React优化","Next.js优化","性能优化"],"ja":["Vercel React","Reactベストプラクティス","Next.jsパフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","React最適化","Next.js最適化","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["Vercel React","React 최적화","Next.js 성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","React 성능 최적화","Next.js 성능 최적화","성능 최적화"],"es":["vercel react","mejores prácticas react","optimización de rendimiento react","next.js performance","react optimization","vercel react best practices"],"fr":["vercel react","meilleures pratiques react","optimisation des performances react","next.js performance","react optimisation","vercel react best practices"],"de":["vercel react","best practices react","leistungsoptimierung react","next.js leistung","react optimierung","vercel react best practices"],"pt":["React","Next.js","Vercel","Otimização de desempenho","Melhores práticas","Desenvolvimento web","Aplicações web","React performance"],"ru":["React","Next.js","Vercel","Оптимизация производительности","Лучшие практики","Разработка веб-приложений","Веб-приложения","React производительность"],"ar":["رياكت","نيكست.جس","فيرسيل","تحسين الأداء","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير تطبيقات الويب","تطبيقات الويب","رياكت أداء"]}},"owner":"mmmmaharshi","repo":"living-word-telugu-bible","repoPath":"mmmmaharshi/living-word-telugu-bible","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:53:17.394Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents optimizing React and Next.js applications for performance and scalability.","zh":"非常适合用于优化 React 和 Next.js 应用程序以实现性能和可扩展性的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js アプリケーションのパフォーマンスとスケーラビリティを最適化するフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"성능과 확장성을 위해 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que optimizan aplicaciones React y Next.js para rendimiento y escalabilidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui optimisent les applications React et Next.js pour les performances et la scalabilité.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die React- und Next.js-Anwendungen für Leistung und Skalierbarkeit optimieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que otimizam aplicações React e Next.js para desempenho e escalabilidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, оптимизирующих приложения React и Next.js для производительности и масштабируемости.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين ي tối ưuية تطبيقات React و Next.js لأداء ومقاييس"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 45 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理人自动重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 45 条规则和 8 个类别进行全面性能优化，包括使用 Vercel 指南的数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、Vercel ガイドラインを使用したデータ取得とバンドルの最適化を含む 8 つのカテゴリの 45 のルールを利用して、包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を行います。","ko":"React 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지를 자동으로 리팩토링하고 코드를 생성하는 기능을 제공하며, 8개의 범주에 걸쳐 45개의 규칙을 사용하여 성능 최적화를 수행하며, Vercel 지침을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, aprovechando 45 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización de rendimiento integral, incluida la optimización de la recuperación de datos y la agrupación utilizando las pautas de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactorisation et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 45 règles dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation des performances complète, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement en utilisant les directives de Vercel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung genutzt werden, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung unter Verwendung der Vercel-Richtlinien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 45 regras em 8 categorias para otimização de desempenho abrangente, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando diretrizes do Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях для всесторонней оптимизации производительности, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и пакетирования с использованием руководств Vercel.","ar":"يُمكن एजنتات من تلقين إعادة هيكلة وتوليد رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، مستخدمين 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الأداء الشامل، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحسين التعبئة باستخدام إرشادات Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components","Generating optimized code for client and server-side data fetching","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance"],"zh":["自动优化新 React 组件的性能","为客户端和服务器端数据获取生成优化代码","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["新しい React コンポーネントのパフォーマンスを自動で最適化する","クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのデータ取得のために最適化されたコードを生成する","既存の React と Next.js コードをより良いパフォーマンスのためにリファクタリングする"],"ko":["새로운 React 컴포넌트의 성능을 자동으로 최적화하는 것","클라이언트 측과 서버 측 데이터 가져오기를 위한 최적화된 코드를 생성하는 것","기존의 React 및 Next.js 코드를 더 나은 성능을 위해 리팩토링하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para nuevos componentes de React","Generar código optimizado para la recuperación de datos en el cliente y en el servidor","Reorganizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les nouveaux composants React","Générer du code optimisé pour la récupération de données sur le client et le serveur","Réorganiser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für neue React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimiertem Code für die Datenabfrage auf Client- und Serverseite","Neustrukturieren des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für eine bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para novos componentes React","Gerar código otimizado para busca de dados do lado do cliente e do servidor","Refatorar o código existente do React e do Next.js para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для новых компонентов React","Генерировать оптимизированный код для извлечения данных на стороне клиента и сервера","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["تلقين تحسين الأداء التلقائي لمكونات React الجديدة","توليد رمز محسّن لاسترجاع البيانات على جانب العميل وخادم","إعادة هيكلة رمز React و Next.js الحالي من أجل أداء أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to applications hosted on Vercel","Dependent on Vercel''s guidelines for best practices"],"zh":["需要 React 和 Next.js 的知识","仅限于托管在 Vercel 上的应用程序","依赖于 Vercel 的最佳实践指南"],"ja":["React と Next.js の知識が必要","Vercel にホストされているアプリケーションに限定される","Vercel のベストプラクティス ガイドラインに依存する"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js의 지식이 필요함","Vercel에 호스팅된 애플리케이션으로 제한됨","Vercel의 최선의 관행 가이드에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones alojadas en Vercel","Dependiente de las pautas de Vercel para las mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité aux applications hébergées sur Vercel","Dépendant des directives de Vercel pour les meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf auf Vercel gehostete Anwendungen","Abhängig von den Vercel-Richtlinien für die besten Praktiken"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações hospedadas no Vercel","Dependente das diretrizes do Vercel para as melhores práticas"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Ограничен для приложений, размещенных на Vercel","Зависит от руководств Vercel для лучших практик"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات المضيفة على Vercel","يعتمد على إرشادات Vercel لأفضل الممارسات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
