el React ベストプラクティスガイドは、React と Next.js アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化するための包括的なガイドです。45 のルールと 8 つのカテゴリで構成されています","ko":"Vercel React 최적화 가이드는 React와 Next.js 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 방법에 대한 포괄적인 가이드입니다. 45개의 규칙과 8개의 카테고리로 구성되어 있습니다","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React y Next.js, con 45 reglas para mejorar el código","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React et Next.js, avec 45 règles pour améliorer le code","de":"Leitfaden für die Leistungsoptimierung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen, mit 45 Regeln für eine Verbesserung des Codes","pt":"Otimização de desempenho para aplicações React e Next.js com as melhores práticas da Vercel","ru":"Оптимизация производительности для приложений React и Next.js с помощью лучших практик Vercel","ar":"تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js مع أفضل الممارسات من Vercel","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["45 条性能优化规则","8 个类别","自动重构和代码生成","优化 React 和 Next.js 应用程序性能","提高应用程序的速度和效率","减少代码错误和 bug"],"ja":["45 のパフォーマンス最適化ルール","8 つのカテゴリ","自動リファクタリングとコード生成","React と Next.js アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化","アプリケーションの速度と効率を向上させる","コードエラーとバグを減らす"],"ko":["45개의 성능 최적화 규칙","8개의 카테고리","자동 리팩토링과 코드 생성","React와 Next.js 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화","애플리케이션의 속도와 효율성을 향상","코드 오류와 버그를 줄임"],"es":["45 reglas para optimizar el código","8 categorías para mejorar el rendimiento","Guía para refactorear y generar código","Soporte para React y Next.js","Priorización de reglas por impacto"],"fr":["45 règles pour optimiser le code","8 catégories pour améliorer les performances","Guide pour réfactorer et générer du code","Prise en charge de React et Next.js","Priorisation des règles par impact"],"de":["45 Regeln zur Optimierung des Codes","8 Kategorien zur Leistungsverbesserung","Leitfaden zur Refaktorisierung und Codegenerierung","Unterstützung für React und Next.js","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Auswirkung"],"pt":["45 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias para refatoração e geração de código","Priorização por impacto para refatoração automática","Otimização de bundling para aplicações React e Next.js","Melhores práticas para escrita de componentes React e páginas Next.js"],"ru":["45 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для рефакторинга и генерации кода","Приоритизация по воздействию для автоматического рефакторинга","Оптимизация бандлинга для приложений React и Next.js","Лучшие практики для написания компонентов React и страниц Next.js"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات للتحديث والتوليد التلقائي للرمز","التحديد بالأولوية لتوليد الرمز التلقائي","تحسين التعبئة لتطبيقات React و Next.js","أفضل الممارسات لكتابة مكونات React وصفحات Next.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 性能优化","Next.js 性能优化","Vercel React","React 优化指南","Next.js 优化指南","前端性能优化","自动重构","代码生成"],"ja":["React パフォーマンス最適化","Next.js パフォーマンス最適化","Vercel React","React 最適化ガイド","Next.js 最適化ガイド","フロントエンドパフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成"],"ko":["React 성능 최적화","Next.js 성능 최적화","Vercel React","React 최적화 가이드","Next.js 최적화 가이드","프론트엔드 성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성"],"es":["vercel react","mejores prácticas react","optimización de rendimiento react","next.js","react performance optimization","vercel best practices"],"fr":["vercel react","meilleures pratiques react","optimisation des performances react","next.js","react performance optimization","vercel best practices"],"de":["vercel react","vercel best practices","react leistungsoptimierung","next.js","react performance optimization","vercel react beste praxis"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas React","Otimização de desempenho React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","React performance optimization","Vercel React best practices"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики React","Оптимизация производительности React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","React производительность оптимизация","Vercel React лучшие практики"],"ar":["Vercel React","أفضل الممارسات React","تحسين الأداء React","Next.js","تطوير الويب","تحسين أداء React","أفضل الممارسات Vercel React"]}},"owner":"quoclucnguyen","repo":"start-new","repoPath":"quoclucnguyen/start-new","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:53:23.473Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing expert guidance on React and Next.js performance optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要在React和Next.js性能优化方面获得专家指导的前端代理。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsのパフォーマンス最適化に関する専門家の指導が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Next.js 성능 최적화에 관한 전문가의 지침이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan orientación experta sobre optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de conseils d''experts sur l''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die expertenbasierte Anleitung zur Leistungsoptimierung von React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de orientação especializada em otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется экспертное руководство по оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات خبيرة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 45 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel''s best practices.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于React组件和Next.js页面，利用45条规则，跨8个类别实现全面性能优化，包括使用Vercel最佳实践的数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"エージェントにReactコンポーネントとNext.jsページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、45のルールを8つのカテゴリにわたって使用して包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を実現し、Vercelのベストプラクティスを使用したデータ取得とバンドル最適化を含みます。","ko":"에이전트에게 React 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 45개의 규칙을 8개의 범주에 걸쳐 사용하여 포괄적인 성능 최적화를 실현하며, Vercel의 최적화된 관행을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, aprovechando 45 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización de rendimiento integral, incluida la optimización de la recolección de datos y la agrupación utilizando las mejores prácticas de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactorisation et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 45 règles réparties dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation complète des performances, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement en utilisant les meilleures pratiques de Vercel.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Refaktorisierung und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem es 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien nutzt, um eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung zu ermöglichen, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung unter Verwendung der Best Practices von Vercel.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 45 regras em 8 categorias para uma otimização de desempenho abrangente, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando as melhores práticas da Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях для всесторонней оптимизации производительности, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и сборки с использованием лучших практик Vercel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير آلي لاعادة بناء وتوليد رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، مستفيدة من 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الأداء الشامل، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحزيم باستخدام أفضل الممارسات لشركة Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React and Next.js applications","Generating optimized code for new React components and Next.js pages","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance and maintainability"],"zh":["自动化React和Next.js应用程序的代码审查以发现性能问题","为新的React组件和Next.js页面生成优化的代码","重构现有的React和Next.js代码以获得更好的性能和可维护性"],"ja":["ReactとNext.jsアプリケーションのコードレビューを自動化してパフォーマンスの問題を特定する","新しいReactコンポーネントとNext.jsページのための最適化されたコードを生成する","既存のReactとNext.jsコードをリファクタリングしてパフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を向上させる"],"ko":["React와 Next.js 애플리케이션의 코드 리뷰를 자동화하여 성능 문제를 식별하는 것","새로운 React 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지를 위한 최적화된 코드를 생성하는 것","기존의 React와 Next.js 코드를 리팩토링하여 성능과 유지 보수성을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento en aplicaciones React y Next.js","Generación de código optimizado para nuevos componentes de React y páginas de Next.js","Refactorización de código existente de React y Next.js para una mejor rendimiento y mantenibilidad"],"fr":["Automatisation des examens de code pour les problèmes de performances dans les applications React et Next.js","Génération de code optimisé pour les nouveaux composants React et les pages Next.js","Refactorisation du code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances et maintenabilité"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme in React- und Next.js-Anwendungen","Generierung von optimiertem Code für neue React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten","Refaktorisierung von bestehendem React- und Next.js-Code für bessere Leistung und Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho em aplicações React e Next.js","Gerar código otimizado para novos componentes React e páginas Next.js","Reconstruir código existente React e Next.js para melhor desempenho e manutenção"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью в приложениях React и Next.js","Генерировать оптимизированный код для новых компонентов React и страниц Next.js","Перестраивать существующий код React и Next.js для улучшения производительности и поддержки"],"ar":["توفير آلي لمراجعة الشفرة لمشاكل الأداء في تطبيقات React و Next.js","توليد شفرة محسّنة لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js الجديدة","إعادة بناء الشفرة الحالية React و Next.js لتحسين ال