 Kategorien für die Priorisierung der Optimierung","Leitfaden für die automatische Refaktorierung","Optimierung der Codegenerierung","Verbesserung der Leistung von React und Next.js"],"pt":["45 regras para otimizar o desempenho","8 categorias para priorizar a refatoração","Guia para implementar a busca de dados","Otimização de bundles","Refatoração de código existente"],"ru":["45 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации рефакторинга","Руководство для реализации поиска данных","Оптимизация пакетов","Рефакторинг существующего кода"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحديد الأولوية لتحسين الكود","دليل لتنفيذ استرجاع البيانات","تحسين الحزم","تحسين الكود الحالي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 性能优化","Next.js 性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","React 优化","Next.js 优化","性能优化指南"],"ja":["Vercel React","React パフォーマンス最適化","Next.js パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","React 最適化","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化ガイド"],"ko":["Vercel React","React 성능 최적화","Next.js 성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","성능 최적화 가이드"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web","optimización de código","refactorización automática"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web","optimisation de code","refactorisation automatique"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung","Codeoptimierung","automatische Refaktorierung"],"pt":["Vercel React","melhores práticas","otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","desenvolvimento web","refatoração de código","otimização de bundles"],"ru":["Vercel React","лучшие практики","оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","веб-разработка","рефакторинг кода","оптимизация пакетов"],"ar":["فيرسيل رياكت","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين الأداء","رياكت","نيكست.جس","تطوير الويب","تحسين الكود","تحسين الحزم"]}},"owner":"chaibuilder","repo":"sdk","repoPath":"chaibuilder/sdk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:53:43.562Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js application performance","zh":"适合需要优化React和Next.js应用程序性能的前端代理","ja":"ReactとNext.jsのアプリケーションパフォーマンスを最適化する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"React와 Next.js 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan un rendimiento optimizado de aplicaciones React y Next.js","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''un rendement optimisé des applications React et Next.js","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die einen optimierten Leistungsverhalten von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado de aplicativos React e Next.js","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходим оптимизированный производительности приложений React и Next.js","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء محسّن لتطبيقات React و Next.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React components and Next.js pages with automated refactoring and code generation, leveraging 45 rules across 8 categories for improved performance, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel''s guidelines","zh":"赋予代理优化React组件和Next.js页面的能力，通过自动重构和代码生成，利用45条规则跨8个类别提高性能，包括使用Vercel指南的数据获取和打包优化","ja":"エージェントにReactコンポーネントとNext.jsページを最適化する能力を与え、自動リファクタリングとコード生成を使用して、パフォーマンスを向上させ、Vercelのガイドラインを使用したデータ取得とバンドル最適化を含む8つのカテゴリにわたる45のルール","ko":"에이전트가 React 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지를 최적화할 수 있도록 해주며, 자동 리팩토링과 코드 생성을 사용하여 성능을 개선하고, Vercel의 가이드ライン을 사용한 데이터 가져오기와 번들 최적화를 포함한 8개 카테고리跨 45개 규칙","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar componentes de React y páginas de Next.js con refactorización y generación de código automatizadas, aprovechando 45 reglas en 8 categorías para un mejor rendimiento, incluida la optimización de la recopilación de datos y la agrupación utilizando las pautas de Vercel","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les composants React et les pages Next.js avec une refactoring et une génération de code automatisées, en exploitant 45 règles dans 8 catégories pour une meilleure performance, y compris l''optimisation de la collecte de données et du regroupement en utilisant les directives de Vercel","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten mit automatisierter Refactoring und Codegenerierung zu optimieren, indem 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine bessere Leistung genutzt werden, einschließlich der Optimierung der Datenerfassung und des Bündelns unter Verwendung der Richtlinien von Vercel","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar componentes React e páginas Next.js com refatoração automatizada e geração de código, utilizando 45 regras em 8 categorias para melhorar o desempenho, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando as diretrizes do Vercel","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать компоненты React и страницы Next.js с помощью автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях для улучшения производительности, включая оптимизацию получения данных и пакетирования с использованием руководства Vercel","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين مكونات React وصفحات Next.js عبر إعادة هيكلة وتوليد автомати للرمز، مستفيدة من 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الأداء، بما في ذلك تحسين استراتيجيات استرجاع البيانات وتحزيم باستخدام إرشادات Vercel"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance","Implementing efficient data fetching strategies for client and server-side rendering","Reviewing and debugging code for performance issues"],"zh":["为新的React组件自动执行性能优化","重构现有的React和Next.js代码以获得更好的性能","为客户端和服务器端渲染实现高效的数据获取策略","查看和调试代码以解决性能问题"],"ja":["新しいReactコンポーネントのパフォーマンス最適化を自動化する","既存のReactとNext.jsコードを再構成してパフォーマンスを向上させる","クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのレンダリングのための効率的なデータ取得戦略を実装する","パフォーマンスの問題を解決するためにコードを確認してデバッグする"],"ko":["新的 React 컴포넌트를 위한 성능 최적화를 자동