es exigences complètes","Opération d''agent pour une intégration fluide","Option pour spécifier un nom de modification","Compatibilité avec l''inférence du contexte de conversation"],"de":["Intelligente Synchronisierung von Delta-Specs mit Main-Specs","Zusammenführung von Änderungen ohne Kopieren vollständiger Anforderungen","Agenten-Operation für eine nahtlose Integration","Option zur Angabe eines Änderungsnamens","Kompatibilität mit der Kontextinferenz von Konversationen"],"pt":["Sincronização de delta specs com main specs","Operação de agente para mesclagem inteligente","Suporte a seleção de alterações","Mesclagem de cenários sem copiar requisitos","Edição direta de specs principais"],"ru":["Синхронизация delta specs с main specs","Операция агента для умного слияния","Поддержка выбора изменений","Слияние сценариев без копирования требований","Прямое редактирование основных спецификаций"],"ar":["متوافق مواصفات دلتا مع مواصفات رئيسية","عملية وسيطة للدمج الذكية","دعم اختيار التغييرات","دمج السيناريوهات بدون نسخ المتطلبات","تحرير مباشر للمواصفات الرئيسية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-sync-specs","智能规格合并","delta 规格同步","agent 驱动操作","开发工具","规格管理","代码同步"],"ja":["openspec-sync-specs","スマートなスペックのマージ","delta スペックの同期","エージェント駆動操作","開発ツール","スペック管理","コードの同期"],"ko":["openspec-sync-specs","智能 규격 병합","delta 규격 동기화","에이전트 구동 연산","개발 도구","규격 관리","코드 동기화"],"es":["sincronización de especificaciones","delta specs","main specs","openspec-sync-specs","desarrollo de software","integración de cambios","fusión de requisitos","agente de sincronización","inferencia de contexto"],"fr":["synchronisation de spécifications","delta specs","main specs","openspec-sync-specs","développement de logiciels","intégration de modifications","fusion d''exigences","agent de synchronisation","inférence de contexte"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Spezifikationen","Delta-Specs","Main-Specs","openspec-sync-specs","Software-Entwicklung","Integration von Änderungen","Zusammenführung von Anforderungen","Synchronisationsagent","Kontextinferenz"],"pt":["openspec-sync-specs","sincronização de specs","mesclagem inteligente","operação de agente","delta specs","main specs","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["openspec-sync-specs","синхронизация спецификаций","умное слияние","операция агента","delta specs","main specs","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["openspec-sync-specs","متوافق مواصفات","دمج ذكية","عملية وسيطة","مواصفات دلتا","مواصفات رئيسية","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"kudegowo","repoPath":"Ejyke90/kudegowo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-sync-specs","description":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs. Use when the user wants to update main specs with changes from a delta spec, without archiving the change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selectio","body":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have delta specs (under `specs/` directory).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Find delta specs**\n\n   Look for delta spec files in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/*/spec.md`.\n\n   Each delta spec file contains sections like:\n   - `## ADDED Requirements` - New requirements to add\n   - `## MODIFIED Requirements` - Changes to existing requirements\n   - `## REMOVED Requirements` - Requirements to remove\n   - `## RENAMED Requirements` - Requirements to rename (FROM:/TO: format)\n\n   If no delta specs found, inform user and stop.\n\n3. **For each delta spec, apply changes to main specs**\n\n   For each capability with a delta spec at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/<capability>/spec.md`:\n\n   a. **Read the delta spec** to understand the intended changes\n\n   b. **Read the main spec** at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md` (may not exist yet)\n\n   c. **Apply changes intelligently**:\n\n      **ADDED Requirements:**\n      - If requirement doesn''t exist in main spec → add it\n      - If requirement already exists → update it to match (treat as implicit MODIFIED)\n\n      **MODIFIED Requirements:**\n      - Find the requirement in main spec\n      - Apply the changes - this can be:\n        - Adding new scenarios (don''t need to copy existing ones)\n        - Modifying existing scenarios\n        - Changing the requirement description\n      - Preserve scenarios/content not mentioned in the delta\n\n      **REMOVED Requirements:**\n      - Remove the entire requirement block from main spec\n\n      **RENAMED Requirements:**\n      - Find the FROM requirement, rename to TO\n\n   d. **Create new main spec** if capability doesn''t exist yet:\n      - Create `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n      - Add Purpose section (can be brief, mark as TBD)\n      - Add Requirements section with the ADDED requirements\n\n4. **Show summary**\n\n   After applying all changes, summarize:\n   - Which capabilities were updated\n   - What changes were made (requirements added/modified/removed/renamed)\n\n**Delta Spec Format Reference**\n\n```markdown\n## ADDED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: New Feature\nThe system SHALL do something new.\n\n#### Scenario: Basic case\n- **WHEN** user does X\n- **THEN** system does Y\n\n## MODIFIED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Existing Feature\n#### Scenario: New scenario to add\n- **WHEN** user does A\n- **THEN** system does B\n\n## REMOVED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Deprecated Feature\n\n## RENAMED Requirements\n\n- FROM: `### Requirement: Old Name`\n- TO: `### Requirement: New Name`\n```\n\n**Key Principle: Intelligent Merging**\n\nUnlike programmatic merging, you can apply **partial updates**:\n- To add a scenario, just include that scenario under MODIFIED - don''t copy existing scenarios\n- The delta represents *intent*, not a wholesale replacement\n- Use your judgment to merge changes sensibly\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Specs Synced: <change-name>\n\nUpdated main specs:\n\n**<capability-1>**:\n- Added requirement: \"New Feature\"\n- Modified requirement: \"Existing Feature\" (added 1 scenario)\n\n**<capability-2>**:\n- Created new spec file\n- Added requirement: \"Another Feature\"\n\nMain specs are now updated. The change remains active - archive when implementation is complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Read both delta and main specs before making changes\n- Preserve existing content not mentioned in delta\n- If something is unclear, ask for clarification\n- Show what you''re changing as you go\n- The operation should be idempotent - running twice should give same result\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:53:35.943Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Specification Management Agents needing intelligent spec merging capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要智能规格合并功能的规格管理代理。","ja":"智能な仕様のマージ機能を必要とする仕様管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"지능형 사양 병합 기능이 필요한 사양 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Especificaciones que necesitan capacidades de fusión de especificaciones inteligentes.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion de Spécifications nécessitant des capacités de fusion de spécifications intelligentes.","de":"Perfekt für Spezifikationsmanagement-Agenten, die intelligente Spezifikationszusammenführungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Especificações que necessitam de capacidades de mesclagem de especificações inteligentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления спецификациями, требующих интеллектуальных возможностей слияния спецификаций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المواصفات الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات دمج مواصفات ذكية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to directly edit main specs by reading delta specs, enabling intelligent merging of changes, such as adding scenarios without duplicating requirements, and handling change management through delta specs and main specs synchronization.","zh":"赋予代理直接编辑主规格的能力，通过读取增量规格，实现智能合并更改，例如添加场景而不重复要求，并通过增量规格和主规格同步处理变更管理。","ja":"エージェントに主仕様を直接編集する能力を与え、デルタ仕様を読み取ることで変更の智能的なマージを可能にし、シナリオを追加することなく要件を重複させずに変更管理をデルタ仕様と主仕様の同期を通じて処理する。","ko":"에이전트가 델타 사양을 읽어들이면서 주 사양을 직접 편집할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 시나리오를 추가하는 등 중복 요구 사항 없이 지능형으로 변경을 병합하고, 델타 사양과 주 사양의 동기화를 통해 변경 관리를 처리할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a editar directamente las especificaciones principales leyendo las especificaciones delta, lo que permite la fusión inteligente de cambios, como agregar escenarios sin duplicar requisitos, y gestionar los cambios a través de la sincronización de especificaciones delta y principales.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''éditer directement les spécifications principales en lisant les spécifications delta, ce qui permet la fusion intelligente des modifications, telles que l''ajout de scénarios sans duplication des exigences, et la gestion des modifications via la synchronisation des spécifications delta et principales.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Hauptspezifikationen durch Lesen der Deltaspezifikationen direkt zu bearbeiten, ermöglicht die intelligente Zusammenführung von Änderungen, wie z.B. das Hinzufügen von Szenarien ohne Duplizierung von Anforderungen, und ermöglicht das Änderungsmanagement durch die Synchronisierung von Deltaspezifikationen und Hauptspezifikationen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a editarem diretamente as especificações principais lendo as especificações delta, permitindo a mesclagem inteligente de alterações, como adicionar cenários sem duplicar requisitos, e lidar com o gerenciamento de alterações por meio da sincronização das especificações delta e principais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью直接 редактировать основные спецификации, читая дельта-спецификации, что позволяет выполнять интеллектуальное слияние изменений, таких как добавление сценариев без дублирования требований, и управлять изменением через синхронизацию дельта-спецификаций и основные спецификации.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من редакة المواصفات الرئيسية مباشرةً من خلال قراءة مواصفات دلتا، وتمكين الدمج الذكي للتغييرات، مثل إضافة السيناريوهات دون تكرار المتطلبات، ومعالجة إدارة التغييرات من خلال مزامنة مواصفات دلتا والمواصفات الرئيسية."},"useCases":{"en":["Merging delta specs into main specs for version control","Applying changes from specific revisions to main specifications","Automating spec updates by syncing delta specs"],"zh":["将增量规格合并到主规格中进行版本控制","将特定修订版本的更改应用到主规格中","通过同步增量规格来自动更新规格"],"ja":["バージョン管理のためにデルタ仕様をメイン仕様にマージする","特定のリビジョンの変更をメイン仕様に適用する","デルタ仕様を同期することで仕様の自動更新を行う"],"ko":["버전 관리를 위해 델타 사양을 주 사양에 병합하는 것","특정 修訂 버전의 변경 사항을 주 사양에 적용하는 것","델타 사양을 동기화하여 사양을 자동으로 업데이트하는 것"],"es":["Fusión de especificaciones delta en especificaciones principales para el control de versiones","Aplicación de cambios de revisiones específicas a las especificaciones principales","Automatización de actualizaciones de especificaciones sincronizando las especificaciones delta"],"fr":["Fusion des spécifications delta dans les spécifications principales pour le contrôle de version","Application des modifications de révisions spécifiques aux spécifications principales","Automatisation des mises à jour de spécifications en synchronisant les spécifications delta"],"de":["Zusammenführung von Deltaspezifikationen in Hauptspezifikationen für die Versionskontrolle","Anwenden von Änderungen aus bestimmten Revisionen auf die Hauptspezifikationen","Automatisierung von Spezifikationsaktualisierungen durch Synchronisierung von Deltaspezifikationen"],"pt":["Mesclagem de especificações delta nas especificações principais para controle de versão","Aplicação de alterações de revisões específicas às especificações principais","Automatização de atualizações de especificações sincronizando especificações delta"],"ru":["Слияние дельта-спецификаций в основные спецификации для управления версиями","Применение изменений из конкретных ревизий к основным спецификациям","Автоматизация обновления спецификаций путем синхронизации дельта-спецификаций"],"ar":["دمج مواصفات دلتا في المواصفات الرئيسية لمراقبة الإصدار","تطبيق التغييرات من المراجعات المحددة إلى المواصفات الرئيسية","توتير تحديثات المواصفات من خلال مزامنة مواصفات دلتا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires inference or specification of change name","Needs conversation context for change name inference","May prompt for change selection if name is vague or ambiguous"],"zh":["需要推断或指定更改名称","需要对话上下文来推断更改名称","如果名称模糊或不明确，可能会提示选择更改"],"ja":["変更名の推論または指定が必要","変更名の推論のために会話のコンテキストが必要","名前が曖昧または不明確な場合、変更の選択を求める場合がある"],"ko":["변경 이름의 추론 또는 지정이 필요합니다.","변경 이름의 추론을 위한 대화 문맥이 필요합니다.","이름이 모호하거나 불분명한 경우 변경 선택을 요구할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere inferencia o especificación del nombre del cambio","Necesita contexto de conversación para la inferencia del nombre del cambio","Puede solicitar la selección de cambio si el nombre es vago o ambiguo"],"fr":["Nécessite une inférence ou une spécification du nom du changement","A besoin d''un contexte de conversation pour l''inférence du nom du changement","Peut solliciter la sélection du changement si le nom est vague ou ambigu"],"de":["Erfordert Inferenz oder Spezifikation des Änderungsnamens","Benötigt Konversationskontext für die Inferenz des Änderungsnamens","Kann die Auswahl des Änderungsvorgangs anfordern, wenn der Name vage oder mehrdeutig ist"],"pt":["Exige inferência ou especificação do nome da alteração","Necessita de contexto de conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Pode solicitar seleção de alteração se o nome for vago ou ambíguo"],"ru":["Требует вывода или указания имени изменения","Требует контекста разговора для вывода имени изменения","Может запросить выбор изменения, если имя неоднозначно или двусмысленно"],"ar":["يتطلب استنتاجًا أو تحديد اسم التغيير","يحتاج إلى سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج اسم التغيير","قد يطلب اختيار التغيير إذا كان الاسم غامض أو مزدوج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex/streaming', 'community', 'ThinkEx-OSS', 'thinkex', 'ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex', 'streaming', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z', '2026-02-18T11:53:52.823Z', NULL, '{"id":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex/streaming","name":"streaming","description":{"zh":"AI API assistant-stream","ja":"AI API assistant-stream","ko":"AI API assistant-stream","es":"El paquete assistant-stream gestiona el streaming desde backends de IA. Mejora la interfaz de usuario con la última API","fr":"Le package assistant-stream gère le streaming depuis les backends d''IA. Améliorez l''interface utilisateur avec la dernière API","de":"Das Paket assistant-stream verwaltet den Streaming von KI-Backends. Verbessern Sie die Benutzeroberfläche mit der neuesten API","pt":"O pacote assistant-stream permite a transmissão de dados de backends de IA, permitindo uma nova geração de interfaces de usuário","ru":"Пакет assistant-stream позволяет передавать данные из бэкендов ИИ, что позволяет создавать новое поколение интерфейсов пользователя","ar":"يسمح حزمة assistant-stream ببث بيانات من خلفيات الذكاء الاصطناعي، مما يتيح جيلًا جديدًا من واجهات المستخدم","en":"Rethinking the User Interface of AI"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI ","ja":"AI","ko":"AI ","es":"Streaming en IA: Nueva Interfaz de Usuario","fr":"Streaming en IA: Nouvelle Interface Utilisateur","de":"Streaming in KI: Neues Benutzerinterface","pt":"Transmissão de IA: Rethinkando a Interface do Usuário","ru":"Потоковая передача ИИ: переосмысление интерфейса пользова...","ar":"بث الذكاء الاصطناعي: إعادة التفكير في واجهة المستخدم","en":"streaming"},"description":{"zh":"AI API assistant-stream","ja":"AI API assistant-stream","ko":"AI API assistant-stream","es":"El paquete assistant-stream gestiona el streaming desde backends de IA. Mejora la interfaz de usuario con la última API","fr":"Le package assistant-stream gère le streaming depuis les backends d''IA. Améliorez l''interface utilisateur avec la dernière API","de":"Das Paket assistant-stream verwaltet den Streaming von KI-Backends. Verbessern Sie die Benutzeroberfläche mit der neuesten API","pt":"O pacote assistant-stream permite a transmissão de dados de backends de IA, permitindo uma nova geração de interfaces de usuário","ru":"Пакет assistant-stream позволяет передавать данные из бэкендов ИИ, что позволяет создавать новое поколение интерфейсов пользователя","ar":"يسمح حزمة assistant-stream ببث بيانات من خلفيات الذكاء الاصطناعي، مما يتيح جيلًا جديدًا من واجهات المستخدم","en":"Rethinking the User Interface of AI"},"definition":{"en":"Rethinking the User Interface of AI"},"features":{"zh":["AI API","assistant-stream","AI SDK","API","AI "],"ja":["AI API","assistant-stream","AI SDK","API","AI "],"ko":["AI API","assistant-stream","AI SDK","API","AI "],"es":["Integración con backends de IA","Mejora de la interfaz de usuario","Soporte para la última API","Gestión de streaming de datos","Compatibilidad con formatos de datos de AI SDK","Documentación detallada"],"fr":["Intégration avec les backends d''IA","Amélioration de l''interface utilisateur","Prise en charge de la dernière API","Gestion du streaming de données","Compatibilité avec les formats de données d''AI SDK","Documentation détaillée"],"de":["Integration mit KI-Backends","Verbesserung der Benutzeroberfläche","Unterstützung für die neueste API","Verwaltung des Streaming von Daten","Kompatibilität mit Formaten von KI-SDK-Daten","Detaillierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Transmissão de dados de backends de IA em tempo real","Suporte a vários formatos de dados","Integração com o SDK de IA","Encoders e decoders personalizáveis","Documentação abrangente"],"ru":["Потоковая передача данных из бэкендов ИИ в режиме реального времени","Поддержка нескольких форматов данных","Интеграция с SDK ИИ","Настраиваемые кодировщики и декодировщики","Полная документация"],"ar":["بث بيانات من خلفيات الذكاء الاصطناعي في وقت حقيقي","دعم عدة صيغ بيانات","التكامل مع SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي","مُشَفَّرات ووظيفة فك التشفير قابلة للتخصيص","وثائق شاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","AI API","assistant-stream","AI SDK","API","AI ","AI ","AI "],"ja":["AI","AI API","assistant-stream","AI SDK","API","AI ","AI ","AI "],"ko":["AI","AI API","assistant-stream","AI SDK","API","AI ","AI ","AI "],"es":["streaming en IA","interfaz de usuario de IA","integración de backends de IA","API de IA","desarrollo de IA","tecnologías de IA","proyectos de IA","soluciones de IA"],"fr":["streaming en IA","interface utilisateur d''IA","intégration de backends d''IA","API d''IA","développement d''IA","technologies d''IA","projets d''IA","solutions d''IA"],"de":["Streaming in KI","Benutzeroberfläche von KI","Integration von KI-Backends","KI-API","KI-Entwicklung","KI-Technologien","KI-Projekte","KI-Lösungen"],"pt":["transmissão de IA","interface de usuário de IA","backend de IA","SDK de IA","encoders e decoders","desenvolvimento de IA","inteligência artificial","aprendizado de máquina"],"ru":["потоковая передача ИИ","интерфейс пользователя ИИ","бэкенд ИИ","SDK ИИ","кодировщики и декодировщики","разработка ИИ","искусственный интеллект","обучение машин"],"ar":["بث الذكاء الاصطناعي","واجهة المستخدم الذكاء الاصطناعي","خلفية الذكاء الاصطناعي","SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي","مُشَفَّرات ووظيفة فك التشفير","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تعلم الآلة"]}},"owner":"ThinkEx-OSS","repo":"thinkex","repoPath":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"streaming","description":"Guide for assistant-stream package and streaming protocols. Use when implementing streaming backends, custom protocols, or debugging stream issues.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui Streaming\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nThe `assistant-stream` package handles streaming from AI backends.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/data-stream.md](./references/data-stream.md) -- AI SDK data stream format\n- [./references/assistant-transport.md](./references/assistant-transport.md) -- Native assistant-ui format\n- [./references/encoders.md](./references/encoders.md) -- Encoders and decoders\n\n## When to Use","body":"# assistant-ui Streaming\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nThe `assistant-stream` package handles streaming from AI backends.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/data-stream.md](./references/data-stream.md) -- AI SDK data stream format\n- [./references/assistant-transport.md](./references/assistant-transport.md) -- Native assistant-ui format\n- [./references/encoders.md](./references/encoders.md) -- Encoders and decoders\n\n## When to Use\n\n```\nUsing Vercel AI SDK?\n├─ Yes → toUIMessageStreamResponse() (no assistant-stream needed)\n└─ No → assistant-stream for custom backends\n```\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install assistant-stream\n```\n\n## Custom Streaming Response\n\n```ts\nimport { createAssistantStreamResponse } from \"assistant-stream\";\n\nexport async function POST(req: Request) {\n  return createAssistantStreamResponse(async (stream) => {\n    stream.appendText(\"Hello \");\n    stream.appendText(\"world!\");\n\n    // Tool call example\n    const tool = stream.addToolCallPart({ toolCallId: \"1\", toolName: \"get_weather\" });\n    tool.argsText.append(''{\"city\":\"NYC\"}'');\n    tool.argsText.close();\n    tool.setResponse({ result: { temperature: 22 } });\n\n    stream.close();\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## With useLocalRuntime\n\n`useLocalRuntime` expects `ChatModelRunResult` chunks. Yield content parts for streaming:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useLocalRuntime } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nconst runtime = useLocalRuntime({\n  model: {\n    async *run({ messages, abortSignal }) {\n      const response = await fetch(\"/api/chat\", {\n        method: \"POST\",\n        body: JSON.stringify({ messages }),\n        signal: abortSignal,\n      });\n\n      const reader = response.body?.getReader();\n      const decoder = new TextDecoder();\n      let buffer = \"\";\n\n      while (reader) {\n        const { done, value } = await reader.read();\n        if (done) break;\n\n        buffer += decoder.decode(value, { stream: true });\n        const parts = buffer.split(\"\\n\");\n        buffer = parts.pop() ?? \"\";\n\n        for (const chunk of parts.filter(Boolean)) {\n          yield { content: [{ type: \"text\", text: chunk }] };\n        }\n      }\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Debugging Streams\n\n```ts\nimport { AssistantStream, DataStreamDecoder } from \"assistant-stream\";\n\nconst stream = AssistantStream.fromResponse(response, new DataStreamDecoder());\nfor await (const event of stream) {\n  console.log(\"Event:\", JSON.stringify(event, null, 2));\n}\n```\n\n## Stream Event Types\n\n- `part-start` with `part.type` = `\"text\" | \"reasoning\" | \"tool-call\" | \"source\" | \"file\"`\n- `text-delta` with streamed text\n- `result` with tool results\n- `step-start`, `step-finish`, `message-finish`\n- `error` strings\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n**Stream not updating UI**\n- Check Content-Type is `text/event-stream`\n- Check for CORS errors\n\n**Tool calls not rendering**\n- `addToolCallPart` needs both `toolCallId` and `toolName`\n- Register tool UI with `makeAssistantToolUI`\n\n**Partial text not showing**\n- Use `text-delta` events for streaming\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:53:52.823Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing real-time data streaming and processing capabilities from AI backends.","zh":"适合需要从AI后端获取实时数据流和处理能力的AI代理。","ja":"AIエージェントがAIバックエンドからリアルタイムデータストリーミングと処理能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"AI 에이전트가 AI 백엔드에서 실시간 데이터 스트리밍과 처리 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de transmisión y procesamiento de datos en tiempo real desde backends de IA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des capacités de diffusion et de traitement de données en temps réel à partir de backends IA.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die Echtzeit-Datenstreaming- und Verarbeitungsfähigkeiten von KI-Backends benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades de transmissão e processamento de dados em tempo real dos backends de IA.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы возможности потоковой передачи и обработки данных в режиме реального времени от бэкендов ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات بث البيانات ومعالجتها في وقت حقيقي من الخوادم الخلفية للذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle streaming from AI backends using the `assistant-stream` package, supporting AI SDK data stream formats and native assistant-ui transport protocols, along with various encoders and decoders.","zh":"赋予代理使用`assistant-stream`包处理AI后端的数据流，支持AI SDK数据流格式和本地assistant-ui传输协议，以及各种编码器和解码器。","ja":"`assistant-stream`パッケージを使用してAIバックエンドからのストリーミングを処理できるようにエージェントを有効にし、AI SDKのデータストリーム形式とネイティブのassistant-uiトランスポートプロトコル、およびさまざまなエンコーダーとデコーダーをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 `assistant-stream` 패키지를 사용하여 AI 백엔드의 스트리밍을 처리할 수 있도록 하여 AI SDK 데이터 스트림 형식과 네이티브 assistant-ui 전송 프로토콜 및 다양한 인코더와 디코더를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar la transmisión desde backends de IA utilizando el paquete `assistant-stream`, que admite formatos de flujo de datos de SDK de IA y protocolos de transporte nativos de assistant-ui, así como varios codificadores y decodificadores.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer la diffusion à partir de backends IA en utilisant le paquet `assistant-stream`, qui prend en charge les formats de flux de données de SDK IA et les protocoles de transport natifs de assistant-ui, ainsi que divers encodeurs et décodeurs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Datenübertragung von KI-Backends mithilfe des `assistant-stream`-Pakets zu verwalten, das Formate für KI-SDK-Datenströme und native assistant-ui-Transportprotokolle sowie verschiedene Encoder und Decoder unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com a transmissão de backends de IA usando o pacote `assistant-stream`, que suporta formatos de fluxo de dados do SDK de IA e protocolos de transporte nativos do assistant-ui, juntamente com vários codificadores e decodificadores.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать потоковую передачу от бэкендов ИИ с помощью пакета `assistant-stream`, поддерживающего форматы потоков данных SDK ИИ и родные протоколы транспорта assistant-ui, а также различные кодировщики и декодировщики.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التعامل مع بث الخوادم الخلفية للذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام حزمة `assistant-stream`، التي تدعم صيغ تدفق البيانات من SDK للذكاء الاصطناعي وبروتوكولات النقل الأصلية ل واجهة المساعد، إلى جانب مشفرات وفك التشفير المختلفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Streaming data from AI models for real-time analysis","Processing native assistant-ui formats for efficient data transport","Encoding and decoding data streams using various encoders and decoders"],"zh":["实时分析的AI模型数据流","高效数据传输的本地assistant-ui格式处理","使用各种编码器和解码器对数据流进行编码和解码"],"ja":["リアルタイム分析のためのAIモデルのデータストリーミング","効率的なデータ転送のためのネイティブのassistant-ui形式の処理","さまざまなエンコーダーとデコーダーを使用したデータストリーミングのエンコードとデコード"],"ko":["실시간 분석을 위한 AI 모델 데이터 스트리밍","효율적인 데이터 전송을 위한 네이티브 assistant-ui 형식 처리","다양한 인코더와 디코더를 사용한 데이터 스트리밍 인코딩 및 디코딩"],"es":["Transmisión de datos desde modelos de IA para análisis en tiempo real","Procesamiento de formatos nativos de assistant-ui para un transporte de datos eficiente","Codificación y decodificación de flujos de datos utilizando varios codificadores y decodificadores"],"fr":["Diffusion de données à partir de modèles IA pour analyse en temps réel","Traitement de formats natifs de assistant-ui pour un transport de données efficace","Encodage et décodage de flux de données en utilisant divers encodeurs et décodeurs"],"de":["Streaming von Daten von KI-Modellen für Echtzeit-Analyse","Verarbeitung von nativen assistant-ui-Formaten für effizienten Datentransport","Codierung und Decodierung von Datenströmen unter Verwendung verschiedener Encoder und Decoder"],"pt":["Transmitir dados de modelos de IA para análise em tempo real","Processar formatos nativos do assistant-ui para transporte de dados eficiente","Codificar e decodificar fluxos de dados usando vários codificadores e decodificadores"],"ru":["Потоковая передача данных от моделей ИИ для анализа в режиме реального времени","Обработка родных форматов assistant-ui для эффективного транспорта данных","Кодирование и декодирование потоков данных с помощью различных кодировщиков и декодировщиков"],"ar":["بث بيانات من نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحليل في الوقت الحقيقي","معالجة صيغ واجهة المساعد الأصلية لنقل البيانات بكفاءة","تشفير وفك تشفير تدفقات البيانات باستخدام مشفرات وفك التشفير المختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the latest API at assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Dependent on specific AI backend and SDK compatibility"],"zh":["需要查阅assistant-ui.com/llms.txt的最新API","依赖于特定的AI后端和SDK兼容性"],"ja":["最新のAPIをassistant-ui.com/llms.txtで参照する必要がある","特定のAIバックエンドとSDKの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["最新 API를 assistant-ui.com/llms.txt에서 참조해야 함","특정 AI 백엔드 및 SDK와의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la última API en assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Dependiente de la compatibilidad específica del backend de IA y del SDK"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation de la dernière API sur assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Dépend de la compatibilité spécifique du backend IA et du SDK"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation der neuesten API unter assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Abhängig von der spezifischen Kompatibilität des KI-Backends und des SDK"],"pt":["Exige consulta da última API em assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Dependente da compatibilidade de backend de IA e SDK específicos"],"ru":["Требует консультации последней версии API на assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Зависит от совместимости конкретного бэкенда ИИ и SDK"],"ar":["يتطلب استشارة أحدث واجهة برمجة التطبيقات على assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","يعتمد على توافق الخادم الخلفي للذكاء الاصطناعي و SDK المحدد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/quant-analyst', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'quant-analyst', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z', '2026-02-18T11:53:52.708Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/quant-analyst","name":"quant-analyst","description":{"zh":"量化分析师是高级金融模型和交易策略的开发专家，专注于数学建模、统计套利、风险管理和算法交易","ja":"量化アナリストは先進的な金融モデルと取引戦略の開発の専門家で、数学的モデリング、統計的アービトラージ、リスクマネジメント、アルゴリズム取引に焦点を当てています","ko":"量화 분석가는 고급 금융 모델 및 거래 전략 개발의 전문가로 수학적 모델링, 통계적 중립, 위험 관리, 알고리즘 거래에 중점을 두고 있습니다","es":"El Quant Analyst es un protocolo de futuros sintéticos que permite a los traders abrir posiciones con apalancamiento. Combina oráculos personalizados, AMM virtuales y suavizado TWAP.","fr":"Le Quant Analyst est un protocole de futurs synthétiques qui permet aux traders d''ouvrir des positions avec effet de levier. Il combine des oracles personnalisés, des AMM virtuelles et un lissage TWAP.","de":"Der Quant Analyst ist ein synthetisches Futures-Protokoll, das es Tradern ermöglicht, mit Hebelwirkung zu handeln. Es kombiniert benutzerdefinierte Orakel, virtuelle AMM und TWAP-Glättung.","pt":"O Quant Analyst é um especialista em modelos financeiros e estratégias de negociação. Ele se concentra em modelagem matemática, arbitragem estatística e gestão de riscos.","ru":"Количественный Аналитик - это специалист по финансовым моделям и торговым стратегиям. Он фокусируется на математическом моделировании, статистической арбитраже и управлении рисками.","ar":"المحلل الكمي هو خبير في النماذج المالية واستراتيجيات التداول. يركز على النمذجة الرياضية والتحكيم الإحصائي وإدارة المخاطر.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"量化分析师 - 高级金融模型和交易策略开发","ja":"量化アナリスト - 先進的な金融モデルと取引戦略の開発","ko":"量화 분석가 - 고급 금융 모델 및 거래 전략 개발","es":"Análisis Cuantitativo para Inversores","fr":"Analyse Quantitative pour Investisseurs","de":"Quantitative Analyse für Investoren","pt":"Quant Analyst: Análise de Mercado Avançada","ru":"Количественный Аналитик: Продвинутый Маркетинг","ar":"محلل كمي: تحليل السوق المتقدم","en":"quant-analyst"},"description":{"zh":"量化分析师是高级金融模型和交易策略的开发专家，专注于数学建模、统计套利、风险管理和算法交易","ja":"量化アナリストは先進的な金融モデルと取引戦略の開発の専門家で、数学的モデリング、統計的アービトラージ、リスクマネジメント、アルゴリズム取引に焦点を当てています","ko":"量화 분석가는 고급 금융 모델 및 거래 전략 개발의 전문가로 수학적 모델링, 통계적 중립, 위험 관리, 알고리즘 거래에 중점을 두고 있습니다","es":"El Quant Analyst es un protocolo de futuros sintéticos que permite a los traders abrir posiciones con apalancamiento. Combina oráculos personalizados, AMM vi...","fr":"Le Quant Analyst est un protocole de futurs synthétiques qui permet aux traders d''ouvrir des positions avec effet de levier. Il combine des oracles personnal...","de":"Der Quant Analyst ist ein synthetisches Futures-Protokoll, das es Tradern ermöglicht, mit Hebelwirkung zu handeln. Es kombiniert benutzerdefinierte Orakel, v...","pt":"O Quant Analyst é um especialista em modelos financeiros e estratégias de negociação. Ele se concentra em modelagem matemática, arbitragem estatística e gest...","ru":"Количественный Аналитик - это специалист по финансовым моделям и торговым стратегиям. Он фокусируется на математическом моделировании, статистической арбитра...","ar":"المحلل الكمي هو خبير في النماذج المالية واستراتيجيات التداول. يركز على النمذجة الرياضية والتحكيم الإحصائي وإدارة المخاطر.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["数学建模","统计套利","风险管理","算法交易","精确性和性能","alpha生成"],"ja":["数学的モデリング","統計的アービトラージ","リスクマネジメント","アルゴリズム取引","精度とパフォーマンス","アルファ生成"],"ko":["수학적 모델링","통계적 중립","위험 관리","알고리즘 거래","정확성과 성능","알파 생성"],"es":["Protocolo de futuros sintéticos y perpétuos","Posiciones con apalancamiento de hasta 1000x","Colateralización con stablecoins","Oráculo personalizado y AMM virtual","Suavizado TWAP para precios estables"],"fr":["Protocole de futurs synthétiques et perpétuels","Positions avec effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x","Collateralisation avec des stablecoins","Oracle personnalisé et AMM virtuelle","Lissage TWAP pour des prix stables"],"de":["Synthetisches und perpetualer Futures-Protokoll","Positionen mit Hebelwirkung von bis zu 1000x","Besicherung mit Stablecoins","Benutzerdefiniertes Orakel und virtuelle AMM","TWAP-Glättung für stabile Preise"],"pt":["Análise de mercado avançada","Modelagem matemática","Arbitragem estatística","Gestão de riscos","Negociação algorítmica"],"ru":["Продвинутый маркетинг","Математическое моделирование","Статистическая арбитраж","Управление рисками","Алгоритмическая торговля"],"ar":["تحليل السوق المتقدم","النمذجة الرياضية","التحكيم الإحصائي","إدارة المخاطر","التداول الخوارزمي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["量化分析师","金融模型","交易策略","数学建模","统计套利","风险管理","算法交易","精确性","性能","alpha生成"],"ja":["量化アナリスト","金融モデル","取引戦略","数学的モデリング","統計的アービトラージ","リスクマネジメント","アルゴリズム取引","精度","パフォーマンス","アルファ生成"],"ko":["량화 분석가","금융 모델","거래 전략","수학적 모델링","통계적 중립","위험 관리","알고리즘 거래","정확성","성능","알파 생성"],"es":["análisis cuantitativo","futuros sintéticos","trading con apalancamiento","stablecoins","oráculo personalizado","AMM virtual","suavizado TWAP"],"fr":["analyse quantitative","futurs synthétiques","trading avec effet de levier","stablecoins","oracle personnalisé","AMM virtuelle","lissage TWAP"],"de":["quantitative Analyse","synthetische Futures","Trading mit Hebelwirkung","Stablecoins","benutzerdefiniertes Orakel","virtuelle AMM","TWAP-Glättung"],"pt":["análise quantitativa","modelos financeiros","estratégias de negociação","arbitragem estatística","gestão de riscos","negociação algorítmica"],"ru":["количественный анализ","финансовые модели","торговые стратегии","статистическая арбитраж","управление рисками","алгоритмическая торговля"],"ar":["التحليل الكمي","النماذج المالية","استراتيجيات التداول","التحكيم الإحصائي","إدارة المخاطر","التداول الخوارزمي"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"quant-analyst","description":"Expert quantitative analyst specializing in financial modeling, algorithmic trading, and risk analytics. Masters statistical methods, derivatives pricing, and high-frequency trading with focus on mathematical rigor, performance optimization, and profitable strategy development.","bodyPreview":"You are a senior quantitative analyst with expertise in developing sophisticated financial models and trading strategies. Your focus spans mathematical modeling, statistical arbitrage, risk management, and algorithmic trading with emphasis on accuracy, performance, and generating alpha through quantitative methods.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for trading requirements and market focus\n2. Review existing strategies, historical data, and risk parameters\n3. Analyze market opportunities, i","body":"You are a senior quantitative analyst with expertise in developing sophisticated financial models and trading strategies. Your focus spans mathematical modeling, statistical arbitrage, risk management, and algorithmic trading with emphasis on accuracy, performance, and generating alpha through quantitative methods.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for trading requirements and market focus\n2. Review existing strategies, historical data, and risk parameters\n3. Analyze market opportunities, inefficiencies, and model performance\n4. Implement robust quantitative trading systems\nQuantitative analysis checklist:\n- Model accuracy validated thoroughly\n- Backtesting comprehensive completely\n- Risk metrics calculated properly\n- Latency < 1ms for HFT achieved\n- Data quality verified consistently\n- Compliance checked rigorously\n- Performance optimized effectively\n- Documentation complete accurately\nFinancial modeling:\n- Pricing models\n- Risk models\n- Portfolio optimization\n- Factor models\n- Volatility modeling\n- Correlation analysis\n- Scenario analysis\n- Stress testing\nTrading strategies:\n- Market making\n- Statistical arbitrage\n- Pairs trading\n- Momentum strategies\n- Mean reversion\n- Options strategies\n- Event-driven trading\n- Crypto algorithms\nStatistical methods:\n- Time series analysis\n- Regression models\n- Machine learning\n- Bayesian inference\n- Monte Carlo methods\n- Stochastic processes\n- Cointegration tests\n- GARCH models\nDerivatives pricing:\n- Black-Scholes models\n- Binomial trees\n- Monte Carlo pricing\n- American options\n- Exotic derivatives\n- Greeks calculation\n- Volatility surfaces\n- Credit derivatives\nRisk management:\n- VaR calculation\n- Stress testing\n- Scenario analysis\n- Position sizing\n- Stop-loss strategies\n- Portfolio hedging\n- Correlation analysis\n- Drawdown control\nHigh-frequency trading:\n- Microstructure analysis\n- Order book dynamics\n- Latency optimization\n- Co-location strategies\n- Market impact models\n- Execution algorithms\n- Tick data analysis\n- Hardware optimization\nBacktesting framework:\n- Historical simulation\n- Walk-forward analysis\n- Out-of-sample testing\n- Transaction costs\n- Slippage modeling\n- Performance metrics\n- Overfitting detection\n- Robustness testing\nPortfolio optimization:\n- Markowitz optimization\n- Black-Litterman\n- Risk parity\n- Factor investing\n- Dynamic allocation\n- Constraint handling\n- Multi-objective optimization\n- Rebalancing strategies\nMachine learning applications:\n- Price prediction\n- Pattern recognition\n- Feature engineering\n- Ensemble methods\n- Deep learning\n- Reinforcement learning\n- Natural language processing\n- Alternative data\nMarket data handling:\n- Data cleaning\n- Normalization\n- Feature extraction\n- Missing data\n- Survivorship bias\n- Corporate actions\n- Real-time processing\n- Data storage\n## MCP Tool Suite\n- **python**: Scientific computing platform\n- **numpy**: Numerical computing\n- **pandas**: Data analysis\n- **quantlib**: Quantitative finance library\n- **zipline**: Backtesting engine\n- **backtrader**: Trading strategy framework\n## Communication Protocol\n### Quant Context Assessment\nInitialize quantitative analysis by understanding trading objectives.\nQuant context query:\n```json\n{\n  \"requesting_agent\": \"quant-analyst\",\n  \"request_type\": \"get_quant_context\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"query\": \"Quant context needed: asset classes, trading frequency, risk tolerance, capital allocation, regulatory constraints, and performance targets.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n## Development Workflow\nExecute quantitative analysis through systematic phases:\n### 1. Strategy Analysis\nResearch and design trading strategies.\nAnalysis priorities:\n- Market research\n- Data analysis\n- Pattern identification\n- Model selection\n- Risk assessment\n- Backtest design\n- Performance targets\n- Implementation planning\nResearch evaluation:\n- Analyze markets\n- Study inefficiencies\n- Test hypotheses\n- Validate patterns\n- Assess risks\n- Estimate returns\n- Plan execution\n- Document findings\n### 2. Implementation Phase\nBuild and test quantitative models.\nImplementation approach:\n- Model development\n- Strategy coding\n- Backtest execution\n- Parameter optimization\n- Risk controls\n- Live testing\n- Performance monitoring\n- Continuous improvement\nDevelopment patterns:\n- Rigorous testing\n- Conservative assumptions\n- Robust validation\n- Risk awareness\n- Performance tracking\n- Code optimization\n- Documentation\n- Version control\nProgress tracking:\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"quant-analyst\",\n  \"status\": \"developing\",\n  \"progress\": {\n    \"sharpe_ratio\": 2.3,\n    \"max_drawdown\": \"12%\",\n    \"win_rate\": \"68%\",\n    \"backtest_years\": 10\n  }\n}\n```\n### 3. Quant Excellence\nDeploy profitable trading systems.\nExcellence checklist:\n- Models validated\n- Performance verified\n- Risks controlled\n- Systems robust\n- Compliance met\n- Documentation complete\n- Monitoring active\n- Profitability achieved\nDelivery notification:\n\"Quantitative system completed. Developed statistical arbitrage strategy with 2.3 Sharpe ratio over 10-year backtest. Maximum drawdown 12% with 68% win rate. Implemented with sub-millisecond execution achieving 23% annualized returns after costs.\"\nModel validation:\n- Cross-validation\n- Out-of-sample testing\n- Parameter stability\n- Regime analysis\n- Sensitivity testing\n- Monte Carlo validation\n- Walk-forward optimization\n- Live performance tracking\nRisk analytics:\n- Value at Risk\n- Conditional VaR\n- Stress scenarios\n- Correlation breaks\n- Tail risk analysis\n- Liquidity risk\n- Concentration risk\n- Counterparty risk\nExecution optimization:\n- Order routing\n- Smart execution\n- Impact minimization\n- Timing optimization\n- Venue selection\n- Cost analysis\n- Slippage reduction\n- Fill improvement\nPerformance attribution:\n- Return decomposition\n- Factor analysis\n- Risk contribution\n- Alpha generation\n- Cost analysis\n- Benchmark comparison\n- Period analysis\n- Strategy attribution\nResearch process:\n- Literature review\n- Data exploration\n- Hypothesis testing\n- Model development\n- Validation process\n- Documentation\n- Peer review\n- Continuous monitoring\nIntegration with other agents:\n- Collaborate with risk-manager on risk models\n- Support fintech-engineer on trading systems\n- Work with data-engineer on data pipelines\n- Guide ml-engineer on ML models\n- Help backend-developer on system architecture\n- Assist database-optimizer on tick data\n- Partner with cloud-architect on infrastructure\n- Coordinate with compliance-officer on regulations\nAlways prioritize mathematical rigor, risk management, and performance while developing quantitative strategies that generate consistent alpha in competitive markets."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:53:52.708Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Agents requiring advanced quantitative analysis and trading strategy development","zh":"非常适合需要高级量化分析和交易策略开发的金融代理","ja":"高度な量化分析と取引戦略の開発を必要とする金融エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 양적 분석과 거래 전략 개발이 필요한 금융 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Financieros que requieren análisis cuantitativo avanzado y desarrollo de estrategias de comercio","fr":"Parfait pour les agents financiers nécessitant une analyse quantitative avancée et un développement de stratégies de trading","de":"Perfekt für Finanzagenten, die eine fortschrittliche quantitative Analyse und die Entwicklung von Handelsstrategien erfordern","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Financeiros que requerem análise quantitativa avançada e desenvolvimento de estratégias de negociação","ru":"Идеально подходит для финансовых агентов, требующих передового количественного анализа и разработки торговых стратегий","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكالات مالية تتطلب تحليلًا كميًا متقدمًا وتطوير استراتيجيات تداول"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop sophisticated financial models and trading strategies using mathematical modeling, statistical arbitrage, and algorithmic trading, with emphasis on accuracy, performance, and generating alpha through quantitative methods, leveraging protocols like synthetic perpetual futures and stablecoin collateralization","zh":"赋予代理开发使用数学建模、统计套利和算法交易的复杂金融模型和交易策略的能力，注重准确性、性能和通过量化方法产生阿尔法，利用合成永续期货和稳定币抵押等协议","ja":"数学モデル、統計的アービトラージ、アルゴリズム取引を使用した複雑な金融モデルと取引戦略を開発するエージェントをEmpowerし、合成永続期限とスターブルコイン担保のようなプロトコルを活用して、精度、パフォーマンス、量化方法によるアルファ生成を重視する","ko":"수학적 모델링, 통계적 아비트라지, 알고리즘 거래를 사용하여 복잡한 금융 모델과 거래 전략을 개발할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여, 합성 영속적 선물과 안정화 코인 담보와 같은 프로토콜을 활용하고, 정확성, 성능, 양적 방법을 통해 알파를 생성하는 것을 강조","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar modelos financieros sofisticados y estrategias de trading utilizando modelado matemático, arbitraje estadístico y trading algorítmico, con énfasis en la precisión, el rendimiento y la generación de alfa a través de métodos cuantitativos, aprovechando protocolos como futuros perpetuos sintéticos y colateralización de stablecoin","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des modèles financiers sophistiqués et des stratégies de trading en utilisant la modélisation mathématique, l''arbitrage statistique et le trading algorithmique, avec un accent sur la précision, les performances et la génération d''alpha grâce à des méthodes quantitatives, en exploitant des protocoles tels que les futurs perpétuels synthétiques et la collatéralisation de stablecoin","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, komplexe Finanzmodelle und Handelsstrategien mithilfe mathematischer Modellierung, statistischem Arbitrage und algorithmischem Trading zu entwickeln, mit Schwerpunkt auf Genauigkeit, Leistung und Alpha-Erzeugung durch quantitative Methoden, unter Nutzung von Protokollen wie synthetischen Perpetual-Futures und Stablecoin-Besicherung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver modelos financeiros sofisticados e estratégias de negociação usando modelagem matemática, arbitragem estatística e negociação algorítmica, com ênfase na precisão, desempenho e geração de alfa por meio de métodos quantitativos, aproveitando protocolos como futuros perpétuos sintéticos e garantia de stablecoin","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать сложные финансовые модели и торговые стратегии с использованием математического моделирования, статистического арбитража и алгоритмической торговли, с упором на точность, производительность и генерацию альфы посредством количественных методов, используя протоколы, такие как синтетические вечные фьючерсы и коллатерализация стейблкоинов","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من تطوير نماذج مالية متقدمة و استراتيجيات تداول باستخدام النمذجة الرياضية والتحكيم الإحصائي والتداول الخوارزمي، مع التركيز على الدقة والأداء وتوليد ألفا من خلال الأساليب الكمية، والاستفادة من البروتوكولات مثل العقود الآجلة الاصطناعية الدائمة وتأمين العملة المستقرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing market opportunities and risk parameters for leveraged long/short positions","Developing and optimizing trading strategies using historical data and machine learning algorithms","Managing risk and generating alpha through quantitative methods and statistical arbitrage"],"zh":["分析杠杆多头/空头仓位的市场机会和风险参数","使用历史数据和机器学习算法开发和优化交易策略","通过量化方法和统计套利管理风险和产生阿尔法"],"ja":["レバレッジのロング/ショートポジションの市場機会とリスクパラメータを分析する","歴史データと機械学習アルゴリズムを使用して取引戦略を開発し、最適化する","量化方法と統計的アービトラージを使用してリスクを管理し、アルファを生成する"],"ko":["레버리지 롱/숏 포지션의 시장 기회와 위험 매개변수를 분석","역사 데이터와 기계 학습 알고리즘을 사용하여 거래 전략을 개발하고 최적화","양적 방법과 통계적 아비트라지를 사용하여 위험을 관리하고 알파를 생성"],"es":["Análisis de oportunidades de mercado y parámetros de riesgo para posiciones largas/cortas apalancadas","Desarrollo y optimización de estrategias de trading utilizando datos históricos y algoritmos de aprendizaje automático","Gestión de riesgos y generación de alpha a través de métodos cuantitativos y arbitraje estadístico"],"fr":["Analyse des opportunités de marché et des paramètres de risque pour les positions longues/courtes à effet de levier","Développement et optimisation de stratégies de trading en utilisant des données historiques et des algorithmes d''apprentissage automatique","Gestion des risques et génération d''alpha grâce à des méthodes quantitatives et à l''arbitrage statistique"],"de":["Analyse von Marktchancen und Risikoparametern für gehebelte Long-/Short-Positionen","Entwicklung und Optimierung von Handelsstrategien unter Verwendung historischer Daten und Machine-Learning-Algorithmen","Risikomanagement und Alpha-Erzeugung durch quantitative Methoden und statistischen Arbitrage"],"pt":["Analisar oportunidades de mercado e parâmetros de risco para posições longas/curtas alavancadas","Desenvolver e otimizar estratégias de negociação usando dados históricos e algoritmos de aprendizado de máquina","Gerenciar riscos e gerar alfa por meio de métodos quantitativos e arbitragem estatística"],"ru":["Анализ рыночных возможностей и параметров риска для плечевых длинных/коротких позиций","Разработка и оптимизация торговых стратегий с использованием исторических данных и алгоритмов машинного обучения","Управление рисками и генерация альфы посредством количественных методов и статистического арбитража"],"ar":["تحليل فرص السوق ومحددات المخاطر للوضعيات الطويلة/القصيرة المضخمة","تطوير وتنظيم استراتيجيات التداول باستخدام البيانات التاريخية و خوارزميات التعلم الآلي","إدارة المخاطر وتوليد ألفا من خلال الأساليب الكمية والتحكيم الإحصائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in mathematical modeling and statistical analysis","Limited to trading and financial applications","Dependent on high-quality and reliable market data feeds"],"zh":["需要数学建模和统计分析的专业知识","仅限于交易和金融应用","依赖于高质量和可靠的市场数据源"],"ja":["数学モデルと統計分析の専門知識が必要","取引と金融アプリケーションに限定される","高品質で信頼できる市場データソースに依存する"],"ko":["수학적 모델링과 통계적 분석의 전문 지식이 필요","거래와 금융 애플리케이션에 한정","고품질이고 신뢰할 수 있는 시장 데이터 소스에 의존"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en modelado matemático y análisis estadístico","Limitado a aplicaciones de trading y financieras","Dependiente de fuentes de datos de mercado de alta calidad y confiables"],"fr":["Nécessite une expérience en modélisation mathématique et en analyse statistique","Limité aux applications de trading et financières","Dépendant de flux de données de marché de haute qualité et fiables"],"de":["Erfordert Erfahrung in mathematischer Modellierung und statistischer Analyse","Begrenzt auf Trading- und Finanzanwendungen","Abhängig von hochwertigen und zuverlässigen Marktdata-Feeds"],"pt":["Requer expertise em modelagem matemática e análise estatística","Limitado a aplicações de negociação e financeiras","Dependente de feeds de dados de mercado de alta qualidade e confiáveis"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в математическом моделировании и статистическом анализе","Ограничен торговыми и финансовыми приложениями","Зависит от высококачественных и надежных потоков рыночных данных"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في النمذجة الرياضية والتحليل الإحصائي","محدود بالتطبيقات المالية والتداول","يعتمد على تدفقات بيانات السوق عالية الجودة والموثوقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
