안 리뷰를 제공합니다","es":"La auditoría de seguridad Convex es una revisión exhaustiva de patrones de seguridad para aplicaciones Convex.","fr":"L''audit de sécurité Convex est une revue exhaustive de modèles de sécurité pour les applications Convex.","de":"Das Convex-Sicherheitsaudit ist eine umfassende Überprüfung von Sicherheitsmustern für Convex-Anwendungen.","pt":"A Auditoria de Segurança Convex é uma ferramenta de revisão de segurança para aplicativos Convex, cobrindo lógica de autorização e isolamento de ações","ru":"Аудит Безопасности Convex - это инструмент комплексного аудита безопасности для приложений Convex, охватывающий логику авторизации и изоляцию действий","ar":"تدقيق أمان Convex هو أداة مراجعة أمنية لتطبيقات Convex، تغطي منطق التفويض وعزل الإجراءات","en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"definition":{"en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"features":{"zh":["授权逻辑","数据访问边界","动作隔离","速率限制","保护敏感操作"],"ja":["認可ロジック","データアクセス境界","アクション分離","レート制限","機密操作の保護"],"ko":["인증 로직","데이터 액세스 경계","액션 분리","속도 제한","민감한 작업 보호"],"es":["Revisión de lógica de autorización","Verificación de límites de acceso a datos","Aislamiento de acciones","Limitación de tasas","Protección de operaciones sensibles"],"fr":["Examen de la logique d''autorisation","Vérification des limites d''accès aux données","Isolement des actions","Limitation des taux","Protection des opérations sensibles"],"de":["Überprüfung der Autorisierungslogik","Überprüfung der Datenzugriffsgrenzen","Aktionstrennung","Ratenbegrenzung","Schutz sensibler Operationen"],"pt":["Revisão de lógica de autorização","Isolamento de ações","Controle de acesso a dados","Limitação de taxa","Proteção de operações sensíveis"],"ru":["Проверка логики авторизации","Изоляция действий","Контроль доступа к данным","Ограничение скорости","Защита чувствительных операций"],"ar":["مراجعة منطق التفويض","عزل الإجراءات","مراقبة الوصول إلى البيانات","تحديد معدل","حماية العمليات الحساسة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 安全审计","Convex 应用安全","授权逻辑","数据访问边界","Convex 安全","Convex 开发"],"ja":["Convex セキュリティ監査","Convex アプリケーションのセキュリティ","認可ロジック","データアクセス境界","Convex セキュリティ","Convex 開発"],"ko":["Convex 보안 감사","Convex 애플리케이션 보안","인증 로직","데이터 액세스 경계","Convex 보안","Convex 개발"],"es":["seguridad Convex","auditoría de seguridad","aplicaciones Convex","autorización","acceso a datos","desarrollo seguro"],"fr":["sécurité Convex","audit de sécurité","applications Convex","autorisation","accès aux données","développement sécurisé"],"de":["Convex-Sicherheit","Sicherheitsaudit","Convex-Anwendungen","Autorisierung","Datenzugriff","sichere Entwicklung"],"pt":["auditoria de segurança convex","segurança de aplicativos","lógica de autorização","isolamento de ações","controle de acesso a dados","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["аудит безопасности convex","безопасность приложений","логика авторизации","изоляция действий","контроль доступа к данным","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تدقيق أمان convex","أمان التطبيقات","منطق التفويض","عزل الإجراءات","مراقبة الوصول إلى البيانات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"charlietlamb","repo":"ferix","repoPath":"charlietlamb/ferix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex Security Audit","description":"Deep security review patterns for authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","security","audit","authorization","rate-limiting","protection"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Security Audit\n\nComprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications including authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n###","body":"# Convex Security Audit\n\nComprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications including authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Security Audit Areas\n\n1. **Authorization Logic** - Who can do what\n2. **Data Access Boundaries** - What data users can see\n3. **Action Isolation** - Protecting external API calls\n4. **Rate Limiting** - Preventing abuse\n5. **Sensitive Operations** - Protecting critical functions\n\n### Authorization Logic Audit\n\n#### Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```typescript\n// convex/lib/auth.ts\nimport { QueryCtx, MutationCtx } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { Doc } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n\ntype UserRole = \"user\" | \"moderator\" | \"admin\" | \"superadmin\";\n\nconst roleHierarchy: Record<UserRole, number> = {\n  user: 0,\n  moderator: 1,\n  admin: 2,\n  superadmin: 3,\n};\n\nexport async function getUser(ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx): Promise<Doc<\"users\"> | null> {\n  const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n  if (!identity) return null;\n  \n  return await ctx.db\n    .query(\"users\")\n    .withIndex(\"by_tokenIdentifier\", (q) => \n      q.eq(\"tokenIdentifier\", identity.tokenIdentifier)\n    )\n    .unique();\n}\n\nexport async function requireRole(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx, \n  minRole: UserRole\n): Promise<Doc<\"users\">> {\n  const user = await getUser(ctx);\n  \n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\",\n      message: \"Authentication required\",\n    });\n  }\n  \n  const userRoleLevel = roleHierarchy[user.role as UserRole] ?? 0;\n  const requiredLevel = roleHierarchy[minRole];\n  \n  if (userRoleLevel < requiredLevel) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: `Role ''${minRole}'' or higher required`,\n    });\n  }\n  \n  return user;\n}\n\n// Permission-based check\ntype Permission = \"read:users\" | \"write:users\" | \"delete:users\" | \"admin:system\";\n\nconst rolePermissions: Record<UserRole, Permission[]> = {\n  user: [\"read:users\"],\n  moderator: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\"],\n  admin: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\", \"delete:users\"],\n  superadmin: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\", \"delete:users\", \"admin:system\"],\n};\n\nexport async function requirePermission(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx,\n  permission: Permission\n): Promise<Doc<\"users\">> {\n  const user = await getUser(ctx);\n  \n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({ code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\", message: \"Authentication required\" });\n  }\n  \n  const userRole = user.role as UserRole;\n  const permissions = rolePermissions[userRole] ?? [];\n  \n  if (!permissions.includes(permission)) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: `Permission ''${permission}'' required`,\n    });\n  }\n  \n  return user;\n}\n```\n\n### Data Access Boundaries Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/data.ts\nimport { query, mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { getUser, requireRole } from \"./lib/auth\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// Audit: Users can only see their own data\nexport const getMyData = query({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"userData\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    if (!user) return [];\n    \n    // SECURITY: Filter by userId\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"userData\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", user._id))\n      .collect();\n  },\n});\n\n// Audit: Verify ownership before returning sensitive data\nexport const getSensitiveItem = query({\n  args: { itemId: v.id(\"sensitiveItems\") },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"sensitiveItems\"),\n    secret: v.string(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    if (!user) return null;\n    \n    const item = await ctx.db.get(args.itemId);\n    \n    // SECURITY: Verify ownership\n    if (!item || item.ownerId !== user._id) {\n      return null; // Don''t reveal if item exists\n    }\n    \n    return item;\n  },\n});\n\n// Audit: Shared resources with access list\nexport const getSharedDocument = query({\n  args: { docId: v.id(\"documents\") },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"documents\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n    accessLevel: v.string(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    const doc = await ctx.db.get(args.docId);\n    \n    if (!doc) return null;\n    \n    // Public documents\n    if (doc.visibility === \"public\") {\n      return { ...doc, accessLevel: \"public\" };\n    }\n    \n    // Must be authenticated for non-public\n    if (!user) return null;\n    \n    // Owner has full access\n    if (doc.ownerId === user._id) {\n      return { ...doc, accessLevel: \"owner\" };\n    }\n    \n    // Check shared access\n    const access = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"documentAccess\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_doc_and_user\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"documentId\", args.docId).eq(\"userId\", user._id)\n      )\n      .unique();\n    \n    if (!access) return null;\n    \n    return { ...doc, accessLevel: access.level };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Action Isolation Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/actions.ts\n\"use node\";\n\nimport { action, internalAction } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { api, internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// SECURITY: Never expose API keys in responses\nexport const callExternalAPI = action({\n  args: { query: v.string() },\n  returns: v.object({ result: v.string() }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Verify user is authenticated\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    if (!identity) {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n    }\n    \n    // Get API key from environment (not hardcoded)\n    const apiKey = process.env.EXTERNAL_API_KEY;\n    if (!apiKey) {\n      throw new Error(\"API key not configured\");\n    }\n    \n    // Log usage for audit trail\n    await ctx.runMutation(internal.audit.logAPICall, {\n      userId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      endpoint: \"external-api\",\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n    \n    const response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/query\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: {\n        \"Authorization\": `Bearer ${apiKey}`,\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ query: args.query }),\n    });\n    \n    if (!response.ok) {\n      // Don''t expose external API error details\n      throw new ConvexError(\"External service unavailable\");\n    }\n    \n    const data = await response.json();\n    \n    // Sanitize response before returning\n    return { result: sanitizeResponse(data) };\n  },\n});\n\n// Internal action - not exposed to clients\nexport const _processPayment = internalAction({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    amount: v.number(),\n    paymentMethodId: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ success: v.boolean(), transactionId: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const stripeKey = process.env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY;\n    \n    // Process payment with Stripe\n    // This should NEVER be exposed as a public action\n    \n    return { success: true, transactionId: \"txn_xxx\" };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Rate Limiting Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/rateLimit.ts\nimport { mutation, query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\nconst RATE_LIMITS = {\n  message: { requests: 10, windowMs: 60000 }, // 10 per minute\n  upload: { requests: 5, windowMs: 300000 },  // 5 per 5 minutes\n  api: { requests: 100, windowMs: 3600000 },  // 100 per hour\n};\n\nexport const checkRateLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.string(),\n    action: v.union(v.literal(\"message\"), v.literal(\"upload\"), v.literal(\"api\")),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ allowed: v.boolean(), retryAfter: v.optional(v.number()) }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const limit = RATE_LIMITS[args.action];\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - limit.windowMs;\n    \n    // Count requests in window\n    const requests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"rateLimits\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user_and_action\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"userId\", args.userId).eq(\"action\", args.action)\n      )\n      .filter((q) => q.gt(q.field(\"timestamp\"), windowStart))\n      .collect();\n    \n    if (requests.length >= limit.requests) {\n      const oldestRequest = requests[0];\n      const retryAfter = oldestRequest.timestamp + limit.windowMs - now;\n      \n      return { allowed: false, retryAfter };\n    }\n    \n    // Record this request\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"rateLimits\", {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      action: args.action,\n      timestamp: now,\n    });\n    \n    return { allowed: true };\n  },\n});\n\n// Use in mutations\nexport const sendMessage = mutation({\n  args: { content: v.string() },\n  returns: v.id(\"messages\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    if (!identity) throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n    \n    // Check rate limit\n    const rateCheck = await checkRateLimit(ctx, {\n      userId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      action: \"message\",\n    });\n    \n    if (!rateCheck.allowed) {\n      throw new ConvexError({\n        code: \"RATE_LIMITED\",\n        message: `Too many requests. Try again in ${Math.ceil(rateCheck.retryAfter! / 1000)} seconds`,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"messages\", {\n      content: args.content,\n      authorId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Sensitive Operations Protection\n\n```typescript\n// convex/admin.ts\nimport { mutation, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { requireRole, requirePermission } from \"./lib/auth\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\n// Two-factor confirmation for dangerous operations\nexport const deleteAllUserData = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    confirmationCode: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Require superadmin\n    const admin = await requireRole(ctx, \"superadmin\");\n    \n    // Verify confirmation code\n    const confirmation = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"confirmations\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_admin_and_code\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"adminId\", admin._id).eq(\"code\", args.confirmationCode)\n      )\n      .filter((q) => q.gt(q.field(\"expiresAt\"), Date.now()))\n      .unique();\n    \n    if (!confirmation || confirmation.action !== \"delete_user_data\") {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Invalid or expired confirmation code\");\n    }\n    \n    // Delete confirmation to prevent reuse\n    await ctx.db.delete(confirmation._id);\n    \n    // Schedule deletion (don''t do it inline)\n    await ctx.scheduler.runAfter(0, internal.admin._performDeletion, {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      requestedBy: admin._id,\n    });\n    \n    // Audit log\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"auditLogs\", {\n      action: \"delete_user_data\",\n      targetUserId: args.userId,\n      performedBy: admin._id,\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n    \n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\n// Generate confirmation code for sensitive action\nexport const requestDeletionConfirmation = mutation({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.string(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const admin = await requireRole(ctx, \"superadmin\");\n    \n    const code = generateSecureCode();\n    \n    await ctx.db.insert(\"confirmations\", {\n      adminId: admin._id,\n      code,\n      action: \"delete_user_data\",\n      targetUserId: args.userId,\n      expiresAt: Date.now() + 5 * 60 * 1000, // 5 minutes\n    });\n    \n    // In production, send code via secure channel (email, SMS)\n    return code;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Complete Audit Trail System\n\n```typescript\n// convex/audit.ts\nimport { mutation, query, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { getUser, requireRole } from \"./lib/auth\";\n\nconst auditEventValidator = v.object({\n  _id: v.id(\"auditLogs\"),\n  _creationTime: v.number(),\n  action: v.string(),\n  userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n  resourceType: v.string(),\n  resourceId: v.string(),\n  details: v.optional(v.any()),\n  ipAddress: v.optional(v.string()),\n  timestamp: v.number(),\n});\n\n// Internal: Log audit event\nexport const logEvent = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    action: v.string(),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n    resourceType: v.string(),\n    resourceId: v.string(),\n    details: v.optional(v.any()),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"auditLogs\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"auditLogs\", {\n      ...args,\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\n// Admin: View audit logs\nexport const getAuditLogs = query({\n  args: {\n    resourceType: v.optional(v.string()),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(auditEventValidator),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await requireRole(ctx, \"admin\");\n    \n    let query = ctx.db.query(\"auditLogs\");\n    \n    if (args.resourceType) {\n      query = query.withIndex(\"by_resource_type\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"resourceType\", args.resourceType)\n      );\n    }\n    \n    return await query\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 100);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Implement defense in depth (multiple security layers)\n- Log all sensitive operations for audit trails\n- Use confirmation codes for destructive actions\n- Rate limit all user-facing endpoints\n- Never expose internal API keys or errors\n- Review access patterns regularly\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Single point of failure** - Implement multiple auth checks\n2. **Missing audit logs** - Log all sensitive operations\n3. **Trusting client data** - Always validate server-side\n4. **Exposing error details** - Sanitize error messages\n5. **No rate limiting** - Always implement rate limits\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Functions Auth: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:54:02.702Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Security-Focused Agents auditing Convex backends to prevent authorization flaws and data leaks.","zh":"适用于安全性焦点代理审计Convex后端，以防止授权漏洞和数据泄露。","ja":"Convexバックエンドの認可の欠陥やデータ漏洩を防ぐために、セキュリティ重視のエージェントによる監査に不可欠です。","ko":"Convex 백엔드의 인증 관련 취약점과 데이터 누출을 방지하기 위해 보안 중심 에이전트가 감사에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de seguridad enfocados que auditan backends de Convex para prevenir fallos de autorización y filtraciones de datos.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de sécurité axés sur l''audit des backends Convex pour prévenir les failles d''autorisation et les fuites de données.","de":"Wesentlich für sicherheitsorientierte Agenten, die Convex-Backends auditen, um Autorisierungsfehler und Datenlecks zu verhindern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Foco de Segurança que auditam backends Convex para prevenir falhas de autorização e vazamentos de dados.","ru":"Необходим для агентов, ориентированных на безопасность, аудита Convex-бэкендов для предотвращения ошибок авторизации и утечек данных.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات التفتيش للأجهزة المتممة المتخصصة في الأمن لفحص الخوادم الخلفية Convex لمنع عيوب التصريح وتسرب البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive security review of Convex applications by implementing authorization logic patterns, validating data access boundaries, enforcing action isolation, and configuring rate limiting for sensitive operations. Directly integrates with Convex''s auth functions and production security documentation.","zh":"通过实施认可逻辑模式、验证数据访问边界、强制操作隔离和为敏感操作配置速率限制，实现对Convex应用程序的全面安全审查。直接与Convex的认证函数和生产安全文档集成。","ja":"認可ロジックパターンの実装、データアクセス境界の検証、操作の分離の強制、感応操作のレート制限の設定により、Convexアプリケーションの包括的なセキュリティレビューを可能にします。Convexの認証機能やプロダクションセキュリティドキュメントとの直接統合もサポートします。","ko":"인증 논리 패턴 구현, 데이터 액세스 경계 검증, 동작 분리 강제 및 민감한 동작에 대한 전송 속도 제한 설정을 통해 Convex 애플리케이션의 종합적인 보안審査를 가능하게 합니다. Convex의 인증 함수 및 프로덕션 보안 문서와 직접 통합합니다.","es":"Permite una revisión de seguridad integral de las aplicaciones Convex implementando patrones de lógica de autorización, validando los límites de acceso a datos, aplicando aislamiento de acciones y configurando la limitación de velocidad para operaciones sensibles. Se integra directamente con las funciones de autenticación de Convex y la documentación de seguridad de producción.","fr":"Permet une revue de sécurité complète des applications Convex en implémentant des modèles de logique d''autorisation, en validant les limites d''accès aux données, en appliquant l''isolement des actions et en configurant la limitation de débit pour les opérations sensibles. S''intègre directement avec les fonctions d''authentification Convex et la documentation de sécurité de production.","de":"Ermöglicht eine umfassende Sicherheitsprüfung von Convex-Anwendungen durch die Implementierung von Autorisierungslogikmustern, die Validierung von Datenzugriffsgrenzen, die Durchsetzung von Aktionsisolierung und die Konfiguration von Rate Limiting für sensible Operationen. Integriert sich direkt mit Convex-Authentifizierungsfunktionen und Produktions-Sicherheitsdokumentation.","pt":"Permite uma revisão de segurança abrangente de aplicações Convex implementando padrões de lógica de autorização, validando limites de acesso a dados, aplicando isolamento de ações e configurando limitação de taxas para operações sensíveis. Integra-se diretamente com as funções de autenticação do Convex e a documentação de segurança de produção.","ru":"Позволяет провести всесторонний обзор безопасности Convex-приложений, реализуя шаблоны авторизационной логики, проверяя границы доступа к данным, обеспечивая изоляцию действий и настраивая ограничение скорости для конфиденциальных операций. Прямо интегрируется с функциями аутентификации Convex и производственной документацией по безопасности.","ar":"يسمح بإجراء مراجعة شاملة للأمان لتطبيقات Convex من خلال تنفيذ أنماط 논ریة التصريح والتحقق من حدود وصول البيانات وتطبيق عزل الإجراءات وتكوين تقييد معدل العمليات الحساسة. يتكامل مباشرة مع وظائف المصادقة Convex وتوثيق الأمان الإنتاجي."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing authorization logic in Convex queries and mutations","Validating data access boundaries against user permissions","Implementing rate limiting for sensitive Convex actions","Isolating high-risk operations in protected functions"],"zh":["审计Convex查询和变更中的认可逻辑","验证数据访问边界是否符合用户权限","为敏感的Convex操作实现速率限制","在受保护的函数中隔离高风险操作"],"ja":["Convexのクエリおよびミューテーションにおける認可ロジックの監査","ユーザ権限に基づくデータアクセス境界の検証","Convexの感応操作に対するレート制限の実装","保護された関数内で高リスク操作の分離"],"ko":["Convex 쿼리 및 변형의 인증 논리 감사","사용자 권한에 따른 데이터 액세스 경계 검증","민감한 Convex 동작에 대한 전송 속도 제한 구현","보호된 함수 내에서 고위험 동작 분리"],"es":["Auditoría de lógica de autorización en consultas y mutaciones de Convex","Validación de límites de acceso a datos contra permisos de usuario","Implementación de limitación de velocidad para acciones sensibles de Convex","Aislamiento de operaciones de alto riesgo en funciones protegidas"],"fr":["Audit de la logique d''autorisation dans les requêtes et les mutations Convex","Validation des limites d''accès aux données par rapport aux autorisations utilisateur","Mise en œuvre de la limitation de débit pour les actions sensibles Convex","Isolement des opérations à haut risque dans des fonctions protégées"],"de":["Auditorische Überprüfung der Autorisierungslogik in Convex-Abfragen und -Mutationen","Validierung von Datenzugriffsgrenzen gegen Benutzerberechtigungen","Implementierung von Rate Limiting für sensible Convex-Aktionen","Isolierung von Hochrisikooperationen in geschützten Funktionen"],"pt":["Auditoria da lógica de autorização em consultas e mutações Convex","Validação de limites de acesso a dados contra permissões de usuário","Implementação de limitação de taxas para ações Convex sensíveis","Isolamento de operações de alto risco em funções protegidas"],"ru":["Аудит авторизационной логики в запросах и мутациях Convex","Проверка границ доступа к данным на соответствие разрешениям пользователей","Реализация ограничения скорости для конфиденциальных действий Convex","Изоляция операций с высоким риском в защищенных функциях"],"ar":["مراجعة 논ریة التصريح في الاستفسارات والتحويلات Convex","التحقق من حدود وصول البيانات مقابل صلاحيات المستخدم","تنفيذ تقييد معدل العمليات الحساسة Convex","عزل العمليات ذات الخطورة العالية في الوظائف المحمية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex-specific implementation knowledge","Depends on current Convex documentation for latest patterns","Limited to Convex backend security context only"],"zh":["需要Convex特定的实现知识","依赖于当前Convex文档以获取最新的模式","仅限于Convex后端安全上下文"],"ja":["Convex特有の実装知識が必要","最新のパターンを取得するために現在のConvexドキュメントに依存","Convexバックエンドのセキュリティコンテキストにのみ適用"],"ko":["Convex 특정 구현 지식 필요","최신 패턴을 얻기 위해 현재 Convex 문서에 의존","Convex 백엔드 보안 컨텍스트에만 적용"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de implementación específico de Convex","Depende de la documentación actual de Convex para los últimos patrones","Limitado al contexto de seguridad de backend de Convex solo"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances d''implémentation spécifiques à Convex","Dépend de la documentation actuelle de Convex pour les derniers modèles","Limité au contexte de sécurité du backend Convex uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert Convex-spezifische Implementierungswissen","Hängt von der aktuellen Convex-Dokumentation für die neuesten Muster ab","Begrenzt auf den Sicherheitskontext des Convex-Backends nur"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de implementação específico do Convex","Depende da documentação atual do Convex para os padrões mais recentes","Limitado ao contexto de segurança do backend Convex apenas"],"ru":["Требует знаний о реализации Convex","Зависит от актуальной документации Convex для последних шаблонов","Ограничен только контекстом безопасности бэкенда Convex"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بتنفيذ Convex","يعتمد على توثيق Convex الحالي لأحدث الأنماط","محدود سياق أمان الخادم الخلفي Convex فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
