чшие Практики для Разработчиков","ar":"دッカー: أفضل الممارسات لل مطورين","en":"docker"},"description":{"zh":"Docker 技术提供了容器开发、构建和部署的最佳实践，提高开发效率","ja":"Docker スキルはコンテナ開発、構築、デプロイのベストプラクティスを提供","ko":"Docker 스킬은 컨테이너 개발,構築, 배포의 베스트 프랙티스를 제공","es":"Docker es una plataforma para crear, desplegar y ejecutar aplicaciones en contenedores","fr":"Docker est une plateforme pour créer, déployer et exécuter des applications dans des conteneurs","de":"Docker ist eine Plattform zum Erstellen, Bereitstellen und Ausführen von Anwendungen in Containern","pt":"O Docker é uma ferramenta essencial para desenvolvedores, permitindo a criação de ambientes de desenvolvimentoconsistentes e eficientes. Nossa documentação c...","ru":"Docker - это необходимый инструмент для разработчиков, позволяющий создавать согласованные и эффективные среды разработки. Наша документация охватывает лучши...","ar":"دッカー هو أداة أساسية لمطوري التطبيقات، مما يسمح بإنشاء بيئات تطوير متسقة وفعالة. توفر وثائقنا أفضل الممارسات لاستخدام دッカー","en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via..."},"definition":{"en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE). LLMProxy handles both modes out of the box, with zero buffering on streams, intelligent load balancing, and OpenAI-compatible API routing."},"features":{"zh":["多阶段构建","容器安全","优化容器镜像","智能负载均衡","零缓冲流"],"ja":["マルチステージビルド","コンテナセキュリティ","コンテナイメージの最適化","インテリジェントロードバランシング","ゼロバッファリングストリーム"],"ko":["다단계 빌드","컨테이너 보안","컨테이너 이미지 최적화","지능형 로드 밸런싱","제로 버퍼링 스트림"],"es":["Mejores prácticas para Dockerfiles","Configuración de docker-compose","Optimización de imágenes de contenedores","Seguridad de contenedores","Construcción multietapa"],"fr":["Meilleures pratiques pour les Dockerfiles","Configuration de docker-compose","Optimisation des images de conteneurs","Sécurité des conteneurs","Construire multétape"],"de":["Best Practices für Dockerfiles","Konfiguration von docker-compose","Optimierung von Container-Images","Container-Sicherheit","Mehrstufige Builds"],"pt":["Melhores práticas para Dockerfiles","Configuração de docker-compose","Otimização de imagens de contêiner","Segurança de contêiner","Construção de várias etapas"],"ru":["Лучшие практики для Dockerfiles","Настройка docker-compose","Оптимизация образов контейнеров","Безопасность контейнеров","Многостадийная сборка"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات لملفات دッカー","تكوين دッカー-كومبوز","تحسين صور الحاويات","أمان الحاويات","بناء متعدد المراحل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Docker","容器化","开发","构建","部署","多阶段构建","容器安全"],"ja":["Docker","コンテナ化","開発","構築","デプロイ","マルチステージビルド","コンテナセキュリティ"],"ko":["Docker","컨테이너화","개발","構築","배포","다단계 빌드","컨테이너 보안"],"es":["Docker para desarrolladores","mejores prácticas de Docker","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Docker","creación de contenedores","despliegue de aplicaciones con Docker","seguridad de contenedores"],"fr":["Docker pour les développeurs","meilleures pratiques de Docker","développement d''applications avec Docker","création de conteneurs","déploiement d''applications avec Docker","sécurité des conteneurs"],"de":["Docker für Entwickler","Best Practices für Docker","Anwendungsentwicklung mit Docker","Erstellung von Containern","Bereitstellung von Anwendungen mit Docker","Container-Sicherheit"],"pt":["Docker para desenvolvedores","Melhores práticas de Docker","Dockerfiles","Segurança de contêiner","Desenvolvimento de aplicações com Docker","Otimização de contêiner"],"ru":["Docker для разработчиков","Лучшие практики Docker","Dockerfiles","Безопасность контейнеров","Разработка приложений с Docker","Оптимизация контейнеров"],"ar":["دッカー لمطوري التطبيقات","أفضل الممارسات لدッカー","ملفات دッカー","أمان الحاويات","تطوير التطبيقات مع دッカー","تحسين الحاويات"]}},"owner":"aiyuekuang","repo":"LLMProxy","repoPath":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docker","description":"Docker and containerization best practices. Use for Dockerfile creation, docker-compose, multi-stage builds, and container optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Docker Skill\n\nContainer best practices for development, building, and deployment.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing Dockerfiles\n- Configuring docker-compose\n- Optimizing container images\n- Container security\n- Multi-stage builds\n\n---\n\n# 📦 Dockerfile Best Practices\n\n## Multi-Stage Build (Go)\n\n```dockerfile\n# Build stage\nFROM golang:1.22-alpine AS builder\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Cache dependencies\nCOPY go.mod go.sum ./\nRUN go mod download\n\n# Build\nCOPY . .\nRUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=linux go build -ld","body":"# Docker Skill\n\nContainer best practices for development, building, and deployment.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing Dockerfiles\n- Configuring docker-compose\n- Optimizing container images\n- Container security\n- Multi-stage builds\n\n---\n\n# 📦 Dockerfile Best Practices\n\n## Multi-Stage Build (Go)\n\n```dockerfile\n# Build stage\nFROM golang:1.22-alpine AS builder\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Cache dependencies\nCOPY go.mod go.sum ./\nRUN go mod download\n\n# Build\nCOPY . .\nRUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=linux go build -ldflags=\"-w -s\" -o /app/server ./cmd/main.go\n\n# Runtime stage\nFROM alpine:3.19\n\nRUN apk --no-cache add ca-certificates tzdata\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Copy binary from builder\nCOPY --from=builder /app/server .\nCOPY --from=builder /app/config.yaml .\n\n# Non-root user\nRUN adduser -D -g '''' appuser\nUSER appuser\n\nEXPOSE 8080\n\nENTRYPOINT [\"./server\"]\n```\n\n## Multi-Stage Build (Node.js)\n\n```dockerfile\n# Dependencies stage\nFROM node:20-alpine AS deps\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY package.json yarn.lock ./\nRUN yarn install --frozen-lockfile\n\n# Build stage\nFROM node:20-alpine AS builder\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY --from=deps /app/node_modules ./node_modules\nCOPY . .\nRUN yarn build\n\n# Runtime stage\nFROM node:20-alpine AS runner\nWORKDIR /app\n\nENV NODE_ENV=production\n\nRUN addgroup -g 1001 -S nodejs\nRUN adduser -S nextjs -u 1001\n\nCOPY --from=builder /app/public ./public\nCOPY --from=builder --chown=nextjs:nodejs /app/.next/standalone ./\nCOPY --from=builder --chown=nextjs:nodejs /app/.next/static ./.next/static\n\nUSER nextjs\n\nEXPOSE 3000\nENV PORT 3000\n\nCMD [\"node\", \"server.js\"]\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔧 Layer Optimization\n\n## Order Matters\n\n```dockerfile\n# ✅ Good: Least changing files first\nCOPY go.mod go.sum ./\nRUN go mod download\n\nCOPY . .\nRUN go build -o app\n\n# ❌ Bad: COPY all invalidates cache\nCOPY . .\nRUN go mod download\nRUN go build -o app\n```\n\n## Reduce Layers\n\n```dockerfile\n# ❌ Bad: Multiple RUN commands\nRUN apt-get update\nRUN apt-get install -y curl\nRUN apt-get install -y git\nRUN rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n\n# ✅ Good: Single RUN command\nRUN apt-get update && \\\n    apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \\\n        curl \\\n        git && \\\n    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n```\n\n## Use .dockerignore\n\n```dockerignore\n# Git\n.git\n.gitignore\n\n# Dependencies\nnode_modules\nvendor\n\n# Build artifacts\ndist\nbuild\n*.exe\n\n# Development files\n*.md\n*.log\n.env.local\n.vscode\n.idea\n\n# Tests\n*_test.go\n__tests__\ncoverage\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🐳 Docker Compose\n\n## Development Setup\n\n```yaml\nversion: ''3.8''\n\nservices:\n  app:\n    build:\n      context: .\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile.dev\n    ports:\n      - \"8080:8080\"\n    volumes:\n      - .:/app\n      - /app/node_modules  # Exclude node_modules\n    environment:\n      - DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@db:5432/app\n      - REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379\n    depends_on:\n      db:\n        condition: service_healthy\n      redis:\n        condition: service_started\n\n  db:\n    image: postgres:16-alpine\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_USER: user\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: pass\n      POSTGRES_DB: app\n    volumes:\n      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n    ports:\n      - \"5432:5432\"\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U user -d app\"]\n      interval: 5s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 5\n\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    ports:\n      - \"6379:6379\"\n    volumes:\n      - redis_data:/data\n\nvolumes:\n  postgres_data:\n  redis_data:\n```\n\n## Production Setup\n\n```yaml\nversion: ''3.8''\n\nservices:\n  app:\n    image: ${REGISTRY}/app:${VERSION}\n    deploy:\n      replicas: 3\n      resources:\n        limits:\n          cpus: ''1''\n          memory: 512M\n        reservations:\n          cpus: ''0.5''\n          memory: 256M\n      restart_policy:\n        condition: on-failure\n        delay: 5s\n        max_attempts: 3\n    environment:\n      - DATABASE_URL=${DATABASE_URL}\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"curl\", \"-f\", \"http://localhost:8080/health\"]\n      interval: 30s\n      timeout: 10s\n      retries: 3\n      start_period: 40s\n    logging:\n      driver: \"json-file\"\n      options:\n        max-size: \"10m\"\n        max-file: \"3\"\n\n  nginx:\n    image: nginx:alpine\n    ports:\n      - \"80:80\"\n      - \"443:443\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf:ro\n      - ./certs:/etc/nginx/certs:ro\n    depends_on:\n      - app\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔒 Security\n\n## Run as Non-Root\n\n```dockerfile\n# Create non-root user\nRUN addgroup -g 1001 -S appgroup && \\\n    adduser -u 1001 -S appuser -G appgroup\n\n# Change ownership\nCOPY --chown=appuser:appgroup . .\n\n# Switch to non-root user\nUSER appuser\n```\n\n## Scan for Vulnerabilities\n\n```bash\n# Using Docker Scout\ndocker scout cves myimage:latest\n\n# Using Trivy\ntrivy image myimage:latest\n\n# Using Snyk\nsnyk container test myimage:latest\n```\n\n## Read-Only Filesystem\n\n```yaml\nservices:\n  app:\n    read_only: true\n    tmpfs:\n      - /tmp\n      - /var/run\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📊 Health Checks\n\n```dockerfile\nHEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=10s --start-period=5s --retries=3 \\\n  CMD curl -f http://localhost:8080/health || exit 1\n```\n\n```go\n// Health endpoint\nfunc (h *Handler) Health(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    checks := map[string]string{\n        \"database\": h.checkDB(),\n        \"redis\":    h.checkRedis(),\n    }\n    \n    healthy := true\n    for _, status := range checks {\n        if status != \"ok\" {\n            healthy = false\n            break\n        }\n    }\n    \n    if healthy {\n        w.WriteHeader(http.StatusOK)\n    } else {\n        w.WriteHeader(http.StatusServiceUnavailable)\n    }\n    json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(checks)\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🛠️ Useful Commands\n\n```bash\n# Build\ndocker build -t myapp:latest .\ndocker build --no-cache -t myapp:latest .  # Fresh build\n\n# Run\ndocker run -d -p 8080:8080 --name myapp myapp:latest\ndocker run --rm -it myapp:latest /bin/sh  # Interactive\n\n# Logs\ndocker logs -f myapp\ndocker logs --tail 100 myapp\n\n# Exec into container\ndocker exec -it myapp /bin/sh\n\n# Cleanup\ndocker system prune -a  # Remove all unused\ndocker volume prune     # Remove unused volumes\ndocker image prune      # Remove dangling images\n\n# Inspect\ndocker stats            # Resource usage\ndocker inspect myapp    # Container details\ndocker history myapp    # Image layers\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📚 References\n\n- [Docker Best Practices](https://docs.docker.com/develop/develop-images/dockerfile_best-practices/)\n- [Docker Security](https://docs.docker.com/engine/security/)\n- [dmmulroy/cloudflare-skill](https://github.com/dmmulroy/cloudflare-skill)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:53:49.439Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Containerization Agents requiring efficient Docker image management and deployment.","zh":"适合需要高效Docker镜像管理和部署的容器化代理。","ja":"Dockerイメージの管理と展開が効率的であることが必要なコンテナ化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"도커 이미지 관리 및 배포가 효율적인 컨테이너화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de contenerización que requieren una gestión y despliegue eficientes de imágenes de Docker.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de conteneurisation nécessitant une gestion et un déploiement efficaces d''images Docker.","de":"Ideal für Containerisierungs-Agents, die eine effiziente Docker-Image-Verwaltung und -Bereitstellung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Containerização que exigem gerenciamento eficiente de imagens Docker e implantação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контейнеризации, требующих эффективного управления образами Docker и развертывания.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء التى تتطلب إدارة صور دوكر فعالة وتحديث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize container images, configure docker-compose, and utilize multi-stage builds for streamlined development and deployment, leveraging Dockerfiles and Server-Sent Events (SSE) for real-time token streaming.","zh":"赋予代理优化容器镜像、配置docker-compose和利用多阶段构建以实现开发和部署的简化，利用Dockerfile和服务器发送事件（SSE）实现实时令牌流式传输。","ja":"エージェントにコンテナイメージを最適化し、docker-composeを構成し、開発と展開をストリームライン化するためのマルチステージビルドを利用できるようにし、Dockerfileとサーバーセントイベント（SSE）を使用してリアルタイムトークンストリーミングを利用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 컨테이너 이미지를 최적화하고, docker-compose를 구성하며, 개발 및 배포를 간소화하기 위한 멀티 스테이지 빌드를 활용할 수 있도록 하며, Dockerfile 및 서버 전송 이벤트(SSE)를 사용하여 실시간 토큰 스트리밍을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar imágenes de contenedores, configurar docker-compose y utilizar construcciones multietapa para un desarrollo y despliegue fluidos, aprovechando Dockerfiles y Eventos Enviados por el Servidor (SSE) para transmisión de tokens en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les images de conteneur, de configurer docker-compose et d''utiliser des builds multétapes pour un développement et un déploiement fluides, en exploitant les Dockerfiles et les Événements Envoyés par le Serveur (SSE) pour un streaming de jetons en temps réel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Container-Images zu optimieren, docker-compose zu konfigurieren und Multi-Stage-Builds für einen reibungslosen Entwicklungs- und Bereitstellungsprozess zu nutzen, indem Dockerfiles und Server-Sent Events (SSE) für Echtzeit-Token-Streaming genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar imagens de contêiner, configurar docker-compose e utilizar compilações em várias etapas para desenvolvimento e implantação simplificados, aproveitando Dockerfiles e Eventos Enviados pelo Servidor (SSE) para transmissão de tokens em tempo real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать контейнерные изображения, настраивать docker-compose и использовать многоэтапную сборку для упрощенного развития и развертывания, используя Dockerfiles и события, отправляемые сервером (SSE), для потоковой передачи токенов в режиме реального времени.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين صور الحاويات وتكوين دوكر-كومبوز واستخدام عمليات بناء متعددة المراحل لتطوير وتنفيذ مبسط ، واستخدام دوكرไฟลز وأحداث مرسلة من الخادم (SSE) لنقل الرموز في الوقت الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing optimized Dockerfiles","Configuring docker-compose for scalable deployments","Implementing multi-stage builds for efficient containerization"],"zh":["编写优化的Dockerfile","为可扩展的部署配置docker-compose","实现多阶段构建以实现高效的容器化"],"ja":["最適化されたDockerfileの作成","スケーラブルな展開のためのdocker-composeの構成","効率的なコンテナ化のためのマルチステージビルドの実装"],"ko":["최적화된 Dockerfile 작성","확장 가능한 배포를 위한 docker-compose 구성","효율적인 컨테이너화 위한 멀티 스테이지 빌드 구현"],"es":["Escritura de Dockerfiles optimizados","Configuración de docker-compose para despliegues escalables","Implementación de construcciones multietapa para una contenerización eficiente"],"fr":["Écriture de Dockerfiles optimisés","Configuration de docker-compose pour des déploiements évolutifs","Mise en œuvre de builds multétapes pour une conteneurisation efficace"],"de":["Schreiben optimierter Dockerfiles","Konfiguration von docker-compose für skalierbare Bereitstellungen","Implementierung von Multi-Stage-Builds für eine effiziente Containerisierung"],"pt":["Escrita de Dockerfiles otimizados","Configuração do docker-compose para implantações escaláveis","Implementação de compilações em várias etapas para containerização eficiente"],"ru":["Написание оптимизированных Dockerfiles","Настройка docker-compose для масштабируемых развертываний","Реализация многоэтапной сборки для эффективной контейнеризации"],"ar":["كتابة دوكرไฟลز محسّنة","تكوين دوكر-كومبوز لتنفيذات قابلة للتوسيع","تنفيذ عمليات بناء متعددة المراحل لتحقيق حاويات فعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker installation","Dependent on specific container runtime environments"],"zh":["需要Docker安装","依赖于特定的容器运行时环境"],"ja":["Dockerのインストールが必要","特定のコンテナランタイム環境に依存する"],"ko":["도커 설치가 필요함","특정 컨테이너 런타임 환경에 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Docker","Dependiente de entornos de tiempo de ejecución de contenedor específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Docker","Dépendant d''environnements d''exécution de conteneur spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Docker-Installation","Abhängig von spezifischen Container-Laufzeitumgebungen"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Docker","Dependente de ambientes de tempo de execução de contêiner específicos"],"ru":["Требует установки Docker","Зависит от определенных сред выполнения контейнеров"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت دوكر","يعتمد على بيئات تشغيل الحاويات المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
