herfähigkeiten","Zettelkasten","Wissensgraphen","Claude Desktop","Wissensverwaltung","Entwicklung von Fähigkeiten","Validierung von Fähigkeiten","modulares Design","Import und Export"],"pt":["criador de habilidades de memória avançada","Zettelkasten","gerenciamento de conhecimento","gráficos de conhecimento","Claude Skills","desenvolvimento de habilidades","validação de habilidades","importação e exportação de dados"],"ru":["создатель продвинутых навыков памяти","Zettelkasten","управление знаниями","графики знаний","Claude Skills","разработка навыков","валидация навыков","импорт и экспорт данных"],"ar":["مبتكر مهارات الذاكرة المتقدمة","Zettelkasten","إدارة المعرفة","رسوم بيانية للمعرفة","مهارات Claude","تطوير المهارات","تحقق من المهارات","استيراد وتصدير البيانات"]}},"owner":"sandraschi","repo":"advanced-memory-mcp","repoPath":"sandraschi/advanced-memory-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.504Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"advanced-memory-skill-creator","description":"Use when planning, scaffolding, validating, or packaging Claude skills inside Advanced Memory MCP.","bodyPreview":"# Advanced Memory Skill Creator\n> **Status**: ✅ Research complete\n>\n> **Last validated**: 2025-11-08\n>\n> **Confidence**: 🟡 Medium — Ready for packaging – keep sources current\n\n## When to load this skill\n- You need to build a new Claude skill that matches Anthropic’s gold-standard structure.\n- You are upgrading a legacy skill (single SKILL.md file) into the modular layout.\n- You must validate a skill before sharing it with teammates or packaging it for SkillsMP.\n- You want to create repeatable a","body":"# Advanced Memory Skill Creator\n> **Status**: ✅ Research complete\n>\n> **Last validated**: 2025-11-08\n>\n> **Confidence**: 🟡 Medium — Ready for packaging – keep sources current\n\n## When to load this skill\n- You need to build a new Claude skill that matches Anthropic’s gold-standard structure.\n- You are upgrading a legacy skill (single SKILL.md file) into the modular layout.\n- You must validate a skill before sharing it with teammates or packaging it for SkillsMP.\n- You want to create repeatable automation around scaffolding, validation, or packaging.\n\n## Quick start workflow\n1. **Collect requirements** using the prompts in [modules/process-guide.md](modules/process-guide.md#step-1-understanding).\n2. **Run the MCP tool**:\n   ```python\n   adn_skills_creator(\n       operation=\"scaffold\",\n       skill_name=\"my-new-skill\",\n       output_dir=\"skills/custom\",\n       category=\"developer\"\n   )\n   ```\n3. **Fill in content** following the templates in `modules/core-guidance.md`.\n4. **Validate** and **package**:\n   ```python\n   adn_skills_creator(operation=\"validate\", skill_path=\"skills/custom/my-new-skill\")\n   adn_skills_creator(operation=\"package\", skill_path=\"skills/custom/my-new-skill\", output_dir=\"dist\")\n   ```\n5. Record sources, update `the status banner`, and publish.\n\n## CLI equivalents\n- Scaffold: `uv run am-skill-creator scaffold my-new-skill --output-dir skills/custom`\n- Validate: `uv run am-skill-creator validate skills/custom/my-new-skill`\n- Package: `uv run am-skill-creator package skills/custom/my-new-skill --output-dir dist`\n- Upgrade legacy skill: `uv run am-skill-creator upgrade skills/legacy/old-skill`\n\n## Module overview\n- [Core guidance](modules/core-guidance.md) — Complete playbooks for scaffolding, validation, packaging, and automation.\n- [Process guide](modules/process-guide.md) — Anthropic six-step methodology tailored to Advanced Memory.\n- [Known gaps](modules/known-gaps.md) — Validation tasks, pending research, and integration TODOs.\n- [Research checklist](modules/research-checklist.md) — Mandatory workflow to capture sources and verify freshness.\n\n## Research status\n- Research complete as of 2025-11-08 (see sources above); rerun checklist quarterly or after Anthropic updates.\n- Document new sources inside `the Source Log` and [modules/research-checklist.md](modules/research-checklist.md) when revisions are made.\n- Update `the status banner` to 🟢 High after field validation and peer review.\n\n## Related tools and references\n- `adn_skills_creator` portmanteau – runtime interface for all operations.\n- `scripts/refactor_skills_modular.py` – bulk upgrade helper.\n- `docs/patterns/claude-skills/skill-creator-reference.md` – Anthropic gold standard.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:54:41.730Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Management Agents needing advanced Zettelkasten capabilities with Claude Desktop integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Zettelkasten 功能和 Claude Desktop 集成的知识管理代理。","ja":"Claude Desktop 統合を必要とする高度な Zettelkasten 機能を必要とするナレッジマネジメントエージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 데스크탑 통합이 필요한 고급 젠텔카스텐 기능을 필요로 하는 지식 관리 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Conocimiento que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de Zettelkasten con integración de Claude Desktop.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion des connaissances ayant besoin de capacités avancées de Zettelkasten avec une intégration de Claude Desktop.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die erweiterte Zettelkasten-Funktionen mit Claude-Desktop-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de Zettelkasten com integração do Claude Desktop.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления знаниями, которым требуются расширенные возможности Zettelkasten с интеграцией Claude Desktop.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المعرفة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة من Zettelkasten مع تكامل Claude Desktop."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create modular skills with knowledge graphs, import/export tools, and seamless Claude Skills integration, leveraging MCP server capabilities for robust knowledge management.","zh":"赋予代理创建模块化技能的能力，利用知识图、导入/导出工具和无缝的 Claude Skills 集成，利用 MCP 服务器功能实现强大的知识管理。","ja":"エージェントがモジュラーなスキルを作成できるようにし、ナレッジグラフ、インポート/エクスポートツール、およびシームレスな Claude Skills 統合を利用し、MCP サーバーの機能を利用して堅牢なナレッジマネジメントを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 모듈화된 기능을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 지식 그래프,导入/导出 도구 및 Claude Skills의 無縫な 統合을 利用하여, MCP 서버의 기능을 利用하여堅牢한 지식 관리를 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear habilidades modulares con gráficos de conocimiento, herramientas de importación/exportación y una integración perfecta con Claude Skills, aprovechando las capacidades del servidor MCP para una gestión robusta del conocimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des compétences modulaires avec des graphiques de connaissances, des outils d''importation/exportation et une intégration transparente de Claude Skills, en exploitant les capacités du serveur MCP pour une gestion robuste des connaissances.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, modulare Fähigkeiten mit Wissensgraphen, Import-/Export-Tools und nahtloser Claude-Skills-Integration zu erstellen, indem die Fähigkeiten des MCP-Servers für ein robustes Wissensmanagement genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar habilidades modulares com grafos de conhecimento, ferramentas de importação/exportação e integração transparente de Habilidades Claude, aproveitando as capacidades do servidor MCP para um gerenciamento de conhecimento robusto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать модульные навыки с графами знаний, инструментами импорта/экспорта и бесшовной интеграцией навыков Claude, используя возможности сервера MCP для прочного управления знаниями.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء مهارات مُتجانسة مع رسوم بيانية للمعرفة وأدوات الاستيراد/التصدير والتكامل السلس لمهارات Claude، مستفيداً من إمكانيات خادم MCP لتحقيق إدارة معرفة قوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Building new Claude skills with Anthropic''s gold-standard structure","Upgrading legacy skills to modular layouts","Validating skills before sharing or packaging for SkillsMP","Creating repeatable knowledge management workflows"],"zh":["使用 Anthropic 的金标准结构构建新的 Claude 技能","将旧的技能升级到模块化布局","在共享或为 SkillsMP 打包之前验证技能","创建可重复的知识管理工作流"],"ja":["Anthropic の金標準構造を使用して新しい Claude スキルを構築する","レガシースキルをモジュラー化されたレイアウトにアップグレードする","共有または SkillsMP にパッケージ化する前にスキルを検証する","繰り返し可能なナレッジマネジメントのワークフローを作成する"],"ko":["Anthropic 의 금표준 구조를 사용하여 새로운 클라우드 기능을 구축하는 것","레거시 기능을 모듈화된 레이아웃으로 업그레이드하는 것","공유 또는 SkillsMP에 패키징하기 전에 기능을 검증하는 것","반복 가능한 지식 관리 워크플로를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Crear nuevas habilidades de Claude con la estructura de referencia de Anthropic","Actualizar habilidades heredadas a diseños modulares","Validar habilidades antes de compartir o empaquetar para SkillsMP","Crear flujos de trabajo de gestión de conocimiento repetibles"],"fr":["Créer de nouvelles compétences Claude avec la structure de référence d''Anthropic","Mettre à niveau les compétences héritées vers des dispositions modulaires","Valider les compétences avant de les partager ou de les empaqueter pour SkillsMP","Créer des flux de travail de gestion des connaissances répétables"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen Claude-Fähigkeiten mit der Referenzstruktur von Anthropic","Aktualisieren von Legacy-Fähigkeiten auf modulare Layouts","Validieren von Fähigkeiten vor dem Teilen oder Verpacken für SkillsMP","Erstellen von wiederholbaren Wissensmanagement-Workflows"],"pt":["Construir novas habilidades Claude com a estrutura de ouro padrão da Anthropic","Atualizar habilidades legadas para layouts modulares","Validar habilidades antes de compartilhar ou empacotar para SkillsMP","Criar fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de conhecimento repetíveis"],"ru":["Создание новых навыков Claude со структурой золотого стандарта Anthropic","Обновление устаревших навыков до модульных компоновок","Проверка навыков перед обменом или упаковкой для SkillsMP","Создание повторяющихся рабочих процессов управления знаниями"],"ar":["بناء مهارات Claude الجديدة مع هيكل معيار الذهب من Anthropic","ترقية مهارات موروثة إلى تخطيطات مُتجانسة","تحقق من المهارات قبل المشاركة أو التعبئة للـ SkillsMP","إنشاء سلاسل عمل متكررة لإدارة المعرفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Desktop environment","Compatibility with specific MCP server version","Medium confidence level indicates need for ongoing source updates"],"zh":["需要 Claude Desktop 环境","兼容特定版本的 MCP 服务器","中等信心水平表示需要持续更新源"],"ja":["Claude Desktop 環境が必要","特定バージョンの MCP サーバーとの互換性","中程度の信頼性レベルは継続的なソース更新の必要性を示唆"],"ko":["클라우드 데스크탑 환경이 필요","특정 버전의 MCP 서버와의 호환성","중등급 信頼性 수준은 지속적인 ソース 更新의 필요성을 나타냄"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Claude Desktop","Compatibilidad con una versión específica del servidor MCP","Nivel de confianza medio indica la necesidad de actualizaciones de origen continuas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''environnement de bureau Claude","Compatibilité avec une version spécifique du serveur MCP","Niveau de confiance moyen indique la nécessité de mises à jour de source continues"],"de":["Benötigt Claude-Desktop-Umgebung","Kompatibilität mit einer bestimmten MCP-Server-Version","Mittleres Vertrauensniveau weist auf die Notwendigkeit kontinuierlicher Quellaktualisierungen hin"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de Claude Desktop","Compatibilidade com versão específica do servidor MCP","Nível de confiança médio indica necessidade de atualizações de fonte contínuas"],"ru":["Требуется среда Claude Desktop","Совместимость с конкретной версией сервера MCP","Уровень средней уверенности указывает на необходимость непрерывных обновлений источника"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة سطح مكتب Claude","التوافق مع إصدار محدد من خادم MCP","مستوى الثقة المتوسط يشير إلى الحاجة إلى تحديثات المصدر المستمرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
