e Fastify para rotas explícitas","Integração com Prisma ORM para gerenciamento de banco de dados","Suporte a SQLite e PostgreSQL","Processamento de imagens com Sharp","Upload de arquivos multipart"],"ru":["Разработка бэкенда с использованием Node.js и TypeScript","Использование Express и Fastify для явного маршрутизации","Интеграция с Prisma ORM для управления базой данных","Поддержка SQLite и PostgreSQL","Обработка изображений с помощью Sharp","Загрузка файлов multipart"],"ar":["تطوير الخلفية باستخدام Node.js و TypeScript","استخدام Express و Fastify للطرق الصريحة","التكامل مع Prisma ORM لإدارة قاعدة البيانات","دعم SQLite و PostgreSQL","معالجة الصور باستخدام Sharp","تحميل الملفات المultipart"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ReJoEs 后端 AI 技能","Node.js","Express","Prisma ORM","后端开发","AI 技术","RESTful API","TypeScript","Fastify"],"ja":["ReJoEs バックエンド AI スキル","Node.js","Express","Prisma ORM","バックエンド開発","AI 技術","RESTful API","TypeScript","Fastify"],"ko":["ReJoEs 백엔드 AI 기술","Node.js","Express","Prisma ORM","백엔드 개발","AI 기술","RESTful API","TypeScript","Fastify"],"es":["ReJoEs Workspace","desarrollo de backend","IA para desarrolladores","Node.js","TypeScript","Prisma ORM","SQLite","PostgreSQL","Sharp","API RESTful"],"fr":["ReJoEs Workspace","développement backend","IA pour développeurs","Node.js","TypeScript","Prisma ORM","SQLite","PostgreSQL","Sharp","API RESTful"],"de":["ReJoEs Workspace","Backend-Entwicklung","KI für Entwickler","Node.js","TypeScript","Prisma ORM","SQLite","PostgreSQL","Sharp","RESTful-API"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de backend","IA","Node.js","TypeScript","Express","Fastify","Prisma ORM","SQLite","PostgreSQL","Sharp"],"ru":["разработка бэкенда","ИИ","Node.js","TypeScript","Express","Fastify","Prisma ORM","SQLite","PostgreSQL","Sharp"],"ar":["تطوير الخلفية","الذكاء الاصطناعي","Node.js","TypeScript","Express","Fastify","Prisma ORM","SQLite","PostgreSQL","Sharp"]}},"owner":"webdevarif","repo":"rejoes-pos","repoPath":"webdevarif/rejoes-pos","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rejoes-workspace","description":"ReJoEs Backend – AI Skills & Responsibilities","bodyPreview":"# ReJoEs Backend – AI Skills & Responsibilities\n\nThis file defines what the AI agent IS ALLOWED and EXPECTED to do\nwhen working on the ReJoEs backend.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Core Technical Stack Skills\n\nThe AI should confidently use and generate:\n\n- Node.js (TypeScript)\n- Express or Fastify (explicit routing)\n- Prisma ORM\n- SQLite (dev/test)\n- PostgreSQL (production-ready schemas)\n- Sharp (image processing)\n- Multipart file uploads\n- RESTful API design\n- Transaction-safe logic\n\n---\n\n## 2. Backend Architect","body":"# ReJoEs Backend – AI Skills & Responsibilities\n\nThis file defines what the AI agent IS ALLOWED and EXPECTED to do\nwhen working on the ReJoEs backend.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Core Technical Stack Skills\n\nThe AI should confidently use and generate:\n\n- Node.js (TypeScript)\n- Express or Fastify (explicit routing)\n- Prisma ORM\n- SQLite (dev/test)\n- PostgreSQL (production-ready schemas)\n- Sharp (image processing)\n- Multipart file uploads\n- RESTful API design\n- Transaction-safe logic\n\n---\n\n## 2. Backend Architecture Skills\n\nThe AI is expected to:\n\n- Design clean controller → service → data layers\n- Centralize business rules (tiers, allowances, limits)\n- Use Prisma transactions for all mutations\n- Keep controllers thin and logic testable\n- Avoid duplication of rule logic\n\n---\n\n## 3. API Design Responsibilities\n\nThe AI may:\n- Create REST endpoints exactly matching the spec\n- Validate request payloads\n- Return structured, predictable JSON errors\n- Enforce idempotency and safety rules\n\nThe AI may NOT:\n- Add extra endpoints\n- Modify API contracts without instruction\n- Add optional behavior not described\n\n---\n\n## 4. Subscription Sync Handling\n\nThe AI should:\n- Parse Shopify subscription webhook payloads\n- Map Shopify fields → internal member fields\n- Normalize tier and status values\n- Detect billing cycle changes\n- Trigger counter resets safely\n\n---\n\n## 5. Image Handling Skills\n\nThe AI may:\n- Accept multipart uploads\n- Compress images\n- Generate thumbnails\n- Store local file paths\n- Return URLs relative to the server\n\nThe AI must:\n- Treat photos as immutable loan identifiers\n- Never overwrite an existing loan photo\n\n---\n\n## 6. Data Integrity Skills\n\nThe AI is expected to:\n- Prevent race conditions\n- Prevent double-loans\n- Prevent counter drift\n- Handle retry-safe operations\n- Use idempotency keys correctly\n\n---\n\n## 7. Testing & Dev Workflow\n\nThe AI may:\n- Generate Prisma schemas\n- Create seed data\n- Write basic API tests\n- Support SQLite file-based databases\n\nThe AI should:\n- Keep production compatibility in mind\n- Avoid SQLite-only hacks\n\n---\n\n## 8. Error Handling Expectations\n\nThe AI should:\n- Return meaningful error messages for POS staff\n- Fail fast on rule violations\n- Avoid silent failures\n- Never partially complete a swap\n\n---\n\n## 9. Security Awareness\n\nThe AI must:\n- Verify Shopify webhooks\n- Avoid leaking internal IDs unnecessarily\n- Assume POS runs in semi-trusted environments\n- Never expose admin-only logic publicly\n\n---\n\n## 10. Delivery Expectations\n\nWhen asked to build:\n- The AI should generate **complete, production-grade backend code**\n- File trees must be explicit\n- Functions must match the spec exactly\n- No placeholder or speculative logic\n\n---\n\n## 11. Mental Model Alignment\n\nThe AI should always reason using this model:\n\n- Photos = items\n- Loans = circulation\n- Time = velocity\n- Subscriptions = funding\n- Shopify = billing truth\n- Backend = operational truth\n\nIf a proposed feature breaks this mental model,\nthe AI should reject it.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:56:28.544Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing advanced Node.js and TypeScript capabilities for ReJoEs backend development.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Node.js 和 TypeScript 功能的全栈代理，用于 ReJoEs 后端开发。","ja":"Node.js と TypeScript の高度な機能が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適です。ReJoEs のバックエンド開発に使用します。","ko":"고급 Node.js와 TypeScript 기능이 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다. ReJoEs 백엔드 개발에 사용됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de Node.js y TypeScript para el desarrollo de backend de ReJoEs.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin de capacités avancées Node.js et TypeScript pour le développement de backend ReJoEs.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die erweiterte Node.js- und TypeScript-Funktionen für die Entwicklung des ReJoEs-Backends benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de capacidades avançadas do Node.js e do TypeScript para o desenvolvimento de backend do ReJoEs.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходимы расширенные возможности Node.js и TypeScript для разработки бэкенда ReJoEs.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرامج الكاملين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة من Node.js و TypeScript لتنمية خلفية ReJoEs."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement RESTful APIs using Express or Fastify, manage databases with Prisma ORM and PostgreSQL, and handle image processing with Sharp, while ensuring transaction-safe logic and multipart file uploads.","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现使用 Express 或 Fastify 的 RESTful API，使用 Prisma ORM 和 PostgreSQL 管理数据库，并使用 Sharp 处理图像，同时确保事务安全逻辑和多部分文件上传。","ja":"エージェントが Express または Fastify を使用した RESTful API を設計および実装し、Prisma ORM と PostgreSQL を使用してデータベースを管理し、Sharp を使用して画像処理を行い、トランザクションセーフロジックとマルチパートファイルアップロードを確保することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Express 또는 Fastify를 사용하여 RESTful API를 설계 및 구현하고, Prisma ORM 및 PostgreSQL을 사용하여 데이터베이스를 관리하며, Sharp를 사용하여 이미지 처리를 수행하고, 트랜잭션 안전 로직 및 멀티파트 파일 업로드를 보장하는 것을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar e implementar APIs RESTful utilizando Express o Fastify, gestionar bases de datos con Prisma ORM y PostgreSQL, y procesar imágenes con Sharp, garantizando una lógica de transacciones seguras y cargas de archivos multipart.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des API RESTful à l''aide d''Express ou de Fastify, de gérer des bases de données avec Prisma ORM et PostgreSQL, et de traiter les images avec Sharp, tout en garantissant une logique de transactions sécurisée et des téléchargements de fichiers multipart.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, RESTful-APIs mit Express oder Fastify zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, Datenbanken mit Prisma ORM und PostgreSQL zu verwalten und Bildverarbeitung mit Sharp durchzuführen, während eine transaktionssichere Logik und multipart-Dateiuploads sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar APIs RESTful usando Express ou Fastify, gerenciar bancos de dados com Prisma ORM e PostgreSQL, e processar imagens com Sharp, garantindo lógica de transações seguras e uploads de arquivos multipart.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать и реализовывать RESTful API с использованием Express или Fastify, управлять базами данных с помощью Prisma ORM и PostgreSQL, а также обрабатывать изображения с помощью Sharp, обеспечивая безопасную логику транзакций и загрузку файлов multipart.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتنفيذ واجهات برمجة تطبيقات RESTful باستخدام Express أو Fastify، وإدارة قواعد البيانات مع Prisma ORM و PostgreSQL، ومعالجة الصور مع Sharp، مع ضمان منطق معاملات آمنة وتحميل الملفات المultipart."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing scalable backend architectures with Node.js and TypeScript","Implementing secure and efficient database schemas with Prisma ORM and PostgreSQL","Optimizing image processing workflows using Sharp"],"zh":["使用 Node.js 和 TypeScript 开发可扩展的后端架构","使用 Prisma ORM 和 PostgreSQL 实现安全高效的数据库模式","使用 Sharp 优化图像处理工作流"],"ja":["Node.js と TypeScript を使用したスケーラブルなバックエンドアーキテクチャの開発","Prisma ORM と PostgreSQL を使用したセキュアで効率的なデータベーススキーマの実装","Sharp を使用した画像処理ワークフローの最適化"],"ko":["Node.js와 TypeScript를 사용하여 확장 가능한 백엔드 아키텍처 개발","Prisma ORM 및 PostgreSQL을 사용하여 보안 및 효율적인 데이터베이스 스키마 구현","Sharp를 사용하여 이미지 처리 워크플로우 최적화"],"es":["Desarrollar arquitecturas de backend escalables con Node.js y TypeScript","Implementar esquemas de base de datos seguros y eficientes con Prisma ORM y PostgreSQL","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de procesamiento de imágenes con Sharp"],"fr":["Développer des architectures de backend escalables avec Node.js et TypeScript","Mettre en œuvre des schémas de base de données sécurisés et efficaces avec Prisma ORM et PostgreSQL","Optimiser les flux de travail de traitement d''images avec Sharp"],"de":["Entwicklung von skalierbaren Backend-Architekturen mit Node.js und TypeScript","Implementierung sicherer und effizienter Datenbankschemata mit Prisma ORM und PostgreSQL","Optimierung von Bildverarbeitungs-Workflows mit Sharp"],"pt":["Desenvolver arquiteturas de backend escaláveis com Node.js e TypeScript","Implementar esquemas de banco de dados seguros e eficientes com Prisma ORM e PostgreSQL","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de processamento de imagens usando Sharp"],"ru":["Разработка масштабируемых архитектур бэкенда с помощью Node.js и TypeScript","Реализация безопасных и эффективных схем баз данных с помощью Prisma ORM и PostgreSQL","Оптимизация потоков обработки изображений с помощью Sharp"],"ar":["تنمية هياكل خلفية قابلة للتحجيم مع Node.js و TypeScript","تنفيذ مخططات قواعد البيانات الآمنة والفعالة مع Prisma ORM و PostgreSQL","تحسين سلاسل معالجة الصور باستخدام Sharp"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js and TypeScript environment","Explicit routing with Express or Fastify needed","PostgreSQL database connection required for production-ready schemas"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 和 TypeScript 环境","需要使用 Express 或 Fastify 的显式路由","需要 PostgreSQL 数据库连接以实现生产就绪模式"],"ja":["Node.js と TypeScript の環境が必要","Express または Fastify を使用した明示的なルーティングが必要","PostgreSQL データベース接続が必要である生産就緒モード"],"ko":["Node.js와 TypeScript 환경이 필요합니다","Express 또는 Fastify를 사용한 명시적 라우팅이 필요합니다","PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 연결이 생산 준비 모드를 구현하는 데 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Node.js y TypeScript","Se requiere enrutamiento explícito con Express o Fastify","Se requiere una conexión de base de datos PostgreSQL para esquemas de producción"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js et TypeScript","Un routage explicite avec Express ou Fastify est nécessaire","Une connexion de base de données PostgreSQL est requise pour les schémas de production"],"de":["Benötigt eine Node.js- und TypeScript-Umgebung","Explizite Routing mit Express oder Fastify erforderlich","Eine PostgreSQL-Datenbankverbindung ist für Produktions-Schemata erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js e TypeScript","Roteamento explícito com Express ou Fastify necessário","Conexão de banco de dados PostgreSQL necessária para esquemas de produção prontos"],"ru":["Требуется среда Node.js и TypeScript","Необходимо явное маршрутизация с помощью Express или Fastify","Требуется подключение к базе данных PostgreSQL для готовых к производству схем"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js و TypeScript","التوجيه الصريح مع Express أو Fastify ضروري","يتطلب الاتصال بقاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL لخطط الإنتاج الجاهزة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
