,"ja":"mcp-repo-scanはコードリポジトリのスキャン工具であり、体系的なリポジトリの完全性監査とパフォーマンス最適化を行う","ko":"mcp-repo-scan은 코드 저장소 스캔 도구로서 체계적인 저장소 완전성 감사 및 성능 최적화를 수행합니다","es":"mcp-repo-scan realiza una auditoría sistemática de la integridad del repositorio, resuelve deficiencias y mejora el rendimiento","fr":"mcp-repo-scan effectue une audit systématique de l''intégrité du référentiel, résout les déficiences et améliore les performances","de":"mcp-repo-scan führt eine systematische Prüfung der Repository-Integrität durch, behebt Mängel und verbessert die Leistung","pt":"O mcp-repo-scan é uma ferramenta que realiza uma auditoria sistemática de integridade do repositório, resolve deficiências e melhora o desempenho do sistema.","ru":"mcp-repo-scan — это инструмент, который выполняет системную проверку целостности репозитория, устраняет недостатки и улучшает производительность системы.","ar":"mcp-repo-scan هو أداة تقوم بفحص صيانة مستودع منهجي، وتحلل العيوب وتحسن أداء النظام.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["系统性仓库完整性审计","架构和操作缺陷解决","系统性能优化","代码仓库扫描","RE-Engine代码库结构分析","MCP集成模式分析"],"ja":["体系的なリポジトリの完全性監査","アーキテクチャと操作の欠陥の解決","システムのパフォーマンス最適化","コードリポジトリのスキャン","RE-Engineのコードベース構造分析","MCP統合パターンの分析"],"ko":["체계적인 저장소 완전성 감사","아키텍처 및 운영의 결함 해결","시스템 성능 최적화","코드 저장소 스캔","RE-Engine의 코드베이스 구조 분석","MCP 통합 패턴 분석"],"es":["Análisis de estructura de código","Validación de integración de MCP","Resolución de deficiencias arquitectónicas","Mejora del rendimiento del sistema","Validación de compilación completa","Análisis de patrones de integración"],"fr":["Analyse de la structure de code","Validation de l''intégration de MCP","Résolution des déficiences architecturales","Amélioration des performances du système","Validation de la compilation complète","Analyse des modèles d''intégration"],"de":["Analyse der Code-Struktur","Validierung der MCP-Integration","Behebung von architektonischen Mängeln","Verbesserung der Systemleistung","Validierung der vollständigen Kompilierung","Analyse der Integrationsmuster"],"pt":["Auditoria de integridade do repositório","Resolução de deficiências arquiteturais e operacionais","Melhoria do desempenho do sistema","Análise detalhada da estrutura do código","Validação de build em todos os componentes"],"ru":["Проверка целостности репозитория","Устранение архитектурных и операционных недостатков","Улучшение производительности системы","Подробный анализ структуры кода","Валидация сборки во всех компонентах"],"ar":["فحص صيانة مستودع","حل العيوب الهندسية والتشغيلية","تحسين أداء النظام","تحليل مفصل لهيكل الكود","تحقق من بناء جميع المكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码仓库扫描","mcp-repo-scan","系统性仓库完整性审计","架构和操作缺陷解决","系统性能优化","RE-Engine","MCP集成","代码库结构分析"],"ja":["コードリポジトリスキャン","mcp-repo-scan","体系的なリポジトリの完全性監査","アーキテクチャと操作の欠陥の解決","システムのパフォーマンス最適化","RE-Engine","MCP統合","コードベース構造分析"],"ko":["코드 저장소 스캔","mcp-repo-scan","체계적인 저장소 완전성 감사","아키텍처 및 운영의 결함 해결","시스템 성능 최적화","RE-Engine","MCP 통합","코드베이스 구조 분석"],"es":["análisis de repositorio","integridad de repositorio","mcp-repo-scan","desarrollo de software","auditoría de código","integración de MCP","mejora del rendimiento","validación de compilación"],"fr":["analyse de référentiel","intégrité de référentiel","mcp-repo-scan","développement de logiciels","audit de code","intégration de MCP","amélioration des performances","validation de compilation"],"de":["Repository-Analyse","Repository-Integrität","mcp-repo-scan","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Audit","MCP-Integration","Leistungsverbesserung","Kompilierungsvalidierung"],"pt":["auditoria de repositório","integridade do repositório","desempenho do sistema","análise de código","validação de build","mcp-repo-scan"],"ru":["проверка репозитория","целостность репозитория","производительность системы","анализ кода","валидация сборки","mcp-repo-scan"],"ar":["فحص مستودع","صيانة مستودع","أداء النظام","تحليل الكود","تحقق من البناء","mcp-repo-scan"]}},"owner":"stackconsult","repo":"RE-Engine","repoPath":"stackconsult/RE-Engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp-repo-scan","description":"Comprehensive RE-Engine repository health audit, issue resolution, and architectural enhancement through systematic codebase analysis","bodyPreview":"# Purpose\nPerform systematic repository integrity audit, resolve architectural/operational deficiencies, and enhance system performance through detailed analysis of RE-Engine''s codebase structure, workflow implementations, and MCP integration patterns.\n\n# Pre-Scan Validation Requirements\n- [ ] Repository synchronized with latest remote commit\n- [ ] Zero uncommitted changes in working directory\n- [ ] Full build validation across all components:\n  - `engine/`: `npm run build`\n  - `web-dashboard/`:","body":"# Purpose\nPerform systematic repository integrity audit, resolve architectural/operational deficiencies, and enhance system performance through detailed analysis of RE-Engine''s codebase structure, workflow implementations, and MCP integration patterns.\n\n# Pre-Scan Validation Requirements\n- [ ] Repository synchronized with latest remote commit\n- [ ] Zero uncommitted changes in working directory\n- [ ] Full build validation across all components:\n  - `engine/`: `npm run build`\n  - `web-dashboard/`: `npm run build`\n  - `playwright/`: `npm run build`\n  - `mcp/*/`: `npm run build` (all MCP servers)\n\n# Detailed Scan Execution Phases\n\n## Phase 1: Repository Structure & Code Quality Audit\n1. **Technology Stack Assessment**:\n   - TypeScript composition: 60.5% (type safety analysis)\n   - JavaScript composition: 25.2% (migration opportunities)\n   - Runtime requirements: Node.js v22+, React 18+, Playwright\n   - Data layer: PostgreSQL (primary), Redis (caching/queues)\n\n2. **Component Architecture Analysis**:\n   - `engine/`: Core backend API, business logic orchestration, message routing engine\n   - `web-dashboard/`: React-based approval interface, real-time monitoring dashboard\n   - `playwright/`: Browser automation framework for human-in-the-loop workflow execution\n   - `mcp/`: Model Context Protocol servers (reengine-core, reengine-browser, reengine-tinyfish)\n   - `scripts/`: Deployment automation, utility scripts, maintenance routines\n\n3. **Dependency & Entrypoint Validation**:\n   - Package.json dependency audit (security vulnerabilities, outdated packages)\n   - Entrypoint file analysis (index.ts, main.js, server.js)\n   - Circular dependency detection\n   - Unused import elimination\n\n## Phase 2: Flow Analysis & Issue Resolution\n4. **Outreach Workflow Mapping**:\n   - Lead ingestion → CSV normalization → data enrichment → approval queue population\n   - Approval workflow → multi-channel dispatch (WhatsApp API, Telegram Bot, SMTP, LinkedIn API, Facebook Graph)\n   - Automated scheduling infrastructure (daily draft generation @ 08:00 UTC, IMAP polling @ 15-min intervals)\n   - Response capture → sentiment analysis → CRM integration\n\n5. **End-to-End Flow Debugging**:\n   - Request parsing → controller routing → service layer → job queue → persistence layer → external API calls\n   - Data transformation validation (DTOs, mappers, serializers)\n   - Error propagation analysis and recovery mechanisms\n   - Transaction boundary identification and optimization\n\n## Phase 3: Performance Optimization\n6. **Development Workflow Enhancement**:\n   - Build optimization: `npm run build` (parallel compilation, tree-shaking)\n   - Testing strategies: `npm test` (unit), `npm run test:integration` (API), `npm run test:smoke` (E2E)\n   - Code quality: `npm run lint` (ESLint), `npm run format` (Prettier), `npm run typecheck` (TypeScript)\n   - Local development: `npm run dashboard` (UI), `npm run mcp:start` (servers)\n\n7. **Deployment Pipeline Optimization**:\n   - Staging deployment: `npm run deploy:staging` (manual) or GitHub Actions (develop branch auto)\n   - Production deployment: `npm run deploy:production` (manual) or GitHub Actions (release branch auto)\n   - CI/CD enhancements: security scanning → dependency analysis → build validation → automated deployment\n\n8. **Environment Configuration Management**:\n   - Required environment variables (`.env.example` validation)\n   - Database connection pooling (PostgreSQL max_connections, Redis cluster config)\n   - External service integration health checks (WhatsApp API status, email provider deliverability)\n\n## Phase 4: MCP Server Deep Dive\n9. **MCP Server Architecture Review**:\n   - `mcp-reengine-core/`: Business logic abstraction layer, tool orchestration\n   - `mcp-reengine-browser/`: Playwright integration, browser automation primitives\n   - `mcp-reengine-tinyfish/`: Specialized domain tools, custom workflow implementations\n\n10. **MCP Server Implementation Fixes**:\n    - Tool implementation validation (input sanitization, output formatting)\n    - JSON schema compliance for request/response structures\n    - Authentication token validation and refresh mechanisms\n    - Error handling standardization (retry policies, circuit breakers)\n\n11. **MCP Performance Validation**:\n    - Load testing: `npm run mcp:start` with concurrent request simulation\n    - Memory leak detection in long-running processes\n    - Tool execution timeout optimization\n    - Inter-server communication efficiency\n\n## Phase 5: Documentation Enhancement & Reporting\n12. **Documentation Updates**:\n    - `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`: Updated component interaction diagrams\n    - `docs/FLOWS.md`: Detailed workflow sequence diagrams\n    - `docs/OPERATIONS.md`: Enhanced development/deployment procedures\n    - `docs/MCP_SERVERS.md`: Comprehensive MCP server implementation guide\n\n13. **Comprehensive Audit Report Generation**:\n    - Issue inventory with severity classification\n    - Performance improvement metrics (before/after benchmarks)\n    - MCP server optimization results\n    - Documentation change log\n    - Strategic recommendations for continued optimization\n\n# Deliverables\nComplete audit and enhancement package including:\n- Automated fix application scripts\n- Interactive issue investigation interface\n- Continuous optimization monitoring framework"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:55:37.237Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring systematic repository integrity audits and performance enhancements through detailed analysis of codebase structures and workflow implementations.","zh":"适合需要系统存储库完整性审计和通过代码库结构和工作流实现详细分析进行性能增强的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が体系的なリポジトリの完全性の監査とコードベース構造およびワークフローの実装の詳細な分析を通じたパフォーマンスの強化を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"시스템 저장소의 무결성 감사 및 코드베이스 구조 및 워크플로 구현에 대한 상세한 분석을 통해 성능을 향상시킬 필요가 있는 코드 검토 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren auditorías de integridad de repositorio sistemáticas y mejoras de rendimiento a través de un análisis detallado de las estructuras de código y las implementaciones de flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des audits d''intégrité de référentiel systématiques et des améliorations de performances via une analyse détaillée des structures de codebase et des implémentations de flux de travail.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die systematische Repository-Integritätsaudits und Leistungsverbesserungen durch detaillierte Analyse von Codebase-Strukturen und Workflow-Implementierungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring systematic repository integrity audits and performance enhancements through detailed analysis of codebase structures and workflow implementations.","ru":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring systematic repository integrity audits and performance enhancements through detailed analysis of codebase structures and workflow implementations.","ar":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring systematic repository integrity audits and performance enhancements through detailed analysis of codebase structures and workflow implementations."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough repository scans, resolving architectural and operational deficiencies, and enhancing system performance through detailed analysis of RE-Engine''s codebase structure, workflow implementations, and MCP integration patterns, utilizing npm run build for full build validation.","zh":"赋予代理执行彻底的存储库扫描，解决架构和操作缺陷，并通过对RE-Engine的代码库结构、工作流实现以及MCP集成模式的详细分析来增强系统性能，使用npm run build进行完整的构建验证。","ja":"代理が包括的なリポジトリのスキャンを実行し、設計および運用上の欠陥を解決し、RE-Engineのコードベース構造、ワークフローの実装、およびMCP統合パターンの詳細な分析を通じてシステムのパフォーマンスを向上させ、npm run buildを使用して完全なビルドの検証を実行することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 저장소 스캔을 수행하여 아키텍처 및 운영 상의 결함을 해결하고 RE-Engine의 코드베이스 구조, 워크플로 구현 및 MCP 통합 패턴에 대한 상세한 분석을 통해 시스템 성능을 향상시키고 npm run build를 사용하여 전체 빌드 검증을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar análisis exhaustivos del repositorio, resolviendo deficiencias arquitectónicas y operativas, y mejorando el rendimiento del sistema a través de un análisis detallado de la estructura de código de RE-Engine, las implementaciones de flujo de trabajo y los patrones de integración de MCP, utilizando npm run build para la validación de compilación completa.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des analyses exhaustives du référentiel, résolvant les déficiences architecturales et opérationnelles, et améliorant les performances du système via une analyse détaillée de la structure de codebase de RE-Engine, des implémentations de flux de travail et des modèles d''intégration de MCP, en utilisant npm run build pour la validation de build complète.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Repository-Scans durchzuführen, architektonische und betriebliche Mängel zu beheben und die Systemleistung durch detaillierte Analyse der Codebase-Struktur von RE-Engine, der Workflow-Implementierungen und der MCP-Integrationsmuster zu verbessern, indem npm run build für die vollständige Build-Validierung verwendet wird.","pt":"Empowers agents to perform thorough repository scans, resolving architectural and operational deficiencies, and enhancing system performance through detailed analysis of RE-Engine''s codebase structure, workflow implementations, and MCP integration patterns, utilizing npm run build for full build validation.","ru":"Empowers agents to perform thorough repository scans, resolving architectural and operational deficiencies, and enhancing system performance through detailed analysis of RE-Engine''s codebase structure, workflow implementations, and MCP integration patterns, utilizing npm run build for full build validation.","ar":"Empowers agents to perform thorough repository scans, resolving architectural and operational deficiencies, and enhancing system performance through detailed analysis of RE-Engine''s codebase structure, workflow implementations, and MCP integration patterns, utilizing npm run build for full build validation."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating repository synchronization with latest remote commits","Identifying and resolving uncommitted changes in working directories","Performing full build validation across all components"],"zh":["验证存储库与最新远程提交的同步","识别和解决工作目录中的未提交更改","在所有组件上执行完整的构建验证"],"ja":["リポジトリと最新のリモートコミットとの同期を検証する","ワークディレクトリの未コミットの変更を特定して解決する","すべてのコンポーネントで完全なビルドの検証を実行する"],"ko":["저장소와 최신 원격 커밋との 동기화를 확인","작업 디렉토리에서 커밋되지 않은 변경 사항을 식별하고 해결","모든 구성 요소에 대해 전체 빌드 검증을 수행"],"es":["Validar la sincronización del repositorio con los últimos commits remotos","Identificar y resolver los cambios no confirmados en los directorios de trabajo","Realizar una validación de compilación completa en todos los componentes"],"fr":["Valider la synchronisation du référentiel avec les derniers commits distants","Identifier et résoudre les modifications non validées dans les répertoires de travail","Effectuer une validation de build complète sur tous les composants"],"de":["Überprüfen der Synchronisation des Repository mit den neuesten Remote-Commits","Identifizieren und Beheben nicht übermittelter Änderungen in den Arbeitsverzeichnissen","Durchführen einer vollständigen Build-Validierung über alle Komponenten"],"pt":["Validating repository synchronization with latest remote commits","Identifying and resolving uncommitted changes in working directories","Performing full build validation across all components"],"ru":["Validating repository synchronization with latest remote commits","Identifying and resolving uncommitted changes in working directories","Performing full build validation across all components"],"ar":["Validating repository synchronization with latest remote commits","Identifying and resolving uncommitted changes in working directories","Performing full build validation across all components"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires repository synchronization with latest remote commit","Zero uncommitted changes in working directory","Full build validation across all components using npm run build"],"zh":["需要存储库与最新远程提交的同步","工作目录中没有未提交的更改","使用npm run build在所有组件上执行完整的构建验证"],"ja":["リポジトリと最新のリモートコミットとの同期が必要","ワークディレクトリに未コミットの変更がない","npm run buildを使用してすべてのコンポーネントで完全なビルドの検証を実行"],"ko":["저장소와 최신 원격 커밋との 동기화가 필요","작업 디렉토리에서 커밋되지 않은 변경 사항이 없음","npm run build를 사용하여 모든 구성 요소에서 전체 빌드 검증을 수행"],"es":["Requiere la sincronización del repositorio con el último commit remoto","Ningún cambio no confirmado en el directorio de trabajo","Validación de compilación completa en todos los componentes utilizando npm run build"],"fr":["Nécessite la synchronisation du référentiel avec le dernier commit distant","Aucune modification non validée dans le répertoire de travail","Validation de build complète sur tous les composants en utilisant npm run build"],"de":["Erfordert die Synchronisation des Repository mit dem neuesten Remote-Commit","Keine nicht übermittelten Änderungen im Arbeitsverzeichnis","Vollständige Build-Validierung über alle Komponenten unter Verwendung von npm run build"],"pt":["Requires repository synchronization with latest remote commit","Zero uncommitted changes in working directory","Full build validation across all components using npm run build"],"ru":["Requires repository synchronization with latest remote commit","Zero uncommitted changes in working directory","Full build validation across all components using npm run build"],"ar":["Requires repository synchronization with latest remote commit","Zero uncommitted changes in working directory","Full build validation across all components using npm run build"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
