"ru":"Правила отладки широты используются для добавления журналов и миксинов отладки к моду Minecraft","ar":"تستخدم قواعد تصحيح خطأ خط العرض لإضافة سجلات وخلائط تصحيح إلى مود مايكروسوفت","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"definition":{"en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"features":{"zh":["添加日志","添加 HUD/操作栏调试覆盖层","添加计数器","添加临时断言/堆栈跟踪","添加性能分析切换"],"ja":["ログの追加","HUD/アクションバーのデバッグ オーバーレイの追加","カウンタの追加","一時的なアサーション/スタック トレースの追加","パフォーマンス分析のトグル追加"],"ko":["로그 추가","HUD/액션바 디버깅 오버레이 추가","카운터 추가","임시 어설션/스택 트레이스 추가","성능 분석 토글 추가"],"pt":["Adição de logs","Adição de mixins de depuração","Adição de contadores","Adição de ''sanity ping'' mixins","Adição de afirmações temporárias/traços de pilha","Adição de toggles de perfil"],"ru":["Добавление журналов","Добавление миксинов отладки","Добавление счётчиков","Добавление миксинов ''sanity ping''","Добавление временных утверждений/стек-трейсов","Добавление переключателей профилирования"],"ar":["إضافة سجلات","إضافة خلائط تصحيح","إضافة عدادات","إضافة خلائط ''sanity ping''","إضافة عبارات مؤقتة/مسارات طويلة","إضافة مفتاح تشغيل للمحاكمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft Fabric 模组","调试工具","latitude-debug-instrumentation-rules","快速调试","低噪音调试","安全调试"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabric モッド","デバッグ ツール","latitude-debug-instrumentation-rules","高速デバッグ","低ノイズ デバッグ","安全なデバッグ"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드","디버깅 도구","latitude-debug-instrumentation-rules","빠른 디버깅","저노이즈 디버깅","안전한 디버깅"],"pt":["mods de Minecraft","depuração de latitude","instrumentação de mods","logs de depuração","mixins de depuração","desenvolvimento de mods","Minecraft Fabric"],"ru":["моды Minecraft","отладка широты","инструментирование модов","журналы отладки","миксины отладки","разработка модов","Minecraft Fabric"],"ar":["مود مايكروسوفت","تصحيح خطأ خط العرض","أدوات مود","سجلات تصحيح","خلائط تصحيح","تطوير مود","مايكروسوفت فابريك"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"latitude","repoPath":"joolbits/latitude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"latitude-debug-instrumentation-rules","description":"Rules for adding debug logs, counters, overlays, and sanity pings in Latitude. Enforces gated, minimal, removable instrumentation and forbids permanent spam in hot paths.","bodyPreview":"# Latitude — Debug Instrumentation Rules (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill is used whenever the assistant proposes:\n- adding logs\n- adding HUD/actionbar debug overlays\n- adding counters\n- adding “sanity ping” mixins\n- adding temporary assertions/stack traces\n- adding profiling toggles\n\nGoal: make debugging **fast**, **low-noise**, and **safe to ship**.\n\n---\n\n## Non-negotiable rules\n1) **All instrumentation is gated** behind a toggle (system property or in-mod debug flag).\n2) Default for any debug togg","body":"# Latitude — Debug Instrumentation Rules (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill is used whenever the assistant proposes:\n- adding logs\n- adding HUD/actionbar debug overlays\n- adding counters\n- adding “sanity ping” mixins\n- adding temporary assertions/stack traces\n- adding profiling toggles\n\nGoal: make debugging **fast**, **low-noise**, and **safe to ship**.\n\n---\n\n## Non-negotiable rules\n1) **All instrumentation is gated** behind a toggle (system property or in-mod debug flag).\n2) Default for any debug toggle is **OFF**.\n3) Never spam in hot paths (per-block/per-vertex/per-tick) without throttling.\n4) Any debug change must be removable in one commit.\n5) Every debug print must answer exactly **one question**.\n\n## Debug flag naming standard (locked)\n\nAll debug instrumentation must follow this scheme:\n\n- **Prefix:** `-Dlatitude.` \n- **Format:** `debug<FeatureName>` (camelCase)\n- **Type:** boolean flags only (`true` enables)\n- **Default:** OFF when not provided\n\nExamples (canonical):\n- `-Dlatitude.debugSnowGuard` \n- `-Dlatitude.debugWarmSnowTrap` \n- `-Dlatitude.debugOpenSpawnPicker` \n- `-Dlatitude.debugLatPick` \n- `-Dlatitude.debugRenderEwWall` \n\nAny new debug flag must conform to this naming scheme.\n\n---\n\n## Approved gating mechanisms (choose one)\nPreferred: JVM system properties (dev-only)\n- `-Dlatitude.debugSnowGuard=true` \n- `-Dlatitude.debugWarmSnowTrap=true` \n- `-Dlatitude.debugLatPick=true` \n- `-Dlatitude.debugRenderEwWall=true` \n\nAlternative: in-mod config keybind / config file (only if it already exists)\n\n---\n\n## Logging rules\n### Throttle requirements\nIf a log is in a frequent path:\n- print at most **once per N events** (e.g., once per 60 ticks or once per 256 calls)\n- or “print only on first occurrence”\n- or “print only when a match happens” (e.g., only when a snow block is seen)\n\n### Content requirements\nLogs must include:\n- short tag in brackets: `[SNOWBLOCK_GUARD]`, `[FREEZE_GUARD]`, `[LAT_PICK]` \n- coords and/or chunk origin when relevant\n- band/zone result when it is a latitude-related bug\n\nNever log:\n- full objects with huge toString output\n- entire registry dumps\n- per-biome spam across many chunks unless explicitly requested\n\n---\n\n## Counter/overlay rules (preferred over spam logs)\nIf the question is “is the hook firing?”:\n- Use counters:\n  - calls / matches / rewrites\n- Show them via actionbar or HUD overlay\n- Gate behind `-Dlatitude.debugWarmSnowTrap=true` \n\nOverlay update cadence:\n- no more than once per 40 ticks (~2s) unless explicitly needed.\n\n---\n\n## Sanity ping rules\nA sanity ping is allowed only when:\n- a mixin is suspected not to apply\n- a crash happens during early init\n- environment mismatch is likely\n\nRules:\n- print once, then stay silent\n- must include the mixin name and target class\n- must be removed or gated before release\n\n---\n\n## Stack trace / crash-once (nuclear) rules\nAllowed only when:\n- write path is unknown and must be identified\n- symptom is rare and hard to reproduce\n\nRules:\n- trigger only on the first match\n- include an explicit comment: “REMOVE AFTER TRACE”\n- must be behind a system property OR removed immediately after capture\n\n---\n\n## “Release safety” checklist (must pass before tagging)\nBefore creating a release tag:\n- debug flags default OFF\n- no ungated WARN spam in worldgen/render loops\n- overlays disabled unless debug flag set\n- `.gitignore` prevents debug-only artifacts from creeping into commits\n\n---\n\n## Expected assistant output\nWhen proposing instrumentation, the assistant must output:\n1) The exact question the instrumentation answers\n2) The minimal hook point\n3) The toggle name\n4) The throttle strategy\n5) The exact file(s) to edit\n6) The removal plan (revert commit or flip flag)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:56:25.693Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Minecraft Fabric Mod Agents requiring deterministic latitude-based biome band debugging and instrumentation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要确定性纬度基于生物群落带调试和仪表功能的Minecraft Fabric Mod代理。","ja":"Minecraft Fabric Modエージェントが、決定論的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンドのデバッグと計装機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"确定적 위도 기반 바이옴 밴드 디버깅 및 계측 기능을 필요로 하는 Minecraft Fabric Mod 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de modificación de Minecraft Fabric que requieren capacidades de depuración e instrumentación de bandas de bioma basadas en latitud determinista.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de modification Minecraft Fabric nécessitant des capacités de débogage et d''instrumentation de bandes de biomes basées sur la latitude déterministe.","de":"Ideal für Minecraft Fabric Mod Agents, die deterministische Breiten-basierte Biome-Band-Debugging- und Instrumentierungs-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mods Minecraft Fabric que necessitam de capacidades determinísticas de depuração e instrumentação baseadas em bandas de biomas de latitude.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов модов Minecraft Fabric, требующих детерминированных возможностей отладки и инструментирования на основе широтных биомных полос.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تعديلات Minecraft Fabric التي تتطلب قدرات تصحيح أخطاء وتجهيز حتمية قائمة على نطاقات المناطق الأحيائية وفق خطوط العرض."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement fast, low-noise, and safe-to-ship debugging mechanisms using gated instrumentation behind system properties or in-mod debug flags, incorporating features like logs, HUD/actionbar debug overlays, counters, sanity ping mixins, and profiling toggles.","zh":"使代理能够使用系统属性或模组调试标志后面的有门控的计装实现快速、低噪声和安全的调试机制，集成了日志、HUD/操作条调试叠加层、计数器、理智PING混入和性能分析切换等功能。","ja":"システムプロパティまたはモッドのデバッグフラグの後ろにゲートされた計装を使用して、迅速で低ノイズで出荷に安全なデバッグメカニズムを実装できるようにエージェントをエンパワーメントします。ログ、HUD/アクションバーのデバッグオーバーレイ、カウンタ、サニティーピングミックスイン、プロファイリングトグルなどの機能を統合します。","ko":"시스템 속성 또는 모드 디버그 플래그 뒤에 게이트된 계측을 사용하여 빠르고 저노이즈이며 안전한 디버깅 메커니즘을 구현할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다. 로그, HUD/액션바 디버그 오버레이, 카운터, 산탄 피닝 믹스인 및 프로파일링 토글과 같은 기능을 통합합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar mecanismos de depuración rápidos, de bajo ruido y seguros para enviar utilizando instrumentación con puerta detrás de propiedades del sistema o indicadores de depuración en el mod, que incorporan características como registros, superposiciones de depuración de HUD/barra de acción, contadores, mezclas de ping de cordura y conmutadores de perfil.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des mécanismes de débogage rapides, à faible bruit et sûrs à expédier en utilisant une instrumentation avec porte derrière les propriétés du système ou les indicateurs de débogage dans le mod, qui intègrent des fonctionnalités comme les journaux, les superpositions de débogage HUD/barre d''action, les compteurs, les mélanges de ping de santé et les commutateurs de profil.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, schnelle, geräuscharme und sichere zum Versand geeignete Debugging-Mechanismen mithilfe einer Instrumentierung mit Schaltung hinter System-Eigenschaften oder Debug-Flags im Mod zu implementieren, die Funktionen wie Protokolle, HUD/Actionleisten-Debug-Überlagerungen, Zähler, Sinn-Ping-Mixins und Profiler-Umschalter umfassen.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a implementar mecanismos de depuração rápidos, de baixo ruído e seguros para envio, usando instrumentação controlada por propriedades do sistema ou flags de depuração internas ao mod, incorporando recursos como logs, sobreposições de depuração HUD/actionbar, contadores, mixins de ping de verificação de integridade e alternadores de profiling.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать быстрые, малошумящие и безопасные для поставки механизмы отладки с использованием управляемого инструментирования через системные свойства или флаги отладки внутри мода, включая такие функции, как логи, оверлеи отладки HUD/панели действий, счетчики, миксины проверки работоспособности (sanity ping) и переключатели профилирования.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ آليات تصحيح أخطاء سريعة ومنخفضة الضوضاء وآمنة للشحن باستخدام أدوات تجهيز خاضعة للبوابة خلف خصائص النظام أو علامات تصحيح داخلية، تتضمن ميزات مثل السجلات، وتراكبات تصحيح HUD/شريط الإجراءات، والعدادات، وخلطات ping التحقق من الصحة، ومفاتيح تبديل إعداد التقارير."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding logs and debug overlays for biome band analysis","Implementing counters and sanity ping mixins for deterministic debugging","Enabling profiling toggles for performance optimization in globe-style worlds"],"zh":["为生物群落带分析添加日志和调试叠加层","实现计数器和理智PING混入以进行确定性调试","在球面世界中启用性能分析切换以优化性能"],"ja":["バイオームバンド分析のためのログとデバッグオーバーレイを追加する","決定論的なデバッグのためのカウンタとサニティーピングミックスインを実装する","球面世界でのパフォーマンス最適化のためのプロファイリングトグルを有効にする"],"ko":["바이옴 밴드 분석을 위한 로그 및 디버그 오버레이 추가","결정적 디버깅을 위한 카운터 및 산탄 피닝 믹스인 구현","구형 세계에서의 성능 최적화를 위한 프로파일링 토글 활성화"],"es":["Agregar registros y superposiciones de depuración para el análisis de bandas de bioma","Implementar contadores y mezclas de ping de cordura para la depuración determinista","Habilitar conmutadores de perfil para la optimización del rendimiento en mundos de estilo globo"],"fr":["Ajouter des journaux et des superpositions de débogage pour l''analyse des bandes de biomes","Mettre en œuvre des compteurs et des mélanges de ping de santé pour le débogage déterministe","Activer les commutateurs de profil pour l''optimisation des performances dans les mondes de style globe"],"de":["Hinzufügen von Protokollen und Debug-Überlagerungen für die Biome-Band-Analyse","Implementieren von Zählern und Sinn-Ping-Mixins für deterministisches Debugging","Aktivieren von Profiler-Umschaltern für die Leistungsoptimierung in Globus-Style-Welten"],"pt":["Adicionar logs e sobreposições de depuração para análise de bandas de biomas","Implementar contadores e mixins de ping de verificação de integridade para depuração determinística","Habilitar alternadores de profiling para otimização de desempenho em mundos de estilo globo"],"ru":["Добавление логов и оверлеев отладки для анализа биомных полос","Реализация счетчиков и миксинов проверки работоспособности (sanity ping) для детерминированной отладки","Включение переключателей профилирования для оптимизации производительности в мире глобального стиля"],"ar":["إضافة سجلات وتراكبات تصحيح أخطاء لتحليل نطاقات المناطق الأحيائية","تنفيذ عدادات وخلطات ping التحقق من الصحة من أجل تصحيح أخطاء حتمي","تمكين مفاتيح تبديل إعداد التقارير لتحسين الأداء في العوالم ذات النمط الكروي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Minecraft Fabric mod environment","Instrumentation must be gated behind a toggle","Default debug toggles are disabled"],"zh":["需要Minecraft Fabric模组环境","计装必须在切换后面","默认调试切换是禁用的"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabricモッド環境が必要","計装はトグル後ろにゲートする必要がある","デフォルトのデバッグトグルは無効"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드 환경이 필요합니다.","계측은 토글 뒤에 게이트해야 합니다.","기본 디버그 토글은 비활성화됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno de modificación de Minecraft Fabric","La instrumentación debe estar limitada detrás de un conmutador","Los conmutadores de depuración predeterminados están deshabilitados"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de modification Minecraft Fabric","L''instrumentation doit être limitée derrière un commutateur","Les commutateurs de débogage par défaut sont désactivés"],"de":["Benötigt Minecraft Fabric Mod-Umgebung","Die Instrumentierung muss hinter einem Umschalter begrenzt werden","Die Standard-Debug-Umschalter sind deaktiviert"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de mod Minecraft Fabric","A instrumentação deve ser controlada por um alternador","Os alternadores de depuração padrão estão desativados"],"ru":["Требует окружения мода Minecraft Fabric","Инструментирование должно управляться переключателем","Переключатели отладки по умолчанию отключены"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تعديل Minecraft Fabric","يجب أن تكون أدوات التجهيز خاضعة للبوابة خلف مفتاح تبديل","مفاتيح تبديل تصحيح الأخطاء الافتراضية معطلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('joolbits/slabbed/slabbed-slab-support-helper-contract', 'community', 'joolbits', 'slabbed', 'joolbits/slabbed', 'slabbed-slab-support-helper-contract', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z', '2026-02-18T11:56:17.870Z', NULL, '{"id":"joolbits/slabbed/slabbed-slab-support-helper-contract","name":"slabbed-slab-support-helper-contract","description":{"zh":"Slabbed Slab 支持助手合约为块状态提供了单一的辅助 API，用于确定顶面地面支持","ja":"Slabbed Slab サポートヘルパーコントラクトは、ブロック状態のトップフェイスの地面サポートを決定するための単一のヘルパー API を提供します","ko":"Slabbed Slab 지원 도우미 계약은 블록 상태에 대한 단일의 헬퍼 API를 제공하여 상단 면의 바닥 지원을 결정합니다","es":"El contrato de ayuda para soporte de losas define una API estable para determinar el soporte en la cara superior de un bloque","fr":"Le contrat d''aide pour le support de dalle définit une API stable pour déterminer le support sur la face supérieure d''un bloc","de":"Der Hilfsvertrag für Plattform-Unterstützung definiert eine stabile API, um die Unterstützung auf der Oberseite eines Blocks zu bestimmen","pt":"O contrato de suporte de laje é uma API de ajuda para determinar o suporte de terreno para a face superior de blocos, incluindo lajes.","ru":"Контракт поддержки плитки - это помощник API для определения поддержки земли для верхней грани блоков, включая плитки.","ar":"عقد دعم اللوح هو واجهة برمجة تطبيقات مساعدة لتحديد دعم الأرض للوجه العلوي من الكتل، بما في ذلك الألواح.","en":"Put things on slabs!"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Slabbed Slab 支持助手合约 - 块状态辅助 API","ja":"Slabbed Slab サポートヘルパーコントラクト - ブロック状態ヘルパー API","ko":"Slabbed Slab 지원 도우미 계약 - 블록 상태 헬퍼 API","es":"Soporte de losas: Contrato de ayuda para desarrolladores","fr":"Support de dalle: Contrat d''aide pour les développeurs","de":"Plattform-Unterstützung: Hilfsvertrag für Entwickler","pt":"Suporte de Laje: Contrato de Ajuda para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Поддержка плитки: контракт помошника для разработчиков","ar":"دعم اللوح: عقد مساعدة للمطورين","en":"slabbed-slab-support-helper-contract"},"description":{"zh":"Slabbed Slab 支持助手合约为块状态提供了单一的辅助 API，用于确定顶面地面支持","ja":"Slabbed Slab サポートヘルパーコントラクトは、ブロック状態のトップフェイスの地面サポートを決定するための単一のヘルパー API を提供します","ko":"Slabbed Slab 지원 도우미 계약은 블록 상태에 대한 단일의 헬퍼 API를 제공하여 상단 면의 바닥 지원을 결정합니다","es":"El contrato de ayuda para soporte de losas define una API estable para determinar el soporte en la cara superior de un bloque","fr":"Le contrat d''aide pour le support de dalle définit une API stable pour déterminer le support sur la face supérieure d''un bloc","de":"Der Hilfsvertrag für Plattform-Unterstützung definiert eine stabile API, um die Unterstützung auf der Oberseite eines Blocks zu bestimmen","pt":"O contrato de suporte de laje é uma API de ajuda para determinar o suporte de terreno para a face superior de blocos, incluindo lajes.","ru":"Контракт поддержки плитки - это помощник API для определения поддержки земли для верхней грани блоков, включая плитки.","ar":"عقد دعم اللوح هو واجهة برمجة تطبيقات مساعدة لتحديد دعم الأرض للوجه العلوي من الكتل، بما في ذلك الألواح.","en":"Put things on slabs!"},"definition":{"en":"Put things on slabs!"},"features":{"zh":["单一的辅助 API","块状态支持","顶面地面支持","无需重复的斜板逻辑","硬编码规则"],"ja":["単一のヘルパー API","ブロック状態サポート","トップフェイスの地面サポート","重複するスラブのロジックは必要ない","ハードコードされたルール"],"ko":["단일의 헬퍼 API","블록 상태 지원","상단 면 바닥 지원","重複하는 슬라브 로직이 필요하지 않음","하드코딩된 규칙"],"es":["API estable para determinar el soporte en la cara superior","No requiere configuración","No permite hacks por bloque dentro de las mezclas","No realiza una revisión general de la física más allá del soporte en la cara superior","Requiere que todas las mezclas llamen a esta API de ayuda"],"fr":["API stable pour déterminer le support sur la face supérieure","Nécessite aucune configuration","N''autorise pas les hacks par bloc à l''intérieur des mélanges","N''effectue pas de révision générale de la physique au-delà du support sur la face supérieure","Exige que toutes les mélanges appellent cette API d''aide"],"de":["Stabile API zur Bestimmung der Unterstützung auf der Oberseite","Benötigt keine Konfiguration","Erlaubt keine Block-Hacks innerhalb der Mischungen","Führt keine umfassende Überprüfung der Physik durch, die über die Unterstützung auf der Oberseite hinausgeht","Erfordert, dass alle Mischungen diese Hilfs-API aufrufen"],"pt":["Definição de suporte de terreno para a face superior de blocos","Inclusão de lajes no cálculo de suporte","API de ajuda para determinar o suporte de terreno","Eliminação de lógica duplicada nos mixins","Regras hard-coded para suporte de terreno"],"ru":["Определение поддержки земли для верхней грани блоков","Включение плиток в расчет поддержки","Помощник API для определения поддержки земли","Удаление дублирующей логики в миксинах","Жестко запрограммированные правила для поддержки земли"],"ar":["تحديد دعم الأرض للوجه العلوي من الكتل","إدراج الألواح في حساب دعم الأرض","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات مساعدة لتحديد دعم الأرض","إزالة المنطق المكرر في الخلطات","قواعد محددة لبرمجة دعم الأرض"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Slabbed Slab","块状态","辅助 API","顶面地面支持","硬编码规则","单一的稳定辅助 API"],"ja":["Slabbed Slab","ブロック状態","ヘルパー API","トップフェイスの地面サポート","ハードコードされたルール","単一の安定したヘルパー API"],"ko":["Slabbed Slab","블록 상태","헬퍼 API","상단 면 바닥 지원","하드코딩된 규칙","단일의 안정적인 헬퍼 API"],"es":["soporte de losas","contrato de ayuda","desarrollo de juegos","API de ayuda","física de bloques","mezclas de bloques","soporte en la cara superior","desarrollo de videojuegos","programación de juegos"],"fr":["support de dalle","contrat d''aide","développement de jeux","API d''aide","physique de blocs","mélanges de blocs","support sur la face supérieure","développement de jeux vidéo","programmation de jeux"],"de":["Plattform-Unterstützung","Hilfsvertrag","Spielentwicklung","Hilfs-API","Blockphysik","Blockmischungen","Unterstützung auf der Oberseite","Videospielentwicklung","Spielprogrammierung"],"pt":["suporte de laje","contrato de ajuda","desenvolvimento de blocos","face superior de blocos","lógica de suporte de terreno","API de ajuda"],"ru":["поддержка плитки","контракт помошника","разработка блоков","верхняя грань блоков","логика поддержки земли","помощник API"],"ar":["دعم اللوح","عقد مساعدة","تطوير الكتل","الوجه العلوي من الكتل","منطق دعم الأرض","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات مساعدة"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"slabbed","repoPath":"joolbits/slabbed","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slabbed-slab-support-helper-contract","description":"Define the single shared helper API all slab-support mixins must use.","bodyPreview":"# Slabbed — Slab Support Helper Contract (Single Source of Truth)\n\n## Goal\nDefine a single, stable helper API for determining whether a block state at a position\nshould count as “ground support” for the **top face**, including slabs.\n\nAll mixins must call this helper; no duplicated slab logic inside mixins.\n\n## Non-goals\n- No per-block hacks inside mixins\n- No broad physics overhaul beyond “support on top face”\n- No config (hard-coded rules)\n\n## Core rule\nTreat the **top face** of:\n- bottom slab","body":"# Slabbed — Slab Support Helper Contract (Single Source of Truth)\n\n## Goal\nDefine a single, stable helper API for determining whether a block state at a position\nshould count as “ground support” for the **top face**, including slabs.\n\nAll mixins must call this helper; no duplicated slab logic inside mixins.\n\n## Non-goals\n- No per-block hacks inside mixins\n- No broad physics overhaul beyond “support on top face”\n- No config (hard-coded rules)\n\n## Core rule\nTreat the **top face** of:\n- bottom slabs (top surface at y+0.5)\n- top slabs (top surface at y+1.0)\n- double slabs (y+1.0)\nas valid “ground support” where vanilla expects solid top support.\n\nStrict visuals expected: placements must align to the slab top surface when possible.\n\n\n## Required helper location\nCreate helper class (when implementing):\n- `src/main/java/com/slabbed/init/SlabSupport.java` \n\nNo other class may implement slab-support rules.\n\n\n## Required public API\nWhen implementing, expose only these methods (no extras unless required):\n\n- `static boolean isSupportedOnTop(WorldView world, BlockPos pos, BlockState belowState)` \n  - Meaning: “does the block at pos.down() support something resting on its TOP face?”\n\n- `static double topSurfaceYOffset(BlockState belowState)` \n  - Returns: surface height in block-space:\n    - full block / double slab / top slab => `1.0` \n    - bottom slab => `0.5` \n    - unsupported => `Double.NaN` \n\n- `static boolean isSlabLike(BlockState state)` \n  - True for `SlabBlock` and any other block types we explicitly add later\n\n\n## Behavior rules (must match vanilla expectations)\n`isSupportedOnTop(...)` should return true if:\n1) Vanilla already considers it valid top support (full blocks, etc.), OR\n2) The below block is a slab (or slab-like) whose **top surface** exists and is solid enough\n   for the category being tested.\n\nDo NOT automatically treat:\n- stairs\n- fences\n- walls\n- trapdoors\n- glass panes\nas support unless a later skill adds them explicitly.\n\nThis mod is “Slabbed”, not “All partial blocks”.\n\n\n## Category flags (for later expansion)\nIf needed later, helper may accept a “support category” enum, but for now:\n- implement the generic “top support” notion first\n- per-block strictness comes later via additional wrapper methods if unavoidable\n\n\n## Mandatory instrumentation (debug flags)\nWhen implementing, add optional debug logging controlled by:\n- `-Dslabbed.debugSupport=true` \n\nLogs must be:\n- one-line\n- prefix `[SLABBED_SUPPORT]` \n- include: pos, belowState, computed yOffset, result\n\nNo logs by default.\n\n\n## Pass criteria\n- All mixins reference `SlabSupport` instead of duplicating slab checks\n- The helper clearly distinguishes bottom vs top slabs\n- The helper does not overreach into other partial blocks\n\n\n## Stop conditions\nIf more than 2 mixins need slightly different “support” semantics:\n- do NOT fork logic inside mixins\n- extend helper API in a single place and update all call sites\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:56:17.870Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Minecraft-themed AI Agents needing advanced block state analysis capabilities, particularly those utilizing helper APIs for ground support detection.","zh":"适合需要高级方块状态分析能力的Minecraft主题AI代理，特别是那些使用辅助API进行地面支持检测的代理。","ja":"MinecraftテーマのAIエージェントが高度なブロック状態分析機能を必要とする場合、特に地面サポート検出のためのヘルパーAPIを使用する場合に適しています。","ko":"마인크래프트 테마의 AI 에이전트가 고급 블록 상태 분석 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합하며, 특히 지면 지원 감지를 위한 헬퍼 API를 사용하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA con tema de Minecraft que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis de estado de bloques, particularmente aquellos que utilizan API de ayuda para la detección de soporte de suelo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA à thème Minecraft ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse d''état de bloc avancées, en particulier ceux qui utilisent des API d''assistance pour la détection de support de sol.","de":"Perfekt für Minecraft-Themen-AI-Agents, die erweiterte Blockzustandsanalysefunktionen benötigen, insbesondere solche, die Helper-APIs für die Erkennung von Bodenunterstützung verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA com tema Minecraft que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise de estado de blocos, particularmente aqueles que utilizam APIs de helper para detecção de suporte ao solo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ с темой Minecraft, которым требуются продвинутые возможности анализа состояния блоков, особенно тех, которые используют помощник API для обнаружения поддержки земли.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكية ذات الشكل المبني على ماين كرافت التي تحتاج إلى قابليات متقدمة لتحليل حالة الكتل، خاصة تلك التي تستخدم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات مساعدة للكشف عن دعم الأرض."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to determine ground support for block states with precision, utilizing a single, stable helper API that treats the top face of bottom slabs as a core rule, ensuring consistency and avoiding per-block hacks or broad physics overhauls, all while adhering to hard-coded rules.","zh":"赋予代理以精确地确定地面支持的方块状态的能力，利用单一的、稳定的辅助API对底部板的顶面进行处理，确保一致性并避免对每个方块的黑客攻击或广泛的物理重构，同时遵循硬编码的规则。","ja":"エージェントに、地面サポートのブロック状態を精密に決定する能力を付与します。一つの安定したヘルパーAPIを使用して、底部スラブのトップ面をコアルールとして扱い、一定性を保ち、ブロックごとのハックや広範な物理オーバーホールを避け、ハードコードされたルールに従います。","ko":"에이전트가 지면 지원의 블록 상태를 정밀하게 결정할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 하나의 안정된 헬퍼 API를 사용하여 하부 슬라브의 상면을 핵심 규칙으로 처리하여 일관성을 유지하고 블록별 해킹이나 광범위한 물리 오버홀을 피하며 하드코딩된 규칙을 따릅니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes determinar el soporte de suelo para los estados de los bloques con precisión, utilizando una sola API de ayuda estable que trata la cara superior de las losas inferiores como una regla básica, garantizando la coherencia y evitando hacks por bloque o revisiones generales de física, todo mientras se adhiere a reglas codificadas en duro.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déterminer le support de sol pour les états de bloc avec précision, en utilisant une seule API d''assistance stable qui traite la face supérieure des dalles inférieures comme une règle de base, garantissant la cohérence et évitant les hacks par bloc ou les révisions générales de physique, tout en respectant les règles codées en dur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Bodenunterstützung für Blockzustände mit Präzision zu bestimmen, indem sie eine einzige, stabile Helper-API verwenden, die die Oberfläche von unteren Platten als grundlegende Regel behandelt, um Konsistenz sicherzustellen und Block-hacks oder umfassende Physik-Überholungen zu vermeiden, während sie sich an hartcodierte Regeln hält.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a determinar o suporte ao solo para estados de blocos com precisão, utilizando uma única e estável API de helper que trata a face superior das placas inferiores como uma regra fundamental, garantindo consistência e evitando hacks por bloco ou alterações gerais de física, tudo enquanto adere a regras codificadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять поддержку земли для состояний блоков с точностью, используя один стабильный помощник API, который рассматривает верхнюю грань нижних слабов как основное правило, обеспечивая последовательность и избегая хаков для каждого блока или общих изменений физики, все это при соблюдении зафиксированных правил.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد دعم الأرض لحالات الكتل بدقة، باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات مساعدة واحدة ومستقرة تعامل مع الوجه العلوي للصفيحات السفلية كقاعدة أساسية، مما يضمن الاتساق وتجنب الاختراقات الخاصة بالكتل أو التعديلات الشاملة للفيزياء، كل ذلك مع اتباع القواعد المحددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing block states for ground support in Minecraft-themed environments","Determining top face support for bottom slabs in various block configurations","Streamlining mixin logic by eliminating duplicated slab logic"],"zh":["分析Minecraft主题环境中的方块状态以检测地面支持","确定各种方块配置中底部板的顶面支持","通过消除重复的板逻辑来简化mixin逻辑"],"ja":["Minecraftテーマの環境における地面サポートのためのブロック状態の分析","さまざまなブロック構成における底部スラブのトップ面サポートの決定","重複したスラブロジックを除去してミックスインロジックを簡素化する"],"ko":["마인크래프트 테마 환경에서 지면 지원을检测하기 위한 블록 상태 분석","다양한 블록 구성에서 하부 슬라브의 상면 지원 결정","중복된 슬라브 로직을 제거하여 믹스인 로직을 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Analizar estados de bloques para la detección de soporte de suelo en entornos con tema de Minecraft","Determinar el soporte de la cara superior para las losas inferiores en varias configuraciones de bloques","Optimizar la lógica de mixin eliminando la lógica de losas duplicada"],"fr":["Analyser les états de bloc pour la détection de support de sol dans les environnements à thème Minecraft","Déterminer le support de la face supérieure pour les dalles inférieures dans différentes configurations de blocs","Optimiser la logique de mixin en éliminant la logique de dalle dupliquée"],"de":["Analysieren von Blockzuständen für die Erkennung von Bodenunterstützung in Minecraft-Themen-Umgebungen","Bestimmen der Oberflächenunterstützung für untere Platten in verschiedenen Blockkonfigurationen","Optimieren der Mixin-Logik durch Eliminierung der duplizierten Plattenlogik"],"pt":["Analisar estados de blocos para suporte ao solo em ambientes com tema Minecraft","Determinar suporte para a face superior de placas inferiores em várias configurações de blocos","Otimizar a lógica de mixin eliminando a lógica duplicada de placas"],"ru":["Анализировать состояния блоков для поддержки земли в средах с темой Minecraft","Определять поддержку для верхней грани нижних слабов в различных конфигурациях блоков","Оптимизировать логику миксина, исключая дублированную логику слабов"],"ar":["تحليل حالات الكتل لدعم الأرض في البيئات المبنية على ماين كرافت","تحديد الدعم للوجه العلوي للصفيحات السفلية في تكوينات كتل مختلفة","تحسين منطق ميكسين من خلال إliminación المنطق المكرر للصفيحات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Applies only to the top face of blocks","No support for per-block hacks or config files","Limited to ground support detection, excluding broad physics overhauls"],"zh":["仅适用于方块的顶面","不支持每个方块的黑客攻击或配置文件","仅限于地面支持检测，不包括广泛的物理重构"],"ja":["ブロックのトップ面のみに適用","ブロックごとのハックや設定ファイルをサポートしない","地面サポート検出のみに限定され、広範な物理オーバーホールは含まない"],"ko":["블록의 상면만에 적용","블록별 해킹이나 설정 파일을 지원하지 않음","지면 지원 감지만으로 제한되어 있으며, 광범위한 물리 오버홀은 포함하지 않음"],"es":["Se aplica solo a la cara superior de los bloques","No admite hacks por bloque ni archivos de configuración","Limitado a la detección de soporte de suelo, excluyendo revisiones generales de física"],"fr":["S''applique uniquement à la face supérieure des blocs","N''admet pas les hacks par bloc ni les fichiers de configuration","Limité à la détection de support de sol, excluant les révisions générales de physique"],"de":["Wird nur auf die Oberfläche der Blöcke angewendet","Unterstützt keine Block-Hacks oder Konfigurationsdateien","Begrenzt auf die Erkennung von Bodenunterstützung, unter Ausschluss von umfassenden Physik-Überholungen"],"pt":["Aplica-se apenas à face superior dos blocos","Não suporta hacks por bloco ou arquivos de configuração","Limitado à detecção de suporte ao solo, excluindo alterações gerais de física"],"ru":["Применяется только к верхней грани блоков","Не поддерживает хаки для каждого блока или файлы конфигурации","Ограничен обнаружением поддержки земли, исключая общие изменения физики"],"ar":["تطبق فقط على الوجه العلوي للكتل","لا يدعم الاختراقات الخاصة بالكتل أو ملفات التكوين","محدود بالكشف عن دعم الأرض، باستثناء التعديلات الشاملة للفيزياء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('joolbits/latitude/latitude-rendering-compat-rules', 'community', 'joolbits', 'latitude', 'joolbits/latitude', 'latitude-rendering-compat-rules', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z', '2026-02-18T11:56:17.553Z', NULL, '{"id":"joolbits/latitude/latitude-rendering-compat-rules","name":"latitude-rendering-compat-rules","description":{"zh":"Minecraft Fabric模组，用于实现确定性的纬度基于生物群落带，适用于球形世界","ja":"Minecraft Fabricモッド、球形世界用の決定的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンドを実現","ko":"Minecraft Fabric 모드, 구형 세계를 위한 결정적인 위도 기반 바이오ーム帶을 구현","es":"Reglas de compatibilidad de renderizado de latitud para Minecraft Fabric mod, para evitar regressiones con shaders","fr":"Règles de compatibilité de rendu de latitude pour le mod Minecraft Fabric, pour éviter les régressions avec des shaders","de":"Kompatibilitätsregeln für Latituden-Rendering im Minecraft Fabric-Mod, um Renderegressionen mit Shadern zu vermeiden","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Minecraft Fabric мод - 纬度渲染兼容规则","ja":"Minecraft Fabricモッド - 緯度レンダリング互換性ルール","ko":"Minecraft Fabric 모드 - 위도 렌더링 호환 규칙","es":"Reglas de compatibilidad de renderizado de latitud para M...","fr":"Règles de compatibilité de rendu de latitude pour Minecraft","de":"Kompatibilitätsregeln für Latituden-Rendering in Minecraft","en":"latitude-rendering-compat-rules"},"description":{"zh":"Minecraft Fabric模组，用于实现确定性的纬度基于生物群落带，适用于球形世界","ja":"Minecraft Fabricモッド、球形世界用の決定的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンドを実現","ko":"Minecraft Fabric 모드, 구형 세계를 위한 결정적인 위도 기반 바이오ーム帶을 구현","es":"Reglas de compatibilidad de renderizado de latitud para Minecraft Fabric mod, para evitar regressiones con shaders","fr":"Règles de compatibilité de rendu de latitude pour le mod Minecraft Fabric, pour éviter les régressions avec des shaders","de":"Kompatibilitätsregeln für Latituden-Rendering im Minecraft Fabric-Mod, um Renderegressionen mit Shadern zu vermeiden","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"definition":{"en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"features":{"zh":["确定性的纬度基于生物群落带","现代顶点发射","渲染兼容规则","避免与shader相关的回归","支持球形世界","兼容Sodium和Iris"],"ja":["決定的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンド","现代的な頂点発射","レンダリング互換性ルール","Shader関連の回帰を避ける","球形世界をサポート","SodiumとIrisと互換性"],"ko":["결정적인 위도 기반 바이오ーム带","현대적인 정점 발신","렌더링 호환 규칙","쉐이더 관련 회귀 피하기","구형 세계 지원","소디움과 아이리스와 호환"],"es":["Evita regressiones en el renderizado con shaders","Compatibilidad con Sodium y Iris","Renderizado de muros de tormenta E/O","Capas de niebla personalizadas","Geometría de depuración de espacio mundial"],"fr":["Évitez les régressions de rendu avec des shaders","Compatibilité avec Sodium et Iris","Rendu de murs de tempête E/O","Couches de brouillard personnalisées","Géométrie de débogage de l''espace mondial"],"de":["Vermeiden Sie Renderegressionen mit Shadern","Kompatibilität mit Sodium und Iris","Rendern von Sturmwnden E/O","Benutzerdefinierte Nebellayer","Welt-Raum-Debug-Geometrie"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft Fabric模组","纬度渲染兼容规则","球形世界","确定性的纬度基于生物群落带","现代顶点发射","渲染兼容规则","shader","Sodium","Iris"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabricモッド","緯度レンダリング互換性ルール","球形世界","決定的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンド","现代的な頂点発射","レンダリング互換性ルール","Shader","Sodium","Iris"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드","위도 렌더링 호환 규칙","구형 세계","결정적인 위도 기반 바이오ーム带","현대적인 정점 발신","렌더링 호환 규칙","쉐이더","소디움","아이리스"],"es":["Minecraft","renderizado de latitud","compatibilidad de shaders","Sodium","Iris","mod de fabricación"],"fr":["Minecraft","rendu de latitude","compatibilité de shaders","Sodium","Iris","mod de fabrication"],"de":["Minecraft","Latituden-Rendering","Shadern-Kompatibilität","Sodium","Iris","Fabric-Mod"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"latitude","repoPath":"joolbits/latitude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"latitude-rendering-compat-rules","description":"Rendering rules for Sodium/Iris compatibility in Latitude (E/W storm walls, fog, overlays). Forbids raw GL state, mandates entry-based vertex emission, approved RenderLayers, and shader-safe debugging patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Latitude — Rendering Compatibility Rules (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill applies to:\n- E/W storm wall rendering\n- custom fog overlays\n- any world-space debug geometry\n- any rendering that must work with Sodium + Iris\n\nGoal: avoid “works vanilla, breaks with shaders” regressions.\n\n---\n\n## Non-negotiable rules\n1) No direct GL state calls in mod render code:\n- No `RenderSystem.*` state toggles\n- No `GL11.*` \n- No manual blend/depth toggles\n\n2) Always use modern vertex emission:\n- `VertexConsumer` wit","body":"# Latitude — Rendering Compatibility Rules (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill applies to:\n- E/W storm wall rendering\n- custom fog overlays\n- any world-space debug geometry\n- any rendering that must work with Sodium + Iris\n\nGoal: avoid “works vanilla, breaks with shaders” regressions.\n\n---\n\n## Non-negotiable rules\n1) No direct GL state calls in mod render code:\n- No `RenderSystem.*` state toggles\n- No `GL11.*` \n- No manual blend/depth toggles\n\n2) Always use modern vertex emission:\n- `VertexConsumer` with `MatrixStack.Entry` \n- prefer built-in `RenderLayer`s / `RenderLayers` helpers\n- never rely on “implicit” GL state being correct\n\n3) Rendering must be safe under:\n- Fabric renderer\n- Sodium renderer\n- Iris shader pipeline\n\n---\n\n## Approved rendering approaches\n### A) World-space geometry (storm wall)\n- Subscribe via the proper world render callback (not HUD)\n- Use `WorldRenderContext` matrices/consumers\n- Emit vertices using `vertex(entry, x,y,z).color(...).texture(...).light(...).normal(...);` \n- Keep geometry stable and avoid Z-fighting (slight inset if needed)\n\n### B) Debug lines/quads\n- Provide a compile-time or JVM-toggle to swap geometry:\n  - line-only layer for shader visibility testing\n  - quad layer for final\n\nAll debug visuals must be behind a toggle and off by default.\n\n---\n\n## Debug toggles (recommended)\n- `-Dlatitude.debugRenderEwWall=true` \n- `-Dlatitude.debugEwWallLines=true` (lines vs quads)\n- `-Dlatitude.debugFog=true` \n\nDefault OFF.\n\n---\n\n## Performance / safety constraints\n- Avoid per-frame allocations in hot render paths.\n- Avoid extremely dense geometry; scale step size with distance if needed.\n- Never spam actionbar logs; use one-shot logs or counters.\n\n---\n\n## Required assistant procedure for render bugs\nWhen a render bug is reported (“not visible with shaders”, “flicker”, etc.), the assistant must:\n1) Identify the current RenderLayer and emission style\n2) Switch to a minimal debug layer (lines) behind a toggle\n3) Confirm callback is firing (single-shot ping)\n4) Reduce z-fighting (slight inset, depth tweaks via layer choice only)\n5) Only then adjust final geometry/layer\n\n---\n\n## Forbidden behaviors\n- “Just disable shaders” as a solution\n- Adding render fixes by toggling GL state directly\n- Shipping with debug render toggles enabled by default\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:56:17.553Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Minecraft Modding Agents requiring deterministic latitude-based biome rendering for globe-style worlds.","zh":"适用于需要确定性纬度基于生物群落渲染的Minecraft模组代理，适用于球面世界。","ja":"Minecraft Moddingエージェントに最適で、球面世界のための決定的な緯度ベースのバイオームレンダリングを必要とする。","ko":"Minecraft 모딩 에이전트에 적합하며, 구형 세계를 위한 결정적 위도 기반 생물 군계 렌더링이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de modificación de Minecraft que requieren una representación de biomas basada en latitud determinista para mundos de estilo globo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de modification de Minecraft nécessitant un rendu de biomes basé sur la latitude déterministe pour les mondes de style globe.","de":"Ideal für Minecraft-Modding-Agents, die eine deterministische, latitudenbasierte Biome-Darstellung für globusartige Welten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de modding do Minecraft que exigem renderização de bioma baseada em latitude determinística para mundos no estilo globo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов моддинга Minecraft, требующих детерминированной отображения биомов на основе широты для глобусоподобных миров.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تعديل إيجينتس ماين كرافت التي تتطلب عرضًا محددًا للمناطق القطبية على أساس خط العرض للعالم على شكل كرة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create seamless E/W storm wall rendering, custom fog overlays, and world-space debug geometry using Sodium + Iris, while avoiding ''works vanilla, breaks with shaders'' regressions through modern vertex emission with VertexConsumer.","zh":"赋予代理创建无缝的东/西风暴墙渲染、自定义雾覆盖层和世界空间调试几何体，使用Sodium + Iris，同时避免使用现代顶点发射和VertexConsumer的''works vanilla, breaks with shaders''回归。","ja":"Sodium + Irisを使用して、東/西の嵐の壁のレンダリング、カスタムのフォグオーバーレイ、ワールドスペースのデバッグ幾何をシームレスに作成できるエージェントをEmpowerし、モダンな頂点エミッションとVertexConsumerを使用して、''works vanilla, breaks with shaders''の回帰を避けます。","ko":"Sodium + Iris를 사용하여 에이전트가 無縫な 동/서 폭풍 벽 렌더링, 사용자 정의雾 오버레이 및 세계 공간 디버깅 기하학을 생성하도록 하며, 현대적 정점 배출 및 VertexConsumer를 사용하여 ''works vanilla, breaks with shaders'' 회귀를 피합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear un renderizado de paredes de tormentas E/O sin problemas, superposiciones de niebla personalizadas y geometría de depuración de espacio de mundo utilizando Sodium + Iris, mientras evita las regresiones ''funciona vanilla, se rompe con shaders'' mediante la emisión de vértices moderna con VertexConsumer.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un rendu de mur de tempête E/O sans problème, des superpositions de brouillard personnalisées et une géométrie de débogage d''espace de monde en utilisant Sodium + Iris, tout en évitant les régressions ''fonctionne vanilla, se casse avec les shaders'' grâce à l''émission de sommets modernes avec VertexConsumer.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, eine nahtlose E/W-Sturmwall-Darstellung, benutzerdefinierte Nebel-Overlays und Welt-Raum-Debug-Geometrie mit Sodium + Iris zu erstellen, während sie ''funktioniert vanilla, bricht mit Shadern''-Rückschläge durch moderne Vertex-Emission mit VertexConsumer vermeiden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar uma renderização de parede de tempestade E/O sem problemas, sobreposições de nevoeiro personalizadas e geometria de depuração no espaço do mundo usando Sodium + Iris, evitando regressões ''funciona vanilla, quebra com shaders'' por meio da emissão de vértices moderna com VertexConsumer.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать бесшовную отрисовку штормовой стены с востока на запад, настраиваемые наложения тумана и отладочную геометрию в пространстве мира с помощью Sodium + Iris, избегая регрессий ''работает с vanilla, ломается с шейдерами'' благодаря современной эмиссии вершин с VertexConsumer.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء عرض جدار العاصفة من الشرق إلى الغرب بدون مشاكل، وتعديلات ضباب مخصصة و هندسة مساحة العالم باستخدام Sodium + Iris، وتجنب انحطاطات ''يعمل الفانيليا، يكسر مع الملحقات'' من خلال انبعاث رأس现代ي مع VertexConsumer."},"useCases":{"en":["Rendering compatible biome bands for Minecraft Fabric mods","Debugging world-space geometry with Sodium + Iris","Creating custom fog overlays for globe-style worlds"],"zh":["为Minecraft Fabric模组渲染兼容的生物群落带","使用Sodium + Iris调试世界空间几何","为球面世界创建自定义雾覆盖层"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabricモッドのバイオームバンドのレンダリング","Sodium + Irisを使用したワールドスペース幾何のデバッグ","球面世界のためのカスタムフォグオーバーレイの作成"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드에 대한 생물 군계 밴드 렌더링","Sodium + Iris를 사용한 세계 공간 기하학 디버깅","구형 세계를 위한 사용자 정의雾 오버레이 생성"],"es":["Renderizado de bandas de biomas compatibles para mods de Minecraft Fabric","Depuración de geometría de espacio de mundo con Sodium + Iris","Creación de superposiciones de niebla personalizadas para mundos de estilo globo"],"fr":["Rendu de bandes de biomes compatibles pour les mods de Minecraft Fabric","Débogage de la géométrie d''espace de monde avec Sodium + Iris","Création de superpositions de brouillard personnalisées pour les mondes de style globe"],"de":["Darstellung kompatibler Biome-Bänder für Minecraft Fabric-Mods","Fehlersuche der Welt-Raum-Geometrie mit Sodium + Iris","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Nebel-Overlays für globusartige Welten"],"pt":["Renderização de bandas de bioma compatíveis para mods do Minecraft Fabric","Depuração de geometria no espaço do mundo com Sodium + Iris","Criação de sobreposições de nevoeiro personalizadas para mundos no estilo globo"],"ru":["Отрисовка совместимых биом-бэндов для модов Minecraft Fabric","Отладка геометрии в пространстве мира с помощью Sodium + Iris","Создание настраиваемых наложений тумана для глобусоподобных миров"],"ar":["تصيير شرائط المناطق القطبية المتوافقة لمودات الفابريك ماين كرافت","تصحيح هندسة الفضاء العالمي مع Sodium + Iris","إنشاء تعديلات ضباب مخصصة للعالم على شكل كرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["No direct GL state calls in mod render code","Requires modern vertex emission with VertexConsumer","Compatible with Sodium + Iris only"],"zh":["模组渲染代码中不直接调用GL状态","需要使用VertexConsumer的现代顶点发射","仅与Sodium + Iris兼容"],"ja":["モッドレンダーコードでは直接GL状態の呼び出しを行わない","VertexConsumerを使用したモダンな頂点エミッションが必要","Sodium + Irisのみと互換性がある"],"ko":["모드 렌더링 코드에서 직접 GL 상태 호출을 수행하지 않음","VertexConsumer를 사용한 현대적 정점 배출이 필요","Sodium + Iris만과 호환"],"es":["No se permiten llamadas de estado GL directas en el código de renderizado de mod","Requiere emisión de vértices moderna con VertexConsumer","Compatible solo con Sodium + Iris"],"fr":["Aucune appel d''état GL direct dans le code de rendu de mod","Nécessite une émission de sommets modernes avec VertexConsumer","Compatible uniquement avec Sodium + Iris"],"de":["Keine direkten GL-Zustandsaufrufe im Mod-Render-Code","Benötigt moderne Vertex-Emission mit VertexConsumer","Kompatibel nur mit Sodium + Iris"],"pt":["Nenhuma chamada direta de estado GL no código de renderização do mod","Exige emissão de vértices moderna com VertexConsumer","Compatível apenas com Sodium + Iris"],"ru":["Нет прямых вызовов состояния GL в коде рендеринга мода","Требуется современная эмиссия вершин с VertexConsumer","Совместима только с Sodium + Iris"],"ar":["لا يوجد استدعاء مباشر لحالة GL في رمز تعديل العرض","يتطلب انبعاث رأس现代ي مع VertexConsumer","متوافق فقط مع Sodium + Iris"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-app-validation', 'community', 'weunica', 'payboxCLI-App', 'weunica/payboxCLI-App', 'wix-cli-app-validation', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z', '2026-02-18T11:56:42.861Z', NULL, '{"id":"weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-app-validation","name":"wix-cli-app-validation","description":{"zh":"Wix CLI应用验证是一个四步骤的顺序工作流，确保Wix CLI应用程序的有效性","ja":"Wix CLIアプリの検証は、4つのステップでWix CLIアプリの有効性を確認するものです","ko":"Wix CLI 애플리케이션 유효성 검사는 4단계의 순차적 워크플로우로 Wix CLI 애플리케이션의 유효성을 확인합니다","es":"La validación de aplicaciones Wix CLI implica un flujo de trabajo secuencial de cuatro pasos: instalación de paquetes, verificación de compilación de TypeScript, compilación y vista previa.","fr":"La validation d''applications Wix CLI implique un workflow séquentiel de quatre étapes : installation de packages, vérification de compilation de TypeScript, build et aperçu.","de":"Die Validierung von Wix-CLI-Anwendungen umfasst einen sequenziellen Workflow von vier Schritten: Paketinstallation, TypeScript-Kompilierungsprüfung, Build und Vorschau.","pt":"O wix-cli-app-validation é uma ferramenta que valida aplicativos Wix CLI através de um fluxo de trabalho sequencial de quatro etapas.","ru":"Wix-cli-app-validation — это инструмент, который проверяет приложения Wix CLI через четырехэтапный последовательный рабочий процесс.","ar":"وظيفة التحقق من صحة تطبيقات Wix CLI هي أداة تحقق من صحة تطبيقات Wix CLI من خلال تدفق عمل متسلسل من أربعة مراحل.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Wix CLI应用验证","ja":"Wix CLIアプリの検証","ko":"Wix CLI 애플리케이션 유효성 검사","es":"Validación de Aplicaciones Wix CLI","fr":"Validation d''Applications Wix CLI","de":"Wix CLI-App-Validierung","pt":"Validação de Aplicativos Wix CLI","ru":"Валидация приложений Wix CLI","ar":"تحقق من صحة تطبيقات Wix CLI","en":"wix-cli-app-validation"},"description":{"zh":"Wix CLI应用验证是一个四步骤的顺序工作流，确保Wix CLI应用程序的有效性","ja":"Wix CLIアプリの検証は、4つのステップでWix CLIアプリの有効性を確認するものです","ko":"Wix CLI 애플리케이션 유효성 검사는 4단계의 순차적 워크플로우로 Wix CLI 애플리케이션의 유효성을 확인합니다","es":"La validación de aplicaciones Wix CLI implica un flujo de trabajo secuencial de cuatro pasos: instalación de paquetes, verificación de compilación de TypeScr...","fr":"La validation d''applications Wix CLI implique un workflow séquentiel de quatre étapes : installation de packages, vérification de compilation de TypeScript, ...","de":"Die Validierung von Wix-CLI-Anwendungen umfasst einen sequenziellen Workflow von vier Schritten: Paketinstallation, TypeScript-Kompilierungsprüfung, Build un...","pt":"O wix-cli-app-validation é uma ferramenta que valida aplicativos Wix CLI através de um fluxo de trabalho sequencial de quatro etapas.","ru":"Wix-cli-app-validation — это инструмент, который проверяет приложения Wix CLI через четырехэтапный последовательный рабочий процесс.","ar":"وظيفة التحقق من صحة تطبيقات Wix CLI هي أداة تحقق من صحة تطبيقات Wix CLI من خلال تدفق عمل متسلسل من أربعة مراحل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["包安装","TypeScript编译检查","构建","预览"],"ja":["パッケージのインストール","TypeScriptのコンパイルチェック","ビルド","プレビュー"],"ko":["패키지 설치","TypeScript 컴파일 확인","빌드","미리 보기"],"es":["Instalación de paquetes","Verificación de compilación de TypeScript","Compilación y vista previa","Deteción de administrador de paquetes","Soporte para npm, yarn y pnp"],"fr":["Installation de packages","Vérification de compilation de TypeScript","Build et aperçu","Détection du gestionnaire de packages","Prise en charge de npm, yarn et pnp"],"de":["Paketinstallation","TypeScript-Kompilierungsprüfung","Build und Vorschau","Erkennung des Paketmanagers","Unterstützung für npm, yarn und pnp"],"pt":["Instalação de pacotes","Verificação de compilação do TypeScript","Construção do aplicativo","Visualização do aplicativo"],"ru":["Установка пакетов","Проверка компиляции TypeScript","Сборка приложения","Просмотр приложения"],"ar":["تثبيت الحزم","التحقق من صحة ترميز TypeScript","بناء التطبيق","معاينة التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Wix CLI","应用验证","包安装","TypeScript编译检查","构建","预览"],"ja":["Wix CLI","アプリの検証","パッケージのインストール","TypeScriptのコンパイルチェック","ビルド","プレビュー"],"ko":["Wix CLI","애플리케이션 유효성 검사","패키지 설치","TypeScript 컴파일 확인","빌드","미리 보기"],"es":["validación de aplicaciones Wix CLI","Wix CLI","desarrollo de aplicaciones","TypeScript","npm","yarn","pnp"],"fr":["validation d''applications Wix CLI","Wix CLI","développement d''applications","TypeScript","npm","yarn","pnp"],"de":["Validierung von Wix-CLI-Anwendungen","Wix CLI","Anwendungsentwicklung","TypeScript","npm","yarn","pnp"],"pt":["validação de aplicativos Wix CLI","desenvolvimento de aplicativos Wix","ferramentas de validação","Wix CLI","TypeScript","npm","yarn"],"ru":["валидация приложений Wix CLI","разработка приложений Wix","инструменты проверки","Wix CLI","TypeScript","npm","yarn"],"ar":["تحقق من صحة تطبيقات Wix CLI","تطوير تطبيقات Wix","أدوات التحقق","Wix CLI","TypeScript","npm","yarn"]}},"owner":"weunica","repo":"payboxCLI-App","repoPath":"weunica/payboxCLI-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wix-cli-app-validation","description":"Use when testing app readiness, verifying runtime behavior, or validating before releases and after changes in the code. Triggers include validate, test, verify, check readiness, preview validation, build verification, TypeScript compilation.","bodyPreview":"# Wix App Validation\n\nValidates Wix CLI applications through a four-step sequential workflow: package installation, TypeScript compilation check, build, and preview.\n\n## Validation Workflow\n\nExecute these steps sequentially. Stop and report errors if any step fails.\n\n### Step 1: Package Installation\n\nEnsure all dependencies are installed before proceeding with the build.\n\n**Detect package manager:**\n- Check for `package-lock.json` → use `npm`\n- Check for `yarn.lock` → use `yarn`\n- Check for `pnp","body":"# Wix App Validation\n\nValidates Wix CLI applications through a four-step sequential workflow: package installation, TypeScript compilation check, build, and preview.\n\n## Validation Workflow\n\nExecute these steps sequentially. Stop and report errors if any step fails.\n\n### Step 1: Package Installation\n\nEnsure all dependencies are installed before proceeding with the build.\n\n**Detect package manager:**\n- Check for `package-lock.json` → use `npm`\n- Check for `yarn.lock` → use `yarn`\n- Check for `pnpm-lock.yaml` → use `pnpm`\n- Default to `npm` if no lock file is found\n\n**Run installation command:**\n\n```bash\n# For npm\nnpm install\n\n# For yarn\nyarn install\n\n# For pnpm\npnpm install\n```\n\n**Success criteria:**\n- Exit code 0\n- All dependencies installed successfully\n- No missing peer dependencies warnings (unless expected)\n- `node_modules` directory exists and contains expected packages\n\n**On failure:** Report the installation errors and stop validation. Common issues:\n- Network connectivity problems\n- Corrupted lock files\n- Version conflicts\n- Missing Node.js or package manager\n\n### Step 2: TypeScript Compilation Check\n\nRun TypeScript compiler to check for type errors.\n\n**Full project check:**\n```bash\nnpx tsc --noEmit\n```\n\n**Targeted check (specific files/directories):**\n\nWhen validating after implementing a specific extension, you can run TypeScript checks on just those files:\n\n```bash\n# Check specific directory\nnpx tsc --noEmit src/extensions/dashboard/pages/survey/**/*.ts src/extensions/dashboard/pages/survey/**/*.tsx\n\n# Check dashboard pages only\nnpx tsc --noEmit src/extensions/dashboard/pages/**/*.ts src/extensions/dashboard/pages/**/*.tsx\n\n# Check site widgets only\nnpx tsc --noEmit src/site/widgets/**/*.ts src/site/widgets/**/*.tsx\n\n# Check dashboard modals only\nnpx tsc --noEmit src/extensions/dashboard/modals/**/*.ts src/extensions/dashboard/modals/**/*.tsx\n\n# Check backend only\nnpx tsc --noEmit src/backend/**/*.ts\n```\n\n**When to use targeted checks:**\n- After implementing a single extension (faster feedback)\n- When debugging type errors in a specific area\n- During iterative development\n\n**When to use full project check:**\n- Before final validation\n- When changes affect shared types\n- Before building/deploying\n\n**Success criteria:**\n- Exit code 0\n- No TypeScript compilation errors\n- All type checks pass\n\n**On failure:** Report the specific TypeScript errors and stop validation. Common issues:\n- Type mismatches between expected and actual types\n- Missing type declarations for imported modules\n- Incorrect generic type parameters\n- Properties not existing on declared types\n- Incompatible function signatures\n\n### Step 3: Build Validation\n\nRun the build command and check for compilation errors:\n\n```bash\nnpx wix build\n```\n\n**Success criteria:**\n- Exit code 0\n- No TypeScript errors\n- No missing dependencies\n\n**On failure:** Report the specific compilation errors and stop validation.\n\n### Step 4: Preview Deployment\n\nStart the preview server:\n\n```bash\nnpx wix preview\n```\n\n**Success criteria:**\n- Preview server starts successfully\n- Preview URLs are generated (both site and dashboard)\n\n**URL extraction:** Parse the terminal output to find both preview URLs. Look for patterns like:\n- Site preview: `Site preview: https://...` or `Site URL: https://...`\n- Dashboard preview: `Dashboard preview: https://...` or `Preview URL: https://...` or `Your app is available at: https://...`\n\nExtract both URLs and provide them to the user for manual verification.\n\n**On failure:** Report the preview startup errors and stop validation.\n\n## Validation Report\n\nAfter completing all steps, provide a summary:\n\n**Pass:**\n- Dependencies: ✓ All packages installed successfully\n- TypeScript: ✓ No compilation errors\n- Build: ✓ Compiled successfully\n- Preview: ✓ Running at [URL]\n\n**Fail:**\n- Identify which step failed\n- Provide specific error messages\n- Suggest remediation steps\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Package installation fails | Missing lock file, network issues, or corrupted node_modules | Delete `node_modules` and lock file, then reinstall |\n| TypeScript compilation fails | Type mismatches, missing declarations, or incorrect types | Fix TypeScript errors shown in `npx tsc --noEmit` output |\n| Build fails with TS errors | Type mismatches | Fix TypeScript errors in source |\n| Preview fails to start | Port conflict or config issue | Check `wix.config.json` |\n| Console errors in preview | Runtime exceptions | Check browser console output |\n| UI not rendering | Component errors | Review component code and imports |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:56:42.861Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated validation of Wix CLI applications through sequential workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要通过顺序工作流自动验证 Wix CLI 应用的开发代理。","ja":"Wix CLI アプリケーションの自動検証が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"순차적 워크플로우를 통해 Wix CLI 애플리케이션의 자동 검증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan validación automatizada de aplicaciones de Wix CLI a través de flujos de trabajo secuenciales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une validation automatique des applications Wix CLI via des flux de travail séquentiels.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Überprüfung von Wix-CLI-Anwendungen durch sequenzielle Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de validação automática de aplicações Wix CLI por meio de fluxos de trabalho sequenciais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматическая проверка приложений Wix CLI через последовательные рабочие процессы.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق الآلي لتطبيقات Wix CLI من خلال سير عمل متسلسلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate Wix CLI applications using a four-step workflow, including package installation with npm or yarn, TypeScript compilation checks, build processes, and preview functionality, ensuring error reporting and sequential execution.","zh":"赋予代理使用四步骤工作流验证 Wix CLI 应用，包括使用 npm 或 yarn 的包安装、TypeScript 编译检查、构建过程和预览功能，确保错误报告和顺序执行。","ja":"エージェントが 4 ステップのワークフローを使用して Wix CLI アプリケーションを検証できるようにし、npm または yarn を使用したパッケージのインストール、TypeScript のコンパイル チェック、ビルド プロセス、およびプレビュー機能を含み、エラー報告と順次実行を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 Wix CLI 애플리케이션을 4단계 워크플로우를 통해 검증할 수 있도록 해주며, npm 또는 yarn을 사용한 패키지 설치, TypeScript 컴파일 확인, 빌드 프로세스 및 미리 보기 기능을 포함하며, 오류 보고 및 순차적 실행을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar aplicaciones de Wix CLI utilizando un flujo de trabajo de cuatro pasos, que incluye la instalación de paquetes con npm o yarn, comprobaciones de compilación de TypeScript, procesos de compilación y funcionalidad de vista previa, garantizando la informe de errores y la ejecución secuencial.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider les applications Wix CLI en utilisant un flux de travail à quatre étapes, comprenant l''installation de packages avec npm ou yarn, les vérifications de compilation de TypeScript, les processus de construction et la fonctionnalité d''aperçu, assurant la déclaration d''erreurs et l''exécution séquentielle.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Wix-CLI-Anwendungen zu überprüfen, indem sie einen vierstufigen Workflow verwenden, der die Installation von Paketen mit npm oder yarn, TypeScript-Überprüfungen, Build-Prozesse und Vorschau-Funktionen umfasst, wodurch Fehlerberichte und sequenzielle Ausführung sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar aplicações Wix CLI usando um fluxo de trabalho de quatro etapas, incluindo instalação de pacotes com npm ou yarn, verificações de compilação do TypeScript, processos de compilação e funcionalidade de visualização, garantindo relatórios de erros e execução sequencial.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять приложения Wix CLI, используя рабочий процесс из четырех шагов, включая установку пакетов с помощью npm или yarn, проверки компиляции TypeScript, процессы сборки и функцию предварительного просмотра, обеспечивающую отчетность об ошибках и последовательную выполнение.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التحقق من تطبيقات Wix CLI باستخدام سير عمل من أربعة خطوات، بما في ذلك تثبيت الحزم مع npm أو yarn، وعمليات التحقق من компиля션 TypeScript، وعمليات البناء، ووظيفة المعاينة، مما يضمن تقارير الأخطاء والتنفيذ المتسلسل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Wix CLI application validation for continuous integration","Debugging package installation issues with npm or yarn","Validating TypeScript compilation for Wix applications"],"zh":["持续集成的 Wix CLI 应用验证自动化","使用 npm 或 yarn 调试包安装问题","Wix 应用 TypeScript 编译的验证"],"ja":["継続的な統合のための Wix CLI アプリケーションの検証の自動化","npm または yarn を使用したパッケージのインストールの問題のデバッグ","Wix アプリケーションの TypeScript コンパイルの検証"],"ko":["연속 통합을 위한 Wix CLI 애플리케이션 검증 자동화","npm 또는 yarn을 사용한 패키지 설치 문제 디버깅","Wix 애플리케이션의 TypeScript 컴파일 검증"],"es":["Automatización de la validación de aplicaciones de Wix CLI para la integración continua","Depuración de problemas de instalación de paquetes con npm o yarn","Validación de la compilación de TypeScript para aplicaciones de Wix"],"fr":["Automatisation de la validation des applications Wix CLI pour l''intégration continue","Débogage des problèmes d''installation de packages avec npm ou yarn","Validation de la compilation de TypeScript pour les applications Wix"],"de":["Automatisierung der Überprüfung von Wix-CLI-Anwendungen für die kontinuierliche Integration","Fehlerbehebung bei der Installation von Paketen mit npm oder yarn","Überprüfung der TypeScript-Kompilierung für Wix-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação de aplicações Wix CLI para integração contínua","Depurar problemas de instalação de pacotes com npm ou yarn","Validar a compilação do TypeScript para aplicações Wix"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку приложений Wix CLI для непрерывной интеграции","Отлаживать проблемы установки пакетов с помощью npm или yarn","Проверять компиляцию TypeScript для приложений Wix"],"ar":["تحسين التحقق الآلي لتطبيقات Wix CLI من أجل التكامل المستمر","تصحيح أخطاء تثبيت الحزم مع npm أو yarn","التحقق من компиля션 TypeScript لتطبيقات Wix"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Wix CLI application setup","Dependent on package managers like npm or yarn","Sequential workflow may halt on error"],"zh":["需要 Wix CLI 应用设置","依赖于包管理器如 npm 或 yarn","顺序工作流可能在错误时停止"],"ja":["Wix CLI アプリケーションの設定が必要","npm または yarn などのパッケージ マネージャーに依存","順次ワークフローはエラー時に停止する可能性がある"],"ko":["Wix CLI 애플리케이션 설정이 필요","npm 또는 yarnなどの 패키지 관리자에 의존","순차적 워크플로우는 오류 발생 시 중지될 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de la aplicación de Wix CLI","Depende de administradores de paquetes como npm o yarn","El flujo de trabajo secuencial puede detenerse en caso de error"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de l''application Wix CLI","Dépend de gestionnaires de packages tels que npm ou yarn","Le flux de travail séquentiel peut s''arrêter en cas d''erreur"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung der Wix-CLI-Anwendung","Hängt von Paketmanagern wie npm oder yarn ab","Der sequenzielle Workflow kann bei einem Fehler anhängen"],"pt":["Exige configuração de aplicação Wix CLI","Dependente de gerenciadores de pacotes como npm ou yarn","Fluxo de trabalho sequencial pode parar em caso de erro"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения Wix CLI","Зависит от менеджеров пакетов, таких как npm или yarn","Последовательный рабочий процесс может остановиться при возникновении ошибки"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق Wix CLI","يعتمد على مشرفي الحزم مثل npm أو yarn","يمكن أن يتوقف سير العمل المتسلسل عند حدوث خطأ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-embedded-script', 'community', 'weunica', 'payboxCLI-App', 'weunica/payboxCLI-App', 'wix-cli-embedded-script', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z', '2026-02-18T11:56:54.564Z', NULL, '{"id":"weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-embedded-script","name":"wix-cli-embedded-script","description":{"zh":"Wix CLI嵌入脚本构建器创建嵌入式脚本扩展，实现Wix站点与第三方服务的集成","ja":"Wix CLI埋め込みスクリプトビルダーは、埋め込みスクリプト拡張を作成し、Wixサイトと第三者サービスとの統合を実現します","ko":"Wix CLI 임베디드 스크립트 빌더는 임베디드 스크립트 확장을 생성하여 Wix 사이트와 제3자 서비스의 통합을 구현합니다","es":"El Wix CLI Embedded Script permite crear extensiones de scripts integrados para sitios web de Wix, mejorando la funcionalidad y la integración con servicios de terceros.","fr":"Le Wix CLI Embedded Script permet de créer des extensions de scripts intégrés pour les sites web Wix, améliorant ainsi la fonctionnalité et l''intégration avec les services tiers.","de":"Der Wix CLI Embedded Script ermöglicht die Erstellung integrierter Skript-Erweiterungen für Wix-Websites, wodurch die Funktionalität und die Integration mit Drittanbieterdiensten verbessert werden.","pt":"O Wix Embedded Script Builder cria extensões de script incorporadas para aplicações Wix CLI, permitindo a integração com serviços de terceiros e funcionalidades personalizadas","ru":"Wix Встроенный Скрипт Билдер создает встроенные скриптовые расширения для приложений Wix CLI, позволяя интегрировать сторонние сервисы и настраиваемые функции","ar":"بناء سكريبت مدمج Wix CLI ينشئ امتدادات سكريبت مدمجة لتطبيقات Wix CLI، مما يسمح بالدمج مع خدمات الطرف الثالث والوظائف المخصصة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Wix CLI嵌入脚本构建器","ja":"Wix CLI埋め込みスクリプトビルダー","ko":"Wix CLI 임베디드 스크립트 빌더","es":"Wix CLI Embedded Script: Crea extensiones de scripts inte...","fr":"Wix CLI Embedded Script : Créez des extensions de scripts...","de":"Wix CLI Embedded Script: Erstellen Sie integrierte Skript...","pt":"Construtor de Scripts Incorporados Wix CLI","ru":"Wix CLI Встроенный Скрипт Билдер","ar":"بناء скрипت مدمج Wix CLI","en":"wix-cli-embedded-script"},"description":{"zh":"Wix CLI嵌入脚本构建器创建嵌入式脚本扩展，实现Wix站点与第三方服务的集成","ja":"Wix CLI埋め込みスクリプトビルダーは、埋め込みスクリプト拡張を作成し、Wixサイトと第三者サービスとの統合を実現します","ko":"Wix CLI 임베디드 스크립트 빌더는 임베디드 스크립트 확장을 생성하여 Wix 사이트와 제3자 서비스의 통합을 구현합니다","es":"El Wix CLI Embedded Script permite crear extensiones de scripts integrados para sitios web de Wix, mejorando la funcionalidad y la integración con servicios ...","fr":"Le Wix CLI Embedded Script permet de créer des extensions de scripts intégrés pour les sites web Wix, améliorant ainsi la fonctionnalité et l''intégration ave...","de":"Der Wix CLI Embedded Script ermöglicht die Erstellung integrierter Skript-Erweiterungen für Wix-Websites, wodurch die Funktionalität und die Integration mit ...","pt":"O Wix Embedded Script Builder cria extensões de script incorporadas para aplicações Wix CLI, permitindo a integração com serviços de terceiros e funcionalida...","ru":"Wix Встроенный Скрипт Билдер создает встроенные скриптовые расширения для приложений Wix CLI, позволяя интегрировать сторонние сервисы и настраиваемые функции","ar":"بناء سكريبت مدمج Wix CLI ينشئ امتدادات سكريبت مدمجة لتطبيقات Wix CLI، مما يسمح بالدمج مع خدمات الطرف الثالث والوظائف المخصصة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建嵌入式脚本扩展","实现Wix站点与第三方服务的集成","支持分析跟踪和广告","允许自定义JavaScript功能","提供快速开始检查清单","支持创建嵌入式脚本文件夹和配置文件"],"ja":["埋め込みスクリプト拡張を作成する","Wixサイトと第三者サービスとの統合を実現する","分析の追跡と広告をサポートする","カスタムJavaScript機能を許可する","クイックスタートチェックリストを提供する","埋め込みスクリプトフォルダと設定ファイルの作成をサポートする"],"ko":["임베디드 스크립트 확장을 생성","Wix 사이트와 제3자 서비스의 통합을 구현","분석 추적과 광고를 지원","사용자 지정 JavaScript 기능을 허용","빠른 시작 체크리스트를 제공","임베디드 스크립트 폴더와 설정 파일의 생성을 지원"],"es":["Crea extensiones de scripts integrados para sitios web de Wix","Mejora la funcionalidad y la integración con servicios de terceros","Permite la inyección de código HTML en el DOM de sitios web de Wix","Facilita la integración con servicios de análisis y publicidad","Permite la creación de funcionalidades personalizadas con JavaScript"],"fr":["Créez des extensions de scripts intégrés pour les sites web Wix","Améliorez la fonctionnalité et l''intégration avec les services tiers","Permet l''injection de code HTML dans le DOM des sites web Wix","Facilite l''intégration avec les services d''analyse et de publicité","Permet la création de fonctionnalités personnalisées avec JavaScript"],"de":["Erstellen Sie integrierte Skript-Erweiterungen für Wix-Websites","Verbessern Sie die Funktionalität und die Integration mit Drittanbieterdiensten","Ermöglicht die Injektion von HTML-Code in das DOM von Wix-Websites","Erleichtert die Integration mit Analyse- und Werbediensten","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Funktionen mit JavaScript"],"pt":["Criação de extensões de script incorporadas","Integração com serviços de terceiros","Rastreio de análises e anúncios","Funcionalidades personalizadas de JavaScript","Injeção de código HTML no DOM de sites Wix","Compatibilidade com aplicações Wix CLI"],"ru":["Создание встроенных скриптовых расширений","Интеграция со сторонними сервисами","Отслеживание аналитики и рекламы","Настраиваемые функции JavaScript","Внедрение кода HTML в DOM сайтов Wix","Совместимость с приложениями Wix CLI"],"ar":["إنشاء امتدادات سكريبت مدمجة","الدمج مع خدمات الطرف الثالث","تعقب التحليلات والإعلانات","الوظائف المخصصة لجافا سكريبت","حَقن كود HTML في DOM لمواقع Wix","التوافق مع تطبيقات Wix CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Wix CLI","嵌入脚本","HTML代码片段","第三方服务集成","分析跟踪","广告","自定义JavaScript功能","Wix站点开发"],"ja":["Wix CLI","埋め込みスクリプト","HTMLコードフラグメント","第三者サービス統合","分析の追跡","広告","カスタムJavaScript機能","Wixサイト開発"],"ko":["Wix CLI","임베디드 스크립트","HTML 코드 조각","제3자 서비스 통합","분석 추적","광고","사용자 지정 JavaScript 기능","Wix 사이트 개발"],"es":["Wix CLI","script integrado","extensiones de scripts","sitios web de Wix","integración con servicios de terceros","análisis web","publicidad en línea","JavaScript"],"fr":["Wix CLI","script intégré","extensions de scripts","sites web Wix","intégration avec les services tiers","analyse web","publicité en ligne","JavaScript"],"de":["Wix CLI","integriertes Skript","Skript-Erweiterungen","Wix-Websites","Integration mit Drittanbieterdiensten","Web-Analyse","Online-Werbung","JavaScript"],"pt":["Wix CLI","Script incorporado","Extensões de script","Integração com serviços de terceiros","Rastreio de análises","Anúncios personalizados","Funcionalidades personalizadas de JavaScript","Desenvolvimento de aplicações Wix"],"ru":["Wix CLI","Встроенный скрипт","Скриптовые расширения","Интеграция со сторонними сервисами","Отслеживание аналитики","Пользовательская реклама","Настраиваемые функции JavaScript","Разработка приложений Wix"],"ar":["Wix CLI","سكريبت مدمج","امتدادات سكريبت","الدمج مع خدمات الطرف الثالث","تعقب التحليلات","إعلانات مخصصة","الوظائف المخصصة لجافا سكريبت","تطوير تطبيقات Wix"]}},"owner":"weunica","repo":"payboxCLI-App","repoPath":"weunica/payboxCLI-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wix-cli-embedded-script","description":"Use when adding tracking code, advertising pixels, third-party integrations, or client-side JavaScript to sites. Triggers include embed, inject, script, third-party integration, DOM injection.","bodyPreview":"# Wix Embedded Script Builder\n\nCreates embedded script extensions for Wix CLI applications. Embedded scripts are HTML code fragments that get injected into the DOM of Wix sites, enabling integration with third-party services, analytics tracking, advertising, and custom JavaScript functionality.\n\n## Quick Start Checklist\n\nFollow these steps in order when creating an embedded script:\n\n1. [ ] Create script folder: `src/site/embedded-scripts/<script-name>/`\n2. [ ] Create `embedded.html` with config","body":"# Wix Embedded Script Builder\n\nCreates embedded script extensions for Wix CLI applications. Embedded scripts are HTML code fragments that get injected into the DOM of Wix sites, enabling integration with third-party services, analytics tracking, advertising, and custom JavaScript functionality.\n\n## Quick Start Checklist\n\nFollow these steps in order when creating an embedded script:\n\n1. [ ] Create script folder: `src/site/embedded-scripts/<script-name>/`\n2. [ ] Create `embedded.html` with config element, styles, and script logic\n3. [ ] Create `extensions.ts` with `extensions.embeddedScript()` and unique UUID\n4. [ ] Create dashboard config page: `src/dashboard/pages/<script-name>-settings/`\n5. [ ] Implement config page with `embeddedScripts` API from `@wix/app-management`\n6. [ ] Update `src/extensions.ts` to import and use both extensions\n7. [ ] Run `npx tsc --noEmit` to verify TypeScript compiles\n8. [ ] Run `npx wix build` and `npx wix preview` to test\n9. [ ] Add the `APPS.MANAGE_EMBEDDED_SCRIPT` permission in the Wix Dev Center (see [Enable Embedded Script Permission](#enable-embedded-script-permission))\n\n## Script Types\n\nEmbedded scripts must declare a type for consent management:\n\n| Type          | Description                                      | Use Cases                               |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| `ESSENTIAL`   | Core functionality crucial to site operation     | Authentication, security features       |\n| `FUNCTIONAL`  | Remembers user choices to improve experience     | Language preferences, UI customization  |\n| `ANALYTICS`   | Provides statistics on how visitors use the site | Google Analytics, Hotjar, Mixpanel      |\n| `ADVERTISING` | Provides visitor data for marketing purposes     | Facebook Pixel, Google Ads, retargeting |\n\n**Selection rule:** If a script falls into multiple types, choose the option closest to the bottom of the list (most restrictive). For example, a script with both Analytics and Advertising aspects should be typed as `ADVERTISING`.\n\n## Placement Options\n\n| Placement    | Description                              | Best For                          |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `HEAD`       | Between `<head>` and `</head>` tags      | Analytics, early initialization   |\n| `BODY_START` | Immediately after opening `<body>` tag   | Critical functionality, noscript  |\n| `BODY_END`   | Immediately before closing `</body>` tag | Non-blocking scripts, performance |\n\n**Selection guidelines:**\n\n- Analytics/tracking → `HEAD` (initialize early)\n- Advertising pixels → `BODY_END` (non-blocking)\n- Critical functionality → `HEAD` or `BODY_START`\n- Non-critical features → `BODY_END` (better performance)\n\n## Dynamic Parameters and Dashboard Configuration\n\n**Every embedded script requires a companion dashboard page** to configure its parameters. Site owners use the dashboard page UI to set values, which are then passed to the embedded script as template variables.\n\n### Architecture Flow\n\n```\nDashboard Page (React UI)\n    │\n    │  embeddedScripts.embedScript({ parameters: {...} })\n    ▼\nWix App Management API\n    │\n    │  Stores parameters, injects as template variables\n    ▼\nEmbedded Script (HTML)\n    │\n    │  {{parameterKey}} → actual value\n    ▼\nSite DOM\n```\n\n**Related skill:** Use `wix-cli-dashboard-page` to create the configuration UI for your embedded script.\n\n### Parameter Types\n\n| Type       | Description              | Dashboard Component    |\n| ---------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| `TEXT`     | Single-line text         | Input                  |\n| `NUMBER`   | Numeric value            | Input type=\"number\"    |\n| `BOOLEAN`  | True/false toggle        | ToggleSwitch, Checkbox |\n| `IMAGE`    | Image from media manager | ImagePicker            |\n| `DATE`     | Date only                | DatePicker             |\n| `DATETIME` | Date with time           | DatePicker + TimeInput |\n| `URL`      | URL with validation      | Input                  |\n| `SELECT`   | Dropdown options         | Dropdown               |\n| `COLOR`    | Color value              | ColorPicker            |\n\n### Template Variable Syntax\n\nEmbedded scripts support parameterization using template variable syntax `{{variableName}}`. These parameters are configured through the dashboard and passed as template variables that should be used in your HTML/JavaScript code.\n\n**Usage Instructions:**\n\n1. **Template Variable Syntax:**\n   - Use `{{parameterKey}}` syntax to insert parameter values into your HTML\n   - Template variables work in HTML attributes\n   - They will be replaced with actual values when the script is injected\n\n2. **HTML Attributes (REQUIRED):**\n   - Store ALL parameter values in data attributes on a configuration element\n   - Template variables can ONLY be used here, not directly in JavaScript\n   - Example: `<div id=\"config\" data-headline=\"{{headline}}\" data-text=\"{{text}}\"></div>`\n\n3. **JavaScript Access:**\n   - JavaScript must read parameter values from the data attributes\n   - Use `getAttribute()` or the `dataset` property\n   - Examples:\n     ```javascript\n     const config = document.getElementById(\"config\");\n     const headline = config?.getAttribute(\"data-headline\");\n     // OR using dataset:\n     const { headline, text } = config.dataset;\n     ```\n\n4. **Type Safety:**\n   - Be aware of parameter types when using them in JavaScript\n   - NUMBER types: convert with `Number()` or `parseInt()`\n   - BOOLEAN types: compare with `''true''` or `''false''` strings\n   - DATE/DATETIME: parse with `new Date()`\n\n5. **Required vs Optional:**\n   - Required parameters will always have values\n   - Optional parameters may be empty - handle gracefully\n   - Provide fallback values for optional parameters\n\n6. **Relevant Parameter Usage:**\n   - Only use dynamic parameters that are relevant to your current use case\n   - Ignore parameters that don''t apply to the functionality you''re implementing\n   - Each parameter you use should serve a clear purpose in the script''s functionality\n   - It''s perfectly fine to not use all parameters if they''re not applicable\n\n**Example Patterns:**\n\n**Pattern 1 - Configuration in Data Attributes:**\n\n```html\n<div\n  id=\"script-config\"\n  data-api-key=\"{{apiKey}}\"\n  data-enabled=\"{{enabled}}\"\n  data-color=\"{{primaryColor}}\"\n></div>\n<script>\n  const config = document.getElementById(\"script-config\");\n  const apiKey = config.getAttribute(\"data-api-key\");\n  const enabled = config.getAttribute(\"data-enabled\") === \"true\";\n  const color = config.getAttribute(\"data-color\");\n\n  if (enabled && apiKey) {\n    // Initialize with configuration\n  }\n</script>\n```\n\n**Pattern 2 - Using dataset Property:**\n\n```html\n<div\n  id=\"script-config\"\n  data-headline=\"{{headline}}\"\n  data-message=\"{{message}}\"\n  data-image-url=\"{{imageUrl}}\"\n></div>\n<script>\n  const config = document.getElementById(\"script-config\");\n  const { headline, message, imageUrl } = config.dataset;\n\n  // Use the variables in your script logic\n  if (headline) {\n    document.querySelector(\"#headline\").textContent = headline;\n  }\n</script>\n```\n\n**Pattern 3 - Conditional Logic:**\n\n```html\n<div\n  id=\"config\"\n  data-mode=\"{{activationMode}}\"\n  data-start=\"{{startDate}}\"\n  data-end=\"{{endDate}}\"\n></div>\n<script>\n  const config = document.getElementById(\"config\");\n  const mode = config.getAttribute(\"data-mode\");\n\n  if (mode === \"timed\") {\n    const startDate = new Date(config.getAttribute(\"data-start\"));\n    const endDate = new Date(config.getAttribute(\"data-end\"));\n    const now = new Date();\n\n    if (now >= startDate && now <= endDate) {\n      // Show content\n    }\n  } else if (mode === \"active\") {\n    // Show content immediately\n  }\n</script>\n```\n\n**Validation Requirements:**\n\n- Only use dynamic parameters that are relevant to your specific use case\n- Ignore parameters that don''t apply to the functionality being implemented\n- Template variables `{{parameterKey}}` must match the exact key names from the parameter definitions\n- Handle both required and optional parameters appropriately\n- Provide sensible default behavior when optional parameters are not set\n- Ensure type-appropriate usage (don''t use NUMBER parameters as strings without conversion)\n\n### Common Parameters\n\nEvery embedded script should have at minimum an **enable/disable toggle** parameter:\n\n| Parameter    | Type      | Purpose                              |\n| ------------ | --------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `enabled`    | `BOOLEAN` | Allow site owner to activate/disable |\n| `apiKey`     | `TEXT`    | Third-party service credentials      |\n| `trackingId` | `TEXT`    | Analytics/pixel identifiers          |\n| `headline`   | `TEXT`    | Customizable display text            |\n| `color`      | `COLOR`   | UI customization                     |\n\n## Output Structure\n\nA complete embedded script implementation requires **two parts**:\n\n### 1. Embedded Script Extension\n\n```\nsrc/site/embedded-scripts/\n└── {script-name}/\n    ├── embedded.html     # HTML/JavaScript code to inject\n    └── extensions.ts     # Metadata (scriptType, placement)\n```\n\n### 2. Dashboard Configuration Page (Required)\n\n```\nsrc/dashboard/\n├── withProviders.tsx     # WDS provider wrapper (required)\n└── pages/\n    └── {script-name}-settings/\n        ├── extensions.ts  # Extension registration (REQUIRED)\n        └── page.tsx       # Configuration UI using embeddedScripts API\n```\n\n**Note:** The dashboard page requires its own `extensions.ts` file. Without this file, the dashboard page will not appear in the Wix dashboard.\n\n**WARNING:** The dashboard page uses DIFFERENT field names than embedded scripts:\n\n- Dashboard pages use `title`, `routePath`, `component`\n- Embedded scripts use `name`, `source`, `placement`, `scriptType`\n\nDo NOT apply embedded script field names to dashboard page registrations.\n\n**See `wix-cli-dashboard-page` skill** for dashboard page implementation details and the extension registration pattern.\n\n## Implementation Pattern\n\n```html\n<!-- Configuration element with template variables -->\n<div id=\"my-config\" data-api-key=\"{{apiKey}}\" data-enabled=\"{{enabled}}\"></div>\n\n<!-- Container for dynamic content -->\n<div id=\"my-container\"></div>\n\n<style>\n  /* Scoped styles for the embedded content */\n  #my-container {\n    /* styles */\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script type=\"module\">\n  // Get configuration from data attributes\n  const config = document.getElementById(\"my-config\");\n  if (!config) throw new Error(\"Config element not found\");\n\n  const { apiKey, enabled } = config.dataset;\n\n  // Exit early if disabled (use throw at module scope, not return)\n  if (enabled !== \"true\") {\n    throw new Error(\"Script disabled\");\n  }\n\n  // Implement functionality in a named function (return is allowed here)\n  async function initialize() {\n    try {\n      // Your implementation\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(\"Script error:\", error);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Initialize when DOM is ready\n  if (document.readyState === \"loading\") {\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", initialize);\n  } else {\n    initialize();\n  }\n</script>\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Analytics Tracking\n\n**Request:** \"Add Google Analytics tracking to my site\"\n\n**Output:**\n\n- Script type: `ANALYTICS`\n- Placement: `HEAD`\n- Template variables: `{{trackingId}}`\n- Implements: gtag.js initialization, page view tracking\n\n### Popup/Modal\n\n**Request:** \"Create a coupon popup that shows when cart value exceeds $50\"\n\n**Output:**\n\n- Script type: `FUNCTIONAL`\n- Placement: `BODY_END`\n- Template variables: `{{couponCode}}`, `{{minimumCartValue}}`, `{{enablePopup}}`\n- Implements: Cart value detection, popup display logic, localStorage for \"don''t show again\"\n\n### Third-Party Chat Widget\n\n**Request:** \"Integrate Intercom chat widget\"\n\n**Output:**\n\n- Script type: `FUNCTIONAL`\n- Placement: `BODY_END`\n- Template variables: `{{appId}}`, `{{userEmail}}`, `{{userName}}`\n- Implements: Intercom SDK initialization, user identification\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Always create a dashboard page:** Every embedded script needs a configuration UI\n- **Include enable/disable toggle:** Let site owners control activation without removing the script\n- **Performance:** Minimize impact - scripts should be lightweight and non-blocking\n- **Security:** Avoid inline event handlers, validate data, escape user input\n- **Error handling:** Fail silently when appropriate - don''t break the site\n- **Module scope early exits:** Use `throw new Error()` for early exits at module scope, not `return`. Rollup (used by Astro) doesn''t allow `return` statements at module scope. Wrap main logic in a named async function where `return` is valid.\n- **Type conversions:** Parameters are always strings - convert in JavaScript as needed\n- **API calls:** Only create fetch() calls to /api/\\* endpoints that exist in the API spec\n- **Scoping:** Prefix CSS classes and IDs to avoid conflicts with site styles\n- **Cleanup:** Remove event listeners and intervals when appropriate\n\n## Complete Example: Coupon Popup\n\n### 1. Define Parameters\n\n```\nParameters for \"cart-coupon-popup\":\n- couponCode (TEXT, required) - The coupon code to display\n- popupHeadline (TEXT, required) - Headline text\n- popupDescription (TEXT, required) - Description text\n- minimumCartValue (NUMBER) - Minimum cart value to show popup\n- enablePopup (BOOLEAN, required) - Enable/disable toggle\n```\n\n### 2. Embedded Script (`embedded.html`)\n\n```html\n<div\n  id=\"popup-config\"\n  data-coupon-code=\"{{couponCode}}\"\n  data-popup-headline=\"{{popupHeadline}}\"\n  data-minimum-cart-value=\"{{minimumCartValue}}\"\n  data-enable-popup=\"{{enablePopup}}\"\n></div>\n<div id=\"popup-container\"></div>\n\n<script type=\"module\">\n  // Get configuration from data attributes\n  const config = document.getElementById(\"popup-config\");\n  if (!config) throw new Error(\"Config element not found\");\n\n  const { couponCode, popupHeadline, minimumCartValue, enablePopup } =\n    config.dataset;\n\n  // Exit early if disabled (use throw at module scope, not return)\n  if (enablePopup !== \"true\") {\n    throw new Error(\"Popup disabled\");\n  }\n\n  // Main logic in a function (return is allowed here)\n  async function initializePopup() {\n    const minValue = Number(minimumCartValue) || 0;\n    // ... popup implementation\n  }\n\n  // Initialize when DOM is ready\n  if (document.readyState === \"loading\") {\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", initializePopup);\n  } else {\n    initializePopup();\n  }\n</script>\n```\n\n### 3. Dashboard Page (See `wix-cli-dashboard-page` skill)\n\nUses `embeddedScripts` API from `@wix/app-management`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { embeddedScripts } from \"@wix/app-management\";\n\n// Load parameters\nconst script = await embeddedScripts.getEmbeddedScript();\nconst params = script.parameters; // { couponCode: \"...\", ... }\n\n// Save parameters (all values must be strings)\nawait embeddedScripts.embedScript({\n  parameters: {\n    couponCode: \"SAVE20\",\n    minimumCartValue: \"50\", // Number as string\n    enablePopup: \"true\", // Boolean as string\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Extension Registration\n\n**Extension registration is MANDATORY and has TWO required steps.**\n\n### Step 1: Create Script-Specific Extension File\n\nEach embedded script requires an `extensions.ts` file in its folder:\n\n```typescript\nimport { extensions } from \"@wix/astro/builders\";\n\nexport const embeddedscriptMyScript = extensions.embeddedScript({\n  id: \"{{GENERATE_UUID}}\",\n  name: \"My Script\",\n  source: \"./site/embedded-scripts/my-script/embedded.html\",\n  placement: \"BODY_END\",\n  scriptType: \"FUNCTIONAL\",\n});\n```\n\n**CRITICAL: UUID Generation**\n\nThe `id` must be a unique, static UUID v4 string. Generate a fresh UUID for each extension - do NOT use `randomUUID()` or copy UUIDs from examples. Replace `{{GENERATE_UUID}}` with a freshly generated UUID like `\"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\"`.\n\n| Property     | Type   | Description                                           |\n| ------------ | ------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `id`         | string | Unique static UUID v4 (generate fresh)                |\n| `name`       | string | Display name for the script                           |\n| `source`     | string | Relative path to the HTML file                        |\n| `placement`  | enum   | `HEAD`, `BODY_START`, or `BODY_END`                   |\n| `scriptType` | enum   | `ESSENTIAL`, `FUNCTIONAL`, `ANALYTICS`, `ADVERTISING` |\n\n### Step 2: Register in Main Extensions File\n\n**CRITICAL:** After creating the script-specific extension file, you MUST read [wix-cli-extension-registration](../wix-cli-extension-registration/SKILL.md) and follow the \"App Registration\" section to update `src/extensions.ts`.\n\n**Without completing Step 2, the embedded script will not be deployed to the site.**\n\n## Enable Embedded Script Permission\n\nAfter implementation, the app developer must manually enable the embedded script permission:\n\n1. Go to [https://manage.wix.com/apps/{app-id}/dev-center-permissions](https://manage.wix.com/apps/{app-id}/dev-center-permissions) (replace `{app-id}` with your actual app ID)\n2. Add the `APPS.MANAGE_EMBEDDED_SCRIPT` permission\n3. Save the changes\n\n**Note:** This is a manual step in the Wix Dev Center. Without this permission, embedded scripts will not function on the site.\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter implementation, use [wix-cli-app-validation](../wix-cli-app-validation/SKILL.md) to validate TypeScript compilation, build, preview, and runtime behavior.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:56:54.564Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing Wix site customization through embedded HTML scripts and third-party integrations.","zh":"非常适合需要通过嵌入式HTML脚本和第三方集成来定制Wix站点的前端代理。","ja":"Wixサイトのカスタマイズに埋め込みHTMLスクリプトとサードパーティの統合を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"埋め込み HTML 스크립트와 제 3 자 통합을 통해 Wix 사이트를 사용자 정의해야 하는 프론트 엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan personalizar sitios web de Wix mediante scripts de HTML incrustados y integraciones de terceros.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui nécessitent une personnalisation de sites Web Wix via des scripts HTML intégrés et des intégrations de tiers.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine Anpassung von Wix-Websites über eingebettete HTML-Skripte und Drittanbieter-Integrationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de personalização de sites Wix por meio de scripts HTML incorporados e integrações de terceiros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется настройка сайтов Wix с помощью встроенных скриптов HTML и интеграций третьих лиц.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تخصيص موقع Wix من خلال 脚本 HTML المضمنة والتكاملات الخارجية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to inject custom JavaScript functionality, integrate with third-party services, and enable analytics tracking within Wix sites using embedded HTML code fragments and the Wix CLI, leveraging DOM manipulation and HTML configuration.","zh":"赋予代理注入自定义JavaScript功能、与第三方服务集成以及在Wix站点中使用嵌入式HTML代码片段和Wix CLI启用分析跟踪的能力，利用DOM操作和HTML配置。","ja":"Wix CLIと埋め込みHTMLコードフラグメントを使用して、Wixサイト内でカスタムJavaScript機能を注入し、サードパーティサービスを統合し、分析トラッキングを有効にするエージェントをEmpower化し、DOM操作とHTML構成を利用します。","ko":"Wix CLI 및 임베디드 HTML 코드 조각을 사용하여 Wix 사이트 내에서 사용자 지정 JavaScript 기능을 삽입하고 제 3 자 서비스를 통합하고 분석 추적을 활성화 할 수있는 에이전트를 강화하고 DOM 조작 및 HTML 구성 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a inyectar funcionalidades personalizadas de JavaScript, integrar con servicios de terceros y habilitar el seguimiento de análisis dentro de los sitios web de Wix mediante fragmentos de código HTML incrustados y la CLI de Wix, aprovechando la manipulación de DOM y la configuración de HTML.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''injecter des fonctionnalités JavaScript personnalisées, d''intégrer des services tiers et d''activer le suivi d''analyse au sein des sites Web Wix à l''aide de fragments de code HTML intégrés et de la CLI Wix, en exploitant la manipulation de DOM et la configuration HTML.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, benutzerdefinierte JavaScript-Funktionalitäten einzuspritzen, sich mit Drittanbieterdiensten zu integrieren und Analysenverfolgung innerhalb von Wix-Websites mithilfe eingebetteter HTML-Code-Fragmente und der Wix-CLI zu ermöglichen, indem DOM-Manipulation und HTML-Konfiguration genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a injetar funcionalidades personalizadas em JavaScript, integrar com serviços de terceiros e habilitar o rastreamento de análise dentro dos sites Wix usando fragmentos de código HTML incorporados e a CLI do Wix, aproveitando a manipulação de DOM e a configuração de HTML.","ru":"Позволяет агентам внедрять пользовательскую функциональность на JavaScript, интегрироваться с сервисами третьих лиц и включать отслеживание аналитики внутри сайтов Wix с помощью фрагментов встроенного кода HTML и CLI Wix, используя манипуляцию DOM и конфигурацию HTML.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تمكين الوكلاء من حقن وظائف جافا سكريبت المخصصة وتكاملها مع خدمات الطرف الثالث وتفعيل تتبع التحليلات داخل مواقع Wix باستخدام شظايا كود HTML المضمنة وواجهة سطر أوامر Wix، واستخدام مаниبولات DOM وتكوين HTML."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom analytics tracking for Wix sites","Integrating third-party services into Wix applications","Injecting custom JavaScript functionality into Wix site DOM"],"zh":["为Wix站点创建自定义分析跟踪","将第三方服务集成到Wix应用程序中","将自定义JavaScript功能注入Wix站点DOM中"],"ja":["Wixサイトのカスタム分析トラッキングを作成する","サードパーティサービスをWixアプリケーションに統合する","WixサイトのDOMにカスタムJavaScript機能を注入する"],"ko":["Wix 사이트에 대한 사용자 지정 분석 추적を作成하는 것","제 3 자 서비스를 Wix 응용 프로그램에 통합","Wix 사이트 DOM에 사용자 지정 JavaScript 기능을 삽입"],"es":["Crear un seguimiento de análisis personalizado para sitios web de Wix","Integrar servicios de terceros en aplicaciones de Wix","Inyectar funcionalidades personalizadas de JavaScript en el DOM del sitio web de Wix"],"fr":["Créer un suivi d''analyse personnalisé pour les sites Web Wix","Intégrer des services tiers dans les applications Wix","Injecter des fonctionnalités JavaScript personnalisées dans le DOM du site Web Wix"],"de":["Erstellen einer benutzerdefinierten Analysenverfolgung für Wix-Websites","Integration von Drittanbieterdiensten in Wix-Anwendungen","Einspritzen von benutzerdefinierter JavaScript-Funktionalität in das DOM der Wix-Website"],"pt":["Criar rastreamento de análise personalizado para sites Wix","Integrar serviços de terceiros em aplicações Wix","Injetar funcionalidades personalizadas em JavaScript no DOM do site Wix"],"ru":["Создание пользовательского отслеживания аналитики для сайтов Wix","Интеграция сервисов третьих лиц в приложения Wix","Внедрение пользовательской функциональности на JavaScript в DOM сайта Wix"],"ar":["إنشاء تتبع تحليلات مخصص لمواقع Wix","تكامل خدمات الطرف الثالث في تطبيقات Wix","حقن وظائف جافا سكريبت المخصصة في نموذج كائن المستند للويب لموقع Wix"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Wix CLI setup","Limited to Wix site integrations","Needs specific folder structure and embedded.html configuration"],"zh":["需要Wix CLI设置","仅限Wix站点集成","需要特定的文件夹结构和embedded.html配置"],"ja":["Wix CLIの設定が必要","Wixサイト統合のみ","特定のフォルダ構造と埋め込み.html構成が必要"],"ko":["Wix CLI 설정이 필요합니다","Wix 사이트 통합만","특정 폴더 구조 및 임베디드.html 구성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Wix CLI","Limitado a integraciones de sitios web de Wix","Necesita una estructura de carpetas específica y configuración de embedded.html"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Wix CLI","Limité aux intégrations de sites Web Wix","Nécessite une structure de dossiers spécifique et une configuration embedded.html"],"de":["Benötigt Wix-CLI-Setup","Begrenzt auf Wix-Website-Integrationen","Benötigt eine spezifische Ordnerstruktur und embedded.html-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Requer configuração da CLI do Wix","Limitado a integrações de sites Wix","Necessita de estrutura de pasta específica e configuração de embedded.html"],"ru":["Требуется настройка CLI Wix","Ограничен интеграциями сайтов Wix","Требует конкретной структуры папок и конфигурации embedded.html"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد واجهة سطر أوامر Wix","محدود بتكاملات موقع Wix","يحتاج إلى بنية مجلدات محددة وتكوين embedded.html"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ollieb89/orchestrator/uv-package-manager', 'community', 'ollieb89', 'orchestrator', 'ollieb89/orchestrator', 'uv-package-manager', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z', '2026-02-18T11:57:24.646Z', NULL, '{"id":"ollieb89/orchestrator/uv-package-manager","name":"uv-package-manager","description":{"zh":"UV 包管理器是一种快速的 Python 包安装器和解析器，用于现代 Python 项目管理和依赖工作流","ja":"UV パッケージマネージャーは、現代の Python プロジェクト管理と依存関係ワークフローに使用される高速な Python パッケージインストーラーと解析器です","ko":"UV 패키지 관리자는 현대적인 파이썬 프로젝트 관리와 의존성 워크플로우에 사용되는 빠른 파이썬 패키지 설치자와 解析器입니다","es":"UV es un gestor de paquetes Python rápido y eficiente, ideal para gestionar dependencias y proyectos. Aprende a usarlo para mejorar tu flujo de trabajo","fr":"UV est un gestionnaire de paquets Python rapide et efficace, idéal pour gérer les dépendances et les projets. Découvrez comment l''utiliser pour améliorer votre flux de travail","de":"UV ist ein schneller und effizienter Python-Paket-Manager, ideal für die Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten und Projekten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ihn verwenden können, um Ihren Arbeitsablauf zu verbessern","pt":"O gerenciador de pacotes UV é uma ferramenta rápida para instalar e gerenciar dependências Python. Aprenda a usá-lo para melhorar a eficiência dos seus projetos.","ru":"Менеджер пакетов UV - это быстрый инструмент для установки и управления зависимостями Python. Узнайте, как его использовать, чтобы повысить эффективность ваших проектов.","ar":"مدير الحزم UV هو أداة سريعة لتثبيت وإدارة الاعتماديات بايثون. تعلم كيفية استخدامها لتحسين كفاءة مشاريعك.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UV 包管理器：Python 项目的快速依赖管理","ja":"UV パッケージマネージャー：Python プロジェクトの高速依存管理","ko":"UV 패키지 관리자: 파이썬 프로젝트의 빠른 의존성 관리","es":"Gestor de paquetes UV: Instalador de Python rápido","fr":"Gestionnaire de paquets UV : Installeur Python rapide","de":"UV-Paket-Manager: Schneller Python-Installer","pt":"Gerenciador de Pacotes UV: Instalador Python Rápido","ru":"UV Пакетный Менеджер: Быстрый Инсталлятор Python","ar":"مدير حزم UV: مثبت بايثون سريع","en":"uv-package-manager"},"description":{"zh":"UV 包管理器是一种快速的 Python 包安装器和解析器，用于现代 Python 项目管理和依赖工作流","ja":"UV パッケージマネージャーは、現代の Python プロジェクト管理と依存関係ワークフローに使用される高速な Python パッケージインストーラーと解析器です","ko":"UV 패키지 관리자는 현대적인 파이썬 프로젝트 관리와 의존성 워크플로우에 사용되는 빠른 파이썬 패키지 설치자와 解析器입니다","es":"UV es un gestor de paquetes Python rápido y eficiente, ideal para gestionar dependencias y proyectos. Aprende a usarlo para mejorar tu flujo de trabajo","fr":"UV est un gestionnaire de paquets Python rapide et efficace, idéal pour gérer les dépendances et les projets. Découvrez comment l''utiliser pour améliorer vot...","de":"UV ist ein schneller und effizienter Python-Paket-Manager, ideal für die Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten und Projekten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ihn verwenden kön...","pt":"O gerenciador de pacotes UV é uma ferramenta rápida para instalar e gerenciar dependências Python. Aprenda a usá-lo para melhorar a eficiência dos seus proje...","ru":"Менеджер пакетов UV - это быстрый инструмент для установки и управления зависимостями Python. Узнайте, как его использовать, чтобы повысить эффективность ваш...","ar":"مدير الحزم UV هو أداة سريعة لتثبيت وإدارة الاعتماديات بايثون. تعلم كيفية استخدامها لتحسين كفاءة مشاريعك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速安装和解析 Python 包","高效管理 Python 项目依赖","支持创建和管理虚拟环境","可以安装 Python 解释器","高效解决依赖冲突","支持从 pip/pip-tools/poetry 迁移"],"ja":["Python パッケージの高速インストールと解析","Python プロジェクトの依存関係の効率的な管理","仮想環境の作成と管理のサポート","Python インタープリターのインストール","依存関係の衝突の効率的な解決","pip/pip-tools/poetry からの移行のサポート"],"ko":["파이썬 패키지의 빠른 설치와 解析","파이썬 프로젝트의 의존성의 효율적인 관리","가상 환경의 생성과 관리 지원","파이썬 인터프리터의 설치","의존성의 충돌의 효율적인 해결","pip/pip-tools/poetry 에서의 마이그레이션 지원"],"es":["Instalación rápida de paquetes Python","Gestión eficiente de dependencias","Creación y gestión de entornos virtuales","Instalación de intérpretes Python","Resolución de conflictos de dependencias","Migración desde pip/pip-tools/poetry"],"fr":["Installation rapide de paquets Python","Gestion efficace des dépendances","Création et gestion d''environnements virtuels","Installation d''interpréteurs Python","Résolution de conflits de dépendances","Migration depuis pip/pip-tools/poetry"],"de":["Schnelle Installation von Python-Paketen","Effiziente Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten","Erstellung und Verwaltung von virtuellen Umgebungen","Installation von Python-Interpretern","Auflösung von Abhängigkeitskonflikten","Migration von pip/pip-tools/poetry"],"pt":["Instalação rápida de dependências","Resolução eficiente de conflitos","Criação e gerenciamento de ambientes virtuais","Instalação de interpretadores Python","Melhoria da eficiência dos pipelines de CI/CD"],"ru":["Быстрая установка зависимостей","Эффективное разрешение конфликтов","Создание и управление виртуальными средами","Установка интерпретаторов Python","Повышение эффективности конвейеров CI/CD"],"ar":["تثبيت سريع للاعتماديات","حل فعال للنزاعات","إنشاء وإدارة بيئات افتراضية","تثبيت مترجمات بايثون","تحسين كفاءة أنابيب CI/CD"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python 包管理","依赖管理","虚拟环境","Python 解释器","依赖冲突","CI/CD 流程","UV 包管理器","Python 项目管理"],"ja":["Python パッケージ管理","依存関係管理","仮想環境","Python インタープリター","依存関係の衝突","CI/CD プロセス","UV パッケージマネージャー","Python プロジェクト管理"],"ko":["파이썬 패키지 관리","의존성 관리","가상 환경","파이썬 인터프리터","의존성 충돌","CI/CD 프로세스","UV 패키지 관리자","파이썬 프로젝트 관리"],"es":["gestor de paquetes python","uv package manager","instalador de paquetes python","gestión de dependencias python","entornos virtuales python","intérpretes python","resolución de conflictos de dependencias","migración de pip a uv"],"fr":["gestionnaire de paquets python","uv package manager","installeur de paquets python","gestion des dépendances python","environnements virtuels python","interpréteurs python","résolution de conflits de dépendances","migration de pip à uv"],"de":["python-paket-manager","uv package manager","python-paket-installer","abhängigkeitsverwaltung python","virtuelle umgebungen python","python-interpreter","auflösung von abhängigkeitskonflikten","migration von pip zu uv"],"pt":["gerenciador de pacotes UV","instalador python rápido","dependências python","ambientes virtuais","interpretadores python","pipelines de CI/CD"],"ru":["менеджер пакетов UV","быстрый инсталлятор python","зависимости python","виртуальные среды","интерпретаторы python","конвейеры CI/CD"],"ar":["مدير حزم UV","مثبت بايثون سريع","اعتماديات بايثون","بيئات افتراضية","مترجمات بايثون","أنابيب CI/CD"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"uv-package-manager","description":"Master the uv package manager for fast Python dependency management, virtual environments, and modern Python project workflows. Use when setting up Python projects, managing dependencies, or optimizing Python development workflows with uv.","bodyPreview":"# UV Package Manager\n\nComprehensive guide to using uv, an extremely fast Python package installer and resolver written in Rust, for modern Python project management and dependency workflows.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new Python projects quickly\n- Managing Python dependencies faster than pip\n- Creating and managing virtual environments\n- Installing Python interpreters\n- Resolving dependency conflicts efficiently\n- Migrating from pip/pip-tools/poetry\n- Speeding up CI/CD pipelines\n-","body":"# UV Package Manager\n\nComprehensive guide to using uv, an extremely fast Python package installer and resolver written in Rust, for modern Python project management and dependency workflows.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new Python projects quickly\n- Managing Python dependencies faster than pip\n- Creating and managing virtual environments\n- Installing Python interpreters\n- Resolving dependency conflicts efficiently\n- Migrating from pip/pip-tools/poetry\n- Speeding up CI/CD pipelines\n- Managing monorepo Python projects\n- Working with lockfiles for reproducible builds\n- Optimizing Docker builds with Python dependencies\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. What is uv?\n- **Ultra-fast package installer**: 10-100x faster than pip\n- **Written in Rust**: Leverages Rust''s performance\n- **Drop-in pip replacement**: Compatible with pip workflows\n- **Virtual environment manager**: Create and manage venvs\n- **Python installer**: Download and manage Python versions\n- **Resolver**: Advanced dependency resolution\n- **Lockfile support**: Reproducible installations\n\n### 2. Key Features\n- Blazing fast installation speeds\n- Disk space efficient with global cache\n- Compatible with pip, pip-tools, poetry\n- Comprehensive dependency resolution\n- Cross-platform support (Linux, macOS, Windows)\n- No Python required for installation\n- Built-in virtual environment support\n\n### 3. UV vs Traditional Tools\n- **vs pip**: 10-100x faster, better resolver\n- **vs pip-tools**: Faster, simpler, better UX\n- **vs poetry**: Faster, less opinionated, lighter\n- **vs conda**: Faster, Python-focused\n\n## Installation\n\n### Quick Install\n\n```bash\n# macOS/Linux\ncurl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh\n\n# Windows (PowerShell)\npowershell -c \"irm https://astral.sh/uv/install.ps1 | iex\"\n\n# Using pip (if you already have Python)\npip install uv\n\n# Using Homebrew (macOS)\nbrew install uv\n\n# Using cargo (if you have Rust)\ncargo install --git https://github.com/astral-sh/uv uv\n```\n\n### Verify Installation\n\n```bash\nuv --version\n# uv 0.x.x\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Create a New Project\n\n```bash\n# Create new project with virtual environment\nuv init my-project\ncd my-project\n\n# Or create in current directory\nuv init .\n\n# Initialize creates:\n# - .python-version (Python version)\n# - pyproject.toml (project config)\n# - README.md\n# - .gitignore\n```\n\n### Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Install packages (creates venv if needed)\nuv add requests pandas\n\n# Install dev dependencies\nuv add --dev pytest black ruff\n\n# Install from requirements.txt\nuv pip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Install from pyproject.toml\nuv sync\n```\n\n## Virtual Environment Management\n\n### Pattern 1: Creating Virtual Environments\n\n```bash\n# Create virtual environment with uv\nuv venv\n\n# Create with specific Python version\nuv venv --python 3.12\n\n# Create with custom name\nuv venv my-env\n\n# Create with system site packages\nuv venv --system-site-packages\n\n# Specify location\nuv venv /path/to/venv\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Activating Virtual Environments\n\n```bash\n# Linux/macOS\nsource .venv/bin/activate\n\n# Windows (Command Prompt)\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate.bat\n\n# Windows (PowerShell)\n.venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n\n# Or use uv run (no activation needed)\nuv run python script.py\nuv run pytest\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Using uv run\n\n```bash\n# Run Python script (auto-activates venv)\nuv run python app.py\n\n# Run installed CLI tool\nuv run black .\nuv run pytest\n\n# Run with specific Python version\nuv run --python 3.11 python script.py\n\n# Pass arguments\nuv run python script.py --arg value\n```\n\n## Package Management\n\n### Pattern 4: Adding Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Add package (adds to pyproject.toml)\nuv add requests\n\n# Add with version constraint\nuv add \"django>=4.0,<5.0\"\n\n# Add multiple packages\nuv add numpy pandas matplotlib\n\n# Add dev dependency\nuv add --dev pytest pytest-cov\n\n# Add optional dependency group\nuv add --optional docs sphinx\n\n# Add from git\nuv add git+https://github.com/user/repo.git\n\n# Add from git with specific ref\nuv add git+https://github.com/user/repo.git@v1.0.0\n\n# Add from local path\nuv add ./local-package\n\n# Add editable local package\nuv add -e ./local-package\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Removing Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Remove package\nuv remove requests\n\n# Remove dev dependency\nuv remove --dev pytest\n\n# Remove multiple packages\nuv remove numpy pandas matplotlib\n```\n\n### Pattern 6: Upgrading Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Upgrade specific package\nuv add --upgrade requests\n\n# Upgrade all packages\nuv sync --upgrade\n\n# Upgrade package to latest\nuv add --upgrade requests\n\n# Show what would be upgraded\nuv tree --outdated\n```\n\n### Pattern 7: Locking Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Generate uv.lock file\nuv lock\n\n# Update lock file\nuv lock --upgrade\n\n# Lock without installing\nuv lock --no-install\n\n# Lock specific package\nuv lock --upgrade-package requests\n```\n\n## Python Version Management\n\n### Pattern 8: Installing Python Versions\n\n```bash\n# Install Python version\nuv python install 3.12\n\n# Install multiple versions\nuv python install 3.11 3.12 3.13\n\n# Install latest version\nuv python install\n\n# List installed versions\nuv python list\n\n# Find available versions\nuv python list --all-versions\n```\n\n### Pattern 9: Setting Python Version\n\n```bash\n# Set Python version for project\nuv python pin 3.12\n\n# This creates/updates .python-version file\n\n# Use specific Python version for command\nuv --python 3.11 run python script.py\n\n# Create venv with specific version\nuv venv --python 3.12\n```\n\n## Project Configuration\n\n### Pattern 10: pyproject.toml with uv\n\n```toml\n[project]\nname = \"my-project\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\ndescription = \"My awesome project\"\nreadme = \"README.md\"\nrequires-python = \">=3.8\"\ndependencies = [\n    \"requests>=2.31.0\",\n    \"pydantic>=2.0.0\",\n    \"click>=8.1.0\",\n]\n\n[project.optional-dependencies]\ndev = [\n    \"pytest>=7.4.0\",\n    \"pytest-cov>=4.1.0\",\n    \"black>=23.0.0\",\n    \"ruff>=0.1.0\",\n    \"mypy>=1.5.0\",\n]\ndocs = [\n    \"sphinx>=7.0.0\",\n    \"sphinx-rtd-theme>=1.3.0\",\n]\n\n[build-system]\nrequires = [\"hatchling\"]\nbuild-backend = \"hatchling.build\"\n\n[tool.uv]\ndev-dependencies = [\n    # Additional dev dependencies managed by uv\n]\n\n[tool.uv.sources]\n# Custom package sources\nmy-package = { git = \"https://github.com/user/repo.git\" }\n```\n\n### Pattern 11: Using uv with Existing Projects\n\n```bash\n# Migrate from requirements.txt\nuv add -r requirements.txt\n\n# Migrate from poetry\n# Already have pyproject.toml, just use:\nuv sync\n\n# Export to requirements.txt\nuv pip freeze > requirements.txt\n\n# Export with hashes\nuv pip freeze --require-hashes > requirements.txt\n```\n\n## Advanced Workflows\n\n### Pattern 12: Monorepo Support\n\n```bash\n# Project structure\n# monorepo/\n#   packages/\n#     package-a/\n#       pyproject.toml\n#     package-b/\n#       pyproject.toml\n#   pyproject.toml (root)\n\n# Root pyproject.toml\n[tool.uv.workspace]\nmembers = [\"packages/*\"]\n\n# Install all workspace packages\nuv sync\n\n# Add workspace dependency\nuv add --path ./packages/package-a\n```\n\n### Pattern 13: CI/CD Integration\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/test.yml\nname: Tests\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Install uv\n        uses: astral-sh/setup-uv@v2\n        with:\n          enable-cache: true\n\n      - name: Set up Python\n        run: uv python install 3.12\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: uv sync --all-extras --dev\n\n      - name: Run tests\n        run: uv run pytest\n\n      - name: Run linting\n        run: |\n          uv run ruff check .\n          uv run black --check .\n```\n\n### Pattern 14: Docker Integration\n\n```dockerfile\n# Dockerfile\nFROM python:3.12-slim\n\n# Install uv\nCOPY --from=ghcr.io/astral-sh/uv:latest /uv /usr/local/bin/uv\n\n# Set working directory\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Copy dependency files\nCOPY pyproject.toml uv.lock ./\n\n# Install dependencies\nRUN uv sync --frozen --no-dev\n\n# Copy application code\nCOPY . .\n\n# Run application\nCMD [\"uv\", \"run\", \"python\", \"app.py\"]\n```\n\n**Optimized multi-stage build:**\n\n```dockerfile\n# Multi-stage Dockerfile\nFROM python:3.12-slim AS builder\n\n# Install uv\nCOPY --from=ghcr.io/astral-sh/uv:latest /uv /usr/local/bin/uv\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Install dependencies to venv\nCOPY pyproject.toml uv.lock ./\nRUN uv sync --frozen --no-dev --no-editable\n\n# Runtime stage\nFROM python:3.12-slim\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Copy venv from builder\nCOPY --from=builder /app/.venv .venv\nCOPY . .\n\n# Use venv\nENV PATH=\"/app/.venv/bin:$PATH\"\n\nCMD [\"python\", \"app.py\"]\n```\n\n### Pattern 15: Lockfile Workflows\n\n```bash\n# Create lockfile (uv.lock)\nuv lock\n\n# Install from lockfile (exact versions)\nuv sync --frozen\n\n# Update lockfile without installing\nuv lock --no-install\n\n# Upgrade specific package in lock\nuv lock --upgrade-package requests\n\n# Check if lockfile is up to date\nuv lock --check\n\n# Export lockfile to requirements.txt\nuv export --format requirements-txt > requirements.txt\n\n# Export with hashes for security\nuv export --format requirements-txt --hash > requirements.txt\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Pattern 16: Using Global Cache\n\n```bash\n# UV automatically uses global cache at:\n# Linux: ~/.cache/uv\n# macOS: ~/Library/Caches/uv\n# Windows: %LOCALAPPDATA%\\uv\\cache\n\n# Clear cache\nuv cache clean\n\n# Check cache size\nuv cache dir\n```\n\n### Pattern 17: Parallel Installation\n\n```bash\n# UV installs packages in parallel by default\n\n# Control parallelism\nuv pip install --jobs 4 package1 package2\n\n# No parallel (sequential)\nuv pip install --jobs 1 package\n```\n\n### Pattern 18: Offline Mode\n\n```bash\n# Install from cache only (no network)\nuv pip install --offline package\n\n# Sync from lockfile offline\nuv sync --frozen --offline\n```\n\n## Comparison with Other Tools\n\n### uv vs pip\n\n```bash\n# pip\npython -m venv .venv\nsource .venv/bin/activate\npip install requests pandas numpy\n# ~30 seconds\n\n# uv\nuv venv\nuv add requests pandas numpy\n# ~2 seconds (10-15x faster)\n```\n\n### uv vs poetry\n\n```bash\n# poetry\npoetry init\npoetry add requests pandas\npoetry install\n# ~20 seconds\n\n# uv\nuv init\nuv add requests pandas\nuv sync\n# ~3 seconds (6-7x faster)\n```\n\n### uv vs pip-tools\n\n```bash\n# pip-tools\npip-compile requirements.in\npip-sync requirements.txt\n# ~15 seconds\n\n# uv\nuv lock\nuv sync --frozen\n# ~2 seconds (7-8x faster)\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Pattern 19: Starting a New Project\n\n```bash\n# Complete workflow\nuv init my-project\ncd my-project\n\n# Set Python version\nuv python pin 3.12\n\n# Add dependencies\nuv add fastapi uvicorn pydantic\n\n# Add dev dependencies\nuv add --dev pytest black ruff mypy\n\n# Create structure\nmkdir -p src/my_project tests\n\n# Run tests\nuv run pytest\n\n# Format code\nuv run black .\nuv run ruff check .\n```\n\n### Pattern 20: Maintaining Existing Project\n\n```bash\n# Clone repository\ngit clone https://github.com/user/project.git\ncd project\n\n# Install dependencies (creates venv automatically)\nuv sync\n\n# Install with dev dependencies\nuv sync --all-extras\n\n# Update dependencies\nuv lock --upgrade\n\n# Run application\nuv run python app.py\n\n# Run tests\nuv run pytest\n\n# Add new dependency\nuv add new-package\n\n# Commit updated files\ngit add pyproject.toml uv.lock\ngit commit -m \"Add new-package dependency\"\n```\n\n## Tool Integration\n\n### Pattern 21: Pre-commit Hooks\n\n```yaml\n# .pre-commit-config.yaml\nrepos:\n  - repo: local\n    hooks:\n      - id: uv-lock\n        name: uv lock\n        entry: uv lock\n        language: system\n        pass_filenames: false\n\n      - id: ruff\n        name: ruff\n        entry: uv run ruff check --fix\n        language: system\n        types: [python]\n\n      - id: black\n        name: black\n        entry: uv run black\n        language: system\n        types: [python]\n```\n\n### Pattern 22: VS Code Integration\n\n```json\n// .vscode/settings.json\n{\n  \"python.defaultInterpreterPath\": \"${workspaceFolder}/.venv/bin/python\",\n  \"python.terminal.activateEnvironment\": true,\n  \"python.testing.pytestEnabled\": true,\n  \"python.testing.pytestArgs\": [\"-v\"],\n  \"python.linting.enabled\": true,\n  \"python.formatting.provider\": \"black\",\n  \"[python]\": {\n    \"editor.defaultFormatter\": \"ms-python.black-formatter\",\n    \"editor.formatOnSave\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n```bash\n# Issue: uv not found\n# Solution: Add to PATH or reinstall\necho ''export PATH=\"$HOME/.cargo/bin:$PATH\"'' >> ~/.bashrc\n\n# Issue: Wrong Python version\n# Solution: Pin version explicitly\nuv python pin 3.12\nuv venv --python 3.12\n\n# Issue: Dependency conflict\n# Solution: Check resolution\nuv lock --verbose\n\n# Issue: Cache issues\n# Solution: Clear cache\nuv cache clean\n\n# Issue: Lockfile out of sync\n# Solution: Regenerate\nuv lock --upgrade\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Project Setup\n\n1. **Always use lockfiles** for reproducibility\n2. **Pin Python version** with .python-version\n3. **Separate dev dependencies** from production\n4. **Use uv run** instead of activating venv\n5. **Commit uv.lock** to version control\n6. **Use --frozen in CI** for consistent builds\n7. **Leverage global cache** for speed\n8. **Use workspace** for monorepos\n9. **Export requirements.txt** for compatibility\n10. **Keep uv updated** for latest features\n\n### Performance Tips\n\n```bash\n# Use frozen installs in CI\nuv sync --frozen\n\n# Use offline mode when possible\nuv sync --offline\n\n# Parallel operations (automatic)\n# uv does this by default\n\n# Reuse cache across environments\n# uv shares cache globally\n\n# Use lockfiles to skip resolution\nuv sync --frozen  # skips resolution\n```\n\n## Migration Guide\n\n### From pip + requirements.txt\n\n```bash\n# Before\npython -m venv .venv\nsource .venv/bin/activate\npip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# After\nuv venv\nuv pip install -r requirements.txt\n# Or better:\nuv init\nuv add -r requirements.txt\n```\n\n### From Poetry\n\n```bash\n# Before\npoetry install\npoetry add requests\n\n# After\nuv sync\nuv add requests\n\n# Keep existing pyproject.toml\n# uv reads [project] and [tool.poetry] sections\n```\n\n### From pip-tools\n\n```bash\n# Before\npip-compile requirements.in\npip-sync requirements.txt\n\n# After\nuv lock\nuv sync --frozen\n```\n\n## Command Reference\n\n### Essential Commands\n\n```bash\n# Project management\nuv init [PATH]              # Initialize project\nuv add PACKAGE              # Add dependency\nuv remove PACKAGE           # Remove dependency\nuv sync                     # Install dependencies\nuv lock                     # Create/update lockfile\n\n# Virtual environments\nuv venv [PATH]              # Create venv\nuv run COMMAND              # Run in venv\n\n# Python management\nuv python install VERSION   # Install Python\nuv python list              # List installed Pythons\nuv python pin VERSION       # Pin Python version\n\n# Package installation (pip-compatible)\nuv pip install PACKAGE      # Install package\nuv pip uninstall PACKAGE    # Uninstall package\nuv pip freeze               # List installed\nuv pip list                 # List packages\n\n# Utility\nuv cache clean              # Clear cache\nuv cache dir                # Show cache location\nuv --version                # Show version\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **Official documentation**: https://docs.astral.sh/uv/\n- **GitHub repository**: https://github.com/astral-sh/uv\n- **Astral blog**: https://astral.sh/blog\n- **Migration guides**: https://docs.astral.sh/uv/guides/\n- **Comparison with other tools**: https://docs.astral.sh/uv/pip/compatibility/\n\n## Best Practices Summary\n\n1. **Use uv for all new projects** - Start with `uv init`\n2. **Commit lockfiles** - Ensure reproducible builds\n3. **Pin Python versions** - Use .python-version\n4. **Use uv run** - Avoid manual venv activation\n5. **Leverage caching** - Let uv manage global cache\n6. **Use --frozen in CI** - Exact reproduction\n7. **Keep uv updated** - Fast-moving project\n8. **Use workspaces** - For monorepo projects\n9. **Export for compatibility** - Generate requirements.txt when needed\n10. **Read the docs** - uv is feature-rich and evolving\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:57:24.646Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing ultra-fast package installation and dependency management.","zh":"非常适合需要超快包安装和依赖管理的Python开发代理。","ja":"Python開発エージェントが超高速のパッケージインストールと依存関係管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"초고속 패키지 설치 및 의존성 관리가 필요한 Python 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan una instalación de paquetes y administración de dependencias ultra-rápidas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Python nécessitant une installation de paquets et une gestion de dépendances ultra-rapides.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine ultraschnelle Paketinstallation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que necessitam de instalação de pacotes ultra-rápida e gerenciamento de dependências.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Python, которым необходима сверхбыстрая установка пакетов и управление зависимостями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين بايثون الذين يحتاجون إلى تثبيت حزم سريع للغاية وإدارة التبعيات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Python dependencies faster than pip, resolve conflicts efficiently, and speed up CI/CD pipelines using uv, a Rust-written package installer and resolver, supporting virtual environments and Python interpreter installations.","zh":"赋予代理更快地管理Python依赖项、更高效地解决冲突以及使用uv（一个用Rust编写的包安装器和解析器）加速CI/CD流水线的能力，支持虚拟环境和Python解释器安装。","ja":"エージェントがPythonの依存関係をpipよりも速く管理し、コンフリクトを効率的に解決し、uv（Rustで書かれたパッケージインストーラーと解決策）を使用してCI/CDパイプラインを高速化することを可能にし、仮想環境とPythonインタープリターのインストールをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Python 의존성을 pip보다 빠르게 관리하고, 충돌을 효율적으로 해결하며, uv(루스트로 작성된 패키지 설치자 및 해결사)를 사용하여 CI/CD 파이프라인을 가속화하는 것을 가능하게 하며, 가상 환경 및 Python 인터프리터 설치를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar las dependencias de Python más rápido que pip, resolver conflictos de manera eficiente y acelerar las tuberías de CI/CD utilizando uv, un instalador y resolutor de paquetes escrito en Rust, que admite entornos virtuales y instalaciones de intérpretes de Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les dépendances Python plus rapidement que pip, de résoudre les conflits de manière efficiente et d''accélérer les pipelines CI/CD en utilisant uv, un installateur et résolveur de paquets écrit en Rust, prenant en charge les environnements virtuels et les installations d''interpréteurs Python.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Python-Abhängigkeiten schneller als pip zu verwalten, Konflikte effizient zu lösen und die CI/CD-Pipelines mithilfe von uv, einem in Rust geschriebenen Paketinstallations- und Auflösungstool, das virtuelle Umgebungen und Python-Interpreter-Installationen unterstützt, zu beschleunigen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar dependências Python mais rapidamente do que o pip, resolver conflitos de forma eficiente e acelerar pipelines de CI/CD usando uv, um instalador e resolvido de pacotes escrito em Rust, que suporta ambientes virtuais e instalações de interpretador Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять зависимостями Python быстрее, чем pip, эффективно решать конфликты и ускорять конвейеры CI/CD с помощью uv, установщика и разрешителя пакетов, написанного на Rust, поддерживающего виртуальные среды и установки интерпретатора Python.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة التبعيات بايثون بشكل أسرع من بيب، وحل النزاعات بفعالية وتسريع خطوط أنابيب CI/CD باستخدام uv، وهو مثبت وحلّ حزم مكتوب بلغة روست، يدعم البيئات الافتراضية وتثبيتات مترجم بايثون."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up new Python projects quickly","Migrating from pip/pip-tools/poetry","Resolving dependency conflicts efficiently"],"zh":["快速设置新的Python项目","从pip/pip-tools/poetry迁移","高效地解决依赖冲突"],"ja":["新しいPythonプロジェクトを迅速に設定する","pip/pip-tools/poetryから移行する","依存関係のコンフリクトを効率的に解決する"],"ko":["새로운 Python 프로젝트를 빠르게 설정하는 것","pip/pip-tools/poetry에서 마이그레이션","의존성 충돌을 효율적으로 해결하는 것"],"es":["Configurar proyectos de Python rápidamente","Migrar desde pip/pip-tools/poetry","Resolver conflictos de dependencias de manera eficiente"],"fr":["Configurer rapidement des projets Python","Migrer depuis pip/pip-tools/poetry","Résoudre les conflits de dépendances de manière efficiente"],"de":["Schnell Python-Projekte einrichten","Von pip/pip-tools/poetry migrieren","Abhängigkeitskonflikte effizient lösen"],"pt":["Configuração rápida de novos projetos Python","Migração de pip/pip-tools/poetry","Resolução eficiente de conflitos de dependência"],"ru":["Быстрая настройка новых проектов Python","Миграция с pip/pip-tools/poetry","Эффективное решение конфликтов зависимостей"],"ar":["إعداد مشاريع بايثون الجديدة بسرعة","الهجرة من بيب/أدوات بيب/شعر","حل النزاعات التبعية بفعالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust installation for uv","Python project compatibility required","Limited to Python ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Rust安装uv","需要Python项目兼容性","仅限Python生态系统"],"ja":["uvをインストールするためにRustが必要","Pythonプロジェクトの互換性が必要","Pythonエコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["uv를 설치하기 위해 루스트가 필요","Python 프로젝트 호환성이 필요","Python 생태계에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Rust para uv","Se requiere compatibilidad del proyecto de Python","Limitado al ecosistema de Python"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Rust pour uv","La compatibilité du projet Python est requise","Limité à l''écosystème Python"],"de":["Benötigt Rust-Installation für uv","Python-Projekt-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Begrenzt auf das Python-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Rust para uv","Compatibilidade do projeto Python necessária","Limitado ao ecossistema Python"],"ru":["Требуется установка Rust для uv","Требуется совместимость проекта Python","Ограничен экосистемой Python"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت روست ل uv","متطلبات توافق مشروع بايثون","محدود بنظام بيئي بايثون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-extension-registration', 'community', 'weunica', 'payboxCLI-App', 'weunica/payboxCLI-App', 'wix-cli-extension-registration', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z', '2026-02-18T11:56:57.503Z', NULL, '{"id":"weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-extension-registration","name":"wix-cli-extension-registration","description":{"zh":"Wix CLI扩展注册是Wix应用开发的关键步骤，用于注册扩展以供Wix CLI识别","ja":"Wix CLI拡張機能の登録は、Wixアプリ開発の重要なステップであり、拡張機能をWix CLIに登録するために使用されます","ko":"Wix CLI 확장 등록은 Wix 애플리케이션 개발의 중요한 단계로, 확장을 Wix CLI에서 인식할 수 있도록 등록하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"El registro de extensiones Wix CLI es crucial para que sean reconocidas por la aplicación. Actualiza src/extensions.ts para importar y registrar extensiones.","fr":"L''enregistrement d''extensions Wix CLI est crucial pour qu''elles soient reconnues par l''application. Mettez à jour src/extensions.ts pour importer et enregistrer des extensions.","de":"Die Registrierung von Wix-CLI-Erweiterungen ist entscheidend, damit sie von der Anwendung erkannt werden. Aktualisieren Sie src/extensions.ts, um Erweiterungen zu importieren und zu registrieren.","pt":"O registro de extensão Wix CLI é necessário para que as extensões sejam reconhecidas pelo Wix CLI. Isso é feito atualizando o arquivo src/extensions.ts.","ru":"Регистрация расширения Wix CLI необходима для того, чтобы расширения были распознаны Wix CLI. Это делается путем обновления файла src/extensions.ts.","ar":"تسجيل امتداد Wix CLI ضروري لكي يتم التعرف على الامتدادات بواسطة Wix CLI. يتم هذا عن طريق تحديث ملف src/extensions.ts.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Wix CLI扩展注册","ja":"Wix CLI拡張機能の登録","ko":"Wix CLI 확장 등록","es":"Registro de Extensiones Wix CLI","fr":"Enregistrement d''Extensions Wix CLI","de":"Wix CLI-Erweiterungsregistrierung","pt":"Registro de Extensão Wix CLI","ru":"Регистрация расширения Wix CLI","ar":"تسجيل امتداد Wix CLI","en":"wix-cli-extension-registration"},"description":{"zh":"Wix CLI扩展注册是Wix应用开发的关键步骤，用于注册扩展以供Wix CLI识别","ja":"Wix CLI拡張機能の登録は、Wixアプリ開発の重要なステップであり、拡張機能をWix CLIに登録するために使用されます","ko":"Wix CLI 확장 등록은 Wix 애플리케이션 개발의 중요한 단계로, 확장을 Wix CLI에서 인식할 수 있도록 등록하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"El registro de extensiones Wix CLI es crucial para que sean reconocidas por la aplicación. Actualiza src/extensions.ts para importar y registrar extensiones.","fr":"L''enregistrement d''extensions Wix CLI est crucial pour qu''elles soient reconnues par l''application. Mettez à jour src/extensions.ts pour importer et enregist...","de":"Die Registrierung von Wix-CLI-Erweiterungen ist entscheidend, damit sie von der Anwendung erkannt werden. Aktualisieren Sie src/extensions.ts, um Erweiterung...","pt":"O registro de extensão Wix CLI é necessário para que as extensões sejam reconhecidas pelo Wix CLI. Isso é feito atualizando o arquivo src/extensions.ts.","ru":"Регистрация расширения Wix CLI необходима для того, чтобы расширения были распознаны Wix CLI. Это делается путем обновления файла src/extensions.ts.","ar":"تسجيل امتداد Wix CLI ضروري لكي يتم التعرف على الامتدادات بواسطة Wix CLI. يتم هذا عن طريق تحديث ملف src/extensions.ts.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["注册扩展以供Wix CLI识别","支持简单模式和高级模式","可以注册多个扩展","需要更新src/extensions.ts文件","支持Wix应用开发","可以提高开发效率"],"ja":["拡張機能をWix CLIに登録する","シンプルモードとアドバンストモードをサポート","複数の拡張機能を登録可能","src/extensions.tsファイルを更新する必要がある","Wixアプリ開発をサポート","開発効率を向上させることが可能"],"ko":["확장을 Wix CLI에서 인식할 수 있도록 등록","심플 모드와 고급 모드를 지원","여러 확장을 등록할 수 있음","src/extensions.ts 파일을 업데이트해야 함","Wix 애플리케이션 개발을 지원","개발 효율성을 높일 수 있음"],"es":["Actualización de src/extensions.ts","Importación de extensiones","Registro de extensiones","Reconocimiento de extensiones por la aplicación","Compatibilidad con Wix CLI"],"fr":["Mise à jour de src/extensions.ts","Importation d''extensions","Enregistrement d''extensions","Reconnaissance d''extensions par l''application","Compatibilité avec Wix CLI"],"de":["Aktualisierung von src/extensions.ts","Import von Erweiterungen","Registrierung von Erweiterungen","Erkennung von Erweiterungen durch die Anwendung","Kompatibilität mit Wix CLI"],"pt":["Atualização do arquivo src/extensions.ts","Registro de extensões para pequenos aplicativos","Uso do padrão simples para registro de extensões","Importação e registro de extensões diretamente","Compatibilidade com Wix CLI"],"ru":["Обновление файла src/extensions.ts","Регистрация расширений для небольших приложений","Использование простого шаблона для регистрации расширений","Импорт и регистрация расширений напрямую","Совместимость с Wix CLI"],"ar":["تحديث ملف src/extensions.ts","تسجيل امتدادات لبرامج الصغيرة","استخدام نمط بسيط لتسجيل الامتدادات","استيراد وتسجيل الامتدادات مباشرة","التوافق مع Wix CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Wix CLI扩展注册","Wix应用开发","扩展注册","Wix CLI","src/extensions.ts","开发效率","Wix开发工具","扩展功能"],"ja":["Wix CLI拡張機能の登録","Wixアプリ開発","拡張機能の登録","Wix CLI","src/extensions.ts","開発効率","Wix開発ツール","拡張機能"],"ko":["Wix CLI 확장 등록","Wix 애플리케이션 개발","확장 등록","Wix CLI","src/extensions.ts","개발 효율성","Wix 개발 도구","확장 기능"],"es":["Wix CLI","Registro de extensiones","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","src/extensions.ts","Importación de extensiones","Registro de extensiones Wix"],"fr":["Wix CLI","Enregistrement d''extensions","Développement d''applications","src/extensions.ts","Importation d''extensions","Enregistrement d''extensions Wix"],"de":["Wix CLI","Erweiterungsregistrierung","Anwendungsentwicklung","src/extensions.ts","Import von Erweiterungen","Wix-Erweiterungsregistrierung"],"pt":["Wix CLI","registro de extensão","src/extensions.ts","pequenos aplicativos","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Wix Astro","registro de extensões"],"ru":["Wix CLI","регистрация расширения","src/extensions.ts","небольшие приложения","разработка приложений","Wix Astro","регистрация расширений"],"ar":["Wix CLI","تسجيل امتداد","src/extensions.ts","برامج الصغيرة","تطوير البرامج","Wix Astro","تسجيل الامتدادات"]}},"owner":"weunica","repo":"payboxCLI-App","repoPath":"weunica/payboxCLI-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wix-cli-extension-registration","description":"Register Wix CLI extensions with the app in src/extensions.ts. Use when registering new or existing extensions with the main app builder.","bodyPreview":"# Wix App Registration\n\nAfter creating any extension file, you MUST update the main `src/extensions.ts` file to register the extension with the app. Without this step, the extension will not be recognized by Wix CLI.\n\n## Simple Pattern (Recommended for Small Apps)\n\n**`src/extensions.ts`** - Import and register extensions directly:\n\n```typescript\nimport { app } from \"@wix/astro/builders\";\nimport { dataExtension } from \"./data/extensions.ts\";\nimport { dashboardpageMyPage } from \"./dashboard/pages/","body":"# Wix App Registration\n\nAfter creating any extension file, you MUST update the main `src/extensions.ts` file to register the extension with the app. Without this step, the extension will not be recognized by Wix CLI.\n\n## Simple Pattern (Recommended for Small Apps)\n\n**`src/extensions.ts`** - Import and register extensions directly:\n\n```typescript\nimport { app } from \"@wix/astro/builders\";\nimport { dataExtension } from \"./data/extensions.ts\";\nimport { dashboardpageMyPage } from \"./dashboard/pages/my-page/extensions.ts\";\nimport { embeddedscriptMyScript } from \"./site/embedded-scripts/my-script/extensions.ts\";\n\nexport default app()\n  .use(dataExtension)\n  .use(dashboardpageMyPage)\n  .use(embeddedscriptMyScript);\n```\n\n**Steps for each new extension:**\n\n1. Import the extension from its `extensions.ts` file\n2. Add `.use(extensionName)` to the app chain\n3. Chain multiple extensions together\n\n## Advanced Pattern (For Large Apps)\n\n**`src/index.ts`** - Re-export all extensions:\n\n```typescript\nexport { dashboardpageMyPage } from \"./dashboard/pages/my-page/extensions\";\nexport { embeddedscriptMyScript } from \"./site/embedded-scripts/my-script/extensions\";\nexport { dataExtension } from \"./data/extensions\";\n```\n\n**`src/extensions.ts`** - Register all extensions programmatically:\n\n```typescript\nimport { app } from \"@wix/astro/builders\";\nimport * as allExtensions from \"./index\";\n\nconst extensionList = Object.values(allExtensions);\n\nconst appBuilder = app();\nextensionList.forEach((extension) => {\n  appBuilder.use(extension);\n});\n\nexport default appBuilder;\n```\n\n## Extension Types Without Registration\n\nThe following extension types do **not** require `extensions.ts` files:\n\n- **Backend API** - Astro server endpoints are auto-discovered\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\nExtension export names follow this pattern: `{extensiontype}{CamelCaseName}`\n\nExamples:\n\n- `dashboardpageCartPopupManager`\n- `embeddedscriptCouponPopup`\n- `sitewidgetCountdownWidget`\n- `sitepluginProductBadge`\n- `ecomshippingratesCustomShipping`\n\nThe type prefix is the extension type in lowercase with no separators.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:56:57.503Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Wix-focused AI Agents requiring seamless extension registration and integration with Wix CLI","zh":"适用于需要无缝扩展注册和与 Wix CLI 集成的 Wix 集中 AI Agent","ja":"Wix に焦点を当てた AI エージェントがシームレスな拡張機能の登録と Wix CLI との統合を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"Wix에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 무결점 확장 등록 및 Wix CLI와의 통합을 필요로 할 경우 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en Wix que requieren una registrazione y integración sin problemas con Wix CLI","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur Wix nécessitant une inscription et une intégration sans problème avec Wix CLI","de":"Ideal für Wix-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Erweiterungsregistrierung und -integration mit Wix CLI erfordern","pt":"Ideal for Wix-focused AI Agents requiring seamless extension registration and integration with Wix CLI","ru":"Ideal for Wix-focused AI Agents requiring seamless extension registration and integration with Wix CLI","ar":"Ideal for Wix-focused AI Agents requiring seamless extension registration and integration with Wix CLI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to register extensions with the Wix app by updating the main `src/extensions.ts` file, utilizing TypeScript and the `@wix/astro/builders` library to ensure recognition by Wix CLI","zh":"赋予代理注册扩展到 Wix 应用程序的能力，方法是更新主 `src/extensions.ts` 文件，利用 TypeScript 和 `@wix/astro/builders` 库以确保 Wix CLI 的识别","ja":"エージェントが Wix アプリケーションに拡張機能を登録できるようにし、TypeScript と `@wix/astro/builders` ライブラリを利用してメインの `src/extensions.ts` ファイルを更新し、Wix CLI によって認識されることを保証する","ko":"에이전트가 Wix 애플리케이션에 확장 기능을 등록할 수 있도록 하며, TypeScript 및 `@wix/astro/builders` 라이브러리를 사용하여 주요 `src/extensions.ts` 파일을 업데이트하여 Wix CLI에 의해 인식되도록 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a registrar extensiones con la aplicación Wix actualizando el archivo principal `src/extensions.ts`, utilizando TypeScript y la biblioteca `@wix/astro/builders` para garantizar el reconocimiento por Wix CLI","fr":"Permet aux agents d''enregistrer des extensions avec l''application Wix en mettant à jour le fichier principal `src/extensions.ts`, en utilisant TypeScript et la bibliothèque `@wix/astro/builders` pour assurer la reconnaissance par Wix CLI","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Erweiterungen mit der Wix-App zu registrieren, indem die Hauptdatei `src/extensions.ts` aktualisiert wird, wobei TypeScript und die Bibliothek `@wix/astro/builders` verwendet werden, um die Erkennung durch Wix CLI sicherzustellen","pt":"Empowers agents to register extensions with the Wix app by updating the main `src/extensions.ts` file, utilizing TypeScript and the `@wix/astro/builders` library to ensure recognition by Wix CLI","ru":"Empowers agents to register extensions with the Wix app by updating the main `src/extensions.ts` file, utilizing TypeScript and the `@wix/astro/builders` library to ensure recognition by Wix CLI","ar":"Empowers agents to register extensions with the Wix app by updating the main `src/extensions.ts` file, utilizing TypeScript and the `@wix/astro/builders` library to ensure recognition by Wix CLI"},"useCases":{"en":["Registering custom extensions for Wix apps","Updating `src/extensions.ts` files for seamless integration","Ensuring Wix CLI recognition of newly created extensions"],"zh":["为 Wix 应用程序注册自定义扩展","更新 `src/extensions.ts` 文件以实现无缝集成","确保 Wix CLI 识别新创建的扩展"],"ja":["Wix アプリケーションのカスタム拡張機能を登録する","`src/extensions.ts` ファイルを更新してシームレスな統合を実現する","新しく作成された拡張機能が Wix CLI によって認識されることを保証する"],"ko":["Wix 애플리케이션에 대한 사용자 지정 확장 기능 등록","`src/extensions.ts` 파일을 업데이트하여 무결점 통합을 구현","새로 созд된 확장 기능이 Wix CLI에 의해 인식되도록 보장"],"es":["Registro de extensiones personalizadas para aplicaciones Wix","Actualización de archivos `src/extensions.ts` para una integración sin problemas","Garantía del reconocimiento de Wix CLI de las extensiones recién creadas"],"fr":["Enregistrement d''extensions personnalisées pour les applications Wix","Mise à jour des fichiers `src/extensions.ts` pour une intégration sans problème","Assurance de la reconnaissance de Wix CLI des extensions récemment créées"],"de":["Registrierung benutzerdefinierter Erweiterungen für Wix-Apps","Aktualisierung von `src/extensions.ts`-Dateien für eine nahtlose Integration","Sicherstellung der Erkennung von Wix CLI für neu erstellte Erweiterungen"],"pt":["Registering custom extensions for Wix apps","Updating `src/extensions.ts` files for seamless integration","Ensuring Wix CLI recognition of newly created extensions"],"ru":["Registering custom extensions for Wix apps","Updating `src/extensions.ts` files for seamless integration","Ensuring Wix CLI recognition of newly created extensions"],"ar":["Registering custom extensions for Wix apps","Updating `src/extensions.ts` files for seamless integration","Ensuring Wix CLI recognition of newly created extensions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires updating the `src/extensions.ts` file manually","Limited to Wix app development environment","Dependent on `@wix/astro/builders` library"],"zh":["需要手动更新 `src/extensions.ts` 文件","仅限 Wix 应用程序开发环境","依赖于 `@wix/astro/builders` 库"],"ja":["`src/extensions.ts` ファイルを手動で更新する必要がある","Wix アプリケーションの開発環境のみ","`@wix/astro/builders` ライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["`src/extensions.ts` 파일을 수동으로 업데이트해야 함","Wix 애플리케이션 개발 환경에만 국한됨","`@wix/astro/builders` 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la actualización manual del archivo `src/extensions.ts`","Limitado al entorno de desarrollo de aplicaciones Wix","Dependiente de la biblioteca `@wix/astro/builders`"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise à jour manuelle du fichier `src/extensions.ts`","Limité à l''environnement de développement d''applications Wix","Dépendant de la bibliothèque `@wix/astro/builders`"],"de":["Erfordert manuelle Aktualisierung der Datei `src/extensions.ts`","Begrenzt auf die Wix-App-Entwicklungsumgebung","Abhängig von der Bibliothek `@wix/astro/builders`"],"pt":["Requires updating the `src/extensions.ts` file manually","Limited to Wix app development environment","Dependent on `@wix/astro/builders` library"],"ru":["Requires updating the `src/extensions.ts` file manually","Limited to Wix app development environment","Dependent on `@wix/astro/builders` library"],"ar":["Requires updating the `src/extensions.ts` file manually","Limited to Wix app development environment","Dependent on `@wix/astro/builders` library"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
