ue te guía en el uso del servidor Obsidian MCP para gestionar y proteger tus vaults","fr":"Obsidian MCP est une compétence qui vous guide dans l''utilisation du serveur Obsidian MCP pour gérer et protéger vos vaults","de":"Obsidian MCP ist eine Fähigkeit, die Sie bei der Verwendung des Obsidian-MCP-Servers zur Verwaltung und zum Schutz Ihrer Vault-Dateien unterstützt","pt":"O Obsidian MCP é uma habilidade que ajuda a gerenciar o vault do usuário de forma segura","ru":"Obsidian MCP — это навык, который помогает управлять хранилищем пользователя в безопасном режиме","ar":"Obsidian MCP هو مهارة تساعد في إدارة الخزنة للمستخدم بطريقة آمنة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["原子更新","前置元数据","批量操作","安全路径保护","元数据验证"],"ja":["原子更新","前置メタデータ","バッチ操作","安全パス保護","メタデータ検証"],"ko":["원자적 업데이트","전처리 메타데이터","일괄 작업","보안 경로 보호","메타데이터 검증"],"es":["Actualizaciones atómicas para cambios pequeños en archivos grandes","Validación de metadatos para garantizar la integridad de los datos","Operaciones por lotes para análisis eficientes","Gestión de metadatos con update_frontmatter y manage_tags","Protección de rutas seguras para evitar accesos no autorizados"],"fr":["Mises à jour atomiques pour des changements mineurs dans des fichiers importants","Validation des métadonnées pour garantir l''intégrité des données","Opérations par lots pour des analyses efficaces","Gestion des métadonnées avec update_frontmatter et manage_tags","Protection des chemins d''accès sécurisés pour éviter les accès non autorisés"],"de":["Atomare Updates für kleine Änderungen in großen Dateien","Validierung von Metadaten zur Gewährleistung der Datenintegrität","Batch-Operationen für effiziente Analysen","Verwaltung von Metadaten mit update_frontmatter und manage_tags","Schutz von sicheren Pfaden zur Verhinderung von unbefugtem Zugriff"],"pt":["Atualizações atômicas","Prioridade ao frontmatter","Operações em lote","Leitura de múltiplas notas","Validação de frontmatter","Controle de caminhos seguros"],"ru":["Атомарные обновления","Приоритет фронтматера","Пакетные операции","Чтение нескольких заметок","Валидация фронтматера","Контроль безопасных путей"],"ar":["تحديثات ذرية","أولوية الفرونتماتر","عمليات الدفع","قراءة الملاحظات المتعددة","تحقق الفرونتماتر","مراقبة المسارات الآمنة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Obsidian MCP","用户数据管理","原子更新","前置元数据","批量操作","安全路径保护","元数据验证"],"ja":["Obsidian MCP","ユーザーデータ管理","原子更新","前置メタデータ","バッチ操作","安全パス保護","メタデータ検証"],"ko":["Obsidian MCP","사용자 데이터 관리","원자적 업데이트","전처리 메타데이터","일괄 작업","보안 경로 보호","메타데이터 검증"],"es":["Obsidian MCP","gestión de vault","seguridad de datos","actualizaciones atómicas","validación de metadatos","operaciones por lotes","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Obsidian MCP","gestion de vault","sécurité des données","mises à jour atomiques","validation des métadonnées","opérations par lots","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Obsidian MCP","Vault-Verwaltung","Daten-Sicherheit","atomare Updates","Metadaten-Validierung","Batch-Operationen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["Obsidian MCP","gerenciamento de vault","segurança de dados","atualizações atômicas","frontmatter","operaciones em lote","leitura de notas","validação de metadados"],"ru":["Obsidian MCP","управление хранилищем","безопасность данных","атомарные обновления","фронтматер","пакетные операции","чтение заметок","валидация метаданных"],"ar":["Obsidian MCP","إدارة الخزنة","أمان البيانات","تحديثات ذرية","فرونتماتر","عمليات الدفع","قراءة الملاحظات","تحقق البيانات الوصفية"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"obsidian-mcp","description":"Guide for interacting with Obsidian vaults via MCP. Use when the user wants to read, write, search, manage tags, or organize notes within their Obsidian vault.","bodyPreview":"# Obsidian MCP Skill\n\nThis skill guides you in using the Obsidian MCP server to manage a user''s vault. The server protects the vault by enforcing safe paths and validating frontmatter.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1.  **Atomic Updates**: Prefer `patch_note` for making small changes to large files to avoid rewriting the entire content.\n2.  **Frontmatter First**: Use `update_frontmatter` or `manage_tags` when only metadata needs changing.\n3.  **Batch Operations**: Use `read_multiple_notes` when analyzing","body":"# Obsidian MCP Skill\n\nThis skill guides you in using the Obsidian MCP server to manage a user''s vault. The server protects the vault by enforcing safe paths and validating frontmatter.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1.  **Atomic Updates**: Prefer `patch_note` for making small changes to large files to avoid rewriting the entire content.\n2.  **Frontmatter First**: Use `update_frontmatter` or `manage_tags` when only metadata needs changing.\n3.  **Batch Operations**: Use `read_multiple_notes` when analyzing multiple related files (up to 10) to save roundtrips.\n4.  **Confirm Destructive Actions**: `delete_note` requires a `confirmPath` argument that matches the `path`.\n\n## API Reference\n\nFor detailed JSON schemas, argument lists, and return types, see [references/api.md](references/api.md).\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### 1. Efficient Editing (Making targeted changes)\n\nUse `patch_note` to replace specific text strings without rewriting the file.\n\n**Goal**: Add an equation to a specific section.\n**Tool**: `patch_note`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"path\": \"Physics/Relativity.md\",\n  \"oldString\": \"## Energy and Mass\",\n  \"newString\": \"## Energy and Mass\\n\\nE = mc²\",\n  \"prettyPrint\": false\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Creating Notes (New content)\n\nUse `write_note` (mode: `overwrite`) to create new files. The server handles directory creation automatically.\n\n**Goal**: Create a meeting note.\n**Tool**: `write_note`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"path\": \"Meetings/Team Sync.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# Team Sync\\n\\n- Discussed Q1 goals\\n- Action items assigned\",\n  \"frontmatter\": {\n      \"tags\": [\"meeting\", \"sync\"],\n      \"date\": \"2025-10-24\"\n  },\n  \"prettyPrint\": false\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Reading Multiple Notes (Research/Summary)\n\nUse `read_multiple_notes` to gather context from several files at once.\n\n**Goal**: Summarize a list of book notes.\n**Tool**: `read_multiple_notes`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"paths\": [\n    \"Reading/The Phoenix Project.md\",\n    \"Reading/Atomic Habits.md\",\n    \"Reading/Deep Work.md\"\n  ],\n  \"prettyPrint\": false\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Managing Metadata (Tags/Status)\n\nUse `update_frontmatter` or `manage_tags` to modify YAML metadata without touching the body content.\n\n**Goal**: Update status and add tags.\n**Tool**: `update_frontmatter`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"path\": \"Projects/Website Redesign.md\",\n  \"frontmatter\": {\n    \"tags\": [\"project\", \"web-design\", \"priority-high\"],\n    \"status\": \"in-progress\"\n  },\n  \"merge\": true,\n  \"prettyPrint\": false\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Searching Content\n\nUse `search_notes` to find relevant information.\n\n**Goal**: Find notes about \"React hooks\".\n**Tool**: `search_notes`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"query\": \"React hooks\",\n  \"limit\": 10,\n  \"searchContent\": true,\n  \"prettyPrint\": false\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:57:20.074Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Management Agents needing advanced Obsidian vault management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Obsidian 仓库管理功能的知识管理代理。","ja":"高度な Obsidian ボールト管理機能を必要とするナレッジマネジメントエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Obsidian 보관소 관리 기능이 필요한 지식 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión del Conocimiento que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión de bóvedas Obsidian.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion des connaissances ayant besoin de capacités avancées de gestion de coffres Obsidian.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die erweiterte Obsidian-Tresor-Verwaltungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que precisam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de cofre Obsidian.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления знаниями, которым необходимы расширенные возможности управления хранилищем Obsidian.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المعرفة الذين بحاجة إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة الخزنة Obsidian."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce safe paths and validate frontmatter using atomic updates, batch operations, and frontmatter-first approaches, leveraging the Obsidian MCP server for secure vault management and utilizing protocols like patch_note, update_frontmatter, and manage_tags.","zh":"赋予代理执行安全路径和验证前置内容，使用原子更新、批处理操作和前置内容优先方法，利用 Obsidian MCP 服务器进行安全的仓库管理，并使用 patch_note、update_frontmatter 和 manage_tags 等协议。","ja":"エージェントに安全なパスを強制し、前置コンテンツを検証することを可能にし、原子更新、バッチ操作、前置コンテンツ優先アプローチを使用し、Obsidian MCP サーバーを使用して安全なボールト管理を行い、patch_note、update_frontmatter、manage_tags などのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 안전한 경로를 강제하고 전면 콘텐츠를 검증할 수 있도록 하며, 원자적 업데이트와 일괄 작업 및 전면 콘텐츠 우선 접근 방식을 사용하며, Obsidian MCP 서버를 사용하여 보안 보관소 관리를 수행하며, patch_note, update_frontmatter 및 manage_tags 등의 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar rutas seguras y validar frontmatter utilizando actualizaciones atómicas, operaciones por lotes y enfoques de frontmatter primero, aprovechando el servidor Obsidian MCP para una gestión segura de bóvedas y utilizando protocolos como patch_note, update_frontmatter y manage_tags.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des chemins sûrs et de valider le frontmatter en utilisant des mises à jour atomiques, des opérations par lots et des approches de frontmatter en premier, en exploitant le serveur Obsidian MCP pour une gestion sécurisée des coffres et en utilisant des protocoles tels que patch_note, update_frontmatter et manage_tags.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, sichere Pfade durchzusetzen und Frontmatter zu validieren, indem sie atomare Updates, Batch-Operationen und Frontmatter-First-Ansätze nutzen, die Obsidian-MCP-Server für eine sichere Tresorverwaltung ausnutzen und Protokolle wie patch_note, update_frontmatter und manage_tags verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor caminhos seguros e validar frontmatter usando atualizações atômicas, operações em lote e abordagens de frontmatter primeiro, aproveitando o servidor Obsidian MCP para gerenciamento de cofre seguro e utilizando protocolos como patch_note, update_frontmatter e manage_tags.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать безопасные пути и проверять frontmatter с помощью атомарных обновлений, пакетных операций и подходов frontmatter-first, используя сервер Obsidian MCP для безопасного управления хранилищем и протоколы как patch_note, update_frontmatter и manage_tags.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض مسارات آمنة و التحقق من frontmatter باستخدام التحديثات الذرية وعمليات الدفع ونهج frontmatter-الأول، مستفيدا من خادم Obsidian MCP لإدارة الخزنة الآمنة واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل patch_note و update_frontmatter و manage_tags."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating vault updates with patch_note for efficient content management","Validating frontmatter to ensure data consistency across notes","Batch processing notes with read_multiple_notes for comprehensive analysis"],"zh":["使用 patch_note 自动化仓库更新以实现高效的内容管理","验证前置内容以确保笔记之间的数据一致性","使用 read_multiple_notes 批处理笔记以进行综合分析"],"ja":["patch_note を使用してボールトの更新を自動化し、効率的なコンテンツ管理を実現する","前置コンテンツを検証して、ノート間のデータの一貫性を確保する","read_multiple_notes を使用してノートをバッチ処理し、総合的な分析を実行する"],"ko":["patch_note를 사용하여 보관소 업데이트를 자동화하여 효율적인 콘텐츠 관리를 수행하는 것","전면 콘텐츠를 검증하여 노트 간의 데이터 일관성을 보장하는 것","read_multiple_notes를 사용하여 노트를 일괄 처리하여 종합적인 분석을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de bóvedas con patch_note para una gestión de contenido eficiente","Validar frontmatter para garantizar la coherencia de los datos en todas las notas","Procesar notas por lotes con read_multiple_notes para un análisis integral"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de coffres avec patch_note pour une gestion de contenu efficace","Valider le frontmatter pour assurer la cohérence des données dans toutes les notes","Traiter les notes par lots avec read_multiple_notes pour une analyse complète"],"de":["Automatisieren von Tresor-Updates mit patch_note für eine effiziente Inhaltsverwaltung","Validieren von Frontmatter, um die Datenkonsistenz in allen Notizen sicherzustellen","Verarbeiten von Notizen in Batches mit read_multiple_notes für eine umfassende Analyse"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de cofre com patch_note para gerenciamento de conteúdo eficiente","Validar frontmatter para garantir a consistência dos dados em notas","Processamento em lote de notas com read_multiple_notes para análise abrangente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления хранилища с помощью patch_note для эффективного управления контентом","Проверять frontmatter, чтобы обеспечить согласованность данных в заметках","Пакетная обработка заметок с read_multiple_notes для всестороннего анализа"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في تحديثات الخزنة مع patch_note لإدارة المحتوى الفعال","التحقق من frontmatter لضمان συνέافيه البيانات في الملاحظات","معالجة الملاحظات بشكل دوري مع read_multiple_notes للتحليل الشامل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Obsidian MCP server setup","Limited to Obsidian vault management","Dependent on frontmatter and safe path configurations"],"zh":["需要 Obsidian MCP 服务器设置","仅限 Obsidian 仓库管理","依赖于前置内容和安全路径配置"],"ja":["Obsidian MCP サーバーの設定が必要","Obsidian ボールト管理のみ","前置コンテンツと安全なパスの構成に依存する"],"ko":["Obsidian MCP 서버 설정이 필요함","Obsidian 보관소 관리에만 제한됨","전면 콘텐츠 및 안전한 경로 구성에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor Obsidian MCP","Limitado a la gestión de bóvedas Obsidian","Dependiente de la configuración de frontmatter y rutas seguras"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur Obsidian MCP","Limité à la gestion de coffres Obsidian","Dépendant de la configuration de frontmatter et de chemins sûrs"],"de":["Benötigt eine Einrichtung des Obsidian-MCP-Servers","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von Obsidian-Tresoren","Abhängig von der Konfiguration von Frontmatter und sicheren Pfaden"],"pt":["Requer configuração do servidor Obsidian MCP","Limitado ao gerenciamento de cofre Obsidian","Dependente de configurações de frontmatter e caminhos seguros"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервера Obsidian MCP","Ограничен управлением хранилищем Obsidian","Зависит от конфигураций frontmatter и безопасных путей"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم Obsidian MCP","محدود بإدارة الخزنة Obsidian","يعتمد على تكوين frontmatter و مسارات آمنة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
