description":{"zh":"Tauri v2 JavaScript 前端集成用于桌面应用开发，支持静态站点生成、单页应用和多页应用","ja":"Tauri v2 JavaScript フロントエンド統合は、デスクトップアプリ開発に使用され、静的サイト生成、シングルページアプリ、そしてマルチページアプリをサポートします","ko":"Tauri v2 JavaScript 프론트엔드 통합은 데스크톱 애플리케이션 개발에 사용되며, 정적 사이트 생성, 싱글 페이지 애플리케이션 및 멀티 페이지 애플리케이션을 지원합니다","es":"Esta habilidad cubre la integración de frameworks de frontend de JavaScript con Tauri v2 para el desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio","fr":"Cette compétence couvre l''intégration de frameworks de frontend JavaScript avec Tauri v2 pour le développement d''applications de bureau","de":"Diese Fähigkeit deckt die Integration von JavaScript-Frontend-Frameworks mit Tauri v2 für die Entwicklung von Desktop-Anwendungen ab","pt":"Integração de frontends JavaScript com Tauri v2 para desenvolvimento de aplicações de desktop","ru":"Интеграция фронтенда JavaScript с Tauri v2 для разработки настольных приложений","ar":"دمج واجهة المستخدم جافا سكريبت مع Tauri v2 لتنمية تطبيقات سطح المكتب","en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"definition":{"en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"features":{"zh":["静态站点生成支持","单页应用支持","多页应用支持","Tauri v2 与 JavaScript 前端框架集成","桌面应用开发"],"ja":["静的サイト生成のサポート","シングルページアプリのサポート","マルチページアプリのサポート","Tauri v2 と JavaScript フロントエンドフレームワークの統合","デスクトップアプリ開発"],"ko":["정적 사이트 생성 지원","싱글 페이지 애플리케이션 지원","멀티 페이지 애플리케이션 지원","Tauri v2와 JavaScript 프론트엔드 프레임워크 통합","데스크톱 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Integración de frameworks de frontend de JavaScript","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio con Tauri v2","Compatibilidad con Static Site Generation (SSG)","Compatibilidad con Single-Page Applications (SPA)","Compatibilidad con Multi-Page App","Arquitectura de frontend agnóstica"],"fr":["Intégration de frameworks de frontend JavaScript","Développement d''applications de bureau avec Tauri v2","Compatibilité avec la génération de sites statiques (SSG)","Compatibilité avec les applications à page unique (SPA)","Compatibilité avec les applications à plusieurs pages","Architecture de frontend agnostique"],"de":["Integration von JavaScript-Frontend-Frameworks","Entwicklung von Desktop-Anwendungen mit Tauri v2","Unterstützung für Static Site Generation (SSG)","Unterstützung für Single-Page-Anwendungen (SPA)","Unterstützung für Multi-Page-Apps","Frontend-agnostische Architektur"],"pt":["Integração com frameworks JavaScript","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de desktop","Suporte a Static Site Generation (SSG)","Suporte a Single-Page Applications (SPA)","Suporte a Multi-Page App","Arquitetura de frontend agnóstica"],"ru":["Интеграция с фреймворками JavaScript","Разработка настольных приложений","Поддержка Static Site Generation (SSG)","Поддержка Single-Page Applications (SPA)","Поддержка Multi-Page App","Архитектура фронтенда агностична"],"ar":["دمج مع إطارات جافا سكريبت","تنمية تطبيقات سطح المكتب","دعم إنتاج الموقع الثابت (SSG)","دعم تطبيقات صفحة واحدة (SPA)","دعم تطبيق صفحات متعددة","هندسة واجهة المستخدم محايدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tauri JS 前端集成","桌面应用开发","JavaScript 前端框架","Tauri v2","静态站点生成","单页应用","多页应用"],"ja":["Tauri JS フロントエンド統合","デスクトップアプリ開発","JavaScript フロントエンドフレームワーク","Tauri v2","静的サイト生成","シングルページアプリ","マルチページアプリ"],"ko":["Tauri JS 프론트엔드 통합","데스크톱 애플리케이션 개발","JavaScript 프론트엔드 프레임워크","Tauri v2","정적 사이트 생성","싱글 페이지 애플리케이션","멀티 페이지 애플리케이션"],"es":["Tauri v2","JavaScript","frontend","desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio","integración de frameworks","Static Site Generation","Single-Page Applications","Multi-Page App"],"fr":["Tauri v2","JavaScript","frontend","développement d''applications de bureau","intégration de frameworks","génération de sites statiques","applications à page unique","applications à plusieurs pages"],"de":["Tauri v2","JavaScript","Frontend","Entwicklung von Desktop-Anwendungen","Integration von Frameworks","Static Site Generation","Single-Page-Anwendungen","Multi-Page-Apps"],"pt":["Tauri","JavaScript","Frontend","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de desktop","Static Site Generation","Single-Page Applications","Multi-Page App","Integração de frontends"],"ru":["Tauri","JavaScript","Фронтенд","Разработка настольных приложений","Static Site Generation","Single-Page Applications","Multi-Page App","Интеграция фронтенда"],"ar":["Tauri","جافا سكريبت","واجهة المستخدم","تنمية تطبيقات سطح المكتب","إنتاج الموقع الثابت","تطبيقات صفحة واحدة","تطبيق صفحات متعددة","دمج واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"TheerasakPing","repo":"video-downloader-tauri","repoPath":"TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"integrating-tauri-js-frontends","description":"Guides Claude through configuring JavaScript frontend frameworks for Tauri v2 desktop applications, including Next.js, Nuxt, Qwik, SvelteKit, and Vite with proper SSG setup, tauri.conf.json settings, and framework-specific configurations.","bodyPreview":"# Tauri v2 JavaScript Frontend Integration\n\nThis skill covers integrating JavaScript frontend frameworks with Tauri v2 for desktop application development.\n\n## Core Architecture\n\nTauri functions as a static web host, serving HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and WASM files through a native webview. The framework is frontend-agnostic but requires specific configurations for optimal integration.\n\n### Supported Application Types\n\n- Static Site Generation (SSG)\n- Single-Page Applications (SPA)\n- Multi-Page App","body":"# Tauri v2 JavaScript Frontend Integration\n\nThis skill covers integrating JavaScript frontend frameworks with Tauri v2 for desktop application development.\n\n## Core Architecture\n\nTauri functions as a static web host, serving HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and WASM files through a native webview. The framework is frontend-agnostic but requires specific configurations for optimal integration.\n\n### Supported Application Types\n\n- Static Site Generation (SSG)\n- Single-Page Applications (SPA)\n- Multi-Page Applications (MPA)\n\n### Not Supported\n\nServer-side rendering (SSR) in its native form. All frameworks must be configured for static output.\n\n## General Requirements\n\n### Key Principles\n\n1. **Static Output Required**: Tauri cannot run a Node.js server - all content must be pre-built static files\n2. **Client-Server Architecture**: Implement proper client-server relationships between app and APIs (no hybrid SSR solutions)\n3. **Mobile Development**: Requires a development server hosting the frontend on your internal IP\n\n### Common tauri.conf.json Structure\n\n```json\n{\n  \"build\": {\n    \"beforeDevCommand\": \"<package-manager> dev\",\n    \"beforeBuildCommand\": \"<package-manager> build\",\n    \"devUrl\": \"http://localhost:<port>\",\n    \"frontendDist\": \"../<output-dir>\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nReplace `<package-manager>` with `npm run`, `yarn`, `pnpm`, or `deno task`.\n\n---\n\n## Framework Configurations\n\n### Vite (React, Vue, Svelte, Solid)\n\nVite is the recommended choice for SPA frameworks due to its fast development experience and simple configuration.\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"tsc && vite build\",\n    \"preview\": \"vite preview\",\n    \"tauri\": \"tauri\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### vite.config.ts\n\n```typescript\nimport { defineConfig } from ''vite'';\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  clearScreen: false,\n  server: {\n    port: 5173,\n    strictPort: true,\n    host: process.env.TAURI_DEV_HOST || ''localhost'',\n    watch: {\n      ignored: [''**/src-tauri/**''],\n    },\n  },\n  envPrefix: [''VITE_'', ''TAURI_ENV_*''],\n  build: {\n    target: process.env.TAURI_ENV_PLATFORM === ''windows'' ? ''chrome105'' : ''safari13'',\n    minify: process.env.TAURI_ENV_DEBUG ? false : ''esbuild'',\n    sourcemap: !!process.env.TAURI_ENV_DEBUG,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### tauri.conf.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"build\": {\n    \"beforeDevCommand\": \"npm run dev\",\n    \"beforeBuildCommand\": \"npm run build\",\n    \"devUrl\": \"http://localhost:5173\",\n    \"frontendDist\": \"../dist\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Next.js\n\nNext.js requires static export mode since Tauri cannot run Node.js servers.\n\n#### Critical Requirements\n\n- Must use `output: ''export''` in next.config\n- Images must be unoptimized for static export\n- Asset prefix required for development server\n\n#### next.config.mjs\n\n```javascript\nconst isProd = process.env.NODE_ENV === ''production'';\nconst internalHost = process.env.TAURI_DEV_HOST || ''localhost'';\n\n/** @type {import(''next'').NextConfig} */\nconst nextConfig = {\n  output: ''export'',\n  images: {\n    unoptimized: true,\n  },\n  assetPrefix: isProd ? undefined : `http://${internalHost}:3000`,\n};\n\nexport default nextConfig;\n```\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"next dev\",\n    \"build\": \"next build\",\n    \"start\": \"next start\",\n    \"tauri\": \"tauri\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### tauri.conf.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"build\": {\n    \"beforeDevCommand\": \"npm run dev\",\n    \"beforeBuildCommand\": \"npm run build\",\n    \"devUrl\": \"http://localhost:3000\",\n    \"frontendDist\": \"../out\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### SSG Considerations for Next.js\n\n- The `out` directory contains static exports\n- Dynamic routes require `generateStaticParams()`\n- API routes are not supported - use Tauri commands instead\n- `next/image` optimization is disabled; use standard `<img>` or configure unoptimized\n\n---\n\n### Nuxt\n\nNuxt must run in SSG mode with `ssr: false` for Tauri compatibility.\n\n#### nuxt.config.ts\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  ssr: false,\n  telemetry: false,\n  devServer: {\n    host: ''0.0.0.0'', // Required for iOS device compatibility\n  },\n  vite: {\n    clearScreen: false,\n    envPrefix: [''VITE_'', ''TAURI_''],\n    server: {\n      strictPort: true,\n      watch: {\n        ignored: [''**/src-tauri/**''],\n      },\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"nuxt dev\",\n    \"build\": \"nuxt build\",\n    \"generate\": \"nuxt generate\",\n    \"tauri\": \"tauri\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### tauri.conf.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"build\": {\n    \"beforeDevCommand\": \"npm run dev\",\n    \"beforeBuildCommand\": \"npm run generate\",\n    \"devUrl\": \"http://localhost:3000\",\n    \"frontendDist\": \"../dist\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### SSG Considerations for Nuxt\n\n- Use `nuxt generate` for production builds (creates static files)\n- Server routes (`/server/api`) are not available - use Tauri commands\n- Nitro server functionality is disabled in SSG mode\n\n---\n\n### SvelteKit\n\nSvelteKit requires the static adapter and SSR must be disabled.\n\n#### Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install --save-dev @sveltejs/adapter-static\n```\n\n#### svelte.config.js\n\n```javascript\nimport adapter from ''@sveltejs/adapter-static'';\nimport { vitePreprocess } from ''@sveltejs/vite-plugin-svelte'';\n\n/** @type {import(''@sveltejs/kit'').Config} */\nconst config = {\n  preprocess: vitePreprocess(),\n  kit: {\n    adapter: adapter({\n      fallback: ''index.html'',\n    }),\n  },\n};\n\nexport default config;\n```\n\n#### src/routes/+layout.ts\n\n```typescript\nexport const ssr = false;\nexport const prerender = true;\n```\n\n#### vite.config.ts\n\n```typescript\nimport { sveltekit } from ''@sveltejs/kit/vite'';\nimport { defineConfig } from ''vite'';\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [sveltekit()],\n  clearScreen: false,\n  server: {\n    port: 5173,\n    strictPort: true,\n    host: process.env.TAURI_DEV_HOST || ''localhost'',\n    watch: {\n      ignored: [''**/src-tauri/**''],\n    },\n  },\n  envPrefix: [''VITE_'', ''TAURI_ENV_*''],\n});\n```\n\n#### tauri.conf.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"build\": {\n    \"beforeDevCommand\": \"npm run dev\",\n    \"beforeBuildCommand\": \"npm run build\",\n    \"devUrl\": \"http://localhost:5173\",\n    \"frontendDist\": \"../build\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### SSG Considerations for SvelteKit\n\n- SPA mode (without prerendering) is recommended for full Tauri API access in load functions\n- With prerendering, load functions execute at build time without Tauri API access\n- The `fallback: ''index.html''` enables SPA routing\n- Output directory is `build/` by default\n\n---\n\n### Qwik\n\nQwik requires the static adapter for Tauri compatibility.\n\n#### Setup\n\n```bash\n# Create project\nnpm create qwik@latest\ncd <project>\n\n# Add static adapter\nnpm run qwik add static\n\n# Add Tauri CLI\nnpm install -D @tauri-apps/cli@latest\n\n# Initialize Tauri\nnpm run tauri init\n```\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"qwik build\",\n    \"tauri\": \"tauri\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### tauri.conf.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"build\": {\n    \"beforeDevCommand\": \"npm run dev\",\n    \"beforeBuildCommand\": \"npm run build\",\n    \"devUrl\": \"http://localhost:5173\",\n    \"frontendDist\": \"../dist\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### SSG Considerations for Qwik\n\n- The static adapter is mandatory\n- Qwik City server functions are not available\n- Use Tauri commands for backend functionality\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference Table\n\n| Framework  | Output Dir | Dev Port | Build Command     | Key Config                    |\n|------------|------------|----------|-------------------|-------------------------------|\n| Vite       | `dist`     | 5173     | `vite build`      | Standard Vite config          |\n| Next.js    | `out`      | 3000     | `next build`      | `output: ''export''`            |\n| Nuxt       | `dist`     | 3000     | `nuxt generate`   | `ssr: false`                  |\n| SvelteKit  | `build`    | 5173     | `vite build`      | `adapter-static`              |\n| Qwik       | `dist`     | 5173     | `qwik build`      | Static adapter                |\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues and Solutions\n\n### Issue: Assets Not Loading in Development\n\n**Cause**: Asset prefix not configured for development server.\n\n**Solution**: Configure asset prefix to point to dev server (see Next.js config example).\n\n### Issue: Tauri APIs Unavailable\n\n**Cause**: Code executing during SSG build time instead of runtime.\n\n**Solution**:\n- Disable prerendering for pages using Tauri APIs\n- Use dynamic imports with `ssr: false`\n- Check for `window.__TAURI__` before API calls\n\n### Issue: Hot Reload Not Working\n\n**Cause**: File watcher including `src-tauri` directory.\n\n**Solution**: Add `**/src-tauri/**` to watch ignore list in Vite config.\n\n### Issue: Mobile Development Fails\n\n**Cause**: Dev server not accessible on network.\n\n**Solution**: Set host to `0.0.0.0` or use `TAURI_DEV_HOST` environment variable.\n\n### Issue: Build Fails with SSR Errors\n\n**Cause**: Framework attempting server-side rendering.\n\n**Solution**: Ensure SSR is disabled:\n- Next.js: `output: ''export''`\n- Nuxt: `ssr: false`\n- SvelteKit: `export const ssr = false` in layout\n- Qwik: Use static adapter\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n### Tauri-Provided Variables\n\n| Variable              | Description                                      |\n|-----------------------|--------------------------------------------------|\n| `TAURI_DEV_HOST`      | Host IP for mobile development                   |\n| `TAURI_ENV_PLATFORM`  | Target platform (windows, macos, linux, ios, android) |\n| `TAURI_ENV_DEBUG`     | Set during debug builds                          |\n\n### Recommended envPrefix\n\n```typescript\nenvPrefix: [''VITE_'', ''TAURI_ENV_*'']\n```\n\n---\n\n## Build Targets\n\nConfigure build targets based on platform webview capabilities:\n\n```typescript\nbuild: {\n  target: process.env.TAURI_ENV_PLATFORM === ''windows''\n    ? ''chrome105''  // WebView2 on Windows\n    : ''safari13'',  // WebKit on macOS/Linux\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mobile Development\n\nFor iOS and Android development, the dev server must be accessible on the network:\n\n```typescript\nserver: {\n  host: process.env.TAURI_DEV_HOST || ''0.0.0.0'',\n  strictPort: true,\n}\n```\n\nRun with the appropriate mobile command:\n```bash\nnpm run tauri ios dev\nnpm run tauri android dev\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:57:32.296Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cross-Platform Agents seeking to integrate JavaScript frontends with Tauri v2 for seamless desktop application development.","zh":"适用于寻求将JavaScript前端与Tauri v2集成以实现无缝桌面应用开发的跨平台代理。","ja":"Tauri v2とJavaScriptフロントエンドを統合してシームレスなデスクトップアプリケーション開発を行うクロスプラットフォームエージェントに最適。","ko":"Tauri v2와 자바스크립트 프론트엔드를 통합하여 무шов한 데스크톱 애플리케이션 개발을 수행하는 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Plataforma Cruzada que buscan integrar frontends de JavaScript con Tauri v2 para un desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio sin problemas.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Plateforme Croisée qui cherchent à intégrer des interfaces frontend JavaScript avec Tauri v2 pour un développement d''applications de bureau sans accroc.","de":"Ideal für Cross-Platform-Agents, die JavaScript-Frontends mit Tauri v2 für eine nahtlose Entwicklung von Desktop-Anwendungen integrieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Plataforma Cruzada que buscam integrar frontends JavaScript com Tauri v2 para desenvolvimento de aplicativos de desktop sem interrupções.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кроссплатформенной разработки, стремящихся интегрировать фронтенд JavaScript с Tauri v2 для бесшовного разработки настольных приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء متعددة المنصات الذين يسعون إلى دمج واجهات المستخدم الأمامية JavaScript مع Tauri v2 لتطوير تطبيقات سطح المكتب دون انقطاع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop desktop applications using Tauri + React + Rust, serving HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and WASM files through a native webview, and supporting Static Site Generation, Single-Page Applications, and Multi-Page Apps.","zh":"赋予代理开发使用Tauri + React + Rust的桌面应用，通过原生网页视图提供HTML、CSS、JavaScript和WASM文件，并支持静态站点生成、单页应用和多页应用。","ja":"エージェントにTauri + React + Rustを使用したデスクトップアプリケーションを開発する力を与え、ネイティブWebビューを介してHTML、CSS、JavaScript、WASMファイルを提供し、静的サイト生成、シングルページアプリケーション、複数ページアプリケーションをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Tauri + React + Rust를 사용하여 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있도록 해주며, 네이티브 웹뷰를 통해 HTML, CSS, 자바스크립트 및 WASM 파일을 제공하고, 정적 사이트 생성, 싱글 페이지 애플리케이션 및 멀티 페이지 애플리케이션을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar aplicaciones de escritorio utilizando Tauri + React + Rust, sirviendo archivos HTML, CSS, JavaScript y WASM a través de una vista web nativa, y admitiendo Generación de Sitios Estáticos, Aplicaciones de Página Única y Aplicaciones de Multi-Página.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications de bureau en utilisant Tauri + React + Rust, en servant des fichiers HTML, CSS, JavaScript et WASM via une vue web native, et en prenant en charge la Génération de Sites Statiques, les Applications à Page Unique et les Applications à Multi-Pages.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Desktop-Anwendungen mit Tauri + React + Rust zu entwickeln, die HTML-, CSS-, JavaScript- und WASM-Dateien über eine native Webansicht bereitstellen und die statische Seitengenerierung, Single-Page-Anwendungen und Multi-Page-Anwendungen unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicativos de desktop usando Tauri + React + Rust, servindo arquivos HTML, CSS, JavaScript e WASM por meio de uma visualização web nativa, e suportando Geração de Sites Estáticos, Aplicativos de Página Única e Aplicativos de Múltiplas Páginas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разработки настольных приложений с использованием Tauri + React + Rust, обслуживающих файлы HTML, CSS, JavaScript и WASM через родную веб-просмотр, и поддерживающих Статичную Генерацию Сайтов, Одностраничные Приложения и Многостраничные Приложения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير تطبيقات سطح المكتب باستخدام Tauri + React + Rust، وتقديم ملفات HTML و CSS و JavaScript و WASM من خلال عرض ويب أصلي، ودعم generar сайتات ثابتة وتطبيقات صفحة واحدة وتطبيقات متعددة الصفحات."},"useCases":{"en":["Building video downloader apps with Tauri and React","Integrating JavaScript frontend frameworks with Tauri v2 for cross-platform compatibility","Developing desktop applications with Rust and JavaScript"],"zh":["使用Tauri和React构建视频下载器应用","将JavaScript前端框架与Tauri v2集成以实现跨平台兼容性","使用Rust和JavaScript开发桌面应用"],"ja":["TauriとReactを使用したビデオダウンローダーアプリの構築","JavaScriptフロントエンドフレームワークをTauri v2と統合してクロスプラットフォーム互換性を実現","RustとJavaScriptを使用したデスクトップアプリケーションの開発"],"ko":["Tauri와 React를 사용하여 비디오 다운로더 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","자바스크립트 프론트엔드 프레임워크를 Tauri v2와 통합하여 크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 구현하는 것","Rust와 자바스크립트를 사용하여 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones de descarga de videos con Tauri y React","Integrar frameworks frontend de JavaScript con Tauri v2 para la compatibilidad entre plataformas","Desarrollar aplicaciones de escritorio con Rust y JavaScript"],"fr":["Construire des applications de téléchargement de vidéos avec Tauri et React","Intégrer des frameworks frontend JavaScript avec Tauri v2 pour la compatibilité entre plateformes","Développer des applications de bureau avec Rust et JavaScript"],"de":["Erstellen von Videodownloader-Apps mit Tauri und React","Integrieren von JavaScript-Frontend-Frameworks mit Tauri v2 für Cross-Platform-Kompatibilität","Entwickeln von Desktop-Anwendungen mit Rust und JavaScript"],"pt":["Construir aplicativos de downloader de vídeo com Tauri e React","Integrar estruturas de frontend JavaScript com Tauri v2 para compatibilidade entre plataformas","Desenvolver aplicativos de desktop com Rust e JavaScript"],"ru":["Построение приложений для скачивания видео с помощью Tauri и React","Интеграция фронтенд-фреймворков JavaScript с Tauri v2 для кроссплатформенной совместимости","Разработка настольных приложений с помощью Rust и JavaScript"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات لتنزيل الفيديو مع Tauri و React","دمج إطارات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية JavaScript مع Tauri v2 لتوافق متعددة المنصات","تطوير تطبيقات سطح المكتب باستخدام Rust و JavaScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tauri v2 and compatible frontend frameworks","Limited to desktop application development"],"zh":["需要Tauri v2和兼容的前端框架","仅限于桌面应用开发"],"ja":["Tauri v2と互換性のあるフロントエンドフレームワークが必要","デスクトップアプリケーション開発のみ"],"ko":["Tauri v2 및 호환 프론트엔드 프레임워크가 필요합니다.","데스크톱 애플리케이션 개발만 해당"],"es":["Requiere Tauri v2 y frameworks frontend compatibles","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio"],"fr":["Nécessite Tauri v2 et des frameworks frontend compatibles","Limité au développement d''applications de bureau"],"de":["Benötigt Tauri v2 und kompatible Frontend-Frameworks","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Desktop-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer Tauri v2 e estruturas de frontend compatíveis","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicativos de desktop"],"ru":["Требует Tauri v2 и совместимых фронтенд-фреймворков","Ограничен разработкой настольных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب Tauri v2 وإطارات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المتوافقة","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات سطح المكتب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
