ت","TDD","استراتيجيات الاختبار","الاختبارات الوحدوية","الاختبارات الشاملة","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"aiyuekuang","repo":"LLMProxy","repoPath":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing","description":"Write comprehensive tests using TDD methodology. Use for unit tests, integration tests, E2E tests with Playwright, and Go testing.","bodyPreview":"# Testing Skill\n\nTest-driven development and comprehensive testing strategies for frontend and backend code.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing unit tests for new features\n- Creating E2E tests with Playwright\n- Testing Go handlers and services\n- Debugging test failures\n- Improving test coverage\n\n---\n\n# 🧪 Test-Driven Development (TDD)\n\n## The TDD Cycle\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  1. RED: Write failing test         │\n│         ↓                           │\n│  2. GREEN: Writ","body":"# Testing Skill\n\nTest-driven development and comprehensive testing strategies for frontend and backend code.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing unit tests for new features\n- Creating E2E tests with Playwright\n- Testing Go handlers and services\n- Debugging test failures\n- Improving test coverage\n\n---\n\n# 🧪 Test-Driven Development (TDD)\n\n## The TDD Cycle\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  1. RED: Write failing test         │\n│         ↓                           │\n│  2. GREEN: Write minimal code       │\n│         ↓                           │\n│  3. REFACTOR: Clean up code         │\n│         ↓                           │\n│  (Repeat)                           │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## TDD Benefits\n\n- Forces you to think about design first\n- Produces testable, modular code\n- Provides instant regression safety\n- Documents expected behavior\n\n---\n\n# 🎯 Frontend Testing\n\n## Unit Testing (Vitest + Testing Library)\n\n### Setup\n```bash\nnpm install -D vitest @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom jsdom\n```\n\n### Configuration (vitest.config.ts)\n```typescript\nimport { defineConfig } from ''vitest/config'';\nimport react from ''@vitejs/plugin-react'';\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [react()],\n  test: {\n    environment: ''jsdom'',\n    setupFiles: ''./src/test/setup.ts'',\n    globals: true,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Component Test Example\n```tsx\nimport { render, screen, fireEvent, waitFor } from ''@testing-library/react'';\nimport userEvent from ''@testing-library/user-event'';\nimport { LoginForm } from ''./LoginForm'';\n\ndescribe(''LoginForm'', () => {\n  it(''submits form with valid credentials'', async () => {\n    const onSubmit = vi.fn();\n    render(<LoginForm onSubmit={onSubmit} />);\n\n    await userEvent.type(screen.getByLabelText(/email/i), ''test@example.com'');\n    await userEvent.type(screen.getByLabelText(/password/i), ''password123'');\n    await userEvent.click(screen.getByRole(''button'', { name: /submit/i }));\n\n    await waitFor(() => {\n      expect(onSubmit).toHaveBeenCalledWith({\n        email: ''test@example.com'',\n        password: ''password123'',\n      });\n    });\n  });\n\n  it(''shows validation error for invalid email'', async () => {\n    render(<LoginForm onSubmit={vi.fn()} />);\n\n    await userEvent.type(screen.getByLabelText(/email/i), ''invalid-email'');\n    await userEvent.click(screen.getByRole(''button'', { name: /submit/i }));\n\n    expect(screen.getByText(/invalid email/i)).toBeInTheDocument();\n  });\n\n  it(''disables submit button while loading'', () => {\n    render(<LoginForm onSubmit={vi.fn()} loading />);\n    expect(screen.getByRole(''button'', { name: /submit/i })).toBeDisabled();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Hook Testing\n```tsx\nimport { renderHook, act } from ''@testing-library/react'';\nimport { useCounter } from ''./useCounter'';\n\ndescribe(''useCounter'', () => {\n  it(''increments counter'', () => {\n    const { result } = renderHook(() => useCounter());\n\n    act(() => {\n      result.current.increment();\n    });\n\n    expect(result.current.count).toBe(1);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🎭 E2E Testing (Playwright)\n\n## Setup\n```bash\nnpm init playwright@latest\n```\n\n## Configuration (playwright.config.ts)\n```typescript\nimport { defineConfig, devices } from ''@playwright/test'';\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  testDir: ''./e2e'',\n  fullyParallel: true,\n  forbidOnly: !!process.env.CI,\n  retries: process.env.CI ? 2 : 0,\n  workers: process.env.CI ? 1 : undefined,\n  reporter: ''html'',\n  use: {\n    baseURL: ''http://localhost:3000'',\n    trace: ''on-first-retry'',\n    screenshot: ''only-on-failure'',\n  },\n  projects: [\n    { name: ''chromium'', use: { ...devices[''Desktop Chrome''] } },\n    { name: ''firefox'', use: { ...devices[''Desktop Firefox''] } },\n    { name: ''webkit'', use: { ...devices[''Desktop Safari''] } },\n  ],\n  webServer: {\n    command: ''npm run dev'',\n    url: ''http://localhost:3000'',\n    reuseExistingServer: !process.env.CI,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Page Object Model\n```typescript\n// e2e/pages/LoginPage.ts\nimport { Page, Locator } from ''@playwright/test'';\n\nexport class LoginPage {\n  readonly page: Page;\n  readonly emailInput: Locator;\n  readonly passwordInput: Locator;\n  readonly submitButton: Locator;\n  readonly errorMessage: Locator;\n\n  constructor(page: Page) {\n    this.page = page;\n    this.emailInput = page.getByLabel(''Email'');\n    this.passwordInput = page.getByLabel(''Password'');\n    this.submitButton = page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Sign in'' });\n    this.errorMessage = page.getByRole(''alert'');\n  }\n\n  async goto() {\n    await this.page.goto(''/login'');\n  }\n\n  async login(email: string, password: string) {\n    await this.emailInput.fill(email);\n    await this.passwordInput.fill(password);\n    await this.submitButton.click();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## E2E Test Example\n```typescript\nimport { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';\nimport { LoginPage } from ''./pages/LoginPage'';\n\ntest.describe(''Authentication'', () => {\n  test(''successful login redirects to dashboard'', async ({ page }) => {\n    const loginPage = new LoginPage(page);\n    await loginPage.goto();\n    await loginPage.login(''user@example.com'', ''validpassword'');\n\n    await expect(page).toHaveURL(''/dashboard'');\n    await expect(page.getByText(''Welcome'')).toBeVisible();\n  });\n\n  test(''invalid credentials show error'', async ({ page }) => {\n    const loginPage = new LoginPage(page);\n    await loginPage.goto();\n    await loginPage.login(''user@example.com'', ''wrongpassword'');\n\n    await expect(loginPage.errorMessage).toHaveText(''Invalid credentials'');\n    await expect(page).toHaveURL(''/login'');\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## API Testing with Playwright\n```typescript\nimport { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';\n\ntest.describe(''API Tests'', () => {\n  test(''GET /api/users returns user list'', async ({ request }) => {\n    const response = await request.get(''/api/users'');\n    \n    expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy();\n    const data = await response.json();\n    expect(data.users).toBeInstanceOf(Array);\n  });\n\n  test(''POST /api/users creates user'', async ({ request }) => {\n    const response = await request.post(''/api/users'', {\n      data: { name: ''Test User'', email: ''test@example.com'' },\n    });\n\n    expect(response.status()).toBe(201);\n    const user = await response.json();\n    expect(user.id).toBeDefined();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔧 Go Testing\n\n## Table-Driven Tests\n```go\nfunc TestParseConfig(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name    string\n        input   string\n        want    *Config\n        wantErr bool\n    }{\n        {\n            name:  \"valid config\",\n            input: `{\"port\": 8080}`,\n            want:  &Config{Port: 8080},\n        },\n        {\n            name:    \"invalid json\",\n            input:   `{invalid}`,\n            wantErr: true,\n        },\n        {\n            name:    \"empty input\",\n            input:   \"\",\n            wantErr: true,\n        },\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.name, func(t *testing.T) {\n            got, err := ParseConfig(tt.input)\n            \n            if tt.wantErr {\n                assert.Error(t, err)\n                return\n            }\n            \n            assert.NoError(t, err)\n            assert.Equal(t, tt.want, got)\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## HTTP Handler Testing\n```go\nfunc TestHandler_GetUser(t *testing.T) {\n    // Setup\n    mockStore := &MockUserStore{\n        users: map[string]*User{\n            \"123\": {ID: \"123\", Name: \"Test User\"},\n        },\n    }\n    handler := NewHandler(mockStore)\n\n    // Create request\n    req := httptest.NewRequest(\"GET\", \"/users/123\", nil)\n    req = mux.SetURLVars(req, map[string]string{\"id\": \"123\"})\n    w := httptest.NewRecorder()\n\n    // Execute\n    handler.GetUser(w, req)\n\n    // Assert\n    assert.Equal(t, http.StatusOK, w.Code)\n    \n    var response User\n    err := json.Unmarshal(w.Body.Bytes(), &response)\n    assert.NoError(t, err)\n    assert.Equal(t, \"Test User\", response.Name)\n}\n```\n\n## Mocking with Interfaces\n```go\n// Define interface\ntype UserStore interface {\n    GetUser(id string) (*User, error)\n    CreateUser(user *User) error\n}\n\n// Mock implementation\ntype MockUserStore struct {\n    users map[string]*User\n    err   error\n}\n\nfunc (m *MockUserStore) GetUser(id string) (*User, error) {\n    if m.err != nil {\n        return nil, m.err\n    }\n    user, ok := m.users[id]\n    if !ok {\n        return nil, ErrNotFound\n    }\n    return user, nil\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Tests\n```go\n//go:build integration\n\nfunc TestDatabase_Integration(t *testing.T) {\n    if testing.Short() {\n        t.Skip(\"skipping integration test\")\n    }\n\n    db := setupTestDB(t)\n    defer db.Close()\n\n    // Test actual database operations\n    user := &User{Name: \"Test\"}\n    err := db.CreateUser(user)\n    assert.NoError(t, err)\n    assert.NotEmpty(t, user.ID)\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# ❌ Testing Anti-Patterns\n\n## Avoid These\n\n1. **Testing implementation, not behavior**\n```go\n// ❌ Bad: Testing internal state\nassert.Equal(t, 3, len(cache.items))\n\n// ✅ Good: Testing behavior\nresult, err := cache.Get(\"key\")\nassert.NoError(t, err)\nassert.Equal(t, expectedValue, result)\n```\n\n2. **Flaky tests**\n```typescript\n// ❌ Bad: Time-dependent\nexpect(Date.now() - startTime).toBeLessThan(100);\n\n// ✅ Good: Mock time\nvi.useFakeTimers();\nvi.setSystemTime(new Date(''2024-01-01''));\n```\n\n3. **Tests that don''t clean up**\n```go\n// ✅ Good: Always cleanup\nfunc TestWithTempFile(t *testing.T) {\n    f, err := os.CreateTemp(\"\", \"test\")\n    require.NoError(t, err)\n    defer os.Remove(f.Name())  // Cleanup\n    \n    // Test logic\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📚 References\n\n- [anthropics/webapp-testing](https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/skills/webapp-testing)\n- [obra/test-driven-development](https://github.com/obra/superpowers/blob/main/skills/test-driven-development/SKILL.md)\n- [trailofbits/property-based-testing](https://github.com/trailofbits/skills/tree/main/plugins/property-based-testing)\n- [lackeyjb/playwright-skill](https://github.com/lackeyjb/playwright-skill)\n- [Playwright Documentation](https://playwright.dev/docs/intro)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:57:58.534Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for QA Automation Agents needing comprehensive test coverage across frontend and backend systems.","zh":"非常适合需要在前端和后端系统中进行全面测试覆盖的QA自动化代理。","ja":"フロントエンドとバックエンドのシステム全体で包括的なテストカバレッジが必要なQA自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"프론트엔드와 백엔드 시스템 전체에서 포괄적인 테스트 커버리지가 필요한 QA 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de QA que necesitan una cobertura de prueba integral en sistemas frontend y backend.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de QA qui nécessitent une couverture de test complète sur les systèmes frontend et backend.","de":"Perfekt für QA-Automationsagenten, die eine umfassende Testabdeckung über Frontend- und Backendsysteme benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de QA que necessitam de cobertura de teste abrangente em sistemas frontend e backend.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации QA, которым требуется всесторонняя проверка тестов на фронте и бэкенде.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين لتحقيق جودة ضمان الجودة الذين يحتاجون إلى تغطية شاملة للاختبار عبر أنظمة الواجهة الأمامية والخلفية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables seamless test-driven development workflows with support for both unit testing and Playwright-powered E2E testing. Provides intelligent debugging capabilities for test failures and coverage analysis for Go handlers and services.","zh":"能够实现无缝的测试驱动开发工作流，支持单元测试和Playwright驱动的E2E测试。提供智能调试功能用于测试失败和Go处理程序及服务的代码覆盖率分析。","ja":"シームレスなテスト駆動開発ワークフローを実現し、ユニットテストとPlaywright駆動のE2Eテストの両方をサポートします。テストの失敗とGoハンドラおよびサービスに対するコードカバレッジ分析のためのインテリジェントなデバッグ機能を提供します。","ko":" 无缝한 테스트 주도 개발 워크플로를 지원하며, 단위 테스트와 Playwright 驱动의 E2E 테스트를 모두 지원합니다. 테스트 실패와 Go 핸들러 및 서비스에 대한 코드 커버리지 분석을 위한 지능형 디버깅 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite flujos de trabajo de desarrollo dirigido por pruebas de forma fluida con soporte tanto para pruebas unitarias como para pruebas E2E con Playwright. Proporciona capacidades de depuración inteligentes para fallos de pruebas y análisis de cobertura para controladores y servicios de Go.","fr":"Permet des flux de travail de développement dirigé par des tests de manière fluide avec un support pour les tests unitaires et les tests E2E avec Playwright. Fournit des capacités de débogage intelligentes pour les échecs de tests et l''analyse de la couverture pour les gestionnaires et les services Go.","de":"Ermöglicht eine nahtlose Test-getriebene Entwicklung mit Unterstützung für Einheitstests und Playwright-aktivierte E2E-Tests. Bietet intelligente Fehlersuche-Funktionen für Testfehler und Abdeckungsanalyse für Go-Handler und -Dienste.","pt":"Permite fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento orientado a testes sem interrupções, com suporte tanto para testes unitários quanto para testes E2E com Playwright. Fornece capacidades de depuração inteligentes para falhas de teste e análise de cobertura para manipuladores e serviços Go.","ru":"Позволяет создавать бесшовные рабочие процессы разработки, управляемой тестами, с поддержкой как модульного тестирования, так и тестирования E2E с помощью Playwright. Предоставляет интеллектуальные возможности отладки для сбоев тестирования и анализ покрытия для обработчиков и сервисов Go.","ar":"يمكّن سلاسل عمل متطورة لتحقيق جودة ضمان الجودة دون انقطاع، مع دعم للاختبارات الوحدوية واختبارات النهاية إلى النهاية التي تعمل بتقنية Playwright. يوفر مقدرات فك شفرة ذكية لفشل الاختبارات وتحليل الغطاء لمنفذين وخدمات Go."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing unit tests for new features","Creating E2E tests with Playwright","Testing Go handlers and services","Debugging test failures","Improving test coverage"],"zh":["编写新功能的单元测试","使用Playwright创建E2E测试","测试Go处理程序和服务","调试测试失败","改进测试覆盖率"],"ja":["新しい機能のユニットテストを記述する","Playwrightを使用してE2Eテストを作成する","Goハンドラとサービスをテストする","テストの失敗をデバッグする","テストカバレッジを改善する"],"ko":["새로운 기능의 유닛 테스트를 작성하다","Playwright를 사용하여 E2E 테스트를 생성하다","Go 핸들러 및 서비스를 테스트하다","테스트 실패를 디버깅하다","테스트 커버리지 개선"],"es":["Escribir pruebas unitarias para nuevas características","Crear pruebas E2E con Playwright","Probar controladores y servicios de Go","Depurar fallos de pruebas","Mejorar la cobertura de pruebas"],"fr":["Écrire des tests unitaires pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Créer des tests E2E avec Playwright","Tester les gestionnaires et les services Go","Déboguer les échecs de tests","Améliorer la couverture de tests"],"de":["Einheitstests für neue Funktionen schreiben","E2E-Tests mit Playwright erstellen","Go-Handler und -Dienste testen","Testfehler debuggen","Testabdeckung verbessern"],"pt":["Escrever testes unitários para recursos novos","Criar testes E2E com Playwright","Testar manipuladores e serviços Go","Depurar falhas de teste","Melhorar a cobertura de teste"],"ru":["Написание модульных тестов для новых функций","Создание тестов E2E с помощью Playwright","Тестирование обработчиков и сервисов Go","Отладка сбоев тестирования","Улучшение покрытия тестирования"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات وحدوية لسمات جديدة","إنشاء اختبارات نهاية إلى نهاية باستخدام Playwright","اختبار منفذين وخدمات Go","فك شفرة فشل الاختبارات","تحسين تغطية الاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific testing frameworks (Playwright)","Go language dependency for backend testing","Test environment setup needed"],"zh":["需要特定的测试框架（Playwright）","后端测试需要Go语言依赖","需要测试环境设置"],"ja":["特定のテストフレームワーク（Playwright）が必要","バックエンドテストにはGo言語の依存が必要","テスト環境の設定が必要"],"ko":["특정 테스트 프레임워크(Playwright)가 필요","백엔드 테스트에는 Go 언어 종속성이 필요","테스트 환경 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere marcos de prueba específicos (Playwright)","Dependencia de lenguaje Go para pruebas de backend","Configuración del entorno de prueba necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite des frameworks de test spécifiques (Playwright)","Dépendance de langage Go pour les tests de backend","Configuration de l''environnement de test nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert spezifische Testframeworks (Playwright)","Go-Sprachabhängigkeit für Back-end-Tests","Testumgebungseinrichtung erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige estruturas de teste específicas (Playwright)","Dependência de linguagem Go para teste de backend","Configuração de ambiente de teste necessária"],"ru":["Требует специальных тестовых фреймворков (Playwright)","Зависимость от языка Go для тестирования бэкенда","Необходима настройка тестовой среды"],"ar":["يتطلب إطارات اختبار محددة (Playwright)","اعتماد لغة Go لاختبار الخلفية","إعداد بيئة الاختبار ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('aiyuekuang/LLMProxy/security', 'community', 'aiyuekuang', 'LLMProxy', 'aiyuekuang/LLMProxy', 'security', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z', '2026-02-18T11:58:28.815Z', NULL, '{"id":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy/security","name":"security","description":{"zh":"安全技能提供了一系列安全功能，包括身份验证、输入验证和代码审查，帮助保护您的LLM后端","ja":"セキュリティスキルは、認証、入力検証、コードレビューなどのセキュリティ機能を提供し、LLMバックエンドを保護するのに役立ちます","ko":"보안 기술은 인증, 입력 검증, 코드 검토 등을 포함한 다양한 보안 기능을 제공하여 LLM 백엔드를 보호하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Nuestras guías de seguridad te ayudan a proteger tus aplicaciones y datos. Aprende a implementar autenticación y autorización seguras","fr":"Nos guides de sécurité vous aident à protéger vos applications et vos données. Apprenez à mettre en œuvre une authentification et une autorisation sécurisées","de":"Unsere Sicherheitsleitfäden helfen Ihnen, Ihre Anwendungen und Daten zu schützen. Lernen Sie, eine sichere Authentifizierung und Autorisierung zu implementieren","pt":"Segurança de aplicativos é fundamental para proteger contra vulnerabilidades. Nossas diretrizes seguem as melhores práticas de OWASP e Trail of Bits.","ru":"Безопасность приложений имеет первостепенное значение для защиты от уязвимостей. Наши рекомендации основаны на лучших практиках OWASP и Trail of Bits.","ar":"أمان التطبيقات أمر بالغ الأهمية لحماية التطبيقات من الثغرات الأمنية. إرشاداتنا تستند إلى أفضل الممارسات من OWASP و Trail of Bits.","en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE). LLMProxy handles both modes out of the box, with zero buffering on streams, intelligent load balancing, and OpenA..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"安全技能：保护LLM后端的终极解决方案","ja":"セキュリティスキル：LLMバックエンドを保護する究極のソリューション","ko":"보안 기술: LLM 백엔드 보호를 위한 최종 해결책","es":"Seguridad para desarrolladores","fr":"Sécurité pour les développeurs","de":"Sicherheit für Entwickler","pt":"Segurança de Aplicativos: Melhores Práticas","ru":"Безопасность Приложений: Лучшие Практики","ar":"أمان التطبيقات: أفضل الممارسات","en":"security"},"description":{"zh":"安全技能提供了一系列安全功能，包括身份验证、输入验证和代码审查，帮助保护您的LLM后端","ja":"セキュリティスキルは、認証、入力検証、コードレビューなどのセキュリティ機能を提供し、LLMバックエンドを保護するのに役立ちます","ko":"보안 기술은 인증, 입력 검증, 코드 검토 등을 포함한 다양한 보안 기능을 제공하여 LLM 백엔드를 보호하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Nuestras guías de seguridad te ayudan a proteger tus aplicaciones y datos. Aprende a implementar autenticación y autorización seguras","fr":"Nos guides de sécurité vous aident à protéger vos applications et vos données. Apprenez à mettre en œuvre une authentification et une autorisation sécurisées","de":"Unsere Sicherheitsleitfäden helfen Ihnen, Ihre Anwendungen und Daten zu schützen. Lernen Sie, eine sichere Authentifizierung und Autorisierung zu implementieren","pt":"Segurança de aplicativos é fundamental para proteger contra vulnerabilidades. Nossas diretrizes seguem as melhores práticas de OWASP e Trail of Bits.","ru":"Безопасность приложений имеет первостепенное значение для защиты от уязвимостей. Наши рекомендации основаны на лучших практиках OWASP и Trail of Bits.","ar":"أمان التطبيقات أمر بالغ الأهمية لحماية التطبيقات من الثغرات الأمنية. إرشاداتنا تستند إلى أفضل الممارسات من OWASP و Trail of Bits.","en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via..."},"definition":{"en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE). LLMProxy handles both modes out of the box, with zero buffering on streams, intelligent load balancing, and OpenAI-compatible API routing."},"features":{"zh":["身份验证和授权","输入验证和清理","代码审查和安全漏洞检测","安全部署配置","敏感数据处理"],"ja":["認証と認可","入力検証とサニタイジング","コードレビューとセキュリティ脆弱性検出","セキュアデプロイ設定","機密データ処理"],"ko":["인증 및 인가","입력 검증 및 정제","코드 검토 및 보안 취약점 탐지","보안 배포 구성","민감한 데이터 처리"],"es":["Autenticación y autorización seguras","Validación y saneamiento de entrada de usuario","Revisión de código para vulnerabilidades de seguridad","Implementación de despliegues seguros","Manejo de datos sensibles"],"fr":["Authentification et autorisation sécurisées","Validation et assainissement des entrées utilisateur","Révision de code pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité","Mise en œuvre de déploiements sécurisés","Gestion de données sensibles"],"de":["Sichere Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Validierung und Säuberung von Benutzereingaben","Überprüfung von Code auf Sicherheitslücken","Implementierung sicherer Bereitstellungen","Umgang mit sensiblen Daten"],"pt":["Autenticação e autorização","Validação e sanitização de entrada de usuário","Revisão de código para vulnerabilidades de segurança","Configuração de implantações seguras","Manipulação de dados sensíveis"],"ru":["Аутентификация и авторизация","Валидация и санитарная обработка пользовательского ввода","Проверка кода на наличие уязвимостей безопасности","Настройка безопасных развертываний","Обработка конфиденциальных данных"],"ar":["التحقق والتصريح","التحقق من صحة وتنقية إدخال المستخدم","استعراض الشفرة البرمجية للثغرات الأمنية","تكوين النشرات الآمنة","معالجة البيانات الحساسة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LLM安全","后端安全","身份验证","输入验证","代码审查","安全部署","敏感数据处理"],"ja":["LLMセキュリティ","バックエンドセキュリティ","認証","入力検証","コードレビュー","セキュアデプロイ","機密データ処理"],"ko":["LLM 보안","백엔드 보안","인증","입력 검증","코드 검토","보안 배포","민감한 데이터 처리"],"es":["seguridad para desarrolladores","autenticación y autorización","validación de entrada de usuario","revisión de código","despliegues seguros","manejo de datos sensibles","OWASP","Trail of Bits"],"fr":["sécurité pour les développeurs","authentification et autorisation","validation des entrées utilisateur","révision de code","déploiements sécurisés","gestion de données sensibles","OWASP","Trail of Bits"],"de":["Sicherheit für Entwickler","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Validierung von Benutzereingaben","Überprüfung von Code","sichere Bereitstellungen","Umgang mit sensiblen Daten","OWASP","Trail of Bits"],"pt":["segurança de aplicativos","OWASP","Trail of Bits","autenticação","autorização","vulnerabilidades de segurança"],"ru":["безопасность приложений","OWASP","Trail of Bits","аутентификация","авторизация","уязвимости безопасности"],"ar":["أمان التطبيقات","OWASP","Trail of Bits","التحقق","التصريح","ثغرات الأمن"]}},"owner":"aiyuekuang","repo":"LLMProxy","repoPath":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security","description":"Security best practices for web applications. Use when implementing authentication, authorization, input validation, or reviewing code for vulnerabilities.","bodyPreview":"# Security Skill\n\nSecurity guidelines based on OWASP, Trail of Bits, and industry best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing authentication/authorization\n- Validating and sanitizing user input\n- Reviewing code for security vulnerabilities\n- Configuring secure deployments\n- Handling sensitive data\n\n---\n\n# 🔐 Authentication\n\n## Password Handling\n\n```go\nimport \"golang.org/x/crypto/bcrypt\"\n\n// Hash password before storing\nfunc hashPassword(password string) (string, error) {\n    bytes","body":"# Security Skill\n\nSecurity guidelines based on OWASP, Trail of Bits, and industry best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing authentication/authorization\n- Validating and sanitizing user input\n- Reviewing code for security vulnerabilities\n- Configuring secure deployments\n- Handling sensitive data\n\n---\n\n# 🔐 Authentication\n\n## Password Handling\n\n```go\nimport \"golang.org/x/crypto/bcrypt\"\n\n// Hash password before storing\nfunc hashPassword(password string) (string, error) {\n    bytes, err := bcrypt.GenerateFromPassword([]byte(password), bcrypt.DefaultCost)\n    return string(bytes), err\n}\n\n// Verify password\nfunc checkPassword(password, hash string) bool {\n    err := bcrypt.CompareHashAndPassword([]byte(hash), []byte(password))\n    return err == nil\n}\n```\n\n## JWT Token Handling\n\n```go\nimport \"github.com/golang-jwt/jwt/v5\"\n\ntype Claims struct {\n    UserID string `json:\"user_id\"`\n    Role   string `json:\"role\"`\n    jwt.RegisteredClaims\n}\n\nfunc generateToken(userID, role string, secret []byte) (string, error) {\n    claims := Claims{\n        UserID: userID,\n        Role:   role,\n        RegisteredClaims: jwt.RegisteredClaims{\n            ExpiresAt: jwt.NewNumericDate(time.Now().Add(24 * time.Hour)),\n            IssuedAt:  jwt.NewNumericDate(time.Now()),\n            Issuer:    \"llmproxy\",\n        },\n    }\n    \n    token := jwt.NewWithClaims(jwt.SigningMethodHS256, claims)\n    return token.SignedString(secret)\n}\n\nfunc validateToken(tokenString string, secret []byte) (*Claims, error) {\n    token, err := jwt.ParseWithClaims(tokenString, &Claims{}, func(t *jwt.Token) (interface{}, error) {\n        if _, ok := t.Method.(*jwt.SigningMethodHMAC); !ok {\n            return nil, fmt.Errorf(\"unexpected signing method: %v\", t.Header[\"alg\"])\n        }\n        return secret, nil\n    })\n    \n    if err != nil {\n        return nil, err\n    }\n    \n    if claims, ok := token.Claims.(*Claims); ok && token.Valid {\n        return claims, nil\n    }\n    \n    return nil, fmt.Errorf(\"invalid token\")\n}\n```\n\n## Secure Session Management\n\n- Use secure, httpOnly cookies\n- Implement session timeout\n- Regenerate session ID after login\n- Invalidate session on logout\n\n```go\nhttp.SetCookie(w, &http.Cookie{\n    Name:     \"session\",\n    Value:    sessionToken,\n    HttpOnly: true,           // Not accessible via JavaScript\n    Secure:   true,           // HTTPS only\n    SameSite: http.SameSiteStrictMode,\n    MaxAge:   3600,           // 1 hour\n    Path:     \"/\",\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🛡️ Authorization\n\n## Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```go\ntype Permission string\n\nconst (\n    PermissionRead   Permission = \"read\"\n    PermissionWrite  Permission = \"write\"\n    PermissionDelete Permission = \"delete\"\n    PermissionAdmin  Permission = \"admin\"\n)\n\ntype Role struct {\n    Name        string\n    Permissions []Permission\n}\n\nvar roles = map[string]Role{\n    \"viewer\": {Name: \"viewer\", Permissions: []Permission{PermissionRead}},\n    \"editor\": {Name: \"editor\", Permissions: []Permission{PermissionRead, PermissionWrite}},\n    \"admin\":  {Name: \"admin\", Permissions: []Permission{PermissionRead, PermissionWrite, PermissionDelete, PermissionAdmin}},\n}\n\nfunc hasPermission(userRole string, required Permission) bool {\n    role, ok := roles[userRole]\n    if !ok {\n        return false\n    }\n    for _, p := range role.Permissions {\n        if p == required {\n            return true\n        }\n    }\n    return false\n}\n```\n\n## Authorization Middleware\n\n```go\nfunc RequirePermission(permission Permission) Middleware {\n    return func(next http.Handler) http.Handler {\n        return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n            claims := getUserClaims(r.Context())\n            if claims == nil {\n                http.Error(w, \"unauthorized\", http.StatusUnauthorized)\n                return\n            }\n            \n            if !hasPermission(claims.Role, permission) {\n                http.Error(w, \"forbidden\", http.StatusForbidden)\n                return\n            }\n            \n            next.ServeHTTP(w, r)\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔍 Input Validation\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n```go\nimport \"github.com/go-playground/validator/v10\"\n\ntype CreateUserRequest struct {\n    Name     string `json:\"name\" validate:\"required,min=2,max=100\"`\n    Email    string `json:\"email\" validate:\"required,email\"`\n    Password string `json:\"password\" validate:\"required,min=8,max=72\"`\n    Age      int    `json:\"age\" validate:\"omitempty,min=0,max=150\"`\n}\n\nvar validate = validator.New()\n\nfunc validateRequest(req interface{}) error {\n    if err := validate.Struct(req); err != nil {\n        var validationErrors validator.ValidationErrors\n        if errors.As(err, &validationErrors) {\n            // Convert to user-friendly messages\n            return formatValidationErrors(validationErrors)\n        }\n        return err\n    }\n    return nil\n}\n```\n\n## SQL Injection Prevention\n\n```go\n// ❌ NEVER: String concatenation\nquery := \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = \" + userInput\n\n// ✅ ALWAYS: Parameterized queries\nquery := \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $1\"\nrow := db.QueryRow(query, userInput)\n\n// ✅ With named parameters (sqlx)\nquery := \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = :name AND status = :status\"\nrows, err := db.NamedQuery(query, map[string]interface{}{\n    \"name\":   name,\n    \"status\": status,\n})\n```\n\n## XSS Prevention\n\n```go\nimport \"html\"\n\n// Escape HTML in output\nfunc sanitizeOutput(input string) string {\n    return html.EscapeString(input)\n}\n\n// In templates, use text/template for auto-escaping\n// or html/template for HTML-aware escaping\n```\n\n```typescript\n// React automatically escapes by default\n// ❌ Dangerous: bypasses escaping\n<div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: userInput }} />\n\n// ✅ Safe: auto-escaped\n<div>{userInput}</div>\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔑 Secrets Management\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```go\n// ❌ NEVER: Hardcoded secrets\nconst apiKey = \"sk-1234567890abcdef\"\n\n// ✅ ALWAYS: Environment variables\napiKey := os.Getenv(\"API_KEY\")\nif apiKey == \"\" {\n    log.Fatal(\"API_KEY environment variable required\")\n}\n```\n\n## Configuration Structure\n\n```go\ntype Config struct {\n    Database struct {\n        Host     string `env:\"DB_HOST\" envDefault:\"localhost\"`\n        Port     int    `env:\"DB_PORT\" envDefault:\"5432\"`\n        Password string `env:\"DB_PASSWORD,required\"`\n    }\n    JWT struct {\n        Secret     string        `env:\"JWT_SECRET,required\"`\n        Expiration time.Duration `env:\"JWT_EXPIRATION\" envDefault:\"24h\"`\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## .gitignore Secrets\n\n```gitignore\n# Environment files\n.env\n.env.local\n.env.*.local\n\n# Config files with secrets\nconfig.yaml\nsecrets/\n\n# Key files\n*.pem\n*.key\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🌐 HTTP Security Headers\n\n```go\nfunc SecurityHeadersMiddleware(next http.Handler) http.Handler {\n    return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n        // Prevent MIME sniffing\n        w.Header().Set(\"X-Content-Type-Options\", \"nosniff\")\n        \n        // Prevent clickjacking\n        w.Header().Set(\"X-Frame-Options\", \"DENY\")\n        \n        // Enable XSS filter\n        w.Header().Set(\"X-XSS-Protection\", \"1; mode=block\")\n        \n        // Content Security Policy\n        w.Header().Set(\"Content-Security-Policy\", \n            \"default-src ''self''; script-src ''self''; style-src ''self'' ''unsafe-inline''\")\n        \n        // Strict Transport Security (HTTPS only)\n        w.Header().Set(\"Strict-Transport-Security\", \n            \"max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains\")\n        \n        // Referrer Policy\n        w.Header().Set(\"Referrer-Policy\", \"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\")\n        \n        next.ServeHTTP(w, r)\n    })\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# ⚡ Rate Limiting\n\n```go\nimport \"golang.org/x/time/rate\"\n\ntype RateLimiter struct {\n    limiters map[string]*rate.Limiter\n    mu       sync.RWMutex\n    rate     rate.Limit\n    burst    int\n}\n\nfunc NewRateLimiter(r rate.Limit, b int) *RateLimiter {\n    return &RateLimiter{\n        limiters: make(map[string]*rate.Limiter),\n        rate:     r,\n        burst:    b,\n    }\n}\n\nfunc (rl *RateLimiter) getLimiter(key string) *rate.Limiter {\n    rl.mu.Lock()\n    defer rl.mu.Unlock()\n    \n    limiter, exists := rl.limiters[key]\n    if !exists {\n        limiter = rate.NewLimiter(rl.rate, rl.burst)\n        rl.limiters[key] = limiter\n    }\n    \n    return limiter\n}\n\nfunc (rl *RateLimiter) Middleware(next http.Handler) http.Handler {\n    return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n        ip := getClientIP(r)\n        limiter := rl.getLimiter(ip)\n        \n        if !limiter.Allow() {\n            http.Error(w, \"rate limit exceeded\", http.StatusTooManyRequests)\n            return\n        }\n        \n        next.ServeHTTP(w, r)\n    })\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📋 Security Checklist\n\n## Authentication\n- [ ] Passwords hashed with bcrypt/argon2\n- [ ] Secure session management\n- [ ] Account lockout after failed attempts\n- [ ] Password complexity requirements\n\n## Authorization\n- [ ] Principle of least privilege\n- [ ] Authorization checked on every request\n- [ ] Resource ownership verified\n\n## Input Validation\n- [ ] All inputs validated and sanitized\n- [ ] Parameterized queries for SQL\n- [ ] Output encoding for XSS prevention\n\n## Data Protection\n- [ ] Sensitive data encrypted at rest\n- [ ] TLS for data in transit\n- [ ] No secrets in code or logs\n\n## Logging & Monitoring\n- [ ] Security events logged\n- [ ] No sensitive data in logs\n- [ ] Alerting for suspicious activity\n\n---\n\n# 📚 References\n\n- [OWASP Top 10](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\n- [OWASP Cheat Sheets](https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/)\n- [trailofbits/static-analysis](https://github.com/trailofbits/skills/tree/main/plugins/static-analysis)\n- [trailofbits/sharp-edges](https://github.com/trailofbits/skills/tree/main/plugins/sharp-edges)\n- [CWE Top 25](https://cwe.mitre.org/top25/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:58:28.815Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring robust security measures, such as authentication and authorization, to protect sensitive data and prevent vulnerabilities.","zh":"适合需要强大的安全措施的AI代理，例如身份验证和授权，以保护敏感数据和防止漏洞。","ja":"ロバストなセキュリティ対策が必要なAIエージェントに適しています。たとえば、認証や認可を使用して機密データを保護し、脆弱性を防ぐことができます。","ko":"강력한 보안対策이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어, 인증 및 인가와 같은 기능을 사용하여 민감한 데이터를 보호하고 취약성을 방지할 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren medidas de seguridad robustas, como autenticación y autorización, para proteger datos sensibles y prevenir vulnerabilidades.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant des mesures de sécurité robustes, telles que l''authentification et l''autorisation, pour protéger les données sensibles et prévenir les vulnérabilités.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die robuste Sicherheitsmaßnahmen wie Authentifizierung und Autorisierung erfordern, um sensible Daten zu schützen und Schwachstellen zu verhindern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que exigem medidas de segurança robustas, como autenticação e autorização, para proteger dados sensíveis e prevenir vulnerabilidades.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих надежных мер безопасности, таких как аутентификация и авторизация, для защиты конфиденциальных данных и предотвращения уязвимостей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يتطلبون إجراءات أمنية قوية، مثل المصادقة والتفويض، لحماية البيانات الحساسة ومنع الثغرات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement secure authentication/authorization using industry standards like OWASP and Trail of Bits, handle sensitive data, and validate user input using libraries like bcrypt for password hashing, ensuring secure deployments and real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE).","zh":"赋予代理实现安全的身份验证/授权，使用行业标准如OWASP和Trail of Bits，处理敏感数据，并使用像bcrypt的密码哈希库来验证用户输入，确保安全的部署和实时令牌流式传输通过Server-Sent Events (SSE)。","ja":"OWASPやTrail of Bitsなどの業界標準を使用して、セキュアな認証/認可を実装し、機密データを処理し、bcryptなどのライブラリを使用してパスワードハッシュ化を行い、ユーザーの入力を検証し、Server-Sent Events (SSE)を介したセキュアなデプロイとリアルタイムトークンストリーミングを可能にします。","ko":"OWASP 및 Trail of Bits와 같은 산업 표준을 사용하여 보안 인증/인가를 구현하고, 민감한 데이터를 처리하고, bcrypt와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 비밀번호 해싱을 수행하고, 사용자 입력을 검증하여, Server-Sent Events (SSE)를 통한 보안 배포 및 실시간 토큰 스트리밍을 обеспеч합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una autenticación/autorización segura utilizando estándares de la industria como OWASP y Trail of Bits, manejar datos sensibles y validar la entrada del usuario utilizando bibliotecas como bcrypt para el hashing de contraseñas, garantizando implementaciones seguras y streaming de tokens en tiempo real a través de Server-Sent Events (SSE).","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une authentification/autorisation sécurisée en utilisant des normes de l''industrie comme OWASP et Trail of Bits, gérer des données sensibles et valider les entrées utilisateur en utilisant des bibliothèques comme bcrypt pour le hachage de mots de passe, garantissant des déploiements sécurisés et un streaming de jetons en temps réel via Server-Sent Events (SSE).","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, eine sichere Authentifizierung/Autorisierung unter Verwendung von Branchenstandards wie OWASP und Trail of Bits zu implementieren, sensible Daten zu handhaben und Benutzereingaben unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie bcrypt für das Passwort-Hashing zu validieren, um sichere Implementierungen und Echtzeit-Token-Streaming über Server-Sent Events (SSE) zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar autenticação/autorização seguras usando padrões da indústria como OWASP e Trail of Bits, lidar com dados sensíveis e validar a entrada do usuário usando bibliotecas como bcrypt para hash de senha, garantindo implantações seguras e transmissão de tokens em tempo real via Server-Sent Events (SSE).","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать безопасную аутентификацию/авторизацию с использованием отраслевых стандартов, таких как OWASP и Trail of Bits, обрабатывать конфиденциальные данные и проверять ввод пользователя с помощью библиотек, таких как bcrypt для хеширования пароля, обеспечивая безопасные развертывания и потоковую передачу токенов в режиме реального времени через Server-Sent Events (SSE).","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنفيذ المصادقة / التفويض الآمن باستخدام معايير الصناعة مثل OWASP و Trail of Bits، ومعالجة البيانات الحساسة، واعتماد مدخلات المستخدم باستخدام المكتبات مثل bcrypt لتشفير كلمة المرور، وضمان النشر الآمن وبث الرموز في الوقت الفعلي عبر Server-Sent Events (SSE)."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure password handling using bcrypt","Validating and sanitizing user input to prevent SQL injection and cross-site scripting (XSS)","Configuring secure deployments with intelligent load balancing and zero buffering on streams","Reviewing code for security vulnerabilities and handling sensitive data"],"zh":["使用bcrypt实现安全的密码处理","验证和清理用户输入以防止SQL注入和跨站脚本攻击（XSS）","配置安全的部署，使用智能负载均衡和流媒体上的零缓冲","查看代码中的安全漏洞并处理敏感数据"],"ja":["bcryptを使用してセキュアなパスワード処理を実装する","ユーザーの入力を検証してSQLインジェクションやクロスサイトスクリプティング（XSS）を防ぐ","セキュアなデプロイを構成し、インテリジェントな負荷分散とストリーム上のゼロバッファリングを使用する","コードのセキュリティ脆弱性を確認し、機密データを処理する"],"ko":["bcrypt를 사용하여 보안 비밀번호 처리를 구현하는 것","사용자 입력을 검증하여 SQL 인젝션 및 크로스 사이트 스크립팅(XSS)을 방지하는 것","보안 배포를 구성하고, 지능형 부하 분산 및 스트림上的 영 버퍼링을 사용하는 것","코드의 보안 취약성을 검토하고, 민감한 데이터를 처리하는 것"],"es":["Implementar un manejo de contraseñas seguro utilizando bcrypt","Validar y sanear la entrada del usuario para prevenir la inyección SQL y el scripting entre sitios (XSS)","Configurar implementaciones seguras con equilibrio de carga inteligente y sin búfer en flujos","Revisar el código en busca de vulnerabilidades de seguridad y manejar datos sensibles"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une gestion de mots de passe sécurisée en utilisant bcrypt","Valider et nettoyer les entrées utilisateur pour prévenir l''injection SQL et le scripting entre sites (XSS)","Configurer des déploiements sécurisés avec un équilibrage de charge intelligent et sans tampon sur les flux","Examiner le code pour détecter les vulnérabilités de sécurité et gérer des données sensibles"],"de":["Sichere Passwortverwaltung mit bcrypt implementieren","Benutzereingaben validieren und bereinigen, um SQL-Injection und Cross-Site-Scripting (XSS) zu verhindern","Sichere Implementierungen mit intelligenter Lastverteilung und ohne Puffer auf Streams konfigurieren","Code auf Sicherheitslücken überprüfen und sensible Daten handhaben"],"pt":["Implementação de tratamento de senha seguro usando bcrypt","Validação e saneamento da entrada do usuário para prevenir injeção de SQL e scripting entre sites (XSS)","Configuração de implantações seguras com balanceamento de carga inteligente e sem bufferização em streams","Revisão do código para vulnerabilidades de segurança e manipulação de dados sensíveis"],"ru":["Реализация безопасного хранения паролей с использованием bcrypt","Проверка и санирование ввода пользователя для предотвращения внедрения SQL и межсайтового скриптинга (XSS)","Настройка безопасных развертываний с интеллектуальным балансированием нагрузки и отсутствием буферизации в потоках","Проверка кода на наличие уязвимостей безопасности и обработку конфиденциальных данных"],"ar":["تنفيذ معالجة كلمة المرور الآمنة باستخدام bcrypt","التحقق من مدخلات المستخدم ومعالجتها لمنع حقن SQL وبرمجة الموقع عبر المواقع (XSS)","تكوين النشر الآمن مع توازن ذكي للتحميل وبدون تحسين الإرسال في تيارات","مراجعة الشفرة للكشف عن نقاط الضعف الأمنية ومعالجة البيانات الحساسة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of OWASP and Trail of Bits security guidelines","Dependent on bcrypt library for password hashing","Limited to applications using Server-Sent Events (SSE) for real-time token streaming"],"zh":["需要了解OWASP和Trail of Bits的安全指南","依赖bcrypt库进行密码哈希化","仅限使用Server-Sent Events (SSE)进行实时令牌流式传输的应用"],"ja":["OWASPとTrail of Bitsのセキュリティガイドラインを理解する必要がある","bcryptライブラリに依存してパスワードハッシュ化を行う","Server-Sent Events (SSE)を使用したリアルタイムトークンストリーミングに対応したアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["OWASP 및 Trail of Bits의 보안 가이드ライン을 이해해야 함","bcrypt 라이브러리에 의존하여 비밀번호 해싱을 수행함","Server-Sent Events (SSE)를 통한 실시간 토큰 스트리밍을 사용하는 응용 프로그램으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las directrices de seguridad de OWASP y Trail of Bits","Dependiente de la biblioteca bcrypt para el hashing de contraseñas","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan Server-Sent Events (SSE) para el streaming de tokens en tiempo real"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des directives de sécurité OWASP et Trail of Bits","Dépend de la bibliothèque bcrypt pour le hachage de mots de passe","Limité aux applications utilisant Server-Sent Events (SSE) pour le streaming de jetons en temps réel"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Sicherheitsrichtlinien von OWASP und Trail of Bits","Abhängig von der Bibliothek bcrypt für das Passwort-Hashing","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die Server-Sent Events (SSE) für das Echtzeit-Token-Streaming verwenden"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento das diretrizes de segurança OWASP e Trail of Bits","Dependente da biblioteca bcrypt para hash de senha","Limitado a aplicações que usam Server-Sent Events (SSE) para transmissão de tokens em tempo real"],"ru":["Требует знания руководств по безопасности OWASP и Trail of Bits","Зависит от библиотеки bcrypt для хеширования пароля","Ограничен для приложений, использующих Server-Sent Events (SSE) для реального времени передачи токенов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة إرشادات أمن OWASP و Trail of Bits","يعتمد على مكتبة bcrypt لتشفير كلمة المرور","محدود للتطبيقات التي تستخدم Server-Sent Events (SSE) لنقل الرموز في الوقت الفعلي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
