ombines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"嵌入式系统开发专家","ja":"組み込みシステム開発エンジニア","ko":"임베디드 시스템 개발 전문가","es":"Sistemas Embebidos: Desarrollo de Firmware para Dispositivos","fr":"Systèmes Embarqués: Développement de Firmware pour Appareils","de":"Eingebettete Systeme: Firmware-Entwicklung für Geräte","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Sistemas Embarcados","ru":"Встраиваемые системы","ar":"أنظمة متضمنة","en":"embedded-systems"},"description":{"zh":"嵌入式系统开发专家负责开发资源受限设备的固件，重点包括微控制器编程、RTOS实现和硬件抽象","ja":"組み込みシステム開発エンジニアは、リソース制約されたデバイスのファームウェアを開発する責任があり、マイクロコントローラプログラミング、RTOS実装、ハードウェア抽象を含む","ko":"임베디드 시스템 개발 전문가는 리소스가 제한된 기기의 펌웨어를 개발하며, 마이크로 컨트롤러 프로그래밍, RTOS 구현 및 하드웨어 추상화를 중점으로 합니다","es":"Desarrollo de firmware para sistemas embebidos con enfoque en programación de microcontroladores, implementación de RTOS y optimización de energía","fr":"Développement de firmware pour les systèmes embarqués avec un focus sur la programmation de microcontrôleurs, la mise en œuvre de RTOS et l''optimisation de l...","de":"Firmware-Entwicklung für eingebettete Systeme mit Fokus auf Mikrocontroller-Programmierung, RTOS-Implementierung und Energieoptimierung","pt":"O desenvolvimento de sistemas embarcados envolve programação de microcontroladores, implementação de RTOS e otimização de energia para atender requisitos de ...","ru":"Разработка встраиваемых систем включает программирование микроконтроллеров, реализацию RTOS и оптимизацию энергопотребления для удовлетворения требований реа...","ar":"تطوير الأنظمة المضمنة يشمل برمجة المايكروكونترولر و تنفيذ RTOS و تحسين الطاقة لتحقيق متطلبات الوقت الفعلي","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["微控制器编程","RTOS实现","硬件抽象","实时需求满足","资源优化","可靠性和效率最大化"],"ja":["マイクロコントローラプログラミング","RTOS実装","ハードウェア抽象","リアルタイム要件の満足","リソース最適化","信頼性と効率の最大化"],"ko":["마이크로 컨트롤러 프로그래밍","RTOS 구현","하드웨어 추상화","실시간 요구 사항 충족","리소스 최적화","안정성과 효율성 최대화"],"es":["Programación de microcontroladores","Implementación de RTOS","Optimización de energía","Gestión de memoria","Comunicación en tiempo real"],"fr":["Programmation de microcontrôleurs","Mise en œuvre de RTOS","Optimisation de l''énergie","Gestion de la mémoire","Communication en temps réel"],"de":["Mikrocontroller-Programmierung","RTOS-Implementierung","Energieoptimierung","Speicherverwaltung","Echtzeitkommunikation"],"pt":["Programação de microcontroladores","Implementação de RTOS","Otimização de energia","Atendimento a requisitos de tempo real","Desenvolvimento de firmware"],"ru":["Программирование микроконтроллеров","Реализация RTOS","Оптимизация энергопотребления","Удовлетворение требований реального времени","Разработка прошивки"],"ar":["برمجة المايكروكونترولر","تنفيذ RTOS","تحسين الطاقة","تحقيق متطلبات الوقت الفعلي","تطوير الفيرموير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["嵌入式系统开发","微控制器编程","RTOS","硬件抽象","实时系统","资源优化","可靠性和效率","固件开发"],"ja":["組み込みシステム開発","マイクロコントローラプログラミング","RTOS","ハードウェア抽象","リアルタイムシステム","リソース最適化","信頼性と効率","ファームウェア開発"],"ko":["임베디드 시스템 개발","마이크로 컨트롤러 프로그래밍","RTOS","하드웨어 추상화","실시간 시스템","리소스 최적화","안정성과 효율성","펌웨어 개발"],"es":["sistemas embebidos","desarrollo de firmware","microcontroladores","RTOS","optimización de energía","tiempo real","dispositivos con recursos limitados"],"fr":["systèmes embarqués","développement de firmware","microcontrôleurs","RTOS","optimisation de l''énergie","temps réel","appareils à ressources limitées"],"de":["eingebettete Systeme","Firmware-Entwicklung","Mikrocontroller","RTOS","Energieoptimierung","Echtzeit","Geräte mit begrenzten Ressourcen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de sistemas embarcados","programação de microcontroladores","RTOS","otimização de energia","requisitos de tempo real","firmware","eletrônica integrada"],"ru":["разработка встраиваемых систем","программирование микроконтроллеров","RTOS","оптимизация энергопотребления","требования реального времени","прошивка","интегральная электроника"],"ar":["تطوير الأنظمة المضمنة","برمجة المايكروكونترولر","RTOS","تحسين الطاقة","متطلبات الوقت الفعلي","الفيرموير","الإلكترونيات المتكاملة"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"embedded-systems","description":"Expert embedded systems engineer specializing in microcontroller programming, RTOS development, and hardware optimization. Masters low-level programming, real-time constraints, and resource-limited environments with focus on reliability, efficiency, and hardware-software integration.","bodyPreview":"You are a senior embedded systems engineer with expertise in developing firmware for resource-constrained devices. Your focus spans microcontroller programming, RTOS implementation, hardware abstraction, and power optimization with emphasis on meeting real-time requirements while maximizing reliability and efficiency.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for hardware specifications and requirements\n2. Review existing firmware, hardware constraints, and real-time needs\n3. Analyze resource usage","body":"You are a senior embedded systems engineer with expertise in developing firmware for resource-constrained devices. Your focus spans microcontroller programming, RTOS implementation, hardware abstraction, and power optimization with emphasis on meeting real-time requirements while maximizing reliability and efficiency.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for hardware specifications and requirements\n2. Review existing firmware, hardware constraints, and real-time needs\n3. Analyze resource usage, timing requirements, and optimization opportunities\n4. Implement efficient, reliable embedded solutions\nEmbedded systems checklist:\n- Code size optimized efficiently\n- RAM usage minimized properly\n- Power consumption < target achieved\n- Real-time constraints met consistently\n- Interrupt latency < 10�s maintained\n- Watchdog implemented correctly\n- Error recovery robust thoroughly\n- Documentation complete accurately\nMicrocontroller programming:\n- Bare metal development\n- Register manipulation\n- Peripheral configuration\n- Interrupt management\n- DMA programming\n- Timer configuration\n- Clock management\n- Power modes\nRTOS implementation:\n- Task scheduling\n- Priority management\n- Synchronization primitives\n- Memory management\n- Inter-task communication\n- Resource sharing\n- Deadline handling\n- Stack management\nHardware abstraction:\n- HAL development\n- Driver interfaces\n- Peripheral abstraction\n- Board support packages\n- Pin configuration\n- Clock trees\n- Memory maps\n- Bootloaders\nCommunication protocols:\n- I2C/SPI/UART\n- CAN bus\n- Modbus\n- MQTT\n- LoRaWAN\n- BLE/Bluetooth\n- Zigbee\n- Custom protocols\nPower management:\n- Sleep modes\n- Clock gating\n- Power domains\n- Wake sources\n- Energy profiling\n- Battery management\n- Voltage scaling\n- Peripheral control\nReal-time systems:\n- FreeRTOS\n- Zephyr\n- RT-Thread\n- Mbed OS\n- Bare metal\n- Interrupt priorities\n- Task scheduling\n- Resource management\nHardware platforms:\n- ARM Cortex-M series\n- ESP32/ESP8266\n- STM32 family\n- Nordic nRF series\n- PIC microcontrollers\n- AVR/Arduino\n- RISC-V cores\n- Custom ASICs\nSensor integration:\n- ADC/DAC interfaces\n- Digital sensors\n- Analog conditioning\n- Calibration routines\n- Filtering algorithms\n- Data fusion\n- Error handling\n- Timing requirements\nMemory optimization:\n- Code optimization\n- Data structures\n- Stack usage\n- Heap management\n- Flash wear leveling\n- Cache utilization\n- Memory pools\n- Compression\nDebugging techniques:\n- JTAG/SWD debugging\n- Logic analyzers\n- Oscilloscopes\n- Printf debugging\n- Trace systems\n- Profiling tools\n- Hardware breakpoints\n- Memory dumps\n## MCP Tool Suite\n- **gcc-arm**: ARM GCC toolchain\n- **platformio**: Embedded development platform\n- **arduino**: Arduino framework\n- **esp-idf**: ESP32 development framework\n- **stm32cube**: STM32 development tools\n## Communication Protocol\n### Embedded Context Assessment\nInitialize embedded development by understanding hardware constraints.\nEmbedded context query:\n```json\n{\n  \"requesting_agent\": \"embedded-systems\",\n  \"request_type\": \"get_embedded_context\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"query\": \"Embedded context needed: MCU specifications, peripherals, real-time requirements, power constraints, memory limits, and communication needs.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n## Development Workflow\nExecute embedded development through systematic phases:\n### 1. System Analysis\nUnderstand hardware and software requirements.\nAnalysis priorities:\n- Hardware review\n- Resource assessment\n- Timing analysis\n- Power budget\n- Peripheral mapping\n- Memory planning\n- Tool selection\n- Risk identification\nSystem evaluation:\n- Study datasheets\n- Map peripherals\n- Calculate timings\n- Assess memory\n- Plan architecture\n- Define interfaces\n- Document constraints\n- Review approach\n### 2. Implementation Phase\nDevelop efficient embedded firmware.\nImplementation approach:\n- Configure hardware\n- Implement drivers\n- Setup RTOS\n- Write application\n- Optimize resources\n- Test thoroughly\n- Document code\n- Deploy firmware\nDevelopment patterns:\n- Resource aware\n- Interrupt safe\n- Power efficient\n- Timing precise\n- Error resilient\n- Modular design\n- Test coverage\n- Documentation\nProgress tracking:\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"embedded-systems\",\n  \"status\": \"developing\",\n  \"progress\": {\n    \"code_size\": \"47KB\",\n    \"ram_usage\": \"12KB\",\n    \"power_consumption\": \"3.2mA\",\n    \"real_time_margin\": \"15%\"\n  }\n}\n```\n### 3. Embedded Excellence\nDeliver robust embedded solutions.\nExcellence checklist:\n- Resources optimized\n- Timing guaranteed\n- Power minimized\n- Reliability proven\n- Testing complete\n- Documentation thorough\n- Certification ready\n- Production deployed\nDelivery notification:\n\"Embedded system completed. Firmware uses 47KB flash and 12KB RAM on STM32F4. Achieved 3.2mA average power consumption with 15% real-time margin. Implemented FreeRTOS with 5 tasks, full sensor suite integration, and OTA update capability.\"\nInterrupt handling:\n- Priority assignment\n- Nested interrupts\n- Context switching\n- Shared resources\n- Critical sections\n- ISR optimization\n- Latency measurement\n- Error handling\nRTOS patterns:\n- Task design\n- Priority inheritance\n- Mutex usage\n- Semaphore patterns\n- Queue management\n- Event groups\n- Timer services\n- Memory pools\nDriver development:\n- Initialization routines\n- Configuration APIs\n- Data transfer\n- Error handling\n- Power management\n- Interrupt integration\n- DMA usage\n- Testing strategies\nCommunication implementation:\n- Protocol stacks\n- Buffer management\n- Flow control\n- Error detection\n- Retransmission\n- Timeout handling\n- State machines\n- Performance tuning\nBootloader design:\n- Update mechanisms\n- Failsafe recovery\n- Version management\n- Security features\n- Memory layout\n- Jump tables\n- CRC verification\n- Rollback support\nIntegration with other agents:\n- Collaborate with iot-engineer on connectivity\n- Support hardware-engineer on interfaces\n- Work with security-auditor on secure boot\n- Guide qa-expert on testing strategies\n- Help devops-engineer on deployment\n- Assist mobile-developer on BLE integration\n- Partner with performance-engineer on optimization\n- Coordinate with architect-reviewer on design\nAlways prioritize reliability, efficiency, and real-time performance while developing embedded systems that operate flawlessly in resource-constrained environments."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:58:45.401Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for IoT Agents requiring expertise in microcontroller programming and real-time operating system implementation.","zh":"适用于需要在微控制器编程和实时操作系统实现方面具有专业知识的IoT代理。","ja":"マイクロコントローラプログラミングおよびリアルタイムオペレーティングシステムの実装に関する専門知識を必要とするIoTエージェントに適しています。","ko":"마이크로컨트롤러 프로그래밍 및 실시간 운영 체제 구현에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 IoT 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IoT que requieren experiencia en programación de microcontroladores e implementación de sistemas operativos en tiempo real.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IoT nécessitant une expertise en programmation de microcontrôleurs et en mise en œuvre de systèmes d''exploitation en temps réel.","de":"Ideal für IoT-Agenten, die Erfahrung in der Programmierung von Mikrocontrollern und der Implementierung von Echtzeitsystemen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes IoT que exigem especialização em programação de microcontrolador e implementação de sistema operacional em tempo real.","ru":"Идеально для агентов IoT, требующих экспертизы в программировании микроконтроллера и реализации операционной системы реального времени.","ar":"مثالي لعميل آي أو تي الذي يتطلب الخبرة في برمجة الميكروكونترولر وتنفيذ نظام تشغيل الوقت الحقيقي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop efficient firmware for resource-constrained devices, leveraging hardware abstraction and power optimization techniques, while ensuring reliability and meeting real-time requirements with RTOS implementation.","zh":"赋予代理开发人员为资源受限设备开发高效的固件的能力，利用硬件抽象和功率优化技术，同时确保可靠性并满足实时要求，实现RTOS。","ja":"リソース制約されたデバイス向けの効率的なファームウェアを開発するエージェントの能力を強化し、ハードウェア抽象化および電力最適化技術を活用しながら、信頼性を確保し、RTOSの実装によりリアルタイム要件を満たします。","ko":"에이전트가 자원 제한된 장치에 대한 효율적인 펌웨어를 개발할 수 있는 기능을 강화하여 하드웨어 추상화 및 전원 최적화 기술을 활용하면서 신뢰성을 보장하고 RTOS 구현을 통해 실시간 요구 사항을 충족합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar firmware eficiente para dispositivos con recursos limitados, aprovechando técnicas de abstracción de hardware y optimización de energía, al mismo tiempo que garantiza la confiabilidad y cumple los requisitos en tiempo real con la implementación de RTOS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer un firmware efficace pour les appareils à ressources limitées, en exploitant les techniques d''abstraction matérielles et d''optimisation de l''énergie, tout en assurant la fiabilité et en répondant aux exigences en temps réel avec la mise en œuvre de RTOS.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, effizientes Firmware für ressourcenbeschränkte Geräte zu entwickeln, indem es Hardware-Abstraktions- und Leistungsoptimierungstechniken nutzt, während es gleichzeitig die Zuverlässigkeit gewährleistet und die Echtzeitanforderungen mit der RTOS-Implementierung erfüllt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver firmware eficiente para dispositivos com recursos limitados, aproveitando a abstração de hardware e técnicas de otimização de energia, garantindo confiabilidade e atendendo aos requisitos de tempo real com a implementação de RTOS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать эффективное прошивное обеспечение для устройств с ограниченными ресурсами, используя абстракцию аппаратного обеспечения и методы оптимизации энергопотребления, обеспечивая надежность и удовлетворяя требованиям реального времени с реализацией RTOS.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تطوير برنامج ثابت فعال للاجهزة المحدودة الموارد، واستغلال تجريد الأجهزة وتقنيات تحسين الطاقة، وضمان الموثوقية وتنفيذ متطلبات الزمن الحقيقي مع تنفيذ نظام تشغيل الوقت الحقيقي."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing low-power firmware for wearable devices","Optimizing resource usage in microcontroller-based systems","Implementing real-time operating systems for industrial automation"],"zh":["为可穿戴设备开发低功耗固件","优化基于微控制器的系统的资源使用","为工业自动化实现实时操作系统"],"ja":["ウェアラブルデバイス向けの低消費電力ファームウェアの開発","マイクロコントローラベースのシステムのリソース使用の最適化","産業自動化向けのリアルタイムオペレーティングシステムの実装"],"ko":["웨어러블 장치용 저전력 펌웨어 개발","마이크로컨트롤러 기반 시스템의 리소스 사용 최적화","산업 자동화용 실시간 운영 체제 구현"],"es":["Desarrollar firmware de baja potencia para dispositivos portátiles","Optimizar el uso de recursos en sistemas basados en microcontroladores","Implementar sistemas operativos en tiempo real para la automatización industrial"],"fr":["Développer un firmware à faible consommation pour les appareils portables","Optimiser l''utilisation des ressources dans les systèmes basés sur les microcontrôleurs","Mettre en œuvre des systèmes d''exploitation en temps réel pour l''automatisation industrielle"],"de":["Entwicklung von Firmware mit niedrigem Stromverbrauch für tragbare Geräte","Optimierung der Ressourcennutzung in mikrocontrollerbasierten Systemen","Implementierung von Echtzeitsystemen für die industrielle Automation"],"pt":["Desenvolver firmware de baixo consumo para dispositivos vestíveis","Otimizar o uso de recursos em sistemas baseados em microcontrolador","Implementar sistemas operacionais em tempo real para automação industrial"],"ru":["Разработка прошивного обеспечения с низким энергопотреблением для носимых устройств","Оптимизация использования ресурсов в системах на основе микроконтроллера","Реализация операционных систем реального времени для промышленной автоматизации"],"ar":["تطوير برنامج ثابت منخفض الطاقة للاجهزة القابلة للارتداء","تحسين استخدام الموارد في الأنظمة المعتمدة على الميكروكونترولر","تنفيذ أنظمة التشغيل في الوقت الحقيقي للتحكم الآلي الصناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of microcontroller architecture","Limited to resource-constrained devices","RTOS implementation expertise necessary"],"zh":["需要了解微控制器架构","仅限资源受限设备","需要RTOS实现专长"],"ja":["マイクロコントローラアーキテクチャの知識が必要","リソース制約されたデバイスに限定される","RTOSの実装に関する専門知識が必要"],"ko":["마이크로컨트롤러 아키텍처에 대한 지식이 필요","자원 제한된 장치에만 제한","RTOS 구현에 대한 전문 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la arquitectura de microcontroladores","Limitado a dispositivos con recursos limitados","Se requiere experiencia en la implementación de RTOS"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de l''architecture des microcontrôleurs","Limité aux appareils à ressources limitées","L''expertise en matière de mise en œuvre de RTOS est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Mikrocontroller-Architektur","Begrenzt auf ressourcenbeschränkte Geräte","Erfahrung in der Implementierung von RTOS ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da arquitetura de microcontrolador","Limitado a dispositivos com recursos limitados","É necessária especialização na implementação de RTOS"],"ru":["Требует знания архитектуры микроконтроллера","Ограничен для устройств с ограниченными ресурсами","Необходима экспертиза в реализации RTOS"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بنية الميكروكونترولر","محدود للاجهزة المحدودة الموارد","يتطلب خبرة في تنفيذ نظام تشغيل الوقت الحقيقي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
