responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via..."},"definition":{"en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE). LLMProxy handles both modes out of the box, with zero buffering on streams, intelligent load balancing, and OpenAI-compatible API routing."},"features":{"zh":["RESTful API 设计原则","错误处理","OpenAPI 文档","API 版本控制","智能负载均衡"],"ja":["RESTful API デザイン原則","エラー処理","OpenAPI ドキュメント","API バージョニング","スマートな負荷分散"],"ko":["RESTful API 디자인 원칙","에러 처리","OpenAPI 문서","API 버전 관리","지능형 로드 밸런싱"],"es":["Principios de diseño de API RESTful","Patrones de diseño de API para APIs robustas","Implementación de manejo de errores y versionado de API","Documentación de API con OpenAPI/Swagger","Diseño de esquemas de solicitud y respuesta","Nombres de recursos y convenciones de URI"],"fr":["Principes de conception d''API RESTful","Modèles de conception d''API pour des API robustes","Implémentation de la gestion des erreurs et du versionnement d''API","Documentation d''API avec OpenAPI/Swagger","Conception de schémas de requête et de réponse","Noms de ressources et conventions d''URI"],"de":["Prinzipien des API-Designs RESTful","Muster des API-Designs für robuste APIs","Implementierung von Fehlerbehandlung und API-Versionierung","API-Dokumentation mit OpenAPI/Swagger","Entwurf von Anforderungs- und Antwortschemas","Ressourcennamen und URI-Konventionen"],"pt":["Princípios de design de API","Padrões de API RESTful","Implementação de solicitações e respostas","Manipulação de erros e exceções","Documentação de API com OpenAPI/Swagger"],"ru":["Принципы проектирования API","Шаблоны API RESTful","Реализация запросов и ответов","Обработка ошибок и исключений","Документация API с OpenAPI/Swagger"],"ar":["مبادئ تصميم واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","أنماط واجهات برمجة التطبيقات RESTful","تنفيذ الطلبات والاستجابات","معالجة الأخطاء والاستثناءات","توثيق واجهات برمجة التطبيقات مع OpenAPI/Swagger"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API 设计","RESTful API","OpenAPI","错误处理","API 版本控制","智能负载均衡","LLMProxy"],"ja":["API デザイン","RESTful API","OpenAPI","エラー処理","API バージョニング","スマートな負荷分散","LLMProxy"],"ko":["API 디자인","RESTful API","OpenAPI","에러 처리","API 버전 관리","지능형 로드 밸런싱","LLMProxy"],"es":["diseño de API","API RESTful","patrones de diseño de API","principios de diseño de API","documentación de API","versionado de API","manejo de errores","esquemas de solicitud y respuesta","nombres de recursos"],"fr":["conception d''API","API RESTful","modèles de conception d''API","principes de conception d''API","documentation d''API","versionnement d''API","gestion des erreurs","schémas de requête et de réponse","noms de ressources"],"de":["API-Design","API RESTful","Muster des API-Designs","Prinzipien des API-Designs","API-Dokumentation","API-Versionierung","Fehlerbehandlung","Anforderungs- und Antwortschemas","Ressourcennamen"],"pt":["design de API","API RESTful","princípios de design","padrões de API","documentação de API","OpenAPI","Swagger","desenvolvimento de API"],"ru":["проектирование API","API RESTful","принципы проектирования","шаблоны API","документация API","OpenAPI","Swagger","разработка API"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات RESTful","مبادئ تصميم","أنماط واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","توثيق واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","OpenAPI","Swagger","تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"aiyuekuang","repo":"LLMProxy","repoPath":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-design","description":"RESTful API design best practices. Use when designing endpoints, request/response schemas, error handling, and API versioning.","bodyPreview":"# API Design Skill\n\nRESTful API design principles and patterns for building robust, scalable APIs.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing new API endpoints\n- Defining request/response schemas\n- Implementing error handling\n- API versioning strategies\n- OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n---\n\n# 🔗 RESTful Conventions\n\n## Resource Naming\n\n```\n# ✅ Good: Plural nouns, lowercase, hyphens\nGET    /api/v1/users\nGET    /api/v1/users/{id}\nPOST   /api/v1/users\nPUT    /api/v1/users/{id}\nDELETE /api/v1/users/{id","body":"# API Design Skill\n\nRESTful API design principles and patterns for building robust, scalable APIs.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing new API endpoints\n- Defining request/response schemas\n- Implementing error handling\n- API versioning strategies\n- OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n---\n\n# 🔗 RESTful Conventions\n\n## Resource Naming\n\n```\n# ✅ Good: Plural nouns, lowercase, hyphens\nGET    /api/v1/users\nGET    /api/v1/users/{id}\nPOST   /api/v1/users\nPUT    /api/v1/users/{id}\nDELETE /api/v1/users/{id}\n\nGET    /api/v1/api-keys\nGET    /api/v1/model-providers\n\n# ❌ Bad: Verbs, camelCase, underscores\nGET    /api/v1/getUsers\nPOST   /api/v1/createUser\nGET    /api/v1/api_keys\n```\n\n## Nested Resources\n\n```\n# User''s API keys\nGET    /api/v1/users/{userId}/api-keys\nPOST   /api/v1/users/{userId}/api-keys\n\n# Model''s versions\nGET    /api/v1/models/{modelId}/versions\n```\n\n## HTTP Methods\n\n| Method | Usage | Idempotent |\n|--------|-------|------------|\n| GET | Retrieve resource(s) | Yes |\n| POST | Create resource | No |\n| PUT | Replace resource | Yes |\n| PATCH | Partial update | Yes |\n| DELETE | Remove resource | Yes |\n\n---\n\n# 📦 Request/Response Format\n\n## Successful Response\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"user_123\",\n    \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2024-01-15T10:30:00Z\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## List Response with Pagination\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": [\n    { \"id\": \"1\", \"name\": \"Item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"2\", \"name\": \"Item 2\" }\n  ],\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"pageSize\": 20,\n    \"total\": 100,\n    \"totalPages\": 5\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Error Response\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n    \"message\": \"Invalid request parameters\",\n    \"details\": [\n      {\n        \"field\": \"email\",\n        \"message\": \"Invalid email format\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"field\": \"password\",\n        \"message\": \"Password must be at least 8 characters\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"requestId\": \"req_abc123\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📊 HTTP Status Codes\n\n## Success (2xx)\n\n| Code | Usage |\n|------|-------|\n| 200 OK | General success, GET/PUT/PATCH |\n| 201 Created | Resource created (POST) |\n| 204 No Content | Success with no body (DELETE) |\n\n## Client Errors (4xx)\n\n| Code | Usage |\n|------|-------|\n| 400 Bad Request | Invalid request format/data |\n| 401 Unauthorized | Missing/invalid authentication |\n| 403 Forbidden | Authenticated but not authorized |\n| 404 Not Found | Resource doesn''t exist |\n| 409 Conflict | Resource conflict (duplicate) |\n| 422 Unprocessable | Validation errors |\n| 429 Too Many Requests | Rate limit exceeded |\n\n## Server Errors (5xx)\n\n| Code | Usage |\n|------|-------|\n| 500 Internal Server Error | Unexpected server error |\n| 502 Bad Gateway | Upstream service error |\n| 503 Service Unavailable | Service temporarily down |\n| 504 Gateway Timeout | Upstream timeout |\n\n---\n\n# 🔍 Query Parameters\n\n## Filtering\n\n```\nGET /api/v1/users?status=active&role=admin\nGET /api/v1/models?provider=openai&type=chat\n```\n\n## Sorting\n\n```\nGET /api/v1/users?sort=createdAt:desc\nGET /api/v1/users?sort=name:asc,createdAt:desc\n```\n\n## Pagination\n\n```\n# Offset-based (simple but slower for large datasets)\nGET /api/v1/users?page=2&pageSize=20\n\n# Cursor-based (better for large datasets)\nGET /api/v1/users?cursor=eyJpZCI6MTAwfQ&limit=20\n```\n\n## Field Selection\n\n```\nGET /api/v1/users?fields=id,name,email\nGET /api/v1/users?include=profile,settings\n```\n\n## Search\n\n```\nGET /api/v1/users?q=john\nGET /api/v1/users?search=john@example\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔐 Authentication\n\n## API Key (Header)\n\n```\nGET /api/v1/models\nAuthorization: Bearer sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxx\n```\n\n## API Key (Query - less secure)\n\n```\nGET /api/v1/models?api_key=sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxx\n```\n\n## JWT Token\n\n```\nGET /api/v1/users/me\nAuthorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📋 API Versioning\n\n## URL Path (Recommended)\n\n```\n/api/v1/users\n/api/v2/users\n```\n\n## Header\n\n```\nGET /api/users\nAPI-Version: 2024-01-15\n```\n\n## Query Parameter\n\n```\nGET /api/users?version=2\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📖 OpenAPI Specification\n\n```yaml\nopenapi: 3.0.3\ninfo:\n  title: LLMProxy API\n  version: 1.0.0\n  description: API for managing LLM proxy services\n\nservers:\n  - url: https://api.llmproxy.io/v1\n\npaths:\n  /models:\n    get:\n      summary: List all models\n      tags: [Models]\n      parameters:\n        - name: provider\n          in: query\n          schema:\n            type: string\n            enum: [openai, anthropic, azure]\n        - name: page\n          in: query\n          schema:\n            type: integer\n            default: 1\n      responses:\n        ''200'':\n          description: List of models\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: ''#/components/schemas/ModelListResponse''\n        ''401'':\n          $ref: ''#/components/responses/Unauthorized''\n\ncomponents:\n  schemas:\n    Model:\n      type: object\n      required: [id, name, provider]\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: string\n          example: \"model_123\"\n        name:\n          type: string\n          example: \"gpt-4\"\n        provider:\n          type: string\n          enum: [openai, anthropic, azure]\n        \n    ModelListResponse:\n      type: object\n      properties:\n        success:\n          type: boolean\n        data:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            $ref: ''#/components/schemas/Model''\n        meta:\n          $ref: ''#/components/schemas/PaginationMeta''\n\n  responses:\n    Unauthorized:\n      description: Authentication required\n      content:\n        application/json:\n          schema:\n            $ref: ''#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse''\n\n  securitySchemes:\n    bearerAuth:\n      type: http\n      scheme: bearer\n```\n\n---\n\n# ⚡ Rate Limiting Headers\n\n```\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nX-RateLimit-Limit: 1000\nX-RateLimit-Remaining: 999\nX-RateLimit-Reset: 1640995200\nRetry-After: 60\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📚 References\n\n- [Microsoft REST API Guidelines](https://github.com/microsoft/api-guidelines)\n- [Google API Design Guide](https://cloud.google.com/apis/design)\n- [JSON:API Specification](https://jsonapi.org/)\n- [OpenAPI Specification](https://swagger.io/specification/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:58:37.005Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing robust RESTful API design and implementation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的RESTful API设计和实现能力的AI代理。","ja":"強力なRESTful API設計と実装能力が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"강력한 RESTful API 설계 및 구현 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de diseño e implementación de API RESTful robustas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de capacités de conception et de mise en œuvre d''API RESTful robustes.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die robuste RESTful-API-Design- und Implementierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades robustas de design e implementação de API RESTful.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуются надежные возможности проектирования и реализации RESTful API.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تحتاج إلى قدرات تصميم وتنفيذ API RESTful قوية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design scalable APIs using RESTful conventions, implement intelligent load balancing, and handle real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE) with zero buffering, while also providing OpenAPI/Swagger documentation.","zh":"赋予代理设计可扩展的API的能力，使用RESTful约定，实现智能负载平衡，并通过Server-Sent Events（SSE）处理实时令牌流，且无缓冲，同时提供OpenAPI/Swagger文档。","ja":"エージェントがRESTful規約を使用してスケーラブルなAPIを設計し、インテリジェントな負荷分散を実装し、Server-Sent Events（SSE）を介してリアルタイムトークンストリーミングを処理する（バッファリングなし）だけでなく、OpenAPI/Swaggerドキュメントも提供する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 RESTful 규약을 사용하여 확장 가능한 API를 설계하고, 지능형 로드 밸런싱을 구현하며, Server-Sent Events(SSE)를 통해 실시간 토큰 스트리밍을 처리(버퍼링 없음)하고,同時に OpenAPI/Swagger 문서를 제공하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar API escalables utilizando convenciones RESTful, implementar un equilibrio de carga inteligente y manejar la transmisión de tokens en tiempo real a través de Server-Sent Events (SSE) con búfer cero, además de proporcionar documentación OpenAPI/Swagger.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des API escalables en utilisant les conventions RESTful, de mettre en œuvre un équilibrage de charge intelligent et de gérer la diffusion de jetons en temps réel via les événements envoyés par le serveur (SSE) avec un tampon zéro, tout en fournissant une documentation OpenAPI/Swagger.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, skalierbare APIs unter Verwendung von RESTful-Konventionen zu entwerfen, intelligente Lastverteilung zu implementieren und Echtzeit-Token-Streaming über Server-Sent Events (SSE) mit Nullpufferung zu verarbeiten, während auch OpenAPI/Swagger-Dokumentation bereitgestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem APIs escaláveis usando convenções RESTful, implementarem balanceamento de carga inteligente e lidarem com transmissão de token em tempo real via Server-Sent Events (SSE) com zero bufferização, além de fornecer documentação OpenAPI/Swagger.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать масштабируемые API с использованием соглашений RESTful, реализовывать интеллектуальный балансировщик нагрузки и обрабатывать потоковую передачу токенов в режиме реального времени через Server-Sent Events (SSE) с нулевой буферизацией, а также предоставляет документацию OpenAPI/Swagger.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تصميم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع باستخدام اتفاقيات RESTful، وتنفيذ موازنة حمولة ذكية ومعالجة بث العلامات في الوقت الفعلي عبر أحداث 서버 المرسلة (SSE) بدون حجز، بالإضافة إلى تقديم توثيق OpenAPI/Swagger."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new API endpoints with plural nouns and lowercase resource naming","Defining request/response schemas for standard JSON responses and real-time token streaming","Implementing error handling and API versioning strategies"],"zh":["使用复数名词和小写资源命名设计新的API端点","为标准JSON响应和实时令牌流定义请求/响应模式","实现错误处理和API版本控制策略"],"ja":["複数名詞と小文字のリソース命名を使用して新しいAPIエンドポイントを設計する","標準的なJSONレスポンスとリアルタイムトークンストリーミングのために、リクエスト/レスポンススキーマを定義する","エラーハンドリングとAPIバージョニング戦略を実装する"],"ko":["복수 명사 및 소문자 리소스 명명 규칙을 사용하여 새로운 API 엔드포인트를 설계한다","표준 JSON 응답 및 실시간 토큰 스트리밍을 위한 요청/응답 스키마를 정의한다","오류 처리 및 API 버전 관리 전략을 구현한다"],"es":["Diseñar nuevos puntos de conexión de API con sustantivos plurales y nombres de recursos en minúsculas","Definir esquemas de solicitud/respuesta para respuestas JSON estándar y transmisión de tokens en tiempo real","Implementar estrategias de control de errores y versionamiento de API"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux points de terminaison d''API avec des noms de ressources au pluriel et en minuscules","Définir des schémas de requête/réponse pour les réponses JSON standard et la diffusion de jetons en temps réel","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de gestion des erreurs et de versionnement d''API"],"de":["Entwerfen neuer API-Endpunkte mit pluralen Substantiven und Kleinbuchstaben-Ressourcennamen","Definieren von Anfrage/Antwortschemata für Standard-JSON-Antworten und Echtzeit-Token-Streaming","Implementieren von Fehlernhandhabungs- und API-Versionierungsstrategien"],"pt":["Projetar novos pontos de extremidade de API com substantivos plurais e nomenclatura de recursos em minúsculas","Definir esquemas de solicitação/resposta para respostas JSON padrão e transmissão de token em tempo real","Implementar estratégias de tratamento de erros e controle de versão de API"],"ru":["Проектировать новые конечные точки API с множественными существительными и наименованием ресурсов в нижнем регистре","Определять схемы запроса/ответа для стандартных ответов JSON и потоковой передачи токенов","Реализовывать стратегии обработки ошибок и управления версиями API"],"ar":["تصميم نهايات برمجة تطبيقات جديدة مع أسماء جمع وأسماء موارد بحروف صغيرة","تحديد مخططات الطلب/الاستجابة لاستجابات JSON القياسية وبث العلامات في الوقت الفعلي","تنفيذ استراتيجيات معالجة الأخطاء ومراقبة إصدار واجهة البرمجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of RESTful API design principles and patterns","Limited to API design and implementation, not a full-fledged backend framework"],"zh":["需要理解RESTful API设计原则和模式","仅限API设计和实现，不是完整的后端框架"],"ja":["RESTful API設計の原則とパターンを理解する必要がある","API設計と実装のみに限定され、完全なバックエンドフレームワークではない"],"ko":["RESTful API 설계 원칙 및 패턴을 이해해야 함","API 설계 및 구현에만 국한되며, 완전한 백엔드 프레임워크가 아님"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios y patrones de diseño de API RESTful","Limitado al diseño y la implementación de API, no un marco de trabajo de backend completo"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes et modèles de conception d''API RESTful","Limité à la conception et à la mise en œuvre d''API, et non à un framework de backend complet"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis für die Prinzipien und Muster des RESTful-API-Designs","Begrenzt auf API-Design und Implementierung, kein umfassendes Backend-Framework"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios e padrões de design de API RESTful","Limitado ao design e implementação de API, não é um framework de backend completo"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов и шаблонов проектирования RESTful API","Ограничен проектированием и реализацией API, не является полноценным фреймворком бэкенда"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ ونمطيات تصميم واجهة برمجة تطبيقات RESTful","محدود بتصميم وتنفيذ واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، وليس إطار عمل خلفي كامل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
