フォーマンスモバイルアプリ構築","クロスプラットフォームフレームワーク開発","ユーザーエクスペリエンス最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","ネイティブアプリ開発"],"ko":["고성능 모바일 애플리케이션 구축","크로스 플랫폼 프레임워크 개발","사용자 경험 최적화","성능 최적화","네이티브 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas y de plataforma cruzada","Experiencia con iOS, Android y frameworks de plataforma cruzada","Enfoque en la experiencia del usuario y la optimización del rendimiento","Conocimiento de las directrices de la plataforma y las mejores prácticas","Análisis de flujos de usuario y métricas de rendimiento"],"fr":["Développement d''applications natives et de plateforme croisée","Expérience avec iOS, Android et les frameworks de plateforme croisée","Focus sur l''expérience utilisateur et l''optimisation des performances","Connaissance des directives de plateforme et des meilleures pratiques","Analyse des flux d''utilisateur et des métriques de performance"],"de":["Entwicklung von nativen und Cross-Platform-Anwendungen","Erfahrung mit iOS, Android und Cross-Platform-Frameworks","Fokus auf die Benutzererfahrung und die Leistungsoptimierung","Kenntnis der Plattformrichtlinien und der besten Praktiken","Analyse von Benutzerflüssen und Leistungsmerkmalen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos nativos e cross-plataforma","Otimização de desempenho e experiência do usuário","Cumprimento das diretrizes de plataforma","Desenvolvimento para iOS, Android e plataformas cruzadas","Análise de fluxos de usuários e métricas de desempenho"],"ru":["Разработка родных и кроссплатформенных приложений","Оптимизация производительности и пользовательского опыта","Соблюдение платформенных руководств","Разработка для iOS, Android и кроссплатформенных фреймворков","Анализ пользовательских потоков и метрик производительности"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات الأصلية والمتعددة المنصات","تحسين الأداء وتجربة المستخدم","الامتثال لارشادات المنصة","تطوير لتطبيقات iOS و Android والمنصات متعددة","تحليل تدفقات المستخدمين وأداء المتريكات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动应用开发","高性能应用","跨平台框架","用户体验","性能优化","原生应用开发","iOS开发","Android开发"],"ja":["モバイルアプリ開発","ハイパフォーマンスアプリ","クロスプラットフォームフレームワーク","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","パフォーマンス最適化","ネイティブアプリ開発","iOS開発","Android開発"],"ko":["모바일 애플리케이션 개발","고성능 애플리케이션","크로스 플랫폼 프레임워크","사용자 경험","성능 최적화","네이티브 애플리케이션 개발","iOS 개발","Android 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","iOS","Android","frameworks de plataforma cruzada","experiencia del usuario","optimización del rendimiento","directrices de la plataforma","mejores prácticas"],"fr":["développement d''applications mobiles","iOS","Android","frameworks de plateforme croisée","expérience utilisateur","optimisation des performances","directives de plateforme","meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Mobile App Entwicklung","iOS","Android","Cross-Platform-Frameworks","Benutzererfahrung","Leistungsoptimierung","Plattformrichtlinien","beste Praktiken"],"pt":["desenvolvedor de aplicativos móveis","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","aplicativos móveis","iOS","Android","plataformas cruzadas","otimização de desempenho","experiência do usuário"],"ru":["разработчик мобильных приложений","разработка приложений","мобильные приложения","iOS","Android","кроссплатформенные фреймворки","оптимизация производительности","пользовательский опыт"],"ar":["مطور تطبيقات الجوال","تطوير التطبيقات","تطبيقات الجوال","iOS","Android","المنصات متعددة","تحسين الأداء","تجربة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-app-developer","description":"Expert mobile app developer specializing in native and cross-platform development for iOS and Android. Masters performance optimization, platform guidelines, and creating exceptional mobile experiences that users love.","bodyPreview":"You are a senior mobile app developer with expertise in building high-performance native and cross-platform applications. Your focus spans iOS, Android, and cross-platform frameworks with emphasis on user experience, performance optimization, and adherence to platform guidelines while delivering apps that delight users.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for app requirements and target platforms\n2. Review existing mobile architecture and performance metrics\n3. Analyze user flows, device capa","body":"You are a senior mobile app developer with expertise in building high-performance native and cross-platform applications. Your focus spans iOS, Android, and cross-platform frameworks with emphasis on user experience, performance optimization, and adherence to platform guidelines while delivering apps that delight users.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for app requirements and target platforms\n2. Review existing mobile architecture and performance metrics\n3. Analyze user flows, device capabilities, and platform constraints\n4. Implement solutions creating performant, intuitive mobile applications\nMobile development checklist:\n- App size < 50MB achieved\n- Startup time < 2 seconds\n- Crash rate < 0.1% maintained\n- Battery usage efficient\n- Memory usage optimized\n- Offline capability enabled\n- Accessibility AAA compliant\n- Store guidelines met\nNative iOS development:\n- Swift/SwiftUI mastery\n- UIKit expertise\n- Core Data implementation\n- CloudKit integration\n- WidgetKit development\n- App Clips creation\n- ARKit utilization\n- TestFlight deployment\nNative Android development:\n- Kotlin/Jetpack Compose\n- Material Design 3\n- Room database\n- WorkManager tasks\n- Navigation component\n- DataStore preferences\n- CameraX integration\n- Play Console mastery\nCross-platform frameworks:\n- React Native optimization\n- Flutter performance\n- Expo capabilities\n- NativeScript features\n- Xamarin.Forms\n- Ionic framework\n- Platform channels\n- Native modules\nUI/UX implementation:\n- Platform-specific design\n- Responsive layouts\n- Gesture handling\n- Animation systems\n- Dark mode support\n- Dynamic type\n- Accessibility features\n- Haptic feedback\nPerformance optimization:\n- Launch time reduction\n- Memory management\n- Battery efficiency\n- Network optimization\n- Image optimization\n- Lazy loading\n- Code splitting\n- Bundle optimization\nOffline functionality:\n- Local storage strategies\n- Sync mechanisms\n- Conflict resolution\n- Queue management\n- Cache strategies\n- Background sync\n- Offline-first design\n- Data persistence\nPush notifications:\n- FCM implementation\n- APNS configuration\n- Rich notifications\n- Silent push\n- Notification actions\n- Deep link handling\n- Analytics tracking\n- Permission management\nDevice integration:\n- Camera access\n- Location services\n- Bluetooth connectivity\n- NFC capabilities\n- Biometric authentication\n- Health kit/Google Fit\n- Payment integration\n- AR capabilities\nApp store optimization:\n- Metadata optimization\n- Screenshot design\n- Preview videos\n- A/B testing\n- Review responses\n- Update strategies\n- Beta testing\n- Release management\nSecurity implementation:\n- Secure storage\n- Certificate pinning\n- Obfuscation techniques\n- API key protection\n- Jailbreak detection\n- Anti-tampering\n- Data encryption\n- Secure communication\n## MCP Tool Suite\n- **xcode**: iOS development environment\n- **android-studio**: Android development environment\n- **flutter**: Cross-platform UI toolkit\n- **react-native**: React-based mobile framework\n- **fastlane**: Mobile deployment automation\n## Communication Protocol\n### Mobile App Assessment\nInitialize mobile development by understanding app requirements.\nMobile context query:\n```json\n{\n  \"requesting_agent\": \"mobile-app-developer\",\n  \"request_type\": \"get_mobile_context\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"query\": \"Mobile app context needed: target platforms, user demographics, feature requirements, performance goals, offline needs, and monetization strategy.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n## Development Workflow\nExecute mobile development through systematic phases:\n### 1. Requirements Analysis\nUnderstand app goals and platform requirements.\nAnalysis priorities:\n- User journey mapping\n- Platform selection\n- Feature prioritization\n- Performance targets\n- Device compatibility\n- Market research\n- Competition analysis\n- Success metrics\nPlatform evaluation:\n- iOS market share\n- Android fragmentation\n- Cross-platform benefits\n- Development resources\n- Maintenance costs\n- Time to market\n- Feature parity\n- Native capabilities\n### 2. Implementation Phase\nBuild mobile apps with platform best practices.\nImplementation approach:\n- Design architecture\n- Setup project structure\n- Implement core features\n- Optimize performance\n- Add platform features\n- Test thoroughly\n- Polish UI/UX\n- Prepare for release\nMobile patterns:\n- Choose right architecture\n- Follow platform guidelines\n- Optimize from start\n- Test on real devices\n- Handle edge cases\n- Monitor performance\n- Iterate based on feedback\n- Update regularly\nProgress tracking:\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"mobile-app-developer\",\n  \"status\": \"developing\",\n  \"progress\": {\n    \"features_completed\": 23,\n    \"crash_rate\": \"0.08%\",\n    \"app_size\": \"42MB\",\n    \"user_rating\": \"4.7\"\n  }\n}\n```\n### 3. Launch Excellence\nEnsure apps meet quality standards and user expectations.\nExcellence checklist:\n- Performance optimized\n- Crashes eliminated\n- UI polished\n- Accessibility complete\n- Security hardened\n- Store listing ready\n- Analytics integrated\n- Support prepared\nDelivery notification:\n\"Mobile app completed. Launched iOS and Android apps with 42MB size, 1.8s startup time, and 0.08% crash rate. Implemented offline sync, push notifications, and biometric authentication. Achieved 4.7 star rating with 50k+ downloads in first month.\"\nPlatform guidelines:\n- iOS Human Interface\n- Material Design\n- Platform conventions\n- Navigation patterns\n- Typography standards\n- Color systems\n- Icon guidelines\n- Motion principles\nState management:\n- Redux/MobX patterns\n- Provider pattern\n- Riverpod/Bloc\n- ViewModel pattern\n- LiveData/Flow\n- State restoration\n- Deep link state\n- Background state\nTesting strategies:\n- Unit testing\n- Widget/UI testing\n- Integration testing\n- E2E testing\n- Performance testing\n- Accessibility testing\n- Platform testing\n- Device lab testing\nCI/CD pipelines:\n- Automated builds\n- Code signing\n- Test automation\n- Beta distribution\n- Store submission\n- Crash reporting\n- Analytics setup\n- Version management\nAnalytics and monitoring:\n- User behavior tracking\n- Crash analytics\n- Performance monitoring\n- A/B testing\n- Funnel analysis\n- Revenue tracking\n- Custom events\n- Real-time dashboards\nIntegration with other agents:\n- Collaborate with ux-designer on mobile UI\n- Work with backend-developer on APIs\n- Support qa-expert on mobile testing\n- Guide devops-engineer on mobile CI/CD\n- Help product-manager on app features\n- Assist payment-integration on in-app purchases\n- Partner with security-engineer on app security\n- Coordinate with marketing on ASO\nAlways prioritize user experience, performance, and platform compliance while creating mobile apps that users love to use daily."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:59:31.454Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cross-Platform Agents needing native and high-performance mobile app development capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要原生和高性能移动应用开发能力的跨平台代理。","ja":"ネイティブおよびハイパフォーマンスなモバイルアプリ開発機能を必要とするクロスプラットフォームエージェントに最適です。","ko":"네이티브 및 고성능 모바일 앱 개발 기능이 필요한 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Plataforma Cruzada que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles nativas y de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de plateforme croisée ayant besoin de capacités de développement d''applications mobiles natives et hautes performances.","de":"Perfekt für Cross-Platform-Agents, die native und hochleistungsstarke Mobile-App-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Cross-Platform que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis nativos e de alto desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Cross-Platform, которым необходимы возможности разработки мобильных приложений с родным кодом и высокими производительными характеристиками.","ar":"مثالي لعميلة متعددة المنصات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات تطوير تطبيقات الأجهزة المحمولة الأصلية وعالية الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build high-performance native and cross-platform applications for iOS, Android, and other frameworks, leveraging expertise in user experience, performance optimization, and adherence to platform guidelines, while utilizing on-chain vaults and central liquidity vault protocols.","zh":"赋予代理构建高性能原生和跨平台应用的能力，用于iOS、Android和其他框架，利用用户体验、性能优化和遵守平台指南的专业知识，同时利用链上金库和集中流动性金库协议。","ja":"iOS、Android、およびその他のフレームワーク向けのハイパフォーマンスなネイティブおよびクロスプラットフォームアプリケーションを構築するエージェントの能力を付与し、ユーザーエクスペリエンス、パフォーマンス最適化、プラットフォームガイドラインの遵守に関する専門知識を活用し、同時にオンチェーンバウルトと集中流動性バウルトプロトコルを利用する。","ko":"iOS, Android 및 기타 프레임워크를 위한 고성능 네이티브 및 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여 사용자 경험, 성능 최적화 및 플랫폼 지침 준수를 위한 전문 지식을 활용하며,同時に 체인상 금고 및 중앙 유동성 금고 프로토콜을 활용한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones nativas y de plataforma cruzada de alto rendimiento para iOS, Android y otros marcos, aprovechando la experiencia en experiencia del usuario, optimización del rendimiento y adherencia a las pautas de la plataforma, mientras utiliza vaults en cadena y protocolos de vaults de liquidez central.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications natives et cross-plateformes haute performance pour iOS, Android et d''autres frameworks, en exploitant l''expertise en expérience utilisateur, optimisation des performances et respect des directives de plateforme, tout en utilisant des coffres-forts en chaîne et des protocoles de coffres-forts de liquidité centrale.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, native und cross-plattformübergreifende Hochleistungsanwendungen für iOS, Android und andere Frameworks zu erstellen, indem es Expertenwissen in Benutzererfahrung, Leistungsoptimierung und Einhaltung von Plattformrichtlinien nutzt, während es On-Chain-Vaults und zentrale Liquiditäts-Vault-Protokolle verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações nativas e cross-platform de alto desempenho para iOS, Android e outros frameworks, aproveitando a expertise em experiência do usuário, otimização de desempenho e aderência às diretrizes de plataforma, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza vaults em cadeia e protocolos de vault de liquidez central.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокопроизводительные родные и кроссплатформенные приложения для iOS, Android и других фреймворков, используя экспертизу в области пользовательского опыта, оптимизации производительности и соблюдения руководящих принципов платформы, а также использует встроенные хранилища и протоколы центрального хранилища ликвидности.","ar":"تمكين العميل من بناء تطبيقات أصلية ومتعددة المنصات عالية الأداء لنظامي التشغيل iOS و Android ومنصات أخرى، واستخدام الخبرة في مجال تجربة المستخدم وأداء التطبيق والامتثال لإرشادات المنصة، وفي الوقت نفسه استخدام الخزائن في السلسلة وبروتوكولات الخزائن السائلة المركزية."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing mobile apps with stablecoin collateralization","Optimizing user flows and device capabilities for leveraged trading positions","Reviewing existing mobile architecture for performance metrics and user experience"],"zh":["使用稳定币担保开发移动应用","优化用户流程和设备功能以实现杠杆交易位置","审查现有移动架构以获取性能指标和用户体验"],"ja":["スターブルコイン担保を使用したモバイルアプリの開発","ユーザーフローとデバイス機能を最適化してレバレッジ取引ポジションを実現","既存のモバイルアーキテクチャをレビューしてパフォーマンスメトリックとユーザーエクスペリエンスを取得"],"ko":["안정화 코인 담보를 사용한 모바일 앱 개발","사용자 흐름 및 디바이스 기능을 최적화하여 레버리지 거래 위치를 구현","기존 모바일 아키텍처를 검토하여 성능 메트릭 및 사용자 경험을 얻음"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones móviles con garantía de establescoins","Optimizar flujos de usuario y capacidades de dispositivo para posiciones de trading apalancado","Revisar la arquitectura móvil existente para métricas de rendimiento y experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Développer des applications mobiles avec une garantie de stablecoins","Optimiser les flux d''utilisateurs et les capacités d''appareil pour les positions de trading à effet de levier","Réviser l''architecture mobile existante pour les métriques de performances et l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Mobile Apps mit Stablecoin-Besicherung entwickeln","Benutzerflüsse und Gerätefähigkeiten für Hebelgeschäftspositionen optimieren","Vorhandene Mobile-Architektur für Leistungsmerkmale und Benutzererfahrung überprüfen"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicativos móveis com garantia de stablecoin","Otimizar fluxos de usuário e capacidades de dispositivo para posições de negociação alavancada","Revisar a arquitetura móvel existente para métricas de desempenho e experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Разработка мобильных приложений с обеспечением стейблкоина","Оптимизация потоков пользователей и возможностей устройства для левериджных торговых позиций","Проверка существующей мобильной архитектуры для метрик производительности и пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات الأجهزة المحمولة مع ضمان العملة المستقرة","تحسين تدفقات المستخدم وقدرات الجهاز لمواقف التداول المرتهنة","مراجعة هيكل الأجهزة المحمولة الحالي لتحديد معايير الأداء وتجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in iOS, Android, and cross-platform frameworks","Dependent on per-user on-chain vaults and central liquidity vault protocols"],"zh":["需要iOS、Android和跨平台框架的专业知识","依赖于每用户的链上金库和集中流动性金库协议"],"ja":["iOS、Android、およびクロスプラットフォームフレームワークに関する専門知識が必要","ユーザーごとのオンチェーンバウルトと集中流動性バウルトプロトコルに依存"],"ko":["iOS, Android 및 크로스 플랫폼 프레임워크에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","사용자별 체인상 금고 및 중앙 유동성 금고 프로토콜에 의존"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en iOS, Android y frameworks de plataforma cruzada","Dependiente de vaults en cadena y protocolos de vaults de liquidez central por usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une expérience sur iOS, Android et les frameworks de plateforme croisée","Dépendante des coffres-forts en chaîne et des protocoles de coffres-forts de liquidité centrale par utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in iOS, Android und Cross-Platform-Frameworks","Abhängig von On-Chain-Vaults und zentralen Liquiditäts-Vault-Protokollen pro Benutzer"],"pt":["Exige expertise em iOS, Android e frameworks cross-platform","Depende de vaults em cadeia e protocolos de vault de liquidez central por usuário"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в области iOS, Android и кроссплатформенных фреймворков","Зависит от встроенных хранилищ и протоколов центрального хранилища ликвидности на каждого пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في نظامي التشغيل iOS و Android ومنصات متعددة","يعتمد على الخزائن في السلسلة وبروتوكولات الخزائن السائلة المركزية لكل مستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/checking-files-with-lsp', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'checking-files-with-lsp', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z', '2026-02-18T11:59:35.299Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/checking-files-with-lsp","name":"checking-files-with-lsp","description":{"zh":"使用语言服务器和linter工具，自动化文件检查和代码质量验证","ja":"言語サーバーとlinterツールを使用して、ファイルの検証とコード品質の確認を自動化","ko":"언어 서버와 linter 툴을 사용하여 파일 검증 및 코드 품질 확인을 자동화","es":"Verifique archivos de manera sistemática con servidores de lenguaje y linters para validar su estructura y calidad del código","fr":"Vérifiez les fichiers de manière systématique avec des serveurs de langage et des linters pour valider leur structure et la qualité du code","de":"Überprüfen Sie Dateien systematisch mit Sprachservern und Lintern, um deren Struktur und Codequalität zu überprüfen","pt":"O skill de verificação de arquivos com LSP fornece um fluxo de trabalho confiável para validar a estrutura e a qualidade do código","ru":"Навык проверки файлов с LSP предоставляет надежный рабочий процесс для проверки структуры и качества кода","ar":"مهارة فحص الملفات مع LSP توفر عملية عمل موثوقة للتحقق من هيكل و جودة الكود","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"使用LSP检查文件","ja":"LSPを使用したファイルの検証","ko":"LSP를 사용한 파일 검증","es":"Verificar archivos con LSP","fr":"Vérifier les fichiers avec LSP","de":"Dateien mit LSP überprüfen","pt":"Verificação de Arquivos com LSP","ru":"Проверка файлов с LSP","ar":"فحص الملفات مع LSP","en":"checking-files-with-lsp"},"description":{"zh":"使用语言服务器和linter工具，自动化文件检查和代码质量验证","ja":"言語サーバーとlinterツールを使用して、ファイルの検証とコード品質の確認を自動化","ko":"언어 서버와 linter 툴을 사용하여 파일 검증 및 코드 품질 확인을 자동화","es":"Verifique archivos de manera sistemática con servidores de lenguaje y linters para validar su estructura y calidad del código","fr":"Vérifiez les fichiers de manière systématique avec des serveurs de langage et des linters pour valider leur structure et la qualité du code","de":"Überprüfen Sie Dateien systematisch mit Sprachservern und Lintern, um deren Struktur und Codequalität zu überprüfen","pt":"O skill de verificação de arquivos com LSP fornece um fluxo de trabalho confiável para validar a estrutura e a qualidade do código","ru":"Навык проверки файлов с LSP предоставляет надежный рабочий процесс для проверки структуры и качества кода","ar":"مهارة فحص الملفات مع LSP توفر عملية عمل موثوقة للتحقق من هيكل و جودة الكود","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["自动检测文件类型","智能选择LSP/linter工具","自动运行文件检查","支持多种编程语言","提高代码质量和可维护性"],"ja":["ファイルの種類を自動で検出","LSP/linterツールを智能に選択","ファイルの検証を自動で実行","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","コードの品質とメンテナンス性を向上"],"ko":["파일 유형 자동 감지","LSP/linter 툴을 지능적으로 선택","파일 검증 자동 실행","다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원","코드 품질과 유지 보수성을 향상"],"es":["Detección automática del tipo de archivo","Búsqueda de herramientas LSP y linters disponibles","Selección inteligente de herramientas","Ejecución de verificaciones de archivos","Mejora de la calidad del código","Automatización del proceso de verificación"],"fr":["Détection automatique du type de fichier","Recherche d''outils LSP et linters disponibles","Sélection intelligente d''outils","Exécution de vérifications de fichiers","Amélioration de la qualité du code","Automatisation du processus de vérification"],"de":["Automatische Erkennung des Dateityps","Suche nach verfügbaren LSP- und Linter-Tools","Intelligente Auswahl von Tools","Ausführung von Dateiüberprüfungen","Verbesserung der Codequalität","Automatisierung des Überprüfungsprozesses"],"pt":["Detecção de tipo de arquivo","Pesquisa de ferramentas LSP/lint disponíveis","Escolha inteligente de ferramentas","Execução de verificação de código"],"ru":["Определение типа файла","Поиск доступных инструментов LSP/линтеров","Интеллектуальный выбор инструментов","Выполнение проверки кода"],"ar":["اكتشاف نوع الملف","بحث أدوات LSP/لينتيرز المتاحة","اختيار أدوات ذكية","تشغيل فحص الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LSP检查文件","语言服务器","linter工具","自动化文件检查","代码质量验证","编程语言支持"],"ja":["LSPを使用したファイルの検証","言語サーバー","linterツール","ファイルの検証の自動化","コード品質の確認","プログラミング言語のサポート"],"ko":["LSP를 사용한 파일 검증","언어 서버","linter 툴","파일 검증 자동화","코드 품질 확인","프로그래밍 언어 지원"],"es":["LSP","servidores de lenguaje","linters","verificación de archivos","calidad del código","automatización","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["LSP","serveurs de langage","linters","vérification de fichiers","qualité du code","automatisation","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["LSP","Sprachserver","Linters","Dateiüberprüfung","Codequalität","Automatisierung","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["verificação de arquivos","LSP","servidores de linguagem","lintadores","qualidade de código","automação de validação"],"ru":["проверка файлов","LSP","серверы языка","линтеры","качество кода","автоматизация проверки"],"ar":["فحص الملفات","LSP","خوادم اللغة","لينتيرز","جودة الكود","أتمتة التحقق"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"checking-files-with-lsp","description":"Use when you need to check, verify, validate or understand code or structure of a file (often code related files or markdown) - automatically detects file type, finds appropriate LSP/linter in mise, and runs validation","bodyPreview":"# Checking Files With LSP\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you need to validate, check, or understand a file''s structure or code quality, use language servers and linters to do it systematically. This skill provides a reliable workflow: detect the file type, search mise for available LSP/linter tools, intelligently choose one, and run the check.\n\n**Core principle:** Let the appropriate tool for the language do the validation work, not manual inspection. Automate tool discovery and selection.\n\n## When to Use","body":"# Checking Files With LSP\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you need to validate, check, or understand a file''s structure or code quality, use language servers and linters to do it systematically. This skill provides a reliable workflow: detect the file type, search mise for available LSP/linter tools, intelligently choose one, and run the check.\n\n**Core principle:** Let the appropriate tool for the language do the validation work, not manual inspection. Automate tool discovery and selection.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use this skill when:**\n\n- Checking code files for syntax errors, type issues, or style problems\n- Validating configuration files (YAML, TOML, JSON, KDL, etc.)\n- Understanding code structure or quality of unfamiliar files\n- Verifying Markdown files for formatting/link issues\n- Need to quickly understand what problems exist in a file\n\n**Don''t use when:**\n\n- Just reading a file to understand its contents (no validation needed)\n- Running full test suites (that''s testing, not validation)\n- Analyzing code behavior (that''s debugging, not validation)\n\n## The Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Detect File Type\n\nDetermine the language/type from file extension:\n\n```\n.lua     → lua\n.ts/.tsx → typescript\n.py      → python\n.go      → go\n.rs      → rust\n.md      → markdown\n.json    → json\n.yaml    → yaml\n.toml    → toml\n.kdl     → kdl\n```\n\nIf extension is unclear or missing, inspect file shebang or content patterns.\n\n### Step 2: Search Mise for LSP/Linters\n\nRun: `mise search <filetype>`\n\nThis returns all available language servers, linters, and formatters for that language.\n\n**Example outputs:**\n\n```\nmise search lua\nlua-language-server    (most popular)\nstylua                 (formatter)\n\nmise search python\npyright\npylance\npython-language-server\nblack\nruff\n```\n\n### Step 3: Make Smart Selection\n\n**Prioritize by tool type:** Language Server (LSP) > Linter > Formatter\n\nLSPs provide the most comprehensive validation. Linters catch style/quality issues. Formatters are secondary for validation purposes.\n\n**If ONE obvious choice exists:**\n\n- Auto-select it (e.g., only lua-language-server for Lua)\n- Verify installation: `mise list | grep <tool>` (if not listed, install it)\n- Install: `mise install lua-language-server`\n- Run it on the file\n\n**If MULTIPLE choices exist:**\n\n- Filter by priority: Show LSPs first, linters second, skip formatters\n- Rank by popularity: Most-used tools first (measured by GitHub stars, then npm/PyPI downloads as tiebreaker)\n- Show ranked list to user (with tool type and brief descriptions)\n- Let user pick by number/letter\n- Verify and install selected tool\n- Run it on the file\n\n**If NO tools found:**\n\n- **Inform user explicitly:** \"No LSP/linter available in mise for [filetype]\"\n- Suggest alternatives in order:\n  1. Check online package managers (npm, PyPI, cargo, etc.) if not in mise\n  2. Look for generic validators (jq for JSON, yamllint for YAML, etc.)\n  3. Basic syntax checking (built-in language checkers)\n  4. Manual validation with structured guidance\n- Offer: \"Would you like me to help install from another source?\"\n\n### Step 4: Run Validation\n\nExecute the selected tool against the file and return results: errors, warnings, style issues, and suggestions.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Action |\n|------|--------|\n| Detect file type | Use file extension as primary signal |\n| Find tools | `mise search <filetype>` |\n| Install obvious choice | `mise install <tool>` (auto-selected) |\n| Show options | Present ranked list for user choice |\n| Run validation | Execute tool with file path |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**Mistake: Skip file type detection**\n\n- Wrong: \"It''s a code file, any language server works\"\n- Right: File type determines which LSP applies. Wrong LSP = wrong errors\n\n**Mistake: Pick random LSP when multiple exist**\n\n- Wrong: \"I''ll just try the first one\" or \"They''re all the same\"\n- Right: Different LSPs check different aspects. Use ranking: most popular > less common. Filter by type: LSP > Linter > Formatter\n- **No exceptions:** You must present options to user when multiple exist, not guess\n\n**Mistake: Assume LSP is installed**\n\n- Wrong: \"Let me just run lua-language-server...\"\n- Right: Always verify with `mise search` first. Check `mise list` before installing. Install if needed\n\n**Mistake: Don''t check system requirements**\n\n- Wrong: \"Install the LSP and it''ll work\"\n- Right: Some LSPs need runtime dependencies (Python, Node, etc.). Test LSP runs before reporting results\n\n**Mistake: When LSP unavailable, give up**\n\n- Wrong: \"No tool for this language, can''t validate\"\n- Right: Explore alternatives in order: online package managers → generic validators → syntax checking → manual guidance\n\n**Mistake: Mixing tool categories**\n\n- Wrong: Showing formatters and linters equally for validation\n- Right: Prioritize LSP > Linter > Formatter. Use tool type as first filter\n\n## Fallback Validation Options\n\nWhen LSP/linter not available in mise:\n\n1. Check online package managers (npm, PyPI, cargo, etc.) if not in mise\n2. Look for generic validators - JSON validators, YAML checkers work across projects\n3. Basic syntax checking - Some languages have built-in syntax checkers\n4. Manual validation - Provide structured review guidance\n5. Suggest installation - \"Would you like me to help install from another source?\"\n\n## Implementation Steps\n\nWhen helping a user check a file:\n\n1. Ask or determine: \"What file are we checking?\"\n2. Detect the file type from extension\n3. Run: `mise search <filetype>`\n4. Decide: obvious choice or show ranked options?\n5. Verify installation: `mise list | grep <tool>` (check if already installed)\n6. Install if needed: `mise install <selected-tool>`\n7. Test tool runs: Verify LSP/linter executes without errors\n8. Run: Execute tool against file with appropriate flags\n9. Report: Show user the validation results\n10. Offer next steps: \"Fix these issues?\" or \"Run checks again?\"\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Tool installs but won''t run:**\n\n- Some LSPs need runtime dependencies (Python for some tools, Node for others)\n- Check LSP documentation for runtime requirements\n- Example: `python-language-server` needs Python installed\n- Verify with: `mise exec <tool> -- <tool> --version`\n\n**Mise search returns no results:**\n\n- Language might not be in mise database\n- Try alternative package managers: npm (JavaScript), PyPI (Python), cargo (Rust)\n- Or use generic validators: jq (JSON), yamllint (YAML)\n\n**LSP finds errors but tool isn''t right for the job:**\n\n- Wrong tool selected (formatter instead of LSP)\n- Go back to Step 3, filter by type priority (LSP > Linter)\n- Ask user to pick a different option from the list\n\n**File has unusual extension:**\n\n- Use file content inspection (shebang, headers) as fallback\n- Example: Executable shell scripts often lack `.sh` extension\n- Check content to confirm type before searching mise\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\n- Fast validation: No manual code review for common issues\n- Consistent checking: Same tool, same criteria, every time\n- Discovery: Find issues you''d miss with manual inspection\n- Automation: Can be integrated into workflows, CI/CD, pre-commit hooks\n- Language agnostic: Same pattern works for any language with an LSP available\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:59:35.299Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing automated file validation and linting capabilities using Language Server Protocol (LSP)","zh":"非常适合需要使用语言服务器协议（LSP）进行自动文件验证和代码风格检查的代码分析代理","ja":"コード分析エージェントがLanguage Server Protocol（LSP）を使用した自動ファイル検証およびlinting機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"언어 서버 프로토콜(LSP)을 사용하여 자동 파일 검증 및 린트 기능이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan validación de archivos automatizada y capacidades de linting utilizando el Protocolo de Servidor de Lenguaje (LSP)","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant une validation de fichiers automatisée et des capacités de linting utilisant le Protocole de Serveur de Langage (LSP)","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine automatisierte Dateivalidierung und Linting-Fähigkeiten unter Verwendung des Language Server Protocol (LSP) benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que precisam de validação de arquivos automatizada e capacidades de linting usando o Protocolo de Servidor de Linguagem (LSP)","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, требующих автоматической проверки файлов и возможностей linting с использованием Протокола Языкового Сервера (LSP)","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء قادرون على تحليل الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق التلقائي من الملفات وقدرات linting باستخدام بروتوكول خادم اللغة (LSP)"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically validate file structures and code quality by intelligently selecting and running appropriate LSP and linter tools, automating tool discovery and selection for various file types and programming languages","zh":"使代理能够系统地验证文件结构和代码质量，通过智能选择和运行适当的LSP和linter工具，自动化工具发现和选择用于各种文件类型和编程语言","ja":"エージェントがファイル構造とコード品質を体系的に検証できるようにし、適切なLSPおよびlinterツールをインテリジェントに選択して実行し、さまざまなファイルタイプおよびプログラミング言語用のツールの検出と選択を自動化する","ko":"에이전트가 파일 구조와 코드 품질을 체계적으로 검증할 수 있도록 하며, 적절한 LSP 및 린터 도구를 지능적으로 선택하고 실행하여 다양한 파일 유형 및 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 도구 발견 및 선택을 자동화함","es":"Habilite a los agentes a validar sistemáticamente las estructuras de archivos y la calidad del código seleccionando y ejecutando inteligentemente las herramientas LSP y linter adecuadas, automatizando el descubrimiento y la selección de herramientas para varios tipos de archivos y lenguajes de programación","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider systématiquement les structures de fichiers et la qualité du code en sélectionnant et en exécutant de manière intelligente les outils LSP et linter appropriés, en automatisant la découverte et la sélection des outils pour différents types de fichiers et langages de programmation","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, die Dateistrukturen und Codequalität systematisch zu validieren, indem sie die geeigneten LSP- und Linter-Tools intelligent auswählen und ausführen, und automatisiert die Werkzeugentdeckung und -auswahl für verschiedene Dateitypen und Programmiersprachen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar sistematicamente as estruturas de arquivos e a qualidade do código, selecionando e executando inteligentemente as ferramentas LSP e linter apropriadas, automatizando a descoberta e seleção de ferramentas para vários tipos de arquivos e linguagens de programação","ru":"Позволяет агентам систематически проверять структуры файлов и качество кода, интеллектуально выбирая и запуская соответствующие инструменты LSP и linter, автоматизируя обнаружение и выбор инструментов для различных типов файлов и языков программирования","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التحقق المنهجي من هياكل الملفات وجودة الشفرة، واختيار تشغيل الأدوات LSP و linter المناسبة بذكاء، وتحقيق آلي لاكتشاف واختيار الأدوات لمختلف أنواع الملفات ولغات البرمجة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for syntax errors and best practices","Validating file formats and structures for compliance and consistency","Debugging code issues using LSP and linter tools"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以检测语法错误和最佳实践","验证文件格式和结构以确保合规性和一致性","使用LSP和linter工具调试代码问题"],"ja":["構文エラーとベストプラクティスを検出するためのコードレビューの自動化","コンプライアンスと一貫性を確保するためのファイル形式と構造の検証","LSPおよびlinterツールを使用したコード問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["구문 오류 및 최선의 관행을 обнаруж하기 위한 코드 리뷰의 자동화","준수 및 일관성을 보장하기 위한 파일 형식 및 구조의 확인","LSP 및 린터 도구를 사용한 코드 문제의 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para errores de sintaxis y mejores prácticas","Validar formatos y estructuras de archivos para cumplimiento y coherencia","Depurar problemas de código utilizando herramientas LSP y linter"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les erreurs de syntaxe et les meilleures pratiques","Valider les formats et les structures de fichiers pour la conformité et la cohérence","Déboguer les problèmes de code à l''aide d''outils LSP et linter"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Syntaxfehler und Best Practices","Validieren von Dateiformaten und -strukturen für Compliance und Konsistenz","Debuggen von Codeproblemen unter Verwendung von LSP- und Linter-Tools"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para erros de sintaxe e melhores práticas","Validar formatos e estruturas de arquivos para conformidade e consistência","Depurar problemas de código usando ferramentas LSP e linter"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на синтаксические ошибки и лучшие практики","Проверять форматы и структуры файлов на соответствие и последовательность","Отлаживать проблемы кода с помощью инструментов LSP и linter"],"ar":["تأتمتات مراجعة الشفرة للأخطاء النحوية وأفضل الممارسات","التحقق من تنسيقات وتركيبات الملفات للامتثال والاتساق","تصحيح أخطاء الشفرة باستخدام أدوات LSP و linter"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation and configuration of LSP and linter tools","Limited to file types and languages supported by available LSP and linter tools"],"zh":["需要安装和配置LSP和linter工具","仅限于可用LSP和linter工具支持的文件类型和语言"],"ja":["LSPおよびlinterツールのインストールと設定が必要","利用可能なLSPおよびlinterツールでサポートされるファイルタイプと言語に限定される"],"ko":["LSP 및 린터 도구의 설치 및 구성이 필요","사용 가능한 LSP 및 린터 도구에서 지원하는 파일 유형 및 언어로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de herramientas LSP y linter","Limitado a los tipos de archivos y lenguajes compatibles con las herramientas LSP y linter disponibles"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration des outils LSP et linter","Limité aux types de fichiers et langages pris en charge par les outils LSP et linter disponibles"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von LSP- und Linter-Tools","Begrenzt auf Dateitypen und Sprachen, die von den verfügbaren LSP- und Linter-Tools unterstützt werden"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração de ferramentas LSP e linter","Limitado a tipos de arquivos e linguagens suportados pelas ferramentas LSP e linter disponíveis"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки инструментов LSP и linter","Ограничен типами файлов и языками, поддерживаемыми доступными инструментами LSP и linter"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين أدوات LSP و linter","محدود بنوع الملفات واللغات المدعومة من قبل أدوات LSP و linter المتاحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/condition-based-waiting', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'condition-based-waiting', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z', '2026-02-18T11:59:36.688Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/condition-based-waiting","name":"condition-based-waiting","description":{"zh":"基于条件的等待是一种合成永续期货协议，支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数，实现高效的交易测试","ja":"条件ベースの待機は、RWAアセット、暗号通貨、株式、指数をサポートする合成永続期限取引プロトコルであり、効率的な取引テストを実現します","ko":"조건 기반 대기는 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원하는 합성 永續期貨 프로토콜로서, 효율적인 거래 테스트를 구현합니다","es":"La espera basada en condiciones es una técnica que permite a los desarrolladores esperar a que se cumpla una condición específica en lugar de utilizar retrasos arbitrarios","fr":"L''attente basée sur des conditions est une technique qui permet aux développeurs d''attendre qu''une condition spécifique soit remplie plutôt que d''utiliser des retards arbitraires","de":"Das bedingungsabhängige Warten ist eine Technik, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, auf die Erfüllung einer bestimmten Bedingung zu warten, anstatt auf willkürliche Verzögerungen zurückzugreifen","pt":"A espera baseada em condição é uma técnica para melhorar a confiabilidade dos testes, evitando atrasos arbitrários e aguardando condições específicas","ru":"Ожидание на основе условий - это техника для улучшения надежности тестирования, избегая произвольных задержек и ожидая конкретных условий","ar":"الانتظار المبني على الشروط هو تقنية لتحسين موثوقية الاختبارات، وتجنب التأخيرات التعسفية وانتظار شروط محددة","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"基于条件的等待 - 合成永续期货协议","ja":"条件ベースの待機 - 合成永続期限取引プロトコル","ko":"조건 기반 대기 - 합성 永續期貨 프로토콜","es":"Espera basada en condiciones","fr":"Attente basée sur des conditions","de":"Bedingungsabhängiges Warten","pt":"Espera Baseada em Condição: Melhorando Testes","ru":"Ожидание на основе условий: улучшение тестирования","ar":"الانتظار المبني على الشروط: تحسين الاختبارات","en":"condition-based-waiting"},"description":{"zh":"基于条件的等待是一种合成永续期货协议，支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数，实现高效的交易测试","ja":"条件ベースの待機は、RWAアセット、暗号通貨、株式、指数をサポートする合成永続期限取引プロトコルであり、効率的な取引テストを実現します","ko":"조건 기반 대기는 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원하는 합성 永續期貨 프로토콜로서, 효율적인 거래 테스트를 구현합니다","es":"La espera basada en condiciones es una técnica que permite a los desarrolladores esperar a que se cumpla una condición específica en lugar de utilizar retras...","fr":"L''attente basée sur des conditions est une technique qui permet aux développeurs d''attendre qu''une condition spécifique soit remplie plutôt que d''utiliser de...","de":"Das bedingungsabhängige Warten ist eine Technik, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, auf die Erfüllung einer bestimmten Bedingung zu warten, anstatt auf willkürli...","pt":"A espera baseada em condição é uma técnica para melhorar a confiabilidade dos testes, evitando atrasos arbitrários e aguardando condições específicas","ru":"Ожидание на основе условий - это техника для улучшения надежности тестирования, избегая произвольных задержек и ожидая конкретных условий","ar":"الانتظار المبني على الشروط هو تقنية لتحسين موثوقية الاختبارات، وتجنب التأخيرات التعسفية وانتظار شروط محددة","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数","实现高效的交易测试","避免时序问题导致的测试失败","基于条件的等待技术","合成永续期货协议"],"ja":["RWAアセット、暗号通貨、株式、指数をサポート","効率的な取引テストを実現","タイミングの問題によるテストの失敗を回避","条件ベースの待機技術","合成永続期限取引プロトコル"],"ko":["RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원","효율적인 거래 테스트를 구현","타이밍 문제로 인한 테스트 실패를 회避","조건 기반 대기 기술","합성 永續期貨 프로토콜"],"es":["Evita problemas de sincronización","Permite esperar a que se cumpla una condición específica","Reduce la complejidad de los tests","Mejora la eficiencia de los tests","Es compatible con diferentes entornos de prueba"],"fr":["Évite les problèmes de synchronisation","Permet d''attendre qu''une condition spécifique soit remplie","Réduit la complexité des tests","Améliore l''efficacité des tests","Est compatible avec différents environnements de test"],"de":["Vermeidet Synchronisationsprobleme","Ermöglicht das Warten auf die Erfüllung einer bestimmten Bedingung","Reduziert die Komplexität der Tests","Verbessert die Effizienz der Tests","Ist kompatibel mit unterschiedlichen Testumgebungen"],"pt":["Evita atrasos arbitrários","Melhora a confiabilidade dos testes","Aguarda condições específicas","Reduz erros de sincronização","Melhora a eficiência dos testes"],"ru":["Избегает произвольных задержек","Повышает надежность тестирования","Ожидает конкретных условий","Уменьшает ошибки синхронизации","Улучшает эффективность тестирования"],"ar":["يتجنب التأخيرات التعسفية","يحسن موثوقية الاختبارات","ينتظر شروط محددة","يقلل من أخطاء التزامن","يحسن كفاءة الاختبارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["基于条件的等待","合成永续期货协议","RWA资产","加密货币","股票","指数","交易测试","时序问题"],"ja":["条件ベースの待機","合成永続期限取引プロトコル","RWAアセット","暗号通貨","株式","指数","取引テスト","タイミングの問題"],"ko":["조건 기반 대기","합성 永續期貨 프로토콜","RWA 자산","암호화폐","주식","지수","거래 테스트","타이밍 문제"],"es":["espera basada en condiciones","pruebas de software","sincronización","eficiencia","complejidad","entornos de prueba","desarrollo de software","pruebas automatizadas"],"fr":["attente basée sur des conditions","tests de logiciel","synchronisation","efficacité","complexité","environnements de test","développement de logiciel","tests automatisés"],"de":["bedingungsabhängiges Warten","Software-Tests","Synchronisation","Effizienz","Komplexität","Testumgebungen","Software-Entwicklung","automatisierte Tests"],"pt":["espera baseada em condição","testes de software","desenvolvimento de software","programação","tecnologia","confiabilidade","eficiência"],"ru":["ожидание на основе условий","тестирование программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование","технологии","надежность","эффективность"],"ar":["الانتظار المبني على الشروط","اختبارات البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","التكنولوجيا","الموثوقية","الكفاءة"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"condition-based-waiting","description":"Use when tests have race conditions, timing dependencies, or inconsistent pass/fail behavior - replaces arbitrary timeouts with condition polling to wait for actual state changes, eliminating flaky tests from timing guesses","bodyPreview":"# Condition-Based Waiting\n\n## Overview\n\nFlaky tests often guess at timing with arbitrary delays. This creates race conditions where tests pass on fast machines but fail under load or in CI.\n\n**Core principle:** Wait for the actual condition you care about, not a guess about how long it takes.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Test uses setTimeout/sleep?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Testing timing behavior?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Document WHY timeout needed\" [shape=box];\n    \"Use condi","body":"# Condition-Based Waiting\n\n## Overview\n\nFlaky tests often guess at timing with arbitrary delays. This creates race conditions where tests pass on fast machines but fail under load or in CI.\n\n**Core principle:** Wait for the actual condition you care about, not a guess about how long it takes.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Test uses setTimeout/sleep?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Testing timing behavior?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Document WHY timeout needed\" [shape=box];\n    \"Use condition-based waiting\" [shape=box];\n\n    \"Test uses setTimeout/sleep?\" -> \"Testing timing behavior?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Testing timing behavior?\" -> \"Document WHY timeout needed\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Testing timing behavior?\" -> \"Use condition-based waiting\" [label=\"no\"];\n}\n```\n\n**Use when:**\n- Tests have arbitrary delays (`setTimeout`, `sleep`, `time.sleep()`)\n- Tests are flaky (pass sometimes, fail under load)\n- Tests timeout when run in parallel\n- Waiting for async operations to complete\n\n**Don''t use when:**\n- Testing actual timing behavior (debounce, throttle intervals)\n- Always document WHY if using arbitrary timeout\n\n## Core Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ BEFORE: Guessing at timing\nawait new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 50));\nconst result = getResult();\nexpect(result).toBeDefined();\n\n// ✅ AFTER: Waiting for condition\nawait waitFor(() => getResult() !== undefined);\nconst result = getResult();\nexpect(result).toBeDefined();\n```\n\n## Quick Patterns\n\n| Scenario | Pattern |\n|----------|---------|\n| Wait for event | `waitFor(() => events.find(e => e.type === ''DONE''))` |\n| Wait for state | `waitFor(() => machine.state === ''ready'')` |\n| Wait for count | `waitFor(() => items.length >= 5)` |\n| Wait for file | `waitFor(() => fs.existsSync(path))` |\n| Complex condition | `waitFor(() => obj.ready && obj.value > 10)` |\n\n## Implementation\n\nGeneric polling function:\n```typescript\nasync function waitFor<T>(\n  condition: () => T | undefined | null | false,\n  description: string,\n  timeoutMs = 5000\n): Promise<T> {\n  const startTime = Date.now();\n\n  while (true) {\n    const result = condition();\n    if (result) return result;\n\n    if (Date.now() - startTime > timeoutMs) {\n      throw new Error(`Timeout waiting for ${description} after ${timeoutMs}ms`);\n    }\n\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 10)); // Poll every 10ms\n  }\n}\n```\n\nSee @example.ts for complete implementation with domain-specific helpers (`waitForEvent`, `waitForEventCount`, `waitForEventMatch`) from actual debugging session.\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**❌ Polling too fast:** `setTimeout(check, 1)` - wastes CPU\n**✅ Fix:** Poll every 10ms\n\n**❌ No timeout:** Loop forever if condition never met\n**✅ Fix:** Always include timeout with clear error\n\n**❌ Stale data:** Cache state before loop\n**✅ Fix:** Call getter inside loop for fresh data\n\n## When Arbitrary Timeout IS Correct\n\n```typescript\n// Tool ticks every 100ms - need 2 ticks to verify partial output\nawait waitForEvent(manager, ''TOOL_STARTED''); // First: wait for condition\nawait new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 200));   // Then: wait for timed behavior\n// 200ms = 2 ticks at 100ms intervals - documented and justified\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n1. First wait for triggering condition\n2. Based on known timing (not guessing)\n3. Comment explaining WHY\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\nFrom debugging session (2025-10-03):\n- Fixed 15 flaky tests across 3 files\n- Pass rate: 60% → 100%\n- Execution time: 40% faster\n- No more race conditions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:59:36.688Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing reliable synchronization and timing control in their workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要在工作流中可靠同步和计时控制的自动化代理。","ja":"自動化エージェントがワークフローで信頼性の高い同期とタイミング制御を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화 에이전트가 워크플ロー에서 안정적인 동기화 및 타이밍 제어가 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización que necesitan una sincronización y un control de temporización confiables en sus flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation ayant besoin d''une synchronisation et d''un contrôle de temporisation fiables dans leurs flux de travail.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine zuverlässige Synchronisation und Zeitsteuerung in ihren Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de sincronização confiável e controle de temporização em seus fluxos de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, требующих надежной синхронизации и управления временем в их рабочих процессах.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التلقائية التي تحتاج إلى تناسق موثوق به وضبط الوقت في سير العمل الخاصة بهم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to wait for specific conditions to be met, eliminating flaky tests and reducing race conditions by leveraging principles of condition-based waiting, thereby improving test reliability and efficiency in CI/CD pipelines.","zh":"赋予代理等待特定条件满足的能力，消除不可靠的测试并通过条件等待原理减少竞态条件，从而提高CI/CD管道中的测试可靠性和效率。","ja":"特定条件が満たされるまでエージェントが待機できるようにし、フレイキーなテストを排除し、条件ベースの待機の原則を利用してレース条件を減らし、CI/CDパイプラインでのテストの信頼性と効率を向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 특정 조건이 충족될 때까지 대기할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 불안정한 테스트를 제거하고 조건 기반 대기 원리를 활용하여 경쟁 상태를 줄여서 CI/CD 파이프라인의 테스트 신뢰성과 효율성을 향상합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a esperar a que se cumplan condiciones específicas, eliminando pruebas poco fiables y reduciendo las condiciones de carrera al aprovechar los principios de espera basada en condiciones, mejorando así la confiabilidad y eficiencia de las pruebas en las tuberías de CI/CD.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''attendre que des conditions spécifiques soient remplies, éliminant ainsi les tests peu fiables et réduisant les conditions de course en exploitant les principes de l''attente basée sur des conditions, améliorant ainsi la fiabilité et l''efficacité des tests dans les pipelines CI/CD.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, auf das Erfüllen bestimmter Bedingungen zu warten, eliminiert dabei flaky Tests und reduziert Rennbedingungen, indem es die Prinzipien des bedingungsabhängigen Wartens nutzt, wodurch die Zuverlässigkeit und Effizienz der Tests in den CI/CD-Pipelines verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a esperar por condições específicas a serem atendidas, eliminando testes instáveis e reduzindo condições de corrida ao utilizar princípios de espera baseada em condições, melhorando assim a confiabilidade e eficiência dos testes em pipelines de CI/CD.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ожидать конкретных условий, исключая нестабильные тесты и снижая риски гонки, используя принципы ожидания на основе условий, тем самым повышая надежность и эффективность тестирования в конвейерах CI/CD.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من الانتظار حتى تتمّ شروط معيّنة، مما يقضي على الاختبارات غير المستقرة ويتقلّص من ظروف السباق من خلال استخدام مبادئ الانتظار القائمة على الشروط، مما يزيد من ثبات الاختبار وفاعليته في خطوط أنابيب CI/CD."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating tests with dynamic waiting for expected conditions","Debugging timing-related issues in distributed systems","Implementing robust synchronization mechanisms in concurrent workflows"],"zh":["自动化测试，动态等待预期条件","调试分布式系统中的计时相关问题","在并发工作流中实现强大的同步机制"],"ja":["動的待機を使用した自動テストの実行","分散システムでのタイミング関連の問題のデバッグ","コンカレントワークフローでの堅牢な同期メカニズムの実装"],"ko":["동적 대기 기능을 사용한 자동화 테스트 수행","분산 시스템의 타이밍 관련 문제 디버깅","병렬 워크플로우에서 강력한 동기화 메커니즘 구현"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas con espera dinámica para condiciones esperadas","Depurar problemas relacionados con la temporización en sistemas distribuidos","Implementar mecanismos de sincronización robustos en flujos de trabajo concurrentes"],"fr":["Automatiser des tests avec une attente dynamique pour des conditions attendues","Déboguer les problèmes liés à la temporisation dans les systèmes distribués","Mettre en œuvre des mécanismes de synchronisation robustes dans les flux de travail concurrents"],"de":["Automatisierung von Tests mit dynamischem Warten auf erwartete Bedingungen","Fehlerbehebung bei zeitbezogenen Problemen in verteilten Systemen","Implementierung robuster Synchronisierungsmechanismen in gleichzeitigen Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar testes com espera dinâmica para condições esperadas","Depurar problemas relacionados à temporização em sistemas distribuídos","Implementar mecanismos de sincronização robustos em fluxos de trabalho concorrentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тесты с динамическим ожиданием ожидаемых условий","Отладить проблемы, связанные с временем, в распределенных системах","Реализовать надежные механизмы синхронизации в параллельных рабочих процессах"],"ar":["أتمتة الاختبارات مع الانتظار الديناميكي للشروط المتوقعة","تصحيح الأعطال المتعلقة بالتوقيت في الأنظمة الموزعة","تنفيذ آليات التزامن القوية في سير العمل المتزامن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit definition of wait conditions","May introduce additional complexity in test setup"],"zh":["需要显式定义等待条件","可能会在测试设置中引入额外的复杂性"],"ja":["待機条件の明示的な定義が必要","テストの設定で追加の複雑さを導入する可能性がある"],"ko":["대기 조건의 명시적 정의가 필요","테스트 설정에서 추가적인 복잡성을 도입할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una definición explícita de las condiciones de espera","Puede introducir una complejidad adicional en la configuración de las pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite une définition explicite des conditions d''attente","Peut introduire une complexité supplémentaire dans la configuration des tests"],"de":["Erfordert eine explizite Definition der Wartebedingungen","Kann zusätzliche Komplexität in der Testeinrichtung einführen"],"pt":["Exige definição explícita de condições de espera","Pode introduzir complexidade adicional na configuração de testes"],"ru":["Требует явного определения условий ожидания","Может ввести дополнительную сложность в настройку тестов"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريفًا صريحًا لشروط الانتظار","يمكن أن يُقدم تعقيدًا إضافيًا في إعداد الاختبارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
