"pt":"Armazenamento Básico de Memória para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Базовое хранилище памяти для разработчиков","ar":"تخزين الذاكرة الأساسي للمطورين","en":"storage-basicmemory"},"description":{"zh":"基本内存存储是项目文档管理的核心原则，要求所有项目文档存储在基本内存中","ja":"ベーシックメモリーストレージはプロジェクト文書管理の核心原則であり、すべてのプロジェクト文書をベーシックメモリに保存することを要求する","ko":"기본 메모리 저장소는 프로젝트 문서 관리의 핵심 원칙으로 모든 프로젝트 문서를 기본 메모리에 저장하도록 요구합니다","es":"El almacenamiento básico de memoria es esencial para proyectos, permitiendo una gestión eficiente de artefactos","fr":"Le stockage de base de mémoire est essentiel pour les projets, permettant une gestion efficace des artefacts","de":"Die Basis-Speicherung ist für Projekte unerlässlich, ermöglicht eine effiziente Verwaltung von Artefakten","pt":"O armazenamento básico de memória é uma abordagem para gerenciar projetos de desenvolvimento, armazenando artefatos de projeto em um local centralizado","ru":"Базовое хранилище памяти - это подход к управлению проектами разработки, при котором артефакты проекта хранятся в центральном месте","ar":"تخزين الذاكرة الأساسي هو نهج لتدبير مشاريع التطوير، حيث يتم تخزين مكونات المشروع في مكان مركزي","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["使用基本内存MCP工具读写项目文档","识别项目文档类型","维护单一来源的真实性","支持多个项目的并发管理","提供项目文档的 explicit linking 和状态跟踪"],"ja":["ベーシックメモリMCPツールを使用してプロジェクト文書を読み書きする","プロジェクト文書の種類を識別する","単一の情報源を維持する","複数のプロジェクトの同時管理をサポートする","プロジェクト文書の明示的なリンクと状態の追跡を提供する"],"ko":["기본 메모리 MCP 도구를 사용하여 프로젝트 문서를 읽고 쓸 수 있습니다","프로젝트 문서의 유형을 인식할 수 있습니다","단일 정보 소스를 유지할 수 있습니다","여러 프로젝트의 동시 관리를 지원합니다","프로젝트 문서의 명시적 링크와 상태 추적을 제공합니다"],"es":["Almacenamiento de artefactos de proyecto","Gestión eficiente de artefactos","Uso de herramientas MCP para leer y escribir artefactos","Reconocimiento de tipos de artefactos","Seguimiento de estado y enlaces explícitos"],"fr":["Stockage d''artefacts de projet","Gestion efficace des artefacts","Utilisation d''outils MCP pour lire et écrire des artefacts","Reconnaissance de types d''artefacts","Suivi de l''état et des liens explicites"],"de":["Speicherung von Projektartefakten","Effiziente Verwaltung von Artefakten","Verwendung von MCP-Tools zum Lesen und Schreiben von Artefakten","Erkennung von Artefakttypen","Status- und Linkverfolgung"],"pt":["Armazenamento centralizado de artefatos de projeto","Gerenciamento de status e vinculação de artefatos","Uso de ferramentas MCP para leitura e escrita de artefatos","Reconhecimento de tipos de artefatos de projeto","Manutenção de uma fonte de verdade única em projetos concorrentes"],"ru":["Центральное хранилище артефактов проекта","Управление статусом и связыванием артефактов","Использование инструментов MCP для чтения и записи артефактов","Распознавание типов артефактов проекта","Поддержание единой источника правды в конкурирующих проектах"],"ar":["تخزين مركزي لمكونات المشروع","إدارة حالة وربط مكونات المشروع","استخدام أدوات MCP للقراءة والكتابة لمكونات المشروع","التعرف على أنواع مكونات المشروع","الحفاظ على مصدر وحيد للحقيقة في المشاريع المتزامنة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["基本内存存储","项目文档管理","MCP工具","单一来源","并发管理","explicit linking","状态跟踪"],"ja":["ベーシックメモリーストレージ","プロジェクト文書管理","MCPツール","単一の情報源","同時管理","明示的なリンク","状態の追跡"],"ko":["기본 메모리 저장소","프로젝트 문서 관리","MCP 도구","단일 정보 소스","동시 관리","명시적 링크","상태 추적"],"es":["almacenamiento básico de memoria","gestión de artefactos","herramientas MCP","tipos de artefactos","seguimiento de estado","desarrollo de proyectos","eficiencia en el almacenamiento"],"fr":["stockage de base de mémoire","gestion des artefacts","outils MCP","types d''artefacts","suivi de l''état","développement de projets","efficacité de stockage"],"de":["Basis-Speicherung","Artefaktverwaltung","MCP-Tools","Artefakttypen","Statusverfolgung","Projektentwicklung","SpeicherEffizienz"],"pt":["armazenamento básico de memória","gerenciamento de projetos","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas MCP","artefatos de projeto","status e vinculação","fonte de verdade única"],"ru":["базовое хранилище памяти","управление проектами","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты MCP","артефакты проекта","статус и связывание","единная источник правды"],"ar":["تخزين الذاكرة الأساسي","إدارة المشاريع","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات MCP","مكونات المشروع","حالة وربط","مصدر وحيد للحقيقة"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"storage-basicmemory","description":"Use when storing project artifacts in basic memory storage.","bodyPreview":"**Core principle:** All project artifacts must be stored in basicmemory under a [ProjectId], with explicit linking and status tracking to maintain single source of truth across concurrent projects.\n> [!NOTE]\n> Before starting anything, ensure you have identified the correct [ProjectId] for the project you are working on.\n## Requirements:\n- use basicmemory mcp tools to read and write [Project Artifacts].\n- Recognise types of [Project Artifacts]: [Spec], [Research], [Descision], [Epic], [Story], [","body":"**Core principle:** All project artifacts must be stored in basicmemory under a [ProjectId], with explicit linking and status tracking to maintain single source of truth across concurrent projects.\n> [!NOTE]\n> Before starting anything, ensure you have identified the correct [ProjectId] for the project you are working on.\n## Requirements:\n- use basicmemory mcp tools to read and write [Project Artifacts].\n- Recognise types of [Project Artifacts]: [Spec], [Research], [Descision], [Epic], [Story], [Task], [Retrospective].\n- Store [Project Artifacts] in basicmemory under the correct project context using [ProjectId].\n## How to interact with [Project Artifacts] storage?\n**CRITICAL** All [Project Artifacts] are interacted with via basicmemory mcp tools.\n**FAILURE MODE** Interacting with [Project Artifacts] via the file system directly is not allowed and will lead to disorganization and loss of data.\n- basicmemory_read_note - Read markdown notes\n- basicmemory_read_content - Read file raw content by path\n- basicmemory_view_note - View formatted notes\n- basicmemory_write_note - Create/update markdown notes\n- basicmemory_edit_note - Edit existing notes with operations\n- basicmemory_move_note - Move notes to new locations\n- basicmemory_delete_note - Delete notes by title\n- basicmemory_canvas - Create Obsidian canvas files\n- basicmemory_search_notes - Search across knowledge base\n- basicmemory_search - Search for content across knowledge base\n- basicmemory_fetch - Fetch full contents of search results\n- basicmemory_recent_activity - Get recent activity\n- basicmemory_build_context - Build context from memory URIs\n- basicmemory_list_memory_projects - List all available projects\n- basicmemory_create_memory_project - Create new projects\n- basicmemory_delete_project - Delete projects\n- basicmemory_list_directory - List directory contents\n- basicmemory_sync_status - Check file sync status\n### Planning Artifact Frontmatter\nFrontmatter for planning artifacts is important. It must remain at the top of the markdown file as YAML, NOT as markdown code blocks.\n#### Understanding Frontmatter\nTemplates contain YAML frontmatter blocks at the top, between `---` delimiters:\n```yaml\n---\nepic_id: 1\ntitle: Epic Title\nstatus: planned\npriority: high\nestimated_effort: 2 weeks\nlinked_spec:\n  - type: spec\n    target: 2.1.1-spec-title\n---\n# Rest of markdown content here\n```\nThis is **actual YAML frontmatter**, not a markdown code block. When you create artifacts, this structure must be preserved exactly.\n#### Frontmatter Preservation Workflow\nWhen creating or updating planning artifacts via `basicmemory_write_note`:\n**Step 1: Parse Template File**\n- Extract the frontmatter block (everything between first `---` and second `---`)\n- Extract the markdown body (everything after the closing `---`)\n- Keep them separate\n**Step 2: Assemble Content for basicmemory**\nThe content passed to `basicmemory_write_note` must be:\n```md\n---\nfield1: value1\nfield2: value2\nlinks:\n  - type: epic\n    target: 2.1.1-epic-title\n---\n# Markdown Heading\nMarkdown body content here...\n```\n**Critical requirements:**\n- Content MUST start with `---`\n- Frontmatter block MUST end with `---`\n- Blank line MUST separate frontmatter from markdown body\n- All frontmatter fields from template MUST be preserved\n- No `## Frontmatter` markdown sections\n**Step 3: Call basicmemory_write_note**\n```md\nbasicmemory_write_note(\n    title=\"artifact-title\",\n    folder=\"2-epics\",  # or 1-prds, 3-research, etc.\n    content=assembled_content,  # With frontmatter at top\n    entity_type=\"epic\",  # or spec, research, story, task, decision\n    tags=extracted_tags,  # Optional, if tags are in frontmatter\n    project=project_id\n)\n```\n**Step 4: basicmemory Handles the Rest**\nbasicmemory automatically:\n- Detects the YAML frontmatter (via `has_frontmatter()`)\n- Parses all frontmatter fields\n- Removes frontmatter from markdown body (via `remove_frontmatter()`)\n- Preserves all fields in the final artifact as YAML frontmatter\n- Converts back to proper markdown with YAML frontmatter\n#### Field Mapping\nTemplate frontmatter fields become YAML frontmatter in the artifact:\n- `epic_id: 1` → stored in frontmatter as `epic_id`\n- `status: planned` → stored as `status`\n- `priority: high` → stored as `priority`\n- `estimated_effort: 2 weeks` → stored as `estimated_effort`\n- `linked_spec: [...]` → stored as YAML list in frontmatter\n- `derived_from: [...]` → stored as YAML list in frontmatter\nThese are **structured metadata fields**, not markdown content.\n#### Common Mistake: Markdown Code Blocks\n❌ **WRONG** - Creates markdown code block, loses frontmatter:\n```md\n---\ntitle: Artifact Title\ntype: epic\npermalink: some-path\n---\n# Artifact Title\n## Frontmatter\n\\`\\`\\`yaml\nepic_idid: 1\nstatus: planned\n\\`\\`\\`\nRest of content...\n```\n✅ **CORRECT** - Preserves frontmatter as YAML:\n```md\n---\ntitle: Artifact Title\ntype: epic\npermalink: some-path\nepic_id: 1\nstatus: planned\n---\n# Artifact Title\nRest of content...\n```\n#### Implementation Best Practices\n1. **Always parse frontmatter carefully** - Extract the YAML block as-is from the template\n2. **Preserve field order** - YAML field order matters for readability\n3. **Validate YAML syntax** - Ensure frontmatter is valid YAML before passing to basicmemory\n4. **Include all template fields** - Don''t drop fields; merge with generated fields instead\n5. **Use proper YAML lists** - Use `-` for list items in frontmatter, not JSON arrays\n6. **Test round-trip** - After creation, verify the artifact has frontmatter, not markdown code blocks\n### [ProjectId] Naming and Format\n**ProjectId Convention:**\n- Format: `slugified-project-name` (kebab-case, lowercase alphanumeric + hyphens)\n- Source: Derived from git repository name or project name\n- Generated by: `./scripts/get_project_id.sh` (automatically slugifies)\n- Examples:\n  - Repository: `github.com/username/dotfiles` → ProjectId: `dotfiles`\n  - Project name: \"User Authentication System\" → ProjectId: `user-authentication-system`\n  - Example name \"My App v2\" → ProjectId: `my-app-v2`\n### Creating new Projects\nIf you need to create a new project in basicmemory, always ensure that \n- Follow the [ProjectId] naming convention.\n- Confirm the project does not already exist by listing existing projects first.\n- Store the project at ~/Notes/Projects/[ProjectId]\n- Never store the project in the same folder as the repo you are working on.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:59:02.633Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT that require efficient data storage and retrieval, leveraging basicmemory for project artifact management.","zh":"适合于像Cursor和AutoGPT这样的AI代理，它们需要高效的数据存储和检索，利用基本内存进行项目工件管理。","ja":"CursorやAutoGPTのような、効率的なデータの保存と取得を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。ベーシックメモリを使用してプロジェクトアーティファクトを管理します。","ko":"커서와 AutoGPT 같은 효율적인 데이터 저장 및检索가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 기본 메모리를 사용하여 프로젝트 아티팩트를 관리합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor y AutoGPT que requieren un almacenamiento y recuperación de datos eficientes, aprovechando la memoria básica para la gestión de artefactos del proyecto.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor et AutoGPT qui nécessitent un stockage et une récupération de données efficaces, en exploitant la mémoire de base pour la gestion des artefacts de projet.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor und AutoGPT, die ein effizientes Daten-speichern und -abrufen benötigen, indem sie das Grundspeicher für die Projektartefaktverwaltung nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor e AutoGPT que requerem armazenamento e recuperação de dados eficientes, aproveitando a memória básica para gerenciamento de artefatos de projeto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor и AutoGPT, которые требуют эффективного хранения и извлечения данных, используя базовую память для управления артефактами проекта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و AutoGPT الذي يتطلب تخزين البيانات واسترجاعها بكفاءة، مستفيداً من الذاكرة الأساسية لإدارة محتوى المشروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to store and manage project artifacts using basicmemory mcp tools, recognizing types such as Spec, Research, Decision, Epic, and Story, while maintaining a single source of truth across concurrent projects through explicit linking and status tracking.","zh":"赋予代理使用基本内存mcp工具来存储和管理项目工件的能力，能够识别诸如Spec、Research、Decision、Epic和Story等类型，同时在并发项目中通过显式链接和状态跟踪保持单一事实来源。","ja":"ベーシックメモリmcpツールを使用して、Spec、Research、Decision、Epic、Storyなどのタイプを認識しながら、プロジェクトアーティファクトを保存して管理するエージェントの能力を付与します。同時に、並行プロジェクト全体で一元化されたソースオブトゥルースを、明示的なリンクとステータストラッキングを通じて維持します。","ko":"기본 메모리 mcp 툴을 사용하여 프로젝트 아티팩트를 저장하고 관리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Spec, Research, Decision, Epic 및 Story 등의 유형을 인식하면서 동시에 병렬 프로젝트에서 명시적 연결 및 상태 추적을 통해 단일 소스 오브 트루스를 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a almacenar y gestionar artefactos del proyecto utilizando las herramientas mcp de memoria básica, reconociendo tipos como Especificación, Investigación, Decisión, Episodio y Historia, manteniendo una sola fuente de verdad a través de proyectos concurrentes mediante enlaces explícitos y seguimiento de estado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de stocker et de gérer les artefacts de projet en utilisant les outils mcp de mémoire de base, en reconnaissant des types tels que Spécification, Recherche, Décision, Épopée et Histoire, tout en maintenant une seule source de vérité à travers les projets concurrents via des liens explicites et un suivi de l''état.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Projektartefakte mithilfe der mcp-Tools des Grundspeichers zu speichern und zu verwalten, wobei Arten wie Spezifikation, Forschung, Entscheidung, Epos und Geschichte erkannt werden, während eine einzige Wahrheitsquelle über konkurrierende Projekte hinweg durch explizite Verknüpfungen und Statusnachverfolgung aufrechterhalten wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a armazenar e gerenciar artefatos de projeto usando as ferramentas mcp da memória básica, reconhecendo tipos como Especificação, Pesquisa, Decisão, Épico e História, mantendo uma única fonte de verdade em projetos concorrentes por meio de vinculação explícita e acompanhamento de status.","ru":"Позволяет агентам хранить и управлять артефактами проекта, используя инструменты mcp базовой памяти, распознавая типы, такие как Спецификация, Исследование, Решение, Эпик и История, поддерживая единую источник правды в конкурирующих проектах посредством явной ссылки и отслеживания статуса.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تخزين محتوى المشروع وإدارته باستخدام أدوات مcp للذاكرة الأساسية، مع التعرف على أنواع مثل المواصفات والبحث والقرار والملحمة والقصة، مع الحفاظ على مصدر وحيد للمعلومات في المشاريع المتزامنة من خلال ربط صريح وتتبع الحالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project artifact storage and retrieval using basicmemory","Generating reports based on project artifacts stored in basicmemory","Tracking project progress by updating artifact status in basicmemory"],"zh":["使用基本内存自动化项目工件的存储和检索","基于基本内存中存储的项目工件生成报告","通过基本内存中更新工件状态来跟踪项目进度"],"ja":["ベーシックメモリを使用してプロジェクトアーティファクトの保存と取得を自動化する","ベーシックメモリに保存されたプロジェクトアーティファクトに基づいてレポートを生成する","ベーシックメモリのアーティファクトのステータスを更新してプロジェクトの進捗状況を追跡する"],"ko":["기본 메모리를 사용하여 프로젝트 아티팩트의 저장 및检索를 자동화하는 것","기본 메모리에 저장된 프로젝트 아티팩트를 기반으로 보고서를 생성","기본 메모리의 아티팩트 상태를 업데이트하여 프로젝트 진행 상황을 추적"],"es":["Automatizar el almacenamiento y la recuperación de artefactos del proyecto utilizando la memoria básica","Generar informes basados en artefactos del proyecto almacenados en la memoria básica","Seguimiento del progreso del proyecto actualizando el estado de los artefactos en la memoria básica"],"fr":["Automatiser le stockage et la récupération des artefacts de projet en utilisant la mémoire de base","Générer des rapports basés sur les artefacts de projet stockés dans la mémoire de base","Suivi de la progression du projet en mettant à jour l''état des artefacts dans la mémoire de base"],"de":["Automatisieren des Speicherns und Abrufens von Projektartefakten unter Verwendung des Grundspeichers","Erstellen von Berichten auf der Grundlage von im Grundspeicher gespeicherten Projektartefakten","Nachverfolgung des Projektfortschritts durch Aktualisieren des Artefaktstatus im Grundspeicher"],"pt":["Automatizar o armazenamento e recuperação de artefatos de projeto usando a memória básica","Gerar relatórios com base em artefatos de projeto armazenados na memória básica","Acompanhar o progresso do projeto atualizando o status do artefato na memória básica"],"ru":["Автоматизировать хранение и извлечение артефактов проекта, используя базовую память","Генерировать отчеты на основе артефактов проекта, хранящихся в базовой памяти","Отслеживать прогресс проекта, обновляя статус артефакта в базовой памяти"],"ar":["أتمتة تخزين واسترجاع محتوى المشروع باستخدام الذاكرة الأساسية","توليد تقارير بناءً على محتوى المشروع المخزّن في الذاكرة الأساسية","تتبع تقدم المشروع bằng تحديث حالة المحتوى في الذاكرة الأساسية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires identification of correct ProjectId for each project","Limited to basicmemory protocol and tools"],"zh":["需要为每个项目识别正确的ProjectId","仅限基本内存协议和工具"],"ja":["各プロジェクトの正しいProjectIdを識別する必要がある","ベーシックメモリのプロトコルとツールに限定される"],"ko":["각 프로젝트에 대한 올바른 프로젝트 ID를 식별해야 함","기본 메모리 프로토콜 및 툴만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere la identificación de la ID de proyecto correcta para cada proyecto","Limitado al protocolo y las herramientas de memoria básica"],"fr":["Nécessite l''identification de l''ID de projet correcte pour chaque projet","Limité au protocole et aux outils de mémoire de base"],"de":["Erfordert die Identifizierung der richtigen Projekt-ID für jedes Projekt","Begrenzt auf das Protokoll und die Tools des Grundspeichers"],"pt":["Requer a identificação do ProjectId correto para cada projeto","Limitado ao protocolo e às ferramentas da memória básica"],"ru":["Требует идентификации правильного ProjectId для каждого проекта","Ограничен протоколом и инструментами базовой памяти"],"ar":["يتطلب تحديد ProjectId الصحيح لكل مشروع","محدود ببروتوكول وأدوات الذاكرة الأساسية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
