liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发 - 高效迭代和代码审查","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発 - 高速イテレーションとコードレビュー","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발 - 빠른 반복과 코드 리뷰","es":"Desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","fr":"Développement piloté par sous-agents","de":"Subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung","pt":"Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Subagentes","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов","ar":"التطوير القائم على وكيل فرعي","en":"subagent-driven-development"},"description":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发是一种通过分配新子代理来执行计划的方法，每个任务后进行代码审查。它实现了快速迭代和高质量代码","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発は、新しいサブエージェントを割り当てることで計画を実行する方法であり、各タスクの後コードレビューが行われます。迅速なイテレーションと高品質のコードを実現します","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발은 새로운 서브 에이전트를 할당하여 계획을 실행하는 방법으로 각 태스크 후에 코드 리뷰가 수행됩니다. 빠른 반복과 고품질 코드를 구현합니다","es":"El desarrollo impulsado por subagentes es una técnica para ejecutar planes de manera eficiente, utilizando subagentes frescos para cada tarea","fr":"Le développement piloté par sous-agents est une technique pour exécuter des plans de manière efficace, en utilisant des sous-agents frais pour chaque tâche","de":"Die subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung ist eine Technik zur effizienten Ausführung von Plänen, bei der für jede Aufgabe ein frischer Subagent eingesetzt wird","pt":"O desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes é uma abordagem que executa planos por meio da dispatch de subagentes frescos por tarefa, com revisão de código apó...","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов - это подход, который выполняет планы путем отправки новых субагентов для каждой задачи, с проверкой кода после каждой.","ar":"التطوير القائم على وكيل فرعي هو نهج يُنفّذ الخطط عن طريق إرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة، مع مراجعة الكود بعد كل واحدة.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["为每个任务分配新子代理","任务后进行代码审查","快速迭代和高质量代码","减少上下文切换","提高开发效率"],"ja":["各タスクに新しいサブエージェントを割り当て","タスク後コードレビューを実施","迅速なイテレーションと高品質のコード","コンテキストスイッチの削減","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["각 태스크에 새로운 서브 에이전트 할당","태스크 후 코드 리뷰 수행","빠른 반복과 고품질 코드","컨텍스트 스위치 감소","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Ejecución de planes con subagentes frescos","Revisión de código después de cada tarea","Iteración rápida sin intervención humana","Sin contaminación de contexto entre tareas","Same session sin cambio de contexto"],"fr":["Exécution de plans avec des sous-agents frais","Révision de code après chaque tâche","Itération rapide sans intervention humaine","Pas de pollution de contexte entre tâches","Même session sans changement de contexte"],"de":["Ausführung von Plänen mit frischen Subagenten","Code-Review nach jeder Aufgabe","Schnelle Iteration ohne menschliche Intervention","Keine Kontextverunreinigung zwischen Aufgaben","Selbe Sitzung ohne Kontextwechsel"],"pt":["Execução de planos com subagentes frescos","Revisão de código após cada tarefa","Iteração rápida sem intervenção humana","Same session sem troca de contexto","Prevenção de poluição de contexto"],"ru":["Выполнение планов с новыми субагентами","Проверка кода после каждой задачи","Быстрая итерация без вмешательства человека","Одна сессия без переключения контекста","Предотвращение загрязнения контекста"],"ar":["تنفيذ الخطط مع وكلاء فرعيين جدد","مراجعة الكود بعد كل مهمة","التحديث السريع بدون تدخل إنساني","جلسة واحدة بدون تبديل السياق","منع تلوث السياق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["子代理驱动开发","快速迭代","代码审查","软件开发方法","高质量代码","开发效率"],"ja":["サブエージェント駆動開発","迅速なイテレーション","コードレビュー","ソフトウェア開発方法","高品質のコード","開発効率"],"ko":["서브 에이전트 주도 개발","빠른 반복","코드 리뷰","소프트웨어 개발 방법","고품질 코드","개발 효율성"],"es":["desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","subagentes frescos","revisión de código","iteración rápida","sin intervención humana","contaminación de contexto","same session"],"fr":["développement piloté par sous-agents","sous-agents frais","révision de code","itération rapide","sans intervention humaine","pollution de contexte","même session"],"de":["subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung","frische Subagenten","Code-Review","schnelle Iteration","ohne menschliche Intervention","Kontextverunreinigung","selbe Sitzung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes","execução de planos","revisão de código","iteração rápida","subagentes frescos","same session","prevenção de poluição de contexto"],"ru":["разработка на основе субагентов","выполнение планов","проверка кода","быстрая итерация","новые субагенты","одна сессия","предотвращение загрязнения контекста"],"ar":["التطوير القائم على وكيل فرعي","تنفيذ الخطط","مراجعة الكود","التحديث السريع","وكلاء فرعيين جدد","جلسة واحدة","منع تلوث السياق"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"subagent-driven-development","description":"Use when executing implementation plans with independent tasks in the current session - dispatches fresh subagent for each task with code review between tasks, enabling fast iteration with quality gates","bodyPreview":"# Subagent-Driven Development\n\nExecute plan by dispatching fresh subagent per task, with code review after each.\n\n**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + review between tasks = high quality, fast iteration\n\n## Overview\n\n**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**\n- Same session (no context switch)\n- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)\n- Code review after each task (catch issues early)\n- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)\n\n**When to use:**\n- Staying in this session","body":"# Subagent-Driven Development\n\nExecute plan by dispatching fresh subagent per task, with code review after each.\n\n**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + review between tasks = high quality, fast iteration\n\n## Overview\n\n**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**\n- Same session (no context switch)\n- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)\n- Code review after each task (catch issues early)\n- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)\n\n**When to use:**\n- Staying in this session\n- Tasks are mostly independent\n- Want continuous progress with quality gates\n\n**When NOT to use:**\n- Need to review plan first (use executing-plans)\n- Tasks are tightly coupled (manual execution better)\n- Plan needs revision (brainstorm first)\n\n## The Process\n\n### 1. Load Plan\n\nRead plan file, create TodoWrite with all tasks.\n\n### 2. Execute Task with Subagent\n\nFor each task:\n\n**Dispatch fresh subagent:**\n```\nTask tool (general-purpose):\n  description: \"Implement Task N: [task name]\"\n  prompt: |\n    You are implementing Task N from [plan-file].\n\n    Read that task carefully. Your job is to:\n    1. Implement exactly what the task specifies\n    2. Write tests (following TDD if task says to)\n    3. Verify implementation works\n    4. Commit your work\n    5. Report back\n\n    Work from: [directory]\n\n    Report: What you implemented, what you tested, test results, files changed, any issues\n```\n\n**Subagent reports back** with summary of work.\n\n### 3. Review Subagent''s Work\n\n**Dispatch code-reviewer subagent:**\n```\nTask tool (superpowers:code-reviewer):\n  Use template at requesting-code-review/code-reviewer.md\n\n  WHAT_WAS_IMPLEMENTED: [from subagent''s report]\n  PLAN_OR_REQUIREMENTS: Task N from [plan-file]\n  BASE_SHA: [commit before task]\n  HEAD_SHA: [current commit]\n  DESCRIPTION: [task summary]\n```\n\n**Code reviewer returns:** Strengths, Issues (Critical/Important/Minor), Assessment\n\n### 4. Apply Review Feedback\n\n**If issues found:**\n- Fix Critical issues immediately\n- Fix Important issues before next task\n- Note Minor issues\n\n**Dispatch follow-up subagent if needed:**\n```\n\"Fix issues from code review: [list issues]\"\n```\n\n### 5. Mark Complete, Next Task\n\n- Mark task as completed in TodoWrite\n- Move to next task\n- Repeat steps 2-5\n\n### 6. Final Review\n\nAfter all tasks complete, dispatch final code-reviewer:\n- Reviews entire implementation\n- Checks all plan requirements met\n- Validates overall architecture\n\n### 7. Complete Development\n\nAfter final review passes:\n- Announce: \"I''m using the finishing-a-development-branch skill to complete this work.\"\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** Use superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch\n- Follow that skill to verify tests, present options, execute choice\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n```\nYou: I''m using Subagent-Driven Development to execute this plan.\n\n[Load plan, create TodoWrite]\n\nTask 1: Hook installation script\n\n[Dispatch implementation subagent]\nSubagent: Implemented install-hook with tests, 5/5 passing\n\n[Get git SHAs, dispatch code-reviewer]\nReviewer: Strengths: Good test coverage. Issues: None. Ready.\n\n[Mark Task 1 complete]\n\nTask 2: Recovery modes\n\n[Dispatch implementation subagent]\nSubagent: Added verify/repair, 8/8 tests passing\n\n[Dispatch code-reviewer]\nReviewer: Strengths: Solid. Issues (Important): Missing progress reporting\n\n[Dispatch fix subagent]\nFix subagent: Added progress every 100 conversations\n\n[Verify fix, mark Task 2 complete]\n\n...\n\n[After all tasks]\n[Dispatch final code-reviewer]\nFinal reviewer: All requirements met, ready to merge\n\nDone!\n```\n\n## Advantages\n\n**vs. Manual execution:**\n- Subagents follow TDD naturally\n- Fresh context per task (no confusion)\n- Parallel-safe (subagents don''t interfere)\n\n**vs. Executing Plans:**\n- Same session (no handoff)\n- Continuous progress (no waiting)\n- Review checkpoints automatic\n\n**Cost:**\n- More subagent invocations\n- But catches issues early (cheaper than debugging later)\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Skip code review between tasks\n- Proceed with unfixed Critical issues\n- Dispatch multiple implementation subagents in parallel (conflicts)\n- Implement without reading plan task\n\n**If subagent fails task:**\n- Dispatch fix subagent with specific instructions\n- Don''t try to fix manually (context pollution)\n\n## Integration\n\n**Required workflow skills:**\n- **writing-plans** - REQUIRED: Creates the plan that this skill executes\n- **requesting-code-review** - REQUIRED: Review after each task (see Step 3)\n- **finishing-a-development-branch** - REQUIRED: Complete development after all tasks (see Step 7)\n\n**Subagents must use:**\n- **test-driven-development** - Subagents follow TDD for each task\n\n**Alternative workflow:**\n- **executing-plans** - Use for parallel session instead of same-session execution\n\nSee code-reviewer template: requesting-code-review/code-reviewer.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T11:59:46.765Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring efficient task execution and code review, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, leveraging subagent-driven-development for accelerated iteration","zh":"适用于需要高效任务执行和代码审查的自主代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code，利用子代理驱动开发进行加速迭代","ja":"タスクの効率的な実行とコードレビューを必要とする自律エージェントに適しています。たとえば、Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeなどで、サブエージェント駆動開発を使用してイテレーションを加速します","ko":"효율적인 작업 실행 및 코드 검토가 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어, Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 경우 하위 에이전트 주도 개발을 사용하여 반복을 가속화합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requieren una ejecución de tareas eficiente y revisión de código, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code, aprovechando el desarrollo impulsado por subagentes para una iteración acelerada","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Autonomes nécessitant une exécution de tâches efficace et une révision de code, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, en exploitant le développement piloté par des sous-agents pour une itération accélérée","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die eine effiziente Aufgabenausführung und Code-Überprüfung erfordern, wie z. B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die die subagentengetriebene Entwicklung für eine beschleunigte Iteration nutzen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que exigem execução de tarefas eficiente e revisão de código, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, aproveitando o desenvolvimento orientado a subagentes para iteração acelerada","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, требующих эффективного выполнения задач и проверки кода, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, использующих разработку, управляемую субагентами, для ускоренной итерации","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستقلين الذين يتطلبون تنفيذاً فعالاً لل任务 ومراجعة الكود، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code، باستخدام تطوير مدعوم من الوكلاء الفرعيين لتعزيز التكرار"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute plans by dispatching fresh subagents per task, utilizing code review after each task for high-quality, fast iteration, and combining this with protocols like synthetic perpetual futures for advanced trading capabilities","zh":"使代理能够通过为每个任务分发新的子代理来执行计划，利用每个任务后的代码审查来实现高质量的快速迭代，并将其与合成永续期货协议等协议结合起来以实现高级交易功能","ja":"エージェントが新しいサブエージェントを各タスクに割り当てて計画を実行できるようにし、各タスク後のコードレビューを使用して、高品質の迅速なイテレーションを実現し、合成永続期限取引などのプロトコルと組み合わせて、高度な取引機能を実現します","ko":"에이전트가 각 작업에 새로운 하위 에이전트를 할당하여 계획을 실행할 수 있도록 하며, 각 작업后的 코드 검토를 사용하여 고품질의 빠른 반복을实现하고, 합성 영속 선물과 같은 프로토콜을 결합하여 고급 거래 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar planes mediante el envío de nuevos subagentes por tarea, utilizando la revisión de código después de cada tarea para una iteración rápida y de alta calidad, y combinando esto con protocolos como futuros sintéticos perpetuos para capacidades de negociación avanzadas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des plans en envoyant de nouveaux sous-agents par tâche, en utilisant la révision de code après chaque tâche pour une itération rapide et de haute qualité, et en combinant cela avec des protocoles comme les futurs synthétiques perpétuels pour des capacités de négociation avancées","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Pläne durch den Versand neuer Subagenten pro Aufgabe auszuführen, indem sie Code-Überprüfungen nach jeder Aufgabe für eine schnelle und hochwertige Iteration verwenden und dies mit Protokollen wie synthetischen Perpetual-Futures für erweiterte Handelsfunktionen kombinieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar planos enviando subagentes frescos por tarefa, utilizando revisão de código após cada tarefa para iteração rápida e de alta qualidade, e combinando isso com protocolos como futuros perpétuos sintéticos para capacidades de negociação avançadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять планы, отправляя свежих субагентов на каждую задачу, используя проверку кода после каждой задачи для быстрой и высококачественной итерации, и сочетая это с протоколами, такими как синтетические вечные фьючерсы, для продвинутых торговых возможностей","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ الخطط من خلال إرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة، واستخدام مراجعة الكود بعد كل مهمة لتحقيق تكرار سريع وذو جودة عالية، ودمج ذلك مع بروتوكولات مثل المشتقات المستمرة المصطنعة للقدرات التداولية المتقدمة"},"useCases":{"en":["Dispatching fresh subagents for tasks","Conducting code reviews after each task for quality assurance","Implementing synthetic perpetual futures protocols for trading"],"zh":["为任务分发新的子代理","任务后的代码审查以确保质量","实现合成永续期货协议以进行交易"],"ja":["タスクに新しいサブエージェントを割り当てる","タスク後のコードレビューを実行して品質を確保する","合成永続期限取引プロトコルを実装して取引を実行する"],"ko":["작업에 새로운 하위 에이전트를 할당","작업后的 코드 검토를 통해 품질을 보증","합성 영속 선물 프로토콜을 구현하여 거래를 수행"],"es":["Envío de nuevos subagentes para tareas","Realización de revisiones de código después de cada tarea para garantizar la calidad","Implementación de protocolos de futuros sintéticos perpetuos para el comercio"],"fr":["Envoi de nouveaux sous-agents pour les tâches","Révision de code après chaque tâche pour assurer la qualité","Mise en œuvre de protocoles de futurs synthétiques perpétuels pour la négociation"],"de":["Versand neuer Subagenten für Aufgaben","Durchführung von Code-Überprüfungen nach jeder Aufgabe zur Qualitätsicherung","Implementierung von Protokollen für synthetische Perpetual-Futures für den Handel"],"pt":["Enviar subagentes frescos para tarefas","Realizar revisões de código após cada tarefa para garantia de qualidade","Implementar protocolos de futuros perpétuos sintéticos para negociação"],"ru":["Отправка свежих субагентов на задачи","Проведение проверки кода после каждой задачи для обеспечения качества","Реализация протоколов синтетических вечных фьючерсов для торговли"],"ar":["إرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد للمهام","إجراء مراجعة الكود بعد كل مهمة لتأكيد الجودة","تنفيذ بروتوكولات المشتقات المستمرة المصطنعة للتداول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ability to dispatch subagents","Needs protocol for code review implementation","Limited to tasks that can be executed in parallel sessions"],"zh":["需要能够分发子代理","需要代码审查实现的协议","仅限于可以在并行会话中执行的任务"],"ja":["サブエージェントを割り当てる能力が必要","コードレビューの実装プロトコルが必要","並行セッションで実行できるタスクに限定される"],"ko":["하위 에이전트를 할당할 수 있는 능력이 필요","코드 검토 구현 프로토콜이 필요","병렬 세션에서 실행할 수 있는 작업으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere la capacidad de enviar subagentes","Necesita un protocolo para la implementación de la revisión de código","Limitado a tareas que se pueden ejecutar en sesiones paralelas"],"fr":["Nécessite la capacité d''envoyer des sous-agents","A besoin d''un protocole pour la mise en œuvre de la révision de code","Limité aux tâches qui peuvent être exécutées dans des sessions parallèles"],"de":["Erfordert die Fähigkeit, Subagenten zu versenden","Benötigt ein Protokoll für die Implementierung der Code-Überprüfung","Begrenzt auf Aufgaben, die in parallelen Sitzungen ausgeführt werden können"],"pt":["Exige a capacidade de enviar subagentes","Necessita de protocolo para implementação da revisão de código","Limitado a tarefas que podem ser executadas em sessões paralelas"],"ru":["Требует возможности отправки субагентов","Требует протокола для реализации проверки кода","Ограничен задачами, которые могут быть выполнены в параллельных сессиях"],"ar":["يتطلب القدرة على إرسال الوكلاء الفرعيين","يحتاج إلى بروتوكول لتنفيذ مراجعة الكود","محدود بالمهمات التي يمكن تنفيذها في جلسات متوازية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
