pto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数","高效的验证机制","合成永续期货协议","高达1000倍的杠杆","稳定币抵押"],"ja":["RWAアセット、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポート","高効率の検証メカニズム","合成永続期貨プロトコル","最大1000倍のレバレッジ","スターブルコインによる担保"],"ko":["RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식 및 지수를 지원","효율적인 검증 메커니즘","합성 영속적 선물 프로토콜","최대 1000배의 레버리지","안정된 코인에 의한 담보"],"es":["Permite posiciones apalancadas con hasta 1000x de apalancamiento","Requiere verificación antes de completar para garantizar la integridad","Soporta activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices","Utiliza un oráculo personalizado y una AMM virtual","Incorpora suavizado de TWAP para la fijación de precios"],"fr":["Permet des positions avec un effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x","Exige une vérification avant achèvement pour assurer l''intégrité","Prend en charge les actifs RWA, les crypto-monnaies, les actions et les indices","Utilise un oracle personnalisé et une AMM virtuelle","Intègre un lissage de TWAP pour la fixation des prix"],"de":["Ermöglicht Positionen mit bis zu 1000x Hebelwirkung","Erfordert eine Verifizierung vor Abschluss, um die Integrität zu gewährleisten","Unterstützt RWA-Assets, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes","Verwendet einen benutzerdefinierten Oracle und eine virtuelle AMM","Integriert TWAP-Glättung für die Preisfestlegung"],"pt":["Suporte a ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices","Posições long/short com alavancagem de até 1000x","Caixa de liquidez central como contraparte para todas as negociações","Preços combinados com oráculo personalizado, AMM virtual e suavização TWAP"],"ru":["Поддержка активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов","Длинные/короткие позиции с левериджем до 1000х","Центральный ликвидный бокс как контрапартия для всех сделок","Цены, объединенные с пользовательским оракулом, виртуальным AMM и сглаживанием TWAP"],"ar":["دعم الأصول RWA والعملات المشفرة والأوراق المالية والأسهم","مواقف طويلة/قصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000 ضعف","صندوق سيولة مركزي كطرف مضاد لجميع الصفقات","أسعار مجتمعة مع أوракل مخصص و AMM افتراضي وتنعيم TWAP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["验证前完成协议","合成永续期货","RWA资产","加密货币","股票","指数","高效验证","杠杆交易"],"ja":["バリデーション前完了プロトコル","合成永続期貨","RWAアセット","暗号資産","株式","指数","高効率検証","レバレッジ取引"],"ko":["검증 전 완료 프로토콜","합성 영속적 선물","RWA 자산","암호화폐","주식","지수","효율적인 검증","레버리지 거래"],"es":["verificación antes de completar","protocolo de futuros sintéticos","operaciones apalancadas","RWA assets","criptomonedas","acciones","índices","oráculo personalizado","AMM virtual","TWAP"],"fr":["vérification avant achèvement","protocole de futurs synthétiques","opérations avec effet de levier","actifs RWA","crypto-monnaies","actions","indices","oracle personnalisé","AMM virtuelle","TWAP"],"de":["Verifizierung vor Abschluss","synthetisches Futures-Protokoll","Operationen mit Hebelwirkung","RWA-Assets","Kryptowährungen","Aktien","Indizes","benutzerdefinierter Oracle","virtuelle AMM","TWAP"],"pt":["verificação antes da conclusão","protocolo de futuros sintéticos","trading de ativos","RWA","criptomoedas","ações","índices","alavancagem"],"ru":["верификация до завершения","синтетический протокол фьючерсов","торговля активами","RWA","криптовалюты","акции","индексы","леверидж"],"ar":["التحقق قبل الإكمال","بروتوكول المستقبل السنتيتيكي","تداول الأصول","RWA","العملات المشفرة","الأوراق المالية","الأسهم","الرافعة المالية"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"verification-before-completion","description":"Use when about to claim work is complete, fixed, or passing, before committing or creating PRs - requires running verification commands and confirming output before making any success claims; evidence before assertions always","bodyPreview":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing sati","body":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing satisfaction:\n\n1. IDENTIFY: What command proves this claim?\n2. RUN: Execute the FULL command (fresh, complete)\n3. READ: Full output, check exit code, count failures\n4. VERIFY: Does output confirm the claim?\n   - If NO: State actual status with evidence\n   - If YES: State claim WITH evidence\n5. ONLY THEN: Make the claim\n\nSkip any step = lying, not verifying\n```\n\n## Common Failures\n\n| Claim | Requires | Not Sufficient |\n|-------|----------|----------------|\n| Tests pass | Test command output: 0 failures | Previous run, \"should pass\" |\n| Linter clean | Linter output: 0 errors | Partial check, extrapolation |\n| Build succeeds | Build command: exit 0 | Linter passing, logs look good |\n| Bug fixed | Test original symptom: passes | Code changed, assumed fixed |\n| Regression test works | Red-green cycle verified | Test passes once |\n| Agent completed | VCS diff shows changes | Agent reports \"success\" |\n| Requirements met | Line-by-line checklist | Tests passing |\n\n## Red Flags - STOP\n\n- Using \"should\", \"probably\", \"seems to\"\n- Expressing satisfaction before verification (\"Great!\", \"Perfect!\", \"Done!\", etc.)\n- About to commit/push/PR without verification\n- Trusting agent success reports\n- Relying on partial verification\n- Thinking \"just this once\"\n- Tired and wanting work over\n- **ANY wording implying success without having run verification**\n\n## Rationalization Prevention\n\n| Excuse | Reality |\n|--------|---------|\n| \"Should work now\" | RUN the verification |\n| \"I''m confident\" | Confidence ≠ evidence |\n| \"Just this once\" | No exceptions |\n| \"Linter passed\" | Linter ≠ compiler |\n| \"Agent said success\" | Verify independently |\n| \"I''m tired\" | Exhaustion ≠ excuse |\n| \"Partial check is enough\" | Partial proves nothing |\n| \"Different words so rule doesn''t apply\" | Spirit over letter |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n**Tests:**\n```\n✅ [Run test command] [See: 34/34 pass] \"All tests pass\"\n❌ \"Should pass now\" / \"Looks correct\"\n```\n\n**Regression tests (TDD Red-Green):**\n```\n✅ Write → Run (pass) → Revert fix → Run (MUST FAIL) → Restore → Run (pass)\n❌ \"I''ve written a regression test\" (without red-green verification)\n```\n\n**Build:**\n```\n✅ [Run build] [See: exit 0] \"Build passes\"\n❌ \"Linter passed\" (linter doesn''t check compilation)\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n```\n✅ Re-read plan → Create checklist → Verify each → Report gaps or completion\n❌ \"Tests pass, phase complete\"\n```\n\n**Agent delegation:**\n```\n✅ Agent reports success → Check VCS diff → Verify changes → Report actual state\n❌ Trust agent report\n```\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nFrom 24 failure memories:\n- your human partner said \"I don''t believe you\" - trust broken\n- Undefined functions shipped - would crash\n- Missing requirements shipped - incomplete features\n- Time wasted on false completion → redirect → rework\n- Violates: \"Honesty is a core value. If you lie, you''ll be replaced.\"\n\n## When To Apply\n\n**ALWAYS before:**\n- ANY variation of success/completion claims\n- ANY expression of satisfaction\n- ANY positive statement about work state\n- Committing, PR creation, task completion\n- Moving to next task\n- Delegating to agents\n\n**Rule applies to:**\n- Exact phrases\n- Paraphrases and synonyms\n- Implications of success\n- ANY communication suggesting completion/correctness\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**No shortcuts for verification.**\n\nRun the command. Read the output. THEN claim the result.\n\nThis is non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:00:09.927Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Compliance Agents needing rigorous verification protocols before completion.","zh":"非常适合需要在完成前经过严格验证协议的合规代理","ja":"完了前に厳格な検証プロトコルを必要とするコンプライアンスエージェントに最適","ko":"완료 전에 엄격한 검증 프로토콜이 필요한 규정 준수 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Cumplimiento que necesitan protocolos de verificación rigurosos antes de la finalización.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conformité ayant besoin de protocoles de vérification rigoureux avant l''achèvement.","de":"Perfekt für Compliance-Agenten, die vor dem Abschluss strenge Überprüfungsprotokolle benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conformidade que necessitam de protocolos rigorosos de verificação antes da conclusão.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по соблюдению требований, которым необходимы строгие протоколы проверки перед завершением.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات توافق في حاجة إلى بروتوكولات التحقق القاسية قبل الإكمال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce the Iron Law of verification, ensuring evidence-based claims through fresh verification evidence, and leveraging protocols like synthetic perpetual futures for secure and transparent transactions.","zh":"赋予代理人执行铁法的权力，通过新鲜的验证证据确保基于证据的声明，并利用合成永续期货等协议以实现安全、透明的交易","ja":"エージェントに鉄法を実施する力を与え、新鮮な検証証拠を通じて証拠に基づく主張を保証し、合成永続将来などのプロトコルを利用して安全で透明な取引を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 철의 법칙을 시행할 수 있는 권한을 부여하여 신선한 검증 증거를 통해 증거 기반의 주장을 보장하고, 합성 영속적 선물과 같은 프로토콜을 활용하여 안전하고 투명한 거래를 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar la Ley de Hierro de la verificación, garantizando reclamaciones basadas en la evidencia a través de evidencia de verificación fresca y aprovechando protocolos como futuros sintéticos perpetuos para transacciones seguras y transparentes.","fr":"Habilite les agents à appliquer la Loi de Fer de la vérification, garantissant des réclamations fondées sur des preuves grâce à des preuves de vérification fraîches et en exploitant des protocoles tels que les futurs synthétiques perpétuels pour des transactions sécurisées et transparentes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das Eisernes Gesetz der Überprüfung durchzusetzen, indem es beweisbasierte Ansprüche durch frische Überprüfungsbeweise sicherstellt und Protokolle wie synthetische Perpetual-Futures für sichere und transparente Transaktionen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar a Lei de Ferro da verificação, garantindo alegações baseadas em evidências por meio de provas de verificação atualizadas e utilizando protocolos como futuros sintéticos perpétuos para transações seguras e transparentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов полномочиями по обеспечению Железного Закона проверки, гарантируя обоснованные заявления на основе свежих доказательств проверки и используя протоколы, такие как синтетические вечные фьючерсы, для безопасных и прозрачных транзакций.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من فرض قانون الحديد للتحقق، وضمان المطالبات القائمة على الأدلة من خلال أدلة تحقق جديدة وتعزيز بروتوكولات مثل المستقبل الاصطناعي الدائم لعمليات آمنة وشفافة."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying trade completion claims","Validating on-chain vault transactions","Enforcing evidence-based status updates"],"zh":["验证交易完成声明","验证链上金库交易","强制执行基于证据的状态更新"],"ja":["取引完了主張の検証","オンチェーン・ボールト取引の検証","証拠に基づくステータス更新の強制実施"],"ko":["거래 완료声明의 검증","체인상 금고 거래의 검증","증거 기반 상태 업데이트의 시행"],"es":["Verificar reclamaciones de finalización de operaciones","Validar transacciones de bóveda en cadena","Hacer cumplir actualizaciones de estado basadas en la evidencia"],"fr":["Vérifier les réclamations d''achèvement des échanges","Valider les transactions de vault en chaîne","Faire respecter les mises à jour d''état fondées sur des preuves"],"de":["Überprüfen von Handelsabschlussansprüchen","Validieren von Vault-Transaktionen in der Kette","Durchsetzen von evidenzbasierten Statusaktualisierungen"],"pt":["Verificar alegações de conclusão de comércio","Validar transações de cofre em cadeia","Aplicar atualizações de status baseadas em evidências"],"ru":["Проверить заявления о завершении торгов","Проверить транзакции в цепочке хранилища","Обеспечить обновления статуса на основе доказательств"],"ar":["التحقق من مطالبات إكمال التجارة","التحقق من معاملات الخزنة على السلسلة","فرض تحديثات الحالة القائمة على الأدلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation of the Gate Function","Violations of the Iron Law may result in dishonest claims"],"zh":["需要实施门函数","违反铁法可能导致不诚实的声明"],"ja":["ゲート関数の実装が必要","鉄法の違反は不誠実な主張につながる可能性がある"],"ko":["게이트 함수의 구현이 필요","철의 법칙을 위반하면 부정직한 주장으로 이어질 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la implementación de la Función de Puerta","Las violaciones de la Ley de Hierro pueden resultar en reclamaciones deshonestas"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise en œuvre de la Fonction de Porte","Les violations de la Loi de Fer peuvent entraîner des réclamations malhonnêtes"],"de":["Erfordert die Implementierung der Gate-Funktion","Verstöße gegen das Eisernes Gesetz können zu unaufrichtigen Ansprüchen führen"],"pt":["Exige a implementação da Função Porta","Violações da Lei de Ferro podem resultar em alegações desonestas"],"ru":["Требует реализации Функции Шлюза","Нарушения Железного Закона могут привести к нечестным заявлениям"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ وظيفة البوابة","المخالفات ل