ntener backends de OpenAI y AzureOpenAI, siguiendo convenciones Git","fr":"Le skill git-conventions fournit des outils pour tester, exploiter et maintenir les backends OpenAI et AzureOpenAI, en suivant les conventions Git","de":"Das Skill git-conventions bietet Tools, um OpenAI- und AzureOpenAI-Backends zu testen, zu betreiben und zu warten, unter Einhaltung von Git-Konventionen","pt":"As convenções Git são um conjunto de ferramentas para testar, operar e manter backends OpenAI, incluindo commits e merge","ru":"Конвенции Git - это набор инструментов для тестирования, эксплуатации и поддержки бэкендов OpenAI, включая коммиты и слияние","ar":"اتفاقيات جيت هي مجموعة من الأدوات لاختبار وتشغيل وصيانة الخوادم الخلفية لشركة OpenAI، بما في ذلك الاشتراكات والدمج","en":"A collection of tools to test, operate and maintain OpenAI backends (OpenAI and AzureOpenAI)"},"definition":{"en":"A collection of tools to test, operate and maintain OpenAI backends (OpenAI and AzureOpenAI)"},"features":{"zh":["Conventional Commits","Commit","Merge","feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, style, perf","Imperative mood, 72, ."],"ja":["Conventional Commits","Commit","Merge","feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, style, perf",""],"ko":["Conventional Commits","Commit","Merge","feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, style, perf","72, ."],"es":["Creación de commits convencionales","Fusión de ramas siguiendo convenciones","Uso de tipos de commits (feat, fix, docs, etc.)","Formato de mensaje de commit estándar","Evitación de commits de secretos"],"fr":["Création de commits conventionnels","Fusion de branches suivant les conventions","Utilisation de types de commits (feat, fix, docs, etc.)","Format de message de commit standard","Évitement de commits de secrets"],"de":["Erstellung von konventionellen Commits","Zusammenführung von Branches unter Einhaltung von Konventionen","Verwendung von Commit-Typen (feat, fix, docs usw.)","Standard-Format für Commit-Nachrichten","Vermeidung von Commits mit Geheimnissen"],"pt":["Commits convencionais com tipos e escopo","Merge de branches seguindo convenções","Formato de mensagem de commit padrão","Tipos de commits: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, style, perf","Evite commit de segredos, como .env e *.cer"],"ru":["Конвенциональные коммиты с типами и областью","Слияние веток в соответствии с конвенциями","Стандартный формат сообщения коммита","Типы коммитов: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, style, perf","Избегайте коммита секретов, таких как .env и *.cer"],"ar":["اشتراكات تقليدية مع أنواع ونطاق","دمج الفروع وفقا لاتفاقيات","تنسيق رسالة الاشتراك القياسي","أنواع الاشتراكات: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, style, perf","تجنب الاشتراك في الأسرار، مثل .env و *.cer"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git","Conventional Commits","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","Commit","Merge","feat","fix","docs"],"ja":["Git","Conventional Commits","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","Commit","Merge","feat","fix","docs"],"ko":["Git","Conventional Commits","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","Commit","Merge","feat","fix","docs"],"es":["convenciones Git","commits convencionales","colaboración en desarrollo","organización de proyectos","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["conventions Git","commits conventionnels","collaboration en développement","organisation de projets","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Git-Konventionen","konventionelle Commits","Zusammenarbeit in der Entwicklung","Projektorganisation","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["convenções git","commits convencionais","merge de branches","formato de mensagem de commit","tipos de commits","segredos no git","organização de código","legibilidade de código"],"ru":["конвенции git","конвенциональные коммиты","слияние веток","формат сообщения коммита","типы коммитов","секреты в git","организация кода","читаемость кода"],"ar":["اتفاقيات جيت","اشتراكات تقليدية","دمج الفروع","تنسيق رسالة الاشتراك","أنواع الاشتراكات","أسرار في جيت","تنظيم الكود","قراءة الكود"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"OpenAI-BackendTools","repoPath":"karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-conventions","description":"Apply when committing code, writing commit messages, or configuring .gitignore","bodyPreview":"# Git Conventions\n\n## Verb Mapping\n\nThis skill implements:\n- [COMMIT] - Create conventional commits\n- [MERGE] - Merge branches following conventions\n\n**Phases**: IMPLEMENT, DELIVER\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Use Conventional Commits: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`\n- Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, style, perf\n- Imperative mood, <72 chars, no period\n- NEVER commit secrets: .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem, *.key\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\nUse **Conventional Commits**: `<type>(<scope>): <des","body":"# Git Conventions\n\n## Verb Mapping\n\nThis skill implements:\n- [COMMIT] - Create conventional commits\n- [MERGE] - Merge branches following conventions\n\n**Phases**: IMPLEMENT, DELIVER\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Use Conventional Commits: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`\n- Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, style, perf\n- Imperative mood, <72 chars, no period\n- NEVER commit secrets: .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem, *.key\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\nUse **Conventional Commits**: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`\n\n### Types\n\n- **feat**: New feature\n- **fix**: Bug fix\n- **docs**: Documentation only\n- **refactor**: Code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature\n- **test**: Adding or updating tests\n- **chore**: Maintenance tasks, dependencies, build changes\n- **style**: Formatting, whitespace (no code logic change)\n- **perf**: Performance improvement\n\n### Guidelines\n\n1. Use imperative mood (\"add\" not \"added\" or \"adds\")\n2. Keep description under 72 characters\n3. No period at the end\n4. Scope should match module/folder name when applicable\n\n### Examples\n\n```\nfeat(crawler): add incremental crawl mode\nfix(auth): handle expired tokens\ndocs: update README installation steps\nrefactor(domains): simplify source validation logic\nchore: update dependencies to latest versions\n```\n\n## Safe Undo Commit\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose the right reset mode to avoid data loss.\n\n### Undo Last Commit (Keep Files)\n\n```bash\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1   # Undo commit, keep files STAGED\ngit reset HEAD~1          # Undo commit, keep files UNSTAGED\n```\n\n### Undo Last Commit (Discard Files) - DESTRUCTIVE\n\n```bash\ngit reset --hard HEAD~1   # Undo commit AND DELETE all changes\n```\n\n**WARNING**: `--hard` deletes uncommitted files permanently (unless recoverable via reflog).\n\n### Recovery After Accidental --hard Reset\n\nIf files were committed before reset, recover from reflog:\n\n```bash\ngit reflog                              # Find commit hash (e.g., abc1234)\ngit checkout abc1234 -- path/to/file    # Recover specific file\ngit checkout abc1234 -- .               # Recover all files from that commit\n```\n\n### Recovery From Remote\n\nIf commit was pushed before local reset:\n\n```bash\ngit fetch origin                        # Get latest from remote\ngit log --oneline origin/master -5      # Check what''s on remote\ngit checkout origin/master -- path/to   # Recover file from remote\n```\n\n### Amend Last Commit (Not Yet Pushed)\n\n```bash\ngit add <files>\ngit commit --amend -m \"new message\"     # Replace last commit\n```\n\n### Force Push After Amend/Reset (Remote Has Old Commit)\n\n```bash\ngit push --force-with-lease             # Safer than --force\n```\n\n**Use `--force-with-lease`**: Fails if remote changed since last fetch (prevents overwriting others'' work).\n\n## .gitignore Rules\n\n1. **NEVER commit secrets**: `.env` files, certificates (*.cer, *.pfx, *.pem, *.key), API keys\n2. **Exclude large binaries**: Reinstallable tools (poppler, node_modules, .venv/) - save repo size\n3. **Exclude build artifacts**: Generated files (dist/, __pycache__/, *.pyc)\n4. **Track shared config**: `.vscode/`, `Set-*-Env.bat` (environment setup scripts)\n5. **Use negation pattern**: Keep specific files with `!` prefix when excluding folders\n6. **Add comments**: Document non-obvious exclusions in .gitignore\n\n## Template\n\n```gitignore\n# Secrets (NEVER commit)\n*.env\n.env.*\n*.cer\n*.pfx\n*.pem\n*.key\n\n# Python\n.venv/\n__pycache__/\n*.pyc\n.pytest_cache/\n.mypy_cache/\n\n# Node.js\nnode_modules/\ndist/\nlib/\n*.log\n\n# IDE (keep .vscode/)\n.vs/\nbin/\nobj/\n\n# OS\n.DS_Store\n\n# Tools (reinstallable)\n.tools/poppler/\n\n# Temporary\n*.tmp\n.tmp_*\n*.bak\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:00:07.634Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing standardized git workflow automation and Conventional Commits implementation.","zh":"适合需要标准化git工作流自动化和Conventional Commits实现的开发代理。","ja":"標準化されたGitワークフロー自動化とConventional Commitsの実装が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 Git 워크플로 자동화 및 Conventional Commits 구현이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan automatización de flujo de trabajo de git estandarizado y implementación de Commits Convencionales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une automatisation de workflow Git standardisée et d''une mise en œuvre de Commits Conventionnels.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine standardisierte Git-Workflow-Automatisierung und eine Implementierung von Conventional Commits benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de automação de fluxo de trabalho git padronizado e implementação de Commits Convencionais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизация стандартизированного рабочего процесса git и реализация Конвенциональных Коммитов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تطبيق تلقائي لتدفق العمل المعياري git وتنفيذ الإلتزامات التقليدية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create conventional commits using Verb Mapping with specific types like feat, fix, and docs, ensuring imperative mood and concise descriptions, all while preventing secret exposure through .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem, and *.key files.","zh":"通过特定类型（如feat、fix和docs）使用动词映射来赋予代理创建常规提交的能力，确保使用祈使语气和简洁的描述，同时防止通过.env、*.cer、*.pfx、*.pem和*.key文件暴露秘密。","ja":"特定タイプ（例：feat、fix、docs）を使用したVerb Mappingにより、代理は常規コミットを作成できるようになり、祈使形と簡潔な説明を保証し、同時に.env、*.cer、*.pfx、*.pem、*.keyファイルを介したシークレットの暴露を防ぎます。","ko":"특정 유형(예: feat, fix, docs)을 사용한 동사 매핑을 통해 에이전트가 표준 커밋을 만들 수 있도록 하며, 명령형과 간결한 설명을 보장同时, .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem, *.key 파일을 통해 비밀 노출을 방지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear commits convencionales mediante el mapeo de verbos con tipos específicos como feat, fix y docs, garantizando un estado de ánimo imperativo y descripciones concisas, al mismo tiempo que evita la exposición de secretos a través de archivos .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem y *.key.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des commits conventionnels en utilisant le mappage de verbes avec des types spécifiques tels que feat, fix et docs, en garantissant un mode impératif et des descriptions concises, tout en empêchant l''exposition de secrets via des fichiers .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem et *.key.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, konventionelle Commits mit Hilfe der Verb-Mapping mit spezifischen Typen wie feat, fix und docs zu erstellen, wodurch ein imperativer Modus und präzise Beschreibungen gewährleistet werden, während gleichzeitig die Offenlegung von Geheimnissen durch Dateien wie .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem und *.key verhindert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar commites convencionais usando Mapeamento de Verbos com tipos específicos como feat, fix e docs, garantindo modo imperativo e descrições concisas, tudo isso enquanto impede a exposição de segredos por meio de arquivos .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem e *.key.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать конвенциональные коммиты с помощью сопоставления глаголов с конкретными типами, такими как feat, fix и docs, обеспечивая императивный режим и краткие описания, все это при предотвращении раскрытия секретов через файлы .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem и *.key.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء إلتزامات تقليدية باستخدام تعيين الفعل مع أنواع محددة مثل feat و fix و docs، مما يضمن الحالة اللازمة والوصف الموجز، كل ذلك مع منع التعرض للأسرار من خلال الملفات .env و *.cer و *.pfx و *.pem و *.key."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit message formatting with Conventional Commits","Merging branches following established git conventions","Enforcing commit type standards such as feat, fix, and refactor"],"zh":["使用Conventional Commits自动化提交消息格式","遵循既定的Git约定合并分支","强制执行feat、fix和重构等提交类型标准"],"ja":["Conventional Commitsを使用したコミットメッセージ形式の自動化","既定のGit規約に従ったブランチのマージ","feat、fix、refactorなどのコミットタイプ標準の強制"],"ko":["Conventional Commits를 사용한 커밋 메시지 형식 자동화","既定的 Git 규약에 따른 브랜치 병합","feat, fix, 리팩토링 등의 커밋 유형 표준 강제"],"es":["Automatización del formato de mensajes de commit con Commits Convencionales","Fusión de ramas siguiendo las convenciones de git establecidas","Aplicación de estándares de tipo de commit como feat, fix y refactor"],"fr":["Automatisation du formatage des messages de commit avec des Commits Conventionnels","Fusion de branches suivant les conventions Git établies","Application des normes de type de commit telles que feat, fix et refactor"],"de":["Automatisierung der Commit-Mitteilungsformatierung mit Conventional Commits","Zusammenführung von Branches unter Einhaltung etablierter Git-Konventionen","Durchsetzung von Commit-Typ-Standard wie feat, fix und refactor"],"pt":["Automatizar o formato de mensagem de commit com Commits Convencionais","Mesclar branches seguindo as convenções git estabelecidas","Aplicar padrões de tipo de commit, como feat, fix e refactor"],"ru":["Автоматизировать формат сообщения коммита с помощью Конвенциональных Коммитов","Объединять ветки в соответствии с установленными конвенциями git","Применять стандарты типа коммита, такие как feat, fix и refactor"],"ar":["تطبيق تلقائي لتنسيق رسالة الإلتزام باستخدام الإلتزامات التقليدية","دمج الفروع اتباعاً للمعايير المحددة ل git","تطبيق معايير نوع الإلتزام، مثل feat و fix و refactor"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to Conventional Commits format","Imperative mood and description length restrictions apply","Specific file types are blocked from commits for security"],"zh":["需要遵守Conventional Commits格式","祈使语气和描述长度限制适用","特定文件类型将被阻止提交以确保安全"],"ja":["Conventional Commits形式の遵守が必要","祈使形と説明の長さ制限が適用される","特定のファイルタイプはセキュリティのためにコミットからブロックされる"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 형식 준수가 필요","祈使문과 설명 길이 제한이 적용","특정 파일 형식은 보안을 위해 커밋에서 차단"],"es":["Requiere adherirse al formato de Commits Convencionales","Se aplican restricciones de estado de ánimo imperativo y longitud de la descripción","Se bloquean tipos de archivos específicos desde los commits por motivos de seguridad"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion au format des Commits Conventionnels","Des restrictions d''état d''âme impératif et de longueur de la description s''appliquent","Des types de fichiers spécifiques sont bloqués depuis les commits pour des raisons de sécurité"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des Conventional Commits-Formats","Es gelten Einschränkungen für den imperativen Modus und die Beschreibungslänge","Bestimmte Dateitypen werden aufgrund von Sicherheitsgründen von Commits ausgeschlossen"],"pt":["Requer aderência ao formato de Commits Convencionais","Restrições de modo imperativo e comprimento da descrição se aplicam","Tipos de arquivos específicos são bloqueados de commits por motivos de segurança"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения формата Конвенциональных Коммитов","Применяются ограничения императивного режима и длины описания","Конкретные типы файлов блокируются от коммитов по соображениям безопасности"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع تنسيق الإلتزامات التقليدية","تطبق قيود الحالة اللازمة وطول الوصف","تُمنع أنواع ملفات محددة من الإلتزام بسبب أسباب أمنية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
