ge","création de documents","maintenance de documents","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Dokumentenschreibung","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","Dokumentenvorlagen","Formatierungsregeln","Erstellung von Dokumenten","Wartung von Dokumenten","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["write-documents","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","documentos técnicos","templates de documentos","regras de formatação","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["write-documents","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","технические документы","шаблоны документов","правила форматирования","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["write-documents","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","مستندات تقنية","قوالب المستندات","قواعد التنسيق","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"OpenAI-BackendTools","repoPath":"karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"write-documents","description":"Apply when creating or editing INFO, SPEC, IMPL, TEST, FIX documents, or STRUT plans","bodyPreview":"# Document Writing Guide\n\nThis skill contains document templates and formatting rules.\n\n## Verb Mapping\n\nThis skill implements:\n- [WRITE-INFO] - Create INFO documents (use INFO_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-SPEC] - Create SPEC documents (use SPEC_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-IMPL-PLAN] - Create IMPL documents (use IMPL_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-TEST-PLAN] - Create TEST documents (use TEST_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-FIX] - Create FIX documents (use FIXES_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-FAIL] - Create/update FAILS.md (use FAILS_TE","body":"# Document Writing Guide\n\nThis skill contains document templates and formatting rules.\n\n## Verb Mapping\n\nThis skill implements:\n- [WRITE-INFO] - Create INFO documents (use INFO_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-SPEC] - Create SPEC documents (use SPEC_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-IMPL-PLAN] - Create IMPL documents (use IMPL_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-TEST-PLAN] - Create TEST documents (use TEST_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-FIX] - Create FIX documents (use FIXES_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-FAIL] - Create/update FAILS.md (use FAILS_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-REVIEW] - Create _REVIEW.md documents (use REVIEW_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-TASKS-PLAN] - Create TASKS documents (use TASKS_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-STRUT] - Create/insert STRUT plans (use STRUT_TEMPLATE.md)\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Use lists, not Markdown tables\n- No emojis - ASCII only, no `---` markers between sections\n- Header block: Doc ID (required), Goal (required), Target file, Depends on (omit if N/A)\n- Every document MUST have a unique ID\n- Reference other docs by filename AND Doc ID: `_SPEC_CRAWLER.md [CRWL-SP01]`\n- Be exhaustive: list ALL domain objects, actions, functions\n- Document History section at end, reverse chronological\n- Use box-drawing characters (├── └── │) for trees\n- SPEC, IMPL, TEST documents MUST have MUST-NOT-FORGET section (after header block, before TOC)\n\n## Document Writing Rules\n\n- Enumerations: use comma-separated format (`.pdf, .docx, .ppt`), NOT slash-separated (`.pdf/.docx/.ppt`)\n- Ambiguous modifiers: when a clause can attach to multiple nouns, split into separate sentences\n  - BAD: \"Files starting with ''!'' signify high relevance that must be treated with extra attention.\"\n  - GOOD: \"Files starting with ''!'' indicate high relevance. This information must be treated with extra attention.\"\n\n## Templates (Required)\n\nYou MUST read the appropriate template before creating documents:\n- `INFO_TEMPLATE.md` - Research and analysis documents\n- `SPEC_TEMPLATE.md` - Technical specifications\n- `IMPL_TEMPLATE.md` - Implementation plans\n- `TEST_TEMPLATE.md` - Test plans\n- `TASKS_TEMPLATE.md` - Task plans (partitioned work items)\n- `FIXES_TEMPLATE.md` - Fix tracking documents\n- `FAILS_TEMPLATE.md` - Failure log (lessons learned)\n- `REVIEW_TEMPLATE.md` - Review documents (_REVIEW.md)\n- `WORKFLOW_TEMPLATE.md` - AGEN verb workflow structure\n- `STRUT_TEMPLATE.md` - STRUT plans (embeddable in any document)\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Read this SKILL.md for core rules\n2. Read the template for your document type (required)\n3. For SPEC documents: also read `SPEC_RULES.md` (required)\n4. Follow the template structure exactly, except when user requests exceptions or different structure\n\n## File Naming\n\n- `_INFO_[TOPIC].md` - Research, analysis, preparation documents\n- `_SPEC_[COMPONENT].md` - Technical specifications\n- `_SPEC_[COMPONENT]_UI.md` - UI specifications\n- `_IMPL_[COMPONENT].md` - Implementation plans\n- `_IMPL_[COMPONENT]_FIXES.md` - Fix tracking during implementation\n- `SPEC_[COMPONENT]_TEST.md` - Test plan for specification\n- `IMPL_[COMPONENT]_TEST.md` - Test plan for implementation\n- `TASKS_[TOPIC].md` - Task plans (partitioned work items)\n- `!` prefix for priority docs that must be read first\n\n## Agent Behavior\n\n- Be extremely concise. Sacrifice grammar for concision.\n- NEVER ask for continuations when following plans.\n- Before assumptions, propose 2-3 implementation alternatives.\n- List assumptions at spec start for user verification.\n- Optimize for simplicity.\n- Re-use existing code by default (DRY principle).\n- Research APIs before suggesting; rely on primary sources only.\n- Document user decisions in \"Key Mechanisms\" and \"What we don''t want\" sections.\n\n## ID System\n\nSee `[AGENT_FOLDER]/rules/devsystem-ids.md` rule (always-on) for complete ID system.\n\n**Quick Reference:**\n- Document: `[TOPIC]-[DOC][NN]` (IN = Info, SP = Spec, IP = Impl Plan, TP = Test Plan)\n  - Example: `CRWL-SP01`, `AUTH-IP01`\n- Spec-Level: `[TOPIC]-[TYPE]-[NN]` (FR = Functional Requirement, IG = Implementation Guarantee, DD = Design Decision)\n  - Example: `CRWL-FR-01`, `AUTH-DD-03`\n- Plan-Level: `[TOPIC]-[DOC][NN]-[TYPE]-[NN]` (EC = Edge Case, IS = Implementation Step, VC = Verification Checklist, TC = Test Case)\n  - Example: `CRWL-IP01-EC-01`, `AUTH-TP01-TC-05`\n\n## Writing AGEN Verb Workflows\n\nAGEN verbs map directly to Windsurf workflows. See `WORKFLOW_TEMPLATE.md` for:\n- Workflow structure template\n- General vs Specific parts pattern\n- Context discovery pattern\n- Strategy pattern\n- Output rules"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:00:18.534Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Writing Agents needing structured document generation and template management for OpenAI backends","zh":"适合需要结构化文档生成和模板管理的技术写作代理，特别是用于OpenAI后端","ja":"OpenAIバックエンドで構造化ドキュメント生成およびテンプレート管理を必要とするテクニカルライティングエージェントに最適","ko":"OpenAI 백엔드에서 구조화된 문서 생성 및 템플릿 관리가 필요한 기술 문서 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Escritura Técnica que necesitan generación de documentos estructurados y gestión de plantillas para backends de OpenAI","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin de génération de documents structurés et de gestion de modèles pour les backends OpenAI","de":"Ideal für technische Schreibagenten, die strukturierte Dokumentenerstellung und Vorlagenverwaltung für OpenAI-Backends benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que necessitam de geração de documentos estruturados e gerenciamento de modelos para backends do OpenAI","ru":"Идеально для агентов технического письма, которым необходима структурированная генерация документов и управление шаблонами для бэкендов OpenAI","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الكتابة الفنية الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد مستندات منظم و إدارة قوالب لخلفيات OpenAI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create standardized documents using INFO_TEMPLATE.md, SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, IMPL_TEMPLATE.md, TEST_TEMPLATE.md, and FIXES_TEMPLATE.md, streamlining the documentation process with verb mapping for WRITE-INFO, WRITE-SPEC, WRITE-IMPL-PLAN, WRITE-TEST-PLAN, WRITE-FIX, and WRITE-FAIL actions","zh":"赋予代理创建标准化文档的能力，使用INFO_TEMPLATE.md、SPEC_TEMPLATE.md、IMPL_TEMPLATE.md、TEST_TEMPLATE.md和FIXES_TEMPLATE.md，通过WRITE-INFO、WRITE-SPEC、WRITE-IMPL-PLAN、WRITE-TEST-PLAN、WRITE-FIX和WRITE-FAIL动作的动词映射简化文档流程","ja":"INFO_TEMPLATE.md、SPEC_TEMPLATE.md、IMPL_TEMPLATE.md、TEST_TEMPLATE.md、FIXES_TEMPLATE.mdを使用して標準化ドキュメントを作成するエージェントの能力を付与し、WRITE-INFO、WRITE-SPEC、WRITE-IMPL-PLAN、WRITE-TEST-PLAN、WRITE-FIX、WRITE-FAILアクションの動詞マッピングによって文書化プロセスを効率化する","ko":"INFO_TEMPLATE.md, SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, IMPL_TEMPLATE.md, TEST_TEMPLATE.md, FIXES_TEMPLATE.md를 사용하여 표준화된 문서를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하고, WRITE-INFO, WRITE-SPEC, WRITE-IMPL-PLAN, WRITE-TEST-PLAN, WRITE-FIX, WRITE-FAIL 동작의 동사 매핑으로 문서화 프로세스를 간소화","es":"Permite a los agentes crear documentos estandarizados utilizando INFO_TEMPLATE.md, SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, IMPL_TEMPLATE.md, TEST_TEMPLATE.md y FIXES_TEMPLATE.md, y simplifica el proceso de documentación con mapeo de verbos para las acciones WRITE-INFO, WRITE-SPEC, WRITE-IMPL-PLAN, WRITE-TEST-PLAN, WRITE-FIX y WRITE-FAIL","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des documents standardisés en utilisant INFO_TEMPLATE.md, SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, IMPL_TEMPLATE.md, TEST_TEMPLATE.md et FIXES_TEMPLATE.md, et rationalise le processus de documentation avec un mappage de verbes pour les actions WRITE-INFO, WRITE-SPEC, WRITE-IMPL-PLAN, WRITE-TEST-PLAN, WRITE-FIX et WRITE-FAIL","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, standardisierte Dokumente mit INFO_TEMPLATE.md, SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, IMPL_TEMPLATE.md, TEST_TEMPLATE.md und FIXES_TEMPLATE.md zu erstellen und rationalisiert den Dokumentationsprozess mit Verb-Mapping für WRITE-INFO-, WRITE-SPEC-, WRITE-IMPL-PLAN-, WRITE-TEST-PLAN-, WRITE-FIX- und WRITE-FAIL-Aktionen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar documentos padronizados usando INFO_TEMPLATE.md, SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, IMPL_TEMPLATE.md, TEST_TEMPLATE.md e FIXES_TEMPLATE.md, otimizando o processo de documentação com mapeamento de verbos para ações WRITE-INFO, WRITE-SPEC, WRITE-IMPL-PLAN, WRITE-TEST-PLAN, WRITE-FIX e WRITE-FAIL","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать стандартизированные документы с использованием INFO_TEMPLATE.md, SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, IMPL_TEMPLATE.md, TEST_TEMPLATE.md и FIXES_TEMPLATE.md, оптимизируя процесс документирования с помощью отображения глаголов для действий WRITE-INFO, WRITE-SPEC, WRITE-IMPL-PLAN, WRITE-TEST-PLAN, WRITE-FIX и WRITE-FAIL","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مستندات موحدة باستخدام INFO_TEMPLATE.md و SPEC_TEMPLATE.md و IMPL_TEMPLATE.md و TEST_TEMPLATE.md و FIXES_TEMPLATE.md، وتبسيط عملية توثيق مع خريطة الفعل لWRITE-INFO و WRITE-SPEC و WRITE-IMPL-PLAN و WRITE-TEST-PLAN و WRITE-FIX و WRITE-FAIL"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating INFO documents with consistent formatting","Creating SPEC documents for project planning","Automating TEST document creation for quality assurance","Updating FAILS.md for error tracking and analysis"],"zh":["生成具有统一格式的INFO文档","为项目规划创建SPEC文档","自动化TEST文档创建以进行质量保证","更新FAILS.md以进行错误跟踪和分析"],"ja":["統一されたフォーマットを持つINFOドキュメントを生成する","プロジェクト計画のためのSPECドキュメントを作成する","品質保証のためのTESTドキュメントの自動化","エラートラッキングおよび分析のためのFAILS.mdの更新"],"ko":["일관된 형식의 INFO 문서 생성","프로젝트 계획을 위한 SPEC 문서 생성","품질 보증을 위한 TEST 문서 자동 생성","오류 추적 및 분석을 위한 FAILS.md 업데이트"],"es":["Generación de documentos INFO con formato coherente","Creación de documentos SPEC para la planificación de proyectos","Automatización de la creación de documentos de prueba para la garantía de calidad","Actualización de FAILS.md para el seguimiento y análisis de errores"],"fr":["Génération de documents INFO avec mise en forme cohérente","Création de documents SPEC pour la planification de projet","Automatisation de la création de documents de test pour l''assurance qualité","Mise à jour de FAILS.md pour le suivi et l''analyse des erreurs"],"de":["Erstellung von INFO-Dokumenten mit konsistentem Format","Erstellung von SPEC-Dokumenten für die Projektplanung","Automatisierung der Erstellung von Testdokumenten für die Qualitätssicherung","Aktualisierung von FAILS.md für die Fehlerverfolgung und -analyse"],"pt":["Gerar documentos INFO com formatação consistente","Criar documentos SPEC para planejamento de projetos","Automatizar a criação de documentos TEST para garantia de qualidade","Atualizar FAILS.md para rastreamento e análise de erros"],"ru":["Генерировать документы INFO с последовательным форматированием","Создавать документы SPEC для планирования проектов","Автоматизировать создание документов TEST для обеспечения качества","Обновлять FAILS.md для отслеживания и анализа ошибок"],"ar":["توليد مستندات INFO ذات تنسيق متسق","إنشاء مستندات SPEC لخطط المشاريع","تأتمة إنشاء مستندات TEST لضمان الجودة","تحديث FAILS.md لتتبع وتحليل الأخطاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to OpenAI and AzureOpenAI backends","Limited to Markdown template formats (.md)"],"zh":["需要访问OpenAI和AzureOpenAI后端","仅限Markdown模板格式(.md)"],"ja":["OpenAIおよびAzureOpenAIバックエンドへのアクセスが必要","Markdownテンプレート形式(.md)のみに限定"],"ko":["OpenAI 및 AzureOpenAI 백엔드에 대한 액세스가 필요","Markdown 템플릿 형식(.md)만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los backends de OpenAI y AzureOpenAI","Limitado a formatos de plantilla Markdown (.md)"],"fr":["Requiert un accès aux backends OpenAI et AzureOpenAI","Limité aux formats de modèles Markdown (.md)"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf OpenAI- und AzureOpenAI-Backends","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Vorlagenformate (.md)"],"pt":["Requer acesso a backends do OpenAI e AzureOpenAI","Limitado a formatos de modelo Markdown (.md)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к бэкендам OpenAI и AzureOpenAI","Ограничен форматами шаблонов Markdown (.md)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى خلفيات OpenAI و AzureOpenAI","محدود بتنسيقات القوالب Markdown (.md)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
