형식 제공"],"es":["Herramientas para probar backends de OpenAI","Patrones de investigación sistemáticos","Jerarquía de fuentes para la investigación","Etiquetas de verificación para afirmaciones","Estrategias de investigación en profundidad"],"fr":["Outils pour tester les backends OpenAI","Modèles de recherche systématiques","Hiérarchie des sources pour la recherche","Étiquettes de vérification pour les affirmations","Stratégies de recherche approfondie"],"de":["Tools zur Überprüfung von OpenAI-Backends","Systematische Forschungsmuster","Quellhierarchie für die Forschung","Verifizierungslabels für Aussagen","Strategien für die tiefere Forschung"],"pt":["Padrões sistemáticos de pesquisa","Ferramentas para testar e operar backends da OpenAI","Investigações aprofundadas em tópicos de desenvolvimento de software","Prioridade de fontes para pesquisa","Rótulos de verificação para marcar afirmações"],"ru":["Систематические исследовательские шаблоны","Инструменты для тестирования и эксплуатации бэкендов OpenAI","Глубокие исследования по темам разработки программного обеспечения","Приоритет источников для исследования","Метки проверки для маркировки утверждений"],"ar":["أنماط بحثية منهجية","أدوات لاختبار وتشغيل خلفيات OpenAI","تحقيقات عميقة في مواضيع تطوير البرمجيات","ترتيب الأولوية للمصادر للبحث","تسميات التحقق لتحديد الادعاءات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ipps-deep-research","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","软件开发","深入研究","系统性研究模式"],"ja":["ipps-deep-research","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","ソフトウェア開発","深い調査","体系的な研究パターン"],"ko":["ipps-deep-research","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","소프트웨어 개발","심층 조사","체계적인 연구 패턴"],"es":["investigación en profundidad","backends de OpenAI","herramientas de investigación","patrones de investigación","jerarquía de fuentes","etiquetas de verificación","estrategias de investigación","desarrollo de software","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI"],"fr":["recherche approfondie","backends OpenAI","outils de recherche","modèles de recherche","hiérarchie des sources","étiquettes de vérification","stratégies de recherche","développement de logiciels","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI"],"de":["tiefere Forschung","OpenAI-Backends","Forschungstools","Forschungsmuster","Quellhierarchie","Verifizierungslabels","Forschungsstrategien","Softwareentwicklung","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI"],"pt":["ipps-deep-research","pesquisa aprofundada","desenvolvimento de software","OpenAI","backends","padrões de pesquisa","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ipps-deep-research","глубокое исследование","разработка программного обеспечения","OpenAI","бэкенды","исследовательские шаблоны","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["ipps-deep-research","البحث العميق","تطوير البرمجيات","OpenAI","خلفيات","أنماط البحث","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"OpenAI-BackendTools","repoPath":"karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ipps-deep-research","description":"Apply when conducting deep research on technologies, APIs, frameworks, or other software development topics requiring systematic investigation","bodyPreview":"# Deep Research Skill\n\nSystematic research patterns for in-depth investigation of software development topics.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n**Core**\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [MUST-NOT-FORGET](#must-not-forget)\n- [Output Format](#output-format)\n\n**Patterns**\n- [MEPI vs MCPI](#mepi-vs-mcpi) - When to use quick vs exhaustive research\n- [Source Hierarchy](#source-hierarchy) - Priority order for sources\n- [Verification Labels](#verification-labels) - How to mark claims\n\n**Strategies**\n- [Technology/","body":"# Deep Research Skill\n\nSystematic research patterns for in-depth investigation of software development topics.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n**Core**\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [MUST-NOT-FORGET](#must-not-forget)\n- [Output Format](#output-format)\n\n**Patterns**\n- [MEPI vs MCPI](#mepi-vs-mcpi) - When to use quick vs exhaustive research\n- [Source Hierarchy](#source-hierarchy) - Priority order for sources\n- [Verification Labels](#verification-labels) - How to mark claims\n\n**Strategies**\n- [Technology/API Research (MCPI)](RESEARCH_STRATEGY_TECH_MCPI.md) - 6-phase exhaustive documentation\n- [Quick Research (MEPI)](#research-strategies) - Abbreviated approach for low-stakes\n\n**Planning & Tracking**\n- [Planning Structure](#planning-structure) - STRUT vs TASKS\n- [Time Tracking](#time-tracking) - Net research time calculation\n\n**Reference**\n- [Tool Reference](RESEARCH_TOOLS.md) - Source collection, PDF processing, transcription\n- [Source ID Format](#source-id-format) - How to cite sources\n- [File Naming Conventions](#file-naming-conventions) - Prefix rules for documents\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Deep research (this skill):**\n- \"Should we use X or Y for our project?\"\n- \"How does X work internally?\"\n- \"What are the production considerations for X?\"\n- Multi-source synthesis required\n- Exhaustive documentation needed\n\n**Quick lookup (not this skill):**\n- \"What''s the syntax for X?\"\n- \"How do I install Y?\"\n- Single-source answers\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Start with assumptions check - write down what you think you know before researching\n- Primary sources > secondary sources > community opinions\n- Document all sources with URLs and access dates\n- Flag information age (APIs change rapidly)\n- Distinguish facts from opinions from assumptions\n- Version-match community sources to subject version\n- Create INFO document for findings\n- **Always create STRUT** for research session orchestration\n- **Track time** - log task start/end for net research time calculation\n- **Track credits** - detect model via screenshot, log switches, calculate usage\n- **Never auto-switch models** - respect user''s model selection throughout research\n\n## Global Patterns\n\n### MEPI vs MCPI\n\n**MEPI** (Most Executable Point of Information) - Default\n- Present 2-3 curated options\n- Filter and recommend\n- Use for: reversible decisions, time-constrained, action-oriented\n\n**MCPI** (Most Complete Point of Information) - Exception\n- Present exhaustive options\n- Document everything\n- Use for: irreversible decisions, high-stakes, archival reference\n\n### Source Hierarchy\n\n1. **Official PDFs/papers** - Legislation, specs, whitepapers, academic papers (often not available as web)\n2. **Official documentation** - Authoritative, version-specific\n3. **Official blog/changelog** - Announcements, rationale\n4. **GitHub repo** - Source code, issues, PRs, discussions\n5. **Conference talks by maintainers** - Design decisions, roadmap\n6. **Reputable tech blogs** - Analysis, comparisons\n7. **Stack Overflow** - Specific problems (verify currency)\n8. **Community forums/Discord** - Anecdotes, edge cases\n\n**Source Persistence**: Download and store all sources in session folder for later reference. Web content changes - PDFs and local copies ensure reproducibility.\n\n### Verification Labels\n\n- `[VERIFIED]` - Confirmed from official documentation\n- `[ASSUMED]` - Inferred but not explicitly stated\n- `[TESTED]` - Manually tested by running code\n- `[PROVEN]` - Confirmed from multiple independent sources\n- `[COMMUNITY]` - Reported by community sources (cite source ID)\n\n### Source ID Format\n\n```\n[TOPIC]-IN01-SC-[SOURCE]-[DOCNAME]\n```\n\nExamples:\n- `GRPH-IN01-SC-MSFT-APIOVERVIEW` - Microsoft Graph official docs\n- `GRPH-IN01-SC-SO-RATELIMIT` - Stack Overflow rate limit discussion\n- `GRPH-IN01-SC-GH-ISSUE1234` - GitHub issue #1234\n\n### File Naming Conventions\n\n- `__` prefix (double underscore): Master/index documents (SOURCES, TOC, TEMPLATE)\n- `_` prefix (single underscore): Topic content files (INFO documents)\n- No prefix: Tracking files (TASKS, NOTES, PROBLEMS, PROGRESS)\n\n### Information Currency\n\n- Note version numbers for all API/library info\n- Check last updated date on documentation\n- Cross-reference with changelog for breaking changes\n- Mark stale info with `[STALE: YYYY]` tag\n\n## Research Strategies\n\nAvailable research strategies (each has its own file):\n\n- **Technology/API Research (MCPI)** - [RESEARCH_STRATEGY_TECH_MCPI.md](RESEARCH_STRATEGY_TECH_MCPI.md) - Exhaustive API/framework documentation\n\n**Quick research (MEPI-style) until full strategy implemented:**\nFor reversible/low-stakes decisions, use abbreviated approach:\n1. Phase 1 (Preflight): 5-10 sources max, skip community deep-dive\n2. Skip Phases 2-4 (no TOC, template, or TASKS)\n3. Phase 5: Create single `_INFO_[TOPIC].md` with findings\n4. Phase 6: Quick `/verify`, done\n\nFuture strategies (not yet implemented):\n- Technology Research (MEPI) - Quick technology evaluation\n- Decision Research - Choose between options\n- Problem-Solving Research - Debug and fix issues\n\n## Tool Reference\n\nSee [RESEARCH_TOOLS.md](RESEARCH_TOOLS.md) for:\n- Source collection tools (search_web, read_url_content, Playwright)\n- Document processing tools (pdf-tools)\n- Transcription tools (llm-transcription)\n- Tool selection flowchart\n- Common workflows\n\n## Planning Structure\n\n**STRUT** (high-level orchestration) - REQUIRED for all research:\n- Tracks phases, objectives, deliverables, transitions\n- Contains time log for net research time\n- Created at research start, updated at phase transitions\n- File: `STRUT_[TOPIC].md` in session folder\n\n**TASKS** (low-level execution) - Created in Phase 4:\n- Flat list of individual research tasks with durations\n- Each task: file to create, sources to use, done-when criteria\n- Tracks task timing: `[HH:MM-HH:MM]` per task\n- File: `TASKS.md` in session folder\n\n## Time Tracking\n\n**Net research time** = active work time, excluding pauses.\n\n**STRUT time log format:**\n```\n## Time Log\nStarted: 2026-01-30 09:00\nEnded: 2026-01-30 14:30\n\nActive intervals:\n- 09:00-10:30 (Phase 1-3)\n- 11:00-12:15 (Phase 4-5)\n- 13:00-14:30 (Phase 5-6)\n\nNet research time: 4h 15m\n```\n\n**TASKS timing format:**\n```\n- [x] TK-01: Research auth [10:00-10:45] 45m\n- [x] TK-02: Research limits [10:15-11:00] 45m (parallel)\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n- Pause detection: Gap > 30min in file timestamps = pause (don''t count)\n- Parallel tasks: Overlapping intervals count once, not doubled\n- Log start time when beginning task, end time when completing\n\n## Credit Tracking (Mandatory)\n\n**Workflow:**\n1. At phase start: `simple-screenshot.ps1` → detect model from Windsurf header\n2. Lookup cost in `windsurf-model-registry.json`\n3. Log model + timestamp in STRUT Credit Tracking section\n4. At session end: calculate total estimated credits\n\n**STRUT Credit Tracking format:**\n```\n## Credit Tracking\nPhase 1: Claude Opus 4.5 (Thinking) [5x] - 09:00\nPhase 2: Claude Opus 4.5 (Thinking) [5x] - 09:30\nPhase 4: Claude Sonnet 4.5 [2x] - 10:15 (user switched)\nPhase 5: Claude Sonnet 4.5 [2x] - 10:45\nPhase 6: Claude Sonnet 4.5 [2x] - 11:30\n\nEstimated credits: (2 phases × 5x) + (3 phases × 2x) = 16 units\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n- **Never auto-switch models** - respect user''s model selection\n- Detect via screenshot only - passive observation\n- Log when model changes (user-initiated)\n- Registry: `[DEVSYSTEM_FOLDER]/skills/windsurf-auto-model-switcher/windsurf-model-registry.json`\n\n## Output Format\n\nDeep research outputs an INFO document. Key sections:\n\n1. **Research Question** - What we''re investigating\n2. **Key Findings** - MEPI-style summary (2-3 main points) or MCPI exhaustive list\n3. **Detailed Analysis** - Full investigation results\n4. **Limitations and Known Issues** - From community sources\n5. **Sources** - All references with quality indicators\n6. **Recommendations** - Actionable conclusions\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Determine research type (MEPI quick vs MCPI exhaustive)\n2. Read this SKILL.md for core principles\n3. Read the appropriate strategy file\n4. Read RESEARCH_TOOLS.md for tool guidance\n5. Follow the strategy''s phases systematically\n6. Output findings as INFO document\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:00:27.305Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing systematic research patterns for in-depth investigation of OpenAI backend topics, such as OpenAI and AzureOpenAI.","zh":"非常适合需要系统化研究模式以深入调查OpenAI后端主题（如OpenAI和AzureOpenAI）的AI智能体。","ja":"OpenAIやAzureOpenAIなどのバックエンドトピックを深く調査するための体系的な研究パターンを必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"OpenAI 및 AzureOpenAI와 같은 OpenAI 백엔드 주제에 대한 심층 조사를 위한 체계적인 연구 패턴이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan patrones de investigación sistemáticos para una investigación en profundidad de temas de backend de OpenAI, como OpenAI y AzureOpenAI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des modèles de recherche systématiques pour une enquête approfondie sur les sujets de backend OpenAI, tels que OpenAI et AzureOpenAI.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die systematische Recherchemuster für eine gründliche Untersuchung von OpenAI-Backend-Themen benötigen, wie z. B. OpenAI und AzureOpenAI.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que necessitam de padrões de pesquisa sistemática para uma investigação aprofundada de tópicos de backend da OpenAI, como OpenAI e AzureOpenAI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым требуются систематические шаблоны исследований для глубокого изучения тем, связанных с бэкендом OpenAI, таких как OpenAI и AzureOpenAI.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى أنماط بحث منهجية لإجراء تحقيقات متعمقة في مواضيع الواجهة الخلفية لـ OpenAI، مثل OpenAI و AzureOpenAI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough research using MEPI vs MCPI patterns, prioritize sources with a clear hierarchy, and verify claims with labeled outputs, all while maintaining OpenAI backends.","zh":"使智能体能够使用MEPI与MCPI模式进行全面研究，通过清晰的层次结构确定来源优先级，并使用带标签的输出验证声明，同时始终保持OpenAI后端。","ja":"MEPI対MCPIパターンを使用して徹底的な調査を行い、明確な階層構造でソースの優先順位を付け、ラベル付けされた出力で主張を検証する能力をエージェントに付与します。すべてOpenAIバックエンドを維持しながら実行されます。","ko":"MEPI 대 MCPI 패턴을 사용하여 포괄적인 연구를 수행하고, 명확한 계층 구조로 소스의 우선순위를 지정하며, 레이블이 지정된 출력으로 주장을 검증할 수 있도록 하여, OpenAI 백엔드를 유지하면서 모든 작업을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar investigaciones exhaustivas utilizando patrones MEPI vs MCPI, priorizar fuentes con una jerarquía clara y verificar afirmaciones con salidas etiquetadas, todo mientras mantiene los backends de OpenAI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mener des recherches approfondies en utilisant des modèles MEPI vs MCPI, de prioriser les sources avec une hiérarchie claire et de vérifier les allégations avec des sorties étiquetées, le tout en maintenant les backends OpenAI.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gründliche Recherchen durchzuführen, indem sie Muster von MEPI vs MCPI verwenden, Quellen mit einer klaren Hierarchie zu priorisieren und Behauptungen mit beschrifteten Ausgaben zu überprüfen, während sie die OpenAI-Backends beibehalten.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a conduzir pesquisas minuciosas usando padrões MEPI versus MCPI, priorizar fontes com uma hierarquia clara e verificar alegações com saídas rotuladas, tudo isso mantendo os backends da OpenAI.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проводить тщательные исследования, используя шаблоны MEPI и MCPI, расставлять приоритеты источников с четкой иерархией и проверять утверждения с помощью помеченных выходных данных, все это при работе с бэкендами OpenAI.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إجراء بحث شامل باستخدام أنماط MEPI مقابل MCPI، وأولوية المصادر ذات التسلسل الهرمي الواضح، والتحقق من الادعاءات بمخرجات مُوسومة، كل ذلك مع الحفاظ على الواجهات الخلفية لـ OpenAI."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating research workflows for OpenAI backend maintenance","Generating verification labels for claims on OpenAI topics","Debugging OpenAI backend issues using systematic research patterns"],"zh":["自动化OpenAI后端维护的研究工作流程","为OpenAI主题的声明生成验证标签","使用系统化研究模式调试OpenAI后端问题"],"ja":["OpenAIバックエンドメンテナンスのための研究ワークフローの自動化","OpenAIトピックに関する主張の検証ラベルの生成","体系的な研究パターンを使用したOpenAIバックエンド問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["OpenAI 백엔드 유지관리를 위한 연구 워크플로우 자동화","OpenAI 주제에 대한 주장의 검증 레이블 생성","체계적인 연구 패턴을 사용한 OpenAI 백엔드 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de investigación para el mantenimiento de backend de OpenAI","Generación de etiquetas de verificación para afirmaciones sobre temas de OpenAI","Depuración de problemas de backend de OpenAI utilizando patrones de investigación sistemáticos"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de recherche pour la maintenance de backend OpenAI","Génération d''étiquettes de vérification pour les allégations sur les sujets OpenAI","Débogage des problèmes de backend OpenAI à l''aide de modèles de recherche systématiques"],"de":["Automatisierung von Forschungsworkflows für die Wartung von OpenAI-Backends","Generierung von Überprüfungslabels für Behauptungen zu OpenAI-Themen","Fehlerbehebung bei OpenAI-Backend-Problemen mithilfe systematischer Recherchemuster"],"pt":["Automatizando fluxos de trabalho de pesquisa para manutenção de backend da OpenAI","Gerando rótulos de verificação para alegações sobre tópicos da OpenAI","Depurando problemas de backend da OpenAI usando padrões de pesquisa sistemática"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов исследований для обслуживания бэкенда OpenAI","Генерация меток проверки для утверждений по темам OpenAI","Отладка проблем бэкенда OpenAI с использованием систематических шаблонов исследований"],"ar":["أتمتة سير عمل البحث لصيانة الواجهة الخلفية لـ OpenAI","إنشاء تسميات التحقق للادعاءات حول مواضيع OpenAI","تصحيح مشاكل الواجهة الخلفية لـ OpenAI باستخدام أنماط البحث المنهجي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to OpenAI and AzureOpenAI backends","Specific to OpenAI and AzureOpenAI topics only"],"zh":["需要访问OpenAI和AzureOpenAI后端","仅适用于OpenAI和AzureOpenAI相关主题"],"ja":["OpenAIおよびAzureOpenAIバックエンドへのアクセスが必要","OpenAIおよびAzureOpenAIトピックにのみ特化"],"ko":["OpenAI 및 AzureOpenAI 백엔드에 대한 접근 권한 필요","OpenAI 및 AzureOpenAI 주제에만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los backends de OpenAI y AzureOpenAI","Específico para temas de OpenAI y AzureOpenAI solo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux backends OpenAI et AzureOpenAI","Spécifique aux sujets OpenAI et AzureOpenAI uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf OpenAI- und AzureOpenAI-Backends","Spezifisch für OpenAI- und AzureOpenAI-Themen"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos backends da OpenAI e AzureOpenAI","Específico apenas para tópicos da OpenAI e AzureOpenAI"],"ru":["Требует доступ к бэкендам OpenAI и AzureOpenAI","Только для тем, связанных с OpenAI и AzureOpenAI"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الواجهات الخلفية لـ OpenAI و AzureOpenAI","مخصص فقط لمواضيع OpenAI و AzureOpenAI"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
