mação de dados","implantação de modelos","monitoramento de modelos","workflows de desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ML-пайплайн","оркестровка рабочего процесса","распределенное обучение","продвинутый вывод","автоматизация данных","развертывание моделей","мониторинг моделей","рабочие процессы разработчиков"],"ar":["PIPELINE ML","أوركسترا تدفق العمل","التدريب الموزع","الاستدلال المتقدم","أتمتة البيانات","تثبيت النماذج","مراقبة النماذج","سير عمل المطورين"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ugro","repoPath":"ollieb89/ugro","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ml-pipeline-workflow","description":"Build end-to-end MLOps pipelines from data preparation through model training, validation, and production deployment. Use when creating ML pipelines, implementing MLOps practices, or automating model training and deployment workflows.","bodyPreview":"# ML Pipeline Workflow\n\nComplete end-to-end MLOps pipeline orchestration from data preparation through model deployment.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive guidance for building production ML pipelines that handle the full lifecycle: data ingestion → preparation → training → validation → deployment → monitoring.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building new ML pipelines from scratch\n- Designing workflow orchestration for ML systems\n- Implementing data → model → deployment automation\n-","body":"# ML Pipeline Workflow\n\nComplete end-to-end MLOps pipeline orchestration from data preparation through model deployment.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive guidance for building production ML pipelines that handle the full lifecycle: data ingestion → preparation → training → validation → deployment → monitoring.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building new ML pipelines from scratch\n- Designing workflow orchestration for ML systems\n- Implementing data → model → deployment automation\n- Setting up reproducible training workflows\n- Creating DAG-based ML orchestration\n- Integrating ML components into production systems\n\n## What This Skill Provides\n\n### Core Capabilities\n\n1. **Pipeline Architecture**\n   - End-to-end workflow design\n   - DAG orchestration patterns (Airflow, Dagster, Kubeflow)\n   - Component dependencies and data flow\n   - Error handling and retry strategies\n\n2. **Data Preparation**\n   - Data validation and quality checks\n   - Feature engineering pipelines\n   - Data versioning and lineage\n   - Train/validation/test splitting strategies\n\n3. **Model Training**\n   - Training job orchestration\n   - Hyperparameter management\n   - Experiment tracking integration\n   - Distributed training patterns\n\n4. **Model Validation**\n   - Validation frameworks and metrics\n   - A/B testing infrastructure\n   - Performance regression detection\n   - Model comparison workflows\n\n5. **Deployment Automation**\n   - Model serving patterns\n   - Canary deployments\n   - Blue-green deployment strategies\n   - Rollback mechanisms\n\n### Reference Documentation\n\nSee the `references/` directory for detailed guides:\n- **data-preparation.md** - Data cleaning, validation, and feature engineering\n- **model-training.md** - Training workflows and best practices\n- **model-validation.md** - Validation strategies and metrics\n- **model-deployment.md** - Deployment patterns and serving architectures\n\n### Assets and Templates\n\nThe `assets/` directory contains:\n- **pipeline-dag.yaml.template** - DAG template for workflow orchestration\n- **training-config.yaml** - Training configuration template\n- **validation-checklist.md** - Pre-deployment validation checklist\n\n## Usage Patterns\n\n### Basic Pipeline Setup\n\n```python\n# 1. Define pipeline stages\nstages = [\n    \"data_ingestion\",\n    \"data_validation\",\n    \"feature_engineering\",\n    \"model_training\",\n    \"model_validation\",\n    \"model_deployment\"\n]\n\n# 2. Configure dependencies\n# See assets/pipeline-dag.yaml.template for full example\n```\n\n### Production Workflow\n\n1. **Data Preparation Phase**\n   - Ingest raw data from sources\n   - Run data quality checks\n   - Apply feature transformations\n   - Version processed datasets\n\n2. **Training Phase**\n   - Load versioned training data\n   - Execute training jobs\n   - Track experiments and metrics\n   - Save trained models\n\n3. **Validation Phase**\n   - Run validation test suite\n   - Compare against baseline\n   - Generate performance reports\n   - Approve for deployment\n\n4. **Deployment Phase**\n   - Package model artifacts\n   - Deploy to serving infrastructure\n   - Configure monitoring\n   - Validate production traffic\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Pipeline Design\n\n- **Modularity**: Each stage should be independently testable\n- **Idempotency**: Re-running stages should be safe\n- **Observability**: Log metrics at every stage\n- **Versioning**: Track data, code, and model versions\n- **Failure Handling**: Implement retry logic and alerting\n\n### Data Management\n\n- Use data validation libraries (Great Expectations, TFX)\n- Version datasets with DVC or similar tools\n- Document feature engineering transformations\n- Maintain data lineage tracking\n\n### Model Operations\n\n- Separate training and serving infrastructure\n- Use model registries (MLflow, Weights & Biases)\n- Implement gradual rollouts for new models\n- Monitor model performance drift\n- Maintain rollback capabilities\n\n### Deployment Strategies\n\n- Start with shadow deployments\n- Use canary releases for validation\n- Implement A/B testing infrastructure\n- Set up automated rollback triggers\n- Monitor latency and throughput\n\n## Integration Points\n\n### Orchestration Tools\n\n- **Apache Airflow**: DAG-based workflow orchestration\n- **Dagster**: Asset-based pipeline orchestration\n- **Kubeflow Pipelines**: Kubernetes-native ML workflows\n- **Prefect**: Modern dataflow automation\n\n### Experiment Tracking\n\n- MLflow for experiment tracking and model registry\n- Weights & Biases for visualization and collaboration\n- TensorBoard for training metrics\n\n### Deployment Platforms\n\n- AWS SageMaker for managed ML infrastructure\n- Google Vertex AI for GCP deployments\n- Azure ML for Azure cloud\n- Kubernetes + KServe for cloud-agnostic serving\n\n## Progressive Disclosure\n\nStart with the basics and gradually add complexity:\n\n1. **Level 1**: Simple linear pipeline (data → train → deploy)\n2. **Level 2**: Add validation and monitoring stages\n3. **Level 3**: Implement hyperparameter tuning\n4. **Level 4**: Add A/B testing and gradual rollouts\n5. **Level 5**: Multi-model pipelines with ensemble strategies\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Batch Training Pipeline\n\n```yaml\n# See assets/pipeline-dag.yaml.template\nstages:\n  - name: data_preparation\n    dependencies: []\n  - name: model_training\n    dependencies: [data_preparation]\n  - name: model_evaluation\n    dependencies: [model_training]\n  - name: model_deployment\n    dependencies: [model_evaluation]\n```\n\n### Real-time Feature Pipeline\n\n```python\n# Stream processing for real-time features\n# Combined with batch training\n# See references/data-preparation.md\n```\n\n### Continuous Training\n\n```python\n# Automated retraining on schedule\n# Triggered by data drift detection\n# See references/model-training.md\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n- **Pipeline failures**: Check dependencies and data availability\n- **Training instability**: Review hyperparameters and data quality\n- **Deployment issues**: Validate model artifacts and serving config\n- **Performance degradation**: Monitor data drift and model metrics\n\n### Debugging Steps\n\n1. Check pipeline logs for each stage\n2. Validate input/output data at boundaries\n3. Test components in isolation\n4. Review experiment tracking metrics\n5. Inspect model artifacts and metadata\n\n## Next Steps\n\nAfter setting up your pipeline:\n\n1. Explore **hyperparameter-tuning** skill for optimization\n2. Learn **experiment-tracking-setup** for MLflow/W&B\n3. Review **model-deployment-patterns** for serving strategies\n4. Implement monitoring with observability tools\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **experiment-tracking-setup**: MLflow and Weights & Biases integration\n- **hyperparameter-tuning**: Automated hyperparameter optimization\n- **model-deployment-patterns**: Advanced deployment strategies\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:00:56.085Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for MLOps Orchestration Agents managing distributed GPU clusters for end-to-end machine learning workflows.","zh":"非常适合管理分布式GPU集群以进行端到端机器学习工作流的MLOps编排智能体。","ja":"エンドツーエンドの機械学習ワークフローを管理する分散GPUクラスター向けのMLOpsオーケストレーションエージェントに最適です。","ko":"엔드투엔드 머신러닝 워크플로우를 관리하는 분산 GPU 클러스터용 MLOps 오케스트레이션 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal for MLOps Orchestration Agents managing distributed GPU clusters for end-to-end machine learning workflows.","fr":"Ideal for MLOps Orchestration Agents managing distributed GPU clusters for end-to-end machine learning workflows.","de":"Ideal for MLOps Orchestration Agents managing distributed GPU clusters for end-to-end machine learning workflows.","pt":"Ideal for MLOps Orchestration Agents managing distributed GPU clusters for end-to-end machine learning workflows.","ru":"Ideal for MLOps Orchestration Agents managing distributed GPU clusters for end-to-end machine learning workflows.","ar":"Ideal for MLOps Orchestration Agents managing distributed GPU clusters for end-to-end machine learning workflows."},"recommendation":{"en":"Transforms independent GPU machines into a cohesive compute system for distributed training and advanced inference. Enables dynamic orchestration of production ML pipelines from data ingestion through model deployment and monitoring.","zh":"将独立的GPU机器转变为用于分布式训练和高级推理的连贯计算系统。支持从数据摄取到模型部署和监控的生产ML流水线的动态编排。","ja":"独立したGPUマシンを、分散トレーニングと高度な推論のための統合された計算システムに変換します。データ取り込みからモデル導入、監視までの本番MLパイプラインの動的オーケストレーションを可能にします。","ko":"독립적인 GPU 머신을 분산 훈련 및 고급 추론을 위한 통합 컴퓨팅 시스템으로 변환합니다. 데이터 수집부터 모델 배포 및 모니터링까지 프로덕션 ML 파이프라인의 동적 오케스트레이션을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Transforms independent GPU machines into a cohesive compute system for distributed training and advanced inference. Enables dynamic orchestration of production ML pipelines from data ingestion through model deployment and monitoring.","fr":"Transforms independent GPU machines into a cohesive compute system for distributed training and advanced inference. Enables dynamic orchestration of production ML pipelines from data ingestion through model deployment and monitoring.","de":"Transforms independent GPU machines into a cohesive compute system for distributed training and advanced inference. Enables dynamic orchestration of production ML pipelines from data ingestion through model deployment and monitoring.","pt":"Transforms independent GPU machines into a cohesive compute system for distributed training and advanced inference. Enables dynamic orchestration of production ML pipelines from data ingestion through model deployment and monitoring.","ru":"Transforms independent GPU machines into a cohesive compute system for distributed training and advanced inference. Enables dynamic orchestration of production ML pipelines from data ingestion through model deployment and monitoring.","ar":"Transforms independent GPU machines into a cohesive compute system for distributed training and advanced inference. Enables dynamic orchestration of production ML pipelines from data ingestion through model deployment and monitoring."},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating distributed training across GPU clusters","Automating end-to-end MLOps pipeline execution","Implementing dynamic resource allocation for inference workloads","Monitoring production ML systems from data to deployment"],"zh":["跨GPU集群编排分布式训练","自动化端到端MLOps流水线执行","为推理工作负载实施动态资源分配","从数据到部署监控生产ML系统"],"ja":["GPUクラスター全体での分散トレーニングのオーケストレーション","エンドツーエンドのMLOpsパイプライン実行の自動化","推論ワークロードのための動的リソース割り当ての実装","データから導入までの本番MLシステムの監視"],"ko":["GPU 클러스터 간 분산 훈련 오케스트레이션","엔드투엔드 MLOps 파이프라인 실행 자동화","추론 워크로드를 위한 동적 리소스 할당 구현","데이터부터 배포까지 프로덕션 ML 시스템 모니터링"],"es":["Orchestrating distributed training across GPU clusters","Automating end-to-end MLOps pipeline execution","Implementing dynamic resource allocation for inference workloads","Monitoring production ML systems from data to deployment"],"fr":["Orchestrating distributed training across GPU clusters","Automating end-to-end MLOps pipeline execution","Implementing dynamic resource allocation for inference workloads","Monitoring production ML systems from data to deployment"],"de":["Orchestrating distributed training across GPU clusters","Automating end-to-end MLOps pipeline execution","Implementing dynamic resource allocation for inference workloads","Monitoring production ML systems from data to deployment"],"pt":["Orchestrating distributed training across GPU clusters","Automating end-to-end MLOps pipeline execution","Implementing dynamic resource allocation for inference workloads","Monitoring production ML systems from data to deployment"],"ru":["Orchestrating distributed training across GPU clusters","Automating end-to-end MLOps pipeline execution","Implementing dynamic resource allocation for inference workloads","Monitoring production ML systems from data to deployment"],"ar":["Orchestrating distributed training across GPU clusters","Automating end-to-end MLOps pipeline execution","Implementing dynamic resource allocation for inference workloads","Monitoring production ML systems from data to deployment"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to multiple GPU machines","Needs infrastructure for dynamic orchestration","Designed for production-scale ML systems only"],"zh":["需要访问多台GPU机器","需要动态编排的基础设施","仅设计用于生产规模的ML系统"],"ja":["複数のGPUマシンへのアクセスが必要","動的オーケストレーションのためのインフラストラクチャが必要","本番規模のMLシステム専用に設計"],"ko":["다중 GPU 머신에 대한 액세스 필요","동적 오케스트레이션을 위한 인프라 필요","프로덕션 규모 ML 시스템 전용으로 설계됨"],"es":["Requires access to multiple GPU machines","Needs infrastructure for dynamic orchestration","Designed for production-scale ML systems only"],"fr":["Requires access to multiple GPU machines","Needs infrastructure for dynamic orchestration","Designed for production-scale ML systems only"],"de":["Requires access to multiple GPU machines","Needs infrastructure for dynamic orchestration","Designed for production-scale ML systems only"],"pt":["Requires access to multiple GPU machines","Needs infrastructure for dynamic orchestration","Designed for production-scale ML systems only"],"ru":["Requires access to multiple GPU machines","Needs infrastructure for dynamic orchestration","Designed for production-scale ML systems only"],"ar":["Requires access to multiple GPU machines","Needs infrastructure for dynamic orchestration","Designed for production-scale ML systems only"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ollieb89/ugro/rag-implementation', 'community', 'ollieb89', 'ugro', 'ollieb89/ugro', 'rag-implementation', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z', '2026-02-18T12:00:32.633Z', NULL, '{"id":"ollieb89/ugro/rag-implementation","name":"rag-implementation","description":{"zh":"RAG实现旨在将多台GPU机器转变为单一的高性能计算系统，支持分布式训练和推理","ja":"RAG実装は、複数のGPUマシンを単一の高性能コンピューティングシステムに変換し、分散トレーニングと推論をサポート","ko":"RAG 구현은 여러개의 GPU 머신을 단일의 고성능 컴퓨팅 시스템으로 변환하여 분산 트레이닝과 추론을 지원","es":"La implementación RAG permite transformar máquinas GPU en un sistema de computo de alto rendimiento para entrenamiento distribuido y flujos de trabajo de desarrolladores. Esto facilita la creación de aplicaciones de aprendizaje automático avanzadas","fr":"La mise en œuvre RAG permet de transformer des machines GPU en un système de calcul haute performance pour la formation distribuée et les flux de travail des développeurs. Cela facilite la création d''applications d''apprentissage automatique avancées","de":"Die RAG-Implementierung ermöglicht die Umwandlung von GPU-Maschinen in ein leistungsfähiges Rechnersystem für verteiltes Training und Entwickler-Workflows. Dies erleichtert die Erstellung von fortschrittlichen Machine-Learning-Anwendungen","pt":"A implementação RAG permite criar aplicações LLM que fornecem respostas precisas e baseadas em conhecimento externo","ru":"Реализация RAG позволяет создавать приложения LLM, которые предоставляют точные и основанные на внешних знаниях ответы","ar":"تنفيذ RAG يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات LLM توفر استجابات دقيقة ومدعمة بمصادر معرفة خارجية","en":"This project aims to transform a small set of independently managed GPU machines into a **single, cohesive, high-power compute system** that can be dynamically orchestrated for **distributed training**, **advanced inference**, and **developer workflows**."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"RAG实现：打造高性能计算系统","ja":"RAG実装：高性能コンピューティングシステムの構築","ko":"RAG 구현: 고성능 컴퓨팅 시스템 구축","es":"Implementación RAG: Desarrollo de Sistemas de Computo de ...","fr":"Mise en œuvre RAG : Création de Systèmes de Calcul Haute ...","de":"RAG-Implementierung: Entwicklung von Hochleistungsrechner...","pt":"Implementação RAG para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Реализация RAG для разработчиков","ar":"تنفيذ RAG للطورين","en":"rag-implementation"},"description":{"zh":"RAG实现旨在将多台GPU机器转变为单一的高性能计算系统，支持分布式训练和推理","ja":"RAG実装は、複数のGPUマシンを単一の高性能コンピューティングシステムに変換し、分散トレーニングと推論をサポート","ko":"RAG 구현은 여러개의 GPU 머신을 단일의 고성능 컴퓨팅 시스템으로 변환하여 분산 트레이닝과 추론을 지원","es":"La implementación RAG permite transformar máquinas GPU en un sistema de computo de alto rendimiento para entrenamiento distribuido y flujos de trabajo de des...","fr":"La mise en œuvre RAG permet de transformer des machines GPU en un système de calcul haute performance pour la formation distribuée et les flux de travail des...","de":"Die RAG-Implementierung ermöglicht die Umwandlung von GPU-Maschinen in ein leistungsfähiges Rechnersystem für verteiltes Training und Entwickler-Workflows. D...","pt":"A implementação RAG permite criar aplicações LLM que fornecem respostas precisas e baseadas em conhecimento externo","ru":"Реализация RAG позволяет создавать приложения LLM, которые предоставляют точные и основанные на внешних знаниях ответы","ar":"تنفيذ RAG يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات LLM توفر استجابات دقيقة ومدعمة بمصادر معرفة خارجية","en":"This project aims to transform a small set of independently managed GPU machines into a **single, cohesive, high-power compute system** that can be dynamical..."},"definition":{"en":"This project aims to transform a small set of independently managed GPU machines into a **single, cohesive, high-power compute system** that can be dynamically orchestrated for **distributed training**, **advanced inference**, and **developer workflows**."},"features":{"zh":["分布式训练","高性能计算","外部知识源集成","开发工作流优化","语义搜索"],"ja":["分散トレーニング","高性能コンピューティング","外部知識源の統合","開発ワークフローの最適化","セマンティック検索"],"ko":["분산 트레이닝","고성능 컴퓨팅","외부 지식源 통합","개발 워크플로우 최적화","语义 검색"],"es":["Entrenamiento distribuido","Flujos de trabajo de desarrolladores","Sistemas de computo de alto rendimiento","Acceso a conocimientos de dominio específico","Respuestas precisas y fundamentadas","Implementación de búsqueda semántica"],"fr":["Formation distribuée","Flux de travail des développeurs","Systèmes de calcul haute performance","Accès à des connaissances de domaine spécifique","Réponses précises et fondées","Mise en œuvre de la recherche sémantique"],"de":["Verteiltes Training","Entwickler-Workflows","Leistungsfähige Rechnersysteme","Zugriff auf domänenspezifisches Wissen","Genauere und fundierte Antworten","Implementierung der semantischen Suche"],"pt":["Criação de sistemas de Q&A sobre documentos proprietários","Desenvolvimento de chatbots com informações atuais e factuais","Implementação de busca semântica com consultas de linguagem natural","Redução de alucinações com respostas baseadas em conhecimento","Acesso a conhecimento específico de domínio para LLMs","Criação de assistentes de documentação"],"ru":["Создание систем Q&A над проприетарными документами","Разработка чат-ботов с актуальной и фактуальной информацией","Реализация семантического поиска с запросами естественного языка","Снижение галлюцинаций с ответами, основанными на знаниях","Доступ к специфичному знанию домена для LLM","Создание помощников документации"],"ar":["إنشاء أنظمة أسئلة وأجوبة على وثائق خاصة"," تطوير بوتات الدردشة مع معلومات حديثة وواقعية","تنفيذ بحث семантиكي بالاستفسارات اللغوية الطبيعية","تقليل الهلوسات بالاستجابات القائمة على المعرفة","تمكين النماذج اللغوية الكبيرة من الوصول إلى معرفة خاصة بالمجال","إنشاء مساعدين للوثائق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RAG实现","高性能计算","分布式训练","外部知识源","开发工作流","语义搜索","LLM应用"],"ja":["RAG実装","高性能コンピューティング","分散トレーニング","外部知識源","開発ワークフロー","セマンティック検索","LLMアプリケーション"],"ko":["RAG 구현","고성능 컴퓨팅","분산 트레이닝","외부 지식源","개발 워크플로우","语义 검색","LLM 애플리케이션"],"es":["RAG","Implementación RAG","Sistemas de computo de alto rendimiento","Entrenamiento distribuido","Flujos de trabajo de desarrolladores","Aprendizaje automático","Procesamiento de lenguaje natural","Búsqueda semántica"],"fr":["RAG","Mise en œuvre RAG","Systèmes de calcul haute performance","Formation distribuée","Flux de travail des développeurs","Apprentissage automatique","Traitement du langage naturel","Recherche sémantique"],"de":["RAG","RAG-Implementierung","Leistungsfähige Rechnersysteme","Verteiltes Training","Entwickler-Workflows","Maschinelles Lernen","Natürliche Sprachverarbeitung","Semantische Suche"],"pt":["RAG","LLM","conhecimento externo","aplicações LLM","sistemas de Q&A","chatbots","busca semântica","respostas baseadas em conhecimento","desenvolvimento de software","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["RAG","LLM","внешние знания","приложения LLM","системы Q&A","чат-боты","семантический поиск","ответы, основанные на знаниях","разработка программного обеспечения","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["RAG","LLM","معرفة خارجية","تطبيقات LLM","أنظمة أسئلة وأجوبة","بوتات الدردشة","بحث семантиكي","استجابات قائمة على المعرفة","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ugro","repoPath":"ollieb89/ugro","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.505Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rag-implementation","description":"Build Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems for LLM applications with vector databases and semantic search. Use when implementing knowledge-grounded AI, building document Q&A systems, or integrating LLMs with external knowledge bases.","bodyPreview":"# RAG Implementation\n\nMaster Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to build LLM applications that provide accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents\n- Creating chatbots with current, factual information\n- Implementing semantic search with natural language queries\n- Reducing hallucinations with grounded responses\n- Enabling LLMs to access domain-specific knowledge\n- Building documentation assistants\n-","body":"# RAG Implementation\n\nMaster Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to build LLM applications that provide accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents\n- Creating chatbots with current, factual information\n- Implementing semantic search with natural language queries\n- Reducing hallucinations with grounded responses\n- Enabling LLMs to access domain-specific knowledge\n- Building documentation assistants\n- Creating research tools with source citation\n\n## Core Components\n\n### 1. Vector Databases\n**Purpose**: Store and retrieve document embeddings efficiently\n\n**Options:**\n- **Pinecone**: Managed, scalable, fast queries\n- **Weaviate**: Open-source, hybrid search\n- **Milvus**: High performance, on-premise\n- **Chroma**: Lightweight, easy to use\n- **Qdrant**: Fast, filtered search\n- **FAISS**: Meta''s library, local deployment\n\n### 2. Embeddings\n**Purpose**: Convert text to numerical vectors for similarity search\n\n**Models:**\n- **text-embedding-ada-002** (OpenAI): General purpose, 1536 dims\n- **all-MiniLM-L6-v2** (Sentence Transformers): Fast, lightweight\n- **e5-large-v2**: High quality, multilingual\n- **Instructor**: Task-specific instructions\n- **bge-large-en-v1.5**: SOTA performance\n\n### 3. Retrieval Strategies\n**Approaches:**\n- **Dense Retrieval**: Semantic similarity via embeddings\n- **Sparse Retrieval**: Keyword matching (BM25, TF-IDF)\n- **Hybrid Search**: Combine dense + sparse\n- **Multi-Query**: Generate multiple query variations\n- **HyDE**: Generate hypothetical documents\n\n### 4. Reranking\n**Purpose**: Improve retrieval quality by reordering results\n\n**Methods:**\n- **Cross-Encoders**: BERT-based reranking\n- **Cohere Rerank**: API-based reranking\n- **Maximal Marginal Relevance (MMR)**: Diversity + relevance\n- **LLM-based**: Use LLM to score relevance\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\nfrom langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\nfrom langchain.llms import OpenAI\n\n# 1. Load documents\nloader = DirectoryLoader(''./docs'', glob=\"**/*.txt\")\ndocuments = loader.load()\n\n# 2. Split into chunks\ntext_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,\n    chunk_overlap=200,\n    length_function=len\n)\nchunks = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)\n\n# 3. Create embeddings and vector store\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = Chroma.from_documents(chunks, embeddings)\n\n# 4. Create retrieval chain\nqa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n    llm=OpenAI(),\n    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(search_kwargs={\"k\": 4}),\n    return_source_documents=True\n)\n\n# 5. Query\nresult = qa_chain({\"query\": \"What are the main features?\"})\nprint(result[''result''])\nprint(result[''source_documents''])\n```\n\n## Advanced RAG Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Hybrid Search\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import BM25Retriever, EnsembleRetriever\n\n# Sparse retriever (BM25)\nbm25_retriever = BM25Retriever.from_documents(chunks)\nbm25_retriever.k = 5\n\n# Dense retriever (embeddings)\nembedding_retriever = vectorstore.as_retriever(search_kwargs={\"k\": 5})\n\n# Combine with weights\nensemble_retriever = EnsembleRetriever(\n    retrievers=[bm25_retriever, embedding_retriever],\n    weights=[0.3, 0.7]\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Multi-Query Retrieval\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers.multi_query import MultiQueryRetriever\n\n# Generate multiple query perspectives\nretriever = MultiQueryRetriever.from_llm(\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(),\n    llm=OpenAI()\n)\n\n# Single query → multiple variations → combined results\nresults = retriever.get_relevant_documents(\"What is the main topic?\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Contextual Compression\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ContextualCompressionRetriever\nfrom langchain.retrievers.document_compressors import LLMChainExtractor\n\ncompressor = LLMChainExtractor.from_llm(llm)\n\ncompression_retriever = ContextualCompressionRetriever(\n    base_compressor=compressor,\n    base_retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever()\n)\n\n# Returns only relevant parts of documents\ncompressed_docs = compression_retriever.get_relevant_documents(\"query\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Parent Document Retriever\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ParentDocumentRetriever\nfrom langchain.storage import InMemoryStore\n\n# Store for parent documents\nstore = InMemoryStore()\n\n# Small chunks for retrieval, large chunks for context\nchild_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=400)\nparent_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=2000)\n\nretriever = ParentDocumentRetriever(\n    vectorstore=vectorstore,\n    docstore=store,\n    child_splitter=child_splitter,\n    parent_splitter=parent_splitter\n)\n```\n\n## Document Chunking Strategies\n\n### Recursive Character Text Splitter\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,\n    chunk_overlap=200,\n    length_function=len,\n    separators=[\"\\n\\n\", \"\\n\", \" \", \"\"]  # Try these in order\n)\n```\n\n### Token-Based Splitting\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import TokenTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = TokenTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=512,\n    chunk_overlap=50\n)\n```\n\n### Semantic Chunking\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import SemanticChunker\n\nsplitter = SemanticChunker(\n    embeddings=OpenAIEmbeddings(),\n    breakpoint_threshold_type=\"percentile\"\n)\n```\n\n### Markdown Header Splitter\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter\n\nheaders_to_split_on = [\n    (\"#\", \"Header 1\"),\n    (\"##\", \"Header 2\"),\n    (\"###\", \"Header 3\"),\n]\n\nsplitter = MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter(headers_to_split_on=headers_to_split_on)\n```\n\n## Vector Store Configurations\n\n### Pinecone\n```python\nimport pinecone\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Pinecone\n\npinecone.init(api_key=\"your-api-key\", environment=\"us-west1-gcp\")\n\nindex = pinecone.Index(\"your-index-name\")\n\nvectorstore = Pinecone(index, embeddings.embed_query, \"text\")\n```\n\n### Weaviate\n```python\nimport weaviate\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Weaviate\n\nclient = weaviate.Client(\"http://localhost:8080\")\n\nvectorstore = Weaviate(client, \"Document\", \"content\", embeddings)\n```\n\n### Chroma (Local)\n```python\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\n\nvectorstore = Chroma(\n    collection_name=\"my_collection\",\n    embedding_function=embeddings,\n    persist_directory=\"./chroma_db\"\n)\n```\n\n## Retrieval Optimization\n\n### 1. Metadata Filtering\n```python\n# Add metadata during indexing\nchunks_with_metadata = []\nfor i, chunk in enumerate(chunks):\n    chunk.metadata = {\n        \"source\": chunk.metadata.get(\"source\"),\n        \"page\": i,\n        \"category\": determine_category(chunk.page_content)\n    }\n    chunks_with_metadata.append(chunk)\n\n# Filter during retrieval\nresults = vectorstore.similarity_search(\n    \"query\",\n    filter={\"category\": \"technical\"},\n    k=5\n)\n```\n\n### 2. Maximal Marginal Relevance\n```python\n# Balance relevance with diversity\nresults = vectorstore.max_marginal_relevance_search(\n    \"query\",\n    k=5,\n    fetch_k=20,  # Fetch 20, return top 5 diverse\n    lambda_mult=0.5  # 0=max diversity, 1=max relevance\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Reranking with Cross-Encoder\n```python\nfrom sentence_transformers import CrossEncoder\n\nreranker = CrossEncoder(''cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2'')\n\n# Get initial results\ncandidates = vectorstore.similarity_search(\"query\", k=20)\n\n# Rerank\npairs = [[query, doc.page_content] for doc in candidates]\nscores = reranker.predict(pairs)\n\n# Sort by score and take top k\nreranked = sorted(zip(candidates, scores), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)[:5]\n```\n\n## Prompt Engineering for RAG\n\n### Contextual Prompt\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Use the following context to answer the question. If you cannot answer based on the context, say \"I don''t have enough information.\"\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer:\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Citations\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Answer the question based on the context below. Include citations using [1], [2], etc.\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer (with citations):\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Confidence\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Answer the question using the context. Provide a confidence score (0-100%) for your answer.\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer:\nConfidence:\"\"\"\n```\n\n## Evaluation Metrics\n\n```python\ndef evaluate_rag_system(qa_chain, test_cases):\n    metrics = {\n        ''accuracy'': [],\n        ''retrieval_quality'': [],\n        ''groundedness'': []\n    }\n\n    for test in test_cases:\n        result = qa_chain({\"query\": test[''question'']})\n\n        # Check if answer matches expected\n        accuracy = calculate_accuracy(result[''result''], test[''expected''])\n        metrics[''accuracy''].append(accuracy)\n\n        # Check if relevant docs were retrieved\n        retrieval_quality = evaluate_retrieved_docs(\n            result[''source_documents''],\n            test[''relevant_docs'']\n        )\n        metrics[''retrieval_quality''].append(retrieval_quality)\n\n        # Check if answer is grounded in context\n        groundedness = check_groundedness(\n            result[''result''],\n            result[''source_documents'']\n        )\n        metrics[''groundedness''].append(groundedness)\n\n    return {k: sum(v)/len(v) for k, v in metrics.items()}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/vector-databases.md**: Detailed comparison of vector DBs\n- **references/embeddings.md**: Embedding model selection guide\n- **references/retrieval-strategies.md**: Advanced retrieval techniques\n- **references/reranking.md**: Reranking methods and when to use them\n- **references/context-window.md**: Managing context limits\n- **assets/vector-store-config.yaml**: Configuration templates\n- **assets/retriever-pipeline.py**: Complete RAG pipeline\n- **assets/embedding-models.md**: Model comparison and benchmarks\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Chunk Size**: Balance between context and specificity (500-1000 tokens)\n2. **Overlap**: Use 10-20% overlap to preserve context at boundaries\n3. **Metadata**: Include source, page, timestamp for filtering and debugging\n4. **Hybrid Search**: Combine semantic and keyword search for best results\n5. **Reranking**: Improve top results with cross-encoder\n6. **Citations**: Always return source documents for transparency\n7. **Evaluation**: Continuously test retrieval quality and answer accuracy\n8. **Monitoring**: Track retrieval metrics in production\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Poor Retrieval**: Check embedding quality, chunk size, query formulation\n- **Irrelevant Results**: Add metadata filtering, use hybrid search, rerank\n- **Missing Information**: Ensure documents are properly indexed\n- **Slow Queries**: Optimize vector store, use caching, reduce k\n- **Hallucinations**: Improve grounding prompt, add verification step\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:00:32.633Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT needing Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) for advanced inference and distributed training","zh":"适用于像 Cursor 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI Agent，它们需要检索增强生成（RAG）来实现高级推理和分布式训练","ja":"Cursor や AutoGPT などの AI エージェントが高度な推論と分散トレーニングを行うために必要な、検索強化生成（RAG）に適しています","ko":"Cursor 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 고급 추론 및 분산 학습을 위해 검색 강화 생성(RAG)이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor y AutoGPT que necesitan Generación aumentada con recuperación (RAG) para inferencia avanzada y entrenamiento distribuido","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor et AutoGPT ayant besoin de Génération augmentée avec récupération (RAG) pour une inférence avancée et un entraînement distribué","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor und AutoGPT, die Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) für erweiterte Inferenz und verteiltes Training benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor e AutoGPT que necessitam de Geração Aumentada por Recuperação (RAG) para inferência avançada e treinamento distribuído","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor и AutoGPT, требующих Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) для продвинутого вывода и распределенной тренировки","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد محسّن بالاسترجاع (RAG) للاستدلال المتقدم والتدريب الموزع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build LLM applications with accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources, reducing hallucinations and enabling access to domain-specific knowledge through distributed training and semantic search with natural language queries","zh":"赋予代理构建使用外部知识源的、准确、有根据的响应的 LLM 应用程序的能力，减少了幻觉，并通过分布式训练和使用自然语言查询的语义搜索实现了对领域特定知识的访问","ja":"エージェントが外部の知識源を使用して、正確で根拠のある応答を持つ LLM アプリケーションを構築できるようにし、幻覚を減らし、分布付きトレーニングと自然言語クエリを使用したセマンティック検索によってドメイン固有の知識へのアクセスを可能にします","ko":"외부 지식 소스를 사용하여 정확하고 근거 있는 응답을 가진 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 환각을 줄이고 분산 학습 및 자연어 쿼리를 사용하는 의미 검색을 통해 도메인 특정 지식에 액세스 할 수 있습니다","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones LLM con respuestas precisas y basadas en hechos utilizando fuentes de conocimiento externas, reduciendo alucinaciones y permitiendo el acceso a conocimientos específicos del dominio a través del entrenamiento distribuido y la búsqueda semántica con consultas de lenguaje natural","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications LLM avec des réponses précises et ancrées dans les faits en utilisant des sources de connaissances externes, en réduisant les hallucinations et en permettant l''accès à des connaissances spécifiques au domaine grâce à un entraînement distribué et à une recherche sémantique avec des requêtes en langage naturel","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, LLM-Anwendungen mit genauen, faktengestützten Antworten zu erstellen, indem sie externe Wissensquellen nutzen, Halluzinationen reduzieren und den Zugriff auf domänen-spezifisches Wissen durch verteiltes Training und semantische Suche mit natürlichsprachigen Abfragen ermöglichen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações LLM com respostas precisas e baseadas em fatos, utilizando fontes de conhecimento externas, reduzindo alucinações e permitindo o acesso a conhecimentos específicos de domínio por meio de treinamento distribuído e busca semântica com consultas de linguagem natural","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать приложения LLM с точными и обоснованными ответами, используя внешние источники знаний, снижая галлюцинации и обеспечивая доступ к домен-специфичным знаниям посредством распределенной тренировки и семантического поиска с естественно-языковыми запросами","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات LLM بالاستجابات الدقيقة والمبنية على الحقائق، باستخدام مصادر معرفة خارجية، وتقليل الوهم، وتمكين الوصول إلى المعرفة المحددة بالمجال من خلال التدريب الموزع والبحث الدلالي بالاستفسارات اللغوية الطبيعية"},"useCases":{"en":["Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents","Implementing semantic search with natural language queries","Creating chatbots with current, factual information"],"zh":["在专有文档上构建 Q&A 系统","使用自然语言查询实现语义搜索","创建具有当前、事实信息的聊天机器人"],"ja":["独自のドキュメント上に Q&A システムを構築する","自然言語クエリを使用したセマンティック検索の実装","現在の、事実の情報を持つチャットボットを作成する"],"ko":["소유 문서에 질문과 답변 시스템을 구축하기","자연어 쿼리를 사용한 의미 검색 구현","현재 및 사실 정보를 갖는 채팅봇 생성"],"es":["Construir sistemas de preguntas y respuestas sobre documentos propiedad de la empresa","Implementar búsqueda semántica con consultas de lenguaje natural","Crear chatbots con información actual y factual"],"fr":["Construire des systèmes de questions et réponses sur des documents propriétaires","Mettre en œuvre une recherche sémantique avec des requêtes en langage naturel","Créer des chatbots avec des informations actuelles et factuelles"],"de":["Erstellen von Frage-und-Antwort-Systemen über proprietäre Dokumente","Implementierung von semantischer Suche mit natürlichsprachigen Abfragen","Erstellen von Chatbots mit aktuellen, faktischen Informationen"],"pt":["Construir sistemas de Perguntas e Respostas sobre documentos proprietários","Implementar busca semântica com consultas de linguagem natural","Criar chatbots com informações atuais e factuais"],"ru":["Построение систем вопросов и ответов над собственными документами","Реализация семантического поиска с естественно-языковыми запросами","Создание чат-ботов с актуальной и фактологической информацией"],"ar":["بناء أنظمة الأسئلة والإجابات على وثائق ملكية","تنفيذ بحث دلالي بالاستفسارات اللغوية الطبيعية","إنشاء محادثات بوتات مع معلومات حالية وواقعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires independently managed GPU machines","Needs dynamic orchestration for distributed training and advanced inference"],"zh":["需要独立管理的 GPU 机器","需要动态编排用于分布式训练和高级推理"],"ja":["独立に管理された GPU マシンが必要","分布付きトレーニングと高度な推論のために、動的オーケストレーションが必要"],"ko":["독립적으로 관리되는 GPU 기계가 필요함","분산 학습 및 고급 추론을 위해 동적 오케스트레이션이 필요"],"es":["Requiere máquinas GPU gestionadas de forma independiente","Necesita orquestación dinámica para entrenamiento distribuido y inferencia avanzada"],"fr":["Nécessite des machines GPU gérées de manière indépendante","A besoin d''une orchestration dynamique pour un entraînement distribué et une inférence avancée"],"de":["Benötigt unabhängig gemanagte GPU-Maschinen","Benötigt dynamische Orchestrierung für verteiltes Training und erweiterte Inferenz"],"pt":["Requer máquinas GPU gerenciadas de forma independente","Necessit