"添加OAuth2/社交登录","实现基于角色的访问控制","设计会话管理","迁移身份验证系统"],"ja":["ユーザー認証システムの実装","RESTまたはGraphQL APIの保護","OAuth2/ソーシャルログインの追加","ロールベースのアクセス制御の実装","セッション管理の設計","認証システムの移行"],"ko":["사용자 인증 시스템 구현","REST 또는 GraphQL API 보호","OAuth2/소셜 로그인 추가","역할 기반 접근 제어 구현","세션 관리 설계","인증 시스템 마이그레이션"],"es":["Implementación de sistemas de autenticación de usuarios","Seguridad de APIs REST o GraphQL","Implementación de OAuth2 y login social","Control de acceso basado en roles","Gestión de sesiones","Depuración de problemas de autenticación"],"fr":["Implémentation de systèmes d''authentification d''utilisateurs","Sécurité des API REST ou GraphQL","Implémentation d''OAuth2 et de login social","Contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles","Gestion des sessions","Débogage des problèmes d''authentification"],"de":["Implementierung von Benutzerauthentifizierungssystemen","Sicherheit von REST- oder GraphQL-APIs","Implementierung von OAuth2 und sozialem Login","Rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle","Sitzungsmanagement","Fehlerbehebung bei Authentifizierungsproblemen"],"pt":["Autenticação de usuário","Autorização de acesso","Integração com OAuth2 e login social","Controle de acesso baseado em funções","Gerenciamento de sessão","Depuração de problemas de autenticação"],"ru":["Аутентификация пользователя","Авторизация доступа","Интеграция с OAuth2 и социальным входом","Контроль доступа на основе ролей","Управление сессией","Отладка проблем аутентификации"],"ar":["مصادقة المستخدم","تفويض الوصول","التكامل مع OAuth2 و تسجيل الدخول الاجتماعي","التحكم في الوصول المستند إلى الأدوار","إدارة الجلسة","تصحيح أخطاء المصادقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["身份验证","授权","实现模式","安全","可扩展","行业标准","现代最佳实践","分布式训练","先进推理","开发人员工作流程"],"ja":["認証","認可","実装パターン","セキュア","スケーラブル","業界標準","モダンなベストプラクティス","分散トレーニング","先進的な推論","開発者ワークフロー"],"ko":["인증","인가","구현 패턴","보안","확장 가능","업계 표준","최신 베스트 프랙티스","분산 트레이닝","고급 추론","개발자 워크플로우"],"es":["autenticación y autorización","patrones de implementación","seguridad de APIs","OAuth2","control de acceso basado en roles","gestión de sesiones","depuración de autenticación","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["authentification et autorisation","modèles d''implémentation","sécurité des API","OAuth2","contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles","gestion des sessions","débogage d''authentification","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Implementierungsmuster","API-Sicherheit","OAuth2","rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle","Sitzungsmanagement","Fehlerbehebung bei Authentifizierung","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["autenticação de desenvolvedores","autorização de acesso","padrões de implementação de autenticação","segurança de sistemas","escalabilidade de sistemas","desenvolvimento de software","autenticação de usuário","controle de acesso"],"ru":["аутентификация разработчиков","авторизация доступа","шаблоны реализации аутентификации","безопасность систем","масштабируемость систем","разработка программного обеспечения","аутентификация пользователя","контроль доступа"],"ar":["مصادقة المطورين","تفويض الوصول","أنماط تنفيذ المصادقة","أمان الأنظمة","نقاط قوة الأنظمة","تطوير البرمجيات","مصادقة المستخدم","التحكم في الوصول"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ugro","repoPath":"ollieb89/ugro","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"auth-implementation-patterns","description":"Master authentication and authorization patterns including JWT, OAuth2, session management, and RBAC to build secure, scalable access control systems. Use when implementing auth systems, securing APIs, or debugging security issues.","bodyPreview":"# Authentication & Authorization Implementation Patterns\n\nBuild secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing user authentication systems\n- Securing REST or GraphQL APIs\n- Adding OAuth2/social login\n- Implementing role-based access control (RBAC)\n- Designing session management\n- Migrating authentication systems\n- Debugging auth issues\n- Implementing SSO or multi-tenancy\n\n## Core Con","body":"# Authentication & Authorization Implementation Patterns\n\nBuild secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing user authentication systems\n- Securing REST or GraphQL APIs\n- Adding OAuth2/social login\n- Implementing role-based access control (RBAC)\n- Designing session management\n- Migrating authentication systems\n- Debugging auth issues\n- Implementing SSO or multi-tenancy\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Authentication vs Authorization\n\n**Authentication (AuthN)**: Who are you?\n- Verifying identity (username/password, OAuth, biometrics)\n- Issuing credentials (sessions, tokens)\n- Managing login/logout\n\n**Authorization (AuthZ)**: What can you do?\n- Permission checking\n- Role-based access control (RBAC)\n- Resource ownership validation\n- Policy enforcement\n\n### 2. Authentication Strategies\n\n**Session-Based:**\n- Server stores session state\n- Session ID in cookie\n- Traditional, simple, stateful\n\n**Token-Based (JWT):**\n- Stateless, self-contained\n- Scales horizontally\n- Can store claims\n\n**OAuth2/OpenID Connect:**\n- Delegate authentication\n- Social login (Google, GitHub)\n- Enterprise SSO\n\n## JWT Authentication\n\n### Pattern 1: JWT Implementation\n\n```typescript\n// JWT structure: header.payload.signature\nimport jwt from ''jsonwebtoken'';\nimport { Request, Response, NextFunction } from ''express'';\n\ninterface JWTPayload {\n    userId: string;\n    email: string;\n    role: string;\n    iat: number;\n    exp: number;\n}\n\n// Generate JWT\nfunction generateTokens(userId: string, email: string, role: string) {\n    const accessToken = jwt.sign(\n        { userId, email, role },\n        process.env.JWT_SECRET!,\n        { expiresIn: ''15m'' }  // Short-lived\n    );\n\n    const refreshToken = jwt.sign(\n        { userId },\n        process.env.JWT_REFRESH_SECRET!,\n        { expiresIn: ''7d'' }  // Long-lived\n    );\n\n    return { accessToken, refreshToken };\n}\n\n// Verify JWT\nfunction verifyToken(token: string): JWTPayload {\n    try {\n        return jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET!) as JWTPayload;\n    } catch (error) {\n        if (error instanceof jwt.TokenExpiredError) {\n            throw new Error(''Token expired'');\n        }\n        if (error instanceof jwt.JsonWebTokenError) {\n            throw new Error(''Invalid token'');\n        }\n        throw error;\n    }\n}\n\n// Middleware\nfunction authenticate(req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) {\n    const authHeader = req.headers.authorization;\n    if (!authHeader?.startsWith(''Bearer '')) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''No token provided'' });\n    }\n\n    const token = authHeader.substring(7);\n    try {\n        const payload = verifyToken(token);\n        req.user = payload;  // Attach user to request\n        next();\n    } catch (error) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Invalid token'' });\n    }\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.get(''/api/profile'', authenticate, (req, res) => {\n    res.json({ user: req.user });\n});\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Refresh Token Flow\n\n```typescript\ninterface StoredRefreshToken {\n    token: string;\n    userId: string;\n    expiresAt: Date;\n    createdAt: Date;\n}\n\nclass RefreshTokenService {\n    // Store refresh token in database\n    async storeRefreshToken(userId: string, refreshToken: string) {\n        const expiresAt = new Date(Date.now() + 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n        await db.refreshTokens.create({\n            token: await hash(refreshToken),  // Hash before storing\n            userId,\n            expiresAt,\n        });\n    }\n\n    // Refresh access token\n    async refreshAccessToken(refreshToken: string) {\n        // Verify refresh token\n        let payload;\n        try {\n            payload = jwt.verify(\n                refreshToken,\n                process.env.JWT_REFRESH_SECRET!\n            ) as { userId: string };\n        } catch {\n            throw new Error(''Invalid refresh token'');\n        }\n\n        // Check if token exists in database\n        const storedToken = await db.refreshTokens.findOne({\n            where: {\n                token: await hash(refreshToken),\n                userId: payload.userId,\n                expiresAt: { $gt: new Date() },\n            },\n        });\n\n        if (!storedToken) {\n            throw new Error(''Refresh token not found or expired'');\n        }\n\n        // Get user\n        const user = await db.users.findById(payload.userId);\n        if (!user) {\n            throw new Error(''User not found'');\n        }\n\n        // Generate new access token\n        const accessToken = jwt.sign(\n            { userId: user.id, email: user.email, role: user.role },\n            process.env.JWT_SECRET!,\n            { expiresIn: ''15m'' }\n        );\n\n        return { accessToken };\n    }\n\n    // Revoke refresh token (logout)\n    async revokeRefreshToken(refreshToken: string) {\n        await db.refreshTokens.deleteOne({\n            token: await hash(refreshToken),\n        });\n    }\n\n    // Revoke all user tokens (logout all devices)\n    async revokeAllUserTokens(userId: string) {\n        await db.refreshTokens.deleteMany({ userId });\n    }\n}\n\n// API endpoints\napp.post(''/api/auth/refresh'', async (req, res) => {\n    const { refreshToken } = req.body;\n    try {\n        const { accessToken } = await refreshTokenService\n            .refreshAccessToken(refreshToken);\n        res.json({ accessToken });\n    } catch (error) {\n        res.status(401).json({ error: ''Invalid refresh token'' });\n    }\n});\n\napp.post(''/api/auth/logout'', authenticate, async (req, res) => {\n    const { refreshToken } = req.body;\n    await refreshTokenService.revokeRefreshToken(refreshToken);\n    res.json({ message: ''Logged out successfully'' });\n});\n```\n\n## Session-Based Authentication\n\n### Pattern 1: Express Session\n\n```typescript\nimport session from ''express-session'';\nimport RedisStore from ''connect-redis'';\nimport { createClient } from ''redis'';\n\n// Setup Redis for session storage\nconst redisClient = createClient({\n    url: process.env.REDIS_URL,\n});\nawait redisClient.connect();\n\napp.use(\n    session({\n        store: new RedisStore({ client: redisClient }),\n        secret: process.env.SESSION_SECRET!,\n        resave: false,\n        saveUninitialized: false,\n        cookie: {\n            secure: process.env.NODE_ENV === ''production'',  // HTTPS only\n            httpOnly: true,  // No JavaScript access\n            maxAge: 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000,  // 24 hours\n            sameSite: ''strict'',  // CSRF protection\n        },\n    })\n);\n\n// Login\napp.post(''/api/auth/login'', async (req, res) => {\n    const { email, password } = req.body;\n\n    const user = await db.users.findOne({ email });\n    if (!user || !(await verifyPassword(password, user.passwordHash))) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Invalid credentials'' });\n    }\n\n    // Store user in session\n    req.session.userId = user.id;\n    req.session.role = user.role;\n\n    res.json({ user: { id: user.id, email: user.email, role: user.role } });\n});\n\n// Session middleware\nfunction requireAuth(req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) {\n    if (!req.session.userId) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n    }\n    next();\n}\n\n// Protected route\napp.get(''/api/profile'', requireAuth, async (req, res) => {\n    const user = await db.users.findById(req.session.userId);\n    res.json({ user });\n});\n\n// Logout\napp.post(''/api/auth/logout'', (req, res) => {\n    req.session.destroy((err) => {\n        if (err) {\n            return res.status(500).json({ error: ''Logout failed'' });\n        }\n        res.clearCookie(''connect.sid'');\n        res.json({ message: ''Logged out successfully'' });\n    });\n});\n```\n\n## OAuth2 / Social Login\n\n### Pattern 1: OAuth2 with Passport.js\n\n```typescript\nimport passport from ''passport'';\nimport { Strategy as GoogleStrategy } from ''passport-google-oauth20'';\nimport { Strategy as GitHubStrategy } from ''passport-github2'';\n\n// Google OAuth\npassport.use(\n    new GoogleStrategy(\n        {\n            clientID: process.env.GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID!,\n            clientSecret: process.env.GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n            callbackURL: ''/api/auth/google/callback'',\n        },\n        async (accessToken, refreshToken, profile, done) => {\n            try {\n                // Find or create user\n                let user = await db.users.findOne({\n                    googleId: profile.id,\n                });\n\n                if (!user) {\n                    user = await db.users.create({\n                        googleId: profile.id,\n                        email: profile.emails?.[0]?.value,\n                        name: profile.displayName,\n                        avatar: profile.photos?.[0]?.value,\n                    });\n                }\n\n                return done(null, user);\n            } catch (error) {\n                return done(error, undefined);\n            }\n        }\n    )\n);\n\n// Routes\napp.get(''/api/auth/google'', passport.authenticate(''google'', {\n    scope: [''profile'', ''email''],\n}));\n\napp.get(\n    ''/api/auth/google/callback'',\n    passport.authenticate(''google'', { session: false }),\n    (req, res) => {\n        // Generate JWT\n        const tokens = generateTokens(req.user.id, req.user.email, req.user.role);\n        // Redirect to frontend with token\n        res.redirect(`${process.env.FRONTEND_URL}/auth/callback?token=${tokens.accessToken}`);\n    }\n);\n```\n\n## Authorization Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```typescript\nenum Role {\n    USER = ''user'',\n    MODERATOR = ''moderator'',\n    ADMIN = ''admin'',\n}\n\nconst roleHierarchy: Record<Role, Role[]> = {\n    [Role.ADMIN]: [Role.ADMIN, Role.MODERATOR, Role.USER],\n    [Role.MODERATOR]: [Role.MODERATOR, Role.USER],\n    [Role.USER]: [Role.USER],\n};\n\nfunction hasRole(userRole: Role, requiredRole: Role): boolean {\n    return roleHierarchy[userRole].includes(requiredRole);\n}\n\n// Middleware\nfunction requireRole(...roles: Role[]) {\n    return (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n        if (!req.user) {\n            return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n        }\n\n        if (!roles.some(role => hasRole(req.user.role, role))) {\n            return res.status(403).json({ error: ''Insufficient permissions'' });\n        }\n\n        next();\n    };\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.delete(''/api/users/:id'',\n    authenticate,\n    requireRole(Role.ADMIN),\n    async (req, res) => {\n        // Only admins can delete users\n        await db.users.delete(req.params.id);\n        res.json({ message: ''User deleted'' });\n    }\n);\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Permission-Based Access Control\n\n```typescript\nenum Permission {\n    READ_USERS = ''read:users'',\n    WRITE_USERS = ''write:users'',\n    DELETE_USERS = ''delete:users'',\n    READ_POSTS = ''read:posts'',\n    WRITE_POSTS = ''write:posts'',\n}\n\nconst rolePermissions: Record<Role, Permission[]> = {\n    [Role.USER]: [Permission.READ_POSTS, Permission.WRITE_POSTS],\n    [Role.MODERATOR]: [\n        Permission.READ_POSTS,\n        Permission.WRITE_POSTS,\n        Permission.READ_USERS,\n    ],\n    [Role.ADMIN]: Object.values(Permission),\n};\n\nfunction hasPermission(userRole: Role, permission: Permission): boolean {\n    return rolePermissions[userRole]?.includes(permission) ?? false;\n}\n\nfunction requirePermission(...permissions: Permission[]) {\n    return (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n        if (!req.user) {\n            return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n        }\n\n        const hasAllPermissions = permissions.every(permission =>\n            hasPermission(req.user.role, permission)\n        );\n\n        if (!hasAllPermissions) {\n            return res.status(403).json({ error: ''Insufficient permissions'' });\n        }\n\n        next();\n    };\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.get(''/api/users'',\n    authenticate,\n    requirePermission(Permission.READ_USERS),\n    async (req, res) => {\n        const users = await db.users.findAll();\n        res.json({ users });\n    }\n);\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Resource Ownership\n\n```typescript\n// Check if user owns resource\nasync function requireOwnership(\n    resourceType: ''post'' | ''comment'',\n    resourceIdParam: string = ''id''\n) {\n    return async (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n        if (!req.user) {\n            return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n        }\n\n        const resourceId = req.params[resourceIdParam];\n\n        // Admins can access anything\n        if (req.user.role === Role.ADMIN) {\n            return next();\n        }\n\n        // Check ownership\n        let resource;\n        if (resourceType === ''post'') {\n            resource = await db.posts.findById(resourceId);\n        } else if (resourceType === ''comment'') {\n            resource = await db.comments.findById(resourceId);\n        }\n\n        if (!resource) {\n            return res.status(404).json({ error: ''Resource not found'' });\n        }\n\n        if (resource.userId !== req.user.userId) {\n            return res.status(403).json({ error: ''Not authorized'' });\n        }\n\n        next();\n    };\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.put(''/api/posts/:id'',\n    authenticate,\n    requireOwnership(''post''),\n    async (req, res) => {\n        // User can only update their own posts\n        const post = await db.posts.update(req.params.id, req.body);\n        res.json({ post });\n    }\n);\n```\n\n## Security Best Practices\n\n### Pattern 1: Password Security\n\n```typescript\nimport bcrypt from ''bcrypt'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\n// Password validation schema\nconst passwordSchema = z.string()\n    .min(12, ''Password must be at least 12 characters'')\n    .regex(/[A-Z]/, ''Password must contain uppercase letter'')\n    .regex(/[a-z]/, ''Password must contain lowercase letter'')\n    .regex(/[0-9]/, ''Password must contain number'')\n    .regex(/[^A-Za-z0-9]/, ''Password must contain special character'');\n\n// Hash password\nasync function hashPassword(password: string): Promise<string> {\n    const saltRounds = 12;  // 2^12 iterations\n    return bcrypt.hash(password, saltRounds);\n}\n\n// Verify password\nasync function verifyPassword(\n    password: string,\n    hash: string\n): Promise<boolean> {\n    return bcrypt.compare(password, hash);\n}\n\n// Registration with password validation\napp.post(''/api/auth/register'', async (req, res) => {\n    try {\n        const { email, password } = req.body;\n\n        // Validate password\n        passwordSchema.parse(password);\n\n        // Check if user exists\n        const existingUser = await db.users.findOne({ email });\n        if (existingUser) {\n            return res.status(400).json({ error: ''Email already registered'' });\n        }\n\n        // Hash password\n        const passwordHash = await hashPassword(password);\n\n        // Create user\n        const user = await db.users.create({\n            email,\n            passwordHash,\n        });\n\n        // Generate tokens\n        const tokens = generateTokens(user.id, user.email, user.role);\n\n        res.status(201).json({\n            user: { id: user.id, email: user.email },\n            ...tokens,\n        });\n    } catch (error) {\n        if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n            return res.status(400).json({ error: error.errors[0].message });\n        }\n        res.status(500).json({ error: ''Registration failed'' });\n    }\n});\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Rate Limiting\n\n```typescript\nimport rateLimit from ''express-rate-limit'';\nimport RedisStore from ''rate-limit-redis'';\n\n// Login rate limiter\nconst loginLimiter = rateLimit({\n    store: new RedisStore({ client: redisClient }),\n    windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,  // 15 minutes\n    max: 5,  // 5 attempts\n    message: ''Too many login attempts, please try again later'',\n    standardHeaders: true,\n    legacyHeaders: false,\n});\n\n// API rate limiter\nconst apiLimiter = rateLimit({\n    windowMs: 60 * 1000,  // 1 minute\n    max: 100,  // 100 requests per minute\n    standardHeaders: true,\n});\n\n// Apply to routes\napp.post(''/api/auth/login'', loginLimiter, async (req, res) => {\n    // Login logic\n});\n\napp.use(''/api/'', apiLimiter);\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Never Store Plain Passwords**: Always hash with bcrypt/argon2\n2. **Use HTTPS**: Encrypt data in transit\n3. **Short-Lived Access Tokens**: 15-30 minutes max\n4. **Secure Cookies**: httpOnly, secure, sameSite flags\n5. **Validate All Input**: Email format, password strength\n6. **Rate Limit Auth Endpoints**: Prevent brute force attacks\n7. **Implement CSRF Protection**: For session-based auth\n8. **Rotate Secrets Regularly**: JWT secrets, session secrets\n9. **Log Security Events**: Login attempts, failed auth\n10. **Use MFA When Possible**: Extra security layer\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Weak Passwords**: Enforce strong password policies\n- **JWT in localStorage**: Vulnerable to XSS, use httpOnly cookies\n- **No Token Expiration**: Tokens should expire\n- **Client-Side Auth Checks Only**: Always validate server-side\n- **Insecure Password Reset**: Use secure tokens with expiration\n- **No Rate Limiting**: Vulnerable to brute force\n- **Trusting Client Data**: Always validate on server\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/jwt-best-practices.md**: JWT implementation guide\n- **references/oauth2-flows.md**: OAuth2 flow diagrams and examples\n- **references/session-security.md**: Secure session management\n- **assets/auth-security-checklist.md**: Security review checklist\n- **assets/password-policy-template.md**: Password requirements template\n- **scripts/token-validator.ts**: JWT validation utility\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:02:04.636Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security-focused AI Agents needing advanced authentication and authorization capabilities for distributed systems","zh":"非常适合需要高级认证和授权能力的安全性人工智能代理，特别是在分布式系统中","ja":"セキュリティに焦点を当てたAIエージェントに適しており、分散システムでの高度な認証および認可機能が必要","ko":"보안에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 분산 시스템에서 고급 인증 및 인가 기능이 필요","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA con enfoque en Seguridad que necesitan capacidades de autenticación y autorización avanzadas para sistemas distribuidos","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA axés sur la Sécurité nécessitant des capacités d''authentification et d''autorisation avancées pour les systèmes distribués","de":"Perfekt für Sicherheitsorientierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsfunktionen für verteilte Systeme benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA com foco em Segurança que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de autenticação e autorização para sistemas distribuídos","ru":"Идеально для AI-агентов, ориентированных на безопасность, которым требуются расширенные возможности аутентификации и авторизации для распределенных систем","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على الأمن والذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحقق الهوية والسماح للنظم الموزعة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement secure, scalable authentication systems using industry-standard OAuth2 protocols, role-based access control, and session management, ensuring robust security for REST or GraphQL APIs","zh":"赋予代理实现使用行业标准OAuth2协议、基于角色的访问控制和会话管理的安全、可扩展的认证系统的能力，确保REST或GraphQL API的强大安全性","ja":"エージェントが業界標準のOAuth2プロトコル、ロールベースのアクセス制御、およびセッション管理を使用して、セキュアでスケーラブルな認証システムを実装できるようにし、RESTまたはGraphQL APIの強力なセキュリティを確保","ko":"에이전트가 산업 표준 OAuth2 프로토콜, 역할 기반 접근 제어 및 세션 관리를 사용하여 보안 및 확장 가능한 인증 시스템을 구현할 수 있도록 하여 REST 또는 GraphQL API에 대한 강력한 보안을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar sistemas de autenticación seguros y escalables utilizando protocolos OAuth2 estándar de la industria, control de acceso basado en roles y gestión de sesiones, garantizando una seguridad robusta para API de REST o GraphQL","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des systèmes d''authentification sécurisés et évolutifs en utilisant des protocoles OAuth2 standard de l''industrie, un contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles et une gestion de sessions, garantissant une sécurité robuste pour les API REST ou GraphQL","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, sichere und skalierbare Authentifizierungssysteme mithilfe von Branchenstandard-OAuth2-Protokollen, rollenbasiertem Zugriff und Sitzungsverwaltung zu implementieren, um eine robuste Sicherheit für REST- oder GraphQL-APIs zu gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar sistemas de autenticação seguros e escaláveis usando protocolos OAuth2 padrão da indústria, controle de acesso baseado em função e gerenciamento de sessão, garantindo segurança robusta para APIs REST ou GraphQL","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность реализовать безопасные и масштабируемые системы аутентификации, используя отраслевые протоколы OAuth2, роль-контроль доступа и управление сессиями, обеспечивая надежную безопасность для REST- или GraphQL-API","ar":"يمكن للعميل تنفيذ أنظمة مصادقة آمنة وقابلة للتوسع باستخدام بروتوكولات OAuth2 القياسية في الصناعة ومراقبة الوصول القائمة على الدور وإدارة الجلسات، مما يضمن الحماية القوية ل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST أو GraphQL"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing user authentication systems with social login","Securing APIs with OAuth2 and RBAC","Debugging authentication issues in distributed training environments"],"zh":["实现具有社交登录的用户认证系统","使用OAuth2和RBAC来保护API","在分布式训练环境中调试认证问题"],"ja":["ソーシャルログインを備えたユーザー認証システムの実装","OAuth2とRBACを使用したAPIの保護","分散トレーニング環境での認証問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["소셜 로그인을 갖춘 사용자 인증 시스템 구현","OAuth2 및 RBAC를 사용한 API 보호","분산된 학습 환경에서 인증 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Implementar sistemas de autenticación de usuarios con inicio de sesión social","Seguir APIs con OAuth2 y RBAC","Depurar problemas de autenticación en entornos de entrenamiento distribuidos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des systèmes d''authentification des utilisateurs avec connexion sociale","Sécuriser les API avec OAuth2 et RBAC","Déboguer les problèmes d''authentification dans les environnements de formation distribués"],"de":["Implementierung von Benutzerauthentifizierungssystemen mit sozialem Login","Sichern von APIs mit OAuth2 und RBAC","Fehlerbehebung bei Authentifizierungsproblemen in verteilten Trainingsumgebungen"],"pt":["Implementação de sistemas de autenticação de usuário com login social","Proteção de APIs com OAuth2 e RBAC","Depuração de problemas de autenticação em ambientes de treinamento distribuídos"],"ru":["Реализация систем аутентификации пользователей с социальным входом","Защита API с помощью OAuth2 и RBAC","Отладка проблем аутентификации в распределенных средах обучения"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنظمة مصادقة المستخدم مع تسجيل الدخول الاجتماعي","أمان واجهات برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام OAuth2 و RBAC","تصحيح الأخطاء في مشاكل المصادقة في بيئات التدريب الموزعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of authentication protocols like OAuth2","Limited to implementing authorization patterns, not general security auditing"],"zh":["需要了解OAuth2等认证协议","仅限于实现授权模式，不包括一般的安全审计"],"ja":["OAuth2などの認証プロトコルに関する知識が必要","認可パターンの実装に限定され、一般的なセキュリティ監査は含まない"],"ko":["OAuth2와 같은 인증 프로토콜에 대한 지식이 필요","인가 패턴 구현에만 국한되며 일반적인 보안 감사를 포함하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de protocolos de autenticación como OAuth2","Limitado a la implementación de patrones de autorización, no auditoría de seguridad general"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des protocoles d''authentification tels que OAuth2","Limité à la mise en œuvre de modèles d''autorisation, et non à l''audit de sécurité général"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Authentifizierungsprotokollen wie OAuth2","Begrenzt auf die Implementierung von Autorisierungsmustern, nicht allgemeine Sicherheitsprüfung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de protocolos de autenticação como OAuth2","Limitado à implementação de padrões de autorização, não auditoria de segurança geral"],"ru":["Требует знания протоколов аутентификации, таких как OAuth2","Ограничен реализацией шаблонов авторизации, а не общей аудитории безопасности"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى معرفة بروتوكولات المصادقة مثل OAuth2","محدود بتمكين أنماط التصريح، وليس تدقيق الأمن العام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Acadbek/personal-site/vercel-react-best-practices', 'community', 'Acadbek', 'personal-site', 'Acadbek/personal-site', 'vercel-react-best-practices', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z', '2026-02-18T12:02:07.572Z', NULL, '{"id":"Acadbek/personal-site/vercel-react-best-practices","name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":{"zh":"Vercel React最佳实践是React和Next.js应用程序的综合性能优化指南","ja":"Vercel Reactベストプラクティスは、ReactとNext.jsアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化するためのガイドです","ko":"버셀 리액트 최적화 가이드는 리액트와 넥스트.js 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React y Next.js, con 57 reglas en 8 categorías","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React et Next.js, avec 57 règles dans 8 catégories","de":"Leitfaden für die Leistungsoptimierung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen, mit 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien","pt":"O guia de melhores práticas da Vercel para React e Next.js ajuda a otimizar o desempenho das aplicações","ru":"Руководство по лучшим практикам Vercel для React и Next.js помогает оптимизировать производительность приложений","ar":"دليل أفضل الممارسات لتفعل Vercel ل React و Next.js يساعد على تحسين أداء التطبيقات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Vercel React最佳实践","ja":"Vercel Reactベストプラクティス","ko":"버셀 리액트 최적화 가이드","es":"Mejores prácticas de Vercel para React","fr":"Meilleures pratiques Vercel pour React","de":"Vercel React Best Practices","pt":"Melhores Práticas Vercel React para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Лучшие практики Vercel React для разработчиков","ar":"أفضل الممارسات لتفعل Vercel React للمطورين","en":"vercel-react-best-practices"},"description":{"zh":"Vercel React最佳实践是React和Next.js应用程序的综合性能优化指南","ja":"Vercel Reactベストプラクティスは、ReactとNext.jsアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化するためのガイドです","ko":"버셀 리액트 최적화 가이드는 리액트와 넥스트.js 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React y Next.js, con 57 reglas en 8 categorías","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React et Next.js, avec 57 règles dans 8 catégories","de":"Leitfaden für die Leistungsoptimierung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen, mit 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien","pt":"O guia de melhores práticas da Vercel para React e Next.js ajuda a otimizar o desempenho das aplicações","ru":"Руководство по лучшим практикам Vercel для React и Next.js помогает оптимизировать производительность приложений","ar":"دليل أفضل الممارسات لتفعل Vercel ل React و Next.js يساعد على تحسين أداء التطبيقات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["57条规则","8个类别","自动重构","代码生成","性能优化"],"ja":["57のルール","8つのカテゴリ","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["57개의 규칙","8개의 카테고리","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","성능 최적화"],"es":["57 reglas para optimizar el rendimiento","8 categorías para una mejor organización","Priorización de reglas por impacto","Guía para la refactorización automática","Generación de código para una mayor eficiencia"],"fr":["57 règles pour optimiser les performances","8 catégories pour une meilleure organisation","Priorisation des règles par impact","Guide pour la refactorisation automatique","Génération de code pour une plus grande efficacité"],"de":["57 Regeln für die Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien für eine bessere Organisation","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Auswirkung","Leitfaden für die automatische Refaktorierung","Codegenerierung für eine höhere Effizienz"],"pt":["57 regras para otimizar o desempenho","8 categorias para priorizar a otimização","Guias para refatoração automática e geração de código","Otimização de desempenho para React e Next.js","Melhores práticas para escrita de componentes e páginas"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации оптимизации","Руководства для автоматического рефакторинга и генерации кода","Оптимизация производительности для React и Next.js","Лучшие практики для написания компонентов и страниц"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحديد أولويات التحسين","دلائل لإعادة هيكلة الترميز التلقائيและการ توليد الرمز","تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js","أفضل الممارسات لكتابة المكونات والصفحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React最佳实践","Next.js性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","性能优化"],"ja":["Vercel React","Reactベストプラクティス","Next.jsパフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["버셀 리액트","리액트 최적화 가이드","넥스트.js 성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","성능 최적화"],"es":["vercel react","mejores prácticas react","optimización de rendimiento react","next.js optimization","react performance optimization","vercel best practices"],"fr":["vercel react","meilleures pratiques react","optimisation des performances react","next.js optimization","react performance optimization","vercel best practices"],"de":["vercel react","best practices react","leistungsoptimierung react","next.js optimierung","react leistungsoptimierung","vercel best practices"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas React","Otimização de desempenho React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento de aplicações web","React performance optimization"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики React","Оптимизация производительности React","Next.js","Разработка веб-приложений","React производительность оптимизация"],"ar":["Vercel React","أفضل الممارسات لتفعل React","تحسين أداء React","Next.js","تطوير التطبيقات الويب","تحسين أداء React"]}},"owner":"Acadbek","repo":"personal-site","repoPath":"Acadbek/personal-site","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:02:07.572Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js performance tuning capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 性能调优功能的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js のパフォーマンス最適化機能を最適化する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan capacidades de ajuste de rendimiento optimizado para React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités de réglage de performances optimisées pour React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die optimierte Leistungsanpassungsfähigkeiten für React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de ajuste e otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы оптимизированные возможности настройки производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي ل와كلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تحسين أداء React و Next.js المُحسّنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, utilizing 57 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling optimization with prioritized impact analysis.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别进行全面性能优化，包括数据获取和包优化，具有优先的影响分析。","ja":"エージェントに React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって使用して包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を実行し、データ取得とバンドル最適化を含む優先度のある影響分析を実行します。","ko":"에이전트에게 React 컴포넌트 및 Next.js 페이지에 대한 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성 기능을 제공하여 57개의 규칙을 8개의 카테고리에서 사용하여 포괄적인 성능 최적화를 수행하며, 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함한 우선순위가 있는 영향 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la reestructuración y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, utilizando 57 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización de rendimiento integral, incluida la optimización de la recuperación de datos y la agrupación con análisis de impacto prioritario.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la réorganisation et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en utilisant 57 règles dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation des performances complète, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement avec analyse d''impact prioritaire.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Umstrukturierung und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, unter Verwendung von 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung mit priorisierter Auswirkungsanalyse.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 57 regras em 8 categorias para otimização abrangente de desempenho, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento com análise de impacto prioritária.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях для всесторонней оптимизации производительности, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и упаковки с приоритетным анализом воздействия.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير آلي لإعادة هيكلة وإنشاء رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، مستخدمًا 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين أداء شاملة، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحزيم مع تحليل تأثير متوازي."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for improved performance","Implementing optimized data fetching strategies for client and server-side rendering","Automating code reviews for performance issues and generating optimized code","Optimizing bundling for faster page loads"],"zh":["重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以提高性能","为客户端和服务器端渲染实现优化的数据获取策略","自动化代码审查以识别性能问题并生成优化代码","优化包以实现更快的页面加载"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの向上のために既存の React と Next.js コードをリファクタリングする","クライアント端とサーバー端のレンダリングのための最適化されたデータ取得戦略を実装する","パフォーマンスの問題を特定し、最適化されたコードを生成するためのコードレビューを自動化する","ページロードを高速化するためのバンドルを最適化する"],"ko":["성능 개선을 위해 기존의 React 및 Next.js 코드를 리팩토링하는 것","클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 렌더링을 위한 최적화된 데이터 가져오기 전략을 구현하는 것","성능 문제를 식별하고 최적화된 코드를 생성하기 위한 코드 리뷰를 자동화하는 것","페이지 로드를 더 빠르게 하기 위한 번들을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Reestructuración de código existente de React y Next.js para una mejor rendimiento","Implementación de estrategias de recuperación de datos optimizadas para renderizado de cliente y servidor","Automatización de revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento y generación de código optimizado","Optimización de la agrupación para cargas de página más rápidas"],"fr":["Réorganisation du code existant de React et Next.js pour une meilleure performance","Mise en œuvre de stratégies de récupération de données optimisées pour le rendu client et serveur","Automatisation des examens de code pour les problèmes de performance et génération de code optimisé","Optimisation du regroupement pour des chargements de page plus rapides"],"de":["Umstrukturierung von bestehendem React- und Next.js-Code für eine bessere Leistung","Implementierung von optimierten Datenabrufstrategien für Client- und Server-Seitendarstellung","Automatisierung von Code-Überprüfungen für Leistungsprobleme und Generierung von optimiertem Code","Optimierung der Bündelung für schnellere Seitenaufbauten"],"pt":["Reorganizar o código existente do React e Next.js para melhorar o desempenho","Implementar estratégias de busca de dados otimizadas para renderização do lado do cliente e servidor","Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho e gerar código otimizado","Otimizar o empacotamento para carregamentos de página mais rápidos"],"ru":["Перестроить существующий код React и Next.js для улучшения производительности","Реализовать оптимизированные стратегии извлечения данных для клиентской и серверной отрисовки","Автоматизировать проверки кода на наличие проблем с производительностью и генерировать оптимизированный код","Оптимизировать упаковку для более быстрой загрузки страниц"],"ar":["إعادة تنظيم رمز React و Next.js الحالي لتحسين الأداء","تطبيق استراتيجيات لاسترجاع البيانات المُحسّنة للتر kiuerjm من جانب العميل والخادم","توفير آلي لمراجعة الشفرة لتحليل مشاكل الأداء وإنشاء شفرة مُحسّنة","تحسين التحزيم لتحميل الصفحات بشكل أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js ecosystems","Limited to Vercel-specific best practices"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Next.js 生态系统","仅限于 Vercel 特有的最佳实践"],"ja":["React と Next.js のエコシステムを理解する必要がある","Vercel 特有のベストプラクティスに限定される"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js 생태계를 이해해야 함","Vercel 특有的 모범 사례로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas de React y Next.js","Limitado a las mejores prácticas específicas de Vercel"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur les écosystèmes React et Next.js","Limité aux meilleures pratiques spécifiques à Vercel"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der React- und Next.js-Ökosysteme","Begrenzt auf Vercel-spezifische Best Practices"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos ecossistemas do React e Next.js","Limitado às melhores práticas específicas do Vercel"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем React и Next.js","Ограничен лучшими практиками, специфичными для Vercel"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ببيئات React و Next.js","محدود بأفضل الممارسات المحددة لبرنامج Vercel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
