 diseño de tableros de KPI es fundamental para tomar decisiones comerciales informadas. Aprende a crear tableros efectivos","fr":"La conception de tableaux de bord KPI est essentielle pour prendre des décisions commerciales éclairées. Découvrez comment créer des tableaux efficaces","de":"Das Design von KPI-Dashboards ist entscheidend für fundierte Geschäftsentscheidungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Dashboards erstellen","pt":"Desenho de painel de KPI para impulsionar decisões de negócios com indicadores de desempenho eficazes","ru":"Дизайн панели KPI для принятия бизнес-решений с помощью эффективных показателей производительности","ar":"تصميم لوحة KPI لتعزيز قرارات الأعمال بمؤشرات أداء فعالة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设计高管仪表盘","选择有意义的KPI","构建实时监控显示","创建部门特定指标视图","改进现有仪表盘布局","建立指标治理"],"ja":["エグゼクティブダッシュボードの設計","意味のあるKPIの選択","リアルタイムモニタリング表示の構築","部門特有のメトリクスビューの作成","既存のダッシュボードレイアウトの改善","メトリクスガバナンスの確立"],"ko":["고위 임원 대시보드 설계","의미 있는 KPI 선택","실시간 모니터링 표시 생성","부서별 메트릭스 뷰 생성","기존 대시보드 레이아웃 개선","메트릭스 거버넌스 설정"],"es":["Diseño de tableros ejecutivos","Selección de KPI significativos","Creación de pantallas de monitoreo en tiempo real","Establecimiento de vistas de métricas departamentales","Mejora de diseños de tableros existentes","Establecimiento de gobernanza de métricas"],"fr":["Conception de tableaux de bord pour les dirigeants","Sélection de KPI significatifs","Création d''écrans de surveillance en temps réel","Établissement de vues de métriques départementales","Amélioration de la conception de tableaux de bord existants","Établissement d''une gouvernance des métriques"],"de":["Entwurf von Führungskräfte-Dashboards","Auswahl von bedeutsamen KPI","Erstellung von Echtzeit-Überwachungsbildschirmen","Einrichtung von Abteilungsspezifischen Metrikenansichten","Verbesserung von bestehenden Dashboard-Layouts","Einrichtung von Metriken-Governance"],"pt":["Padrões abrangentes para desenho de painel de KPI","Seleção de KPIs significativos","Criação de exibições de monitoramento em tempo real","Desenvolvimento de vistas de métricas personalizadas","Otimização de layouts de painel existentes","Estabelecimento de governança de métricas"],"ru":["Комплексные шаблоны для дизайна панели KPI","Выбор значимых KPI","Создание дисплеев мониторинга в режиме реального времени","Разработка пользовательских представлений метрик","Оптимизация существующих макетов панелей","Установление управления метриками"],"ar":["أنماط شاملة لتصميم لوحة KPI","اختيار KPIs ذي معنى","إنشاء عروض مراقبة في الوقت الفعلي","تنمية مناظير مقاييس مخصصة","تحسين تخطيطات لوحة موجودة","تأسيس إدارة المقاييس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["KPI仪表盘设计","业务决策","关键绩效指标","仪表盘设计","数据可视化","业务智能","数据分析"],"ja":["KPIダッシュボード設計","ビジネス上の意思決定","主要業績評価指標","ダッシュボード設計","データ視覚化","ビジネスインテリジェンス","データ分析"],"ko":["KPI 대시보드 디자인","비즈니스 의사 결정","주요 성과 지표","대시보드 디자인","데이터 시각화","비즈니스 인텔리전스","데이터 분석"],"es":["diseño de tableros de KPI","indicadores de rendimiento clave","tableros ejecutivos","monitoreo en tiempo real","métricas departamentales","gobernanza de métricas"],"fr":["conception de tableaux de bord KPI","indicateurs de performance clés","tableaux de bord pour les dirigeants","surveillance en temps réel","métriques départementales","gouvernance des métriques"],"de":["KPI-Dashboard-Design","Schlüsselkennzahlen","Führungskräfte-Dashboards","Echtzeit-Überwachung","Abteilungsspezifische Metriken","Metriken-Governance"],"pt":["desenho de painel de KPI","indicadores de desempenho","painéis de KPI","desenvolvimento de painéis","KPI framework","governança de métricas","análise de negócios","tomada de decisões"],"ru":["дизайн панели KPI","показатели производительности","панели KPI","разработка панелей","KPI фреймворк","управление метриками","бизнес-анализ","принятие решений"],"ar":["تصميم لوحة KPI","مؤشرات الأداء","لوحات KPI","تطوير اللوحات","إطار KPI","إدارة المقاييس","تحليل الأعمال","اتخاذ القرارات"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kpi-dashboard-design","description":"Design effective KPI dashboards with metrics selection, visualization best practices, and real-time monitoring patterns. Use when building business dashboards, selecting metrics, or designing data visualization layouts.","bodyPreview":"# KPI Dashboard Design\n\nComprehensive patterns for designing effective Key Performance Indicator (KPI) dashboards that drive business decisions.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing executive dashboards\n- Selecting meaningful KPIs\n- Building real-time monitoring displays\n- Creating department-specific metrics views\n- Improving existing dashboard layouts\n- Establishing metric governance\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. KPI Framework\n\n| Level           | Focus            | Update Frequency  | Audience","body":"# KPI Dashboard Design\n\nComprehensive patterns for designing effective Key Performance Indicator (KPI) dashboards that drive business decisions.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing executive dashboards\n- Selecting meaningful KPIs\n- Building real-time monitoring displays\n- Creating department-specific metrics views\n- Improving existing dashboard layouts\n- Establishing metric governance\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. KPI Framework\n\n| Level           | Focus            | Update Frequency  | Audience   |\n| --------------- | ---------------- | ----------------- | ---------- |\n| **Strategic**   | Long-term goals  | Monthly/Quarterly | Executives |\n| **Tactical**    | Department goals | Weekly/Monthly    | Managers   |\n| **Operational** | Day-to-day       | Real-time/Daily   | Teams      |\n\n### 2. SMART KPIs\n\n```\nSpecific: Clear definition\nMeasurable: Quantifiable\nAchievable: Realistic targets\nRelevant: Aligned to goals\nTime-bound: Defined period\n```\n\n### 3. Dashboard Hierarchy\n\n```\n├── Executive Summary (1 page)\n│   ├── 4-6 headline KPIs\n│   ├── Trend indicators\n│   └── Key alerts\n├── Department Views\n│   ├── Sales Dashboard\n│   ├── Marketing Dashboard\n│   ├── Operations Dashboard\n│   └── Finance Dashboard\n└── Detailed Drilldowns\n    ├── Individual metrics\n    └── Root cause analysis\n```\n\n## Common KPIs by Department\n\n### Sales KPIs\n\n```yaml\nRevenue Metrics:\n  - Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR)\n  - Annual Recurring Revenue (ARR)\n  - Average Revenue Per User (ARPU)\n  - Revenue Growth Rate\n\nPipeline Metrics:\n  - Sales Pipeline Value\n  - Win Rate\n  - Average Deal Size\n  - Sales Cycle Length\n\nActivity Metrics:\n  - Calls/Emails per Rep\n  - Demos Scheduled\n  - Proposals Sent\n  - Close Rate\n```\n\n### Marketing KPIs\n\n```yaml\nAcquisition:\n  - Cost Per Acquisition (CPA)\n  - Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC)\n  - Lead Volume\n  - Marketing Qualified Leads (MQL)\n\nEngagement:\n  - Website Traffic\n  - Conversion Rate\n  - Email Open/Click Rate\n  - Social Engagement\n\nROI:\n  - Marketing ROI\n  - Campaign Performance\n  - Channel Attribution\n  - CAC Payback Period\n```\n\n### Product KPIs\n\n```yaml\nUsage:\n  - Daily/Monthly Active Users (DAU/MAU)\n  - Session Duration\n  - Feature Adoption Rate\n  - Stickiness (DAU/MAU)\n\nQuality:\n  - Net Promoter Score (NPS)\n  - Customer Satisfaction (CSAT)\n  - Bug/Issue Count\n  - Time to Resolution\n\nGrowth:\n  - User Growth Rate\n  - Activation Rate\n  - Retention Rate\n  - Churn Rate\n```\n\n### Finance KPIs\n\n```yaml\nProfitability:\n  - Gross Margin\n  - Net Profit Margin\n  - EBITDA\n  - Operating Margin\n\nLiquidity:\n  - Current Ratio\n  - Quick Ratio\n  - Cash Flow\n  - Working Capital\n\nEfficiency:\n  - Revenue per Employee\n  - Operating Expense Ratio\n  - Days Sales Outstanding\n  - Inventory Turnover\n```\n\n## Dashboard Layout Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Executive Summary\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  EXECUTIVE DASHBOARD                        [Date Range ▼]  │\n├─────────────┬─────────────┬─────────────┬─────────────────┤\n│   REVENUE   │   PROFIT    │  CUSTOMERS  │    NPS SCORE    │\n│   $2.4M     │    $450K    │    12,450   │       72        │\n│   ▲ 12%     │    ▲ 8%     │    ▲ 15%    │     ▲ 5pts     │\n├─────────────┴─────────────┴─────────────┴─────────────────┤\n│                                                             │\n│  Revenue Trend                    │  Revenue by Product     │\n│  ┌───────────────────────┐       │  ┌──────────────────┐   │\n│  │    /\\    /\\          │       │  │ ████████ 45%     │   │\n│  │   /  \\  /  \\    /\\   │       │  │ ██████   32%     │   │\n│  │  /    \\/    \\  /  \\  │       │  │ ████     18%     │   │\n│  │ /            \\/    \\ │       │  │ ██        5%     │   │\n│  └───────────────────────┘       │  └──────────────────┘   │\n│                                                             │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  🔴 Alert: Churn rate exceeded threshold (>5%)              │\n│  🟡 Warning: Support ticket volume 20% above average        │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: SaaS Metrics Dashboard\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SAAS METRICS                     Jan 2024  [Monthly ▼]     │\n├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  ┌────────────────┐  │  MRR GROWTH                          │\n│  │      MRR       │  │  ┌────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │    $125,000    │  │  │                          /──   │  │\n│  │     ▲ 8%       │  │  │                    /────/      │  │\n│  └────────────────┘  │  │              /────/            │  │\n│  ┌────────────────┐  │  │        /────/                  │  │\n│  │      ARR       │  │  │   /────/                       │  │\n│  │   $1,500,000   │  │  └────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│  │     ▲ 15%      │  │  J  F  M  A  M  J  J  A  S  O  N  D  │\n│  └────────────────┘  │                                      │\n├──────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  UNIT ECONOMICS      │  COHORT RETENTION                    │\n│                      │                                      │\n│  CAC:     $450       │  Month 1: ████████████████████ 100%  │\n│  LTV:     $2,700     │  Month 3: █████████████████    85%   │\n│  LTV/CAC: 6.0x       │  Month 6: ████████████████     80%   │\n│                      │  Month 12: ██████████████      72%   │\n│  Payback: 4 months   │                                      │\n├──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  CHURN ANALYSIS                                             │\n│  ┌──────────┬──────────┬──────────┬──────────────────────┐ │\n│  │ Gross    │ Net      │ Logo     │ Expansion            │ │\n│  │ 4.2%     │ 1.8%     │ 3.1%     │ 2.4%                 │ │\n│  └──────────┴──────────┴──────────┴──────────────────────┘ │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Real-time Operations\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  OPERATIONS CENTER                    Live ● Last: 10:42:15 │\n├────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────┤\n│  SYSTEM HEALTH             │  SERVICE STATUS                │\n│  ┌──────────────────────┐  │                                │\n│  │   CPU    MEM    DISK │  │  ● API Gateway      Healthy    │\n│  │   45%    72%    58%  │  │  ● User Service     Healthy    │\n│  │   ███    ████   ███  │  │  ● Payment Service  Degraded   │\n│  │   ███    ████   ███  │  │  ● Database         Healthy    │\n│  │   ███    ████   ███  │  │  ● Cache            Healthy    │\n│  └──────────────────────┘  │                                │\n├────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┤\n│  REQUEST THROUGHPUT        │  ERROR RATE                    │\n│  ┌──────────────────────┐  │  ┌──────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │ ▁▂▃▄▅▆▇█▇▆▅▄▃▂▁▂▃▄▅ │  │  │ ▁▁▁▁▁▂▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁  │  │\n│  └──────────────────────┘  │  └──────────────────────────┘  │\n│  Current: 12,450 req/s     │  Current: 0.02%                │\n│  Peak: 18,200 req/s        │  Threshold: 1.0%               │\n├────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────┤\n│  RECENT ALERTS                                              │\n│  10:40  🟡 High latency on payment-service (p99 > 500ms)    │\n│  10:35  🟢 Resolved: Database connection pool recovered     │\n│  10:22  🔴 Payment service circuit breaker tripped          │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Implementation Patterns\n\n### SQL for KPI Calculations\n\n```sql\n-- Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR)\nWITH mrr_calculation AS (\n    SELECT\n        DATE_TRUNC(''month'', billing_date) AS month,\n        SUM(\n            CASE subscription_interval\n                WHEN ''monthly'' THEN amount\n                WHEN ''yearly'' THEN amount / 12\n                WHEN ''quarterly'' THEN amount / 3\n            END\n        ) AS mrr\n    FROM subscriptions\n    WHERE status = ''active''\n    GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC(''month'', billing_date)\n)\nSELECT\n    month,\n    mrr,\n    LAG(mrr) OVER (ORDER BY month) AS prev_mrr,\n    (mrr - LAG(mrr) OVER (ORDER BY month)) / LAG(mrr) OVER (ORDER BY month) * 100 AS growth_pct\nFROM mrr_calculation;\n\n-- Cohort Retention\nWITH cohorts AS (\n    SELECT\n        user_id,\n        DATE_TRUNC(''month'', created_at) AS cohort_month\n    FROM users\n),\nactivity AS (\n    SELECT\n        user_id,\n        DATE_TRUNC(''month'', event_date) AS activity_month\n    FROM user_events\n    WHERE event_type = ''active_session''\n)\nSELECT\n    c.cohort_month,\n    EXTRACT(MONTH FROM age(a.activity_month, c.cohort_month)) AS months_since_signup,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT a.user_id) AS active_users,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT a.user_id)::FLOAT / COUNT(DISTINCT c.user_id) * 100 AS retention_rate\nFROM cohorts c\nLEFT JOIN activity a ON c.user_id = a.user_id\n    AND a.activity_month >= c.cohort_month\nGROUP BY c.cohort_month, EXTRACT(MONTH FROM age(a.activity_month, c.cohort_month))\nORDER BY c.cohort_month, months_since_signup;\n\n-- Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC)\nSELECT\n    DATE_TRUNC(''month'', acquired_date) AS month,\n    SUM(marketing_spend) / NULLIF(COUNT(new_customers), 0) AS cac,\n    SUM(marketing_spend) AS total_spend,\n    COUNT(new_customers) AS customers_acquired\nFROM (\n    SELECT\n        DATE_TRUNC(''month'', u.created_at) AS acquired_date,\n        u.id AS new_customers,\n        m.spend AS marketing_spend\n    FROM users u\n    JOIN marketing_spend m ON DATE_TRUNC(''month'', u.created_at) = m.month\n    WHERE u.source = ''marketing''\n) acquisition\nGROUP BY DATE_TRUNC(''month'', acquired_date);\n```\n\n### Python Dashboard Code (Streamlit)\n\n```python\nimport streamlit as st\nimport pandas as pd\nimport plotly.express as px\nimport plotly.graph_objects as go\n\nst.set_page_config(page_title=\"KPI Dashboard\", layout=\"wide\")\n\n# Header with date filter\ncol1, col2 = st.columns([3, 1])\nwith col1:\n    st.title(\"Executive Dashboard\")\nwith col2:\n    date_range = st.selectbox(\n        \"Period\",\n        [\"Last 7 Days\", \"Last 30 Days\", \"Last Quarter\", \"YTD\"]\n    )\n\n# KPI Cards\ndef metric_card(label, value, delta, prefix=\"\", suffix=\"\"):\n    delta_color = \"green\" if delta >= 0 else \"red\"\n    delta_arrow = \"▲\" if delta >= 0 else \"▼\"\n    st.metric(\n        label=label,\n        value=f\"{prefix}{value:,.0f}{suffix}\",\n        delta=f\"{delta_arrow} {abs(delta):.1f}%\"\n    )\n\ncol1, col2, col3, col4 = st.columns(4)\nwith col1:\n    metric_card(\"Revenue\", 2400000, 12.5, prefix=\"$\")\nwith col2:\n    metric_card(\"Customers\", 12450, 15.2)\nwith col3:\n    metric_card(\"NPS Score\", 72, 5.0)\nwith col4:\n    metric_card(\"Churn Rate\", 4.2, -0.8, suffix=\"%\")\n\n# Charts\ncol1, col2 = st.columns(2)\n\nwith col1:\n    st.subheader(\"Revenue Trend\")\n    revenue_data = pd.DataFrame({\n        ''Month'': pd.date_range(''2024-01-01'', periods=12, freq=''M''),\n        ''Revenue'': [180000, 195000, 210000, 225000, 240000, 255000,\n                    270000, 285000, 300000, 315000, 330000, 345000]\n    })\n    fig = px.line(revenue_data, x=''Month'', y=''Revenue'',\n                  line_shape=''spline'', markers=True)\n    fig.update_layout(height=300)\n    st.plotly_chart(fig, use_container_width=True)\n\nwith col2:\n    st.subheader(\"Revenue by Product\")\n    product_data = pd.DataFrame({\n        ''Product'': [''Enterprise'', ''Professional'', ''Starter'', ''Other''],\n        ''Revenue'': [45, 32, 18, 5]\n    })\n    fig = px.pie(product_data, values=''Revenue'', names=''Product'',\n                 hole=0.4)\n    fig.update_layout(height=300)\n    st.plotly_chart(fig, use_container_width=True)\n\n# Cohort Heatmap\nst.subheader(\"Cohort Retention\")\ncohort_data = pd.DataFrame({\n    ''Cohort'': [''Jan'', ''Feb'', ''Mar'', ''Apr'', ''May''],\n    ''M0'': [100, 100, 100, 100, 100],\n    ''M1'': [85, 87, 84, 86, 88],\n    ''M2'': [78, 80, 76, 79, None],\n    ''M3'': [72, 74, 70, None, None],\n    ''M4'': [68, 70, None, None, None],\n})\nfig = go.Figure(data=go.Heatmap(\n    z=cohort_data.iloc[:, 1:].values,\n    x=[''M0'', ''M1'', ''M2'', ''M3'', ''M4''],\n    y=cohort_data[''Cohort''],\n    colorscale=''Blues'',\n    text=cohort_data.iloc[:, 1:].values,\n    texttemplate=''%{text}%'',\n    textfont={\"size\": 12},\n))\nfig.update_layout(height=250)\nst.plotly_chart(fig, use_container_width=True)\n\n# Alerts Section\nst.subheader(\"Alerts\")\nalerts = [\n    {\"level\": \"error\", \"message\": \"Churn rate exceeded threshold (>5%)\"},\n    {\"level\": \"warning\", \"message\": \"Support ticket volume 20% above average\"},\n]\nfor alert in alerts:\n    if alert[\"level\"] == \"error\":\n        st.error(f\"🔴 {alert[''message'']}\")\n    elif alert[\"level\"] == \"warning\":\n        st.warning(f\"🟡 {alert[''message'']}\")\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Limit to 5-7 KPIs** - Focus on what matters\n- **Show context** - Comparisons, trends, targets\n- **Use consistent colors** - Red=bad, green=good\n- **Enable drilldown** - From summary to detail\n- **Update appropriately** - Match metric frequency\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t show vanity metrics** - Focus on actionable data\n- **Don''t overcrowd** - White space aids comprehension\n- **Don''t use 3D charts** - They distort perception\n- **Don''t hide methodology** - Document calculations\n- **Don''t ignore mobile** - Ensure responsive design\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Stephen Few''s Dashboard Design](https://www.perceptualedge.com/articles/visual_business_intelligence/rules_for_using_color.pdf)\n- [Edward Tufte''s Principles](https://www.edwardtufte.com/tufte/)\n- [Google Data Studio Gallery](https://datastudio.google.com/gallery)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:02:30.386Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced KPI visualization and dashboard design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 KPI 可视化和仪表板设计能力的数据分析代理。","ja":"高度な KPI 可視化とダッシュボード設計能力が必要なデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 KPI 시각화 및 대시보드 디자인 기능이 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de datos que necesitan visualización avanzada de KPI y capacidades de diseño de panel de control.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données nécessitant une visualisation avancée des KPI et des capacités de conception de tableau de bord.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die eine erweiterte KPI-Visualisierung und Dashboard-Design-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced KPI visualization and dashboard design capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced KPI visualization and dashboard design capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced KPI visualization and dashboard design capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive and effective Key Performance Indicator (KPI) dashboards using frameworks like KPI Framework, driving business decisions with real-time monitoring displays and metric governance, while selecting meaningful KPIs and establishing department-specific metrics views.","zh":"赋予代理创建综合且有效的关键绩效指标（KPI）仪表板的能力，使用 KPI 框架等框架，通过实时监控显示和指标治理驱动业务决策，同时选择有意义的 KPI 并建立部门特定的指标视图。","ja":"KPI フレームワークなどのフレームワークを使用して、包括的かつ効果的な主要業績評価指標（KPI）ダッシュボードを作成するエージェントをエンパワーメントします。リアルタイムの監視表示とメトリクス ガバナンスを駆使してビジネス上の意思決定を推進し、同時に意味のある KPI を選択し、部門固有のメトリクス ビューを確立します。","ko":"KPI 프레임워크와 같은 프레임워크를 사용하여 포괄적이고 효과적인 주요 성과 지표(KPI) 대시보드를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다. 실시간 모니터링 디스플레이와 메트릭스 거버넌스를 통해 비즈니스 의사 결정을 주도하며,同時에 의미 있는 KPI를 선택하고 부서별 메트릭스 뷰를 설정합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear paneles de indicadores de rendimiento clave (KPI) integrales y efectivos utilizando frameworks como KPI Framework, impulsando las decisiones comerciales con pantallas de monitoreo en tiempo real y gobernanza de métricas, al tiempo que selecciona KPI significativos y establece vistas de métricas específicas del departamento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des tableaux de bord d''indicateurs de performance clés (KPI) complets et efficaces en utilisant des frameworks tels que KPI Framework, en stimulant la prise de décision commerciale avec des affichages de surveillance en temps réel et une gouvernance des métriques, tout en sélectionnant des KPI significatifs et en établissant des vues de métriques spécifiques aux départements.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende und effektive Key-Performance-Indikator- (KPI-) Dashboards unter Verwendung von Frameworks wie KPI Framework zu erstellen, um Geschäftsentscheidungen mit Echtzeit-Überwachungsanzeige und Metrikregierung zu treffen, während sie bedeutungsvolle KPIs auswählen und abteilungsspezifische Metrikenansichten festlegen.","pt":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive and effective Key Performance Indicator (KPI) dashboards using frameworks like KPI Framework, driving business decisions with real-time monitoring displays and metric governance, while selecting meaningful KPIs and establishing department-specific metrics views.","ru":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive and effective Key Performance Indicator (KPI) dashboards using frameworks like KPI Framework, driving business decisions with real-time monitoring displays and metric governance, while selecting meaningful KPIs and establishing department-specific metrics views.","ar":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive and effective Key Performance Indicator (KPI) dashboards using frameworks like KPI Framework, driving business decisions with real-time monitoring displays and metric governance, while selecting meaningful KPIs and establishing department-specific metrics views."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing executive dashboards with meaningful KPIs","Building real-time monitoring displays for metric governance","Improving existing dashboard layouts for better decision-making"],"zh":["使用有意义的 KPI 设计高管仪表板","为指标治理构建实时监控显示","改进现有的仪表板布局以实现更好的决策"],"ja":["意味のある KPI を使用してエグゼクティブ ダッシュボードを設計する","メトリクス ガバナンスのためのリアルタイム監視表示を構築する","既存のダッシュボード レイアウトを改善してより良い意思決定を実現する"],"ko":["의미 있는 KPI를 사용하여 이그제큐티브 대시보드를 설계하는 것","메트릭스 거버넌스를 위한 실시간 모니터링 디스플레이를 구축하는 것","既存의 대시보드 레이아웃을 개선하여 더 나은 의사 결정을 실현하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar paneles ejecutivos con KPI significativos","Crear pantallas de monitoreo en tiempo real para la gobernanza de métricas","Mejorar los diseños de paneles existentes para una mejor toma de decisiones"],"fr":["Concevoir des tableaux de bord exécutifs avec des KPI significatifs","Créer des affichages de surveillance en temps réel pour la gouvernance des métriques","Améliorer les dispositions de tableaux de bord existants pour une meilleure prise de décision"],"de":["Entwerfen von Executive-Dashboards mit bedeutungsvollen KPIs","Erstellen von Echtzeit-Überwachungsanzeigen für die Metrikregierung","Verbesserung der bestehenden Dashboard-Layouts für bessere Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Designing executiv