。永続的な認証と自己回復機能をサポート","ko":"Playwright 자동화 에이전트는 안전하고 효율적인 브라우저 자동화를 위한 솔루션입니다. 지속적인 인증 및 자기 회복 기능을 지원합니다","es":"El agente Playwright es una herramienta para pruebas automatizadas que prioriza la seguridad y la eficiencia","fr":"L''agent Playwright est un outil de tests automatisés qui privilégie la sécurité et l''efficacité","de":"Der Playwright-Agent ist ein Werkzeug für automatisierte Tests, das Sicherheit und Effizienz priorisiert","pt":"O agente Playwright é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que fornece autenticação persistente e uma camada de abstração para ferramentas MCP.","ru":"Агент Playwright - это инструмент автоматизации браузера, который предоставляет постоянную аутентификацию и абстрактный слой для инструментов MCP.","ar":"وكيل Playwright هو أداة أتمتة المتصفح التي توفر مصادقة مستمرة وطبقة أبستракت لادوات MCP.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["持久身份验证","自愈能力","支持 API 集成","失败时生成追踪和截图","结构化日志输出"],"ja":["永続的な認証","自己回復機能","API 統合のサポート","失敗時にトレースとスクリーンショットを生成","構造化ログ出力"],"ko":["지속적인 인증","자기 회복 기능","API 통합 지원","실패 시 추적 및 스크린샷 생성","구조화된 로그 출력"],"es":["Estrategia de autenticación persistente","Capa de auto-sanación con retry y fallbacks","Capa de abstracción para herramientas MCP","Seguimiento de trazas en caso de fallo","Capturas de pantalla en caso de fallo","Registros estructurados"],"fr":["Stratégie d''authentification persistante","Couche de self-réparation avec retry et fallbacks","Couche d''abstraction pour les outils MCP","Traçage des traces en cas d''échec","Captures d''écran en cas d''échec","Journaux structurés"],"de":["Persistente Authentifizierungsstrategie","Selbstheilungsschicht mit Retry und Fallbacks","Abstraktionsschicht für MCP-Tools","Ablaufverfolgung bei Fehlern","Bildschirmfotos bei Fehlern","Strukturierte Protokolle"],"pt":["Autenticação persistente","Camada de abstração para ferramentas MCP","Registro de traces em caso de falha","Captura de tela em caso de falha","Logs estruturados"],"ru":["Постоянная аутентификация","Абстрактный слой для инструментов MCP","Запись трассировки при сбое","Скриншот при сбое","Структурированные журналы"],"ar":["المصادقة المستمرة","طبقة أبستракت لادوات MCP","تسجيل الأثر عند الفشل","التقاط الشاشة عند الفشل","السجلات المنظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Playwright","自动化代理","浏览器自动化","持久身份验证","自愈能力","API 集成"],"ja":["Playwright","オートメーションエージェント","ブラウザ自動化","永続的な認証","自己回復機能","API 統合"],"ko":["Playwright","자동화 에이전트","브라우저 자동화","지속적인 인증","자기 회복 기능","API 통합"],"es":["pruebas automatizadas","agente playwright","seguridad en pruebas","automatización de UI","herramientas de desarrollo","pruebas de software","desarrollo de software","automatización de navegador"],"fr":["tests automatisés","agent playwright","sécurité dans les tests","automatisation de l''UI","outils de développement","tests de logiciel","développement de logiciel","automatisation de navigateur"],"de":["automatisierte Tests","Playwright-Agent","Sicherheit in Tests","Automatisierung von UI","Entwicklungstools","Software-Tests","Software-Entwicklung","Browser-Automatisierung"],"pt":["automação de navegador","agente Playwright","testes automatizados","autenticação persistente","ferramentas MCP","registro de traces","captura de tela","logs estruturados"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","агент Playwright","автоматизированное тестирование","постоянная аутентификация","инструменты MCP","запись трассировки","скриншот","структурированные журналы"],"ar":["أتمتة المتصفح","وكيل Playwright","اختبارات آليه","المصادقة المستمرة","ادوات MCP","تسجيل الأثر","التقاط الشاشة","السجلات المنظمة"]}},"owner":"stackconsult","repo":"RE-Engine","repoPath":"stackconsult/RE-Engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reengine-playwright-agent","description":"Implement Playwright-based human-browser automation with robust selectors, tracing, retries, and safe human-in-the-loop gates.","bodyPreview":"# Playwright Human-Browser Agent\n\n## Safety\n- Never bypass CAPTCHA/2FA.\n- Prefer API integrations over UI automation when possible.\n\n## Output artifacts\n- traces on failure\n- screenshots on failure\n- structured logs\n\n## Deliverables\n- a Playwright harness with persistent auth strategy\n- a self-healing layer (retry taxonomy + fallbacks)\n- an abstraction layer usable by MCP tools","body":"# Playwright Human-Browser Agent\n\n## Safety\n- Never bypass CAPTCHA/2FA.\n- Prefer API integrations over UI automation when possible.\n\n## Output artifacts\n- traces on failure\n- screenshots on failure\n- structured logs\n\n## Deliverables\n- a Playwright harness with persistent auth strategy\n- a self-healing layer (retry taxonomy + fallbacks)\n- an abstraction layer usable by MCP tools\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:02:51.473Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Automation Agents requiring robust browser interaction and self-healing capabilities with Playwright","zh":"适用于需要强大的浏览器交互和自愈能力的高级自动化代理，特别是与 Playwright 配合使用","ja":"Playwright を使用して堅牢なブラウザインタラクションとセルフヒーリング機能を必要とする高度な自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"Playwright와 함께 강력한 브라우저 상호 작용 및 자기 치유 기능이 필요한 고급 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización avanzados que requieren una interacción robusta con el navegador y capacidades de auto-curación con Playwright","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation avancés nécessitant une interaction robuste avec le navigateur et des capacités d''auto-réparation avec Playwright","de":"Ideal für erweiterte Automatisierungsagenten, die eine robuste Browser-Interaktion und Selbstheilungsfähigkeiten mit Playwright benötigen","pt":"Ideal for Advanced Automation Agents requiring robust browser interaction and self-healing capabilities with Playwright","ru":"Ideal for Advanced Automation Agents requiring robust browser interaction and self-healing capabilities with Playwright","ar":"Ideal for Advanced Automation Agents requiring robust browser interaction and self-healing capabilities with Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate complex web interactions using Playwright''s API integrations and UI automation, while ensuring safety with persistent auth strategies and retry taxonomy, and providing valuable output artifacts like traces and screenshots on failure","zh":"赋予代理使用 Playwright 的 API 集成和 UI 自动化来自动化复杂的 Web 交互，同时确保通过持久身份验证策略和重试分类来保证安全，并在失败时提供有价值的输出工件，如跟踪和截图","ja":"Playwright の API 統合と UI オートメーションを使用して複雑な Web インタラクションを自動化し、永続的な認証戦略とリトライ分類で安全性を確保し、失敗時にトレースやスクリーンショットなどの有価値な出力アーティファクトを提供するエージェントを強化","ko":"Playwright의 API 통합 및 UI 자동화를 사용하여 복잡한 웹 상호 작용을 자동화하고, 지속적인 인증 전략 및 재시도 분류를 통해 안전성을 보장하며, 실패 시 추적 및 스크린샷과 같은 유용한 출력 아티팩트를 제공하여 에이전트를 강화","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar interacciones web complejas utilizando integraciones de API y automatización de UI de Playwright, al mismo tiempo que garantiza la seguridad con estrategias de autenticación persistente y taxonomía de reintento, y proporciona valiosos artefactos de salida como trazas y capturas de pantalla en caso de error","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser des interactions web complexes en utilisant les intégrations d''API et l''automatisation de l''interface utilisateur de Playwright, tout en assurant la sécurité avec des stratégies d''authentification persistante et une taxonomie de réessai, et en fournissant des artefacts de sortie précieux tels que des traces et des captures d''écran en cas d''erreur","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, komplexe Web-Interaktionen mithilfe von Playwrights API-Integrationen und UI-Automatisierung zu automatisieren, während gleichzeitig die Sicherheit durch persistente Authentifizierungsstrategien und Retry-Taxonomie gewährleistet wird und wertvolle Ausgabeartefakte wie Spuren und Screenshots bei Fehlern bereitgestellt werden","pt":"Empowers agents to automate complex web interactions using Playwright''s API integrations and UI automation, while ensuring safety with persistent auth strategies and retry taxonomy, and providing valuable output artifacts like traces and screenshots on failure","ru":"Empowers agents to automate complex web interactions using Playwright''s API integrations and UI automation, while ensuring safety with persistent auth strategies and retry taxonomy, and providing valuable output artifacts like traces and screenshots on failure","ar":"Empowers agents to automate complex web interactions using Playwright''s API integrations and UI automation, while ensuring safety with persistent auth strategies and retry taxonomy, and providing valuable output artifacts like traces and screenshots on failure"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web workflows with persistent authentication","Debugging web applications using structured logs and failure screenshots","Implementing self-healing automation layers with retry mechanisms and fallbacks"],"zh":["使用持久身份验证自动化 Web 工作流程","使用结构化日志和失败截图调试 Web 应用程序","使用重试机制和回退实现自愈自动化层"],"ja":["永続的な認証を使用して Web ワークフローを自動化","構造化ログと失敗スクリーンショットを使用して Web アプリケーションをデバッグ","リトライメカニズムとフォールバックを使用してセルフヒーリング自動化レイヤーを実装"],"ko":["지속적인 인증을 사용하여 웹 워크플로우를 자동화","구조화된 로그 및 실패 스크린샷을 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션을 디버그","재시도 메커니즘 및 폴백을 사용하여 자기 치유 자동화 계층을 구현"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo web con autenticación persistente","Depurar aplicaciones web utilizando registros estructurados y capturas de pantalla de errores","Implementar capas de automatización de auto-curación con mecanismos de reintento y respaldo"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail web avec une authentification persistante","Déboguer les applications web en utilisant des journaux structurés et des captures d''écran d''erreurs","Mettre en œuvre des couches d''automatisation auto-réparatrices avec des mécanismes de réessai et de secours"],"de":["Web-Workflows mit persistenter Authentifizierung automatisieren","Web-Anwendungen mithilfe von strukturierten Protokollen und Fehlerscreenshots debuggen","Selbstheilungsschichten der Automatisierung mit Wiederholungsmechanismen und Fallbacks implementieren"],"pt":["Automating web workflows with persistent authentication","Debugging web applications using structured logs and failure screenshots","Implementing self-healing automation layers with retry mechanisms and fallbacks"],"ru":["Automating web workflows with persistent authentication","Debugging web applications using structured logs and failure screenshots","Implementing self-healing automation layers with retry mechanisms and fallbacks"],"ar":["Automating web workflows with persistent authentication","Debugging web applications using structured logs and failure screenshots","Implementing self-healing automation layers with retry mechanisms and fallbacks"]},"limitations":{"en":["Never bypasses CAPTCHA/2FA for security","Prefer API integrations over UI automation when possible"],"zh":["出于安全原因，从不绕过 CAPTCHA/2FA","尽可能优先使用 API 集成而不是 UI 自动化"],"ja":["セキュリティのため、CAPTCHA/2FA を迂回しない","可能な限り API 統合を UI オートメーションよりも優先する"],"ko":["보안을 위해 CAPTCHA/2FA를 우회하지 않음","가능한 경우 API 통합을 UI 자동화보다 우선"],"es":["Nunca omite CAPTCHA/2FA por motivos de seguridad","Preferir integraciones de API sobre automatización de UI cuando sea posible"],"fr":["Ne contourne jamais CAPTCHA/2FA pour des raisons de sécurité","Préférer les intégrations d''API à l''automatisation de l''interface utilisateur lorsque cela est possible"],"de":["Niemals CAPTCHA/2FA aus Sicherheitsgründen umgehen","API-Integrationen der UI-Automatisierung vorziehen, wenn möglich"],"pt":["Never bypasses CAPTCHA/2FA for security","Prefer API integrations over UI automation when possible"],"ru":["Never bypasses CAPTCHA/2FA for security","Prefer API integrations over UI automation when possible"],"ar":["Never bypasses CAPTCHA/2FA for security","Prefer API integrations over UI automation when possible"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
