ity-audit"},"description":{"zh":"安全审计技能是一种代码安全审计工具，用于比较两个Git引用并检测安全漏洞","ja":"コードセキュリティー監査ツールは、2つのGit参照を比較してセキュリティー漏洞を検出する","ko":"코드 보안 감사 도구는 두 개의 Git 참조를 비교하여 보안 취약점을 발견","es":"El análisis de seguridad de código compara dos referencias de Git y audita el código para detectar vulnerabilidades","fr":"L''audit de sécurité de code compare deux références Git et audite le code pour détecter les vulnérabilités","de":"Die Sicherheitsprüfung von Code vergleicht zwei Git-Referenzen und prüft den Code auf Schwachstellen","pt":"O skill de auditoria de segurança compara dois refs de git e audita diferenças de código-fonte, alterações de dependências e riscos de workflow","ru":"Навык аудита безопасности сравнивает два git-refs и проверяет различия в коде, изменения зависимостей и риски workflow","ar":"مهارة فحص الأمان تقارن بين اثنين من المراجع git وتفحص الفرق في الكود وتغييرات الإعتماد والمخاطر في سير العمل","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["比较两个Git引用","检测安全漏洞","分析源代码差异","检查依赖变化","检测新引入的包行为"],"ja":["2つのGit参照を比較","セキュリティー漏洞を検出","ソースコードの差異を分析","依存関係の変更を確認","新しく導入されたパッケージの動作を検出"],"ko":["두 개의 Git 참조를 비교","보안 취약점을 발견","소스 코드의 차이를 분석","의존関係의 변경을 확인","새로 도입된 패키지의 동작을 발견"],"es":["Análisis de diferencias de código entre dos referencias de Git","Detección de vulnerabilidades de seguridad en el código","Análisis de dependencias y determinismo de lockfile","Detección de riesgos en flujos de trabajo de CI/CD","Informe de auditoría en formato Markdown"],"fr":["Analyse des différences de code entre deux références Git","Détection des vulnérabilités de sécurité dans le code","Analyse des dépendances et déterminisme de lockfile","Détection des risques dans les flux de travail de CI/CD","Rapport d''audit au format Markdown"],"de":["Analyse der Code-Unterschiede zwischen zwei Git-Referenzen","Erkennung von Sicherheitslücken im Code","Analyse von Abhängigkeiten und Determinismus von Lockfile","Erkennung von Risiken in CI/CD-Workflows","Prüfbericht im Markdown-Format"],"pt":["Comparação de refs de git","Análise de diferenças de código-fonte","Verificação de alterações de dependências","Análise de riscos de workflow","Relatório em Markdown"],"ru":["Сравнение git-refs","Анализ различий кода","Проверка изменений зависимостей","Анализ рисков workflow","Отчет в Markdown"],"ar":["مقارنة المراجع git","تحليل الفرق في الكود المصدري","التحقق من تغييرات الإعتماد","تحليل المخاطر في سير العمل","التقرير في Markdown"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码安全审计","Git引用比较","安全漏洞检测","源代码分析","依赖变化检测","代码安全工具"],"ja":["コードセキュリティー監査","Git参照比較","セキュリティー漏洞検出","ソースコード分析","依存関係の変更検出","コードセキュリティー工具"],"ko":["코드 보안 감사","Git 참조 비교","보안 취약점 발견","소스 코드 분석","의존관계의 변경 확인","코드 보안 도구"],"es":["análisis de seguridad de código","auditoría de código","seguridad de código","vulnerabilidades de seguridad","diferencias de código","dependencias de código","CI/CD","informe de auditoría"],"fr":["audit de sécurité de code","analyse de code","sécurité de code","vulnérabilités de sécurité","différences de code","dépendances de code","CI/CD","rapport d''audit"],"de":["Sicherheitsprüfung von Code","Code-Audit","Code-Sicherheit","Sicherheitslücken","Code-Unterschiede","Code-Abhängigkeiten","CI/CD","Prüfbericht"],"pt":["auditoria de segurança","análise de código","segurança de código","vulnerabilidades de segurança","git","refs","workflow"],"ru":["аудит безопасности","анализ кода","безопасность кода","уязвимости безопасности","git","refs","workflow"],"ar":["فحص أمني","تحليل الكود","أمان الكود","ثغرات أمنية","git","المراجع","سير العمل"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-audit","description":"Audits security and supply-chain risk between two git refs for pre-release security review.","bodyPreview":"# Pre-Release Security Audit (Between Any Two Git Refs)\n\nThis skill compares **any two git refs** (tag/branch/commit SHA) and audits:\n- Source-code diffs for security regressions\n- Dependency changes (direct + transitive) and lockfile determinism\n- Newly introduced package behaviors inside `node_modules`\n- CI/CD workflow risks in `.github/workflows` and build configs\n\nThe output is a Markdown report, with a unique title and filename containing the refs to avoid overwrites.\n\n## 0) Mandatory: conf","body":"# Pre-Release Security Audit (Between Any Two Git Refs)\n\nThis skill compares **any two git refs** (tag/branch/commit SHA) and audits:\n- Source-code diffs for security regressions\n- Dependency changes (direct + transitive) and lockfile determinism\n- Newly introduced package behaviors inside `node_modules`\n- CI/CD workflow risks in `.github/workflows` and build configs\n\nThe output is a Markdown report, with a unique title and filename containing the refs to avoid overwrites.\n\n## 0) Mandatory: confirm audit range (BASE_REF, TARGET_REF)\n\n### Ref rules\n- Accepted: tag / branch / commit SHA\n- `BASE_REF` = starting point, `TARGET_REF` = ending point (release candidate)\n\n### If refs are not explicitly provided by the user\nAsk exactly once before doing any work:\n\n> Which two git refs should I compare? (e.g. `v5.19.0` → `release/v5.20.0`, or `main` → `feature/xxx`)\n\n### If only one ref is provided\nAsk for the missing ref. Do **not** assume defaults unless the user explicitly says:\n- “latest tag → HEAD”\n- or provides an equivalent instruction.\n\n---\n\n## 1) Output requirements (hard constraints)\n\n- Report filename must include refs to avoid collisions:\n  - `security-audit__${BASE_REF_SAFE}__to__${TARGET_REF_SAFE}.md`\n  - `BASE_REF_SAFE`/`TARGET_REF_SAFE` must replace `/` with `__` (or `-`) for filesystem safety.\n- Report title must include refs:\n  - `# Security Audit Report (${BASE_REF} → ${TARGET_REF})`\n- Evidence must be traceable: file path + line numbers (when possible) + short snippet.\n\n---\n\n## 2) Safety rules (must follow)\n\n- Never print or paste secrets: mnemonics/seed phrases, private keys, signing payloads, API keys, tokens, cookies, session IDs.\n- If command outputs may contain secrets (env dumps, logs), redact before writing to the report.\n- Prefer short excerpts; do not paste large bundles.\n\n---\n\n## 3) Execution checklist\n\n### Step A — Verify refs and collect context\n- [ ] Verify both refs exist:\n  - `git rev-parse --verify \"${BASE_REF}^{commit}\"`\n  - `git rev-parse --verify \"${TARGET_REF}^{commit}\"`\n- [ ] Record:\n  - BASE_SHA, TARGET_SHA\n  - Working tree clean? `git status --porcelain`\n- [ ] List changed files:\n  - `git diff --name-status \"${BASE_REF}..${TARGET_REF}\"`\n\n### Step B — Collect key diffs\nFocus on:\n- [ ] Source: `**/*.{js,ts,tsx}`\n- [ ] Dependencies: `**/package.json`, `yarn.lock`\n- [ ] CI: `.github/workflows/**`\n- [ ] Expo/EAS configs: `eas.json`, `app.json`, `app.config.*`, build scripts\n\n### Step C — Dependency delta (direct deps)\n- [ ] For each changed `package.json`, compute:\n  - Added / removed / updated deps (include workspace path)\n- [ ] Version range policy checks:\n  - Flag `*` / `latest` as High risk\n  - Flag `^` / `~` as Medium risk (explain why this matters for release determinism)\n- [ ] If deps changed but `yarn.lock` did not, flag as High risk.\n\n### Step D — Lockfile determinism (best-effort)\n- [ ] Detect Yarn flavor: `yarn -v`\n- [ ] Try one:\n  - Yarn Berry: `yarn install --immutable`\n  - Yarn Classic: `yarn install --frozen-lockfile`\n- [ ] Record anomalies: `resolutions`, `patches`, non-registry sources, unexpected downloads.\n\n### Step E — Known vulnerability scanning (best-effort)\n- [ ] `yarn audit` (if available)\n- [ ] `osv-scanner` against `yarn.lock` (if available)\n- [ ] If missing tools, note “not run + reason”.\n\n### Step F — New dependency deep inspection (node_modules)\nFor each newly added **direct dependency**:\n- [ ] Inspect `<pkg>/package.json`:\n  - `preinstall`, `install`, `postinstall` scripts\n  - entry points (`main`, `module`, `exports`)\n  - binary/native artifacts (`bin/`, `.node`)\n- [ ] Keyword scan (case-insensitive) in its installed code:\n  - Sensitive: `privateKey|mnemonic|seed|keystore|passphrase`\n  - Storage: `localStorage|indexedDB|AsyncStorage|keychain|keystore`\n  - Network: `fetch|axios|XMLHttpRequest|http|https|WebSocket|ws`\n  - Dynamic exec: `eval|new Function|child_process|spawn|exec`\n  - Install hooks: `preinstall|install|postinstall`\n- [ ] If hits exist: include **path + line + short snippet** and explain expected vs suspicious behavior.\n- [ ] Assign risk rating: Low / Medium / High.\n\n### Step G — Source diff security review (AI reasoning step)\nWithin `${BASE_REF}..${TARGET_REF}` diffs, prioritize:\n- signing flows / key handling / mnemonic\n- network layer / RPC / telemetry\n- storage layer (local/secure storage)\n- logging / analytics / error reporting\nOutput: suspicious changes list (each with summary, impact, evidence excerpt).\n\n### Step H — CI/CD & build pipeline risks\nInspect `.github/workflows/**` and build configs:\n- [ ] Flag `uses: ...@latest` (High)\n- [ ] Flag floating tags not pinned to SHA (Medium, note risk)\n- [ ] Check `permissions:` for over-broad scopes\n- [ ] Flag remote script execution patterns (curl|bash, remote downloads)\n- [ ] Note install safety (`--ignore-scripts`, etc.)\n- [ ] Expo/EAS: flag hooks that download remote code, run arbitrary scripts, or leak env into logs\n\n---\n\n## 4) Report template\n\nWrite the report to:\n`security-audit__${BASE_REF_SAFE}__to__${TARGET_REF_SAFE}.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:03:42.883Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Security Agents requiring in-depth source-code diff analysis and dependency auditing for secure protocol development.","zh":"适合需要进行深入源代码差异分析和依赖审计的高级安全代理，用于安全协议开发。","ja":"高度なセキュリティエージェントが、セキュアなプロトコル開発のための詳細なソースコード差分分析と依存関係監査を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 보안 에이전트가 보안 프로토콜 개발을 위한 심층적인 소스 코드 차이 분석 및 종속성 감사를 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Seguridad Avanzados que requieren un análisis de diferencias de código fuente en profundidad y auditoría de dependencias para el desarrollo de protocolos seguros.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de sécurité avancés nécessitant une analyse approfondie des différences de code source et une audit de dépendances pour le développement de protocoles sécurisés.","de":"Ideal für fortgeschrittene Sicherheitsagenten, die eine tiefgehende Analyse der Quellcode-Änderungen und eine Abhängigkeitsprüfung für die Entwicklung sicherer Protokolle erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança Avançados que exigem análise de diff de código-fonte em profundidade e auditoria de dependências para desenvolvimento de protocolos seguros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов безопасности, требующих глубокого анализа исходного кода и аудита зависимостей для разработки безопасных протоколов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل أمن متقدم يتطلب تحليل差 код مصدر في عمق وتدقيق للتكاليف لتطوير بروتوكول آمن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect security regressions, audit dependency changes, and identify CI/CD workflow risks through comprehensive Markdown reports, utilizing Git refs and node_modules analysis.","zh":"赋予代理检测安全性回归、审计依赖关系变化、并通过综合Markdown报告识别CI/CD工作流风险，利用Git引用和node_modules分析。","ja":"エージェントに、Git参照とnode_modules分析を使用して、セキュリティの後退を検出し、依存関係の変更を監査し、CI/CDワークフローのリスクを特定するための包括的なMarkdownレポートを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 보안 회귀를 감지하고 종속성 변경을 감사하며 Git 참조 및 node_modules 분석을 사용하여 포괄적인 Markdown 보고서를 통해 CI/CD 워크플로우リス크를 식별할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para detectar regresiones de seguridad, auditar cambios de dependencias e identificar riesgos en los flujos de trabajo de CI/CD a través de informes Markdown completos, utilizando referencias Git y análisis de node_modules.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter les régressions de sécurité, d''auditer les modifications de dépendances et d''identifier les risques dans les flux de travail CI/CD grâce à des rapports Markdown complets, en utilisant des références Git et une analyse de node_modules.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Sicherheitsrückschritte zu erkennen, Änderungen an Abhängigkeiten zu überprüfen und Risiken in den CI/CD-Workflows durch umfassende Markdown-Berichte zu identifizieren, die Git-Verweise und node_modules-Analyse verwenden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes detectem regressões de segurança, auditem alterações de dependências e identifiquem riscos de workflow CI/CD por meio de relatórios Markdown abrangentes, utilizando referências Git e análise de node_modules.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обнаруживать регрессии безопасности, аудировать изменения зависимостей и выявлять риски рабочего процесса CI/CD посредством всесторонних отчетов Markdown, используя ссылки Git и анализ node_modules.","ar":"تمكن العميل من كشف انحدارات الأمان وتدقيق التغييرات في التبعيات وتحديد مخاطر تدفق عمل CI/CD من خلال تقارير Markdown شاملة، باستخدام مراجع Git وتحليل node_modules."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing source-code diffs for security vulnerabilities between Git refs","Analyzing dependency changes and lockfile determinism for secure protocol updates","Identifying newly introduced package behaviors and CI/CD workflow risks in protocol development"],"zh":["审计Git引用之间的源代码差异以发现安全漏洞","分析依赖关系变化和锁定文件确定性以进行安全协议更新","识别新引入的包行为和CI/CD工作流风险在协议开发中"],"ja":["Git参照間のソースコードの差分を監査してセキュリティの脆弱性を検出する","依存関係の変更とロックファイルの決定性を分析してセキュアなプロトコル更新を実行する","プロトコル開発において新しく導入されたパッケージの動作とCI/CDワークフローのリスクを特定する"],"ko":["Git 참조 간의 소스 코드 차이를 감사하여 보안 취약점을 발견하는 것","종속성 변경 및 잠금 파일 결정성을 분석하여 보안 프로토콜 업데이트를 수행하는 것","프로토콜 개발에서 새로 도입된 패키지 동작 및 CI/CD 워크플로우 리스크를 식별하는 것"],"es":["Auditoría de diferencias de código fuente para vulnerabilidades de seguridad entre referencias Git","Análisis de cambios de dependencias y determinismo de lockfile para actualizaciones de protocolos seguros","Identificación de nuevos comportamientos de paquetes y riesgos en los flujos de trabajo de CI/CD en el desarrollo de protocolos"],"fr":["Auditoría des différences de code source pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité entre les références Git","Analyse des modifications de dépendances et du déterminisme des lockfiles pour les mises à jour de protocoles sécurisés","Identification de nouveaux comportements de paquets et de risques dans les flux de travail CI/CD dans le développement de protocoles"],"de":["Überprüfung der Quellcode-Änderungen auf Sicherheitsverletzungen zwischen Git-Referenzen","Analyse der Änderungen an Abhängigkeiten und des Lockfile-Determinismus für sichere Protokoll-Updates","Identifizierung neuer Verhaltensweisen von Paketen und Risiken in den CI/CD-Workflows bei der Protokollentwicklung"],"pt":["Auditoria de diffs de código-fonte para vulnerabilidades de segurança entre referências Git","Análise de alterações de dependências e determinismo de lockfile para atualizações de protocolos seguros","Identificação de comportamentos de pacotes introduzidos recentemente e riscos de workflow CI/CD no desenvolvimento de protocolos"],"ru":["Аудит diffs исходного кода на наличие уязвимостей безопасности между ссылками Git","Анализ изменений зависимостей и детерминизма lockfile для безопасных обновлений протоколов","Определение недавно введенных поведений пакетов и рисков рабочего процесса CI/CD при разработке протоколов"],"ar":["تدقيق فروقات رمز المصدر للثغرات الأمنية بين مراجع Git","تحليل التغييرات في التبعيات وتحديد قفل الملفات لنظام بروتوكول آمن","تحديد سلوكيات الحزم المقدمة حديثًا ومخاطر تدفق عمل CI/CD في تطوير البروتوكول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Git repository and refs","Limited to auditing source-code diffs and dependencies, not runtime security"],"zh":["需要访问Git仓库和引用","仅限审计源代码差异和依赖关系，不包括运行时安全性"],"ja":["Gitリポジトリと参照へのアクセスが必要","ソースコードの差分と依存関係の監査のみに限定され、ランタイムセキュリティは対象外"],"ko":["Git 저장소 및 참조에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","소스 코드 차이 및 종속성 감사만 제한되며 런타임 보안은 제외됩니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio Git y referencias","Limitado a la auditoría de diferencias de código fuente y dependencias, no la seguridad en tiempo de ejecución"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git et aux références","Limité à l''audit des différences de code source et des dépendances, et non à la sécurité en temps de exécution"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Git-Repository und -Referenzen","Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung der Quellcode-Änderungen und Abhängigkeiten, nicht auf die Laufzeit-Sicherheit"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório Git e referências","Limitado à auditoria de diffs de código-fonte e dependências, não segurança em tempo de execução"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию Git и ссылкам","Ограничен аудитом diffs исходного кода и зависимостей, не безопасностью во время выполнения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Git والمراجع","محدود بتدقيق فروقات رمز المصدر والتكاليف، وليس أمان التشغيل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
