t スキルにはコミット履歴のナビゲーションとファイルの復元が含まれており、開発者が Git を効率的に使用できるようにします","ko":"Git 기술 스킬은 커밋 기록 탐색 및 파일 복구를 포함하여 개발자가 Git을 효율적으로 사용할 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"El skill de Git permite a los desarrolladores navegar el historial de commits y recuperar archivos eliminados","fr":"Le skill Git permet aux développeurs de naviguer dans l''historique des commits et de récupérer des fichiers supprimés","de":"Das Git-Skill ermöglicht es Entwicklern, die Commit-Historie zu navigieren und gelöschte Dateien wiederherzustellen","pt":"O Git é uma ferramenta essencial para controle de versão, permitindo navegar pelo histórico de commits e recuperar arquivos excluídos","ru":"Git - это необходимый инструмент для контроля версий, позволяющий навигировать по истории коммитов и восстанавливать удаленные файлы","ar":"جيت هو أداة أساسية للتحكم في الإصدارات، مما يسمح بالتنقل في سجل التعديلات واستعادة الملفات المحذوفة","en":"An Azure Web App in Python to crawl the content of SharePoint sites into OpenAI Vector Stores"},"definition":{"en":"An Azure Web App in Python to crawl the content of SharePoint sites into OpenAI Vector Stores"},"features":{"zh":["提交历史导航","文件恢复","Git 命令行操作","提交记录分析","文件版本控制"],"ja":["コミット履歴のナビゲーション","ファイルの復元","Git コマンドライン操作","コミットレコード分析","ファイルバージョン管理"],"ko":["커밋 기록 탐색","파일 복구","Git 명령줄操作","커밋 기록 분석","파일 버전 제어"],"es":["Navegación del historial de commits","Recuperación de archivos eliminados","Verificación de la raíz del repositorio","Uso de reflog para la recuperación","Opción de mostrar A/M/D por commit"],"fr":["Navigation dans l''historique des commits","Récupération de fichiers supprimés","Vérification de la racine du référentiel","Utilisation de reflog pour la récupération","Option d''affichage A/M/D par commit"],"de":["Navigation in der Commit-Historie","Wiederherstellung gelöschter Dateien","Überprüfung der Repository-Wurzel","Verwendung von Reflog für die Wiederherstellung","Option zum Anzeigen von A/M/D pro Commit"],"pt":["Navegação pelo histórico de commits","Recuperação de arquivos excluídos","Verificação da raiz do repositório","Uso de reflog para recuperação","Visualização de status de arquivos por commit"],"ru":["Навигация по истории коммитов","Восстановление удаленных файлов","Проверка корня репозитория","Использование рефлога для восстановления","Просмотр статуса файлов по коммитам"],"ar":["تنقل في سجل التعديلات","استعادة الملفات المحذوفة","التحقق من جذور المستودع","استخدام سجل الإعادة لاستعادة","عرض حالة الملفات حسب التعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 技术技能","提交历史导航","文件恢复","Git 命令行","版本控制","开发工具","代码管理"],"ja":["Git スキル","コミット履歴のナビゲーション","ファイルの復元","Git コマンドライン","バージョン管理","開発ツール","コード管理"],"ko":["Git 기술 스킬","커밋 기록 탐색","파일 복구","Git 명령줄","버전 제어","개발 도구","코드 관리"],"es":["git para desarrolladores","navegación de commits","recuperación de archivos","control de versiones","desarrollo de software","herramientas de git"],"fr":["git pour développeurs","navigation dans les commits","récupération de fichiers","contrôle de version","développement de logiciels","outils git"],"de":["git für entwickler","navigation in commits","wiederherstellung von dateien","versionskontrolle","softwareentwicklung","git-tools"],"pt":["Git","controle de versão","histórico de commits","recuperação de arquivos","reflog","repositório","navegação","arquivos excluídos"],"ru":["Git","контроль версий","история коммитов","восстановление файлов","рефлог","репозиторий","навигация","удаленные файлы"],"ar":["جيت","التحكم في الإصدارات","سجل التعديلات","استعادة الملفات","سجل الإعادة","مستودع","التنقل","الملفات المحذوفة"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","repoPath":"karstenheld3/SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git","description":"Apply when working with Git repositories, commit history, or recovering files from previous commits","bodyPreview":"# Git Skill\n\nGit operations with focus on commit history navigation and file recovery.\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Always verify repository root before operations: `git rev-parse --show-toplevel`\n- Use `--name-status` to see A/M/D (Added/Modified/Deleted) per commit\n- To recover deleted file: checkout from commit BEFORE deletion (use `^` suffix)\n- Reflog survives even after reset/rebase - use it for recovery\n\n## Setup\n\nFor installation, see `SETUP.md` in this skill folder.\n\n## Commit History Navigati","body":"# Git Skill\n\nGit operations with focus on commit history navigation and file recovery.\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Always verify repository root before operations: `git rev-parse --show-toplevel`\n- Use `--name-status` to see A/M/D (Added/Modified/Deleted) per commit\n- To recover deleted file: checkout from commit BEFORE deletion (use `^` suffix)\n- Reflog survives even after reset/rebase - use it for recovery\n\n## Setup\n\nFor installation, see `SETUP.md` in this skill folder.\n\n## Commit History Navigation\n\n### View Recent Commits\n\n```powershell\n# Last 10 commits, one line each\ngit log --oneline -10\n\n# With file changes summary\ngit log --oneline --name-status -10\n\n# With date and author\ngit log --format=\"%h %ad %an: %s\" --date=short -10\n```\n\n### View Files Changed in Specific Commit\n\n```powershell\n# Show files with status (A=added, M=modified, D=deleted)\ngit show --name-status <commit_hash>\n\n# Just the file list\ngit show --name-only <commit_hash>\n\n# Full diff\ngit show <commit_hash>\n```\n\n### Navigate Commits Step by Step\n\n```powershell\n# Show current HEAD\ngit log --oneline -1\n\n# Show parent of HEAD\ngit log --oneline HEAD^ -1\n\n# Show N commits back\ngit log --oneline HEAD~5 -1\n\n# Compare two commits\ngit diff <commit1> <commit2> --name-status\n```\n\n### Interactive Walkback (Step Through History)\n\nTo investigate commits one-by-one, walking backwards:\n\n```powershell\n# Step 1: Start at HEAD, show what changed\ngit log --oneline -1\ngit show --name-status HEAD\n\n# Step 2: Move back one commit, show changes\ngit log --oneline HEAD^ -1\ngit show --name-status HEAD^\n\n# Step 3: Continue back (use ~2, ~3, etc.)\ngit log --oneline HEAD~2 -1\ngit show --name-status HEAD~2\n\n# Pattern: HEAD~N where N = steps back from current\n```\n\n**Tip:** Your current position is always HEAD. Use `git log --oneline -1` to confirm where you are.\n\n## File Recovery\n\n### Find When File Was Deleted\n\n```powershell\n# List all deleted files across history\ngit log --diff-filter=D --summary\n\n# Find specific file deletion\ngit log --diff-filter=D --summary -- \"**/filename.ext\"\n\n# Find EXACTLY which commit deleted a specific file (one-liner)\ngit log --diff-filter=D -1 -- path/to/file.ext\n\n# With paths\ngit log --diff-filter=D --name-only --format=\"%H %s\"\n```\n\n### Find Last Commit Where File Existed\n\n```powershell\n# Shows commits that touched the file (including deletion)\ngit log --all -- path/to/deleted/file.ext\n\n# The first result is the deletion commit\n# Use its parent (^) to get the version before deletion\n```\n\n### Recover Deleted File\n\n```powershell\n# From commit that deleted it (^ = parent commit)\ngit checkout <deletion_commit>^ -- path/to/file.ext\n\n# From known good commit\ngit checkout <good_commit> -- path/to/file.ext\n\n# Alternative (Git 2.23+): git restore --source=<commit> -- path/to/file\n\n# Using show (outputs to stdout, redirect to file)\ngit show <commit>:path/to/file.ext > recovered_file.ext\n```\n\n### Recover File from Reflog\n\n```powershell\n# View reflog\ngit reflog\n\n# Recover from specific reflog entry\ngit checkout HEAD@{n} -- path/to/file.ext\n```\n\n## Guided Recovery Workflow\n\nWhen user needs to recover accidentally deleted files:\n\n### Step 1: Identify Deletion\n\n```powershell\n# Find recent deletions\ngit log --diff-filter=D --name-only --format=\"=== %H %s ===\" -5\n```\n\n**Note:** If file was renamed (not deleted), use `git log --follow -- oldname` to track renames.\n\n### Step 2: Confirm Deletion Commit\n\n```powershell\n# Show what was deleted in that commit\ngit show --name-status <commit_hash>\n```\n\n### Step 3: Verify File Existed Before\n\n```powershell\n# Check file in parent commit\ngit show <commit_hash>^:<path/to/file>\n```\n\n### Step 4: Recover\n\n```powershell\n# Restore the file\ngit checkout <commit_hash>^ -- path/to/file\n```\n\n### Step 5: Verify Recovery\n\n```powershell\n# Check file exists\nGet-Item path/to/file\n\n# Check status\ngit status\n```\n\n## Batch Operations\n\n### List All Files Deleted in Last N Commits\n\n```powershell\ngit log --diff-filter=D --name-only --format=\"\" -n 20 | Where-Object { $_ -ne \"\" } | Sort-Object -Unique\n```\n\n### Recover Multiple Files from Same Commit\n\n```powershell\n# List files first\ngit show --name-only <commit>^\n\n# Recover specific files\ngit checkout <commit>^ -- file1.ext file2.ext file3.ext\n\n# Recover entire directory\ngit checkout <commit>^ -- path/to/directory/\n```\n\n## Comparing Versions\n\n### Compare File Across Commits\n\n```powershell\n# Between two commits\ngit diff <commit1> <commit2> -- path/to/file\n\n# Between commit and working directory\ngit diff <commit> -- path/to/file\n\n# Between commit and staged\ngit diff --cached <commit> -- path/to/file\n```\n\n### Show File Content at Specific Commit\n\n```powershell\ngit show <commit>:path/to/file\n```\n\n## Undo Operations\n\n### Undo Last Commit (Keep Changes)\n\n```powershell\ngit reset --soft HEAD^\n```\n\n### Undo Last Commit (Discard Changes)\n\n```powershell\ngit reset --hard HEAD^\n```\n\n### Restore File to Last Committed Version\n\n```powershell\ngit checkout HEAD -- path/to/file\n```\n\n### Unstage File\n\n```powershell\ngit reset HEAD -- path/to/file\n```\n\n## Status and Inspection\n\n### Repository Status\n\n```powershell\ngit status\ngit status --short\n```\n\n### Show Staged Changes\n\n```powershell\ngit diff --cached\ngit diff --cached --name-status\n```\n\n### Show Unstaged Changes\n\n```powershell\ngit diff\ngit diff --name-status\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Investigate Accidental Deletion\n\n```powershell\n# 1. Find what was deleted recently\ngit log --diff-filter=D --name-only -5\n\n# 2. Identify the commit\ngit show <commit> --name-status\n\n# 3. Recover\ngit checkout <commit>^ -- <file>\n```\n\n### Recover Workflow File Deleted by Commit Workflow\n\nWhen `/commit` accidentally deletes a file:\n\n```powershell\n# 1. Check last few commits for deletions\ngit log --diff-filter=D --name-status -3\n\n# 2. Find the workflow file\ngit log --diff-filter=D -- \"**/*.md\" --name-only -5\n\n# 3. Recover from parent of deletion commit\ngit checkout <commit>^ -- .windsurf/workflows/filename.md\n```\n\n### Compare What Changed Between Sessions\n\n```powershell\n# Find commits from today\ngit log --since=\"today\" --oneline\n\n# Compare start to end\ngit diff <first_commit> <last_commit> --name-status\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:04:01.311Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Version Control Agents needing advanced commit history navigation and file recovery capabilities in git.","zh":"适用于需要高级提交历史导航和文件恢复功能的版本控制代理，特别是在git环境中。","ja":"Git環境における高度なコミット履歴のナビゲーションとファイルの復元機能を必要とするバージョン管理エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Git에서 고급 커밋 기록 탐색 및 파일 복구 기능이 필요한 버전 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de control de versiones que necesitan una navegación avanzada de historial de confirmaciones y capacidades de recuperación de archivos en git.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contrôle de version ayant besoin d''une navigation avancée de l''historique des validations et de capacités de récupération de fichiers dans git.","de":"Ideal für Versionskontrollagenten, die eine erweiterte Navigation des Commit-Verlaufs und Dateiwiederherstellungsfunktionen in Git benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de controle de versão que precisam de navegação avançada de histórico de commit e capacidades de recuperação de arquivos no git.","ru":"Идеально для агентов контроля версий, которым необходима продвинутая навигация по истории коммитов и возможности восстановления файлов в git.","ar":"مثالي للوكيلات التي تتحكم في الإصدارات التي تحتاج إلى ملاحة متقدمة لتاريخ الإيداع وقدرات استعادة الملفات في جيت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate commit histories using `git rev-parse` and recover deleted files via reflog, leveraging `--name-status` for Added/Modified/Deleted file tracking and `^` suffix for file recovery from previous commits.","zh":"使代理能够使用`git rev-parse`导航提交历史，并通过reflog恢复已删除的文件，利用`--name-status`进行添加/修改/删除文件跟踪，并使用`^`后缀从以前的提交中恢复文件。","ja":"`git rev-parse`を使用してコミット履歴をナビゲートし、reflogを使用して削除されたファイルを回復することができ、`--name-status`を使用して追加/変更/削除されたファイルを追跡し、`^`サフィックスを使用して以前のコミットからのファイルの回復が可能になります。","ko":"`git rev-parse`를 사용하여 커밋 기록을 탐색하고, reflog를 통해 삭제된 파일을 복구하며, `--name-status`를 사용하여 추가/수정/삭제된 파일을 추적하고, `^` 접미사를 사용하여 이전 커밋에서 파일을 복구할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a navegar por los historiales de confirmaciones utilizando `git rev-parse` y a recuperar archivos eliminados a través de reflog, aprovechando `--name-status` para el seguimiento de archivos agregados/modificados/eliminados y el sufijo `^` para la recuperación de archivos de commits anteriores.","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans les historiques de validation à l''aide de `git rev-parse` et de récupérer des fichiers supprimés via reflog, en exploitant `--name-status` pour le suivi des fichiers ajoutés/modifiés/supprimés et le suffixe `^` pour la récupération de fichiers à partir de commits précédents.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Commit-Verläufe mit `git rev-parse` zu navigieren und gelöschte Dateien über Reflog wiederherzustellen, indem `--name-status` für die Nachverfolgung hinzugefügter/geänderter/gelöschter Dateien und das Suffix `^` für die Wiederherstellung von Dateien aus vorherigen Commits genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar pelos históricos de commit usando `git rev-parse` e recuperar arquivos excluídos via reflog, aproveitando `--name-status` para rastreamento de arquivos Adicionados/Modificados/Excluídos e sufixo `^` para recuperação de arquivos de commits anteriores.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью навигации по историям коммитов с помощью `git rev-parse` и восстановления удаленных файлов через reflog, используя `--name-status` для отслеживания добавленных/измененных/удаленных файлов и суффикс `^` для восстановления файлов из предыдущих коммитов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التنقل في تاريخ الإيداع باستخدام `git rev-parse` واستعادة الملفات المحذوفة عبر reflog ، واستخدام `--name-status` لتتبع الملفات المضافة / المعدلة / المحذوفة واللاحقة `^` لاستعادة الملفات من الإيداعات السابقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Navigating commit histories for auditing","Recovering deleted files from previous commits","Analyzing file changes with `--name-status`"],"zh":["用于审计的提交历史导航","从以前的提交中恢复已删除的文件","使用`--name-status`分析文件更改"],"ja":["監査のためのコミット履歴のナビゲーション","以前のコミットからの削除されたファイルの回復","`--name-status`を使用したファイルの変更分析"],"ko":["감사용 커밋 기록 탐색","이전 커밋에서 삭제된 파일 복구","`--name-status`를 사용한 파일 변경 분석"],"es":["Navegar por los historiales de confirmaciones para auditorías","Recuperar archivos eliminados de commits anteriores","Analizar cambios de archivos con `--name-status`"],"fr":["Naviguer dans les historiques de validation pour les audits","Récupérer des fichiers supprimés à partir de commits précédents","Analyser les modifications de fichiers avec `--name-status`"],"de":["Durch Navigation in Commit-Verläufen für Audits","Wiederherstellung gelöschter Dateien aus vorherigen Commits","Analyse von Dateiänderungen mit `--name-status`"],"pt":["Navegação por históricos de commit para auditoria","Recuperação de arquivos excluídos de commits anteriores","Análise de alterações de arquivos com `--name-status`"],"ru":["Навигация по историям коммитов для аудита","Восстановление удаленных файлов из предыдущих коммитов","Анализ изменений файлов с помощью `--name-status`"],"ar":["ملاحة تاريخ الإيداع للتدقيق","استعادة الملفات المحذوفة من الإيداعات السابقة","تحليل تغييرات الملفات باستخدام `--name-status`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git repository access","Dependent on accurate repository root verification"],"zh":["需要git仓库访问权限","依赖于准确的仓库根目录验证"],"ja":["Gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","正確なリポジトリルートの検証に依存"],"ko":["Git 저장소 액세스가 필요","정확한 저장소 루트 검증에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio git","Dependiente de la verificación precisa de la raíz del repositorio"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel git","Dépend de la vérification précise de la racine du référentiel"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Abhängig von der genauen Überprüfung der Repository-Wurzel"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório git","Dependente da verificação precisa da raiz do repositório"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию git","Зависит от точной верификации корня репозитория"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع جيت","يعتمد على التحقق الدقيق من 根 المستودع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-archive-change', 'community', 'Ejyke90', 'kudegowo', 'Ejyke90/kudegowo', 'openspec-archive-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z', '2026-02-18T12:04:26.539Z', NULL, '{"id":"Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-archive-change","name":"openspec-archive-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change 技术用于存档实验工作流中完成的变更，通过选项指定变更名称或从对话上下文推断","ja":"openspec-archive-change 技術は、実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブするために使用され、変更名を指定するオプションや会話のコンテキストから推測する","ko":"openspec-archive-change 기술은 실험 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경 사항을 보관하는 데 사용되며, 변경 이름을 지정하거나 대화의.context에서 추론","es":"La habilidad openspec-archive-change archiva cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental.","fr":"La compétence openspec-archive-change archive les modifications terminées dans le flux de travail expérimental.","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-archive-change archiviert abgeschlossene Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow.","pt":"O openspec-archive-change é uma ferramenta para arquivar alterações concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental.","ru":"Openspec-archive-change - это инструмент для архивирования завершенных изменений в экспериментальном рабочем процессе.","ar":"openspec-archive-change هو أداة لتخزين التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change 技术文档","ja":"openspec-archive-change 技術ドキュメント","ko":"openspec-archive-change 기술 문서","es":"Archivar cambios con openspec-archive-change","fr":"Archiver les modifications avec openspec-archive-change","de":"Änderungen mit openspec-archive-change archivieren","pt":"Arquivar alterações com openspec-archive-change","ru":"Архивирование изменений с openspec-archive-change","ar":"أرشفة التغييرات باستخدام openspec-archive-change","en":"openspec-archive-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change 技术用于存档实验工作流中完成的变更，通过选项指定变更名称或从对话上下文推断","ja":"openspec-archive-change 技術は、実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブするために使用され、変更名を指定するオプションや会話のコンテキストから推測する","ko":"openspec-archive-change 기술은 실험 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경 사항을 보관하는 데 사용되며, 변경 이름을 지정하거나 대화의.context에서 추론","es":"La habilidad openspec-archive-change archiva cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental.","fr":"La compétence openspec-archive-change archive les modifications terminées dans le flux de travail expérimental.","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-archive-change archiviert abgeschlossene Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow.","pt":"O openspec-archive-change é uma ferramenta para arquivar alterações concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental.","ru":"Openspec-archive-change - это инструмент для архивирования завершенных изменений в экспериментальном рабочем процессе.","ar":"openspec-archive-change هو أداة لتخزين التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["存档完成的变更","选项指定变更名称","从对话上下文推断变更","使用 AskUserQuestion 工具选择变更","仅显示活动变更"],"ja":["完了した変更のアーカイブ","変更名のオプション指定","会話のコンテキストから変更を推測","AskUserQuestion ツールを使用した変更の選択","アクティブな変更のみを表示"],"ko":["완료된 변경 사항 보관","변경 이름 지정 옵션","대화의.context에서 변경 사항 추론","AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용한 변경 사항 선택","활성 변경 사항만 표시"],"es":["Archivar cambios completados","Selección de cambios disponibles","Uso de la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Mostrar solo cambios activos","Compatibilidad con el esquema de cada cambio"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications terminées","Sélection des modifications disponibles","Utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Afficher uniquement les modifications actives","Compatibilité avec le schéma de chaque modification"],"de":["Archivieren abgeschlossener Änderungen","Auswahl verfügbarer Änderungen","Verwendung des Tools AskUserQuestion","Anzeigen nur aktiver Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit dem Schema jeder Änderung"],"pt":["Arquive alterações concluídas","Lista de alterações ativas","Seleção de alterações para arquivar","Uso do AskUserQuestion tool","Compatibilidade com openspec list --json"],"ru":["Архивирование завершенных изменений","Список активных изменений","Выбор изменений для архивирования","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion","Совместимость с openspec list --json"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة","قائمة التغييرات النشطة","اختيار التغييرات لأرشفتها","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion","التوافق مع openspec list --json"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-archive-change","实验工作流","变更存档","AskUserQuestion","活动变更"],"ja":["openspec-archive-change","実験ワークフロー","変更アーカイブ","AskUserQuestion","アクティブな変更"],"ko":["openspec-archive-change","실험 워크플로우","변경 사항 보관","AskUserQuestion","활성 변경"],"es":["openspec-archive-change","archivar cambios","flujo de trabajo experimental","AskUserQuestion","cambios activos","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["openspec-archive-change","archiver les modifications","flux de travail expérimental","AskUserQuestion","modifications actives","développement de logiciels"],"de":["openspec-archive-change","änderungen archivieren","experimenteller workflow","AskUserQuestion","aktive änderungen","softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["openspec-archive-change","arquivar alterações","fluxo de trabalho experimental","ferramenta de arquivamento","AskUserQuestion tool","openspec list --json"],"ru":["openspec-archive-change","архивирование изменений","экспериментальный рабочий процесс","инструмент архивирования","AskUserQuestion tool","openspec list --json"],"ar":["openspec-archive-change","أرشفة التغييرات","تدفق العمل التجريبي","أداة أرشفة","AskUserQuestion tool","openspec list --json"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"kudegowo","repoPath":"Ejyke90/kudegowo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:04:26.539Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Experimental Workflow Agents needing to efficiently manage change archives using openspec-archive-change functionality.","zh":"适用于需要使用openspec-archive-change功能高效管理更改存档的实验工作流代理的理想选择。","ja":"openspec-archive-change機能を使用して変更アーカイブを効率的に管理する必要がある実験ワークフロー エージェントに最適です。","ko":"openspec-archive-change 기능을 사용하여 변경 아카이브를 효율적으로 관리하는 데 필요한 실험 워크플로 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de flujo de trabajo experimental que necesitan gestionar eficientemente los archivos de cambio utilizando la funcionalidad openspec-archive-change.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de workflow expérimental ayant besoin de gérer efficacement les archives de modification en utilisant la fonctionnalité openspec-archive-change.","de":"Ideal für experimentelle Workflow-Agents, die Änderungsarchive mithilfe der openspec-archive-change-Funktionalität effizient verwalten müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Fluxo de Trabalho Experimental que precisam gerenciar eficientemente arquivos de alterações usando a funcionalidade openspec-archive-change.","ru":"Идеально для Экспериментальных Агентов Workflow, которым необходимо эффективно управлять архивами изменений с использованием функциональности openspec-archive-change.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات وكيل التجارب التي تحتاج إلى إدارة كفاءة أرشيفات التغيير باستخدام وظائف openspec-archive-change."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to archive completed changes in experimental workflows by running `openspec list --json` and utilizing the AskUserQuestion tool for seamless change selection, including support for active change filtering and schema inclusion.","zh":"通过运行`openspec list --json`和利用AskUserQuestion工具实现无缝的更改选择，包括支持活动更改过滤和模式包含，赋予代理在实验工作流中存档已完成更改的能力。","ja":"AskUserQuestionツールを使用してシームレスな変更の選択を行い、実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブするための`openspec list --json`の実行およびアクティブな変更のフィルタリングとスキーマの包含をサポートすることで、エージェントに能力を付与します。","ko":"`openspec list --json`을 실행하고 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 무결점의 변경 선택을 thực hiện하며, 실험 워크플로에서 완료된 변경을 아카이브하고, 활성 변경 필터링 및 스키마 포함을 지원하여 에이전트에 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar los cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales ejecutando `openspec list --json` y utilizando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para una selección de cambios sin problemas, incluyendo soporte para filtrado de cambios activos e inclusión de esquemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver les modifications complètes dans les flux de travail expérimentaux en exécutant `openspec list --json` et en utilisant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour une sélection de modifications transparente, y compris le support pour le filtrage des modifications actives et l''inclusion de schémas.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows zu archivieren, indem sie `openspec list --json` ausführen und das Tool AskUserQuestion für eine nahtlose Änderungsauswahl verwenden, einschließlich Unterstützung für die Filterung aktiver Änderungen und die Einbeziehung von Schemata.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais executando `openspec list --json` e utilizando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção de alterações sem interrupção, incluindo suporte para filtragem de alterações ativas e inclusão de esquema.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальных рабочих процессах, запуская `openspec list --json` и используя инструмент AskUserQuestion для бесшовного выбора изменений, включая поддержку фильтрации активных изменений и включения схемы.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سير عمل التجارب عن طريق تشغيل `openspec list --json` واستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار التغييرات بسلاسة، بما في ذلك دعم تصفية التغييرات النشطة وإدراج مخطط."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed changes in experimental workflows","Prompting users for change selection using the AskUserQuestion tool","Filtering active changes for efficient archive management"],"zh":["在实验工作流中存档已完成的更改","使用AskUserQuestion工具提示用户选择更改","筛选活动更改以实现高效的存档管理"],"ja":["実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブする","AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーに変更の選択を促す","アクティブな変更をフィルタリングして効率的なアーカイブ管理を行う"],"ko":["실험 워크플로에서 완료된 변경을 아카이브하는 것","AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자에게 변경 선택을 제안하는 것","활성 변경을 필터링하여 효율적인 아카이브 관리를 하는 것"],"es":["Archivar cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales","Solicitar a los usuarios que seleccionen cambios mediante la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Filtrar cambios activos para una gestión de archivos eficiente"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications complètes dans les flux de travail expérimentaux","Inviter les utilisateurs à sélectionner des modifications à l''aide de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Filtrer les modifications actives pour une gestion d''archives efficace"],"de":["Abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows archivieren","Benutzern Änderungsauswahl über das Tool AskUserQuestion anbieten","Aktive Änderungen filtern für eine effiziente Archivverwaltung"],"pt":["Arquivar alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais","Solicitar aos usuários a seleção de alterações usando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion","Filtrar alterações ativas para gerenciamento de arquivo eficiente"],"ru":["Архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальных рабочих процессах","Предлагать пользователям выбор изменений с помощью инструмента AskUserQuestion","Фильтровать активные изменения для эффективного управления архивом"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سير عمل التجارب","تحفيز المستخدمين على اختيار التغييرات باستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion","تصفية التغييرات النشطة من أجل إدارة أرشيف فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec-archive-change functionality","Needs access to conversation context for change name inference","Limited to archiving completed changes"],"zh":["需要openspec-archive-change功能","需要对话上下文以推断更改名称","仅限存档已完成的更改"],"ja":["openspec-archive-change機能が必要","会話コンテキストへのアクセスが変更名の推論に必要","完了した変更のみをアーカイブできる"],"ko":["openspec-archive-change 기능이 필요합니다.","대화 문脈에 대한 액세스가 변경 이름 추론에 필요합니다.","완료된 변경만 아카이브 할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere la funcionalidad openspec-archive-change","Necesita acceso al contexto de conversación para inferir el nombre del cambio","Limitado a archivar cambios completados"],"fr":["Nécessite la fonctionnalité openspec-archive-change","A besoin d''un accès au contexte de conversation pour inférer le nom de la modification","Limité à l''archivage des modifications complètes"],"de":["Benötigt die openspec-archive-change-Funktionalität","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Konversationskontext zur Ableitung des Änderungsnamens","Begrenzt auf das Archivieren abgeschlossener Änderungen"],"pt":["Exige a funcionalidade openspec-archive-change","Necessita acesso ao contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Limitado a arquivar alterações concluídas"],"ru":["Требует функциональности openspec-archive-change","Требует доступа к контексту разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен архивированием завершенных изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب وظائف openspec-archive-change","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج اسم التغيير","محدود بأرشفة التغييرات المكتملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
