merge, mejorando la organización y la colaboración en proyectos de desarrollo","fr":"Le skill ''git-conventions'' met en œuvre des conventions Git pour les commits et les merge, améliorant l''organisation et la collaboration dans les projets de ...","de":"Der Skill ''git-conventions'' implementiert Git-Konventionen für Commits und Merge, verbessert die Organisation und die Zusammenarbeit in Entwicklungsprojekten","pt":"O skill ''git-conventions'' implementa convenções Git para commits e merge, garantindo uma estrutura consistente para o seu código","ru":"Навык ''git-conventions'' реализует Гит конвенции для коммитов и слияния, обеспечивая последовательную структуру для вашего кода","ar":"مهارة ''git-conventions'' تطبق اتفاقيات جيت للالتزام والدمج، مما يضمن هيكلا متسقا لمشاريعك","en":"An Azure Web App in Python to crawl the content of SharePoint sites into OpenAI Vector Stores"},"definition":{"en":"An Azure Web App in Python to crawl the content of SharePoint sites into OpenAI Vector Stores"},"features":{"zh":["Conventional Commits","Verb Mapping","IMPLEMENT","DELIVER","Merge"],"ja":["Conventional Commits","Verb Mapping","IMPLEMENT","DELIVER","Merge"],"ko":["Conventional Commits","Verb Mapping","IMPLEMENT","DELIVER","Merge"],"es":["Convenciones para commits","Convenciones para merge","Mejora la organización del código","Facilita la colaboración en equipo","Seguimiento de cambios en el código"],"fr":["Conventions pour les commits","Conventions pour les merge","Amélioration de l''organisation du code","Facilitation de la collaboration d''équipe","Suivi des modifications du code"],"de":["Konventionen für Commits","Konventionen für Merge","Verbesserung der Codeorganisation","Erleichterung der Teamzusammenarbeit","Verfolgung von Änderungen im Code"],"pt":["Implementação de convenções Git para commits","Suporte a merge de branches","Formatos de mensagem de commit personalizados","Tipos de commites pré-definidos","Prevenção de commites de segredos"],"ru":["Реализация Гит конвенций для коммитов","Поддержка слияния веток","Настройка форматов сообщений коммитов","Предопределенные типы коммитов","Предотвращение коммитов секретов"],"ar":["تطبيق اتفاقيات جيت للالتزام","دعم دمج الفروع","تنسيقات رسائل الالتزام المخصصة","أنواع التزامات محددة مسبقا","منع التزامات السر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git","Conventional Commits","Verb Mapping","Azure Web App","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","Python"],"ja":["Git","Conventional Commits","Verb Mapping","Azure Web App","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","Python"],"ko":["Git","Conventional Commits","Verb Mapping","Azure Web App","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","Python"],"es":["convenciones git","commits","merge","desarrollo de software","colaboración en equipo","organización del código"],"fr":["conventions git","commits","merge","développement de logiciels","collaboration d''équipe","organisation du code"],"de":["git-konventionen","commits","merge","softwareentwicklung","teamzusammenarbeit","codeorganisation"],"pt":["convenções git","commits","merge","formatos de mensagem","tipos de commites","desenvolvimento de software","controle de versão"],"ru":["Гит конвенции","коммиты","слияние","форматы сообщений","типы коммитов","разработка программного обеспечения","контроль версий"],"ar":["إتفاقيات جيت","التزام","الدمج","تنسيقات الرسائل","أنواع التزامات","تطوير البرمجيات","مراقبة الإصدار"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","repoPath":"karstenheld3/SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-conventions","description":"Apply when committing code, writing commit messages, or configuring .gitignore","bodyPreview":"# Git Conventions\n\n## Verb Mapping\n\nThis skill implements:\n- [COMMIT] - Create conventional commits\n- [MERGE] - Merge branches following conventions\n\n**Phases**: IMPLEMENT, DELIVER\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Use Conventional Commits: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`\n- Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, style, perf\n- Imperative mood, <72 chars, no period\n- NEVER commit secrets: .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem, *.key\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\nUse **Conventional Commits**: `<type>(<scope>): <des","body":"# Git Conventions\n\n## Verb Mapping\n\nThis skill implements:\n- [COMMIT] - Create conventional commits\n- [MERGE] - Merge branches following conventions\n\n**Phases**: IMPLEMENT, DELIVER\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Use Conventional Commits: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`\n- Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, style, perf\n- Imperative mood, <72 chars, no period\n- NEVER commit secrets: .env, *.cer, *.pfx, *.pem, *.key\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\nUse **Conventional Commits**: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`\n\n### Types\n\n- **feat**: New feature\n- **fix**: Bug fix\n- **docs**: Documentation only\n- **refactor**: Code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature\n- **test**: Adding or updating tests\n- **chore**: Maintenance tasks, dependencies, build changes\n- **style**: Formatting, whitespace (no code logic change)\n- **perf**: Performance improvement\n\n### Guidelines\n\n1. Use imperative mood (\"add\" not \"added\" or \"adds\")\n2. Keep description under 72 characters\n3. No period at the end\n4. Scope should match module/folder name when applicable\n\n### Examples\n\n```\nfeat(crawler): add incremental crawl mode\nfix(auth): handle expired tokens\ndocs: update README installation steps\nrefactor(domains): simplify source validation logic\nchore: update dependencies to latest versions\n```\n\n## Safe Undo Commit\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose the right reset mode to avoid data loss.\n\n### Undo Last Commit (Keep Files)\n\n```bash\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1   # Undo commit, keep files STAGED\ngit reset HEAD~1          # Undo commit, keep files UNSTAGED\n```\n\n### Undo Last Commit (Discard Files) - DESTRUCTIVE\n\n```bash\ngit reset --hard HEAD~1   # Undo commit AND DELETE all changes\n```\n\n**WARNING**: `--hard` deletes uncommitted files permanently (unless recoverable via reflog).\n\n### Recovery After Accidental --hard Reset\n\nIf files were committed before reset, recover from reflog:\n\n```bash\ngit reflog                              # Find commit hash (e.g., abc1234)\ngit checkout abc1234 -- path/to/file    # Recover specific file\ngit checkout abc1234 -- .               # Recover all files from that commit\n```\n\n### Recovery From Remote\n\nIf commit was pushed before local reset:\n\n```bash\ngit fetch origin                        # Get latest from remote\ngit log --oneline origin/master -5      # Check what''s on remote\ngit checkout origin/master -- path/to   # Recover file from remote\n```\n\n### Amend Last Commit (Not Yet Pushed)\n\n```bash\ngit add <files>\ngit commit --amend -m \"new message\"     # Replace last commit\n```\n\n### Force Push After Amend/Reset (Remote Has Old Commit)\n\n```bash\ngit push --force-with-lease             # Safer than --force\n```\n\n**Use `--force-with-lease`**: Fails if remote changed since last fetch (prevents overwriting others'' work).\n\n## .gitignore Rules\n\n1. **NEVER commit secrets**: `.env` files, certificates (*.cer, *.pfx, *.pem, *.key), API keys\n2. **Exclude large binaries**: Reinstallable tools (poppler, node_modules, .venv/) - save repo size\n3. **Exclude build artifacts**: Generated files (dist/, __pycache__/, *.pyc)\n4. **Track shared config**: `.vscode/`, `Set-*-Env.bat` (environment setup scripts)\n5. **Use negation pattern**: Keep specific files with `!` prefix when excluding folders\n6. **Add comments**: Document non-obvious exclusions in .gitignore\n\n## Template\n\n```gitignore\n# Secrets (NEVER commit)\n*.env\n.env.*\n*.cer\n*.pfx\n*.pem\n*.key\n\n# Python\n.venv/\n__pycache__/\n*.pyc\n.pytest_cache/\n.mypy_cache/\n\n# Node.js\nnode_modules/\ndist/\nlib/\n*.log\n\n# IDE (keep .vscode/)\n.vs/\nbin/\nobj/\n\n# OS\n.DS_Store\n\n# Tools (reinstallable)\n../.tools/poppler/\n\n# Temporary\n*.tmp\n.tmp_*\n*.bak\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:04:47.564Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing standardized commit formatting and branch merging capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交格式和分支合并功能的代码管理代理。","ja":"コード管理エージェントが標準化されたコミット形式とブランチマージ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 형식 및 분기 병합 기능이 필요한 코드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing standardized commit formatting and branch merging capabilities.","fr":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing standardized commit formatting and branch merging capabilities.","de":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing standardized commit formatting and branch merging capabilities.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de formatação de commit padronizada e capacidades de mesclagem de branches.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению кодом, которым требуются стандартизированная форматирование коммитов и возможности слияния веток.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق تعليمات برمجية معيارية وقدرات دمج الفروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create conventional commits using the imperative mood with strict character limits, and merge branches following established conventions, all while ensuring sensitive information like .env files and certificates are never committed.","zh":"使代理能够使用祈使语气和严格的字符限制创建标准化的提交，并遵循既定的约定合并分支，同时确保不提交如 .env 文件和证书等敏感信息。","ja":"エージェントが命令形と厳格な文字制限を使用して標準的なコミットを作成し、既定の規約に従ってブランチをマージすることを可能にし、同時に .env ファイルや証明書などの機密情報がコミットされないことを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 명령어 형식과 엄격한 문자 제한을 사용하여 표준화된 커밋을 생성하고, 정해진 규약에 따라 브랜치를 병합하며, 동시에 .env 파일이나 인증서와 같은 민감한 정보가 커밋되지 않도록 합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to create conventional commits using the imperative mood with strict character limits, and merge branches following established conventions, all while ensuring sensitive information like .env files and certificates are never committed.","fr":"Empowers agents to create conventional commits using the imperative mood with strict character limits, and merge branches following established conventions, all while ensuring sensitive information like .env files and certificates are never committed.","de":"Empowers agents to create conventional commits using the imperative mood with strict character limits, and merge branches following established conventions, all while ensuring sensitive information like .env files and certificates are never committed.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar commits convencionais usando o modo imperativo com limites de caracteres estritos e mesclar branches seguindo convenções estabelecidas, garantindo que informações confidenciais como arquivos .env e certificados nunca sejam comprometidos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать конвенциональные коммиты с использованием императива с строгими ограничениями на количество символов и сливать ветки в соответствии с установленными конвенциями, гарантируя, что конфиденциальная информация, такая как файлы .env и сертификаты, никогда не будет коммитена.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء تعليمات برمجية تقليدية باستخدام الحالة اللازمة مع حدود الأحرف الصارمة ودمج الفروع اتباعًا للمواصفات المحددة، مع ضمان ألا يتم أبدًا التزامن المعلومات الحساسة مثل الملفات .env والشهادات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit message formatting for consistency","Enforcing conventional commit types such as feat, fix, and docs","Merging branches while adhering to predefined git conventions"],"zh":["为一致性自动化提交消息格式","强制执行传统的提交类型，例如 feat、fix 和 docs","在遵循预定义的 Git 约定的同时合并分支"],"ja":["一貫性のためコミットメッセージのフォーマットを自動化する","feat、fix、docs などの従来のコミットタイプを適用する","事前に定義された Git 規約に従ってブランチをマージする"],"ko":["일관성을 위해 커밋 메시지 형식을 자동화하는 것","feat, fix, docs와 같은 전통적인 커밋 유형을 적용하는 것","사전에 정의된 Git 규약을 따르는 동안 브랜치를 병합하는 것"],"es":["Automating commit message formatting for consistency","Enforcing conventional commit types such as feat, fix, and docs","Merging branches while adhering to predefined git conventions"],"fr":["Automating commit message formatting for consistency","Enforcing conventional commit types such as feat, fix, and docs","Merging branches while adhering to predefined git conventions"],"de":["Automating commit message formatting for consistency","Enforcing conventional commit types such as feat, fix, and docs","Merging branches while adhering to predefined git conventions"],"pt":["Automatizar a formatação de mensagens de commit para consistência","Impor tipos de commit convencionais, como feat, fix e docs","Mesclar branches enquanto se adere às convenções de git pré-definidas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать форматирование сообщений коммитов для последовательности","Принудительно использовать конвенциональные типы коммитов, такие как feat, fix и docs","Сливать ветки, придерживаясь предварительно определенных конвенций git"],"ar":["توفير تنسيق رسائل تعليمات برمجية تلقائيًا من أجل الاتساق","فرض أنواع تعليمات برمجية تقليدية مثل feat و fix و docs","دمج الفروع مع الالتزام بالمواصفات المحددة مسبقًا ل git"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to specific commit message formats","Restrictions on committing certain file types like .cer, .pfx, .pem, and .key","Imperative mood and character limits must be observed"],"zh":["需要遵守特定的提交消息格式","限制提交某些文件类型，例如 .cer、.pfx、.pem 和 .key","必须遵守祈使语气和字符限制"],"ja":["特定のコミットメッセージ形式に従う必要がある",".cer、.pfx、.pem、.key などの特定のファイルタイプのコミットを制限する","命令形と文字制限を遵守する必要がある"],"ko":["특정한 커밋 메시지 형식을 따라야 하는 것",".cer, .pfx, .pem, .key와 같은 특정 파일 유형의 커밋을 제한하는 것","명령어 형식과 문자 제한을 준수해야 하는 것"],"es":["Requires adherence to specific commit message formats","Restrictions on committing certain file types like .cer, .pfx, .pem, and .key","Imperative mood and character limits must be observed"],"fr":["Requires adherence to specific commit message formats","Restrictions on committing certain file types like .cer, .pfx, .pem, and .key","Imperative mood and character limits must be observed"],"de":["Requires adherence to specific commit message formats","Restrictions on committing certain file types like .cer, .pfx, .pem, and .key","Imperative mood and character limits must be observed"],"pt":["Exige aderência a formatos de mensagens de commit específicos","Restrições ao comprometimento de certos tipos de arquivos, como .cer, .pfx, .pem e .key","O modo imperativo e os limites de caracteres devem ser observados"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения конкретных форматов сообщений коммитов","Ограничения на коммит определенных типов файлов, таких как .cer, .pfx, .pem и .key","Императив и ограничения на количество символов должны быть соблюдены"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباعًا لتنسيقات رسائل تعليمات برمجية محددة","قيود على التزامن أنواع ملفات معينة مثل .cer و .pfx و .pem و .key","يجب مراعاة الحالة اللازمة والحدود المحددة للأحرف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
