ompletion"},"description":{"zh":"验证前完成是一种确保代码质量和效率的核心原则，强调在声明完成前必须进行验证","ja":"Verification Before Completionは、コード品質と効率を確保するための核心原則であり、完了を宣言する前に必ず検証を行うことを強調する","ko":"검증 전 완료는 코드 품질과 효율을 보장하는 핵심 원칙으로, 완료를 선언하기 전에 반드시 검증을 수행해야 함을 강조한다","es":"La verificación antes de completar es un principio fundamental para garantizar la eficiencia y la honestidad en el trabajo.","fr":"La vérification avant achèvement est un principe fondamental pour garantir l''efficacité et l''honnêteté dans le travail.","de":"Die Verifizierung vor Abschluss ist ein grundlegendes Prinzip, um die Effizienz und Ehrlichkeit in der Arbeit zu gewährleisten.","pt":"A verificação antes da conclusão é um princípio fundamental para garantir a eficiência e a honestidade no desenvolvimento de projetos","ru":"Верификация до завершения является основным принципом для обеспечения эффективности и честности в разработке проектов","ar":"التحقق قبل الإكمال هو مبدأ أساسي لضمان الكفاءة والنزاهة في تطوير المشاريع","en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"definition":{"en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"features":{"zh":["验证前完成核心原则","确保代码质量","提高效率","强调验证的重要性","适用于软件开发"],"ja":["Verification Before Completion核心原則","コード品質を確保","効率を向上","検証の重要性を強調","ソフトウェア開発向け"],"ko":["검증 전 완료 핵심 원칙","코드 품질 보장","효율성 향상","검증의 중요성 강조","소프트웨어 개발용"],"es":["Verificación de evidencia","Garantía de eficiencia","Principio de honestidad","Proceso de comprobación","Mejora de la productividad"],"fr":["Vérification de preuves","Garantie d''efficacité","Principe d''honnêteté","Processus de vérification","Amélioration de la productivité"],"de":["Verifizierung von Beweisen","Garantie der Effizienz","Prinzip der Ehrlichkeit","Prozess der Überprüfung","Verbesserung der Produktivität"],"pt":["Garantia de eficiência","Prevenção de erros","Melhoria da qualidade","Redução de riscos","Aumento da produtividade"],"ru":["Гарантия эффективности","Предотвращение ошибок","Улучшение качества","Снижение рисков","Повышение производительности"],"ar":["ضمان الكفاءة","منع الأخطاء","تحسين الجودة","تقليل المخاطر","زيادة الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["验证前完成","软件开发原则","代码质量","效率","验证","verity原则"],"ja":["Verification Before Completion","ソフトウェア開発原則","コード品質","効率","検証","verity原則"],"ko":["검증 전 완료","소프트웨어 개발 원칙","코드 품질","효율성","검증","신뢰 원칙"],"es":["verificación antes de completar","eficiencia en el trabajo","honestidad laboral","principios de trabajo","productividad laboral"],"fr":["vérification avant achèvement","efficacité au travail","honnêteté professionnelle","principes de travail","productivité au travail"],"de":["Verifizierung vor Abschluss","Effizienz in der Arbeit","Ehrlichkeit in der Arbeit","Arbeitsprinzipien","Arbeitsproduktivität"],"pt":["verificação antes da conclusão","desenvolvimento de projetos","eficiência","honestidade","qualidade","produtividade"],"ru":["верификация до завершения","разработка проектов","эффективность","честность","качество","производительность"],"ar":["التحقق قبل الإكمال","تطوير المشاريع","الكفاءة","النزاهة","الجودة","الإنتاجية"]}},"owner":"faint45","repo":"zhewei-ai-chat-01","repoPath":"faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"verification-before-completion","description":"Use when about to claim work is complete, fixed, or passing, before committing or creating PRs - requires running verification commands and confirming output before making any success claims; evidence before assertions always","bodyPreview":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing sati","body":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing satisfaction:\n\n1. IDENTIFY: What command proves this claim?\n2. RUN: Execute the FULL command (fresh, complete)\n3. READ: Full output, check exit code, count failures\n4. VERIFY: Does output confirm the claim?\n   - If NO: State actual status with evidence\n   - If YES: State claim WITH evidence\n5. ONLY THEN: Make the claim\n\nSkip any step = lying, not verifying\n```\n\n## Common Failures\n\n| Claim | Requires | Not Sufficient |\n|-------|----------|----------------|\n| Tests pass | Test command output: 0 failures | Previous run, \"should pass\" |\n| Linter clean | Linter output: 0 errors | Partial check, extrapolation |\n| Build succeeds | Build command: exit 0 | Linter passing, logs look good |\n| Bug fixed | Test original symptom: passes | Code changed, assumed fixed |\n| Regression test works | Red-green cycle verified | Test passes once |\n| Agent completed | VCS diff shows changes | Agent reports \"success\" |\n| Requirements met | Line-by-line checklist | Tests passing |\n\n## Red Flags - STOP\n\n- Using \"should\", \"probably\", \"seems to\"\n- Expressing satisfaction before verification (\"Great!\", \"Perfect!\", \"Done!\", etc.)\n- About to commit/push/PR without verification\n- Trusting agent success reports\n- Relying on partial verification\n- Thinking \"just this once\"\n- Tired and wanting work over\n- **ANY wording implying success without having run verification**\n\n## Rationalization Prevention\n\n| Excuse | Reality |\n|--------|---------|\n| \"Should work now\" | RUN the verification |\n| \"I''m confident\" | Confidence ≠ evidence |\n| \"Just this once\" | No exceptions |\n| \"Linter passed\" | Linter ≠ compiler |\n| \"Agent said success\" | Verify independently |\n| \"I''m tired\" | Exhaustion ≠ excuse |\n| \"Partial check is enough\" | Partial proves nothing |\n| \"Different words so rule doesn''t apply\" | Spirit over letter |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n**Tests:**\n```\n✅ [Run test command] [See: 34/34 pass] \"All tests pass\"\n❌ \"Should pass now\" / \"Looks correct\"\n```\n\n**Regression tests (TDD Red-Green):**\n```\n✅ Write → Run (pass) → Revert fix → Run (MUST FAIL) → Restore → Run (pass)\n❌ \"I''ve written a regression test\" (without red-green verification)\n```\n\n**Build:**\n```\n✅ [Run build] [See: exit 0] \"Build passes\"\n❌ \"Linter passed\" (linter doesn''t check compilation)\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n```\n✅ Re-read plan → Create checklist → Verify each → Report gaps or completion\n❌ \"Tests pass, phase complete\"\n```\n\n**Agent delegation:**\n```\n✅ Agent reports success → Check VCS diff → Verify changes → Report actual state\n❌ Trust agent report\n```\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nFrom 24 failure memories:\n- your human partner said \"I don''t believe you\" - trust broken\n- Undefined functions shipped - would crash\n- Missing requirements shipped - incomplete features\n- Time wasted on false completion → redirect → rework\n- Violates: \"Honesty is a core value. If you lie, you''ll be replaced.\"\n\n## When To Apply\n\n**ALWAYS before:**\n- ANY variation of success/completion claims\n- ANY expression of satisfaction\n- ANY positive statement about work state\n- Committing, PR creation, task completion\n- Moving to next task\n- Delegating to agents\n\n**Rule applies to:**\n- Exact phrases\n- Paraphrases and synonyms\n- Implications of success\n- ANY communication suggesting completion/correctness\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**No shortcuts for verification.**\n\nRun the command. Read the output. THEN claim the result.\n\nThis is non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:04:41.737Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Quality Assurance Agents needing rigorous verification and validation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要严格验证和确认能力的质量保证代理。","ja":"品質保証エージェントが厳格な検証とバリデーションの機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"엄격한 검증 및 확인 기능이 필요한 품질 보증 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de garantía de calidad que necesitan capacidades de verificación y validación rigurosas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''assurance qualité ayant besoin de capacités de vérification et de validation rigoureuses.","de":"Perfekt für Qualitätsprüfungsagenten, die strengen Überprüfungs- und Validierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Garantia de Qualidade que necessitam de capacidades rigorosas de verificação e validação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по обеспечению качества, которым необходимы строгие возможности верификации и проверки.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات ضمان الجودة التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات صارمة للتأكد والتحقق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce evidence-based claims with fresh verification evidence, leveraging the Iron Law of NO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE, ensuring adherence to the core principle of Evidence before claims, always.","zh":"赋予代理人以新鲜的验证证据来强制执行基于证据的主张，利用没有新鲜验证证据就不提出完成主张的铁律，确保始终遵循证据先于主张的核心原则。","ja":"エージェントが新しい検証証拠を使用して証拠に基づく主張を強制することを可能にし、fresh verification evidenceなしにcompletion claimsを提出しないという鉄則を利用して、常に証拠が主張の前にあるという核心原則を遵守します。","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 검증 증거를 사용하여 증거 기반의 주장을 강제执行할 수 있도록 하며, 새로은 검증 증거 없이 완료 주장을 제출하지 않는다는 철칙을 활용하여 항상 증거가 주장보다 먼저라는 핵심 원칙을 준수합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer valer reclamaciones basadas en evidencia con evidencia de verificación fresca, aprovechando la Ley de Hierro de NO RECLAMACIONES DE FINALIZACIÓN SIN EVIDENCIA DE VERIFICACIÓN FRESCA, garantizando el cumplimiento del principio fundamental de Evidencia antes que reclamaciones, siempre.","fr":"Habilite les agents à faire valoir des allégations basées sur des preuves avec des preuves de vérification fraîches, en exploitant la Loi de Fer de PAS DE RÉCLAMATIONS DE COMPLÉTION SANS PREUVES DE VÉRIFICATION FRAÎCHES, en garantissant le respect du principe fondamental de Preuves avant les allégations, toujours.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, evidenzbasierte Behauptungen mit frischer Verifizierungsevidenz geltend zu machen, indem es das eiserne Gesetz von KEINE ABSCHLUSSBEHAUPTUNGEN OHNE FRISCHE VERIFIZIERUNGSEVIDENZ nutzt, und damit die Einhaltung des Grundprinzips der Evidenz vor Behauptungen sicherstellt, immer.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor alegações baseadas em evidências com provas de verificação recente, aproveitando a Lei de Ferro de NENHUMA ALEGACAO DE CONCLUSAO SEM PROVAS DE VERIFICACAO RECENTE, garantindo a adesão ao princípio fundamental de Evidências antes de alegações, sempre.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью утверждать обоснованные заявления с помощью свежих доказательств верификации, используя Железный Закон НЕТ ЗАЯВЛЕНИЙ О ЗАВЕРШЕНИИ БЕЗ СВЕЖИХ ДОКАЗАТЕЛЬСТВ ВЕРИФИКАЦИИ, гарантируя соблюдение основного принципа Доказательства до заявлений, всегда.","ar":"تمكن العميل من فرض المطالبات القائمة على الأدلة مع أدلة التحقق الجديد، مستفيداً من قانون الحديد لا مطالبات إكمال بدون أدلة تحقق جديدة، مما يضمن الالتزام بمبدأ الأدلة قبل المطالبات، دائماً."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating completion claims with automated verification commands","Generating fresh verification evidence for claims","Enforcing the Iron Law in development workflows"],"zh":["使用自动化验证命令验证完成主张","为主张生成新鲜的验证证据","在开发工作流中强制执行铁律"],"ja":["自動検証コマンドを使用して完了主張を検証する","主張のために新しい検証証拠を生成する","開発ワークフローで鉄則を強制する"],"ko":["자동화 검증 명령을 사용하여 완료 주장을 검증하는 것","주장의 새로운 검증 증거를 생성하는 것","개발 워크플ロー에서 철칙을 강제하는 것"],"es":["Validar reclamaciones de finalización con comandos de verificación automatizados","Generar evidencia de verificación fresca para reclamaciones","Hacer cumplir la Ley de Hierro en flujos de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Valider les allégations de complétion avec des commandes de vérification automatisées","Générer des preuves de vérification fraîches pour les allégations","Faire respecter la Loi de Fer dans les flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Abgeschlossene Ansprüche mit automatisierten Überprüfungsbefehlen validieren","Frische Verifizierungsevidenz für Ansprüche generieren","Das eiserne Gesetz in Entwicklungswerkflüssen durchsetzen"],"pt":["Validar alegações de conclusão com comandos de verificação automatizados","Gerar provas de verificação recente para alegações","Impor a Lei de Ferro nos fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Проверять заявления об окончании с помощью автоматизированных команд верификации","Генерировать свежие доказательства верификации для заявлений","Внедрять Железный Закон в рабочих процессах разработки"],"ar":["التحقق من مطالبات الإكمال مع أوامر التحقق المُتَوسطة","توليد أدلة تحقق جديدة للمطالبات","تطبيق قانون الحديد في سير عمل التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to the Iron Law","Violating the letter of the rule violates the spirit of the rule","Fresh verification evidence must be provided for all completion claims"],"zh":["需要严格遵守铁律","违反规则的字面意思就是违反规则的精神","所有完成主张都必须提供新鲜的验证证据"],"ja":["鉄則を厳格に遵守する必要がある","規則の文字を违反すると規則の精神も違反する","すべての完了主張に対して新しい検証証拠を提供する必要がある"],"ko":["철칙을 엄격하게遵守해야 함","규칙의 문자를 위반하면 규칙의 정신도 위반함","모든 완료 주장에 대해서 새로운 검증 증거를 제공해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adherencia a la Ley de Hierro","Violando la letra de la regla se viola el espíritu de la regla","Deben proporcionarse evidencia de verificación fresca para todas las reclamaciones de finalización"],"fr":["Nécessite une stricte adhésion à la Loi de Fer","En violant la lettre de la règle, on viole l''esprit de la règle","Des preuves de vérification fraîches doivent être fournies pour toutes les allégations de complétion"],"de":["Erfordert eine strikte Einhaltung des eisernen Gesetzes","Die Verletzung des Buchstabens der Regel verletzt den Geist der Regel","Für alle Abgeschlossene Ansprüche muss frische Verifizierungsevidenz bereitgestellt werden"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita à Lei de Ferro","Violar a letra da regra viola o espírito da regra","Provas de verificação recente devem ser fornecidas para todas as alegações de conclusão"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения Железного Закона","Нарушение буквы правила нарушает дух правила","Свежие доказательства верификации должны быть предоставлены для всех заявлений об окончании"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام الصارم بقانون الحديد","مخالفة حرفة القاعدة تمثل مخالفة لروح القاعدة","يجب تقديم أدلة تحقق جديدة لجميع مطالبات الإكمال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
