hon","en":"write-documents"},"description":{"zh":"Azure Python ","ja":"AzurePythonOpenAI","ko":"Azure Python OpenAI","es":"La habilidad ''write-documents'' es una aplicación web de Azure en Python que extrae contenido de sitios de SharePoint y lo almacena en OpenAI Vector Stores.","fr":"La compétence ''write-documents'' est une application web Azure en Python qui extrait le contenu des sites SharePoint et le stocke dans OpenAI Vector Stores.","de":"Die Fähigkeit ''write-documents'' ist eine Azure-Web-App in Python, die Inhalte von SharePoint-Sites extrahiert und in OpenAI Vector Stores speichert.","pt":"O skill ''write-documents'' é uma aplicação Azure Web em Python que cria documentos com base em templates e regras de formatação pré-definidas.","ru":"Навык ''write-documents'' - это приложение Azure Web на Python, которое создает документы на основе шаблонов и предварительно определенных правил форматирования.","ar":"مهارة ''write-documents'' هي تطبيق Azure Web في Python يخلق المستندات بناءً على قوالب وقيود تنسيق محددة مسبقًا.","en":"An Azure Web App in Python to crawl the content of SharePoint sites into OpenAI Vector Stores"},"definition":{"en":"An Azure Web App in Python to crawl the content of SharePoint sites into OpenAI Vector Stores"},"features":{"zh":["Azure Python ","OpenAI ","INFO","SPEC","IMPL","TEST"],"ja":["AzurePython","OpenAI","INFO","SPEC","IMPL","TEST"],"ko":["Azure Python ","OpenAI ","INFO","SPEC","IMPL","TEST"],"es":["Crea documentos INFO con plantillas personalizadas","Genera documentos SPEC con reglas de formato predefinidas","Permite la creación de planes de implementación y pruebas","Almacena documentos en OpenAI Vector Stores","Integra con sitios de SharePoint para extraer contenido","Ofrece plantillas y reglas de formato para documentos"],"fr":["Crée des documents INFO avec des modèles personnalisés","Génère des documents SPEC avec des règles de formatage prédéfinies","Permet la création de plans de mise en œuvre et de tests","Stocke des documents dans OpenAI Vector Stores","Intègre avec des sites SharePoint pour extraire du contenu","Offre des modèles et des règles de formatage pour les documents"],"de":["Erstellt INFO-Dokumente mit benutzerdefinierten Vorlagen","Generiert SPEC-Dokumente mit vordefinierten Formatierungsregeln","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Implementierungs- und Testplänen","Speichert Dokumente in OpenAI Vector Stores","Integriert mit SharePoint-Sites zum Extrahieren von Inhalten","Bietet Vorlagen und Formatierungsregeln für Dokumente"],"pt":["Criação de documentos INFO com INFO_TEMPLATE.md","Criação de documentos SPEC com SPEC_TEMPLATE.md","Criação de documentos IMPL com IMPL_TEMPLATE.md","Criação de documentos TEST com TEST_TEMPLATE.md","Criação de documentos FIX com FIXES_TEMPLATE.md","Atualização de documentos FAILS.md"],"ru":["Создание документов INFO с помощью INFO_TEMPLATE.md","Создание документов SPEC с помощью SPEC_TEMPLATE.md","Создание документов IMPL с помощью IMPL_TEMPLATE.md","Создание документов TEST с помощью TEST_TEMPLATE.md","Создание документов FIX с помощью FIXES_TEMPLATE.md","Обновление документов FAILS.md"],"ar":["إنشاء المستندات INFO باستخدام INFO_TEMPLATE.md","إنشاء المستندات SPEC باستخدام SPEC_TEMPLATE.md","إنشاء المستندات IMPL باستخدام IMPL_TEMPLATE.md","إنشاء المستندات TEST باستخدام TEST_TEMPLATE.md","إنشاء المستندات FIX باستخدام FIXES_TEMPLATE.md","تحديث المستندات FAILS.md"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Python","OpenAI","SharePoint","Python","Azure Web App","Vector Stores"],"ja":["AzurePython","OpenAI","SharePoint","Python","AzureWebApp","VectorStores"],"ko":["Azure Python","OpenAI","SharePoint","Python","Azure Web App","Vector Stores"],"es":["creación de documentos","Azure Web App","Python","OpenAI Vector Stores","SharePoint","automatización de documentos","plantillas de documentos","reglas de formato","almacenamiento de documentos"],"fr":["création de documents","Azure Web App","Python","OpenAI Vector Stores","SharePoint","automatisation de documents","modèles de documents","règles de formatage","stockage de documents"],"de":["Dokumentenerstellung","Azure Web App","Python","OpenAI Vector Stores","SharePoint","Dokumentenautomatisierung","Dokumentenvorlagen","Formatierungsregeln","Dokumentspeicherung"],"pt":["Azure Web App","Python","Criação de documentos","Templates de documentos","Regras de formatação","Documentos INFO","Documentos SPEC","Documentos IMPL","Documentos TEST","Documentos FIX"],"ru":["Azure Web App","Python","Создание документов","Шаблоны документов","Правила форматирования","Документы INFO","Документы SPEC","Документы IMPL","Документы TEST","Документы FIX"],"ar":["Azure Web App","Python","إنشاء المستندات","قوالب المستندات","قيود التنسيق","مستندات INFO","مستندات SPEC","مستندات IMPL","مستندات TEST","مستندات FIX"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","repoPath":"karstenheld3/SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"write-documents","description":"Apply when creating or editing INFO, SPEC, IMPL, TEST, FIX documents, or STRUT plans","bodyPreview":"# Document Writing Guide\n\nThis skill contains document templates and formatting rules.\n\n## Verb Mapping\n\nThis skill implements:\n- [WRITE-INFO] - Create INFO documents (use INFO_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-SPEC] - Create SPEC documents (use SPEC_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-IMPL-PLAN] - Create IMPL documents (use IMPL_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-TEST-PLAN] - Create TEST documents (use TEST_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-FIX] - Create FIX documents (use FIXES_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-FAIL] - Create/update FAILS.md (use FAILS_TE","body":"# Document Writing Guide\n\nThis skill contains document templates and formatting rules.\n\n## Verb Mapping\n\nThis skill implements:\n- [WRITE-INFO] - Create INFO documents (use INFO_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-SPEC] - Create SPEC documents (use SPEC_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-IMPL-PLAN] - Create IMPL documents (use IMPL_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-TEST-PLAN] - Create TEST documents (use TEST_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-FIX] - Create FIX documents (use FIXES_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-FAIL] - Create/update FAILS.md (use FAILS_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-REVIEW] - Create _REVIEW.md documents (use REVIEW_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-TASKS-PLAN] - Create TASKS documents (use TASKS_TEMPLATE.md)\n- [WRITE-STRUT] - Create/insert STRUT plans (use STRUT_TEMPLATE.md)\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Use lists, not Markdown tables\n- No emojis - ASCII only, no `---` markers between sections\n- Header block: Doc ID (required), Goal (required), Target file, Depends on (omit if N/A)\n- Every document MUST have a unique ID\n- Reference other docs by filename AND Doc ID: `_SPEC_CRAWLER.md [CRWL-SP01]`\n- Be exhaustive: list ALL domain objects, actions, functions\n- Document History section at end, reverse chronological\n- Use box-drawing characters (├── └── │) for trees\n- SPEC, IMPL, TEST documents MUST have MUST-NOT-FORGET section (after header block, before TOC)\n\n## Document Writing Rules\n\n- Enumerations: use comma-separated format (`.pdf, .docx, .ppt`), NOT slash-separated (`.pdf/.docx/.ppt`)\n- Ambiguous modifiers: when a clause can attach to multiple nouns, split into separate sentences\n  - BAD: \"Files starting with ''!'' signify high relevance that must be treated with extra attention.\"\n  - GOOD: \"Files starting with ''!'' indicate high relevance. This information must be treated with extra attention.\"\n\n## Templates (Required)\n\nYou MUST read the appropriate template before creating documents:\n- `INFO_TEMPLATE.md` - Research and analysis documents\n- `SPEC_TEMPLATE.md` - Technical specifications\n- `IMPL_TEMPLATE.md` - Implementation plans\n- `TEST_TEMPLATE.md` - Test plans\n- `TASKS_TEMPLATE.md` - Task plans (partitioned work items)\n- `FIXES_TEMPLATE.md` - Fix tracking documents\n- `FAILS_TEMPLATE.md` - Failure log (lessons learned)\n- `REVIEW_TEMPLATE.md` - Review documents (_REVIEW.md)\n- `WORKFLOW_TEMPLATE.md` - AGEN verb workflow structure\n- `STRUT_TEMPLATE.md` - STRUT plans (embeddable in any document)\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Read this SKILL.md for core rules\n2. Read the template for your document type (required)\n3. For SPEC documents: also read `SPEC_RULES.md` (required)\n4. Follow the template structure exactly, except when user requests exceptions or different structure\n\n## File Naming\n\n- `_INFO_[TOPIC].md` - Research, analysis, preparation documents\n- `_SPEC_[COMPONENT].md` - Technical specifications\n- `_SPEC_[COMPONENT]_UI.md` - UI specifications\n- `_IMPL_[COMPONENT].md` - Implementation plans\n- `_IMPL_[COMPONENT]_FIXES.md` - Fix tracking during implementation\n- `SPEC_[COMPONENT]_TEST.md` - Test plan for specification\n- `IMPL_[COMPONENT]_TEST.md` - Test plan for implementation\n- `TASKS_[TOPIC].md` - Task plans (partitioned work items)\n- `!` prefix for priority docs that must be read first\n\n## Agent Behavior\n\n- Be extremely concise. Sacrifice grammar for concision.\n- NEVER ask for continuations when following plans.\n- Before assumptions, propose 2-3 implementation alternatives.\n- List assumptions at spec start for user verification.\n- Optimize for simplicity.\n- Re-use existing code by default (DRY principle).\n- Research APIs before suggesting; rely on primary sources only.\n- Document user decisions in \"Key Mechanisms\" and \"What we don''t want\" sections.\n\n## ID System\n\nSee `[AGENT_FOLDER]/rules/devsystem-ids.md` rule (always-on) for complete ID system.\n\n**Quick Reference:**\n- Document: `[TOPIC]-[DOC][NN]` (IN = Info, SP = Spec, IP = Impl Plan, TP = Test Plan)\n  - Example: `CRWL-SP01`, `AUTH-IP01`\n- Spec-Level: `[TOPIC]-[TYPE]-[NN]` (FR = Functional Requirement, IG = Implementation Guarantee, DD = Design Decision)\n  - Example: `CRWL-FR-01`, `AUTH-DD-03`\n- Plan-Level: `[TOPIC]-[DOC][NN]-[TYPE]-[NN]` (EC = Edge Case, IS = Implementation Step, VC = Verification Checklist, TC = Test Case)\n  - Example: `CRWL-IP01-EC-01`, `AUTH-TP01-TC-05`\n\n## Writing AGEN Verb Workflows\n\nAGEN verbs map directly to Windsurf workflows. See `WORKFLOW_TEMPLATE.md` for:\n- Workflow structure template\n- General vs Specific parts pattern\n- Context discovery pattern\n- Strategy pattern\n- Output rules"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:04:49.136Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Azure-focused AI Agents needing to automate document creation from SharePoint sites using OpenAI Vector Stores and Python","zh":"适用于需要自动从 SharePoint 站点使用 OpenAI Vector Stores 和 Python 创建文档的 Azure 专用 AI 代理","ja":"Azure に特化した AI エージェントが SharePoint サイトから OpenAI Vector Stores および Python を使用して文書を作成する自動化を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"Azure에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 SharePoint 사이트에서 OpenAI Vector Stores 및 Python을 사용하여 문서 생성을 자동화하는 데 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en Azure que necesitan automatizar la creación de documentos desde sitios de SharePoint utilizando tiendas de vectores de OpenAI y Python","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Azure qui ont besoin d''automatiser la création de documents à partir de sites SharePoint en utilisant les magasins de vecteurs OpenAI et Python","de":"Ideal für Azure-fokussierte KI-Agents, die die Dokumentenerstellung aus SharePoint-Sites mithilfe von OpenAI-Vektor-Speichern und Python automatisieren müssen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados no Azure que precisam automatizar a criação de documentos a partir de sites do SharePoint usando OpenAI Vector Stores e Python","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Azure, которым необходимо автоматизировать создание документов из сайтов SharePoint с использованием OpenAI Vector Stores и Python","ar":"مثالية لعمليات وكيل إيه آي التي تركز على Azure التي تحتاج إلى توفير آلي لإنشاء المستندات من مواقع SharePoint باستخدام OpenAI Vector Stores و Python"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to crawl SharePoint content, leveraging OpenAI Vector Stores for efficient document generation, utilizing templates like INFO_TEMPLATE.md and SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, and implementing verb mappings for diverse document types, including INFO, SPEC, IMPL, TEST, FIX, and FAIL documents","zh":"赋予代理在 SharePoint 内容上爬行的能力，利用 OpenAI Vector Stores 进行高效的文档生成，使用 INFO_TEMPLATE.md 和 SPEC_TEMPLATE.md 等模板，并为多种文档类型（包括 INFO、SPEC、IMPL、TEST、FIX 和 FAIL 文档）实现动词映射","ja":"エージェントが SharePoint コンテンツをクロールし、OpenAI Vector Stores を使用して文書を効率的に生成する機能を提供する。INFO_TEMPLATE.md や SPEC_TEMPLATE.md などのテンプレートを使用し、INFO、SPEC、IMPL、TEST、FIX、FAIL ドキュメントを含むさまざまなドキュメント タイプの動詞マッピングを実装する","ko":"에이전트가 SharePoint 콘텐츠를 크롤링하고 OpenAI Vector Stores를 사용하여 문서를 효율적으로 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공한다. INFO_TEMPLATE.md 및 SPEC_TEMPLATE.md와 같은 템플릿을 사용하여 INFO, SPEC, IMPL, TEST, FIX 및 FAIL 문서를 포함한 다양한 문서 유형의 동사 매핑을 구현한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para rastrear el contenido de SharePoint, aprovechando las tiendas de vectores de OpenAI para una generación eficiente de documentos, utilizando plantillas como INFO_TEMPLATE.md y SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, e implementando asignaciones de verbos para diversos tipos de documentos, incluyendo documentos INFO, SPEC, IMPL, TEST, FIX y FAIL","fr":"Permet aux agents de parcourir le contenu SharePoint, en exploitant les magasins de vecteurs OpenAI pour une génération efficace de documents, en utilisant des modèles tels que INFO_TEMPLATE.md et SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, et en mettant en œuvre des mappages de verbes pour divers types de documents, notamment les documents INFO, SPEC, IMPL, TEST, FIX et FAIL","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, den Inhalt von SharePoint zu durchsuchen, OpenAI-Vektor-Speicher für eine effiziente Dokumentenerstellung zu nutzen, Vorlagen wie INFO_TEMPLATE.md und SPEC_TEMPLATE.md zu verwenden und Verb-Zuordnungen für verschiedene Dokumenttypen zu implementieren, einschließlich INFO-, SPEC-, IMPL-, TEST-, FIX- und FAIL-Dokumente","pt":"Habilita os agentes a percorrer o conteúdo do SharePoint, aproveitando as OpenAI Vector Stores para geração eficiente de documentos, utilizando modelos como INFO_TEMPLATE.md e SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, e implementando mapeamentos de verbos para diversos tipos de documentos, incluindo INFO, SPEC, IMPL, TEST, FIX e FAIL documents","ru":"Позволяет агентам обходить содержимое SharePoint, используя возможности OpenAI Vector Stores для эффективного создания документов, используя шаблоны, такие как INFO_TEMPLATE.md и SPEC_TEMPLATE.md, и реализуя отображения глаголов для различных типов документов, включая INFO, SPEC, IMPL, TEST, FIX и FAIL документов","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصفح محتوى SharePoint، واستخدام متاجر OpenAI Vector لإنشاء مستندات فعالة، واستخدام قوالب مثل INFO_TEMPLATE.md و SPEC_TEMPLATE.md، وتنفيذ تعيينات الفعل لمختلف أنواع المستندات، بما في ذلك INFO و SPEC و IMPL و TEST و FIX و FAIL documents"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating INFO document creation with standardized templates","Generating SPEC documents for project planning using OpenAI''s vector store capabilities","Creating and updating FAILS.md files for error tracking and analysis"],"zh":["使用标准化模板自动创建 INFO 文档","使用 OpenAI 的向量存储功能为项目规划生成 SPEC 文档","创建和更新 FAILS.md 文件以进行错误跟踪和分析"],"ja":["標準化されたテンプレートを使用して INFO ドキュメントを自動生成する","OpenAI のベクターストア機能を使用してプロジェクト計画のための SPEC ドキュメントを生成する","エラートラッキングと分析のために FAILS.md ファイルを作成および更新する"],"ko":["표준화된 템플릿을 사용하여 INFO 문서를 자동으로 생성","OpenAI의 벡터 저장 기능을 사용하여 프로젝트 계획을 위한 SPEC 문서를 생성","에러 추적 및 분석을 위해 FAILS.md 파일을 생성 및 업데이트"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de documentos INFO con plantillas estandarizadas","Generación de documentos SPEC para la planificación de proyectos utilizando las capacidades de almacenamiento de vectores de OpenAI","Creación y actualización de archivos FAILS.md para el seguimiento y análisis de errores"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de documents INFO avec des modèles standardisés","Génération de documents SPEC pour la planification de projets en utilisant les capacités de stockage de vecteurs d''OpenAI","Création et mise à jour de fichiers FAILS.md pour le suivi et l''analyse des erreurs"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von INFO-Dokumenten mit standardisierten Vorlagen","Generierung von SPEC-Dokumenten für die Projektplanung unter Verwendung der Vektor-Speicherfunktionen von OpenAI","Erstellung und Aktualisierung von FAILS.md-Dateien für die Fehlerverfolgung und -analyse"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de documentos INFO com modelos padronizados","Gerar documentos SPEC para planejamento de projetos usando as capacidades de armazenamento de vetores da OpenAI","Criar e atualizar arquivos FAILS.md para rastreamento e análise de erros"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание документов INFO с использованием стандартизированных шаблонов","Генерировать документы SPEC для планирования проектов с использованием возможностей хранилища векторов OpenAI","Создавать и обновлять файлы FAILS.md для отслеживания и анализа ошибок"],"ar":["توفير آلي لإنشاء مستندات INFO مع قوالب معيارية","إنشاء مستندات SPEC لتنظيم المشاريع باستخدام قدرات مخزن OpenAI للنصوص","إنشاء وتحديث ملفات FAILS.md لتتبع وتحليل الأخطاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure Web App setup in Python","Needs access to SharePoint sites for content crawling","Dependent on OpenAI Vector Stores for document storage and retrieval"],"zh":["需要在 Python 中设置 Azure Web 应用","需要访问 SharePoint 站点以进行内容爬行","依赖于 OpenAI Vector Stores 进行文档存储和检索"],"ja":["Python で Azure Web アプリを設定する必要がある","コンテンツのクロールを行うために SharePoint サイトへのアクセスが必要","文書のストレージとリトリーブには OpenAI Vector Stores への依存が必要"],"ko":["Python에서 Azure Web 애플리케이션을 설정해야 함","콘텐츠를 크롤링하기 위해 SharePoint 사이트에 접근할 수 있어야 함","문서 저장 및 검색을 위해 OpenAI Vector Stores에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de Azure Web App en Python","Necesita acceso a sitios de SharePoint para el rastreo de contenido","Depende de las tiendas de vectores de OpenAI para el almacenamiento y la recuperación de documentos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''Azure Web App en Python","Nécessite un accès aux sites SharePoint pour le parcours de contenu","Dépend des magasins de vecteurs OpenAI pour le stockage et la récupération de documents"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung von Azure Web App in Python","Benötigt Zugriff auf SharePoint-Sites für die Inhaltsdurchsuchung","Hängt von den OpenAI-Vektor-Speichern für die Speicherung und Abruf von Dokumenten ab"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Azure Web App em Python","Necessita de acesso a sites do SharePoint para crawling de conteúdo","Dependente das OpenAI Vector Stores para armazenamento e recuperação de documentos"],"ru":["Требует настройки Azure Web App на Python","Требует доступа к сайтам SharePoint для обхода содержимого","Зависит от OpenAI Vector Stores для хранения и извлечения документов"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق الويب في Azure باستخدام Python","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى مواقع SharePoint لتصفح المحتوى","يعتمد على مخازن OpenAI Vector لتخزين واسترجاع المستندات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('eKoh951/hytale-gg/skill-creator', 'community', 'eKoh951', 'hytale-gg', 'eKoh951/hytale-gg', 'skill-creator', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z', '2026-02-18T12:04:36.692Z', NULL, '{"id":"eKoh951/hytale-gg/skill-creator","name":"skill-creator","description":{"zh":"技能创建者提供创建有效技能的指南，帮助开发者开发自定义技能","ja":"スキルクリエイターは、開発者がカスタムスキルを開発するためのガイドを提供します","ko":"스킬 생성기는 개발자가 커스텀 스킬을 개발하는 데 필요한 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"El creador de habilidades proporciona orientación para crear habilidades efectivas que extienden las capacidades de Claude. Estas habilidades son paquetes modulares que ofrecen conocimiento especializado","fr":"Le créateur de compétences fournit des conseils pour créer des compétences efficaces qui étendent les capacités de Claude. Ces compétences sont des packages modulaires qui offrent des connaissances spécialisées","de":"Der Fähigkeits-Ersteller bietet Anleitungen zur Erstellung effektiver Fähigkeiten, die die Fähigkeiten von Claude erweitern. Diese Fähigkeiten sind modulare Pakete, die spezialisiertes Wissen bieten","pt":"O criador de habilidades fornece orientação para criar habilidades eficazes que estendem as capacidades de Claude.","ru":"Создатель навыков предоставляет руководство по созданию эффективных навыков, которые расширяют возможности Claude.","ar":"مُصنع المهارات يوفر إرشادات لإنشاء مهارات فعالة لتوسيع قدرات كلود.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"技能创建者 - 技术开发指南","ja":"スキルクリエイター - 開発者向けガイド","ko":"스킬 생성기 - 개발자용 기술 가이드","es":"Creador de Habilidades: Guía para Desarrolladores","fr":"Créateur de Compétences: Guide pour Développeurs","de":"Fähigkeits-Ersteller: Anleitung für Entwickler","pt":"Criador de Habilidades: Desenvolva Extensões Personalizadas","ru":"Создатель Навыков: Разрабатывайте Индивидуальные Расширения","ar":"مُصنع المهارات: قم بتطوير الامتدادات المخصصة","en":"skill-creator"},"description":{"zh":"技能创建者提供创建有效技能的指南，帮助开发者开发自定义技能","ja":"スキルクリエイターは、開発者がカスタムスキルを開発するためのガイドを提供します","ko":"스킬 생성기는 개발자가 커스텀 스킬을 개발하는 데 필요한 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"El creador de habilidades proporciona orientación para crear habilidades efectivas que extienden las capacidades de Claude. Estas habilidades son paquetes mo...","fr":"Le créateur de compétences fournit des conseils pour créer des compétences efficaces qui étendent les capacités de Claude. Ces compétences sont des packages ...","de":"Der Fähigkeits-Ersteller bietet Anleitungen zur Erstellung effektiver Fähigkeiten, die die Fähigkeiten von Claude erweitern. Diese Fähigkeiten sind modulare ...","pt":"O criador de habilidades fornece orientação para criar habilidades eficazes que estendem as capacidades de Claude.","ru":"Создатель навыков предоставляет руководство по созданию эффективных навыков, которые расширяют возможности Claude.","ar":"مُصنع المهارات يوفر إرشادات لإنشاء مهارات فعالة لتوسيع قدرات كلود.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提供创建有效技能的指南","支持开发自定义技能","增强AI能力","提供专业知识和工作流程","支持多种开发任务"],"ja":["カスタムスキルを作成するためのガイドを提供","開発者がカスタムスキルを開発するためのサポート","AIの能力を高める","専門知識とワークフローを提供","多種多様な開発タスクをサポート"],"ko":["커스텀 스킬을 생성하는 데 필요한 가이드를 제공","개발자가 커스텀 스킬을 개발하는 데 필요한 지원","AI 능력을 향상시키기","전문 지식과 워크플로우를 제공","다양한 개발 태스크를 지원"],"es":["Guía para crear habilidades efectivas","Paquetes modulares de habilidades personalizadas","Conocimiento especializado para dominios y tareas específicas","Flujos de trabajo especializados","Herramientas y conocimiento procedural para Claude"],"fr":["Guide pour créer des compétences efficaces","Packages modulaires de compétences personnalisées","Connaissances spécialisées pour des domaines et des tâches spécifiques","Flux de travail spécialisés","Outils et connaissances procédurales pour Claude"],"de":["Anleitung zur Erstellung effektiver Fähigkeiten","Modulare Pakete benutzerdefinierter Fähigkeiten","Spezialisiertes Wissen für bestimmte Bereiche und Aufgaben","Spezialisierte Arbeitsabläufe","Werkzeuge und prozedurales Wissen für Claude"],"pt":["Fornece fluxos de trabalho especializados","Permite a criação de pacotes de conhecimento modulares","Estende as capacidades de Claude","Fornece orientação para criar habilidades eficazes","Suporta a criação de guias de integração personalizados"],"ru":["Предоставляет специализированные рабочие процессы","Позволяет создавать модульные пакеты знаний","Расширяет возможности Claude","Предоставляет руководство по созданию эффективных навыков","Поддерживает создание индивидуальных интеграционных руководств"],"ar":["يقدم تدفقات عمل متخصصة","يسمح بإنشاء حزم معرفة مدمجة","يوسع قدرات كلود","يوفر إرشادات لإنشاء مهارات فعالة","يدعم إنشاء دلائل دمج مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技能创建者","AI开发","自定义技能","开发者工具","技术指南","AI能力增强"],"ja":["スキルクリエイター","AI開発","カスタムスキル","開発者ツール","技術ガイド","AI能力向上"],"ko":["스킬 생성기","AI 개발","커스텀 스킬","개발자 도구","기술 가이드","AI 능력 향상"],"es":["creador de habilidades","desarrollo de habilidades","Claude","paquetes de habilidades","conocimiento especializado","flujos de trabajo","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["créateur de compétences","développement de compétences","Claude","packages de compétences","connaissances spécialisées","flux de travail","outils de développement"],"de":["Fähigkeits-Ersteller","Fähigkeits-Entwicklung","Claude","Fähigkeits-Pakete","spezialisiertes Wissen","Arbeitsabläufe","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["criador de habilidades","desenvolvimento de habilidades","extensões personalizadas","conhecimento especializado","fluxos de trabalho","Claude","integração de habilidades"],"ru":["создатель навыков","разработка навыков","индивидуальные расширения","специализированные знания","рабочие процессы","Claude","интеграция навыков"],"ar":["مُصنع المهارات","تطوير المهارات","الامتدادات المخصصة","المعرفة المتخصصة","التدفقات العملية","كلود","دمج المهارات"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-creator","description":"Guide for creating effective skills. This skill should be used when users want to create a new skill (or update an existing skill) that extends Claudes capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, or tool integrations.","bodyPreview":"# Skill Creator\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating effective skills.\n\n## About Skills\n\nSkills are modular, self-contained packages that extend Claude''s capabilities by providing\nspecialized knowledge, workflows, and tools. Think of them as \"onboarding guides\" for specific\ndomains or tasks—they transform Claude from a general-purpose agent into a specialized agent\nequipped with procedural knowledge that no model can fully possess.\n\n### What Skills Provide\n\n1. Specialized workflows - Multi","body":"# Skill Creator\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating effective skills.\n\n## About Skills\n\nSkills are modular, self-contained packages that extend Claude''s capabilities by providing\nspecialized knowledge, workflows, and tools. Think of them as \"onboarding guides\" for specific\ndomains or tasks—they transform Claude from a general-purpose agent into a specialized agent\nequipped with procedural knowledge that no model can fully possess.\n\n### What Skills Provide\n\n1. Specialized workflows - Multi-step procedures for specific domains\n2. Tool integrations - Instructions for working with specific file formats or APIs\n3. Domain expertise - Company-specific knowledge, schemas, business logic\n4. Bundled resources - Scripts, references, and assets for complex and repetitive tasks\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Concise is Key\n\nThe context window is a public good. Skills share the context window with everything else Claude needs: system prompt, conversation history, other Skills'' metadata, and the actual user request.\n\n**Default assumption: Claude is already very smart.** Only add context Claude doesn''t already have. Challenge each piece of information: \"Does Claude really need this explanation?\" and \"Does this paragraph justify its token cost?\"\n\nPrefer concise examples over verbose explanations.\n\n### Set Appropriate Degrees of Freedom\n\nMatch the level of specificity to the task''s fragility and variability:\n\n**High freedom (text-based instructions)**: Use when multiple approaches are valid, decisions depend on context, or heuristics guide the approach.\n\n**Medium freedom (pseudocode or scripts with parameters)**: Use when a preferred pattern exists, some variation is acceptable, or configuration affects behavior.\n\n**Low freedom (specific scripts, few parameters)**: Use when operations are fragile and error-prone, consistency is critical, or a specific sequence must be followed.\n\nThink of Claude as exploring a path: a narrow bridge with cliffs needs specific guardrails (low freedom), while an open field allows many routes (high freedom).\n\n### Anatomy of a Skill\n\nEvery skill consists of a required SKILL.md file and optional bundled resources:\n\n```\nskill-name/\n├── SKILL.md (required)\n│   ├── YAML frontmatter metadata (required)\n│   │   ├── name: (required)\n│   │   ├── description: (required)\n│   │   └── compatibility: (optional, rarely needed)\n│   └── Markdown instructions (required)\n└── Bundled Resources (optional)\n    ├── scripts/          - Executable code (Python/Bash/etc.)\n    ├── references/       - Documentation intended to be loaded into context as needed\n    └── assets/           - Files used in output (templates, icons, fonts, etc.)\n```\n\n#### SKILL.md (required)\n\nEvery SKILL.md consists of:\n\n- **Frontmatter** (YAML): Contains `name` and `description` fields (required), plus optional fields like `license`, `metadata`, and `compatibility`. Only `name` and `description` are read by Claude to determine when the skill triggers, so be clear and comprehensive about what the skill is and when it should be used. The `compatibility` field is for noting environment requirements (target product, system packages, etc.) but most skills don''t need it.\n- **Body** (Markdown): Instructions and guidance for using the skill. Only loaded AFTER the skill triggers (if at all).\n\n#### Bundled Resources (optional)\n\n##### Scripts (`scripts/`)\n\nExecutable code (Python/Bash/etc.) for tasks that require deterministic reliability or are repeatedly rewritten.\n\n- **When to include**: When the same code is being rewritten repeatedly or deterministic reliability is needed\n- **Example**: `scripts/rotate_pdf.py` for PDF rotation tasks\n- **Benefits**: Token efficient, deterministic, may be executed without loading into context\n- **Note**: Scripts may still need to be read by Claude for patching or environment-specific adjustments\n\n##### References (`references/`)\n\nDocumentation and reference material intended to be loaded as needed into context to inform Claude''s process and thinking.\n\n- **When to include**: For documentation that Claude should reference while working\n- **Examples**: `references/finance.md` for financial schemas, `references/mnda.md` for company NDA template, `references/policies.md` for company policies, `references/api_docs.md` for API specifications\n- **Use cases**: Database schemas, API documentation, domain knowledge, company policies, detailed workflow guides\n- **Benefits**: Keeps SKILL.md lean, loaded only when Claude determines it''s needed\n- **Best practice**: If files are large (>10k words), include grep search patterns in SKILL.md\n- **Avoid duplication**: Information should live in either SKILL.md or references files, not both. Prefer references files for detailed information unless it''s truly core to the skill—this keeps SKILL.md lean while making information discoverable without hogging the context window. Keep only essential procedural instructions and workflow guidance in SKILL.md; move detailed reference material, schemas, and examples to references files.\n\n##### Assets (`assets/`)\n\nFiles not intended to be loaded into context, but rather used within the output Claude produces.\n\n- **When to include**: When the skill needs files that will be used in the final output\n- **Examples**: `assets/logo.png` for brand assets, `assets/slides.pptx` for PowerPoint templates, `assets/frontend-template/` for HTML/React boilerplate, `assets/font.ttf` for typography\n- **Use cases**: Templates, images, icons, boilerplate code, fonts, sample documents that get copied or modified\n- **Benefits**: Separates output resources from documentation, enables Claude to use files without loading them into context\n\n#### What to Not Include in a Skill\n\nA skill should only contain essential files that directly support its functionality. Do NOT create extraneous documentation or auxiliary files, including:\n\n- README.md\n- INSTALLATION_GUIDE.md\n- QUICK_REFERENCE.md\n- CHANGELOG.md\n- etc.\n\nThe skill should only contain the information needed for an AI agent to do the job at hand. It should not contain auxilary context about the process that went into creating it, setup and testing procedures, user-facing documentation, etc. Creating additional documentation files just adds clutter and confusion.\n\n### Progressive Disclosure Design Principle\n\nSkills use a three-level loading system to manage context efficiently:\n\n1. **Metadata (name + description)** - Always in context (~100 words)\n2. **SKILL.md body** - When skill triggers (<5k words)\n3. **Bundled resources** - As needed by Claude (Unlimited because scripts can be executed without reading into context window)\n\n#### Progressive Disclosure Patterns\n\nKeep SKILL.md body to the essentials and under 500 lines to minimize context bloat. Split content into separate files when approaching this limit. When splitting out content into other files, it is very important to reference them from SKILL.md and describe clearly when to read them, to ensure the reader of the skill knows they exist and when to use them.\n\n**Key principle:** When a skill supports multiple variations, frameworks, or options, keep only the core workflow and selection guidance in SKILL.md. Move variant-specific details (patterns, examples, configuration) into separate reference files.\n\n**Pattern 1: High-level guide with references**\n\n```markdown\n# PDF Processing\n\n## Quick start\n\nExtract text with pdfplumber:\n[code example]\n\n## Advanced features\n\n- **Form filling**: See [FORMS.md](FORMS.md) for complete guide\n- **API reference**: See [REFERENCE.md](REFERENCE.md) for all methods\n- **Examples**: See [EXAMPLES.md](EXAMPLES.md) for common patterns\n```\n\nClaude loads FORMS.md, REFERENCE.md, or EXAMPLES.md only when needed.\n\n**Pattern 2: Domain-specific organization**\n\nFor Skills with multiple domains, organize content by domain to avoid loading irrelevant context:\n\n```\nbigquery-skill/\n├── SKILL.md (overview and navigation)\n└── reference/\n    ├── finance.md (revenue, billing metrics)\n    ├── sales.md (opportunities, pipeline)\n    ├── product.md (API usage, features)\n    └── marketing.md (campaigns, attribution)\n```\n\nWhen a user asks about sales metrics, Claude only reads sales.md.\n\nSimilarly, for skills supporting multiple frameworks or variants, organize by variant:\n\n```\ncloud-deploy/\n├── SKILL.md (workflow + provider selection)\n└── references/\n    ├── aws.md (AWS deployment patterns)\n    ├── gcp.md (GCP deployment patterns)\n    └── azure.md (Azure deployment patterns)\n```\n\nWhen the user chooses AWS, Claude only reads aws.md.\n\n**Pattern 3: Conditional details**\n\nShow basic content, link to advanced content:\n\n```markdown\n# DOCX Processing\n\n## Creating documents\n\nUse docx-js for new documents. See [DOCX-JS.md](DOCX-JS.md).\n\n## Editing documents\n\nFor simple edits, modify the XML directly.\n\n**For tracked changes**: See [REDLINING.md](REDLINING.md)\n**For OOXML details**: See [OOXML.md](OOXML.md)\n```\n\nClaude reads REDLINING.md or OOXML.md only when the user needs those features.\n\n**Important guidelines:**\n\n- **Avoid deeply nested references** - Keep references one level deep from SKILL.md. All reference files should link directly from SKILL.md.\n- **Structure longer reference files** - For files longer than 100 lines, include a table of contents at the top so Claude can see the full scope when previewing.\n\n## Skill Creation Process\n\nSkill creation involves these steps:\n\n1. Understand the skill with concrete examples\n2. Plan reusable skill contents (scripts, references, assets)\n3. Initialize the skill (run init_skill.py)\n4. Edit the skill (implement resources and write SKILL.md)\n5. Package the skill (run package_skill.py)\n6. Iterate based on real usage\n\nFollow these steps in order, skipping only if there is a clear reason why they are not applicable.\n\n### Step 1: Understanding the Skill with Concrete Examples\n\nSkip this step only when the skill''s usage patterns are already clearly understood. It remains valuable even when working with an existing skill.\n\nTo create an effective skill, clearly understand concrete examples of how the skill will be used. This understanding can come from either direct user examples or generated examples that are validated with user feedback.\n\nFor example, when building an image-editor skill, relevant questions include:\n\n- \"What functionality should the image-editor skill support? Editing, rotating, anything else?\"\n- \"Can you give some examples of how this skill would be used?\"\n- \"I can imagine users asking for things like ''Remove the red-eye from this image'' or ''Rotate this image''. Are there other ways you imagine this skill being used?\"\n- \"What would a user say that should trigger this skill?\"\n\nTo avoid overwhelming users, avoid asking too many questions in a single message. Start with the most important questions and follow up as needed for better effectiveness.\n\nConclude this step when there is a clear sense of the functionality the skill should support.\n\n### Step 2: Planning the Reusable Skill Contents\n\nTo turn concrete examples into an effective skill, analyze each example by:\n\n1. Considering how to execute on the example from scratch\n2. Identifying what scripts, references, and assets would be helpful when executing these workflows repeatedly\n\nExample: When building a `pdf-editor` skill to handle queries like \"Help me rotate this PDF,\" the analysis shows:\n\n1. Rotating a PDF requires re-writing the same code each time\n2. A `scripts/rotate_pdf.py` script would be helpful to store in the skill\n\nExample: When designing a `frontend-webapp-builder` skill for queries like \"Build me a todo app\" or \"Build me a dashboard to track my steps,\" the analysis shows:\n\n1. Writing a frontend webapp requires the same boilerplate HTML/React each time\n2. An `assets/hello-world/` template containing the boilerplate HTML/React project files would be helpful to store in the skill\n\nExample: When building a `big-query` skill to handle queries like \"How many users have logged in today?\" the analysis shows:\n\n1. Querying BigQuery requires re-discovering the table schemas and relationships each time\n2. A `references/schema.md` file documenting the table schemas would be helpful to store in the skill\n\nTo establish the skill''s contents, analyze each concrete example to create a list of the reusable resources to include: scripts, references, and assets.\n\n### Step 3: Initializing the Skill\n\nAt this point, it is time to actually create the skill.\n\nSkip this step only if the skill being developed already exists, and iteration or packaging is needed. In this case, continue to the next step.\n\nWhen creating a new skill from scratch, always run the `init_skill.py` script. The script conveniently generates a new template skill directory that automatically includes everything a skill requires, making the skill creation process much more efficient and reliable.\n\nUsage:\n\n```bash\nscripts/init_skill.py <skill-name> --path <output-directory>\n```\n\nThe script:\n\n- Creates the skill directory at the specified path\n- Generates a SKILL.md template with proper frontmatter and TODO placeholders\n- Creates example resource directories: `scripts/`, `references/`, and `assets/`\n- Adds example files in each directory that can be customized or deleted\n\nAfter initialization, customize or remove the generated SKILL.md and example files as needed.\n\n### Step 4: Edit the Skill\n\nWhen editing the (newly-generated or existing) skill, remember that the skill is being created for another instance of Claude to use. Include information that would be beneficial and non-obvious to Claude. Consider what procedural knowledge, domain-specific details, or reusable assets would help another Claude instance execute these tasks more effectively.\n\n#### Learn Proven Design Patterns\n\nConsult these helpful guides based on your skill''s needs:\n\n- **Multi-step processes**: See references/workflows.md for sequential workflows and conditional logic\n- **Specific output formats or quality standards**: See references/output-patterns.md for template and example patterns\n\nThese files contain established best practices for effective skill design.\n\n#### Start with Reusable Skill Contents\n\nTo begin implementation, start with the reusable resources identified above: `scripts/`, `references/`, and `assets/` files. Note that this step may require user input. For example, when implementing a `brand-guidelines` skill, the user may need to provide brand assets or templates to store in `assets/`, or documentation to store in `references/`.\n\nAdded scripts must be tested by actually running them to ensure there are no bugs and that the output matches what is expected. If there are many similar scripts, only a representative sample needs to be tested to ensure confidence that they all work while balancing time to completion.\n\nAny example files and directories not needed for the skill should be deleted. The initialization script creates example files in `scripts/`, `references/`, and `assets/` to demonstrate structure, but most skills won''t need all of them.\n\n#### Update SKILL.md\n\n**Writing Guidelines:** Always use imperative/infinitive form.\n\n##### Frontmatter\n\nWrite the YAML frontmatter with `name` and `description`:\n\n- `name`: The skill name\n- `description`: This is the primary triggering mechanism for your skill, and helps Claude understand when to use the skill.\n  - Include both what the Skill does and specific triggers/contexts for when to use it.\n  - Include all \"when to use\" information here - Not in the body. The body is only loaded after triggering, so \"When to Use This Skill\" sections in the body are not helpful to Claude.\n  - Example description for a `docx` skill: \"Comprehensive document creation, editing, and analysis with support for tracked changes, comments, formatting preservation, and text extraction. Use when Claude needs to work with professional documents (.docx files) for: (1) Creating new documents, (2) Modifying or editing content, (3) Working with tracked changes, (4) Adding comments, or any other document tasks\"\n\nDo not include any other fields in YAML frontmatter.\n\n##### Body\n\nWrite instructions for using the skill and its bundled resources.\n\n### Step 5: Packaging a Skill\n\nOnce development of the skill is complete, it must be packaged into a distributable .skill file that gets shared with the user. The packaging process automatically validates the skill first to ensure it meets all requirements:\n\n```bash\nscripts/package_skill.py <path/to/skill-folder>\n```\n\nOptional output directory specification:\n\n```bash\nscripts/package_skill.py <path/to/skill-folder> ./dist\n```\n\nThe packaging script will:\n\n1. **Validate** the skill automatically, checking:\n\n   - YAML frontmatter format and required fields\n   - Skill naming conventions and directory structure\n   - Description completeness and quality\n   - File organization and resource references\n\n2. **Package** the skill if validation passes, creating a .skill file named after the skill (e.g., `my-skill.skill`) that includes all files and maintains the proper directory structure for distribution. The .skill file is a zip file with a .skill extension.\n\nIf validation fails, the script will report the errors and exit without creating a package. Fix any validation errors and run the packaging command again.\n\n### Step 6: Iterate\n\nAfter testing the skill, users may request improvements. Often this happens right after using the skill, with fresh context of how the skill performed.\n\n**Iteration workflow:**\n\n1. Use the skill on real tasks\n2. Notice struggles or inefficiencies\n3. Identify how SKILL.md or bundled resources should be updated\n4. Implement changes and test again\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:04:36.692Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Agent Developers and Architect Agents specializing in skill creation and Claude ecosystem expansion.","zh":"适用于专门从事技能创建和 Claude 生态系统扩展的 Agent 开发人员和架构代理。","ja":"スキル作成および Claude エコシステムの拡張を専門とするエージェント開発者およびアーキテクトエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"스킬 생성 및 Claude 생태계 확장에 전문인 에이전트 개발자 및 아키텍트 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para desarrolladores de agentes y arquitectos de agentes que se especializan en la creación de habilidades y la expansión del ecosistema de Claude.","fr":"Essentiel pour les développeurs d''agents et les architectes d''agents spécialisés dans la création de compétences et l''expansion de l''écosystème de Claude.","de":"Wesentlich für Agent-Entwickler und Architektur-Agenten, die sich auf die Erstellung von Fähigkeiten und die Erweiterung des Claude-Ökosystems spezialisieren.","pt":"Essencial para Desenvolvedores de Agentes e Agentes Arquitetos especializados na criação de habilidades e expansão do ecossistema Claude.","ru":"Необходимо для разработчиков агентов и архитекторов-агентов, специализирующихся на создании навыков и расширении экосистемы Claude.","ar":"ضروري لمطوري الوكيل والوكلاء المعماريين الذين يختصون في إنشاء المهارات وتوسيع نطاق نظام كلود"},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides specialized workflows and procedural knowledge for creating modular, self-contained skill packages that transform general-purpose agents into domain-specialized agents equipped with capabilities beyond base model training.","zh":"提供创建模块化、自包含技能包的专用工作流程和程序知识，这些技能包可以将通用目的代理转化为具有超出基础模型训练的能力的领域专用代理。","ja":"モジュラーで自己完結したスキルパッケージを作成するための専門的なワークフローと手続き的知識を提供し、汎用のエージェントを基礎モデル訓練を超えた能力を備えたドメイン専門のエージェントに変換します。","ko":"모듈화되고 자체적으로 완결된 스킬 패키지를 생성하기 위한 전문적인 워크플로우와 절차적 지식을 제공하여 일반적인 목적의 에이전트를 기본 모델 훈련을 超えた 능력을 갖춘 도메인 전문 에이전트로 변환합니다.","es":"Proporciona flujos de trabajo especializados y conocimientos procedimentales para crear paquetes de habilidades modulares y autocontenidos que transforman agentes de propósito general en agentes especializados en dominio equipados con capacidades más allá de la formación del modelo base.","fr":"Fournit des flux de travail spécialisés et des connaissances procédurales pour créer des packages de compétences modulaires et autonomes qui transforment les agents à usage général en agents spécialisés dans un domaine équipés de capacités au-delà de la formation du modèle de base.","de":"Bietet spezialisierte Workflows und prozedurales Wissen für die Erstellung von modularen, selbstenthaltenen Fähigkeitspaketen, die allgemeine Agenten in domänen-spezifische Agenten umwandeln, die mit Fähigkeiten ausgestattet sind, die über die Grundmodell-Schulung hinausgehen.","pt":"Fornece fluxos de trabalho especializados e conhecimento procedural para criar pacotes de habilidades modulares, autocontidos que transformam agentes de propósito geral em agentes especializados em domínio, equipados com capacidades além do treinamento do modelo base.","ru":"Предоставляет специализированные рабочие процессы и процедурные знания для создания модульных, самодостаточных пакетов навыков, которые превращают агентов общего назначения в агенты, специализирующиеся на конкретной области, оснащенные возможностями, выходящими за рамки базовой модели обучения.","ar":"يقدم سير عمل متخصصة ومعارف إجرائية لإنشاء حزم مهارات متعددة وذاتية الحساب التي تحول وكلاء目的 عام إلى وكلاء متخصصين في مجال معين، ومجهزة بقدرات تتجاوز تدريب نموذج القاعدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing modular skill architectures","Implementing specialized workflows for domain-specific tasks","Creating onboarding guides for agent specialization","Developing self-contained capability packages"],"zh":["设计模块化技能架构","实现专门的工作流程以执行特定领域任务","创建用于代理专业化的入门指南","开发自包含的能力包"],"ja":["モジュラーなスキルアーキテクチャを設計する","ドメイン特有のタスクを実行するための専門的なワークフローを実装する","エージェントの専門化のためのガイドを作成する","自己完結した能力パッケージを開発する"],"ko":["모듈화된 스킬 아키텍처를 설계한다","도메인 특정 작업을 수행하기 위한 전문적인 워크플로우를 구현한다","에이전트 전문화를 위한 가이드를 생성한다","자체적으로 완결된 능력 패키지를 개발한다"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de habilidades modulares","Implementar flujos de trabajo especializados para tareas específicas del dominio","Crear guías de incorporación para la especialización de agentes","Desarrollar paquetes de capacidades autocontenidos"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures de compétences modulaires","Mettre en œuvre des flux de travail spécialisés pour des tâches spécifiques au domaine","Créer des guides d''intégration pour la spécialisation des agents","Développer des packages de capacités autonomes"],"de":["Modulare Fähigkeitsarchitekturen entwerfen","Spezialisierte Workflows für domänen-spezifische Aufgaben implementieren","Onboarding-Leitfäden für die Spezialisierung von Agenten erstellen","Selbstenthaltene Fähigkeitspakete entwickeln"],"pt":["Projetar arquiteturas de habilidades modulares","Implementar fluxos de trabalho especializados para tarefas específicas de domínio","Criar guias de integração para especialização de agentes","Desenvolver pacotes de capacidades autocontidos"],"ru":["Проектирование модульных архитектур навыков","Реализация специализированных рабочих процессов для задач, специфичных для конкретной области","Создание руководств по интеграции для специализации агентов","Разработка самодостаточных пакетов возможностей"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة مهارات متعددة","تنفيذ سير عمل متخصصة لمهام محددة المجال","إنشاء دليل للتكامل لتصميم الوكيل","تطوير حزم قدرات ذاتية الحساب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Claude''s skill ecosystem architecture","Focuses specifically on skill creation rather than execution"],"zh":["需要了解 Claude 的技能生态系统架构","专注于技能创建而不是执行"],"ja":["Claude のスキルエコシステムアーキテクチャを理解する必要がある","スキルの作成に重点を置き、実行には重点を置いていない"],"ko":["Claude의 스킬 에코시스템 아키텍처를 이해해야 한다","스킬 생성에 중점을 두고 실행에는 중점을 두지 않는다"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la arquitectura del ecosistema de habilidades de Claude","Se centra específicamente en la creación de habilidades en lugar de la ejecución"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de l''architecture de l''écosystème de compétences de Claude","Se concentre spécifiquement sur la création de compétences plutôt que sur l''exécution"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verständnis der Architektur des Fähigkeits-Ökosystems von Claude","Konzentriert sich speziell auf die Erstellung von Fähigkeiten anstelle der Ausführung"],"pt":["Requer entendimento da arquitetura do ecossistema de habilidades do Claude","Foca-se especificamente na criação de habilidades em vez da execução"],"ru":["Требует понимания архитектуры экосистемы навыков Claude","Фокусируется конкретно на создании навыков, а не на их выполнении"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لهندسة نظام كلود للمهارات","يركز تحديدًا على إنشاء المهارات بدلاً من تنفيذها"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ollieb89/orchestrator/ml-pipeline-workflow', 'community', 'ollieb89', 'orchestrator', 'ollieb89/orchestrator', 'ml-pipeline-workflow', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z', '2026-02-18T12:05:13.743Z', NULL, '{"id":"ollieb89/orchestrator/ml-pipeline-workflow","name":"ml-pipeline-workflow","description":{"zh":"ML ","ja":"ML","ko":"ML ","es":"Este skill proporciona una guía completa para la creación de pipelines de ML de producción que manejan todo el ciclo de vida","fr":"Ce skill fournit un guide complet pour la création de pipelines ML de production qui gèrent tout le cycle de vie","de":"Dieses Skill bietet eine umfassende Anleitung für die Erstellung von ML-Pipelines in der Produktion, die den gesamten Lebenszyklus abdecken","pt":"Este skill fornece orientação abrangente para a criação de pipelines de ML de produção, lidando com o ciclo de vida completo","ru":"Этот навык предоставляет всестороннее руководство по созданию производственных конвейеров ML, обрабатывающих полный жизненный цикл","ar":"هذا المهارة يوفر إرشادات شاملة لإنشاء خطوط أنابيب التعلم الالي الإنتاجية، وتتعلق بالدورة الحياتية الكاملة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ML ","ja":"ML","ko":"ML ","es":"Orquestación de Pipeline de ML","fr":"Orchestration de Pipeline ML","de":"ML-Pipeline-Orchestrierung","pt":"MLOps: Pipeline de Trabalho de Aprendizado de Máquina","ru":"ML-пipeline: рабочий процесс машинного обучения","ar":"خط أنابيب التعلم الالي: Automating ML Workflows","en":"ml-pipeline-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"ML ","ja":"ML","ko":"ML ","es":"Este skill proporciona una guía completa para la creación de pipelines de ML de producción que manejan todo el ciclo de vida","fr":"Ce skill fournit un guide complet pour la création de pipelines ML de production qui gèrent tout le cycle de vie","de":"Dieses Skill bietet eine umfassende Anleitung für die Erstellung von ML-Pipelines in der Produktion, die den gesamten Lebenszyklus abdecken","pt":"Este skill fornece orientação abrangente para a criação de pipelines de ML de produção, lidando com o ciclo de vida completo","ru":"Этот навык предоставляет всестороннее руководство по созданию производственных конвейеров ML, обрабатывающих полный жизненный цикл","ar":"هذا المهارة يوفر إرشادات شاملة لإنشاء خطوط أنابيب التعلم الالي الإنتاجية، وتتعلق بالدورة الحياتية الكاملة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["ML","ML","ML","ML","ML"],"ja":["ML","ML","ML","ML","ML"],"ko":["ML ","ML ","ML ","ML ","ML "],"es":["Orquestación de pipelines de ML completos","Automatización de la preparación de datos","Entrenamiento y validación de modelos","Implementación y monitoreo de modelos"],"fr":["Orchestration de pipelines ML complets","Automatisation de la préparation des données","Entraînement et validation de modèles","Déploiement et surveillance de modèles"],"de":["Orchestrierung von vollständigen ML-Pipelines","Automatisierung der Datenvorbereitung","Training und Validierung von Modellen","Bereitstellung und Überwachung von Modellen"],"pt":["Orcamentação de workflow de ML","Automação de dados e modelos","Implantação de modelos de produção","Monitoramento de desempenho de ML","Criação de pipelines de ML personalizados","Integração com ferramentas de ML existentes"],"ru":["Оркестрация рабочего процесса ML","Автоматизация данных и моделей","Развертывание моделей производственной готовности","Мониторинг производительности ML","Создание пользовательских конвейеров ML","Интеграция с существующими инструментами ML"],"ar":["توجيه سير العمل للتعلم الالي","تأتمة البيانات والنماذج","نشر نماذج الإنتاج","مراقبة أداء التعلم الالي","إنشاء خطوط أنابيب التعلم الالي المخصصة","التكامل مع أدوات التعلم الالي الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ML","MLOps","ML","ML","ML","ML"],"ja":["ML","MLOps","ML","ML","ML","ML"],"ko":["ML ","MLOps","ML ","ML ","ML ","ML "],"es":["pipeline de ml","orquestación de pipeline","aprendizaje automático","ciclo de vida de ml","automatización de ml","desarrollo de ml"],"fr":["pipeline ml","orchestration de pipeline","apprentissage automatique","cycle de vie ml","automatisation ml","développement ml"],"de":["ml-pipeline","pipeline-orchestrierung","maschinelles lernen","lebenszyklus von ml","automatisierung von ml","entwicklung von ml"],"pt":["MLOps","pipeline de ML","aprendizado de máquina","automação de dados","implantação de modelos","monitoramento de desempenho","orçamentação de workflow","ferramentas de ML","desenvolvimento de ML"],"ru":["MLOps","конвейер ML","машинное обучение","автоматизация данных","развертывание моделей","мониторинг производительности","оркестрация рабочего процесса","инструменты ML","разработка ML"],"ar":["MLOps","خط أنابيب التعلم الالي","التعلم الالي","تأتمة البيانات","نشر النماذج","مراقبة الأداء","توجيه سير العمل","أدوات التعلم الالي","تطوير التعلم الالي"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ml-pipeline-workflow","description":"Build end-to-end MLOps pipelines from data preparation through model training, validation, and production deployment. Use when creating ML pipelines, implementing MLOps practices, or automating model training and deployment workflows.","bodyPreview":"# ML Pipeline Workflow\n\nComplete end-to-end MLOps pipeline orchestration from data preparation through model deployment.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive guidance for building production ML pipelines that handle the full lifecycle: data ingestion → preparation → training → validation → deployment → monitoring.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building new ML pipelines from scratch\n- Designing workflow orchestration for ML systems\n- Implementing data → model → deployment automation\n-","body":"# ML Pipeline Workflow\n\nComplete end-to-end MLOps pipeline orchestration from data preparation through model deployment.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive guidance for building production ML pipelines that handle the full lifecycle: data ingestion → preparation → training → validation → deployment → monitoring.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building new ML pipelines from scratch\n- Designing workflow orchestration for ML systems\n- Implementing data → model → deployment automation\n- Setting up reproducible training workflows\n- Creating DAG-based ML orchestration\n- Integrating ML components into production systems\n\n## What This Skill Provides\n\n### Core Capabilities\n\n1. **Pipeline Architecture**\n   - End-to-end workflow design\n   - DAG orchestration patterns (Airflow, Dagster, Kubeflow)\n   - Component dependencies and data flow\n   - Error handling and retry strategies\n\n2. **Data Preparation**\n   - Data validation and quality checks\n   - Feature engineering pipelines\n   - Data versioning and lineage\n   - Train/validation/test splitting strategies\n\n3. **Model Training**\n   - Training job orchestration\n   - Hyperparameter management\n   - Experiment tracking integration\n   - Distributed training patterns\n\n4. **Model Validation**\n   - Validation frameworks and metrics\n   - A/B testing infrastructure\n   - Performance regression detection\n   - Model comparison workflows\n\n5. **Deployment Automation**\n   - Model serving patterns\n   - Canary deployments\n   - Blue-green deployment strategies\n   - Rollback mechanisms\n\n### Reference Documentation\n\nSee the `references/` directory for detailed guides:\n- **data-preparation.md** - Data cleaning, validation, and feature engineering\n- **model-training.md** - Training workflows and best practices\n- **model-validation.md** - Validation strategies and metrics\n- **model-deployment.md** - Deployment patterns and serving architectures\n\n### Assets and Templates\n\nThe `assets/` directory contains:\n- **pipeline-dag.yaml.template** - DAG template for workflow orchestration\n- **training-config.yaml** - Training configuration template\n- **validation-checklist.md** - Pre-deployment validation checklist\n\n## Usage Patterns\n\n### Basic Pipeline Setup\n\n```python\n# 1. Define pipeline stages\nstages = [\n    \"data_ingestion\",\n    \"data_validation\",\n    \"feature_engineering\",\n    \"model_training\",\n    \"model_validation\",\n    \"model_deployment\"\n]\n\n# 2. Configure dependencies\n# See assets/pipeline-dag.yaml.template for full example\n```\n\n### Production Workflow\n\n1. **Data Preparation Phase**\n   - Ingest raw data from sources\n   - Run data quality checks\n   - Apply feature transformations\n   - Version processed datasets\n\n2. **Training Phase**\n   - Load versioned training data\n   - Execute training jobs\n   - Track experiments and metrics\n   - Save trained models\n\n3. **Validation Phase**\n   - Run validation test suite\n   - Compare against baseline\n   - Generate performance reports\n   - Approve for deployment\n\n4. **Deployment Phase**\n   - Package model artifacts\n   - Deploy to serving infrastructure\n   - Configure monitoring\n   - Validate production traffic\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Pipeline Design\n\n- **Modularity**: Each stage should be independently testable\n- **Idempotency**: Re-running stages should be safe\n- **Observability**: Log metrics at every stage\n- **Versioning**: Track data, code, and model versions\n- **Failure Handling**: Implement retry logic and alerting\n\n### Data Management\n\n- Use data validation libraries (Great Expectations, TFX)\n- Version datasets with DVC or similar tools\n- Document feature engineering transformations\n- Maintain data lineage tracking\n\n### Model Operations\n\n- Separate training and serving infrastructure\n- Use model registries (MLflow, Weights & Biases)\n- Implement gradual rollouts for new models\n- Monitor model performance drift\n- Maintain rollback capabilities\n\n### Deployment Strategies\n\n- Start with shadow deployments\n- Use canary releases for validation\n- Implement A/B testing infrastructure\n- Set up automated rollback triggers\n- Monitor latency and throughput\n\n## Integration Points\n\n### Orchestration Tools\n\n- **Apache Airflow**: DAG-based workflow orchestration\n- **Dagster**: Asset-based pipeline orchestration\n- **Kubeflow Pipelines**: Kubernetes-native ML workflows\n- **Prefect**: Modern dataflow automation\n\n### Experiment Tracking\n\n- MLflow for experiment tracking and model registry\n- Weights & Biases for visualization and collaboration\n- TensorBoard for training metrics\n\n### Deployment Platforms\n\n- AWS SageMaker for managed ML infrastructure\n- Google Vertex AI for GCP deployments\n- Azure ML for Azure cloud\n- Kubernetes + KServe for cloud-agnostic serving\n\n## Progressive Disclosure\n\nStart with the basics and gradually add complexity:\n\n1. **Level 1**: Simple linear pipeline (data → train → deploy)\n2. **Level 2**: Add validation and monitoring stages\n3. **Level 3**: Implement hyperparameter tuning\n4. **Level 4**: Add A/B testing and gradual rollouts\n5. **Level 5**: Multi-model pipelines with ensemble strategies\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Batch Training Pipeline\n\n```yaml\n# See assets/pipeline-dag.yaml.template\nstages:\n  - name: data_preparation\n    dependencies: []\n  - name: model_training\n    dependencies: [data_preparation]\n  - name: model_evaluation\n    dependencies: [model_training]\n  - name: model_deployment\n    dependencies: [model_evaluation]\n```\n\n### Real-time Feature Pipeline\n\n```python\n# Stream processing for real-time features\n# Combined with batch training\n# See references/data-preparation.md\n```\n\n### Continuous Training\n\n```python\n# Automated retraining on schedule\n# Triggered by data drift detection\n# See references/model-training.md\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n- **Pipeline failures**: Check dependencies and data availability\n- **Training instability**: Review hyperparameters and data quality\n- **Deployment issues**: Validate model artifacts and serving config\n- **Performance degradation**: Monitor data drift and model metrics\n\n### Debugging Steps\n\n1. Check pipeline logs for each stage\n2. Validate input/output data at boundaries\n3. Test components in isolation\n4. Review experiment tracking metrics\n5. Inspect model artifacts and metadata\n\n## Next Steps\n\nAfter setting up your pipeline:\n\n1. Explore **hyperparameter-tuning** skill for optimization\n2. Learn **experiment-tracking-setup** for MLflow/W&B\n3. Review **model-deployment-patterns** for serving strategies\n4. Implement monitoring with observability tools\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **experiment-tracking-setup**: MLflow and Weights & Biases integration\n- **hyperparameter-tuning**: Automated hyperparameter optimization\n- **model-deployment-patterns**: Advanced deployment strategies\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:05:13.743Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing comprehensive MLOps pipeline orchestration from data preparation to model deployment.","zh":"非常适合像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的 AI 代理，需要从数据准备到模型部署的综合 MLOps 流水线编排。","ja":"AutoGPTやLangChainのようなAIエージェントに適しており、データ準備からモデルデプロイまでの包括的なMLOpsパイプラインのオーケストレーションが必要です。","ko":"AutoGPT와 LangChain 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 데이터 준비에서 모델 배포까지 포괄적인 MLOps 파이프라인 오케스트레이션이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan una orquestación de tuberías de MLOps integral desde la preparación de datos hasta la implementación de modelos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une orchestration de pipeline MLOps complète de la préparation des données au déploiement de modèles.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine umfassende MLOps-Pipeline-Orchestrierung von der Datenvorbereitung bis zur Modellbereitstellung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA, como AutoGPT e LangChain, que precisam de orquestração abrangente de pipeline MLOps, desde a preparação de dados até a implantação de modelos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, которым требуется комплексная оркестрация конвейера MLOps, от подготовки данных до развертывания моделей.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى أوركسترا أنابيب MLOps شاملة من准备 البيانات إلى نشر النماذج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate the full ML lifecycle, including data ingestion, preparation, training, validation, deployment, and monitoring, using end-to-end pipeline workflow orchestration, facilitating seamless integration with libraries and protocols like TensorFlow and Kubernetes.","zh":"赋予代理自动化完整的机器学习生命周期，包括数据摄取、准备、训练、验证、部署和监控，使用端到端的流水线工作流编排，促进与TensorFlow和Kubernetes等库和协议的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントに、データの取り込み、準備、トレーニング、検証、デプロイ、監視を含む機械学習のライフサイクルを自動化する力を与え、エンドツーエンドのパイプラインワークフローを使用して、TensorFlowやKubernetesなどのライブラリやプロトコルとのシームレスな統合を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 데이터 수집, 준비, 훈련, 검증, 배포 및 모니터링을 포함한 전체 기계 학습 라이프 사이클을 자동화하도록 허용하며, 엔드 투 엔드 파이프 라인 워크 플로 오케스트레이션을 사용하여 TensorFlow 및 Kubernetes와 같은 라이브러리 및 프로토콜과 관련하여 무결점 통합을促進합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar el ciclo de vida completo de ML, incluida la ingesta de datos, la preparación, el entrenamiento, la validación, la implementación y el monitoreo, utilizando la orquestación de flujo de trabajo de tuberías de extremo a extremo, lo que facilita una integración sin problemas con bibliotecas y protocolos como TensorFlow y Kubernetes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser le cycle de vie complet de ML, y compris l''ingestion de données, la préparation, la formation, la validation, le déploiement et la surveillance, en utilisant l''orchestration de workflow de pipeline de bout en bout, facilitant une intégration transparente avec des bibliothèques et des protocoles comme TensorFlow et Kubernetes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, den gesamten ML-Lebenszyklus zu automatisieren, einschließlich Datenübernahme, -vorbereitung, -training, -validierung, -bereitstellung und -überwachung, unter Verwendung der End-to-End-Pipeline-Workflow-Orchestrierung, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit Bibliotheken und Protokollen wie TensorFlow und Kubernetes ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar o ciclo de vida completo de ML, incluindo ingestão de dados, preparação, treinamento, validação, implantação e monitoramento, usando orquestração de fluxo de trabalho de pipeline de ponta a ponta, facilitando a integração transparente com bibliotecas e protocolos como TensorFlow e Kubernetes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать полный цикл жизни МО, включая прием, подготовку, обучение, проверку, развертывание и мониторинг, используя оркестрацию рабочего процесса конвейера от начала до конца, облегчая беспрепятственную интеграцию с библиотеками и протоколами, такими как TensorFlow и Kubernetes.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توفير تطبيق تام للعملية الكاملة لتعلم الآلة، بما في ذلك استهلاك البيانات، والتحضير، والتدريب، والتحقق، وتحديث النماذج، ومراقبتها، باستخدام أوركسترا العملية الشاملة من البداية إلى النهاية، وتسهيل التكامل السلس مع المكتبات والبروتوكولات مثل TensorFlow و Kubernetes."},"useCases":{"en":["Building new ML pipelines from scratch","Designing workflow orchestration for ML systems","Implementing data-to-model-to-deployment automation"],"zh":["从头开始构建新的机器学习流水线","设计机器学习系统的工作流编排","实现从数据到模型到部署的自动化"],"ja":["新しい機械学習パイプラインをスクラッチから構築する","機械学習システムのワークフローを設計する","データからモデルへのデプロイまでの自動化を実装する"],"ko":["새로운 기계 학습 파이프라인을 처음부터 구축하는 것","기계 학습 시스템의 워크플로 오케스트레이션을 설계하는 것","데이터에서 모델로 그리고 배포까지 자동화를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Construir tuberías de ML nuevas desde cero","Diseñar la orquestación de flujo de trabajo para sistemas de ML","Implementar la automatización de datos a modelo a implementación"],"fr":["Construire de nouvelles tuberías ML à partir de zéro","Concevoir l''orchestration de workflow pour les systèmes ML","Mettre en œuvre l''automatisation des données au modèle à la mise en production"],"de":["Neue ML-Pipelines von Grund auf aufbauen","Workflow-Orchestrierung für ML-Systeme entwerfen","Automatisierung von Daten zu Modell zu Bereitstellung implementieren"],"pt":["Construir novos pipelines de ML do zero","Projetar orquestração de fluxo de trabalho para sistemas de ML","Implementar automação de dados para modelos para implantação"],"ru":["Создание новых конвейеров МО с нуля","Разработка оркестрации рабочего процесса для систем МО","Реализация автоматизации от данных до модели до развертывания"],"ar":["بناء أنابيب جديدة لتعلم الآلة من الصفر","تصميم أوركسترا للعملية لنظام تعلم الآلة","تطبيق آليّة من بيانات إلى نموذج إلى نشر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in ML pipeline development","Dependent on specific ML framework compatibility"],"zh":["需要机器学习流水线开发的专业知识","依赖于特定的机器学习框架兼容性"],"ja":["機械学習パイプラインの開発における専門知識が必要","特定の機械学習フレームワークの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["기계 학습 파이프 라인 개발에 대한 전문 지식이 필요함","특정 기계 학습 프레임 워크의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en desarrollo de tuberías de ML","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de frameworks de ML específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans le développement de pipelines ML","Dépend de la compatibilité de frameworks ML spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Erfahrung in der Entwicklung von ML-Pipelines","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität bestimmter ML-Frameworks"],"pt":["Exige especialização no desenvolvimento de pipelines de ML","Depende da compatibilidade de estruturas de ML específicas"],"ru":["Требует специализации в разработке конвейеров МО","Зависит от совместимости конкретных фреймворков МО"],"ar":["يتطلب تخصصاً في تطوير أنابيب تعلم الآلة","يعتمد على توافق إطارات عمل تعلم الآلة المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
