ar melhorias","Guia para escrita de componentes React","Melhores práticas para busca de dados","Otimização de código para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации улучшений","Руководство для написания компонентов React","Лучшие практики для поиска данных","Оптимизация кода для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحديد الأولويات","دليل كتابة مكونات رياكت","أفضل الممارسات للبحث عن البيانات","تحسين الكود لتحقيق أفضل أداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React性能优化","Next.js性能优化","Vercel React","自动重构","代码生成","数据获取优化","代码打包优化"],"ja":["Reactパフォーマンス最適化","Next.jsパフォーマンス最適化","Vercel React","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","データ取得の最適化","コードバンドルの最適化"],"ko":["리액트 성능 최적화","넥스트.js 성능 최적화","버셀 리액트","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","데이터 가져오기 최적화","코드 번들 최적화"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","Next.js","React","desarrollo web","escalabilidad","rendimiento","refactoreo de código"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","Next.js","React","développement web","scalabilité","performances","réfactoration de code"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungs-Optimierung","Next.js","React","Web-Entwicklung","Skalierbarkeit","Leistung","Code-Refaktorisierung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Melhores práticas","Desenvolvimento web","Performance optimization"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Лучшие практики","Веб-разработка","Производительность"],"ar":["رياكت فيرسل","تحسين الأداء","رياكت","نيكست.جس","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير الويب","أداء"]}},"owner":"Acadbek","repo":"vercel","repoPath":"Acadbek/vercel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.506Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:05:56.740Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in React and Next.js applications, seeking to optimize performance and adhere to best practices","zh":"适合专注于 React 和 Next.js 应用程序的前端代理，旨在优化性能并遵循最佳实践","ja":"React および Next.js アプリケーションを専門とするフロントエンド エージェントに適しており、パフォーマンスを最適化し、ベストプラクティスに従うことを目指しています","ko":"React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션을 전문으로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 성능을 최적화하고 최선의 관행을 준수하려는 경우에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que se especializan en aplicaciones de React y Next.js, y buscan optimizar el rendimiento y cumplir con las mejores prácticas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend spécialisés dans les applications React et Next.js, cherchant à optimiser les performances et à respecter les meilleures pratiques","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf React- und Next.js-Anwendungen spezialisieren und die Leistung optimieren und den Best Practices folgen möchten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend especializados em aplicações React e Next.js, buscando otimizar o desempenho e seguir as melhores práticas","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на приложениях React и Next.js, стремящихся оптимизировать производительность и следовать лучшим практикам","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم المتخصص في تطبيقات React و Next.js ، يسعى لتحسين الأداء والالتزام بأفضل الممارسات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 57 rules across 8 categories, including data fetching, performance optimization, and bundling, with tools like TanStack Query, Sentry, and Clerk","zh":"赋予代理人自动重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别，包括数据获取、性能优化和打包，使用 TanStack Query、Sentry 和 Clerk 等工具","ja":"エージェントに React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって活用し、データ取得、パフォーマンス最適化、バンドルなど、TanStack Query、Sentry、Clerk などのツールを利用します","ko":"에이전트가 React 컴포넌트 및 Next.js 페이지에 대한 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 57개의 규칙을 8개 카테고리 전반에 걸쳐 활용하여 데이터 가져오기, 성능 최적화, 번들링 등을 TanStack Query, Sentry, Clerk 등의 도구를 사용하여 수행합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la refactoring y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, aprovechando 57 reglas en 8 categorías, incluyendo la recuperación de datos, la optimización del rendimiento y la agrupación, con herramientas como TanStack Query, Sentry y Clerk","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la réorganisation et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 57 règles dans 8 catégories, notamment la récupération de données, l''optimisation des performances et le regroupement, avec des outils comme TanStack Query, Sentry et Clerk","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien genutzt werden, einschließlich Datenabruf, Leistungsoptimierung und Bündelung, mit Tools wie TanStack Query, Sentry und Clerk","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a reestruturação e geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 57 regras em 8 categorias, incluindo busca de dados, otimização de desempenho e empacotamento, com ferramentas como TanStack Query, Sentry e Clerk","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях, включая получение данных, оптимизацию производительности и упаковку, с помощью инструментов seperti TanStack Query, Sentry и Clerk","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تلقيم إعادة هيكلة وجيل رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js ، باستخدام 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات ، بما في ذلك استرجاع البيانات وتحسين الأداء وتحزيم ، مع أدوات مثل TanStack Query و Sentry و Clerk"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for React applications","Generating optimized Next.js pages with TanStack Query","Refactoring existing React code for better performance and maintainability"],"zh":["为 React 应用程序自动执行性能优化","使用 TanStack Query 生成优化的 Next.js 页面","重构现有的 React 代码以获得更好的性能和可维护性"],"ja":["React アプリケーションのパフォーマンス最適化を自動化する","TanStack Query を使用して最適化された Next.js ページを生成する","既存の React コードをリファクタリングしてパフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を向上させる"],"ko":["React 애플리케이션을 위한 성능 최적화를 자동화하는 것","TanStack Query를 사용하여 최적화된 Next.js 페이지를 생성하는 것","기존 React 코드를 리팩토링하여 성능과 유지 보수성을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para aplicaciones de React","Generar páginas de Next.js optimizadas con TanStack Query","Refactorizar el código de React existente para un mejor rendimiento y mantenibilidad"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les applications React","Générer des pages Next.js optimisées avec TanStack Query","Réorganiser le code React existant pour une meilleure performance et maintenabilité"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für React-Anwendungen","Generieren von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit TanStack Query","Refaktorisieren des bestehenden React-Codes für eine bessere Leistung und Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para aplicações React","Gerar páginas Next.js otimizadas com TanStack Query","Reestruturar o código React existente para melhor desempenho e manutenção"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для приложений React","Генерировать оптимизированные страницы Next.js с TanStack Query","Рефакторить существующий код React для лучшей производительности и поддержки"],"ar":["تلقيم تحسين الأداء تلقائيًا لتطبيقات React ","توليد صفحات Next.js المُحسّنة مع TanStack Query","إعادة هيكلة رمز React الحالي من أجل تحسين الأداء والصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to applications using Vercel and supported libraries like Neon, Shadcn, and Drizzle"],"zh":["需要 React 和 Next.js 的知识","仅限于使用 Vercel 和支持的库，如 Neon、Shadcn 和 Drizzle 的应用程序"],"ja":["React と Next.js の知識が必要","Vercel とサポートされているライブラリ (Neon、Shadcn、Drizzle など) を使用するアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","Vercel 및 지원 라이브러리(Neon, Shadcn, Drizzle 등)를 사용하는 애플리케이션에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan Vercel y bibliotecas compatibles como Neon, Shadcn y Drizzle"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité aux applications qui utilisent Vercel et des bibliothèques prises en charge comme Neon, Shadcn et Drizzle"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die Vercel und unterstützte Bibliotheken wie Neon, Shadcn und Drizzle verwenden"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações que usam Vercel e bibliotecas compatíveis como Neon, Shadcn e Drizzle"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Ограничен приложениями, использующими Vercel и поддерживаемыми библиотеками, такими как Neon, Shadcn и Drizzle"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Next.js ","محدود للتطبيقات التي تستخدم Vercel والمكتبات المدعومة مثل Neon و Shadcn و Drizzle"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
