لاصطناعي","الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"ThinkEx-OSS","repo":"thinkex","repoPath":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"setup","description":"Setup and configure assistant-ui in a project. Use when installing packages, configuring runtimes, or troubleshooting setup issues.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui Setup\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/ai-sdk.md](./references/ai-sdk.md) -- AI SDK v6 setup (recommended)\n- [./references/langgraph.md](./references/langgraph.md) -- LangGraph agent setup\n- [./references/custom-backend.md](./references/custom-backend.md) -- useLocalRuntime / useExternalStoreRuntime\n- [./references/ag-ui.md](./references/ag-ui.md) -- AG-UI protocol\n- [./references/a2a","body":"# assistant-ui Setup\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/ai-sdk.md](./references/ai-sdk.md) -- AI SDK v6 setup (recommended)\n- [./references/langgraph.md](./references/langgraph.md) -- LangGraph agent setup\n- [./references/custom-backend.md](./references/custom-backend.md) -- useLocalRuntime / useExternalStoreRuntime\n- [./references/ag-ui.md](./references/ag-ui.md) -- AG-UI protocol\n- [./references/a2a.md](./references/a2a.md) -- A2A protocol\n- [./references/styling.md](./references/styling.md) -- Styling options\n- [./references/tanstack.md](./references/tanstack.md) -- TanStack Router\n\n## Pick Your Setup\n\n```\nUsing Vercel AI SDK?\n├─ Yes → useChatRuntime (recommended)\n└─ No\n   ├─ LangGraph agents? → useLangGraphRuntime\n   ├─ AG-UI protocol? → useAgUiRuntime\n   ├─ A2A protocol? → useA2ARuntime\n   ├─ External state (Redux/Zustand)? → useExternalStoreRuntime\n   └─ Custom API → useLocalRuntime\n```\n\n## Quick Start (AI SDK)\n\n```bash\nnpm install @assistant-ui/react @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk @ai-sdk/react ai @ai-sdk/openai\n```\n\n```tsx\n// app/page.tsx\n\"use client\";\nimport { AssistantRuntimeProvider, Thread } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\nimport { useChatRuntime, AssistantChatTransport } from \"@assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk\";\n\nexport default function Chat() {\n  const runtime = useChatRuntime({\n    transport: new AssistantChatTransport({ api: \"/api/chat\" }),\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <AssistantRuntimeProvider runtime={runtime}>\n      <Thread />\n    </AssistantRuntimeProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n```ts\n// app/api/chat/route.ts\nimport { openai } from \"@ai-sdk/openai\";\nimport { streamText } from \"ai\";\n\nexport async function POST(req: Request) {\n  const { messages } = await req.json();\n  const result = streamText({ model: openai(\"gpt-4o\"), messages });\n  return result.toUIMessageStreamResponse();\n}\n```\n\n## Styling\n\n```tsx\n// Option 1: Pre-built CSS\nimport \"@assistant-ui/styles/default.css\";\n\n// Option 2: Tailwind (add to tailwind.config.js)\ncontent: [\"./node_modules/@assistant-ui/react/dist/**/*.js\"]\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```env\nOPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...\nANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...\nNEXT_PUBLIC_ASSISTANT_BASE_URL=https://api.assistant-ui.com  # For cloud\n```\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n**\"Cannot find module @ai-sdk/react\"**\n```bash\nnpm install @ai-sdk/react\n```\n\n**Styles not applied**\n- Import CSS at root level or configure Tailwind content paths\n\n**Streaming not working**\n- Use `toUIMessageStreamResponse()` in API route\n- Check for CORS errors in console\n\n**\"runtime is undefined\"**\n- Call `useChatRuntime` inside a component, not at module level\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:07:02.309Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing customized user interface setup and integration with AI SDKs","zh":"非常适合需要定制用户界面设置和与AI SDK集成的AI代理","ja":"AIエージェントがカスタマイズされたユーザーインターフェース設定とAI SDKとの統合を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"사용자 인터페이스 설정과 AI SDK 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una configuración de interfaz de usuario personalizada y una integración con SDK de IA","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une configuration d''interface utilisateur personnalisée et une intégration avec des SDK IA","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächenkonfiguration und eine Integration mit KI-SDKs benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que necessitam de configuração personalizada de interface do utilizador e integração com SDKs de IA","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым требуется настройка пользовательского интерфейса и интеграция с ИИ SDK","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد واجهة مستخدم مخصصة والتكامل مع أدوات تطوير برمجيات الذكاء الاصطناعي (SDK)"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate with AI SDK v6, LangGraph, and custom backends using protocols like AG-UI, enabling seamless interaction with local runtime and external stores, and providing access to the latest API through assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","zh":"赋予代理集成AI SDK v6、LangGraph和使用AG-UI等协议的自定义后端的能力，实现与本地运行时和外部存储的无缝交互，并通过assistant-ui.com/llms.txt提供访问最新API的功能","ja":"エージェントがAI SDK v6、LangGraph、およびAG-UIなどのプロトコルを使用したカスタムバックエンドを統合できるようになり、ローカルランタイムと外部ストアとのシームレスなやり取りを可能にし、assistant-ui.com/llms.txtを介して最新のAPIへのアクセスを提供する","ko":"에이전트가 AI SDK v6, LangGraph 및 AG-UI와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하는 사용자 지정 백엔드를 통합할 수 있도록 하여 로컬 런타임 및 외부 저장소와의 무결점 상호 작용을 가능하게 하고 assistant-ui.com/llms.txt를 통해 최신 API에 접근할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrarse con AI SDK v6, LangGraph y backends personalizados que utilizan protocolos como AG-UI, lo que permite una interacción sin problemas con el tiempo de ejecución local y las tiendas externas, y proporciona acceso a la última API a través de assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer avec AI SDK v6, LangGraph et des backends personnalisés utilisant des protocoles tels que AG-UI, ce qui permet une interaction transparente avec le runtime local et les magasins externes, et fournit un accès à la dernière API via assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sich in AI SDK v6, LangGraph und benutzerdefinierte Backends mit Protokollen wie AG-UI zu integrieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Interaktion mit der lokalen Laufzeit und externen Speichern ermöglicht wird und Zugriff auf die neueste API über assistant-ui.com/llms.txt gewährt","pt":"Capacita os agentes a integrar com AI SDK v6, LangGraph e backends personalizados usando protocolos como AG-UI, permitindo uma interação perfeita com o runtime local e lojas externas, e fornecendo acesso à API mais recente através de assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","ru":"Позволяет агентам интегрироваться с AI SDK v6, LangGraph и пользовательскими бэкендами с использованием таких протоколов, как AG-UI, обеспечивая беспрерывное взаимодействие с локальной средой выполнения и внешними хранилищами, а также предоставляя доступ к последней версии API через assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من التكامل مع AI SDK v6 وLangGraph والخلفيات المخصصة باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل AG-UI، مما يتيح تفاعلاً سلساً مع وقت التشغيل المحلي والمخازن الخارجية، ويوفر الوصول إلى أحدث واجهة برمجة تطبيقات (API) عبر assistant-ui.com/llms.txt"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring AI SDK v6 for optimal performance","Setting up LangGraph agents for advanced language understanding","Implementing custom backends using useLocalRuntime and useExternalStoreRuntime"],"zh":["为AI SDK v6配置最佳性能","为高级语言理解设置LangGraph代理","使用useLocalRuntime和useExternalStoreRuntime实现自定义后端"],"ja":["AI SDK v6を最適なパフォーマンスで構成する","高度な言語理解のためのLangGraphエージェントを設定する","useLocalRuntimeとuseExternalStoreRuntimeを使用してカスタムバックエンドを実装する"],"ko":["AI SDK v6를 최적의 성능으로 구성","고급 언어 이해를 위한 LangGraph 에이전트 설정","useLocalRuntime 및 useExternalStoreRuntime을 사용하여 사용자 지정 백엔드 구현"],"es":["Configuración de AI SDK v6 para un rendimiento óptimo","Configuración de agentes LangGraph para una comprensión avanzada del lenguaje","Implementación de backends personalizados que utilizan useLocalRuntime y useExternalStoreRuntime"],"fr":["Configuration de AI SDK v6 pour des performances optimales","Configuration des agents LangGraph pour une compréhension avancée du langage","Mise en œuvre de backends personnalisés utilisant useLocalRuntime et useExternalStoreRuntime"],"de":["Konfiguration von AI SDK v6 für optimale Leistung","Einrichtung von LangGraph-Agents für ein erweitertes Sprachverständnis","Implementierung von benutzerdefinierten Backends mit useLocalRuntime und useExternalStoreRuntime"],"pt":["Configurar o AI SDK v6 para desempenho ideal","Configurar agentes LangGraph para compreensão linguística avançada","Implementar backends personalizados usando useLocalRuntime e useExternalStoreRuntime"],"ru":["Настройка AI SDK v6 для оптимальной производительности","Настройка агентов LangGraph для расширенного понимания языка","Реализация пользовательских бэкендов с использованием useLocalRuntime и useExternalStoreRuntime"],"ar":["تهيئة AI SDK v6 لأداء مثالي","إعداد وكلاء LangGraph لفهم متقدم للغة","تنفيذ خلفيات مخصصة باستخدام useLocalRuntime و useExternalStoreRuntime"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of assistant-ui.com/llms.txt for latest API","Dependent on specific AI SDK and protocol versions"],"zh":["需要查阅assistant-ui.com/llms.txt以获取最新的API","依赖于特定的AI SDK和协议版本"],"ja":["最新のAPIを取得するためにassistant-ui.com/llms.txtを参照する必要がある","特定のAI SDKおよびプロトコルバージョンに依存している"],"ko":["最新 API를 얻으려면 assistant-ui.com/llms.txt를 참조해야 함","특정 AI SDK 및 프로토콜 버전에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de assistant-ui.com/llms.txt para la última API","Dependiente de versiones específicas de AI SDK y protocolo"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation de assistant-ui.com/llms.txt pour la dernière API","Dépendante de versions spécifiques de AI SDK et de protocole"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation von assistant-ui.com/llms.txt für die neueste API","Abhängig von spezifischen Versionen von KI-SDK und Protokoll"],"pt":["Requer consulta de assistant-ui.com/llms.txt para a API mais recente","Dependente de versões específicas do AI SDK e dos protocolos"],"ru":["Требуется обращение к assistant-ui.com/llms.txt для получения последней версии API","Зависит от конкретных версий AI SDK и протоколов"],"ar":["يتطلب الرجوع إلى assistant-ui.com/llms.txt للحصول على أحدث واجهة برمجة تطبيقات (API)","يعتمد على إصدارات محددة من أدوات تطوير برمجيات الذكاء الاصطناعي (SDK) والبروتوكولات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
