act JS","Code open source","Attention aux détails esthétiques","Options de personnalisation"],"de":["Benutzerdefiniertes Frontend-Design","Kompatibilität mit React JS","Open-Source-Code","Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details","Anpassungsoptionen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Desenvolvimento de componentes e páginas para React JS","Atenção ao detalhe estético e criativo","Implementação de código de trabalho real","Compatibilidade com frameworks React JS"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя","Разработка компонентов и страниц для React JS","Внимание к эстетическим и творческим деталям","Реализация рабочего кода","Совместимость с фреймворками React JS"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تطوير المكونات والصفحات لتطبيقات React JS","الاهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية والإبداعية","تنفيذ код يعمل بشكل فعّال","التوافق مع إطارات عمل React JS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["anthropic-frontend-design","React JS","开源网站构建器","独特前端接口","生产级前端","AI 风格"],"ja":["anthropic-frontend-design","React JS","オープンソースウェブサイトビルダー","独特なフロントエンドインターフェース","プロダクションレベルのフロントエンド","AI スタイル"],"ko":["anthropic-frontend-design","React JS","오픈소스 웹사이트 빌더","독특한 프론트엔드 인터페이스","생산급 프론트엔드","AI 스타일"],"es":["diseño de frontend","React JS","constructor de sitios web","código abierto","interfaces de usuario personalizadas","desarrollo web"],"fr":["conception de frontend","React JS","outils de construction de site web","code open source","interfaces utilisateur sur mesure","développement web"],"de":["Frontend-Design","React JS","Website-Builder","Open-Source-Code","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["construtor de sites open source","React JS","interfaces de usuário personalizadas","desenvolvimento de componentes","design de frontend","frameworks React JS"],"ru":["открытый конструктор сайтов","React JS","индивидуальные интерфейсы пользователя","разработка компонентов","дизайн фронта","фреймворки React JS"],"ar":["معمل موقع مفتوح المصدر","React JS","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تطوير المكونات","تصميم الواجهة الأمامية","إطارات عمل React JS"]}},"owner":"chaibuilder","repo":"sdk","repoPath":"chaibuilder/sdk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"anthropic-frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter. Instead, opt for distinctive, unexpected, characterful font choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:06:56.491Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing production-grade React JS frontend interfaces with exceptional aesthetic details","zh":"非常适合需要生产级React JS前端界面的全栈代理，具有出色的美学细节","ja":"フルスタックエージェントが生産性の高いReact JSフロントエンドインターフェイスを必要とする場合に最適です。美的細節に優れています","ko":"프로덕션급 React JS 프론트엔드 인터페이스가 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합하며, 예외적인 미적 세부사항을 가지고 있습니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan interfaces de frontend de React JS de nivel de producción con detalles estéticos excepcionales","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''interfaces frontend React JS de niveau de production avec des détails esthétiques exceptionnels","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die Produktions-React-JS-Frontend-Schnittstellen mit außergewöhnlichen ästhetischen Details benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de interfaces de frontend de React JS de produção com detalhes estéticos excepcionais","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, которым требуются фронтенд-интерфейсы React JS промышленного уровня с исключительными эстетическими деталями","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكاملون الذين يحتاجون إلى واجهات أمامية من React JS من الدرجة الإنتاجية مع تفاصيل جمالية استثنائية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, real working code with React JS frameworks, avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics and implementing creative choices with exceptional attention to detail, utilizing design thinking and bold aesthetic directions","zh":"赋予代理商创造独特的、真正可用的代码的能力，使用React JS框架，避免通用的''AI乱码''美学，并使用设计思维和大胆的美学方向来实现创造性的选择，具有出色的关注细节","ja":"エージェントが独自の、実際に動作するコードを作成する能力を付与します。React JSフレームワークを使用して、一般的な''AIスロップ''美学を避け、デザイン思考と大胆な美学方向性を使用して創造的な選択を実現します。細部への注目が優れています","ko":"에이전트가 독특한 실제 작동하는 코드를 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. React JS 프레임워크를 사용하여 일반적인 ''AI 스크램블'' 미학을 피하고, 디자인 사고와 대담한 미학 방향을 사용하여 창의적인 선택을 구현하며, 세부 사항에 대한 주의가_Exceptional","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear código real y funcional con frameworks de React JS, evitando estéticas genéricas de ''suciedad de IA'' y implementando elecciones creativas con una atención excepcional al detalle, utilizando diseño de pensamiento y direcciones estéticas atrevidas","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un code réel et fonctionnel avec des frameworks React JS, en évitant les esthétiques génériques de ''soulagement IA'' et en mettant en œuvre des choix créatifs avec une attention exceptionnelle au détail, en utilisant la conception de la pensée et les directions esthétiques audacieuses","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eigenständigen, funktionierenden Code mit React-JS-Frameworks zu erstellen, generische ''KI-Schund''-Ästhetik zu vermeiden und kreative Entscheidungen mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für Details umzusetzen, unter Nutzung von Design-Denken und mutigen ästhetischen Richtungen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar códigos distintos e funcionais com estruturas React JS, evitando estéticas genéricas de ''slop de IA'' e implementando escolhas criativas com atenção excepcional aos detalhes, utilizando design thinking e direções estéticas ousadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отличительные, рабочие коды с фреймворками React JS, избегая общих эстетических решений ''AI-слоу'' и реализуя творческие решения с исключительным вниманием к деталям, используя принципы дизайн-мышления и смелые эстетические направления","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء رموز متميزة ووظيفية مع إطارات عمل React JS، وتجنب الجماليات العادية لبرامج ''سلو'' الاصطناعي وتنفيذ الخيارات الإبداعية مع اهتمام استثنائي بالتفاصيل، باستخدام التفكير التصميمي والاتجاهات الجمالية الجريئة"},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom React JS components with unique interfaces","Designing production-grade frontend applications with specific audience and purpose in mind","Creating distinctive page layouts with technical constraints and creative freedom"],"zh":["使用独特的接口构建自定义React JS组件","设计具有特定受众和用途的生产级前端应用程序","创建具有技术约束和创造性自由的独特页面布局"],"ja":["ユニークなインターフェイスを持つカスタムReact JSコンポーネントを構築する","特定のオーディエンスと目的を念頭に置いて、生産性の高いフロントエンドアプリケーションを設計する","技術的な制約と創造的な自由度を持つユニークなページレイアウトを作成する"],"ko":["고유한 인터페이스를 가진 사용자 지정 React JS 컴포넌트를 빌드하는 것","특정 대상 및 목적을 고려하여 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 애플리케이션을 설계하는 것","기술적인 제약과 창의적인 자유를 가진 고유한 페이지 레이아웃을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Construir componentes personalizados de React JS con interfaces únicas","Diseñar aplicaciones frontend de nivel de producción con una audiencia y un propósito específicos","Crear diseños de página distintivos con restricciones técnicas y libertad creativa"],"fr":["Construire des composants React JS personnalisés avec des interfaces uniques","Concevoir des applications frontend de niveau de production avec un public et un objectif spécifiques","Créer des dispositions de page distinctives avec des contraintes techniques 