tives","de":"Convex Realtime: Erstellen Sie reaktive Anwendungen","pt":"Convex Realtime: Desenvolva Aplicativos Reativos","ru":"Convex Realtime: Постройте Реактивные Приложения","ar":"Convex Realtime: بناء تطبيقات تفاعلية","en":"Convex Realtime"},"description":{"zh":"Convex Realtime是一个构建实时应用的集中式中心，提供实时订阅、乐观更新、智能缓存和基于游标的分页","ja":"Convex Realtimeはリアクティブアプリケーションを構築するための集中センターで、リアルタイムサブスクリプション、楽観的な更新、インテリジェントなキャッシュ、カーソルベースのページネーションを提供","ko":"Convex Realtime는 실시간 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 집중 센터로 실시간 구독, 낙관적 업데이트, 지능형 캐싱 및 커서 기반 페이징을 제공","es":"Convex Realtime es una plataforma centralizada para habilidades de agentes que permite crear aplicaciones reactivas con tecnologías avanzadas.","fr":"Convex Realtime est une plateforme centralisée pour les compétences des agents qui permet de créer des applications réactives avec des technologies avancées.","de":"Convex Realtime ist eine zentrale Plattform für Agentenfähigkeiten, die das Erstellen reaktiver Anwendungen mit fortschrittlichen Technologien ermöglicht.","pt":"Convex Realtime é uma plataforma centralizada para habilidades de agentes, permitindo o desenvolvimento de aplicativos reativos com recursos como inscrições ...","ru":"Convex Realtime — это централизованный хаб для навыков агентов, позволяющий разрабатывать реактивные приложения с функциями, такими как подписки в реальном в...","ar":"Convex Realtime هو центр موحد لمهارات الوكيل، مما يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات تفاعلية مع ميزات مثل الاشتراكات في الوقت الحقيقي والتحديثات المتفائلة.","en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"definition":{"en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"features":{"zh":["实时订阅","乐观更新","智能缓存","基于游标的分页","构建实时应用"],"ja":["リアルタイムサブスクリプション","楽観的な更新","インテリジェントなキャッシュ","カーソルベースのページネーション","リアクティブアプリケーションの構築"],"ko":["실시간 구독","낙관적 업데이트","지능형 캐싱","커서 기반 페이징","실시간 애플리케이션 구축"],"es":["Suscripciones en tiempo real","Actualizaciones optimistas","Caché inteligente","Paginación basada en cursores"],"fr":["Abonnements en temps réel","Mises à jour optimistes","Cache intelligent","Pagination basée sur les curseurs"],"de":["Echtzeit-Abonnements","Optimistische Updates","Intelligenter Cache","Cursor-basierte Paginierung"],"pt":["Inscrições em tempo real","Atualizações otimistas","Cache inteligente","Paginação baseada em cursor"],"ru":["Подписки в реальном времени","Оптимистические обновления","Умный кэш","Курсорная пагинация"],"ar":["الاشتراكات في الوقت الحقيقي","التحديثات المتفائلة","التخزين المؤقت الذكي","التنقل القائم على المؤشر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex Realtime","实时应用","实时订阅","乐观更新","智能缓存","基于游标的分页","React","JavaScript"],"ja":["Convex Realtime","リアクティブアプリケーション","リアルタイムサブスクリプション","楽観的な更新","インテリジェントなキャッシュ","カーソルベースのページネーション","React","JavaScript"],"ko":["Convex Realtime","실시간 애플리케이션","실시간 구독","낙관적 업데이트","지능형 캐싱","커서 기반 페이징","React","JavaScript"],"es":["Convex Realtime","aplicaciones reactivas","suscripciones en tiempo real","actualizaciones optimistas","caché inteligente","paginación basada en cursores","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Convex Realtime","applications réactives","abonnements en temps réel","mises à jour optimistes","cache intelligent","pagination basée sur les curseurs","développement d''applications"],"de":["Convex Realtime","reaktive Anwendungen","Echtzeit-Abonnements","optimistische Updates","intelligenter Cache","Cursor-basierte Paginierung","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos reativos","Convex Realtime","Inscrições em tempo real","Atualizações otimistas","Cache inteligente","Paginação baseada em cursor"],"ru":["Разработка реактивных приложений","Convex Realtime","Подписки в реальном времени","Оптимистические обновления","Умный кэш","Курсорная пагинация"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات تفاعلية","Convex Realtime","الاشتراكات في الوقت الحقيقي","التحديثات المتفائلة","التخزين المؤقت الذكي","التنقل القائم على المؤشر"]}},"owner":"charlietlamb","repo":"ferix","repoPath":"charlietlamb/ferix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex Realtime","description":"Patterns for building reactive apps including subscription management, optimistic updates, cache behavior, and paginated queries with cursor-based loading","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","realtime","subscriptions","optimistic-updates","pagination"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Realtime\n\nBuild reactive applications with Convex''s real-time subscriptions, optimistic updates, intelligent caching, and cursor-based pagination.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/client/react\n- Optimistic Updates: https://docs.convex.dev/client/react/optimistic-updates\n- Pagination: https://docs.convex.dev/database/pagination\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Inst","body":"# Convex Realtime\n\nBuild reactive applications with Convex''s real-time subscriptions, optimistic updates, intelligent caching, and cursor-based pagination.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/client/react\n- Optimistic Updates: https://docs.convex.dev/client/react/optimistic-updates\n- Pagination: https://docs.convex.dev/database/pagination\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### How Convex Realtime Works\n\n1. **Automatic Subscriptions** - useQuery creates a subscription that updates automatically\n2. **Smart Caching** - Query results are cached and shared across components\n3. **Consistency** - All subscriptions see a consistent view of the database\n4. **Efficient Updates** - Only re-renders when relevant data changes\n\n### Basic Subscriptions\n\n```typescript\n// React component with real-time data\nimport { useQuery } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction TaskList({ userId }: { userId: Id<\"users\"> }) {\n  // Automatically subscribes and updates in real-time\n  const tasks = useQuery(api.tasks.list, { userId });\n\n  if (tasks === undefined) {\n    return <div>Loading...</div>;\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <ul>\n      {tasks.map((task) => (\n        <li key={task._id}>{task.title}</li>\n      ))}\n    </ul>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Conditional Queries\n\n```typescript\nimport { useQuery } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: Id<\"users\"> | null }) {\n  // Skip query when userId is null\n  const user = useQuery(\n    api.users.get,\n    userId ? { userId } : \"skip\"\n  );\n\n  if (userId === null) {\n    return <div>Select a user</div>;\n  }\n\n  if (user === undefined) {\n    return <div>Loading...</div>;\n  }\n\n  return <div>{user.name}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n### Mutations with Real-time Updates\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMutation, useQuery } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction TaskManager({ userId }: { userId: Id<\"users\"> }) {\n  const tasks = useQuery(api.tasks.list, { userId });\n  const createTask = useMutation(api.tasks.create);\n  const toggleTask = useMutation(api.tasks.toggle);\n\n  const handleCreate = async (title: string) => {\n    // Mutation triggers automatic re-render when data changes\n    await createTask({ title, userId });\n  };\n\n  const handleToggle = async (taskId: Id<\"tasks\">) => {\n    await toggleTask({ taskId });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <button onClick={() => handleCreate(\"New Task\")}>Add Task</button>\n      <ul>\n        {tasks?.map((task) => (\n          <li key={task._id} onClick={() => handleToggle(task._id)}>\n            {task.completed ? \"✓\" : \"○\"} {task.title}\n          </li>\n        ))}\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Optimistic Updates\n\nShow changes immediately before server confirmation:\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMutation, useQuery } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\nimport { Id } from \"../convex/_generated/dataModel\";\n\nfunction TaskItem({ task }: { task: Task }) {\n  const toggleTask = useMutation(api.tasks.toggle).withOptimisticUpdate(\n    (localStore, args) => {\n      const { taskId } = args;\n      const currentValue = localStore.getQuery(api.tasks.get, { taskId });\n      \n      if (currentValue !== undefined) {\n        localStore.setQuery(api.tasks.get, { taskId }, {\n          ...currentValue,\n          completed: !currentValue.completed,\n        });\n      }\n    }\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <div onClick={() => toggleTask({ taskId: task._id })}>\n      {task.completed ? \"✓\" : \"○\"} {task.title}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Optimistic Updates for Lists\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useCreateTask(userId: Id<\"users\">) {\n  return useMutation(api.tasks.create).withOptimisticUpdate(\n    (localStore, args) => {\n      const { title, userId } = args;\n      const currentTasks = localStore.getQuery(api.tasks.list, { userId });\n      \n      if (currentTasks !== undefined) {\n        // Add optimistic task to the list\n        const optimisticTask = {\n          _id: crypto.randomUUID() as Id<\"tasks\">,\n          _creationTime: Date.now(),\n          title,\n          userId,\n          completed: false,\n        };\n        \n        localStore.setQuery(api.tasks.list, { userId }, [\n          optimisticTask,\n          ...currentTasks,\n        ]);\n      }\n    }\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Cursor-Based Pagination\n\n```typescript\n// convex/messages.ts\nimport { query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { paginationOptsValidator } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport const listPaginated = query({\n  args: {\n    channelId: v.id(\"channels\"),\n    paginationOpts: paginationOptsValidator,\n  },\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"messages\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_channel\", (q) => q.eq(\"channelId\", args.channelId))\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .paginate(args.paginationOpts);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// React component with pagination\nimport { usePaginatedQuery } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MessageList({ channelId }: { channelId: Id<\"channels\"> }) {\n  const { results, status, loadMore } = usePaginatedQuery(\n    api.messages.listPaginated,\n    { channelId },\n    { initialNumItems: 20 }\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {results.map((message) => (\n        <div key={message._id}>{message.content}</div>\n      ))}\n      \n      {status === \"CanLoadMore\" && (\n        <button onClick={() => loadMore(20)}>Load More</button>\n      )}\n      \n      {status === \"LoadingMore\" && <div>Loading...</div>}\n      \n      {status === \"Exhausted\" && <div>No more messages</div>}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Infinite Scroll Pattern\n\n```typescript\nimport { usePaginatedQuery } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { useEffect, useRef } from \"react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction InfiniteMessageList({ channelId }: { channelId: Id<\"channels\"> }) {\n  const { results, status, loadMore } = usePaginatedQuery(\n    api.messages.listPaginated,\n    { channelId },\n    { initialNumItems: 20 }\n  );\n  \n  const observerRef = useRef<IntersectionObserver>();\n  const loadMoreRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (observerRef.current) {\n      observerRef.current.disconnect();\n    }\n\n    observerRef.current = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      if (entries[0].isIntersecting && status === \"CanLoadMore\") {\n        loadMore(20);\n      }\n    });\n\n    if (loadMoreRef.current) {\n      observerRef.current.observe(loadMoreRef.current);\n    }\n\n    return () => observerRef.current?.disconnect();\n  }, [status, loadMore]);\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {results.map((message) => (\n        <div key={message._id}>{message.content}</div>\n      ))}\n      <div ref={loadMoreRef} style={{ height: 1 }} />\n      {status === \"LoadingMore\" && <div>Loading...</div>}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Multiple Subscriptions\n\n```typescript\nimport { useQuery } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction Dashboard({ userId }: { userId: Id<\"users\"> }) {\n  // Multiple subscriptions update independently\n  const user = useQuery(api.users.get, { userId });\n  const tasks = useQuery(api.tasks.list, { userId });\n  const notifications = useQuery(api.notifications.unread, { userId });\n\n  const isLoading = user === undefined || \n                    tasks === undefined || \n                    notifications === undefined;\n\n  if (isLoading) {\n    return <div>Loading...</div>;\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <h1>Welcome, {user.name}</h1>\n      <p>You have {tasks.length} tasks</p>\n      <p>{notifications.length} unread notifications</p>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Real-time Chat Application\n\n```typescript\n// convex/messages.ts\nimport { query, mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: { channelId: v.id(\"channels\") },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"messages\"),\n    _creationTime: v.number(),\n    content: v.string(),\n    authorId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    authorName: v.string(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const messages = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"messages\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_channel\", (q) => q.eq(\"channelId\", args.channelId))\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(100);\n\n    // Enrich with author names\n    return Promise.all(\n      messages.map(async (msg) => {\n        const author = await ctx.db.get(msg.authorId);\n        return {\n          ...msg,\n          authorName: author?.name ?? \"Unknown\",\n        };\n      })\n    );\n  },\n});\n\nexport const send = mutation({\n  args: {\n    channelId: v.id(\"channels\"),\n    authorId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"messages\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"messages\", {\n      channelId: args.channelId,\n      authorId: args.authorId,\n      content: args.content,\n    });\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// ChatRoom.tsx\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\nimport { useState, useRef, useEffect } from \"react\";\n\nfunction ChatRoom({ channelId, userId }: Props) {\n  const messages = useQuery(api.messages.list, { channelId });\n  const sendMessage = useMutation(api.messages.send);\n  const [input, setInput] = useState(\"\");\n  const messagesEndRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n  // Auto-scroll to bottom on new messages\n  useEffect(() => {\n    messagesEndRef.current?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \"smooth\" });\n  }, [messages]);\n\n  const handleSend = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    if (!input.trim()) return;\n\n    await sendMessage({\n      channelId,\n      authorId: userId,\n      content: input.trim(),\n    });\n    setInput(\"\");\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"chat-room\">\n      <div className=\"messages\">\n        {messages?.map((msg) => (\n          <div key={msg._id} className=\"message\">\n            <strong>{msg.authorName}:</strong> {msg.content}\n          </div>\n        ))}\n        <div ref={messagesEndRef} />\n      </div>\n      \n      <form onSubmit={handleSend}>\n        <input\n          value={input}\n          onChange={(e) => setInput(e.target.value)}\n          placeholder=\"Type a message...\"\n        />\n        <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Use \"skip\" for conditional queries instead of conditionally calling hooks\n- Implement optimistic updates for better perceived performance\n- Use usePaginatedQuery for large datasets\n- Handle undefined state (loading) explicitly\n- Avoid unnecessary re-renders by memoizing derived data\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Conditional hook calls** - Use \"skip\" instead of if statements\n2. **Not handling loading state** - Always check for undefined\n3. **Missing optimistic update rollback** - Optimistic updates auto-rollback on error\n4. **Over-fetching with pagination** - Use appropriate page sizes\n5. **Ignoring subscription cleanup** - React handles this automatically\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- React Client: https://docs.convex.dev/client/react\n- Optimistic Updates: https://docs.convex.dev/client/react/optimistic-updates\n- Pagination: https://docs.convex.dev/database/pagination\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:07:09.873Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Realtime Data Agents needing advanced reactive application capabilities with Convex''s real-time subscriptions and optimistic updates.","zh":"非常适合需要高级反应性应用功能的实时数据代理，Convex的实时订阅和乐观更新。","ja":"リアルタイムデータエージェントが高度なリアクティブアプリケーション機能を必要とする場合に最適です。Convexのリアルタイムサブスクリプションと楽観的な更新を使用します。","ko":"고급 반응형 애플리케이션 기능이 필요한 실시간 데이터 에이전트에 적합합니다. Convex의 실시간 구독 및 낙관적 업데이트를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Datos en Tiempo Real que necesitan capacidades de aplicación reactiva avanzadas con suscripciones en tiempo real y actualizaciones optimistas de Convex.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de données en temps réel nécessitant des capacités d''application réactive avancées avec les abonnements en temps réel et les mises à jour optimistes de Convex.","de":"Perfekt für Echtzeit-Daten-Agenten, die erweiterte reaktive Anwendungsfähigkeiten mit Convex'' Echtzeit-Abonnements und optimistischen Updates benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Dados em Tempo Real que necessitam de capacidades de aplicação reativa avançadas com assinaturas em tempo real e atualizações otimistas do Convex.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов реального времени, которым необходимы продвинутые реактивные возможности с помощью подписок и оптимистических обновлений Convex в реальном времени.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء البيانات في الوقت الفعلي الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تطبيق ردة الفعل المتقدمة مع الاشتراكات في الوقت الفعلي والتحديثات المتفائلة من Convex."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build reactive applications with intelligent caching, cursor-based pagination, and real-time data synchronization using Convex''s client-side libraries, enabling seamless integration with React applications and efficient data management.","zh":"赋予代理构建反应性应用的能力，使用Convex的客户端库，实现智能缓存、基于光标的分页和实时数据同步，从而实现与React应用的无缝集成和高效的数据管理。","ja":"エージェントに、Convexのクライアントサイドライブラリを使用して、リアクティブアプリケーションを構築する能力を与えます。スマートキャッシング、カーソルベースのページネーション、リアルタイムデータ同期を実現し、Reactアプリケーションとのシームレスな統合と効率的なデータ管理を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 반응형 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 해줍니다. Convex의 클라이언트 사이드 라이브러리를 사용하여 지능형 캐싱, 커서 기반 페이징 및 실시간 데이터 동기화를 구현하여 React 애플리케이션과의 无缝 통합 및 효율적인 데이터 관리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones reactivas con almacenamiento en caché inteligente, paginación basada en cursor y sincronización de datos en tiempo real utilizando las bibliotecas del lado del cliente de Convex, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con aplicaciones React y un manejo de datos eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications réactives avec un cache intelligent, une pagination basée sur le curseur et une synchronisation de données en temps réel en utilisant les bibliothèques côté client de Convex, ce qui permet une intégration transparente avec les applications React et une gestion de données efficace.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, reaktive Anwendungen mit intelligenter Zwischenspeicherung, cursorbasierter Paginierung und Echtzeit-Datensynchronisierung zu erstellen, indem sie die Client-Bibliotheken von Convex verwenden, was eine nahtlose Integration mit React-Anwendungen und effizientes Datenmanagement ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações reativas com cache inteligente, paginação baseada em cursor e sincronização de dados em tempo real usando as bibliotecas do lado do cliente do Convex, permitindo uma integração perfeita com aplicações React e um gerenciamento de dados eficiente.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать реактивные приложения с помощью интеллектуального кэширования, курсорной пагинации и синхронизации данных в реальном времени с использованием библиотек клиента Convex, что позволяет осуществлять бесшовную интеграцию с приложениями React и эффективное управление данными.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات ردة الفعل مع ذاكرة تخزين مؤقت ذكية وتنقّل صفحات قائم على المؤشر ومتوافق البيانات في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام مكتبات جانب العميل من Convex، مما يسمح بالتكامل السلس مع تطبيقات React وإدارة البيانات الفعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building real-time data dashboards with optimistic updates","Implementing cursor-based pagination for efficient data retrieval","Developing reactive applications with intelligent caching mechanisms"],"zh":["使用乐观更新构建实时数据仪表板","实现基于光标的分页以高效检索数据","使用智能缓存机制开发反应性应用"],"ja":["楽観的な更新を使用してリアルタイムデータダッシュボードを構築する","カーソルベースのページネーションを実装して効率的なデータ取得を行う","スマートキャッシングメカニズムを使用してリアクティブアプリケーションを開発する"],"ko":["낙관적 업데이트를 사용하여 실시간 데이터 대시보드를 구축합니다","커서 기반 페이징을 구현하여 효율적인 데이터检索를 thực hiện합니다","지능형 캐싱 메커니즘을 사용하여 반응형 애플리케이션을 개발합니다"],"es":["Construir paneles de datos en tiempo real con actualizaciones optimistas","Implementar paginación basada en cursor para una recuperación de datos eficiente","Desarrollar aplicaciones reactivas con mecanismos de almacenamiento en caché inteligentes"],"fr":["Créer des tableaux de bord de données en temps réel avec des mises à jour optimistes","Mettre en œuvre une pagination basée sur le curseur pour une récupération de données efficace","Développer des applications réactives avec des mécanismes de cache intelligents"],"de":["Erstellen von Echtzeit-Daten-Dashboards mit optimistischen Updates","Implementieren von cursorbasierter Paginierung für eine effiziente Datenerfassung","Entwickeln von reaktiven Anwendungen mit intelligenten Zwischenspeichermechanismen"],"pt":["Construir painéis de dados em tempo real com atualizações otimistas","Implementar paginação baseada em cursor para recuperação eficiente de dados","Desenvolver aplicações reativas com mecanismos de cache inteligentes"],"ru":["Построение панелей данных в реальном времени с оптимистическими обновлениями","Реализация курсорной пагинации для эффективного извлечения данных","Разработка реактивных приложений с механизмами интеллектуального кэширования"],"ar":["بناء لوحات بيانات في الوقت الفعلي مع تحديثات متفائلة","تنفيذ تنقّل صفحات قائم على المؤشر للوصول الفعال إلى البيانات","تطوير تطبيقات ردة الفعل مع آليات ذاكرة تخزين مؤقت ذكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex client-side library integration","Optimistic updates require careful implementation to avoid data inconsistencies","Pagination limits may apply depending on the Convex database configuration"],"zh":["需要Convex客户端库集成","乐观更新需要谨慎实现以避免数据不一致","分页限制可能取决于Convex数据库配置"],"ja":["Convexクライアントサイドライブラリの統合が必要","楽観的な更新では、データの不一致を避けるために慎重な実装が必要","ページネーションの制限は、Convexデータベースの構成によって異なる場合があります"],"ko":["Convex 클라이언트 사이드 라이브러리 통합이 필요합니다","낙관적 업데이트에서는 데이터 불일치를 피하기 위해 주의깊은 구현이 필요합니다","페이징 제한은 Convex 데이터베이스 구성에 따라 다를 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere integración de biblioteca del lado del cliente de Convex","Las actualizaciones optimistas requieren una implementación cuidadosa para evitar inconsistencias de datos","Los límites de paginación pueden aplicarse dependiendo de la configuración de la base de datos de Convex"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de la bibliothèque côté client de Convex","Les mises à jour optimistes nécessitent une mise en œuvre soignée pour éviter les incohérences de données","Les limites de pagination peuvent s''appliquer en fonction de la configuration de la base de données Convex"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration der Client-Bibliothek von Convex","Optimistische Updates erfordern eine sorgfältige Implementierung, um Dateninkonsistenzen zu vermeiden","Paginierungsgrenzen können je nach Konfiguration der Convex-Datenbank angewendet werden"],"pt":["Requer integração da biblioteca do lado do cliente do Convex","Atualizações otimistas requerem implementação cuidadosa para evitar inconsistências de dados","Limites de paginação podem ser aplicados dependendo da configuração do banco de dados do Convex"],"ru":["Требуется интеграция с библиотекой клиента Convex","Оптимистические обновления требуют тщательной реализации для избежания несоответствий данных","Ограничения пагинации могут применяться в зависимости от конфигурации базы данных Convex"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مكتبة جانب العميل من Convex","التحديثات المتفائلة تتطلب تنفيذاً دقيقاً لتجنب عدم التطابق في البيانات","قد يتم تطبيق حدود التنقّل الصفحات اعتماداً على تكوين قاعدة بيانات Convex"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
