"fr":"Next-intl est un outil de traduction pour les développeurs qui permet de mettre en œuvre des traductions de manière efficace.","de":"Next-intl ist ein Übersetzungstool für Entwickler, das die Implementierung von Übersetzungen auf effiziente Weise ermöglicht.","pt":"O next-intl fornece uma solução de internacionalização para aplicações, com suporte a múltiplos idiomas e locales","ru":"next-intl предоставляет решение для интернационализации приложений, с поддержкой нескольких языков и локалей","ar":"يقدم next-intl حلول التدويل للتطبيقات، مع دعم للغات و_regions متعددة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持多语言","国际化解决方案","自动合并翻译文件","客户端翻译支持","服务端翻译支持","灵活的翻译配置"],"ja":["多言語対応","国際化ソリューション","自動で翻訳ファイルをマージ","クライアント側翻訳サポート","サーバー側翻訳サポート","柔軟な翻訳設定"],"ko":["多言語 지원","국제화 솔루션","자동으로 翻訳 파일을 合并","클라이언트 측 翻訳 지원","서버 측 翻訳 지원","유연한 翻訳 구성"],"es":["Arquitectura de traducción escalable","Soporte para múltiples idiomas","Carga de traducciones de manera asíncrona","Compatibilidad con Next.js","Fácil implementación"],"fr":["Architecture de traduction évolutrice","Prise en charge de plusieurs langues","Chargement de traductions de manière asynchrone","Compatibilité avec Next.js","Implémentation facile"],"de":["Skalierbare Übersetzungsarchitektur","Unterstützung für mehrere Sprachen","Asynchrone Übersetzungsładung","Kompatibilität mit Next.js","Einfache Implementierung"],"pt":["Suporte a múltiplos idiomas e locales","Arquitetura de traduções escalável","Integração com Next.js","Traduções personalizáveis","Suporte a Survey keys"],"ru":["Поддержка нескольких языков и локалей","Масштабируемая архитектура переводов","Интеграция с Next.js","Настраиваемые переводы","Поддержка Survey keys"],"ar":["دعم للغات و_regions المتعددة","هيكل ترجمات قابل للتحجيم","التكامل مع Next.js","ترجمات قابلة للتعديل","دعم مفاتيح الاستطلاع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next-Intl","翻译功能","多语言支持","国际化","客户端翻译","服务端翻译","自动合并翻译文件"],"ja":["Next-Intl","翻訳機能","多言語対応","国際化","クライアント側翻訳","サーバー側翻訳","自動で翻訳ファイルをマージ"],"ko":["Next-Intl","번역 기능","多言語 지원","국제화","클라이언트 측 翻訳","서버 측 翻訳","자동으로 翻訳 파일을 合并"],"es":["traducciones next-intl","desarrollo de software","traducción de aplicaciones","next.js","internacionalización","i18n"],"fr":["traductions next-intl","développement de logiciels","traduction d''applications","next.js","internationalisation","i18n"],"de":["next-intl-übersetzungen","software-entwicklung","übersetzung von anwendungen","next.js","internationalisierung","i18n"],"pt":["next-intl","internacionalização","traduções","locales","Next.js","i18n"],"ru":["next-intl","интернационализация","переводы","локали","Next.js","i18n"],"ar":["next-intl","تدويل","ترجمات","مناطق","Next.js","i18n"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"next-intl-translations","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# next-intl Translations\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n- **Locales**: `en` (default), `es` — defined in `i18n/locales.ts`\n- **Messages**: Split into 11 domain files per locale under `messages/{locale}/`\n- **Merge**: `i18n/request.ts` loads all files via `Promise.all` and merges them. Survey keys are **deep-merged** from 3 files.\n- **Root layout**: `messages={null}` on `NextIntlClientProvider` — zero translation JSON shipped globally\n- **Scoped providers**: Only routes with client-side translation n","body":"# next-intl Translations\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n- **Locales**: `en` (default), `es` — defined in `i18n/locales.ts`\n- **Messages**: Split into 11 domain files per locale under `messages/{locale}/`\n- **Merge**: `i18n/request.ts` loads all files via `Promise.all` and merges them. Survey keys are **deep-merged** from 3 files.\n- **Root layout**: `messages={null}` on `NextIntlClientProvider` — zero translation JSON shipped globally\n- **Scoped providers**: Only routes with client-side translation needs get a `NextIntlClientProvider` with `pick()`\n\n## Message Files\n\n```\nmessages/\n├── en/\n│   ├── common.json      (navigation, footer, metadata)\n│   ├── auth.json         (auth)\n│   ├── home.json         (home.hero, reviews)\n│   ├── servers.json      (server, categories, regions, servers)\n│   ├── creators.json     (creators)\n│   ├── branding.json     (branding)\n│   ├── profile.json      (profile, settings)\n│   ├── submit.json       (submit)\n│   ├── survey-common.json  (survey.listing, survey.common)\n│   ├── survey-player.json  (survey.player)\n│   └── survey-owner.json   (survey.owner)\n└── es/  (mirrors en/ structure exactly)\n```\n\n### Rules for Message Files\n\n1. **Both locales must have identical key structure** — run `npx @lingual/i18n-check@latest --source en --locales messages` to verify\n2. **Each file has unique top-level keys** except survey files which share the `survey` top-level key with different sub-keys\n3. **Adding a new domain file** requires updating `i18n/request.ts` to import and spread it into the merged object\n4. **Never use `experimental.messages` precompilation** — it bypasses the custom deep-merge in `request.ts` and breaks survey translations\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Server Components (preferred)\n\nUse `useTranslations` from `next-intl` directly — translations resolve on the server, zero JS shipped.\n\n```tsx\n// No ''use client'' directive\nimport { useTranslations } from ''next-intl'';\n\nexport function Footer() {\n  const t = useTranslations(''footer'');\n  return <p>{t(''copyright'', { year: 2026 })}</p>;\n}\n```\n\n### Client Components — Donut Pattern\n\nWhen a component needs interactivity AND translations, split into server wrapper + client shell. Pass pre-translated strings as props.\n\n```tsx\n// header.tsx (Server Component — resolves translations)\nimport { useTranslations } from ''next-intl'';\nimport { HeaderClient } from ''./header-client'';\n\nexport function Header() {\n  const t = useTranslations(''navigation'');\n  return <HeaderClient labels={{ signIn: t(''signIn''), surveys: t(''surveys'') }} />;\n}\n\n// header-client.tsx (Client Component — receives string props)\n''use client'';\nexport function HeaderClient({ labels }: { labels: { signIn: string; surveys: string } }) {\n  // useState, useAuth, etc. — no useTranslations needed\n}\n```\n\n### Client Components — Scoped Provider\n\nWhen client components must call `useTranslations` themselves (e.g., dynamic survey rendering), wrap with a scoped `NextIntlClientProvider` in a parent server layout/page.\n\n```tsx\n// app/[locale]/survey/[slug]/layout.tsx\nimport { pick } from ''es-toolkit'';\nimport { NextIntlClientProvider } from ''next-intl'';\nimport { getMessages, setRequestLocale } from ''next-intl/server'';\n\nexport default async function SurveySlugLayout({\n  children,\n  params,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n  params: Promise<{ locale: string; slug: string }>;\n}) {\n  const { locale } = await params;\n  setRequestLocale(locale);\n  const messages = await getMessages({ locale });\n\n  return (\n    <NextIntlClientProvider messages={pick(messages as Record<string, unknown>, [''survey''])}>\n      {children}\n    </NextIntlClientProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Decision Flowchart\n\n1. Component has NO interactivity? → **Server Component** with `useTranslations`\n2. Component has interactivity but few labels? → **Donut pattern** (server wrapper passes string props)\n3. Component has interactivity AND many dynamic translation keys? → **Scoped provider** in parent layout/page\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n- **Every layout/page** in `app/[locale]/` must call `setRequestLocale(locale)` — required for static rendering\n- **Always pass `{ locale }` explicitly** to `getMessages()` and `getTranslations()` in layouts/pages\n- **Root layout uses `messages={null}`** — never pass all messages globally\n- **Use `pick()` from `es-toolkit`** to scope provider messages to only needed keys (e.g., `[''survey'']`)\n- **Localized pathnames** must be configured in BOTH `i18n/routing.ts` AND `next.config.ts` rewrites — see `references/pathnames.md`\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter any translation change, run:\n\n```bash\nnpx @lingual/i18n-check@latest --source en --locales messages\n```\n\nExpected output: \"No missing keys found!\" — fix any reported gaps before committing.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:07:44.682Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Next.js Internationalization Agents managing multi-domain translation architectures.","zh":"对于管理多领域翻译架构的Next.js国际化代理至关重要。","ja":"Next.jsの国際化エージェントが複数ドメインの翻訳アーキテクチャを管理するために不可欠です。","ko":"다중 도메인 번역 아키텍처를 관리하는 Next.js 국제화 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de internacionalización de Next.js que gestionan arquitecturas de traducción multi-dominio.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''internationalisation de Next.js gérant des architectures de traduction multi-domaine.","de":"Wesentlich für Next.js-Internationalisierungsagenten, die Multi-Domain-Übersetzungsarchitekturen verwalten.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Internacionalização do Next.js que gerenciam arquiteturas de tradução multi-domínio.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов интернационализации Next.js, управляющих архитектурами перевода с несколькими доменами.","ar":"ضروري لموكلات الترجمة الدولية لـ Next.js التي تدير هياكل ترجمة متعددة المجالات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to dynamically load and merge translation domains from locale-specific JSON files using Promise.all, while implementing zero-JSON global shipping through NextIntlClientProvider with messages={null}. Deep-merges survey keys from multiple files for complex translation structures.","zh":"使代理能够使用Promise.all动态加载和合并来自特定区域设置JSON文件的翻译域，同时通过NextIntlClientProvider与messages={null}实现零JSON全局交付。深度合并来自多个文件的调查键以支持复杂翻译结构。","ja":"Promise.allを使用してロケール固有のJSONファイルから翻訳ドメインを動的に読み込み、マージする一方、messages={null}のNextIntlClientProviderを通じてゼロJSONグローバル配送を実装します。複数のファイルから調査キーをディープマージして複雑な翻訳構造に対応します。","ko":"Promise.all을 사용하여 로케일별 JSON 파일에서 번역 도메인을 동적으로 로드 및 병합하고, messages={null}로 NextIntlClientProvider를 통해 제로 JSON 글로벌 전송을 구현합니다. 복잡한 번역 구조를 위해 여러 파일의 설문 키를 딥 머지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes cargar y combinar dinámicamente dominios de traducción de archivos JSON específicos de la ubicación utilizando Promise.all, mientras implementa la entrega global de cero JSON a través de NextIntlClientProvider con messages={null}. Combina profundamente las claves de la encuesta de varios archivos para estructuras de traducción complejas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de charger et de fusionner dynamiquement des domaines de traduction de fichiers JSON spécifiques à la localisation à l''aide de Promise.all, tout en mettant en œuvre une livraison globale de zéro JSON via NextIntlClientProvider avec messages={null}. Effectue un deep-merge des clés d''enquête de plusieurs fichiers pour des structures de traduction complexes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Übersetzungsdomänen aus lokalisierungsspezifischen JSON-Dateien mithilfe von Promise.all dynamisch zu laden und zu kombinieren, während sie gleichzeitig eine globale Lieferung von null-JSON über NextIntlClientProvider mit messages={null} implementieren. Führt ein Deep-Merge von Umfrage-Schlüsseln aus mehreren Dateien für komplexe Übersetzungsstrukturen durch.","pt":"Permite que os agentes carreguem dinamicamente e mesclhem domínios de tradução de arquivos JSON específicos de localização usando Promise.all, enquanto implementam o envio global zero-JSON por meio do NextIntlClientProvider com mensagens={null}. Funde profundamente as chaves de pesquisa de vários arquivos para estruturas de tradução complexas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам динамически загружать и объединять домены перевода из файлов JSON, специфичных для локали, используя Promise.all, а также реализовывать глобальную доставку zero-JSON через NextIntlClientProvider с messages={null}. Глубоко объединяет ключи опроса из нескольких файлов для сложных структур перевода.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتحميل وتجانس مجالات الترجمة من ملفات JSON الخاصة بالموقع الجغرافي باستخدام Promise.all، في حين ينفذ الشحن العالمي بدون JSON من خلال NextIntlClientProvider مع رسائل={null}. يدمج بشكل عميق مفاتيح المسح من عدة ملفات لهياكل ترجمة معقدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Dynamically loading locale-specific message domains","Deep-merging survey translations from multiple JSON files","Implementing zero-translation shipping for global layouts","Managing scoped translation providers for client-side routes"],"zh":["动态加载特定区域设置的消息域","深度合并来自多个JSON文件的调查翻译","为全局布局实现零翻译交付","管理客户端路由的范围化翻译提供程序"],"ja":["ロケール固有のメッセージドメインの動的読み込み","複数のJSONファイルからの調査翻訳のディープマージ","グローバルレイアウトのためのゼロ翻訳配送の実装","クライアントサイドルートのスコープ付き翻訳プロバイダーの管理"],"ko":["로케일별 메시지 도메인 동적 로딩","여러 JSON 파일의 설문 번역 딥 머징","글로벌 레이아웃을 위한 제로 번역 전송 구현","클라이언트 측 경로의 범위 지정 번역 공급자 관리"],"es":["Cargar dinámicamente dominios de mensajes específicos de la ubicación","Combinar profundamente traducciones de encuestas de múltiples archivos JSON","Implementar la entrega de cero traducciones para diseños globales","Administrar proveedores de traducción con ámbito para rutas del lado del cliente"],"fr":["Charger dynamiquement des domaines de messages spécifiques à la localisation","Fusionner en profondeur des traductions d''enquête de plusieurs fichiers JSON","Mettre en œuvre une livraison de zéro traduction pour les dispositions globales","Gérer des fournisseurs de traduction avec portée pour les routes du côté client"],"de":["Lokalisierungsspezifische Nachrichtendomänen dynamisch laden","Umfrageübersetzungen aus mehreren JSON-Dateien tief kombinieren","Eine null-Übersetzungslieferung für globale Layouts implementieren","Übersetzungsdienstanbieter mit Umfang für Client-Seiten-Wege verwalten"],"pt":["Carregamento dinâmico de domínios de mensagem específicos de localização","Mesclagem profunda de traduções de pesquisa de vários arquivos JSON","Implementação do envio de tradução zero para layouts globais","Gerenciamento de provedores de tradução com escopo para rotas do lado do cliente"],"ru":["Динамическая загрузка доменов сообщений, специфичных для локали","Глубокое объединение переводов опроса из нескольких файлов JSON","Реализация доставки перевода zero для глобальных макетов","Управление поставщиками перевода с областью действия для маршрутов на стороне клиента"],"ar":["تحميل ديناميكي لمجالات الرسائل الخاصة بالموقع الجغرافي","دمج عميق للترجمات الاستطلاعية من ملفات JSON متعددة","تنفيذ شحن الترجمة الصفري للمخططات العالمية","إدارة مزودي الترجمة بالمجال للطرق على جانب العميل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js App Router architecture","Dependent on next-intl library patterns","Needs structured domain file organization per locale"],"zh":["需要Next.js App Router架构","依赖于next-intl库的模式","需要按区域设置组织结构化域文件"],"ja":["Next.js App Routerアーキテクチャが必要","next-intlライブラリのパターンに依存","ロケールごとの構造化されたドメインファイルの編成が必要"],"ko":["Next.js App Router 아키텍처 필요","next-intl 라이브러리 패턴에 종속","로케일별 구조화된 도메인 파일 구성 필요"],"es":["Requiere la arquitectura del enrutador de aplicaciones de Next.js","Depende de los patrones de la biblioteca next-intl","Necesita una organización de archivos de dominio estructurada por ubicación"],"fr":["Nécessite l''architecture du routeur d''applications de Next.js","Dépend des modèles de la bibliothèque next-intl","A besoin d''une organisation de fichiers de domaine structurée par localisation"],"de":["Benötigt die Architektur des Next.js-App-Routers","Hängt von den Mustern der next-intl-Bibliothek ab","Benötigt eine strukturierte Dateiorganisation pro Lokalisierung"],"pt":["Exige arquitetura do Roteador de Aplicativos do Next.js","Dependente de padrões da biblioteca next-intl","Necessita de organização estruturada de arquivos de domínio por localização"],"ru":["Требует архитектуры маршрутизатора приложений Next.js","Зависит от шаблонов библиотеки next-intl","Требует структурированной организации файлов доменов по локали"],"ar":["يتطلب بنية موجه تطبيقات Next.js","يعتمد على أنماط مكتبة next-intl","يحتاج إلى تنظيم ملفات المجال المنظم حسب الموقع الجغرافي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
