auvegarde étiqueté"],"de":["Minimale Implementierung","Platzieren von Objekten auf ebenen Flächen","Grundlegende Platzierungs- und Überlebensfunktionen","Bodenfackel-Block-Design","Speicherplatz mit Etikett"],"pt":["Implementação mínima de gancho","Categoria de objeto que funciona em superfícies de slabs","Inclusão de colocação e sobrevivência","Visuais estritos","Minimização da invasividade"],"ru":["Минимальная реализация крюка","Категория объектов, работающих на поверхностях слэбов","Включение размещения и выживания","Строгие визуальные эффекты","Минимизация инвазивности"],"ar":["تنفيذ مقبض أدنى","فئة الكائنات التي تعمل على سطح slab","تضمين وضع ونجاة","المرئيات الصارمة","تقليل الغزو"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Slabbed","最小钩子实现","垂直切片","对象类别","板顶","放置","生存","视觉效果","侵入性"],"ja":["Slabbed","マイナル フック実装","垂直スライス","オブジェクト カテゴリ","スラブ","配置","サバイバル","視覚","侵入性"],"ko":["Slabbed","최소 후크 구현","垂直 切片","객체 카테고리","슬래브","배치","생존","시각","침입"],"es":["hook Slabbed","implementación minimalista","desarrollo de juegos","colocación de objetos","superficies planas","funcionalidades básicas","diseño de bloque","punto de guardado"],"fr":["crochet Slabbed","mise en œuvre minimaliste","développement de jeux","placement d''objets","surfaces planes","fonctionnalités de base","conception de bloc","point de sauvegarde"],"de":["Haken Slabbed","minimale Implementierung","Spielentwicklung","Platzieren von Objekten","ebene Flächen","grundlegende Funktionen","Block-Design","Speicherplatz"],"pt":["slabbed-minimal-hook-implementation-playbook","implementação mínima de gancho","desenvolvimento de jogos","programação de jogos","game development","game programming","slabbed"],"ru":["slabbed-minimal-hook-implementation-playbook","минимальная реализация крюка","разработка игр","программирование игр","game development","game programming","слэббед"],"ar":["slabbed-minimal-hook-implementation-playbook","تنفيذ مقبض أدنى","تطوير الألعاب","برمجة الألعاب","game development","game programming","slabbed"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"slabbed","repoPath":"joolbits/slabbed","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slabbed-minimal-hook-implementation-playbook","description":"Implement one minimal end-to-end slab support slice (placement plus survival) and tag the result.","bodyPreview":"# Slabbed — Minimal Hook Implementation Playbook (One Block, End-to-End)\n\n## Goal\nImplement the smallest complete vertical slice:\n- ONE “object” category works on slab tops\n- includes both placement and survival (no pop-off)\n- strict visuals (correct height/shape)\n- minimal invasiveness\n- savepoint tagged\n\nRecommended first block category: **floor torch** (small surface + simple support logic)\n\n## Non-goals\n- No “all items” yet\n- No broad sweeping hooks unless proven safe\n- No performance tuning","body":"# Slabbed — Minimal Hook Implementation Playbook (One Block, End-to-End)\n\n## Goal\nImplement the smallest complete vertical slice:\n- ONE “object” category works on slab tops\n- includes both placement and survival (no pop-off)\n- strict visuals (correct height/shape)\n- minimal invasiveness\n- savepoint tagged\n\nRecommended first block category: **floor torch** (small surface + simple support logic)\n\n## Non-goals\n- No “all items” yet\n- No broad sweeping hooks unless proven safe\n- No performance tuning beyond “don’t spam logs”\n\n## Preconditions\n- `slabbed-mixin-target-discovery` completed and provides concrete Yarn targets\n- `slabbed-test-matrix-and-repro-world` exists and repro lanes are ready\n- Working branch is clean\n- `./gradlew build` currently passes\n\n## Step 0) Create a working branch\n- Branch: `feat/torch-on-slabs` \n- Confirm clean status\n\n## Step 1) Add SlabSupport helper (if not already)\nImplement `com.slabbed.init.SlabSupport` per `slabbed-slab-support-helper-contract`.\n\nDo NOT add extra behavior. Keep it generic to “top support”.\n\n## Step 2) Add ONE mixin for placement\nUsing the Yarn target plan:\n- Create ONE mixin file (placement-time for torch)\n- Hook should only widen “supported on top” when below is slab top face\n\nRules:\n- Keep injection narrow (one method)\n- Avoid redirecting huge helper methods unless necessary\n- If you must intercept a predicate, do it at the closest call site for torch placement\n\n## Step 3) Add ONE mixin for survival\nAdd ONE mixin that prevents torch breaking due to slab support:\n- Hook the torch’s `canPlaceAt` (or equivalent survival predicate) to allow slab-top support\n\nEnsure:\n- it still breaks when truly unsupported (air, liquids, etc.)\n- it still follows vanilla where appropriate\n\n## Step 4) Strict visuals sanity\nValidate that the torch visually sits on slab top:\n- bottom slab: torch base at y+0.5\n- top slab: torch base at y+1.0\n\nIf visual mismatch exists due to vanilla model assumptions:\n- stop and report the exact mismatch\n- do not hack around with unrelated rendering changes yet\n\n## Step 5) Test the vertical slice\nRun the test matrix only for the torch category:\n- Full blocks lane must still pass\n- Bottom slab lane must pass\n- Top slab lane must pass\nRun update triggers:\n- neighbor update\n- chunk unload/reload\n\n## Step 6) Savepoint\nIf torch passes:\n- `./gradlew build` \n- commit message: `feat: allow floor torches on slab tops` \n- tag: `slabbed-first-placement-pass` \n\nIf survival also passes after updates:\n- add second commit if needed: `fix: prevent torch popping off on slab updates` \n- tag: `slabbed-first-survival-pass` \n\n\n## Output report format (required)\n- Strategy used (1 line)\n- Yarn target(s) touched (class#method)\n- Files changed\n- Test result summary (torch only)\n- Commit hash(es) + tag(s)\n\n## Stop conditions\n- If any mixin target is missing (“no targets”): stop and rerun discovery\n- If torch works but breaks another block in baseline lane: revert to last tag and reduce scope\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:08:32.432Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Game Development Agents needing minimal hook implementation for object placement on slabs","zh":"非常适合游戏开发代理，需要最小的钩子实现来放置物体在板上","ja":"ゲーム開発エージェントに最適で、スラブ上のオブジェクト配置のための最小限のフック実装が必要","ko":"게임 개발 에이전트에게 적합하며 슬라브 위의 오브젝트 배치에 최소한의 후크 구현이 필요","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de juegos que necesitan una implementación mínima de ganchos para la colocación de objetos en losas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de jeux ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre minimale de crochets pour le placement d''objets sur dalles","de":"Perfekt für Game-Development-Agents, die eine minimale Hook-Implementierung für die Objektplatzierung auf Schablonen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento de jogos que necessitam de implementação mínima de ganchos para colocação de objetos em lajes","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки игр, которым требуется минимальная реализация крючков для размещения объектов на слэбах","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير الألعاب الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ-hook الحد الأدنى لوضع الكائنات على اللوح"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement a minimal vertical slice with strict visuals, including correct height and shape, using a one-block category like floor torch, with minimal invasiveness and savepoint tagging, utilizing placement and survival logic","zh":"赋予代理实现一个最小的垂直切片，具有严格的视觉效果，包括正确的高度和形状，使用一个像地板火炬这样的单一块类别，具有最小的侵入性和保存点标记，利用放置和生存逻辑","ja":"エージェントが最小限の垂直スライスを実装できるようにし、厳密な視覚効果、正しい高さと形状、１つのブロックカテゴリ（例：床の火炬）を使用し、最小限の侵入性とセーブポイントのタグ付け、配置と生存ロジックを利用","ko":"에이전트가 최소한의 수직 슬라이스를 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 엄격한 시각 효과, 올바른 높이와 모양, 하나의 블록 카테고리(예: 바닥 등불)를 사용하며, 최소한의 침입성과 저장점 태그 지정, 배치 및 생존 논리를 사용","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar un corte vertical mínimo con visuales estrictas, incluyendo la altura y la forma correctas, utilizando una categoría de un bloque como antorcha de suelo, con una invasividad mínima y etiquetado de punto de guardado, utilizando lógica de colocación y supervivencia","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre un slice vertical minimal avec des visuels stricts, y compris la hauteur et la forme correctes, en utilisant une catégorie d''un bloc comme torche de sol, avec une invasivité minimale et un étiquetage de point de sauvegarde, en utilisant la logique de placement et de survie","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, einen minimalen vertikalen Slice mit strengen Visuals zu implementieren, einschließlich korrekter Höhe und Form, unter Verwendung einer Kategorie mit einem Block wie Bodenfackel, mit minimaler Invasivität und Speicherpunktetikettierung, unter Verwendung von Platzierungs- und Überlebenslogik","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar uma fatia vertical mínima com visuais estritas, incluindo altura e forma corretas, usando uma categoria de um bloco como tocha de piso, com minimização de invasividade e marcação de ponto de salvamento, utilizando lógica de colocação e sobrevivência","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать минимальную вертикальную срез с строгими визуальными эффектами, включая правильную высоту и форму, используя категорию одного блока, например, пола факела, с минимальным вторжением и маркировкой точки сохранения, используя логику размещения и выживания","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تنفيذ شريحة رأسية قليلة مع تأثيرات بصرية صارمة، بما في ذلك الارتفاع والشكل الصحيحين، باستخدام فئة كتلة واحدة مثل شعلة الأرض، مع الحد الأدنى من الغزو وتعليم نقطة الحفظ، باستخدام منطق وضع وتنفيذ البقاء"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing object placement on slab tops with correct height and shape","Developing minimal hook implementations for various object categories","Testing survival logic to prevent object pop-off"],"zh":["在板顶部实现物体放置，具有正确的高度和形状","为各种物体类别开发最小的钩子实现","测试生存逻辑以防止物体弹出"],"ja":["スラブの上部にオブジェクトを配置するための実装、正しい高さと形状","様々なオブジェクトカテゴリのための最小限のフック実装の開発","オブジェクトのポップオフを防ぐための生存ロジックのテスト"],"ko":["슬라브 위의 오브젝트 배치 구현, 올바른 높이와 모양","各种 오브젝트 카테고리의 최소한의 후크 구현 개발","오브젝트 팝업 방지를 위한 생존 논리 테스트"],"es":["Implementación de la colocación de objetos en la parte superior de losas con altura y forma correctas","Desarrollo de implementaciones de ganchos mínimas para varias categorías de objetos","Pruebas de lógica de supervivencia para prevenir el desprendimiento de objetos"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre du placement d''objets sur le dessus des dalles avec hauteur et forme correctes","Développement de mises en œuvre de crochets minimales pour différentes catégories d''objets","Tests de logique de survie pour empêcher le décrochage d''objets"],"de":["Implementierung der Objektplatzierung auf Schablonenoberflächen mit korrekter Höhe und Form","Entwicklung von minimalen Hook-Implementierungen für verschiedene Objektkategorien","Tests der Überlebenslogik, um das Abfallen von Objekten zu verhindern"],"pt":["Implementação de colocação de objetos em superfícies de lajes com altura e forma corretas","Desenvolvimento de implementações de ganchos mínimas para várias categorias de objetos","Teste de lógica de sobrevivência para prevenir a saída de objetos"],"ru":["Реализация размещения объектов на поверхностях слэбов с правильной высотой и формой","Разработка минимальных реализаций крючков для различных категорий объектов","Тестирование логики выживания для предотвращения выпадения объектов"],"ar":["تنفيذ وضع الكائنات على سطح اللوح مع الارتفاع والشكل الصحيحين","تطوير تنفيذات hooks الحد الأدنى لفئات الكائنات المختلفة","اختبار منطق البقاء لمنع الخروج من الكائنات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to one object category at a time","No support for broad sweeping hooks unless proven safe","No performance tuning"],"zh":["一次只能对一个物体类别进行操作","不支持广泛的扫描钩子，除非已证明是安全的","不进行性能优化"],"ja":["１度に１つのオブジェクトカテゴリのみに対応","広範囲のスイープフックは安全であることが証明されない限りサポートしない","パフォーマンスチューニングは行わない"],"ko":["한 번에 하나의 오브젝트 카테고리만対応","광범위한 스윕 후크는 안전한 것으로 증명되지 않는 한 지원하지 않음","성능 최적화는 수행하지 않음"],"es":["Limitado a una categoría de objetos a la vez","No admite ganchos de barrido amplio a menos que se pruebe su seguridad","No hay ajuste de rendimiento"],"fr":["Limité à une catégorie d''objets à la fois","N''a pas de support pour les crochets de balayage large à moins que cela soit prouvé sans danger","Pas de réglage des performances"],"de":["Begrenzt auf eine Objektkategorie gleichzeitig","Keine Unterstützung für breite Haken, es sei denn, diese sind als sicher bewiesen","Keine Leistungsabstimmung"],"pt":["Limitado a uma categoria de objeto de cada vez","Sem suporte para ganchos amplos a menos que sejam comprovadamente seguros","Sem ajuste de desempenho"],"ru":["Ограничен один категорией объекта одновременно","Нет поддержки широких крючков, если они не доказали свою безопасность","Нет настройки производительности"],"ar":["محدود لفئة واحدة من الكائنات في كل مرة","لا دعم للكروك الواسع إلا إذا كانوا محسّنين بأمان","لا ضبط للأداء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
