e contexto inteligente","Implementación de tareas de manera eficiente","Verificación y compromiso de la implementación","Seguimiento de la Metodología de Ralph Wiggum","Uso de archivos de configuración como prd.json y progress.md"],"fr":["Sélection de contexte intelligente","Mise en œuvre de tâches de manière efficace","Vérification et validation de la mise en œuvre","Suivi de la Méthodologie de Ralph Wiggum","Utilisation de fichiers de configuration tels que prd.json et progress.md"],"de":["Intelligente Kontextauswahl","Effiziente Implementierung von Aufgaben","Überprüfung und Validierung der Implementierung","Befolgen der Ralph-Wiggum-Methode","Verwendung von Konfigurationsdateien wie prd.json und progress.md"],"pt":["Executa um ciclo de desenvolvimento seguindo a Metodologia Ralph Wiggum","Análise de backlog para determinar o próximo passo lógico","Leitura de arquivos prd.json e progress.md","Verificação e commit de tarefas"],"ru":["Выполняет один цикл разработки, следующий методологии Ральфа Виггума","Анализ бэклога для определения следующего логического шага","Чтение файлов prd.json и progress.md","Проверка и фиксация задач"],"ar":["تنفذ دورة تطوير واحدة وفقًا لمетодولوجيا رالف وايغوم","تحليل قائمة الإنتظار لتحديد الخطوة التالية المنطقية","قراءة ملفات prd.json و progress.md","التحقق والالتزام بالمهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ralph 开发周期","AI 助手文档管道","AnyDocsMCP","自动化开发","文档管道自动化"],"ja":["Ralph 開発サイクル","AI アシスタント ドキュメント パイプライン","AnyDocsMCP","自動化開発","ドキュメント パイプライン自動化"],"ko":["Ralph 개발 사이클","AI 보조 문서 파이프라인","AnyDocsMCP","자동화 개발","문서 파이프라인 자동화"],"es":["ralph-cycle","desarrollo de AI","metodología de desarrollo","implementación de tareas","verificación y compromiso","Metodología de Ralph Wiggum","prd.json","progress.md"],"fr":["ralph-cycle","développement d''IA","méthodologie de développement","mise en œuvre de tâches","vérification et validation","Méthodologie de Ralph Wiggum","prd.json","progress.md"],"de":["ralph-cycle","KI-Entwicklung","Entwicklungszyklus","Aufgabenimplementierung","Überprüfung und Validierung","Ralph-Wiggum-Methode","prd.json","progress.md"],"pt":["Ralph-Cycle","pipeline de documentação MCP","metodologia Ralph Wiggum","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de ciclos de desenvolvimento","análise de backlog"],"ru":["Ralph-Cycle","универсальная документация MCP","методология Ральфа Виггума","разработка программного обеспечения","управление циклами разработки","анализ бэклога"],"ar":["رالف-سايكل","أنابيب وثائق MCP","مетодولوجيا رالف وايغوم","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة دوائر التطوير","تحليل قائمة الإنتظار"]}},"owner":"jusedit","repo":"any-docs-mcp","repoPath":"jusedit/any-docs-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph-cycle","description":"Execute a single Ralph development cycle by selecting a failing task, implementing it, verifying with tests, and committing. Use when ready to implement the next feature from the backlog.","bodyPreview":"# Ralph Development Cycle\n\nThis skill executes a single development cycle following the Ralph Wiggum Methodology: pick one task, implement it, verify it, commit it.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting a cycle:\n\n- ✅ `prd.json` exists with backlog\n- ✅ `progress.md` exists\n- ✅ `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` exists\n\n## Cycle Steps\n\n### Step 1: Smart Context Selection\n\nRead `prd.json` and `progress.md`. Analyze the backlog to determine the most logical next step.\n\n**Selection Logic:** Do not simply p","body":"# Ralph Development Cycle\n\nThis skill executes a single development cycle following the Ralph Wiggum Methodology: pick one task, implement it, verify it, commit it.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting a cycle:\n\n- ✅ `prd.json` exists with backlog\n- ✅ `progress.md` exists\n- ✅ `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` exists\n\n## Cycle Steps\n\n### Step 1: Smart Context Selection\n\nRead `prd.json` and `progress.md`. Analyze the backlog to determine the most logical next step.\n\n**Selection Logic:** Do not simply pick the first item. Select the task that:\n\n- Is currently failing (`passes: false`)\n- Is unblocked by other tasks (dependencies are met)\n- Makes the most sense to implement given the current state of the code\n\n**Announce:** \"I have selected [task name] because [reason].\"\n\n**Constraint:** PICK ONLY ONE TASK AT A TIME! Do not skip tasks unless blocked. If blocked, document the blocking reason in `progress.md`.\n\n### Step 2: Planning & Journaling\n\nAppend a new entry to `progress.md` with the header \"## Working on [Task Name]\"\n\nWrite a brief plan of execution in the log including:\n\n- What files will be modified/created\n- What approach you''ll take\n- Any potential challenges\n- How you''ll verify completion\n\n**Constraint:** Do not modify code yet.\n\n### Step 3: Implementation\n\nImplement the feature described in the selected task using the smallest change that satisfies the acceptance criteria.\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n- Work ONLY on this specific task\n- Do not refactor unrelated code\n- Modify only files required for the selected task\n- Adhere to the standards in `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md`\n- Follow the acceptance criteria from `prd.json`\n\n### Step 4: Verification\n\nExecute the verification command (e.g., `npm test`, `pytest`, etc.) relevant to this task.\n\nReference `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` for the correct verification commands. If it does not list any, infer minimal verification and document it in `progress.md`.\n\n**Retry Logic:**\n\nIf the command fails:\n\n1. Read the error output\n2. Attempt to fix the code\n3. Re-run verification\n4. Repeat up to 3 times\n\nIf it still fails after 3 tries, document the failure and next hypothesis in `progress.md`, then stop.\n\n### Step 5: Completion & Commit\n\nIf verification passes:\n\n1. Update `prd.json`: set `passes` to `true` for this task\n2. Update `progress.md`: Append \"**Result:** Success\"\n3. Run `git add .`\n4. Run `git commit --no-gpg-sign -m \"feat: [task description]\"`\n\n## Supporting Resources\n\nReference these files for guidance:\n\n- `cycle-checklist.md` - Quick reference checklist\n- `verification-examples.md` - Common verification patterns\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n❌ Do not work on multiple tasks simultaneously\n❌ Do not mark task as passing without running verification\n❌ Do not commit code that fails tests\n❌ Do not refactor unrelated code during implementation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:08:46.087Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Agents needing structured development cycle management, such as those utilizing the Ralph Wiggum Methodology","zh":"适用于需要结构化开发周期管理的自主代理，例如使用拉尔夫·维格姆方法论的代理","ja":"構造化された開発サイクル管理が必要な自律エージェントに適しています。たとえば、ラルフ・ウィッグム・メソッドを使用するエージェント","ko":"구조화된 개발 주기 관리가 필요한 자율 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 예를 들어, 랄프 위그럼 방법론을 사용하는 에이전트","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Autónomos que necesitan una gestión de ciclo de desarrollo estructurado, como aquellos que utilizan la Metodología Ralph Wiggum","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Autonomes ayant besoin d''une gestion de cycle de développement structurée, tels que ceux utilisant la Méthodologie Ralph Wiggum","de":"Perfekt für autonome Agenten, die eine strukturierte Zyklusverwaltung der Entwicklung benötigen, wie z.B. solche, die die Ralph-Wiggum-Methode verwenden","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autônomos que precisam de gerenciamento de ciclo de desenvolvimento estruturado, como aqueles que utilizam a Metodologia Ralph Wiggum","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, которым требуется управление циклом разработки, например, тех, кто использует методологию Ральфа Уиггума","ar":"مثالي لعميل المستقلة التي تحتاج إلى إدارة دورة التطوير المهيكلة، مثل تلك التي تستخدم منهجية رالف ويغوم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute a single development cycle by reading `prd.json` and `progress.md`, analyzing the backlog, and determining the most logical next step using Smart Context Selection, leveraging `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` for technical guidance","zh":"使代理能够通过读取 `prd.json` 和 `progress.md`、分析积压并使用智能上下文选择确定最合理的下一步来执行单个开发周期，同时利用 `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` 获取技术指导","ja":"エージェントが `prd.json` と `progress.md` を読み取り、バックログを分析し、スマートコンテキストセレクションを使用して最も論理的な次のステップを決定し、`.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` を使用して技術ガイダンスを提供することで、単一の開発サイクルを実行できるようにします","ko":"에이전트가 `prd.json`과 `progress.md`를 읽고 백로그를 분석한 뒤 스마트 컨텍스트 선택을 사용하여 가장 논리적인 다음 단계를 결정하고 `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md`를 사용하여 기술 가이드를 제공함으로써 단일 개발 주기를 실행할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar un solo ciclo de desarrollo leyendo `prd.json` y `progress.md`, analizando el backlog y determinando el siguiente paso más lógico utilizando la Selección de Contexto Inteligente, aprovechando `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` para la orientación técnica","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter un seul cycle de développement en lisant `prd.json` et `progress.md`, en analysant le backlog et en déterminant l''étape logique suivante à l''aide de la Sélection de Contexte Intelligente, en exploitant `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` pour les conseils techniques","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, einen einzelnen Entwicklungszyklus auszuführen, indem sie `prd.json` und `progress.md` lesen, den Backlog analysieren und den nächstlogischen Schritt unter Verwendung der intelligenten Kontextauswahl bestimmen, indem sie `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` für technische Anleitung nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar um único ciclo de desenvolvimento lendo `prd.json` e `progress.md`, analisando o backlog e determinando o próximo passo mais lógico usando Seleção de Contexto Inteligente, aproveitando `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` para orientação técnica","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять один цикл разработки, читая `prd.json` и `progress.md`, анализируя бэклог и определяя наиболее логический следующий шаг с помощью умного выбора контекста, опираясь на `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` для технического руководства","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تنفيذ دورة تطوير واحدة من خلال قراءة `prd.json` و `progress.md` ، وتحليل قائمة العمل المعلقة ، وتحديد الخطوة المنطقية التالية باستخدام اختيار السياق الذكي ، والاستفادة من `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` لإرشادات فنية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task selection from backlog","Implementing and verifying tasks using the Ralph Wiggum Methodology","Committing changes after successful verification"],"zh":["从积压中自动选择任务","使用拉尔夫·维格姆方法论实施和验证任务","验证成功后提交更改"],"ja":["バックログからタスクを自動的に選択する","ラルフ・ウィッグム・メソッドを使用してタスクを実装し検証する","検証に成功した後変更をコミットする"],"ko":["백로그에서 태스크를 자동으로 선택한다","랄프 위그럼 방법론을 사용하여 태스크를 구현하고 검증한다","검증에 성공한 후 변경 사항을 커밋한다"],"es":["Automatizar la selección de tareas del backlog","Implementar y verificar tareas utilizando la Metodología Ralph Wiggum","Confirmar cambios después de la verificación exitosa"],"fr":["Automatiser la sélection de tâches du backlog","Mettre en œuvre et vérifier des tâches en utilisant la Méthodologie Ralph Wiggum","Valider les modifications après une vérification réussie"],"de":["Automatisieren der Aufgabenwahl aus dem Backlog","Implementieren und Überprüfen von Aufgaben unter Verwendung der Ralph-Wiggum-Methode","Bestätigen von Änderungen nach erfolgreicher Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar seleção de tarefas do backlog","Implementar e verificar tarefas usando a Metodologia Ralph Wiggum","Confirmar alterações após verificação bem-sucedida"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выбор задач из бэклога","Реализовывать и проверять задачи с помощью методологии Ральфа Уиггума","Зафиксировать изменения после успешной верификации"],"ar":["تحسين processo اختيار المهام من قائمة العمل المعلقة","تنفيذ و التحقق من المهام باستخدام منهجية رالف ويغوم","التأكيد على التغييرات بعد التحقق الناجح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `prd.json` with backlog","Needs `progress.md` and `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` to exist","Limited to a single development cycle per execution"],"zh":["需要 `prd.json` 中的积压","需要 `progress.md` 和 `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` 来存在","每次执行仅限于单个开发周期"],"ja":["バックログを含む `prd.json` が必