متقدم","en":"advanced-video-downloader"},"description":{"zh":"高级视频下载器提供从1000+平台下载和转录视频的功能，包括YouTube、Bilibili、TikTok等，使用yt-dlp和SiliconFlow API","ja":"高度なビデオダウンローダーは、yt-dlpとSiliconFlow APIを使用して1000+のプラットフォームからビデオをダウンロードしてトランスクリプトする機能を提供します","ko":"고급 비디오 다운로더는 yt-dlp와 SiliconFlow API를 사용하여 1000+ 플랫폼에서 비디오를 다운로드하고 전사하는 기능을 제공합니다","es":"El descargador de videos avanzado ofrece capacidades de descarga y transcripción de videos de 1000+ plataformas.","fr":"Le téléchargeur vidéo avancé offre des capacités de téléchargement et de transcription de vidéos de 1000+ plateformes.","de":"Der erweiterte Video-Downloader bietet Funktionen zur Download und Transkription von Videos von 1000+ Plattformen.","pt":"O Baixador de Vídeo Avançado é uma aplicação que combina tecnologias para oferecer download e transcrição de vídeos de múltiplas plataformas.","ru":"Продвинутый загрузчик видео — это приложение, которое объединяет технологии для обеспечения скачивания и транскрипции видео с множества платформ.","ar":"مُحَمِّل الفيديو المتقدم هو تطبيق ي結ب التكنولوجيا لتقديم خدمات تنزيل ونسخ الفيديوهات من منصات متعددة.","en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"definition":{"en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"features":{"zh":["支持1000+平台的视频下载","使用yt-dlp进行视频下载","使用SiliconFlow API进行视频转录","支持Markdown格式的转录输出","使用Tauri + React + Rust技术开发"],"ja":["1000+のプラットフォームからのビデオダウンロードをサポート","yt-dlpを使用したビデオダウンロード","SiliconFlow APIを使用したビデオトランスクリプト","Markdown形式のトランスクリプト出力をサポート","Tauri + React + Rust技術を使用した開発"],"ko":["1000+ 플랫폼에서 비디오를 다운로드하는 것을 지원","yt-dlp를 사용하여 비디오를 다운로드","SiliconFlow API를 사용하여 비디오를 전사","Markdown 형식의 전사 출력을 지원","Tauri + React + Rust 기술을 사용하여 개발"],"es":["Descarga de videos de 1000+ plataformas","Transcripción AI con SiliconFlow API","Integración con yt-dlp","Compatibilidad con YouTube, Bilibili, TikTok y más","Conversión de videos a Markdown"],"fr":["Téléchargement de vidéos de 1000+ plateformes","Transcription IA avec l''API SiliconFlow","Intégration avec yt-dlp","Compatibilité avec YouTube, Bilibili, TikTok et plus","Conversion de vidéos en Markdown"],"de":["Download von Videos von 1000+ Plattformen","AI-Transkription mit SiliconFlow API","Integration mit yt-dlp","Kompatibilität mit YouTube, Bilibili, TikTok und mehr","Umwandlung von Videos in Markdown"],"pt":["Download de vídeos de 1000+ plataformas","Transcrição de vídeos para Markdown","Integração com yt-dlp","Uso da SiliconFlow API","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de vídeo","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Скачивание видео с 1000+ платформ","Транскрипция видео в Markdown","Интеграция с yt-dlp","Использование SiliconFlow API","Поддержка нескольких форматов видео","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["تنزيل الفيديوهات من 1000+ منصة","نسخ الفيديوهات إلى Markdown","التكامل مع yt-dlp","استخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SiliconFlow","دعم عدة صيغ فيديو","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["视频下载","视频转录","Tauri","React","Rust","yt-dlp","SiliconFlow API","Markdown","高级视频下载器"],"ja":["ビデオダウンロード","ビデオトランスクリプト","Tauri","React","Rust","yt-dlp","SiliconFlow API","Markdown","高度なビデオダウンローダー"],"ko":["비디오 다운로드","비디오 전사","Tauri","React","Rust","yt-dlp","SiliconFlow API","Markdown","고급 비디오 다운로더"],"es":["descargador de videos","transcripción de videos","yt-dlp","SiliconFlow API","Tauri","React","Rust","descarga de videos de YouTube"],"fr":["téléchargeur vidéo","transcription de vidéos","yt-dlp","API SiliconFlow","Tauri","React","Rust","téléchargement de vidéos YouTube"],"de":["Video-Downloader","Transkription von Videos","yt-dlp","SiliconFlow API","Tauri","React","Rust","YouTube-Video-Download"],"pt":["baixador de vídeo avançado","download de vídeos","transcrição de vídeos","yt-dlp","SiliconFlow API","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","tecnologias de vídeo","plataformas de vídeo","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["продвинутый загрузчик видео","скачивание видео","транскрипция видео","yt-dlp","SiliconFlow API","разработка приложений","видео технологии","видео платформы","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مُحَمِّل فيديو متقدم","تنزيل الفيديوهات","نسخ الفيديوهات","yt-dlp","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SiliconFlow","تطوير التطبيقات","تكنولوجيا الفيديو","منصات الفيديو","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"TheerasakPing","repo":"video-downloader-tauri","repoPath":"TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"advanced-video-downloader","description":"Download and transcribe videos from YouTube, Bilibili, TikTok and 1000+ platforms. Use when user requests video download, transcription (转录/字幕提取), or converting video to text/markdown. Supports quality selection, audio extraction, playlist downloads, cookie-based authentication, and AI-powered transcription via SiliconFlow API (免费转录).","bodyPreview":"# Advanced Video Downloader\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive video downloading and transcription capabilities from 1000+ platforms including YouTube, Bilibili, TikTok, Twitter, Instagram, and more. It combines:\n- **yt-dlp**: Powerful video downloading tool\n- **SiliconFlow API**: Free AI-powered transcription to convert videos to Markdown\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when the user:\n- Explicitly requests to download a video (\"download this video\", \"下载视频\")\n- Provid","body":"# Advanced Video Downloader\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive video downloading and transcription capabilities from 1000+ platforms including YouTube, Bilibili, TikTok, Twitter, Instagram, and more. It combines:\n- **yt-dlp**: Powerful video downloading tool\n- **SiliconFlow API**: Free AI-powered transcription to convert videos to Markdown\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when the user:\n- Explicitly requests to download a video (\"download this video\", \"下载视频\")\n- Provides video URLs from any platform\n- Mentions saving videos for offline viewing\n- Wants to extract audio from videos\n- Needs to download multiple videos or playlists\n- Asks about video quality options\n- Requests video transcription (\"转录视频\", \"提取字幕\", \"视频转文字\")\n- Wants to convert video/audio to text or Markdown\n- Asks to download AND transcribe a video in one workflow\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Single Video Download\nDownload individual videos from any supported platform with automatic quality selection.\n\n**Example usage:**\n```\nUser: \"Download this YouTube video: https://youtube.com/watch?v=abc123\"\nUser: \"下载这个B站视频: https://bilibili.com/video/BV1xxx\"\n```\n\n### 2. Batch & Playlist Download\nDownload multiple videos or entire playlists at once.\n\n**Example usage:**\n```\nUser: \"Download all videos from this playlist\"\nUser: \"Download these 3 videos: [URL1], [URL2], [URL3]\"\n```\n\n### 3. Audio Extraction\nExtract audio only from videos, saving as MP3 or M4A.\n\n**Example usage:**\n```\nUser: \"Download only the audio from this video\"\nUser: \"Convert this video to MP3\"\n```\n\n### 4. Quality Selection\nChoose specific video quality (4K, 1080p, 720p, etc.).\n\n**Example usage:**\n```\nUser: \"Download in 4K quality\"\nUser: \"Get the 720p version to save space\"\n```\n\n### 5. Video/Audio Transcription\nConvert video or audio files to Markdown text using SiliconFlow''s free AI transcription API.\n\n**Example usage:**\n```\nUser: \"Transcribe this video to text\" / \"转录这个视频\"\nUser: \"Download and transcribe this YouTube video\"\nUser: \"将这个音频转成文字\"\nUser: \"Extract transcript from this MP4 file\"\n```\n\n**Supported formats:**\n- Audio: MP3, WAV, M4A, FLAC, AAC, OGG, OPUS, WMA\n- Video: MP4, AVI, MOV, MKV, FLV, WMV, WEBM, M4V\n\n## Response Pattern\n\nWhen a user requests video download:\n\n### Step 1: Identify the Platform and URL(s)\n```python\n# Extract video URL(s) from user message\n# Identify platform: YouTube, Bilibili, TikTok, etc.\n```\n\n### Step 2: Check Tool Availability\n```bash\n# Check if yt-dlp is installed\nyt-dlp --version\n```\n\n### Step 3: Select Appropriate yt-dlp Command\n\nBased on platform and requirements:\n- **YouTube, Twitter, Instagram, TikTok**: Basic command works\n- **Bilibili**: Basic command works for most videos\n- **Quality selection**: Use `-f` with height filter\n- **Audio only**: Use `-x --audio-format mp3`\n- **Playlists**: Use playlist-specific output template\n\n### Step 4: Execute Download\n\nUse yt-dlp directly with appropriate options:\n\n```bash\n# Basic download (best quality MP4)\nyt-dlp -f \"bestvideo[ext=mp4]+bestaudio[ext=m4a]/best[ext=mp4]/best\" --merge-output-format mp4 -o \"%(title)s.%(ext)s\" \"VIDEO_URL\"\n\n# Specific quality (1080p)\nyt-dlp -f \"bestvideo[height<=1080]+bestaudio/best[height<=1080]\" --merge-output-format mp4 -o \"%(title)s.%(ext)s\" \"VIDEO_URL\"\n\n# Audio only (MP3)\nyt-dlp -x --audio-format mp3 -o \"%(title)s.%(ext)s\" \"VIDEO_URL\"\n\n# With cookies file (for protected content)\nyt-dlp --cookies cookies.txt -o \"%(title)s.%(ext)s\" \"VIDEO_URL\"\n\n# Playlist download\nyt-dlp -o \"%(playlist)s/%(playlist_index)s - %(title)s.%(ext)s\" \"PLAYLIST_URL\"\n```\n\n### Step 5: Report Results\nAfter download completes, report:\n- ✅ Video title and duration\n- ✅ File size and format\n- ✅ Save location\n- ✅ Download speed and time taken\n- ⚠️ Any warnings or quality limitations\n\n**Example output:**\n```\n✅ Downloaded: \"Video Title Here\"\n   Duration: 15:30\n   Quality: 1080p MP4\n   Size: 234 MB\n   Location: ./Video Title Here.mp4\n   Time: 45 seconds at 5.2 MB/s\n```\n\n## Transcription Response Pattern\n\nWhen a user requests video/audio transcription:\n\n### Step 1: Check Prerequisites\n```bash\n# Verify SiliconFlow API key is available\necho $SILICONFLOW_API_KEY\n# Or user must provide via --api-key parameter\n```\n\n**API Key Setup:**\n- Get free API key from: https://cloud.siliconflow.cn/account/ak\n- Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and add your API key\n- Or set environment variable: `SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=sk-xxx`\n\n### Step 2: Validate File\nEnsure the file exists and is a supported format (audio or video).\n\n### Step 3: Execute Transcription\nUse the bundled script `scripts/transcribe_siliconflow.py`:\n\n```bash\n# Basic transcription\npython scripts/transcribe_siliconflow.py --file video.mp4 --api-key sk-xxx\n\n# With custom output path\npython scripts/transcribe_siliconflow.py --file audio.mp3 --output transcript.md --api-key sk-xxx\n\n# Using environment variable for API key\npython scripts/transcribe_siliconflow.py --file video.mp4\n```\n\n### Step 4: Report Transcription Results\n```\n✅ Transcription complete!\n   File: video.mp4\n   Output: 2025-01-15-video.md\n   Size: 12.5 KB\n\n   Preview:\n   --------------------------------------------------\n   [First 200 characters of transcription...]\n   --------------------------------------------------\n```\n\n## Combined Workflow: Download + Transcribe\n\nFor requests like \"Download and transcribe this video\":\n\n```bash\n# Step 1: Download video\nyt-dlp -f \"bestvideo[ext=mp4]+bestaudio[ext=m4a]/best\" --merge-output-format mp4 -o \"%(title)s.%(ext)s\" \"VIDEO_URL\"\n\n# Step 2: Transcribe the downloaded file\npython scripts/transcribe_siliconflow.py --file \"Downloaded Video Title.mp4\" --api-key sk-xxx\n```\n\n## Platform-Specific Notes\n\n### YouTube\n- Fully supported by yt-dlp\n- No authentication needed for public videos\n- Supports all quality levels including 4K/8K\n\n### Bilibili\n- Supported by yt-dlp\n- High-quality downloads may require login cookies\n- Use `--cookies` with cookies.txt for member-only content\n\n### Other Platforms\n- Most platforms work well with yt-dlp\n- Check `references/supported_platforms.md` for full list\n\n## Handling Cookies for Protected Content\n\nFor platforms requiring authentication (Bilibili VIP, member-only content, etc.):\n\n### Method 1: Export Cookies File (Recommended)\n```bash\n# Use browser extension \"Get cookies.txt LOCALLY\"\n# Export cookies.txt, then:\nyt-dlp --cookies cookies.txt \"VIDEO_URL\"\n```\n\n### Method 2: Manual Cookies File\n```bash\n# Create cookies.txt in Netscape format\n# Use browser extension \"Get cookies.txt LOCALLY\"\n# Then use with yt-dlp\nyt-dlp --cookies cookies.txt \"VIDEO_URL\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Issue: Video quality lower than expected\n**Solution:**\n1. Check if platform requires login for HD\n2. Use `--cookies cookies.txt` for authenticated access\n3. Explicitly specify quality with `-f` parameter\n\n### Issue: Download very slow\n**Solution:**\n1. Check internet connection\n2. Try different time of day (peak hours affect speed)\n3. Use `--concurrent-fragments` for faster downloads\n\n### Issue: \"Video unavailable\" or geo-restricted\n**Solution:**\n1. Video may be region-locked\n2. Use proxy/VPN if legally permitted\n3. Check if video is still available on platform\n\n### Issue: Transcription API key error\n**Solution:**\n1. Verify API key starts with `sk-`\n2. Get free key from: https://cloud.siliconflow.cn/account/ak\n3. Set environment variable: `SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=sk-xxx`\n\n### Issue: Transcription returns empty text\n**Solution:**\n1. Check if audio/video has clear speech\n2. Verify file format is supported\n3. File may be too short or contain only music\n\n## Common Commands\n\n### Quality Presets\n\n```bash\n# 4K (2160p)\nyt-dlp -f \"bestvideo[height<=2160]+bestaudio/best[height<=2160]\" --merge-output-format mp4 \"VIDEO_URL\"\n\n# 1080p (Full HD)\nyt-dlp -f \"bestvideo[height<=1080]+bestaudio/best[height<=1080]\" --merge-output-format mp4 \"VIDEO_URL\"\n\n# 720p (HD)\nyt-dlp -f \"bestvideo[height<=720]+bestaudio/best[height<=720]\" --merge-output-format mp4 \"VIDEO_URL\"\n\n# 480p (SD)\nyt-dlp -f \"bestvideo[height<=480]+bestaudio/best[height<=480]\" --merge-output-format mp4 \"VIDEO_URL\"\n```\n\n### Audio Extraction\n\n```bash\n# Extract as MP3\nyt-dlp -x --audio-format mp3 -o \"%(title)s.%(ext)s\" \"VIDEO_URL\"\n\n# Extract as M4A (better quality)\nyt-dlp -x --audio-format m4a -o \"%(title)s.%(ext)s\" \"VIDEO_URL\"\n```\n\n### Batch Downloads\n\n```bash\n# Download multiple URLs from file\nyt-dlp -a urls.txt\n\n# Download playlist with custom naming\nyt-dlp -o \"%(playlist)s/%(playlist_index)s - %(title)s.%(ext)s\" \"PLAYLIST_URL\"\n\n# Download channel''s videos\nyt-dlp -o \"%(uploader)s/%(title)s.%(ext)s\" \"CHANNEL_URL\"\n```\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n### Configuration\n\n#### `.env.example`\nTemplate for environment variables. Copy to `.env` and add your SiliconFlow API key.\n\n### Scripts\n\n#### `scripts/transcribe_siliconflow.py`\nAI-powered transcription script using SiliconFlow''s free API.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\npython scripts/transcribe_siliconflow.py --file <audio/video> [--api-key <key>] [--output <path>]\n```\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `--file, -f`: Input audio/video file (required)\n- `--api-key, -k`: SiliconFlow API key (or use `SILICONFLOW_API_KEY` env var)\n- `--output, -o`: Output markdown file path (default: `YYYY-MM-DD-filename.md`)\n- `--model, -m`: Model to use (default: `FunAudioLLM/SenseVoiceSmall`)\n\n### References\n\n#### `references/supported_platforms.md`\nComprehensive list of 1000+ supported platforms with platform-specific notes and requirements.\n\n#### `references/quality_formats.md`\nDetailed explanation of video formats, codecs, and quality selection strategies.\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Always specify quality if user has preference** - saves bandwidth and storage\n2. **Batch downloads save time** - use playlist URLs when possible\n3. **Audio extraction is faster** - recommend for podcast/music content\n4. **Check file size before downloading** - warn user for very large files (>1GB)\n5. **Transcription works best with clear audio** - consider extracting audio first for better results\n\n## Sources\n\n- [yt-dlp Documentation](https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp)\n- [yt-dlp Installation Guide](https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp#installation)\n- [SiliconFlow API Documentation](https://docs.siliconflow.cn/)\n- [SiliconFlow Free API Key](https://cloud.siliconflow.cn/account/ak)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:09:07.597Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Media Agents requiring comprehensive video downloading and transcription capabilities from multiple platforms","zh":"适用于需要从多个平台下载和转录视频的媒体代理","ja":"複数のプラットフォームからのビデオのダウンロードとトランスクリプション機能を必要とするメディアエージェントに適しています","ko":"여러 플랫폼에서 비디오를 다운로드하고 전사하는 기능을 필요로 하는 미디어 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de medios que requieren capacidades de descarga y transcripción de video integrales desde múltiples plataformas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de médias nécessitant des capacités de téléchargement et de transcription de vidéos complètes à partir de plusieurs plateformes","de":"Ideal für Media-Agenten, die umfassende Video-Download- und Transkriptionsfunktionen von mehreren Plattformen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mídia que exigem capacidades de download de vídeo e transcrição abrangentes de várias plataformas","ru":"Идеально подходит для медиа-агентов, требующих комплексных возможностей скачивания видео и транскрипции с нескольких платформ","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الوسائط الذين يتطلبون возможности تحميل شاملة لتحميل الفيديو والنسخ من منصات متعددة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to download videos from 1000+ platforms including YouTube, Bilibili, and TikTok using yt-dlp, and transcribe them to Markdown using SiliconFlow API, supporting various video formats and protocols","zh":"赋予代理下载来自1000+平台（包括YouTube、Bilibili和TikTok）的视频使用yt-dlp，并使用SiliconFlow API将其转录为Markdown，支持各种视频格式和协议","ja":"エージェントに、yt-dlpを使用してYouTube、Bilibili、TikTokを含む1000以上のプラットフォームからのビデオをダウンロードし、SiliconFlow APIを使用してMarkdownにトランスクリプションする機能を提供します。さまざまなビデオ形式とプロトコルをサポートします","ko":"에이전트가 yt-dlp를 사용하여 1000개 이상의 플랫폼(Youtube, Bilibili, TikTok 포함)에서 비디오를 다운로드하고, SiliconFlow API를 사용하여 마크다운으로 전사하는 기능을 제공합니다. 다양한 비디오 형식과 프로토콜을 지원합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes descargar videos de más de 1000 plataformas, incluyendo YouTube, Bilibili y TikTok, utilizando yt-dlp, y transcribirlos a Markdown utilizando la API de SiliconFlow, que admite varios formatos y protocolos de video","fr":"Permet aux agents de télécharger des vidéos à partir de plus de 1000 plateformes, dont YouTube, Bilibili et TikTok, en utilisant yt-dlp, et de les transcrire en Markdown en utilisant l''API SiliconFlow, qui prend en charge divers formats et protocoles vidéo","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Videos von über 1000 Plattformen, einschließlich YouTube, Bilibili und TikTok, mithilfe von yt-dlp herunterzuladen und in Markdown mithilfe der SiliconFlow-API zu transkribieren, die verschiedene Videoformate und -protokolle unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a baixar vídeos de mais de 1000 plataformas, incluindo YouTube, Bilibili e TikTok usando yt-dlp, e transcrevê-los para Markdown usando a API SiliconFlow, suportando vários formatos de vídeo e protocolos","ru":"Позволяет агентам скачивать видео с более чем 1000 платформ, включая YouTube, Bilibili и TikTok, используя yt-dlp, и транскрибировать их в Markdown, используя API SiliconFlow, поддерживающую различные форматы видео и протоколы","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحميل مقاطع فيديو من أكثر من 1000 منصة ، بما في ذلك يوتيوب و Bilibili وتيك توك باستخدام yt-dlp ، ونسخها إلى Markdown باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SiliconFlow ، ودعم صيغ فيديو وبروتوكولات متعددة"},"useCases":{"en":["Downloading videos from social media platforms","Transcribing videos to Markdown for text analysis","Automating video content processing for machine learning models"],"zh":["从社交媒体平台下载视频","将视频转录为Markdown进行文本分析","自动化视频内容处理以用于机器学习模型"],"ja":["ソーシャルメディアプラットフォームからのビデオダウンロード","テキスト分析のためのビデオをMarkdownにトランスクリプションする","機械学習モデルで使用するためのビデオコンテンツ処理の自動化"],"ko":["소셜 미디어 플랫폼에서 비디오 다운로드","텍스트 분석을 위한 비디오를 마크다운으로 전사","기계 학습 모델에서 사용하기 위한 비디오 내용 처리 자동화"],"es":["Descargar videos de plataformas de medios sociales","Transcribir videos a Markdown para análisis de texto","Automatizar el procesamiento de contenido de video para modelos de aprendizaje automático"],"fr":["Télécharger des vidéos à partir de plateformes de médias sociaux","Transcrire des vidéos en Markdown pour l''analyse de texte","Automatiser le traitement de contenu vidéo pour les modèles d''apprentissage automatique"],"de":["Videos von sozialen Medienplattformen herunterladen","Videos in Markdown für Textanalyse transkribieren","Automatisieren des Videoinhaltsverarbeitungsprozesses für maschinelle Lernmodelle"],"pt":["Baixar vídeos de plataformas de mídia social","Transcrever vídeos para Markdown para análise de texto","Automatizar o processamento de conteúdo de vídeo para modelos de aprendizado de máquina"],"ru":["Скачивание видео с социальных медиа-платформ","Транскрипция видео в Markdown для анализа текста","Автоматизация обработки видеоконтента для моделей машинного обучения"],"ar":["تحميل مقاطع الفيديو من منصات الوسائط الاجتماعية","نسخ مقاطع الفيديو إلى Markdown للتحليل النصي","توفير автоматизация معالجة محتوى الفيديو لنمذجة التعلم الآلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires yt-dlp and SiliconFlow API integration","Limited to platforms supported by yt-dlp and SiliconFlow API"],"zh":["需要yt-dlp和SiliconFlow API集成","仅限于yt-dlp和SiliconFlow API支持的平台"],"ja":["yt-dlpとSiliconFlow APIの統合が必要","yt-dlpとSiliconFlow APIでサポートされているプラットフォームのみ"],"ko":["yt-dlp와 SiliconFlow API 통합이 필요","yt-dlp와 SiliconFlow API에서 지원하는 플랫폼만"],"es":["Requiere la integración de yt-dlp y la API de SiliconFlow","Limitado a las plataformas compatibles con yt-dlp y la API de SiliconFlow"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de yt-dlp et de l''API SiliconFlow","Limité aux plateformes prises en charge par yt-dlp et l''API SiliconFlow"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration von yt-dlp und der SiliconFlow-API","Begrenzt auf Plattformen, die von yt-dlp und der SiliconFlow-API unterstützt werden"],"pt":["Exige integração com yt-dlp e API SiliconFlow","Limitado às plataformas suportadas por yt-dlp e API SiliconFlow"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с yt-dlp и API SiliconFlow","Ограничен платформами, поддерживаемыми yt-dlp и API SiliconFlow"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع yt-dlp و واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SiliconFlow","محدود بالمنصات المدعومة من yt-dlp و واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SiliconFlow"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
