 것을 한 번에 생성","사용자 정의 파일 생성 지원","VS Code와 통합하여 개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Apertura de archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc en Marked 2","Mejora del flujo de trabajo para desarrolladores","Compatibilidad con VS Code","Edición eficiente de archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Ouverture de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc dans Marked 2","Amélioration du flux de travail pour les développeurs","Compatibilité avec VS Code","Édition efficace de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Öffnen von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien in Marked 2","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs für Entwickler","Kompatibilität mit VS Code","Effiziente Bearbeitung von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Abre arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc no Marked 2","Simplifica a criação de artefatos","Permite a edição de arquivos no VS Code","Suporta a geração de arquivos em kebab-case","Pergunta ao usuário sobre o tipo de alteração desejada","Deriva o nome da alteração a partir da descrição do usuário"],"ru":["Открывает файлы Markdown и AsciiDoc в Marked 2","Упрощает создание артефактов","Позволяет редактировать файлы в VS Code","Поддерживает генерацию файлов в kebab-case","Спрашивает пользователя о типе изменения","Получает имя изменения из описания пользователя"],"ar":["يفتح ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc في Marked 2","يسهم في تبسيط إنشاء الملفات","يسمح بتحرير الملفات في برنامج VS Code","يدعم إنشاء الملفات في kebab-case","يسأل المستخدم عن نوع التغيير المطلوب","يستخلص اسم التغيير من وصف المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["VS Code 扩展","Markdown 文件","AsciiDoc 文件","Marked 2","快速创建","开发效率","VS Code 集成"],"ja":["VS Code 拡張","Markdown ファイル","AsciiDoc ファイル","Marked 2","高速作成","開発効率","VS Code 統合"],"ko":["VS Code 확장","Markdown 파일","AsciiDoc 파일","Marked 2","빠른 생성","개발 효율성","VS Code 통합"],"es":["VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","extensión de VS Code","desarrollo de software","edición de archivos","flujo de trabajo","productividad"],"fr":["VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","extension de VS Code","développement de logiciels","édition de fichiers","flux de travail","productivité"],"de":["VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","VS Code-Erweiterung","Softwareentwicklung","Dateibearbeitung","Arbeitsablauf","Produktivität"],"pt":["VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","criação de artefatos","desenvolvimento de software","extensão para VS Code","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","produtividade de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","создание артефактов","разработка программного обеспечения","расширение для VS Code","инструменты разработки","продуктивность разработки"],"ar":["برنامج VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","إنشاء الملفات","تطوير البرمجيات","امتداد لبرنامج VS Code","أدوات التطوير","إنتاجية التطوير"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"vscode-open-in-marked2","repoPath":"gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-ff-change","description":"Fast-forward through OpenSpec artifact creation. Use when the user wants to quickly create all artifacts needed for implementation without stepping through each one individually.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-c","body":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/`.\n\n3. **Get the artifact build order**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to get:\n   - `applyRequires`: array of artifact IDs needed before implementation (e.g., `[\"tasks\"]`)\n   - `artifacts`: list of all artifacts with their status and dependencies\n\n4. **Create artifacts in sequence until apply-ready**\n\n   Use the **TodoWrite tool** to track progress through the artifacts.\n\n   Loop through artifacts in dependency order (artifacts with no pending dependencies first):\n\n   a. **For each artifact that is `ready` (dependencies satisfied)**:\n      - Get instructions:\n        ```bash\n        openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n        ```\n      - The instructions JSON includes:\n        - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n        - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance for this artifact type\n        - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n        - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n      - Read any completed dependency files for context\n      - Create the artifact file using `template` as the structure\n      - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints - but do NOT copy them into the file\n      - Show brief progress: \"✓ Created <artifact-id>\"\n\n   b. **Continue until all `applyRequires` artifacts are complete**\n      - After creating each artifact, re-run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Check if every artifact ID in `applyRequires` has `status: \"done\"` in the artifacts array\n      - Stop when all `applyRequires` artifacts are done\n\n   c. **If an artifact requires user input** (unclear context):\n      - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to clarify\n      - Then continue with creation\n\n5. **Show final status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing all artifacts, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- List of artifacts created with brief descriptions\n- What''s ready: \"All artifacts created! Ready for implementation.\"\n- Prompt: \"Run `/opsx:apply` or ask me to implement to start working on the tasks.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\n- Follow the `instruction` field from `openspec instructions` for each artifact type\n- The schema defines what each artifact should contain - follow it\n- Read dependency artifacts for context before creating new ones\n- Use `template` as the structure for your output file - fill in its sections\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ALL artifacts needed for implementation (as defined by schema''s `apply.requires`)\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- If context is critically unclear, ask the user - but prefer making reasonable decisions to keep momentum\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Verify each artifact file exists after writing before proceeding to next\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:09:17.202Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing rapid Markdown and AsciiDoc file handling in VS Code","zh":"非常适合需要在VS Code中快速处理Markdown和AsciiDoc文件的开发代理","ja":"VS CodeでMarkdownとAsciiDocファイルを迅速に処理する必要がある開発エージェントに最適","ko":"VS Code에서 Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일을 신속하게 처리해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan un manejo rápido de archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc en VS Code","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion rapide de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc dans VS Code","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die ein schnelles Handling von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien in VS Code benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de manipulação rápida de arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc no VS Code","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима быстрая обработка файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc в VS Code","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير العاملين الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة سريعة لملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc في VS Code"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fast-forward through artifact creation, generating everything needed to start implementation in one go, using Marked 2 for Markdown and AsciiDoc file preview, and leveraging kebab-case change names for efficient project setup","zh":"赋予代理人快速创建构件的能力，使用Marked 2预览Markdown和AsciiDoc文件，并利用短横线命名法更高效地设置项目","ja":"エージェントがアーティファクトの作成を高速化する機能を提供し、Marked 2を使用してMarkdownとAsciiDocファイルをプレビューし、ケバブケースの変更名を使用してプロジェクトの設定を効率化する","ko":"에이전트가 아티팩트 생성을 신속하게 진행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, Marked 2를 사용하여 Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일을 미리 보고, 케밥 케이스 변경 이름을 사용하여 프로젝트 설정을 효율적으로 진행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a avanzar rápidamente en la creación de artefactos, generando todo lo necesario para comenzar la implementación de una vez, utilizando Marked 2 para la vista previa de archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc, y aprovechando los nombres de cambio en kebab-case para una configuración de proyecto eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire un saut en avant dans la création d''artefacts, en générant tout ce qui est nécessaire pour commencer la mise en œuvre en une seule fois, en utilisant Marked 2 pour l''aperçu de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc, et en exploitant les noms de changement en kebab-case pour une configuration de projet efficace","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, durch die Artefakterstellung zu beschleunigen, indem alles Notwendige für den Beginn der Implementierung auf einmal generiert wird, unter Verwendung von Marked 2 für die Vorschau von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien und unter Ausnutzung von kebab-case-Änderungsnamen für eine effiziente Projektsetup","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acelerar a criação de artefatos, gerando tudo o que é necessário para iniciar a implementação de uma vez, usando o Marked 2 para visualização de arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc e aproveitando nomes de alterações em kebab-case para configuração eficiente do projeto","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ускорить создание артефактов, генерируя все необходимое для начала реализации за один раз, используя Marked 2 для предпросмотра файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc и используя имена изменений в kebab-case для эффективной настройки проекта","ar":"يمكن للعميل التحرك بسرعة في إنشاء الملفات المطلوبة ، من خلال إنشاء كل ما هو ضروري لبدء التنفيذ في المرة الأولى ، باستخدام Marked 2 لمعاينة ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc واستخدام أسماء التغييرات في kebab-case لتكوين المشروع بكفاءة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Markdown file generation","Streamlining AsciiDoc file preview in Marked 2","Deriving kebab-case change names from user descriptions"],"zh":["自动化Markdown文件生成","在Marked 2中简化AsciiDoc文件预览","从用户描述中导出短横线命名法的更改名称"],"ja":["Markdownファイルの自動生成","Marked 2でのAsciiDocファイルプレビューの簡素化","ユーザー描述からケバブケースの変更名を導出"],"ko":["Markdown 파일 자동 생성","Marked 2에서 AsciiDoc 파일 미리 보기 단순화","사용자 설명에서 케밥 케이스 변경 이름 추출"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de archivos Markdown","Optimización de la vista previa de archivos AsciiDoc en Marked 2","Derivación de nombres de cambio en kebab-case a partir de descripciones de usuarios"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de fichiers Markdown","Optimisation de l''aperçu de fichiers AsciiDoc dans Marked 2","Déduction de noms de changement en kebab-case à partir de descriptions d''utilisateurs"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Markdown-Dateien","Optimierung der Vorschau von AsciiDoc-Dateien in Marked 2","Ableitung von Änderungsnamen im kebab-case aus Benutzerbeschreibungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de arquivos Markdown","Otimizar a visualização de arquivos AsciiDoc no Marked 2","Derivar nomes de alterações em kebab-case a partir de descrições do usuário"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию файлов Markdown","Оптимизировать предпросмотр файлов AsciiDoc в Marked 2","Получать имена изменений в kebab-case из описаний пользователя"],"ar":["توفير 자동 لإنشاء ملفات Markdown","تحسين معاينة ملفات AsciiDoc في Marked 2","استخراج أسماء التغييرات في kebab-case من وصفات المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VS Code extension installation","Limited to Markdown and AsciiDoc file formats","Needs user input for change name or description"],"zh":["需要安装VS Code扩展","仅限Markdown和AsciiDoc文件格式","需要用户输入更改名称或描述"],"ja":["VS Code拡張機能のインストールが必要","MarkdownとAsciiDocファイル形式のみ","変更名または説明のユーザー入力が必要"],"ko":["VS Code 확장 프로그램 설치가 필요","Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일 형식만 해당","사용자 입력이 변경 이름 또는 설명에 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la extensión de VS Code","Limitado a los formatos de archivo Markdown y AsciiDoc","Necesita la entrada del usuario para el nombre o la descripción del cambio"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''extension VS Code","Limité aux formats de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc","Nécessite une entrée de l''utilisateur pour le nom ou la description du changement"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der VS Code-Erweiterung","Begrenzt auf Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateiformate","Benötigt die Eingabe des Benutzers für den Namen oder die Beschreibung der Änderung"],"pt":["Requer instalação da extensão do VS Code","Limitado a formatos de arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc","Necessita de entrada do usuário para nome ou descrição da alteração"],"ru":["Требует установки расширения VS Code","Ограничен форматами файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc","Требует ввода пользователя для имени или описания изменения"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت امتداد VS Code","محدود بصيغ ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc","يحتاج إلى إدخال المستخدم لاسم التغيير أو الوصف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
