ides de développement complet pour les applications Vue 3 avec TypeScript, y compris la configuration et les meilleures pratiques","de":"Umfassende Entwicklungsguides für Vue 3-Anwendungen mit TypeScript, einschließlich Konfiguration und Best Practices","pt":"Este guia oferece diretrizes abrangentes para desenvolver aplicações Vue 3 com TypeScript, incluindo configuração e boas práticas","ru":"Это руководство предоставляет комплексные рекомендации для разработки приложений Vue 3 с TypeScript, включая настройку и лучшие практики","ar":"يقدم هذا الدليل إرشادات شاملة لتطوير تطبيقات Vue 3 مع TypeScript، بما في ذلك الإعداد وأفضل الممارسات","en":"个人网站模板，动效流"},"definition":{"en":"个人网站模板，动效流"},"features":{"zh":["TypeScript 配置","Vue 3 应用调试","Vite 配置","Vue Router 类型路由","Vitest 组件测试","组合 API 模式"],"ja":["TypeScript 設定","Vue 3 アプリのデバッグ","Vite 設定","Vue Router 型ルーティング","Vitest コンポーネントテスト","コンポジション API パターン"],"ko":["TypeScript 구성","Vue 3 애플리케이션 디버깅","Vite 구성","Vue Router 유형 라우팅","Vitest 컴포넌트 테스트","컴포지션 API 패턴"],"es":["Configuración de TypeScript para Vue 3","Depuración de problemas de comprobación de tipos con vue-tsc","Configuración de Vite para proyectos Vue","Enrutamiento tipado con Vue Router","Pruebas de componentes con Vitest"],"fr":["Configuration de TypeScript pour Vue 3","Débogage des problèmes de vérification de types avec vue-tsc","Configuration de Vite pour les projets Vue","Enrutement typé avec Vue Router","Tests de composants avec Vitest"],"de":["TypeScript-Konfiguration für Vue 3","Fehlerbehebung bei Typprüfungsproblemen mit vue-tsc","Vite-Konfiguration für Vue-Projekte","Typisierung von Routen mit Vue Router","Komponententests mit Vitest"],"pt":["Configuração de projetos Vue 3 + TypeScript","Depuração de problemas de verificação de tipo com vue-tsc","Integração com IDE/editores com Volar","Configuração de Vite para projetos Vue","Trabalho com rotas tipadas do Vue Router","Escrita de testes de componentes com Vitest"],"ru":["Настройка проектов Vue 3 + TypeScript","Отладка проблем проверки типов с vue-tsc","Интеграция с IDE/редакторами с Volar","Настройка Vite для проектов Vue","Работа с типизированными маршрутами Vue Router","Написание тестов компонентов с Vitest"],"ar":["إعداد مشاريع Vue 3 + TypeScript","تصحيح مشاكل التحقق من النوع مع vue-tsc","التكامل مع IDE/المحررين مع Volar","إعداد Vite لمشاريع Vue","العمل مع مسارات مُحددة النوع من Vue Router","كتابة اختبارات المكونات مع Vitest"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vue 最佳实践","TypeScript 配置","Vue 3 应用","Vite","Vue Router","Vitest","组合 API","Vue 调试","Vue 测试"],"ja":["Vue ベストプラクティス","TypeScript 設定","Vue 3 アプリ","Vite","Vue Router","Vitest","コンポジション API","Vue デバッグ","Vue テスト"],"ko":["Vue 최적화 가이드","TypeScript 구성","Vue 3 애플리케이션","Vite","Vue Router","Vitest","컴포지션 API","Vue 디버깅","Vue 테스트"],"es":["mejores prácticas vue","vue 3","typeScript","vite","vue router","vitest","desarrollo de aplicaciones","prácticas de desarrollo"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques vue","vue 3","typeScript","vite","vue router","vitest","développement d''applications","pratiques de développement"],"de":["vue-best-practices","vue 3","typeScript","vite","vue router","vitest","anwendungsentwicklung","entwicklungspraktiken"],"pt":["melhores práticas vue","desenvolvimento vue 3","typescript","configuração vue","depuração vue","testes vue","vite","vue router","vitest"],"ru":["лучшие практики vue","разработка приложений vue 3","typescript","настройка vue","отладка vue","тестирование vue","vite","vue router","vitest"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات ل_vue","تطوير تطبيقات vue 3","typescript","إعداد vue","تصحيح vue","اختبار vue","vite","vue router","vitest"]}},"owner":"lycHub","repo":"cool-person","repoPath":"lycHub/cool-person","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vue-best-practices","description":"Comprehensive Vue 3 development best practices, TypeScript configuration, tooling troubleshooting, testing patterns, and composition API gotchas. Covers vue-tsc, Volar, Vite configuration, Vue Router typing, component testing, reactivity patterns, and SFC features. Use when working with Vue 3 + TypeScript projects, debugging build errors, writing tests, or following best practices.","version":"5.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vue Best Practices\n\nComprehensive development guidelines, TypeScript configuration, and best practices for Vue 3 applications.\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Setting up or configuring Vue 3 + TypeScript projects\n- Debugging type checking issues with vue-tsc\n- Fixing IDE/editor integration with Volar\n- Configuring Vite for Vue projects\n- Working with Vue Router typed routes\n- Writing component tests with Vitest\n- Using Composition API patterns\n- Working with defineModel, defineProps, defineExpose\n- Writi","body":"# Vue Best Practices\n\nComprehensive development guidelines, TypeScript configuration, and best practices for Vue 3 applications.\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Setting up or configuring Vue 3 + TypeScript projects\n- Debugging type checking issues with vue-tsc\n- Fixing IDE/editor integration with Volar\n- Configuring Vite for Vue projects\n- Working with Vue Router typed routes\n- Writing component tests with Vitest\n- Using Composition API patterns\n- Working with defineModel, defineProps, defineExpose\n- Writing reusable composables\n\n---\n\n## Capability Rules\n\nRules that enable AI to solve problems it cannot solve without the skill.\n\n### Type Checking\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [vue-tsc-strict-templates](rules/vue-tsc-strict-templates.md) | HIGH | Enable strict template checking to catch undefined components |\n| [vue-define-model-generics](rules/vue-define-model-generics.md) | HIGH | Fix vue-tsc errors when using defineModel with generic components |\n\n### vueCompilerOptions Settings\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [fallthrough-attributes](rules/fallthrough-attributes.md) | HIGH | Type-check fallthrough attributes on wrapper components |\n| [strict-css-modules](rules/strict-css-modules.md) | MEDIUM | Catch typos in CSS module class names at compile time |\n| [data-attributes-config](rules/data-attributes-config.md) | MEDIUM | Allow data-* attributes with strictTemplates enabled |\n\n### Tooling & Configuration\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [vue-tsc-typescript-compatibility](rules/vue-tsc-typescript-compatibility.md) | HIGH | Fix vue-tsc and TypeScript version incompatibility issues |\n| [volar-3-breaking-changes](rules/volar-3-breaking-changes.md) | HIGH | Fix editor integration after Volar/vue-language-server 3.0 upgrade |\n| [module-resolution-bundler](rules/module-resolution-bundler.md) | HIGH | Fix \"Cannot find module\" errors after @vue/tsconfig upgrade |\n| [unplugin-auto-import-conflicts](rules/unplugin-auto-import-conflicts.md) | HIGH | Fix component types resolving as any with unplugin conflicts |\n| [codeactions-save-performance](rules/codeactions-save-performance.md) | HIGH | Fix 30-60 second save delays in large Vue projects |\n\n### Vite Configuration\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [path-alias-vue-sfc](rules/path-alias-vue-sfc.md) | HIGH | Fix resolve.alias failures in Vue SFC files |\n| [duplicate-plugin-detection](rules/duplicate-plugin-detection.md) | MEDIUM | Detect and fix duplicate Vue plugin registration |\n\n### Component Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [use-template-ref-generics](rules/use-template-ref-generics.md) | MEDIUM | Fix incorrect type inference for refs to generic components |\n| [define-model-update-event](rules/define-model-update-event.md) | MEDIUM | Fix runtime errors from unexpected undefined in model updates |\n| [with-defaults-union-types](rules/with-defaults-union-types.md) | MEDIUM | Fix incorrect default value behavior with union type props |\n| [verbatim-module-syntax](rules/verbatim-module-syntax.md) | MEDIUM | Fix Vite dev server errors with type-only imports |\n| [deep-watch-numeric](rules/deep-watch-numeric.md) | MEDIUM | Enable efficient array mutation watching with Vue 3.5+ numeric deep |\n\n### Template Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [vue-directive-comments](rules/vue-directive-comments.md) | HIGH | Control template type checking with @vue-ignore, @vue-skip directives |\n\n### SFC Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [script-setup-jsdoc](rules/script-setup-jsdoc.md) | MEDIUM | Add JSDoc documentation to script setup components |\n\n### Vue Router\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [vue-router-typed-params](rules/vue-router-typed-params.md) | MEDIUM | Fix route params type narrowing with unplugin-vue-router |\n\n### Testing Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [teleport-testing](rules/teleport-testing.md) | HIGH | Test teleported content (modals, tooltips) |\n\n### TypeScript Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [vueuse-emits-conflict](rules/vueuse-emits-conflict.md) | MEDIUM | Fix $emit type conflicts with VueUse element composables |\n\n---\n\n## Efficiency Rules\n\nRules that help AI solve problems more effectively and consistently.\n\n### Vite Configuration\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [runtime-env-variables](rules/runtime-env-variables.md) | HIGH | Implement runtime environment variables for multi-env deployments |\n| [hmr-vue-ssr](rules/hmr-vue-ssr.md) | MEDIUM | Fix HMR issues in Vue SSR applications |\n\n### Component Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [define-expose-types](rules/define-expose-types.md) | MEDIUM | Fix \"Property does not exist\" errors when accessing exposed methods |\n| [provide-inject-types](rules/provide-inject-types.md) | MEDIUM | Enable type-safe dependency injection with InjectionKey |\n\n### Vue Router\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [route-meta-types](rules/route-meta-types.md) | HIGH | Extend RouteMeta interface for type-safe metadata |\n| [scroll-behavior-types](rules/scroll-behavior-types.md) | MEDIUM | Properly type scrollBehavior function |\n| [dynamic-routes-typing](rules/dynamic-routes-typing.md) | MEDIUM | Type-safe dynamic route configuration |\n\n### Testing Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [suspense-testing](rules/suspense-testing.md) | HIGH | Test async components with Suspense properly |\n| [pinia-store-mocking](rules/pinia-store-mocking.md) | HIGH | Mock Pinia stores correctly with Vitest |\n| [router-mocking](rules/router-mocking.md) | HIGH | Mock Vue Router with useRoute and useRouter |\n| [vue-test-utils-types](rules/vue-test-utils-types.md) | MEDIUM | Fix wrapper.vm property access types in Vue Test Utils |\n\n### Composition API Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [reactive-destructuring](rules/reactive-destructuring.md) | HIGH | Avoid reactivity loss when destructuring reactive objects |\n| [composable-cleanup](rules/composable-cleanup.md) | HIGH | Prevent memory leaks in composables with proper cleanup |\n| [ref-unwrapping](rules/ref-unwrapping.md) | MEDIUM | Understand ref auto-unwrapping in reactive objects |\n| [watcheffect-tracking](rules/watcheffect-tracking.md) | MEDIUM | Fix conditional dependency tracking in watchEffect |\n\n### SFC Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [script-setup-patterns](rules/script-setup-patterns.md) | HIGH | Best practices for script setup syntax |\n| [css-v-bind](rules/css-v-bind.md) | MEDIUM | Safely use reactive values in CSS |\n\n### TypeScript Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [component-type-helpers](rules/component-type-helpers.md) | HIGH | Extract component prop and emit types |\n| [event-handler-typing](rules/event-handler-typing.md) | MEDIUM | Type event handlers correctly |\n\n---\n\n## Reference\n\n- [Vue Language Tools](https://github.com/vuejs/language-tools)\n- [Vue 3 Documentation](https://vuejs.org/)\n- [Vite Documentation](https://vite.dev/)\n- [Vue Router](https://router.vuejs.org/)\n- [Vue Test Utils](https://test-utils.vuejs.org/)\n- [VueUse](https://vueuse.org/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:09:28.816Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents focused on building scalable and maintainable Vue 3 applications with TypeScript","zh":"适用于专注于构建可扩展和可维护的 Vue 3 应用程序（使用 TypeScript）的前端代理","ja":"TypeScript を使用してスケーラブルでメンテナンス可能な Vue 3 アプリケーションを構築することに重点を置くフロントエンド エージェントに最適","ko":"TypeScript를 사용하여 확장 가능하고 유지 보수 가능한 Vue 3 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 중점을 둔 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend centrados en construir aplicaciones escalables y mantenibles con Vue 3 y TypeScript","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend axés sur la création d''applications évolutives et maintenables avec Vue 3 et TypeScript","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf den Bau von skalierbaren und wartbaren Vue-3-Anwendungen mit TypeScript konzentrieren","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend focados em construir aplicações escaláveis e mantíveis com Vue 3 e TypeScript","ru":"Идеально для агентов фронтенда, ориентированных на создание масштабируемых и поддерживаемых приложений Vue 3 с TypeScript","ar":"مثالي للوكيلات الأمامية التي تركز على بناء تطبيقات قابلة للتطوير وقابلة للصيانة مع Vue 3 و TypeScript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to set up and configure Vue 3 projects with TypeScript, leveraging best practices for debugging type checking issues with vue-tsc, configuring Vite, and working with Vue Router typed routes, while utilizing Composition API patterns and tools like Volar for seamless IDE integration","zh":"赋予代理设置和配置使用 TypeScript 的 Vue 3 项目的能力，利用 vue-tsc 进行调试类型检查问题、配置 Vite 和使用 Vue Router 的类型化路由以及 Composition API 模式等最佳实践，同时利用 Volar 等工具实现无缝的 IDE 集成","ja":"エージェントに、TypeScript を使用する Vue 3 プロジェクトを設定して構成する能力を付与し、vue-tsc を使用したタイプ チェックの問題のデバッグ、Vite の構成、Vue Router の型付けルーティング、Composition API パターンなどのベスト プラクティスを活用し、Volar などのツールを使用して無駄のない IDE 統合を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 TypeScript를 사용하는 Vue 3 프로젝트를 설정하고 구성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, vue-tsc를 사용한 타입 검사 문제의 디버깅, Vite의 구성, Vue Router의 유형화된 라우팅, Composition API 패턴 등의 모범 사례를 활용하고, Volar 등의 툴을 사용하여 무결한 IDE 통합을 구현","es":"Permite a los agentes configurar y establecer proyectos de Vue 3 con TypeScript, aprovechando las mejores prácticas para depurar problemas de comprobación de tipos con vue-tsc, configurar Vite y trabajar con rutas tipadas de Vue Router, mientras utiliza patrones y herramientas de la API de Composición como Volar para una integración de IDE sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer et de paramétrer des projets Vue 3 avec TypeScript, en exploitant les meilleures pratiques pour déboguer les problèmes de vérification de types avec vue-tsc, configurer Vite et travailler avec des routes typées de Vue Router, tout en utilisant des modèles et des outils d''API de composition comme Volar pour une intégration d''IDE sans accroc","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Vue-3-Projekte mit TypeScript einzurichten und zu konfigurieren, indem sie bewährte Verfahren zur Fehlerbehebung von Typüberprüfungsproblemen mit vue-tsc, zur Konfiguration von Vite und zur Arbeit mit typisierten Vue-Router-Routen nutzen, während sie Muster und Tools der Composition-API wie Volar für eine nahtlose IDE-Integration verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar e configurar projetos Vue 3 com TypeScript, aproveitando as melhores práticas para depurar problemas de verificação de tipos com vue-tsc, configurar Vite e trabalhar com rotas tipadas do Vue Router, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza padrões de API de Composição e ferramentas como Volar para integração de IDE sem problemas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настроить и сконфигурировать 