Sichere Authentifizierung mit gh auth login","Verwendung der --repo-Flagge für Operationen außerhalb des Git-Verzeichnisses","Überprüfung des Authentifizierungsstatus mit gh auth status","Einrichtung des Git-Credential-Helfers","Integration mit OpenAI und AzureOpenAI"],"pt":["Autenticação com o GitHub","Uso do flag --repo","Verificação do status de autenticação","Configuração do helper de credenciais do Git","Uso da CLI do GitHub para testar e operar backends do OpenAI"],"ru":["Аутентификация с GitHub","Использование флага --repo","Проверка статуса аутентификации","Настройка помощника учетных данных Git","Использование GitHub CLI для тестирования и эксплуатации бэкендов OpenAI"],"ar":["التحقق من هوية المستخدم مع GitHub","استخدام علم --repo","فحص حالة التحقق من الهوية","تكوين مساعد بيانات اعتماد Git","استخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub لاختبار وتشغيل الخوادم الخلفية لمشغل OpenAI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CLI","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","命令行工具","认证","授权","仓库操作","Git 凭据帮助"],"ja":["GitHub CLI","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","コマンドライン ツール","認証","認可","リポジトリ操作","Git クレデンシャル ヘルパー"],"ko":["GitHub CLI","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","명령줄 도구","인증","인가","저장소 운영","Git 자격증명 도우미"],"es":["GitHub CLI","desarrollo de software","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","autenticación segura","Git","desarrolladores"],"fr":["GitHub CLI","développement de logiciels","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","authentification sécurisée","Git","développeurs"],"de":["GitHub CLI","Softwareentwicklung","OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","sichere Authentifizierung","Git","Entwickler"],"pt":["GitHub CLI","OpenAI","backends","autenticação","flag --repo","credenciais do Git","desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["GitHub CLI","OpenAI","бэкенды","аутентификация","флаг --repo","учетные данные Git","разработчики","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub","OpenAI","الخوادم الخلفية","التحقق من الهوية","علم --repo","بيانات اعتماد Git","المطورون","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"OpenAI-BackendTools","repoPath":"karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github","description":"Apply when working with GitHub repositories, issues, PRs, or authentication","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI Guide\n\nRules and usage for GitHub CLI in `[WORKSPACE_FOLDER]/.tools/gh/`.\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Authenticate before first use: `gh auth login`\n- Use `--repo` flag when not in a git directory\n- Check auth status if commands fail: `gh auth status`\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Login to GitHub\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" auth login\n```\n\n### Check authentication status\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" auth status\n```\n\n### Setup git credential helper\n```powershell\n& \".tools/g","body":"# GitHub CLI Guide\n\nRules and usage for GitHub CLI in `[WORKSPACE_FOLDER]/.tools/gh/`.\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Authenticate before first use: `gh auth login`\n- Use `--repo` flag when not in a git directory\n- Check auth status if commands fail: `gh auth status`\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Login to GitHub\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" auth login\n```\n\n### Check authentication status\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" auth status\n```\n\n### Setup git credential helper\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" auth setup-git\n```\n\n## Repository Operations\n\n### Create new repository\n```powershell\n# Public repo\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo create <name> --public --source=. --remote=origin --push\n\n# Private repo\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo create <name> --private --source=. --remote=origin --push\n\n# From current directory with defaults\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo create --source=. --push\n```\n\n### Clone repository\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo clone <owner>/<repo>\n```\n\n### View repository info\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo view\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo view <owner>/<repo>\n```\n\n### List your repositories\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo list\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo list --limit 50\n```\n\n## Issues\n\n### Create issue\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue create --title \"Bug: something broke\" --body \"Description\"\n```\n\n### List issues\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue list\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue list --state open\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue list --label \"bug\"\n```\n\n### View issue\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue view <number>\n```\n\n### Close issue\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue close <number>\n```\n\n## Pull Requests\n\n### Create PR\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr create --title \"Add feature\" --body \"Description\"\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr create --fill  # Use commit info\n```\n\n### List PRs\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr list\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr list --state open\n```\n\n### View PR\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr view <number>\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr view --web  # Open in browser\n```\n\n### Merge PR\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr merge <number>\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr merge <number> --squash\n```\n\n### Checkout PR locally\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr checkout <number>\n```\n\n## Releases\n\n### Create release\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" release create v1.0.0 --title \"Version 1.0.0\" --notes \"Release notes\"\n```\n\n### List releases\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" release list\n```\n\n### Download release assets\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" release download v1.0.0\n```\n\n## Gists\n\n### Create gist\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" gist create file.txt --public\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" gist create file1.txt file2.txt --desc \"My gist\"\n```\n\n### List gists\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" gist list\n```\n\n## Workflow / Actions\n\n### List workflows\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" workflow list\n```\n\n### View workflow runs\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" run list\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" run view <run-id>\n```\n\n### Trigger workflow\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" workflow run <workflow-name>\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Create repo and push existing project\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo create <name> --private --source=. --remote=origin --push\n```\n\n### Fork and clone\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo fork <owner>/<repo> --clone\n```\n\n### Open repo in browser\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo view --web\n```\n\n## Setup\n\nFor initial installation, see `SETUP.md` in this skill folder.\n\n**Tool location:** `.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:09:11.487Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring seamless GitHub integration and automation","zh":"适用于需要无缝 GitHub 集成和自动化的 DevOps Agent","ja":"GitHub の統合と自動化を必要とする DevOps エージェントに最適","ko":"무결점 GitHub 통합 및 자동화가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren una integración y automatización de GitHub sin problemas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une intégration et une automatisation GitHub sans heurts","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine nahtlose GitHub-Integration und Automatisierung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que exigem integração sem interrupções com o GitHub e automação","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих бесшовной интеграции с GitHub и автоматизации","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذي يتطلب تكاملًا بدون انقطاع مع GitHub وتنفيذ تلقائي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate GitHub workflows using the GitHub CLI, facilitating tasks such as authentication, repository management, and issue tracking, all while leveraging git credential helpers and the `gh auth` command for secure interactions","zh":"赋予代理人使用 GitHub CLI 自动化 GitHub 工作流的能力，方便任务如身份验证、仓库管理和问题跟踪，同时利用 git 凭据助手和 `gh auth` 命令进行安全交互","ja":"エージェントが GitHub CLI を使用して GitHub ワークフローを自動化できるようにし、認証、リポジトリ管理、問題追跡などのタスクを容易にし、同時に git クレデンシャル ヘルパーと `gh auth` コマンドを使用してセキュアなやり取りを行う","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub CLI를 사용하여 GitHub 워크플ロー 자동화를 가능하게 하며, 인증, 저장소 관리 및 문제 추적 등의 작업을 용이하게 하며,同时 git 자격 증명 도우미와 `gh auth` 명령을 사용하여 보안 상호 작용을 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo de GitHub utilizando la CLI de GitHub, facilitando tareas como la autenticación, la administración de repositorios y el seguimiento de problemas, todo mientras aprovecha los ayudantes de credenciales de git y el comando `gh auth` para interacciones seguras","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail GitHub en utilisant la CLI GitHub, en facilitant des tâches telles que l''authentification, la gestion des référentiels et le suivi des problèmes, le tout en exploitant les aides de credentials git et la commande `gh auth` pour des interactions sécurisées","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, GitHub-Workflows mithilfe der GitHub-CLI zu automatisieren, wodurch Aufgaben wie Authentifizierung, Repository-Verwaltung und Problemmeldung erleichtert werden, und zwar unter Ausnutzung von git-Zugriffshilfen und dem `gh auth`-Befehl für sichere Interaktionen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho do GitHub usando a CLI do GitHub, facilitando tarefas como autenticação, gerenciamento de repositórios e acompanhamento de problemas, tudo isso aproveitando os ajudantes de credenciais do git e o comando `gh auth` para interações seguras","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать рабочие процессы GitHub с помощью CLI GitHub, облегчая задачи, такие как аутентификация, управление репозиториями и отслеживание проблем, все это при использовании помощников учетных данных git и команды `gh auth` для безопасного взаимодействия","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتحويل سير عمل GitHub تلقائيًا باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub، ويسهل المهام مثل المصادقة وإدارة المستودعات وتحديد المشكلات، وكل ذلك بالاستفادة من مساعدي بيانات اعتماد git وأمر `gh auth` للتفاعلات الآمنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Authenticating with GitHub using `gh auth login`","Managing repositories with the `--repo` flag","Debugging authentication issues with `gh auth status`"],"zh":["使用 `gh auth login` 进行 GitHub 身份验证","使用 `--repo` 标志管理仓库","使用 `gh auth status` 调试身份验证问题"],"ja":["`gh auth login` を使用した GitHub 認証","`--repo` フラグを使用したリポジトリ管理","`gh auth status` を使用した認証問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["`gh auth login`을 사용한 GitHub 인증","`--repo` 플래그를 사용한 저장소 관리","`gh auth status`를 사용한 인증 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Autenticación con GitHub utilizando `gh auth login`","Administración de repositorios con la marca `--repo`","Depuración de problemas de autenticación con `gh auth status`"],"fr":["Authentification avec GitHub en utilisant `gh auth login`","Gestion des référentiels avec l''indicateur `--repo`","Débogage des problèmes d''authentification avec `gh auth status`"],"de":["Authentifizierung bei GitHub mit `gh auth login`","Verwaltung von Repositories mit der Option `--repo`","Fehlerbehebung bei Authentifizierungsproblemen mit `gh auth status`"],"pt":["Autenticar com o GitHub usando `gh auth login`","Gerenciar repositórios com a flag `--repo`","Depurar problemas de autenticação com `gh auth status`"],"ru":["Аутентификация в GitHub с помощью `gh auth login`","Управление репозиториями с флагом `--repo`","Отладка проблем аутентификации с помощью `gh auth status`"],"ar":["المصادقة على GitHub باستخدام `gh auth login`","إدارة المستودعات مع علم `--repo`","تصحيح مشكلات المصادقة باستخدام `gh auth status`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Needs authentication before first use","Dependent on git directory context or `--repo` flag"],"zh":["需要安装 GitHub CLI","需要在第一次使用前进行身份验证","依赖于 git 目录上下文或 `--repo` 标志"],"ja":["GitHub CLI のインストールが必要","最初の使用前に認証が必要","git ディレクトリ コンテキストまたは `--repo` フラグに依存"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치가 필요","최초 사용 전 인증이 필요","git 디렉토리 컨텍스트 또는 `--repo` 플래그에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de GitHub","Necesita autenticación antes del primer 