ch: بحث متعمق في تطوير البرمجيات","en":"ipps-deep-research"},"description":{"zh":"ipps-deep-research, Azure ","ja":"ipps-deep-research, Azure ","ko":"ipps-deep-research, Azure ","es":"ipps-deep-research es una herramienta de investigación que utiliza Azure Web App en Python para indexar contenido de SharePoint","fr":"ipps-deep-research est un outil de recherche qui utilise Azure Web App en Python pour indexer le contenu de SharePoint","de":"ipps-deep-research ist ein Recherche-Tool, das Azure Web App in Python verwendet, um SharePoint-Inhalte zu indexieren","pt":"O ipps-deep-research é uma ferramenta de pesquisa aprofundada para desenvolvedores, permitindo a investigação sistemática de tópicos de desenvolvimento de so...","ru":"ipps-deep-research - это инструмент глубокого исследования для разработчиков, позволяющий проводить систематическое исследование тем разработки программного ...","ar":"ipps-deep-research هو أداة بحث متعمق للمطورين، مما يسمح بالتحقيق المنهجي لمواضيع تطوير البرمجيات","en":"An Azure Web App in Python to crawl the content of SharePoint sites into OpenAI Vector Stores"},"definition":{"en":"An Azure Web App in Python to crawl the content of SharePoint sites into OpenAI Vector Stores"},"features":{"zh":["Azure ","Python","SharePoint","OpenAI ","Vector Stores"],"ja":["Azure ","Python","SharePoint","OpenAI ","Vector Stores"],"ko":["Azure ","Python","SharePoint","OpenAI ","Vector Stores"],"es":["Indexación de contenido de SharePoint","Utiliza Azure Web App en Python","Integración con OpenAI Vector Stores","Patrones de investigación sistemáticos","Jerarquía de fuentes de información","Etiquetas de verificación para afirmaciones"],"fr":["Indexation de contenu de SharePoint","Utilise Azure Web App en Python","Intégration avec OpenAI Vector Stores","Modèles de recherche systématiques","Hiérarchie des sources d''information","Étiquettes de vérification pour les affirmations"],"de":["Indexierung von SharePoint-Inhalten","Verwendung von Azure Web App in Python","Integration mit OpenAI Vector Stores","Systematische Recherchemuster","Hierarchie der Informationsquellen","Überprüfungslabels für Aussagen"],"pt":["Pesquisa sistemática de tópicos de desenvolvimento de software","Integração com Azure Web App e OpenAI Vector Stores","Análise de padrões de pesquisa para desenvolvedores","Priorização de fontes de informação","Verificação de afirmações com labels de verificação"],"ru":["Систематическое исследование тем разработки программного обеспечения","Интеграция с Azure Web App и OpenAI Vector Stores","Анализ шаблонов исследования для разработчиков","Приоритизация источников информации","Проверка утверждений с помощью меток верификации"],"ar":["البحث المنهجي لمواضيع تطوير البرمجيات","التكامل مع Azure Web App و OpenAI Vector Stores","تحليل أنماط البحث للمطورين","ترتيب الأولويات للمصادر المعلوماتية","التحقق من الادعاءات باستخدام تسميات التحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ipps-deep-research","Azure ","Python","SharePoint","OpenAI","Vector Stores","Azure Web App","Python"],"ja":["ipps-deep-research","Azure ","Python","SharePoint","OpenAI","Vector Stores","Azure Web App","Python"],"ko":["ipps-deep-research","Azure ","Python","SharePoint","OpenAI","Vector Stores","Azure Web App","Python"],"es":["investigación profunda","indexación de contenido","SharePoint","Azure Web App","Python","OpenAI Vector Stores","recherche sistemática","jerarquía de fuentes"],"fr":["recherche approfondie","indexation de contenu","SharePoint","Azure Web App","Python","OpenAI Vector Stores","recherche systématique","hiérarchie des sources"],"de":["tiefere Recherche","Indexierung von Inhalten","SharePoint","Azure Web App","Python","OpenAI Vector Stores","systematische Recherche","Hierarchie der Quellen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","pesquisa aprofundada","Azure Web App","OpenAI Vector Stores","análise de padrões de pesquisa","priorização de fontes de informação"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","глубокое исследование","Azure Web App","OpenAI Vector Stores","анализ шаблонов исследования","приоритизация источников информации"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","بحث متعمق","Azure Web App","OpenAI Vector Stores","تحليل أنماط البحث","ترتيب الأولويات للمصادر المعلوماتية"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","repoPath":"karstenheld3/SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ipps-deep-research","description":"Apply when conducting deep research on technologies, APIs, frameworks, or other software development topics requiring systematic investigation","bodyPreview":"# Deep Research Skill\n\nSystematic research patterns for in-depth investigation of software development topics.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n**Core**\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [MUST-NOT-FORGET](#must-not-forget)\n- [Output Format](#output-format)\n\n**Patterns**\n- [MEPI vs MCPI](#mepi-vs-mcpi) - When to use quick vs exhaustive research\n- [Source Hierarchy](#source-hierarchy) - Priority order for sources\n- [Verification Labels](#verification-labels) - How to mark claims\n\n**Strategies**\n- [Technology/","body":"# Deep Research Skill\n\nSystematic research patterns for in-depth investigation of software development topics.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n**Core**\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [MUST-NOT-FORGET](#must-not-forget)\n- [Output Format](#output-format)\n\n**Patterns**\n- [MEPI vs MCPI](#mepi-vs-mcpi) - When to use quick vs exhaustive research\n- [Source Hierarchy](#source-hierarchy) - Priority order for sources\n- [Verification Labels](#verification-labels) - How to mark claims\n\n**Strategies**\n- [Technology/API Research (MCPI)](RESEARCH_STRATEGY_TECH_MCPI.md) - 6-phase exhaustive documentation\n- [Quick Research (MEPI)](#research-strategies) - Abbreviated approach for low-stakes\n\n**Templates**\n- [TOC Template](RESEARCH_TOC_TEMPLATE.md) - Table of Contents structure\n- [Create TOC Workflow](RESEARCH_CREATE_TOC.md) - How to create TOC files\n\n**Planning & Tracking**\n- [Planning Structure](#planning-structure) - STRUT vs TASKS\n- [Time Tracking](#time-tracking) - Net research time calculation\n\n**Reference**\n- [Tool Reference](RESEARCH_TOOLS.md) - Source collection, PDF processing, transcription\n- [Source ID Format](#source-id-format) - How to cite sources\n- [File Naming Conventions](#file-naming-conventions) - Prefix rules for documents\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Deep research (this skill):**\n- \"Should we use X or Y for our project?\"\n- \"How does X work internally?\"\n- \"What are the production considerations for X?\"\n- Multi-source synthesis required\n- Exhaustive documentation needed\n\n**Quick lookup (not this skill):**\n- \"What''s the syntax for X?\"\n- \"How do I install Y?\"\n- Single-source answers\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Start with assumptions check - write down what you think you know before researching\n- Primary sources > secondary sources > community opinions\n- Document all sources with URLs and access dates\n- Flag information age (APIs change rapidly)\n- Distinguish facts from opinions from assumptions\n- Version-match community sources to subject version\n- Create INFO document for findings\n- **Always create STRUT** for research session orchestration\n- **Track time** - log task start/end for net research time calculation\n- **Track credits** - detect model via screenshot, log switches, calculate usage\n- **Never auto-switch models** - respect user''s model selection throughout research\n\n## Global Patterns\n\n### MEPI vs MCPI\n\n**MEPI** (Most Executable Point of Information) - Default\n- Present 2-3 curated options\n- Filter and recommend\n- Use for: reversible decisions, time-constrained, action-oriented\n\n**MCPI** (Most Complete Point of Information) - Exception\n- Present exhaustive options\n- Document everything\n- Use for: irreversible decisions, high-stakes, archival reference\n\n### Source Hierarchy\n\n1. **Official PDFs/papers** - Legislation, specs, whitepapers, academic papers (often not available as web)\n2. **Official documentation** - Authoritative, version-specific\n3. **Official blog/changelog** - Announcements, rationale\n4. **GitHub repo** - Source code, issues, PRs, discussions\n5. **Conference talks by maintainers** - Design decisions, roadmap\n6. **Reputable tech blogs** - Analysis, comparisons\n7. **Stack Overflow** - Specific problems (verify currency)\n8. **Community forums/Discord** - Anecdotes, edge cases\n\n**Source Persistence**: Download and store all sources in session folder for later reference. Web content changes - PDFs and local copies ensure reproducibility.\n\n### Verification Labels\n\n- `[VERIFIED]` - Confirmed from official documentation\n- `[ASSUMED]` - Inferred but not explicitly stated\n- `[TESTED]` - Manually tested by running code\n- `[PROVEN]` - Confirmed from multiple independent sources\n- `[COMMUNITY]` - Reported by community sources (cite source ID)\n\n### Source ID Format\n\n```\n[TOPIC]-IN01-SC-[SOURCE]-[DOCNAME]\n```\n\nExamples:\n- `GRPH-IN01-SC-MSFT-APIOVERVIEW` - Microsoft Graph official docs\n- `GRPH-IN01-SC-SO-RATELIMIT` - Stack Overflow rate limit discussion\n- `GRPH-IN01-SC-GH-ISSUE1234` - GitHub issue #1234\n\n### File Naming Conventions\n\n- `__` prefix (double underscore): Master/index documents (SOURCES, TOC, TEMPLATE)\n- `_` prefix (single underscore): Topic content files (INFO documents)\n- No prefix: Tracking files (TASKS, NOTES, PROBLEMS, PROGRESS)\n\n### Information Currency\n\n- Note version numbers for all API/library info\n- Check last updated date on documentation\n- Cross-reference with changelog for breaking changes\n- Mark stale info with `[STALE: YYYY]` tag\n\n## Research Strategies\n\nAvailable research strategies (each has its own file):\n\n- **Technology/API Research (MCPI)** - [RESEARCH_STRATEGY_TECH_MCPI.md](RESEARCH_STRATEGY_TECH_MCPI.md) - Exhaustive API/framework documentation\n\n**Quick research (MEPI-style) until full strategy implemented:**\nFor reversible/low-stakes decisions, use abbreviated approach:\n1. Phase 1 (Preflight): 5-10 sources max, skip community deep-dive\n2. Skip Phases 2-4 (no TOC, template, or TASKS)\n3. Phase 5: Create single `_INFO_[TOPIC].md` with findings\n4. Phase 6: Quick `/verify`, done\n\nFuture strategies (not yet implemented):\n- Technology Research (MEPI) - Quick technology evaluation\n- Decision Research - Choose between options\n- Problem-Solving Research - Debug and fix issues\n\n## Tool Reference\n\nSee [RESEARCH_TOOLS.md](RESEARCH_TOOLS.md) for:\n- Source collection tools (search_web, read_url_content, Playwright)\n- Document processing tools (pdf-tools)\n- Transcription tools (llm-transcription)\n- Tool selection flowchart\n- Common workflows\n\n## Planning Structure\n\n**STRUT** (high-level orchestration) - REQUIRED for all research:\n- Tracks phases, objectives, deliverables, transitions\n- Contains time log for net research time\n- Created at research start, updated at phase transitions\n- File: `STRUT_[TOPIC].md` in session folder\n\n**TASKS** (low-level execution) - Created in Phase 4:\n- Flat list of individual research tasks with durations\n- Each task: file to create, sources to use, done-when criteria\n- Tracks task timing: `[HH:MM-HH:MM]` per task\n- File: `TASKS.md` in session folder\n\n## Time Tracking\n\n**Net research time** = active work time, excluding pauses.\n\n**STRUT time log format:**\n```\n## Time Log\nStarted: 2026-01-30 09:00\nEnded: 2026-01-30 14:30\n\nActive intervals:\n- 09:00-10:30 (Phase 1-3)\n- 11:00-12:15 (Phase 4-5)\n- 13:00-14:30 (Phase 5-6)\n\nNet research time: 4h 15m\n```\n\n**TASKS timing format:**\n```\n- [x] TK-01: Research auth [10:00-10:45] 45m\n- [x] TK-02: Research limits [10:15-11:00] 45m (parallel)\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n- Pause detection: Gap > 30min in file timestamps = pause (don''t count)\n- Parallel tasks: Overlapping intervals count once, not doubled\n- Log start time when beginning task, end time when completing\n\n## Credit Tracking (Mandatory)\n\n**Workflow:**\n1. At phase start: `simple-screenshot.ps1` → detect model from Windsurf header\n2. Lookup cost in `windsurf-model-registry.json`\n3. Log model + timestamp in STRUT Credit Tracking section\n4. At session end: calculate total estimated credits\n\n**STRUT Credit Tracking format:**\n```\n## Credit Tracking\nPhase 1: Claude Opus 4.5 (Thinking) [5x] - 09:00\nPhase 2: Claude Opus 4.5 (Thinking) [5x] - 09:30\nPhase 4: Claude Sonnet 4.5 [2x] - 10:15 (user switched)\nPhase 5: Claude Sonnet 4.5 [2x] - 10:45\nPhase 6: Claude Sonnet 4.5 [2x] - 11:30\n\nEstimated credits: (2 phases × 5x) + (3 phases × 2x) = 16 units\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n- **Never auto-switch models** - respect user''s model selection\n- Detect via screenshot only - passive observation\n- Log when model changes (user-initiated)\n- Registry: `[DEVSYSTEM_FOLDER]/skills/windsurf-auto-model-switcher/windsurf-model-registry.json`\n\n## Output Format\n\nDeep research outputs an INFO document. Key sections:\n\n1. **Research Question** - What we''re investigating\n2. **Key Findings** - MEPI-style summary (2-3 main points) or MCPI exhaustive list\n3. **Detailed Analysis** - Full investigation results\n4. **Limitations and Known Issues** - From community sources\n5. **Sources** - All references with quality indicators\n6. **Recommendations** - Actionable conclusions\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Determine research type (MEPI quick vs MCPI exhaustive)\n2. Read this SKILL.md for core principles\n3. Read the appropriate strategy file\n4. Read RESEARCH_TOOLS.md for tool guidance\n5. Follow the strategy''s phases systematically\n6. Output findings as INFO document\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:10:05.950Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Azure-focused AI Agents requiring advanced SharePoint site crawling and OpenAI Vector Store integration capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级SharePoint站点爬取和OpenAI向量存储集成能力的Azure专注AI代理。","ja":"Azureに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが、高度なSharePointサイトクロールとOpenAIベクトルストア統合機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 SharePoint 사이트 크롤링 및 OpenAI 벡터 저장소 통합 기능이 필요한 Azure 초점 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de AI centrados en Azure que requieren capacidades avanzadas de crawling de sitios de SharePoint y de integración con OpenAI Vector Store.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Azure nécessitant des capacités avancées de crawling de sites SharePoint et d''intégration à OpenAI Vector Store.","de":"Ideal für Azure-fokussierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte SharePoint-Site-Crawling- und OpenAI-Vector-Store-Integrationsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA focados no Azure que requerem capacidades avançadas de crawl de sites do SharePoint e integração com o OpenAI Vector Store.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Azure, требующих продвинутых возможностей поиска сайтов SharePoint и интеграции с OpenAI Vector Store.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على Azure ويتطلبون قدرات متقدمة لتحليل المواقع الخاصة بشركة SharePoint وتكامل مخزن OpenAI Vector."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically research software development topics by crawling SharePoint sites and storing content in OpenAI Vector Stores, utilizing Python and Azure Web Apps to facilitate in-depth investigations with features like MEPI vs MCPI research patterns and source hierarchy prioritization.","zh":"使代理能够通过爬取SharePoint站点并将内容存储在OpenAI向量存储中，利用Python和Azure Web Apps进行深入调查，具有MEPI与MCPI研究模式和源层次优先级等功能。","ja":"エージェントがSharePointサイトをクロールし、内容をOpenAIベクトルストアに保存することで、PythonとAzure Web Appsを利用して、MEPIとMCPIの研究パターンやソース階層の優先順位付けなどの機能を備えた詳細な調査を体系的に行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 SharePoint 사이트를 크롤링하고 내용을 OpenAI 벡터 저장소에 저장함으로써 Python 및 Azure Web Apps를 사용하여 MEPI 및 MCPI 연구 패턴 및 소스 계층 구조 우선 순위를 포함한 기능으로 자세한 조사를 체계적으로 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes investigar sistemáticamente temas de desarrollo de software al crawling de sitios de SharePoint y almacenar contenido en OpenAI Vector Stores, utilizando Python y Azure Web Apps para facilitar investigaciones en profundidad con características como patrones de investigación MEPI vs MCPI y priorización de la jerarquía de fuentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher systématiquement des sujets de développement de logiciels en crawlant des sites SharePoint et en stockant le contenu dans des magasins de vecteurs OpenAI, en utilisant Python et des applications Web Azure pour faciliter des investigations en profondeur avec des fonctionnalités telles que des modèles de recherche MEPI vs MCPI et une priorisation de la hiérarchie des sources.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, systematisch Software-Entwicklungs-Themen zu erforschen, indem sie SharePoint-Sites durchsuchen und Inhalte in OpenAI-Vector-Speichern speichern, wobei Python und Azure-Web-Apps zur Erleichterung von Untersuchungen mit Funktionen wie MEPI-vs-MCPI-Forschungsmustern und Quellenhierarchie-Priorisierung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pesquisar tópicos de desenvolvimento de software de forma sistemática, crawlando sites do SharePoint e armazenando o conteúdo em lojas de vetores OpenAI, utilizando Python e Aplicativos Web do Azure para facilitar investigações aprofundadas com recursos como padrões de pesquisa MEPI vs MCPI e priorização da hierarquia de fontes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически исследовать темы разработки программного обеспечения, выполняя поиск сайтов SharePoint и храня содержимое в хранилищах векторов OpenAI, используя Python и веб-приложения Azure для облегчения глубоких исследований с функциями, такими как модели исследования MEPI vs MCPI и приоритизация иерархии источников.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من البحث عن مواضيع تطوير البرمجيات بطريقة منهجية من خلال تحليل المواقع الخاصة بشركة SharePoint وتخزين المحتوى في مخازن OpenAI Vector، باستخدام Python وتطبيقات الويب في Azure لتسهيل التحقيقات العميقة باستخدام ميزات مثل أنماط البحث MEPI vs MCPI وتحديد اولوية هرمية المصادر."},"useCases":{"en":["Crawling SharePoint sites for research data","Integrating research findings into OpenAI Vector Stores","Applying systematic research patterns for in-depth software development topic analysis"],"zh":["爬取SharePoint站点以获取研究数据","将研究结果集成到OpenAI向量存储中","应用系统研究模式进行软件开发主题的深入分析"],"ja":["研究データを取得するためにSharePointサイトをクロールする","研究結果をOpenAIベクトルストアに統合する","ソフトウェア開発のトピック分析のための詳細な分析に体系的な研究パターンを適用する"],"ko":["연구 데이터를 얻기 위해 SharePoint 사이트를 크롤링하는 것","연구 결과를 OpenAI 벡터 저장소에 통합하는 것","소프트웨어 개발 주제에 대한 자세한 분석을 위해 체계적인 연구 패턴을 적용하는 것"],"es":["Crawling de sitios de SharePoint para obtener datos de investigación","Integración de los resultados de la investigación en OpenAI Vector Stores","Aplicación de patrones de investigación sistemáticos para el análisis de temas de desarrollo de software en profundidad"],"fr":["Crawling de sites SharePoint pour obtenir des données de recherche","Intégration des résultats de la recherche dans des magasins de vecteurs OpenAI","Application de modèles de recherche systématiques pour l''analyse de sujets de développement de logiciels en profondeur"],"de":["Durchsuchen von SharePoint-Sites zur Gewinnung von Forschungsdaten","Integration von Forschungsergebnissen in OpenAI-Vector-Speicher","Anwendung systematischer Forschungsmuster für die Analyse von Software-Entwicklungs-Themen in der Tiefe"],"pt":["Crawling de sites do SharePoint para coletar dados de pesquisa","Integrar descobertas de pesquisa em lojas de vetores OpenAI","Aplicar padrões de pesquisa sistemáticos para análise de tópicos de desenvolvimento de software aprofundada"],"ru":["Просмотр сайтов SharePoint для сбора данных исследований","Интеграция результатов исследований в хранилища векторов OpenAI","Применение систематических моделей исследования для глубокого анализа тем разработки программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تحليل المواقع الخاصة بشركة SharePoint لجمع بيانات البحث","دمج نتائج البحث في مخازن OpenAI Vector","تطبيق أنماط بحث منهجية لتحليل مواضيع تطوير البرمجيات بعمق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure Web App setup","Needs access to SharePoint sites","Dependent on OpenAI Vector Stores"],"zh":["需要Azure Web应用程序设置","需要访问SharePoint站点","依赖于OpenAI向量存储"],"ja":["Azure Web Appの設定が必要","SharePointサイトへのアクセスが必要","OpenAIベクトルストアに依存する"],"ko":["Azure Web App 설정이 필요합니다.","SharePoint 사이트에 액세스해야 합니다.","OpenAI 벡터 저장소에 종속됩니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de Azure Web App","Necesita acceso a sitios de SharePoint","Dependiente de OpenAI Vector Stores"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application Web Azure","A besoin d''un accès aux sites SharePoint","Dépendant des magasins de vecteurs OpenAI"],"de":["Benötigt Azure-Web-App-Setup","Benötigt Zugriff auf SharePoint-Sites","Abhängig von OpenAI-Vector-Speichern"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Azure Web App","Necessita acesso a sites do SharePoint","Depende de lojas de vetores OpenAI"],"ru":["Требует настройки веб-приложения Azure","Требует доступа к сайтам SharePoint","Зависит от хранилищ векторов OpenAI"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق الويب في Azure","يتطلب الوصول إلى المواقع الخاصة بشركة SharePoint","يعتمد على مخازن OpenAI Vector"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
