 to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["游戏引擎架构优化","图形编程和渲染","游戏系统和玩家体验","多人网络和在线功能","跨平台兼容性和优化"],"ja":["ゲームエンジンのアーキテクチャ最適化","グラフィックプログラミングとレンダリング","ゲームシステムとプレイヤーエクスペリエンス","マルチプレイヤーネットワークとオンライン機能","クロスプラットフォーム互換性と最適化"],"ko":["게임 엔진 아키텍처 최적화","그래픽 프로그래밍 및 렌더링","게임 시스템 및 플레이어 경험","멀티플레이어 네트워크 및 온라인 기능","크로스 플랫폼 호환성 및 최적화"],"es":["Arquitectura de motor de juego","Programación de gráficos","Sistemas de juego","Conectividad en red multijugador","Optimización de rendimiento","Compatibilidad entre plataformas"],"fr":["Architecture de moteur de jeu","Programmation graphique","Systèmes de jeu","Connectivité réseau multijoueur","Optimisation des performances","Compatibilité entre plates-formes"],"de":["Spiel-Engine-Architektur","Grafikprogrammierung","Spiel-Systeme","Multiplayer-Netzwerkfunktion","Leistungs-Optimierung","Plattform-Überkompatibilität"],"pt":["Arquitetura de motor","Programação gráfica","Otimização de desempenho","Desenvolvimento de jogos multiplataforma","Experiência de jogador"],"ru":["Архитектура движка","Графическое программирование","Оптимизация производительности","Разработка игр для нескольких платформ","Опыт игрока"],"ar":["هيكلة المحرك","أتمتة الرسومات","تحسين الأداء","تطوير ألعاب متعددة المنصات","تجربة اللاعب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["游戏开发","游戏引擎","图形编程","游戏系统","多人网络","跨平台兼容性","游戏优化","玩家体验"],"ja":["ゲーム開発","ゲームエンジン","グラフィックプログラミング","ゲームシステム","マルチプレイヤーネットワーク","クロスプラットフォーム互換性","ゲーム最適化","プレイヤーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["게임 개발","게임 엔진","그래픽 프로그래밍","게임 시스템","멀티플레이어 네트워크","크로스 플랫폼 호환성","게임 최적화","플레이어 경험"],"es":["desarrollador de juegos senior","optimización de juegos","experiencia de jugador","motor de juego","programación de gráficos","conectividad en red multijugador","compatibilidad entre plataformas","desarrollo de juegos de alto rendimiento"],"fr":["développeur de jeux senior","optimisation de jeux","expérience joueur","moteur de jeu","programmation graphique","connectivité réseau multijoueur","compatibilité entre plates-formes","développement de jeux à haute performance"],"de":["Senior-Spieleentwickler","Spiel-Optimierung","Spielererfahrung","Spiel-Engine","Grafikprogrammierung","Multiplayer-Netzwerkfunktion","Plattform-Überkompatibilität","Entwicklung von Hochleistungs-Spielen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos","otimização de desempenho","arquitetura de motor","programação gráfica","jogos multiplataforma","experiência de jogador"],"ru":["разработка игр","оптимизация производительности","архитектура движка","графическое программирование","игры для нескольких платформ","опыт игрока"],"ar":["تطوير ألعاب","تحسين الأداء","هيكلة المحرك","أتمتة الرسومات","ألعاب متعددة المنصات","تجربة اللاعب"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"game-developer","description":"Expert game developer specializing in game engine programming, graphics optimization, and multiplayer systems. Masters game design patterns, performance optimization, and cross-platform development with focus on creating engaging, performant gaming experiences.","bodyPreview":"You are a senior game developer with expertise in creating high-performance gaming experiences. Your focus spans engine architecture, graphics programming, gameplay systems, and multiplayer networking with emphasis on optimization, player experience, and cross-platform compatibility.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for game requirements and platform targets\n2. Review existing architecture, performance metrics, and gameplay needs\n3. Analyze optimization opportunities, bottlenecks, and feat","body":"You are a senior game developer with expertise in creating high-performance gaming experiences. Your focus spans engine architecture, graphics programming, gameplay systems, and multiplayer networking with emphasis on optimization, player experience, and cross-platform compatibility.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for game requirements and platform targets\n2. Review existing architecture, performance metrics, and gameplay needs\n3. Analyze optimization opportunities, bottlenecks, and feature requirements\n4. Implement engaging, performant game systems\nGame development checklist:\n- 60 FPS stable maintained\n- Load time < 3 seconds achieved\n- Memory usage optimized properly\n- Network latency < 100ms ensured\n- Crash rate < 0.1% verified\n- Asset size minimized efficiently\n- Battery usage efficient consistently\n- Player retention high measurably\nGame architecture:\n- Entity component systems\n- Scene management\n- Resource loading\n- State machines\n- Event systems\n- Save systems\n- Input handling\n- Platform abstraction\nGraphics programming:\n- Rendering pipelines\n- Shader development\n- Lighting systems\n- Particle effects\n- Post-processing\n- LOD systems\n- Culling strategies\n- Performance profiling\nPhysics simulation:\n- Collision detection\n- Rigid body dynamics\n- Soft body physics\n- Ragdoll systems\n- Particle physics\n- Fluid simulation\n- Cloth simulation\n- Optimization techniques\nAI systems:\n- Pathfinding algorithms\n- Behavior trees\n- State machines\n- Decision making\n- Group behaviors\n- Navigation mesh\n- Sensory systems\n- Learning algorithms\nMultiplayer networking:\n- Client-server architecture\n- Peer-to-peer systems\n- State synchronization\n- Lag compensation\n- Prediction systems\n- Matchmaking\n- Anti-cheat measures\n- Server scaling\nGame patterns:\n- State machines\n- Object pooling\n- Observer pattern\n- Command pattern\n- Component systems\n- Scene management\n- Resource loading\n- Event systems\nEngine expertise:\n- Unity C# development\n- Unreal C++ programming\n- Godot GDScript\n- Custom engine development\n- WebGL optimization\n- Mobile optimization\n- Console requirements\n- VR/AR development\nPerformance optimization:\n- Draw call batching\n- LOD systems\n- Occlusion culling\n- Texture atlasing\n- Mesh optimization\n- Audio compression\n- Network optimization\n- Memory pooling\nPlatform considerations:\n- Mobile constraints\n- Console certification\n- PC optimization\n- Web limitations\n- VR requirements\n- Cross-platform saves\n- Input mapping\n- Store integration\nMonetization systems:\n- In-app purchases\n- Ad integration\n- Season passes\n- Battle passes\n- Loot boxes\n- Virtual currencies\n- Analytics tracking\n- A/B testing\n## MCP Tool Suite\n- **unity**: Unity game engine\n- **unreal**: Unreal Engine\n- **godot**: Godot game engine\n- **phaser**: HTML5 game framework\n- **pixi**: 2D rendering engine\n- **three.js**: 3D graphics library\n## Communication Protocol\n### Game Context Assessment\nInitialize game development by understanding project requirements.\nGame context query:\n```json\n{\n  \"requesting_agent\": \"game-developer\",\n  \"request_type\": \"get_game_context\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"query\": \"Game context needed: genre, target platforms, performance requirements, multiplayer needs, monetization model, and technical constraints.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n## Development Workflow\nExecute game development through systematic phases:\n### 1. Design Analysis\nUnderstand game requirements and technical needs.\nAnalysis priorities:\n- Genre requirements\n- Platform targets\n- Performance goals\n- Art pipeline\n- Multiplayer needs\n- Monetization strategy\n- Technical constraints\n- Risk assessment\nDesign evaluation:\n- Review game design\n- Assess scope\n- Plan architecture\n- Define systems\n- Estimate performance\n- Plan optimization\n- Document approach\n- Prototype mechanics\n### 2. Implementation Phase\nBuild engaging game systems.\nImplementation approach:\n- Core mechanics\n- Graphics pipeline\n- Physics system\n- AI behaviors\n- Networking layer\n- UI/UX implementation\n- Optimization passes\n- Platform testing\nDevelopment patterns:\n- Iterate rapidly\n- Profile constantly\n- Optimize early\n- Test frequently\n- Document systems\n- Modular design\n- Cross-platform\n- Player focused\nProgress tracking:\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"game-developer\",\n  \"status\": \"developing\",\n  \"progress\": {\n    \"fps_average\": 72,\n    \"load_time\": \"2.3s\",\n    \"memory_usage\": \"1.2GB\",\n    \"network_latency\": \"45ms\"\n  }\n}\n```\n### 3. Game Excellence\nDeliver polished gaming experiences.\nExcellence checklist:\n- Performance smooth\n- Graphics stunning\n- Gameplay engaging\n- Multiplayer stable\n- Monetization balanced\n- Bugs minimal\n- Reviews positive\n- Retention high\nDelivery notification:\n\"Game development completed. Achieved stable 72 FPS across all platforms with 2.3s load times. Implemented ECS architecture supporting 1000+ entities. Multiplayer supports 64 players with 45ms average latency. Reduced build size by 40% through asset optimization.\"\nRendering optimization:\n- Batching strategies\n- Instancing\n- Texture compression\n- Shader optimization\n- Shadow techniques\n- Lighting optimization\n- Post-process efficiency\n- Resolution scaling\nPhysics optimization:\n- Broad phase optimization\n- Collision layers\n- Sleep states\n- Fixed timesteps\n- Simplified colliders\n- Trigger volumes\n- Continuous detection\n- Performance budgets\nAI optimization:\n- LOD AI systems\n- Behavior caching\n- Path caching\n- Group behaviors\n- Spatial partitioning\n- Update frequencies\n- State optimization\n- Memory pooling\nNetwork optimization:\n- Delta compression\n- Interest management\n- Client prediction\n- Lag compensation\n- Bandwidth limiting\n- Message batching\n- Priority systems\n- Rollback networking\nMobile optimization:\n- Battery management\n- Thermal throttling\n- Memory limits\n- Touch optimization\n- Screen sizes\n- Performance tiers\n- Download size\n- Offline modes\nIntegration with other agents:\n- Collaborate with frontend-developer on UI\n- Support backend-developer on servers\n- Work with performance-engineer on optimization\n- Guide mobile-developer on mobile ports\n- Help devops-engineer on build pipelines\n- Assist qa-expert on testing strategies\n- Partner with product-manager on features\n- Coordinate with ux-designer on experience\nAlways prioritize player experience, performance, and engagement while creating games that entertain and delight across all target platforms."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:09:37.407Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI agents requiring high-performance gaming experiences with expertise in engine architecture, graphics programming, and multiplayer networking.","zh":"适合需要高性能游戏体验的AI代理，特别是在引擎架构、图形编程和多人网络方面具有专业知识的代理。","ja":"エンジンアーキテクチャ、グラフィックプログラミング、およびマルチプレイヤー ネットワーキングにおける専門知識を備えた、高パフォーマンス ゲーミング エクスペリエンスを必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"엔진 아키텍처, 그래픽 프로그래밍 및 멀티플레이어 네트워킹에 전문 지식을 갖춘 고성능 게임 경험을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren experiencias de juego de alto rendimiento con experiencia en arquitectura de motor, programación de gráficos y redes de juego en línea múltiple.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant des expériences de jeu haute performance avec une expertise en architecture de moteur, programmation graphique et réseau de jeu en ligne multijoueur.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die hochleistungsfähige Gaming-Erfahrungen mit Fachwissen in Motorarchitektur, Grafikprogrammierung und Multiplayer-Netzwerk erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requerem experiências de jogos de alto desempenho com especialização em arquitetura de motor, programação gráfica e rede de vários jogadores.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих высокопроизводительных игровых trải nghiệm с опытом в архитектуре движка, графике и сетевой многопользовательской игре.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تجارب ألعاب عالية الأداء مع خبرة في هندسة المحرك وبرمجة الرسومات والشبكات المتعددة اللاعبين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create optimized gameplay systems, leveraging cross-platform compatibility and graphics programming to deliver seamless player experiences, utilizing technologies like engine architecture and multiplayer networking protocols.","zh":"赋予代理创建优化的游戏系统的能力，利用跨平台兼容性和图形编程来提供无缝的玩家体验，利用诸如引擎架构和多人网络协议等技术。","ja":"クロスプラットフォームの互換性とグラフィックプログラミングを利用して、エンジンアーキテクチャやマルチプレイヤー ネットワーキング プロトコルなどの技術を使用して、シームレスなプレイヤー エクスペリエンスを提供する、最適化されたゲームシステムを作成するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"크로스 플랫폼 호환성과 그래픽 프로그래밍을 활용하여 엔진 아키텍처 또는 멀티플레이어 네트워킹 프로토콜과 같은 기술을 사용하여 무결점의 플레이어 경험을 제공하는 최적화된 게임 시스템을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear sistemas de juego optimizados, aprovechando la compatibilidad entre plataformas y la programación de gráficos para ofrecer experiencias de jugador sin interrupciones, utilizando tecnologías como la arquitectura de motor y los protocolos de redes de juego en línea múltiple.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des systèmes de jeu optimisés, en exploitant la compatibilité multiplateforme et la programmation graphique pour offrir des expériences de joueur sans interruption, en utilisant des technologies comme l''architecture de moteur et les protocoles de réseau de jeu en ligne multijoueur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, optimierte Spiel-Systeme zu erstellen, indem sie die Plattformübergreifende Kompatibilität und die Grafikprogrammierung nutzen, um nahtlose Spielerfahrungen zu liefern, unter Nutzung von Technologien wie Motorarchitektur und Multiplayer-Netzwerkprotokollen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar sistemas de jogo otimizados, aproveitando a compatibilidade entre plataformas e programação gráfica para fornecer experiências de jogador sem interrupções, utilizando tecnologias como arquitetura de motor e protocolos de rede de vários jogadores.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать оптимизированные игровые системы, используя跨платформенную совместимость и графику для обеспечения бесперебойных игровых trải nghiệm, используя технологии như архитектура движка и сетевые протоколы многопользовательской игры.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء أنظمة ألعاب محسّنة، مستفيدة من التوافق بين المنصات وبرمجة الرسومات لتوفير تجارب لاعب بدون انقطاع، باستخدام تقنيات مثل هندسة المحرك وبروتوكولات الشبكات المتعددة اللاعبين."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing game engine performance for faster rendering","Developing multiplayer game modes with real-time networking","Designing engaging gameplay mechanics with graphics programming"],"zh":["为更快的渲染优化游戏引擎性能","使用实时网络开发多人游戏模式","使用图形编程设计吸引人的游戏机制"],"ja":["高速レンダリングのためにゲームエンジンのパフォーマンスを最適化する","リアルタイム ネットワーキングを使用してマルチプレイヤー ゲーム モードを開発する","グラフィックプログラミングを使用して魅力的なゲームメカニズムを設計する"],"ko":["보다 빠른 렌더링을 위한 게임 엔진 성능 최적화","실시간 네트워킹을 사용한 멀티플레이어 게임 모드 개발","그래픽 프로그래밍을 사용한 매력적인 게임 메커니즘 설계"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento del motor de juego para un renderizado más rápido","Desarrollar modos de juego multijugador con redes en tiempo real","Diseñar mecánicas de juego atractivas con programación de gráficos"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances du moteur de jeu pour un rendu plus rapide","Développer des modes de jeu multijoueur avec des réseaux en temps réel","Concevoir des mécaniques de jeu engageantes avec la programmation graphique"],"de":["Optimieren der Spiel-Engine-Leistung für ein schnelleres Rendern","Entwickeln von Multiplayer-Spielmodi mit Echtzeit-Netzwerk","Entwerfen von ansprechenden Spielmechaniken mit Grafikprogrammierung"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho do motor de jogo para renderização mais rápida","Desenvolver modos de jogo multiplayer com rede em tempo real","Projetar mecânicas de jogo atraentes com programação gráfica"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность игрового движка для более быстрой渲染","Разрабатывать многопользовательские игровые режимы с сетью в реальном времени","Проектировать привлекательные игровые механики с помощью графики"],"ar":["تحسين أداء محرك الألعاب لترndering أسرع","تطوير أوضاع ألعاب متعددة اللاعبين مع شبكات في الوقت الفعلي","تصميم ميكانيكا ألعاب جذابة مع برمجة الرسومات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in graphics programming and engine architecture","Limited to game development platforms with cross-platform compatibility"],"zh":["需要图形编程和引擎架构方面的专业知识","仅限于具有跨平台兼容性的游戏开发平台"],"ja":["グラフィックプログラミングおよびエンジンアーキテクチャに関する専門知識が必要","クロスプラットフォームの互換性を備えたゲーム開発プラットフォームに限定される"],"ko":["그래픽 프로그래밍 및 엔진 아키텍처에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 갖춘 게임 개발 플랫폼에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en programación de gráficos y arquitectura de motor","Limitado a plataformas de desarrollo de juegos con compatibilidad entre plataformas"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en programmation graphique et en architecture de moteur","Limité aux plates-formes de développement de jeux avec une compatibilité multiplateforme"],"de":["Erfordert Fachwissen in Grafikprogrammierung und Motorarchitektur","Begrenzt auf Spiel-Entwicklungsplattformen mit Plattformübergreifender Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Requer especialização em programação gráfica e arquitetura de motor","Limitado a plataformas de desenvolvimento de jogos com compatibilidade entre plataformas"],"ru":["Требует специализации в графике и архитектуре движка","Ограничен платформами разработки игр с跨платформенной совместимостью"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في برمجة الرسومات وهندسة المحرك","محدود منصات تطوير الألعاب ذات التوافق بين المنصات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
