调查","ja":"並列エージェントの派遣 - 故障調査の高速化","ko":"병렬 에이전트 디스패치 - 고장 조사 가속","es":"Dispatching Parallel Agents: Optimización de Pruebas","fr":"Dispatching Parallel Agents: Optimisation des Tests","de":"Dispatching Parallel Agents: Optimierung von Tests","pt":"Despachar Agentes Paralelos - Otimização de Desenvolvimento","ru":"Диспетчер параллельных агентов - оптимизация разработки","ar":"توجيه وكلاء موازية - تحسين التطوير","en":"dispatching-parallel-agents"},"description":{"zh":"并行代理调度是一种通过同时处理多个独立问题域来加速故障调查的技术","ja":"並列エージェントの派遣は、複数の独立した問題ドメインを同時に処理することで故障調査を加速する技術です","ko":"병렬 에이전트 디스패치는 여러 개의 독립된 문제 도메인을 동시에 처리함으로써 고장 조사를 가속화하는 기술입니다","es":"Dispatching Parallel Agents es una técnica para optimizar pruebas mediante la ejecución concurrente de agentes en dominios de problemas independientes","fr":"Dispatching Parallel Agents est une technique pour optimiser les tests en exécutant des agents en parallèle dans des domaines de problèmes indépendants","de":"Dispatching Parallel Agents ist eine Technik, um Tests durch die gleichzeitige Ausführung von Agenten in unabhängigen Problemgebieten zu optimieren","pt":"A técnica de despachar agentes paralelos permite que desenvolvedores trabalhem de forma mais eficiente, investigando problemas independentes de forma simultâ...","ru":"Техника диспетчеризации параллельных агентов позволяет разработчикам работать более эффективно, расследуя независимые проблемы одновременно.","ar":"تقنية توجيه الوكلاء الموازية تسمح للمطورين بالعمل ب 方ة أكثر فعالية، حيث يتم التحقيق في المشاكل المستقلة في نفس الوقت.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["同时处理多个独立问题域","加速故障调查和调试","提高开发效率和生产力","支持多种编程语言和框架","易于集成和扩展"],"ja":["複数の独立した問題ドメインを同時に処理","故障調査とデバッグの高速化","開発効率と生産性的向上","複数のプログラミング言語とフレームワークのサポート","簡単な統合と拡張"],"ko":["여러 개의 독립된 문제 도메인을 동시에 처리","고장 조사를 가속화하고 디버깅","개발 효율과 생산성을 높임","여러 프로그래밍 언어와 프레임워크를 지원","쉽게 통합과 확장 가능"],"es":["Ejecución concurrente de agentes","Optimización de pruebas","Reducción de tiempos de investigación","Soporte para dominios de problemas independientes","Mejora de la eficiencia en la resolución de problemas"],"fr":["Exécution concurrente d''agents","Optimisation des tests","Réduction des temps d''investigation","Prise en charge de domaines de problèmes indépendants","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans la résolution de problèmes"],"de":["Gleichzeitige Ausführung von Agenten","Optimierung von Tests","Reduzierung der Untersuchungszeit","Unterstützung für unabhängige Problemgebiete","Verbesserung der Effizienz bei der Problemlösung"],"pt":["Investigação paralela de problemas independentes","Redução do tempo de investigação","Melhoria da produtividade","Trabalho eficiente em problemas complexos","Suporte a desenvolvedores em equipes"],"ru":["Параллельное расследование независимых проблем","Сокращение времени расследования","Повышение производительности","Эффективная работа над сложными проблемами","Поддержка разработчиков в командах"],"ar":["التحقيق الموازي للمشاكل المستقلة","تقليل وقت التحقيق","تحسين الإنتاجية","العمل الفعال في المشاكل المعقدة","دعم المطورين في الفريق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["并行代理调度","故障调查","开发效率","生产力","编程语言","框架","调试","测试"],"ja":["並列エージェントの派遣","故障調査","開発効率","生産性","プログラミング言語","フレームワーク","デバッグ","テスト"],"ko":["병렬 에이전트 디스패치","고장 조사","개발 효율","생산성","프로그래밍 언어","프레임워크","디버깅","테스트"],"es":["Dispatching Parallel Agents","pruebas paralelas","optimización de pruebas","dominios de problemas independientes","eficiencia en la resolución de problemas","tecnologías de pruebas","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Dispatching Parallel Agents","tests parallèles","optimisation des tests","domaines de problèmes indépendants","efficacité dans la résolution de problèmes","technologies de test","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Dispatching Parallel Agents","parallele Tests","Optimierung von Tests","unabhängige Problemgebiete","Effizienz bei der Problemlösung","Testtechnologien","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["despachar agentes paralelos","otimização de desenvolvimento","investigação paralela","redução do tempo de investigação","melhoria da produtividade","trabalho eficiente","desenvolvedores","equipes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["диспетчеризация параллельных агентов","оптимизация разработки","параллельное расследование","сокращение времени расследования","повышение производительности","эффективная работа","разработчики","команды разработки"],"ar":["توجيه وكلاء موازية","تحسين التطوير","التحقيق الموازي","تقليل وقت التحقيق","تحسين الإنتاجية","العمل الفعال","المطورين","فرق التطوير"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dispatching-parallel-agents","description":"Use when facing 3+ independent failures that can be investigated without shared state or dependencies - dispatches multiple Claude agents to investigate and fix independent problems concurrently","bodyPreview":"# Dispatching Parallel Agents\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you have multiple unrelated failures (different test files, different subsystems, different bugs), investigating them sequentially wastes time. Each investigation is independent and can happen in parallel.\n\n**Core principle:** Dispatch one agent per independent problem domain. Let them work concurrently.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Multiple failures?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Are they independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Single","body":"# Dispatching Parallel Agents\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you have multiple unrelated failures (different test files, different subsystems, different bugs), investigating them sequentially wastes time. Each investigation is independent and can happen in parallel.\n\n**Core principle:** Dispatch one agent per independent problem domain. Let them work concurrently.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Multiple failures?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Are they independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Single agent investigates all\" [shape=box];\n    \"One agent per problem domain\" [shape=box];\n    \"Can they work in parallel?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Sequential agents\" [shape=box];\n    \"Parallel dispatch\" [shape=box];\n\n    \"Multiple failures?\" -> \"Are they independent?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Are they independent?\" -> \"Single agent investigates all\" [label=\"no - related\"];\n    \"Are they independent?\" -> \"Can they work in parallel?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Can they work in parallel?\" -> \"Parallel dispatch\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Can they work in parallel?\" -> \"Sequential agents\" [label=\"no - shared state\"];\n}\n```\n\n**Use when:**\n\n- 3+ test files failing with different root causes\n- Multiple subsystems broken independently\n- Each problem can be understood without context from others\n- No shared state between investigations\n\n**Don''t use when:**\n\n- Failures are related (fix one might fix others)\n- Need to understand full system state\n- Agents would interfere with each other\n\n## The Pattern\n\n### 1. Identify Independent Domains\n\nGroup failures by what''s broken:\n\n- File A tests: Tool approval flow\n- File B tests: Batch completion behavior\n- File C tests: Abort functionality\n\nEach domain is independent - fixing tool approval doesn''t affect abort tests.\n\n### 2. Create Focused Agent Tasks\n\nEach agent gets:\n\n- **Specific scope:** One test file or subsystem\n- **Clear goal:** Make these tests pass\n- **Constraints:** Don''t change other code\n- **Expected output:** Summary of what you found and fixed\n\n### 3. Dispatch in Parallel\n\n```typescript\n// In  AI environment\nTask(\"Fix agent-tool-abort.test.ts failures\");\nTask(\"Fix batch-completion-behavior.test.ts failures\");\nTask(\"Fix tool-approval-race-conditions.test.ts failures\");\n// All three run concurrently\n```\n\n### 4. Review and Integrate\n\nWhen agents return:\n\n- Read each summary\n- Verify fixes don''t conflict\n- Run full test suite\n- Integrate all changes\n\n## Agent Prompt Structure\n\nGood agent prompts are:\n\n1. **Focused** - One clear problem domain\n2. **Self-contained** - All context needed to understand the problem\n3. **Specific about output** - What should the agent return?\n\n```markdown\nFix the 3 failing tests in src/agents/agent-tool-abort.test.ts:\n\n1. \"should abort tool with partial output capture\" - expects ''interrupted at'' in message\n2. \"should handle mixed completed and aborted tools\" - fast tool aborted instead of completed\n3. \"should properly track pendingToolCount\" - expects 3 results but gets 0\n\nThese are timing/race condition issues. Your task:\n\n1. Read the test file and understand what each test verifies\n2. Identify root cause - timing issues or actual bugs?\n3. Fix by:\n   - Replacing arbitrary timeouts with event-based waiting\n   - Fixing bugs in abort implementation if found\n   - Adjusting test expectations if testing changed behavior\n\nDo NOT just increase timeouts - find the real issue.\n\nReturn: Summary of what you found and what you fixed.\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**❌ Too broad:** \"Fix all the tests\" - agent gets lost\n**✅ Specific:** \"Fix agent-tool-abort.test.ts\" - focused scope\n\n**❌ No context:** \"Fix the race condition\" - agent doesn''t know where\n**✅ Context:** Paste the error messages and test names\n\n**❌ No constraints:** Agent might refactor everything\n**✅ Constraints:** \"Do NOT change production code\" or \"Fix tests only\"\n\n**❌ Vague output:** \"Fix it\" - you don''t know what changed\n**✅ Specific:** \"Return summary of root cause and changes\"\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n**Related failures:** Fixing one might fix others - investigate together first\n**Need full context:** Understanding requires seeing entire system\n**Exploratory debugging:** You don''t know what''s broken yet\n**Shared state:** Agents would interfere (editing same files, using same resources)\n\n## Real Example from Session\n\n**Scenario:** 6 test failures across 3 files after major refactoring\n\n**Failures:**\n\n- agent-tool-abort.test.ts: 3 failures (timing issues)\n- batch-completion-behavior.test.ts: 2 failures (tools not executing)\n- tool-approval-race-conditions.test.ts: 1 failure (execution count = 0)\n\n**Decision:** Independent domains - abort logic separate from batch completion separate from race conditions\n\n**Dispatch:**\n\n```\nAgent 1 → Fix agent-tool-abort.test.ts\nAgent 2 → Fix batch-completion-behavior.test.ts\nAgent 3 → Fix tool-approval-race-conditions.test.ts\n```\n\n**Results:**\n\n- Agent 1: Replaced timeouts with event-based waiting\n- Agent 2: Fixed event structure bug (threadId in wrong place)\n- Agent 3: Added wait for async tool execution to complete\n\n**Integration:** All fixes independent, no conflicts, full suite green\n\n**Time saved:** 3 problems solved in parallel vs sequentially\n\n## Key Benefits\n\n1. **Parallelization** - Multiple investigations happen simultaneously\n2. **Focus** - Each agent has narrow scope, less context to track\n3. **Independence** - Agents don''t interfere with each other\n4. **Speed** - 3 problems solved in time of 1\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter agents return:\n\n1. **Review each summary** - Understand what changed\n2. **Check for conflicts** - Did agents edit same code?\n3. **Run full suite** - Verify all fixes work together\n4. **Spot check** - Agents can make systematic errors\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\nFrom debugging session (2025-10-03):\n\n- 6 failures across 3 files\n- 3 agents dispatched in parallel\n- All investigations completed concurrently\n- All fixes integrated successfully\n- Zero conflicts between agent changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:10:47.614Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain requiring concurrent problem-solving capabilities for efficient failure investigation and analysis.","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的自主代理，需要并发问题解决能力以高效地进行故障调查和分析。","ja":"AutoGPTやLangChainのような自律エージェントに適しており、効率的な障害調査および分析のために並行問題解決能力が必要です。","ko":"AutoGPT와 LangChain 같은 자율 에이전트에 적합하며, 효율적인 장애 조사 및 분석을 위해 병렬 문제 해결能力이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren capacidades de resolución de problemas concurrentes para una investigación y análisis de fallos eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents autonomes comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités de résolution de problèmes concurrentes pour une investigation et une analyse d''échec efficientes.","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die konkurrierende Problemlösungsfähigkeiten für eine effiziente Ausfalluntersuchung und -analyse erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos como AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem capacidades de resolução de problemas concorrentes para investigação e análise de falhas eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих возможностей параллельного решения проблем для эффективного расследования и анализа неисправностей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستقلين مثل AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يتطلبون قدرات حل مشاكل متزامنة لفحص الفشل والتحليل الفعال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dispatch multiple parallel agents per independent problem domain, leveraging core principles of concurrent investigation to reduce overall analysis time, utilizing protocols like synthetic perpetual futures and combining pricing from various sources including cus.","zh":"赋予代理同时派遣多个并行代理以处理每个独立问题域，利用并发调查的核心原则来减少总体分析时间，利用类似合成永续期权的协议，并结合来自各种来源（包括cus）的价格。","ja":"エージェントに複数の並列エージェントを各独立した問題ドメインに同時に派遣する機能を与え、並行調査の核心原則を利用して全体的な分析時間を短縮する。シンセティック・パーペチュアル・フューチャーズなどのプロトコルを使用し、さまざまなソース（包括cus）からの価格を組み合わせます。","ko":"에이전트가 독립된 문제 도메인마다 여러 개의 병렬 에이전트를 동시에派遣 할 수 있게하여, 병렬조사의 핵심 원리를 활용하여 전체 분석 시간을 단축하고, 합성 영속적 선물과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 다양한 소스(cus 포함)의 가격을 결합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enviar múltiples agentes paralelos por dominio de problema independiente, aprovechando principios básicos de investigación concurrente para reducir el tiempo general de análisis, utilizando protocolos como futuros sintéticos perpetuos y combinando precios de diversas fuentes, incluyendo cus.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''envoyer plusieurs agents parallèles par domaine de problème indépendant, en exploitant les principes fondamentaux de l''investigation concurrente pour réduire le temps d''analyse global, en utilisant des protocoles tels que les futurs synthétiques perpétuels et en combinant les prix de diverses sources, y compris cus.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, mehrere parallele Agenten pro unabhängigem Problemgebiet zu entsenden, indem sie grundlegende Prinzipien der konkurrierenden Untersuchung nutzen, um die gesamte Analysezeit zu reduzieren, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie synthetischen Perpetual-Futures und der Kombination von Preisen aus verschiedenen Quellen, einschließlich cus.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a enviar vários agentes paralelos por domínio de problema independente, aproveitando princípios básicos de investigação concorrente para reduzir o tempo geral de análise, utilizando protocolos como futuros sintéticos perpétuos e combinando preços de várias fontes, incluindo cus.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отправлять несколько параллельных агентов на каждый независимый проблемный домен, используя основные принципы параллельного расследования для снижения общего времени анализа, используя протоколы, такие как синтетические вечные фьючерсы, и объединяя цены из различных источников, включая cus.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إرسال وكلاء متوازيين متعددين لكل مجال مشكلة مستقل، مستفيداً من المبادئ الأساسية للتحقيق المتزامن لتقليل الوقت العام للتحليل، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل المستقبل الاصطناعي الدائم ومزج الأسعار من مصادر مختلفة، بما في ذلك cus."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating multiple unrelated failures concurrently","Analyzing independent subsystems in parallel","Debugging different test files simultaneously"],"zh":["同时调查多个无关的故障","并行分析独立的子系统","同时调试不同的测试文件"],"ja":["複数の無関係な障害を同時に調査する","独立したサブシステムを並行して分析する","異なるテストファイルを同時にデバッグする"],"ko":["여러개의 관련없는 장애를 동시에 조사","독립된 서브시스템을 병렬로 분석","다른 테스트 파일을 동시에 디버깅"],"es":["Investigar múltiples fallos no relacionados de forma concurrente","Analizar subsistemas independientes en paralelo","Depurar diferentes archivos de prueba simultáneamente"],"fr":["Enquêter sur plusieurs défaillances non liées de manière concurrente","Analyser des sous-systèmes indépendants en parallèle","Déboguer différents fichiers de test simultanément"],"de":["Mehrere nicht verwandte Ausfälle gleichzeitig untersuchen","Unabhängige Subsysteme parallel analysieren","Verschiedene Testdateien gleichzeitig debuggen"],"pt":["Investigar várias falhas não relacionadas simultaneamente","Analizar subsistemas independentes em paralelo","Depurar arquivos de teste diferentes simultaneamente"],"ru":["Расследование нескольких независимых неисправностей одновременно","Анализ независимых подсистем параллельно","Отладка разных тестовых файлов одновременно"],"ar":["فحص عدة فشلات غير متعلقة في وقت واحد","تحليل النظم الفرعية المستقلة بالتوازي","تصحيح أخطاء ملفات الاختبار المختلفة في نفس الوقت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires independent problem domains for effective parallelization","Dependent on the complexity and number of independent failures"],"zh":["需要独立的问题域以实现有效的并行化","取决于独立故障的复杂性和数量"],"ja":["有効な並列化のためには独立した問題ドメインが必要","独立した障害の複雑さと数に依存する"],"ko":["유효한 병렬화를 위해서는 독립된 문제 도메인이 필요","독립된 장애의 복잡도와 수에 의존"],"es":["Requiere dominios de problema independientes para una paralelización efectiva","Depende de la complejidad y del número de fallos independientes"],"fr":["Nécessite des domaines de problème indépendants pour une parallélisation efficace","Dépend de la complexité et du nombre de défaillances indépendantes"],"de":["Benötigt unabhängige Problemgebiete für eine effektive Paralelisierung","Hängt von der Komplexität und der Anzahl der unabhängigen Ausfälle ab"],"pt":["Exige domínios de problema independentes para uma parallelização eficaz","Depende da complexidade e do número de falhas independentes"],"ru":["Требует независимых проблемных доменов для эффективной параллелизации","Зависит от сложности и количества независимых неисправностей"],"ar":["يتطلب مجالات مشكلة مستقلة للتوازي الفعال","يعتمد على сложية وعدد الفشلات المستقلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
