Applications Cross-Plateformes","de":"Tauri v2: Entwicklung von Cross-Plattform-Anwendungen","pt":"Tauri v2: Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos Cross-Plataforma","ru":"Tauri v2: Разработка Кроссплатформенных Приложений","ar":"Tauri v2: تطوير تطبيقات متعددة المنصات","en":"tauri-v2"},"description":{"zh":"Tauri v2 开发技能是构建跨平台桌面和移动应用的解决方案，使用 Tauri、React 和 Rust","ja":"Tauri v2 開発スキルは、Tauri、React、Rustを使用してクロスプラットフォーム デスクトップとモバイル アプリを構築するソリューション","ko":"Tauri v2 개발스キル은 Tauri, React 및 Rust를 사용하여 크로스 플랫폼 데스크탑 및 모바일 앱을 개발하는 솔루션","es":"Tauri v2 es una habilidad de desarrollo que permite crear aplicaciones cross-plataforma con frontends web y backends Rust, reduciendo errores comunes y mejor...","fr":"Tauri v2 est une compétence de développement qui permet de créer des applications cross-plateformes avec des frontends web et des backends Rust, en réduisant...","de":"Tauri v2 ist eine Entwicklungsfähigkeit, die die Erstellung von Cross-Plattform-Anwendungen mit Web-Frontends und Rust-Backends ermöglicht, wodurch gemeinsam...","pt":"O Tauri v2 é uma habilidade de desenvolvimento que permite construir aplicativos cross-plataforma com frontends web e backends Rust.","ru":"Tauri v2 - это навык разработки, который позволяет создавать кроссплатформенные приложения с веб-интерфейсом и бэкендом на Rust.","ar":"Tauri v2 هوskill لتطوير تطبيقات متعددة المنصات مع واجهات ويب و backends Rust.","en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"definition":{"en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"features":{"zh":["跨平台开发","快速设置","减少常见错误","节省令牌","使用 Tauri、React 和 Rust"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォーム開発","迅速なセットアップ","一般的なエラーの減少","トークンの節約","Tauri、React、Rustの使用"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 개발","빠른 설정","일반적인 오류 감소","토큰 절약","Tauri, React, Rust 사용"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones cross-plataforma","Frontends web con React","Backends con Rust","Reducción de errores comunes","Mejora de la eficiencia","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Développement d''applications cross-plateformes","Frontends web avec React","Backends avec Rust","Réduction des erreurs courantes","Amélioration de l''efficacité","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Entwicklung von Cross-Plattform-Anwendungen","Web-Frontends mit React","Backends mit Rust","Reduzierung von gemeinsamen Fehlern","Verbesserung der Effizienz","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos cross-plataforma","Frontends web com React","Backends seguros e performáticos com Rust","Redução de erros comuns","Economia de tempo de desenvolvimento","Suporte a desktop e mobile"],"ru":["Разработка кроссплатформенных приложений","Веб-интерфейсы с React","Безопасные и производительные бэкенды на Rust","Минимизация ошибок","Сокращение времени разработки","Поддержка desktop и mobile"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات متعددة المنصات","واجهات ويب مع React","خوادم خلفية آمنة وذكية مع Rust","تقليل الأخطاء الشائعة","توفير وقت التطوير","دعم سطح المكتب والموبايل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tauri v2","跨平台开发","React","Rust","快速设置","错误减少","开发技能"],"ja":["Tauri v2","クロスプラットフォーム開発","React","Rust","迅速なセットアップ","エラーの減少","開発スキル"],"ko":["Tauri v2","크로스 플랫폼 개발","React","Rust","빠른 설정","오류 감소","개발 스킬"],"es":["Tauri v2","desarrollo de aplicaciones","cross-plataforma","React","Rust","reducción de errores","eficiencia","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Tauri v2","développement d''applications","cross-plateformes","React","Rust","réduction des erreurs","efficacité","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Tauri v2","Entwicklung von Anwendungen","Cross-Plattform","React","Rust","Reduzierung von Fehlern","Effizienz","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Tauri v2","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","cross-plataforma","React","Rust","aplicativos desktop","aplicativos mobile","redução de erros","economia de tempo"],"ru":["Tauri v2","разработка приложений","кроссплатформенные приложения","React","Rust","desktop-приложения","mobile-приложения","минимизация ошибок","сокращение времени разработки"],"ar":["Tauri v2","تطوير التطبيقات","تطبيقات متعددة المنصات","React","Rust","تطبيقات سطح المكتب","تطبيقات الموبايل","تقليل الأخطاء","توفير الوقت"]}},"owner":"TheerasakPing","repo":"video-downloader-tauri","repoPath":"TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tauri-v2","description":"Tauri v2 cross-platform app development with Rust backend. Use when configuring tauri.conf.json, implementing Rust commands (#[tauri::command]), setting up IPC patterns (invoke, emit, channels), configuring permissions/capabilities, troubleshooting build issues, or deploying desktop/mobile apps. Triggers on Tauri, src-tauri, invoke, emit, capabilities.json.","bodyPreview":"# Tauri v2 Development Skill\n\n> Build cross-platform desktop and mobile apps with web frontends and Rust backends.\n\n## Before You Start\n\n**This skill prevents 8+ common errors and saves ~60% tokens.**\n\n| Metric | Without Skill | With Skill |\n|--------|--------------|------------|\n| Setup Time | ~2 hours | ~30 min |\n| Common Errors | 8+ | 0 |\n| Token Usage | High (exploration) | Low (direct patterns) |\n\n### Known Issues This Skill Prevents\n\n1. Permission denied errors from missing capabilities\n2.","body":"# Tauri v2 Development Skill\n\n> Build cross-platform desktop and mobile apps with web frontends and Rust backends.\n\n## Before You Start\n\n**This skill prevents 8+ common errors and saves ~60% tokens.**\n\n| Metric | Without Skill | With Skill |\n|--------|--------------|------------|\n| Setup Time | ~2 hours | ~30 min |\n| Common Errors | 8+ | 0 |\n| Token Usage | High (exploration) | Low (direct patterns) |\n\n### Known Issues This Skill Prevents\n\n1. Permission denied errors from missing capabilities\n2. IPC failures from unregistered commands in `generate_handler!`\n3. State management panics from type mismatches\n4. Mobile build failures from missing Rust targets\n5. White screen issues from misconfigured dev URLs\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Create a Tauri Command\n\n```rust\n// src-tauri/src/lib.rs\n#[tauri::command]\nfn greet(name: String) -> String {\n    format!(\"Hello, {}!\", name)\n}\n\npub fn run() {\n    tauri::Builder::default()\n        .invoke_handler(tauri::generate_handler![greet])\n        .run(tauri::generate_context!())\n        .expect(\"error while running tauri application\");\n}\n```\n\n**Why this matters:** Commands not in `generate_handler![]` silently fail when invoked from frontend.\n\n### Step 2: Call from Frontend\n\n```typescript\nimport { invoke } from ''@tauri-apps/api/core'';\n\nconst greeting = await invoke<string>(''greet'', { name: ''World'' });\nconsole.log(greeting); // \"Hello, World!\"\n```\n\n**Why this matters:** Use `@tauri-apps/api/core` (not `@tauri-apps/api/tauri` - that''s v1 API).\n\n### Step 3: Add Required Permissions\n\n```json\n// src-tauri/capabilities/default.json\n{\n    \"$schema\": \"../gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json\",\n    \"identifier\": \"default\",\n    \"windows\": [\"main\"],\n    \"permissions\": [\"core:default\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Why this matters:** Tauri v2 denies everything by default - explicit permissions required for all operations.\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n- Register every command in `tauri::generate_handler![cmd1, cmd2, ...]`\n- Return `Result<T, E>` from commands for proper error handling\n- Use `Mutex<T>` for shared state accessed from multiple commands\n- Add capabilities before using any plugin features\n- Use `lib.rs` for shared code (required for mobile builds)\n\n### Never Do\n\n- Never use borrowed types (`&str`) in async commands - use owned types\n- Never block the main thread - use async for I/O operations\n- Never hardcode paths - use Tauri path APIs (`app.path()`)\n- Never skip capability setup - even \"safe\" operations need permissions\n\n### Common Mistakes\n\n**Wrong - Borrowed type in async:**\n```rust\n#[tauri::command]\nasync fn bad(name: &str) -> String { // Compile error!\n    name.to_string()\n}\n```\n\n**Correct - Owned type:**\n```rust\n#[tauri::command]\nasync fn good(name: String) -> String {\n    name\n}\n```\n\n**Why:** Async commands cannot borrow data across await points; Tauri requires owned types for async command parameters.\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\n| Issue | Root Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-----------|----------|\n| \"Command not found\" | Missing from `generate_handler!` | Add command to handler macro |\n| \"Permission denied\" | Missing capability | Add to `capabilities/default.json` |\n| State panic on access | Type mismatch in `State<T>` | Use exact type from `.manage()` |\n| White screen on launch | Frontend not building | Check `beforeDevCommand` in config |\n| IPC timeout | Blocking async command | Remove blocking code or use spawn |\n| Mobile build fails | Missing Rust targets | Run `rustup target add <target>` |\n\n## Configuration Reference\n\n### tauri.conf.json\n\n```json\n{\n    \"$schema\": \"./gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json\",\n    \"productName\": \"my-app\",\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n    \"identifier\": \"com.example.myapp\",\n    \"build\": {\n        \"devUrl\": \"http://localhost:5173\",\n        \"frontendDist\": \"../dist\",\n        \"beforeDevCommand\": \"npm run dev\",\n        \"beforeBuildCommand\": \"npm run build\"\n    },\n    \"app\": {\n        \"windows\": [{\n            \"label\": \"main\",\n            \"title\": \"My App\",\n            \"width\": 800,\n            \"height\": 600\n        }],\n        \"security\": {\n            \"csp\": \"default-src ''self''; img-src ''self'' data:\",\n            \"capabilities\": [\"default\"]\n        }\n    },\n    \"bundle\": {\n        \"active\": true,\n        \"targets\": \"all\",\n        \"icon\": [\"icons/icon.icns\", \"icons/icon.ico\", \"icons/icon.png\"]\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Key settings:**\n- `build.devUrl`: Must match your frontend dev server port\n- `app.security.capabilities`: Array of capability file identifiers\n\n### Cargo.toml\n\n```toml\n[package]\nname = \"app\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nedition = \"2021\"\n\n[lib]\nname = \"app_lib\"\ncrate-type = [\"staticlib\", \"cdylib\", \"rlib\"]\n\n[build-dependencies]\ntauri-build = { version = \"2\", features = [] }\n\n[dependencies]\ntauri = { version = \"2\", features = [] }\nserde = { version = \"1\", features = [\"derive\"] }\nserde_json = \"1\"\n```\n\n**Key settings:**\n- `[lib]` section: Required for mobile builds\n- `crate-type`: Must include all three types for cross-platform\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Error Handling Pattern\n\n```rust\nuse thiserror::Error;\n\n#[derive(Debug, Error)]\nenum AppError {\n    #[error(\"IO error: {0}\")]\n    Io(#[from] std::io::Error),\n    #[error(\"Not found: {0}\")]\n    NotFound(String),\n}\n\nimpl serde::Serialize for AppError {\n    fn serialize<S>(&self, serializer: S) -> Result<S::Ok, S::Error>\n    where S: serde::ser::Serializer {\n        serializer.serialize_str(self.to_string().as_ref())\n    }\n}\n\n#[tauri::command]\nfn risky_operation() -> Result<String, AppError> {\n    Ok(\"success\".into())\n}\n```\n\n### State Management Pattern\n\n```rust\nuse std::sync::Mutex;\nuse tauri::State;\n\nstruct AppState {\n    counter: u32,\n}\n\n#[tauri::command]\nfn increment(state: State<''_, Mutex<AppState>>) -> u32 {\n    let mut s = state.lock().unwrap();\n    s.counter += 1;\n    s.counter\n}\n\n// In builder:\ntauri::Builder::default()\n    .manage(Mutex::new(AppState { counter: 0 }))\n```\n\n### Event Emission Pattern\n\n```rust\nuse tauri::Emitter;\n\n#[tauri::command]\nfn start_task(app: tauri::AppHandle) {\n    std::thread::spawn(move || {\n        app.emit(\"task-progress\", 50).unwrap();\n        app.emit(\"task-complete\", \"done\").unwrap();\n    });\n}\n```\n\n```typescript\nimport { listen } from ''@tauri-apps/api/event'';\n\nconst unlisten = await listen(''task-progress'', (e) => {\n    console.log(''Progress:'', e.payload);\n});\n// Call unlisten() when done\n```\n\n### Channel Streaming Pattern\n\n```rust\nuse tauri::ipc::Channel;\n\n#[derive(Clone, serde::Serialize)]\n#[serde(tag = \"event\", content = \"data\")]\nenum DownloadEvent {\n    Progress { percent: u32 },\n    Complete { path: String },\n}\n\n#[tauri::command]\nasync fn download(url: String, on_event: Channel<DownloadEvent>) {\n    for i in 0..=100 {\n        on_event.send(DownloadEvent::Progress { percent: i }).unwrap();\n    }\n    on_event.send(DownloadEvent::Complete { path: \"/downloads/file\".into() }).unwrap();\n}\n```\n\n```typescript\nimport { invoke, Channel } from ''@tauri-apps/api/core'';\n\nconst channel = new Channel<DownloadEvent>();\nchannel.onmessage = (msg) => console.log(msg.event, msg.data);\nawait invoke(''download'', { url: ''https://...'', onEvent: channel });\n```\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n### References\n\nLocated in `references/`:\n- [`capabilities-reference.md`](references/capabilities-reference.md) - Permission patterns and examples\n- [`ipc-patterns.md`](references/ipc-patterns.md) - Complete IPC examples\n\n> **Note:** For deep dives on specific topics, see the reference files above.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n### Required\n\n| Package | Version | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| `@tauri-apps/cli` | ^2.0.0 | CLI tooling |\n| `@tauri-apps/api` | ^2.0.0 | Frontend APIs |\n| `tauri` | ^2.0.0 | Rust core |\n| `tauri-build` | ^2.0.0 | Build scripts |\n\n### Optional (Plugins)\n\n| Package | Version | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| `tauri-plugin-fs` | ^2.0.0 | File system access |\n| `tauri-plugin-dialog` | ^2.0.0 | Native dialogs |\n| `tauri-plugin-shell` | ^2.0.0 | Shell commands, open URLs |\n| `tauri-plugin-http` | ^2.0.0 | HTTP client |\n| `tauri-plugin-store` | ^2.0.0 | Key-value storage |\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- [Tauri v2 Documentation](https://v2.tauri.app/)\n- [Commands Reference](https://v2.tauri.app/develop/calling-rust/)\n- [Capabilities & Permissions](https://v2.tauri.app/security/capabilities/)\n- [Configuration Reference](https://v2.tauri.app/reference/config/)\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### White Screen on Launch\n\n**Symptoms:** App launches but shows blank white screen\n\n**Solution:**\n1. Verify `devUrl` matches your frontend dev server port\n2. Check `beforeDevCommand` runs your dev server\n3. Open DevTools (Cmd+Option+I / Ctrl+Shift+I) to check for errors\n\n### Command Returns Undefined\n\n**Symptoms:** `invoke()` returns undefined instead of expected value\n\n**Solution:**\n1. Verify command is in `generate_handler![]`\n2. Check Rust command actually returns a value\n3. Ensure argument names match (camelCase in JS, snake_case in Rust by default)\n\n### Mobile Build Failures\n\n**Symptoms:** Android/iOS build fails with missing target\n\n**Solution:**\n```bash\n# Android targets\nrustup target add aarch64-linux-android armv7-linux-androideabi i686-linux-android x86_64-linux-android\n\n# iOS targets (macOS only)\nrustup target add aarch64-apple-ios x86_64-apple-ios aarch64-apple-ios-sim\n```\n\n## Setup Checklist\n\nBefore using this skill, verify:\n\n- [ ] `npx tauri info` shows correct Tauri v2 versions\n- [ ] `src-tauri/capabilities/default.json` exists with at least `core:default`\n- [ ] All commands registered in `generate_handler![]`\n- [ ] `lib.rs` contains shared code (for mobile support)\n- [ ] Required Rust targets installed for target platforms\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:10:20.283Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Desktop App Development Agents needing to build secure, cross-platform applications with Rust backends and web frontends.","zh":"非常适合需要构建安全、跨平台应用的桌面应用开发代理，后端使用Rust，前端使用Web。","ja":"RustバックエンドとWebフロントエンドを使用した安全でクロスプラットフォームなアプリケーションを構築する必要があるデスクトップアプリ開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"데스크톱 애플리케이션 개발 에이전트가 Rust 백엔드와 웹 프런트엔드를 사용하여 보안이 확보되고 크로스 플랫폼인 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio que necesitan crear aplicaciones seguras y multiplataforma con backends de Rust y frontends web.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''applications de bureau ayant besoin de créer des applications sécurisées et multiplateformes avec des backends Rust et des frontends web.","de":"Perfekt für Desktop-App-Entwicklungsagenten, die sichere, plattformübergreifende Anwendungen mit Rust-Backends und Web-Frontends erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfect for Desktop App Development Agents needing to build secure, cross-platform applications with Rust backends and web frontends.","ru":"Perfect for Desktop App Development Agents needing to build secure, cross-platform applications with Rust backends and web frontends.","ar":"Perfect for Desktop App Development Agents needing to build secure, cross-platform applications with Rust backends and web frontends."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to rapidly scaffold Tauri v2 projects while preventing common setup errors like permission denied issues from missing capabilities. It provides optimized patterns for Rust-React integration that reduce token usage by ~60% compared to manual exploration.","zh":"能够让代理快速构建Tauri v2项目，同时防止常见的权限不足等设置错误。它提供了优化的Rust-React集成模式，减少了手动探索时的令牌使用量约60%。","ja":"エージェントがTauri v2プロジェクトを迅速にスケルトン化できるようにし、キャパビリティ不足によるパーミッション拒否などの一般的なセットアップエラーを防ぎます。Rust-React統合の最適化されたパターンを提供し、手動の探索と比較して約60%のトークン使用量を削減します。","ko":"에이전트가 빠르게 Tauri v2 프로젝트를 스캐폴딩할 수 있도록 하면서, 누락된 기능으로 인한 권한 거부 등의 일반적인 설정 오류를 방지합니다. Rust-React 통합을 위한 최적화된 패턴을 제공하여 수동 탐색과 비교하여 약 60%의 토큰 사용량을 줄입니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear rápidamente proyectos de Tauri v2 mientras evitan errores comunes de configuración como problemas de permisos denegados por capacidades missing. Proporciona patrones optimizados para la integración de Rust-React que reducen el uso de tokens en un ~60% en comparación con la exploración manual.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer rapidement des projets Tauri v2 tout en évitant les erreurs de configuration courantes comme les problèmes de permissions refusées due à des capacités manquantes. Fournit des modèles optimisés pour l''intégration de Rust-React qui réduisent l''utilisation de jetons d''environ ~60% par rapport à l''exploration manuelle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Tauri-v2-Projekte schnell zu erstellen, während es gemeinsame Konfigurationsfehler wie Berechtigungsprobleme durch fehlende Funktionen vermeidet. Bietet optimierte Muster für die Rust-React-Integration, die den Tokenverbrauch um ~60% im Vergleich zur manuellen Erkundung reduzieren.","pt":"Enables agents to rapidly scaffold Tauri v2 projects while preventing common setup errors like permission denied issues from missing capabilities. It provides optimized patterns for Rust-React integration that reduce token usage by ~60% compared to manual exploration.","ru":"Enables agents to rapidly scaffold Tauri v2 projects while preventing common setup errors like permission denied issues from missing capabilities. It provides optimized patterns for Rust-React integration that reduce token usage by ~60% compared to manual exploration.","ar":"Enables agents to rapidly scaffold Tauri v2 projects while preventing common setup errors like permission denied issues from missing capabilities. It provides optimized patterns for Rust-React integration that reduce token usage by ~60% compared to manual exploration."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating cross-platform desktop app builds","Generating secure capability configurations","Debugging Rust-WebView communication issues","Optimizing build processes for mobile targets"],"zh":["自动化跨平台桌面应用程序构建","生成安全的能力配置","调试Rust-WebView通信问题","优化移动目标的构建过程"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームデスクトップアプリの自動化ビルド","セキュアな機能設定の生成","Rust-WebView通信の問題のデバッグ","モバイルターゲットのビルドプロセスの最適化"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 데스크톱 애플리케이션 자동화 빌드","보안 기능 구성 생성","Rust-WebView 통신 문제 디버깅","모바일 대상의 빌드 프로세스 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de aplicaciones de escritorio multiplataforma","Generar configuraciones de capacidad seguras","Depurar problemas de comunicación entre Rust y WebView","Optimizar los procesos de compilación para objetivos móviles"],"fr":["Automatiser la création d''applications de bureau multiplateformes","Générer des configurations de capacité sécurisées","Déboguer les problèmes de communication entre Rust et WebView","Optimiser les processus de construction pour les cibles mobiles"],"de":["Automatisieren des Erstellens von plattformübergreifenden Desktop-Anwendungen","Erzeugen sicherer Fähigkeitskonfigurationen","Debuggen von Kommunikationsproblemen zwischen Rust und WebView","Optimieren der Build-Prozesse für mobile Ziele"],"pt":["Automating cross-platform desktop app builds","Generating secure capability configurations","Debugging Rust-WebView communication issues","Optimizing build processes for mobile targets"],"ru":["Automating cross-platform desktop app builds","Generating secure capability configurations","Debugging Rust-WebView communication issues","Optimizing build processes for mobile targets"],"ar":["Automating cross-platform desktop app builds","Generating secure capability configurations","Debugging Rust-WebView communication issues","Optimizing build processes for mobile targets"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust toolchain installation","Limited to Tauri v2 specific patterns","Mobile platform support requires additional setup"],"zh":["需要Rust工具链安装","仅限Tauri v2特定模式","移动平台支持需要额外设置"],"ja":["Rustツールチェーンのインストールが必要","Tauri v2特有のパターンに限定される","モバイルプラットフォームのサポートには追加の設定が必要"],"ko":["Rust 툴체인 설치가 필요함","Tauri v2 특정 패턴으로 제한됨","모바일 플랫폼 지원에는 추가 설정이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la cadena de herramientas de Rust","Limitado a patrones específicos de Tauri v2","El soporte de plataforma móvil requiere una configuración adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la chaîne d''outils Rust","Limité aux modèles spécifiques de Tauri v2","Le support de plateforme mobile nécessite une configuration supplémentaire"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der Rust-Toolchain","Begrenzt auf Tauri-v2-spezifische Muster","Die mobile Plattformunterstützung erfordert eine zusätzliche Einrichtung"],"pt":["Requires Rust toolchain installation","Limited to Tauri v2 specific patterns","Mobile platform support requires additional setup"],"ru":["Requires Rust toolchain installation","Limited to Tauri v2 specific patterns","Mobile platform support requires additional setup"],"ar":["Requires Rust toolchain installation","Limited to Tauri v2 specific patterns","Mobile platform support requires additional setup"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01/webapp-testing', 'community', 'faint45', 'zhewei-ai-chat-01', 'faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01', 'webapp-testing', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z', '2026-02-18T12:10:38.009Z', NULL, '{"id":"faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01/webapp-testing","name":"webapp-testing","description":{"zh":"使用 Python Playwright 脚本测试本地 Web 应用，提高开发效率和质量","ja":"Python Playwright スクリプトを使用してローカル Web アプリケーションをテストし、開発効率と品質を向上させる","ko":"Python Playwright 스크립트를 사용하여 로컬 웹 애플리케이션을 테스트하여 개발 효율성과 품질을 향상시킵니다","es":"El skill de pruebas de aplicaciones web permite probar aplicaciones web locales con scripts de Python Playwright. Los scripts de ayuda están disponibles para gestionar el ciclo de vida del servidor.","fr":"Le skill de tests d''applications web permet de tester des applications web locales avec des scripts Python Playwright. Des scripts d''aide sont disponibles pour gérer le cycle de vie du serveur.","de":"Das Skill für Webanwendungstests ermöglicht das Testen lokaler Webanwendungen mit Python-Playwright-Skripten. Hilfseskripte sind verfügbar, um den Lebenszyklus des Servers zu verwalten.","pt":"O teste de aplicativos web é crucial para garantir a qualidade do código. Com Playwright, você pode escrever scripts Python para testar aplicativos web locais.","ru":"Тестирование веб-приложений имеет важное значение для обеспечения качества кода. С помощью Playwright вы можете писать скрипты Python для тестирования локальных веб-приложений.","ar":"اختبار تطبيقات الويب ضروري لضمان جودة الرمز. مع Playwright ، يمكنك كتابة سكريبتات Python لاختبار تطبيقات الويب المحلية.","en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Web 应用测试解决方案","ja":"Webアプリケーションテストソリューション","ko":"웹 애플리케이션 테스팅 솔루션","es":"Pruebas de Aplicaciones Web con Playwright","fr":"Tests d''Applications Web avec Playwright","de":"Webanwendungstests mit Playwri