 para ver la ayuda","Evita la contaminación del contexto con scripts grandes"],"fr":["Scripts Python Playwright pour les tests d''applications web","Scripts d''aide pour gérer le cycle de vie du serveur","Prise en charge de plusieurs serveurs","Option d''exécuter des scripts avec --help pour afficher l''aide","Évite la pollution du contexte avec des scripts importants"],"de":["Python-Playwright-Skripte für Webanwendungstests","Hilfseskripte für die Verwaltung des Server-Lebenszyklus","Unterstützung für mehrere Server","Option, Skripte mit --help auszuführen, um die Hilfe anzuzeigen","Vermeidet die Verschmutzung des Kontexts mit großen Skripten"],"pt":["Teste de aplicativos web locais com scripts Python","Gerenciamento de ciclo de vida do servidor com suporte a vários servidores","Scripts de ajuda disponíveis para simplificar o processo de teste","Suporte a execução de scripts com opção --help para visualizar a utilização","Possibilidade de personalizar soluções de teste de acordo com as necessidades"],"ru":["Тестирование локальных веб-приложений с помощью скриптов Python","Управление циклом жизни сервера с поддержкой нескольких серверов","Доступные скрипты-помощники для упрощения процесса тестирования","Поддержка выполнения скриптов с опцией --help для просмотра использования","Возможность настраивать решения тестирования в соответствии с потребностями"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات الويب المحلية باستخدام سكريبتات Python","إدارة دورة حياة الخادم مع دعم للخادمات المتعددة","سكريبتات مساعدة متاحة لتبسيط عملية الاختبار","دعم تشغيل السكريبتات مع خيار --help لعرض الاستخدام","امكانية تخصيص حلول الاختبار وفقاً للاحتياجات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web 应用测试","Python Playwright","自动化测试","本地 Web 应用","开发效率","测试工具"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションテスト","Python Playwright","自動テスト","ローカル Web アプリケーション","開発効率","テストツール"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션 테스팅","Python Playwright","자동화 테스팅","로컬 웹 애플리케이션","개발 효율성","테스트 도구"],"es":["pruebas de aplicaciones web","Python Playwright","scripts de ayuda","gestión de servidores","desarrollo web","testing de aplicaciones","automatización de pruebas","playwright python"],"fr":["tests d''applications web","Python Playwright","scripts d''aide","gestion de serveurs","développement web","testing d''applications","automatisation de tests","playwright python"],"de":["Webanwendungstests","Python Playwright","Hilfseskripte","Serververwaltung","Webentwicklung","Testing von Anwendungen","Automatisierung von Tests","playwright python"],"pt":["teste de aplicativos web","playwright","python","teste de software","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","teste de unidade","teste de integração"],"ru":["тестирование веб-приложений","playwright","python","тестирование программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","юнит-тестирование","интеграционное тестирование"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات الويب","playwright","python","اختبار برنامج","تطوير برنامج","جودة الرمز","اختبار الوحدة","اختبار التكامل"]}},"owner":"faint45","repo":"zhewei-ai-chat-01","repoPath":"faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Toolkit for interacting with and testing local web applications using Playwright. Supports verifying frontend functionality, debugging UI behavior, capturing browser screenshots, and viewing browser logs.","bodyPreview":"# Web Application Testing\n\nTo test local web applications, write native Python Playwright scripts.\n\n**Helper Scripts Available**:\n- `scripts/with_server.py` - Manages server lifecycle (supports multiple servers)\n\n**Always run scripts with `--help` first** to see usage. DO NOT read the source until you try running the script first and find that a customized solution is abslutely necessary. These scripts can be very large and thus pollute your context window. They exist to be called directly as bl","body":"# Web Application Testing\n\nTo test local web applications, write native Python Playwright scripts.\n\n**Helper Scripts Available**:\n- `scripts/with_server.py` - Manages server lifecycle (supports multiple servers)\n\n**Always run scripts with `--help` first** to see usage. DO NOT read the source until you try running the script first and find that a customized solution is abslutely necessary. These scripts can be very large and thus pollute your context window. They exist to be called directly as black-box scripts rather than ingested into your context window.\n\n## Decision Tree: Choosing Your Approach\n\n```\nUser task → Is it static HTML?\n    ├─ Yes → Read HTML file directly to identify selectors\n    │         ├─ Success → Write Playwright script using selectors\n    │         └─ Fails/Incomplete → Treat as dynamic (below)\n    │\n    └─ No (dynamic webapp) → Is the server already running?\n        ├─ No → Run: python scripts/with_server.py --help\n        │        Then use the helper + write simplified Playwright script\n        │\n        └─ Yes → Reconnaissance-then-action:\n            1. Navigate and wait for networkidle\n            2. Take screenshot or inspect DOM\n            3. Identify selectors from rendered state\n            4. Execute actions with discovered selectors\n```\n\n## Example: Using with_server.py\n\nTo start a server, run `--help` first, then use the helper:\n\n**Single server:**\n```bash\npython scripts/with_server.py --server \"npm run dev\" --port 5173 -- python your_automation.py\n```\n\n**Multiple servers (e.g., backend + frontend):**\n```bash\npython scripts/with_server.py \\\n  --server \"cd backend && python server.py\" --port 3000 \\\n  --server \"cd frontend && npm run dev\" --port 5173 \\\n  -- python your_automation.py\n```\n\nTo create an automation script, include only Playwright logic (servers are managed automatically):\n```python\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True) # Always launch chromium in headless mode\n    page = browser.new_page()\n    page.goto(''http://localhost:5173'') # Server already running and ready\n    page.wait_for_load_state(''networkidle'') # CRITICAL: Wait for JS to execute\n    # ... your automation logic\n    browser.close()\n```\n\n## Reconnaissance-Then-Action Pattern\n\n1. **Inspect rendered DOM**:\n   ```python\n   page.screenshot(path=''/tmp/inspect.png'', full_page=True)\n   content = page.content()\n   page.locator(''button'').all()\n   ```\n\n2. **Identify selectors** from inspection results\n\n3. **Execute actions** using discovered selectors\n\n## Common Pitfall\n\n❌ **Don''t** inspect the DOM before waiting for `networkidle` on dynamic apps\n✅ **Do** wait for `page.wait_for_load_state(''networkidle'')` before inspection\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Use bundled scripts as black boxes** - To accomplish a task, consider whether one of the scripts available in `scripts/` can help. These scripts handle common, complex workflows reliably without cluttering the context window. Use `--help` to see usage, then invoke directly. \n- Use `sync_playwright()` for synchronous scripts\n- Always close the browser when done\n- Use descriptive selectors: `text=`, `role=`, CSS selectors, or IDs\n- Add appropriate waits: `page.wait_for_selector()` or `page.wait_for_timeout()`\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- **examples/** - Examples showing common patterns:\n  - `element_discovery.py` - Discovering buttons, links, and inputs on a page\n  - `static_html_automation.py` - Using file:// URLs for local HTML\n  - `console_logging.py` - Capturing console logs during automation"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:10:38.009Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT requiring automated web application testing with native Python Playwright scripts.","zh":"适合于像 Cursor 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要使用本地 Python Playwright 脚本进行自动化的 Web 应用程序测试。","ja":"Cursor および AutoGPT などの AI エージェントに適しており、ネイティブ Python Playwright スクリプトを使用した自動化された Web アプリケーション テストを必要とする。","ko":"Cursor 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 네이티브 Python Playwright 스크립트를 사용하여 자동화된 웹 애플리케이션 테스트를 수행하는 데 필요한 경우에 사용됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor y AutoGPT que requieren pruebas automatizadas de aplicaciones web con scripts de Python Playwright nativos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor et AutoGPT nécessitant des tests automatisés d''applications web avec des scripts Python Playwright natifs.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor und AutoGPT, die automatisierte Webanwendungstests mit nativen Python-Playwright-Skripten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor e AutoGPT que requerem testes automatizados de aplicativos web com scripts Python Playwright nativos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor и AutoGPT, требующих автоматизированного тестирования веб-приложений с использованием родных скриптов Python Playwright.","ar":"مثالية لعميل الإي إيه مثل Cursor و AutoGPT التي تتطلب اختبارات تطبيق الويب الآلية باستخدام البرامج النصية Python Playwright الأصلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to test local web applications using Python Playwright, managing server lifecycles with scripts like `with_server.py`, and supports multiple servers through protocols like HTTP and HTTPS.","zh":"赋予代理使用 Python Playwright 测试本地 Web 应用程序的能力，使用诸如 `with_server.py` 的脚本来管理服务器生命周期，并通过 HTTP 和 HTTPS 等协议支持多个服务器。","ja":"エージェントが Python Playwright を使用してローカル Web アプリケーションをテストできるようにし、`with_server.py` などのスクリプトを使用してサーバー ライフサイクルを管理し、HTTP や HTTPS などのプロトコルを介して複数のサーバーをサポートする。","ko":"에이전트가 Python Playwright를 사용하여 로컬 웹 애플리케이션을 테스트할 수 있도록 하며, `with_server.py`와 같은 스크립트를 사용하여 서버 라이프사이클을 관리하고, HTTP 및 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 여러 서버를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes probar aplicaciones web locales utilizando Python Playwright, gestionar ciclos de vida del servidor con scripts como `with_server.py` y soporta múltiples servidores a través de protocolos como HTTP y HTTPS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tester des applications web locales en utilisant Python Playwright, en gérant les cycles de vie du serveur avec des scripts comme `with_server.py` et prend en charge plusieurs serveurs via des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTTPS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, lokale Webanwendungen mit Python Playwright zu testen, Serverlebenszyklen mit Skripten wie `with_server.py` zu verwalten und unterstützt mehrere Server über Protokolle wie HTTP und HTTPS.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a testar aplicativos web locais usando Python Playwright, gerenciando ciclos de vida do servidor com scripts como `with_server.py`, e suporta vários servidores por meio de protocolos como HTTP e HTTPS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тестировать локальные веб-приложения с помощью Python Playwright, управляя жизненным циклом сервера с помощью скриптов, таких как `with_server.py`, и поддерживает несколько серверов через протоколы, такие как HTTP и HTTPS.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من اختبار تطبيقات الويب المحلية باستخدام Python Playwright، وإدارة دورة حياة الخادم مع البرامج النصية مثل `with_server.py`، ودعم الخوادم المتعددة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و HTTPS."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web application testing with Playwright scripts","Debugging web application issues using server lifecycle management","Testing web applications with multiple server setups"],"zh":["使用 Playwright 脚本自动化 Web 应用程序测试","使用服务器生命周期管理调试 Web 应用程序问题","使用多个服务器设置测试 Web 应用程序"],"ja":["Playwright スクリプトを使用した Web アプリケーション テストの自動化","サーバー ライフサイクル管理を使用した Web アプリケーションの問題のデバッグ","複数のサーバー設定を使用した Web アプリケーションのテスト"],"ko":["Playwright 스크립트를 사용한 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 자동화","서버 라이프사이클 관리를 사용한 웹 애플리케이션 문제 디버깅","여러 서버 설정을 사용한 웹 애플리케이션 테스트"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de aplicaciones web con scripts de Playwright","Depurar problemas de aplicaciones web mediante la gestión del ciclo de vida del servidor","Probar aplicaciones web con configuraciones de servidor múltiples"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests d''applications web avec des scripts Playwright","Déboguer les problèmes d''applications web en utilisant la gestion du cycle de vie du serveur","Tester des applications web avec des configurations de serveur multiples"],"de":["Automatisieren von Webanwendungstests mit Playwright-Skripten","Debuggen von Webanwendungsproblemen durch Server-Lebenszyklusverwaltung","Testen von Webanwendungen mit mehreren Server-Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de aplicativos web com scripts Playwright","Depurar problemas de aplicativos web usando gerenciamento de ciclo de vida do servidor","Testar aplicativos web com várias configurações de servidor"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование веб-приложений с помощью скриптов Playwright","Отладить проблемы веб-приложений с помощью управления жизненным циклом сервера","Тестировать веб-приложения с несколькими настройками сервера"],"ar":["الآليّة لاختبار تطبيقات الويب باستخدام البرامج النصية Playwright","تصحيح الأخطاء في تطبيقات الويب باستخدام إدارة دورة حياة الخادم","اختبار تطبيقات الويب مع عدة إعدادات للخادم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Native Python Playwright scripts only","Limited to local web application testing"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境","仅支持本地 Python Playwright 脚本","仅限于本地 Web 应用程序测试"],"ja":["Python 環境が必要","ネイティブ Python Playwright スクリプトのみをサポート","ローカル Web アプリケーション テストに限定"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요합니다.","네이티브 Python Playwright 스크립트만 지원","로컬 웹 애플리케이션 테스트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Solo scripts de Python Playwright nativos","Limitado a pruebas de aplicaciones web locales"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Uniquement des scripts Python Playwright natifs","Limité aux tests d''applications web locales"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Nur native Python-Playwright-Skripte","Begrenzt auf lokale Webanwendungstests"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Somente scripts Python Playwright nativos","Limitado a testes de aplicativos web locais"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Только родные скрипты Python Playwright","Ограничен тестированием локальных веб-приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","البرامج النصية الأصلية ل Python Playwright فقط","محدود باختبار تطبيقات الويب المحلية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
