,"Edición inteligente de especs principales","Soporte para operaciones de cambio","Compatibilidad con VS Code","Mejora de la eficiencia en el desarrollo"],"fr":["Synchronisation des specs Markdown et AsciiDoc avec Marked 2","Édition intelligente des specs principales","Prise en charge des opérations de changement","Compatibilité avec VS Code","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans le développement"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Spezifikationen von Markdown und AsciiDoc mit Marked 2","Intelligente Bearbeitung von Hauptspezifikationen","Unterstützung für Änderungsoperationen","Kompatibilität mit VS Code","Verbesserung der Effizienz in der Entwicklung"],"pt":["Sincronização de especificações Markdown e AsciiDoc","Integração com Marked 2","Operação baseada em agente","Edição direta de especificações principais","Mesclagem inteligente de alterações"],"ru":["Синхронизация спецификаций Markdown и AsciiDoc","Интеграция с Marked 2","Операция на основе агента","Прямое редактирование основных спецификаций","Интеллектуальное слияние изменений"],"ar":["مزامنة مواصفات Markdown و AsciiDoc","التكامل مع Marked 2","عملية تعتمد على العميل","التحرير المباشر للمواصفات الرئيسية","دمج ذكي للتغييرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["VS Code 扩展","Markdown 同步","AsciiDoc 同步","智能合并","编辑工具","开发效率","代码管理"],"ja":["VS Code 拡張機能","Markdown 同期","AsciiDoc 同期","智能マージ","編集ツール","開発効率","コード管理"],"ko":["VS Code 확장 기능","Markdown 동기화","AsciiDoc 동기화","智能 병합","편집 도구","개발 효율성","코드 관리"],"es":["openspec-sync-specs","extensión VS Code","sincronización de especs","Marked 2","desarrollo de software","eficiencia en el desarrollo","edición de especs","operaciones de cambio"],"fr":["openspec-sync-specs","extension VS Code","synchronisation de specs","Marked 2","développement de logiciels","efficacité dans le développement","édition de specs","opérations de changement"],"de":["openspec-sync-specs","VS Code-Erweiterung","Synchronisierung von Spezifikationen","Marked 2","Softwareentwicklung","Effizienz in der Entwicklung","Bearbeitung von Spezifikationen","Änderungsoperationen"],"pt":["openspec-sync-specs","VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","Sincronização de especificações","Extensão do VS Code","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["openspec-sync-specs","VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","Синхронизация спецификаций","Расширение VS Code","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["openspec-sync-specs","VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","مزامنة المواصفات","توسيع VS Code","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"vscode-open-in-marked2","repoPath":"gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-sync-specs","description":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs. Use when the user wants to update main specs with changes from a delta spec, without archiving the change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selectio","body":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have delta specs (under `specs/` directory).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Find delta specs**\n\n   Look for delta spec files in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/*/spec.md`.\n\n   Each delta spec file contains sections like:\n   - `## ADDED Requirements` - New requirements to add\n   - `## MODIFIED Requirements` - Changes to existing requirements\n   - `## REMOVED Requirements` - Requirements to remove\n   - `## RENAMED Requirements` - Requirements to rename (FROM:/TO: format)\n\n   If no delta specs found, inform user and stop.\n\n3. **For each delta spec, apply changes to main specs**\n\n   For each capability with a delta spec at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/<capability>/spec.md`:\n\n   a. **Read the delta spec** to understand the intended changes\n\n   b. **Read the main spec** at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md` (may not exist yet)\n\n   c. **Apply changes intelligently**:\n\n      **ADDED Requirements:**\n      - If requirement doesn''t exist in main spec → add it\n      - If requirement already exists → update it to match (treat as implicit MODIFIED)\n\n      **MODIFIED Requirements:**\n      - Find the requirement in main spec\n      - Apply the changes - this can be:\n        - Adding new scenarios (don''t need to copy existing ones)\n        - Modifying existing scenarios\n        - Changing the requirement description\n      - Preserve scenarios/content not mentioned in the delta\n\n      **REMOVED Requirements:**\n      - Remove the entire requirement block from main spec\n\n      **RENAMED Requirements:**\n      - Find the FROM requirement, rename to TO\n\n   d. **Create new main spec** if capability doesn''t exist yet:\n      - Create `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n      - Add Purpose section (can be brief, mark as TBD)\n      - Add Requirements section with the ADDED requirements\n\n4. **Show summary**\n\n   After applying all changes, summarize:\n   - Which capabilities were updated\n   - What changes were made (requirements added/modified/removed/renamed)\n\n**Delta Spec Format Reference**\n\n```markdown\n## ADDED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: New Feature\nThe system SHALL do something new.\n\n#### Scenario: Basic case\n- **WHEN** user does X\n- **THEN** system does Y\n\n## MODIFIED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Existing Feature\n#### Scenario: New scenario to add\n- **WHEN** user does A\n- **THEN** system does B\n\n## REMOVED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Deprecated Feature\n\n## RENAMED Requirements\n\n- FROM: `### Requirement: Old Name`\n- TO: `### Requirement: New Name`\n```\n\n**Key Principle: Intelligent Merging**\n\nUnlike programmatic merging, you can apply **partial updates**:\n- To add a scenario, just include that scenario under MODIFIED - don''t copy existing scenarios\n- The delta represents *intent*, not a wholesale replacement\n- Use your judgment to merge changes sensibly\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Specs Synced: <change-name>\n\nUpdated main specs:\n\n**<capability-1>**:\n- Added requirement: \"New Feature\"\n- Modified requirement: \"Existing Feature\" (added 1 scenario)\n\n**<capability-2>**:\n- Created new spec file\n- Added requirement: \"Another Feature\"\n\nMain specs are now updated. The change remains active - archive when implementation is complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Read both delta and main specs before making changes\n- Preserve existing content not mentioned in delta\n- If something is unclear, ask for clarification\n- Show what you''re changing as you go\n- The operation should be idempotent - running twice should give same result\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:10:50.518Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Agent Developers needing Markdown and AsciiDoc file synchronization with intelligent merging capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要将 Markdown 和 AsciiDoc 文件同步并具有智能合并功能的 Agent 开发者。","ja":"マークダウンとAsciiDocファイルの同期と智能的なマージ機能が必要なエージェント開発者に最適です。","ko":"마크다운과 AsciiDoc 파일을 동기화하고智能적인 병합 기능이 필요한 에이전트 개발자에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de agentes que necesitan sincronización de archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc con capacidades de fusión inteligente.","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs d''agents ayant besoin de synchronisation de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc avec des capacités de fusion intelligentes.","de":"Perfekt für Agent-Entwickler, die eine Synchronisierung von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien mit intelligenten Merge-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Desenvolvedores de Agentes que necessitam de sincronização de arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc com capacidades de mesclagem inteligente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Разработчиков Агентов, которым необходима синхронизация файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc с функциями интеллектуального слияния.","ar":"مثالي لمنطقي التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى مزامنة ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc مع القدرات المتقدمة للمزج الذكي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to sync delta specs from changes to main specs using Markdown and AsciiDoc files, enabling intelligent merging and direct editing of main specs with libraries like Marked 2, supporting file formats like .md and .adoc.","zh":"使得代理能够使用 Markdown 和 AsciiDoc 文件从主规格的更改中同步 delta 规格，实现智能合并，并使用 Marked 2 等库直接编辑主规格，支持 .md 和 .adoc 等文件格式。","ja":"マークダウンとAsciiDocファイルを使用して、メイン仕様の変更からデルタ仕様を同期し、智能的なマージを実現し、Marked 2などのライブラリを使用してメイン仕様を直接編集し、.mdや.adocなどのファイル形式をサポートします。","ko":"마크다운과 AsciiDoc 파일을 사용하여 주요 사양의 변경에서 델타 사양을 동기화하고智能적인 병합을 구현하며, Marked 2 등의 라이브러리를 사용하여 주요 사양을 직접 편집하며, .md 및 .adoc 등의 파일 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a sincronizar especificaciones delta desde los cambios a las especificaciones principales utilizando archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc, lo que permite la fusión inteligente y la edición directa de las especificaciones principales con bibliotecas como Marked 2, que admiten formatos de archivo como .md y .adoc.","fr":"Permet aux agents de synchroniser les spécifications delta à partir des modifications apportées aux spécifications principales en utilisant des fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc, ce qui permet la fusion intelligente et l''édition directe des spécifications principales avec des bibliothèques comme Marked 2, qui prennent en charge des formats de fichier tels que .md et .adoc.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Delta-Spezifikationen aus Änderungen an den Hauptspezifikationen mithilfe von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien zu synchronisieren, was eine intelligente Zusammenführung und direkte Bearbeitung der Hauptspezifikationen mit Bibliotheken wie Marked 2 ermöglicht, die Dateiformate wie .md und .adoc unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a sincronizar especificações delta a partir de alterações nas especificações principais usando arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc, permitindo mesclagem inteligente e edição direta das especificações principais com bibliotecas como Marked 2, suportando formatos de arquivo como .md e .adoc.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью синхронизировать спецификации delta из изменений основной спецификации с помощью файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc, обеспечивая интеллектуальное слияние и прямое редактирование основной спецификации с библиотеками như Marked 2, поддерживающими форматы файлов seperti .md и .adoc.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من مزامنة المواصفات دلتا من التغييرات على المواصفات الرئيسية باستخدام ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc، وتمكين المزج الذكي والتعديل المباشر للمواصفات الرئيسية مع مكتبات مثل Marked 2، ودعم صيغ الملفات مثل .md و .adoc."},"useCases":{"en":["Syncing delta specs for efficient requirement updates","Merging scenario changes without copying entire requirements","Automating spec updates from conversation context"],"zh":["为高效的需求更新同步 delta 规格","在不复制整个需求的情况下合并场景更改","从会话上下文自动更新规格"],"ja":["効率的な要件更新のためのデルタ仕様の同期","全要件をコピーせずにシナリオの変更をマージする","会話のコンテキストから仕様を自動更新する"],"ko":["효율적인 요구 사항 업데이트 위한 델타 사양 동기화","전체 요구 사항을 복사하지 않고 시나리오 변경을 병합","대화의 맥락에서 사양을 자동으로 업데이트하는"],"es":["Sincronización de especificaciones delta para actualizaciones de requisitos eficientes","Fusión de cambios de escenarios sin copiar todos los requisitos","Automatización de actualizaciones de especificaciones desde el contexto de la conversación"],"fr":["Synchronisation des spécifications delta pour des mises à jour de exigences efficaces","Fusion des changements de scénarios sans copier toutes les exigences","Automatisation des mises à jour de spécifications à partir du contexte de la conversation"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Delta-Spezifikationen für effiziente Anforderungsaktualisierungen","Zusammenführung von Szenarienänderungen ohne Kopieren aller Anforderungen","Automatisierung von Spezifikationsaktualisierungen aus dem Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Sincronização de especificações delta para atualizações eficientes de requisitos","Mesclagem de cenários de alteração sem copiar todos os requisitos","Automatização de atualizações de especificações a partir do contexto da conversa"],"ru":["Синхронизация спецификаций delta для эффективного обновления требований","Слияние сценариев изменений без копирования всех требований","Автоматизация обновления спецификаций из контекста разговора"],"ar":["مزامنة مواصفات دلتا لتحديث متطلبات فعال","دمج تغييرات السيناريو بدون نسخ جميع المتطلبات","تأتمة تحديث المواصفات من سياق المحادثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VS Code extension installation","Limited to Markdown and AsciiDoc file formats","Needs inference of change name from conversation context or prompt for selection"],"zh":["需要安装 VS Code 扩展","仅限于 Markdown 和 AsciiDoc 文件格式","需要从会话上下文或提示中推断更改名称"],"ja":["VS Code拡張機能のインストールが必要","マークダウンとAsciiDocファイル形式のみに限定","会話のコンテキストまたはプロンプトから変更名を推論する必要がある"],"ko":["VS Code 확장 프로그램 설치가 필요","마크다운과 AsciiDoc 파일 형식만으로 제한","대화의 맥락 또는 프롬프트에서 변경 이름을 추론해야 함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la extensión de VS Code","Limitado a formatos de archivo Markdown y AsciiDoc","Necesita inferencia del nombre del cambio desde el contexto de la conversación o una solicitud de selección"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''extension VS Code","Limité aux formats de fichier Markdown et AsciiDoc","Nécessite une inférence du nom du changement à partir du contexte de la conversation ou une demande de sélection"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der VS Code-Erweiterung","Begrenzt auf Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateiformate","Benötigt die Inferenz des Änderungsnamens aus dem Konversationskontext oder eine Aufforderung zur Auswahl"],"pt":["Exige instalação da extensão VS Code","Limitado a formatos de arquivo Markdown e AsciiDoc","Necessita de inferência do nome da alteração a partir do contexto da conversa ou prompt para seleção"],"ru":["Требует установки расширения VS Code","Ограничен форматами файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc","Требует вывода имени изменения из контекста разговора или подсказки для выбора"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ملحقات VS Code","محدود بصيغ الملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc","يحتاج إلى استنتاج اسم التغيير من سياق المحادثة أو توجيه للاختيار"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
