ules/subtitles.md](./rules/subtitles.md) file for more information.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animatio","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## Captions\n\nWhen dealing with captions or subtitles, load the [./rules/subtitles.md](./rules/subtitles.md) file for more information.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/light-leaks.md](rules/light-leaks.md) - Light leak overlay effects using @remotion/light-leaks\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/transparent-videos.md](rules/transparent-videos.md) - Rendering out a video with transparency\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:11:56.185Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Editing Agents needing advanced Remotion code optimization and domain-specific knowledge.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Remotion代码优化和领域特定知识的视频编辑代理","ja":"ビデオ編集エージェントが高度なRemotionコード最適化とドメイン固有の知識を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 Remotion 코드 최적화 및 도메인 특정 지식이 필요한 비디오 편집 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfect for Video Editing Agents needing advanced Remotion code optimization and domain-specific knowledge.","fr":"Perfect for Video Editing Agents needing advanced Remotion code optimization and domain-specific knowledge.","de":"Perfect for Video Editing Agents needing advanced Remotion code optimization and domain-specific knowledge.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Edição de Vídeo que necessitam de otimização avançada de código Remotion e conhecimento específico de domínio.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов видеомонтажа, которым требуется продвинутая оптимизация кода Remotion и специфические знания в области.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحرير الفيديو الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين متقدم لرموشن_remotion و معرفة محددة للنطاق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality video content using Remotion, with best practices for 3D content creation via Three.js and React Three Fiber, and fundamental animation techniques, all while following specific rules for subtitles and captions.","zh":"赋予代理创建高质量视频内容的能力，使用Remotion，遵循Three.js和React Three Fiber的最佳实践，掌握基本动画技术，并遵循特定的字幕和标题规则","ja":"Remotionを使用して高品質のビデオコンテンツを作成するエージェントをEmpowerする、三次元コンテンツ作成のためのThree.jsとReact Three Fiberのベストプラクティス、基本的なアニメーション技術、字幕とキャプションの特定のルールに従う","ko":"에이전트가 Remotion을 사용하여 고화질 비디오 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있도록 하는데, Three.js 및 React Three Fiber의 모범 사례를 따르는 3D 콘텐츠 생성 및 기본 애니메이션 기술, 그리고 자막 및 캡션의 특정 규칙을 따름","es":"Empowers agents to create high-quality video content using Remotion, with best practices for 3D content creation via Three.js and React Three Fiber, and fundamental animation techniques, all while following specific rules for subtitles and captions.","fr":"Empowers agents to create high-quality video content using Remotion, with best practices for 3D content creation via Three.js and React Three Fiber, and fundamental animation techniques, all while following specific rules for subtitles and captions.","de":"Empowers agents to create high-quality video content using Remotion, with best practices for 3D content creation via Three.js and React Three Fiber, and fundamental animation techniques, all while following specific rules for subtitles and captions.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo de vídeo de alta qualidade usando Remotion, com as melhores práticas para criação de conteúdo 3D via Three.js e React Three Fiber, e técnicas de animação fundamentais, seguindo regras específicas para legendas e legendas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать контент высокого качества с помощью Remotion, используя лучшие практики для создания 3D-контента через Three.js и React Three Fiber, а также базовые техники анимации, соблюдая специальные правила для субтитров и титров.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية إنشاء محتوى فيديو عالي الجودة باستخدام Remotion، مع أفضل الممارسات لإنشاء محتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد عبر Three.js و React Three Fiber، وتقنيات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية، مع اتباع قواعد محددة للترجمة و التعليقات الصوتية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D content in Remotion using Three.js","Creating smooth animations with fundamental animation rules","Optimizing video subtitles and captions with specific loading rules"],"zh":["使用Three.js在Remotion中生成三维内容","使用基本动画规则创建平滑动画","使用特定的加载规则优化视频字幕和标题"],"ja":["Three.jsを使用してRemotionで3Dコンテンツを生成する","基本的なアニメーションルールを使用してスムーズなアニメーションを作成する","特定のロードルールを使用してビデオ字幕とキャプションを最適化する"],"ko":["Three.js를 사용하여 Remotion에서 3D 콘텐츠를 생성","기본 애니메이션 규칙을 사용하여 부드러운 애니메이션을 생성","특정 로딩 규칙을 사용하여 비디오 자막 및 캡션을 최적화"],"es":["Generating 3D content in Remotion using Three.js","Creating smooth animations with fundamental animation rules","Optimizing video subtitles and captions with specific loading rules"],"fr":["Generating 3D content in Remotion using Three.js","Creating smooth animations with fundamental animation rules","Optimizing video subtitles and captions with specific loading rules"],"de":["Generating 3D content in Remotion using Three.js","Creating smooth animations with fundamental animation rules","Optimizing video subtitles and captions with specific loading rules"],"pt":["Geração de conteúdo 3D no Remotion usando Three.js","Criação de animações suaves com regras de animação fundamentais","Otimização de legendas e legendas de vídeo com regras de carregamento específicas"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-контента в Remotion с помощью Three.js","Создание плавных анимаций с базовыми правилами анимации","Оптимизация субтитров и титров видео с особыми правилами загрузки"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد في Remotion باستخدام Three.js","إنشاء رسوم متحركة ناعمة مع قواعد الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية","تحسين ترجمة الفيديو و التعليقات الصوتية مع قواعد تحميل محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Specific to Remotion video editing ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Remotion代码库访问权限","特定于Remotion视频编辑生态系统"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Remotionビデオ編集エコシステムに特有"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스 액세스가 필요","Remotion 비디오 편집 생태계에 특정"],"es":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Specific to Remotion video editing ecosystem"],"fr":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Specific to Remotion video editing ecosystem"],"de":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Specific to Remotion video editing ecosystem"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código Remotion","Específico para o ecossistema de edição de vídeo Remotion"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе Remotion","Специфичен для экосистемы видеомонтажа Remotion"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة Remotion","محدد لمنظومة تحرير الفيديو Remotion"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
