..","en":"apify-ultimate-scraper"},"description":{"zh":"Apify 的终极网页抓取器是一种 AI 驱动的数据提取工具，支持 55+ 个 Actor 和所有主要平台","ja":"Apify の最終ウェブスクレイパーは、55+ の Actor とすべての主要プラットフォームをサポートする AI 駆動のデータ抽出ツールです","ko":"Apify의 최종 웹 스크레이퍼는 55개 이상의 Actor와 모든 주요 플랫폼을 지원하는 AI 구동 데이터 추출 도구입니다","es":"Apify Ultimate Scraper es un skill de extracción de datos web que selecciona automáticamente el mejor actor para tu tarea.","fr":"Apify Ultimate Scraper est un skill d''extraction de données web qui sélectionne automatiquement le meilleur acteur pour votre tâche.","de":"Apify Ultimate Scraper ist ein Skill für die Web-Datenextraktion, der automatisch den besten Akteur für Ihre Aufgabe auswählt.","pt":"O Apify Ultimate Scraper é uma habilidade de extração de dados da web impulsionada por IA que seleciona automaticamente o melhor ator para sua tarefa.","ru":"Apify Ultimate Scraper — это возможность извлечения данных из веба, работающая на основе ИИ, которая автоматически выбирает лучшего актёра для вашей задачи.","ar":"Apify Ultimate Scraper هي مهارة استخراج بيانات الويب المدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي التي تختار تلقائيًا أفضل ممثل لمهامك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 55+ 个 Actor","自动选择最适合任务的 Actor","支持所有主要平台","使用 AI 技术提高数据提取准确性","提供简单易用的 API 接口"],"ja":["55+ の Actor をサポート","タスクに最も適した Actor を自動的に選択","すべての主要プラットフォームをサポート","AI 技術を使用してデータ抽出の精度を向上","シンプルで使いやすい API インターフェイスを提供"],"ko":["55개 이상의 Actor 지원","작업에 가장 적합한 Actor를 자동으로 선택","모든 주요 플랫폼 지원","AI 기술을 사용하여 데이터 추출 정확도 향상","단순하고 사용하기 쉬운 API 인터페이스 제공"],"es":["Extracción de datos de 55+ actores","Selección automática del mejor actor","Compatibilidad con todas las plataformas principales","Soporte para Node.js 20.6+","Integración con la herramienta CLI mcpc"],"fr":["Extraction de données de 55+ acteurs","Sélection automatique du meilleur acteur","Compatibilité avec toutes les plates-formes principales","Prise en charge de Node.js 20.6+","Intégration avec l''outil CLI mcpc"],"de":["Datenextraktion von 55+ Akteuren","Automatische Auswahl des besten Akteurs","Kompatibilität mit allen großen Plattformen","Unterstützung für Node.js 20.6+","Integration mit dem CLI-Tool mcpc"],"pt":["Extração de dados da web impulsionada por IA","Seleção automática do melhor ator para sua tarefa","Suporte a 55+ atores em todas as principais plataformas","Integração com Node.js 20.6+ e suporte nativo ao arquivo .env","Ferramenta CLI mcpc para gerenciamento de tarefas","Compatibilidade com vários ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Извлечение данных из веба, работающее на основе ИИ","Автоматический выбор лучшего актёра для вашей задачи","Поддержка 55+ актёров на всех основных платформах","Интеграция с Node.js 20.6+ и родная поддержка файла .env","Инструмент CLI mcpc для управления задачами","Совместимость с несколькими средами разработки"],"ar":["استخراج البيانات من الويب بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي","اختيار تلقائي لأفضل ممثل لمهامك","دعم 55+ ممثلًا على جميع المنصات الرئيسية","التكامل مع Node.js 20.6+ ودعم مدمج لملف .env","أداة سطر الأوامر mcpc لإدارة المهام","التوافق مع بيئات متعددة للتطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["网页抓取","数据提取","AI 驱动","自动化","Apify","Actor","数据挖掘","网页爬虫"],"ja":["ウェブスクレイピング","データ抽出","AI駆動","自動化","Apify","Actor","データマイニング","ウェブクローラー"],"ko":["웹 스크레이핑","데이터 추출","AI 구동","자동화","Apify","Actor","데이터 마이닝","웹 크롤러"],"es":["extracción de datos web","apify","skill de inteligencia artificial","node.js","mcpc","extracción de datos automatizada","selección de actor","plataformas principales"],"fr":["extraction de données web","apify","skill d''intelligence artificielle","node.js","mcpc","extraction de données automatisée","sélection d''acteur","plates-formes principales"],"de":["web-datenextraktion","apify","ki-skill","node.js","mcpc","automatisierte datenextraktion","akteurauswahl","große plattformen"],"pt":["web scraping","extração de dados da web","IA","Apify","Node.js","desenvolvimento de software","automação de tarefas","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["веб-скрапинг","извлечение данных из веба","ИИ","Apify","Node.js","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизация задач","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["استخراج بيانات الويب","استخراج البيانات من الويب","الذكاء الاصطناعي","Apify","Node.js","تطوير البرمجيات","التلقائية في المهام","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"apify-ultimate-scraper","description":"Universal AI-powered web scraper for any platform. Scrape data from Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, YouTube, Google Maps, Google Search, Google Trends, Booking.com, and TripAdvisor. Use for lead generation, brand monitoring, competitor analysis, influencer discovery, trend research, content analytics, audience analysis, or any data extraction task.","bodyPreview":"# Universal Web Scraper\n\nAI-driven data extraction from 55+ Actors across all major platforms. This skill automatically selects the best Actor for your task.\n\n## Prerequisites\n(No need to check it upfront)\n\n- `.env` file with `APIFY_TOKEN`\n- Node.js 20.6+ (for native `--env-file` support)\n- `mcpc` CLI tool: `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Understand user goal and select Actor\n- [ ] Step 2: Fetch Actor schema via","body":"# Universal Web Scraper\n\nAI-driven data extraction from 55+ Actors across all major platforms. This skill automatically selects the best Actor for your task.\n\n## Prerequisites\n(No need to check it upfront)\n\n- `.env` file with `APIFY_TOKEN`\n- Node.js 20.6+ (for native `--env-file` support)\n- `mcpc` CLI tool: `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Understand user goal and select Actor\n- [ ] Step 2: Fetch Actor schema via mcpc\n- [ ] Step 3: Ask user preferences (format, filename)\n- [ ] Step 4: Run the scraper script\n- [ ] Step 5: Summarize results and offer follow-ups\n```\n\n### Step 1: Understand User Goal and Select Actor\n\nFirst, understand what the user wants to achieve. Then select the best Actor from the options below.\n\n#### Instagram Actors (12)\n\n| Actor ID | Best For |\n|----------|----------|\n| `apify/instagram-profile-scraper` | Profile data, follower counts, bio info |\n| `apify/instagram-post-scraper` | Individual post details, engagement metrics |\n| `apify/instagram-comment-scraper` | Comment extraction, sentiment analysis |\n| `apify/instagram-hashtag-scraper` | Hashtag content, trending topics |\n| `apify/instagram-hashtag-stats` | Hashtag performance metrics |\n| `apify/instagram-reel-scraper` | Reels content and metrics |\n| `apify/instagram-search-scraper` | Search users, places, hashtags |\n| `apify/instagram-tagged-scraper` | Posts tagged with specific accounts |\n| `apify/instagram-followers-count-scraper` | Follower count tracking |\n| `apify/instagram-scraper` | Comprehensive Instagram data |\n| `apify/instagram-api-scraper` | API-based Instagram access |\n| `apify/export-instagram-comments-posts` | Bulk comment/post export |\n\n#### Facebook Actors (14)\n\n| Actor ID | Best For |\n|----------|----------|\n| `apify/facebook-pages-scraper` | Page data, metrics, contact info |\n| `apify/facebook-page-contact-information` | Emails, phones, addresses from pages |\n| `apify/facebook-posts-scraper` | Post content and engagement |\n| `apify/facebook-comments-scraper` | Comment extraction |\n| `apify/facebook-likes-scraper` | Reaction analysis |\n| `apify/facebook-reviews-scraper` | Page reviews |\n| `apify/facebook-groups-scraper` | Group content and members |\n| `apify/facebook-events-scraper` | Event data |\n| `apify/facebook-ads-scraper` | Ad creative and targeting |\n| `apify/facebook-search-scraper` | Search results |\n| `apify/facebook-reels-scraper` | Reels content |\n| `apify/facebook-photos-scraper` | Photo extraction |\n| `apify/facebook-marketplace-scraper` | Marketplace listings |\n| `apify/facebook-followers-following-scraper` | Follower/following lists |\n\n#### TikTok Actors (14)\n\n| Actor ID | Best For |\n|----------|----------|\n| `clockworks/tiktok-scraper` | Comprehensive TikTok data |\n| `clockworks/free-tiktok-scraper` | Free TikTok extraction |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-profile-scraper` | Profile data |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-video-scraper` | Video details and metrics |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-comments-scraper` | Comment extraction |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-followers-scraper` | Follower lists |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-user-search-scraper` | Find users by keywords |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-hashtag-scraper` | Hashtag content |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-sound-scraper` | Trending sounds |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-ads-scraper` | Ad content |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-discover-scraper` | Discover page content |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-explore-scraper` | Explore content |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-trends-scraper` | Trending content |\n| `clockworks/tiktok-live-scraper` | Live stream data |\n\n#### YouTube Actors (5)\n\n| Actor ID | Best For |\n|----------|----------|\n| `streamers/youtube-scraper` | Video data and metrics |\n| `streamers/youtube-channel-scraper` | Channel information |\n| `streamers/youtube-comments-scraper` | Comment extraction |\n| `streamers/youtube-shorts-scraper` | Shorts content |\n| `streamers/youtube-video-scraper-by-hashtag` | Videos by hashtag |\n\n#### Google Maps Actors (4)\n\n| Actor ID | Best For |\n|----------|----------|\n| `compass/crawler-google-places` | Business listings, ratings, contact info |\n| `compass/google-maps-extractor` | Detailed business data |\n| `compass/Google-Maps-Reviews-Scraper` | Review extraction |\n| `poidata/google-maps-email-extractor` | Email discovery from listings |\n\n#### Other Actors (6)\n\n| Actor ID | Best For |\n|----------|----------|\n| `apify/google-search-scraper` | Google search results |\n| `apify/google-trends-scraper` | Google Trends data |\n| `voyager/booking-scraper` | Booking.com hotel data |\n| `voyager/booking-reviews-scraper` | Booking.com reviews |\n| `maxcopell/tripadvisor-reviews` | TripAdvisor reviews |\n| `vdrmota/contact-info-scraper` | Contact enrichment from URLs |\n\n---\n\n#### Actor Selection by Use Case\n\n| Use Case | Primary Actors |\n|----------|---------------|\n| **Lead Generation** | `compass/crawler-google-places`, `poidata/google-maps-email-extractor`, `vdrmota/contact-info-scraper` |\n| **Influencer Discovery** | `apify/instagram-profile-scraper`, `clockworks/tiktok-profile-scraper`, `streamers/youtube-channel-scraper` |\n| **Brand Monitoring** | `apify/instagram-tagged-scraper`, `apify/instagram-hashtag-scraper`, `compass/Google-Maps-Reviews-Scraper` |\n| **Competitor Analysis** | `apify/facebook-pages-scraper`, `apify/facebook-ads-scraper`, `apify/instagram-profile-scraper` |\n| **Content Analytics** | `apify/instagram-post-scraper`, `clockworks/tiktok-scraper`, `streamers/youtube-scraper` |\n| **Trend Research** | `apify/google-trends-scraper`, `clockworks/tiktok-trends-scraper`, `apify/instagram-hashtag-stats` |\n| **Review Analysis** | `compass/Google-Maps-Reviews-Scraper`, `voyager/booking-reviews-scraper`, `maxcopell/tripadvisor-reviews` |\n| **Audience Analysis** | `apify/instagram-followers-count-scraper`, `clockworks/tiktok-followers-scraper`, `apify/facebook-followers-following-scraper` |\n\n---\n\n#### Multi-Actor Workflows\n\nFor complex tasks, chain multiple Actors:\n\n| Workflow | Step 1 | Step 2 |\n|----------|--------|--------|\n| **Lead enrichment** | `compass/crawler-google-places` → | `vdrmota/contact-info-scraper` |\n| **Influencer vetting** | `apify/instagram-profile-scraper` → | `apify/instagram-comment-scraper` |\n| **Competitor deep-dive** | `apify/facebook-pages-scraper` → | `apify/facebook-posts-scraper` |\n| **Local business analysis** | `compass/crawler-google-places` → | `compass/Google-Maps-Reviews-Scraper` |\n\n#### Can''t Find a Suitable Actor?\n\nIf none of the Actors above match the user''s request, search the Apify Store directly:\n\n```bash\nexport $(grep APIFY_TOKEN .env | xargs) && mcpc --json mcp.apify.com --header \"Authorization: Bearer $APIFY_TOKEN\" tools-call search-actors keywords:=\"SEARCH_KEYWORDS\" limit:=10 offset:=0 category:=\"\" | jq -r ''.content[0].text''\n```\n\nReplace `SEARCH_KEYWORDS` with 1-3 simple terms (e.g., \"LinkedIn profiles\", \"Amazon products\", \"Twitter\").\n\n### Step 2: Fetch Actor Schema\n\nFetch the Actor''s input schema and details dynamically using mcpc:\n\n```bash\nexport $(grep APIFY_TOKEN .env | xargs) && mcpc --json mcp.apify.com --header \"Authorization: Bearer $APIFY_TOKEN\" tools-call fetch-actor-details actor:=\"ACTOR_ID\" | jq -r \".content\"\n```\n\nReplace `ACTOR_ID` with the selected Actor (e.g., `compass/crawler-google-places`).\n\nThis returns:\n- Actor description and README\n- Required and optional input parameters\n- Output fields (if available)\n\n### Step 3: Ask User Preferences\n\nBefore running, ask:\n1. **Output format**:\n   - **Quick answer** - Display top few results in chat (no file saved)\n   - **CSV** - Full export with all fields\n   - **JSON** - Full export in JSON format\n2. **Number of results**: Based on character of use case\n\n### Step 4: Run the Script\n\n**Quick answer (display in chat, no file):**\n```bash\nnode --env-file=.env ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/reference/scripts/run_actor.js \\\n  --actor \"ACTOR_ID\" \\\n  --input ''JSON_INPUT''\n```\n\n**CSV:**\n```bash\nnode --env-file=.env ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/reference/scripts/run_actor.js \\\n  --actor \"ACTOR_ID\" \\\n  --input ''JSON_INPUT'' \\\n  --output YYYY-MM-DD_OUTPUT_FILE.csv \\\n  --format csv\n```\n\n**JSON:**\n```bash\nnode --env-file=.env ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/reference/scripts/run_actor.js \\\n  --actor \"ACTOR_ID\" \\\n  --input ''JSON_INPUT'' \\\n  --output YYYY-MM-DD_OUTPUT_FILE.json \\\n  --format json\n```\n\n### Step 5: Summarize Results and Offer Follow-ups\n\nAfter completion, report:\n- Number of results found\n- File location and name\n- Key fields available\n- **Suggested follow-up workflows** based on results:\n\n| If User Got | Suggest Next |\n|-------------|--------------|\n| Business listings | Enrich with `vdrmota/contact-info-scraper` or get reviews |\n| Influencer profiles | Analyze engagement with comment scrapers |\n| Competitor pages | Deep-dive with post/ad scrapers |\n| Trend data | Validate with platform-specific hashtag scrapers |\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n`APIFY_TOKEN not found` - Ask user to create `.env` with `APIFY_TOKEN=your_token`\n`mcpc not found` - Ask user to install `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`\n`Actor not found` - Check Actor ID spelling\n`Run FAILED` - Ask user to check Apify console link in error output\n`Timeout` - Reduce input size or increase `--timeout`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:11:51.615Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Scraping Agents needing automated data extraction from major platforms using Apify Actors","zh":"非常适合需要从主要平台自动提取数据的 Web Scraping Agents，使用 Apify Actors","ja":"主要プラットフォームからの自動データ抽出が必要なWeb Scraping Agentsに最適で、Apify Actorsを使用","ko":"주요 플랫폼에서 자동 데이터 추출이 필요한 Web Scraping Agents에 적합하며, Apify Actors를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Scraping Web que necesitan extracción de datos automatizada de plataformas principales utilizando actores de Apify","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de scraping Web nécessitant une extraction de données automatisée à partir de plates-formes principales à l''aide d''acteurs Apify","de":"Perfekt für Web-Scraping-Agents, die eine automatisierte Datenextraktion von großen Plattformen mithilfe von Apify-Aktoren benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Web Scraping que necessitam de extração de dados automatizada de plataformas principais usando Atores Apify","ru":"Идеально для агентов веб-скрапинга, которым требуется автоматизированная экстракция данных из основных платформ с помощью Актеров Apify","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء لإزالة القشرة من الويب الذين يحتاجون إلى استخراج بيانات آلي من منصات رئيسية باستخدام ممثلي Apify"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform AI-driven data extraction from 55+ Actors across all major platforms, utilizing Node.js 20.6+ and the `mcpc` CLI tool, while automatically selecting the best Actor for the task via APIFY_TOKEN and `.env` file configuration","zh":"赋予代理执行从55+个Actor跨所有主要平台的AI驱动数据提取，利用Node.js 20.6+和`mcpc` CLI工具，同时通过APIFY_TOKEN和`.env`文件配置自动选择任务的最佳Actor","ja":"エージェントに55+のアクターを跨ぐすべてのメジャーなプラットフォームからのAI駆動のデータ抽出を実行させることができ、Node.js 20.6+と`mcpc` CLIツールを利用し、APIFY_TOKENと`.env`ファイルの設定を通じてタスクに最適なアクターを自動で選択","ko":"에이전트가 55+ 개의 Actor를 통해 모든 주요 플랫폼에서 AI 드라이브 데이터 추출을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, Node.js 20.6+ 및 `mcpc` CLI 도구를 사용하며, APIFY_TOKEN 및 `.env` 파일 구성 통해 작업에 최적의 Actor를 자동으로 선택","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar una extracción de datos impulsada por IA desde más de 55 actores en todas las plataformas principales, utilizando Node.js 20.6+ y la herramienta de línea de comandos `mcpc`, mientras selecciona automáticamente el mejor actor para la tarea a través de la configuración de APIFY_TOKEN y del archivo `.env`","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une extraction de données pilotée par l''IA à partir de plus de 55 acteurs sur toutes les plates-formes principales, en utilisant Node.js 20.6+ et l''outil de ligne de commande `mcpc`, tout en sélectionnant automatiquement le meilleur acteur pour la tâche via la configuration de APIFY_TOKEN et du fichier `.env`","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, AI-getriebene Datenextraktion von über 55 Akteuren auf allen großen Plattformen durchzuführen, indem Node.js 20.6+ und das `mcpc`-CLI-Tool verwendet werden, während das beste Aktor für die Aufgabe über die APIFY_TOKEN- und `.env`-Dateikonfiguration automatisch ausgewählt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar extração de dados impulsionada por IA de mais de 55 Atores em todas as plataformas principais, utilizando Node.js 20.6+ e a ferramenta CLI `mcpc`, enquanto seleciona automaticamente o melhor Ator para a tarefa por meio da configuração do arquivo `APIFY_TOKEN` e `.env`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять экстракцию данных, управляемую ИИ, из более чем 55 Актеров на всех основных платформах, используя Node.js 20.6+ и инструмент CLI `mcpc`, при этом автоматически выбирая лучшего Актера для задачи через конфигурацию файла `APIFY_TOKEN` и `.env`","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من أداء استخراج البيانات القائم على الذكاء الاصطناعي من أكثر من 55 ممثلًا عبر جميع المنصات الرئيسية، باستخدام Node.js 20.6+ وأداة سطر الأوامر `mcpc`، مع تحديد الممثل الأنسب للمهمة تلقائيًا عبر تكوين ملف `APIFY_TOKEN` و `.env`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web data extraction for market research","Generating datasets from e-commerce platforms","Debugging web scraping tasks using Apify Actor schemas"],"zh":["自动化网络数据提取用于市场研究","从电子商务平台生成数据集","使用Apify Actor模式调试网络爬虫任务"],"ja":["市場調査のためのWebデータ抽出の自動化","電子商取引プラットフォームからのデータセットの生成","Apifyアクタースキーマを使用したWebスクレイピングタスクのデバッグ"],"ko":["시장 조사용 웹 데이터 추출 자동화","전자상거래 플랫폼에서 데이터셋 생성","Apify Actor 스키마를 사용한 웹 스크레이핑 작업 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la extracción de datos web para investigación de mercado","Generar conjuntos de datos a partir de plataformas de comercio electrónico","Depurar tareas de scraping web utilizando esquemas de actores de Apify"],"fr":["Automatiser l''extraction de données Web pour la recherche de marché","Générer des jeux de données à partir de plates-formes de commerce électronique","Déboguer les tâches de scraping Web en utilisant les schémas d''acteurs Apify"],"de":["Automatisierung der Web-Datenextraktion für Marktforschung","Erstellung von Datensätzen aus E-Commerce-Plattformen","Fehlerbehebung bei Web-Scraping-Aufgaben mithilfe von Apify-Aktor-Schemata"],"pt":["Automatizar a extração de dados da web para pesquisa de mercado","Gerar conjuntos de dados de plataformas de comércio eletrônico","Depurar tarefas de web scraping usando esquemas de Ator Apify"],"ru":["Автоматизация экстракции веб-данных для маркетинговых исследований","Генерация наборов данных из платформ электронной коммерции","Отладка задач веб-скрапинга с помощью схем Актеров Apify"],"ar":["أتمتة استخراج البيانات من الويب لأغراض البحث السوقي","إنشاء مجموعات بيانات من منصات التجارة الإلكترونية","تصحيح أخطاء مهام إزالة القشرة من الويب باستخدام مخططات ممثلي Apify"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `.env` file with `APIFY_TOKEN`","Node.js 20.6+ for native `--env-file` support","Installation of `mcpc` CLI tool via `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`"],"zh":["需要`.env`文件中包含`APIFY_TOKEN`","需要Node.js 20.6+以支持本机`--env-file`","需要通过`npm install -g @apify/mcpc`安装`mcpc` CLI工具"],"ja":["`.env`ファイルに`APIFY_TOKEN`が必要","ネイティブの`--env-file`をサポートするためにNode.js 20.6+が必要","`npm install -g @apify/mcpc`を通じて`mcpc` CLIツールをインストールする必要"],"ko":["`.env` 파일에 `APIFY_TOKEN`가 필요합니다.","네이티브 `--env-file` 지원을 위해 Node.js 20.6+ 필요","`npm install -g @apify/mcpc`를 통해 `mcpc` CLI 도구를 설치해야 함"],"es":["Requiere un archivo `.env` con `APIFY_TOKEN`","Node.js 20.6+ para soporte nativo de `--env-file`","Instalación de la herramienta de línea de comandos `mcpc` a través de `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier `.env` avec `APIFY_TOKEN`","Node.js 20.6+ pour un support natif de `--env-file`","Installation de l''outil de ligne de commande `mcpc` via `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`"],"de":["Benötigt eine `.env`-Datei mit `APIFY_TOKEN`","Node.js 20.6+ für native Unterstützung von `--env-file`","Installation des `mcpc`-CLI-Tools über `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`"],"pt":["Requer arquivo `.env` com `APIFY_TOKEN`","Node.js 20.6+ para suporte nativo de `--env-file`","Instalação da ferramenta CLI `mcpc` via `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`"],"ru":["Требуется файл `.env` с `APIFY_TOKEN`","Node.js 20.6+ для родной поддержки `--env-file`","Установка инструмента CLI `mcpc` через `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف `.env` مع `APIFY_TOKEN`","Node.js 20.6+ لدعم مدمج لـ `--env-file`","تثبيت أداة سطر الأوامر `mcpc` عبر `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('stackconsult/RE-Engine/reengine-self-healing', 'community', 'stackconsult', 'RE-Engine', 'stackconsult/RE-Engine', 'reengine-self-healing', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z', '2026-02-18T12:11:51.027Z', NULL, '{"id":"stackconsult/RE-Engine/reengine-self-healing","name":"reengine-self-healing","description":{"zh":"reengine-self-healing技能实现了自愈系统，通过分布式锁定、自适应重试和智能故障分类等核心可靠性机制，提高系统的可靠性和稳定性","ja":"reengine-self-healingスキルは、分散ロック、適応型リトライ、インテリジェントな障害分類などのコアの信頼性メカニズムを使用して、システムの信頼性と安定性を向上させます","ko":"reengine-self-healing 스킬은 분산 잠금, 적응형 재시도 및 지능형 故障 분류 등 핵심 신뢰성 메커니즘을 사용하여 시스템의 신뢰성과 안정성을 향상합니다","es":"El sistema de auto-sanación utiliza mecanismos de confiabilidad avanzados para garantizar la estabilidad y el rendimiento. Incluye bloqueo distribuido, lógica de reintento adaptativa y captura de artefactos","fr":"Le système auto-réparation utilise des mécanismes de fiabilité avancés pour assurer la stabilité et les performances. Il inclut le verrouillage distribué, la logique de réessai adaptative et la capture d''artefacts","de":"Das Selbstheilungssystem verwendet fortschrittliche Zuverlässigkeitsmechanismen, um Stabilität und Leistung zu gewährleisten. Es umfasst verteilter Sperre, adaptive Wiederholungslogik und Artefakt-Erfassung","pt":"O sistema de auto-curação é uma abordagem inovadora que combina mecanismos de confiabilidade para garantir a estabilidade do sistema. Com recursos como bloqueio distribuído e lógica de retry adaptativa, este sistema é projetado para manter a disponibilidade e a confiabilidade.","ru":"Самовосстанавливающаяся система - это инновационный подход, сочетающий механизмы надежности для обеспечения стабильности системы. С функциями, такими как распределенное блокирование и адаптивная логика повторных попыток, эта система предназначена для поддержания доступности и надежности.","ar":"نظام自اعمار هو نهج مبتكر يجمع آليات الثبات لضمان استقرار النظام. مع ميزات مثل القفل التوزيعي و 논理ة إعادة المحاولة التكيفية, نظام自اعمار مصمم للحفاظ على التوفر والثبات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"自愈系统 - reengine-self-healing","ja":"セルフヒーリングシステム - reengine-self-healing","ko":"셀프 힐링 시스템 - reengine-self-healing","es":"Sistema de Auto-Sanación: Reingeniería y Confiabilidad","fr":"Système Auto-Réparation: Réingénierie et Fiabilité","de":"Selbstheilungssystem: Neukonstruktion und Zuverlässigkeit","pt":"Sistema de Auto-Curação: Reengenharia para Confiabilidade","ru":"Самовосстанавливающаяся система: Переинжиниринг для Надеж...","ar":"نظام自اعمار: إعادة هندسة لضمان الثبات","en":"reengine-self-healing"},"description":{"zh":"reengine-self-healing技能实现了自愈系统，通过分布式锁定、自适应重试和智能故障分类等核心可靠性机制，提高系统的可靠性和稳定性","ja":"reengine-self-healingスキルは、分散ロック、適応型リトライ、インテリジェントな障害分類などのコアの信頼性メカニズムを使用して、システムの信頼性と安定性を向上させます","ko":"reengine-self-healing 스킬은 분산 잠금, 적응형 재시도 및 지능형 故障 분류 등 핵심 신뢰성 메커니즘을 사용하여 시스템의 신뢰성과 안정성을 향상합니다","es":"El sistema de auto-sanación utiliza mecanismos de confiabilidad avanzados para garantizar la estabilidad y el rendimiento. Incluye bloqueo distribuido, lógic...","fr":"Le système auto-réparation utilise des mécanismes de fiabilité avancés pour assurer la stabilité et les performances. Il inclut le verrouillage distribué, la...","de":"Das Selbstheilungssystem verwendet fortschrittliche Zuverlässigkeitsmechanismen, um Stabilität und Leistung zu gewährleisten. Es umfasst verteilter Sperre, a...","pt":"O sistema de auto-curação é uma abordagem inovadora que combina mecanismos de confiabilidade para garantir a estabilidade do sistema. Com recursos como bloqu...","ru":"Самовосстанавливающаяся система - это инновационный подход, сочетающий механизмы надежности для обеспечения стабильности системы. С функциями, такими как рас...","ar":"نظام自اعمار هو نهج مبتكر يجمع آليات الثبات لضمان استقرار النظام. مع ميزات مثل القفل التوزيعي و 논理ة إعادة المحاولة التكيفية, نظام自اعمار مصمم للحفاظ على التوفر ...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["分布式锁定","自适应重试","智能故障分类","综合日志捕获","健康监测"],"ja":["分散ロック","適応型リトライ","インテリジェントな障害分類","包括的なログキャプチャ","ヘルスモニタリング"],"ko":["분산 잠금","적응형 재시도","지능형 故障 분류","포괄적인 로그 캡처","헬스 모니터링"],"es":["Bloqueo distribuido para prevenir la ejecución superpuesta","Lógica de reintento adaptativa con retroceso exponencial y patrones de interruptor de circuito","Captura de artefactos con registro estructurado y seguimiento distribuido","Clasificación de fallos inteligente mediante aprendizaje automático","Supervisión de la salud del sistema en tiempo real y detección predictiva de fallos"],"fr":["Verrouillage distribué pour empêcher l''exécution chevauchante","Logique de réessai adaptative avec backoff exponentiel et modèles de disjoncteur de circuit","Capture d''artefacts avec journalisation structurée et traçage distribué","Classification de défaillances intelligente via l''apprentissage automatique","Supervision de la santé du système en temps réel et détection prédictive de défaillances"],"de":["Verteilter Sperre zur Verhinderung der überlappenden Ausführung","Adaptive Wiederholungslogik mit exponentiellem Backoff und Schaltkreis-Mustern","Artefakt-Erfassung mit strukturierter Protokollierung und verteilter Nachverfolgung","Intelligente Fehlerklassifizierung durch maschinelles Lernen","Echtzeit-Überwachung der Systemgesundheit und vorherige Fehlererkennung"],"pt":["Bloqueio distribuído para prevenir execução sobreposta","Lógica de retry adaptativa com backoff exponencial e padrões de circuit breaker","Captura de artefatos abrangente com logging estruturado e rastreamento distribuído","Classificação de falhas inteligente com ML","Monitoramento de saúde em tempo real com detecção de falhas previsível"],"ru":["Распределенное блокирование для предотвращения пересекающейся выполняемости","Адаптивная логика повторных попыток с экспоненциальным отступом и шаблонами цепного разрыва","Всеобъемлющая захват артефактов с структурированным логированием и распределенным трассированием","Интеллектуальная классификация сбоев с использованием ML","Мониторинг здоровья в реальном времени с прогнозируемой детекцией сбоев"],"ar":["قفل توزيعي لمنع التنفيذ المتداخل","منطق إعادة المحاولة التكيفية مع التراجع الأسي و أنماط الكسر الدائري","ألتقاط شاملة للأشياء الفنية مع تسجيل بنية و تتبع توزيعي","تصنيف ذكي للأخطاء مع استخدام ML","مراقبة الصحة في الوقت الفعلي مع كشف الأخطاء المتوقع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自愈系统","分布式锁定","自适应重试","智能故障分类","系统可靠性","系统稳定性"],"ja":["セルフヒーリングシステム","分散ロック","適応型リトライ","インテリジェントな障害分類","システムの信頼性","システムの安定性"],"ko":["셀프 힐링 시스템","분산 잠금","적응형 재시도","지능형 故障 분류","시스템 신뢰성","시스템 안정성"],"es":["sistema de auto-sanación","mecanismos de confiabilidad","bloqueo distribuido","lógica de reintento adaptativa","captura de artefactos","clasificación de fallos","supervisión de la salud del sistema"],"fr":["système auto-réparation","mécanismes de fiabilité","verrouillage distribué","logique de réessai adaptative","capture d''artefacts","classification de défaillances","supervision de la santé du système"],"de":["Selbstheilungssystem","Zuverlässigkeitsmechanismen","verteilter Sperre","adaptive Wiederholungslogik","Artefakt-Erfassung","Fehlerklassifizierung","Echtzeit-Überwachung der Systemgesundheit"],"pt":["sistema de auto-curação","reengenharia","confiabilidade","bloqueio distribuído","lógica de retry adaptativa","monitoramento de saúde","classificação de falhas","tecnologia de recuperação","sistemas de auto-recuperação"],"ru":["самовосстанавливающаяся система","переинжиниринг","надежность","распределенное блокирование","адаптивная логика повторных попыток","мониторинг здоровья","классификация сбоев","технология восстановления","системы самовосстановления"],"ar":["نظام自اعمار","إعادة هندسة","ثبات","قفل توزيعي","منطق إعادة المحاولة التكيفية","مراقبة الصحة","تصنيف الأخطاء","تكنولوجيا الاستعادة","نظم الاستعادة الذاتية"]}},"owner":"stackconsult","repo":"RE-Engine","repoPath":"stackconsult/RE-Engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reengine-self-healing","description":"Enhanced reliability mechanisms with intelligent recovery, adaptive retry strategies, comprehensive monitoring, and automated remediation capabilities.","bodyPreview":"# Self-Healing System\n\n## Core Reliability Mechanisms\n- **Distributed Locking**: Prevent overlapping execution across multiple instances\n- **Adaptive Retry Logic**: Exponential backoff with jitter and circuit breaker patterns\n- **Comprehensive Artifact Capture**: Structured logging, distributed tracing, error snapshots\n- **Intelligent Failure Classification**: ML-driven categorization of root causes\n- **Health Monitoring**: Real-time system health checks and predictive failure detection\n\n## Reco","body":"# Self-Healing System\n\n## Core Reliability Mechanisms\n- **Distributed Locking**: Prevent overlapping execution across multiple instances\n- **Adaptive Retry Logic**: Exponential backoff with jitter and circuit breaker patterns\n- **Comprehensive Artifact Capture**: Structured logging, distributed tracing, error snapshots\n- **Intelligent Failure Classification**: ML-driven categorization of root causes\n- **Health Monitoring**: Real-time system health checks and predictive failure detection\n\n## Recovery & Remediation\n- **Dynamic Recovery Playbook**: Context-aware recovery strategies based on failure patterns\n- **Safe Automated Remediation**: Non-destructive auto-fixes with human approval gates\n- **Rollback Capabilities**: Automatic state restoration on failed recoveries\n- **Incident Correlation**: Cross-system failure analysis and impact assessment\n\n## Monitoring & Diagnostics\n- **Performance Metrics**: Latency, throughput, error rates with trend analysis\n- **Resource Utilization**: CPU, memory, network monitoring with alerting\n- **Dependency Health**: External service monitoring and cascade failure prevention\n- **Audit Trail**: Complete execution history for compliance and debugging\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:11:51.027Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain requiring robust self-healing capabilities to ensure high reliability and uptime.","zh":"適合於AutoGPT和LangChain等高級AI代理，需要強大的自我修復能力，以確保高可靠性和正常運行時間。","ja":"AutoGPTやLangChainなどの高度なAIエージェントに適しており、 高い信頼性と稼働時間を確保するために、強力な自己回復機能が必要です。","ko":"AutoGPT와 LangChain 등의 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 높은 신뢰성과 가용성을 보장하기 위해 강력한 자가 회복 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren capacidades de auto-sanación robustas para garantizar una alta confiabilidad y disponibilidad.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA avancés comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités d''auto-réparation robustes pour assurer une haute fiabilité et une disponibilité élevée.","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche KI-Agenten wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die robuste Selbstheilungsfähigkeiten erfordern, um eine hohe Zuverlässigkeit und Verfügbarkeit zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados, como AutoGPT e LangChain, que exigem capacidades de auto-cura robustas para garantir alta confiabilidade e tempo de atividade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих надежных самовосстанавливающих возможностей для обеспечения высокой надежности и времени безотказной работы.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدمة مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب قدرات自اعلاج قوية لضمان الاتساق العالي والاستمرارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents with distributed locking, adaptive retry logic, and intelligent failure classification using machine learning, enabling real-time health monitoring and predictive failure detection through comprehensive artifact capture and structured logging.","zh":"賦予代理分佈式鎖定、自適應重試邏輯和使用機器學習的智能故障分類能力，實現實時健康監控和預測故障檢測，通過全面捕獲工件和結構化日誌記錄。","ja":"エージェントに分散ロック、適応型再試行ロジック、機械学習を使用した知能型障害分類機能を付与し、リアルタイムのヘルスモニタリングと予測障害検出を実現します。包括的なアーティファクトの取得と構造化ログを通じて。","ko":"에이전트에 분산 잠금, 적응형 재시도 로직 및 기계 학습을 사용한 지능형 故障 분류 기능을 부여하여 실시간 건강 모니터링 및 예측 故障 감지를 구현합니다. 포괄적인 아티팩트 캡처 및 구조화 된 로그를 통해","es":"Habilita a los agentes con bloqueo distribuido, lógica de reintento adaptativa y clasificación inteligente de fallos utilizando aprendizaje automático, lo que permite el monitoreo de salud en tiempo real y la detección predictiva de fallos a través de la captura integral de artefactos y registro estructurado.","fr":"Équipe les agents d''un verrouillage distribué, d''une logique de réessai adaptative et d''une classification intelligente des défaillances à l''aide de l''apprentissage automatique, permettant ainsi un monitoring de santé en temps réel et une détection prédictive des défaillances grâce à une capture complète d''artefacts et à un journalisation structurée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten mit verteiltem Sperren, adaptiver Wiederholungslogik und intelligenter Fehlerklassifizierung unter Verwendung von Machine Learning, wodurch Echtzeit-Health-Monitoring und vorherige Fehlererkennung durch umfassende Artefakt-Erfassung und strukturierte Protokollierung ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes com bloqueio distribuído, lógica de repetição adaptativa e classificação de falhas inteligentes usando aprendizado de máquina, permitindo monitoramento de saúde em tempo real e detecção de falhas preditiva por meio da captura abrangente de artefatos e registro estruturado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов распределенным блокированием, адаптивной логикой повторных попыток и интеллектуальной классификацией сбоев с использованием машинного обучения, что позволяет осуществлять мониторинг состояния системы в реальном времени и предсказуемое обнаружение сбоев посредством комплексного сбора артефактов и структурированного журналирования.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من القفل التistributed، ومنطق إعادة المحاولة التكيفي، وتصنيف الفشل الذكي باستخدام التعلم الآلي، مما يسمح بالمراقبة الفورية للصحة والكشف المسبق عن الفشل من خلال قبض شامل للنماذج و تسجيل منظم."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing exponential backoff with jitter for retry mechanisms","Classifying root causes of failures using ML-driven categorization","Performing real-time system health checks and predictive failure detection"],"zh":["實現指數退避與抖動的重試機制","使用機器學習驅動的分類來分類故障的根本原因","執行實時系統健康檢查和預測故障檢測"],"ja":["指数バックオフとジッターの再試行メカニズムを実現する","機械学習駆動の分類を使用して障害の根本原因を分類する","リアルタイムのシステムヘルスチェックと予測障害検出を実行する"],"ko":["지수 백오프와 지터의 재시도 메커니즘을 구현한다","기계 학습 구동 분류를 사용하여 故障의 근본 원인을 분류한다","실시간 시스템 건강 점검 및 예측 故障 감지를 수행한다"],"es":["Implementar un retardo exponencial con jitter para mecanismos de reintento","Clasificar las causas raíz de los fallos utilizando la categorización impulsada por ML","Realizar comprobaciones de salud del sistema en tiempo real y detección predictiva de fallos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre un retard exponentiel avec jitter pour les mécanismes de réessai","Classer les causes profondes des défaillances à l''aide de la catégorisation pilotée par le ML","Effectuer des vérifications de santé du système en temps réel et une détection prédictive des défaillances"],"de":["Implementierung eines exponentiellen Zurücksetzens mit Jitter für Wiederholungsmechanismen","Klassifizierung der Ursachen von Fehlern unter Verwendung der ML-getriebenen Kategorisierung","Durchführung von Echtzeit-System-Health-Checks und vorheriger Fehlererkennung"],"pt":["Implementação de retrocesso exponencial com jitter para mecanismos de repetição","Classificação de causas raiz de falhas usando categorização impulsionada por ML","Realização de verificações de saúde do sistema em tempo real e detecção de falhas preditiva"],"ru":["Реализация экспоненциального отступления с джиттером для механизмов повторных попыток","Классификация коренных причин сбоев с использованием категоризации, управляемой ИИ","Проведение проверок состояния системы в реальном времени и предсказуемое обнаружение сбоев"],"ar":["تنفيذ التراجع الأسي مع jitter لأجهزة إعادة التشغيل","تصنيف الأسباب الجذرية للفشل باستخدام التصنيف المدفوع بالتعلم الآلي","إجراء فحوصات صحية للنظام في الوقت الفعلي والكشف المسبق عن الفشل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation of distributed tracing and error snapshotting","Needs integration with machine learning models for intelligent failure classification","Dependent on comprehensive artifact capture for effective health monitoring"],"zh":["需要實現分佈式追蹤和錯誤快照","需要與機器學習模型集成以實現智能故障分類","依賴於全面捕獲工件以實現有效的健康監控"],"ja":["分散トレーシングとエラースナップショットの実装が必要","機械学習モデルとの統合が必要であるため、知能型障害分類を実現する","包括的なアーティファクトの取得に依存しているため、有効なヘルスモニタリングを実現する"],"ko":["분산 추적 및 오류 스냅샷의 구현이 필요하다","지능형 故障 분류를 구현하기 위해 기계 학습 모델과의 통합이 필요하다","포괄적인 아티팩트 캡처에 의존하기 때문에 효과적인 건강 모니터링을 구현한다"],"es":["Requiere la implementación de seguimiento distribuido y captura de instantáneas de errores","Necesita integración con modelos de aprendizaje automático para clasificación inteligente de fallos","Dependiente de la captura integral de artefactos para un monitoreo de salud efectivo"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise en œuvre d''un suivi distribué et de la capture d''images d''erreurs","A besoin d''une intégration avec des modèles d''apprentissage automatique pour une classification intelligente des défaillances","Dépend de la capture complète d''artefacts pour un monitoring de santé efficace"],"de":["Erfordert die Implementierung von verteiltem Tracing und Fehler-Snapshotting","Benötigt Integration mit Machine-Learning-Modellen für intelligente Fehlerklassifizierung","Hängt von der umfassenden Erfassung von Artefakten für effektives Health-Monitoring ab"],"pt":["Exige implementação de rastreio distribuído e captura de instantâneos de erros","Necessita integração com modelos de aprendizado de máquina para classificação de falhas inteligentes","Depende da captura abrangente de artefatos para monitoramento de saúde eficaz"],"ru":["Требует реализации распределенного трассирования и захвата снимков ошибок","Требует интеграции с моделями машинного обучения для интеллектуальной классификации сбоев","Зависит от комплексного сбора артефактов для эффективного мониторинга состояния"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ تتبع موزع وقبض صورة للخطأ","يحتاج إلى دمج مع نماذج التعلم الآلي للتصنيف الذكي للفشل","يعتمد على قبض شامل للنماذج لمراقبة صحية فعالة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/storage-zk', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'storage-zk', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z', '2026-02-18T12:12:40.197Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/storage-zk","name":"storage-zk","description":{"zh":"存储-ZK 协议是一种支持 RWA 资产、加密货币、股票和指数的合成永续期货协议，具有高达 1000 倍的杠杆","ja":"ストレージ-ZK プロトコルは、RWA 資産、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポートする合成永続期貨プロトコルであり、最大 1000 倍のレバレッジを提供する","ko":"저장소-ZK 프로토콜은 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식 및 지수를 지원하는 합성 영구 선물 프로토콜로, 최대 1000 배의 레버리지가 가능합니다","es":"Storage-zk es un protocolo de futuros sintéticos perpetuos que permite a los traders abrir posiciones apalancadas con hasta 1000x de apalancamiento.","fr":"Storage-zk est un protocole de futurs perpétuels synthétiques qui permet aux traders d''ouvrir des positions avec un effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x.","de":"Storage-zk ist ein synthetisches Perpetual-Futures-Protokoll, das es Tradern ermöglicht, mit bis zu 1000x Hebelwirkung zu handeln.","pt":"O Storage-ZK é um protocolo de futuros sintéticos perpétuos que suporta ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices, com posições longas e curtas alavancadas.","ru":"Storage-ZK - это синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов, поддерживающий активы RWA, криптовалюты, акции и индексы, с левериджными длинными и короткими позициями.","ar":"Storage-ZK هو بروتوكول المستقبل السنتيتيكي الدائم الذي يدعم الأصول RWA، العملات المشفرة، الأسهم والمؤشرات، مع مراكز مالية طويلة وقصيرة.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"存储-ZK 协议：合成永续期货和去中心化交易","ja":"ストレージ-ZK プロトコル：合成永続期貨と分散トレーディング","ko":"저장소-ZK 프로토콜: 합성 영구 선물 및 분산 거래","es":"Protocolo de Futuros Sintéticos Perpetuos - storage-zk","fr":"Protocole de Futurs Perpétuels Synthétiques - storage-zk","de":"Synthetisches Perpetual-Futures-Protokoll - storage-zk","pt":"Protocolo de Futuros Sintéticos Perpétuos - Storage-ZK","ru":"Синтетический Протокол Вечных Фьючерсов - Storage-ZK","ar":"بروتوكول المستقبل السنتيتيكي الدائم - Storage-ZK","en":"storage-zk"},"description":{"zh":"存储-ZK 协议是一种支持 RWA 资产、加密货币、股票和指数的合成永续期货协议，具有高达 1000 倍的杠杆","ja":"ストレージ-ZK プロトコルは、RWA 資産、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポートする合成永続期貨プロトコルであり、最大 1000 倍のレバレッジを提供する","ko":"저장소-ZK 프로토콜은 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식 및 지수를 지원하는 합성 영구 선물 프로토콜로, 최대 1000 배의 레버리지가 가능합니다","es":"Storage-zk es un protocolo de futuros sintéticos perpetuos que permite a los traders abrir posiciones apalancadas con hasta 1000x de apalancamiento.","fr":"Storage-zk est un protocole de futurs perpétuels synthétiques qui permet aux traders d''ouvrir des positions avec un effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x.","de":"Storage-zk ist ein synthetisches Perpetual-Futures-Protokoll, das es Tradern ermöglicht, mit bis zu 1000x Hebelwirkung zu handeln.","pt":"O Storage-ZK é um protocolo de futuros sintéticos perpétuos que suporta ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices, com posições longas e curtas alavancadas.","ru":"Storage-ZK - это синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов, поддерживающий активы RWA, криптовалюты, акции и индексы, с левериджными длинными и короткими позиц...","ar":"Storage-ZK هو بروتوكول المستقبل السنتيتيكي الدائم الذي يدعم الأصول RWA، العملات المشفرة، الأسهم والمؤشرات، مع مراكز مالية طويلة وقصيرة.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["支持 RWA 资产、加密货币、股票和指数","高达 1000 倍的杠杆","去中心化交易","自定义 Oracle 和 Virtual AMM","TWAP 平滑价格"],"ja":["RWA 資産、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポート","最大 1000 倍のレバレッジ","分散トレーディング","カスタム Oracle と Virtual AMM","TWAP スムージング価格"],"ko":["RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식 및 지수를 지원","최대 1000 배의 레버리지","분산 거래","사용자 정의 오라클 및 가상 AMM","TWAP 스무딩 가격"],"es":["Soporte para activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices","Apalancamiento de hasta 1000x","Bóveda de liquidez centralizada","Oracle personalizado y AMM virtual","Suavizamiento TWAP"],"fr":["Prise en charge des actifs RWA, des cryptomonnaies, des actions et des indices","Effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x","Coffre de liquidité centralisé","Oracle personnalisé et AMM virtuel","Lissage TWAP"],"de":["Unterstützung für RWA-Assets, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes","Hebelwirkung von bis zu 1000x","Zentralisierte Liquiditätsbörse","Benutzerdefinierter Oracle und virtuelles AMM","TWAP-Glätting"],"pt":["Suporte a ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices","Posições longas e curtas alavancadas de até 1000x","Cofre de liquidez central como contraparte para todas as negociações","Preços combinados com oráculo personalizado, Virtual AMM e suavização TWAP"],"ru":["Поддержка активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов","Левериджные длинные и короткие позиции до 1000x","Центральный кофр ликвидности как контрагент для всех торгов","Цены, объединенные с пользовательским оракулом, Virtual AMM и сглаживанием TWAP"],"ar":["دعم الأصول RWA، العملات المشفرة، الأسهم والمؤشرات","مراكز مالية طويلة وقصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000x","خزانة سيولة مركزية كطرف مقابل لجميع الصفقات","أسعار مجتمعة مع بريدج مخصص، Virtual AMM وتنعيم TWAP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["存储-ZK 协议","合成永续期货","去中心化交易","RWA 资产","加密货币","股票","指数","杠杆","自定义 Oracle","Virtual AMM"],"ja":["ストレージ-ZK プロトコル","合成永続期貨","分散トレーディング","RWA 資産","暗号資産","株式","指数","レバレッジ","カスタム Oracle","Virtual AMM"],"ko":["저장소-ZK 프로토콜","합성 영구 선물","분산 거래","RWA 자산","암호화폐","주식","지수","레버리지","사용자 정의 오라클","가상 AMM"],"es":["futuros sintéticos perpetuos","protocolo de futuros","apalancamiento","criptomonedas","activos RWA","acciones","índices","oracle personalizado","AMM virtual","suavizamiento TWAP"],"fr":["futurs perpétuels synthétiques","protocole de futurs","effet de levier","cryptomonnaies","actifs RWA","actions","indices","oracle personnalisé","AMM virtuel","lissage TWAP"],"de":["synthetische Perpetual-Futures","Futures-Protokoll","Hebelwirkung","Kryptowährungen","RWA-Assets","Aktien","Indizes","benutzerdefinierter Oracle","virtuelles AMM","TWAP-Glätting"],"pt":["futuros sintéticos perpétuos","ativos RWA","criptomoedas","ações","índices","posições longas e curtas","alavancagem","cofre de liquidez central"],"ru":["синтетические вечные фьючерсы","активы RWA","криптовалюты","акции","индексы","длинные и короткие позиции","леверидж","центральный кофр ликвидности"],"ar":["المستقبل السنتيتيكي الدائم","الأصول RWA","العملات المشفرة","الأسهم","المؤشرات","مراكز مالية طويلة وقصيرة","الرافعة المالية","خزانة سيولة مركزية"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"storage-zk","description":"Use when creating, linking, searching, or updating notes with the `wiki` CLI.","bodyPreview":"# Personal Wiki: Using the `wiki` CLI\n## Quick Start: `wiki` CLI\nThe `wiki` CLI intelligently discovers your notebook patih.\n```bash\nwiki new --title \"My Note\"\nwiki list --match=\"pattern\"\nwiki list --format=json | jq .\n```\n# Use discovered notebook (auto-discovers path internally)\n## Common Workflows with `wiki` CLI\n### Single Note: Create → Link → Search → Export\n```bash\n# 1. Create new note (auto-discovers notebook)\nNOTE_PATH=$(wiki new --title \"Research Topic\" --print-path)\n# 2. Edit file and","body":"# Personal Wiki: Using the `wiki` CLI\n## Quick Start: `wiki` CLI\nThe `wiki` CLI intelligently discovers your notebook patih.\n```bash\nwiki new --title \"My Note\"\nwiki list --match=\"pattern\"\nwiki list --format=json | jq .\n```\n# Use discovered notebook (auto-discovers path internally)\n## Common Workflows with `wiki` CLI\n### Single Note: Create → Link → Search → Export\n```bash\n# 1. Create new note (auto-discovers notebook)\nNOTE_PATH=$(wiki new --title \"Research Topic\" --print-path)\n# 2. Edit file and add links (manual)\necho -e \"\\n\\nRelated: [existing-note-id](Existing Note Title)\" >> \"$NOTE_PATH\"\n# 3. Search for related notes\nwiki list --match=\"Research\" --format=long\n# 4. Export results\nwiki list --match=\"Research\" --format=json | jq .\n```\n### Register Project with Notebook\n```bash\n# Register current project with notebook (for context matching)\nwiki project add\n```\n### Export All Notes from Project\n```bash\n# Get notebook, then export\nNOTEBOOK=$(wiki project discover)\nwiki list --format=json > all-notes.json\n# Validate export\njq . < all-notes.json > /dev/null && echo \"Valid JSON\"\n```\n## When to Use\n**Symptoms:**\n- Need to export notes in various formats\n- Want automatic project-to-notebook mapping\n- Working with multiple projects and notebooks\n**When NOT to use:**\n- Editing notebook configuration (see zk documentation for `config.toml`)\n- Advanced templating (templates are Handlebars, see zk docs)\n- LSP setup (language server integration, separate config)\n## `wiki` vs. Direct `zk` Commands\n| Scenario | Use | Example |\n|----------|-----|---------|\n| **Notebook auto-discovery** | `wiki` CLI | `wiki new --title \"Note\"` (auto-discovers) |\n| **Explicit notebook control** | Direct `zk` | `zk list -W /path --match=\"x\"` (explicit control) |\n| **Register project context** | `wiki project add` | Helps future discovery for this project |\n## Quick Reference: `wiki` CLI Commands\n| Task | Command | Notes |\n|------|---------|-------|\n| Create note | `wiki new --title \"Title\" --print-path` | Auto-discovers notebook; returns path |\n| List all notes | `wiki list` | Defaults to table format |\n| Search pattern | `wiki list --match=\"pattern\"` | Regex or plain text |\n| Export JSON | `wiki list --format=json > file.json` | Use redirection for output |\n| Export CSV | `wiki list --format=csv > file.csv` | RFC 4180 compliant; use CSV parser |\n| Export oneline | `wiki list --format=oneline > file.txt` | Minimal format, easy to parse |\n| Find backlinks | `wiki list --linked-by=<note-id>` | Shows notes linking to target |\n| Show note details | `wiki list --match=<note-id> --format=long` | Includes metadata and preview |\n## Quick Reference: Direct `zk` Commands (When You Need Explicit Control)\n| Task | Command | Notes |\n|------|---------|-------|\n| Create note | `zk new -W <dir> --title \"Title\" --print-path` | Explicit notebook path required |\n| List all notes | `zk list -W <dir>` | Always include `-W` flag |\n| Search pattern | `zk list -W <dir> --match=\"pattern\"` | Regex or plain text |\n| Export JSON | `zk list -W <dir> --format=json > file.json` | Use redirection for output |\n| Export CSV | `zk list -W <dir> --format=csv > file.csv` | RFC 4180 compliant; use CSV parser |\n| Find backlinks | `zk list -W <dir> --linked-by=<note-id>` | Shows notes linking to target |\n## Filtering Options\n| Filter | Syntax | Example | Note |\n|--------|--------|---------|------|\n| Title/body | `--match=\"pattern\"` | `zk list -W /nb --match=\"daily\"` | Regex or plain text search |\n| Linked-by | `--linked-by=<id>` | `zk list -W /nb --linked-by=abc123` | Show notes linking to abc123 |\n| Other filters | Check `zk list --help` | `zk list --help \\| grep -i filter` | ZK may have additional filters not listed |\n**Important:** For any filtering not shown here, always verify with `zk list --help` before assuming syntax. ZK may add new filters in newer versions.\n## Understanding Notebook Discovery\nThe `wiki` CLI **automatically handles notebook discovery** using a smart search algorithm. No need to manually specify `-W` flags.\n### How `wiki` Discovers Your Notebook\nWhen you run any `wiki` command, it searches in this order:\n1. **Environment variable** `NOTEBOOK_PATH` (if explicitly set)\n2. **Ancestor directories** for `.zk/config.toml` (finds project-local notebooks)\n3. **Context registry** in `~/Notes/` (matches your project path to a registered notebook)\n4. **Global fallback** `~/.config/zk/config.toml` (if it defines a `notebook.dir`)\n**Advantage:** You don''t need to worry about getting the path wrong. Just run `wiki` commands.\n### Direct `zk` Commands: Explicit `-W` Flag Required\nIf you bypass `wiki` and use `zk` directly, you **must** always include `-W`:\n```bash\n# ❌ DON''T - unsafe, ambiguous which notebook is used\nzk list --match=\"search\"\n# ✅ DO - explicit notebook path\nzk list -W /path/to/notebook --match=\"search\"\n```\nIf you''re in `~/projects/project-a/notes/` and run `zk list` without `-W`, it might find `~/projects/.zk` instead.\n### Troubleshooting: Verify Which Notebook Is Active\n```bash\n# Using wiki (recommended)\nwiki project discover\n# Returns: /path/to/notebook\n# Using direct zk with explicit path\nzk info -W /path/to/notebook\n# Shows: notebook path, config, note count\n```\n## Link Creation Patterns\nZK does **not** have a `zk link` command. Links are created by editing markdown files directly:\n### Wiki-style Links (Most Common)\n```markdown\nThis note connects to [[other-note-id]] and [[another-one]].\n```\nZK automatically resolves these to matching note IDs. The ID can be filename without extension or explicit ID field in note frontmatter.\n### Markdown Links (Also Valid)\n```markdown\nSee [related note](/path/to/note.md) for details.\n```\nZK understands both formats. Wiki-style `[[]]` is preferred for cross-referencing.\n### Backlink Discovery\nFind all notes linking to a specific note:\n```bash\nzk list -W /notebook --linked-by=target-note-id\n```\n## Export Workflows\n**Pattern:** Use `zk list` with `--format` flag + output redirection\n### Before Any Bulk Export: Safety Checklist\nBulk exports (100+ notes) can be dangerous if not validated:\n- [ ] Do you have a backup of the notebook? (`cp -r /notebook /notebook.backup`)\n- [ ] Are you exporting to test data first? (Start with `--match=\"test\"` to validate format)\n- [ ] Do you understand what you''re exporting? (Links as refs? Full body? Metadata?)\n- [ ] Is the output format valid? (Test with `head -5 export.json | jq .`)\n**Example: Safe bulk export**\n```bash\n# 1. Validate on one note\nzk list -W /notebook --match=\"note-id\" --format=json | jq .\n# 2. Check structure is what you expect\n# (inspect the JSON output)\n# 3. Export to temp file first\nzk list -W /notebook --format=json > /tmp/export.json\n# 4. Validate output is valid JSON\njq . < /tmp/export.json > /dev/null && echo \"Valid JSON\"\n# 5. Move to final location\nmv /tmp/export.json ~/exports/notes.json\n```\n### JSON Export (Programmatic)\n```bash\nzk list -W /notebook --match=\"tag:project\" --format=json > export.json\n```\nOutput includes: id, title, path, body, tags, relationships\n### CSV Export (Spreadsheet Import)\n```bash\nzk list -W /notebook --format=csv > notes.csv\n```\nOutput columns: title, path, modified date. Parse with CSV reader, not `awk`.\n### Oneline Export (Grep-able)\n```bash\nzk list -W /notebook --format=oneline > index.txt\n```\nOutput: `id - title - path` on single line per note\n## Common Mistakes\n| Mistake | Problem | Fix |\n|---------|---------|-----|\n| Using `zk` without `-W` flag | Ambiguous which notebook is used | Use `wiki` CLI (auto-discovers) or explicit `-W /path` |\n| `zk export` | No export command exists | Use `wiki list --format=X > file` (or `zk list -W <dir>...`) |\n| `zk link note1 note2` | No link command | Edit markdown files, add `[[note-id]]` manually |\n| `wiki list --match=\"x\"` fails | Notebook not discovered | Run `wiki project discover` to verify path |\n| `--format json` (no redirection) | Output prints to stdout, not file | Use `> file.json` to capture output |\n| `[[filepath]]` instead of `[[id]]` | Wiki-links use ID, not path | Use note ID or filename without extension |\n| Assuming links created CLI-side | Links are manually edited | Always add links by editing note files directly |\n| Hardcoding notebook paths in scripts | Breaks when project moves | Use `wiki` CLI or `wiki project discover` instead |\n## Reference: Output Formats\n### Table (Default)\n```\nid | title | path\n```\n### Long (Includes Metadata)\n```\nid: xxx\ntitle: My Note\npath: /notebook/notes/xxx.md\nlinks: [[id1]], [[id2]]\n```\n### JSON (Programmatic Parsing)\n```json\n[{\"id\":\"xxx\",\"title\":\"My Note\",\"tags\":[\"tag1\"],\"path\":\"/notebook/notes/xxx.md\"}]\n```\n### CSV (Spreadsheet Import) — RFC 4180 Compliant\n**Format:** Quoted fields, comma-separated, includes header row\n```csv\ntitle,path,modified\n\"My Note\",/notebook/notes/xxx.md,2025-01-15\n\"Note with, comma\",/notebook/notes/yyy.md,2025-01-14\n```\n**Important:** Parse CSV with a proper CSV parser, not `awk -F'',''`, because titles can contain commas. Example with Python:\n```python\nimport csv\nwith open(''notes.csv'') as f:\n    for row in csv.DictReader(f):\n        print(row[''title''], row[''path''])\n```\n### Oneline (Grep-able)\n```\nxxx - My Note - /notebook/notes/xxx.md\n```\n## Workflow Examples\n### Single Note: Create → Link → Search → Export (Using `wiki` CLI)\n```bash\n# 1. Create new note (notebook auto-discovered)\nNOTE_PATH=$(wiki new --title \"Research Topic\" --print-path)\n# 2. Edit file and add links (manual)\necho -e \"\\n\\nRelated: [[existing-note-id]]\" >> \"$NOTE_PATH\"\n# 3. Search for related notes\nwiki list --match=\"Research\" --format=long\n# 4. Export results\nwiki list --match=\"Research\" --linked-by=\"research-topic-id\" --format=json > related-notes.json\n```\n**Advantage:** No need to discover notebook path manually. `wiki` handles it.\n### Single Note: Using Direct `zk` (When You Need Explicit Control)\n```bash\n# 1. Create new note with explicit notebook path\nNOTEBOOK=\"/path/to/notebook\"\nNOTE_PATH=$(zk new -W \"$NOTEBOOK\" --title \"Research Topic\" --print-path)\n# 2. Edit file and add links (manual)\necho -e \"\\n\\nRelated: [[existing-note-id]]\" >> \"$NOTE_PATH\"\n# 3. Search for related notes\nzk list -W \"$NOTEBOOK\" --match=\"Research\" --format=long\n# 4. Export results\nzk list -W \"$NOTEBOOK\" --match=\"Research\" --linked-by=\"research-topic-id\" --format=json > related-notes.json\n```\n**Note:** Step 2 requires manual file editing. No CLI command creates links; you add them to markdown content.\n### Bulk: Create Multiple Notes & Link to Master (Using `wiki`)\nFor creating 10+ notes that all link to a master note:\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nMASTER_ID=\"master-index\"\n# Create notes in a loop (notebook auto-discovered)\nfor i in {1..10}; do\n  NOTE_PATH=$(wiki new \\\n    --title \"Topic $i\" \\\n    --print-path)\n  \n  # Add link to master note\n  echo \"\" >> \"$NOTE_PATH\"\n  echo \"See master: [[${MASTER_ID}]]\" >> \"$NOTE_PATH\"\ndone\n# Verify all notes link to master\nwiki list --linked-by=\"$MASTER_ID\" --format=long\n```\n**Advantage:** No need to discover or pass notebook path. `wiki` handles it automatically.\n### Bulk: Using Direct `zk` (Explicit Notebook Path)\nFor explicit control over notebook:\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nNOTEBOOK=\"/path/to/notebook\"\nMASTER_ID=\"master-index\"\n# Create notes in a loop\nfor i in {1..10}; do\n  NOTE_PATH=$(zk new -W \"$NOTEBOOK\" \\\n    --title \"Topic $i\" \\\n    --print-path)\n  \n  # Add link to master note\n  echo \"\" >> \"$NOTE_PATH\"\n  echo \"See master: [[${MASTER_ID}]]\" >> \"$NOTE_PATH\"\ndone\n# Verify all notes link to master\nzk list -W \"$NOTEBOOK\" --linked-by=\"$MASTER_ID\" --format=long\n```\n**Constraint:** ZK doesn''t have a bulk-link command. Manual editing via script is the standard approach.\n### Export Large Notebook Safely (Using `wiki`)\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nEXPORT_DIR=\"$HOME/exports\"\nTIMESTAMP=$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)\n# Create export directory with timestamp\nmkdir -p \"$EXPORT_DIR\"\n# Test export format on small sample (notebook auto-discovered)\necho \"=== Testing format on 1 note ===\"\nwiki list -l 1 --format=json | jq . > /dev/null\nif [ $? -ne 0 ]; then\n  echo \"ERROR: JSON validation failed\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n# Full export\necho \"=== Exporting all notes ===\"\nwiki list --format=json > \"$EXPORT_DIR/export_${TIMESTAMP}.json\"\n# Validate output\njq . < \"$EXPORT_DIR/export_${TIMESTAMP}.json\" > /dev/null\nif [ $? -eq 0 ]; then\n  echo \"✓ Export successful: $EXPORT_DIR/export_${TIMESTAMP}.json\"\nelse\n  echo \"✗ Export failed: JSON is invalid\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n**Advantage:** No manual path discovery needed.\n### Export Large Notebook Safely (Direct `zk` with Explicit Path)\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nNOTEBOOK=\"/path/to/notebook\"\nEXPORT_DIR=\"$HOME/exports\"\nTIMESTAMP=$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)\n# Create export directory with timestamp\nmkdir -p \"$EXPORT_DIR\"\n# Test export format on small sample\necho \"=== Testing format on 1 note ===\"\nzk list -W \"$NOTEBOOK\" -l 1 --format=json | jq . > /dev/null\nif [ $? -ne 0 ]; then\n  echo \"ERROR: JSON validation failed\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n# Full export\necho \"=== Exporting all notes ===\"\nzk list -W \"$NOTEBOOK\" --format=json > \"$EXPORT_DIR/export_${TIMESTAMP}.json\"\n# Validate output\njq . < \"$EXPORT_DIR/export_${TIMESTAMP}.json\" > /dev/null\nif [ $? -eq 0 ]; then\n  echo \"✓ Export successful: $EXPORT_DIR/export_${TIMESTAMP}.json\"\nelse\n  echo \"✗ Export failed: JSON is invalid\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n## Real-World Impact\n**Without this skill:** Agents waste time guessing at nonexistent commands (`zk export`, `zk link`), get confused by `-W` flag, and struggle with format options.\n**With this skill:** Agents know exactly which commands exist, understand working directory behavior, master export patterns, and avoid wasted attempts at missing commands.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:12:40.197Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Decentralized Finance Agents requiring advanced perpetual futures trading capabilities with support for RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes.","zh":"适合于需要高级永续期货交易功能的去中心化金融代理，支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数。","ja":"高度な永続的な将来の取引機能を必要とする分散金融エージェントに適しています。RWAアセット、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポートします。","ko":"고급 永續期貨 거래 기능이 필요한 분산금융 에이전트에 적합합니다. RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de finanzas descentralizadas que requieren capacidades de trading de futuros perpetuos avanzados con soporte para activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de finance décentralisée nécessitant des capacités de trading de futures perpétuels avancées avec un support pour les actifs RWA, les crypto-monnaies, les actions et les indices.","de":"Ideal für dezentrale Finanzagenten, die erweiterte Perpetual-Futures-Handelsfunktionen mit Unterstützung für RWA-Vermögenswerte, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Finanças Descentralizadas que exigem capacidades avançadas de negociação de futuros perpétuos com suporte a ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices.","ru":"Идеально для децентрализованных финансовых агентов, требующих продвинутых возможностей торговли вечными фьючерсами с поддержкой активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الماليين اللامركزية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتداول العقود الآجلة الأبدية مع دعم الأصول RWA والعملات المشفرة والأوراق المالية والمؤشرات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage leveraged long/short positions with up to 1000x collateralization using stablecoins, interacting with a central liquidity vault as counterparty, and leveraging pricing mechanisms that combine custom algorithms.","zh":"赋予代理管理使用稳定币进行最高1000倍担保的杠杆多头/空头头寸的能力，并与中心流动性金库作为对手方进行交互，利用结合自定义算法的定价机制。","ja":"エージェントに、スタブルコインを使用して最大1000倍の担保によるレバレッジのロング/ショートポジションを管理する機能を提供します。中央の流動性金庫を対価として交互に作用し、カスタムアルゴリズムを組み合わせた価格決定メカニズムを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 스테이블 코인을 사용하여 최대 1000 배의 담보로 레버리지 롱/숏 포지션을 관리 할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 중앙 유동성 금고를 대응자로 하여 상호 작용하고, 사용자 정의 알고리즘을 결합한 가격 결정 메커니즘을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar posiciones largas/cortas apalancadas con hasta 1000x de colateralización utilizando establescoines, interactuando con un vault de liquidez central como contraparte, y aprovechando mecanismos de precios que combinan algoritmos personalizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des positions longues/courtes levées avec jusqu''à 1000x de collateralisation en utilisant des stablecoins, en interagissant avec un vault de liquidité central en tant que contrepartie, et en exploitant des mécanismes de prix qui combinent des algorithmes personnalisés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, lang/kurze Positionen mit bis zu 1000x Collateralisierung mithilfe von Stablecoins zu verwalten, indem sie mit einem zentralen Liquiditäts-Vault als Kontrahent interagieren und Preisbildungsmechanismen nutzen, die benutzerdefinierte Algorithmen kombinieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar posições compradas/curtas alavancadas com até 1000x de garantia usando stablecoins, interagindo com um cofre de liquidez central como contraparte e aproveitando mecanismos de precificação que combinam algoritmos personalizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять кредитными длинными/короткими позициями с использованием до 1000-кратной залога с помощью стейблкоинов, взаимодействуя с центральным хранилищем ликвидности в качестве контрагента и используя ценообразующие механизмы, которые объединяют настраиваемые алгоритмы.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة المراكز المشتقة الطويلة/القصيرة مع ضمان تصل إلى 1000 ضعف باستخدام العملات المستقرة، والتفاعل مع خزنة سيولة مركزية كطرف مضاد، وامتهان آليات التسعير التي تدمج الخوارزميات المخصصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating trading strategies with RWA assets and cryptocurrencies","Generating risk assessments for high-leverage trades with stablecoin collateralization","Optimizing portfolio performance by interacting with the central liquidity vault"],"zh":["使用RWA资产和加密货币自动化交易策略","使用稳定币担保生成高杠杆交易的风险评估","通过与中心流动性金库交互优化投资组合性能"],"ja":["RWAアセットおよび暗号資産を使用した取引戦略の自動化","スタブルコイン担保を使用した高レバレッジ取引のリスク評価の生成","中央流動性金庫とのやり取りによる投資ポートフォリオのパフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["RWA 자산 및 암호화폐를 사용하여 거래 전략 자동화","스테이블 코인 담보를 사용하여 고레버리지 거래의 위험 평가 생성","중앙 유동성 금고와의 상호 작용을 통해 포트폴리오 성능 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar estrategias de trading con activos RWA y criptomonedas","Generar evaluaciones de riesgo para operaciones de alto apalancamiento con colateralización de stablecoin","Optimizar el rendimiento de la cartera interactuando con el vault de liquidez central"],"fr":["Automatiser les stratégies de trading avec des actifs RWA et des crypto-monnaies","Générer des évaluations de risque pour des opérations à haut levier avec une collateralisation de stablecoin","Optimiser les performances du portefeuille en interagissant avec le vault de liquidité central"],"de":["Automatisierung von Trading-Strategien mit RWA-Vermögenswerten und Kryptowährungen","Erstellung von Risikobewertungen für hochgehebelte Trades mit Stablecoin-Besicherung","Optimierung der Portfolioperformance durch Interaktion mit dem zentralen Liquiditäts-Vault"],"pt":["Automatizar estratégias de negociação com ativos RWA e criptomoedas","Gerar avaliações de risco para negociações de alto alavancamento com garantia de stablecoin","Otimizar o desempenho da carteira interagindo com o cofre de liquidez central"],"ru":["Автоматизировать торговые стратегии с активами RWA и криптовалютами","Генерировать оценки риска для торговли с высоким кредитным плечом с залогом стейблкоина","Оптимизировать производительность портфеля, взаимодействуя с центральным хранилищем ликвидности"],"ar":["تأتميم استراتيجيات التداول مع الأصول RWA والعملات المشفرة","توليد تقييمات للمخاطر للتداول ذي الرافعة المالية العالية مع ضمان العملة المستقرة","تحسين أداء المحفظة بالتفاعل مع خزنة السيولة المركزية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires on-chain vaults for per-user collateral management","Dependent on stablecoin availability for collateralization","Limited to assets supported by the storage-zk protocol"],"zh":["需要链上金库进行每用户担保管理","依赖稳定币的可用性进行担保","仅限于存储-ZK协议支持的资产"],"ja":["各ユーザーの担保管理のためにオンチェーン金庫が必要","担保のためにスタブルコインの可用性に依存","ストレージ-ZKプロトコルによってサポートされるアセットのみに限定"],"ko":["사용자별 담보 관리를 위해 온체인 금고가 필요","담보를 위해 스테이블 코인의 가용성에 의존","저장-ZK 프로토콜에 의해 지원되는 자산のみ로 제한"],"es":["Requiere vaults en cadena para la gestión de colateral por usuario","Depende de la disponibilidad de stablecoins para la colateralización","Limitado a activos compatibles con el protocolo storage-zk"],"fr":["Nécessite des vaults en chaîne pour la gestion de la collateralisation par utilisateur","Dépend de la disponibilité des stablecoins pour la collateralisation","Limité aux actifs pris en charge par le protocole storage-zk"],"de":["Benötigt On-Chain-Vaults für die Verwaltung von Collateralisierung pro Benutzer","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit von Stablecoins für die Besicherung ab","Begrenzt auf Vermögenswerte, die vom storage-zk-Protokoll unterstützt werden"],"pt":["Exige cofres em cadeia para gestão de garantia por usuário","Depende da disponibilidade de stablecoin para garantia","Limitado aos ativos suportados pelo protocolo storage-zk"],"ru":["Требует наличия в цепи хранилищ для управления залогом на пользователя","Зависит от наличия стейблкоинов для залога","Ограничен активами, поддерживаемыми протоколом storage-zk"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود خزائن في السلسلة لإدارة الضمان للمستخدم","يعتمد على توافر العملات المستقرة للضمان","محدود بالأصول المدعومة من بروتوكول storage-zk"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/deep-researcher', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'deep-researcher', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z', '2026-02-18T12:12:14.107Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/deep-researcher","name":"deep-researcher","description":{"zh":"深度研究者是一种合成永续协议，支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数，提供高达1000倍的杠杆。该协议采用自定义oracle、虚拟AMM和TWAP平滑的价格机制","ja":"ディープリサーチャーは、RWA資産、暗号貨幣、株式、指数をサポートする合成永続プロトコルで、高いレバレッジを提供。価格メカニズムは、カスタムオラクル、仮想AMM、TWAPスムージングを使用","ko":"딥 리서처는 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식 및 지수를 지원하는 합성 영속 프로토콜로 높은 레버리지 제공한다. 가격 메커니즘은 사용자 지정 오라클, 가상 AMM 및 TWAP 스무딩을 사용","es":"Deep Researcher es un protocolo de futuros sintéticos que admite activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices con apalancamiento de hasta 1000x. Combina un oráculo personalizado, un AMM virtual y suavizado TWAP","fr":"Deep Researcher est un protocole de futures synthétiques qui prend en charge les actifs RWA, les crypto-monnaies, les actions et les indices avec un effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x. Il combine un oracle personnalisé, un AMM virtuel et un lissage TWAP","de":"Deep Researcher ist ein synthetisches Futures-Protokoll, das RWA-Assets, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes mit bis zu 1000x Hebelwirkung unterstützt. Es kombiniert einen benutzerdefinierten Oracle, ein virtuelles AMM und TWAP-Glättung","pt":"O Deep Researcher é um protocolo de futuros perpétuos sintéticos que combina uma oracle personalizada, um AMM virtual e suavização TWAP.","ru":"Deep Researcher - это синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов, который комбинирует индивидуальную оракул, виртуальный AMM и сглаживание TWAP.","ar":"مُحقق متعمق هو بروتوكول مستقبلات متواصلة اصطناعي ي結ب أوراكل مخصصة و AMM افتراضي وتحسين TWAP.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"深度研究者：支持RWA资产和加密货币的合成永续协议","ja":"ディープリサーチャー：RWA資産と暗号貨幣をサポートする合成永続プロトコル","ko":"딥 리서처: RWA 자산 및 암호화폐를 지원하는 합성 영속 프로토콜","es":"Deep Researcher: Protocolo de futuros sintéticos","fr":"Deep Researcher: Protocole de futures synthétiques","de":"Deep Researcher: Synthetisches Futures-Protokoll","pt":"Deep Researcher: Protocolo de Futuros Perpétuos Sintéticos","ru":"Deep Researcher: Синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов","ar":"مُحقق متعمق: بروتوكول مستقبلات متواصلة اصطناعية","en":"deep-researcher"},"description":{"zh":"深度研究者是一种合成永续协议，支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数，提供高达1000倍的杠杆。该协议采用自定义oracle、虚拟AMM和TWAP平滑的价格机制","ja":"ディープリサーチャーは、RWA資産、暗号貨幣、株式、指数をサポートする合成永続プロトコルで、高いレバレッジを提供。価格メカニズムは、カスタムオラクル、仮想AMM、TWAPスムージングを使用","ko":"딥 리서처는 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식 및 지수를 지원하는 합성 영속 프로토콜로 높은 레버리지 제공한다. 가격 메커니즘은 사용자 지정 오라클, 가상 AMM 및 TWAP 스무딩을 사용","es":"Deep Researcher es un protocolo de futuros sintéticos que admite activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices con apalancamiento de hasta 1000x. Combina un...","fr":"Deep Researcher est un protocole de futures synthétiques qui prend en charge les actifs RWA, les crypto-monnaies, les actions et les indices avec un effet de...","de":"Deep Researcher ist ein synthetisches Futures-Protokoll, das RWA-Assets, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes mit bis zu 1000x Hebelwirkung unterstützt. Es ko...","pt":"O Deep Researcher é um protocolo de futuros perpétuos sintéticos que combina uma oracle personalizada, um AMM virtual e suavização TWAP.","ru":"Deep Researcher - это синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов, который комбинирует индивидуальную оракул, виртуальный AMM и сглаживание TWAP.","ar":"مُحقق متعمق هو بروتوكول مستقبلات متواصلة اصطناعي ي結ب أوراكل مخصصة و AMM افتراضي وتحسين TWAP.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数","高达1000倍的杠杆","自定义oracle价格机制","虚拟AMM和TWAP平滑","每用户的链上保险库"],"ja":["RWA資産、暗号貨幣、株式、指数をサポート","最大1000倍のレバレッジ","カスタムオラクル価格メカニズム","仮想AMMとTWAPスムージング","ユーザーごとのオンチェーンバウルト"],"ko":["RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식 및 지수를 지원","최대 1000배의 레버리지","사용자 지정 오라클 가격 메커니즘","가상 AMM 및 TWAP 스무딩","사용자별 온체인 보관소"],"es":["Apoyo a activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices","Apalancamiento de hasta 1000x","Oráculo personalizado","AMM virtual","Suavizado TWAP"],"fr":["Prise en charge des actifs RWA, des crypto-monnaies, des actions et des indices","Effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x","Oracle personnalisé","AMM virtuel","Lissage TWAP"],"de":["Unterstützung von RWA-Assets, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes","Hebelwirkung von bis zu 1000x","Benutzerdefinierter Oracle","Virtuelles AMM","TWAP-Glättung"],"pt":["Suporte a ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices","Posições long/short com alavancagem de até 1000x","Caixa de liquidez centralizada como contraparte para todas as negociações","Preços combinados com oracle personalizada, AMM virtual e suavização TWAP","Vaults on-chain por usuário para armazenar stablecoins"],"ru":["Поддержка активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов","Долгие/короткие позиции с левериджем до 1000x","Центральная ликвидационная коробка в качестве контрагента для всех торгов","Цены, объединенные с индивидуальной оракул, виртуальным AMM и сглаживанием TWAP","Хранилища on-chain для каждого пользователя для хранения стейблкоинов"],"ar":["دعم الأصول RWA والعملات المشفرة والأسهم والمؤشرات","مراكز طويلة/قصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000x","خزنة سيولة مركزية كطرف مقابل لجميع الصفقات","أسعار مجتمعة مع أوراكل مخصصة و AMM افتراضي وتحسين TWAP","مخازن على السلسلة لكل مستخدم لتخزين الاستقرار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["深度研究者","合成永续协议","RWA资产","加密货币","杠杆交易","自定义oracle","虚拟AMM","TWAP平滑"],"ja":["ディープリサーチャー","合成永続プロトコル","RWA資産","暗号貨幣","レバレッジトレード","カスタムオラクル","仮想AMM","TWAPスムージング"],"ko":["딥 리서처","합성 영속 프로토콜","RWA 자산","암호화폐","레버리지 거래","사용자 지정 오라클","가상 AMM","TWAP 스무딩"],"es":["futuros sintéticos","activos RWA","criptomonedas","acciones","índices","apalancamiento","oráculo personalizado","AMM virtual","suavizado TWAP"],"fr":["futures synthétiques","actifs RWA","crypto-monnaies","actions","indices","effet de levier","oracle personnalisé","AMM virtuel","lissage TWAP"],"de":["synthetische Futures","RWA-Assets","Kryptowährungen","Aktien","Indizes","Hebelwirkung","benutzerdefinierter Oracle","virtuelles AMM","TWAP-Glättung"],"pt":["Deep Researcher","Futuros perpétuos sintéticos","Ativos RWA","Criptomoedas","Ações","Índices","Leveragem","Stablecoins"],"ru":["Deep Researcher","Синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов","Активы RWA","Криптовалюты","Акции","Индексы","Леверидж","Стейблкоины"],"ar":["مُحقق متعمق","بروتوكول مستقبلات متواصلة اصطناعي","الأصول RWA","العملات المشفرة","الأسهم","المؤشرات","رافعة مالية","استقرار"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deep-researcher","description":"Use when delegating research tasks requiring verified information from multiple authoritative sources - crawls and fact-checks beyond surface-level findings, providing evidence of verification process with confidence levels for each claim","bodyPreview":"# Deep Researcher\n\n## Overview\n\n**Deep research IS systematic information verification with evidence trails.**\n\nThe deep-researcher superpower converts vague research requests into structured investigation with explicit confidence levels. Instead of \"I found X\", it''s \"X verified by 3 independent sources, accessed [dates], confidence level: high\".\n\nCore principle: Research without verification is just collection. Verification without evidence is faith.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse deep researcher when yo","body":"# Deep Researcher\n\n## Overview\n\n**Deep research IS systematic information verification with evidence trails.**\n\nThe deep-researcher superpower converts vague research requests into structured investigation with explicit confidence levels. Instead of \"I found X\", it''s \"X verified by 3 independent sources, accessed [dates], confidence level: high\".\n\nCore principle: Research without verification is just collection. Verification without evidence is faith.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse deep researcher when you need:\n\n- **Verified findings** - Claims backed by 3+ independent sources\n- **Evidence trails** - Exact URLs, access dates, source credibility assessment\n- **Confidence levels** - Know which findings are solid vs. speculative\n- **Multi-source synthesis** - Patterns across authorities, not single-source claims\n- **Technical research** - Architecture decisions, implementation patterns, best practices\n- **Fact-checking** - Contradicting sources identified and explained\n- **Future reference** - Structured output you can re-read and cite later\n\nDon''t use when:\n- You need real-time data (stock prices, current weather, today''s events)\n- Single authoritative source is sufficient (official docs, RFC specifications)\n- Request is vague without topic or storage destination\n- Research is project-specific (create CLAUDE.md instead)\n\n## Request Structure (REQUIRED)\n\nDeep researcher needs three things:\n\n1. **Topic** (required) - Clear research question\n   - \"Compare authentication strategies in modern web frameworks\"\n   - \"Investigate performance implications of different database indexing approaches\"\n   - \"Research current best practices for handling TypeScript error types\"\n\n2. **Storage Prefix** (required) - Where output files go\n   - `/research/auth-strategies`\n   - `./findings/database-performance`\n   - `~/projects/typescript-research`\n\n3. **Things to Avoid** (optional) - Topics or sources to exclude\n   - \"Avoid paywalled academic papers\"\n   - \"Skip marketing materials, focus on technical documentation\"\n   - \"Exclude blog posts older than 2 years\"\n\n**Rejection Protocol:** Missing topic or storage prefix? Researcher rejects request. **You must also reject vague requests.** If you can''t extract clear topic, storage prefix, and avoid list from a request, REFUSE TO DELEGATE. State back what you''d need to proceed. Vague input = vague output—rejecting protects both you and the researcher.\n\n**Under pressure to skip this?** Time pressure, authority pressure, urgency—none of these change this requirement. 10 minutes structuring saves 2+ hours of re-research.\n\n## Research Methodology\n\n### Phase 1: Topic Scoping & Planning\n\nBreak research question into specific sub-questions. Identify primary vs. secondary sources. Define verification strategy **before searching**.\n\n**Critical:** If request comes with implicit bias (e.g., \"prove this was right\"), reframe it objectively. Research meant to validate past decisions is corrupted at intake. Authority pressure doesn''t change this—reframe and present both versions to the requester.\n\n**Example:** \"Compare auth strategies\" becomes:\n- What strategies exist? (primary: official docs)\n- Pros/cons of each? (secondary: technical analysis)\n- Which scale best? (secondary: community discussion, benchmarks)\n- Current industry consensus? (secondary: recent articles, GitHub patterns)\n\n**When reframing:** Director says \"Prove our choice was right\" → You propose \"Compare our choice vs. alternatives objectively\" → Either validates the choice (stronger vindication) or reveals issues early (valuable).\n\n### Phase 2: Source Collection & Crawling\n\n- **Primary sources:** Official documentation, RFCs, original research, API references\n- **Secondary sources:** Technical analysis, blog posts, code examples, community discussion\n- **Target:** 3-5 independent authoritative sources per claim\n- **Document:** URLs, access dates, source type, author/publisher\n\n### Phase 3: Information Collation\n\nOrganize findings by theme. Note agreements and disagreements. Identify patterns, outliers, contradictions.\n\n### Phase 4: Verification & Fact-Checking\n\nFor each major claim:\n\n| Element | What |\n|---------|------|\n| **Source URL** | Exact location of information |\n| **Access Date** | When retrieved |\n| **Source Type** | Academic, official docs, news, community, blog |\n| **Author/Publisher** | Who created this |\n| **Confidence** | high (3+ independent agreement), medium (2 sources), low (single source) |\n| **Contradictions** | Any sources disagreeing |\n\n**Handling contradictions:** When sources disagree, investigate why. Allocate 1-2 hours to understand context-dependence. If 1-2 hours doesn''t resolve it, document the contradiction at medium/low confidence rather than picking one source arbitrarily. Contradictions are information—they tell you the topic is context-dependent.\n\n**Under exhaustion pressure?** The skill doesn''t make fatigue disappear. What it does is make lazy source-picking shameful. Document why you picked one over others, or spend the time understanding the disagreement. Don''t pretend \"they all have merits\" is research.\n\n### Phase 5: Structured Output\n\nResearch writes to provided directory:\n\n```\n<prefix>/\n├── <topic>-thinking.md       # Reasoning, methodology, decisions\n├── <topic>-research.md       # Raw findings organized by theme\n├── <topic>-verification.md   # Evidence of verification, source audit\n├── <topic>-insights.md       # Key insights, patterns, implications\n└── <topic>-summary.md        # Executive summary with conclusions\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n### thinking.md\nYour research process, decisions made, rabbit holes explored, assumptions, limitations.\n\n### research.md\nFindings organized by key themes or questions. Direct quotes with source attribution. Publication dates. Both supporting and contradicting evidence.\n\n### verification.md\nSource credibility matrix. Verification approach for each claim. Cross-reference patterns. Confidence levels. Gaps or unverifiable claims. URLs with access dates.\n\n### insights.md\nPatterns synthesized across sources. Emerging consensus vs. outlier views. Surprising findings. Areas needing further research.\n\n### summary.md\n1-2 paragraph executive summary. Key findings with confidence levels. Main limitations or caveats. Recommendations.\n\n## Core Standards\n\n**No speculation** - Flag anything not directly sourced\n\n**No synthesis without evidence** - Don''t combine sources into novel claims\n\n**No appeals to authority** - Verify claims, not just who said them. When authority pressure conflicts with methodology, reframe the request and present both versions to the requester.\n\n**Transparency** - Show your work, readers see your reasoning\n\n**Humility** - Clearly state limitations and uncertainty areas\n\n**Recency** - Always note if information is outdated or superseded\n\n## Red Flags - STOP If You Feel These Pressures\n\n- \"Time pressure means skip structuring\"\n- \"Authority wants validation, not investigation\"\n- \"I''m exhausted, good enough is enough\"\n- \"This process is too rigid\"\n- \"Just start, I''ll structure later\"\n\n**All of these mean: Stop. You''re about to corrupt the research. Structure first. Then research. The framework protects research quality, not impedes it.**\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**❌ Single-source claims**\n\"React Server Components are better\" (from one blog post)\n✅ Fix: \"React Server Components have advantages for X (React docs, Vercel article, community discussion agree on this aspect)\"\n\n**❌ Missing confidence levels**\nTreating all findings as equally solid\n✅ Fix: Mark what''s well-verified (high confidence) vs. emerging (medium/low)\n\n**❌ Skipping contradictions**\n\"Everyone agrees on X\"\n✅ Fix: Document where sources disagree and why\n\n**❌ Marketing-sourced findings**\nRelying on vendor materials as primary evidence\n✅ Fix: Verify claims in neutral sources (official docs, independent analysis)\n\n**❌ Outdated information**\n\"Best practice from 2020\" without noting if superseded\n✅ Fix: Check if newer sources contradict or update this\n\n## Verification Evidence Standards\n\nFor each major claim, ALWAYS provide:\n\n1. **Source URL** - exact location\n2. **Access Date** - when retrieved\n3. **Source Type** - academic, official, news, community, blog\n4. **Author/Publisher** - who produced it\n5. **Confidence Level** - based on independent agreement\n6. **Contradictions** - any disagreeing sources\n\n## When to Escalate\n\nEncounter highly specialized technical topics? Load relevant expert skills.\n\nConflicting information that can''t be resolved? Document the disagreement thoroughly—different sources may be correct for different contexts.\n\nNeed statistical analysis? Use bash tools appropriately.\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\nFrom RED-GREEN-REFACTOR testing (2025-12-13):\n- Structured requests are enforced: vague input rejected before research starts\n- Evidence trails documented: 42 KB research output per session with source credibility matrix\n- Confidence levels transparent: claims marked high/medium/low based on independent agreement\n- Authority pressure resisted: 60% of agents reframe validation requests to objective research\n- Time pressure managed: 10 min structuring saves 2+ hours of re-research\n- Exhaustion-proof methodology: contradictions investigated rather than arbitrarily chosen\n- Bulletproofing tested: skill maintains compliance under 3+ combined pressures\n\nReal impact: Saves 10-20 hours per research project vs. manual approach. Produces decision-quality documentation suitable for architecture reviews and team training.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:12:14.107Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research & Analysis Agents requiring systematic information verification with evidence trails.","zh":"非常适合需要系统信息验证和证据跟踪的研究与分析代理","ja":"体系的な情報の検証と証拠の追跡を必要とする研究分析エージェントに最適","ko":"체계적인 정보 검증 및 증거 추적이 필요한 연구 및 분석 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación y análisis que requieren una verificación sistemática de la información con rastros de evidencia.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche et d''analyse nécessitant une vérification systématique de l''information avec des traces de preuve.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungs- und Analyseagenten, die eine systematische Überprüfung von Informationen mit Beweisnachweisen erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa e Análise que exigem verificação sistemática de informações com rastros de evidências.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов исследований и анализа, требующих систематической проверки информации с помощью доказательств.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات البحث والتحليل التي تتطلب التحقق المنهجي للمعلومات مع مسارات الأدلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert vague research requests into structured investigations with explicit confidence levels, systematically verifying information through multiple independent sources and providing auditable evidence trails instead of unsubstantiated claims.","zh":"赋予代理能力，将模糊的研究请求转换为结构化的调查，具有明确的置信度水平，通过多个独立来源系统地验证信息，并提供可审计的证据跟踪，而不是不经证实的说法","ja":"エージェントに、漠然とした研究リクエストを明確な信頼度レベルを持つ構造化された調査に変換する能力を付与し、複数の独立した情報源を通じて情報を体系的に検証し、裏付けのない主張ではなく、監査可能な証拠の追跡を提供する","ko":"에이전트에게 애매한 연구 요청을 명확한 신뢰도 수준을 갖춘 구조화된 조사로 변환하는 능력을 부여하며, 여러 독립적인 정보원을 통해 정보를 체계적으로 검증하고, 증거가 없는 주장 대신 감사 가능한 증거 추적을 제공","es":"Empodera a los agentes para convertir solicitudes de investigación vagas en investigaciones estructuradas con niveles de confianza explícitos, verificando sistemáticamente la información a través de múltiples fuentes independientes y proporcionando rastros de evidencia auditables en lugar de afirmaciones no sustentadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des demandes de recherche vagues en des enquêtes structurées avec des niveaux de confiance explicites, en vérifiant systématiquement l''information à travers de multiples sources indépendantes et en fournissant des traces de preuve auditable au lieu d''allégations non étayées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, vage Forschungsanfragen in strukturierte Untersuchungen mit expliziten Vertrauensniveaus umzuwandeln, indem sie Informationen systematisch durch multiple unabhängige Quellen überprüfen und auditable Beweisnachweise bereitstellen, anstatt unbegründete Behauptungen aufzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter pedidos de pesquisa vagos em investigações estruturadas com níveis de confiança explícitos, verificando sistematicamente as informações por meio de várias fontes independentes e fornecendo rastros de evidências auditáveis em vez de alegações não comprovadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать расплывчатые запросы исследований в структурированные расследования с явными уровнями достоверности, систематически проверяя информацию через несколько независимых источников и предоставляя аудиторные следы доказательств вместо необоснованных утверждений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل طلبات البحث الغامضة إلى تحقيقات منظمّة مع مستويات ثقة صريحة، والتحقق المنهجي للمعلومات من خلال عدة مصادر مستقلة وتقديم مسارات أدلة قابلة للتدقيق بدلاً من المطالبات غير المثبتة."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying financial data accuracy for RWA assets","Systematically cross-referencing crypto market intelligence","Generating evidence-backed research reports with confidence scoring"],"zh":["验证金融数据的准确性，用于RWA资产","系统地交叉引用加密市场情报","生成具有置信度评分的证据支持的研究报告"],"ja":["RWAアセットの金融データの正確性を検証する","暗号化市場インテリジェンスを体系的に相互参照する","信頼度スコアリングを備えた証拠によって裏付けられた研究レポートを生成する"],"ko":["RWA 자산을 위한 금융 데이터의 정확성을 검증","암호화 시장 정보를 체계적으로 상호 참조","신뢰도 점수를 가진 증거 지원 연구 보고서 생성"],"es":["Verificar la precisión de los datos financieros para los activos de RWA","Referenciar sistemáticamente la inteligencia del mercado de criptomonedas","Generar informes de investigación respaldados por evidencia con puntuación de confianza"],"fr":["Vérifier l''exactitude des données financières pour les actifs RWA","Référencer systématiquement l''intelligence du marché des crypto-monnaies","Générer des rapports de recherche étayés par des preuves avec une notation de confiance"],"de":["Überprüfen der Genauigkeit von Finanzdaten für RWA-Vermögenswerte","Systematische Kreuzreferenzierung von Kryptowährungsmarktinformationen","Erstellen von forschungsbasierten Berichten mit Beweisnachweisen und Vertrauensbewertung"],"pt":["Verificar a precisão dos dados financeiros para ativos RWA","Referenciar sistematicamente a inteligência de mercado de criptomoedas","Gerar relatórios de pesquisa comprovados com pontuação de confiança"],"ru":["Проверка точности финансовых данных для активов RWA","Систематический кросс-референсинг криптовалютной рыночной разведки","Генерация исследовательских отчетов, подтвержденных доказательствами, с оценкой достоверности"],"ar":["التحقق من دقة البيانات المالية لأصول RWA","المراجع المتعاقبة بشكل منهجي للاستخبارات السوقية لصناعة العملات المشفرة","توليد تقارير بحث مدعومة بالأدلة مع توجيه نقاط الثقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to multiple independent data sources","Dependent on source reliability and timeliness","Needs structured data inputs for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要访问多个独立的数据源","依赖于来源的可靠性和及时性","需要结构化的数据输入才能获得最佳性能"],"ja":["複数の独立したデータソースへのアクセスが必要","情報源の信頼性とタイムリー性に依存する","最適なパフォーマンスを得るには構造化されたデータ入力が必要"],"ko":["여러 개의 독립적인 데이터 소스에 대한 액세스가 필요","정보원 신뢰도 및 적시성에 의존","최적의 성능을 얻기 위해서는 구조화된 데이터 입력이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a múltiples fuentes de datos independientes","Depende de la fiabilidad y oportunidad de las fuentes","Necesita entradas de datos estructuradas para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à de multiples sources de données indépendantes","Dépend de la fiabilité et de la ponctualité des sources","Nécessite des entrées de données structurées pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf mehrere unabhängige Datenquellen","Hängt von der Zuverlässigkeit und Aktualität der Quellen ab","Benötigt strukturierte Dateneingaben für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Requer acesso a várias fontes de dados independentes","Dependente da confiabilidade e da oportunidade das fontes","Necessita de entradas de dados estruturadas para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к нескольким независимым источникам данных","Зависит от достоверности и оперативности источников","Требует структурированных входных данных для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى عدة مصادر بيانات مستقلة","يعتمد على موثوقية المصادر وتأخرها","يتطلب مدخلات بيانات منظمّة لأداء مثالي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
