,"reconocimiento de patrones","árbol de sintaxis abstracta","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","AST-Grep"],"fr":["analyse de code","reconnaissance de modèles","arbre de syntaxe abstrait","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","AST-Grep"],"de":["Code-Analyse","Mustererkennung","abstrakter Syntaxbaum","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","AST-Grep"],"pt":["análise de código","árvore de sintaxe abstrata","reconhecimento de padrões","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade do código","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","tecnologia de programação","desenvolvedores de software"],"ru":["анализ кода","абстрактное синтаксическое дерево","распознавание образов","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","инструменты разработки","технология программирования","разработчики программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تحليل رمز","شجرة الصياغة المجردة","التعرف على الأنماط","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الشفرة","أدوات التطوير","تكنولوجيا البرمجة","مطوّرو البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ast-grep-code-analysis","description":"Use when analyzing complex codebases for security vulnerabilities, performance issues, and structural patterns - provides systematic AST-based approach using ast-grep for comprehensive code understanding beyond manual inspection","bodyPreview":"# AST-Grep Code Analysis\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> This skill requires that `as-grep` is installed and configured in your development environment. If it''s not installed we can use `mise -g --pin ast-grep`\n\n## Overview\n\n**AST-Grep Code Analysis uses Abstract Syntax Tree pattern matching to systematically identify code issues, replacing manual line-by-line inspection with structural pattern recognition.**\n\nCore principle: Code structure reveals more than surface reading - AST patterns expose hidden relationshi","body":"# AST-Grep Code Analysis\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> This skill requires that `as-grep` is installed and configured in your development environment. If it''s not installed we can use `mise -g --pin ast-grep`\n\n## Overview\n\n**AST-Grep Code Analysis uses Abstract Syntax Tree pattern matching to systematically identify code issues, replacing manual line-by-line inspection with structural pattern recognition.**\n\nCore principle: Code structure reveals more than surface reading - AST patterns expose hidden relationships, security vulnerabilities, and architectural issues that manual inspection misses.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Need to analyze code?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Complex/nested structure?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Security review needed?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Performance analysis?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Use ast-grep patterns\" [shape=box];\n    \"Manual review sufficient\" [shape=box];\n\n    \"Need to analyze code?\" -> \"Complex/nested structure?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Complex/nested structure?\" -> \"Security review needed?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Security review needed?\" -> \"Performance analysis?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Performance analysis?\" -> \"Use ast-grep patterns\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Complex/nested structure?\" -> \"Manual review sufficient\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Security review needed?\" -> \"Manual review sufficient\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Performance analysis?\" -> \"Manual review sufficient\" [label=\"no\"];\n}\n```\n\n**Use when:**\n- Code has nested functions, complex control flow, or multiple abstraction layers\n- Security review required (authentication, authorization, data handling)\n- Performance analysis needed (React hooks, loops, async patterns)\n- Large codebase where manual inspection is impractical\n- Need to identify patterns across multiple files\n- Time pressure requires systematic approach over ad-hoc analysis\n\n**Do NOT use when:**\n- Simple, straightforward code (< 50 lines)\n- Single-file utilities with obvious structure\n- When quick glance is sufficient for the task\n\n## Core Pattern\n\n**Before (Manual Inspection):**\n```javascript\n// Agent manually reads line by line\nif (data[i].admin) {\n  userObj.token = generateToken(data[i].id); // \"This looks insecure\"\n}\n```\n\n**After (AST Pattern Matching):**\n```yaml\n# ast-grep rule: insecure-token-generation\nrule:\n  pattern: |\n    function $FUNC($ARGS) {\n      const secret = $SECRET;\n      return btoa(JSON.stringify($PAYLOAD) + ''.'' + $SECRET);\n    }\n  meta:\n    severity: ERROR\n    message: \"Hardcoded secret in token generation\"\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Analysis Type | AST Pattern Focus | Common Issues Found |\n|---------------|------------------|-------------------|\n| **Security** | String literals in crypto functions | Hardcoded secrets, weak encryption |\n| **Performance** | React hooks dependencies | Infinite re-renders, memory leaks |\n| **Structure** | Function nesting depth | Complex control flow, maintainability |\n| **Data Flow** | Variable assignments and usage | Unused variables, implicit dependencies |\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Installation and Setup\n\n```bash\n# Install ast-grep\nnpm install -g @ast-grep/cli\n\n# Initialize configuration\nast-grep init\n\n# Create rules directory\nmkdir -p sg-rules/security sg-rules/performance sg-rules/structure\n```\n\n### Essential Security Patterns\n\n**Hardcoded Secrets Detection:**\n```yaml\n# sg-rules/security/hardcoded-secrets.yml\nid: hardcoded-secrets\nlanguage: javascript\nrule:\n  pattern: |\n    const $VAR = ''$LITERAL'';\n    $FUNC($VAR, ...)\n  meta:\n    severity: ERROR\n    message: \"Potential hardcoded secret detected\"\n```\n\n**Insecure Token Generation:**\n```yaml\n# sg-rules/security/insecure-tokens.yml\nid: insecure-token-generation\nlanguage: javascript\nrule:\n  pattern: |\n    btoa(JSON.stringify($OBJ) + ''.'' + $SECRET)\n  meta:\n    severity: ERROR\n    message: \"Insecure token generation using base64\"\n```\n\n### Performance Pattern Detection\n\n**React Hook Dependencies:**\n```yaml\n# sg-rules/performance/react-hook-deps.yml\nid: react-hook-dependency-array\nlanguage: typescript\nrule:\n  pattern: |\n    useEffect(() => {\n      $BODY\n    }, [$FUNC])\n  meta:\n    severity: WARNING\n    message: \"Function dependency in useEffect may cause infinite re-renders\"\n```\n\n**Missing useCallback Optimization:**\n```yaml\n# sg-rules/performance/missing-use-callback.yml\nid: missing-use-callback\nlanguage: typescript\nrule:\n  pattern: |\n    const $FUNC = ($ARGS) => {\n      $BODY\n    };\n  inside:\n    kind: function_declaration\n    has:\n      kind: arrow_function\n  meta:\n    severity: INFO\n    message: \"Consider wrapping function in useCallback for optimization\"\n```\n\n### Structural Analysis Patterns\n\n**Deep Nesting Detection:**\n```yaml\n# sg-rules/structure/deep-nesting.yml\nid: deep-nesting\nlanguage: javascript\nrule:\n  any:\n    - pattern: |\n        if ($COND1) {\n          if ($COND2) {\n            if ($COND3) {\n              $BODY\n            }\n          }\n        }\n    - pattern: |\n        for ($INIT) {\n          for ($INIT2) {\n            for ($INIT3) {\n              $BODY\n            }\n          }\n        }\n  meta:\n    severity: WARNING\n    message: \"Deep nesting detected - consider refactoring\"\n```\n\n### Running Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Run all security rules\nast-grep run -r sg-rules/security/\n\n# Run performance analysis on React components\nast-grep run -r sg-rules/performance/ --include=\"*.tsx,*.jsx\"\n\n# Generate comprehensive report\nast-grep run -r sg-rules/ --format=json > analysis-report.json\n\n# Interactive analysis\nast-grep run -r sg-rules/ --interactive\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Why It Happens | Fix |\n|---------|----------------|-----|\n| **Too generic patterns** | Trying to catch everything | Focus on specific, high-impact patterns |\n| **Missing context** | Patterns don''t consider surrounding code | Use `inside` and `has` constraints |\n| **False positives** | Overly broad matching | Add negative constraints with `not` |\n| **Language-specific assumptions** | JavaScript patterns applied to TypeScript | Create separate rules per language |\n| **No severity prioritization** | All issues marked as error | Use appropriate severity levels |\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\n**Before AST Analysis:**\n- Manual code review: 2-3 hours for medium codebase\n- Missed security vulnerabilities: 40-60%\n- Inconsistent analysis between reviewers\n- No systematic approach to pattern detection\n\n**After AST Analysis:**\n- Automated pattern detection: 5-10 minutes\n- Security vulnerability detection: 90%+\n- Consistent, repeatable analysis\n- Comprehensive coverage of known anti-patterns\n\n**Example Results:**\n```bash\n$ ast-grep run -r sg-rules/\nsrc/components/UserProfile.jsx:15: ERROR [insecure-tokens] Insecure token generation\nsrc/hooks/useAuth.js:8: ERROR [hardcoded-secrets] Potential hardcoded secret\nsrc/components/UserProfile.jsx:23: WARNING [react-hook-deps] Function dependency may cause re-renders\nsrc/utils/processData.js:45: WARNING [deep-nesting] Deep nesting detected\n\nFound 4 issues (2 errors, 2 warnings)\n```\n\n## Integration Workflow\n\n1. **Setup**: Create rule sets for security, performance, structure\n2. **Baseline**: Run analysis on existing codebase to establish patterns\n3. **Iterate**: Refine rules based on false positives/negatives  \n4. **Automate**: Integrate into CI/CD pipeline for continuous analysis\n5. **Monitor**: Track issue reduction over time\n\n**Required Background**: Understanding of AST concepts, pattern matching, and code structure analysis. AST patterns reveal what manual inspection misses - systematic, comprehensive, and repeatable code analysis."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:12:42.855Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced Abstract Syntax Tree pattern matching capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级抽象语法树模式匹配功能的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が高度な抽象構文木パターンマッチング機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 추상 구문 트리 패턴 매칭 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades de coincidencia de patrones de Árbol de Sintaxis Abstracta avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des capacités de correspondance de modèles d''Arbre de Syntaxe Abstrait avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die erweiterte Möglichkeiten zur Mustererkennung im Abstract Syntax Tree benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de combinação de padrões de Árvore de Sintaxe Abstrata.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодового обзора, требующих продвинутых возможностей сопоставления с образцом Абстрактного Синтаксического Дерева.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكود التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة من مطابقة نمط شجرة البناء المجرد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically identify code issues using structural pattern recognition, replacing manual line-by-line inspection with AST-Grep''s advanced code analysis, leveraging Abstract Syntax Tree patterns and supporting libraries like `as-grep`.","zh":"赋予代理使用结构模式识别系统地识别代码问题的能力，使用AST-Grep的高级代码分析替换手动逐行检查，利用抽象语法树模式和支持库，如`as-grep`。","ja":"代理に構造パターン認識を使用してコードの問題を体系的に識別する能力を与え、手動の行ごとの検査をAST-Grepの高度なコード分析に置き換え、抽象構文木パターンと`as-grep`などのサポートライブラリを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 구조 패턴 인식을 사용하여 코드 문제를 체계적으로 식별할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 수동으로 줄 단위로 검사하는 것을 AST-Grep의 고급 코드 분석으로 대체하며, 추상 구문 트리 패턴 및 `as-grep`와 같은 지원 라이브러리를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar sistemáticamente problemas de código utilizando el reconocimiento de patrones estructurales, reemplazando la inspección manual línea por línea con el análisis de código avanzado de AST-Grep, aprovechando los patrones del Árbol de Sintaxis Abstracta y las bibliotecas de soporte como `as-grep`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier systématiquement les problèmes de code en utilisant la reconnaissance de modèles structurels, remplaçant l''inspection manuelle ligne par ligne par l''analyse de code avancée d''AST-Grep, en exploitant les modèles d''Arbre de Syntaxe Abstrait et les bibliothèques de support comme `as-grep`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Codeprobleme systematisch mithilfe der Erkennung struktureller Muster zu identifizieren, wobei die manuelle Zeile-für-Zeile-Inspektion durch die erweiterte Codeanalyse von AST-Grep ersetzt wird, die Muster des Abstract Syntax Tree und unterstützende Bibliotheken wie `as-grep` nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar sistematicamente problemas de código usando reconhecimento de padrão estrutural, substituindo a inspeção manual linha por linha pela análise de código avançada do AST-Grep, utilizando padrões de Árvore de Sintaxe Abstrata e bibliotecas de suporte como `as-grep`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически выявлять проблемы кода с помощью распознавания структурных образцов, заменяя ручную проверку построчно продвинутым анализом кода AST-Grep, используя образцы Абстрактного Синтаксического Дерева и поддерживающие библиотеки, такие как `as-grep`.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل الكود بطريقة منهجية باستخدام التعرف على النمط الهيكلي، واستبدال التفتيش اليدوي سطر بسطر بالتحليل المتقدم للكود من AST-Grep، باستخدام أنماط شجرة البناء المجرد والمكتبات الداعمة مثل `as-grep`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code inspections for security vulnerabilities","Debugging complex codebases using AST pattern matching","Identifying hidden code relationships with structural analysis"],"zh":["自动化代码安全漏洞检测","使用AST模式匹配调试复杂代码库","使用结构分析识别隐藏的代码关系"],"ja":["コードのセキュリティ脆弱性を自動的に検査する","ASTパターンマッチングを使用して複雑なコードベースをデバッグする","構造分析を使用して隠れたコード関係を識別する"],"ko":["코드 보안 취약점 자동화 검사","AST 패턴 매칭을 사용한 복잡한 코드베이스 디버깅","구조 분석을 사용한 숨겨진 코드 관계 식별"],"es":["Automatización de inspecciones de código para vulnerabilidades de seguridad","Depuración de bases de código complejas mediante coincidencia de patrones de AST","Identificación de relaciones de código ocultas con análisis estructural"],"fr":["Automatisation des inspections de code pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité","Débogage de bases de code complexes à l''aide de la correspondance de modèles d''AST","Identification de relations de code cachées avec l''analyse structurelle"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Inspektionen für Sicherheitslücken","Fehlersuche in komplexen Codebasen mithilfe der AST-Mustervergleichung","Identifizierung verborgener Code-Beziehungen durch strukturelle Analyse"],"pt":["Automatizar inspeções de código para vulnerabilidades de segurança","Depurar bases de código complexas usando combinação de padrão de AST","Identificar relacionamentos ocultos de código com análise estrutural"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверки кода на наличие уязвимостей безопасности","Отладка сложных кодовых баз с помощью сопоставления образцов AST","Определение скрытых связей кода с помощью структурного анализа"],"ar":["توفير عمليات تفتيش الكود للثغرات الأمنية","تصحيح أخطاء القواعد المركبة باستخدام مطابقة نمط شجرة البناء المجرد","تحديد العلاقات الخفية للكود بالتحليل الهيكلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `as-grep` installation and configuration","Dependent on specific development environment setup"],"zh":["需要安装和配置`as-grep`","依赖于特定的开发环境设置"],"ja":["`as-grep`のインストールと設定が必要","特定の開発環境設定に依存する"],"ko":["`as-grep` 설치 및 구성 필요","특정 개발 환경 설정에 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de `as-grep`","Dependiente de la configuración específica del entorno de desarrollo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de `as-grep`","Dépend de la configuration spécifique de l''environnement de développement"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von `as-grep`","Hängt von der spezifischen Entwicklungsumgebung-Konfiguration ab"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do `as-grep`","Depende de configuração específica do ambiente de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации `as-grep`","Зависит от конкретной настройки среды разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتهيئة `as-grep`","يعتمد على إعداد محدд لبيئة التطوير"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
