ign"},"description":{"zh":"该技能指导创建独特的生产级前端界面，实现真正的工作代码，并注重美学细节","ja":"このスキルは、独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェースを作成するためのガイドとなり、実際の動作コードを実装し、美学的な詳細に注目します","ko":"이 스킬은 독특한 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하는 방법을 안내하며 실제 작동하는 코드를 구현하고 미적 세부사항에 주목합니다","es":"Esta habilidad guía la creación de interfaces de frontend distintivas y de alta calidad, evitando estéticas genéricas","fr":"Cette compétence guide la création d''interfaces de frontend distinctives et de haute qualité, évitant les esthétiques génériques","de":"Diese Fähigkeit leitet die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten und hochwertigen Frontend-Schnittstellen, vermeidet generische Ästhetik","pt":"O skill de frontend-design permite criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e de alta qualidade, evitando estéticas genéricas.","ru":"Навык frontend-design позволяет создавать индивидуальные и высококачественные пользовательские интерфейсы, избегая общих эстетических решений.","ar":"تمكن مهارة تصميم الواجهة الأمامية من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة وعالية الجودة، وتجنب الأساليب الجمالية العامة.","en":"Native MCP gateway for AI-native developers. Manage tools across Cursor, Claude, VS Code & more from your system tray. Dynamic discovery, profile isolation, ..."},"definition":{"en":"Native MCP gateway for AI-native developers. Manage tools across Cursor, Claude, VS Code & more from your system tray. Dynamic discovery, profile isolation, zero Docker overhead."},"features":{"zh":["动态发现","个人资料隔离","零Docker开销","支持多种工具","美学细节关注","创意选择"],"ja":["動的検出","プロファイルの分離","ゼロDockerオーバーヘッド","複数ツールのサポート","美学的な詳細への注目","創造的な選択"],"ko":["동적 발견","개인 정보 분리","제로 도커 오버헤드","다중 도구 지원","미적 세부사항 주목","창의적인 선택"],"es":["Diseño de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Implementación de código de trabajo con atención al detalle","Creación de estéticas audaces y direcciones creativas","Integración con herramientas como Cursor, Claude y VS Code","Descubrimiento dinámico y aislamiento de perfiles","Sin sobrecarga de Docker"],"fr":["Conception d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Mise en œuvre de code de travail avec attention au détail","Création d''esthétiques audacieuses et de directions créatives","Intégration avec des outils tels que Cursor, Claude et VS Code","Découverte dynamique et isolation de profils","Sans surcharge de Docker"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen","Implementierung von Arbeitscode mit Aufmerksamkeit für Details","Erstellung von mutigen Ästhetiken und kreativen Richtungen","Integration mit Tools wie Cursor, Claude und VS Code","Dynamische Entdeckung und Profileinschließung","Ohne Docker-Overhead"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Evitação de estéticas genéricas","Implementação de soluções de design inovadoras","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Compatibilidade com ferramentas como Cursor, Claude e VS Code"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных пользовательских интерфейсов","Избежание общих эстетических решений","Реализация инновационных решений дизайна","Внимание к эстетическим деталям","Совместимость с инструментами như Cursor, Claude и VS Code"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تجنب الأساليب الجمالية العامة","تنفيذ حلول تصميم مبتكرة","الاهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية","التوافق مع أدوات مثل Cursor و Claude و VS Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级界面","AI风格","美学细节","创意选择","动态发现","个人资料隔离","零Docker开销"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクションレベルインターフェース","AIスタイル","美学的な詳細","創造的な選択","動的検出","プロファイルの分離","ゼロDockerオーバーヘッド"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 인터페이스","AI 스타일","미적 세부사항","창의적인 선택","동적 발견","개인 정보 분리","제로 도커 오버헤드"],"es":["diseño de frontend","desarrollo de frontend","interfaces de usuario","estéticas de frontend","herramientas de frontend","desarrollo de aplicaciones web","diseño de aplicaciones móviles","experiencia del usuario","UI/UX"],"fr":["conception de frontend","développement de frontend","interfaces utilisateur","esthétiques de frontend","outils de frontend","développement d''applications web","conception d''applications mobiles","expérience utilisateur","UI/UX"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Frontend-Entwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","Frontend-Ästhetik","Frontend-Tools","Webanwendungs-Entwicklung","Mobile-Anwendungs-Design","Benutzererfahrung","UI/UX"],"pt":["frontend-design","desenvolvimento de frontend","design de interface de usuário","interface de usuário personalizada","soluções de design inovadoras"],"ru":["frontend-design","разработка фронтенда","дизайн пользовательского интерфейса","индивидуальный пользовательский интерфейс","инновационные решения дизайна"],"ar":["تصميم الواجهة الأمامية","تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","تصميم واجهة المستخدم","واجهة مستخدم مخصصة","حلول تصميم مبتكرة"]}},"owner":"afaraha8403","repo":"MCP-Scooter","repoPath":"afaraha8403/MCP-Scooter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:13:15.614Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing custom, production-grade frontend interfaces with dynamic discovery and zero Docker overhead.","zh":"非常适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要自定义的、生产级的前端接口，具有动态发现和零Docker开销的特点。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeのようなAIエージェントに最適で、カスタムのプロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイスが必要で、動的検出とゼロDockerオーバーヘッドを備えています。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 커스텀한 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스와 동적 발견 및 제로 도커 오버헤드가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan interfaces frontend personalizadas y de grado de producción con descubrimiento dinámico y sin sobrecarga de Docker.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant des interfaces frontend personnalisées et de qualité production avec découverte dynamique et sans surcharge Docker.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die individuelle Frontend-Schnittstellen in Produktionsqualität mit dynamischer Erkennung und ohne Docker-Overhead benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de interfaces de frontend personalizadas, de produção e de grau de qualidade, com descoberta dinâmica e sem sobrecarga do Docker.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуются индивидуальные, промышленные интерфейсы frontend с динамическим обнаружением и без дополнительной нагрузки Docker.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء الذكية مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى واجهات أمامية مخصصة ومتقدمة وإنتاجية مع اكتشاف ديناميكي وبدون تحميل إضافي من Docker."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate distinctive, real-world frontend code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices, utilizing native MCP gateways and managing tools across multiple platforms, including VS Code, with profile isolation and dynamic system tray integration.","zh":"赋予代理生成具有独特的、现实世界的前端代码的能力，具有对美学细节的异常关注和创造性选择，利用本地MCP网关，并跨多个平台（包括VS Code）管理工具，具有配置文件隔离和动态系统托盘集成。","ja":"エージェントに独自のリアルワールドのフロントエンドコードを生成する能力を与え、美的細節と創造的な選択に例外的な注意を払い、ネイティブMCPゲートウェイを利用し、複数のプラットフォーム（VS Codeを含む）にわたってツールを管理し、プロファイルの分離と動的システムトレイ統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 독특한 실세계 프론트엔드 코드를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 미적 세부 사항과 창의적 선택에 예외적인 주의를 기울이며, 네이티브 MCP 게이트웨이를 활용하고, 여러 플랫폼(VS Code 포함)에서 도구를 관리하며, 프로파일 분리 및 동적 시스템 트레이 통합을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar código frontend distintivo y del mundo real con una atención excepcional a los detalles estéticos y las elecciones creativas, utilizando gateways MCP nativos y gestionando herramientas en múltiples plataformas, incluido VS Code, con aislamiento de perfiles e integración dinámica en la bandeja del sistema.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer un code frontend distinctif et réel avec une attention exceptionnelle aux détails esthétiques et aux choix créatifs, en utilisant des passerelles MCP natives et en gérant les outils sur plusieurs plateformes, y compris VS Code, avec isolement des profils et intégration dynamique dans la zone de notification.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten die Erstellung von einzigartigem, praxisnahem Frontend-Code mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details und kreative Entscheidungen, unter Verwendung nativer MCP-Gateways und Verwaltung von Tools über mehrere Plattformen hinweg, einschließlich VS Code, mit Profilisolierung und dynamischer Systemintegration.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar código de frontend distinto e do mundo real, com atenção excepcional aos detalhes estéticos e escolhas criativas, utilizando gateways MCP nativos e gerenciando ferramentas em várias plataformas, incluindo o VS Code, com isolamento de perfil e integração de bandeja de sistema dinâmica.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать отличительный, реальный код frontend с исключительным вниманием к эстетическим деталям и творческим решениям, используя родные шлюзы MCP и управляя инструментами на нескольких платформах, включая VS Code, с изоляцией профиля и динамической интеграцией системной панели.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد رمز واجهة أمامية متميزة وعالمية مع اهتمام استثنائي بال细يات الجمالية والخيارات الإبداعية، مستخدمًا بوابات MCP الأصلية والإدارة الأدوات عبر منصات متعددة، بما في ذلك VS Code، مع عزل الملف الشخصي وتكامل شريط النظام الديناميكي."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom frontend components with bold aesthetic directions","Building production-grade pages and applications with exceptional user experience","Designing interfaces that avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics for enhanced user engagement"],"zh":["创建具有大胆美学方向的自定义前端组件","构建具有异常用户体验的生产级页面和应用程序","设计避免通用''AI slop''美学以增强用户参与度的接口"],"ja":["大胆な美的方向を持つカスタムフロントエンドコンポーネントを作成する","例外的なユーザーエクスペリエンスを持つプロダクショングレードのページとアプリケーションを構築する","一般的な''AI slop''美的を避けてユーザー関与を高めるインターフェイスを設計する"],"ko":["대담한 미적 방향을 가진 커스텀 프론트엔드 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","예외적인 사용자 경험을 가진 프로덕션급 페이지 및 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","일반적인 ''AI slop'' 미학을 피하고 사용자 참여를 향상시키는 인터페이스를 설계하는 것"],"es":["Creación de componentes frontend personalizados con direcciones estéticas audaces","Construcción de páginas y aplicaciones de grado de producción con una experiencia de usuario excepcional","Diseño de interfaces que evitan la estética genérica de ''basura de IA'' para una mayor participación del usuario"],"fr":["Création de composants frontend personnalisés avec des directions esthétiques audacieuses","Construction de pages et d''applications de qualité production avec une expérience utilisateur exceptionnelle","Conception d''interfaces évitant l''esthétique générique du ''n''importe quoi IA'' pour une meilleure engagement utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung individueller Frontend-Komponenten mit mutigen ästhetischen Richtungen","Entwicklung von Seiten und Anwendungen in Produktionsqualität mit außergewöhnlicher Benutzererfahrung","Gestaltung von Schnittstellen, die generische ''KI-Schludrigkeit'' vermeiden, um die Nutzerbindung zu verbessern"],"pt":["Criar componentes de frontend personalizados com direções estéticas ousadas","Construir páginas e aplicações de produção de alto nível com experiência do usuário excepcional","Projetar interfaces que evitem a estética genérica ''slop de IA'' para engajamento do usuário aprimorado"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных компонентов frontend с смелыми эстетическими направлениями","Строительство промышленных страниц и приложений с исключительным пользовательским опытом","Проектирование интерфейсов, избегающих.generic ''сlop ИИ'' эстетики для улучшения пользовательского взаимодействия"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات واجهة أمامية مخصصة بإتجاهات جمالية جريئة","بناء صفحات وتطبيقات إنتاجية عالية الجودة مع تجربة مستخدم استثنائية","تصميم واجهات تتفادى الجماليات العامة ''سلوك الذكاء الاصطناعي'' لتعزيز المشاركة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires native MCP gateway compatibility","Dependent on system tray integration for dynamic tool management"],"zh":["需要本地MCP网关兼容性","依赖于系统托盘集成以实现动态工具管理"],"ja":["ネイティブMCPゲートウェイの互換性が必要","動的ツール管理のためにシステムトレイ統合に依存する"],"ko":["네이티브 MCP 게이트웨이 호환성이 필요합니다.","동적 도구 관리를 위해 시스템 트레이 통합에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con gateway MCP nativo","Depende de la integración con la bandeja del sistema para la gestión dinámica de herramientas"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec la passerelle MCP native","Dépend de l''intégration dans la zone de notification pour la gestion dynamique des outils"],"de":["Erfordert native MCP-Gateway-Kompatibilität","Abhängig von der Systemintegration für die dynamische Tool-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com gateway MCP nativo","Dependente da integração da bandeja de sistema para gerenciamento de ferramentas dinâmico"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с родным шлюзом MCP","Зависит от интеграции системной панели для динамического управления инструментами"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع بوابة MCP الأصلية","يعتمد على تكامل شريط النظام لإدارة الأدوات الديناميكي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
