gen und Mutationen mit Validierung","Aktionen und HTTP-Endpunkte","Fehlerbehandlung und Ausnahmen","Dokumentation und Ressourcen für Entwickler","Integration mit anderen Diensten und Tools","Sicherheit und Skalierbarkeit für Anwendungen"],"pt":["Consultas e mutações","Ações e endpoints HTTP","Validação e tratamento de erros","Considerações de tempo de execução","Implementação de funções convexas"],"ru":["Запросы и мутации","Действия и конечные точки HTTP","Проверка и обработка ошибок","Учет времени выполнения","Реализация выпуклых функций"],"ar":["الاستفسارات والتحويلات","الأفعال ونقاط النهاية HTTP","التحقق ومعالجة الأخطاء","الاعتبارات الزمنية","تنفيذ الدالات المحدبة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 函数","数据处理","查询函数","变异函数","操作","HTTP 端点","开发指南","Convex 开发","数据处理优化"],"ja":["Convex 関数","データ処理","クエリ関数","ミューテーション関数","操作","HTTP エンドポイント","開発ガイド","Convex 開発","データ処理最適化"],"ko":["Convex 함수","데이터 처리","쿼리 함수","뮤테이션 함수","액션","HTTP 엔드포인트","개발 튜토리얼","Convex 개발","데이터 처리 최적화"],"es":["funciones convexas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","consultas y mutaciones","acciones y puntos de conexión HTTP","validación y control de errores","escalabilidad y seguridad","documentación para desarrolladores","recursos para desarrolladores","integración con servicios y herramientas"],"fr":["fonctions convexes","développement d''applications","requêtes et mutations","actions et points de terminaison HTTP","validation et gestion des erreurs","évolutivité et sécurité","documentation pour les développeurs","ressources pour les développeurs","intégration avec des services et des outils"],"de":["konvexe Funktionen","Anwendungsentwicklung","Abfragen und Mutationen","Aktionen und HTTP-Endpunkte","Validierung und Fehlerbehandlung","Skalierbarkeit und Sicherheit","Dokumentation für Entwickler","Ressourcen für Entwickler","Integration mit Diensten und Tools"],"pt":["funções convexas","consultas","mutações","ações","endpoints HTTP","validação","tratamento de erros","otimização"],"ru":["выпуклые функции","запросы","мутации","действия","конечные точки HTTP","проверка","обработка ошибок","оптимизация"],"ar":["دالات محدبة","استفسارات","تحويلات","أفعال","نقاط النهاية HTTP","التحقق","معالجة الأخطاء","تحسين"]}},"owner":"charlietlamb","repo":"ferix","repoPath":"charlietlamb/ferix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex Functions","description":"Writing queries, mutations, actions, and HTTP actions with proper argument validation, error handling, internal functions, and runtime considerations","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","functions","queries","mutations","actions","http"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Functions\n\nMaster Convex functions including queries, mutations, actions, and HTTP endpoints with proper validation, error handling, and runtime considerations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/functions\n- Query Functions: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/query-functions\n- Mutation Functions: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/mutation-functions\n- Actions: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/","body":"# Convex Functions\n\nMaster Convex functions including queries, mutations, actions, and HTTP endpoints with proper validation, error handling, and runtime considerations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/functions\n- Query Functions: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/query-functions\n- Mutation Functions: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/mutation-functions\n- Actions: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/actions\n- HTTP Actions: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/http-actions\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Function Types Overview\n\n| Type | Database Access | External APIs | Caching | Use Case |\n|------|----------------|---------------|---------|----------|\n| Query | Read-only | No | Yes, reactive | Fetching data |\n| Mutation | Read/Write | No | No | Modifying data |\n| Action | Via runQuery/runMutation | Yes | No | External integrations |\n| HTTP Action | Via runQuery/runMutation | Yes | No | Webhooks, APIs |\n\n### Queries\n\nQueries are reactive, cached, and read-only:\n\n```typescript\nimport { query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const getUser = query({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.union(\n    v.object({\n      _id: v.id(\"users\"),\n      _creationTime: v.number(),\n      name: v.string(),\n      email: v.string(),\n    }),\n    v.null()\n  ),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.get(args.userId);\n  },\n});\n\n// Query with index\nexport const listUserTasks = query({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"tasks\"),\n    _creationTime: v.number(),\n    title: v.string(),\n    completed: v.boolean(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"tasks\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", args.userId))\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .collect();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Mutations\n\nMutations modify the database and are transactional:\n\n```typescript\nimport { mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const createTask = mutation({\n  args: {\n    title: v.string(),\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"tasks\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Validate user exists\n    const user = await ctx.db.get(args.userId);\n    if (!user) {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"User not found\");\n    }\n\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"tasks\", {\n      title: args.title,\n      userId: args.userId,\n      completed: false,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const deleteTask = mutation({\n  args: { taskId: v.id(\"tasks\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.taskId);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Actions\n\nActions can call external APIs but have no direct database access:\n\n```typescript\n\"use node\";\n\nimport { action } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { api, internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nexport const sendEmail = action({\n  args: {\n    to: v.string(),\n    subject: v.string(),\n    body: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ success: v.boolean() }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Call external API\n    const response = await fetch(\"https://api.email.com/send\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify(args),\n    });\n\n    return { success: response.ok };\n  },\n});\n\n// Action calling queries and mutations\nexport const processOrder = action({\n  args: { orderId: v.id(\"orders\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Read data via query\n    const order = await ctx.runQuery(api.orders.get, { orderId: args.orderId });\n    \n    if (!order) {\n      throw new Error(\"Order not found\");\n    }\n\n    // Call external payment API\n    const paymentResult = await processPayment(order);\n\n    // Update database via mutation\n    await ctx.runMutation(internal.orders.updateStatus, {\n      orderId: args.orderId,\n      status: paymentResult.success ? \"paid\" : \"failed\",\n    });\n\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### HTTP Actions\n\nHTTP actions handle webhooks and external requests:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/http.ts\nimport { httpRouter } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { httpAction } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { api, internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nconst http = httpRouter();\n\n// Webhook endpoint\nhttp.route({\n  path: \"/webhooks/stripe\",\n  method: \"POST\",\n  handler: httpAction(async (ctx, request) => {\n    const signature = request.headers.get(\"stripe-signature\");\n    const body = await request.text();\n\n    // Verify webhook signature\n    if (!verifyStripeSignature(body, signature)) {\n      return new Response(\"Invalid signature\", { status: 401 });\n    }\n\n    const event = JSON.parse(body);\n\n    // Process webhook\n    await ctx.runMutation(internal.payments.handleWebhook, {\n      eventType: event.type,\n      data: event.data,\n    });\n\n    return new Response(\"OK\", { status: 200 });\n  }),\n});\n\n// API endpoint\nhttp.route({\n  path: \"/api/users/:userId\",\n  method: \"GET\",\n  handler: httpAction(async (ctx, request) => {\n    const url = new URL(request.url);\n    const userId = url.pathname.split(\"/\").pop();\n\n    const user = await ctx.runQuery(api.users.get, { \n      userId: userId as Id<\"users\"> \n    });\n\n    if (!user) {\n      return new Response(\"Not found\", { status: 404 });\n    }\n\n    return Response.json(user);\n  }),\n});\n\nexport default http;\n```\n\n### Internal Functions\n\nUse internal functions for sensitive operations:\n\n```typescript\nimport { internalMutation, internalQuery, internalAction } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// Only callable from other Convex functions\nexport const _updateUserCredits = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    amount: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await ctx.db.get(args.userId);\n    if (!user) return null;\n\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.userId, {\n      credits: (user.credits || 0) + args.amount,\n    });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\n// Call internal function from action\nexport const purchaseCredits = action({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\"), amount: v.number() },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Process payment externally\n    await processPayment(args.amount);\n\n    // Update credits via internal mutation\n    await ctx.runMutation(internal.users._updateUserCredits, {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      amount: args.amount,\n    });\n\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Scheduling Functions\n\nSchedule functions to run later:\n\n```typescript\nimport { mutation, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nexport const scheduleReminder = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    message: v.string(),\n    delayMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"_scheduled_functions\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.scheduler.runAfter(\n      args.delayMs,\n      internal.notifications.sendReminder,\n      { userId: args.userId, message: args.message }\n    );\n  },\n});\n\nexport const sendReminder = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    message: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"notifications\", {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      message: args.message,\n      sentAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Complete Function File\n\n```typescript\n// convex/messages.ts\nimport { query, mutation, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nconst messageValidator = v.object({\n  _id: v.id(\"messages\"),\n  _creationTime: v.number(),\n  channelId: v.id(\"channels\"),\n  authorId: v.id(\"users\"),\n  content: v.string(),\n  editedAt: v.optional(v.number()),\n});\n\n// Public query\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    channelId: v.id(\"channels\"),\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(messageValidator),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const limit = args.limit ?? 50;\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"messages\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_channel\", (q) => q.eq(\"channelId\", args.channelId))\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(limit);\n  },\n});\n\n// Public mutation\nexport const send = mutation({\n  args: {\n    channelId: v.id(\"channels\"),\n    authorId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"messages\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    if (args.content.trim().length === 0) {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Message cannot be empty\");\n    }\n\n    const messageId = await ctx.db.insert(\"messages\", {\n      channelId: args.channelId,\n      authorId: args.authorId,\n      content: args.content.trim(),\n    });\n\n    // Schedule notification\n    await ctx.scheduler.runAfter(0, internal.messages.notifySubscribers, {\n      channelId: args.channelId,\n      messageId,\n    });\n\n    return messageId;\n  },\n});\n\n// Internal mutation\nexport const notifySubscribers = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    channelId: v.id(\"channels\"),\n    messageId: v.id(\"messages\"),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Get channel subscribers and notify them\n    const subscribers = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"subscriptions\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_channel\", (q) => q.eq(\"channelId\", args.channelId))\n      .collect();\n\n    for (const sub of subscribers) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"notifications\", {\n        userId: sub.userId,\n        messageId: args.messageId,\n        read: false,\n      });\n    }\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Always define args and returns validators\n- Use queries for read operations (they are cached and reactive)\n- Use mutations for write operations (they are transactional)\n- Use actions only when calling external APIs\n- Use internal functions for sensitive operations\n- Add `\"use node\";` at the top of action files using Node.js APIs\n- Handle errors with ConvexError for user-facing messages\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Using actions for database operations** - Use queries/mutations instead\n2. **Calling external APIs from queries/mutations** - Use actions\n3. **Forgetting to add \"use node\"** - Required for Node.js APIs in actions\n4. **Missing return validators** - Always specify returns\n5. **Not using internal functions for sensitive logic** - Protect with internalMutation\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Functions Overview: https://docs.convex.dev/functions\n- Query Functions: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/query-functions\n- Mutation Functions: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/mutation-functions\n- Actions: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/actions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:13:36.347Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring mastery of Convex functions, including queries, mutations, and actions with robust validation and error handling.","zh":"适用于需要掌握凸函数的云代理，包括查询、变异和操作，具有强大的验证和错误处理。","ja":"凸関数をマスターする必要があるクラウドエージェントに適しています。クエリ、ミューテーション、操作を含み、強力な検証とエラーハンドリングを備えています。","ko":"凸 함수를 마스터해야 하는 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다. 쿼리, 뮤테이션, 액션을 포함하며 강력한 유효성 검사 및 오류 처리를 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Nube que requieren dominio de funciones Convexas, incluidas consultas, mutaciones y acciones con validación robusta y control de errores.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant une maîtrise des fonctions Convex, y compris les requêtes, les mutations et les actions avec une validation robuste et une gestion des erreurs.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die die Beherrschung von Convex-Funktionen erfordern, einschließlich Abfragen, Mutationen und Aktionen mit robuster Validierung und Fehlerbehandlung.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que exigem domínio de funções Convexas, incluindo consultas, mutações e ações com validação robusta e tratamento de erros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих освоения выпуклых функций, включая запросы, мутации и действия с надежной проверкой и обработкой ошибок.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل السحابي التي تتطلب إتقان الدوال المحدبة، بما في ذلك الاستفسارات والتحويلات والactions مع التحقق القوي والمعالجة الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Convex functions for querying data, performing mutations, and executing actions, all while ensuring proper validation, error handling, and runtime considerations through HTTPS endpoints.","zh":"赋予代理使用凸函数查询数据、执行变异和操作的能力，同时确保适当的验证、错误处理和运行时考虑，通过HTTPS端点。","ja":"エージェントに凸関数を使用してデータを照会したり、ミューテーションを実行したり、操作を実行したりする能力を与え、HTTPSエンドポイントを介して適切な検証、エラーハンドリング、および実行時考慮を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가凸 함수를 사용하여 데이터를 쿼리하거나 뮤테이션을 수행하거나 액션을 실행할 수 있도록 하며 HTTPS 엔드포인트를 통해 적절한 검증, 오류 처리 및 런타임 고려를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar las funciones Convexas para consultar datos, realizar mutaciones y ejecutar acciones, todo mientras se garantiza una validación adecuada, control de errores y consideraciones de tiempo de ejecución a través de puntos de conexión HTTPS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les fonctions Convex pour interroger des données, effectuer des mutations et exécuter des actions, le tout en garantissant une validation appropriée, une gestion des erreurs et des considérations de temps d''exécution via des points de terminaison HTTPS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Convex-Funktionen für Datenabfragen, Mutationen und Aktionen auszuführen, während eine ordnungsgemäße Validierung, Fehlerbehandlung und Laufzeitüberlegungen durch HTTPS-Endpunkte sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar funções Convexas para consultar dados, realizar mutações e executar ações, garantindo a validação adequada, tratamento de erros e considerações de tempo de execução por meio de endpoints HTTPS.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность использовать выпуклые функции для запроса данных, выполнения мутаций и выполнения действий, обеспечивая правильную проверку, обработку ошибок и учет условий выполнения через конечные точки HTTPS.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على استخدام الدوال المحدبة لاستعلام البيانات وتنفيذ التحويلات وتنفيذ الإجراءات، مع ضمان التحقق الصحيح والمعالجة الأخطاء والاعتبارات الزمنية من خلال نقاط النهاية HTTPS."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing query functions for data retrieval","Building mutation functions for data manipulation","Creating custom actions with Convex functions"],"zh":["实现数据检索的查询函数","构建数据操作的变异函数","使用凸函数创建自定义操作"],"ja":["データの取得のためのクエリ関数を実装する","データの操作のためのミューテーション関数を構築する","凸関数を使用してカスタム操作を作成する"],"ko":["데이터 검색을 위한 쿼리 함수 구현","데이터 조작을 위한 뮤테이션 함수 구축","凸 함수를 사용하여 사용자 지정 동작 생성"],"es":["Implementar funciones de consulta para la recuperación de datos","Crear funciones de mutación para la manipulación de datos","Crear acciones personalizadas con funciones Convexas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des fonctions de requête pour la récupération de données","Construire des fonctions de mutation pour la manipulation de données","Créer des actions personnalisées avec des fonctions Convex"],"de":["Implementierung von Abfragefunktionen für die Datenerfassung","Erstellung von Mutationsfunktionen für die Datenmanipulation","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Aktionen mit Convex-Funktionen"],"pt":["Implementar funções de consulta para recuperação de dados","Construir funções de mutação para manipulação de dados","Criar ações personalizadas com funções Convexas"],"ru":["Реализация функций запроса для извлечения данных","Построение функций мутации для манипулирования данными","Создание пользовательских действий с использованием выпуклых функций"],"ar":["تنفيذ دوال استعلام لاسترجاع البيانات","بناء دوال تحويل للتعامل مع البيانات","إنشاء إجراءات مخصصة باستخدام الدوال المحدبة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex documentation and APIs","Dependent on Convex runtime environment"],"zh":["需要访问凸函数文档和API","依赖于凸函数运行时环境"],"ja":["凸関数のドキュメントとAPIにアクセスする必要がある","凸関数のランタイム環境に依存する"],"ko":["凸 함수 문서 및 API에 액세스해야 함","凸 함수 런타임 환경에 종속됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación y las API de Convex","Dependiente del entorno de tiempo de ejecución de Convex"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation et aux API Convex","Dépendant de l''environnement d''exécution Convex"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Convex-Dokumentation und -APIs","Abhängig von der Convex-Laufzeitumgebung"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação e APIs Convex","Dependente do ambiente de tempo de execução Convex"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации и API выпуклых функций","Зависит от среды выполнения выпуклых функций"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق و واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الدوال المحدبة","يعتمد على بيئة تشغيل الدوال المحدبة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ollieb89/orchestrator/testing-patterns', 'community', 'ollieb89', 'orchestrator', 'ollieb89/orchestrator', 'testing-patterns', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z', '2026-02-18T12:12:55.523Z', NULL, '{"id":"ollieb89/orchestrator/testing-patterns","name":"testing-patterns","description":{"zh":"测试模式是指构建可靠测试套件的原则和最佳实践，包括测试金字塔和AAA模式","ja":"テストパターンは、信頼性の高いテストスイートを構築するための原則とベストプラクティスです。テストパイラミッドとAAAパターンが含まれます","ko":"테스팅 패턴은 안정적인 테스트 세트를 구축하기 위한 원칙과 모범 사례입니다. 테스팅 피라미드와 AAA 패턴을 포함합니다","es":"Los patrones de pruebas son principios para desarrollar test suites confiables y escalables. Aprende sobre la pirámide de testing y el patrón AAA.","fr":"Les modèles de tests sont des principes pour développer des suites de tests fiables et évolutives. Découvrez la pyramide de test et le modèle AAA.","de":"Testmuster sind Prinzipien für die Entwicklung verlässlicher und skalierbarer Test-Suiten. Erfahren Sie mehr über die Testpyramide und das AAA-Muster.","pt":"Padrões de teste são princípios para criar testes mais confiáveis e eficazes. Aprenda sobre a pirâmide de teste e o padrão AAA.","ru":"Шаблоны тестирования - это принципы для создания более надежных и эффективных тестов. Узнайте о пирамиде тестирования и шаблоне AAA.","ar":"نماذج الاختبار هي مبادئ لإنشاء اختبارات أكثر موثوقية وفعالية. تعلم عن هرم الاختبار ونمطز AAA.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"测试模式","ja":"テストパターン","ko":"테스팅 패턴","es":"Patrones de Pruebas: Mejora la Confianza en tus Códigos","fr":"Modèles de Tests: Améliorez la Fiabilité de vos Codes","de":"Testmuster: Verbessern Sie die Zuverlässigkeit Ihres Codes","pt":"Padrões de Teste: Melhores Práticas para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Шаблоны тестирования: принципы надежных наборов тестов","ar":"نماذج الاختبار: مبادئ لتطوير مجموعات اختبار موثوقة","en":"testing-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"测试模式是指构建可靠测试套件的原则和最佳实践，包括测试金字塔和AAA模式","ja":"テストパターンは、信頼性の高いテストスイートを構築するための原則とベストプラクティスです。テストパイラミッドとAAAパターンが含まれます","ko":"테스팅 패턴은 안정적인 테스트 세트를 구축하기 위한 원칙과 모범 사례입니다. 테스팅 피라미드와 AAA 패턴을 포함합니다","es":"Los patrones de pruebas son principios para desarrollar test suites confiables y escalables. Aprende sobre la pirámide de testing y el patrón AAA.","fr":"Les modèles de tests sont des principes pour développer des suites de tests fiables et évolutives. Découvrez la pyramide de test et le modèle AAA.","de":"Testmuster sind Prinzipien für die Entwicklung verlässlicher und skalierbarer Test-Suiten. Erfahren Sie mehr über die Testpyramide und das AAA-Muster.","pt":"Padrões de teste são princípios para criar testes mais confiáveis e eficazes. Aprenda sobre a pirâmide de teste e o padrão AAA.","ru":"Шаблоны тестирования - это принципы для создания более надежных и эффективных тестов. Узнайте о пирамиде тестирования и шаблоне AAA.","ar":"نماذج الاختبار هي مبادئ لإنشاء اختبارات أكثر موثوقية وفعالية. تعلم عن هرم الاختبار ونمطز AAA.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["测试金字塔","AAA模式","可靠的测试套件","测试数据设置","代码执行和验证"],"ja":["テストパイラミッド","AAAパターン","信頼性の高いテストスイート","テストデータの設定","コードの実行と検証"],"ko":["테스팅 피라미드","AAA 패턴","안정적인 테스트 세트","테스트 데이터 설정","코드 실행과 검증"],"es":["Pirámide de testing","Patrón AAA","Pruebas unitarias","Pruebas de integración","Pruebas E2E"],"fr":["Pyramide de test","Modèle AAA","Tests unitaires","Tests d''intégration","Tests E2E"],"de":["Testpyramide","AAA-Muster","Einheitstests","Integrationstests","E2E-Tests"],"pt":["Pirâmide de teste","Padrão AAA","Testes unitários","Testes de integração","Testes de ponta a ponta"],"ru":["Пирамида тестирования","Шаблон AAA","Юнит-тесты","Тесты интеграции","Тесты от начала до конца"],"ar":["هرم الاختبار","نمطز AAA","اختبارات الوحدات","اختبارات التكامل","اختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["测试模式","测试金字塔","AAA模式","测试套件","代码测试","测试数据","可靠的测试"],"ja":["テストパターン","テストパイラミッド","AAAパターン","テストスイート","コードテスト","テストデータ","信頼性の高いテスト"],"ko":["테스팅 패턴","테스팅 피라미드","AAA 패턴","테스트 세트","코드 테스트","테스트 데이터","안정적인 테스트"],"es":["patrones de pruebas","testing","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración","pruebas E2E","desarrollo de software","calidad de código"],"fr":["modèles de tests","test","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration","tests E2E","développement de logiciels","qualité de code"],"de":["Testmuster","Testen","Einheitstests","Integrationstests","E2E-Tests","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität"],"pt":["padrões de teste","desenvolvimento de software","testes unitários","testes de integração","testes de ponta a ponta","pirâmide de teste","padrão AAA"],"ru":["шаблоны тестирования","разработка программного обеспечения","юнит-тесты","тесты интеграции","тесты от начала до конца","пирамида тестирования","шаблон AAA"],"ar":["نماذج الاختبار","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات الوحدات","اختبارات التكامل","اختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية","هرم الاختبار","نمطز AAA"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-patterns","description":"Testing patterns and principles. Unit, integration, mocking strategies.","bodyPreview":"# Testing Patterns\n\n> Principles for reliable test suites.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Testing Pyramid\n\n```\n        /\\          E2E (Few)\n       /  \\         Critical flows\n      /----\\\n     /      \\       Integration (Some)\n    /--------\\      API, DB queries\n   /          \\\n  /------------\\    Unit (Many)\n                    Functions, classes\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. AAA Pattern\n\n| Step | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **Arrange** | Set up test data |\n| **Act** | Execute code under test |\n| **Assert** | Verify outcom","body":"# Testing Patterns\n\n> Principles for reliable test suites.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Testing Pyramid\n\n```\n        /\\          E2E (Few)\n       /  \\         Critical flows\n      /----\\\n     /      \\       Integration (Some)\n    /--------\\      API, DB queries\n   /          \\\n  /------------\\    Unit (Many)\n                    Functions, classes\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. AAA Pattern\n\n| Step | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **Arrange** | Set up test data |\n| **Act** | Execute code under test |\n| **Assert** | Verify outcome |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Test Type Selection\n\n### When to Use Each\n\n| Type | Best For | Speed |\n|------|----------|-------|\n| **Unit** | Pure functions, logic | Fast (<50ms) |\n| **Integration** | API, DB, services | Medium |\n| **E2E** | Critical user flows | Slow |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Unit Test Principles\n\n### Good Unit Tests\n\n| Principle | Meaning |\n|-----------|---------|\n| Fast | < 100ms each |\n| Isolated | No external deps |\n| Repeatable | Same result always |\n| Self-checking | No manual verification |\n| Timely | Written with code |\n\n### What to Unit Test\n\n| Test | Don''t Test |\n|------|------------|\n| Business logic | Framework code |\n| Edge cases | Third-party libs |\n| Error handling | Simple getters |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Integration Test Principles\n\n### What to Test\n\n| Area | Focus |\n|------|-------|\n| API endpoints | Request/response |\n| Database | Queries, transactions |\n| External services | Contracts |\n\n### Setup/Teardown\n\n| Phase | Action |\n|-------|--------|\n| Before All | Connect resources |\n| Before Each | Reset state |\n| After Each | Clean up |\n| After All | Disconnect |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Mocking Principles\n\n### When to Mock\n\n| Mock | Don''t Mock |\n|------|------------|\n| External APIs | The code under test |\n| Database (unit) | Simple dependencies |\n| Time/random | Pure functions |\n| Network | In-memory stores |\n\n### Mock Types\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Stub | Return fixed values |\n| Spy | Track calls |\n| Mock | Set expectations |\n| Fake | Simplified implementation |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Test Organization\n\n### Naming\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Should behavior | \"should return error when...\" |\n| When condition | \"when user not found...\" |\n| Given-when-then | \"given X, when Y, then Z\" |\n\n### Grouping\n\n| Level | Use |\n|-------|-----|\n| describe | Group related tests |\n| it/test | Individual case |\n| beforeEach | Common setup |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Test Data\n\n### Strategies\n\n| Approach | Use |\n|----------|-----|\n| Factories | Generate test data |\n| Fixtures | Predefined datasets |\n| Builders | Fluent object creation |\n\n### Principles\n\n- Use realistic data\n- Randomize non-essential values (faker)\n- Share common fixtures\n- Keep data minimal\n\n---\n\n## 9. Best Practices\n\n| Practice | Why |\n|----------|-----|\n| One assert per test | Clear failure reason |\n| Independent tests | No order dependency |\n| Fast tests | Run frequently |\n| Descriptive names | Self-documenting |\n| Clean up | Avoid side effects |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Test implementation | Test behavior |\n| Duplicate test code | Use factories |\n| Complex test setup | Simplify or split |\n| Ignore flaky tests | Fix root cause |\n| Skip cleanup | Reset state |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Tests are documentation. If someone can''t understand what the code does from the tests, rewrite them.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:12:55.523Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT that require structured testing methodologies, such as the Testing Pyramid and AAA Pattern, for reliable test suites.","zh":"适用于像 Cursor 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要结构化的测试方法论，例如测试金字塔和 AAA 模式，以实现可靠的测试套件。","ja":"Cursor や AutoGPT などの構造化されたテスト方法論、たとえばテストピラミッドや AAA パターンが必要な AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Cursor 및 AutoGPT와 같은 구조화된 테스트 방법론(예: 테스트 피라미드 및 AAA 패턴)이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT that require structured testing methodologies, such as the Testing Pyramid and AAA Pattern, for reliable test suites.","fr":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT that require structured testing methodologies, such as the Testing Pyramid and AAA Pattern, for reliable test suites.","de":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT that require structured testing methodologies, such as the Testing Pyramid and AAA Pattern, for reliable test suites.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor e AutoGPT que exigem metodologias de teste estruturadas, como a Pirâmide de Testes e o Padrão AAA, para conjuntos de testes confiáveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor и AutoGPT, которые требуют структурированных методологий тестирования, таких как Пирамида Тестирования и Шаблон AAA, для надёжных наборов тестов.","ar":"مثالية لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و AutoGPT التي تتطلب منهجيات اختبار متطورة، مثل هرم الاختبار ونمط AAA، لاستدعاءات الاختبار الموثوقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust tests using the Testing Pyramid, focusing on unit, integration, and end-to-end tests, and to follow the AAA Pattern for arranging test data, acting on code under test, and asserting outcomes, leveraging critical flows and API queries.","zh":"赋予代理编写强大的测试的能力，使用测试金字塔，专注于单元测试、集成测试和端到端测试，并遵循 AAA 模式来安排测试数据、对代码进行操作和断言结果，利用关键流程和 API 查询。","ja":"テストピラミッドを使用して強力なテストを記述するエージェントの能力を付与し、ユニットテスト、統合テスト、エンドツーエンドテストに焦点を当て、テストデータの配置、コードの操作、結果のアサーションに AAA パターンを使用し、重要なフローと API クエリを活用します。","ko":"테스트 피라미드를 사용하여 강력한 테스트를 작성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 단위 테스트, 통합 테스트 및 종단 간 테스트에 중점을 두고, 테스트 데이터를 배치하고 코드를操作하고 결과를 단언하기 위해 AAA 패턴을 따르며, 중요한 흐름과 API 쿼리를 활용합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to write robust tests using the Testing Pyramid, focusing on unit, integration, and end-to-end tests, and to follow the AAA Pattern for arranging test data, acting on code under test, and asserting outcomes, leveraging critical flows and API queries.","fr":"Empowers agents to write robust tests using the Testing Pyramid, focusing on unit, integration, and end-to-end tests, and to follow the AAA Pattern for arranging test data, acting on code under test, and asserting outcomes, leveraging critical flows and API queries.","de":"Empowers agents to write robust tests using the Testing Pyramid, focusing on unit, integration, and end-to-end tests, and to follow the AAA Pattern for arranging test data, acting on code under test, and asserting outcomes, leveraging critical flows and API queries.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes robustos usando a Pirâmide de Testes, com foco em testes unitários, de integração e de ponta a ponta, e a seguir o Padrão AAA para organizar dados de teste, agir em código em teste e afirmar resultados, aproveitando fluxos críticos e consultas de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать надёжные тесты с помощью Пирамиды Тестирования, сосредотачиваясь на модульных, интеграционных и энд-ту-энд тестах, и следовать Шаблону AAA для организации тестовых данных, действия над тестируемым кодом и утверждения результатов, используя критические потоки и запросы API.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من كتابة الاختبارات القوية باستخدام هرم الاختبار، مع التركيز على اختبارات الوحدة وتكاملها واختبارات النهاية إلى النهاية، واتباع نمط AAA لتنظيم بيانات الاختبار والعمل على التعليمات البرمجية التي يتم اختبارها والإدلاء بنتائجها، واستغلال تدفقات حرجة واستفسارات واجهة البرمجة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test suite creation with the Testing Pyramid","Generating test cases using the AAA Pattern","Debugging critical flows in integration tests","Validating API queries in end-to-end tests"],"zh":["使用测试金字塔自动创建测试套件","使用 AAA 模式生成测试用例","在集成测试中调试关键流程","在端到端测试中验证 API 查询"],"ja":["テストピラミッドを使用してテストスイートの自動作成","AAA パターンを使用してテストケースを生成","統合テストで重要なフローをデバッグ","エンドツーエンドテストで API クエリを検証"],"ko":["테스트 피라미드를 사용하여 테스트套件 자동 생성","AAA 패턴을 사용하여 테스트케이스 생성","통합테스트에서 중요한 흐름 디버깅","종단 간 테스트에서 API 쿼리 검증"],"es":["Automating test suite creation with the Testing Pyramid","Generating test cases using the AAA Pattern","Debugging critical flows in integration tests","Validating API queries in end-to-end tests"],"fr":["Automating test suite creation with the Testing Pyramid","Generating test cases using the AAA Pattern","Debugging critical flows in integration tests","Validating API queries in end-to-end tests"],"de":["Automating test suite creation with the Testing Pyramid","Generating test cases using the AAA Pattern","Debugging critical flows in integration tests","Validating API queries in end-to-end tests"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de conjuntos de testes com a Pirâmide de Testes","Gerar casos de teste usando o Padrão AAA","Depurar fluxos críticos em testes de integração","Validar consultas de API em testes de ponta a ponta"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание наборов тестов с помощью Пирамиды Тестирования","Генерировать тестовые случаи с помощью Шаблона AAA","Отлаживать критические потоки в интеграционных тестах","Проверять запросы API в энд-ту-энд тестах"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء مجموعات الاختبار باستخدام هرم الاختبار","إنشاء حالات اختبار باستخدام نمط AAA","تصحيح تدفقات حرجة في اختبارات التكامل","التحقق من استفسارات واجهة البرمجة في اختبارات النهاية إلى النهاية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of testing principles","Limited to software development contexts","Does not cover non-functional testing aspects"],"zh":["需要了解测试原则","仅限于软件开发背景","不涵盖非功能性测试方面"],"ja":["テストの原則を理解する必要がある","ソフトウェア開発の背景に限定される","非機能テストの側面はカバーされない"],"ko":["테스트 원칙을 이해해야 함","소프트웨어 개발 배경에만 적용","비기능 테스트 측면은 다루지 않음"],"es":["Requires understanding of testing principles","Limited to software development contexts","Does not cover non-functional testing aspects"],"fr":["Requires understanding of testing principles","Limited to software development contexts","Does not cover non-functional testing aspects"],"de":["Requires understanding of testing principles","Limited to software development contexts","Does not cover non-functional testing aspects"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de teste","Limitado a contextos de desenvolvimento de software","Não cobre aspectos de teste não funcionais"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов тестирования","Ограничен контекстами разработки программного обеспечения","Не покрывает аспекты нефункционального тестирования"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ الاختبار","محدود سياقات تطوير البرمجيات","لا يغطي جوانب الاختبار غير الوظيفي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
