sitions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["支持 RWA 资产、加密货币、股票和指数","高达 1000 倍的杠杆","自定义 oracle 和 Virtual AMM","TWAP 平滑定价","每用户的链上金库"],"ja":["RWA アセット、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポート","最大 1000 倍のレバレッジ","カスタム オラクルと Virtual AMM","TWAP スムージング価格","ユーザーごとのオンチェーン ボールト"],"ko":["RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원","최대 1000배의 레버리지","사용자 정의 오라클 및 가상 AMM","TWAP 스무딩 가격","사용자별 온체인 보관소"],"es":["Soporta activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones e índices","Apalancamiento de hasta 1000x","Bóveda de liquidez centralizada","Oracle personalizado y suavizado TWAP","Posiciones largas y cortas con colateralización en stablecoins"],"fr":["Prend en charge les actifs RWA, les crypto-monnaies, les actions et les indices","Effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x","Chambre de liquidité centralisée","Oracle personnalisé et lissage TWAP","Positions longues et courtes avec collatéralisation en stablecoins"],"de":["Unterstützt RWA-Vermögenswerte, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes","Hebel von bis zu 1000x","Zentrale Liquiditätsbörse","Benutzerdefinierter Oracle und TWAP-Glättung","Lange und kurze Positionen mit Stablecoin-Besicherung"],"pt":["Suporte a ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices","Alavancagem de até 1000x","Oráculo personalizado","AMM virtual","Suavização TWAP"],"ru":["Поддержка активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов","Леверидж до 1000х","Пользовательский оракул","Виртуальный AMM","Сглаживание TWAP"],"ar":["دعم أصول RWA والعملات المشفرة والأوراق المالية والأسواق","رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000 ضعف","موزع أصول مخصص","AMM افتراضي","تحسين TWAP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["合成永续期货","RWA 资产","加密货币","股票","指数","杠杆交易","自定义 oracle","Virtual AMM","TWAP 平滑"],"ja":["合成永続期貨","RWA アセット","暗号資産","株式","指数","レバレッジ トレーディング","カスタム オラクル","Virtual AMM","TWAP スムージング"],"ko":["합성 영속 펀드","RWA 자산","암호화폐","주식","지수","레버리지 거래","사용자 정의 오라클","가상 AMM","TWAP 스무딩"],"es":["ralph-loop","futuros sintéticos perpetuos","activos RWA","criptomonedas","acciones","índices","apalancamiento","stablecoins","oracle","TWAP"],"fr":["ralph-loop","futures synthétiques perpétuelles","actifs RWA","crypto-monnaies","actions","indices","effet de levier","stablecoins","oracle","TWAP"],"de":["ralph-loop","synthetische Perpetual-Futures","RWA-Vermögenswerte","Kryptowährungen","Aktien","Indizes","Hebel","Stablecoins","Oracle","TWAP"],"pt":["Ralph-Loop","futuros sintéticos","RWA","criptomoedas","ações","índices","alavancagem","oráculo personalizado","AMM virtual","suavização TWAP"],"ru":["Ralph-Loop","синтетические фьючерсы","RWA","криптовалюты","акции","индексы","леверидж","пользовательский оракул","виртуальный AMM","сглаживание TWAP"],"ar":["رالف-لووب","مستقبلات مالية اصطناعية","RWA","العملات المشفرة","الأوراق المالية","الأسواق","رافعة مالية","موزع أصول مخصص","AMM افتراضي","تحسين TWAP"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph-loop","description":"Use when performing ralph wiggum style long-running development loops with pacing control.","bodyPreview":"# Ralph Wiggum - Long-Running Development Loops\n\nLong-running iterative development loops with pacing control.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Complex tasks requiring multiple iterations\n- Tasks with many discrete steps that build on each other\n- Work that benefits from periodic reflection\n\nDo NOT use for simple one-shot tasks or quick fixes.\n\n## Agent Tool\n\nCall `ralph_start` to begin a loop on yourself:\n\n```\nralph_start({\n  name: \"loop-name\",\n  taskContent: \"# Task\\n\\n## Goals\\n- Goal 1\\n\\n## Checklist\\n-","body":"# Ralph Wiggum - Long-Running Development Loops\n\nLong-running iterative development loops with pacing control.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Complex tasks requiring multiple iterations\n- Tasks with many discrete steps that build on each other\n- Work that benefits from periodic reflection\n\nDo NOT use for simple one-shot tasks or quick fixes.\n\n## Agent Tool\n\nCall `ralph_start` to begin a loop on yourself:\n\n```\nralph_start({\n  name: \"loop-name\",\n  taskContent: \"# Task\\n\\n## Goals\\n- Goal 1\\n\\n## Checklist\\n- [ ] Item 1\\n- [ ] Item 2\",\n  maxIterations: 50,        // Default: 50\n  itemsPerIteration: 3,     // Optional: suggest N items per turn\n  reflectEvery: 10,         // Optional: reflect every N iterations\n  useSubagents: true,       // Optional: delegate each task to subagent\n  subagentAgent: \"default\"  // Optional: subagent name (default: ''default'')\n})\n```\n\n## Loop Behavior\n\n1. Task content is saved to `.ralph/<name>.md`\n2. Each iteration: work on task, update file\n3. Call `ralph_done` tool to proceed to next iteration\n4. When complete: output `<promise>COMPLETE</promise>`\n5. Loop ends on completion or max iterations (default 50)\n\n## User Commands\n\n- `/ralph start <name|path>` - Start a new loop\n- `/ralph resume <name>` - Resume loop\n- `/ralph stop` - Pause loop (when agent idle)\n- `/ralph-stop` - Stop active loop (idle only)\n- `/ralph status` - Show loops\n- `/ralph list --archived` - Show archived loops\n- `/ralph archive <name>` - Move loop to archive\n- `/ralph clean [--all]` - Clean completed loops\n- `/ralph cancel <name>` - Delete loop\n- `/ralph nuke [--yes]` - Delete all .ralph data\n\nDuring streaming: press ESC to interrupt, send a normal message to resume, and run `/ralph-stop` when idle to end the loop.\n\n## Task File Format\n\n```markdown\n# Task Title\n\nBrief description.\n\n## Goals\n- Goal 1\n- Goal 2\n\n## Checklist\n- [ ] Item 1\n- [ ] Item 2\n- [x] Completed item\n\n## Notes\n(Update with progress, decisions, blockers)\n```\n\n## Subagent Mode\n\nDelegate each checklist task to a separate subagent thread:\n\n```bash\n/ralph start my-tasks --use-subagents --subagent-agent default\n```\n\n**How it works:**\n- Extracts uncompleted checklist items (`- [ ] Task`)\n- Each task is delegated to a fresh subagent thread (1 task = 1 subagent)\n- Subagent completes task and marks it done (`- [x] Task`)\n- Main loop orchestrates and tracks progress\n- Automatic retry logic for failures (2 attempts)\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Fresh context per task (no pollution)\n- Isolated execution (failures don''t cascade)\n- Clear task tracking and progress reporting\n- Suitable for independent, discrete tasks\n\n**When to use:**\n- Tasks are independent (no shared state)\n- Each task is substantial enough for separate execution\n- You want clean separation between tasks\n- Task list is well-defined upfront\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Clear checklist**: Break work into discrete items\n2. **Update as you go**: Mark items complete, add notes\n3. **Reflect when stuck**: Use reflection to reassess approach (normal mode)\n4. **Complete properly**: Only output completion marker when truly done\n5. **Subagent mode**: Use for independent tasks with clear boundaries\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:14:14.828Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced Development Agents needing long-running iterative development loops with pacing control.","zh":"适合需要长时间迭代开发循环和节奏控制的高级开发代理。","ja":"長期間にわたる反復開発ループとペース制御が必要な高度な開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"장기간에 걸친 반복 개발 루프와 페이스 컨트롤이 필요한 고급 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo Avanzados que necesitan bucles de desarrollo iterativos de larga duración con control de ritmo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement Avancés ayant besoin de boucles de développement itératives à long terme avec contrôle du rythme.","de":"Perfekt für Advanced Development Agents, die lange, iterative Entwicklungsschleifen mit Geschwindigkeitskontrolle benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Avançado que necessitam de loops de desenvolvimento iterativos de longa duração com controle de ritmo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Продвинутых Агентов Разработки, которым требуются длительные итеративные циклы разработки с контролем темпа.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير متقدمة تحتاج إلى دورات تطوير متكررة طويلة الأمد مع سيطرة على الإيقاع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute complex tasks with multiple iterations, leveraging periodic reflection and discrete step management through the `ralph_start` function, combining task content with iterative development loops.","zh":"赋予代理执行复杂任务的能力，通过周期性的反思和离散步骤管理，利用 `ralph_start` 函数，将任务内容与迭代开发循环相结合。","ja":"エージェントに複雑なタスクを実行する能力を与え、周期的な反省と離散的なステップ管理を通じて、`ralph_start` 関数を利用してタスクの内容を反復開発ループと組み合わせます。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 작업을 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 주기적인 반성과 분리된 단계 관리를 통해 `ralph_start` 함수를 사용하여 작업 내용을 반복 개발 루프와 결합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar tareas complejas con múltiples iteraciones, aprovechando la reflexión periódica y la gestión de pasos discretos a través de la función `ralph_start`, combinando el contenido de la tarea con los bucles de desarrollo iterativos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tâches complexes avec de multiples itérations, en exploitant la réflexion périodique et la gestion de pas discrets via la fonction `ralph_start`, en combinant le contenu de la tâche avec les boucles de développement itératives.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, komplexe Aufgaben mit mehreren Iterationen auszuführen, indem sie periodische Reflexion und diskrete Schrittverwaltung durch die `ralph_start`-Funktion nutzen und Aufgabeninhalte mit iterativen Entwicklungsschleifen kombinieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar tarefas complexas com múltiplas iterações, aproveitando a reflexão periódica e o gerenciamento de passos discretos por meio da função `ralph_start`, combinando o conteúdo da tarefa com loops de desenvolvimento iterativos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять сложные задачи с множественными итерациями, используя периодическое размышление и дискретное управление шагами посредством функции `ralph_start`, сочетая содержание задачи с итеративными циклами разработки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ مهام معقدة مع عدة تكرارات، واستغلال الانعكاس الدوري والتدبير المقطعي للخطوات من خلال دالة `ralph_start`، ومزج محتوى المهمة مع الحلقات التطويرية المتكررة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating complex task iterations with pacing control","Generating iterative development loops for discrete step management","Debugging long-running tasks with periodic reflection"],"zh":["使用节奏控制的自动化复杂任务迭代","生成离散步骤管理的迭代开发循环","使用周期性反思的长时间任务调试"],"ja":["ペース制御を使用した複雑なタスクの反復の自動化","離散的なステップ管理のための反復開発ループの生成","周期的な反省を使用した長時間のタスクのデバッグ"],"ko":["페이스 컨트롤을 사용한 복잡한 작업의 반복 자동화","분리된 단계 관리를 위한 반복 개발 루프의 생성","주기적인 반성을 사용한 장기간의 작업 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar iteraciones de tareas complejas con control de ritmo","Generar bucles de desarrollo iterativos para la gestión de pasos discretos","Depurar tareas de larga duración con reflexión periódica"],"fr":["Automatiser les itérations de tâches complexes avec contrôle du rythme","Générer des boucles de développement itératives pour la gestion de pas discrets","Déboguer des tâches à long terme avec réflexion périodique"],"de":["Automatisieren von komplexen Aufgabeniterationen mit Geschwindigkeitskontrolle","Generieren von iterativen Entwicklungsschleifen für die Verwaltung von diskreten Schritten","Debuggen von langlaufenden Aufgaben mit periodischer Reflexion"],"pt":["Automatizar iterações de tarefas complexas com controle de ritmo","Gerar loops de desenvolvimento iterativos para gerenciamento de passos discretos","Depurar tarefas de longa duração com reflexão periódica"],"ru":["Автоматизация сложных задач с контролем темпа","Генерация итеративных циклов разработки для дискретного управления шагами","Отладка задач длительного выполнения с периодическим размышлением"],"ar":["تأتميم تكرارات مهام معقدة مع سيطرة على الإيقاع","генерация حلقات تطوير متكررة لإدارة خطوات منفصلة","تصحيح أخطاء مهام طويلة الأمد مع انعكاس دوري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Not suitable for simple one-shot tasks or quick fixes","Requires iterative development loop management"],"zh":["不适合简单的单次任务或快速修复","需要迭代开发循环管理"],"ja":["単純な1回限りのタスクまたはクイックフィックスに適していない","反復開発ループ管理が必要"],"ko":["단순한 단일 작업이나 빠른 수정에 적합하지 않음","반복 개발 루프 관리가 필요"],"es":["No es adecuado para tareas simples de un solo disparo o soluciones rápidas","Requiere gestión de bucles de desarrollo iterativos"],"fr":["N''est pas adapté pour les tâches simples à usage unique ou les correctifs rapides","Nécessite une gestion de boucles de développement itératives"],"de":["Nicht geeignet für einfache Einmal-Aufgaben oder schnelle Lösungen","Benötigt Verwaltung von iterativen Entwicklungsschleifen"],"pt":["Não é adequado para tarefas simples de um único disparo ou correções rápidas","Requer gerenciamento de loops de desenvolvimento iterativos"],"ru":["Не подходит для простых одноразовых задач или быстрых исправлений","Требует управления итеративными циклами разработки"],"ar":["لا يصلح للمهام البسيطة ذات الإطلاق الواحد أو الإصلاحات السريعة","يتطلب إدارة الحلقات التطويرية المتكررة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-site-component', 'community', 'weunica', 'payboxCLI-App', 'weunica/payboxCLI-App', 'wix-cli-site-component', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z', '2026-02-18T12:14:19.720Z', NULL, '{"id":"weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-site-component","name":"wix-cli-site-component","description":{"zh":"Wix CLI网站组件构建器创建生产就绪的React网站组件，支持编辑器清单","ja":"Wix CLIサイトコンポーネントビルダーは、エディター・マニフェストをサポートするプロダクションレディのReactサイトコンポーネントを作成します","ko":"Wix CLI 사이트 컴포넌트 빌더는 에디터 매니페스트를 지원하는 프로덕션 레디 리액트 사이트 컴포넌트를 생성합니다","es":"wix-cli-site-component es una herramienta para crear componentes de sitio de Wix de alta calidad con editor de manifiestos para aplicaciones de Wix CLI","fr":"wix-cli-site-component est un outil pour créer des composants de site Wix de haute qualité avec éditeur de manifestes pour les applications Wix CLI","de":"wix-cli-site-component ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von hochwertigen Wix-Site-Komponenten mit Editor-Manifesten für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen","pt":"O Wix Site Component Builder cria componentes de site React de alta qualidade com manifestos de editor para aplicações Wix CLI.","ru":"Wix Site Component Builder создает компоненты сайта React высокого качества с манифестами редактора для приложений Wix CLI.","ar":"يتم إنشاء مكونات موقع React عالية الجودة مع manifests للناشر لبرامج Wix CLI باستخدام Wix Site Component Builder","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Wix CLI网站组件构建器","ja":"Wix CLIサイトコンポーネントビルダー","ko":"Wix CLI 사이트 컴포넌트 빌더","es":"Crear componentes de sitio de Wix con wix-cli-site-component","fr":"Créer des composants de site Wix avec wix-cli-site-component","de":"Erstellen von Wix-Site-Komponenten mit wix-cli-site-compo...","pt":"Construtor de Componentes de Site Wix CLI","ru":"Wix CLI Сайт Компонент Билдер","ar":"مكونات موقع Wix CLI","en":"wix-cli-site-component"},"description":{"zh":"Wix CLI网站组件构建器创建生产就绪的React网站组件，支持编辑器清单","ja":"Wix CLIサイトコンポーネントビルダーは、エディター・マニフェストをサポートするプロダクションレディのReactサイトコンポーネントを作成します","ko":"Wix CLI 사이트 컴포넌트 빌더는 에디터 매니페스트를 지원하는 프로덕션 레디 리액트 사이트 컴포넌트를 생성합니다","es":"wix-cli-site-component es una herramienta para crear componentes de sitio de Wix de alta calidad con editor de manifiestos para aplicaciones de Wix CLI","fr":"wix-cli-site-component est un outil pour créer des composants de site Wix de haute qualité avec éditeur de manifestes pour les applications Wix CLI","de":"wix-cli-site-component ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von hochwertigen Wix-Site-Komponenten mit Editor-Manifesten für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen","pt":"O Wix Site Component Builder cria componentes de site React de alta qualidade com manifestos de editor para aplicações Wix CLI.","ru":"Wix Site Component Builder создает компоненты сайта React высокого качества с манифестами редактора для приложений Wix CLI.","ar":"يتم إنشاء مكونات موقع React عالية الجودة مع manifests للناشر لبرامج Wix CLI باستخدام Wix Site Component Builder","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建生产就绪的React网站组件","支持编辑器清单","集成了Wix编辑器","定义组件清单","支持自定义内容和样式"],"ja":["プロダクションレディのReactサイトコンポーネントを作成","エディター・マニフェストをサポート","Wixエディターと統合","コンポーネントマニフェストを定義","カスタムコンテンツとスタイルをサポート"],"ko":["프로덕션 레디 리액트 사이트 컴포넌트 생성","에디터 매니페스트 지원","Wix 에디터와 통합","컴포넌트 매니페스트 정의","사용자 정의 콘텐츠 및 스타일 지원"],"es":["Crea componentes de sitio de Wix de alta calidad","Integra con el editor de Wix","Permite la personalización de contenido, estilo y comportamiento","Requiere cuatro archivos obligatorios","Define el contrato entre el componente React y el ecosistema Wix"],"fr":["Crée des composants de site Wix de haute qualité","S''intègre à l''éditeur Wix","Permet la personnalisation de contenu, de style et de comportement","Requiert quatre fichiers obligatoires","Définit le contrat entre le composant React et l''écosystème Wix"],"de":["Erstellt hochwertige Wix-Site-Komponenten","Integriert mit dem Wix-Editor","Ermöglicht die Anpassung von Inhalt, Stil und Verhalten","Benötigt vier obligatorische Dateien","Definiert den Vertrag zwischen dem React-Komponenten und dem Wix-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Criação de componentes de site React de alta qualidade","Integração com o Wix Editor","Manifestos de editor personalizáveis","Arquitetura de quatro arquivos requeridos","Suporte a personalização de conteúdo e estilo"],"ru":["Создание компонентов сайта React высокого качества","Интеграция с Wix Editor","Настраиваемые манифесты редактора","Архитектура из четырех обязательных файлов","Поддержка настройки контента и стиля"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات موقع React عالية الجودة","التكامل مع محرر Wix","manifests قابل للتعديل","هندسة من أربعة ملفات مطلوبة","دعم تعديل المحتوى والنمط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Wix CLI","React网站组件","编辑器清单","Wix编辑器","组件清单","自定义内容","自定义样式"],"ja":["Wix CLI","Reactサイトコンポーネント","エディター・マニフェスト","Wixエディター","コンポーネントマニフェスト","カスタムコンテンツ","カスタムスタイル"],"ko":["Wix CLI","리액트 사이트 컴포넌트","에디터 매니페스트","Wix 에디터","컴포넌트 매니페스트","사용자 정의 콘텐츠","사용자 정의 스타일"],"es":["wix-cli-site-component","componentes de sitio de Wix","React","Wix Editor","personalización de sitios web","desarrollo web","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["wix-cli-site-component","composants de site Wix","React","Éditeur Wix","personnalisation de sites web","développement web","outils de développement"],"de":["wix-cli-site-component","Wix-Site-Komponenten","React","Wix-Editor","Anpassung von Websites","Webentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Wix CLI","Componentes de site React","Wix Editor","Manifestos de editor","Desenvolvimento de aplicações Wix","Componentes de site personalizados"],"ru":["Wix CLI","Компоненты сайта React","Wix Editor","Манифесты редактора","Разработка приложений Wix","Пользовательские компоненты сайта"],"ar":["Wix CLI","مكونات موقع React","محرر Wix","manifests للناشر","تطوير برامج Wix","مكونات موقع مخصصة"]}},"owner":"weunica","repo":"payboxCLI-App","repoPath":"weunica/payboxCLI-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wix-cli-site-component","description":"Use when building React site components with editor manifests for Wix CLI applications.","bodyPreview":"# Wix Site Component Builder\n\nCreates production-quality React site components with editor manifests for Wix CLI applications. Site components are React components that integrate with the Wix Editor, allowing site owners to customize content, styling, and behavior through a visual interface.\n\n## Architecture\n\nSite components consist of **four required files**:\n\n### 1. Component Manifest (`manifest.json`)\n\nDefines the contract between the React component and Wix ecosystem:\n\n- **editorElement**: R","body":"# Wix Site Component Builder\n\nCreates production-quality React site components with editor manifests for Wix CLI applications. Site components are React components that integrate with the Wix Editor, allowing site owners to customize content, styling, and behavior through a visual interface.\n\n## Architecture\n\nSite components consist of **four required files**:\n\n### 1. Component Manifest (`manifest.json`)\n\nDefines the contract between the React component and Wix ecosystem:\n\n- **editorElement**: Root element configuration (selector, displayName, archetype, layout)\n- **cssProperties**: CSS API for styling customization\n- **data**: Data API for content configuration\n- **elements**: Nested element definitions for granular editing\n- **behaviors**: Editor interaction behaviors\n\n### 2. React Component (`component.tsx`)\n\nProduction-ready React functional component:\n\n- Implements props interface matching manifest data structure\n- Applies className and id to root element\n- Handles element removal state via `wix.elementsRemovalState`\n- Uses sub-component pattern for nested elements\n- Includes proper TypeScript typing and error handling\n\n### 3. CSS Styles (`style.css`)\n\nModern CSS with responsive design:\n\n- Synced selectors with manifest and React classNames\n- CSS variables for dynamic styling\n- Responsive design without media queries (flexbox, grid, clamp)\n- Pointer events enabled for editor elements\n- No inline styles for static values\n- Each selector once only, `box-sizing: border-box` all elements\n- NO `transition: all`, NO media queries (except `prefers-reduced-motion`)\n- Root display: Declare `--display: [value]` CSS variable, then use `display: var(--display)` on root\n\n### 4. TypeScript Types (`types.ts`)\n\nStrict type definitions:\n\n- Props interfaces for all components\n- Data type mappings (text → string, image → Image object)\n- Element props structure with optional chaining\n- Wix system types (Wix interface, REMOVED type)\n\n## Component Manifest Structure\n\n**You MUST read [MANIFEST_GUIDELINES.md](references/MANIFEST_GUIDELINES.md) before implementing a site component.** It contains the complete manifest structure, all data types, element configurations, and required patterns.\n\nThe manifest defines the editor contract using these key sections:\n\n### editorElement (Root Configuration)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"selector\": \".component-name\",\n  \"displayName\": \"Component Name\",\n  \"archetype\": \"Container\",\n  \"layout\": {\n    \"resizeDirection\": \"horizontalAndVertical\",\n    \"contentResizeDirection\": \"horizontal\"\n  },\n  \"cssProperties\": {\n    \"backgroundColor\": {\n      \"displayName\": \"Background Color\",\n      \"defaultValue\": \"#ffffff\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"data\": {\n    \"columns\": {\n      \"dataType\": \"number\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Number of Columns\",\n      \"number\": { \"minimum\": 1, \"maximum\": 4 }\n    }\n  },\n  \"elements\": {\n    \"title\": {\n      \"elementType\": \"inlineElement\",\n      \"inlineElement\": {\n        \"selector\": \".component-name__title\",\n        \"displayName\": \"Title\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"titleText\": {\n            \"dataType\": \"text\",\n            \"displayName\": \"Title Text\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"behaviors\": {\n          \"selectable\": true,\n          \"removable\": true\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Data Types Reference\n\n| Type | Runtime Value | Use Case |\n|------|---------------|----------|\n| `text` | string | Names, titles, descriptions |\n| `textEnum` | string | Predefined options |\n| `number` | number | Quantities, dimensions |\n| `booleanValue` | boolean | Toggles, flags |\n| `a11y` | Object | Accessibility attributes |\n| `link` | `{ href, target, rel }` | Navigation links |\n| `image` | `{ uri, url, alt, width, height }` | Images |\n| `video` | Video object | Media content |\n| `vectorArt` | Sanitized SVG object | Icons, graphics |\n| `localDate` | string (YYYY-MM-DD) | Date values |\n| `localTime` | string (hh:mm) | Time values |\n| `webUrl` | string | External URLs |\n| `richText` | string (HTML) | Formatted content |\n| `arrayItems` | Array | Collections, lists |\n| `direction` | string | HTML dir attribute |\n| `menuItems` | Array of menu items | Navigation menus |\n\n### CSS Properties Reference\n\nCommon CSS properties for styling customization:\n\n- **Layout**: `display`, `gap`, `padding`, `margin`, `width`, `height`\n- **Typography**: `font`, `fontSize`, `fontWeight`, `textAlign`, `color`\n- **Background**: `backgroundColor`, `backgroundImage`\n- **Border**: `border`, `borderRadius`, `boxShadow`\n- **Positioning**: `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `flexDirection`\n\n**Complete CSS properties reference:** See [CSS_GUIDELINES.md](references/CSS_GUIDELINES.md) for all CSS properties, variable patterns, and styling best practices.\n\n## React Component Patterns\n\n**Complete reference:** See [REACT_PATTERNS.md](references/REACT_PATTERNS.md) for detailed component architecture, all coding patterns, and implementation examples.\n\n### Props Structure\n\n```typescript\ninterface ComponentProps {\n  // Standard props (always present)\n  className: string;\n  id: string;\n  wix?: Wix;\n\n  // Component-level data (from editorElement.data)\n  columns?: number;\n  layout?: string;\n\n  // Element props (from elements definitions)\n  elementProps?: {\n    title?: {\n      titleText?: string;\n      wix?: Wix;\n    };\n    button?: {\n      buttonText?: string;\n      buttonLink?: Link;\n      wix?: Wix;\n    };\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Sub-Component Pattern\n\nExtract every distinct UI element into named sub-components:\n\n```typescript\n// Title sub-component\ninterface TitleProps {\n  titleText?: string;\n  className: string;\n}\n\nconst Title: FC<TitleProps> = ({ titleText = \"Default Title\", className }) => (\n  <h2 className={className}>{titleText}</h2>\n);\n\n// Main component\nconst ProductCard: FC<ProductCardProps> = ({\n  className,\n  id,\n  elementProps,\n  wix\n}) => {\n  const removalState = wix?.elementsRemovalState || {};\n\n  return (\n    <div className={`product-card ${className}`} id={id}>\n      {!removalState[''title''] && (\n        <Title\n          className=\"product-card__title\"\n          {...elementProps?.title}\n        />\n      )}\n      {!removalState[''button''] && (\n        <Button\n          className=\"product-card__button\"\n          {...elementProps?.button}\n        />\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n```\n\n### Conditional Rendering\n\nAll elements must be conditionally rendered based on removal state:\n\n```typescript\nconst removalState = wix?.elementsRemovalState || {};\n\nreturn (\n  <div className={`component ${className}`} id={id}>\n    {!removalState[''elementKey''] && <Element />}\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## CSS Guidelines\n\n### Responsive Design Strategy\n\nComponents live in user-resizable containers (300-1200px) within varying viewports:\n\n- **Root element**: `width: 100%; height: 100%`\n- **Layout structure**: Use CSS Grid and Flexbox for fluid responsiveness\n- **Typography**: Use `clamp()` for fluid scaling\n- **Spacing**: Fixed or tight clamp spacing (≤50% variation)\n\n### CSS Variables for Dynamic Styling\n\n```css\n.component {\n  --display: block;\n  --background-color: #ffffff;\n  --text-color: #333333;\n\n  display: var(--display);\n  background-color: var(--background-color);\n  color: var(--text-color);\n  pointer-events: auto;\n}\n```\n\n### Selector Synchronization\n\n**CRITICAL**: CSS selectors must match manifest selectors and React classNames exactly:\n\n- React: `className=\"product-card__title\"`\n- CSS: `.product-card__title { ... }`\n- Manifest: `\"selector\": \".product-card__title\"`\n\n## Design Guidelines\n\n**Complete reference:** See [DESIGN_SYSTEM.md](references/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md) for visual design principles, creative guidelines, and aesthetic best practices.\n\n### Spacing as Communication\n\n| Relationship | Value | Use Case |\n|---|---|---|\n| Tight (icon + label) | 0.25-0.5rem (4-8px) | Clustering related items |\n| Same category | 1-1.5rem (16-24px) | Card sections, form fields |\n| Different sections | 2-3rem (32-48px) | Major content blocks |\n| Emphasis/Drama | 4rem+ (64px+) | Hero content, luxury feel |\n\n### Visual Consistency\n\n- **Corner Radius**: All similar elements share same radius (0-4px sharp, 6-12px rounded)\n- **Shadow Levels**: Max 3 levels (rest, hover, floating)\n- **Element Heights**: Consistent heights for similar elements\n- **Color Strategy**: Use full palette purposefully for hierarchy and zones\n\n### Creative Exploration\n\nPush beyond obvious solutions:\n\n- **Cards**: Asymmetric grids, overlapping elements, thick accent borders\n- **Lists**: Alternating styles, spotlight patterns, color rhythm\n- **Interactive Elements**: Split buttons, colored icon circles, smooth transitions\n- **Content Hierarchy**: Large numbers for stats, quote callouts, whitespace dividers\n\n## Component Elements Guidelines\n\n### One Element = One Manifest Entry\n\nEach distinct visual part requires a separate manifest element:\n\n- ✅ 3 buttons → 3 separate elements\n- ✅ Image + text → 2 separate elements\n- ❌ Multiple items grouped as one element\n\n### Data Scoping Rules\n\n**editorElement.data** - Component-wide configuration only:\n- ✅ Layout enums, numbers (columns: 3, speed: 500)\n- ❌ Text, links, images (belongs to elements)\n- ❌ show/hide booleans (use removable: true instead)\n\n**elements[key].data** - Content for that specific element:\n- ✅ Element-specific content (title text, button link, image)\n\n## Asset Requirements\n\nWhen components need default images, use this format:\n\n```typescript\n// Import in component\nimport { heroImage } from ''./assets/defaultImages'';\n\n// Usage\n<img src={heroImage} alt=\"Hero\" />\n```\n\nAsset specification format:\n```\n<imageUrlName>\n{ \"description\": \"Modern cityscape at sunset\", \"width\": 1920, \"height\": 1088 }\n</imageUrlName>\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n- Import as named export from `''./assets/defaultImages''`\n- Width/height: multiples of 64, between 128-2048px\n- NEVER use external URLs\n\n## Output Structure\n\n```\nsrc/site/components/\n└── {component-name}/\n    ├── manifest.json        # Component manifest\n    ├── component.tsx        # React component\n    ├── style.css           # CSS styles\n    ├── types.ts            # TypeScript types\n    └── assets/             # Optional assets\n        └── defaultImages.ts\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n**Complete working example:** See [EXAMPLE.md](references/EXAMPLE.md) for a full production-ready site component with all patterns, including manifest, React component, CSS, and types.\n\n### Product Card Component\n\n**Request:** \"Create a product card component with image, title, price, and buy button\"\n\n**Output:**\n- Manifest with 4 elements (image, title, price, button)\n- React component with sub-components for each element\n- CSS with responsive grid layout and hover effects\n- TypeScript types for all props and data structures\n\n### Hero Section Component\n\n**Request:** \"Build a hero section with background image, headline, subtitle, and CTA button\"\n\n**Output:**\n- Manifest with background image CSS property and 3 text elements\n- React component with overlay design and typography hierarchy\n- CSS with responsive text scaling and dramatic spacing\n- Asset specifications for default hero images\n\n### Feature List Component\n\n**Request:** \"Create a features component with configurable number of items\"\n\n**Output:**\n- Manifest with arrayItems data type for feature collection\n- React component mapping over features array with safety checks\n- CSS with flexible grid layout adapting to item count\n- Sub-components for feature icons, titles, and descriptions\n\n## Extension Registration\n\n**Extension registration is MANDATORY and has TWO required steps.**\n\n### Step 1: Create Component-Specific Extension File\n\nEach site component requires an `extensions.ts` file in its folder:\n\n```typescript\nimport { extensions } from \"@wix/astro/builders\";\nimport manifest from \"./site/components/my-component/manifest.json\";\n\nexport const sitecomponentMyComponent = extensions.siteComponent({\n  ...manifest,\n  id: \"{{GENERATE_UUID}}\",\n  description: \"My Component\",\n  type: \"platform.builder.{{GENERATE_UUID}}\",\n  resources: {\n    client: {\n      component: \"./site/components/my-component/component.tsx\",\n      componentUrl: \"./site/components/my-component/component.tsx\",\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Note:** The `id` and `type` should use the same UUID.\n\n**CRITICAL: UUID Generation**\n\nThe `id` must be a unique, static UUID v4 string. Generate a fresh UUID for each extension - do NOT use `randomUUID()` or copy UUIDs from examples.\n\n### Step 2: Register in Main Extensions File\n\n**CRITICAL:** After creating the component-specific extension file, you MUST read [wix-cli-extension-registration](../wix-cli-extension-registration/SKILL.md) and follow the \"App Registration\" section to update `src/extensions.ts`.\n\n**Without completing Step 2, the site component will not be available in the Wix Editor.**\n\n## Code Quality Requirements\n\n**Complete reference:** See [TYPESCRIPT_QUALITY.md](references/TYPESCRIPT_QUALITY.md) for comprehensive type safety guidelines and code quality standards.\n\n### TypeScript Standards\n\n- Strict TypeScript with no `any` types\n- Explicit return types for all functions\n- Proper null/undefined handling with optional chaining\n- No `@ts-ignore` or `@ts-expect-error` comments\n\n### React Best Practices\n\n- Functional components with hooks\n- Proper dependency arrays in useEffect\n- Component must react to prop changes\n- SSR-safe code (no browser APIs at module scope)\n\n### ESLint Compliance\n\n1. No unused vars/params/imports (`@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars`)\n2. No external images: `img` `src` not `https://...` (allowed: local imports, `wixstatic.com`, variables)\n3. SSR-safe: No `window`/`document` at module scope/constructor, guard browser APIs in `useEffect`/handlers\n4. No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` or inline `<style>` tags - use CSS variables or inline `style` prop for dynamic values\n5. No `window.fetch` (`no-restricted-properties`)\n6. Hooks `exhaustive-deps`: ALL values from component scope used inside `useEffect`/`useCallback` MUST be in dependency array\n7. Use `const`/`let` (no `var`), no unknown JSX properties\n\n## Hard Constraints\n\n- Do NOT invent or assume new types, modules, functions, props, events, or imports\n- Use only entities explicitly present in the provided references or standard libraries already used in this project\n- Do NOT add dependencies; do NOT use `@wix/design-system` or `@wix/wix-ui-icons-common`\n- All user-facing content must come from props (no hardcoded text)\n- Links/media from manifest only, never hardcode URLs\n- NEVER use mocks, placeholders, or TODOs in any code\n- ALWAYS implement complete, production-ready functionality\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter implementation, use [wix-cli-app-validation](../wix-cli-app-validation/SKILL.md) to validate TypeScript compilation, build, preview, and runtime behavior.\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n- [Complete Example](references/EXAMPLE.md) - Full production-ready site component example with all patterns\n- [Component Manifest Guidelines](references/MANIFEST_GUIDELINES.md) - Detailed manifest structure and best practices\n- [React Patterns](references/REACT_PATTERNS.md) - Component architecture and coding patterns\n- [CSS Guidelines](references/CSS_GUIDELINES.md) - Styling conventions and responsive design\n- [Design System](references/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md) - Visual design principles and creative guidelines\n- [TypeScript Quality](references/TYPESCRIPT_QUALITY.md) - Type safety and code quality standards\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:14:19.720Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to create customizable React site components for Wix CLI applications.","zh":"非常适合需要为 Wix CLI 应用程序创建可定制的 React 站点组件的前端代理。","ja":"Wix CLI アプリケーション向けのカスタマイズ可能な React サイト コンポーネントを作成する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Wix CLI 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 정의 가능한 React 사이트 컴포넌트를 생성해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan crear componentes de sitios personalizables de React para aplicaciones de Wix CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de créer des composants de site React personnalisables pour les applications Wix CLI.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte React-Website-Komponenten für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam criar componentes de site personalizáveis do React para aplicações do Wix CLI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо создавать настраиваемые компоненты сайта React для приложений Wix CLI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مكونات موقع تفاعلية قابلة للتعديل لمؤسسة Wix CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate production-quality React site components with editor manifests, integrating seamlessly with the Wix Editor through manifest.json files and utilizing the Wix ecosystem''s editorElement contract.","zh":"赋予代理生成生产级的 React 站点组件的能力，具有编辑器清单，通过 manifest.json 文件与 Wix 编辑器无缝集成，并利用 Wix 生态系统的 editorElement 合同。","ja":"エージェントが、エディター マニフェストを備えた生産性の高い React サイト コンポーネントを生成することを可能にし、manifest.json ファイルを介して Wix エディターとシームレスに統合し、Wix エコシステムの editorElement 契約を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 편집기 매니페스트를 갖춘 생산성 있는 React 사이트 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, manifest.json 파일을 통해 Wix 편집기와 무縫으로 통합하고 Wix 생태계의 editorElement 계약을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar componentes de sitios de React de calidad de producción con manifiestos de editor, integrándose perfectamente con el Editor de Wix a través de archivos manifest.json y utilizando el contrato editorElement del ecosistema de Wix.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour générer des composants de site React de qualité de production avec des manifestes d''éditeur, s''intégrant en douceur avec l''Éditeur Wix via des fichiers manifest.json et en utilisant le contrat editorElement de l''écosystème Wix.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Produktionsqualitäts-React-Website-Komponenten mit Editor-Manifesten zu generieren, die nahtlos mit dem Wix-Editor über manifest.json-Dateien integriert werden und den editorElement-Vertrag des Wix-Ökosystems nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem componentes de site do React de qualidade de produção com manifestos de editor, integrando-se perfeitamente ao Editor do Wix por meio de arquivos manifest.json e utilizando o contrato editorElement do ecossistema do Wix.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать компоненты сайта React высокого качества с манифестами редактора, интегрируясь без проблем с редактором Wix через файлы manifest.json и используя контракт editorElement экосистемы Wix.","ar":"يمكن للعميل أن ينتج مكونات موقع تفاعلي من نوع رياكت بجودة إنتاج مع وثائق تحرير، متكامل بشكل ممتاز مع محرر Wix من خلال ملفات manifest.json ومتوافق مع عقدة editorElement في نظام Wix."},"useCases":{"en":["Building reusable React components for Wix sites","Creating customizable site elements with editor manifests","Integrating Wix Editor functionality into React applications"],"zh":["为 Wix 站点构建可重用的 React 组件","使用编辑器清单创建可定制的站点元素","将 Wix 编辑器功能集成到 React 应用程序中"],"ja":["Wix サイト向けの再利用可能な React コンポーネントを構築する","エディター マニフェストを使用してカスタマイズ可能なサイト要素を作成する","Wix エディターの機能を React アプリケーションに統合する"],"ko":["Wix 사이트를 위한 재사용 가능한 React 컴포넌트를 구축하는 것","편집기 매니페스트를 사용하여 사용자 정의 가능한 사이트 요소를 생성하는 것","Wix 편집기 기능을 React 애플리케이션에 통합하는 것"],"es":["Construir componentes de React reutilizables para sitios de Wix","Crear elementos de sitio personalizables con manifiestos de editor","Integrar la funcionalidad del Editor de Wix en aplicaciones de React"],"fr":["Créer des composants React réutilisables pour les sites Wix","Créer des éléments de site personnalisables avec des manifestes d''éditeur","Intégrer la fonctionnalité de l''Éditeur Wix dans les applications React"],"de":["Erstellen von wiederverwendbaren React-Komponenten für Wix-Websites","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Website-Elementen mit Editor-Manifesten","Integrieren der Wix-Editor-Funktionalität in React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Construir componentes React reutilizáveis para sites Wix","Criar elementos de site personalizáveis com manifestos de editor","Integrar funcionalidades do Editor do Wix em aplicações React"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов React для сайтов Wix","Создание настраиваемых элементов сайта с манифестами редактора","Интеграция функций редактора Wix в приложения React"],"ar":["بناء مكونات رياكت قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لمواقع Wix","إنشاء عناصر موقع قابلة للتخصيص مع وثائق تحرير","دمج وظائف محرر Wix في تطبيقات رياكت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires four specific files, including manifest.json","Limited to React components and Wix CLI applications"],"zh":["需要四个特定的文件，包括 manifest.json","仅限 React 组件和 Wix CLI 应用程序"],"ja":["manifest.json を含む 4 つの特定のファイルが必要","React コンポーネントと Wix CLI アプリケーションにのみ限られている"],"ko":["manifest.json을 포함한 4개의 특정 파일이 필요","React 컴포넌트와 Wix CLI 애플리케이션에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere cuatro archivos específicos, incluyendo manifest.json","Limitado a componentes de React y aplicaciones de Wix CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite quatre fichiers spécifiques, y compris manifest.json","Limité aux composants React et aux applications Wix CLI"],"de":["Benötigt vier spezifische Dateien, einschließlich manifest.json","Begrenzt auf React-Komponenten und Wix-CLI-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer quatro arquivos específicos, incluindo manifest.json","Limitado a componentes React e aplicações Wix CLI"],"ru":["Требует четырех определенных файлов, включая manifest.json","Ограничен компонентами React и приложениями Wix CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب四ة ملفات محددة، بما في ذلك manifest.json","محدود بمكونات رياكت وتطبيقات Wix CLI"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
