l to Code: Exportieren Sie Entwürfe in React/Tailwin...","pt":"Pencil to Code: Crie Código React com Tailwind","ru":"Карандаш в код: Экспорт дизайна Pencil в React","ar":"قلم إلى كود: استيراد تصاميم Pencil إلى React","en":"pencil-to-code"},"description":{"zh":"Pencil to Code允许您将Pencil设计导出为生产级React/Tailwind代码，支持React和Vue框架","ja":"Pencil to Codeは、Pencilデザインを本番用のReact/Tailwindコードにエクスポートすることができます。ReactとVueのフレームワークをサポート","ko":"Pencil to Code는 Pencil 디자인을 생산용 React/Tailwind 코드로导出할 수 있습니다. React 및 Vue 프레임워크를 지원","es":"Pencil to Code es una herramienta que exporta diseños Pencil a código React y Tailwind, permitiendo una integración fluida en su flujo de trabajo de desarrollo.","fr":"Pencil to Code est un outil qui exporte des conceptions Pencil en code React et Tailwind, permettant une intégration fluide dans votre flux de travail de dév...","de":"Pencil to Code ist ein Tool, das Pencil-Entwürfe in React- und Tailwind-Code exportiert, ermöglicht eine nahtlose Integration in Ihren Entwicklungsworkflow.","pt":"Pencil to Code é uma ferramenta que converte designs Pencil em código React com Tailwind. É ideal para desenvolvedores que desejam acelerar o processo de des...","ru":"Карандаш в код — это инструмент, который преобразует дизайн Pencil в код React с Tailwind. Он идеален для разработчиков, которые хотят ускорить процесс разра...","ar":"قلم إلى كود هو أداة تحول تصاميم Pencil إلى كود React مع Tailwind. هو أداة مثالية للمطورين الذين يرغبون في تسريع عملية التطوير.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持导出React和Vue框架代码","自动生成Tailwind类","可选的组件名称和输出路径","可选的截图比较用于验证"],"ja":["ReactとVueのフレームワークコードのエクスポートをサポート","Tailwindクラスの自動生成","コンポーネント名と出力パスのオプション","バリデーションのためのスクリーンショット比較のオプション"],"ko":["React 및 Vue 프레임워크 코드导出 지원","Tailwind 클래스 자동 생성","组件 이름 및 출력 경로 옵션","검증을 위한 스크린샷 비교 옵션"],"es":["Exportación de diseños Pencil a código React y Tailwind","Integración con frameworks como React y Vue","Configuración de tema Tailwind a partir de variables de diseño","Comparación de capturas de pantalla para validación"],"fr":["Exportation de conceptions Pencil en code React et Tailwind","Intégration avec des frameworks tels que React et Vue","Configuration du thème Tailwind à partir de variables de conception","Comparaison d''captures d''écran pour la validation"],"de":["Export von Pencil-Entwürfen in React- und Tailwind-Code","Integration mit Frameworks wie React und Vue","Konfiguration des Tailwind-Themas aus Design-Variablen","Vergleich von Screenshots zur Validierung"],"pt":["Exporte designs Pencil para código React","Suporte a Tailwind para estilização","Opção de exportar componentes React individuais ou todo o documento","Configuração de tema Tailwind a partir de variáveis Pencil","Comparação de screenshots para validação"],"ru":["Экспортируйте дизайн Pencil в код React","Поддержка Tailwind для стилизации","Возможность экспорта отдельных компонентов React или всего документа","Конфигурация темы Tailwind из переменных Pencil","Сравнение скриншотов для валидации"],"ar":["استيراد تصاميم Pencil إلى كود React","دعم Tailwind للاستيلاء","خيار استيراد مكونات React الفردية أو المستند الكامل","تكوين موضوع Tailwind من متغيرات Pencil","مقارنة لقطات الشاشة للتأكيد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pencil to Code","设计导出","React","Tailwind","Vue","代码生成","前端开发"],"ja":["Pencil to Code","デザインエクスポート","React","Tailwind","Vue","コード生成","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Pencil to Code","디자인导出","React","Tailwind","Vue","코드 생성","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["Pencil to Code","diseño y desarrollo","React","Tailwind","exportación de diseños","desarrollo web","herramientas de diseño"],"fr":["Pencil to Code","conception et développement","React","Tailwind","exportation de conceptions","développement web","outils de conception"],"de":["Pencil to Code","Design und Entwicklung","React","Tailwind","Export von Entwürfen","Webentwicklung","Design-Tools"],"pt":["Pencil to Code","design para desenvolvedores","React","Tailwind","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de design","exportar designs","código React"],"ru":["Карандаш в код","дизайн для разработчиков","React","Tailwind","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты дизайна","экспорт дизайна","код React"],"ar":["قلم إلى كود","تصميم للمطورين","React","Tailwind","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التصميم","استيراد التصاميم","كود React"]}},"owner":"ElementsAI-Dev","repo":"Cognia","repoPath":"ElementsAI-Dev/Cognia","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pencil-to-code","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Pencil to Code\n\nExport Pencil .pen designs to production React/Tailwind code.\n\n## Interface\n\n**Input:**\n- Frame ID to export (or entire document)\n- Target framework: React (default), Vue, HTML\n- Optional: Component name, output path\n\n**Output:**\n- React component(s) with Tailwind classes\n- Tailwind theme configuration (from .pen variables)\n- Optional: Screenshot comparison for validation\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Read Design Structure\n\n```javascript\n// Get full frame tree\nmcp__pencil__batch_get({","body":"# Pencil to Code\n\nExport Pencil .pen designs to production React/Tailwind code.\n\n## Interface\n\n**Input:**\n- Frame ID to export (or entire document)\n- Target framework: React (default), Vue, HTML\n- Optional: Component name, output path\n\n**Output:**\n- React component(s) with Tailwind classes\n- Tailwind theme configuration (from .pen variables)\n- Optional: Screenshot comparison for validation\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Read Design Structure\n\n```javascript\n// Get full frame tree\nmcp__pencil__batch_get({\n  filePath: \"<path>.pen\",\n  nodeIds: [\"frameId\"],\n  readDepth: 10,\n  resolveInstances: true,\n  resolveVariables: true\n})\n\n// Get design variables/theme\nmcp__pencil__get_variables({ filePath: \"<path>.pen\" })\n```\n\n### 2. Extract Design Tokens\n\nTransform .pen variables → Tailwind theme:\n\n```css\n/* From .pen variables */\n@theme {\n  --color-primary: [from variables.colors.primary];\n  --color-background: [from variables.colors.background];\n  --font-sans: [from variables.fonts.body];\n  /* ... */\n}\n```\n\nReference: `references/token-extraction.md`\n\n### 3. Map Nodes to Components\n\n| .pen Node Type | React Output |\n|---------------|--------------|\n| `frame` with layout | `<div className=\"flex ...\">` |\n| `frame` with children | Component with children |\n| `text` | `<p>`, `<h1-6>`, or `<span>` |\n| `ref` (instance) | Reusable component |\n| `rectangle` | `<div>` with fill |\n| `ellipse` | `<div className=\"rounded-full\">` |\n| `image` | `<img>` or `fill: url()` |\n\nReference: `references/node-mapping.md`\n\n### 4. Generate Code\n\n**Component structure:**\n```tsx\n// components/[ComponentName].tsx\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\ninterface [ComponentName]Props {\n  className?: string\n  // Extracted props from design\n}\n\nexport function [ComponentName]({ className, ...props }: [ComponentName]Props) {\n  return (\n    <div className={cn(\"[tailwind classes]\", className)}>\n      {/* Nested structure */}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**Tailwind mapping:**\n```\n.pen property → Tailwind class\n--------------------------------\nfill: #000     → bg-black\nlayout: horizontal → flex flex-row\ngap: 16        → gap-4\npadding: [16,24,16,24] → py-4 px-6\nfontSize: 24   → text-2xl\nfontWeight: 700 → font-bold\ncornerRadius: [8,8,8,8] → rounded-lg\n```\n\n### 5. Validate (Optional)\n\n```javascript\n// Screenshot the .pen frame\nmcp__pencil__get_screenshot({ nodeId: \"frameId\" })\n\n// Compare visually with rendered React\n// (Manual step or browser automation)\n```\n\n### 6. Output\n\n```markdown\n## Generated Components\n\n### [ComponentName]\n- File: `components/[ComponentName].tsx`\n- Props: [list extracted props]\n\n### Theme Configuration\n- File: `app/globals.css` (additions)\n\n## Verification\nScreenshot comparison: [attached]\n```\n\n## Translation Rules\n\n### Layout System\n\n```\n.pen                          Tailwind\n--------------------------------------\nlayout: \"vertical\"         → flex flex-col\nlayout: \"horizontal\"       → flex flex-row\nlayout: \"grid\"             → grid\nalignItems: \"center\"       → items-center\njustifyContent: \"center\"   → justify-center\ngap: 8                     → gap-2\ngap: 16                    → gap-4\ngap: 24                    → gap-6\nwidth: \"fill_container\"    → w-full\nheight: \"fill_container\"   → h-full\n```\n\n### Spacing (8-point grid)\n\n```\n.pen padding                  Tailwind\n----------------------------------------\n[8,8,8,8]                  → p-2\n[16,16,16,16]              → p-4\n[16,24,16,24]              → py-4 px-6\n[24,32,24,32]              → py-6 px-8\n```\n\n### Typography\n\n```\n.pen                          Tailwind\n----------------------------------------\nfontSize: 12               → text-xs\nfontSize: 14               → text-sm\nfontSize: 16               → text-base\nfontSize: 20               → text-xl\nfontSize: 24               → text-2xl\nfontSize: 32               → text-3xl\nfontSize: 48               → text-5xl\nfontWeight: 400            → font-normal\nfontWeight: 500            → font-medium\nfontWeight: 600            → font-semibold\nfontWeight: 700            → font-bold\n```\n\n### Colors\n\n```\n.pen                          Tailwind\n----------------------------------------\nfill: \"#FFFFFF\"            → bg-white\nfill: \"#000000\"            → bg-black\nfill: variable             → bg-[var(--color-name)]\ntextColor: \"#6B7280\"       → text-gray-500\nstroke: \"#E5E5E5\"          → border-gray-200\n```\n\n### Border Radius\n\n```\n.pen cornerRadius             Tailwind\n----------------------------------------\n[0,0,0,0]                  → rounded-none\n[4,4,4,4]                  → rounded\n[8,8,8,8]                  → rounded-lg\n[16,16,16,16]              → rounded-2xl\n[9999,9999,9999,9999]      → rounded-full\n```\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **Single concern**: Export → code. No design modifications.\n- **Tailwind 4 @theme**: CSS-first token system\n- **React + TypeScript**: Default output target\n- **Semantic HTML**: Choose appropriate elements\n- **Accessibility**: Include aria attributes where detectable\n\n## References\n\n- `references/node-mapping.md` — Complete node → component mapping\n- `references/token-extraction.md` — Variable → theme extraction\n- `design-tokens/` — Token system conventions\n\n## Integration\n\n**Called by:**\n- `design-exploration` orchestrator (after direction selection)\n- Direct user invocation\n\n**Composes:**\n- `design-tokens` (for theme structure)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:14:14.858Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing seamless design-to-code conversion for React and Tailwind applications.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝设计到代码转换的React和Tailwind应用的前端代理。","ja":"ReactおよびTailwindアプリケーションでデザインからコードへのシームレスな変換が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"리액트와 테일윈드 애플리케이션에서 디자인을 코드로 변환하는 데 시ーム리스한 변환이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una conversión de diseño a código sin problemas para aplicaciones de React y Tailwind.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui nécessitent une conversion de conception à code sans faille pour les applications React et Tailwind.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die eine nahtlose Design-zu-Code-Konvertierung für React- und Tailwind-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de conversão de design para código sem interrupções para aplicações React e Tailwind.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима бесшовная конвертация дизайна в код для приложений React и Tailwind.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل تصميم متوافق لتحويل الكود لبرامج React و Tailwind."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to export Pencil designs to production-ready React components with Tailwind classes, utilizing .pen variables for theme configuration and facilitating screenshot comparison for validation, all while supporting frameworks like React and Vue.","zh":"赋予代理导出Pencil设计到生产就绪的React组件的能力，具有Tailwind类，利用.pen变量进行主题配置，并通过截图比较进行验证，同时支持像React和Vue这样的框架。","ja":"Pencilデザインを生产就緒のReactコンポーネントにエクスポートするエージェントの能力を与え、Tailwindクラス、.pen変数を使用したテーマ設定、および検証のためのスクリーンショット比較を提供し、ReactやVueなどのフレームワークもサポートします。","ko":"펜슬 디자인을 생산 준비된 리액트 컴포넌트로 내보내기 위한 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 테일윈드 클래스, .pen 변수를 사용한 테마 구성 및 검증을 위한 스크린샷 비교를 제공하고 리액트 및 뷰와 같은 프레임워크도 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes exportar diseños de Pencil a componentes de React listos para la producción con clases de Tailwind, utilizando variables .pen para la configuración del tema y facilitando la comparación de capturas de pantalla para la validación, todo mientras admite frameworks como React y Vue.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exporter des conceptions Pencil vers des composants React prêts pour la production avec des classes Tailwind, en utilisant des variables .pen pour la configuration du thème et en facilitant la comparaison d''écran pour la validation, le tout en prenant en charge des frameworks tels que React et Vue.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Pencil-Entwürfe in produktionssreife React-Komponenten mit Tailwind-Klassen zu exportieren, indem .pen-Variablen für die Themenkonfiguration verwendet werden und der Vergleich von Screenshots für die Validierung erleichtert wird, und unterstützt dabei Frameworks wie React und Vue.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a exportar projetos Pencil para componentes React prontos para produção com classes Tailwind, utilizando variáveis .pen para configuração de temas e facilitando a comparação de capturas de tela para validação, tudo isso enquanto suporta frameworks como React e Vue.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью экспортировать проекты Pencil в готовые к производству компоненты React с классами Tailwind, используя переменные .pen для конфигурации тем и облегчая сравнение скриншотов для проверки, все это при поддержке фреймворков seperti React и Vue.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استيراد تصاميم قلم الرصاص إلى مكونات رياكت جاهزة للإنتاج مع فصول تايلويند، باستخدام متغيرات .pen لتهيئة المواضيع وتسهيل مقارنة لقطات الشاشة للتحقق، وكل ذلك مع دعم الإطارات مثل رياكت وفيو."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the conversion of Pencil designs to React components","Generating Tailwind theme configurations from .pen variables","Validating design implementations through screenshot comparisons"],"zh":["自动将Pencil设计转换为React组件","从.pen变量生成Tailwind主题配置","通过截图比较验证设计实现"],"ja":["PencilデザインをReactコンポーネントに自動変換する",".pen変数からTailwindテーマ設定を生成する","スクリーンショット比較を使用してデザインの実装を検証する"],"ko":["펜슬 디자인을 리액트 컴포넌트로 자동 변환하기",".pen 변수에서 테일윈드 테마 구성 생성하기","스크린샷 비교를 통해 디자인 구현 검증하기"],"es":["Automatizar la conversión de diseños de Pencil a componentes de React","Generar configuraciones de temas de Tailwind a partir de variables .pen","Validar implementaciones de diseño mediante comparaciones de capturas de pantalla"],"fr":["Automatiser la conversion de conceptions Pencil en composants React","Générer des configurations de thème Tailwind à partir de variables .pen","Valider les mises en œuvre de conception via des comparaisons d''écran"],"de":["Automatisieren der Konvertierung von Pencil-Entwürfen in React-Komponenten","Erzeugen von Tailwind-Themenkonfigurationen aus .pen-Variablen","Validieren von Designimplementierungen durch Screenshots-Vergleiche"],"pt":["Automatizar a conversão de projetos Pencil em componentes React","Gerar configurações de tema Tailwind a partir de variáveis .pen","Validar implementações de design por meio de comparações de capturas de tela"],"ru":["Автоматизировать конвертацию проектов Pencil в компоненты React","Генерировать конфигурации темы Tailwind из переменных .pen","Проверять реализацию дизайна путем сравнения скриншотов"],"ar":["أتمتة تحويل تصاميم قلم الرصاص إلى مكونات رياكت","إنشاء تهيئة مواضيع تايلويند من متغيرات .pen","التحقق من تنفيذ التصميم من خلال مقارنة لقطات الشاشة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Pencil .pen design files","Limited to React, Vue, and HTML target frameworks","Dependent on Tailwind for styling"],"zh":["需要Pencil .pen设计文件","仅限React、Vue和HTML目标框架","依赖于Tailwind进行样式设置"],"ja":["Pencil .penデザインファイルが必要","React、Vue、HTMLターゲットフレームワークのみ","Tailwindに依存してスタイリングを行う"],"ko":["펜슬 .pen 디자인 파일이 필요함","리액트, 뷰, HTML 타겟 프레임워크만 지원","테일윈드에 의존하여 스타일을 설정함"],"es":["Requiere archivos de diseño .pen de Pencil","Limitado a frameworks de destino React, Vue y HTML","Dependiente de Tailwind para el estilo"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers de conception .pen de Pencil","Limité aux frameworks cibles React, Vue et HTML","Dépend de Tailwind pour le style"],"de":["Benötigt Pencil-.pen-Design-Dateien","Begrenzt auf React-, Vue- und HTML-Zielframeworks","Abhängig von Tailwind für das Styling"],"pt":["Requer arquivos de design Pencil .pen","Limitado a frameworks de destino React, Vue e HTML","Dependente de Tailwind para estilização"],"ru":["Требует файлов дизайна Pencil .pen","Ограничен фреймворками назначения React, Vue и HTML","Зависит от Tailwind для стилизации"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات تصميم قلم الرصاص .pen","محدود بالإطارات الوجهة رياكت، فيو، و إتش تي إم إل","يعتمد على تايلويند لتهيئة الشكل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
