ines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Native模块修复协议","ja":"ネイティブモジュールのパッチング","ko":"네이티브 모듈 패칭 프로토콜","es":"Reparación de módulos nativos","fr":"Correction de modules natifs","de":"Patching von Native-Modulen","pt":"Correção de Módulos Nativos","ru":"Патчинг Родных Модулей","ar":"صيانة الوحدات الأصلية","en":"patching-native-modules"},"description":{"zh":"本文介绍如何分析崩溃日志、修复Native模块漏洞并生成补丁的工作流程","ja":"この文書では、クラッシュログを分析し、ネイティブモジュールのバグを修復してパッチを生成するワークフローについて説明します","ko":"본 문서는 크래시 로그 분석, 네이티브 모듈 버그 수정 및 패치 생성 워크플로우를紹介합니다","es":"El proceso de reparación de módulos nativos implica analizar registros de errores, localizar y solucionar fallos, y generar parches para mejorar la estabilid...","fr":"Le processus de correction de modules natifs consiste à analyser les journaux d''erreurs, à localiser et à corriger les bogues, et à générer des correctifs po...","de":"Der Prozess des Patching von Native-Modulen umfasst die Analyse von Fehlerprotokollen, die Lokalisierung und Behebung von Fehlern sowie die Generierung von P...","pt":"O patching-native-modules é um processo para analisar e corrigir bugs em módulos nativos, melhorando a estabilidade do aplicativo","ru":"Патчинг родных модулей - это процесс анализа и исправления ошибок в родных модулях для улучшения стабильности приложения","ar":"صيانة الوحدات الأصلية هي عملية لتحليل وإصلاح العلل في الوحدات الأصلية لتحسين استقرار التطبيق","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["分析崩溃日志","定位并修复Native模块漏洞","生成补丁","清理构建产物","提交和PR"],"ja":["