操作をサポートします","ko":"agent-browser는 브라우저 자동화 테스트 도구로 브라우저 자동화 테스트와 상호 작용을 지원합니다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta de automatización de navegador que permite navegar, capturar pantallas y interactuar con elementos de forma sencilla","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil d''automatisation de navigateur qui permet de naviguer, de capturer des écrans et d''interagir avec des éléments de manière simple","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Tool für die Automatisierung von Browsern, mit dem Sie navigieren, Screenshots erstellen und mit Elementen interagieren können","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite executar tarefas de forma eficiente","ru":"Agent-browser — это инструмент для автоматизации браузера, который позволяет выполнять задачи эффективно","ar":"agent-browser هو أداة تautomatización المتصفح التي تمكنك من تشغيل المهام بفعالية","en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"definition":{"en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"features":{"zh":["自动化浏览器测试","支持浏览器交互","快照和重新快照功能","支持元素引用","命令行界面"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化テスト","ブラウザ操作のサポート","スナップショットとリスナップショット機能","要素参照のサポート","コマンドラインインターフェース"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화 테스트","브라우저 상호 작용 지원","스냅샷과 리스냅샷 기능","요소 참조 지원","명령줄 인터페이스"],"es":["Navegación automática","Captura de pantalla","Interacción con elementos","Obtención de referencias de elementos","Re-captura de pantalla después de cambios en el DOM"],"fr":["Navigation automatisée","Capture d''écran","Interaction avec des éléments","Obtention de références d''éléments","Re-capture d''écran après des changements dans le DOM"],"de":["Automatisierte Navigation","Screenshots","Interaktion mit Elementen","Abruf von Element-Referenzen","Neuer Screenshot nach Änderungen im DOM"],"pt":["Navegação automática","Captura de elementos","Interação com elementos","Atualização de referências","Suporte a comandos personalizados"],"ru":["Автоматическая навигация","Снятие элементов","Взаимодействие с элементами","Обновление ссылок","Поддержка пользовательских команд"],"ar":["التautomatización التلقائي","التقطع العناصر","التفاعل مع العناصر","تحديث المراجع","دعم الأوامر المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["agent-browser","自动化浏览器测试","浏览器自动化","测试自动化","开发工具","命令行工具"],"ja":["agent-browser","ブラウザ自動化テスト","ブラウザ自動化","テスト自動化","開発ツール","コマンドラインツール"],"ko":["agent-browser","브라우저 자동화 테스트","브라우저 자동화","테스트 자동화","개발 도구","명령줄 도구"],"es":["automatización de navegador","agent-browser","navegación automática","captura de pantalla","interacción con elementos","desarrollo web","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","agent-browser","navigation automatisée","capture d''écran","interaction avec des éléments","développement web","automatisation de tâches"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","agent-browser","automatisierte Navigation","Screenshots","Interaktion mit Elementen","Webentwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["automação de navegador","agent-browser","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","automatização de tarefas","navegação automática"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","agent-browser","веб-разработка","инструменты разработки","автоматизация задач","автоматическая навигация"],"ar":["تautomatización المتصفح","agent-browser","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير","تautomatización المهام","التautomatización التلقائي"]}},"owner":"faint45","repo":"zhewei-ai-chat-01","repoPath":"faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-browser","description":"Browser automation CLI for AI agents. Use when the user needs to interact with websites, including navigating pages, filling forms, clicking buttons, taking screenshots, extracting data, testing web apps, or automating any browser task. Triggers include requests to open a website, fill out a form, click a button, take a screenshot, scrape data from a page, test this web app, login to a site, automate browser actions, or any task requiring programmatic web interaction.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nEvery browser automation follows this pattern:\n\n1. **Navigate**: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. **Snapshot**: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (get element refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. **Interact**: Use refs to click, fill, select\n4. **Re-snapshot**: After navigation or DOM changes, get fresh refs\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/form\nagent-browser snapshot -i\n# Output: @e1 [input type=\"email\"], @e2 [input type=\"password\"], @e3 [b","body":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nEvery browser automation follows this pattern:\n\n1. **Navigate**: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. **Snapshot**: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (get element refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. **Interact**: Use refs to click, fill, select\n4. **Re-snapshot**: After navigation or DOM changes, get fresh refs\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/form\nagent-browser snapshot -i\n# Output: @e1 [input type=\"email\"], @e2 [input type=\"password\"], @e3 [button] \"Submit\"\n\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"user@example.com\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password123\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle\nagent-browser snapshot -i  # Check result\n```\n\n## Essential Commands\n\n```bash\n# Navigation\nagent-browser open <url>              # Navigate (aliases: goto, navigate)\nagent-browser close                   # Close browser\n\n# Snapshot\nagent-browser snapshot -i             # Interactive elements with refs (recommended)\nagent-browser snapshot -i -C          # Include cursor-interactive elements (divs with onclick, cursor:pointer)\nagent-browser snapshot -s \"#selector\" # Scope to CSS selector\n\n# Interaction (use @refs from snapshot)\nagent-browser click @e1               # Click element\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"         # Clear and type text\nagent-browser type @e2 \"text\"         # Type without clearing\nagent-browser select @e1 \"option\"     # Select dropdown option\nagent-browser check @e1               # Check checkbox\nagent-browser press Enter             # Press key\nagent-browser scroll down 500         # Scroll page\n\n# Get information\nagent-browser get text @e1            # Get element text\nagent-browser get url                 # Get current URL\nagent-browser get title               # Get page title\n\n# Wait\nagent-browser wait @e1                # Wait for element\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle # Wait for network idle\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/page\"    # Wait for URL pattern\nagent-browser wait 2000               # Wait milliseconds\n\n# Capture\nagent-browser screenshot              # Screenshot to temp dir\nagent-browser screenshot --full       # Full page screenshot\nagent-browser pdf output.pdf          # Save as PDF\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Submission\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/signup\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"Jane Doe\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"jane@example.com\"\nagent-browser select @e3 \"California\"\nagent-browser check @e4\nagent-browser click @e5\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle\n```\n\n### Authentication with State Persistence\n\n```bash\n# Login once and save state\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/login\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"$USERNAME\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"$PASSWORD\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"\nagent-browser state save auth.json\n\n# Reuse in future sessions\nagent-browser state load auth.json\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/dashboard\n```\n\n### Data Extraction\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/products\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser get text @e5           # Get specific element text\nagent-browser get text body > page.txt  # Get all page text\n\n# JSON output for parsing\nagent-browser snapshot -i --json\nagent-browser get text @e1 --json\n```\n\n### Parallel Sessions\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --session site1 open https://site-a.com\nagent-browser --session site2 open https://site-b.com\n\nagent-browser --session site1 snapshot -i\nagent-browser --session site2 snapshot -i\n\nagent-browser session list\n```\n\n### Visual Browser (Debugging)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --headed open https://example.com\nagent-browser highlight @e1          # Highlight element\nagent-browser record start demo.webm # Record session\n```\n\n### Local Files (PDFs, HTML)\n\n```bash\n# Open local files with file:// URLs\nagent-browser --allow-file-access open file:///path/to/document.pdf\nagent-browser --allow-file-access open file:///path/to/page.html\nagent-browser screenshot output.png\n```\n\n### iOS Simulator (Mobile Safari)\n\n```bash\n# List available iOS simulators\nagent-browser device list\n\n# Launch Safari on a specific device\nagent-browser -p ios --device \"iPhone 16 Pro\" open https://example.com\n\n# Same workflow as desktop - snapshot, interact, re-snapshot\nagent-browser -p ios snapshot -i\nagent-browser -p ios tap @e1          # Tap (alias for click)\nagent-browser -p ios fill @e2 \"text\"\nagent-browser -p ios swipe up         # Mobile-specific gesture\n\n# Take screenshot\nagent-browser -p ios screenshot mobile.png\n\n# Close session (shuts down simulator)\nagent-browser -p ios close\n```\n\n**Requirements:** macOS with Xcode, Appium (`npm install -g appium && appium driver install xcuitest`)\n\n**Real devices:** Works with physical iOS devices if pre-configured. Use `--device \"<UDID>\"` where UDID is from `xcrun xctrace list devices`.\n\n## Ref Lifecycle (Important)\n\nRefs (`@e1`, `@e2`, etc.) are invalidated when the page changes. Always re-snapshot after:\n\n- Clicking links or buttons that navigate\n- Form submissions\n- Dynamic content loading (dropdowns, modals)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser click @e5              # Navigates to new page\nagent-browser snapshot -i            # MUST re-snapshot\nagent-browser click @e1              # Use new refs\n```\n\n## Semantic Locators (Alternative to Refs)\n\nWhen refs are unavailable or unreliable, use semantic locators:\n\n```bash\nagent-browser find text \"Sign In\" click\nagent-browser find label \"Email\" fill \"user@test.com\"\nagent-browser find role button click --name \"Submit\"\nagent-browser find placeholder \"Search\" type \"query\"\nagent-browser find testid \"submit-btn\" click\n```\n\n## Deep-Dive Documentation\n\n| Reference | When to Use |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| [references/commands.md](references/commands.md) | Full command reference with all options |\n| [references/snapshot-refs.md](references/snapshot-refs.md) | Ref lifecycle, invalidation rules, troubleshooting |\n| [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md) | Parallel sessions, state persistence, concurrent scraping |\n| [references/authentication.md](references/authentication.md) | Login flows, OAuth, 2FA handling, state reuse |\n| [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md) | Recording workflows for debugging and documentation |\n| [references/proxy-support.md](references/proxy-support.md) | Proxy configuration, geo-testing, rotating proxies |\n\n## Ready-to-Use Templates\n\n| Template | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [templates/form-automation.sh](templates/form-automation.sh) | Form filling with validation |\n| [templates/authenticated-session.sh](templates/authenticated-session.sh) | Login once, reuse state |\n| [templates/capture-workflow.sh](templates/capture-workflow.sh) | Content extraction with screenshots |\n\n```bash\n./templates/form-automation.sh https://example.com/form\n./templates/authenticated-session.sh https://app.example.com/login\n./templates/capture-workflow.sh https://example.com ./output\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:15:21.273Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated browser interactions and DOM element manipulation.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化浏览器交互和DOM元素操作的AI代理。","ja":"自動化ブラウザの操作とDOMエレメント操作が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 브라우저 상호작용 및 DOM 요소 조작이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan interacciones de navegador automatizadas y manipulación de elementos DOM.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''interactions de navigateur automatisées et de manipulation d''éléments DOM.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die automatisierte Browser-Interaktionen und DOM-Element-Manipulation benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que necessitam de interações automatizadas com o navegador e manipulação de elementos DOM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым требуется автоматизированное взаимодействие с браузером и манипулирование элементами DOM.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تفاعلات متصفح مؤتمتة ومعالجة عناصر DOM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser workflows using GitHub Pages deployment, leveraging protocols like HTTP and HTML element references like @e1, @e2, allowing for seamless navigation, snapshotting, and interaction with web pages.","zh":"赋予代理自动化浏览器工作流的能力，使用GitHub Pages部署，利用HTTP等协议和@e1、@e2等HTML元素引用，实现无缝导航、快照和网页交互。","ja":"GitHub Pagesの展開を使用して、HTTPや@e1、@e2などのHTML要素参照などのプロトコルを活用し、エージェントにブラウザのワークフローを自動化する能力を付与し、シームレスなナビゲーション、スナップショット、ウェブページとの相互作用を実現します。","ko":"GitHub Pages 배포를 사용하여 HTTP 및 @e1, @e2와 같은 HTML 요소 참조와 같은 프로토콜을 활용하여 에이전트가 브라우저 워크플로우를 자동화하는 기능을 부여하여 무결점 탐색, 스냅샷 및 웹 페이지와의 상호 작용을实现합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo del navegador utilizando la implementación de GitHub Pages, aprovechando protocolos como HTTP y referencias de elementos HTML como @e1, @e2, lo que permite una navegación, instantánea y interacción con páginas web sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des flux de travail de navigateur automatisés en utilisant le déploiement GitHub Pages, en exploitant des protocoles comme HTTP et des références d''éléments HTML comme @e1, @e2, permettant ainsi une navigation, une capture d''écran et une interaction avec les pages web sans heurts.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Browser-Workflows mithilfe der GitHub Pages-Implementierung zu automatisieren, indem Protokolle wie HTTP und HTML-Element-Referenzen wie @e1, @e2 genutzt werden, was eine nahtlose Navigation, Momentaufnahme und Interaktion mit Webseiten ermöglicht.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho do navegador usando a implantação do GitHub Pages, aproveitando protocolos como HTTP e referências de elementos HTML como @e1, @e2, permitindo uma navegação, captura de instantâneos e interação perfeitas com páginas da web.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать рабочие процессы в браузере с использованием развертывания GitHub Pages, используя такие протоколы, как HTTP, и ссылки на HTML-элементы, такие как @e1, @e2, что обеспечивает беспрепятственную навигацию, создание снимков и взаимодействие с веб-страницами.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من أتمتة سير عمل المتصفح باستخدام النشر على GitHub Pages، والاستفادة من بروتوكولات مثل HTTP ومراجع عناصر HTML مثل @e1 و @e2، مما يسمح بالتنقل السلس، والتقاط اللقطات، والتفاعل مع صفحات الويب."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating form submissions on web pages","Debugging browser-based applications using snapshot references","Interacting with dynamic web content using element refs"],"zh":["在网页上自动提交表单","使用快照引用调试基于浏览器的应用程序","使用元素引用与动态网页内容交互"],"ja":["ウェブページでのフォームの自動送信","スナップショット参照を使用したブラウザベースのアプリケーションのデバッグ","エレメント参照を使用した動的ウェブコンテンツとの相互作用"],"ko":["웹 페이지에서 양식을 자동 제출","스냅샷 참조를 사용하여 브라우저 기반 애플리케이션 디버깅","요소 참조를 사용하여 동적 웹 콘텐츠와 상호 작용"],"es":["Automatización de envíos de formularios en páginas web","Depuración de aplicaciones basadas en navegador utilizando referencias de instantáneas","Interacción con contenido web dinámico utilizando referencias de elementos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la soumission de formulaires sur des pages web","Débogage d''applications basées sur navigateur en utilisant des références d''instantanés","Interaction avec du contenu web dynamique en utilisant des références d''éléments"],"de":["Automatisierung von Formulareingaben auf Webseiten","Fehlerbehebung von browserbasierten Anwendungen unter Verwendung von Schnappschuss-Referenzen","Interaktion mit dynamischem Web-Inhalt unter Verwendung von Element-Referenzen"],"pt":["Automatização de envios de formulários em páginas da web","Depuração de aplicações baseadas em navegador usando referências de instantâneos","Interação com conteúdo web dinâmico usando referências de elementos"],"ru":["Автоматизация отправки форм на веб-страницах","Отладка браузерных приложений с использованием ссылок на снимки","Взаимодействие с динамическим веб-контентом с использованием ссылок на элементы"],"ar":["أتمتة تقديم النماذج على صفحات الويب","تصحيح تطبيقات المستندة إلى المتصفح باستخدام مراجع اللقطات","التفاعل مع محتوى الويب الديناميكي باستخدام مراجع العناصر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Pages deployment","Limited to browser automation workflows"],"zh":["需要GitHub Pages部署","仅限于浏览器自动化工作流"],"ja":["GitHub Pagesの展開が必要","ブラウザの自動化ワークフローに限定"],"ko":["GitHub Pages 배포가 필요","브라우저 자동화 워크플로우에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere implementación de GitHub Pages","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de automatización de navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite un déploiement GitHub Pages","Limité aux flux de travail d''automatisation de navigateur"],"de":["Erfordert GitHub Pages-Implementierung","Begrenzt auf Browser-Automatisierungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Requer implantação no GitHub Pages","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de automação de navegador"],"ru":["Требуется развертывание на GitHub Pages","Ограничено рабочими процессами автоматизации браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب النشر على GitHub Pages","يقتصر على سير عمل أتمتة المتصفح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
