":"Depuração Sistemática: 4 Fases para Resolver Problemas","ru":"Системная отладка: 4-фазный процесс решения проблем","ar":"التصحيح المنهجي: 4 مراحل لحل المشكلات","en":"systematic-debugging"},"description":{"zh":"系统化调试技能提供结构化调试方法，确保在解决问题前充分理解问题。通过4阶段流程避免随机猜测，提高调试效率和准确性。","ja":"システマティックデバッグは構造化されたアプローチを提供し、問題解決前に適切に理解することを保証します。4段階プロセスで推測を排除し、効率を向上させます。","ko":"체계적인 디버깅은 문제를 해결하기 전에 완전히 이해하도록 보장하는 구조화된 접근법을 제공합니다. 4단계 프로セス로 무작위 추측을 방지하고 효율성을 높입니다.","es":"El depuración sistemática es un enfoque estructurado que impide las conjeturas aleatorias y garantiza que los problemas se entiendan correctamente antes de r...","fr":"Le débogage systématique est une approche structurée qui empêche les devinettes aléatoires et garantit que les problèmes soient correctement compris avant d''...","de":"Die systematische Fehlersuche ist ein strukturierter Ansatz, der zufällige Raten verhindert und sicherstellt, dass Probleme richtig verstanden werden, bevor ...","pt":"A depuração sistemática é uma abordagem estruturada para resolver problemas, evitando palpites aleatórios e garantindo que os problemas sejam bem compreendid...","ru":"Системная отладка - это структурированный подход к решению проблем, исключающий случайные догадки и гарантирующий, что проблемы правильно поняты прежде, чем ...","ar":"التصحيح المنهجي هو نهج منظم لحل المشكلات، يمنع التخمين العشوائي ويكفل فهم المشكلات جيدًا قبل حلها","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["4阶段结构化调试流程","问题重现方法与步骤记录","重现率评估标准","避免盲目猜测的系统化方法","预期结果与实际结果对比分析","问题理解优先于解决方案"],"ja":["4段階の構造化デバッグプロセス","問題再現方法とステップ記録","再現率評価基準","推測を排除するシステムアプローチ","期待結果と実際の結果の比較分析","解決策より問題理解を優先"],"ko":["4단계 구조화된 디버깅 프로세스","문제 재현 방법 및 단계 기록","재현률 평가 기준","추측을 배제하는 체계적 접근법","예상 결과와 실제 결과 비교 분석","해결책보다 문제 이해 우선"],"es":["Enfoque estructurado de 4 fases","Reproducción confiable del problema","Análisis detallado del problema","Solución y verificación efectivas","Reducción de conjeturas aleatorias"],"fr":["Approche structurée en 4 phases","Reproduction fiable du problème","Analyse détaillée du problème","Solution et vérification efficaces","Réduction des devinettes aléatoires"],"de":["Strukturierter 4-Phasen-Ansatz","Zuverlässige Reproduktion des Problems","Detaillierte Analyse des Problems","Effektive Lösung und Überprüfung","Reduzierung zufälliger Raten"],"pt":["4 fases de depuração","Reprodução do problema","Análise do problema","Resolução do problema"],"ru":["4 фазы отладки","Воспроизведение проблемы","Анализ проблемы","Решение проблемы"],"ar":["4 مراحل تصحيح","إعادة إنتاج المشكلة","تحليل المشكلة","حل المشكلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["系统化调试方法","开发调试技巧","问题重现步骤","调试最佳实践","结构化故障排除","软件开发调试","代码调试流程","重现率评估"],"ja":["システマティックデバッグ","開発デバッグ技術","問題再現ステップ","デバッグベストプラクティス","構造化トラブルシューティング","ソフトウェア開発デバッグ","コードデバッグプロセス","再現率評価"],"ko":["체계적 디버깅","개발 디버깅 기술","문제 재현 단계","디버깅 최적 방법","구조화된 문제 해결","소프트웨어 개발 디버깅","코드 디버깅 프로세스","재현률 평가"],"es":["depuración sistemática","enfoque estructurado","reproducción de problemas","análisis de problemas","solución de problemas","verificación de problemas","debugging","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["débogage systématique","approche structurée","reproduction de problèmes","analyse de problèmes","solution de problèmes","vérification de problèmes","debugging","développement de logiciels"],"de":["systematische Fehlersuche","strukturierter Ansatz","Reproduktion von Problemen","Analyse von Problemen","Lösung von Problemen","Überprüfung von Problemen","debugging","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["depuração sistemática","resolução de problemas","análise de problemas","desenvolvimento de software","técnica de depuração","melhoria de processo"],"ru":["системная отладка","решение проблем","анализ проблем","разработка программного обеспечения","техника отладки","усовершенствование процесса"],"ar":["التصحيح المنهجي","حل المشكلات","تحليل المشكلات","تطوير البرمجيات","تقنية التصحيح","تحسين العملية"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"systematic-debugging","description":"4-phase systematic debugging methodology with root cause analysis and evidence-based verification. Use when debugging complex issues.","bodyPreview":"# Systematic Debugging\n\n> Source: obra/superpowers\n\n## Overview\nThis skill provides a structured approach to debugging that prevents random guessing and ensures problems are properly understood before solving.\n\n## 4-Phase Debugging Process\n\n### Phase 1: Reproduce\nBefore fixing, reliably reproduce the issue.\n\n```markdown\n## Reproduction Steps\n1. [Exact step to reproduce]\n2. [Next step]\n3. [Expected vs actual result]\n\n## Reproduction Rate\n- [ ] Always (100%)\n- [ ] Often (50-90%)\n- [ ] Sometimes (1","body":"# Systematic Debugging\n\n> Source: obra/superpowers\n\n## Overview\nThis skill provides a structured approach to debugging that prevents random guessing and ensures problems are properly understood before solving.\n\n## 4-Phase Debugging Process\n\n### Phase 1: Reproduce\nBefore fixing, reliably reproduce the issue.\n\n```markdown\n## Reproduction Steps\n1. [Exact step to reproduce]\n2. [Next step]\n3. [Expected vs actual result]\n\n## Reproduction Rate\n- [ ] Always (100%)\n- [ ] Often (50-90%)\n- [ ] Sometimes (10-50%)\n- [ ] Rare (<10%)\n```\n\n### Phase 2: Isolate\nNarrow down the source.\n\n```markdown\n## Isolation Questions\n- When did this start happening?\n- What changed recently?\n- Does it happen in all environments?\n- Can we reproduce with minimal code?\n- What''s the smallest change that triggers it?\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Understand\nFind the root cause, not just symptoms.\n\n```markdown\n## Root Cause Analysis\n### The 5 Whys\n1. Why: [First observation]\n2. Why: [Deeper reason]\n3. Why: [Still deeper]\n4. Why: [Getting closer]\n5. Why: [Root cause]\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Fix & Verify\nFix and verify it''s truly fixed.\n\n```markdown\n## Fix Verification\n- [ ] Bug no longer reproduces\n- [ ] Related functionality still works\n- [ ] No new issues introduced\n- [ ] Test added to prevent regression\n```\n\n## Debugging Checklist\n\n```markdown\n## Before Starting\n- [ ] Can reproduce consistently\n- [ ] Have minimal reproduction case\n- [ ] Understand expected behavior\n\n## During Investigation\n- [ ] Check recent changes (git log)\n- [ ] Check logs for errors\n- [ ] Add logging if needed\n- [ ] Use debugger/breakpoints\n\n## After Fix\n- [ ] Root cause documented\n- [ ] Fix verified\n- [ ] Regression test added\n- [ ] Similar code checked\n```\n\n## Common Debugging Commands\n\n```bash\n# Recent changes\ngit log --oneline -20\ngit diff HEAD~5\n\n# Search for pattern\ngrep -r \"errorPattern\" --include=\"*.ts\"\n\n# Check logs\npm2 logs app-name --err --lines 100\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n❌ **Random changes** - \"Maybe if I change this...\"\n❌ **Ignoring evidence** - \"That can''t be the cause\"\n❌ **Assuming** - \"It must be X\" without proof\n❌ **Not reproducing first** - Fixing blindly\n❌ **Stopping at symptoms** - Not finding root cause\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:15:21.160Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Debugging Agents that require a structured approach to identifying and resolving issues using a 4-Phase Debugging Process","zh":"Ideal for Debugging Agents that require a structured approach to identifying and resolving issues using a 4-Phase Debugging Process","ja":"Ideal for Debugging Agents that require a structured approach to identifying and resolving issues using a 4-Phase Debugging Process","ko":"Ideal for Debugging Agents that require a structured approach to identifying and resolving issues using a 4-Phase Debugging Process","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Depuración que requieren un enfoque estructurado para identificar y resolver problemas utilizando un Proceso de Depuración de 4 fases","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Débogage qui nécessitent une approche structurée pour identifier et résoudre les problèmes en utilisant un Processus de Débogage en 4 phases","de":"Ideal für Debugging-Agenten, die einen strukturierten Ansatz zur Identifizierung und Lösung von Problemen unter Verwendung eines 4-Phasen-Debugging-Prozesses erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de depuração que exigem uma abordagem estruturada para identificar e resolver problemas utilizando um Processo de Depuração em 4 Fases","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов отладки, требующих структурированного подхода к выявлению и решению проблем с использованием 4-фазного процесса отладки","ar":"مثالي لعميل تصحيح الأخطاء الذي يتطلب نهجًا منظمًا لتحديد ومعالجة المشكلات باستخدام عملية تصحيح الأخطاء في 4 مراحل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically reproduce issues, ensuring problems are properly understood before solving, utilizing techniques such as reproduction steps and reproduction rates to guarantee reliable debugging","zh":"Empowers agents to systematically reproduce issues, ensuring problems are properly understood before solving, utilizing techniques such as reproduction steps and reproduction rates to guarantee reliable debugging","ja":"Empowers agents to systematically reproduce issues, ensuring problems are properly understood before solving, utilizing techniques such as reproduction steps and reproduction rates to guarantee reliable debugging","ko":"Empowers agents to systematically reproduce issues, ensuring problems are properly understood before solving, utilizing techniques such as reproduction steps and reproduction rates to guarantee reliable debugging","es":"Permite a los agentes reproducir sistemáticamente los problemas, asegurando que los problemas se entiendan adecuadamente antes de resolverlos, utilizando técnicas como pasos de reproducción y tasas de reproducción para garantizar una depuración confiable","fr":"Permet aux agents de reproduire systématiquement les problèmes, en s''assurant que les problèmes soient bien compris avant d''être résolus, en utilisant des techniques telles que les étapes de reproduction et les taux de reproduction pour garantir un débogage fiable","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Probleme systematisch zu reproduzieren, damit sichergestellt wird, dass die Probleme vor der Lösung ordnungsgemäß verstanden werden, unter Verwendung von Techniken wie Reproduktionsschritten und Reproduktionsraten, um eine zuverlässige Fehlersuche zu gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a reproduzir sistematicamente os problemas, garantindo que os problemas sejam compreendidos corretamente antes de serem resolvidos, utilizando técnicas como etapas de reprodução e taxas de reprodução para garantir uma depuração confiável","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически воспроизводить проблемы, гарантируя, что проблемы правильно понимаемы до их решения, используя методы, такие как шаги воспроизведения и показатели воспроизведения, для обеспечения надежной отладки","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إعادة إنتاج المشكلات بشكل منهجي، مما يضمن فهم المشكلات بشكل صحيح قبل حلها، باستخدام تقنيات مثل خطوات الإعادة وإحصاءات الإعادة لضمان تصحيح أخطاء موثوق"},"useCases":{"en":["Reproducing complex errors","Debugging intermittent issues","Documenting reproducible steps for team collaboration"],"zh":["Reproducing complex errors","Debugging intermittent issues","Documenting reproducible steps for team collaboration"],"ja":["Reproducing complex errors","Debugging intermittent issues","Documenting reproducible steps for team collaboration"],"ko":["Reproducing complex errors","Debugging intermittent issues","Documenting reproducible steps for team collaboration"],"es":["Reproducir errores complejos","Depurar problemas intermitentes","Documentar pasos reproducibles para la colaboración en equipo"],"fr":["Reproduire des erreurs complexes","Déboguer des problèmes intermittents","Documenter les étapes reproductibles pour la collaboration d''équipe"],"de":["Komplexe Fehler reproduzieren","Intermittierende Probleme debuggen","Reproduzierbare Schritte für die Teamzusammenarbeit dokumentieren"],"pt":["Reproduzir erros complexos","Depurar problemas intermitentes","Documentar etapas reprodutíveis para colaboração em equipe"],"ru":["Воспроизведение сложных ошибок","Отладка интермиттирующих проблем","Документирование воспроизводимых шагов для командного сотрудничества"],"ar":["إعادة إنتاج الأخطاء المعقدة","تصحيح الأخطاء المتقطعة","توثيق خطوات الإعادة للتعاون الفريق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires meticulous record-keeping","May not be effective for extremely rare or non-reproducible issues"],"zh":["Requires meticulous record-keeping","May not be effective for extremely rare or non-reproducible issues"],"ja":["Requires meticulous record-keeping","May not be effective for extremely rare or non-reproducible issues"],"ko":["Requires meticulous record-keeping","May not be effective for extremely rare or non-reproducible issues"],"es":["Requiere un registro meticuloso","Puede no ser eficaz para problemas extremadamente raros o no reproducibles"],"fr":["Nécessite une tenue de registre minutieuse","Peut ne pas être efficace pour les problèmes extrêmement rares ou non reproductibles"],"de":["Erfordert eine sorgfältige Aufzeichnung","Kann für extrem seltene oder nicht reproduzierbare Probleme nicht wirksam sein"],"pt":["Exige um registro minucioso","Pode não ser eficaz para problemas extremamente raros ou não reprodutíveis"],"ru":["Требует тщательного учета","Может быть неэффективным для чрезвычайно редких или нерепродуцируемых проблем"],"ar":["يتطلب تسجيلًا دقيقًا","قد لا يكون فعالًا لمشكلات نادرة جدًا أو غير قابلة لإعادة الإنتاج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
