uthoring guidelines, and utilizing protocols like those outlined in https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt for broader context.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes Convex autocontenidos y reutilizables con exportaciones y gestión de dependencias, aprovechando la documentación de Convex y las directrices de autoría de componentes, y utilizando protocolos como los descritos en https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt para un contexto más amplio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants Convex autocontenus et réutilisables avec des exportations et une gestion des dépendances, en exploitant la documentation Convex et les directives d''écriture de composants, et en utilisant des protocoles tels que ceux décrits dans https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt pour un contexte plus large.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, selbstenthaltene und wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten mit Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung zu erstellen, indem sie die Convex-Dokumentation und die Richtlinien für die Erstellung von Komponenten nutzen und Protokolle wie die in https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt beschriebenen für einen breiteren Kontext verwenden.","pt":"Empowers agents to create self-contained, reusable Convex components with exports and dependency management, leveraging the Convex documentation and component authoring guidelines, and utilizing protocols like those outlined in https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt for broader context.","ru":"Empowers agents to create self-contained, reusable Convex components with exports and dependency management, leveraging the Convex documentation and component authoring guidelines, and utilizing protocols like those outlined in https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt for broader context.","ar":"Empowers agents to create self-contained, reusable Convex components with exports and dependency management, leveraging the Convex documentation and component authoring guidelines, and utilizing protocols like those outlined in https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt for broader context."},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring reusable Convex components for sharing across projects","Managing dependencies and exports for self-contained components","Debugging Convex component implementations using the latest documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/components"],"zh":["Authoring reusable Convex components for sharing across projects","Managing dependencies and exports for self-contained components","Debugging Convex component implementations using the latest documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/components"],"ja":["Authoring reusable Convex components for sharing across projects","Managing dependencies and exports for self-contained components","Debugging Convex component implementations using the latest documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/components"],"ko":["Authoring reusable Convex components for sharing across projects","Managing dependencies and exports for self-contained components","Debugging Convex component implementations using the latest documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/components"],"es":["Creación de componentes Convex reutilizables para compartir en varios proyectos","Gestión de dependencias y exportaciones para componentes autocontenidos","Depuración de implementaciones de componentes Convex utilizando la última documentación de https://docs.convex.dev/components"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex réutilisables pour partager entre plusieurs projets","Gestion des dépendances et des exportations pour des composants autocontenus","Débogage des implémentations de composants Convex en utilisant la dernière documentation de https://docs.convex.dev/components"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Convex-Komponenten zur gemeinsamen Nutzung in verschiedenen Projekten","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten und Exporten für selbstenthaltene Komponenten","Fehlerbehebung bei der Implementierung von Convex-Komponenten unter Verwendung der neuesten Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/components"],"pt":["Authoring reusable