cciones","compatibilidad lingüística","formatos de fecha y hora","conjuntos de caracteres"],"fr":["i18n","internationalisation","traductions","développement de logiciels","gestion des traductions","compatibilité linguistique","formats de date et d''heure","jeux de caractères"],"de":["i18n","Internationalisierung","Übersetzungen","Software-Entwicklung","Verwaltung von Übersetzungen","Sprachkompatibilität","Datums- und Zeitformate","Zeichensätze"],"pt":["i18n","internacionalização","desenvolvimento de software","tradução","compatibilidade","regiões","idiomas"],"ru":["i18n","интернационализация","разработка программного обеспечения","перевод","совместимость","регионы","языки"],"ar":["i18n","التدويل","تطوير البرمجيات","ترجمة","توافق","مناطق","لغات"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"i18n","description":"Internationalization and translation management. Use when adding translations, displaying text, handling locales, or managing translation keys. NEVER modify auto-generated translation files. Triggers on i18n, translation, locale, formatMessage, useIntl, ETranslations, text, string, hardcode, intl, translate, language, localization, internationalization.","bodyPreview":"# Internationalization (i18n)\n\nGuidelines for internationalization and translation management.\n\n## Critical Restrictions\n\n**ABSOLUTELY FORBIDDEN** (auto-generated files):\n```typescript\n// ❌ NEVER modify auto-generated translation files\n// These are typically generated from a translation management system\n\n// ❌ NEVER hardcode text strings\n<Text>Confirm</Text>\n\n// ✅ CORRECT - Always use translation keys\nimport { ETranslations } from ''@{scope}/shared/src/locale'';\nintl.formatMessage({ id: ETranslati","body":"# Internationalization (i18n)\n\nGuidelines for internationalization and translation management.\n\n## Critical Restrictions\n\n**ABSOLUTELY FORBIDDEN** (auto-generated files):\n```typescript\n// ❌ NEVER modify auto-generated translation files\n// These are typically generated from a translation management system\n\n// ❌ NEVER hardcode text strings\n<Text>Confirm</Text>\n\n// ✅ CORRECT - Always use translation keys\nimport { ETranslations } from ''@{scope}/shared/src/locale'';\nintl.formatMessage({ id: ETranslations.global__confirm })\n```\n\n**Consequences of violation:**\n- Translation system corruption\n- Loss of translation work\n- Build failures in i18n pipeline\n- Breaking localization for international users\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Using Translations in Components\n```typescript\nimport { useIntl } from ''react-intl'';\nimport { ETranslations } from ''@{scope}/shared/src/locale'';\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  const intl = useIntl();\n\n  return (\n    <Text>\n      {intl.formatMessage({ id: ETranslations.global__confirm })}\n    </Text>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Using formatMessage Outside Components\n```typescript\nimport { appLocale } from ''@{scope}/shared/src/locale/appLocale'';\nimport { ETranslations } from ''@{scope}/shared/src/locale'';\n\nconst message = appLocale.intl.formatMessage({\n  id: ETranslations.global__cancel,\n});\n```\n\n## Translation Workflow\n\n1. **Design provides translation key** like `prime::restore_purchases`\n2. **Run sync command**: `yarn fetch:locale`\n3. **Convert key format**: `prime::restore_purchases` → `ETranslations.prime_restore_purchases`\n4. **Use in code**:\n   ```tsx\n   {intl.formatMessage({ id: ETranslations.prime_restore_purchases })}\n   ```\n\n## Translation Key Naming Pattern\n\n```\nnamespace__action_description\n\nExamples:\n- global__confirm\n- global__cancel\n- swap__select_token\n- wallet__create_wallet\n- settings__dark_mode\n```\n\n## Detailed Guide\n\nFor comprehensive i18n guidelines and examples, see [i18n.md](references/rules/i18n.md).\n\nTopics covered:\n- Translation management restrictions\n- Using translations in components\n- Translation key naming conventions\n- Locale handling and fallbacks\n- Code examples\n- Workflow summary\n\n## Key Files (Example Structure)\n\n| Purpose | File Path |\n|---------|-----------|\n| Translation enum | `packages/shared/src/locale/enum/translations.ts` |\n| Locale JSON files | `packages/shared/src/locale/json/` |\n| App locale | `packages/shared/src/locale/appLocale.ts` |\n| Default locale | `packages/shared/src/locale/getDefaultLocale.ts` |\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `/date-formatting` - Date formatting with locale support\n- `/coding-patterns` - General coding patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:15:56.037Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multilingual AI Agents needing advanced internationalization and translation management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级国际化和翻译管理功能的多语言AI代理。","ja":"高度な国際化と翻訳管理機能を必要とするマルチリンガルAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 국제화 및 번역 관리 기능이 필요한 다국어 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Multilingual AI Agents needing advanced internationalization and translation management capabilities.","fr":"Perfect for Multilingual AI Agents needing advanced internationalization and translation management capabilities.","de":"Perfect for Multilingual AI Agents needing advanced internationalization and translation management capabilities.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Multilíngues que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de internacionalização e gerenciamento de traduções.","ru":"Идеально для многоязычных агентов ИИ, которым необходимы расширенные возможности интернационализации и управления переводами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتعددة اللغات الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة للتوحيد والتحرير الإدارة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage translations efficiently using translation keys andintl.formatMessage, ensuring seamless integration with translation management systems and support for various locales.","zh":"赋予代理高效管理翻译的能力，使用翻译密钥和intl.formatMessage，确保与翻译管理系统的无缝集成，并支持各种地域。","ja":"エージェントが翻訳を効率的に管理できるようにし、翻訳キーとintl.formatMessageを使用して、翻訳管理システムとのシームレスな統合とさまざまなロケールのサポートを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 翻訳 키와 intl.formatMessage를 사용하여 효율적으로 번역을 관리할 수 있도록 하여, 번역 관리 시스템과의 無縫な 統合 및 다양한 로케일의 지원을 보장합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to manage translations efficiently using translation keys andintl.formatMessage, ensuring seamless integration with translation management systems and support for various locales.","fr":"Empowers agents to manage translations efficiently using translation keys andintl.formatMessage, ensuring seamless integration with translation management systems and support for various locales.","de":"Empowers agents to manage translations efficiently using translation keys andintl.formatMessage, ensuring seamless integration with translation management systems and support for various locales.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar traduções de forma eficiente usando chaves de tradução e intl.formatMessage, garantindo uma integração perfeita com sistemas de gerenciamento de traduções e suporte a vários locais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять переводами с помощью ключей перевода и intl.formatMessage, обеспечивая бесперебойную интеграцию с системами управления переводами и поддержку различных локалей.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الترجمات بفعالية باستخدام مفاتيح الترجمة و intl.formatMessage، مما يضمن التكامل السلس مع أنظمة إدارة الترجمة ودعم اللغات المختلفة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating translation file generation","Generating locale-specific content using intl.formatMessage","Debugging hardcoded text strings to ensure i18n compliance"],"zh":["自动化翻译文件生成","使用intl.formatMessage生成地域特定内容","调试硬编码文本字符串以确保i18n合规性"],"ja":["翻訳ファイルの自動生成","intl.formatMessageを使用してロケール固有のコンテンツを生成する","ハードコーディングされたテキスト文字列をデバッグしてi18nの準拠を確保する"],"ko":["자동으로 번역 파일 생성하기","intl.formatMessage를 사용하여 로케일별 콘텐츠 생성하기","하드코딩된 텍스트 문자열 디버깅하여 i18n 규정 준수 보장하기"],"es":["Automating translation file generation","Generating locale-specific content using intl.formatMessage","Debugging hardcoded text strings to ensure i18n compliance"],"fr":["Automating translation file generation","Generating locale-specific content using intl.formatMessage","Debugging hardcoded text strings to ensure i18n compliance"],"de":["Automating translation file generation","Generating locale-specific content using intl.formatMessage","Debugging hardcoded text strings to ensure i18n compliance"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de arquivos de tradução","Gerar conteúdo específico do local usando intl.formatMessage","Depurar strings de texto hardcoded para garantir a conformidade com i18n"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию файлов перевода","Генерировать контент, специфичный для локали, с помощью intl.formatMessage","Отлаживать жёстко закодированные текстовые строки для обеспечения соответствия i18n"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء ملفات الترجمة","إنشاء محتوى محدد للموقع باستخدام intl.formatMessage","تصحيح الأخطاء في السلاسل النصية المكوّدة بشكل صلب لضمان امتثال i18n"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to critical restrictions, such as not modifying auto-generated translation files","Must use translation keys instead of hardcoding text strings"],"zh":["需要遵守关键限制，例如不修改自动生成的翻译文件","必须使用翻译密钥代替硬编码文本字符串"],"ja":["重要な制限に従う必要があります。たとえば、自動生成された翻訳ファイルを変更しないことなど","ハードコーディングされたテキスト文字列の代わりに翻訳キーを使用する必要があります"],"ko":["중요한 제약을 준수해야 함. 예를 들어 자동 생성된 번역 파일을 수정하지 않음","하드코딩된 텍스트 문자열 대신 번역 키를 사용해야 함"],"es":["Requires adherence to critical restrictions, such as not modifying auto-generated translation files","Must use translation keys instead of hardcoding text strings"],"fr":["Requires adherence to critical restrictions, such as not modifying auto-generated translation files","Must use translation keys instead of hardcoding text strings"],"de":["Requires adherence to critical restrictions, such as not modifying auto-generated translation files","Must use translation keys instead of hardcoding text strings"],"pt":["Exige a adesão a restrições críticas, como não modificar arquivos de tradução auto-gerados","Deve usar chaves de tradução em vez de strings de texto hardcoded"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения критических ограничений, таких как не изменять автоматически сгенерированные файлы перевода","Должно использовать ключи перевода вместо жёстко закодированных текстовых строк"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام bằngقيود حرجة، مثل عدم تعديل ملفات الترجمة المُنشأة تلقائيًا","يجب استخدام مفاتيح الترجمة بدلاً من السلاسل النصية المُكوّدة بشكل صلب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-backend-api', 'community', 'weunica', 'payboxCLI-App', 'weunica/payboxCLI-App', 'wix-cli-backend-api', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z', '2026-02-18T12:16:37.417Z', NULL, '{"id":"weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-backend-api","name":"wix-cli-backend-api","description":{"es":"Wix Backend API Builder crea endpoints HTTP para aplicaciones Wix CLI, procesando datos y devolviendo respuestas","fr":"Wix Backend API Builder crée des points de terminaison HTTP pour les applications Wix CLI, traitant les données et renvoyant des réponses","de":"Wix Backend API Builder erstellt HTTP-Endpunkte für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen, verarbeitet Daten und gibt Antworten zurück","pt":"O Wix Backend API Builder cria endpoints HTTP para aplicações Wix CLI, permitindo processar dados e retornar respostas. Os endpoints são alimentados por Astro endpoints e são descobertos automaticamente a partir do sistema de arquivos.","ru":"Wix Backend API Builder создает HTTP-эндпоинты для приложений Wix CLI, позволяя обрабатывать данные и возвращать ответы. Эндпоинты работают на основе Astro endpoints и автоматически обнаруживаются из файловой системы.","ar":"يُنشئ Wix Backend API Builder نهايات HTTP لبرامج Wix CLI، مما يسمح بمعالجة البيانات وإرجاع الردود. تعمل النهايات على أساس Astro endpoints ويكشف عنها تلقائيًا من نظام الملفات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Wix CLI Backend API: Crea endpoints HTTP","fr":"Wix CLI Backend API : Créez des points de terminaison HTTP","de":"Wix CLI Backend API: Erstelle HTTP-Endpunkte","pt":"Wix CLI Backend API: Construa Endpoints HTTP","ru":"Wix CLI Backend API: Создание HTTP-эндпоинтов","ar":"وكس سي إل آي باك إند أпи: بناء نهايات HTTP","en":"wix-cli-backend-api"},"description":{"es":"Wix Backend API Builder crea endpoints HTTP para aplicaciones Wix CLI, procesando datos y devolviendo respuestas","fr":"Wix Backend API Builder crée des points de terminaison HTTP pour les applications Wix CLI, traitant les données et renvoyant des réponses","de":"Wix Backend API Builder erstellt HTTP-Endpunkte für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen, verarbeitet Daten und gibt Antworten zurück","pt":"O Wix Backend API Builder cria endpoints HTTP para aplicações Wix CLI, permitindo processar dados e retornar respostas. Os endpoints são alimentados por Astr...","ru":"Wix Backend API Builder создает HTTP-эндпоинты для приложений Wix CLI, позволяя обрабатывать данные и возвращать ответы. Эндпоинты работают на основе Astro e...","ar":"يُنشئ Wix Backend API Builder نهايات HTTP لبرامج Wix CLI، مما يسمح بمعالجة البيانات وإرجاع الردود. تعمل النهايات على أساس Astro endpoints ويكشف عنها تلقائيًا...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Crea endpoints HTTP para aplicaciones Wix CLI","Procesa datos y devuelve respuestas","Utiliza Astro endpoints","Archivos en src/pages/api/ con extensión .ts","No requiere registro de extensiones"],"fr":["Créez des points de terminaison HTTP pour les applications Wix CLI","Traite les données et renvoie des réponses","Utilise les points de terminaison Astro","Fichiers dans src/pages/api/ avec extension .ts","Nécessite pas d''enregistrement d''extensions"],"de":["Erstellt HTTP-Endpunkte für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen","Verarbeitet Daten und gibt Antworten zurück","Verwendet Astro-Endpunkte","Dateien in src/pages/api/ mit .ts-Erweiterung","Benötigt keine Registrierung von Erweiterungen"],"pt":["Criação de endpoints HTTP para aplicações Wix CLI","Processamento de dados e retorno de respostas","Integração com Astro endpoints","Descoberta automática de endpoints a partir do sistema de arquivos","Não requer registro de extensão"],"ru":["Создание HTTP-эндпоинтов для приложений Wix CLI","Обработка данных и возврат ответов","Интеграция с Astro endpoints","Автоматическое обнаружение эндпоинтов из файловой системы","Не требует регистрации расширения"],"ar":["إنشاء نهايات HTTP لبرامج Wix CLI","معالجة البيانات وإرجاع الردود","التكامل مع Astro endpoints","اكتشاف تلقائي لنهايات HTTP من نظام الملفات","لا يتطلب تسجيل الإضافة"]},"keywords":{"es":["Wix CLI","Backend API","endpoints HTTP","Astro endpoints","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Wix API","API de backend"],"fr":["Wix CLI","Backend API","points de terminaison HTTP","points de terminaison Astro","développement d''applications","Wix API","API de backend"],"de":["Wix CLI","Backend API","HTTP-Endpunkte","Astro-Endpunkte","Anwendungsentwicklung","Wix API","Backend-API"],"pt":["Wix CLI","Backend API","Endpoints HTTP","Astro endpoints","Desenvolvimento de aplicações Wix","API Wix","Wix Backend API Builder"],"ru":["Wix CLI","Backend API","HTTP-эндпоинты","Astro endpoints","Разработка приложений Wix","API Wix","Wix Backend API Builder"],"ar":["وكس سي إل آي","باك إند أпи","نهايات HTTP","Astro endpoints","تطوير برامج Wix","API Wix","وكس باك إند أпи بيلدر"]}},"owner":"weunica","repo":"payboxCLI-App","repoPath":"weunica/payboxCLI-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wix-cli-backend-api","description":"Creates HTTP endpoints for Wix CLI apps. Use only when the user specifically asks for a backend endpoint. Use when building REST API endpoints, backend HTTP handlers, or server-side logic. Triggers include backend API, HTTP endpoint, HTTP methods, form handling, file uploads.","bodyPreview":"# Wix Backend API Builder\n\nCreates HTTP endpoints for Wix CLI applications — server-side routes that handle HTTP requests, process data, and return responses. HTTP endpoints are powered by Astro endpoints and are automatically discovered from the file system.\n\n**Key facts:**\n\n- Files live in `src/pages/api/` with `.ts` extension\n- Cannot be added via `npm run generate` — create files directly\n- Don''t appear on the Extensions page in the app dashboard\n- No extension registration needed (auto-disc","body":"# Wix Backend API Builder\n\nCreates HTTP endpoints for Wix CLI applications — server-side routes that handle HTTP requests, process data, and return responses. HTTP endpoints are powered by Astro endpoints and are automatically discovered from the file system.\n\n**Key facts:**\n\n- Files live in `src/pages/api/` with `.ts` extension\n- Cannot be added via `npm run generate` — create files directly\n- Don''t appear on the Extensions page in the app dashboard\n- No extension registration needed (auto-discovered)\n- Replace the legacy \"HTTP functions\" from the previous Wix CLI for Apps\n\n## Use Cases\n\nUse HTTP endpoints when you need to:\n\n- Build REST APIs with multiple HTTP methods\n- Integrate with external APIs or services\n- Handle complex form submissions or file uploads\n- Serve dynamic content (images, RSS feeds, personalized data)\n- Access runtime data or server-side databases\n\n## File Structure and Naming\n\n### Basic Endpoint\n\nFile path determines the endpoint URL:\n\n```\nsrc/pages/api/<your-endpoint-name>.ts\n```\n\n### Dynamic Routes\n\nUse square brackets for dynamic parameters:\n\n```\nsrc/pages/api/users/[id].ts → /api/users/:id\nsrc/pages/api/posts/[slug].ts → /api/posts/:slug\nsrc/pages/api/users/[userId]/posts/[postId].ts → /api/users/:userId/posts/:postId\n```\n\n## HTTP Methods\n\nExport named functions for each HTTP method. Type with `APIRoute` from `astro`. Each handler receives a `request` object and returns a `Response`:\n\n```typescript\nimport type { APIRoute } from \"astro\";\n\nexport const GET: APIRoute = async ({ request }) => {\n  console.log(\"Log from GET.\"); // This message logs to your CLI.\n  return new Response(\"Response from GET.\"); // This response is visible in the browser console\n};\n\nexport const POST: APIRoute = async ({ request }) => {\n  const data = await request.json();\n  console.log(\"Log POST with body: \", data); // This message logs to your CLI.\n  return new Response(JSON.stringify(data)); // This response is visible in the browser console.\n};\n```\n\n## Request Handling\n\n### Path Parameters\n\n```typescript\nexport const GET: APIRoute = async ({ params }) => {\n  const { id } = params; // From /api/users/[id]\n\n  if (!id) {\n    return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"ID required\" }), {\n      status: 400,\n      statusText: \"Bad Request\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Use id to fetch data\n};\n```\n\n### Query Parameters\n\nUse `new URL(request.url).searchParams`:\n\n```typescript\nexport const GET: APIRoute = async ({ request }) => {\n  const url = new URL(request.url);\n  const search = url.searchParams.get(\"search\");\n  const limit = parseInt(url.searchParams.get(\"limit\") || \"10\", 10);\n  const offset = parseInt(url.searchParams.get(\"offset\") || \"0\", 10);\n\n  // Use query parameters\n};\n```\n\n### Request Body\n\nParse JSON body from POST/PUT/PATCH requests:\n\n```typescript\nexport const POST: APIRoute = async ({ request }) => {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json();\n    const { title, content } = body;\n\n    if (!title || !content) {\n      return new Response(\n        JSON.stringify({ error: \"Title and content required\" }),\n        {\n          status: 400,\n          statusText: \"Bad Request\",\n          headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n        }\n      );\n    }\n\n    // Process data\n  } catch {\n    return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Invalid JSON\" }), {\n      status: 400,\n      statusText: \"Bad Request\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n    });\n  }\n};\n```\n\n### Headers\n\n```typescript\nconst authHeader = request.headers.get(\"Authorization\");\nconst contentType = request.headers.get(\"Content-Type\");\n```\n\n## Response Patterns\n\nAlways return a `Response` object with proper status codes and headers:\n\n```typescript\n// 200 OK\nreturn new Response(JSON.stringify({ data: result }), {\n  status: 200,\n  headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n});\n\n// 201 Created\nreturn new Response(JSON.stringify({ id: newId, ...data }), {\n  status: 201,\n  headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n});\n\n// 204 No Content (for DELETE)\nreturn new Response(null, { status: 204 });\n\n// 400 Bad Request\nreturn new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Invalid input\" }), {\n  status: 400,\n  statusText: \"Bad Request\",\n  headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n});\n\n// 404 Not Found\nreturn new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Not found\" }), {\n  status: 404,\n  statusText: \"Not Found\",\n  headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n});\n\n// 500 Internal Server Error\nreturn new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Internal server error\" }), {\n  status: 500,\n  statusText: \"Internal Server Error\",\n  headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n});\n```\n\n## Frontend Integration\n\nCall HTTP endpoints from frontend components using Wix''s built-in HTTP client (`httpClient.fetchWithAuth()`):\n\n```typescript\nimport { httpClient } from \"@wix/essentials\";\n\n// GET request\nconst baseApiUrl = new URL(import.meta.url).origin;\nconst res = await httpClient.fetchWithAuth(\n  `${baseApiUrl}/api/<your-endpoint-name>`,\n);\nconst data = await res.text();\n\n// POST request\nconst res = await httpClient.fetchWithAuth(\n  `${baseApiUrl}/api/<your-endpoint-name>`,\n  {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    body: JSON.stringify({ message: \"Hello from frontend\" }),\n  },\n);\nconst data = await res.json();\n```\n\n## Build, Deploy, and Delete\n\nTo take HTTP endpoints to production, build and release your project:\n\n1. Build the project assets using the [`build`](https://dev.wix.com/docs/wix-cli/command-reference/project-commands/build) command.\n2. Optionally create preview URLs using the [`preview`](https://dev.wix.com/docs/wix-cli/command-reference/project-commands/preview) command to share with team members for testing.\n3. Release your project using the [`release`](https://dev.wix.com/docs/wix-cli/command-reference/project-commands/release) command.\n\nOnce released, endpoints are accessible at production URLs and handle live traffic.\n\nTo delete an HTTP endpoint, remove the file under `src/pages/api/` and release again.\n\n## Output Structure\n\n```\nsrc/pages/api/\n├── users.ts              # /api/users endpoint\n├── users/\n│   └── [id].ts           # /api/users/:id endpoint\n└── posts.ts              # /api/posts endpoint\n```\n\n## Code Quality Requirements\n\n- Strict TypeScript (no `any`, explicit return types)\n- Type all handlers with `APIRoute` from `astro`\n- Always return `Response` objects with `JSON.stringify()` for JSON\n- Proper HTTP status codes (200, 201, 204, 400, 404, 500)\n- Include `Content-Type: application/json` header on JSON responses\n- Include `statusText` in error responses\n- Handle errors with try/catch blocks\n- Validate input parameters and request bodies\n- Use async/await for asynchronous operations\n- No `@ts-ignore` comments\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter implementation, use [wix-cli-app-validation](../wix-cli-app-validation/SKILL.md) to validate TypeScript compilation, build, preview, and runtime behavior.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:16:37.417Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing to create server-side routes for Wix CLI applications with Astro endpoints","zh":"非常适合需要为带有 Astro 端点的 Wix CLI 应用程序创建服务器端路由的全栈智能体","ja":"Astroエンドポイントを持つWix CLIアプリケーションのサーバーサイドルートを作成する必要があるフルスタックエージェントに最適です","ko":"Astro 엔드포인트가 있는 Wix CLI 애플리케이션을 위한 서버 측 경로를 생성해야 하는 풀 스택 에이전트에 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Full Stack que necesitan crear rutas del lado del servidor para aplicaciones de Wix CLI con puntos de conexión de Astro","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui ont besoin de créer des routes côté serveur pour les applications Wix CLI avec des points de terminaison Astro","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die Server-seitige Routen für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen mit Astro-Endpunkten erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam criar rotas do lado do servidor para aplicações Wix CLI com endpoints Astro","ru":"Идеально для агентов Full Stack, которым необходимо создавать серверные маршруты для приложений Wix CLI с конечными точками Astro","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرامج الكاملة الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مسارات على جانب الخادم لتطبيقات ويكس سي إل آي مع نقاط نهاية أسترو"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate HTTP endpoints for Wix CLI applications, leveraging Astro endpoints and automatic file system discovery, with support for TypeScript (.ts) files in the src/pages/api/ directory","zh":"赋能智能体为 Wix CLI 应用程序生成 HTTP 端点，利用 Astro 端点和自动文件系统发现功能，并支持 src/pages/api/ 目录中的 TypeScript (.ts) 文件","ja":"Astroエンドポイントと自動ファイルシステム検出を活用し、src/pages/api/ディレクトリ内のTypeScript（.ts）ファイルをサポートして、Wix CLIアプリケーションのHTTPエンドポイントを生成する機能をエージェントに提供します","ko":"Astro 엔드포인트와 자동 파일 시스템 검색을 활용하여 Wix CLI 애플리케이션을 위한 HTTP 엔드포인트를 생성할 수 있도록 지원하며, src/pages/api/ 디렉터리 내 TypeScript(.ts) 파일을 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar puntos de conexión HTTP para aplicaciones de Wix CLI, aprovechando los puntos de conexión de Astro y el descubrimiento automático del sistema de archivos, con soporte para archivos TypeScript (.ts) en el directorio src/pages/api/","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des points de terminaison HTTP pour les applications Wix CLI, en exploitant les points de terminaison Astro et la découverte automatique du système de fichiers, avec prise en charge des fichiers TypeScript (.ts) dans le répertoire src/pages/api/","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, HTTP-Endpunkte für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen zu generieren, indem sie Astro-Endpunkte und die automatische Dateisystemerkennung nutzen, mit Unterstützung für TypeScript-Dateien (.ts) im Verzeichnis src/pages/api/","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar pontos de extremidade HTTP para aplicações Wix CLI, utilizando pontos de extremidade Astro e descoberta automática do sistema de arquivos, com suporte a arquivos TypeScript (.ts) no diretório src/pages/api/","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать конечные точки HTTP для приложений Wix CLI, используя конечные точки Astro и автоматическое обнаружение файловой системы, с поддержкой файлов TypeScript (.ts) в директории src/pages/api/","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد نقاط نهاية إتش تي إم إل لل تطبيقات ويكس سي إل آي، باستخدام نقاط النهاية أسترو واكتشاف نظام الملفات التلقائي، مع دعم الملفات تایبسكريبت (.ts) في الدليل src/pages/api/"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating server-side routes for Wix CLI applications","Automating HTTP endpoint generation with Astro endpoints","Building custom API endpoints with TypeScript"],"zh":["为 Wix CLI 应用程序创建服务器端路由","使用 Astro 端点自动化 HTTP 端点生成","使用 TypeScript 构建自定义 API 端点"],"ja":["Wix CLIアプリケーションのサーバーサイドルートの作成","Astroエンドポイントを使用したHTTPエンドポイント生成の自動化","TypeScriptを使用したカスタムAPIエンドポイントの構築"],"ko":["Wix CLI 애플리케이션을 위한 서버 측 경로 생성","Astro 엔드포인트를 사용한 HTTP 엔드포인트 생성 자동화","TypeScript를 사용한 사용자 정의 API 엔드포인트 구축"],"es":["Crear rutas del lado del servidor para aplicaciones de Wix CLI","Automatizar la generación de puntos de conexión HTTP con puntos de conexión de Astro","Crear puntos de conexión de API personalizados con TypeScript"],"fr":["Créer des routes côté serveur pour les applications Wix CLI","Automatiser la génération de points de terminaison HTTP avec des points de terminaison Astro","Construire des points de terminaison d''API personnalisés avec TypeScript"],"de":["Serverseitige Routen für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen erstellen","Automatisieren der Generierung von HTTP-Endpunkten mit Astro-Endpunkten","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten API-Endpunkten mit TypeScript"],"pt":["Criação de rotas do lado do servidor para aplicações Wix CLI","Automatização da geração de pontos de extremidade HTTP com pontos de extremidade Astro","Construção de pontos de extremidade de API personalizados com TypeScript"],"ru":["Создание серверных маршрутов для приложений Wix CLI","Автоматизация генерации конечных точек HTTP с конечными точками Astro","Построение пользовательских конечных точек API с помощью TypeScript"],"ar":["إنشاء مسارات على جانب الخادم لتطبيقات ويكس سي إل آي","أتمتة توليد نقاط النهاية إتش تي إم إل مع نقاط النهاية أسترو","بناء نقاط نهاية واي فاي الأعمال المخصصة مع تایبسكريبت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual file creation in src/pages/api/ directory","No support for extension registration or appearance on the Extensions page","Limited to Wix CLI applications with Astro endpoints"],"zh":["需要在 src/pages/api/ 目录中手动创建文件","不支持扩展注册或在扩展页面上显示","仅限于带有 Astro 端点的 Wix CLI 应用程序"],"ja":["src/pages/api/ディレクトリ内での手動ファイル作成が必要","拡張機能の登録または拡張機能ページへの表示はサポートされていない","Astroエンドポイントを持つWix CLIアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["src/pages/api/ 디렉터리에서 수동으로 파일 생성 필요","확장 기능 등록 또는 확장 기능 페이지 표시 미지원","Astro 엔드포인트가 있는 Wix CLI 애플리케이션으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la creación manual de archivos en el directorio src/pages/api/","No admite el registro de extensiones o la aparición en la página de extensiones","Limitado a aplicaciones de Wix CLI con puntos de conexión de Astro"],"fr":["Nécessite la création manuelle de fichiers dans le répertoire src/pages/api/","Ne prend pas en charge l''enregistrement d''extensions ou l''affichage sur la page des extensions","Limité aux applications Wix CLI avec des points de terminaison Astro"],"de":["Erfordert manuelle Dateierstellung im Verzeichnis src/pages/api/","Unterstützt keine Erweiterungsregistrierung oder Anzeige auf der Erweiterungsseite","Begrenzt auf Wix-CLI-Anwendungen mit Astro-Endpunkten"],"pt":["Requer criação manual de arquivos no diretório src/pages/api/","Sem suporte para registro de extensões ou exibição na página de Extensões","Limitado a aplicações Wix CLI com pontos de extremidade Astro"],"ru":["Требуется ручное создание файлов в директории src/pages/api/","Нет поддержки регистрации расширений или отображения на странице Расширений","Ограничен для приложений Wix CLI с конечными точками Astro"],"ar":["يتطل