hes divergentes"],"de":["Bereinigung des Commits-Verlaufs","Effektive Kollaboration","Wiederherstellung verlorener Commits","Verwaltung komplexer Branches","Vorbereitung sauberer Überprüfungsanfragen","Synchronisierung divergierender Branches"],"pt":["Limpeza do histórico de commits","Aplicação de commits específicos em branches","Encontrar commits que introduziram bugs","Trabalho em múltiplos recursos simultaneamente","Recuperação de erros ou commits perdidos","Gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho de branch complexos"],"ru":["Очистка истории коммитов","Применение конкретных коммитов к веткам","Поиск коммитов, которые ввели ошибки","Работа над несколькими функциями одновременно","Восстановление после ошибок или потерянных коммитов","Управление сложными рабочими процессами веток"],"ar":["تنظيف تاريخ Commits","تطبيق Commits محددة على الفروع","العثور على Commits التي أدخلت أخطاء","العمل على ميزات متعددة في نفس الوقت","استعادة الأخطاء أو Commits المفقودة","إدارة سير عمل الفروع المعقدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 高级工作流","代码管理","协作开发","版本控制","Git 技术","代码提交","分支管理"],"ja":["Git 高度なワークフロー","コード管理","共同作業","バージョン管理","Git 技術","コードのコミット","ブランチ管理"],"ko":["Git 고급 워크플로","코드 관리","협업 개발","버전 관리","Git 기술","코드 커밋","브랜치 관리"],"es":["git avanzado","flujos de trabajo de git","colaboración en git","recuperación de commits","gestión de ramas en git","git para desarrolladores"],"fr":["git avancé","workflows git","collaboration sur git","récupération de commits","gestion de branches sur git","git pour les développeurs"],"de":["erweiterter git","git-workflows","kollaboration in git","wiederherstellung von commits","verwaltung von branches in git","git für entwickler"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho git","técnicas avançadas git","gerenciamento de repositórios git","commits git","branches git","recuperação de erros git","desenvolvimento de software","controle de versão"],"ru":["рабочий процесс git","расширенные техники git","управление репозиториями git","коммиты git","ветки git","восстановление после ошибок git","разработка программного обеспечения","контроль версий"],"ar":["سير عمل جيت","تقنيات جيت المتقدمة","إدارة مستودعات جيت","commits جيت","فروع جيت","استعادة الأخطاء جيت","تطوير البرمجيات","مراقبة الإصدار"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ugro","repoPath":"ollieb89/ugro","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-advanced-workflows","description":"Master advanced Git workflows including rebasing, cherry-picking, bisect, worktrees, and reflog to maintain clean history and recover from any situation. Use when managing complex Git histories, collaborating on feature branches, or troubleshooting repository issues.","bodyPreview":"# Git Advanced Workflows\n\nMaster advanced Git techniques to maintain clean history, collaborate effectively, and recover from any situation with confidence.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Cleaning up commit history before merging\n- Applying specific commits across branches\n- Finding commits that introduced bugs\n- Working on multiple features simultaneously\n- Recovering from Git mistakes or lost commits\n- Managing complex branch workflows\n- Preparing clean PRs for review\n- Synchronizing diverged b","body":"# Git Advanced Workflows\n\nMaster advanced Git techniques to maintain clean history, collaborate effectively, and recover from any situation with confidence.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Cleaning up commit history before merging\n- Applying specific commits across branches\n- Finding commits that introduced bugs\n- Working on multiple features simultaneously\n- Recovering from Git mistakes or lost commits\n- Managing complex branch workflows\n- Preparing clean PRs for review\n- Synchronizing diverged branches\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Interactive Rebase\n\nInteractive rebase is the Swiss Army knife of Git history editing.\n\n**Common Operations:**\n- `pick`: Keep commit as-is\n- `reword`: Change commit message\n- `edit`: Amend commit content\n- `squash`: Combine with previous commit\n- `fixup`: Like squash but discard message\n- `drop`: Remove commit entirely\n\n**Basic Usage:**\n```bash\n# Rebase last 5 commits\ngit rebase -i HEAD~5\n\n# Rebase all commits on current branch\ngit rebase -i $(git merge-base HEAD main)\n\n# Rebase onto specific commit\ngit rebase -i abc123\n```\n\n### 2. Cherry-Picking\n\nApply specific commits from one branch to another without merging entire branches.\n\n```bash\n# Cherry-pick single commit\ngit cherry-pick abc123\n\n# Cherry-pick range of commits (exclusive start)\ngit cherry-pick abc123..def456\n\n# Cherry-pick without committing (stage changes only)\ngit cherry-pick -n abc123\n\n# Cherry-pick and edit commit message\ngit cherry-pick -e abc123\n```\n\n### 3. Git Bisect\n\nBinary search through commit history to find the commit that introduced a bug.\n\n```bash\n# Start bisect\ngit bisect start\n\n# Mark current commit as bad\ngit bisect bad\n\n# Mark known good commit\ngit bisect good v1.0.0\n\n# Git will checkout middle commit - test it\n# Then mark as good or bad\ngit bisect good  # or: git bisect bad\n\n# Continue until bug found\n# When done\ngit bisect reset\n```\n\n**Automated Bisect:**\n```bash\n# Use script to test automatically\ngit bisect start HEAD v1.0.0\ngit bisect run ./test.sh\n\n# test.sh should exit 0 for good, 1-127 (except 125) for bad\n```\n\n### 4. Worktrees\n\nWork on multiple branches simultaneously without stashing or switching.\n\n```bash\n# List existing worktrees\ngit worktree list\n\n# Add new worktree for feature branch\ngit worktree add ../project-feature feature/new-feature\n\n# Add worktree and create new branch\ngit worktree add -b bugfix/urgent ../project-hotfix main\n\n# Remove worktree\ngit worktree remove ../project-feature\n\n# Prune stale worktrees\ngit worktree prune\n```\n\n### 5. Reflog\n\nYour safety net - tracks all ref movements, even deleted commits.\n\n```bash\n# View reflog\ngit reflog\n\n# View reflog for specific branch\ngit reflog show feature/branch\n\n# Restore deleted commit\ngit reflog\n# Find commit hash\ngit checkout abc123\ngit branch recovered-branch\n\n# Restore deleted branch\ngit reflog\ngit branch deleted-branch abc123\n```\n\n## Practical Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Clean Up Feature Branch Before PR\n\n```bash\n# Start with feature branch\ngit checkout feature/user-auth\n\n# Interactive rebase to clean history\ngit rebase -i main\n\n# Example rebase operations:\n# - Squash \"fix typo\" commits\n# - Reword commit messages for clarity\n# - Reorder commits logically\n# - Drop unnecessary commits\n\n# Force push cleaned branch (safe if no one else is using it)\ngit push --force-with-lease origin feature/user-auth\n```\n\n### Workflow 2: Apply Hotfix to Multiple Releases\n\n```bash\n# Create fix on main\ngit checkout main\ngit commit -m \"fix: critical security patch\"\n\n# Apply to release branches\ngit checkout release/2.0\ngit cherry-pick abc123\n\ngit checkout release/1.9\ngit cherry-pick abc123\n\n# Handle conflicts if they arise\ngit cherry-pick --continue\n# or\ngit cherry-pick --abort\n```\n\n### Workflow 3: Find Bug Introduction\n\n```bash\n# Start bisect\ngit bisect start\ngit bisect bad HEAD\ngit bisect good v2.1.0\n\n# Git checks out middle commit - run tests\nnpm test\n\n# If tests fail\ngit bisect bad\n\n# If tests pass\ngit bisect good\n\n# Git will automatically checkout next commit to test\n# Repeat until bug found\n\n# Automated version\ngit bisect start HEAD v2.1.0\ngit bisect run npm test\n```\n\n### Workflow 4: Multi-Branch Development\n\n```bash\n# Main project directory\ncd ~/projects/myapp\n\n# Create worktree for urgent bugfix\ngit worktree add ../myapp-hotfix hotfix/critical-bug\n\n# Work on hotfix in separate directory\ncd ../myapp-hotfix\n# Make changes, commit\ngit commit -m \"fix: resolve critical bug\"\ngit push origin hotfix/critical-bug\n\n# Return to main work without interruption\ncd ~/projects/myapp\ngit fetch origin\ngit cherry-pick hotfix/critical-bug\n\n# Clean up when done\ngit worktree remove ../myapp-hotfix\n```\n\n### Workflow 5: Recover from Mistakes\n\n```bash\n# Accidentally reset to wrong commit\ngit reset --hard HEAD~5  # Oh no!\n\n# Use reflog to find lost commits\ngit reflog\n# Output shows:\n# abc123 HEAD@{0}: reset: moving to HEAD~5\n# def456 HEAD@{1}: commit: my important changes\n\n# Recover lost commits\ngit reset --hard def456\n\n# Or create branch from lost commit\ngit branch recovery def456\n```\n\n## Advanced Techniques\n\n### Rebase vs Merge Strategy\n\n**When to Rebase:**\n- Cleaning up local commits before pushing\n- Keeping feature branch up-to-date with main\n- Creating linear history for easier review\n\n**When to Merge:**\n- Integrating completed features into main\n- Preserving exact history of collaboration\n- Public branches used by others\n\n```bash\n# Update feature branch with main changes (rebase)\ngit checkout feature/my-feature\ngit fetch origin\ngit rebase origin/main\n\n# Handle conflicts\ngit status\n# Fix conflicts in files\ngit add .\ngit rebase --continue\n\n# Or merge instead\ngit merge origin/main\n```\n\n### Autosquash Workflow\n\nAutomatically squash fixup commits during rebase.\n\n```bash\n# Make initial commit\ngit commit -m \"feat: add user authentication\"\n\n# Later, fix something in that commit\n# Stage changes\ngit commit --fixup HEAD  # or specify commit hash\n\n# Make more changes\ngit commit --fixup abc123\n\n# Rebase with autosquash\ngit rebase -i --autosquash main\n\n# Git automatically marks fixup commits\n```\n\n### Split Commit\n\nBreak one commit into multiple logical commits.\n\n```bash\n# Start interactive rebase\ngit rebase -i HEAD~3\n\n# Mark commit to split with ''edit''\n# Git will stop at that commit\n\n# Reset commit but keep changes\ngit reset HEAD^\n\n# Stage and commit in logical chunks\ngit add file1.py\ngit commit -m \"feat: add validation\"\n\ngit add file2.py\ngit commit -m \"feat: add error handling\"\n\n# Continue rebase\ngit rebase --continue\n```\n\n### Partial Cherry-Pick\n\nCherry-pick only specific files from a commit.\n\n```bash\n# Show files in commit\ngit show --name-only abc123\n\n# Checkout specific files from commit\ngit checkout abc123 -- path/to/file1.py path/to/file2.py\n\n# Stage and commit\ngit commit -m \"cherry-pick: apply specific changes from abc123\"\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always Use --force-with-lease**: Safer than --force, prevents overwriting others'' work\n2. **Rebase Only Local Commits**: Don''t rebase commits that have been pushed and shared\n3. **Descriptive Commit Messages**: Future you will thank present you\n4. **Atomic Commits**: Each commit should be a single logical change\n5. **Test Before Force Push**: Ensure history rewrite didn''t break anything\n6. **Keep Reflog Aware**: Remember reflog is your safety net for 90 days\n7. **Branch Before Risky Operations**: Create backup branch before complex rebases\n\n```bash\n# Safe force push\ngit push --force-with-lease origin feature/branch\n\n# Create backup before risky operation\ngit branch backup-branch\ngit rebase -i main\n# If something goes wrong\ngit reset --hard backup-branch\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Rebasing Public Branches**: Causes history conflicts for collaborators\n- **Force Pushing Without Lease**: Can overwrite teammate''s work\n- **Losing Work in Rebase**: Resolve conflicts carefully, test after rebase\n- **Forgetting Worktree Cleanup**: Orphaned worktrees consume disk space\n- **Not Backing Up Before Experiment**: Always create safety branch\n- **Bisect on Dirty Working Directory**: Commit or stash before bisecting\n\n## Recovery Commands\n\n```bash\n# Abort operations in progress\ngit rebase --abort\ngit merge --abort\ngit cherry-pick --abort\ngit bisect reset\n\n# Restore file to version from specific commit\ngit restore --source=abc123 path/to/file\n\n# Undo last commit but keep changes\ngit reset --soft HEAD^\n\n# Undo last commit and discard changes\ngit reset --hard HEAD^\n\n# Recover deleted branch (within 90 days)\ngit reflog\ngit branch recovered-branch abc123\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/git-rebase-guide.md**: Deep dive into interactive rebase\n- **references/git-conflict-resolution.md**: Advanced conflict resolution strategies\n- **references/git-history-rewriting.md**: Safely rewriting Git history\n- **assets/git-workflow-checklist.md**: Pre-PR cleanup checklist\n- **assets/git-aliases.md**: Useful Git aliases for advanced workflows\n- **scripts/git-clean-branches.sh**: Clean up merged and stale branches\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:16:55.764Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing advanced Git workflow management and version control capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Git 工作流管理和版本控制功能的 DevOps 代理。","ja":"DevOps エージェントが高度な Git ワークフロー管理およびバージョン管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Git 워크플로 관리 및 버전 관리 기능이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo de Git avanzada y capacidades de control de versiones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion de workflow Git avancée et de capacités de contrôle de version.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine erweiterte Git-Workflow-Verwaltung und Versionierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho Git avançado e capacidades de controle de versão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления Git и контроля версий.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ديڤ أوبس الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة لتدفق عمل جيت وقدرات التحكم في الإصدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain clean commit history, collaborate effectively, and recover from Git mistakes using techniques like cherry-picking, rebase, and branch management, all while working with distributed training and advanced inference workflows.","zh":"使代理能够维护干净的提交历史，有效地协作，并使用 cherry-picking、rebase 和分支管理等技术从 Git 错误中恢复，同时处理分布式训练和高级推理工作流。","ja":"エージェントがクリーンなコミット履歴を維持し、効果的にコラボレートし、チェリー・ピッキング、リベース、ブランチ管理などのテクニックを使用して Git のミスから回復することを可能にし、分散トレーニングと高度な推論ワークフローを処理する。","ko":"에이전트가 깨끗한 커밋 기록을 유지하고, 효과적으로 협업하며, 체리 픽킹, 리베이스 및 브랜치 관리와 같은 기술을 사용하여 Git 오류에서 회복할 수 있도록 하며, 분산 트레이닝 및 고급 추론 워크플로우를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener un historial de confirmaciones limpio, colaborar de manera efectiva y recuperarse de errores de Git utilizando técnicas como cherry-picking, rebase y gestión de ramas, todo mientras trabaja con flujos de entrenamiento distribuido y flujos de inferencia avanzada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir un historique de commits propre, de collaborer efficacement et de se rétablir des erreurs Git en utilisant des techniques comme cherry-picking, rebase et gestion de branches, le tout en travaillant avec des flux de formation distribués et des flux d''inférence avancés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ein sauberes Commit-Historie beizubehalten, effektiv zusammenzuarbeiten und von Git-Fehlern mithilfe von Techniken wie Cherry-Picking, Rebase und Branch-Management zu recovern, während sie mit verteilten Trainings- und erweiterten Inferenz-Workflows arbeiten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter um histórico de commits limpo, colaborar de forma eficaz e recuperar de erros Git usando técnicas como cherry-picking, rebase e gerenciamento de branches, tudo isso enquanto trabalha com fluxos de treinamento distribuído e inferência avançada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать чистую историю коммитов, эффективно сотрудничать и восстанавливаться после ошибок Git с помощью таких техник, как cherry-picking, rebase и управление ветками, все это при работе с распределенными обучающими и продвинутыми выводными потоками.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على الحفاظ على تاريخ إلتزامات نظيف والتعاون بفعالية والاستعادة من الأخطاء جيت باستخدام تقنيات مثل cherry-picking و rebase وإدارة الفروع، كل ذلك أثناء العمل مع تدفقات التدريب الموزعة والاستدلال المتقدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Cleaning up commit history before merging","Applying specific commits across branches for distributed training","Recovering from Git mistakes or lost commits in complex branch workflows"],"zh":["合并前清理提交历史","在分布式训练中跨分支应用特定提交","在复杂分支工作流中从 Git 错误或丢失提交中恢复"],"ja":["マージ前にコミット履歴をクリーンアップする","分散トレーニングでブランチ間で特定のコミットを適用する","複雑なブランチワークフローで Git のミスまたは失われたコミットから回復する"],"ko":["병합 전 커밋 기록을 정리하는 것","분산 트레이닝에서 브랜치 간에 특정 커밋을 적용하는 것","복잡한 브랜치 워크플로우에서 Git 오류 또는 потерян 커밋에서 회복하는 것"],"es":["Limpieza del historial de confirmaciones antes de fusionar","Aplicación de confirmaciones específicas en ramas para entrenamiento distribuido","Recuperación de errores de Git o confirmaciones perdidas en flujos de trabajo de ramas complejas"],"fr":["Nettoyage de l''historique des commits avant de fusionner","Application de commits spécifiques sur des branches pour la formation distribuée","Récupération d''erreurs Git ou de commits perdus dans des flux de travail de branches complexes"],"de":["Bereinigung des Commit-Historie vor dem Zusammenführen","Anwenden spezifischer Commits auf Zweige für verteiltes Training","Wiederherstellung von Git-Fehlern oder verlorenen Commits in komplexen Branch-Workflows"],"pt":["Limpar o histórico de commits antes de mesclar","Aplicar commits específicos em branches para treinamento distribuído","Recuperar de erros Git ou commits perdidos em fluxos de trabalho de branches complexos"],"ru":["Очистка истории коммитов перед слиянием","Применение определенных коммитов к веткам для распределенного обучения","Восстановление после ошибок Git или потерянных коммитов в сложных потоках работы с ветками"],"ar":["تنظيف تاريخ الإلتزامات قبل الدمج","تطبيق إلتزامات محددة عبر الفروع للتدريب الموزع","استعادة الأخطاء جيت أو الإلتزامات المفقودة في تدفقات عمل الفروع المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Limited to Git-based version control systems"],"zh":["需要 Git 安装和配置","仅限于 Git 基础的版本控制系统"],"ja":["Git のインストールと構成が必要","Git ベースのバージョン管理システムのみ"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요","Git 기반 버전 관리 시스템만 해당"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Limitado a sistemas de control de versiones basados en Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Limité aux systèmes de contrôle de version basés sur Git"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Git-basierte Versionierungssysteme"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Limitado a sistemas de controle de versão baseados em Git"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Ограничен системами контроля версий на основе Git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين جيت","محدود لأنظمة التحكم في الإصدارات المستندة إلى جيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
