 pytest","Integración con CI/CD para pruebas automatizadas"],"fr":["Tests unitaires de flux de travail","Tests d''intégration avec des activités mockées","Tests de lecture pour valider la déterminisme","Développement local avec serveur Temporal et pytest","Intégration avec CI/CD pour des tests automatisés"],"de":["Einheitliche Tests von Workflows","Integrationstests mit mockten Aktivitäten","Wiedergabetests zur Validierung der Determinismus","Lokale Entwicklung mit Temporal-Server und pytest","Integration mit CI/CD für automatisierte Tests"],"pt":["Testes unitários de fluxos de trabalho","Testes de integração com atividades mockadas","Testes de reprodução para validação de determinismo","Desenvolvimento local com servidor Temporal e pytest","Integração com CI/CD para testes automatizados"],"ru":["Юнит-тестирование рабочих процессов","Интеграционное тестирование с模拟ными hoạtidades","Тестирование воспроизведения для проверки детерминизма","Местное развитие с сервером Temporal и pytest","Интеграция с CI/CD для автоматизированного тестирования"],"ar":["اختبارات الوحدات لتدفقات العمل","اختبارات التكامل مع أنشطة محاكاة","اختبارات الإعادة لتحقق من التحديد","التطوير المحلي مع خادم Temporal و pytest","التكامل مع CI/CD لاختبارات автоматية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Temporal Python","pytest"," ","CI/CD"," "," "],"ja":["Temporal Python","pytest"," ","CI/CD"," "," "],"ko":["Temporal Python","pytest"," ","CI/CD"," "," "],"es":["pruebas de Temporal Python","estrategias de prueba","pytest","desarrollo de software","entrenamiento distribuido","flujos de trabajo de desarrolladores","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración"],"fr":["tests Temporal Python","stratégies de test","pytest","développement de logiciels","formation distribuée","flux de travail des développeurs","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration"],"de":["Temporal Python Testing","Teststrategien","pytest","Software-Entwicklung","verteilter Training","Entwickler-Workflows","Einheitliche Tests","Integrationstests"],"pt":["testes python","temporal python testing","pytest","fluxos de trabalho","testes unitários","testes de integração","reprodução de testes","desenvolvimento local","ci/cd"],"ru":["тесты python","временные тесты python","pytest","рабочие процессы","юнит-тестирование","интеграционное тестирование","тестирование воспроизведения","местное развитие","ci/cd"],"ar":["اختبارات بايثون","اختبارات بايثون الزمنية","pytest","تدفقات العمل","اختبارات الوحدات","اختبارات التكامل","اختبارات الإعادة","التطوير المحلي","ci/cd"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ugro","repoPath":"ollieb89/ugro","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"temporal-python-testing","description":"Test Temporal workflows with pytest, time-skipping, and mocking strategies. Covers unit testing, integration testing, replay testing, and local development setup. Use when implementing Temporal workflow tests or debugging test failures.","bodyPreview":"# Temporal Python Testing Strategies\n\nComprehensive testing approaches for Temporal workflows using pytest, progressive disclosure resources for specific testing scenarios.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- **Unit testing workflows** - Fast tests with time-skipping\n- **Integration testing** - Workflows with mocked activities\n- **Replay testing** - Validate determinism against production histories\n- **Local development** - Set up Temporal server and pytest\n- **CI/CD integration** - Automated testing","body":"# Temporal Python Testing Strategies\n\nComprehensive testing approaches for Temporal workflows using pytest, progressive disclosure resources for specific testing scenarios.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- **Unit testing workflows** - Fast tests with time-skipping\n- **Integration testing** - Workflows with mocked activities\n- **Replay testing** - Validate determinism against production histories\n- **Local development** - Set up Temporal server and pytest\n- **CI/CD integration** - Automated testing pipelines\n- **Coverage strategies** - Achieve ≥80% test coverage\n\n## Testing Philosophy\n\n**Recommended Approach** (Source: docs.temporal.io/develop/python/testing-suite):\n- Write majority as integration tests\n- Use pytest with async fixtures\n- Time-skipping enables fast feedback (month-long workflows → seconds)\n- Mock activities to isolate workflow logic\n- Validate determinism with replay testing\n\n**Three Test Types**:\n1. **Unit**: Workflows with time-skipping, activities with ActivityEnvironment\n2. **Integration**: Workers with mocked activities\n3. **End-to-end**: Full Temporal server with real activities (use sparingly)\n\n## Available Resources\n\nThis skill provides detailed guidance through progressive disclosure. Load specific resources based on your testing needs:\n\n### Unit Testing Resources\n**File**: `resources/unit-testing.md`\n**When to load**: Testing individual workflows or activities in isolation\n**Contains**:\n- WorkflowEnvironment with time-skipping\n- ActivityEnvironment for activity testing\n- Fast execution of long-running workflows\n- Manual time advancement patterns\n- pytest fixtures and patterns\n\n### Integration Testing Resources\n**File**: `resources/integration-testing.md`\n**When to load**: Testing workflows with mocked external dependencies\n**Contains**:\n- Activity mocking strategies\n- Error injection patterns\n- Multi-activity workflow testing\n- Signal and query testing\n- Coverage strategies\n\n### Replay Testing Resources\n**File**: `resources/replay-testing.md`\n**When to load**: Validating determinism or deploying workflow changes\n**Contains**:\n- Determinism validation\n- Production history replay\n- CI/CD integration patterns\n- Version compatibility testing\n\n### Local Development Resources\n**File**: `resources/local-setup.md`\n**When to load**: Setting up development environment\n**Contains**:\n- Docker Compose configuration\n- pytest setup and configuration\n- Coverage tool integration\n- Development workflow\n\n## Quick Start Guide\n\n### Basic Workflow Test\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom temporalio.testing import WorkflowEnvironment\nfrom temporalio.worker import Worker\n\n@pytest.fixture\nasync def workflow_env():\n    env = await WorkflowEnvironment.start_time_skipping()\n    yield env\n    await env.shutdown()\n\n@pytest.mark.asyncio\nasync def test_workflow(workflow_env):\n    async with Worker(\n        workflow_env.client,\n        task_queue=\"test-queue\",\n        workflows=[YourWorkflow],\n        activities=[your_activity],\n    ):\n        result = await workflow_env.client.execute_workflow(\n            YourWorkflow.run,\n            args,\n            id=\"test-wf-id\",\n            task_queue=\"test-queue\",\n        )\n        assert result == expected\n```\n\n### Basic Activity Test\n\n```python\nfrom temporalio.testing import ActivityEnvironment\n\nasync def test_activity():\n    env = ActivityEnvironment()\n    result = await env.run(your_activity, \"test-input\")\n    assert result == expected_output\n```\n\n## Coverage Targets\n\n**Recommended Coverage** (Source: docs.temporal.io best practices):\n- **Workflows**: ≥80% logic coverage\n- **Activities**: ≥80% logic coverage\n- **Integration**: Critical paths with mocked activities\n- **Replay**: All workflow versions before deployment\n\n## Key Testing Principles\n\n1. **Time-Skipping** - Month-long workflows test in seconds\n2. **Mock Activities** - Isolate workflow logic from external dependencies\n3. **Replay Testing** - Validate determinism before deployment\n4. **High Coverage** - ≥80% target for production workflows\n5. **Fast Feedback** - Unit tests run in milliseconds\n\n## How to Use Resources\n\n**Load specific resource when needed**:\n- \"Show me unit testing patterns\" → Load `resources/unit-testing.md`\n- \"How do I mock activities?\" → Load `resources/integration-testing.md`\n- \"Setup local Temporal server\" → Load `resources/local-setup.md`\n- \"Validate determinism\" → Load `resources/replay-testing.md`\n\n## Additional References\n\n- Python SDK Testing: docs.temporal.io/develop/python/testing-suite\n- Testing Patterns: github.com/temporalio/temporal/blob/main/docs/development/testing.md\n- Python Samples: github.com/temporalio/samples-python\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:16:57.235Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing advanced Temporal testing strategies with pytest","zh":"非常适合需要高级时间测试策略的工作流自动化代理，特别是与pytest结合使用","ja":"ワークフロー自動化エージェントがpytestを使用して高度な時間テスト戦略を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"pytest와 함께 고급 시간 테스트 전략이 필요한 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización de Flujos de Trabajo que necesitan estrategias de prueba temporales avanzadas con pytest","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de workflow nécessitant des stratégies de test temporel avancées avec pytest","de":"Perfekt für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte temporale Teststrategien mit pytest benötigen","pt":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing advanced Temporal testing strategies with pytest","ru":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing advanced Temporal testing strategies with pytest","ar":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing advanced Temporal testing strategies with pytest"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate determinism against production histories using replay testing, and streamline unit testing workflows with time-skipping, while also facilitating integration testing with mocked activities and local development setup with Temporal server and pytest","zh":"赋予代理验证确定性与生产历史的能力，使用回放测试，并通过时间跳过优化单元测试工作流，同时还可以通过模拟活动和本地开发设置促进集成测试，使用Temporal服务器和pytest","ja":"リプレイテストを使用して決定性を検証し、時間ジャンプを使用してユニットテストワークフローを最適化し、モックアクティビティとローカル開発設定を使用して統合テストを促進することでエージェントを強化し、Temporalサーバーとpytestを使用した設定","ko":"재생 테스트를 사용하여 결정성을 검증하고 시간跳음을 통해 단위 테스트 워크플ロー 최적화, 모의 활동 및 로컬 개발 설정을 사용하여 통합 테스트를 촉진, Temporal 서버 및 pytest를 사용한 설정","es":"Permite a los agentes validar el determinismo frente a historias de producción utilizando pruebas de reproducción y agilizar flujos de trabajo de pruebas unitarias con salto de tiempo, y también facilita pruebas de integración con actividades simuladas y configuración de desarrollo local con servidor Temporal y pytest","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider le déterminisme contre les historiques de production en utilisant des tests de replay, et de rationaliser les flux de travail de test unitaire avec un saut dans le temps, tout en facilitant les tests d''intégration avec des activités mockées et une configuration de développement local avec serveur Temporal et pytest","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Determinismus gegen Produktionshistorien unter Verwendung von Replay-Tests zu validieren und Einheitstest-Workflows mit Zeitsprung zu rationalisieren, und erleichtert auch Integrations-Tests mit simulierten Aktivitäten und lokale Entwicklungsumgebung mit Temporal-Server und pytest","pt":"Empowers agents to validate determinism against production histories using replay testing, and streamline unit testing workflows with time-skipping, while also facilitating integration testing with mocked activities and local development setup with Temporal server and pytest","ru":"Empowers agents to validate determinism against production histories using replay testing, and streamline unit testing workflows with time-skipping, while also facilitating integration testing with mocked activities and local development setup with Temporal server and pytest","ar":"Empowers agents to validate determinism against production histories using replay testing, and streamline unit testing workflows with time-skipping, while also facilitating integration testing with mocked activities and local development setup with Temporal server and pytest"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating unit testing workflows with fast tests and time-skipping","Debugging integration testing workflows with mocked activities","Validating determinism against production histories using replay testing","Streamlining local development with Temporal server and pytest setup","Integrating automated testing into CI/CD pipelines"],"zh":["使用快速测试和时间跳过自动化单元测试工作流","使用模拟活动调试集成测试工作流","使用回放测试验证生产历史中的确定性","使用Temporal服务器和pytest设置优化本地开发","将自动测试集成到CI/CD管道中"],"ja":["高速テストと時間ジャンプを使用したユニットテストワークフローの自動化","モックアクティビティを使用した統合テストワークフローのデバッグ","リプレイテストを使用した生産履歴の決定性の検証","Temporalサーバーとpytestを使用したローカル開発の最適化","自動テストをCI/CDパイプラインに統合"],"ko":["빠른 테스트 및 시간跳음을 사용한 단위 테스트 워크플ロー 자동화","모의 활동을 사용한 통합 테스트 워크플ロー 디버깅","재생 테스트를 사용한 생산 기록의 결정성 검증","Temporal 서버 및 pytest를 사용한 로컬 개발 최적화","자동 테스트를 CI/CD 파이프라인에 통합"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de pruebas unitarias con pruebas rápidas y salto de tiempo","Depurar flujos de trabajo de pruebas de integración con actividades simuladas","Validar determinismo frente a historias de producción utilizando pruebas de reproducción","Racionalizar el desarrollo local con configuración de servidor Temporal y pytest","Integrar pruebas automatizadas en pipelines de CI/CD"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de test unitaire avec des tests rapides et un saut dans le temps","Déboguer les flux de travail de test d''intégration avec des activités mockées","Valider le déterminisme contre les historiques de production en utilisant des tests de replay","Rationaliser le développement local avec une configuration de serveur Temporal et pytest","Intégrer des tests automatisés dans les pipelines de CI/CD"],"de":["Automatisieren von Einheitstest-Workflows mit schnellen Tests und Zeitsprung","Debuggen von Integrations-Test-Workflows mit simulierten Aktivitäten","Validieren von Determinismus gegen Produktionshistorien unter Verwendung von Replay-Tests","Rationalisieren der lokalen Entwicklung mit Temporal-Server- und pytest-Konfiguration","Integrieren von automatisierten Tests in CI/CD-Pipelines"],"pt":["Automating unit testing workflows with fast tests and time-skipping","Debugging integration testing workflows with mocked activities","Validating determinism agains