a de seguridad para aplicaciones Convex","Guía de implementación con documentación oficial"],"fr":["Authentification et autorisation","Exposition des fonctions et contrôle d''accès","Validation des arguments et gestion des variables d''environnement","Audit de sécurité pour les applications Convex","Guide d''implémentation avec documentation officielle"],"de":["Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Funktionsfreigabe und Zugriffskontrolle","Argumentvalidierung und Umgebungsvariable-Handling","Sicherheitsprüfung für Convex-Anwendungen","Implementierungsleitfaden mit offizieller Dokumentation"],"pt":["Verificação de autenticação","Exposição de funções","Validação de argumentos","Controle de acesso em nível de linha","Tratamento de variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["Проверка аутентификации","Экспозиция функций","Валидация аргументов","Контроль доступа на уровне строки","Обработка переменных окружения"],"ar":["فحص المصادقة","إظهار الدوال","تصحيح Arguments","مراقبة الوصول على مستوى السطر","معالجة متغيرات البيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex","Security Check","Authentication","Function Exposure","Argument Validation","Row-level Access Control","Environment Variable Handling","Convex Security"],"ja":["Convex","Security Check","Authentication","Function Exposure","Argument Validation","Row-level Access Control","Environment Variable Handling","Convex Security"],"ko":["Convex","Security Check","Authentication","Function Exposure","Argument Validation","Row-level Access Control","Environment Variable Handling","Convex Security"],"es":["seguridad Convex","auditoría de seguridad","autenticación Convex","control de acceso Convex","desarrollo de aplicaciones Convex","Convex Security Check","guía de seguridad Convex","mejores prácticas de seguridad Convex"],"fr":["sécurité Convex","audit de sécurité","authentification Convex","contrôle d''accès Convex","développement d''applications Convex","Convex Security Check","guide de sécurité Convex","meilleures pratiques de sécurité Convex"],"de":["Convex-Sicherheit","Sicherheitsprüfung","Convex-Authentifizierung","Convex-Zugriffskontrolle","Convex-Anwendungsentwicklung","Convex Security Check","Sicherheitsleitfaden Convex","Sicherheitsbest-Practices Convex"],"pt":["segurança Convex","verificação de segurança","autenticação Convex","controle de acesso Convex","desenvolvimento de aplicações Convex","segurança de aplicações"],"ru":["безопасность Convex","проверка безопасности","аутентификация Convex","контроль доступа Convex","разработка приложений Convex","безопасность приложений"],"ar":["أمان Convex","فحص أمان","مصادقة Convex","مراقبة الوصول Convex","تطوير تطبيقات Convex","أمان التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"charlietlamb","repo":"ferix","repoPath":"charlietlamb/ferix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex Security Check","description":"Quick security audit checklist covering authentication, function exposure, argument validation, row-level access control, and environment variable handling","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","security","authentication","authorization","checklist"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Security Check\n\nA quick security audit checklist for Convex applications covering authentication, function exposure, argument validation, row-level access control, and environment variable handling.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- Functions Auth: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- For broader context: https://docs.","body":"# Convex Security Check\n\nA quick security audit checklist for Convex applications covering authentication, function exposure, argument validation, row-level access control, and environment variable handling.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- Functions Auth: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Security Checklist\n\nUse this checklist to quickly audit your Convex application''s security:\n\n#### 1. Authentication\n\n- [ ] Authentication provider configured (Clerk, Auth0, etc.)\n- [ ] All sensitive queries check `ctx.auth.getUserIdentity()`\n- [ ] Unauthenticated access explicitly allowed where intended\n- [ ] Session tokens properly validated\n\n#### 2. Function Exposure\n\n- [ ] Public functions (`query`, `mutation`, `action`) reviewed\n- [ ] Internal functions use `internalQuery`, `internalMutation`, `internalAction`\n- [ ] No sensitive operations exposed as public functions\n- [ ] HTTP actions validate origin/authentication\n\n#### 3. Argument Validation\n\n- [ ] All functions have explicit `args` validators\n- [ ] All functions have explicit `returns` validators\n- [ ] No `v.any()` used for sensitive data\n- [ ] ID validators use correct table names\n\n#### 4. Row-Level Access Control\n\n- [ ] Users can only access their own data\n- [ ] Admin functions check user roles\n- [ ] Shared resources have proper access checks\n- [ ] Deletion functions verify ownership\n\n#### 5. Environment Variables\n\n- [ ] API keys stored in environment variables\n- [ ] No secrets in code or schema\n- [ ] Different keys for dev/prod environments\n- [ ] Environment variables accessed only in actions\n\n### Authentication Check\n\n```typescript\n// convex/auth.ts\nimport { query, mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// Helper to require authentication\nasync function requireAuth(ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx) {\n  const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n  if (!identity) {\n    throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n  }\n  return identity;\n}\n\n// Secure query pattern\nexport const getMyProfile = query({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"users\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    email: v.string(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const identity = await requireAuth(ctx);\n    \n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"users\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_tokenIdentifier\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"tokenIdentifier\", identity.tokenIdentifier)\n      )\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Function Exposure Check\n\n```typescript\n// PUBLIC - Exposed to clients (review carefully!)\nexport const listPublicPosts = query({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.array(v.object({ /* ... */ })),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    // Anyone can call this - intentionally public\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"posts\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_public\", (q) => q.eq(\"isPublic\", true))\n      .collect();\n  },\n});\n\n// INTERNAL - Only callable from other Convex functions\nexport const _updateUserCredits = internalMutation({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\"), amount: v.number() },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // This cannot be called directly from clients\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.userId, {\n      credits: args.amount,\n    });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Argument Validation Check\n\n```typescript\n// GOOD: Strict validation\nexport const createPost = mutation({\n  args: {\n    title: v.string(),\n    content: v.string(),\n    category: v.union(\n      v.literal(\"tech\"),\n      v.literal(\"news\"),\n      v.literal(\"other\")\n    ),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"posts\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const identity = await requireAuth(ctx);\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"posts\", {\n      ...args,\n      authorId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n    });\n  },\n});\n\n// BAD: Weak validation\nexport const createPostUnsafe = mutation({\n  args: {\n    data: v.any(), // DANGEROUS: Allows any data\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"posts\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"posts\", args.data);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Row-Level Access Control Check\n\n```typescript\n// Verify ownership before update\nexport const updateTask = mutation({\n  args: {\n    taskId: v.id(\"tasks\"),\n    title: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const identity = await requireAuth(ctx);\n    \n    const task = await ctx.db.get(args.taskId);\n    \n    // Check ownership\n    if (!task || task.userId !== identity.tokenIdentifier) {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Not authorized to update this task\");\n    }\n    \n    await ctx.db.patch(args.taskId, { title: args.title });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\n// Verify ownership before delete\nexport const deleteTask = mutation({\n  args: { taskId: v.id(\"tasks\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const identity = await requireAuth(ctx);\n    \n    const task = await ctx.db.get(args.taskId);\n    \n    if (!task || task.userId !== identity.tokenIdentifier) {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Not authorized to delete this task\");\n    }\n    \n    await ctx.db.delete(args.taskId);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Environment Variables Check\n\n```typescript\n// convex/actions.ts\n\"use node\";\n\nimport { action } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const sendEmail = action({\n  args: {\n    to: v.string(),\n    subject: v.string(),\n    body: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ success: v.boolean() }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Access API key from environment\n    const apiKey = process.env.RESEND_API_KEY;\n    \n    if (!apiKey) {\n      throw new Error(\"RESEND_API_KEY not configured\");\n    }\n    \n    const response = await fetch(\"https://api.resend.com/emails\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: {\n        \"Authorization\": `Bearer ${apiKey}`,\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify({\n        from: \"noreply@example.com\",\n        to: args.to,\n        subject: args.subject,\n        html: args.body,\n      }),\n    });\n    \n    return { success: response.ok };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Complete Security Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// convex/secure.ts\nimport { query, mutation, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// Authentication helper\nasync function getAuthenticatedUser(ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx) {\n  const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n  if (!identity) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\",\n      message: \"You must be logged in\",\n    });\n  }\n  \n  const user = await ctx.db\n    .query(\"users\")\n    .withIndex(\"by_tokenIdentifier\", (q) => \n      q.eq(\"tokenIdentifier\", identity.tokenIdentifier)\n    )\n    .unique();\n    \n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"USER_NOT_FOUND\",\n      message: \"User profile not found\",\n    });\n  }\n  \n  return user;\n}\n\n// Check admin role\nasync function requireAdmin(ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx) {\n  const user = await getAuthenticatedUser(ctx);\n  \n  if (user.role !== \"admin\") {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: \"Admin access required\",\n    });\n  }\n  \n  return user;\n}\n\n// Public: List own tasks\nexport const listMyTasks = query({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"tasks\"),\n    title: v.string(),\n    completed: v.boolean(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const user = await getAuthenticatedUser(ctx);\n    \n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"tasks\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", user._id))\n      .collect();\n  },\n});\n\n// Admin only: List all users\nexport const listAllUsers = query({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"users\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    role: v.string(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    await requireAdmin(ctx);\n    \n    return await ctx.db.query(\"users\").collect();\n  },\n});\n\n// Internal: Update user role (never exposed)\nexport const _setUserRole = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    role: v.union(v.literal(\"user\"), v.literal(\"admin\")),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.userId, { role: args.role });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Always verify user identity before returning sensitive data\n- Use internal functions for sensitive operations\n- Validate all arguments with strict validators\n- Check ownership before update/delete operations\n- Store API keys in environment variables\n- Review all public functions for security implications\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Missing authentication checks** - Always verify identity\n2. **Exposing internal operations** - Use internalMutation/Query\n3. **Trusting client-provided IDs** - Verify ownership\n4. **Using v.any() for arguments** - Use specific validators\n5. **Hardcoding secrets** - Use environment variables\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Authentication: https://docs.convex.dev/auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- Functions Auth: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:17:25.753Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Security Agents requiring comprehensive Convex application audits, covering authentication, function exposure, and row-level access control.","zh":"适用于需要对 Convex 应用程序进行全面审计的云安全代理，涵盖身份验证、函数暴露和行级访问控制。","ja":"Convex アプリケーションの包括的な監査が必要なクラウド セキュリティ エージェントに適しています。認証、関数の公開、行レベルのアクセス制御をカバーします。","ko":"Convex 애플리케이션에 대한全面적인 감사를 요구하는 클라우드 보안 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 인증, 함수 노출 및 행 수준의 액세스 제어를 다룹니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Seguridad en la Nube que requieren auditorías de aplicaciones Convex exhaustivas, que cubren la autenticación, la exposición de funciones y el control de acceso a nivel de fila.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Sécurité Cloud nécessitant des audits d''applications Convex complets, couvrant l''authentification, l''exposition des fonctions et le contrôle d''accès au niveau des lignes.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Sicherheitsagenten, die umfassende Convex-Anwendungsaudits benötigen, die Authentifizierung, Funktionsfreigabe und Zeilenberechtigung umfassen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança em Nuvem que requerem auditorias de aplicativos Convex abrangentes, cobrindo autenticação, exposição de funções e controle de acesso em nível de linha.","ru":"Идеально для агентов облачной безопасности, требующих всесторонних аудитов приложений Convex, покрывающих аутентификацию, экспозицию функций и контроль доступа на уровне строк.","ar":"مثالي لوسيطي أمن السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى مراجعة شاملة لتطبيقات Convex، وتغطية مصادقة المستخدمين، وکشف الوظائف، ومراقبة الوصول إلى الصفوف."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform quick security audits on Convex applications using authentication protocols, function exposure checks, and environment variable handling, ensuring production-ready security via https://docs.convex.dev/auth and https://docs.convex.dev/production.","zh":"赋予代理快速安全审计 Convex 应用程序的能力，使用身份验证协议、函数暴露检查和环境变量处理，通过 https://docs.convex.dev/auth 和 https://docs.convex.dev/production 确保生产就绪的安全性。","ja":"エージェントが Convex アプリケーションに対して迅速なセキュリティ監査を実行できるようにし、認証プロトコル、関数の公開チェック、環境変数の処理を使用して、https://docs.convex.dev/auth と https://docs.convex.dev/production で生産就緒のセキュリティを確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 인증 프로토콜, 함수 노출 확인 및 환경 변수 처리를 사용하여 Convex 애플리케이션에 대한 빠른 보안 감사를 수행할 수 있도록 하여 https://docs.convex.dev/auth 및 https://docs.convex.dev/production에서 생산 준비가 된 보안을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de seguridad rápidas en aplicaciones Convex utilizando protocolos de autenticación, comprobaciones de exposición de funciones y manejo de variables de entorno, garantizando la seguridad lista para producción a través de https://docs.convex.dev/auth y https://docs.convex.dev/production.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de sécurité rapides sur les applications Convex en utilisant des protocoles d''authentification, des vérifications d''exposition de fonctions et une gestion de variables d''environnement, assurant la sécurité prête pour la production via https://docs.convex.dev/auth et https://docs.convex.dev/production.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, schnelle Sicherheitsaudits in Convex-Anwendungen durchzuführen, indem Authentifizierungsprotokolle, Funktionsfreigabepüfungen und Umgebungsvariable-Handhabung verwendet werden, um über https://docs.convex.dev/auth und https://docs.convex.dev/production Produktionsbereitschaft sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de segurança rápidas em aplicativos Convex usando protocolos de autenticação, verificações de exposição de funções e manipulação de variáveis de ambiente, garantindo segurança pronta para produção via https://docs.convex.dev/auth e https://docs.convex.dev/production.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять быстрые аудиты безопасности приложений Convex с использованием протоколов аутентификации, проверок экспозиции функций и обработки переменных среды, обеспечивая готовность к производству через https://docs.convex.dev/auth и https://docs.convex.dev/production.","ar":"تمكّن الوسيطين من إجراء مراجعات أمنية سريعة لتطبيقات Convex باستخدام بروتوكولات المصادقة، ومراجعة كشف الوظائف، ومعالجة متغيرات البيئة، وضمان الأمان الجاهز للانتاج عبر https://docs.convex.dev/auth و https://docs.convex.dev/production."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing Convex applications for authentication vulnerabilities","Validating function exposure and argument validation in Convex functions","Implementing row-level access control for secure data management"],"zh":["审计 Convex 应用程序以发现身份验证漏洞","验证 Convex 函数中的函数暴露和参数验证","实现行级访问控制以实现安全的数据管理"],"ja":["認証の脆弱性を検出するために Convex アプリケーションを監査する","Convex 関数の関数の公開と引数の検証を検証する","セキュアなデータ管理のために行レベルのアクセス制御を実装する"],"ko":["인증 취약성을 발견하기 위해 Convex 애플리케이션 감사","Convex 함수의 함수 노출 및 인수 유효성을 검사","보안 데이터 관리를 위해 행 수준의 액세스 제어 구현"],"es":["Auditoría de aplicaciones Convex para vulnerabilidades de autenticación","Validación de la exposición de funciones y la validación de argumentos en funciones Convex","Implementación del control de acceso a nivel de fila para una gestión de datos segura"],"fr":["Audit des applications Convex pour les vulnérabilités d''authentification","Validation de l''exposition des fonctions et de la validation des arguments dans les fonctions Convex","Mise en œuvre du contrôle d''accès au niveau des lignes pour une gestion de données sécurisée"],"de":["Auditoría de aplicaciones Convex para vulnerabilidades de autenticación","Validierung der Funktionsfreigabe und der Argumentvalidierung in Convex-Funktionen","Implementierung der Zeilenberechtigung für sichere Datenverwaltung"],"pt":["Auditoria de aplicativos Convex para vulnerabilidades de autenticação","Validação de exposição de funções e validação de argumentos em funções Convex","Implementação de controle de acesso em nível de linha para gerenciamento de dados seguro"],"ru":["Аудит приложений Convex на уязвимости аутентификации","Валидация экспозиции функций и проверка аргументов в функциях Convex","Реализация контроля доступа на уровне строк для безопасного управления данными"],"ar":["مراجعة تطبيقات Convex للثغرات الأمنية في المصادقة","تحقق من كشف الوظائف وتصحيح الحجج في وظائف Convex","تنفيذ مراقبة الوصول إلى الصفوف لأدارة البيانات الآمنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex application documentation","Limited to Convex applications, not applicable to other platforms"],"zh":["需要访问 Convex 应用程序文档","仅限 Convex 应用程序，不适用于其他平台"],"ja":["Convex アプリケーションのドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Convex アプリケーションにのみ適用され、他のプラットフォームでは適用されない"],"ko":["Convex 애플리케이션 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요","Convex 애플리케이션에만 적용되며 다른 플랫폼에는 적용되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de la aplicación Convex","Limitado a aplicaciones Convex, no aplicable a otras plataformas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à la documentation de l''application Convex","Limité aux applications Convex, non applicable à d''autres plateformes"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Convex-Anwendungs-Dokumentation","Begrenzt auf Convex-Anwendungen, nicht anwendbar auf andere Plattformen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação do aplicativo Convex","Limitado a aplicativos Convex, não se aplica a outras plataformas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации приложения Convex","Ограничен приложениями Convex, не применимо к другим платформам"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق تطبيق Convex","محدود بتطبيقات Convex، لا ينطبق على منصات أخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-backend-event', 'community', 'weunica', 'payboxCLI-App', 'weunica/payboxCLI-App', 'wix-cli-backend-event', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z', '2026-02-18T12:17:20.296Z', NULL, '{"id":"weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-backend-event","name":"wix-cli-backend-event","description":{"zh":"Wix CLI 后端事件扩展创建事件扩展，用于触发特定条件下的逻辑，例如联系人创建、订单下单、预订确认或博客文章发布","ja":"Wix CLI バックエンドイベント拡張は、特定の条件下でロジックを実行するイベント拡張を作成します。たとえば、連絡先の作成、注文の受付、予約の確定、またはブログ記事の公開","ko":"Wix CLI 백엔드 이벤트 확장은 특정 조건에 따라 로직을 실행하는 이벤트 확장을 생성합니다. 예를 들어, 연락처 생성, 주문 처리, 예약 확인 또는 블로그 게시물 발행","es":"La extensión Wix CLI Backend Event permite crear eventos personalizados para aplicaciones Wix CLI. Los eventos se activan cuando se cumplen condiciones específicas.","fr":"L''extension Wix CLI Backend Event permet de créer des événements personnalisés pour les applications Wix CLI. Les événements sont déclenchés lorsqu''une condition spécifique est remplie.","de":"Die Wix-CLI-Backend-Event-Erweiterung ermöglicht die Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Ereignisse für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen. Ereignisse werden ausgelöst, wenn bestimmte Bedingungen erfüllt sind.","pt":"A extensão Wix CLI Backend Event permite criar extensões de eventos para aplicações Wix CLI, permitindo executar lógica personalizada em resposta a eventos específicos","ru":"Расширение Wix CLI Backend Event позволяет создавать расширения событий для приложений Wix CLI, что позволяет выполнить пользовательскую логику в ответ на конкретные события","ar":"امتداد ويكس سي إل آي بيك إند إيفنت يسمح بإنشاء امتدادات للأحداث لتطبيقات ويكس سي إل آي، مما يتيح تنفيذ 논 理 الخاصة عند حدوث أحداث معينة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Wix CLI 后端事件扩展","ja":"Wix CLI バックエンドイベント拡張","ko":"Wix CLI 백엔드 이벤트 확장","es":"Wix CLI Backend Event: Extensiones de eventos personalizadas","fr":"Wix CLI Backend Event : Extensions d''événements personnal...","de":"Wix CLI Backend Event: Erweitern Sie Ihre App mit Event-E...","pt":"Wix CLI Backend Event: Crie Extensões de Eventos","ru":"Wix CLI Backend Event: Создайте расширения событий","ar":"ويكس سي إل آي بيك إند إيفنت: إنشاء امتدادات للأحداث","en":"wix-cli-backend-event"},"description":{"zh":"Wix CLI 后端事件扩展创建事件扩展，用于触发特定条件下的逻辑，例如联系人创建、订单下单、预订确认或博客文章发布","ja":"Wix CLI バックエンドイベント拡張は、特定の条件下でロジックを実行するイベント拡張を作成します。たとえば、連絡先の作成、注文の受付、予約の確定、またはブログ記事の公開","ko":"Wix CLI 백엔드 이벤트 확장은 특정 조건에 따라 로직을 실행하는 이벤트 확장을 생성합니다. 예를 들어, 연락처 생성, 주문 처리, 예약 확인 또는 블로그 게시물 발행","es":"La extensión Wix CLI Backend Event permite crear eventos personalizados para aplicaciones Wix CLI. Los eventos se activan cuando se cumplen condiciones espec...","fr":"L''extension Wix CLI Backend Event permet de créer des événements personnalisés pour les applications Wix CLI. Les événements sont déclenchés lorsqu''une condi...","de":"Die Wix-CLI-Backend-Event-Erweiterung ermöglicht die Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Ereignisse für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen. Ereignisse werden ausgelöst, wenn bes...","pt":"A extensão Wix CLI Backend Event permite criar extensões de eventos para aplicações Wix CLI, permitindo executar lógica personalizada em resposta a eventos e...","ru":"Расширение Wix CLI Backend Event позволяет создавать расширения событий для приложений Wix CLI, что позволяет выполнить пользовательскую логику в ответ на ко...","ar":"امتداد ويكس سي إل آي بيك إند إيفنت يسمح بإنشاء امتدادات للأحداث لتطبيقات ويكس سي إل آي، مما يتيح تنفيذ 논 理 الخاصة عند حدوث أحداث معينة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建事件扩展","触发特定条件下的逻辑","支持联系人创建、订单下单、预订确认或博客文章发布等用例","使用 JavaScript SDK webhooks 实现","支持 Wix CLI 应用程序"],"ja":["イベント拡張を作成","特定の条件下でロジックを実行","連絡先の作成、注文の受付、予約の確定、またはブログ記事の公開などのユースケースをサポート","JavaScript SDK webhooks を使用して実装","Wix CLI アプリケーションをサポート"],"ko":["이벤트 확장을 생성","특정 조건에 따라 로직을 실행","연락처 생성, 주문 처리, 예약 확인 또는 블로그 게시물 발행などの 사용 사례를 지원","JavaScript SDK webhooks를 사용하여 구현","Wix CLI 애플리케이션을 지원"],"es":["Crea eventos personalizados para aplicaciones Wix CLI","Activa eventos cuando se cumplen condiciones específicas","Utiliza lógica personalizada para responder a eventos","Se integra con el SDK webhooks de JavaScript","Permite automatizar tareas y procesos","Es compatible con proyectos de aplicaciones y headless"],"fr":["Créez des événements personnalisés pour les applications Wix CLI","Déclenchez des événements lorsqu''une condition spécifique est remplie","Utilisez une logique personnalisée pour répondre aux événements","Intégrez avec le SDK webhooks JavaScript","Permet d''automatiser des tâches et des processus","Est compatible avec les projets d''applications et headless"],"de":["Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte Ereignisse für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen","Lösen Sie Ereignisse aus, wenn bestimmte Bedingungen erfüllt sind","Verwenden Sie benutzerdefinierte Logik, um auf Ereignisse zu reagieren","Integrieren Sie mit dem JavaScript-Webhooks-SDK","Ermöglichen Sie die Automatisierung von Aufgaben und Prozessen","Ist kompatibel mit Anwendungs- und Headless-Projekten"],"pt":["Crie extensões de eventos para aplicações Wix CLI","Execute lógica personalizada em resposta a eventos específicos","Utilize webhooks do JavaScript SDK para receber notificações de eventos","Subscreva seu projeto para webhooks de eventos","Execute ações personalizadas quando um contato é criado, um pedido é feito, uma reserva é confirmada, etc.","Integre com aplicações Wix CLI para headless e app projects"],"ru":["Создайте расширения событий для приложений Wix CLI","Выполните пользовательскую логику в ответ на конкретные события","Используйте вебхуки JavaScript SDK для получения уведомлений о событиях","Подпишите свой проект на вебхуки событий","Выполните пользовательские действия, когда создается контакт, делается заказ, подтверждается бронирование и т. д.","Интегрируйте с приложениями Wix CLI для headless и app projects"],"ar":["إنشاء امتدادات للأحداث لتطبيقات ويكس سي إل آي","تنفيذ 논 理 الخاصة عند حدوث أحداث معينة","استخدام الويب هوك من SDK جافا سكريبت لاستلام إشعارات الأحداث","الاشتراك في مشروعك في الويب هوك للأحداث","تنفيذ إجراءات مخصصة عند إنشاء جهة اتصال، أو إجراء طلب، أو تأكيد حجز، إلخ.","التكامل مع تطبيقات ويكس سي إل آي لمشاريع الهيدليس وتطبيقات المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Wix CLI","后端事件扩展","事件扩展","JavaScript SDK","webhooks","Wix 应用程序","联系人创建","订单下单","预订确认","博客文章发布"],"ja":["Wix CLI","バックエンドイベント拡張","イベント拡張","JavaScript SDK","webhooks","Wix アプリケーション","連絡先の作成","注文の受付","予約の確定","ブログ記事の公開"],"ko":["Wix CLI","백엔드 이벤트 확장","이벤트 확장","JavaScript SDK","webhooks","Wix 애플리케이션","연락처 생성","주문 처리","예약 확인","블로그 게시물 발행"],"es":["Wix CLI","Eventos personalizados","Aplicaciones Wix CLI","SDK webhooks JavaScript","Automatización de tareas","Proyectos de aplicaciones","Proyectos headless","Lógica personalizada","Ereignis-Erweiterungen"],"fr":["Wix CLI","Événements personnalisés","Applications Wix CLI","SDK webhooks JavaScript","Automatisation de tâches","Projets d''applications","Projets headless","Logique personnalisée","Extensions d''événements"],"de":["Wix CLI","Benutzerdefinierte Ereignisse","Wix-CLI-Anwendungen","JavaScript-Webhooks-SDK","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Anwendungsprojekte","Headless-Projekte","Benutzerdefinierte Logik","Ereignis-Erweiterungen"],"pt":["Wix CLI Backend Event","Extensões de eventos Wix CLI","Webhooks JavaScript SDK","Aplicações Wix CLI","Headless projects","App projects","Lógica personalizada","Eventos personalizados","Notificações de eventos"],"ru":["Wix CLI Backend Event","Расширения событий Wix CLI","Вебхуки JavaScript SDK","Приложения Wix CLI","Headless проекты","App проекты","Пользовательская логика","Пользовательские события","Уведомления о событиях"],"ar":["ويكس سي إل آي بيك إند إيفنت","امتدادات للأحداث ويكس سي إل آي","الويب هوك من SDK جافا سكريبت","تطبيقات ويكس سي إل آي","مشاريع الهيدليس","تطبيقات المشاريع","논 理 الخاصة","أحداث مخصصة","إشعارات الأحداث"]}},"owner":"weunica","repo":"payboxCLI-App","repoPath":"weunica/payboxCLI-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wix-cli-backend-event","description":"Create backend event extensions that respond to Wix events. Use when implementing handlers that run when specific conditions occur on a site. Triggers include event extension, backend event, webhook handler.","bodyPreview":"# Wix CLI Backend Event Extension\n\nCreates event extensions for Wix CLI applications. Events are triggered when specific conditions occur—on a Wix user''s site for app projects, or on your project''s site for headless projects. Your project responds using event extensions built on JavaScript SDK webhooks; the CLI subscribes your project to these webhooks.\n\nCommon use cases: run logic when a contact is created, an order is placed, a booking is confirmed, or a blog post is published.\n\n## Quick Start","body":"# Wix CLI Backend Event Extension\n\nCreates event extensions for Wix CLI applications. Events are triggered when specific conditions occur—on a Wix user''s site for app projects, or on your project''s site for headless projects. Your project responds using event extensions built on JavaScript SDK webhooks; the CLI subscribes your project to these webhooks.\n\nCommon use cases: run logic when a contact is created, an order is placed, a booking is confirmed, or a blog post is published.\n\n## Quick Start Checklist\n\nFollow these steps in order when creating an event extension.\n\n1. [ ] Create event folder: `src/backend/events/<event-name>/`\n2. [ ] Create `<event-name>.ts` with the SDK event import and handler function\n3. [ ] Create `<event-name>.extension.ts` with `extensions.event()` and a unique UUID\n4. [ ] Update `src/extensions.ts` to import and use the new extension\n\n**User (manual):** Configure app permissions for the event in the app dashboard if required; release a version and trigger the event to test.\n\n## References\n\n| Topic | Reference |\n| --- | --- |\n| Common events (CRM, eCommerce, Bookings, Blog) | [COMMON-EVENTS.md](references/COMMON-EVENTS.md) |\n\n## Output Structure\n\nTwo files per event ([docs](https://dev.wix.com/docs/wix-cli/guides/extensions/backend-extensions/events/event-extension-files-and-code)). Only **one** handler per event allowed in the app (including dashboard handlers).\n\n```\nsrc/backend/events/<event-name>/\n├── <event-name>.extension.ts   # Builder: extensions.event({ id, source }) – id is unique GUID\n└── <event-name>.ts             # Handler: imports SDK event (e.g. onContactCreated), runs on trigger\n```\n\n## Implementation Pattern\n\n### Event builder (`<event-name>.extension.ts`)\n\nUse `extensions.event()` from `@wix/astro/builders`. Required fields: `id` (unique GUID), `source` (path to the handler file).\n\n```typescript\nimport { extensions } from \"@wix/astro/builders\";\n\nexport const eventContactCreated = extensions.event({\n  id: \"{{GENERATE_UUID}}\",\n  source: \"./backend/events/contact-created/contact-created.ts\",\n});\n```\n\n**CRITICAL: UUID Generation**\n\nThe `id` must be a unique, static UUID v4 string. Generate a fresh UUID for each extension—do NOT use `randomUUID()` or copy UUIDs from examples. Replace `{{GENERATE_UUID}}` with a freshly generated UUID like `\"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\"`.\n\n### Event handler (`<event-name>.ts`)\n\nImport the event from the correct SDK module and pass a handler. Wix invokes the handler with the event payload and metadata when the event occurs. Handler signatures are documented in the [JavaScript SDK reference](https://dev.wix.com/docs/sdk).\n\n```typescript\nimport { onContactCreated } from \"@wix/crm/events\";\n\nonContactCreated((event) => {\n  console.log(\"Contact created:\", event.entity);\n  // Custom logic: sync to CRM, send welcome email, etc.\n});\n```\n\nHandler can be `async`; ensure errors are caught and logged so one failing handler does not break others.\n\n## Extension Registration\n\n**Two steps required.**\n\n### Step 1: Event builder file\n\nCreate `<event-name>.extension.ts` inside the event folder (and `<event-name>.ts` for the handler) as shown in [Implementation Pattern](#implementation-pattern) above.\n\n### Step 2: Register in main extensions.ts\n\n**CRITICAL:** Read [wix-cli-extension-registration](../wix-cli-extension-registration/SKILL.md) and add the event extension to `src/extensions.ts` (import and `.use(eventContactCreated)` or equivalent). Without this, the event extension is not active.\n\nNaming: export names follow `event{CamelCaseName}` (e.g. `eventContactCreated`, `eventOrderPaid`).\n\n## Elevating Permissions for API Calls\n\nWhen calling Wix APIs from inside an event handler, use `auth.elevate` from `@wix/essentials` so the call runs with the right permissions.\n\n```typescript\nimport { auth } from \"@wix/essentials\";\nimport { items } from \"@wix/data\";\n\nonContactCreated(async (event) => {\n  const elevatedQuery = auth.elevate(items.query);\n  const result = await elevatedQuery(\"MyCollection\").find();\n  // Use result\n});\n```\n\n## Key Constraints\n\n- **One handler per event** – You cannot have two event extensions for the same event in the app (local or dashboard).\n- **Permissions** – Each event may require specific permission scopes; configure them in the app dashboard (Permissions page).\n- **Testing** – Release a version with your changes, then perform the action that triggers the event. Some events are not fully testable in local dev.\n- **Backend limits** – Event handlers run under backend extension limits (e.g. 1000 CPU ms per request, 20 sub-requests). See [About Backend Extensions](https://dev.wix.com/docs/wix-cli/guides/extensions/backend-extensions/about-backend-extensions).\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Error handling:** Wrap handler logic in try/catch; log and optionally rethrow or report.\n- **Idempotency:** Events may be delivered more than once; design handlers to be idempotent where possible.\n- **Logging:** Use `console.log` for debugging; keep production logs minimal and non-sensitive.\n- **Performance:** Finish within backend limits; offload heavy work to queues or background jobs if needed.\n\n## Testing Event Extensions\n\n1. **Release** a version with your changes.\n2. **Trigger** the event by taking an action.\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter implementation, use [wix-cli-app-validation](../wix-cli-app-validation/SKILL.md) to validate TypeScript, build, and preview.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:17:20.296Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing event-driven automation for Wix CLI applications","zh":"非常适合需要为 Wix CLI 应用程序进行事件驱动自动化的 Web 开发智能体","ja":"Wix CLI アプリケーションのイベント駆動型自動化を必要とする Web 開発エージェントに最適です","ko":"Wix CLI 애플리케이션을 위한 이벤트 기반 자동화가 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan automatización basada en eventos para aplicaciones de Wix CLI","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant une automatisation basée sur les événements pour les applications Wix CLI","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine ereignisgesteuerte Automatisierung für Wix-CLI-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de automação baseada em eventos para aplicações Wix CLI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходима автоматизация на основе событий для приложений Wix CLI","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الويب الذين يحتاجون إلى أتمتة مدفوعة بالأحداث لتطبيقات Wix CLI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to respond to specific conditions on Wix sites using JavaScript SDK webhooks, enabling automated logic execution for events like contact creation, order placement, or blog post publication via HTTP protocols","zh":"使智能体能够使用 JavaScript SDK Webhook 响应 Wix 站点上的特定条件，从而通过 HTTP 协议为联系人创建、订单下达或博客文章发布等事件实现自动化逻辑执行","ja":"JavaScript SDK の Webhook を使用して Wix サイトの特定の条件に応答するエージェントを強化し、HTTP プロトコルを介して連絡先作成、注文、またはブログ投稿の公開などのイベントの自動化されたロジック実行を可能にします","ko":"JavaScript SDK 웹훅을 사용하여 Wix 사이트의 특정 조건에 대응할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화하며, HTTP 프로토콜을 통해 연락처 생성, 주문 처리 또는 블로그 게시물 게시와 같은 이벤트에 대한 자동화된 로직 실행을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a responder a condiciones específicas en sitios de Wix utilizando webhooks de SDK de JavaScript, lo que permite la ejecución de lógica automatizada para eventos como la creación de contactos, la colocación de pedidos o la publicación de entradas de blog a través de protocolos HTTP","fr":"Permet aux agents de répondre à des conditions spécifiques sur les sites Wix en utilisant des webhooks de SDK JavaScript, permettant ainsi l''exécution de logique automatisée pour des événements tels que la création de contacts, la mise à place de commandes ou la publication de billets de blog via des protocoles HTTP","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, auf bestimmte Bedingungen auf Wix-Seiten zu reagieren, indem sie JavaScript-SDK-Webhooks verwenden, wodurch die Ausführung automatisierter Logik für Ereignisse wie die Erstellung von Kontakten, die Auftragserteilung oder die Veröffentlichung von Blog-Beiträgen über HTTP-Protokolle ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a responderem a condições específicas em sites Wix usando webhooks do SDK da Web JavaScript, permitindo a execução lógica automatizada para eventos como criação de contato, colocação de pedido ou publicação de postagem de blog via protocolos HTTP","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реагировать на конкретные условия на сайтах Wix с помощью веб-хуков JavaScript SDK, что позволяет выполнять автоматическую логику для событий, таких как создание контакта, размещение заказа или публикация поста в блоге через протоколы HTTP","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من الاستجابة للشروط المحددة في مواقع Wix باستخدام الويب هوك SDK الويب جافا سكريبت، مما يتيح تنفيذ المنطق الآلي للأحداث مثل إنشاء جهة اتصال أو وضع طلب أو نشر منشور مدونة عبر بروتوكولات HTTP"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating workflows on contact creation","Triggering custom logic on order placement","Notifying teams when a blog post is published"],"zh":["在创建联系人时自动化工作流程","在订单下达时触发自定义逻辑","在博客文章发布时通知团队"],"ja":["連絡先作成時のワークフローの自動化","注文時のカスタムロジックのトリガー","ブログ投稿公開時のチームへの通知"],"ko":["연락처 생성 시 워크플로우 자동화","주문 발생 시 사용자 정의 로직 트리거","블로그 게시물 게시 시 팀에 알림"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo en la creación de contactos","Activación de lógica personalizada en la colocación de pedidos","Notificación a equipos cuando se publica una entrada de blog"],"fr":["Automatisation de flux de travail lors de la création de contacts","Déclenchement d''une logique personnalisée lors de la mise à place de commandes","Notification des équipes lors de la publication d''un billet de blog"],"de":["Automatisierung von Workflows bei der Erstellung von Kontakten","Auslösen von benutzerdefinierter Logik bei der Auftragserteilung","Benachrichtigung von Teams, wenn ein Blog-Beitrag veröffentlicht wird"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho na criação de contatos","Acionar lógica personalizada na colocação de pedidos","Notificar equipes quando uma postagem de blog é publicada"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов при создании контактов","Запуск пользовательской логики при размещении заказов","Уведомление команд при публикации поста в блоге"],"ar":["أتمتة سير العمل عند إنشاء جهات الاتصال","تشغيل المنطق المخصص عند وضع الطلبات","إعلام الفرق عند نشر منشور مدونة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Wix CLI setup","JavaScript SDK expertise needed","Limited to Wix platform events"],"zh":["需要设置 Wix CLI","需要 JavaScript SDK 专业知识","仅限于 Wix 平台事件"],"ja":["Wix CLI のセットアップが必要","JavaScript SDK の専門知識が必要","Wix プラットフォームのイベントに限定"],"ko":["Wix CLI 설정 필요","JavaScript SDK 전문성 필요","Wix 플랫폼 이벤트로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Wix CLI","Se necesita experiencia en SDK de JavaScript","Limitado a eventos de la plataforma Wix"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Wix CLI","Des compétences en SDK JavaScript sont nécessaires","Limité aux événements de la plateforme Wix"],"de":["Benötigt Wix-CLI-Setup","JavaScript-SDK-Expertenwissen erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Wix-Plattformereignisse"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Wix CLI","É necessária especialização em SDK JavaScript","Limitado a eventos da plataforma Wix"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Wix CLI","Необходимо знание JavaScript SDK","Ограничен событиями платформы Wix"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Wix CLI","يتطلب خبرة في SDK جافا سكريبت","محدود بأحداث منصة Wix"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
