thentifizierung mit gh auth login","Verwendung der --repo-Flagge für Operationen außerhalb des Git-Verzeichnisses","Überprüfung des Authentifizierungsstatus mit gh auth status","Einrichtung des Git-Credential-Helfers","Integration mit Azure Web App und OpenAI Vector Stores"],"pt":["Autenticação segura com gh auth login","Uso do flag --repo para operações fora do diretório Git","Verificação do status de autenticação com gh auth status","Configuração do helper de credenciais do Git","Integração com o Azure Web App e OpenAI Vector Stores"],"ru":["Безопасная аутентификация с gh auth login","Использование флага --repo для операций вне директории Git","Проверка статуса аутентификации с gh auth status","Настройка хелпера учетных данных Git","Интеграция с Azure Web App и OpenAI Vector Stores"],"ar":["المصادقة الآمنة مع gh auth login","استخدام علم --repo للعمليات خارج دليل Git","التحقق من حالة المصادقة مع gh auth status","إعداد مساعد بيانات الاعتماد Git","التكامل مع Azure Web App و OpenAI Vector Stores"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CLI","Azure Web App","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","认证","命令行工具","开发效率"],"ja":["GitHub CLI","Azure Web App","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","認証","コマンドラインツール","開発効率"],"ko":["GitHub CLI","Azure Web App","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","인증","명령줄 도구","개발 효율성"],"es":["github cli","desarrollo de software","azure web app","openai vector stores","autenticación segura","git credential helper"],"fr":["github cli","développement de logiciels","azure web app","openai vector stores","authentification sécurisée","git credential helper"],"de":["github cli","software-entwicklung","azure web app","openai vector stores","sichere authentifizierung","git-credential-helfer"],"pt":["GitHub CLI","desenvolvedores","autenticação","Git","Azure Web App","OpenAI Vector Stores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","integração contínua"],"ru":["GitHub CLI","разработчики","аутентификация","Git","Azure Web App","OpenAI Vector Stores","инструменты разработки","непрерывная интеграция"],"ar":["GitHub CLI","المطورين","المصادقة","Git","Azure Web App","OpenAI Vector Stores","أدوات التطوير","التكامل المستمر"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","repoPath":"karstenheld3/SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github","description":"Apply when working with GitHub repositories, issues, PRs, or authentication","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI Guide\n\nRules and usage for GitHub CLI in `[WORKSPACE_FOLDER]/.tools/gh/`.\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Authenticate before first use: `gh auth login`\n- Use `--repo` flag when not in a git directory\n- Check auth status if commands fail: `gh auth status`\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Login to GitHub\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" auth login\n```\n\n### Check authentication status\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" auth status\n```\n\n### Setup git credential helper\n```powershell\n& \"..","body":"# GitHub CLI Guide\n\nRules and usage for GitHub CLI in `[WORKSPACE_FOLDER]/.tools/gh/`.\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Authenticate before first use: `gh auth login`\n- Use `--repo` flag when not in a git directory\n- Check auth status if commands fail: `gh auth status`\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Login to GitHub\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" auth login\n```\n\n### Check authentication status\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" auth status\n```\n\n### Setup git credential helper\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" auth setup-git\n```\n\n## Repository Operations\n\n### Create new repository\n```powershell\n# Public repo\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo create <name> --public --source=. --remote=origin --push\n\n# Private repo\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo create <name> --private --source=. --remote=origin --push\n\n# From current directory with defaults\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo create --source=. --push\n```\n\n### Clone repository\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo clone <owner>/<repo>\n```\n\n### View repository info\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo view\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo view <owner>/<repo>\n```\n\n### List your repositories\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo list\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo list --limit 50\n```\n\n## Issues\n\n### Create issue\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue create --title \"Bug: something broke\" --body \"Description\"\n```\n\n### List issues\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue list\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue list --state open\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue list --label \"bug\"\n```\n\n### View issue\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue view <number>\n```\n\n### Close issue\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" issue close <number>\n```\n\n## Pull Requests\n\n### Create PR\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr create --title \"Add feature\" --body \"Description\"\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr create --fill  # Use commit info\n```\n\n### List PRs\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr list\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr list --state open\n```\n\n### View PR\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr view <number>\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr view --web  # Open in browser\n```\n\n### Merge PR\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr merge <number>\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr merge <number> --squash\n```\n\n### Checkout PR locally\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" pr checkout <number>\n```\n\n## Releases\n\n### Create release\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" release create v1.0.0 --title \"Version 1.0.0\" --notes \"Release notes\"\n```\n\n### List releases\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" release list\n```\n\n### Download release assets\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" release download v1.0.0\n```\n\n## Gists\n\n### Create gist\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" gist create file.txt --public\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" gist create file1.txt file2.txt --desc \"My gist\"\n```\n\n### List gists\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" gist list\n```\n\n## Workflow / Actions\n\n### List workflows\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" workflow list\n```\n\n### View workflow runs\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" run list\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" run view <run-id>\n```\n\n### Trigger workflow\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" workflow run <workflow-name>\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Create repo and push existing project\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo create <name> --private --source=. --remote=origin --push\n```\n\n### Fork and clone\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo fork <owner>/<repo> --clone\n```\n\n### Open repo in browser\n```powershell\n& \"../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe\" repo view --web\n```\n\n## Setup\n\nFor initial installation, see `SETUP.md` in this skill folder.\n\n**Tool location:** `../.tools/gh/bin/gh.exe`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:18:49.994Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Automation Agents requiring seamless GitHub repository management and content synchronization.","zh":"适用于需要无缝 GitHub 仓库管理和内容同步的 DevOps 自动化代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの管理とコンテンツの同期が必要な DevOps オートメーション エージェントに最適。","ko":"无설통합 GitHub 저장소 관리 및 콘텐츠 동기화가 필요한 DevOps 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de DevOps que requieren una gestión de repositorios de GitHub y sincronización de contenido sin problemas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation DevOps nécessitant une gestion de référentiels GitHub et une synchronisation de contenu sans faille.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Automationsagenten, die eine reibungslose GitHub-Repository-Verwaltung und Inhalts-Synchronisation erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de automação DevOps que exigem gerenciamento de repositório do GitHub sem interrupções e sincronização de conteúdo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации DevOps, требующих бесшовного управления репозиториями GitHub и синхронизации контента.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات أتمتة DevOps التي تتطلب إدارة مخازن GitHub متواصلة وتزامن المحتوى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct GitHub CLI integration for repository operations without requiring local git directories. Provides authentication management through `gh auth login` and credential helper setup for automated workflows.","zh":"启用直接 GitHub CLI 集成以进行不需要本地 git 目录的仓库操作。通过 `gh auth login` 和凭据帮助程序设置提供身份验证管理，以实现自动化工作流。","ja":"ローカル Git ディレクトリを必要とせずにリポジトリ操作を行うための直接の GitHub CLI 統合を可能にします。`gh auth login` および資格情報ヘルパーのセットアップを通じて、自動化されたワークフローに対する認証管理を提供します。","ko":"로컬 git 디렉토리가 필요 없는 리포지토리 작업을 위한 직접 GitHub CLI 통합을 가능하게 합니다. `gh auth login` 및 자격 증명 도우미 설정을 통해 자동화된 워크플로우에 대한 인증 관리를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la integración directa de GitHub CLI para operaciones de repositorio sin requerir directorios git locales. Proporciona gestión de autenticación a través de `gh auth login` y configuración de ayuda de credenciales para flujos de trabajo automatizados.","fr":"Permet l''intégration directe de GitHub CLI pour les opérations de référentiel sans nécessiter de répertoires git locaux. Fournit une gestion d''authentification via `gh auth login` et une configuration d''aide de credentials pour les flux de travail automatisés.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Integration von GitHub CLI für Repository-Vorgänge ohne lokale Git-Verzeichnisse. Bietet Authentifizierungsverwaltung über `gh auth login` und Credential-Helfer-Setup für automatisierte Workflows.","pt":"Permite a integração direta do GitHub CLI para operações de repositório sem exigir diretórios git locais. Fornece gerenciamento de autenticação por meio de `gh auth login` e configuração de helper de credenciais para fluxos de trabalho automatizados.","ru":"Позволяет выполнять прямую интеграцию GitHub CLI для операций с репозиторием без необходимости локальных каталогов git. Предоставляет управление аутентификацией через `gh auth login` и настройку помощника учетных данных для автоматизированных рабочих процессов.","ar":"تمكن من التكامل المباشر لخط أوامر GitHub لعمليات مخزن بدون الحاجة إلى مكاتب جيت محلية. يوفر إدارة المصادقة من خلال `gh auth login` وإعداد مساعد بيانات اعتماد للتدفقات العملية المتمتة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating repository content synchronization","Managing GitHub authentication for CI/CD pipelines","Executing repository commands from non-git directories using --repo flag"],"zh":["自动化仓库内容同步","管理 GitHub 身份验证以用于 CI/CD 流水线","使用 --repo 标志从非 git 目录执行仓库命令"],"ja":["リポジトリ コンテンツの同期を自動化する","CI/CD パイプライン用の GitHub 認証を管理する","--repo フラグを使用して非 Git ディレクトリからリポジトリ コマンドを実行する"],"ko":["리포지토리 콘텐츠 동기화를 자동화하는 것","CI/CD 파이프라인을 위한 GitHub 인증을 관리하는 것","--repo 플래그를 사용하여 非 git 디렉토리에서 리포지토리 명령을 실행하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la sincronización de contenido de repositorio","Gestionar la autenticación de GitHub para pipelines de CI/CD","Ejecutar comandos de repositorio desde directorios no git utilizando la bandera --repo"],"fr":["Automatiser la synchronisation de contenu de référentiel","Gérer l''authentification GitHub pour les pipelines de CI/CD","Exécuter des commandes de référentiel à partir de répertoires non git en utilisant le drapeau --repo"],"de":["Automatisieren der Repository-Inhalts-Synchronisation","Verwalten der GitHub-Authentifizierung für CI/CD-Pipelines","Ausführen von Repository-Befehlen aus nicht-Git-Verzeichnissen unter Verwendung der --repo-Flagge"],"pt":["Automatizar a sincronização de conteúdo do repositório","Gerenciar a autenticação do GitHub para pipelines de CI/CD","Executar comandos de repositório de diretórios não git usando a flag --repo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать синхронизацию контента репозитория","Управлять аутентификацией GitHub для конвейеров CI/CD","Выполнять команды репозитория из не-git каталогов с помощью флага --repo"],"ar":["أتمتة مزامنة محتوى المخزن","إدارة مصادقة GitHub لأنابيب CI/CD","تنفيذ أوامر مخزن من مكاتب غير جيت باستخدام علم --repo"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires initial authentication setup","Dependent on GitHub CLI binary availability","Needs proper credential helper configuration"],"zh":["需要初始身份验证设置","依赖于 GitHub CLI 二进制文件的可用性","需要正确的凭据帮助程序配置"],"ja":["初期認証設定が必要","GitHub CLI バイナリの可用性に依存している","適切な資格情報ヘルパーの設定が必要"],"ko":["초기 인증 설정이 필요합니다","GitHub CLI 바이너리의 가용성에 종속됩니다","적절한 자격 증명 도우미 구성이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de autenticación inicial","Dependiente de la disponibilidad del binario de GitHub CLI","Necesita una configuración adecuada del ayudante de credenciales"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''authentification initiale","Dépend de la disponibilité du binaire GitHub CLI","Nécessite une configuration appropriée de l''aide de credentials"],"de":["Benötigt eine anfängliche Authentifizierungs-Setup","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit der GitHub-CLI-Binärdatei ab","Benötigt eine ordnungsgemäße Konfiguration des Credential-Helfers"],"pt":["Exige configuração de autenticação inicial","Depende da disponibilidade do binário do GitHub CLI","Necessita de configuração adequada do helper de credenciais"],"ru":["Требует первоначальной настройки аутентификации","Зависит от доступности бинарного файла GitHub CLI","Требует правильной настройки помощника учетных данных"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مصادقة أولي","يعتمد على توافر ملف ثنائي لخط أوامر GitHub","يحتاج إلى إعداد مساعد بيانات اعتماد مناسب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
