льное развитие UI","Подход artifact-driven","Создание изменений для SaaS-приложений","Набор современного развития UI","Эффективные инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة المستخدم التجريبي","نهج قائم على المكونات","إنشاء التغييرات لتطبيقات SaaS","مجموعة تطوير واجهة المستخدم الحديثة","أدوات تطوير فعالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-new-change","UI开发工具包","现代SaaS应用","实验性开发","HAI3","UI开发","SaaS开发"],"ja":["openspec-new-change","UI開発キット","モダンSaaSアプリケーション","実験的な開発","HAI3","UI開発","SaaS開発"],"ko":["openspec-new-change","UI 개발 키트","최신 SaaS 애플리케이션","실험적인 개발","HAI3","UI 개발","SaaS 개발"],"es":["desarrollo UI","SaaS","kit de desarrollo","enfoque experimental","arte factos","creación de cambios","HAI3"],"fr":["développement UI","SaaS","kit de développement","approche expérimentale","artefacts","création de modifications","HAI3"],"de":["UI-Entwicklung","SaaS","Entwicklungskit","experimenteller Ansatz","Artefakte","Erstellung von Änderungen","HAI3"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de UI","aplicativos SaaS","HAI3","kit de desenvolvimento","abordagem experimental","artifact-driven","mudanças para aplicativos","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologias de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["разработка UI","SaaS-приложения","HAI3","набор разработки","экспериментальный подход","artifact-driven","изменения для приложений","разработка программного обеспечения","технологии разработки"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة المستخدم","تطبيقات SaaS","HAI3","مجموعة تطوير","نهج تجريبي","قائم على المكونات","التغييرات لتطبيقات","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا التطوير"]}},"owner":"HAI3org","repo":"HAI3","repoPath":"HAI3org/HAI3","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-new-change","description":"Start a new OpenSpec change using the experimental artifact workflow. Use when the user wants to create a new feature, fix, or modification with a structured step-by-step approach.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentic","body":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Determine the workflow schema**\n\n   Use the default schema (omit `--schema`) unless the user explicitly requests a different workflow.\n\n   **Use a different schema only if the user mentions:**\n   - A specific schema name → use `--schema <name>`\n   - \"show workflows\" or \"what workflows\" → run `openspec schemas --json` and let them choose\n\n   **Otherwise**: Omit `--schema` to use the default.\n\n3. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   Add `--schema <name>` only if the user requested a specific workflow.\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/` with the selected schema.\n\n4. **Show the artifact status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This shows which artifacts need to be created and which are ready (dependencies satisfied).\n\n5. **Get instructions for the first artifact**\n   The first artifact depends on the schema (e.g., `proposal` for spec-driven).\n   Check the status output to find the first artifact with status \"ready\".\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions <first-artifact-id> --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This outputs the template and context for creating the first artifact.\n\n6. **STOP and wait for user direction**\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing the steps, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- Schema/workflow being used and its artifact sequence\n- Current status (0/N artifacts complete)\n- The template for the first artifact\n- Prompt: \"Ready to create the first artifact? Just describe what this change is about and I''ll draft it, or ask me to continue.\"\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Do NOT create any artifacts yet - just show the instructions\n- Do NOT advance beyond showing the first artifact template\n- If the name is invalid (not kebab-case), ask for a valid name\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Pass --schema if using a non-default workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:18:50.614Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI Development Agents needing an experimental artifact-driven approach for modern SaaS applications","zh":"非常适合需要采用实验性工件驱动方法进行现代SaaS应用程序UI开发的智能体","ja":"現代的なSaaSアプリケーションのための実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチを必要とするUI開発エージェントに最適です","ko":"현대적인 SaaS 애플리케이션을 위한 실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근 방식이 필요한 UI 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de UI que necesitan un enfoque experimental basado en artefactos para aplicaciones SaaS modernas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''interface utilisateur ayant besoin d''une approche expérimentale basée sur des artefacts pour les applications SaaS modernes","de":"Perfekt für UI-Entwicklungsagenten, die einen experimentellen, artefaktbasierten Ansatz für moderne SaaS-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de UI que precisam de uma abordagem experimental baseada em artefatos para aplicações SaaS modernas","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки UI, которым требуется экспериментальный артефактно-ориентированный подход для современных приложений SaaS","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى نهج تجريبي مدفوع بالمن制 لبرامج SaaS الحديثة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to initiate new changes using kebab-case names or descriptions, leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for open-ended user input and deriving change names from descriptions, utilizing protocols like artifact-driven development","zh":"使智能体能够利用kebab-case命名或描述来发起新变更，运用AskUserQuestion工具获取开放式用户输入，并从描述中推导变更名称，利用诸如工件驱动开发等协议","ja":"kebab-caseの名前または説明を使用して新しい変更を開始し、AskUserQuestionツールを活用してオープンエンドのユーザー入力を取得し、説明から変更名を導出し、アーティファクト駆動開発などのプロトコルを利用するようにエージェントを支援します","ko":"kebab-case 이름 또는 설명을 사용하여 새로운 변경 사항을 시작하고, AskUserQuestion 도구를 활용한 개방형 사용자 입력을 통해 설명에서 변경 이름을 도출하며, 아티팩트 주도 개발과 같은 프로토콜을 활용하도록 에이전트를 권한 부여합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a iniciar nuevos cambios utilizando nombres o descripciones en formato kebab-case, aprovechando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la entrada de usuario de preguntas abiertas y derivando nombres de cambios de descripciones, utilizando protocolos como el desarrollo basado en artefactos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''initier de nouveaux changements en utilisant des noms ou des descriptions au format kebab-case, en exploitant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour une saisie utilisateur de questions ouvertes et en dérivant les noms de changements à partir de descriptions, en utilisant des protocoles tels que le développement basé sur les artefacts","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Änderungen zu initiieren, indem sie kebab-case-Namen oder -Beschreibungen verwenden, die AskUserQuestion-Tool für offene Benutzereingaben nutzt und Änderungsnamen aus Beschreibungen ableitet, wobei Protokolle wie die artefaktbasierte Entwicklung verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a iniciar novas alterações usando nomes ou descrições em kebab-case, aproveitando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para entrada de usuário aberta e derivando nomes de alterações a partir de descrições, utilizando protocolos como desenvolvimento baseado em artefatos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью инициировать новые изменения с использованием имен или описаний в kebab-case, используя инструмент AskUserQuestion для открытого ввода пользователя и получая имена изменений из описаний, используя такие протоколы, как артефактно-ориентированное развитие","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من启动 التغييرات الجديدة باستخدام أسماء أو описات في kebab-case، واستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion للENTRY المفتوحة للمستخدم واستخلاص أسماء التغيير من الوصف، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل التطوير القائم على المن制"},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new SaaS application features","Deriving kebab-case change names from user descriptions","Implementing experimental UI development workflows"],"zh":["初始化新的SaaS应用程序功能","从用户描述中推导kebab-case变更名称","实施实验性UI开发工作流程"],"ja":["新しいSaaSアプリケーション機能の初期化","ユーザーの説明からkebab-caseの変更名を導出","実験的なUI開発ワークフローの実装"],"ko":["새로운 SaaS 애플리케이션 기능 초기화","사용자 설명에서 kebab-case 변경 이름 도출","실험적 UI 개발 워크플로우 구현"],"es":["Inicialización de nuevas características de aplicaciones SaaS","Derivación de nombres de cambios en formato kebab-case a partir de descripciones de usuario","Implementación de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de UI experimentales"],"fr":["Initialisation de nouvelles fonctionnalités d''applications SaaS","Déduction de noms de changements au format kebab-case à partir de descriptions utilisateur","Mise en œuvre de flux de travail de développement d''interface utilisateur expérimentaux"],"de":["Initialisierung neuer SaaS-Anwendungsmerkmale","Ableitung von Änderungsnamen im kebab-case-Format aus Benutzerbeschreibungen","Implementierung experimenteller UI-Entwicklungsworkflows"],"pt":["Inicialização de recursos de aplicativos SaaS novos","Derivação de nomes de alterações em kebab-case a partir de descrições do usuário","Implementação de fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de UI experimentais"],"ru":["Инициализация новых функций приложений SaaS","Получение имен изменений в kebab-case из описаний пользователя","Реализация экспериментальных рабочих процессов разработки UI"],"ar":["تثبيت ميزات جديدة لبرامج SaaS","استخلاص أسماء التغييرات في kebab-case من وصفات المستخدم","تنفيذ تدفقات عمل تجريبية لبرامج SaaS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for change name or description","Limited to kebab-case naming convention"],"zh":["需要用户输入变更名称或描述","仅限于kebab-case命名约定"],"ja":["変更名または説明にはユーザー入力が必要","kebab-case命名規則に限定される"],"ko":["변경 이름 또는 설명에 대한 사용자 입력 필요","kebab-case 명명 규칙으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entrada de usuario para el nombre o la descripción del cambio","Limitado a la convención de nomenclatura kebab-case"],"fr":["Nécessite une saisie utilisateur pour le nom ou la description du changement","Limité à la convention de nommage kebab-case"],"de":["Benutzereingabe für Änderungsname oder -beschreibung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die kebab-case-Namenskonvention"],"pt":["Exige entrada do usuário para nome ou descrição da alteração","Limitado à convenção de nomenclatura em kebab-case"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для имени или описания изменения","Ограничен конвенцией именования в kebab-case"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لاسم أو وصف التغيير","محدود باتفاقية التسمية في kebab-case"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
