describir lo que se desea construir o arreglar","Ofrece una forma de trabajar en un cambio de manera colaborativa"],"fr":["Lancer un nouveau changement avec une approche expérimentale","Dériver un nom en kebab-case à partir d''une description","Utiliser l''outil AskUserQuestion pour demander des informations","Permettre de décrire ce que l''on souhaite construire ou réparer","Offrir un moyen de travailler sur un changement de manière collaborative"],"de":["Erstellen Sie eine neue Änderung mit einem experimentellen Ansatz","Leiten Sie einen Namen im kebab-Format aus einer Beschreibung ab","Verwenden Sie das Tool AskUserQuestion, um Informationen anzufordern","Ermöglichen Sie die Beschreibung dessen, was Sie bauen oder reparieren möchten","Bieten Sie eine Möglichkeit, an einer Änderung kollaborativ zu arbeiten"],"pt":["Inicie uma nova alteração com a abordagem experimental","Forneça um nome em kebab-case ou uma descrição","Derive um nome em kebab-case a partir de uma descrição","Use a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para solicitar informações","Aprenda a trabalhar com a abordagem experimental baseada em artefatos"],"ru":["Запустите новое изменение с помощью экспериментального подхода","Предоставьте имя в kebab-case или описание","Получите имя в kebab-case из описания","Используйте инструмент AskUserQuestion для запроса информации","Узнайте, как работать с экспериментальным подходом, основанном на артефактах"],"ar":["ابدا تغيير جديد بالمنهج التجريبي","قدم اسم بالشكل kebab-case أو وصف","استخرج اسم بالشكل kebab-case من وصف","استخدم أداة AskUserQuestion لطلب المعلومات","تعرف على كيفية العمل بالمنهج التجريبي القائم على الملفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-new-change","实验性的基于工件的方法","开始新的更改","开发技术","AskUserQuestion 工具"],"ja":["openspec-new-change","実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチ","新しい変更の開始","開発技術","AskUserQuestion ツール"],"ko":["openspec-new-change","실험적인 아티팩트 기반 접근 방식","新的 변경 시작","개발 기술","AskUserQuestion 도구"],"es":["OpenSpec","nuevo cambio","enfoque experimental","artefactos","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","desarrollo colaborativo"],"fr":["OpenSpec","nouveau changement","approche expérimentale","artefacts","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","développement collaboratif"],"de":["OpenSpec","neue Änderung","experimenteller Ansatz","Artefakte","kebab-Format","AskUserQuestion","kollaborative Entwicklung"],"pt":["abordagem experimental","arte-fatos","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","desenvolvimento de software","iniciar alteração","nome em kebab-case","descrição de alteração"],"ru":["экспериментальный подход","артефакты","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","разработка программного обеспечения","запустить изменение","имя в kebab-case","описание изменения"],"ar":["المنهج التجريبي","الملفات","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","تطوير البرمجيات","بدء التغيير","اسم بالشكل kebab-case","وصف التغيير"]}},"owner":"beyildirim","repo":"tracehound","repoPath":"beyildirim/tracehound","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-new-change","description":"Start a new OpenSpec change using the experimental artifact workflow. Use when the user wants to create a new feature, fix, or modification with a structured step-by-step approach.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentic","body":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Determine the workflow schema**\n\n   Use the default schema (omit `--schema`) unless the user explicitly requests a different workflow.\n\n   **Use a different schema only if the user mentions:**\n   - A specific schema name → use `--schema <name>`\n   - \"show workflows\" or \"what workflows\" → run `openspec schemas --json` and let them choose\n\n   **Otherwise**: Omit `--schema` to use the default.\n\n3. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   Add `--schema <name>` only if the user requested a specific workflow.\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/` with the selected schema.\n\n4. **Show the artifact status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This shows which artifacts need to be created and which are ready (dependencies satisfied).\n\n5. **Get instructions for the first artifact**\n   The first artifact depends on the schema (e.g., `proposal` for spec-driven).\n   Check the status output to find the first artifact with status \"ready\".\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions <first-artifact-id> --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This outputs the template and context for creating the first artifact.\n\n6. **STOP and wait for user direction**\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing the steps, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- Schema/workflow being used and its artifact sequence\n- Current status (0/N artifacts complete)\n- The template for the first artifact\n- Prompt: \"Ready to create the first artifact? Just describe what this change is about and I''ll draft it, or ask me to continue.\"\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Do NOT create any artifacts yet - just show the instructions\n- Do NOT advance beyond showing the first artifact template\n- If the name is invalid (not kebab-case), ask for a valid name\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Pass --schema if using a non-default workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:19:06.643Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing to initiate new changes using experimental artifact-driven approaches.","zh":"非常适合需要使用实验性基于构件的方法启动新更改的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチを使用して新しい変更を開始する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"실험적인 아티팩트 기반 접근 방식을 사용하여 새로운 변경을 시작해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan iniciar nuevos cambios utilizando enfoques experimentales basados en artefactos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''initier de nouveaux changements en utilisant des approches expérimentales basées sur des artefacts.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die neue Änderungen mithilfe experimenteller, an Artefakten orientierter Ansätze initiieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam iniciar novas alterações usando abordagens experimentais baseadas em artefatos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходимо инициировать новые изменения с помощью экспериментальных подходов, основанных на артефактах.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء发 توسعه الذين يحتاجون إلى إطلاق تغييرات جديدة باستخدام منهجيات تجريبية تقوم على المكونات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to derive kebab-case names from user descriptions and utilize the AskUserQuestion tool for open-ended input, facilitating the creation of new changes with minimal initial information, leveraging protocols such as open-ended questioning and description parsing.","zh":"赋予代理从用户描述中推导出短横线命名法的名称，并利用 AskUserQuestion 工具进行开放式输入，从而可以使用最少的初始信息创建新的更改，利用诸如开放式提问和描述解析等协议。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーの説明からケバブケースの名前を導出し、AskUserQuestionツールを使用してオープンエンド入力を行うことができます。こうすることで、エージェントは最小限の初期情報で新しい変更を作成できます。オープンエンド質問や説明解析などのプロトコルを利用できます。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 설명에서 케밥 케이스 이름을 유추하고 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 개방형 입력을 수행할 수 있도록 해줍니다.这样하면 에이전트는 최소한의 초기 정보로 새로운 변경을 만들 수 있습니다. 개방형 질문이나 설명 파싱 등의 프로토콜을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes derivar nombres en kebab-case a partir de descripciones de usuarios y utilizar la herramienta AskUserQuestion para entrada de preguntas abiertas, lo que facilita la creación de nuevos cambios con un mínimo de información inicial, aprovechando protocolos como preguntas y análisis de descripciones abiertas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de dériver des noms en kebab-case à partir de descriptions d''utilisateurs et d''utiliser l''outil AskUserQuestion pour des entrées de questions ouvertes, facilitant ainsi la création de nouveaux changements avec un minimum d''informations initiales, en exploitant des protocoles tels que des questions et un análisis de descriptions ouvertes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, kebab-case-Namen aus Benutzerbeschreibungen abzuleiten und das Tool AskUserQuestion für offene Eingaben zu nutzen, wodurch die Erstellung neuer Änderungen mit minimalen Anfangsinformationen erleichtert wird, indem Protokolle wie offene Fragen und Beschreibungsanalyse genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a derivar nomes em kebab-case a partir de descrições do usuário e utilizar a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para entrada aberta, facilitando a criação de novas alterações com informações iniciais mínimas, aproveitando protocolos como questionamento aberto e análise de descrições.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выводить имена в формате kebab-case из описаний пользователей и использовать инструмент AskUserQuestion для открытого ввода, что облегчает создание новых изменений с минимальной начальной информацией, используя протоколы, такие как открытый вопрос и анализ описаний.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من استخلاص أسماء الشيشة من وصفات المستخدم واستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لإدخال مفتوح ، مما يُسهل إنشاء تغييرات جديدة مع معلومات أولية قليلة ، مستفيدا من بروتوكولات مثل الاستفهام المفتوح و تحليل الوصف"},"useCases":{"en":["Initiating new changes based on user descriptions","Deriving kebab-case names for change tracking","Utilizing the AskUserQuestion tool for clarifying user requests"],"zh":["基于用户描述启动新的更改","为更改跟踪推导出短横线命名法的名称","利用 AskUserQuestion 工具来澄清用户请求"],"ja":["ユーザーの説明に基づいて新しい変更を開始する","変更追跡のためのケバブケースの名前を導出する","AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーのリクエストを明確にする"],"ko":["사용자 설명을 기반으로 새로운 변경을 시작하는 것","변경 추적을 위한 케밥 케이스 이름을 유추하는 것","AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자의 요청을 명확히 하는 것"],"es":["Iniciar nuevos cambios en función de las descripciones de los usuarios","Derivar nombres en kebab-case para el seguimiento de cambios","Utilizar la herramienta AskUserQuestion para aclarar las solicitudes de los usuarios"],"fr":["Initier de nouveaux changements sur la base de descriptions d''utilisateurs","Dériver des noms en kebab-case pour le suivi des changements","Utiliser l''outil AskUserQuestion pour clarifier les demandes des utilisateurs"],"de":["Neue Änderungen auf der Grundlage von Benutzerbeschreibungen initiieren","Kebab-case-Namen für die Änderungsverfolgung ableiten","Das Tool AskUserQuestion zur Klarstellung von Benutzeranfragen nutzen"],"pt":["Iniciar novas alterações com base em descrições do usuário","Derivar nomes em kebab-case para acompanhamento de alterações","Utilizar a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para esclarecer solicitações do usuário"],"ru":["Инициирование новых изменений на основе описаний пользователя","Вывод имен в формате kebab-case для отслеживания изменений","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion для уточнения запросов пользователя"],"ar":["إطلاق تغييرات جديدة استنادا إلى وصفات المستخدم","استخلاص أسماء الشيشة لتتبع التغييرات","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لتوضيح طلبات المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input or description","Limited to deriving kebab-case names from descriptions"],"zh":["需要用户输入或描述","仅限从描述中推导出短横线命名法的名称"],"ja":["ユーザーの入力または説明が必要","説明からケバブケースの名前を導出することのみ"],"ko":["사용자 입력 또는 설명이 필요함","설명에서 케밥 케이스 이름을 유추하는 것만 가능"],"es":["Requiere entrada o descripción del usuario","Limitado a derivar nombres en kebab-case de descripciones"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée ou une description de l''utilisateur","Limité à la dérivation de noms en kebab-case à partir de descriptions"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzereingaben oder -beschreibungen","Begrenzt auf die Ableitung von kebab-case-Namen aus Beschreibungen"],"pt":["Requer entrada ou descrição do usuário","Limitado à derivação de nomes em kebab-case a partir de descrições"],"ru":["Требует ввода или описания пользователя","Ограничен выводом имен в формате kebab-case из описаний"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال وصفة من المستخدم","محدود بالاستخلاص أسماء الشيشة من الوصف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('uxname/liteend/openspec-new-change', 'community', 'uxname', 'liteend', 'uxname/liteend', 'openspec-new-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z', '2026-02-18T12:18:57.410Z', NULL, '{"id":"uxname/liteend/openspec-new-change","name":"openspec-new-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-new-change是一个轻量级的GraphQL和Prisma.io Node.js后端，用于快速开始新项目","ja":"openspec-new-changeは軽量級のGraphQLとPrisma.io Node.jsバックエンドで、新しいプロジェクトを迅速に開始します","ko":"openspec-new-change는 경량级 GraphQL 및 Prisma.io Node.js 백엔드로 새로운 프로젝트를 빠르게 시작합니다","es":"Inicia un nuevo cambio utilizando el enfoque experimental basado en artefactos con una backend ligera de GraphQL y Prisma.io en node.js.","fr":"Démarrez un nouveau changement en utilisant l''approche expérimentale basée sur les artefacts avec une backend légère de GraphQL et Prisma.io en node.js.","de":"Erstellen Sie eine neue Änderung mit dem experimentellen ansatz basierend auf Artefakten mit einer leichten GraphQL- und Prisma.io-Backend in node.js.","pt":"O openspec-new-change é uma abordagem experimental para criar mudanças em projetos, utilizando GraphQL e Prisma.io em node.js.","ru":"Openspec-new-change - это экспериментальный подход к созданию изменений в проектах, использующий GraphQL и Prisma.io в node.js.","ar":"openspec-new-change هو نهج تجريبي لإنشاء التغييرات في المشاريع، باستخدام GraphQL و Prisma.io في node.js.","en":"Lightweight GraphQL & Prisma.io node.js backend"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-new-change：轻量级GraphQL和Prisma.io Node.js后端","ja":"openspec-new-change：軽量級GraphQLとPrisma.io Node.jsバックエンド","ko":"openspec-new-change: 경량级 GraphQL 및 Prisma.io Node.js 백엔드","es":"Inicia un nuevo cambio con GraphQL y Prisma.io","fr":"Démarrez un nouveau changement avec GraphQL et Prisma.io","de":"Erstellen Sie eine neue Änderung mit GraphQL und Prisma.io","pt":"Crie Mudanças com openspec-new-chang