'outil AskUserQuestion","Exécution de commandes comme openspec list --json","Intégration avec la conversation pour déduire le nom de la modification"],"de":["Überprüfung der Implementierung von Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit Änderungsartefakten wie Spezifikationen und Aufgaben","Auswahl von Änderungen mit der AskUserQuestion-Tool","Ausführung von Befehlen wie openspec list --json","Integration mit der Konversation, um den Änderungsnamen abzuleiten"],"pt":["Verificação de alterações","Conformidade com especificações","Integração com openspec","Suporte a seleção de alterações","Prompt para seleção de alterações"],"ru":["Проверка изменений","Соответствие спецификациям","Интеграция с openspec","Поддержка выбора изменений","Промпт для выбора изменений"],"ar":["التحقق من التغييرات","مطابقة المواصفات","التكامل مع openspec","دعم اختيار التغييرات","التنبيه لاختيار التغييرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-verify-change","UI开发工具包","现代SaaS应用","变更工件","实现验证","HAI3"],"ja":["openspec-verify-change","UI開発キット","モダンSaaSアプリケーション","変更アーティファクト","実装の確認","HAI3"],"ko":["openspec-verify-change","UI 개발 키트","모던 SaaS 애플리케이션","변경 아티팩트","구현 확인","HAI3"],"es":["openspec-verify-change","verificación de implementación","artefactos de cambio","desarrollo de software","herramientas de verificación","integración con la conversación"],"fr":["openspec-verify-change","vérification de la mise en œuvre","artefacts de modification","développement de logiciels","outils de vérification","intégration avec la conversation"],"de":["openspec-verify-change","Überprüfung der Implementierung","Änderungsartefakte","Softwareentwicklung","Überprüfungstools","Integration mit der Konversation"],"pt":["openspec-verify-change","verificação de alterações","conformidade com especificações","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","SAAS","implementação de alterações"],"ru":["openspec-verify-change","проверка изменений","соответствие спецификациям","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","SAAS","реализация изменений"],"ar":["openspec-verify-change","التحقق من التغييرات","مطابقة المواصفات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","SAAS","تنفيذ التغييرات"]}},"owner":"HAI3org","repo":"HAI3","repoPath":"HAI3org/HAI3","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-verify-change","description":"Verify implementation matches change artifacts. Use when the user wants to validate that implementation is complete, correct, and coherent before archiving.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifa","body":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifact exists).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n   Mark changes with incomplete tasks as \"(In Progress)\".\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifacts exist for this change\n\n3. **Get the change directory and load artifacts**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns the change directory and context files. Read all available artifacts from `contextFiles`.\n\n4. **Initialize verification report structure**\n\n   Create a report structure with three dimensions:\n   - **Completeness**: Track tasks and spec coverage\n   - **Correctness**: Track requirement implementation and scenario coverage\n   - **Coherence**: Track design adherence and pattern consistency\n\n   Each dimension can have CRITICAL, WARNING, or SUGGESTION issues.\n\n5. **Verify Completeness**\n\n   **Task Completion**:\n   - If tasks.md exists in contextFiles, read it\n   - Parse checkboxes: `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - Count complete vs total tasks\n   - If incomplete tasks exist:\n     - Add CRITICAL issue for each incomplete task\n     - Recommendation: \"Complete task: <description>\" or \"Mark as done if already implemented\"\n\n   **Spec Coverage**:\n   - If delta specs exist in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`:\n     - Extract all requirements (marked with \"### Requirement:\")\n     - For each requirement:\n       - Search codebase for keywords related to the requirement\n       - Assess if implementation likely exists\n     - If requirements appear unimplemented:\n       - Add CRITICAL issue: \"Requirement not found: <requirement name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Implement requirement X: <description>\"\n\n6. **Verify Correctness**\n\n   **Requirement Implementation Mapping**:\n   - For each requirement from delta specs:\n     - Search codebase for implementation evidence\n     - If found, note file paths and line ranges\n     - Assess if implementation matches requirement intent\n     - If divergence detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Implementation may diverge from spec: <details>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Review <file>:<lines> against requirement X\"\n\n   **Scenario Coverage**:\n   - For each scenario in delta specs (marked with \"#### Scenario:\"):\n     - Check if conditions are handled in code\n     - Check if tests exist covering the scenario\n     - If scenario appears uncovered:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Scenario not covered: <scenario name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Add test or implementation for scenario: <description>\"\n\n7. **Verify Coherence**\n\n   **Design Adherence**:\n   - If design.md exists in contextFiles:\n     - Extract key decisions (look for sections like \"Decision:\", \"Approach:\", \"Architecture:\")\n     - Verify implementation follows those decisions\n     - If contradiction detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Design decision not followed: <decision>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Update implementation or revise design.md to match reality\"\n   - If no design.md: Skip design adherence check, note \"No design.md to verify against\"\n\n   **Code Pattern Consistency**:\n   - Review new code for consistency with project patterns\n   - Check file naming, directory structure, coding style\n   - If significant deviations found:\n     - Add SUGGESTION: \"Code pattern deviation: <details>\"\n     - Recommendation: \"Consider following project pattern: <example>\"\n\n8. **Generate Verification Report**\n\n   **Summary Scorecard**:\n   ```\n   ## Verification Report: <change-name>\n\n   ### Summary\n   | Dimension    | Status           |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | Completeness | X/Y tasks, N reqs|\n   | Correctness  | M/N reqs covered |\n   | Coherence    | Followed/Issues  |\n   ```\n\n   **Issues by Priority**:\n\n   1. **CRITICAL** (Must fix before archive):\n      - Incomplete tasks\n      - Missing requirement implementations\n      - Each with specific, actionable recommendation\n\n   2. **WARNING** (Should fix):\n      - Spec/design divergences\n      - Missing scenario coverage\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   3. **SUGGESTION** (Nice to fix):\n      - Pattern inconsistencies\n      - Minor improvements\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   **Final Assessment**:\n   - If CRITICAL issues: \"X critical issue(s) found. Fix before archiving.\"\n   - If only warnings: \"No critical issues. Y warning(s) to consider. Ready for archive (with noted improvements).\"\n   - If all clear: \"All checks passed. Ready for archive.\"\n\n**Verification Heuristics**\n\n- **Completeness**: Focus on objective checklist items (checkboxes, requirements list)\n- **Correctness**: Use keyword search, file path analysis, reasonable inference - don''t require perfect certainty\n- **Coherence**: Look for glaring inconsistencies, don''t nitpick style\n- **False Positives**: When uncertain, prefer SUGGESTION over WARNING, WARNING over CRITICAL\n- **Actionability**: Every issue must have a specific recommendation with file/line references where applicable\n\n**Graceful Degradation**\n\n- If only tasks.md exists: verify task completion only, skip spec/design checks\n- If tasks + specs exist: verify completeness and correctness, skip design\n- If full artifacts: verify all three dimensions\n- Always note which checks were skipped and why\n\n**Output Format**\n\nUse clear markdown with:\n- Table for summary scorecard\n- Grouped lists for issues (CRITICAL/WARNING/SUGGESTION)\n- Code references in format: `file.ts:123`\n- Specific, actionable recommendations\n- No vague suggestions like \"consider reviewing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:20:17.466Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring precise change verification and implementation validation in modern SaaS applications","zh":"适用于需要在现代SaaS应用程序中进行精确变更验证和实现验证的开发代理","ja":"開発エージェントが最新のSaaSアプリケーションで正確な変更の検証と実装の検証を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"최신 SaaS 애플리케이션에서 정확한 변경 사항 검증 및 구현 검증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una verificación de cambios precisa y una validación de implementación en aplicaciones SaaS modernas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une vérification de changement précise et une validation d''implémentation dans les applications SaaS modernes","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel benötigende Agenten, die eine genaue Änderungsüberprüfung und Implementierungsvalidierung in modernen SaaS-Anwendungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring precise change verification and implementation validation in modern SaaS applications","ru":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring precise change verification and implementation validation in modern SaaS applications","ar":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring precise change verification and implementation validation in modern SaaS applications"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change artifacts using openspec, facilitating accurate specs, tasks, and design validation through JSON outputs and the AskUserQuestion tool","zh":"使代理能够使用openspec验证实现是否与变更工件相符，从而通过JSON输出和AskUserQuestion工具实现准确的规格、任务和设计验证","ja":"エージェントがopenspecを使用して実装が変更アーティファクトと一致することを検証できるようにし、JSON出力とAskUserQuestionツールを通じて正確な仕様、タスク、設計の検証を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 openspec를 사용하여 구현이 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 확인할 수 있도록 하여 JSON 출력 및 AskUserQuestion 도구를 통해 정확한 사양, 작업 및 디자인 검증을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar que la implementación coincide con los artefactos de cambio utilizando openspec, lo que facilita especificaciones precisas, tareas y validación de diseño a través de salidas JSON y la herramienta AskUserQuestion","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que l''implémentation correspond aux artefacts de changement en utilisant openspec, ce qui facilite des spécifications précises, des tâches et une validation de conception via des sorties JSON et l''outil AskUserQuestion","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten unter Verwendung von openspec zu überprüfen, wodurch genaue Spezifikationen, Aufgaben und Designvalidierung durch JSON-Ausgaben und das Tool AskUserQuestion erleichtert werden","pt":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change artifacts using openspec, facilitating accurate specs, tasks, and design validation through JSON outputs and the AskUserQuestion tool","ru":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change artifacts using openspec, facilitating accurate specs, tasks, and design validation through JSON outputs and the AskUserQuestion tool","ar":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change artifacts using openspec, facilitating accurate specs, tasks, and design validation through JSON outputs and the AskUserQuestion tool"},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying change implementations against specs","Validating design and task alignments","Automating change artifact checks"],"zh":["验证变更实现是否与规格相符","验证设计和任务对齐","自动化变更工件检查"],"ja":["変更の実装が仕様と一致することを検証する","設計とタスクの整合性を検証する","変更アーティファクトのチェックを自動化する"],"ko":["변경 사항 구현이 사양과 일치하는지 확인","디자인 및 작업 정렬을 확인","변경 아티팩트 체크 자동화"],"es":["Verificar implementaciones de cambios frente a especificaciones","Validar alineaciones de diseño y tarea","Automatizar comprobaciones de artefactos de cambio"],"fr":["Vérifier les implémentations de changement par rapport aux spécifications","Valider les alignements de conception et de tâche","Automatiser les vérifications d''artefacts de changement"],"de":["Überprüfen von Änderungsimplementierungen gegen Spezifikationen","Validieren von Design- und Aufgabenabstimmungen","Automatisieren von Änderungsartefaktprüfungen"],"pt":["Verifying change implementations against specs","Validating design and task alignments","Automating change artifact checks"],"ru":["Verifying change implementations against specs","Validating design and task alignments","Automating change artifact checks"],"ar":["Verifying change implementations against specs","Validating design and task alignments","Automating change artifact checks"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Needs user input for change selection when name is vague or omitted"],"zh":["需要openspec的安装和配置","依赖对话上下文来推断变更名称","需要用户输入来选择变更名称时名称不明确或省略"],"ja":["openspecのインストールと設定が必要","会話のコンテキストに依存して変更名を推測する","変更名が不明確または省略された場合にユーザー入力を必要とする"],"ko":["openspec 설치 및 구성이 필요","대화 문脈에 의존하여 변경 이름을 추론","변경 이름이 불명확하거나省略된 경우 사용자 입력이 필요"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de openspec","Depende del contexto de conversación para la inferencia del nombre de cambio","Necesita entrada de usuario para la selección de cambios cuando el nombre es vago u omitido"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''openspec","Dépend du contexte de conversation pour l''inférence du nom de changement","Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour la sélection de changements lorsque le nom est vague ou omis"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von openspec","Hängt vom Konversationskontext für die Ableitung des Änderungsnamens ab","Benötigt eine Benutzereingabe für die Änderungsauswahl, wenn der Name vage oder weggelassen ist"],"pt":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Needs user input for change selection when name is vague or omitted"],"ru":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Needs user input for change selection when name is vague or omitted"],"ar":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Needs user input for change selection when name is vague or omitted"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
