 Änderungen","Integration mit openspec list","Verwendung des AskUserQuestion-Tools","Unterstützung für die Auswahl von Änderungen"],"pt":["Crie o próximo artefato","Selecione mudanças com facilidade","Use o comando openspec list --json","Use a ferramenta AskUserQuestion","Apresente as 3 principais mudanças","Trabalhe em mudanças de forma eficiente"],"ru":["Создайте следующий артефакт","Выберите изменения легко","Используйте команду openspec list --json","Используйте инструмент AskUserQuestion","Представьте 3 основных изменения","Работайте над изменениями эффективно"],"ar":["قم بإنشاء الملف التالي","اختر التغييرات بسهولة","استخدم الأمر openspec list --json","استخدم أداة AskUserQuestion","عرض 3 التغييرات الرئيسية","اعمل على التغييرات بفعالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-continue-change","代码变更管理","代码管理","技术技能","开发技术","代码变更","工件创建","代码管理工具"],"ja":["openspec-continue-change","コードの変更管理","コード管理","技術スキル","開発技術","コードの変更","アーティファクトの作成","コード管理ツール"],"ko":["openspec-continue-change","코드 변경 관리","코드 관리","개발 기술","코드 변경","아티팩트 생성","코드 관리 도구","개발자 용도"],"es":["openspec","continuar cambios","crear artefacto","seleccionar cambios","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","integración con openspec","AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["openspec","continuer les modifications","créer un artefact","sélectionner des modifications","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","intégration avec openspec","AskUserQuestion"],"de":["openspec","Änderungen fortsetzen","Artefakt erstellen","Änderungen auswählen","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklertools","Integration mit openspec","AskUserQuestion"],"pt":["OpenSpec","Continue Change","Mudança de software","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Openspec list","AskUserQuestion","Desenvolvedores"],"ru":["OpenSpec","Продолжить изменение","Изменение программного обеспечения","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты разработки","Openspec список","AskUserQuestion","Разработчики"],"ar":["OpenSpec","استمرار التغيير","تغير البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","قائمة Openspec","AskUserQuestion","المطورون"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"ai-assisted-engineering","repoPath":"gAmUssA/ai-assisted-engineering","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ---\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ---\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ---\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/<capability>/spec.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal''s Capabilities section (use the capability name, not the change name).\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:21:20.072Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined change management and artifact creation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要简化变更管理和构件创建能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがストリームライン化された変更管理とアーティファクトの作成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"변경 관리와 아티팩트 생성 기능을 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión de cambios y capacidades de creación de artefactos optimizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion des modifications et des capacités de création d''artefacts rationalisées.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Änderungsverwaltung und Artefakt-Erstellung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gestão de alterações e capacidades de criação de artefatos simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих упрощенного управления изменениями и возможностей создания артефактов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب إدارة تغييرات مبسطة وقدرات إنشاء أشياء"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly continue working on changes by creating the next artifact, utilizing the `openspec list --json` command and the AskUserQuestion tool for efficient change selection, and supporting JSON data formats for robust integration.","zh":"使代理能够通过创建下一个构件、使用 `openspec list --json` 命令和 AskUserQuestion 工具进行高效的更改选择，并支持 JSON 数据格式以实现强大的集成，来无缝地继续处理更改。","ja":"エージェントが `openspec list --json` コマンドと AskUserQuestion ツールを使用して効率的な変更の選択を行い、JSON データ形式をサポートして強力な統合を実現し、次のアーティファクトを作成して変更の処理を無断に継続できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 `openspec list --json` 명령과 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 효율적인 변경 선택을 수행하고 JSON 데이터 형식을 지원하여 강력한 통합을 구현하며 다음 아티팩트를 생성하여 변경 처리를 무중단으로 계속할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a continuar trabajando en los cambios de manera fluida creando el siguiente artefacto, utilizando el comando `openspec list --json` y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para una selección eficiente de cambios, y admitiendo formatos de datos JSON para una integración robusta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de continuer à travailler sur les modifications de manière fluide en créant le prochain artefact, en utilisant la commande `openspec list --json` et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour une sélection efficace de modifications, et en prenant en charge les formats de données JSON pour une intégration robuste.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, nahtlos an den Änderungen weiterzuarbeiten, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen, den Befehl `openspec list --json` und das Tool AskUserQuestion für eine effiziente Änderungsauswahl verwenden und JSON-Datenformate für eine robuste Integration unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a continuar trabalhando em alterações de forma contínua, criando o próximo artefato, utilizando o comando `openspec list --json` e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para uma seleção eficiente de alterações, e suportando formatos de dados JSON para integração robusta.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовно продолжать работу над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт, используя команду `openspec list --json` и инструмент AskUserQuestion для эффективного выбора изменений, а также поддерживая форматы данных JSON для прочной интеграции.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من الاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات بشكل متواصل عن طريق إنشاء الملف القادم، باستخدام أمر `openspec list --json` وأداة AskUserQuestion لتحديد التغييرات بكفاءة، ودعم تنسيقات بيانات JSON من أجل التكامل القوي"},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing stalled changes","Creating new artifacts for existing changes","Managing multiple changes with automated selection prompts"],"zh":["继续停滞的更改","为现有更改创建新构件","使用自动选择提示管理多个更改"],"ja":["停止した変更の続行","既存の変更に新しいアーティファクトを作成","自動選択プロンプトを使用して複数の変更を管理"],"ko":["중단된 변경을 계속하기","기존 변경에 대한 새로운 아티팩트 생성","자동 선택提示를 사용하여 다중 변경 관리"],"es":["Continuar cambios detenidos","Crear nuevos artefactos para cambios existentes","Gestionar múltiples cambios con solicitudes de selección automatizadas"],"fr":["Poursuivre les modifications interrompues","Créer de nouveaux artefacts pour des modifications existantes","Gérer plusieurs modifications avec des invites de sélection automatisées"],"de":["Unterbrochene Änderungen fortsetzen","Erstellen neuer Artefakte für bestehende Änderungen","Verwalten mehrerer Änderungen mit automatisierten Auswahlhinweisen"],"pt":["Continuar alterações interrompidas","Criar novos artefatos para alterações existentes","Gerenciar várias alterações com prompts de seleção automatizados"],"ru":["Продолжить приостановленные изменения","Создать новые артефакты для существующих изменений","Управлять несколькими изменениями с автоматическими подсказками выбора"],"ar":["استمرار التغييرات المتوقفة","إنشاء أشياء جديدة للتغييرات الحالية","إدارة التغييرات المتعددة مع ترشيحات اختيار أوتوماتيكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires conversation context or explicit change name specification","Limited to top 3- changes for selection prompt"],"zh":["需要会话上下文或显式的更改名称规范","选择提示仅限于前 3 个更改"],"ja":["会話のコンテキストまたは明示的な変更名の指定が必要","選択プロンプトは先頭の 3 つの変更に限定されている"],"ko":["대화 상텍스트 또는 명시적인 변경 이름 사양이 필요","선택 프롬프트는 첫 3개의 변경으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere contexto de conversación o especificación explícita del nombre del cambio","Limitado a los 3 primeros cambios para la solicitud de selección"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de conversation ou une spécification explicite du nom de la modification","Limité aux 3 premières modifications pour l''invite de sélection"],"de":["Benötigt Konversationskontext oder explizite Änderungsname-Angabe","Begrenzt auf die ersten 3 Änderungen für die Auswahlhinweis"],"pt":["Exige contexto de conversa ou especificação explícita do nome da alteração","Limitado aos principais 3- alterações para prompt de seleção"],"ru":["Требует контекста разговора или явного указания имени изменения","Ограничен до 3- основных изменений для подсказки выбора"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق محادثة أو تحديد اسم التغيير الصريح","محدود بالتغييرات الثلاث الأولى لترشيحات الاختيار"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('beyildirim/tracehound/openspec-continue-change', 'community', 'beyildirim', 'tracehound', 'beyildirim/tracehound', 'openspec-continue-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z', '2026-02-18T12:20:51.611Z', NULL, '{"id":"beyildirim/tracehound/openspec-continue-change","name":"openspec-continue-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-continue-change 技术允许开发人员继续工作于更改并创建下一个工件","ja":"openspec-continue-change 技術では、開発者は変更を続けて次のアーティファクトを作成できます","ko":"openspec-continue-change 개발을 통해 개발자는 변경을 계속하고 다음 아티팩트를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"La habilidad openspec-continue-change permite a los desarrolladores continuar trabajando en un cambio creando el siguiente artefacto.","fr":"La compétence openspec-continue-change permet aux développeurs de continuer à travailler sur un changement en créant le prochain artefact.","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-continue-change ermöglicht es Entwicklern, eine Änderung fortzusetzen, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen.","pt":"O openspec-continue-change permite continuar trabalhando em mudanças, criando o próximo artifact. Ele pode inferir o nome da mudança do contexto da conversa ou solicitar ao usuário.","ru":"Openspec-continue-change позволяет продолжить работу над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт. Он может вывести имя изменения из контекста разговора или запросить у пользователя.","ar":"يسمح openspec-continue-change بالاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات، بواسطة إنشاء الترضية القادمة. يمكنه استنتاج اسم التغيير من سياق المحادثة أو طلبها من المستخدم.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-continue-change 技术","ja":"openspec-continue-change 技術","ko":"openspec-continue-change 개발","es":"Continuar cambio con openspec","fr":"Continuer le changement avec openspec","de":"Änderung mit openspec fortsetzen","pt":"Continuar Mudanças com openspec-continue-change","ru":"Продолжить изменения с openspec-co