r la herramienta AskUserQuestion para seleccionar el cambio","Presentar los 3 cambios más recientes"],"fr":["Continuer un changement sans spécifier le nom","Sélectionner le changement approprié à partir de la conversation","Exécuter openspec list --json pour obtenir les changements disponibles","Utiliser l''outil AskUserQuestion pour sélectionner le changement","Présenter les 3 changements les plus récents"],"de":["Eine Änderung ohne Angabe des Namens fortsetzen","Die richtige Änderung aus der Konversation auswählen","Openspec list --json ausführen, um verfügbare Änderungen zu erhalten","Das Tool AskUserQuestion verwenden, um die Änderung auszuwählen","Die 3 zuletzt geänderten Änderungen anzeigen"],"pt":["Continuar trabalhando em mudanças","Criar o próximo artifact","Inferir o nome da mudança do contexto da conversa","Solicitar ao usuário para selecionar a mudança","Listar mudanças disponíveis em ordem de modificação","Usar a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção de mudança"],"ru":["Продолжить работу над изменениями","Создать следующий артефакт","Вывести имя изменения из контекста разговора","Запросить у пользователя выбор изменения","Перечислить доступные изменения в порядке модификации","Использовать инструмент AskUserQuestion для выбора изменения"],"ar":["الاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات","إنشاء الترضية القادمة","استنتاج اسم التغيير من سياق المحادثة","طلب من المستخدم اختيار التغيير","قائمة التغييرات المتاحة بالترتيب التصحيحي","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار التغيير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-continue-change","继续更改","创建下一个工件","会话上下文","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"ja":["openspec-continue-change","変更を続ける","次のアーティファクトを作成","会話のコンテキスト","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"ko":["openspec-continue-change","변경을 계속","다음 아티팩트를 생성","대화 상단의 컨텍스트","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"es":["openspec","continuar cambio","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","gestión de cambios","desarrollo ágil"],"fr":["openspec","continuer le changement","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","gestion de changements","développement agile"],"de":["openspec","änderung fortsetzen","softwareentwicklung","entwicklungstools","änderungsmanagement","agiles entwickeln"],"pt":["openspec-continue-change","continuar mudanças","criar artifact","inferir nome da mudança","selecionar mudança","listar mudanças","AskUserQuestion","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["openspec-continue-change","продолжить изменения","создать артефакт","вывести имя изменения","выбрать изменение","перечислить изменения","AskUserQuestion","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["openspec-continue-change","استمرار التغييرات","إنشاء الترضية","استنتاج اسم التغيير","اختيار التغيير","قائمة التغييرات","AskUserQuestion","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"beyildirim","repo":"tracehound","repoPath":"beyildirim/tracehound","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ---\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ---\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ---\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/<capability>/spec.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal''s Capabilities section (use the capability name, not the change name).\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:20:51.611Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring efficient change management and artifact creation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效变更管理和构件创建能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが効率的な変更管理とアーティファクトの作成能力を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 효율적인 변경 관리 및 아티팩트 생성 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión de cambios eficiente y capacidades de creación de artefactos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de changements efficace et des capacités de création d''artefacts.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine effiziente Änderungsverwaltung und Artefakt-Erstellungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem gerenciamento de alterações eficiente e capacidades de criação de artefatos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих эффективного управления изменениями и возможностей создания артефактов.","ar":"مثالي لويجين التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تغييرات فعالة وقدرات إنشاء مصنوعات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly continue working on changes by creating the next artifact, utilizing the `openspec list --json` command for retrieving available changes and the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, all while handling change name inference and ambiguity resolution through conversational context.","zh":"使代理能够无缝地继续处理更改，通过创建下一个构件，利用 `openspec list --json` 命令来检索可用的更改，并使用 AskUserQuestion 工具进行用户选择，同时处理更改名称推断和歧义解决通过对话上下文。","ja":"エージェントが変更を続行できるようにし、次のアーティファクトを作成することで、利用可能な変更を取得するために `openspec list --json` コマンドと、ユーザー選択のために AskUserQuestion ツールを使用し、会話のコンテキストを介して変更名の推論と曖昧さの解決を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 변경을 계속할 수 있도록 하여 다음 아티팩트를 생성하고, 사용 가능한 변경을 검색하기 위해 `openspec list --json` 명령과 사용자 선택을 위해 AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하며, 대화 상의 맥락을 통해 변경 이름 추론 및 모호성 해결을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a continuar trabajando en cambios de forma continua creando el siguiente artefacto, utilizando el comando `openspec list --json` para recuperar los cambios disponibles y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la selección del usuario, todo mientras maneja la inferencia del nombre de cambio y la resolución de ambigüedad a través del contexto conversacional.","fr":"Permet aux agents de continuer à travailler sur les changements de manière continue en créant le prochain artefact, en utilisant la commande `openspec list --json` pour récupérer les changements disponibles et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection de l''utilisateur, le tout en gérant l''inférence du nom de changement et la résolution d''ambiguïté à travers le contexte conversationnel.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, kontinuierlich an Änderungen zu arbeiten, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen, wobei sie den Befehl `openspec list --json` verwenden, um verfügbare Änderungen abzurufen, und das Tool AskUserQuestion für die Benutzerauswahl, während sie die Namensinferenz und die Auflösung von Mehrdeutigkeiten durch den konversationellen Kontext handhaben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a continuar trabalhando em alterações de forma contínua, criando o próximo artefato, utilizando o comando `openspec list --json` para recuperar alterações disponíveis e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção de usuário, lidando com inferência de nome de alteração e resolução de ambiguidade por meio do contexto conversacional.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью беспрепятственно продолжать работать над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт, используя команду `openspec list --json` для получения доступных изменений и инструмент AskUserQuestion для выбора пользователя, при этом обрабатывая вывод имени изменения и разрешение неоднозначности через контекст разговора.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات بسلاسة من خلال إنشاء المصنوع التالي، باستخدام أمر `openspec list --json` لاسترجاع التغييرات المتاحة وأداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار المستخدم، مع التعامل مع استنتاج اسم التغيير وحل الغموض من خلال السياق المحادثي."},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing development on recently modified changes","Creating new artifacts for ongoing projects","Resolving change name ambiguity through user prompts"],"zh":["继续开发最近修改的更改","为正在进行的项目创建新的构件","通过用户提示解决更改名称歧义"],"ja":["最近変更された変更の開発を続ける","進行中のプロジェクトの新しいアーティファクトを作成する","ユーザーのプロンプトを介して変更名の曖昧さを解決する"],"ko":["최근 수정된 변경의 개발을 계속하는 것","진행 중인 프로젝트에 대한 새로운 아티팩트를 생성하는 것","사용자 프롬프트를 통해 변경 이름의 모호성을 해결하는 것"],"es":["Continuar el desarrollo en cambios recientemente modificados","Crear nuevos artefactos para proyectos en curso","Resolver la ambigüedad del nombre de cambio a través de solicitudes de usuario"],"fr":["Continuer le développement sur des changements récemment modifiés","Créer de nouveaux artefacts pour les projets en cours","Résoudre l''ambiguïté du nom de changement à travers des invites de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Fortsetzen der Entwicklung bei kürzlich geänderten Änderungen","Erstellen neuer Artefakte für laufende Projekte","Auflösung der Mehrdeutigkeit des Änderungsnamens durch Benutzereingaben"],"pt":["Continuar desenvolvimento em alterações recentemente modificadas","Criar novos artefatos para projetos em andamento","Resolver ambiguidade de nome de alteração por meio de prompts de usuário"],"ru":["Продолжение разработки недавно измененных изменений","Создание новых артефактов для текущих проектов","Разрешение неоднозначности имени изменения через подсказки пользователя"],"ar":["استمرار التطوير في التغييرات المعدلة مؤخرًا","إنشاء مصنوعات جديدة لمشاريع جارية","حل الغموض في اسم التغيير من خلال إشارات المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 changes for user selection"],"zh":["需要对话上下文来推断更改名称","用户选择仅限于前 3 个更改"],"ja":["変更名の推論に会話のコンテキストが必要","ユーザー選択は先頭 3 つの変更に限定される"],"ko":["변경 이름 추론에 대화 맥락이 필요","사용자 선택은 최상위 3개의 변경으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al contexto de conversación para la inferencia del nombre de cambio","Limitado a los 3 primeros cambios para la selección del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au contexte de conversation pour l''inférence du nom de changement","Limité aux 3 premiers changements pour la sélection de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Konversationskontext für die Namensinferenz der Änderung","Begrenzt auf die ersten 3 Änderungen für die Benutzerauswahl"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao contexto da conversa para inferência de nome de alteração","Limitado aos 3 principais alterações para seleção de usuário"],"ru":["Требует доступа к контексту разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен до 3 лучших изменений для выбора пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج اسم التغيير","محدود إلى 3 تغييرات principales لاختيار المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HAI3org/HAI3/openspec-sync-specs', 'community', 'HAI3org', 'HAI3', 'HAI3org/HAI3', 'openspec-sync-specs', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z', '2026-02-18T12:21:22.255Z', NULL, '{"id":"HAI3org/HAI3/openspec-sync-specs","name":"openspec-sync-specs","description":{"zh":"openspec-sync-specs是HAI3 UI开发工具包的一部分，用于智能同步规格。它可以直接编辑主规格以应用更改","ja":"openspec-sync-specsはHAI3 UI開発キットの一部であり、スマートな仕様の同期を行う。主仕様を直接編集して変更を適用する","ko":"openspec-sync-specs는 HAI3 UI 개발 키트의 일부로 스마트 스펙 동기화를 수행한다. 주 스펙을 직접 편집하여 변경 사항을 적용한다","es":"openspec-sync-specs es un kit de desarrollo de UI para aplicaciones SaaS modernas que permite la sincronización de especificaciones","fr":"openspec-sync-specs est un kit de développement d''UI pour les applications SaaS modernes qui permet la synchronisation des spécifications","de":"openspec-sync-specs ist ein UI-Entwicklungskit für moderne SaaS-Anwendungen, der die Spezifikationssynchronisierung ermöglicht","pt":"openspec-sync-specs é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento de UI para aplicativos SaaS modernos que sincroniza delta specs com main specs","ru":"openspec-sync-specs - это инструментарий для разработки UI современных SaaS-приложений, который синхронизирует delta specs с main specs","ar":"openspec-sync-specs هي أداة تطوير واجهة المستخدم للتطبيقات السحابية الحديثة التي تمزمن مواصفات دلتا مع مواصفات رئيسية","en":"HAI3 - UI development kit for modern SaaS applications"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-sync-specs：智能同步规格","ja":"openspec-sync-specs：スマートな仕様の同期","ko":"openspec-sync-specs: 스마트 스펙 동기화","es":"Sincronización de especificaciones con openspec-sync-specs","fr":"Synchronisation des spécifications avec openspec-sync-specs","de":"Spezifikationssynchronisierung mit openspec-sync-specs","pt":"Sincronize Especificações com openspec-sync-specs","ru":"Синхронизируйте спецификации с openspec-sync-specs","ar":"مزامنة المواصفات مع openspec-sync-specs","en":"openspec-sync-specs"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-sync-specs是HAI3 UI开发工具包的一部分，用于智能同步规格。它可以直接编辑主规格以应用更改","ja":"openspec-sync-specsはHAI3 UI開発キットの一部であり、スマートな仕様の同期を行う。主仕様を直接編集して変更を適用する","ko":"openspec-sync-specs는 HAI3 UI 개발 키트의 일부로 스마트 스펙 동기화를 수행한다. 주 스펙을 직접 편집하여 변경 사항을 적용한다","es":"openspec-sync-specs es un kit de desarrollo de UI para aplicaciones SaaS modernas que permite la sincronización de especificaciones","fr":"openspec-sync-specs est un kit de développement d''UI pour les applications SaaS modernes qui permet la synchronisation des spécifications","de":"openspec-sync-specs ist ein UI-Entwicklungskit für moderne SaaS-Anwendungen, der die Spezifikationssynchronisierung ermöglicht","pt":"openspec-sync-specs é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento de UI para aplicativos SaaS modernos que sincroniza delta specs com main specs","ru":"openspec-sync-specs - это инструментарий для разработки UI современных SaaS-приложений, который синхронизирует delta specs с main specs","ar":"openspec-sync-specs هي أداة تطوير واجهة المستخدم للتطبيقات السحابية الحديثة التي تمزمن مواصفات دلتا مع مواصفات رئيسية","en":"HAI3 - UI development kit for modern SaaS applications"},"definition":{"en":"HAI3 - UI development kit for modern SaaS applications"},"features":{"zh":["智能合并","直接编辑主规格","支持多种规格格式","提高UI开发效率","减少手动编辑错误"],"ja":["スマートなマージ","主仕様の直接編集","複数の仕様形式をサポート","UI開発の効率を向上","手動編集エラーを減らす"],"ko":["스마트 병합","주 스펙의 직접 편집","다양한 스펙 형식을 지원","UI 개발 효율성 향상","수동 편집 오류 감소"],"es":["Sincronización de especificaciones","Edición directa de especificaciones principales","Fusión inteligente de escenarios","Compatibilidad con cambios de nombre"],"fr":["Synchronisation des spécifications","Édition directe des spécifications principales","Fusion intelligente de scénarios","Compatibilité avec les changements de nom"],"de":["Spezifikationssynchronisierung","Direkte Bearbeitung von Hauptspezifikationen","Intelligente Szenariozusammenführung","Kompatibilität mit Namensänderungen"],"pt":["Sincronização de delta specs com main specs","Operação baseada em agente","Mesclagem inteligente de specs","Suporte a seleção de alterações","Integração com desenvolvimento de UI de aplicativos SaaS"],"ru":["Синхронизация delta specs с main specs","Агентно-ориентированная операция","Интеллектуальное слияние specs","Поддержка выбора изменений","Интеграция с разработкой UI современных SaaS-приложений"],"ar":["مزامنة مواصفات دلتا مع مواصفات رئيسية","عملية قائمة على الوكيل","دمج ذكي للمواصفات","دعم اختيار التغييرات","التكامل مع تطوير واجهة المستخدم للتطبيقات السحابية الحديثة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-sync-specs","智能同步规格","UI开发工具包","HAI3","规格合并","直接编辑主规格"],"ja":["openspec-sync-specs","スマートな仕様の同期","UI開発キット","HAI3","仕様マージ","主仕様の直接編集"],"ko":["openspec-sync-specs","스마트 스펙 동기화","UI 개발 키트","HAI3","스펙 병합","주 스펙의 직접 편집"],"es":["sincronización de especificaciones","desarrollo de UI","aplicaciones SaaS","kit de desarrollo","fusión inteligente","edición de especificaciones"],"fr":["synchronisation des spécifications","développement d''UI","applications SaaS","kit de développement","fusion intelligente","édition de spécifications"],"de":["Spezifikationssynchronisierung","UI-Entwicklung","SaaS-Anwendungen","Entwicklungskit","intelligente Zusammenführung","Bearbeitung von Spezifikationen"],"pt":["openspec-sync-specs","desenvolvimento de UI","aplicativos SaaS","sincronização de specs","operação baseada em agente","mesclagem inteligente de specs","seleção de alterações"],"ru":["openspec-sync-specs","разработка UI","SaaS-приложения","синхронизация specs","агентно-ориентированная операция","интеллектуальное слияние specs","выбор изменений"],"ar":["openspec-sync-specs","تطوير واجهة المستخدم","التطبيقات السحابية","مزامنة المواصفات","عملية قائمة على الوكيل","دمج ذكي للمواصفات","اختيار التغييرات"]}},"owner":"HAI3org","repo":"HAI3","repoPath":"HAI3org/HAI3","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.508Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-sync-specs","description":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs. Use when the user wants to update main specs with changes from a delta spec, without archiving the change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selectio","body":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have delta specs (under `specs/` directory).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Find delta specs**\n\n   Look for delta spec files in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/*/spec.md`.\n\n   Each delta spec file contains sections like:\n   - `## ADDED Requirements` - New requirements to add\n   - `## MODIFIED Requirements` - Changes to existing requirements\n   - `## REMOVED Requirements` - Requirements to remove\n   - `## RENAMED Requirements` - Requirements to rename (FROM:/TO: format)\n\n   If no delta specs found, inform user and stop.\n\n3. **For each delta spec, apply changes to main specs**\n\n   For each capability with a delta spec at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/<capability>/spec.md`:\n\n   a. **Read the delta spec** to understand the intended changes\n\n   b. **Read the main spec** at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md` (may not exist yet)\n\n   c. **Apply changes intelligently**:\n\n      **ADDED Requirements:**\n      - If requirement doesn''t exist in main spec → add it\n      - If requirement already exists → update it to match (treat as implicit MODIFIED)\n\n      **MODIFIED Requirements:**\n      - Find the requirement in main spec\n      - Apply the changes - this can be:\n        - Adding new scenarios (don''t need to copy existing ones)\n        - Modifying existing scenarios\n        - Changing the requirement description\n      - Preserve scenarios/content not mentioned in the delta\n\n      **REMOVED Requirements:**\n      - Remove the entire requirement block from main spec\n\n      **RENAMED Requirements:**\n      - Find the FROM requirement, rename to TO\n\n   d. **Create new main spec** if capability doesn''t exist yet:\n      - Create `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n      - Add Purpose section (can be brief, mark as TBD)\n      - Add Requirements section with the ADDED requirements\n\n4. **Show summary**\n\n   After applying all changes, summarize:\n   - Which capabilities were updated\n   - What changes were made (requirements added/modified/removed/renamed)\n\n**Delta Spec Format Reference**\n\n```markdown\n## ADDED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: New Feature\nThe system SHALL do something new.\n\n#### Scenario: Basic case\n- **WHEN** user does X\n- **THEN** system does Y\n\n## MODIFIED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Existing Feature\n#### Scenario: New scenario to add\n- **WHEN** user does A\n- **THEN** system does B\n\n## REMOVED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Deprecated Feature\n\n## RENAMED Requirements\n\n- FROM: `### Requirement: Old Name`\n- TO: `### Requirement: New Name`\n```\n\n**Key Principle: Intelligent Merging**\n\nUnlike programmatic merging, you can apply **partial updates**:\n- To add a scenario, just include that scenario under MODIFIED - don''t copy existing scenarios\n- The delta represents *intent*, not a wholesale replacement\n- Use your judgment to merge changes sensibly\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Specs Synced: <change-name>\n\nUpdated main specs:\n\n**<capability-1>**:\n- Added requirement: \"New Feature\"\n- Modified requirement: \"Existing Feature\" (added 1 scenario)\n\n**<capability-2>**:\n- Created new spec file\n- Added requirement: \"Another Feature\"\n\nMain specs are now updated. The change remains active - archive when implementation is complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Read both delta and main specs before making changes\n- Preserve existing content not mentioned in delta\n- If something is unclear, ask for clarification\n- Show what you''re changing as you go\n- The operation should be idempotent - running twice should give same result\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:21:22.255Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI Development Agents needing advanced spec synchronization capabilities in modern SaaS applications","zh":"非常适合需要高级规格同步功能的UI开发代理，尤其是在现代SaaS应用中","ja":"UI開発エージェントが高度な仕様同期機能を必要とする場合、特にモダンなSaaSアプリケーションで最適","ko":"고급 규격 동기화 기능이 필요한 UI 개발 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 모던 SaaS 애플리케이션에서","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de UI que necesitan capacidades de sincronización de especificaciones avanzadas en aplicaciones SaaS modernas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''interface utilisateur nécessitant des capacités de synchronisation de spécifications avancées dans les applications SaaS modernes","de":"Perfekt für UI-Entwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Spezifikationssynchronisierungsfunktionen in modernen SaaS-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de UI que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de sincronização de especificações em aplicações SaaS modernas","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов развития UI, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности синхронизации спецификаций в современных приложениях SaaS","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتزامن المواصفات في تطبيقات السحابة الحديثة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to intelligently merge delta specs into main specs using agent-driven operations, supporting libraries like HAI3 and file formats for efficient change management and scenario updates","zh":"赋予代理智能合并delta规格到主规格的能力，使用代理驱动的操作，支持像HAI3这样的库和文件格式，以实现高效的变更管理和场景更新","ja":"エージェントにデルタ仕様をメイン仕様に智能的にマージする能力を与え、エージェント駆動の操作を使用し、HAI3などのライブラリやファイル形式をサポートして、効率的な変更管理とシナリオ更新を実現","ko":"에이전트가 델타 규격을 메인 규격으로 지능적으로 머지할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 에이전트 주도 연산을 사용하고, HAI3 같은 라이브러리와 파일 형식을 지원하여, 효율적인 변경 관리와 시나리오 업데이트를 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a fusionar inteligentemente las especificaciones delta en las especificaciones principales utilizando operaciones impulsadas por agentes, y admite bibliotecas como HAI3 y formatos de archivo para un cambio eficiente de gestión y actualizaciones de escenarios","fr":"Permet aux agents de fusionner intelligemment les spécifications delta dans les spécifications principales en utilisant des opérations pilotées par agent, et prend en charge des bibliothèques comme HAI3 et des formats de fichier pour une gestion efficace des changements et des mises à jour de scénarios","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Delta-Spezifikationen intelligent in die HauptSpezifikationen zu mergen, indem sie agentengetriebene Operationen verwenden, und unterstützt Bibliotheken wie HAI3 und Dateiformate für eine effiziente Änderungsverwaltung und Szenario-Updates","pt":"Habilita os agentes a mesclar inteligentemente as especificações delta nas especificações principais usando operações impulsionadas por agentes, suportando bibliotecas como HAI3 e formatos de arquivo para gerenciamento eficiente de alterações e atualizações de cenários","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интеллектуально объединять дельта-спецификации с основными спецификациями с помощью операций, управляемых агентами, поддерживая библиотеки типа HAI3 и форматы файлов для эффективного управления изменениями и обновлениями сценариев","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من دمج المواصفات دلتا بشكل ذكي في المواصفات الرئيسية باستخدام عمليات مدفوعة بالوكلاء، مع دعم لمكتبات مثل HAI3 وتنسيقات الملفات لتحديثات كفؤة للإدارة والتغييرات والسيناريوهات"},"useCases":{"en":["Syncing delta specs from changes to main specs","Automating spec updates with intelligent merging","Debugging spec inconsistencies with conversation context inference"],"zh":["从更改中同步delta规格到主规格","使用智能合并自动规格更新","使用对话上下文推理调试规格不一致"],"ja":["変更からデルタ仕様をメイン仕様に同期","智能マージを使用して仕様を自動更新","会話のコンテキスト推理を使用して仕様の不一致をデバッグ"],"ko":["변경에서 델타 규격을 메인 규격으로 동기화","지능적 머지를 사용하여 규격을 자동 업데이트함","대화 문脈 추론을 사용하여 규격의 불일치를 디버깅"],"es":["Sincronización de especificaciones delta desde los cambios hasta las especificaciones principales","Automatización de actualizaciones de especificaciones con fusión inteligente","Depuración de inconsistencias de especificaciones con inferencia de contexto de conversación"],"fr":["Synchronisation des spécifications delta depuis les changements jusqu''aux spécifications principales","Automatisation des mises à jour de spécifications avec fusion intelligente","Débogage des incohérences de spécifications avec inférence de contexte de conversation"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Delta-Spezifikationen von Änderungen zu Haupt-Spezifikationen","Automatisierung von Spezifikations-Updates mit intelligenter Merge","Fehlerbehebung bei Spezifikationsinkonsistenzen mit Konversationskontextinferenz"],"pt":["Sincronização de especificações delta de alterações para especificações principais","Automatização de atualizações de especificações com mesclagem inteligente","Depuração de inconsistências de especificações com inferência de contexto de conversação"],"ru":["Синхронизация дельта-спецификаций изменений с основными спецификациями","Автоматизация обновления спецификаций с интеллектуальным слиянием","Отладка несоответствий спецификаций с помощью вывода контекста разговора"],"ar":["مزامنة مواصفات دلتا من التغييرات إلى المواصفات الرئيسية","تحديث آلي للمواصفات باستخدام الدمج الذكي","تصحيح أخطاء عدم تطابق في المواصفات باستخدام استنتاج سياق المحادثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires HAI3 UI development kit","Needs inference from conversation context for change name","Limited to modern SaaS applications"],"zh":["需要HAI3 UI开发工具包","需要从对话上下文推理变化名称","仅限于现代SaaS应用"],"ja":["HAI3 UI開発キットが必要","変更名称の会話コンテキストからの推理が必要","モダンなSaaSアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["HAI3 UI 개발 키트가 필요","변경 이름의 대화 문脈에서 추론이 필요","모던 SaaS 애플리케이션에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere el kit de desarrollo de UI HAI3","Necesita inferencia del contexto de conversación para el nombre del cambio","Limitado a aplicaciones SaaS modernas"],"fr":["Nécessite le kit de développement d''interface utilisateur HAI3","Nécessite une inférence du contexte de conversation pour le nom du changement","Limité aux applications SaaS modernes"],"de":["Benötigt das HAI3-UI-Entwicklungskit","Benötigt eine Inferenz aus dem Konversationskontext für den Änderungsnamen","Begrenzt auf moderne SaaS-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer kit de desenvolvimento UI HAI3","Necessita inferência do contexto da conversa para o nome da alteração","Limitado a aplicações SaaS modernas"],"ru":["Требует комплекта разработки UI HAI3","Требует вывода контекста разговора для имени изменения","Ограничен современными приложениями SaaS"],"ar":["يتطلب حزمة تطوير واجهة المستخدم HAI3","يحتاج إلى استنتاج سياق المحادثة لاسم التغيير","محدود بتطبيقات السحابة الحديثة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
