s synchronisieren","pt":"Sincronize Especificações com openspec-sync-specs","ru":"Синхронизируйте спецификации с openspec-sync-specs","ar":"مزامنة المواصفات مع openspec-sync-specs","en":"openspec-sync-specs"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-sync-specs是一种轻量级的GraphQL和Prisma.io后端，用于同步delta specs","ja":"openspec-sync-specsは軽量級のGraphQLとPrisma.ioバックエンドで、delta specsの同期に使用されます","ko":"openspec-sync-specs는 경량급 GraphQL 및 Prisma.io 백엔드로 델타 사양을 동기화하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"openspec-sync-specs es una solución de backend ligera para node.js que sincroniza delta specs con main specs de manera inteligente.","fr":"openspec-sync-specs est une solution de backend légère pour node.js qui synchronise les delta specs avec les main specs de manière intelligente.","de":"openspec-sync-specs ist eine leichte Backend-Lösung für node.js, die Delta-Specs mit Main-Specs intelligent synchronisiert.","pt":"O openspec-sync-specs é um agente leve que sincroniza delta specs com main specs. Ele permite mesclagem inteligente, como adicionar um cenário sem copiar tod...","ru":"Openspec-sync-specs - это легкий агент, который синхронизирует delta specs с main specs. Он позволяет интеллектуальное слияние, например, добавление сценария...","ar":"openspec-sync-specs هو وكلاء خفيف يزامن مواصفات دلتا مع مواصفات رئيسية. يتيح الاندماج الذكي، مثل إضافة سيناريو دون نسخ متطلبات كاملة.","en":"Lightweight GraphQL & Prisma.io node.js backend"},"definition":{"en":"Lightweight GraphQL & Prisma.io node.js backend"},"features":{"zh":["智能合并","delta specs同步","轻量级GraphQL后端","Prisma.io集成","可选的变更名称指定","对话上下文感知"],"ja":["スマートマージ","delta specsの同期","軽量級GraphQLバックエンド","Prisma.io統合","変更名の任意指定","会話コンテキスト感知"],"ko":["스마트 병합","델타 사양 동기화","경량급 GraphQL 백엔드","Prisma.io 통합","변경 이름의任意 지정","대화 컨텍스트 인식"],"es":["Sincronización de especificaciones","Soporte para GraphQL y Prisma.io","Operación de agente impulsada","Fusión inteligente de cambios","Compatibilidad con node.js"],"fr":["Synchronisation des spécifications","Prise en charge de GraphQL et Prisma.io","Opération d''agent pilotée","Fusion intelligente des modifications","Compatibilité avec node.js"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Spezifikationen","Unterstützung für GraphQL und Prisma.io","Agenten-getriebener Betrieb","Intelligente Zusammenführung von Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit node.js"],"pt":["Sincronização de delta specs com main specs","Mesclagem inteligente de especificações","Suporte a GraphQL e Prisma.io","Operação baseada em agente","Edição direta de especificações principais"],"ru":["Синхронизация delta specs с main specs","Интеллектуальное слияние спецификаций","Поддержка GraphQL и Prisma.io","Операция на основе агента","Прямое редактирование основных спецификаций"],"ar":["مزامنة مواصفات دلتا مع مواصفات رئيسية","الاندماج الذكي للمواصفات","دعم GraphQL و Prisma.io","عملية dựa على وكلاء","التحرير المباشر للمواصفات الرئيسية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-sync-specs","GraphQL","Prisma.io","delta specs","智能合并","后端开发","Node.js","JavaScript"],"ja":["openspec-sync-specs","GraphQL","Prisma.io","delta specs","スマートマージ","バックエンド開発","Node.js","JavaScript"],"ko":["openspec-sync-specs","GraphQL","Prisma.io","델타 사양","스마트 병합","백엔드 개발","Node.js","JavaScript"],"es":["sincronización de especificaciones","backend ligero","node.js","GraphQL","Prisma.io","agente impulsado","fusión inteligente"],"fr":["synchronisation des spécifications","backend léger","node.js","GraphQL","Prisma.io","opération d''agent","fusion intelligente"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Spezifikationen","leichtes Backend","node.js","GraphQL","Prisma.io","Agenten-getriebener Betrieb","intelligente Zusammenführung"],"pt":["openspec-sync-specs","sincronização de especificações","GraphQL","Prisma.io","desenvolvimento de software","agente de sincronização","mesclagem inteligente"],"ru":["openspec-sync-specs","синхронизация спецификаций","GraphQL","Prisma.io","разработка программного обеспечения","агент синхронизации","интеллектуальное слияние"],"ar":["openspec-sync-specs","مزامنة المواصفات","GraphQL","Prisma.io","تطوير البرمجيات","وكيل المزامنة","الاندماج الذكي"]}},"owner":"uxname","repo":"liteend","repoPath":"uxname/liteend","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-sync-specs","description":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs. Use when the user wants to update main specs with changes from a delta spec, without archiving the change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selectio","body":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have delta specs (under `specs/` directory).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Find delta specs**\n\n   Look for delta spec files in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/*/spec.md`.\n\n   Each delta spec file contains sections like:\n   - `## ADDED Requirements` - New requirements to add\n   - `## MODIFIED Requirements` - Changes to existing requirements\n   - `## REMOVED Requirements` - Requirements to remove\n   - `## RENAMED Requirements` - Requirements to rename (FROM:/TO: format)\n\n   If no delta specs found, inform user and stop.\n\n3. **For each delta spec, apply changes to main specs**\n\n   For each capability with a delta spec at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/<capability>/spec.md`:\n\n   a. **Read the delta spec** to understand the intended changes\n\n   b. **Read the main spec** at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md` (may not exist yet)\n\n   c. **Apply changes intelligently**:\n\n      **ADDED Requirements:**\n      - If requirement doesn''t exist in main spec → add it\n      - If requirement already exists → update it to match (treat as implicit MODIFIED)\n\n      **MODIFIED Requirements:**\n      - Find the requirement in main spec\n      - Apply the changes - this can be:\n        - Adding new scenarios (don''t need to copy existing ones)\n        - Modifying existing scenarios\n        - Changing the requirement description\n      - Preserve scenarios/content not mentioned in the delta\n\n      **REMOVED Requirements:**\n      - Remove the entire requirement block from main spec\n\n      **RENAMED Requirements:**\n      - Find the FROM requirement, rename to TO\n\n   d. **Create new main spec** if capability doesn''t exist yet:\n      - Create `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n      - Add Purpose section (can be brief, mark as TBD)\n      - Add Requirements section with the ADDED requirements\n\n4. **Show summary**\n\n   After applying all changes, summarize:\n   - Which capabilities were updated\n   - What changes were made (requirements added/modified/removed/renamed)\n\n**Delta Spec Format Reference**\n\n```markdown\n## ADDED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: New Feature\nThe system SHALL do something new.\n\n#### Scenario: Basic case\n- **WHEN** user does X\n- **THEN** system does Y\n\n## MODIFIED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Existing Feature\n#### Scenario: New scenario to add\n- **WHEN** user does A\n- **THEN** system does B\n\n## REMOVED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Deprecated Feature\n\n## RENAMED Requirements\n\n- FROM: `### Requirement: Old Name`\n- TO: `### Requirement: New Name`\n```\n\n**Key Principle: Intelligent Merging**\n\nUnlike programmatic merging, you can apply **partial updates**:\n- To add a scenario, just include that scenario under MODIFIED - don''t copy existing scenarios\n- The delta represents *intent*, not a wholesale replacement\n- Use your judgment to merge changes sensibly\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Specs Synced: <change-name>\n\nUpdated main specs:\n\n**<capability-1>**:\n- Added requirement: \"New Feature\"\n- Modified requirement: \"Existing Feature\" (added 1 scenario)\n\n**<capability-2>**:\n- Created new spec file\n- Added requirement: \"Another Feature\"\n\nMain specs are now updated. The change remains active - archive when implementation is complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Read both delta and main specs before making changes\n- Preserve existing content not mentioned in delta\n- If something is unclear, ask for clarification\n- Show what you''re changing as you go\n- The operation should be idempotent - running twice should give same result\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:21:28.862Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for GraphQL Schema Management Agents handling incremental specification updates.","zh":"对于处理增量规范更新的 GraphQL 模式管理代理来说是必不可少的。","ja":"GraphQL スキーマ管理エージェントがインクリメンタルな仕様の更新を処理するために不可欠です。","ko":"증분 사양 업데이트를 처리하는 GraphQL 스키마 관리 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de administración de esquemas GraphQL que manejan actualizaciones de especificaciones incrementales.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de gestion de schémas GraphQL qui gèrent les mises à jour de spécifications incrémentielles.","de":"Wesentlich für GraphQL-Schema-Management-Agents, die inkrementelle Spezifikationsaktualisierungen verarbeiten.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Esquema GraphQL que lidam com atualizações de especificações incrementais.","ru":"Необходим для агентов управления схемой GraphQL, обрабатывающих инкрементальные обновления спецификаций.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات إدارة مخطط GraphQL التي تتعامل مع تحديثات مواصفات متزايدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables intelligent merging of delta specs into main GraphQL specifications using Prisma.io, allowing agents to add scenarios without duplicating entire requirements through context-aware change detection.","zh":"通过使用 Prisma.io，实现了 delta 规范与主 GraphQL 规范的智能合并，允许代理在不重复整个需求的情况下通过上下文感知的更改检测添加场景。","ja":"Prisma.io を使用して、デルタ仕様とメインの GraphQL 仕様を賢くマージし、エージェントがコンテキストを認識した変更の検出を介してシナリオを追加できるようにします。","ko":"Prisma.io를 사용하여 델타 사양과 주요 GraphQL 사양을 지능적으로 병합하여 에이전트가 컨텍스트 인식 변경 감지를 통해 시나리오를 추가할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite la fusión inteligente de especificaciones delta en especificaciones principales de GraphQL utilizando Prisma.io, lo que permite a los agentes agregar escenarios sin duplicar los requisitos completos a través de la detección de cambios consciente del contexto.","fr":"Permet la fusion intelligente des spécifications delta dans les spécifications principales GraphQL à l''aide de Prisma.io, ce qui permet aux agents d''ajouter des scénarios sans dupliquer les exigences complètes grâce à la détection de changements consciente du contexte.","de":"Ermöglicht die intelligente Zusammenführung von Deltaspezifikationen in die Haupt-GraphQL-Spezifikationen unter Verwendung von Prisma.io, wodurch es den Agenten ermöglicht wird, Szenarien hinzuzufügen, ohne die gesamten Anforderungen durch kontextbewusste Änderungserkennung zu duplizieren.","pt":"Permite a mesclagem inteligente de especificações delta nos principais esquemas GraphQL usando Prisma.io, permitindo que os agentes adicionem cenários sem duplicar todos os requisitos por meio da detecção de alterações sensível ao contexto.","ru":"Позволяет интеллектуально объединять спецификации delta в основные спецификации GraphQL с помощью Prisma.io, что позволяет агентам добавлять сценарии без дублирования всех требований посредством контекстно-зависимого обнаружения изменений.","ar":"يمكّن دمج ذكاء المواصفات دلتا في مواصفات جرافكول الرئيسية باستخدام بريسما.أي أو، مما يسمح للوكلاء بإضافة سيناريوهات دون تكرار جميع المتطلبات من خلال الكشف عن التغييرات الوعي بالسياق."},"useCases":{"en":["Synchronizing delta specs after schema changes","Intelligently merging new scenarios into existing requirements","Resolving ambiguous change names through contextual inference"],"zh":["模式更改后同步 delta 规范","将新场景智能地合并到现有需求中","通过上下文推理解决模糊的更改名称"],"ja":["スキーマの変更後、デルタ仕様を同期する","新しいシナリオを既存の要件に賢くマージする","コンテキスト推論を通じて曖昧な変更名を解決する"],"ko":["스키마 변경 후 델타 사양을 동기화하는 것","새로운 시나리오를 기존 요구 사항에 지능적으로 병합하는 것","컨텍스트 추론을 통해 모호한 변경 이름을 해결하는 것"],"es":["Sincronizar las especificaciones delta después de los cambios de esquema","Fusionar inteligentemente nuevos escenarios en los requisitos existentes","Resolver nombres de cambios ambiguos a través de la inferencia contextual"],"fr":["Synchroniser les spécifications delta après les modifications de schéma","Fusionner intelligemment de nouveaux scénarios dans les exigences existantes","Résoudre les noms de changements ambigus grâce à l''inférence contextuelle"],"de":["Deltaspezifikationen nach Schemäänderungen synchronisieren","Intelligente Zusammenführung neuer Szenarien in bestehende Anforderungen","Auflösung mehrdeutiger Änderungsnamen durch kontextuelle Inferenz"],"pt":["Sincronizar especificações delta após alterações de esquema","Mesclar inteligentemente novos cenários em requisitos existentes","Resolver nomes de alterações ambíguos por meio da inferência contextual"],"ru":["Синхронизировать спецификации delta после изменений схемы","Интеллектуально объединять новые сценарии с существующими требованиями","Решать неоднозначные имена изменений посредством контекстной инференции"],"ar":["تماشى مواصفات دلتا بعد التغييرات في المخطط","دمج السيناريوهات الجديدة بشكل ذكي في المتطلبات الحالية","حل أسماء التغييرات الغامضة من خلال الاستدلال السياقي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js backend environment","Depends on conversation context for change name inference","Must prompt user when change names are vague or ambiguous"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 后端环境","依赖于对话上下文进行更改名称推理","当更改名称不明确或模糊时，必须提示用户"],"ja":["Node.js のバックエンド環境が必要","変更名の推論に会話のコンテキストに依存する","変更名が曖昧または不明確な場合、ユーザーにプロンプトする必要がある"],"ko":["Node.js 백엔드 환경이 필요합니다.","변경 이름 추론에 대화 컨텍스트에 의존합니다.","변경 이름이 모호하거나 불명확한 경우 사용자에게 프롬프트해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno de backend de Node.js","Depende del contexto de conversación para la inferencia del nombre del cambio","Debe solicitar al usuario cuando los nombres de los cambios son vagos o ambiguos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de backend Node.js","Dépend du contexte de conversation pour l''inférence du nom du changement","Doit solliciter l''utilisateur lorsque les noms des changements sont vagues ou ambigus"],"de":["Benötigt eine Node.js-Backend-Umgebung","Hängt vom Konversationskontext für die Inferenz des Änderungsnamens ab","Muss den Benutzer auffordern, wenn die Änderungsnamen vage oder mehrdeutig sind"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de backend Node.js","Depende do contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Deve solicitar ao usuário quando os nomes das alterações forem vagos ou ambíguos"],"ru":["Требует среды backend Node.js","Зависит от контекста разговора для вывода имени изменения","Должен запрашивать пользователя, когда имена изменений неясны или двусмысленны"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة خلفية نود.جس","يعتمد على سياق المحادثة لاستدلال اسم التغيير","يجب حث المستخدم عندما تكون أسماء التغييرات غامضة أو مزدوجة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
