ons delta","Fusion intelligente des modifications","Édition directe des spécifications principales","Option pour spécifier un nom de modification","Inférence du nom de modification depuis le contexte de la conversation"],"de":["Automatische Synchronisierung von Delta-Spezifikationen","Intelligente Zusammenführung von Änderungen","Direkte Bearbeitung der Haupt-Spezifikationen","Option zum Angeben eines Änderungsnamens","Ableitung des Änderungsnamens aus dem Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Sincronização inteligente de delta specs com main specs","Mesclagem de cenários sem copiar requisitos inteiros","Operação de agente para edição direta de main specs","Suporte a inferência de contexto de conversa","Prompt para seleção de mudanças disponíveis"],"ru":["Умная синхронизация delta specs с main specs","Объединение сценариев без копирования целых требований","Операция агента для прямого редактирования main specs","Поддержка вывода контекста разговора","Промпт для выбора доступных изменений"],"ar":["مزامنة ذكية لمواصفات دلتا مع مواصفات رئيسية","دمج السيناريوهات بدون نسخ المتطلبات كاملة","عملية وسيطة لتحرير مباشر لمواصفات رئيسية","دعم استنتاج سياق المحادثة","ترويج لاختيار التغييرات المتاحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-sync-specs","智能合并","规格同步","delta规格","主规格更新","agent驱动"],"ja":["openspec-sync-specs","智能マージ","規格同期","デルタ規格","メイン規格更新","エージェント駆動"],"ko":["openspec-sync-specs","智能 병합","규격 동기화","델타 규격","메인 규격 업데이트","에이전트 드라이븐"],"es":["sincronización de especificaciones","especificaciones delta","fusión inteligente","edición de especificaciones","automatización de flujo de trabajo","openspec-sync-specs","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["synchronisation des spécifications","spécifications delta","fusion intelligente","édition de spécifications","automatisation du flux de travail","openspec-sync-specs","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Spezifikationen","Delta-Spezifikationen","intelligente Zusammenführung","Bearbeitung von Spezifikationen","Automatisierung des Arbeitsablaufs","openspec-sync-specs","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["sincronização de specs","delta specs","main specs","openspec-sync-specs","desenvolvimento de software","workflow de desenvolvimento","eficiência de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["синхронизация спек","delta спеки","main спеки","openspec-sync-specs","разработка программного обеспечения","рабочий процесс разработки","эффективность разработки"],"ar":["مزامنة المواصفات","مواصفات دلتا","مواصفات رئيسية","openspec-sync-specs","تطوير البرمجيات","سير عمل التطوير","كفاءة التطوير"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"ai-assisted-engineering","repoPath":"gAmUssA/ai-assisted-engineering","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-sync-specs","description":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs. Use when the user wants to update main specs with changes from a delta spec, without archiving the change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selectio","body":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have delta specs (under `specs/` directory).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Find delta specs**\n\n   Look for delta spec files in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/*/spec.md`.\n\n   Each delta spec file contains sections like:\n   - `## ADDED Requirements` - New requirements to add\n   - `## MODIFIED Requirements` - Changes to existing requirements\n   - `## REMOVED Requirements` - Requirements to remove\n   - `## RENAMED Requirements` - Requirements to rename (FROM:/TO: format)\n\n   If no delta specs found, inform user and stop.\n\n3. **For each delta spec, apply changes to main specs**\n\n   For each capability with a delta spec at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/<capability>/spec.md`:\n\n   a. **Read the delta spec** to understand the intended changes\n\n   b. **Read the main spec** at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md` (may not exist yet)\n\n   c. **Apply changes intelligently**:\n\n      **ADDED Requirements:**\n      - If requirement doesn''t exist in main spec → add it\n      - If requirement already exists → update it to match (treat as implicit MODIFIED)\n\n      **MODIFIED Requirements:**\n      - Find the requirement in main spec\n      - Apply the changes - this can be:\n        - Adding new scenarios (don''t need to copy existing ones)\n        - Modifying existing scenarios\n        - Changing the requirement description\n      - Preserve scenarios/content not mentioned in the delta\n\n      **REMOVED Requirements:**\n      - Remove the entire requirement block from main spec\n\n      **RENAMED Requirements:**\n      - Find the FROM requirement, rename to TO\n\n   d. **Create new main spec** if capability doesn''t exist yet:\n      - Create `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n      - Add Purpose section (can be brief, mark as TBD)\n      - Add Requirements section with the ADDED requirements\n\n4. **Show summary**\n\n   After applying all changes, summarize:\n   - Which capabilities were updated\n   - What changes were made (requirements added/modified/removed/renamed)\n\n**Delta Spec Format Reference**\n\n```markdown\n## ADDED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: New Feature\nThe system SHALL do something new.\n\n#### Scenario: Basic case\n- **WHEN** user does X\n- **THEN** system does Y\n\n## MODIFIED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Existing Feature\n#### Scenario: New scenario to add\n- **WHEN** user does A\n- **THEN** system does B\n\n## REMOVED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Deprecated Feature\n\n## RENAMED Requirements\n\n- FROM: `### Requirement: Old Name`\n- TO: `### Requirement: New Name`\n```\n\n**Key Principle: Intelligent Merging**\n\nUnlike programmatic merging, you can apply **partial updates**:\n- To add a scenario, just include that scenario under MODIFIED - don''t copy existing scenarios\n- The delta represents *intent*, not a wholesale replacement\n- Use your judgment to merge changes sensibly\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Specs Synced: <change-name>\n\nUpdated main specs:\n\n**<capability-1>**:\n- Added requirement: \"New Feature\"\n- Modified requirement: \"Existing Feature\" (added 1 scenario)\n\n**<capability-2>**:\n- Created new spec file\n- Added requirement: \"Another Feature\"\n\nMain specs are now updated. The change remains active - archive when implementation is complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Read both delta and main specs before making changes\n- Preserve existing content not mentioned in delta\n- If something is unclear, ask for clarification\n- Show what you''re changing as you go\n- The operation should be idempotent - running twice should give same result\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:21:38.449Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Specification Management Agents needing intelligent spec merging capabilities.","zh":"Perfect for Specification Management Agents needing intelligent spec merging capabilities.","ja":"Perfect for Specification Management Agents needing intelligent spec merging capabilities.","ko":"Perfect for Specification Management Agents needing intelligent spec merging capabilities.","es":"Perfect for Specification Management Agents needing intelligent spec merging capabilities.","fr":"Perfect for Specification Management Agents needing intelligent spec merging capabilities.","de":"Perfect for Specification Management Agents needing intelligent spec merging capabilities.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Especificações que necessitam de capacidades de mesclagem de especificações inteligentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления спецификациями, требующих интеллектуальных возможностей слияния спецификаций.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المواصفات التي تحتاج إلى مهارات دمج مواصفات ذكية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to sync delta specs with main specs, enabling intelligent merging and direct editing of specs, while supporting scenario additions without duplicating requirements, all through an agent-driven operation.","zh":"Empowers agents to sync delta specs with main specs, enabling intelligent merging and direct editing of specs, while supporting scenario additions without duplicating requirements, all through an agent-driven operation.","ja":"Empowers agents to sync delta specs with main specs, enabling intelligent merging and direct editing of specs, while supporting scenario additions without duplicating requirements, all through an agent-driven operation.","ko":"Empowers agents to sync delta specs with main specs, enabling intelligent merging and direct editing of specs, while supporting scenario additions without duplicating requirements, all through an agent-driven operation.","es":"Empowers agents to sync delta specs with main specs, enabling intelligent merging and direct editing of specs, while supporting scenario additions without duplicating requirements, all through an agent-driven operation.","fr":"Empowers agents to sync delta specs with main specs, enabling intelligent merging and direct editing of specs, while supporting scenario additions without duplicating requirements, all through an agent-driven operation.","de":"Empowers agents to sync delta specs with main specs, enabling intelligent merging and direct editing of specs, while supporting scenario additions without duplicating requirements, all through an agent-driven operation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a sincronizar especificações delta com as principais especificações, permitindo a mesclagem inteligente e a edição direta das especificações, enquanto suporta a adição de cenários sem duplicar requisitos, tudo por meio de uma operação impulsionada por agente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью синхронизировать дельта-спецификации с основными спецификациями, что позволяет выполнять интеллектуальное слияние и прямое редактирование спецификаций, а также поддерживает добавление сценариев без дублирования требований, все это через операцию, управляемую агентом.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من مزامنة مواصفات دلتا مع المواصفات الرئيسية، وتمكين الدمج الذكي وتحرير المواصفات مباشرة، مع دعم إضافة السيناريوهات دون تكرار المتطلبات، وكل ذلك من خلال عملية مدفوعة بالوكيل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating spec updates from change requests","Merging delta specs into main specifications","Applying changes without overwriting existing requirements"],"zh":["Automating spec updates from change requests","Merging delta specs into main specifications","Applying changes without overwriting existing requirements"],"ja":["Automating spec updates from change requests","Merging delta specs into main specifications","Applying changes without overwriting existing requirements"],"ko":["Automating spec updates from change requests","Merging delta specs into main specifications","Applying changes without overwriting existing requirements"],"es":["Automating spec updates from change requests","Merging delta specs into main specifications","Applying changes without overwriting existing requirements"],"fr":["Automating spec updates from change requests","Merging delta specs into main specifications","Applying changes without overwriting existing requirements"],"de":["Automating spec updates from change requests","Merging delta specs into main specifications","Applying changes without overwriting existing requirements"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de especificações a partir de solicitações de alteração","Mesclar especificações delta nas especificações principais","Aplicar alterações sem sobrescrever requisitos existentes"],"ru":["Автоматизация обновления спецификаций из запросов на изменение","Слияние дельта-спецификаций в основные спецификации","Применение изменений без перезаписи существующих требований"],"ar":["تحديث التلقائي لتحديث المواصفات من طلبات التغيير","دمج مواصفات دلتا في المواصفات الرئيسية","تطبيق التغييرات دون كتابة متطلبات موجودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires conversation context or explicit change name specification","May prompt for change selection if input is vague or ambiguous"],"zh":["Requires conversation context or explicit change name specification","May prompt for change selection if input is vague or ambiguous"],"ja":["Requires conversation context or explicit change name specification","May prompt for change selection if input is vague or ambiguous"],"ko":["Requires conversation context or explicit change name specification","May prompt for change selection if input is vague or ambiguous"],"es":["Requires conversation context or explicit change name specification","May prompt for change selection if input is vague or ambiguous"],"fr":["Requires conversation context or explicit change name specification","May prompt for change selection if input is vague or ambiguous"],"de":["Requires conversation context or explicit change name specification","May prompt for change selection if input is vague or ambiguous"],"pt":["Requer contexto de conversa ou especificação explícita do nome da alteração","Pode solicitar seleção de alteração se a entrada for vaga ou ambígua"],"ru":["Требуется контекст разговора или явное указание имени изменения","Может запросить выбор изменения, если входные данные неоднозначны или расплывчаты"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق المحادثة أو تحديد اسم التغيير明","يمكن أن يطلب اختيار التغيير إذا كانت المدخلات غامضة أو غير واضحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
