hronise les spécifications delta avec les specs principales de manière intelligente","de":"openspec-sync-specs ist eine Agenten-Operation, die Delta-Spezifikationen mit den Haupt-Specs intelligently synchronisiert","pt":"openspec-sync-specs é uma operação baseada em agente que sincroniza delta specs com specs principais, permitindo mesclagem inteligente de cenários e requisitos","ru":"openspec-sync-specs - это операция на основе агента, которая синхронизирует дельта-спецификации с основными спецификациями, позволяя интеллектуальное слияние...","ar":"openspec-sync-specs هي عملية تعتمد على الوكيل لتزامن مواصفات دلتا مع مواصفات رئيسية، مما يسمح بالدمج الذكي للسيناريوهات والمتطلبات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Sincronización de especifcaciones delta con las principales specs","Operación de agente para una integración más inteligente","Permite la fusión inteligente de escenarios","Edición directa de las specs principales","Compatibilidad con la inferencia de contexto de conversación"],"fr":["Synchronisation des spécifications delta avec les specs principales","Opération d''agent pour une intégration plus intelligente","Permet la fusion intelligente de scénarios","Édition directe des specs principales","Compatibilité avec l''inférence de contexte de conversation"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Delta-Spezifikationen mit den Haupt-Specs","Agenten-Operation für eine intelligentere Integration","Ermöglicht die intelligente Zusammenführung von Szenarien","Direkte Bearbeitung der Haupt-Specs","Kompatibilität mit der Kontextinferenz von Konversationen"],"pt":["Sincronização de delta specs com specs principais","Mesclagem inteligente de cenários e requisitos","Operação baseada em agente para edição direta de specs principais","Suporte à seleção de alterações para sincronização","Capacidade de inferir alterações a partir do contexto de conversa"],"ru":["Синхронизация дельта-спецификаций с основными спецификациями","Интеллектуальное слияние сценариев и требований","Операция на основе агента для прямого редактирования основых спецификаций","Поддержка выбора изменений для синхронизации","Возможность вывода изменений из контекста разговора"],"ar":["مزامنة مواصفات دلتا مع مواصفات رئيسية","الدمج الذكي للسيناريوهات والمتطلبات","عملية تعتمد على الوكيل لتحرير مباشر لمواصفات رئيسية","دعم اختيار التغييرات لتزامن","قدرة على استنتاج التغييرات من سياق المحادثة"]},"keywords":{"es":["sincronización de specs","especificaciones delta","operación de agente","integración inteligente","fusion de escenarios","edición de specs","inferencia de contexto"],"fr":["synchronisation de specs","spécifications delta","opération d''agent","intégration intelligente","fusion de scénarios","édition de specs","inférence de contexte"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Specs","Delta-Spezifikationen","Agenten-Operation","intelligentere Integration","Zusammenführung von Szenarien","Bearbeitung von Specs","Kontextinferenz"],"pt":["sincronização de especificações","delta specs","specs principais","mesclagem inteligente","operação baseada em agente","edição direta de specs","seleção de alterações","inferência de alterações"],"ru":["синхронизация спецификаций","дельта-спецификации","основные спецификации","интеллектуальное слияние","операция на основе агента","прямое редактирование спецификаций","выбор изменений","вывод изменений"],"ar":["مزامنة المواصفات","مواصفات دلتا","مواصفات رئيسية","الدمج الذكي","عملية تعتمد على الوكيل","تحرير مباشر للمواصفات","اختيار التغييرات","استنتاج التغييرات"]}},"owner":"beyildirim","repo":"tracehound","repoPath":"beyildirim/tracehound","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-sync-specs","description":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs. Use when the user wants to update main specs with changes from a delta spec, without archiving the change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selectio","body":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have delta specs (under `specs/` directory).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Find delta specs**\n\n   Look for delta spec files in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/*/spec.md`.\n\n   Each delta spec file contains sections like:\n   - `## ADDED Requirements` - New requirements to add\n   - `## MODIFIED Requirements` - Changes to existing requirements\n   - `## REMOVED Requirements` - Requirements to remove\n   - `## RENAMED Requirements` - Requirements to rename (FROM:/TO: format)\n\n   If no delta specs found, inform user and stop.\n\n3. **For each delta spec, apply changes to main specs**\n\n   For each capability with a delta spec at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/<capability>/spec.md`:\n\n   a. **Read the delta spec** to understand the intended changes\n\n   b. **Read the main spec** at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md` (may not exist yet)\n\n   c. **Apply changes intelligently**:\n\n      **ADDED Requirements:**\n      - If requirement doesn''t exist in main spec → add it\n      - If requirement already exists → update it to match (treat as implicit MODIFIED)\n\n      **MODIFIED Requirements:**\n      - Find the requirement in main spec\n      - Apply the changes - this can be:\n        - Adding new scenarios (don''t need to copy existing ones)\n        - Modifying existing scenarios\n        - Changing the requirement description\n      - Preserve scenarios/content not mentioned in the delta\n\n      **REMOVED Requirements:**\n      - Remove the entire requirement block from main spec\n\n      **RENAMED Requirements:**\n      - Find the FROM requirement, rename to TO\n\n   d. **Create new main spec** if capability doesn''t exist yet:\n      - Create `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n      - Add Purpose section (can be brief, mark as TBD)\n      - Add Requirements section with the ADDED requirements\n\n4. **Show summary**\n\n   After applying all changes, summarize:\n   - Which capabilities were updated\n   - What changes were made (requirements added/modified/removed/renamed)\n\n**Delta Spec Format Reference**\n\n```markdown\n## ADDED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: New Feature\nThe system SHALL do something new.\n\n#### Scenario: Basic case\n- **WHEN** user does X\n- **THEN** system does Y\n\n## MODIFIED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Existing Feature\n#### Scenario: New scenario to add\n- **WHEN** user does A\n- **THEN** system does B\n\n## REMOVED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Deprecated Feature\n\n## RENAMED Requirements\n\n- FROM: `### Requirement: Old Name`\n- TO: `### Requirement: New Name`\n```\n\n**Key Principle: Intelligent Merging**\n\nUnlike programmatic merging, you can apply **partial updates**:\n- To add a scenario, just include that scenario under MODIFIED - don''t copy existing scenarios\n- The delta represents *intent*, not a wholesale replacement\n- Use your judgment to merge changes sensibly\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Specs Synced: <change-name>\n\nUpdated main specs:\n\n**<capability-1>**:\n- Added requirement: \"New Feature\"\n- Modified requirement: \"Existing Feature\" (added 1 scenario)\n\n**<capability-2>**:\n- Created new spec file\n- Added requirement: \"Another Feature\"\n\nMain specs are now updated. The change remains active - archive when implementation is complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Read both delta and main specs before making changes\n- Preserve existing content not mentioned in delta\n- If something is unclear, ask for clarification\n- Show what you''re changing as you go\n- The operation should be idempotent - running twice should give same result\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:21:41.110Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Specification Management Agents requiring intelligent spec merging and delta updates","zh":"适用于需要智能规格合并和增量更新的规格管理代理","ja":"知的仕様マージおよびデルタ更新を必要とする仕様管理エージェントに適しています","ko":"지능형 사양 병합 및 델타 업데이트가 필요한 사양 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de especificaciones que requieren una fusión de especificaciones inteligente y actualizaciones delta","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de spécifications nécessitant une fusion de spécifications intelligente et des mises à jour delta","de":"Ideal für Spezifikationsmanagement-Agenten, die eine intelligente Spezifikationszusammenführung und Delta-Updates erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Especificações que exigem mesclagem de especificações inteligente e atualizações delta","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления спецификациями, требующих интеллектуального слияния спецификаций и обновлений дельта","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المواصفات الذي يتطلب دمج مواصفات ذكي وتحديثات دلتا"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to sync delta specs with main specs, enabling intelligent merging and conflict resolution through direct editing, using change names and conversation context to infer and apply changes accurately","zh":"赋予代理人同步主规格和增量规格的能力，通过直接编辑实现智能合并和冲突解决，利用变更名称和对话上下文来准确推断和应用变更","ja":"メイン仕様とデルタ仕様を同期する能力をエージェントに与え、直接編集を使用して知的マージとコンフリクト解決を可能にし、変更名と会話コンテキストを使用して変更を正確に推論して適用します","ko":"메인 사양과 델타 사양을 동기화하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하여 직접 편집을 통해 지능형 병합 및 충돌 해결을 가능하게 하며, 변경 이름과 대화 문맥을 사용하여 변경 사항을 정확하게 추론하여 적용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a sincronizar las especificaciones delta con las especificaciones principales, permitiendo la fusión inteligente y la resolución de conflictos a través de la edición directa, utilizando nombres de cambios y contexto de conversación para inferir y aplicar los cambios con precisión","fr":"Permet aux agents de synchroniser les spécifications delta avec les spécifications principales, permettant une fusion intelligente et une résolution de conflits via l''édition directe, en utilisant les noms de changements et le contexte de conversation pour inférer et appliquer les changements avec précision","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Delta-Spezifikationen mit den Haupt-Spezifikationen zu synchronisieren, wodurch eine intelligente Zusammenführung und Konfliktlösung durch direkte Bearbeitung ermöglicht wird, indem Änderungsnamen und Konversationskontext verwendet werden, um Änderungen genau abzuleiten und anzuwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a sincronizar especificações delta com as principais especificações, permitindo a mesclagem inteligente e a resolução de conflitos por meio da edição direta, usando nomes de alterações e contexto de conversa para inferir e aplicar alterações com precisão","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью синхронизировать дельта-спецификации с основными спецификациями, обеспечивая интеллектуальное слияние и разрешение конфликтов посредством прямого редактирования, используя имена изменений и контекст разговора для вывода и точного применения изменений","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية مزامنة مواصفات دلتا مع المواصفات الرئيسية، وتمكين الدمج الذكي وحل النزاعات من خلال التحرير المباشر، باستخدام أسماء التغيير والسياق المحادثة لاستنتاج وتطبيق التغييرات بدقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating spec updates by merging delta specs","Resolving spec conflicts through intelligent merging","Streamlining change management by inferring change names from conversation context"],"zh":["通过合并增量规格来自动化规格更新","通过智能合并来解决规格冲突","通过从对话上下文中推断变更名称来简化变更管理"],"ja":["デルタ仕様をマージすることで仕様更新を自動化する","知的マージを使用して仕様のコンフリクトを解決する","会話コンテキストから変更名を推論することで変更管理を簡素化する"],"ko":["델타 사양을 병합하여 사양 업데이트를 자동화하는 것","지능형 병합을 사용하여 사양 충돌을 해결하는 것","대화 문맥에서 변경 이름을 추론하여 변경 관리를 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de especificaciones mediante la fusión de especificaciones delta","Resolver conflictos de especificaciones a través de la fusión inteligente","Optimizar la gestión de cambios inferiendo nombres de cambios del contexto de conversación"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de spécifications en fusionnant les spécifications delta","Résoudre les conflits de spécifications via une fusion intelligente","Optimiser la gestion des changements en inférant les noms de changements du contexte de conversation"],"de":["Automatisieren von Spezifikations-Updates durch die Zusammenführung von Delta-Spezifikationen","Auflösen von Spezifikationskonflikten durch intelligente Zusammenführung","Optimieren des Änderungsmanagements durch Ableiten von Änderungsnamen aus dem Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de especificações mesclando especificações delta","Resolver conflitos de especificações por meio da mesclagem inteligente","Otimizar gerenciamento de alterações inferindo nomes de alterações do contexto de conversa"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления спецификаций, сливая дельта-спецификации","Разрешать конфликты спецификаций посредством интеллектуального слияния","Оптимизировать управление изменениями, выводя имена изменений из контекста разговора"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحديثات المواصفات عن طريق مزامنة مواصفات دلتا","حل النزاعات في المواصفات من خلال الدمج الذكي","تبسيط إدارة التغييرات من خلال استنتاج أسماء التغيير من السياق المحادثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit change name or inferrable conversation context","May prompt for change selection if input is vague or ambiguous"],"zh":["需要显式的变更名称或可推断的对话上下文","如果输入不明确或模糊，可能会提示选择变更"],"ja":["明示的な変更名または推論可能な会話コンテキストが必要","入力が不明確または曖昧な場合、変更の選択を求めることがある"],"ko":["명시적인 변경 이름 또는 추론 가능한 대화 문맥이 필요","입력이 불명확または 모호한 경우 변경 선택을 요청할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere un nombre de cambio explícito o un contexto de conversación inferible","Puede solicitar la selección de cambios si la entrada es vaga o ambigua"],"fr":["Nécessite un nom de changement explicite ou un contexte de conversation inférable","Peut demander la sélection de changements si l''entrée est vague ou ambiguë"],"de":["Benötigt einen expliziten Änderungsnamen oder einen ableitbaren Konversationskontext","Kann die Auswahl von Änderungen anfordern, wenn die Eingabe vage oder mehrdeutig ist"],"pt":["Exige nome de alteração explícito ou contexto de conversa inferível","Pode solicitar seleção de alteração se a entrada for vaga ou ambígua"],"ru":["Требует явного имени изменения или выводимого контекста разговора","Может запросить выбор изменения, если входные данные неоднозначны или расплывчаты"],"ar":["يتطلب اسم تغيير صريح أو سياق محادثة يمكن استنتاجه","يمكن أن يطلب اختيار التغيير إذا كانت الإدخال غامضة أو غير واضحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
