:"frontend-design"},"description":{"zh":"前端设计技能指导创建独特的生产级前端界面，注重细节和创意选择","ja":"フロントエンドデザインスキルは、独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成するためのガイドです。細部と創造的な選択に焦点を当てています","ko":"프론트엔드 디자인 스킬은 독특한 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하는 데 도움을 주는 가이드입니다. 세부 사항과 창의적인 선택에 중점을 둡니다","es":"El diseño de frontend guía la creación de interfaces de usuario distintivas y de producción. Implementa código de trabajo real con atención excepcional a los...","fr":"La conception de frontend guide la création d''interfaces utilisateur distinctives et de production. Implémenter du code de travail réel avec une attention ex...","de":"Das Frontend-Design leitet die Erstellung einzigartiger Benutzeroberflächen und Produktionscode. Implementieren Sie echten Arbeitscode mit außergewöhnlicher ...","pt":"Desenvolva interfaces de usuário personalizadas e de alta qualidade com atenção aos detalhes estéticos","ru":"Разработайте уникальные и высококачественные интерфейсы пользователя с вниманием к деталям","ar":"أنشئ واجهات مستخدم مخصصة وعالية الجودة مع اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建独特的前端界面","避免通用AI美学","注重细节和创意选择","生产级代码","实用设计"],"ja":["独自のフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成","一般的なAIエステティックを避ける","細部と創造的な選択に焦点を当てる","プロダクションレベルのコード","実用的デザイン"],"ko":["독특한 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성","일반적인 AI 미학을 피함","세부 사항과 창의적인 선택에 중점을 둠","프로덕션급 코드","실용적인 디자인"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Implementación de código de frontend de producción","Atención al detalle estético","Opciones creativas para el diseño","Desarrollo de componentes y páginas web","Integración con tecnologías de backend"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Implémentation de code de frontend de production","Attention aux détails esthétiques","Options créatives pour la conception","Développement de composants et de pages web","Intégration avec les technologies de backend"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen","Implementierung von Produktions-Code für Frontend","Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details","Kreative Optionen für das Design","Entwicklung von Komponenten und Webseiten","Integration mit Backend-Technologien"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Desenvolvimento de componentes e páginas","Implementação de soluções técnicas criativas","Otimização para experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Создание уникальных интерфейсов пользователя","Внимание к деталям","Разработка компонентов и страниц","Реализация творческих технических решений","Оптимизация для пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية","تطوير المكونات والصفحات","تنفيذ حلول تقنية إبداعية","تحسين لتحقيق تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级前端","独特界面","AI美学","细节设计","创意选择"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクションレベルのフロントエンド","独自のインターフェイス","AIエステティック","細部デザイン","創造的な選択"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 프론트엔드","독특한 인터페이스","AI 미학","세부 디자인","창의적인 선택"],"es":["diseño de frontend","desarrollo web","interfaces de usuario","estética web","codificación de frontend","producción de frontend","tecnologías de frontend","desarrollo de aplicaciones web","experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["conception de frontend","développement web","interfaces utilisateur","esthétique web","codage de frontend","production de frontend","technologies de frontend","développement d''applications web","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Webentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","Webästhetik","Frontend-Codierung","Frontend-Produktion","Frontend-Technologien","Webanwendungs-Entwicklung","Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["frontend design","desenvolvimento de frontend","interfaces de usuário personalizadas","experiência do usuário","desenvolvimento web","design de interfaces"],"ru":["фронтенд-дизайн","разработка фронтенда","уникальные интерфейсы пользователя","пользовательский опыт","веб-разработка","дизайн интерфейсов"],"ar":["تصميم الواجهة الأمامية","تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تجربة المستخدم","تطوير الويب","تصميم الواجهات"]}},"owner":"DiscourseAiOrgs","repo":"discourse.ai_landing_page","repoPath":"DiscourseAiOrgs/discourse.ai_landing_page","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:21:45.279Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing production-grade frontend interface creation with attention to aesthetic details.","zh":"适用于需要生产级前端接口创建并注重美观细节的UI焦点代理","ja":"UIに焦点を当てたエージェントが、生産性の高いフロントエンドインターフェイスの作成と美観の細部に注意する必要がある場合に適しています","ko":"생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스 생성 및 미적 세부 사항에 주의가 필요한 UI 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan crear interfaces de frontend de grado de producción con atención a los detalles estéticos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant la création d''interfaces frontend de production avec attention aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Perfekt für an der Benutzeroberfläche ausgerichtete Agenten, die eine erstklassige Erstellung von Frontend-Oberflächen mit Beachtung der ästhetischen Details benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI que necessitam de criação de interface de frontend de produção com atenção a detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым необходима создание интерфейса frontend производственного класса с учетом деталей эстетики.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على واجهة المستخدم و kteří يحتاجون إلى إنشاء واجهة أمامية من الدرجة الأولى مع اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices, utilizing protocols like HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, and potentially generating responsive designs and interactive components.","zh":"赋予代理人创造独特的、真正可用的代码的能力，具有对美观细节和创造性选择的异常关注，利用HTML、CSS和JavaScript等协议，并可能生成响应式设计和交互组件","ja":"エージェントが独自の、実際に動作するコードを生み出す能力を付与し、美観の細部や創造的な選択肢に例外的な注意を払い、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptなどのプロトコルを利用し、レスポンシブデザインやインタラクティブコンポーネントを生成する可能性がある","ko":"에이전트가 독특한 실제 작동하는 코드를 제작할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 미적 세부 사항과 창의적 선택에 예외적인 주의를 기울이며, HTML, CSS, 자바스크립트 등의 프로토콜을 활용하여 반응형 디자인과 상호 작용 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있는 가능성이 있습니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear código real y funcional con una atención excepcional a los detalles estéticos y opciones creativas, utilizando protocolos como HTML, CSS y JavaScript, y potencialmente generando diseños responsivos y componentes interactivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un code réel et fonctionnel avec une attention exceptionnelle aux détails esthétiques et aux choix créatifs, en utilisant des protocoles tels que HTML, CSS et JavaScript, et potentiellement en générant des conceptions responsives et des composants interactifs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, deutlich unterscheidbares, reales und funktionierendes Code mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details und kreative Entscheidungen zu erstellen, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie HTML, CSS und JavaScript, und potenziell die Generierung responsiver Designs und interaktiver Komponenten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar código de trabalho real distinto, com atenção excepcional a detalhes estéticos e escolhas criativas, utilizando protocolos como HTML, CSS e JavaScript, e potencialmente gerando designs responsivos e componentes interativos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отличительный, реально работающий код с исключительным вниманием к деталям эстетики и творческим выбором, используя протоколы như HTML, CSS и JavaScript, и потенциально генерируя отзывчивые дизайны и интерактивные компоненты.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء رمز عمل حقيقي متميز مع اهتمام استثنائي بالتفاصيل الجمالية والاختيارات الإبداعية، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTML و CSS و JavaScript، وربما توليد تصاميم مستجيبة ومكونات تفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive hero sections","Building custom UI components","Creating production-ready web application interfaces"],"zh":["设计响应式英雄区段","构建自定义UI组件","创建生产就绪的Web应用程序接口"],"ja":["レスポンシブなヒーローセクションの設計","カスタムUIコンポーネントの構築","生産就緒のWebアプリケーションインターフェイスの作成"],"ko":["반응형 영웅 섹션 설계","사용자 지정 UI 컴포넌트 구축","생산 준비 웹 애플리케이션 인터페이스 생성"],"es":["Diseñar secciones de héroe responsivas","Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados","Crear interfaces de aplicaciones web de producción listas"],"fr":["Concevoir des sections de héros responsives","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés","Créer des interfaces d''applications web de production prêtes"],"de":["Responsives Hero-Section-Design","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Erstellen von produktionsbereiten Webanwendungs-Oberflächen"],"pt":["Projetar seções de heróis responsivas","Construir componentes de UI personalizados","Criar interfaces de aplicativos web de produção prontas"],"ru":["Проектирование отзывчивых секций героев","Создание пользовательских компонентов UI","Создание интерфейсов веб-приложений производственного класса"],"ar":["تصميم أقسام بطل مستجيبة","بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","إنشاء واجهات تطبيقات الويب الجاهزة للانتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires context about purpose, audience, or technical constraints","May need additional libraries or frameworks for complex designs"],"zh":["需要关于目的、受众或技术约束的上下文","可能需要额外的库或框架用于复杂的设计"],"ja":["目的、対象者、または技術的制約についてのコンテキストが必要","複雑なデザインの場合は追加のライブラリまたはフレームワークが必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["목적, 대상 또는 기술적 제약에 대한 컨텍스트가 필요","복잡한 디자인의 경우 추가 라이브러리 또는 프레임워크가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere contexto sobre el propósito, la audiencia o las limitaciones técnicas","Puede necesitar bibliotecas o frameworks adicionales para diseños complejos"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte sur l''objectif, le public ou les contraintes techniques","Peut nécessiter des bibliothèques ou des frameworks supplémentaires pour des conceptions complexes"],"de":["Benötigt Kontext über den Zweck, das Publikum oder technische Einschränkungen","Kann zusätzliche Bibliotheken oder Frameworks für komplexe Designs benötigen"],"pt":["Exige contexto sobre propósito, audiência ou restrições técnicas","Pode precisar de bibliotecas ou estruturas adicionais para designs complexos"],"ru":["Требует контекста о цели, аудитории или технических ограничениях","Может потребовать дополнительных библиотек или фреймворков для сложных дизайнов"],"ar":["يتطلب سياقًا عن الغرض أو الجمهور أو القيود الفنية","يمكن أن يحتاج إلى مكتبات أو إطارات إضافية لتصاميم معقدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
