,"تطوير المكونات والصفحات","تنفيذ المتطلبات الفنية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级界面","功能性代码","审美细节","AI风格","设计思维","前端开发"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクショングレードインターフェイス","機能性コード","美観の細部","AIスタイル","デザイン思考","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 인터페이스","기능적 코드","미적 세부","AI 스타일","디자인 사고","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["diseño frontend","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo web","codificación","diseño de alta calidad","atención al detalle","creación de interfaces","personalización de interfaces"],"fr":["conception frontend","interfaces utilisateur","développement web","codage","conception de haute qualité","attention aux détails","création d''interfaces","personnalisation d''interfaces"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung","Codierung","Hochwertige Konzeption","Besondere Aufmerksamkeit für Details","Erstellung von Oberflächen","Anpassung von Oberflächen"],"pt":["frontend design","desenvolvimento de frontend","interfaces de usuário personalizadas","design de interface de usuário","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologias web"],"ru":["фронтенд-дизайн","разработка фронтенда","уникальные интерфейсы пользователя","дизайн интерфейса пользователя","разработка программного обеспечения","веб-технологии"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الويب"]}},"owner":"sorashin","repo":"2x4cad","repoPath":"sorashin/2x4cad","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:22:13.169Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual AI Agents needing production-grade frontend interface design with exceptional aesthetic details and creative choices.","zh":"非常适合需要生产级前端界面设计的视觉AI代理，具有出色的美学细节和创意选择。","ja":"製品グレードのフロントエンドインターフェースデザインが必要な視覚AIエージェントに最適で、卓越した美的詳細と創造的な選択肢を備えている。","ko":"생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스 디자인이 필요한 시각 AI 에이전트에게 완벽하며,卓越한 미적 세부 사항과 창의적인 선택을 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA visuales que necesitan un diseño de interfaz de usuario de frontend de nivel de producción con detalles estéticos excepcionales y opciones creativas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA visuels qui ont besoin d''une conception d''interface frontend de niveau de production avec des détails esthétiques exceptionnels et des choix créatifs.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle KI-Agenten, die ein produktionsreifes Frontend-Interface-Design mit außergewöhnlichen ästhetischen Details und kreativen Auswahlmöglichkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Visuais que necessitam de design de interface de frontend de nível de produção com detalhes estéticos excepcionais e opções criativas.","ru":"Идеально для визуальных агентов ИИ, которым требуется производственный дизайн интерфейса frontend с исключительными эстетическими деталями и творческими решениями.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل البصري الذي يحتاج إلى تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية من الدرجة الإنتاجية مع تفاصيل جمالية استثنائية وخيارات إبداعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, real working code for frontend interfaces, avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics by implementing bold aesthetic directions, leveraging HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, and incorporating design thinking principles.","zh":"赋予代理创建独特的、真正可用的前端接口代码，通过实施大胆的美学方向、利用HTML、CSS和JavaScript，并融入设计思维原则，避免通用的''AI乱码''美学。","ja":"エージェントが独自の実際に機能するフロントエンドインターフェースのコードを作成できるようにし、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを利用し、デザイン思考の原則を取り入れて、大胆な美的方向を実施し、一般的な''AI汚れ''の美学を避ける。","ko":"에이전트가 独特한 실제 작동하는 프론트엔드 인터페이스 코드를 만들 수 있도록 하며, HTML, CSS, 자바스크립트를 활용하고, 디자인 사고 원칙을 통합하여, 대담한 미적 방향을 구현하고, 일반적인 ''AI 혼란'' 미학을 피합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear código de trabajo real y distintivo para interfaces de frontend, evitando la estética genérica de ''suciedad de IA'' al implementar direcciones estéticas audaces, aprovechando HTML, CSS y JavaScript, e incorporando principios de diseño de pensamiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un code de travail réel et distinctif pour les interfaces frontend, en évitant l''esthétique générique de ''bazar d''IA'' en mettant en œuvre des directions esthétiques audacieuses, en exploitant HTML, CSS et JavaScript, et en intégrant les principes de conception de la pensée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eigenständiges, reales Arbeitscode für Frontend-Interfaces zu erstellen, wodurch die generische ''KI-Schlamperei''-Ästhetik vermieden wird, indem mutige ästhetische Richtungen umgesetzt, HTML, CSS und JavaScript genutzt und Design-Denken-Prinzipien eingebunden werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar código de trabalho real e distinto para interfaces de frontend, evitando estética genérica ''slop'' de IA, implementando direções estéticas ousadas, utilizando HTML, CSS e JavaScript e incorporando princípios de pensamento de design.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отличительный, реально работающий код для интерфейсов frontend, избегая генерической эстетики ''сlop'' ИИ, реализуя смелые эстетические направления, используя HTML, CSS и JavaScript и включающие принципы дизайн-мышления.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء كود حقيقي وفريد ل_interfaces frontend، وتجنب جماليات ''سلو'' العامة للوكلاء، من خلال تطبيق اتجاهات جمالية جريئة، واستخدام لغات HTML و CSS و JavaScript، وإدماج مبادئ التفكير التصميمي."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating custom UI components for web applications","Designing responsive layouts for mobile and desktop interfaces","Creating visually appealing hero sections with SVG graphics"],"zh":["为Web应用程序生成自定义UI组件","为移动和桌面接口设计响应式布局","使用SVG图形创建视觉上吸引人的英雄部分"],"ja":["WebアプリケーションのカスタムUIコンポーネントを生成する","モバイルとデスクトップのインターフェースのレスポンシブレイアウトを設計する","SVGグラフィックスを使用して視覚的に魅力的なヒーローセクションを作成する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 정의 UI 컴포넌트 생성","모바일 및 데스크톱 인터페이스에 대한 반응형 레이아웃 설계","SVG 그래픽을 사용하여 시각적으로 매력적인 영웅 섹션 생성"],"es":["Generación de componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados para aplicaciones web","Diseño de diseños responsivos para interfaces de móviles y de escritorio","Creación de secciones de héroe visualmente atractivas con gráficos SVG"],"fr":["Génération de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés pour les applications Web","Conception de dispositions réactives pour les interfaces mobiles et de bureau","Création de sections de héros visuellement attrayantes avec des graphiques SVG"],"de":["Generierung benutzerdefinierter Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für Webanwendungen","Entwurf responsiver Layouts für mobile und Desktop-Interfaces","Erstellung visuell ansprechender Hero-Abschnitte mit SVG-Grafiken"],"pt":["Geração de componentes de UI personalizados para aplicações web","Design de layouts responsivos para interfaces móveis e de desktop","Criação de seções de heróis visualmente atraentes com gráficos SVG"],"ru":["Генерация пользовательских компонентов UI для веб-приложений","Дизайн адаптивных макетов для мобильных и настольных интерфейсов","Создание визуально привлекательных секций героев с помощью графики SVG"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة لتطبيقات الويب","تصميم طرازات مستجابة ل_wizards المحمول و سطح المكتب","إنشاء أقسام البطولة بصرية جذابة مع رسومات SVG"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements and context","Dependent on agent''s understanding of design thinking and aesthetic principles"],"zh":["需要用户提供前端要求和上下文","依赖于代理对设计思维和美学原则的理解"],"ja":["ユーザーが提供するフロントエンドの要件とコンテキストが必要","エージェントのデザイン思考と美的原則の理解に依存する"],"ko":["사용자가 제공하는 프론트엔드 요구 사항과 컨텍스트가 필요합니다.","에이전트의 디자인思考 및 미적 원칙 이해에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere requisitos y contexto de frontend proporcionados por el usuario","Dependiente de la comprensión del agente de los principios de diseño de pensamiento y estéticos"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences et un contexte de frontend fournis par l''utilisateur","Dépend de la compréhension de l''agent des principes de conception de la pensée et esthétiques"],"de":["Benötigt vom Benutzer bereitgestellte Anforderungen und Kontext für Frontend","Abhängig vom Verständnis des Agents für Design-Denken- und ästhetische Prinzipien"],"pt":["Exige requisitos e contexto de frontend fornecidos pelo usuário","Depende da compreensão do agente sobre princípios de design thinking e estéticos"],"ru":["Требует предоставления пользователем требований и контекста frontend","Зависит от понимания агентом принципов дизайн-мышления и эстетических принципов"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات وسياق واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المقدمة من قبل المستخدم","يعتمد على فهم الوكيل لمبادئ التفكير التصميمي والمبادئ الجمالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
