thetik und Kreativität","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建独特的前端界面","实现实用代码","优秀的美学细节","避免一般性的AI美学","支持多种技术栈"],"ja":["独自のフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成","実用的コードを実現","優れた美学的詳細","一般的なAIエステティックを避ける","複数の技術スタックをサポート"],"ko":["독특한 프론트엔드 인터페이스 생성","실제 작동하는 코드 구현","우수한 미적 세부 사항","일반적인 AI 미학 피하기","다중 기술 스택 지원"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Enfoque en la estética y la creatividad","Implementación de código de producción de alta calidad","Atención al detalle y decisiones creativas","Compatibilidad con diferentes componentes y tecnologías","Diseño de interfaces de usuario para diferentes dispositivos y resoluciones"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Focus sur l''esthétique et la créativité","Implémentation de code de production de haute qualité","Attention au détail et décisions créatives","Compatibilité avec différents composants et technologies","Conception d''interfaces utilisateur pour différents appareils et résolutions"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen","Fokus auf Ästhetik und Kreativität","Implementierung von Produktionscode hoher Qualität","Aufmerksamkeit für Details und kreative Entscheidungen","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Komponenten und Technologien","Design von Benutzeroberflächen für verschiedene Geräte und Auflösungen"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级前端","AI美学","独特界面","实用代码","美学细节"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクションレベルのフロントエンド","AIエステティック","独自のインターフェイス","実用的コード","美学的詳細"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 프론트엔드","AI 미학","독특한 인터페이스","실제 작동하는 코드","미적 세부 사항"],"es":["diseño de frontend","interfaces de usuario","estética","creatividad","código de producción","desarrollo web","tecnologías frontend","diseño de componentes","diseño de páginas web"],"fr":["conception de frontend","interfaces utilisateur","esthétique","créativité","code de production","développement web","technologies frontend","conception de composants","conception de pages web"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Ästhetik","Kreativität","Produktionscode","Webentwicklung","Frontend-Technologien","Komponenten-Design","Webseiten-Design"]}},"owner":"fmbp1981-hash","repo":"prospect-pulse-54","repoPath":"fmbp1981-hash/prospect-pulse-54","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:22:18.304Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to create production-grade, custom frontend interfaces with exceptional aesthetic details","zh":"非常适合需要创建生产级、自定义前端接口并具有异常美观细节的AI代理","ja":"プロダクショングレードのカスタムフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成し、卓越した美的詳細を持つAIエージェントに最適","ko":"생산급의 사용자 지정 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하고 예외적인 미적 세부 사항을 갖는 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan crear interfaces de frontend personalizadas de nivel de producción con detalles estéticos excepcionales","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de créer des interfaces frontend personnalisées de niveau de production avec des détails esthétiques exceptionnels","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten, die benutzerdefinierte Frontend-Schnittstellen der Produktionsklasse mit außergewöhnlichen ästhetischen Details erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam criar interfaces de frontend personalizadas de produção com detalhes estéticos excepcionais","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо создавать индивидуальные интерфейсы frontend уровня производства с исключительными эстетическими деталями","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة من الجيل الحالي مع تفاصيل جمالية استثنائية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate distinctive, real working code with attention to creative choices, implementing bold aesthetic directions using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, while avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics","zh":"赋予代理生成具有创造力选择的独特、真实工作代码，实施大胆的美学方向，使用HTML、CSS和JavaScript，同时避免通用的''AI slop''美学","ja":"エージェントが創造的な選択に注目して独自の実際に動作するコードを生成できるようにし、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用して大胆な美学的方向性を実装し、一般的な''AI slop''美学を避ける","ko":"에이전트가 창의적인 선택에 주의하여 독특하고 실제 작동하는 코드를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 대담한 미학적 방향을 구현하고 일반적인 ''AI slop'' 미학을 피함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar código real y funcional con atención a las opciones creativas, implementando direcciones estéticas atrevidas utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript, evitando al mismo tiempo la estética genérica de ''suciedad de IA''","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du code réel et fonctionnel avec attention aux choix créatifs, en mettant en œuvre des directions esthétiques audacieuses en utilisant HTML, CSS et JavaScript, tout en évitant l''esthétique générique de ''sloppiness IA''","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, distinktives, funktionierendes Code mit Beachtung der kreativen Entscheidungen zu generieren, indem sie kühne ästhetische Richtungen mit HTML, CSS und JavaScript umsetzen und dabei die genérica ''KI-Schlamperei''-Ästhetik vermeiden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar código de trabalho real distinto, com atenção às escolhas criativas, implementando direções estéticas ousadas usando HTML, CSS e JavaScript, enquanto evita estéticas genéricas de ''slop'' de IA","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать отличный, реально работающий код, обращая внимание на творческие решения, реализуя смелые эстетические направления с использованием HTML, CSS и JavaScript, при этом избегая общих эстетических решений ''слоу'' ИИ","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توليد رمز فعّال متميز مع اهتمام بالخيارات الإبداعية وتنفيذ التوجيهات الجمالية الجريئة باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript مع تجنب الجماليات العامة لتراخي الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web applications","Building custom UI components","Creating visually appealing landing pages"],"zh":["设计响应式网页应用","构建自定义UI组件","创建视觉上吸引人的登陆页面"],"ja":["レスポンシブなWebアプリケーションの設計","カスタムUIコンポーネントの構築","視覚的に魅力的なランディングページの作成"],"ko":["응답형 웹 애플리케이션 설계","사용자 지정 UI 구성 요소 구축","시각적으로 매력적인 랜딩 페이지 생성"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones web responsivas","Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados","Crear páginas de aterrizaje visualmente atractivas"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications web responsives","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés","Créer des pages d''atterrissage visuellement attrayantes"],"de":["Entwicklung responsiver Webanwendungen","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Erstellung visuell ansprechender Landeseiten"],"pt":["Projetar aplicações web responsivas","Construir componentes de UI personalizados","Criar páginas de destino visualmente atraentes"],"ru":["Проектирование отзывчивых веб-приложений","Создание индивидуальных компонентов пользовательского интерфейса","Создание визуально привлекательных посадочных страниц"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتكيف","بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","إنشاء صفحات هبوط جذابة بصريًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements","May need additional technical constraints for optimal implementation"],"zh":["需要用户提供的前端要求","可能需要额外的技术约束以实现最佳实现"],"ja":["ユーザー提供のフロントエンド要件が必要","最適な実装には追加の技術的制約が必要になる場合があり"],"ko":["사용자 제공 프론트엔드 요구 사항 필요","최적의 구현을 위해 추가 기술 제약이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere requisitos de frontend proporcionados por el usuario","Puede necesitar restricciones técnicas adicionales para una implementación óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences de frontend fournies par l''utilisateur","Peut nécessiter des contraintes techniques supplémentaires pour une mise en œuvre optimale"],"de":["Benötigt von Benutzern bereitgestellte Frontend-Anforderungen","Kann zusätzliche technische Einschränkungen für eine optimale Implementierung benötigen"],"pt":["Requer requisitos de frontend fornecidos pelo usuário","Pode precisar de restrições técnicas adicionais para implementação ótima"],"ru":["Требует переданных пользователем требований к frontend","Может потребовать дополнительных технических ограничений для оптимальной реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المقدمة من المستخدم","يمكن أن يحتاج إلى قيود تقنية إضافية من أجل التنفيذ الأمثل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('fabioalcocer/quick-questions/frontend-design', 'community', 'fabioalcocer', 'quick-questions', 'fabioalcocer/quick-questions', 'frontend-design', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z', '2026-02-18T12:22:37.710Z', NULL, '{"id":"fabioalcocer/quick-questions/frontend-design","name":"frontend-design","description":{"es":"Este skill guía la creación de interfaces frontend distintivas y de producción con atención al detalle estético.","fr":"Ce skill guide la création d''interfaces frontend distinctives et de production avec une attention particulière aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Diese Fähigkeit leitet die Erstellung einzigartiger und produktionssreifer Frontend-Schnittstellen mit besonderer Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details.","pt":"Este skill ajuda a criar interfaces frontend personalizadas e de produção, com atenção aos detalhes estéticos e escolhas criativas","ru":"Этот навык помогает создавать индивидуальные интерфейсы frontend, с учетом эстетических деталей и творческих решений","ar":"هذا المهارة يساعد على إنشاء واجهات المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة وذات الجودة العالية، مع اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية والخيارات الإبداعية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Diseño Frontend Único","fr":"Conception Frontend Personnalisée","de":"Einzigartiges Frontend-Design","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Interfaces Frontend Personalizadas","ru":"Разработка Индивидуальных Интерфейсов Frontend","ar":"تصميم واجهات المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة","en":"frontend-design"},"description":{"es":"Este skill guía la creación de interfaces frontend distintivas y de producción con atención al detalle estético.","fr":"Ce skill guide la création d''interfaces frontend distinctives et de production avec une attention particulière aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Diese Fähigkeit leitet die Erstellung einzigartiger und produktionssreifer Frontend-Schnittstellen mit besonderer Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details.","pt":"Este skill ajuda a criar interfaces frontend personalizadas e de produção, com atenção aos detalhes estéticos e escolhas criativas","ru":"Этот навык помогает создавать индивидуальные интерфейсы frontend, с учетом эстетических деталей и творческих решений","ar":"هذا المهارة يساعد على إنشاء واجهات المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة وذات الجودة العالية، مع اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية والخيارات الإبداعية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Implementación de código de producción","Atención al detalle estético","Dirección estética atrevida","Compatibilidad con componentes y páginas","Consideración de contexto y propósito"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de code de production","Attention aux détails esthétiques","Direction esthétique audacieuse","Compatibilité avec les composants et les pages","Considération du contexte et du but"],"de":["Implementierung von Produktionscode","Beachtung von ästhetischen Details","Mutiger ästhetischer Ansatz","Kompatibilität mit Komponenten und Seiten","Berücksichtigung von Kontext und Zweck"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces frontend personalizadas","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Escolhas criativas","Desenvolvimento de componentes","Construção de páginas e aplicações","Implementação de requisitos técnicos"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов frontend","Учет эстетических деталей","Творческие решения","Разработка компонентов","Строительство страниц и приложений","Реализация технических требований"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة","اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية","الخيارات الإبداعية","تطوير المكونات","بناء الصفحات والتطبيقات","تنفيذ المتطلبات الفنية"]},"keywords":{"es":["diseño frontend","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo web","producción de código","estética digital","experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["conception frontend","interfaces utilisateur","développement web","production de code","esthétique numérique","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung","Code-Produktion","digitale Ästhetik","Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","interfaces de usuário","design de interface","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","tecnologias frontend","criação de componentes","construção de páginas","requisitos técnicos","escolhas criativas"],"ru":["разработка frontend","интерфейсы пользователя","дизайн интерфейса","разработка приложений","технологии frontend","создание компонентов","строительство страниц","технические требования","творческие решения"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات المستخدم","تطوير التطبيقات","تقنيات الواجهة الأمامية","إنشاء المكونات","بناء الصفحات","المتطلبات الفنية","الخيارات الإبداعية","تصميم الواجهة","تطوير الواجهة الأمامية"]}},"owner":"fabioalcocer","repo":"quick-questions","repoPath":"fabioalcocer/quick-questions","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:22:37.710Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX-focused Agents needing to create production-grade, custom frontend interfaces with exceptional aesthetic details","zh":"非常适合专注于UI/UX的智能体，需要创建具有卓越美学细节的生产级自定义前端界面","ja":"UI/UXに焦点を当てたエージェントに最適であり、優れた美的詳細を備えたプロダクショングレードのカスタムフロントエンドインターフェースを作成する必要がある場合に適しています","ko":"UI/UX에 중점을 둔 에이전트에게 완벽하며, 탁월한 미적 디테일을 갖춘 프로덕션 등급의 사용자 정의 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en UI/UX que necesitan crear interfaces frontend personalizadas de grado de producción con detalles estéticos excepcionales","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''expérience utilisateur et l''interface utilisateur (UI/UX) qui ont besoin de créer des interfaces frontend personnalisées de niveau de production avec des détails esthétiques exceptionnels","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-fokussierte Agents, die benutzerdefinierte Frontend-Schnittstellen mit außergewöhnlichen ästhetischen Details im Produktionsgrad erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfect for UI/UX-focused Agents needing to create production-grade, custom frontend interfaces with exceptional aesthetic details","ru":"Perfect for UI/UX-focused Agents needing to create production-grade, custom frontend interfaces with exceptional aesthetic details","ar":"Perfect for UI/UX-focused Agents needing to create production-grade, custom frontend interfaces with exceptional aesthetic details"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement real working code with attention to creative choices, generating distinctive interfaces that avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, utilizing design thinking principles and committing to bold aesthetic directions","zh":"使智能体能够实现真正可工作的代码，同时注重创意选择，生成避免通用''AI劣质''美学的独特界面，利用设计思维原则并致力于大胆的美学方向","ja":"創造的な選択に注意を払いながら実際に動作するコードを実装する能力をエージェントに与え、デザイン思考の原則を活用し、大胆な美的方向性にコミットすることで、一般的な''AIスロップ''の美学を避ける独特なインターフェースを生成します","ko":"창의적 선택에 주의를 기울이며 실제 작동 코드를 구현할 수 있도록 에이전트를 권한 부여하고, 디자인 사고 원칙을 활용하고 대담한 미적 방향에 전념하여 일반적인 ''AI 슬롭'' 미학을 피하는 독특한 인터페이스를 생성합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar código de trabajo real con atención a las opciones creativas, generando interfaces distintivas que evitan la estética genérica de ''suciedad de IA'', utilizando principios de diseño de pensamiento y comprometiéndose con direcciones estéticas audaces","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre un code de travail réel avec attention portée aux choix créatifs, générant des interfaces distinctives qui évitent l''esthétique générique de ''bavure d''IA'', en utilisant les principes de conception de la pensée et en s''engageant dans des directions esthétiques audacieuses","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, echten Arbeitscode mit kreativen Wahlmöglichkeiten zu implementieren und damit eine distinktive Oberfläche zu erstellen, die eine generische ''KI-Schmiere''-Ästhetik vermeidet, indem Design-Denksprinzipien verwendet und eine mutige ästhetische Richtung eingeschlagen wird","pt":"Empowers agents to implement real working code with attention to creative choices, generating distinctive interfaces that avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, utilizing design thinking principles and committing to bold aesthetic directions","ru":"Empowers agents to implement real working code with attention to creative choices, generating distinctive interfaces that avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, utilizing design thinking principles and committing to bold aesthetic directions","ar":"Empowers agents to implement real working code with attention to creative choices, generating distinctive interfaces that avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, utilizing design thinking principles and committing to bold aesthetic directions"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web applications with unique layouts","Developing custom UI components with precise aesthetic control","Creating visually stunning hero sections for landing pages"],"zh":["设计具有独特布局的响应式Web应用程序","开发具有精确美学控制的定制UI组件","为落地页创建视觉惊艳的Hero部分"],"ja":["独自のレイアウトを持つレスポンシブWebアプリケーションの設計","精密な美的制御を備えたカスタムUIコンポーネントの開発","ランディングページのための視覚的に見事なヒーローセクションの作成"],"ko":["고유한 레이아웃을 가진 반응형 웹 애플리케이션 설계","정밀한 미적 제어를 통한 사용자 정의 UI 컴포넌트 개발","랜딩 페이지를 위한 시각적으로 stunning한 히어로 섹션 생성"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones web responsivas con diseños únicos","Desarrollar componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados con un control estético preciso","Crear secciones de héroe visualmente impresionantes para páginas de aterrizaje"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications web responsives avec des dispositions uniques","Développer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés avec un contrôle esthétique précis","Créer des sections de héros visuellement impressionnantes pour les pages de destination"],"de":["Responsive Webanwendungen mit einzigartigen Layouts entwerfen","Benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit präziser ästhetischer Kontrolle entwickeln","Visuell atemberaubende Hero-Abschnitte für Landeseiten erstellen"],"pt":["Designing responsive web applications with unique layouts","Developing custom UI components with precise aesthetic control","Creating visually stunning hero sections for landing pages"],"ru":["Designing responsive web applications with unique layouts","Developing custom UI components with precise aesthetic control","Creating visually stunning hero sections for landing pages"],"ar":["Designing responsive web applications with unique layouts","Developing custom UI components with precise aesthetic control","Creating visually stunning hero sections for landing pages"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires precise frontend requirements from the user","Dependent on the agent''s ability to understand context and commit to a bold aesthetic direction"],"zh":["需要用户提供精确的前端需求","依赖于智能体理解上下文并致力于大胆美学方向的能力"],"ja":["ユーザーからの正確なフロントエンド要件が必要","コンテキストを理解し大胆な美的方向性にコミットするエージェントの能力に依存"],"ko":["사용자로부터 정확한 프론트엔드 요구사항이 필요함","컨텍스트를 이해하고 대담한 미적 방향에 전념하는 에이전트의 능력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere requisitos frontend precisos del usuario","Depende de la capacidad del agente para comprender el contexto y comprometerse con una dirección estética audaz"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences frontend précises de l''utilisateur","Dépend de la capacité de l''agent à comprendre le contexte et à s''engager dans une direction esthétique audacieuse"],"de":["Benötigt genaue Frontend-Anforderungen vom Benutzer","Hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agents ab, den Kontext zu verstehen und eine mutige ästhetische Richtung einzuschlagen"],"pt":["Requires precise frontend requirements from the user","Dependent on the agent''s ability to understand context and commit to a bold aesthetic direction"],"ru":["Requires precise frontend requirements from the user","Dependent on the agent''s ability to understand context and commit to a bold aesthetic direction"],"ar":["Requires precise frontend requirements from the user","Dependent on the agent''s ability to understand context and commit to a bold aesthetic direction"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
