ilos de chat permite a los desarrolladores gestionar múltiples conversaciones con facilidad","fr":"La liste de threads de chat permet aux développeurs de gérer plusieurs conversations avec facilité","de":"Die Chat-Thread-Liste ermöglicht es Entwicklern, mehrere Konversationen leicht zu verwalten","pt":"A thread list é uma ferramenta para gerenciar conversas em tempo real, permitindo a criação de interfaces personalizadas para múltiplas conversas","ru":"Thread list - это инструмент для управления беседами в реальном времени, позволяющий создавать пользовательские интерфейсы для нескольких разговоров","ar":"قائمة الخيط هي أداة لإدارة المحادثات في الوقت الفعلي، مما يسمح بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة لمحادثات متعددة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["内置和自定义UI支持","多个聊天线程管理","使用useChatRuntime + cloud","线程CRUD操作","自定义线程列表UI"],"ja":["ビルトインとカスタムUIのサポート","複数のチャットスレッドの管理","useChatRuntime + cloudを使用","スレッドCRUD操作","カスタムスレッドリストUI"],"ko":["내장 및 사용자 정의 UI 지원","여러 채팅 쓰레드 관리","useChatRuntime + cloud 사용","쓰레드 CRUD 작업","사용자 정의 쓰레드 목록 UI"],"es":["Administración de múltiples hilos de chat","Interfaz de usuario personalizada","Integración con la nube","Operaciones CRUD para hilos de chat","Compatibilidad con Assistant Cloud"],"fr":["Gestion de plusieurs threads de chat","Interface utilisateur personnalisée","Intégration au cloud","Opérations CRUD pour les threads de chat","Compatibilité avec Assistant Cloud"],"de":["Verwaltung mehrerer Chat-Threads","Benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberfläche","Integration in die Cloud","CRUD-Operationen für Chat-Threads","Kompatibilität mit Assistant Cloud"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de conversas em tempo real","Criação de interfaces personalizadas","Suporte a múltiplas conversas","Integração com a API em tempo real","Customização da interface do usuário"],"ru":["Управление беседами в реальном времени","Создание пользовательских интерфейсов","Поддержка нескольких разговоров","Интеграция с API в реальном времени","Настройка пользовательского интерфейса"],"ar":["إدارة المحادثات في الوقت الفعلي","إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","دعم محادثات متعددة","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات في الوقت الفعلي","تخصيص واجهة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["thread-list Skill","聊天线程管理","内置UI","自定义UI","useChatRuntime","cloud"],"ja":["thread-listスキル","チャットスレッド管理","ビルトインUI","カスタムUI","useChatRuntime","cloud"],"ko":["thread-list 스킬","채팅 쓰레드 관리","내장 UI","사용자 정의 UI","useChatRuntime","cloud"],"es":["lista de hilos de chat","desarrollo de chat","interfaz de usuario personalizada","integración con la nube","operaciones CRUD","Assistant Cloud","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de chat"],"fr":["liste de threads de chat","développement de chat","interface utilisateur personnalisée","intégration au cloud","opérations CRUD","Assistant Cloud","développement de logiciels","technologies de chat"],"de":["Chat-Thread-Liste","Chat-Entwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberfläche","Integration in die Cloud","CRUD-Operationen","Assistant Cloud","Software-Entwicklung","Chat-Technologien"],"pt":["thread list","gerenciamento de conversas","interface em tempo real","customização da interface","api em tempo real","desenvolvimento de chat"],"ru":["thread list","управление беседами","интерфейс в реальном времени","настройка интерфейса","api в реальном времени","разработка чата"],"ar":["قائمة الخيط","إدارة المحادثات","واجهة في الوقت الفعلي","تخصيص الواجهة","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات في الوقت الفعلي","تطوير الدردشة"]}},"owner":"yashness","repo":"yash-full-stack-personal","repoPath":"yashness/yash-full-stack-personal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"thread-list","description":"Guide for multi-thread management in assistant-ui. Use when implementing thread lists, switching threads, or managing conversation history.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui Thread List\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nManage multiple chat threads with built-in or custom UI.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/management.md](./references/management.md) -- Thread CRUD operations\n- [./references/custom-ui.md](./references/custom-ui.md) -- Custom thread list UI\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThread list is available with `useChatRuntime` + cloud:\n\n```tsx\nimport { AssistantCloud } from \"assistant-cloud\";\nim","body":"# assistant-ui Thread List\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nManage multiple chat threads with built-in or custom UI.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/management.md](./references/management.md) -- Thread CRUD operations\n- [./references/custom-ui.md](./references/custom-ui.md) -- Custom thread list UI\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThread list is available with `useChatRuntime` + cloud:\n\n```tsx\nimport { AssistantCloud } from \"assistant-cloud\";\nimport { useChatRuntime, AssistantChatTransport } from \"@assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk\";\nimport { AssistantRuntimeProvider, Thread, ThreadList } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nconst cloud = new AssistantCloud({\n  baseUrl: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSISTANT_BASE_URL,\n  authToken: async () => getAuthToken(),\n});\n\nfunction Chat() {\n  const runtime = useChatRuntime({\n    transport: new AssistantChatTransport({ api: \"/api/chat\" }),\n    cloud,\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <AssistantRuntimeProvider runtime={runtime}>\n      <div className=\"flex h-screen\">\n        <ThreadList className=\"w-64 border-r\" />\n        <Thread className=\"flex-1\" />\n      </div>\n    </AssistantRuntimeProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Thread Operations\n\n```tsx\nimport { useAssistantApi, useAssistantState } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nconst api = useAssistantApi();\nconst { threads, mainThreadId } = useAssistantState(s => s.threadList);\n\n// Switch to thread\napi.threads().switchToThread(threadId);\n\n// Create new thread\napi.threads().switchToNewThread();\n\n// Thread item operations\nconst item = api.threads().item({ id: threadId });\nawait item.rename(\"New Title\");\nawait item.archive();\nawait item.delete();\n```\n\n## Custom Thread List\n\n```tsx\nimport { ThreadListPrimitive, ThreadListItemPrimitive } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nfunction CustomThreadList() {\n  return (\n    <ThreadListPrimitive.Root className=\"w-64\">\n      <ThreadListPrimitive.New className=\"w-full p-2 bg-blue-500 text-white\">\n        + New Chat\n      </ThreadListPrimitive.New>\n\n      <ThreadListPrimitive.Items>\n        <ThreadListItemPrimitive.Root className=\"flex p-2 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n          <ThreadListItemPrimitive.Trigger className=\"flex-1\">\n            <ThreadListItemPrimitive.Title />\n          </ThreadListItemPrimitive.Trigger>\n          <ThreadListItemPrimitive.Archive>Archive</ThreadListItemPrimitive.Archive>\n          <ThreadListItemPrimitive.Delete>Delete</ThreadListItemPrimitive.Delete>\n        </ThreadListItemPrimitive.Root>\n      </ThreadListPrimitive.Items>\n    </ThreadListPrimitive.Root>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Without Cloud (Local)\n\n```tsx\nimport { useRemoteThreadListRuntime, InMemoryThreadListAdapter } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nconst runtime = useRemoteThreadListRuntime({\n  adapter: new InMemoryThreadListAdapter(),\n  runtimeHook: () => useLocalRuntime({ model: myModel }),\n});\n```\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n**ThreadList not showing**\n- Pass `cloud` to runtime\n- Check authentication\n\n**Threads not persisting**\n- Verify cloud connection\n- Check network requests\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:22:57.521Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing multi-thread conversation management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要多线程对话管理功能的对话式代理。","ja":"マルチスレッド会話管理機能を必要とする会話エージェントに最適です。","ko":"다중 스레드 대화 관리 기능이 필요한 대화형 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de conversación que necesitan capacidades de gestión de conversación multi-hilo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conversation nécessitant des capacités de gestion de conversation multi-fil.","de":"Perfekt für Conversational Agents, die Möglichkeiten zur Verwaltung von Multi-Thread-Konversationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conversação que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de conversas multi-thread.","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных Агентов, требующих возможностей управления разговорами в нескольких потоках.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحادثين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إدارة محادثات متعددة الخيط"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple chat threads with built-in or custom UI, leveraging cloud services and utilizing libraries like AssistantCloud, while referencing the latest API from assistant-ui.com/llms.txt.","zh":"赋予代理管理多个聊天线程的能力，使用内置或自定义UI，利用云服务，并利用AssistantCloud和assistant-ui.com/llms.txt上的最新API等库。","ja":"エージェントに複数のチャットスレッドを管理する機能を提供し、ビルトインまたはカスタムUIを使用し、クラウドサービスを利用し、AssistantCloudやassistant-ui.com/llms.txtの最新APIなどのライブラリを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 여러 채팅 쓰레드를 관리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 내장 또는 사용자 지정 UI를 사용하고, 클라우드 서비스를 활용하며, AssistantCloud 및 assistant-ui.com/llms.txt의 최신 API와 같은 라이브러리를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar múltiples hilos de chat con una interfaz de usuario integrada o personalizada, aprovechando los servicios en la nube y utilizando bibliotecas como AssistantCloud, mientras se hace referencia a la última API desde assistant-ui.com/llms.txt.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs fils de chat avec une interface utilisateur intégrée ou personnalisée, en exploitant les services cloud et en utilisant des bibliothèques comme AssistantCloud, tout en référençant la dernière API depuis assistant-ui.com/llms.txt.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehrere Chat-Threads mit einer integrierten oder benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberfläche zu verwalten, indem Cloud-Dienste genutzt und Bibliotheken wie AssistantCloud verwendet werden, während auf die neueste API von assistant-ui.com/llms.txt verwiesen wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar várias threads de chat com UI incorporada ou personalizada, aproveitando serviços de nuvem e utilizando bibliotecas como AssistantCloud, enquanto referencia a última API de assistant-ui.com/llms.txt.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять несколькими потоками чата с встроенным или пользовательским интерфейсом, используя облачные сервисы и библиотеки seperti AssistantCloud, а также ссылаясь на последний API с assistant-ui.com/llms.txt.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة عدة خيوط محادثة باستخدام واجهة مستخدم مدمجة أو مخصصة، واستغلال خدمات السحابة واستخدام مكتبات مثل AssistantCloud، في حين الإشارة إلى أحدث واجهة برمجة تطبيقات من assistant-ui.com/llms.txt"},"useCases":{"en":["Managing concurrent conversations","Implementing custom thread list UI","Performing thread CRUD operations"],"zh":["管理并发对话","实现自定义线程列表UI","执行线程CRUD操作"],"ja":["同時会話の管理","カスタムスレッドリストUIの実装","スレッドCRUD操作の実行"],"ko":["동시 대화 관리","사용자 지정 스레드 목록 UI 구현","스레드 CRUD 연산 수행"],"es":["Gestión de conversaciones concurrentes","Implementación de una lista de hilos de interfaz de usuario personalizada","Realización de operaciones CRUD de hilos"],"fr":["Gestion de conversations concurrentes","Implémentation d''une liste de fils d''interface utilisateur personnalisée","Réalisations d''opérations CRUD de fils"],"de":["Verwaltung von gleichzeitigen Konversationen","Implementierung einer benutzerdefinierten Thread-Liste-Benutzeroberfläche","Durchführung von Thread-CRUD-Operationen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de conversas concorrentes","Implementação de lista de threads de UI personalizada","Realização de operações CRUD de thread"],"ru":["Управление параллельными разговорами","Реализация пользовательского интерфейса списка потоков","Выполнение операций CRUD потока"],"ar":["إدارة محادثات متزامنة","تنفيذ قائمة خيوط واجهة مستخدم مخصصة","تنفيذ عمليات CRUD للخيط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AssistantCloud and cloud services","Must consult assistant-ui.com/llms.txt for latest API"],"zh":["需要AssistantCloud和云服务","必须参考assistant-ui.com/llms.txt获取最新API"],"ja":["AssistantCloudとクラウドサービスが必要","最新APIを取得するためにassistant-ui.com/llms.txtを参照する必要がある"],"ko":["AssistantCloud 및 클라우드 서비스가 필요","最新 API를 얻기 위해 assistant-ui.com/llms.txt를 참조해야 함"],"es":["Requiere AssistantCloud y servicios en la nube","Debe consultar assistant-ui.com/llms.txt para la última API"],"fr":["Nécessite AssistantCloud et des services cloud","Doit consulter assistant-ui.com/llms.txt pour la dernière API"],"de":["Benötigt AssistantCloud und Cloud-Dienste","Muss assistant-ui.com/llms.txt für die neueste API konsultieren"],"pt":["Requer AssistantCloud e serviços de nuvem","Deve consultar assistant-ui.com/llms.txt para obter a última API"],"ru":["Требует AssistantCloud и облачных сервисов","Должен консультироваться с assistant-ui.com/llms.txt для получения последней API"],"ar":["يتطلب AssistantCloud وخدمات السحابة","يجب استشارة assistant-ui.com/llms.txt للحصول على أحدث واجهة برمجة تطبيقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
