模式和最佳实践","ja":"Temporal ワークフロー オーケストレーション パターンは、信頼性の高い分散システムを設計するための基本設計決定、リシエンス パターン、ベスト プラクティスを提供します","ko":"Temporal 워크플로 오케스트레이션 패턴은 신뢰할 수 있는 분산 시스템을 설계하기 위한 기본 설계 결정, 탄력성 패턴 및 최적의 프랙티스를 제공합니다","es":"Dominar la orquestación de flujo de trabajo con Temporal para construir sistemas distribuidos confiables.","fr":"Maîtriser l''orchestration de workflow avec Temporal pour construire des systèmes distribués fiables.","de":"Meistern Sie die Workflow-Orchestrierung mit Temporal, um zuverlässige verteilte Systeme zu bauen.","pt":"Orquestração de fluxo de trabalho com Temporal. Aprenda a criar sistemas distribuídos confiáveis com padrões de design e resiliência.","ru":"Оркестровка рабочих процессов с помощью Temporal. Узнайте, как создавать надежные распределенные системы с шаблонами проектирования и устойчивостью.","ar":"توجيه تدفقات العمل مع Temporal. تعلم كيفية بناء أنظمة موزعة موثوقة مع أنماط التصميم وال弾性.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["多步骤流程管理","分布式事务支持","长时间运行的工作流支持","自动状态管理","弹性模式支持"],"ja":["マルチステップ プロセスの管理","分散トランザクションのサポート","長時間実行されるワークフローのサポート","自動状態管理","リシエンス パターンのサポート"],"ko":["멀티스텝 프로세스 관리","분산 트랜잭션 지원","장시간 실행되는 워크플로우 지원","자동 상태 관리","탄력성 패턴 지원"],"es":["Arquitectura de orquestación de flujo de trabajo escalable","Gestión de procesos complejos en sistemas distribuidos","Patrones de resiliencia para sistemas confiables","Soporte para transacciones distribuidas","Gestión de flujos de trabajo de larga duración","Integración con Temporal"],"fr":["Architecture d''orchestration de workflow escalable","Gestion de processus complexes dans des systèmes distribués","Modèles de résilience pour des systèmes fiables","Support pour les transactions distribuées","Gestion de flux de travail de longue durée","Intégration avec Temporal"],"de":["Skalierbare Workflow-Orchestrierungsarchitektur","Verwaltung komplexer Prozesse in verteilten Systemen","Resilienzmuster für zuverlässige Systeme","Unterstützung für verteilte Transaktionen","Verwaltung von langfristigen Workflows","Integration mit Temporal"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de processos de várias etapas","Transações distribuídas com semântica all-or-nothing","Fluxos de trabalho de longa duração com estado automático","Padrões de design para sistemas distribuídos","Técnicas de resiliência para garantir a confiabilidade","Integração com Temporal para orquestração de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Управление многоступенчатыми процессами","Распределенные транзакции с семантикой all-or-nothing","Долгосрочные рабочие процессы со автоматическим состоянием","Шаблоны проектирования для распределенных систем","Техники устойчивости для обеспечения надежности","Интеграция с Temporal для оркестровки рабочих процессов"],"ar":["إدارة العمليات المتعددة المراحل","عمليات توزيعية ذات معنى all-or-nothing","تدفقات العمل الطويلة الأمد مع حالة أوتوماتيكية","أنماط التصميم لأنظمة موزعة","تقنيات弾性 لتأمين الموثوقية","التكامل مع Temporal لتوجيه تدفقات العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["工作流编排","分布式系统","Temporal","工作流管理","弹性模式","长时间运行的工作流"],"ja":["ワークフロー オーケストレーション","分散システム","Temporal","ワークフロー管理","リシエンス パターン","長時間実行されるワークフロー"],"ko":["워크플로 오케스트레이션","분산 시스템","Temporal","워크플로우 관리","탄력성 패턴","장시간 실행되는 워크플로우"],"es":["orquestación de flujo de trabajo","arquitectura de sistema distribuido","patrones de diseño de software","resiliencia en sistemas","transacciones distribuidas","Temporal","desarrollo de software","sistemas confiables"],"fr":["orchestration de workflow","architecture de système distribué","modèles de conception de logiciel","résilience dans les systèmes","transactions distribuées","Temporal","développement de logiciel","systèmes fiables"],"de":["Workflow-Orchestrierung","Architektur von verteilten Systemen","Entwurfsmuster für Software","Resilienz in Systemen","verteilte Transaktionen","Temporal","Softwareentwicklung","zuverlässige Systeme"],"pt":["orquestração de fluxo de trabalho","sistemas distribuídos","padrões de design","resiliência","temporal","fluxos de trabalho de longa duração","transações distribuídas","gerenciamento de processos"],"ru":["оркестровка рабочих процессов","распределенные системы","шаблоны проектирования","устойчивость","temporal","долгосрочные рабочие процессы","распределенные транзакции","управление процессами"],"ar":["توجيه تدفقات العمل","أنظمة موزعة","أنماط التصميم","ال弾性","temporal","تدفقات العمل الطويلة الأمد","عمليات توزيعية","إدارة العمليات"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ml_challenges","repoPath":"ollieb89/ml_challenges","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"workflow-orchestration-patterns","description":"Design durable workflows with Temporal for distributed systems. Covers workflow vs activity separation, saga patterns, state management, and determinism constraints. Use when building long-running processes, distributed transactions, or microservice orchestration.","bodyPreview":"# Workflow Orchestration Patterns\n\nMaster workflow orchestration architecture with Temporal, covering fundamental design decisions, resilience patterns, and best practices for building reliable distributed systems.\n\n## When to Use Workflow Orchestration\n\n### Ideal Use Cases (Source: docs.temporal.io)\n\n- **Multi-step processes** spanning machines/services/databases\n- **Distributed transactions** requiring all-or-nothing semantics\n- **Long-running workflows** (hours to years) with automatic state","body":"# Workflow Orchestration Patterns\n\nMaster workflow orchestration architecture with Temporal, covering fundamental design decisions, resilience patterns, and best practices for building reliable distributed systems.\n\n## When to Use Workflow Orchestration\n\n### Ideal Use Cases (Source: docs.temporal.io)\n\n- **Multi-step processes** spanning machines/services/databases\n- **Distributed transactions** requiring all-or-nothing semantics\n- **Long-running workflows** (hours to years) with automatic state persistence\n- **Failure recovery** that must resume from last successful step\n- **Business processes**: bookings, orders, campaigns, approvals\n- **Entity lifecycle management**: inventory tracking, account management, cart workflows\n- **Infrastructure automation**: CI/CD pipelines, provisioning, deployments\n- **Human-in-the-loop** systems requiring timeouts and escalations\n\n### When NOT to Use\n\n- Simple CRUD operations (use direct API calls)\n- Pure data processing pipelines (use Airflow, batch processing)\n- Stateless request/response (use standard APIs)\n- Real-time streaming (use Kafka, event processors)\n\n## Critical Design Decision: Workflows vs Activities\n\n**The Fundamental Rule** (Source: temporal.io/blog/workflow-engine-principles):\n- **Workflows** = Orchestration logic and decision-making\n- **Activities** = External interactions (APIs, databases, network calls)\n\n### Workflows (Orchestration)\n\n**Characteristics:**\n- Contain business logic and coordination\n- **MUST be deterministic** (same inputs → same outputs)\n- **Cannot** perform direct external calls\n- State automatically preserved across failures\n- Can run for years despite infrastructure failures\n\n**Example workflow tasks:**\n- Decide which steps to execute\n- Handle compensation logic\n- Manage timeouts and retries\n- Coordinate child workflows\n\n### Activities (External Interactions)\n\n**Characteristics:**\n- Handle all external system interactions\n- Can be non-deterministic (API calls, DB writes)\n- Include built-in timeouts and retry logic\n- **Must be idempotent** (calling N times = calling once)\n- Short-lived (seconds to minutes typically)\n\n**Example activity tasks:**\n- Call payment gateway API\n- Write to database\n- Send emails or notifications\n- Query external services\n\n### Design Decision Framework\n\n```\nDoes it touch external systems? → Activity\nIs it orchestration/decision logic? → Workflow\n```\n\n## Core Workflow Patterns\n\n### 1. Saga Pattern with Compensation\n\n**Purpose**: Implement distributed transactions with rollback capability\n\n**Pattern** (Source: temporal.io/blog/compensating-actions-part-of-a-complete-breakfast-with-sagas):\n\n```\nFor each step:\n  1. Register compensation BEFORE executing\n  2. Execute the step (via activity)\n  3. On failure, run all compensations in reverse order (LIFO)\n```\n\n**Example: Payment Workflow**\n1. Reserve inventory (compensation: release inventory)\n2. Charge payment (compensation: refund payment)\n3. Fulfill order (compensation: cancel fulfillment)\n\n**Critical Requirements:**\n- Compensations must be idempotent\n- Register compensation BEFORE executing step\n- Run compensations in reverse order\n- Handle partial failures gracefully\n\n### 2. Entity Workflows (Actor Model)\n\n**Purpose**: Long-lived workflow representing single entity instance\n\n**Pattern** (Source: docs.temporal.io/evaluate/use-cases-design-patterns):\n- One workflow execution = one entity (cart, account, inventory item)\n- Workflow persists for entity lifetime\n- Receives signals for state changes\n- Supports queries for current state\n\n**Example Use Cases:**\n- Shopping cart (add items, checkout, expiration)\n- Bank account (deposits, withdrawals, balance checks)\n- Product inventory (stock updates, reservations)\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Encapsulates entity behavior\n- Guarantees consistency per entity\n- Natural event sourcing\n\n### 3. Fan-Out/Fan-In (Parallel Execution)\n\n**Purpose**: Execute multiple tasks in parallel, aggregate results\n\n**Pattern:**\n- Spawn child workflows or parallel activities\n- Wait for all to complete\n- Aggregate results\n- Handle partial failures\n\n**Scaling Rule** (Source: temporal.io/blog/workflow-engine-principles):\n- Don''t scale individual workflows\n- For 1M tasks: spawn 1K child workflows × 1K tasks each\n- Keep each workflow bounded\n\n### 4. Async Callback Pattern\n\n**Purpose**: Wait for external event or human approval\n\n**Pattern:**\n- Workflow sends request and waits for signal\n- External system processes asynchronously\n- Sends signal to resume workflow\n- Workflow continues with response\n\n**Use Cases:**\n- Human approval workflows\n- Webhook callbacks\n- Long-running external processes\n\n## State Management and Determinism\n\n### Automatic State Preservation\n\n**How Temporal Works** (Source: docs.temporal.io/workflows):\n- Complete program state preserved automatically\n- Event History records every command and event\n- Seamless recovery from crashes\n- Applications restore pre-failure state\n\n### Determinism Constraints\n\n**Workflows Execute as State Machines**:\n- Replay behavior must be consistent\n- Same inputs → identical outputs every time\n\n**Prohibited in Workflows** (Source: docs.temporal.io/workflows):\n- ❌ Threading, locks, synchronization primitives\n- ❌ Random number generation (`random()`)\n- ❌ Global state or static variables\n- ❌ System time (`datetime.now()`)\n- ❌ Direct file I/O or network calls\n- ❌ Non-deterministic libraries\n\n**Allowed in Workflows**:\n- ✅ `workflow.now()` (deterministic time)\n- ✅ `workflow.random()` (deterministic random)\n- ✅ Pure functions and calculations\n- ✅ Calling activities (non-deterministic operations)\n\n### Versioning Strategies\n\n**Challenge**: Changing workflow code while old executions still running\n\n**Solutions**:\n1. **Versioning API**: Use `workflow.get_version()` for safe changes\n2. **New Workflow Type**: Create new workflow, route new executions to it\n3. **Backward Compatibility**: Ensure old events replay correctly\n\n## Resilience and Error Handling\n\n### Retry Policies\n\n**Default Behavior**: Temporal retries activities forever\n\n**Configure Retry**:\n- Initial retry interval\n- Backoff coefficient (exponential backoff)\n- Maximum interval (cap retry delay)\n- Maximum attempts (eventually fail)\n\n**Non-Retryable Errors**:\n- Invalid input (validation failures)\n- Business rule violations\n- Permanent failures (resource not found)\n\n### Idempotency Requirements\n\n**Why Critical** (Source: docs.temporal.io/activities):\n- Activities may execute multiple times\n- Network failures trigger retries\n- Duplicate execution must be safe\n\n**Implementation Strategies**:\n- Idempotency keys (deduplication)\n- Check-then-act with unique constraints\n- Upsert operations instead of insert\n- Track processed request IDs\n\n### Activity Heartbeats\n\n**Purpose**: Detect stalled long-running activities\n\n**Pattern**:\n- Activity sends periodic heartbeat\n- Includes progress information\n- Timeout if no heartbeat received\n- Enables progress-based retry\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Workflow Design\n\n1. **Keep workflows focused** - Single responsibility per workflow\n2. **Small workflows** - Use child workflows for scalability\n3. **Clear boundaries** - Workflow orchestrates, activities execute\n4. **Test locally** - Use time-skipping test environment\n\n### Activity Design\n\n1. **Idempotent operations** - Safe to retry\n2. **Short-lived** - Seconds to minutes, not hours\n3. **Timeout configuration** - Always set timeouts\n4. **Heartbeat for long tasks** - Report progress\n5. **Error handling** - Distinguish retryable vs non-retryable\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n**Workflow Violations**:\n- Using `datetime.now()` instead of `workflow.now()`\n- Threading or async operations in workflow code\n- Calling external APIs directly from workflow\n- Non-deterministic logic in workflows\n\n**Activity Mistakes**:\n- Non-idempotent operations (can''t handle retries)\n- Missing timeouts (activities run forever)\n- No error classification (retry validation errors)\n- Ignoring payload limits (2MB per argument)\n\n### Operational Considerations\n\n**Monitoring**:\n- Workflow execution duration\n- Activity failure rates\n- Retry attempts and backoff\n- Pending workflow counts\n\n**Scalability**:\n- Horizontal scaling with workers\n- Task queue partitioning\n- Child workflow decomposition\n- Activity batching when appropriate\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n**Official Documentation**:\n- Temporal Core Concepts: docs.temporal.io/workflows\n- Workflow Patterns: docs.temporal.io/evaluate/use-cases-design-patterns\n- Best Practices: docs.temporal.io/develop/best-practices\n- Saga Pattern: temporal.io/blog/saga-pattern-made-easy\n\n**Key Principles**:\n1. Workflows = orchestration, Activities = external calls\n2. Determinism is non-negotiable for workflows\n3. Idempotency is critical for activities\n4. State preservation is automatic\n5. Design for failure and recovery\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:22:45.580Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Distributed System Agents requiring reliable workflow orchestration with Temporal","zh":"适用于需要可靠工作流编排的分布式系统代理，具有 Temporal 的支持","ja":"Temporal を使用した信頼性の高いワークフロー オーケストレーションが必要な分散システム エージェントに最適","ko":"Temporal을 사용한 안정적인 워크플로 오케스트레이션이 필요한 분산 시스템 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Sistemas Distribuidos que requieren una orquestación de flujo de trabajo confiable con Temporal","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de systèmes distribués nécessitant une orchestration de flux de travail fiable avec Temporal","de":"Ideal für verteilte Systemagenten, die eine zuverlässige Workflow-Orchestrierung mit Temporal erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Sistema Distribuído que requerem orquestração de fluxo de trabalho confiável com Temporal","ru":"Идеально для агентов распределенных систем, требующих надежной оркестрации рабочих процессов с Temporal","ar":"مثالية لويكيل الأنظمة الموزعة التي تتطلب إدارة تدفق عمل موثوقة مع Temporal"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master workflow orchestration architecture, leveraging fundamental design decisions, resilience patterns, and best practices for building reliable distributed systems with multi-step processes, distributed transactions, and long-running workflows using Temporal","zh":"赋予代理掌握工作流编排架构的能力，利用基本的设计决策、弹性模式和构建可靠的分散系统的最佳实践，包括多步骤的流程、分布式事务和长时间运行的工作流，使用 Temporal","ja":"エージェントにワークフロー オーケストレーション アーキテクチャをマスターする能力を与え、基本的な設計決定、回復パターン、および Temporal を使用したマルチステップ プロセス、分散トランザクション、長時間実行ワークフローを備えた信頼性の高い分散システムの構築のベスト プラクティスを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 워크플로 오케스트레이션 아키텍처를 마스터할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 기본적인 설계 결정, 탄력성 패턴 및 Temporal을 사용한 다단계 프로세스, 분산 트랜잭션 및 장기 실행 워크플로가 포함된 안정적인 분산 시스템 구축을 위한最佳實踐을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar la arquitectura de orquestación de flujos de trabajo, aprovechando decisiones de diseño fundamentales, patrones de resiliencia y mejores prácticas para la construcción de sistemas distribuidos confiables con procesos de varios pasos, transacciones distribuidas y flujos de trabajo de larga duración que utilizan Temporal","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser l''architecture d''orchestration de flux de travail, en exploitant les décisions de conception fondamentales, les modèles de résilience et les meilleures pratiques pour la construction de systèmes distribués fiables avec des processus multétapes, des transactions distribuées et des flux de travail à long terme utilisant Temporal","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Architektur der Workflow-Orchestrierung zu meistern, indem grundlegende Designentscheidungen, Resilienzmuster und Best Practices für den Bau zuverlässiger verteilter Systeme mit mehrschrittigen Prozessen, verteilten Transaktionen und lang laufenden Workflows unter Verwendung von Temporal genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar a arquitetura de orquestração de fluxo de trabalho, aproveitando decisões de design fundamentais, padrões de resiliência e melhores práticas para construir sistemas distribuídos confiáveis com processos de vários passos, transações distribuídas e fluxos de trabalho de longa duração usando Temporal","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить архитектуру оркестрации рабочих процессов, используя фундаментальные решения по проектированию, модели устойчивости и лучшие практики для создания надежных распределенных систем с многоступенчатыми процессами, распределенными транзакциями и долгосрочными рабочими процессами с помощью Temporal","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إتقان هندسة إدارة تدفق العمل، مستفيداً من