re et collaborer efficacement","de":"Erweiterte Git-Workflows beherrschen, um ein sauberes Historie zu halten und effektiv zu kollaborieren","pt":"Aprenda a dominar fluxos de trabalho avançados Git para manter um histórico limpo e colaborar de forma eficaz","ru":"Освойте продвинутые рабочие процессы Git, чтобы поддерживать чистую историю и сотрудничать эффективно","ar":"تعلم سير عمل جيت المتقدمة للحفاظ على تاريخ نظيف والتعاون بفعالية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["清洁提交历史","跨分支应用提交","查找引入 Bug 的提交","同时处理多个功能","恢复 Git 错误或丢失的提交","管理复杂的分支工作流"],"ja":["クリーンなコミット履歴","ブランチ間でコミットを適用","バグを導入したコミットを探す","複数の機能を同時に処理","Git のエラーまたは失われたコミットから復旧","複雑なブランチワークフローを管理"],"ko":["깨끗한 커밋 기록","브랜치 간에 커밋 적용","버그를 도입한 커밋 찾기","여러 기능 동시 처리","Git 오류 또는 손실된 커밋 복구","복잡한 브랜치 워크플로 관리"],"es":["Limpieza del historial de commits","Aplicación de commits específicos en ramas","Búsqueda de commits que introdujeron errores","Trabajo en múltiples características simultáneamente","Recuperación de errores o commits perdidos","Gestión de flujos de trabajo de ramas complejas"],"fr":["Nettoyage de l''historique des commits","Application de commits spécifiques sur des branches","Recherche de commits qui ont introduit des bogues","Travail sur plusieurs fonctionnalités simultanément","Récupération d''erreurs ou de commits perdus","Gestion de flux de travail de branches complexes"],"de":["Bereinigung des Commit-Historie","Anwendung spezifischer Commits auf Zweigen","Suche nach Commits, die Fehler eingeführt haben","Arbeit an mehreren Funktionen gleichzeitig","Wiederherstellung von Fehlern oder verlorenen Commits","Verwaltung komplexer Zweig-Workflows"],"pt":["Limpeza de histórico de commits","Aplicação de commits específicos em branches","Encontrar commits que introduziram bugs","Trabalho em múltiplos recursos simultaneamente","Recuperação de erros Git ou commits perdidos","Gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho de branch complexos"],"ru":["Очистка истории коммитов","Применение конкретных коммитов к веткам","Поиск коммитов, которые ввели баги","Работа над несколькими функциями одновременно","Восстановление после ошибок Git или потерянных коммитов","Управление сложными рабочими процессами веток"],"ar":["تنظيف تاريخ Commits","تطبيق Commits معينة على الفروع","العثور على Commits التي أدخلت أخطاء","العمل على ميزات متعددة في نفس الوقت","استعادة الأخطاء Git أو Commits المفقودة","إدارة سير عمل الفروع المعقدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 高级工作流","Git 技术","版本控制","协作开发","代码管理","提交历史","分支管理","Git 恢复"],"ja":["Git アドバンスドワークフロー","Git 技術","バージョン管理","コラボレーション開発","コード管理","コミット履歴","ブランチ管理","Git 復旧"],"ko":["Git 고급 워크플로","Git 기술","버전 관리","협력 개발","코드 관리","커밋 기록","브랜치 관리","Git 복구"],"es":["git avanzado","flujos de trabajo git","historial de commits","colaboración en git","recuperación de errores git","gestión de ramas git","desarrollo de software","control de versiones"],"fr":["git avancé","workflows git","historique des commits","collaboration sur git","récupération d''erreurs git","gestion de branches git","développement de logiciels","contrôle de versions"],"de":["erweitertes Git","Git-Workflows","Commit-Historie","Kollaboration in Git","Fehlerwiederherstellung Git","Zweig-Verwaltung Git","Software-Entwicklung","Versionierung"],"pt":["Git avançado","Fluxos de trabalho Git","Técnicas Git","Colaboração Git","Histórico de commits","Recuperação de erros Git","Gerenciamento de branch"],"ru":["Продвинутый Git","Рабочие процессы Git","Техники Git","Сотрудничество Git","История коммитов","Восстановление после ошибок Git","Управление ветками"],"ar":["جيت المتقدمة","سير عمل جيت","تقنيات جيت","التعاون جيت","تاريخ Commits","استعادة الأخطاء جيت","إدارة الفروع"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ml_challenges","repoPath":"ollieb89/ml_challenges","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-advanced-workflows","description":"Master advanced Git workflows including rebasing, cherry-picking, bisect, worktrees, and reflog to maintain clean history and recover from any situation. Use when managing complex Git histories, collaborating on feature branches, or troubleshooting repository issues.","bodyPreview":"# Git Advanced Workflows\n\nMaster advanced Git techniques to maintain clean history, collaborate effectively, and recover from any situation with confidence.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Cleaning up commit history before merging\n- Applying specific commits across branches\n- Finding commits that introduced bugs\n- Working on multiple features simultaneously\n- Recovering from Git mistakes or lost commits\n- Managing complex branch workflows\n- Preparing clean PRs for review\n- Synchronizing diverged b","body":"# Git Advanced Workflows\n\nMaster advanced Git techniques to maintain clean history, collaborate effectively, and recover from any situation with confidence.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Cleaning up commit history before merging\n- Applying specific commits across branches\n- Finding commits that introduced bugs\n- Working on multiple features simultaneously\n- Recovering from Git mistakes or lost commits\n- Managing complex branch workflows\n- Preparing clean PRs for review\n- Synchronizing diverged branches\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Interactive Rebase\n\nInteractive rebase is the Swiss Army knife of Git history editing.\n\n**Common Operations:**\n- `pick`: Keep commit as-is\n- `reword`: Change commit message\n- `edit`: Amend commit content\n- `squash`: Combine with previous commit\n- `fixup`: Like squash but discard message\n- `drop`: Remove commit entirely\n\n**Basic Usage:**\n```bash\n# Rebase last 5 commits\ngit rebase -i HEAD~5\n\n# Rebase all commits on current branch\ngit rebase -i $(git merge-base HEAD main)\n\n# Rebase onto specific commit\ngit rebase -i abc123\n```\n\n### 2. Cherry-Picking\n\nApply specific commits from one branch to another without merging entire branches.\n\n```bash\n# Cherry-pick single commit\ngit cherry-pick abc123\n\n# Cherry-pick range of commits (exclusive start)\ngit cherry-pick abc123..def456\n\n# Cherry-pick without committing (stage changes only)\ngit cherry-pick -n abc123\n\n# Cherry-pick and edit commit message\ngit cherry-pick -e abc123\n```\n\n### 3. Git Bisect\n\nBinary search through commit history to find the commit that introduced a bug.\n\n```bash\n# Start bisect\ngit bisect start\n\n# Mark current commit as bad\ngit bisect bad\n\n# Mark known good commit\ngit bisect good v1.0.0\n\n# Git will checkout middle commit - test it\n# Then mark as good or bad\ngit bisect good  # or: git bisect bad\n\n# Continue until bug found\n# When done\ngit bisect reset\n```\n\n**Automated Bisect:**\n```bash\n# Use script to test automatically\ngit bisect start HEAD v1.0.0\ngit bisect run ./test.sh\n\n# test.sh should exit 0 for good, 1-127 (except 125) for bad\n```\n\n### 4. Worktrees\n\nWork on multiple branches simultaneously without stashing or switching.\n\n```bash\n# List existing worktrees\ngit worktree list\n\n# Add new worktree for feature branch\ngit worktree add ../project-feature feature/new-feature\n\n# Add worktree and create new branch\ngit worktree add -b bugfix/urgent ../project-hotfix main\n\n# Remove worktree\ngit worktree remove ../project-feature\n\n# Prune stale worktrees\ngit worktree prune\n```\n\n### 5. Reflog\n\nYour safety net - tracks all ref movements, even deleted commits.\n\n```bash\n# View reflog\ngit reflog\n\n# View reflog for specific branch\ngit reflog show feature/branch\n\n# Restore deleted commit\ngit reflog\n# Find commit hash\ngit checkout abc123\ngit branch recovered-branch\n\n# Restore deleted branch\ngit reflog\ngit branch deleted-branch abc123\n```\n\n## Practical Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Clean Up Feature Branch Before PR\n\n```bash\n# Start with feature branch\ngit checkout feature/user-auth\n\n# Interactive rebase to clean history\ngit rebase -i main\n\n# Example rebase operations:\n# - Squash \"fix typo\" commits\n# - Reword commit messages for clarity\n# - Reorder commits logically\n# - Drop unnecessary commits\n\n# Force push cleaned branch (safe if no one else is using it)\ngit push --force-with-lease origin feature/user-auth\n```\n\n### Workflow 2: Apply Hotfix to Multiple Releases\n\n```bash\n# Create fix on main\ngit checkout main\ngit commit -m \"fix: critical security patch\"\n\n# Apply to release branches\ngit checkout release/2.0\ngit cherry-pick abc123\n\ngit checkout release/1.9\ngit cherry-pick abc123\n\n# Handle conflicts if they arise\ngit cherry-pick --continue\n# or\ngit cherry-pick --abort\n```\n\n### Workflow 3: Find Bug Introduction\n\n```bash\n# Start bisect\ngit bisect start\ngit bisect bad HEAD\ngit bisect good v2.1.0\n\n# Git checks out middle commit - run tests\nnpm test\n\n# If tests fail\ngit bisect bad\n\n# If tests pass\ngit bisect good\n\n# Git will automatically checkout next commit to test\n# Repeat until bug found\n\n# Automated version\ngit bisect start HEAD v2.1.0\ngit bisect run npm test\n```\n\n### Workflow 4: Multi-Branch Development\n\n```bash\n# Main project directory\ncd ~/projects/myapp\n\n# Create worktree for urgent bugfix\ngit worktree add ../myapp-hotfix hotfix/critical-bug\n\n# Work on hotfix in separate directory\ncd ../myapp-hotfix\n# Make changes, commit\ngit commit -m \"fix: resolve critical bug\"\ngit push origin hotfix/critical-bug\n\n# Return to main work without interruption\ncd ~/projects/myapp\ngit fetch origin\ngit cherry-pick hotfix/critical-bug\n\n# Clean up when done\ngit worktree remove ../myapp-hotfix\n```\n\n### Workflow 5: Recover from Mistakes\n\n```bash\n# Accidentally reset to wrong commit\ngit reset --hard HEAD~5  # Oh no!\n\n# Use reflog to find lost commits\ngit reflog\n# Output shows:\n# abc123 HEAD@{0}: reset: moving to HEAD~5\n# def456 HEAD@{1}: commit: my important changes\n\n# Recover lost commits\ngit reset --hard def456\n\n# Or create branch from lost commit\ngit branch recovery def456\n```\n\n## Advanced Techniques\n\n### Rebase vs Merge Strategy\n\n**When to Rebase:**\n- Cleaning up local commits before pushing\n- Keeping feature branch up-to-date with main\n- Creating linear history for easier review\n\n**When to Merge:**\n- Integrating completed features into main\n- Preserving exact history of collaboration\n- Public branches used by others\n\n```bash\n# Update feature branch with main changes (rebase)\ngit checkout feature/my-feature\ngit fetch origin\ngit rebase origin/main\n\n# Handle conflicts\ngit status\n# Fix conflicts in files\ngit add .\ngit rebase --continue\n\n# Or merge instead\ngit merge origin/main\n```\n\n### Autosquash Workflow\n\nAutomatically squash fixup commits during rebase.\n\n```bash\n# Make initial commit\ngit commit -m \"feat: add user authentication\"\n\n# Later, fix something in that commit\n# Stage changes\ngit commit --fixup HEAD  # or specify commit hash\n\n# Make more changes\ngit commit --fixup abc123\n\n# Rebase with autosquash\ngit rebase -i --autosquash main\n\n# Git automatically marks fixup commits\n```\n\n### Split Commit\n\nBreak one commit into multiple logical commits.\n\n```bash\n# Start interactive rebase\ngit rebase -i HEAD~3\n\n# Mark commit to split with ''edit''\n# Git will stop at that commit\n\n# Reset commit but keep changes\ngit reset HEAD^\n\n# Stage and commit in logical chunks\ngit add file1.py\ngit commit -m \"feat: add validation\"\n\ngit add file2.py\ngit commit -m \"feat: add error handling\"\n\n# Continue rebase\ngit rebase --continue\n```\n\n### Partial Cherry-Pick\n\nCherry-pick only specific files from a commit.\n\n```bash\n# Show files in commit\ngit show --name-only abc123\n\n# Checkout specific files from commit\ngit checkout abc123 -- path/to/file1.py path/to/file2.py\n\n# Stage and commit\ngit commit -m \"cherry-pick: apply specific changes from abc123\"\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always Use --force-with-lease**: Safer than --force, prevents overwriting others'' work\n2. **Rebase Only Local Commits**: Don''t rebase commits that have been pushed and shared\n3. **Descriptive Commit Messages**: Future you will thank present you\n4. **Atomic Commits**: Each commit should be a single logical change\n5. **Test Before Force Push**: Ensure history rewrite didn''t break anything\n6. **Keep Reflog Aware**: Remember reflog is your safety net for 90 days\n7. **Branch Before Risky Operations**: Create backup branch before complex rebases\n\n```bash\n# Safe force push\ngit push --force-with-lease origin feature/branch\n\n# Create backup before risky operation\ngit branch backup-branch\ngit rebase -i main\n# If something goes wrong\ngit reset --hard backup-branch\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Rebasing Public Branches**: Causes history conflicts for collaborators\n- **Force Pushing Without Lease**: Can overwrite teammate''s work\n- **Losing Work in Rebase**: Resolve conflicts carefully, test after rebase\n- **Forgetting Worktree Cleanup**: Orphaned worktrees consume disk space\n- **Not Backing Up Before Experiment**: Always create safety branch\n- **Bisect on Dirty Working Directory**: Commit or stash before bisecting\n\n## Recovery Commands\n\n```bash\n# Abort operations in progress\ngit rebase --abort\ngit merge --abort\ngit cherry-pick --abort\ngit bisect reset\n\n# Restore file to version from specific commit\ngit restore --source=abc123 path/to/file\n\n# Undo last commit but keep changes\ngit reset --soft HEAD^\n\n# Undo last commit and discard changes\ngit reset --hard HEAD^\n\n# Recover deleted branch (within 90 days)\ngit reflog\ngit branch recovered-branch abc123\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/git-rebase-guide.md**: Deep dive into interactive rebase\n- **references/git-conflict-resolution.md**: Advanced conflict resolution strategies\n- **references/git-history-rewriting.md**: Safely rewriting Git history\n- **assets/git-workflow-checklist.md**: Pre-PR cleanup checklist\n- **assets/git-aliases.md**: Useful Git aliases for advanced workflows\n- **scripts/git-clean-branches.sh**: Clean up merged and stale branches\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:23:14.290Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced Git workflow management and version control capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Git 工作流管理和版本控制能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが高度な Git ワークフロー管理とバージョン管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Git 워크플ロー 관리 및 버전 관리 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo de Git avanzada y capacidades de control de versiones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion avancée du workflow Git et de capacités de contrôle de version.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Git-Workflow-Verwaltung und Versionierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de gerenciamento avançado de fluxo de trabalho do Git e capacidades de controle de versão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления рабочим процессом Git и контроля версий.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة متقدمة لتدفق العمل جيت وقدرات التحكم في الإصدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain clean commit history using techniques like rebasing and squashing, apply specific commits across branches using cherry-picking, and recover from mistakes using Git reflog and reset, all while managing complex branch workflows and preparing clean PRs for review.","zh":"赋予代理维护干净的提交历史记录的能力，使用重新提交和压缩等技术，使用 cherry-picking 在分支之间应用特定的提交，并使用 Git reflog 和重置恢复错误，同时管理复杂的分支工作流并准备干净的 PR 以供审查。","ja":"エージェントがリベースやスクワッシュなどの手法を使用してクリーンなコミット履歴を維持できるようにし、チェリー・ピッキングを使用してブランチ間で特定のコミットを適用し、Git リファログとリセットを使用してミスから回復し、複雑なブランチワークフローを管理しながらクリーンな PR をレビューのために準備します。","ko":"에이전트가 rebasing 및 squashing 등의 기술을 사용하여 깨끗한 커밋 기록을 유지할 수 있도록 하며, cherry-picking을 사용하여 브랜치 간에 특정 커밋을 적용하고, Git reflog 및 reset을 사용하여 오류에서 복구하며, 복잡한 브랜치 워크플로우를 관리하면서 깨끗한 PR을 리뷰를 위해 준비합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener un historial de confirmaciones limpio utilizando técnicas como rebase y squash, aplicar confirmaciones específicas en ramas utilizando cherry-picking y recuperarse de errores utilizando Git reflog y reset, todo mientras se gestionan flujos de trabajo de ramas complejas y se preparan PRs limpios para revisión.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir un historique de commits propre en utilisant des techniques comme le rebasage et le squash, d''appliquer des commits spécifiques sur des branches à l''aide de cherry-picking et de se remettre d''erreurs en utilisant Git reflog et reset, le tout en gérant des flux de travail de branches complexes et en préparant des PR propres pour examen.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ein sauberes Commit-Verlauf zu erhalten, indem sie Techniken wie Rebase und Squash verwenden, bestimmte Commits über Branches hinweg mithilfe von Cherry-Picking anwenden und sich von Fehlern mithilfe von Git Reflog und Reset erholen, während sie komplexe Branch-Workflows verwalten und saubere PRs für die Überprüfung vorbereiten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter um histórico de commits limpo usando técnicas como rebase e squashing, aplicar commits específicos em branches usando cherry-picking e se recuperar de erros usando Git reflog e reset, tudo enquanto gerencia fluxos de trabalho de branch complexos e prepara PRs limpas para revisão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать чистую историю коммитов с помощью техник, таких как ребейзинг и сквошинг, применять конкретные коммиты к веткам с помощью черри-пикинга и восстанавливаться после ошибок с помощью Git рефлог и сброс, все это при управлении сложными рабочими процессами веток и подготовке чистых PR для рассмотрения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على سجل إلتزامات نظيف باستخدام تقنيات مثل إعادة البناء والتقلص، وتطبيق الإلتزامات المحددة عبر الفروع باستخدام cherry-picking، والتعافي من الأخطاء باستخدام Git reflog وإعادة التعيين، كل ذلك أثناء إدارة سلاسل عمل الفروع المعقدة وتهيئة طلبات الجذب النظيفة لمراجعة."},"useCases":{"en":["Cleaning up commit history before merging pull requests","Applying specific commits across branches for bug fixes or feature updates","Recovering from Git mistakes or lost commits using reflog and reset"],"zh":["在合并请求之前清理提交历史记录","在分支之间应用特定的提交以进行错误修复或功能更新","使用 reflog 和重置恢复 Git 错误或丢失的提交"],"ja":["プルリクエストをマージする前にコミット履歴をクリーンアップする","ブランチ間で特定のコミットを適用してバグ修正または機能更新を行う","リファログとリセットを使用して Git のミスまたは失われたコミットから回復する"],"ko":["풀 리퀘스트를 병합하기 전에 커밋 기록을 정리하는 것","브랜치 간에 특정 커밋을 적용하여 버그 수정 또는 기능 업데이트를 수행하는 것","Git reflog 및 reset을 사용하여 Git 오류 또는 손실된 커밋에서 복구하는 것"],"es":["Limpieza del historial de confirmaciones antes de fusionar solicitudes de extracción","Aplicación de confirmaciones específicas en ramas para correcciones de errores o actualizaciones de funciones","Recuperación de errores de Git o confirmaciones perdidas utilizando reflog y reset"],"fr":["Nettoyage de l''historique des commits avant de fusionner les demandes d''extraction","Application de commits spécifiques sur des branches pour des corrections de bogues ou des mises à jour de fonctionnalités","Récupération d''erreurs Git ou de commits perdus en utilisant reflog et reset"],"de":["Bereinigung des Commit-Verlaufs vor dem Zusammenführen von Pull-Anfragen","Anwenden bestimmter Commits über Branches hinweg für Fehlerbehebungen oder Funktionsupdates","Wiederherstellung von Git-Fehlern oder verlorenen Commits mithilfe von Reflog und Reset"],"pt":["Limpar o histórico de commits antes de mesclar pull requests","Aplicar commits específicos em branches para correções de bugs ou atualizações de recursos","Recuperar-se de erros do Git ou commits perdidos usando reflog e reset"],"ru":["Очистка истории коммитов перед слиянием пулл-реквестов","Применение конкретных коммитов к веткам для исправления ошибок или обновления функций","Восстановление после ошибок Git или потерянных коммитов с помощью рефлог и сброс"],"ar":["تنظيف سجل الإلتزامات قبل دمج طلبات السحب","تطبيق الإلتزامات المحددة عبر الفروع لتصحيح الأخطاء أو تحديث الميزات","التعافي من أخطاء Git أو الإلتزامات المفقودة باستخدام سجل المرجع وإعادة التعيين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Limited to Git version control system"],"zh":["需要 Git 安装和配置","仅限 Git 版本控制系统"],"ja":["Git のインストールと構成が必要","Git 版本管理システムに限定される"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요함","Git 버전 관리 시스템에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Limitado al sistema de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Limité au système de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf das Git-Versionierungssystem"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Limitado ao sistema de controle de versão Git"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Ограничен системой контроля версий Git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين جيت","محدود بنظام التحكم في الإصدار جيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
