r les flux de travail Temporal utilisant pytest. Ressources pour les tests unitaires, d''intégration et de répétition","de":"Testing-Strategien für Temporal-Workflows mit pytest. Ressourcen für Unit-Tests, Integrationstests und Wiedergabetests","pt":"Estratégias de teste abrangentes para workflows Temporal em Python com pytest e recursos para cenários de teste específicos","ru":"Комплексные стратегии тестирования для рабочих процессов Temporal на Python с помощью pytest и ресурсов для конкретных сценариев тестирования","ar":"استراتيجيات اختبار شاملة لعمليات Temporal في بايثون باستخدام pytest وموارد لسيناريوهات اختبار محددة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":[" "," "," "," "],"ja":[" "," "," "," "],"ko":[" "," "," "," "],"es":["Testing unitario de flujos de trabajo","Testing de integración con actividades mockeadas","Testing de reproducción para validar la determinismo","Desarrollo local con servidor Temporal y pytest","Integración con CI/CD para testing automatizado"],"fr":["Test unitaire des flux de travail","Test d''intégration avec des activités mockées","Test de répétition pour valider la déterminisme","Développement local avec serveur Temporal et pytest","Intégration avec CI/CD pour des tests automatisés"],"de":["Unit-Testing von Workflows","Integrationstesting mit gemockten Aktivitäten","Wiedergabetesting zur Validierung der Determinismus","Lokale Entwicklung mit Temporal-Server und pytest","Integration mit CI/CD für automatisiertes Testing"],"pt":["Testes unitários de workflows","Testes de integração com atividades mockadas","Testes de replay para validar determinismo","Desenvolvimento local com servidor Temporal e pytest","Integração com CI/CD para testes automatizados"],"ru":["Юнит-тестирование рабочих процессов","Интеграционное тестирование с имитированными hoạtностью","Тестирование replay для проверки детерминизма","Местное развитие с сервером Temporal и pytest","Интеграция с CI/CD для автоматизированного тестирования"],"ar":["اختبارات الوحدات لعمليات","اختبارات التكامل مع أنشطة محاكاة","اختبارات الإعادة التشغيلية لتحقق التحديد","التطوير المحلي بخادم Temporal و pytest","التكامل مع CI/CD للاختبارات الآلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Temporal Python"," ","pytest"," "," "," "],"ja":["Temporal Python"," ","pytest"," "," "," "],"ko":["Temporal Python"," ","pytest"," "," "," "],"es":["pruebas de python temporal","testing de flujos de trabajo","pytest","desarrollo local","integración con ci/cd","testing unitario","testing de integración","testing de reproducción"],"fr":["test python temporel","testing de flux de travail","pytest","développement local","intégration avec ci/cd","test unitaire","test d''intégration","test de répétition"],"de":["temporal python testing","workflow-testing","pytest","lokale entwicklung","integration mit ci/cd","unit-testing","integrationstesting","wiedergabetesting"],"pt":["testes de Temporal em Python","pytest para Temporal","testes unitários de workflows","testes de integração em Python","replay testing em Python","desenvolvimento local de Temporal","CI/CD para testes automatizados"],"ru":["тестирование Temporal на Python","pytest для Temporal","юнит-тестирование рабочих процессов","интеграционное тестирование на Python","тестирование replay на Python","местное развитие Temporal","CI/CD для автоматизированного тестирования"],"ar":["اختبار Temporal بايثون","pytest ل Temporal","اختبارات الوحدات لعمليات","اختبارات التكامل في بايثون","اختبارات الإعادة التشغيلية في بايثون","التطوير المحلي ل Temporal","CI/CD للاختبارات الآلية"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ml_challenges","repoPath":"ollieb89/ml_challenges","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"temporal-python-testing","description":"Test Temporal workflows with pytest, time-skipping, and mocking strategies. Covers unit testing, integration testing, replay testing, and local development setup. Use when implementing Temporal workflow tests or debugging test failures.","bodyPreview":"# Temporal Python Testing Strategies\n\nComprehensive testing approaches for Temporal workflows using pytest, progressive disclosure resources for specific testing scenarios.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- **Unit testing workflows** - Fast tests with time-skipping\n- **Integration testing** - Workflows with mocked activities\n- **Replay testing** - Validate determinism against production histories\n- **Local development** - Set up Temporal server and pytest\n- **CI/CD integration** - Automated testing","body":"# Temporal Python Testing Strategies\n\nComprehensive testing approaches for Temporal workflows using pytest, progressive disclosure resources for specific testing scenarios.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- **Unit testing workflows** - Fast tests with time-skipping\n- **Integration testing** - Workflows with mocked activities\n- **Replay testing** - Validate determinism against production histories\n- **Local development** - Set up Temporal server and pytest\n- **CI/CD integration** - Automated testing pipelines\n- **Coverage strategies** - Achieve ≥80% test coverage\n\n## Testing Philosophy\n\n**Recommended Approach** (Source: docs.temporal.io/develop/python/testing-suite):\n- Write majority as integration tests\n- Use pytest with async fixtures\n- Time-skipping enables fast feedback (month-long workflows → seconds)\n- Mock activities to isolate workflow logic\n- Validate determinism with replay testing\n\n**Three Test Types**:\n1. **Unit**: Workflows with time-skipping, activities with ActivityEnvironment\n2. **Integration**: Workers with mocked activities\n3. **End-to-end**: Full Temporal server with real activities (use sparingly)\n\n## Available Resources\n\nThis skill provides detailed guidance through progressive disclosure. Load specific resources based on your testing needs:\n\n### Unit Testing Resources\n**File**: `resources/unit-testing.md`\n**When to load**: Testing individual workflows or activities in isolation\n**Contains**:\n- WorkflowEnvironment with time-skipping\n- ActivityEnvironment for activity testing\n- Fast execution of long-running workflows\n- Manual time advancement patterns\n- pytest fixtures and patterns\n\n### Integration Testing Resources\n**File**: `resources/integration-testing.md`\n**When to load**: Testing workflows with mocked external dependencies\n**Contains**:\n- Activity mocking strategies\n- Error injection patterns\n- Multi-activity workflow testing\n- Signal and query testing\n- Coverage strategies\n\n### Replay Testing Resources\n**File**: `resources/replay-testing.md`\n**When to load**: Validating determinism or deploying workflow changes\n**Contains**:\n- Determinism validation\n- Production history replay\n- CI/CD integration patterns\n- Version compatibility testing\n\n### Local Development Resources\n**File**: `resources/local-setup.md`\n**When to load**: Setting up development environment\n**Contains**:\n- Docker Compose configuration\n- pytest setup and configuration\n- Coverage tool integration\n- Development workflow\n\n## Quick Start Guide\n\n### Basic Workflow Test\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom temporalio.testing import WorkflowEnvironment\nfrom temporalio.worker import Worker\n\n@pytest.fixture\nasync def workflow_env():\n    env = await WorkflowEnvironment.start_time_skipping()\n    yield env\n    await env.shutdown()\n\n@pytest.mark.asyncio\nasync def test_workflow(workflow_env):\n    async with Worker(\n        workflow_env.client,\n        task_queue=\"test-queue\",\n        workflows=[YourWorkflow],\n        activities=[your_activity],\n    ):\n        result = await workflow_env.client.execute_workflow(\n            YourWorkflow.run,\n            args,\n            id=\"test-wf-id\",\n            task_queue=\"test-queue\",\n        )\n        assert result == expected\n```\n\n### Basic Activity Test\n\n```python\nfrom temporalio.testing import ActivityEnvironment\n\nasync def test_activity():\n    env = ActivityEnvironment()\n    result = await env.run(your_activity, \"test-input\")\n    assert result == expected_output\n```\n\n## Coverage Targets\n\n**Recommended Coverage** (Source: docs.temporal.io best practices):\n- **Workflows**: ≥80% logic coverage\n- **Activities**: ≥80% logic coverage\n- **Integration**: Critical paths with mocked activities\n- **Replay**: All workflow versions before deployment\n\n## Key Testing Principles\n\n1. **Time-Skipping** - Month-long workflows test in seconds\n2. **Mock Activities** - Isolate workflow logic from external dependencies\n3. **Replay Testing** - Validate determinism before deployment\n4. **High Coverage** - ≥80% target for production workflows\n5. **Fast Feedback** - Unit tests run in milliseconds\n\n## How to Use Resources\n\n**Load specific resource when needed**:\n- \"Show me unit testing patterns\" → Load `resources/unit-testing.md`\n- \"How do I mock activities?\" → Load `resources/integration-testing.md`\n- \"Setup local Temporal server\" → Load `resources/local-setup.md`\n- \"Validate determinism\" → Load `resources/replay-testing.md`\n\n## Additional References\n\n- Python SDK Testing: docs.temporal.io/develop/python/testing-suite\n- Testing Patterns: github.com/temporalio/temporal/blob/main/docs/development/testing.md\n- Python Samples: github.com/temporalio/samples-python\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:23:23.694Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents focused on workflow automation needing advanced Temporal testing capabilities with pytest","zh":"适合专注于工作流自动化并需要高级时间测试功能的AI代理，特别是使用pytest","ja":"ワークフロー自動化に焦点を当てて、pytestを使用した高度な時間テスト機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"pytest를 사용한 고급 시간 테스트 기능이 필요한 워크플ロー 자동화에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA centrados en la automatización de flujos de trabajo que necesitan capacidades de prueba temporales avanzadas con pytest","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA axés sur l''automatisation des flux de travail nécessitant des capacités de test temporel avancées avec pytest","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die auf Workflow-Automatisierung fokussiert sind und erweiterte Temporal-Testfunktionen mit pytest benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados na automação de fluxos de trabalho que necessitam de capacidades de teste temporal avançadas com pytest","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на автоматизацию рабочих процессов, требующих продвинутых возможностей временного тестирования с помощью pytest","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على أتمتة سير العمل الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات اختبار زمنية متقدمة مع pytest"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write comprehensive unit tests, integration tests, and replay tests for Temporal workflows, utilizing time-skipping and mocked activities with pytest, while ensuring determinism against production histories","zh":"赋予代理编写Temporal工作流的全面单元测试、集成测试和回放测试的能力，利用pytest中的时间跳过和模拟活动，同时确保对生产历史的确定性","ja":"pytestを使用して、時間スキップとモック活動を活用し、Temporalワークフローに対する決定性を保証することで、エージェントが包括的なユニットテスト、統合テスト、リプレイテストを記述できるようにする","ko":"pytest를 사용하여 시간跳过와 모의 활동을 활용하고 생산 기록에 대한 결정성을 보장함으로써 에이전트가 포괄적인 단위 테스트, 통합 테스트 및 재생 테스트를 작성할 수 있도록 하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas unitarias, pruebas de integración y pruebas de reproducción para flujos de trabajo Temporal, utilizando saltos de tiempo y actividades simuladas con pytest, al mismo tiempo que garantiza la determinismo frente a historias de producción","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests unitaires complets, des tests d''intégration et des tests de replay pour les flux de travail Temporal, en utilisant des sauts de temps et des activités simulées avec pytest, tout en assurant la déterminisme face aux historiques de production","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, umfassende Einheitstests, Integrations- und Replay-Tests für Temporal-Workflows zu schreiben, unter Nutzung von Zeitübersprüngen und simulierten Aktivitäten mit pytest, während gleichzeitig die Determinismus gegenüber Produktionshistorien sichergestellt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes unitários abrangentes, testes de integração e testes de reprodução para fluxos de trabalho Temporal, utilizando saltos de tempo e atividades simuladas com pytest, garantindo a determinismo contra históricos de produção","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать комплексные модульные тесты, тесты интеграции и тесты воспроизведения для рабочих процессов Temporal, используя пропуск времени и имитированные активности с помощью pytest, обеспечивая детерминизм против производственных историй","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة واختبارات التكامل واختبارات الإعادة لهياكل سير العمل Temporal، باستخدام تخطي الزمن والأنشطة المحاكاة مع pytest، مع ضمان التحديد ضد سجلات الإنتاج"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating workflow testing with fast time-skipping","Debugging workflows using mocked activities","Validating workflow determinism through replay testing"],"zh":["使用快速时间跳过自动化工作流测试","使用模拟活动调试工作流","通过回放测试验证工作流确定性"],"ja":["高速時間スキップを使用したワークフローテストの自動化","モック活動を使用したワークフローのデバッグ","リプレイテストを使用したワークフローの決定性の検証"],"ko":["빠른 시간 뛰기를 사용한 워크플ロー 테스트 자동화","모의 활동을 사용한 워크플로 디버깅","재생 테스트를 사용한 워크플로 결정성 검증"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de flujo de trabajo con saltos de tiempo rápidos","Depuración de flujos de trabajo utilizando actividades simuladas","Validación de la determinismo del flujo de trabajo a través de pruebas de reproducción"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de flux de travail avec des sauts de temps rapides","Débogage des flux de travail à l''aide d''activités simulées","Validation de la déterminisme du flux de travail via des tests de replay"],"de":["Automatisierung von Workflow-Tests mit schnellem Zeitübersprung","Fehlerbehebung in Workflows unter Verwendung von simulierten Aktivitäten","Validierung der Determinismus von Workflows durch Replay-Tests"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de fluxos de trabalho com saltos de tempo rápidos","Depurar fluxos de trabalho usando atividades simuladas","Validar a determinismo do fluxo de trabalho por meio de testes de reprodução"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование рабочих процессов с быстрым пропуском времени","Отлаживать рабочие процессы с помощью имитированных активностей","Проверять детерминизм рабочего процесса путем тестирования воспроизведения"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار هياكل سير العمل مع تخطي الزمن السريع","تصحيح الأعطال لهياكل سير العمل باستخدام الأنشطة المحاكاة","التحقق من تحديد هياكل سير العمل من خلال اختبارات الإعادة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pytest and Temporal server setup","Python compatibility required","Limited to Temporal workflow testing"],"zh":["需要pytest和Temporal服务器设置","需要Python兼容性","仅限于Temporal工作流测试"],"ja":["pytestとTemporalサーバーの設定が必要","Pythonの互換性が必要","Temporalワークフローテストに限定"],"ko":["pytest 및 Temporal 서버 설정이 필요","Python 호환성이 필요","Temporal 워크플로우 테스트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de servidor pytest y Temporal","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python","Limitado a pruebas de flujo de trabajo Temporal"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de serveur pytest et Temporal","Compatibilité Python requise","Limité aux tests de flux de travail Temporal"],"de":["Benötigt pytest- und Temporal-Server-Konfiguration","Python-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Temporal-Workflow-Tests"],"pt":["Requer configuração do servidor pytest e Temporal","Compatibilidade com Python necessária","Limitado ao teste de fluxos de trabalho Temporal"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервера pytest и Temporal","Требуется совместимость с Python","Ограничен тестированием рабочих процессов Temporal"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم pytest و Temporal","متطلبات التوافق مع Python","محدود باختبار هياكل سير العمل Temporal"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
