F转换和优化","ja":"PDFツールはOpenAIバックエンドのテストとメンテナンスに使用されるツールのコレクションであり、PDF変換と最適化を含む","ko":"PDF 도구는 OpenAI 백엔드 테스트 및 유지 보수를 위한 도구 모음으로 PDF 변환 및 최적화를 포함합니다","es":"La colección de herramientas PDF para desarrolladores ofrece funcionalidades para probar y mantener backends de OpenAI","fr":"La collection d''outils PDF pour développeurs offre des fonctionnalités pour tester et maintenir les backends OpenAI","de":"Die Sammlung von PDF-Tools für Entwickler bietet Funktionen zum Testen und Warten von OpenAI-Backends","pt":"As ferramentas PDF são uma coleção de utilitários para testar, operar e manter backends OpenAI. Elas permitem converter PDF em JPG para análise de visão.","ru":"Инструменты PDF представляют собой набор утилит для тестирования, эксплуатации и обслуживания бэкендов OpenAI. Они позволяют конвертировать PDF в JPG для ана...","ar":"أدوات PDF هي مجموعة من الأدوات لاختبار وتشغيل وصيانة الخلفيات مفتوحة الذكاء الاصطناعي. وهي تسمح بتحويل PDF إلى JPG لتحليل الرؤية.","en":"A collection of tools to test, operate and maintain OpenAI backends (OpenAI and AzureOpenAI)"},"definition":{"en":"A collection of tools to test, operate and maintain OpenAI backends (OpenAI and AzureOpenAI)"},"features":{"zh":["PDF转换","PDF优化","支持多种DPI设置","两次降采样：Ghostscript和QPDF","支持批量转换","集成OpenAI后端测试"],"ja":["PDF変換","PDF最適化","複数のDPI設定をサポート","2回のダウンサンプリング：GhostscriptとQPDF","バッチ変換をサポート","OpenAIバックエンドテストとの統合"],"ko":["PDF 변환","PDF 최적화","다중 DPI 설정 지원","2회 다운샘플링: Ghostscript 및 QPDF","배치 변환 지원","OpenAI 백엔드 테스트 통합"],"es":["Conversión de PDF a JPG","Uso de 150 DPI para pantalla y 300 DPI para OCR","Redimensionamiento de dos pasos con Ghostscript y QPDF","Compatibilidad con OpenAI y AzureOpenAI","Script de conversión de PDF a JPG en Python"],"fr":["Conversion de PDF en JPG","Utilisation de 150 DPI pour l''écran et 300 DPI pour l''OCR","Redimensionnement en deux étapes avec Ghostscript et QPDF","Compatibilité avec OpenAI et AzureOpenAI","Script de conversion de PDF en JPG en Python"],"de":["Konvertierung von PDF in JPG","Verwendung von 150 DPI für Bildschirm und 300 DPI für OCR","Zweistufiges Downsizing mit Ghostscript und QPDF","Kompatibilität mit OpenAI und AzureOpenAI","Skript zur Konvertierung von PDF in JPG in Python"],"pt":["Conversão de PDF em JPG","Otimização de imagens","Análise de visão","Utilitários para backends OpenAI","Configuração personalizada"],"ru":["Конвертация PDF в JPG","Оптимизация изображений","Анализ зрения","Утилиты для бэкендов OpenAI","Пользовательская настройка"],"ar":["تحويل PDF إلى JPG","تحسين الصور","تحليل الرؤية","أدوات لخلفيات مفتوحة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكوين مخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF工具","OpenAI后端","PDF转换","PDF优化","DPI设置","Ghostscript","QPDF","批量转换","OpenAI测试"],"ja":["PDFツール","OpenAIバックエンド","PDF変換","PDF最適化","DPI設定","Ghostscript","QPDF","バッチ変換","OpenAIテスト"],"ko":["PDF 도구","OpenAI 백엔드","PDF 변환","PDF 최적화","DPI 설정","Ghostscript","QPDF","배치 변환","OpenAI 테스트"],"es":["herramientas pdf","desarrollo de pdf","conversión de pdf a jpg","openai","azureopenai","ghostscript","qpdf","python"],"fr":["outils pdf","développement de pdf","conversion de pdf en jpg","openai","azureopenai","ghostscript","qpdf","python"],"de":["pdf-tools","entwicklung von pdf","konvertierung von pdf in jpg","openai","azureopenai","ghostscript","qpdf","python"],"pt":["ferramentas pdf","conversão pdf jpg","análise de visão","backends openai","otimização de imagens","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["инструменты pdf","конвертация pdf jpg","анализ зрения","бэкенды openai","оптимизация изображений","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أدوات pdf","تحويل pdf إلى jpg","تحليل الرؤية","خلفيات مفتوحة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الصور","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"OpenAI-BackendTools","repoPath":"karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf-tools","description":"Apply when converting, processing, or analyzing PDF files","bodyPreview":"# PDF Tools Guide\n\nRules and usage for PDF tools in `[WORKSPACE_FOLDER]/.tools/`.\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Check existing conversions before converting\n- Default output: `.tools/_pdf_to_jpg_converted/[PDF_FILENAME]/`\n- Use 150 DPI for screen, 300 DPI for OCR\n- Two-pass downsizing: Ghostscript (images) then QPDF (structure)\n\n## PDF to JPG Conversion\n\n### Script: `DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/convert-pdf-to-jpg.py`\n\nConverts PDF pages to JPG images for vision analysis.\n\n**Usage:**\n```powershell\npyth","body":"# PDF Tools Guide\n\nRules and usage for PDF tools in `[WORKSPACE_FOLDER]/.tools/`.\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Check existing conversions before converting\n- Default output: `.tools/_pdf_to_jpg_converted/[PDF_FILENAME]/`\n- Use 150 DPI for screen, 300 DPI for OCR\n- Two-pass downsizing: Ghostscript (images) then QPDF (structure)\n\n## PDF to JPG Conversion\n\n### Script: `DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/convert-pdf-to-jpg.py`\n\nConverts PDF pages to JPG images for vision analysis.\n\n**Usage:**\n```powershell\npython DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/convert-pdf-to-jpg.py <input.pdf> [--output <dir>] [--dpi <dpi>] [--pages <range>]\n```\n\n**Examples:**\n```powershell\npython DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/convert-pdf-to-jpg.py invoice.pdf\npython DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/convert-pdf-to-jpg.py invoice.pdf --dpi 200 --pages 1-2\npython DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/convert-pdf-to-jpg.py invoice.pdf --pages 1\n```\n\n**Output Convention:**\n- Default output: `.tools/_pdf_to_jpg_converted/[PDF_FILENAME]/`\n- Each PDF gets its own subfolder named after the PDF file (without extension)\n- Files named: `[PDF_FILENAME]_page001.jpg`, `[PDF_FILENAME]_page002.jpg`, etc.\n- Check for existing subfolder to skip re-conversion\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `--output`: Output directory (default: `.tools/_pdf_to_jpg_converted/`)\n- `--dpi`: Resolution (default: 150)\n- `--pages`: Page range - \"1\", \"1-3\", or \"all\" (default: all)\n\n## 7-Zip CLI Tools\n\nLocation: `.tools/7z/`\n\n7-Zip is required to extract Ghostscript from its NSIS installer. The standalone `7za.exe` cannot extract NSIS archives.\n\n### Extract archive\n```powershell\n& \".tools/7z/7z.exe\" x -y -o\"output_folder\" \"archive.zip\"\n```\n\n### Extract NSIS installer (like Ghostscript)\n```powershell\n& \".tools/7z/7z.exe\" x -y -o\"output_folder\" \"installer.exe\"\n```\n\n### List archive contents\n```powershell\n& \".tools/7z/7z.exe\" l \"archive.zip\"\n```\n\n## Poppler CLI Tools\n\nLocation: `.tools/poppler/Library/bin/`\n\n### pdftoppm - PDF to Image\n```powershell\n& \".tools/poppler/Library/bin/pdftoppm.exe\" -jpeg -r 150 \"input.pdf\" \"output_prefix\"\n```\n\n### pdftotext - Extract Text\n```powershell\n& \".tools/poppler/Library/bin/pdftotext.exe\" \"input.pdf\" \"output.txt\"\n```\n\n### pdfinfo - Get PDF Metadata\n```powershell\n& \".tools/poppler/Library/bin/pdfinfo.exe\" \"input.pdf\"\n```\n\n### pdfseparate - Split PDF Pages\n```powershell\n& \".tools/poppler/Library/bin/pdfseparate.exe\" \"input.pdf\" \"output_%d.pdf\"\n```\n\n### pdfunite - Merge PDFs\n```powershell\n& \".tools/poppler/Library/bin/pdfunite.exe\" \"page1.pdf\" \"page2.pdf\" \"merged.pdf\"\n```\n\n## QPDF CLI Tools\n\nLocation: `.tools/qpdf/bin/`\n\n### Merge PDFs\n```powershell\n& \".tools/qpdf/bin/qpdf.exe\" --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n```\n\n### Split PDF (extract pages)\n```powershell\n& \".tools/qpdf/bin/qpdf.exe\" input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- output.pdf\n```\n\n### Decrypt PDF\n```powershell\n& \".tools/qpdf/bin/qpdf.exe\" --decrypt --password=secret encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### Repair PDF\n```powershell\n& \".tools/qpdf/bin/qpdf.exe\" --replace-input damaged.pdf\n```\n\n### Linearize (optimize for web)\n```powershell\n& \".tools/qpdf/bin/qpdf.exe\" --linearize input.pdf output.pdf\n```\n\n## Smart PDF Compression Script\n\n### Script: `DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/compress-pdf.py`\n\nIntelligent PDF compression that analyzes content and applies optimal strategy.\n\n**Usage:**\n```powershell\npython DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/compress-pdf.py <input.pdf> [--compression high|medium|low] [--output output.pdf]\n```\n\n**Examples:**\n```powershell\npython DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/compress-pdf.py report.pdf\npython DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/compress-pdf.py report.pdf --compression high\npython DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/compress-pdf.py report.pdf --compression low --output archive.pdf\n```\n\n**Compression levels:**\n- **high**: Target 50%+ reduction, aggressive (72 DPI)\n- **medium**: Target 25%+ reduction, balanced (150 DPI)\n- **low**: Target 10%+ reduction, preserve quality (300 DPI)\n\n**Features:**\n- Analyzes PDF structure (images, DPI, format, optimization status)\n- Predicts compression potential before processing\n- Escalates to more aggressive strategies if target not reached\n- Reverts to previous result if aggressive approach shows insufficient improvement\n\n**Output:** `.tools/_pdf_output/[PDF_FILENAME]_compressed.pdf`\n\n## Simple PDF Downsizing Script\n\n### Script: `DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/downsize-pdf-images.py`\n\nDirect Ghostscript wrapper for manual DPI control.\n\n**Usage:**\n```powershell\npython DevSystemV2/skills/pdf-tools/downsize-pdf-images.py <input.pdf> [--output <dir>] [--dpi <dpi>] [--preset <preset>]\n```\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `--output`: Output directory (default: `.tools/_pdf_output/`)\n- `--dpi`: Resolution (default: 150)\n- `--preset`: Quality preset - screen (72), ebook (150), printer (300), prepress (300)\n\n**Output:** `.tools/_pdf_output/[PDF_FILENAME]_[DPI]dpi.pdf`\n\n## Ghostscript CLI Tools\n\nLocation: `.tools/gs/bin/`\n\n### Compress images (downsize PDF)\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gs/bin/gswin64c.exe\" -sDEVICE=pdfwrite -dCompatibilityLevel=1.4 -dPDFSETTINGS=/screen -dDownsampleColorImages=true -dColorImageResolution=72 -dDownsampleGrayImages=true -dGrayImageResolution=72 -dDownsampleMonoImages=true -dMonoImageResolution=72 -dNOPAUSE -dQUIET -dBATCH -sOutputFile=output.pdf input.pdf\n```\n\n### Quality presets (`-dPDFSETTINGS`)\n- `/screen` - 72 DPI, smallest file size\n- `/ebook` - 150 DPI, medium quality\n- `/printer` - 300 DPI, high quality\n- `/prepress` - 300 DPI, color preserving\n\n### Remove all images (text only)\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gs/bin/gswin64c.exe\" -sDEVICE=pdfwrite -dCompatibilityLevel=1.4 -dFILTERIMAGE=true -dNOPAUSE -dQUIET -dBATCH -sOutputFile=output.pdf input.pdf\n```\n\n## PDF Downsizing Workflow\n\nTwo-pass workflow for maximum compression:\n\n### Pass 1: Ghostscript (image compression)\n```powershell\n& \".tools/gs/bin/gswin64c.exe\" -sDEVICE=pdfwrite -dCompatibilityLevel=1.4 -dPDFSETTINGS=/screen -dDownsampleColorImages=true -dColorImageResolution=72 -dDownsampleGrayImages=true -dGrayImageResolution=72 -dNOPAUSE -dQUIET -dBATCH -sOutputFile=temp.pdf input.pdf\n```\n\n### Pass 2: QPDF (structure optimization)\n```powershell\n& \".tools/qpdf/bin/qpdf.exe\" --linearize --object-streams=generate --stream-data=compress --compress-streams=y --optimize-images --flatten-annotations=screen temp.pdf output.pdf\nRemove-Item temp.pdf\n```\n\n## PDF Analysis\n\nBefore optimizing, analyze the PDF to understand what''s consuming space.\n\n### Get PDF info\n```powershell\n& \".tools/poppler/Library/bin/pdfinfo.exe\" \"input.pdf\"\n```\n\n### List all images with details\n```powershell\n& \".tools/poppler/Library/bin/pdfimages.exe\" -list \"input.pdf\"\n```\n\nShows: page, dimensions, color space, compression, DPI, size. Use to determine if images can be further compressed.\n\n### Count images\n```powershell\n& \".tools/poppler/Library/bin/pdfimages.exe\" -list \"input.pdf\" | Measure-Object\n```\n\n## Optimization Strategies (by effectiveness)\n\nTested on 6 real-world annual reports (50-100 MB each):\n\n**High compression (>50% reduction):**\n- JPEG2000 at 200 DPI: 77 MB → 4.5 MB (94% with screen, 86% with ebook)\n- Mixed content, not optimized: 84 MB → 34 MB (59%)\n- Mixed content: 49 MB → 21 MB (57%)\n\n**Moderate compression (10-50%):**\n- Already optimized PDF: 47 MB → 42 MB (10%)\n\n**Low compression (<10%):**\n- PDF with 10552 tiny images: 58 MB → 56 MB (4%) - many small UI elements\n- Image-only PDF at 115 DPI: 101 MB → 97 MB (4% at 100 DPI, 77% at 72 DPI)\n\n**Key factors affecting compression:**\n- **Image format**: JPEG2000 (jpx) compresses dramatically when converted to JPEG\n- **Image DPI**: High DPI (200+) benefits most from downsampling\n- **Already optimized**: PDFs marked \"Optimized: yes\" compress less\n- **Many small images**: Thousands of tiny icons/UI elements resist compression\n\n### Strategy 1: Aggressive (best for large reductions)\n```powershell\ncmd /c \"& ''.tools/gs/bin/gswin64c.exe'' -sDEVICE=pdfwrite -dCompatibilityLevel=1.4 -dPDFSETTINGS=/screen -dDetectDuplicateImages=true -dCompressFonts=true -dSubsetFonts=true -dConvertCMYKImagesToRGB=true -dColorImageDownsampleType=/Bicubic -dNOPAUSE -dBATCH -sOutputFile=output.pdf input.pdf\"\n```\n\n### Strategy 2: Balanced (preserves more quality)\n```powershell\ncmd /c \"& ''.tools/gs/bin/gswin64c.exe'' -sDEVICE=pdfwrite -dCompatibilityLevel=1.4 -dPDFSETTINGS=/ebook -dDetectDuplicateImages=true -dCompressFonts=true -dSubsetFonts=true -dConvertCMYKImagesToRGB=true -dNOPAUSE -dBATCH -sOutputFile=output.pdf input.pdf\"\n```\n\n### Strategy 3: Structure only (no quality loss)\n```powershell\n& \".tools/qpdf/bin/qpdf.exe\" --linearize --object-streams=generate --compress-streams=y --recompress-flate input.pdf output.pdf\n```\n\n## Key Optimization Flags\n\n- `-dDetectDuplicateImages=true` - Replace duplicate images with references\n- `-dCompressFonts=true` - Compress font data\n- `-dSubsetFonts=true` - Include only used glyphs\n- `-dConvertCMYKImagesToRGB=true` - Convert CMYK to RGB (smaller)\n- `-dColorImageDownsampleType=/Bicubic` - Better quality downsampling\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Analyze first**: Use `pdfimages -list` to understand image content before optimizing\n2. **Check existing conversions**: Before converting, check if subfolder exists in `_pdf_to_jpg_converted/`\n3. **Use appropriate DPI**: 72 for web/archive, 150 for screen, 300 for print/OCR\n4. **Convert specific pages**: Use `--pages` to avoid converting entire large PDFs\n5. **Clean up**: Delete old conversions when no longer needed\n6. **Two-pass for maximum compression**: Ghostscript (images) then QPDF (structure)\n\n## Setup\n\nFor initial installation, see `SETUP.md` in this skill folder.\n\n**Tool locations:**\n- 7-Zip: `.tools/7z/`\n- Poppler: `.tools/poppler/`\n- QPDF: `.tools/qpdf/`\n- Ghostscript: `.tools/gs/`\n- Installers: `.tools/_installer/`\n- JPG output: `.tools/_pdf_to_jpg_converted/`\n- PDF output: `.tools/_pdf_output/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:24:39.618Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Analysis Agents requiring advanced PDF processing and conversion capabilities for vision analysis.","zh":"适用于需要高级PDF处理和转换功能的分析代理，用于视觉分析。","ja":"分析エージェントが高度なPDF処理および変換機能を必要とする視覚分析に最適です。","ko":"비전 분석을 위한 고급 PDF 처리 및 변환 기능을 필요로 하는 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis que requieren capacidades avanzadas de procesamiento y conversión de PDF para análisis de visión.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse nécessitant des capacités avancées de traitement et de conversion de PDF pour l''analyse de vision.","de":"Ideal für Analyseagenten, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungs- und Konvertierungsfunktionen für die Bildanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise que exigem processamento e capacidades de conversão de PDF avançadas para análise de visão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа, требующих передовых возможностей обработки и преобразования PDF для анализа зрения.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التحليل التي تتطلب معالجة ومميزات تحويل PDF متقدمة للتحليل البصري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert PDF pages to JPG images using Python scripts, leveraging Ghostscript and QPDF for two-pass downsizing, and supporting DPI settings for screen and OCR outputs.","zh":"使代理能够使用Python脚本将PDF页面转换为JPG图像，利用Ghostscript和QPDF进行两次降采样，并支持DPI设置以实现屏幕和OCR输出。","ja":"Pythonスクリプトを使用してPDFページをJPG画像に変換するエージェントを可能にします。GhostscriptとQPDFを使用して2回のダウンサイジングを行い、画面およびOCR出力のDPI設定をサポートします。","ko":"Python 스크립트를 사용하여 PDF 페이지를 JPG 이미지로 변환할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며 Ghostscript와 QPDF를 사용하여 2차 다운사이징을 수행하고 화면 및 OCR 출력을 위한 DPI 설정을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes convertir páginas de PDF a imágenes JPG utilizando scripts de Python, aprovechando Ghostscript y QPDF para la reducción de tamaño en dos pasos, y admitiendo configuraciones de DPI para salidas de pantalla y OCR.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des pages PDF en images JPG en utilisant des scripts Python, en exploitant Ghostscript et QPDF pour la réduction de taille en deux passes, et en prenant en charge les paramètres de DPI pour les sorties d''écran et OCR.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, PDF-Seiten in JPG-Bilder mithilfe von Python-Skripten umzuwandeln, indem Ghostscript und QPDF für eine zweiphasige Verkleinerung genutzt und DPI-Einstellungen für Bildschirm- und OCR-Ausgaben unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter páginas de PDF em imagens JPG usando scripts Python, aproveitando o Ghostscript e o QPDF para redução de tamanho em duas etapas e suportando configurações de DPI para saídas de tela e OCR.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конвертировать страницы PDF в изображения JPG с помощью скриптов Python, используя Ghostscript и QPDF для двухпасовой уменьшения размера, и поддерживая настройки DPI для экранных и OCR-выходов.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تحويل صفحات PDF إلى صور JPG باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون، وتحقيق ذلك من خلال استخدام Ghostscript و QPDF لتقليص الحجم في مرحلتين، ودعم إعدادات DPI للخروجات الشاشة وOCR."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting PDF documents to JPG images for vision analysis","Automating PDF to JPG conversions with specified DPI settings","Downsizing PDF files using Ghostscript and QPDF for efficient storage"],"zh":["将PDF文档转换为JPG图像以进行视觉分析","使用指定DPI设置自动将PDF转换为JPG","使用Ghostscript和QPDF对PDF文件进行降采样以实现高效存储"],"ja":["視覚分析のためにPDFドキュメントをJPG画像に変換する","指定されたDPI設定でPDFをJPGに自動変換する","GhostscriptとQPDFを使用してPDFファイルをダウンサイジングして効率的なストレージを実現する"],"ko":["비전 분석을 위해 PDF 문서를 JPG 이미지로 변환하는 것","지정된 DPI 설정으로 PDF를 JPG로 자동 변환하는 것","Ghostscript와 QPDF를 사용하여 PDF 파일을 다운사이징하여 효율적인 저장을実現하는 것"],"es":["Conversión de documentos PDF a imágenes JPG para análisis de visión","Automatización de conversión de PDF a JPG con configuraciones de DPI especificadas","Reducción de tamaño de archivos PDF utilizando Ghostscript y QPDF para un almacenamiento eficiente"],"fr":["Conversion de documents PDF en images JPG pour analyse de vision","Automatisation de la conversion de PDF en JPG avec des paramètres de DPI spécifiés","Réduction de taille de fichiers PDF en utilisant Ghostscript et QPDF pour un stockage efficace"],"de":["Konvertierung von PDF-Dokumenten in JPG-Bilder für die Bildanalyse","Automatisierung der Konvertierung von PDF in JPG mit angegebenen DPI-Einstellungen","Verkleinerung von PDF-Dateien mithilfe von Ghostscript und QPDF für effizientes Speichern"],"pt":["Conversão de documentos PDF em imagens JPG para análise de visão","Automação de conversões de PDF para JPG com configurações de DPI especificadas","Redução de tamanho de arquivos PDF usando Ghostscript e QPDF para armazenamento eficiente"],"ru":["Преобразование документов PDF в изображения JPG для анализа зрения","Автоматизация преобразований PDF в JPG с указанными настройками DPI","Уменьшение размера файлов PDF с помощью Ghostscript и QPDF для эффективного хранения"],"ar":["تحويل مستندات PDF إلى صور JPG للتحليل البصري","أتمتة تحويلات PDF إلى JPG مع إعدادات DPI محددة","تقليص حجم ملفات PDF باستخدام Ghostscript و QPDF لتخزين فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Dependent on Ghostscript and QPDF libraries","Specific output directory structure required"],"zh":["需要Python环境","依赖于Ghostscript和QPDF库","需要特定的输出目录结构"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","GhostscriptとQPDFライブラリに依存する","特定の出力ディレクトリ構造が必要"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요","Ghostscript와 QPDF 라이브러리에 의존","특정 출력 디렉토리 구조가 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Dependiente de las bibliotecas Ghostscript y QPDF","Se requiere una estructura de directorio de salida específica"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Dépend des bibliothèques Ghostscript et QPDF","Une structure de répertoire de sortie spécifique est requise"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken Ghostscript und QPDF","Eine spezifische Ausgabeverzeichnisstruktur ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python","Dependente das bibliotecas Ghostscript e QPDF","Estrutura de diretório de saída específica exigida"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Зависит от библиотек Ghostscript и QPDF","Требуется специальная структура выходного каталога"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","يعتمد على مكتبات Ghostscript و QPDF","هيكل دليل إخراج محدد مطلوب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
