 RFC/ADR","Guide pour la prise de décisions techniques","Intégration avec des outils de développement d''IA"],"de":["Erstellung von Projektverfassungen","Änderung von Agentenanweisungsdateien","Pflege von RFC/ADR-Dokumenten","Leitfaden für technische Entscheidungen","Integration mit KI-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Criação de constituições de projeto","Gerenciamento de arquivos de instruções de agente","Criação e validação de documentos de RFC/ADR","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte à tomada de decisões técnicas"],"ru":["Создание конституций проекта","Управление файлами инструкций агента","Создание и проверка документов RFC/ADR","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка принятия технических решений"],"ar":["إنشاء دستورات المشروع","إدارة ملفات تعليمات الوكيل","إنشاء وتحقق وثائق RFC/ADR","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم اتخاذ القرارات الفنية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目治理","项目管理","技术决策","AI代理","RFC/ADR","项目宪法","代理指令文件","正式化技术决策","项目管理效率"],"ja":["プロジェクトガバナンス","プロジェクト管理","技術的決定","AIエージェント","RFC/ADR","プロジェクト憲章","エージェント指令ファイル","技術的決定の正式化","プロジェクト管理の効率化"],"ko":["프로젝트 거버넌스","프로젝트 관리","기술적 결정","AI 에이전트","RFC/ADR","프로젝트 헌장","에이전트 지침 파일","기술적 결정의 공식화","프로젝트 관리의 효율화"],"es":["gobernanza de proyectos","desarrollo de IA","constituciones de proyectos","RFC/ADR","agentes de IA","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["gouvernance de projets","développement d''IA","constitutions de projets","RFC/ADR","agents d''IA","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Projektgovernance","KI-Entwicklung","Projektverfassungen","RFC/ADR","KI-Agenten","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["governança de projeto","desenvolvimento de software","constituições de projeto","arquivos de instruções de agente","documentos de RFC/ADR","tomada de decisões técnicas"],"ru":["управление проектами","разработка программного обеспечения","конституции проекта","файлы инструкций агента","документы RFC/ADR","принятие технических решений"],"ar":["حوكمة المشروع","تطوير البرمجيات","دستورات المشروع","ملفات تعليمات الوكيل","وثائق RFC/ADR","اتخاذ القرارات الفنية"]}},"owner":"goondocks-co","repo":"open-agent-kit","repoPath":"goondocks-co/open-agent-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-governance","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Project Governance\n\nCreate, modify, and maintain project constitutions, agent instruction files, and RFC/ADR documents that guide AI agents and formalize technical decisions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Create a constitution\n\n```bash\n# Analyze the project, then create oak/constitution.md\n# See references/constitution-guide.md for the full process\n```\n\n### Create an RFC\n\n```bash\noak-dev rfc create --title \"Add caching layer\" --template feature\noak-dev rfc list\noak-dev rfc validate oak/rfc/RFC-001-add-","body":"# Project Governance\n\nCreate, modify, and maintain project constitutions, agent instruction files, and RFC/ADR documents that guide AI agents and formalize technical decisions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Create a constitution\n\n```bash\n# Analyze the project, then create oak/constitution.md\n# See references/constitution-guide.md for the full process\n```\n\n### Create an RFC\n\n```bash\noak-dev rfc create --title \"Add caching layer\" --template feature\noak-dev rfc list\noak-dev rfc validate oak/rfc/RFC-001-add-caching-layer.md\n```\n\n### Sync agent instruction files\n\n```bash\noak-dev rules sync-agents          # Sync constitution references to all agent files\noak-dev rules detect-existing      # Discover all configured agent instruction files\n```\n\n## Commands Reference\n\n### Rules commands\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `oak-dev rules sync-agents` | Sync constitution references to all agent instruction files |\n| `oak-dev rules sync-agents --dry-run` | Preview what files will be checked/updated |\n| `oak-dev rules detect-existing` | Discover all configured agent instruction files |\n| `oak-dev rules detect-existing --json` | Machine-readable output of agent files |\n\n### RFC commands\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `oak-dev rfc create --title \"...\" --template <type>` | Create a new RFC |\n| `oak-dev rfc list` | List all RFCs |\n| `oak-dev rfc validate <path>` | Validate RFC structure and content |\n| `oak-dev rfc show <path>` | Show RFC details |\n| `oak-dev rfc adopt <path>` | Mark RFC as adopted |\n| `oak-dev rfc abandon <path> --reason \"...\"` | Mark RFC as abandoned |\n\n## When to Use\n\n- **Creating a new constitution** for a project that doesn''t have one\n- **Adding rules** when you identify patterns that should be standardized\n- **Syncing agent files** after constitution changes\n- **Creating CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, or .cursorrules** for a new project\n- **Proposing a new feature** that needs team review (RFC)\n- **Making architectural decisions** that should be documented (ADR)\n- **Learning context engineering theory** behind effective rule writing -- see `/context-engineering` for the altitude concept, canonical examples, and structured context patterns\n- **Reviewing an RFC** for completeness and technical soundness\n\n## Constitution Structure\n\nA good constitution is **explicit, enforceable, and anchored**:\n\n| Quality | Good | Bad |\n|---------|------|-----|\n| Specificity | \"All API endpoints MUST validate input using Pydantic models\" | \"Use best practices\" |\n| Anchors | \"Copy `src/features/auth/service.py` for new services\" | \"Follow good patterns\" |\n| Non-goals | \"This tool is NOT a CI/CD orchestrator\" | (no boundaries) |\n| Gates | \"`make check` must pass for all changes\" | \"Add tests if needed\" |\n\nRequired sections: Metadata, Scope and Non-Goals, Golden Paths with Anchor Index, Architecture Invariants, No-Magic-Literals, CLI Behavior, Quality Gates. See `references/constitution-guide.md` for the full structure and creation process.\n\n## RFC Templates\n\n| Template | Use For |\n|----------|---------|\n| `feature` | New features, capabilities |\n| `architecture` | System architecture changes |\n| `engineering` | Development practices, tooling |\n| `process` | Team processes, workflows |\n\n## Key Workflows\n\n### Adding a rule to an existing constitution\n\n1. **Read** the current constitution (`oak/constitution.md`)\n2. **Add** the full rule to the appropriate section using RFC 2119 language (MUST, SHOULD, MAY)\n3. **Sync** to all agent files: `oak-dev rules sync-agents`\n\n**CRITICAL:** Rules MUST be added to the constitution FIRST, then synced to agent files. Never add a rule only to an agent file.\n\n### RFC lifecycle\n\n1. **Create**: `oak-dev rfc create --title \"...\" --template feature --author \"Name\"`\n2. **Fill in**: Problem context, proposed solution, trade-offs, alternatives\n3. **Review**: Use the review checklist (see `references/reviewing-rfcs.md`)\n4. **Adopt or abandon**: `oak-dev rfc adopt <path>` or `oak-dev rfc abandon <path> --reason \"...\"`\n\n### RFC review checklist (summary)\n\n- Structure: Clear title, correct status, all required sections\n- Context: Problem clearly stated, \"why now?\" addressed, scope defined\n- Decision: Solution clear, technical approach explained\n- Consequences: Positive/negative outcomes listed, mitigations proposed\n- Alternatives: Other options considered, reasons for rejection explained\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Problem | Fix |\n|--------------|---------|-----|\n| \"Use best practices\" | Not enforceable | Specify the practice |\n| \"When possible\" | Loophole generator | Define when it''s required |\n| No anchors | Agents freestyle | Point to specific files |\n| No non-goals | Scope creep | Explicitly exclude things |\n| \"Add tests if needed\" | Permission to skip | Define coverage requirements |\n| \"Make reasonable assumptions\" | Inconsistent patterns | Say \"ask if uncertain\" |\n\n## Files\n\n- Constitution: `oak/constitution.md` or `.constitution.md`\n- Agent files: Run `oak-dev rules detect-existing` to discover all agent instruction files\n- RFCs: `oak/rfc/RFC-XXX-short-title.md`\n\n## Deep Dives\n\nFor detailed guidance, consult the reference documents:\n\n- **`references/constitution-guide.md`** — Full constitution creation process and structure\n- **`references/constitution-good-example.md`** — Complete example of a well-structured constitution\n- **`references/constitution-bad-example.md`** — Anti-patterns to avoid\n- **`references/agent-files-guide.md`** — Creating and syncing agent instruction files\n- **`references/agent-file-good-example.md`** — Well-structured agent file example\n- **`references/agent-file-bad-example.md`** — Poorly structured agent file example\n- **`references/creating-rfcs.md`** — Detailed RFC creation workflow\n- **`references/reviewing-rfcs.md`** — RFC review checklist and feedback format\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:24:59.313Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Productivity Agents that need to formalize technical decisions and maintain project documentation standards.","zh":"非常适合需要正式化技术决策和维护项目文档标准的开发者生产力代理。","ja":"技術的な意思決定を正式化し、プロジェクトのドキュメントの標準を維持する必要がある開発者生産性エージェントに最適です。","ko":"기술적인 결정의 공식화를 필요로 하며, 프로젝트 문서의 표준을 유지해야 하는 개발자 생산성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Productividad de Desarrolladores que necesitan formalizar decisiones técnicas y mantener los estándares de documentación de proyectos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Productivité des Développeurs qui ont besoin de formaliser les décisions techniques et de maintenir les normes de documentation de projet.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickler-Produktivitätsagenten, die technische Entscheidungen formalisieren und Projekt-Dokumentationsstandards beibehalten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade de Desenvolvedores que precisam formalizar decisões técnicas e manter padrões de documentação de projetos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов производительности разработчиков, которым необходимо формализовать технические решения и поддерживать стандарты документации проектов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إنتاجية المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى تعزيز القرارات الفنية و المحافظة على معايير توثيق المشروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated creation and maintenance of project constitutions, RFCs, and ADRs through CLI tools like oak-dev. Provides structured governance frameworks for technical decision-making and agent instruction standardization.","zh":"通过像 oak-dev 这样的 CLI 工具，实现项目宪章、RFC 和 ADR 的自动化创建和维护。为技术决策和代理指令标准化提供结构化的治理框架。","ja":"oak-dev のような CLI ツールを使用して、プロジェクト憲章、RFC、ADR の自動化された作成と維持を可能にします。技術的な意思決定とエージェントの指示の標準化のための構造化されたガバナンス フレームワークを提供します。","ko":"oak-dev 같은 CLI 도구를 통해 프로젝트 헌장, RFC, ADR의 자동 생성 및 유지 보수를 가능하게 합니다. 기술적 의사 결정 및 에이전트 지침의 표준화를 위한 구조화 된 거버넌스 프레임워크를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la creación y el mantenimiento automatizados de constituciones de proyectos, RFC y ADR a través de herramientas de línea de comandos como oak-dev. Proporciona marcos de gobernanza estructurados para la toma de decisiones técnicas y la estandarización de instrucciones de agentes.","fr":"Permet la création et la maintenance automatisées de constitutions de projets, de documents RFC et d''ADR via des outils de ligne de commande tels que oak-dev. Fournit des cadres de gouvernance structurés pour la prise de décision technique et la normalisation des instructions d''agent.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Erstellung und Wartung von Projektverfassungen, RFCs und ADRs über CLI-Tools wie oak-dev. Bietet strukturierte Governance-Rahmenbedingungen für die technische Entscheidungsfindung und die Standardisierung von Agentenanweisungen.","pt":"Permite a criação e manutenção automatizada de constituições de projeto, RFCs e ADRs por meio de ferramentas de linha de comando como o oak-dev. Fornece estruturas de governança estruturadas para tomada de decisões técnicas e padronização de instruções de agente.","ru":"Позволяет автоматизировать создание и поддержание конституций проектов, RFC и ADR с помощью инструментов командной строки, таких как oak-dev. Предоставляет структурированные рамки управления для принятия технических решений и стандартизации инструкций агента.","ar":"يمكن إنشاء و صيانة دستورات المشروع و وثائق RFC و ADR تلقائيا بواسطة أدوات سطر الأوامر مثل oak-dev. يوفر إطار حوكمة منظم لاتخاذ القرارات الفنية و توحيد تعليمات العميل."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating project constitutions for new repositories","Generating RFC documents for feature proposals","Validating ADR compliance across codebases","Maintaining governance documentation consistency"],"zh":["为新仓库创建项目宪章","为功能提案生成 RFC 文档","在代码库中验证 ADR 合规性","维护治理文档的一致性"],"ja":["新しいリポジトリのプロジェクト憲章の作成","機能提案のためのRFCドキュメントの生成","コードベース全体でのADRのコンプライアンスの検証","ガバナンス ドキュメントの整合性の維持"],"ko":["새로운 저장소용 프로젝트 헌장 생성","기능 제안을 위한 RFC 문서 생성","코드베이스 전반의 ADR 준수 검증","거버넌스 문서 일관성 유지"],"es":["Crear constituciones de proyectos para nuevos repositorios","Generar documentos RFC para propuestas de características","Validar el cumplimiento de ADR en código","Mantener la coherencia de la documentación de gobernanza"],"fr":["Créer des constitutions de projets pour de nouveaux référentiels","Générer des documents RFC pour des propositions de fonctionnalités","Valider la conformité ADR à travers les bases de code","Maintenir la cohérence de la documentation de gouvernance"],"de":["Erstellen von Projektverfassungen für neue Repositorys","Erzeugen von RFC-Dokumenten für Funktionsvorschläge","Überprüfen der ADR-Konformität in Codebasen","Beibehalten der Konsistenz der Governance-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criar constituições de projeto para novos repositórios","Gerar documentos RFC para propostas de recursos","Validar conformidade com ADR em código","Manter consistência da documentação de governança"],"ru":["Создание конституций проекта для новых репозиториев","Генерация документов RFC для предложений функций","Проверка соответствия ADR в коде","Поддержание согласованности документации управления"],"ar":["إنشاء دستورات مشروع لل仓وب الجديدة","توليد وثائق RFC لطرح الميزات","التحقق من مطابقة ADR في الشفرة","الحفاظ على توحيد توثيق الحوكمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access for document operations","Depends on oak-dev CLI tool availability","Needs project analysis capabilities for constitution creation"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限以进行文档操作","依赖 oak-dev CLI 工具的可用性","需要项目分析能力以创建宪章"],"ja":["ドキュメント操作のためのファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","oak-dev CLIツールの可用性に依存","憲章の作成のためのプロジェクト分析機能が必要"],"ko":["문서 작업을 위한 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","oak-dev CLI 도구의 가용성에 의존","헌장 생성을 위한 프로젝트 분석 기능이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para operaciones de documentos","Depende de la disponibilidad de la herramienta de línea de comandos oak-dev","Necesita capacidades de análisis de proyectos para la creación de constituciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour les opérations de documents","Dépend de la disponibilité de l''outil de ligne de commande oak-dev","A besoin de capacités d''analyse de projet pour la création de constitutions"],"de":["Benötigt Dateizugriff für Dokumentenoperationen","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit des oak-dev-CLI-Tools ab","Benötigt Projektanalysefähigkeiten für die Erstellung von Verfassungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos para operações de documento","Depende da disponibilidade da ferramenta oak-dev CLI","Necessita de capacidades de análise de projeto para criação de constituição"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для операций с документами","Зависит от доступности инструмента командной строки oak-dev","Требует возможностей анализа проекта для создания конституции"],"ar":["يتطلب وصول إلى نظام الملفات لعمليات المستند","يعتمد على توافر أداة سطر الأوامر oak-dev","يحتاج إلى قدرات تحليل المشروع لإنشاء الدستور"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
