를 수집하는 데 도움이 되는 도구입니다","es":"El recopilador de logs es una herramienta que ayuda a los desarrolladores a recopilar y analizar logs para identificar y solucionar errores","fr":"Le collecteur de logs est un outil qui aide les développeurs à collecter et à analyser les logs pour identifier et résoudre les erreurs","de":"Der Log-Sammler ist ein Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, Logs zu sammeln und zu analysieren, um Fehler zu identifizieren und zu beheben","pt":"O coletor de logs é uma ferramenta que ajuda a coletar e analisar logs para identificar problemas em seu código","ru":"Сборщик логов - это инструмент, который помогает собирать и анализировать логи для выявления проблем в вашем коде","ar":"مجمع السجلات هو أداة تساعد في جمع وتحليل السجلات لتحديد المشكلات في кодك","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["收集和分析日志","解决难以复现的错误","提供错误报告和建议","支持多种日志格式","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["ログの収集と分析","エラーの解決","エラー報告と提案","多種のログ形式をサポート","使用と統合が容易"],"ko":["로그 수집과 분석","오류 해결","오류 보고와 제안","다양한 로그 형식을 지원","사용과 통합이 쉬움"],"es":["Recopilación de logs y evidencia","Análisis de errores y comportamientos extraños","Captura de contexto: OS, versión Python, modo de ejecución","Redacción de informes cortos con evidencia y próximas hipótesis","Identificación de errores difíciles de reproducir"],"fr":["Collecte de logs et de preuves","Analyse d''erreurs et de comportements étranges","Captura de contexte : OS, version Python, mode d''exécution","Rédaction de rapports courts avec preuves et prochaines hypothèses","Identification d''erreurs difficiles à reproduire"],"de":["Sammeln von Logs und Beweisen","Analyse von Fehlern und ungewöhnlichen Verhaltensweisen","Ergebnis des Kontexts: OS, Python-Version, Ausführungsmodus","Erstellung von Kurzberichten mit Beweisen und nächsten Hypothesen","Identifizierung von schwer zu reproduzierenden Fehlern"],"pt":["Coleta de logs e evidências","Análise de erros e comportamentos estranhos","Captura de contexto de execução","Redação de relatórios com evidências e hipóteses","Identificação de problemas difíceis de reproduzir"],"ru":["Сбор логов и доказательств","Анализ ошибок и необычного поведения","Захват контекста выполнения","Создание отчетов с доказательствами и гипотезами","Выявление трудно воспроизводимых проблем"],"ar":["جمع السجلات والادلة","تحليل الأخطاء والسلوك الغير عادي","التقاط سياق التنفيذ","كتابة تقارير مع الأدلة والفرضيات","تحديد المشكلات الصعبة الإعادة إنتاجها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["日志收集器","日志分析","错误解决","开发者工具","日志管理","错误报告"],"ja":["ログ収集ツール","ログ分析","エラー解決","開発者ツール","ログ管理","エラー報告"],"ko":["로그 수집기","로그 분석","오류 해결","개발자 도구","로그 관리","오류 보고"],"es":["recopilador de logs","herramienta de desarrollo","análisis de errores","identificación de errores","desarrollo de software","depuración de código"],"fr":["collecteur de logs","outil de développement","analyse d''erreurs","identification d''erreurs","développement de logiciels","débogage de code"],"de":["Log-Sammler","Entwicklungstool","Fehleranalyse","Fehleridentifizierung","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Debugging"],"pt":["coletor de logs","depuração","análise de erros","comportamento estranho","relatórios de erro","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["сборщик логов","отладка","анализ ошибок","необычное поведение","отчеты об ошибках","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مجمع السجلات","فحص أخطاء","تحليل الأخطاء","سلوك غير عادي","تقارير الأخطاء","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"AlbanoArranz","repo":"Traductor-Documentacion-Tecnica","repoPath":"AlbanoArranz/Traductor-Documentacion-Tecnica","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"log-collector","description":"Recopila evidencia (logs, pasos de repro, versiones) para diagnosticar un fallo sin inventar causas. Úsese cuando el usuario mencione error, traceback, crash, logs, no funciona, o fallos en build/export.","bodyPreview":"# Recopilar logs y evidencia\n\n## Cuándo usar esta skill\n- Cuando haya un fallo difícil de reproducir.\n- Cuando el usuario comparta un error/traceback o un comportamiento extraño.\n\n## Flujo de trabajo\n- [ ] Pedir pasos para reproducir (mínimos).\n- [ ] Pedir el error exacto (traceback/logs).\n- [ ] Capturar contexto: OS, versión Python, modo de ejecución (dev/exe).\n- [ ] Redactar un reporte corto con evidencia y próximas hipótesis.\n\n## Instrucciones\n1. Pide inputs (sin mezclar):\n   - Pasos para rep","body":"# Recopilar logs y evidencia\n\n## Cuándo usar esta skill\n- Cuando haya un fallo difícil de reproducir.\n- Cuando el usuario comparta un error/traceback o un comportamiento extraño.\n\n## Flujo de trabajo\n- [ ] Pedir pasos para reproducir (mínimos).\n- [ ] Pedir el error exacto (traceback/logs).\n- [ ] Capturar contexto: OS, versión Python, modo de ejecución (dev/exe).\n- [ ] Redactar un reporte corto con evidencia y próximas hipótesis.\n\n## Instrucciones\n1. Pide inputs (sin mezclar):\n   - Pasos para reproducir.\n   - Error/traceback completo.\n   - Qué comando se ejecutó.\n2. Normaliza el reporte:\n   - **Repro**: pasos enumerados.\n   - **Observed**: qué pasa.\n   - **Expected**: qué debería pasar.\n   - **Logs**: error exacto.\n   - **Environment**: OS/Python.\n3. Si hace falta ejecutar comandos para recoger info, pedir confirmación explícita.\n\n## Restricciones\n- No inventar causas.\n- No pedir datos sensibles.\n- No ejecutar comandos sin confirmación.\n\n## Recursos\n- Checklist: `resources/checklist.md`\n- Test plan: `test_plan.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:25:30.358Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Debugging Agents requiring efficient log collection and error analysis capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效日志收集和错误分析能力的调试代理。","ja":"デバッグエージェントが効率的なログ収集およびエラー分析機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"효율적인 로그 수집 및 오류 분석 기능이 필요한 디버깅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de depuración que requieren una recolección de registros eficiente y capacidades de análisis de errores.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de débogage nécessitant une collecte de journaux efficace et des capacités d''analyse d''erreurs.","de":"Ideal für Debugging-Agents, die eine effiziente Protokollsammlung und Fehleranalysefunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Depuração que exigem coleta eficiente de logs e capacidades de análise de erros.","ru":"Идеально для агентов отладки, требующих эффективного сбора журналов и возможностей анализа ошибок.","ar":"مثالي لعميل فحص الأخطاء الذي يتطلب جمع سجلات فعال وخصائص تحليل الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture and analyze logs, tracebacks, and execution context, including OS, Python version, and execution mode, to expedite issue resolution using protocols like traceback and log analysis.","zh":"赋予代理捕获和分析日志、回溯和执行上下文的能力，包括操作系统、Python版本和执行模式，以使用回溯和日志分析等协议加速问题解决。","ja":"エージェントにログ、トレースバック、実行コンテキストをキャプチャして分析する能力を付与し、OS、Pythonバージョン、実行モードなどを含むトレースバックやログ分析などのプロトコルを使用して問題解決を迅速化します。","ko":"에이전트에 로그, 추적 및 실행 컨텍스트를 캡처하고 분석하는 능력을 부여하여 OS, Python 버전, 실행 모드 등을 포함한 추적 및 로그 분석과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 문제 해결을 가속화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes capturar y analizar registros, seguimientos y contexto de ejecución, incluyendo SO, versión de Python y modo de ejecución, para agilizar la resolución de problemas utilizando protocolos como seguimiento y análisis de registros.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer et d''analyser les journaux, les traces et le contexte d''exécution, y compris le système d''exploitation, la version de Python et le mode d''exécution, pour accélérer la résolution des problèmes en utilisant des protocoles tels que la trace et l''analyse des journaux.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Protokolle, Rückverfolgungen und Ausführungskontext zu erfassen und zu analysieren, einschließlich Betriebssystem, Python-Version und Ausführungsmodus, um die Problembehandlung mithilfe von Protokollen wie Rückverfolgung und Protokollanalyse zu beschleunigen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar e analisar logs, rastros de erro e contexto de execução, incluindo SO, versão do Python e modo de execução, para agilizar a resolução de problemas usando protocolos como rastros de erro e análise de logs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватить и проанализировать журналы, трассировки ошибок и контекст выполнения, включая ОС, версию Python и режим выполнения, чтобы ускорить решение проблем с помощью протоколов, таких как трассировка ошибок и анализ журналов.","ar":"تمكين العميل من التقاط وتحليل السجلات وأثر الأخطاء وسياق التنفيذ، بما في ذلك نظام التشغيل وإصدار بايثون ووضع التنفيذ، لتسريع حل المشكلات باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل أثر الأخطاء وتحليل السجلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging difficult-to-reproduce failures","Analyzing error reports and tracebacks","Gathering execution context for issue reproduction"],"zh":["调试难以重现的故障","分析错误报告和回溯","收集问题重现的执行上下文"],"ja":["再現困難な障害のデバッグ","エラーレポートとトレースバックの分析","問題の再現のために実行コンテキストを収集"],"ko":["재현하기 어려운 오류의 디버깅","오류 보고서 및 추적의 분석","문제 재현을 위한 실행 컨텍스트 수집"],"es":["Depuración de fallos difíciles de reproducir","Análisis de informes de errores y seguimientos","Recopilación de contexto de ejecución para la reproducción de problemas"],"fr":["Débogage des défaillances difficiles à reproduire","Analyse des rapports d''erreurs et des traces","Collecte du contexte d''exécution pour la reproduction des problèmes"],"de":["Debugging von schwer zu reproduzierenden Fehlern","Analyse von Fehlerberichten und Rückverfolgungen","Sammeln von Ausführungskontext für die Wiedergabe von Problemen"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas difíceis de reproduzir","Análise de relatórios de erros e rastros de erro","Coleta de contexto de execução para reprodução de problemas"],"ru":["Отладка трудно воспроизводимых сбоев","Анализ отчетов об ошибках и трассировок ошибок","Сбор контекста выполнения для воспроизведения проблем"],"ar":["فحص الأخطاء الصعبة في الإعادة","تحليل تقارير الأخطاء وأثر الأخطاء","جمع سياق التنفيذ لإعادة إنتاج المشكلات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for reproduction steps and error details","Limited to Python-based execution contexts"],"zh":["需要用户输入以重现步骤和错误详细信息","仅限于基于Python的执行上下文"],"ja":["再現手順とエラー詳細の入力をユーザーに必要とする","Pythonベースの実行コンテキストに限定"],"ko":["재현 단계 및 오류 세부 정보를 입력하기 위해 사용자 입력이 필요","Python 기반의 실행 컨텍스트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la entrada del usuario para los pasos de reproducción y los detalles de los errores","Limitado a contextos de ejecución basados en Python"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour les étapes de reproduction et les détails des erreurs","Limité aux contextes d''exécution basés sur Python"],"de":["Benutzereingabe für die Reproduktionsschritte und die Fehlerdetails erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Python-basierte Ausführungskontexte"],"pt":["Exige entrada do usuário para etapas de reprodução e detalhes de erros","Limitado a contextos de execução baseados em Python"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для шагов воспроизведения и деталей ошибок","Ограничен контекстами выполнения на основе Python"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم للخطوات الإعادة وإدخال تفاصيل الأخطاء","محدود سياقات التنفيذ التي تعتمد على بايثون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('DeanMojo/polysmith-mvp/polymarket', 'community', 'DeanMojo', 'polysmith-mvp', 'DeanMojo/polysmith-mvp', 'polymarket', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z', '2026-02-18T12:25:36.490Z', NULL, '{"id":"DeanMojo/polysmith-mvp/polymarket","name":"polymarket","description":{"zh":"Polymarket开发技能，为开发者提供全面支持，涵盖API、交易和市场数据","ja":"Polymarket開発スキルは、開発者に全面的なサポートを提供し、API、取引、市場データをカバーする","ko":"Polymarket 개발 스킬은 개발자에게 완전한 지원을 제공하며, API, 거래, 시장 데이터를 포함한다","es":"Polymarket es una plataforma de mercados de predicción que ofrece una API para el acceso a datos de mercado y trading","fr":"Polymarket est une plateforme de marchés de prédiction qui propose une API pour l''accès aux données de marché et au trading","de":"Polymarket ist eine Plattform für Vorhersagemärkte, die eine API für den Zugriff auf Marktdaten und Trading bietet","pt":"O Polymarket é uma plataforma de mercados de previsão que oferece API e serviços para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a usar esses recursos para construir aplicações personalizadas.","ru":"Polymarket — это платформа прогнозных рынков, предлагающая API и сервисы для разработчиков. Узнайте, как использовать эти ресурсы для создания индивидуальных приложений.","ar":"Polymarket هو منصة لأسواق التنبؤ التي توفر API وخدمات للمطورين. تعلم كيفية استخدام هذه الموارد لبناء تطبيقات مخصصة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Polymarket开发技能","ja":"Polymarket開発スキル","ko":"Polymarket 개발 스킬","es":"Desarrollo de Polymarket: API y trading","fr":"Développement Polymarket: API et trading","de":"Polymarket-Entwicklung: API und Trading","pt":"Desenvolvimento Polymarket: API e Plataforma","ru":"Разработка на Polymarket: API и платформа","ar":"تطوير Polymarket: API ومنصة","en":"polymarket"},"description":{"zh":"Polymarket开发技能，为开发者提供全面支持，涵盖API、交易和市场数据","ja":"Polymarket開発スキルは、開発者に全面的なサポートを提供し、API、取引、市場データをカバーする","ko":"Polymarket 개발 스킬은 개발자에게 완전한 지원을 제공하며, API, 거래, 시장 데이터를 포함한다","es":"Polymarket es una plataforma de mercados de predicción que ofrece una API para el acceso a datos de mercado y trading","fr":"Polymarket est une plateforme de marchés de prédiction qui propose une API pour l''accès aux données de marché et au trading","de":"Polymarket ist eine Plattform für Vorhersagemärkte, die eine API für den Zugriff auf Marktdaten und Trading bietet","pt":"O Polymarket é uma plataforma de mercados de previsão que oferece API e serviços para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a usar esses recursos para construir aplicaçõe...","ru":"Polymarket — это платформа прогнозных рынков, предлагающая API и сервисы для разработчиков. Узнайте, как использовать эти ресурсы для создания индивидуальных...","ar":"Polymarket هو منصة لأسواق التنبؤ التي توفر API وخدمات للمطورين. تعلم كيفية استخدام هذه الموارد لبناء تطبيقات مخصصة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持Polymarket API","提供交易功能","包含市场数据","支持WebSocket订阅","提供实时数据流","支持构建应用程序"],"ja":["Polymarket APIのサポート","取引機能の提供","市場データの包含","WebSocketサブスクリプションのサポート","リアルタイムデータストリームの提供","アプリケーションの構築のサポート"],"ko":["Polymarket API 지원","거래 기능 제공","시장 데이터 포함","WebSocket 구독 지원","실시간 데이터 스트림 제공","애플리케이션 구축 지원"],"es":["Acceso a la API de Polymarket","Trading y gestión de órdenes","Datos de mercado en tiempo real","Implementación de estrategias de trading","Desarrollo de aplicaciones personalizadas"],"fr":["Accès à l''API Polymarket","Trading et gestion des ordres","Données de marché en temps réel","Mise en œuvre de stratégies de trading","Développement d''applications personnalisées"],"de":["Zugriff auf die Polymarket-API","Trading und Auftragsverwaltung","Echtzeit-Marktdaten","Implementierung von Trading-Strategien","Entwicklung von individuellen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Acesso à API de mercados de previsão","Uso de serviços de transmissão de dados em tempo real","Desenvolvimento de estratégias de negociação","Criação de aplicações personalizadas com serviços Polymarket","Integração com WebSocket para atualizações em tempo real"],"ru":["Доступ к API прогнозных рынков","Использование сервисов потоковой передачи данных в реальном времени","Разработка торговых стратегий","Создание индивидуальных приложений с сервисами Polymarket","Интеграция с WebSocket для обновлений в реальном времени"],"ar":[" الوصول إلى API لأسواق التنبؤ","استخدام خدمات بث البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","تطوير استراتيجيات التداول","إنشاء تطبيقات مخصصة مع خدمات Polymarket","التكامل مع WebSocket لتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Polymarket开发","Polymarket API","交易","市场数据","WebSocket","实时数据流","应用程序构建"],"ja":["Polymarket開発","Polymarket API","取引","市場データ","WebSocket","リアルタイムデータストリーム","アプリケーションの構築"],"ko":["Polymarket 개발","Polymarket API","거래","시장 데이터","WebSocket","실시간 데이터 스트림","애플리케이션 구축"],"es":["Polymarket","desarrollo de aplicaciones","API de mercados de predicción","trading y datos de mercado","estrategias de trading","análisis de datos de mercado"],"fr":["Polymarket","développement d''applications","API de marchés de prédiction","trading et données de marché","stratégies de trading","analyse de données de marché"],"de":["Polymarket","Anwendungsentwicklung","API für Vorhersagemärkte","Trading und Marktdaten","Trading-Strategien","Marktdatenanalyse"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento Polymarket","API de mercados de previsão","Transmissão de dados em tempo real","Estratégias de negociação","Aplicações personalizadas","Integração WebSocket"],"ru":["Разработка на Polymarket","API прогнозных рынков","Потоковая передача данных в реальном времени","Торговые стратегии","Индивидуальные приложения","Интеграция WebSocket"],"ar":["تطوير Polymarket","API لأسواق التنبؤ","بث البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","استراتيجيات التداول","تطبيقات مخصصة","التكامل مع WebSocket"]}},"owner":"DeanMojo","repo":"polysmith-mvp","repoPath":"DeanMojo/polysmith-mvp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"polymarket","description":"Comprehensive Polymarket skill covering prediction markets, API, trading, market data, and real-time WebSocket data streaming. Build applications with Polymarket services, monitor live trades, and integrate market predictions.","bodyPreview":"# Polymarket Comprehensive Skill\n\nComplete assistance with Polymarket development - covering the full platform (API, trading, market data) and the real-time data streaming client (WebSocket subscriptions for live market activity).\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill should be triggered when:\n\n**Platform & API:**\n- Working with Polymarket prediction markets\n- Using Polymarket API for market data\n- Implementing trading strategies\n- Building applications with Polymarket services\n- Learning Polym","body":"# Polymarket Comprehensive Skill\n\nComplete assistance with Polymarket development - covering the full platform (API, trading, market data) and the real-time data streaming client (WebSocket subscriptions for live market activity).\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill should be triggered when:\n\n**Platform & API:**\n- Working with Polymarket prediction markets\n- Using Polymarket API for market data\n- Implementing trading strategies\n- Building applications with Polymarket services\n- Learning Polymarket best practices\n\n**Real-Time Data Streaming:**\n- Connecting to Polymarket''s WebSocket service\n- Building prediction market monitoring tools\n- Processing live trades, orders, and market updates\n- Monitoring market comments and social reactions\n- Tracking RFQ (Request for Quote) activity\n- Integrating crypto price feeds\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Real-Time Data Client Setup\n\n**Installation:**\n```bash\nnpm install @polymarket/real-time-data-client\n```\n\n**Basic Usage:**\n```typescript\nimport { RealTimeDataClient } from \"@polymarket/real-time-data-client\";\n\nconst onMessage = (message: Message): void => {\n    console.log(message.topic, message.type, message.payload);\n};\n\nconst onConnect = (client: RealTimeDataClient): void => {\n    client.subscribe({\n        subscriptions: [{\n            topic: \"activity\",\n            type: \"trades\"\n        }]\n    });\n};\n\nnew RealTimeDataClient({ onMessage, onConnect }).connect();\n```\n\n### Supported WebSocket Topics\n\n**1. Activity (`activity`)**\n- `trades` - Completed trades\n- `orders_matched` - Order matching events\n- Filters: `{\"event_slug\":\"string\"}` OR `{\"market_slug\":\"string\"}`\n\n**2. Comments (`comments`)**\n- `comment_created`, `comment_removed`\n- `reaction_created`, `reaction_removed`\n- Filters: `{\"parentEntityID\":number,\"parentEntityType\":\"Event\"}`\n\n**3. RFQ (`rfq`)**\n- Request/Quote lifecycle events\n- No filters, no auth required\n\n**4. Crypto Prices (`crypto_prices`, `crypto_prices_chainlink`)**\n- `update` - Real-time price feeds\n- Filters: `{\"symbol\":\"BTC\"}` (optional)\n\n**5. CLOB User (`clob_user`)** ⚠️ Requires Auth\n- `order` - User''s order updates\n- `trade` - User''s trade executions\n\n**6. CLOB Market (`clob_market`)**\n- `price_change` - Price movements\n- `agg_orderbook` - Aggregated order book\n- `last_trade_price` - Latest prices\n- `market_created`, `market_resolved`\n\n### Authentication for User Data\n\n```typescript\nclient.subscribe({\n    subscriptions: [{\n        topic: \"clob_user\",\n        type: \"*\",\n        clob_auth: {\n            key: \"your-api-key\",\n            secret: \"your-api-secret\",\n            passphrase: \"your-passphrase\"\n        }\n    }]\n});\n```\n\n### Common Use Cases\n\n**Monitor Specific Market:**\n```typescript\nclient.subscribe({\n    subscriptions: [{\n        topic: \"activity\",\n        type: \"trades\",\n        filters: `{\"market_slug\":\"btc-above-100k-2024\"}`\n    }]\n});\n```\n\n**Track Multiple Markets:**\n```typescript\nclient.subscribe({\n    subscriptions: [{\n        topic: \"clob_market\",\n        type: \"price_change\",\n        filters: `[\"100\",\"101\",\"102\"]`\n    }]\n});\n```\n\n**Monitor Event Comments:**\n```typescript\nclient.subscribe({\n    subscriptions: [{\n        topic: \"comments\",\n        type: \"*\",\n        filters: `{\"parentEntityID\":12345,\"parentEntityType\":\"Event\"}`\n    }]\n});\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\nThis skill includes comprehensive documentation in `references/`:\n\n**Platform Documentation:**\n- **api.md** - Polymarket API documentation\n- **getting_started.md** - Getting started guide\n- **guides.md** - Development guides\n- **learn.md** - Learning resources\n- **trading.md** - Trading documentation\n- **other.md** - Additional resources\n\n**Real-Time Client:**\n- **README.md** - WebSocket client API and examples\n- **llms.md** - LLM integration guide\n- **llms-full.md** - Complete LLM documentation\n\nUse `view` to read specific reference files for detailed information.\n\n## Key Features\n\n**Platform Capabilities:**\n✅ Prediction market creation and resolution\n✅ Trading API (REST & WebSocket)\n✅ Market data queries\n✅ User portfolio management\n✅ Event and market discovery\n\n**Real-Time Streaming:**\n✅ WebSocket-based persistent connections\n✅ Topic-based subscriptions\n✅ Dynamic subscription management\n✅ Filter support for targeted data\n✅ User authentication for private data\n✅ TypeScript with full type safety\n✅ Initial data dumps on connection\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### WebSocket Connection Management\n- Use `onConnect` callback for subscriptions\n- Implement reconnection logic for production\n- Clean up with `disconnect()` when done\n- Handle authentication errors gracefully\n\n### Subscription Strategy\n- Use wildcards (`\"*\"`) sparingly\n- Apply filters to reduce data volume\n- Unsubscribe from unused streams\n- Process messages asynchronously\n\n### Performance\n- Consider batching high-frequency data\n- Use filters to minimize client processing\n- Validate message payloads before use\n\n## Requirements\n\n- **Node.js**: 14+ recommended\n- **TypeScript**: Optional but recommended\n- **Package Manager**: npm or yarn\n\n## Resources\n\n### Official Links\n- **Polymarket Platform**: https://polymarket.com\n- **Real-Time Client Repo**: https://github.com/Polymarket/real-time-data-client\n- **API Documentation**: See references/api.md\n\n### Working with This Skill\n\n**For Beginners:**\nStart with `getting_started.md` for foundational concepts.\n\n**For API Integration:**\nUse `api.md` and `trading.md` for REST API details.\n\n**For Real-Time Data:**\nUse `README.md` for WebSocket client implementation.\n\n**For LLM Integration:**\nUse `llms.md` and `llms-full.md` for AI/ML use cases.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Real-Time Client is TypeScript/JavaScript (not Python)\n- Some WebSocket topics require authentication\n- Use filters to manage message volume effectively\n- All timestamps are Unix timestamps\n- Market IDs are strings (e.g., \"100\", \"101\")\n- Platform documentation covers both REST API and WebSocket usage\n\n---\n\n**This comprehensive skill combines Polymarket platform expertise with real-time data streaming capabilities!**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:25:36.490Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Financial Analysis Agents requiring real-time market data and API integration with Polymarket prediction markets.","zh":"适合需要实时市场数据和与Polymarket预测市场API集成的金融分析代理。","ja":"ポリーマーケットの予測市場とAPIの統合およびリアルタイムの市場データを必要とする金融分析エージェントに最適。","ko":"실시간 시장 데이터 및 폴리마켓 예측 시장의 API 통합이 필요한 금융 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis financiero que requieren datos de mercado en tiempo real y integración de API con los mercados de predicción de Polymarket.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse financière nécessitant des données de marché en temps réel et une intégration d''API avec les marchés de prédiction de Polymarket.","de":"Ideal für Finanzanalyseagenten, die Echtzeit-Marktdaten und API-Integration mit den Vorhersagemärkten von Polymarket erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise Financeira que requerem dados de mercado em tempo real e integração de API com mercados de previsão da Polymarket.","ru":"Идеально для финансовых аналитических агентов, требующих данных рынка в режиме реального времени и интеграции API с предиктивными рынками Polymarket.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل مالي يحتاج إلى بيانات سوق في الوقت الفعلي وتكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع أسواق التنبؤ في Polymarket."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to tap into Polymarket''s API for market data, implement trading strategies, and build applications with real-time data streaming via WebSocket subscriptions, leveraging Polymarket services for predictive analytics and decision-making.","zh":"赋予代理访问Polymarket的API以获取市场数据、实施交易策略、并通过WebSocket订阅构建具有实时数据流的应用，利用Polymarket服务进行预测分析和决策。","ja":"ポリーマーケットのAPIにアクセスして市場データを取得し、取引戦略を実装し、WebSocketサブスクリプションによるリアルタイムデータストリーミングでアプリケーションを構築し、予測分析および意思決定のためにポリーマーケットサービスを活用できるようにエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"폴리마켓의 API에 접근하여 시장 데이터를 얻고, 거래 전략을 구현하고, WebSocket 구독을 통한 실시간 데이터 스트리밍으로 애플리케이션을 구축하며, 예측 분석 및 의사 결정 için 폴리마켓 서비스를 활용할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar la API de Polymarket para obtener datos de mercado, implementar estrategias de trading y construir aplicaciones con transmisión de datos en tiempo real a través de suscripciones WebSocket, aprovechando los servicios de Polymarket para análisis predictivos y toma de decisiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti de l''API de Polymarket pour les données de marché, de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de trading et de construire des applications avec un flux de données en temps réel via des abonnements WebSocket, en exploitant les services de Polymarket pour l''analyse prédictive et la prise de décision.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, auf die Polymarket-API für Marktdaten zuzugreifen, Handelsstrategien umzusetzen und Anwendungen mit Echtzeit-Datenübertragung über WebSocket-Abonnements zu erstellen, indem die Dienste von Polymarket für Vorhersageanalysen und Entscheidungsfindung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a utilizar a API da Polymarket para dados de mercado, implementar estratégias de negociação e construir aplicações com transmissão de dados em tempo real via assinaturas WebSocket, aproveitando os serviços da Polymarket para análise preditiva e tomada de decisões.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать API Polymarket для получения рыночных данных, реализации торговых стратегий и создания приложений с потоковой передачей данных в режиме реального времени через подписки WebSocket, используя услуги Polymarket для прогностического анализа и принятия решений.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من Polymarket للحصول على بيانات السوق وتنفيذ استراتيجيات التداول وبناء التطبيقات ببث البيانات في الوقت الفعلي عبر اشتراكات WebSocket، واستخدام خدمات Polymarket للتحليل التنبؤي و اتخاذ القرارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing algorithmic trading strategies using Polymarket API","Building real-time market data visualizations with WebSocket subscriptions","Developing predictive models with Polymarket''s market data and services"],"zh":["使用Polymarket API实施算法交易策略","使用WebSocket订阅构建实时市场数据可视化","使用Polymarket的市场数据和服务开发预测模型"],"ja":["ポリーマーケットAPIを使用してアルゴリズム取引戦略を実装する","WebSocketサブスクリプションを使用してリアルタイムの市場データ視覚化を構築する","ポリーマーケットの市場データおよびサービスを使用して予測モデルを開発する"],"ko":["폴리마켓 API를 사용하여 알고리즘 거래 전략을 구현하는 것","WebSocket 구독을 사용하여 실시간 시장 데이터 시각화를 구축하는 것","폴리마켓의 시장 데이터 및 서비스를 사용하여 예측 모델을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Implementación de estrategias de trading algorítmico utilizando la API de Polymarket","Creación de visualizaciones de datos de mercado en tiempo real con suscripciones WebSocket","Desarrollo de modelos predictivos con los datos de mercado y servicios de Polymarket"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de stratégies de trading algorithmique à l''aide de l''API de Polymarket","Création de visualisations de données de marché en temps réel avec des abonnements WebSocket","Développement de modèles prédictifs avec les données de marché et les services de Polymarket"],"de":["Implementierung von algorithmischen Handelsstrategien unter Verwendung der Polymarket-API","Erstellung von Echtzeit-Marktdaten-Visualisierungen mit WebSocket-Abonnements","Entwicklung von Vorhersagemodellen mit den Marktdaten und Diensten von Polymarket"],"pt":["Implementação de estratégias de negociação algorítmica usando a API da Polymarket","Construção de visualizações de dados de mercado em tempo real com assinaturas WebSocket","Desenvolvimento de modelos preditivos com dados de mercado e serviços da Polymarket"],"ru":["Реализация алгоритмических торговых стратегий с использованием API Polymarket","Создание визуализаций рыночных данных в режиме реального времени с помощью подписок WebSocket","Разработка предиктивных моделей с использованием рыночных данных и услуг Polymarket"],"ar":["تنفيذ استراتيجيات التداول الخوارزمية باستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من Polymarket","بناء مرئيات بيانات السوق في الوقت الفعلي مع اشتراكات WebSocket","تطوير نماذج تنبؤية مع بيانات السوق وخدمات Polymarket"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Polymarket API access","Limited to Polymarket prediction markets and services"],"zh":["需要Polymarket API访问","仅限Polymarket预测市场和服务"],"ja":["ポリーマーケットAPIへのアクセスが必要","ポリーマーケットの予測市場およびサービスに限定"],"ko":["폴리마켓 API 접근이 필요","폴리마켓 예측 시장 및 서비스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de Polymarket","Limitado a los mercados y servicios de predicción de Polymarket"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API de Polymarket","Limité aux marchés et services de prédiction de Polymarket"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Polymarket-API","Begrenzt auf die Vorhersagemärkte und -dienste von Polymarket"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API da Polymarket","Limitado aos mercados de previsão e serviços da Polymarket"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API Polymarket","Ограничен предиктивными рынками и услугами Polymarket"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من Polymarket","محدود بالأسواق التنبؤية وخدمات Polymarket"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('uxname/litefront/openspec-explore', 'community', 'uxname', 'litefront', 'uxname/litefront', 'openspec-explore', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z', '2026-02-18T12:25:15.280Z', NULL, '{"id":"uxname/litefront/openspec-explore","name":"openspec-explore","description":{"zh":"openspec-explore是一个Vite + GraphQL + Typescript前端模板，使用Feature-Sliced Design作为项目架构方法","ja":"openspec-exploreは、Feature-Sliced Designを使用したVite + GraphQL + Typescriptフロントエンドボイラープレートです","ko":"openspec-explore는 Feature-Sliced Design를 사용한 Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 프론트엔드 보일러플레이트입니다","es":"openspec-explore es una plantilla de frontend que combina Vite, GraphQL y Typescript con Feature-Sliced Design","fr":"openspec-explore est un modèle de frontend qui combine Vite, GraphQL et Typescript avec Feature-Sliced Design","de":"openspec-explore ist ein Frontend-Boilerplate, das Vite, GraphQL und Typescript mit Feature-Sliced Design kombiniert","pt":"O openspec-explore é um boilerplate frontend com Vite, GraphQL e Typescript, projetado com a metodologia de arquitetura de projeto Feature-Sliced Design","ru":"Openspec-explore - это фронтенд-боилерплейт с Vite, GraphQL и Typescript, разработанный с использованием методологии проектной архитектуры Feature-Sliced Design","ar":"openspec-explore هو قالب أمامي مع Vite و GraphQL و Typescript، مصمم باستخدام منهجية تصميم ميزة مقطعة للهندسة المعمارية للمشروع","en":"A Vite + GraphQL + Typescript frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-explore：Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 前端模板","ja":"openspec-explore：Vite + GraphQL + Typescript フロントエンドボイラープレート","ko":"openspec-explore：Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 프론트엔드 보일러플레이트","es":"Plantilla de frontend con Vite, GraphQL y Typescript","fr":"Modèle de frontend avec Vite, GraphQL et Typescript","de":"Frontend-Boilerplate mit Vite, GraphQL und Typescript","pt":"openspec-explore: Boilerplate Frontend com Vite + GraphQL...","ru":"openspec-explore: Фронтенд-боилерплейт с Vite + GraphQL +...","ar":"openspec-explore: قالب أمامي مع Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","en":"openspec-explore"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-explore是一个Vite + GraphQL + Typescript前端模板，使用Feature-Sliced Design作为项目架构方法","ja":"openspec-exploreは、Feature-Sliced Designを使用したVite + GraphQL + Typescriptフロントエンドボイラープレートです","ko":"openspec-explore는 Feature-Sliced Design를 사용한 Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 프론트엔드 보일러플레이트입니다","es":"openspec-explore es una plantilla de frontend que combina Vite, GraphQL y Typescript con Feature-Sliced Design","fr":"openspec-explore est un modèle de frontend qui combine Vite, GraphQL et Typescript avec Feature-Sliced Design","de":"openspec-explore ist ein Frontend-Boilerplate, das Vite, GraphQL und Typescript mit Feature-Sliced Design kombiniert","pt":"O openspec-explore é um boilerplate frontend com Vite, GraphQL e Typescript, projetado com a metodologia de arquitetura de projeto Feature-Sliced Design","ru":"Openspec-explore - это фронтенд-боилерплейт с Vite, GraphQL и Typescript, разработанный с использованием методологии проектной архитектуры Feature-Sliced Design","ar":"openspec-explore هو قالب أمامي مع Vite و GraphQL و Typescript، مصمم باستخدام منهجية تصميم ميزة مقطعة للهندسة المعمارية للمشروع","en":"A Vite + GraphQL + Typescript frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"definition":{"en":"A Vite + GraphQL + Typescript frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"features":{"zh":["使用Vite作为构建工具","支持GraphQL查询","使用Typescript作为编程语言","采用Feature-Sliced Design作为项目架构方法","支持创建OpenSpec文档"],"ja":["Viteをビルドツールとして使用","GraphQLクエリをサポート","Typescriptをプログラミング言語として使用","Feature-Sliced Designをプロジェクトアーキテクチャ方法として採用","OpenSpecドキュメントの作成をサポート"],"ko":["Vite를 빌드 도구로 사용","GraphQL 쿼리를 지원","Typescript를 프로그래밍 언어로 사용","Feature-Sliced Design를 프로젝트 아키텍처 방법으로 채택","OpenSpec 문서의 생성을 지원"],"es":["Plantilla de frontend con Vite","Integración con GraphQL","Soporte para Typescript","Arquitectura Feature-Sliced Design","Creación de artefactos OpenSpec","Modo de exploración para diseño y planificación"],"fr":["Modèle de frontend avec Vite","Intégration avec GraphQL","Prise en charge de Typescript","Architecture Feature-Sliced Design","Création d''artefacts OpenSpec","Mode d''exploration pour la conception et la planification"],"de":["Frontend-Boilerplate mit Vite","Integration mit GraphQL","Unterstützung für Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design-Architektur","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten","Explorationsmodus für Design und Planung"],"pt":["Boilerplate frontend com Vite","Integração com GraphQL","Suporte a Typescript","Metodologia de arquitetura de projeto Feature-Sliced Design","Criação de artefatos OpenSpec","Modo de exploração para pensamento e visualização"],"ru":["Фронтенд-боилерплейт с Vite","Интеграция с GraphQL","Поддержка Typescript","Методология проектной архитектуры Feature-Sliced Design","Создание артефактов OpenSpec","Режим исследования для мышления и визуализации"],"ar":["قالب أمامي مع Vite","التكامل مع GraphQL","دعم Typescript","منهجية تصميم ميزة مقطعة للهندسة المعمارية للمشروع","إنشاء مكونات OpenSpec","وضع الاستكشاف للتفكير والتصور"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-explore","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","前端模板","前端开发","Web开发"],"ja":["openspec-explore","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","フロントエンドボイラープレート","フロントエンド開発","Web開発"],"ko":["openspec-explore","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","프론트엔드 보일러플레이트","프론트엔드 개발","웹 개발"],"es":["plantilla de frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","arquitectura de proyecto","desarrollo de software","frontend development"],"fr":["modèle de frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","architecture de projet","développement de logiciels","développement frontend"],"de":["Frontend-Boilerplate","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","Projektarchitektur","Softwareentwicklung","Frontend-Entwicklung"],"pt":["openspec-explore","boilerplate frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","desenvolvimento web","aplicativos web"],"ru":["openspec-explore","фронтенд-боилерплейт","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","разработка веб-приложений","веб-приложения"],"ar":["openspec-explore","قالب أمامي","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","منهجية تصميم ميزة مقطعة","تطوير تطبيقات الويب","تطبيقات الويب"]}},"owner":"uxname","repo":"litefront","repoPath":"uxname/litefront","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s c","body":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n```bash\nopenspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type | Where to Capture |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made | `design.md` |\n   | Scope changed | `proposal.md` |\n   | New work identified | `tasks.md` |\n   | Assumption invalidated | Relevant artifact |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:25:15.280Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced frontend architecture exploration and planning using Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Vite、GraphQL 和 Typescript 进行高级前端架构探索和规划的 AI 代理","ja":"Vite、GraphQL、TypeScript を使用した高度なフロントエンドアーキテクチャの探索と計画が必要な AI エージェントに最適","ko":"Vite, GraphQL, TypeScript를 사용하여 고급 프론트엔드 아키텍처를 탐색하고 계획하는 데 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan una exploración y planificación avanzadas de arquitectura frontend utilizando Vite, GraphQL y Typescript","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents IA ayant besoin d''une exploration et d''une planification avancées de l''architecture frontend à l''aide de Vite, GraphQL et Typescript","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Explorations- und Planungsphase für Frontend-Architektur mit Vite, GraphQL und Typescript benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de exploração e planejamento avançados de arquitetura de frontend usando Vite, GraphQL e Typescript","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые исследование и планирование архитектуры фронтенда с использованием Vite, GraphQL и Typescript","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الإيصاء بالذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى استكشاف وتخطيط متقدم للهيكل الأمامي باستخدام Vite و GraphQL و Typescript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to explore and visualize Feature-Sliced Design project architectures, leveraging GraphQL and Typescript for robust frontend development, and generates OpenSpec artifacts such as proposals, designs, and specs","zh":"赋予代理探索和可视化功能切片设计项目架构的能力，利用 GraphQL 和 TypeScript 进行强大的前端开发，并生成诸如提案、设计和规格等 OpenSpec 文档","ja":"GraphQL と TypeScript を使用して強力なフロントエンド開発を行い、提案、設計、仕様などの OpenSpec アーティファクトを生成しながら、機能スライス設計プロジェクトアーキテクチャを探索および視覚化するエージェントに力を与える","ko":"GraphQL과 TypeScript를 사용하여 강력한 프론트엔드 개발을 수행하며, 제안, 설계, 사양 등과 같은 OpenSpec 아티팩트를 생성하면서 기능 슬라이스 설계 프로젝트 아키텍처를 탐색 및 시각화하는 에이전트에 힘을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a explorar y visualizar arquitecturas de proyectos de diseño en secciones, aprovechando GraphQL y Typescript para un desarrollo de frontend robusto, y genera artefactos OpenSpec como propuestas, diseños y especificaciones","fr":"Permet aux agents d''explorer et de visualiser les architectures de projets de conception en tranches, en exploitant GraphQL et Typescript pour un développement de frontend robuste, et génère des artefacts OpenSpec tels que des propositions, des conceptions et des spécifications","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Projektarchitekturen im Feature-Sliced-Design zu erkunden und zu visualisieren, indem GraphQL und Typescript für robuste Frontend-Entwicklung genutzt werden, und generiert OpenSpec-Artefakte wie Vorschläge, Entwürfe und Spezifikationen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a explorar e visualizar projetos de arquitetura de design em fatias de recursos, utilizando GraphQL e Typescript para desenvolvimento de frontend robusto, e gera artefatos OpenSpec, como propostas, designs e especificações","ru":"Позволяет агентам исследовать и визуализировать проекты архитектуры дизайна, разрезанные на функции, используя GraphQL и Typescript для прочного разработки фронтенда, и генерирует артефакты OpenSpec, такие как предложения, дизайны и спецификации","ar":"تمكين العمليات من استكشاف وتصور مشاريع هيكل تصميم مقسم إلى شرائح ميزات، باستخدام GraphQL و Typescript من أجل تطوير هيكل أمامي متين، وGENERATE معالم OpenSpec مثل المقترحات والتصاميم والمواصفات"},"useCases":{"en":["Exploring Vite-based project structures","Visualizing Feature-Sliced Design architectures","Generating OpenSpec proposals for new features"],"zh":["探索基于 Vite 的项目结构","可视化功能切片设计架构","为新功能生成 OpenSpec 提案"],"ja":["Vite ベースのプロジェクト構造の探索","機能スライス設計アーキテクチャの視覚化","新しい機能の OpenSpec 提案の生成"],"ko":["Vite 기반 프로젝트 구조 탐색","기능 슬라이스 설계 아키텍처 시각화","새로운 기능의 OpenSpec 제안 생성"],"es":["Exploración de estructuras de proyectos basadas en Vite","Visualización de arquitecturas de diseño en secciones","Generación de propuestas OpenSpec para nuevas características"],"fr":["Exploration de structures de projets basées sur Vite","Visualisation d''architectures de conception en tranches","Génération de propositions OpenSpec pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités"],"de":["Erkundung von Vite-basierten Projektstrukturen","Visualisierung von Feature-Sliced-Design-Architekturen","Generierung von OpenSpec-Vorschlägen für neue Funktionen"],"pt":["Explorar estruturas de projetos baseados em Vite","Visualizar arquiteturas de design em fatias de recursos","Gerar propostas OpenSpec para recursos novos"],"ru":["Изучать структуры проектов на основе Vite","Визуализировать архитектуры дизайна, разрезанные на функции","Генерировать предложения OpenSpec для новых функций"],"ar":["استكشاف هياكل المشاريع التي تعتمد على Vite","تصور هيكل التصميم المقسم إلى شرائح ميزات","توليد مقترحات OpenSpec لخصائص جديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to exploration and planning, cannot implement code","Requires user to exit explore mode for implementation"],"zh":["仅限于探索和规划，无法实施代码","需要用户退出探索模式以进行实施"],"ja":["探索と計画のみに限定され、コードの実装はできません","実装するには、ユーザーが探索モードを終了する必要があります"],"ko":["탐색 및 계획만 가능하며, 코드 구현은 불가","구현을 위해 사용자는 탐색 모드를 종료해야 함"],"es":["Limitado a la exploración y la planificación, no puede implementar código","Requiere que el usuario salga del modo de exploración para la implementación"],"fr":["Limité à l''exploration et à la planification, ne peut pas implémenter de code","Nécessite que l''utilisateur quitte le mode d''exploration pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Erkundung und Planung, kann keinen Code implementieren","Benutzer muss den Explorationsmodus verlassen, um die Implementierung durchzuführen"],"pt":["Limitado à exploração e planejamento, não pode implementar código","Requer que o usuário saia do modo de exploração para implementação"],"ru":["Ограничен исследованием и планированием, не может реализовывать код","Требует от пользователя выхода из режима исследования для реализации"],"ar":["محدود بالاستكشاف والتخطيط، لا يمكنه تنفيذ الشفرة","يتطلب من المستخدم الخروج من وضع الاستكشاف للتطبيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01/mcp-builder', 'community', 'faint45', 'zhewei-ai-chat-01', 'faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01', 'mcp-builder', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z', '2026-02-18T12:25:44.854Z', NULL, '{"id":"faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01/mcp-builder","name":"mcp-builder","description":{"zh":"MCP Builder 是一个用于创建 MCP 服务器的工具，帮助开发者实现 LLM 与外部服务的交互","ja":"MCP Builder は、MCPサーバーを作成し、LLMと外部サービスを接続するためのツールです","ko":"MCP Builder는 MCP 서버를 생성하여 LLM과 외부 서비스를 연결하는 데 도움을 주는 도구입니다","es":"Desarrolla servidores MCP que permitan a los LLM interactuar con servicios externos a través de herramientas bien diseñadas","fr":"Développez des serveurs MCP qui permettent aux LLM d''interagir avec des services externes via des outils bien conçus","de":"Entwickeln Sie MCP-Server, die es LLM ermöglichen, mit externen Diensten über gut konzipierte Tools zu interagieren","pt":"O MCP é um protocolo que permite que os LLMs interajam com serviços externos. Este guia fornece uma visão geral do desenvolvimento de servidores MCP.","ru":"MCP — это протокол, который позволяет LLM взаимодействовать с внешними сервисами. Это руководство предоставляет обзор разработки серверов MCP.","ar":"MCP هو بروتوكول يسمح للمodels اللغة الطبيعية بالتفاعل مع الخدمات الخارجية. هذا الدليل يوفر نظرة عامة على تطوير خوادم MCP.","en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"MCP Builder 技术指南","ja":"MCP Builder 技術ガイド","ko":"MCP Builder 기술 가이드","es":"Guía de desarrollo de servidores MCP","fr":"Guide de développement de serveurs MCP","de":"MCP-Server-Entwicklungsleitfaden","pt":"Guia de Desenvolvimento de Servidores MCP","ru":"Руководство по разработке серверов MCP","ar":"دليل تطوير خوادم MCP","en":"mcp-builder"},"description":{"zh":"MCP Builder 是一个用于创建 MCP 服务器的工具，帮助开发者实现 LLM 与外部服务的交互","ja":"MCP Builder は、MCPサーバーを作成し、LLMと外部サービスを接続するためのツールです","ko":"MCP Builder는 MCP 서버를 생성하여 LLM과 외부 서비스를 연결하는 데 도움을 주는 도구입니다","es":"Desarrolla servidores MCP que permitan a los LLM interactuar con servicios externos a través de herramientas bien diseñadas","fr":"Développez des serveurs MCP qui permettent aux LLM d''interagir avec des services externes via des outils bien conçus","de":"Entwickeln Sie MCP-Server, die es LLM ermöglichen, mit externen Diensten über gut konzipierte Tools zu interagieren","pt":"O MCP é um protocolo que permite que os LLMs interajam com serviços externos. Este guia fornece uma visão geral do desenvolvimento de servidores MCP.","ru":"MCP — это протокол, который позволяет LLM взаимодействовать с внешними сервисами. Это руководство предоставляет обзор разработки серверов MCP.","ar":"MCP هو بروتوكول يسمح للمodels اللغة الطبيعية بالتفاعل مع الخدمات الخارجية. هذا الدليل يوفر نظرة عامة على تطوير خوادم MCP.","en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"definition":{"en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"features":{"zh":["支持创建高质量的 MCP 服务器","实现 LLM 与外部服务的交互","提供 API Coverage 和 Workflow Tools","支持深度研究和规划","支持创建自定义的 MCP 服务器"],"ja":["高品質のMCPサーバーの作成をサポート","LLMと外部サービスの接続を実現","API CoverageとWorkflow Toolsを提供","深度研究と計画をサポート","カスタムMCPサーバーの作成をサポート"],"ko":["고품질의 MCP 서버 생성 지원","LLM과 외부 서비스의 연결 구현","API Coverage와 Workflow Tools 제공","심도 있는 연구와 계획 지원","사용자 정의 MCP 서버 생성 지원"],"es":["Diseño de API de cobertura vs. herramientas de flujo de trabajo","Planificación y investigación en profundidad","Creación de servidores MCP de alta calidad","Interacción con servicios externos","Herramientas de flujo de trabajo bien diseñadas"],"fr":["Conception d''API de couverture vs. outils de workflow","Planification et recherche approfondie","Création de serveurs MCP de haute qualité","Interaction avec des services externes","Outils de workflow bien conçus"],"de":["API-Design von Abdeckung vs. Workflow-Tools","Planung und tiefe Recherche","Erstellung von hochwertigen MCP-Servern","Interaktion mit externen Diensten","Gut konzipierte Workflow-Tools"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de servidores MCP","Interação com serviços externos","Ferramentas de workflow personalizadas","API de cobertura","Planejamento e pesquisa aprofundada"],"ru":["Разработка серверов MCP","Взаимодействие с внешними сервисами","Пользовательские инструменты workflow","API-покрытие","Глубокое планирование и исследование"],"ar":["تطوير خوادم MCP","التفاعل مع الخدمات الخارجية","أدوات تدفق عمل مخصصة","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تغطية","التخطيط والبحث العميق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MCP Builder","MCP 服务器","LLM","外部服务","API Coverage","Workflow Tools","深度研究","规划"],"ja":["MCP Builder","MCPサーバー","LLM","外部サービス","API Coverage","Workflow Tools","深度研究","計画"],"ko":["MCP Builder","MCP 서버","LLM","외부 서비스","API Coverage","Workflow Tools","심도 있는 연구","계획"],"es":["desarrollo de servidores MCP","LLM","servicios externos","herramientas de flujo de trabajo","API de cobertura","planificación y investigación","alta calidad"],"fr":["développement de serveurs MCP","LLM","services externes","outils de workflow","API de couverture","planification et recherche","haute qualité"],"de":["MCP-Server-Entwicklung","LLM","externe Dienste","Workflow-Tools","API-Abdeckung","Planung und Recherche","hochwertig"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de servidores MCP","LLM","serviços externos","ferramentas de workflow","API de cobertura","planejamento e pesquisa","Model Context Protocol"],"ru":["разработка серверов MCP","LLM","внешние сервисы","инструменты workflow","API-покрытие","планирование и исследование","Model Context Protocol"],"ar":["تطوير خوادم MCP","LLM","الخدمات الخارجية","أدوات تدفق عمل","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تغطية","التخطيط والبحث","Model Context Protocol"]}},"owner":"faint45","repo":"zhewei-ai-chat-01","repoPath":"faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp-builder","description":"Guide for creating high-quality MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers that enable LLMs to interact with external services through well-designed tools. Use when building MCP servers to integrate external APIs or services, whether in Python (FastMCP) or Node/TypeScript (MCP SDK).","bodyPreview":"# MCP Server Development Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers that enable LLMs to interact with external services through well-designed tools. The quality of an MCP server is measured by how well it enables LLMs to accomplish real-world tasks.\n\n---\n\n# Process\n\n## 🚀 High-Level Workflow\n\nCreating a high-quality MCP server involves four main phases:\n\n### Phase 1: Deep Research and Planning\n\n#### 1.1 Understand Modern MCP Design\n\n**API Coverage vs. Workflow Tools:**\nBalan","body":"# MCP Server Development Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers that enable LLMs to interact with external services through well-designed tools. The quality of an MCP server is measured by how well it enables LLMs to accomplish real-world tasks.\n\n---\n\n# Process\n\n## 🚀 High-Level Workflow\n\nCreating a high-quality MCP server involves four main phases:\n\n### Phase 1: Deep Research and Planning\n\n#### 1.1 Understand Modern MCP Design\n\n**API Coverage vs. Workflow Tools:**\nBalance comprehensive API endpoint coverage with specialized workflow tools. Workflow tools can be more convenient for specific tasks, while comprehensive coverage gives agents flexibility to compose operations. Performance varies by client—some clients benefit from code execution that combines basic tools, while others work better with higher-level workflows. When uncertain, prioritize comprehensive API coverage.\n\n**Tool Naming and Discoverability:**\nClear, descriptive tool names help agents find the right tools quickly. Use consistent prefixes (e.g., `github_create_issue`, `github_list_repos`) and action-oriented naming.\n\n**Context Management:**\nAgents benefit from concise tool descriptions and the ability to filter/paginate results. Design tools that return focused, relevant data. Some clients support code execution which can help agents filter and process data efficiently.\n\n**Actionable Error Messages:**\nError messages should guide agents toward solutions with specific suggestions and next steps.\n\n#### 1.2 Study MCP Protocol Documentation\n\n**Navigate the MCP specification:**\n\nStart with the sitemap to find relevant pages: `https://modelcontextprotocol.io/sitemap.xml`\n\nThen fetch specific pages with `.md` suffix for markdown format (e.g., `https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/draft.md`).\n\nKey pages to review:\n- Specification overview and architecture\n- Transport mechanisms (streamable HTTP, stdio)\n- Tool, resource, and prompt definitions\n\n#### 1.3 Study Framework Documentation\n\n**Recommended stack:**\n- **Language**: TypeScript (high-quality SDK support and good compatibility in many execution environments e.g. MCPB. Plus AI models are good at generating TypeScript code, benefiting from its broad usage, static typing and good linting tools)\n- **Transport**: Streamable HTTP for remote servers, using stateless JSON (simpler to scale and maintain, as opposed to stateful sessions and streaming responses). stdio for local servers.\n\n**Load framework documentation:**\n\n- **MCP Best Practices**: [📋 View Best Practices](./reference/mcp_best_practices.md) - Core guidelines\n\n**For TypeScript (recommended):**\n- **TypeScript SDK**: Use WebFetch to load `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/main/README.md`\n- [⚡ TypeScript Guide](./reference/node_mcp_server.md) - TypeScript patterns and examples\n\n**For Python:**\n- **Python SDK**: Use WebFetch to load `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/main/README.md`\n- [🐍 Python Guide](./reference/python_mcp_server.md) - Python patterns and examples\n\n#### 1.4 Plan Your Implementation\n\n**Understand the API:**\nReview the service''s API documentation to identify key endpoints, authentication requirements, and data models. Use web search and WebFetch as needed.\n\n**Tool Selection:**\nPrioritize comprehensive API coverage. List endpoints to implement, starting with the most common operations.\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2: Implementation\n\n#### 2.1 Set Up Project Structure\n\nSee language-specific guides for project setup:\n- [⚡ TypeScript Guide](./reference/node_mcp_server.md) - Project structure, package.json, tsconfig.json\n- [🐍 Python Guide](./reference/python_mcp_server.md) - Module organization, dependencies\n\n#### 2.2 Implement Core Infrastructure\n\nCreate shared utilities:\n- API client with authentication\n- Error handling helpers\n- Response formatting (JSON/Markdown)\n- Pagination support\n\n#### 2.3 Implement Tools\n\nFor each tool:\n\n**Input Schema:**\n- Use Zod (TypeScript) or Pydantic (Python)\n- Include constraints and clear descriptions\n- Add examples in field descriptions\n\n**Output Schema:**\n- Define `outputSchema` where possible for structured data\n- Use `structuredContent` in tool responses (TypeScript SDK feature)\n- Helps clients understand and process tool outputs\n\n**Tool Description:**\n- Concise summary of functionality\n- Parameter descriptions\n- Return type schema\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Async/await for I/O operations\n- Proper error handling with actionable messages\n- Support pagination where applicable\n- Return both text content and structured data when using modern SDKs\n\n**Annotations:**\n- `readOnlyHint`: true/false\n- `destructiveHint`: true/false\n- `idempotentHint`: true/false\n- `openWorldHint`: true/false\n\n---\n\n### Phase 3: Review and Test\n\n#### 3.1 Code Quality\n\nReview for:\n- No duplicated code (DRY principle)\n- Consistent error handling\n- Full type coverage\n- Clear tool descriptions\n\n#### 3.2 Build and Test\n\n**TypeScript:**\n- Run `npm run build` to verify compilation\n- Test with MCP Inspector: `npx @modelcontextprotocol/inspector`\n\n**Python:**\n- Verify syntax: `python -m py_compile your_server.py`\n- Test with MCP Inspector\n\nSee language-specific guides for detailed testing approaches and quality checklists.\n\n---\n\n### Phase 4: Create Evaluations\n\nAfter implementing your MCP server, create comprehensive evaluations to test its effectiveness.\n\n**Load [✅ Evaluation Guide](./reference/evaluation.md) for complete evaluation guidelines.**\n\n#### 4.1 Understand Evaluation Purpose\n\nUse evaluations to test whether LLMs can effectively use your MCP server to answer realistic, complex questions.\n\n#### 4.2 Create 10 Evaluation Questions\n\nTo create effective evaluations, follow the process outlined in the evaluation guide:\n\n1. **Tool Inspection**: List available tools and understand their capabilities\n2. **Content Exploration**: Use READ-ONLY operations to explore available data\n3. **Question Generation**: Create 10 complex, realistic questions\n4. **Answer Verification**: Solve each question yourself to verify answers\n\n#### 4.3 Evaluation Requirements\n\nEnsure each question is:\n- **Independent**: Not dependent on other questions\n- **Read-only**: Only non-destructive operations required\n- **Complex**: Requiring multiple tool calls and deep exploration\n- **Realistic**: Based on real use cases humans would care about\n- **Verifiable**: Single, clear answer that can be verified by string comparison\n- **Stable**: Answer won''t change over time\n\n#### 4.4 Output Format\n\nCreate an XML file with this structure:\n\n```xml\n<evaluation>\n  <qa_pair>\n    <question>Find discussions about AI model launches with animal codenames. One model needed a specific safety designation that uses the format ASL-X. What number X was being determined for the model named after a spotted wild cat?</question>\n    <answer>3</answer>\n  </qa_pair>\n<!-- More qa_pairs... -->\n</evaluation>\n```\n\n---\n\n# Reference Files\n\n## 📚 Documentation Library\n\nLoad these resources as needed during development:\n\n### Core MCP Documentation (Load First)\n- **MCP Protocol**: Start with sitemap at `https://modelcontextprotocol.io/sitemap.xml`, then fetch specific pages with `.md` suffix\n- [📋 MCP Best Practices](./reference/mcp_best_practices.md) - Universal MCP guidelines including:\n  - Server and tool naming conventions\n  - Response format guidelines (JSON vs Markdown)\n  - Pagination best practices\n  - Transport selection (streamable HTTP vs stdio)\n  - Security and error handling standards\n\n### SDK Documentation (Load During Phase 1/2)\n- **Python SDK**: Fetch from `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/main/README.md`\n- **TypeScript SDK**: Fetch from `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/main/README.md`\n\n### Language-Specific Implementation Guides (Load During Phase 2)\n- [🐍 Python Implementation Guide](./reference/python_mcp_server.md) - Complete Python/FastMCP guide with:\n  - Server initialization patterns\n  - Pydantic model examples\n  - Tool registration with `@mcp.tool`\n  - Complete working examples\n  - Quality checklist\n\n- [⚡ TypeScript Implementation Guide](./reference/node_mcp_server.md) - Complete TypeScript guide with:\n  - Project structure\n  - Zod schema patterns\n  - Tool registration with `server.registerTool`\n  - Complete working examples\n  - Quality checklist\n\n### Evaluation Guide (Load During Phase 4)\n- [✅ Evaluation Guide](./reference/evaluation.md) - Complete evaluation creation guide with:\n  - Question creation guidelines\n  - Answer verification strategies\n  - XML format specifications\n  - Example questions and answers\n  - Running an evaluation with the provided scripts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:25:44.854Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to interact with external services through Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers.","zh":"非常适合需要通过模型上下文协议（MCP）服务器与外部服务交互的AI代理。","ja":"モデルコンテキストプロトコル（MCP）サーバーを介して外部サービスと交互作用する必要があるAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"외부 서비스와 모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜(MCP) 서버를 통해 상호 작용해야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan interactuar con servicios externos a través de servidores de Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''interagir avec des services externes via des serveurs de Protocole de Contexte de Modèle (MCP).","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die mit externen Diensten über Model Context Protocol (MCP)-Server interagieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam interagir com serviços externos por meio de servidores do Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP).","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо взаимодействовать с внешними сервисами через серверы Протокола контекста модели (MCP).","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تحتاج إلى التفاعل مع الخدمات الخارجية من خلال خادم بروتوكول سياق النموذج (MCP)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality MCP servers, enabling Large Language Models (LLMs) to accomplish real-world tasks through well-designed tools and APIs, leveraging the Model Context Protocol for seamless interaction.","zh":"赋予代理创建高质量的MCP服务器的能力，使大型语言模型（LLM）能够通过精心设计的工具和API完成实际任务，同时利用模型上下文协议实现无缝交互。","ja":"エージェントに高品質のMCPサーバーを作成する能力を与え、Large Language Models（LLM）が、よく設計されたツールとAPIを使用して、実世界のタスクを実行できるようにし、モデルコンテキストプロトコルを使用してシームレスな相互作用を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 높은 품질의 MCP 서버를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 큰 언어 모델(LLM)이 잘 설계된 도구와 API를 통해 실제 작업을 수행할 수 있으며 모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜을 사용하여 무결점 상호 작용을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear servidores MCP de alta calidad, lo que permite a los Grandes Modelos de Lenguaje (LLMs) realizar tareas del mundo real a través de herramientas y API bien diseñadas, aprovechando el Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo para una interacción fluida.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des serveurs MCP de haute qualité, permettant ainsi aux Grand Modèles de Langage (LLMs) d''accomplir des tâches du monde réel via des outils et des API bien conçus, en exploitant le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle pour une interaction fluide.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, hochwertige MCP-Server zu erstellen, wodurch Large Language Models (LLMs) reale Aufgaben mit Hilfe von gut gestalteten Tools und APIs ausführen können, die den Model Context Protocol für eine nahtlose Interaktion nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem servidores MCP de alta qualidade, permitindo que os Grandes Modelos de Linguagem (LLMs) realizem tarefas do mundo real por meio de ferramentas e APIs bem projetadas, aproveitando o Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo para interação sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать серверы MCP высокого качества, что позволяет Большим языковым моделям (LLM) выполнять реальные задачи с помощью хорошо спроектированных инструментов и API, используя Протокол контекста модели для беспрепятственного взаимодействия.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء خوادم MCP عالية الجودة، مما يسمح للنماذج اللغوية الكبيرة (LLMs) بإنجاز مهام العالم الحقيقي من خلال أدوات وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات المصممة جيدًا، مستفيدًا من بروتوكول سياق النموذج للتفاعل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing MCP servers for LLMs to interact with external services","Designing workflow tools for API coverage and integration","Building high-quality MCP servers for real-world task automation"],"zh":["为LLM开发MCP服务器以与外部服务交互","设计用于API覆盖和集成的工作流工具","构建高质量的MCP服务器以实现实际任务自动化"],"ja":["LLMが外部サービスと交互作用するためのMCPサーバーの開発","APIカバレッジと統合のためのワークフローツールの設計","実世界のタスク自動化のための高品質なMCPサーバーの構築"],"ko":["LLM이 외부 서비스와 상호 작용하기 위한 MCP 서버 개발","API 커버리지 및 통합을 위한 워크플로우 도구 설계","실제 작업 자동화를 위한 높은 품질의 MCP 서버 구축"],"es":["Desarrollar servidores MCP para que los LLM interactúen con servicios externos","Diseñar herramientas de flujo de trabajo para la cobertura de API y la integración","Crear servidores MCP de alta calidad para la automatización de tareas del mundo real"],"fr":["Développer des serveurs MCP pour que les LLM interagissent avec des services externes","Concevoir des outils de workflow pour la couverture de l''API et l''intégration","Créer des serveurs MCP de haute qualité pour l''automatisation des tâches du monde réel"],"de":["MCP-Server für die Interaktion von LLM mit externen Diensten entwickeln","Workflow-Tools für API-Abdeckung und Integration entwerfen","Hochwertige MCP-Server für die Automatisierung von realen Aufgaben erstellen"],"pt":["Desenvolver servidores MCP para LLMs interagirem com serviços externos","Projetar ferramentas de fluxo de trabalho para cobertura e integração de API","Construir servidores MCP de alta qualidade para automação de tarefas do mundo real"],"ru":["Разработка серверов MCP для взаимодействия LLM с внешними сервисами","Проектирование инструментов рабочего процесса для покрытия и интеграции API","Создание серверов MCP высокого качества для автоматизации реальных задач"],"ar":["إنشاء خوادم MCP للنماذج اللغوية الكبيرة للتفاعل مع الخدمات الخارجية","تصميم أدوات سير العمل لتغطية ودمج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","بناء خوادم MCP عالية الجودة للآليّة تلقائية للمهام الحقيقية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Modern MCP Design and API Coverage vs. Workflow Tools","Dependent on the quality of the MCP server design and implementation"],"zh":["需要了解现代MCP设计和API覆盖与工作流工具","依赖于MCP服务器设计和实现的质量"],"ja":["モダンMCPデザインとAPIカバレッジ対ワークフローツールの理解が必要","MCPサーバーの設計と実装の品質に依存する"],"ko":["현대 MCP 설계 및 API 커버리지와 워크플로우 도구를 이해해야 함","MCP 서버 설계 및 구현의 품질에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del Diseño Moderno de MCP y la Cobertura de API vs. Herramientas de Flujo de Trabajo","Depende de la calidad del diseño e implementación del servidor MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la Conception Moderne de MCP et de la Couverture de l''API vs. Outils de Workflow","Dépend de la qualité de la conception et de la mise en œuvre du serveur MCP"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis des Modernen MCP-Designs und der API-Abdeckung vs. Workflow-Tools","Hängt von der Qualität des MCP-Server-Designs und der Implementierung ab"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do Design Moderno de MCP e Cobertura de API versus Ferramentas de Fluxo de Trabalho","Dependente da qualidade do design e implementação do servidor MCP"],"ru":["Требует понимания Современного дизайна MCP и покрытия API по сравнению с инструментами рабочего процесса","Зависит от качества дизайна и реализации сервера MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم التصميم الحديث لمكبوت بروتوكول سياق النموذج وتغطية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مقابل أدوات سير العمل","يعتمد على جودة تصميم وتنفيذ خادم بروتوكول سياق النموذج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
