deos, áudio e fontes","Uso de áudio em Remotion","Práticas recomendadas para Remotion"],"ru":["3D с Three.js и React Three Fiber","Основные анимации для Remotion","Импорт изображений, видео, аудио и шрифтов","Использование аудио в Remotion","Рекомендуемые практики для Remotion"],"ar":["3D مع Three.js و React Three Fiber","الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية ل Remotion","استيراد الصور، والفيديو، والصوت، والخطوط","استخدام الصوت في Remotion","أفضل الممارسات ل Remotion"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion","视频生成","代码优化","3D 内容","动画技能","资产导入","音频支持"],"ja":["Remotion","動画生成","コードの最適化","3D コンテンツ","アニメーションスキル","アセットのインポート","オーディオサポート"],"ko":["Remotion","비디오 생성","코드 최적화","3D 컨텐츠","애니메이션 스킬","자산导入","오디오 지원"],"es":["Remotion","mejores prácticas","creación de videos","contenido 3D","animación","importación de activos","audio en Remotion","desarrollo de video","herramientas de video","tecnologías de video"],"fr":["Remotion","bonnes pratiques","création de vidéos","contenu 3D","animation","importation de ressources","audio dans Remotion","développement de vidéo","outils de vidéo","technologies de vidéo"],"de":["Remotion","Best Practices","Videoerstellung","3D-Inhalte","Animation","Importieren von Assets","Audio in Remotion","Videotechnologie","Video-Tools","Video-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Remotion","Melhores práticas","3D","Animações","Ativos","Áudio","Desenvolvimento de vídeo","Geração de vídeo","Ferramentas de vídeo"],"ru":["Remotion","Лучшие практики","3D","Анимации","Активы","Аудио","Разработка видео","Генерация видео","Инструменты видео"],"ar":["Remotion","أفضل الممارسات","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","الملفات","الصوت","تطوير الفيديو","إنشاء الفيديو","أدوات الفيديو"]}},"owner":"hototohototo","repo":"remotionAI-play","repoPath":"hototohototo/remotionAI-play","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:25:47.880Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing expertise in Remotion code and domain-specific knowledge.","zh":"非常适合需要在Remotion代码和特定领域知识方面拥有专业知识的视频生成代理。","ja":"Remotionコードとドメイン固有の知識に関する専門知識を必要とするビデオ生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Remotion 코드 및 도메인 특정 지식에 대한 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 비디오 생성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Generación de Video que necesitan experiencia en código Remotion y conocimientos específicos del dominio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de vidéos ayant besoin d''expertise en code Remotion et de connaissances spécifiques au domaine.","de":"Perfekt für Video-Generierungsagenten, die Expertenwissen in Remotion-Code und domänen-spezifischem Wissen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que necessitam de especialização em código Remotion e conhecimento específico de domínio.","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации видео, нуждающихся в опыте работы с кодом Remotion и знании конкретной области.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في كود Remotion ومعارف محددة لمنطقة معينة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master Remotion best practices, leveraging Three.js and React Three Fiber for 3D content, and fundamental animation skills, while efficiently importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion projects.","zh":"赋予代理掌握Remotion最佳实践的能力，利用Three.js和React Three Fiber进行3D内容创建，并掌握基本动画技能，同时高效地将图像、视频、音频和字体导入Remotion项目。","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用した3Dコンテンツの作成、および基本的なアニメーションスキルをマスターし、効率的に画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントをRemotionプロジェクトにインポートするRemotionのベストプラクティスをマスターするエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용한 3D 콘텐츠 생성 및 기본 애니메이션技能을 마스터하고, 효율적으로 이미지, 비디오, 오디오 및 폰트를 Remotion 프로젝트에 가져오는 Remotion의 최고 실践을 마스터하는 에이전트에게 권장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar las mejores prácticas de Remotion, aprovechando Three.js y React Three Fiber para contenido 3D, y habilidades de animación fundamentales, mientras importa eficientemente imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes en proyectos de Remotion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser les meilleures pratiques de Remotion, en exploitant Three.js et React Three Fiber pour le contenu 3D, et les compétences en animation fondamentales, tout en important efficacement des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices dans les projets Remotion.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Remotion-Best-Practices zu meistern, indem sie Three.js und React Three Fiber für 3D-Inhalte und grundlegende Animationsfähigkeiten nutzen und Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten in Remotion-Projekte effizient importieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar as melhores práticas de Remotion, aproveitando o Three.js e o React Three Fiber para conteúdo 3D, e habilidades fundamentais de animação, enquanto importa eficientemente imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes para projetos Remotion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить лучшие практики Remotion, используя Three.js и React Three Fiber для контента 3D, и фундаментальные навыки анимации, а также эффективно импортируя изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты в проекты Remotion.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إتقان أفضل الممارسات لبرنامج Remotion، واستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber لإنشاء محتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد، ومهارات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية، وأيضًا استيراد الصور وملفات الفيديو والصوت والخطوط بشكل فعال في مشاريع برنامج Remotion."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D content in Remotion using Three.js","Creating smooth animations with fundamental animation skills","Importing and managing assets like images, videos, and fonts"],"zh":["使用Three.js在Remotion中生成3D内容","使用基本动画技能创建平滑动画","导入和管理图像、视频和字体等资产"],"ja":["Three.jsを使用してRemotionで3Dコンテンツを生成する","基本的なアニメーションスキルを使用してスムーズなアニメーションを作成する","画像、ビデオ、フォントなどのアセットをインポートして管理する"],"ko":["Three.js를 사용하여 Remotion에서 3D 콘텐츠를 생성하는 것","기본 애니메이션 기술을 사용하여 매끄러운 애니메이션을 생성하는 것","이미지, 비디오, 폰트 등 자산을 가져오고 관리하는 것"],"es":["Generar contenido 3D en Remotion mediante Three.js","Crear animaciones suaves con habilidades de animación fundamentales","Importar y administrar activos como imágenes, videos y fuentes"],"fr":["Générer du contenu 3D dans Remotion à l''aide de Three.js","Créer des animations fluides avec des compétences en animation fondamentales","Importer et gérer des actifs tels que des images, des vidéos et des polices"],"de":["3D-Inhalte in Remotion mit Three.js generieren","Sanfte Animationen mit grundlegenden Animationsfähigkeiten erstellen","Bilder, Videos und Schriftarten als Assets importieren und verwalten"],"pt":["Gerar conteúdo 3D no Remotion usando Three.js","Criar animações suaves com habilidades fundamentais de animação","Importar e gerenciar ativos como imagens, vídeos e fontes"],"ru":["Генерация контента 3D в Remotion с помощью Three.js","Создание гладких анимаций с фундаментальными навыками анимации","Импорт и управление активами, такими как изображения, видео и шрифты"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد في برنامج Remotion باستخدام Three.js","إنشاء رسوم متحركة ناعمة باستخدام مهارات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية","استيراد وإدارة الملفات مثل الصور وملفات الفيديو والخطوط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Domain-specific knowledge of video generation and Remotion ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Remotion代码库访问权限","需要视频生成和Remotion生态系统的特定领域知识"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","ビデオ生成とRemotionエコシステムに関するドメイン固有の知識が必要"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 대한 접근 권한이 필요합니다","비디오 생성 및 Remotion 에코시스템에 대한 도메인 특정 지식이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código Remotion","Conocimientos específicos del dominio de la generación de video y el ecosistema Remotion"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code Remotion","Connaissances spécifiques au domaine de la génération de vidéos et de l''écosystème Remotion"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebasis","Domänen-spezifisches Wissen über die Videogenerierung und das Remotion-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código Remotion","Conhecimento específico de domínio de geração de vídeo e ecossistema Remotion"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе Remotion","Конкретные знания области генерации видео и экосистемы Remotion"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة كود برنامج Remotion","معرفة محددة لمنطقة إنشاء الفيديو وبيئة برنامج Remotion"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('EmilyMacro/test/project-onboarding', 'community', 'EmilyMacro', 'test', 'EmilyMacro/test', 'project-onboarding', 0, 0, 20, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z', '2026-02-18T12:25:48.854Z', NULL, '{"id":"EmilyMacro/test/project-onboarding","name":"project-onboarding","description":{"zh":"项目入门指南提供了项目背景、需求、架构、数据模型和计划的清晰概述","ja":"プロジェクトオンボーディングガイドは、プロジェクトの背景、要件、構成、データモデル、計画の明確な概要を提供します","ko":"프로젝트 온보딩 가이드는 프로젝트 배경, 요구사항, 아키텍처, 데이터 모델 및 계획에 대한 명확한 개요를 제공합니다","es":"Nuestro enfoque de integración de proyectos proporciona un contexto canónico para garantizar la seguridad y privacidad de los datos","fr":"Notre approche d''intégration de projets fournit un contexte canonique pour assurer la sécurité et la confidentialité des données","de":"Unser Projektintegrationsansatz bietet einen kanonischen Kontext, um die Sicherheit und Privatsphäre von Daten zu gewährleisten","pt":"O onboarding de projeto envolve configurar o contexto do projeto, definir papéis e permissões e garantir a segurança e privacidade dos dados.","ru":"Вводный проект включает в себя настройку контекста проекта, определение ролей и разрешений, а также обеспечение безопасности и конфиденциальности данных.","ar":"تأسيس المشروع يتضمن تعيين سياق المشروع، وتحديد الأدوار والصلاحيات، وضمان أمان وخصوصية البيانات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"项目入门指南","ja":"プロジェクトオンボーディング","ko":"프로젝트 온보딩 가이드","es":"Integración de proyectos con contexto canónico","fr":"Intégration de projets avec contexte canonique","de":"Projektintegration mit kanonischen Kontext","pt":"Onboarding de Projeto: Guia Técnico","ru":"Вводный Проект: Техническое Руководство","ar":"تأسيس المشروع: دليل تقني","en":"project-onboarding"},"description":{"zh":"项目入门指南提供了项目背景、需求、架构、数据模型和计划的清晰概述","ja":"プロジェクトオンボーディングガイドは、プロジェクトの背景、要件、構成、データモデル、計画の明確な概要を提供します","ko":"프로젝트 온보딩 가이드는 프로젝트 배경, 요구사항, 아키텍처, 데이터 모델 및 계획에 대한 명확한 개요를 제공합니다","es":"Nuestro enfoque de integración de proyectos proporciona un contexto canónico para garantizar la seguridad y privacidad de los datos","fr":"Notre approche d''intégration de projets fournit un contexte canonique pour assurer la sécurité et la confidentialité des données","de":"Unser Projektintegrationsansatz bietet einen kanonischen Kontext, um die Sicherheit und Privatsphäre von Daten zu gewährleisten","pt":"O onboarding de projeto envolve configurar o contexto do projeto, definir papéis e permissões e garantir a segurança e privacidade dos dados.","ru":"Вводный проект включает в себя настройку контекста проекта, определение ролей и разрешений, а также обеспечение безопасности и конфиденциальности данных.","ar":"تأسيس المشروع يتضمن تعيين سياق المشروع، وتحديد الأدوار والصلاحيات، وضمان أمان وخصوصية البيانات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["项目背景和需求","架构和数据模型","项目计划和时间表","用户角色和权限","隐私和安全考虑"],"ja":["プロジェクトの背景と要件","構成とデータモデル","プロジェクト計画とスケジュール","ユーザーロールと権限","プライバシーとセキュリティの考慮"],"ko":["프로젝트 배경과 요구사항","아키텍처와 데이터 모델","프로젝트 계획과 일정","사용자 역할과 권한","개인정보와 보안 고려"],"es":["Contexto canónico para proyectos","Definición de roles y permisos","Clasificación de datos para seguridad","Planificación de proyectos y arquitectura","Documentación de requisitos y breves de proyecto"],"fr":["Contexte canonique pour les projets","Définition des rôles et des autorisations","Classification des données pour la sécurité","Planification de projets et architecture","Documentation des exigences et des briefs de projet"],"de":["Kanonischer Kontext für Projekte","Definition von Rollen und Berechtigungen","Datenklassifizierung für die Sicherheit","Projektplanung und Architektur","Dokumentation von Anforderungen und Projektbriefen"],"pt":["Definição de papéis e permissões","Classificação de dados","Garantia de segurança e privacidade","Criação de um plano de projeto","Definição de arquitetura e modelo de dados"],"ru":["Определение ролей и разрешений","Классификация данных","Обеспечение безопасности и конфиденциальности","Создание плана проекта","Определение архитектуры и модели данных"],"ar":["تحديد الأدوار والصلاحيات","تصنيف البيانات","ضمان الأمان و الخصوصية","إنشاء خطة للمشروع","تحديد الهيكل ونموذج البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目入门","项目管理","项目计划","需求分析","架构设计","数据模型","用户角色","权限管理","隐私和安全"],"ja":["プロジェクトオンボーディング","プロジェクト管理","プロジェクト計画","要件分析","構成設計","データモデル","ユーザーロール","権限管理","プライバシーとセキュリティ"],"ko":["프로젝트 온보딩","프로젝트 관리","프로젝트 계획","요구사항 분석","아키텍처 설계","데이터 모델","사용자 역할","권한 관리","개인정보와 보안"],"es":["integración de proyectos","contexto canónico","seguridad de datos","privacidad de datos","planificación de proyectos","arquitectura de proyectos","definición de roles","permisos de proyecto"],"fr":["intégration de projets","contexte canonique","sécurité des données","confidentialité des données","planification de projets","architecture de projets","définition des rôles","autorisations de projet"],"de":["Projektintegration","kanonischer Kontext","Datensicherheit","Datenschutz","Projektplanung","Projektarchitektur","Rollendefinition","Projektberechtigungen"],"pt":["onboarding de projeto","segurança de dados","privacidade de dados","definição de papéis","classificação de dados","plano de projeto","arquitetura de projeto","modelo de dados"],"ru":["вводный проект","безопасность данных","конфиденциальность данных","определение ролей","классификация данных","план проекта","архитектура проекта","модель данных"],"ar":["تأسيس المشروع","أمان البيانات","خصوصية البيانات","تحديد الأدوار","تصنيف البيانات","خطة المشروع","هيكل المشروع","نموذج البيانات"]}},"owner":"EmilyMacro","repo":"test","repoPath":"EmilyMacro/test","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-onboarding","description":"Project-specific onboarding context (roles, key flows, data sensitivity, how to run tests, and where the canonical docs live).","bodyPreview":"## Canonical project context\n\n- Project brief: `orga/domain/project-brief.md`\n- Requirements: `orga/domain/requirements.md`\n- Architecture: `orga/domain/architecture.md`\n- Data model: `orga/domain/data-model.md`\n- Plan: `orga/domain/project-plan.md`\n\n## Users, roles, and permissions\n\n- Define roles and what each role can see/do.\n- If the project has sensitive data, document the threat hotspots and required mitigations.\n\n## Privacy & security\n\n- Data classification (public/internal/secret) and wh","body":"## Canonical project context\n\n- Project brief: `orga/domain/project-brief.md`\n- Requirements: `orga/domain/requirements.md`\n- Architecture: `orga/domain/architecture.md`\n- Data model: `orga/domain/data-model.md`\n- Plan: `orga/domain/project-plan.md`\n\n## Users, roles, and permissions\n\n- Define roles and what each role can see/do.\n- If the project has sensitive data, document the threat hotspots and required mitigations.\n\n## Privacy & security\n\n- Data classification (public/internal/secret) and what counts as PII.\n- Secrets handling: what must never be committed.\n- High-risk surfaces (uploads, admin screens, exports, webhooks, auth flows).\n- Minimal threat sketch and required tests/smoke checks.\n\n## Repo hygiene\n\n- `.gitignore` should exclude secrets and local artifacts (e.g. `.env`, `.venv/`, caches, uploads).\n- Prefer `.env.example` for documenting required environment variables.\n\n## Key flows\n\n- List the top user journeys (the ones that drive most design/testing decisions).\n\n## Development workflow\n\n- Tasks index: `orga/tasks/TASKS.md`\n- Start a task: GitHub Actions **Start Task**, then `/plan-task`.\n- Finish a task: GitHub Actions **Finish Task**.\n\n## Commands\n\n- Tests: `python -m pytest -q`\n\n## Notes\n\nUpdate this skill whenever the project brief changes significantly.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:25:48.854Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Organizational Agents requiring structured project context and access control management.","zh":"适合需要结构化项目背景和访问控制管理的组织代理","ja":"構造化されたプロジェクトの背景とアクセス制御管理を必要とする組織エージェントに適しています","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 컨텍스트와 액세스 제어 관리가 필요한 조직 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes organizacionales que requieren un contexto de proyecto estructurado y gestión de control de acceso.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents organisationnels nécessitant un contexte de projet structuré et une gestion de contrôle d''accès.","de":"Ideal für organisatorische Agenten, die einen strukturierten Projektkontext und eine Zugriffscontrollverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Organizacionais que requerem contexto de projeto estruturado e gerenciamento de controle de acesso.","ru":"Идеально для Организационных Агентов, требующих структурированного контекста проекта и управления контролем доступа.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإدارة التنظيمية التي تتطلب سياق مشروع منظم وإدارة التحكم في الوصول."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage project onboarding by defining canonical project contexts, including project briefs, requirements, architecture, and data models, while ensuring role-based access control and data classification for sensitive information, utilizing Markdown files for documentation and collaborating on project plans.","zh":"赋予代理管理项目上线的能力，通过定义规范的项目背景，包括项目简介、要求、架构和数据模型，同时确保基于角色的访问控制和敏感信息的数据分类，利用Markdown文件进行文档编制和项目计划的协作","ja":"エージェントにプロジェクトのオンボーディングを管理する能力を与え、プロジェクトの概要、要件、構成、データモデルなどを含む標準的なプロジェクトの背景を定義し、ロールベースのアクセス制御と機密情報のデータ分類を確保し、Markdownファイルを使用して文書化とプロジェクト計画の協力を実施する","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 온보딩을 관리할 수 있도록 empowerment하며, 프로젝트 개요, 요구 사항, 아키텍처 및 데이터 모델 등을 포함한 표준 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 정의하고, 역할 기반의 액세스 제어 및 민감한 정보의 데이터 분류를 보장하며, Markdown 파일을 사용하여 문서화 및 프로젝트 계획 협력을 수행한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar la incorporación de proyectos definiendo contextos de proyecto canónicos, incluyendo informes de proyecto, requisitos, arquitectura y modelos de datos, al mismo tiempo que garantiza el control de acceso basado en roles y la clasificación de datos para información sensible, utilizando archivos Markdown para la documentación y colaborando en los planes de proyecto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''intégration de projets en définissant des contextes de projet canoniques, y compris les briefs de projet, les exigences, l''architecture et les modèles de données, tout en assurant un contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles et une classification des données pour les informations sensibles, en utilisant des fichiers Markdown pour la documentation et en collaborant sur les plans de projet.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Projekt-Onboarding durch Definition kanonischer Projekt-Kontexte zu verwalten, einschließlich Projektbriefings, Anforderungen, Architektur und Datenmodellen, während gleichzeitig rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle und Datenklassifizierung für sensible Informationen sichergestellt werden, unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien für die Dokumentation und Zusammenarbeit an Projektplänen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o processo de integração de projetos definindo contextos de projeto canônicos, incluindo briefings de projeto, requisitos, arquitetura e modelos de dados, garantindo o controle de acesso baseado em funções e classificação de dados para informações sensíveis, utilizando arquivos Markdown para documentação e colaboração em planos de projeto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять интеграцией проектов, определяя канонические контексты проекта, включая описания проекта, требования, архитектуру и модели данных, обеспечивая роль-базированный контроль доступа и классификацию данных для конфиденциальной информации, используя файлы Markdown для документации и сотрудничества в проектных планах.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إدارة عملية دمج المشاريع عن طريق تعريف سياقات المشروع القائمة على المعايير، بما في ذلك خطط المشروع والمتطلبات والهيكل والنمذجة البيانية، مع ضمان التحكم في الوصولตาม الأدوار وتصنيف البيانات للمعلومات الحساسة، باستخدام ملفات Markdown للتوثيق والتعاون في خطط المشروع."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining project scope and requirements","Assigning roles and permissions for team members","Classifying data and implementing security mitigations"],"zh":["定义项目范围和要求","为团队成员分配角色和权限","对数据进行分类并实施安全缓解措施"],"ja":["プロジェクトの範囲と要件を定義する","チームメンバーにロールとアクセス許可を割り当てる","データを分類し、セキュリティ対策を実施する"],"ko":["프로젝트 범위 및 요구 사항을 정의","팀 구성원에게 역할 및 액세스 권한을 할당","데이터를 분류 및 보안 완화를 구현"],"es":["Definir el alcance y los requisitos del proyecto","Asignar roles y permisos para los miembros del equipo","Clasificar datos e implementar mitigaciones de seguridad"],"fr":["Définir la portée et les exigences du projet","Attribuer des rôles et des autorisations pour les membres de l''équipe","Classer les données et mettre en œuvre des atténuations de sécurité"],"de":["Definieren des Projektumfangs und der Anforderungen","Zuweisen von Rollen und Berechtigungen für Teammitglieder","Klassifizieren von Daten und Umsetzen von Sicherheitsmaßnahmen"],"pt":["Definir o escopo e os requisitos do projeto","Atribuir funções e permissões para membros da equipe","Classificar dados e implementar mitigação de segurança"],"ru":["Определение объема и требований проекта","Назначение ролей и разрешений для членов команды","Классификация данных и реализация мер по смягчению последствий для безопасности"],"ar":["تحديد نطاق ومتطلبات المشروع","تعيين الأدوار والصلاحيات لأعضاء الفريق","تصنيف البيانات وتنفيذ تخفيف الأخطار الأمنية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Markdown file access and editing capabilities","Limited to organizational and project management contexts"],"zh":["需要Markdown文件的访问和编辑能力","仅限组织和项目管理背景"],"ja":["Markdownファイルへのアクセスと編集機能が必要","組織とプロジェクト管理の背景のみに限定される"],"ko":["Markdown 파일에 대한 액세스 및 편집 기능이 필요","조직 및 프로젝트 관리 배경에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso y capacidad de edición de archivos Markdown","Limitado a contextos de gestión organizacional y de proyectos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès et des capacités d''édition de fichiers Markdown","Limité aux contextes de gestion organisationnelle et de projets"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff und Bearbeitungsfähigkeiten für Markdown-Dateien","Begrenzt auf organisatorische und Projektmanagement-Kontexte"],"pt":["Requer acesso e capacidade de edição de arquivos Markdown","Limitado a contextos de gestão organizacional e de projeto"],"ru":["Требует доступа и возможности редактирования файлов Markdown","Ограничен контекстами организационного и проектного управления"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول والقدرة على تحرير ملفات Markdown","محدود بالسياقات الإدارية والتنظيمية للمشاريع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-site-widget', 'community', 'weunica', 'payboxCLI-App', 'weunica/payboxCLI-App', 'wix-cli-site-widget', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z', '2026-02-18T12:26:24.157Z', NULL, '{"id":"weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-site-widget","name":"wix-cli-site-widget","description":{"zh":"Wix CLI网站小工具构建器创建自定义元素小工具扩展，允许站点所有者添加交互式、可配置的小工具到他们的页面","ja":"Wix CLIサイトウィジェットビルダーは、カスタム要素ウィジェット拡張を作成し、サイト所有者がページにインタラクティブで設定可能なウィジェットを追加できるようにします","ko":"Wix CLI 사이트 위젯 빌더는 사용자 정의 요소 위젯 확장을 생성하여 사이트 소유자가 페이지에 상호 작용 및 구성 가능한 위젯을 추가할 수 있습니다","pt":"O Wix Site Widget Builder cria extensões de widgets personalizadas para aplicações Wix CLI, permitindo que os proprietários de sites adicionem widgets interativos e configuráveis às suas páginas.","ru":"Wix Site Widget Builder создает пользовательские расширения виджетов для приложений Wix CLI, позволяя владельцам сайтов добавлять интерактивные и настраиваемые виджеты на свои страницы.","ar":"بناء أداة موقع Wix CLI ي创建 امتدادات أداة موقع مخصصة لتطبيقات Wix CLI، مما يسمح لمالكي المواقع بإضافة أدوات موقع تفاعلية وقابلة للتعديل إلى صفحاتهم.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Wix CLI网站小工具构建器","ja":"Wix CLIサイトウィジェットビルダー","ko":"Wix CLI 사이트 위젯 빌더","pt":"Construtor de Widgets de Site Wix CLI","ru":"Wix CLI Сайт Виджет Билдер","ar":"بناء أداة موقع Wix CLI","en":"wix-cli-site-widget"},"description":{"zh":"Wix CLI网站小工具构建器创建自定义元素小工具扩展，允许站点所有者添加交互式、可配置的小工具到他们的页面","ja":"Wix CLIサイトウィジェットビルダーは、カスタム要素ウィジェット拡張を作成し、サイト所有者がページにインタラクティブで設定可能なウィジェットを追加できるようにします","ko":"Wix CLI 사이트 위젯 빌더는 사용자 정의 요소 위젯 확장을 생성하여 사이트 소유자가 페이지에 상호 작용 및 구성 가능한 위젯을 추가할 수 있습니다","pt":"O Wix Site Widget Builder cria extensões de widgets personalizadas para aplicações Wix CLI, permitindo que os proprietários de sites adicionem widgets intera...","ru":"Wix Site Widget Builder создает пользовательские расширения виджетов для приложений Wix CLI, позволяя владельцам сайтов добавлять интерактивные и настраиваем...","ar":"بناء أداة موقع Wix CLI ي创建 امتدادات أداة موقع مخصصة لتطبيقات Wix CLI، مما يسمح لمالكي المواقع بإضافة أدوات موقع تفاعلية وقابلة للتعديل إلى صفحاتهم.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建自定义元素小工具扩展","支持React组件","具有内置设置面板","可以添加交互式小工具到Wix页面","支持Wix Editor"],"ja":["カスタム要素ウィジェット拡張を作成","Reactコンポーネントをサポート","ビルトイン設定パネルを備える","Wixページにインタラクティブなウィジェットを追加","Wix Editorをサポート"],"ko":["사용자 정의 요소 위젯 확장을 생성","React 컴포넌트 지원","내장 설정 패널","Wix 페이지에 상호 작용 위젯 추가","Wix Editor 지원"],"pt":["Criação de widgets personalizados para aplicações Wix CLI","Conversão de componentes React em componentes web","Adição de painel de configuração integrado","Compatibilidade com o Wix Editor","Desenvolvimento de widgets interativos e configuráveis"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских виджетов для приложений Wix CLI","Преобразование компонентов React в веб-компоненты","Добавление встроенного панеля настроек","Совместимость с Wix Editor","Разработка интерактивных и настраиваемых виджетов"],"ar":["إنشاء أدوات موقع مخصصة لتطبيقات Wix CLI","تحويل مكونات React إلى مكونات ويب","إضافة لوحة إعدادات مدمجة","توافق مع محرر Wix","تنمية أدوات موقع تفاعلية وقابلة للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Wix CLI","网站小工具","自定义元素","React组件","Wix Editor","交互式小工具","可配置小工具","网站开发","前端开发"],"ja":["Wix CLI","サイトウィジェット","カスタム要素","Reactコンポーネント","Wix Editor","インタラクティブなウィジェット","設定可能なウィジェット","ウェブ開発","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Wix CLI","사이트 위젯","사용자 정의 요소","React 컴포넌트","Wix Editor","상호 작용 위젯","구성 가능한 위젯","웹 개발","프론트엔드 개발"],"pt":["Wix CLI","Widget de site","Extensão de widget","Desenvolvimento de widget","Wix Editor","Componentes React","Componentes web","Painel de configuração"],"ru":["Wix CLI","Сайт виджет","Расширение виджета","Разработка виджета","Wix Editor","Компоненты React","Веб-компоненты","Панель настроек"],"ar":["Wix CLI","أداة موقع","امتداد أداة","تنمية أداة","محرر Wix","مكونات React","مكونات ويب","لوحة إعدادات"]}},"owner":"weunica","repo":"payboxCLI-App","repoPath":"weunica/payboxCLI-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wix-cli-site-widget","description":"Use when building interactive widgets, custom data displays, or configurable site components with settings panels. Triggers include widget, custom element, interactive component, editor component, configurable widget, web component.","bodyPreview":"# Wix Site Widget Builder\n\nCreates custom element widget extensions for Wix CLI applications. Site widgets are React components converted to web components that appear in the Wix Editor, allowing site owners to add interactive, configurable widgets to their pages with a built-in settings panel.\n\n## Quick Start Checklist\n\nFollow these steps in order when creating a site widget:\n\n1. [ ] Create widget folder: `src/site/widgets/custom-elements/<widget-name>/`\n2. [ ] Create `widget.tsx` with React co","body":"# Wix Site Widget Builder\n\nCreates custom element widget extensions for Wix CLI applications. Site widgets are React components converted to web components that appear in the Wix Editor, allowing site owners to add interactive, configurable widgets to their pages with a built-in settings panel.\n\n## Quick Start Checklist\n\nFollow these steps in order when creating a site widget:\n\n1. [ ] Create widget folder: `src/site/widgets/custom-elements/<widget-name>/`\n2. [ ] Create `widget.tsx` with React component and `reactToWebComponent` conversion\n3. [ ] Create `panel.tsx` with WDS components and `widget.getProp/setProp`\n4. [ ] Create `extensions.ts` with `extensions.customElement()` and unique UUID\n5. [ ] Update `src/extensions.ts` to import and use the new extension\n\n## Architecture\n\nSite widgets consist of **two required files**:\n\n### 1. Widget Component (`widget.tsx`)\n\nReact component converted to a web component using `react-to-webcomponent`:\n\n- Define Props interface with configurable properties (camelCase)\n- Create a React functional component that renders the widget UI\n- Convert to web component with props mapping\n- Use inline styles (no CSS imports)\n- Handle Wix Editor environment when using Wix Data API\n\n### 2. Settings Panel (`panel.tsx`)\n\nSettings panel shown in the Wix Editor sidebar:\n\n- Uses Wix Design System components (see [references/SETTINGS_PANEL.md](references/SETTINGS_PANEL.md))\n- Manages widget properties via `@wix/editor` widget API\n- Loads initial values with `widget.getProp(''kebab-case-name'')`\n- Updates properties with `widget.setProp(''kebab-case-name'', value)`\n- Wrapped in `WixDesignSystemProvider > SidePanel > SidePanel.Content`\n\n## Widget Component Pattern\n\n```typescript\nimport React, { type FC, useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport ReactDOM from \"react-dom\";\nimport reactToWebComponent from \"react-to-webcomponent\";\n\ninterface WidgetProps {\n  title?: string;\n  targetDate?: string;\n  bgColor?: string;\n  textColor?: string;\n  font?: string;\n}\n\nconst CustomElement: FC<WidgetProps> = ({\n  title = \"Default Title\",\n  targetDate = \"\",\n  bgColor = \"#ffffff\",\n  textColor = \"#333333\",\n  font = \"{}\",\n}) => {\n  // Parse font if needed\n  const { font: textFont, textDecoration } = JSON.parse(font);\n\n  // Component logic and state\n  const [data, setData] = useState(null);\n\n  // Use inline styles\n  const styles = {\n    wrapper: {\n      display: \"flex\",\n      flexDirection: \"column\",\n      padding: \"20px\",\n      backgroundColor: bgColor,\n      color: textColor,\n      fontFamily: textFont || \"inherit\",\n    },\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div style={styles.wrapper}>\n      {title && <h2 style={{ margin: 0 }}>{title}</h2>}\n      {/* Widget content */}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n\n// Convert to web component\nconst customElement = reactToWebComponent(CustomElement, React, ReactDOM, {\n  props: {\n    title: \"string\",\n    targetDate: \"string\",\n    bgColor: \"string\",\n    textColor: \"string\",\n    font: \"string\",\n  },\n});\n\nexport default customElement;\n```\n\n**Key Points:**\n\n- Props interface uses **camelCase** (e.g., `targetDate`, `bgColor`)\n- `reactToWebComponent` config uses camelCase keys with `''string''` type\n- All props are passed as strings from the web component\n- Use inline styles, not CSS imports\n- Parse complex props (like `font`) from JSON strings if needed\n\n## Settings Panel Pattern\n\n```typescript\nimport React, { type FC, useState, useEffect, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport { widget } from \"@wix/editor\";\nimport {\n  SidePanel,\n  WixDesignSystemProvider,\n  Input,\n  FormField,\n  Box,\n} from \"@wix/design-system\";\nimport \"@wix/design-system/styles.global.css\";\n\nconst Panel: FC = () => {\n  const [title, setTitle] = useState<string>(\"\");\n  const [targetDate, setTargetDate] = useState<string>(\"\");\n  const [bgColor, setBgColor] = useState<string>(\"#ffffff\");\n\n  // Load initial values (kebab-case prop names)\n  useEffect(() => {\n    Promise.all([\n      widget.getProp(\"title\"),\n      widget.getProp(\"target-date\"),\n      widget.getProp(\"bg-color\"),\n    ])\n      .then(([titleVal, dateVal, bgColorVal]) => {\n        setTitle(titleVal || \"\");\n        setTargetDate(dateVal || \"\");\n        setBgColor(bgColorVal || \"#ffffff\");\n      })\n      .catch((error) =>\n        console.error(\"Failed to fetch widget properties:\", error)\n      );\n  }, []);\n\n  // Update both local state and widget prop (kebab-case)\n  const handleTitleChange = useCallback(\n    (event: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\n      const newTitle = event.target.value;\n      setTitle(newTitle);\n      widget.setProp(\"title\", newTitle);\n    },\n    []\n  );\n\n  const handleDateChange = useCallback(\n    (event: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\n      const newDate = event.target.value;\n      setTargetDate(newDate);\n      widget.setProp(\"target-date\", newDate);\n    },\n    []\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <WixDesignSystemProvider>\n      <SidePanel width=\"300\" height=\"100vh\">\n        <SidePanel.Header title=\"Widget Settings\" />\n        <SidePanel.Content noPadding stretchVertically>\n          <Box direction=\"vertical\" gap=\"24px\">\n            <SidePanel.Field>\n              <FormField label=\"Title\">\n                <Input\n                  type=\"text\"\n                  value={title}\n                  onChange={handleTitleChange}\n                  placeholder=\"Enter title\"\n                />\n              </FormField>\n            </SidePanel.Field>\n\n            <SidePanel.Field>\n              <FormField label=\"Target Date\">\n                <Input\n                  type=\"date\"\n                  value={targetDate}\n                  onChange={handleDateChange}\n                />\n              </FormField>\n            </SidePanel.Field>\n          </Box>\n        </SidePanel.Content>\n      </SidePanel>\n    </WixDesignSystemProvider>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Panel;\n```\n\n**Key Points:**\n\n- Prop names in `widget.getProp()` and `widget.setProp()` use **kebab-case** (e.g., `\"target-date\"`, `\"bg-color\"`)\n- Always update both local state AND widget prop in onChange handlers\n- Wrap content in `WixDesignSystemProvider > SidePanel > SidePanel.Content`\n- Use WDS components from `@wix/design-system` (see [references/SETTINGS_PANEL.md](references/SETTINGS_PANEL.md))\n- Import `@wix/design-system/styles.global.css` for styles\n\n## Props Naming Convention\n\n**Critical:** Props use different naming conventions in each file:\n\n| File                           | Convention | Example                                       |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `widget.tsx` (Props interface) | camelCase  | `targetDate`, `bgColor`, `textColor`          |\n| `panel.tsx` (widget API)       | kebab-case | `\"target-date\"`, `\"bg-color\"`, `\"text-color\"` |\n| `reactToWebComponent` config   | camelCase  | `targetDate: ''string''`                        |\n\nThe web component automatically converts between camelCase (React props) and kebab-case (HTML attributes).\n\n## Wix Data API Integration\n\nWhen using Wix Data API in widgets, you **must** handle the Wix Editor environment gracefully:\n\n```typescript\nimport { items } from \"@wix/data\";\nimport { window as wixWindow } from \"@wix/site-window\";\n\nconst CustomElement: FC<WidgetProps> = ({ collectionId }) => {\n  const [data, setData] = useState(null);\n  const [isEditor, setIsEditor] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const loadData = async () => {\n      const currentViewMode = await wixWindow.viewMode();\n\n      if (currentViewMode === \"Editor\") {\n        // Don''t fetch data in editor - show placeholder\n        setIsEditor(true);\n        return;\n      }\n\n      // Fetch real data only on live site\n      try {\n        const results = await items.query(collectionId).limit(10).find();\n        setData(results.items);\n      } catch (error) {\n        console.error(\"Failed to load data:\", error);\n      }\n    };\n\n    loadData();\n  }, [collectionId]);\n\n  if (isEditor) {\n    return (\n      <div style={{ padding: \"20px\", border: \"2px dashed #ccc\" }}>\n        <p>Widget will display data on the live site</p>\n        <p>Collection: {collectionId}</p>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Render widget with real data\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {data?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.title}</div>\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n- Import `{ window as wixWindow }` from `\"@wix/site-window\"`\n- Check `await wixWindow.viewMode()` before fetching data\n- If `viewMode === ''Editor''`, show a placeholder UI instead\n- Only fetch and render real data when NOT in editor mode\n\n## Font Selection\n\nFor font selection in settings panels, use `FontPickerField` component with `inputs.selectFont()`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { inputs } from \"@wix/editor\";\nimport { FontPickerField } from \"./components/FontPickerField\";\n\nconst Panel: FC = () => {\n  const [font, setFont] = useState({ font: \"\", textDecoration: \"\" });\n\n  const handleFontChange = async () => {\n    const selectedFont = await inputs.selectFont();\n    if (selectedFont) {\n      const fontValue = {\n        font: selectedFont.fontFamily || \"\",\n        textDecoration: selectedFont.textDecoration || \"\",\n      };\n      setFont(fontValue);\n      widget.setProp(\"font\", JSON.stringify(fontValue));\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <FontPickerField\n      label=\"Text Font\"\n      value={font}\n      onChange={handleFontChange}\n    />\n  );\n};\n```\n\n**Important:** Use `inputs.selectFont()` from `@wix/editor`, NOT a text Input. This provides a rich font picker dialog with bold, italic, size, and typography features.\n\n## Output Structure\n\n```\nsrc/site/widgets/custom-elements/\n└── {widget-name}/\n    ├── widget.tsx           # Main widget component\n    ├── panel.tsx            # Settings panel component\n    ├── extensions.ts         # Extension registration\n    ├── components/          # Optional sub-components\n    │   ├── ColorPickerField.tsx\n    │   └── FontPickerField.tsx\n    └── utils/               # Optional helper functions\n        └── formatters.ts\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Countdown Timer Widget\n\n**Request:** \"Create a countdown timer widget\"\n\n**Output:**\n\n- Widget with configurable title, target date/time, colors, and font\n- Settings panel with date picker, time input, color pickers, font picker\n- Real-time countdown display with days, hours, minutes, seconds\n\n### Product Showcase Widget\n\n**Request:** \"Create a widget that displays products from a collection\"\n\n**Output:**\n\n- Widget that queries Wix Data collection\n- Editor environment handling (shows placeholder in editor)\n- Settings panel for collection selection, display options, styling\n- Responsive grid layout with product cards\n\n### Interactive Calculator Widget\n\n**Request:** \"Create a calculator widget with customizable colors\"\n\n**Output:**\n\n- Functional calculator component\n- Settings panel for color customization (background, buttons, text)\n- Inline styles for all styling\n- No external dependencies\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics\n\nAvoid generic aesthetics. Create distinctive designs with unique fonts (avoid Inter, Roboto, Arial), cohesive color palettes, CSS animations for micro-interactions, and context-specific choices. Don''t use clichéd color schemes or predictable layouts.\n\n## Extension Registration\n\n**Extension registration is MANDATORY and has TWO required steps.**\n\n### Step 1: Create Widget-Specific Extension File\n\nEach site widget requires an `extensions.ts` file in its folder:\n\n```typescript\nimport { extensions } from \"@wix/astro/builders\";\n\nexport const sitewidgetMyWidget = extensions.customElement({\n  id: \"{{GENERATE_UUID}}\",\n  name: \"My Widget\",\n  tagName: \"my-widget\",\n  element: \"./site/widgets/custom-elements/my-widget/widget.tsx\",\n  settings: \"./site/widgets/custom-elements/my-widget/panel.tsx\",\n  installation: {\n    autoAdd: true,\n  },\n  width: {\n    defaultWidth: 500,\n    allowStretch: true,\n  },\n  height: {\n    defaultHeight: 500,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**CRITICAL: UUID Generation**\n\nThe `id` must be a unique, static UUID v4 string. Generate a fresh UUID for each extension - do NOT use `randomUUID()` or copy UUIDs from examples. Replace `{{GENERATE_UUID}}` with a freshly generated UUID like `\"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\"`.\n\n| Property       | Type   | Description                            |\n| -------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `id`           | string | Unique static UUID v4 (generate fresh) |\n| `name`         | string | Display name in editor                 |\n| `tagName`      | string | HTML custom element tag (kebab-case)   |\n| `element`      | string | Path to widget React component         |\n| `settings`     | string | Path to settings panel component       |\n| `installation` | object | Auto-add behavior                      |\n| `width`        | object | Default width and stretch settings     |\n| `height`       | object | Default height settings                |\n\n### Step 2: Register in Main Extensions File\n\n**CRITICAL:** After creating the widget-specific extension file, you MUST read [wix-cli-extension-registration](../wix-cli-extension-registration/SKILL.md) and follow the \"App Registration\" section to update `src/extensions.ts`.\n\n**Without completing Step 2, the site widget will not be available in the Wix Editor.**\n\n## Code Quality Requirements\n\n- Strict TypeScript (no `any`, explicit return types)\n- Functional React components with hooks\n- Proper error handling and loading states\n- No `@ts-ignore` comments\n- Inline styles only (no CSS imports)\n- Handle Wix Editor environment when using Wix Data API\n- Consistent prop naming (camelCase in widget, kebab-case in panel)\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter implementation completes, the **wix-cli-orchestrator** will run validation using [wix-cli-app-validation](../wix-cli-app-validation/SKILL.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:26:24.157Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing custom Wix site widget development with React and web components.","zh":"非常适合需要使用React和Web组件进行自定义Wix站点小部件开发的前端代理。","ja":"ReactとWebコンポーネントを使用したカスタムWixサイトウィジェット開発を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 웹 컴포넌트를 사용하여 사용자 지정 Wix 사이트 위젯 개발이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan desarrollo de widgets de sitios personalizados de Wix con React y componentes web.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de développement de widgets de site personnalisés Wix avec React et composants Web.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte Wix-Website-Widget-Entwicklung mit React und Webkomponenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de desenvolvimento de widgets personalizados do site Wix com React e componentes da web.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо создавать пользовательские виджеты сайта Wix с использованием React и веб-компонентов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير عناصر وIDGET مخصصة لموقع Wix باستخدام React ومكونات الويب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive, configurable site widgets for the Wix Editor, leveraging React components and web components with built-in settings panels, utilizing Wix CLI applications and TypeScript.","zh":"赋予代理创建交互式、可配置的站点小部件的能力，用于Wix编辑器，利用React组件和Web组件以及内置设置面板，使用Wix CLI应用程序和TypeScript。","ja":"Wixエディター用のインタラクティブで構成可能なサイトウィジェットを作成するエージェントをEmpowerします。ReactコンポーネントとWebコンポーネントを活用し、内蔵の設定パネルを使用し、Wix CLIアプリケーションとTypeScriptを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Wix 편집기에 대한 상호 작용형 및 구성 가능한 사이트 위젯을 만들 수 있도록 합니다. React 구성 요소 및 웹 구성 요소를 활용하고 내장 설정 패널을 사용하며 Wix CLI 애플리케이션 및 TypeScript를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear widgets de sitio interactivos y configurables para el Editor de Wix, aprovechando componentes de React y componentes web con paneles de configuración integrados, utilizando aplicaciones de Wix CLI y TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des widgets de site interactifs et configurables pour l''Éditeur Wix, en exploitant les composants React et les composants Web avec des panneaux de paramètres intégrés, en utilisant les applications Wix CLI et TypeScript.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, interaktive, konfigurierbare Site-Widgets für den Wix-Editor zu erstellen, indem React-Komponenten und Webkomponenten mit integrierten Einstellungspanels genutzt werden, unter Einsatz von Wix-CLI-Anwendungen und TypeScript.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem widgets de site interativos e configuráveis para o Editor Wix, aproveitando componentes React e componentes da web com painéis de configuração integrados, utilizando aplicativos Wix CLI e TypeScript.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать интерактивные и настраиваемые виджеты сайта для редактора Wix, используя компоненты React и веб-компоненты с встроенными панелями настроек, а также приложения Wix CLI и TypeScript.","ar":"يمنح العملاء khả्षमत إنشاء عناصر وIDGET تفاعلية وقابلة للتكوين لمحرر Wix، مستفيدا من مكونات React ومكونات الويب مع لوحات إعدادات مدمجة، باستخدام تطبيقات Wix CLI وTypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom site widgets with React and web components","Creating interactive site elements for Wix Editor pages","Developing configurable widgets with built-in settings panels"],"zh":["使用React和Web组件构建自定义站点小部件","为Wix编辑器页面创建交互式站点元素","使用内置设置面板开发可配置的小部件"],"ja":["ReactとWebコンポーネントを使用してカスタムサイトウィジェットを構築する","Wixエディターのページ用のインタラクティブなサイト要素を作成する","内蔵の設定パネルを使用して構成可能なウィジェットを開発する"],"ko":["React 및 웹 컴포넌트를 사용하여 사용자 지정 사이트 위젯을 구축하는 것","Wix 편집기 페이지에 대한 상호 작용형 사이트 요소를 생성하는 것","내장 설정 패널을 사용하여 구성 가능한 위젯을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Creación de widgets de sitio personalizados con React y componentes web","Creación de elementos de sitio interactivos para páginas del Editor de Wix","Desarrollo de widgets configurables con paneles de configuración integrados"],"fr":["Création de widgets de site personnalisés avec React et composants Web","Création d''éléments de site interactifs pour les pages de l''Éditeur Wix","Développement de widgets configurables avec des panneaux de paramètres intégrés"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Site-Widgets mit React und Webkomponenten","Erstellung interaktiver Site-Elemente für Wix-Editor-Seiten","Entwicklung konfigurierbarer Widgets mit integrierten Einstellungspanels"],"pt":["Construção de widgets de site personalizados com React e componentes da web","Criação de elementos de site interativos para páginas do Editor Wix","Desenvolvimento de widgets configuráveis com painéis de configuração integrados"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских виджетов сайта с использованием React и веб-компонентов","Создание интерактивных элементов сайта для страниц редактора Wix","Разработка настраиваемых виджетов с встроенными панелями настроек"],"ar":["بناء عناصر وIDGET مخصصة لموقع الويب باستخدام React ومكونات الويب","إنشاء عناصر موقع تفاعلية للصفحات التي تقوم بتعديلها Wix","تطوير عناصر وIDGET قابلة للتكوين مع لوحات إعدادات مدمجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Wix CLI application setup","Limited to React and web components","Needs TypeScript configuration"],"zh":["需要Wix CLI应用程序设置","仅限React和Web组件","需要TypeScript配置"],"ja":["Wix CLIアプリケーションのセットアップが必要","ReactとWebコンポーネントに限定される","TypeScriptの構成が必要"],"ko":["Wix CLI 애플리케이션 설정이 필요합니다.","React 및 웹 컴포넌트로 제한됩니다.","TypeScript 구성이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de la aplicación Wix CLI","Limitado a React y componentes web","Requiere configuración de TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de l''application Wix CLI","Limité à React et aux composants Web","Nécessite la configuration de TypeScript"],"de":["Erfordert Wix-CLI-Anwendungskonfiguration","Begrenzt auf React und Webkomponenten","Benötigt TypeScript-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Requer configuração do aplicativo Wix CLI","Limitado a React e componentes da web","Necessita de configuração do TypeScript"],"ru":["Требуется настройка приложения Wix CLI","Ограничен только React и веб-компонентами","Требуется настройка TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق Wix CLI","محدود بالreact ومكونات الويب","يحتاج إلى إعداد TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
