itt","pt":"Bibliotecas Recomendadas para Progresso de Projeto","ru":"Рекомендуемые библиотеки для прогресса проекта","ar":"مكتبات متوافق مع تقدم المشروع","en":"recommended-library-for-project-progress"},"description":{"zh":"为了管理复杂的组件拆解场景，我们推荐使用React Three Fiber (R3F) 和 @react-three/drei库","ja":"複雑なコンポーネントの分解シナリオを管理するために、React Three Fiber (R3F) と @react-three/dreiライブラリを推奨します","ko":"복잡한 컴포넌트 분해 시나리오를 관리하기 위해 React Three Fiber (R3F)와 @react-three/drei 라이브러리를 추천합니다","es":"La biblioteca recomendada para el progreso del proyecto es una combinación de React Three Fiber y @react-three/drei para una gestión eficiente de componentes","fr":"La bibliothèque recommandée pour le progrès du projet est une combinaison de React Three Fiber et @react-three/drei pour une gestion efficace des composants","de":"Die empfohlene Bibliothek für den Projektfortschritt ist eine Kombination aus React Three Fiber und @react-three/drei für eine effiziente Komponentenverwaltung","pt":"As bibliotecas recomendadas para o progresso do projeto incluem React Three Fiber e @react-three/drei para gerenciar componentes complexos","ru":"Рекомендуемые библиотеки для прогресса проекта включают React Three Fiber и @react-three/drei для управления сложными компонентами","ar":"تشمل المكتبات الموصى بها للتقدم في المشروع React Three Fiber و @react-three/drei لإدارة المكونات المعقدة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["declarative Three.js开发","易于组件化","高效的状态管理","可扩展性","提高管理效率"],"ja":["Declarative Three.js開発","コンポーネント化の容易さ","効率的な状態管理","拡張性","管理効率の向上"],"ko":["선언적 Three.js 개발","컴포넌트화의 용이성","효율적인 상태 관리","확장성","관리 효율의 향상"],"es":["Desarrollo declarativo de Three.js dentro de React","Facilita la componentización de partes y la gestión eficiente del estado","Maximiza la eficiencia de la gestión mediante la organización de componentes","Permite la escalabilidad y la flexibilidad en la gestión de componentes","Mejora la eficiencia en la gestión de componentes complejos","Facilita la colaboración y el intercambio de componentes"],"fr":["Développement déclaratif de Three.js à l''intérieur de React","Facilite la composition de parties et la gestion efficace de l''état","Maximise l''efficacité de la gestion en organisant les composants","Permet la scalabilité et la flexibilité dans la gestion de composants","Améliore l''efficacité dans la gestion de composants complexes","Facilite la collaboration et l''échange de composants"],"de":["Declarative Entwicklung von Three.js innerhalb von React","Erleichtert die Komponentenzerlegung und die effiziente Zustandsverwaltung","Maximiert die Effizienz der Verwaltung durch die Organisation von Komponenten","Ermöglicht die Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität bei der Verwaltung von Komponenten","Verbessert die Effizienz bei der Verwaltung komplexer Komponenten","Erleichtert die Zusammenarbeit und den Austausch von Komponenten"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento declarativo com Three.js dentro do React","Facilita a componentização de partes e gerenciamento de estado","Maximiza a eficiência de gerenciamento com organização de componentes","Permite escalabilidade suave em cenários complexos","Inclui bibliotecas como React Three Fiber e @react-three/drei"],"ru":["Декларативное развитие с Three.js внутри React","Облегчает компонентизацию частей и управление состоянием","Максимизирует эффективность управления с организацией компонентов","Позволяет масштабируемость в сложных сценариях","Включает библиотеки как React Three Fiber и @react-three/drei"],"ar":["التطوير الإقراري مع Three.js داخل React","تسهل مكونات الأجزاء وإدارة الحالة","توسع كفاءة الإدارة بتنظيم المكونات","تمكن من التوسع السلس في السيناريوهات المعقدة","تشمل مكتبات مثل React Three Fiber و @react-three/drei"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目进度","推荐库","React Three Fiber","Three.js","组件化","状态管理","可扩展性"],"ja":["プロジェクト進度","推奨ライブラリ","React Three Fiber","Three.js","コンポーネント化","状態管理","拡張性"],"ko":["프로젝트 진행","추천 라이브러리","React Three Fiber","Three.js","컴포넌트화","상태 관리","확장성"],"es":["bibliotecas de proyecto","React Three Fiber","desarrollo de componentes","gestión de estado","escalabilidad","flexibilidad","colaboración","intercambio de componentes"],"fr":["bibliothèques de projet","React Three Fiber","développement de composants","gestion de l''état","scalabilité","flexibilité","collaboration","échange de composants"],"de":["Projektbibliotheken","React Three Fiber","Komponentenentwicklung","Zustandsverwaltung","Skalierbarkeit","Flexibilität","Zusammenarbeit","Austausch von Komponenten"],"pt":["bibliotecas recomendadas","projetos complexos","React Three Fiber","@react-three/drei","desenvolvimento declarativo","componentização","gerenciamento de estado","escalabilidade"],"ru":["рекомендуемые библиотеки","сложные проекты","React Three Fiber","@react-three/drei","декларативное развитие","компонентизация","управление состоянием","масштабируемость"],"ar":["مكتبات متوافق","مشاريع معقدة","React Three Fiber","@react-three/drei","التطوير الإقراري","مكونات","إدارة الحالة","قابلية التوسع"]}},"owner":"sonaspo855","repo":"lg-electronics-repair-3d","repoPath":"sonaspo855/lg-electronics-repair-3d","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"recommended-library-for-project-progress","description":"A brief description, shown to the model to help it understand when to use this skill","bodyPreview":"## 1. Recommended Tech Stack & Libraries\n\nTo manage complex component disassembly scenarios smoothly and with scalability, we propose the following library combinations:\n\n- **React Three Fiber (R3F) & @react-three/drei:** - Enables declarative Three.js development within React, facilitating easy componentization of parts and efficient state management.\n    \n    - **Componentization**:\n        \n        - Maximize management efficiency by organizing cabinet covers, doors, and screws into independe","body":"## 1. Recommended Tech Stack & Libraries\n\nTo manage complex component disassembly scenarios smoothly and with scalability, we propose the following library combinations:\n\n- **React Three Fiber (R3F) & @react-three/drei:** - Enables declarative Three.js development within React, facilitating easy componentization of parts and efficient state management.\n    \n    - **Componentization**:\n        \n        - Maximize management efficiency by organizing cabinet covers, doors, and screws into independent React components.\n            \n    - **LOD (Level of Detail)**:\n        \n        - Optimize web browser performance by adjusting rendering quality of large components based on camera distance.\n            \n    - **Declarative Structure**:\n        \n        - Improve readability and maintainability by managing PCBs, harnesses, and screws as separate React components.\n            \n    - **useGLTF**:\n        \n        - Efficiently loads and caches high-resolution PCB models.\n            \n        - Dramatically reduces development time for lighting and environment setup using `useGLTF`, `PresentationControls`, and `Environment`.\n            \n    - **ContactShadows**:\n        \n        - Enhances three-dimensional depth by processing real-time shadows when the drainage tank is removed from the main body.\n            \n- **Framer Motion 3D:** - Powerful for ''Sequence-based'' animations that are more complex than standard animations.\n    \n    - Integrates seamlessly with R3F to declaratively control movement and rotation values.\n        \n- GSAP (GreenSock Animation Platform): - Timeline Control:\n    \n    - Enables precise, second-by-second design of complex sequences, such as multiple screws unscrewing in order followed by the PCB being lifted.\n    \n    - **Linear Movement Optimization**:\n        \n        - Best for applying sophisticated mathematical Easing formulas (e.g., \"fast start, smooth stop\") when implementing logic like `animateLinearMove`.\n            \n- **Skinned Mesh & Bones (Cable Representation):**\n    \n    - Strongly recommended for harness (cable) disconnection to achieve realistic effects where wires bend and slide out naturally, rather than moving in simple straight lines.\n        \n- **Physics-based Animation (CANNON.js, etc.):**\n    \n    - Can provide a realistic disassembly experience by applying subtle gravity or collision effects when the cabinet cover is detached.\n        \n- **Zustand (State Management):**\n    \n    - Ideal for managing the start and end states of animations by detecting user click events.\n        \n- **Pivot Point Setup:** - Since parts must move around hinges or specific axes rather than rotating in place, a prerequisite is creating virtual **Pivots (Groups)** in the 3D modeling stage or via code to reset the hierarchy.\n    \n- **Easing Function Utilization:** - Apply mathematical deceleration formulas like `power2.out` to ensure parts stop smoothly, mimicking actual physical laws.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:26:24.282Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced 3D visualization and component management capabilities within React.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 3D 可视化和组件管理功能的前端代理，特别是在 React 中。","ja":"React 内で高度な 3D 可視化とコンポーネント管理機能を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 내에서 고급 3D 시각화 및 컴포넌트 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades de visualización 3D avanzadas y gestión de componentes dentro de React.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités de visualisation 3D avancées et de gestion de composants au sein de React.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte 3D-Visualisierungs- und Komponentenverwaltungsfunktionen innerhalb von React benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização 3D e gestão de componentes dentro do React.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности 3D-визуализации и управления компонентами в React.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة في التصور ثلاثي الأبعاد وإدارة المكونات داخل React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to declaratively develop Three.js applications within React using React Three Fiber (R3F) and @react-three/drei, facilitating efficient state management and componentization of complex parts like cabinet covers, doors, and screws.","zh":"赋予代理在 React 中使用 React Three Fiber (R3F) 和 @react-three/drei 进行声明式开发 Three.js 应用程序的能力，促进复杂组件（如柜门、门、螺丝等）状态管理和组件化的高效实现。","ja":"React Three Fiber (R3F) と @react-three/drei を使用して React 内で宣言的に Three.js アプリケーションを開発できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、キャビネットカバー、ドア、ネジなどの複雑なパーツの状態管理とコンポーネント化を効率化します。","ko":"React 내에서 React Three Fiber (R3F) 및 @react-three/drei를 사용하여 선언적 방식으로 Three.js 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화하여, 캐비닛 커버, 문, 나사 등과 같은 복잡한 부품의 상태 관리 및 컴포넌트화를 효율적으로 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones Three.js de forma declarativa dentro de React utilizando React Three Fiber (R3F) y @react-three/drei, lo que facilita una gestión de estado eficiente y la componentización de partes complejas como cubiertas de armarios, puertas y tornillos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications Three.js de manière déclarative au sein de React en utilisant React Three Fiber (R3F) et @react-three/drei, ce qui facilite une gestion d''état efficace et la componentisation de parties complexes comme des couvercles de placards, des portes et des vis.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Three.js-Anwendungen deklarativ innerhalb von React mithilfe von React Three Fiber (R3F) und @react-three/drei zu entwickeln, was eine effiziente Zustandsverwaltung und die Komponentenisierung komplexer Teile wie Schrankschubladen, Türen und Schrauben erleichtert.","pt":"Permite que os agentes desenvolvam aplicações Three.js de forma declarativa dentro do React usando React Three Fiber (R3F) e @react-three/drei, facilitando a gestão eficiente de estado e a componentização de peças complexas como tampas de armário, portas e parafusos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам декларативно разрабатывать приложения Three.js в React с использованием React Three Fiber (R3F) и @react-three/drei, способствуя эффективному управлению состоянием и компонентизации сложных деталей, таких как крышки шкафов, двери и винты.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تطوير تطبيقات Three.js بشكل تصريحي داخل React باستخدام React Three Fiber (R3F) و @react-three/drei، مما يسهل الإدارة الفعالة للحالة وتكوين مكونات الأجزاء المعقدة مثل أغطية الخزانات والأبواب والمسامير."},"useCases":{"en":["Componentizing complex 3D models for efficient rendering","Managing scalable and interactive 3D scenes with React","Streamlining the development of 3D disassembly scenarios"],"zh":["为复杂 3D 模型提供高效的渲染组件化","使用 React 管理可扩展且交互的 3D 场景","简化 3D 拆解场景的开发"],"ja":["複雑な 3D モデルを効率的にレンダリングするコンポーネント化","React を使用して拡張可能なインタラクティブな 3D シーンを管理","3D 分解シナリオの開発を簡素化"],"ko":["복잡한 3D 모델을 효율적으로 렌더링하는 컴포넌트화","React를 사용하여 확장 가능하며 상호 작용하는 3D 장면을 관리","3D 분해 시나리오의 개발을 단순화"],"es":["Componentizar modelos 3D complejos para un renderizado eficiente","Gestionar escenas 3D escalables e interactivas con React","Optimizar el desarrollo de escenarios de desensamblaje 3D"],"fr":["Composant des modèles 3D complexes pour un rendu efficace","Gérer des scènes 3D escalables et interactives avec React","Optimiser le développement de scénarios de désassemblage 3D"],"de":["Komplexere 3D-Modelle für ein effizientes Rendering komponentisieren","Skalierbare und interaktive 3D-Szenen mit React verwalten","Die Entwicklung von 3D-Demontageszenarien optimieren"],"pt":["Componentização de modelos 3D complexos para renderização eficiente","Gestão de cenas 3D escaláveis e interativas com React","Simplificação do desenvolvimento de cenários de desmontagem 3D"],"ru":["Компонентизация сложных 3D-моделей для эффективного рендеринга","Управление масштабируемыми и интерактивными 3D-сценами с помощью React","Упрощение разработки сценариев 3D-разборки"],"ar":["تكوين نماذج ثلاثية الأبعاد معقدة للتقديم الفعال","إدارة مشاهد ثلاثية الأبعاد قابلة للتطوير والتتفاعل مع React","تبسيط تطوير سيناريوهات التفكيك ثلاثية الأبعاد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React environment","Three.js compatibility needed","Specifically tailored for declarative 3D development within React"],"zh":["需要 React 环境","需要 Three.js 兼容性","特别为 React 中的声明式 3D 开发而设计"],"ja":["React 環境が必要","Three.js との互換性が必要","React 内での宣言的 3D 開発用に特化"],"ko":["React 환경이 필요","Three.js와의 호환성이 필요","React 내에서의 선언적 3D 개발을 위해 특별히 설계"],"es":["Requiere entorno de React","Se necesita compatibilidad con Three.js","Específicamente diseñado para el desarrollo 3D declarativo dentro de React"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React","La compatibilité avec Three.js est nécessaire","Conçu spécifiquement pour le développement 3D déclaratif au sein de React"],"de":["Benötigt React-Umgebung","Three.js-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Speziell für die deklarative 3D-Entwicklung innerhalb von React konzipiert"],"pt":["Requer um ambiente React","Necessita de compatibilidade com Three.js","Especificamente adaptado para desenvolvimento 3D declarativo dentro do React"],"ru":["Требуется среда React","Необходима совместимость с Three.js","Специально предназначен для декларативной 3D-разработки в React"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React","يلزم التوافق مع Three.js","مصمم خصيصًا للتطوير التصريحي ثلاثي الأبعاد داخل React"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
