ration von nativen Modulen und Schriftarten","Strukturierung von Monorepo-Projekten mit na"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho","Implementação de animações","Padrões de UI","Otimizações de plataforma","Configuração de módulos nativos","Estruturação de projetos monorepo"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности","Реализация анимаций","Шаблоны UI","Платформенные оптимизации","Настройка родных модулей","Структуризация проектов monorepo"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","تنفيذ الرسوم المتحركة","أنماط الواجهة","ضبط المنصة","تكوين الوحدات الأصلية","هيكلة مشاريع مونوربو"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native","Expo","Vercel","技术技能","性能优化","动画实现","UI 模式","平台特定优化"],"ja":["React Native","Expo","Vercel","スキル","パフォーマンスの最適化","アニメーションの実装","UI パターン","プラットフォーム固有の最適化"],"ko":["React Native","Expo","Vercel","기술 스킬","성능 최적화","애니메이션 구현","UI 패턴","플랫폼 특정 최적화"],"es":["React Native","Expo","mejores prácticas","rendimiento","animaciones","UI","optimización de plataforma","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["React Native","Expo","meilleures pratiques","performances","animations","UI","optimisation de plateforme","développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["React Native","Expo","beste Praktiken","Leistung","Animationen","UI","Plattformoptimierung","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen"],"pt":["React Native","Expo","desenvolvimento móvel","otimização de desempenho","animações","UI","monorepo"],"ru":["React Native","Expo","мобильная разработка","оптимизация производительности","анимации","UI","monorepo"],"ar":["ري액ت نيتيف","إكسبو","تطوير الجوال","تحسين الأداء","الرسوم المتحركة","الواجهة","مونوربو"]}},"owner":"theonizs","repo":"my-pearl-page","repoPath":"theonizs/my-pearl-page","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-native-skills","description":"","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# React Native Skills\n\nComprehensive best practices for React Native and Expo applications. Contains\nrules across multiple categories covering performance, animations, UI patterns,\nand platform-specific optimizations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Building React Native or Expo apps\n- Optimizing list and scroll performance\n- Implementing animations with Reanimated\n- Working with images and media\n- Configuring native modules or fonts\n- Structuring monorepo projects with na","body":"# React Native Skills\n\nComprehensive best practices for React Native and Expo applications. Contains\nrules across multiple categories covering performance, animations, UI patterns,\nand platform-specific optimizations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Building React Native or Expo apps\n- Optimizing list and scroll performance\n- Implementing animations with Reanimated\n- Working with images and media\n- Configuring native modules or fonts\n- Structuring monorepo projects with native dependencies\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category         | Impact   | Prefix               |\n| -------- | ---------------- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| 1        | List Performance | CRITICAL | `list-performance-`  |\n| 2        | Animation        | HIGH     | `animation-`         |\n| 3        | Navigation       | HIGH     | `navigation-`        |\n| 4        | UI Patterns      | HIGH     | `ui-`                |\n| 5        | State Management | MEDIUM   | `react-state-`       |\n| 6        | Rendering        | MEDIUM   | `rendering-`         |\n| 7        | Monorepo         | MEDIUM   | `monorepo-`          |\n| 8        | Configuration    | LOW      | `fonts-`, `imports-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. List Performance (CRITICAL)\n\n- `list-performance-virtualize` - Use FlashList for large lists\n- `list-performance-item-memo` - Memoize list item components\n- `list-performance-callbacks` - Stabilize callback references\n- `list-performance-inline-objects` - Avoid inline style objects\n- `list-performance-function-references` - Extract functions outside render\n- `list-performance-images` - Optimize images in lists\n- `list-performance-item-expensive` - Move expensive work outside items\n- `list-performance-item-types` - Use item types for heterogeneous lists\n\n### 2. Animation (HIGH)\n\n- `animation-gpu-properties` - Animate only transform and opacity\n- `animation-derived-value` - Use useDerivedValue for computed animations\n- `animation-gesture-detector-press` - Use Gesture.Tap instead of Pressable\n\n### 3. Navigation (HIGH)\n\n- `navigation-native-navigators` - Use native stack and native tabs over JS navigators\n\n### 4. UI Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- `ui-expo-image` - Use expo-image for all images\n- `ui-image-gallery` - Use Galeria for image lightboxes\n- `ui-pressable` - Use Pressable over TouchableOpacity\n- `ui-safe-area-scroll` - Handle safe areas in ScrollViews\n- `ui-scrollview-content-inset` - Use contentInset for headers\n- `ui-menus` - Use native context menus\n- `ui-native-modals` - Use native modals when possible\n- `ui-measure-views` - Use onLayout, not measure()\n- `ui-styling` - Use StyleSheet.create or Nativewind\n\n### 5. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `react-state-minimize` - Minimize state subscriptions\n- `react-state-dispatcher` - Use dispatcher pattern for callbacks\n- `react-state-fallback` - Show fallback on first render\n- `react-compiler-destructure-functions` - Destructure for React Compiler\n- `react-compiler-reanimated-shared-values` - Handle shared values with compiler\n\n### 6. Rendering (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-text-in-text-component` - Wrap text in Text components\n- `rendering-no-falsy-and` - Avoid falsy && for conditional rendering\n\n### 7. Monorepo (MEDIUM)\n\n- `monorepo-native-deps-in-app` - Keep native dependencies in app package\n- `monorepo-single-dependency-versions` - Use single versions across packages\n\n### 8. Configuration (LOW)\n\n- `fonts-config-plugin` - Use config plugins for custom fonts\n- `imports-design-system-folder` - Organize design system imports\n- `js-hoist-intl` - Hoist Intl object creation\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/list-performance-virtualize.md\nrules/animation-gpu-properties.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:26:00.553Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Agents needing comprehensive React Native and Expo application optimization skills","zh":"适用于需要全面React Native和Expo应用优化技能的移动代理","ja":"React NativeおよびExpoアプリの包括的な最適化スキルが必要なモバイルエージェントに適しています","ko":"전반적인 React Native 및 Expo 애플리케이션 최적화 기술이 필요한 모바일 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes móviles que necesitan habilidades de optimización de aplicaciones de React Native y Expo comprehensivas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents mobiles ayant besoin de compétences complètes en optimisation d''applications React Native et Expo","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Agents, die umfassende Fähigkeiten zur Optimierung von React Native- und Expo-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Móveis que necessitam de habilidades abrangentes de otimização de aplicativos React Native e Expo","ru":"Идеально для мобильных агентов, которым необходимы комплексные навыки оптимизации приложений React Native и Expo","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحمول الذي يحتاج إلى مهارات شاملة لتحسين تطبيقات React Native و Expo"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize list and scroll performance, implement animations with Reanimated, and configure native modules or fonts, leveraging best practices for performance, animations, UI patterns, and platform-specific optimizations in React Native and Expo applications","zh":"赋予代理商优化列表和滚动性能、使用Reanimated实现动画、配置原生模块或字体的能力，利用React Native和Expo应用中的最佳实践，实现性能、动画、UI模式和平台特定优化","ja"