kend"],"ru":["разработка приложений Go","LLMProxy","маршрутизация запросов","управление нагрузкой","Server-Sent Events","OpenAI","разработка бэкенда"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات جوه","LLMProxy","توجيه الطلبات","إدارة الحمل","أحداث الخادم","OpenAI","تطوير الخلفية"]}},"owner":"aiyuekuang","repo":"LLMProxy","repoPath":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"go-backend","description":"Go backend development best practices for LLMProxy. Use when writing Go code, handlers, middleware, or backend services.","bodyPreview":"# Go Backend Skill\n\nBest practices for Go backend development, specifically tailored for LLMProxy architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing Go HTTP handlers\n- Implementing middleware\n- Database operations\n- Error handling and logging\n- Performance optimization\n\n---\n\n# 📁 Project Structure\n\n```\n.\n├── cmd/\n│   └── main.go              # Application entry point\n├── internal/\n│   ├── auth/                # Authentication logic\n│   ├── config/              # Configuration management\n│   ├──","body":"# Go Backend Skill\n\nBest practices for Go backend development, specifically tailored for LLMProxy architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing Go HTTP handlers\n- Implementing middleware\n- Database operations\n- Error handling and logging\n- Performance optimization\n\n---\n\n# 📁 Project Structure\n\n```\n.\n├── cmd/\n│   └── main.go              # Application entry point\n├── internal/\n│   ├── auth/                # Authentication logic\n│   ├── config/              # Configuration management\n│   ├── database/            # Database layer\n│   ├── lb/                  # Load balancing\n│   ├── middleware/          # HTTP middleware\n│   ├── proxy/               # Proxy handlers\n│   └── metrics/             # Monitoring\n├── pkg/                     # Public packages\n├── deployments/             # Deployment configs\n└── docs/                    # Documentation\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔧 Handler Patterns\n\n## Standard Handler Structure\n\n```go\nfunc (h *Handler) HandleRequest(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    ctx := r.Context()\n    \n    // 1. Parse and validate input\n    var req RequestDTO\n    if err := json.NewDecoder(r.Body).Decode(&req); err != nil {\n        h.respondError(w, http.StatusBadRequest, \"invalid request body\")\n        return\n    }\n    \n    if err := h.validator.Validate(req); err != nil {\n        h.respondError(w, http.StatusBadRequest, err.Error())\n        return\n    }\n    \n    // 2. Execute business logic\n    result, err := h.service.Process(ctx, req)\n    if err != nil {\n        h.handleError(w, err)\n        return\n    }\n    \n    // 3. Return response\n    h.respondJSON(w, http.StatusOK, result)\n}\n```\n\n## Response Helpers\n\n```go\ntype Response struct {\n    Success bool        `json:\"success\"`\n    Data    interface{} `json:\"data,omitempty\"`\n    Error   *ErrorInfo  `json:\"error,omitempty\"`\n}\n\ntype ErrorInfo struct {\n    Code    string `json:\"code\"`\n    Message string `json:\"message\"`\n}\n\nfunc (h *Handler) respondJSON(w http.ResponseWriter, status int, data interface{}) {\n    w.Header().Set(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n    w.WriteHeader(status)\n    json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(Response{\n        Success: true,\n        Data:    data,\n    })\n}\n\nfunc (h *Handler) respondError(w http.ResponseWriter, status int, message string) {\n    w.Header().Set(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n    w.WriteHeader(status)\n    json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(Response{\n        Success: false,\n        Error: &ErrorInfo{\n            Code:    http.StatusText(status),\n            Message: message,\n        },\n    })\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# ⚠️ Error Handling\n\n## Custom Error Types\n\n```go\ntype AppError struct {\n    Code       string\n    Message    string\n    HTTPStatus int\n    Err        error\n}\n\nfunc (e *AppError) Error() string {\n    if e.Err != nil {\n        return fmt.Sprintf(\"%s: %v\", e.Message, e.Err)\n    }\n    return e.Message\n}\n\nfunc (e *AppError) Unwrap() error {\n    return e.Err\n}\n\n// Predefined errors\nvar (\n    ErrNotFound      = &AppError{Code: \"NOT_FOUND\", HTTPStatus: 404}\n    ErrUnauthorized  = &AppError{Code: \"UNAUTHORIZED\", HTTPStatus: 401}\n    ErrForbidden     = &AppError{Code: \"FORBIDDEN\", HTTPStatus: 403}\n    ErrBadRequest    = &AppError{Code: \"BAD_REQUEST\", HTTPStatus: 400}\n    ErrInternal      = &AppError{Code: \"INTERNAL_ERROR\", HTTPStatus: 500}\n)\n\nfunc NewNotFoundError(resource string) *AppError {\n    return &AppError{\n        Code:       \"NOT_FOUND\",\n        Message:    fmt.Sprintf(\"%s not found\", resource),\n        HTTPStatus: http.StatusNotFound,\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Error Handling in Handlers\n\n```go\nfunc (h *Handler) handleError(w http.ResponseWriter, err error) {\n    var appErr *AppError\n    if errors.As(err, &appErr) {\n        h.respondError(w, appErr.HTTPStatus, appErr.Message)\n        return\n    }\n    \n    // Log unexpected errors\n    h.logger.Error(\"unexpected error\", zap.Error(err))\n    h.respondError(w, http.StatusInternalServerError, \"internal server error\")\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔒 Middleware Patterns\n\n## Middleware Chain\n\n```go\ntype Middleware func(http.Handler) http.Handler\n\nfunc Chain(middlewares ...Middleware) Middleware {\n    return func(final http.Handler) http.Handler {\n        for i := len(middlewares) - 1; i >= 0; i-- {\n            final = middlewares[i](final)\n        }\n        return final\n    }\n}\n\n// Usage\nhandler := Chain(\n    LoggingMiddleware,\n    RecoveryMiddleware,\n    AuthMiddleware,\n    RateLimitMiddleware,\n)(finalHandler)\n```\n\n## Logging Middleware\n\n```go\nfunc LoggingMiddleware(next http.Handler) http.Handler {\n    return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n        start := time.Now()\n        \n        // Wrap response writer to capture status\n        wrapped := &responseWriter{ResponseWriter: w, status: http.StatusOK}\n        \n        next.ServeHTTP(wrapped, r)\n        \n        logger.Info(\"request\",\n            zap.String(\"method\", r.Method),\n            zap.String(\"path\", r.URL.Path),\n            zap.Int(\"status\", wrapped.status),\n            zap.Duration(\"duration\", time.Since(start)),\n        )\n    })\n}\n\ntype responseWriter struct {\n    http.ResponseWriter\n    status int\n}\n\nfunc (w *responseWriter) WriteHeader(status int) {\n    w.status = status\n    w.ResponseWriter.WriteHeader(status)\n}\n```\n\n## Recovery Middleware\n\n```go\nfunc RecoveryMiddleware(next http.Handler) http.Handler {\n    return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n        defer func() {\n            if err := recover(); err != nil {\n                logger.Error(\"panic recovered\",\n                    zap.Any(\"error\", err),\n                    zap.String(\"stack\", string(debug.Stack())),\n                )\n                http.Error(w, \"Internal Server Error\", http.StatusInternalServerError)\n            }\n        }()\n        next.ServeHTTP(w, r)\n    })\n}\n```\n\n## Auth Middleware\n\n```go\nfunc AuthMiddleware(next http.Handler) http.Handler {\n    return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n        token := r.Header.Get(\"Authorization\")\n        if token == \"\" {\n            http.Error(w, \"unauthorized\", http.StatusUnauthorized)\n            return\n        }\n        \n        // Validate token\n        claims, err := validateToken(strings.TrimPrefix(token, \"Bearer \"))\n        if err != nil {\n            http.Error(w, \"invalid token\", http.StatusUnauthorized)\n            return\n        }\n        \n        // Add claims to context\n        ctx := context.WithValue(r.Context(), userClaimsKey, claims)\n        next.ServeHTTP(w, r.WithContext(ctx))\n    })\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 💾 Database Patterns\n\n## Repository Pattern\n\n```go\ntype UserRepository interface {\n    GetByID(ctx context.Context, id string) (*User, error)\n    Create(ctx context.Context, user *User) error\n    Update(ctx context.Context, user *User) error\n    Delete(ctx context.Context, id string) error\n    List(ctx context.Context, opts ListOptions) ([]*User, error)\n}\n\ntype userRepository struct {\n    db *sql.DB\n}\n\nfunc (r *userRepository) GetByID(ctx context.Context, id string) (*User, error) {\n    query := `SELECT id, name, email, created_at FROM users WHERE id = $1`\n    \n    var user User\n    err := r.db.QueryRowContext(ctx, query, id).Scan(\n        &user.ID, &user.Name, &user.Email, &user.CreatedAt,\n    )\n    if err == sql.ErrNoRows {\n        return nil, ErrNotFound\n    }\n    if err != nil {\n        return nil, fmt.Errorf(\"query user: %w\", err)\n    }\n    \n    return &user, nil\n}\n```\n\n## Transaction Handling\n\n```go\nfunc (r *userRepository) CreateWithProfile(ctx context.Context, user *User, profile *Profile) error {\n    tx, err := r.db.BeginTx(ctx, nil)\n    if err != nil {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"begin transaction: %w\", err)\n    }\n    defer tx.Rollback()  // No-op if committed\n    \n    // Insert user\n    _, err = tx.ExecContext(ctx, \n        `INSERT INTO users (id, name, email) VALUES ($1, $2, $3)`,\n        user.ID, user.Name, user.Email,\n    )\n    if err != nil {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"insert user: %w\", err)\n    }\n    \n    // Insert profile\n    _, err = tx.ExecContext(ctx,\n        `INSERT INTO profiles (user_id, bio) VALUES ($1, $2)`,\n        user.ID, profile.Bio,\n    )\n    if err != nil {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"insert profile: %w\", err)\n    }\n    \n    if err := tx.Commit(); err != nil {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"commit transaction: %w\", err)\n    }\n    \n    return nil\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# ⚡ Performance Best Practices\n\n## Connection Pooling\n\n```go\ndb, err := sql.Open(\"postgres\", connString)\nif err != nil {\n    return err\n}\n\n// Configure pool\ndb.SetMaxOpenConns(25)\ndb.SetMaxIdleConns(5)\ndb.SetConnMaxLifetime(5 * time.Minute)\ndb.SetConnMaxIdleTime(1 * time.Minute)\n```\n\n## Context Timeouts\n\n```go\nfunc (h *Handler) HandleRequest(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // Add timeout to context\n    ctx, cancel := context.WithTimeout(r.Context(), 30*time.Second)\n    defer cancel()\n    \n    result, err := h.service.Process(ctx)\n    if errors.Is(err, context.DeadlineExceeded) {\n        h.respondError(w, http.StatusGatewayTimeout, \"request timeout\")\n        return\n    }\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\n## Sync Pool for Reusable Objects\n\n```go\nvar bufferPool = sync.Pool{\n    New: func() interface{} {\n        return new(bytes.Buffer)\n    },\n}\n\nfunc processData(data []byte) {\n    buf := bufferPool.Get().(*bytes.Buffer)\n    defer func() {\n        buf.Reset()\n        bufferPool.Put(buf)\n    }()\n    \n    // Use buffer...\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🧪 Testing Patterns\n\n```go\nfunc TestHandler_CreateUser(t *testing.T) {\n    // Setup\n    ctrl := gomock.NewController(t)\n    defer ctrl.Finish()\n    \n    mockService := NewMockUserService(ctrl)\n    handler := NewHandler(mockService)\n    \n    // Expectations\n    mockService.EXPECT().\n        Create(gomock.Any(), gomock.Any()).\n        Return(&User{ID: \"123\", Name: \"Test\"}, nil)\n    \n    // Request\n    body := `{\"name\": \"Test\", \"email\": \"test@example.com\"}`\n    req := httptest.NewRequest(\"POST\", \"/users\", strings.NewReader(body))\n    req.Header.Set(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n    w := httptest.NewRecorder()\n    \n    // Execute\n    handler.CreateUser(w, req)\n    \n    // Assert\n    assert.Equal(t, http.StatusCreated, w.Code)\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📚 References\n\n- [Effective Go](https://golang.org/doc/effective_go)\n- [Go Code Review Comments](https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/CodeReviewComments)\n- [Uber Go Style Guide](https://github.com/uber-go/guide/blob/master/style.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:26:57.038Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring seamless integration with LLM backends via Go HTTP handlers and Server-Sent Events (SSE) for real-time token streaming.","zh":"适用于需要与LLM后端通过Go HTTP处理程序和服务发送事件（SSE）进行无缝集成以实现实时令牌流的云代理。","ja":"LLMバックエンドとのシームレスな統合を必要とするクラウドエージェントに適しています。Go HTTPハンドラーとServer-Sent Events（SSE）を使用したリアルタイムトークンストリーミングが可能です。","ko":"LLM 백엔드와의 무결점 통합을 요구하는 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다. Go HTTP 핸들러와 Server-Sent Events(SSE)를 통한 실시간 토큰 스트리밍이 가능합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes en la Nube que requieren una integración sin problemas con backends LLM a través de controladores HTTP de Go y Eventos enviados por el servidor (SSE) para transmisión de tokens en tiempo real.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant une intégration transparente avec les backends LLM via des gestionnaires HTTP Go et des événements envoyés par le serveur (SSE) pour le streaming de jetons en temps réel.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit LLM-Backends über Go-HTTP-Handler und Server-Sent Events (SSE) für Echtzeit-Token-Streaming erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que requerem integração sem interrupções com backends LLM por meio de manipuladores HTTP Go e Eventos Enviados pelo Servidor (SSE) para transmissão de tokens em tempo real.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих бесшовной интеграции с бэкендами LLM через обработчики HTTP Go и события, отправленные сервером (SSE), для потоковой передачи токенов в режиме реального времени.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذي يتطلب دمجًا بدون انقطاع مع خلفيات LLM من خلال معالجات HTTP Go وأحداث مرسلة من الخادم (SSE) لتيار الرموز في الوقت الفعلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle both standard JSON responses and real-time token streaming with intelligent load balancing, zero buffering on streams, and support for OpenAPI, enabling efficient LLMProxy architecture implementations using Go backend development best practices, including middleware implementation and database operations.","zh":"赋予代理处理标准JSON响应和实时令牌流的能力，具有智能负载均衡、流的零缓冲和OpenAPI支持，实现使用Go后端开发最佳实践（包括中间件实现和数据库操作）的高效LLMProxy架构。","ja":"エージェントが標準のJSONレスポンスとリアルタイムトークンストリーミングの両方を処理できるようにし、インテリジェントな負荷分散、ストリームのゼロバッファリング、OpenAPIのサポートを提供することで、Goバックエンド開発のベストプラクティス（ミドルウェアの実装やデータベース操作を含む）を使用した効率的なLLMProxyアーキテクチャの実装を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 표준 JSON 응답과 실시간 토큰 스트리밍을 모두 처리할 수 있도록 하며, 지능형 부하 분산, 스트림의 제로 버퍼링, OpenAPI 지원을 제공하여 Go 백엔드 개발 모범 사례(미들웨어 구현 및 데이터베이스 작업 포함)를 사용한 효율적인 LLMProxy 아키텍처 구현을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes controlar tanto las respuestas JSON estándar como el streaming de tokens en tiempo real con equilibrio de carga inteligente, cero buffering en las transmisiones y soporte para OpenAPI, lo que permite implementaciones de arquitectura LLMProxy eficientes utilizando las mejores prácticas de desarrollo de backend de Go, incluida la implementación de middleware y operaciones de base de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer à la fois les réponses JSON standard et le streaming de jetons en temps réel avec un équilibrage de charge intelligent, un tamponnage nul sur les flux et un support pour OpenAPI, permettant ainsi des implémentations d''architecture LLMProxy efficaces en utilisant les meilleures pratiques de développement de backend Go, y compris la mise en œuvre de middleware et les opérations de base de données.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sowohl Standard-JSON-Antworten als auch Echtzeit-Token-Streaming mit intelligenter Lastverteilung, Nullpufferung auf Streams und Unterstützung für OpenAPI zu handhaben, wodurch effiziente Implementierungen der LLMProxy-Architektur mithilfe der besten Praktiken für die Entwicklung von Go-Backends ermöglicht werden, einschließlich Middleware-Implementierung und Datenbankvorgänge.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidarem com respostas JSON padrão e transmissão de tokens em tempo real com balanceamento de carga inteligente, zero bufferização em transmissões e suporte ao OpenAPI, permitindo implementações eficientes da arquitetura LLMProxy usando as melhores práticas de desenvolvimento de backend Go, incluindo implementação de middleware e operações de banco de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать как стандартные ответы JSON, так и потоковую передачу токенов в режиме реального времени с помощью интеллектуального балансирования нагрузки, отсутствия буферизации в потоках и поддержки OpenAPI, что позволяет эффективно реализовывать архитектуру LLMProxy, используя лучшие практики разработки бэкенда на Go, включая реализацию middleware и операции с базами данных.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من التعامل مع استجابات JSON القياسية وتيار الرموز في الوقت الفعلي مع موازنة الحمل الذكية وعدم وجود تحديث في التدفقات ودعم OpenAPI، مما يسمح بتنفيذ هيكلة LLMProxy بكفاءة باستخدام أفضل الممارسات لتطوير الخلفية Go، بما في ذلك تنفيذ البرامج الوسيطة وعمليات قاعدة البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing middleware for authentication and authorization","Optimizing LLM backend requests with intelligent load balancing","Streaming real-time tokens via Server-Sent Events (SSE) for interactive applications"],"zh":["实现用于认证和授权的中间件","使用智能负载均衡优化LLM后端请求","通过服务发送事件（SSE）实现实时令牌流以适应交互式应用程序"],"ja":["認証と認可のためのミドルウェアを実装する","インテリジェントな負荷分散を使用してLLMバックエンドのリクエストを最適化する","サーバーセントイベント（SSE）を使用してインタラクティブなアプリケーション向けのリアルタイムトークンストリーミングを実現する"],"ko":["인증 및 인가를 위한 미들웨어 구현","지능형 부하 분산을 사용하여 LLM 백엔드 요청 최적화","Server-Sent Events(SSE)를 사용하여 상호작용형 애플리케이션을 위한 실시간 토큰 스트리밍 구현"],"es":["Implementación de middleware para autenticación y autorización","Optimización de solicitudes de backend LLM con equilibrio de carga inteligente","Transmisión de tokens en tiempo real a través de Eventos enviados por el servidor (SSE) para aplicaciones interactivas"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de middleware pour l''authentification et l''autorisation","Optimisation des requêtes de backend LLM avec un équilibrage de charge intelligent","Streaming de jetons en temps réel via des événements envoyés par le serveur (SSE) pour des applications interactives"],"de":["Implementierung von Middleware für Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Optimierung von LLM-Backend-Anfragen mit intelligenter Lastverteilung","Streaming von Echtzeit-Tokens über Server-Sent Events (SSE) für interaktive Anwendungen"],"pt":["Implementação de middleware para autenticação e autorização","Otimização de solicitações de backend LLM com balanceamento de carga inteligente","Transmissão de tokens em tempo real via Eventos Enviados pelo Servidor (SSE) para aplicações interativas"],"ru":["Реализация middleware для аутентификации и авторизации","Оптимизация запросов к бэкенду LLM с помощью интеллектуального балансирования нагрузки","Потоковая передача токенов в режиме реального времени через события, отправленные сервером (SSE), для интерактивных приложений"],"ar":["تنفيذ البرامج الوسيطة للتحقق من الشخصية والتصريح","تحسين طلبات خلفية LLM مع موازنة الحمل الذكية","تيار الرموز في الوقت الفعلي عبر أحداث مرسلة من الخادم (SSE) للتطبيقات التفاعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go programming language proficiency","LLMProxy architecture dependency","Server-Sent Events (SSE) compatibility requirements"],"zh":["需要Go编程语言的专业知识","LLMProxy架构依赖","服务发送事件（SSE）兼容性要求"],"ja":["Goプログラミング言語の知識が必要","LLMProxyアーキテクチャへの依存","サーバーセントイベント（SSE）への互換性要件"],"ko":["Go 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","LLMProxy 아키텍처 의존성","Server-Sent Events(SSE) 호환성 요구 사항"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos del lenguaje de programación Go","Dependencia de la arquitectura LLMProxy","Requisitos de compatibilidad con Eventos enviados por el servidor (SSE)"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en langage de programmation Go","Dépendance de l''architecture LLMProxy","Exigences de compatibilité avec les événements envoyés par le serveur (SSE)"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse in der Programmiersprache Go","Abhängigkeit von der LLMProxy-Architektur","Kompatibilitätsanforderungen für Server-Sent Events (SSE)"],"pt":["Exige proficiência na linguagem de programação Go","Dependência da arquitetura LLMProxy","Requisitos de compatibilidade com Eventos Enviados pelo Servidor (SSE)"],"ru":["Требует навыков программирования на языке Go","Зависимость от архитектуры LLMProxy","Требования совместимости с событиями, отправленными сервером (SSE)"],"ar":["يتطلب إتقان لغة برمجة Go","اعتماد هيكلة LLMProxy","متطلبات التوافق مع أحداث مرسلة من الخادم (SSE)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
