ma que permite aos traders abrir posições alavancadas longas ou curtas com até 1000x de alavancagem","ru":"Синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов - это платформа, позволяющая трейдерам открывать левериджные длинные или короткие позиции с левериджем до 1000х","ar":"بروتوكول مستقبلات دائمة اصطناعية هو منصة تسمح للمتداولين فتح مراكز مالية طويلة أو قصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000 ضعف","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["合成永续期货","RWA资产支持","加密货币支持","股票支持","指数支持"],"ja":["合成永続期貨","RWAアセット対応","暗号資産対応","株式対応","指数対応"],"ko":["합성 영구 선물","RWA 자산 지원","암호화폐 지원","주식 지원","지수 지원"],"pt":["Suporte a ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices","Alavancagem de até 1000x","Oracle personalizada","AMM virtual","Suavização TWAP"],"ru":["Поддержка активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов","Леверидж до 1000х","Индивидуальная оракул","Виртуальный AMM","Сглаживание TWAP"],"ar":["دعم أصول RWA والأصول الرقمية وأسهم وفهارس","رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000 ضعف","أوراكل مخصصة","AMM افتراضي","تحسين TWAP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["qa讨论协议","合成永续期货","RWA资产","加密货币","股票","指数","合成期货"],"ja":["QAディスカッションプロトコル","合成永続期貨","RWAアセット","暗号資産","株式","指数","合成期貨"],"ko":["QA 토론 프로토콜","합성 영구 선물","RWA 자산","암호화폐","주식","지수","합성 선물"],"pt":["protocolo de futuros perpétuos sintéticos","ativos RWA","criptomoedas","ações","índices","alavancagem","oracle personalizada","AMM virtual","suavização TWAP"],"ru":["синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов","активы RWA","криптовалюты","акции","индексы","леверидж","индивидуальная оракул","виртуальный AMM","сглаживание TWAP"],"ar":["بروتوكول مستقبلات دائمة اصطناعية","أصول RWA","الأصول الرقمية","أسهم","فهارس","رافعة مالية","أوراكل مخصصة","AMM افتراضي","تحسين TWAP"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"qa-discussion","description":"Conducts structured Q&A discussions with users, handling multiple choice, single choice, and open-ended questions one at a time - tracks progress, validates answers, and provides summary reports for complete discussions","bodyPreview":"# Q&A Discussion Conductor\n\n## Overview\n\nSystematically conduct structured Q&A discussions with users. Handles multiple question types, tracks progress, validates responses, and generates comprehensive summary reports. Perfect for assessments, onboarding, feedback collection, or educational interactions.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n**Question Types:**\n- **Multiple Choice**: Select one or more correct answers from options\n- **Single Choice**: Select exactly one correct answer from options  \n- **Open-E","body":"# Q&A Discussion Conductor\n\n## Overview\n\nSystematically conduct structured Q&A discussions with users. Handles multiple question types, tracks progress, validates responses, and generates comprehensive summary reports. Perfect for assessments, onboarding, feedback collection, or educational interactions.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n**Question Types:**\n- **Multiple Choice**: Select one or more correct answers from options\n- **Single Choice**: Select exactly one correct answer from options  \n- **Open-Ended**: Free-form text responses with optional validation\n\n**Session Features:**\n- Progress tracking (Question X of Y)\n- One question at a time for clarity\n- Smart re-prompting on invalid answers with helpful feedback\n- Complete response logging with validation status\n- Summary report after discussion completion\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Conduct structured assessments or quizzes\n- Gather feedback through systematic questioning\n- Onboard users with validated knowledge checks\n- Create educational interactions with tracking\n- Run audits or compliance checks requiring documented responses\n\n**Don''t use when:**\n- Questions are casual or conversational (just chat naturally)\n- You don''t need to validate or track responses\n- The discussion is exploratory rather than structured\n\n## The Process\n\n### Step 1: Define Questions\n\nCreate a structured question array with all necessary metadata:\n\n```typescript\nconst questions: Question[] = [\n  {\n    id: ''q1'',\n    text: ''What is the capital of France?'',\n    type: ''single'',\n    options: [''London'', ''Paris'', ''Berlin'', ''Madrid''],\n    correctAnswer: ''Paris''\n  },\n  {\n    id: ''q2'',\n    text: ''Select all that apply: Which are JavaScript frameworks?'',\n    type: ''multiple'',\n    options: [''React'', ''Django'', ''Vue'', ''Laravel''],\n    correctAnswers: [''React'', ''Vue'']\n  },\n  {\n    id: ''q3'',\n    text: ''Explain why you chose your answer above'',\n    type: ''open'',\n    validation: (answer) => answer.length >= 10\n  }\n];\n```\n\n### Step 2: Conduct the Discussion\n\nCall the main function to start:\n\n```typescript\nconst session = await conductDiscussion(questions);\n```\n\nThe skill will:\n1. Display each question clearly with progress indicator\n2. Wait for user response\n3. Validate against question criteria\n4. Re-prompt if invalid with helpful feedback\n5. Store validated response\n6. Move to next question\n7. Generate summary when complete\n\n### Step 3: Review Results\n\nAccess the session data for reporting:\n\n```typescript\n// Session structure:\n{\n  totalQuestions: number;\n  completedQuestions: number;\n  responses: Array<{\n    questionId: string;\n    text: string;\n    answer: string;\n    isValid: boolean;\n    attempts: number;\n  }>;\n  summary: {\n    totalAttempts: number;\n    validResponses: number;\n    invalidResponses: number;\n    completionTime: number;\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Display Conventions\n\n**Question Presentation:**\n- Clear title showing question number and total (e.g., \"Question 1 of 5\")\n- Question text prominently displayed\n- Options numbered for easy reference (1, 2, 3...)\n- Instructions vary by type:\n  - Single choice: \"Select one option (enter number)\"\n  - Multiple choice: \"Select all that apply (enter numbers separated by commas)\"\n  - Open-ended: \"Enter your response (minimum 10 characters)\"\n\n**Validation Feedback:**\n- Invalid input: \"Invalid selection. Please enter 1, 2, 3, or 4\"\n- Multiple choice format error: \"Invalid format. Use: 1,2,3\"\n- Open-ended validation failed: \"Response too short. Please provide more detail\"\n- Empty input: \"Response cannot be empty\"\n\n**Progress Display:**\n- Each question shows: \"Question 2 of 7\"\n- Visual spacing between questions for clarity\n- Summary displayed after final question\n\n## Error Handling\n\n**Input Validation:**\n- Out of range selections → re-prompt with valid range\n- Wrong format (single choice given multiple) → explain expected format\n- Empty responses → ask to provide an answer\n- Custom validation failures → explain criteria with helpful message\n\n**Session Errors:**\n- No questions provided → throw clear error\n- Invalid question type → validate during setup\n- Timeout/interruption → save progress and allow resume\n\n## Key Principles\n\n- **One question at a time** - Never show multiple questions together\n- **Clear feedback** - Always explain why an answer is invalid\n- **Complete tracking** - Log every response with validation status\n- **Flexible validation** - Support exact match, list validation, and custom functions\n- **User-friendly** - Numbered options, clear instructions, helpful messages\n- **Resumable** - Design allows pausing and resuming if needed\n\n## Example Usage\n\nSee @index.ts for complete implementation with:\n- Full TypeScript types for all question types\n- Comprehensive error handling\n- Real-world usage examples\n- Integration patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:27:03.224Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational Agents requiring structured Q&A discussion capabilities to handle multiple question types and generate comprehensive summary reports.","zh":"适用于需要结构化问答讨论能力的对话式代理，能够处理多种类型的问题并生成综合的摘要报告。","ja":"構造化されたQ&Aディスカッション能力を必要とする会話エージェントに適しています。複数の質問タイプを処理し、包括的な要約レポートを生成できます。","ko":"구조화된 Q&A 토론 기능이 필요한 대화형 에이전트에 적합합니다. 여러 유형의 질문을 처리하고 종합적인 요약 보고서를 생성할 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Conversacionales que requieren capacidades de discusión de Preguntas y Respuestas estructuradas para manejar varios tipos de preguntas y generar informes de resumen comprehensivos.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Conversationnels nécessitant des capacités de discussion de Questions et Réponses structurées pour gérer plusieurs types de questions et générer des rapports de résumé complets.","de":"Ideal für Conversational Agents, die strukturierte Q&A-Diskussionsfunktionen erfordern, um mehrere Fragearten zu bearbeiten und umfassende Zusammenfassungsberichte zu erstellen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conversação que requerem capacidades de discussão de Q&A estruturada para lidar com vários tipos de perguntas e gerar relatórios de resumo abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных Агентов, требующих структурированных возможностей обсуждения вопросов и ответов для обработки нескольких типов вопросов и создания комплексных отчетов-резюме.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل المحادثي التي تتطلب قدرات مناقشة سؤال وإجابة منظمّة لمعالجة أنواع متعددة من الأسئلة وتوليد تقارير إجمالية شاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct systematic and structured Q&A discussions, handling multiple choice, single choice, and open-ended questions, while tracking progress and validating responses using protocols like on-chain vaults and central liquidity vaults.","zh":"赋予代理进行系统化和结构化的Q&A讨论的能力，能够处理多选题、单选题和开放性问题，同时使用像链上金库和中心流动性金库这样的协议来跟踪进度和验证响应。","ja":"エージェントに、システム化された構造化されたQ&Aディスカッションを実施する能力を付与します。多選択、単選択、およびオープンエンドの質問を処理し、オンチェーンバウルトや中央流動性バウルトなどのプロトコルを使用して進捗を追跡し、応答を検証します。","ko":"에이전트가 체계적이고 구조화된 Q&A 토론을 수행하도록 하여 여러 선택형 질문, 단일 선택형 질문 및 개방형 질문을 처리하고 온체인 금고 및 중앙 유동성 금고 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 진행 상황을 추적하고 응답을 검증할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar discusiones de Preguntas y Respuestas sistemáticas y estructuradas, manejar preguntas de opción múltiple, opción única y preguntas abiertas, mientras rastrea el progreso y valida las respuestas utilizando protocolos como bóvedas en cadena y bóvedas de liquidez central.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mener des discussions de Questions et Réponses systématiques et structurées, gérer des questions à choix multiple, à choix unique et des questions ouvertes, tout en suivant les progrès et en validant les réponses en utilisant des protocoles tels que des chambres fortes en chaîne et des chambres de liquidité centrale.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, systematische und strukturierte Q&A-Diskussionen zu führen, multiple Choice-, single Choice- und offene Fragen zu bearbeiten, während sie den Fortschritt verfolgen und Antworten mithilfe von Protokollen wie On-Chain-Vaults und zentralen Liquiditäts-Vaults validieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a conduzir discussões de Q&A sistemáticas e estruturadas, lidando com perguntas de múltipla escolha, escolha única e perguntas abertas, enquanto rastreia o progresso e valida respostas usando protocolos como cofres em cadeia e cofres de liquidez centralizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить систематические и структурированные обсуждения вопросов и ответов, обрабатывая вопросы с несколькими вариантами ответов, единственным вариантом ответа и открытыми вопросами, а также отслеживает прогресс и проверяет ответы с использованием таких протоколов, как хранилища в цепи и централизованные хранилища ликвидности.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إجراء مناقشات منظمّة ومتسلسلة لمسائل الإجابة والأسئلة، وتحديد أنواع متعددة من الأسئلة وتوليد تقارير إجمالية شاملة، مع تتبع التقدم وتصديق الإجابات باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل الخزائن في السلسلة والسيولة المركزية للصرف."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating user assessments with multiple choice questions","Generating comprehensive summary reports for educational interactions","Validating user responses for feedback collection and onboarding processes"],"zh":["使用多选题自动化用户评估","为教育互动生成综合摘要报告","验证用户响应以收集反馈和入职流程"],"ja":["多選択質問を使用してユーザー評価を自動化する","教育的相互作用のための包括的な要約レポートを生成する","ユーザーの応答を検証してフィードバックを収集し、オンボーディングプロセスを実施する"],"ko":["다중 선택형 질문을 사용하여 사용자 평가를 자동화","교육 상호 작용을 위한 종합적인 요약 보고서 생성","사용자 응답을 검증하여 피드백을 수집하고 온보딩 프로세스를 수행"],"es":["Automatizar las evaluaciones de los usuarios con preguntas de opción múltiple","Generar informes de resumen comprehensivos para interacciones educativas","Validar las respuestas de los usuarios para la recopilación de comentarios y los procesos de incorporación"],"fr":["Automatiser les évaluations des utilisateurs avec des questions à choix multiple","Générer des rapports de résumé complets pour les interactions éducatives","Valider les réponses des utilisateurs pour la collecte de commentaires et les processus d''intégration"],"de":["Automatisieren von Benutzerevaluierungen mit Multiple-Choice-Fragen","Erstellen von umfassenden Zusammenfassungsberichten für Bildungsinteraktionen","Validieren von Benutzerantworten für die Feedback-Sammlung und die Onboarding-Prozesse"],"pt":["Automatizar avaliações de usuário com perguntas de múltipla escolha","Gerar relatórios de resumo abrangentes para interações educacionais","Validar respostas de usuário para coleta de feedback e processos de integração"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оценку пользователей с помощью вопросов с несколькими вариантами ответов","Генерировать комплексные отчеты-резюме для образовательных взаимодействий","Проверять ответы пользователей для сбора обратной связи и процессов интеграции"],"ar":["أتمتة تقييم المستخدمين باستخدام أسئلة متعددة الخيارات","توليد تقارير إجمالية شاملة للتفاعلات التعليمية","تصديق إجابات المستخدمين لجمع الملاحظات وعمليات التأهيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires per-user on-chain vaults for stablecoin collateralization","Dependent on central liquidity vault as counterparty for trades"],"zh":["需要每用户链上金库用于稳定币抵押","依赖中心流动性金库作为交易的对手方"],"ja":["安定したコインの担保のためにユーザーごとにオンチェーンバウルトが必要","取引のカウンターパーティーとして中央流動性バウルトに依存"],"ko":["안정된 코인의 담보를 위해 사용자별 온체인 금고가 필요","거래의 카운터 파티로서 중앙 유동성 금고에 의존"],"es":["Requiere bóvedas en cadena por usuario para la colateralización de establescoins","Depende de una bóveda de liquidez central como contraparte para operaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite des chambres fortes en chaîne par utilisateur pour la collateralisation des stablecoins","Dépend d''une chambre de liquidité centrale en tant que contrepartie pour les opérations"],"de":["Benötigt On-Chain-Vaults pro Benutzer für die Besicherung von Stablecoins","Hängt von einem zentralen Liquiditäts-Vault als Kontrahent für Handel ab"],"pt":["Exige cofres em cadeia por usuário para garantia de estabilização de moeda","Depende de cofre de liquidez centralizado como contraparte para negociações"],"ru":["Требует хранилищ в цепи для каждого пользователя для обеспечения стабилизации монеты","Зависит от централизованного хранилища ликвидности в качестве контрагента для торговых операций"],"ar":["يتطلب خزائن في السلسلة لكل مستخدم لضمان استقرار العملة","يعتمد على خزنة سيولة مركزية كطرف مقابل للصرف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/web3-testing', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'web3-testing', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z', '2026-02-18T12:26:51.521Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/web3-testing","name":"web3-testing","description":{"zh":"Web3智能合约测试是使用Hardhat、Foundry等工具进行智能合约的全面测试","ja":"Web3スマートコントラクトテストは、Hardhat、Foundryなどのツールを使用してスマートコントラクトの包括的なテストを実施すること","ko":"Web3 스마트 계약 테스트는 Hardhat, Foundry 등을 사용하여 스마트 계약의 종합적인 테스트를 수행","es":"Dominar estrategias de prueba para smart contracts con Hardhat, Foundry y patrones de prueba avanzados","fr":"Maîtrisez les stratégies de test pour les smart contracts avec Hardhat, Foundry et des modèles de test avancés","de":"Meistern Sie Teststrategien für Smart Contracts mit Hardhat, Foundry und erweiterten Testmustern","pt":"Desenvolva estratégias de teste abrangentes para contratos inteligentes. Aprenda a usar Hardhat, Foundry e padrões de teste avançados.","ru":"Разработайте комплексные стратегии тестирования для умных контрактов. Узнайте, как использовать Hardhat, Foundry и продвинутые шаблоны тестирования.","ar":"طور استراتيجيات اختبار شاملة لعقود ذكية. تعلم كيفية استخدام Hardhat و Foundry و أنماط اختبار متقدمة","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Web3智能合约测试","ja":"Web3スマートコントラクトテスト","ko":"Web3 스마트 계약 테스트","es":"Pruebas de Smart Contracts Web3","fr":"Tests de Smart Contracts Web3","de":"Web3 Smart Contract Tests","pt":"Teste de Contratos Inteligentes Web3","ru":"Тестирование умных контрактов Web3","ar":"اختبار عقود الويب3 الذكية","en":"web3-testing"},"description":{"zh":"Web3智能合约测试是使用Hardhat、Foundry等工具进行智能合约的全面测试","ja":"Web3スマートコントラクトテストは、Hardhat、Foundryなどのツールを使用してスマートコントラクトの包括的なテストを実施すること","ko":"Web3 스마트 계약 테스트는 Hardhat, Foundry 등을 사용하여 스마트 계약의 종합적인 테스트를 수행","es":"Dominar estrategias de prueba para smart contracts con Hardhat, Foundry y patrones de prueba avanzados","fr":"Maîtrisez les stratégies de test pour les smart contracts avec Hardhat, Foundry et des modèles de test avancés","de":"Meistern Sie Teststrategien für Smart Contracts mit Hardhat, Foundry und erweiterten Testmustern","pt":"Desenvolva estratégias de teste abrangentes para contratos inteligentes. Aprenda a usar Hardhat, Foundry e padrões de teste avançados.","ru":"Разработайте комплексные стратегии тестирования для умных контрактов. Узнайте, как использовать Hardhat, Foundry и продвинутые шаблоны тестирования.","ar":"طور استراتيجيات اختبار شاملة لعقود ذكية. تعلم كيفية استخدام Hardhat و Foundry و أنماط اختبار متقدمة","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["单元测试","集成测试","gas优化测试","边界测试","主网测试"],"ja":["ユニットテスト","統合テスト","ガステスト","エッジテスト","メインタスト"],"ko":["유닛 테스트","통합 테스트","가스 최적화 테스트","경계 테스트","메인넷 테스트"],"es":["Pruebas unitarias para smart contracts","Configuración de suites de pruebas de integración","Pruebas de optimización de gas","Pruebas de borde con fuzzing","Creación de un entorno de prueba realista","Informes de cobertura de pruebas automatizados"],"fr":["Tests unitaires pour les smart contracts","Configuration de suites de tests d''intégration","Tests d''optimisation de gaz","Tests de cas limite avec fuzzing","Création d''un environnement de test réaliste","Rapports de couverture de tests automatisés"],"de":["Einheitliche Tests für Smart Contracts","Einrichtung von Integrations-Test-Suiten","Gastoptimierungstests","Randfall-Tests mit Fuzzing","Erstellung einer realistischen Testumgebung","Automatisierte Testabdeckungsberichte"],"pt":["Teste unitário para contratos inteligentes","Configuração de suites de teste de integração","Otimização de gás para contratos inteligentes","Teste de fuzzing para casos de bordo","Forking da mainnet para testes realistas","Relatórios de cobertura de teste automatizados"],"ru":["Юнит-тестирование для умных контрактов","Настройка наборов тестирования интеграции","Оптимизация газа для умных контрактов","Тестирование fuzzing для граничных случаев","Форк mainnet для реалистичных тестов","Автоматические отчеты о покрытии тестирования"],"ar":["اختبار الوحدة لعقود ذكية","تكوين حزمة اختبار التكامل","تحسين الغاز لعقود ذكية","اختبار الفززينج للحالات الحدية","فورك الماينيت للاختبارات الواقعية","تقارير تغطية الاختبار الآلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web3","智能合约","Hardhat","Foundry","测试","区块链"],"ja":["Web3","スマートコントラクト","Hardhat","Foundry","テスト","ブロックチェーン"],"ko":["Web3","스마트 계약","Hardhat","Foundry","테스트","블록체인"],"es":["pruebas de smart contracts","Hardhat","Foundry","patrones de prueba avanzados","optimización de gas","fuzzing","integración continua","desarrollo de blockchain"],"fr":["tests de smart contracts","Hardhat","Foundry","modèles de test avancés","optimisation de gaz","fuzzing","intégration continue","développement de blockchain"],"de":["Smart-Contract-Tests","Hardhat","Foundry","erweiterte Testmuster","Gastoptimierung","Fuzzing","kontinuierliche Integration","Blockchain-Entwicklung"],"pt":["teste de contratos inteligentes","web3","hardhat","foundry","teste unitário","teste de integração","otimização de gás","fuzzing","forking mainnet"],"ru":["тестирование умных контрактов","web3","hardhat","foundry","юнит-тестирование","тестирование интеграции","оптимизация газа","фuzzing","форк mainnet"],"ar":["اختبار العقود الذكية","الويب3","hardhat","foundry","اختبار الوحدة","اختبار التكامل","تحسين الغاز","فززينج","فورك الماينيت"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web3-testing","description":"Test smart contracts comprehensively using Hardhat and Foundry with unit tests, integration tests, and mainnet forking. Use when testing Solidity contracts, setting up blockchain test suites, or validating DeFi protocols.","bodyPreview":"# Web3 Smart Contract Testing\n\nMaster comprehensive testing strategies for smart contracts using Hardhat, Foundry, and advanced testing patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing unit tests for smart contracts\n- Setting up integration test suites\n- Performing gas optimization testing\n- Fuzzing for edge cases\n- Forking mainnet for realistic testing\n- Automating test coverage reporting\n- Verifying contracts on Etherscan\n\n## Hardhat Testing Setup\n\n```javascript\n// hardhat.config.js\nrequire(\"@n","body":"# Web3 Smart Contract Testing\n\nMaster comprehensive testing strategies for smart contracts using Hardhat, Foundry, and advanced testing patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing unit tests for smart contracts\n- Setting up integration test suites\n- Performing gas optimization testing\n- Fuzzing for edge cases\n- Forking mainnet for realistic testing\n- Automating test coverage reporting\n- Verifying contracts on Etherscan\n\n## Hardhat Testing Setup\n\n```javascript\n// hardhat.config.js\nrequire(\"@nomicfoundation/hardhat-toolbox\");\nrequire(\"@nomiclabs/hardhat-etherscan\");\nrequire(\"hardhat-gas-reporter\");\nrequire(\"solidity-coverage\");\n\nmodule.exports = {\n  solidity: {\n    version: \"0.8.19\",\n    settings: {\n      optimizer: {\n        enabled: true,\n        runs: 200,\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  networks: {\n    hardhat: {\n      forking: {\n        url: process.env.MAINNET_RPC_URL,\n        blockNumber: 15000000,\n      },\n    },\n    goerli: {\n      url: process.env.GOERLI_RPC_URL,\n      accounts: [process.env.PRIVATE_KEY],\n    },\n  },\n  gasReporter: {\n    enabled: true,\n    currency: \"USD\",\n    coinmarketcap: process.env.COINMARKETCAP_API_KEY,\n  },\n  etherscan: {\n    apiKey: process.env.ETHERSCAN_API_KEY,\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Unit Testing Patterns\n\n```javascript\nconst { expect } = require(\"chai\");\nconst { ethers } = require(\"hardhat\");\nconst {\n  loadFixture,\n  time,\n} = require(\"@nomicfoundation/hardhat-network-helpers\");\n\ndescribe(\"Token Contract\", function () {\n  // Fixture for test setup\n  async function deployTokenFixture() {\n    const [owner, addr1, addr2] = await ethers.getSigners();\n\n    const Token = await ethers.getContractFactory(\"Token\");\n    const token = await Token.deploy();\n\n    return { token, owner, addr1, addr2 };\n  }\n\n  describe(\"Deployment\", function () {\n    it(\"Should set the right owner\", async function () {\n      const { token, owner } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n      expect(await token.owner()).to.equal(owner.address);\n    });\n\n    it(\"Should assign total supply to owner\", async function () {\n      const { token, owner } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n      const ownerBalance = await token.balanceOf(owner.address);\n      expect(await token.totalSupply()).to.equal(ownerBalance);\n    });\n  });\n\n  describe(\"Transactions\", function () {\n    it(\"Should transfer tokens between accounts\", async function () {\n      const { token, owner, addr1 } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n\n      await expect(token.transfer(addr1.address, 50)).to.changeTokenBalances(\n        token,\n        [owner, addr1],\n        [-50, 50],\n      );\n    });\n\n    it(\"Should fail if sender doesn''t have enough tokens\", async function () {\n      const { token, addr1 } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n      const initialBalance = await token.balanceOf(addr1.address);\n\n      await expect(\n        token.connect(addr1).transfer(owner.address, 1),\n      ).to.be.revertedWith(\"Insufficient balance\");\n    });\n\n    it(\"Should emit Transfer event\", async function () {\n      const { token, owner, addr1 } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n\n      await expect(token.transfer(addr1.address, 50))\n        .to.emit(token, \"Transfer\")\n        .withArgs(owner.address, addr1.address, 50);\n    });\n  });\n\n  describe(\"Time-based tests\", function () {\n    it(\"Should handle time-locked operations\", async function () {\n      const { token } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n\n      // Increase time by 1 day\n      await time.increase(86400);\n\n      // Test time-dependent functionality\n    });\n  });\n\n  describe(\"Gas optimization\", function () {\n    it(\"Should use gas efficiently\", async function () {\n      const { token } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n\n      const tx = await token.transfer(addr1.address, 100);\n      const receipt = await tx.wait();\n\n      expect(receipt.gasUsed).to.be.lessThan(50000);\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Foundry Testing (Forge)\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.0;\n\nimport \"forge-std/Test.sol\";\nimport \"../src/Token.sol\";\n\ncontract TokenTest is Test {\n    Token token;\n    address owner = address(1);\n    address user1 = address(2);\n    address user2 = address(3);\n\n    function setUp() public {\n        vm.prank(owner);\n        token = new Token();\n    }\n\n    function testInitialSupply() public {\n        assertEq(token.totalSupply(), 1000000 * 10**18);\n    }\n\n    function testTransfer() public {\n        vm.prank(owner);\n        token.transfer(user1, 100);\n\n        assertEq(token.balanceOf(user1), 100);\n        assertEq(token.balanceOf(owner), token.totalSupply() - 100);\n    }\n\n    function testFailTransferInsufficientBalance() public {\n        vm.prank(user1);\n        token.transfer(user2, 100); // Should fail\n    }\n\n    function testCannotTransferToZeroAddress() public {\n        vm.prank(owner);\n        vm.expectRevert(\"Invalid recipient\");\n        token.transfer(address(0), 100);\n    }\n\n    // Fuzzing test\n    function testFuzzTransfer(uint256 amount) public {\n        vm.assume(amount > 0 && amount <= token.totalSupply());\n\n        vm.prank(owner);\n        token.transfer(user1, amount);\n\n        assertEq(token.balanceOf(user1), amount);\n    }\n\n    // Test with cheatcodes\n    function testDealAndPrank() public {\n        // Give ETH to address\n        vm.deal(user1, 10 ether);\n\n        // Impersonate address\n        vm.prank(user1);\n\n        // Test functionality\n        assertEq(user1.balance, 10 ether);\n    }\n\n    // Mainnet fork test\n    function testForkMainnet() public {\n        vm.createSelectFork(\"https://eth-mainnet.alchemyapi.io/v2/...\");\n\n        // Interact with mainnet contracts\n        address dai = 0x6B175474E89094C44Da98b954EedeAC495271d0F;\n        assertEq(IERC20(dai).symbol(), \"DAI\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Advanced Testing Patterns\n\n### Snapshot and Revert\n\n```javascript\ndescribe(\"Complex State Changes\", function () {\n  let snapshotId;\n\n  beforeEach(async function () {\n    snapshotId = await network.provider.send(\"evm_snapshot\");\n  });\n\n  afterEach(async function () {\n    await network.provider.send(\"evm_revert\", [snapshotId]);\n  });\n\n  it(\"Test 1\", async function () {\n    // Make state changes\n  });\n\n  it(\"Test 2\", async function () {\n    // State reverted, clean slate\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Mainnet Forking\n\n```javascript\ndescribe(\"Mainnet Fork Tests\", function () {\n  let uniswapRouter, dai, usdc;\n\n  before(async function () {\n    await network.provider.request({\n      method: \"hardhat_reset\",\n      params: [\n        {\n          forking: {\n            jsonRpcUrl: process.env.MAINNET_RPC_URL,\n            blockNumber: 15000000,\n          },\n        },\n      ],\n    });\n\n    // Connect to existing mainnet contracts\n    uniswapRouter = await ethers.getContractAt(\n      \"IUniswapV2Router\",\n      \"0x7a250d5630B4cF539739dF2C5dAcb4c659F2488D\",\n    );\n\n    dai = await ethers.getContractAt(\n      \"IERC20\",\n      \"0x6B175474E89094C44Da98b954EedeAC495271d0F\",\n    );\n  });\n\n  it(\"Should swap on Uniswap\", async function () {\n    // Test with real Uniswap contracts\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Impersonating Accounts\n\n```javascript\nit(\"Should impersonate whale account\", async function () {\n  const whaleAddress = \"0x...\";\n\n  await network.provider.request({\n    method: \"hardhat_impersonateAccount\",\n    params: [whaleAddress],\n  });\n\n  const whale = await ethers.getSigner(whaleAddress);\n\n  // Use whale''s tokens\n  await dai\n    .connect(whale)\n    .transfer(addr1.address, ethers.utils.parseEther(\"1000\"));\n});\n```\n\n## Gas Optimization Testing\n\n```javascript\nconst { expect } = require(\"chai\");\n\ndescribe(\"Gas Optimization\", function () {\n  it(\"Compare gas usage between implementations\", async function () {\n    const Implementation1 =\n      await ethers.getContractFactory(\"OptimizedContract\");\n    const Implementation2 = await ethers.getContractFactory(\n      \"UnoptimizedContract\",\n    );\n\n    const contract1 = await Implementation1.deploy();\n    const contract2 = await Implementation2.deploy();\n\n    const tx1 = await contract1.doSomething();\n    const receipt1 = await tx1.wait();\n\n    const tx2 = await contract2.doSomething();\n    const receipt2 = await tx2.wait();\n\n    console.log(\"Optimized gas:\", receipt1.gasUsed.toString());\n    console.log(\"Unoptimized gas:\", receipt2.gasUsed.toString());\n\n    expect(receipt1.gasUsed).to.be.lessThan(receipt2.gasUsed);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Coverage Reporting\n\n```bash\n# Generate coverage report\nnpx hardhat coverage\n\n# Output shows:\n# File                | % Stmts | % Branch | % Funcs | % Lines |\n# -------------------|---------|----------|---------|---------|\n# contracts/Token.sol |   100   |   90     |   100   |   95    |\n```\n\n## Contract Verification\n\n```javascript\n// Verify on Etherscan\nawait hre.run(\"verify:verify\", {\n  address: contractAddress,\n  constructorArguments: [arg1, arg2],\n});\n```\n\n```bash\n# Or via CLI\nnpx hardhat verify --network mainnet CONTRACT_ADDRESS \"Constructor arg1\" \"arg2\"\n```\n\n## CI/CD Integration\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/test.yml\nname: Tests\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v2\n        with:\n          node-version: \"16\"\n\n      - run: npm install\n      - run: npx hardhat compile\n      - run: npx hardhat test\n      - run: npx hardhat coverage\n\n      - name: Upload coverage to Codecov\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v2\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/hardhat-setup.md**: Hardhat configuration guide\n- **references/foundry-setup.md**: Foundry testing framework\n- **references/test-patterns.md**: Testing best practices\n- **references/mainnet-forking.md**: Fork testing strategies\n- **references/contract-verification.md**: Etherscan verification\n- **assets/hardhat-config.js**: Complete Hardhat configuration\n- **assets/test-suite.js**: Comprehensive test examples\n- **assets/foundry.toml**: Foundry configuration\n- **scripts/test-contract.sh**: Automated testing script\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Test Coverage**: Aim for >90% coverage\n2. **Edge Cases**: Test boundary conditions\n3. **Gas Limits**: Verify functions don''t hit block gas limit\n4. **Reentrancy**: Test for reentrancy vulnerabilities\n5. **Access Control**: Test unauthorized access attempts\n6. **Events**: Verify event emissions\n7. **Fixtures**: Use fixtures to avoid code duplication\n8. **Mainnet Fork**: Test with real contracts\n9. **Fuzzing**: Use property-based testing\n10. **CI/CD**: Automate testing on every commit"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:26:51.521Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Blockchain Agents requiring advanced smart contract testing capabilities with Hardhat and Foundry","zh":"适用于需要使用Hardhat和Foundry进行高级智能合约测试的区块链代理","ja":"HardhatおよびFoundryを使用した高度なスマートコントラクトテスト機能が必要なブロックチェーンエージェントに最適","ko":"하드해트와 파운드리 등을 사용한 고급 스마트 컨트랙트 테스트 기능이 필요한 블록체인 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Blockchain que requieren capacidades de prueba de contrato inteligente avanzadas con Hardhat y Foundry","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de blockchain nécessitant des capacités de test de contrat intelligent avancées avec Hardhat et Foundry","de":"Ideal für Blockchain-Agents, die erweiterte Smart-Contract-Testfunktionen mit Hardhat und Foundry benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Blockchain que requerem capacidades avançadas de teste de contrato inteligente com Hardhat e Foundry","ru":"Идеально для агентов блокчейна, требующих расширенных возможностей тестирования умных контрактов с Hardhat и Foundry","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء سلاسل الكتل الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لاختبار العقد الذكي مع Hardhat و Foundry"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write unit tests for smart contracts, set up integration test suites, and perform gas optimization testing using advanced testing patterns and libraries like Hardhat and Foundry, ensuring robustness and security of decentralized applications","zh":"赋予代理编写智能合约的单元测试、设置集成测试套件以及使用Hardhat和Foundry等高级测试模式和库进行气体优化测试的能力，确保去中心化应用的稳健性和安全性","ja":"HardhatおよびFoundryなどの高度なテストパターンとライブラリを使用して、スマートコントラクトのユニットテストを記述し、統合テストスイートを設定し、ガス最適化テストを実行することで、分散型アプリケーションの堅牢性とセキュリティを確保するエージェントの能力を提供する","ko":"하드해트와 파운드리 等의 고급 테스트 패턴과 라이브러리 등을 사용하여 스마트 컨트랙트의 유닛 테스트를 작성하고, 통합 테스트 스위트를 설정하며, 가스 최적화 테스트를 수행할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여, 분산형 애플리케이션의 견고성과 보안성을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas unitarias para contratos inteligentes, configurar suites de pruebas de integración y realizar pruebas de optimización de gas utilizando patrones y bibliotecas de prueba avanzadas como Hardhat y Foundry, garantizando la robustez y la seguridad de las aplicaciones descentralizadas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests unitaires pour les contrats intelligents, de configurer des suites de tests d''intégration et de réaliser des tests d''optimisation de gaz en utilisant des modèles et des bibliothèques de test avancés comme Hardhat et Foundry, garantissant la robustesse et la sécurité des applications décentralisées","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Einheitstests für Smart-Contracts zu schreiben, Integrations-Test-Suiten einzurichten und Gas-Optimierungs-Tests mit Hilfe von fortschrittlichen Testmustern und Bibliotheken wie Hardhat und Foundry durchzuführen, um die Robustheit und Sicherheit dezentraler Anwendungen zu gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes unitários para contratos inteligentes, configurar conjuntos de testes de integração e realizar testes de otimização de gás usando padrões e bibliotecas de teste avançados como Hardhat e Foundry, garantindo a robustez e a segurança de aplicações descentralizadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать модульные тесты для умных контрактов, настраивать наборы интеграционных тестов и выполнять тестирование оптимизации газа с использованием продвинутых шаблонов тестирования и библиотек, таких как Hardhat и Foundry, обеспечивая надежность и безопасность децентрализованных приложений","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من كتابة اختبارات الوحدة للعقود الذكية وضبط مجموعات اختبار التكامل وأداء اختبارات تحسين الغاز باستخدام أنماط اختبار متقدمة ومكتبات مثل Hardhat و Foundry، مما يضمن متانتها وأمان التطبيقات اللامركزية"},"useCases":{"en":["Writing unit tests for smart contracts","Fuzzing for edge cases in decentralized finance protocols","Automating test coverage reporting for Etherscan verification"],"zh":["编写智能合约的单元测试","针对去中心化金融协议中的边缘情况进行模糊测试","自动化Etherscan验证的测试覆盖报告"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトのユニットテストを記述する","分散型金融プロトコルのエッジケースに対するファジングテストを実行する","Etherscanの検証のためのテストカバレッジレポートを自動化する"],"ko":["스마트 컨트랙트의 유닛 테스트를 작성","분산형 금융 프로토콜의 에지 케이스에 대한 퍼징 테스트를 수행","이더스캔 검증을 위한 테스트 커버리지 리포트를 자동화"],"es":["Escribir pruebas unitarias para contratos inteligentes","Fuzzing para casos de borde en protocolos de finanzas descentralizadas","Automatizar informes de cobertura de pruebas para verificación de Etherscan"],"fr":["Écrire des tests unitaires pour les contrats intelligents","Fuzzing pour les cas de bordure dans les protocoles de finance décentralisée","Automatiser les rapports de couverture de tests pour la vérification d''Etherscan"],"de":["Schreiben von Einheitstests für Smart-Contracts","Fuzzing für Randfälle in dezentralen Finanzprotokollen","Automatisieren von Testabdeckungsberichten für Etherscan-Verifizierung"],"pt":["Escrever testes unitários para contratos inteligentes","Fuzzing para casos de bordo em protocolos de finanças descentralizadas","Automatizar a geração de relatórios de cobertura de testes para verificação do Etherscan"],"ru":["Написание модульных тестов для умных контрактов","Fuzzing для граничных случаев в протоколах децентрализованного финансирования","Автоматизация генерации отчетов о покрытии тестирования для верификации Etherscan"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات الوحدة للعقود الذكية","Fuzzing لحالات الحافة في بروتوكولات التمويل اللامركزي","أتمتة توليد تقارير تغطية الاختبار للتحقق من Etherscan"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Limited to Ethereum-based smart contracts","Needs access to Etherscan API for contract verification"],"zh":["需要Node.js环境","仅限以太坊基于的智能合约","需要访问Etherscan API进行合约验证"],"ja":["Node.js環境が必要","イーサリアムベースのスマートコントラクトのみ","コントラクトの検証のためにEtherscan APIへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["노드js 환경이 필요","이더리움 기반의 스마트 컨트랙트만 해당","컨트랙트 검증을 위해 이더스캔 API 접근이 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Node.js","Limitado a contratos inteligentes basados en Ethereum","Necesita acceso a la API de Etherscan para la verificación de contratos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Limité aux contrats intelligents basés sur Ethereum","Nécessite un accès à l''API d''Etherscan pour la vérification des contrats"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Ethereum-basierte Smart-Contracts","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Etherscan-API für die Verifizierung von Verträgen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js","Limitado a contratos inteligentes baseados em Ethereum","Necessita acesso à API do Etherscan para verificação de contrato"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Ограничен умными контрактами на основе Ethereum","Требует доступа к API Etherscan для верификации контракта"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","محدود بالعقود الذكية المستندة إلى إيثريوم","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Etherscan للتحقق من العقد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
