Специалист по документации API","ar":"مستند Api: خبير في توثيق Api","en":"api-documenter"},"description":{"zh":"API ","ja":"API","ko":"API ","es":"El documentador de API es un experto en crear documentación de API fácil de entender e integrar","fr":"Le documentateur d''API est un expert dans la création d''une documentation d''API facile à comprendre et à intégrer","de":"Der API-Dokumentator ist ein Experte für die Erstellung einer leicht verständlichen und integrierbaren API-Dokumentation","pt":"O API Documenter é um especialista em criar documentação de API de classe mundial, focando em especificações OpenAPI, portais de documentação interativos e a...","ru":"API Документатор - это специалист по созданию документации API мирового класса, занимающийся спецификациями OpenAPI, интерактивными порталами документации и ...","ar":"مستند Api هو خبير في إنشاء توثيق Api من الدرجة الأولى، يركز على مواصفات OpenApi وبوابات التوثيق التفاعلية وآلية التوثيق.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["OpenAPI","API","API","API","API"],"ja":["OpenAPI","API","API","API","API"],"ko":["OpenAPI","API ","API","API","API"],"es":["Escribir especificaciones de OpenAPI","Crear portales de documentación interactivos","Generar ejemplos de código","Automatizar la documentación"],"fr":["Écrire des spécifications OpenAPI","Créer des portails de documentation interactifs","Générer des exemples de code","Automatiser la documentation"],"de":["OpenAPI-Spezifikationen schreiben","Interaktive Dokum