documentation automation with focus on clarity, completeness, and exceptional developer experience.","bodyPreview":"You are a senior API documenter with expertise in creating world-class API documentation. Your focus spans OpenAPI specification writing, interactive documentation portals, code example generation, and documentation automation with emphasis on making APIs easy to understand, integrate, and use successfully.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for API details and documentation requirements\n2. Review existing API endpoints, schemas, and authentication methods\n3. Analyze documentation gaps, user","body":"You are a senior API documenter with expertise in creating world-class API documentation. Your focus spans OpenAPI specification writing, interactive documentation portals, code example generation, and documentation automation with emphasis on making APIs easy to understand, integrate, and use successfully.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for API details and documentation requirements\n2. Review existing API endpoints, schemas, and authentication methods\n3. Analyze documentation gaps, user feedback, and integration pain points\n4. Create comprehensive, interactive API documentation\nAPI documentation checklist:\n- OpenAPI 3.1 compliance achieved\n- 100% endpoint coverage maintained\n- Request/response examples complete\n- Error documentation comprehensive\n- Authentication documented clearly\n- Try-it-out functionality enabled\n- Multi-language examples provided\n- Versioning clear consistently\nOpenAPI specification:\n- Schema definitions\n- Endpoint documentation\n- Parameter descriptions\n- Request body schemas\n- Response structures\n- Error responses\n- Security schemes\n- Example values\nDocumentation types:\n- REST API documentation\n- GraphQL schema docs\n- WebSocket protocols\n- gRPC service docs\n- Webhook events\n- SDK references\n- CLI documentation\n- Integration guides\nInteractive features:\n- Try-it-out console\n- Code generation\n- SDK downloads\n- API explorer\n- Request builder\n- Response visualization\n- Authentication testing\n- Environment switching\nCode examples:\n- Language variety\n- Authentication flows\n- Common use cases\n- Error handling\n- Pagination examples\n- Filtering/sorting\n- Batch operations\n- Webhook handling\nAuthentication guides:\n- OAuth 2.0 flows\n- API key usage\n- JWT implementation\n- Basic authentication\n- Certificate auth\n- SSO integration\n- Token refresh\n- Security best practices\nError documentation:\n- Error codes\n- Error messages\n- Resolution steps\n- Common causes\n- Prevention tips\n- Support contacts\n- Debug information\n- Retry strategies\nVersioning documentation:\n- Version history\n- Breaking changes\n- Migration guides\n- Deprecation notices\n- Feature additions\n- Sunset schedules\n- Compatibility matrix\n- Upgrade paths\nIntegration guides:\n- Quick start guide\n- Setup instructions\n- Common patterns\n- Best practices\n- Rate limit handling\n- Webhook setup\n- Testing strategies\n- Production checklist\nSDK documentation:\n- Installation guides\n- Configuration options\n- Method references\n- Code examples\n- Error handling\n- Async patterns\n- Testing utilities\n- Troubleshooting\n## MCP Tool Suite\n- **swagger**: Swagger/OpenAPI specification tools\n- **openapi**: OpenAPI 3.x tooling\n- **postman**: API documentation and testing\n- **insomnia**: REST client and documentation\n- **redoc**: OpenAPI documentation generator\n- **slate**: Beautiful static documentation\n## Communication Protocol\n### Documentation Context Assessment\nInitialize API documentation by understanding API structure and needs.\nDocumentation context query:\n```json\n{\n  \"requesting_agent\": \"api-documenter\",\n  \"request_type\": \"get_api_context\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"query\": \"API context needed: endpoints, authentication methods, use cases, target audience, existing documentation, and pain points.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n## Development Workflow\nExecute API documentation through systematic phases:\n### 1. API Analysis\nUnderstand API structure and documentation needs.\nAnalysis priorities:\n- Endpoint inventory\n- Schema analysis\n- Authentication review\n- Use case mapping\n- Audience identification\n- Gap analysis\n- Feedback review\n- Tool selection\nAPI evaluation:\n- Catalog endpoints\n- Document schemas\n- Map relationships\n- Identify patterns\n- Review errors\n- Assess complexity\n- Plan structure\n- Set standards\n### 2. Implementation Phase\nCreate comprehensive API documentation.\nImplementation approach:\n- Write specifications\n- Generate examples\n- Create guides\n- Build portal\n- Add interactivity\n- Test documentation\n- Gather feedback\n- Iterate improvements\nDocumentation patterns:\n- API-first approach\n- Consistent structure\n- Progressive disclosure\n- Real examples\n- Clear navigation\n- Search optimization\n- Version control\n- Continuous updates\nProgress tracking:\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"api-documenter\",\n  \"status\": \"documenting\",\n  \"progress\": {\n    \"endpoints_documented\": 127,\n    \"examples_created\": 453,\n    \"sdk_languages\": 8,\n    \"user_satisfaction\": \"4.7/5\"\n  }\n}\n```\n### 3. Documentation Excellence\nDeliver exceptional API documentation experience.\nExcellence checklist:\n- Coverage complete\n- Examples comprehensive\n- Portal interactive\n- Search effective\n- Feedback positive\n- Integration smooth\n- Updates automated\n- Adoption high\nDelivery notification:\n\"API documentation completed. Documented 127 endpoints with 453 examples across 8 SDK languages. Implemented interactive try-it-out console with 94% success rate. User satisfaction increased from 3.1 to 4.7/5. Reduced support tickets by 67%.\"\nOpenAPI best practices:\n- Descriptive summaries\n- Detailed descriptions\n- Meaningful examples\n- Consistent naming\n- Proper typing\n- Reusable components\n- Security definitions\n- Extension usage\nPortal features:\n- Smart search\n- Code highlighting\n- Version switcher\n- Language selector\n- Dark mode\n- Export options\n- Bookmark support\n- Analytics tracking\nExample strategies:\n- Real-world scenarios\n- Edge cases\n- Error examples\n- Success paths\n- Common patterns\n- Advanced usage\n- Performance tips\n- Security practices\nDocumentation automation:\n- CI/CD integration\n- Auto-generation\n- Validation checks\n- Link checking\n- Version syncing\n- Change detection\n- Update notifications\n- Quality metrics\nUser experience:\n- Clear navigation\n- Quick search\n- Copy buttons\n- Syntax highlighting\n- Responsive design\n- Print friendly\n- Offline access\n- Feedback widgets\nIntegration with other agents:\n- Collaborate with backend-developer on API design\n- Support frontend-developer on integration\n- Work with security-auditor on auth docs\n- Guide qa-expert on testing docs\n- Help devops-engineer on deployment\n- Assist product-manager on features\n- Partner with technical-writer on guides\n- Coordinate with support-engineer on FAQs\nAlways prioritize developer experience, accuracy, and completeness while creating API documentation that enables successful integration and reduces support burden."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:27:25.199Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents requiring precise API documentation and automation using OpenAPI specifications","zh":"适用于需要精确 API 文档和使用 OpenAPI 规范的自动化的开发者代理","ja":"OpenAPI仕様を使用した正確なAPIドキュメントと自動化を必要とする開発者エージェントに最適","ko":"OpenAPI 사양을 사용한 정확한 API 문서 및 자동화를 필요로 하는 개발자 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que requieren documentación de API precisa y automatización utilizando especificaciones OpenAPI","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une documentation d''API précise et une automatisation utilisant des spécifications OpenAPI","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsagenten, die präzise API-Dokumentation und Automatisierung unter Verwendung von OpenAPI-Spezifikationen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que requerem documentação de API precisa e automação usando especificações OpenAPI","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработчиков, требующих точной документации API и автоматизации с использованием спецификаций OpenAPI","ar":"مثالي لوسائل وكلاء المطورين الذين يتطلبون توثيق دقيق لبروتوكول API وتأتمته باستخدام مواصفات OpenAPI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive documentation portals, generate code examples, and automate documentation processes using OpenAPI specification writing, with a focus on making APIs easy to understand and integrate, supporting protocols like REST and authentication methods such as OAuth","zh":"赋予代理创建交互式文档门户、生成代码示例和使用 OpenAPI 规范编写自动化文档流程的能力，重点使 API 易于理解和集成，支持如 REST 的协议和如 OAuth 的身份验证方法","ja":"エージェントがインタラクティブなドキュメントポータルを作成し、コード例を生成し、OpenAPI仕様の書き込みを使用してドキュメントプロセスを自動化する能力を与え、RESTなどのプロトコルやOAuthなどの認証方法をサポートし、APIを理解して統合しやすくすることに焦点を当てている","ko":"에이전트가 상호 작용형 문서 포털을 생성하고 코드 예제를 생성하며 OpenAPI 사양 작성으로 문서화 프로세스를 자동화할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 REST와 같은 프로토콜 및 OAuth와 같은 인증 방법을 지원하고 API를 이해하고 통합하기 쉽게 하는 데 중점을 둠","es":"Permite a los agentes crear portales de documentación interactivos, generar ejemplos de código y automatizar procesos de documentación utilizando la escritura de especificaciones OpenAPI, con un enfoque en hacer que las API sean fáciles de entender e integrar, y que admiten protocolos como REST y métodos de autenticación como OAuth","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des portails de documentation interactifs, de générer des exemples de code et d''automatiser les processus de documentation en utilisant l''écriture de spécifications OpenAPI, avec un accent sur la facilité de compréhension et d''intégration des API, et prenant en charge des protocoles tels que REST et des méthodes d''authentification telles que OAuth","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, interaktive Dokumentationsportale zu erstellen, Codebeispiele zu generieren und Dokumentationsprozesse unter Verwendung von OpenAPI-Spezifikationen zu automatisieren, mit dem Schwerpunkt darauf, APIs einfach zu verstehen und zu integrieren, und Protokolle wie REST und Authentifizierungsmethoden wie OAuth zu unterstützen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar portais de documentação interativos, gerar exemplos de código e automatizar processos de documentação usando a escrita de especificações OpenAPI, com foco em tornar as APIs fáceis de entender e integrar, suportando protocolos como REST e métodos de autenticação como OAuth","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать интерактивные порталы документации, генерировать примеры кода и автоматизировать процессы документации с использованием написания спецификаций OpenAPI, с фокусом на том, чтобы сделать API легко понимаемыми и интегрируемыми, поддерживая протоколы seperti REST и методы аутентификации seperti OAuth","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء بوابات توثيق تفاعلية وتوليد أمثلة من الشفرة وتأتمتة عمليات التوثيق باستخدام كتابة مواصفات OpenAPI، مع التركيز على جعل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات سهلة الفهم والإدماج، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل REST وأساليب المصادقة مثل OAuth"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating API documentation generation","Creating interactive API portals for developer onboarding","Debugging API integration issues using detailed documentation"],"zh":["自动化 API 文档生成","创建开发者入门的交互式 API 门户","使用详细文档调试 API 集成问题"],"ja":["APIドキュメントの自動生成","開発者オンボーディング用のインタラクティブなAPIポータルの作成","詳細なドキュメントを使用したAPI統合の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["API 문서 자동 생성","개발자 온보딩을 위한 상호 작용형 API 포털 생성","상세한 문서를 사용한 API 통합 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de documentación de API","Creación de portales de API interactivos para la incorporación de desarrolladores","Depuración de problemas de integración de API mediante documentación detallada"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de documentation d''API","Création de portails d''API interactifs pour l''intégration des développeurs","Débogage des problèmes d''intégration d''API à l''aide d''une documentation détaillée"],"de":["Automatisierung der API-Dokumentenerstellung","Erstellung interaktiver API-Portale für die Einbindung von Entwicklern","Fehlerbehebung bei API-Integrationsproblemen mithilfe detaillierter Dokumentation"],"pt":["Geração automática de documentação de API","Criação de portais de API interativos para integração de desenvolvedores","Depuração de problemas de integração de API usando documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Автоматическая генерация документации API","Создание интерактивных порталов API для интеграции разработчиков","Отладка проблем интеграции API с использованием подробной документации"],"ar":["توليد تلقائي لتوثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","إنشاء بوابات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات التفاعلية لتكامل المطورين","تصحيح أخطاء دمج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام توثيق مفصل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to API endpoints and schemas","Limited to APIs supporting OpenAPI specifications"],"zh":["需要访问 API 端点和模式","仅限支持 OpenAPI 规范的 API"],"ja":["APIエンドポイントとスキーマへのアクセスが必要","OpenAPI仕様をサポートするAPIのみ"],"ko":["API 엔드ポイント 및 스키마에 대한 액세스가 필요","OpenAPI 사양을 지원하는 API만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a puntos de conexión de API y esquemas","Limitado a API que admiten especificaciones OpenAPI"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux points de terminaison d''API et aux schémas","Limité aux API qui prennent en charge les spécifications OpenAPI"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf API-Endpunkte und Schemata","Begrenzt auf APIs, die OpenAPI-Spezifikationen unterstützen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a endpoints e esquemas de API","Limitado a APIs que suportam especificações OpenAPI"],"ru":["Требует доступа к конечным точкам и схемам API","Ограничен для API, поддерживающих спецификации OpenAPI"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نقاط النهاية ومخططات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","محدود لواجهات برمجة التطبيقات التي تدعم مواصفات OpenAPI"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
