teralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["详细的任务计划","代码和测试指导","文档和开发最佳实践","频繁的提交和代码审查","支持多种开发框架"],"ja":["詳細なタスクプラン","コードとテストのガイド","ドキュメントと開発のベストプラクティス","頻繁なコミットとコードレビュー","多種の開発フレームワークをサポート"],"ko":["자세한 작업 계획","코드 및 테스트 가이드","문서 및 개발 최선의 관행","頻繁한 커밋 및 코드 리뷰","다양한 개발 프레임워크 지원"],"es":["Planificación detallada","Implementación de proyectos de desarrollo","Enfoque en escritura de planes","Creación de planes de implementación","Documentación de proyectos","Pruebas y depuración"],"fr":["Planification détaillée","Mise en œuvre de projets de développement","Approche d''écriture de plans","Création de plans de mise en œuvre","Documentation de projets","Tests et débogage"],"de":["Detaillierte Planung","Implementierung von Entwicklungsprojekten","Ansatz zur Schreibplanung","Erstellung von Implementierungsplänen","Dokumentation von Projekten","Tests und Fehlersuche"],"pt":["Suporte a ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices","Posições alavancadas de longo e curto prazo","Caixa de liquidez centralizada","Preços combinados com oráculo personalizado, Virtual AMM e suavização TWAP"],"ru":["Поддержка активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов","Левериджные позиции долгого и короткого сроков","Централизованная ликвидационная коробка","Цены, объединенные с пользовательским оракулом, виртуальным AMM и сглаживанием TWAP"],"ar":["دعم أصول RWA والعملات المشفرة والأوراق المالية والأسهم","مراكز مالية مخففة طويلة و قصيرة الأجل","صندوق سيولة مركزي","أسعار مجزأة مع محرك أوراكل مخصص و AMM افتراضي وتحسين TWAP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Writing Plans","开发指南","实现计划","代码审查","开发最佳实践","频繁提交","代码测试","开发框架"],"ja":["Writing Plans","開発ガイド","実装計画","コードレビュー","開発のベストプラクティス","頻繁なコミット","コードテスト","開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["Writing Plans","개발 가이드","구현 계획","코드 리뷰","개발 최선의 관행","頻繁한 커밋","코드 테스트","개발 프레임워크"],"es":["escritura de planes","desarrollo de software","planificación de proyectos","implementación de proyectos","documentación de proyectos","pruebas y depuración","desarrollo de aplicaciones","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["écriture de plans","développement de logiciels","planification de projets","mise en œuvre de projets","documentation de projets","tests et débogage","développement d''applications","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Schreibplanung","Software-Entwicklung","Projektplanung","Implementierung von Projekten","Dokumentation von Projekten","Tests und Fehlersuche","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["futuros perpétuos sintéticos","protocolo de futuros","trading de criptomoedas","posições alavancadas","caixa de liquidez centralizada","preços de ativos","oráculo personalizado","Virtual AMM","suavização TWAP"],"ru":["синтетические вечные фьючерсы","протокол фьючерсов","торговля криптовалютами","левериджные позиции","централизованная ликвидационная коробка","цены активов","пользовательский оракул","виртуальный AMM","сглаживание TWAP"],"ar":["عقود آجلة اصطناعية دائمة","بروتوكول العقود الآجلة","تداول العملات المشفرة","مراكز مالية مخففة","صندوق سيولة مركزي","أسعار الأصول","محرك أوراكل مخصص","AMM افتراضي","تحسين TWAP"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writing-plans","description":"Use when design is complete and you need detailed implementation tasks for engineers with zero codebase context - creates comprehensive implementation plans with exact file paths, complete code examples, and verification steps assuming engineer has minimal domain knowledge","bodyPreview":"If there is no spec yet, do NOT use this skill. Use brainstorming or specification skills first.\n\n# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled develo","body":"If there is no spec yet, do NOT use this skill. Use brainstorming or specification skills first.\n\n# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test design very well.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the writing-plans skill to create the implementation plan.\"\n\n**Context:** This should be run in a dedicated worktree (created by brainstorming skill).\n\n**Save plans to:** using scopecraft tools\n\n## Bite-Sized Task Granularity\n\n**Each step is one action (2-5 minutes):**\n- \"Write the failing test\" - step\n- \"Run it to make sure it fails\" - step\n- \"Implement the minimal code to make the test pass\" - step\n- \"Run the tests and make sure they pass\" - step\n- \"Commit\" - step\n\n## Plan Document Header\n\n**Every plan MUST start with this header:**\n\n```markdown\n---\ninsert frontmatter here\n---\n# [Feature Name] Implementation Plan\n\n> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.\n\n**Goal:** [One sentence describing what this builds]\n\n**Architecture:** [2-3 sentences about approach]\n\n**Tech Stack:** [Key technologies/libraries]\n```\n\n\n## Task Structure\n\n```markdown\n### Task N: [Component Name]\n\n**Files:**\n- Create: `exact/path/to/file.py`\n- Modify: `exact/path/to/existing.py:123-145`\n- Test: `tests/exact/path/to/test.py`\n\n**Step 1: Write the failing test**\n\n```python\ndef test_specific_behavior():\n    result = function(input)\n    assert result == expected\n```\n\n**Step 2: Run test to verify it fails**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: FAIL with \"function not defined\"\n\n**Step 3: Write minimal implementation**\n\n```python\ndef function(input):\n    return expected\n```\n\n**Step 4: Run test to verify it passes**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: PASS\n\n**Step 5: Commit**\n\n```bash\ngit add tests/path/test.py src/path/file.py\ngit commit -m \"feat: add specific feature\"\n```\n```\n\n## Remember\n- Exact file paths always\n- Complete code in plan (not \"add validation\")\n- Exact commands with expected output\n- Reference relevant skills with @ syntax\n- DRY, YAGNI, TDD, frequent commits\n\n## Execution Handoff\n\nAfter saving the plan, offer execution choice:\n\n**\"Plan complete and saved to `docs/plans/<filename>.md`. Two execution options:**\n\n**1. Subagent-Driven (this session)** - I dispatch fresh subagent per task, review between tasks, fast iteration\n\n**2. Parallel Session (separate)** - Open new session with executing-plans, batch execution with checkpoints\n\n**Which approach?\"**\n\n**If Subagent-Driven chosen:**\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development\n- Stay in this session\n- Fresh subagent per task + code review\n\n**If Parallel Session chosen:**\n- Guide them to open new session in worktree\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** New session uses superpowers:executing-plans\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:26:54.545Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured implementation planning and documentation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化实施规划和文档编制能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが構造化された実装計画と文書化能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 구현 계획 및 문서화 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una planificación de implementación estructurada y capacidades de documentación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une planification d''implémentation structurée et des capacités de documentation.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine strukturierte Implementierungsplanung und Dokumentationsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de planejamento de implementação estruturado e capacidades de documentação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы структурированный план реализации и возможности документирования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط تنفيذ منظم وقدرات توثيقية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive implementation plans using TDD, DRY, and YAGNI principles, combining code, testing, and documentation into bite-sized tasks with frequent commits, all while assuming a zero-context codebase and supporting per-user on-chain vaults and central liquidity vaults for leveraged trading.","zh":"赋予代理创建全面实施计划的能力，使用TDD、DRY和YAGNI原则，将代码、测试和文档组合成小任务，频繁提交，同时假设零上下文代码库，并支持每用户的链上金库和中心流动性金库用于杠杆交易。","ja":"エージェントがTDD、DRY、YAGNI原則を使用して包括的な実装計画を作成できるようにし、コード、テスト、文書を小さなタスクに組み合わせて頻繁にコミットし、ゼロコンテキストコードベースと各ユーザーのオンチェーンバウチャーおよび中央流動性バウチャーをサポートし、レバレッジ取引に使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 TDD, DRY, YAGNI 원칙을 사용하여 포괄적인 구현 계획을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 코드, 테스트 및 문서를 작은 작업으로 결합하여 빈번한 커밋을 수행하며, 영 컨텍스트 코드베이스 및 각 사용자의 체인 온 보울트 및 중앙 유동성 보울트를 지원하여 레버리지 거래에 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear planes de implementación integrales utilizando los principios TDD, DRY y YAGNI, combinando código, pruebas y documentación en tareas de tamaño reducido con commits frecuentes, asumiendo una base de código de contexto cero y admitiendo bóvedas de cadena por usuario y bóvedas de liquidez centralizadas para operaciones con apalancamiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des plans d''implémentation complets en utilisant les principes TDD, DRY et YAGNI, en combinant code, tests et documentation en tâches de petite taille avec des validations fréquentes, en supposant une base de code sans contexte et en prenant en charge les coffres-forts en chaîne par utilisateur et les coffres-forts de liquidité centralisés pour les opérations à effet de levier.","de":"Ermächtigt Mittel, umfassende Implementierungspläne unter Verwendung der TDD-, DRY- und YAGNI-Prinzipien zu erstellen, indem Code, Tests und Dokumentation in kleine Aufgaben mit häufigen Commits kombiniert werden, unter der Annahme einer Codebasis ohne Kontext und mit Unterstützung von Benutzer-On-Chain-Tresoren und zentralen Liquiditätstresoren für Hebelgeschäfte.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar planos de implementação abrangentes usando princípios TDD, DRY e YAGNI, combinando código, testes e documentação em tarefas de tamanho reduzido com commits frequentes, assumindo uma base de código sem contexto e suportando cofres de corrente por usuário e cofres de liquidez centralizados para negociação alavancada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать обширные планы реализации, используя принципы TDD, DRY и YAGNI, объединяя код, тестирование и документацию в небольшие задачи с частыми коммитами, предполагая базу кода без контекста и поддерживая перечисленные хранилища на цепочке для каждого пользователя и централизованные хранилища ликвидности для торговли с кредитным плечом.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء خطط تنفيذ شاملة باستخدام مبادئ TDD و DRY و YAGNI، ودمج الكود والاختبارات والتوثيق في مهام بحجم مناسب مع الالتزامات المتكررة، افتراض قاعدة كود خالية من السياق ودعم الخزائن السلسلة لكل مستخدم والخزائن السائلة المركزية للتداول المضخّم."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating detailed task lists for engineers","Creating documentation for synthetic perpetual futures protocols","Testing and validating code for RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes"],"zh":["为工程师生成详细的任务列表","为合成永续期货协议创建文档","测试和验证代码，用于RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数"],"ja":["エンジニア向けの詳細なタスクリストを生成する","合成永続期限契約の文書を作成する","RWAアセット、暗号通貨、株式、指数のコードをテストして検証する"],"ko":["엔지니어를 위한詳細한 작업 목록 생성","합성 영구 선물 프로토콜을 위한 문서 생성","RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수에 대한 코드 테스트 및 검증"],"es":["Generación de listas de tareas detalladas para ingenieros","Creación de documentación para protocolos de futuros perpetuos sintéticos","Pruebas y validación de código para activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices"],"fr":["Génération de listes de tâches détaillées pour les ingénieurs","Création de documentation pour les protocoles de futures synthétiques perpétuels","Tests et validation de code pour les actifs RWA, les crypto-monnaies, les actions et les indices"],"de":["Erstellung detaillierter Aufgabenlisten für Ingenieure","Erstellung von Dokumentationen für synthetische Perpetual-Futures-Protokolle","Testen und Validieren von Code für RWA-Vermögenswerte, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes"],"pt":["Geração de listas de tarefas detalhadas para engenheiros","Criação de documentação para protocolos de futuros perpétuos sintéticos","Testes e validação de código para ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices"],"ru":["Генерация подробных списков задач для инженеров","Создание документации для протоколов синтетических вечных фьючерсов","Тестирование и проверка кода для активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов"],"ar":["إنشاء قائمة مهام مفصلة لمهندسي البرمجيات","创ية توثيق لبروتوكولات العقود الآجلة المستدامة المصنّعة","اختبار وتحقق الكود للاصول RWA والعملات المشفرة والأوراق المالية والأسواق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specification or brainstorming skills as prerequisites","Assumes skilled developer with questionable taste","Limited to perpetual futures protocol and trading use cases"],"zh":["需要规格或头脑风暴技能作为先决条件","假设开发人员具有可疑的品位","仅限于永续期货协议和交易用例"],"ja":["仕様またはブレインストーミングスキルが先决条件として必要","スキルを持った開発者が疑わしい味を持ち合わせていると仮定","永続期限契約およびトレーディング用途への使用が限定される"],"ko":["사양 또는 브레인 스토밍 기술이 사전 조건으로 필요","개발자가 의심스러운 취향을 가지고 있다고 가정","영구 선물 프로토콜 및 거래용 사례로 제한"],"es":["Requiere habilidades de especificación o de lluvia de ideas como requisitos previos","Supone un desarrollador experimentado con gusto cuestionable","Limitado a protocolos de futuros perpetuos y casos de uso de operaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite des compétences de spécification ou de réflexion créative comme prérequis","Suppose un développeur expérimenté avec un goût discutable","Limité aux protocoles de futures perpétuels et aux cas d''utilisation des opérations"],"de":["Erfordert Spezifikations- oder Brainstorming-Fähigkeiten als Voraussetzungen","Geht von einem erfahrenen Entwickler mit fragwürdigem Geschmack aus","Begrenzt auf Perpetual-Futures-Protokolle und Handelsanwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Exige habilidades de especificação ou brainstorming como pré-requisitos","Pressupõe desenvolvedor habilidoso com gosto questionável","Limitado a casos de uso de protocolos de futuros perpétuos e negociação"],"ru":["Требует навыков спецификации или мозгового штурма в качестве предварительных требований","Предполагает опытного разработчика с сомнительным вкусом","Ограничен протоколами вечных фьючерсов и торговыми случаями"],"ar":["يتطلب مهارات توثيق أو عمل دمى كمتطلبات مسبقة","يفترض مطوّر ماهر ذا ذوق مشكوك فيه","محدود ببروتوكولات العقود الآجلة المستدامة وحالات الاستخدام التجارية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('aiyuekuang/LLMProxy/product-design', 'community', 'aiyuekuang', 'LLMProxy', 'aiyuekuang/LLMProxy', 'product-design', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z', '2026-02-18T12:27:26.947Z', NULL, '{"id":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy/product-design","name":"product-design","description":{"zh":"产品设计技能涉及产品思维、需求定义和功能规范，用于指导产品开发","ja":"製品設計スキルは、製品思考、要件定義、機能仕様を含み、製品開発を導く","ko":"제품 디자인 스킬은 제품 사고, 요구 사항 정의, 기능 명세를 포함하여 제품 개발을 가이드한다","es":"El diseño de producto implica la definición de requisitos y la especificación de características para crear productos innovadores","fr":"La conception de produit implique la définition des exigences et la spécification des fonctionnalités pour créer des produits innovants","de":"Das Produktdesign umfasst die Definition von Anforderungen und die Spezifikation von Funktionen, um innovative Produkte zu erstellen","pt":"O desenho de produto envolve a definição de requisitos e especificação de recursos para desenvolvedores","ru":"Проектирование продукта включает определение требований и спецификацию функций для разработчиков","ar":"تصميم المنتج ينطوي على تحديد المتطلبات وتصميم الميزات للمطورين","en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE). LLMProxy handles both modes out of the box, with zero buffering on streams, intelligent load balancing, and OpenA..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"产品设计技能 - 产品思维和功能规范","ja":"製品設計スキル - 製品思考と機能仕様","ko":"제품 디자인 스킬 - 제품 사고와 기능 명세","es":"Diseño de Producto: Desarrollo de Requisitos y Caracterís...","fr":"Conception de Produit: Définition des Exigences et Foncti...","de":"Produktdesign: Anforderungsdefinition und Funktionsspezif...","pt":"Desenho de Produto: Técnico de SEO para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Проектирование Продукта: Технический SEO для Разработчиков","ar":"تصميم المنتج: تحسين محركات البحث الفني للمطورين","en":"product-design"},"description":{"zh":"产品设计技能涉及产品思维、需求定义和功能规范，用于指导产品开发","ja":"製品設計スキルは、製品思考、要件定義、機能仕様を含み、製品開発を導く","ko":"제품 디자인 스킬은 제품 사고, 요구 사항 정의, 기능 명세를 포함하여 제품 개발을 가이드한다","es":"El diseño de producto implica la definición de requisitos y la especificación de características para crear productos innovadores","fr":"La conception de produit implique la définition des exigences et la spécification des fonctionnalités pour créer des produits innovants","de":"Das Produktdesign umfasst die Definition von Anforderungen und die Spezifikation von Funktionen, um innovative Produkte zu erstellen","pt":"O desenho de produto envolve a definição de requisitos e especificação de recursos para desenvolvedores","ru":"Проектирование продукта включает определение требований и спецификацию функций для разработчиков","ar":"تصميم المنتج ينطوي على تحديد المتطلبات وتصميم الميزات للمطورين","en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via..."},"definition":{"en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE). LLMProxy handles both modes out of the box, with zero buffering on streams, intelligent load balancing, and OpenAI-compatible API routing."},"features":{"zh":["产品思维","需求定义","功能规范","产品路线图规划","MVP范围定义"],"ja":["製品思考","要件定義","機能仕様","製品ロードマップ計画","MVP範囲定義"],"ko":["제품 사고","요구 사항 정의","기능 명세","제품 로드맵 계획","MVP 범위 정의"],"es":["Definición de requisitos del producto","Especificación de características","Planificación de la hoja de ruta del producto","Priorización de características","Creación de un documento de requisitos del producto (PRD)"],"fr":["Définition des exigences du produit","Spécification des fonctionnalités","Planification de la feuille de route du produit","Priorisation des fonctionnalités","Création d''un document d''exigences du produit (PRD)"],"de":["Definition von Produktanforderungen","Spezifikation von Funktionen","Planung der Produkt-Roadmap","Priorisierung von Funktionen","Erstellung eines Produktanforderungsdokuments (PRD)"],"pt":["Definição de requisitos de produto","Especificação de recursos","Priorização de recursos","Planejamento de roadmap de produto","Definição de MVP"],"ru":["Определение требований продукта","Спецификация функций","Приоритизация функций","Планирование дорожной карты продукта","Определение MVP"],"ar":["تحديد متطلبات المنتج","تصميم الميزات","ترتيب الأولويات للميزات","تخطيط خريطة طريق المنتج","تحديد MVP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["产品设计","产品思维","需求定义","功能规范","产品路线图","MVP","产品开发","软件开发"],"ja":["製品設計","製品思考","要件定義","機能仕様","製品ロードマップ","MVP","製品開発","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["제품 디자인","제품 사고","요구 사항 정의","기능 명세","제품 로드맵","MVP","제품 개발","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["diseño de producto","desarrollo de producto","requisitos del producto","características del producto","planificación de la hoja de ruta del producto","priorización de características"],"fr":["conception de produit","développement de produit","exigences du produit","fonctionnalités du produit","planification de la feuille de route du produit","priorisation des fonctionnalités"],"de":["Produktdesign","Produktentwicklung","Produktanforderungen","Produktfunktionen","Planung der Produkt-Roadmap","Priorisierung von Funktionen"],"pt":["desenho de produto","SEO para desenvolvedores","requisitos de produto","especificação de recursos","priorização de recursos","planejamento de produto"],"ru":["проектирование продукта","SEO для разработчиков","требования продукта","спецификация функций","приоритизация функций","планирование продукта"],"ar":["تصميم المنتج","تحسين محركات البحث للمطورين","متطلبات المنتج","تصميم الميزات","ترتيب الأولويات للميزات","تخطيط المنتج"]}},"owner":"aiyuekuang","repo":"LLMProxy","repoPath":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"product-design","description":"Product design and requirements analysis. Use when writing PRDs, defining features, user stories, and product specifications.","bodyPreview":"# Product Design Skill\n\nProduct thinking, requirements definition, and feature specification.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing product requirements (PRD)\n- Defining user stories\n- Feature prioritization\n- Product roadmap planning\n- MVP scoping\n\n---\n\n# 📋 Product Requirements Document (PRD)\n\n## PRD Template\n\n```markdown\n# Feature Name\n\n## Overview\nBrief description of the feature and its purpose.\n\n## Goals\n- Primary goal\n- Success metrics (KPIs)\n\n## User Stories\nAs a [user type], I want to [","body":"# Product Design Skill\n\nProduct thinking, requirements definition, and feature specification.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing product requirements (PRD)\n- Defining user stories\n- Feature prioritization\n- Product roadmap planning\n- MVP scoping\n\n---\n\n# 📋 Product Requirements Document (PRD)\n\n## PRD Template\n\n```markdown\n# Feature Name\n\n## Overview\nBrief description of the feature and its purpose.\n\n## Goals\n- Primary goal\n- Success metrics (KPIs)\n\n## User Stories\nAs a [user type], I want to [action] so that [benefit].\n\n## Requirements\n\n### Functional Requirements\n1. FR-001: User can create...\n2. FR-002: System should...\n\n### Non-Functional Requirements\n- Performance: Response < 200ms\n- Availability: 99.9% uptime\n- Security: Role-based access\n\n## User Flow\n1. User clicks \"Create\"\n2. Form appears\n3. User fills fields\n4. Submit → Success message\n\n## UI/UX Considerations\n- Design mockups link\n- Edge cases\n- Error states\n\n## Technical Considerations\n- API changes needed\n- Database schema updates\n- Third-party integrations\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Feature X (future phase)\n- Feature Y (not planned)\n\n## Timeline\n- Design: Week 1\n- Development: Week 2-3\n- Testing: Week 4\n- Release: Week 5\n\n## Open Questions\n- [ ] Question 1?\n- [ ] Question 2?\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📝 User Stories\n\n## Format\n\n```\nAs a [user persona]\nI want to [action/goal]\nSo that [benefit/value]\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n```markdown\n# Good User Stories\n\nAs a developer\nI want to generate API keys from the dashboard\nSo that I can authenticate my applications quickly\n\nAs an admin\nI want to view usage analytics per user\nSo that I can identify heavy users and plan capacity\n\nAs a new user\nI want guided onboarding\nSo that I can understand how to use the platform quickly\n```\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n```markdown\n**Story**: User can reset password\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- [ ] User receives reset email within 1 minute\n- [ ] Reset link expires after 24 hours\n- [ ] Password must meet complexity requirements\n- [ ] User is logged in after successful reset\n- [ ] Old sessions are invalidated\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🎯 Feature Prioritization\n\n## RICE Framework\n\n```\nRICE Score = (Reach × Impact × Confidence) / Effort\n\nReach:      Users affected per quarter\nImpact:     0.25 (minimal) to 3 (massive)\nConfidence: 100% (high) to 50% (low)\nEffort:     Person-months\n```\n\n## MoSCoW Method\n\n| Priority | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| **Must Have** | Critical for launch |\n| **Should Have** | Important but not critical |\n| **Could Have** | Nice to have if time |\n| **Won''t Have** | Out of scope for now |\n\n## Priority Matrix\n\n```\n        High Impact\n             │\n    Quick    │    Big\n    Wins     │    Bets\n             │\nLow ─────────┼───────── High\nEffort       │         Effort\n             │\n    Fill     │    Money\n    Ins      │    Pit\n             │\n        Low Impact\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🗺️ Product Roadmap\n\n## Quarterly Roadmap\n\n```markdown\n## Q1 2024 - Foundation\n\n### Month 1\n- [ ] User authentication system\n- [ ] Basic API key management\n\n### Month 2\n- [ ] Usage tracking\n- [ ] Dashboard v1\n\n### Month 3\n- [ ] Rate limiting\n- [ ] Basic analytics\n\n## Q2 2024 - Growth\n\n### Month 4-6\n- [ ] Team management\n- [ ] Advanced analytics\n- [ ] Billing integration\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🚀 MVP Definition\n\n## MVP Checklist\n\n```markdown\n## Core Value Proposition\nWhat is the ONE thing this product must do?\n\n## Minimum Features\n1. Feature A (essential)\n2. Feature B (essential)\n3. Feature C (nice to have) ← Cut this\n\n## Success Criteria\n- 100 beta users\n- 50% retention after 1 week\n- NPS > 30\n\n## Timeline\n- 4-6 weeks maximum\n- Ship early, iterate fast\n```\n\n## Feature Scope Matrix\n\n| Feature | MVP | V1.0 | V2.0 |\n|---------|-----|------|------|\n| User auth | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| API keys | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Basic dashboard | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Usage analytics | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Team features | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |\n| SSO | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n# 👥 Personas\n\n## Persona Template\n\n```markdown\n## Developer Dan\n\n**Role**: Full-stack developer at startup\n\n**Goals**:\n- Ship features quickly\n- Minimize infrastructure work\n- Stay within budget\n\n**Pain Points**:\n- Complex API integrations\n- Managing multiple AI providers\n- Unpredictable costs\n\n**Behaviors**:\n- Prefers documentation over videos\n- Values developer experience\n- Price-sensitive\n\n**Quote**: \"I just want it to work without reading 50 pages of docs.\"\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📊 Success Metrics\n\n## AARRR Framework (Pirate Metrics)\n\n| Stage | Metric | Example |\n|-------|--------|---------|\n| **Acquisition** | How users find you | Sign-ups, traffic |\n| **Activation** | First value moment | First API call |\n| **Retention** | Users coming back | DAU/MAU, churn |\n| **Revenue** | Monetization | MRR, ARPU |\n| **Referral** | Users sharing | NPS, referral rate |\n\n## Key Metrics\n\n```markdown\n## North Star Metric\nTotal API calls processed per day\n\n## Supporting Metrics\n- Active users (DAU/WAU/MAU)\n- Activation rate (%)\n- Churn rate (%)\n- Average revenue per user (ARPU)\n- Customer acquisition cost (CAC)\n- Lifetime value (LTV)\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📚 References\n\n- [Inspired by Marty Cagan](https://www.svpg.com/inspired-how-to-create-products-customers-love/)\n- [Shape Up by Basecamp](https://basecamp.com/shapeup)\n- [Product School](https://productschool.com/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:27:26.947Z","qualityScore":70}');
