 les développeurs","de":"Root Cause Tracing für Entwickler","pt":"Rastreamento de Causa Raiz","ru":"Отслеживание коренной причины","ar":"تتبع السبب الجذري","en":"root-cause-tracing"},"description":{"zh":"Root Cause Tracing","ja":"Root Cause Tracing","ko":"Root Cause Tracing","es":"El rastreo de causa raíz es una técnica para identificar y solucionar errores de manera efectiva. Permite a los desarrolladores encontrar la causa original d...","fr":"Le traçage de cause racine est une technique pour identifier et résoudre les erreurs de manière efficace. Il permet aux développeurs de trouver la cause orig...","de":"Root Cause Tracing ist eine Technik, um Fehler effektiv zu identifizieren und zu beheben. Sie ermöglicht es Entwicklern, die ursprüngliche Ursache eines Prob...","pt":"O rastreamento de causa raiz é uma técnica para identificar a origem de um problema, permitindo soluções mais eficazes","ru":"Отслеживание коренной причины - это техника для выявления источника проблемы, позволяющая находить более эффективные решения","ar":"تتبع السبب الجذري هو تقنية لتحديد مصدر المشكلة، مما يسمح بالحصول على حلول أكثر فعالية","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing"],"ja":["Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing"],"ko":["Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing"],"es":["Identificación de la causa original de un error","Técnica para depuración efectiva","Mejora de las habilidades de resolución de problemas","Análisis de la cadena de llamadas","Solución de errores de manera eficiente"],"fr":["Identification de la cause originale d''une erreur","Technique pour un débogage efficace","Amélioration des compétences de résolution de problèmes","Analyse de la chaîne d''appels","Résolution d''erreurs de manière efficace"],"de":["Identifizierung der ursprünglichen Ursache eines Fehlers","Technik für effektive Fehlersuche","Verbesserung der Fähigkeiten zur Problemlösung","Analyse der Aufrufkette","Behebung von Fehlern auf effiziente Weise"],"pt":["Identificação da causa raiz","Análise de problemas complexos","Soluções eficazes","Melhoria da depuração"],"ru":["Выявление коренной причины","Анализ сложных проблем","Эффективные решения","Улучшение отладки"],"ar":["تحديد السبب الجذري","تحليل مشكلات معقدة","حلول فعالة","تحسين التصحيح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing"],"ja":["Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing"],"ko":["Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing","Root Cause Tracing"],"es":["rastreo de causa raíz","depuración de código","resolución de errores","análisis de cadena de llamadas","desarrollo de software","tecnología de desarrollo"],"fr":["traçage de cause racine","débogage de code","résolution d''erreurs","analyse de chaîne d''appels","développement de logiciels","technologie de développement"],"de":["Root Cause Tracing","Fehlersuche im Code","Fehlerbehebung","Analyse der Aufrufkette","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstechnologie"],"pt":["rastreamento de causa raiz","análise de problemas","soluções eficazes","depuração","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["отслеживание коренной причины","анализ проблем","эффективные решения","отладка","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تتبع السبب الجذري","تحليل المشكلات","حلول فعالة","التصحيح","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"root-cause-tracing","description":"Use when errors occur deep in execution and you need to trace back to find the original trigger - systematically traces bugs backward through call stack, adding instrumentation when needed, to identify source of invalid data or incorrect behavior","bodyPreview":"# Root Cause Tracing\n\n## Overview\n\nBugs often manifest deep in the call stack (git init in wrong directory, file created in wrong location, database opened with wrong path). Your instinct is to fix where the error appears, but that''s treating a symptom.\n\n**Core principle:** Trace backward through the call chain until you find the original trigger, then fix at the source.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Bug appears deep in stack?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Can trace backwards?\" [sh","body":"# Root Cause Tracing\n\n## Overview\n\nBugs often manifest deep in the call stack (git init in wrong directory, file created in wrong location, database opened with wrong path). Your instinct is to fix where the error appears, but that''s treating a symptom.\n\n**Core principle:** Trace backward through the call chain until you find the original trigger, then fix at the source.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Bug appears deep in stack?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Can trace backwards?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Fix at symptom point\" [shape=box];\n    \"Trace to original trigger\" [shape=box];\n    \"BETTER: Also add defense-in-depth\" [shape=box];\n\n    \"Bug appears deep in stack?\" -> \"Can trace backwards?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Can trace backwards?\" -> \"Trace to original trigger\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Can trace backwards?\" -> \"Fix at symptom point\" [label=\"no - dead end\"];\n    \"Trace to original trigger\" -> \"BETTER: Also add defense-in-depth\";\n}\n```\n\n**Use when:**\n- Error happens deep in execution (not at entry point)\n- Stack trace shows long call chain\n- Unclear where invalid data originated\n- Need to find which test/code triggers the problem\n\n## The Tracing Process\n\n### 1. Observe the Symptom\n```\nError: git init failed in /Users/jesse/project/packages/core\n```\n\n### 2. Find Immediate Cause\n**What code directly causes this?**\n```typescript\nawait execFileAsync(''git'', [''init''], { cwd: projectDir });\n```\n\n### 3. Ask: What Called This?\n```typescript\nWorktreeManager.createSessionWorktree(projectDir, sessionId)\n  → called by Session.initializeWorkspace()\n  → called by Session.create()\n  → called by test at Project.create()\n```\n\n### 4. Keep Tracing Up\n**What value was passed?**\n- `projectDir = ''''` (empty string!)\n- Empty string as `cwd` resolves to `process.cwd()`\n- That''s the source code directory!\n\n### 5. Find Original Trigger\n**Where did empty string come from?**\n```typescript\nconst context = setupCoreTest(); // Returns { tempDir: '''' }\nProject.create(''name'', context.tempDir); // Accessed before beforeEach!\n```\n\n## Adding Stack Traces\n\nWhen you can''t trace manually, add instrumentation:\n\n```typescript\n// Before the problematic operation\nasync function gitInit(directory: string) {\n  const stack = new Error().stack;\n  console.error(''DEBUG git init:'', {\n    directory,\n    cwd: process.cwd(),\n    nodeEnv: process.env.NODE_ENV,\n    stack,\n  });\n\n  await execFileAsync(''git'', [''init''], { cwd: directory });\n}\n```\n\n**Critical:** Use `console.error()` in tests (not logger - may not show)\n\n**Run and capture:**\n```bash\nnpm test 2>&1 | grep ''DEBUG git init''\n```\n\n**Analyze stack traces:**\n- Look for test file names\n- Find the line number triggering the call\n- Identify the pattern (same test? same parameter?)\n\n## Finding Which Test Causes Pollution\n\nIf something appears during tests but you don''t know which test:\n\nUse the bisection script: @find-polluter.sh\n\n```bash\n./find-polluter.sh ''.git'' ''src/**/*.test.ts''\n```\n\nRuns tests one-by-one, stops at first polluter. See script for usage.\n\n## Real Example: Empty projectDir\n\n**Symptom:** `.git` created in `packages/core/` (source code)\n\n**Trace chain:**\n1. `git init` runs in `process.cwd()` ← empty cwd parameter\n2. WorktreeManager called with empty projectDir\n3. Session.create() passed empty string\n4. Test accessed `context.tempDir` before beforeEach\n5. setupCoreTest() returns `{ tempDir: '''' }` initially\n\n**Root cause:** Top-level variable initialization accessing empty value\n\n**Fix:** Made tempDir a getter that throws if accessed before beforeEach\n\n**Also added defense-in-depth:**\n- Layer 1: Project.create() validates directory\n- Layer 2: WorkspaceManager validates not empty\n- Layer 3: NODE_ENV guard refuses git init outside tmpdir\n- Layer 4: Stack trace logging before git init\n\n## Key Principle\n\n```dot\ndigraph principle {\n    \"Found immediate cause\" [shape=ellipse];\n    \"Can trace one level up?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Trace backwards\" [shape=box];\n    \"Is this the source?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Fix at source\" [shape=box];\n    \"Add validation at each layer\" [shape=box];\n    \"Bug impossible\" [shape=doublecircle];\n    \"NEVER fix just the symptom\" [shape=octagon, style=filled, fillcolor=red, fontcolor=white];\n\n    \"Found immediate cause\" -> \"Can trace one level up?\";\n    \"Can trace one level up?\" -> \"Trace backwards\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Can trace one level up?\" -> \"NEVER fix just the symptom\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Trace backwards\" -> \"Is this the source?\";\n    \"Is this the source?\" -> \"Trace backwards\" [label=\"no - keeps going\"];\n    \"Is this the source?\" -> \"Fix at source\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Fix at source\" -> \"Add validation at each layer\";\n    \"Add validation at each layer\" -> \"Bug impossible\";\n}\n```\n\n**NEVER fix just where the error appears.** Trace back to find the original trigger.\n\n## Stack Trace Tips\n\n**In tests:** Use `console.error()` not logger - logger may be suppressed\n**Before operation:** Log before the dangerous operation, not after it fails\n**Include context:** Directory, cwd, environment variables, timestamps\n**Capture stack:** `new Error().stack` shows complete call chain\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\nFrom debugging session (2025-10-03):\n- Found root cause through 5-level trace\n- Fixed at source (getter validation)\n- Added 4 layers of defense\n- 1847 tests passed, zero pollution\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:27:42.137Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing advanced root cause analysis capabilities in complex call stacks.","zh":"非常适合需要在复杂调用堆栈中进行高级根因分析的调试代理。","ja":"複雑なコールスタックで高度な根本原因分析機能が必要なデバッグエージェントに最適です。","ko":"복잡한 호출 스택에서 고급 루트 원인 분석 기능이 필요한 디버깅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de depuración que necesitan capacidades de análisis de causa raíz avanzadas en pilas de llamadas complejas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de débogage ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse de cause racine avancées dans des piles d''appels complexes.","de":"Perfekt für Debugging-Agents, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Analyse der Ursache in komplexen Aufrufstapeln benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Depuração que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise de causa raiz em pilhas de chamadas complexas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов отладки, требующих продвинутых возможностей анализа коренной причины в сложных стеках вызовов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل调试 الحاجة إلى قدرات تحليل السبب الأصلي المتقدمة في مكدسات الدعوة المعقدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trace backwards through the call chain, identifying original triggers and fixing issues at the source, utilizing techniques like git init and database path analysis.","zh":"赋予代理追踪调用链的能力，找出原始触发器并在源头解决问题，利用诸如git init和数据库路径分析等技术。","ja":"コールチェーンを逆方向に追跡し、元のトリガーを特定し、ソースで問題を修正するエージェントをEmpowerします。git initやデータベースパス分析などの手法を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 호출 체인을 역방향으로 추적하여 원래 트리거를 식별하고 소스에서 문제를 해결할 수 있게 합니다. git init 및 데이터베이스 경로 분석과 같은 기술을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a rastrear hacia atrás a través de la cadena de llamadas, identificando los desencadenantes originales y solucionando problemas en la fuente, utilizando técnicas como git init y análisis de ruta de base de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de retracer vers l''arrière à travers la chaîne d''appels, en identifiant les déclencheurs originaux et en résolvant les problèmes à la source, en utilisant des techniques comme git init et l''analyse du chemin de base de données.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, rückwärts durch die Aufrufkette zu verfolgen, die ursprünglichen Auslöser zu identifizieren und Probleme an der Quelle zu beheben, indem Techniken wie git init und Datenbankpfadanalyse verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a rastrear para trás pela cadeia de chamadas, identificando gatilhos originais e corrigindo problemas na fonte, utilizando técnicas como git init e análise de caminho de banco de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать назад по цепочке вызовов, определяя исходные триггеры и исправляя проблемы у источника, используя методы như git init и анализ пути базы данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تتبع الخلف من خلال سلسلة الدعوة، وتحديد الأسباب الأصلية وإصلاح المشكلات في المصدر، باستخدام تقنيات مثل git init وتحليل مسار قاعدة البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging deep-seated errors in codebases","Tracing backwards through complex call stacks","Identifying original triggers for bugs"],"zh":["调试代码库中的深层错误","逆向追踪复杂的调用堆栈","识别错误的原始触发器"],"ja":["コードベースの深層的なエラーのデバッグ","複雑なコールスタックを逆方向に追跡","バグの元のトリガーを特定"],"ko":["코드베이스의 깊은 오류 디버깅","복잡한 호출 스택을 역방향으로 추적","버그의 원래 트리거 식별"],"es":["Depuración de errores profundamente arraigados en las bases de código","Rastrear hacia atrás a través de pilas de llamadas complejas","Identificar los desencadenantes originales de los errores"],"fr":["Débogage d''erreurs profondément ancrées dans les bases de code","Retracer vers l''arrière à travers des piles d''appels complexes","Identifier les déclencheurs originaux des bogues"],"de":["Fehler in Codebasen zu finden und zu beheben","Rückwärts durch komplexe Aufrufstapel verfolgen","Ursprüngliche Auslöser für Fehler identifizieren"],"pt":["Depuração de erros profundamente enraizados em codebases","Rastrear para trás por pilhas de chamadas complexas","Identificar gatilhos originais para bugs"],"ru":["Отладка глубоко укоренившихся ошибок в кодовых базах","Отслеживание назад по сложным стекам вызовов","Определение исходных триггеров для ошибок"],"ar":["تصحيح الأخطاء المتأصلة深око في قواعد الكود","تتبع الخلف من خلال مكدسات الدعوة المعقدة","تحديد الأسباب الأصلية للأخطاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to call stack and codebase","May require manual analysis for extremely complex issues"],"zh":["需要访问调用堆栈和代码库","可能需要手动分析极其复杂的问题"],"ja":["コールスタックとコードベースへのアクセスが必要","極めて複雑な問題の場合は手動分析が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["호출 스택과 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","극도로 복잡한 문제의 경우 수동 분석이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la pila de llamadas y a la base de código","Puede requerir análisis manual para problemas extremadamente complejos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la pile d''appels et à la base de code","Peut nécessiter une analyse manuelle pour des problèmes extrêmement complexes"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Aufrufstapel und die Codebasis","Kann manuelle Analyse für extrem komplexe Probleme erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso à pilha de chamadas e codebase","Pode requerer análise manual para questões extremamente complexas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к стеку вызовов и кодовой базе","Может требовать ручного анализа для чрезвычайно сложных вопросов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مكدس الدعوة وقاعدة الكود","يمكن أن يتطلب التحليل اليدوي للمسائل المعقدة للغاية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/state-management', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'state-management', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.509Z', '2026-02-18T12:27:43.002Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/state-management","name":"state-management","description":{"zh":"状态管理是一种合成永续期货协议，支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数。它提供了推荐的结构和最佳实践，用于组织全局状态和特征特定状态","ja":"ステート管理は、RWAアセット、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポートする合成永続期貨プロトコルです。グローバルステートと機能特定のステートを組織するための推奨構造とベストプラクティスを提供します","ko":"상태 관리는 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식 및 지수를 지원하는 합성 영구期货 프로토콜입니다. 전역 상태와 기능 별 상태를 구성하기 위한 추천 구조와 모범 사례를 제공합니다","es":"La gestión de estado es crucial en un protocolo de futuros sintéticos. Aprende sobre la organización de átomos y el patrón de gestión de estado.","fr":"La gestion d''état est essentielle dans un protocole de futures synthétiques. Découvrez l''organisation des atomes et le modèle de gestion d''état.","de":"Die Zustandsverwaltung ist entscheidend in einem synthetischen Futures-Protokoll. Erfahren Sie mehr über die Organisation von Atomen und das Muster der Zustandsverwaltung.","pt":"O gerenciamento de estado é uma técnica fundamental em desenvolvimento de software, permitindo que os desenvolvedores gerenciem de forma eficaz o estado das aplicações.","ru":"Управление состоянием является фундаментальной техникой в разработке программного обеспечения, позволяющей разработчикам эффективно управлять состоянием приложений.","ar":"إدارة الحالة هي تقنية أساسية في تطوير البرمجيات، مما يسمح للمطورين بإدارة حالة التطبيقات بفعالية.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as