,"ar":"استلام مراجعة الكود بفعالية","en":"receiving-code-review"},"description":{"zh":"代码审查是一项关键的开发流程，确保代码质量和可维护性。有效的代码审查技巧可以帮助开发者提高代码质量和开发效率","ja":"コードレビューは、コード品質とメンテナンス性を確保するための重要な開発プロセスです。効果的なコードレビュースキルは、開発者がコード品質と開発効率を向上させるのに役立ちます","ko":"코드 리뷰는 코드 품질과 유지 보수성을 보장하는 중요한 개발 프로세스입니다. 효과적인 코드 리뷰 기술은 개발자가 코드 품질과 개발 효율성을 향상시키는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Revisión de código para desarrolladores. Aprende a evaluar y responder a feedback técnico","fr":"Révision de code pour développeurs. Apprenez à évaluer et à répondre aux commentaires techniques","de":"Code-Review für Entwickler. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie technisches Feedback bewerten und beantworten","pt":"Receba revisão de código de forma técnica e objetiva, melhorando a colaboração em equipe e a qualidade do código","ru":"Получайте код-ревью технически и объективно, улучшая командную работу и качество кода","ar":"استلم مراجعة الكود بشكل فني وموضوعي لتحسين تنسيق الفريق وجودة الكود","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["技术评估","代码验证","开发效率提高","代码质量保证","有效的沟通"],"ja":["技術的評価","コード検証","開発効率の向上","コード品質の保証","有効なコミュニケーション"],"ko":["기술적 평가","코드 검증","개발 효율성 향상","코드 품질 보장","유효한 커뮤니케이션"],"es":["Verificación de la exactitud técnica","Evaluación de la calidad del código","Mejora de la colaboración en equipo","Desarrollo de habilidades técnicas","Implementación de mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Vérification de l''exactitude technique","Évaluation de la qualité du code","Amélioration de la collaboration d''équipe","Développement de compétences techniques","Mise en œuvre de meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Überprüfung der technischen Genauigkeit","Bewertung der Code-Qualität","Verbesserung der Teamzusammenarbeit","Entwicklung von technischen Fähigkeiten","Umsetzung von Best Practices"],"pt":["Verificação técnica do código","Avaliação objetiva da qualidade do código","Melhoria da colaboração em equipe","Garantia da correção do código","Aumento da eficiência do desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Техническая проверка кода","Объективная оценка качества кода","Улучшение командной работы","Гарантия правильности кода","Повышение эффективности разработки"],"ar":["فحص فني للكود","تقييم موضوعي لجودة الكود","تحسين تنسيق الفريق","ضمان دقة الكود","زيادة كفاءة التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","代码质量","开发效率","技术评估","代码验证","开发最佳实践"],"ja":["コードレビュー","コード品質","開発効率","技術的評価","コード検証","開発ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","코드 품질","개발 효율성","기술적 평가","코드 검증","개발 최선의 방법"],"es":["revisión de código","desarrollo de software","colaboración en equipo","mejora de la calidad","desarrollo técnico","evaluación de código"],"fr":["révision de code","développement de logiciels","collaboration d''équipe","amélioration de la qualité","développement technique","évaluation de code"],"de":["Code-Review","Software-Entwicklung","Teamzusammenarbeit","Qualitätsverbesserung","technische Entwicklung","Code-Bewertung"],"pt":["revisão de código","desenvolvimento de software","colaboração em equipe","qualidade do código","eficiência do desenvolvimento","melhoria da qualidade do código"],"ru":["код-ревью","разработка программного обеспечения","командная работа","качество кода","эффективность разработки","улучшение качества кода"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","تنسيق الفريق","جودة الكود","كفاءة التطوير","تحسين جودة الكود"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"receiving-code-review","description":"Use when receiving code review feedback, before implementing suggestions, especially if feedback seems unclear or technically questionable - requires technical rigor and verification, not performative agreement or blind implementation","bodyPreview":"# Code Review Reception\n\n## Overview\n\nCode review requires technical evaluation, not emotional performance.\n\n**Core principle:** Verify before implementing. Ask before assuming. Technical correctness over social comfort.\n\n## The Response Pattern\n\n```\nWHEN receiving code review feedback:\n\n1. READ: Complete feedback without reacting\n2. UNDERSTAND: Restate requirement in own words (or ask)\n3. VERIFY: Check against codebase reality\n4. EVALUATE: Technically sound for THIS codebase?\n5. RESPOND: Techni","body":"# Code Review Reception\n\n## Overview\n\nCode review requires technical evaluation, not emotional performance.\n\n**Core principle:** Verify before implementing. Ask before assuming. Technical correctness over social comfort.\n\n## The Response Pattern\n\n```\nWHEN receiving code review feedback:\n\n1. READ: Complete feedback without reacting\n2. UNDERSTAND: Restate requirement in own words (or ask)\n3. VERIFY: Check against codebase reality\n4. EVALUATE: Technically sound for THIS codebase?\n5. RESPOND: Technical acknowledgment or reasoned pushback\n6. IMPLEMENT: One item at a time, test each\n```\n\n## Forbidden Responses\n\n**NEVER:**\n- \"You''re absolutely right!\" (explicit CLAUDE.md violation)\n- \"Great point!\" / \"Excellent feedback!\" (performative)\n- \"Let me implement that now\" (before verification)\n\n**INSTEAD:**\n- Restate the technical requirement\n- Ask clarifying questions\n- Push back with technical reasoning if wrong\n- Just start working (actions > words)\n\n## Handling Unclear Feedback\n\n```\nIF any item is unclear:\n  STOP - do not implement anything yet\n  ASK for clarification on unclear items\n\nWHY: Items may be related. Partial understanding = wrong implementation.\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\nyour human partner: \"Fix 1-6\"\nYou understand 1,2,3,6. Unclear on 4,5.\n\n❌ WRONG: Implement 1,2,3,6 now, ask about 4,5 later\n✅ RIGHT: \"I understand items 1,2,3,6. Need clarification on 4 and 5 before proceeding.\"\n```\n\n## Source-Specific Handling\n\n### From your human partner\n- **Trusted** - implement after understanding\n- **Still ask** if scope unclear\n- **No performative agreement**\n- **Skip to action** or technical acknowledgment\n\n### From External Reviewers\n```\nBEFORE implementing:\n  1. Check: Technically correct for THIS codebase?\n  2. Check: Breaks existing functionality?\n  3. Check: Reason for current implementation?\n  4. Check: Works on all platforms/versions?\n  5. Check: Does reviewer understand full context?\n\nIF suggestion seems wrong:\n  Push back with technical reasoning\n\nIF can''t easily verify:\n  Say so: \"I can''t verify this without [X]. Should I [investigate/ask/proceed]?\"\n\nIF conflicts with your human partner''s prior decisions:\n  Stop and discuss with your human partner first\n```\n\n**your human partner''s rule:** \"External feedback - be skeptical, but check carefully\"\n\n## YAGNI Check for \"Professional\" Features\n\n```\nIF reviewer suggests \"implementing properly\":\n  grep codebase for actual usage\n\n  IF unused: \"This endpoint isn''t called. Remove it (YAGNI)?\"\n  IF used: Then implement properly\n```\n\n**your human partner''s rule:** \"You and reviewer both report to me. If we don''t need this feature, don''t add it.\"\n\n## Implementation Order\n\n```\nFOR multi-item feedback:\n  1. Clarify anything unclear FIRST\n  2. Then implement in this order:\n     - Blocking issues (breaks, security)\n     - Simple fixes (typos, imports)\n     - Complex fixes (refactoring, logic)\n  3. Test each fix individually\n  4. Verify no regressions\n```\n\n## When To Push Back\n\nPush back when:\n- Suggestion breaks existing functionality\n- Reviewer lacks full context\n- Violates YAGNI (unused feature)\n- Technically incorrect for this stack\n- Legacy/compatibility reasons exist\n- Conflicts with your human partner''s architectural decisions\n\n**How to push back:**\n- Use technical reasoning, not defensiveness\n- Ask specific questions\n- Reference working tests/code\n- Involve your human partner if architectural\n\n**Signal if uncomfortable pushing back out loud:** \"Strange things are afoot at the Circle K\"\n\n## Acknowledging Correct Feedback\n\nWhen feedback IS correct:\n```\n✅ \"Fixed. [Brief description of what changed]\"\n✅ \"Good catch - [specific issue]. Fixed in [location].\"\n✅ [Just fix it and show in the code]\n\n❌ \"You''re absolutely right!\"\n❌ \"Great point!\"\n❌ \"Thanks for catching that!\"\n❌ \"Thanks for [anything]\"\n❌ ANY gratitude expression\n```\n\n**Why no thanks:** Actions speak. Just fix it. The code itself shows you heard the feedback.\n\n**If you catch yourself about to write \"Thanks\":** DELETE IT. State the fix instead.\n\n## Gracefully Correcting Your Pushback\n\nIf you pushed back and were wrong:\n```\n✅ \"You were right - I checked [X] and it does [Y]. Implementing now.\"\n✅ \"Verified this and you''re correct. My initial understanding was wrong because [reason]. Fixing.\"\n\n❌ Long apology\n❌ Defending why you pushed back\n❌ Over-explaining\n```\n\nState the correction factually and move on.\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Performative agreement | State requirement or just act |\n| Blind implementation | Verify against codebase first |\n| Batch without testing | One at a time, test each |\n| Assuming reviewer is right | Check if breaks things |\n| Avoiding pushback | Technical correctness > comfort |\n| Partial implementation | Clarify all items first |\n| Can''t verify, proceed anyway | State limitation, ask for direction |\n\n## Real Examples\n\n**Performative Agreement (Bad):**\n```\nReviewer: \"Remove legacy code\"\n❌ \"You''re absolutely right! Let me remove that...\"\n```\n\n**Technical Verification (Good):**\n```\nReviewer: \"Remove legacy code\"\n✅ \"Checking... build target is 10.15+, this API needs 13+. Need legacy for backward compat. Current impl has wrong bundle ID - fix it or drop pre-13 support?\"\n```\n\n**YAGNI (Good):**\n```\nReviewer: \"Implement proper metrics tracking with database, date filters, CSV export\"\n✅ \"Grepped codebase - nothing calls this endpoint. Remove it (YAGNI)? Or is there usage I''m missing?\"\n```\n\n**Unclear Item (Good):**\n```\nyour human partner: \"Fix items 1-6\"\nYou understand 1,2,3,6. Unclear on 4,5.\n✅ \"Understand 1,2,3,6. Need clarification on 4 and 5 before implementing.\"\n```\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**External feedback = suggestions to evaluate, not orders to follow.**\n\nVerify. Question. Then implement.\n\nNo performative agreement. Technical rigor always.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:27:50.708Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing structured feedback reception and verification capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化反馈接收和验证能力的代码分析代理。","ja":"構造化されたフィードバックの受信と検証機能を必要とするコード分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 피드백 수신 및 확인 기능을 필요로 하는 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Código que necesitan recepción y verificación de retroalimentación estructurada.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code ayant besoin d''une rétroaction structurée et de capacités de vérification.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine strukturierte Feedback-Rezeption und Verifizierungskapazitäten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades de receção e verificação de feedback estruturado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, требующих структурированного приема и проверки обратной связи.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى استقبال وتحقق مُرتّب للتعليقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to technically evaluate code review feedback using a systematic response pattern, ensuring verification against codebase reality and evaluation of technical soundness, all while prioritizing technical correctness over social comfort.","zh":"赋予代理使用系统响应模式对代码审查反馈进行技术评估的能力，确保与代码库现实的验证和技术合理性的评估，同时优先考虑技术正确性而非社会舒适度。","ja":"エージェントに、コードレビューフィードバックを技術的に評価するための体系的なレスポンスパターンを使用する能力を付与し、コードベースの現実に対する検証と技術的健全性の評価を保証し、社会的快適さよりも技術的正確性を優先します。","ko":"에이전트가 코드 리뷰 피드백을 기술적으로 평가할 수 있는 체계적인 응답 패턴을 사용할 수 있도록 해주며, 코드베이스의 현실에 대한 검증과 기술적健全성을 평가하면서 사회적 편안함보다 기술적 정확성을優先합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar técnicamente la retroalimentación de revisión de código utilizando un patrón de respuesta sistemático, garantizando la verificación contra la realidad de la base de código y la evaluación de la solidez técnica, todo mientras prioriza la corrección técnica sobre la comodidad social.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer techniquement les commentaires de révision de code en utilisant un modèle de réponse systématique, en garantissant la vérification contre la réalité de la base de code et l''évaluation de la solidité technique, le tout en donnant la priorité à la correction technique plutôt qu''au confort social.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, die Code-Review-Rückmeldung mit einem systematischen Antwortmuster technisch zu bewerten, wodurch die Überprüfung gegen die Realität der Codebasis und die Bewertung der technischen Solidität sichergestellt werden, während technische Korrektheit gegenüber sozialem Komfort priorisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar tecnicamente as feedbacks de revisão de código usando um padrão de resposta sistemático, garantindo a verificação contra a realidade do repositório de código e a avaliação da solidez técnica, priorizando a correção técnica sobre o conforto social.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью технически оценивать обратную связь по код-ревью, используя систематический ответный шаблон, гарантируя проверку против реальности кодовой базы и оценку технической обоснованности, отдавая приоритет технической правильности над социальным комфортом.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تقييم تعليقات مراجعة الشفرة تقنيًا باستخدام نمط استجابة منهجي، مما يضمن التحقق من واقع قاعدة الشفرة وتقييم الصوابية الفنية، مع تقديم الأهمية للصواب الفني على الراحة الاجتماعية"},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying code review feedback against on-chain vaults and central liquidity vaults","Evaluating technical soundness of leveraged long/short positions in perpetual futures protocols","Responding to code review feedback with technically sound counterparty trade pricing"],"zh":["验证代码审查反馈与链上金库和中心流动性金库的匹配性","评估永续期货协议中杠杆多头/空头头寸的技术合理性","使用技术合理的对手方交易价格来响应代码审查反馈"],"ja":["コードレビューフィードバックをオンチェーンバウルトと中央流動性バウルトと照合すること","永続期貨プロトコルのレバレッジロング/ショートポジションの技術的健全性を評価すること","技術的健全性のあるカウンターパーティー取引価格を使用してコードレビューフィードバックに応答すること"],"ko":["코드 리뷰 피드백을 체인상 금고와 중앙 유동성 금고와의 일치性을 확인하는こと","영구적 선물 프로토콜의 레버리지 롱/숏 포지션의 기술적 합理성을 평가하는こと","기술적으로 합리적인 카운터파티 거래 가격을 사용하여 코드 리뷰 피드백에 응답하는こと"],"es":["Verificar la retroalimentación de revisión de código contra bóvedas en cadena y bóvedas de liquidez centralizadas","Evaluar la solidez técnica de posiciones largas/cortas apalancadas en protocolos de futuros perpetuos","Responder a la retroalimentación de revisión de código con un precio de contraparte comercial técnicamente sólido"],"fr":["Vérifier les commentaires de révision de code contre les coffres en chaîne et les coffres de liquidité centralisés","Évaluer la solidité technique des positions longues/courtes avec effet de levier dans les protocoles de futurs perpetuels","Répondre aux commentaires de révision de code avec un prix de contrepartie commerciale techniquement solide"],"de":["Überprüfen der Code-Review-Rückmeldung gegen On-Chain-Vaults und zentrale Liquiditäts-Vaults","Bewerten der technischen Solidität von Long/Short-Positionen mit Hebelwirkung in Perpetual-Futures-Protokollen","Antworten auf die Code-Review-Rückmeldung mit einem technisch solide gehandelten Kontrahentenpreis"],"pt":["Verificar feedback de revisão de código contra vaults em cadeia e vaults de liquidez centralizados","Avaliar a solidez técnica de posições longas/curtas alavancadas em protocolos de futuros perpétuos","Responder a feedback de revisão de código com preços de negociação de contraparte tecnicamente sólidos"],"ru":["Проверка обратной связи по код-ревью против вольтов в цепи и централизованных ликвидных вольтов","Оценка технической обоснованности длинных/коротких позиций с использованием рычага в протоколах вечных фьючерсов","Ответ на обратную связь по код-ревью с технически обоснованными ценами контрагента"],"ar":["التحقق من تعليقات مراجعة الشفرة مقابل الخزائن في السلسلة والخزائن المركزية للسيولة","تقييم الصوابية الفنية للمواقف الطويلة/القصيرة المُضاعفة في بروتوكولات المشتقات المستقبلية الدائمة","الاستجابة لتعليقات مراجعة الشفرة بأسعار تجارة مضادة فنيًا صحيحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of synthetic perpetual futures protocols","Limited to code review feedback reception and response"],"zh":["需要理解合成永续期货协议","仅限代码审查反馈的接收和响应"],"ja":["合成永続期貨プロトコルの理解が必要","コードレビューフィードバックの受信と応答に限定される"],"ko":["합성 영구적 선물 프로토콜에 대한 이해가 필요함","코드 리뷰 피드백의 수신 및 응답에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de protocolos de futuros perpetuos sintéticos","Limitado a la recepción y respuesta de retroalimentación de revisión de código"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des protocoles de futurs perpetuels synthétiques","Limité à la réception et à la réponse des commentaires de révision de code"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis von synthetischen Perpetual-Futures-Protokollen","Begrenzt auf die Rezeption und Antwort von Code-Review-Rückmeldungen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de protocolos de futuros perpétuos sintéticos","Limitado à receção e resposta de feedback de revisão de código"],"ru":["Требует понимания синтетических протоколов вечных фьючерсов","Ограничен приёмом и ответом на обратную связь по код-ревью"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم بروتوكولات المشتقات المستقبلية الدائمة المُصطنعة","محدود بالاستقبال والاستجابة لتعليقات مراجعة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
