nvex Best Practices ofrece patrones para organizar funciones, optimizar consultas y manejar errores de manera efectiva","fr":"Convex Best Practices propose des modèles pour organiser des fonctions, optimiser des requêtes et gérer des erreurs de manière efficace","de":"Convex Best Practices bietet Muster für die Organisation von Funktionen, die Optimierung von Abfragen und die effektive Fehlerbehandlung","pt":"Construa aplicações Convex de produção com padrões estabelecidos para organização de funções, otimização de consultas e tratamento de erros","ru":"Создавайте приложения Convex для производства с установленными шаблонами для организации функций, оптимизации запросов и обработки ошибок","ar":"ابني تطبيقات Convex جاهزة للإنتاج باستخدام الأنماط المثبتة لتنظيم الوظائف وتحسين الاستعلامات ومعالجة الأخطاء","en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"definition":{"en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"features":{"zh":["函数组织","查询优化","验证","TypeScript使用","错误处理"],"ja":["関数の組織","クエリの最適化","検証","TypeScriptの使用","エラーハンドリング"],"ko":["함수 조직","쿼리 최적화","검증","TypeScript 사용","오류 처리"],"es":["Organización de funciones","Optimización de consultas","Validación y manejo de errores","Uso de TypeScript","Mejores prácticas para aplicaciones de producción"],"fr":["Organisation de fonctions","Optimisation de requêtes","Validation et gestion d''erreurs","Utilisation de TypeScript","Bonnes pratiques pour les applications de production"],"de":["Funktionsorganisation","Abfrageoptimierung","Validierung und Fehlerbehandlung","Verwendung von TypeScript","Best Practices für Produktionsanwendungen"],"pt":["Organização de funções","Otimização de consultas","Validação","Uso de TypeScript","Tratamento de erros"],"ru":["Организация функций","Оптимизация запросов","Валидация","Использование TypeScript","Обработка ошибок"],"ar":["تنظيم الوظائف","تحسين الاستعلامات","التحقق","استخدام TypeScript","معالجة الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex开发","Convex最佳实践","函数组织","查询优化","验证","TypeScript使用","错误处理"],"ja":["Convex開発","Convexベストプラクティス","関数の組織","クエリの最適化","検証","TypeScriptの使用","エラーハンドリング"],"ko":["Convex 개발","Convex 최고의 실践","함수 조직","쿼리 최적화","검증","TypeScript 사용","오류 처리"],"es":["Convex","desarrollo de aplicaciones","mejores prácticas","optimización de consultas","manejo de errores","TypeScript","aplicaciones de producción"],"fr":["Convex","développement d''applications","bonnes pratiques","optimisation de requêtes","gestion d''erreurs","TypeScript","applications de production"],"de":["Convex","Anwendungsentwicklung","Best Practices","Abfrageoptimierung","Fehlerbehandlung","TypeScript","Produktionsanwendungen"],"pt":["melhores práticas Convex","desenvolvimento de aplicações Convex","organização de funções Convex","otimização de consultas Convex","validação Convex","TypeScript Convex","tratamento de erros Convex"],"ru":["лучшие практики Convex","разработка приложений Convex","организация функций Convex","оптимизация запросов Convex","валидация Convex","TypeScript Convex","обработка ошибок Convex"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات Convex","تطوير تطبيقات Convex","تنظيم الوظائف Convex","تحسين الاستعلامات Convex","التحقق Convex","استخدام TypeScript Convex","معالجة الأخطاء Convex"]}},"owner":"charlietlamb","repo":"ferix","repoPath":"charlietlamb/ferix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex Best Practices","description":"Guidelines for building production-ready Convex apps covering function organization, query patterns, validation, TypeScript usage, error handling, and the Zen of Convex design philosophy","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","best-practices","typescript","production","error-handling"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Best Practices\n\nBuild production-ready Convex applications by following established patterns for function organization, query optimization, validation, TypeScript usage, and error handling.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/\n- Error Handling: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/error-handling\n- Write Conflicts: https://docs.convex.dev/error#1\n- For broader context:","body":"# Convex Best Practices\n\nBuild production-ready Convex applications by following established patterns for function organization, query optimization, validation, TypeScript usage, and error handling.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/\n- Error Handling: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/error-handling\n- Write Conflicts: https://docs.convex.dev/error#1\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### The Zen of Convex\n\n1. **Convex manages the hard parts** - Let Convex handle caching, real-time sync, and consistency\n2. **Functions are the API** - Design your functions as your application''s interface\n3. **Schema is truth** - Define your data model explicitly in schema.ts\n4. **TypeScript everywhere** - Leverage end-to-end type safety\n5. **Queries are reactive** - Think in terms of subscriptions, not requests\n\n### Function Organization\n\nOrganize your Convex functions by domain:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/users.ts - User-related functions\nimport { query, mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"users\"),\n    _creationTime: v.number(),\n    name: v.string(),\n    email: v.string(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.get(args.userId);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Argument and Return Validation\n\nAlways define validators for arguments AND return types:\n\n```typescript\nexport const createTask = mutation({\n  args: {\n    title: v.string(),\n    description: v.optional(v.string()),\n    priority: v.union(v.literal(\"low\"), v.literal(\"medium\"), v.literal(\"high\")),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"tasks\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"tasks\", {\n      title: args.title,\n      description: args.description,\n      priority: args.priority,\n      completed: false,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Query Patterns\n\nUse indexes instead of filters for efficient queries:\n\n```typescript\n// Schema with index\nexport default defineSchema({\n  tasks: defineTable({\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    status: v.string(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_user\", [\"userId\"])\n    .index(\"by_user_and_status\", [\"userId\", \"status\"]),\n});\n\n// Query using index\nexport const getTasksByUser = query({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"tasks\"),\n    _creationTime: v.number(),\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    status: v.string(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"tasks\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", args.userId))\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .collect();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n\nUse ConvexError for user-facing errors:\n\n```typescript\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const updateTask = mutation({\n  args: {\n    taskId: v.id(\"tasks\"),\n    title: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const task = await ctx.db.get(args.taskId);\n    \n    if (!task) {\n      throw new ConvexError({\n        code: \"NOT_FOUND\",\n        message: \"Task not found\",\n      });\n    }\n    \n    await ctx.db.patch(args.taskId, { title: args.title });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Avoiding Write Conflicts (Optimistic Concurrency Control)\n\nConvex uses OCC. Follow these patterns to minimize conflicts:\n\n```typescript\n// GOOD: Make mutations idempotent\nexport const completeTask = mutation({\n  args: { taskId: v.id(\"tasks\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const task = await ctx.db.get(args.taskId);\n    \n    // Early return if already complete (idempotent)\n    if (!task || task.status === \"completed\") {\n      return null;\n    }\n    \n    await ctx.db.patch(args.taskId, {\n      status: \"completed\",\n      completedAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\n// GOOD: Patch directly without reading first when possible\nexport const updateNote = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"notes\"), content: v.string() },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Patch directly - ctx.db.patch throws if document doesn''t exist\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { content: args.content });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\n// GOOD: Use Promise.all for parallel independent updates\nexport const reorderItems = mutation({\n  args: { itemIds: v.array(v.id(\"items\")) },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const updates = args.itemIds.map((id, index) =>\n      ctx.db.patch(id, { order: index })\n    );\n    await Promise.all(updates);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### TypeScript Best Practices\n\n```typescript\nimport { Id, Doc } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n\n// Use Id type for document references\ntype UserId = Id<\"users\">;\n\n// Use Doc type for full documents\ntype User = Doc<\"users\">;\n\n// Define Record types properly\nconst userScores: Record<Id<\"users\">, number> = {};\n```\n\n### Internal vs Public Functions\n\n```typescript\n// Public function - exposed to clients\nexport const getUser = query({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.union(v.null(), v.object({ /* ... */ })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // ...\n  },\n});\n\n// Internal function - only callable from other Convex functions\nexport const _updateUserStats = internalMutation({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // ...\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Complete CRUD Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// convex/tasks.ts\nimport { query, mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\nconst taskValidator = v.object({\n  _id: v.id(\"tasks\"),\n  _creationTime: v.number(),\n  title: v.string(),\n  completed: v.boolean(),\n  userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n});\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.array(taskValidator),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"tasks\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", args.userId))\n      .collect();\n  },\n});\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    title: v.string(),\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"tasks\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"tasks\", {\n      title: args.title,\n      completed: false,\n      userId: args.userId,\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    taskId: v.id(\"tasks\"),\n    title: v.optional(v.string()),\n    completed: v.optional(v.boolean()),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const { taskId, ...updates } = args;\n    \n    // Remove undefined values\n    const cleanUpdates = Object.fromEntries(\n      Object.entries(updates).filter(([_, v]) => v !== undefined)\n    );\n    \n    if (Object.keys(cleanUpdates).length > 0) {\n      await ctx.db.patch(taskId, cleanUpdates);\n    }\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { taskId: v.id(\"tasks\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.taskId);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Always define return validators for functions\n- Use indexes for all queries that filter data\n- Make mutations idempotent to handle retries gracefully\n- Use ConvexError for user-facing error messages\n- Organize functions by domain (users.ts, tasks.ts, etc.)\n- Use internal functions for sensitive operations\n- Leverage TypeScript''s Id and Doc types\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Using filter instead of withIndex** - Always define indexes and use withIndex\n2. **Missing return validators** - Always specify the returns field\n3. **Non-idempotent mutations** - Check current state before updating\n4. **Reading before patching unnecessarily** - Patch directly when possible\n5. **Not handling null returns** - Document IDs might not exist\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Best Practices: https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/\n- Error Handling: https://docs.convex.dev/functions/error-handling\n- Write Conflicts: https://docs.convex.dev/error#1\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:28:07.472Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Agents requiring optimized Convex application development with best practices for function organization, query optimization, and error handling.","zh":"适用于需要优化Convex应用程序开发的全栈代理，遵循函数组织、查询优化和错误处理的最佳实践。","ja":"Convexアプリケーション開発を最適化する必要があるフルスタックエージェントに適しています。関数の組織化、クエリの最適化、エラー処理のベストプラクティスに従います。","ko":"최적화된 Convex 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 함수 조직, 쿼리 최적화, 오류 처리를 위한 모범 사례를 따릅니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack que requieren un desarrollo de aplicaciones Convex optimizado con las mejores prácticas para la organización de funciones, la optimización de consultas y el manejo de errores.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant un développement d''applications Convex optimisé avec les meilleures pratiques pour l''organisation des fonctions, l''optimisation des requêtes et la gestion des erreurs.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die ein optimiertes Convex-Anwendungs-Entwicklung mit besten Praktiken für Funktionsorganisation, Abfrageoptimierung und Fehlerbehandlung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack que requerem desenvolvimento de aplicativos Convex otimizados com as melhores práticas para organização de funções, otimização de consultas e tratamento de erros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, требующих оптимизированного разработки приложений Convex с лучшими практиками для организации функций, оптимизации запросов и обработки ошибок.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرمجيات الكامل الذي يتطلب تطبيق تطبيقات Convex الأمثل مع أفضل الممارسات لتنظيم الوظائف وتحسين الاستعلامات ومعالجة الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build production-ready Convex applications by following established patterns for TypeScript usage, validation, and error handling, utilizing resources like https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/ for optimal performance.","zh":"使代理能够通过遵循TypeScript使用、验证和错误处理的既定模式，使用https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/等资源，构建可用于生产的Convex应用程序，从而实现最佳性能。","ja":"エージェントがTypeScriptの使用、検証、エラー処理の確立されたパターンに従って、https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/などのリソースを利用し、最高のパフォーマンスを発揮するプロダクションレディのConvexアプリケーションを構築できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 TypeScript 사용, 검증, 오류 처리의 확립된 패턴을 따르고 https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/などの 리소스를 사용하여 최고의 성능을 발휘하는 프로덕션 레디 Convex 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones Convex listas para producción siguiendo patrones establecidos para el uso de TypeScript, la validación y el manejo de errores, utilizando recursos como https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/ para un rendimiento óptimo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications Convex prêtes pour la production en suivant des modèles établis pour l''utilisation de TypeScript, la validation et la gestion des erreurs, en utilisant des ressources comme https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/ pour des performances optimales.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, produktionsreife Convex-Anwendungen zu erstellen, indem sie etablierte Muster für die Verwendung von TypeScript, Validierung und Fehlerbehandlung befolgen, unter Verwendung von Ressourcen wie https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/ für optimale Leistung.","pt":"Permite que os agentes construam aplicações Convex prontas para produção, seguindo padrões estabelecidos para uso de TypeScript, validação e tratamento de erros, utilizando recursos como https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/ para desempenho ótimo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать приложения Convex, готовые к производству, следуя устоявшимся шаблонам для использования TypeScript, проверки и обработки ошибок, используя ресурсы, такие как https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/ для оптимальной производительности.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء بناء تطبيقات Convex جاهزة للإنتاج باتباع الأنماط المقبولة لاستخدام TypeScript والتحقق من الصحة ومعالجة الأخطاء، باستخدام الموارد مثل https://docs.convex.dev/understanding/best-practices/ للأداء الأمثل."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing efficient query optimization techniques","Organizing functions for scalable Convex applications","Handling errors effectively using Convex''s error handling mechanisms"],"zh":["实现高效的查询优化技术","组织函数以实现Convex应用程序的可扩展性","有效地使用Convex的错误处理机制处理错误"],"ja":["効率的なクエリ最適化技術の実装","関数をConvexアプリケーションのスケーラビリティを実現するために組織化","Convexのエラー処理メカニズムを使用してエラーを効果的に処理"],"ko":["효율적인 쿼리 최적화 기술 구현","Convex 애플리케이션의 확장성을 위해 함수를 조직화","Convex의 오류 처리 메커니즘을 사용하여 오류를 효과적으로 처리"],"es":["Implementar técnicas de optimización de consultas eficientes","Organizar funciones para aplicaciones Convex escalables","Manejar errores de manera efectiva utilizando los mecanismos de manejo de errores de Convex"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des techniques d''optimisation de requêtes efficaces","Organiser des fonctions pour des applications Convex escalables","Gérer les erreurs de manière efficace en utilisant les mécanismes de gestion des erreurs de Convex"],"de":["Effiziente Abfrageoptimierungstechniken implementieren","Funktionen für skalierbare Convex-Anwendungen organisieren","Fehler effektiv mit Convex-Fehlerbehandlungsmechanismen verwalten"],"pt":["Implementação de técnicas de otimização de consultas eficientes","Organização de funções para aplicações Convex escaláveis","Tratamento eficaz de erros usando os mecanismos de tratamento de erros do Convex"],"ru":["Реализация эффективных методов оптимизации запросов","Организация функций для масштабируемых приложений Convex","Эффективное обработка ошибок с помощью механизмов обработки ошибок Convex"],"ar":["تنفيذ تقنيات تحسين استعلام فعالة","تنظيم الوظائف لتطبيقات Convex قابلة للتوسع","معالجة فعالة للأخطاء باستخدام آليات معالجة الأخطاء في Convex"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex documentation and resources","Assumes familiarity with TypeScript and Convex development principles"],"zh":["需要访问Convex文档和资源","假设熟悉TypeScript和Convex开发原则"],"ja":["Convexのドキュメントとリソースへのアクセスが必要","TypeScriptとConvex開発の原則に精通していることが前提"],"ko":["Convex 문서 및 리소스에 액세스해야 함","TypeScript 및 Convex 개발 원칙에 익숙하다고 가정"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación y recursos de Convex","Supone familiaridad con los principios de desarrollo de TypeScript y Convex"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation et aux ressources de Convex","Suppose une familiarité avec les principes de développement de TypeScript et Convex"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Convex-Dokumentation und -Ressourcen","Gilt eine Vertrautheit mit den Entwicklungsprinzipien von TypeScript und Convex voraus"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação e recursos do Convex","Pressupõe familiaridade com os princípios de desenvolvimento do TypeScript e Convex"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации и ресурсам Convex","Предполагает знакомство с принципами разработки TypeScript и Convex"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق Convex والموارد","يفترض دراية بمبادئ تطوير TypeScript وConvex"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
