"El Validador de Esquemas Convex permite definir y validar esquemas de bases de datos en Convex con tipado adecuado y configuración de índices","fr":"Le Validateur de Schémas Convex permet de définir et de valider les schémas de base de données Convex avec un typage approprié et une configuration d''index","de":"Der Convex-Schema-Validator ermöglicht die Definition und Validierung von Datenbankschemata in Convex mit geeigneter Typisierung und Indexkonfiguration","pt":"O Validador de Esquema Convex permite definir e validar esquemas de banco de dados no Convex com recursos como tipagem, configuração de índices e campos opci...","ru":"Валидатор Схемы Convex позволяет определять и проверять схемы базы данных в Convex с функциями, такими как типизация, настройка индексов и необязательные поля.","ar":"مؤشر مخطط القمعي يسمح بتعريف ومصادقة مخططات قواعد البيانات في Convex مع ميزات مثل التيبين وتكوين الفهارس والحقول الاختيارية.","en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"definition":{"en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"features":{"zh":["Convex","Type","Index","Field","Union","Migration"],"ja":["Convex","Type","Index","Field","Union","Migration"],"ko":["Convex","Type","Index","Field","Union","Migration"],"es":["Definición de esquemas de bases de datos","Validación de esquemas con tipado adecuado","Configuración de índices","Campos opcionales y uniones","Estrategias para migraciones de esquemas"],"fr":["Définition de schémas de base de données","Validation de schémas avec typage approprié","Configuration d''index","Champs facultatifs et unions","Stratégies pour les migrations de schémas"],"de":["Definition von Datenbankschemata","Validierung von Schemata mit geeigneter Typisierung","Indexkonfiguration","Optional-Felder und Unionen","Strategien für Schema-Migrationen"],"pt":["Definição de esquemas de banco de dados","Validação de esquemas com tipagem","Configuração de índices","Campos opcionais","União de tipos de dados","Estratégias para migração de esquemas"],"ru":["Определение схем базы данных","Проверка схем с типизацией","Настройка индексов","Необязательные поля","Объединение типов данных","Стратегии для миграции схем"],"ar":["تعريف مخططات قواعد البيانات","مصادقة المخططات مع التيبين","تكوين الفهارس","الحقول الاختيارية","اتحاد أنواع البيانات","استراتيجيات للهجرة المخططية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex Schema Validator","Convex","Schema","Validator","Database","Type","Index","Field","Union","Migration"],"ja":["Convex Schema Validator","Convex","Schema","Validator","Database","Type","Index","Field","Union","Migration"],"ko":["Convex Schema Validator","Convex","Schema","Validator","Database","Type","Index","Field","Union","Migration"],"es":["Validador de esquemas Convex","Definición de esquemas de bases de datos","Validación de esquemas","Tipado adecuado","Configuración de índices","Migraciones de esquemas"],"fr":["Validateur de schémas Convex","Définition de schémas de base de données","Validation de schémas","Typage approprié","Configuration d''index","Migrations de schémas"],"de":["Convex-Schema-Validator","Definition von Datenbankschemata","Validierung von Schemata","Geeignete Typisierung","Indexkonfiguration","Schema-Migrationen"],"pt":["validador de esquema convex","esquema de banco de dados","tipagem de dados","configuração de índices","campos opcionais","migração de esquemas"],"ru":["валидатор схемы convex","схема базы данных","типизация данных","настройка индексов","необязательные поля","миграция схем"],"ar":["مؤشر مخطط القمعي","مخطط قاعدة البيانات","تيبين البيانات","تكوين الفهارس","الحقول الاختيارية","هجرة المخطط"]}},"owner":"charlietlamb","repo":"ferix","repoPath":"charlietlamb/ferix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex Schema Validator","description":"Defining and validating database schemas with proper typing, index configuration, optional fields, unions, and migration strategies for schema changes","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","schema","validation","typescript","indexes","migrations"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Schema Validator\n\nDefine and validate database schemas in Convex with proper typing, index configuration, optional fields, unions, and strategies for schema migrations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas\n- Indexes: https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes\n- Data Types: https://docs.convex.dev/database/types\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructi","body":"# Convex Schema Validator\n\nDefine and validate database schemas in Convex with proper typing, index configuration, optional fields, unions, and strategies for schema migrations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas\n- Indexes: https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes\n- Data Types: https://docs.convex.dev/database/types\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Basic Schema Definition\n\n```typescript\n// convex/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  users: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    email: v.string(),\n    avatarUrl: v.optional(v.string()),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  \n  tasks: defineTable({\n    title: v.string(),\n    description: v.optional(v.string()),\n    completed: v.boolean(),\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    priority: v.union(\n      v.literal(\"low\"),\n      v.literal(\"medium\"),\n      v.literal(\"high\")\n    ),\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n### Validator Types\n\n| Validator | TypeScript Type | Example |\n|-----------|----------------|---------|\n| `v.string()` | `string` | `\"hello\"` |\n| `v.number()` | `number` | `42`, `3.14` |\n| `v.boolean()` | `boolean` | `true`, `false` |\n| `v.null()` | `null` | `null` |\n| `v.int64()` | `bigint` | `9007199254740993n` |\n| `v.bytes()` | `ArrayBuffer` | Binary data |\n| `v.id(\"table\")` | `Id<\"table\">` | Document reference |\n| `v.array(v)` | `T[]` | `[1, 2, 3]` |\n| `v.object({})` | `{ ... }` | `{ name: \"...\" }` |\n| `v.optional(v)` | `T \\| undefined` | Optional field |\n| `v.union(...)` | `T1 \\| T2` | Multiple types |\n| `v.literal(x)` | `\"x\"` | Exact value |\n| `v.any()` | `any` | Any value |\n| `v.record(k, v)` | `Record<K, V>` | Dynamic keys |\n\n### Index Configuration\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineSchema({\n  messages: defineTable({\n    channelId: v.id(\"channels\"),\n    authorId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n    sentAt: v.number(),\n  })\n    // Single field index\n    .index(\"by_channel\", [\"channelId\"])\n    // Compound index\n    .index(\"by_channel_and_author\", [\"channelId\", \"authorId\"])\n    // Index for sorting\n    .index(\"by_channel_and_time\", [\"channelId\", \"sentAt\"]),\n    \n  // Full-text search index\n  articles: defineTable({\n    title: v.string(),\n    body: v.string(),\n    category: v.string(),\n  })\n    .searchIndex(\"search_content\", {\n      searchField: \"body\",\n      filterFields: [\"category\"],\n    }),\n});\n```\n\n### Complex Types\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Nested objects\n  profiles: defineTable({\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    settings: v.object({\n      theme: v.union(v.literal(\"light\"), v.literal(\"dark\")),\n      notifications: v.object({\n        email: v.boolean(),\n        push: v.boolean(),\n      }),\n    }),\n  }),\n\n  // Arrays of objects\n  orders: defineTable({\n    customerId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    items: v.array(v.object({\n      productId: v.id(\"products\"),\n      quantity: v.number(),\n      price: v.number(),\n    })),\n    status: v.union(\n      v.literal(\"pending\"),\n      v.literal(\"processing\"),\n      v.literal(\"shipped\"),\n      v.literal(\"delivered\")\n    ),\n  }),\n\n  // Record type for dynamic keys\n  analytics: defineTable({\n    date: v.string(),\n    metrics: v.record(v.string(), v.number()),\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n### Discriminated Unions\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineSchema({\n  events: defineTable(\n    v.union(\n      v.object({\n        type: v.literal(\"user_signup\"),\n        userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n        email: v.string(),\n      }),\n      v.object({\n        type: v.literal(\"purchase\"),\n        userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n        orderId: v.id(\"orders\"),\n        amount: v.number(),\n      }),\n      v.object({\n        type: v.literal(\"page_view\"),\n        sessionId: v.string(),\n        path: v.string(),\n      })\n    )\n  ).index(\"by_type\", [\"type\"]),\n});\n```\n\n### Optional vs Nullable Fields\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineSchema({\n  items: defineTable({\n    // Optional: field may not exist\n    description: v.optional(v.string()),\n    \n    // Nullable: field exists but can be null\n    deletedAt: v.union(v.number(), v.null()),\n    \n    // Optional and nullable\n    notes: v.optional(v.union(v.string(), v.null())),\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n### Index Naming Convention\n\nAlways include all indexed fields in the index name:\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineSchema({\n  posts: defineTable({\n    authorId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    categoryId: v.id(\"categories\"),\n    publishedAt: v.number(),\n    status: v.string(),\n  })\n    // Good: descriptive names\n    .index(\"by_author\", [\"authorId\"])\n    .index(\"by_author_and_category\", [\"authorId\", \"categoryId\"])\n    .index(\"by_category_and_status\", [\"categoryId\", \"status\"])\n    .index(\"by_status_and_published\", [\"status\", \"publishedAt\"]),\n});\n```\n\n### Schema Migration Strategies\n\n#### Adding New Fields\n\n```typescript\n// Before\nusers: defineTable({\n  name: v.string(),\n  email: v.string(),\n})\n\n// After - add as optional first\nusers: defineTable({\n  name: v.string(),\n  email: v.string(),\n  avatarUrl: v.optional(v.string()), // New optional field\n})\n```\n\n#### Backfilling Data\n\n```typescript\n// convex/migrations.ts\nimport { internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const backfillAvatars = internalMutation({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.number(),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const users = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"users\")\n      .filter((q) => q.eq(q.field(\"avatarUrl\"), undefined))\n      .take(100);\n\n    for (const user of users) {\n      await ctx.db.patch(user._id, {\n        avatarUrl: `https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/initials/svg?seed=${user.name}`,\n      });\n    }\n\n    return users.length;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### Making Optional Fields Required\n\n```typescript\n// Step 1: Backfill all null values\n// Step 2: Update schema to required\nusers: defineTable({\n  name: v.string(),\n  email: v.string(),\n  avatarUrl: v.string(), // Now required after backfill\n})\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Complete E-commerce Schema\n\n```typescript\n// convex/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  users: defineTable({\n    email: v.string(),\n    name: v.string(),\n    role: v.union(v.literal(\"customer\"), v.literal(\"admin\")),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_email\", [\"email\"])\n    .index(\"by_role\", [\"role\"]),\n\n  products: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    description: v.string(),\n    price: v.number(),\n    category: v.string(),\n    inventory: v.number(),\n    isActive: v.boolean(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_category\", [\"category\"])\n    .index(\"by_active_and_category\", [\"isActive\", \"category\"])\n    .searchIndex(\"search_products\", {\n      searchField: \"name\",\n      filterFields: [\"category\", \"isActive\"],\n    }),\n\n  orders: defineTable({\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    items: v.array(v.object({\n      productId: v.id(\"products\"),\n      quantity: v.number(),\n      priceAtPurchase: v.number(),\n    })),\n    total: v.number(),\n    status: v.union(\n      v.literal(\"pending\"),\n      v.literal(\"paid\"),\n      v.literal(\"shipped\"),\n      v.literal(\"delivered\"),\n      v.literal(\"cancelled\")\n    ),\n    shippingAddress: v.object({\n      street: v.string(),\n      city: v.string(),\n      state: v.string(),\n      zip: v.string(),\n      country: v.string(),\n    }),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n    updatedAt: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_user\", [\"userId\"])\n    .index(\"by_user_and_status\", [\"userId\", \"status\"])\n    .index(\"by_status\", [\"status\"]),\n\n  reviews: defineTable({\n    productId: v.id(\"products\"),\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    rating: v.number(),\n    comment: v.optional(v.string()),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_product\", [\"productId\"])\n    .index(\"by_user\", [\"userId\"]),\n});\n```\n\n### Using Schema Types in Functions\n\n```typescript\n// convex/products.ts\nimport { query, mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { Doc, Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n\n// Use Doc type for full documents\ntype Product = Doc<\"products\">;\n\n// Use Id type for references\ntype ProductId = Id<\"products\">;\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { productId: v.id(\"products\") },\n  returns: v.union(\n    v.object({\n      _id: v.id(\"products\"),\n      _creationTime: v.number(),\n      name: v.string(),\n      description: v.string(),\n      price: v.number(),\n      category: v.string(),\n      inventory: v.number(),\n      isActive: v.boolean(),\n    }),\n    v.null()\n  ),\n  handler: async (ctx, args): Promise<Product | null> => {\n    return await ctx.db.get(args.productId);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Always define explicit schemas rather than relying on inference\n- Use descriptive index names that include all indexed fields\n- Start with optional fields when adding new columns\n- Use discriminated unions for polymorphic data\n- Validate data at the schema level, not just in functions\n- Plan index strategy based on query patterns\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Missing indexes for queries** - Every withIndex needs a corresponding schema index\n2. **Wrong index field order** - Fields must be queried in order defined\n3. **Using v.any() excessively** - Lose type safety benefits\n4. **Not making new fields optional** - Breaks existing data\n5. **Forgetting system fields** - _id and _creationTime are automatic\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Schemas: https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas\n- Indexes: https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes\n- Data Types: https://docs.convex.dev/database/types\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:28:28.112Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Database Management Agents requiring advanced Convex schema validation and migration strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Convex模式验证和迁移策略的数据库管理智能体。","ja":"高度なConvexスキーマ検証と移行戦略を必要とするデータベース管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Convex 스키마 검증 및 마이그레이션 전략이 필요한 데이터베이스 관리 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Administración de Bases de Datos que requieren validación de esquemas Convex avanzada y estrategias de migración.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de base de données nécessitant une validation de schéma Convex avancée et des stratégies de migration.","de":"Ideal für Datenbank-Management-Agents, die eine erweiterte Convex-Schemavalidierung und Migrationsstrategien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Banco de Dados que exigem validação avançada de esquema Convex e estratégias de migração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления базами данных, требующих продвинутой валидации схемы Convex и стратегий миграции.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة قاعدة البيانات الذي يتطلب التحقق المتقدم من مخطط Convex و استراتيجيات النقل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define and validate database schemas in Convex with proper typing, index configuration, and optional fields, utilizing unions and strategies for seamless schema migrations, all while referencing the latest documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas.","zh":"使智能体能够在Convex中定义和验证数据库模式，包括正确的类型、索引配置和可选字段，利用联合和策略实现无缝模式迁移，同时参考https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas上的最新文档。","ja":"エージェントがConvexで適切な型付け、インデックス設定、オプションフィールドを使用してデータベーススキーマを定義および検証し、ユニオンと戦略を活用してシームレスなスキーマ移行を実現することを可能にします。すべてhttps://docs.convex.dev/database/schemasの最新ドキュメントを参照しながら行われます。","ko":"에이전트가 적절한 타이핑, 인덱스 구성 및 선택적 필드를 통해 Convex에서 데이터베이스 스키마를 정의하고 검증할 수 있도록 지원하며, 연합 및 전략을 활용한 원활한 스키마 마이그레이션을 수행하고, https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas의 최신 문서를 참조합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir y validar esquemas de base de datos en Convex con tipado adecuado, configuración de índices y campos opcionales, utilizando uniones y estrategias para migraciones de esquema sin problemas, todo mientras se hace referencia a la última documentación de https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir et de valider les schémas de base de données dans Convex avec un typage approprié, une configuration d''index et des champs facultatifs, en utilisant des unions et des stratégies pour des migrations de schéma sans problème, tout en référençant la dernière documentation de https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Datenbankschemata in Convex mit ordnungsgemäßer Typisierung, Indexkonfiguration und optionalen Feldern zu definieren und zu validieren, indem Unions und Strategien für nahtlose Schemamigrationen verwendet werden, während auf die aktuellste Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas verwiesen wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir e validar esquemas de banco de dados em Convex com digitação apropriada, configuração de índice e campos opcionais, utilizando uniões e estratégias para migrações de esquema sem problemas, tudo isso referenciando a documentação mais recente de https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять и проверять схемы баз данных в Convex с правильным типом, конфигурацией индекса и необязательными полями, используя объединения и стратегии для бесперебойных миграций схем, при этом ссылаясь на последнюю документацию с https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تعريف مخطط قاعدة البيانات وتحديده في Convex مع تنسيق مناسب وتكوين فهرس وحقول اختيارية ، باستخدام الاتحادات والاستراتيجيات من أجل هجرة مخطط بدون مشاكل، مع الإشارة إلى أحدث الوثائق من https://docs.convex.dev/database/schemas."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating database schemas with proper typing and index configuration","Generating schema migrations with unions and strategic planning","Debugging Convex database issues with Data Types documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/database/types","Optimizing database performance with Indexes configuration as per https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes"],"zh":["使用正确的类型和索引配置验证数据库模式","使用联合和战略规划生成模式迁移","使用https://docs.convex.dev/database/types上的数据类型文档调试Convex数据库问题","根据https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes上的索引配置优化数据库性能"],"ja":["適切な型付けとインデックス設定によるデータベーススキーマの検証","ユニオンと戦略的計画によるスキーマ移行の生成","https://docs.convex.dev/database/types のデータ型ドキュメントを使用したConvexデータベースの問題のデバッグ","https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes に従ったインデックス設定によるデータベースパフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["적절한 타이핑 및 인덱스 구성으로 데이터베이스 스키마 검증","연합 및 전략적 계획을 통한 스키마 마이그레이션 생성","https://docs.convex.dev/database/types의 데이터 타입 문서를 사용한 Convex 데이터베이스 문제 디버깅","https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes에 따른 인덱스 구성으로 데이터베이스 성능 최적화"],"es":["Validar esquemas de base de datos con tipado y configuración de índices adecuados","Generar migraciones de esquema con uniones y planificación estratégica","Depurar problemas de base de datos Convex con documentación de tipos de datos de https://docs.convex.dev/database/types","Optimizar el rendimiento de la base de datos con configuración de índices según https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes"],"fr":["Valider les schémas de base de données avec un typage et une configuration d''index appropriés","Générer des migrations de schéma avec des unions et une planification stratégique","Déboguer les problèmes de base de données Convex avec la documentation des types de données de https://docs.convex.dev/database/types","Optimiser les performances de la base de données avec une configuration d''index selon https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes"],"de":["Datenbankschemata mit ordnungsgemäßer Typisierung und Indexkonfiguration validieren","Schemamigrationen mit Unions und strategischer Planung generieren","Convex-Datenbankprobleme mit der Dokumentation der Datentypen von https://docs.convex.dev/database/types debuggen","Datenbankleistung mit Indexkonfiguration gemäß https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes optimieren"],"pt":["Validar esquemas de banco de dados com digitação apropriada e configuração de índice","Gerar migrações de esquema com uniões e planejamento estratégico","Depurar problemas de banco de dados Convex com documentação de Tipos de Dados de https://docs.convex.dev/database/types","Otimizar o desempenho do banco de dados com configuração de Índices conforme https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes"],"ru":["Проверять схемы баз данных с правильным типом и конфигурацией индекса","Генерировать миграции схем с объединениями и стратегическим планированием","Отлаживать проблемы базы данных Convex с документацией по Типам Данных из https://docs.convex.dev/database/types","Оптимизировать производительность базы данных с конфигурацией Индексов согласно https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes"],"ar":["التحقق من مخطط قاعدة البيانات مع تنسيق مناسب وتكوين فهرس","توليد هجرة مخطط مع اتحادات وتخطيط استراتيجي","تصحيح أخطاء قاعدة البيانات Convex مع توثيق أنواع البيانات من https://docs.convex.dev/database/types","تحسين أداء قاعدة البيانات مع تكوين الفهارس حسب https://docs.convex.dev/database/indexes"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex database documentation","Limited to Convex database schemas","Needs understanding of Convex-specific data types and indexes"],"zh":["需要访问Convex数据库文档","仅限于Convex数据库模式","需要理解Convex特定的数据类型和索引"],"ja":["Convexデータベースドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Convexデータベーススキーマに限定される","Convex固有のデータ型とインデックスの理解が必要"],"ko":["Convex 데이터베이스 문서에 대한 액세스 필요","Convex 데이터베이스 스키마로 제한됨","Convex 특정 데이터 타입 및 인덱스에 대한 이해 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de la base de datos Convex","Limitado a los esquemas de base de datos Convex","Necesita comprensión de los tipos de datos y los índices específicos de Convex"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation de la base de données Convex","Limité aux schémas de base de données Convex","Nécessite une compréhension des types de données et des index spécifiques à Convex"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Convex-Datenbankdokumentation","Begrenzt auf Convex-Datenbankschemata","Benötigt Verständnis für Convex-spezifische Datentypen und Indizes"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação do banco de dados Convex","Limitado a esquemas de banco de dados Convex","Necessita de compreensão de tipos de dados e índices específicos do Convex"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации базы данных Convex","Ограничен схемами баз данных Convex","Требует понимания типов данных и индексов, специфичных для Convex"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق قاعدة البيانات Convex","محدود بمخطط قاعدة البيانات Convex","يحتاج إلى فهم أنواع البيانات والفهارس الخاصة ب Convex"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('congwa/wdm/theme-factory', 'community', 'congwa', 'wdm', 'congwa/wdm', 'theme-factory', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z', '2026-02-18T12:28:51.255Z', NULL, '{"id":"congwa/wdm/theme-factory","name":"theme-factory","description":{"zh":"Theme Factory 技术是一款智能数据管理工具，提供 AI 对话暂停反馈、智能存储清理和全面数据分析功能","ja":"テーマファクトリー技術は、AI対話一時停止フィードバック、智能ストレージクリア、総合データ分析などの機能を提供するインテリジェントデータ管理ツールです","ko":"테마 팩토리 기술은 AI 대화 일시 중지 피드백, 스마트 스토리지 클리어, 종합 데이터 분석 등의 기능을 제공하는 지능형 데이터 관리 도구입니다","es":"La Fábrica de Temas es una herramienta de gestión de datos inteligente para Windsurf AI que ofrece funcionalidades de pausa de conversación AI, limpieza de almacenamiento y análisis de datos para desarrolladores","fr":"L''Usine de Thèmes est un outil de gestion de données intelligent pour Windsurf AI qui propose des fonctionnalités de pause de conversation AI, de nettoyage de stockage et d''analyse de données pour les développeurs","de":"Die Theme-Factory ist ein intelligentes Datenmanagement-Tool für Windsurf AI, das Funktionen für AI-Gesprächspause, Speicherbereinigung und Datenanalyse für Entwickler bietet","pt":"A Fábrica de Temas é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de dados inteligente para Windsurf AI, oferecendo recursos como pausa de conversa, limpeza de armazenamento e análise de dados","ru":"Фабрика Тем - это интеллектуальный инструмент управления данными для Windsurf AI, предлагающий функции паузы разговора, очистки хранилища и анализа данных","ar":"مصنع السمات هو أداة إدارة بيانات ذكية لبيئة Windsurf AI، توفر ميزات مثل إيقاف المحادثة وتنظيف التخزين وتحليل البيانات","en":"款专为 Windsurf AI 开发环境打造的智能数据管理工具，提供 **AI 对话暂停反馈**、**智能存储清理** 和 **全面数据分析** 功能"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Theme Factory 技术 - 智能数据管理工具","ja":"テーマファクトリー - インテリジェントデータ管理ツール","ko":"테마 팩토리 기술 - 지능형 데이터 관리 도구","es":"Fábrica de Temas: Herramienta de Gestión de Datos para Wi...",