,"Análisis de datos completo","Colores y fuentes personalizables","Diseño de temas profesionales","Aplicación de temas a artefactos"],"fr":["Pause de conversation AI","Nettoyage de stockage intelligent","Analyse de données complète","Couleurs et polices personnalisables","Conception de thèmes professionnels","Application de thèmes à des artefacts"],"de":["AI-Gesprächspause","Intelligente Speicherbereinigung","Vollständige Datenanalyse","Anpassbare Farben und Schriftarten","Professionelles Themen-Design","Anwendung von Themen auf Artefakte"],"pt":["Pausa de conversa AI","Limpeza de armazenamento inteligente","Análise de dados completa","Gerenciamento de dados eficiente","Integração com Windsurf AI","Ferramenta de gerenciamento de dados personalizável"],"ru":["Пауза разговора AI","Интеллектуальная очистка хранилища","Полный анализ данных","Эффективное управление данными","Интеграция с Windsurf AI","Настраиваемый инструмент управления данными"],"ar":["إيقاف المحادثة الذكية","تنظيف التخزين الذكي","تحليل البيانات الشامل","إدارة البيانات الفعالة","التكامل مع Windsurf AI","أداة إدارة البيانات القابلة للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能数据管理","AI 对话","数据分析","Windsurf AI","开发环境","数据管理工具"],"ja":["インテリジェントデータ管理","AI対話","データ分析","Windsurf AI","開発環境","データ管理ツール"],"ko":["지능형 데이터 관리","AI 대화","데이터 분석","윈드서프 AI","개발 환경","데이터 관리 도구"],"es":["gestión de datos","Windsurf AI","pausa de conversación AI","limpieza de almacenamiento","análisis de datos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","temas personalizables","diseño de temas"],"fr":["gestion de données","Windsurf AI","pause de conversation AI","nettoyage de stockage","analyse de données","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","thèmes personnalisables","conception de thèmes"],"de":["Datenmanagement","Windsurf AI","AI-Gesprächspause","Speicherbereinigung","Datenanalyse","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools","anpassbare Themen","Themen-Design"],"pt":["fábrica de temas","gerenciamento de dados","Windsurf AI","pausa de conversa","limpeza de armazenamento","análise de dados","inteligência artificial","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["фабрика тем","управление данными","Windsurf AI","пауза разговора","очистка хранилища","анализ данных","искусственный интеллект","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مصنع السمات","إدارة البيانات","Windsurf AI","إيقاف المحادثة","تنظيف التخزين","تحليل البيانات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"congwa","repo":"wdm","repoPath":"congwa/wdm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"theme-factory","description":"Toolkit for styling artifacts with a theme. These artifacts can be slides, docs, reportings, HTML landing pages, etc. There are 10 pre-set themes with colors/fonts that you can apply to any artifact that has been creating, or can generate a new theme on-the-fly.","bodyPreview":"# Theme Factory Skill\n\nThis skill provides a curated collection of professional font and color themes themes, each with carefully selected color palettes and font pairings. Once a theme is chosen, it can be applied to any artifact.\n\n## Purpose\n\nTo apply consistent, professional styling to presentation slide decks, use this skill. Each theme includes:\n- A cohesive color palette with hex codes\n- Complementary font pairings for headers and body text\n- A distinct visual identity suitable for differe","body":"# Theme Factory Skill\n\nThis skill provides a curated collection of professional font and color themes themes, each with carefully selected color palettes and font pairings. Once a theme is chosen, it can be applied to any artifact.\n\n## Purpose\n\nTo apply consistent, professional styling to presentation slide decks, use this skill. Each theme includes:\n- A cohesive color palette with hex codes\n- Complementary font pairings for headers and body text\n- A distinct visual identity suitable for different contexts and audiences\n\n## Usage Instructions\n\nTo apply styling to a slide deck or other artifact:\n\n1. **Show the theme showcase**: Display the `theme-showcase.pdf` file to allow users to see all available themes visually. Do not make any modifications to it; simply show the file for viewing.\n2. **Ask for their choice**: Ask which theme to apply to the deck\n3. **Wait for selection**: Get explicit confirmation about the chosen theme\n4. **Apply the theme**: Once a theme has been chosen, apply the selected theme''s colors and fonts to the deck/artifact\n\n## Themes Available\n\nThe following 10 themes are available, each showcased in `theme-showcase.pdf`:\n\n1. **Ocean Depths** - Professional and calming maritime theme\n2. **Sunset Boulevard** - Warm and vibrant sunset colors\n3. **Forest Canopy** - Natural and grounded earth tones\n4. **Modern Minimalist** - Clean and contemporary grayscale\n5. **Golden Hour** - Rich and warm autumnal palette\n6. **Arctic Frost** - Cool and crisp winter-inspired theme\n7. **Desert Rose** - Soft and sophisticated dusty tones\n8. **Tech Innovation** - Bold and modern tech aesthetic\n9. **Botanical Garden** - Fresh and organic garden colors\n10. **Midnight Galaxy** - Dramatic and cosmic deep tones\n\n## Theme Details\n\nEach theme is defined in the `themes/` directory with complete specifications including:\n- Cohesive color palette with hex codes\n- Complementary font pairings for headers and body text\n- Distinct visual identity suitable for different contexts and audiences\n\n## Application Process\n\nAfter a preferred theme is selected:\n1. Read the corresponding theme file from the `themes/` directory\n2. Apply the specified colors and fonts consistently throughout the deck\n3. Ensure proper contrast and readability\n4. Maintain the theme''s visual identity across all slides\n\n## Create your Own Theme\nTo handle cases where none of the existing themes work for an artifact, create a custom theme. Based on provided inputs, generate a new theme similar to the ones above. Give the theme a similar name describing what the font/color combinations represent. Use any basic description provided to choose appropriate colors/fonts. After generating the theme, show it for review and verification. Following that, apply the theme as described above.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:28:51.255Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-focused AI Agents needing professional font and color theme management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要专业字体和色彩主题管理能力的设计为导向的AI代理。","ja":"デザイン中心のAIエージェントがプロフェッショナルなフォントとカラーテーマ管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"전문적인 폰트와 색상 테마 관리 기능이 필요한 디자인 중심의 AI 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA con enfoque de Diseño que necesitan capacidades de administración de fuentes y temas de color profesionales.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA axés sur la conception nécessitant des capacités de gestion de polices et de thèmes de couleur professionnelles.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte KI-Agents, die professionelle Schrift- und Farbschemaverwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA com foco em Design que necessitam de capacidades profissionais de gerenciamento de fontes e temas de cores.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на дизайн, которым необходимы профессиональные возможности управления шрифтами и цветовыми темами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على التصميم والذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة الخطوط والخلفيات اللونية الاحترافية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply consistent, professional styling to presentation slide decks using curated font and color themes, including cohesive color palettes with hex codes and complementary font pairings for headers and body text, all while maintaining a distinct visual identity.","zh":"赋予代理将一致的专业样式应用于演示文稿幻灯片，使用策划的字体和色彩主题，包括具有十六进制代码的协调色板和标题和正文文本的互补字体配对，同时保持着独特的视觉身份。","ja":"カーブドなフォントとカラーテーマを使用して、プレゼンテーション用スライドデッキに一貫したプロフェッショナルなスタイリングを適用できるようにエージェントをEmpower化します。ヘッダーとボディテキストの補完的なフォントペアリングを含む、十六進数コードを備えた調和的な色彩パレット。","ko":"커브드한 폰트와 색상 테마를 사용하여 프레젠테이션용 슬라이드 덱에 일관된 전문적인 스타일을 적용할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다. 헤더와 본문 텍스트를 위한 보완적인 폰트 페어링을 포함하여 16진수 코드를 갖춘 조화로운 색상 팔레트.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un estilo coherente y profesional a las diapositivas de presentación utilizando temas de fuentes y colores curados, incluidas paletas de colores coherentes con códigos hex y parejas de fuentes complementarias para encabezados y texto del cuerpo, todo mientras mantiene una identidad visual distintiva.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un style cohérent et professionnel aux diapositives de présentation en utilisant des thèmes de polices et de couleurs curatoriaux, y compris des palettes de couleurs cohérentes avec des codes hex et des paires de polices complémentaires pour les en-têtes et le texte du corps, tout en maintenant une identité visuelle distincte.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, einen konsistenten, professionellen Stil auf Präsentationsfolien anzuwenden, indem sie kuratierte Schrift- und Farbschemata verwenden, einschließlich kohärenter Farbpaletten mit Hex-Codes und komplementären Schriftkombinationen für Kopfzeilen und Fließtext, während sie eine deutliche visuelle Identität beibehalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar estilos consistentes e profissionais a conjuntos de slides de apresentação usando temas de fontes e cores curados, incluindo paletas de cores coesas com códigos hex e pares de fontes complementares para cabeçalhos e texto do corpo, mantendo uma identidade visual distinta.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять последовательные и профессиональные стили к наборам слайдов презентации с помощью отобранных тем шрифтов и цветов, включая сплоченные цветовые палитры с кодами hex и дополняющие пары шрифтов для заголовков и текста тела, сохраняя при этом четкую визуальную идентичность.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من تطبيق تنسيقات متسقة ومهنية على شرائح العرض باستخدام مواضيع خطوط وألوان منقحة، بما في ذلك لوحات ألوان متجانسة مع رموز سداسي عشرية وأزواج خطوط مكمّلة للرؤوس والنص الرئيسي، مع الحفاظ على هوية بصرية متميزة."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying consistent themes to presentation slide decks","Generating professional color palettes with hex codes","Selecting complementary font pairings for headers and body text"],"zh":["将一致的主题应用于演示文稿幻灯片","生成具有十六进制代码的专业色彩 팔레트","为标题和正文文本选择互补的字体配对"],"ja":["プレゼンテーション用スライドデッキに一貫したテーマを適用する","十六進数コードを備えたプロフェッショナルなカラーパレットを生成する","ヘッダーとボディテキストのための補完的なフォントペアリングを選択する"],"ko":["프레젠테이션용 슬라이드 덱에 일관된 테마를 적용하는 것","16진수 코드를 갖춘 전문적인 색상 팔레트를 생성하는 것","헤더와 본문 텍스트를 위한 보완적인 폰트 페어링을 선택하는 것"],"es":["Aplicar temas coherentes a las diapositivas de presentación","Generar paletas de colores profesionales con códigos hex","Seleccionar parejas de fuentes complementarias para encabezados y texto del cuerpo"],"fr":["Appliquer des thèmes cohérents aux diapositives de présentation","Générer des palettes de couleurs professionnelles avec des codes hex","Sélectionner des paires de polices complémentaires pour les en-têtes et le texte du corps"],"de":["Konsistente Themen auf Präsentationsfolien anwenden","Erstellen von professionellen Farbpaletten mit Hex-Codes","Auswählen von komplementären Schriftkombinationen für Kopfzeilen und Fließtext"],"pt":["Aplicar temas consistentes a conjuntos de slides de apresentação","Gerar paletas de cores profissionais com códigos hex","Selecionar pares de fontes complementares para cabeçalhos e texto do corpo"],"ru":["Применение последовательных тем к наборам слайдов презентации","Генерация профессиональных цветовых палитр с кодами hex","Выбор дополняющих пар шрифтов для заголовков и текста тела"],"ar":["تطبيق مواضيع متسقة على شرائح العرض","إنتاج لوحات ألوان احترافية مع رموز سداسية عشرية","اختيار أزواج خطوط مكمّلة للرؤوس والنص الرئيسي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires theme selection and application to artifacts","Limited to presentation slide decks and similar visual content"],"zh":["需要主题选择和应用于制品","仅限于演示文稿幻灯片和类似的视觉内容"],"ja":["テーマの選択とアーティファクトへの適用が必要","プレゼンテーション用スライドデッキと類似の視覚コンテンツのみ"],"ko":["테마 선택 및 아티팩트 적용이 필요","프레젠테이션용 슬라이드 덱 및 유사한 시각적 콘텐츠만"],"es":["Requiere la selección y aplicación de temas a artefactos","Limitado a diapositivas de presentación y contenido visual similar"],"fr":["Nécessite la sélection et l''application de thèmes à des artefacts","Limité aux diapositives de présentation et au contenu visuel similaire"],"de":["Benötigt die Auswahl und Anwendung von Themen auf Artefakte","Begrenzt auf Präsentationsfolien und ähnlichen visuellen Inhalt"],"pt":["Exige seleção e aplicação de temas a artefatos","Limitado a conjuntos de slides de apresentação e conteúdo visual semelhante"],"ru":["Требует выбора и применения тем к артефактам","Ограничен наборами слайдов презентации и подобным визуальным контентом"],"ar":["يتطلب اختيار وتطبيق المواضيع على الهياكل","محدود بشرائح العرض ومحتوى بصرية مشابه"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
