物プロトコル：RWA資産、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポート","ko":"합성 영속적 선물 프로토콜: RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원","es":"Protocolo de Futuros Perpetuos Sintéticos","fr":"Protocole de Futures Perpétuels Synthétiques","de":"Synthetisches Perpetual-Futures-Protokoll","pt":"Protocolo de Futuros Perpétuos Sintéticos","ru":"Синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов","ar":"بروتوكول المشتقات المستقبلية الشبهية الدائمة","en":"summary"},"description":{"zh":"合成永续期货协议是一种支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数的去中心化交易协议","ja":"合成永続先物プロトコルは、RWA資産、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポートする分散型取引プロトコルです","ko":"합성 영속적 선물 프로토콜은 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원하는 분산형 거래 프로토콜입니다","es":"El protocolo de futuros perpetuos sintéticos es una plataforma que admite activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices con posiciones apalancadas","fr":"Le protocole de futures perpétuels synthétiques est une plateforme qui prend en charge les actifs RWA, les crypto-monnaies, les actions et les indices avec d...","de":"Das synthetische Perpetual-Futures-Protokoll ist eine Plattform, die RWA-Assets, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes mit gehebelten Positionen unterstützt","pt":"O protocolo de futuros perpétuos sintéticos é uma plataforma que permite aos traders abrir posições alavancadas longas/curtas com até 1000x de alavanco","ru":"Синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов - это платформа, которая позволяет трейдерам открывать левериджные длинные/короткие позиции с до 1000х кратным плечом","ar":"بروتوكول المشتقات المستقبلية الشبهية الدائمة هو منصة تسمح للمتداولين بفتح مراكز طويلة/قصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000 ضعف","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["高达1000倍的杠杆","稳定币抵押","去中心化清算","支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数"],"ja":["最大1000倍のレバレッジ","スターブルコインによる担保","分散型のクリアリング","RWA資産、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポート"],"ko":["최대 1000배의 레버리지","스테이블코인 담보","분산형 청산","RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원"],"es":["Soporte para activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices","Posiciones apalancadas de hasta 1000x","Bóveda de liquidez centralizada","Oracle personalizado y suavizado TWAP"],"fr":["Prise en charge des actifs RWA, des crypto-monnaies, des actions et des indices","Positions à effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x","Chambre de liquide centrale","Oracle personnalisé et lissage TWAP"],"de":["Unterstützung für RWA-Assets, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes","Gehebelte Positionen von bis zu 1000x","Zentrale Liquiditätsbörse","Benutzerdefinierter Oracle und TWAP-Glättung"],"pt":["Suporte a ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices","Posições alavancadas longas/curtas com até 1000x de alavanco","Cofre de liquidez centralizado","Preços combinados com oráculo personalizado, AMM virtual e suavização TWAP"],"ru":["Поддержка активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов","Левериджные длинные/короткие позиции с до 1000х кратным плечом","Централизованный кофр ликвидности","Цены, объединенные с индивидуальным оракулом, виртуальным AMM и сглаживанием TWAP"],"ar":["دعم الأصول RWA والعملات المشفرة والأوراق المالية والمؤشرات","مراكز طويلة/قصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000 ضعف","خزانة سيولة مركزية","أسعار مجتمعة مع محرك أوراكل مخصص و AMM افتراضي وتنعيم TWAP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["合成永续期货","去中心化交易","RWA资产","加密货币","杠杆交易","稳定币"],"ja":["合成永続先物","分散型取引","RWA資産","暗号資産","レバレッジ取引","スターブルコイン"],"ko":["합성 영속적 선물","분산형 거래","RWA 자산","암호화폐","레버리지 거래","스테이블코인"],"es":["futuros perpetuos sintéticos","activos RWA","criptomonedas","acciones","índices","posiciones apalancadas","oracle personalizado","suavizado TWAP"],"fr":["futures perpétuels synthétiques","actifs RWA","crypto-monnaies","actions","indices","positions à effet de levier","oracle personnalisé","lissage TWAP"],"de":["synthetische Perpetual-Futures","RWA-Assets","Kryptowährungen","Aktien","Indizes","gehebelte Positionen","benutzerdefinierter Oracle","TWAP-Glättung"],"pt":["futuros perpétuos sintéticos","ativos RWA","criptomoedas","ações","índices","posições alavancadas","oráculo personalizado","AMM virtual","suavização TWAP"],"ru":["синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов","активы RWA","криптовалюты","акции","индексы","левериджные позиции","индивидуальный оракул","виртуальный AMM","сглаживание TWAP"],"ar":["بروتوكول المشتقات المستقبلية الشبهية الدائمة","الأصول RWA","العملات المشفرة","الأوراق المالية","المؤشرات","مراكز رافعة مالية","محرك أوراكل مخصص","AMM افتراضي","تنعيم TWAP"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"summary","description":"Quick summary of Conventional Commits specification and core concepts for semantic commit messages.","bodyPreview":"# Conventional Commits Summary\n\n## The Specification\n\n**Conventional Commits** is a lightweight convention on top of commit messages that provides an easy set of rules for creating an explicit commit history. It makes it easier to write automated tools on top of commits and aligns with Semantic Versioning.\n\n## Commit Message Structure\n\nEvery conventional commit follows this format:\n\n```\n<type>[optional scope]: <description>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer(s)]\n```\n\n### Components Explained\n\n**","body":"# Conventional Commits Summary\n\n## The Specification\n\n**Conventional Commits** is a lightweight convention on top of commit messages that provides an easy set of rules for creating an explicit commit history. It makes it easier to write automated tools on top of commits and aligns with Semantic Versioning.\n\n## Commit Message Structure\n\nEvery conventional commit follows this format:\n\n```\n<type>[optional scope]: <description>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer(s)]\n```\n\n### Components Explained\n\n**Type** (REQUIRED)\n- A noun that describes the kind of change: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `chore`, `ci`, `build`\n- Communicates the intent of the change\n- Maps to semantic versioning bumps\n\n**Scope** (OPTIONAL)\n- Noun describing a section of the codebase\n- Wrapped in parenthesis: `feat(parser):`\n- Provides additional context about what part of the system changed\n\n**Description** (REQUIRED)\n- Short summary of the code changes\n- Starts with lowercase (when not using parenthesis scope)\n- Concise and clear, typically 50 characters or less\n- Written in imperative mood: \"add\" not \"added\" or \"adds\"\n\n**Body** (OPTIONAL)\n- Longer explanation of the commit\n- Separated from description by blank line\n- Can contain multiple paragraphs\n- Provides contextual information about what and why\n\n**Footer** (OPTIONAL)\n- Additional metadata or references\n- Preceded by blank line\n- Format: `<token>: <value>`\n- Special footer: `BREAKING CHANGE:` for major version changes\n\n## Core Commit Types\n\n### Primary Types (Semantic Versioning)\n\n**feat** - New Feature\n- Introduces a new feature to your codebase\n- Maps to `MINOR` version bump in SemVer\n- Example: `feat(auth): add OAuth 2.0 support`\n\n**fix** - Bug Fix\n- Patches a bug in your codebase\n- Maps to `PATCH` version bump in SemVer\n- Example: `fix(parser): handle edge case with empty arrays`\n\n**BREAKING CHANGE** - Breaking Change\n- Introduces a breaking API change\n- Maps to `MAJOR` version bump in SemVer\n- Indicated by `!` before colon or in footer\n- Example: `feat!: drop support for Node 6`\n\n### Supporting Types\n\n- **docs**: Documentation changes only\n- **style**: Code style changes (formatting, semicolons, etc.) - doesn''t affect code logic\n- **refactor**: Code refactoring without feature or bug fix\n- **perf**: Performance improvements\n- **test**: Adding or updating tests\n- **chore**: Build process, dependencies, tooling\n- **ci**: CI/CD configuration changes\n- **build**: Changes to build system or external dependencies\n\n## Why Use Conventional Commits?\n\n✅ **Automated Tooling**: Tools can automatically parse and act on commits\n✅ **Clear History**: Commit history is human-readable and searchable\n✅ **Semantic Versioning**: Automatic version bumping based on commit types\n✅ **Changelog Generation**: Auto-generate changelogs from commits\n✅ **Team Communication**: Clear understanding of what changed and why\n✅ **Project Organization**: Encourages atomic, well-organized commits\n\n## Quick Examples\n\n```\nfeat: allow provided config object to extend other configs\n```\n\n```\nfix(parser): prevent racing of requests\n```\n\n```\nfeat(api)!: send an email to the customer when a product is shipped\n```\n\n```\ndocs: correct spelling of CHANGELOG\n```\n\n```\nrefactor(core): simplify request processing logic\n```\n\n## Key Principles\n\n✅ **Type First**: Always specify the commit type\n✅ **Scope Optional**: Add scope when helpful for clarity\n✅ **Description Imperative**: Use \"add\", \"fix\", \"refactor\" not \"added\", \"fixed\", \"refactored\"\n✅ **Description Lowercase**: Start description with lowercase (unless following scope with parenthesis)\n✅ **One Logical Change**: Keep commits atomic and focused\n✅ **Breaking Changes Clear**: Always mark breaking changes explicitly\n\n## Integration with SemVer\n\n| Commit Type | SemVer Impact | Example |\n|------------|---------------|---------|\n| `feat` | MINOR bump | `v1.0.0` → `v1.1.0` |\n| `fix` | PATCH bump | `v1.1.0` → `v1.1.1` |\n| `BREAKING CHANGE` | MAJOR bump | `v1.1.1` → `v2.0.0` |\n| `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `chore`, `ci` | No SemVer impact | Development only |\n\n---\n\n**License**: [Creative Commons - CC BY 3.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/)\n\nSource: [Conventional Commits v1.0.0](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:28:29.568Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced text summarization capabilities for synthetic perpetual futures protocols and Conventional Commits analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要高级文本摘要能力的AI代理，如Claude Code和AutoGPT，用于合成永续期货协议和传统提交分析。","ja":"Claude CodeやAutoGPTのような、高度なテキスト要約機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。シンセティック・パーペチュアル・フューチャーズ・プロトコルや従来のコミット分析に使用されます。","ko":"Claude Code와 AutoGPT 같은 고급 텍스트 요약 기능을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 합성 영구적 선물 프로토콜 및 전통적인 커밋 분석에 사용됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades de resumen de texto avanzadas para protocolos de futuros sintéticos perpetuos y análisis de Commits Convencionales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT qui ont besoin de capacités de résumé de texte avancées pour les protocoles de futurs synthétiques permanents et l''analyse des Commits Conventionnels.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte Textzusammenfassungsfunktionen für synthetische Perpetual-Futures-Protokolle und Conventional-Commits-Analysen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de resumo de texto para protocolos de futuros perpétuos sintéticos e análise de Commits Convencionais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым требуются продвинутые возможности суммаризации текста для синтетических вечных фьючерсных протоколов и анализа Конвенциональных Коммитов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتلخيص النصوص لبروتوكولات المستقبل السينثيتي الدائم والتحليلات التزامات التقليدية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate concise summaries of complex financial protocols and commit message structures, utilizing Conventional Commits specification and Semantic Versioning, and providing easy integration with on-chain vaults and central liquidity vaults.","zh":"使代理能够生成复杂金融协议和提交消息结构的简明摘要，利用传统提交规范和语义版本控制，并提供与链上金库和集中流动性金库的轻松集成。","ja":"エージェントが複雑な金融プロトコルやコミットメッセージ構造の簡潔な要約を生成できるようにし、従来のコミット仕様やセマンティックバージョニングを利用し、オンチェーン・ボールトや集中流動性ボールトとのシームレスな統合を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 금융 프로토콜 및 커밋 메시지 구조의 간결한 요약을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 전통적인 커밋 명세 및 의미 버전 관리를 활용하고, 체인상 금고 및 집중 유동성 금고와의 쉬운 통합을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar resúmenes concisos de protocolos financieros complejos y estructuras de mensajes de confirmación, utilizando la especificación Conventional Commits y la versión semántica, y proporcionando una integración sencilla con bóvedas en cadena y bóvedas de liquidez central.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des résumés concis de protocoles financiers complexes et de structures de messages de validation, en utilisant la spécification Conventional Commits et la version sémantique, et en fournissant une intégration facile avec les coffres en chaîne et les coffres de liquidité centrale.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, präzise Zusammenfassungen komplexer Finanzprotokolle und Commit-Nachrichtenstrukturen zu erstellen, indem sie die Conventional-Commits-Spezifikation und die semantische Versionierung verwenden und eine einfache Integration mit On-Chain-Vaults und zentralen Liquiditäts-Vaults ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar resumos concisos de protocolos financeiros complexos e estruturas de mensagens de commit, utilizando a especificação Conventional Commits e Controle de Versão Semântico, e fornecendo integração fácil com cofres na cadeia e cofres de liquidez central.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать краткие резюме сложных финансовых протоколов и структур сообщений коммита, используя спецификацию Конвенциональных Коммитов и Семантическое Управление Версиями, и обеспечивая легкую интеграцию с хранилищами в цепочке и центральными хранилищами ликвидности.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توليد ملخصات موجزة لبروتوكولات مالية معقدة وهياكل رسائل التزام، باستخدام مواصفات الالتزامات التقليدية وإدارة الإصدارات الدلالية، وتوفير تكامل سهل مع الخزائن على السلسلة والخزائن المركزية للسائلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Summarizing synthetic perpetual futures protocol specifications","Analyzing Conventional Commits for automated tooling","Generating descriptions for leveraged long/short positions"],"zh":["总结合成永续期货协议规格","分析传统提交用于自动化工具","生成杠杆多头/空头位置的描述"],"ja":["シンセティック・パーペチュアル・フューチャーズ・プロトコルの仕様を要約する","従来のコミットを分析して自動化ツールを作成する","レバレッジ・ロング/ショート・ポジションの説明を生成する"],"ko":["합성 영구적 선물 프로토콜 사양을 요약하는 것","전통적인 커밋을 분석하여 자동화 도구를 생성하는 것","레버리지 롱/숏 포지션에 대한 설명을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Resumir las especificaciones del protocolo de futuros sintéticos perpetuos","Analizar Commits Convencionales para herramientas automatizadas","Generar descripciones para posiciones largas/cortas apalancadas"],"fr":["Résumer les spécifications du protocole de futurs synthétiques permanents","Analyser les Commits Conventionnels pour les outils automatisés","Générer des descriptions pour les positions longues/courtes à effet de levier"],"de":["Zusammenfassung der Spezifikationen des synthetischen Perpetual-Futures-Protokolls","Analyse von Conventional Commits für automatisierte Tools","Erstellung von Beschreibungen für gehebelte Long-/Short-Positionen"],"pt":["Resumir especificações de protocolos de futuros perpétuos sintéticos","Analizar Commits Convencionais para ferramentas automatizadas","Gerar descrições para posições longas/curtas alavancadas"],"ru":["Резюмировать спецификации синтетических вечных фьючерсных протоколов","Анализировать Конвенциональные Коммиты для автоматизированных инструментов","Генерировать описания для кредитных длинных/коротких позиций"],"ar":["تلخيص مواصفات بروتوكولات المستقبل السينثيتي الدائم","تحليل التزامات التقليدية لأدوات التأتمت","توليد وصفات لمواقف طويلة/قصيرة مُضاعفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of financial protocols and Conventional Commits","Limited to text-based input and output"],"zh":["需要理解金融协议和传统提交","仅限文本输入和输出"],"ja":["金融プロトコルや従来のコミットの理解が必要","テキスト入力と出力のみに限定される"],"ko":["금융 프로토콜 및 전통적인 커밋에 대한 이해가 필요","텍스트 입력 및 출력만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de protocolos financieros y Commits Convencionales","Limitado a entrada y salida de texto"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des protocoles financiers et des Commits Conventionnels","Limité à l''entrée et à la sortie de texte"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis von Finanzprotokollen und Conventional Commits","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Eingabe und Ausgabe"],"pt":["Requer entendimento de protocolos financeiros e Commits Convencionais","Limitado a entrada e saída baseadas em texto"],"ru":["Требует понимания финансовых протоколов и Конвенциональных Коммитов","Ограничен входом и выходом на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم بروتوكولات مالية والتزامات التقليدية","محدود بالمدخلات والمخرجات القائمة على النص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
