 est cruciale pour collecter des données précises et améliorer la prise de décision","de":"Die Erstellung von effektiven Umfragen ist entscheidend, um genaue Daten zu sammeln und die Entscheidungsfindung zu verbessern","pt":"Desenvolva pesquisas eficazes com frameworks de líderes de produtos. Clarifique metas, escolha métricas certas e desenhe perguntas limpas.","ru":"Разработайте эффективные опросы с помощью фреймворков лидеров продукта. Ясно определите цели, выберите правильные метрики и спроектируйте чистые вопросы.","ar":"طور استبيانات فعالة باستخدام إطارات عمل من قادة المنتجات. حدد الأهداف واختر المقاييس الصحيحة وصمم أسئلة نظيفة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["确定调查目标","选择合适的指标","设计清晰的问题","创建有效的调查问卷"],"ja":["調査の目的を明確に","適切な指標を選択","クリーンな質問を設計","効果的な調査を作成"],"ko":["설문조사의 목표를 설정","적절한 지표를 선택","깨끗한 질문을 설계","효과적인 설문조사를 생성"],"es":["Clarificar el objetivo","Elegir la métrica adecuada","Diseñar preguntas limpias","Seleccionar entre NPS, CSAT, PMF o enfoques personalizados"],"fr":["Clarifier l''objectif","Choisir la métrique appropriée","Concevoir des questions propres","Sélectionner entre NPS, CSAT, PMF ou approches personnalisées"],"de":["Ziel klären","Die richtige Metrik wählen","Sauber gestaltete Fragen","Auswahl zwischen NPS, CSAT, PMF oder benutzerdefinierten Ansätzen"],"pt":["Clarificar metas de pesquisa","Escolher métricas certas","Desenhar perguntas limpas","Utilizar frameworks de líderes de produtos"],"ru":["Ясно определить цели опроса","Выбрать правильные метрики","Спроектировать чистые вопросы","Использовать фреймворки лидеров продукта"],"ar":["تحديد أهداف الاستبيان","اختيار المقاييس الصحيحة","تصميم أسئلة نظيفة","استخدام إطارات عمل من قادة المنتجات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["调查问卷设计","用户反馈","见解收集","有效调查","清晰问题","调查目标"],"ja":["調査のデザイン","ユーザーのフィードバック","洞察の収集","効果的な調査","クリーンな質問","調査の目的"],"ko":["설문조사 설계","사용자 피드백","통찰력 수집","효과적인 설문조사","깨끗한 질문","설문조사의 목표"],"es":["diseño de encuestas","investigación de mercado","recopilación de datos","análisis de retroalimentación","NPS","CSAT","PMF"],"fr":["conception de sondages","recherche de marché","collecte de données","analyse de rétroaction","NPS","CSAT","PMF"],"de":["Umfragen erstellen","Marktforschung","Daten sammeln","Feedback-Analyse","NPS","CSAT","PMF"],"pt":["desenho de pesquisas","criação de pesquisas","frameworks de pesquisa","metodologia de pesquisa","coleta de dados","análise de feedback"],"ru":["разработка опросов","создание опросов","фреймворки опросов","методология опросов","сбор данных","анализ обратной связи"],"ar":["تصميم استبيانات","إنشاء استبيانات","إطارات عمل للاستبيانات","منهجية الاستبيان","جمع البيانات","تحليل آراء المشاركين"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"designing-surveys","description":"Help users design effective surveys. Use when someone is creating customer surveys, NPS measurements, product-market fit surveys, or feedback collection mechanisms.","bodyPreview":"# Designing Surveys\n\nHelp the user design effective surveys using frameworks from 9 product leaders who have built rigorous research and feedback systems.\n\n## How to Help\n\nWhen the user asks for help with surveys:\n\n1. **Clarify the goal** - Determine if they''re measuring satisfaction, identifying problems, or prioritizing features\n2. **Choose the right metric** - Help them select between NPS, CSAT, PMF survey, or custom approaches\n3. **Design clean questions** - Ensure each question measures one","body":"# Designing Surveys\n\nHelp the user design effective surveys using frameworks from 9 product leaders who have built rigorous research and feedback systems.\n\n## How to Help\n\nWhen the user asks for help with surveys:\n\n1. **Clarify the goal** - Determine if they''re measuring satisfaction, identifying problems, or prioritizing features\n2. **Choose the right metric** - Help them select between NPS, CSAT, PMF survey, or custom approaches\n3. **Design clean questions** - Ensure each question measures one thing precisely\n4. **Target the right respondents** - Help them reach users with fresh, relevant experience\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### NPS is scientifically flawed\nJudd Antin: \"NPS is the best example of the marketing industry marketing itself. The consensus in the survey science community is that NPS makes all the mistakes. Customer satisfaction, a simple CSAT metric, is better. It has better data properties, it is more precise, it is more correlated to business outcomes.\" Use CSAT with 5-7 item scales instead.\n\n### Force prioritization with constraints\nNicole Forsgren: \"Let them pick three, just three. Of those three, how often does this affect you? Is this hourly? Is this daily? Is this weekly?\" Limit respondents to their top barriers to keep data clean, then measure frequency to weight impact.\n\n### Survey your best customers at the right time\nGia Laudi: \"Very importantly, they signed up for your product recently enough that they remember what life was like before. Generally, we say that''s in the three to six-month range.\" Target customers who have been using the product 3-6 months so their memory of the ''before'' state is fresh.\n\n### Onboarding surveys improve conversion\nLaura Schaffer: \"We just asked for forgiveness and put these questions into the signup flow. An improved conversion by like 5%, just improved signups.\" Adding ''good friction'' in the form of targeted questions can increase conversion by reassuring users they''re in the right place.\n\n### Avoid double-barreled questions\nNicole Forsgren: \"You''re asking four different questions there. If someone answers yes, was it the build? Was it the test? Was it slow or was it flaky?\" Ensure each survey question only asks about one specific variable.\n\n### Use MaxDiff for feature prioritization\nMadhavan Ramanujam: \"Identify the most important for you, and the least important. If you do this a few times, you will be able to prioritize the entire feature set in a relative fashion.\" MaxDiff (Most/Least) surveys are superior to simple ranking for identifying value drivers.\n\n## Questions to Help Users\n\n- \"What specific decision will this survey inform?\"\n- \"Are you asking about one thing per question, or multiple things?\"\n- \"Who are your ''best'' customers and when did they sign up?\"\n- \"Are all scale options visible on mobile without scrolling?\"\n- \"How will you force respondents to prioritize rather than rate everything high?\"\n\n## Common Mistakes to Flag\n\n- **Double-barreled questions** - Asking about speed AND complexity in one question\n- **Too many options** - Allowing respondents to select unlimited items instead of forcing prioritization\n- **Wrong timing** - Surveying customers who are too new (no experience) or too old (forgot the ''before'')\n- **NPS worship** - Relying on a metric with known scientific flaws over simpler, better alternatives\n- **Hidden scale options** - Mobile surveys where users can''t see all options create response bias\n\n## Deep Dive\n\nFor all 10 insights from 9 guests, see `references/guest-insights.md`\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- Writing North Star Metrics\n- Defining Product Vision\n- Prioritizing Roadmap\n- Setting OKRs & Goals\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:29:01.736Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced survey design capabilities to enhance user research and feedback systems.","zh":"适合需要高级调查设计功能的AI代理，如Claude Code和AutoGPT，以增强用户研究和反馈系统。","ja":"Claude CodeやAutoGPTのような高度な調査設計機能を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。ユーザー研究とフィードバックシステムを強化するために。","ko":"고급 설문조사 디자인 기능이 필요한 Claude Code와 AutoGPT 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 사용자 연구 및 피드백 시스템을 강화하는 데 도움이 됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de diseño de encuestas para mejorar los sistemas de investigación y comentarios de los usuarios.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT ayant besoin de capacités avancées de conception de sondages pour améliorer les systèmes de recherche et de commentaires des utilisateurs.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte Umfrage-Design-Funktionen benötigen, um Benutzerforschung und Feedback-Systeme zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de design de pesquisas para melhorar a pesquisa de usuário e os sistemas de feedback.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности проектирования опросов для улучшения исследований пользователей и систем обратной связи.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصميم الاستبيانات لتحسين أبحاث المستخدم ونظم التغذية الراجعة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft effective surveys using proven frameworks from product leaders, incorporating metrics like NPS, CSAT, and PMF surveys, and ensuring clean, targeted question design to gather actionable insights.","zh":"赋予代理创建有效调查的能力，使用来自产品领导者的成熟框架，结合NPS、CSAT和PMF调查等指标，确保清晰、有针对性的问题设计以收集可行的见解。","ja":"エージェントが有効な調査を作成できるようにし、製品リーダーの実証済みフレームワークを使用し、NPS、CSAT、PMF調査などの指標を組み込み、ターゲットに絞った質問設計を実現して、有効な洞察を収集します。","ko":"에이전트가 효과적인 설문조사를 만들 수 있도록 해주며, 제품 리더들의 검증된 프레임워크를 사용하여 NPS, CSAT, PMF 설문조사 등의 지표를 통합하고, 깨끗하고 목표 지향적인 질문 설계를 통해 실질적인 통찰력을 수집할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear encuestas efectivas utilizando marcos probados de líderes de productos, incorporando métricas como NPS, CSAT y encuestas PMF, y asegurando un diseño de preguntas limpio y dirigido para recopilar información útil.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des sondages efficaces en utilisant des cadres éprouvés de leaders de produits, en intégrant des mesures comme NPS, CSAT et des sondages PMF, et en assurant une conception de questions ciblée et propre pour recueillir des informations utiles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, effektive Umfragen zu erstellen, indem sie bewährte Rahmenbedingungen von Produktleitern verwenden, Metriken wie NPS, CSAT und PMF-Umfragen einbeziehen und eine saubere, gezielte Fragestellung sicherstellen, um handhabbare Erkenntnisse zu sammeln.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar pesquisas eficazes usando estruturas comprovadas de líderes de produto, incorporando métricas como NPS, CSAT e pesquisas PMF, e garantindo um design de perguntas limpo e direcionado para reunir insights ação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать эффективные опросы, используя проверенные框架 лидеров продукта, включающие метрики, такие как NPS, CSAT и опросы PMF, и гарантируя чистый, целевой дизайн вопросов для сбора действенных инсайтов.","ar":"يتمكن الوكيل من إنشاء استبيانات فعالة باستخدام الإطارات المثبتة من قادة المنتج، ودمج مقاييس مثل NPS و CSAT وتصاميم الاستبيان PMF، وضمان تصميم أسئلة نظيف ومتوجه لجمع رؤى قابلة للتنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing satisfaction surveys with targeted NPS metrics","Creating problem identification surveys with clear CSAT measures","Developing feature prioritization surveys using PMF approaches"],"zh":["使用有针对性的NPS指标设计满意度调查","使用清晰的CSAT衡量标准创建问题识别调查","使用PMF方法开发功能优先级调查"],"ja":["ターゲットに絞ったNPS指標を使用した満足度調査の設計","明確なCSAT尺度を使用した問題識別調査の作成","PMFアプローチを使用した機能優先順位調査の開発"],"ko":["목표 지향적인 NPS 지표를 사용한 만족도 설문조사 설계","명확한 CSAT 측정 기준을 사용한 문제 식별 설문조사 생성","PMF 접근 방식을 사용한 기능 우선순위 설문조사 개발"],"es":["Diseñar encuestas de satisfacción con métricas NPS dirigidas","Crear encuestas de identificación de problemas con medidas CSAT claras","Desarrollar encuestas de priorización de funciones utilizando enfoques PMF"],"fr":["Concevoir des sondages de satisfaction avec des mesures NPS ciblées","Créer des sondages d''identification de problèmes avec des mesures CSAT claires","Développer des sondages de priorisation de fonctionnalités en utilisant des approches PMF"],"de":["Entwerfen von Zufriedenheitsumfragen mit gezielten NPS-Metriken","Erstellen von Problemerkennungsumfragen mit klaren CSAT-Maßen","Entwickeln von Funktionspriorisierungs-Umfragen unter Verwendung von PMF-Ansätzen"],"pt":["Projeto de pesquisas de satisfação com métricas NPS direcionadas","Criação de pesquisas de identificação de problemas com medidas CSAT claras","Desenvolvimento de pesquisas de priorização de recursos usando abordagens PMF"],"ru":["Проектирование опросов удовлетворенности с нацеленными метриками NPS","Создание опросов выявления проблем с четкими мерами CSAT","Разработка опросов приоритизации функций с использованием подходов PMF"],"ar":["تصميم استبيانات رضا العملاء مع مقاييس NPS المستهدفة","إنشاء استبيانات تحديد المشكلات مع مقاييس CSAT واضحة","تطوير استبيانات ترتيب الأولويات للميزات باستخدام مناهج PMF"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of user goals and objectives","Limited to survey design and does not include survey deployment or analysis capabilities"],"zh":["需要了解用户目标和目标","仅限调查设计，不包括调查部署或分析功能"],"ja":["ユーザーゴールとオブジェクトの理解が必要","調査設計のみに限定され、調査の展開または分析機能は含まれていない"],"ko":["사용자 목표와 목적을 이해해야 함","설문조사 설계만 포함하며, 설문조사 배포 또는 분석 기능은 포함되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los objetivos y metas del usuario","Limitado al diseño de encuestas y no incluye capacidades de implementación o análisis de encuestas"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des objectifs et des buts de l''utilisateur","Limité à la conception de sondages et ne comprend pas les capacités de déploiement ou d''analyse de sondages"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis der Benutzerziele und -objektive","Begrenzt auf Umfrage-Design und umfasst keine Umfrage-Einrichtungs- oder Analysefunktionen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos objetivos e metas do usuário","Limitado ao design de pesquisas e não inclui capacidades de implantação ou análise de pesquisas"],"ru":["Требует понимания целей и задач пользователя","Ограничен дизайном опросов и не включает возможности развертывания или анализа опросов"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم الأهداف والمهام للمستخدم","محدود بتصميم الاستبيانات ولا يتضمن إمكانيات نشر أو تحليل الاستبيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
