 Plattformen zu extrahieren.","pt":"Realize pesquisa de mercado com Apify Actors, extrair dados de múltiplas plataformas de forma eficiente","ru":"Проводите маркетинговые исследования с помощью Apify Actors, извлекая данные из нескольких платформ","ar":"اجري بحث سوقي مع ممثلي Apify، واستخرج البيانات من منصات متعددة بسهولة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Apify Actors","API","Node.js 20.6+","mcpc CLI","APIFY_TOKEN","env"],"ja":["Apify Actors","API","Node.js 20.6+","mcpc CLI","APIFY_TOKEN",""],"ko":["Apify Actors","API","Node.js 20.6+","mcpc CLI","APIFY_TOKEN",""],"es":["Extracción de datos de varias plataformas","Utilización de Actores Apify","Compatibilidad con Node.js 20.6+","Soporte para archivos .env","Integración con la herramienta CLI mcpc"],"fr":["Extraction de données de plusieurs plateformes","Utilisation des Acteurs Apify","Compatibilité avec Node.js 20.6+","Prise en charge des fichiers .env","Intégration avec l''outil CLI mcpc"],"de":["Datenextraktion aus mehreren Plattformen","Verwendung von Apify-Aktoren","Kompatibilität mit Node.js 20.6+","Unterstützung für .env-Dateien","Integration mit dem CLI-Tool mcpc"],"pt":["Extração de dados de múltiplas plataformas","Uso de Atores Apify para pesquisa de mercado","Suporte a Node.js 20.6+","Integração com o CLI tool mcpc","Configuração via arquivo .env","Suporte a token de API Apify"],"ru":["Извлечение данных из нескольких платформ","Использование актеров Apify для маркетинговых исследований","Поддержка Node.js 20.6+","Интеграция с инструментом командной строки mcpc","Настройка через файл .env","Поддержка токена API Apify"],"ar":["استخراج البيانات من منصات متعددة","استخدام ممثلي Apify لإجراء بحث سوقي","دعم Node.js 20.6+","التكامل مع أداة سطر الأوامر mcpc","التكوين عبر ملف .env","دعم رمز وصول API Apify"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Apify market research","Apify Actors","API","Node.js","mcpc CLI","APIFY_TOKEN","env","market research"],"ja":["Apify","Apify Actors","API","Node.js","mcpc CLI","APIFY_TOKEN","","market research"],"ko":["Apify ","Apify Actors","API","Node.js","mcpc CLI","APIFY_TOKEN","","market research"],"es":["investigación de mercado","apify","actores apify","extracción de datos","nodejs","desarrollo de software","market research"],"fr":["recherche de marché","apify","acteurs apify","extraction de données","nodejs","développement de logiciels","market research"],"de":["marktforschung","apify","apify-akteure","datenextraktion","nodejs","softwareentwicklung","market research"],"pt":["pesquisa de mercado","Apify Actors","extração de dados","Node.js","mcpc","API Apify","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de mercado","ferramentas de pesquisa"],"ru":["маркетинговые исследования","Apify Actors","извлечение данных","Node.js","mcpc","API Apify","разработка программного обеспечения","рыночные технологии","инструменты исследования"],"ar":["البحث السوقي","ممثلي Apify","استخراج البيانات","Node.js","mcpc","API Apify","تطوير البرمجيات","تقنيات السوق","أدوات البحث"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"apify-market-research","description":"Analyze market conditions, geographic opportunities, pricing, consumer behavior, and product validation across Google Maps, Facebook, Instagram, Booking.com, and TripAdvisor.","bodyPreview":"# Market Research\n\nConduct market research using Apify Actors to extract data from multiple platforms.\n\n## Prerequisites\n(No need to check it upfront)\n\n- `.env` file with `APIFY_TOKEN`\n- Node.js 20.6+ (for native `--env-file` support)\n- `mcpc` CLI tool: `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Identify market research type (select Actor)\n- [ ] Step 2: Fetch Actor schema via mcpc\n- [ ] Step 3: Ask user preferences (format","body":"# Market Research\n\nConduct market research using Apify Actors to extract data from multiple platforms.\n\n## Prerequisites\n(No need to check it upfront)\n\n- `.env` file with `APIFY_TOKEN`\n- Node.js 20.6+ (for native `--env-file` support)\n- `mcpc` CLI tool: `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Identify market research type (select Actor)\n- [ ] Step 2: Fetch Actor schema via mcpc\n- [ ] Step 3: Ask user preferences (format, filename)\n- [ ] Step 4: Run the analysis script\n- [ ] Step 5: Summarize findings\n```\n\n### Step 1: Identify Market Research Type\n\nSelect the appropriate Actor based on research needs:\n\n| User Need | Actor ID | Best For |\n|-----------|----------|----------|\n| Market density | `compass/crawler-google-places` | Location analysis |\n| Geospatial analysis | `compass/google-maps-extractor` | Business mapping |\n| Regional interest | `apify/google-trends-scraper` | Trend data |\n| Pricing and demand | `apify/facebook-marketplace-scraper` | Market pricing |\n| Event market | `apify/facebook-events-scraper` | Event analysis |\n| Consumer needs | `apify/facebook-groups-scraper` | Group research |\n| Market landscape | `apify/facebook-pages-scraper` | Business pages |\n| Business density | `apify/facebook-page-contact-information` | Contact data |\n| Cultural insights | `apify/facebook-photos-scraper` | Visual research |\n| Niche targeting | `apify/instagram-hashtag-scraper` | Hashtag research |\n| Hashtag stats | `apify/instagram-hashtag-stats` | Market sizing |\n| Market activity | `apify/instagram-reel-scraper` | Activity analysis |\n| Market intelligence | `apify/instagram-scraper` | Full data |\n| Product launch research | `apify/instagram-api-scraper` | API access |\n| Hospitality market | `voyager/booking-scraper` | Hotel data |\n| Tourism insights | `maxcopell/tripadvisor-reviews` | Review analysis |\n\n### Step 2: Fetch Actor Schema\n\nFetch the Actor''s input schema and details dynamically using mcpc:\n\n```bash\nexport $(grep APIFY_TOKEN .env | xargs) && mcpc --json mcp.apify.com --header \"Authorization: Bearer $APIFY_TOKEN\" tools-call fetch-actor-details actor:=\"ACTOR_ID\" | jq -r \".content\"\n```\n\nReplace `ACTOR_ID` with the selected Actor (e.g., `compass/crawler-google-places`).\n\nThis returns:\n- Actor description and README\n- Required and optional input parameters\n- Output fields (if available)\n\n### Step 3: Ask User Preferences\n\nBefore running, ask:\n1. **Output format**:\n   - **Quick answer** - Display top few results in chat (no file saved)\n   - **CSV** - Full export with all fields\n   - **JSON** - Full export in JSON format\n2. **Number of results**: Based on character of use case\n\n### Step 4: Run the Script\n\n**Quick answer (display in chat, no file):**\n```bash\nnode --env-file=.env ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/reference/scripts/run_actor.js \\\n  --actor \"ACTOR_ID\" \\\n  --input ''JSON_INPUT''\n```\n\n**CSV:**\n```bash\nnode --env-file=.env ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/reference/scripts/run_actor.js \\\n  --actor \"ACTOR_ID\" \\\n  --input ''JSON_INPUT'' \\\n  --output YYYY-MM-DD_OUTPUT_FILE.csv \\\n  --format csv\n```\n\n**JSON:**\n```bash\nnode --env-file=.env ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/reference/scripts/run_actor.js \\\n  --actor \"ACTOR_ID\" \\\n  --input ''JSON_INPUT'' \\\n  --output YYYY-MM-DD_OUTPUT_FILE.json \\\n  --format json\n```\n\n### Step 5: Summarize Findings\n\nAfter completion, report:\n- Number of results found\n- File location and name\n- Key market insights\n- Suggested next steps (deeper analysis, validation)\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n`APIFY_TOKEN not found` - Ask user to create `.env` with `APIFY_TOKEN=your_token`\n`mcpc not found` - Ask user to install `npm install -g @apify/mcpc`\n`Actor not found` - Check Actor ID spelling\n`Run FAILED` - Ask user to check Apify console link in error output\n`Timeout` - Reduce input size or increase `--timeout`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:29:53.965Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Extraction Agents needing automated market research capabilities using Apify Actors","zh":"非常适合需要使用Apify Actors进行自动化市场研究的数据提取代理","ja":"Apify Actorsを使用した自動化市場調査機能を必要とするデータ抽出エージェントに最適","ko":"Apify Actors를 사용하여 자동화된 시장 연구 기능을 필요한 데이터 추출 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Extracción de Datos que necesitan capacidades de investigación de mercado automatizada utilizando Actores de Apify","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Extraction de Données nécessitant des capacités de recherche de marché automatisées utilisant les Acteurs Apify","de":"Perfekt für Data-Extraktions-Agents, die automatisierte Marktforschungsfähigkeiten mit Apify-Aktoren benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Extração de Dados que precisam de capacidades de pesquisa de mercado automatizadas usando Atores Apify","ru":"Идеально для агентов по извлечению данных, которым необходимы автоматические возможности маркетинговых исследований с помощью актеров Apify","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء استخراج البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات البحث السوقية الآلية باستخدام ممثلي Apify"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct market research by extracting data from multiple platforms using Apify Actors, leveraging the `mcpc` CLI tool and Node.js 20.6+ for native `--env-file` support, and interacting with APIs via `.env` files containing `APIFY_TOKEN`","zh":"赋予代理商通过Apify Actors从多个平台提取数据的能力，利用`mcpc` CLI工具和Node.js 20.6+的本地`--env-file`支持，并通过包含`APIFY_TOKEN`的`.env`文件与API交互","ja":"エージェントがApify Actorsを使用して複数のプラットフォームからデータを抽出する機能を提供し、`mcpc` CLIツールとNode.js 20.6+のネイティブ`--env-file`サポートを利用し、`APIFY_TOKEN`を含む`.env`ファイルを介してAPIと対話する","ko":"에이전트가 Apify Actors를 사용하여 여러 플랫폼에서 데이터를 추출하는 기능을 제공하고, `mcpc` CLI 툴과 Node.js 20.6+의 네이티브 `--env-file` 지원을 활용하며, `APIFY_TOKEN`을 포함하는 `.env` 파일을 통해 API와 상호 작용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar investigaciones de mercado extrayendo datos de múltiples plataformas utilizando Actores de Apify, aprovechando la herramienta de línea de comandos `mcpc` y Node.js 20.6+ para soporte nativo de `--env-file`, e interactuando con API a través de archivos `.env` que contienen `APIFY_TOKEN`","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des recherches de marché en extrayant des données de plusieurs plateformes à l''aide d''Acteurs Apify, en exploitant l''outil de ligne de commande `mcpc` et Node.js 20.6+ pour un support natif de `--env-file`, et en interagissant avec des API via des fichiers `.env` contenant `APIFY_TOKEN`","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Marktforschung durchzuführen, indem Daten aus mehreren Plattformen mithilfe von Apify-Aktoren extrahiert werden, die `mcpc`-CLI-Tool und Node.js 20.6+ für native `--env-file`-Unterstützung nutzen und mit APIs über `.env`-Dateien interagieren, die `APIFY_TOKEN` enthalten","pt":"Habilita agentes a realizar pesquisas de mercado extraíndo dados de múltiplas plataformas usando Atores Apify, aproveitando a ferramenta CLI `mcpc` e Node.js 20.6+ para suporte nativo `--env-file`, e interagindo com APIs via arquivos `.env` contendo `APIFY_TOKEN`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить маркетинговые исследования, извлекая данные из нескольких платформ с помощью актеров Apify, используя инструмент CLI `mcpc` и Node.js 20.6+ для родной поддержки `--env-file`, и взаимодействуя с API через файлы `.env`, содержащие `APIFY_TOKEN`","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إجراء بحوث السوق عن طريق استخراج البيانات من منصات متعددة باستخدام ممثلي Apify، واستخدام أداة CLI `mcpc` و Node.js 20.6+ لدعم مستندات `--env-file` الأصلية، والتفاعل مع واجهات برمجة التطبيقات عبر ملفات `.env` تحتوي على `APIFY_TOKEN`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating data extraction from e-commerce websites","Generating market trends reports using Apify Actors","Fetching Actor schema via `mcpc` for customized market research"],"zh":["自动化从电子商务网站提取数据","使用Apify Actors生成市场趋势报告","通过`mcpc`获取Actor模式以进行自定义市场研究"],"ja":["電子商取引ウェブサイトからのデータ抽出の自動化","Apify Actorsを使用した市場動向レポートの生成","`mcpc`を介してActorスキーマを取得し、カスタマイズされた市場調査を実施"],"ko":["전자상거래 웹사이트에서 데이터 추출을 자동화","Apify Actors를 사용하여 시장 동향 보고서 생성","`mcpc`를 통해 Actor 스키마를 가져와 맞춤형 시장 연구 수행"],"es":["Automatización de la extracción de datos de sitios web de comercio electrónico","Generación de informes de tendencias de mercado utilizando Actores de Apify","Obtención del esquema de Actor a través de `mcpc` para investigación de mercado personalizada"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''extraction de données de sites web de commerce électronique","Génération de rapports de tendances de marché à l''aide d''Acteurs Apify","Récupération du schéma d''Acteur via `mcpc` pour une recherche de marché personnalisée"],"de":["Automatisierung der Datenextraktion von E-Commerce-Websites","Erstellung von Markttrendberichten unter Verwendung von Apify-Aktoren","Abruf des Aktorschemas über `mcpc` für maßgeschneiderte Marktforschung"],"pt":["Automatizar a extração de dados de sites de comércio eletrônico","Gerar relatórios de tendências de mercado usando Atores Apify","Buscar esquema de Ator via `mcpc` para pesquisas de mercado personalizadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать извлечение данных из сайтов электронной коммерции","Генерировать отчеты о рыночных тенденциях с помощью актеров Apify","Получать схему актора через `mcpc` для настраиваемых маркетинговых исследований"],"ar":["تأتمتة استخراج البيانات من مواقع التجارة الإلكترونية","إنتاج تقارير عن اتجاهات السوق باستخدام ممثلي Apify","استرجاع مخطط الممثل عبر `mcpc` لبحوث السوق المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `APIFY_TOKEN` in a `.env` file","Needs Node.js 20.6+ for native `--env-file` support","Dependent on `mcpc` CLI tool installation"],"zh":["需要在`.env`文件中包含`APIFY_TOKEN`","需要Node.js 20.6+的本地`--env-file`支持","依赖于`mcpc` CLI工具的安装"],"ja":["`.env`ファイルに`APIFY_TOKEN`を含める必要がある","Node.js 20.6+のネイティブ`--env-file`サポートが必要","`mcpc` CLIツールのインストールに依存する"],"ko":["`.env` 파일에 `APIFY_TOKEN`을 포함해야 함","Node.js 20.6+의 네이티브 `--env-file` 지원이 필요","`mcpc` CLI 툴의 설치에 의존"],"es":["Requiere `APIFY_TOKEN` en un archivo `.env`","Necesita Node.js 20.6+ para soporte nativo de `--env-file`","Dependiente de la instalación de la herramienta de línea de comandos `mcpc`"],"fr":["Nécessite `APIFY_TOKEN` dans un fichier `.env`","Nécessite Node.js 20.6+ pour un support natif de `--env-file`","Dépend de l''installation de l''outil de ligne de commande `mcpc`"],"de":["Benötigt `APIFY_TOKEN` in einer `.env`-Datei","Benötigt Node.js 20.6+ für native `--env-file`-Unterstützung","Abhängig von der Installation des `mcpc`-CLI-Tools"],"pt":["Requer `APIFY_TOKEN` em um arquivo `.env`","Necessita Node.js 20.6+ para suporte nativo `--env-file`","Dependente da instalação da ferramenta CLI `mcpc`"],"ru":["Требует `APIFY_TOKEN` в файле `.env`","Требует Node.js 20.6+ для родной поддержки `--env-file`","Зависит от установки инструмента CLI `mcpc`"],"ar":["يتطلب `APIFY_TOKEN` في ملف `.env`","يحتاج إلى Node.js 20.6+ لدعم مستندات `--env-file` الأصلية","يعتمد على تثبيت أداة CLI `mcpc`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
