playbook de servicio de transferencia R2 es una guía para desarrolladores que necesitan integrar el servicio en sus proyectos","fr":"Le guide de service de transfert R2 est une référence pour les développeurs qui doivent intégrer le service dans leurs projets","de":"Das R2-Transfer-Service-Playbook ist eine Anleitung für Entwickler, die den Service in ihre Projekte integrieren müssen","pt":"O R2 Transfer Service Playbook é um guia para implementar a entrega de links e URLs de forma segura e eficiente.","ru":"R2 Сервис Передачи Плейбук - это руководство по реализации доставки ссылок и URL-адресов в безопасной и эффективной форме.","ar":"كتاب ألعاب خدمة نقل R2 هو دليل لتنفيذ تسليم الروابط والمواقع بأمان وكفاءة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用范围：services/r2_transfer_service.py、email_processing/orchestrator.py 等","前提条件：ENV 变量、Virtualenv 等","配置要求：R2_BASE_URL、R2_FETCH_TOKEN、ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS 等"],"ja":["使用範囲：services/r2_transfer_service.py、email_processing/orchestrator.py など","前提条件：ENV 変数、Virtualenv など","設定要件：R2_BASE_URL、R2_FETCH_TOKEN、ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS など"],"ko":["사용 범위：services/r2_transfer_service.py, email_processing/orchestrator.py 등","사전 조건：ENV 변수, Virtualenv 등","구성 요구 사항：R2_BASE_URL, R2_FETCH_TOKEN, ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS 등"],"es":["Integración con servicios de correo electrónico","Compatibilidad con Cloudflare Worker","Soporte para múltiples dominios","Requisitos de entorno obligatorios","Virtualenv para scripts y pruebas"],"fr":["Intégration avec les services de courrier électronique","Compatibilité avec Cloudflare Worker","Prise en charge de plusieurs domaines","Exigences d''environnement obligatoires","Virtualenv pour scripts et tests"],"de":["Integration mit E-Mail-Diensten","Kompatibilität mit Cloudflare Worker","Unterstützung für mehrere Domains","Obligatorische Umgebungsanforderungen","Virtualenv für Skripte und Tests"],"pt":["Implementação de entrega de links e URLs seguras","Otimização da entrega de conteúdo","Utilização de tokens de fetch","Integração com Cloudflare Worker","Compatibilidade com vários domínios","Utilização de variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["Реализация доставки ссылок и URL-адресов с безопасностью","Оптимизация доставки контента","Использование токенов fetch","Интеграция с Cloudflare Worker","Совместимость с несколькими доменами","Использование переменных среды"],"ar":["تنفيذ تسليم الروابط والمواقع بأمان","تحسين تسليم المحتوى","استخدام رموز FETCH","التكامل مع Cloudflare Worker","التوافق مع عدة نطاقات","استخدام متغيرات البيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["R2 转移服务","数据传输","ENV 变量","Virtualenv","R2_BASE_URL","R2_FETCH_TOKEN","ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS"],"ja":["R2 転送サービス","データ転送","ENV 変数","Virtualenv","R2_BASE_URL","R2_FETCH_TOKEN","ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS"],"ko":["R2 전송 서비스","데이터 전송","ENV 변수","Virtualenv","R2_BASE_URL","R2_FETCH_TOKEN","ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS"],"es":["servicio de transferencia R2","playbook de servicio de transferencia R2","integración de servicio de transferencia R2","desarrollo de servicio de transferencia R2","seguridad de datos","transferencia de datos","Cloudflare Worker","virtualenv"],"fr":["service de transfert R2","guide de service de transfert R2","intégration de service de transfert R2","développement de service de transfert R2","sécurité des données","transfert de données","Cloudflare Worker","virtualenv"],"de":["R2-Transfer-Service","R2-Transfer-Service-Anleitung","Integration von R2-Transfer-Service","Entwicklung von R2-Transfer-Service","Datensicherheit","Datentransfer","Cloudflare Worker","virtualenv"],"pt":["R2 Transfer Service Playbook","entrega de links","entrega de URLs","segurança","eficiência","Cloudflare Worker","variáveis de ambiente","tokens de fetch"],"ru":["R2 Сервис Передачи Плейбук","доставка ссылок","доставка URL-адресов","безопасность","эффективность","Cloudflare Worker","переменные среды","токены fetch"],"ar":["كتاب ألعاب خدمة نقل R2","تسليم الروابط","تسليم المواقع","الأمان","الكفاءة","Cloudflare Worker","متغيرات البيئة","رموز FETCH"]}},"owner":"ki2pixel","repo":"render_signal_server","repoPath":"ki2pixel/render_signal_server","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"r2-transfer-service-playbook","description":"Manage changes to the R2 transfer pipeline (Python service, Cloudflare Workers, PHP logger) with mandatory validations, allowlists, and regression checks.","bodyPreview":"# R2 Transfer Service Playbook\n\n## Portée\nUtilise ce skill lorsqu''une tâche touche :\n- `services/r2_transfer_service.py`\n- `email_processing/orchestrator.py` (section delivery_links / r2_url)\n- `deployment/cloudflare-worker/*`\n- `deployment/public_html/config_api.php`, `deployment/public_html/test-direct.php`, pages de test R2\n\n## Pré-requis\n- ENV obligatoires : `R2_BASE_URL`, `R2_FETCH_TOKEN`, `ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS`.\n- Virtualenv `/mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server` pour les scripts/tests.","body":"# R2 Transfer Service Playbook\n\n## Portée\nUtilise ce skill lorsqu''une tâche touche :\n- `services/r2_transfer_service.py`\n- `email_processing/orchestrator.py` (section delivery_links / r2_url)\n- `deployment/cloudflare-worker/*`\n- `deployment/public_html/config_api.php`, `deployment/public_html/test-direct.php`, pages de test R2\n\n## Pré-requis\n- ENV obligatoires : `R2_BASE_URL`, `R2_FETCH_TOKEN`, `ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS`.\n- Virtualenv `/mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server` pour les scripts/tests.\n- Accès au déploiement Cloudflare Workers (wrangler).\n\n## Workflow\n1. **Analyse des dépendances**\n   - Confirmer la présence des ENV ci-dessus.\n   - Vérifier les allowlists (Dropbox/FromSmash/SwissTransfer) avant toute nouvelle source.\n2. **Mises à jour Python**\n   - Toujours valider les domaines via `is_allowed_domain`.\n   - Injecter le header `X-R2-FETCH-TOKEN` pour chaque requête Worker.\n   - Conserver les logs sans PII et retour fallback `raw_url` en cas d''échec.\n3. **Workers Cloudflare**\n   - Garder le mode fetch avec timeout 120s pour Dropbox `/scl/fo/`.\n   - Mettre à jour `httpMetadata.contentDisposition` pour préserver le nom de fichier.\n   - Exécuter `wrangler deploy --dry-run` (documenter la sortie).\n4. **PHP Logger / Diagnostics**\n   - Assurer que `config_api.php` continue d''écrire les paires `source_url`/`r2_url`.\n   - Tester `deployment/public_html/test-direct.php` pour valider le flux complet.\n5. **Tests & validation**\n   - Lancer le helper `./.windsurf/skills/r2-transfer-service-playbook/test_r2_worker.sh`.\n   - Compléter si besoin avec des tests ciblés sur les nouvelles sources.\n6. **Documentation & Memory Bank**\n   - Mettre à jour `docs/processing/file-offload.md` ou section dédiée R2.\n   - Ajouter une entrée dans la Memory Bank si de nouvelles sources sont supportées.\n\n## Ressources\n- `test_r2_worker.sh` : active le venv, exécute les tests R2 et vérifie la page de test PHP.\n\n## Conseils\n- En cas de nouvelle plateforme de fichiers, créer un helper dédié (normalisation URL, validation).\n- Limiter les retries côté Worker, gérer les erreurs HTTP explicitement.\n- Garder les scripts de cleanup alignés (expiration 24h par défaut).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:29:51.428Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloudflare Worker Agents needing R2 transfer service integration and advanced URL delivery link management.","zh":"非常适合需要R2传输服务集成和高级URL交付链接管理的Cloudflare Worker代理。","ja":"R2転送サービス統合と高度なURL配信リンク管理が必要なCloudflare Workerエージェントに最適です。","ko":"R2 전송 서비스 통합 및 고급 URL 전달 링크 관리가 필요한 Cloudflare Worker 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Cloudflare Worker que necesitan integración del servicio de transferencia R2 y gestión avanzada de enlaces de entrega de URL.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloudflare Worker ayant besoin d''une intégration du service de transfert R2 et d''une gestion avancée des liens de livraison d''URL.","de":"Perfekt für Cloudflare-Worker-Agents, die eine R2-Transferservice-Integration und eine erweiterte URL-Lieferlink-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Trabalhador da Cloudflare que necessitam de integração do serviço de transferência R2 e gerenciamento avançado de links de entrega de URL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Cloudflare Worker, которым необходима интеграция с сервисом передачи R2 и продвинутым управлением ссылками доставки URL.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Cloudflare Worker الذي يحتاج إلى دمج خدمة نقل R2 وإدارة ربط URL متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly interact with R2 services using Python scripts, leveraging ENV variables like R2_BASE_URL and R2_FETCH_TOKEN, and utilizing virtual environments for efficient testing and deployment on Cloudflare Workers.","zh":"赋予代理使用Python脚本无缝地与R2服务交互，利用ENV变量如R2_BASE_URL和R2_FETCH_TOKEN，并利用虚拟环境进行高效的测试和在Cloudflare Workers上的部署。","ja":"Pythonスクリプトを使用して、R2サービスと無縫にやり取りできるエージェントを有効にし、ENV変数のR2_BASE_URLとR2_FETCH_TOKENを活用し、仮想環境を使用してCloudflare Workersへのテストとデプロイを効率化します。","ko":"Python 스크립트를 사용하여 R2 서비스와 무결점으로 상호 작용할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고, ENV 변수인 R2_BASE_URL 및 R2_FETCH_TOKEN을 활용하며, 가상 환경을 사용하여 Cloudflare Workers에 대한 테스트 및 배포를 효율적으로 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar de forma transparente con los servicios R2 mediante scripts de Python, aprovechando variables de entorno como R2_BASE_URL y R2_FETCH_TOKEN, y utilizando entornos virtuales para pruebas y despliegue eficientes en Cloudflare Workers.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir de manière transparente avec les services R2 à l''aide de scripts Python, en exploitant des variables d''environnement comme R2_BASE_URL et R2_FETCH_TOKEN, et en utilisant des environnements virtuels pour des tests et des déploiements efficaces sur Cloudflare Workers.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, nahtlos mit R2-Diensten über Python-Skripte zu interagieren, indem Umgebungsvariablen wie R2_BASE_URL und R2_FETCH_TOKEN genutzt und virtuelle Umgebungen für effizientes Testen und Bereitstellen auf Cloudflare Workers verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir sem problemas com os serviços R2 usando scripts Python, aproveitando variáveis de ambiente como R2_BASE_URL e R2_FETCH_TOKEN, e utilizando ambientes virtuais para testes e implantação eficientes nos Trabalhadores da Cloudflare.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность бесшовного взаимодействия с сервисами R2 с помощью скриптов Python, используя переменные среды seperti R2_BASE_URL и R2_FETCH_TOKEN, и использует виртуальные среды для эффективного тестирования и развертывания на Cloudflare Workers.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التفاعل بسلاسة مع خدمات R2 باستخدام سكريبتات Python، واستخدام متغيرات البيئة مثل R2_BASE_URL و R2_FETCH_TOKEN، واستخدام بيئات افتراضية لفحص وكشف فعال على عمال Cloudflare."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating R2 transfer service tasks using services/r2_transfer_service.py","Generating and validating delivery links with email_processing/orchestrator.py","Deploying and testing R2 configurations on Cloudflare Workers and public_html environments"],"zh":["使用services/r2_transfer_service.py自动化R2传输服务任务","使用email_processing/orchestrator.py生成和验证交付链接","在Cloudflare Workers和public_html环境中部署和测试R2配置"],"ja":["services/r2_transfer_service.pyを使用してR2転送サービスを自動化する","email_processing/orchestrator.pyを使用して配信リンクを生成して検証する","Cloudflare Workersとpublic_html環境でR2構成をデプロイしてテストする"],"ko":["services/r2_transfer_service.py를 사용하여 R2 전송 서비스 작업을 자동화합니다.","email_processing/orchestrator.py를 사용하여 전달 링크를 생성하고 검증합니다.","Cloudflare Workers 및 public_html 환경에서 R2 구성을 배포하고 테스트합니다."],"es":["Automatizar tareas del servicio de transferencia R2 mediante services/r2_transfer_service.py","Generar y validar enlaces de entrega con email_processing/orchestrator.py","Implementar y probar configuraciones R2 en entornos Cloudflare Workers y public_html"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches de service de transfert R2 à l''aide de services/r2_transfer_service.py","Générer et valider les liens de livraison avec email_processing/orchestrator.py","Déployer et tester les configurations R2 sur les environnements Cloudflare Workers et public_html"],"de":["Automatisieren von R2-Transferservice-Aufgaben mit services/r2_transfer_service.py","Erzeugen und Validieren von Lieferlinks mit email_processing/orchestrator.py","Bereitstellen und Testen von R2-Konfigurationen in Cloudflare-Worker- und public_html-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de serviço de transferência R2 usando services/r2_transfer_service.py","Gerar e validar links de entrega com email_processing/orchestrator.py","Implantar e testar configurações R2 em ambientes Cloudflare Workers e public_html"],"ru":["Автоматизировать задачи сервиса передачи R2 с помощью services/r2_transfer_service.py","Генерировать и проверять ссылки доставки с помощью email_processing/orchestrator.py","Развертывать и тестировать конфигурации R2 в средах Cloudflare Workers и public_html"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في مهام خدمة نقل R2 باستخدام services/r2_transfer_service.py","تحديث وتصديق روابط التوصيل مع email_processing/orchestrator.py","نشر وتجربة تكوينات R2 في بيئات Cloudflare Workers و public_html"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires R2_BASE_URL, R2_FETCH_TOKEN, and ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS ENV variables","Specific virtual environment /mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server needed for scripts and tests"],"zh":["需要R2_BASE_URL、R2_FETCH_TOKEN和ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS ENV变量","需要特定的虚拟环境/mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server用于脚本和测试"],"ja":["R2_BASE_URL、R2_FETCH_TOKEN、ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS ENV変数が必要","特定の仮想環境/mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_serverがスクリプトとテストに必要"],"ko":["R2_BASE_URL, R2_FETCH_TOKEN 및 ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS ENV 변수가 필요합니다.","특정 가상 환경 /mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server가 스크립트 및 테스트에 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere variables de entorno R2_BASE_URL, R2_FETCH_TOKEN y ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS","Entorno virtual específico /mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server necesario para scripts y pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite des variables d''environnement R2_BASE_URL, R2_FETCH_TOKEN et ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS","Environnement virtuel spécifique /mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server nécessaire pour les scripts et les tests"],"de":["Benötigt Umgebungsvariablen R2_BASE_URL, R2_FETCH_TOKEN und ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS","Spezifisches virtuelles Umfeld /mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server erforderlich für Skripte und Tests"],"pt":["Exige variáveis de ambiente R2_BASE_URL, R2_FETCH_TOKEN e ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS","Ambiente virtual específico /mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server necessário para scripts e testes"],"ru":["Требует переменных среды R2_BASE_URL, R2_FETCH_TOKEN и ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS","Требуется конкретная виртуальная среда /mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server для скриптов и тестов"],"ar":["يتطلب متغيرات بيئة R2_BASE_URL و R2_FETCH_TOKEN و ALLOWED_R2_DOMAINS","بيئة افتراضية محددة /mnt/venv_ext4/venv_render_signal_server مطلوبة للسكريبتات والاختبارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/pr-review', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'pr-review', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z', '2026-02-18T12:29:59.666Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/pr-review","name":"pr-review","description":{"zh":"PR Review是一种合成永续期货协议，支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数，通过自定义oracle、虚拟AMM和TWAP平滑的价格机制","ja":"PR Reviewは、RWAアセット、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポートする合成永続期限取引プロトコルであり、カスタムオラクル、仮想AMM、TWAPスムージングの価格メカニズムを使用","ko":"PR Review는 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원하는 합성 영속적 선물 프로토콜로서, 사용자 정의 오라클, 가상 AMM 및 TWAP 스무딩의 가격 메커니즘을 사용합니다","es":"El protocolo de futuros sintéticos permite a los traders abrir posiciones apalancadas con garantía en estables coins. La revisión de PR prioriza la seguridad y la corrección.","fr":"Le protocole de futurs synthétiques permet aux traders d''ouvrir des positions à effet de levier garanties par des stable coins. La révision PR donne la priorité à la sécurité et à la correction.","de":"Das synthetische Futures-Protokoll ermöglicht es Tradern, mit Garantie in Stable Coins gehebelte Positionen zu eröffnen. Die PR-Überprüfung priorisiert Sicherheit und Korrektheit.","pt":"O protocolo de futuros perpétuos sintéticos é uma plataforma de negociação que suporta ativos de RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices. A revisão de PR é um workflow que prioriza segurança, correção, arquitetura e desempenho","ru":"Синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов - это торговая платформа, поддерживающая активы RWA, криптовалюты, акции и индексы. Обзор ПР - это рабочий процесс, который отдает приоритет безопасности, правильности, архитектуре и производительности","ar":"بروتوكول مستقبلات المشتقات الاصطناعية الدائمة هو منصة تداول تدعم أصول RWA و العملات المشفرة و الأسهم و المؤشرات. مراجعة.PR هي عملية عمل تركز على الأمان و الدقة و الهيكلة و الأداء","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码审查工作流 - PR Review","ja":"コードレビューのワークフロー - PR Review","ko":"코드 리뷰 워크플로우 - PR Review","es":"Revisión de PR: seguridad y protocolo de futuros sintéticos","fr":"Révision PR : sécurité et protocole de futurs synthétiques","de":"PR-Überprüfung: Sicherheit und synthetisches Futures-Prot...","pt":"Revisão de PR: Protocolo de Futuros Perpétuos Sintéticos","ru":"ПР-ревью: Синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов","ar":"مراجعة.PR: بروتوكول مستقبلات المشتقات الاصطناعية الدائمة","en":"pr-review"},"description":{"zh":"PR Review是一种合成永续期货协议，支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数，通过自定义oracle、虚拟AMM和TWAP平滑的价格机制","ja":"PR Reviewは、RWAアセット、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポートする合成永続期限取引プロトコルであり、カスタムオラクル、仮想AMM、TWAPスムージングの価格メカニズムを使用","ko":"PR Review는 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원하는 합성 영속적 선물 프로토콜로서, 사용자 정의 오라클, 가상 AMM 및 TWAP 스무딩의 가격 메커니즘을 사용합니다","es":"El protocolo de futuros sintéticos permite a los traders abrir posiciones apalancadas con garantía en estables coins. La revisión de PR prioriza la seguridad...","fr":"Le protocole de futurs synthétiques permet aux traders d''ouvrir des positions à effet de levier garanties par des stable coins. La révision PR donne la prior...","de":"Das synthetische Futures-Protokoll ermöglicht es Tradern, mit Garantie in Stable Coins gehebelte Positionen zu eröffnen. Die PR-Überprüfung priorisiert Siche...","pt":"O protocolo de futuros perpétuos sintéticos é uma plataforma de negociação que suporta ativos de RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices. A revisão de PR é um wor...","ru":"Синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов - это торговая платформа, поддерживающая активы RWA, криптовалюты, акции и индексы. Обзор ПР - это рабочий процесс, к...","ar":"بروتوكول مستقبلات المشتقات الاصطناعية الدائمة هو منصة تداول تدعم أصول RWA و العملات المشفرة و الأسهم و المؤشرات. مراجعة.PR هي عملية عمل تركز على الأمان و الد...","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["合成永续期货协议","支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数","自定义oracle","虚拟AMM","TWAP平滑"],"ja":["合成永続期限取引プロトコル","RWAアセット、暗号資産、株式、指数のサポート","カスタムオラクル","仮想AMM","TWAPスムージング"],"ko":["합성 영속적 선물 프로토콜","RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수 지원","사용자 정의 오라클","가상 AMM","TWAP 스무딩"],"es":["Protocolo de futuros sintéticos","Posiciones apalancadas con garantía en estables coins","Revisión de PR con prioridad a la seguridad","Diseño de arquitectura escalable","Pricing combinado con oracle personalizado y Virtual AMM"],"fr":["Protocole de futurs synthétiques","Positions à effet de levier garanties par des stable coins","Révision PR avec priorité à la sécurité","Conception d''architecture évolutiva","Pricing combiné avec oracle personnalisé et Virtual AMM"],"de":["Synthetisches Futures-Protokoll","Gehebelte Positionen mit Garantie in Stable Coins","PR-Überprüfung mit Priorität auf Sicherheit","Skalierbare Architektur","Pricing-Kombination mit benutzerdefiniertem Oracle und Virtual AMM"],"pt":["Suporte a ativos de RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices","Revisão de PR com foco em segurança, correção, arquitetura e desempenho","Utilização de uma oracle personalizada, Virtual AMM e suavização TWAP","Posições longas e curtas com alavancagem de até 1000x","Caixa de liquidez centralizada como contraparte para todas as negociações"],"ru":["Поддержка активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов","Обзор ПР с уделением внимания безопасности, правильности, архитектуре и производительности","Использование индивидуальной оракул, Virtual AMM и сглаживания TWAP","Длинные и короткие позиции с левериджем до 1000x","Центральная ликвидационная коробка в качестве контрагента для всех торгов"],"ar":["دعم أصول RWA و العملات المشفرة و الأسهم و المؤشرات","مراجعة.PR مع التركيز على الأمان و الدقة و الهيكلة و الأداء","استخدام أوراكل مخصصة و Virtual AMM و تحسين TWAP","مراكز طويلة و قصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000x","صندوق سيولة مركزي كطرف مخالف لجميع المعاملات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","PR Review","合成永续期货","RWA资产","加密货币","股票","指数","自定义oracle","虚拟AMM","TWAP平滑"],"ja":["コードレビュー","PR Review","合成永続期限取引","RWAアセット","暗号資産","株式","指数","カスタムオラクル","仮想AMM","TWAPスムージング"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","PR Review","합성 영속적 선물","RWA 자산","암호화폐","주식","지수","사용자 정의 오라클","가상 AMM","TWAP 스무딩"],"es":["revisión de PR","protocolo de futuros sintéticos","seguridad en el código","posiciones apalancadas","estables coins","oracle personalizado","Virtual AMM"],"fr":["révision PR","protocole de futurs synthétiques","sécurité du code","positions à effet de levier","stable coins","oracle personnalisé","Virtual AMM"],"de":["PR-Überprüfung","synthetisches Futures-Protokoll","Sicherheit im Code","gehebelte Positionen","Stable Coins","benutzerdefiniertes Oracle","Virtual AMM"],"pt":["revisão de PR","protocolo de futuros perpétuos sintéticos","negociação de criptomoedas","negociação de ações","negociação de índices","segurança de código","desempenho de código"],"ru":["обзор ПР","синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов","торговля криптовалютами","торговля акциями","торговля индексами","безопасность кода","производительность кода"],"ar":["مراجعة.PR","بروتوكول مستقبلات المشتقات الاصطناعية الدائمة","تداول العملات المشفرة","تداول الأسهم","تداول المؤشرات","أمان الشفرة","أداء الشفرة"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-review","description":"Security-first PR review checklist. Use when reviewing diffs/PRs, especially changes involving auth, networking, sensitive data, or dependency/lockfile updates. Focus on secret/PII leakage risk, supply-chain risk (npm + node_modules inspection), cross-platform architecture (extension/mobile/desktop/web), and React performance (hooks + re-render hotspots). Avoid UI style nitpicks. PR Review.","bodyPreview":"# Secure PR Review\n\nFollow this workflow when reviewing code changes. Prioritize **security > correctness > architecture > performance**.\n\n## Review scope (base branch)\n- Review scope: treat the main branch as the base. Always review the PR as the diff between the current branch (HEAD) and main (i.e., changes introduced by this branch vs main).\n- Use PR semantics when generating the diff: `git fetch origin && git diff origin/main...HEAD` (triple-dot) to review only the changes introduced on this","body":"# Secure PR Review\n\nFollow this workflow when reviewing code changes. Prioritize **security > correctness > architecture > performance**.\n\n## Review scope (base branch)\n- Review scope: treat the main branch as the base. Always review the PR as the diff between the current branch (HEAD) and main (i.e., changes introduced by this branch vs main).\n- Use PR semantics when generating the diff: `git fetch origin && git diff origin/main...HEAD` (triple-dot) to review only the changes introduced on this branch relative to main.\n\n## 0) Scope the change & File Structure Analysis\n\n- Identify what changed (files, modules, entrypoints, routes/screens).\n- Identify risk areas: auth flows, signing/keys, networking, analytics, storage, dependency updates.\n\n### 0.1 File Change Inventory (REQUIRED)\n\nGenerate a structured overview of ALL changed files using this format:\n\n```markdown\n## PR File Structure Analysis\n\n### Changed Files Summary\n| File | Change Type | Category | Risk Level | Description |\n|------|-------------|----------|------------|-------------|\n| `path/to/file.ts` | Added/Modified/Deleted | UI/Logic/API/Config/Test | Low/Medium/High | Brief description |\n\n### Files by Category\n\n#### 🔐 Security-Critical Files\n- Files touching auth, crypto, keys, secrets\n\n#### 🌐 API/Network Files\n- Files with network requests, API calls\n\n#### 🧩 Business Logic Files\n- Core logic, state management, services\n\n#### 🎨 UI Component Files\n- React components, styles, layouts\n\n#### ⚙️ Configuration Files\n- package.json, configs, manifests\n\n#### 🧪 Test Files\n- Unit tests, integration tests\n\n#### 📦 Dependency Changes\n- package.json, lockfile changes\n```\n\n### 0.2 Per-File Analysis (REQUIRED)\nFor EACH changed file, provide:\n\n```markdown\n### `path/to/file.ts`\n**Change Type**: Added | Modified | Deleted\n**Lines Changed**: +XX / -YY\n**Category**: UI | Logic | API | Config | Test\n**Risk Level**: Low | Medium | High | Critical\n\n**What This File Does**:\n- Primary responsibility of this file\n\n**Changes Made**:\n1. Specific change 1\n2. Specific change 2\n3. ...\n\n**Dependencies**:\n- Imports from: [list key imports]\n- Exported to: [list files that import this]\n\n**Security Considerations**:\n- Any security-relevant aspects\n\n**Cross-Platform Impact**:\n- [ ] Extension\n- [ ] Mobile (iOS/Android)\n- [ ] Desktop\n- [ ] Web\n```\n\n## 1) Secrets / PII / privacy (MUST)\n- Do not allow logs/telemetry/error reports to include: mnemonics/seed phrases, private keys, signing payloads, API keys, tokens, cookies, session IDs, addresses tied to identity, or any PII.\n- Inspect all “exfil paths”: `console.*`, logging utilities, analytics SDKs, error reporting, network requests, and persistence:\n  - Web: localStorage / IndexedDB\n  - RN: AsyncStorage / secure storage\n  - Desktop: filesystem / keychain / sqlite\n- If any potential leak exists, explicitly document:\n  - **source** (what sensitive data),\n  - **sink** (where it goes),\n  - **trigger** (when it happens),\n  - **impact** (who/what is exposed),\n  - **fix** (concrete remediation).\n\n## 2) AuthN / AuthZ (MUST)\n- Verify authentication middleware/guards wrap every protected route and cannot be bypassed.\n- Verify authorization checks (roles/permissions) are correct and consistent.\n- Verify server/client trust boundaries: never trust client input for authorization decisions.\n\n## 3) Dependency & supply-chain security (HIGHEST PRIORITY)\nIf `package.json` / lockfiles changed, you MUST do all of the following:\n\n### 3.1 Enumerate changes\n- List every added/updated/removed dependency with **name + from→to version** and the reason (if stated in PR).\n\n### 3.2 Quick ecosystem risk check (before approve)\n- For each changed package:\n  - check for recent maintainer/ownership changes, suspicious release cadence, known advisories/CVEs, typosquatting risk.\n  - if your environment supports it, run commands like: `npm view <pkg> time maintainers repository dist.tarball`.\n\n### 3.3 Source inspection (node_modules) — REQUIRED when risk is non-trivial\n- Inspect the dependency’s `node_modules/<pkg>/package.json` and entrypoints (`main` / `module` / `exports`).\n- Grep for high-risk behavior (examples; expand as needed):\n  - outbound/network: `fetch(`, `axios`, `XMLHttpRequest`, `http`, `https`, `ws`, `request`, `net`, `dns`\n  - dynamic execution: `eval`, `new Function`, dynamic `require`, remote script loading\n  - install hooks: `postinstall`, `preinstall`, `install`, binary downloads\n  - privilege access: filesystem, clipboard, keychain/keystore, environment variables\n- Treat as **HIGH RISK** and block approval unless justified + isolated:\n  - any telemetry / remote config fetch / unexpected outbound requests\n  - any dynamic execution or install-time script behavior\n  - any access to sensitive storage or wallet-related data\n\n### 3.4 React Native native-layer inspection (REQUIRED for RN libraries)\n- For React Native dependencies (or any package with native bindings: `.podspec`, `ios/`, `android/`, `react-native.config.js`, TurboModules/Fabric):\n  - Inspect iOS/Android native sources for security + performance.\n  - Confirm there are **no unexpected outbound requests**, no telemetry/upload without explicit product intent, and no access to wallet secrets/private keys/seed data.\n  - If necessary, drill into third-party native dependencies:\n    - iOS: CocoaPods / `Pods/` sources, vendored frameworks, build scripts\n    - Android: Gradle/Maven artifacts, JNI/native libs, build-time tasks\n  - Treat any hidden network behavior, dynamic loading, install/build scripts, or obfuscated native code as **HIGH RISK** unless explicitly justified and isolated.\n\n## 4) Mandatory callout when node_modules performs outbound requests\nIf `node_modules` code performs **any** outbound network/API request (directly or indirectly), call it out clearly in the review:\n- **exact call site** (file path + function)\n- **destination** (full URL/host)\n- **payload fields** (what data is sent)\n- **headers/auth** (tokens/cookies/identifiers)\n- **trigger conditions** (when/how it runs)\n- **cross-platform impact** (extension/mobile/desktop/web)\n\n## 4.1 Extension manifest permissions changes (HIGHEST PRIORITY)\n- If `manifest.json` (`permissions`, `host_permissions`, `optional_permissions`) changes:\n  - Call it out **prominently** as the top review item.\n  - Enumerate added/removed permissions and explain what new capabilities they enable.\n  - Assess least-privilege: confirm the permission is strictly necessary, scoped to minimal hosts, and does not broaden data access/exfil paths.\n  - Re-check data exposure surfaces introduced by the permission change (network, storage, messaging, content scripts, background/service worker).\n\n## 5) Cross-platform architecture review (extension/mobile/desktop/web)\nReview the implementation as a senior multi-platform architect:\n- Is the approach the simplest correct solution with good maintainability/testability?\n- Identify platform pitfalls:\n  - Extension constraints (MV3/service worker lifetimes, permissions, CSP)\n  - RN constraints (WebView, native modules, backgrounding)\n  - Desktop (Electron security boundaries, IPC, nodeIntegration)\n  - Web (CORS, storage, XSS, bundle size, runtime differences)\n- If not optimal, propose a better alternative with tradeoffs.\n\n## 6) React performance (hooks + re-render hotspots)\nFor new/modified components:\n- Check for unnecessary re-renders from unstable references:\n  - inline objects/functions passed to children\n  - incorrect hook dependency arrays\n  - state placed too high causing wide re-render fanout\n- Validate memoization strategy (`memo`, `useMemo`, `useCallback`) is correct (no stale closures / broken deps).\n- Watch for expensive work in render, list rendering issues, and missing cleanup for subscriptions/listeners.\n- Apply stricter scrutiny to **new parent/child boundaries** and call out any likely re-render hotspots.\n\n## 7) Review output format (keep it actionable)\n- Focus on security/correctness/architecture/performance.\n- Avoid UI style / comment nitpicks unless they cause real bugs, security risk, or measurable perf regression.\n- Provide findings as:\n  - **Blockers** (must fix)\n  - **High risk** (strongly recommended)\n  - **Suggestions** (nice-to-have)\n  - **Questions** (needs clarification)\n\n## Additional resources\n\n- Dependency audit: [reference/dependency-audit.md](reference/dependency-audit.md)\n- React performance: [reference/react-performance.md](reference/react-performance.md)\n- Cross-platform checks: [reference/cross-platform.md](reference/cross-platform.md)\n- File analysis patterns: [reference/file-analysis.md](reference/file-analysis.md)\n\n## 8) Architecture Visualization (REQUIRED)\n\nGenerate ASCII diagrams to illustrate the PR''s architectural impact. ASCII diagrams are terminal-friendly and don''t require external tools.\n\n### 8.1 File Dependency Graph\n\nShow how changed files relate to each other:\n\n```text\n┌─────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐\n│   package.json      │────▶│     yarn.lock       │\n└─────────────────────┘     └─────────────────────┘\n          │\n          ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐\n│   native patch      │────▶│   iOS/Android code  │\n└─────────────────────┘     └─────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 8.2 Data Flow Diagram\n\nFor PRs involving data processing:\n\n```text\nUser Input ──▶ Validation ──▶ Business Logic ──▶ API Call\n                                                    │\n              UI Render ◀── State Update ◀──────────┘\n```\n\n### 8.3 Component Hierarchy\n\nFor UI changes, show component relationships:\n\n```text\nParentComponent\n├── ChildA (props: data, onSubmit)\n│   ├── GrandchildA1\n│   └── GrandchildA2\n└── ChildB (props: config)\n    └── GrandchildB1\n```\n\n### 8.4 State Flow\n\nFor state-related changes:\n\n```text\n[*] ──▶ Idle ──fetchData()──▶ Loading\n                                 │\n         ┌───────────────────────┼───────────────────────┐\n         │                       │                       │\n         ▼                       ▼                       │\n      Success ──reset()──▶    Error ──retry()────────────┘\n         │                       │\n         └───────dismiss()───────┘\n                    │\n                    ▼\n                  Idle\n```\n\n### 8.5 Sequence Diagram\n\nFor async operations:\n\n```text\nUser          Component        Service           API\n  │               │               │               │\n  │──click()─────▶│               │               │\n  │               │──callSvc()───▶│               │\n  │               │               │──POST /api───▶│\n  │               │               │◀──response────│\n  │               │◀──result──────│               │\n  │◀──update UI───│               │               │\n```\n\n### 8.6 Cross-Platform Impact\n\nShow which platforms are affected:\n\n```text\nChanged Code: packages/shared/src/sentry/basicOptions.ts\n\nPlatform Impact:\n┌───────────┬───────────┬───────────┬───────────┐\n│ Extension │  Mobile   │  Desktop  │    Web    │\n├───────────┼───────────┼───────────┼───────────┤\n│     ✓     │     ✓     │     ✓     │     ✓     │\n└───────────┴───────────┴───────────┴───────────┘\n\nRisk Level:  [HIGH]      [HIGH]      [MEDIUM]    [LOW]\n```\n\n### Diagram Guidelines\n\n1. **Always generate at least 2 diagrams** for non-trivial PRs:\n   - File dependency graph (always)\n   - One domain-specific diagram (data flow / component hierarchy / state / sequence)\n\n2. **Use box-drawing characters**:\n   - `┌ ┐ └ ┘ │ ─ ├ ┤ ┬ ┴ ┼` for boxes and tables\n   - `▶ ◀ ▲ ▼` for arrows\n   - `✓ ✗` for status indicators\n\n3. **Highlight risk areas**:\n   - Use `[HIGH]` `[MEDIUM]` `[LOW]` labels\n   - Mark security-critical paths with `🔐` or `⚠️`\n\n4. **Keep diagrams focused**:\n   - Max 10-15 nodes per diagram\n   - Split complex flows into multiple diagrams\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:29:59.666Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring strict security protocols and Git workflow integration.","zh":"适用于需要严格安全协议和Git工作流集成的代码审查代理。","ja":"厳格なセキュリティプロトコルとGitワークフローの統合を必要とするコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"엄격한 보안 프로토콜과 Git 워크플로 통합을 필요로 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren protocolos de seguridad estrictos y integración de flujo de trabajo de Git.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des protocoles de sécurité stricts et une intégration de workflow Git.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agenten, die strenge Sicherheitsprotokolle und Git-Workflow-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de revisão de código que exigem protocolos de segurança rigorosos e integração de fluxo de trabalho do Git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, требующих строгих протоколов безопасности и интеграции с рабочим процессом Git.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يتطلب بروتوكولات أمان صارمة وتكامل تدفق عمل Git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to prioritize security over correctness, architecture, and performance by utilizing Git diff semantics and triple-dot notation for precise code change reviews, ensuring secure PR reviews with protocols like git fetch and git diff.","zh":"通过利用Git diff语义和三点符号来进行精确的代码变更审查，赋予代理以安全为最高优先级，而不是正确性、架构和性能，并确保使用git fetch和git diff等协议进行安全的PR审查。","ja":"Git diffの意味と三点表記を使用して正確なコードの変更点のレビューを行い、セキュリティを正しさ、構造、パフォーマンスよりも優先させ、git fetchやgit diffなどのプロトコルを使用した安全なPRレビューを可能にします。","ko":"Git diff 의미와 세 점 표기법을 사용하여 정확한 코드 변경 리뷰를 수행하고, 보안을 올바름, 구조, 성능보다 우선시하여 git fetch 및 git diff와 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 보안 PR 리뷰를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a priorizar la seguridad sobre la corrección, la arquitectura y el rendimiento mediante la utilización de semántica de diferencia de Git y notación de tres puntos para revisiones de cambios de código precisas, garantizando revisiones de PR seguras con protocolos como git fetch y git diff.","fr":"Permet aux agents de donner la priorité à la sécurité par rapport à la correction, à l''architecture et aux performances en utilisant la sémantique de différence Git et la notation de triple point pour des examens de modification de code précis, garantissant des examens de PR sécurisés avec des protocoles tels que git fetch et git diff.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Sicherheit über Korrektheit, Architektur und Leistung zu priorisieren, indem Git-Diff-Semantik und Dreipunktnotation für präzise Codeänderungsprüfungen verwendet werden, um sichere PR-Überprüfungen mit Protokollen wie git fetch und git diff sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a priorizar a segurança sobre a correção, arquitetura e desempenho, utilizando semântica de diff do Git e notação de três pontos para revisões precisas de alterações de código, garantindo revisões de PR seguras com protocolos como git fetch e git diff.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью уделять приоритетное внимание безопасности над правильностью, архитектурой и производительностью, используя семантику Git diff и нотацию из трех точек для точных обзоров изменений кода, обеспечивая безопасные обзоры PR с протоколами như git fetch и git diff.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء الأولوية للأمان على الصوابية والهيكلة والأداء من خلال استخدام معاني Git diff وتدوين النقاط الثلاث للrevision الدقيق لتغييرات الكود، مما يضمن مراجعات PR آمنة بروتوكولات مثل git fetch و git diff."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing code changes with security as the top priority","Generating diffs between current and main branches for precise reviews","Ensuring correct Git workflow for secure PR reviews"],"zh":["以安全为最高优先级审查代码变更","生成当前分支和主分支之间的差异以进行精确审查","确保正确的Git工作流以进行安全的PR审查"],"ja":["セキュリティを第一にコードの変更点をレビューする","現在のブランチとメインブランチの差異を生成して正確なレビューを行う","セキュリティなPRレビューを行うために正しいGitワークフローを確保する"],"ko":["보안을 최우선으로 코드 변경을 리뷰하는 것","현재 브랜치와 메인 브랜치 사이의 차이를 생성하여 정확한 리뷰를 수행하는 것","보안한 PR 리뷰를 수행하기 위해 올바른 Git 워크플로를 보장하는 것"],"es":["Revisar cambios de código con la seguridad como prioridad principal","Generar diferencias entre las ramas actual y principal para revisiones precisas","Garantizar el flujo de trabajo de Git correcto para revisiones de PR seguras"],"fr":["Réviser les modifications de code avec la sécurité comme priorité principale","Générer des différences entre les branches actuelle et principale pour des examens précis","Assurer le flux de travail Git correct pour des examens de PR sécurisés"],"de":["Überprüfen von Codeänderungen mit Sicherheit als oberste Priorität","Erzeugen von Diffs zwischen aktuellen und Hauptzweigen für präzise Überprüfungen","Sicherstellen des richtigen Git-Workflows für sichere PR-Überprüfungen"],"pt":["Revisar alterações de código com a segurança como prioridade máxima","Gerar diffs entre os ramos atual e principal para revisões precisas","Garantir fluxo de trabalho do Git correto para revisões de PR seguras"],"ru":["Проверка изменений кода с приоритетом безопасности","Генерация diffs между текущей и основной ветками для точных обзоров","Обеспечение правильного рабочего процесса Git для безопасных обзоров PR"],"ar":["مراجعة تغييرات الكود مع الأولوية القصوى للأمان","генерация الفروقات بين الفروع الحالية والرئيسية لمراجعات دقيقة","ضمان سير عمل Git الصحيح لمراجعات PR آمنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Limited to reviewing code changes introduced between the current branch and main branch"],"zh":["需要Git安装和配置","仅限于审查当前分支和主分支之间引入的代码变更"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと設定が必要","現在のブランチとメインブランチの間で導入されたコードの変更点のみをレビューする"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요함","현재 브랜치와 메인 브랜치 사이에서 도입된 코드 변경만을 리뷰하는 것"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Limitado a la revisión de cambios de código introducidos entre la rama actual y la rama principal"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Limité à la révision des modifications de code introduites entre la branche actuelle et la branche principale"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung von Codeänderungen, die zwischen dem aktuellen Zweig und dem Hauptzweig eingeführt wurden"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Git","Limitado à revisão de alterações de código introduzidas entre o ramo atual e o ramo principal"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Git","Ограничен обзором изменений кода, введенных между текущей и основной ветками"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Git","محدود لمراجعة تغييرات الكود التي تم إدخالها بين الفروع الحالية والرئيسية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
