"de":"NFT-Standards: ERC-721 und ERC-1155 für Entwickler","pt":"Padrões NFT: ERC-721 e ERC-1155","ru":"Стандарты NFT: ERC-721 и ERC-1155","ar":"معايير NFT: ERC-721 و ERC-1155","en":"nft-standards"},"description":{"zh":"NFT 标准包括 ERC-721 和 ERC-1155，用于创建和管理非同质化代币","ja":"NFT 標準は、ERC-721 と ERC-1155 で構成され、非同質化トークンの作成と管理に使用されます","ko":"NFT 표준은 ERC-721 및 ERC-1155를 포함하여 비가역 토큰을 생성 및 관리하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Estándares NFT para desarrolladores. Aprende sobre ERC-721, ERC-1155 y metadatos para crear colecciones y marketplaces de NFT","fr":"Normes NFT pour les développeurs. Découvrez ERC-721, ERC-1155 et les métadonnées pour créer des collections et des marketplaces de NFT","de":"NFT-Standards für Entwickler. Erfahren Sie über ERC-721, ERC-1155 und Metadaten, um NFT-Sammlungen und -Marketplaces zu erstellen","pt":"Entenda os padrões NFT ERC-721 e ERC-1155 para criar coleções de NFT, implementar funcionalidades de marketplace e mais","ru":"Поймите стандарты NFT ERC-721 и ERC-1155 для создания коллекций NFT, реализации функций рынка и многое другое","ar":"افهم معايير NFT ERC-721 و ERC-1155 لإنشاء مجموعات NFT وتنفيذ وظائف السوق وأكثر","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["ERC-721 和 ERC-1155 标准","元数据最佳实践","高级 NFT 功能","创建和管理 NFT 集合","实现市场功能"],"ja":["ERC-721 と ERC-1155 標準","メタデータのベストプラクティス","高级 NFT 機能","NFT コレクションの作成と管理","マーケット機能の実装"],"ko":["ERC-721 및 ERC-1155 표준","메타데이터 최적화","고급 NFT 기능","NFT 컬렉션 생성 및 관리","마켓 기능 구현"],"es":["ERC-721","ERC-1155","Metadatos","Creación de colecciones de NFT","Implementación de marketplaces"],"fr":["ERC-721","ERC-1155","Métadonnées","Création de collections de NFT","Mise en œuvre de marketplaces"],"de":["ERC-721","ERC-1155","Metadaten","Erstellung von NFT-Sammlungen","Implementierung von Marketplaces"],"pt":["Criação de coleções de NFT","Implementação de funcionalidades de marketplace","Metadados avançados","Tokens soulbound","Royalties e compartilhamento de receita"],"ru":["Создание коллекций NFT","Реализация функций рынка","Продвинутые метаданные","Токены soulbound","Роялти и разделение дохода"],"ar":["إنشاء مجموعات NFT","تنفيذ وظائف السوق","بيانات وصفية متقدمة","رموز Soulbound","العوائد و 分享 الإيرادات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NFT 标准","ERC-721","ERC-1155","非同质化代币","元数据","NFT 集合","市场功能"],"ja":["NFT 標準","ERC-721","ERC-1155","非同質化トークン","メタデータ","NFT コレクション","マーケット機能"],"ko":["NFT 표준","ERC-721","ERC-1155","비가역 토큰","메타데이터","NFT 컬렉션","마켓 기능"],"es":["estándares NFT","ERC-721","ERC-1155","desarrollo de NFT","marketplace de NFT","metadatos de NFT"],"fr":["normes NFT","ERC-721","ERC-1155","développement de NFT","marketplace de NFT","métadonnées de NFT"],"de":["NFT-Standards","ERC-721","ERC-1155","NFT-Entwicklung","NFT-Marketplace","NFT-Metadaten"],"pt":["NFT","ERC-721","ERC-1155","Desenvolvimento de NFT","Metadados de NFT","Mercado de NFT"],"ru":["NFT","ERC-721","ERC-1155","Разработка NFT","Метаданные NFT","Рынок NFT"],"ar":["NFT","ERC-721","ERC-1155","تطوير NFT","بيانات وصفية NFT","سوق NFT"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nft-standards","description":"Implement NFT standards (ERC-721, ERC-1155) with proper metadata handling, minting strategies, and marketplace integration. Use when creating NFT contracts, building NFT marketplaces, or implementing digital asset systems.","bodyPreview":"# NFT Standards\n\nMaster ERC-721 and ERC-1155 NFT standards, metadata best practices, and advanced NFT features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating NFT collections (art, gaming, collectibles)\n- Implementing marketplace functionality\n- Building on-chain or off-chain metadata\n- Creating soulbound tokens (non-transferable)\n- Implementing royalties and revenue sharing\n- Developing dynamic/evolving NFTs\n\n## ERC-721 (Non-Fungible Token Standard)\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma s","body":"# NFT Standards\n\nMaster ERC-721 and ERC-1155 NFT standards, metadata best practices, and advanced NFT features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating NFT collections (art, gaming, collectibles)\n- Implementing marketplace functionality\n- Building on-chain or off-chain metadata\n- Creating soulbound tokens (non-transferable)\n- Implementing royalties and revenue sharing\n- Developing dynamic/evolving NFTs\n\n## ERC-721 (Non-Fungible Token Standard)\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.0;\n\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/extensions/ERC721URIStorage.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/extensions/ERC721Enumerable.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/access/Ownable.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/Counters.sol\";\n\ncontract MyNFT is ERC721URIStorage, ERC721Enumerable, Ownable {\n    using Counters for Counters.Counter;\n    Counters.Counter private _tokenIds;\n\n    uint256 public constant MAX_SUPPLY = 10000;\n    uint256 public constant MINT_PRICE = 0.08 ether;\n    uint256 public constant MAX_PER_MINT = 20;\n\n    constructor() ERC721(\"MyNFT\", \"MNFT\") {}\n\n    function mint(uint256 quantity) external payable {\n        require(quantity > 0 && quantity <= MAX_PER_MINT, \"Invalid quantity\");\n        require(_tokenIds.current() + quantity <= MAX_SUPPLY, \"Exceeds max supply\");\n        require(msg.value >= MINT_PRICE * quantity, \"Insufficient payment\");\n\n        for (uint256 i = 0; i < quantity; i++) {\n            _tokenIds.increment();\n            uint256 newTokenId = _tokenIds.current();\n            _safeMint(msg.sender, newTokenId);\n            _setTokenURI(newTokenId, generateTokenURI(newTokenId));\n        }\n    }\n\n    function generateTokenURI(uint256 tokenId) internal pure returns (string memory) {\n        // Return IPFS URI or on-chain metadata\n        return string(abi.encodePacked(\"ipfs://QmHash/\", Strings.toString(tokenId), \".json\"));\n    }\n\n    // Required overrides\n    function _beforeTokenTransfer(\n        address from,\n        address to,\n        uint256 tokenId,\n        uint256 batchSize\n    ) internal override(ERC721, ERC721Enumerable) {\n        super._beforeTokenTransfer(from, to, tokenId, batchSize);\n    }\n\n    function _burn(uint256 tokenId) internal override(ERC721, ERC721URIStorage) {\n        super._burn(tokenId);\n    }\n\n    function tokenURI(uint256 tokenId) public view override(ERC721, ERC721URIStorage) returns (string memory) {\n        return super.tokenURI(tokenId);\n    }\n\n    function supportsInterface(bytes4 interfaceId)\n        public\n        view\n        override(ERC721, ERC721Enumerable)\n        returns (bool)\n    {\n        return super.supportsInterface(interfaceId);\n    }\n\n    function withdraw() external onlyOwner {\n        payable(owner()).transfer(address(this).balance);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## ERC-1155 (Multi-Token Standard)\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.0;\n\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC1155/ERC1155.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/access/Ownable.sol\";\n\ncontract GameItems is ERC1155, Ownable {\n    uint256 public constant SWORD = 1;\n    uint256 public constant SHIELD = 2;\n    uint256 public constant POTION = 3;\n\n    mapping(uint256 => uint256) public tokenSupply;\n    mapping(uint256 => uint256) public maxSupply;\n\n    constructor() ERC1155(\"ipfs://QmBaseHash/{id}.json\") {\n        maxSupply[SWORD] = 1000;\n        maxSupply[SHIELD] = 500;\n        maxSupply[POTION] = 10000;\n    }\n\n    function mint(\n        address to,\n        uint256 id,\n        uint256 amount\n    ) external onlyOwner {\n        require(tokenSupply[id] + amount <= maxSupply[id], \"Exceeds max supply\");\n\n        _mint(to, id, amount, \"\");\n        tokenSupply[id] += amount;\n    }\n\n    function mintBatch(\n        address to,\n        uint256[] memory ids,\n        uint256[] memory amounts\n    ) external onlyOwner {\n        for (uint256 i = 0; i < ids.length; i++) {\n            require(tokenSupply[ids[i]] + amounts[i] <= maxSupply[ids[i]], \"Exceeds max supply\");\n            tokenSupply[ids[i]] += amounts[i];\n        }\n\n        _mintBatch(to, ids, amounts, \"\");\n    }\n\n    function burn(\n        address from,\n        uint256 id,\n        uint256 amount\n    ) external {\n        require(from == msg.sender || isApprovedForAll(from, msg.sender), \"Not authorized\");\n        _burn(from, id, amount);\n        tokenSupply[id] -= amount;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Metadata Standards\n\n### Off-Chain Metadata (IPFS)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"NFT #1\",\n  \"description\": \"Description of the NFT\",\n  \"image\": \"ipfs://QmImageHash\",\n  \"attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"trait_type\": \"Background\",\n      \"value\": \"Blue\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"trait_type\": \"Rarity\",\n      \"value\": \"Legendary\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"trait_type\": \"Power\",\n      \"value\": 95,\n      \"display_type\": \"number\",\n      \"max_value\": 100\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### On-Chain Metadata\n\n```solidity\ncontract OnChainNFT is ERC721 {\n    struct Traits {\n        uint8 background;\n        uint8 body;\n        uint8 head;\n        uint8 rarity;\n    }\n\n    mapping(uint256 => Traits) public tokenTraits;\n\n    function tokenURI(uint256 tokenId) public view override returns (string memory) {\n        Traits memory traits = tokenTraits[tokenId];\n\n        string memory json = Base64.encode(\n            bytes(\n                string(\n                    abi.encodePacked(\n                        ''{\"name\": \"NFT #'', Strings.toString(tokenId), ''\",'',\n                        ''\"description\": \"On-chain NFT\",'',\n                        ''\"image\": \"data:image/svg+xml;base64,'', generateSVG(traits), ''\",'',\n                        ''\"attributes\": ['',\n                        ''{\"trait_type\": \"Background\", \"value\": \"'', Strings.toString(traits.background), ''\"},'',\n                        ''{\"trait_type\": \"Rarity\", \"value\": \"'', getRarityName(traits.rarity), ''\"}'',\n                        '']}''\n                    )\n                )\n            )\n        );\n\n        return string(abi.encodePacked(\"data:application/json;base64,\", json));\n    }\n\n    function generateSVG(Traits memory traits) internal pure returns (string memory) {\n        // Generate SVG based on traits\n        return \"...\";\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Royalties (EIP-2981)\n\n```solidity\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/interfaces/IERC2981.sol\";\n\ncontract NFTWithRoyalties is ERC721, IERC2981 {\n    address public royaltyRecipient;\n    uint96 public royaltyFee = 500; // 5%\n\n    constructor() ERC721(\"Royalty NFT\", \"RNFT\") {\n        royaltyRecipient = msg.sender;\n    }\n\n    function royaltyInfo(uint256 tokenId, uint256 salePrice)\n        external\n        view\n        override\n        returns (address receiver, uint256 royaltyAmount)\n    {\n        return (royaltyRecipient, (salePrice * royaltyFee) / 10000);\n    }\n\n    function setRoyalty(address recipient, uint96 fee) external onlyOwner {\n        require(fee <= 1000, \"Royalty fee too high\"); // Max 10%\n        royaltyRecipient = recipient;\n        royaltyFee = fee;\n    }\n\n    function supportsInterface(bytes4 interfaceId)\n        public\n        view\n        override(ERC721, IERC165)\n        returns (bool)\n    {\n        return interfaceId == type(IERC2981).interfaceId ||\n               super.supportsInterface(interfaceId);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Soulbound Tokens (Non-Transferable)\n\n```solidity\ncontract SoulboundToken is ERC721 {\n    constructor() ERC721(\"Soulbound\", \"SBT\") {}\n\n    function _beforeTokenTransfer(\n        address from,\n        address to,\n        uint256 tokenId,\n        uint256 batchSize\n    ) internal virtual override {\n        require(from == address(0) || to == address(0), \"Token is soulbound\");\n        super._beforeTokenTransfer(from, to, tokenId, batchSize);\n    }\n\n    function mint(address to) external {\n        uint256 tokenId = totalSupply() + 1;\n        _safeMint(to, tokenId);\n    }\n\n    // Burn is allowed (user can destroy their SBT)\n    function burn(uint256 tokenId) external {\n        require(ownerOf(tokenId) == msg.sender, \"Not token owner\");\n        _burn(tokenId);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Dynamic NFTs\n\n```solidity\ncontract DynamicNFT is ERC721 {\n    struct TokenState {\n        uint256 level;\n        uint256 experience;\n        uint256 lastUpdated;\n    }\n\n    mapping(uint256 => TokenState) public tokenStates;\n\n    function gainExperience(uint256 tokenId, uint256 exp) external {\n        require(ownerOf(tokenId) == msg.sender, \"Not token owner\");\n\n        TokenState storage state = tokenStates[tokenId];\n        state.experience += exp;\n\n        // Level up logic\n        if (state.experience >= state.level * 100) {\n            state.level++;\n        }\n\n        state.lastUpdated = block.timestamp;\n    }\n\n    function tokenURI(uint256 tokenId) public view override returns (string memory) {\n        TokenState memory state = tokenStates[tokenId];\n\n        // Generate metadata based on current state\n        return generateMetadata(tokenId, state);\n    }\n\n    function generateMetadata(uint256 tokenId, TokenState memory state)\n        internal\n        pure\n        returns (string memory)\n    {\n        // Dynamic metadata generation\n        return \"\";\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Gas-Optimized Minting (ERC721A)\n\n```solidity\nimport \"erc721a/contracts/ERC721A.sol\";\n\ncontract OptimizedNFT is ERC721A {\n    uint256 public constant MAX_SUPPLY = 10000;\n    uint256 public constant MINT_PRICE = 0.05 ether;\n\n    constructor() ERC721A(\"Optimized NFT\", \"ONFT\") {}\n\n    function mint(uint256 quantity) external payable {\n        require(_totalMinted() + quantity <= MAX_SUPPLY, \"Exceeds max supply\");\n        require(msg.value >= MINT_PRICE * quantity, \"Insufficient payment\");\n\n        _mint(msg.sender, quantity);\n    }\n\n    function _baseURI() internal pure override returns (string memory) {\n        return \"ipfs://QmBaseHash/\";\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/erc721.md**: ERC-721 specification details\n- **references/erc1155.md**: ERC-1155 multi-token standard\n- **references/metadata-standards.md**: Metadata best practices\n- **references/enumeration.md**: Token enumeration patterns\n- **assets/erc721-contract.sol**: Production ERC-721 template\n- **assets/erc1155-contract.sol**: Production ERC-1155 template\n- **assets/metadata-schema.json**: Standard metadata format\n- **assets/metadata-uploader.py**: IPFS upload utility\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use OpenZeppelin**: Battle-tested implementations\n2. **Pin Metadata**: Use IPFS with pinning service\n3. **Implement Royalties**: EIP-2981 for marketplace compatibility\n4. **Gas Optimization**: Use ERC721A for batch minting\n5. **Reveal Mechanism**: Placeholder → reveal pattern\n6. **Enumeration**: Support walletOfOwner for marketplaces\n7. **Whitelist**: Merkle trees for efficient whitelisting\n\n## Marketplace Integration\n\n- OpenSea: ERC-721/1155, metadata standards\n- LooksRare: Royalty enforcement\n- Rarible: Protocol fees, lazy minting\n- Blur: Gas-optimized trading"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:29:58.100Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Blockchain Agents specializing in NFT development and requiring in-depth knowledge of ERC-721 and ERC-1155 standards.","zh":"适合专注于NFT开发并需要深入了解ERC-721和ERC-1155标准的区块链代理","ja":"NFT開発に特化し、ERC-721およびERC-1155標準に関する深い知識を必要とするブロックチェーンエージェントに適しています","ko":"NFT 개발에 전문적인 블록체인 에이전트에게 적합하며, ERC-721 및 ERC-1155 표준에 대한 심도 있는 지식을 필요로 함","es":"Ideal para agentes de Blockchain que se especializan en desarrollo de NFT y requieren conocimiento en profundidad de los estándares ERC-721 y ERC-1155.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de Blockchain spécialisés dans le développement de NFT et nécessitant une connaissance approfondie des normes ERC-721 et ERC-1155.","de":"Ideal für Blockchain-Agents, die sich auf NFT-Entwicklung spezialisieren und ein tiefes Verständnis der ERC-721- und ERC-1155-Standards erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Blockchain especializados em desenvolvimento de NFT e que exigem conhecimento aprofundado dos padrões ERC-721 e ERC-1155.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов блокчейна, специализирующихся на разработке NFT и требующих глубоких знаний стандартов ERC-721 и ERC-1155.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل البلوكشين المتخصصة في تطوير NFT والمتطلبة معرفة متعمقة بمعايير ERC-721 و ERC-1155."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master NFT metadata best practices, implement marketplace functionality, and develop advanced NFT features using ERC-721 and ERC-1155 protocols, enabling the creation of complex on-chain and off-chain metadata, soulbound tokens, and dynamic NFTs.","zh":"使代理能够掌握NFT元数据最佳实践，实现市场功能，并使用ERC-721和ERC-1155协议开发高级NFT功能，从而实现复杂的链上和链下元数据、灵魂绑定令牌和动态NFT的创建","ja":"エージェントがNFTメタデータのベストプラクティスをマスターし、市場機能を実装し、ERC-721およびERC-1155プロトコルを使用して高度なNFT機能を開発できるようにし、複雑なオンチェーンおよびオフチェーンメタデータ、ソウルバウンドトークン、および動的NFTの作成を可能にする","ko":"에이전트가 NFT 메타데이터의 beste 실践을 마스터하고, 시장 기능을 구현하며, ERC-721 및 ERC-1155 프로토콜을 사용하여 고급 NFT 기능을 개발할 수 있도록 하여, 복잡한 온체인 및 오프체인 메타데이터, 소울바운드 토큰 및 동적 NFT의 생성을 가능하게 함","es":"Permite a los agentes dominar las mejores prácticas de metadatos de NFT, implementar funcionalidades de mercado e implementar características avanzadas de NFT utilizando los protocolos ERC-721 y ERC-1155, lo que permite la creación de metadatos complejos en cadena y fuera de cadena, tokens vinculados al alma y NFT dinámicos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser les meilleures pratiques de métadonnées de NFT, de mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités de marché et de développer des fonctionnalités de NFT avancées en utilisant les protocoles ERC-721 et ERC-1155, permettant ainsi la création de métadonnées complexes en chaîne et hors chaîne, de tokens liés à l''âme et de NFT dynamiques.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die besten Praktiken für NFT-Metadaten zu beherrschen, Marktfunktionen zu implementieren und erweiterte NFT-Funktionen mit den Protokollen ERC-721 und ERC-1155 zu entwickeln, wodurch die Erstellung komplexer On-Chain- und Off-Chain-Metadaten, Seelentoken und dynamischer NFTs ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar as melhores práticas de metadados de NFT, implementar funcionalidades de marketplace e desenvolver recursos avançados de NFT usando os protocolos ERC-721 e ERC-1155, permitindo a criação de metadados complexos em cadeia e fora de cadeia, tokens soulbound e NFTs dinâmicos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить лучшие практики метаданных NFT, реализовать функциональность рынка и разработать продвинутые функции NFT с использованием протоколов ERC-721 и ERC-1155, что позволяет создавать сложные метаданные в цепи и вне цепи, токены soulbound и динамические NFT.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إتقان أفضل الممارسات لبيانات تعريف NFT، وتطبيق وظائف السوق، وتنمية الميزات المتقدمة ل-NFT باستخدام بروتوكولات ERC-721 و ERC-1155، مما يسمح بإنشاء بيانات تعريف معقدة على السلسلة وخارجها، وعملات الروح وال-NFT الديناميكي."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating NFT collections with standardized metadata","Implementing royalties and revenue sharing for NFT marketplaces","Developing soulbound tokens and non-transferable NFTs","Generating dynamic and evolving NFTs using ERC-721 and ERC-1155","Building on-chain and off-chain metadata for NFTs"],"zh":["创建具有标准化元数据的NFT集合","实现NFT市场的版税和收入分成","开发灵魂绑定令牌和非可转让NFT","使用ERC-721和ERC-1155生成动态和演化的NFT","为NFT构建链上和链下元数据"],"ja":["標準化されたメタデータを備えたNFTコレクションを作成する","NFTマーケットプレイスでのロイヤリティと収益分配の実装","ソウルバウンドトークンと転送不可NFTの開発","ERC-721およびERC-1155を使用した動的および進化するNFTの生成","NFT用のオンチェーンおよびオフチェーンメタデータの構築"],"ko":["표준화된 메타데이터를 갖춘 NFT 컬렉션を作成","NFT 시장의 로열티 및 수익 분배 구현","소울바운드 토큰 및 전송 불가능한 NFT 개발","ERC-721 및 ERC-1155를 사용한 동적 및 진화하는 NFT 생성","NFT용 온체인 및 오프체인 메타데이터 구축"],"es":["Crear colecciones de NFT con metadatos estandarizados","Implementar regalías y reparto de ingresos para mercados de NFT","Desarrollar tokens vinculados al alma y NFT no transferibles","Generar NFT dinámicos y evolutivos utilizando ERC-721 y ERC-1155","Crear metadatos en cadena y fuera de cadena para NFT"],"fr":["Créer des collections de NFT avec des métadonnées standardisées","Mettre en œuvre des redevances et un partage de revenus pour les marchés de NFT","Développer des tokens liés à l''âme et des NFT non transférables","Générer des NFT dynamiques et évolutifs en utilisant ERC-721 et ERC-1155","Créer des métadonnées en chaîne et hors chaîne pour les NFT"],"de":["Erstellen von NFT-Sammlungen mit standardisierten Metadaten","Implementierung von Tantiemen und Umsatzbeteiligung für NFT-Märkte","Entwicklung von Seelentoken und nicht übertragbaren NFT","Erzeugen von dynamischen und sich entwickelnden NFT mit ERC-721 und ERC-1155","Erstellen von On-Chain- und Off-Chain-Metadaten für NFT"],"pt":["Criar coleções de NFT com metadados padronizados","Implementar direitos autorais e compartilhamento de receita para marketplaces de NFT","Desenvolver tokens soulbound e NFTs não transferíveis","Gerar NFTs dinâmicos e evolutivos usando ERC-721 e ERC-1155","Construir metadados em cadeia e fora de cadeia para NFTs"],"ru":["Создание коллекций NFT с стандартизированными метаданными","Реализация роялти и распределения доходов для рынков NFT","Разработка токенов soulbound и непередаваемых NFT","Генерация динамических и эволюционирующих NFT с использованием ERC-721 и ERC-1155","Создание метаданных в цепи и вне цепи для NFT"],"ar":["إنشاء مجموعات من NFT مع بيانات تعريف معيارية","تطبيق حقوق الطبع والنشر وتقاسم الإيرادات لأنظمة السوق NFT","تطوير عملات الروح و-NFT غير القابلة للتحويل","توليد NFTs ديناميكي وتطوري باستخدام ERC-721 و ERC-1155","بناء بيانات تعريف على السلسلة وخارجها ل-NFTs"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Solidity programming language","Limited to Ethereum blockchain and EVM-compatible chains","Needs understanding of blockchain development and smart contracts"],"zh":["需要Solidity编程语言的知识","仅限以太坊区块链和EVM兼容链","需要区块链开发和智能合约的理解"],"ja":["Solidityプログラミング言語の知識が必要","EthereumブロックチェーンおよびEVM互換チェーンに限定","ブロックチェーン開発およびスマートコントラクトの理解が必要"],"ko":["Solidity 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 지식이 필요","이더리움 블록체인 및 EVM 호환 체인에 한정","블록체인 개발 및 스마트 계약에 대한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del lenguaje de programación Solidity","Limitado a la blockchain de Ethereum y cadenas compatibles con EVM","Necesita comprensión del desarrollo de blockchain y contratos inteligentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du langage de programmation Solidity","Limité à la blockchain Ethereum et aux chaînes compatibles EVM","Nécessite une compréhension du développement de blockchain et des contrats intelligents"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Programmiersprache Solidity","Begrenzt auf die Ethereum-Blockchain und EVM-kompatible Ketten","Benötigt Verständnis für Blockchain-Entwicklung und Smart Contracts"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da linguagem de programação Solidity","Limitado à blockchain Ethereum e às cadeias compatíveis com EVM","Necessita de compreensão do desenvolvimento de blockchain e contratos inteligentes"],"ru":["Требует знания языка программирования Solidity","Ограничен блокчейном Ethereum и цепями, совместимыми с EVM","Требует понимания разработки блокчейна и смарт-контрактов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بلغة برمجة Solidity","محدود بالسلسلة البلوكية Ethereum والسلاسل المتوافقة مع EVM","يحتاج إلى فهم لتطوير البلوكشين والتعاقدات