pec-bulk-archive-change","es":"Archivar cambios en bulk con openspec-bulk-archive-change","fr":"Archiver les modifications en bulk avec openspec-bulk-arc...","de":"Änderungen im Bulk mit openspec-bulk-archive-change archi...","pt":"Openspec-Bulk-Archive-Change: Ferramenta de Arquivamento ...","ru":"Openspec-Bulk-Archive-Change: Инструмент пакетного архиви...","ar":"openspec-Bulk-Archive-Change: أداة أرشفة بالجملة","en":"openspec-bulk-archive-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-bulk-archive-change技能允许您批量归档完成的更改，智能处理规格冲突","ja":"openspec-bulk-archive-changeスキルはバルクで完了した変更をアーカイブし、仕様の衝突を智能的に処理","ko":"openspec-bulk-archive-change 스킬은 대량으로 완료된 변경을存档하고 규격 충돌을智能적으로 처리","es":"openspec-bulk-archive-change es una habilidad que permite archivar múltiples cambios completados en una sola operación, manejando conflictos de especificacio...","fr":"openspec-bulk-archive-change est une compétence qui permet d''archiver plusieurs modifications complétées en une seule opération, en gérant de manière intelli...","de":"openspec-bulk-archive-change ist eine Fähigkeit, die es ermöglicht, mehrere abgeschlossene Änderungen in einer einzigen Operation zu archivieren, indem sie S...","pt":"A ferramenta openspec-bulk-archive-change é uma solução para arquivar várias alterações em uma operação, lidando com conflitos de especificação de forma inte...","ru":"Инструмент openspec-bulk-archive-change является решением для архивирования нескольких изменений в одной операции, обрабатывая конфликты спецификации интелле...","ar":"أداة openspec-Bulk-Archive-Change هي حل لأرشفة عدة تغييرات في عملية واحدة، وتتعامل مع конфликات المواصفات بذكاء.","en":"A Vite + GraphQL + Typescript frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"definition":{"en":"A Vite + GraphQL + Typescript frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"features":{"zh":["批量归档完成的更改","智能处理规格冲突","使用Vite + GraphQL + Typescript前端模板","采用Feature-Sliced Design作为项目架构方法论","支持多选变化存档","自动检测代码库以确定实际实现"],"ja":["バルクで完了した変更をアーカイブ","仕様の衝突を智能的に処理","Vite + GraphQL + Typescript前端ボイラープレートを使用","Feature-Sliced Designをプロジェクトアーキテクチャ方法論として採用","複数の変更を選択してアーカイブ","コードベースを自動检测して実際の実装を決定"],"ko":["대량으로 완료된 변경을存档","규격 충돌을智能적으로 처리","Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 프론트엔드 보일러プレ이트를 사용","Feature-Sliced Design를 프로젝트 아키텍처 방법론으로採用","複数の変更을 선택하여存档","코드베이스를 자동으로检测하여 실제 구현을 결정"],"es":["Archivar múltiples cambios completados en una sola operación","Manejo inteligente de conflictos de especificaciones","Uso de la herramienta AskUserQuestion para seleccionar cambios","Compatibilidad con Vite, GraphQL y Typescript","Diseño de proyecto basado en Feature-Sliced Design"],"fr":["Archiver plusieurs modifications complétées en une seule opération","Gestion intelligente des conflits de spécifications","Utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour sélectionner les modifications","Compatibilité avec Vite, GraphQL et Typescript","Conception de projet basée sur Feature-Sliced Design"],"de":["Mehrere abgeschlossene Änderungen in einer einzigen Operation archivieren","Intelligente Handhabung von Spezifikationskonflikten","Verwendung des Tools AskUserQuestion zur Auswahl von Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit Vite, GraphQL und Typescript","Projektdesign basierend auf Feature-Sliced Design"],"pt":["Arquivamento em lote de alterações","Lidamento com conflitos de especificação","Uso da ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção de alterações","Execução do comando openspec list --json para obter alterações ativas","Compatibilidade com Vite, GraphQL e Typescript"],"ru":["Пакетное архивирование изменений","Обработка конфликтов спецификации","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion для выбора изменений","Выполнение команды openspec list --json для получения активных изменений","Совместимость с Vite, GraphQL и Typescript"],"ar":["أرشفة بالجملة للتغييرات","التعامل مع конфликات المواصفات","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لتحديد التغييرات","تشغيل الأمر openspec list --json لاسترجاع التغييرات النشطة","التوافق مع Vite و GraphQL و Typescript"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","批量归档更改","智能处理规格冲突","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design"],"ja":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","バルクアーカイブ変更","仕様の衝突を智能的に処理","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design"],"ko":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","대량存档 변경","규격 충돌을智能적으로 처리","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design"],"es":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","archivar cambios en bulk","manejo de conflictos de especificaciones","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design"],"fr":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","archiver les modifications en bulk","gestion des conflits de spécifications","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design"],"de":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","Änderungen im Bulk archivieren","Handhabung von Spezifikationskonflikten","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design"],"pt":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","arquivamento em lote","conflitos de especificação","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","ferramenta de arquivamento","produtividade"],"ru":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","пакетное архивирование","конфликты спецификации","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","инструмент архивирования","производительность"],"ar":["openspec-Bulk-Archive-Change","أرشفة بالجملة","conflicts المواصفات","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","أداة أرشفة","إنتاجية"]}},"owner":"uxname","repo":"litefront","repoPath":"uxname/litefront","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-bulk-archive-change","description":"Archive multiple completed changes at once. Use when archiving several parallel changes.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select t","body":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select to let user choose changes:\n   - Show each change with its schema\n   - Include an option for \"All changes\"\n   - Allow any number of selections (1+ works, 2+ is the typical use case)\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT auto-select. Always let the user choose.\n\n3. **Batch validation - gather status for all selected changes**\n\n   For each selected change, collect:\n\n   a. **Artifact status** - Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Parse `schemaName` and `artifacts` list\n      - Note which artifacts are `done` vs other states\n\n   b. **Task completion** - Read `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n      - Count `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n      - If no tasks file exists, note as \"No tasks\"\n\n   c. **Delta specs** - Check `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/` directory\n      - List which capability specs exist\n      - For each, extract requirement names (lines matching `### Requirement: <name>`)\n\n4. **Detect spec conflicts**\n\n   Build a map of `capability -> [changes that touch it]`:\n\n   ```\n   auth -> [change-a, change-b]  <- CONFLICT (2+ changes)\n   api  -> [change-c]            <- OK (only 1 change)\n   ```\n\n   A conflict exists when 2+ selected changes have delta specs for the same capability.\n\n5. **Resolve conflicts agentically**\n\n   **For each conflict**, investigate the codebase:\n\n   a. **Read the delta specs** from each conflicting change to understand what each claims to add/modify\n\n   b. **Search the codebase** for implementation evidence:\n      - Look for code implementing requirements from each delta spec\n      - Check for related files, functions, or tests\n\n   c. **Determine resolution**:\n      - If only one change is actually implemented -> sync that one''s specs\n      - If both implemented -> apply in chronological order (older first, newer overwrites)\n      - If neither implemented -> skip spec sync, warn user\n\n   d. **Record resolution** for each conflict:\n      - Which change''s specs to apply\n      - In what order (if both)\n      - Rationale (what was found in codebase)\n\n6. **Show consolidated status table**\n\n   Display a table summarizing all changes:\n\n   ```\n   | Change               | Artifacts | Tasks | Specs   | Conflicts | Status |\n   |---------------------|-----------|-------|---------|-----------|--------|\n   | schema-management   | Done      | 5/5   | 2 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | project-config      | Done      | 3/3   | 1 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | add-oauth           | Done      | 4/4   | 1 delta | auth (!)  | Ready* |\n   | add-verify-skill    | 1 left    | 2/5   | None    | None      | Warn   |\n   ```\n\n   For conflicts, show the resolution:\n   ```\n   * Conflict resolution:\n     - auth spec: Will apply add-oauth then add-jwt (both implemented, chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   For incomplete changes, show warnings:\n   ```\n   Warnings:\n   - add-verify-skill: 1 incomplete artifact, 3 incomplete tasks\n   ```\n\n7. **Confirm batch operation**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with a single confirmation:\n\n   - \"Archive N changes?\" with options based on status\n   - Options might include:\n     - \"Archive all N changes\"\n     - \"Archive only N ready changes (skip incomplete)\"\n     - \"Cancel\"\n\n   If there are incomplete changes, make clear they''ll be archived with warnings.\n\n8. **Execute archive for each confirmed change**\n\n   Process changes in the determined order (respecting conflict resolution):\n\n   a. **Sync specs** if delta specs exist:\n      - Use the openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven intelligent merge)\n      - For conflicts, apply in resolved order\n      - Track if sync was done\n\n   b. **Perform the archive**:\n      ```bash\n      mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n      mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n      ```\n\n   c. **Track outcome** for each change:\n      - Success: archived successfully\n      - Failed: error during archive (record error)\n      - Skipped: user chose not to archive (if applicable)\n\n9. **Display summary**\n\n   Show final results:\n\n   ```\n   ## Bulk Archive Complete\n\n   Archived 3 changes:\n   - schema-management-cli -> archive/2026-01-19-schema-management-cli/\n   - project-config -> archive/2026-01-19-project-config/\n   - add-oauth -> archive/2026-01-19-add-oauth/\n\n   Skipped 1 change:\n   - add-verify-skill (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\n   Spec sync summary:\n   - 4 delta specs synced to main specs\n   - 1 conflict resolved (auth: applied both in chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   If any failures:\n   ```\n   Failed 1 change:\n   - some-change: Archive directory already exists\n   ```\n\n**Conflict Resolution Examples**\n\nExample 1: Only one implemented\n```\nConflict: specs/auth/spec.md touched by [add-oauth, add-jwt]\n\nChecking add-oauth:\n- Delta adds \"OAuth Provider Integration\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/auth/oauth.ts implementing OAuth flow\n\nChecking add-jwt:\n- Delta adds \"JWT Token Handling\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... no JWT implementation found\n\nResolution: Only add-oauth is implemented. Will sync add-oauth specs only.\n```\n\nExample 2: Both implemented\n```\nConflict: specs/api/spec.md touched by [add-rest-api, add-graphql]\n\nChecking add-rest-api (created 2026-01-10):\n- Delta adds \"REST Endpoints\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/rest.ts\n\nChecking add-graphql (created 2026-01-15):\n- Delta adds \"GraphQL Schema\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/graphql.ts\n\nResolution: Both implemented. Will apply add-rest-api specs first,\nthen add-graphql specs (chronological order, newer takes precedence).\n```\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n- <change-2> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-2>/\n\nSpec sync summary:\n- N delta specs synced to main specs\n- No conflicts (or: M conflicts resolved)\n```\n\n**Output On Partial Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete (partial)\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n\nSkipped M changes:\n- <change-2> (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\nFailed K changes:\n- <change-3>: Archive directory already exists\n```\n\n**Output When No Changes**\n\n```\n## No Changes to Archive\n\nNo active changes found. Use `/opsx:new` to create a new change.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Allow any number of changes (1+ is fine, 2+ is the typical use case)\n- Always prompt for selection, never auto-select\n- Detect spec conflicts early and resolve by checking codebase\n- When both changes are implemented, apply specs in chronological order\n- Skip spec sync only when implementation is missing (warn user)\n- Show clear per-change status before confirming\n- Use single confirmation for entire batch\n- Track and report all outcomes (success/skip/fail)\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive\n- Archive directory target uses current date: YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n- If archive target exists, fail that change but continue with others\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:31:07.413Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing efficient bulk archiving of completed changes with intelligent spec conflict resolution.","zh":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing efficient bulk archiving of completed changes with intelligent spec conflict resolution.","ja":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing efficient bulk archiving of completed changes with intelligent spec conflict resolution.","ko":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing efficient bulk archiving of completed changes with intelligent spec conflict resolution.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de código que necesitan archivado en bloque eficiente de cambios completados con resolución inteligente de conflictos de especificaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant un archivage en bloc efficace des modifications terminées avec une résolution intelligente des conflits de spécifications.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agents, die ein effizientes Bulk-Archivieren abgeschlossener Änderungen mit intelligenter Spezifikationskonfliktlösung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que precisam de arquivamento em massa eficiente de alterações concluídas com resolução inteligente de conflitos de especificação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления кодом, которым требуется эффективное массовое архивирование завершенных изменений с интеллектуальным разрешением конфликтов спецификаций.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى أرشفة كفؤة بالجملة للتغييرات المكتملة مع حل ذكي للتعارضات في المواصفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to batch-archive changes using Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript, handling spec conflicts by checking the codebase and determining what''s actually implemented via Feature-Sliced Design.","zh":"Empowers agents to batch-archive changes using Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript, handling spec conflicts by checking the codebase and determining what''s actually implemented via Feature-Sliced Design.","ja":"Empowers agents to batch-archive changes using Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript, handling spec conflicts by checking the codebase and determining what''s actually implemented via Feature-Sliced Design.","ko":"Empowers agents to batch-archive changes using Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript, handling spec conflicts by checking the codebase and determining what''s actually implemented via Feature-Sliced Design.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar por lotes cambios utilizando Vite, GraphQL y Typescript, manejando conflictos de especificaciones verificando la base de código y determinando qué es lo que realmente se implementa a través del diseño en rebanadas de características.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver par lot des modifications en utilisant Vite, GraphQL et Typescript, en gérant les conflits de spécifications en vérifiant la base de code et en déterminant ce qui est réellement implémenté via la conception en tranches de fonctionnalités.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Änderungen mit Vite, GraphQL und Typescript zu batch-archivieren, indem Spezifikationskonflikte durch Überprüfung der Codebasis und Bestimmung dessen gelöst werden, was tatsächlich über das Feature-Sliced-Design implementiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fazer o arquivamento em lote de alterações usando Vite, GraphQL e Typescript, lidando com conflitos de especificação verificando a base de código e determinando o que é implementado de fato via Feature-Sliced Design.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью архивировать изменения пакетно с помощью Vite, GraphQL и Typescript, обрабатывая конфликты спецификаций путем проверки кодовой базы и определения того, что фактически реализовано посредством Feature-Sliced Design.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أرشفة التغييرات بالجملة باستخدام Vite و GraphQL و Typescript ، ومعالجة تعارضات المواصفات من خلال التحقق من قاعدة الشفرة وتحديد ما تم تنفيذه بالفعل من خلال تصميم Feature-Sliced."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving multiple completed changes in a single operation","Intelligently resolving spec conflicts during bulk archiving","Streamlining codebase management using Feature-Sliced Design"],"zh":["Archiving multiple completed changes in a single operation","Intelligently resolving spec conflicts during bulk archiving","Streamlining codebase management using Feature-Sliced Design"],"ja":["Archiving multiple completed changes in a single operation","Intelligently resolving spec conflicts during bulk archiving","Streamlining codebase management using Feature-Sliced Design"],"ko":["Archiving multiple completed changes in a single operation","Intelligently resolving spec conflicts during bulk archiving","Streamlining codebase management using Feature-Sliced Design"],"es":["Archivar múltiples cambios completados en una sola operación","Resolver inteligentemente conflictos de especificaciones durante el archivado en bloque","Optimizar la gestión de la base de código utilizando el diseño en rebanadas de características"],"fr":["Archiver plusieurs modifications terminées en une seule opération","Résoudre intelligemment les conflits de spécifications lors de l''archivage en bloc","Optimiser la gestion de la base de code en utilisant la conception en tranches de fonctionnalités"],"de":["Mehrere abgeschlossene Änderungen in einem einzigen Vorgang archivieren","Spezifikationskonflikte während des Bulk-Archivierens intelligent lösen","Codebasis-Verwaltung mithilfe des Feature-Sliced-Designs optimieren"],"pt":["Arquivar várias alterações concluídas em uma única operação","Resolver inteligentemente conflitos de especificação durante o arquivamento em massa","Otimizar a gestão da base de código usando Feature-Sliced Design"],"ru":["Архивировать несколько завершенных изменений в одной операции","Интеллектуально разрешать конфликты спецификаций во время массового архивирования","Оптимизировать управление кодовой базой с помощью Feature-Sliced Design"],"ar":["أرشفة عدة تغييرات مكتملة في عملية واحدة"," حل تعارضات المواصفات بذكاء خلال الأرشفة بالجملة","جعل إدارة قاعدة الشفرة أكثر كفاءة باستخدام تصميم Feature-Sliced"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript setup","Needs access to the codebase for spec conflict resolution","No input parameters are required, relies on prompting user for change selection"],"zh":["Requires Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript setup","Needs access to the codebase for spec conflict resolution","No input parameters are required, relies on prompting user for change selection"],"ja":["Requires Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript setup","Needs access to the codebase for spec conflict resolution","No input parameters are required, relies on prompting user for change selection"],"ko":["Requires Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript setup","Needs access to the codebase for spec conflict resolution","No input parameters are required, relies on prompting user for change selection"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Vite, GraphQL y Typescript","Necesita acceso a la base de código para la resolución de conflictos de especificaciones","No se requieren parámetros de entrada, depende de la solicitud del usuario para la selección de cambios"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Vite, GraphQL et Typescript","Nécessite un accès à la base de code pour la résolution des conflits de spécifications","Aucun paramètre d''entrée n''est requis, repose sur la demande de l''utilisateur pour la sélection des modifications"],"de":["Benötigt Vite-, GraphQL- und Typescript-Setup","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebasis für die Auflösung von Spezifikationskonflikten","Keine Eingabeparameter erforderlich, verlässt sich auf die Aufforderung des Benutzers zur Änderungsauswahl"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Vite, GraphQL e Typescript","Necessita acesso à base de código para resolução de conflitos de especificação","Nenhum parâmetro de entrada é necessário, depende de prompt para seleção de alterações"],"ru":["Требует настройки Vite, GraphQL и Typescript","Требует доступа к кодовой базе для разрешения конфликтов спецификаций","Не требуются входные параметры, полагается на запрос для выбора изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Vite و GraphQL و Typescript","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة لحل تعارضات المواصفات","لا يتطلب معلمات إدخال، يعتمد على التوجيه لاختيار التغييرات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ollieb89/ugro/stripe-integration', 'community', 'ollieb89', 'ugro', 'ollieb89/ugro', 'stripe-integration', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z', '2026-02-18T12:30:39.850Z', NULL, '{"id":"ollieb89/ugro/stripe-integration","name":"stripe-integration","description":{"zh":"Stripe集成提供了强大的PCI合规支付流程解决方案，支持结账、订阅、Webhook和退款等功能","ja":"Stripe統合は、強力でPCIコンプライアントな支払いフローを提供し、チェックアウト、サブスクリプション、Webhook、返金などの機能をサポートします","ko":"스트라이프 통합은 강력하고 PCI 규정 준수하는 결제 흐름을 제공하며 체크아웃, 구독, 웹후크, 환불 등 기능을 지원합니다","es":"La integración de Stripe permite pagos seguros y PCI-compliant en aplicaciones web y móviles","fr":"L''intégration de Stripe permet des paiements sécurisés et PCI-compliant dans les applications web et mobiles","de":"Die Stripe-Integration ermöglicht sichere und PCI-konforme Zahlungen in Web- und Mobilanwendungen","pt":"A integração do Stripe permite pagamentos online robustos e seguros. Implemente fluxos de pagamento PCI-compliant, incluindo checkout e assinaturas.","ru":"Интеграция Stripe позволяет осуществлять онлайн-платежи robustly и безопасно. Реализуйте потоки платежей, соответствующие требованиям PCI, включая checkout и подписки.","ar":"تتيح لك تكامل سترايب الدفع عبر الإنترنت القوي والأمن. قم بتطبيق تدفقات الدفع المطابق لPCI ، بما في ذلك الفاتورة والتسجيل.","en":"This project aims to transform a small set of independently managed GPU machines into a **single, cohesive, high-power compute system** that can be dynamically orchestrated for **distributed training**, **advanced inference**, and **developer workflows**."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Stripe集成 - 实现PCI合规的支付流程","ja":"Stripe統合 - PCIコンプライアンスの支払いフローを実現","ko":"스트라이프 통합 - PCI 규정 준수 결제 흐름 구현","es":"Integración de Stripe para pagos seguros","fr":"Intégration Stripe pour paiements sécurisés","de":"Stripe-Integration für sichere Zahlungen","pt":"Integração Stripe para Pagamentos Online","ru":"Интеграция Stripe для онлайн-платежей","ar":"تكامل سترايب للدفع عبر الإنترنت","en":"stripe-integration"},"description":{"zh":"Stripe集成提供了强大的PCI合规支付流程解决方案，支持结账、订阅、Webhook和退款等功能","ja":"Stripe統合は、強力でPCIコンプライアントな支払いフローを提供し、チェックアウト、サブスクリプション、Webhook、返金などの機能をサポートします","ko":"스트라이프 통합은 강력하고 PCI 규정 준수하는 결제 흐름을 제공하며 체크아웃, 구독, 웹후크, 환불 등 기능을 지원합니다","es":"La integración de Stripe permite pagos seguros y PCI-compliant en aplicaciones web y móviles","fr":"L''intégration de Stripe permet des paiements sécurisés et PCI-compliant dans les applications web et mobiles","de":"Die Stripe-Integration ermöglicht sichere und PCI-konforme Zahlungen in Web- und Mobilanwendungen","pt":"A integração do Stripe permite pagamentos online robustos e seguros. Implemente fluxos de pagamento PCI-compliant, incluindo checkout e assinaturas.","ru":"Интеграция Stripe позволяет осуществлять онлайн-платежи robustly и безопасно. Реализуйте потоки платежей, соответствующие требованиям PCI, включая checkout и...","ar":"تتيح لك تكامل سترايب الدفع عبر الإنترنت القوي والأمن. قم بتطبيق تدفقات الدفع المطابق لPCI ، بما في ذلك الفاتورة والتسجيل.","en":"This project aims to transform a small set of independently managed GPU machines into a **single, cohesive, high-power compute system** that can be dynamical..."},"definition":{"en":"This project aims to transform a small set of independently managed GPU machines into a **single, cohesive, high-power compute system** that can be dynamically orchestrated for **distributed training**, **advanced inference**, and **developer workflows**."},"features":{"zh":["PCI合规的支付流程","支持结账、订阅、Webhook和退款","强大的安全性和合规性","易于集成和使用","支持多种支付方式"],"ja":["PCIコンプライアントな支払いフロー","チェックアウト、サブスクリプション、Webhook、返金のサポート","強力なセキュリティとコンプライアンス","簡単な統合と使用","複数の支払い方法のサポート"],"ko":["PCI 규정 준수하는 결제 흐름","체크아웃, 구독, 웹후크, 환불 지원","강력한 보안과 규정 준수","쉽게 통합하고 사용","여러 가지 결제 방법 지원"],"es":["Pagos PCI-compliant","Procesamiento de pagos recurrentes","Gestión de métodos de pago del cliente","Implementación de SCA para pagos europeos","Webhooks y reembolsos","Flujos de pago personalizados"],"fr":["Paiements PCI-compliant","Traitement de paiements récurrents","Gestion des méthodes de paiement du client","Mise en œuvre de l''SCA pour les paiements européens","Webhooks et remboursements","Flux de paiement personnalisés"],"de":["PCI-konforme Zahlungen","Verarbeitung von wiederkehrenden Zahlungen","Verwaltung von Kundenzahlungsmethoden","Implementierung von SCA für europäische Zahlungen","Webhooks und Rückerstattungen","Benutzerdefinierte Zahlungsflüsse"],"pt":["Pagamento online seguro","Fluxos de pagamento PCI-compliant","Checkout e assinaturas","Webhooks e notificações","Gerenciamento de métodos de pagamento","Autenticação de cliente forte"],"ru":["Безопасные онлайн-платежи","Потоки платежей, соответствующие требованиям PCI","Checkout и подписки","Вебхуки и уведомления","Управление методами платежей","Сильная аутентификация клиента"],"ar":["دفع عبر الإنترنت آمن","تدفقات الدفع المطابق لPCI","الفاتورة والتسجيل","الويب هوك والتنبيهات","إدارة طرق الدفع","تحقق قوي من هوية العميل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Stripe集成","PCI合规","支付流程","结账","订阅","Webhook","退款","安全性","合规性"],"ja":["Stripe統合","PCIコンプライアンス","支払いフロー","チェックアウト","サブスクリプション","Webhook","返金","セキュリティ","コンプライアンス"],"ko":["스트라이프 통합","PCI 규정 준수","결제 흐름","체크아웃","구독","웹후크","환불","보안","규정 준수"],"es":["integración de Stripe","pagos seguros","PCI-compliant","procesamiento de pagos","suscripciones","reembolsos","SCA","desarrollo de aplicaciones","pagos en línea"],"fr":["intégration de Stripe","paiements sécurisés","PCI-compliant","traitement de paiements","abonnements","remboursements","SCA","développement d''applications","paiements en ligne"],"de":["Stripe-Integration","sichere Zahlungen","PCI-konforme","Zahlungsverarbeitung","Abonnements","Rückerstattungen","SCA","Anwendungsentwicklung","Online-Zahlungen"],"pt":["integração stripe","pagamento online","PCI-compliant","checkout","assinaturas","webhooks","refunds","desenvolvedores","pagamento seguro"],"ru":["интеграция stripe","онлайн-платежи","PCI-совместимый","checkout","подписки","вебхуки","возвраты","разработчики","безопасные платежи"],"ar":["تكامل سترايب","دفع عبر الإنترنت","مطابق لPCI","الفاتورة","التسجيل","الويب هوك","استرداد","مطورين","دفع آمن"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ugro","repoPath":"ollieb89/ugro","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"stripe-integration","description":"Implement Stripe payment processing for robust, PCI-compliant payment flows including checkout, subscriptions, and webhooks. Use when integrating Stripe payments, building subscription systems, or implementing secure checkout flows.","bodyPreview":"# Stripe Integration\n\nMaster Stripe payment processing integration for robust, PCI-compliant payment flows including checkout, subscriptions, webhooks, and refunds.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing payment processing in web/mobile applications\n- Setting up subscription billing systems\n- Handling one-time payments and recurring charges\n- Processing refunds and disputes\n- Managing customer payment methods\n- Implementing SCA (Strong Customer Authentication) for European payments\n- Buildin","body":"# Stripe Integration\n\nMaster Stripe payment processing integration for robust, PCI-compliant payment flows including checkout, subscriptions, webhooks, and refunds.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing payment processing in web/mobile applications\n- Setting up subscription billing systems\n- Handling one-time payments and recurring charges\n- Processing refunds and disputes\n- Managing customer payment methods\n- Implementing SCA (Strong Customer Authentication) for European payments\n- Building marketplace payment flows with Stripe Connect\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Payment Flows\n**Checkout Session (Hosted)**\n- Stripe-hosted payment page\n- Minimal PCI compliance burden\n- Fastest implementation\n- Supports one-time and recurring payments\n\n**Payment Intents (Custom UI)**\n- Full control over payment UI\n- Requires Stripe.js for PCI compliance\n- More complex implementation\n- Better customization options\n\n**Setup Intents (Save Payment Methods)**\n- Collect payment method without charging\n- Used for subscriptions and future payments\n- Requires customer confirmation\n\n### 2. Webhooks\n**Critical Events:**\n- `payment_intent.succeeded`: Payment completed\n- `payment_intent.payment_failed`: Payment failed\n- `customer.subscription.updated`: Subscription changed\n- `customer.subscription.deleted`: Subscription canceled\n- `charge.refunded`: Refund processed\n- `invoice.payment_succeeded`: Subscription payment successful\n\n### 3. Subscriptions\n**Components:**\n- **Product**: What you''re selling\n- **Price**: How much and how often\n- **Subscription**: Customer''s recurring payment\n- **Invoice**: Generated for each billing cycle\n\n### 4. Customer Management\n- Create and manage customer records\n- Store multiple payment methods\n- Track customer metadata\n- Manage billing details\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nimport stripe\n\nstripe.api_key = \"sk_test_...\"\n\n# Create a checkout session\nsession = stripe.checkout.Session.create(\n    payment_method_types=[''card''],\n    line_items=[{\n        ''price_data'': {\n            ''currency'': ''usd'',\n            ''product_data'': {\n                ''name'': ''Premium Subscription'',\n            },\n            ''unit_amount'': 2000,  # $20.00\n            ''recurring'': {\n                ''interval'': ''month'',\n            },\n        },\n        ''quantity'': 1,\n    }],\n    mode=''subscription'',\n    success_url=''https://yourdomain.com/success?session_id={CHECKOUT_SESSION_ID}'',\n    cancel_url=''https://yourdomain.com/cancel'',\n)\n\n# Redirect user to session.url\nprint(session.url)\n```\n\n## Payment Implementation Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: One-Time Payment (Hosted Checkout)\n```python\ndef create_checkout_session(amount, currency=''usd''):\n    \"\"\"Create a one-time payment checkout session.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        session = stripe.checkout.Session.create(\n            payment_method_types=[''card''],\n            line_items=[{\n                ''price_data'': {\n                    ''currency'': currency,\n                    ''product_data'': {\n                        ''name'': ''Purchase'',\n                        ''images'': [''https://example.com/product.jpg''],\n                    },\n                    ''unit_amount'': amount,  # Amount in cents\n                },\n                ''quantity'': 1,\n            }],\n            mode=''payment'',\n            success_url=''https://yourdomain.com/success?session_id={CHECKOUT_SESSION_ID}'',\n            cancel_url=''https://yourdomain.com/cancel'',\n            metadata={\n                ''order_id'': ''order_123'',\n                ''user_id'': ''user_456''\n            }\n        )\n        return session\n    except stripe.error.StripeError as e:\n        # Handle error\n        print(f\"Stripe error: {e.user_message}\")\n        raise\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Custom Payment Intent Flow\n```python\ndef create_payment_intent(amount, currency=''usd'', customer_id=None):\n    \"\"\"Create a payment intent for custom checkout UI.\"\"\"\n    intent = stripe.PaymentIntent.create(\n        amount=amount,\n        currency=currency,\n        customer=customer_id,\n        automatic_payment_methods={\n            ''enabled'': True,\n        },\n        metadata={\n            ''integration_check'': ''accept_a_payment''\n        }\n    )\n    return intent.client_secret  # Send to frontend\n\n# Frontend (JavaScript)\n\"\"\"\nconst stripe = Stripe(''pk_test_...'');\nconst elements = stripe.elements();\nconst cardElement = elements.create(''card'');\ncardElement.mount(''#card-element'');\n\nconst {error, paymentIntent} = await stripe.confirmCardPayment(\n    clientSecret,\n    {\n        payment_method: {\n            card: cardElement,\n            billing_details: {\n                name: ''Customer Name''\n            }\n        }\n    }\n);\n\nif (error) {\n    // Handle error\n} else if (paymentIntent.status === ''succeeded'') {\n    // Payment successful\n}\n\"\"\"\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Subscription Creation\n```python\ndef create_subscription(customer_id, price_id):\n    \"\"\"Create a subscription for a customer.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        subscription = stripe.Subscription.create(\n            customer=customer_id,\n            items=[{''price'': price_id}],\n            payment_behavior=''default_incomplete'',\n            payment_settings={''save_default_payment_method'': ''on_subscription''},\n            expand=[''latest_invoice.payment_intent''],\n        )\n\n        return {\n            ''subscription_id'': subscription.id,\n            ''client_secret'': subscription.latest_invoice.payment_intent.client_secret\n        }\n    except stripe.error.StripeError as e:\n        print(f\"Subscription creation failed: {e}\")\n        raise\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Customer Portal\n```python\ndef create_customer_portal_session(customer_id):\n    \"\"\"Create a portal session for customers to manage subscriptions.\"\"\"\n    session = stripe.billing_portal.Session.create(\n        customer=customer_id,\n        return_url=''https://yourdomain.com/account'',\n    )\n    return session.url  # Redirect customer here\n```\n\n## Webhook Handling\n\n### Secure Webhook Endpoint\n```python\nfrom flask import Flask, request\nimport stripe\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\nendpoint_secret = ''whsec_...''\n\n@app.route(''/webhook'', methods=[''POST''])\ndef webhook():\n    payload = request.data\n    sig_header = request.headers.get(''Stripe-Signature'')\n\n    try:\n        event = stripe.Webhook.construct_event(\n            payload, sig_header, endpoint_secret\n        )\n    except ValueError:\n        # Invalid payload\n        return ''Invalid payload'', 400\n    except stripe.error.SignatureVerificationError:\n        # Invalid signature\n        return ''Invalid signature'', 400\n\n    # Handle the event\n    if event[''type''] == ''payment_intent.succeeded'':\n        payment_intent = event[''data''][''object'']\n        handle_successful_payment(payment_intent)\n    elif event[''type''] == ''payment_intent.payment_failed'':\n        payment_intent = event[''data''][''object'']\n        handle_failed_payment(payment_intent)\n    elif event[''type''] == ''customer.subscription.deleted'':\n        subscription = event[''data''][''object'']\n        handle_subscription_canceled(subscription)\n\n    return ''Success'', 200\n\ndef handle_successful_payment(payment_intent):\n    \"\"\"Process successful payment.\"\"\"\n    customer_id = payment_intent.get(''customer'')\n    amount = payment_intent[''amount'']\n    metadata = payment_intent.get(''metadata'', {})\n\n    # Update your database\n    # Send confirmation email\n    # Fulfill order\n    print(f\"Payment succeeded: {payment_intent[''id'']}\")\n\ndef handle_failed_payment(payment_intent):\n    \"\"\"Handle failed payment.\"\"\"\n    error = payment_intent.get(''last_payment_error'', {})\n    print(f\"Payment failed: {error.get(''message'')}\")\n    # Notify customer\n    # Update order status\n\ndef handle_subscription_canceled(subscription):\n    \"\"\"Handle subscription cancellation.\"\"\"\n    customer_id = subscription[''customer'']\n    # Update user access\n    # Send cancellation email\n    print(f\"Subscription canceled: {subscription[''id'']}\")\n```\n\n### Webhook Best Practices\n```python\nimport hashlib\nimport hmac\n\ndef verify_webhook_signature(payload, signature, secret):\n    \"\"\"Manually verify webhook signature.\"\"\"\n    expected_sig = hmac.new(\n        secret.encode(''utf-8''),\n        payload,\n        hashlib.sha256\n    ).hexdigest()\n\n    return hmac.compare_digest(signature, expected_sig)\n\ndef handle_webhook_idempotently(event_id, handler):\n    \"\"\"Ensure webhook is processed exactly once.\"\"\"\n    # Check if event already processed\n    if is_event_processed(event_id):\n        return\n\n    # Process event\n    try:\n        handler()\n        mark_event_processed(event_id)\n    except Exception as e:\n        log_error(e)\n        # Stripe will retry failed webhooks\n        raise\n```\n\n## Customer Management\n\n```python\ndef create_customer(email, name, payment_method_id=None):\n    \"\"\"Create a Stripe customer.\"\"\"\n    customer = stripe.Customer.create(\n        email=email,\n        name=name,\n        payment_method=payment_method_id,\n        invoice_settings={\n            ''default_payment_method'': payment_method_id\n        } if payment_method_id else None,\n        metadata={\n            ''user_id'': ''12345''\n        }\n    )\n    return customer\n\ndef attach_payment_method(customer_id, payment_method_id):\n    \"\"\"Attach a payment method to a customer.\"\"\"\n    stripe.PaymentMethod.attach(\n        payment_method_id,\n        customer=customer_id\n    )\n\n    # Set as default\n    stripe.Customer.modify(\n        customer_id,\n        invoice_settings={\n            ''default_payment_method'': payment_method_id\n        }\n    )\n\ndef list_customer_payment_methods(customer_id):\n    \"\"\"List all payment methods for a customer.\"\"\"\n    payment_methods = stripe.PaymentMethod.list(\n        customer=customer_id,\n        type=''card''\n    )\n    return payment_methods.data\n```\n\n## Refund Handling\n\n```python\ndef create_refund(payment_intent_id, amount=None, reason=None):\n    \"\"\"Create a refund.\"\"\"\n    refund_params = {\n        ''payment_intent'': payment_intent_id\n    }\n\n    if amount:\n        refund_params[''amount''] = amount  # Partial refund\n\n    if reason:\n        refund_params[''reason''] = reason  # ''duplicate'', ''fraudulent'', ''requested_by_customer''\n\n    refund = stripe.Refund.create(**refund_params)\n    return refund\n\ndef handle_dispute(charge_id, evidence):\n    \"\"\"Update dispute with evidence.\"\"\"\n    stripe.Dispute.modify(\n        charge_id,\n        evidence={\n            ''customer_name'': evidence.get(''customer_name''),\n            ''customer_email_address'': evidence.get(''customer_email''),\n            ''shipping_documentation'': evidence.get(''shipping_proof''),\n            ''customer_communication'': evidence.get(''communication''),\n        }\n    )\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n```python\n# Use test mode keys\nstripe.api_key = \"sk_test_...\"\n\n# Test card numbers\nTEST_CARDS = {\n    ''success'': ''4242424242424242'',\n    ''declined'': ''4000000000000002'',\n    ''3d_secure'': ''4000002500003155'',\n    ''insufficient_funds'': ''4000000000009995''\n}\n\ndef test_payment_flow():\n    \"\"\"Test complete payment flow.\"\"\"\n    # Create test customer\n    customer = stripe.Customer.create(\n        email=\"test@example.com\"\n    )\n\n    # Create payment intent\n    intent = stripe.PaymentIntent.create(\n        amount=1000,\n        currency=''usd'',\n        customer=customer.id,\n        payment_method_types=[''card'']\n    )\n\n    # Confirm with test card\n    confirmed = stripe.PaymentIntent.confirm(\n        intent.id,\n        payment_method=''pm_card_visa''  # Test payment method\n    )\n\n    assert confirmed.status == ''succeeded''\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/checkout-flows.md**: Detailed checkout implementation\n- **references/webhook-handling.md**: Webhook security and processing\n- **references/subscription-management.md**: Subscription lifecycle\n- **references/customer-management.md**: Customer and payment method handling\n- **references/invoice-generation.md**: Invoicing and billing\n- **assets/stripe-client.py**: Production-ready Stripe client wrapper\n- **assets/webhook-handler.py**: Complete webhook processor\n- **assets/checkout-config.json**: Checkout configuration templates\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always Use Webhooks**: Don''t rely solely on client-side confirmation\n2. **Idempotency**: Handle webhook events idempotently\n3. **Error Handling**: Gracefully handle all Stripe errors\n4. **Test Mode**: Thoroughly test with test keys before production\n5. **Metadata**: Use metadata to link Stripe objects to your database\n6. **Monitoring**: Track payment success rates and errors\n7. **PCI Compliance**: Never handle raw card data on your server\n8. **SCA Ready**: Implement 3D Secure for European payments\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Not Verifying Webhooks**: Always verify webhook signatures\n- **Missing Webhook Events**: Handle all relevant webhook events\n- **Hardcoded Amounts**: Use cents/smallest currency unit\n- **No Retry Logic**: Implement retries for API calls\n- **Ignoring Test Mode**: Test all edge cases with test cards\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:30:39.850Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Commerce Agents needing PCI-compliant payment processing with subscription management and webhook handling.","zh":"非常适合需要符合PCI标准的支付处理、订阅管理和Webhook处理的商务代理。","ja":"PCI準拠の決済処理、サブスクリプション管理、Webhook処理を必要とするコマースエージェントに最適です。","ko":"PCI 규정을 준수하는 결제 처리, 구독 관리 및 웹훅 처리가 필요한 커머스 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio que necesitan procesamiento de pagos compatible con PCI con gestión de suscripciones y manejo de webhooks.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce ayant besoin d''un traitement de paiement conforme à la norme PCI avec une gestion d''abonnement et une gestion de webhooks.","de":"Perfekt für Handelsagenten, die PCI-konformen Zahlungsverkehr mit Abonnementverwaltung und Webhook-Verarbeitung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comércio que necessitam de processamento de pagamento compatível com o PCI, com gerenciamento de assinaturas e tratamento de webhooks.","ru":"Идеально для коммерческих агентов, которым необходима обработка платежей, соответствующая требованиям PCI, с управлением подписками и обработкой веб-хуков.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Commerce الذي يحتاج إلى معالجة الدفع المتوافقة مع معايير PCI مع إدارة الاشتراكات ومعالجة الويب هوك."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement Stripe''s complete payment ecosystem including checkout flows, recurring billing systems, and SCA-compliant European transactions through robust API integration and webhook verification.","zh":"通过强大的API集成和Webhook验证，使代理能够实施Stripe的完整支付生态系统，包括结账流程、循环计费系统和符合SCA标准的欧洲交易。","ja":"堅牢なAPI統合とWebhook検証を通じて、チェックアウトフロー、定期課金システム、SCA準拠の欧州取引を含むStripeの完全な決済エコシステムの実装をエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"강력한 API 통합 및 웹훅 검증을 통해 체크아웃 플로우, 반복 결제 시스템 및 SCA를 준수하는 유럽 결제를 포함한 Stripe의 완전한 결제 생태계 구현을 에이전트가 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar el ecosistema de pagos completo de Stripe, incluidos flujos de checkout, sistemas de facturación recurrente y transacciones europeas compatibles con la SCA a través de una integración de API robusta y verificación de webhooks.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre l''écosystème de paiement complet de Stripe, y compris les flux de checkout, les systèmes de facturation récurrente et les transactions européennes conformes à la SCA, grâce à une intégration d''API robuste et à une vérification de webhooks.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Stripes vollständiges Zahlungssystem zu implementieren, einschließlich Checkout-Fluss, wiederkehrender Rechnungssysteme und SCA-konformer europäischer Transaktionen durch robuste API-Integration und Webhook-Verifizierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar o ecossistema de pagamento completo da Stripe, incluindo fluxos de checkout, sistemas de faturação recorrente e transações europeias compatíveis com a SCA, por meio de integração robusta de API e verificação de webhooks.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать полный экосистему платежей Stripe, включая потоки оформления заказа, системы регулярного выставления счетов и европейские транзакции, соответствующие требованиям SCA, посредством прочной интеграции API и верификации веб-хуков.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تنفيذ نظام دفع كامل من ستрайب بما في ذلك عمليات الدفع، ونظام الفواتير المتكرر، والتعاملات الأوروبية المتوافقة مع معايير SCA من خلال دمج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات القوية وتأكيد الويب هوك."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing checkout flows for web applications","Setting up recurring subscription billing systems","Handling payment disputes and refund processing","Managing customer payment methods securely","Implementing Strong Customer Authentication for EU payments"],"zh":["为Web应用程序实施结账流程","设置循环订阅计费系统","处理支付争议和退款流程","安全管理客户支付方法","为欧盟支付实施强客户认证(SCA)"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションのチェックアウトフローの実装","定期サブスクリプション課金システムの設定","支払い紛争と返金処理の対応","顧客の決済方法の安全な管理","EU決済のための強力な顧客認証(SCA)の実装"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션용 체크아웃 플로우 구현","반복 구독 결제 시스템 설정","결제 분쟁 및 환불 처리","고객 결제 방법 안전하게 관리","EU 결제를 위한 강력한 고객 인증(SCA) 구현"],"es":["Implementar flujos de checkout para aplicaciones web","Configurar sistemas de facturación de suscripción recurrente","Manejar disputas de pago y procesamiento de reembolsos","Gestionar métodos de pago del cliente de forma segura","Implementar una autenticación de cliente sólida para pagos de la UE"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des flux de checkout pour les applications Web","Configurer des systèmes de facturation d''abonnement récurrent","Gérer les litiges de paiement et le traitement des remboursements","Gérer de manière sécurisée les méthodes de paiement des clients","Mettre en œuvre une authentification client solide pour les paiements de l''UE"],"de":["Implementierung von Checkout-Fluss für Webanwendungen","Einrichtung von Abonnement-Abrechnungssystemen","Handhabung von Zahlungsstreitigkeiten und Erstattungsverarbeitung","Sichere Verwaltung von Kundenzahlungsmethoden","Implementierung einer starken Kundenauthentifizierung für EU-Zahlungen"],"pt":["Implementação de fluxos de checkout para aplicações web","Configuração de sistemas de faturação de assinaturas recorrentes","Tratamento de disputas de pagamento e processamento de reembolsos","Gerenciamento de métodos de pagamento do cliente de forma segura","Implementação de Autenticação de Cliente F