 위한 React 라이브러리입니다. 조합 가능한 원시 형태를 제공하여 개발자가 사용자 지정 채팅 인터페이스를 빠르게 구축할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"assistant-ui es una biblioteca de React para construir interfaces de chat de IA con componentes personalizables. Permite crear interfaces de chat personaliza...","fr":"assistant-ui est une bibliothèque React pour construire des interfaces de chat d''IA avec des composants personnalisables. Elle permet de créer des interfaces...","de":"assistant-ui ist eine React-Bibliothek zum Erstellen von KI-Chat-Schnittstellen mit anpassbaren Komponenten. Sie ermöglicht das Erstellen benutzerdefinierter...","en":"Rethinking the User Interface of AI"},"definition":{"en":"Rethinking the User Interface of AI"},"features":{"zh":["可组合的原语","快速构建自定义聊天界面","支持 React","提供最新的 API 文档","核心架构和分层系统"],"ja":["組み合わせ可能なプリミティブ","カスタマイズされたチャットインターフェースの迅速な構築","React のサポート","最新の API ドキュメントの提供","コアアーキテクチャと分層システム"],"ko":["조합 가능한 원시 형태","사용자 지정 채팅 인터페이스의 빠른 구축","React 지원","최신 API 문서 제공","코어 아키텍처 및 계층 시스템"],"es":["Componentes personalizables para interfaces de chat","Arquitectura en capas para una mayor flexibilidad","Guía de selección de paquetes para una implementación óptima","Compatibilidad con la última API de assistant-ui","Documentación detallada para una integración sencilla"],"fr":["Composants personnalisables pour les interfaces de chat","Architecture en couches pour une plus grande flexibilité","Guide de sélection de packages pour une mise en œuvre optimale","Compatibilité avec la dernière API d''assistant-ui","Documentation détaillée pour une intégration simple"],"de":["Anpassbare Komponenten für KI-Chat-Schnittstellen","Schichtenarchitektur für eine größere Flexibilität","Paket-Auswahlleitfaden für eine optimale Implementierung","Kompatibilität mit der neuesten API von assistant-ui","Detaillierte Dokumentation für eine einfache Integration"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 聊天界面","React 库","可组合的原语","聊天界面构建","AI 交流","用户体验"],"ja":["AI チャットインターフェース","React ライブラリ","組み合わせ可能なプリミティブ","チャットインターフェース構築","AI 交流","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["AI 채팅 인터페이스","React 라이브러리","조합 가능한 원시 형태","채팅 인터페이스 구축","AI交流","사용자 경험"],"es":["assistant-ui","biblioteca de React","interfaces de chat de IA","componentes personalizables","arquitectura en capas","desarrollo de chatbots","IA y machine learning"],"fr":["assistant-ui","bibliothèque React","interfaces de chat d''IA","composants personnalisables","architecture en couches","développement de chatbots","IA et machine learning"],"de":["assistant-ui","React-Bibliothek","KI-Chat-Schnittstellen","anpassbare Komponenten","Schichtenarchitektur","Entwicklung von Chatbots","KI und Machine Learning"]}},"owner":"ThinkEx-OSS","repo":"thinkex","repoPath":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"assistant-ui","description":"Guide for assistant-ui library - AI chat UI components. Use when asking about architecture, debugging, or understanding the codebase.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nReact library for building AI chat interfaces with composable primitives.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/architecture.md](./references/architecture.md) -- Core architecture and layered system\n- [./references/packages.md](./references/packages.md) -- Package overview and selection guide\n\n## When to Use\n\n| Use Case | Best For |\n|----------|----------|\n| Chat UI from scratch | Full co","body":"# assistant-ui\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nReact library for building AI chat interfaces with composable primitives.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/architecture.md](./references/architecture.md) -- Core architecture and layered system\n- [./references/packages.md](./references/packages.md) -- Package overview and selection guide\n\n## When to Use\n\n| Use Case | Best For |\n|----------|----------|\n| Chat UI from scratch | Full control over UX |\n| Existing AI backend | Connects to any streaming backend |\n| Custom message types | Tools, images, files, custom parts |\n| Multi-thread apps | Built-in thread list management |\n| Production apps | Cloud persistence, auth, analytics |\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                  UI Components (Primitives)             │\n│    ThreadPrimitive, MessagePrimitive, ComposerPrimitive │\n└─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘\n                          │\n┌─────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────┐\n│                   Context Hooks                         │\n│   useAssistantApi, useAssistantState, useAssistantEvent │\n└─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘\n                          │\n┌─────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────┐\n│                    Runtime Layer                        │\n│  AssistantRuntime → ThreadRuntime → MessageRuntime      │\n└─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘\n                          │\n┌─────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────┐\n│                   Adapters/Backend                      │\n│   AI SDK · LangGraph · Custom · Cloud Persistence       │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Pick a Runtime\n\n```\nUsing AI SDK?\n├─ Yes → useChatRuntime (recommended)\n└─ No\n   ├─ External state (Redux/Zustand)? → useExternalStoreRuntime\n   ├─ LangGraph agent? → useLangGraphRuntime\n   ├─ AG-UI protocol? → useAgUiRuntime\n   ├─ A2A protocol? → useA2ARuntime\n   └─ Custom API → useLocalRuntime\n```\n\n## Core Packages\n\n| Package | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `@assistant-ui/react` | UI primitives & hooks |\n| `@assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk` | Vercel AI SDK v6 adapter |\n| `@assistant-ui/react-langgraph` | LangGraph adapter |\n| `@assistant-ui/react-markdown` | Markdown rendering |\n| `@assistant-ui/styles` | Pre-built CSS |\n| `assistant-stream` | Streaming protocol |\n| `assistant-cloud` | Cloud persistence |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```tsx\nimport { AssistantRuntimeProvider, Thread } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\nimport { useChatRuntime, AssistantChatTransport } from \"@assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk\";\n\nfunction App() {\n  const runtime = useChatRuntime({\n    transport: new AssistantChatTransport({ api: \"/api/chat\" }),\n  });\n  return (\n    <AssistantRuntimeProvider runtime={runtime}>\n      <Thread />\n    </AssistantRuntimeProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## State Access\n\n```tsx\nimport { useAssistantApi, useAssistantState } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nconst api = useAssistantApi();\napi.thread().append({ role: \"user\", content: [{ type: \"text\", text: \"Hi\" }] });\napi.thread().cancelRun();\n\nconst messages = useAssistantState(s => s.thread.messages);\nconst isRunning = useAssistantState(s => s.thread.isRunning);\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `/setup` - Installation and configuration\n- `/primitives` - UI component customization\n- `/runtime` - State management deep dive\n- `/tools` - Tool registration and UI\n- `/streaming` - Streaming protocols\n- `/cloud` - Persistence and auth\n- `/thread-list` - Multi-thread management\n- `/update` - Version updates and migrations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:31:13.139Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced chat interface customization with React and composable primitives.","zh":"非常适合需要使用React和组合原语进行高级聊天界面自定义的AI代理。","ja":"Reactと組み合わせ可能なプリミティブを使用した高度なチャットインターフェースのカスタマイズが必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 조합 가능한 원시 값을 사용하여 고급 채팅 인터페이스 사용자 지정이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una personalización avanzada de la interfaz de chat con React y primitivas componibles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une personnalisation avancée de l''interface de chat avec React et primitives componibles.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Anpassung der Chat-Schnittstelle mit React und komponierbaren Primitiven benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de personalização avançada de interface de chat com React e primitivos compostos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходима продвинутая настройка интерфейса чата с помощью React и составных примитивов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تحتاج إلى تخصيص متقدم لواجهة الدردشة باستخدام React والأمثلة الأولية القابلة للتأليف."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build AI chat interfaces with modular architecture and layered systems, utilizing React libraries and API references from assistant-ui.com/llms.txt for seamless integration and customization.","zh":"赋予代理构建AI聊天接口的能力，采用模块化架构和分层系统，利用React库和assistant-ui.com/llms.txt的API参考，以实现无缝集成和自定义。","ja":"モジュラーなアーキテクチャとレイヤードシステムを使用して、Reactライブラリとassistant-ui.com/llms.txtのAPIリファレンスを活用し、シームレスな統合とカスタマイズを実現することで、AIチャットインターフェースの構築を可能にします。","ko":"모듈식 아키텍처와 계층화된 시스템을 사용하여 React 라이브러리와 assistant-ui.com/llms.txt의 API 참조를 활용하여无缝한 통합과 사용자 지정이 가능하도록 하여 AI 채팅 인터페이스의 구축을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir interfaces de chat de IA con arquitectura modular y sistemas en capas, utilizando bibliotecas de React y referencias de API de assistant-ui.com/llms.txt para una integración y personalización sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des interfaces de chat d''IA avec une architecture modulaire et des systèmes en couches, en utilisant des bibliothèques React et des références d''API de assistant-ui.com/llms.txt pour une intégration et une personnalisation sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, KI-Chat-Schnittstellen mit modularer Architektur und schichtbasierten Systemen zu erstellen, indem React-Bibliotheken und API-Verweise von assistant-ui.com/llms.txt für eine nahtlose Integration und Anpassung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir interfaces de chat de IA com arquitetura modular e sistemas em camadas, utilizando bibliotecas React e referências de API do assistant-ui.com/llms.txt para integração e personalização sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интерфейсы чата ИИ с модульной архитектурой и системами слоев, используя библиотеки React и ссылки на API с assistant-ui.com/llms.txt для бесшовной интеграции и настройки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات دردشة ذكية مع هندسة معمارية متواصلة وأنظمةطبقية، باستخدام مكتبات React ومراجع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من assistant-ui.com/llms.txt من أجل التكامل والتخصيص السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Building chat UI from scratch with composable primitives","Implementing modular architecture for AI chat interfaces","Customizing AI chat interfaces with layered systems"],"zh":["从头开始使用组合原语构建聊天UI","为AI聊天接口实现模块化架构","使用分层系统自定义AI聊天接口"],"ja":["組み合わせ可能なプリミティブを使用してチャットUIをスクラッチから構築する","AIチャットインターフェースにモジュラーなアーキテクチャを実装する","レイヤードシステムを使用してAIチャットインターフェースをカスタマイズする"],"ko":["조합 가능한 원시 값을 사용하여 채팅 UI를 처음부터 구축하는 것","AI 채팅 인터페이스에 모듈식 아키텍처를 구현하는 것","계층화된 시스템을 사용하여 AI 채팅 인터페이스를 사용자 지정하는 것"],"es":["Construir la interfaz de chat desde cero con primitivas componibles","Implementar arquitectura modular para interfaces de chat de IA","Personalizar interfaces de chat de IA con sistemas en capas"],"fr":["Construire l''interface de chat à partir de zéro avec des primitives componibles","Mettre en œuvre une architecture modulaire pour les interfaces de chat d''IA","Personnaliser les interfaces de chat d''IA avec des systèmes en couches"],"de":["Chat-Benutzeroberfläche von Grund auf mit komponierbaren Primitiven erstellen","Modulare Architektur für KI-Chat-Schnittstellen implementieren","KI-Chat-Schnittstellen mit schichtbasierten Systemen anpassen"],"pt":["Construir interface de chat do zero com primitivos compostos","Implementar arquitetura modular para interfaces de chat de IA","Personalizar interfaces de chat de IA com sistemas em camadas"],"ru":["Создание интерфейса чата с нуля с помощью составных примитивов","Реализация модульной архитектуры для интерфейсов чата ИИ","Настройка интерфейсов чата ИИ с помощью систем слоев"],"ar":["بناء واجهة دردشة من الصفر مع الأمثلة الأولية القابلة للتأليف","تنفيذ هندسة معمارية متواصلة لأنظمة واجهة دردشة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تخصيص واجهات دردشة الذكاء الاصطناعي مع أنظمة الطبقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React library compatibility","Always consult assistant-ui.com/llms.txt for latest API"],"zh":["需要React库兼容性","请始终参考assistant-ui.com/llms.txt以获取最新的API"],"ja":["Reactライブラリの互換性が必要","最新のAPIを取得するために、常にassistant-ui.com/llms.txtを参照してください"],"ko":["React 라이브러리 호환성이 필요합니다","최신 API를 얻으려면 항상 assistant-ui.com/llms.txt를 참조하십시오"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con la biblioteca React","Consultar siempre assistant-ui.com/llms.txt para la última API"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité de la bibliothèque React","Consulter toujours assistant-ui.com/llms.txt pour la dernière API"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit der React-Bibliothek","Immer assistant-ui.com/llms.txt für die neueste API konsultieren"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com biblioteca React","Sempre consulte assistant-ui.com/llms.txt para obter a API mais recente"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с библиотекой React","Всегда консультируйтесь с assistant-ui.com/llms.txt для получения последней версии API"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع مكتبة React","استشر دائمًا assistant-ui.com/llms.txt للحصول على أحدث إصدار من واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
