s tests de bout en bout","Configuration personnalisable"],"de":["Ausführung von Einheitstests","Ausführung von Integrationstests","Kompatibilität mit Quarkus und Angular","Unterstützung für End-to-End-Tests","Anpassbare Konfiguration"],"pt":["Executa testes de unidade e integração para o backend Quarkus","Executa testes de ponta a ponta para o frontend Angular","Suporta testes de signup com Playwright","Permite personalizar a execução de testes com variáveis de ambiente","Integração com Maven para execução de testes","Suporta testes de frontend e backend"],"ru":["Выполняет модульные и интеграционные тесты для бэкенда Quarkus","Выполняет конечные тесты для фронтенда Angular","Поддерживает тесты регистрации с Playwright","Позволяет настраивать выполнение тестов с помощью переменных окружения","Интегрируется с Maven для выполнения тестов","Поддерживает тесты фронтенда и бэкенда"],"ar":["تشغيل الاختبارات الوحدوية والتكاملية للخلفية Quarkus","تشغيل الاختبارات النهاية إلى النهاية للواجهة الأمامية Angular","دعم اختبارات التسجيل مع Playwright","السماح بتعديل تشغيل الاختبارات باستخدام متغيرات البيئة","التكامل مع Maven لتشغيل الاختبارات","دعم اختبارات الواجهة الأمامية والخلفية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["run-tests","OAuth授权服务器","Angular前端测试","Quarkus后端测试","e2e测试","最简实现"],"ja":["run-tests","OAuth認証サーバー","Angularフロントエンドテスト","Quarkusバックエンドテスト","e2eテスト","最小の実装"],"ko":["run-tests","OAuth 인증 서버","Angular 프론트엔드 테스트","Quarkus 백엔드 테스트","e2e 테스트","최소한의 구현"],"es":["pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración","Quarkus","Angular","tests de software","run-tests","desarrollo de software","calidad del código"],"fr":["tests unitaires","tests d''intégration","Quarkus","Angular","tests de logiciel","run-tests","développement de logiciel","qualité du code"],"de":["Einheitstests","Integrationstests","Quarkus","Angular","Softwaretests","run-tests","Softwareentwicklung","Codequalität"],"pt":["run-tests","testes de unidade","testes de integração","testes de ponta a ponta","Quarkus","Angular","Playwright","Maven","desenvolvimento de software","testes de software"],"ru":["run-tests","модульные тесты","интеграционные тесты","конечные тесты","Quarkus","Angular","Playwright","Maven","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения"],"ar":["run-tests","اختبارات الوحدوية","اختبارات التكاملية","اختبارات النهاية إلى النهاية","Quarkus","Angular","Playwright","Maven","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"abstratium-dev","repo":"abstrauth","repoPath":"abstratium-dev/abstrauth","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"run-tests","description":"Runs unit and integration tests, Angular tests, and optionally also E2E tests.","bodyPreview":"# Run Tests\n\n## When to use this skill\nUse this skill when the user needs to run tests.\n\n## How to run tests\n1. Use `mvn test -DskipTests -DskipITs` to run just the Angular frontend tests.\n2. Use `mvn test` to run unit and integration tests of the Quarkus backend, as well as the Angular frontend tests.\n3. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=true PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx playwright test` in the `e2e-tests` directory to run the \"signup\" e2e tests.\n4. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=false PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx play","body":"# Run Tests\n\n## When to use this skill\nUse this skill when the user needs to run tests.\n\n## How to run tests\n1. Use `mvn test -DskipTests -DskipITs` to run just the Angular frontend tests.\n2. Use `mvn test` to run unit and integration tests of the Quarkus backend, as well as the Angular frontend tests.\n3. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=true PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx playwright test` in the `e2e-tests` directory to run the \"signup\" e2e tests.\n4. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=false PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx playwright test` in the `e2e-tests` directory to run the \"nosignup\" e2e tests.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:31:10.245Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated testing capabilities with Maven and Playwright","zh":"适用于需要使用Maven和Playwright进行自动化测试的开发代理","ja":"MavenおよびPlaywrightを使用した自動テスト機能を必要とする開発エージェントに適しています","ko":"Maven과 Playwright를 사용한 자동화된 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren capacidades de prueba automatizada con Maven y Playwright","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des capacités de test automatisé avec Maven et Playwright","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungagenten, die automatisierte Testfunktionen mit Maven und Playwright benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem capacidades de teste automatizado com Maven e Playwright","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированных возможностей тестирования с Maven и Playwright","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يتطلبون إمكانيات اختبار آلية مع Maven و Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute unit tests, integration tests, and end-to-end tests using Maven and Playwright, supporting protocols like OAuth and handling different test environments with variables like ALLOW_SIGNUP and PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN","zh":"赋予代理执行单元测试、集成测试和端到端测试的能力，使用Maven和Playwright，支持OAuth等协议，并使用ALLOW_SIGNUP和PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN等变量处理不同的测试环境","ja":"MavenおよびPlaywrightを使用して、ユニットテスト、統合テスト、エンドツーエンドテストを実行する機能をエージェントに付与します。OAuthなどのプロトコルをサポートし、ALLOW_SIGNUPやPLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPENなどの変数を使用して、さまざまなテスト環境を処理します","ko":"Maven과 Playwright를 사용하여 유닛 테스트, 통합 테스트, 엔드투엔드 테스트를 실행할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 부여합니다. OAuth와 같은 프로토콜을 지원하며, ALLOW_SIGNUP와 PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN과 같은 변수를 사용하여 다양한 테스트 환경을 처리합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar pruebas unitarias, pruebas de integración y pruebas de extremo a extremo utilizando Maven y Playwright, y admite protocolos como OAuth y maneja diferentes entornos de prueba con variables como ALLOW_SIGNUP y PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests unitaires, des tests d''intégration et des tests de bout en bout en utilisant Maven et Playwright, en prenant en charge des protocoles comme OAuth et en gérant différents environnements de test avec des variables comme ALLOW_SIGNUP et PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Einheitstests, IntegrationsTests und End-to-End-Tests mit Maven und Playwright auszuführen, unterstützt Protokolle wie OAuth und verwaltet verschiedene Testumgebungen mit Variablen wie ALLOW_SIGNUP und PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes unitários, testes de integração e testes de ponta a ponta usando Maven e Playwright, suportando protocolos como OAuth e lidando com diferentes ambientes de teste com variáveis como ALLOW_SIGNUP e PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять модульные тесты, тесты интеграции и тесты конечного результата, используя Maven и Playwright, поддерживая протоколы, такие как OAuth, и обрабатывая различные тестовые среды с переменными, такими как ALLOW_SIGNUP и PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل الاختبارات الموحدة واختبارات التكامل واختبارات النهاية إلى النهاية باستخدام Maven و Playwright، مع دعم بروتوكولات مثل OAuth ومعالجة بيئات الاختبار المختلفة مع متغيرات مثل ALLOW_SIGNUP و PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN"},"useCases":{"en":["Running Angular frontend tests with Maven","Executing Quarkus backend unit and integration tests","Performing end-to-end tests for signup functionality with Playwright"],"zh":["使用Maven运行Angular前端测试","执行Quarkus后端单元测试和集成测试","使用Playwright执行注册功能的端到端测试"],"ja":["Mavenを使用してAngularフロントエンドテストを実行する","Quarkusバックエンドのユニットテストと統合テストを実行する","Playwrightを使用してサインアップ機能のエンドツーエンドテストを実行する"],"ko":["Maven을 사용하여 Angular 프론트엔드 테스트를 실행하는 것","Quarkus 백엔드의 유닛 테스트와 통합 테스트를 실행하는 것","Playwright를 사용하여 회원 가입 기능의 엔드 투 엔드 테스트를 실행하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar pruebas frontend de Angular con Maven","Ejecutar pruebas unitarias y de integración de Quarkus backend","Realizar pruebas de extremo a extremo para la funcionalidad de registro con Playwright"],"fr":["Exécuter des tests frontend Angular avec Maven","Exécuter des tests unitaires et d''intégration de backend Quarkus","Effectuer des tests de bout en bout pour la fonctionnalité d''inscription avec Playwright"],"de":["Angular-Frontend-Tests mit Maven ausführen","Quarkus-Backend-Einheitstests und -IntegrationsTests ausführen","End-to-End-Tests für die Registrierungsfunktion mit Playwright durchführen"],"pt":["Execução de testes frontend Angular com Maven","Execução de testes unitários e de integração Quarkus backend","Realização de testes de ponta a ponta para funcionalidade de cadastro com Playwright"],"ru":["Выполнение тестов frontend Angular с Maven","Выполнение тестов unit и интеграции Quarkus backend","Проведение тестов конечного результата для функциональности регистрации с Playwright"],"ar":["تشغيل اختبارات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية Angular مع Maven","تشغيل اختبارات الوحدات واختبارات التكامل للخلفية Quarkus","إجراء اختبارات النهاية إلى النهاية للوظيفة التسجيلية مع Playwright"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Maven installation","Limited to specific test environments and configurations","Dependent on Playwright for end-to-end testing"],"zh":["需要Maven安装","仅限于特定的测试环境和配置","依赖Playwright进行端到端测试"],"ja":["Mavenのインストールが必要","特定のテスト環境と構成のみに限定される","エンドツーエンドテストにはPlaywrightに依存する"],"ko":["Maven 설치가 필요합니다","특정 테스트 환경 및 구성에만 제한됩니다","엔드 투 엔드 테스트는 Playwright에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Maven","Limitado a entornos de prueba y configuraciones específicas","Dependiente de Playwright para pruebas de extremo a extremo"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Maven","Limité à des environnements de test et des configurations spécifiques","Dépendant de Playwright pour les tests de bout en bout"],"de":["Benötigt Maven-Installation","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Testumgebungen und Konfigurationen","Abhängig von Playwright für End-to-End-Tests"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Maven","Limitado a ambientes de teste e configurações específicas","Dependente do Playwright para testes de ponta a ponta"],"ru":["Требует установки Maven","Ограничен конкретными тестовыми средами и конфигурациями","Зависит от Playwright для тестов конечного результата"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Maven","محدود بالبيئات وضبط الاختبار المحدد","يعتمد على Playwright لاختبارات النهاية إلى النهاية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
