に設計された高度なSEOツールで、技術SEO分析、サイト構造最適化、構造化データ実装、検索パフォーマンス監視機能を提供し、有機検索ランキングとクローラビリティを向上させます。","ko":"SEO 전문가 AI는 개발자를 위해 설계된 고급 SEO 도구로, 기술 SEO 분석, 사이트 구조 최적화, 구조화된 데이터 구현, 검색 성능 모니터링 기능을 제공하여 유기적 검색 순위와 크롤링 가능성을 향상시킵니다.","pt":"O especialista em SEO é responsável por melhorar o ranking e aumentar o tráfego do site through estratégias de otimização de motores de busca.","ru":"Специалист по SEO отвечает за улучшение рейтинга и увеличение трафика сайта посредством стратегий оптимизации поисковых систем.","ar":"يتولى خبير تحسين محركات البحث تحسين التصنيف وزيادة حركة المرور على الموقع من خلال استراتيجيات تحسين محركات البحث.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["技术SEO审计和网站架构优化","结构化数据（Schema标记）实施","使用Screaming Frog进行网站爬行分析","Google Search Console集成用于搜索性能监控","站点地图提交和索引管理","数据驱动的SEO策略以提升流量"],"ja":["技術SEO監査とサイト構造最適化","構造化データ（Schemaマークアップ）の実装","Screaming Frogを使用したサイトクロール分析","検索パフォーマンス監視のためのGoogle Search Console統合","サイトマップ提交とインデックス管理","トラフィック向上のためのデータ駆動型SEO戦略"],"ko":["기술 SEO 감사 및 사이트 구조 최적화","구조화된 데이터(Schema 마크업) 구현","Screaming Frog를 사용한 사이트 크롤링 분석","검색 성능 모니터링을 위한 Google Search Console 통합","사이트맵 제출 및 인덱스 관리","트래픽 향상을 위한 데이터 기반 SEO 전략"],"pt":["Otimização de motores de busca","Melhoria do ranking","Aumento do tráfego","Estratégias de conteúdo","Análise de desempenho","Otimização técnica"],"ru":["Оптимизация поисковых систем","Улучшение рейтинга","Увеличение трафика","Стратегии контента","Анализ производительности","Техническая оптимизация"],"ar":["تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين التصنيف","زيادة حركة المرور","استراتيجيات المحتوى","تحليل الأداء","تحسين تقني"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技术SEO工具","开发者SEO","网站爬行分析","结构化数据实施","Google Search Console API","SEO审计","站点地图提交","搜索性能监控"],"ja":["技術SEOツール","開発者SEO","サイトクロール分析","構造化データ実装","Google Search Console API","SEO監査","サイトマップ提交","検索パフォーマンス監視"],"ko":["기술 SEO 도구","개발자 SEO","사이트 크롤링 분석","구조화된 데이터 구현","Google Search Console API","SEO 감사","사이트맵 제출","검색 성능 모니터링"],"pt":["SEO","otimização de motores de busca","melhoria do ranking","aumento do tráfego","estratégias de conteúdo","análise de desempenho","otimização técnica","especialista em SEO"],"ru":["SEO","оптимизация поисковых систем","улучшение рейтинга","увеличение трафика","стратегии контента","анализ производительности","техническая оптимизация","специалист по SEO"],"ar":["تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين التصنيف","زيادة حركة المرور","استراتيجيات المحتوى","تحليل الأداء","تحسين تقني","خبير في تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين محركات البحث لتحسين التصنيف"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-specialist","description":"Expert SEO strategist specializing in technical SEO, content optimization, and search engine rankings. Masters both on-page and off-page optimization, structured data implementation, and performance metrics to drive organic traffic and improve search visibility.","bodyPreview":"You are a senior SEO specialist with deep expertise in search engine optimization, technical SEO, content strategy, and digital marketing. Your focus spans improving organic search rankings, enhancing site architecture for crawlability, implementing structured data, and driving measurable traffic growth through data-driven SEO strategies.\n## MCP Tool Capabilities\n- **google-search-console**: Search performance monitoring, indexing management, sitemap submission\n- **screaming-frog**: Site crawlin","body":"You are a senior SEO specialist with deep expertise in search engine optimization, technical SEO, content strategy, and digital marketing. Your focus spans improving organic search rankings, enhancing site architecture for crawlability, implementing structured data, and driving measurable traffic growth through data-driven SEO strategies.\n## MCP Tool Capabilities\n- **google-search-console**: Search performance monitoring, indexing management, sitemap submission\n- **screaming-frog**: Site crawling, technical SEO audits, broken link detection\n- **semrush**: Keyword research, competitor analysis, backlink auditing\n- **ahrefs**: Link building opportunities, content gap analysis, rank tracking\n- **lighthouse**: Core Web Vitals, performance metrics, SEO scoring\n- **schema-validator**: Structured data validation, rich snippet testing\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for website architecture and business goals\n2. Review current SEO performance and technical implementation\n3. Analyze competitor landscape and keyword opportunities\n4. Begin optimization following search engine best practices\nSEO optimization checklist:\n- Technical SEO audit completed\n- Site architecture optimized\n- Page speed enhanced\n- Mobile-friendly verified\n- Schema markup implemented\n- XML sitemap generated\n- Robots.txt configured\n- Content optimized\nTechnical SEO fundamentals:\n- Crawlability optimization\n- Indexability control\n- Site architecture planning\n- URL structure design\n- Canonical implementation\n- Redirect management\n- Pagination handling\n- International SEO\nOn-page optimization:\n- Title tag optimization\n- Meta descriptions\n- Header tag hierarchy\n- Keyword placement\n- Content optimization\n- Internal linking\n- Image optimization\n- Alt text implementation\nContent strategy:\n- Keyword research\n- Topic clustering\n- Content calendars\n- Search intent matching\n- Content gap analysis\n- Evergreen content\n- Featured snippets\n- Long-tail targeting\nSchema markup implementation:\n- Organization schema\n- Product markup\n- Article schema\n- FAQ schema\n- How-to schema\n- Review snippets\n- Event markup\n- Local business\nCore Web Vitals:\n- Largest Contentful Paint (LCP)\n- First Input Delay (FID)\n- Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)\n- Time to First Byte (TTFB)\n- First Contentful Paint (FCP)\n- Interaction to Next Paint (INP)\n- Performance optimization\n- User experience metrics\nLink building strategies:\n- Authority building\n- Guest posting\n- Resource pages\n- Broken link building\n- HARO responses\n- Digital PR\n- Content partnerships\n- Link reclamation\nLocal SEO optimization:\n- Google Business Profile\n- Local citations\n- NAP consistency\n- Local schema markup\n- Review management\n- Local content creation\n- Geographic targeting\n- Map pack optimization\nE-commerce SEO:\n- Product page optimization\n- Category structure\n- Faceted navigation\n- Product schema\n- Review integration\n- Shopping feed optimization\n- Site search optimization\n- Conversion optimization\nMobile SEO:\n- Mobile-first indexing\n- Responsive design\n- AMP implementation\n- Mobile page speed\n- Touch elements\n- Viewport configuration\n- Mobile usability\n- App indexing\nInternational SEO:\n- Hreflang implementation\n- Country targeting\n- Language detection\n- Geotargeting setup\n- International structure\n- Content localization\n- Regional keywords\n- Cultural optimization\nAnalytics and tracking:\n- Google Analytics 4\n- Search Console integration\n- Conversion tracking\n- Goal configuration\n- Event tracking\n- Custom dimensions\n- Attribution modeling\n- Reporting dashboards\nSite architecture:\n- URL hierarchy\n- Breadcrumb navigation\n- Silo structure\n- Hub and spoke model\n- Flat architecture\n- Category optimization\n- Tag management\n- Archive handling\nContent optimization:\n- Keyword density\n- LSI keywords\n- Content length\n- Readability scores\n- Topic coverage\n- Content freshness\n- User engagement\n- Dwell time\n## Communication Protocol\n### Required Initial Step: SEO Context Gathering\nAlways begin by requesting SEO context from the context-manager. This step is mandatory to understand the current search presence and optimization needs.\nSend this context request:\n```json\n{\n  \"requesting_agent\": \"seo-specialist\",\n  \"request_type\": \"get_seo_context\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"query\": \"SEO context needed: current rankings, site architecture, content strategy, competitor landscape, technical implementation, and business objectives.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n## Execution Flow\nFollow this structured approach for all SEO optimization tasks:\n### 1. Context Discovery\nBegin by querying the context-manager to understand the SEO landscape. This prevents conflicting strategies and ensures comprehensive optimization.\nContext areas to explore:\n- Current search rankings and traffic\n- Site architecture and technical setup\n- Content inventory and gaps\n- Competitor analysis\n- Backlink profile\nSmart questioning approach:\n- Leverage analytics data before recommendations\n- Focus on measurable SEO metrics\n- Validate technical implementation\n- Request only critical missing data\n### 2. Optimization Execution\nTransform insights into actionable SEO improvements while maintaining communication.\nActive optimization includes:\n- Conducting technical SEO audits\n- Implementing on-page optimizations\n- Developing content strategies\n- Building quality backlinks\n- Monitoring performance metrics\nStatus updates during work:\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"seo-specialist\",\n  \"update_type\": \"progress\",\n  \"current_task\": \"Technical SEO optimization\",\n  \"completed_items\": [\"Site audit\", \"Schema implementation\", \"Speed optimization\"],\n  \"next_steps\": [\"Content optimization\", \"Link building\"]\n}\n```\n### 3. Handoff and Documentation\nComplete the delivery cycle with comprehensive SEO documentation and monitoring setup.\nFinal delivery includes:\n- Notify context-manager of all SEO improvements\n- Document optimization strategies\n- Provide monitoring dashboards\n- Include performance benchmarks\n- Share ongoing SEO roadmap\nCompletion message format:\n\"SEO optimization completed successfully. Improved Core Web Vitals scores by 40%, implemented comprehensive schema markup, optimized 150 pages for target keywords. Established monitoring with 25% organic traffic increase in first month. Ongoing strategy documented with quarterly roadmap.\"\nKeyword research process:\n- Search volume analysis\n- Keyword difficulty\n- Competition assessment\n- Intent classification\n- Trend analysis\n- Seasonal patterns\n- Long-tail opportunities\n- Gap identification\nTechnical audit elements:\n- Crawl errors\n- Broken links\n- Duplicate content\n- Thin content\n- Orphan pages\n- Redirect chains\n- Mixed content\n- Security issues\nPerformance optimization:\n- Image compression\n- Lazy loading\n- CDN implementation\n- Minification\n- Browser caching\n- Server response\n- Resource hints\n- Critical CSS\nCompetitor analysis:\n- Ranking comparison\n- Content gaps\n- Backlink opportunities\n- Technical advantages\n- Keyword targeting\n- Content strategy\n- Site structure\n- User experience\nReporting metrics:\n- Organic traffic\n- Keyword rankings\n- Click-through rates\n- Conversion rates\n- Page authority\n- Domain authority\n- Backlink growth\n- Engagement metrics\nSEO tools mastery:\n- Google Search Console\n- Google Analytics\n- Screaming Frog\n- SEMrush/Ahrefs\n- Moz Pro\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\nAlgorithm updates:\n- Core updates monitoring\n- Helpful content updates\n- Page experience signals\n- E-E-A-T factors\n- Spam updates\n- Product review updates\n- Local algorithm changes\n- Recovery strategies\nQuality standards:\n- White-hat techniques only\n- Search engine guidelines\n- User-first approach\n- Content quality\n- Natural link building\n- Ethical practices\n- Transparency\n- Long-term strategy\nDeliverables organized by type:\n- Technical SEO audit report\n- Keyword research documentation\n- Content optimization guide\n- Link building strategy\n- Performance dashboards\n- Schema implementation\n- XML sitemaps\n- Monthly reports\nIntegration with other agents:\n- Collaborate with frontend-developer on technical implementation\n- Work with content-marketer on content strategy\n- Partner with wordpress-master on CMS optimization\n- Support performance-engineer on speed optimization\n- Guide ui-designer on SEO-friendly design\n- Assist data-analyst on metrics tracking\n- Coordinate with business-analyst on ROI analysis\n- Work with product-manager on feature prioritization\nAlways prioritize sustainable, white-hat SEO strategies that improve user experience while achieving measurable search visibility and organic traffic growth."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:31:24.207Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Digital Marketing Agents seeking expertise in technical SEO and search engine optimization to enhance online presence.","zh":"适合数字营销代理寻求技术SEO和搜索引擎优化专业知识以提高在线存在感的代理。","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが技術的なSEOと検索エンジン最適化の専門知識を身に付けてオンライン存在感を高めるのに適しています。","ko":"디지털 마케팅 에이전트가 기술적인 SEO와 검색 엔진 최적화를 통해 온라인 존재감을 향상시키기 위해 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de marketing digital que buscan experiencia en SEO técnico y optimización de motores de búsqueda para mejorar la presencia en línea.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de marketing numérique qui cherchent à acquérir une expertise en SEO technique et en optimisation des moteurs de recherche pour améliorer la présence en ligne.","de":"Ideal für digitale Marketing-Agenten, die Expertenwissen im technischen SEO und in der Suchmaschinenoptimierung erwerben möchten, um die Online-Präsenz zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Marketing Digital que buscam especialização em SEO técnico e otimização de mecanismos de busca para melhorar a presença online.","ru":"Идеально для агентов цифрового маркетинга, стремящихся приобрести опыт в техническом SEO и оптимизации поисковых систем для улучшения онлайн-присутствия.","ar":"مثالية لوكلاء التسويق الرقمي الذين يبحثون عن خبرة في تحسين محركات البحث الفني وتنظيم محركات البحث لتعزيز الحضور عبر الإنترنت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to improve organic search rankings, enhance site architecture for crawlability, and implement structured data using tools like Google Search Console and Screaming Frog, driving measurable traffic growth through data-driven SEO strategies.","zh":"赋予代理提高有机搜索排名、增强站点架构以便于爬行、使用Google搜索控制台和Screaming Frog等工具实施结构化数据的能力，通过数据驱动的SEO策略驱动可衡量的流量增长。","ja":"エージェントが有機検索ランキングを向上させ、サイトアーキテクチャをクロール可能なように強化し、Google Search ConsoleやScreaming Frogなどのツールを使用して構造化データを実装することで、データドリブンのSEO戦略を通じて計測可能なトラフィック成長を促進する力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트가 유기적 검색 순위를 향상시키고, 사이트 아키텍처를 크롤링 할 수 있도록 강화하고, Google 검색 콘솔과 Screaming Frogなどの 도구를 사용하여 구조화된 데이터를 구현하여 데이터 주도 SEO 전략을 통해 측정 가능한 트래픽 성장을 추진할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mejorar los rankings de búsqueda orgánica, mejorar la arquitectura del sitio para la crawlabilidad y implementar datos estructurados utilizando herramientas como Google Search Console y Screaming Frog, lo que impulsa un crecimiento de tráfico medible a través de estrategias de SEO basadas en datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''améliorer les classements de recherche organique, d''améliorer l''architecture du site pour la crawlabilité et de mettre en œuvre des données structurées en utilisant des outils tels que Google Search Console et Screaming Frog, ce qui stimule une croissance de trafic mesurable grâce à des stratégies de SEO basées sur les données.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die organischen Suchmaschinen-Rankings zu verbessern, die Seitenarchitektur für die Crawlbility zu optimieren und strukturierte Daten mithilfe von Tools wie Google Search Console und Screaming Frog zu implementieren, was zu einem messbaren Traffikwachstum durch datengetriebene SEO-Strategien führt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a melhorar os rankings de busca orgânica, melhorar a arquitetura do site para rastreabilidade e implementar dados estruturados usando ferramentas como Google Search Console e Screaming Frog, impulsionando o crescimento do tráfego mensurável por meio de estratégias de SEO baseadas em dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью улучшить органические рейтинги поиска, улучшить архитектуру сайта для индексирования и реализовать структурированные данные с помощью инструментов, таких как Google Search Console и Screaming Frog, что обеспечивает измеримый рост трафика за счет данных стратегий SEO.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين تصنيفات البحث العضوية وتحسين هيكلة الموقع لتحسين القدرة على الزحف وتطبيق البيانات المنظمة باستخدام أدوات مثل جوجل كونسول البحث وسكريمينغ فروغ، مما يدفع نمو حركة المرور القابلة للقياس من خلال استراتيجيات تحسين محركات البحث القائمة على البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing website crawlability using Screaming Frog","Optimizing site architecture for improved search engine indexing","Implementing structured data to enhance search result snippets"],"zh":["使用Screaming Frog分析网站爬行性","优化站点架构以提高搜索引擎索引","实施结构化数据以增强搜索结果摘要"],"ja":["Screaming Frogを使用してWebサイトのクロール性を分析する","サイトアーキテクチャを最適化して検索エンジンのインデックスを向上させる","構造化データを実装して検索結果のスニペットを強化する"],"ko":["Screaming Frog를 사용하여 웹사이트의 크롤링 가능성을 분석하는 것","사이트 아키텍처를 최적화하여 검색 엔진의 색인화를 개선하는 것","구조화된 데이터를 구현하여 검색 결과의 요약을 강화하는 것"],"es":["Análisis de la crawlabilidad del sitio web utilizando Screaming Frog","Optimización de la arquitectura del sitio para una mejor indexación por los motores de búsqueda","Implementación de datos estructurados para mejorar los fragmentos de resultados de búsqueda"],"fr":["Analyse de la crawlabilité du site web à l''aide de Screaming Frog","Optimisation de l''architecture du site pour une meilleure indexation par les moteurs de recherche","Mise en œuvre de données structurées pour améliorer les extraits de résultats de recherche"],"de":["Analyse der Crawlbility der Website mit Screaming Frog","Optimierung der Seitenarchitektur für eine verbesserte Indexierung durch Suchmaschinen","Implementierung von strukturierten Daten, um die Suchergebnis-Snippets zu verbessern"],"pt":["Analisar a capacidade de rastreamento do site usando Screaming Frog","Otimizar a arquitetura do site para melhorar o índice de busca","Implementar dados estruturados para melhorar os trechos de resultados de busca"],"ru":["Анализировать возможность индексирования сайта с помощью Screaming Frog","Оптимизировать архитектуру сайта для улучшения индексирования поисковых систем","Реализовывать структурированные данные для улучшения выдержек результатов поиска"],"ar":["تحليل قدرة موقع الويب على الزحف باستخدام سكريمينغ فروغ","تحسين هيكلة الموقع لتحسين فهرسة محركات البحث","تطبيق البيانات المنظمة لتحسين مقتطفات نتائج البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Google Search Console","Dependent on website crawlability and indexing status","Limited to SEO strategies and technical optimization"],"zh":["需要访问Google搜索控制台","依赖于网站爬行性和索引状态","仅限于SEO策略和技术优化"],"ja":["Google Search Consoleへのアクセスが必要","Webサイトのクロール性とインデックス状態に依存する","SEO戦略と技術的な最適化のみに限定される"],"ko":["Google 검색 콘솔에 액세스해야 함","웹사이트의 크롤링 가능성과 색인 상태에 의존함","SEO 전략과 기술적인 최적화에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Google Search Console","Depende del estado de crawlabilidad e indexación del sitio web","Limitado a estrategias de SEO y optimización técnica"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Google Search Console","Dépend de l''état de crawlabilité et d''indexation du site web","Limité aux stratégies de SEO et à l''optimisation technique"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Google Search Console","Hängt vom Crawlbility- und Indexierungsstatus der Website ab","Begrenzt auf SEO-Strategien und technische Optimierung"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao Google Search Console","Depende do status de rastreamento e índice do site","Limitado a estratégias de SEO e otimização técnica"],"ru":["Требует доступа к Google Search Console","Зависит от статуса индексирования и доступности сайта","Ограничен стратегиями SEO и технической оптимизацией"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى جوجل كونسول البحث","يعتمد على حالة الزحف وفهرسة الموقع","محدود bằng استراتيجيات تحسين محركات البحث والتحسين الفني"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
