impagos de manera eficiente","fr":"Automatisez les systèmes de facturation pour mettre en œuvre des prélèvements récurrents et gérer les impayés de manière efficace","de":"Automatisieren Sie Rechnungssysteme, um wiederkehrende Abbuchungen durchzuführen und Mahnungen effizient zu verwalten","pt":"A Automação de Faturamento é uma habilidade que permite implementar sistemas de faturamento automatizados para gerenciar assinaturas de SaaS e processar paga...","ru":"Автоматизация выставления счетов - это навык, который позволяет реализовать автоматизированные системы выставления счетов для управления подписками SaaS и об...","ar":"أتمتة الفواتير هي مهارة تسمح بتنفيذ أنظمة tự độngة للفواتير لإدارة الاشتراكات SaaS ومعالجة المدفوعات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["循环账单","发票生成","催收管理","比例计算","税费计算"],"ja":["繰り返し請求","請求書の生成","督促管理","比例計算","税金計算"],"ko":["반복 청구","청구서 생성","독촉 관리","비율 계산","세금 계산"],"es":["Facturación recurrente","Generación de facturas","Gestión de impagos","Cálculo de impuestos","Cobro basado en el uso","Gestión de ciclos de facturación"],"fr":["Facturation récurrente","Génération de factures","Gestion des impayés","Calcul des taxes","Prélèvement basé sur l''utilisation","Gestion des cycles de facturation"],"de":["Wiederkehrende Rechnungsstellung","Rechnungserstellung","Mahnwesen","Steuerechner","Verbrauchsabhängige Abbuchung","Rechnungskreisverwaltung"],"pt":["Faturamento recorrente","Geração de faturas","Gerenciamento de dunning","Cálculo de proration","Cálculo de impostos"],"ru":["Рекуррентное выставление счетов","Генерация счетов","Управление дunning","Расчет прорейта","Расчет налогов"],"ar":["الفواتير المتكررة","إنشاء الفواتير","إدارة دunning","حساب Прорейт","حساب الضرائب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自动化账单系统","循环账单","发票生成","催收管理","比例计算","税费计算","SaaS订阅计费"],"ja":["請求自動化システム","繰り返し請求","請求書の生成","督促管理","比例計算","税金計算","SaaSサブスクリプション請求"],"ko":["자동화 청구 시스템","반복 청구","청구서 생성","독촉 관리","비율 계산","세금 계산","SaaS 구독 청구"],"es":["automatización de facturación","facturación recurrente","generación de facturas","gestión de impagos","cálculo de impuestos","cobro basado en el uso","desarrollo de software","soluciones de facturación"],"fr":["automatisation de la facturation","facturation récurrente","génération de factures","gestion des impayés","calcul des taxes","prélèvement basé sur l''utilisation","développement de logiciels","solutions de facturation"],"de":["Rechnungsautomatisierung","wiederkehrende Rechnungsstellung","Rechnungserstellung","Mahnwesen","Steuerechner","Verbrauchsabhängige Abbuchung","Software-Entwicklung","Rechnungslösungen"],"pt":["automação de faturamento","faturamento recorrente","gerenciamento de pagamentos","assinaturas de SaaS","geração de faturas","cálculo de impostos"],"ru":["автоматизация выставления счетов","рекуррентное выставление счетов","управление платежами","подписки SaaS","генерация счетов","расчет налогов"],"ar":["أتمتة الفواتير","الفواتير المتكررة","إدارة المدفوعات","الاشتراكات SaaS","إنشاء الفواتير","حساب الضرائب"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ml_challenges","repoPath":"ollieb89/ml_challenges","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"billing-automation","description":"Build automated billing systems for recurring payments, invoicing, subscription lifecycle, and dunning management. Use when implementing subscription billing, automating invoicing, or managing recurring payment systems.","bodyPreview":"# Billing Automation\n\nMaster automated billing systems including recurring billing, invoice generation, dunning management, proration, and tax calculation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing SaaS subscription billing\n- Automating invoice generation and delivery\n- Managing failed payment recovery (dunning)\n- Calculating prorated charges for plan changes\n- Handling sales tax, VAT, and GST\n- Processing usage-based billing\n- Managing billing cycles and renewals\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Bill","body":"# Billing Automation\n\nMaster automated billing systems including recurring billing, invoice generation, dunning management, proration, and tax calculation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing SaaS subscription billing\n- Automating invoice generation and delivery\n- Managing failed payment recovery (dunning)\n- Calculating prorated charges for plan changes\n- Handling sales tax, VAT, and GST\n- Processing usage-based billing\n- Managing billing cycles and renewals\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Billing Cycles\n**Common Intervals:**\n- Monthly (most common for SaaS)\n- Annual (discounted long-term)\n- Quarterly\n- Weekly\n- Custom (usage-based, per-seat)\n\n### 2. Subscription States\n```\ntrial → active → past_due → canceled\n              → paused → resumed\n```\n\n### 3. Dunning Management\nAutomated process to recover failed payments through:\n- Retry schedules\n- Customer notifications\n- Grace periods\n- Account restrictions\n\n### 4. Proration\nAdjusting charges when:\n- Upgrading/downgrading mid-cycle\n- Adding/removing seats\n- Changing billing frequency\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom billing import BillingEngine, Subscription\n\n# Initialize billing engine\nbilling = BillingEngine()\n\n# Create subscription\nsubscription = billing.create_subscription(\n    customer_id=\"cus_123\",\n    plan_id=\"plan_pro_monthly\",\n    billing_cycle_anchor=datetime.now(),\n    trial_days=14\n)\n\n# Process billing cycle\nbilling.process_billing_cycle(subscription.id)\n```\n\n## Subscription Lifecycle Management\n\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\nfrom enum import Enum\n\nclass SubscriptionStatus(Enum):\n    TRIAL = \"trial\"\n    ACTIVE = \"active\"\n    PAST_DUE = \"past_due\"\n    CANCELED = \"canceled\"\n    PAUSED = \"paused\"\n\nclass Subscription:\n    def __init__(self, customer_id, plan, billing_cycle_day=None):\n        self.id = generate_id()\n        self.customer_id = customer_id\n        self.plan = plan\n        self.status = SubscriptionStatus.TRIAL\n        self.current_period_start = datetime.now()\n        self.current_period_end = self.current_period_start + timedelta(days=plan.trial_days or 30)\n        self.billing_cycle_day = billing_cycle_day or self.current_period_start.day\n        self.trial_end = datetime.now() + timedelta(days=plan.trial_days) if plan.trial_days else None\n\n    def start_trial(self, trial_days):\n        \"\"\"Start trial period.\"\"\"\n        self.status = SubscriptionStatus.TRIAL\n        self.trial_end = datetime.now() + timedelta(days=trial_days)\n        self.current_period_end = self.trial_end\n\n    def activate(self):\n        \"\"\"Activate subscription after trial or immediately.\"\"\"\n        self.status = SubscriptionStatus.ACTIVE\n        self.current_period_start = datetime.now()\n        self.current_period_end = self.calculate_next_billing_date()\n\n    def mark_past_due(self):\n        \"\"\"Mark subscription as past due after failed payment.\"\"\"\n        self.status = SubscriptionStatus.PAST_DUE\n        # Trigger dunning workflow\n\n    def cancel(self, at_period_end=True):\n        \"\"\"Cancel subscription.\"\"\"\n        if at_period_end:\n            self.cancel_at_period_end = True\n            # Will cancel when current period ends\n        else:\n            self.status = SubscriptionStatus.CANCELED\n            self.canceled_at = datetime.now()\n\n    def calculate_next_billing_date(self):\n        \"\"\"Calculate next billing date based on interval.\"\"\"\n        if self.plan.interval == ''month'':\n            return self.current_period_start + timedelta(days=30)\n        elif self.plan.interval == ''year'':\n            return self.current_period_start + timedelta(days=365)\n        elif self.plan.interval == ''week'':\n            return self.current_period_start + timedelta(days=7)\n```\n\n## Billing Cycle Processing\n\n```python\nclass BillingEngine:\n    def process_billing_cycle(self, subscription_id):\n        \"\"\"Process billing for a subscription.\"\"\"\n        subscription = self.get_subscription(subscription_id)\n\n        # Check if billing is due\n        if datetime.now() < subscription.current_period_end:\n            return\n\n        # Generate invoice\n        invoice = self.generate_invoice(subscription)\n\n        # Attempt payment\n        payment_result = self.charge_customer(\n            subscription.customer_id,\n            invoice.total\n        )\n\n        if payment_result.success:\n            # Payment successful\n            invoice.mark_paid()\n            subscription.advance_billing_period()\n            self.send_invoice(invoice)\n        else:\n            # Payment failed\n            subscription.mark_past_due()\n            self.start_dunning_process(subscription, invoice)\n\n    def generate_invoice(self, subscription):\n        \"\"\"Generate invoice for billing period.\"\"\"\n        invoice = Invoice(\n            customer_id=subscription.customer_id,\n            subscription_id=subscription.id,\n            period_start=subscription.current_period_start,\n            period_end=subscription.current_period_end\n        )\n\n        # Add subscription line item\n        invoice.add_line_item(\n            description=subscription.plan.name,\n            amount=subscription.plan.amount,\n            quantity=subscription.quantity or 1\n        )\n\n        # Add usage-based charges if applicable\n        if subscription.has_usage_billing:\n            usage_charges = self.calculate_usage_charges(subscription)\n            invoice.add_line_item(\n                description=\"Usage charges\",\n                amount=usage_charges\n            )\n\n        # Calculate tax\n        tax = self.calculate_tax(invoice.subtotal, subscription.customer)\n        invoice.tax = tax\n\n        invoice.finalize()\n        return invoice\n\n    def charge_customer(self, customer_id, amount):\n        \"\"\"Charge customer using saved payment method.\"\"\"\n        customer = self.get_customer(customer_id)\n\n        try:\n            # Charge using payment processor\n            charge = stripe.Charge.create(\n                customer=customer.stripe_id,\n                amount=int(amount * 100),  # Convert to cents\n                currency=''usd''\n            )\n\n            return PaymentResult(success=True, transaction_id=charge.id)\n        except stripe.error.CardError as e:\n            return PaymentResult(success=False, error=str(e))\n```\n\n## Dunning Management\n\n```python\nclass DunningManager:\n    \"\"\"Manage failed payment recovery.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.retry_schedule = [\n            {''days'': 3, ''email_template'': ''payment_failed_first''},\n            {''days'': 7, ''email_template'': ''payment_failed_reminder''},\n            {''days'': 14, ''email_template'': ''payment_failed_final''}\n        ]\n\n    def start_dunning_process(self, subscription, invoice):\n        \"\"\"Start dunning process for failed payment.\"\"\"\n        dunning_attempt = DunningAttempt(\n            subscription_id=subscription.id,\n            invoice_id=invoice.id,\n            attempt_number=1,\n            next_retry=datetime.now() + timedelta(days=3)\n        )\n\n        # Send initial failure notification\n        self.send_dunning_email(subscription, ''payment_failed_first'')\n\n        # Schedule retries\n        self.schedule_retries(dunning_attempt)\n\n    def retry_payment(self, dunning_attempt):\n        \"\"\"Retry failed payment.\"\"\"\n        subscription = self.get_subscription(dunning_attempt.subscription_id)\n        invoice = self.get_invoice(dunning_attempt.invoice_id)\n\n        # Attempt payment again\n        result = self.charge_customer(subscription.customer_id, invoice.total)\n\n        if result.success:\n            # Payment succeeded\n            invoice.mark_paid()\n            subscription.status = SubscriptionStatus.ACTIVE\n            self.send_dunning_email(subscription, ''payment_recovered'')\n            dunning_attempt.mark_resolved()\n        else:\n            # Still failing\n            dunning_attempt.attempt_number += 1\n\n            if dunning_attempt.attempt_number < len(self.retry_schedule):\n                # Schedule next retry\n                next_retry_config = self.retry_schedule[dunning_attempt.attempt_number]\n                dunning_attempt.next_retry = datetime.now() + timedelta(days=next_retry_config[''days''])\n                self.send_dunning_email(subscription, next_retry_config[''email_template''])\n            else:\n                # Exhausted retries, cancel subscription\n                subscription.cancel(at_period_end=False)\n                self.send_dunning_email(subscription, ''subscription_canceled'')\n\n    def send_dunning_email(self, subscription, template):\n        \"\"\"Send dunning notification to customer.\"\"\"\n        customer = self.get_customer(subscription.customer_id)\n\n        email_content = self.render_template(template, {\n            ''customer_name'': customer.name,\n            ''amount_due'': subscription.plan.amount,\n            ''update_payment_url'': f\"https://app.example.com/billing\"\n        })\n\n        send_email(\n            to=customer.email,\n            subject=email_content[''subject''],\n            body=email_content[''body'']\n        )\n```\n\n## Proration\n\n```python\nclass ProrationCalculator:\n    \"\"\"Calculate prorated charges for plan changes.\"\"\"\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def calculate_proration(old_plan, new_plan, period_start, period_end, change_date):\n        \"\"\"Calculate proration for plan change.\"\"\"\n        # Days in current period\n        total_days = (period_end - period_start).days\n\n        # Days used on old plan\n        days_used = (change_date - period_start).days\n\n        # Days remaining on new plan\n        days_remaining = (period_end - change_date).days\n\n        # Calculate prorated amounts\n        unused_amount = (old_plan.amount / total_days) * days_remaining\n        new_plan_amount = (new_plan.amount / total_days) * days_remaining\n\n        # Net charge/credit\n        proration = new_plan_amount - unused_amount\n\n        return {\n            ''old_plan_credit'': -unused_amount,\n            ''new_plan_charge'': new_plan_amount,\n            ''net_proration'': proration,\n            ''days_used'': days_used,\n            ''days_remaining'': days_remaining\n        }\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def calculate_seat_proration(current_seats, new_seats, price_per_seat, period_start, period_end, change_date):\n        \"\"\"Calculate proration for seat changes.\"\"\"\n        total_days = (period_end - period_start).days\n        days_remaining = (period_end - change_date).days\n\n        # Additional seats charge\n        additional_seats = new_seats - current_seats\n        prorated_amount = (additional_seats * price_per_seat / total_days) * days_remaining\n\n        return {\n            ''additional_seats'': additional_seats,\n            ''prorated_charge'': max(0, prorated_amount),  # No refund for removing seats mid-cycle\n            ''effective_date'': change_date\n        }\n```\n\n## Tax Calculation\n\n```python\nclass TaxCalculator:\n    \"\"\"Calculate sales tax, VAT, GST.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        # Tax rates by region\n        self.tax_rates = {\n            ''US_CA'': 0.0725,  # California sales tax\n            ''US_NY'': 0.04,    # New York sales tax\n            ''GB'': 0.20,       # UK VAT\n            ''DE'': 0.19,       # Germany VAT\n            ''FR'': 0.20,       # France VAT\n            ''AU'': 0.10,       # Australia GST\n        }\n\n    def calculate_tax(self, amount, customer):\n        \"\"\"Calculate applicable tax.\"\"\"\n        # Determine tax jurisdiction\n        jurisdiction = self.get_tax_jurisdiction(customer)\n\n        if not jurisdiction:\n            return 0\n\n        # Get tax rate\n        tax_rate = self.tax_rates.get(jurisdiction, 0)\n\n        # Calculate tax\n        tax = amount * tax_rate\n\n        return {\n            ''tax_amount'': tax,\n            ''tax_rate'': tax_rate,\n            ''jurisdiction'': jurisdiction,\n            ''tax_type'': self.get_tax_type(jurisdiction)\n        }\n\n    def get_tax_jurisdiction(self, customer):\n        \"\"\"Determine tax jurisdiction based on customer location.\"\"\"\n        if customer.country == ''US'':\n            # US: Tax based on customer state\n            return f\"US_{customer.state}\"\n        elif customer.country in [''GB'', ''DE'', ''FR'']:\n            # EU: VAT\n            return customer.country\n        elif customer.country == ''AU'':\n            # Australia: GST\n            return ''AU''\n        else:\n            return None\n\n    def get_tax_type(self, jurisdiction):\n        \"\"\"Get type of tax for jurisdiction.\"\"\"\n        if jurisdiction.startswith(''US_''):\n            return ''Sales Tax''\n        elif jurisdiction in [''GB'', ''DE'', ''FR'']:\n            return ''VAT''\n        elif jurisdiction == ''AU'':\n            return ''GST''\n        return ''Tax''\n\n    def validate_vat_number(self, vat_number, country):\n        \"\"\"Validate EU VAT number.\"\"\"\n        # Use VIES API for validation\n        # Returns True if valid, False otherwise\n        pass\n```\n\n## Invoice Generation\n\n```python\nclass Invoice:\n    def __init__(self, customer_id, subscription_id=None):\n        self.id = generate_invoice_number()\n        self.customer_id = customer_id\n        self.subscription_id = subscription_id\n        self.status = ''draft''\n        self.line_items = []\n        self.subtotal = 0\n        self.tax = 0\n        self.total = 0\n        self.created_at = datetime.now()\n\n    def add_line_item(self, description, amount, quantity=1):\n        \"\"\"Add line item to invoice.\"\"\"\n        line_item = {\n            ''description'': description,\n            ''unit_amount'': amount,\n            ''quantity'': quantity,\n            ''total'': amount * quantity\n        }\n        self.line_items.append(line_item)\n        self.subtotal += line_item[''total'']\n\n    def finalize(self):\n        \"\"\"Finalize invoice and calculate total.\"\"\"\n        self.total = self.subtotal + self.tax\n        self.status = ''open''\n        self.finalized_at = datetime.now()\n\n    def mark_paid(self):\n        \"\"\"Mark invoice as paid.\"\"\"\n        self.status = ''paid''\n        self.paid_at = datetime.now()\n\n    def to_pdf(self):\n        \"\"\"Generate PDF invoice.\"\"\"\n        from reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\n        # Generate PDF\n        # Include: company info, customer info, line items, tax, total\n        pass\n\n    def to_html(self):\n        \"\"\"Generate HTML invoice.\"\"\"\n        template = \"\"\"\n        <!DOCTYPE html>\n        <html>\n        <head><title>Invoice #{invoice_number}</title></head>\n        <body>\n            <h1>Invoice #{invoice_number}</h1>\n            <p>Date: {date}</p>\n            <h2>Bill To:</h2>\n            <p>{customer_name}<br>{customer_address}</p>\n            <table>\n                <tr><th>Description</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Amount</th></tr>\n                {line_items}\n            </table>\n            <p>Subtotal: ${subtotal}</p>\n            <p>Tax: ${tax}</p>\n            <h3>Total: ${total}</h3>\n        </body>\n        </html>\n        \"\"\"\n\n        return template.format(\n            invoice_number=self.id,\n            date=self.created_at.strftime(''%Y-%m-%d''),\n            customer_name=self.customer.name,\n            customer_address=self.customer.address,\n            line_items=self.render_line_items(),\n            subtotal=self.subtotal,\n            tax=self.tax,\n            total=self.total\n        )\n```\n\n## Usage-Based Billing\n\n```python\nclass UsageBillingEngine:\n    \"\"\"Track and bill for usage.\"\"\"\n\n    def track_usage(self, customer_id, metric, quantity):\n        \"\"\"Track usage event.\"\"\"\n        UsageRecord.create(\n            customer_id=customer_id,\n            metric=metric,\n            quantity=quantity,\n            timestamp=datetime.now()\n        )\n\n    def calculate_usage_charges(self, subscription, period_start, period_end):\n        \"\"\"Calculate charges for usage in billing period.\"\"\"\n        usage_records = UsageRecord.get_for_period(\n            subscription.customer_id,\n            period_start,\n            period_end\n        )\n\n        total_usage = sum(record.quantity for record in usage_records)\n\n        # Tiered pricing\n        if subscription.plan.pricing_model == ''tiered'':\n            charge = self.calculate_tiered_pricing(total_usage, subscription.plan.tiers)\n        # Per-unit pricing\n        elif subscription.plan.pricing_model == ''per_unit'':\n            charge = total_usage * subscription.plan.unit_price\n        # Volume pricing\n        elif subscription.plan.pricing_model == ''volume'':\n            charge = self.calculate_volume_pricing(total_usage, subscription.plan.tiers)\n\n        return charge\n\n    def calculate_tiered_pricing(self, total_usage, tiers):\n        \"\"\"Calculate cost using tiered pricing.\"\"\"\n        charge = 0\n        remaining = total_usage\n\n        for tier in sorted(tiers, key=lambda x: x[''up_to'']):\n            tier_usage = min(remaining, tier[''up_to''] - tier[''from''])\n            charge += tier_usage * tier[''unit_price'']\n            remaining -= tier_usage\n\n            if remaining <= 0:\n                break\n\n        return charge\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/billing-cycles.md**: Billing cycle management\n- **references/dunning-management.md**: Failed payment recovery\n- **references/proration.md**: Prorated charge calculations\n- **references/tax-calculation.md**: Tax/VAT/GST handling\n- **references/invoice-lifecycle.md**: Invoice state management\n- **assets/billing-state-machine.yaml**: Billing workflow\n- **assets/invoice-template.html**: Invoice templates\n- **assets/dunning-policy.yaml**: Dunning configuration\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Automate Everything**: Minimize manual intervention\n2. **Clear Communication**: Notify customers of billing events\n3. **Flexible Retry Logic**: Balance recovery with customer experience\n4. **Accurate Proration**: Fair calculation for plan changes\n5. **Tax Compliance**: Calculate correct tax for jurisdiction\n6. **Audit Trail**: Log all billing events\n7. **Graceful Degradation**: Handle edge cases without breaking\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Incorrect Proration**: Not accounting for partial periods\n- **Missing Tax**: Forgetting to add tax to invoices\n- **Aggressive Dunning**: Canceling too quickly\n- **No Notifications**: Not informing customers of failures\n- **Hardcoded Cycles**: Not supporting custom billing dates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:32:30.623Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Agents needing automated billing and invoicing capabilities for SaaS and subscription-based services.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化账单和发票功能的金融代理，特别是针对SaaS和订阅制服务。","ja":"金融エージェントがSaaSおよびサブスクリプションベースのサービス向けの自動化請求および請求書機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"금융 에이전트가 SaaS 및 구독 기반 서비스를 위한 자동화된 청구 및 발송 기능을 필요로 할 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Financieros que necesitan capacidades automatizadas de facturación y cobro para servicios SaaS y basados en suscripción.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Financiers ayant besoin de capacités automatisées de facturation et de gestion des factures pour les services SaaS et basés sur l''abonnement.","de":"Perfekt für Finanzagenten, die automatisierte Abrechnungs- und Rechnungsstellungskapazitäten für SaaS- und abonnementbasierte Dienste benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Financeiros que necessitam de capacidades automatizadas de faturação e cobrança para serviços SaaS e baseados em subscrição.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Финансовых Агентов, которым требуются автоматизированные возможности выставления счетов и биллинга для SaaS-сервисов и услуг по подписке.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الخدمات المالية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات الفواتير والفوترة الآلية للخدمات القائمة على الاشتراك وبرنامج كخدمة (SaaS)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage recurring billing, generate invoices, and handle dunning management using protocols like proration and tax calculation, including support for sales tax, VAT, and GST.","zh":"赋予代理人管理循环计费、生成发票和处理催收管理的能力，使用的协议包括按比例收费和税金计算，包括对销售税、增值税和商品及服务税的支持。","ja":"エージェントが繰り返し請求、請求書の生成、以及prorationや税金計算などのプロトコルを使用した督促管理を処理することを可能にします。また、売上税、付加価値税、ならびに商品およびサービス税に対するサポートも含まれます。","ko":"에이전트가 반복 청구, 청구서 생성, 그리고 proration 및 세금 계산과 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 독촉 관리를 처리할 수 있도록 합니다. 또한 판매세, 부가가치세, Goods and Services Tax에 대한 지원도 포함됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar la facturación recurrente, generar facturas y manejar la gestión de cobranza utilizando protocolos como cálculo prorrateado y de impuestos, incluyendo soporte para impuesto sobre las ventas, IVA y GST.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer la facturation récurrente, de générer des factures et de traiter la gestion des relances en utilisant des protocoles tels que le calcul au prorata et le calcul des taxes, y compris la prise en charge de la taxe de vente, de la TVA et de la GST.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten die Verwaltung wiederkehrender Abrechnungen, die Erstellung von Rechnungen und das Management des Mahnwesens unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie anteiliger Berechnung und Steuerberechnung, einschließlich Unterstützung für Umsatzsteuer, Mehrwertsteuer (MwSt.) und GST.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerir a cobrança recorrente, gerar faturas e gerir processos de cobrança usando protocolos como cálculo de taxas proporcionais e impostos, incluindo suporte para imposto sobre vendas, IVA e GST.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять периодическим биллингом, генерировать счета-фактуры и обрабатывать управление взысканием долгов с использованием таких протоколов, как пропорциональное распределение и расчет налогов, включая поддержку налога с продаж, НДС и GST.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة الفوترة المتكررة، وإنشاء الفواتير، ومعالجة إدارة متابعة الديون باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل التحاسب التناسبي وحساب الضرائب، بما في ذلك الدعم لضريبة المبيعات، والضريبة على القيمة المضافة (VAT)، وضريبة السلع والخدمات (GST)."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating invoice generation and delivery","Implementing usage-based billing and renewal cycles","Calculating prorated charges for plan changes and handling failed payment recovery"],"zh":["自动化发票生成和投递","实施基于使用情况的计费和续费周期","计算变更后按比例收费并处理失败的付款恢复"],"ja":["請求書の自動生成および配信","使用状況に基づく請求および更新サイクルの実施","プラン変更後の割合計算および失敗した支払い回復の処理"],"ko":["청구서 자동 생성 및 전송","사용량 기반 청구 및 갱신 주기 구현","변경 후 비율 계산 및 실패한 결제 복구 처리"],"es":["Automatización de la generación y entrega de facturas","Implementación de ciclos de facturación basados en el uso y renovación","Cálculo de cargos prorrateados por cambios de plan y gestión de recuperación de pagos fallidos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération et de la livraison des factures","Mise en œuvre de la facturation basée sur l''utilisation et des cycles de renouvellement","Calcul des frais au prorata pour les changements de forfait et gestion de la récupération des paiements échoués"],"de":["Automatisierung der Rechnungserstellung und -zustellung","Implementierung nutzungsbasierter Abrechnungen und Verlängerungszyklen","Berechnung anteiliger Gebühren für Tarifänderungen und Behandlung fehlgeschlagener Zahlungswiederherstellung"],"pt":["Automatização da geração e entrega de faturas","Implementação de cobrança baseada no uso e ciclos de renovação","Cálculo de cobranças proporcionais para alterações de plano e tratamento de recuperação de pagamentos falhados"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания и доставки счетов-фактур","Внедрение биллинга на основе использования и циклов продления","Расчет пропорциональных charges при изменении тарифного плана и обработка восстановления неудачных платежей"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء الفواتير وتسليمها","تنفيذ الفوترة القائمة على الاستخدام ودورات التجديد","حساب الرسوم التناسبية لتغييرات الخطة ومعالجة استرداد الدفعات الفاشلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with payment gateways","Limited to billing and invoicing for digital services and products"],"zh":["需要与支付网关集成","仅限于数字服务和产品的计费和发票"],"ja":["決済ゲートウェイとの統合が必要","デジタルサービスおよび製品の請求および請求書のみに限定される"],"ko":["결제 게이트웨이와의 통합이 필요","디지털 서비스 및 제품의 청구 및 청구서만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración con pasarelas de pago","Limitado a la facturación y cobro para servicios y productos digitales"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec des passerelles de paiement","Limité à la facturation et à la gestion des factures pour les services et produits numériques"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit Zahlungsgateways","Beschränkt auf Abrechnung und Rechnungsstellung für digitale Dienste und Produkte"],"pt":["Requer integração com gateways de pagamento","Limitado à faturação e cobrança para serviços e produtos digitais"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с платежными шлюзами","Ограничено биллингом и выставлением счетов для цифровых услуг и продуктов"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع بوابات الدفع","يقتصر على الفوترة والفواتير للخدمات والمنتجات الرقمية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('beyildirim/tracehound/openspec-explore', 'community', 'beyildirim', 'tracehound', 'beyildirim/tracehound', 'openspec-explore', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z', '2026-02-18T12:33:00.732Z', NULL, '{"id":"beyildirim/tracehound/openspec-explore","name":"openspec-explore","description":{"zh":"openspec-explore 模式允许开发人员自由探索和设计，提高开发效率","ja":"openspec-explore モードでは、開発者が自由に探索と設計を行うことができ、開発効率が向上します","ko":"openspec-explore 모드는 개발자가 자유롭게 탐색하고 설계할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 개발 효율성을 높여줍니다","es":"El modo de exploración de OpenSpec permite a los desarrolladores investigar y planificar proyectos sin implementar código.","fr":"Le mode d''exploration OpenSpec permet aux développeurs de rechercher et de planifier des projets sans mettre en œuvre de code.","de":"Der OpenSpec-Explorationsmodus ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Projekte zu untersuchen und zu planen, ohne Code zu implementieren.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-explore 技术探索模式","ja":"openspec-explore 技術探索モード","ko":"openspec-explore 기술 탐색 모드","es":"Modo de exploración de OpenSpec","fr":"Mode d''exploration OpenSpec","de":"OpenSpec-Explorationsmodus","en":"openspec-explore"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-explore 模式允许开发人员自由探索和设计，提高开发效率","ja":"openspec-explore モードでは、開発者が自由に探索と設計を行うことができ、開発効率が向上します","ko":"openspec-explore 모드는 개발자가 자유롭게 탐색하고 설계할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 개발 효율성을 높여줍니다","es":"El modo de exploración de OpenSpec permite a los desarrolladores investigar y planificar proyectos sin implementar código.","fr":"Le mode d''exploration OpenSpec permet aux développeurs de rechercher et de planifier des projets sans mettre en œuvre de code.","de":"Der OpenSpec-Explorationsmodus ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Projekte zu untersuchen und zu planen, ohne Code zu implementieren.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自由探索","设计提案","规范制定","代码搜索","开发效率提高"],"ja":["自由な探索","設計提案","規範の制定","コードの検索","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["자유로운 탐색","설계 제안","규范 설정","코드 검색","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Investigación de código sin implementación","Creación de artefactos OpenSpec","Planificación de proyectos","Análisis de código existente","Investigación de requisitos del proyecto"],"fr":["Recherche de code sans mise en œuvre","Création d''artefacts OpenSpec","Planification de projets","Analyse de code existant","Recherche de exigences de projet"],"de":["Untersuchung von Code ohne Implementierung","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten","Projektplanung","Analyse von bestehendem Code","Untersuchung von Projektanforderungen"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-explore","技术探索","开发效率","设计模式","代码搜索","规范制定"],"ja":["openspec-explore","技術探索","開発効率","設計モード","コード検索","規範制定"],"ko":["openspec-explore","기술 탐색","개발 효율성","디자인 모드","코드 검색","규范 설정"],"es":["modo de exploración","OpenSpec","desarrollo de software","planificación de proyectos","investigación de código","arteartos OpenSpec"],"fr":["mode d''exploration","OpenSpec","développement de logiciels","planification de projets","recherche de code","artefacts OpenSpec"],"de":["Explorationsmodus","OpenSpec","Softwareentwicklung","Projektplanung","Codeuntersuchung","OpenSpec-Artefakte"]}},"owner":"beyildirim","repo":"tracehound","repoPath":"beyildirim/tracehound","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s c","body":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n```bash\nopenspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type | Where to Capture |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made | `design.md` |\n   | Scope changed | `proposal.md` |\n   | New work identified | `tasks.md` |\n   | Assumption invalidated | Relevant artifact |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:33:00.732Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conceptual AI Agents needing advanced exploratory thinking and OpenSpec artifact creation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级探索性思维和 OpenSpec 文档创建能力的概念性 AI代理。","ja":"概念的なAIエージェントが高度な探索的思考とOpenSpecアーティファクトの作成機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 탐색적 사고와 OpenSpec 아티팩트 생성 기능이 필요한 개념적 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Conceptual que necesitan pensamiento exploratorio avanzado y capacidades de creación de artefactos OpenSpec.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Conceptuelle ayant besoin d''une pensée exploratoire avancée et de capacités de création d''artefacts OpenSpec.","de":"Perfekt für konzeptionelle KI-Agents, die erweitertes exploratives Denken und OpenSpec-Artifakte erstellende Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Conceituais que necessitam de pensamento exploratório avançado e capacidades de criação de artefatos OpenSpec.","ru":"Идеально для концептуальных агентов ИИ, которым требуются передовые исследовательские навыки мышления и возможности создания артефактов OpenSpec.","ar":"مثالية لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المفهومی الذي يحتاج إلى التفكير الاستكشافي المتقدم وقدرات إنشاء الملفات المفتوحة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to think deeply and visualize freely, following conversations wherever they go, while creating OpenSpec proposals, designs, and specs using codebase investigation and file reading capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理深入思考和自由可视化的能力，能够跟随对话的任何流向，同时使用代码库调查和文件读取功能创建OpenSpec提案、设计和规格。","ja":"エージェントに深く考え、自由に可視化する能力を与え、会話のどこへでも従うことができ、コードベースの調査とファイルの読み取り機能を使用してOpenSpecの提案、設計、仕様を作成します。","ko":"에이전트가 깊이 생각하고 자유롭게 시각화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 대화의 흐름을 어디로든 따라갈 수 있으며, 코드베이스 조사와 파일 읽기 기능을 사용하여 OpenSpec 제안, 설계, 사양을 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a pensar profundamente y visualizar libremente, siguiendo conversaciones dondequiera que vayan, mientras crean propuestas, diseños y especificaciones OpenSpec utilizando capacidades de investigación de código y lectura de archivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réfléchir profondément et de visualiser librement, en suivant les conversations où qu''elles aillent, tout en créant des propositions, des conceptions et des spécifications OpenSpec en utilisant les capacités d''investigation de code et de lecture de fichiers.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, tief zu denken und frei zu visualisieren, indem sie Gespräche überallhin verfolgen, während sie OpenSpec-Vorschläge, -Entwürfe und -Spezifikationen unter Verwendung von Codebasis-Untersuchungs- und Dateilesefunktionen erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pensar profundamente e visualizar livremente, seguindo as conversas para onde elas forem, enquanto criam propostas, designs e especificações OpenSpec usando capacidades de investigação de código e leitura de arquivos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью глубоко мыслить и свободно визуализировать, следуя за разговорами, куда бы они ни шли, создавая предложения, дизайны и спецификации OpenSpec с помощью возможностей исследования кодовой базы и чтения файлов.","ar":"تمكن العميل من التفكير العميق والتصور الحر، متبوعًا بالحوارات أينما ذهبت، مع إنشاء مقترحات وتصاميم ومواصفات مفتوحة باستخدام إمكانيات التحقيق في قاعدة الشفرة وقراءة الملفات."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating codebases for potential feature implementations","Generating OpenSpec artifacts such as proposals and designs","Debugging complex conversation flows through exploratory thinking"],"zh":["调查代码库以实现潜在功能","生成OpenSpec文档，如提案和设计","通过探索性思维调试复杂的对话流"],"ja":["機能の実装の可能性を調査するためのコードベースの調査","OpenSpecのアーティファクト such as 提案と設計の生成","探索的思考を通じて複雑な会話フローのデバッグ"],"ko":["기능 구현에 대한 코드베이스 조사","OpenSpec 아티팩트 생성, 예를 들어 제안 및 설계","탐색적 사고를 통해 복잡한 대화 흐름 디버깅"],"es":["Investigación de código para posibles implementaciones de características","Generación de artefactos OpenSpec como propuestas y diseños","Depuración de flujos de conversación complejos a través del pensamiento exploratorio"],"fr":["Investigation de codebases pour des mises en œuvre de fonctionnalités potentielles","Génération d''artefacts OpenSpec tels que des propositions et des conceptions","Débogage de flux de conversation complexes grâce à la pensée exploratoire"],"de":["Untersuchung von Codebasen für potenzielle Funktionsimplementierungen","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artifakten wie Vorschlägen und Entwürfen","Fehlerbehebung komplexer Gesprächsflüsse durch exploratives Denken"],"pt":["Investigação de código para implementações de recursos potenciais","Geração de artefatos OpenSpec, como propostas e designs","Depuração de fluxos de conversação complexos por meio do pensamento exploratório"],"ru":["Изучение кодовой базы для потенциальной реализации функций","Генерация артефактов OpenSpec, таких как предложения и дизайны","Отладка сложных потоков разговора посредством исследовательского мышления"],"ar":["التحقيق في قاعدة الشفرة لتنفيذ الميزات المحتملة","إنشاء ملفات مفتوحة مثل المقترحات والتصاميم","تصحيح الأخطاء في تدفقات المحادثة المعقدة من خلال التفكير الاستكشافي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must not write code or implement features in explore mode","Requires user to exit explore mode for implementation using commands like /opsx:new or /opsx:ff"],"zh":["探索模式下不能编写代码或实现功能","需要用户退出探索模式以使用命令（如 /opsx:new 或 /opsx:ff）进行实现"],"ja":["探索モードではコードの記述や機能の実装を行うことができない","実装には、ユーザーが探索モードを終了し、/opsx:new または /opsx:ffなどのコマンドを使用する必要がある"],"ko":["탐색 모드에서는 코드를 작성하거나 기능을 구현할 수 없음","구현을 위해 사용자는 탐색 모드를 종료하고 /opsx:new 또는 /opsx:ffなどの 명령어를 사용해야 함"],"es":["No debe escribir código o implementar características en el modo de exploración","Requiere que el usuario salga del modo de exploración para la implementación utilizando comandos como /opsx:nuevo o /opsx:ff"],"fr":["Ne doit pas écrire de code ou mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités en mode d''exploration","Nécessite que l''utilisateur quitte le mode d''exploration pour la mise en œuvre en utilisant des commandes comme /opsx:nouveau ou /opsx:ff"],"de":["Sollte keinen Code schreiben oder Funktionen im Explorationsmodus implementieren","Benötigt, dass der Benutzer den Explorationsmodus verlässt, um die Implementierung mithilfe von Befehlen wie /opsx:neu oder /opsx:ff durchzuführen"],"pt":["Não deve escrever código ou implementar recursos no modo de exploração","Exige que o usuário saia do modo de exploração para implementação usando comandos como /opsx:new ou /opsx:ff"],"ru":["Не должен писать код или реализовывать функции в режиме исследования","Требует от пользователя выйти из режима исследования для реализации с помощью команд, таких как /opsx:new или /opsx:ff"],"ar":["لا ينبغي أن يکتب الشفرة أو يطبق الميزات في وضع الاستكشاف","يتطلب من المستخدم الخروج من وضع الاستكشاف للتطبيق باستخدام أوامر مثل /opsx:new أو /opsx:ff"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
