permet de créer des applications SaaS modernes avec facilité. Explorez et visualisez librement.","de":"Das UI-Entwicklungskit HAI3 ermöglicht die Erstellung moderner SaaS-Anwendungen mit Leichtigkeit. Erkunden und visualisieren Sie frei.","pt":"O openspec-explore é um kit de desenvolvimento UI para criar soluções inovadoras para aplicativos SaaS modernos, permitindo que os desenvolvedores pensem e v...","ru":"Openspec-explore - это набор для разработки UI, предназначенный для создания инновационных решений для современных приложений SaaS, позволяющий разработчикам...","ar":"openspec-explore هو حزمة تطوير واجهة المستخدم لإنشاء حلول مبتكرة لبرامج SaaS الحديثة، مما يسمح للمطورين بالتفكير والتصور بحرية","en":"HAI3 - UI development kit for modern SaaS applications"},"definition":{"en":"HAI3 - UI development kit for modern SaaS applications"},"features":{"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones SaaS modernas","Kit de desarrollo UI integral","Exploración y visualización libre","Creación de artefactos OpenSpec","Investigación del código y la base de código"],"fr":["Développement d''applications SaaS modernes","Kit de développement UI complet","Exploration et visualisation libre","Création d''artefacts OpenSpec","Recherche de code et de base de code"],"de":["Entwicklung moderner SaaS-Anwendungen","Umfangreiches UI-Entwicklungskit","Freie Erkundung und Visualisierung","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten","Code- und Codebasis-Recherche"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de UI para aplicativos SaaS modernos","Modo de exploração para pensamento e visualização livre","Criação de artefatos OpenSpec","Leitura de arquivos e busca de código","Investigação da base de código"],"ru":["Разработка UI для современных приложений SaaS","Режим исследования для свободного мышления и визуализации","Создание артефактов OpenSpec","Чтение файлов и поиск кода","Изучение кодовой базы"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة المستخدم لبرامج SaaS الحديثة","وضع الاستكشاف للتفكير والتصور الحر","إنشاء مكونات OpenSpec","قراءة الملفات و搜索 الشفرة","تحقيق في قاعدة الشفرة"]},"keywords":{"es":["desarrollo UI","aplicaciones SaaS modernas","kit de desarrollo","exploración de código","artefactos OpenSpec","investigación de código","HAI3","openspec-explore"],"fr":["développement UI","applications SaaS modernes","kit de développement","exploration de code","artefacts OpenSpec","recherche de code","HAI3","openspec-explore"],"de":["UI-Entwicklung","moderne SaaS-Anwendungen","Entwicklungskit","Code-Erkundung","OpenSpec-Artefakte","Code-Recherche","HAI3","openspec-explore"],"pt":["desenvolvimento ui","aplicativos saas","openspec-explore","kit de desenvolvimento","modo de exploração","artefatos openspec"],"ru":["разработка ui","приложения saas","openspec-explore","набор для разработки","режим исследования","артефакты openspec"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة المستخدم","برامج saas","openspec-explore","حزمة تطوير","وضع الاستكشاف","مكونات openspec"]}},"owner":"HAI3org","repo":"HAI3","repoPath":"HAI3org/HAI3","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s c","body":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n```bash\nopenspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type | Where to Capture |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made | `design.md` |\n   | Scope changed | `proposal.md` |\n   | New work identified | `tasks.md` |\n   | Assumption invalidated | Relevant artifact |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:32:55.237Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced UI development kit capabilities for modern SaaS applications","zh":"适用于需要高级 UI 开发工具包功能的现代 SaaS 应用程序的 AI 代理","ja":"高度な UI 開発キットの機能を必要とするモダンな SaaS アプリケーション向けの AI エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 UI 개발 키트 기능이 필요한 현대적인 SaaS 애플리케이션을 위한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de kit de desarrollo de interfaz de usuario para aplicaciones SaaS modernas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de capacités avancées de kit de développement d''interface utilisateur pour les applications SaaS modernes","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte UI-Entwicklungskit-Funktionen für moderne SaaS-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de kits de desenvolvimento de UI para aplicações SaaS modernas","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности набора инструментов для разработки пользовательского интерфейса для современных SaaS-приложений","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لمجموعة تطوير واجهة المستخدم للتطبيقات الحديثة كخدمة (SaaS)"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to think deeply and visualize freely, creating OpenSpec artifacts like proposals, designs, and specs, while investigating codebases and searching code, all within the explore mode protocol","zh":"赋予代理深入思考和自由可视化的能力，创建类似提案、设计和规格的 OpenSpec 文档，同时在探索模式协议中调查代码库和搜索代码","ja":"エージェントが深く考え、自由に可視化できるようにし、プロポーザル、デザイン、仕様などの OpenSpec アーティファクトを作成しながら、コードベースを調査し、コードを検索することができる、すべて探索モードプロトコルの中で","ko":"에이전트가 깊이 생각하고 자유롭게 시각화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 탐색 모드 프로토콜 내에서 코드베이스를 조사하고 코드를 검색하는 동시에, 제안서, 디자인, 사양 등과 같은 OpenSpec 아티팩트를 생성","es":"Permite a los agentes pensar profundamente y visualizar libremente, creando artefactos OpenSpec como propuestas, diseños y especificaciones, mientras investigan las bases de código y buscan código, todo dentro del protocolo de modo de exploración","fr":"Permet aux agents de réfléchir profondément et de visualiser librement, en créant des artefacts OpenSpec tels que des propositions, des conceptions et des spécifications, tout en investiguant les bases de code et en recherchant du code, le tout dans le protocole de mode d''exploration","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, tief zu denken und frei zu visualisieren, indem sie OpenSpec-Artefakte wie Vorschläge, Entwürfe und Spezifikationen erstellen, während sie Codebasen untersuchen und nach Code suchen, all dies innerhalb des Explorationsmodus-Protokolls","pt":"Capacita os agentes a pensar profundamente e visualizar livremente, criando artefatos OpenSpec como propostas, designs e especificações, enquanto investigam bases de código e pesquisam código, tudo dentro do protocolo do modo de exploração","ru":"Позволяет агентам глубоко мыслить и свободно визуализировать, создавая артефакты OpenSpec, такие как предложения, проекты и спецификации, одновременно исследуя кодбазы и выполняя поиск по коду, все в рамках протокола режима исследования","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من التفكير بعمق والتخيل بحرية، وإنشاء مواد OpenSpec مثل المقترحات والتصميمات والمواصفات، أثناء البحث في قواعد التعليمات البرمجية والبحث في الكود، كل ذلك ضمن بروتوكول وضع الاستكشاف"},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating codebases for modern SaaS applications","Creating OpenSpec proposals and designs","Searching code for specific implementation details"],"zh":["为现代 SaaS 应用程序调查代码库","创建 OpenSpec 提案和设计","搜索代码以获取特定实现细节"],"ja":["モダンな SaaS アプリケーションのコードベースを調査する","OpenSpec の提案と設計を作成する","特定の実装詳細を検索するためのコードを検索する"],"ko":["현대적인 SaaS 애플리케이션의 코드베이스를 조사","OpenSpec 제안서와 디자인을 생성","특정 구현 세부 정보를 검색하기 위한 코드를 검색"],"es":["Investigar bases de código para aplicaciones SaaS modernas","Crear propuestas y diseños OpenSpec","Buscar código para detalles de implementación específicos"],"fr":["Investiguer des bases de code pour les applications SaaS modernes","Créer des propositions et des conceptions OpenSpec","Rechercher du code pour des détails d''implémentation spécifiques"],"de":["Untersuchen von Codebasen für moderne SaaS-Anwendungen","Erstellen von OpenSpec-Vorschlägen und -Entwürfen","Suchen von Code für spezifische Implementierungsdetails"],"pt":["Investigação de bases de código para aplicações SaaS modernas","Criação de propostas e designs OpenSpec","Pesquisa de código para detalhes de implementação específicos"],"ru":["Исследование кодбаз для современных SaaS-приложений","Создание предложений и проектов OpenSpec","Поиск кода для конкретных деталей реализации"],"ar":["البحث في قواعد التعليمات البرمجية لتطبيقات SaaS الحديثة","إنشاء مقترحات وتصميمات OpenSpec","البحث في الكود للحصول على تفاصيل تنفيذية محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must not write code or implement features in explore mode","Requires exiting explore mode to implement changes via /opsx:new or /opsx:ff"],"zh":["探索模式下不能编写代码或实现功能","需要退出探索模式以通过 /opsx:new 或 /opsx:ff 实现更改"],"ja":["探索モードではコードを書いたり機能を実装したりできない","/opsx:new または /opsx:ff を介して変更を実施するために探索モードを終了する必要がある"],"ko":["탐색 모드에서 코드를 작성하거나 기능을 구현할 수 없음","/opsx:new 또는 /opsx:ff를 통해 변경을 구현하기 위해 탐색 모드를 종료해야 함"],"es":["No debe escribir código o implementar características en el modo de exploración","Requiere salir del modo de exploración para implementar cambios a través de /opsx:new o /opsx:ff"],"fr":["Ne doit pas écrire de code ou implémenter des fonctionnalités en mode d''exploration","Nécessite de quitter le mode d''exploration pour implémenter des modifications via /opsx:new ou /opsx:ff"],"de":["Darf keinen Code schreiben oder Funktionen im Explorationsmodus implementieren","Erfordert das Verlassen des Explorationsmodus, um Änderungen über /opsx:new oder /opsx:ff umzusetzen"],"pt":["Não deve escrever código ou implementar funcionalidades no modo de exploração","Requer sair do modo de exploração para implementar alterações via /opsx:new ou /opsx:ff"],"ru":["Не должен писать код или реализовывать функции в режиме исследования","Требуется выход из режима исследования для внесения изменений через /opsx:new или /opsx:ff"],"ar":["يجب عدم كتابة التعليمات البرمجية أو تنفيذ الميزات في وضع الاستكشاف","يتطلب الخروج من وضع الاستكشاف لتنفيذ التغييرات عبر /opsx:new أو /opsx:ff"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('uxname/liteend/openspec-explore', 'community', 'uxname', 'liteend', 'uxname/liteend', 'openspec-explore', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z', '2026-02-18T12:32:55.082Z', NULL, '{"id":"uxname/liteend/openspec-explore","name":"openspec-explore","description":{"zh":"OpenSpec探索是一个轻量级Node.js后端工具，专注于GraphQL和Prisma.io的探索与设计模式。它允许开发者深入思考代码库，创建OpenSpec工件，而无需实施功能。","ja":"OpenSpec探索は、GraphQLとPrisma.ioに焦点を当てた軽量Node.jsバックエンドツールです。開発者がコードベースを調査し、OpenSpecアーティファクトを作成できますが、実装は行いません。","ko":"OpenSpec 탐색은 GraphQL 및 Prisma.io에 중점을 둔 경량 Node.js 백엔드 도구입니다. 개발자가 코드베이스를 조사하고 OpenSpec 아티팩트를 생성할 수 있지만 구현은 수행하지 않습니다.","es":"openspec-explore es un backend ligero de GraphQL y Prisma.io para desarrolladores, permite explorar y visualizar código de forma libre.","fr":"openspec-explore est un backend léger GraphQL et Prisma.io pour les développeurs, permettant d''explorer et de visualiser le code de manière libre.","de":"openspec-explore ist ein leichtes GraphQL- und Prisma.io-Backend für Entwickler, ermöglicht die freie Exploration und Visualisierung von Code.","pt":"O openspec-explore é um agente de IA para modo de exploração em backends Node.js com GraphQL e Prisma.io. Ele permite análise profunda de código e criação de artefatos OpenSpec, mas não implementa funcionalidades.","ru":"openspec-explore — это ИИ-агент для режима исследования в бэкендах Node.js с GraphQL и Prisma.io. Он позволяет глубоко анализировать код и создавать артефакты OpenSpec, но не реализует функциональность.","ar":"openspec-explore هو وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي لوضع الاستكشاف في Backends Node.js بخاصية GraphQL و Prisma.io. يسمح بالتحليل العميق للتعليمات البرمجية وإنشاء قطع OpenSpec، ولكنه لا ينفذ الوظائف.","en":"Lightweight GraphQL & Prisma.io node.js backend"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"OpenSpec探索：轻量级GraphQL和Prisma后端工具","ja":"OpenSpec探索：軽量GraphQLとPrismaバックエンドツール","ko":"OpenSpec 탐색: 경량 GraphQL 및 Prisma 백엔드 도구","es":"Explora openspec: Backend ligero GraphQL y Prisma.io","fr":"Découvrez openspec: Backend léger GraphQL et Prisma.io","de":"Entdecken Sie openspec: Leichtes GraphQL- und Prisma.io-B...","pt":"openspec-explore: Backend Node.js com GraphQL e Prisma","ru":"openspec-explore: Backend Node.js с GraphQL и Prisma","ar":"openspec-explore: Backend Node.js بخاصية GraphQL و Prisma","en":"openspec-explore"},"description":{"zh":"OpenSpec探索是一个轻量级Node.js后端工具，专注于GraphQL和Prisma.io的探索与设计模式。它允许开发者深入思考代码库，创建OpenSpec工件，而无需实施功能。","ja":"OpenSpec探索は、GraphQLとPrisma.ioに焦点を当てた軽量Node.jsバックエンドツールです。開発者がコードベースを調査し、OpenSpecアーティファクトを作成できますが、実装は行いません。","ko":"OpenSpec 탐색은 GraphQL 및 Prisma.io에 중점을 둔 경량 Node.js 백엔드 도구입니다. 개발자가 코드베이스를 조사하고 OpenSpec 아티팩트를 생성할 수 있지만 구현은 수행하지 않습니다.","es":"openspec-explore es un backend ligero de GraphQL y Prisma.io para desarrolladores, permite explorar y visualizar código de forma libre.","fr":"openspec-explore est un backend léger GraphQL et Prisma.io pour les développeurs, permettant d''explorer et de visualiser le code de manière libre.","de":"openspec-explore ist ein leichtes GraphQL- und Prisma.io-Backend für Entwickler, ermöglicht die freie Exploration und Visualisierung von Code.","pt":"O openspec-explore é um agente de IA para modo de exploração em backends Node.js com GraphQL e Prisma.io. Ele permite análise profunda de código e criação de...","ru":"openspec-explore — это ИИ-агент для режима исследования в бэкендах Node.js с GraphQL и Prisma.io. Он позволяет глубоко анализировать код и создавать артефакт...","ar":"openspec-explore هو وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي لوضع الاستكشاف في Backends Node.js بخاصية GraphQL و Prisma.io. يسمح بالتحليل العميق للتعليمات البرمجية وإنشاء قطع OpenS...","en":"Lightweight GraphQL & Prisma.io node.js backend"},"definition":{"en":"Lightweight GraphQL & Prisma.io node.js backend"},"features":{"zh":["轻量级Node.js后端集成GraphQL和Prisma.io","探索模式支持深度思考和可视化","允许代码文件读取和代码库搜索","禁止代码编写或功能实施","可创建OpenSpec工件（提案、设计、规范）","通过命令如/opsx:new退出探索以实施更改"],"ja":["GraphQLとPrisma.ioを統合した軽量Node.jsバックエンド","探索モードで深い思考と可視化をサポート","コードファイルの読み取りとコードベースの検索が可能","コード作成や機能実装は禁止","OpenSpecアーティファクト（提案、設計、仕様）の作成可","/opsx:newなどのコマンドで探索モードを終了して変更を実施"],"ko":["GraphQL 및 Prisma.io와 통합된 경량 Node.js 백엔드","탐색 모드로 깊은 사고와 시각화 지원","코드 파일 읽기 및 코드베이스 검색 가능","코드 작성 또는 기능 구현 금지","OpenSpec 아티팩트(제안, 설계, 사양) 생성 가능","/opsx:new 등의 명령으로 탐색 모드 종료 및 변경 구현"],"es":["Backend ligero de GraphQL","Integración con Prisma.io","Exploración y visualización de código","Creación de artefactos OpenSpec","Modo de exploración para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Backend léger GraphQL","Intégration avec Prisma.io","Exploration et visualisation de code","Création d''artefacts OpenSpec","Mode d''exploration pour les développeurs"],"de":["Leichtes GraphQL-Backend","Integration mit Prisma.io","Exploration und Visualisierung von Code","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten","Explorationsmodus für Entwickler"],"pt":["Modo de exploração seguro para análise de código","Suporte a backends Node.js com GraphQL e Prisma.io","Leitura de arquivos e pesquisa no codebase","Criação de artefatos OpenSpec (propostas, designs)","Impedido de escrever código ou implementar features","Ativação via comandos como `/opsx:new` ou `/opsx:ff`"],"ru":["Безопасный режим исследования для анализа кода","Поддержка бэкендов Node.js с GraphQL и Prisma.io","Чтение файлов и поиск по кодовой базе","Создание артефактов OpenSpec (предложения, проекты)","Запрещено писать код или реализовывать функции","Активация через команды `/opsx:new` или `/opsx:ff`"],"ar":["وضع استكشاف آمن لتحليل التعليمات البرمجية","دعم Backends Node.js بخاصية GraphQL و Prisma.io","قراءة الملفات والبحث في قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية","إنشاء قطع OpenSpec (مقترحات، تصاميم)","غير قادر على كتابة التعليمات البرمجية أو تنفيذ الميزات","التنشيط عبر أوامر مثل `/opsx:new` أو `/opsx:ff`"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GraphQL探索工具","Prisma后端开发","Node.js轻量后端","OpenSpec规范创建","代码库搜索","开发者AI代理","探索模式","无代码设计"],"ja":["GraphQL探索ツール","Prismaバックエンド開発","Node.js軽量バックエンド","OpenSpec仕様作成","コードベース検索","開発者AIエージェント","探索モード","ノーコード設計"],"ko":["GraphQL 탐색 도구","Prisma 백엔드 개발","Node.js 경량 백엔드","OpenSpec 사양 생성","코드베이스 검색","개발자 AI 에이전트","탐색 모드","노코드 설계"],"es":["openspec-explore","GraphQL","Prisma.io","backend ligero","exploración de código","desarrollo de software","OpenSpec"],"fr":["openspec-explore","GraphQL","Prisma.io","backend léger","exploration de code","développement de logiciels","OpenSpec"],"de":["openspec-explore","GraphQL","Prisma.io","leichtes Backend","Code-Exploration","Software-Entwicklung","OpenSpec"],"pt":["openspec-explore","nodejs backend","graphql prisma","analise de codigo","modo exploracao","artefatos openspec","desenvolvimento seguro","ia para devs"],"ru":["openspec-explore","nodejs бэкенд","graphql prisma","анализ кода","режим исследования","артефакты openspec","безопасная разработка","ии для разработчиков"],"ar":["openspec-explore","nodejs backend","graphql prisma","تحليل التعليمات البرمجية","وضع الاستكشاف","قطع openspec","تطوير آمن","ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"uxname","repo":"liteend","repoPath":"uxname/liteend","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s c","body":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n```bash\nopenspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type | Where to Capture |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made | `design.md` |\n   | Scope changed | `proposal.md` |\n   | New work identified | `tasks.md` |\n   | Assumption invalidated | Relevant artifact |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:32:55.082Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing lightweight GraphQL and Prisma.io node.js backend exploration capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要轻量级 GraphQL 和 Prisma.io node.js 后端探索能力的 AI 智能体。","ja":"軽量な GraphQL および Prisma.io の node.js バックエンド探索機能を必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"가벼운 GraphQL 및 Prisma.io node.js 백엔드 탐색 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de exploración de GraphQL y Prisma.io ligeras en el backend de node.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin de capacités de exploration GraphQL et Prisma.io légères dans le backend node.js.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die leichte GraphQL- und Prisma.io-Explorationsfunktionen im node.js-Backend benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que precisam de capacidades de exploração de backend node.js leve com GraphQL e Prisma.io.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы легкие возможности GraphQL и Prisma.io для изучения узлов backend node.js.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوسائط الذكية التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات إكشاف خفيفة لجزء الخادم من node.js باستخدام GraphQL و Prisma.io."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to explore and visualize codebases using GraphQL and Prisma.io, facilitating deep thinking and free investigation of node.js backends, while creating OpenSpec artifacts like proposals, designs, and specs.","zh":"使智能体能够使用 GraphQL 和 Prisma.io 探索和可视化代码库，促进对 node.js 后端的深度思考和自由调查，同时创建提案、设计和规格等 OpenSpec 工件。","ja":"GraphQL と Prisma.io を使用してコードベースを探索および可視化し、node.js バックエンドの深い思考と自由な調査を促進すると同時に、提案、設計、仕様などの OpenSpec 成果物を作成することをエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 GraphQL과 Prisma.io를 사용하여 코드베이스를 탐색하고 시각화하여 node.js 백엔드에 대한 깊은 사고와 자유로운 조사를 용이하게 하며, 제안서, 설계 및 사양과 같은 OpenSpec 산출물을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a explorar y visualizar bases de código utilizando GraphQL y Prisma.io, lo que facilita el pensamiento profundo y la investigación libre de backends de node.js, al mismo tiempo que se crean artefactos de OpenSpec como propuestas, diseños y especificaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''explorer et de visualiser des bases de code à l''aide de GraphQL et Prisma.io, facilitant ainsi la réflexion approfondie et l''investigation libre des backends node.js, tout en créant des artefacts OpenSpec tels que des propositions, des conceptions et des spécifications.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Codebasen mit GraphQL und Prisma.io zu erkunden und zu visualisieren, wodurch tiefes Nachdenken und freie Untersuchung von node.js-Backends ermöglicht wird, während OpenSpec-Artefakte wie Vorschläge, Entwürfe und Spezifikationen erstellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a explorar e visualizar bases de código usando GraphQL e Prisma.io, facilitando o pensamento profundo e a investigação livre de backends node.js, ao mesmo tempo em que cria artefatos OpenSpec, como propostas, projetos e especificações.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью изучать и визуализировать кодовые базы с помощью GraphQL и Prisma.io, облегчая глубокое мышление и свободное исследование backend-части node.js, а также создание артефактов OpenSpec, таких как предложения, дизайны и спецификации.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من استكشاف قواعد البيانات وتصورها باستخدام GraphQL و Prisma.io، ويسهم في التفكير العميق والتحقيق الحر لمكونات الخادم من node.js، مع خلق مستندات مفتوحة مثل المقترحات والتصاميم والمواصفات."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating codebases","Creating OpenSpec proposals","Visualizing node.js backend architectures"],"zh":["调查代码库","创建 OpenSpec 提案","可视化 node.js 后端架构"],"ja":["コードベースの調査","OpenSpec 提案の作成","node.js バックエンドアーキテクチャの可視化"],"ko":["코드베이스 조사","OpenSpec 제안서 작성","node.js 백엔드 아키텍처 시각화"],"es":["Investigar bases de código","Crear propuestas de OpenSpec","Visualizar arquitecturas de backend de node.js"],"fr":["Investir des bases de code","Créer des propositions OpenSpec","Visualiser les architectures de backend node.js"],"de":["Codebasen untersuchen","OpenSpec-Vorschläge erstellen","node.js-Backend-Architekturen visualisieren"],"pt":["Investigar bases de código","Criar propostas OpenSpec","Visualizar arquiteturas de backend node.js"],"ru":["Изучение кодовых баз","Создание предложений OpenSpec","Визуализация архитектур backend-части node.js"],"ar":["استكشاف قواعد البيانات","إنشاء مقترحات OpenSpec","تصور هياكل الخادم من node.js"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must not write code or implement features in explore mode","Requires node.js environment"],"zh":["在探索模式下不得编写代码或实现功能","需要 node.js 环境"],"ja":["探索モードではコードを書いたり機能を実装したりしてはならない","node.js 環境が必要"],"ko":["탐색 모드에서는 코드를 작성하거나 기능을 구현해서는 안 됨","node.js 환경이 필요함"],"es":["No debe escribir código ni implementar características en modo de exploración","Requiere un entorno de node.js"],"fr":["Ne doit pas écrire de code ou implémenter des fonctionnalités en mode d''exploration","Nécessite un environnement node.js"],"de":["Sollte keinen Code schreiben oder Funktionen in Explorationsmodus implementieren","Benötigt eine node.js-Umgebung"],"pt":["Não deve escrever código ou implementar recursos no modo de exploração","Requer ambiente node.js"],"ru":["Не должен писать код или реализовывать функции в режиме изучения","Требует среды node.js"],"ar":["لا ينبغي أن يكتب الرمز أو يطبق الميزات في وضع الاستكشاف","يتطلب بيئة node.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('anthonyshew/my-video/remotion-best-practices', 'community', 'anthonyshew', 'my-video', 'anthonyshew/my-video', 'remotion-best-practices', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z', '2026-02-18T12:33:44.717Z', NULL, '{"id":"anthonyshew/my-video/remotion-best-practices","name":"remotion-best-practices","description":{"zh":"这是一个为 Remotion 开发者设计的 AI 技能，提供关于 3D 内容、动画、资源管理等关键领域的最佳实践和代码示例。","ja":"これは Remotion 開発者向けに設計された AI スキルで、3D コンテンツ、アニメーション、アセット管理などの主要分野に関するベストプラクティスとコード例を提供します。","ko":"이것은 Remotion 개발자를 위해 설계된 AI 기술로, 3D 콘텐츠, 애니메이션, 에셋 관리 등의 주요 분야에 대한 최적의 실무와 코드 예시를 제공합니다.","es":"Las mejores prácticas de Remotion ofrecen conocimientos específicos del dominio para mejorar su desarrollo. Incluye reglas para 3D, animaciones, activos y audio.","fr":"Les bonnes pratiques de Remotion offrent des connaissances spécifiques au domaine pour améliorer votre développement. Inclut des règles pour 3D, animations, ressources et audio.","de":"Die Remotion-Best-Practices bieten branchenspezifisches Wissen, um Ihre Entwicklung zu verbessern. Enthält Regeln für 3D, Animationen, Assets und Audio.","pt":"Remotion é uma ferramenta poderosa para criar conteúdo de vídeo personalizado. Aprenda as melhores práticas para dominá-la","ru":"Remotion - мощный инструмент для создания персонализированного видеоконтента. Узнайте лучшие практики для его освоения","ar":"ريموشن هي أداة قوية لإنشاء محتوى فيديو مخصص. تعلم أفضل الممارسات لاستغلالها","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Remotion 最佳实践技能 - 开发者指南","ja":"Remotion ベストプラクティススキル - 開発者ガイド","ko":"Remotion 최적의 실무 기술 - 개발자 가이드","es":"Mejores prácticas de Remotion","fr":"Bonnes pratiques de Remotion","de":"Remotion-Best-Practices","pt":"Melhores Práticas Remotion","ru":"Лучшие практики Remotion","ar":"أفضل الممارسات ريموشن","en":"remotion-best-practices"},"description":{"zh":"这是一个为 Remotion 开发者设计的 AI 技能，提供关于 3D 内容、动画、资源管理等关键领域的最佳实践和代码示例。","ja":"これは Remotion 開発者向けに設計された AI スキルで、3D コンテンツ、アニメーション、アセット管理などの主要分野に関するベストプラクティスとコード例を提供します。","ko":"이것은 Remotion 개발자를 위해 설계된 AI 기술로, 3D 콘텐츠, 애니메이션, 에셋 관리 등의 주요 분야에 대한 최적의 실무와 코드 예시를 제공합니다.","es":"Las mejores prácticas de Remotion ofrecen conocimientos específicos del dominio para mejorar su desarrollo. Incluye reglas para 3D, animaciones, activos y au...","fr":"Les bonnes pratiques de Remotion offrent des connaissances spécifiques au domaine pour améliorer votre développement. Inclut des règles pour 3D, animations, ...","de":"Die Remotion-Best-Practices bieten branchenspezifisches Wissen, um Ihre Entwicklung zu verbessern. Enthält Regeln für 3D, Animationen, Assets und Audio.","pt":"Remotion é uma ferramenta poderosa para criar conteúdo de vídeo personalizado. Aprenda as melhores práticas para dominá-la","ru":"Remotion - мощный инструмент для создания персонализированного видеоконтента. Узнайте лучшие практики для его освоения","ar":"ريموشن هي أداة قوية لإنشاء محتوى فيديو مخصص. تعلم أفضل الممارسات لاستغلالها","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Three.js 与 React Three Fiber 的 3D 内容集成","Remotion 基础动画技术与技能","图像、视频、音频和字体等资源的导入指南","音频处理与集成的最佳实践","结构化规则文件与详细解释","可直接使用的代码示例片段"],"ja":["Three.js と React Three Fiber を使用した 3D コンテンツ統合","Remotion の基本的なアニメーション技術とスキル","画像、動画、オーディオ、フォントなどのアセットインポートガイド","オーディオ処理と統合のベストプラクティス","構造化されたルールファイルと詳細な説明","すぐに使用できるコードスニペット"],"ko":["Three.js 및 React Three Fiber를 이용한 3D 콘텐츠 통합","Remotion 기본 애니메이션 기술 및 스킬","이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 폰트 등의 에셋 가져오기 가이드","오디오 처리 및 통합 최적의 실무","구조화된 규칙 파일과 상세 설명","즉시 사용 가능한 코드 스니펫"],"es":["Reglas para 3D con Three.js y React Three Fiber","Habilidades de animación fundamentales","Importación de imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes","Uso de audio en Remotion","Ejemplos de código detallados"],"fr":["Règles pour 3D avec Three.js et React Three Fiber","Compétences d''animation fondamentales","Importation d''images, de vidéos, d''audio et de polices","Utilisation de l''audio dans Remotion","Exemples de code détaillés"],"de":["Regeln für 3D mit Three.js und React Three Fiber","Grundlegende Animationsfähigkeiten","Importieren von Bildern, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten","Verwendung von Audio in Remotion","Detaillierte Codebeispiele"],"pt":["Criação de conteúdo 3D com Three.js e React Three Fiber","Animações fundamentais para Remotion","Importação de imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes","Otimização de desempenho para vídeos","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Создание 3D-контента с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber","Основные анимации для Remotion","Импорт изображений, видео, аудио и шрифтов","Оптимизация производительности для видео","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى 3D باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية لريموشن","استيراد الصور وملفات الفيديو والصوت والخطوط","تحسين الأداء للفيديوهات","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["remotion 最佳实践","remotion 3d 指南","react three fiber remotion","remotion 动画技巧","remotion 资源导入","remotion 音频处理","程序化视频开发","remotion 代码示例"],"ja":["remotion ベストプラクティス","remotion 3d ガイド","react three fiber remotion","remotion アニメーション技術","remotion アセットインポート","remotion オーディオ処理","プログラムによる動画開発","remotion コード例"],"ko":["remotion 최적의 실무","remotion 3d 가이드","react three fiber remotion","remotion 애니메이션 기술","remotion 에셋 가져오기","remotion 오디오 처리","프로그래밍 방식 비디오 개발","remotion 코드 예시"],"es":["Remotion","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de video","Three.js","React Three Fiber","animaciones","activos","audio"],"fr":["Remotion","bonnes pratiques","développement de vidéo","Three.js","React Three Fiber","animations","ressources","audio"],"de":["Remotion","Best-Practices","Videoentwicklung","Three.js","React Three Fiber","Animationen","Assets","Audio"],"pt":["Remotion","melhores práticas","3D","animações","importação de ativos","vídeo personalizado","desenvolvimento de vídeo","ferramentas de vídeo","React Three Fiber","Three.js"],"ru":["Remotion","лучшие практики","3D","анимации","импорт активов","персонализированное видео","разработка видео","инструменты видео","React Three Fiber","Three.js"],"ar":["ريموشن","أفضل الممارسات","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الأصول","فيديو مخصص","تطوير الفيديو","أدوات الفيديو","React Three Fiber","Three.js"]}},"owner":"anthonyshew","repo":"my-video","repoPath":"anthonyshew/my-video","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:33:44.717Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing advanced Remotion capabilities and domain-specific knowledge.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Remotion功能和特定领域知识的视频生成代理。","ja":"高度なRemotionの機能とドメイン固有の知識を必要とするビデオ生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Remotion 기능과 특정 도메인 지식을 필요로 하는 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Generación de Video que necesitan capacidades de Remotion avanzadas y conocimientos específicos del dominio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de vidéos nécessitant des fonctionnalités de Remotion avancées et des connaissances spécifiques au domaine.","de":"Perfekt für Video-Generierungsagenten, die erweiterte Remotion-Funktionen und domänenpezifisches Wissen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de Remotion e conhecimento específico de domínio.","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации видео, которым необходимы передовые возможности Remotion и специфические знания в области.","ar":" مثالي لعميل إنتاج الفيديو الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة من Remotion ومعرفة خاصة بالمجال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex 3D content using Three.js and React Three Fiber, while mastering fundamental animation skills and efficiently importing various assets such as images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion projects.","zh":"赋予代理创建复杂的3D内容的能力，使用Three.js和React Three Fiber，同时掌握基本的动画技能，并高效地将图像、视频、音频和字体等各种资产导入Remotion项目。","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用して複雑な3Dコンテンツを作成し、基本的なアニメーションスキルをマスターし、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどの様々なアセットをRemotionプロジェクトに効率的にインポートするエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 복잡한 3D 콘텐츠를 생성하고 기본적인 애니메이션 기술을 마스터하며 이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 글꼴 등 다양한 자산을 Remotion 프로젝트에 효율적으로 가져오는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear contenido 3D complejo utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber, mientras dominan habilidades de animación fundamentales e importan de manera eficiente varios activos como imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes en proyectos de Remotion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un contenu 3D complexe en utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber, tout en maîtrisant les compétences d''animation fondamentales et en important efficacement divers actifs tels que des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices dans les projets Remotion.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexen 3D-Inhalt mit Three.js und React Three Fiber zu erstellen, während sie grundlegende Animationsfähigkeiten beherrschen und verschiedene Assets wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten in Remotion-Projekte effizient importieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo 3D complexo usando Three.js e React Three Fiber, ao mesmo tempo em que dominam habilidades de animação fundamentais e importam eficientemente vários ativos, como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes, para projetos Remotion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложный 3D-контент с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber, одновременно осваивая фундаментальные навыки анимации и эффективно импортируя различные активы, такие как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты, в проекты Remotion.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية إنشاء محتوى 3D معقد باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber، في حين يتقن مهارات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية ويستورد بكفاءة مختلفة من الأصول، مثل الصور و الفيديوهات و الصوت و الخطوط، إلى مشاريع Remotion."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations for explainer videos","Optimizing video asset imports for faster rendering","Debugging animation issues in Remotion projects"],"zh":["为解释视频生成3D动画","优化视频资源导入以加快渲染速度","调试Remotion项目中的动画问题"],"ja":["解説動画のための3Dアニメーション生成","レンダリングの高速化のためのビデオアセットのインポートの最適化","Remotionプロジェクトでのアニメーション問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["설명 비디오를 위한 3D 애니메이션 생성","렌더링 속도 향상을 위한 비디오 자산 가져오기 최적화","Remotion 프로젝트에서 애니메이션 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Generar animaciones 3D para videos explicativos","Optimizar la importación de activos de video para un renderizado más rápido","Depurar problemas de animación en proyectos de Remotion"],"fr":["Générer des animations 3D pour des vidéos explicatives","Optimiser l''importation d''actifs vidéo pour un rendu plus rapide","Déboguer les problèmes d''animation dans les projets Remotion"],"de":["Erstellen von 3D-Animationen für Erklärvideos","Optimieren des Video-Asset-Imports für ein schnelleres Rendering","Debuggen von Animationsproblemen in Remotion-Projekten"],"pt":["Geração de animações 3D para vídeos explicativos","Otimização da importação de ativos de vídeo para renderização mais rápida","Depuração de problemas de animação em projetos Remotion"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-анимаций для эксплайнер-видео","Оптимизация импорта видео-активов для более быстрой отрисовки","Отладка проблем анимации в проектах Remotion"],"ar":["إنشاء رسوم متحركة 3D لفيديوهاتشرح","تحسين استيراد أصول الفيديو لتصيير أسرع","تصحيح مشاكل الرسوم المتحركة في مشاريع Remotion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Familiarity with Three.js and React Three Fiber recommended"],"zh":["需要访问Remotion代码库","建议熟悉Three.js和React Three Fiber"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Three.jsとReact Three Fiberの経験が推奨される"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 접근해야 함","Three.js와 React Three Fiber에 익숙해지는 것이 추천됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código de Remotion","Se recomienda familiaridad con Three.js y React Three Fiber"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code Remotion","Familiarité avec Three.js et React Three Fiber recommandée"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Remotion-Codebasis","Vertrautheit mit Three.js und React Three Fiber wird empfohlen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código base Remotion","Familiaridade com Three.js e React Three Fiber recomendada"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кодовой базе Remotion","Рекомендуется знакомство с Three.js и React Three Fiber"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية Remotion","يوصى بالاطلاع على Three.js و React Three Fiber"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('takitajwar17/remotion/remotion-best-practices', 'community', 'takitajwar17', 'remotion', 'takitajwar17/remotion', 'remotion-best-practices', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z', '2026-02-18T12:33:16.571Z', NULL, '{"id":"takitajwar17/remotion/remotion-best-practices","name":"remotion-best-practices","description":{"zh":"Remotion 最佳实践提供了有关如何高效使用 Remotion 的指导，包括 3D 内容、动画、资产和音频的处理","ja":"Remotion ベストプラクティスは、Remotion を効率的に使用する方法に関するガイダンスを提供します。3D コンテンツ、 애니메이션、資産、オーディオの処理が含まれます","ko":"Remotion 최적화 실践은 Remotion을 효율적으로 사용하는 방법에 대한 가이드를 제공합니다. 3D 컨텐츠, 애니메이션, 자산 및 오디오 처리가 포함됩니다","es":"Remotion es una herramienta poderosa para crear contenido de video personalizado. Nuestras mejores prácticas te ayudarán a dominar su uso.","fr":"Remotion est un outil puissant pour créer du contenu vidéo personnalisé. Nos meilleures pratiques vous aideront à maîtriser son utilisation.","de":"Remotion ist ein leistungsfähiges Tool für die Erstellung von individuellen Videoinhalten. Unsere Best Practices helfen Ihnen, seine Verwendung zu meistern.","pt":"Remotion é uma ferramenta poderosa para criar conteúdo de vídeo personalizado. Aprenda as melhores práticas para dominá-la","ru":"Remotion - это мощный инструмент для создания персонализированного видеоконтента. Узнайте лучшие практики для его освоения","ar":"ريموشن هي أداة قوية لإنشاء محتوى فيديو مخصص. تعلم أفضل الممارسات للسيطرة عليها","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Remotion 最佳实践","ja":"Remotion ベストプラクティス","ko":"Remotion 최적화 실践","es":"Mejores prácticas de Remotion","fr":"Bonnes pratiques de Remotion","de":"Remotion Best Practices","pt":"Melhores Práticas Remotion","ru":"Лучшие практики Remotion","ar":"أفضل الممارسات ريموشن","en":"remotion-best-practices"},"description":{"zh":"Remotion 最佳实践提供了有关如何高效使用 Remotion 的指导，包括 3D 内容、动画、资产和音频的处理","ja":"Remotion ベストプラクティスは、Remotion を効率的に使用する方法に関するガイダンスを提供します。3D コンテンツ、 애니메이션、資産、オーディオの処理が含まれます","ko":"Remotion 최적화 실践은 Remotion을 효율적으로 사용하는 방법에 대한 가이드를 제공합니다. 3D 컨텐츠, 애니메이션, 자산 및 오디오 처리가 포함됩니다","es":"Remotion es una herramienta poderosa para crear contenido de video personalizado. Nuestras mejores prácticas te ayudarán a dominar su uso.","fr":"Remotion est un outil puissant pour créer du contenu vidéo personnalisé. Nos meilleures pratiques vous aideront à maîtriser son utilisation.","de":"Remotion ist ein leistungsfähiges Tool für die Erstellung von individuellen Videoinhalten. Unsere Best Practices helfen Ihnen, seine Verwendung zu meistern.","pt":"Remotion é uma ferramenta poderosa para criar conteúdo de vídeo personalizado. Aprenda as melhores práticas para dominá-la","ru":"Remotion - это мощный инструмент для создания персонализированного видеоконтента. Узнайте лучшие практики для его освоения","ar":"ريموشن هي أداة قوية لإنشاء محتوى فيديو مخصص. تعلم أفضل الممارسات للسيطرة عليها","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["3D 内容处理","动画技能","资产导入","音频处理","React Three Fiber 集成"],"ja":["3D コンテンツの処理","アニメーションスキル","資産のインポート","オーディオの処理","React Three Fiber の統合"],"ko":["3D 컨텐츠 처리","애니메이션 스킬","자산导入","오디오 처리","React Three Fiber 통합"],"es":["Creación de contenido 3D con Three.js y React Three Fiber","Animaciones fundamentales para Remotion","Importación de imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes","Uso de audio en Remotion","Ejemplos de código detallados"],"fr":["Création de contenu 3D avec Three.js et React Three Fiber","Animations fondamentales pour Remotion","Importation d''images, de vidéos, d''audio et de polices","Utilisation de l''audio dans Remotion","Exemples de code détaillés"],"de":["Erstellung von 3D-Inhalten mit Three.js und React Three Fiber","Grundlegende Animationen für Remotion","Import von Bildern, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten","Verwendung von Audio in Remotion","Detaillierte Codebeispiele"],"pt":["Criação de conteúdo 3D com Three.js e React Three Fiber","Animações fundamentais para Remotion","Importação de imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes","Otimização de desempenho para vídeos","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Создание 3D-контента с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber","Фундаментальные анимации для Remotion","Импорт изображений, видео, аудио и шрифтов","Оптимизация производительности для видео","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى 3D باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية لريموشن","استيراد الصور والفيديوهات والصوت والخطوط","تحسين الأداء للفيديوهات","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion","最佳实践","3D 内容","动画","资产","音频","React Three Fiber"],"ja":["Remotion","ベストプラクティス","3D コンテンツ","アニメーション","資産","オーディオ","React Three Fiber"],"ko":["Remotion","최적화 실践","3D 컨텐츠","애니메이션","자산","오디오","React Three Fiber"],"es":["Remotion","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de video","contenido personalizado","Three.js","React Three Fiber","animaciones","importación de activos"],"fr":["Remotion","bonnes pratiques","développement de vidéo","contenu personnalisé","Three.js","React Three Fiber","animations","importation de ressources"],"de":["Remotion","Best Practices","Videoentwicklung","individueller Inhalt","Three.js","React Three Fiber","Animationen","Import von Ressourcen"],"pt":["Remotion","melhores práticas","3D","animações","importação de ativos","desenvolvimento de vídeo","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Three.js","React Three Fiber"],"ru":["Remotion","лучшие практики","3D","анимации","импорт активов","разработка видео","инструменты разработки","Three.js","React Three Fiber"],"ar":["ريموشن","أفضل الممارسات","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الأصول","تطوير الفيديو","أدوات التطوير","Three.js","React Three Fiber"]}},"owner":"takitajwar17","repo":"remotion","repoPath":"takitajwar17/remotion","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:33:16.571Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI Agents generating programmatic videos with Remotion, providing domain-specific expertise in React-based animation workflows.","zh":"对于使用Remotion生成程序化视频的AI代理至关重要，提供基于React的动画工作流程的领域专业知识。","ja":"Remotionを使用してプログラムによるビデオを生成するAIエージェントにとって必須であり、Reactベースのアニメーションワークフローに関する分野特化の専門知識を提供します。","ko":"Remotion으로 프로그램 방식의 비디오를 생성하는 AI 에이전트에 필수적이며, React 기반 애니메이션 워크플로우에 대한 도메인 특화 전문 지식을 제공합니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de IA que generan videos programáticos con Remotion, brindando experiencia específica del dominio en flujos de trabajo de animación basados en React.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents IA générant des vidéos programmatiques avec Remotion, fournissant une expertise spécifique au domaine dans les flux de travail d''animation basés sur React.","de":"Wesentlich für KI-Agents, die programmatische Videos mit Remotion erstellen, und bietet domänen-spezifische Expertise in React-basierten Animations-Workflows.","pt":"Essencial para agentes de IA que geram vídeos programáticos com Remotion, fornecendo expertise específica de domínio em fluxos de trabalho de animação baseados em React.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов ИИ, генерирующих программные видео с помощью Remotion, предоставляя экспертизу в области конкретных доменов в рабочих процессах анимации на основе React.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تولد مقاطع فيديو برمجية باستخدام Remotion، وتوفر خبرة محددة في مجال سير عمل الرسوم المتحركة التي تعتمد على React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master Remotion''s programmatic video creation capabilities, including Three.js 3D content integration, React Three Fiber implementations, and optimized asset handling for images, videos, audio, and fonts. Provides structured best practices for creating deterministic animations and video compositions programmatically.","zh":"使代理能够掌握Remotion的程序化视频创建功能，包括Three.js 3D内容集成、React Three Fiber实现，以及针对图像、视频、音频和字体的优化资源处理。为以编程方式创建确定性动画和视频合成提供结构化的最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントがRemotionのプログラムによるビデオ作成機能（Three.jsの3Dコンテンツ統合、React Three Fiberの実装、画像、動画、オーディオ、フォントの最適化されたアセット処理を含む）を習得できるようにします。プログラムによって決定論的なアニメーションとビデオ合成を作成するための構造化されたベストプラクティスを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js 3D 콘텐츠 통합, React Three Fiber 구현, 이미지, 비디오, 오디오 및 글꼴을 위한 최적화된 에셋 처리 등을 포함한 Remotion의 프로그램 방식 비디오 생성 기능을 숙달할 수 있도록 합니다. 프로그램적으로 결정론적 애니메이션과 비디오 컴포지션을 생성하기 위한 구조화된 모범 사례를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar las capacidades de creación de videos programáticos de Remotion, incluyendo la integración de contenido 3D de Three.js, implementaciones de React Three Fiber y el manejo optimizado de activos para imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes. Proporciona prácticas recomendadas estructuradas para crear animaciones y composiciones de video de forma programática y determinista.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser les capacités de création de vidéos programmatiques de Remotion, y compris l''intégration de contenu 3D Three.js, les implémentations de React Three Fiber et la gestion optimisée des ressources pour les images, les vidéos, l''audio et les polices. Fournit des meilleures pratiques structurées pour créer des animations et des compositions de vidéo de manière programmatique.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Remotions Fähigkeiten zur Erstellung von programmatischen Videos zu meistern, einschließlich der Integration von Three.js-3D-Inhalten, React-Three-Fiber-Implementierungen und optimierter Asset-Verwaltung für Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten. Bietet strukturierte Best-Practices für die Erstellung von deterministischen Animationen und Videozusammensetzungen in programmatischer Form.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar as capacidades de criação de vídeo programático do Remotion, incluindo a integração de conteúdo 3D do Three.js, implementações do React Three Fiber e manipulação de ativos otimizados para imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes. Fornece práticas recomendadas estruturadas para criar animações e composições de vídeo de forma programática e determinística.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить возможности программного создания видео в Remotion, включая интеграцию 3D-контента Three.js, реализации React Three Fiber и оптимизированную обработку активов для изображений, видео, аудио и шрифтов. Предоставляет структурированные лучшие практики для создания детерминированных анимаций и видеокомпозиций программно.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إتقان قدرات إنشاء الفيديو البرمجية في Remotion، بما في ذلك دمج محتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد من Three.js وتنفيذات React Three Fiber ومعالجة أصول محسنة للصور والفيديو والصوت والخطوط. توفر أفضل الممارسات المنظمة لإنشاء رسوم متحركة وتركيبات فيديو برمجيا بطريقة محددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D video content using Three.js and React Three Fiber","Creating optimized animation sequences with Remotion''s timeline system","Handling media assets programmatically for video compositions","Developing responsive video layouts with React components"],"zh":["使用Three.js和React Three Fiber生成3D视频内容","利用Remotion的时间线系统创建优化的动画序列","以编程方式处理媒体资源以进行视频合成","使用React组件开发响应式视频布局"],"ja":["Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用した3Dビデオコンテンツの生成","Remotionのタイムラインシステムを使用した最適化されたアニメーションシーケンスの作成","ビデオ合成のためのメディアアセットのプログラムによる処理","Reactコンポーネントを使用したレスポンシブなビデオレイアウトの開発"],"ko":["Three.js 및 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 3D 비디오 콘텐츠 생성","Remotion의 타임라인 시스템으로 최적화된 애니메이션 시퀀스 생성","비디오 컴포지션을 위한 미디어 에셋 프로그램 처리","React 컴포넌트로 반응형 비디오 레이아웃 개발"],"es":["Generar contenido de video 3D utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber","Crear secuencias de animación optimizadas con el sistema de línea de tiempo de Remotion","Manejar activos multimedia de forma programática para composiciones de video","Desarrollar diseños de video responsivos con componentes de React"],"fr":["Générer du contenu vidéo 3D en utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber","Créer des séquences d''animation optimisées avec le système de timeline de Remotion","Gérer les ressources multimédias de manière programmatique pour les compositions de vidéo","Développer des mises en page de vidéo responsives avec des composants React"],"de":["Erzeugen von 3D-Videoinhalten mit Three.js und React Three Fiber","Erstellen von optimierten Animationssequenzen mit Remotions Zeitachse-System","Verwalten von Medien-Assets programmatisch für Videozusammensetzungen","Entwickeln von responsiven Video-Layouts mit React-Komponenten"],"pt":["Gerar conteúdo de vídeo 3D usando Three.js e React Three Fiber","Criar sequências de animação otimizadas com o sistema de linha do tempo do Remotion","Manipular ativos de mídia programaticamente para composições de vídeo","Desenvolver layouts de vídeo responsivos com componentes React"],"ru":["Генерировать 3D-видео контент с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber","Создавать оптимизированные анимационные последовательности с помощью системы временной шкалы Remotion","Обрабатывать медиа-активы программно для видеокомпозиций","Разрабатывать адаптивные видео-макеты с помощью компонентов React"],"ar":["توليد محتوى فيديو ثلاثي الأبعاد باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","إنشاء تسلسلات رسوم متحركة محسنة باستخدام نظام جدول زمني Remotion","معالجة أصول الوسائطprogrammatically من أجل تركيبات الفيديو","تطوير تخطيطات فيديو قابلة للتكيف باستخدام مكونات React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Remotion codebase or project setup","Focuses exclusively on Remotion ecosystem (not general video editing)","Assumes React and JavaScript/TypeScript knowledge"],"zh":["需要现有的Remotion代码库或项目设置","完全专注于Remotion生态系统（非通用视频编辑）","假定具备React和JavaScript/TypeScript知识"],"ja":["既存のRemotionコードベースまたはプロジェクト設定が必要","Remotionエコシステムに完全に焦点を当てている（一般的なビデオ編集ではない）","ReactおよびJavaScript/TypeScriptの知識を前提としている"],"ko":["기존 Remotion 코드베이스 또는 프로젝트 설정 필요","Remotion 생태계에만 집중함(일반 비디오 편집 아님)","React 및 JavaScript/TypeScript 지식 가정"],"es":["Requiere una base de código existente de Remotion o una configuración de proyecto","Se centra exclusivamente en el ecosistema de Remotion (no en la edición de video en general)","Supone conocimiento de React y JavaScript/TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une base de code existante de Remotion ou une configuration de projet","Se concentre exclusivement sur l''écosystème de Remotion (et non sur l''édition de vidéo en général)","Suppose des connaissances en React et JavaScript/TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt eine bestehende Remotion-Codebasis oder eine Projektkonfiguration","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf das Remotion-Ökosystem (nicht auf die allgemeine Videoverarbeitung)","Geht von Kenntnissen in React und JavaScript/TypeScript aus"],"pt":["Requer uma base de código Remotion existente ou configuração de projeto","Foca exclusivamente no ecossistema Remotion (não edição de vídeo geral)","Pressupõe conhecimento de React e JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует существующей базы кода Remotion или настройки проекта","Сосредоточен исключительно на экосистеме Remotion (не общая видеоредакция)","Предполагает знание React и JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب قاعدة شفرة Remotion موجودة أو إعداد مشروع","يركز حصريا على نظام Remotion (لا تحرير فيديو عام)","يفترض معرفة React و JavaScript/TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-apply-change', 'community', 'Ejyke90', 'kudegowo', 'Ejyke90/kudegowo', 'openspec-apply-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z', '2026-02-18T12:33:46.158Z', NULL, '{"id":"Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-apply-change","name":"openspec-apply-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-apply-change技能用于实现OpenSpec变更，通过自动化任务提高开发效率","ja":"OpenSpecの変更適用を実現するopenspec-apply-changeスキルにより、タスクの自動化と開発効率の向上を図る","ko":"openspec-apply-change 스킬은 OpenSpec 변경을 적용하여 자동화 작업과 개발 효율성을 높여줍니다","es":"La habilidad openspec-apply-change permite implementar tareas desde un cambio OpenSpec, mejorando la eficiencia en el desarrollo.","fr":"La compétence openspec-apply-change permet de mettre en œuvre des tâches à partir d''un changement OpenSpec, améliorant ainsi l''efficacité du développement.","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-apply-change ermöglicht die Implementierung von Aufgaben aus einer OpenSpec-Änderung, wodurch die Effizienz bei der Entwicklung verbessert wird.","pt":"O openspec-apply-change é uma habilidade que implementa tarefas de alteração do OpenSpec. Ele seleciona a alteração com base no nome fornecido ou no contexto da conversa.","ru":"Openspec-apply-change — это навык, который реализует задачи изменения OpenSpec. Он выбирает изменение на основе предоставленного имени или контекста разговора.","ar":"openspec-apply-change هو مهارة ينفذ مهام تغيير OpenSpec. يقوم باختيار التغيير dựa على الاسم المُقدم أو سياق المحادثة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"OpenSpec 变更应用 - 开发者指南","ja":"OpenSpec 変更適用 - デベロッパーガイド","ko":"OpenSpec 변경 적용 - 개발자 가이드","es":"Aplicar cambios con OpenSpec","fr":"Appliquer les modifications OpenSpec","de":"Änderungen mit OpenSpec anwenden","pt":"Aplicar Mudanças OpenSpec","ru":"Применение изменений OpenSpec","ar":"تطبيق التغييرات OpenSpec","en":"openspec-apply-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-apply-change技能用于实现OpenSpec变更，通过自动化任务提高开发效率","ja":"OpenSpecの変更適用を実現するopenspec-apply-changeスキルにより、タスクの自動化と開発効率の向上を図る","ko":"openspec-apply-change 스킬은 OpenSpec 변경을 적용하여 자동화 작업과 개발 효율성을 높여줍니다","es":"La habilidad openspec-apply-change permite implementar tareas desde un cambio OpenSpec, mejorando la eficiencia en el desarrollo.","fr":"La compétence openspec-apply-change permet de mettre en œuvre des tâches à partir d''un changement OpenSpec, améliorant ainsi l''efficacité du développement.","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-apply-change ermöglicht die Implementierung von Aufgaben aus einer OpenSpec-Änderung, wodurch die Effizienz bei der Entwicklung verbes...","pt":"O openspec-apply-change é uma habilidade que implementa tarefas de alteração do OpenSpec. Ele seleciona a alteração com base no nome fornecido ou no contexto...","ru":"Openspec-apply-change — это навык, который реализует задачи изменения OpenSpec. Он выбирает изменение на основе предоставленного имени или контекста разговора.","ar":"openspec-apply-change هو مهارة ينفذ مهام تغيير OpenSpec. يقوم باختيار التغيير dựa على الاسم المُقدم أو سياق المحادثة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化OpenSpec变更任务","支持从对话上下文中推断变更名","当变更名不明确时，提示可用变更","支持运行openspec list --json获取可用变更","提高开发效率"],"ja":["OpenSpecの変更タスクの自動化","会話のコンテキストから変更名を推測する機能","変更名が不明確な場合、利用可能な変更を提示","openspec list --jsonを実行して利用可能な変更を取得","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["OpenSpec 변경 작업 자동화","대화 문맥에서 변경 이름을 추론하는 기능","변경 이름이 모호한 경우 사용 가능한 변경提示","openspec list --json 실행하여 사용 가능한 변경 얻기","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Implementación de tareas desde un cambio OpenSpec","Inferencia del cambio desde el contexto de conversación","Selección automática si solo hay un cambio activo","Solicitud de cambios disponibles si la referencia es ambigua","Integración con la línea de comandos de OpenSpec"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de tâches à partir d''un changement OpenSpec","Déduction du changement à partir du contexte de conversation","Sélection automatique si seul un changement est actif","Demande de changements disponibles si la référence est ambiguë","Intégration avec la ligne de commande OpenSpec"],"de":["Implementierung von Aufgaben aus einer OpenSpec-Änderung","Ableitung der Änderung aus dem Konversationskontext","Automatische Auswahl, wenn nur eine Änderung aktiv ist","Anfrage nach verfügbaren Änderungen, wenn die Referenz mehrdeutig ist","Integration mit der OpenSpec-Kommandozeile"],"pt":["Seleção de alteração com base no nome ou contexto","Implementação de tarefas de alteração do OpenSpec","Suporte a várias alterações","Inferência de alteração a partir do contexto da conversa","Prompt para alterações disponíveis em caso de ambiguidade"],"ru":["Выбор изменения на основе имени или контекста","Реализация задач изменения OpenSpec","Поддержка нескольких изменений","Вывод изменения из контекста разговора","Предложение доступных изменений в случае неоднозначности"],"ar":["اختيار التغيير dựa على الاسم أو السياق","تنفيذ مهام تغيير OpenSpec","دعم التغييرات المتعددة","استنتاج التغيير من سياق المحادثة","توجيه إلى التغييرات المتاحة في حالة الغموض"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenSpec","openspec-apply-change","自动化","开发效率","变更管理","开发工具"],"ja":["OpenSpec","openspec-apply-change","自動化","開発効率","変更管理","開発ツール"],"ko":["OpenSpec","openspec-apply-change","자동화","개발 효율성","변경 관리","개발 도구"],"es":["openspec-apply-change","desarrollo de software","implementación de tareas","cambios OpenSpec","eficiencia en el desarrollo","integración con OpenSpec"],"fr":["openspec-apply-change","développement de logiciels","mise en œuvre de tâches","modifications OpenSpec","efficacité du développement","intégration avec OpenSpec"],"de":["openspec-apply-change","Software-Entwicklung","Implementierung von Aufgaben","OpenSpec-Änderungen","Effizienz bei der Entwicklung","Integration mit OpenSpec"],"pt":["openspec-apply-change","aplicar mudanças OpenSpec","implementar tarefas de alteração","seleção de alteração","inferência de alteração","prompt para alterações"],"ru":["openspec-apply-change","применение изменений OpenSpec","реализация задач изменения","выбор изменения","вывод изменения","предложение изменений"],"ar":["openspec-apply-change","تطبيق التغييرات OpenSpec","تنفيذ مهام التغيير","اختيار التغيير","استنتاج التغيير","توجيه إلى التغييرات"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"kudegowo","repoPath":"Ejyke90/kudegowo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-apply-change","description":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change. Use when the user wants to start implementing, continue implementation, or work through tasks.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Select the change**\n\n   If a name is provided, use it. Otherwise:\n   - Infer from conversation context if the user mentioned a change\n   - Auto-select if only one active change exists\n   - If ambiguous, run `openspec list --json` to get available changes and use the *","body":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Select the change**\n\n   If a name is provided, use it. Otherwise:\n   - Infer from conversation context if the user mentioned a change\n   - Auto-select if only one active change exists\n   - If ambiguous, run `openspec list --json` to get available changes and use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select\n\n   Always announce: \"Using change: <name>\" and how to override (e.g., `/opsx:apply <other>`).\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifact contains the tasks (typically \"tasks\" for spec-driven, check status for others)\n\n3. **Get apply instructions**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns:\n   - Context file paths (varies by schema - could be proposal/specs/design/tasks or spec/tests/implementation/docs)\n   - Progress (total, complete, remaining)\n   - Task list with status\n   - Dynamic instruction based on current state\n\n   **Handle states:**\n   - If `state: \"blocked\"` (missing artifacts): show message, suggest using openspec-continue-change\n   - If `state: \"all_done\"`: congratulate, suggest archive\n   - Otherwise: proceed to implementation\n\n4. **Read context files**\n\n   Read the files listed in `contextFiles` from the apply instructions output.\n   The files depend on the schema being used:\n   - **spec-driven**: proposal, specs, design, tasks\n   - Other schemas: follow the contextFiles from CLI output\n\n5. **Show current progress**\n\n   Display:\n   - Schema being used\n   - Progress: \"N/M tasks complete\"\n   - Remaining tasks overview\n   - Dynamic instruction from CLI\n\n6. **Implement tasks (loop until done or blocked)**\n\n   For each pending task:\n   - Show which task is being worked on\n   - Make the code changes required\n   - Keep changes minimal and focused\n   - Mark task complete in the tasks file: `- [ ]` → `- [x]`\n   - Continue to next task\n\n   **Pause if:**\n   - Task is unclear → ask for clarification\n   - Implementation reveals a design issue → suggest updating artifacts\n   - Error or blocker encountered → report and wait for guidance\n   - User interrupts\n\n7. **On completion or pause, show status**\n\n   Display:\n   - Tasks completed this session\n   - Overall progress: \"N/M tasks complete\"\n   - If all done: suggest archive\n   - If paused: explain why and wait for guidance\n\n**Output During Implementation**\n\n```\n## Implementing: <change-name> (schema: <schema-name>)\n\nWorking on task 3/7: <task description>\n[...implementation happening...]\n✓ Task complete\n\nWorking on task 4/7: <task description>\n[...implementation happening...]\n✓ Task complete\n```\n\n**Output On Completion**\n\n```\n## Implementation Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Progress:** 7/7 tasks complete ✓\n\n### Completed This Session\n- [x] Task 1\n- [x] Task 2\n...\n\nAll tasks complete! Ready to archive this change.\n```\n\n**Output On Pause (Issue Encountered)**\n\n```\n## Implementation Paused\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Progress:** 4/7 tasks complete\n\n### Issue Encountered\n<description of the issue>\n\n**Options:**\n1. <option 1>\n2. <option 2>\n3. Other approach\n\nWhat would you like to do?\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Keep going through tasks until done or blocked\n- Always read context files before starting (from the apply instructions output)\n- If task is ambiguous, pause and ask before implementing\n- If implementation reveals issues, pause and suggest artifact updates\n- Keep code changes minimal and scoped to each task\n- Update task checkbox immediately after completing each task\n- Pause on errors, blockers, or unclear requirements - don''t guess\n- Use contextFiles from CLI output, don''t assume specific file names\n\n**Fluid Workflow Integration**\n\nThis skill supports the \"actions on a change\" model:\n\n- **Can be invoked anytime**: Before all artifacts are done (if tasks exist), after partial implementation, interleaved with other actions\n- **Allows artifact updates**: If implementation reveals design issues, suggest updating artifacts - not phase-locked, work fluidly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:33:46.158Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring seamless OpenSpec integration for automated change management.","zh":"适用于需要无缝OpenSpec集成以实现自动化变更管理的DevOps代理。","ja":"OpenSpecのシームレスな統合が必要なDevOpsエージェントの自動化された変更管理に適しています。","ko":"자동화된 변경 관리를 위해 무결점 OpenSpec 통합이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren una integración sin problemas de OpenSpec para la gestión automatizada de cambios.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une intégration OpenSpec transparente pour la gestion automatique des changements.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine nahtlose OpenSpec-Integration für die automatisierte Änderungsverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes DevOps que exigem integração perfeita do OpenSpec para gerenciamento de alterações automatizado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, требующих бесшовной интеграции OpenSpec для автоматизированного управления изменениями.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذين يتطلبون تكامل OpenSpec بدون مشاكل لإدارة التغييرات الآلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute tasks from OpenSpec changes using JSON output from ''openspec list'' commands, allowing for dynamic change selection and inference from conversation context.","zh":"赋予代理执行任务的能力，使用来自''openspec list''命令的JSON输出，从对话上下文中选择和推断变更，实现动态变更选择。","ja":"''openspec list''コマンドのJSON出力からタスクを実行するエージェントの能力を付与し、会話のコンテキストから動的変更の選択と推論を可能にします。","ko":"''openspec list'' 명령의 JSON 출력을 사용하여 에이전트가 작업을 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 대화의.context에서 동적 변경 선택 및 추론을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar tareas a partir de los cambios de OpenSpec utilizando la salida JSON de los comandos ''openspec list'', lo que permite la selección dinámica de cambios y la inferencia del contexto de la conversación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tâches à partir des modifications OpenSpec en utilisant la sortie JSON des commandes ''openspec list'', ce qui permet la sélection dynamique de modifications et l''inférence du contexte de la conversation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Aufgaben basierend auf OpenSpec-Änderungen auszuführen, indem sie die JSON-Ausgabe der ''openspec list''-Befehle verwenden, was die dynamische Änderungsauswahl und die Inferenz aus dem Gesprächskontext ermöglicht.","pt":"Permite que os agentes executem tarefas a partir de alterações do OpenSpec usando a saída JSON dos comandos ''openspec list'', permitindo a seleção dinâmica de alterações e inferência do contexto da conversa.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять задачи из изменений OpenSpec, используя выходные данные JSON из команд ''openspec list'', что позволяет выполнять динамический выбор изменений и вывод из контекста разговора.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بتنفيذ المهام من التغييرات OpenSpec باستخدام الإخراج JSON من أوامر ''openspec list''، مما يسمح باختيار التغييرات ديناميكيًا واستخلاصها من سياق المحادثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating change implementation","Inferring change names from conversation context","Selecting changes using ''openspec list --json'' output"],"zh":["自动实施变更","从对话上下文推断变更名称","使用''openspec list --json''输出选择变更"],"ja":["変更の自動実装","会話のコンテキストから変更名を推測","''openspec list --json''出力から変更を選択"],"ko":["변경 자동 구현","대화 문脈에서 변경 이름 추론","''openspec list --json'' 출력을 사용한 변경 선택"],"es":["Automatización de la implementación de cambios","Inferencia de nombres de cambios a partir del contexto de la conversación","Selección de cambios utilizando la salida ''openspec list --json''"],"fr":["Automatisation de la mise en œuvre des modifications","Inférence des noms de modifications à partir du contexte de la conversation","Sélection de modifications en utilisant la sortie ''openspec list --json''"],"de":["Automatisierung der Änderungsimplementierung","Ableitung von Änderungsnamen aus dem Gesprächskontext","Auswahl von Änderungen unter Verwendung der Ausgabe ''openspec list --json''"],"pt":["Automatizar a implementação de alterações","Inferir nomes de alterações do contexto da conversa","Selecionar alterações usando a saída ''openspec list --json''"],"ru":["Автоматизация реализации изменений","Выделение имен изменений из контекста разговора","Выбор изменений с помощью вывода ''openspec list --json''"],"ar":["توسيع تطبيق التغييرات آليًا","استنتاج أسماء التغييرات من سياق المحادثة","اختيار التغييرات باستخدام الإخراج ''openspec list --json''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenSpec installation","Conversation context or explicit change name needed","Ambiguous change names require user prompting"],"zh":["需要OpenSpec安装","需要对话上下文或显式变更名称","模糊的变更名称需要用户提示"],"ja":["OpenSpecのインストールが必要","会話のコンテキストまたは明示的な変更名が必要","曖昧な変更名にはユーザーのプロンプティングが必要"],"ko":["OpenSpec 설치 필요","대화 문脈 또는 명시적 변경 이름 필요","모호한 변경 이름은 사용자 프롬프트가 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de OpenSpec","Se necesita el contexto de la conversación o el nombre de cambio explícito","Los nombres de cambio ambiguos requieren una intervención del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''OpenSpec","Le contexte de la conversation ou le nom de modification explicite est nécessaire","Les noms de modification ambigus nécessitent une intervention de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von OpenSpec","Der Gesprächskontext oder der explizite Änderungsname ist erforderlich","Mehrdeutige Änderungsnamen erfordern eine Benutzereingabe"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do OpenSpec","Contexto da conversa ou nome de alteração explícito necessário","Nomes de alterações ambíguos requerem solicitação de usuário"],"ru":["Требует установки OpenSpec","Необходим контекст разговора или явное имя изменения","Неоднозначные имена изменений требуют запроса пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت OpenSpec","سياق المحادثة أو اسم التغيير الصريح مطلوب","أسماء التغييرات الغامضة تتطلب التحفيز من المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gAmUssA/ai-assisted-engineering/openspec-explore', 'community', 'gAmUssA', 'ai-assisted-engineering', 'gAmUssA/ai-assisted-engineering', 'openspec-explore', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z', '2026-02-18T12:32:47.662Z', NULL, '{"id":"gAmUssA/ai-assisted-engineering/openspec-explore","name":"openspec-explore","description":{"zh":"openspec-explore 是一种技术探索模式，允许开发者深入思考和可视化代码库，不进行实现","ja":"openspec-explore は、開発者が深く考え、コードベースを可視化できる技術探索モードであり、実装は行わない","ko":"openspec-explore는 개발자가 깊이 생각하고 코드베이스를 시각화할 수 있는 기술 탐색 모드로서, 구현은 수행하지 않는다","es":"El modo de exploración de OpenSpec permite a los desarrolladores pensar y visualizar libremente sin implementar código, enfocándose en la creación de artefactos como propuestas y especificaciones","fr":"Le mode d''exploration d''OpenSpec permet aux développeurs de réfléchir et de visualiser librement sans implémenter de code, en se concentrant sur la création d''artefacts tels que des propositions et des spécifications","de":"Der Entdeckungsmodus von OpenSpec ermöglicht es Entwicklern, frei nachzudenken und zu visualisieren, ohne Code zu implementieren, und konzentriert sich auf die Erstellung von Artefakten wie Vorschlägen und Spezifikationen","pt":"O modo de exploração OpenSpec permite que desenvolvedores pensem e visualizem livremente sem implementar código. Ele é ideal para investigar a base de código e criar artefatos OpenSpec.","ru":"Режим изучения OpenSpec позволяет разработчикам думать и визуализировать свободно без реализации кода. Он идеален для изучения кодовой базы и создания артефактов OpenSpec.","ar":"وضع الاستكشاف OpenSpec يسمح للمطورين بالتفكير والتصور بحرية دون تنفيذ代码. إنه مثالي لاستكشاف قاعدة الشفرة وإنشاء مواصفات OpenSpec.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-explore 技术探索模式","ja":"openspec-explore 技術探索モード","ko":"openspec-explore 기술 탐색 모드","es":"Explora OpenSpec: Modo de exploración para desarrolladores","fr":"OpenSpec Explore : Mode d''exploration pour les développeurs","de":"OpenSpec-Explorer: Entdeckungsmodus für Entwickler","pt":"Explorar OpenSpec: Modo de Exploração para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Откройте OpenSpec: Режим Изучения для Разработчиков","ar":"استكشاف OpenSpec: وضع الاستكشاف للمطورين","en":"openspec-explore"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-explore 是一种技术探索模式，允许开发者深入思考和可视化代码库，不进行实现","ja":"openspec-explore は、開発者が深く考え、コードベースを可視化できる技術探索モードであり、実装は行わない","ko":"openspec-explore는 개발자가 깊이 생각하고 코드베이스를 시각화할 수 있는 기술 탐색 모드로서, 구현은 수행하지 않는다","es":"El modo de exploración de OpenSpec permite a los desarrolladores pensar y visualizar libremente sin implementar código, enfocándose en la creación de artefac...","fr":"Le mode d''exploration d''OpenSpec permet aux développeurs de réfléchir et de visualiser librement sans implémenter de code, en se concentrant sur la création ...","de":"Der Entdeckungsmodus von OpenSpec ermöglicht es Entwicklern, frei nachzudenken und zu visualisieren, ohne Code zu implementieren, und konzentriert sich auf d...","pt":"O modo de exploração OpenSpec permite que desenvolvedores pensem e visualizem livremente sem implementar código. Ele é ideal para investigar a base de código...","ru":"Режим изучения OpenSpec позволяет разработчикам думать и визуализировать свободно без реализации кода. Он идеален для изучения кодовой базы и создания артефа...","ar":"وضع الاستكشاف OpenSpec يسمح للمطورين بالتفكير والتصور بحرية دون تنفيذ代码. إنه مثالي لاستكشاف قاعدة الشفرة وإنشاء مواصفات OpenSpec.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["深入思考和可视化代码库","不进行代码实现","可以创建 OpenSpec 文档","支持开发者自由探索","提高开发效率和质量"],"ja":["コードベースの深く考えると可視化","コードの実装は行わない","OpenSpec ドキュメントを作成可能","開発者の自由な探索をサポート","開発効率と品質の向上"],"ko":["코드베이스의 깊이 생각하고 시각화","코드 구현은 수행하지 않는다","OpenSpec 문서を作成할 수 있다","개발자의 자유로운 탐색을 지원","개발 효율과 품질의 향상"],"es":["Modo de exploración para desarrolladores","Creación de artefactos OpenSpec","Investigación del código base","Búsqueda de código","Lectura de archivos"],"fr":["Mode d''exploration pour les développeurs","Création d''artefacts OpenSpec","Recherche dans le code base","Recherche de code","Lecture de fichiers"],"de":["Entdeckungsmodus für Entwickler","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten","Untersuchung des Code-Basisses","Code-Suche","Dateilesen"],"pt":["Modo de exploração para desenvolvedores","Investigação da base de código","Criação de artefatos OpenSpec","Nenhuma implementação de código","Pensamento e visualização livres"],"ru":["Режим изучения для разработчиков","Изучение кодовой базы","Создание артефактов OpenSpec","Нет реализации кода","Свободное мышление и визуализация"],"ar":["وضع استكشاف للمطورين","استكشاف قاعدة الشفرة","إنشاء مواصفات OpenSpec","لا تنفيذ للشفرة","التفكير والتصور الحر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-explore","技术探索模式","代码库可视化","开发效率","代码质量","OpenSpec"],"ja":["openspec-explore","技術探索モード","コードベース可視化","開発効率","コード品質","OpenSpec"],"ko":["openspec-explore","기술 탐색 모드","코드베이스 시각화","개발 효율","코드 품질","OpenSpec"],"es":["OpenSpec","modo de exploración","desarrollo de software","creación de artefactos","investigación de código","búsqueda de código"],"fr":["OpenSpec","mode d''exploration","développement de logiciels","création d''artefacts","recherche de code","recherche dans le code base"],"de":["OpenSpec","Entdeckungsmodus","Software-Entwicklung","Erstellung von Artefakten","Code-Untersuchung","Code-Suche"],"pt":["OpenSpec","modo de exploração","desenvolvedores","investigação de código","artefatos OpenSpec","pensamento livre","visualização livre"],"ru":["OpenSpec","режим изучения","разработчики","изучение кода","артефакты OpenSpec","свободное мышление","свободная визуализация"],"ar":["OpenSpec","وضع الاستكشاف","مطورين","استكشاف الشفرة","مواصفات OpenSpec","التفكير الحر","التصور الحر"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"ai-assisted-engineering","repoPath":"gAmUssA/ai-assisted-engineering","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s c","body":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n```bash\nopenspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type | Where to Capture |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made | `design.md` |\n   | Scope changed | `proposal.md` |\n   | New work identified | `tasks.md` |\n   | Assumption invalidated | Relevant artifact |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:32:47.662Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conceptual AI Agents needing advanced OpenSpec exploration and proposal generation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级OpenSpec探索和提案生成能力的概念AI代理。","ja":"概念AIエージェントが高度なOpenSpecの探索と提案の生成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 OpenSpec 탐색 및 제안 생성 기능이 필요한 개념 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Conceptuales que necesitan una exploración avanzada de OpenSpec y capacidades de generación de propuestas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA conceptuels nécessitant une exploration avancée d''OpenSpec et des capacités de génération de propositions.","de":"Perfekt für konzeptionelle KI-Agents, die erweiterte OpenSpec-Exploration und Vorschlagsgenerierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Conceituais que precisam de exploração avançada do OpenSpec e capacidades de geração de propostas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для концептуальных агентов ИИ, которым необходима расширенная эксплуатация OpenSpec и возможности генерации предложений.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المفاهيمي الذين يحتاجون إلى استكشاف متقدم في OpenSpec وقدرات توليد الاقتراحات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to think deeply and visualize freely, facilitating the creation of OpenSpec artifacts such as proposals, designs, and specs, while ensuring strict adherence to explore mode protocols, including reading files and searching code without implementing features.","zh":"赋予代理深入思考和自由可视化的能力，促进OpenSpec文档的创建，例如提案、设计和规格，同时确保严格遵守探索模式协议，包括阅读文件和搜索代码而不实现功能。","ja":"エージェントに深く考え、自由に視覚化する力を与え、OpenSpecアーティファクトの作成を促進します。たとえば、提案、設計、仕様などを、探索モードのプロトコルに厳密に従って作成します。探索モードでは、ファイルの読み取りやコードの検索を行いますが、機能の実装は行いません。","ko":"에이전트가 깊이 생각하고 자유롭게 시각화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 OpenSpec 아티팩트의 생성을 촉진합니다. 예를 들어, 제안, 설계, 사양 등을 탐색 모드 프로토콜을 엄격히 준수하여 생성합니다. 탐색 모드에서는 파일을 읽거나 코드를 검색하지만 기능을 구현하지 않습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a pensar profundamente y visualizar con libertad, facilitando la creación de artefactos OpenSpec como propuestas, diseños y especificaciones, al mismo tiempo que garantiza el cumplimiento estricto de los protocolos de modo de exploración, incluyendo la lectura de archivos y la búsqueda de código sin implementar características.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réfléchir profondément et de visualiser librement, facilitant la création d''artefacts OpenSpec tels que des propositions, des conceptions et des spécifications, tout en assurant le respect strict des protocoles de mode d''exploration, y compris la lecture de fichiers et la recherche de code sans implémenter de fonctionnalités.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, tief zu denken und frei zu visualisieren, wodurch die Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten wie Vorschlägen, Entwürfen und Spezifikationen erleichtert wird, während gleichzeitig die strikte Einhaltung der Explorationsmodusprotokolle gewährleistet wird, einschließlich dem Lesen von Dateien und der Suche nach Code ohne die Implementierung von Funktionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pensar profundamente e visualizar livremente, facilitando a criação de artefatos OpenSpec, como propostas, projetos e especificações, garantindo ao mesmo tempo a adesão estrita aos protocolos do modo de exploração, incluindo a leitura de arquivos e a pesquisa de código sem implementar recursos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью глубоко думать и свободно визуализировать, облегчая создание артефактов OpenSpec, таких как предложения, проекты и спецификации, обеспечивая при этом строгое соблюдение протоколов режима эксплуатации, включая чтение файлов и поиск кода без реализации функций.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من التفكير بعمق والتصور بحرية، وتسهل إنشاء مواصفات مفتوحة مثل المقترحات والتصاميم والمواصفات، مع ضمان الالتزام الصارم ببروتوكولات режим الاستكشاف، بما في ذلك قراءة الملفات والبحث عن الكود دون تنفيذ الميزات."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating codebases without modifying them","Generating OpenSpec proposals and designs","Debugging conversations to improve explore mode outcomes"],"zh":["在不修改代码库的情况下调查代码库","生成OpenSpec提案和设计","调试对话以改善探索模式结果"],"ja":["コードベースを変更せずにコードベースを調査する","OpenSpecの提案と設計を生成する","会話をデバッグして探索モードの結果を改善する"],"ko":["코드베이스를 수정하지 않고 코드베이스를 조사하는 것","OpenSpec 제안 및 설계 생성","대화调试를 통해 탐색 모드 결과 개선"],"es":["Investigar bases de código sin modificarlas","Generar propuestas y diseños OpenSpec","Depurar conversaciones para mejorar los resultados del modo de exploración"],"fr":["Enquêter sur des bases de code sans les modifier","Générer des propositions et des conceptions OpenSpec","Déboguer des conversations pour améliorer les résultats du mode d''exploration"],"de":["Untersuchen von Codebasen ohne sie zu modifizieren","Erzeugen von OpenSpec-Vorschlägen und -Entwürfen","Fehlersuche in Konversationen, um die Ergebnisse des Explorationsmodus zu verbessern"],"pt":["Investigar repositórios de código sem modificá-los","Gerar propostas e projetos OpenSpec","Depurar conversas para melhorar os resultados do modo de exploração"],"ru":["Изучать базы кода без их изменения","Генерировать предложения и проекты OpenSpec","Отлаживать разговоры для улучшения результатов режима эксплуатации"],"ar":["استقصاء مخازن الشفرة بدون تعديلها","توليد مقترحات وتصاميم مفتوحة","تصحيح المحادثات لتحسين نتائج режим الاستكشاف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must not write code or implement features in explore mode","Requires user to exit explore mode for implementation using commands like /opsx:new or /opsx:ff"],"zh":["探索模式下不得编写代码或实现功能","需要用户退出探索模式以使用命令（如/opsx:new或/opsx:ff）进行实现"],"ja":["探索モードでコードを書いたり機能を実装したりしてはならない","ユーザーが/opsx:newまたは/opsx:ffなどのコマンドを使用して実装するために探索モードを終了する必要がある"],"ko":["탐색 모드에서 코드를 작성하거나 기능을 구현할 수 없음","사용자가 /opsx:new 또는 /opsx:ff와 같은 명령을 사용하여 구현하기 위해 탐색 모드를 종료해야 함"],"es":["No debe escribir código o implementar características en modo de exploración","Requiere que el usuario salga del modo de exploración para la implementación utilizando comandos como /opsx:new o /opsx:ff"],"fr":["Ne doit pas écrire de code ou implémenter de fonctionnalités en mode d''exploration","Requiert que l''utilisateur quitte le mode d''exploration pour la mise en œuvre en utilisant des commandes comme /opsx:new ou /opsx:ff"],"de":["Darf in Explorationsmodus keinen Code schreiben oder Funktionen implementieren","Benutzer muss den Explorationsmodus verlassen, um die Implementierung mithilfe von Befehlen wie /opsx:new oder /opsx:ff durchzuführen"],"pt":["Não deve escrever código ou implementar recursos no modo de exploração","Exige que o usuário saia do modo de exploração para implementação usando comandos como /opsx:new ou /opsx:ff"],"ru":["Не должен писать код или реализовывать функции в режиме эксплуатации","Требует от пользователя выхода из режима эксплуатации для реализации с помощью команд như /opsx:new или /opsx:ff"],"ar":["لا يجب كتابته الشفرة أو تنفيذ الميزات في режим الاستكشاف","يتطلب من المستخدم الخروج من режим الاستكشاف للتطبيق باستخدام أوامر مثل /opsx:new أو /opsx:ff"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
