ahlungen"],"pt":["Checkout seguro","Assinaturas e cobranças recorrentes","Webhooks para notificações em tempo real","Reembolsos e disputas","Gestão de métodos de pagamento do cliente","Autenticação de cliente forte (SCA) para pagamentos europeus"],"ru":["Безопасный checkout","Подписки и регулярные платежи","Вебхуки для уведомлений в режиме реального времени","Возвраты и споры","Управление методами оплаты клиентов","Сильная аутентификация клиентов (SCA) для европейских платежей"],"ar":["دفع آمن","الاشتراكات والمدفوعات المتكررة","الويب هوك للتنبيهات في الوقت الفعلي","الاسترجاعات والمطالب","إدارة طرق دفع العملاء","تحقق قوي من العميل (SCA) لمدفوعات أوروبا"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Stripe集成","PCI合规","支付流程","结账","订阅","Webhook","退款"],"ja":["Stripe統合","PCIコンプライアンス","支払いフロー","決済","サブスクリプション","Webhook","返金"],"ko":["Stripe 통합","PCI 규정 준수","결제 흐름","결제","구독","웹후크","환불"],"es":["integración de Stripe","pagos seguros","PCI-compliant","flujos de pago","checkout","suscripciones","webhooks","reembolsos","autenticación del cliente fuerte"],"fr":["intégration de Stripe","paiements sécurisés","PCI-compliant","flux de paiement","checkout","abonnements","webhooks","remboursements","authentification du client forte"],"de":["Stripe-Integration","sichere Zahlungen","PCI-konforme","Zahlungsflüsse","Checkout","Abonnements","Webhooks","Rückerstattungen","starke Kundenauthentifizierung"],"pt":["integração stripe","pagamento seguro","pci compliant","assinaturas","reembolsos","webhooks","autenticação de cliente forte","pagamento recorrente"],"ru":["интеграция stripe","безопасный платеж","pci-совместимый","подписки","возвраты","вебхуки","сильная аутентификация клиентов","регулярный платеж"],"ar":["تكامل ستрайب","دفع آمن","متوافق مع معايير الأمن لإدارة البطاقات (PCI)","الاشتراكات","الاسترجاعات","الويب هوك","تحقق قوي من العميل","دفع متكرر"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ml_challenges","repoPath":"ollieb89/ml_challenges","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"stripe-integration","description":"Implement Stripe payment processing for robust, PCI-compliant payment flows including checkout, subscriptions, and webhooks. Use when integrating Stripe payments, building subscription systems, or implementing secure checkout flows.","bodyPreview":"# Stripe Integration\n\nMaster Stripe payment processing integration for robust, PCI-compliant payment flows including checkout, subscriptions, webhooks, and refunds.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing payment processing in web/mobile applications\n- Setting up subscription billing systems\n- Handling one-time payments and recurring charges\n- Processing refunds and disputes\n- Managing customer payment methods\n- Implementing SCA (Strong Customer Authentication) for European payments\n- Buildin","body":"# Stripe Integration\n\nMaster Stripe payment processing integration for robust, PCI-compliant payment flows including checkout, subscriptions, webhooks, and refunds.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing payment processing in web/mobile applications\n- Setting up subscription billing systems\n- Handling one-time payments and recurring charges\n- Processing refunds and disputes\n- Managing customer payment methods\n- Implementing SCA (Strong Customer Authentication) for European payments\n- Building marketplace payment flows with Stripe Connect\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Payment Flows\n**Checkout Session (Hosted)**\n- Stripe-hosted payment page\n- Minimal PCI compliance burden\n- Fastest implementation\n- Supports one-time and recurring payments\n\n**Payment Intents (Custom UI)**\n- Full control over payment UI\n- Requires Stripe.js for PCI compliance\n- More complex implementation\n- Better customization options\n\n**Setup Intents (Save Payment Methods)**\n- Collect payment method without charging\n- Used for subscriptions and future payments\n- Requires customer confirmation\n\n### 2. Webhooks\n**Critical Events:**\n- `payment_intent.succeeded`: Payment completed\n- `payment_intent.payment_failed`: Payment failed\n- `customer.subscription.updated`: Subscription changed\n- `customer.subscription.deleted`: Subscription canceled\n- `charge.refunded`: Refund processed\n- `invoice.payment_succeeded`: Subscription payment successful\n\n### 3. Subscriptions\n**Components:**\n- **Product**: What you''re selling\n- **Price**: How much and how often\n- **Subscription**: Customer''s recurring payment\n- **Invoice**: Generated for each billing cycle\n\n### 4. Customer Management\n- Create and manage customer records\n- Store multiple payment methods\n- Track customer metadata\n- Manage billing details\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nimport stripe\n\nstripe.api_key = \"sk_test_...\"\n\n# Create a checkout session\nsession = stripe.checkout.Session.create(\n    payment_method_types=[''card''],\n    line_items=[{\n        ''price_data'': {\n            ''currency'': ''usd'',\n            ''product_data'': {\n                ''name'': ''Premium Subscription'',\n            },\n            ''unit_amount'': 2000,  # $20.00\n            ''recurring'': {\n                ''interval'': ''month'',\n            },\n        },\n        ''quantity'': 1,\n    }],\n    mode=''subscription'',\n    success_url=''https://yourdomain.com/success?session_id={CHECKOUT_SESSION_ID}'',\n    cancel_url=''https://yourdomain.com/cancel'',\n)\n\n# Redirect user to session.url\nprint(session.url)\n```\n\n## Payment Implementation Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: One-Time Payment (Hosted Checkout)\n```python\ndef create_checkout_session(amount, currency=''usd''):\n    \"\"\"Create a one-time payment checkout session.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        session = stripe.checkout.Session.create(\n            payment_method_types=[''card''],\n            line_items=[{\n                ''price_data'': {\n                    ''currency'': currency,\n                    ''product_data'': {\n                        ''name'': ''Purchase'',\n                        ''images'': [''https://example.com/product.jpg''],\n                    },\n                    ''unit_amount'': amount,  # Amount in cents\n                },\n                ''quantity'': 1,\n            }],\n            mode=''payment'',\n            success_url=''https://yourdomain.com/success?session_id={CHECKOUT_SESSION_ID}'',\n            cancel_url=''https://yourdomain.com/cancel'',\n            metadata={\n                ''order_id'': ''order_123'',\n                ''user_id'': ''user_456''\n            }\n        )\n        return session\n    except stripe.error.StripeError as e:\n        # Handle error\n        print(f\"Stripe error: {e.user_message}\")\n        raise\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Custom Payment Intent Flow\n```python\ndef create_payment_intent(amount, currency=''usd'', customer_id=None):\n    \"\"\"Create a payment intent for custom checkout UI.\"\"\"\n    intent = stripe.PaymentIntent.create(\n        amount=amount,\n        currency=currency,\n        customer=customer_id,\n        automatic_payment_methods={\n            ''enabled'': True,\n        },\n        metadata={\n            ''integration_check'': ''accept_a_payment''\n        }\n    )\n    return intent.client_secret  # Send to frontend\n\n# Frontend (JavaScript)\n\"\"\"\nconst stripe = Stripe(''pk_test_...'');\nconst elements = stripe.elements();\nconst cardElement = elements.create(''card'');\ncardElement.mount(''#card-element'');\n\nconst {error, paymentIntent} = await stripe.confirmCardPayment(\n    clientSecret,\n    {\n        payment_method: {\n            card: cardElement,\n            billing_details: {\n                name: ''Customer Name''\n            }\n        }\n    }\n);\n\nif (error) {\n    // Handle error\n} else if (paymentIntent.status === ''succeeded'') {\n    // Payment successful\n}\n\"\"\"\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Subscription Creation\n```python\ndef create_subscription(customer_id, price_id):\n    \"\"\"Create a subscription for a customer.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        subscription = stripe.Subscription.create(\n            customer=customer_id,\n            items=[{''price'': price_id}],\n            payment_behavior=''default_incomplete'',\n            payment_settings={''save_default_payment_method'': ''on_subscription''},\n            expand=[''latest_invoice.payment_intent''],\n        )\n\n        return {\n            ''subscription_id'': subscription.id,\n            ''client_secret'': subscription.latest_invoice.payment_intent.client_secret\n        }\n    except stripe.error.StripeError as e:\n        print(f\"Subscription creation failed: {e}\")\n        raise\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Customer Portal\n```python\ndef create_customer_portal_session(customer_id):\n    \"\"\"Create a portal session for customers to manage subscriptions.\"\"\"\n    session = stripe.billing_portal.Session.create(\n        customer=customer_id,\n        return_url=''https://yourdomain.com/account'',\n    )\n    return session.url  # Redirect customer here\n```\n\n## Webhook Handling\n\n### Secure Webhook Endpoint\n```python\nfrom flask import Flask, request\nimport stripe\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\nendpoint_secret = ''whsec_...''\n\n@app.route(''/webhook'', methods=[''POST''])\ndef webhook():\n    payload = request.data\n    sig_header = request.headers.get(''Stripe-Signature'')\n\n    try:\n        event = stripe.Webhook.construct_event(\n            payload, sig_header, endpoint_secret\n        )\n    except ValueError:\n        # Invalid payload\n        return ''Invalid payload'', 400\n    except stripe.error.SignatureVerificationError:\n        # Invalid signature\n        return ''Invalid signature'', 400\n\n    # Handle the event\n    if event[''type''] == ''payment_intent.succeeded'':\n        payment_intent = event[''data''][''object'']\n        handle_successful_payment(payment_intent)\n    elif event[''type''] == ''payment_intent.payment_failed'':\n        payment_intent = event[''data''][''object'']\n        handle_failed_payment(payment_intent)\n    elif event[''type''] == ''customer.subscription.deleted'':\n        subscription = event[''data''][''object'']\n        handle_subscription_canceled(subscription)\n\n    return ''Success'', 200\n\ndef handle_successful_payment(payment_intent):\n    \"\"\"Process successful payment.\"\"\"\n    customer_id = payment_intent.get(''customer'')\n    amount = payment_intent[''amount'']\n    metadata = payment_intent.get(''metadata'', {})\n\n    # Update your database\n    # Send confirmation email\n    # Fulfill order\n    print(f\"Payment succeeded: {payment_intent[''id'']}\")\n\ndef handle_failed_payment(payment_intent):\n    \"\"\"Handle failed payment.\"\"\"\n    error = payment_intent.get(''last_payment_error'', {})\n    print(f\"Payment failed: {error.get(''message'')}\")\n    # Notify customer\n    # Update order status\n\ndef handle_subscription_canceled(subscription):\n    \"\"\"Handle subscription cancellation.\"\"\"\n    customer_id = subscription[''customer'']\n    # Update user access\n    # Send cancellation email\n    print(f\"Subscription canceled: {subscription[''id'']}\")\n```\n\n### Webhook Best Practices\n```python\nimport hashlib\nimport hmac\n\ndef verify_webhook_signature(payload, signature, secret):\n    \"\"\"Manually verify webhook signature.\"\"\"\n    expected_sig = hmac.new(\n        secret.encode(''utf-8''),\n        payload,\n        hashlib.sha256\n    ).hexdigest()\n\n    return hmac.compare_digest(signature, expected_sig)\n\ndef handle_webhook_idempotently(event_id, handler):\n    \"\"\"Ensure webhook is processed exactly once.\"\"\"\n    # Check if event already processed\n    if is_event_processed(event_id):\n        return\n\n    # Process event\n    try:\n        handler()\n        mark_event_processed(event_id)\n    except Exception as e:\n        log_error(e)\n        # Stripe will retry failed webhooks\n        raise\n```\n\n## Customer Management\n\n```python\ndef create_customer(email, name, payment_method_id=None):\n    \"\"\"Create a Stripe customer.\"\"\"\n    customer = stripe.Customer.create(\n        email=email,\n        name=name,\n        payment_method=payment_method_id,\n        invoice_settings={\n            ''default_payment_method'': payment_method_id\n        } if payment_method_id else None,\n        metadata={\n            ''user_id'': ''12345''\n        }\n    )\n    return customer\n\ndef attach_payment_method(customer_id, payment_method_id):\n    \"\"\"Attach a payment method to a customer.\"\"\"\n    stripe.PaymentMethod.attach(\n        payment_method_id,\n        customer=customer_id\n    )\n\n    # Set as default\n    stripe.Customer.modify(\n        customer_id,\n        invoice_settings={\n            ''default_payment_method'': payment_method_id\n        }\n    )\n\ndef list_customer_payment_methods(customer_id):\n    \"\"\"List all payment methods for a customer.\"\"\"\n    payment_methods = stripe.PaymentMethod.list(\n        customer=customer_id,\n        type=''card''\n    )\n    return payment_methods.data\n```\n\n## Refund Handling\n\n```python\ndef create_refund(payment_intent_id, amount=None, reason=None):\n    \"\"\"Create a refund.\"\"\"\n    refund_params = {\n        ''payment_intent'': payment_intent_id\n    }\n\n    if amount:\n        refund_params[''amount''] = amount  # Partial refund\n\n    if reason:\n        refund_params[''reason''] = reason  # ''duplicate'', ''fraudulent'', ''requested_by_customer''\n\n    refund = stripe.Refund.create(**refund_params)\n    return refund\n\ndef handle_dispute(charge_id, evidence):\n    \"\"\"Update dispute with evidence.\"\"\"\n    stripe.Dispute.modify(\n        charge_id,\n        evidence={\n            ''customer_name'': evidence.get(''customer_name''),\n            ''customer_email_address'': evidence.get(''customer_email''),\n            ''shipping_documentation'': evidence.get(''shipping_proof''),\n            ''customer_communication'': evidence.get(''communication''),\n        }\n    )\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n```python\n# Use test mode keys\nstripe.api_key = \"sk_test_...\"\n\n# Test card numbers\nTEST_CARDS = {\n    ''success'': ''4242424242424242'',\n    ''declined'': ''4000000000000002'',\n    ''3d_secure'': ''4000002500003155'',\n    ''insufficient_funds'': ''4000000000009995''\n}\n\ndef test_payment_flow():\n    \"\"\"Test complete payment flow.\"\"\"\n    # Create test customer\n    customer = stripe.Customer.create(\n        email=\"test@example.com\"\n    )\n\n    # Create payment intent\n    intent = stripe.PaymentIntent.create(\n        amount=1000,\n        currency=''usd'',\n        customer=customer.id,\n        payment_method_types=[''card'']\n    )\n\n    # Confirm with test card\n    confirmed = stripe.PaymentIntent.confirm(\n        intent.id,\n        payment_method=''pm_card_visa''  # Test payment method\n    )\n\n    assert confirmed.status == ''succeeded''\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/checkout-flows.md**: Detailed checkout implementation\n- **references/webhook-handling.md**: Webhook security and processing\n- **references/subscription-management.md**: Subscription lifecycle\n- **references/customer-management.md**: Customer and payment method handling\n- **references/invoice-generation.md**: Invoicing and billing\n- **assets/stripe-client.py**: Production-ready Stripe client wrapper\n- **assets/webhook-handler.py**: Complete webhook processor\n- **assets/checkout-config.json**: Checkout configuration templates\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always Use Webhooks**: Don''t rely solely on client-side confirmation\n2. **Idempotency**: Handle webhook events idempotently\n3. **Error Handling**: Gracefully handle all Stripe errors\n4. **Test Mode**: Thoroughly test with test keys before production\n5. **Metadata**: Use metadata to link Stripe objects to your database\n6. **Monitoring**: Track payment success rates and errors\n7. **PCI Compliance**: Never handle raw card data on your server\n8. **SCA Ready**: Implement 3D Secure for European payments\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Not Verifying Webhooks**: Always verify webhook signatures\n- **Missing Webhook Events**: Handle all relevant webhook events\n- **Hardcoded Amounts**: Use cents/smallest currency unit\n- **No Retry Logic**: Implement retries for API calls\n- **Ignoring Test Mode**: Test all edge cases with test cards\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:34:10.561Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for E-commerce Agents needing robust PCI-compliant payment processing integration via Stripe","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Stripe 实现强大的 PCI 合规支付处理集成的电子商务代理","ja":"Stripe 経由で堅牢な PCI コンプライアンス支払い処理統合を必要とする E コマースエージェントに最適","ko":"스트라이프를 통해 강력한 PCI 규정 준수 결제 처리 통합이 필요한 전자상거래 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio electrónico que necesitan una integración de procesamiento de pagos robusta y compatible con PCI a través de Stripe","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce électronique ayant besoin d''une intégration de traitement de paiement robuste et conforme à la norme PCI via Stripe","de":"Perfekt für E-Commerce-Agents, die eine robuste PCI-konforme Zahlungsverarbeitungsintegration über Stripe benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comércio Eletrônico que precisam de uma integração de processamento de pagamentos robusta e compatível com o PCI via Stripe","ru":"Идеально для агентов электронной коммерции, которым требуется надежная интеграция с обработкой платежей, соответствующая требованиям PCI, через Stripe","ar":"مثالي لويجوه التجارة الإلكترونية الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج معالجة الدفع القوي المتوافق مع معايير الأمن المالي PCI من خلال Stripe"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage checkout, subscriptions, webhooks, and refunds using Stripe''s payment processing API, ensuring Strong Customer Authentication for European payments and handling one-time payments and recurring charges via webhooks","zh":"赋予代理商使用 Stripe 的支付处理 API 管理结账、订阅、Webhook 和退款，确保欧洲支付的强客户身份验证，并通过 Webhook 处理一次性支付和循环费用","ja":"Stripe の支払い処理 API を使用して、チェックアウト、サブスクリプション、Webhook、返金を管理し、欧州の支払いに対する強力な顧客認証を確保し、Webhook 経由で一時的な支払いと繰り返し請求を処理する","ko":"에이전트가 스트라이프의 결제 처리 API를 사용하여 체크아웃, 구독, 웹후크, 환불을 관리하도록 하여 유럽 결제의 강력한 고객 인증을 보장하고 웹후크를 통해 일회성 결제 및 반복 청구를 처리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el pago, las suscripciones, los webhooks y los reembolsos utilizando la API de procesamiento de pagos de Stripe, garantizando una autenticación de cliente fuerte para los pagos europeos y manejo de pagos únicos y cargos recurrentes a través de webhooks","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer le processus de paiement, les abonnements, les webhooks et les remboursements en utilisant l''API de traitement de paiement de Stripe, assurant une authentification client forte pour les paiements européens et gérant les paiements uniques et les frais récurrents via les webhooks","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Checkout, Abonnements, Webhooks und Rückerstattungen mithilfe der Zahlungsverarbeitungs-API von Stripe zu verwalten, wodurch eine starke Kundenauthentifizierung für europäische Zahlungen sichergestellt wird und einmalige Zahlungen und regelmäßige Gebühren über Webhooks abgewickelt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar checkout, assinaturas, webhooks e reembolsos usando a API de processamento de pagamentos da Stripe, garantindo Autenticação de Cliente Forte para pagamentos europeus e tratamento de pagamentos únicos e cobranças recorrentes via webhooks","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять оформлением заказа, подписками, веб-хуками и возвратами средств с помощью API обработки платежей Stripe, обеспечивая Сильную Аутентификацию Клиента для европейских платежей и обработку единовременных платежей и регулярных сборов через веб-хуки","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة عملية الدفع والاشتراكات والرُسائل الويب والاستردادات باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات معالجة الدفع من Stripe، مما يضمن مصادقة العملاء القوية لل مدفوعات الأوروبية ومعالجة المدفوعات المنفردة والرسوم المتكررة عبر الرسائل الويب"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing payment processing in web and mobile applications","Setting up subscription billing systems with recurring charges","Handling refunds and disputes via Stripe''s API"],"zh":["在 Web 和移动应用程序中实现支付处理","设置具有循环费用的订阅计费系统","通过 Stripe 的 API 处理退款和争议"],"ja":["Web とモバイルアプリケーションで支払い処理を実装する","繰り返し料金を持つサブスクリプション請求システムを設定する","Stripe の API 経由で返金と紛争を処理する"],"ko":["웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션에서 결제 처리 구현","반복되는 요금이 있는 구독 청구 시스템 설정","스트라이프의 API를 통해 환불 및 분쟁 처리"],"es":["Implementar el procesamiento de pagos en aplicaciones web y móviles","Configurar sistemas de facturación de suscripciones con cargos recurrentes","Gestionar reembolsos y disputas a través de la API de Stripe"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le traitement de paiement dans les applications web et mobiles","Configurer les systèmes de facturation d''abonnement avec des frais récurrents","Gérer les remboursements et les litiges via l''API de Stripe"],"de":["Implementierung der Zahlungsverarbeitung in Web- und Mobilanwendungen","Einrichtung von Abonnements-Abrechnungssystemen mit regelmäßigen Gebühren","Handhabung von Rückerstattungen und Streitigkeiten über die Stripe-API"],"pt":["Implementação do processamento de pagamentos em aplicações web e móveis","Configuração de sistemas de faturamento de assinaturas com cobranças recorrentes","Tratamento de reembolsos e disputas via API da Stripe"],"ru":["Реализация обработки платежей в веб- и мобильных приложениях","Настройка систем выставления счетов за подписки с регулярными сборами","Обработка возвратов средств и споров через API Stripe"],"ar":["تنفيذ معالجة الدفع في التطبيقات الويب والجوال","إعداد أنظمة فواتير الاشتراكات مع الرسوم المتكررة","معالجة الاستردادات والنزاعات من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Stripe"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Stripe API Key","PCI-compliance requirements must be met","European payments require Strong Customer Authentication implementation"],"zh":["需要 Stripe API 密钥","必须满足 PCI 合规性要求","欧洲支付需要强客户身份验证实现"],"ja":["Stripe API キーが必要","PCI コンプライアンス要件を満たす必要がある","欧州の支払いには強力な顧客認証の実装が必要"],"ko":["스트라이프 API 키가 필요","PCI 규정 준수 요구 사항을 충족해야 함","유럽 결제에는 강력한 고객 인증 구현이 필요"],"es":["Requiere clave de API de Stripe","Deben cumplirse los requisitos de cumplimiento de PCI","Los pagos europeos requieren la implementación de una autenticación de cliente fuerte"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API Stripe","Les exigences de conformité PCI doivent être respectées","Les paiements européens nécessitent la mise en œuvre d''une authentification client forte"],"de":["Benötigt Stripe-API-Schlüssel","PCI-Konformitätsanforderungen müssen erfüllt werden","Europäische Zahlungen erfordern die Implementierung einer starken Kundenauthentifizierung"],"pt":["Requer Chave de API da Stripe","Os requisitos de conformidade com o PCI devem ser atendidos","Pagamentos europeus exigem implementação de Autenticação de Cliente Forte"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API Stripe","Требования соответствия PCI должны быть выполнены","Европейские платежи требуют реализации Сильной Аутентификации Клиента"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Stripe","يجب استيفاء متطلبات التوافق مع معايير الأمن المالي PCI","تتطلب المدفوعات الأوروبية تنفيذ مصادقة العملاء القوية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('beyildirim/tracehound/openspec-bulk-archive-change', 'community', 'beyildirim', 'tracehound', 'beyildirim/tracehound', 'openspec-bulk-archive-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z', '2026-02-18T12:35:01.435Z', NULL, '{"id":"beyildirim/tracehound/openspec-bulk-archive-change","name":"openspec-bulk-archive-change","description":{"es":"El skill openspec-bulk-archive-change permite archivar múltiples cambios completados en una sola operación, manejando conflictos de especificaciones de manera inteligente","fr":"Le skill openspec-bulk-archive-change permet d''archiver plusieurs changements complets en une seule opération, en gérant de manière intelligente les conflits de spécifications","de":"Das Skill openspec-bulk-archive-change ermöglicht das Archivieren mehrerer abgeschlossener Änderungen in einer einzigen Operation, indem es Spezifikationskonflikte intelligent handhabt","pt":"O OpenSpec permite arquivar várias alterações concluídas em uma única operação, lidando com conflitos de especificação de forma inteligente.","ru":"OpenSpec позволяет архивировать несколько завершенных изменений в одной операции, обрабатывая конфликты спецификаций умно.","ar":"يسمح OpenSpec بأرشفة عدة تغييرات مكتملة في عملية واحدة، مع التعامل مع конфликات المواصفات بذكاء.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Cambiar archivos en masa con openspec-bulk-archive-change","fr":"Modifier les archives en masse avec openspec-bulk-archive...","de":"Massen-Archivänderung mit openspec-bulk-archive-change","pt":"Arquivamento em Massa com OpenSpec","ru":"Массовое архивирование с OpenSpec","ar":"أرشفة الكتلة مع OpenSpec","en":"openspec-bulk-archive-change"},"description":{"es":"El skill openspec-bulk-archive-change permite archivar múltiples cambios completados en una sola operación, manejando conflictos de especificaciones de maner...","fr":"Le skill openspec-bulk-archive-change permet d''archiver plusieurs changements complets en une seule opération, en gérant de manière intelligente les conflits...","de":"Das Skill openspec-bulk-archive-change ermöglicht das Archivieren mehrerer abgeschlossener Änderungen in einer einzigen Operation, indem es Spezifikationskon...","pt":"O OpenSpec permite arquivar várias alterações concluídas em uma única operação, lidando com conflitos de especificação de forma inteligente.","ru":"OpenSpec позволяет архивировать несколько завершенных изменений в одной операции, обрабатывая конфликты спецификаций умно.","ar":"يسمح OpenSpec بأرشفة عدة تغييرات مكتملة في عملية واحدة، مع التعامل مع конфликات المواصفات بذكاء.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Archivar múltiples cambios completados en una sola operación","Manejo inteligente de conflictos de especificaciones","Uso de la herramienta AskUserQuestion para seleccionar cambios","Compatibilidad con la lista de cambios activos","Soporte para selección múltiple de cambios"],"fr":["Archiver plusieurs changements complets en une seule opération","Gestion intelligente des conflits de spécifications","Utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour sélectionner les changements","Compatibilité avec la liste des changements actifs","Prise en charge de la sélection multiple de changements"],"de":["Mehrere abgeschlossene Änderungen in einer einzigen Operation archivieren","Intelligente Handhabung von Spezifikationskonflikten","Verwendung des Tools AskUserQuestion zur Auswahl von Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit der Liste der aktiven Änderungen","Unterstützung für die Auswahl mehrerer Änderungen"],"pt":["Arquivamento em massa de alterações concluídas","Lidando com conflitos de especificação de forma inteligente","Utiliza o comando `openspec list --json` para obter alterações ativas","Prompt para seleção de alterações","Utiliza a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção multipla","Verifica o código para determinar o que está implementado"],"ru":["Массовое архивирование завершенных изменений","Умная обработка конфликтов спецификаций","Использует команду `openspec list --json` для получения активных изменений","Запрос на выбор изменений","Использует инструмент AskUserQuestion для множественного выбора","Проверяет код, чтобы определить, что реализовано"],"ar":["أرشفة جماعية للتغييرات المكتملة","التعامل مع конфликات المواصفات بذكاء","استخدام الأمر `openspec list --json` للحصول على التغييرات النشطة","استدعاء لتحديد التغييرات","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion للتحديد المتعدد","التحقق من الكود لتحديد ما تم تنفيذه"]},"keywords":{"es":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","archivar cambios","manejo de conflictos","desarrollo de software","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","archiver les changements","gestion des conflits","développement de logiciels","flux de travail de développement","outils de développement"],"de":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","Änderungen archivieren","Konfliktlösung","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungs-Workflow","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["openspec","arquivamento em massa","conflitos de especificação","alterações concluídas","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","programação","tecnologia"],"ru":["openspec","массовое архивирование","конфликты спецификаций","завершенные изменения","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","программирование","технологии"],"ar":["openspec","أرشفة جماعية","conflictos de especificación","تغييرات مكتملة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","برمجة","تكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"beyildirim","repo":"tracehound","repoPath":"beyildirim/tracehound","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-bulk-archive-change","description":"Archive multiple completed changes at once. Use when archiving several parallel changes.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select t","body":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select to let user choose changes:\n   - Show each change with its schema\n   - Include an option for \"All changes\"\n   - Allow any number of selections (1+ works, 2+ is the typical use case)\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT auto-select. Always let the user choose.\n\n3. **Batch validation - gather status for all selected changes**\n\n   For each selected change, collect:\n\n   a. **Artifact status** - Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Parse `schemaName` and `artifacts` list\n      - Note which artifacts are `done` vs other states\n\n   b. **Task completion** - Read `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n      - Count `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n      - If no tasks file exists, note as \"No tasks\"\n\n   c. **Delta specs** - Check `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/` directory\n      - List which capability specs exist\n      - For each, extract requirement names (lines matching `### Requirement: <name>`)\n\n4. **Detect spec conflicts**\n\n   Build a map of `capability -> [changes that touch it]`:\n\n   ```\n   auth -> [change-a, change-b]  <- CONFLICT (2+ changes)\n   api  -> [change-c]            <- OK (only 1 change)\n   ```\n\n   A conflict exists when 2+ selected changes have delta specs for the same capability.\n\n5. **Resolve conflicts agentically**\n\n   **For each conflict**, investigate the codebase:\n\n   a. **Read the delta specs** from each conflicting change to understand what each claims to add/modify\n\n   b. **Search the codebase** for implementation evidence:\n      - Look for code implementing requirements from each delta spec\n      - Check for related files, functions, or tests\n\n   c. **Determine resolution**:\n      - If only one change is actually implemented -> sync that one''s specs\n      - If both implemented -> apply in chronological order (older first, newer overwrites)\n      - If neither implemented -> skip spec sync, warn user\n\n   d. **Record resolution** for each conflict:\n      - Which change''s specs to apply\n      - In what order (if both)\n      - Rationale (what was found in codebase)\n\n6. **Show consolidated status table**\n\n   Display a table summarizing all changes:\n\n   ```\n   | Change               | Artifacts | Tasks | Specs   | Conflicts | Status |\n   |---------------------|-----------|-------|---------|-----------|--------|\n   | schema-management   | Done      | 5/5   | 2 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | project-config      | Done      | 3/3   | 1 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | add-oauth           | Done      | 4/4   | 1 delta | auth (!)  | Ready* |\n   | add-verify-skill    | 1 left    | 2/5   | None    | None      | Warn   |\n   ```\n\n   For conflicts, show the resolution:\n   ```\n   * Conflict resolution:\n     - auth spec: Will apply add-oauth then add-jwt (both implemented, chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   For incomplete changes, show warnings:\n   ```\n   Warnings:\n   - add-verify-skill: 1 incomplete artifact, 3 incomplete tasks\n   ```\n\n7. **Confirm batch operation**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with a single confirmation:\n\n   - \"Archive N changes?\" with options based on status\n   - Options might include:\n     - \"Archive all N changes\"\n     - \"Archive only N ready changes (skip incomplete)\"\n     - \"Cancel\"\n\n   If there are incomplete changes, make clear they''ll be archived with warnings.\n\n8. **Execute archive for each confirmed change**\n\n   Process changes in the determined order (respecting conflict resolution):\n\n   a. **Sync specs** if delta specs exist:\n      - Use the openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven intelligent merge)\n      - For conflicts, apply in resolved order\n      - Track if sync was done\n\n   b. **Perform the archive**:\n      ```bash\n      mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n      mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n      ```\n\n   c. **Track outcome** for each change:\n      - Success: archived successfully\n      - Failed: error during archive (record error)\n      - Skipped: user chose not to archive (if applicable)\n\n9. **Display summary**\n\n   Show final results:\n\n   ```\n   ## Bulk Archive Complete\n\n   Archived 3 changes:\n   - schema-management-cli -> archive/2026-01-19-schema-management-cli/\n   - project-config -> archive/2026-01-19-project-config/\n   - add-oauth -> archive/2026-01-19-add-oauth/\n\n   Skipped 1 change:\n   - add-verify-skill (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\n   Spec sync summary:\n   - 4 delta specs synced to main specs\n   - 1 conflict resolved (auth: applied both in chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   If any failures:\n   ```\n   Failed 1 change:\n   - some-change: Archive directory already exists\n   ```\n\n**Conflict Resolution Examples**\n\nExample 1: Only one implemented\n```\nConflict: specs/auth/spec.md touched by [add-oauth, add-jwt]\n\nChecking add-oauth:\n- Delta adds \"OAuth Provider Integration\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/auth/oauth.ts implementing OAuth flow\n\nChecking add-jwt:\n- Delta adds \"JWT Token Handling\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... no JWT implementation found\n\nResolution: Only add-oauth is implemented. Will sync add-oauth specs only.\n```\n\nExample 2: Both implemented\n```\nConflict: specs/api/spec.md touched by [add-rest-api, add-graphql]\n\nChecking add-rest-api (created 2026-01-10):\n- Delta adds \"REST Endpoints\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/rest.ts\n\nChecking add-graphql (created 2026-01-15):\n- Delta adds \"GraphQL Schema\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/graphql.ts\n\nResolution: Both implemented. Will apply add-rest-api specs first,\nthen add-graphql specs (chronological order, newer takes precedence).\n```\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n- <change-2> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-2>/\n\nSpec sync summary:\n- N delta specs synced to main specs\n- No conflicts (or: M conflicts resolved)\n```\n\n**Output On Partial Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete (partial)\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n\nSkipped M changes:\n- <change-2> (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\nFailed K changes:\n- <change-3>: Archive directory already exists\n```\n\n**Output When No Changes**\n\n```\n## No Changes to Archive\n\nNo active changes found. Use `/opsx:new` to create a new change.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Allow any number of changes (1+ is fine, 2+ is the typical use case)\n- Always prompt for selection, never auto-select\n- Detect spec conflicts early and resolve by checking codebase\n- When both changes are implemented, apply specs in chronological order\n- Skip spec sync only when implementation is missing (warn user)\n- Show clear per-change status before confirming\n- Use single confirmation for entire batch\n- Track and report all outcomes (success/skip/fail)\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive\n- Archive directory target uses current date: YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n- If archive target exists, fail that change but continue with others\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:35:01.435Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing efficient spec change management and batch archiving capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的规格更改管理和批量存档功能的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが効率的な仕様変更管理とバッチアーカイブ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 사양 변경 관리 및 배치 아카이브 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión eficiente de cambios de especificación y capacidades de archivado por lotes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion efficace des changements de spécification et de capacités d''archivage par lots.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungagenten, die eine effiziente Spezifikationsänderungsverwaltung und Batch-Archivierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de uma gestão eficiente de alterações de especificação e capacidades de arquivamento em lote.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется эффективное управление изменениями спецификаций и возможности пакетного архивирования.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة فعالة لتغييرات المواصفات وقدرات الأرشفة الدفعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to intelligently handle spec conflicts by checking the codebase, determining implemented changes, and batch-archiving completed changes using the `openspec list --json` command, providing seamless integration with existing development workflows and tools like the AskUserQuestion tool for multi-select prompts.","zh":"使代理能够通过检查代码库、确定已实现的更改并使用 `openspec list --json` 命令批量存档已完成的更改来智能地处理规范冲突，从而与现有的开发工作流和工具（如用于多选提示的 AskUserQuestion 工具）实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがコードベースをチェックして実装された変更を決定し、`openspec list --json` コマンドを使用して完了した変更をバッチでアーカイブすることで、仕様の衝突を知的に処理できるようにし、AskUserQuestion ツールなどの既存の開発ワークフローとツールとのシームレスな統合を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 코드베이스를 확인하여 구현된 변경 사항을 결정하고 `openspec list --json` 명령을 사용하여 완료된 변경 사항을 일괄 아카이브함으로써 사양 충돌을 지능적으로 처리할 수 있도록 하여 기존 개발 워크플로와 툴(예: 다중 선택 프롬프트용 AskUserQuestion 툴)との无缝한 통합을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar inteligentemente conflictos de especificación verificando la base de código, determinando los cambios implementados y archivando por lotes los cambios completados utilizando el comando `openspec list --json`, proporcionando una integración perfecta con flujos de trabajo y herramientas de desarrollo existentes como la herramienta AskUserQuestion para solicitudes de selección múltiple.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière intelligente les conflits de spécification en vérifiant la base de code, en déterminant les changements implémentés et en archivant par lots les changements terminés en utilisant la commande `openspec list --json`, fournissant une intégration transparente avec les flux de travail et les outils de développement existants comme l''outil AskUserQuestion pour les invites de sélection multiple.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Spezifikationskonflikte intelligent zu handhaben, indem sie den Code-Stapel überprüfen, die implementierten Änderungen bestimmen und die abgeschlossenen Änderungen mit dem Befehl `openspec list --json` batch-archivieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungswerkzeugen und -workflows wie dem AskUserQuestion-Tool für Multi-Select-Prompts ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes lidem inteligentemente com conflitos de especificação, verificando a base de código, determinando as alterações implementadas e arquivando em lote as alterações concluídas usando o comando `openspec list --json`, proporcionando uma integração perfeita com os fluxos de trabalho e ferramentas de desenvolvimento existentes, como a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para prompts de seleção múltipla.","ru":"Позволяет агентам интеллектуально обрабатывать конфликты спецификаций путем проверки кодовой базы, определения реализованных изменений и пакетного архивирования завершенных изменений с использованием команды `openspec list --json`, обеспечивая беспрерывную интеграцию с существующими рабочими процессами и инструментами разработки, такими как инструмент AskUserQuestion для запросов с множественным выбором.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من معالجة تضارب المواصفات بذكاء من خلال فحص قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية، وتحديد التغييرات المنفذة، وأرشفة التغييرات المكتملة دفعةً باستخدام أمر `openspec list --json`، مما يوفر تكاملاً سلسًا مع سير عمل وأدوات التطوير الحالية مثل أداة AskUserQuestion للمطالبات متعددة الخيارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating bulk archiving of completed changes","Resolving spec conflicts across multiple changes","Streamlining development workflows by batching archive operations"],"zh":["自动批量存档已完成的更改","解决跨多个更改的规范冲突","通过批量存档操作来简化开发工作流"],"ja":["完了した変更のバルクアーカイブの自動化","複数の変更をまたぐ仕様の衝突を解決する","バッチアーカイブ操作による開発ワークフローの合理化"],"ko":["완료된 변경의 일괄 아카이브 자동화","여러 변경을 아우르는 사양 충돌 해결","배치 아카이브 작업에 의한 개발 워크플로우의 간소화"],"es":["Automatización del archivado por lotes de cambios completados","Resolución de conflictos de especificación en múltiples cambios","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo mediante operaciones de archivado por lotes"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''archivage par lots des changements terminés","Résolution des conflits de spécification sur plusieurs changements","Optimisation des flux de travail de développement en batchant les opérations d''archivage"],"de":["Automatisierung des Batch-Archivierens abgeschlossener Änderungen","Auflösung von Spezifikationskonflikten über mehrere Änderungen hinweg","Optimierung von Entwicklungswerkzeugen durch Batch-Archivierungsoperationen"],"pt":["Automatização do arquivamento em massa de alterações concluídas","Resolução de conflitos de especificação em várias alterações","Simplificação dos fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento através do agrupamento de operações de arquivamento"],"ru":["Автоматизация массового архивирования завершенных изменений","Разрешение конфликтов спецификаций для нескольких изменений","Оптимизация рабочих процессов разработки за счет пакетных операций архивирования"],"ar":["أتمتة الأرشفة الدفعية للتغييرات المكتملة","حل تضاربات المواصفات عبر تغييرات متعددة","تبسيط سير عمل التطوير من خلال تجميع عمليات الأرشفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires active changes to exist","Dependent on `openspec list --json` command functionality","Needs user input for change selection via AskUserQuestion tool"],"zh":["需要活动的更改存在","依赖于 `openspec list --json` 命令的功能","需要通过 AskUserQuestion 工具选择更改的用户输入"],"ja":["アクティブな変更の存在が必要","`openspec list --json` コマンドの機能に依存","変更の選択のための AskUserQuestion ツールによるユーザー入力が必要"],"ko":["활동적인 변경이 존재해야 함","`openspec list --json` 명령의 기능에 의존","AskUserQuestion 툴을 통한 변경 선택에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요"],"es":["Requiere que existan cambios activos","Depende de la funcionalidad del comando `openspec list --json`","Necesita entrada del usuario para la selección de cambios a través de la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Nécessite l''existence de changements actifs","Dépend de la fonctionnalité de la commande `openspec list --json`","Nécessite une saisie utilisateur pour la sélection des changements via l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Erfordert aktive Änderungen","Hängt von der Funktionalität des Befehls `openspec list --json` ab","Benötigt Benutzereingaben für die Änderungsauswahl über das AskUserQuestion-Tool"],"pt":["Requer que existam alterações ativas","Dependente da funcionalidade do comando `openspec list --json`","Necessita de entrada do usuário para seleção de alterações via ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Требует наличия активных изменений","Зависит от функциональности команды `openspec list --json`","Требует ввода пользователя для выбора изменений через инструмент AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود تغييرات نشطة","يعتمد على وظيفة الأمر `openspec list --json`","يحتاج إلى إدخال من المستخدم لاختيار التغيير عبر أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
