"Compatibilidad con node.js","Selección de cambios mediante herramienta AskUserQuestion","Ejecución de comando openspec list --json"],"fr":["Archivage en bulk de changements terminés","Gestion intelligente des conflits de spécifications","Utilisation de GraphQL et Prisma.io","Compatibilité avec node.js","Sélection de changements via l''outil AskUserQuestion","Exécution de la commande openspec list --json"],"de":["Bulk-Archivierung abgeschlossener Änderungen","Intelligente Handhabung von Spezifikationskonflikten","Verwendung von GraphQL und Prisma.io","Kompatibilität mit node.js","Auswahl von Änderungen über das Tool AskUserQuestion","Ausführung des Befehls openspec list --json"],"pt":["Arquivamento em massa de alterações concluídas","Utilização de GraphQL e Prisma.io","Detecção inteligente de conflitos de especificação","Seleção de alterações por meio da ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Массовое архивирование завершенных изменений","Использование GraphQL и Prisma.io","Интеллектуальное обнаружение конфликтов спецификации","Выбор изменений с помощью инструмента AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["أرشفة الكتلة للتغيرات المكتملة","استخدام GraphQL و Prisma.io","كشف ذكي عن تحديات المواصفات","اختيار التغيرات من خلال أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","GraphQL","Prisma.io","节点.js","批量存档","规格冲突","智能处理"],"ja":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","GraphQL","Prisma.io","ノード.js","一括アーカイブ","スキル紛争","スマート処理"],"ko":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","GraphQL","Prisma.io","노드.js","일괄 아카이브","규격 충돌","스마트 처리"],"es":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","archivado en bulk","gestión de conflictos","GraphQL","Prisma.io","node.js","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"fr":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","archivage en bulk","gestion de conflits","GraphQL","Prisma.io","node.js","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"de":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","Bulk-Archivierung","Konfliktlösung","GraphQL","Prisma.io","node.js","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"pt":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","arquivamento em massa","GraphQL","Prisma.io","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de alterações"],"ru":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","массовое архивирование","GraphQL","Prisma.io","разработка программного обеспечения","управление изменениями"],"ar":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","أرشفة الكتلة","GraphQL","Prisma.io","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة التغيرات"]}},"owner":"uxname","repo":"liteend","repoPath":"uxname/liteend","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-bulk-archive-change","description":"Archive multiple completed changes at once. Use when archiving several parallel changes.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select t","body":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select to let user choose changes:\n   - Show each change with its schema\n   - Include an option for \"All changes\"\n   - Allow any number of selections (1+ works, 2+ is the typical use case)\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT auto-select. Always let the user choose.\n\n3. **Batch validation - gather status for all selected changes**\n\n   For each selected change, collect:\n\n   a. **Artifact status** - Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Parse `schemaName` and `artifacts` list\n      - Note which artifacts are `done` vs other states\n\n   b. **Task completion** - Read `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n      - Count `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n      - If no tasks file exists, note as \"No tasks\"\n\n   c. **Delta specs** - Check `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/` directory\n      - List which capability specs exist\n      - For each, extract requirement names (lines matching `### Requirement: <name>`)\n\n4. **Detect spec conflicts**\n\n   Build a map of `capability -> [changes that touch it]`:\n\n   ```\n   auth -> [change-a, change-b]  <- CONFLICT (2+ changes)\n   api  -> [change-c]            <- OK (only 1 change)\n   ```\n\n   A conflict exists when 2+ selected changes have delta specs for the same capability.\n\n5. **Resolve conflicts agentically**\n\n   **For each conflict**, investigate the codebase:\n\n   a. **Read the delta specs** from each conflicting change to understand what each claims to add/modify\n\n   b. **Search the codebase** for implementation evidence:\n      - Look for code implementing requirements from each delta spec\n      - Check for related files, functions, or tests\n\n   c. **Determine resolution**:\n      - If only one change is actually implemented -> sync that one''s specs\n      - If both implemented -> apply in chronological order (older first, newer overwrites)\n      - If neither implemented -> skip spec sync, warn user\n\n   d. **Record resolution** for each conflict:\n      - Which change''s specs to apply\n      - In what order (if both)\n      - Rationale (what was found in codebase)\n\n6. **Show consolidated status table**\n\n   Display a table summarizing all changes:\n\n   ```\n   | Change               | Artifacts | Tasks | Specs   | Conflicts | Status |\n   |---------------------|-----------|-------|---------|-----------|--------|\n   | schema-management   | Done      | 5/5   | 2 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | project-config      | Done      | 3/3   | 1 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | add-oauth           | Done      | 4/4   | 1 delta | auth (!)  | Ready* |\n   | add-verify-skill    | 1 left    | 2/5   | None    | None      | Warn   |\n   ```\n\n   For conflicts, show the resolution:\n   ```\n   * Conflict resolution:\n     - auth spec: Will apply add-oauth then add-jwt (both implemented, chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   For incomplete changes, show warnings:\n   ```\n   Warnings:\n   - add-verify-skill: 1 incomplete artifact, 3 incomplete tasks\n   ```\n\n7. **Confirm batch operation**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with a single confirmation:\n\n   - \"Archive N changes?\" with options based on status\n   - Options might include:\n     - \"Archive all N changes\"\n     - \"Archive only N ready changes (skip incomplete)\"\n     - \"Cancel\"\n\n   If there are incomplete changes, make clear they''ll be archived with warnings.\n\n8. **Execute archive for each confirmed change**\n\n   Process changes in the determined order (respecting conflict resolution):\n\n   a. **Sync specs** if delta specs exist:\n      - Use the openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven intelligent merge)\n      - For conflicts, apply in resolved order\n      - Track if sync was done\n\n   b. **Perform the archive**:\n      ```bash\n      mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n      mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n      ```\n\n   c. **Track outcome** for each change:\n      - Success: archived successfully\n      - Failed: error during archive (record error)\n      - Skipped: user chose not to archive (if applicable)\n\n9. **Display summary**\n\n   Show final results:\n\n   ```\n   ## Bulk Archive Complete\n\n   Archived 3 changes:\n   - schema-management-cli -> archive/2026-01-19-schema-management-cli/\n   - project-config -> archive/2026-01-19-project-config/\n   - add-oauth -> archive/2026-01-19-add-oauth/\n\n   Skipped 1 change:\n   - add-verify-skill (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\n   Spec sync summary:\n   - 4 delta specs synced to main specs\n   - 1 conflict resolved (auth: applied both in chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   If any failures:\n   ```\n   Failed 1 change:\n   - some-change: Archive directory already exists\n   ```\n\n**Conflict Resolution Examples**\n\nExample 1: Only one implemented\n```\nConflict: specs/auth/spec.md touched by [add-oauth, add-jwt]\n\nChecking add-oauth:\n- Delta adds \"OAuth Provider Integration\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/auth/oauth.ts implementing OAuth flow\n\nChecking add-jwt:\n- Delta adds \"JWT Token Handling\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... no JWT implementation found\n\nResolution: Only add-oauth is implemented. Will sync add-oauth specs only.\n```\n\nExample 2: Both implemented\n```\nConflict: specs/api/spec.md touched by [add-rest-api, add-graphql]\n\nChecking add-rest-api (created 2026-01-10):\n- Delta adds \"REST Endpoints\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/rest.ts\n\nChecking add-graphql (created 2026-01-15):\n- Delta adds \"GraphQL Schema\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/graphql.ts\n\nResolution: Both implemented. Will apply add-rest-api specs first,\nthen add-graphql specs (chronological order, newer takes precedence).\n```\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n- <change-2> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-2>/\n\nSpec sync summary:\n- N delta specs synced to main specs\n- No conflicts (or: M conflicts resolved)\n```\n\n**Output On Partial Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete (partial)\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n\nSkipped M changes:\n- <change-2> (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\nFailed K changes:\n- <change-3>: Archive directory already exists\n```\n\n**Output When No Changes**\n\n```\n## No Changes to Archive\n\nNo active changes found. Use `/opsx:new` to create a new change.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Allow any number of changes (1+ is fine, 2+ is the typical use case)\n- Always prompt for selection, never auto-select\n- Detect spec conflicts early and resolve by checking codebase\n- When both changes are implemented, apply specs in chronological order\n- Skip spec sync only when implementation is missing (warn user)\n- Show clear per-change status before confirming\n- Use single confirmation for entire batch\n- Track and report all outcomes (success/skip/fail)\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive\n- Archive directory target uses current date: YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n- If archive target exists, fail that change but continue with others\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:34:24.264Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Node.js Agents requiring efficient change management and archiving capabilities with GraphQL and Prisma.io","zh":"适用于需要高效变更管理和存档功能的 Node.js 代理，特别是使用 GraphQL 和 Prisma.io 的场景","ja":"Node.js エージェントが効率的な変更管理とアーカイブ機能を必要とする場合に適しています。GraphQL と Prisma.io を使用する場合に特に効果的です","ko":"효율적인 변경 관리 및 아카이브 기능이 필요한 Node.js 에이전트에 적합하며, GraphQL 및 Prisma.io를 사용하는 경우에 특히 유용합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de Node.js que requieren un manejo de cambios eficiente y capacidades de archivado con GraphQL y Prisma.io","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Node.js nécessitant une gestion de changements efficace et des capacités d''archivage avec GraphQL et Prisma.io","de":"Ideal für Node.js-Agents, die effizientes Change-Management und Archivierungsfähigkeiten mit GraphQL und Prisma.io erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Node.js que necessitam de gerenciamento de alterações eficiente e capacidades de arquivamento com GraphQL e Prisma.io","ru":"Идеально для агентов Node.js, требующих эффективного управления изменениями и возможностей архивации с GraphQL и Prisma.io","ar":"مثالي لعميل Node.js الذي يتطلب إدارة تغييرات فعالة وقدرات أرشفة مع GraphQL و Prisma.io"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to intelligently batch-archive completed changes, handling spec conflicts by checking the codebase with Prisma.io, utilizing GraphQL for lightweight backend operations, and implementing conflict resolution through codebase analysis","zh":"赋予代理智能批量存档已完成的更改的能力，通过使用 Prisma.io 检查代码库、利用 GraphQL 进行轻量级后端操作，并通过代码库分析实现冲突解决","ja":"エージェントに、Prisma.io を使用してコードベースをチェックしたり、GraphQL を使用して軽量バックエンド操作を行ったりすることで、完了した変更をインテリジェントにバッチアーカイブし、コードベース分析を通じてコンフリクトを解決する能力を付与します","ko":"에이전트가 완료된 변경 사항을智能적으로 일괄 아카이브할 수 있도록 하며, Prisma.io를 사용하여 코드베이스를 확인하고, GraphQL을 사용하여 경량 백엔드操作을 수행하며, 코드베이스 분석을 통해 충돌을 解決하는 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar inteligentemente en lotes los cambios completados, manejando conflictos de especificaciones verificando la base de código con Prisma.io, utilizando GraphQL para operaciones de backend ligeras y implementando resolución de conflictos a través del análisis de la base de código","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en lot les changements terminés de manière intelligente, en gérant les conflits de spécifications en vérifiant la base de code avec Prisma.io, en utilisant GraphQL pour des opérations de backend légères et en mettant en œuvre la résolution de conflits via l''analyse de la base de code","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, abgeschlossene Änderungen intelligent zu batchen und Spezifikationskonflikte durch Überprüfung der Codebasis mit Prisma.io zu handhaben, GraphQL für leichte Backend-Operationen zu nutzen und Konfliktlösungen durch Codebasisanalyse umzusetzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a inteligentemente criar lotes de arquivamento de alterações concluídas, lidando com conflitos de especificação verificando o código-fonte com Prisma.io, utilizando GraphQL para operações leves de backend e implementando resolução de conflitos por meio da análise do código-fonte","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интеллектуально создавать пакетное архивирование завершенных изменений, обрабатывая конфликты спецификаций путем проверки кодовой базы с помощью Prisma.io, используя GraphQL для легких операций бэкенда и реализуя разрешение конфликтов через анализ кодовой базы","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء أرشيفات مجمعة بشكل ذكي للتغييرات المكتملة، ومعالجة تضارب المواصفات عن طريق فحص المصدر البرمجي مع Prisma.io، واستخدام GraphQL للعمليات الخفيفة للخلفية وتنفيذ حل النزاعات من خلال تحليل المصدر البرمجي"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating bulk archiving of completed changes","Resolving spec conflicts through codebase analysis","Streamlining change management with GraphQL and Prisma.io"],"zh":["自动化完成的更改的批量存档","通过代码库分析解决规格冲突","使用 GraphQL 和 Prisma.io 简化变更管理"],"ja":["完了した変更のバルクアーカイブの自動化","コードベース分析による仕様のコンフリクト解決","GraphQL と Prisma.io を使用した変更管理の合理化"],"ko":["완료된 변경 사항의 일괄 아카이브 자동화","코드베이스 분석을 통한 사양 충돌 해결","GraphQL 및 Prisma.io를 사용한 변경 관리 최적화"],"es":["Automatización del archivado en masa de cambios completados","Resolución de conflictos de especificaciones a través del análisis de la base de código","Optimización de la gestión de cambios con GraphQL y Prisma.io"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''archivage en masse des changements terminés","Résolution des conflits de spécifications via l''analyse de la base de code","Optimisation de la gestion des changements avec GraphQL et Prisma.io"],"de":["Automatisierung des Massenarchivierens abgeschlossener Änderungen","Auflösung von Spezifikationskonflikten durch Codebasisanalyse","Optimierung des Change-Managements mit GraphQL und Prisma.io"],"pt":["Automatizar o arquivamento em massa de alterações concluídas","Resolver conflitos de especificação por meio da análise do código-fonte","Otimizar o gerenciamento de alterações com GraphQL e Prisma.io"],"ru":["Автоматизировать пакетное архивирование завершенных изменений","Разрешать конфликты спецификаций путем анализа кодовой базы","Оптимизировать управление изменениями с помощью GraphQL и Prisma.io"],"ar":["تأتمتة أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة بالجملة","حل تضارب المواصفات من خلال تحليل المصدر البرمجي","تحسين إدارة التغييرات مع GraphQL و Prisma.io"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Dependent on Prisma.io and GraphQL","No active changes will stop the process"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 环境","依赖于 Prisma.io 和 GraphQL","没有活动的更改将停止该过程"],"ja":["Node.js 環境が必要","Prisma.io と GraphQL 依存","アクティブな変更がない場合はプロセスが停止します"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요합니다","Prisma.io 및 GraphQL에 의존합니다","활성 변경이 없으면 프로세스가 중지됩니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Node.js","Dependiente de Prisma.io y GraphQL","No se detendrá el proceso si no hay cambios activos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Dépendant de Prisma.io et GraphQL","Aucun changement actif n''arrêtera le processus"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js-Umgebung","Abhängig von Prisma.io und GraphQL","Keine aktiven Änderungen werden den Prozess stoppen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js","Dependente de Prisma.io e GraphQL","Nenhuma alteração ativa irá parar o processo"],"ru":["Требуется среда Node.js","Зависит от Prisma.io и GraphQL","Нет активных изменений не остановит процесс"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","يعتمد على Prisma.io و GraphQL","لا تغييرات نشطة سوف توقف العملية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
