 plusieurs modifications complètes en une seule opération","Gestion intelligente des conflits de spécifications","Utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection des modifications","Compatibilité avec la ligne de commande via `openspec list --json`","Détection automatique des modifications actives","Rapports de l''utilisateur en cas d''absence de modifications actives"],"de":["Archivierung mehrerer abgeschlossener Änderungen in einer einzigen Operation","Intelligente Handhabung von Spezifikationskonflikten","Verwendung des Tools AskUserQuestion für die Auswahl von Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit der Kommandozeile über `openspec list --json`","Automatische Erkennung von aktiven Änderungen","Benutzerberichte im Falle von nicht vorhandenen aktiven Änderungen"],"pt":["Arquivamento em lote de alterações concluídas","Resolução inteligente de conflitos de especificação","Integração com a ferramenta AskUserQuestion","Suporte a seleção múltipla de alterações","Execução de comandos personalizados para arquivamento"],"ru":["Массовое архивирование завершенных изменений","Умное разрешение конфликтов спецификаций","Интеграция с инструментом AskUserQuestion","Поддержка многоэтажного выбора изменений","Выполнение пользовательских команд для архивирования"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة بالجملة","حل الصراعات في مواصفات البنية البرمجية بذكاء","التكامل مع أداة AskUserQuestion","دعم التحديد المتعدد للتغييرات","تنفيذ أوامر مخصصة لأرشفة التغييرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","批量存档","规格冲突","智能处理","AskUserQuestion","多选"],"ja":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","一括アーカイブ","仕様の衝突","智能的な処理","AskUserQuestion","複数選択"],"ko":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","일괄 아카이브","사양 충돌","智能적인 처리","AskUserQuestion","다중 선택"],"es":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","archivado masivo de cambios","desarrollo de software","gestión de cambios","conflictos de especificaciones","AskUserQuestion","línea de comandos"],"fr":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","archivage bulk de modifications","développement de logiciels","gestion de modifications","conflits de spécifications","AskUserQuestion","ligne de commande"],"de":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","Massenarchivierung von Änderungen","Software-Entwicklung","Änderungsmanagement","Spezifikationskonflikte","AskUserQuestion","Kommandozeile"],"pt":["arquivamento em lote","openspec","alterações concluídas","resolução de conflitos","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","askuserquestion","seleção múltipla","comandos personalizados"],"ru":["массовое архивирование","openspec","завершенные изменения","разрешение конфликтов","инструмент разработки","askuserquestion","многоэтажный выбор","пользовательские команды"],"ar":["أرشفة بالجملة","openspec","تغييرات مكتملة","حل الصراعات","أداة تطوير","askuserquestion","تحديد متعدد","أوامر مخصصة"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"ai-assisted-engineering","repoPath":"gAmUssA/ai-assisted-engineering","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-bulk-archive-change","description":"Archive multiple completed changes at once. Use when archiving several parallel changes.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select t","body":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select to let user choose changes:\n   - Show each change with its schema\n   - Include an option for \"All changes\"\n   - Allow any number of selections (1+ works, 2+ is the typical use case)\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT auto-select. Always let the user choose.\n\n3. **Batch validation - gather status for all selected changes**\n\n   For each selected change, collect:\n\n   a. **Artifact status** - Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Parse `schemaName` and `artifacts` list\n      - Note which artifacts are `done` vs other states\n\n   b. **Task completion** - Read `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n      - Count `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n      - If no tasks file exists, note as \"No tasks\"\n\n   c. **Delta specs** - Check `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/` directory\n      - List which capability specs exist\n      - For each, extract requirement names (lines matching `### Requirement: <name>`)\n\n4. **Detect spec conflicts**\n\n   Build a map of `capability -> [changes that touch it]`:\n\n   ```\n   auth -> [change-a, change-b]  <- CONFLICT (2+ changes)\n   api  -> [change-c]            <- OK (only 1 change)\n   ```\n\n   A conflict exists when 2+ selected changes have delta specs for the same capability.\n\n5. **Resolve conflicts agentically**\n\n   **For each conflict**, investigate the codebase:\n\n   a. **Read the delta specs** from each conflicting change to understand what each claims to add/modify\n\n   b. **Search the codebase** for implementation evidence:\n      - Look for code implementing requirements from each delta spec\n      - Check for related files, functions, or tests\n\n   c. **Determine resolution**:\n      - If only one change is actually implemented -> sync that one''s specs\n      - If both implemented -> apply in chronological order (older first, newer overwrites)\n      - If neither implemented -> skip spec sync, warn user\n\n   d. **Record resolution** for each conflict:\n      - Which change''s specs to apply\n      - In what order (if both)\n      - Rationale (what was found in codebase)\n\n6. **Show consolidated status table**\n\n   Display a table summarizing all changes:\n\n   ```\n   | Change               | Artifacts | Tasks | Specs   | Conflicts | Status |\n   |---------------------|-----------|-------|---------|-----------|--------|\n   | schema-management   | Done      | 5/5   | 2 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | project-config      | Done      | 3/3   | 1 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | add-oauth           | Done      | 4/4   | 1 delta | auth (!)  | Ready* |\n   | add-verify-skill    | 1 left    | 2/5   | None    | None      | Warn   |\n   ```\n\n   For conflicts, show the resolution:\n   ```\n   * Conflict resolution:\n     - auth spec: Will apply add-oauth then add-jwt (both implemented, chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   For incomplete changes, show warnings:\n   ```\n   Warnings:\n   - add-verify-skill: 1 incomplete artifact, 3 incomplete tasks\n   ```\n\n7. **Confirm batch operation**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with a single confirmation:\n\n   - \"Archive N changes?\" with options based on status\n   - Options might include:\n     - \"Archive all N changes\"\n     - \"Archive only N ready changes (skip incomplete)\"\n     - \"Cancel\"\n\n   If there are incomplete changes, make clear they''ll be archived with warnings.\n\n8. **Execute archive for each confirmed change**\n\n   Process changes in the determined order (respecting conflict resolution):\n\n   a. **Sync specs** if delta specs exist:\n      - Use the openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven intelligent merge)\n      - For conflicts, apply in resolved order\n      - Track if sync was done\n\n   b. **Perform the archive**:\n      ```bash\n      mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n      mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n      ```\n\n   c. **Track outcome** for each change:\n      - Success: archived successfully\n      - Failed: error during archive (record error)\n      - Skipped: user chose not to archive (if applicable)\n\n9. **Display summary**\n\n   Show final results:\n\n   ```\n   ## Bulk Archive Complete\n\n   Archived 3 changes:\n   - schema-management-cli -> archive/2026-01-19-schema-management-cli/\n   - project-config -> archive/2026-01-19-project-config/\n   - add-oauth -> archive/2026-01-19-add-oauth/\n\n   Skipped 1 change:\n   - add-verify-skill (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\n   Spec sync summary:\n   - 4 delta specs synced to main specs\n   - 1 conflict resolved (auth: applied both in chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   If any failures:\n   ```\n   Failed 1 change:\n   - some-change: Archive directory already exists\n   ```\n\n**Conflict Resolution Examples**\n\nExample 1: Only one implemented\n```\nConflict: specs/auth/spec.md touched by [add-oauth, add-jwt]\n\nChecking add-oauth:\n- Delta adds \"OAuth Provider Integration\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/auth/oauth.ts implementing OAuth flow\n\nChecking add-jwt:\n- Delta adds \"JWT Token Handling\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... no JWT implementation found\n\nResolution: Only add-oauth is implemented. Will sync add-oauth specs only.\n```\n\nExample 2: Both implemented\n```\nConflict: specs/api/spec.md touched by [add-rest-api, add-graphql]\n\nChecking add-rest-api (created 2026-01-10):\n- Delta adds \"REST Endpoints\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/rest.ts\n\nChecking add-graphql (created 2026-01-15):\n- Delta adds \"GraphQL Schema\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/graphql.ts\n\nResolution: Both implemented. Will apply add-rest-api specs first,\nthen add-graphql specs (chronological order, newer takes precedence).\n```\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n- <change-2> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-2>/\n\nSpec sync summary:\n- N delta specs synced to main specs\n- No conflicts (or: M conflicts resolved)\n```\n\n**Output On Partial Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete (partial)\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n\nSkipped M changes:\n- <change-2> (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\nFailed K changes:\n- <change-3>: Archive directory already exists\n```\n\n**Output When No Changes**\n\n```\n## No Changes to Archive\n\nNo active changes found. Use `/opsx:new` to create a new change.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Allow any number of changes (1+ is fine, 2+ is the typical use case)\n- Always prompt for selection, never auto-select\n- Detect spec conflicts early and resolve by checking codebase\n- When both changes are implemented, apply specs in chronological order\n- Skip spec sync only when implementation is missing (warn user)\n- Show clear per-change status before confirming\n- Use single confirmation for entire batch\n- Track and report all outcomes (success/skip/fail)\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive\n- Archive directory target uses current date: YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n- If archive target exists, fail that change but continue with others\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:34:36.823Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring efficient change management and spec conflict resolution in codebases.","zh":"适合需要在代码库中高效管理更改和解决规格冲突的开发代理。","ja":"コードベースでの変更管理と仕様の衝突解決を効率的に行う必要がある開発エージェントに最適。","ko":"코드베이스에서 변경 관리와 사양 충돌 해결을 효율적으로 수행해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren un cambio de gestión eficiente y resolución de conflictos de especificaciones en codebases.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion efficace des modifications et une résolution de conflits de spécifications dans les bases de code.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine effiziente Änderungsverwaltung und Spezifikationskonfliktlösung in Codebasen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento eficiente de alterações e resolução de conflitos de especificação em repositórios de código.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих эффективного управления изменениями и разрешения конфликтов спецификаций в кодовой базе.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تتطلب إدارة فعالة للتغييرات وحل النزاعات المحددة في قواعد بيانات الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented, utilizing the `openspec list --json` command for active change retrieval and the AskUserQuestion tool for multi-select prompts.","zh":"赋予代理批量归档更改的能力，通过检查代码库来确定实际实现的内容，利用 `openspec list --json` 命令进行活动更改检索，并使用 AskUserQuestion 工具进行多选提示。","ja":"エージェントにバッチアーカイブの変更を実行する能力を与え、コードベースをチェックして実際に実装されている内容を判断し、`openspec list --json` コマンドを使用してアクティブな変更を取得し、AskUserQuestion ツールを使用してマルチセレクトのプロンプトを実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 일괄 변경을存档할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 코드베이스를 확인하여 실제로 구현된 내용을 결정하고 `openspec list --json` 명령을 사용하여 활성 변경을 검색하며 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 다중 선택提示를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar por lotes los cambios, manejar conflictos de especificaciones de forma inteligente verificando la base de código para determinar qué es lo que realmente se ha implementado, utilizando el comando `openspec list --json` para la recuperación de cambios activos y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para las opciones de selección múltiple.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en archive par lots les modifications, en gérant de manière intelligente les conflits de spécifications en vérifiant la base de code pour déterminer ce qui est réellement mis en œuvre, en utilisant la commande `openspec list --json` pour la récupération des modifications actives et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour les invites de sélection multiple.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, Änderungen in Chargen zu archivieren, Spezifikationskonflikte intelligent zu lösen, indem die Codebasis überprüft wird, um zu bestimmen, was tatsächlich implementiert wurde, unter Verwendung des `openspec list --json`-Befehls für die Abrufung von aktiven Änderungen und des AskUserQuestion-Tools für Multi-Auswahlfelder.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar em lote as alterações, lidando com conflitos de especificação de forma inteligente, verificando a base de código para determinar o que está implementado, utilizando o comando `openspec list --json` para recuperação ativa de alterações e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para prompts de seleção múltipla.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью пакетного архивирования изменений, интеллектуально обрабатывая конфликты спецификаций путем проверки кодовой базы для определения того, что фактически реализовано, используя команду `openspec list --json` для активного извлечения изменений и инструмент AskUserQuestion для многоселекторных запросов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من أرشفة التغييرات بصفة جماعية، ويتعامل بذكاء مع النزاعات المحددة من خلال فحص قاعدة الشفرة لتحديد ما تم تنفيذه، مع استخدام الأمر `openspec list --json` لاسترجاع التغييرات النشطة وأداة AskUserQuestion لمطالبات الانتخاب المتعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Batch-archiving completed changes in a single operation","Intelligently resolving spec conflicts by analyzing the codebase","Streamlining change management workflows by automating archival processes"],"zh":["批量存档完成的更改以单一操作","通过分析代码库智能地解决规格冲突","通过自动存档流程简化更改管理工作流"],"ja":["1 回の操作で完了した変更をバッチアーカイブする","コードベースを分析して仕様の衝突を賢く解決する","自動アーカイブ プロセスを使用して変更管理ワークフローをストリームライン化する"],"ko":["单一 작업으로 완료된 변경 사항 일괄 보관","코드베이스를 분석하여 사양 충돌을 지능적으로 해결","자동 보관 프로세스를 사용하여 변경 관리 워크플로를 간소화"],"es":["Archivar por lotes los cambios completados en una sola operación","Resolver de forma inteligente los conflictos de especificaciones analizando la base de código","Optimizar los flujos de trabajo de gestión de cambios automatizando los procesos de archivo"],"fr":["Mettre en archive par lots les modifications terminées en une seule opération","Résoudre de manière intelligente les conflits de spécifications en analysant la base de code","Optimiser les flux de travail de gestion des modifications en automatisant les processus d''archivage"],"de":["Abgeschlossene Änderungen in einer einzigen Operation archivieren","Spezifikationskonflikte intelligent durch Analyse der Codebasis lösen","Änderungsverwaltungs-Workflows durch Automatisierung von Archivierungsprozessen optimieren"],"pt":["Arquivamento em lote de alterações concluídas em uma única operação","Resolução inteligente de conflitos de especificação por meio da análise da base de código","Otimização dos fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de alterações por meio da automação de processos de arquivamento"],"ru":["Пакетное архивирование завершенных изменений в одной операции","Интеллектуальное разрешение конфликтов спецификаций путем анализа кодовой базы","Оптимизация рабочих процессов управления изменениями путем автоматизации архивных процессов"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة بصفة جماعية في عملية واحدة","حل النزاعات المحددة بذكاء من خلال تحليل قاعدة الشفرة","تبسيط سير عمليات إدارة التغييرات من خلال توفير عمليات الأرشفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `openspec` command-line tool accessibility","No active changes exist, operation will be terminated","Dependent on user input for change selection via AskUserQuestion tool"],"zh":["需要 `openspec` 命令行工具的可访问性","没有活动更改，操作将被终止","依赖于 AskUserQuestion 工具的用户输入来选择更改"],"ja":["`openspec` コマンドラインツールのアクセシビリティが必要","アクティブな変更がないため、操作が終了される","変更の選択に AskUserQuestion ツールのユーザー入力に依存"],"ko":["`openspec` 명령줄 도구의 접근성이 필요","활성 변경이 없으므로 작업이 종료","AskUserQuestion 도구의 사용자 입력에 의존하여 변경 사항을 선택"],"es":["Requiere la accesibilidad de la herramienta de línea de comandos `openspec`","No existen cambios activos, la operación se terminará","Depende de la entrada del usuario para la selección de cambios a través de 