ل مع npm","التوافق مع التعديلات على GitHub","دليل الهجرة الكامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 更新","用户界面","开发体验","AI 系统","优化","重新思考"],"ja":["AI の更新","ユーザーインターフェイス","開発体験","AI システム","最適化","再考"],"ko":["AI 업데이트","사용자 인터페이스","개발 경험","AI 시스템","최적화","재정의"],"es":["actualización de IA","interfaz de usuario de IA","desarrollo de IA","migración de SDK","verificación de versiones","guias de migración"],"fr":["mise à jour de l''IA","interface utilisateur de l''IA","développement de l''IA","migration de SDK","vérification des versions","guides de migration"],"de":["Update der KI","Benutzeroberfläche für KI","Entwicklung von KI","Migration von SDK","Überprüfung von Versionen","Migrationsleitfäden"],"pt":["atualização da IA","interface do usuário da IA","migração de versão","npm","GitHub","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["обновление ИИ","интерфейс пользователя ИИ","миграция версии","npm","GitHub","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تحديث الذكاء الاصطناعي","واجهة المستخدم للذكاء الاصطناعي","هجرة الإصدار","npm","GitHub","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ThinkEx-OSS","repo":"thinkex","repoPath":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"update","description":"Update assistant-ui and AI SDK to latest versions. Detects current versions, identifies breaking changes, and executes migrations.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui Update\n\n**Always verifies against npm ground truth and GitHub commits.**\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/ai-sdk-v6.md](./references/ai-sdk-v6.md) -- AI SDK v4/v5 → v6 migration (complete guide)\n- [./references/assistant-ui.md](./references/assistant-ui.md) -- assistant-ui version migrations\n- [./references/breaking-changes.md](./references/breaking-changes.md) -- Quick reference table\n\n## Phase 1: Detect Versions\n\n### Get Ground Truth\n\n```bash\n# Installed versions\nnpm ls @assistan","body":"# assistant-ui Update\n\n**Always verifies against npm ground truth and GitHub commits.**\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/ai-sdk-v6.md](./references/ai-sdk-v6.md) -- AI SDK v4/v5 → v6 migration (complete guide)\n- [./references/assistant-ui.md](./references/assistant-ui.md) -- assistant-ui version migrations\n- [./references/breaking-changes.md](./references/breaking-changes.md) -- Quick reference table\n\n## Phase 1: Detect Versions\n\n### Get Ground Truth\n\n```bash\n# Installed versions\nnpm ls @assistant-ui/react @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk ai @ai-sdk/react 2>/dev/null\n\n# Latest from npm\nnpm view @assistant-ui/react version\nnpm view @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk version\nnpm view ai version\n```\n\n### Version Analysis\n\n| Package | Check For |\n|---------|-----------|\n| `ai` | < 6.0.0 → needs AI SDK v6 migration |\n| `@assistant-ui/react` | < 0.11.0 → needs runtime migration |\n| `@assistant-ui/react` | < 0.10.0 → needs ESM migration |\n| `@assistant-ui/react` | < 0.8.0 → needs UI split migration |\n| `@assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk` | < 1.0.0 → needs AI SDK v6 first |\n\n## Phase 2: Route to Migration\n\n```\nAI SDK < 6.0.0?\n├─ Yes → See ./references/ai-sdk-v6.md\n└─ No\n   └─ assistant-ui outdated?\n      ├─ Yes → See ./references/assistant-ui.md\n      └─ No → Already up to date\n```\n\n### Migration Order\n\n1. **AI SDK first** (if < 6.0.0) - Required for @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk >= 1.0\n2. **assistant-ui second** - Apply breaking changes for version jump\n3. **Verify** - Type check, build, test\n\n## Phase 3: Execute\n\n### Update Packages\n\n```bash\n# pnpm\npnpm add @assistant-ui/react@latest @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk@latest ai@latest @ai-sdk/react@latest\n\n# npm\nnpm install @assistant-ui/react@latest @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk@latest ai@latest @ai-sdk/react@latest\n```\n\n### Apply Migrations\n\nBased on version jump, apply relevant migrations from references.\n\n### Verify\n\n```bash\nnpx tsc --noEmit  # Type check\npnpm build        # Build check\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**\"Peer dependency conflict\"**\n- Update all packages together\n- Check version compatibility in [./references/breaking-changes.md](./references/breaking-changes.md)\n\n**Type errors after upgrade**\n- Consult breaking changes reference\n- Check specific migration guide\n\n**Runtime errors**\n- Verify API patterns match new version\n- Check for renamed/moved APIs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:35:10.708Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing seamless version migrations and GitHub commit verification.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝版本迁移和GitHub提交验证的AI代理。","ja":"シームレスなバージョン移行とGitHubコミット検証を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"원활한 버전 마이그레이션과 GitHub 커밋 검증이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que necesitan migraciones de versión perfectas y verificación de commits de GitHub.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA nécessitant des migrations de version transparentes et une vérification des commits GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die nahtlose Versionsmigrationen und GitHub-Commit-Verifizierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de migrações de versão sem interrupções e verificação de commits do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы бесшовные миграции версий и проверка коммитов GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تحتاج إلى تحديثات إصدار متواصلة وتأكيد الإلتزامات على GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify against npm ground truth and GitHub commits, ensuring accurate AI SDK version migrations, such as v4/v5 to v6, using libraries like npm and referencing files like .md for documentation.","zh":"使代理能够根据npm基准真相和GitHub提交进行验证，确保准确的AI SDK版本迁移（例如从v4/v5到v6），使用npm等库并参考.md等文档文件。","ja":"npmのグランドトゥルースとGitHubコミットに対して検証を行うことで、v4/v5からv6などのAI SDKバージョン移行を正確に確保し、npmなどのライブラリを使用し、.mdなどのドキュメントファイルを参照します。","ko":"에이전트가 npm 기준 정보와 GitHub 커밋에 대해 검증하여, v4/v5에서 v6와 같은 AI SDK 버전 마이그레이션의 정확성을 보장하며, npm과 같은 라이브러리를 사용하고 .md와 같은 문서 파일을 참조합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes verificar contra la fuente de verdad de npm y los commits de GitHub, asegurando migraciones precisas de la versión del SDK de IA, como de v4/v5 a v6, utilizando bibliotecas como npm y haciendo referencia a archivos como .md para la documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier par rapport à la source de vérité npm et aux commits GitHub, garantissant des migrations précises des versions du SDK IA, comme de v4/v5 à v6, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme npm et en référençant des fichiers tels que .md pour la documentation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, gegen die npm-Grundwahrheit und GitHub-Commits zu verifizieren, um genaue Migrationen der KI-SDK-Versionen sicherzustellen, wie z.B. von v4/v5 zu v6, unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie npm und unter Bezugnahme auf Dateien wie .md für die Dokumentation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar contra a verdade fundamental do npm e os commits do GitHub, garantindo migrações de versão de SDK de IA precisas, como de v4/v5 para v6, usando bibliotecas como o npm e referenciando arquivos como .md para documentação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять против основной истины npm и коммитов GitHub, обеспечивая точные миграции версий SDK ИИ, такие как с v4/v5 на v6, используя библиотеки как npm и ссылаясь на файлы như .md для документации.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من صحة الحقيقة الأساسية لنPM والالتزامات على GitHub، مما يضمن تحديثات إصدار SDK الذكي الدقيق، مثل v4/v5 إلى v6، باستخدام مكتبات مثل nPM والاطلاع على الملفات مثل .md للتوثيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Detecting AI SDK version updates","Validating GitHub commits for breaking changes","Migrating to new assistant-ui versions"],"zh":["检测AI SDK版本更新","验证GitHub提交以识别重大变更","迁移到新的assistant-ui版本"],"ja":["AI SDKのバージョン更新の検出","破壊的変更のためのGitHubコミットの検証","新しいassistant-uiバージョンへの移行"],"ko":["AI SDK 버전 업데이트 감지","주요 변경 사항에 대한 GitHub 커밋 검증","새로운 assistant-ui 버전으로 마이그레이션"],"es":["Detección de actualizaciones de versión del SDK de IA","Validación de commits de GitHub para cambios disruptivos","Migración a nuevas versiones de assistant-ui"],"fr":["Détection des mises à jour de version du SDK IA","Validation des commits GitHub pour les changements breaking","Migration vers de nouvelles versions d''assistant-ui"],"de":["Erkennung von KI-SDK-Versionsaktualisierungen","Validierung von GitHub-Commits auf Breaking Changes","Migration zu neuen Assistant-UI-Versionen"],"pt":["Detecção de atualizações de versão do SDK de IA","Validação de commits do GitHub para alterações de quebra","Migração para novas versões do assistant-ui"],"ru":["Обнаружение обновлений версии SDK ИИ","Проверка коммитов GitHub на наличие критических изменений","Миграция на новые версии assistant-ui"],"ar":["اكتشاف تحديثات إصدار SDK الذكي","التحقق من الالتزامات على GitHub لتحديد التغييرات الكبيرة","تحديث إلى إصدارات جديدة من واجهة المساعد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm access","GitHub commit history needed","Specific to AI SDK version migrations"],"zh":["需要npm访问权限","需要GitHub提交历史","特定于AI SDK版本迁移"],"ja":["npmへのアクセスが必要","GitHubのコミット履歴が必要","AI SDKのバージョン移行に特化"],"ko":["npm 접근 권한 필요","GitHub 커밋 기록 필요","AI SDK 버전 마이그레이션에 특화됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a npm","Se necesita el historial de commits de GitHub","Específico para migraciones de versión del SDK de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès npm","Historique des commits GitHub nécessaire","Spécifique aux migrations de version du SDK IA"],"de":["Erfordert npm-Zugriff","GitHub-Commit-Verlauf benötigt","Spezifisch für KI-SDK-Versionsmigrationen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao npm","Histórico de commits do GitHub necessário","Específico para migrações de versão do SDK de IA"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к npm","Необходим история коммитов GitHub","Конкретно для миграций версий SDK ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى nPM","يتطلب تاريخ الالتزامات على GitHub","محدد لمهاجرة إصدار SDK الذكي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
