ternet à partir d''une variété de...","de":"OPeNDAP ist ein Netzwerkdaten-Zugriffsprotokoll, das es Forschern ermöglicht, wissenschaftliche Daten im Internet von einer Vielzahl von Programmen aus zuzug...","en":"NetCDF Expansion Pack"},"definition":{"en":"NetCDF Expansion Pack"},"features":{"zh":["网络透明","灵活的数据子集","支持 HTTP","客户端/服务器架构","数据访问和处理"],"ja":["ネットワーク透過性","柔軟なデータサブセット","HTTP サポート","クライアント/サーバー アーキテクチャ","データアクセスと処理"],"ko":["네트워크 투명성","유연한 데이터 서브셋","HTTP 지원","클라이언트/서버 아키텍처","데이터 접근 및 처리"],"es":["Acceso a datos científicos remotos","Arquitectura cliente/servidor basada en HTTP","Subconjunto de datos flexible a través de expresiones de restricción","Compatibilidad con una variedad de programas","Acceso a datos en Internet desde cualquier lugar"],"fr":["Accès à des données scientifiques à distance","Architecture client/serveur basée sur HTTP","Sous-ensemble de données flexible via des expressions de contrainte","Compatibilité avec une variété de programmes","Accès à des données sur Internet depuis n''importe où"],"de":["Zugriff auf remote wissenschaftliche Daten","Client/Server-Architektur basierend auf HTTP","Flexibles Daten-Subsetting durch Constraints-Ausdrücke","Kompatibilität mit einer Vielzahl von Programmen","Zugriff auf Daten im Internet von überall"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OPeNDAP","网络数据访问","科学数据","远程数据访问","数据子集","HTTP","客户端/服务器"],"ja":["OPeNDAP","ネットワーク データ アクセス","科学データ","リモート データ アクセス","データサブセット","HTTP","クライアント/サーバー"],"ko":["OPeNDAP","네트워크 데이터 접근","과학 데이터","원격 데이터 접근","데이터 서브셋","HTTP","클라이언트/서버"],"es":["OPeNDAP","acceso a datos científicos","datos remotos","protocolo de acceso a datos","red de datos","investigación científica","análisis de datos","visualización de datos"],"fr":["OPeNDAP","accès à des données scientifiques","données à distance","protocole d''accès aux données","réseau de données","recherche scientifique","analyse de données","visualisation de données"],"de":["OPeNDAP","Zugriff auf wissenschaftliche Daten","remote Daten","Netzwerkdaten-Zugriffsprotokoll","Datenanalyse","Datenvisualisierung","wissenschaftliche Forschung","Datenmanagement"]}},"owner":"Intelligent-Data-Design-Inc","repo":"NEP","repoPath":"Intelligent-Data-Design-Inc/NEP","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"opendap","description":"Understanding OPeNDAP (Open-source Project for a Network Data Access Protocol) for accessing remote scientific data via HTTP, including DAP2/DAP4 protocols, constraint expressions, data models, and client integration. Use when working with OPeNDAP URLs, writing data access code, or integrating with NetCDF.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# OPeNDAP Skill\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive knowledge of OPeNDAP to help you access, serve, and work with remote scientific data effectively.\n\n## Overview\n\nOPeNDAP (Open-source Project for a Network Data Access Protocol) provides a way for researchers to access scientific data anywhere on the Internet from a wide variety of programs. It uses a client/server architecture built on HTTP and provides flexible data subsetting through constraint expressions.\n\n**Key Features**:\n- Network-transpa","body":"# OPeNDAP Skill\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive knowledge of OPeNDAP to help you access, serve, and work with remote scientific data effectively.\n\n## Overview\n\nOPeNDAP (Open-source Project for a Network Data Access Protocol) provides a way for researchers to access scientific data anywhere on the Internet from a wide variety of programs. It uses a client/server architecture built on HTTP and provides flexible data subsetting through constraint expressions.\n\n**Key Features**:\n- Network-transparent data access via URLs\n- Data subsetting at the server (reduces bandwidth)\n- Format-independent data model\n- Compatible with NetCDF, HDF5, and other formats\n- Supports gridded data, sequences, and complex structures\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Client/Server Architecture\n\nOPeNDAP uses a web-based client/server model similar to the World Wide Web:\n\n- **Server (Hyrax)**: Translates data from storage format to DAP format for transmission\n- **Client**: Requests data via URLs and translates DAP format to local API format\n- **Protocol**: HTTP-based Data Access Protocol (DAP)\n\n**Data Flow**:\n```\nUser Program → OPeNDAP Client Library → HTTP Request → OPeNDAP Server\n                                                              ↓\nUser Program ← Translated Data ← DAP Response ← Read Local Files\n```\n\n### 2. OPeNDAP URLs\n\nAn OPeNDAP URL identifies a dataset and optionally includes a constraint expression:\n\n**Basic URL Structure**:\n```\nhttp://server.domain/path/to/dataset.nc\n```\n\n**URL with Constraint Expression**:\n```\nhttp://server.domain/path/to/dataset.nc?variable[start:stop]&selection_clause\n```\n\n**URL Suffixes** (Service Endpoints):\n- `.dds` - Dataset Descriptor Structure (DAP2 - data shape)\n- `.das` - Data Attribute Structure (DAP2 - metadata)\n- `.dmr.xml` - Dataset Metadata Response (DAP4 - combined structure)\n- `.dods` - Binary data (DAP2)\n- `.dap` - Binary data (DAP4)\n- `.ascii` - ASCII representation of data\n- `.html` - Web form interface\n- `.info` - Combined DDS + DAS in HTML\n\n### 3. Data Access Protocol (DAP)\n\n**DAP2** (Older, widely supported):\n- Separate DDS and DAS responses\n- Binary data in .dods format\n- Simpler data model\n\n**DAP4** (Newer, enhanced):\n- Unified DMR (Dataset Metadata Response) in XML\n- Enhanced data model with groups\n- Better support for complex types\n- Improved performance\n\n## OPeNDAP Data Model\n\n### Base Types\n\n- **Byte, Int16, Int32, Int64** - Integer types\n- **UInt16, UInt32, UInt64** - Unsigned integers  \n- **Float32, Float64** - Floating-point numbers\n- **String** - Character strings\n- **URL** - Uniform Resource Locators\n\n### Constructor Types\n\n- **Array** - Multi-dimensional arrays with indexing\n- **Structure** - Collection of related variables\n- **Sequence** - Ordered collection of instances (like database rows)\n- **Grid** - Array with coordinate map vectors\n\n**Example Grid**:\n```\nGrid {\n  Array:\n    Int16 sst[time=1857][lat=89][lon=180];\n  Maps:\n    Float64 time[time=1857];\n    Float64 lat[lat=89];\n    Float64 lon[lon=180];\n} sst;\n```\n\n## Constraint Expressions\n\nConstraint expressions allow you to subset data on the server before transmission.\n\n### Syntax\n\n```\nURL?projection&selection\n```\n\n- **Projection**: Comma-separated list of variables to return\n- **Selection**: Boolean expressions to filter data (prefixed with &)\n\n### Array Subsetting\n\n**Single element**:\n```\n?variable[index]\n?sst[0][10][20]\n```\n\n**Range (start:stop)**:\n```\n?variable[start:stop]\n?sst[0:10][20:30][40:50]\n```\n\n**Stride (start:stride:stop)**:\n```\n?variable[start:stride:stop]\n?sst[0:2:100]  # Every 2nd element from 0 to 100\n```\n\n### Selection Clauses\n\n**Comparison operators**: `<`, `>`, `<=`, `>=`, `=`, `!=`\n\n**Examples**:\n```\n?station&station.temp>20.0\n?station&station.lat>0.0&station.lon<-60.0\n?station&station.month={4,5,6,7}  # List for OR\n```\n\n### Server Functions\n\nHyrax servers support functions for advanced operations:\n\n**geogrid()** - Subset by geographic coordinates:\n```\n?geogrid(sst, 62, 206, 56, 210, \"19722<time<19755\")\n```\n\n**linear_scale()** - Scale data values:\n```\n?linear_scale(sst, 0.01, 0)  # y = 0.01*x + 0\n```\n\n**version()** - List available functions:\n```\n?version()\n```\n\nCall any function with no arguments to see its documentation.\n\n## Using OPeNDAP with NetCDF\n\n### NetCDF-C Library\n\nThe NetCDF-C library has built-in OPeNDAP support. Simply use an OPeNDAP URL instead of a file path:\n\n```c\n#include <netcdf.h>\n\nint ncid, varid;\nchar *url = \"http://test.opendap.org/dap/data/nc/sst.mnmean.nc.gz\";\n\n// Open remote dataset\nnc_open(url, NC_NOWRITE, &ncid);\n\n// Access variables normally\nnc_inq_varid(ncid, \"sst\", &varid);\n\n// Read data with subsetting\nsize_t start[] = {0, 0, 0};\nsize_t count[] = {1, 10, 10};\nfloat data[10][10];\nnc_get_vara_float(ncid, varid, start, count, &data[0][0]);\n\nnc_close(ncid);\n```\n\n### URL with Constraint Expression\n\nYou can include constraint expressions in the URL:\n\n```c\nchar *url = \"http://server.org/data.nc?sst[0:10][20:30][40:50]\";\nnc_open(url, NC_NOWRITE, &ncid);\n```\n\n### Fortran Programs\n\n```fortran\nprogram read_opendap\n  use netcdf\n  implicit none\n  \n  integer :: ncid, varid, status\n  character(len=256) :: url\n  real :: data(10, 10)\n  \n  url = \"http://test.opendap.org/dap/data/nc/sst.mnmean.nc.gz\"\n  \n  status = nf90_open(url, NF90_NOWRITE, ncid)\n  status = nf90_inq_varid(ncid, \"sst\", varid)\n  status = nf90_get_var(ncid, varid, data, &\n                        start=[1,1,1], count=[10,10,1])\n  status = nf90_close(ncid)\n  \nend program read_opendap\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### 1. Exploring a Dataset\n\n**Step 1**: Get the DMR/DDS to see structure:\n```\nhttp://server.org/data.nc.dmr.xml\nhttp://server.org/data.nc.dds  (DAP2)\n```\n\n**Step 2**: Get attributes:\n```\nhttp://server.org/data.nc.das  (DAP2)\n```\n\n**Step 3**: Use .info for combined view:\n```\nhttp://server.org/data.nc.info\n```\n\n### 2. Subsetting Data\n\n**Step 1**: Identify variable and dimensions from DMR/DDS\n\n**Step 2**: Construct constraint expression:\n```\n?variable[time_start:time_end][lat_start:lat_end][lon_start:lon_end]\n```\n\n**Step 3**: Test with .ascii to verify:\n```\nhttp://server.org/data.nc.ascii?sst[0:1][10:20][30:40]\n```\n\n**Step 4**: Use in your program with full URL\n\n### 3. Working with Sequences\n\nSequences are like database tables with rows of data:\n\n**Get specific fields**:\n```\n?sequence.field1,sequence.field2\n```\n\n**Filter rows**:\n```\n?sequence.field1,sequence.field2&sequence.field1>100\n```\n\n**Multiple conditions**:\n```\n?sequence&sequence.temp>20&sequence.depth<100\n```\n\n## Client Tools\n\n### Matlab\n\nMatlab 2012a+ has built-in OPeNDAP support via NetCDF interface:\n\n```matlab\nurl = ''http://test.opendap.org/dap/data/nc/sst.mnmean.nc.gz'';\nncid = netcdf.open(url);\ndata = netcdf.getVar(ncid, varid);\nnetcdf.close(ncid);\n```\n\n### Python\n\nUsing netCDF4-python or xarray:\n\n```python\nimport netCDF4\nurl = \"http://test.opendap.org/dap/data/nc/sst.mnmean.nc.gz\"\nds = netCDF4.Dataset(url)\nsst = ds.variables[''sst''][0:10, 20:30, 40:50]\n```\n\n### Command-line Tools\n\n**ncdump** (with OPeNDAP-enabled NetCDF):\n```bash\nncdump -h \"http://server.org/data.nc\"\nncdump -v sst \"http://server.org/data.nc?sst[0:10][20:30]\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n**1. URL not recognized**:\n- Ensure NetCDF library is compiled with DAP support\n- Check URL syntax (http:// or https://)\n\n**2. Constraint expression errors**:\n- Verify variable names match DDS/DMR exactly\n- Check array bounds (0-indexed)\n- Ensure proper quoting in shell commands\n\n**3. Performance issues**:\n- Use constraint expressions to reduce data transfer\n- Request only needed variables\n- Consider server-side functions for processing\n\n**4. Authentication**:\n- Some servers require credentials\n- Use .netrc file or URL-embedded credentials\n- Check server documentation for auth methods\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Essential URL Patterns\n\n```\n# Get metadata\nhttp://server/dataset.nc.dmr.xml  (DAP4)\nhttp://server/dataset.nc.dds      (DAP2)\nhttp://server/dataset.nc.das      (DAP2)\n\n# Get data\nhttp://server/dataset.nc?var[0:10]\nhttp://server/dataset.nc.ascii?var[0:10]\n\n# Multiple variables\nhttp://server/dataset.nc?var1,var2,var3\n\n# With selection\nhttp://server/dataset.nc?var&var>100\n```\n\n### Constraint Expression Operators\n\n- Array: `[start:stop]`, `[start:stride:stop]`\n- Comparison: `<`, `>`, `<=`, `>=`, `=`, `!=`\n- String match: `~=` (regex)\n- Lists: `{val1,val2,val3}` (OR operation)\n- Structure fields: `structure.field`\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nSee [references/PROTOCOL.md](references/PROTOCOL.md) for DAP2 and DAP4 protocol details.\n\nSee [references/CONSTRAINTS.md](references/CONSTRAINTS.md) for comprehensive constraint expression examples.\n\nSee [references/DATA-MODEL.md](references/DATA-MODEL.md) for complete data type documentation.\n\nSee [references/CLIENT-USAGE.md](references/CLIENT-USAGE.md) for client integration examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:35:47.755Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Scientific Data Analysis Agents needing to access and manipulate remote NetCDF data via OPeNDAP protocol","zh":"非常适合需要通过OPeNDAP协议访问和操作远程NetCDF数据的科学数据分析代理","ja":"OPeNDAPプロトコルを介してリモートのNetCDFデータにアクセスおよび操作する必要がある科学データ分析エージェントに最適","ko":"OPeNDAP 프로토콜을 통해 원격 NetCDF 데이터에 액세스 및 조작하는 데 필요한 과학 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos Científicos que necesitan acceder y manipular datos NetCDF remotos a través del protocolo OPeNDAP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données scientifiques ayant besoin d''accéder et de manipuler des données NetCDF distantes via le protocole OPeNDAP","de":"Perfekt für wissenschaftliche Datenanalyse-Agents, die auf Remote-NetCDF-Daten über das OPeNDAP-Protokoll zugreifen und diese manipulieren müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados Científicos que precisam acessar e manipular dados NetCDF remotos via protocolo OPeNDAP","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа научных данных, которым необходимо доступ и манипуляция удаленными данными NetCDF через протокол OPeNDAP","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل البيانات العلمية التي تحتاج إلى الوصول والتعامل مع بيانات NetCDF عن بعد عبر بروتوكول OPeNDAP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to access, serve, and work with remote scientific data effectively using OPeNDAP''s client/server architecture and flexible data subsetting through constraint expressions over HTTP, enabling seamless integration with NetCDF files","zh":"赋予代理访问、提供和有效使用OPeNDAP的客户端/服务器架构和通过HTTP上的约束表达式对数据进行灵活的子集化，从而实现与NetCDF文件的无缝集成","ja":"OPeNDAPのクライアント/サーバーアーキテクチャとHTTP上の制約表現による柔軟なデータサブセットを使用して、エージェントがリモートの科学データにアクセスして提供し、効果的に作業できるようにし、NetCDFファイルとのシームレスな統合を可能にします","ko":"OPeNDAP의 클라이언트/서버 아키텍처와 HTTP上的 제약 표현을 통해 데이터의 유연한 부분 집합화를 사용하여 에이전트가 원격 과학 데이터에 액세스하고 제공하고 효과적으로 작업할 수 있도록 하여 NetCDF 파일과의 무결점 통합을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a acceder, servir y trabajar con datos científicos remotos de manera efectiva utilizando la arquitectura cliente/servidor de OPeNDAP y la subconjunción de datos flexible a través de expresiones de restricción sobre HTTP, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con archivos NetCDF","fr":"Permet aux agents d''accéder, de servir et de travailler avec des données scientifiques distantes de manière efficace en utilisant l''architecture client/serveur d''OPeNDAP et la sous-partition de données flexible via des expressions de contrainte sur HTTP, ce qui permet une intégration transparente avec les fichiers NetCDF","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Remote-wissenschaftliche Daten effektiv über die Client-Server-Architektur von OPeNDAP und flexible Daten-Subsetting durch Constraints-Ausdrücke über HTTP zu zugreifen, zu servieren und zu bearbeiten, was eine nahtlose Integration mit NetCDF-Dateien ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acessarem, servirem e trabalharem com dados científicos remotos de forma eficaz, utilizando a arquitetura cliente/servidor do OPeNDAP e subconjunto de dados flexível por meio de expressões de restrição sobre HTTP, permitindo integração perfeita com arquivos NetCDF","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью доступа, обслуживания и работы с удаленными научными данными эффективно, используя клиент-серверную архитектуру OPeNDAP и гибкий подмножество данных посредством ограничительных выражений по HTTP, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с файлами NetCDF","ar":"تمكن العميل من الوصول إلى البيانات العلمية عن بعد وتقديمها والعمل معها بفعالية باستخدام هيكل العميل والخادم الخاص ببروتوكول OPeNDAP وتجزئة البيانات المرنة من خلال التعبيرات القصرية عبر بروتوكول HTTP، مما يتيح التكامل السلس مع ملفات NetCDF"},"useCases":{"en":["Accessing remote scientific data via OPeNDAP","Subsetting large datasets using constraint expressions","Serving NetCDF data to various client applications"],"zh":["通过OPeNDAP访问远程科学数据","使用约束表达式对大型数据集进行子集化","将NetCDF数据提供给各种客户端应用程序"],"ja":["OPeNDAPを介してリモートの科学データにアクセスする","制約表現を使用して大規模なデータセットをサブセット化する","NetCDFデータをさまざまなクライアントアプリケーションに提供する"],"ko":["OPeNDAP를 통해 원격 과학 데이터에 액세스하는 것","제약 표현을 사용하여 대규모 데이터 세트를 부분 집합화하는 것","NetCDF 데이터를 다양한 클라이언트 애플리케이션에 제공하는 것"],"es":["Acceder a datos científicos remotos a través de OPeNDAP","Subconjuntar grandes conjuntos de datos utilizando expresiones de restricción","Servir datos NetCDF a varias aplicaciones cliente"],"fr":["Accéder à des données scientifiques distantes via OPeNDAP","Sous-partitionner de grands ensembles de données à l''aide d''expressions de contrainte","Servir des données NetCDF à diverses applications clientes"],"de":["Auf Remote-wissenschaftliche Daten über OPeNDAP zugreifen","Große Datensätze unter Verwendung von Constraints-Ausdrücken subsetting","NetCDF-Daten an verschiedene Client-Anwendungen servieren"],"pt":["Acessar dados científicos remotos via OPeNDAP","Subconjunto de grandes conjuntos de dados usando expressões de restrição","Servir dados NetCDF para várias aplicações de cliente"],"ru":["Доступ к удаленным научным данным через OPeNDAP","Подмножество крупных наборов данных с помощью ограничительных выражений","Обслуживание данных NetCDF для различных клиентских приложений"],"ar":["الوصول إلى البيانات العلمية عن بعد عبر بروتوكول OPeNDAP","تقسيم مجموعات البيانات الكبيرة باستخدام التعبيرات القصرية","تقديم بيانات NetCDF إلى تطبيقات العملاء المختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OPeNDAP server setup","Limited to NetCDF file format","Dependent on HTTP protocol"],"zh":["需要OPeNDAP服务器设置","仅限于NetCDF文件格式","依赖于HTTP协议"],"ja":["OPeNDAPサーバーの設定が必要","NetCDFファイル形式のみに限定される","HTTPプロトコルに依存する"],"ko":["OPeNDAP 서버 설정이 필요","NetCDF 파일 형식만 제한","HTTP 프로토콜에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor OPeNDAP","Limitado al formato de archivo NetCDF","Dependiente del protocolo HTTP"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur OPeNDAP","Limité au format de fichier NetCDF","Dépendant du protocole HTTP"],"de":["Benötigt OPeNDAP-Server-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf NetCDF-Dateiformat","Abhängig vom HTTP-Protokoll"],"pt":["Requer configuração do servidor OPeNDAP","Limitado ao formato de arquivo NetCDF","Dependente do protocolo HTTP"],"ru":["Требуется настройка сервера OPeNDAP","Ограничен форматом файла NetCDF","Зависит от протокола HTTP"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم بروتوكول OPeNDAP","محدود بتنسيق ملف NetCDF","يعتمد على بروتوكول HTTP"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('goondocks-co/open-agent-kit/codebase-intelligence', 'community', 'goondocks-co', 'open-agent-kit', 'goondocks-co/open-agent-kit', 'codebase-intelligence', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z', '2026-02-18T12:36:15.268Z', NULL, '{"id":"goondocks-co/open-agent-kit/codebase-intelligence","name":"codebase-intelligence","description":{"zh":"代码库智能搜索是一种强大的工具，允许开发者使用语义向量搜索、影响分析和SQL查询来搜索和分析代码库","ja":"コードベースインテリジェンスは、開発者がセマンティックベクターサーチ、影響分析、SQLクエリーを使用してコードベースを検索、分析できる強力なツールです","ko":"코드베이스 인텔리전스는 개발자가 의미 벡터 검색, 영향 분석 및 SQL 쿼리를 사용하여 코드베이스를 검색하고 분석할 수 있는 강력한 도구입니다","es":"La inteligencia de código te permite buscar, analizar y consultar tu base de código de manera eficiente","fr":"L''intelligence de codebase vous permet de rechercher, d''analyser et d''interroger votre base de code de manière efficace","de":"Die Codebase-Intelligenz ermöglicht es Ihnen, Ihren Code effizient zu durchsuchen, zu analysieren und zu befragen","pt":"A inteligência de codebase é uma ferramenta poderosa que permite busca e análise de código usando vetores semânticos e consultas SQL diretas","ru":"Интеллект кодовой базы - это мощный инструмент, который позволяет искать и анализировать код с помощью семантических векторов и прямых запросов SQL","ar":"ذكاء قاعدة الشفرة هو أداة قوية تمكنك من البحث وتحليل الشفرة باستخدام متجهات دلالية واستفسارات SQL مباشرة","en":"Repository for Open Agent Kit"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码库智能搜索","ja":"コードベースインテリジェンス","ko":"코드베이스 인텔리전스","es":"Inteligencia de código: búsqueda y análisis de código","fr":"Intelligence de codebase : recherche et analyse de code","de":"Codebase-Intelligenz: Code-Suche und -Analyse","pt":"Inteligência de Codebase: Busca e Análise de Código","ru":"Интеллект кодовой базы: поиск и анализ кода","ar":"ذكاء قاعدة الشفرة: بحث وتحليل الشفرة","en":"codebase-intelligence"},"description":{"zh":"代码库智能搜索是一