description":{"zh":"Playwright CLI是一种浏览器自动化工具，支持快速开发和测试","ja":"Playwright CLIはブラウザの自動化ツールで、迅速な開発とテストをサポートします","ko":"Playwright CLI는 브라우저 자동화 도구로서 빠른 개발과 테스트를 지원합니다","es":"Playwright-cli es una herramienta para automatizar tareas en el navegador, ideal para desarrolladores que buscan agilizar sus flujos de trabajo","fr":"Playwright-cli est un outil pour automatiser des tâches dans le navigateur, idéal pour les développeurs qui cherchent à accélérer leurs flux de travail","de":"Playwright-cli ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung von Browser-Aufgaben, ideal für Entwickler, die ihre Arbeitsabläufe beschleunigen möchten","pt":"O playwright-cli é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite automatizar tarefas de navegação e interação","ru":"playwright-cli - это инструмент для автоматизации браузера, который позволяет автоматизировать задачи навигации и взаимодействия","ar":"playwright-cli هو أداة أتمتة المتصفح التي تمكنك من أتمتة المهام التفاعلية والملاحة","en":"A minimal implementation of an OAuth authorization server which is kept as simple as possible for only the flows and requirements used by abstratium"},"definition":{"en":"A minimal implementation of an OAuth authorization server which is kept as simple as possible for only the flows and requirements used by abstratium"},"features":{"zh":["快速打开网页","支持点击和输入操作","可重新快照网页","支持核心工作流","提供多种命令行选项"],"ja":["迅速にWebページを開く","クリックと入力操作をサポート","ウェブページを再スナップショットする","コアワークフローをサポート","多くのコマンドラインオプションを提供"],"ko":["빠르게 웹 페이지 열기","클릭 및 입력 동작 지원","웹 페이지를 다시 스냅샷","코어 워크플로 지원","다양한 명령줄 옵션 제공"],"es":["Automatización de navegación","Interacción con elementos de la página","Captura de instantáneas de la página","Repetición de acciones","Soporte para múltiples navegadores"],"fr":["Automatisation de la navigation","Interaction avec les éléments de la page","Capture d''instantanés de la page","Répétition d''actions","Prise en charge de plusieurs navigateurs"],"de":["Automatisierung der Navigation","Interaktion mit Seitenelementen","Erstellung von Seiten-Schnappschüssen","Wiederholung von Aktionen","Unterstützung für mehrere Browser"],"pt":["Abre URLs no navegador","Clica em elementos da página","Digita texto em campos de formulário","Envia teclas de pressionamento","Fecha o navegador"],"ru":["Открывает URL-адреса в браузере","Кликает на элементы страницы","Вводит текст в поля формы","Отправляет клавиши нажатия","Закрывает браузер"],"ar":["فتحURL في المتصفح","نقر على عناصر الصفحة","كتابة نص في حقول النماذج","إرسال مفتاح الضغط","إغلاق المتصفح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Playwright CLI","浏览器自动化","命令行工具","快速开发","自动化测试","网页交互"],"ja":["Playwright CLI","ブラウザ自動化","コマンドラインツール","迅速な開発","自動化テスト","Webページの相互作用"],"ko":["Playwright CLI","브라우저 자동화","명령줄 도구","빠른 개발","자동화 테스트","웹 페이지 상호 작용"],"es":["automatización de navegador","playwright-cli","desarrollo web","automatización de tareas","herramientas de desarrollo","navegador automático"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","playwright-cli","développement web","automatisation de tâches","outils de développement","navigateur automatique"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","playwright-cli","Web-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Entwickler-Tools","automatischer Browser"],"pt":["playwright-cli","automação de navegador","linha de comando","navegação automática","interação com página","teste de interface do usuário"],"ru":["playwright-cli","автоматизация браузера","командная строка","автоматическая навигация","взаимодействие со страницей","тестирование интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["playwright-cli","أتمتة المتصفح","سطر الأوامر","ملاحة أتمتيك","التفاعل مع الصفحة","اختبار واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"abstratium-dev","repo":"abstrauth","repoPath":"abstratium-dev/abstrauth","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright-cli","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://playwright.dev\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `playwright-cli open https://example.com`\n2. Interact using refs from the snapshot\n3. Re-snapshot after significant changes\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/\nplaywright-cli close\nplaywright-cli type \"search query\"\nplaywright-cli cl","body":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://playwright.dev\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `playwright-cli open https://example.com`\n2. Interact using refs from the snapshot\n3. Re-snapshot after significant changes\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/\nplaywright-cli close\nplaywright-cli type \"search query\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli dblclick e7\nplaywright-cli fill e5 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli drag e2 e8\nplaywright-cli hover e4\nplaywright-cli select e9 \"option-value\"\nplaywright-cli upload ./document.pdf\nplaywright-cli check e12\nplaywright-cli uncheck e12\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli eval \"document.title\"\nplaywright-cli eval \"el => el.textContent\" e5\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept \"confirmation text\"\nplaywright-cli dialog-dismiss\nplaywright-cli resize 1920 1080\n```\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli go-back\nplaywright-cli go-forward\nplaywright-cli reload\n```\n\n### Keyboard\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli press Enter\nplaywright-cli press ArrowDown\nplaywright-cli keydown Shift\nplaywright-cli keyup Shift\n```\n\n### Mouse\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli mousemove 150 300\nplaywright-cli mousedown\nplaywright-cli mousedown right\nplaywright-cli mouseup\nplaywright-cli mouseup right\nplaywright-cli mousewheel 0 100\n```\n\n### Save as\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli screenshot\nplaywright-cli screenshot e5\nplaywright-cli pdf\n```\n\n### Tabs\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-new\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/page\nplaywright-cli tab-close\nplaywright-cli tab-close 2\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\n```\n\n### DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli console warning\nplaywright-cli network\nplaywright-cli run-code \"async page => await page.context().grantPermissions([''geolocation''])\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\n```\n\n### Configuration\n```bash\n# Configure the session\nplaywright-cli config my-config.json\n# Configure named session\nplaywright-cli --session=mysession config my-config.json\n# Start with configured session\nplaywright-cli open --config=my-config.json\n```\n\n### Sessions\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli --session=mysession open example.com\nplaywright-cli --session=mysession click e6\nplaywright-cli session-list\nplaywright-cli session-stop mysession\nplaywright-cli session-stop-all\nplaywright-cli session-delete\nplaywright-cli session-delete mysession\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/form\nplaywright-cli snapshot\n\nplaywright-cli fill e1 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli fill e2 \"password123\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli snapshot\n```\n\n## Example: Multi-tab workflow\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/other\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\nplaywright-cli snapshot\n```\n\n## Example: Debugging with DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli network\n```\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:36:25.304Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Browser Automation Agents needing advanced interaction capabilities with web pages via OAuth authorization","zh":"非常适合需要通过OAuth授权与网页进行高级交互的浏览器自动化代理","ja":"OAuth認証を介したWebページとの高度なやり取りが必要なブラウザ自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"OAuth 인증을 통해 웹 페이지와 고급 상호 작용이 필요한 브라우저 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización de Navegador que necesitan capacidades de interacción avanzadas con páginas web a través de autorización OAuth","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Navigateur ayant besoin de capacités d''interaction avancées avec les pages Web via une autorisation OAuth","de":"Perfekt für Browser-Automatisierungs-Agents, die erweiterte Interaktionsmöglichkeiten mit Webseiten über OAuth-Autorisierung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Navegador que necessitam de capacidades de interação avançadas com páginas da web via autorização OAuth","ru":"Идеально для Браузерных Автоматизационных Агентов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности взаимодействия с веб-страницами через авторизацию OAuth","ar":"مثالي لعميل آلي للتسجيل في المتصفح الذي يحتاج إلى تفاعلات متقدمة مع صفحات الويب من خلال مصادقة OAuth"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using playwright-cli, enabling navigation, clicking, and typing on web pages with OAuth authorization, supporting protocols like HTTPS and handling browser automation tasks","zh":"赋予代理使用playwright-cli自动化浏览器交互的能力，实现网页的导航、点击和输入，支持HTTPS等协议，并处理浏览器自动化任务","ja":"playwright-cliを使用してブラウザのやり取りを自動化するエージェントを可能にし、Webページのナビゲーション、クリック、入力を可能にし、HTTPSなどのプロトコルをサポートし、ブラウザ自動化タスクを処理","ko":"playwright-cli를 사용하여 브라우저 상호 작용을 자동화할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 웹 페이지의 탐색, 클릭 및 입력을 가능하게 하며 HTTPS 등 프로토콜을 지원하고 브라우저 자동화 작업을 처리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar interacciones del navegador utilizando playwright-cli, lo que permite la navegación, el clic y la escritura en páginas web con autorización OAuth, y admite protocolos como HTTPS y manejo de tareas de automatización de navegador","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions de navigateur en utilisant playwright-cli, ce qui permet la navigation, le clic et la saisie sur les pages Web avec une autorisation OAuth, et prend en charge des protocoles comme HTTPS et la gestion des tâches d''automatisation de navigateur","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Browser-Interaktionen mithilfe von playwright-cli zu automatisieren, wodurch die Navigation, das Klicken und das Tippen auf Webseiten mit OAuth-Autorisierung ermöglicht wird, und unterstützt Protokolle wie HTTPS und die Handhabung von Browser-Automatisierungsaufgaben","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações do navegador usando playwright-cli, permitindo navegação, cliques e digitação em páginas da web com autorização OAuth, suportando protocolos como HTTPS e lidando com tarefas de automação do navegador","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера с помощью playwright-cli, позволяя навигацию, клики и набор текста на веб-страницах с авторизацией OAuth, поддерживая протоколы типа HTTPS и обрабатывая задачи автоматизации браузера","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من توفير عميل آلي للتسجيل في المتصفح باستخدام playwright-cli، مما يسمح بالملاحة والنقرات والكتابة على صفحات الويب بمصادقة OAuth، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS ومعالجة مهام آليّة للمتصفح"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser interactions for data scraping","Generating browser automation scripts for testing","Debugging web page issues using playwright-cli''s snapshot feature"],"zh":["自动化浏览器交互以进行数据抓取","为测试生成浏览器自动化脚本","使用playwright-cli的快照功能调试网页问题"],"ja":["データスクレイピングのためのブラウザのやり取りを自動化する","テストのためのブラウザ自動化スクリプトを生成する","playwright-cliのスナップショット機能を使用してWebページの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["데이터 스크레이핑을 위해 브라우저 상호 작용을 자동화하는 것","테스트를 위한 브라우저 자동화 스크립트를 생성하는 것","playwright-cli의 스냅샷 기능을 사용하여 웹 페이지 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de interacciones del navegador para extracción de datos","Generación de scripts de automatización de navegador para pruebas","Depuración de problemas de página web utilizando la función de instantánea de playwright-cli"],"fr":["Automatisation des interactions de navigateur pour le scraping de données","Génération de scripts d''automatisation de navigateur pour les tests","Débogage des problèmes de page Web en utilisant la fonction d''instantané de playwright-cli"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browser-Interaktionen für Datenextraktion","Erstellung von Browser-Automatisierungsskripten für Tests","Fehlerbehebung bei Webseitenproblemen mithilfe der Snapshot-Funktion von playwright-cli"],"pt":["Automatizar interações do navegador para extração de dados","Gerar scripts de automação do navegador para testes","Depurar problemas de páginas da web usando o recurso de instantâneo do playwright-cli"],"ru":["Автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера для сбора данных","Генерировать скрипты автоматизации браузера для тестирования","Отлаживать проблемы веб-страниц с помощью функции снимка playwright-cli"],"ar":["أتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح لاستخراج البيانات","генерировать سكريبتات آليّة للمتصفح للاختبارات","تصحيح مشاكل صفحات الويب باستخدام ميزة لقطة playwright-cli"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires playwright-cli installation","Limited to specific flows and requirements used by abstratium","Needs proper handling of browser automation tasks"],"zh":["需要安装playwright-cli","仅限于abstratium使用的特定流程和要求","需要适当处理浏览器自动化任务"],"ja":["playwright-cliのインストールが必要","abstratiumによって使用される特定のフローと要件に限定される","ブラウザ自動化タスクの適切な処理が必要"],"ko":["playwright-cli 설치가 필요","abstratium에서 사용하는 특정 흐름 및 요구 사항으로 제한","브라우저 자동화 작업의 적절한 처리가 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de playwright-cli","Limitado a flujos y requisitos específicos utilizados por abstratium","Requiere un manejo adecuado de las tareas de automatización de navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de playwright-cli","Limité à des flux et des exigences spécifiques utilisés par abstratium","Nécessite une gestion appropriée des tâches d''automatisation de navigateur"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von playwright-cli","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Flows und Anforderungen, die von abstratium verwendet werden","Benötigt eine ordnungsgemäße Handhabung von Browser-Automatisierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Exige instalação do playwright-cli","Limitado a fluxos e requisitos específicos usados pelo abstratium","Necessita de tratamento adequado de tarefas de automação do navegador"],"ru":["Требует установки playwright-cli","Ограничен конкретными потоками и требованиями, используемыми abstratium","Требует правильного xử lý задач автоматизации браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت playwright-cli","محدود بالتدفقات والمتطلبات المحددة التي يستخدمها abstratium","يتطلب معالجة مناسبة لمهام آليّة للمتصفح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
