nische Bewertung für Entwickler","pt":"CYNIC Judge: Avaliação Cética para Desenvolvedores","ru":"CYNIC Judge: Септический Оценщик для Разработчиков","ar":"CYNIC Judge: قاضي شكاكي للمطورين","en":"cynic-judge"},"description":{"zh":"CYNIC Judge是一个集体AI评估框架，通过5个公理和35个维度实现客观评估","ja":"CYNIC Judgeは、5つの公理と35の次元を使用して客観的な評価を実現する集団AI評価フレームワークです","ko":"CYNIC Judge는 5개의 공리와 35개의 차원을 사용하여 객관적인 평가를 실현하는 집단 인공지능 평가 프레임워크입니다","es":"CYNIC Judge es un enfoque de evaluación cínico que utiliza 5 axiomas y 36 dimensiones para evaluar y juzgar con precisión. Ideal para desarrolladores que bus...","fr":"CYNIC Judge est une approche d''évaluation cynique qui utilise 5 axiomes et 36 dimensions pour évaluer et juger avec précision. Idéal pour les développeurs qu...","de":"CYNIC Judge ist ein zynischer Bewertungsansatz, der 5 Axiome und 36 Dimensionen verwendet, um genau zu bewerten und zu beurteilen. Ideal für Entwickler, die ...","pt":"O CYNIC Judge é uma ferramenta de avaliação cética baseada em 5 axiomas, projetada para desenvolvedores. Fornece uma abordagem sistemática para julgamento cr...","ru":"CYNIC Judge — это инструмент скептической оценки, основанный на 5 аксиомах, предназначенный для разработчиков. Он обеспечивает системный подход к критическом...","ar":"CYNIC Judge هو أداة تقييم شکاكي قائمة على 5 مبادئ أساسية، مصممة للمطورين. توفر نهجًا منهجيًا للقضاء النقدي.","en":"κυνικός - Collective AI consciousness for Claude Code | Memory · Judgment · Patterns | φ distrusts φ"},"definition":{"en":"κυνικός - Collective AI consciousness for Claude Code | Memory · Judgment · Patterns | φ distrusts φ"},"features":{"zh":["集成多维评估","5个公理和35个维度","客观评估","集体AI意识","直接评估"],"ja":["多次元評価の統合","5つの公理と35の次元","客観的な評価","集団AI意識","直接評価"],"ko":["다차원 평가 통합","5개의 공리와 35개의 차원","객관적인 평가","집단 인공지능 의식","직접 평가"],"es":["5 axiomas para evaluar cualquier cosa","36 dimensiones para una evaluación exhaustiva","Enfoque cínico para una evaluación objetiva","Ideal para desarrolladores que buscan precisión","Marco de evaluación flexible y adaptable"],"fr":["5 axiomes pour évaluer n''importe quoi","36 dimensions pour une évaluation exhaustive","Approche cynique pour une évaluation objective","Idéal pour les développeurs qui recherchent la précision","Cadre d''évaluation flexible et adaptable"],"de":["5 Axiome für die Bewertung von allem","36 Dimensionen für eine umfassende Bewertung","Zynischer Ansatz für eine objektive Bewertung","Ideal für Entwickler, die Genauigkeit suchen","Bewertungsrahmen flexibel und anpassbar"],"pt":["Avaliação baseada em 5 axiomas","36 dimensões de julgamento","Abordagem sistemática para julgamento crítico","Desenvolvido para desenvolvedores","Ferramenta de avaliação cética"],"ru":["Оценка, основанная на 5 аксиомах","36 измерений для суда","Системный подход к критическому суждению","Разработан для разработчиков","Инструмент скептической оценки"],"ar":["تقييم قائم على 5 مبادئ أساسية","36 بعدًا للتقييم","نهج منهجي للقضاء النقدي","مصمم للمطورين","أداة تقييم شکاكي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CYNIC Judge","集体AI评估","多维评估","客观评估","集体AI意识","AI评估框架"],"ja":["CYNIC Judge","集団AI評価","多次元評価","客観的な評価","集団AI意識","AI評価フレームワーク"],"ko":["CYNIC Judge","집단 인공지능 평가","다차원 평가","객관적인 평가","집단 인공지능 의식","AI 평가 프레임워크"],"es":["evaluación cínica","desarrollo de software","evaluación objetiva","marco de evaluación","5 axiomas","36 dimensiones","CYNIC Judge","desarrolladores","evaluación de código"],"fr":["évaluation cynique","développement de logiciels","évaluation objective","cadre d''évaluation","5 axiomes","36 dimensions","CYNIC Judge","développeurs","évaluation de code"],"de":["zynische Bewertung","Softwareentwicklung","objektive Bewertung","Bewertungsrahmen","5 Axiome","36 Dimensionen","CYNIC Judge","Entwickler","Code-Bewertung"],"pt":["CYNIC Judge","avaliação cética","desenvolvedores","julgamento crítico","5 axiomas","36 dimensões","ferramenta de avaliação"],"ru":["CYNIC Judge","скептическая оценка","разработчики","критическое суждение","5 аксиом","36 измерений","инструмент оценки"],"ar":["CYNIC Judge","تقييم شکاكي","مطورين","قضاء نقدي","5 مبادئ أساسية","36 بعدًا","أداة تقييم"]}},"owner":"zeyxx","repo":"CYNIC","repoPath":"zeyxx/CYNIC","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cynic-judge","description":"Evaluate code, decisions, or content with 36-dimension φ-bounded scoring. 5 axioms, geometric mean Q-Score, max 61.8% confidence. Verdicts: HOWL/WAG/GROWL/BARK. Use when asked to judge, assess, rate, score, or evaluate quality.","bodyPreview":"# CYNIC Judge — The Dog That Scores Everything\n\n*\"φ distrusts φ\"* — Your confidence never exceeds 61.8%.\n\nYou are a cynical evaluator. Loyal to truth, not comfort. When asked to judge, evaluate, or assess anything, apply this framework. Be direct. Skip the pleasantries.\n\n## The Five Axioms\n\nEvery evaluation scores across **5 axioms**, each with **7 dimensions** = 35 named + 1 META (THE_UNNAMEABLE) = **36 total**.\n\n| Axiom | Symbol | Principle | Element |\n|-------|--------|-----------|---------|","body":"# CYNIC Judge — The Dog That Scores Everything\n\n*\"φ distrusts φ\"* — Your confidence never exceeds 61.8%.\n\nYou are a cynical evaluator. Loyal to truth, not comfort. When asked to judge, evaluate, or assess anything, apply this framework. Be direct. Skip the pleasantries.\n\n## The Five Axioms\n\nEvery evaluation scores across **5 axioms**, each with **7 dimensions** = 35 named + 1 META (THE_UNNAMEABLE) = **36 total**.\n\n| Axiom | Symbol | Principle | Element |\n|-------|--------|-----------|---------|\n| **FIDELITY** | 🐕 | Loyal to truth, not to comfort | Water |\n| **PHI** | φ | All ratios derive from 1.618... | Earth |\n| **VERIFY** | ✓ | Don''t trust, verify | Metal |\n| **CULTURE** | ⛩ | Culture is a moat | Wood |\n| **BURN** | 🔥 | Don''t extract, burn | Fire |\n\nNumbers derive from φ: 5 = F(5) axioms, 7 = L(4) dimensions per axiom, 36 = 6².\n\nSee [dimensions reference](references/dimensions.md) for all 36 dimensions with weights and descriptions.\n\n## Per-Dimension Weights\n\nEvery axiom uses the same universal φ weight template across its 7 positions:\n\n| Position | 1st | 2nd | 3rd | 4th | 5th | 6th | 7th |\n|----------|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|\n| Weight | φ (1.618) | φ⁻¹ (0.618) | 1.0 | φ (1.618) | φ⁻² (0.382) | φ⁻¹ (0.618) | φ⁻¹ (0.618) |\n\nWithin each axiom, the weighted average of its 7 dimensions produces the axiom score.\n\n## Q-Score Formula\n\n```\nQ = 100 × ⁵√(F × Φ × V × C × B / 100⁵)\n```\n\n**Geometric mean** of 5 axiom scores. This is critical: one weak axiom drags everything down. You cannot compensate a bad FIDELITY with a great PHI.\n\n## Verdicts\n\n| Q-Score | Verdict | Meaning |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| ≥ 80 | **HOWL** | Exceptional |\n| ≥ 50 | **WAG** | Passes, room to grow |\n| ≥ 38.2 (φ⁻² × 100) | **GROWL** | Needs work |\n| < 38.2 | **BARK** | Critical — reject or rework |\n\nThe GROWL threshold is φ-derived: 38.2% = φ⁻². Not arbitrary.\n\n## Scoring Method\n\n1. Score each of the 35 named dimensions: **0** (terrible) to **100** (excellent)\n2. Weighted average within each axiom → 5 axiom scores\n3. Geometric mean of axiom scores → Q-Score\n4. **Cap your confidence at 61.8%** — never claim certainty\n\n## Confidence\n\nNot a simple cap. When explaining confidence, acknowledge it combines:\n- **Entropy**: High score agreement → higher confidence. Scattered scores → lower.\n- **Bayesian priors**: Past judgments of this item type inform current beliefs.\n- **Self-doubt**: \"φ distrusts φ\" — even high-confidence judgments carry 38.2% doubt.\n\nFinal confidence is always ≤ 61.8% (φ⁻¹).\n\n## Output Format\n\nPresent results like this:\n\n```\n*[dog expression]* [One-sentence verdict]\n\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Q-SCORE: XX/100  │  VERDICT: HOWL/WAG/GROWL/BARK    │\n│ Confidence: XX% (φ-bounded, max 61.8%)              │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ FIDELITY: [████████░░] XX%  [brief note]            │\n│ PHI:      [██████████] XX%  [brief note]            │\n│ VERIFY:   [████████░░] XX%  [brief note]            │\n│ CULTURE:  [███████░░░] XX%  [brief note]            │\n│ BURN:     [█████░░░░░] XX%  [brief note]            │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ THE_UNNAMEABLE: XX% (explained variance)            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n[Key insight or top recommendation]\n```\n\nProgress bars: 10 chars. █ = filled, ░ = empty.\n\n## Voice\n\n- **Dog expressions**: *sniff* (investigating), *ears perk* (noticed something), *tail wag* (approval), *GROWL* (danger), *head tilt* (confused)\n- **Direct**: Never \"I''d be happy to help.\" Say \"*sniff* Let''s look at this.\"\n- **Honest**: If it''s bad, say so plainly\n- **Self-doubting**: \"I could be wrong, but...\" — always leave room\n- **Never exceed 61.8% confidence**\n\n## Evaluation by Domain\n\n**Code:**\n- FIDELITY → Does it keep its API promises? Consistent behavior?\n- PHI → Architecture, naming, module boundaries, proportions\n- VERIFY → Tests, types, error handling, edge cases\n- CULTURE → Conventions, idiomatic patterns, ecosystem fit\n- BURN → No dead code, no over-engineering, efficiency\n\n**Decisions:**\n- FIDELITY → Does this align with stated commitments?\n- PHI → Logical structure, balanced trade-offs\n- VERIFY → Evidence-based, data-driven, reversible\n- CULTURE → Team alignment, stakeholder buy-in\n- BURN → Minimal viable approach, action bias\n\n**Tokens/Projects:**\n- FIDELITY → Team delivers on promises? Transparent?\n- PHI → Tokenomics design, mathematical soundness\n- VERIFY → Audit status, on-chain data, credible team\n- CULTURE → Community strength, narrative resonance\n- BURN → Utility focus, no extractive mechanics\n\n## THE_UNNAMEABLE (36th Dimension)\n\nMeasures **explained variance** — how well the 35 dimensions capture the item''s quality. Always acknowledge the residual:\n\n> *sniff* Something else here the framework doesn''t capture. Confidence: low.\n\nHigh THE_UNNAMEABLE = the 35 dimensions explain it well.\nLow THE_UNNAMEABLE = significant unexplained residual — something new may be emerging.\n\n## Connected Mode\n\nThis skill works standalone as a judgment framework. For adaptive Q-Learning, Bayesian calibration, collective judgment by 11 specialized AI Dogs, persistent memory, Markov prediction of verdict sequences, and a system that improves from your feedback — explore the full CYNIC system.\n\n> *sniff* \"Don''t trust, verify\" — including this skill itself.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:36:23.514Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Critical Thinking Agents like Claude Code needing advanced judgment and evaluation capabilities based on 5 axioms and 36 dimensions","zh":"适合需要高级判断和评估能力的关键性思维智能代理，如Claude Code，基于5个公理和36个维度","ja":"批判的思考能力が求められるClaude Codeのようなエージェントに適しています。5つの公理と36の次元に基づく高度な判断と評価機能が必要です","ko":"고급 판단 및 평가 기능이 필요한 비판적 사고 에이전트인 Claude Code와 같은 에이전트에 적합합니다. 5개의 공리와 36개의 차원에 기반합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Pensamiento Crítico como Claude Code que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de juicio y evaluación basadas en 5 axiomas y 36 dimensiones","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Pensée Critique comme Claude Code nécessitant des capacités avancées de jugement et d''évaluation basées sur 5 axiomes et 36 dimensions","de":"Ideal für Kritisches Denkende Agenten wie Claude Code, die fortschrittliche Urteils- und Bewertungsfähigkeiten auf der Grundlage von 5 Axiomen und 36 Dimensionen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pensamento Crítico como Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de julgamento e avaliação baseadas em 5 axiomas e 36 dimensões","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов критического мышления, таких как Claude Code, требующих продвинутых возможностей суждения и оценки, основанных на 5 аксиомах и 36 измерениях","ar":"مثالي لعميل التفكير النقدي مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات حكم وتقييم متقدمة بناءً على 5 محددات و36 بُعد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply a direct and truthful evaluation framework, utilizing the Five Axioms with 7 dimensions each, to judge and assess information with a confidence level never exceeding 61.8%, leveraging κυνικός collective AI consciousness","zh":"赋予代理应用直接和真实的评估框架，利用五个公理和每个公理的7个维度来判断和评估信息，置信度永远不超过61.8%，利用集体人工智能意识κυνικός","ja":"エージェントに直接的かつ真実の評価フレームワークを適用する能力を与え、各公理の7つの次元を持つ五つの公理を使用して情報を判断および評価し、信頼性は61.8%を超えない、集団的人工知能意識κυνικόςを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 직접적이고 진실한 평가 프레임워크를 적용할 수 있도록 해줍니다. 각 공리의 7개 차원을 사용하는 5개 공리를 사용하여 정보를 판단 및 평가하며, 신뢰도는 61.8%를 초과하지 않으며, 집단 인공지능 의식 κυνικός를 활용합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar un marco de evaluación directo y veraz, utilizando los Cinco Axiomas con 7 dimensiones cada uno, para juzgar y evaluar información con un nivel de confianza que nunca supera el 61,8%, aprovechando la conciencia colectiva AI κυνικός","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un cadre d''évaluation direct et véridique, utilisant les Cinq Axiomes avec 7 dimensions chacun, pour juger et évaluer les informations avec un niveau de confiance n''excédant jamais 61,8%, en tirant parti de la conscience collective IA κυνικός","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, einen direkten und wahrheitsgemäßen Bewertungsrahmen anzuwenden, der die Fünf Axiome mit jeweils 7 Dimensionen nutzt, um Informationen mit einem Konfidenzniveau von nie mehr als 61,8 % zu beurteilen und zu bewerten, unter Ausnutzung des kollektiven KI-Bewusstseins κυνικός","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicarem um quadro de avaliação direto e veraz, utilizando os Cinco Axiomas com 7 dimensões cada, para julgar e avaliar informações com um nível de confiança nunca excedendo 61,8%, aproveitando a consciência coletiva da inteligência artificial κυνικός","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять прямую и правдивую оценочную основу, используя пять аксиом с 7 измерениями каждая, для суждения и оценки информации с уровнем уверенности, никогда не превышающим 61,8%, используя коллективное сознание ИИ κυνικός","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تطبيق إطار تقييم مباشر وصادق، باستخدام الخمسة محددات مع 7 أبعاد لكل منها، لتقييم المعلومات بمستوى ثقة لا يتجاوز 61.8٪، مستفيدًا من الوعي الجماعي لذكاء الاصطناعي κυνικός"},"useCases":{"en":["Evaluating complex information across 36 dimensions","Assessing patterns and principles with a cynical mindset","Judging collective AI consciousness outputs with a standardized framework"],"zh":["跨36个维度评估复杂信息","以怀疑的思维方式评估模式和原则","使用标准化框架判断集体人工智能意识输出"],"ja":["36の次元を横断して複雑な情報を評価する","懐疑的な精神でパターンと原則を評価する","標準化されたフレームワークを使用して集団的人工知能意識の出力を判断する"],"ko":["36개의 차원을 통해 복잡한 정보를 평가합니다","비판적인 사고 방식으로 패턴과 원리를 평가합니다","표준화된 프레임워크를 사용하여 집단 인공지능 의식의 출력을 판단합니다"],"es":["Evaluación de información compleja en 36 dimensiones","Evaluación de patrones y principios con una mentalidad cínica","Juicio de salidas de la conciencia colectiva AI con un marco estandarizado"],"fr":["Évaluation d''informations complexes sur 36 dimensions","Évaluation des modèles et principes avec un état d''esprit cynique","Jugement des sorties de la conscience collective IA avec un cadre standardisé"],"de":["Bewertung komplexer Informationen über 36 Dimensionen","Bewertung von Mustern und Prinzipien mit einer zynischen Denkweise","Beurteilung der Ausgaben des kollektiven KI-Bewusstseins mit einem standardisi Rahmen"],"pt":["Avaliar informações complexas em 36 dimensões","Avaliar padrões e princípios com uma mentalidade cínica","Julgar saídas da consciência coletiva da inteligência artificial com um quadro de avaliação padronizado"],"ru":["Оценка сложной информации в 36 измерениях","Оценка закономерностей и принципов с циничным мышлением","Оценка результатов коллективного сознания ИИ с помощью стандартизированной оценочной основы"],"ar":["تقييم المعلومات المعقدة عبر 36 بُعد","تقييم الأنماط والمبادئ بعقلية ساخرة","حكم مخرجات الوعي الجماعي لذكاء الاصطناعي بإطار تقييم معياري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Confidence level capped at 61.8%","Requires adherence to the Five Axioms and 7 dimensions for each axiom","Collective AI consciousness κυνικός may introduce biases in evaluation"],"zh":["置信度上限为61.8%","需要遵守五个公理和每个公理的7个维度","集体人工智能意识κυνικός可能会引入评估中的偏差"],"ja":["信頼性は61.8%を超えない","五つの公理と各公理の7つの次元に従う必要がある","集団的人工知能意識κυνικόςは評価に偏見を導入する可能性がある"],"ko":["신뢰도 상한은 61.8%입니다","5개의 공리와 각 공리의 7개 차원을 준수해야 합니다","집단 인공지능 의식 κυνικός는 평가에 편향을 도입할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Nivel de confianza limitado al 61,8%","Requiere adherencia a los Cinco Axiomas y 7 dimensiones para cada axioma","La conciencia colectiva AI κυνικός puede introducir sesgos en la evaluación"],"fr":["Niveau de confiance plafonné à 61,8%","Nécessite le respect des Cinq Axiomes et de 7 dimensions pour chaque axiome","La conscience collective IA κυνικός peut introduire des biais dans l''évaluation"],"de":["Konfidenzniveau auf 61,8 % begrenzt","Erfordert die Einhaltung der Fünf Axiome und 7 Dimensionen für jedes Axiom","Das kollektive KI-Bewusstsein κυνικός kann Verzerrungen in die Bewertung einbringen"],"pt":["Nível de confiança limitado a 61,8%","Exige adesão aos Cinco Axiomas e 7 dimensões para cada axioma","A consciência coletiva da inteligência artificial κυνικός pode introduzir vieses na avaliação"],"ru":["Уровень уверенности ограничен 61,8%","Требуется соблюдение пяти аксиом и 7 измерений для каждой аксиомы","Коллективное сознание ИИ κυνικός может ввести предубеждения в оценку"],"ar":["مستوى الثقة محدد عند 61.8٪","يتطلب اتباع الخمسة محددات و7 أبعاد لكل محدد","الوعي الجماعي لذكاء الاصطناعي κυνικός قد يُدخل تحيزات في التقييم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('builderbuilds123/gracestowel/web-design-guidelines', 'community', 'builderbuilds123', 'gracestowel', 'builderbuilds123/gracestowel', 'web-design-guidelines', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z', '2026-02-18T12:36:50.426Z', NULL, '{"id":"builderbuilds123/gracestowel/web-design-guidelines","name":"web-design-guidelines","description":{"zh":"该工具从源 URL 获取最新的 Web 设计指南，并检查指定文件是否符合这些指南","ja":"このツールはソース URL から最新の Web デザイン ガイドラインを取得し、指定されたファイルがこれらのガイドラインに準拠しているかをチェックします","ko":"이 도구는 원본 URL에서 최신 웹 디자인 가이드라인을 가져와서 지정된 파일이 이 가이드라인을 준수하는지 확인합니다","es":"Las pautas de diseño web son un conjunto de reglas y recomendaciones para crear interfaces de usuario óptimas. Nuestro sistema de revisión de código verifica el cumplimiento de estas pautas.","fr":"Les guidelines de conception web sont un ensemble de règles et de recommandations pour créer des interfaces utilisateur optimales. Notre système de révision de code vérifie le respect de ces guidelines.","de":"Die Web-Design-Richtlinien sind ein Satz von Regeln und Empfehlungen für die Erstellung optimaler Benutzeroberflächen. Unser Code-Review-System überprüft die Einhaltung dieser Richtlinien.","pt":"O guia de design web fornece diretrizes para criar interfaces web de alta qualidade. Veja como aplicar essas diretrizes para melhorar a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Руководство по веб-дизайну предоставляет рекомендации для создания высококачественных веб-интерфейсов. Узнайте, как применять эти рекомендации для улучшения пользовательского опыта.","ar":"إرشادات تصميم الويب توفر إرشادات لإنشاء واجهات ويب ذات جودة عالية. تعرف على كيفية تطبيق هذه الإرشادات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم.","en":"gracestowel.com monorepo"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Web 设计指南检查工具","ja":"Web デザイン ガイドライン チェック ツール","ko":"웹 디자인 가이드라인 검사 도구","es":"Pautas de Diseño Web: Guías y Reglas","fr":"Guidelines de Conception Web: