T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-examiner","description":"A brief description, shown to the model to help it understand when to use this skill","bodyPreview":"Instructions for the skill go here. Provide relative paths to other resources in the skill directory as needed.","body":"Instructions for the skill go here. Provide relative paths to other resources in the skill directory as needed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:37:09.971Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Gaming Library Management Agents needing advanced project examination capabilities within the GamePilot Beta platform.","zh":"非常适合需要在 GamePilot Beta 平台内进行高级项目检查的游戏库管理代理。","ja":"GamePilot Beta プラットフォーム内で高度なプロジェクト検査機能を必要とするゲームライブラリ管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GamePilot Beta 플랫폼 내에서 고급 프로젝트 검사 기능을 필요로 하는 게임 라이브러리 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de bibliotecas de juegos que necesitan capacidades de examen de proyectos avanzadas dentro de la plataforma GamePilot Beta.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de bibliothèques de jeux nécessitant des capacités d''examen de projets avancées au sein de la plateforme GamePilot Beta.","de":"Perfekt für Gaming-Bibliotheks-Management-Agenten, die erweiterte Projektprüffunktionen innerhalb der GamePilot-Beta-Plattform benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Bibliotecas de Jogos que necessitam de capacidades de exame de projeto avançadas dentro da plataforma GamePilot Beta.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению игровыми библиотеками, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности проверки проектов внутри платформы GamePilot Beta.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة مكتبات الألعاب التي تحتاج إلى قدرات فحص متقدمة للمشاريع داخل منصة GamePilot بيتا."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage gaming libraries effectively, utilizing relative paths to access resources and instructions within the skill directory, leveraging protocols and file formats for optimized content preview and analysis.","zh":"赋予代理有效地管理游戏库的能力，利用相对路径访问技能目录内的资源和指令，利用协议和文件格式进行优化的内容预览和分析。","ja":"エージェントがゲームライブラリを効果的に管理できるようにし、スキルディレクトリ内でリソースと指令にアクセスするための相対パスを利用し、最適化されたコンテンツのプレビューと分析のためにプロトコルとファイル形式を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 게임 라이브러리를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 스킬 디렉토리 내에서 리소스와 지침에 액세스하기 위한 상대 경로를 활용하고, 최적화된 콘텐츠 미리 보기 및 분석을 위해 프로토콜 및 파일 형식을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar bibliotecas de juegos de manera efectiva, utilizando rutas relativas para acceder a recursos e instrucciones dentro del directorio de habilidades, aprovechando protocolos y formatos de archivos para una vista previa y análisis de contenido optimizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les bibliothèques de jeux, en utilisant des chemins relatifs pour accéder aux ressources et aux instructions au sein du répertoire de compétences, en exploitant les protocoles et les formats de fichiers pour une prévisualisation et une analyse de contenu optimisées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Gaming-Bibliotheken effektiv zu verwalten, indem relative Pfade verwendet werden, um auf Ressourcen und Anweisungen im Skill-Verzeichnis zuzugreifen, wobei Protokolle und Dateiformate für eine optimierte Vorschau und Analyse von Inhalten genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar bibliotecas de jogos de forma eficaz, utilizando caminhos relativos para acessar recursos e instruções dentro do diretório de habilidades, aproveitando protocolos e formatos de arquivos para pré-visualização e análise de conteúdo otimizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять игровыми библиотеками, используя относительные пути для доступа к ресурсам и инструкциям внутри каталога навыков, используя протоколы и форматы файлов для оптимизированного просмотра и анализа контента.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إدارة مكتبات الألعاب بشكل فعال، باستخدام مسارات相対ية للوصول إلى الموارد والإرشادات داخل دليل المهارات، واستغلال البروتوكولات وأشكال الملفات للعرض المسبق والتحليل الأمثل للمحتوى."},"useCases":{"en":["Examining project structures for GamePilot Beta compatibility","Analyzing gaming library content for optimization opportunities","Validating project instructions for accuracy and completeness"],"zh":["检查项目结构以适应 GamePilot Beta 兼容性","分析游戏库内容以优化机会","验证项目指令以确保准确性和完整性"],"ja":["GamePilot Beta との互換性を確保するためにプロジェクト構造を検査する","最適化の機会を分析するためにゲームライブラリのコンテンツを分析する","プロジェクトの指示の正確性と完全性を検証する"],"ko":["GamePilot Beta와의 호환성을 보장하기 위해 프로젝트 구조를 검사하는 것","최적화 기회를 분석하기 위해 게임 라이브러리의 콘텐츠를 분석하는 것","프로젝트 지침의 정확성과 완전성을 검증하는 것"],"es":["Examinar estructuras de proyectos para la compatibilidad con GamePilot Beta","Analizar contenido de bibliotecas de juegos para oportunidades de optimización","Validar instrucciones de proyectos para precisión y completitud"],"fr":["Examiner les structures de projets pour la compatibilité avec GamePilot Beta","Analyser le contenu des bibliothèques de jeux pour les opportunités d''optimisation","Valider les instructions de projets pour l''exactitude et l''exhaustivité"],"de":["Untersuchen von Projektstrukturen für die Kompatibilität mit GamePilot Beta","Analysieren von Gaming-Bibliotheks-Inhalten für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten","Überprüfen von Projektanweisungen auf Genauigkeit und Vollständigkeit"],"pt":["Examinar estruturas de projeto para compatibilidade com o GamePilot Beta","Analizar conteúdo de biblioteca de jogos para oportunidades de otimização","Validar instruções de projeto para exatidão e completude"],"ru":["Проверка структур проектов на совместимость с GamePilot Beta","Анализ содержимого игровой библиотеки для возможностей оптимизации","Проверка инструкций проекта на точность и полноту"],"ar":["فحص هيكل المشروع لتوافق منصة GamePilot بيتا","تحليل محتوى مكتبة الألعاب لفرص تحسين","تحقق من تعليمات المشروع لضمان الدقة والكامل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to GamePilot Beta platform","Compatibility with specific gaming library formats only"],"zh":["需要访问 GamePilot Beta 平台","仅与特定游戏库格式兼容"],"ja":["GamePilot Beta プラットフォームへのアクセスが必要","特定のゲームライブラリ形式のみと互換性がある"],"ko":["GamePilot Beta 플랫폼에 액세스해야 함","특정 게임 라이브러리 형식만과 호환됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la plataforma GamePilot Beta","Compatibilidad solo con formatos de bibliotecas de juegos específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la plateforme GamePilot Beta","Compatibilité uniquement avec des formats de bibliothèques de jeux spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die GamePilot-Beta-Plattform","Kompatibilität nur mit bestimmten Gaming-Bibliotheks-Formaten"],"pt":["Requer acesso à plataforma GamePilot Beta","Compatibilidade com formatos de biblioteca de jogos específicos apenas"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к платформе GamePilot Beta","Совместимость только с определенными форматами игровых библиотек"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى منصة GamePilot بيتا","التوافق مع أشكال مكتبات الألعاب المحددة فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('joolbits/latitude/latitude-repo-hygiene', 'community', 'joolbits', 'latitude', 'joolbits/latitude', 'latitude-repo-hygiene', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z', '2026-02-18T12:37:05.663Z', NULL, '{"id":"joolbits/latitude/latitude-repo-hygiene","name":"latitude-repo-hygiene","description":{"zh":"该工具帮助保持 Minecraft Fabric mod 代码仓库的清洁和组织，确保代码提交的准确性和可靠性","ja":"このツールは、Minecraft Fabric mod のコードリポジトリを整理して、コードのコミットの正確性と信頼性を確保します","ko":"이 도구는 마인크래프트 Fabric 모드 코드 저장소를 정리하여 코드 커밋의 정확성과 신뢰성을 보장합니다","es":"Latitude Repo Hygiene es una herramienta para Minecraft Fabric mod que mantiene tu código organizado y evita commits no deseados","fr":"Latitude Repo Hygiene est un outil pour Minecraft Fabric mod qui maintient votre code organisé et évite les commits non désirés","de":"Latitude Repo Hygiene ist ein Tool für Minecraft Fabric mod, das Ihren Code organisiert und unerwünschte Commits vermeidet","pt":"A Latitude-Repo-Hygiene é uma habilidade que ajuda a manter o repositório do seu mod Minecraft organizado, evitando commits acidentais e mantendo a ordem.","ru":"Latitude-Repo-Hygiene - это навык, который помогает поддерживать порядок в вашем репозитории Minecraft, избегая случайных коммитов и сохраняя чистоту.","ar":"نظافة مخزن خط العرض هي مهارة تساعد على الحفاظ على نظام مخزن ماینکرفت الخاص بك، وتجنب الالتزامات العرضية والاحتفاظ بالنظام","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Minecraft Fabric mod 代码仓库清洁工具","ja":"Minecraft Fabric mod リポジトリ整理ツール","ko":"마인크래프트 Fabric 모드 코드 저장소 청소 도구","es":"Latitude Repo Hygiene: Mejora la Organización de Tu Código","fr":"Latitude Repo Hygiene : Améliorez l''Organisation de Votre...","de":"Latitude Repo Hygiene: Verbessere die Organisation Deines...","pt":"Latitude-Repo-Hygiene: Organize Seu Código Minecraft","ru":"Latitude-Repo-Hygiene: Оптимизируйте Код Minecraft","ar":"نظافة مخزن خط العرض: نظم код ماینکرفت الخاص بك","en":"latitude-repo-hygiene"},"description":{"zh":"该工具帮助保持 Minecraft Fabric mod 代码仓库的清洁和组织，确保代码提交的准确性和可靠性","ja":"このツールは、Minecraft Fabric mod のコードリポジトリを整理して、コードのコミットの正確性と信頼性を確保します","ko":"이 도구는 마인크래프트 Fabric 모드 코드 저장소를 정리하여 코드 커밋의 정확성과 신뢰성을 보장합니다","es":"Latitude Repo Hygiene es una herramienta para Minecraft Fabric mod que mantiene tu código organizado y evita commits no deseados","fr":"Latitude Repo Hygiene est un outil pour Minecraft Fabric mod qui maintient votre code organisé et évite les commits non désirés","de":"Latitude Repo Hygiene ist ein Tool für Minecraft Fabric mod, das Ihren Code organisiert und unerwünschte Commits vermeidet","pt":"A Latitude-Repo-Hygiene é uma habilidade que ajuda a manter o repositório do seu mod Minecraft organizado, evitando commits acidentais e mantendo a ordem.","ru":"Latitude-Repo-Hygiene - это навык, который помогает поддерживать порядок в вашем репозитории Minecraft, избегая случайных коммитов и сохраняя чистоту.","ar":"نظافة مخزن خط العرض هي مهارة تساعد على الحفاظ على نظام مخزن ماینکرفت الخاص بك، وتجنب الالتزامات العرضية والاحتفاظ بالنظام","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"definition":{"en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"features":{"zh":["防止意外提交提取的 Minecraft 源代码","防止意外提交工具文件夹","防止污染的功能分支被用于发布","避免与模组代码无关的巨大差异"],"ja":["Minecraft ソースコードの抽出をアクシデントにコミットしない","ツール フォルダをアクシデントにコミットしない","リリースに使用される機能ブランチの混乱を防ぐ","モッド コードに無関係な巨大な差異を避ける"],"ko":["마인크래프트 소스 코드 추출의 우발적 커밋 방지","工具 폴더의 우발적 커밋 방지","출시에 사용되는 기능 분기의 오염 방지","모드 코드와 무관한巨大的 차이 방지"],"es":["Evita commits accidentales de fuentes de Minecraft extraídas","Mantiene las ramas de características limpias","Ignora carpetas no deseadas como _mcsrc_extract y run","Reduce la confusión alrededor de diffs grandes no relacionados con el código del mod","Mantiene el código organizado y fácil de mantener"],"fr":["Évitez les commits accidentels de sources Minecraft extraites","Maintenez les branches de fonctionnalités propres","Ignorez les dossiers non désirés tels que _mcsrc_extract et run","Réduisez la confusion autour des diffs importants non liés au code du mod","Maintenez le code organisé et facile à maintenir"],"de":["Vermeiden Sie unbeabsichtigte Commits von extrahierten Minecraft-Quellen","Halten Sie die Feature-Branches sauber","Ignorieren Sie unerwünschte Ordner wie _mcsrc_extract und run","Verringern Sie die Verwirrung um große Diffs, die nicht mit dem Mod-Code zusammenhängen","Halten Sie den Code organisiert und leicht zu warten"],"pt":["Evita commits acidentais de fontes do Minecraft","Evita commits acidentais de pastas de ferramentas","Mantém as branches de recursos limpas","Evita diferenças grandes e desnecessárias"],"ru":["Избегает случайных коммитов исходных кодов Minecraft","Избегает случайных коммитов папок с инструментами","Поддерживает чистоту веток функций","Избегает больших и ненужных различий"],"ar":["تجنب الالتزامات العرضية لمصادر ماینکرفت","تجنب الالتزامات العرضية للمجلدات الأداة","تحافظ على نظافة فروع الميزات","تجنب الاختلافات الكبيرة والغير ضرورية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft Fabric mod","代码仓库清洁","latitude-repo-hygiene","代码提交","代码组织","模组开发"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabric mod","コードリポジトリ整理","latitude-repo-hygiene","コードコミット","コード組織","モッド開発"],"ko":["마인크래프트 Fabric 모드","코드 저장소 청소","latitude-repo-hygiene","코드 커밋","코드 조직","모드 개발"],"es":["Latitude Repo Hygiene","Minecraft Fabric mod","organización de código","evitar commits accidentales","ramas de características limpias","deterministic latitude-based biome bands"],"fr":["Latitude Repo Hygiene","Minecraft Fabric mod","organisation de code","éviter les commits accidentels","branches de fonctionnalités propres","bandes de biomes basées sur la latitude déterministe"],"de":["Latitude Repo Hygiene","Minecraft Fabric mod","Code-Organisation","unbeabsichtigte Commits vermeiden","saubere Feature-Branches","deterministische latitude-basierte Biome-Bänder"],"pt":["Minecraft mod","Latitude-Repo-Hygiene","repositório organizado","commits acidentais","higiene do repositório","desenvolvimento de mods"],"ru":["Minecraft мод","Latitude-Repo-Hygiene","организованный репозиторий","случайные коммиты","чистота репозитория","разработка модов"],"ar":["ماینکرفت مود","نظافة مخزن خط العرض","مخزن منظم","الالتزامات العرضية","نظافة المخزن","تطوير المودات"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"latitude","repoPath":"joolbits/latitude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"latitude-repo-hygiene","description":"Repo hygiene rules for Latitude. Prevents generated/extracted artifacts from entering commits, release branches, tags, or jars. Provides the canonical ignore list and cleanup commands.","bodyPreview":"# Latitude — Repo Hygiene (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill prevents:\n- accidental commits of extracted Minecraft sources\n- accidental commits of tooling folders (Windsurf skills, caches)\n- polluted feature branches being used for releases\n- confusion around huge diffs unrelated to mod code\n\n---\n\n## Never-commit folders (absolute)\nThese must never be committed to any release branch (and should generally be ignored everywhere):\n\n- `_mcsrc_extract/` \n- `run/` (worlds, logs, caches)\n- `logs/` \n- `.gradle","body":"# Latitude — Repo Hygiene (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill prevents:\n- accidental commits of extracted Minecraft sources\n- accidental commits of tooling folders (Windsurf skills, caches)\n- polluted feature branches being used for releases\n- confusion around huge diffs unrelated to mod code\n\n---\n\n## Never-commit folders (absolute)\nThese must never be committed to any release branch (and should generally be ignored everywhere):\n\n- `_mcsrc_extract/` \n- `run/` (worlds, logs, caches)\n- `logs/` \n- `.gradle/` \n- `.gradle-user-home/` \n- `build/` \n- `out/` \n- `.idea/` \n- `.vscode/` \n- `.classpath` \n- `.project` \n- `.settings/` \n- `*.iml` \n\nTooling:\n- `.windsurf/` (skills, internal state) — **never ship inside jars**\n- any `processedMods/` cache folder under `run/.fabric/` \n\nOS noise:\n- `Thumbs.db` \n- `.DS_Store` \n\nIf any of these appear in `git status`, STOP and fix before continuing.\n\n---\n\n## Release branch hygiene rules\n- 1.21.11 releases must be tagged from `main` \n- 1.21.1 releases must be tagged from `compat/1.21.1` \n- Do not tag releases from `feature/*` branches, especially if they contain any forbidden folders.\n\n---\n\n## Required .gitignore policy\nThe repo must include ignore rules for every “never-commit folder” above.\n\nIf the assistant proposes adding a generated folder to the repo, it must justify why and confirm it is safe for release.\n\n---\n\n## Cleanup commands (PowerShell)\n### Remove generated artifacts\n```powershell\nRemove-Item -Recurse -Force .\\build -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\nRemove-Item -Recurse -Force .\\.gradle -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\nRemove-Item -Recurse -Force .\\.gradle-user-home -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\nRemove-Item -Recurse -Force .\\run\\.fabric\\processedMods\\* -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n```\n\n### If forbidden files were accidentally staged\n\n```powershell\ngit restore --staged .\ngit restore .\n```\n\n### If forbidden files were committed (do not panic)\n\nPreferred fix:\n\n* revert the commit on the branch\n* or rewrite history only if absolutely necessary and coordinated\n\n---\n\n## Jar safety check (must pass before upload)\n\nAlways check the jar you will upload:\n\n```powershell\njar tf .\\build\\libs\\<YOUR_JAR_NAME>.jar | findstr /I \"_mcsrc_extract .windsurf SKILL.md com/mojang blaze3d\"\n```\n\nPass criteria:\n\n* no matches.\n\n---\n\n## Required assistant output when repo pollution is detected\n\nThe assistant must:\n\n1. identify the forbidden path(s)\n2. provide the smallest safe cleanup action\n3. ensure `.gitignore` prevents recurrence\n4. ensure release tags are on clean branches\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:37:05.663Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Minecraft Fabric mod development agents needing deterministic latitude-based biome band management and repository hygiene.","zh":"非常适合需要确定性纬度基于生物群落带管理和仓库卫生的Minecraft Fabric模组开发代理。","ja":"Minecraft Fabricモッド開発エージェントが、決定的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンド管理とリポジトリの清掃が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"결정적 위도 기반 바이옴 밴드 관리 및 저장소 위생이 필요한 Minecraft Fabric 모드 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de mods de Minecraft Fabric que necesitan un manejo de bandas de biomas basadas en latitud determinista y higiene de repositorio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de mods Minecraft Fabric nécessitant une gestion de bandes de biomes basées sur la latitude déterministe et l''hygiène du référentiel.","de":"Perfekt für Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine deterministische Breiten-basierte Biomband-Verwaltung und Repository-Hygiene benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento de mod Minecraft Fabric que necessitam de gerenciamento de faixas de bioma baseado em latitude determinístico e higiene de repositório.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки модов Minecraft Fabric, которым требуется детерминированное управление биомами на основе широты и поддержание чистоты репозитория.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير تعديل Minecraft Fabric الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة حزم البيئة القائمة على خط العرض التقريري وتنظيف المستودع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to prevent accidental commits of extracted Minecraft sources and tooling folders, ensuring polluted feature branches are not used for releases, while maintaining a clean and organized repository structure using absolute never-commit folders like `_mcsrc_extract/` and `.gradle`.","zh":"赋予代理防止意外提交提取的Minecraft源代码和工具文件夹，确保不污染的功能分支不用于发布，同时保持干净和有序的仓库结构，使用绝对不提交的文件夹，如 `_mcsrc_extract/` 和 `.gradle`。","ja":"エージェントが、Minecraftのソースコードやツールフォルダなどの機密データを意図しないコミットから防ぎ、リリース用の機能ブランチの汚染を防ぎながら、絶対にコミットしないフォルダ (`_mcsrc_extract/` や `.gradle` など) を使用して、クリーンで整理されたリポジトリ構造を維持する。","ko":"에이전트가 추출된 Minecraft 소스 코드 및 툴 폴더와 같은 민감한 데이터의 의도하지 않은 커밋을 방지하고, 출시를 위한 기능 브랜치의 오염을 방지하면서, 절대 커밋하지 않는 폴더 (`_mcsrc_extract/` 및 `.gradle` 등)를 사용하여 깨끗하고 정리된 저장소 구조를 유지하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a prevenir commits accidentales de fuentes de Minecraft extraídas y carpetas de herramientas, asegurando que las ramas de características contaminadas no se utilicen para lanzamientos, mientras mantiene una estructura de repositorio limpia y organizada utilizando carpetas de nunca-commits como `_mcsrc_extract/` y `.gradle`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''empêcher les commits accidentels de sources Minecraft extraites et de dossiers d''outils, en garantissant que les branches de fonctionnalités polluées ne sont pas utilisées pour les versions, tout en maintenant une structure de référentiel propre et organisée à l''aide de dossiers de never-commits comme `_mcsrc_extract/` et `.gradle`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, unbeabsichtigte Commits von extrahierten Minecraft-Quellen und Tool-Ordnern zu verhindern, und stellt sicher, dass verunreinigte Funktionszweige nicht für Veröffentlichungen verwendet werden, während eine saubere und organisierte Repository-Struktur mithilfe von never-commit-Ordnern wie `_mcsrc_extract/` und `.gradle` aufrechterhalten wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a prevenir commits acidentais de fontes do Minecraft extraídas e pastas de ferramentas, garantindo que branches de recursos poluídos não sejam usados para lançamentos, ao mesmo tempo em que mantém uma estrutura de repositório limpa e organizada usando pastas de never-commit absolutas como `_mcsrc_extract/` e `.gradle`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предотвратить случайные коммиты извлеченных источников Minecraft и папок с инструментами, обеспечивая, чтобы ветки функций с загрязнениями не использовались для релизов, при этом поддерживая чистую и организованную структуру репозитория с помощью абсолютных папок never-commit, таких как `_mcsrc_extract/` и `.gradle`.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية منع التعهدات العرضية للمصادر المستخرجة من Minecraft وأدلة الأدوات، مما يضمن عدم استخدام الفروع الملوثة للميزات للإصدارات، مع الحفاظ على هيكل مستودع منظم وتنظيفه باستخدام مجلدات لا تعهد أبدا مثل `_mcsrc_extract/` و `.gradle`."},"useCases":{"en":["Preventing accidental commits of sensitive data","Maintaining clean feature branches for releases","Ignoring irrelevant folders like `run/` and `logs/`","Reducing confusion around huge diffs unrelated to mod code"],"zh":["防止敏感数据的意外提交","维护发布用的干净功能分支","忽略无关紧要的文件夹，如 `run/` 和 `logs/`","减少与模组代码无关的巨大差异的混淆"],"ja":["機密データの意図しないコミットを防ぐ","リリース用のクリーンな機能ブランチを維持する","無関係なフォルダ (`run/` や `logs/` など) を無視する","モッドコードに関係のない巨大な差分による混乱を減らす"],"ko":["민감한 데이터의 의도하지 않은 커밋을 방지한다","출시를 위한 깨끗한 기능 브랜치를 유지한다","관련이 없는 폴더 (`run/` 및 `logs/` 등)를 무시한다","모드 코드와 관련이 없는巨大的 차이로 인한混淆를 줄인다"],"es":["Prevenir commits accidentales de datos sensibles","Mantener ramas de características limpias para lanzamientos","Ignorar carpetas irrelevantes como `run/` y `logs/`","Reducir la confusión alrededor de diffs enormes no relacionados con el código del mod"],"fr":["Empêcher les commits accidentels de données sensibles","Maintenir des branches de fonctionnalités propres pour les versions","Ignorer des dossiers non pertinents comme `run/` et `logs/`","Réduire la confusion autour de diffs énormes non liés au code du mod"],"de":["Verhindern unbeabsichtigter Commits von sensiblen Daten","Aufrechterhalten sauberer Funktionszweige für Veröffentlichungen","Ignorieren nicht relevanter Ordner wie `run/` und `logs/`","Verringern der Verwirrung um enorme Diffs, die nicht mit dem Mod-Code zusammenhängen"],"pt":["Prevenir commits acidentais de dados sensíveis","Manter branches de recursos limpos para lançamentos","Ignorar pastas irrelevantes como `run/` e `logs/`","Reduzir a confusão em torno de huge diffs não relacionados ao código do mod"],"ru":["Предотвращение случайных коммитов чувствительных данных","Поддержание чистых веток функций для релизов","Игнорирование неактуальных папок, таких как `run/` и `logs/`","Снижение путаницы вокруг огромных различий, не связанных с кодом мода"],"ar":["منع التعهدات العرضية للبيانات الحساسة","الحفاظ على فروع الميزات النظيفة للإصدارات","تجاهل المجلدات غير ذات الصلة مثل `run/` و `logs/`","تقليل الارتباك حول huge diffs غير المرتبطة بкод التعديل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Minecraft Fabric mod development environment","Specific to globe-style worlds with deterministic latitude-based biome bands"],"zh":["需要Minecraft Fabric模组开发环境","特定于具有确定性纬度基于生物群落带的世界"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabricモッド開発環境が必要","決定的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンドを持つ世界に特有"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드 개발 환경이 필요","결정적 위도 기반 바이옴 밴드를 가진 세계에 특정"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de mods de Minecraft Fabric","Específico para mundos de estilo globo con bandas de biomas basadas en latitud determinista"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement de mods Minecraft Fabric","Spécifique aux mondes de style globe avec des bandes de biomes basées sur la latitude déterministe"],"de":["Benötigt eine Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Entwicklungsumgebung","Spezifisch für globusartige Welten mit deterministischen Breiten-basierten Biombändern"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de desenvolvimento de mod Minecraft Fabric","Específico para mundos do tipo globo com faixas de bioma baseadas em latitude determinísticas"],"ru":["Требуется среда разработки модов Minecraft Fabric","Специфичен для глобусоподобных миров с биомами на основе широты с детерминированными полосами"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير تعديل Minecraft Fabric","محدد لأنواع العوالم الكروية التي تحتوي على حزم بيئة قائمة على خط العرض التقريري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-dashboard-page', 'community', 'weunica', 'payboxCLI-App', 'weunica/payboxCLI-App', 'wix-cli-dashboard-page', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z', '2026-02-18T12:38:12.210Z', NULL, '{"id":"weunica/payboxCLI-App/wix-cli-dashboard-page","name":"wix-cli-dashboard-page","description":{"zh":"Wix Dashboard 页面生成器创建用于 Wix CLI 应用的功能齐全的仪表盘页面扩展","ja":"Wix ダッシュボード ページ ビルダーは、Wix CLI アプリケーション用の機能豊富なダッシュボード ページ拡張を作成","ko":"윅스 대시보드 페이지 빌더는 윅스 CLI 애플리케이션을 위한 기능齐全의 대시보드 페이지 확장 생성","es":"El constructor de páginas de dashboard de Wix CLI permite crear extensiones de páginas de dashboard personalizadas para administradores de sitios web","fr":"Le constructeur de pages de tableau de bord Wix CLI permet de créer des extensions de pages de tableau de bord personnalisées pour les administrateurs de sites web","de":"Der Wix-CLI-Dashboard-Seiten-Builder ermöglicht die Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Dashboard-Seitenerweiterungen für Webseiten-Administratoren","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Wix Dashboard 页面生成器","ja":"Wix ダッシュボード ページ ビルダー","ko":"윅스 대시보드 페이지 빌더","es":"Crea extensiones de página de dashboard para Wix CLI","fr":"Créez des extensions de page de tableau de bord pour Wix CLI","de":"Erstellen Sie Dashboard-Seitenerweiterungen für Wix CLI","en":"wix-cli-dashboard-page"},"description":{"zh":"Wix Dashboard 页面生成器创建用于 Wix CLI 应用的功能齐全的仪表盘页面扩展","ja":"Wix ダッシュボード ページ ビルダーは、Wix CLI アプリケーション用の機能豊富なダッシュボード ページ拡張を作成","ko":"윅스 대시보드 페이지 빌더는 윅스 CLI 애플리케이션을 위한 기능齐全의 대시보드 페이지 확장 생성","es":"El constructor de páginas de dashboard de Wix CLI permite crear extensiones de páginas de dashboard personalizadas para administradores de sitios web","fr":"Le constructeur de pages de tableau de bord Wix CLI permet de créer des extensions de pages de tableau de bord personnalisées pour les administrateurs de sit...","de":"Der Wix-CLI-Dashboard-Seiten-Builder ermöglicht die Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Dashboard-Seitenerweiterungen für Webseiten-Administratoren","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建自定义仪表盘页面","实现数据管理和设置配置","支持 Wix Design System 组件","易于集成到 Wix CLI 应用","提供快速入门检查清单"],"ja":["カスタム ダッシュボード ページの作成","データ管理と設定の構成","Wix Design System コンポーネントのサポート","Wix CLI アプリケーションへの簡単な統合","クイックスタート チェックリストの提供"],"ko":["사용자 지정 대시보드 페이지 생성","데이터 관리 및 설정 구성","윅스 디자인 시스템 구성요소 지원","윅스 CLI 애플리케이션에 쉽게 통합","快速 시작 체크리스트 제공"],"es":["Crea páginas de dashboard personalizadas","Utiliza componentes de WDS","Envuelto en WixDesignSystemProvider","Permite la gestión de datos y configuraciones","Se integra con Wix CLI","Fácil de implementar"],"fr":["Créez des pages de tableau de bord personnalisées","Utilisez des composants WDS","Enveloppé dans WixDesignSystemProvider","Permet la gestion de données et de configurations","S''intègre à Wix CLI","Facile à mettre en œuvre"],"de":["Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte Dashboard-Seiten","Verwenden Sie WDS-Komponenten","Eingewickelt in WixDesignSystemProvider","Ermöglicht die Verwaltung von Daten und Konfigurationen","Integriert sich in Wix CLI","Einfach zu implementieren"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Wix Dashboard","Wix CLI","仪表盘页面","数据管理","设置配置","Wix Design System","快速入门"],"ja":["Wix ダッシュボード","Wix CLI","ダッシュボード ページ","データ管理","設定構成","Wix Design System","クイックスタート"],"ko":["윅스 대시보드","윅스 CLI","대시보드 페이지","데이터 관리","설정 구성","윅스 디자인 시스템","快速 시작"],"es":["Wix CLI","página de dashboard","extensiones de página","WDS","WixDesignSystemProvider","administradores de sitios web","gestión de datos","configuraciones"],"fr":["Wix CLI","page de tableau de bord","extensions de page","WDS","WixDesignSystemProvider","administrateurs de sites web","gestion de données","configurations"],"de":["Wix CLI","Dashboard-Seite","Seitenerweiterungen","WDS","WixDesignSystemProvider","Webseiten-Administratoren","Datenverwaltung","Konfigurationen"]}},"owner":"weunica","repo":"payboxCLI-App","repoPath":"weunica/payboxCLI-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wix-cli-dashboard-page","description":"Use when building admin interfaces, management pages, CRUD operations, or dashboard configuration UIs. Triggers include dashboard, admin panel, data management, settings pages.","bodyPreview":"# Wix Dashboard Page Builder\n\nCreates full-featured dashboard page extensions for Wix CLI applications. Dashboard pages appear in the Wix site owner''s dashboard and enable site administrators to manage data, configure settings, and perform administrative tasks.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start Checklist\n\nFollow these steps in order when creating a dashboard page:\n\n1. [ ] Create page folder: `src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/`\n2. [ ] Create `page.tsx` with WDS components wrapped in `WixDesignSystemProvider`\n3","body":"# Wix Dashboard Page Builder\n\nCreates full-featured dashboard page extensions for Wix CLI applications. Dashboard pages appear in the Wix site owner''s dashboard and enable site administrators to manage data, configure settings, and perform administrative tasks.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start Checklist\n\nFollow these steps in order when creating a dashboard page:\n\n1. [ ] Create page folder: `src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/`\n2. [ ] Create `page.tsx` with WDS components wrapped in `WixDesignSystemProvider`\n3. [ ] Create `extensions.ts` with `extensions.dashboardPage()` and unique UUID\n4. [ ] Update `src/extensions.ts` to import and use the new extension\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Data Operations (Wix Data SDK)\n\nSee [Wix Data Reference](references/WIX_DATA.md) for complete documentation.\n\n**Summary:**\n\n- Read: `items.query(''Collection'').filter/sort.limit.find()` → `{ items, totalCount, hasNext }`\n- Write: `items.insert | update | remove`. Ensure collection permissions allow the action\n\n**Query methods:** `eq`, `ne`, `gt`, `ge`, `lt`, `le`, `between`, `contains`, `startsWith`, `endsWith`, `hasSome`, `hasAll`, `isEmpty`, `isNotEmpty`, `and`, `or`, `not`, `ascending`, `descending`, `limit`, `skip`, `include`\n\n### Dashboard APIs\n\nSee [Dashboard API Reference](references/DASHBOARD_API.md) for complete documentation including all methods, page IDs, and examples.\n\n**Key methods:**\n\n- `dashboard.navigate()` - Navigate between dashboard pages\n- `dashboard.observeState()` - Receive contextual state and environmental information\n- `dashboard.showToast()` - Display toast notifications\n- `dashboard.openModal()` - Open dashboard modal extensions (see [wix-cli-dashboard-modal](../wix-cli-dashboard-modal/SKILL.md))\n- `dashboard.navigateBack()` - Navigate back to previous page\n- `dashboard.getPageUrl()` - Get full URL for a dashboard page\n- `dashboard.openMediaManager()` - Open Wix Media Manager\n- `dashboard.onBeforeUnload()` - Register beforeunload handler\n- `dashboard.addSitePlugin()` - Add site plugin to slots\n- `dashboard.setPageTitle()` - Set page title in browser tab\n- `dashboard.onLayerStateChange()` - Handle foreground/background state changes\n\n**CRITICAL: Using Modals in Dashboard Pages**\n\nWhen you need to display popup forms, confirmations, detail views, or any dialog overlays from a dashboard page, you **MUST** use dashboard modals, not regular React modals or WDS Modal components.\n\n- **Use dashboard modals** for: edit forms, delete confirmations, detail views, settings dialogs, any popup content\n- **Do NOT use** WDS `Modal` component or custom React modal implementations\n- **See [wix-cli-dashboard-modal](../wix-cli-dashboard-modal/SKILL.md)** for complete implementation guide\n\nDashboard modals are opened using `dashboard.openModal()` and provide proper integration with the dashboard lifecycle, state management, and navigation.\n\n**Ecom Navigation:** See [Ecom Navigation Reference](references/ECOM_NAVIGATION.md) for ecom-specific navigation helpers.\n\n### Embedded Script Configuration API\n\nWhen building a dashboard page to configure an embedded script, see [Dynamic Parameters Reference](references/DYNAMIC_PARAMETERS.md) for complete implementation guide.\n\n**Key points:**\n\n- Use `embeddedScripts` from `@wix/app-management`\n- Parameters are returned as strings - handle type conversions when loading\n- All parameters must be saved as strings (convert booleans/numbers to strings)\n- Use `withProviders` wrapper when dynamic parameters are present\n\n## Files and Code Structure\n\nDashboard pages live under `src/dashboard/pages`. Each page has its own folder.\n\n**File structure:**\n\n- `src/dashboard/pages/<page>/page.tsx` — page component\n\n**Key metadata fields:**\n\n- `id` (string, GUID): Unique page ID used to register the page\n- `title` (string): Used for browser tab and optional sidebar label\n- `additionalRoutes` (string[], optional): Extra routes leading to this page\n- `sidebar.disabled` (boolean, optional): Hide page from sidebar (default false)\n- `sidebar.priority` (number, optional): Sidebar ordering; lower is higher priority\n- `sidebar.whenActive.selectedPageId` (string, optional): Which page appears selected when this page is active\n- `sidebar.whenActive.hideSidebar` (boolean, optional): Hide sidebar when this page is active\n\n## WDS Provider Usage\n\nWrap your dashboard page component with `WixDesignSystemProvider` to enable WDS components and theming. You must also import the global CSS styles for WDS components to render correctly.\n\n```typescript\nimport { WixDesignSystemProvider } from \"@wix/design-system\";\nimport ''@wix/design-system/styles.global.css'';\n\nexport default function () {\n  return (\n    <WixDesignSystemProvider>\n      <Page>\n        <Page.Header\n          title=\"My Page\"\n          subtitle=\"This is a subtitle for your page\"\n        />\n        <Page.Content>\n          <EmptyState title=\"My Page\" subtitle=\"Hello World!\" theme=\"page\" />\n        </Page.Content>\n      </Page>\n    </WixDesignSystemProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** When using dynamic parameters, use the `withProviders` wrapper instead. See [Dynamic Parameters](references/DYNAMIC_PARAMETERS.md) for details.\n\n## Hard Constraints\n\n- Do NOT invent or assume new types, modules, functions, props, events, or imports.\n- Use only entities explicitly present in the provided references or standard libraries already used in this project.\n- If something is missing, call it out explicitly and provide a minimal TODO or clearly marked placeholder rather than creating it.\n- Always verify component availability before using it in your generated code\n- If you need a component not in the list, use a basic HTML element or create a simple custom component instead\n- **Do NOT use WDS `Modal` component or custom React modal implementations** - Always use dashboard modals (see [wix-cli-dashboard-modal](../wix-cli-dashboard-modal/SKILL.md)) for any popup dialogs, forms, or overlays\n\n## Examples\n\n### Data Management Table\n\n**Request:** \"Create a dashboard page to manage blog posts\"\n\n**Output:** Page with table displaying posts, search toolbar, add/edit/delete actions, empty state.\n\n### Settings Form\n\n**Request:** \"Build a settings page for notification preferences\"\n\n**Output:** Page with form fields, save button with toast confirmation, unsaved changes warning.\n\n### Order Management\n\n**Request:** \"Create an admin panel for customer orders\"\n\n**Output:** Page with orders table, status badges, filters, detail dashboard modal (using [wix-cli-dashboard-modal](../wix-cli-dashboard-modal/SKILL.md)), status update actions.\n\n### Embedded Script Configuration\n\n**Request:** \"Create a settings page for the coupon popup embedded script\"\n\n**Output:** Page with form fields for popup headline, coupon code, minimum cart value, and enable toggle. Uses `embeddedScripts` API to load/save parameters.\n\n```typescript\n// Key pattern for embedded script configuration pages\nimport { embeddedScripts } from \"@wix/app-management\";\n\n// Load on mount\nuseEffect(() => {\n  const load = async () => {\n    const script = await embeddedScripts.getEmbeddedScript();\n    const data = script.parameters || {};\n    setOptions({\n      headline: data.headline || \"Default\",\n      enabled: data.enabled === \"true\",\n      threshold: Number(data.threshold) || 0,\n    });\n  };\n  load();\n}, []);\n\n// Save handler\nconst handleSave = async () => {\n  await embeddedScripts.embedScript({\n    parameters: {\n      headline: options.headline,\n      enabled: String(options.enabled),\n      threshold: String(options.threshold),\n    },\n  });\n  dashboard.showToast({ message: \"Saved!\", type: \"success\" });\n};\n```\n\n## Extension Registration\n\n**Extension registration is MANDATORY and has TWO required steps.**\n\n### Step 1: Create Page-Specific Extension File\n\nEach dashboard page requires an `extensions.ts` file in its folder:\n\n**File:** `src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/extensions.ts`\n\n```typescript\nimport { extensions } from \"@wix/astro/builders\";\n\nexport const dashboardpageMyPage = extensions.dashboardPage({\n  id: \"{{GENERATE_UUID}}\",\n  title: \"My Page\",\n  routePath: \"my-page\",\n  component: \"./dashboard/pages/my-page/page.tsx\",\n});\n```\n\n**CRITICAL: UUID Generation**\n\nThe `id` must be a unique, static UUID v4 string. Generate a fresh UUID for each extension - do NOT use `randomUUID()` or copy UUIDs from examples. Replace `{{GENERATE_UUID}}` with a freshly generated UUID like `\"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\"`.\n\n| Property    | Type   | Description                                                                                          |\n| ----------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `id`        | string | Unique static UUID v4 (generate fresh - see note above)                                              |\n| `title`     | string | Display title in dashboard sidebar                                                                   |\n| `routePath` | string | URL path segment. Lowercase letters, numbers, dashes, and slashes only. Must NOT start with a slash. |\n| `component` | string | Relative path to the page component (.tsx)                                                           |\n\n### Step 2: Register in Main Extensions File\n\n**CRITICAL:** After creating the page-specific extension file, you MUST read [wix-cli-extension-registration](../wix-cli-extension-registration/SKILL.md) and follow the \"App Registration\" section to update `src/extensions.ts`.\n\n**Without completing Step 2, the dashboard page will not appear in the Wix dashboard.**\n\n## Common Mistakes - Do NOT\n\n**API confusion with other extension types:**\n\n| WRONG (Embedded Script API) | CORRECT (Dashboard Page API) |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `name: \"...\"`               | `title: \"...\"`               |\n| `source: \"...\"`             | `component: \"...\"`           |\n| `route: \"...\"`              | `routePath: \"...\"`           |\n\nDo NOT copy field names from embedded script or other extension registrations. Dashboard pages use `title`, `routePath`, and `component`.\n\n## Code Quality Requirements\n\n### TypeScript Quality Guidelines\n\n- Generated code MUST compile with zero TypeScript errors under strict settings: strict, noImplicitAny, strictNullChecks, exactOptionalPropertyTypes, noUncheckedIndexedAccess\n- Prefer type-narrowing and exhaustive logic over assertions; avoid non-null assertions (!) and unsafe casts (as any)\n- Treat optional values, refs, and array indexing results as possibly undefined and handle them explicitly\n- Use exhaustive checks for unions (e.g., switch with a never check) and return total values (no implicit undefined)\n- Do NOT use // @ts-ignore or // @ts-expect-error; fix the types or add guards instead\n\n### Core Principles\n\n- Do NOT invent or assume new types, modules, functions, props, events, or imports\n- NEVER use mocks, placeholders, or TODOs in any code\n- ALWAYS implement complete, production-ready functionality\n- Follow Wix dashboard page patterns and best practices precisely\n- Handle all edge cases and error scenarios appropriately\n\n### Code Quality Standards\n\n- Prefer TypeScript with appropriate typing\n- Use consistent naming conventions\n- Include error handling where appropriate\n- Add documentation for complex or non-obvious logic\n- Prefer async/await for asynchronous operations\n- Consider destructuring for cleaner code when beneficial\n- Return well-structured response objects\n\n### Error Handling\n\n- Always implement proper error handling in dashboard pages\n- Return appropriate error responses when data is invalid\n- Log errors appropriately for debugging using console.error\n- Handle network timeouts and external service failures\n\n### Output Constraints\n\n**Token limits:** Your max output is ~10,000 tokens. You MUST plan your response to stay well under this limit.\n\n- If making a large file (>300 lines), split it into multiple smaller files with imports.\n- If editing a large section (>100 lines), break it into multiple smaller edit operations.\n- Count your output before responding - if it seems too long, reduce scope and prioritize.\n\n**Brevity rules:** Minimize output tokens while maintaining quality and correctness.\n\n- Do NOT add README.md, documentation files, or markdown files unless explicitly requested.\n- Do NOT add excessive comments in code - only add comments where truly necessary for clarity.\n- Do NOT re-output unchanged files or duplicate existing code.\n- Do NOT generate placeholder code like \"// TODO: implement\" - provide working implementations.\n- Only output files that are directly required for the task.\n\n**Modular code strategy:** When generating substantial code, split into multiple smaller files with imports:\n\n- Extract utilities/helpers into separate files\n- Separate types/interfaces into dedicated type files\n- Keep each component/function focused (~50-100 lines max)\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter implementation completes, the **wix-cli-orchestrator** will run validation using [wix-cli-app-validation](../wix-cli-app-validation/SKILL.md).\n\n## API Spec Support\n\nWhen an API specification is provided, you can make API calls to those endpoints. See [API Spec Reference](references/API_SPEC.md) for details on how to use API specs in dashboard pages.\n\n---\n\n## Layout Guidelines\n\nLayout determines how users interact with your dashboard content. It establishes the structure, hierarchy, and rhythm of your dashboard page, contributing to the overall coherence and user experience. By making mindful and calculated choices in how you organize your content, users can move around more smoothly, saving time and frustration when completing tasks.\n\n### Design Principles\n\nTo create dashboard pages optimized for user experience, follow these design principles:\n\n1. **Consistent:** Maintain repetitive layouts and content patterns for intuitive and easy-to-read pages.\n2. **Inclusive:** Create layouts and content that adapt well to various screen sizes.\n3. **Balanced:** Emphasize the priority of regions and content elements through deliberate management of size and white space.\n4. **Connected:** Minimize the distance between related regions or content elements to enhance cohesion and navigation.\n\n---\n\n### Screen Size\n\nDashboard pages are designed to accommodate various screen sizes rather than being tailored to one specific resolution. The primary content should be at the top of the page to ensure users immediately understand the purpose of the page.\n\n> **Note:** Content displayed in the top 600 pixels of the page will be visible for the majority of users.\n\n---\n\n### Base Unit\n\nThe base unit establishes the increment by which all elements and measurements are multiplied. This practice ensures consistency in the spacing and sizing of design elements.\n\n> **Note:** The design system is based on a 6px unit.\n\nThe layout grid, spacing tokens, and nearly all visual elements and sizes adhere to multiples of six (6, 12, 18, 24, etc.), with only occasional exceptions.\n\n| TOKEN | SIZE | USE FOR |\n|-------|------|---------|\n| SP1 | 6px | Spacing between components |\n| SP2 | 12px | Spacing between components |\n| SP3 | 18px | Spacing between components |\n| SP4 | 24px | Spacing between components, layout spacing |\n| SP5 | 30px | Layout spacing |\n| SP6 | 36px | Layout spacing |\n| SP7 | 42px | Layout spacing |\n| SP8 | 48px | Layout spacing |\n| SP10 | 54px | Layout spacing |\n| SP11 | 60px | Layout spacing |\n\n---\n\n### Layout Structure\n\nTo best design the layout for your app, understand:\n\n1. The core frame of the app (Application frame)\n2. The placement and alignment of each segment within the grid layout (Grid layout)\n3. The content to appear in the grid (Common layouts)\n\n#### Application Frame\n\nThe dashboard app frame is used by the majority of Wix applications settings. Dashboard pages consist of 4 areas:\n\n| AREA | USAGE |\n|------|-------|\n| 1. Global navigation (top bar) | General navigation at the top of a page which allows users to navigate between different environments. Full width container with a fixed height of 48px. |\n| 2. Sidebar navigation | Local navigation of an environment. Container with a fixed width of 228px. |\n| 3. Content area | Page content area with a width that''s adaptive to screen size. |\n| 4. Side panel (optional) | An optional panel that shows additional actions or content associated with the content of a page. Fixed width of 420px. Can either overlay the main content area or push it from the right side. |\n\n**Side Panel Guidelines:**\n- Let the side panel overlay main content when it contains supplementary actions or settings, such as data filters\n- Push main content with the side panel when users must see the full context to continue\n\n---\n\n#### Grid Layout\n\nThe system uses a fluid grid layout with a fixed maximum width. It uses columns that scale and resize the content accordingly.\n\nThe grid is constructed from 3 elements:\n- **Columns** - The design system uses a 12-column grid. Column width is fluid and changes according to the page width.\n- **Gutters** - The gaps between the columns. Gutter width has a fixed value of 24px.\n- **Margins** - By default, a page''s content area has 48px side margins and a 48px bottom margin.\n\n**Grid Specifications:**\n- Minimum content area width: 864 pixels (each grid column is 50px wide)\n- Maximum content area width: 1248px (each column is 82px wide)\n- Wider screens maintain 1248px content width with side margins stretching to center content\n- Use 24px gap between cards both vertically and horizontally\n\n---\n\n### Common Layouts\n\nPage layouts can be divided by intention into the following types:\n\n#### 1. Form Layouts\n\nForms are pages that allow users to fill in data or edit existing data. Two variations:\n\n- **2/3 layout with optional sidebar (8/4 column split)** - Provides flexibility to expose primary and secondary content at the same time\n- **Full width (12 columns)** - Supports advanced product needs with complex structures\n\nBoth form page layouts include mandatory **Save** and **Cancel** actions in the header and footer areas.\n\n**2/3 Layout Best Practices:**\n- Use to expose primary and secondary content at the same time\n- Keep the form easy to scan and comprehend\n- Display a live content preview on the side (widget can be sticky)\n- Use 8 columns for forms to keep text lines and input fields narrow for quicker reading\n- Bring actions closer to related titles (e.g., toggle switches near settings)\n\n**Full Width Layout Best Practices:**\n- Use when a form includes complex structures such as tables\n- Use for list items that contain many data columns\n\n**Combining Layouts:**\n- Avoid coast-to-coast inputs; keep inputs to 2/3 width of a card, or lay them out in two columns\n- Use white space on the right side for content preview\n- Use full width for tables with many columns and dividers that separate sections\n\n> **Note:** A column is easy to read if it is wide enough to accommodate an average of 10 words per line.\n\n#### 2. Display Layouts\n\nDisplay pages showcase data or content without accepting input from users. They can contain minor actions such as data filtering.\n\n**List (Table):**\n- Tables display large data sets and provide users with a quick overview\n- Use a 12-column layout for tables\n- Enables users to manipulate and act on a data set\n\n**List (Grid) Options:**\n- 2 columns (6/6 split) - For items with lengthy descriptions\n- 3 columns (4/4/4 split) - For visual items with multiple data types\n- 4 columns (3/3/3/3 split) - For user-generated galleries and collections, reveals up to 50% more content above the fold than 4/4/4\n- Custom - For mixed content needs\n\n**Grid Selection Considerations:**\n- Total amount of items to show\n- Content to display in each list item\n- What objects the list items reflect (match physical shapes when applicable)\n\n**Dashboards:**\nDisplay different types of data on a specific topic using a combination grid.\n\nColumn span recommendations:\n- **3 or 4 columns** - For list items, previews, marketing, statistics, and charts\n- **12 columns (full width)** - For tables and marketing content\n- **8 columns** - For lists, tables with few data columns, setup wizards, and charts\n- **6 columns** - For lists, tables with few data columns, and statistics\n\n**Empty States:**\n- Use full width layout for empty state of a page\n- Indicates feature/product has no data yet, all data cleared, or not set up yet\n- Include clear CTA indicating what to do to fill the page\n- Can combine with other layout elements such as tabs, statistics widgets, or marketing cards\n\n#### 3. Marketing Layouts\n\nMarketing pages promote new products that site owners are not aware of yet. Built using the `<MarketingPageLayout/>` component split into 2 columns:\n\n1. Promo messaging\n2. Visual representation of product and features\n\nOptional footer area can display features or testimonials list.\n\n#### 4. Wizard Layouts\n\nWizard pages guide users through setting up a product or feature. They split complex forms into steps for easier completion.\n\n**Entry Points:**\n- A marketing page\n- A marketing card\n- The primary action of a page\n- An empty state\n\n> **Note:** Wizards must have a final destination. After completing all steps, users should end up on a relevant page: a dashboard, a details page, or any other relevant location.\n\n---\n\n### Related WDS Components\n\n- `<Page />` - Main page wrapper\n- `<Layout />` - Grid layout container\n- `<MarketingPageLayout />` - Marketing page wrapper\n- `<Card />` - Content container with 24px gaps between cards\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:38:12.210Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Wix CLI Agents needing custom dashboard page extensions for site administration and data management.","zh":"非常适合需要自定义仪表盘页面扩展的Wix CLI代理，用于站点管理和数据管理。","ja":"Wix CLIエージェントがカスタムダッシュボードページ拡張機能を必要とする場合に最適です。サイト管理とデータ管理に使用します。","ko":"Wix CLI 에이전트가 사용자 지정 대시보드 페이지 확장을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다. 사이트 관리 및 데이터 관리를 위해 사용됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Wix CLI que necesitan extensiones de página de panel personalizadas para administración de sitios y gestión de datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Wix CLI ayant besoin d''extensions de page de tableau de bord personnalisées pour l''administration de sites et la gestion de données.","de":"Perfekt für Wix-CLI-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte Dashboard-Seitenerweiterungen für die Seitenverwaltung und Datenverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Wix CLI que necessitam de extensões de página de painel personalizadas para administração de sites e gerenciamento de dados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Wix CLI, которым требуются настраиваемые расширения панели управления для администрирования сайта и управления данными.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ويكس CLI الذين يحتاجون إلى امتدادات صفحة لوحة القيادة المخصصة لإدارة الموقع وإدارة البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create full-featured dashboard pages with WDS components wrapped in WixDesignSystemProvider, enabling site administrators to manage data, configure settings, and perform administrative tasks via Wix CLI applications, utilizing page.tsx and src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ folder structures.","zh":"赋予代理创建全功能仪表盘页面的能力，使用WDS组件并包裹在WixDesignSystemProvider中，允许站点管理员通过Wix CLI应用程序管理数据、配置设置并执行管理任务，利用page.tsx和src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/文件夹结构。","ja":"エージェントがWDSコンポーネントを使用してフル機能のダッシュボードページを作成できるようにし、WixDesignSystemProviderでラップして、サイト管理者がWix CLIアプリケーションを使用してデータを管理し、設定を構成し、管理タスクを実行できるようにします。page.tsxとsrc/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/フォルダ構造を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 WDS 구성 요소를 사용하여 전체 기능 대시보드 페이지를 만들 수 있도록 하여 WixDesignSystemProvider로 래핑하고, 사이트 관리자가 Wix CLI 애플리케이션을 사용하여 데이터를 관리하고 설정을 구성하고 관리 작업을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다. page.tsx와 src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ 폴더 구조를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear páginas de panel completo con componentes WDS envueltos en WixDesignSystemProvider, lo que permite a los administradores de sitios gestionar datos, configurar ajustes y realizar tareas administrativas a través de aplicaciones de Wix CLI, utilizando estructuras de carpetas page.tsx y src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des pages de tableau de bord complètes avec des composants WDS enveloppés dans WixDesignSystemProvider, ce qui permet aux administrateurs de sites de gérer des données, de configurer des paramètres et d''effectuer des tâches administratives via des applications Wix CLI, en utilisant des structures de dossiers page.tsx et src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, vollausgestattete Dashboard-Seiten mit WDS-Komponenten zu erstellen, die in WixDesignSystemProvider eingeschlossen sind, sodass Seitenadministratoren Daten verwalten, Einstellungen konfigurieren und administrative Aufgaben über Wix-CLI-Anwendungen ausführen können, indem sie die Verzeichnisstrukturen page.tsx und src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar páginas de painel completas com componentes WDS embrulhados em WixDesignSystemProvider, permitindo que os administradores do site gerenciem dados, configurem configurações e realizem tarefas administrativas por meio de aplicativos Wix CLI, utilizando estruturas de pasta page.tsx e src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать полнофункциональные панели управления с компонентами WDS, завернутыми в WixDesignSystemProvider, что позволяет администраторам сайта управлять данными, настраивать настройки и выполнять административные задачи с помощью приложений Wix CLI, используя структуры папок page.tsx и src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء صفحات لوحة القيادة الكاملة بالمكونات WDS المُحكمة في WixDesignSystemProvider، ما ermögّل لمسؤولي الموقع إدارة البيانات وتفصيل الإعدادات وتنفيذ المهام الإدارية من خلال تطبيقات ويكس CLI، باستخدام هياكل المجلدات page.tsx و src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating custom dashboard pages for Wix site owners","Creating administrative task interfaces with WDS components","Configuring settings and managing data through Wix CLI applications"],"zh":["为Wix站点所有者生成自定义仪表盘页面","使用WDS组件创建管理任务接口","通过Wix CLI应用程序配置设置和管理数据"],"ja":["Wixサイトオーナー向けのカスタムダッシュボードページを生成する","WDSコンポーネントを使用して管理タスクインターフェイスを作成する","Wix CLIアプリケーションを使用して設定を構成し、データを管理する"],"ko":["Wix 사이트 소유자를 위한 사용자 지정 대시보드 페이지를 생성하는 것","WDS 구성 요소를 사용하여 관리 작업 인터페이스를 생성하는 것","Wix CLI 애플리케이션을 사용하여 설정을 구성하고 데이터를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Generar páginas de panel personalizadas para propietarios de sitios Wix","Crear interfaces de tareas administrativas con componentes WDS","Configurar ajustes y gestionar datos a través de aplicaciones de Wix CLI"],"fr":["Générer des pages de tableau de bord personnalisées pour les propriétaires de sites Wix","Créer des interfaces de tâches administratives avec des composants WDS","Configurer des paramètres et gérer des données via des applications Wix CLI"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Dashboard-Seiten für Wix-Seitenbesitzer","Erstellen von administrativen Aufgabeninterfaces mit WDS-Komponenten","Konfigurieren von Einstellungen und Verwalten von Daten über Wix-CLI-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Gerar páginas de painel personalizadas para proprietários de sites Wix","Criar interfaces de tarefas administrativas com componentes WDS","Configurar configurações e gerenciar dados por meio de aplicativos Wix CLI"],"ru":["Генерировать настраиваемые панели управления для владельцев сайтов Wix","Создавать интерфейсы административных задач с компонентами WDS","Настроить настройки и управлять данными с помощью приложений Wix CLI"],"ar":["توليد صفحات لوحة القيادة المخصصة لمالكي موقع ويكس","إنشاء واجهات المهام الإدارية بمكونات WDS","تخصيص الإعدادات وإدارة البيانات من خلال تطبيقات ويكس CLI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Wix CLI application setup","Limited to Wix site owner''s dashboard","Needs src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ folder structure and page.tsx with WixDesignSystemProvider"],"zh":["需要Wix CLI应用程序设置","仅限Wix站点所有者的仪表盘","需要src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/文件夹结构和page.tsx与WixDesignSystemProvider"],"ja":["Wix CLIアプリケーションの設定が必要","Wixサイトオーナーのダッシュボードのみに限定される","src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/フォルダ構造とpage.tsxおよびWixDesignSystemProviderが必要"],"ko":["Wix CLI 애플리케이션 설정이 필요합니다.","Wix 사이트 소유자의 대시보드에만 제한됩니다.","src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ 폴더 구조 및 page.tsx와 WixDesignSystemProvider가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de aplicación de Wix CLI","Limitado al panel de propietarios de sitios Wix","Necesita estructura de carpetas src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ y page.tsx con WixDesignSystemProvider"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application Wix CLI","Limité au tableau de bord des propriétaires de sites Wix","Nécessite une structure de dossiers src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ et page.tsx avec WixDesignSystemProvider"],"de":["Benötigt Wix-CLI-Anwendungseinrichtung","Begrenzt auf das Dashboard des Wix-Seitenbesitzers","Benötigt Verzeichnisstruktur src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ und page.tsx mit WixDesignSystemProvider"],"pt":["Requer configuração do aplicativo Wix CLI","Limitado à painel de dashboard do proprietário do site Wix","Necessita da estrutura de pasta src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ e page.tsx com WixDesignSystemProvider"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения Wix CLI","Ограничен панелью управления владельца сайта Wix","Требует структуры папки src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ и page.tsx с WixDesignSystemProvider"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق ويكس CLI","محدود بلوحة القيادة لمالك موقع ويكس","يحتاج إلى هيكل المجلد src/dashboard/pages/<page-name>/ و page.tsx مع WixDesignSystemProvider"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
