раммного обеспечения","React","Vercel","Композиция компонентов"],"ar":["أنماط التركيبة Vercel","مكونات React مرنة","تجنب الخصائص المنطقية","المكونات المركبة","رفع الحالة","تطوير البرمجيات","React","Vercel","تركيبة المكونات"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-composition-patterns","description":"","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# React Composition Patterns\n\nComposition patterns for building flexible, maintainable React components. Avoid\nboolean prop proliferation by using compound components, lifting state, and\ncomposing internals. These patterns make codebases easier for both humans and AI\nagents to work with as they scale.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Refactoring components with many boolean props\n- Building reusable component libraries\n- Designing flexible component APIs\n- Reviewing compone","body":"# React Composition Patterns\n\nComposition patterns for building flexible, maintainable React components. Avoid\nboolean prop proliferation by using compound components, lifting state, and\ncomposing internals. These patterns make codebases easier for both humans and AI\nagents to work with as they scale.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Refactoring components with many boolean props\n- Building reusable component libraries\n- Designing flexible component APIs\n- Reviewing component architecture\n- Working with compound components or context providers\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                | Impact | Prefix          |\n| -------- | ----------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| 1        | Component Architecture  | HIGH   | `architecture-` |\n| 2        | State Management        | MEDIUM | `state-`        |\n| 3        | Implementation Patterns | MEDIUM | `patterns-`     |\n| 4        | React 19 APIs           | MEDIUM | `react19-`      |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Component Architecture (HIGH)\n\n- `architecture-avoid-boolean-props` - Don''t add boolean props to customize\n  behavior; use composition\n- `architecture-compound-components` - Structure complex components with shared\n  context\n\n### 2. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `state-decouple-implementation` - Provider is the only place that knows how\n  state is managed\n- `state-context-interface` - Define generic interface with state, actions, meta\n  for dependency injection\n- `state-lift-state` - Move state into provider components for sibling access\n\n### 3. Implementation Patterns (MEDIUM)\n\n- `patterns-explicit-variants` - Create explicit variant components instead of\n  boolean modes\n- `patterns-children-over-render-props` - Use children for composition instead\n  of renderX props\n\n### 4. React 19 APIs (MEDIUM)\n\n> **⚠️ React 19+ only.** Skip this section if using React 18 or earlier.\n\n- `react19-no-forwardref` - Don''t use `forwardRef`; use `use()` instead of `useContext()`\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/architecture-avoid-boolean-props.md\nrules/state-context-interface.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:37:51.920Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to refactor complex React components with boolean prop proliferation","zh":"非常适合需要重构具有布尔属性泛滥的复杂React组件的前端代理","ja":"複雑なReactコンポーネントのブール値のプロパティの乱立を再構成する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"복잡한 리액트 컴포넌트의 불리언 속성 증식을 재구성해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 최적","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan refactorizar componentes React complejos con proliferación de propiedades booleanas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de réorganiser des composants React complexes avec une prolifération de propriétés booléennes","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die komplexe React-Komponenten mit boolean Propagation neu strukturieren müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam reestruturar componentes React complexos com proliferação de propriedades booleanas","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо рефакторить сложные компоненты React с распространением булевых свойств","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى إعادة هيكلة مكونات React المعقدة مع انتشار الخصائص المنطقية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compose internals, lift state, and utilize compound components for flexible and maintainable React components, streamlining codebases with scalable composition patterns and APIs","zh":"赋予代理内部组成、状态提升和利用复合组件以实现灵活和可维护的React组件的能力，通过可扩展的组合模式和API简化代码库","ja":"内部の構成、状態の持ち上げ、複合コンポーネントの利用などにより、柔軟でメンテナンス可能なReactコンポーネントを構成でき、コードベースをスケーラブルな構成パターンやAPIで簡素化できる","ko":"내부 구조, 상태 올리기, 복합 컴포넌트 활용 등을 통해 유연하고 유지 보수 가능한 리액트 컴포넌트를 구성할 수 있으며, 확장 가능한 구성 패턴과 API로 코드베이스를 간소화할 수 있음","es":"Habilita a los agentes a componer internos, elevar el estado y utilizar componentes compuestos para componentes de React flexibles y mantenibles, racionalizando las bases de código con patrones de composición escalables y APIs","fr":"Permet aux agents de composer les internes, de soulever l''état et d''utiliser des composants composés pour des composants React flexibles et maintenables, rationalisant les bases de code avec des modèles de composition évolutifs et des API","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Interna zu komponieren, den Zustand anzuheben und zusammengesetzte Komponenten für flexible und wartbare React-Komponenten zu nutzen, Codebasen mit skalierbaren KompositionsMustern und APIs zu rationalisieren","pt":"Permite que os agentes componham internos, levantem o estado e utilizem componentes compostos para componentes React flexíveis e mantenedores, racionalizando os repositórios de código com padrões de composição escaláveis e APIs","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью составлять внутренние компоненты, поднимать состояние и использовать составные компоненты для гибких и поддерживаемых компонентов React, оптимизируя кодовые базы с помощью масштабируемых шаблонов композиции и API","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تكوين الداخلي، رفع الحالة، واستخدام المكونات المركبة لتحقيق مكونات React مرنة وقابلة للصيانة، وتبسيط قواعد البيانات باستخدام أنماط التركيب القابلة للتطوير وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات"},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring components with multiple boolean props","Building reusable React component libraries","Designing flexible component APIs for large-scale applications"],"zh":["重构具有多个布尔属性的组件","构建可重用的React组件库","为大规模应用程序设计灵活的组件API"],"ja":["複数のブール値属性を持つコンポーネントのリファクタリング","再利用可能なReactコンポーネントライブラリの構築","大規模アプリケーション向けの柔軟なコンポーネントAPIの設計"],"ko":["여러개의 불리언 속성을 갖는 컴포넌트의 리팩토링","재사용 가능한 리액트 컴포넌트 라이브러리의 구축","대규모 애플리케이션을 위한 유연한 컴포넌트 API의 설계"],"es":["Reorganizar componentes con varias propiedades booleanas","Crear bibliotecas de componentes React reutilizables","Diseñar APIs de componentes flexibles para aplicaciones a gran escala"],"fr":["Réorganiser des composants avec plusieurs propriétés booléennes","Créer des bibliothèques de composants React réutilisables","Concevoir des API de composants flexibles pour des applications à grande échelle"],"de":["Komponenten mit mehreren boolean Eigenschaften neu strukturieren","Wiederverwendbare React-Komponentenbibliotheken erstellen","Flexible Komponenten-APIs für große Anwendungen entwerfen"],"pt":["Reestruturação de componentes com várias propriedades booleanas","Construção de bibliotecas de componentes React reutilizáveis","Projeto de APIs de componentes flexíveis para aplicações em larga escala"],"ru":["Рефакторинг компонентов с несколькими булевыми свойствами","Создание библиотек переиспользуемых компонентов React","Проектирование гибких API компонентов для крупномасштабных приложений"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة المكونات مع خصائص منطقية متعددة","بناء مكتبات مكونات React قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تصميم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات مرنة للمكونات لتطبيقات واسعة النطاق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and JavaScript","Limited to React-based applications"],"zh":["需要React和JavaScript的知识","仅限于基于React的应用程序"],"ja":["ReactとJavaScriptの知識が必要","Reactベースのアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["리액트와 자바스크립트에 대한 지식이 필요","리액트 기반의 애플리케이션에 한정"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y JavaScript","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en React"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et JavaScript","Limité aux applications basées sur React"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und JavaScript","Begrenzt auf React-basierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e JavaScript","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em React"],"ru":["Требует знания React и JavaScript","Ограничен для приложений на основе React"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و JavaScript","محدود للتطبيقات المستندة إلى React"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pliniou/loto-generator/skill-android-loto-orchestrator', 'community', 'pliniou', 'loto-generator', 'pliniou/loto-generator', 'skill-android-loto-orchestrator', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z', '2026-02-18T12:38:12.038Z', NULL, '{"id":"pliniou/loto-generator/skill-android-loto-orchestrator","name":"skill-android-loto-orchestrator","description":{"zh":"Android Loto Orchestrator 是一种架构模式，帮助开发者优化应用的可扩展性、测试性和性能","ja":"Android Loto Orchestrator は、アーキテクチャパターンであり、開発者が应用の拡張性、テスト性、パフォーマンスを最適化するのに役立ちます","ko":"Android Loto Orchestrator 는 애플리케이션의 확장성, 테스트성 및 성능을 최적화하는 아키텍처 패턴입니다","es":"El orquestador de arquitectura Android ayuda a mantener aplicaciones escalables, testables y rápidas","fr":"L''orchestrateur d''architecture Android aide à maintenir des applications évolutives, testables et rapides","de":"Der Android-Architektur-Orchestrierer hilft, Anwendungen skalierbar, testbar und schnell zu halten","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Android Loto 架构优化","ja":"Android Loto アーキテクチャ最適化","ko":"Android Loto 아키텍처 최적화","es":"Orquestador de Arquitectura Android","fr":"Orchestrateur d''Architecture Android","de":"Android-Architektur-Orchestrierer","en":"skill-android-loto-orchestrator"},"description":{"zh":"Android Loto Orchestrator 是一种架构模式，帮助开发者优化应用的可扩展性、测试性和性能","ja":"Android Loto Orchestrator は、アーキテクチャパターンであり、開発者が应用の拡張性、テスト性、パフォーマンスを最適化するのに役立ちます","ko":"Android Loto Orchestrator 는 애플리케이션의 확장성, 테스트성 및 성능을 최적화하는 아키텍처 패턴입니다","es":"El orquestador de arquitectura Android ayuda a mantener aplicaciones escalables, testables y rápidas","fr":"L''orchestrateur d''architecture Android aide à maintenir des applications évolutives, testables et rapides","de":"Der Android-Architektur-Orchestrierer hilft, Anwendungen skalierbar, testbar und schnell zu halten","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["保持 Domain 层的纯 Kotlin 代码","依赖注入和流向 Domain 层","集中业务逻辑于 Domain 层","离线优先的 UI 设计","避免阻塞主线程的 I/O 操作"],"ja":["Domain 層の純 Kotlin コードを維持する","依存関係の注入と Domain 層への流れ","ビジネスロジックを Domain 層に集中する","オフライン優先の UI 設計","メインスレッドをブロックする I/O 操作を避ける"],"ko":["Domain 계층에 대한純 Kotlin 코드 유지","의존성 주입 및 Domain 계층으로의 흐름","비즈니스 로직을 Domain 계층에 집중","오프라인 우선의 UI 설계","메인 스레드를 차단하는 I/O 작업 피하기"],"es":["Mantiene el dominio puro en Kotlin","Dependencias fluídas hacia el dominio","Centraliza reglas de negocio en casos de uso","GUI offline-first con actualización en background","No bloquea el hilo principal con I/O"],"fr":["Maintient le domaine pur en Kotlin","Dépendances fluides vers le domaine","Centralise les règles métier dans les cas d''utilisation","GUI offline-first avec mise à jour en arrière-plan","Ne bloque pas le thread principal avec I/O"],"de":["Hält das Domän-Modell rein in Kotlin","Abhängigkeiten fließen in das Domän-Modell","Zentralisiert Geschäftsregeln in Use-Cases","GUI offline-first mit Hintergrund-Aktualisierung","Blockiert nicht den Haupt-Thread mit I/O"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Android 架构","应用性能优化","可扩展性设计","测试驱动开发","Domain 驱动设计","Kotlin 开发"],"ja":["Android アーキテクチャ","应用パフォーマンス最適化","拡張性設計","テスト駆動開発","Domain ドリブンデザイン","Kotlin 開発"],"ko":["Android 아키텍처","애플리케이션 성능 최적화","확장성 설계","테스트 주도 개발","Domain 주도 설계","Kotlin 개발"],"es":["arquitectura android","diseño de aplicaciones","escalabilidad","testabilidad","rendimiento","kotlin","dominio puro"],"fr":["architecture android","conception d''applications","évolvabilité","testabilité","performances","kotlin","domaine pur"],"de":["android-architektur","anwendungsdesign","skalierbarkeit","testbarkeit","leistung","kotlin","reines domän-modell"]}},"owner":"pliniou","repo":"loto-generator","repoPath":"pliniou/loto-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-android-loto-orchestrator","description":"Orquestra desenvolvimento Android para o Loto Generator com Clean Architecture, domínio em Kotlin puro, dados offline-first (Room + WorkManager + Retrofit), UI em Jetpack Compose Material 3 e guardrails de performance. Use quando precisar projetar, revisar ou implementar features end-to-end envolvendo contratos entre camadas, sync resiliente, regras de negócio, estado de tela e otimizações de execução.","bodyPreview":"# Skill Android Loto Orchestrator\n\nAlinhar decisões entre arquitetura, domínio, dados, UI e performance para manter o app escalável, testável e rápido.\n\n## Definir Regras Inegociáveis\n\n- Manter `domain` puro Kotlin, sem dependência de Android/framework.\n- Fazer dependências fluírem para dentro: `ui -> domain <- data(impl)`.\n- Centralizar regras de negócio em use cases/entidades do domínio.\n- Guiar UI por dados locais (`offline-first`) e atualizar em background.\n- Não bloquear main thread com I/O","body":"# Skill Android Loto Orchestrator\n\nAlinhar decisões entre arquitetura, domínio, dados, UI e performance para manter o app escalável, testável e rápido.\n\n## Definir Regras Inegociáveis\n\n- Manter `domain` puro Kotlin, sem dependência de Android/framework.\n- Fazer dependências fluírem para dentro: `ui -> domain <- data(impl)`.\n- Centralizar regras de negócio em use cases/entidades do domínio.\n- Guiar UI por dados locais (`offline-first`) e atualizar em background.\n- Não bloquear main thread com I/O, parsing, sync ou cálculos pesados.\n\n## Planejar Feature End-to-End\n\nPara cada feature, produzir este recorte mínimo antes de codar:\n\n1. Caso de uso e regras de negócio (domain).\n2. Contrato de repositório (interface no domain).\n3. Estratégia de persistência/sync (data).\n4. Estado e eventos de tela (ui/viewmodel).\n5. Riscos de performance e testes de regressão.\n\n## Arquitetar Camadas\n\n- Definir pastas/módulos por `ui`, `domain`, `data` (ou por feature mantendo essas fronteiras).\n- Criar interfaces de repositório no domínio; implementar no data.\n- Proibir lógica de negócio em composables, activities/fragments e DAOs.\n- Expor modelos de resultado explícitos (`Result` ou sealed classes) para sucesso/erro.\n\n## Aplicar Injeção de Dependência (Hilt)\n\n- Usar `@HiltAndroidApp` na aplicação.\n- Fornecer implementações via módulos Hilt por camada.\n- Usar escopos corretos no grafo:\n- `@Singleton` para DB, API, repositórios singleton.\n- `@ViewModelScoped`/`@ActivityRetainedScoped` para dependências de estado de tela.\n- Validar grafo DI para garantir que UI não acesse detalhes de infra diretamente.\n\n## Implementar Offline-First\n\n- Ler sempre do Room primeiro e observar por `Flow`.\n- Executar sync silencioso com WorkManager quando houver conectividade.\n- Aplicar stale-while-revalidate: cache imediato, refresh em background.\n- Mapear `DTO -> entidade/data -> modelo de domínio` antes de expor dados.\n- Tratar migração legada (`lottery_data.json`) no startup para Room e remover fonte antiga.\n- Versionar schema de assets e manter parser com fallback controlado.\n- Registrar staleness por modalidade e sinalizar dado desatualizado sem quebrar fluxo.\n\n## Implementar UI Compose\n\n- Construir telas com Compose + Material 3, sem hardcode de cor/tipografia.\n- Modelar `UiState` explícito: `Loading`, `Content`, `Empty`, `Error`.\n- Aplicar unidirectional data flow: UI renderiza estado e dispara eventos.\n- Fazer state hoisting; manter composables preferencialmente stateless.\n- Tratar acessibilidade (content descriptions, touch target >= 48dp, contraste).\n- Usar navegação com contratos claros de argumentos.\n\n## Proteger Performance\n\n- Definir metas: startup, frame time/jank, memória, bateria, rede.\n- Evitar recomposição ampla: estados granulares, chaves estáveis em listas.\n- Usar lazy layouts e paginação para grandes coleções.\n- Garantir I/O e sync fora da main thread.\n- Medir com profiling/macrobenchmark e corrigir gargalos antes de release.\n- Manter release otimizado com R8 e recursos enxutos.\n\n## Validar Qualidade\n\nAntes de concluir qualquer feature, validar:\n\n1. Regras de negócio cobertas por testes unitários de domínio.\n2. Repositórios com cenários offline/online, erro e retry.\n3. ViewModel com testes de estado/evento.\n4. UI cobrindo estados principais e acessibilidade básica.\n5. Sem quebra de fronteiras arquiteturais.\n\n## Critérios de Conclusão\n\nConsiderar a entrega pronta somente quando:\n\n- A feature funciona sem rede com dados locais existentes.\n- Sync posterior atualiza dados e notifica UI via `Flow`.\n- Não há lógica de negócio fora do domínio.\n- Não há operação pesada na thread principal.\n- Testes críticos passam e riscos remanescentes estão documentados.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:38:12.038Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Android Architecture Agents specializing in clean architecture enforcement and performance optimization.","zh":"适合专注于清洁架构强制执行和性能优化的Android架构代理。","ja":"Androidアーキテクチャエージェントがクリーンアーキテクチャの施行とパフォーマンス最適化に特化するための理想的なエージェントです。","ko":"클린 아키텍처 적용 및 성능 최적화를 전문으로 하는 안드로이드 아키텍처 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitectura de Android especializados en la aplicación de arquitectura limpia y optimización del rendimiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Architecture Android spécialisés dans l''application de l''architecture propre et l''optimisation des performances.","de":"Ideal für Android-Architektur-Agenten, die auf saubere Architektur-Durchsetzung und Leistungsoptimierung spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitetura Android especializados em aplicação de arquitetura limpa e otimização de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально для агентов архитектуры Android, специализирующихся на обеспечении чистой архитектуры и оптимизации производительности.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء عمارة الأندرويد الذين ي专ون في تنفيذ العمارة النظيفة و تحسين الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to enforce unidirectional dependency flow (ui -> domain <- data), maintain pure Kotlin domain layers free from Android framework dependencies, and implement offline-first strategies with background synchronization while preventing main thread I/O blocking.","zh":"使代理能够施行单向依赖流（ui -> 域 <- 数据），保持纯Kotlin域层免受Android框架依赖，并实施离线优先策略，同时防止主线程I/O阻塞。","ja":"エージェントが単方向の依存関係フロー（ui -> ドメイン <- データ）を施行し、純粋なKotlinドメインレイヤーをAndroidフレームワークの依存関係から解放し、バックグラウンド同期を使用してオフライン優先戦略を実装し、メインスレッドのI/Oブロックを防止することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 단방향 의존성 흐름을 적용하고, 안드로이드 프레임워크 종속성을 제거한 순수한 Kotlin 도메인 계층을 유지하며, 백그라운드 동기화를 사용하여 오프라인 우선 전략을 구현하고, 메인 스레드 I/O 차단을 방지할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes hacer cumplir el flujo de dependencia unidireccional (ui -> dominio <- datos), mantener capas de dominio de Kotlin puro libres de dependencias del marco de Android y implementar estrategias de primera instancia sin conexión con sincronización en segundo plano mientras se evita el bloqueo de E/S en el subproceso principal.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un flux de dépendance unidirectionnel (ui -> domaine <- données), de maintenir des couches de domaine Kotlin pures exemptes de dépendances du framework Android et de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de synchronisation de données en mode déconnecté avec synchronisation en arrière-plan tout en empêchant le blocage d''E/S sur le thread principal.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den unidirektionalen Abhängigkeitsfluss (ui -> Domäne <- Daten) durchzusetzen, reine Kotlin-Domänen-Schichten frei von Android-Framework-Abhängigkeiten zu erhalten und Offline-First-Strategien mit Hintergrundsynchronisation umzusetzen, während das Blockieren von E/A-Vorgängen im Hauptthread verhindert wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes apliquem o fluxo de dependência unidirecional (ui -> domínio <- dados), mantenham camadas de domínio Kotlin puras livres de dependências do framework Android e implementem estratégias de primeiro offline com sincronização em segundo plano, enquanto evitam a blocagem de E/S na thread principal.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обеспечивать односторонний поток зависимостей (ui -> домен <- данные), поддерживать чистые слои домена на Kotlin, свободные от зависимостей фреймворка Android, и реализовывать стратегии offline-first с фоновой синхронизацией, предотвращая блокировку операций ввода/вывода в основной поток.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتطبيق تدفق التبعية أحادي الاتجاه (واجهة المستخدم -> المجال <- البيانات) ، والحفاظ على طبقات المجال Kotlin النقية خالية من التبعيات الإطار الأندرويد ، وتنفيذ استراتيجيات أولاً بدون اتصال مع التزامن الخلفي ، في حين منع حظر الإدخال / الإخراج في الخيط الرئيسي."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing clean architecture dependency rules","Implementing offline-first data synchronization strategies","Optimizing main thread performance by preventing I/O operations","Centralizing business rules in pure Kotlin use cases"],"zh":["执行清洁架构依赖规则","实施离线优先数据同步策略","通过防止I/O操作优化主线程性能","在纯Kotlin用例中集中业务规则"],"ja":["クリーンアーキテクチャの依存関係ルールを実施する","オフライン優先のデータ同期戦略を実装する","I/O操作を防止してメインスレッドのパフォーマンスを最適化する","純粋なKotlinのユースケースでビジネスルールを集中化する"],"ko":["클린 아키텍처 의존성 규칙을 적용하는 것","오프라인 우선 데이터 동기화 전략을 구현하는 것","I/O 작업을 방지하여 메인 스레드 성능을 최적화하는 것","순수한 Kotlin 유즈 케이스에서 비즈니스 규칙을 집중하는 것"],"es":["Aplicar reglas de dependencia de arquitectura limpia","Implementar estrategias de sincronización de datos de primera instancia sin conexión","Optimizar el rendimiento del subproceso principal evitando operaciones de E/S","Centralizar reglas de negocio en casos de uso de Kotlin puro"],"fr":["Appliquer des règles de dépendance d''architecture propre","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de synchronisation de données en mode déconnecté","Optimiser les performances du thread principal en évitant les opérations d''E/S","Centraliser les règles métier dans des cas d''utilisation de Kotlin pur"],"de":["Regeln für saubere Architektur-Abhängigkeiten durchsetzen","Strategien für Offline-First-Datensynchronisation umsetzen","Hauptthread-Leistung optimieren, indem E/A-Vorgänge verhindert werden","Geschäftsregeln in reinen Kotlin-Use-Cases zentralisieren"],"pt":["Aplicação de regras de dependência de arquitetura limpa","Implementação de estratégias de sincronização de dados de primeiro offline","Otimização do desempenho da thread principal prevenindo operações de E/S","Centralização de regras de negócios em casos de uso Kotlin puro"],"ru":["Применение правил чистой архитектуры","Реализация стратегий offline-first для синхронизации данных","Оптимизация производительности основного потока путем предотвращения операций ввода/вывода","Централизация бизнес-правил в чистых случаях использования на Kotlin"],"ar":["تطبيق قواعد العمارة النظيفة","تنفيذ استراتيجيات بدون اتصال أولاً للتنسيق البيانات","تحسين أداء الخيط الرئيسي من خلال منع عمليات الإدخال / الإخراج","تجميع قواعد العمل في حالات استخدام Kotlin النقية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Android-specific architecture patterns only","Requires Kotlin-based domain layer implementation","Focuses exclusively on mobile app scalability patterns"],"zh":["仅适用于Android特定架构模式","需要基于Kotlin的域层实现","仅专注于移动应用可扩展性模式"],"ja":["Android固有のアーキテクチャパターンにのみ対応","Kotlinベースのドメインレイヤー実装が必要","モバイルアプリのスケーラビリティパターンにのみ焦点を当てている"],"ko":["안드로이드 고유의 아키텍처 패턴만 해당","Kotlin 기반의 도메인 계층 구현이 필요","모바일 앱의 확장성 패턴에만 중점을 두고 있음"],"es":["Patrones de arquitectura específicos de Android solamente","Requiere implementación de capa de dominio basada en Kotlin","Se centra exclusivamente en patrones de escalabilidad de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Modèles d''architecture spécifiques à Android uniquement","Nécessite une implémentation de couche de domaine basée sur Kotlin","Se concentre exclusivement sur les modèles de scalabilité des applications mobiles"],"de":["Nur Android-spezifische Architekturmuster","Benötigt eine auf Kotlin basierende Domänen-Schicht-Implementierung","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf Skalierbarkeitsmuster für Mobile Apps"],"pt":["Padrões de arquitetura específicos do Android apenas","Requer implementação de camada de domínio baseada em Kotlin","Concentra-se exclusivamente em padrões de escalabilidade de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Только паттерны архитектуры, специфичные для Android","Требуется реализация слоя домена на основе Kotlin","Сосредоточен исключительно на паттернах масштабирования мобильных приложений"],"ar":["نماذج عمارة محددة للأندرويد فقط","يتطلب تنفيذ طبقة المجال على أساس Kotlin","يركز حصريا على أنماط قابلية التوسع لتطبيقات الجوال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2/openspec-apply-change', 'community', 'gAmUssA', 'vscode-open-in-marked2', 'gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2', 'openspec-apply-change', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z', '2026-02-18T12:37:53.955Z', NULL, '{"id":"gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2/openspec-apply-change","name":"openspec-apply-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-apply-change 是一个 VS Code 扩展，用于打开 Markdown 和 AsciiDoc 文件，并实现 OpenSpec 更改","ja":"openspec-apply-change は、Markdown および AsciiDoc ファイルを開き、OpenSpec の変更を実行する VS Code 拡張です","ko":"openspec-apply-change는 Markdown 및 AsciiDoc 파일을 열고 OpenSpec 변경 사항을 구현하는 VS Code 확장입니다","es":"La extensión openspec-apply-change para VS Code permite implementar tareas desde un cambio de OpenSpec de manera eficiente.","fr":"L''extension openspec-apply-change pour VS Code permet d''implémenter des tâches à partir d''un changement OpenSpec de manière efficace.","de":"Die Erweiterung openspec-apply-change für VS Code ermöglicht die effiziente Implementierung von Aufgaben aus einer OpenSpec-Änderung.","pt":"A extensão Openspec Apply Change para VS Code permite abrir arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc em Marked 2, melhorando a produtividade dos desenvolvedores.","ru":"Расширение Openspec Apply Change для VS Code позволяет открывать файлы Markdown и AsciiDoc в Marked 2, улучшая производительность разработчиков.","ar":"يمكّن توسيع openspec apply change لملفات(vs code) 开发者 من تحرير ملفات ماركد و أSCIIDOC بفعالية","en":"VS Code extension to open Markdown and AsciiDoc files in Marked 2"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-apply-change VS Code 扩展","ja":"openspec-apply-change VS Code 拡張","ko":"openspec-apply-change VS Code 확장","es":"Aplicar cambios con openspec-apply-change en VS Code","fr":"Appliquer des modifications avec openspec-apply-change su...","de":"Änderungen mit openspec-apply-change in VS Code anw