":["Implémentation de tâches à partir d''un changement OpenSpec","Compatibilité avec Markdown et AsciiDoc","Sélection automatique des changements","Prise en charge pour déduire les changements du contexte de conversation"],"de":["Implementierung von Aufgaben aus einer OpenSpec-Änderung","Kompatibilität mit Markdown und AsciiDoc","Automatische Auswahl von Änderungen","Unterstützung für die Ableitung von Änderungen aus dem Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Abre arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc em Marked 2","Melhora a produtividade dos desenvolvedores","Permite a edição de arquivos com Marked 2","Facilita a implementação de tarefas do OpenSpec","Fornece uma interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Открывает файлы Markdown и AsciiDoc в Marked 2","Улучшает производительность разработчиков","Позволяет редактировать файлы с Marked 2","Облегчает реализацию задач OpenSpec","Предоставляет интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["يفتح ملفات ماركد و أSCIIDOC في ماركد 2","يحسن إنتاجية المطورين","يسمح بتحرير الملفات مع ماركد 2","يسهل تنفيذ مهام الopenspec","يوفر واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-apply-change","VS Code 扩展","OpenSpec","Markdown","AsciiDoc","开发效率"],"ja":["openspec-apply-change","VS Code 拡張","OpenSpec","Markdown","AsciiDoc","開発効率"],"ko":["openspec-apply-change","VS Code 확장","OpenSpec","Markdown","AsciiDoc","개발 효율성"],"es":["openspec-apply-change","VS Code","OpenSpec","Markdown","AsciiDoc","desarrollo de software","extensiones de VS Code"],"fr":["openspec-apply-change","VS Code","OpenSpec","Markdown","AsciiDoc","développement de logiciels","extensions de VS Code"],"de":["openspec-apply-change","VS Code","OpenSpec","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Softwareentwicklung","VS-Code-Erweiterungen"],"pt":["Openspec Apply Change","VS Code","Marked 2","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Desenvolvimento de software","Produtividade","Extensão VS Code"],"ru":["Openspec Apply Change","VS Code","Marked 2","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Разработка программного обеспечения","Производительность","Расширение VS Code"],"ar":["openspec apply change","vs code","ماركد 2","ماركد","أSCIIDOC","تطوير البرمجيات","الإنتاجية","توسيع(vs code)"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"vscode-open-in-marked2","repoPath":"gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-apply-change","description":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change. Use when the user wants to start implementing, continue implementation, or work through tasks.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Select the change**\n\n   If a name is provided, use it. Otherwise:\n   - Infer from conversation context if the user mentioned a change\n   - Auto-select if only one active change exists\n   - If ambiguous, run `openspec list --json` to get available changes and use the *","body":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Select the change**\n\n   If a name is provided, use it. Otherwise:\n   - Infer from conversation context if the user mentioned a change\n   - Auto-select if only one active change exists\n   - If ambiguous, run `openspec list --json` to get available changes and use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select\n\n   Always announce: \"Using change: <name>\" and how to override (e.g., `/opsx:apply <other>`).\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifact contains the tasks (typically \"tasks\" for spec-driven, check status for others)\n\n3. **Get apply instructions**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns:\n   - Context file paths (varies by schema - could be proposal/specs/design/tasks or spec/tests/implementation/docs)\n   - Progress (total, complete, remaining)\n   - Task list with status\n   - Dynamic instruction based on current state\n\n   **Handle states:**\n   - If `state: \"blocked\"` (missing artifacts): show message, suggest using openspec-continue-change\n   - If `state: \"all_done\"`: congratulate, suggest archive\n   - Otherwise: proceed to implementation\n\n4. **Read context files**\n\n   Read the files listed in `contextFiles` from the apply instructions output.\n   The files depend on the schema being used:\n   - **spec-driven**: proposal, specs, design, tasks\n   - Other schemas: follow the contextFiles from CLI output\n\n5. **Show current progress**\n\n   Display:\n   - Schema being used\n   - Progress: \"N/M tasks complete\"\n   - Remaining tasks overview\n   - Dynamic instruction from CLI\n\n6. **Implement tasks (loop until done or blocked)**\n\n   For each pending task:\n   - Show which task is being worked on\n   - Make the code changes required\n   - Keep changes minimal and focused\n   - Mark task complete in the tasks file: `- [ ]` → `- [x]`\n   - Continue to next task\n\n   **Pause if:**\n   - Task is unclear → ask for clarification\n   - Implementation reveals a design issue → suggest updating artifacts\n   - Error or blocker encountered → report and wait for guidance\n   - User interrupts\n\n7. **On completion or pause, show status**\n\n   Display:\n   - Tasks completed this session\n   - Overall progress: \"N/M tasks complete\"\n   - If all done: suggest archive\n   - If paused: explain why and wait for guidance\n\n**Output During Implementation**\n\n```\n## Implementing: <change-name> (schema: <schema-name>)\n\nWorking on task 3/7: <task description>\n[...implementation happening...]\n✓ Task complete\n\nWorking on task 4/7: <task description>\n[...implementation happening...]\n✓ Task complete\n```\n\n**Output On Completion**\n\n```\n## Implementation Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Progress:** 7/7 tasks complete ✓\n\n### Completed This Session\n- [x] Task 1\n- [x] Task 2\n...\n\nAll tasks complete! Ready to archive this change.\n```\n\n**Output On Pause (Issue Encountered)**\n\n```\n## Implementation Paused\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Progress:** 4/7 tasks complete\n\n### Issue Encountered\n<description of the issue>\n\n**Options:**\n1. <option 1>\n2. <option 2>\n3. Other approach\n\nWhat would you like to do?\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Keep going through tasks until done or blocked\n- Always read context files before starting (from the apply instructions output)\n- If task is ambiguous, pause and ask before implementing\n- If implementation reveals issues, pause and suggest artifact updates\n- Keep code changes minimal and scoped to each task\n- Update task checkbox immediately after completing each task\n- Pause on errors, blockers, or unclear requirements - don''t guess\n- Use contextFiles from CLI output, don''t assume specific file names\n\n**Fluid Workflow Integration**\n\nThis skill supports the \"actions on a change\" model:\n\n- **Can be invoked anytime**: Before all artifacts are done (if tasks exist), after partial implementation, interleaved with other actions\n- **Allows artifact updates**: If implementation reveals design issues, suggest updating artifacts - not phase-locked, work fluidly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:37:53.955Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing to streamline OpenSpec change implementation and Markdown/AsciiDoc file management within VS Code.","zh":"非常适合需要简化 OpenSpec 变更实现和在 VS Code 中管理 Markdown/AsciiDoc 文件的开发者代理。","ja":"VS Code 内で OpenSpec 変更の実装と Markdown/AsciiDoc ファイルの管理を効率化する必要がある Developer エージェントに最適です。","ko":"VS Code 내에서 OpenSpec 변경 구현 및 Markdown/AsciiDoc 파일 관리를 간소화해야 하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan optimizar la implementación de cambios de OpenSpec y la administración de archivos Markdown/AsciiDoc dentro de VS Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de rationaliser la mise en œuvre des modifications OpenSpec et la gestion des fichiers Markdown/AsciiDoc dans VS Code.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsagenten, die die Implementierung von OpenSpec-Änderungen und die Verwaltung von Markdown/AsciiDoc-Dateien in VS Code optimieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que precisam otimizar a implementação de alterações do OpenSpec e gerenciar arquivos Markdown/AsciiDoc dentro do VS Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым необходимо оптимизировать реализацию изменений OpenSpec и управление файлами Markdown/AsciiDoc внутри VS Code.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يحتاج إلى تسهيل تنفيذ التغييرات في مواصفات مفتوحة وإدارة ملفات Markdown/AsciiDoc داخل VS Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement tasks from OpenSpec changes, leveraging Marked 2 for Markdown and AsciiDoc file preview, and utilizing the ''openspec list --json'' command for seamless change selection and management.","zh":"赋予代理实现来自 OpenSpec 变更的任务的能力，利用 Marked 2 进行 Markdown 和 AsciiDoc 文件的预览，并利用 ''openspec list --json'' 命令实现无缝的变更选择和管理。","ja":"OpenSpec 変更からタスクを実装するエージェントを可能にし、Marked 2 を使用して Markdown と AsciiDoc ファイルのプレビューを生成し、''openspec list --json'' コマンドを使用して変更の選択と管理をシームレスに行う。","ko":"에이전트가 OpenSpec 변경에서 태스크를 구현할 수 있도록 하며, Marked 2를 사용하여 Markdown 및 AsciiDoc 파일의 미리 보기를 생성하고, ''openspec list --json'' 명령을 사용하여 변경 선택 및 관리를 원활하게 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar tareas a partir de cambios de OpenSpec, aprovechando Marked 2 para la vista previa de archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc, y utilizando el comando ''openspec list --json'' para una selección y administración de cambios sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des tâches à partir de modifications OpenSpec, en exploitant Marked 2 pour l''aperçu des fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc, et en utilisant la commande ''openspec list --json'' pour une sélection et une gestion de modifications sans heurts.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Aufgaben aus OpenSpec-Änderungen umzusetzen, indem Marked 2 für die Vorschau von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien genutzt wird und der Befehl ''openspec list --json'' für eine nahtlose Änderungsauswahl und -verwaltung verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar tarefas a partir de alterações do OpenSpec, utilizando o Marked 2 para visualização de arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc, e utilizando o comando ''openspec list --json'' para seleção e gerenciamento de alterações sem interrupção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать задачи на основе изменений OpenSpec, используя Marked 2 для предварительного просмотра файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc, и используя команду ''openspec list --json'' для бесшовного выбора и управления изменениями.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ المهام من التغييرات في مواصفات مفتوحة، مستخدمين Marked 2 لعرض ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc، واستخدام الأمر ''openspec list --json'' لاختيار التغييرات وإدارتها بسلاسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating OpenSpec change implementation with inferred or specified change names","Generating content previews for Markdown and AsciiDoc files using Marked 2","Debugging ambiguous change selections using ''openspec list --json'' output"],"zh":["使用推断或指定的变更名称自动化 OpenSpec 变更的实现","使用 Marked 2 为 Markdown 和 AsciiDoc 文件生成内容预览","使用 ''openspec list --json'' 输出调试模糊的变更选择"],"ja":["推測された変更名または指定された変更名を使用して OpenSpec 変更の実装を自動化する","Marked 2 を使用して Markdown と AsciiDoc ファイルのコンテンツ プレビューを生成する","''openspec list --json'' 出力を使用して曖昧な変更の選択をデバッグする"],"ko":["추론되거나 지정된 변경 이름을 사용하여 OpenSpec 변경 구현을 자동화하는 것","Marked 2를 사용하여 Markdown 및 AsciiDoc 파일의 콘텐츠 미리 보기를 생성하는 것","''openspec list --json'' 출력을 사용하여 모호한 변경 선택을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la implementación de cambios de OpenSpec con nombres de cambios inferidos o especificados","Generación de vistas previas de contenido para archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc utilizando Marked 2","Depuración de selecciones de cambios ambigüas utilizando la salida de ''openspec list --json''"],"fr":["Automatisation de la mise en œuvre des modifications OpenSpec avec des noms de modifications inférés ou spécifiés","Génération d''aperçus de contenu pour les fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc en utilisant Marked 2","Débogage des sélections de modifications ambiguës en utilisant la sortie de ''openspec list --json''"],"de":["Automatisierung der Implementierung von OpenSpec-Änderungen mit abgeleiteten oder angegebenen Änderungsnamen","Erzeugung von Vorschauen für Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien unter Verwendung von Marked 2","Fehlersuche bei mehrdeutigen Änderungsauswahlen unter Verwendung der Ausgabe von ''openspec list --json''"],"pt":["Automatizar a implementação de alterações do OpenSpec com nomes de alterações inferidos ou especificados","Gerar visualizações de conteúdo para arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc usando o Marked 2","Depurar seleções de alterações ambíguas usando a saída do comando ''openspec list --json''"],"ru":["Автоматизировать реализацию изменений OpenSpec с выведенными или указанными именами изменений","Генерировать предварительные просмотры контента для файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc, используя Marked 2","Отлаживать неоднозначные выборы изменений, используя вывод команды ''openspec list --json''"],"ar":["توفير آلي لتنفيذ التغييرات في مواصفات مفتوحة بأسماء التغييرات المُستدلة أو المُحددة","_generating معاينة المحتوى لملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc باستخدام Marked 2","تصحيح الاختيارات الغامضة للتغييرات باستخدام إخراج الأمر ''openspec list --json''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VS Code extension installation","Limited to Markdown and AsciiDoc file formats","Dependent on ''openspec list --json'' command for change selection"],"zh":["需要安装 VS Code 扩展","仅限 Markdown 和 AsciiDoc 文件格式","依赖 ''openspec list --json'' 命令进行变更选择"],"ja":["VS Code 拡張機能のインストールが必要","Markdown と AsciiDoc ファイル形式のみに限定される","変更の選択には ''openspec list --json'' コマンドに依存する"],"ko":["VS Code 확장 프로그램 설치가 필요함","Markdown 및 AsciiDoc 파일 형식만으로 제한됨","''openspec list --json'' 명령에 의존하여 변경 선택을 수행함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la extensión de VS Code","Limitado a los formatos de archivo Markdown y AsciiDoc","Dependiente del comando ''openspec list --json'' para la selección de cambios"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''extension VS Code","Limité aux formats de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc","Dépendant de la commande ''openspec list --json'' pour la sélection de modifications"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der VS Code-Erweiterung","Begrenzt auf die Dateiformate Markdown und AsciiDoc","Abhängig vom Befehl ''openspec list --json'' für die Änderungsauswahl"],"pt":["Requer instalação da extensão do VS Code","Limitado a formatos de arquivo Markdown e AsciiDoc","Dependente do comando ''openspec list --json'' para seleção de alterações"],"ru":["Требует установки расширения VS Code","Ограничен форматами файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc","Зависит от команды ''openspec list --json'' для выбора изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ملحق VS Code","محدود بالتنسيقات ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc","يعتمد على الأمر ''openspec list --json'' لاختيار التغييرات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
