nnalités","Compatibilité avec TypeScript et JavaScript","Documentation détaillée sur better-auth.com/docs"],"de":["Installation von Better Auth","Erstellung von Authentifizierung mit auth.ts und auth-client.ts","Konfiguration des Route-Handlers","Verwendung von Plugins zur Hinzufügung von Funktionalitäten","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript und JavaScript","Detaillierte Dokumentation auf better-auth.com/docs"],"pt":["Instalação do Better Auth","Criação de autenticação com auth.ts e auth-client.ts","Configuração do roteador","Execução do CLI migrate/generate","Adição de recursos via plugins","Suporte a frameworks e bancos de dados"],"ru":["Установка Better Auth","Создание аутентификации с auth.ts и auth-client.ts","Настройка маршрутизатора","Выполнение CLI migrate/generate","Добавление функций через плагины","Поддержка фреймворков и баз данных"],"ar":["تثبيت Better Auth","إنشاء مصادقة مع auth.ts و auth-client.ts","تكوين الموجه","تشغيل CLI migrate/generate","إضافة ميزات عبر البرامج المساعدة","دعم الإطارات والقواعد البيانية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["身份验证","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","应用程序安全","用户认证","代码示例","语法","新项目设置"],"ja":["認証","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","アプリケーションセキュリティ","ユーザー認証","コード例","構文","新しいプロジェクト設定"],"ko":["인증","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","애플리케이션 보안","사용자 인증","코드 예제","구문","새 프로젝트 설정"],"es":["autenticación de usuario","Create Auth Skill","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","seguridad de aplicaciones","desarrollo de software","autenticación y autorización"],"fr":["authentification utilisateur","Create Auth Skill","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","sécurité des applications","développement de logiciels","authentification et autorisation"],"de":["Benutzerauthentifizierung","Create Auth Skill","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","Anwendungssicherheit","Softwareentwicklung","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung"],"pt":["autenticação","TypeScript","JavaScript","Better Auth","desenvolvimento web","segurança","roteador","plugins","frameworks","bancos de dados"],"ru":["аутентификация","TypeScript","JavaScript","Better Auth","веб-разработка","безопасность","маршрутизатор","плагины","фреймворки","базы данных"],"ar":["المصادقة","TypeScript","JavaScript","Better Auth","تطوير الويب","الأمان","الموجه","البرامج المساعدة","الإطارات","القواعد البيانية"]}},"owner":"ThinkEx-OSS","repo":"thinkex","repoPath":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-auth-skill","description":"Skill for creating auth layers in TypeScript/JavaScript apps using Better Auth.","bodyPreview":"# Create Auth Skill\n\nGuide for adding authentication to TypeScript/JavaScript applications using Better Auth.\n\n**For code examples and syntax, see [better-auth.com/docs](https://better-auth.com/docs).**\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nIs this a new/empty project?\n├─ YES → New project setup\n│   1. Identify framework\n│   2. Choose database\n│   3. Install better-auth\n│   4. Create auth.ts + auth-client.ts\n│   5. Set up route handler\n│   6. Run CLI migrate/generate\n│   7. Add features via plugins\n│\n└─ N","body":"# Create Auth Skill\n\nGuide for adding authentication to TypeScript/JavaScript applications using Better Auth.\n\n**For code examples and syntax, see [better-auth.com/docs](https://better-auth.com/docs).**\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nIs this a new/empty project?\n├─ YES → New project setup\n│   1. Identify framework\n│   2. Choose database\n│   3. Install better-auth\n│   4. Create auth.ts + auth-client.ts\n│   5. Set up route handler\n│   6. Run CLI migrate/generate\n│   7. Add features via plugins\n│\n└─ NO → Does project have existing auth?\n    ├─ YES → Migration/enhancement\n    │   • Audit current auth for gaps\n    │   • Plan incremental migration\n    │   • See migration guides in docs\n    │\n    └─ NO → Add auth to existing project\n        1. Analyze project structure\n        2. Install better-auth\n        3. Create auth config\n        4. Add route handler\n        5. Run schema migrations\n        6. Integrate into existing pages\n```\n\n---\n\n## Installation\n\n**Core:** `npm install better-auth`\n\n**Scoped packages (as needed):**\n| Package | Use case |\n|---------|----------|\n| `@better-auth/passkey` | WebAuthn/Passkey auth |\n| `@better-auth/sso` | SAML/OIDC enterprise SSO |\n| `@better-auth/stripe` | Stripe payments |\n| `@better-auth/scim` | SCIM user provisioning |\n| `@better-auth/expo` | React Native/Expo |\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```env\nBETTER_AUTH_SECRET=<32+ chars, generate with: openssl rand -base64 32>\nBETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000\nDATABASE_URL=<your database connection string>\n```\n\nAdd OAuth secrets as needed: `GITHUB_CLIENT_ID`, `GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`, etc.\n\n---\n\n## Server Config (auth.ts)\n\n**Location:** `lib/auth.ts` or `src/lib/auth.ts`\n\n**Minimal config needs:**\n- `database` - Connection or adapter\n- `emailAndPassword: { enabled: true }` - For email/password auth\n\n**Standard config adds:**\n- `socialProviders` - OAuth providers (google, github, etc.)\n- `emailVerification.sendVerificationEmail` - Email verification handler\n- `emailAndPassword.sendResetPassword` - Password reset handler\n\n**Full config adds:**\n- `plugins` - Array of feature plugins\n- `session` - Expiry, cookie cache settings\n- `account.accountLinking` - Multi-provider linking\n- `rateLimit` - Rate limiting config\n\n**Export types:** `export type Session = typeof auth.$Infer.Session`\n\n---\n\n## Client Config (auth-client.ts)\n\n**Import by framework:**\n| Framework | Import |\n|-----------|--------|\n| React/Next.js | `better-auth/react` |\n| Vue | `better-auth/vue` |\n| Svelte | `better-auth/svelte` |\n| Solid | `better-auth/solid` |\n| Vanilla JS | `better-auth/client` |\n\n**Client plugins** go in `createAuthClient({ plugins: [...] })`.\n\n**Common exports:** `signIn`, `signUp`, `signOut`, `useSession`, `getSession`\n\n---\n\n## Route Handler Setup\n\n| Framework | File | Handler |\n|-----------|------|---------|\n| Next.js App Router | `app/api/auth/[...all]/route.ts` | `toNextJsHandler(auth)` → export `{ GET, POST }` |\n| Next.js Pages | `pages/api/auth/[...all].ts` | `toNextJsHandler(auth)` → default export |\n| Express | Any file | `app.all(\"/api/auth/*\", toNodeHandler(auth))` |\n| SvelteKit | `src/hooks.server.ts` | `svelteKitHandler(auth)` |\n| SolidStart | Route file | `solidStartHandler(auth)` |\n| Hono | Route file | `auth.handler(c.req.raw)` |\n\n**Next.js Server Components:** Add `nextCookies()` plugin to auth config.\n\n---\n\n## Database Migrations\n\n| Adapter | Command |\n|---------|---------|\n| Built-in Kysely | `npx @better-auth/cli@latest migrate` (applies directly) |\n| Prisma | `npx @better-auth/cli@latest generate --output prisma/schema.prisma` then `npx prisma migrate dev` |\n| Drizzle | `npx @better-auth/cli@latest generate --output src/db/auth-schema.ts` then `npx drizzle-kit push` |\n\n**Re-run after adding plugins.**\n\n---\n\n## Database Adapters\n\n| Database | Setup |\n|----------|-------|\n| SQLite | Pass `better-sqlite3` or `bun:sqlite` instance directly |\n| PostgreSQL | Pass `pg.Pool` instance directly |\n| MySQL | Pass `mysql2` pool directly |\n| Prisma | `prismaAdapter(prisma, { provider: \"postgresql\" })` from `better-auth/adapters/prisma` |\n| Drizzle | `drizzleAdapter(db, { provider: \"pg\" })` from `better-auth/adapters/drizzle` |\n| MongoDB | `mongodbAdapter(db)` from `better-auth/adapters/mongodb` |\n\n---\n\n## Common Plugins\n\n| Plugin | Server Import | Client Import | Purpose |\n|--------|---------------|---------------|---------|\n| `twoFactor` | `better-auth/plugins` | `twoFactorClient` | 2FA with TOTP/OTP |\n| `organization` | `better-auth/plugins` | `organizationClient` | Teams/orgs |\n| `admin` | `better-auth/plugins` | `adminClient` | User management |\n| `bearer` | `better-auth/plugins` | - | API token auth |\n| `openAPI` | `better-auth/plugins` | - | API docs |\n| `passkey` | `@better-auth/passkey` | `passkeyClient` | WebAuthn |\n| `sso` | `@better-auth/sso` | - | Enterprise SSO |\n\n**Plugin pattern:** Server plugin + client plugin + run migrations.\n\n---\n\n## Auth UI Implementation\n\n**Sign in flow:**\n1. `signIn.email({ email, password })` or `signIn.social({ provider, callbackURL })`\n2. Handle `error` in response\n3. Redirect on success\n\n**Session check (client):** `useSession()` hook returns `{ data: session, isPending }`\n\n**Session check (server):** `auth.api.getSession({ headers: await headers() })`\n\n**Protected routes:** Check session, redirect to `/sign-in` if null.\n\n---\n\n## Security Checklist\n\n- [ ] `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` set (32+ chars)\n- [ ] `advanced.useSecureCookies: true` in production\n- [ ] `trustedOrigins` configured\n- [ ] Rate limits enabled\n- [ ] Email verification enabled\n- [ ] Password reset implemented\n- [ ] 2FA for sensitive apps\n- [ ] CSRF protection NOT disabled\n- [ ] `account.accountLinking` reviewed\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| \"Secret not set\" | Add `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` env var |\n| \"Invalid Origin\" | Add domain to `trustedOrigins` |\n| Cookies not setting | Check `baseURL` matches domain; enable secure cookies in prod |\n| OAuth callback errors | Verify redirect URIs in provider dashboard |\n| Type errors after adding plugin | Re-run CLI generate/migrate |\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Docs](https://better-auth.com/docs)\n- [Examples](https://github.com/better-auth/examples)\n- [Plugins](https://better-auth.com/docs/concepts/plugins)\n- [CLI](https://better-auth.com/docs/concepts/cli)\n- [Migration Guides](https://better-auth.com/docs/guides)"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:38:10.242Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing secure authentication integration in TypeScript/JavaScript applications.","zh":"非常适合需要在TypeScript/JavaScript应用程序中集成安全身份验证的全栈代理。","ja":"TypeScript/JavaScriptアプリケーションで安全な認証を統合する必要があるフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"TypeScript/JavaScript 애플리케이션에서 보안 인증을 통합해야 하는 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan integración de autenticación segura en aplicaciones TypeScript/JavaScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui ont besoin d''une intégration d''authentification sécurisée dans les applications TypeScript/JavaScript.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine sichere Authentifizierungsintegration in TypeScript/JavaScript-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de integração de autenticação segura em aplicações TypeScript/JavaScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходима безопасная аутентификация в приложениях TypeScript/JavaScript.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج المصادقة الآمنة في تطبيقات TypeScript/JavaScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust authentication using Better Auth, enabling secure user interfaces with features like route handlers, database integration, and plugin-based feature extension via protocols such as HTTPS.","zh":"赋予代理实现强大的身份验证能力，使用Better Auth，实现安全的用户界面，具有路由处理、数据库集成和基于插件的功能扩展等特性，支持HTTPS等协议。","ja":"エージェントに強力な認証を実装する能力を与え、Better Authを使用して、HTTPSなどのプロトコルを介したルートハンドラー、データベース統合、プラグインベースの機能拡張などの機能を備えた安全なユーザーインターフェイスを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Better Auth를 사용하여 강력한 인증을 구현할 수 있도록 하여 HTTPS 등의 프로토콜을 통해 라우트 처리, 데이터베이스 통합, 플러그인 기반 기능 확장 등의 기능을 갖춘 보안 사용자 인터페이스를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una autenticación robusta utilizando Better Auth, lo que permite interfaces de usuario seguras con características como controladores de ruta, integración de base de datos y extensión de características basada en plugins a través de protocolos como HTTPS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une authentification robuste en utilisant Better Auth, ce qui permet des interfaces utilisateur sécurisées avec des fonctionnalités telles que des gestionnaires de route, une intégration de base de données et une extension de fonctionnalités basée sur des plugins via des protocoles tels que HTTPS.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, eine robuste Authentifizierung mithilfe von Better Auth zu implementieren, wodurch sichere Benutzeroberflächen mit Funktionen wie Routen-Handlern, Datenbankintegration und plug-in-basierte Funktionserweiterung über Protokolle wie HTTPS ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar uma autenticação robusta usando Better Auth, permitindo interfaces de usuário seguras com recursos como controladores de rota, integração de banco de dados e extensão de recursos baseada em plug-in via protocolos como HTTPS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать безопасную аутентификацию с помощью Better Auth, позволяя создавать безопасные интерфейсы пользователя с функциями, такими как обработчики маршрутов, интеграция с базой данных и расширение функций на основе плагинов через протоколы, такие как HTTPS.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ المصادقة القوية باستخدام Better Auth، مما يسمح بواجهات مستخدم آمنة مع ميزات مثل معالجات المسار وتكامل قاعدة البيانات وتوسيع الميزات القائم على البرامج الإضافية عبر بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure login systems","Configuring role-based access control","Integrating authentication with existing TypeScript/JavaScript projects"],"zh":["实现安全登录系统","配置基于角色的访问控制","将身份验证集成到现有的TypeScript/JavaScript项目中"],"ja":["セキュアなログインシステムの実装","ロールベースのアクセス制御の構成","既存のTypeScript/JavaScriptプロジェクトへの認証の統合"],"ko":["보안 로그인 시스템 구현","역할 기반 접근 제어 구성","기존 TypeScript/JavaScript 프로젝트와의 인증 통합"],"es":["Implementar sistemas de inicio de sesión seguros","Configurar control de acceso basado en roles","Integrar la autenticación con proyectos TypeScript/JavaScript existentes"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des systèmes de connexion sécurisés","Configurer un contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles","Intégrer l''authentification avec des projets TypeScript/JavaScript existants"],"de":["Sichere Anmelde-Systeme implementieren","Rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle konfigurieren","Authentifizierung in bestehende TypeScript/JavaScript-Projekte integrieren"],"pt":["Implementação de sistemas de login seguros","Configuração de controle de acesso baseado em função","Integração da autenticação com projetos TypeScript/JavaScript existentes"],"ru":["Реализация безопасных систем входа","Настройка контроля доступа на основе ролей","Интеграция аутентификации с существующими проектами TypeScript/JavaScript"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنظمة الدخول الآمنة","تكوين التحكم في الوصول القائم على الدور","دمج المصادقة مع مشاريع TypeScript/JavaScript الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Better Auth installation","TypeScript/JavaScript environment only","Database setup necessary"],"zh":["需要Better Auth的安装","仅限TypeScript/JavaScript环境","需要数据库设置"],"ja":["Better Authのインストールが必要","TypeScript/JavaScript環境のみ","データベースの設定が必要"],"ko":["Better Auth 설치가 필요합니다","TypeScript/JavaScript 환경만 지원","데이터베이스 설정이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Better Auth","Entorno solo de TypeScript/JavaScript","Configuración de base de datos necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Better Auth","Environnement TypeScript/JavaScript uniquement","Configuration de la base de données nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Better Auth","Nur TypeScript/JavaScript-Umgebung","Datenbanksetup erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Better Auth","Ambiente TypeScript/JavaScript apenas","Configuração do banco de dados necessária"],"ru":["Требуется установка Better Auth","Только среда TypeScript/JavaScript","Необходима настройка базы данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Better Auth","بيئة TypeScript/JavaScript فقط","تثبيت قاعدة البيانات ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
