para scripts de shell que ayuda a detectar errores y mejorar la calidad del código","fr":"ShellCheck est un outil d''analyse statique pour les scripts shell qui aide à détecter les erreurs et à améliorer la qualité du code","de":"ShellCheck ist ein Tool für die statische Analyse von Shell-Skripten, das hilft, Fehler zu erkennen und die Code-Qualität zu verbessern","pt":"O ShellCheck é uma ferramenta de análise de código que ajuda a melhorar a qualidade dos scripts de shell","ru":"ShellCheck — это инструмент статического анализа, который помогает улучшить качество скриптов shell","ar":"ShellCheck هو أداة تحليل الكود تساعد على تحسين جودة البرامج النصية shell","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["配置ShellCheck进行静态分析","提高shell脚本质量","捕获常见陷阱","强制执行最佳实践","集成到CI/CD管道中"],"ja":["ShellCheckを静的解析に構成する","シェルスクリプトの質を向上させる","一般的な落とし穴を捕捉する","ベストプラクティスを適用する","CI/CDパイプラインに統合する"],"ko":["ShellCheck를 정적 분석에 구성","셸 스크립트 품질 개선","일반적인 함정을 잡기","최선의 관행 적용","CI/CD 파이프라인에 통합"],"es":["Análisis estático de scripts de shell","Detección de errores y vulnerabilidades","Configuración personalizada para proyectos específicos","Integración con pipelines de CI/CD","Informes detallados de errores y advertencias"],"fr":["Analyse statique de scripts shell","Détection d''erreurs et de vulnérabilités","Configuration personnalisée pour les projets spécifiques","Intégration avec les pipelines de CI/CD","Rapports détaillés d''erreurs et d''avis"],"de":["Statische Analyse von Shell-Skripten","Fehler- und Schwachstellen-Erkennung","Benutzerdefinierte Konfiguration für spezifische Projekte","Integration mit CI/CD-Pipelines","Detaillierte Fehler- und Warnungsberichte"],"pt":["Configuração personalizada do ShellCheck","Análise de código estática para scripts de shell","Detecção de erros e problemas comuns","Integração com pipelines de CI/CD","Suporte a projetos específicos"],"ru":["Настройка ShellCheck под конкретный проект","Статический анализ кода для скриптов shell","Обнаружение ошибок и распространенных проблем","Интеграция с конвейерами CI/CD","Поддержка конкретных проектов"],"ar":["تكوين ShellCheck حسب المشروع","تحليل الكود الثابت للبرامج النصية shell","اكتشاف الأخطاء والمشاكل الشائعة","التكامل مع أنابيب CI/CD","دعم المشاريع الخاصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ShellCheck","静态分析","shell脚本","配置","最佳实践","CI/CD","自动化测试"],"ja":["ShellCheck","静的解析","シェルスクリプト","構成","ベストプラクティス","CI/CD","自動テスト"],"ko":["ShellCheck","정적 분석","셸 스크립트","구성","최선의 관행","CI/CD","자동화 테스트"],"es":["ShellCheck","análisis estático","scripts de shell","seguridad","calidad del código","CI/CD","integración","configuración"],"fr":["ShellCheck","analyse statique","scripts shell","sécurité","qualité du code","CI/CD","intégration","configuration"],"de":["ShellCheck","statische Analyse","Shell-Skripte","Sicherheit","Code-Qualität","CI/CD","Integration","Konfiguration"],"pt":["ShellCheck","análise de código","scripts de shell","qualidade de código","erros comuns","CI/CD","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["ShellCheck","статический анализ","скрипты shell","качество кода","распространенные ошибки","CI/CD","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["ShellCheck","تحليل الكود","البرامج النصية shell","جودة الكود","الأخطاء الشائعة","CI/CD","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shellcheck-configuration","description":"Master ShellCheck static analysis configuration and usage for shell script quality. Use when setting up linting infrastructure, fixing code issues, or ensuring script portability.","bodyPreview":"# ShellCheck Configuration and Static Analysis\n\nComprehensive guidance for configuring and using ShellCheck to improve shell script quality, catch common pitfalls, and enforce best practices through static code analysis.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up linting for shell scripts in CI/CD pipelines\n- Analyzing existing shell scripts for issues\n- Understanding ShellCheck error codes and warnings\n- Configuring ShellCheck for specific project requirements\n- Integrating ShellCheck into develo","body":"# ShellCheck Configuration and Static Analysis\n\nComprehensive guidance for configuring and using ShellCheck to improve shell script quality, catch common pitfalls, and enforce best practices through static code analysis.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up linting for shell scripts in CI/CD pipelines\n- Analyzing existing shell scripts for issues\n- Understanding ShellCheck error codes and warnings\n- Configuring ShellCheck for specific project requirements\n- Integrating ShellCheck into development workflows\n- Suppressing false positives and configuring rule sets\n- Enforcing consistent code quality standards\n- Migrating scripts to meet quality gates\n\n## ShellCheck Fundamentals\n\n### What is ShellCheck?\n\nShellCheck is a static analysis tool that analyzes shell scripts and detects problematic patterns. It supports:\n- Bash, sh, dash, ksh, and other POSIX shells\n- Over 100 different warnings and errors\n- Configuration for target shell and flags\n- Integration with editors and CI/CD systems\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# macOS with Homebrew\nbrew install shellcheck\n\n# Ubuntu/Debian\napt-get install shellcheck\n\n# From source\ngit clone https://github.com/koalaman/shellcheck.git\ncd shellcheck\nmake build\nmake install\n\n# Verify installation\nshellcheck --version\n```\n\n## Configuration Files\n\n### .shellcheckrc (Project Level)\n\nCreate `.shellcheckrc` in your project root:\n\n```\n# Specify target shell\nshell=bash\n\n# Enable optional checks\nenable=avoid-nullary-conditions\nenable=require-variable-braces\n\n# Disable specific warnings\ndisable=SC1091\ndisable=SC2086\n```\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n```bash\n# Set default shell target\nexport SHELLCHECK_SHELL=bash\n\n# Enable strict mode\nexport SHELLCHECK_STRICT=true\n\n# Specify configuration file location\nexport SHELLCHECK_CONFIG=~/.shellcheckrc\n```\n\n## Common ShellCheck Error Codes\n\n### SC1000-1099: Parser Errors\n```bash\n# SC1004: Backslash continuation not followed by newline\necho hello\\\nworld  # Error - needs line continuation\n\n# SC1008: Invalid data for operator `==''\nif [[ $var =  \"value\" ]]; then  # Space before ==\n    true\nfi\n```\n\n### SC2000-2099: Shell Issues\n\n```bash\n# SC2009: Consider using pgrep or pidof instead of grep|grep\nps aux | grep -v grep | grep myprocess  # Use pgrep instead\n\n# SC2012: Use `ls` only for viewing. Use `find` for reliable output\nfor file in $(ls -la)  # Better: use find or globbing\n\n# SC2015: Avoid using && and || instead of if-then-else\n[[ -f \"$file\" ]] && echo \"found\" || echo \"not found\"  # Less clear\n\n# SC2016: Expressions don''t expand in single quotes\necho ''$VAR''  # Literal $VAR, not variable expansion\n\n# SC2026: This word is non-standard. Set POSIXLY_CORRECT\n# when using with scripts for other shells\n```\n\n### SC2100-2199: Quoting Issues\n\n```bash\n# SC2086: Double quote to prevent globbing and word splitting\nfor i in $list; do  # Should be: for i in $list or for i in \"$list\"\n    echo \"$i\"\ndone\n\n# SC2115: Literal tilde in path not expanded. Use $HOME instead\n~/.bashrc  # In strings, use \"$HOME/.bashrc\"\n\n# SC2181: Check exit code directly with `if`, not indirectly in a list\nsome_command\nif [ $? -eq 0 ]; then  # Better: if some_command; then\n\n# SC2206: Quote to prevent word splitting or set IFS\narray=( $items )  # Should use: array=( $items )\n```\n\n### SC3000-3999: POSIX Compliance Issues\n\n```bash\n# SC3010: In POSIX sh, use ''case'' instead of ''cond && foo''\n[[ $var == \"value\" ]] && do_something  # Not POSIX\n\n# SC3043: In POSIX sh, use ''local'' is undefined\nfunction my_func() {\n    local var=value  # Not POSIX in some shells\n}\n```\n\n## Practical Configuration Examples\n\n### Minimal Configuration (Strict POSIX)\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# Configure for maximum portability\n\nshellcheck \\\n  --shell=sh \\\n  --external-sources \\\n  --check-sourced \\\n  script.sh\n```\n\n### Development Configuration (Bash with Relaxed Rules)\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# Configure for Bash development\n\nshellcheck \\\n  --shell=bash \\\n  --exclude=SC1091,SC2119 \\\n  --enable=all \\\n  script.sh\n```\n\n### CI/CD Integration Configuration\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nset -Eeuo pipefail\n\n# Analyze all shell scripts and fail on issues\nfind . -type f -name \"*.sh\" | while read -r script; do\n    echo \"Checking: $script\"\n    shellcheck \\\n        --shell=bash \\\n        --format=gcc \\\n        --exclude=SC1091 \\\n        \"$script\" || exit 1\ndone\n```\n\n### .shellcheckrc for Project\n\n```\n# Shell dialect to analyze against\nshell=bash\n\n# Enable optional checks\nenable=avoid-nullary-conditions,require-variable-braces,check-unassigned-uppercase\n\n# Disable specific warnings\n# SC1091: Not following sourced files (many false positives)\ndisable=SC1091\n\n# SC2119: Use function_name instead of function_name -- (arguments)\ndisable=SC2119\n\n# External files to source for context\nexternal-sources=true\n```\n\n## Integration Patterns\n\n### Pre-commit Hook Configuration\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# .git/hooks/pre-commit\n\n#!/bin/bash\nset -e\n\n# Find all shell scripts changed in this commit\ngit diff --cached --name-only | grep ''\\.sh$'' | while read -r script; do\n    echo \"Linting: $script\"\n\n    if ! shellcheck \"$script\"; then\n        echo \"ShellCheck failed on $script\"\n        exit 1\n    fi\ndone\n```\n\n### GitHub Actions Workflow\n\n```yaml\nname: ShellCheck\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  shellcheck:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n\n      - name: Run ShellCheck\n        run: |\n          sudo apt-get install shellcheck\n          find . -type f -name \"*.sh\" -exec shellcheck {} \\;\n```\n\n### GitLab CI Pipeline\n\n```yaml\nshellcheck:\n  stage: lint\n  image: koalaman/shellcheck-alpine\n  script:\n    - find . -type f -name \"*.sh\" -exec shellcheck {} \\;\n  allow_failure: false\n```\n\n## Handling ShellCheck Violations\n\n### Suppressing Specific Warnings\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n\n# Disable warning for entire line\n# shellcheck disable=SC2086\nfor file in $(ls -la); do\n    echo \"$file\"\ndone\n\n# Disable for entire script\n# shellcheck disable=SC1091,SC2119\n\n# Disable multiple warnings (format varies)\ncommand_that_fails() {\n    # shellcheck disable=SC2015\n    [ -f \"$1\" ] && echo \"found\" || echo \"not found\"\n}\n\n# Disable specific check for source directive\n# shellcheck source=./helper.sh\nsource helper.sh\n```\n\n### Common Violations and Fixes\n\n#### SC2086: Double quote to prevent word splitting\n\n```bash\n# Problem\nfor i in $list; do done\n\n# Solution\nfor i in $list; do done  # If $list is already quoted, or\nfor i in \"${list[@]}\"; do done  # If list is an array\n```\n\n#### SC2181: Check exit code directly\n\n```bash\n# Problem\nsome_command\nif [ $? -eq 0 ]; then\n    echo \"success\"\nfi\n\n# Solution\nif some_command; then\n    echo \"success\"\nfi\n```\n\n#### SC2015: Use if-then instead of && ||\n\n```bash\n# Problem\n[ -f \"$file\" ] && echo \"exists\" || echo \"not found\"\n\n# Solution - clearer intent\nif [ -f \"$file\" ]; then\n    echo \"exists\"\nelse\n    echo \"not found\"\nfi\n```\n\n#### SC2016: Expressions don''t expand in single quotes\n\n```bash\n# Problem\necho ''Variable value: $VAR''\n\n# Solution\necho \"Variable value: $VAR\"\n```\n\n#### SC2009: Use pgrep instead of grep\n\n```bash\n# Problem\nps aux | grep -v grep | grep myprocess\n\n# Solution\npgrep -f myprocess\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Checking Multiple Files\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n\n# Sequential checking\nfor script in *.sh; do\n    shellcheck \"$script\"\ndone\n\n# Parallel checking (faster)\nfind . -name \"*.sh\" -print0 | \\\n    xargs -0 -P 4 -n 1 shellcheck\n```\n\n### Caching Results\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n\nCACHE_DIR=\".shellcheck_cache\"\nmkdir -p \"$CACHE_DIR\"\n\ncheck_script() {\n    local script=\"$1\"\n    local hash\n    local cache_file\n\n    hash=$(sha256sum \"$script\" | cut -d'' '' -f1)\n    cache_file=\"$CACHE_DIR/$hash\"\n\n    if [[ ! -f \"$cache_file\" ]]; then\n        if shellcheck \"$script\" > \"$cache_file\" 2>&1; then\n            touch \"$cache_file.ok\"\n        else\n            return 1\n        fi\n    fi\n\n    [[ -f \"$cache_file.ok\" ]]\n}\n\nfind . -name \"*.sh\" | while read -r script; do\n    check_script \"$script\" || exit 1\ndone\n```\n\n## Output Formats\n\n### Default Format\n\n```bash\nshellcheck script.sh\n\n# Output:\n# script.sh:1:3: warning: foo is referenced but not assigned. [SC2154]\n```\n\n### GCC Format (for CI/CD)\n\n```bash\nshellcheck --format=gcc script.sh\n\n# Output:\n# script.sh:1:3: warning: foo is referenced but not assigned.\n```\n\n### JSON Format (for parsing)\n\n```bash\nshellcheck --format=json script.sh\n\n# Output:\n# [{\"file\": \"script.sh\", \"line\": 1, \"column\": 3, \"level\": \"warning\", \"code\": 2154, \"message\": \"...\"}]\n```\n\n### Quiet Format\n\n```bash\nshellcheck --format=quiet script.sh\n\n# Returns non-zero if issues found, no output otherwise\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Run ShellCheck in CI/CD** - Catch issues before merging\n2. **Configure for your target shell** - Don''t analyze bash as sh\n3. **Document exclusions** - Explain why violations are suppressed\n4. **Address violations** - Don''t just disable warnings\n5. **Enable strict mode** - Use `--enable=all` with careful exclusions\n6. **Update regularly** - Keep ShellCheck current for new checks\n7. **Use pre-commit hooks** - Catch issues locally before pushing\n8. **Integrate with editors** - Get real-time feedback during development\n\n## Resources\n\n- **ShellCheck GitHub**: https://github.com/koalaman/shellcheck\n- **ShellCheck Wiki**: https://www.shellcheck.net/wiki/\n- **Error Code Reference**: https://www.shellcheck.net/\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:37:55.145Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing advanced shell script static analysis and linting capabilities for CI/CD pipelines","zh":"非常适合需要为CI/CD流水线提供高级Shell脚本静态分析和linting功能的DevOps智能体","ja":"CI/CDパイプラインのための高度なシェルスクリプト静的解析およびリンティング機能を必要とするDevOpsエージェントに最適","ko":"CI/CD 파이프라인을 위한 고급 셸 스크립트 정적 분석 및 린팅 기능이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan un análisis de script de shell estático avanzado y capacidades de linting para pipelines de CI/CD","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une analyse de script shell statique avancée et de fonctionnalités de linting pour les pipelines CI/CD","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die erweiterte Shell-Script-Static-Analyse- und Linting-Funktionen für CI/CD-Pipelines benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes DevOps que necessitam de análise estática avançada de scripts de shell e capacidades de linting para pipelines CI/CD","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым требуются продвинутые возможности статического анализа скриптов shell и линтинга для конвейеров CI/CD","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل ثابت متقدم لسكريبتات Shell وقدرات لينتينج للأنابيب CI/CD"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce best practices in shell scripting through comprehensive ShellCheck configuration, catching common pitfalls and improving script quality with features like static code analysis and customizable linting rules for ShellCheck error codes and warnings","zh":"通过全面的ShellCheck配置，使智能体能够强制执行Shell脚本最佳实践，包括静态代码分析和针对ShellCheck错误代码及警告的可定制linting规则等功能，从而捕获常见陷阱并提高脚本质量","ja":"包括的なShellCheck設定を通じて、静的コード解析やShellCheckエラーコードおよび警告に対するカスタマイズ可能なリンティングルールなどの機能により、一般的な落とし穴を捕捉し、スクリプト品質を向上させることで、エージェントがシェルスクリプトのベストプラクティスを実施できるようにする","ko":"포괄적인 ShellCheck 구성을 통해 정적 코드 분석 및 ShellCheck 오류 코드 및 경고에 대한 사용자 정의 가능한 린팅 규칙과 같은 기능으로 일반적인 함정을 포착하고 스크립트 품질을 개선하여 에이전트가 셸 스크립팅에 대한 모범 사례를 시행할 수 있도록 지원함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas en la programación de shell a través de una configuración completa de ShellCheck, capturando trampas comunes y mejorando la calidad del script con características como análisis de código estático y reglas de linting personalizables para códigos de error y advertencias de ShellCheck","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques en matière de scripting shell grâce à une configuration complète de ShellCheck, en détectant les pièges courants et en améliorant la qualité du script avec des fonctionnalités telles que l''analyse de code statique et des règles de linting personnalisables pour les codes d''erreur et les avertissements de ShellCheck","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bewährte Verfahren in der Shell-Programmierung durch eine umfassende ShellCheck-Konfiguration durchzusetzen, indem es gängige Fallstricke erkennt und die Skriptqualität mit Funktionen wie statischer Codeanalyse und anpassbaren Linting-Regeln für ShellCheck-Fehlercodes und Warnungen verbessert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor as melhores práticas na programação de shell por meio de uma configuração abrangente do ShellCheck, capturando armadilhas comuns e melhorando a qualidade do script com recursos como análise de código estático e regras de linting personalizáveis para códigos de erro e avisos do ShellCheck","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью навязать лучшие практики в написании скриптов shell посредством всесторонней конфигурации ShellCheck, обнаруживая распространенные ловушки и улучшая качество скрипта с помощью функций, таких как статический анализ кода и настраиваемые правила линтинга для кодов ошибок и предупреждений ShellCheck","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على فرض أفضل الممارسات في برمجة Shell من خلال تكوين ShellCheck الشامل ، واكتشاف الفخاخ الشائعة وتحسين جودة البرنامج مع الميزات مثل التحليل الثابت للبرمجيات وقواعد اللينتينج القابلة للتعديل لأكواد الأخطاء وتنبيهات ShellCheck"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring ShellCheck for project-specific requirements","Analyzing existing shell scripts for issues and vulnerabilities","Integrating ShellCheck into development workflows for automated linting and testing"],"zh":["为特定项目需求配置ShellCheck","分析现有Shell脚本的问题和漏洞","将ShellCheck集成到开发工作流中以实现自动化linting和测试"],"ja":["プロジェクト固有の要件に合わせたShellCheckの設定","既存のシェルスクリプトの問題と脆弱性の分析","自動リンティングおよびテストのためにShellCheckを開発ワークフローに統合"],"ko":["프로젝트별 요구 사항에 맞게 ShellCheck 구성","기존 셸 스크립트의 문제점 및 취약점 분석","자동 린팅 및 테스트를 위해 개발 워크플로에 ShellCheck 통합"],"es":["Configuración de ShellCheck para requisitos específicos del proyecto","Análisis de scripts de shell existentes en busca de problemas y vulnerabilidades","Integración de ShellCheck en flujos de trabajo de desarrollo para linting y pruebas automatizadas"],"fr":["Configuration de ShellCheck pour les exigences spécifiques du projet","Analyse des scripts shell existants pour les problèmes et les vulnérabilités","Intégration de ShellCheck dans les flux de travail de développement pour le linting et les tests automatisés"],"de":["Konfiguration von ShellCheck für projektspezifische Anforderungen","Analyse bestehender Shell-Skripte auf Probleme und Schwachstellen","Integration von ShellCheck in Entwicklungswerkflüsse für automatisiertes Linting und Testen"],"pt":["Configurando o ShellCheck para requisitos específicos do projeto","Analisando scripts de shell existentes para problemas e vulnerabilidades","Integrando o ShellCheck a fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento para linting e teste automatizados"],"ru":["Настройка ShellCheck для проектных требований","Анализ существующих скриптов shell на наличие проблем и уязвимостей","Интеграция ShellCheck в рабочие процессы разработки для автоматического линтинга и тестирования"],"ar":["تكوين ShellCheck لمتطلبات مشروع محددة","تحليل سكريبتات Shell الحالية لمشاكل والثغرات","دمج ShellCheck في سير عمل التطوير للتنقيح والاختبار التلقائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ShellCheck installation and configuration","Limited to shell script analysis and linting"],"zh":["需要安装和配置ShellCheck","仅限于Shell脚本分析和linting"],"ja":["ShellCheckのインストールと設定が必要","シェルスクリプトの解析とリンティングに限定される"],"ko":["ShellCheck 설치 및 구성 필요","셸 스크립트 분석 및 린팅으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de ShellCheck","Limitado al análisis y linting de scripts de shell"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de ShellCheck","Limité à l''analyse et au linting de scripts shell"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von ShellCheck","Begrenzt auf die Analyse und das Linting von Shell-Skripten"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do ShellCheck","Limitado à análise e linting de scripts de shell"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации ShellCheck","Ограничен анализом и линтингом скриптов shell"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ShellCheck وتحديثه","محدود بتحليل سكريبتات Shell واللينتينج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
