eistungsoptimierung für Entwickler","pt":"Otimização de Desempenho para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Оптимизация Производительности для Разработчиков","ar":"تحسين الأداء لتطوير البرمجيات","en":"performance"},"description":{"zh":"性能优化技术用于提高React和React Native应用的性能","ja":"ReactとReact Nativeアプリのパフォーマンスを向上させるための最適化技術","ko":"React 및 React Native 애플리케이션의 성능을 개선하는 최적화 기술","es":"La optimización del rendimiento es crucial para aplicaciones React y React Native. Conoce las mejores prácticas para mejorar el rendimiento","fr":"L''optimisation des performances est cruciale pour les applications React et React Native. Découvrez les meilleures pratiques pour améliorer les performances","de":"Die Leistungsoptimierung ist entscheidend für React- und React-Native-Anwendungen. Erfahren Sie die besten Praktiken zur Leistungssteigerung","pt":"Otimização de desempenho para aplicativos React e React Native, com foco em padrões e práticas recomendadas para melhorar a eficiência","ru":"Оптимизация производительности для приложений React и React Native, с фокусом на шаблонах и лучших практиках для повышения эффективности","ar":"تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و React Native، مع التركيز على النماذج والأساليب الموصى بها لتحسين الكفاءة","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["并发请求限制","桥接优化","列表渲染优化","React优化模式","稳定币支持","自定义oracle"],"ja":["同時リクエストの制限","ブリッジ最適化","リストレンダリングの最適化","React最適化パターン","ステーブルコインのサポート","カスタムオラクル"],"ko":["동시 요청 제한","브릿지 최적화","리스트 렌더링 최적화","React 최적화 패턴","안정화폐 지원","사용자 지정 오라클"],"es":["Optimización de solicitudes concurrentes","Optimización del puente","Mejora del rendimiento de la lista","Uso de executeBatched","Minimización de cruces","Uso de FlashList"],"fr":["Optimisation des requêtes concurrentes","Optimisation du pont","Amélioration des performances de la liste","Utilisation de executeBatched","Minimisation des traversées","Utilisation de FlashList"],"de":["Optimierung von gleichzeitigen Anfragen","Optimierung der Brücke","Verbesserung der Listendarstellung","Verwendung von executeBatched","Minimierung von Übergängen","Verwendung von FlashList"],"pt":["Otimização de requisições concorrentes","Otimização da ponte React Native","Otimização da renderização de listas","Uso de executeBatched para requisições em lote","Minimização de cruzamentos na ponte","Uso de FlashList para renderização de listas"],"ru":["Оптимизация конкурирующих запросов","Оптимизация моста React Native","Оптимизация рендеринга списков","Использование executeBatched для пакетных запросов","Минимизация пересечений на мосту","Использование FlashList для рендеринга списков"],"ar":["تحسين الطلبات المتزامنة","تحسين جسر React Native","تحسين عرض القوائم","استخدام executeBatched للطلبات المجمعة","تقليل العبور على الجسر","استخدام FlashList لعرض القوائم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["性能优化","React优化","React Native优化","并发请求","桥接优化","列表渲染"],"ja":["パフォーマンス最適化","React最適化","React Native最適化","同時リクエスト","ブリッジ最適化","リストレンダリング"],"ko":["성능 최적화","React 최적화","React Native 최적화","동시 요청","브릿지 최적화","리스트 렌더링"],"es":["optimización de rendimiento","React","React Native","desarrollo de aplicaciones","mejora del rendimiento","patrones de optimización","prácticas recomendadas"],"fr":["optimisation des performances","React","React Native","développement d''applications","amélioration des performances","modèles d''optimisation","meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Leistungsoptimierung","React","React Native","Anwendungsentwicklung","Leistungsverbesserung","Optimierungsmuster","Best Practices"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho","react","react native","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","padrões de otimização","práticas recomendadas","requisições concorrentes","ponte react native","renderização de listas"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности","react","react native","разработка приложений","шаблоны оптимизации","лучшие практики","конкурирующие запросы","мост react native","рендеринг списков"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","react","react native","تطوير البرمجيات","نماذج تحسين","أساليب موصى بها","الطلبات المتزامنة","جسر react native","عرض القوائم"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"performance","description":"Performance optimization guidelines for React/React Native applications. Use when optimizing app performance, fixing UI freezes/lag, reducing re-renders, handling concurrent operations, or analyzing performance bottlenecks. Triggers on performance, optimization, optimize, slow, lag, freeze, hang, jank, stutter, memory, leak, concurrent, batching, batch, memoization, memo, bridge, windowSize, contentVisibility, FlashList, re-render, fps, tti, bundle.","bodyPreview":"# Performance Optimization\n\nPerformance optimization patterns and best practices for React/React Native applications.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Category | Key Optimization | When to Use |\n|----------|------------------|-------------|\n| **Concurrent Requests** | Limit to 3-5, use `executeBatched` | Multiple API calls, network-heavy operations |\n| **Bridge Optimization** | Minimize crossings, batch data | React Native bridge overhead, iOS/Android |\n| **List Rendering** | FlashList, windowSize={5}, co","body":"# Performance Optimization\n\nPerformance optimization patterns and best practices for React/React Native applications.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Category | Key Optimization | When to Use |\n|----------|------------------|-------------|\n| **Concurrent Requests** | Limit to 3-5, use `executeBatched` | Multiple API calls, network-heavy operations |\n| **Bridge Optimization** | Minimize crossings, batch data | React Native bridge overhead, iOS/Android |\n| **List Rendering** | FlashList, windowSize={5}, content-visibility | Lists with 100+ items |\n| **Memoization** | memo, useMemo, useCallback | Expensive computations, prevent re-renders |\n| **Heavy Operations** | InteractionManager, setTimeout | UI blocking operations |\n\n## Critical Performance Rules\n\n### ❌ FORBIDDEN: Too Many Concurrent Requests\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ BAD - Can freeze UI with 15+ requests\nconst requests = items.map(item => fetchData(item));\nawait Promise.all(requests);\n```\n\n### ✅ CORRECT: Batched Execution with Concurrency Limit\n\n```typescript\nasync function executeBatched<T>(\n  tasks: Array<() => Promise<T>>,\n  concurrency = 3,\n): Promise<Array<PromiseSettledResult<T>>> {\n  const results: Array<PromiseSettledResult<T>> = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < tasks.length; i += concurrency) {\n    const batch = tasks.slice(i, i + concurrency);\n    const batchResults = await Promise.allSettled(\n      batch.map((task) => task()),\n    );\n    results.push(...batchResults);\n  }\n  return results;\n}\n\nconst tasks = items.map(item => () => fetchData(item));\nawait executeBatched(tasks, 3); // Max 3 concurrent\n```\n\n## 🚨 Built-in Optimizations\n\n**Already Optimized - NO ACTION NEEDED:**\n\n| Component | Optimization | Details |\n|-----------|--------------|---------|\n| `ListView` | `windowSize={5}` | Auto-limits visible items |\n| `Tabs` | `contentVisibility: ''hidden''` | Hides inactive tabs |\n| `Dialog` | `contentVisibility: ''hidden''` | Hides when closed |\n\n## Detailed Guide\n\nFor comprehensive performance optimization strategies, see [performance.md](references/rules/performance.md).\n\nTopics covered:\n- Concurrent request control\n- React Native bridge optimization\n- Heavy operations offloading\n- List rendering (windowSize, FlashList, content-visibility)\n- Memoization & callbacks\n- State updates optimization\n- Image optimization\n- Async operations & race conditions\n- Real-world iOS AppHang case study\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `/coding-patterns` - General coding patterns and conventions\n- `/sentry-analysis` - Sentry error analysis (includes performance issues)\n- `/react-best-practices` - React/React Native optimizations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:38:52.663Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents optimizing React and React Native applications, needing expertise in concurrent requests, bridge optimization, and list rendering.","zh":"适用于优化 React 和 React Native 应用程序的 AI 代理，需要在并发请求、桥接优化和列表渲染方面的专业知识。","ja":"React と React Native アプリケーションの最適化に適した AI エージェントで、並列リクエスト、ブリッジ最適化、リストレンダリングの専門知識が必要です。","ko":"React와 React Native 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 데 적합한 AI 에이전트로, 병렬 요청, 브리지 최적화 및 목록 렌더링에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que optimizan aplicaciones de React y React Native, que necesitan experiencia en solicitudes concurrentes, optimización de puentes y renderizado de listas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA qui optimisent les applications React et React Native, ayant besoin d''expertise dans les requêtes concurrentes, l''optimisation des ponts et le rendu de listes.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die React- und React-Native-Anwendungen optimieren, die Erfahrung in gleichzeitigen Anfragen, Brückenchoptimierung und Listendarstellung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA que otimizam aplicações React e React Native, necessitando de especialização em requisições concorrentes, otimização de ponte e renderização de lista.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, оптимизирующих приложения React и React Native, требующих опыта в области параллельных запросов, оптимизации моста и отображения списка.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكية التي تحسن تطبيقات React و React Native، تحتاج إلى خبرة في الطلبات المتزامنة وتحسين الجسر وتصيير القائمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize application performance by leveraging techniques like executeBatched for concurrent requests, minimizing bridge crossings, and utilizing FlashList for efficient list rendering, resulting in enhanced user experience and reduced latency.","zh":"通过利用 executeBatched 等技术来优化并发请求、最小化桥接开销、利用 FlashList 进行高效的列表渲染，从而增强用户体验和减少延迟，赋予代理优化应用程序性能的能力。","ja":"executeBatched などのテクニックを使用して並列リクエストを最適化し、ブリッジのオーバーヘッドを最小限に抑え、FlashList を使用して効率的なリストレンダリングを行うことで、ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上と遅延の削減を実現し、エージェントにアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する能力を付与します。","ko":"병렬 요청을 최적화하고, 브리지를 최소화하며, FlashList를 사용하여 효율적인 목록 렌더링을 выпол림으로써, 사용자 경험을 향상시키고 지연을 줄여주는 executeBatched와 같은 기술을 활용하여, 에이전트가 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación utilizando técnicas como executeBatched para solicitudes concurrentes, minimizando los cruces de puentes y utilizando FlashList para un renderizado de listas eficiente, lo que resulta en una experiencia del usuario mejorada y una latencia reducida.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances de l''application en utilisant des techniques comme executeBatched pour les requêtes concurrentes, en minimisant les passages de ponts et en utilisant FlashList pour un rendu de listes efficace, ce qui se traduit par une expérience utilisateur améliorée et une latence réduite.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Anwendungsleistung zu optimieren, indem sie Techniken wie executeBatched für gleichzeitige Anfragen, Minimierung von Brückendurchgängen und Verwendung von FlashList für effizientes Listendarstellen verwenden, was zu einer verbesserten Benutzererfahrung und reduzierter Latenz führt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho da aplicação utilizando técnicas como executeBatched para requisições concorrentes, minimizando as travessias de ponte e utilizando FlashList para uma renderização de lista eficiente, resultando em uma experiência do usuário aprimorada e latência reduzida.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать производительность приложения, используя методы, такие как executeBatched для параллельных запросов, минимизируя переходы через мост и используя FlashList для эффективного отображения списка, что приводит к улучшению пользовательского опыта и снижению задержки.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين أداء التطبيق باستخدام تقنيات مثل executeBatched للطلبات المتزامنة وتقليل عبور الجسر واستخدام FlashList لتصيير قائمة فعال، مما يؤدي إلى تجربة مستخدم محسنة وتأخير مخفض."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing concurrent API requests for faster data fetching","Improving React Native performance by minimizing bridge overhead","Enhancing list rendering efficiency with FlashList and windowSize optimization"],"zh":["优化并发 API 请求以实现更快的数据获取","通过最小化桥接开销来提高 React Native 性能","使用 FlashList 和窗口大小优化来提高列表渲染效率"],"ja":["並列 API リクエストを最適化してデータ取得を高速化する","ブリッジのオーバーヘッドを最小限に抑えることで React Native のパフォーマンスを向上させる","FlashList とウィンドウサイズの最適化を使用してリストレンダリングの効率を高める"],"ko":["병렬 API 요청을 최적화하여 데이터 가져오기를 더 빠르게 함","브리지를 최소화하여 React Native 성능을 향상시키기","FlashList와 창 크기 최적화를 사용하여 목록 렌더링 효율을 높임"],"es":["Optimizar las solicitudes de API concurrentes para una recuperación de datos más rápida","Mejorar el rendimiento de React Native minimizando la sobrecarga del puente","Mejorar la eficiencia del renderizado de listas con FlashList y optimización de windowSize"],"fr":["Optimiser les requêtes API concurrentes pour un récupération de données plus rapide","Améliorer les performances de React Native en minimisant la surcharge du pont","Améliorer l''efficacité du rendu de listes avec FlashList et l''optimisation de windowSize"],"de":["Optimieren von gleichzeitigen API-Anfragen für eine schnellere Datenerfassung","Verbesserung der Leistung von React Native durch Minimierung der Brückenüberlastung","Verbesserung der Effizienz des Listendarstellens mit FlashList und windowSize-Optimierung"],"pt":["Otimização de requisições de API concorrentes para busca de dados mais rápida","Melhoria do desempenho do React Native minimizando a sobrecarga da ponte","Melhoria da eficiência de renderização de lista com FlashList e otimização do tamanho da janela"],"ru":["Оптимизация параллельных запросов API для более быстрой загрузки данных","Улучшение производительности React Native за счет минимизации накладных расходов на мост","Повышение эффективности отображения списка с помощью FlashList и оптимизации размера окна"],"ar":["تحسين الطلبات المتزامنة لبروتوكول_API لجلب البيانات بشكل أسرع","تحسين أداء React Native من خلال تقليل عبور الجسر","تحسين كفاءة تصيير القائمة باستخدام FlashList وتحسين حجم النافذة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or React Native application context","Limited to optimization of specific performance categories (concurrent requests, bridge optimization, list rendering)"],"zh":["需要 React 或 React Native 应用程序上下文","仅限于特定性能类别（并发请求、桥接优化、列表渲染）的优化"],"ja":["React または React Native アプリケーションのコンテキストが必要","特定のパフォーマンスカテゴリ（並列リクエスト、ブリッジ最適化、リストレンダリング）のみの最適化に限定される"],"ko":["React 또는 React Native 애플리케이션 컨텍스트가 필요함","특정 성능 카테고리(병렬 요청, 브리지 최적화, 목록 렌더링)のみ 최적화에 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un contexto de aplicación de React o React Native","Limitado a la optimización de categorías de rendimiento específicas (solicitudes concurrentes, optimización de puentes, renderizado de listas)"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte d''application React ou React Native","Limité à l''optimisation de catégories de performances spécifiques (requêtes concurrentes, optimisation des ponts, rendu de listes)"],"de":["Benötigt einen React- oder React-Native-Anwendungskontext","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung spezifischer Leistungskategorien (gleichzeitige Anfragen, Brückenchoptimierung, Listendarstellung)"],"pt":["Exige contexto de aplicação React ou React Native","Limitado à otimização de categorias de desempenho específicas (requisições concorrentes, otimização de ponte, renderização de lista)"],"ru":["Требует контекста приложения React или React Native","Ограничен оптимизацией определенных категорий производительности (параллельные запросы, оптимизация моста, отображение списка)"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تطبيق React أو React Native","محدود بتحسين فئات الأداء المحددة (الطلبات المتزامنة وتحسين الجسر وتصيير القائمة)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('aiyuekuang/LLMProxy/git-workflow', 'community', 'aiyuekuang', 'LLMProxy', 'aiyuekuang/LLMProxy', 'git-workflow', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z', '2026-02-18T12:38:58.979Z', NULL, '{"id":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy/git-workflow","name":"git-workflow","description":{"zh":"Git 工作流程是版本控制的关键，包括提交消息、分支策略和 GitHub 协作","ja":"Git ワークフローはバージョン管理の重要な要素であり、コミットメッセージ、ブランチ戦略、GitHub コラボレーションを含みます","ko":"Git 작업 흐름은 버전 관리의 핵심입니다. 커밋 메시지, 브랜치 전략, GitHub 협력을 포함합니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo Git es fundamental para el control de versiones y la colaboración en proyectos de desarrollo. Aprende a utilizarlo de manera efectiva.","fr":"Le flux de travail Git est essentiel pour le contrôle de version et la collaboration dans les projets de développement. Apprenez à l''utiliser de manière efficace.","de":"Der Git-Workflow ist für die Versionskontrolle und die Zusammenarbeit in Entwicklungsprojekten von entscheidender Bedeutung. Lernen Sie, ihn effektiv zu nutzen.","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho Git é uma conjunto de práticas para controle de versão, estratégias de branch e colaboração no GitHub","ru":"Рабочий процесс Git - это набор практик для контроля версий, стратегий веток и сотрудничества на GitHub","ar":"تدفق عمل Git هو مجموعة من الممارسات لإدارة الإصدارات و استراتيجيات الفروع و التعاون على GitHub","en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE). LLMProxy handles both modes out of the box, with zero buffering on streams, intelligent load balancing, and OpenA..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Git 工作流程最佳实践","ja":"Git ワークフローのベストプラクティス","ko":"Git 작업 흐름 최적화","es":"Flujo de Trabajo Git: Mejores Prácticas","fr":"Flux de Travail Git : Meilleures Pratiques","de":"Git-Workflow: Best Practices","pt":"Fluxo de Trabalho Git: Práticas de Controle de Versão","ru":"Рабочий процесс Git: лучшие практики контроля версий","ar":"تدفق عمل Git: أفضل الممارسات لإدارة الإصدارات","en":"git-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"Git 工作流程是版本控制的关键，包括提交消息、分支策略和 GitHub 协作","ja":"Git ワークフローはバージョン管理の重要な要素であり、コミットメッセージ、ブランチ戦略、GitHub コラボレーションを含みます","ko":"Git 작업 흐름은 버전 관리의 핵심입니다. 커밋 메시지, 브랜치 전략, GitHub 협력을 포함합니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo Git es fundamental para el control de versiones y la colaboración en proyectos de desarrollo. Aprende a utilizarlo de manera efectiva.","fr":"Le flux de travail Git est essentiel pour le contrôle de version et la collaboration dans les projets de développement. Apprenez à l''utiliser de manière effi...","de":"Der Git-Workflow ist für die Versionskontrolle und die Zusammenarbeit in Entwicklungsprojekten von entscheidender Bedeutung. Lernen Sie, ihn effektiv zu nutzen.","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho Git é uma conjunto de práticas para controle de versão, estratégias de branch e colaboração no GitHub","ru":"Рабочий процесс Git - это набор практик для контроля версий, стратегий веток и сотрудничества на GitHub","ar":"تدفق عمل Git هو مجموعة من الممارسات لإدارة الإصدارات و استراتيجيات الفروع و التعاون على GitHub","en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via..."},"definition":{"en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE). LLMProxy handles both modes out of the box, with zero buffering on streams, intelligent load balancing, and OpenAI-compatible API routing."},"features":{"zh":["提交消息最佳实践","分支策略管理","GitHub 协作工具","合并冲突解决","Git 历史管理"],"ja":["コミットメッセージのベストプラクティス","ブランチ戦略の管理","GitHub コラボレーションツール","マージコンフリクトの解決","Git 歴史の管理"],"ko":["커밋 메시지 최적화","브랜치 전략 관리","GitHub 협력 도구","병합 충돌 해결","Git 기록 관리"],"es":["Mejores prácticas para commits y mensajes","Estrategias de ramificación y fusión","Colaboración en GitHub y revisión de solicitudes de extracción","Resolución de conflictos de fusión y gestión del historial de Git","Formato de commits convencionales"],"fr":["Meilleures pratiques pour les commits et les messages","Stratégies de branchement et de fusion","Collaboration sur GitHub et examen des demandes d''extraction","Résolution des conflits de fusion et gestion de l''historique Git","Format de commits conventionnels"],"de":["Best Practices für Commits und Nachrichten","Branching- und Merge-Strategien","Zusammenarbeit auf GitHub und Überprüfung von Pull-Requests","Auflösung von Merge-Konflikten und Git-Historie-Verwaltung","Konventioneller Commit-Format"],"pt":["Commits com mensagens apropriadas","Gerenciamento de branches","Criação e revisão de pull requests","Resolução de conflitos de merge","Gerenciamento de histórico Git"],"ru":["Коммиты с соответствующими сообщениями","Управление ветками","Создание и рассмотрение запросов на слияние","Разрешение конфликтов слияния","Управление историей Git"],"ar":["التعليقات الملتزمة بالرسائل المناسبة","إدارة الفروع","إنشاء ومراجعة طلبات الدمج","حل النزاعات المتعلقة بالدمج","إدارة تاريخ Git"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 工作流程","版本控制","提交消息","分支策略","GitHub 协作","Git 最佳实践"],"ja":["Git ワークフロー","バージョン管理","コミットメッセージ","ブランチ戦略","GitHub コラボレーション","Git ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Git 작업 흐름","버전 관리","커밋 메시지","브랜치 전략","GitHub 협력","Git 최적화"],"es":["flujo de trabajo Git","control de versiones","colaboración en GitHub","ramificación y fusión","commits y mensajes","resolución de conflictos","gestión del historial de Git","desarrollo de software","prácticas de desarrollo"],"fr":["flux de travail Git","contrôle de version","collaboration sur GitHub","branchement et fusion","commits et messages","résolution des conflits","gestion de l''historique Git","développement de logiciels","pratiques de développement"],"de":["Git-Workflow","Versionskontrolle","Zusammenarbeit auf GitHub","Branching und Merge","Commits und Nachrichten","Auflösung von Konflikten","Git-Historie-Verwaltung","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungspraktiken"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho Git","controle de versão","estratégias de branch","colaboração no GitHub","commits","pull requests","merge conflicts"],"ru":["рабочий процесс Git","контроль версий","стратегии веток","сотрудничество на GitHub","коммиты","запросы на слияние","конфликты слияния"],"ar":["تدفق عمل Git","إدارة الإصدارات","استراتيجيات الفروع","التعاون على GitHub","التعليقات الملتزمة","طلبات الدمج","نزاعات الدمج"]}},"owner":"aiyuekuang","repo":"LLMProxy","repoPath":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-workflow","description":"Git and GitHub workflow best practices. Use for commits, branches, PRs, merging, and version control operations.","bodyPreview":"# Git Workflow Skill\n\nGit best practices for version control, branching strategies, and GitHub collaboration.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating commits with proper messages\n- Managing branches\n- Creating and reviewing pull requests\n- Resolving merge conflicts\n- Git history management\n\n---\n\n# 📝 Commit Messages\n\n## Conventional Commits Format\n\n```\n<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer(s)]\n```\n\n## Commit Types\n\n| Type | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `feat` | N","body":"# Git Workflow Skill\n\nGit best practices for version control, branching strategies, and GitHub collaboration.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating commits with proper messages\n- Managing branches\n- Creating and reviewing pull requests\n- Resolving merge conflicts\n- Git history management\n\n---\n\n# 📝 Commit Messages\n\n## Conventional Commits Format\n\n```\n<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer(s)]\n```\n\n## Commit Types\n\n| Type | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `feat` | New feature |\n| `fix` | Bug fix |\n| `docs` | Documentation only |\n| `style` | Formatting, no code change |\n| `refactor` | Code restructuring |\n| `perf` | Performance improvement |\n| `test` | Adding/updating tests |\n| `chore` | Maintenance tasks |\n| `ci` | CI/CD changes |\n| `build` | Build system changes |\n\n## Examples\n\n```bash\n# Feature\nfeat(auth): add JWT token refresh mechanism\n\n# Bug fix\nfix(proxy): resolve connection leak in upstream handler\n\n# With body\nfeat(api): add rate limiting for /v1/chat endpoint\n\nImplements token bucket algorithm with configurable\nrate and burst size. Limits are per API key.\n\nCloses #123\n\n# Breaking change\nfeat(config)!: change yaml config structure\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: config.yaml format changed.\nSee migration guide in docs/migration-v2.md\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🌳 Branching Strategy\n\n## Git Flow\n\n```\nmain (production)\n  │\n  └── develop (integration)\n        │\n        ├── feature/user-auth\n        ├── feature/dashboard\n        ├── fix/login-bug\n        └── release/v1.2.0\n              │\n              └── hotfix/critical-fix → main\n```\n\n## Branch Naming\n\n```bash\n# Features\nfeature/add-user-authentication\nfeature/JIRA-123-dashboard-charts\n\n# Bug fixes\nfix/login-validation-error\nfix/JIRA-456-memory-leak\n\n# Releases\nrelease/v1.2.0\nrelease/2024-01-sprint\n\n# Hotfixes\nhotfix/critical-security-patch\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔄 Pull Request Workflow\n\n## Creating a PR\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create feature branch\ngit checkout -b feature/my-feature develop\n\n# 2. Make commits\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"feat: implement feature\"\n\n# 3. Push and create PR\ngit push -u origin feature/my-feature\n\n# 4. Create PR via GitHub CLI\ngh pr create --title \"feat: implement feature\" \\\n  --body \"Description of changes\" \\\n  --base develop\n```\n\n## PR Template\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\nBrief description of changes\n\n## Type of Change\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [ ] New feature\n- [ ] Breaking change\n- [ ] Documentation update\n\n## Changes Made\n- Change 1\n- Change 2\n\n## Testing\n- [ ] Unit tests added/updated\n- [ ] Integration tests pass\n- [ ] Manual testing completed\n\n## Screenshots (if UI changes)\n\n## Checklist\n- [ ] Code follows style guidelines\n- [ ] Self-reviewed\n- [ ] Comments added for complex logic\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n## Merging Strategies\n\n```bash\n# Squash merge (recommended for features)\n# Combines all commits into one clean commit\ngh pr merge --squash\n\n# Merge commit (for releases)\n# Preserves full history\ngh pr merge --merge\n\n# Rebase (for small changes)\n# Linear history, no merge commit\ngh pr merge --rebase\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔧 Common Git Operations\n\n## Stashing Changes\n\n```bash\n# Save current work\ngit stash save \"WIP: feature description\"\n\n# List stashes\ngit stash list\n\n# Apply most recent stash\ngit stash pop\n\n# Apply specific stash\ngit stash apply stash@{2}\n\n# Clear all stashes\ngit stash clear\n```\n\n## Rebasing\n\n```bash\n# Interactive rebase last 5 commits\ngit rebase -i HEAD~5\n\n# Rebase onto main\ngit rebase main\n\n# Continue after resolving conflicts\ngit rebase --continue\n\n# Abort rebase\ngit rebase --abort\n```\n\n## Cherry-picking\n\n```bash\n# Apply specific commit to current branch\ngit cherry-pick abc123\n\n# Cherry-pick without committing\ngit cherry-pick --no-commit abc123\n\n# Cherry-pick range\ngit cherry-pick abc123..def456\n```\n\n## Undoing Changes\n\n```bash\n# Undo last commit (keep changes)\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n\n# Undo last commit (discard changes)\ngit reset --hard HEAD~1\n\n# Revert a commit (creates new commit)\ngit revert abc123\n\n# Restore file to last commit\ngit checkout -- filename\n\n# Unstage file\ngit reset HEAD filename\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔀 Merge Conflict Resolution\n\n## Process\n\n```bash\n# 1. Update your branch\ngit fetch origin\ngit rebase origin/main\n\n# 2. If conflicts occur, resolve them\n# Edit conflicting files, then:\ngit add resolved-file.go\ngit rebase --continue\n\n# 3. Force push (if rebased)\ngit push --force-with-lease\n```\n\n## Conflict Markers\n\n```\n<<<<<<< HEAD\nYour changes\n=======\nTheir changes\n>>>>>>> feature-branch\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n- Keep changes focused and PRs small\n- Rebase frequently to avoid large conflicts\n- Use `git mergetool` for complex conflicts\n- Communicate with team before force pushing\n\n---\n\n# 📊 Git History Management\n\n## Viewing History\n\n```bash\n# Pretty log\ngit log --oneline --graph --all\n\n# Show changes in commits\ngit log -p -3\n\n# Search commits by message\ngit log --grep=\"fix\"\n\n# Show commits by author\ngit log --author=\"name\"\n\n# Show files changed\ngit log --stat\n```\n\n## Finding Bugs with Bisect\n\n```bash\n# Start bisect\ngit bisect start\n\n# Mark current as bad\ngit bisect bad\n\n# Mark known good commit\ngit bisect good v1.0.0\n\n# Git checks out middle commit, test it, then:\ngit bisect good  # or git bisect bad\n\n# When done\ngit bisect reset\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🏷️ Tagging Releases\n\n```bash\n# Create annotated tag\ngit tag -a v1.2.0 -m \"Release version 1.2.0\"\n\n# Push tags\ngit push origin v1.2.0\ngit push --tags\n\n# List tags\ngit tag -l \"v1.*\"\n\n# Delete tag\ngit tag -d v1.2.0\ngit push origin --delete v1.2.0\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📚 References\n\n- [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/)\n- [Git Flow](https://nvie.com/posts/a-successful-git-branching-model/)\n- [fvadicamo/dev-agent-skills](https://github.com/fvadicamo/dev-agent-skills)\n- [obra/finishing-a-development-branch](https://github.com/obra/superpowers/blob/main/skills/finishing-a-development-branch/SKILL.md)\n- [obra/using-git-worktrees](https://github.com/obra/superpowers/blob/main/skills/using-git-worktrees/SKILL.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:38:58.979Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined version control and collaboration workflows with Git","zh":"适用于需要简化版本控制和 Git 协作工作流的开发代理","ja":"開発エージェントが Git を使用してバージョン管理とコラボレーションワークフローを簡素化する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"Git를 사용하여 버전 관리 및 협업 워크플로를 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren un control de versiones y flujos de trabajo de colaboración optimizados con Git","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de version et des flux de travail de collaboration rationalisés avec Git","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine optimierte Versionskontrolle und Collaborations-Workflows mit Git benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem controle de versão e fluxos de trabalho de colaboração simplificados com Git","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих упрощенного контроля версий и рабочих процессов сотрудничества с Git","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب التحكم في الإصدار والعمل المشترك المُ简َّة مع Git"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage commits with conventional commit formats, intelligently handle branching strategies, and facilitate seamless GitHub collaboration using Server-Sent Events (SSE) for real-time updates, along with intelligent load balancing and OpenAPI compatibility","zh":"赋予代理管理提交的能力，使用标准提交格式，智能处理分支策略，并使用 Server-Sent Events (SSE) 实现 GitHub 实时更新，同时具有智能负载均衡和 OpenAPI 兼容性","ja":"エージェントがコミットを管理できるようにし、従来のコミット形式を使用し、分岐戦略を賢く処理し、Server-Sent Events (SSE) を使用して GitHub でリアルタイム更新を可能にし、インテリジェントな負荷分散と OpenAPI 互換性も備える","ko":"에이전트가 커밋을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 표준 커밋 형식을 사용하고, 분기 전략을智能하게 처리하며, Server-Sent Events (SSE)를 사용하여 GitHub에서 실시간 업데이트를 가능하게 하며,智能한 부하 분산 및 OpenAPI 호환성을 갖추고 있음","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar los commits con formatos de commit convencionales, manejar inteligentemente las estrategias de ramificación y facilitar una colaboración sin problemas en GitHub utilizando eventos enviados por el servidor (SSE) para actualizaciones en tiempo real, junto con un equilibrio de carga inteligente y compatibilidad con OpenAPI","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les commits avec des formats de commit conventionnels, de gérer de manière intelligente les stratégies de branchement et de faciliter une collaboration sans problème sur GitHub en utilisant des événements envoyés par le serveur (SSE) pour des mises à jour en temps réel, ainsi qu''un équilibrage de charge intelligent et une compatibilité avec OpenAPI","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Commits mit konventionellen Commit-Formaten zu verwalten, Verzweigungsstrategien intelligent zu handhaben und eine nahtlose GitHub-Zusammenarbeit mithilfe von Server-Sent Events (SSE) für Echtzeit-Updates sowie intelligente Lastverteilung und OpenAPI-Kompatibilität zu erleichtern","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar commits com formatos de commit convencionais, lidar inteligentemente com estratégias de ramificação e facilitar a colaboração sem problemas no GitHub usando Eventos Enviados pelo Servidor (SSE) para atualizações em tempo real, juntamente com balanceamento de carga inteligente e compatibilidade com OpenAPI","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность управлять коммитами с использованием стандартных форматов коммитов, интеллектуально обрабатывать стратегии ветвления и обеспечивать бесперебойное сотрудничество на GitHub с использованием событий, отправляемых сервером (SSE), для обновлений в реальном времени, а также интеллектуального балансирования нагрузки и совместимости с OpenAPI","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة الإلتزامات بطرق التزامات تقليدية، ومعالجة استراتيجيات الفرع بذكاء، وتسهيل التعاون السلس على منصة GitHub باستخدام أحداث مرسلة من الخادم (SSE) للحصول على تحديثات في الوقت الفعلي، إلى جانب توازن الحمل الذكي ومدى توافقها مع OpenAPI"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit messages with proper formatting","Managing and reviewing pull requests efficiently","Resolving merge conflicts using Git history management","Implementing consistent branching strategies for collaborative projects"],"zh":["自动化提交消息以适当的格式","高效地管理和审查拉取请求","使用 Git 历史记录管理解决合并冲突","为协作项目实施一致的分支策略"],"ja":["適切な形式でのコミットメッセージの自動化","プルリクエストの効率的な管理とレビュー","Git の履歴管理を使用してマージコンフリクトを解決する","共同プロジェクトに一貫したブランチ戦