","Estándares de código personalizables","Integración con herramientas de CI","Análisis de código estático"],"fr":["Linting automatique","Documentation de code","Normes de code personnalisables","Intégration avec des outils de CI","Analyse de code statique"],"de":["Automatisches Linting","Code-Dokumentation","Anpassbare Code-Standards","Integration mit CI-Tools","Statischer Code-Analyse"],"pt":["Linting automático","Documentação de código","Padrões de codificação","Verificação de tipo","Estrutura de pastas","Suporte a internacionalização"],"ru":["Автоматический linting","Документация кода","Стандарты кодирования","Проверка типов","Структура папок","Поддержка интернационализации"],"ar":["linting آلي","توثيق الكود","معايير البرمجة","فحص النوع","هيكل المجلدات","دعم التدويل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码质量","Lint","TypeScript","代码标准","预提交工作流","开发效率","代码可读性"],"ja":["コード品質","Lint","TypeScript","コード規約","プレコミットワークフロー","開発効率","コード可読性"],"ko":["코드 품질","Lint","TypeScript","코드 표준","预提交 워크플로우","개발 효율성","코드 가독성"],"es":["calidad de código","linting","documentación de código","estándares de código","desarrollo de software","mejora de código","análisis de código","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["qualité de code","linting","documentation de code","normes de code","développement de logiciels","amélioration de code","analyse de code","outils de développement"],"de":["Code-Qualität","Linting","Code-Dokumentation","Code-Standards","Softwareentwicklung","Code-Optimierung","Code-Analyse","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["qualidade de código","linting","documentação","padrões de codificação","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","práticas de codificação","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["качество кода","linting","документация","стандарты кодирования","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","практики кодирования","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["جودة الكود","linting","توثيق","معايير البرمجة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","ممارسات البرمجة","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-quality","description":"Code quality standards and best practices. Use when fixing lint warnings, running pre-commit tasks, handling unused variables, writing comments, or ensuring code quality. All comments must be in English. Triggers on lint, linting, eslint, oxlint, tsc, type check, unused variable, comment, documentation, spellcheck, code quality, pre-commit, yarn lint.","bodyPreview":"# Code Quality\n\nLinting, documentation, and general code quality standards.\n\n## Lint Commands\n\n```bash\n# Pre-commit (fast, only staged files)\nyarn lint:staged\nyarn tsc:staged\n\n# CI only (full project check)\nyarn lint        # Comprehensive: TypeScript, ESLint, folder structure, i18n\nyarn lint:only   # Quick: oxlint only\nyarn tsc:only    # Full type check\n```\n\n**Note:** `yarn lint` is for CI only. For pre-commit, always use `yarn lint:staged`.\n\n## Pre-Commit Workflow\n\nFor fast pre-commit validati","body":"# Code Quality\n\nLinting, documentation, and general code quality standards.\n\n## Lint Commands\n\n```bash\n# Pre-commit (fast, only staged files)\nyarn lint:staged\nyarn tsc:staged\n\n# CI only (full project check)\nyarn lint        # Comprehensive: TypeScript, ESLint, folder structure, i18n\nyarn lint:only   # Quick: oxlint only\nyarn tsc:only    # Full type check\n```\n\n**Note:** `yarn lint` is for CI only. For pre-commit, always use `yarn lint:staged`.\n\n## Pre-Commit Workflow\n\nFor fast pre-commit validation:\n```bash\n# Lint only modified files (recommended)\nyarn lint:staged\n\n# Or with type check\nyarn lint:staged && yarn tsc:staged\n```\n\n## Common Lint Fixes\n\n```typescript\n// Unused variable - prefix with underscore\nconst { used, unused } = obj;     // ❌ Error: ''unused'' is defined but never used\nconst { used, unused: _unused } = obj;  // ✅ OK\n\n// Unused parameter - prefix with underscore\nfunction foo(used: string, unused: number) {}     // ❌ Error\nfunction foo(used: string, _unused: number) {}    // ✅ OK\n\n// Floating promise - add void or await\nsomeAsyncFunction();        // ❌ Error: Promises must be awaited\nvoid someAsyncFunction();   // ✅ OK (fire-and-forget)\nawait someAsyncFunction();  // ✅ OK (wait for result)\n```\n\n## Language Requirements\n\n**All comments must be written in English:**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: English comment\n// Calculate the total balance including pending transactions\n\n// ❌ BAD: Chinese comment\n// 计算总余额，包括待处理的交易\n\n// ✅ GOOD: JSDoc in English\n/**\n * Fetches user balance from the blockchain.\n * @param address - The wallet address to query\n * @returns The balance in native token units\n */\nasync function fetchBalance(address: string): Promise<bigint> {\n  // ...\n}\n```\n\n## When to Comment\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Explain non-obvious logic\n// Use 1.5x gas limit to account for estimation variance on this chain\nconst gasLimit = estimatedGas * 1.5n;\n\n// ✅ GOOD: Explain business logic\n// Premium users get 50% discount on transaction fees\nconst fee = isPremium ? baseFee * 0.5 : baseFee;\n\n// ❌ BAD: Obvious comment\n// Set the value to 5\nconst value = 5;\n```\n\n## Development Principles\n\n### Single Responsibility\nEach function should perform a single, atomic task:\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Single responsibility\nasync function fetchUserBalance(userId: string): Promise<Balance> {\n  const user = await getUser(userId);\n  return await getBalanceForAddress(user.address);\n}\n\n// ❌ BAD: Multiple responsibilities\nasync function fetchUserBalanceAndUpdateUI(userId: string) {\n  const user = await getUser(userId);\n  const balance = await getBalanceForAddress(user.address);\n  setBalanceState(balance);\n  showNotification(''Balance updated'');\n  logAnalytics(''balance_fetched'');\n}\n```\n\n### Avoid Over-Abstraction\nDon''t create helpers for one-time operations:\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ BAD: Over-abstracted\nconst createUserFetcher = (config: Config) => {\n  return (userId: string) => {\n    return fetchWithConfig(config, `/users/${userId}`);\n  };\n};\nconst fetchUser = createUserFetcher(defaultConfig);\nconst user = await fetchUser(userId);\n\n// ✅ GOOD: Simple and direct\nconst user = await fetch(`/api/users/${userId}`).then(r => r.json());\n```\n\n## Detailed Guides\n\n### Code Quality Standards\nSee [code-quality.md](references/rules/code-quality.md) for comprehensive guidelines:\n- Linting commands and pre-commit workflow\n- Comment and documentation standards\n- Language requirements (English only)\n- Single responsibility principle\n- Avoiding over-abstraction\n- Consistent naming conventions\n- Code quality checklist\n\n### Fixing Lint Warnings\nSee [fix-lint.md](references/rules/fix-lint.md) for complete lint fix workflow:\n- Analyzing lint warnings\n- Categorizing lint errors\n- Common fix patterns by category\n- Spellcheck fixes\n- Unused variable/parameter handling\n- Automated fix strategies\n- Testing after fixes\n\n## Spellcheck\n\nIf a technical term triggers spellcheck errors:\n```bash\n# Check if word exists\ngrep -i \"yourword\" development/spellCheckerSkipWords.txt\n\n# Add if not present (ask team lead first)\necho \"yourword\" >> development/spellCheckerSkipWords.txt\n```\n\n## Checklist\n\n### Pre-commit\n- [ ] `yarn lint:staged` passes\n- [ ] `yarn tsc:staged` passes\n\n### Code Quality\n- [ ] All comments are in English\n- [ ] No commented-out code committed\n- [ ] Functions have single responsibility\n- [ ] No unnecessary abstractions\n- [ ] Consistent naming conventions\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `/sentry-analysis` - Sentry error analysis and fixes\n- `/coding-patterns` - General coding patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:39:00.004Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-focused AI Agents requiring rigorous code quality standards and automated linting workflows.","zh":"适用于专注于TypeScript的AI代理，需要严格的代码质量标准和自动化的linting工作流程。","ja":"TypeScriptに焦点を当てたAIエージェントに適しており、厳格なコード品質標準と自動化されたlintingワークフローが必要です。","ko":"TypeScript에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 엄격한 코드 품질 표준 및 자동화된 linting 워크플ロー가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial enfocados en TypeScript que requieren estrictas normas de calidad de código y flujos de trabajo de linting automatizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur TypeScript nécessitant des normes de qualité de code rigoureuses et des flux de travail de linting automatisés.","de":"Ideal für TypeScript-fokussierte KI-Agents, die strenge Codequalitätsstandards und automatisierte Linting-Workflows erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em TypeScript que exigem padrões rigorosos de qualidade de código e fluxos de trabalho de linting automatizados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на TypeScript, требующих строгих стандартов качества кода и автоматизированных рабочих процессов linting.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على TypeScript و الذين يتطلبون معايير جودة شاملة للرمز البرمجي وعمليات العمل التلقائية ل linting."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce strict code quality standards through comprehensive linting, utilizing tools like ESLint and TypeScript, and maintaining consistent folder structures and i18n support.","zh":"赋予代理人通过全面linting、利用像ESLint和TypeScript这样的工具以及保持一致的文件夹结构和i18n支持来执行严格的代码质量标准的能力。","ja":"ESLintやTypeScriptなどのツールを使用して、包括的なlintingを実行し、一貫したフォルダ構造とi18nサポートを維持することで、厳格なコード品質標準を適用するエージェントの能力を強化します。","ko":"ESLint 및 TypeScript와 같은 도구를 사용하여 포괄적인 linting을 수행하고 일관된 폴더 구조 및 i18n 지원을 유지함으로써 엄격한 코드 품질 표준을 적용할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar estrictas normas de calidad de código a través de una linting integral, utilizando herramientas como ESLint y TypeScript, y manteniendo estructuras de carpetas consistentes y soporte para i18n.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des normes de qualité de code strictes grâce à une linting complète, en utilisant des outils tels que ESLint et TypeScript, et en maintenant des structures de dossiers cohérentes et un support pour i18n.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, strenge Codequalitätsstandards durch umfassendes Linting durchzusetzen, unter Verwendung von Tools wie ESLint und TypeScript, und konsistente Ordnerstrukturen und i18n-Unterstützung aufrechtzuerhalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor padrões rigorosos de qualidade de código por meio de linting abrangente, utilizando ferramentas como ESLint e TypeScript, e mantendo estruturas de pastas consistentes e suporte a i18n.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать строгие стандарты качества кода посредством всестороннего linting, используя инструменты seperti ESLint и TypeScript, и поддерживая последовательную структуру папок и поддержку i18n.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض معايير جودة شاملة للرمز البرمجي من خلال linting شامل ، باستخدام أدوات مثل ESLint و TypeScript ، وتحافظ على هيكل مجلدات متسقة ودعم i18n."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews with yarn lint:staged","Validating TypeScript configurations with yarn tsc:only","Enforcing coding standards across large projects with yarn lint"],"zh":["使用yarn lint:staged自动执行代码审查","使用yarn tsc:only验证TypeScript配置","使用yarn lint在大型项目中执行编码标准"],"ja":["yarn lint:stagedを使用してコードレビューを自動化する","yarn tsc:onlyを使用してTypeScript構成を検証する","yarn lintを使用して大規模なプロジェクト全体でコーディング規約を適用する"],"ko":["yarn lint:staged를 사용하여 코드 리뷰를 자동화합니다.","yarn tsc:only를 사용하여 TypeScript 구성驗證","yarn lint를 사용하여 대규모 프로젝트에서 코딩 표준을 적용합니다."],"es":["Automatizar revisiones de código con yarn lint:staged","Validar configuraciones de TypeScript con yarn tsc:only","Aplicar normas de codificación en proyectos grandes con yarn lint"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code avec yarn lint:staged","Valider les configurations TypeScript avec yarn tsc:only","Appliquer les normes de codage dans de grands projets avec yarn lint"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews mit yarn lint:staged","Validieren von TypeScript-Konfigurationen mit yarn tsc:only","Durchsetzen von Codierungsstandards in großen Projekten mit yarn lint"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código com yarn lint:staged","Validar configurações do TypeScript com yarn tsc:only","Impor padrões de codificação em projetos grandes com yarn lint"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода с помощью yarn lint:staged","Проверять конфигурации TypeScript с помощью yarn tsc:only","Применять стандарты кодирования в крупных проектах с помощью yarn lint"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في مراجعة الكود مع yarn lint:staged","التحقق من إعدادات TypeScript مع yarn tsc:only","فرض معايير التشفير عبر مشاريع كبيرة مع yarn lint"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires yarn package manager","Specific to TypeScript and ESLint ecosystems"],"zh":["需要yarn包管理器","特定于TypeScript和ESLint生态系统"],"ja":["yarnパッケージマネージャーが必要","TypeScriptとESLintのエコシステムに特有"],"ko":["yarn 패키지 관리자가 필요합니다.","TypeScript 및 ESLint 생태계에 특정"],"es":["Requiere el administrador de paquetes yarn","Específico para los ecosistemas de TypeScript y ESLint"],"fr":["Nécessite le gestionnaire de paquets yarn","Spécifique aux écosystèmes TypeScript et ESLint"],"de":["Benötigt den Paketmanager yarn","Spezifisch für die Ökosysteme von TypeScript und ESLint"],"pt":["Exige o gerenciador de pacotes yarn","Específico para os ecossistemas TypeScript e ESLint"],"ru":["Требует менеджера пакетов yarn","Специфичен для экосистем TypeScript и ESLint"],"ar":["يتطلب مدير حزم yarn","محدد لأنظمة TypeScript و ESLint"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/risk-manager', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'risk-manager', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z', '2026-02-18T12:39:09.925Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/risk-manager","name":"risk-manager","description":{"zh":"风险管理器是一种合成永续期货协议，支持多种资产，包括RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数，提供高达1000倍的杠杆和稳定币抵押","ja":"リスクマネージャーは、RWA資産、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポートする合成無期限先物プロトコルであり、最大1000倍のレバレッジとスターブルコイン担保を提供する","ko":"리스크 매니저는 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원하는 합성 永续 선물 프로토콜로서 최대 1000배의 레버리지와 스테이블 코인 담보를 제공","es":"El gestor de riesgos es un protocolo de futuros perpetuos sintéticos que permite a los traders abrir posiciones apalancadas con un máximo de 1000x. Combina un oráculo personalizado, un AMM virtual y suavizado TWAP.","fr":"Le gestionnaire de risques est un protocole de futures perpétuels synthétiques qui permet aux traders d''ouvrir des positions à effet de levier avec un maximum de 1000x. Il combine un oracle personnalisé, un AMM virtuel et un lissage TWAP.","de":"Der Risikomanager ist ein synthetisches Perpetual-Futures-Protokoll, das es Tradern ermöglicht, mit einem Hebel von bis zu 1000x zu handeln. Es kombiniert einen benutzerdefinierten Oracle, ein virtuelles AMM und ein TWAP-Glättung.","pt":"O Gerenciador de Risco é um protocolo de futuros perpétuos sintéticos que suporta ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices, permitindo posições longas e curtas com alavancagem de até 1000x","ru":"Менеджер рисков - это синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов, поддерживающий активы RWA, криптовалюты, акции и индексы, позволяющий открывать длинные и короткие позиции с левериджем до 1000x","ar":"مدير المخاطر هو بروتوكول مستقبلات دائمة اصطناعي يدعم الأصول RWA والعملات المشفرة وأسهم والأسواق، ويمكن فتح مراكز طويلة وقصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000x","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"风险管理器：合成永续期货协议","ja":"リスクマネージャー：合成無期限先物プロトコル","ko":"리스크 매니저: 합성 永续 선물 프로토콜","es":"Gestor de Riesgos: Protocolo de Futuros Perpetuos Sintéticos","fr":"Gestionnaire de Risques: Protocole de Futures Perpétuels ...","de":"Risikomanager: Synthetisches Perpetual-Futures-Protokoll","pt":"Gerenciador de Risco: Protocolo de Futuros Perpétuos Sint...","ru":"Менеджер рисков: Синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов","ar":"مدير المخاطر: بروتوكول مستقبلات دائمة اصطناعي","en":"risk-manager"},"description":{"zh":"风险管理器是一种合成永续期货协议，支持多种资产，包括RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数，提供高达1000倍的杠杆和稳定币抵押","ja":"リスクマネージャーは、RWA資産、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポートする合成無期限先物プロトコルであり、最大1000倍のレバレッジとスターブルコイン担保を提供する","ko":"리스크 매니저는 RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원하는 합성 永续 선물 프로토콜로서 최대 1000배의 레버리지와 스테이블 코인 담보를 제공","es":"El gestor de riesgos es un protocolo de futuros perpetuos sintéticos que permite a los traders abrir posiciones apalancadas con un máximo de 1000x. Combina u...","fr":"Le gestionnaire de risques est un protocole de futures perpétuels synthétiques qui permet aux traders d''ouvrir des positions à effet de levier avec un maximu...","de":"Der Risikomanager ist ein synthetisches Perpetual-Futures-Protokoll, das es Tradern ermöglicht, mit einem Hebel von bis zu 1000x zu handeln. Es kombiniert ei...","pt":"O Gerenciador de Risco é um protocolo de futuros perpétuos sintéticos que suporta ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices, permitindo posições longas e cur...","ru":"Менеджер рисков - это синтетический протокол вечных фьючерсов, поддерживающий активы RWA, криптовалюты, акции и индексы, позволяющий открывать длинные и коро...","ar":"مدير المخاطر هو بروتوكول مستقبلات دائمة اصطناعي يدعم الأصول RWA والعملات المشفرة وأسهم والأسواق، ويمكن فتح مراكز طويلة وقصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000x","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["高达1000倍的杠杆","稳定币抵押","支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数","合成永续期货协议","自定义oracle和虚拟AMM","TWAP平滑"],"ja":["最大1000倍のレバレッジ","スターブルコイン担保","RWA資産、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポート","合成無期限先物プロトコル","カスタムオラクルと仮想AMM","TWAP平滑"],"ko":["최대 1000배의 레버리지","스테이블 코인 담보","RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원","합성 永续 선물 프로토콜","사용자 정의 오라클과 가상 AMM","TWAP 평활"],"es":["Soporte para activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices","Apalancamiento de hasta 1000x","Bóveda de liquidez centralizada","Oráculo personalizado y AMM virtual","Suavizado TWAP","Vaults de usuario en cadena"],"fr":["Prise en charge des actifs RWA, des crypto-monnaies, des actions et des indices","Effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x","Chambre de liquide centralisée","Oracle personnalisé et AMM virtuel","Lissage TWAP","Coffres-forts d''utilisateur en chaîne"],"de":["Unterstützung für RWA-Assets, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes","Hebel bis zu 1000x","Zentrale Liquiditätsbörse","Benutzerdefinierter Oracle und virtuelles AMM","TWAP-Glättung","Benutzervaults in der Kette"],"pt":["Suporte a ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices","Posições longas e curtas com alavancagem de até 1000x","Pricing combina oracle personalizado, Virtual AMM e suavização TWAP","Vault de liquidez centralizado","Gerenciamento de riscos de ativos financeiros"],"ru":["Поддержка активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов","Длинные и короткие позиции с левериджем до 1000x","Прайсинг объединяет индивидуальный оракул, виртуальный AMM и сглаживание TWAP","Централизованный вольт ликвидности","Управление рисками финансовых активов"],"ar":["دعم الأصول RWA والعملات المشفرة وأسهم والأسواق","مراكز طويلة وقصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000x","تسعير يجمع بين أوراكل مخصص وAMM افتراضي وتحسين TWAP","خزنة سيولة مركزية","إدارة المخاطر المالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["风险管理器","合成永续期货协议","RWA资产","加密货币","股票","指数","杠杆","稳定币抵押"],"ja":["リスクマネージャー","合成無期限先物プロトコル","RWA資産","暗号資産","株式","指数","レバレッジ","スターブルコイン担保"],"ko":["리스크 매니저","합성 永续 선물 프로토콜","RWA 자산","암호화폐","주식","지수","레버리지","스테이블 코인 담보"],"es":["gestor de riesgos","futuros perpetuos sintéticos","activos RWA","criptomonedas","acciones","índices","apalancamiento","bóveda de liquidez","oráculo personalizado","AMM virtual"],"fr":["gestionnaire de risques","futures perpétuels synthétiques","actifs RWA","crypto-monnaies","actions","indices","effet de levier","chambre de liquide","oracle personnalisé","AMM virtuel"],"de":["Risikomanager","synthetische Perpetual-Futures","RWA-Assets","Kryptowährungen","Aktien","Indizes","Hebel","Liquiditätsbörse","benutzerdefinierter Oracle","virtuelles AMM"],"pt":["gerenciamento de risco","futuros perpétuos sintéticos","ativos RWA","criptomoedas","ações","índices","alavancagem","oracle personalizado","Virtual AMM","suavização TWAP"],"ru":["управление рисками","синтетические вечные фьючерсы","активы RWA","криптовалюты","акции","индексы","леверидж","индивидуальный оракул","виртуальный AMM","сглаживание TWAP"],"ar":["إدارة المخاطر","مستقبلات دائمة اصطناعي","الأصول RWA","العملات المشفرة","أسهم","الأسواق","رافعة مالية","أوراكل مخصص","AMM افتراضي","تحسين TWAP"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"risk-manager","description":"Expert risk manager specializing in comprehensive risk assessment, mitigation strategies, and compliance frameworks. Masters risk modeling, stress testing, and regulatory compliance with focus on protecting organizations from financial, operational, and strategic risks.","bodyPreview":"You are a senior risk manager with expertise in identifying, quantifying, and mitigating enterprise risks. Your focus spans risk modeling, compliance monitoring, stress testing, and risk reporting with emphasis on protecting organizational value while enabling informed risk-taking and regulatory compliance.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for risk environment and regulatory requirements\n2. Review existing risk frameworks, controls, and exposure levels\n3. Analyze risk factors, compliance g","body":"You are a senior risk manager with expertise in identifying, quantifying, and mitigating enterprise risks. Your focus spans risk modeling, compliance monitoring, stress testing, and risk reporting with emphasis on protecting organizational value while enabling informed risk-taking and regulatory compliance.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for risk environment and regulatory requirements\n2. Review existing risk frameworks, controls, and exposure levels\n3. Analyze risk factors, compliance gaps, and mitigation opportunities\n4. Implement comprehensive risk management solutions\nRisk management checklist:\n- Risk models validated thoroughly\n- Stress tests comprehensive completely\n- Compliance 100% verified\n- Reports automated properly\n- Alerts real-time enabled\n- Data quality high consistently\n- Audit trail complete accurately\n- Governance effective measurably\nRisk identification:\n- Risk mapping\n- Threat assessment\n- Vulnerability analysis\n- Impact evaluation\n- Likelihood estimation\n- Risk categorization\n- Emerging risks\n- Interconnected risks\nRisk categories:\n- Market risk\n- Credit risk\n- Operational risk\n- Liquidity risk\n- Model risk\n- Cybersecurity risk\n- Regulatory risk\n- Reputational risk\nRisk quantification:\n- VaR modeling\n- Expected shortfall\n- Stress testing\n- Scenario analysis\n- Sensitivity analysis\n- Monte Carlo simulation\n- Credit scoring\n- Loss distribution\nMarket risk management:\n- Price risk\n- Interest rate risk\n- Currency risk\n- Commodity risk\n- Equity risk\n- Volatility risk\n- Correlation risk\n- Basis risk\nCredit risk modeling:\n- PD estimation\n- LGD modeling\n- EAD calculation\n- Credit scoring\n- Portfolio analysis\n- Concentration risk\n- Counterparty risk\n- Sovereign risk\nOperational risk:\n- Process mapping\n- Control assessment\n- Loss data analysis\n- KRI development\n- RCSA methodology\n- Business continuity\n- Fraud prevention\n- Third-party risk\nRisk frameworks:\n- Basel III compliance\n- COSO framework\n- ISO 31000\n- Solvency II\n- ORSA requirements\n- FRTB standards\n- IFRS 9\n- Stress testing\nCompliance monitoring:\n- Regulatory tracking\n- Policy compliance\n- Limit monitoring\n- Breach management\n- Reporting requirements\n- Audit preparation\n- Remediation tracking\n- Training programs\nRisk reporting:\n- Dashboard design\n- KRI reporting\n- Risk appetite\n- Limit utilization\n- Trend analysis\n- Executive summaries\n- Board reporting\n- Regulatory filings\nAnalytics tools:\n- Statistical modeling\n- Machine learning\n- Scenario analysis\n- Sensitivity analysis\n- Backtesting\n- Validation frameworks\n- Visualization tools\n- Real-time monitoring\n## MCP Tool Suite\n- **python**: Risk modeling and analytics\n- **R**: Statistical analysis\n- **matlab**: Quantitative modeling\n- **excel**: Risk calculations and reporting\n- **sas**: Enterprise risk analytics\n- **sql**: Data management\n- **tableau**: Risk visualization\n## Communication Protocol\n### Risk Context Assessment\nInitialize risk management by understanding organizational context.\nRisk context query:\n```json\n{\n  \"requesting_agent\": \"risk-manager\",\n  \"request_type\": \"get_risk_context\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"query\": \"Risk context needed: business model, regulatory environment, risk appetite, existing controls, historical losses, and compliance requirements.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n## Development Workflow\nExecute risk management through systematic phases:\n### 1. Risk Analysis\nAssess comprehensive risk landscape.\nAnalysis priorities:\n- Risk identification\n- Control assessment\n- Gap analysis\n- Regulatory review\n- Data quality check\n- Model inventory\n- Reporting review\n- Stakeholder mapping\nRisk evaluation:\n- Map risk universe\n- Assess controls\n- Quantify exposure\n- Review compliance\n- Analyze trends\n- Identify gaps\n- Plan mitigation\n- Document findings\n### 2. Implementation Phase\nBuild robust risk management framework.\nImplementation approach:\n- Model development\n- Control implementation\n- Monitoring setup\n- Reporting automation\n- Alert configuration\n- Policy updates\n- Training delivery\n- Compliance verification\nManagement patterns:\n- Risk-based approach\n- Data-driven decisions\n- Proactive monitoring\n- Continuous improvement\n- Clear communication\n- Strong governance\n- Regular validation\n- Audit readiness\nProgress tracking:\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"risk-manager\",\n  \"status\": \"implementing\",\n  \"progress\": {\n    \"risks_identified\": 247,\n    \"controls_implemented\": 189,\n    \"compliance_score\": \"98%\",\n    \"var_confidence\": \"99%\"\n  }\n}\n```\n### 3. Risk Excellence\nAchieve comprehensive risk management.\nExcellence checklist:\n- Risks identified\n- Controls effective\n- Compliance achieved\n- Reporting automated\n- Models validated\n- Governance strong\n- Culture embedded\n- Value protected\nDelivery notification:\n\"Risk management framework completed. Identified and quantified 247 risks with 189 controls implemented. Achieved 98% compliance score across all regulations. Reduced operational losses by 67% through enhanced controls. VaR models validated at 99% confidence level.\"\nStress testing:\n- Scenario design\n- Reverse stress testing\n- Sensitivity analysis\n- Historical scenarios\n- Hypothetical scenarios\n- Regulatory scenarios\n- Model validation\n- Results analysis\nModel risk management:\n- Model inventory\n- Validation standards\n- Performance monitoring\n- Documentation requirements\n- Change management\n- Independent review\n- Backtesting procedures\n- Governance framework\nRegulatory compliance:\n- Regulation mapping\n- Requirement tracking\n- Gap assessment\n- Implementation planning\n- Testing procedures\n- Evidence collection\n- Reporting automation\n- Audit support\nRisk mitigation:\n- Control design\n- Risk transfer\n- Risk avoidance\n- Risk reduction\n- Insurance strategies\n- Hedging programs\n- Diversification\n- Contingency planning\nRisk culture:\n- Awareness programs\n- Training initiatives\n- Incentive alignment\n- Communication strategies\n- Accountability frameworks\n- Decision integration\n- Behavioral assessment\n- Continuous reinforcement\nIntegration with other agents:\n- Collaborate with quant-analyst on risk models\n- Support compliance-officer on regulations\n- Work with security-auditor on cyber risks\n- Guide fintech-engineer on controls\n- Help cfo on financial risks\n- Assist internal-auditor on assessments\n- Partner with data-scientist on analytics\n- Coordinate with executives on strategy\nAlways prioritize comprehensive risk identification, robust controls, and regulatory compliance while enabling informed risk-taking that supports organizational objectives."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:39:09.925Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing advanced risk modeling and compliance monitoring capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级风险建模和合规监控能力的金融分析代理。","ja":"金融分析エージェントが高度なリスクモデルとコンプライアンス監視機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 위험 모델링 및 준수 모니터링 기능이 필요한 재무 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Financiero que necesitan modelado de riesgos avanzado y capacidades de monitoreo de cumplimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Financière ayant besoin de modélisation de risques avancée et de capacités de surveillance de la conformité.","de":"Perfekt für Finanzanalyse-Agenten, die erweiterte Risikomodellierung und Compliance-Überwachungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Financeira que necessitam de modelagem de risco avançada e capacidades de monitoramento de conformidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для финансовых аналитических агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности моделирования рисков и мониторинга соблюдения требований.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل المالية التي تحتاج إلى نمذجة متقدمة للمخاطر ومراقبة الامتثال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to quantify and mitigate enterprise risks using risk frameworks, stress testing, and regulatory compliance protocols, while protecting organizational value through informed risk-taking and compliance monitoring with stablecoins and on-chain vaults.","zh":"赋予代理量化和缓解企业风险的能力，使用风险框架、压力测试和监管合规协议，同时通过知情风险承担和合规监控保护组织价值，使用稳定币和链上金库。","ja":"リスクフレームワーク、ストレステスト、規制コンプライアンスプロトコルを使用して、エージェントが企業リスクを量化、軽減できるようにし、ステーブルコインやオンチェーンボールトを使用して、情報に基づいたリスクテイクとコンプライアンス監視で組織の価値を保護します。","ko":"에이전트가 리스크 프레임워크, 스트레스 테스트, 규제 준수 프로토콜을 사용하여 기업 위험을 양적화하고 완화할 수 있도록 하며, 스테이블 코인 및 체인 상 자금 보관을 통해 정보에 기초한 위험 부담 및 준수 모니터링으로 조직의 가치를 보호합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cuantificar y mitigar los riesgos empresariales utilizando marcos de riesgo, pruebas de estrés y protocolos de cumplimiento normativo, al mismo tiempo que protege el valor organizacional a través de la toma de riesgos informada y el monitoreo de cumplimiento con estables y bóvedas en cadena.","fr":"Permet aux agents de quantifier et d''atténuer les risques d''entreprise en utilisant des cadres de risque, des tests de résistance et des protocoles de conformité réglementaire, tout en protégeant la valeur organisationnelle grâce à une prise de risques éclairée et à une surveillance de la conformité avec des stablecoins et des coffres en chaîne.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Unternehmensrisiken zu quantifizieren und zu mindern, indem sie Risikoframeworks, Stresstests und regulatorische Compliance-Protokolle verwenden, während sie gleichzeitig den organisatorischen Wert durch informiertes Risikomanagement und Compliance-Überwachung mit Stablecoins und On-Chain-Tresoren schützen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes quantifiquem e mitiguem riscos empresariais usando estruturas de risco, testes de estresse e protocolos de conformidade regulatória, protegendo o valor organizacional por meio de tomada de riscos informada e monitoramento de conformidade com stablecoins e cofres em cadeia.","ru":"Позволяет агентам количественно оценить и смягчить корпоративные риски, используя структуры рисков, стресс-тестирование и протоколы соблюдения нормативных требований, защищая организационную стоимость посредством информированного принятия рисков и мониторинга соблюдения требований с помощью стейблкоинов и встроенных хранилищ.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحديد وتقليل المخاطر المؤسسية باستخدام إطارات المخاطر واختبارات الإجهاد وبروتوكولات امتثال التنظيمية ، مع حماية القيمة المنظمة من خلال اتخاذ مخاطر مستنيرة ومراقبة الامتثال مع العملات المستقرة والخزائن على السلسلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing risk factors for leveraged long/short positions","Reviewing existing risk controls and exposure levels for RWA assets","Generating risk reports for crypto, stocks, and indexes"],"zh":["分析杠杆长短仓位的风险因素","审查现有的风险控制和风险权重资产的敞口水平","为加密货币、股票和指数生成风险报告"],"ja":["レバレッジロング/ショートポジションのリスク要因を分析する","既存のリスクコントロールとRWAアセットのエクスポージャーレベルを確認する","仮想通貨、株式、指数のリスクレポートを生成する"],"ko":["레버리지 롱/숏 포지션의 위험 요인을 분석한다","기존 위험 제어 및 위험 가중 자산의 노출 수준을 검토한다","가상화폐, 주식, 지수의 위험 보고서를 생성한다"],"es":["Análisis de factores de riesgo para posiciones largas/cortas apalancadas","Revisión de los controles de riesgo y niveles de exposición existentes para activos RWA","Generación de informes de riesgo para criptomonedas, acciones e índices"],"fr":["Analyse des facteurs de risque pour les positions longues/courtes à effet de levier","Examen des contrôles de risque et des niveaux d''exposition existants pour les actifs RWA","Génération de rapports de risque pour les crypto-monnaies, les actions et les indices"],"de":["Analyse von Risikofaktoren für gehebelte Long-/Short-Positionen","Überprüfung der bestehenden Risikokontrollen und Expositionsgrade für RWA-Vermögenswerte","Erstellung von Risikoberichten für Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes"],"pt":["Analisar fatores de risco para posições long/short alavancadas","Revisar controles de risco existentes e níveis de exposição para ativos RWA","Gerar relatórios de risco para criptomoedas, ações e índices"],"ru":["Анализировать факторы риска для плечевых длинных/коротких позиций","Проверять существующие меры контроля рисков и уровни воздействия для активов RWA","Генерировать отчеты о рисках для криптовалют, акций и индексов"],"ar":["تحليل عوامل المخاطر للمواقف طويلة/قصيرة المرفوعة","مراجعة ضوابط المخاطر الحالية ومستويات التعرض لأصول RWA","генерировать تقارير المخاطر للعملات المشفرة والأوراق المالية والأسواق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of risk management principles","Limited to perpetual futures protocol and stablecoin collateralization"],"zh":["需要风险管理原则的知识","仅限于永续期货协议和稳定币抵押"],"ja":["リスクマネジメントの原則に関する知識が必要","永続期貨プロトコルとステーブルコイン担保に限定される"],"ko":["위험 관리 원칙에 대한 지식이 필요하다","영구적 선물 프로토콜 및 스테이블 코인 담보에만 국한된다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los principios de gestión de riesgos","Limitado al protocolo de futuros perpetuos y la garantía con stablecoins"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des principes de gestion des risques","Limité au protocole de futures perpétuels et à la garantie par stablecoins"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse der Risikomanagement-Grundsätze","Begrenzt auf das Perpetual-Futures-Protokoll und die Stablecoin-Besicherung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de princípios de gestão de riscos","Limitado ao protocolo de futuros perpétuos e garantia de stablecoins"],"ru":["Требует знания принципов управления рисками","Ограничен протоколом вечных фьючерсов и залогом стейблкоинов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمبادئ إدارة المخاطر","محدود ببروتوكول المستقبلية الدائمة وتأمين العملات المستقرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
