aults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Sentry 分析与错误修复","ja":"Sentry 解析とエラーフィックス","ko":"Sentry 분석 및 오류 수정","es":"Análisis de errores Sentry","fr":"Analyse d''erreurs Sentry","de":"Sentry-Fehleranalyse","pt":"Análise de Erros Sentry","ru":"Анализ ошибок Sentry","ar":"تحليل أخطاء سينتري","en":"sentry-analysis"},"description":{"zh":"Sentry 分析是一种用于分析和修复生产环境错误的综合工作流程，包括错误分析、根因识别和修复","ja":"Sentry 解析は、エラー分析、根本原因の特定、修復を含む生産環境のエラーを分析および修復するための包括的なワークフローです","ko":"Sentry 분석은 오류 분석, 근본 원인 식별 및 수정을 포함하여 프로덕션 환경의 오류를 분석 및 수정하는ための 포괄적인 워크플로입니다","es":"El análisis de errores Sentry es un proceso que ayuda a identificar y solucionar errores de producción. Este proceso implica obtener registros JSON de Sentry...","fr":"L''analyse d''erreurs Sentry est un processus qui aide à identifier et à résoudre les erreurs de production. Ce processus implique l''obtention de journaux JSON...","de":"Die Sentry-Fehleranalyse ist ein Prozess, der dabei hilft, Produktionsfehler zu identifizieren und zu beheben. Dieser Prozess umfasst das Abrufen von Sentry-...","pt":"O protocolo de análise de erros Sentry é uma ferramenta poderosa para identificar e corrigir erros de produção","ru":"Протокол анализа ошибок Sentry является мощным инструментом для выявления и исправления ошибок производства","ar":"بروتوكول تحليل أخطاء سينتري هو أداة قوية لتحليل وتصحيح أخطاء الإنتاج","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["错误分析","根因识别","