o","Sentry","desenvolvimento de software","correção de erros","log de análise de erros","testes e verificação","criação de solicitações de pull"],"ru":["анализ ошибок","производство","Sentry","разработка программного обеспечения","исправление ошибок","журнал анализа ошибок","тестирование и верификация","создание запросов на принятие изменений"],"ar":["تحليل أخطاء","الإنتاج","سينتري","تطوير البرمجيات","تصحيح أخطاء","سجل تحليل أخطاء","اختبارات والتأكد","إنشاء طلبات سحب"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sentry-analysis","description":"Analyze and fix production errors from Sentry crash reports. Use when investigating AppHang, ANR, crashes, or production errors. Includes complete workflow from JSON analysis to bug fix implementation with evidence-based methodology. Triggers on sentry, crash, AppHang, ANR, error analysis, production error, bug analysis, crash report, freeze, hang, not responding, stacktrace, breadcrumbs, exception.","bodyPreview":"# Sentry Error Analysis & Fixes\n\nComplete workflow for analyzing and fixing production errors from Sentry crash reports.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n```\n1. Obtain Sentry JSON log\n   ↓\n2. Analyze error\n   ↓\n3. Identify root cause\n   ↓\n4. Generate bug analysis log\n   ↓\n🚨 WAIT FOR USER CONFIRMATION 🚨\n   ↓\n5. Implement fix (only after approval)\n   ↓\n6. Test & verify\n   ↓\n7. Create PR\n```\n\n## Critical Requirements\n\n**MUST follow these rules:**\n\n1. ✅ **Always create a bug analysis log** in `node_modules/","body":"# Sentry Error Analysis & Fixes\n\nComplete workflow for analyzing and fixing production errors from Sentry crash reports.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n```\n1. Obtain Sentry JSON log\n   ↓\n2. Analyze error\n   ↓\n3. Identify root cause\n   ↓\n4. Generate bug analysis log\n   ↓\n🚨 WAIT FOR USER CONFIRMATION 🚨\n   ↓\n5. Implement fix (only after approval)\n   ↓\n6. Test & verify\n   ↓\n7. Create PR\n```\n\n## Critical Requirements\n\n**MUST follow these rules:**\n\n1. ✅ **Always create a bug analysis log** in `node_modules/.cache/bugs/` before implementing fixes\n2. 🚨 **MUST wait for user confirmation** before starting any code changes\n3. ✅ **Bug analysis must be complete** with all sections filled\n4. ✅ **Use evidence-based methodology** (环环相扣，逐步递进)\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Common Error Types\n\n| Type | Description | Common Causes |\n|------|-------------|---------------|\n| AppHang | iOS app frozen >5s | Too many concurrent requests, main thread blocking |\n| ANR | Android Not Responding | Heavy operations on main thread, deadlocks |\n| Crash | App terminated | Null pointer, memory issues, unhandled exceptions |\n| Exception | Handled error | Network failures, validation errors, state issues |\n\n### Analysis Methodology\n\nUse **6 types of proof** to establish causation:\n\n1. **Stack Trace Evidence** - Error location in code\n2. **Breadcrumbs Evidence** - User actions leading to error\n3. **Code Logic Evidence** - Why the code causes the issue\n4. **Timing Evidence** - When and how often it occurs\n5. **Device/Platform Evidence** - Affected platforms/devices\n6. **Fix Verification** - Testing confirms fix works\n\n### Common Fix Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Pattern 1: Concurrent request control\nasync function executeBatched<T>(\n  tasks: Array<() => Promise<T>>,\n  concurrency = 3,\n): Promise<Array<PromiseSettledResult<T>>> {\n  const results: Array<PromiseSettledResult<T>> = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < tasks.length; i += concurrency) {\n    const batch = tasks.slice(i, i + concurrency);\n    const batchResults = await Promise.allSettled(\n      batch.map((task) => task()),\n    );\n    results.push(...batchResults);\n  }\n  return results;\n}\n\n// Pattern 2: Main thread offloading (React Native)\nimport { InteractionManager } from ''react-native'';\n\nInteractionManager.runAfterInteractions(() => {\n  // Heavy operation here\n});\n\n// Pattern 3: Error boundary\n<ErrorBoundary fallback={<ErrorFallback />}>\n  <Component />\n</ErrorBoundary>\n```\n\n## Detailed Guide\n\nFor comprehensive Sentry error analysis workflow, see [fix-sentry-errors.md](references/rules/fix-sentry-errors.md).\n\nTopics covered:\n- Obtaining Sentry JSON logs\n- Python-based quick analysis\n- Bug analysis log template\n- 6 types of proof methodology\n- Root cause identification\n- Common fix patterns (AppHang, ANR, Crashes)\n- Real-world case studies\n- Testing and verification\n- PR creation workflow\n\n## Key Files\n\n| Purpose | Location |\n|---------|----------|\n| Bug analysis logs | `node_modules/.cache/bugs/` |\n| Sentry config | `packages/shared/src/modules/sentry/` |\n| Error boundaries | `packages/kit/src/components/ErrorBoundary/` |\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Analyzing iOS AppHang errors (5+ second freezes)\n- Fixing Android ANR (Application Not Responding)\n- Investigating crash reports with stack traces\n- Understanding user actions before crashes (breadcrumbs)\n- Creating evidence-based bug analysis reports\n- Implementing fixes for production errors\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `/performance` - Performance optimization patterns\n- `/error-handling` - Error handling best practices\n- `/sentry` - Sentry configuration and filtering\n- `/code-quality` - Lint fixes and code quality\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:39:09.839Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing advanced error analysis and logging capabilities for Sentry crash reports.","zh":"非常适合需要高级错误分析和日志记录功能的调试代理，以支持Sentry崩溃报告。","ja":"Sentryクラッシュレポートのための高度なエラーアナリシスとログ記録機能を必要とするデバッグエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Sentry 크래시 보고서를 위한 고급 오류 분석 및 로깅 기능이 필요한 디버깅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de depuración que necesitan un análisis de errores avanzado y capacidades de registro para informes de errores de Sentry.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de débogage nécessitant une analyse d''erreurs avancée et des fonctionnalités de journalisation pour les rapports de plantage de Sentry.","de":"Perfekt für Debugging-Agents, die eine erweiterte Fehleranalyse und Protokollfunktionen für Sentry-Crash-Berichte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de depuração que necessitam de análise de erros avançada e capacidades de registro para relatórios de crash do Sentry.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов отладки, требующих продвинутого анализа ошибок и возможностей ведения журнала для отчетов о сбоях Sentry.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التصحيح التي تحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم للأخطاء وقدرات تسجيل لتقارير الحوادث في Sentry."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate error analysis workflows, generating bug analysis logs in JSON format and implementing fixes after user confirmation, leveraging on-chain vaults and central liquidity vault protocols for robust trade management.","zh":"赋予代理自动执行错误分析工作流的能力，生成JSON格式的错误分析日志，并在用户确认后实施修复，利用链上金库和集中流动性金库协议实现强大的交易管理。","ja":"エージェントにエラーアナリシスワークフローを自動化する能力を与え、JSON形式のバグ分析ログを生成し、ユーザーの確認後に対策を実施し、オンチェーン・ボールトと集中流動性ボールト・プロトコルを利用して堅牢な取引管理を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 자동으로 오류 분석 워크플로를 실행할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 JSON 형식의 버그 분석 로그를 생성하고 사용자 확인 후 수정을 구현하며, 체인 상 금고와 집중 유동성 금고 프로토콜을 활용하여 강력한 거래 관리를 제공한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo de análisis de errores, generando registros de análisis de errores en formato JSON e implementando soluciones después de la confirmación del usuario, aprovechando bóvedas en cadena y protocolos de bóveda de liquidez centralizados para una gestión de operaciones sólida.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail d''analyse d''erreurs, en générant des journaux d''analyse de bogue au format JSON et en mettant en œuvre des correctifs après confirmation de l''utilisateur, en exploitant les coffres-forts en chaîne et les protocoles de coffre de liquidité centralisés pour une gestion des transactions robuste.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Fehleranalyse-Workflows zu automatisieren, indem sie Fehleranalyse-Protokolle im JSON-Format generieren und nach Benutzerbestätigung Korrekturen implementieren, indem sie auf Blockchain-Vaults und zentrale Liquiditäts-Vault-Protokolle für eine robuste Handelsverwaltung setzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho de análise de erros, gerando registros de análise de bugs no formato JSON e implementando correções após confirmação do usuário, aproveitando vaults em cadeia e protocolos de vault de liquidez central para gerenciamento de negociações robusto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рабочие процессы анализа ошибок, генерируя журналы анализа ошибок в формате JSON и реализуя исправления после подтверждения пользователя, используя встроенные хранилища и протоколы центрального хранилища ликвидности для надежного управления торговлей.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تلقين عمليات تحليل الأخطاء، وتوليد سجلات تحليل الأخطاء بформات JSON وتنفيذ الإصلاحات بعد تأكيد المستخدم، واستخدام الخزائن المتسلسلة وبروتوكولات الخزائن السائلة المركزية لإدارة التداول القوي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Sentry error analysis and fixes","Generating bug analysis logs for production errors","Implementing trade management fixes for leveraged long/short positions"],"zh":["自动化Sentry错误分析和修复","生成生产错误的错误分析日志","实现杠杆多头/空头头寸的交易管理修复"],"ja":["Sentryエラーアナリシスと修正の自動化","生産エラーのバグ分析ログの生成","レバレッジド・ロング/ショート・ポジションの取引管理修正の実施"],"ko":["Sentry 오류 분석 및 수정 자동화","프로덕션 오류에 대한 버그 분석 로그 생성","레버리지 롱/숏 포지션의 거래 관리 수정 구현"],"es":["Automatizar el análisis de errores de Sentry y soluciones","Generar registros de análisis de errores para errores de producción","Implementar soluciones de gestión de operaciones para posiciones largas/cortas apalancadas"],"fr":["Automatiser l''analyse d''erreurs de Sentry et les correctifs","Générer des journaux d''analyse de bogue pour les erreurs de production","Mettre en œuvre des correctifs de gestion de transactions pour les positions longues/courtes à effet de levier"],"de":["Automatisieren der Fehleranalyse und -behebung von Sentry","Generieren von Fehleranalyse-Protokollen für Produktionsfehler","Implementieren von Handelsmanagement-Korrekturen für Long-/Short-Positionen mit Hebelwirkung"],"pt":["Automatizar análise de erros do Sentry e correções","Gerar registros de análise de bugs para erros de produção","Implementar correções de gerenciamento de negociações para posições longas/curtas alavancadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать анализ ошибок и исправления Sentry","Генерировать журналы анализа ошибок для ошибок производства","Реализовывать исправления управления торговлей для длинных/коротких позиций с использованием кредитного плеча"],"ar":["تلقين تحليل الأخطاء وإصلاحات Sentry","توليد سجلات تحليل الأخطاء للأخطاء الإنتاجية","تنفيذ إصلاحات إدارة التداول لمواقف طويلة/قصيرة مرفوعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Sentry JSON log access","Limited to trades with stablecoin collateralization","User confirmation required for fix implementation"],"zh":["需要Sentry JSON日志访问","仅限于稳定币抵押交易","需要用户确认才可以实施修复"],"ja":["Sentry JSONログへのアクセスが必要","ステーブルコイン担保取引のみに限定","対策の実施にはユーザーの確認が必要"],"ko":["Sentry JSON 로그 액세스가 필요함","안정币 담보 거래에만 국한됨","수정 구현에는 사용자 확인이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a registros JSON de Sentry","Limitado a operaciones con garantía de estabilización de moneda","Se requiere confirmación del usuario para implementar soluciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux journaux JSON de Sentry","Limité aux transactions avec une garantie de stabilisation de la monnaie","Une confirmation de l''utilisateur est requise pour mettre en œuvre des correctifs"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Sentry-JSON-Logdateien","Begrenzt auf Handel mit stabilen Kollateralisierungen","Benutzerbestätigung erforderlich für die Implementierung von Korrekturen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao log JSON do Sentry","Limitado a negociações com garantia de stablecoin","Confirmação do usuário necessária para implementação de correção"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к журналу JSON Sentry","Ограничен для торговли с обеспечением стейблкоина","Требуется подтверждение пользователя для реализации исправления"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سجل JSON في Sentry","محدود للتداول مع ضمان العملات المستقرة","يتطلب تأكيد المستخدم لتنفيذ الإصلاح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
