استخدام Git Worktrees لتطوير متواز","en":"using-git-worktrees"},"description":{"zh":"Git Worktree 允许您创建多个独立的工作空间，提高代码管理效率","ja":"Git Worktree を使用すると、複数の独立したワークスペースを作成できます","ko":"Git Worktree를 사용하여 여러 개의 독립적인 작업 공간을 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"Git Worktrees permite crear espacios de trabajo aislados para trabajar en múltiples ramas simultáneamente","fr":"Git Worktrees permet de créer des espaces de travail isolés pour travailler sur plusieurs branches simultanément","de":"Git Worktrees ermöglicht die Erstellung von isolierten Arbeitsbereichen, um an mehreren Zweigen gleichzeitig zu arbeiten","pt":"Git Worktrees permite criar espaços de trabalho isolados para desenvolver múltiplos branches simultaneamente","ru":"Git Worktrees позволяет создавать изолированные рабочие пространства для разработки нескольких веток одновременно","ar":"Git Worktrees يسمح بإنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة لتطوير فروع متعددة في نفس الوقت","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["创建多个独立的工作空间","提高代码管理效率","支持多分支同时工作","安全的目录选择和验证"],"ja":["複数の独立したワークスペースを作成","コード管理の効率を向上","複数のブランチを同時に作業","安全なディレクトリ選択と検証"],"ko":["여러 개의 독립적인 작업 공간 생성","코드 관리 효율성 향상","여러 브랜치 동시 작업 지원","안전한 디렉토리 선택 및 검증"],"es":["Crear espacios de trabajo aislados","Trabajar en múltiples ramas simultáneamente","Seguridad de directorios","Verificación de seguridad","Compatibilidad con múltiples sistemas de control de versiones"],"fr":["Créer des espaces de travail isolés","Travailler sur plusieurs branches simultanément","Sécurité des répertoires","Vérification de sécurité","Compatibilité avec plusieurs systèmes de contrôle de version"],"de":["Erstellung von isolierten Arbeitsbereichen","Arbeiten an mehreren Zweigen gleichzeitig","Sicherheit von Verzeichnissen","Sicherheitsüberprüfung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Versionskontrollsystemen"],"pt":["Criação de espaços de trabalho isolados","Desenvolvimento de múltiplos branches simultaneamente","Compartilhamento do mesmo repositório","Segurança e isolamento de diretórios","Melhoria da produtividade do time de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Создание изолированных рабочих пространств","Разработка нескольких веток одновременно","Общее использование одного и того же хранилища","Безопасность и изоляция директорий","Повышение производительности команды разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة","تطوير فروع متعددة في نفس الوقت","مشاركة نفس المستودع","أمان و عزل الدلائل","تحسين إنتاجية فريق التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git Worktree","代码管理","多分支","独立工作空间","Git 工具","版本控制"],"ja":["Git Worktree","コード管理","マルチブランチ","独立したワークスペース","Git ツール","バージョン管理"],"ko":["Git Worktree","코드 관리","다중 브랜치","독립적인 작업 공간","Git 도구","버전 관리"],"es":["Git Worktrees","espacios de trabajo aislados","ramas simultáneas","seguridad de directorios","verificación de seguridad","desarrollo de software","control de versiones"],"fr":["Git Worktrees","espaces de travail isolés","branches simultanées","sécurité des répertoires","vérification de sécurité","développement de logiciels","contrôle de version"],"de":["Git Worktrees","isolierte Arbeitsbereiche","Zweige gleichzeitig","Sicherheit von Verzeichnissen","Sicherheitsüberprüfung","Softwareentwicklung","Versionskontrolle"],"pt":["Git Worktrees","desenvolvimento paralelo","espaços de trabalho isolados","compartilhamento de repositório","produtividade do time de desenvolvimento","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Git Worktrees","параллельная разработка","изолированные рабочие пространства","общее использование хранилища","производительность команды разработки","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Git Worktrees","تطوير متواز","مساحات عمل معزولة","مشاركة مستودع","إنتاجية فريق التطوير","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-git-worktrees","description":"Use when starting feature work that needs isolation from current workspace or before executing implementation plans - creates isolated git worktrees with smart directory selection and safety verification","bodyPreview":"# Using Git Worktrees\n\n## Overview\n\nGit worktrees create isolated workspaces sharing the same repository, allowing work on multiple branches simultaneously without switching.\n\n**Core principle:** Systematic directory selection + safety verification = reliable isolation.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the using-git-worktrees skill to set up an isolated workspace.\"\n\n## Directory Selection Process\n\n1. Determine what the path for the required workree will be \"<parent-worktree-dir>/<feature-ident","body":"# Using Git Worktrees\n\n## Overview\n\nGit worktrees create isolated workspaces sharing the same repository, allowing work on multiple branches simultaneously without switching.\n\n**Core principle:** Systematic directory selection + safety verification = reliable isolation.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the using-git-worktrees skill to set up an isolated workspace.\"\n\n## Directory Selection Process\n\n1. Determine what the path for the required workree will be \"<parent-worktree-dir>/<feature-identifier>\"\n2. Are we already there? Is it a git worktree? If so, report and exit.\n3. If we''re are in the wrong worktree, report and exit.\n4. Identify parent worktree directory using priority:\n   - Existing worktree parent directory\n   - AGENTS.md preference\n   - User prompt\n5. Ensure project-local directories are in .gitignore\n6. Create worktree, run setup, verify clean baseline\n\n### 1. Check if there is an existing worktree parent directory\n\n```bash\n# Check in priority order\nls -d \"../$(git rev-parse --path-format=absolute --git-common-dir | xargs dirname).worktrees\" 2>/dev/null      # Alternative\n```\n\n**If found:** Use that directory.\n\n### 2. Check AGENTS.md\n\n```bash\ngrep -i \"worktree.*director\" AGENTS.md 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n**If preference specified:** Use it without asking.\n\n### 3. Ask User\n\nIf no directory exists and no AGENTS.md preference:\n\n```\nNo worktree directory found. Where should I create worktrees?\n\n1. ../$(basename \"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\").worktrees (project-local, hidden)\n2. ~/.locals/share/<project-name>.worktrees/ (global location)\n\nWhich would you prefer?\n```\n\n## Creation Steps\n\n### 1. Detect Project Name\n\n```bash\nproject=$(git rev-parse --path-format=absolute --git-common-dir | xargs dirname)\n```\n\n### 2. Create Worktree\n\n```bash\n# Create worktree with new branch\npath=\"../${project}.worktrees/${feature_name}\"\nmkdir -p \"$path\"\ngit worktree add \"$path\" -b \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\ncd \"$path\"\n```\n\n### 3. Run Project Setup\n\nAuto-detect and run appropriate setup:\n\n```bash\n# if Justfile\nif [ -f Justfile ]; then just setup; fi\n\n# if Mise\nif [ -f .mise.toml ]; then mise setup; exit 0; fi\n\n# Node.js (npm)\nif [ -f package.json ]; then npm install; fi\n# Node.js (yarn)\nif [ -f package.json ]; then yarn install; fi\n# Node.js (bun)\nif [ -f package.json ]; then bun install; fi\n# Node.js (pnpm)\nif [ -f package.json ]; then pnpm install; fi\n\n\n# Rust\nif [ -f Cargo.toml ]; then cargo build; fi\n\n# Python\nif [ -f requirements.txt ]; then pip install -r requirements.txt; fi\nif [ -f pyproject.toml ]; then poetry install; fi\n\n# Go\nif [ -f go.mod ]; then go mod download; fi\n```\n\n### 4. Verify Clean Baseline\n\nRun tests to ensure worktree starts clean:\n\n```bash\n# Examples - use project-appropriate command\n# if Justfile\nif [ -f Justfile ]; then just test; fi\n\nif [ -f .mise.toml ]; then\n  mise check\n  exit 0\nfi\n\nnpm test\ncargo test\npytest\ngo test ./...\n```\n\n**If tests fail:** Report failures, ask whether to proceed or investigate.\n\n**If tests pass:** Report ready.\n\n### 5. Report Location\n\n```\nWorktree ready at <full-path>\nTests passing (<N> tests, 0 failures)\nReady to implement <feature-identifier>\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Situation                   | Action                            |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| No worktrees yet            | Use `../<projectname>.worktrees/` |\n| Neither exists              | Check AGENTS.md → Ask user        |\n| Directory not in .gitignore | Add it immediately + commit       |\n| Tests fail during baseline  | Report failures + ask             |\n| No package.json/Cargo.toml  | Skip dependency install           |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**Assuming directory location**\n\n- **Problem:** Creates inconsistency, violates project conventions\n- **Fix:** Follow priority: existing > AGENTS.md > ask\n\n**Proceeding with failing tests**\n\n- **Problem:** Can''t distinguish new bugs from pre-existing issues\n- **Fix:** Report failures, get explicit permission to proceed\n\n**Hardcoding setup commands**\n\n- **Problem:** Breaks on projects using different tools\n- **Fix:** Auto-detect from project files (package.json, etc.)\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n```\nYou: I''m using the using-git-worktrees skill to set up an isolated workspace.\n\n[Check ../<projectname>.worktrees/ - exists]\n[Create worktree: git worktree add ../<projectname>.worktrees/auth -b feature/auth]\n[Run npm install]\n[Run npm test - 47 passing]\n\nWorktree ready at /Users/jesse/myproject.worktrees/auth\nTests passing (47 tests, 0 failures)\nReady to implement auth feature\n```\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n\n- Create worktree within existing workspace\n- Skip baseline test verification\n- Proceed with failing tests without asking\n- Assume directory location when ambiguous\n- Skip AGENTS.md check\n\n**Always:**\n\n- Follow directory priority: existing > AGENTS.md > ask\n- Verify .gitignore for project-local\n- Auto-detect and run project setup\n- Verify clean test baseline\n\n## Integration\n\n**Called by:**\n\n- **brainstorming** (Phase 4) - REQUIRED when design is approved and implementation follows\n- Any skill needing isolated workspace\n\n**Pairs with:**\n\n- **finishing-a-development-branch** - REQUIRED for cleanup after work complete\n- **executing-plans** or **subagent-driven-development** - Work happens in this worktree\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:39:25.116Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents requiring parallel branch management and isolated workspaces in Git repositories.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Git 仓库中进行并行分支管理和隔离工作空间的开发代理。","ja":"Git リポジトリで並列ブランチ管理と分離されたワークスペースを必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Git 리포지토리에서 병렬 분기 관리 및 분리된 작업 공간이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren gestión de ramas paralelas y espacios de trabajo aislados en repositorios de Git.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement nécessitant une gestion de branches parallèles et des espaces de travail isolés dans les référentiels Git.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine parallele Verwaltung von Zweigen und isolierte Arbeitsbereiche in Git-Repositorys erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento de branch paralelo e espaços de trabalho isolados em repositórios Git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих параллельного управления ветками и изолированных рабочих пространств в репозиториях Git.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات开发 التي تتطلب إدارة فرع متوازي ومساحات عمل معزولة في مستودعات جيت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create isolated workspaces sharing the same repository, allowing for simultaneous work on multiple branches without switching, utilizing Git worktrees with systematic directory selection and safety verification for reliable isolation.","zh":"赋予代理创建共享同一仓库的隔离工作空间的能力，允许在不切换的情况下同时处理多个分支，利用 Git worktrees 以系统化的目录选择和安全验证来实现可靠的隔离。","ja":"エージェントが同じリポジトリを共有する分離されたワークスペースを作成できるようにし、切り替えずに複数のブランチを同時に作業できるようにする。Git worktrees を使用して、システム化されたディレクトリ選択と安全性の検証による信頼性の高い分離を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 동일한 리포지토리를 공유하는 분리된 작업 공간을 생성할 수 있도록 하여, 전환하지 않고 여러 분기를 동시에 작업할 수 있도록 합니다. Git worktrees를 사용하여 시스템화된 디렉토리 선택 및 안전성 검증을 통해 안정적인 분리를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear espacios de trabajo aislados que comparten el mismo repositorio, lo que permite el trabajo simultáneo en múltiples ramas sin cambiar, utilizando Git worktrees con selección de directorios sistemáticos y verificación de seguridad para un aislamiento confiable.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des espaces de travail isolés partageant le même référentiel, permettant un travail simultané sur plusieurs branches sans basculement, en utilisant des worktrees Git avec une sélection de répertoires systématique et une vérification de sécurité pour une isolation fiable.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, isolierte Arbeitsbereiche zu erstellen, die das gleiche Repository teilen, was eine gleichzeitige Arbeit an mehreren Zweigen ohne Umschaltung ermöglicht, indem Git-Arbeitsbereiche mit systematischer Verzeichnisauswahl und Sicherheitsüberprüfung für eine zuverlässige Isolation verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar espaços de trabalho isolados que compartilham o mesmo repositório, permitindo o trabalho simultâneo em várias branches sem a necessidade de alternância, utilizando Git worktrees com seleção sistemática de diretórios e verificação de segurança para isolamento confiável.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать изолированные рабочие пространства, которые используют одно и то же хранилище, что позволяет работать над несколькими ветками одновременно без переключения, используя Git worktrees с системным выбором каталогов и проверкой безопасности для надежной изоляции.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة تشارك نفس المستودع، مما يسمح بالعمل المتزامن على عدة فروع دون الحاجة إلى التبديل، باستخدام Git worktrees مع اختيار دلالي نظامي وتحقق أمني لتحقيق عزل موثوق به."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing multiple feature branches simultaneously","Isolating experimental code changes","Streamlining collaborative development workflows"],"zh":["同时管理多个功能分支","隔离实验性代码更改","简化协作开发工作流"],"ja":["複数の機能ブランチを同時に管理する","実験的なコード変更を分離する","コラボレーション開発ワークフローを簡素化する"],"ko":["여러 기능 분기를 동시에 관리한다","실험적인 코드 변경을 분리한다","협력 개발 워크플로우를 간소화한다"],"es":["Gestión de varias ramas de características simultáneamente","Aislamiento de cambios de código experimentales","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo colaborativo"],"fr":["Gestion de plusieurs branches de fonctionnalités simultanément","Isolement de modifications de code expérimentales","Optimisation de flux de travail de développement collaboratif"],"de":["Verwaltung mehrerer Funktionszweige simultan","Isolierung experimenteller Code-Änderungen","Optimierung von kollaborativen Entwicklungswerkflüssen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de várias branches de recursos simultaneamente","Isolamento de alterações de código experimentais","Otimização de fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento colaborativo"],"ru":["Управление несколькими функциональными ветками одновременно","Изоляция экспериментальных изменений кода","Оптимизация сотрудничества в рабочих процессах разработки"],"ar":["إدارة فروع متعددة في نفس الوقت","عزل التغييرات التجريبية في الكود","تبسيط سير عمل التطوير التعاوني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git version control system","Limited to single repository per worktree"],"zh":["需要 Git 版本控制系统","每个 worktree 仅限于单个仓库"],"ja":["Git バージョン管理システムが必要","各 worktree は単一のリポジトリに限定される"],"ko":["Git 버전 관리 시스템이 필요하다","각 worktree는 단일 리포지토리에限定된다"],"es":["Requiere sistema de control de versiones Git","Limitado a un solo repositorio por worktree"],"fr":["Nécessite le système de contrôle de version Git","Limité à un seul référentiel par worktree"],"de":["Erfordert Git-versionskontrollsystem","Begrenzt auf ein einzelnes Repository pro Worktree"],"pt":["Exige sistema de controle de versão Git","Limitado a um repositório por worktree"],"ru":["Требуется система контроля версий Git","Ограничен один репозиторий на worktree"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام التحكم في الإصدار جيت","محدود بمستودع واحد لكل شجرة عمل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
