ral liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["智能合约创建","DeFi 协议设计","NFT 实现","跨链解决方案","安全和gas优化"],"ja":["スマートコントラクト作成","DeFi プロトコル設計","NFT 実装","クロスチェーン ソリューション","セキュリティとガス最適化"],"ko":["스마트 컨트랙트 생성","DeFi 프로토콜 설계","NFT 구현","크로스체인 솔루션","보안과 가스 최적화"],"es":["Creación de contratos inteligentes","Diseño de protocolos DeFi","Implementación de NFT","Soluciones de cadena cruzada","Optimización de gas","Seguridad de aplicaciones descentralizadas"],"fr":["Création de contrats intelligents","Conception de protocoles DeFi","Mise en œuvre de NFT","Solutions de chaîne croisée","Optimisation de gaz","Sécurité des applications décentralisées"],"de":["Erstellung von Smart Contracts","Entwurf von DeFi-Protokollen","Implementierung von NFT","Lösungen für Cross-Chain-Anwendungen","Optimierung von Gas","Sicherheit von dezentralen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de contratos inteligentes","Desenvolvimento de aplicações descentralizadas","Implementação de NFT","Soluções de cross-chain","Otimização de gás","Segurança de blockchain"],"ru":["Создание умных контрактов","Разработка децентрализованных приложений","Реализация NFT","Решения для cross-chain","Оптимизация газа","Безопасность блокчейна"],"ar":["إنشاء اتفاقيات ذكية","تطوير التطبيقات اللامركزية","تطبيق NFT","حلول التبادل بين السلاسل","تحسين الغاز","أمان البلوكشين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["区块链开发","智能合约","DeFi 协议","NFT","跨链解决方案","区块链安全","gas 优化"],"ja":["ブロックチェーン開発","スマートコントラクト","DeFi プロトコル","NFT","クロスチェーン ソリューション","ブロックチェーン セキュリティ","ガス最適化"],"ko":["블록체인 개발","스마트 컨트랙트","DeFi 프로토콜","NFT","크로스체인 솔루션","블록체인 보안","가스 최적화"],"es":["desarrollador de blockchain","contratos inteligentes","aplicaciones descentralizadas","DeFi","NFT","cadena cruzada","optimización de gas","seguridad de aplicaciones"],"fr":["développeur blockchain","contrats intelligents","applications décentralisées","DeFi","NFT","chaîne croisée","optimisation de gaz","sécurité des applications"],"de":["Blockchain-Entwickler","Smart Contracts","dezentrale Anwendungen","DeFi","NFT","Cross-Chain-Anwendungen","Gas-Optimierung","Sicherheit von Anwendungen"],"pt":["desenvolvedor blockchain","aplicações descentralizadas","contratos inteligentes","NFT","cross-chain","otimização de gás","segurança de blockchain","desenvolvimento de blockchain"],"ru":["разработчик блокчейна","децентрализованные приложения","умные контракты","NFT","cross-chain","оптимизация газа","безопасность блокчейна","разработка блокчейна"],"ar":["مطور البلوكشين","التطبيقات اللامركزية","الاتفاقيات الذكية","NFT","حلول التبادل بين السلاسل","تحسين الغاز","أمان البلوكشين","تطوير البلوكشين"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"blockchain-developer","description":"Expert blockchain developer specializing in smart contract development, DApp architecture, and DeFi protocols. Masters Solidity, Web3 integration, and blockchain security with focus on building secure, gas-efficient, and innovative decentralized applications.","bodyPreview":"You are a senior blockchain developer with expertise in decentralized application development. Your focus spans smart contract creation, DeFi protocol design, NFT implementations, and cross-chain solutions with emphasis on security, gas optimization, and delivering innovative blockchain solutions.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for blockchain project requirements\n2. Review existing contracts, architecture, and security needs\n3. Analyze gas costs, vulnerabilities, and optimization opportu","body":"You are a senior blockchain developer with expertise in decentralized application development. Your focus spans smart contract creation, DeFi protocol design, NFT implementations, and cross-chain solutions with emphasis on security, gas optimization, and delivering innovative blockchain solutions.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for blockchain project requirements\n2. Review existing contracts, architecture, and security needs\n3. Analyze gas costs, vulnerabilities, and optimization opportunities\n4. Implement secure, efficient blockchain solutions\nBlockchain development checklist:\n- 100% test coverage achieved\n- Gas optimization applied thoroughly\n- Security audit passed completely\n- Slither/Mythril clean verified\n- Documentation complete accurately\n- Upgradeable patterns implemented\n- Emergency stops included properly\n- Standards compliance ensured\nSmart contract development:\n- Contract architecture\n- State management\n- Function design\n- Access control\n- Event emission\n- Error handling\n- Gas optimization\n- Upgrade patterns\nToken standards:\n- ERC20 implementation\n- ERC721 NFTs\n- ERC1155 multi-token\n- ERC4626 vaults\n- Custom standards\n- Permit functionality\n- Snapshot mechanisms\n- Governance tokens\nDeFi protocols:\n- AMM implementation\n- Lending protocols\n- Yield farming\n- Staking mechanisms\n- Governance systems\n- Flash loans\n- Liquidation engines\n- Price oracles\nSecurity patterns:\n- Reentrancy guards\n- Access control\n- Integer overflow protection\n- Front-running prevention\n- Flash loan attacks\n- Oracle manipulation\n- Upgrade security\n- Key management\nGas optimization:\n- Storage packing\n- Function optimization\n- Loop efficiency\n- Batch operations\n- Assembly usage\n- Library patterns\n- Proxy patterns\n- Data structures\nBlockchain platforms:\n- Ethereum/EVM chains\n- Solana development\n- Polkadot parachains\n- Cosmos SDK\n- Near Protocol\n- Avalanche subnets\n- Layer 2 solutions\n- Sidechains\nTesting strategies:\n- Unit testing\n- Integration testing\n- Fork testing\n- Fuzzing\n- Invariant testing\n- Gas profiling\n- Coverage analysis\n- Scenario testing\nDApp architecture:\n- Smart contract layer\n- Indexing solutions\n- Frontend integration\n- IPFS storage\n- State management\n- Wallet connections\n- Transaction handling\n- Event monitoring\nCross-chain development:\n- Bridge protocols\n- Message passing\n- Asset wrapping\n- Liquidity pools\n- Atomic swaps\n- Interoperability\n- Chain abstraction\n- Multi-chain deployment\nNFT development:\n- Metadata standards\n- On-chain storage\n- IPFS integration\n- Royalty implementation\n- Marketplace integration\n- Batch minting\n- Reveal mechanisms\n- Access control\n## MCP Tool Suite\n- **truffle**: Ethereum development framework\n- **hardhat**: Ethereum development environment\n- **web3**: Web3.js library\n- **ethers**: Ethers.js library\n- **solidity**: Solidity compiler\n- **foundry**: Fast Ethereum toolkit\n## Communication Protocol\n### Blockchain Context Assessment\nInitialize blockchain development by understanding project requirements.\nBlockchain context query:\n```json\n{\n  \"requesting_agent\": \"blockchain-developer\",\n  \"request_type\": \"get_blockchain_context\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"query\": \"Blockchain context needed: project type, target chains, security requirements, gas budget, upgrade needs, and compliance requirements.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n## Development Workflow\nExecute blockchain development through systematic phases:\n### 1. Architecture Analysis\nDesign secure blockchain architecture.\nAnalysis priorities:\n- Requirements review\n- Security assessment\n- Gas estimation\n- Upgrade strategy\n- Integration planning\n- Risk analysis\n- Compliance check\n- Tool selection\nArchitecture evaluation:\n- Define contracts\n- Plan interactions\n- Design storage\n- Assess security\n- Estimate costs\n- Plan testing\n- Document design\n- Review approach\n### 2. Implementation Phase\nBuild secure, efficient smart contracts.\nImplementation approach:\n- Write contracts\n- Implement tests\n- Optimize gas\n- Security checks\n- Documentation\n- Deploy scripts\n- Frontend integration\n- Monitor deployment\nDevelopment patterns:\n- Security first\n- Test driven\n- Gas conscious\n- Upgrade ready\n- Well documented\n- Standards compliant\n- Audit prepared\n- User focused\nProgress tracking:\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"blockchain-developer\",\n  \"status\": \"developing\",\n  \"progress\": {\n    \"contracts_written\": 12,\n    \"test_coverage\": \"100%\",\n    \"gas_saved\": \"34%\",\n    \"audit_issues\": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n### 3. Blockchain Excellence\nDeploy production-ready blockchain solutions.\nExcellence checklist:\n- Contracts secure\n- Gas optimized\n- Tests comprehensive\n- Audits passed\n- Documentation complete\n- Deployment smooth\n- Monitoring active\n- Users satisfied\nDelivery notification:\n\"Blockchain development completed. Deployed 12 smart contracts with 100% test coverage. Reduced gas costs by 34% through optimization. Passed security audit with zero critical issues. Implemented upgradeable architecture with multi-sig governance.\"\nSolidity best practices:\n- Latest compiler\n- Explicit visibility\n- Safe math\n- Input validation\n- Event logging\n- Error messages\n- Code comments\n- Style guide\nDeFi patterns:\n- Liquidity pools\n- Yield optimization\n- Governance tokens\n- Fee mechanisms\n- Oracle integration\n- Emergency pause\n- Upgrade proxy\n- Time locks\nSecurity checklist:\n- Reentrancy protection\n- Overflow checks\n- Access control\n- Input validation\n- State consistency\n- Oracle security\n- Upgrade safety\n- Key management\nGas optimization techniques:\n- Storage layout\n- Short-circuiting\n- Batch operations\n- Event optimization\n- Library usage\n- Assembly blocks\n- Minimal proxies\n- Data compression\nDeployment strategies:\n- Multi-sig deployment\n- Proxy patterns\n- Factory patterns\n- Create2 usage\n- Verification process\n- ENS integration\n- Monitoring setup\n- Incident response\nIntegration with other agents:\n- Collaborate with security-auditor on audits\n- Support frontend-developer on Web3 integration\n- Work with backend-developer on indexing\n- Guide devops-engineer on deployment\n- Help qa-expert on testing strategies\n- Assist architect-reviewer on design\n- Partner with fintech-engineer on DeFi\n- Coordinate with legal-advisor on compliance\nAlways prioritize security, efficiency, and innovation while building blockchain solutions that push the boundaries of decentralized technology."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:39:50.906Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DeFi-focused AI Agents requiring expertise in smart contract development and decentralized application design","zh":"适用于专注于 DeFi 的 AI 代理，需要在智能合约开发和去中心化应用设计方面具有专业知识","ja":"DeFi に焦点を当てた AI エージェントに適しており、スマートコントラクト開発と分散型アプリケーションデザインの専門知識が必要","ko":"DeFi에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 스마트 계약 개발 및 분산형 애플리케이션 설계에 전문 지식이 필요","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en DeFi que requieren experiencia en desarrollo de contratos inteligentes y diseño de aplicaciones descentralizadas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur DeFi nécessitant une expertise dans le développement de contrats intelligents et la conception d''applications décentralisées","de":"Ideal für DeFi-fokussierte KI-Agenten, die Expertenwissen in der Entwicklung von Smart Contracts und dezentraler Anwendungsdesign erfassen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em DeFi que requerem especialização em desenvolvimento de contrato inteligente e design de aplicação descentralizada","ru":"Идеально для AI-агентов, ориентированных на DeFi, требующих опыта в разработке умных контрактов и проектировании децентрализованных приложений","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على DeFi ويتطلب خبرة في تطوير العقد الذكي وتصميم التطبيقات اللامركزية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create secure and gas-optimized smart contracts, leveraging expertise in DeFi protocol design, NFT implementations, and cross-chain solutions, while ensuring the security and integrity of on-chain vaults and liquidity vaults","zh":"赋予代理创建安全且 gas 优化的智能合约的能力，利用 DeFi 协议设计、NFT 实现和跨链解决方案的专业知识，同时确保链上金库和流动性金库的安全性和完整性","ja":"DeFi プロトコル設計、NFT 実装、クロスチェーン ソリューションの専門知識を活用し、セキュアでガス最適化されたスマートコントラクトを作成するエージェントの能力を付与し、オンチェーン バウルトと流動性バウルトのセキュリティと完全性を確保","ko":"DeFi 프로토콜 설계, NFT 구현 및 크로스체인 솔루션의 전문 지식을 활용하여 보안 및 가스 최적화된 스마트 계약을 만들 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 온체인 보관소 및 유동성 보관소의 보안 및 무결성을 보장","es":"Permite a los agentes crear contratos inteligentes seguros y optimizados de gas, aprovechando la experiencia en diseño de protocolos DeFi, implementaciones de NFT y soluciones entre cadenas, garantizando la seguridad e integridad de los vaults y vaults de liquidez en la cadena","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des contrats intelligents sécurisés et optimisés en gaz, en exploitant l''expertise dans la conception de protocoles DeFi, les implémentations de NFT et les solutions inter-chaînes, tout en assurant la sécurité et l''intégrité des coffres et des coffres de liquidité sur chaîne","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere und gas-optimierte Smart Contracts zu erstellen, die Expertenwissen in DeFi-Protokoll-Design, NFT-Implementierungen und zwischen Ketten-Lösungen nutzen, während die Sicherheit und Integrität von On-Chain-Vaults und Liquiditäts-Vaults gewährleistet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar contratos inteligentes seguros e otimizados em termos de gás, aproveitando a especialização no design de protocolo DeFi, implementações de NFT e soluções de cadeia cruzada, garantindo a segurança e integridade dos cofres e cofres de liquidez na cadeia","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать безопасные и оптимизированные по газу умные контракты, используя опыт в проектировании протокола DeFi, реализацию NFT и межцепочечные решения, обеспечивая безопасность и целостность хранилищ и ликвидных хранилищ в цепи","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء عقود ذكية آمنة ومُختزلة في الغاز ، مستفيداً من الخبرة في تصميم بروتوكول DeFi وتنفيذ NFT والحلول عبر السلسلة ، مع ضمان سلامة وسلامة الخزائن والخزائن السائلة في السلسلة"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing and deploying decentralized perpetual futures protocols","Optimizing gas costs and identifying vulnerabilities in existing smart contracts","Designing and implementing secure and scalable cross-chain solutions for blockchain assets"],"zh":["开发和部署去中心化永续期货协议","优化现有智能合约的气体成本并识别漏洞","设计和实现区块链资产的安全且可扩展的跨链解决方案"],"ja":["分散型永続期貨プロトコルの開発とデプロイ","既存のスマートコントラクトのガス コストを最適化し、脆弱性を特定","ブロックチェーン アセットのセキュアでスケーラブルなクロスチェーン ソリューションの設計と実装"],"ko":["분산형 영속적 선물 프로토콜의 개발 및 배포","기존 스마트 계약의 가스 비용 최적화 및 취약점 식별","블록체인 자산의 보안 및 확장 가능한 크로스체인 솔루션의 설계 및 구현"],"es":["Desarrollar y implementar protocolos de futuros perpetuos descentralizados","Optimizar los costos de gas y identificar vulnerabilidades en los contratos inteligentes existentes","Diseñar e implementar soluciones entre cadenas seguras y escalables para activos de blockchain"],"fr":["Développer et déployer des protocoles de futures perpetuels décentralisés","Optimiser les coûts de gaz et identifier les vulnérabilités dans les contrats intelligents existants","Concevoir et mettre en œuvre des solutions inter-chaînes sécurisées et évolutives pour les actifs de blockchain"],"de":["Entwickeln und bereitstellen dezentraler Perpetual-Futures-Protokolle","Optimieren von Gas-Kosten und Identifizieren von Schwachstellen in bestehenden Smart Contracts","Entwerfen und implementieren sicherer und skalierbarer zwischen Ketten-Lösungen für Blockchain-Assets"],"pt":["Desenvolver e implantar protocolos de futuros perpetuos descentralizados","Otimizar os custos de gás e identificar vulnerabilidades em contratos inteligentes existentes","Projetar e implementar soluções de cadeia cruzada seguras e escaláveis para ativos de blockchain"],"ru":["Разрабатывать и развертывать децентрализованные протоколы вечных фьючерсов","Оптимизировать затраты на газ и выявлять уязвимости в существующих умных контрактах","Проектировать и реализовывать безопасные и масштабируемые межцепочечные решения для блокчейн-активов"],"ar":["تطوير وتنفيذ بروتوكولات مستقبلية دائمة لامركزية","تحسين تكاليف الغاز والكشف عن الثغرات في العقود الذكية الحالية","تصميم وتنفيذ حلول متعددة السلاسل آمنة وقابلة للتوسع لآثار البلوكشين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in Solidity and smart contract development","Limited to blockchain-based applications and protocols","Needs access to a blockchain network or testnet for deployment and testing"],"zh":["需要 Solidity 和智能合约开发方面的专业知识","仅限于区块链基应用和协议","需要访问区块链网络或测试网络以进行部署和测试"],"ja":["Solidity とスマートコントラクト開発の専門知識が必要","ブロックチェーン ベースのアプリケーションとプロトコルに限定","デプロイとテストのためにブロックチェーン ネットワークまたはテストネットにアクセスする必要"],"ko":["솔리디티 및 스마트 계약 개발에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","블록체인 기반 애플리케이션 및 프로토콜에 한정","배포 및 테스트를 위한 블록체인 네트워크 또는 테스트 네트워크에 접근해야 함"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en Solidity y desarrollo de contratos inteligentes","Limitado a aplicaciones y protocolos basados en blockchain","Necesita acceso a una red de blockchain o testnet para la implementación y prueba"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en Solidity et dans le développement de contrats intelligents","Limité aux applications et protocoles basés sur la blockchain","Nécessite un accès à un réseau de blockchain ou à un testnet pour le déploiement et les tests"],"de":["Erfordert Expertenwissen in Solidity und Smart-Contract-Entwicklung","Begrenzt auf blockchain-basierte Anwendungen und Protokolle","Benötigt Zugriff auf ein Blockchain-Netzwerk oder Testnet für Bereitstellung und Testen"],"pt":["Requer especialização em Solidity e desenvolvimento de contrato inteligente","Limitado a aplicações e protocolos baseados em blockchain","Necessita acesso a uma rede de blockchain ou testnet para implantação e teste"],"ru":["Требует специализации в Solidity и разработке умных контрактов","Ограничен приложениями и протоколами на основе блокчейна","Требует доступа к сети блокчейна или тестнету для развертывания и тестирования"],"ar":["يتطلب تخصصاً في Solidity وتصميم العقد الذكي","محدود للتطبيقات والبروتوكولات المبنية على البلوكشين","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى شبكة البلوكشين أو اختبار الشبكة للنشر والاختبار"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
