,"複数のテストフレームワークのサポート","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["테스트 검증","옵션 제시","워크플로우 실행","리소스 정리","다중 테스트 프레임워크 지원","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Verificación de pruebas","Presentación de opciones","Ejecución de la elección","Limpieza y organización del código"],"fr":["Vérification des tests","Présentation d''options","Exécution du choix","Nettoyage et organisation du code"],"de":["Überprüfung von Tests","Darstellung von Optionen","Ausführung der Auswahl","Reinigung und Organisation des Codes"],"pt":["Verificação de testes","Apresentação de opções","Execução de fluxos de trabalho escolhidos","Limpeza de recursos","Suporte a múltiplos fluxos de trabalho"],"ru":["Проверка тестов","Представление вариантов","Выполнение выбранных рабочих процессов","Очистка ресурсов","Поддержка нескольких рабочих процессов"],"ar":["التحقق من الاختبارات","تقديم الخيارات","تنفيذ تدفقات العمل المختارة","تنظيف الموارد","دعم تدفقات العمل المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["完成开发分支","开发工作流","测试验证","开发效率","代码质量","自动化测试","开发工具","软件开发"],"ja":["開発ブランチ完了","開発ワークフロー","テスト検証","開発効率","コード品質","自動テスト","開発ツール","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["개발 분기 완료","개발 워크플로우","테스트 검증","개발 효율성","코드 품질","자동 테스트","개발 도구","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de software","ramas de desarrollo","pruebas de software","desarrollo eficiente","gestión de código","finalización de ramas"],"fr":["développement de logiciels","branches de développement","tests de logiciels","développement efficace","gestion de code","finalisation de branches"],"de":["Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungszweige","Software-Tests","effiziente Entwicklung","Code-Verwaltung","Fertigstellung von Zweigen"],"pt":["finalizar ramo de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","fluxo de trabalho","verificação de testes","limpeza de recursos","desenvolvimento ágil"],"ru":["завершение ветки разработки","разработка программного обеспечения","рабочий процесс","проверка тестов","очистка ресурсов","гибкая разработка"],"ar":["إكمال فرع التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","تدفق العمل","التحقق من الاختبارات","تنظيف الموارد","تطوير مرن"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"finishing-a-development-branch","description":"Use when implementation is complete, all tests pass, and you need to decide how to integrate the work - guides completion of development work by presenting structured options for merge, PR, or cleanup","bodyPreview":"# Finishing a Development Branch\n\n## Overview\n\nGuide completion of development work by presenting clear options and handling chosen workflow.\n\n**Core principle:** Verify tests → Present options → Execute choice → Clean up.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the finishing-a-development-branch skill to complete this work.\"\n\n## The Process\n\n### Step 1: Verify Tests\n\n**Before presenting options, verify tests pass:**\n\n```bash\n# Run project''s test suite\nnpm test / cargo test / pytest / go test ./...\n`","body":"# Finishing a Development Branch\n\n## Overview\n\nGuide completion of development work by presenting clear options and handling chosen workflow.\n\n**Core principle:** Verify tests → Present options → Execute choice → Clean up.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the finishing-a-development-branch skill to complete this work.\"\n\n## The Process\n\n### Step 1: Verify Tests\n\n**Before presenting options, verify tests pass:**\n\n```bash\n# Run project''s test suite\nnpm test / cargo test / pytest / go test ./...\n```\n\n**If tests fail:**\n```\nTests failing (<N> failures). Must fix before completing:\n\n[Show failures]\n\nCannot proceed with merge/PR until tests pass.\n```\n\nStop. Don''t proceed to Step 2.\n\n**If tests pass:** Continue to Step 2.\n\n### Step 2: Determine Base Branch\n\n```bash\n# Try common base branches\ngit merge-base HEAD main 2>/dev/null || git merge-base HEAD master 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nOr ask: \"This branch split from main - is that correct?\"\n\n### Step 3: Present Options\n\nPresent exactly these 4 options:\n\n```\nImplementation complete. What would you like to do?\n\n1. Merge back to <base-branch> locally\n2. Push and create a Pull Request\n3. Keep the branch as-is (I''ll handle it later)\n4. Discard this work\n\nWhich option?\n```\n\n**Don''t add explanation** - keep options concise.\n\n### Step 4: Execute Choice\n\n#### Option 1: Merge Locally\n\n```bash\n# Switch to base branch\ngit checkout <base-branch>\n\n# Pull latest\ngit pull\n\n# Merge feature branch\ngit merge <feature-branch>\n\n# Verify tests on merged result\n<test command>\n\n# If tests pass\ngit branch -d <feature-branch>\n```\n\nThen: Cleanup worktree (Step 5)\n\n#### Option 2: Push and Create PR\n\n```bash\n# Push branch\ngit push -u origin <feature-branch>\n\n# Create PR\ngh pr create --title \"<title>\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n<2-3 bullets of what changed>\n\n## Test Plan\n- [ ] <verification steps>\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\nThen: Cleanup worktree (Step 5)\n\n#### Option 3: Keep As-Is\n\nReport: \"Keeping branch <name>. Worktree preserved at <path>.\"\n\n**Don''t cleanup worktree.**\n\n#### Option 4: Discard\n\n**Confirm first:**\n```\nThis will permanently delete:\n- Branch <name>\n- All commits: <commit-list>\n- Worktree at <path>\n\nType ''discard'' to confirm.\n```\n\nWait for exact confirmation.\n\nIf confirmed:\n```bash\ngit checkout <base-branch>\ngit branch -D <feature-branch>\n```\n\nThen: Cleanup worktree (Step 5)\n\n### Step 5: Cleanup Worktree\n\n**For Options 1, 2, 4:**\n\nCheck if in worktree:\n```bash\ngit worktree list | grep $(git branch --show-current)\n```\n\nIf yes:\n```bash\ngit worktree remove <worktree-path>\n```\n\n**For Option 3:** Keep worktree.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Option | Merge | Push | Keep Worktree | Cleanup Branch |\n|--------|-------|------|---------------|----------------|\n| 1. Merge locally | ✓ | - | - | ✓ |\n| 2. Create PR | - | ✓ | ✓ | - |\n| 3. Keep as-is | - | - | ✓ | - |\n| 4. Discard | - | - | - | ✓ (force) |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**Skipping test verification**\n- **Problem:** Merge broken code, create failing PR\n- **Fix:** Always verify tests before offering options\n\n**Open-ended questions**\n- **Problem:** \"What should I do next?\" → ambiguous\n- **Fix:** Present exactly 4 structured options\n\n**Automatic worktree cleanup**\n- **Problem:** Remove worktree when might need it (Option 2, 3)\n- **Fix:** Only cleanup for Options 1 and 4\n\n**No confirmation for discard**\n- **Problem:** Accidentally delete work\n- **Fix:** Require typed \"discard\" confirmation\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Proceed with failing tests\n- Merge without verifying tests on result\n- Delete work without confirmation\n- Force-push without explicit request\n\n**Always:**\n- Verify tests before offering options\n- Present exactly 4 options\n- Get typed confirmation for Option 4\n- Clean up worktree for Options 1 & 4 only\n\n## Integration\n\n**Called by:**\n- **subagent-driven-development** (Step 7) - After all tasks complete\n- **executing-plans** (Step 5) - After all batches complete\n\n**Pairs with:**\n- **using-git-worktrees** - Cleans up worktree created by that skill\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:40:11.526Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined project completion workflows, particularly those utilizing npm, cargo, pytest, or go test.","zh":"适用于需要简化项目完成工作流的开发代理，特别是那些使用npm、cargo、pytest或go test的代理。","ja":"プロジェクトの完了ワークフローを簡素化する必要がある開発エージェントに適しています。特にnpm、cargo、pytest、またはgo testを使用するエージェントに適しています。","ko":"프로젝트 완성 워크플로를 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 npm, cargo, pytest 또는 go test를 사용하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren flujos de trabajo de finalización de proyectos optimizados, particularmente aquellos que utilizan npm, cargo, pytest o go test.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des flux de travail de finalisation de projet rationalisés, en particulier ceux qui utilisent npm, cargo, pytest ou go test.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die optimierte Arbeitsabläufe für die Projektabschluss benötigen, insbesondere solche, die npm, cargo, pytest oder go test verwenden.","pt":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined project completion workflows, particularly those utilizing npm, cargo, pytest, or go test.","ru":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined project completion workflows, particularly those utilizing npm, cargo, pytest, or go test.","ar":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined project completion workflows, particularly those utilizing npm, cargo, pytest, or go test."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently finish development branches by verifying tests, presenting workflow options, executing chosen actions, and cleaning up, leveraging core principles like test verification and option presentation, and utilizing tools such as npm test, cargo test, pytest, or go test.","zh":"赋予代理高效完成开发分支的能力，通过验证测试、呈现工作流选项、执行选定的操作和清理，利用核心原则如测试验证和选项呈现，并利用诸如npm test、cargo test、pytest或go test等工具。","ja":"エージェントが開発ブランチを効率的に完了できるようにします。テストの検証、ワークフロー オプションの提示、選択されたアクションの実行、クリーンアップを行い、テストの検証やオプションの提示などの基本原則を活用し、npm test、cargo test、pytest、またはgo testなどのツールを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 개발 브랜치를 효율적으로 완료할 수 있도록 합니다. 테스트 검증, 워크플로 옵션 표시, 선택한 동작 실행 및 정리 등을 통해 核心 원칙을 활용하고, npm test, cargo test, pytest 또는 go test와 같은 도구를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a finalizar eficientemente las ramas de desarrollo verificando pruebas, presentando opciones de flujo de trabajo, ejecutando acciones elegidas y limpiando, aprovechando principios básicos como la verificación de pruebas y la presentación de opciones, y utilizando herramientas como npm test, cargo test, pytest o go test.","fr":"Permet aux agents de terminer efficacement les branches de développement en vérifiant les tests, en présentant des options de workflow, en exécutant les actions choisies et en nettoyant, en exploitant des principes de base tels que la vérification des tests et la présentation d''options, et en utilisant des outils tels que npm test, cargo test, pytest ou go test.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, Entwicklungszweige effizient abzuschließen, indem sie Tests überprüfen, Arbeitsablauf-Optionen präsentieren, ausgewählte Aktionen ausführen und aufräumen, wobei sie grundlegende Prinzipien wie Testüberprüfung und Optionenpräsentation nutzen und Tools wie npm test, cargo test, pytest oder go test verwenden.","pt":"Empowers agents to efficiently finish development branches by verifying tests, presenting workflow options, executing chosen actions, and cleaning up, leveraging core principles like test verification and option presentation, and utilizing tools such as npm test, cargo test, pytest, or go test.","ru":"Empowers agents to efficiently finish development branches by verifying tests, presenting workflow options, executing chosen actions, and cleaning up, leveraging core principles like test verification and option presentation, and utilizing tools such as npm test, cargo test, pytest, or go test.","ar":"Empowers agents to efficiently finish development branches by verifying tests, presenting workflow options, executing chosen actions, and cleaning up, leveraging core principles like test verification and option presentation, and utilizing tools such as npm test, cargo test, pytest, or go test."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying project tests before deployment","Presenting developers with clear workflow options","Automating cleanup after branch completion"],"zh":["在部署前验证项目测试","向开发人员呈现清晰的工作流选项","自动清理分支完成后"],"ja":["デプロイ前にプロジェクトのテストを検証する","開発者に明確なワークフロー オプションを提示する","ブランチの完了後に自動でクリーンアップする"],"ko":["배포 전 프로젝트 테스트를 검증","개발자에게 명확한 워크플로 옵션을 제시","브랜치 완료 후 자동으로 정리"],"es":["Verificar las pruebas del proyecto antes de la implementación","Presentar a los desarrolladores opciones de flujo de trabajo claras","Automatizar la limpieza después de la finalización de la rama"],"fr":["Vérifier les tests du projet avant le déploiement","Présenter aux développeurs des options de workflow claires","Automatiser le nettoyage après la fin de la branche"],"de":["Überprüfen der Projekttests vor der Bereitstellung","Entwicklern klare Arbeitsablauf-Optionen präsentieren","Aufräumen nach dem Abschluss der Zweigautomatisierung"],"pt":["Verifying project tests before deployment","Presenting developers with clear workflow options","Automating cleanup after branch completion"],"ru":["Verifying project tests before deployment","Presenting developers with clear workflow options","Automating cleanup after branch completion"],"ar":["Verifying project tests before deployment","Presenting developers with clear workflow options","Automating cleanup after branch completion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project test suite setup","Limited to projects using supported testing frameworks like npm, cargo, pytest, or go test"],"zh":["需要项目测试套件设置","仅限于使用支持的测试框架，如npm、cargo、pytest或go test的项目"],"ja":["プロジェクトのテスト スイートの設定が必要","サポートされているテスト フレームワーク (npm、cargo、pytest、またはgo test) を使用するプロジェクトのみに限定"],"ko":["프로젝트 테스트 세트 설정이 필요","지원되는 테스트 프레임워크(npm, cargo, pytest 또는 go test)를 사용하는 프로젝트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la configuración del conjunto de pruebas del proyecto","Limitado a proyectos que utilizan marcos de prueba compatibles como npm, cargo, pytest o go test"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du jeu de tests du projet","Limité aux projets qui utilisent des cadres de test pris en charge comme npm, cargo, pytest ou go test"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung des Projekt-Test-Suiten","Begrenzt auf Projekte, die unterstützte Test-Frameworks wie npm, cargo, pytest oder go test verwenden"],"pt":["Requires project test suite setup","Limited to projects using supported testing frameworks like npm, cargo, pytest, or go test"],"ru":["Requires project test suite setup","Limited to projects using supported testing frameworks like npm, cargo, pytest, or go test"],"ar":["Requires project test suite setup","Limited to