ptimización de rendimiento para React y Next.js"],"fr":["40+ règles d''optimisation","8 catégories d''améliorations","Guide pour la refactorisation automatique","Génération de code","Optimisation des performances pour React et Next.js"],"de":["40+ Optimierungsregeln","8 Kategorien von Verbesserungen","Leitfaden für die automatische Refaktorierung","Codegenerierung","Leistungsoptimierung für React und Next.js"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho para React e Next.js","40+ regras em 8 categorias","Priorização de regras por impacto","Guia para refatoração automática e geração de código"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для React и Next.js","40+ правил в 8 категориях","Приоритизация правил по влиянию","Руководство для автоматической рефакторации и генерации кода"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js","40+ قاعدة في 8 فئات","ترتيب الأولويات للقواعد حسب التأثير","دليل إرشادي لتحسين الترميز التلقائي وتوليد الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 优化","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","React 最佳实践","前端开发","Web 开发"],"ja":["React 最適化","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","React ベストプラクティス","フロントエンド開発","Web 開発"],"ko":["React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","React 최적화 모범 사례","프론트엔드 개발","웹 개발"],"es":["mejores prácticas de React","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo de aplicaciones","reglas de optimización","refactorización automática","generación de código"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques React","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement d''applications","règles d''optimisation","refactorisation automatique","génération de code"],"de":["Best Practices für React","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Anwendungsentwicklung","Optimierungsregeln","automatische Refaktorierung","Codegenerierung"],"pt":["melhores práticas react","otimização de desempenho react","next.js","desenvolvimento web","react performance optimization","react best practices"],"ru":["лучшие практики react","оптимизация производительности react","next.js","веб-разработка","react производительность оптимизация","react лучшие практики"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات ل-react","تحسين الأداء ل-react","next.js","تطوير الويب","تحسين الأداء ل-react","أفضل الممارسات ل-react"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, containing 40+ rules across 8 categories. Rules are prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for","body":"# React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, containing 40+ rules across 8 categories. Rules are prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\nRules are prioritized by impact:\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact |\n|----------|----------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical Patterns (Apply First)\n\n**Eliminate Waterfalls:**\n- Defer await until needed (move into branches)\n- Use `Promise.all()` for independent async operations\n- Start promises early, await late\n- Use `better-all` for partial dependencies\n- Use Suspense boundaries to stream content\n\n**Reduce Bundle Size:**\n- Avoid barrel file imports (import directly from source)\n- Use `next/dynamic` for heavy components\n- Defer non-critical third-party libraries\n- Preload based on user intent\n\n### High-Impact Server Patterns\n\n- Use `React.cache()` for per-request deduplication\n- Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- Minimize serialization at RSC boundaries\n- Parallelize data fetching with component composition\n\n### Medium-Impact Client Patterns\n\n- Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- Defer state reads to usage point\n- Use lazy state initialization for expensive values\n- Use derived state subscriptions\n- Apply `startTransition` for non-urgent updates\n\n### Rendering Patterns\n\n- Animate SVG wrappers, not SVG elements directly\n- Use `content-visibility: auto` for long lists\n- Prevent hydration mismatch with inline scripts\n- Use explicit conditional rendering (`? :` not `&&`)\n\n### JavaScript Patterns\n\n- Batch DOM CSS changes via classes\n- Build index maps for repeated lookups\n- Cache repeated function calls\n- Use `toSorted()` instead of `sort()` for immutability\n- Early length check for array comparisons\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples is available in:\n\n- `references/react-performance-guidelines.md` - Complete guide with all patterns\n- `references/rules/` - Individual rule files organized by category\n\nTo look up a specific pattern, grep the rules directory:\n```\ngrep -l \"suspense\" references/rules/\ngrep -l \"barrel\" references/rules/\ngrep -l \"swr\" references/rules/\n```\n\n## Rule Categories in `references/rules/`\n\n- `async-*` - Waterfall elimination patterns\n- `bundle-*` - Bundle size optimization\n- `server-*` - Server-side performance\n- `client-*` - Client-side data fetching\n- `rerender-*` - Re-render optimization\n- `rendering-*` - DOM rendering performance\n- `js-*` - JavaScript micro-optimizations\n- `advanced-*` - Advanced patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:40:02.521Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React component rendering and performance enhancement.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 组件渲染和性能增强的前端代理","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントの最適化された React コンポーネントレンダリングとパフォーマンスの向上に最適","ko":"최적화된 React 컴포넌트 렌더링 및 성능 향상을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan una renderización de componentes de React optimizados y una mejora del rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''un rendu de composants React optimisé et d''une amélioration des performances.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine optimierte React-Komponenten-Renderung und eine Leistungssteigerung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de renderização de componentes React otimizados e melhoria de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходима оптимизированная отрисовка компонентов React и улучшение производительности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تقديم مكونات React متقدمة وتحسين الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to refactor and optimize React and Next.js applications using 40+ rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact for automated code generation and review, leveraging React best practices for improved performance and efficiency.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 40+ 条规则和 8 个类别的重构和优化 React 和 Next.js 应用程序的能力，按照影响力优先用于自动代码生成和审查，利用 React 最佳实践来提高性能和效率","ja":"エージェントに、40以上のルールと8つのカテゴリを使用してReactとNext.jsアプリケーションをリファクタリングして最適化する能力を与え、影響力に基づいて自動コード生成とレビューを優先し、パフォーマンスと効率の向上のためのReactのベストプラクティスを利用する","ko":"에이전트에게 40개 이상의 규칙과 8개의 카테고리를 사용하여 리액트와 넥스트.js 애플리케이션을 리팩토링하고 최적화하는 능력을 부여하여 자동 코드 생성과 검토를 영향력에 따라 우선순위로 하며 리액트의 최선의 관행을 사용하여 성능과 효율을 향상","es":"Habilita a los agentes a refactorizar y optimizar aplicaciones de React y Next.js utilizando más de 40 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto para la generación y revisión automatizada de código, aprovechando las mejores prácticas de React para mejorar el rendimiento y la eficiencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de refactoriser et d''optimiser les applications React et Next.js en utilisant plus de 40 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact pour la génération et la révision automatique de code, en exploitant les meilleures pratiques de React pour améliorer les performances et l''efficacité.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, React- und Next.js-Anwendungen unter Verwendung von über 40 Regeln in 8 Kategorien zu refactorisieren und zu optimieren, priorisiert nach Auswirkung für die automatisierte Codegenerierung und -prüfung, unter Ausnutzung der besten React-Praktiken für eine verbesserte Leistung und Effizienz.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a refatorar e otimizar aplicações React e Next.js usando 40+ regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto para geração e revisão de código automatizadas, aproveitando as melhores práticas do React para melhorar o desempenho e a eficiência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью рефакторинга и оптимизации приложений React и Next.js с помощью 40+ правил в 8 категориях, отсортированных по степени воздействия для автоматизированного кодогенерации и проверки, используя лучшие практики React для улучшения производительности и эффективности.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إعادة هيكلة وتحسين تطبيقات React و Next.js باستخدام 40+ قاعدة في 8 فئات، مصنفة حسب التأثير للتحليل التلقائي وتحسين الكود، مستفيداً من أفضل ممارسات React لتحسين الأداء والكفاءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for React components","Optimizing performance for Next.js pages","Generating optimized code for data fetching and server-side rendering"],"zh":["自动化 React 组件的代码审查","优化 Next.js 页面的性能","生成优化的代码用于数据获取和服务器端渲染"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントのコードレビューを自動化する","Next.jsページのパフォーマンスを最適化する","データ取得とサーバーサイドレンダリングのための最適化されたコードを生成する"],"ko":["리액트 컴포넌트의 코드 리뷰를 자동화하는 것","넥스트.js 페이지의 성능을 최적화하는 것","데이터 가져오기 및 서버 측 렌더링을 위한 최적화된 코드를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para componentes de React","Optimizar el rendimiento para páginas de Next.js","Generar código optimizado para la recuperación de datos y la renderización del lado del servidor"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les composants React","Optimiser les performances pour les pages Next.js","Générer du code optimisé pour la récupération de données et le rendu côté serveur"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für React-Komponenten","Optimieren der Leistung für Next.js-Seiten","Generieren von optimiertem Code für die Datenerfassung und die Server-seitige Renderung"],"pt":["Automatizar análises de código para componentes React","Otimizar o desempenho para páginas Next.js","Gerar código otimizado para busca de dados e renderização no servidor"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода для компонентов React","Оптимизировать производительность для страниц Next.js","Генерировать оптимизированный код для запроса данных и рендеринга на сервере"],"ar":["التحكم التلقائي في مراجعة الكود لمكونات React","تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات Next.js","توليد الكود المتقدم للبحث عن البيانات وتقديمها على الخادم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js project setup","Limited to JavaScript and TypeScript support"],"zh":["需要 React 或 Next.js 项目设置","仅限 JavaScript 和 TypeScript 支持"],"ja":["ReactまたはNext.jsプロジェクトの設定が必要","JavaScriptとTypeScriptのサポートのみ"],"ko":["리액트 또는 넥스트.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요","자바스크립트와 타입스크립트만 지원"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de proyecto de React o Next.js","Limitado al soporte de JavaScript y TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React ou Next.js","Limité au support de JavaScript et TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt eine Projektsetup von React oder Next.js","Begrenzt auf JavaScript- und TypeScript-Unterstützung"],"pt":["Requer configuração de projeto React ou Next.js","Limitado ao suporte a JavaScript e TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта React или Next.js","Ограничен поддержкой только JavaScript и TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع React أو Next.js","محدود بالدعم لجافا سكريبت وتايب سكريبت فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('charlietlamb/ferix/Convex File Storage', 'community', 'charlietlamb', 'ferix', 'charlietlamb/ferix', 'Convex File Storage', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z', '2026-02-18T12:40:04.994Z', NULL, '{"id":"charlietlamb/ferix/Convex File Storage","name":"Convex File Storage","description":{"zh":"Convex, ","ja":"Convex","ko":"Convex, ","es":"Convex File Storage es un hub centralizado para gestionar archivos en aplicaciones Convex","fr":"Le stockage de fichiers Convex est un hub centralisé pour gérer les fichiers dans les applications Convex","de":"Convex Dateispeicher ist ein zentralisiertes Hub für die Dateiverwaltung in Convex-Anwendungen","pt":"O Armazenamento de Arquivos Convex é um hub centralizado para gerenciar uploads, armazenamento e servindo de arquivos em aplicações Convex.","ru":"Хранилище Файлов Convex — это централизованный хаб для управления загрузкой, хранением и обслуживанием файлов в приложениях Convex.","ar":"تخزين الملفات المح,､د Convex هو مركز مركزي لادارة تحميل و تخزين و تقديم الملفات في تطبيقات Convex.","en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Convex ","ja":"Convex","ko":"Convex ","es":"Almacenamiento de archivos Convex","fr":"Stockage de fichiers Convex","de":"Convex Dateispeicher","pt":"Armazenamento de Arquivos Convex","ru":"Хранилище Файлов Convex","ar":"تخزين الملفات المح,､د Convex","en":"Convex File Storage"},"description":{"zh":"Convex, ","ja":"Convex","ko":"Convex, ","es":"Convex File Storage es un hub centralizado para gestionar archivos en aplicaciones Convex","fr":"Le stockage de fichiers Convex est un hub centralisé pour gérer les fichiers dans les applications Convex","de":"Convex Dateispeicher ist ein zentralisiertes Hub für die Dateiverwaltung in Convex-Anwendungen","pt":"O Armazenamento de Arquivos Convex é um hub centralizado para gerenciar uploads, armazenamento e servindo de arquivos em aplicações Convex.","ru":"Хранилище Файлов Convex — это централизованный хаб для управления загрузкой, хранением и обслуживанием файлов в приложениях Convex.","ar":"تخزين الملفات المح,､د Convex هو مركز مركزي لادارة تحميل و تخزين و تقديم الملفات في تطبيقات Convex.","en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"definition":{"en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"features":{"zh":["Convex","","","URL"],"ja":["Convex","","","URL"],"ko":["Convex","","","URL"],"es":["Subir archivos","Servir archivos","Gestionar imágenes","Gestionar documentos","Gestionar archivos generados"],"fr":["Télécharger des fichiers","Servir des fichiers","Gérer les images","Gérer les documents","Gérer les fichiers générés"],"de":["Dateien hochladen","Dateien servieren","Bilder verwalten","Dokumente verwalten","Generierte Dateien verwalten"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de uploads de arquivos","Armazenamento de arquivos com padrões adequados","Servindo de arquivos em aplicações Convex","Suporte a imagens, documentos e arquivos gerados","Documentação completa para implementação","Integração com a plataforma Convex"],"ru":["Управление загрузкой файлов","Хранение файлов с правильными шаблонами","Обслуживание файлов в приложениях Convex","Поддержка изображений, документов и сгенерированных файлов","Полная документация для реализации","Интеграция с платформой Convex"],"ar":["ادارة تحميل الملفات","تخزين الملفات مع الأنماط المناسبة","تقديم الملفات في تطبيقات Convex","دعم الصور و المستندات و الملفات المولدة","توثيق كامل للتنفيذ","التكامل مع منصة Convex"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex","File Storage","Cloud Storage","File Upload","File Serving","Convex"],"ja":["Convex","File Storage","Cloud Storage","File Upload","File Serving","Convex"],"ko":["Convex","File Storage","Cloud Storage","File Upload","File Serving","Convex"],"es":["almacenamiento de archivos Convex","gestión de archivos","subir archivos","servir archivos","Convex","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["stockage de fichiers Convex","gestion de fichiers","télécharger des fichiers","servir des fichiers","Convex","développement d''applications"],"de":["Convex Dateispeicher","Dateiverwaltung","Dateien hochladen","Dateien servieren","Convex","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Armazenamento de Arquivos Convex","Gerenciamento de arquivos","Upload de arquivos","Servindo de arquivos","Aplicações Convex","Desenvolvimento de software","Gerenciamento de dados","Convex"],"ru":["Хранилище Файлов Convex","Управление файлами","Загрузка файлов","Обслуживание файлов","Приложения Convex","Разработка программного обеспечения","Управление данными","Convex"],"ar":["تخزين الملفات المح,､د Convex","ادارة الملفات","تحميل الملفات","تقديم الملفات","تطبيقات Convex","تطوير البرمجيات","ادارة البيانات","Convex"]}},"owner":"charlietlamb","repo":"ferix","repoPath":"charlietlamb/ferix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex File Storage","description":"Complete file handling including upload flows, serving files via URL, storing generated files from actions, deletion, and accessing file metadata from system tables","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","file-storage","uploads","images","files"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex File Storage\n\nHandle file uploads, storage, serving, and management in Convex applications with proper patterns for images, documents, and generated files.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage\n- Upload Files: https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files\n- Serve Files: https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## I","body":"# Convex File Storage\n\nHandle file uploads, storage, serving, and management in Convex applications with proper patterns for images, documents, and generated files.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage\n- Upload Files: https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files\n- Serve Files: https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### File Storage Overview\n\nConvex provides built-in file storage with:\n- Automatic URL generation for serving files\n- Support for any file type (images, PDFs, videos, etc.)\n- File metadata via the `_storage` system table\n- Integration with mutations and actions\n\n### Generating Upload URLs\n\n```typescript\n// convex/files.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const generateUploadUrl = mutation({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.string(),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    return await ctx.storage.generateUploadUrl();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Client-Side Upload\n\n```typescript\n// React component\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\nimport { useState } from \"react\";\n\nfunction FileUploader() {\n  const generateUploadUrl = useMutation(api.files.generateUploadUrl);\n  const saveFile = useMutation(api.files.saveFile);\n  const [uploading, setUploading] = useState(false);\n\n  const handleUpload = async (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\n    const file = e.target.files?.[0];\n    if (!file) return;\n\n    setUploading(true);\n    try {\n      // Step 1: Get upload URL\n      const uploadUrl = await generateUploadUrl();\n\n      // Step 2: Upload file to storage\n      const result = await fetch(uploadUrl, {\n        method: \"POST\",\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": file.type },\n        body: file,\n      });\n\n      const { storageId } = await result.json();\n\n      // Step 3: Save file reference to database\n      await saveFile({\n        storageId,\n        fileName: file.name,\n        fileType: file.type,\n        fileSize: file.size,\n      });\n    } finally {\n      setUploading(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <input\n        type=\"file\"\n        onChange={handleUpload}\n        disabled={uploading}\n      />\n      {uploading && <p>Uploading...</p>}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Saving File References\n\n```typescript\n// convex/files.ts\nimport { mutation, query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const saveFile = mutation({\n  args: {\n    storageId: v.id(\"_storage\"),\n    fileName: v.string(),\n    fileType: v.string(),\n    fileSize: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"files\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"files\", {\n      storageId: args.storageId,\n      fileName: args.fileName,\n      fileType: args.fileType,\n      fileSize: args.fileSize,\n      uploadedAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Serving Files via URL\n\n```typescript\n// convex/files.ts\nexport const getFileUrl = query({\n  args: { storageId: v.id(\"_storage\") },\n  returns: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.storage.getUrl(args.storageId);\n  },\n});\n\n// Get file with URL\nexport const getFile = query({\n  args: { fileId: v.id(\"files\") },\n  returns: v.union(\n    v.object({\n      _id: v.id(\"files\"),\n      fileName: v.string(),\n      fileType: v.string(),\n      fileSize: v.number(),\n      url: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\n    }),\n    v.null()\n  ),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const file = await ctx.db.get(args.fileId);\n    if (!file) return null;\n\n    const url = await ctx.storage.getUrl(file.storageId);\n    \n    return {\n      _id: file._id,\n      fileName: file.fileName,\n      fileType: file.fileType,\n      fileSize: file.fileSize,\n      url,\n    };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Displaying Files in React\n\n```typescript\nimport { useQuery } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction FileDisplay({ fileId }: { fileId: Id<\"files\"> }) {\n  const file = useQuery(api.files.getFile, { fileId });\n\n  if (!file) return <div>Loading...</div>;\n  if (!file.url) return <div>File not found</div>;\n\n  // Handle different file types\n  if (file.fileType.startsWith(\"image/\")) {\n    return <img src={file.url} alt={file.fileName} />;\n  }\n\n  if (file.fileType === \"application/pdf\") {\n    return (\n      <iframe\n        src={file.url}\n        title={file.fileName}\n        width=\"100%\"\n        height=\"600px\"\n      />\n    );\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <a href={file.url} download={file.fileName}>\n      Download {file.fileName}\n    </a>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Storing Generated Files from Actions\n\n```typescript\n// convex/generate.ts\n\"use node\";\n\nimport { action } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { api } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nexport const generatePDF = action({\n  args: { content: v.string() },\n  returns: v.id(\"_storage\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Generate PDF (example using a library)\n    const pdfBuffer = await generatePDFFromContent(args.content);\n\n    // Convert to Blob\n    const blob = new Blob([pdfBuffer], { type: \"application/pdf\" });\n\n    // Store in Convex\n    const storageId = await ctx.storage.store(blob);\n\n    return storageId;\n  },\n});\n\n// Generate and save image\nexport const generateImage = action({\n  args: { prompt: v.string() },\n  returns: v.id(\"_storage\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Call external API to generate image\n    const response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/generate\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      body: JSON.stringify({ prompt: args.prompt }),\n    });\n\n    const imageBuffer = await response.arrayBuffer();\n    const blob = new Blob([imageBuffer], { type: \"image/png\" });\n\n    return await ctx.storage.store(blob);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Accessing File Metadata\n\n```typescript\n// convex/files.ts\nimport { query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n\ntype FileMetadata = {\n  _id: Id<\"_storage\">;\n  _creationTime: number;\n  contentType?: string;\n  sha256: string;\n  size: number;\n};\n\nexport const getFileMetadata = query({\n  args: { storageId: v.id(\"_storage\") },\n  returns: v.union(\n    v.object({\n      _id: v.id(\"_storage\"),\n      _creationTime: v.number(),\n      contentType: v.optional(v.string()),\n      sha256: v.string(),\n      size: v.number(),\n    }),\n    v.null()\n  ),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const metadata = await ctx.db.system.get(args.storageId);\n    return metadata as FileMetadata | null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Deleting Files\n\n```typescript\n// convex/files.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const deleteFile = mutation({\n  args: { fileId: v.id(\"files\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const file = await ctx.db.get(args.fileId);\n    if (!file) return null;\n\n    // Delete from storage\n    await ctx.storage.delete(file.storageId);\n\n    // Delete database record\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.fileId);\n\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Image Upload with Preview\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\nimport { useState, useRef } from \"react\";\n\nfunction ImageUploader({ onUpload }: { onUpload: (id: Id<\"files\">) => void }) {\n  const generateUploadUrl = useMutation(api.files.generateUploadUrl);\n  const saveFile = useMutation(api.files.saveFile);\n  const [preview, setPreview] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [uploading, setUploading] = useState(false);\n  const inputRef = useRef<HTMLInputElement>(null);\n\n  const handleFileSelect = async (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\n    const file = e.target.files?.[0];\n    if (!file) return;\n\n    // Validate file type\n    if (!file.type.startsWith(\"image/\")) {\n      alert(\"Please select an image file\");\n      return;\n    }\n\n    // Validate file size (max 10MB)\n    if (file.size > 10 * 1024 * 1024) {\n      alert(\"File size must be less than 10MB\");\n      return;\n    }\n\n    // Show preview\n    const reader = new FileReader();\n    reader.onload = (e) => setPreview(e.target?.result as string);\n    reader.readAsDataURL(file);\n\n    // Upload\n    setUploading(true);\n    try {\n      const uploadUrl = await generateUploadUrl();\n      const result = await fetch(uploadUrl, {\n        method: \"POST\",\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": file.type },\n        body: file,\n      });\n\n      const { storageId } = await result.json();\n      const fileId = await saveFile({\n        storageId,\n        fileName: file.name,\n        fileType: file.type,\n        fileSize: file.size,\n      });\n\n      onUpload(fileId);\n    } finally {\n      setUploading(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <input\n        ref={inputRef}\n        type=\"file\"\n        accept=\"image/*\"\n        onChange={handleFileSelect}\n        style={{ display: \"none\" }}\n      />\n      \n      <button\n        onClick={() => inputRef.current?.click()}\n        disabled={uploading}\n      >\n        {uploading ? \"Uploading...\" : \"Select Image\"}\n      </button>\n\n      {preview && (\n        <img\n          src={preview}\n          alt=\"Preview\"\n          style={{ maxWidth: 200, marginTop: 10 }}\n        />\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Schema for File Storage\n\n```typescript\n// convex/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  files: defineTable({\n    storageId: v.id(\"_storage\"),\n    fileName: v.string(),\n    fileType: v.string(),\n    fileSize: v.number(),\n    uploadedBy: v.id(\"users\"),\n    uploadedAt: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_user\", [\"uploadedBy\"])\n    .index(\"by_type\", [\"fileType\"]),\n\n  // User avatars\n  users: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    email: v.string(),\n    avatarStorageId: v.optional(v.id(\"_storage\")),\n  }),\n\n  // Posts with images\n  posts: defineTable({\n    authorId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n    imageStorageIds: v.array(v.id(\"_storage\")),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_author\", [\"authorId\"]),\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Validate file types and sizes on the client before uploading\n- Store file metadata (name, type, size) in your own table\n- Use the `_storage` system table only for Convex metadata\n- Delete storage files when deleting database references\n- Use appropriate Content-Type headers when uploading\n- Consider image optimization for large images\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Not setting Content-Type header** - Files may not serve correctly\n2. **Forgetting to delete storage** - Orphaned files waste storage\n3. **Not validating file types** - Security risk for malicious uploads\n4. **Large file uploads without progress** - Poor UX for users\n5. **Using deprecated getMetadata** - Use ctx.db.system.get instead\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- File Storage: https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage\n- Upload Files: https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files\n- Serve Files: https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:40:04.994Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code requiring centralized file management for images, documents, and generated files in Convex applications.","zh":"非常适合需要集中管理Convex应用程序中图像、文档和生成文件的AI代理，如Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code。","ja":"Convexアプリケーションにおける画像、ドキュメント、生成ファイルの一元化されたファイル管理を必要とするCursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Convex 애플리케이션에서 이미지, 문서 및 생성된 파일을 위한 중앙 집중식 파일 관리가 필요한 Cursor, Windsurf 및 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que requieren una gestión de archivos centralizada para imágenes, documentos y archivos generados en aplicaciones Convex.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une gestion de fichiers centralisée pour les images, les documents et les fichiers générés dans les applications Convex.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine zentrale Dateiverwaltung für Bilder, Dokumente und generierte Dateien in Convex-Anwendungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que requerem gerenciamento de arquivos centralizado para imagens, documentos e arquivos gerados em aplicações Convex.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих централизованного управления файлами для изображений, документов и сгенерированных файлов в приложениях Convex.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تتطلب إدارة مركزية للملفات للصور والوثائق والملفات المولدة في تطبيقات Convex."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle file uploads, storage, serving, and management with proper patterns, leveraging Convex file storage capabilities for secure and efficient data handling, including support for uploading files via https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files and serving files through https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files.","zh":"使代理能够通过正确模式处理文件上传、存储、提供和管理，利用Convex文件存储功能实现安全高效的数据处理，包括支持通过https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files上传文件以及通过https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files提供文件。","ja":"適切なパターンを用いてファイルのアップロード、保存、提供、管理を処理するエージェントを強化し、安全で効率的なデータ処理を実現するConvexファイルストレージ機能を活用します。https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-filesを介したファイルのアップロードと、https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-filesを介したファイルの提供のサポートを含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 적절한 패턴으로 파일 업로드, 저장, 제공 및 관리를 처리할 수 있도록 하여, 안전하고 효율적인 데이터 처리를 위한 Convex 파일 저장소 기능을 활용합니다. 여기에는 https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files를 통한 파일 업로드 및 https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files를 통한 파일 제공 지원이 포함됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes manejar la carga, el almacenamiento, la entrega y la gestión de archivos con patrones adecuados, aprovechando las capacidades de almacenamiento de archivos de Convex para un manejo de datos seguro y eficiente, incluyendo soporte para la carga de archivos a través de https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files y la entrega de archivos a través de https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les téléchargements, le stockage, la diffusion et la gestion de fichiers avec des modèles appropriés, en exploitant les capacités de stockage de fichiers Convex pour un traitement de données sécurisé et efficace, y compris la prise en charge du téléchargement de fichiers via https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files et la diffusion de fichiers via https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Dateiuploads, -speicherung, -bereitstellung und -verwaltung mit geeigneten Mustern zu handhaben, indem es die Dateispeicherfunktionen von Convex für sicheres und effizientes Datenhandling nutzt, einschließlich Unterstützung für das Hochladen von Dateien über https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files und das Bereitstellen von Dateien über https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com uploads de arquivos, armazenamento, fornecimento e gerenciamento com padrões adequados, aproveitando as capacidades de armazenamento de arquivos do Convex para manipulação de dados segura e eficiente, incluindo suporte para uploads de arquivos via https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files e fornecimento de arquivos por meio de https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать загрузку файлов, хранение, предоставление и управление с помощью правильных шаблонов, используя возможности хранения файлов Convex для безопасной и эффективной обработки данных, включая поддержку загрузки файлов через https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files и предоставление файлов через https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التعامل مع تحميل الملفات وتخزينها وتقديمها وإدارتها باستخدام أنماط مناسبة، مستفيدة من قدرات تخزين الملفات في Convex لتعامل البيانات الآمن والم 효ث، بما في ذلك الدعم لتحميل الملفات عبر https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/upload-files وتقديم الملفات عبر https://docs.convex.dev/file-storage/serve-files."},"useCases":{"en":["Uploading and managing image files for data visualization","Serving and streaming generated documents and files","Implementing secure file storage patterns for sensitive data"],"zh":["为数据可视化上传和管理图像文件","提供和流式传输生成的文档和文件","为敏感数据实施安全的文件存储模式"],"ja":["データ可視化のための画像ファイルのアップロードと管理","生成されたドキュメントやファイルの提供とストリーミング","機密データのための安全なファイルストレージパターンの実装"],"ko":["데이터 시각화를 위한 이미지 파일 업로드 및 관리","생성된 문서 및 파일 제공 및 스트리밍","민감한 데이터를 위한 안전한 파일 저장소 패턴 구현"],"es":["Cargar y gestionar archivos de imagen para la visualización de datos","Servir y transmitir documentos y archivos generados","Implementar patrones de almacenamiento de archivos seguros para datos sensibles"],"fr":["Télécharger et gérer des fichiers d''image pour la visualisation de données","Servir et diffuser des documents et des fichiers générés","Mettre en œuvre des modèles de stockage de fichiers sécurisés pour les données sensibles"],"de":["Bild-Dateien für die Datenvisualisierung hochladen und verwalten","Generierte Dokumente und Dateien bereitstellen und streamen","Sichere Dateispeicher-Muster für sensible Daten implementieren"],"pt":["Fazer upload e gerenciar arquivos de imagem para visualização de dados","Fornecer e transmitir documentos e arquivos gerados","Implementar padrões de armazenamento de arquivos seguros para dados sensíveis"],"ru":["Загрузка и управление файлами изображений для визуализации данных","Предоставление и потоковое передача сгенерированных документов и файлов","Реализация безопасных шаблонов хранения файлов для конфиденциальных данных"],"ar":["تحميل وإدارة ملفات الصور للرؤية البيانية للبيانات","تقديم وتمرير المستندات والملفات المولّدة","تنفيذ أنماط تخزين ملفات آمنة للبيانات الحساسة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex application setup","Dependent on Convex file storage documentation for implementation details","Limited to Convex-specific file storage and serving capabilities"],"zh":["需要Convex应用程序设置","依赖于Convex文件存储文档以获取实现细节","仅限于Convex特定的文件存储和提供功能"],"ja":["Convexアプリケーションのセットアップが必要","実装の詳細についてはConvexファイルストレージのドキュメントに依存","Convex固有のファイルストレージおよび提供機能に限定"],"ko":["Convex 애플리케이션 설정이 필요함","구현 세부 사항은 Convex 파일 저장소 문서에 의존","Convex 특정 파일 저장 및 제공 기능으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de aplicación Convex","Depende de la documentación de almacenamiento de archivos de Convex para detalles de implementación","Limitado a capacidades de almacenamiento y entrega de archivos específicas de Convex"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application Convex","Dépend de la documentation de stockage de fichiers Convex pour les détails d''implémentation","Limité aux capacités de stockage et de diffusion de fichiers spécifiques à Convex"],"de":["Benötigt Convex-Anwendungskonfiguration","Hängt von der Convex-Dateispeicherdokumentation für Implementierungsdetails ab","Begrenzt auf Convex-spezifische Dateispeicher- und -bereitstellungsfunktionen"],"pt":["Requer configuração de aplicativo Convex","Depende da documentação de armazenamento de arquivos do Convex para detalhes de implementação","Limitado às capacidades de armazenamento e fornecimento de arquivos específicas do Convex"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения Convex","Зависит от документации хранения файлов Convex для деталей реализации","Ограничен возможностями хранения и предоставления файлов, специфичными для Convex"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق Convex","يعتمد على توثيق تخزين الملفات في Convex للتفاصيل الفنية","محدود بقدرات تخزين وتقديم الملفات الخاصة بـ Convex"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/testing-anti-patterns', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'testing-anti-patterns', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z', '2026-02-18T12:40:07.322Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/testing-anti-patterns","name":"testing-anti-patterns","description":{"zh":"测试反模式强调测试代码的真实行为，避免模拟行为，提高测试效率","ja":"テストアンチパターンは、テストコードの真実の動作をテストし、モックの動作を避けることを重視する","ko":"테스트 반 패턴은 테스트 코드의 실제 동작을 테스트하고 모의 동작을 피하는 것을 강조합니다","es":"Los patrones de prueba anti-test se refieren a prácticas de testing que verifican comportamientos mockeados en lugar de comportamientos reales.","fr":"Les modèles de test anti-modèles font référence à des pratiques de testing qui vérifient des comportements mockés au lieu de comportements réels.","de":"Test-Anti-Muster beziehen sich auf Test-Praktiken, die mock-Verhaltensweisen überprüfen anstelle von echten Verhaltensweisen.","pt":"Os padrões anti-teste podem comprometer a eficácia dos testes. Aprenda a evitá-los e melhorar sua estratégia de teste","ru":"Анти-шаблоны тестирования могут поставить под угрозу эффективность тестирования. Узнайте, как их избежать и улучшить свою стратегию тестирования","ar":"أنماط مضادة للاختبار يمكن أن تعرض فعالية الاختبار للخطر. تعرف على كيفية تجنبها وتحسين استراتيجية الاختبار","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"测试反模式 - 合理测试实践","ja":"テストアンチパターン - 適切なテスト実践","ko":"테스트 반 패턴 - 적절한 테스트 관행","es":"Patrones de Prueba Anti-Test","fr":"Modèles de Test Anti-Modèles","de":"Test Anti-Muster","pt":"Padrões Anti-Teste: Melhorias para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Анти-шаблоны тестирования: Советы для разработчиков","ar":"أنماط مضادة للاختبار: تحسينات للمطورين","en":"testing-anti-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"测试反模式强调测试代码的真实行为，避免模拟行为，提高测试效率","ja":"テストアンチパターンは、テストコードの真実の動作をテストし、モックの動作を避けることを重視する","ko":"테스트 반 패턴은 테스트 코드의 실제 동작을 테스트하고 모의 동작을 피하는 것을 강조합니다","es":"Los patrones de prueba anti-test se refieren a prácticas de testing que verifican comportamientos mockeados en lugar de comportamientos reales.","fr":"Les modèles de test anti-modèles font référence à des pratiques de testing qui vérifient des comportements mockés au lieu de comportements réels.","de":"Test-Anti-Muster beziehen sich auf Test-Praktiken, die mock-Verhaltensweisen überprüfen anstelle von echten Verhaltensweisen.","pt":"Os padrões anti-teste podem comprometer a eficácia dos testes. Aprenda a evitá-los e melhorar sua estratégia de teste","ru":"Анти-шаблоны тестирования могут поставить под угрозу эффективность тестирования. Узнайте, как их избежать и улучшить свою стратегию тестирования","ar":"أنماط مضادة للاختبار يمكن أن تعرض فعالية الاختبار للخطر. تعرف على كيفية تجنبها وتحسين استراتيجية الاختبار","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["测试真实行为","避免模拟行为","提高测试效率","遵循严格的TDD"],"ja":["真実の動作をテストする","モックの動作を避ける","テストの効率を高める","厳密なTDDに従う"],"ko":["실제 동작 테스트","모의 동작 피하기","테스트 효율성 향상","엄격한 TDD 준수"],"es":["Evita testing de comportamiento mockeado","Nunca agregues métodos de prueba solo a clases de producción","Nunca mockees sin entender las dependencias","Sigue estrictamente TDD para prevenir anti-patrones","Verifica comportamientos reales en lugar de mockeados","Mejora la calidad de tus pruebas"],"fr":["Évitez les tests de comportement mocké","N''ajoutez jamais de méthodes de test uniquement aux classes de production","N''mockez jamais sans comprendre les dépendances","Suivez strictement TDD pour prévenir les anti-modèles","Vérifiez les comportements réels au lieu des mockés","Améliorez la qualité de vos tests"],"de":["Vermeiden Sie Testing von mock-Verhaltensweisen","Fügen Sie niemals Test-Methoden nur zu Produktionsklassen hinzu","Mocken Sie niemals ohne die Abhängigkeiten zu verstehen","Folgen Sie streng TDD, um Anti-Muster zu vermeiden","Überprüfen Sie echte Verhaltensweisen anstelle von mock-Verhaltensweisen","Verbessern Sie die Qualität Ihrer Tests"],"pt":["Evite testar comportamento de mock","Não adicione métodos de teste apenas para classes de produção","Não mocke sem entender as dependências","Siga a abordagem TDD estrita","Verifique o comportamento real do código","Use oráculo personalizado e suavização TWAP"],"ru":["Избегайте тестирования поведения mock","Не добавляйте методы тестирования только для производственных классов","Не mock без понимания зависимостей","Следуйте строгому подходу TDD","Проверяйте реальное поведение кода","Используйте自定义ный оракул и сглаживание TWAP"],"ar":["تجنب اختبار سلوك المقلد","لا تقم بإضافة أساليب الاختبار فقط للفئات الإنتاجية","لا تقم بالمقلد دون فهم الاعتماديات","اتبع نهج TDD الصارم","تحقق من السلوك الفعلي للكود","استخدم أوракل مخصص وتسوية TWAP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["测试反模式","TDD","模拟行为","测试效率","代码测试","软件开发"],"ja":["テストアンチパターン","TDD","モックの動作","テストの効率","コードテスト","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["테스트 반 패턴","TDD","모의 동작","테스트 효율성","코드 테스트","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["patrones de prueba anti-test","testing de software","pruebas unitarias","TDD","mockear","comportamiento real","calidad de pruebas","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software"],"fr":["modèles de test anti-modèles","testing de logiciel","tests unitaires","TDD","mocking","comportement réel","qualité de tests","développement de logiciel","tests de logiciel"],"de":["Test-Anti-Muster","Software-Testing","Einheitstests","TDD","Mocken","echtes Verhalten","Test-Qualität","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Tests"],"pt":["padrões anti-teste","teste de unidade","TDD","mock","desenvolvimento de software","melhorias de teste","estratégia de teste","orquestração de teste"],"ru":["анти-шаблоны тестирования","юнит-тестирование","TDD","мок","разработка программного обеспечения","улучшение тестирования","стратегия тестирования","оркестрация тестирования"],"ar":["أنماط مضادة للاختبار","اختبار الوحدة","TDD","المقلد","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين الاختبار","استراتيجية الاختبار","توجيه الاختبار"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-anti-patterns","description":"Use when writing or changing tests, adding mocks, or tempted to add test-only methods to production code - prevents testing mock behavior, production pollution with test-only methods, and mocking without understanding dependencies","bodyPreview":"# Testing Anti-Patterns\n\n## Overview\n\nTests must verify real behavior, not mock behavior. Mocks are a means to isolate, not the thing being tested.\n\n**Core principle:** Test what the code does, not what the mocks do.\n\n**Following strict TDD prevents these anti-patterns.**\n\n## The Iron Laws\n\n```\n1. NEVER test mock behavior\n2. NEVER add test-only methods to production classes\n3. NEVER mock without understanding dependencies\n```\n\n## Anti-Pattern 1: Testing Mock Behavior\n\n**The violation:**\n```types","body":"# Testing Anti-Patterns\n\n## Overview\n\nTests must verify real behavior, not mock behavior. Mocks are a means to isolate, not the thing being tested.\n\n**Core principle:** Test what the code does, not what the mocks do.\n\n**Following strict TDD prevents these anti-patterns.**\n\n## The Iron Laws\n\n```\n1. NEVER test mock behavior\n2. NEVER add test-only methods to production classes\n3. NEVER mock without understanding dependencies\n```\n\n## Anti-Pattern 1: Testing Mock Behavior\n\n**The violation:**\n```typescript\n// ❌ BAD: Testing that the mock exists\ntest(''renders sidebar'', () => {\n  render(<Page />);\n  expect(screen.getByTestId(''sidebar-mock'')).toBeInTheDocument();\n});\n```\n\n**Why this is wrong:**\n- You''re verifying the mock works, not that the component works\n- Test passes when mock is present, fails when it''s not\n- Tells you nothing about real behavior\n\n**your human partner''s correction:** \"Are we testing the behavior of a mock?\"\n\n**The fix:**\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Test real component or don''t mock it\ntest(''renders sidebar'', () => {\n  render(<Page />);  // Don''t mock sidebar\n  expect(screen.getByRole(''navigation'')).toBeInTheDocument();\n});\n\n// OR if sidebar must be mocked for isolation:\n// Don''t assert on the mock - test Page''s behavior with sidebar present\n```\n\n### Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE asserting on any mock element:\n  Ask: \"Am I testing real component behavior or just mock existence?\"\n\n  IF testing mock existence:\n    STOP - Delete the assertion or unmock the component\n\n  Test real behavior instead\n```\n\n## Anti-Pattern 2: Test-Only Methods in Production\n\n**The violation:**\n```typescript\n// ❌ BAD: destroy() only used in tests\nclass Session {\n  async destroy() {  // Looks like production API!\n    await this._workspaceManager?.destroyWorkspace(this.id);\n    // ... cleanup\n  }\n}\n\n// In tests\nafterEach(() => session.destroy());\n```\n\n**Why this is wrong:**\n- Production class polluted with test-only code\n- Dangerous if accidentally called in production\n- Violates YAGNI and separation of concerns\n- Confuses object lifecycle with entity lifecycle\n\n**The fix:**\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Test utilities handle test cleanup\n// Session has no destroy() - it''s stateless in production\n\n// In test-utils/\nexport async function cleanupSession(session: Session) {\n  const workspace = session.getWorkspaceInfo();\n  if (workspace) {\n    await workspaceManager.destroyWorkspace(workspace.id);\n  }\n}\n\n// In tests\nafterEach(() => cleanupSession(session));\n```\n\n### Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE adding any method to production class:\n  Ask: \"Is this only used by tests?\"\n\n  IF yes:\n    STOP - Don''t add it\n    Put it in test utilities instead\n\n  Ask: \"Does this class own this resource''s lifecycle?\"\n\n  IF no:\n    STOP - Wrong class for this method\n```\n\n## Anti-Pattern 3: Mocking Without Understanding\n\n**The violation:**\n```typescript\n// ❌ BAD: Mock breaks test logic\ntest(''detects duplicate server'', () => {\n  // Mock prevents config write that test depends on!\n  vi.mock(''ToolCatalog'', () => ({\n    discoverAndCacheTools: vi.fn().mockResolvedValue(undefined)\n  }));\n\n  await addServer(config);\n  await addServer(config);  // Should throw - but won''t!\n});\n```\n\n**Why this is wrong:**\n- Mocked method had side effect test depended on (writing config)\n- Over-mocking to \"be safe\" breaks actual behavior\n- Test passes for wrong reason or fails mysteriously\n\n**The fix:**\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Mock at correct level\ntest(''detects duplicate server'', () => {\n  // Mock the slow part, preserve behavior test needs\n  vi.mock(''MCPServerManager''); // Just mock slow server startup\n\n  await addServer(config);  // Config written\n  await addServer(config);  // Duplicate detected ✓\n});\n```\n\n### Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE mocking any method:\n  STOP - Don''t mock yet\n\n  1. Ask: \"What side effects does the real method have?\"\n  2. Ask: \"Does this test depend on any of those side effects?\"\n  3. Ask: \"Do I fully understand what this test needs?\"\n\n  IF depends on side effects:\n    Mock at lower level (the actual slow/external operation)\n    OR use test doubles that preserve necessary behavior\n    NOT the high-level method the test depends on\n\n  IF unsure what test depends on:\n    Run test with real implementation FIRST\n    Observe what actually needs to happen\n    THEN add minimal mocking at the right level\n\n  Red flags:\n    - \"I''ll mock this to be safe\"\n    - \"This might be slow, better mock it\"\n    - Mocking without understanding the dependency chain\n```\n\n## Anti-Pattern 4: Incomplete Mocks\n\n**The violation:**\n```typescript\n// ❌ BAD: Partial mock - only fields you think you need\nconst mockResponse = {\n  status: ''success'',\n  data: { userId: ''123'', name: ''Alice'' }\n  // Missing: metadata that downstream code uses\n};\n\n// Later: breaks when code accesses response.metadata.requestId\n```\n\n**Why this is wrong:**\n- **Partial mocks hide structural assumptions** - You only mocked fields you know about\n- **Downstream code may depend on fields you didn''t include** - Silent failures\n- **Tests pass but integration fails** - Mock incomplete, real API complete\n- **False confidence** - Test proves nothing about real behavior\n\n**The Iron Rule:** Mock the COMPLETE data structure as it exists in reality, not just fields your immediate test uses.\n\n**The fix:**\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Mirror real API completeness\nconst mockResponse = {\n  status: ''success'',\n  data: { userId: ''123'', name: ''Alice'' },\n  metadata: { requestId: ''req-789'', timestamp: 1234567890 }\n  // All fields real API returns\n};\n```\n\n### Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE creating mock responses:\n  Check: \"What fields does the real API response contain?\"\n\n  Actions:\n    1. Examine actual API response from docs/examples\n    2. Include ALL fields system might consume downstream\n    3. Verify mock matches real response schema completely\n\n  Critical:\n    If you''re creating a mock, you must understand the ENTIRE structure\n    Partial mocks fail silently when code depends on omitted fields\n\n  If uncertain: Include all documented fields\n```\n\n## Anti-Pattern 5: Integration Tests as Afterthought\n\n**The violation:**\n```\n✅ Implementation complete\n❌ No tests written\n\"Ready for testing\"\n```\n\n**Why this is wrong:**\n- Testing is part of implementation, not optional follow-up\n- TDD would have caught this\n- Can''t claim complete without tests\n\n**The fix:**\n```\nTDD cycle:\n1. Write failing test\n2. Implement to pass\n3. Refactor\n4. THEN claim complete\n```\n\n## When Mocks Become Too Complex\n\n**Warning signs:**\n- Mock setup longer than test logic\n- Mocking everything to make test pass\n- Mocks missing methods real components have\n- Test breaks when mock changes\n\n**your human partner''s question:** \"Do we need to be using a mock here?\"\n\n**Consider:** Integration tests with real components often simpler than complex mocks\n\n## TDD Prevents These Anti-Patterns\n\n**Why TDD helps:**\n1. **Write test first** → Forces you to think about what you''re actually testing\n2. **Watch it fail** → Confirms test tests real behavior, not mocks\n3. **Minimal implementation** → No test-only methods creep in\n4. **Real dependencies** → You see what the test actually needs before mocking\n\n**If you''re testing mock behavior, you violated TDD** - you added mocks without watching test fail against real code first.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Fix |\n|--------------|-----|\n| Assert on mock elements | Test real component or unmock it |\n| Test-only methods in production | Move to test utilities |\n| Mock without understanding | Understand dependencies first, mock minimally |\n| Incomplete mocks | Mirror real API completely |\n| Tests as afterthought | TDD - tests first |\n| Over-complex mocks | Consider integration tests |\n\n## Red Flags\n\n- Assertion checks for `*-mock` test IDs\n- Methods only called in test files\n- Mock setup is >50% of test\n- Test fails when you remove mock\n- Can''t explain why mock is needed\n- Mocking \"just to be safe\"\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**Mocks are tools to isolate, not things to test.**\n\nIf TDD reveals you''re testing mock behavior, you''ve gone wrong.\n\nFix: Test real behavior or question why you''re mocking at all.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:40:07.322Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Test-Driven Development (TDD) Agents seeking to avoid common testing pitfalls and ensure real behavior verification","zh":"非常适合希望避免常见测试陷阱并确保真实行为验证的测试驱动开发（TDD）智能体","ja":"一般的なテストの落とし穴を回避し、実際の動作検証を確保しようとするテスト駆動開発（TDD）エージェントに最適です","ko":"일반적인 테스트 함정을 피하고 실제 동작 검증을 보장하려는 테스트 주도 개발(TDD) 에이전트에 이상적입니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas (TDD) que buscan evitar las trampas comunes de prueba y asegurar la verificación del comportamiento real","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement piloté par les tests (TDD) cherchant à éviter les pièges de test courants et à assurer la vérification du comportement réel","de":"Ideal für Test-Driven Development (TDD)-Agenten, die gemeinsame Testfallen vermeiden und eine reale Verhaltensüberprüfung sicherstellen möchten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes (TDD) que buscam evitar armadilhas comuns de teste e garantir a verificação do comportamento real","ru":"Идеально для агентов Test-Driven Development (TDD), стремящихся избежать распространенных ловушек тестирования и обеспечить проверку реального поведения","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير القائم على الاختبار (TDD) الذين يسعون لتجنب الأخطاء الشائعة في الاختبار وضمان التحقق من السلوك الفعلي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write effective tests by avoiding mock behavior testing, adding test-only methods to production classes, and mocking without understanding dependencies, thus ensuring adherence to the Iron Laws of testing and promoting strict TDD principles","zh":"通过避免模拟行为测试、避免向生产类添加仅供测试的方法、以及在未理解依赖关系的情况下进行模拟，使智能体能够编写有效的测试，从而确保遵守测试的铁律并促进严格的TDD原则","ja":"モック動作テストの回避、プロダクションクラスへのテスト専用メソッドの追加の回避、依存関係を理解しないモックの回避により、エージェントが効果的なテストを作成できるようにし、テストの鉄則の遵守と厳格なTDD原則の促進を確保します","ko":"모의 동작 테스트 회피, 프로덕션 클래스에 테스트 전용 메서드 추가 회피, 종속성 이해 없이 모의 객체 사용 회피를 통해 에이전트가 효과적인 테스트를 작성할 수 있도록 지원하므로, 테스트의 철칙을 준수하고 엄격한 TDD 원칙을 촉진합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas efectivas evitando pruebas de comportamiento de simulación, agregando métodos de prueba solo a clases de producción y simulando sin comprender las dependencias, asegurando así el cumplimiento de las Leyes de Hierro de las pruebas y promoviendo principios estrictos de TDD","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests efficaces en évitant les tests de comportement de simulation, en ajoutant des méthodes de test uniquement aux classes de production et en simulant sans comprendre les dépendances, assurant ainsi le respect des Lois de Fer du testing et promouvant les principes stricts de TDD","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, effektive Tests zu schreiben, indem sie das Testen von Mock-Verhalten vermeiden, Test-Only-Methoden zu Produktionsklassen hinzufügen und ohne das Verständnis von Abhängigkeiten mocken, um so die Einhaltung der Eisenregeln des Testens sicherzustellen und strikte TDD-Prinzipien zu fördern","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes eficazes evitando testes de comportamento de simulação, adicionando métodos de teste apenas para classes de produção e simulando sem entender as dependências, garantindo assim a aderência às Leis de Ferro do teste e promovendo princípios estritos de TDD","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать эффективные тесты, избегая тестирования имитированного поведения, добавляя методы только для тестирования в производственные классы и имитируя без понимания зависимостей, тем самым обеспечивая соблюдение Железных Законов тестирования и продвижение строгих принципов TDD","ar":"تمكين العملاء من كتابة اختبارات فعالة من خلال تجنب اختبار سلوك المحاكاة، وإضافة طرق اختبار فقط إلى فئات الإنتاج، ومحاكاة بدون فهم الاعتماديات، وبالتالي ضمان الالتزام بقوانين الحديد للاختبار وتعزيز مبادئ التطوير الموجه بالاختبار بشكل صارم"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging test failures caused by mock behavior","Identifying and removing test-only methods from production code","Improving test reliability by understanding dependencies before mocking"],"zh":["调试由模拟行为引起的测试失败","识别并从生产代码中移除仅供测试的方法","在模拟之前理解依赖关系以提高测试可靠性"],"ja":["モック動作が原因のテスト失敗のデバッグ","プロダクションコードからテスト専用メソッドを識別して削除","モック作成前に依存関係を理解してテスト信頼性を向上"],"ko":["모의 동작으로 인한 테스트 실패 디버깅","프로덕션 코드에서 테스트 전용 메서드 식별 및 제거","모의 객체 사용 전 종속성 이해를 통한 테스트 신뢰성 향상"],"es":["Depuración de fallos de prueba causados por comportamiento de simulación","Identificación y eliminación de métodos de prueba solo de código de producción","Mejora de la confiabilidad de las pruebas mediante la comprensión de las dependencias antes de la simulación"],"fr":["Débogage des échecs de test causés par le comportement de simulation","Identification et suppression des méthodes de test uniquement du code de production","Amélioration de la fiabilité des tests en comprenant les dépendances avant la simulation"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Testfehlern, die durch Mock-Verhalten verursacht werden","Identifizierung und Entfernung von Test-Only-Methoden aus Produktionscode","Verbesserung der Testzuverlässigkeit durch das Verständnis von Abhängigkeiten vor dem Mocken"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de teste causadas por comportamento de simulação","Identificação e remoção de métodos de teste apenas de código de produção","Melhoria da confiabilidade do teste entendendo dependências antes de simular"],"ru":["Отладка сбоев тестирования, вызванных имитированным поведением","Определение и удаление методов только для тестирования из производственного кода","Улучшение надежности тестирования путем понимания зависимостей до имитации"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء الاختبار الناجمة عن سلوك المحاكاة","تحديد وإزالة أساليب الاختبار فقط من رمز الإنتاج","تحسين موثوقية الاختبار من خلال فهم الاعتماديات قبل المحاكاة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of TDD principles","Adherence to the Iron Laws of testing is mandatory","May not be compatible with agents that heavily rely on mock behavior testing"],"zh":["需要理解TDD原则","必须遵守测试的铁律","可能与严重依赖模拟行为测试的智能体不兼容"],"ja":["TDD原則の理解が必要","テストの鉄則への遵守が必須","モック動作テストに大きく依存するエージェントと互換性がない可能性があります"],"ko":["TDD 원칙에 대한 이해 필요","테스트의 철칙 준수가 필수적임","모의 동작 테스트에 크게 의존하는 에이전트와 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de TDD","El cumplimiento de las Leyes de Hierro de las pruebas es obligatorio","Puede que no sea compatible con agentes que dependen en gran medida de pruebas de comportamiento de simulación"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de TDD","Le respect des Lois de Fer du testing est obligatoire","Peut ne pas être compatible avec les agents qui s''appuient lourdement sur les tests de comportement de simulation"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verständnis der TDD-Prinzipien","Die Einhaltung der Eisenregeln des Testens ist obligatorisch","Kann möglicherweise nicht mit Agenten kompatibel sein, die stark auf Mock-Verhalten-Tests angewiesen sind"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de TDD","Aderência às Leis de Ferro do teste é obrigatória","Pode não ser compatível com agentes que dependem fortemente de testes de comportamento de simulação"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов TDD","Соблюдение Железных Законов тестирования обязательно","Может быть несовместимо с агентами, которые сильно полагаются на тестирование имитированного поведения"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ التطوير الموجه بالاختبار","الامتثال لقوانين الحديد للاختبار إلزامي","قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع العملاء الذين يعتمدون بشكل كبير على اختبار سلوك المحاكاة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
