"GitHubの問題と基本メモリ・アーティファクトのサポート","双方のソースの実行パターン","インテリジェントなソース検出","統一されたワークフロー","双方のチャネルの更新"],"ko":["GitHub 이슈 및 기본 메모리 아티팩트 지원","雙源 실행 패턴","智能 소스 감지","통합 워크플로","양방향 채널 업데이트"],"es":["Detección de formato de entrada inteligente","Ejecución de tareas unificadas desde GitHub y Basic Memory","Actualización de ambos canales","Soporte para GitHub issues y Basic Memory artifacts","Patrón de ejecución de tareas dual","Integración con flujos de trabajo personalizados"],"fr":["Détection de format d''entrée intelligente","Exécution de tâches unifiées à partir de GitHub et de Basic Memory","Mise à jour de tous les canaux","Prise en charge des problèmes GitHub et des artefacts Basic Memory","Modèle d''exécution de tâches dual","Intégration avec des flux de travail personnalisés"],"de":["Intelligente Eingabeformat-Erkennung","Ausführung einheitlicher Aufgaben von GitHub und Basic Memory","Aktualisierung beider Kanäle","Unterstützung für GitHub-Probleme und Basic Memory-Artefakte","Duales Aufgaben-Ausführungsmuster","Integration mit benutzerdefinierten Workflows"],"pt":["Execução de tarefas de qualquer fonte","Integração com GitHub e Basic Memory","Detecção inteligente de formato de entrada","Fluxo de trabalho unificado","Atualização em ambos os canais"],"ru":["Выполнение задач из любого источника","Интеграция с GitHub и Basic Memory","Интеллектуальное обнаружение формата входных данных","Унифицированный рабочий процесс","Обновление в обоих каналах"],"ar":["تنفيذ المهام من أي مصدر","التكامل مع GitHub و Basic Memory","اكتشاف ذكي لتنسيق الإدخال","سير عمل موحد","التحديث في كلا القنوات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["执行任务","任意来源","GitHub问题","基本内存工件","双源执行模式","智能源检测","统一工作流","双通道更新"],"ja":["タスクの実行","任意ソース","GitHubの問題","基本メモリ・アーティファクト","双方のソースの実行パターン","インテリジェントなソース検出","統一されたワークフロー","双方のチャネルの更新"],"ko":["태스크 실행","어떤 소스에서든","GitHub 이슈","기본 메모리 아티팩트","雙源 실행 패턴","智能 소스 감지","통합 워크플로","양방향 채널 업데이트"],"es":["ejecución de tareas","GitHub","Basic Memory","patrón de ejecución dual","detección de formato de entrada","tareas unificadas","desarrollo de software","integración de flujos de trabajo","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["exécution de tâches","GitHub","Basic Memory","modèle d''exécution dual","détection de format d''entrée","tâches unifiées","développement de logiciels","intégration de flux de travail","automatisation de tâches"],"de":["Ausführung von Aufgaben","GitHub","Basic Memory","duales Aufgaben-Ausführungsmuster","Eingabeformat-Erkennung","einheitliche Aufgaben","Softwareentwicklung","Integration von Workflows","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["execução de tarefas","GitHub","Basic Memory","detecção de formato de entrada","fluxo de trabalho unificado","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["выполнение задач","GitHub","Basic Memory","обнаружение формата входных данных","унифицированный рабочий процесс","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تنفيذ المهام","GitHub","Basic Memory","اكتشاف تنسيق الإدخال","سير عمل موحد","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"executing-tasks-from-any-source","description":"Execute tasks from both GitHub issues and Basic Memory artifacts using unified workflow - supports intelligent source detection and dual-channel status management","bodyPreview":"# Executing Tasks From Any Source\n\n## Overview\n\nThe `/project:do:task` workflow supports both **GitHub issues** and **Basic Memory artifacts** through intelligent source detection. This skill explains the dual-source execution pattern.\n\n**Core principle:** Detect input format → Fetch from appropriate source → Execute unified workflow → Update both channels.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Executing tasks from GitHub issues (traditional issue-based workflow)\n- Executing tasks from Basic Memory arti","body":"# Executing Tasks From Any Source\n\n## Overview\n\nThe `/project:do:task` workflow supports both **GitHub issues** and **Basic Memory artifacts** through intelligent source detection. This skill explains the dual-source execution pattern.\n\n**Core principle:** Detect input format → Fetch from appropriate source → Execute unified workflow → Update both channels.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Executing tasks from GitHub issues (traditional issue-based workflow)\n- Executing tasks from Basic Memory artifacts (Johnny Decimal format: `5.1.1-task-*`)\n- Switching between task sources within the same project\n- Building tools/agents that need to support both task sources\n\n## Quick Reference: Source Detection\n\n| Input Format | Example | Source | Worktree Name |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Issue number | `123` or `#123` | GitHub API | `feature/123-auth-implementation` |\n| Johnny Decimal | `5.1.1-task-auth` | Basic Memory | `feature/5.1.1-task-auth` |\n\n**Detection logic:**\n```bash\nif [[ $ARGUMENTS =~ ^#?[0-9]+$ ]]; then\n  # GitHub issue - pure digits with optional #\n  ISSUE_NUM=$(echo $ARGUMENTS | tr -d ''#'')\n  SOURCE=\"github\"\nelif [[ $ARGUMENTS =~ ^[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)+.* ]]; then\n  # Basic Memory artifact - Johnny Decimal format\n  ARTIFACT_ID=$ARGUMENTS\n  SOURCE=\"basicmemory\"\nelse\n  echo \"Error: Invalid task format. Use GitHub issue (#123) or Johnny Decimal artifact (5.1.1-task-name)\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n## GitHub Issue Execution Path\n\n### Step 1: Fetch Issue Details\n\n```bash\n# Fetch issue using GitHub CLI\ngh issue view $ISSUE_NUM --json title,body,author,labels,assignees,linkedIssues\n\n# Extract components:\n# - Title: Issue headline\n# - Body: Full description with acceptance criteria\n# - Author: Original creator\n# - Labels: Topic tags (feature, bug, etc)\n# - Assignees: Current assignee\n# - LinkedIssues: Related/parent issues\n```\n\n### Step 2: Worktree Creation\n\nPass to `using-git-worktrees` skill:\n```\nfeature_identifier: \"{ISSUE_NUM}-{slug}\"\nExample: \"123-add-user-authentication\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Status Updates (In-Progress)\n\n```bash\n# Add in-progress label\ngh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --add-label \"in-progress\"\n\n# Add comment\ngh issue comment $ISSUE_NUM -b \"Implementation started. Tracking in worktree.\"\n\n# Remove ready/todo labels\ngh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --remove-label \"ready,todo\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Status Updates (Completed)\n\n```bash\n# Update labels\ngh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --remove-label \"in-progress\"\ngh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --add-label \"completed\"\n\n# Add completion comment with PR link\ngh issue comment $ISSUE_NUM -b \"Completed in PR #{PR_NUMBER}. See changes above.\"\n```\n\n## Basic Memory Artifact Execution Path\n\n### Artifact Structure\n\nTasks in Basic Memory use this structure:\n\n```markdown\n---\ntitle: \"5.1.1-task-user-authentication\"\nfolder: \"5-tasks\"\nentity_type: \"task\"\nentity_metadata:\n  tags: [\"authentication\", \"user-system\"]\n  status: \"pending\"\n  priority: \"high\"\n  epic_id: \"2.1.1-epic-auth-system\"\n  dependencies: []\n---\n\n# Task: Implement User Authentication\n\n## Description\nDetailed task description...\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Criterion 1\n- [ ] Criterion 2\n\n## Dependencies\n- depends_on [[2.1.0-epic-auth-system]]\n```\n\n### Step 1: Fetch Artifact Details\n\n```bash\n# Use basicmemory_read_note with Johnny Decimal lookup\n# Tool extracts: title, content, frontmatter (status, epic_id, dependencies)\n# from 5-tasks folder matching the artifact ID\n\n# Frontmatter fields parsed:\n# - status: \"pending\" | \"in-progress\" | \"completed\"\n# - epic_id: Parent epic reference (e.g., \"2.1.1-epic-auth\")\n# - priority: \"high\" | \"medium\" | \"low\"\n# - dependencies: List of related artifacts\n```\n\n### Step 2: Worktree Creation\n\nPass to `using-git-worktrees` skill:\n```\nfeature_identifier: \"{JOHNNY_DECIMAL}-{slug}\"\nExample: \"5.1.1-task-user-authentication\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Status Updates (In-Progress)\n\n```bash\n# Use basicmemory_edit_note to update frontmatter\nbasicmemory_edit_note(\n  identifier: \"5.1.1-task-auth\",\n  operation: \"find_replace\",\n  find_text: \"status: pending\",\n  content: \"status: in-progress\"\n)\n\n# Add implementation note\nbasicmemory_edit_note(\n  identifier: \"5.1.1-task-auth\",\n  operation: \"append\",\n  content: \"\\n## Implementation Log\\n- Started implementation in worktree\\n\"\n)\n```\n\n### Step 4: Status Updates (Completed)\n\n```bash\n# Update status to completed\nbasicmemory_edit_note(\n  identifier: \"5.1.1-task-auth\",\n  operation: \"find_replace\",\n  find_text: \"status: in-progress\",\n  content: \"status: completed\"\n)\n\n# Add PR link to artifact\nbasicmemory_edit_note(\n  identifier: \"5.1.1-task-auth\",\n  operation: \"append\",\n  content: \"\\n- Completed in PR: https://github.com/repo/pulls/123\\n\"\n)\n```\n\n## Unified Workflow Steps (Apply to Both Sources)\n\nOnce task is fetched from its source, the remaining workflow is identical:\n\n1. **Deep Technical Analysis** (Step 2)\n   - Extract user story\n   - Map acceptance criteria\n   - Determine technical scope\n   - Check dependencies\n   - Consider edge cases\n\n2. **System Impact Assessment** (Step 3)\n   - Frontend changes needed?\n   - Backend changes needed?\n   - Database migrations?\n   - Testing strategy?\n\n3. **Human Validation Check** (Step 4)\n   - Stop and ask if architectural decisions needed\n   - Stop and ask if security/performance critical\n   - Wait for explicit approval\n\n4. **Implementation** (Steps 6-12)\n   - Design test strategy\n   - Plan implementation approach\n   - Execute core implementation\n   - Run comprehensive tests\n   - Update documentation\n   - Quality validation\n\n5. **Completion** (Steps 13-15)\n   - Update task status (source-specific)\n   - Create pull request linking to task\n   - Monitor code review\n   - After merge: update parent issue/epic\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Check task dependencies before starting\n\n**GitHub:**\n```bash\n# Get linked issues that are blockers\ngh issue view $ISSUE_NUM --json linkedIssues --jq ''.linkedIssues[] | select(.url | contains(\"blocked\"))''\n```\n\n**Basic Memory:**\n```bash\n# Read the artifact to find depends_on relations\nbasicmemory_read_note(\"5.1.1-task-auth\")\n# Check frontmatter: dependencies: [...] or look for \"depends_on [[...]]\" in content\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Get parent context\n\n**GitHub:**\n```bash\n# Find linked parent issue (PRD/Feature)\ngh issue view $ISSUE_NUM --json linkedIssues \\\n  | jq ''.linkedIssues[] | select(.title | contains(\"Feature\") or contains(\"PRD\"))''\n```\n\n**Basic Memory:**\n```bash\n# Fetch parent epic using epic_id from frontmatter\nbasicmemory_read_note(\"2.1.1-epic-auth-system\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Update related items after completion\n\n**GitHub:**\n```bash\n# Update parent issue with progress\ngh issue comment $PARENT_ISSUE_NUM -b \"Completed task #{ISSUE_NUM}\"\n\n# Link completed task to parent\ngh issue edit $ISSUE_NUM --add-label \"merged\"\n```\n\n**Basic Memory:**\n```bash\n# Update parent epic\nbasicmemory_edit_note(\n  identifier: \"2.1.1-epic-auth\",\n  operation: \"append\",\n  content: \"\\n- Completed: [[5.1.1-task-user-authentication]]\\n\"\n)\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Invalid Task Format\n\n```bash\nif [[ ! $ARGUMENTS =~ ^(#?[0-9]+|[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)+.*)$ ]]; then\n  echo \"❌ Invalid task format\"\n  echo \"GitHub issue: 123 or #123\"\n  echo \"Basic Memory: 5.1.1-task-name\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n### GitHub Issue Not Found\n\n```bash\nif ! gh issue view $ISSUE_NUM 2>/dev/null; then\n  echo \"❌ GitHub issue #$ISSUE_NUM not found\"\n  echo \"Check the issue number and try again\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n### Basic Memory Artifact Not Found\n\n```bash\nif ! basicmemory_read_note($ARTIFACT_ID) 2>/dev/null; then\n  echo \"❌ Basic Memory artifact $ARTIFACT_ID not found in 5-tasks/\"\n  echo \"Check the artifact ID matches Johnny Decimal format: N.N.N-task-*\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n## Integration Points\n\n**Called by:**\n- `/project:do:task` workflow (main entry point)\n- Agent task execution systems\n- Task queuing systems\n\n**Pairs with:**\n- `using-git-worktrees` - Creates isolated workspace\n- `executing-plans` - For comprehensive implementation\n- `subagent-driven-development` - For delegated work\n- `finishing-a-development-branch` - For cleanup after completion\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always verify task exists** before starting workflow\n2. **Check dependencies** before implementing\n3. **Use consistent worktree naming** - helps with resumption\n4. **Update status in source** before creating worktree\n5. **Document completion** in both PR comment and task artifact\n6. **Keep frontmatter clean** - avoid manual formatting in Basic Memory\n7. **Link related tasks** - use relations/dependencies properly\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Start implementation without fetching task details first\n- Ignore dependency warnings\n- Proceed with failing tests without asking\n- Forget to update task status when switching sources\n- Mix GitHub and Basic Memory references inconsistently\n\n**Always:**\n- Detect source format before proceeding\n- Fetch complete task context\n- Verify dependencies before starting\n- Update task status at start and completion\n- Link PR to task in both channels\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:40:34.272Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring versatile task execution from diverse sources like GitHub issues and Basic Memory artifacts.","zh":"适用于需要从GitHub问题和基本内存工件等多种来源执行多样化任务的自动化代理的理想选择。","ja":"GitHubの問題やBasic Memoryアーティファクトなどの多様なソースからのタスクの実行が必要な自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 이슈 및 기본 메모리 아티팩트 등 다양한 소스에서 다중 작업을 실행해야 하는 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización que requieren una ejecución de tareas versátil desde diversas fuentes como problemas de GitHub y artefactos de Memoria Básica.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant une exécution de tâches polyvalente à partir de diverses sources comme les problèmes GitHub et les artefacts de Mémoire de Base.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine vielseitige Aufgabenausführung aus verschiedenen Quellen wie GitHub-Problemen und Basic-Memory-Artefakten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que exigem execução de tarefas versáteis de fontes diversificadas, como problemas do GitHub e artefatos de Memória Básica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, требующих универсального выполнения задач из различных источников, таких как проблемы GitHub и артефакты базовой памяти.","ar":"مثالية لعميل التutomatization الذي يتطلب تنفيذ مهام متنوعة من مصادر مختلفة مثل قضايا GitHub وأ_rtifacts الذاكرة الأساسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect input formats, fetch from appropriate sources, and execute unified workflows, updating both channels seamlessly, leveraging intelligent source detection and dual-source execution patterns.","zh":"赋予代理检测输入格式、从适当的源提取并执行统一的工作流程的能力，同时更新两个通道，利用智能源检测和双源执行模式。","ja":"エージェントに入力形式を検出し、適切なソースからフェッチして統一されたワークフローを実行する能力を与え、双方のチャネルをシームレスに更新することで、智能ソース検出とデュアルソース実行パターンを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 입력 형식을 감지하고 적절한 소스에서 가져와 통일된 워크플ロー를 실행하여 두 채널을 무縫으로 업데이트할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며, 지능형 소스 감지 및 이중 소스 실행 패턴을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes detectar formatos de entrada, recuperar de fuentes adecuadas y ejecutar flujos de trabajo unificados, actualizando ambos canales de forma fluida, aprovechando la detección inteligente de fuentes y patrones de ejecución de fuentes duales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter les formats d''entrée, de récupérer à partir de sources appropriées et d''exécuter des flux de travail unifiés, en mettant à jour les deux canaux de manière transparente, en exploitant la détection intelligente de sources et les modèles d''exécution de sources doubles.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Eingabeformate zu erkennen, von geeigneten Quellen abzurufen und einheitliche Workflows auszuführen, wobei beide Kanäle nahtlos aktualisiert werden, indem intelligente Quellenerkennung und Dual-Quell-Ausführungsmuster genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar formatos de entrada, buscar em fontes apropriadas e executar fluxos de trabalho unificados, atualizando ambos os canais de forma transparente, aproveitando a detecção inteligente de fontes e padrões de execução de fontes duplas.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность обнаруживать форматы входных данных, получать их из соответствующих источников и выполнять унифицированные рабочие процессы, обновляя оба канала бесшовно, используя интеллектуальное обнаружение источников и двойные шаблоны выполнения.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من اكتشاف تنسيقات الإدخال، والبحث في المصادر المناسبة، وتنفيذ سير العمل الموحدة، وتحديث كلا القناتين بسلاسة، واستخدام الكشف الذكي للمصدر ونمط التنفيذ المزدوج."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task execution from GitHub issues for streamlined project management","Executing tasks from Basic Memory artifacts for enhanced data-driven workflows","Integrating with synthetic perpetual futures protocols for advanced trading automation"],"zh":["自动执行GitHub问题的任务以实现流畅的项目管理","执行基本内存工件的任务以增强数据驱动的工作流程","与合成永续期货协议集成以实现高级交易自动化"],"ja":["GitHubの問題のタスクを自動化してプロジェクト管理を効率化する","Basic Memoryアーティファクトのタスクを実行してデータ駆動型のワークフローを強化する","合成永続期貨プロトコルと統合して高度な取引自動化を実現する"],"ko":["GitHub 이슈의 작업을 자동화하여 프로젝트 관리를 간소화하는 것","기본 메모리 아티팩트의 작업을 실행하여 데이터 주도 워크플로우를 강화하는 것","합성 영구 선물 프로토콜과 통합하여 고급 거래 자동화를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la ejecución de tareas desde problemas de GitHub para una gestión de proyectos optimizada","Ejecutar tareas desde artefactos de Memoria Básica para flujos de trabajo impulsados por datos mejorados","Integrarse con protocolos de futuros sintéticos perpetuos para una automatización de trading avanzada"],"fr":["Automatiser l''exécution de tâches à partir de problèmes GitHub pour une gestion de projet optimisée","Exécuter des tâches à partir d''artefacts de Mémoire de Base pour des flux de travail impulsés par les données améliorés","Intégrer des protocoles de futurs synthétiques perpétuels pour une automatisation de trading avancée"],"de":["Automatisieren der Aufgabenausführung aus GitHub-Problemen für eine optimierte Projektverwaltung","Ausführen von Aufgaben aus Basic-Memory-Artefakten für erweiterte datengetriebene Workflows","Integration in Protokolle für synthetische Perpetual-Futures für eine erweiterte Handelsautomatisierung"],"pt":["Automatizar a execução de tarefas a partir de problemas do GitHub para gerenciamento de projetos otimizado","Executar tarefas a partir de artefatos de Memória Básica para fluxos de trabalho orientados a dados aprimorados","Integrar com protocolos de futuros sintéticos perpétuos para automação de negociação avançada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выполнение задач из проблем GitHub для оптимизации управления проектами","Выполнять задачи из артефактов базовой памяти для улучшения данных, управляемых рабочими процессами","Интегрироваться с протоколами синтетических вечных фьючерсов для продвинутой автоматизации торговли"],"ar":["توفير تنفيذ مهام آلي من قضايا GitHub من أجل إدارة مشروع محسّنة","تنفيذ مهام من أثر الذاكرة الأساسية من أجل سير عمل مدفوعة بالبيانات المحسّنة","التكامل مع بروتوكولات المستقبل الاصطناعي الدائم من أجل توفير تداول آلي متقدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires intelligent source detection capabilities","Limited to GitHub issues and Basic Memory artifacts as input sources"],"zh":["需要智能源检测能力","仅限GitHub问题和基本内存工件作为输入源"],"ja":["智能ソース検出機能が必要","入力ソースとしてはGitHubの問題とBasic Memoryアーティファクトのみに限定される"],"ko":["지능형 소스 감지 기능이 필요","입력 소스로 GitHub 이슈 및 기본 메모리 아티팩트만 제한"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de detección inteligente de fuentes","Limitado a problemas de GitHub y artefactos de Memoria Básica como fuentes de entrada"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de détection intelligente de sources","Limité aux problèmes GitHub et aux artefacts de Mémoire de Base en tant que sources d''entrée"],"de":["Erfordert Fähigkeiten zur intelligenten Quellenerkennung","Begrenzt auf GitHub-Probleme und Basic-Memory-Artefakte als Eingabequellen"],"pt":["Exige capacidades de detecção inteligente de fontes","Limitado a problemas do GitHub e artefatos de Memória Básica como fontes de entrada"],"ru":["Требует возможностей интеллектуального обнаружения источников","Ограничен проблемами GitHub и артефактами базовой памяти в качестве источников входных данных"],"ar":["يتطلب قدرات الكشف الذكي للمصدر","محدود بمشاكل GitHub وأثر الذاكرة الأساسية كمصادر إدخال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
