nference**, and **developer workflows**."},"features":{"zh":["设计复杂的生产LLM应用程序","优化提示性能和一致性","实现结构化推理模式","构建少数-shot学习系统","创建可重用提示模板"],"ja":["複雑なプロダクションLLMアプリケーションの設計","プロンプトのパフォーマンスと一貫性の最適化","構造化された推論パターンの実装","少数ショット学習システムの構築","再利用可能なプロンプトテンプレートの作成"],"ko":["복잡한 프로덕션 LLM 애플리케이션 설계","프롬프트 성능 및 일관성 최적화","구조화된 추론 패턴 구현","소수 샷 학습 시스템 구축","재사용 가능한 프롬프트 템플릿 생성"],"es":["Diseño de prompts complejos para aplicaciones de producción","Optimización del rendimiento y la consistencia de los prompts","Implementación de patrones de razonamiento estructurados","Creación de sistemas de aprendizaje con ejemplo dinámico","Creación de plantillas de prompts reutilizables con interpolación de variables"],"fr":["Conception de prompts complexes pour des applications de production","Optimisation des performances et de la cohérence des prompts","Mise en œuvre de modèles de raisonnement structurés","Création de systèmes d''apprentissage avec sélection d''exemples dynamiques","Création de modèles de prompts réutilisables avec interpolation de variables"],"de":["Entwurf komplexer Prompts für Produktionsanwendungen","Optimierung der Leistung und Konsistenz von Prompts","Implementierung von Mustern für strukturiertes Denken","Erstellung von Systemen für few-shot-Lernen mit dynamischer Beispielauswahl","Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Prompt-Vorlagen mit Variableninterpolation"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de prompts complexos para aplicações LLM de produção","Otimização do desempenho e consistência de prompts","Implementação de padrões de raciocínio estruturados","Criação de sistemas de aprendizado com exemplo dinâmico","Desenvolvimento de modelos de prompt reutilizáveis"],"ru":["Разработка сложных промптов для приложений LLM в производстве","Оптимизация производительности и согласованности промптов","Реализация структурированных шаблонов рассуждений","Создание систем обучения с динамическим выбором примеров","Разработка повторно используемых шаблонов промптов"],"ar":["تصميم استدلالات معقدة لتطبيقات LLM الإنتاجية","تحسين أداء وتوافق الاستدلالات","تنفيذ أنماط استدلالية متكاملة","إنشاء أنظمة تعلم بالأمثلة الديناميكية","تصميم قوالب استدلال قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Prompt Engineering","LLM性能优化","分布式训练","推理","开发工作流","结构化推理","少数-shot学习"],"ja":["プロンプトエンジニアリング","LLMパフォーマンス最適化","分散トレーニング","推論","開発ワークフロー","構造化された推論","少数ショット学習"],"ko":["프롬프트 엔지니어링","LLM 성능 최적화","분산 트레이닝","추론","개발 워크플로우","구조화된 추론","소수 샷 학습"],"es":["ingeniería de prompts","modelos de lenguaje","aprendizaje automático","procesamiento de lenguaje natural","patrones de ingeniería de prompts","optimización de prompts","diseño de prompts","aprendizaje con ejemplo dinámico","plantillas de prompts reutilizables"],"fr":["ingénierie de prompts","modèles de langage","apprentissage automatique","traitement automatique des langues","modèles d''ingénierie de prompts","optimisation de prompts","conception de prompts","apprentissage avec sélection d''exemples dynamiques","modèles de prompts réutilisables"],"de":["Prompt-Engineering","Sprachmodelle","maschinelles Lernen","natürliche Sprachverarbeitung","Muster für Prompt-Engineering","Optimierung von Prompts","Entwurf von Prompts","few-shot-Lernen mit dynamischer Beispielauswahl","wiederverwendbare Prompt-Vorlagen"],"pt":["engenharia de prompt","LLM","aprendizado de máquina","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de desempenho","modelos de linguagem","treinamento distribuído","fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvedores"],"ru":["инженерия промптов","LLM","машинное обучение","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация производительности","языковые модели","распределенная тренировка","рабочие процессы разработчиков"],"ar":["هندسة الاستدلال","LLM","تعلم الآلة","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين الأداء","نماذج اللغة","تدريب موزع","عمليات عمل المطورين"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ugro","repoPath":"ollieb89/ugro","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prompt-engineering-patterns","description":"Master advanced prompt engineering techniques to maximize LLM performance, reliability, and controllability in production. Use when optimizing prompts, improving LLM outputs, or designing production prompt templates.","bodyPreview":"# Prompt Engineering Patterns\n\nMaster advanced prompt engineering techniques to maximize LLM performance, reliability, and controllability.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing complex prompts for production LLM applications\n- Optimizing prompt performance and consistency\n- Implementing structured reasoning patterns (chain-of-thought, tree-of-thought)\n- Building few-shot learning systems with dynamic example selection\n- Creating reusable prompt templates with variable interpolation\n- Debuggin","body":"# Prompt Engineering Patterns\n\nMaster advanced prompt engineering techniques to maximize LLM performance, reliability, and controllability.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing complex prompts for production LLM applications\n- Optimizing prompt performance and consistency\n- Implementing structured reasoning patterns (chain-of-thought, tree-of-thought)\n- Building few-shot learning systems with dynamic example selection\n- Creating reusable prompt templates with variable interpolation\n- Debugging and refining prompts that produce inconsistent outputs\n- Implementing system prompts for specialized AI assistants\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Few-Shot Learning\n- Example selection strategies (semantic similarity, diversity sampling)\n- Balancing example count with context window constraints\n- Constructing effective demonstrations with input-output pairs\n- Dynamic example retrieval from knowledge bases\n- Handling edge cases through strategic example selection\n\n### 2. Chain-of-Thought Prompting\n- Step-by-step reasoning elicitation\n- Zero-shot CoT with \"Let''s think step by step\"\n- Few-shot CoT with reasoning traces\n- Self-consistency techniques (sampling multiple reasoning paths)\n- Verification and validation steps\n\n### 3. Prompt Optimization\n- Iterative refinement workflows\n- A/B testing prompt variations\n- Measuring prompt performance metrics (accuracy, consistency, latency)\n- Reducing token usage while maintaining quality\n- Handling edge cases and failure modes\n\n### 4. Template Systems\n- Variable interpolation and formatting\n- Conditional prompt sections\n- Multi-turn conversation templates\n- Role-based prompt composition\n- Modular prompt components\n\n### 5. System Prompt Design\n- Setting model behavior and constraints\n- Defining output formats and structure\n- Establishing role and expertise\n- Safety guidelines and content policies\n- Context setting and background information\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom prompt_optimizer import PromptTemplate, FewShotSelector\n\n# Define a structured prompt template\ntemplate = PromptTemplate(\n    system=\"You are an expert SQL developer. Generate efficient, secure SQL queries.\",\n    instruction=\"Convert the following natural language query to SQL:\\n{query}\",\n    few_shot_examples=True,\n    output_format=\"SQL code block with explanatory comments\"\n)\n\n# Configure few-shot learning\nselector = FewShotSelector(\n    examples_db=\"sql_examples.jsonl\",\n    selection_strategy=\"semantic_similarity\",\n    max_examples=3\n)\n\n# Generate optimized prompt\nprompt = template.render(\n    query=\"Find all users who registered in the last 30 days\",\n    examples=selector.select(query=\"user registration date filter\")\n)\n```\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Progressive Disclosure\nStart with simple prompts, add complexity only when needed:\n\n1. **Level 1**: Direct instruction\n   - \"Summarize this article\"\n\n2. **Level 2**: Add constraints\n   - \"Summarize this article in 3 bullet points, focusing on key findings\"\n\n3. **Level 3**: Add reasoning\n   - \"Read this article, identify the main findings, then summarize in 3 bullet points\"\n\n4. **Level 4**: Add examples\n   - Include 2-3 example summaries with input-output pairs\n\n### Instruction Hierarchy\n```\n[System Context] → [Task Instruction] → [Examples] → [Input Data] → [Output Format]\n```\n\n### Error Recovery\nBuild prompts that gracefully handle failures:\n- Include fallback instructions\n- Request confidence scores\n- Ask for alternative interpretations when uncertain\n- Specify how to indicate missing information\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Be Specific**: Vague prompts produce inconsistent results\n2. **Show, Don''t Tell**: Examples are more effective than descriptions\n3. **Test Extensively**: Evaluate on diverse, representative inputs\n4. **Iterate Rapidly**: Small changes can have large impacts\n5. **Monitor Performance**: Track metrics in production\n6. **Version Control**: Treat prompts as code with proper versioning\n7. **Document Intent**: Explain why prompts are structured as they are\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Over-engineering**: Starting with complex prompts before trying simple ones\n- **Example pollution**: Using examples that don''t match the target task\n- **Context overflow**: Exceeding token limits with excessive examples\n- **Ambiguous instructions**: Leaving room for multiple interpretations\n- **Ignoring edge cases**: Not testing on unusual or boundary inputs\n\n## Integration Patterns\n\n### With RAG Systems\n```python\n# Combine retrieved context with prompt engineering\nprompt = f\"\"\"Given the following context:\n{retrieved_context}\n\n{few_shot_examples}\n\nQuestion: {user_question}\n\nProvide a detailed answer based solely on the context above. If the context doesn''t contain enough information, explicitly state what''s missing.\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Validation\n```python\n# Add self-verification step\nprompt = f\"\"\"{main_task_prompt}\n\nAfter generating your response, verify it meets these criteria:\n1. Answers the question directly\n2. Uses only information from provided context\n3. Cites specific sources\n4. Acknowledges any uncertainty\n\nIf verification fails, revise your response.\"\"\"\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Token Efficiency\n- Remove redundant words and phrases\n- Use abbreviations consistently after first definition\n- Consolidate similar instructions\n- Move stable content to system prompts\n\n### Latency Reduction\n- Minimize prompt length without sacrificing quality\n- Use streaming for long-form outputs\n- Cache common prompt prefixes\n- Batch similar requests when possible\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/few-shot-learning.md**: Deep dive on example selection and construction\n- **references/chain-of-thought.md**: Advanced reasoning elicitation techniques\n- **references/prompt-optimization.md**: Systematic refinement workflows\n- **references/prompt-templates.md**: Reusable template patterns\n- **references/system-prompts.md**: System-level prompt design\n- **assets/prompt-template-library.md**: Battle-tested prompt templates\n- **assets/few-shot-examples.json**: Curated example datasets\n- **scripts/optimize-prompt.py**: Automated prompt optimization tool\n\n## Success Metrics\n\nTrack these KPIs for your prompts:\n- **Accuracy**: Correctness of outputs\n- **Consistency**: Reproducibility across similar inputs\n- **Latency**: Response time (P50, P95, P99)\n- **Token Usage**: Average tokens per request\n- **Success Rate**: Percentage of valid outputs\n- **User Satisfaction**: Ratings and feedback\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Review the prompt template library for common patterns\n2. Experiment with few-shot learning for your specific use case\n3. Implement prompt versioning and A/B testing\n4. Set up automated evaluation pipelines\n5. Document your prompt engineering decisions and learnings\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:41:07.888Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Model Agents requiring advanced prompt engineering techniques to maximize performance, reliability, and controllability in production environments.","zh":"适用于需要高级提示工程技术来最大化性能、可靠性和可控性的大型语言模型代理的生产环境。","ja":"大規模言語モデルエージェントが生産環境でパフォーマンス、信頼性、および制御性を最大化するために高度なプロンプトエンジニアリング技術を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"생산 환경에서 성능, 안정성 및 제어성을 최대화하기 위해 고급 프롬프트 엔지니어링 기술이 필요한 대규모 언어 모델 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Modelo de Lenguaje que requieren técnicas de ingeniería de prompts avanzadas para maximizar el rendimiento, la confiabilidad y el control en entornos de producción.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Modèle de Langage nécessitant des techniques d''ingénierie de prompts avancées pour maximiser les performances, la fiabilité et la contrôlabilité dans les environnements de production.","de":"Ideal für Language-Model-Agents, die erweiterte Prompt-Engineering-Techniken erfordern, um Leistung, Zuverlässigkeit und Steuerbarkeit in Produktionsumgebungen zu maximieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Modelo de Linguagem que exigem técnicas avançadas de engenharia de prompts para maximizar o desempenho, a confiabilidade e o controle em ambientes de produção.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов языковых моделей, требующих продвинутых техник инженерии запросов для максимизации производительности, надежности и контроля в производственной среде.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل نموذج اللغة التي تتطلب تقنيات هندسة استجواب متقدمة لتعزيز الأداء والموثوقية والتحكم في بيئات الإنتاج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design complex prompts for production LLM applications, optimize prompt performance and consistency, and implement structured reasoning patterns like chain-of-thought and tree-of-thought using distributed training and advanced inference protocols.","zh":"赋予代理设计复杂的生产级大语言模型应用提示，优化提示性能和一致性，并使用分布式训练和高级推理协议实现结构化的推理模式，如链式思维和树式思维。","ja":"エージェントに、複雑なプロンプトを生産レベルの大規模言語モデルアプリケーション用に設計し、プロンプトのパフォーマンスと一貫性を最適化し、分散トレーニングと高度な推論プロトコルを使用して、連鎖的思考や木的思考のような構造化された推論パターンを実装する力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트가 생산용 대규모 언어 모델 애플리케이션을 위한 복잡한 프롬프트를 설계하고 프롬프트 성능 및 일관성을 최적화하며 분산式 학습 및 고급 추론 프로토콜을 사용하여 사슬형 사고 및 나무형 사고와 같은 구조화된 추론 패턴을 구현할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar promts complejos para aplicaciones LLM de producción, optimizar el rendimiento y la consistencia de los promts, e implementar patrones de razonamiento estructurados como cadena de pensamiento y árbol de pensamiento utilizando entrenamiento distribuido y protocolos de inferencia avanzados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des promts complexes pour les applications LLM de production, d''optimiser les performances et la cohérence des promts, et de mettre en œuvre des modèles de raisonnement structurés comme la chaîne de pensée et l''arbre de pensée en utilisant la formation distribuée et les protocoles d''inférence avancés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Prompts für Produktions-LLM-Anwendungen zu entwerfen, die Prompt-Leistung und -Konsistenz zu optimieren und strukturierte Denkmuster wie Gedankenketten und Denkbaum mit verteilter Schulung und erweiterten Inferenzprotokollen zu implementieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar prompts complexos para aplicações LLM de produção, otimizar o desempenho e a consistência dos prompts e implementar padrões de raciocínio estruturados, como cadeia de pensamento e árvore de pensamento, utilizando treinamento distribuído e protocolos de inferência avançados.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность проектировать сложные запросы для приложений LLM, оптимизировать производительность и согласованность запросов и реализовывать структурированные шаблоны рассуждений, такие как цепочка мыслей и дерево мыслей, используя распределенную обучение и продвинутые протоколы вывода.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم استجوابات معقدة لتطبيقات LLM الإنتاجية، وتحسين أداء الاستجوابات وثباتها، وتنفيذ أنماط استدلال مهيكلة، مثل سلسلة التفكير وشجرة التفكير، باستخدام تدريب موزع وبروتوكولات استخلاص متقدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing complex prompts for production LLM applications","Optimizing prompt performance and consistency for reliable outcomes","Implementing structured reasoning patterns for advanced decision-making"],"zh":["为生产级大语言模型应用设计复杂的提示","优化提示性能和一致性以获得可靠的结果","实现结构化的推理模式以进行高级决策"],"ja":["生産レベルの大規模言語モデルアプリケーションのための複雑なプロンプトを設計する","プロンプトのパフォーマンスと一貫性を最適化して信頼性の高い結果を得る","高度な決定-makingのための構造化された推論パターンを実装する"],"ko":["생산용 대규모 언어 모델 애플리케이션을 위한 복잡한 프롬프트 설계","신뢰할 수 있는 결과를 얻기 위해 프롬프트 성능 및 일관성을 최적화","고급 의사 결정에 대한 구조화된 추론 패턴 구현"],"es":["Diseñar promts complejos para aplicaciones LLM de producción","Optimizar el rendimiento y la consistencia de los promts para resultados confiables","Implementar patrones de razonamiento estructurados para la toma de decisiones avanzada"],"fr":["Concevoir des promts complexes pour les applications LLM de production","Optimiser les performances et la cohérence des promts pour des résultats fiables","Mettre en œuvre des modèles de raisonnement structurés pour la prise de décision avancée"],"de":["Komplexe Prompts für Produktions-LLM-Anwendungen entwerfen","Die Prompt-Leistung und -Konsistenz für zuverlässige Ergebnisse optimieren","Strukturierte Denkmuster für erweiterte Entscheidungsfindung implementieren"],"pt":["Projeto de prompts complexos para aplicações LLM de produção","Otimização do desempenho e da consistência dos prompts para resultados confiáveis","Implementação de padrões de raciocínio estruturados para tomada de decisões avançadas"],"ru":["Проектирование сложных запросов для приложений LLM","Оптимизация производительности и согласованности запросов для надежных результатов","Реализация структурированных шаблонов рассуждений для продвинутого принятия решений"],"ar":["تصميم استجوابات معقدة لتطبيقات LLM الإنتاجية","تحسين أداء الاستجوابات وثباتها للحصول على نتائج موثوقة","تنفيذ أنماط استدلال مهيكلة لتaken قرارات متقدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of LLM performance, reliability, and controllability","Dependent on dynamic orchestration for distributed training and advanced inference","Limited to applications with accessible GPU machines for high-power compute systems"],"zh":["需要了解大语言模型的性能、可靠性和可控性","依赖于动态编排进行分布式训练和高级推理","仅限于具有可访问的GPU机器的应用以获得高功率计算系统"],"ja":["大規模言語モデルのパフォーマンス、信頼性、および制御性についての理解が必要","分散トレーニングと高度な推論のための動的オーケストレーションに依存している","高パワーコンピュータシステムを得るためにアクセス可能なGPUマシンを持つアプリケーションに限定されている"],"ko":["대규모 언어 모델의 성능, 안정성 및 제어성에 대한 이해가 필요","분산 학습 및 고급 추론을 위한 동적 오케스트레이션에 의존","고출력 컴퓨팅 시스템을 얻기 위해 접근 가능한 GPU 머신이 있는 애플리케이션으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del rendimiento, la confiabilidad y el control de LLM","Depende de la orquestación dinámica para el entrenamiento distribuido y la inferencia avanzada","Limitado a aplicaciones con máquinas GPU accesibles para sistemas de cómputo de alta potencia"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des performances, de la fiabilité et de la contrôlabilité de LLM","Dépend de l''orchestration dynamique pour la formation distribuée et l''inférence avancée","Limité aux applications avec des machines GPU accessibles pour les systèmes de calcul haute puissance"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für LLM-Leistung, -Zuverlässigkeit und -Steuerbarkeit","Hängt von der dynamischen Orchestrierung für verteilter Schulung und erweiterter Inferenz ab","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen mit zugänglichen GPU-Maschinen für Hochleistungsrechnersysteme"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do desempenho, confiabilidade e controle do LLM","Depende da orquestração dinâmica para treinamento distribuído e inferência avançada","Limitado a aplicações com máquinas GPU acessíveis para sistemas de computação de alta potência"],"ru":["Требует понимания производительности, надежности и контроля LLM","Зависит от динамической оркестровки для распределенной обучения и продвинутого вывода","Ограничен для приложений с доступными машинами GPU для высокомощных вычислительных систем"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم الأداء والموثوقية والتحكم في LLM","يعتمد على الأوركسترا الديناميكية للتدريب الموزع والإستخلاص المتقدم","محدود للتطبيقات التي تحتوي على آلات GPU قابلة للوصول لأنظمة الحوسبة عالية القوة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
