de compartir código","Configuración de CI/CD para monorepos","Depuración de problemas específicos de monorepo"],"fr":["Création de monorepos évolutifs","Partage de code et d''outils","Gestion de dépendances partagées","Mise en œuvre de stratégies de partage de code","Configuration de CI/CD pour les monorepos","Débogage de problèmes spécifiques aux monorepos"],"de":["Erstellung von skalierbaren Monorepos","Code- und Tool-Sharing","Verwaltung von gemeinsamen Abhängigkeiten","Implementierung von Code-Sharing-Strategien","Konfiguration von CI/CD für Monorepos","Fehlerbehebung bei Monorepo-spezifischen Problemen"],"pt":["Criação de monorepos eficientes","Compartilhamento de código entre projetos","Otimização do desempenho de build e testes","Gerenciamento de dependências compartilhadas","Implementação de estratégias de compartilhamento de código","Configuração de CI/CD para monorepos"],"ru":["Создание эффективных монорепозиториев","Обмен кодом между проектами","Оптимизация производительности сборки и тестирования","Управление общими зависимостями","Реализация стратегий обмена кодом","Настройка CI/CD для монорепозиториев"],"ar":["إنشاء مونوريبو فعالة","مشاركة الكود بين المشاريع","تحسين أداء البناء والاختبار","إدارة التبعيات المشتركة","تنفيذ استراتيجيات مشاركة الكود","تكوين CI/CD لمونوريبو"]},"keywords":{"zh":["monorepo管理","代码仓库","代码共享","工具一致性","原子变化","版本控制","构建优化","测试性能"],"ja":["モノレポ管理","コードリポジトリ","コード共有","ツールの統一","原子変更","バージョン管理","ビルド最適化","テストパフォーマンス"],"ko":["모노레포 관리","코드 저장소","코드 공유","도구 일관성","원자적 변경","버전 관리","빌드 최적화","테스트 성능"],"es":["monorepo","desarrollo de software","gestión de código","compartir código","herramientas de desarrollo","escalabilidad","eficiencia","depuración"],"fr":["monorepo","développement de logiciels","gestion de code","partage de code","outils de développement","évolutivité","efficacité","débogage"],"de":["monorepo","software-entwicklung","code-management","code-sharing","entwicklungstools","skalierbarkeit","effizienz","fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["gerenciamento de monorepo","monorepo eficiente","compartilhamento de código","otimização de desempenho","gerenciamento de dependências","CI/CD para monorepos","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","gerenciamento de projetos"],"ru":["управление монорепозиторием","эффективный монорепозиторий","обмен кодом","оптимизация производительности","управление зависимостями","CI/CD для монорепозиториев","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","управление проектами"],"ar":["إدارة مونوريبو","مونوريبو فعالة","مشاركة الكود","تحسين الأداء","إدارة التبعيات","CI/CD لمونوريبو","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","إدارة المشاريع"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ugro","repoPath":"ollieb89/ugro","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.511Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"monorepo-management","description":"Master monorepo management with Turborepo, Nx, and pnpm workspaces to build efficient, scalable multi-package repositories with optimized builds and dependency management. Use when setting up monorepos, optimizing builds, or managing shared dependencies.","bodyPreview":"# Monorepo Management\n\nBuild efficient, scalable monorepos that enable code sharing, consistent tooling, and atomic changes across multiple packages and applications.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new monorepo projects\n- Migrating from multi-repo to monorepo\n- Optimizing build and test performance\n- Managing shared dependencies\n- Implementing code sharing strategies\n- Setting up CI/CD for monorepos\n- Versioning and publishing packages\n- Debugging monorepo-specific issues\n\n## Core Conc","body":"# Monorepo Management\n\nBuild efficient, scalable monorepos that enable code sharing, consistent tooling, and atomic changes across multiple packages and applications.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new monorepo projects\n- Migrating from multi-repo to monorepo\n- Optimizing build and test performance\n- Managing shared dependencies\n- Implementing code sharing strategies\n- Setting up CI/CD for monorepos\n- Versioning and publishing packages\n- Debugging monorepo-specific issues\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Why Monorepos?\n\n**Advantages:**\n- Shared code and dependencies\n- Atomic commits across projects\n- Consistent tooling and standards\n- Easier refactoring\n- Simplified dependency management\n- Better code visibility\n\n**Challenges:**\n- Build performance at scale\n- CI/CD complexity\n- Access control\n- Large Git repository\n\n### 2. Monorepo Tools\n\n**Package Managers:**\n- pnpm workspaces (recommended)\n- npm workspaces\n- Yarn workspaces\n\n**Build Systems:**\n- Turborepo (recommended for most)\n- Nx (feature-rich, complex)\n- Lerna (older, maintenance mode)\n\n## Turborepo Setup\n\n### Initial Setup\n\n```bash\n# Create new monorepo\nnpx create-turbo@latest my-monorepo\ncd my-monorepo\n\n# Structure:\n# apps/\n#   web/          - Next.js app\n#   docs/         - Documentation site\n# packages/\n#   ui/           - Shared UI components\n#   config/       - Shared configurations\n#   tsconfig/     - Shared TypeScript configs\n# turbo.json      - Turborepo configuration\n# package.json    - Root package.json\n```\n\n### Configuration\n\n```json\n// turbo.json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://turbo.build/schema.json\",\n  \"globalDependencies\": [\"**/.env.*local\"],\n  \"pipeline\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"outputs\": [\"dist/**\", \".next/**\", \"!.next/cache/**\"]\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"build\"],\n      \"outputs\": [\"coverage/**\"]\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"outputs\": []\n    },\n    \"dev\": {\n      \"cache\": false,\n      \"persistent\": true\n    },\n    \"type-check\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"outputs\": []\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n```json\n// package.json (root)\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-monorepo\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"workspaces\": [\n    \"apps/*\",\n    \"packages/*\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"turbo run build\",\n    \"dev\": \"turbo run dev\",\n    \"test\": \"turbo run test\",\n    \"lint\": \"turbo run lint\",\n    \"format\": \"prettier --write \\\"**/*.{ts,tsx,md}\\\"\",\n    \"clean\": \"turbo run clean && rm -rf node_modules\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"turbo\": \"^1.10.0\",\n    \"prettier\": \"^3.0.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@8.0.0\"\n}\n```\n\n### Package Structure\n\n```json\n// packages/ui/package.json\n{\n  \"name\": \"@repo/ui\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"main\": \"./dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"./dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"import\": \"./dist/index.js\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/index.d.ts\"\n    },\n    \"./button\": {\n      \"import\": \"./dist/button.js\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/button.d.ts\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsup src/index.ts --format esm,cjs --dts\",\n    \"dev\": \"tsup src/index.ts --format esm,cjs --dts --watch\",\n    \"lint\": \"eslint src/\",\n    \"type-check\": \"tsc --noEmit\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@repo/tsconfig\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"tsup\": \"^7.0.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \"^18.2.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## pnpm Workspaces\n\n### Setup\n\n```yaml\n# pnpm-workspace.yaml\npackages:\n  - ''apps/*''\n  - ''packages/*''\n  - ''tools/*''\n```\n\n```json\n// .npmrc\n# Hoist shared dependencies\nshamefully-hoist=true\n\n# Strict peer dependencies\nauto-install-peers=true\nstrict-peer-dependencies=true\n\n# Performance\nstore-dir=~/.pnpm-store\n```\n\n### Dependency Management\n\n```bash\n# Install dependency in specific package\npnpm add react --filter @repo/ui\npnpm add -D typescript --filter @repo/ui\n\n# Install workspace dependency\npnpm add @repo/ui --filter web\n\n# Install in all packages\npnpm add -D eslint -w\n\n# Update all dependencies\npnpm update -r\n\n# Remove dependency\npnpm remove react --filter @repo/ui\n```\n\n### Scripts\n\n```bash\n# Run script in specific package\npnpm --filter web dev\npnpm --filter @repo/ui build\n\n# Run in all packages\npnpm -r build\npnpm -r test\n\n# Run in parallel\npnpm -r --parallel dev\n\n# Filter by pattern\npnpm --filter \"@repo/*\" build\npnpm --filter \"...web\" build  # Build web and dependencies\n```\n\n## Nx Monorepo\n\n### Setup\n\n```bash\n# Create Nx monorepo\nnpx create-nx-workspace@latest my-org\n\n# Generate applications\nnx generate @nx/react:app my-app\nnx generate @nx/next:app my-next-app\n\n# Generate libraries\nnx generate @nx/react:lib ui-components\nnx generate @nx/js:lib utils\n```\n\n### Configuration\n\n```json\n// nx.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"nx/presets/npm.json\",\n  \"$schema\": \"./node_modules/nx/schemas/nx-schema.json\",\n  \"targetDefaults\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"inputs\": [\"production\", \"^production\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"^production\", \"{workspaceRoot}/jest.preset.js\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"{workspaceRoot}/.eslintrc.json\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"namedInputs\": {\n    \"default\": [\"{projectRoot}/**/*\", \"sharedGlobals\"],\n    \"production\": [\n      \"default\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/**/?(*.)+(spec|test).[jt]s?(x)?(.snap)\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/tsconfig.spec.json\"\n    ],\n    \"sharedGlobals\": []\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Running Tasks\n\n```bash\n# Run task for specific project\nnx build my-app\nnx test ui-components\nnx lint utils\n\n# Run for affected projects\nnx affected:build\nnx affected:test --base=main\n\n# Visualize dependencies\nnx graph\n\n# Run in parallel\nnx run-many --target=build --all --parallel=3\n```\n\n## Shared Configurations\n\n### TypeScript Configuration\n\n```json\n// packages/tsconfig/base.json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"incremental\": true,\n    \"declaration\": true\n  },\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\"]\n}\n\n// packages/tsconfig/react.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"./base.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"lib\": [\"ES2022\", \"DOM\", \"DOM.Iterable\"]\n  }\n}\n\n// apps/web/tsconfig.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"@repo/tsconfig/react.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"rootDir\": \"src\"\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n### ESLint Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// packages/config/eslint-preset.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  extends: [\n    ''eslint:recommended'',\n    ''plugin:@typescript-eslint/recommended'',\n    ''plugin:react/recommended'',\n    ''plugin:react-hooks/recommended'',\n    ''prettier'',\n  ],\n  plugins: [''@typescript-eslint'', ''react'', ''react-hooks''],\n  parser: ''@typescript-eslint/parser'',\n  parserOptions: {\n    ecmaVersion: 2022,\n    sourceType: ''module'',\n    ecmaFeatures: {\n      jsx: true,\n    },\n  },\n  settings: {\n    react: {\n      version: ''detect'',\n    },\n  },\n  rules: {\n    ''@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars'': ''error'',\n    ''react/react-in-jsx-scope'': ''off'',\n  },\n};\n\n// apps/web/.eslintrc.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  extends: [''@repo/config/eslint-preset''],\n  rules: {\n    // App-specific rules\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Code Sharing Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Shared UI Components\n\n```typescript\n// packages/ui/src/button.tsx\nimport * as React from ''react'';\n\nexport interface ButtonProps {\n  variant?: ''primary'' | ''secondary'';\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n  onClick?: () => void;\n}\n\nexport function Button({ variant = ''primary'', children, onClick }: ButtonProps) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      className={`btn btn-${variant}`}\n      onClick={onClick}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n\n// packages/ui/src/index.ts\nexport { Button, type ButtonProps } from ''./button'';\nexport { Input, type InputProps } from ''./input'';\n\n// apps/web/src/app.tsx\nimport { Button } from ''@repo/ui'';\n\nexport function App() {\n  return <Button variant=\"primary\">Click me</Button>;\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Shared Utilities\n\n```typescript\n// packages/utils/src/string.ts\nexport function capitalize(str: string): string {\n  return str.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + str.slice(1);\n}\n\nexport function truncate(str: string, length: number): string {\n  return str.length > length ? str.slice(0, length) + ''...'' : str;\n}\n\n// packages/utils/src/index.ts\nexport * from ''./string'';\nexport * from ''./array'';\nexport * from ''./date'';\n\n// Usage in apps\nimport { capitalize, truncate } from ''@repo/utils'';\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Shared Types\n\n```typescript\n// packages/types/src/user.ts\nexport interface User {\n  id: string;\n  email: string;\n  name: string;\n  role: ''admin'' | ''user'';\n}\n\nexport interface CreateUserInput {\n  email: string;\n  name: string;\n  password: string;\n}\n\n// Used in both frontend and backend\nimport type { User, CreateUserInput } from ''@repo/types'';\n```\n\n## Build Optimization\n\n### Turborepo Caching\n\n```json\n// turbo.json\n{\n  \"pipeline\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      // Build depends on dependencies being built first\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n\n      // Cache these outputs\n      \"outputs\": [\"dist/**\", \".next/**\"],\n\n      // Cache based on these inputs (default: all files)\n      \"inputs\": [\"src/**/*.tsx\", \"src/**/*.ts\", \"package.json\"]\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      // Run tests in parallel, don''t depend on build\n      \"cache\": true,\n      \"outputs\": [\"coverage/**\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Remote Caching\n\n```bash\n# Turborepo Remote Cache (Vercel)\nnpx turbo login\nnpx turbo link\n\n# Custom remote cache\n# turbo.json\n{\n  \"remoteCache\": {\n    \"signature\": true,\n    \"enabled\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## CI/CD for Monorepos\n\n### GitHub Actions\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/ci.yml\nname: CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0  # For Nx affected commands\n\n      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v2\n        with:\n          version: 8\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v3\n        with:\n          node-version: 18\n          cache: ''pnpm''\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\n\n      - name: Build\n        run: pnpm turbo run build\n\n      - name: Test\n        run: pnpm turbo run test\n\n      - name: Lint\n        run: pnpm turbo run lint\n\n      - name: Type check\n        run: pnpm turbo run type-check\n```\n\n### Deploy Affected Only\n\n```yaml\n# Deploy only changed apps\n- name: Deploy affected apps\n  run: |\n    if pnpm nx affected:apps --base=origin/main --head=HEAD | grep -q \"web\"; then\n      echo \"Deploying web app\"\n      pnpm --filter web deploy\n    fi\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Consistent Versioning**: Lock dependency versions across workspace\n2. **Shared Configs**: Centralize ESLint, TypeScript, Prettier configs\n3. **Dependency Graph**: Keep it acyclic, avoid circular dependencies\n4. **Cache Effectively**: Configure inputs/outputs correctly\n5. **Type Safety**: Share types between frontend/backend\n6. **Testing Strategy**: Unit tests in packages, E2E in apps\n7. **Documentation**: README in each package\n8. **Release Strategy**: Use changesets for versioning\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Circular Dependencies**: A depends on B, B depends on A\n- **Phantom Dependencies**: Using deps not in package.json\n- **Incorrect Cache Inputs**: Missing files in Turborepo inputs\n- **Over-Sharing**: Sharing code that should be separate\n- **Under-Sharing**: Duplicating code across packages\n- **Large Monorepos**: Without proper tooling, builds slow down\n\n## Publishing Packages\n\n```bash\n# Using Changesets\npnpm add -Dw @changesets/cli\npnpm changeset init\n\n# Create changeset\npnpm changeset\n\n# Version packages\npnpm changeset version\n\n# Publish\npnpm changeset publish\n```\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/release.yml\n- name: Create Release Pull Request or Publish\n  uses: changesets/action@v1\n  with:\n    publish: pnpm release\n  env:\n    GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n    NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/turborepo-guide.md**: Comprehensive Turborepo documentation\n- **references/nx-guide.md**: Nx monorepo patterns\n- **references/pnpm-workspaces.md**: pnpm workspace features\n- **assets/monorepo-checklist.md**: Setup checklist\n- **assets/migration-guide.md**: Multi-repo to monorepo migration\n- **scripts/dependency-graph.ts**: Visualize package dependencies\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:41:10.916Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents and AI Assistants like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code, seeking to streamline code management through efficient monorepo strategies.","zh":"适合DevOps代理和AI助手，如Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code，旨在通过高效的单体仓库策略简化代码管理。","ja":"DevOpsエージェントやCursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIアシスタントが、効率的なモノレポ戦略を通じてコード管理をストリームライン化することに適しています。","ko":"DevOps 에이전트 및 Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 어시스턴트에게 적합하며, 효율적인 모노레포 전략을 통해 코드 관리를 간소화하는 것을 목표로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de DevOps y Asistentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code, que buscan optimizar la gestión de código a través de estrategias de monorepo eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps et les assistants IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code, qui cherchent à rationaliser la gestion de code grâce à des stratégies de monorepo efficaces.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents und KI-Assistenten wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die die Codeverwaltung durch effiziente Monorepo-Strategien optimieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps e assistentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code, que buscam simplificar a gestão de código por meio de estratégias de monorepo eficientes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps и помощников ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, стремящихся оптимизировать управление кодом за счет эффективных стратегий монорепозитория.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء DevOps ومساعدي الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code ، الذين يهدفون إلى简ification إدارة الكود من خلال استراتيجيات Monorepo الفعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex projects by implementing scalable monorepo architectures, leveraging consistent tooling, and optimizing build and test performance through atomic changes and code sharing strategies, utilizing CI/CD pipelines and version control systems.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂项目的能力，通过实施可扩展的单体仓库架构，利用一致的工具，并通过原子改动和代码共享策略优化构建和测试性能，利用CI/CD流水线和版本控制系统。","ja":"エージェントに複雑なプロジェクトを管理する能力を与え、スケーラブルなモノレポアーキテクチャを実装し、一貫したツールを利用し、原子的な変更とコード共有戦略を通じてビルドとテストのパフォーマンスを最適化し、CI/CDパイプラインとバージョン管理システムを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 프로젝트를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 확장 가능한 모노레포 아키텍처를 구현하고 일관된 툴을 활용하며, 원자적 변경과 코드 공유 전략을 통해 빌드 및 테스트 성능을 최적화하며, CI/CD 파이프라인 및 버전 관리 시스템을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar proyectos complejos implementando arquitecturas de monorepo escalables, aprovechando herramientas consistentes y optimizando el rendimiento de compilación y prueba a través de cambios atómicos y estrategias de intercambio de código, utilizando tuberías de CI/CD y sistemas de control de versiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des projets complexes en mettant en œuvre des architectures de monorepo évolutives, en exploitant des outils cohérents et en optimisant les performances de construction et de test grâce à des changements atomiques et des stratégies de partage de code, en utilisant des pipelines de CI/CD et des systèmes de contrôle de version.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Projekte zu verwalten, indem sie skalierbare Monorepo-Architekturen implementieren, konsistente Tooling nutzen und die Build- und Testleistung durch atomare Änderungen und Code-Teilungsstrategien optimieren, indem sie CI/CD-Pipelines und Versionskontrollsysteme verwenden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem projetos complexos implementando arquiteturas de monorepo escaláveis, utilizando ferramentas consistentes e otimizando o desempenho de build e teste por meio de alterações atômicas e estratégias de compartilhamento de código, utilizando pipelines CI/CD e sistemas de controle de versão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными проектами, реализуя масштабируемые архитектуры монорепозитория, используя последовательные инструменты и оптимизируя производительность сборки и тестирования за счет атомарных изменений и стратегий обмена кодом, используя конвейеры CI/CD и системы контроля версий.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إدارة المشاريع المعقدة من خلال تنفيذ هندسة مونوربو قابلة للتوسيع، وتطبيق أدوات متسقة وتحسين أداء بناء الاختبار من خلال التغييرات الذرية و استراتيجيات مشاركة الكود، باستخدام خطوط أنابيب CI/CD وأنظمة التحكم في الإصدار."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating multi-repo projects to unified monorepos","Optimizing build and test performance in large-scale monorepo environments","Implementing efficient code sharing and dependency management across multiple packages"],"zh":["将多仓库项目迁移到统一的单体仓库","在大规模单体仓库环境中优化构建和测试性能","在多个包之间实现高效的代码共享和依赖管理"],"ja":["マルチリポジトリプロジェクトを統一されたモノレポに移行する","大規模なモノレポ環境でのビルドとテストのパフォーマンスを最適化する","複数のパッケージ間で効率的なコード共有と依存管理を実現する"],"ko":["멀티 리포지토리 프로젝트를統一된 모노레포로 마이그레이션","대규모 모노레포 환경에서 빌드 및 테스트 성능 최적화","複数 패키지間에서 효율적인 코드 공유 및 의존성 관리 구현"],"es":["Migrar proyectos multi-repo a monorepos unificados","Optimizar el rendimiento de compilación y prueba en entornos de monorepo a gran escala","Implementar un intercambio de código y gestión de dependencias eficientes en varios paquetes"],"fr":["Migrer des projets multi-repo vers des monorepos unifiés","Optimiser les performances de construction et de test dans des environnements de monorepo à grande échelle","Mettre en œuvre un partage de code et une gestion de dépendances efficaces à travers plusieurs packages"],"de":["Migrieren von Multi-Repo-Projekten zu einheitlichen Monorepos","Optimieren der Build- und Testleistung in großen Monorepo-Umgebungen","Implementieren eines effizienten Code-Sharings und Abhängigkeitsmanagements über mehrere Pakete"],"pt":["Migrar projetos multi-repo para monorepos unificados","Otimizar o desempenho de build e teste em ambientes de monorepo em larga escala","Implementar compartilhamento de código eficiente e gerenciamento de dependências em vários pacotes"],"ru":["Перемещение проектов с несколькими репозиториями в унифицированные монорепозитории","Оптимизация производительности сборки и тестирования в крупномасштабных средах монорепозитория","Реализация эффективного обмена кодом и управления зависимостями в нескольких пакетах"],"ar":["نقل مشاريع متعددة المستودعات إلى مونوربو موحدة","تحسين أداء بناء الاختبار في بيئات مونوربو كبيرة النطاق","تنفيذ مشاركة الكود الفعالة وإدارة التبعيات عبر حزم متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comprehensive understanding of version control systems","Dependent on consistent tooling and infrastructure setup","May require adjustments for very large or highly complex monorepo projects"],"zh":["需要对版本控制系统有全面理解","依赖于一致的工具和基础设施设置","可能需要对非常大的或高度复杂的单体仓库项目进行调整"],"ja":["バージョン管理システムについて包括的な理解が必要","一貫したツールとインフラストラクチャの設定に依存","非常に大規模または高度に複雑なモノレポプロジェクトの場合、調整が必要になる可能性"],"ko":["버전 관리 시스템에 대한 포괄적인 이해가 필요","일관된 툴 및 인프라스트럭처 설정에 의존","非常히 큰 규모 또는高度히 복잡한 모노레포 프로젝트의 경우 조정이 필요할 수"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión integral de los sistemas de control de versiones","Depende de herramientas y configuración de infraestructura consistentes","Puede requerir ajustes para proyectos de monorepo muy grandes o altamente complejos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension approfondie des systèmes de contrôle de version","Dépend de l''outillage et de la configuration d''infrastructure cohérents","Peut nécessiter des ajustements pour les projets de monorepo très grands ou hautement complexes"],"de":["Benötigt ein umfassendes Verständnis von Versionskontrollsystemen","Hängt von konsistenter Tooling und Infrastrukturkonfiguration ab","Kann Anpassungen für sehr große oder hoch komplexe Monorepo-Projekte erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento abrangente dos sistemas de controle de versão","Depende de ferramentas e infraestrutura consistentes","Pode exigir ajustes para projetos de monorepo muito grandes ou altamente complexos"],"ru":["Требует всестороннего понимания систем контроля версий","Зависит от последовательных инструментов и настройки инфраструктуры","Может требовать корректировок для очень крупных или высоко сложных проектов монорепозитория"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا شاملاً لأنظمة التحكم في الإصدار","يعتمد على أدوات وبنية تحتية متسقة"," قد يتطلب تعديلات لمشاريع مونوربو كبيرة جدًا أو معقدة للغاية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
