en","Technische Anleitung für den Aktualisierungsprozess","Verweis auf die Dokumentation von AI SDK v6"],"pt":["Verificação contra npm","Verificação contra commits do GitHub","Atualização de dependências","Atualização de bibliotecas","Manutenção da consistência do projeto","Garantia da estabilidade do projeto"],"ru":["Проверка против npm","Проверка против коммитов GitHub","Обновление зависимостей","Обновление библиотек","Поддержание согласованности проекта","Гарантия стабильности проекта"],"ar":["التحقق من npm","التحقق من Commits من GitHub","تحديث الإعتماديات","تحديث المكتبات","الحفاظ على اتساق المشروع","ضمان استقرار المشروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Assistant UI 更新","版本更新指南","npm 和 GitHub","版本一致性","更新流程","开发者指南"],"ja":["Assistant UI アップデート","バージョン更新ガイド","npm と GitHub","バージョンの一致性","アップデートプロセス","開発者ガイド"],"ko":["Assistant UI 업데이트","버전 업데이트 가이드","npm 및 GitHub","버전 일치성","업데이트 프로세스","개발자 가이드"],"es":["actualización de versiones","verificación de npm","commits de GitHub","actualización de software","guía técnica","AI SDK v6","desarrollo de software","gestión de versiones"],"fr":["mise à jour des versions","vérification de npm","commits de GitHub","mise à jour de logiciels","guide technique","AI SDK v6","développement de logiciels","gestion de versions"],"de":["Aktualisierung von Versionen","Überprüfung von npm","Commits von GitHub","Aktualisierung von Software","technische Anleitung","AI SDK v6","Softwareentwicklung","Versionsverwaltung"],"pt":["atualização de versões","npm","github","dependências","bibliotecas","consistência","estabilidade","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["обновление версий","npm","github","зависимости","библиотеки","согласованность","стабильность","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تحديث الإصدارات","npm","github","الإعتماديات","المكتبات","الاتساق","الاستقرار","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"yashness","repo":"yash-full-stack-personal","repoPath":"yashness/yash-full-stack-personal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"update","description":"Update assistant-ui and AI SDK to latest versions. Detects current versions, identifies breaking changes, and executes migrations.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui Update\n\n**Always verifies against npm ground truth and GitHub commits.**\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/ai-sdk-v6.md](./references/ai-sdk-v6.md) -- AI SDK v4/v5 → v6 migration (complete guide)\n- [./references/assistant-ui.md](./references/assistant-ui.md) -- assistant-ui version migrations\n- [./references/breaking-changes.md](./references/breaking-changes.md) -- Quick reference table\n\n## Phase 1: Detect Versions\n\n### Get Ground Truth\n\n```bash\n# Installed versions\nnpm ls @assistan","body":"# assistant-ui Update\n\n**Always verifies against npm ground truth and GitHub commits.**\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/ai-sdk-v6.md](./references/ai-sdk-v6.md) -- AI SDK v4/v5 → v6 migration (complete guide)\n- [./references/assistant-ui.md](./references/assistant-ui.md) -- assistant-ui version migrations\n- [./references/breaking-changes.md](./references/breaking-changes.md) -- Quick reference table\n\n## Phase 1: Detect Versions\n\n### Get Ground Truth\n\n```bash\n# Installed versions\nnpm ls @assistant-ui/react @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk ai @ai-sdk/react 2>/dev/null\n\n# Latest from npm\nnpm view @assistant-ui/react version\nnpm view @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk version\nnpm view ai version\n```\n\n### Version Analysis\n\n| Package | Check For |\n|---------|-----------|\n| `ai` | < 6.0.0 → needs AI SDK v6 migration |\n| `@assistant-ui/react` | < 0.11.0 → needs runtime migration |\n| `@assistant-ui/react` | < 0.10.0 → needs ESM migration |\n| `@assistant-ui/react` | < 0.8.0 → needs UI split migration |\n| `@assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk` | < 1.0.0 → needs AI SDK v6 first |\n\n## Phase 2: Route to Migration\n\n```\nAI SDK < 6.0.0?\n├─ Yes → See ./references/ai-sdk-v6.md\n└─ No\n   └─ assistant-ui outdated?\n      ├─ Yes → See ./references/assistant-ui.md\n      └─ No → Already up to date\n```\n\n### Migration Order\n\n1. **AI SDK first** (if < 6.0.0) - Required for @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk >= 1.0\n2. **assistant-ui second** - Apply breaking changes for version jump\n3. **Verify** - Type check, build, test\n\n## Phase 3: Execute\n\n### Update Packages\n\n```bash\n# pnpm\npnpm add @assistant-ui/react@latest @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk@latest ai@latest @ai-sdk/react@latest\n\n# npm\nnpm install @assistant-ui/react@latest @assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk@latest ai@latest @ai-sdk/react@latest\n```\n\n### Apply Migrations\n\nBased on version jump, apply relevant migrations from references.\n\n### Verify\n\n```bash\nnpx tsc --noEmit  # Type check\npnpm build        # Build check\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**\"Peer dependency conflict\"**\n- Update all packages together\n- Check version compatibility in [./references/breaking-changes.md](./references/breaking-changes.md)\n\n**Type errors after upgrade**\n- Consult breaking changes reference\n- Check specific migration guide\n\n**Runtime errors**\n- Verify API patterns match new version\n- Check for renamed/moved APIs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:42:24.931Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to verify and update dependencies against npm ground truth and GitHub commits.","zh":"非常适合需要验证和更新依赖项以满足npm基准事实和GitHub提交的AI代理。","ja":"npmの基準事実とGitHubのコミットに対して依存関係を検証および更新する必要があるAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"npm 기준 사실과 GitHub 커밋에 대한 의존성 확인 및 업데이트가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan verificar y actualizar dependencias contra la verdad de npm y los commits de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de vérifier et de mettre à jour les dépendances par rapport à la vérité de npm et aux commits GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die Abhängigkeiten gegen die npm-Wahrheit und GitHub-Commits überprüfen und aktualisieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam verificar e atualizar dependências contra a verdade fundamental do npm e commits do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо проверять и обновлять зависимости против эталонной истины npm и коммитов GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق من الإعتماديات وتحديثها ضد الحقيقة الأساسية ل npm والالتزامات على GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify installed versions against npm and GitHub, ensuring consistency and accuracy by utilizing npm ls and GitHub commits, facilitating seamless migrations like AI SDK v4/v5 to v6.","zh":"使代理能够通过利用npm ls和GitHub提交来验证安装版本与npm和GitHub之间的一致性和准确性，从而实现无缝迁移，如AI SDK v4/v5到v6。","ja":"エージェントがnpm lsとGitHubのコミットを利用して、npmとGitHubの間のインストールされたバージョンを検証することで、一貫性と正確性を確保し、AI SDK v4/v5からv6へのような無縫な移行を容易にします。","ko":"에이전트가 npm ls 및 GitHub 커밋을 사용하여 npm 및 GitHub 간의 설치된 버전을 확인하여 일관성 및 정확성을 보장하여 AI SDK v4/v5에서 v6으로의 無縫な 마이그레이션을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar las versiones instaladas contra npm y GitHub, asegurando la coherencia y la precisión mediante el uso de npm ls y commits de GitHub, facilitando migraciones sin problemas como AI SDK v4/v5 a v6.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier les versions installées par rapport à npm et GitHub, en garantissant la cohérence et l''exactitude en utilisant npm ls et les commits GitHub, facilitant ainsi les migrations sans problème comme AI SDK v4/v5 à v6.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, installierte Versionen gegen npm und GitHub zu überprüfen, Konsistenz und Genauigkeit sicherzustellen, indem npm ls und GitHub-Commits verwendet werden, um eine nahtlose Migration wie z.B. AI SDK v4/v5 auf v6 zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar as versões instaladas contra o npm e o GitHub, garantindo a consistência e a precisão ao utilizar npm ls e commits do GitHub, facilitando migrações sem problemas como AI SDK v4/v5 para v6.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять установленные версии против npm и GitHub, обеспечивая согласованность и точность путем использования npm ls и коммитов GitHub, облегчая беспроблемные миграции, такие как AI SDK v4/v5 на v6.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على التحقق من الإصدارات المثبتة ضد npm و GitHub ، مما يضمن الاتساق والدقة من خلال استخدام npm ls والالتزامات على GitHub ، وتسهيل الهجرات بدون مشاكل مثل AI SDK v4/v5 إلى v6."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying npm package versions","Detecting updates for assistant-ui","Validating GitHub commits for breaking changes"],"zh":["验证npm包版本","检测assistant-ui的更新","验证GitHub提交的破坏性变化"],"ja":["npmパッケージのバージョンの検証","assistant-uiの更新の検出","GitHubコミットの破壊的変更の検証"],"ko":["npm 패키지 버전 확인","assistant-ui 업데이트 감지","GitHub 커밋의 중단 변경 사항 확인"],"es":["Verificar versiones de paquetes npm","Detectar actualizaciones para assistant-ui","Validar commits de GitHub para cambios importantes"],"fr":["Vérifier les versions de packages npm","Détecter les mises à jour pour assistant-ui","Valider les commits GitHub pour les changements importants"],"de":["npm-Paketversionen überprüfen","Updates für assistant-ui erkennen","GitHub-Commits für wichtige Änderungen validieren"],"pt":["Verificar versões de pacotes npm","Detectar atualizações para assistant-ui","Validar commits do GitHub para alterações de quebra"],"ru":["Проверка версий пакетов npm","Обнаружение обновлений для assistant-ui","Проверка коммитов GitHub на наличие изменений, нарушающих работу"],"ar":["التحقق من إصدارات حزم npm","كشف التحديثات ل واجهة المساعد","التحقق من الالتزامات على GitHub لتحديد التغييرات الكاسرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm access","GitHub repository access needed","Limited to specific package versions like @assistan"],"zh":["需要npm访问权限","需要GitHub仓库访问权限","仅限特定包版本，如@assistan"],"ja":["npmへのアクセスが必要","GitHubリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","特定のパッケージバージョン（例：@assistan）のみ"],"ko":["npm 액세스 권한 필요","GitHub 리포지토리 액세스 권한 필요","특정 패키지 버전(@assistan과 같은)만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso a npm","Se necesita acceso al repositorio de GitHub","Limitado a versiones de paquetes específicas como @assistan"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à npm","Un accès au référentiel GitHub est nécessaire","Limité à des versions de packages spécifiques comme @assistan"],"de":["Benötigt npm-Zugriff","GitHub-Repository-Zugriff erforderlich","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Paketversionen wie @assistan"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao npm","Acesso ao repositório do GitHub necessário","Limitado a versões de pacotes específicas, como @assistan"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к npm","Необходим доступ к репозиторию GitHub","Ограничен конкретными версиями пакетов, такими как @assistan"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى npm","مطلوب الوصول إلى مستودع GitHub","محدود بإصدارات حزم محددة مثل @assistan"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
