er más opciones"],"fr":["Découvrez des compétences à partir de l''écosystème de compétences ouvert","Installez des compétences pour étendre les capacités de votre agent","Recherchez des outils, des modèles et des flux de travail","Étendez les capacités de votre agent avec des compétences spécialisées","Permet aux utilisateurs de rechercher et de trouver des compétences spécifiques","Intègre avec l''écosystème de compétences ouvert pour offrir plus d''options"],"de":["Entdecken Sie Fähigkeiten aus dem offenen Fähigkeits-Ökosystem","Installieren Sie Fähigkeiten, um die Fähigkeiten Ihres Agents zu erweitern","Suchen Sie nach Tools, Vorlagen und Workflows","Erweitern Sie die Fähigkeiten Ihres Agents mit spezialisierten Fähigkeiten","Ermöglichen Sie es Benutzern, nach bestimmten Fähigkeiten zu suchen und zu finden","Integriert mit dem offenen Fähigkeits-Ökosystem, um mehr Optionen anzubieten"],"pt":["Descoberta de habilidades do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes abertos","Instalação de habilidades com facilidade","Suporte a tarefas comuns e especializadas","Pesquisa de ferramentas, templates e fluxos de trabalho","Extensão das capacidades do agente"],"ru":["Обнаружение навыков из открытого экосистемы навыков агентов","Установка навыков с легкостью","Поддержка обычных и специализированных задач","Поиск инструментов, шаблонов и рабочих процессов","Расширение возможностей агента"],"ar":["اكتشاف المهارات من نظام المهارات المفتوح للوكلاء","تثبيت المهارات بسهولة","دعم المهام الشائعة والمتخصصة","بحث أدوات وقوالب وعمليات العمل","توسيع قدرات الوكيل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 智能客服","开箱即用","开发者工具","客户转化","人工客服","开箱即用的 AI 智能客服系统"],"ja":["AI インテリジェントカスタマーサポート","オープンエージェントスキルエコシステム","開発者ツール","カスタマー転換","人工カスタマーサポート","オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムとの統合"],"ko":["AI 인텔리전트 고객 지원","오픈 에이전트 스킬 에코시스템","개발자 도구","고객 전환","인공 고객 지원","오픈 에이전트 스킬 에코시스템과의 통합"],"es":["find-skills","inteligencia artificial","habilidades","ecosistema de habilidades abiertas","agentes","competencias","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["find-skills","intelligence artificielle","compétences","écosystème de compétences ouvert","agents","capacités","développement de logiciels","technologies d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["find-skills","künstliche Intelligenz","Fähigkeiten","offenes Fähigkeits-Ökosystem","Agenten","Fähigkeiten","Software-Entwicklung","künstliche Intelligenz Technologien"],"pt":["find-skills","habilidades de agentes","ecossistema de habilidades","descoberta de habilidades","instalação de habilidades","tarefas comuns","tarefas especializadas","pesquisa de ferramentas"],"ru":["find-skills","навыки агентов","экосистема навыков","обнаружение навыков","установка навыков","обычные задачи","специализированные задачи","поиск инструментов"],"ar":["find-skills","مهارات الوكلاء","نظام المهارات","اكتشاف المهارات","تثبيت المهارات","المهام الشائعة","المهام المتخصصة","بحث أدوات"]}},"owner":"congwa","repo":"embedease-ai","repoPath":"congwa/embedease-ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"find-skills","description":"Helps users discover and install agent skills when they ask questions like how do I do X, find a skill for X, is there a skill that can..., or express interest in extending capabilities. This skill should be used when the user is looking for functionality that might exist as an installable skill.","bodyPreview":"# Find Skills\n\nThis skill helps you discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Asks \"how do I do X\" where X might be a common task with an existing skill\n- Says \"find a skill for X\" or \"is there a skill for X\"\n- Asks \"can you do X\" where X is a specialized capability\n- Expresses interest in extending agent capabilities\n- Wants to search for tools, templates, or workflows\n- Mentions they wish they had help with a","body":"# Find Skills\n\nThis skill helps you discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Asks \"how do I do X\" where X might be a common task with an existing skill\n- Says \"find a skill for X\" or \"is there a skill for X\"\n- Asks \"can you do X\" where X is a specialized capability\n- Expresses interest in extending agent capabilities\n- Wants to search for tools, templates, or workflows\n- Mentions they wish they had help with a specific domain (design, testing, deployment, etc.)\n\n## What is the Skills CLI?\n\nThe Skills CLI (`npx skills`) is the package manager for the open agent skills ecosystem. Skills are modular packages that extend agent capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, and tools.\n\n**Key commands:**\n\n- `npx skills find [query]` - Search for skills interactively or by keyword\n- `npx skills add <package>` - Install a skill from GitHub or other sources\n- `npx skills check` - Check for skill updates\n- `npx skills update` - Update all installed skills\n\n**Browse skills at:** https://skills.sh/\n\n## How to Help Users Find Skills\n\n### Step 1: Understand What They Need\n\nWhen a user asks for help with something, identify:\n\n1. The domain (e.g., React, testing, design, deployment)\n2. The specific task (e.g., writing tests, creating animations, reviewing PRs)\n3. Whether this is a common enough task that a skill likely exists\n\n### Step 2: Search for Skills\n\nRun the find command with a relevant query:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills find [query]\n```\n\nFor example:\n\n- User asks \"how do I make my React app faster?\" → `npx skills find react performance`\n- User asks \"can you help me with PR reviews?\" → `npx skills find pr review`\n- User asks \"I need to create a changelog\" → `npx skills find changelog`\n\nThe command will return results like:\n\n```\nInstall with npx skills add <owner/repo@skill>\n\nvercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices\n└ https://skills.sh/vercel-labs/agent-skills/vercel-react-best-practices\n```\n\n### Step 3: Present Options to the User\n\nWhen you find relevant skills, present them to the user with:\n\n1. The skill name and what it does\n2. The install command they can run\n3. A link to learn more at skills.sh\n\nExample response:\n\n```\nI found a skill that might help! The \"vercel-react-best-practices\" skill provides\nReact and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering.\n\nTo install it:\nnpx skills add vercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices\n\nLearn more: https://skills.sh/vercel-labs/agent-skills/vercel-react-best-practices\n```\n\n### Step 4: Offer to Install\n\nIf the user wants to proceed, you can install the skill for them:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills add <owner/repo@skill> -g -y\n```\n\nThe `-g` flag installs globally (user-level) and `-y` skips confirmation prompts.\n\n## Common Skill Categories\n\nWhen searching, consider these common categories:\n\n| Category        | Example Queries                          |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| Web Development | react, nextjs, typescript, css, tailwind |\n| Testing         | testing, jest, playwright, e2e           |\n| DevOps          | deploy, docker, kubernetes, ci-cd        |\n| Documentation   | docs, readme, changelog, api-docs        |\n| Code Quality    | review, lint, refactor, best-practices   |\n| Design          | ui, ux, design-system, accessibility     |\n| Productivity    | workflow, automation, git                |\n\n## Tips for Effective Searches\n\n1. **Use specific keywords**: \"react testing\" is better than just \"testing\"\n2. **Try alternative terms**: If \"deploy\" doesn''t work, try \"deployment\" or \"ci-cd\"\n3. **Check popular sources**: Many skills come from `vercel-labs/agent-skills` or `ComposioHQ/awesome-claude-skills`\n\n## When No Skills Are Found\n\nIf no relevant skills exist:\n\n1. Acknowledge that no existing skill was found\n2. Offer to help with the task directly using your general capabilities\n3. Suggest the user could create their own skill with `npx skills init`\n\nExample:\n\n```\nI searched for skills related to \"xyz\" but didn''t find any matches.\nI can still help you with this task directly! Would you like me to proceed?\n\nIf this is something you do often, you could create your own skill:\nnpx skills init my-xyz-skill\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:42:34.231Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for General-Purpose AI Agents needing seamless skill discovery and integration from the open agent skills ecosystem.","zh":"适合需要从开放代理技能生态系统中实现无缝技能发现和集成的通用人工智能代理。","ja":"オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムからのシームレスなスキル発見と統合を必要とする汎用AIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"오픈 에이전트 스킬 에코시스템에서 무조건적인 스킬 발견 및 통합이 필요한 일반-purpose AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA de Propósito General que necesitan un descubrimiento e integración de habilidades sin problemas desde el ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA polyvalents ayant besoin d''une découverte et d''une intégration de compétences sans problème à partir de l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouverts.","de":"Perfekt für Allzweck-KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Entdeckung und Integration von Fähigkeiten aus dem offenen Agenten-Fähigkeits-Ökosystem benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA de Propósito Geral que necessitam de descoberta e integração de habilidades sem interrupções do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes abertos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ общего назначения, которым требуется бесшовное обнаружение и интеграция навыков из открытого экосистемы навыков агентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي العام الذي يحتاجون إلى اكتشاف مهارات وتكامل بدون انقطاع من النظام البيئي مفتوح لمهارات الوكيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover and install new skills using natural language queries, facilitating the search for specialized tools, templates, and workflows through protocols like skill querying and installation.","zh":"赋予代理发现和安装新技能的能力，使用自然语言查询，通过技能查询和安装等协议促进搜索专用工具、模板和工作流。","ja":"エージェントに新しいスキルを発見しインストールする能力を付与し、自然言語クエリを使用し、スキルクエリやインストールなどのプロトコルを介して専用ツール、テンプレート、ワークフローを検索することを促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 스킬을 발견하고 설치할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 자연어 쿼리를 사용하고 스킬 쿼리 및 설치와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 전문 도구, 템플릿 및 워크플로를 검색할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descubrir e instalar nuevas habilidades utilizando consultas de lenguaje natural, facilitando la búsqueda de herramientas especializadas, plantillas y flujos de trabajo a través de protocolos como la consulta y la instalación de habilidades.","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir et d''installer de nouvelles compétences en utilisant des requêtes en langage naturel, facilitant la recherche d''outils spécialisés, de modèles et de flux de travail via des protocoles tels que la requête et l''installation de compétences.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, neue Fähigkeiten mithilfe natürlicher Sprachabfragen zu entdecken und zu installieren, wodurch die Suche nach spezialisierten Tools, Vorlagen und Workflows über Protokolle wie Fähigkeitsabfrage und -installation erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrirem e instalarem novas habilidades usando consultas de linguagem natural, facilitando a busca por ferramentas especializadas, modelos e fluxos de trabalho por meio de protocolos como consulta e instalação de habilidades.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать и устанавливать новые навыки с использованием запросов естественного языка, облегчая поиск специализированных инструментов, шаблонов и рабочих процессов через протоколы, такие как запрос и установка навыков.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من اكتشاف وتثبيت مهارات جديدة باستخدام استفسارات لغة طبيعية، وتسهيل البحث عن أدوات متخصصة وقوالب وعمليات عمل من خلال بروتوكولات مثل استفسار وتثبيت المهارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Discovering new skills for user-requested tasks","Installing skills for specialized capabilities","Searching for tools and templates to extend agent functionality"],"zh":["为用户请求的任务发现新的技能","安装技能以获得专门的能力","搜索工具和模板以扩展代理功能"],"ja":["ユーザー要求のタスクのための新しいスキルを発見する","専門能力のためのスキルをインストールする","エージェントの機能を拡張するためのツールとテンプレートを検索する"],"ko":["사용자 요청 작업을 위한 새로운 스킬 발견","전문 능력의 스킬 설치","에이전트 기능 확장을 위한工具 및 템플릿 검색"],"es":["Descubrir nuevas habilidades para tareas solicitadas por el usuario","Instalar habilidades para capacidades especializadas","Buscar herramientas y plantillas para ampliar la funcionalidad del agente"],"fr":["Découvrir de nouvelles compétences pour les tâches demandées par l''utilisateur","Installer des compétences pour des capacités spécialisées","Rechercher des outils et des modèles pour étendre la fonctionnalité de l''agent"],"de":["Entdecken neuer Fähigkeiten für vom Benutzer angeforderte Aufgaben","Installieren von Fähigkeiten für spezialisierte Fähigkeiten","Suchen nach Tools und Vorlagen, um die Funktionalität des Agents zu erweitern"],"pt":["Descobrir novas habilidades para tarefas solicitadas pelo usuário","Instalar habilidades para capacidades especializadas","Pesquisar ferramentas e modelos para estender a funcionalidade do agente"],"ru":["Обнаружение новых навыков для задач, запрошенных пользователем","Установка навыков для специализированных возможностей","Поиск инструментов и шаблонов для расширения функциональности агента"],"ar":["اكتشاف مهارات جديدة للمهام المطلوبة من قبل المستخدم","تثبيت المهارات لقدرات متخصصة","البحث عن أدوات وقوالب لتوسيع وظيفة الوكيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the open agent skills ecosystem","Dependent on user input for skill discovery"],"zh":["需要访问开放代理技能生态系统","依赖于用户输入进行技能发现"],"ja":["オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムへのアクセスが必要","スキル発見にユーザー入力を依存"],"ko":["오픈 에이전트 스킬 에코시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요","스킬 발견에 사용자 입력을 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertos","Dependiente de la entrada del usuario para el descubrimiento de habilidades"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouverts","Dépend de la saisie de l''utilisateur pour la découverte de compétences"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das offene Agenten-Fähigkeits-Ökosystem","Abhängig von der Benutzereingabe für die Entdeckung von Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao ecossistema de habilidades de agentes abertos","Dependente da entrada do usuário para descoberta de habilidades"],"ru":["Требует доступа к открытому экосистеме навыков агентов","Зависит от ввода пользователя для обнаружения навыков"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى النظام البيئي مفتوح لمهارات الوكيل","يعتمد على مدخلات المستخدم لاكتشاف المهارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
